G["$gHe's:She's; one of our veteran Rank 9 brawlers here in the Brawlpub. It's $n!"]="Recebam a $guno de nossos veteranos: uma das nossas veteranas; lutadores de grau 9 no Clube de Luta. É $n!"
G["$gHey there, handsome.  You want to go somewhere after this?  Just you and me?:Back off, skank.  I'm trying to put out a vibe here, and you're ruining it.;"]="$gHola, bonito. Quer que vamos a algum lado depois de isto? Solos você e eu.: Afaste-se, vadia. Estou tentando ter um momento vibrante e me lo está atrapalhando.;"
G["$gHey there, stranger. I'd brawl with you any day of the week.  And I promise you, it'll last longer than 2 minutes.\n<Helga winks disarmingly.>:I saw you making eyes at Harr back there. That tauren is MINE.\nWhy don't you drag your ugly, gold-digging face to another blimp?;"]="$gHey there, stranger. I'd brawl with you any day of the week.  And I promise you, it'll last longer than 2 minutes.\n<Helga winks disarmingly.>:I saw you making eyes at Harr back there. That tauren is MINE.\nWhy don't you drag your ugly, gold-digging face to another blimp?;"
