G["$n smash da demons.  Save Ogri'la!"]="$n esmagar demônios! Superando Ogri'a!"
G["$n smash warp-gate good, but da demons make it strong again.\n\n$n bring Gahk another darkrune and Gahk make special crystalforged darkrune for $n!"]="$n smash warp-gate good, but da demons make it strong again.\n\n$n bring Gahk another darkrune and Gahk make special crystalforged darkrune for $n!"
