G["$n wins! $n wins!"]="$n venceu! $n venceu!"
G["$n!"]="$n!"
G["$n!  Betrayer of Ragnaros!"]="$n! $gTraidor: Traidora; de Ragnaros!"
G["$n!  Da crystals sing about you!"]="$n! Os cristais cantam sobre você!"
G["$n!  I hardly recognized you in your new outfit.  Still have that tunic... or did you take the chausses... or was it the staff?   I can't recall, it was so long ago...\n\nWell, I'm glad you are here to help out again.  We could use all the help we can get.  $n, if you perform the way you did back in Westfall with the People's Militia, we have a chance.\n\nThese are dire times, if we don't win this battle, there may not be a Westfall to return to."]="$n!  I hardly recognized you in your new outfit.  Still have that tunic... or did you take the chausses... or was it the staff?   I can't recall, it was so long ago...\n\nWell, I'm glad you are here to help out again.  We could use all the help we can get.  $n, if you perform the way you did back in Westfall with the People's Militia, we have a chance.\n\nThese are dire times, if we don't win this battle, there may not be a Westfall to return to."
G["$n!  I hear you're Ironstock's new little whipping $r.  What's she got ya doin' now?"]="$n! Ouvi que é $gel novo bode expiatório: a nova bode expiatório; $r de Cargacero. Que você fazendo agora?"
G["$n!  I hope you're ready to get to work, because there is much for you to do here on Sunstrider Isle.\n\nEver since the destruction of the Sunwell by Arthas and the Scourge, we have been a race adrift on a sea of uncertainty.  We teeter on the edge of oblivion.  This will change, $c, and you will learn and aid our recovery at the same time.\n\nThe Outland awaits us!"]="$n! Espero que venha para começar a trabalhar, porque tem muito que fazer aqui, na ilha do Andarilho do Sol.\n\nDesde a destruição da Nascente do Sol por Arthas e o Flagelo, somos uma raça à deriva em um mar de incertezas. Nos estamos ao limiar do esquecimento. Isto vai mudar, $c. Ao mesmo tempo que aprende, ajudará a nossa recuperação.\n\nTerralém nos espera!"
G["$n!  I know where the other emissary went."]="$n! Sei aonde tem ido o outro emissário."
G["$n!  I know where the other troll went."]="$n! Sei aonde tem ido o outro troll."
G["$n!  I remember your hunting prowess all too well.  You might have gotten off to a shaky start in Stranglethorn, but you stuck in there and became one o' the finest when you bagged old Bangalash.\n\nBut listen, $g lad : lass;, the prey out here in the Outland is the real deal.  And I've the scars to prove it!"]="$n!  I remember your hunting prowess all too well.  You might have gotten off to a shaky start in Stranglethorn, but you stuck in there and became one o' the finest when you bagged old Bangalash.\n\nBut listen, $g lad : lass;, the prey out here in the Outland is the real deal.  And I've the scars to prove it!"
G["$n!  I'm finished!"]="$n! E terminou!"
G["$n!  Our supplies are dwindling and until we get more we can't launch large ground assaults into the Field of Strife!\n\nSpeak with the Stormpike Quartermaster.  He'll tell you what you can do to resupply our assault forces."]="$n! Nossos suprimentos cada vez são mais limitados e, até que não consigamos mais, não poderemos lançar ataque terrestres a grande escala na Terra de Disputa.\n\nFala com o Intendente Pico Tempestade. Dirá a você o que pode fazer para reabastecer a nossas tropas de ataque."
G["$n!  Prepare to meet your doom!"]="$n! Prepare-se para morrer!"
G["$n!  Thanks again for all the help."]="$n! Obrigado novamente por toda sua ajuda."
G["$n!  What are you doing talking to me?  You should be out fighting the Horde!\n\nI have assault orders for one of our field marshals in the Field of Strife, but I need someone I can count on.\n\nPerhaps if your standing with the Stormpike militia were higher, I could count on you..."]="$n! O que está fazendo falando comigo? Deveria estar combatendo contra a Horda!\n\nTenho ordens de ataque de um dos nossos Marechais de campo na Terra de Disputa, mas preciso de alguém digno de confiança.\n\nTalvez, se a milícia Pico Tempestade te tivesse te tuvieran em mais alta consideração, poderá contar com você..."
G["$n!  You're back!  And not a moment too soon!"]="$n! Voltou! E logo a tempo!"
G["$n! $n! $n!"]="$n! $n! $n!"
G["$n! Ah, fantastic to see you out and about. Busy as always, hm?"]="$n! Ah, é fantástico ver você por aqui. Como sempre, terá muito que fazer, eh?"
G["$n! Brewmast Boof sent me to fetch a vial of pure water from the water spirits but Poppers ate the offering. Now I have no way to convince them to give me one and they don't look very friendly. Do you think you could persuade them for me?"]="$n! Brewmast Boof sent me to fetch a vial of pure water from the water spirits but Poppers ate the offering. Now I have no way to convince them to give me one and they don't look very friendly. Do you think you could persuade them for me?"
G["$n! CAN YOU HEAR ME? Just checking to see if you're paying attention."]="$n! ME OUVE? Somente queria testar se me estava prestando atenção."
G["$n! Come here! Surely you know of the battle that rages within Alterac Valley back on Azeroth. We need every able-bodied fighter we can muster. Fight with the Stormpike Guard and defeat the Frostwolves!"]="$n! Venha aqui! Sem dúvida sabe da batalha que tem lugar no Vale Alterac, em Azeroth. precisamos de qualquer combatente capacitado que possamos reunir. Luta contra a Guarda Pico Tempestade e vence aos Lobo Gelo!"
G["$n! Come here. I have a ... \"special project\" requiring your assistance."]="$n! Venha aqui. preciso da sua ajuda com um... \"projeto especial\"."
G["$n! Finally!\n\nYou must take this beacon and plant it in the eastern crater of the central battle grounds. My flight will attack when the beacon beams its coordinates!"]="$n! Finally!\n\nYou must take this beacon and plant it in the eastern crater of the central battle grounds. My flight will attack when the beacon beams its coordinates!"
G["$n! Get out of the black ooze on the ground!"]="$n! Afaste-se do lodo negro que há no chão!"
G["$n! Great work decoding the message. Let's get to the bottom of this.\n\nAre you ready to fly?"]="$n! Fez um bom trabalho ao decodificar a mensagem. Vamos ver que se esconde por trás deste assunto.\n\n$gPronto: Pronta; para voar?"
G["$n! Help!"]="$n! Socorro!"
G["$n! How are you? I hear things from here and there about your heroics."]="$n, como está? Me chegam notícia de aqui e de além sobre seus feitos heroicos."
G["$n! How can I help you, old friend?"]="$n! Como posso ajudar você, amigo?"
G["$n! How have ye been $g lad : lass;? Show me what ye've learned since I saw ye last, we'll see if there's anything new I can teach ye."]="$n! Como tem estado, $gmuchacho: moça;? Mostre-me o que te ensinei a última vez que te vi. Veremos se há algo novo que possa ensinar."
G["$n! How ya doin', hon?"]="$n! Que tal vai, céu?"
G["$n! I am delighted to see that you are celebrating the Wanderer's Festival with us!\n\nIt is often said that pandaren are not the adventurous sort. But look around at these faces - ah, you see? The starry eyes of dreamers!\n\nI should think that someday soon, there will be many more pandaren adventurers to speak of, making a difference all over the world. Don't you think?"]="$n! I am delighted to see that you are celebrating the Wanderer's Festival with us!\n\nIt is often said that pandaren are not the adventurous sort. But look around at these faces - ah, you see? The starry eyes of dreamers!\n\nI should think that someday soon, there will be many more pandaren adventurers to speak of, making a difference all over the world. Don't you think?"
G["$n! I'm glad you made it."]="$n! fico feliz em que o conseguiu."
G["$n! I'm watching you!"]="$n! Te estou observando!"
G["$n! I've been awaiting your return. What be takin' ya so long, mon?\n\nIt be time to complete da conversion of da Blightbloods.\n\nJoin me and witness the creation of our army!"]="$n! tenho estado esperando seu volta. Que você retenido tanto tempo, tron?\n\nÉ hora de concluir a conversão dos Sangue da Praga.\n\nJunte-se a mim e conresiliência a criação de nosso exército!"
G["$n! I've been wondering how you were. What's kept you?"]="$n! I've been wondering how you were. What's kept you?"
G["$n! It's me! Remember? From the Tian Monastery?\n\nIt took me a while, but I've finally graduated! Xiao, too, and... well, everybody else that you see here.\n\nWe're not students anymore. We're on our first quest - the quest to find the Hidden Master."]="$n! Sou eu! Te lembra de mim? Do Monastério Tian?\n\nMe tem levado um tempo, mas finalmente me e formado! Xiao também e... bom, todos os outros que vê aqui.\n\nJá não somos estudantes, estamos em nossa primeira missão: procurar ao mestre oculto."
G["$n! Ovah he'ah!"]="$n! Aqui!"
G["$n! Please tell me that monster, the Trade Prince, didn't survive?!"]="$n! Por favor, diga que esse monstro do Príncipe mercante não tem sobrevivido!!"
G["$n! So strange to see you here, far from the green forests of Pandaria.\n\nWhen I first sailed away from the Wandering Isle, years ago, this ragged shore was one of the first places I visited. Ahh! The air still smells the same!\n\nBut times have changed. Back then I helped Thrall, Vol'jin, Rexxar and Rokhan to lay the foundation of Orgrimmar. Today, I hardly recognize the place.\n\n<Chen's face falls.>\n\nSo much needless bloodshed. I just don't understand. Has Pandaria taught us nothing?"]="$n! So strange to see you here, far from the green forests of Pandaria.\n\nWhen I first sailed away from the Wandering Isle, years ago, this ragged shore was one of the first places I visited. Ahh! The air still smells the same!\n\nBut times have changed. Back then I helped Thrall, Vol'jin, Rexxar and Rokhan to lay the foundation of Orgrimmar. Today, I hardly recognize the place.\n\n<Chen's face falls.>\n\nSo much needless bloodshed. I just don't understand. Has Pandaria taught us nothing?"
G["$n! Some of my men are trapped in the basement - there is little time, help me save them!!"]="$n! Alguns de meus homens estão presos no porão. Fica pouco tempo. Ajude-me a salvá-los!"
G["$n! Still fighting the good fight?"]="$n! Continua ao pé do canhão?"
G["$n! Stormwind is under siege by elementals and needs your strength!\n\nWe've evacuated most of the city.  King Wrynn is holding the Trade District while Lady Proudmoore and the Archbishop defend the Mage and Cathedral Districts.\n\nWherever you go, you'll be of great help."]="$n! Ventobravo está sob cerco dos elementais e precisa sua força!\n\nTemos evacuado a maior parte da cidade! O rei Wrynn se tornou forte no Distrito de Mercadores enquanto Lady Corajoso e o arcebispo defendem o Bairro dos Magos e o Distrito da Catedral.\n\nAli onde queira que vá, será de grande ajuda!"
G["$n! THIS AREA IS OFF LIMITS!"]="$n! O ACESSO A ESTA ZONA ESTÁ PROIBIDO!"
G["$n! The Warchief is alive - he was rescued off the coast. Come outside, quickly. The town is ours!"]="$n, O Chefe de Guerra! Está vivo! Lhe resgataram na costa. Saia, rápido! A cidade é nossa!"
G["$n! The crystals sing your praises!"]="$n! Os cristais cantam seus louvores!"
G["$n! What can I do for ya?"]="$n! O que posso fazer por você?"
G["$n! What else have you been up to out there? Let me give you a word of advice; don't accept a promotion that'll take you out of the action."]="$n! Que mais tem estado fazendo aí fosse? Deixe-me dar a você um conselho: não aceite uma promoção que te tire da ação."
G["$n! You did it! I can't believe my eyes... the Inferno is gone... What has Aessina done!?"]="$n! O conseguiu! Não posso acreditar o que meus olhos veem... O Averno sumiu... Que fez Aessina?!"
G["$n! You got any humdingers to tell us? I bet you just got all kinds of new stories 'bout your adventures and whatnot."]="$n! You got any humdingers to tell us? I bet you just got all kinds of new stories 'bout your adventures and whatnot."
G["$n! You wanna help me out here with Fizz? He's up to no good again!"]="$n! Pode me ajudar com Fizz? Já volta a estar tramando algo!"
G["$n! You're a sight for sore eyes. Get over here and give me a hand, would you?"]="$n! Que bom ver você os olhos. Venha aqui e dê-me uma mão, que?"
G["$n! You're alive! Have you heard?"]="$n! Está $gvivo: viva;! Você soube?"
G["$n! You've returned just to talk to me? That's very thoughtful of you, and you look pretty sweet in that outfit, too!\n\nYou don't know how good it makes me feel to see you. It can get pretty lonely up here, what with most of these yahoos not being able to see me, and all. It's a great thing that you did for all of us, and I'll never forget it!\n\nThanks for dropping in and saying hi, and don't be such a stranger."]="$n! Voltou somente para falar comigo? É muito gentil pela sua parte e além... isso que veste posto te favorece muito!\n\nNão sabe quanto fico feliz em ver você. Posso chegar a me sentir muito somente aqui devido a que a maior parte de estes idiotas não podem me ver. Nunca esquecerei o que fez por todos nós!\n\nObrigado por vir a cumprimentar e não se esquecer de mim."
G["$n's concoction is ruined.  A new one must be created from scratch."]="O mistura de $n está arruinado. É preciso criar um novo desde zero."
G["$n's exotic fighting technique throws the Drakerider off-balance."]="A exótica técnica de luta de $n é preciso o cavaleiro de dracos perca o equilíbrio."
G["$n's here. Let's go."]="$n, Muito bem. Vamos."
G["$n, $g king : queen; of da ogres here!"]="Aqui $n, $grei: rainha; dos ogros!"
G["$n, $g king : queen; of the ogres, is here!"]="$n, $grei: rainha; dos ogros está aqui!"
G["$n, $g you handsome devil : you sexy thing;, get over here.  We need to talk about some statues...."]="$n, $gmacizo: linda;, aproxime-se. Temos que falar sobre certas estátuas..."
G["$n, $n, $n. Next time, try not to die so much."]="$n, $n, $n... A próxima vez tenta que não te matem tanto."
G["$n, $n. Can I call you $n?\n\nI am hanging from a meathook in the back of an ogre cave.\n\nHow do you THINK my research is progressing, you pompous dirt-sucking ass-$c? C'mere! C'mere you son of a swineherd!\n\n<Kristoff flutters back and forth on his chain, trying desperately to kick you in the face.>"]="$n, $n. Posso chamar você $n?\n\nEstou pendurado de um gancho de carne no fundo da caverna de um ogro.\n\nVocê como pensa que vai meu investigação, $c de meia-tigela $gcretino: cretina; e $gpresuntuoso: presuntuosa;? Venha! Venha aqui, $ghijo: filha; de piara!\n\n<Kristoff se se contorce cima e baixo no seu corrente, tentando desesperadamente dar a você uma chute na rosto.>"
G["$n, Champion of the Bronze Dragonflight, has rung the Scarab Gong. The ancient gates of Ahn'Qiraj open, revealing the horrors of a forgotten war..."]="$n, $gcampeón: campeona; do Voo Bronze, fez soar o gongo do Besouro. As antigas portões de Ahn'Qiraj se abrem, deixando ao descoberto os horrores de uma guerra esquecida..."
G["$n, Gahk's friend."]="$n ser amigo de Gahk!"
G["$n, I am in need of your help once again."]="$n, preciso da sua ajuda mais uma vez."
G["$n, I am not surprised to see you here. I always thought you were my brightest pupil. I am honored to fight alongside you, my friend."]="$n, não me surpreende ver você aqui. Sempre pensei que eras meu aluno mais brilhante. Me sinto honrada de lutar ao seu lado."
G["$n, I am pleased to see you. Our dwarven allies require our assistance in Alterac Valley. Will you help them?"]="$n, fico feliz em ver você. Nossos aliados anões necessário nossa ajuda no Vale Alterac. Os ajudará?"
G["$n, I have confirmed that this blood is from the Bonechewer clan of orcs, tainted with demonic power.  I'm afraid, however, that my current equipment can delve no deeper into this mystery..."]="$n, I have confirmed that this blood is from the Bonechewer clan of orcs, tainted with demonic power.  I'm afraid, however, that my current equipment can delve no deeper into this mystery..."
G["$n, I have created the cleansing totem."]="$n, criei o totem de limpeza."
G["$n, I have the information you seek..."]="$n, tenho a informações que procura..."
G["$n, I hope that you're staying for a while.  Stop by later if you have the time."]="Espero que te fique uma temporada, $n. Passe por aqui depois se tem tempo."
G["$n, I implore you to go to the Gate of Winter's Blossom and seek out Shado-Master Maikee as soon as you can."]="$n, te imploro que vá ao Passagem do Pétalo Glacial e encontre ao mestre Shado Maikee o antes possível."
G["$n, I lend you the cold vengeance of the northern winds!"]="$n, Te ofereço a fria vingança dos ventos do norte!"
G["$n, I need your help!"]="$n, preciso da sua ajuda!"
G["$n, I remember when you first came to see my father after the battle for Ebon Hold. I'm glad you're still with us."]="$n, lembrança quando veio a ver a meu pai pela primeira vez depois da batalha pelo Bastião de Ébano. fico feliz em que continue conosco."
G["$n, I shall leave before one of these beasts takes a liking to me!"]="$n, I shall leave before one of these beasts takes a liking to me!"
G["$n, I sure hope somebody finds my dog!"]="$n, espero que alguém encuentre a meu cão!"
G["$n, I was wondering if you'd be willing to endorse me come election time?"]="Apoyarías meu candidatura nas seguintes elecções, $n?"
G["$n, I will attend to the Arch Druid.  Malfurion and Matoclaw have requested your presence immediately."]="$n, Eu me ocupo do Arquidruida. Malfurion e Matogarra querem que vá a vê-os imediatamente."
G["$n, I would have words with you."]="$n, gostaria falar com você."
G["$n, I'd recognize dem tusks anywhere... What... What have dey done ta you, mon?"]="$n, reconheceria esses presas em qualquer lugar... Que... Que te têm feito, tron?"
G["$n, I'd recognize that decay anywhere... What... What have they done to you, $n?"]="$n, reconheceria essa descomoposição em qualquer lugar... Que... Que te têm feito, $n?"
G["$n, I'd recognize that face anywhere... What... What have they done to ye, $g lad:lass;?"]="$n, reconheceria esse rosto em qualquer lugar... Que... Que te têm feito, $gchico: garota;?"
G["$n, I'd recognize that face anywhere... What... What have they done to you, $n?"]="$n, reconheceria esse rosto em qualquer lugar... Que... Que te têm feito, $n?"
G["$n, I'd recognize those face tentacles anywhere... What... What have they done to you, $n?"]="$n, reconheceria esses tentáculos em qualquer lugar... Que... Que te têm feito, $n?"
G["$n, I'd recognize those horns anywhere... What... What have they done to you, $n?"]="$n, reconheceria esses chifres em qualquer lugar... Que... Que te têm feito, $n?"
G["$n, I'll make sure all my friends in the Cartel know that you've saved my life today.  Here - I'm going to need to be able to travel light, so please help yourself to my cache of tailoring and leatherworking supplies!  Thanks again - see ya!"]="$n, me garantirei de que todos meus amigos do Cartel saibam que me salvou a vida. Preciso viajar leve de peso assim que, por favor, pegue o que queira de meu estoque de suprimentos de alfaiataria e couro. Obrigado novamente, até depois!"
G["$n, I'm gifting Sunsong Ranch to you. You're in charge, now!"]="$n, te vou dar o Rancho Cantosol você. Agora você está ao envio!"
G["$n, I'm glad that you're here. Maybe I can teach you a thing or two.\n\nWhat do you think, $g sir : ma'am;?"]="$n, fico feliz em que estiver aqui. Talvez possa ensinar um par de coisas?\n\nQue opinas, $gsenhor: senhorita;?"
G["$n, I'm going to need your help!"]="$n, vou precisar sua ajuda!"
G["$n, I've rescued your equipment for you. I think you've seen all you need to see."]="$n, e recuperei seu equipamento. Acho que já tem visto tudo o que precisa ver."
G["$n, Krom'gar's army is no more. Your rank no longer has meaning. If you wish to truly help the Horde, your considerable power could be used in Desolace or in the Southern Barrens."]="$n, o exército de Krom'gar já não existe. Seu grau já não tem sentido. Se de verdade que ajudar à Horda, seu considerável força nos viria muito bem em Desolação ou nos Sertões do Sul."
G["$n, Savior of the Krazzworks!"]="$n, Salvador da Krazzaria!"
G["$n, a moment of your time, please? There's trouble that we need your help with."]="$n, tem um minuto? Precisamos que nos ajude com um problema."
G["$n, allow me to give you some advice: tuck tail now and fly back down to the safety of the valleys below."]="Permite que te dé um conselho, $n. Coleta a cauda e voe novamente aos vales seguros de além baixo."
G["$n, along with High Tinker Mekkatorque and Mountaineer Stonegrind, has defeated Razlo Crushcog!"]="$n, along with High Tinker Mekkatorque and Mountaineer Stonegrind, has defeated Razlo Crushcog!"
G["$n, can I come and train with you after we're done here?"]="Posso treinar com você quando terminarmos, $n?"
G["$n, can you help me get rid of these virmen?"]="$n, pode me ajudar a acabar com estes virmen?"
G["$n, come on! Get over here!!!"]="Venha, $n! Venha aqui!!"
G["$n, do you feel the need -- the need for speed?"]="$n, sente a necessidade... a necessidade de velocidade?"
G["$n, don't just stand there! Kharanos is burning! Go help! Ach, all that brew..."]="Espabila, $n! Kharanos está em chamas! Vê a ajudar! Toda essa cerveja..."
G["$n, eh? Oy! Citizen $n, come 'ere. Highlord Bolvar Fordragon has requested that all able bodied heroes o' the Alliance meet with him at Stormwind Keep. You just been recruited, mate! Get a move on!"]="$n, eh? Oy! Citizen $n, come 'ere. Highlord Bolvar Fordragon has requested that all able bodied heroes o' the Alliance meet with him at Stormwind Keep. You just been recruited, mate! Get a move on!"
G["$n, fun fact: the mogu here at Mogujia weren't always terracotta. They were buried alive with their lord after he died in glorious battle."]="Um fato curioso, $n: os mogu de Mogujia não sempre foram de terracota. Os enterravam vivos ao lado aos seus senhores quando estes morriam em batalhas épicas."
G["$n, get into the Ultimate Footbomb Uniform behind you and get down to the docks. Help Thrall kick the Trade Prince's butt!"]="$n, entre no uniforme de futebomba supremo que tem por trás de ti e baixa ao cais. Ajuda a Thrall a acabar o sozinho com o Príncipe mercante!"
G["$n, get over here."]="$n, venha aqui."
G["$n, get these Wildhammer off of my airfield!"]="$n, tire a esses Martelo Feroz de meu base aérea!"
G["$n, get to Stormwind. Tell King Wrynn everything. EVERYTHING! GO NOW!"]="$n, vê a Ventobravo. Cuéntale tudo ao rei Wrynn. TUDO! VÊ, AGORA!"
G["$n, get to one of the Krazz Cannons and shoot those Stormtalons down before they bring this whole place down on us!"]="$n, get to one of the Krazz Cannons and shoot those Stormtalons down before they bring this whole place down on us!"
G["$n, get to the Mechashark X-Steam Controller. Rid us of the Hammer menace!"]="$n, get to the Mechashark X-Steam Controller. Rid us of the Hammer menace!"
G["$n, get your crap ready. I'm sending you out into the field."]="$n, pegue seus coisas e prepare-se. Te envio ao campo de batalha."
G["$n, glad to see you're still in one piece! I saw a rocket fly by earlier and heard your voice screaming, so I was a bit worried.\n\nWe have one last shipment to take care of. Talk to me when you're ready and we'll get going."]="$n, fico feliz em ver você de uma peça! Há um tempo vi passar um foguete a toda velocidade e te ouvi gritar, assim que estava um pouco preocupado.\n\nTemos que cuidar de um último carregamento. Fala comigo quando queira poderá em marcha."
G["$n, good to see you!\n\nOr is this the first time that we've met?\n\nI'm in so many places and times right now, I sometimes have a hard time keeping track of all of it."]="$n, fico feliz em ver você!\n\nOU é pela primeira vez que nos encontramos?\n\nAgora mesmo estou em tantos lugares e momentos que a vezes é difícil levar a conta."
G["$n, have ye any idea o' what we're up against in Alterac Valley?  Are ye ready to fight the Frostwolf Clan?"]="$n, tem alguma ideia dao que nos enfrentamos no Vale Alterac? Está $gpronto: pronta; para lutar ao clã Lobo Gelo?"
G["$n, have you been back to Orgrimmar?  What news?"]="Tem passado por Orgrimmar, $n? Traz alguma notícia?"
G["$n, help me by activating the three large totems."]="$n, Ativaos três totens grandes, por favor."
G["$n, hop into one of those B.C. Eliminators and wipe out the pygmies!"]="$n, hop into one of those B.C. Eliminators and wipe out the pygmies!"
G["$n, how are you today?"]="Como você está hoje, $n?"
G["$n, how are you?"]="Como você está, $n?"
G["$n, how many hundreds of demons have you banished?"]="$n, quantos centenas de demônios tem desterrado?"
G["$n, how may I further your training in the eyes of the Earth Mother?"]="$n, como posso fomentar seu treinamento aos olhos da Mãe Terra?"
G["$n, how may I further your training?"]="$n, como posso ajudar você a melhorar seu treinamento?"
G["$n, how's your mount holding up?  Pretty rough up there these days?"]="$n, que tal aguanta seu montaria? É duro estar ali lá em cima hoje em dia?"
G["$n, if you have the time later, perhaps you and I could sit and talk over tea?"]="$n, se depois tem tempo, poderíamos nos sentar e falar enquanto nos tomamos um chá."
G["$n, is it? I have heard your name spoken in the village."]="$n, verdade? Ouvi falar de ti pela aldeia."
G["$n, is that you? Please free me from these chains."]="$n, é você? Por favor, liberte-me de estas correntes."
G["$n, it is dangerous out there. For your own safety, make use of the totem I gave you!"]="$n, isto é perigoso. Pelo seu própria segurança, usao totem que te dei."
G["$n, it is good to see you again.\n\nRemember to stay focused on your learning.  You represent our future, and should you falter our future will be dark indeed."]="$n, it is good to see you again.\n\nRemember to stay focused on your learning.  You represent our future, and should you falter our future will be dark indeed."
G["$n, it is good to see you.  Our war with the other elemental lords yet rages, but your efforts help ensure our victory."]="Fico feliz ver você novamente, $n. Nossa guerra com os outros Senhores Elementais continua em pleno auge, mas seus esforços ajudam a garantir nossa vitória."
G["$n, it is good to see you. Have you come to help push the front for us?"]="$n, fico feliz em ver você. Tem vindo para fazer avançar o linha de frente para nós?"
G["$n, it's good to see veterans like you in the field!  I'm sorry to report that our supplies are currently too low to launch any large ground assaults against the Horde.\n\nSpeak with our quartermaster; he has supply missions available."]="$n, fico feliz em ver a veteranos como você no campo! Sinto informar de que nossos suprimentos são demais escassos para lançar ataque terrestres a grande escala contra a Horda.\n\nFala com nosso intendente; tem missões de suprimentos disponíveis."
G["$n, it's good to see you again!  Are you having fun at the Faire?\n\nWant to arm wrestle?  No, of course not... you want to keep your arm!"]="$n, fico feliz em ver você novamente! Te o está passando bem na Feira?\n\nQue dar um pulso? Não, claro que não... Certo que não que perder seu braço!"
G["$n, it's very good to see you again!"]="$n, fico feliz em voltar a ver você!"
G["$n, it's you! Thanks, $g man : sweetie;!"]="$n, é você! Obrigado, $gtío: querida;!"
G["$n, just between you and me, I never saw the fall of the Lich King. And... well... I've never been to Ulduar. I... well... I am a dungeon explorer. Yes. I prefer exploring dungeons with allies. The pay is excellent and the risk is low."]="$n, entre você eu, nunca vi a cai do Rei Lich. E.. bom... nunca tenho estado em Ulduar. Eu... bom... sou um explorador de masmorras. Sim. Prefiro explorar masmorras com aliados. A paga é excelente e os riscos mínimos."
G["$n, know that our \"Warchief\" does not speak for us all. There are those among us who hope to see the Dragonmaw great again... and free from corruption."]="$n, quero que saiba que nosso \"Chefe de Guerra\" não fala em nome de todos. Entre nós há quem desejam ver aos Faucedraco com o seu grandeza de antanho... E livres de toda corrupção."
G["$n, let's go see if this plan will work.  Come along, Buddy!"]="$n, vamos conferir se funciona esse plano. Vamos, colega!"
G["$n, let's use the antechamber to the right."]="$n, usemos a antecâmara da direita."
G["$n, may I have a moment of your time?"]="$n, pode me dedicar um momento do seu tempo?"
G["$n, may your death stand as an example to all who challenge the Defias Brotherhood!"]="$n, que seu morte sirva de exemplo a todos os que desafíen à Guilda Défias!"
G["$n, my $g boy : girl;!\n\nWant me to teach you any of my thermal palms healing techniques?\n\nNo? How about bandages? Do you want to learn about bandages?"]="$n, my $g boy : girl;!\n\nWant me to teach you any of my thermal palms healing techniques?\n\nNo? How about bandages? Do you want to learn about bandages?"
G["$n, my child, come here, I have something to ask of you."]="$n, $ghijo meu: filha minha;, venha aqui. E de pedir algo."
G["$n, my duties are complete and I shall now take my leave.  Luck to you my $gfellow:lady;, and remember to keep the Bell, Wheel and Candle working!"]="$n, my duties are complete and I shall now take my leave.  Luck to you my $gfellow:lady;, and remember to keep the Bell, Wheel and Candle working!"
G["$n, my form has now changed! The true strength of my spirit is returning to me now... The cursed grasp of the forest is leaving me."]="$n, meu forma tem mudado! A verdadeira força de meu espírito voltou a mim... A maldição do florestas me está abandonando."
G["$n, my good friend! I hope everything is going well for you and Mr. Yoon at the farm."]="$n, meu $gbuen amigo: boa amiga;! Espero que tudo os vá bem você e ao Sr. Yoon na fazenda."
G["$n, no hurt A-Me. A-Me, good."]="$n, no hurt A-Me. A-Me, good."
G["$n, one of these days I want to buy you a drink."]="$n, um dos estes dias quero convidar a uma bebida."
G["$n, our attack should be ready shortly. Wait here and push up the ramp with them."]="$n, our attack should be ready shortly. Wait here and push up the ramp with them."
G["$n, our forces are about to push up the ramp. You should join them."]="$n, our forces are about to push up the ramp. You should join them."
G["$n, our forces are pushing up the ramp. You should join them there."]="$n, our forces are pushing up the ramp. You should join them there."
G["$n, our forces are pushing up to the tower already. You should join them, quickly."]="$n, nossas forças já se estão abrindo passo na torre. Deveria se juntar a elas, rápido."
G["$n, over here if you please."]="$n, venha aqui, por favor."
G["$n, over here!"]="$n, por aqui!"
G["$n, over here."]="$n, por aqui."
G["$n, over here. He's hurt."]="Aqui, $n. Está ferido."
G["$n, over here. What do you have to report? Were you followed?"]="$n, por aqui. O que precisa informar? Te têm seguido?"
G["$n, pay very close attention to what I do and follow my instructions precisely. To not heed my words is to sign your own death warrant, as Taskmaster Fizzule is VERY well versed in the ways of the warrior and the assassin."]="$n, coloque muita atenção ao que faço e continua meus instruções com precisão. Não oferecer atenção a meus palavras significa assinar seu sentência de morte, já que o Capataz Fizzule conhece MUITO BEM os segredos dos guerreiros e os assassinos."
G["$n, please come to me.  I'm here in Zim'Torga now."]="Por favor, $n, venha aqui. Agora estou em Zim'torga."
G["$n, please listen closely. You MUST go back to Ordo Ragemesa and kill their chief."]="$n, ouça atenciosamente, por favor. DEVE voltar à Meseta Infame de Ordo e matar ao seu chefe."
G["$n, please make sure that you tell Gahruj of our success."]="$n, comunica a Gahruj nosso êxito."
G["$n, please stop those pirates before they destroy the Speedbarge!"]="$n, por favor, detenha a esses piratas antes de que destruam o Barcódromo!"
G["$n, please take a look at the sample of the Vylestem vine that I took from the caverns, so that you know what to look for..."]="$n, por favor, dê um olhada à mostra de hera vil que colhi nas cavernas, assim saberá o que está procurando..."
G["$n, right? Word of advice: don't let the Trade Prince catch you around here. He knows you're after his job.\n\nEveryone knows."]="$n, verdade? Um conselho: não permitas que o Príncipe mercante te veja por aqui. Sabe que que seu posto.\n\nTodo o mundo o sabe."
G["$n, sit on down. The fire's warm and the monkeys don't seem to like it."]="$n, sente-se. O fogo é quente e parece ser que aos macacos não lhes há graça."
G["$n, slay any dragons today?"]="$n matar algum dragão hoje?"
G["$n, slay dragon?"]="$n matar dragão!"
G["$n, somehow I feel stronger from Mam'toth's blood."]="$n, por algum motivo me sinto mais forte Obrigado à sangue de Mam'toth."
G["$n, stay here and help Taylor recover."]="$n, stay here and help Taylor recover."
G["$n, summon me again when you need to perform the ritual again."]="$n, volta a me invocar quando necesites voltar a realizar o ritual."
G["$n, terror of the skies, how are you doing?"]="$n, terror dos céus, como está?"
G["$n, thank goodness you're here!"]="$n, ainda bem que você está aqui!"
G["$n, thank you again for helping us. We couldn't have achieved any of this without you."]="$n, Obrigado novamente por nos ajudar. Não poderíamos conseguido nada de isto sem ti."
G["$n, thank you for dealing with the mystery of the Shadow Council at Grangol'var Village."]="$n, thank you for dealing with the mystery of the Shadow Council at Grangol'var Village."
G["$n, thank you for helping me today. I knew we could convince my father of the right course. Please, go back to your other duties for now."]="$n, Obrigado por me ajudar hoje. Sabia que poderíamos convencer a meu pai de fazer o correto. Vê, por agora pode voltar aos seus outras ocupações."
G["$n, thank you for your help. While the world will not know, you've saved them more than they're aware. Kanrethad had to be stopped. I'll see to it that he stays banished."]="$n, obrigada por sua ajuda. Mesmo que o mundo não saiba disso, você os salvou muito mais do que podem imaginar. Kanrethad precisava ser parado. Garantirei que ele continue banido."
G["$n, that's it! I have finally figured it out!"]="$n, isso é! Finalmente o e averiguado!"
G["$n, the Silverwing Sentinels must be crushed!  Are you ready for Warsong Gulch?"]="$n, é preciso acabar com os sentinelas Asa de Prata! Está $gpreparado: preparada; para a Ravina Brado Guerreiro?"
G["$n, the Sons of Lothar have fought here, on the Hellfire Peninsula, for two decades.  We are beset on all sides by indigenous orcs and hellish demons of the Burning Crusade, and though our hearts still beat fiercely, years of war have reduced our numbers.\n\nYou, and the influx of Azeroth's new generation of heroes, are a welcome sight indeed!"]="$n, the Sons of Lothar have fought here, on the Hellfire Peninsula, for two decades.  We are beset on all sides by indigenous orcs and hellish demons of the Burning Crusade, and though our hearts still beat fiercely, years of war have reduced our numbers.\n\nYou, and the influx of Azeroth's new generation of heroes, are a welcome sight indeed!"
G["$n, the Stormpike Guard is in need of your aid in the battle against the Frostwolf Clan in Alterac Valley, now more than ever.  The opportunities for honor and repute are greater than ever as well! Will you join the battle?"]="$n, a Guarda Pico Tempestade precisa mais do que nunca sua ajuda na batalha contra o clã Lobo Gelo no Vale Alterac. E há mais possibilidades que nunca de obter honra e reputação! Vai se juntar à batalha?"
G["$n, the Twilight slaves you and others have been rescuing from Wolf's Run are wandering into camp, but they can't tell me who they are and they speak in riddles and gibberish.\n\nI thought Twilight's Hammer kept the slaves in line the old fashioned way - you know, whips and chains - but it's clear that there's some brainwashing at work..."]="$n, the Twilight slaves you and others have been rescuing from Wolf's Run are wandering into camp, but they can't tell me who they are and they speak in riddles and gibberish.\n\nI thought Twilight's Hammer kept the slaves in line the old fashioned way - you know, whips and chains - but it's clear that there's some brainwashing at work..."
G["$n, the most famous $r $c in all of Pandaria! Get over here and give ol' Chow a hug!"]="$n, the most famous $r $c in all of Pandaria! Get over here and give ol' Chow a hug!"
G["$n, the translation is finished!"]="$n, a tradução está pronta!"
G["$n, the village of Azure Watch is burning!  Go help fight the fire!"]="$n, a Avançado Lazúli está em chamas! ajude-os a apagar o fogo!"
G["$n, the village of Goldshire is burning!  Go help fight the fire!"]="$n, Vilhadorada está em chamas! Vê e ajude-os a apagar o fogo!"
G["$n, there's something that I need you to do."]="$n, há algo que preciso que faça."
G["$n, this beer... well, it might be the best of Brewfest!"]="$n, esta cerveja... Bom, talvez seja a melhor da Festa."
G["$n, this came for you this morning."]="Chegou isto para você pela manhã, $n."
G["$n, this last spot's for you and Farmer Yoon. Why don't you do the honors?"]="$n, este lugar de aqui é para o fazendeiro Yoon e para você. Por que não faz os honores?"
G["$n, underneath the moss, this heart looks like a seed!"]="$n, sob o musgo, este Coração parece uma semente!"
G["$n, unlocking the secret of these collars is beyond my skills..."]="$n, unlocking the secret of these collars is beyond my skills..."
G["$n, was it? That is a mighty fine piece of work ye have there. I'll take ye on, train ye how to make armor fit fer King Magni himself."]="$n, was it? That is a mighty fine piece of work ye have there. I'll take ye on, train ye how to make armor fit fer King Magni himself."
G["$n, was it? There'll be a few extra gold for you if you can personally guarantee my safety."]="$n, was it? There'll be a few extra gold for you if you can personally guarantee my safety."
G["$n, we have enough supplies to launch ground assaults into the Field of Strife.  If you want to send the orders, and your rank is high enough, then speak with Sergeant Yazra Bloodsnarl in Frostwolf Village."]="$n, temos suficientes suprimentos para lançar ataque terrestres na Terra de Disputa. Se que dar as ordens, e tem grau para fazer isso, vá embora a falar com o sargento Yazra Grunhido Sangrenta na Aldeia Lobo Gelo."
G["$n, we have enough supplies to launch ground assaults.  If your standing with the Stormpike Guard is high enough, then speak with Corporal Noreg Stormpike."]="$n, temos suficientes suprimentos para lançar ataque terrestres. Se seu grau na Guarda Pico Tempestade é o suficiente alto, fala com o cabo Noreg Pico Tempestade."
G["$n, we meet again! You looking for Shang? I think he's in back, polishing his melon."]="$n, we meet again! You looking for Shang? I think he's in back, polishing his melon."
G["$n, we must hurry and discover when the North Wind has started distorting the timeline. Only then can we defeat him and correct it."]="$n, we must hurry and discover when the North Wind has started distorting the timeline. Only then can we defeat him and correct it."
G["$n, we must speak when the queen is done with you."]="$n, devemos falar quando a rainha tenha terminou com você."
G["$n, we need to escape through the northern tunnel!"]="$n, temos que escapar pelo túnel do norte!"
G["$n, what are you still doing here?  Have you spoken with Proenitus down at the crash site yet?"]="$n, what are you still doing here?  Have you spoken with Proenitus down at the crash site yet?"
G["$n, what are you waiting for?  Find Field Marshal Teravaine in the Field of Strife and give him the assault orders.  Once he gets the orders, he and his troops will charge into the Horde and take no prisoners!"]="$n, what are you waiting for?  Find Field Marshal Teravaine in the Field of Strife and give him the assault orders.  Once he gets the orders, he and his troops will charge into the Horde and take no prisoners!"
G["$n, what are you waiting for?  Find Field Marshal in the Field of Strife and give him the assault orders.  Once he gets the orders, he and his troops will charge into the Horde and take no prisoners!"]="$n, what are you waiting for?  Find Field Marshal in the Field of Strife and give him the assault orders.  Once he gets the orders, he and his troops will charge into the Horde and take no prisoners!"
G["$n, what's this I hear about trouble at the Gate of Winter's Blossom? Are we looking at a second yaungol invasion even bigger than the first?"]="$n, que é isso que ouvi de que há problemas no Passagem do Pétalo Glacial? Se trata de uma segunda invasão yaungol ainda maior que a primeira?"
G["$n, with the crane's powers, you can jump over the flames!"]="$n, Graças ao poder da grulha, pode saltar as chamas!"
G["$n, wonderful to see you. Wonderful."]="$n, é maravilhoso ver você. Maravilhoso!"
G["$n, you above all have earned the right for the Horde to inhabit our ancestral home."]="$n, você mais que ninguém ganhou o direito a que a Horda habite nosso lar ancestral."
G["$n, you and Hobart are going to be the death of me!"]="$n, você e Roberto vais a ser meu morte!"
G["$n, you and I are friends."]="$n, você e eu somos amigos."
G["$n, you and I should race sometime."]="$n, um dia destes nós deveríamos apostar uma corrida."
G["$n, you and your Alliance did much to aid my people in freeing the Black Temple of Illidan's grasp. \n\nI will help you as a show of mutual trust and repayment of the debt I owe you."]="$n, you and your Alliance did much to aid my people in freeing the Black Temple of Illidan's grasp. \n\nI will help you as a show of mutual trust and repayment of the debt I owe you."
G["$n, you and your Horde  did much to aid my people in freeing the Black Temple of Illidan's grasp. \n\nI will help you as a show of mutual trust and repayment of the debt I owe you."]="$n, you and your Horde  did much to aid my people in freeing the Black Temple of Illidan's grasp. \n\nI will help you as a show of mutual trust and repayment of the debt I owe you."
G["$n, you are becoming quite a skilled medic. You should continue your first aid training."]="$n, você está se tornando um médico habilidoso. Continue seu treinamento em Primeiros Socorros."
G["$n, you are ready for the ultimate task.  The fiery runes etched on the floor of the molten core are conduits to the realm of fire, and their presence is both an affront to us and a source of power for the Firelords.  They must be extinguished!\n\nTo extinguish a rune, take a vial of aqual quintessence.  Pour it on the rune and its flame will go out, rendering it useless and weakening our enemy!"]="$n, you are ready for the ultimate task.  The fiery runes etched on the floor of the molten core are conduits to the realm of fire, and their presence is both an affront to us and a source of power for the Firelords.  They must be extinguished!\n\nTo extinguish a rune, take a vial of aqual quintessence.  Pour it on the rune and its flame will go out, rendering it useless and weakening our enemy!"
G["$n, you are the Skyguard's best; make us proud!"]="$n, é o melhor da Guarda do céu, faça que nos sintamos orgulhosos!"
G["$n, you are the champion I've long been awaiting. You will be the one to find and reunite the elemental spirits so that we might speak to Shen-zin Su and heal our land."]="$n, you are the champion I've long been awaiting. You will be the one to find and reunite the elemental spirits so that we might speak to Shen-zin Su and heal our land."
G["$n, you did it. It looks like they're fleeing."]="$n, você conseguiu. Parece que eles estão fugindo."
G["$n, you did well. I'm going back to camp to take care of the wounded. Check in with the Commander when you're done out here."]="$n, you did well. I'm going back to camp to take care of the wounded. Check in with the Commander when you're done out here."
G["$n, you do not know how to tame a pet."]="$n, não sabe como domar uma ajudante."
G["$n, you gonna save us from those pirates, or what?!"]="$n, you gonna save us from those pirates, or what?!"
G["$n, you gotta get in there and rescue our people!"]="$n, precisa entrar aí e resgate a nossa gente!"
G["$n, you gotta get in there and save our people!"]="$n, precisa entrar aí e superando a nossa gente!"
G["$n, you gotta get those teraptor hatchlings before they get us!"]="$n, precisa conseguir essas proles de teraptor antes de que nos pilhen!"
G["$n, you have disturbed me from my rest!"]="$n, tem interrompido meu descanso!"
G["$n, you have done a great service for us, restoring some of our honor.  Look for us again in your darkest hour when our enemies are near."]="$n, you have done a great service for us, restoring some of our honor.  Look for us again in your darkest hour when our enemies are near."
G["$n, you have no idea how glad I am to see you. Supervising is hungry work."]="$n, não tem ideia do que fico feliz em ver você. Supervisionar me da muita fome."
G["$n, you have no idea what a relief it is to see you!"]="$n, não sabe quanto nos alivia ver você!"
G["$n, you have to hunt down the Trade Prince!"]="$n, precisa ir a pelo Príncipe mercante!"
G["$n, you have to hurry and break your moolah out of the bank!"]="$n, precisa dar a você pressa e tirar seu pasta do banco!"
G["$n, you have unleashed the wolf ancient and defeated his shadow. Your actions already reverberate across the dream - thank you. But more remains to be done..."]="$n, tem liberado ao ancestral lobo e derrotou ao seu sombra. Seus actos já resuenan pelo Sonho... Obrigado. Mas ainda restam coisas por fazer..."
G["$n, you look well. I heard the call to arms, which is why I've left our home and come here to join the fight.\n\nI see you have grown much since we last met. I am honored to have taught you. You are a true hero of the Alliance."]="$n, you look well. I heard the call to arms, which is why I've left our home and come here to join the fight.\n\nI see you have grown much since we last met. I am honored to have taught you. You are a true hero of the Alliance."
G["$n, you return!  The spirits of my last meal said you would come see me and that we would discuss business.\n\nWere they correct?"]="$n, you return!  The spirits of my last meal said you would come see me and that we would discuss business.\n\nWere they correct?"
G["$n, you should know that the last sixteen recruits..."]="$n, you should know that the last sixteen recruits..."
G["$n, you too shall serve the Master!"]="$n, você também servirás ao Mestre!"
G["$n, you were slain by Hagara's Ice Wave. \nStart running early to avoid the ice!"]="$n, you were slain by Hagara's Ice Wave. \nStart running early to avoid the ice!"
G["$n, you were slain by a Resonating Crystal. Standing closer to the Resonating Crystal reduces the damage."]="$n, you were slain by a Resonating Crystal. Standing closer to the Resonating Crystal reduces the damage."
G["$n, you're an inspiration."]="$n, você é uma inspiração."
G["$n, you're going to want to fly over these giants and stone troggs. Don't try to ride through them."]="$n, you're going to want to fly over these giants and stone troggs. Don't try to ride through them."
G["$n, you've done it!"]="$n, você conseguiu!"
G["$n, you've returned! Is that the middle fragment?"]="$n, voltou! Isso é o fragmento central?"
G["$n, your bomber is ready.  Good luck!"]="$n, your bomber is ready.  Good luck!"
G["$n, your strength is inspiring."]="$n, sua força é inspiradora."
G["$n. These shells tell me much, but I fear many more questions are now raised..."]="$n, estes caparazones me dizem muito, mas me temo que têm surgido muitas mais perguntas..."
G["$n. Zuni. Ya'll find ya trainer in the trainin' grounds to the east. Bring pride to the Darkspear."]="$n. Zuni. Ya'll find ya trainer in the trainin' grounds to the east. Bring pride to the Darkspear."
G["$n... You have served the Horde well.\n\nHurry now... speak with Kadrak....\n\nSave Splintertree!!"]="$n... Tem servido bem à Horda.\n\nDate pressa... fala com Kadrak...\n\nSalva ao Machadozo!"
G["$n?"]="$n?"
G["$n? $G Sir : Ma'am;, you're not a hunter, you're a $c."]="$n? $GSenhor: Senhorita; senhor: Senhorita;, não é $Gun caçador: uma caçadora;, é $gun: uma; $c."
G["$n? I heard you were dead."]="$n? Oí que havia morto."
G["$n? It's about time you got here. What kept you? My father's life is in jeopardy!"]="$n? Já era hora de que vinieras. Por que você retrasado? A vida de meu pai corre perigo!"
G["$n? Mon?"]="$n? Tron?"
G["$n? What are you doing here? And is that Keegan Firebeard behind you?"]="$n? O que está fazendo aqui? E esse que está por trás de ti, não é Keegan Barbafuego?"
G["$n? What are you doing here? We need you up on the Skyfire! Quick, take the portal!"]="$n? O que está fazendo aqui? Precisamos de você no Abrasacielos! Usao portal, rápido!"
G["$n? What is going on here?"]="$n? O que está acontecendo aqui?"
G["$n?! What are you still doing here?\n\nYou have to get off of the island, or better yet, into one of my Town-In-A-Boxes!\n\nDon't wait too long, my $g boy : girl;! The Cataclysm is upon us!"]="$n?! What are you still doing here?\n\nYou have to get off of the island, or better yet, into one of my Town-In-A-Boxes!\n\nDon't wait too long, my $g boy : girl;! The Cataclysm is upon us!"
G["$ndamus, you're a born leader!"]="$ndamus, te queremos, líder!"
G["$p - good work. Without your assistance, I'm afraid this whole business would have ended quite nastily."]="Bom trabalho, $p. Sem sua ajuda, tudo este assunto haveria tido um fim muito amargo."
G["$p can also teach your villagers to defend themselves."]="$p can also teach your villagers to defend themselves."
G["$p is coming. They can help us get you out of here."]="$p is coming. They can help us get you out of here."
G["$p!  I am setting up a sobering fire.  If you need a fresh breath come toward me."]="$p!  I am setting up a sobering fire.  If you need a fresh breath come toward me."
G["$p! Are you okay? Wake up!"]="$p! Você está bem? Acorde!"
G["$p! Check this thing out!"]="$p! Olhe só isto!"
G["$p! Come in close and help me pop this big ol' bubble!"]="$p! Aproxime-se e ajude-me a estourar esta bolha enorme!"
G["$p! I am... not in control... Get away!"]="$p! Não... tenho... o controle... Corre!"
G["$p! Nesingwary and Nesingwary are waiting for you at the Torjari Pit."]="$p! Nesingwary e Nesingwary estão esperando você na Fosso Torjari."
G["$p! Over here!"]="$p! Aqui!"
G["$p! There are mogu near! Watch out!"]="$p! Há mogu perto! Cuidado!"
G["$p! We've done it!"]="$p! Conseguimos!"
G["$p! You'll help me stop the mantid?"]="$p! Me ajudará a parar aos mantídeos?"
G["$p! You're here! Assault their leader and we will back you up."]="$p! You're here! Assault their leader and we will back you up."
G["$p! You've saved us! We'll go somewhere safe."]="$p! Nos salvou! Vamos a algum lugar certo."
G["$p, Taoshi, help these men get their camp in order.  I'll assess the state of the bridge."]="$p, Ajudem a estes homens com o seu acampamento. Eu avaliarei a situação."
G["$p, a word before you venture forth."]="$p, uma coisa antes de que continue adiante."
G["$p, go speak to Guard Captain Oakenshield. Tell him we need reinforcements!"]="$p, Vê a falar com o capitão Escudo de Carvalho. Peça reforços!"
G["$p, help at Farwatch Overlook and then bring Nurong back to us here. Our final confrontation approaches swiftly."]="$p, Ajuda no Alto de Vigilância e traz de volta a Nurong. O enfrentamento fim está perto."
G["$p, if the scouts give you any information on the mogu leader, you know what to do."]="$p, se os batedores te derem qualquer tipo de informações sobre o líder mogu, já sabe o que precisa fazer."
G["$p, it is good to see you. It will be an honor to face Lei Shen.\n\nThe lorewalkers of the Wandering Isle told us many stories of the dreaded Thunder King. We must proceed with caution here. If legends are to be believed, he was as clever as he was brutal."]="$p, it is good to see you. It will be an honor to face Lei Shen.\n\nThe lorewalkers of the Wandering Isle told us many stories of the dreaded Thunder King. We must proceed with caution here. If legends are to be believed, he was as clever as he was brutal."
G["$p, let me know if you need any help with the village defenses!"]="$p, Avise-me se você precisa ajuda com as defesas da aldeia!"
G["$p, meet me at Dawnchaser Retreat. I must see to my brother's remains, and then we must deal with this mantid threat."]="$p, meet me at Dawnchaser Retreat. I must see to my brother's remains, and then we must deal with this mantid threat."
G["$p, meet me at the Sentinel Basecamp. I must bring my daughter's body there. We still have the Water of Youth."]="$p, meet me at the Sentinel Basecamp. I must bring my daughter's body there. We still have the Water of Youth."
G["$p, meet me back at Thunder Cleft. I must bring my brother's body back to our people."]="$p, meet me back at Thunder Cleft. I must bring my brother's body back to our people."
G["$p, my men have been instructed to wait for your arrival before they attack. Do not delay."]="$p, E organizado a meus homens que aguarden seu chegada antes de atacar. Não te retrases."
G["$p, our people have lived the wholes of their lives on this great turtle, Shen-zin Su, but not in hundreds of years has anyone spoken to him."]="$p, Nosso povo tem vivido durante generações sobre Shen-zin Seu, a grande tartaruga, mas em centenas de anos ninguém tem falado com ele."
G["$p, over here at the exit."]="$p, por aqui, na saída."
G["$p, over here near the end of the bridge."]="$p, por aqui, perto do fim da ponte."
G["$p, report for duty immediately!"]="$p, apresente-se imediatamente!"
G["$p, take care of those eggs! We'll focus on the big mama!"]="$p, Encárgate desses ovos! E nós da mamãe!"
G["$p, watch the corners. I hear something comin'."]="$p, atenção às esquinas. Acho que ouvi algo."
G["$p, we could use a champion like you in Stoneplow."]="$p, nos viria muito bem $gun campeão: uma campeona; como você em Vilharroca."
G["$p, we should discuss matters back in Krasarang. For now, thank you for your help. There is a portal that can return you to Lion's Landing whenever you choose."]="$p, deveríamos falar em Krasarang. Por agora, te agradeço sua ajuda. Há um portal que te devolverá ao Ancoradouro do Leão quando o quiser."
G["$p, where's Master Shang?"]="$p, onde está o Mestre Shang?"
G["$p... To think you'd risked your life to save me - twice now - and I'd only treated you with disdain."]="$p... To think you'd risked your life to save me - twice now - and I'd only treated you with disdain."
G["$p... he's succumbing to the sha..."]="$p, Sucumbe ao sha..."
G["$p... you picked that flower like a champion! You're like a... a professional flower-picker! Have you done this before?"]="$p, Que maneira de coletar flores! Parece que leve toda a vida se dedicando a isto! Confesse. O havia feito antes, verdade?"
