G["'Netherstorm' was not always as you see it now.\n\nThere was a time when this crumbling land was known as the Plains of Farahlon. Little of those days has survived the evil that has taken hold here."]="'Netherstorm' was not always as you see it now.\n\nThere was a time when this crumbling land was known as the Plains of Farahlon. Little of those days has survived the evil that has taken hold here."
