G["'Sploded dat one!"]="Esse explodido!"
G["'Sweet child', pappy'd always call me. Well, what we're plannin' for these Horde vermin ain't so sweet!"]="'Sweet child', pappy'd always call me. Well, what we're plannin' for these Horde vermin ain't so sweet!"
G["'Talon King' Ikiss is one of the leaders of the Sethekk, along with my brother, Darkweaver Syth.\n\nIt was they who led the exodus of the Sethekk from Skettis to the ruins of Auchindoun. In the beginning, Ikiss was a charismatic leader, but he has descended into madness.\n\nNow, he openly proclaims that he is Terokk reborn! He truly expects the arakkoa to bend knee to him as their ruler. Can you believe his arrogance?"]="'Talon King' Ikiss is one of the leaders of the Sethekk, along with my brother, Darkweaver Syth.\n\nIt was they who led the exodus of the Sethekk from Skettis to the ruins of Auchindoun. In the beginning, Ikiss was a charismatic leader, but he has descended into madness.\n\nNow, he openly proclaims that he is Terokk reborn! He truly expects the arakkoa to bend knee to him as their ruler. Can you believe his arrogance?"
G["'Til Mighty Firebeard crossed heart and professed"]="'Til Mighty Firebeard crossed heart and professed"
