G["'Twas a fierce battle, $n! Take a moment to rest and gather yer forces. Who knows what lies beyond that door?\n\nLet me know when yer ready and we'll begin our ascent into the upper reaches of the citadel."]="'Twas a fierce battle, $n! Take a moment to rest and gather yer forces. Who knows what lies beyond that door?\n\nLet me know when yer ready and we'll begin our ascent into the upper reaches of the citadel."
