G["<A cockroach slithers from Calder's mouth and scurries back into his skull through an empty eye socket.>"]="<Uma barata desliza da boca de Calder e volta para o seu crânio através de uma cavidade ocular vazia.>"
G["<A dream-like vision of Ysera floats before you, her attention divided. After a moment, she addresses you.>\n\nFor many years, Aviana fluttered at the periphery of my dreams. I wondered if she should ever return to us. I fear her spirit has darkened with the passage of time...\n\nBut we have more immediate concerns if we hope to save this mountain."]="<A dream-like vision of Ysera floats before you, her attention divided. After a moment, she addresses you.>\n\nFor many years, Aviana fluttered at the periphery of my dreams. I wondered if she should ever return to us. I fear her spirit has darkened with the passage of time...\n\nBut we have more immediate concerns if we hope to save this mountain."
G["<A hand-lettered sign reads:>\n\n          Secret Lab Archives\n     X. Nizzlebex, Lab Director\n\n\n<It appears nobody is home right now. Perhaps you should come back later?>"]="<Um cartaz escrito a mão diz:>\n\n Arquivo do Laboratório Segredo\n X. Nizzlebex. Director do laboratório\n\n\n<Parece que agora mesmo no há ninguém. Talvez deveria voltar mais tarde?>"
G["<A hand-lettered sign reads:>\n\n          Secret Lab Archives\n     X. Nizzlebex, Lab Director\n\n\nPlease ring buzzer for service."]="<A hand-lettered sign reads:>\n\n          Secret Lab Archives\n     X. Nizzlebex, Lab Director\n\n\nPlease ring buzzer for service."
G["<A hefty tome with a well-worn cover and bits of earth stuck in the bindings. It looks like Yoon has been carrying on tradition and recording the history of Sunsong Ranch in this journal. It lies open to his last entry: a note addressed to you!>\n\n\"Thank you for restoring my family's land to its former glory. I am on to bigger things; It is your turn to fill in these pages now.\""]="<A hefty tome with a well-worn cover and bits of earth stuck in the bindings. It looks like Yoon has been carrying on tradition and recording the history of Sunsong Ranch in this journal. It lies open to his last entry: a note addressed to you!>\n\n\"Thank you for restoring my family's land to its former glory. I am on to bigger things; It is your turn to fill in these pages now.\""
G["<A soothing light fills you as you approach the naaru.  Slow musical chimes echo within your mind and, though a word is not uttered, you feel an assurance of safety.  You are welcome in Shattrath City.>"]="<Uma luz suave o enche quando você se aproxima do naaru. Carrilhões musicais lentos ecoam na sua mente e, embora uma palavra não seja pronunciada, você sente uma garantia de segurança. Você é bem-vindo na Shattrath."
G["<A strange light ignites in Ota Wen's eyes as he stands up straight, roaring at the heavens.>\n\nYES, WE WILL RISE UP! RISE UP AND DESTROY OUR JAILORS!"]="<A strange light ignites in Ota Wen's eyes as he stands up straight, roaring at the heavens.>\n\nYES, WE WILL RISE UP! RISE UP AND DESTROY OUR JAILORS!"
G["<A whisper escapes Shaldyn's throat as you approach.>\nHelp... please."]="<Um sussurro escapa da garganta de Shaldyn quando te acercas.>\n\nAjuda... por favor."
G["<Administer the Healing Salve.>"]="<Administra o bálsamo de cura.>"
G["<Administer the condensed nether gas.>"]="<Administer the condensed nether gas.>"
G["<Administer the draught.>"]="<Administer the draught.>"
G["<Administer the restorative draught.>"]="<Administre o rascunho restaurador.>"
