G["<All that remains of Malik the Unscathed, his polearm rests unceremoniously on a weapon rack.>"]="<All that remains of Malik the Unscathed, his polearm rests unceremoniously on a weapon rack.>"
G["<Allyndia's body bobs gently in the surf. It appears that she's been dead for some time.>"]="<O corpo da Allyndia balança suavemente nas ondas. Parece que ela está morta há algum tempo."
G["<Altruis turns to face you and smiles.>\n\nI do not.\n\n<Altruis points to his steed, Nethrandamus.>\n\nWe must stop them before these forge camps are able to complete whatever it is that they are building."]="<Altruis turns to face you and smiles.>\n\nI do not.\n\n<Altruis points to his steed, Nethrandamus.>\n\nWe must stop them before these forge camps are able to complete whatever it is that they are building."
G["<Andorov looks at you grimly.>\n\nIf it bleeds, we can kill it."]="<Andorov looks at you grimly.>\n\nIf it bleeds, we can kill it."
G["<Anduin sizes you up.>\n\n$n, is it? A few of your triumphs have been the talk of the court.\n\nWhat was it like to serve in Northrend? Have you seen the World Tree? Are the stories about Vashj'ir true? I have so many questions!"]="<Anduin sizes you up.>\n\n$n, is it? A few of your triumphs have been the talk of the court.\n\nWhat was it like to serve in Northrend? Have you seen the World Tree? Are the stories about Vashj'ir true? I have so many questions!"
G["<Anduin's bodyguards edge closer the moment you address the prince.>\n\nIt's okay. I'd just like to have a chat with my friend. We're far from any battlefronts here. Can some part of the world still be safe for civilized conversation?\n\nCome, sit down! Join us!"]="<Anduin's bodyguards edge closer the moment you address the prince.>\n\nIt's okay. I'd just like to have a chat with my friend. We're far from any battlefronts here. Can some part of the world still be safe for civilized conversation?\n\nCome, sit down! Join us!"
G["<Angela coos to the felhunter again before turning her attention to you.>\n\nJir'see's always been smaller than all the other felhunters, but that's never bothered him. And Outland's going to change all that, right Jir'see?\n\nMomma's little angel is going to grow up to be a big, fierce felhunter, yes he is!"]="<Angela coos to the felhunter again before turning her attention to you.>\n\nJir'see's always been smaller than all the other felhunters, but that's never bothered him. And Outland's going to change all that, right Jir'see?\n\nMomma's little angel is going to grow up to be a big, fierce felhunter, yes he is!"
G["<Angela nods.>\n\nAfter the deaths, the Six decided that the best course of action was to seal the staff behind impenetrable barriers of magic and appoint a watcher: A guardian of the staff... I would be that watcher."]="<Angela nods.>\n\nAfter the deaths, the Six decided that the best course of action was to seal the staff behind impenetrable barriers of magic and appoint a watcher: A guardian of the staff... I would be that watcher."
G["<Archmage Vargoth favors you with a wry smile.>\n\nPlenty of room at the cursed Violet Tower.\n\nAny time of year, you can find me here."]="<Archmage Vargoth favors you with a wry smile.>\n\nPlenty of room at the cursed Violet Tower.\n\nAny time of year, you can find me here."
G["<As you approach, you hear Cerellean gasp for breath. He looks to stand a chance if rescued soon.>"]="<Quando você se aproxima, ouve Cerellean ofegar. Ele parece ter uma chance se for resgatado em breve."
G["<As you greet Ambassador Frasaboo in the furbolg language, he smiles.>\n\nYou must be the one spoken of in the prophecy. It is a great honor to meet you.\n\nI am Ambassador Frasaboo, High Chief Stillpine's representative in Blood Watch."]="<As you greet Ambassador Frasaboo in the furbolg language, he smiles.>\n\nYou must be the one spoken of in the prophecy. It is a great honor to meet you.\n\nI am Ambassador Frasaboo, High Chief Stillpine's representative in Blood Watch."
G["<As you place the apexis shards into the nest surrounding the dragon egg, they begin to hum.  A few moments later a crack appears in the rugged shell, and a black dragon whelpling emerges, squalling for its father.>"]="<As you place the apexis shards into the nest surrounding the dragon egg, they begin to hum.  A few moments later a crack appears in the rugged shell, and a black dragon whelpling emerges, squalling for its father.>"
G["<As you place the apexis shards into the nest surrounding the dragon egg, they begin to hum.  A few moments later a crack appears in the rugged shell, and a black dragon whelpling emerges, squalling for its mother.>"]="<As you place the apexis shards into the nest surrounding the dragon egg, they begin to hum.  A few moments later a crack appears in the rugged shell, and a black dragon whelpling emerges, squalling for its mother.>"
G["<As you place your apexis shards into the fel crystalforge and pull the lever, the device makes an unworldly sound as it grinds them into dust.  A few moments later your flask pops out of its 'mouth'.>"]="<Quando você coloca seus cacos de ápice na forja de cristal vil e puxa a alavanca, o dispositivo emite um som não-mundano enquanto os tritura em pó. Alguns momentos depois, seu balão sai da boca."
G["<As you place your apexis shards into the fel crystalforge and pull the lever, the device makes an unworldly sound as it grinds them into dust.  A few moments later your flasks pop out of its 'mouth'.>"]="<Quando você coloca seus cacos de ápice na forja de cristal vil e puxa a alavanca, o dispositivo emite um som não-mundano enquanto os tritura em pó. Alguns momentos depois, seus frascos saem da sua 'boca'.>"
G["<As you place your apexis shards within the hollow of the Bash'ir crystalforge and pull the lever, the device literally disintegrates them.  A few moments later your flask appears at your feet.>"]="<Quando você coloca seus fragmentos de ápice dentro da cavidade da forja de cristal Bash'ir e puxa a alavanca, o dispositivo literalmente os desintegra. Alguns momentos depois, seu frasco aparece aos seus pés.>"
G["<As you place your apexis shards within the hollow of the Bash'ir crystalforge and pull the lever, the device literally disintegrates them.  A few moments later your flasks appear at your feet.>"]="<Quando você coloca seus fragmentos de ápice dentro da cavidade da forja de cristal Bash'ir e puxa a alavanca, o dispositivo literalmente os desintegra. Alguns momentos depois, seus frascos aparecem aos seus pés.>"
G["<As you turn Barithras' limp body over in the water, a brutal injury on his head makes it very apparent why he did not make it.>"]="<Quando você vira o corpo flácido de Barithras na água, um ferimento brutal na cabeça deixa bem claro por que ele não o fez.>"
G["<Ask Thisalee to release the harpy.>"]="<Ask Thisalee to release the harpy.>"
G["<Attempt to remove Fizzle's Hand, then.>"]="<Então, intenta recuperar a mão de Fizzle.>"
G["<Attempt to remove the orb.>"]="<Intenta recuperar o orbe.>"
G["<Aysa appears to be deeply lost in her excercises.>"]="<Aysa parece estar profundamente concentrada nos seus exercícios.>"
G["<Baron Revilgaz's private stock.  Do not touch under any circumstances!>"]="<Estoque privado do Barão Revilgaz. Não toque em nenhuma circunstância!>"
G["<Begin emergency shutdown.>"]="<Iniciar o desligamento de emergência.>"
G["<Behind the warlock's eyes smolders a deep malevolence.>"]="<Atrás dos olhos do bruxo arde uma profunda malevolência.>"
G["<Ben scratches his head.>\n\n I'm not the greatest with directions, but I reckon the Redbelly Mandarin are about's here, in the Fields of Niuzao in Townlong Steppes. \n\n<Ben circles a general area on your map.>"]="<Ben scratches his head.>\n\n I'm not the greatest with directions, but I reckon the Redbelly Mandarin are about's here, in the Fields of Niuzao in Townlong Steppes. \n\n<Ben circles a general area on your map.>"
G["<Big Dan makes a combination of sleepy, fitful grunts and snorts.>\n\nYeah... Stormstout alright..."]="<Big Dan makes a combination of sleepy, fitful grunts and snorts.>\n\nYeah... Stormstout alright..."
G["<Blackhorn gazes out across the distant inferno, then turns his attention back to you.>"]="<Blackhorn olha através do inferno distante, depois volta sua atenção para você.>"
G["<Blackhorn strains against his bonds, for the first time visibly upset.>\n\nRedemption! You act as if there's an escape from the Burning Legion. So smug! As though your efforts a decade ago or in Outland have slowed the Legion a single iota! They will come, $r. They will return. And I will be here to welcome them."]="<Blackhorn strains against his bonds, for the first time visibly upset.>\n\nRedemption! You act as if there's an escape from the Burning Legion. So smug! As though your efforts a decade ago or in Outland have slowed the Legion a single iota! They will come, $r. They will return. And I will be here to welcome them."
G["<Blanche shouts over the commotion of the storm.>\n\nYou made it! The boiler and the brewkegs are in place... now all we need is Mother Nature to work her magic.\n\nWhat do you say? Are you ready for some fireworks?"]="<Blanche shouts over the commotion of the storm.>\n\nYou made it! The boiler and the brewkegs are in place... now all we need is Mother Nature to work her magic.\n\nWhat do you say? Are you ready for some fireworks?"
G["<Bloodrose eyes you curiously.>\n\nI cannot help but wonder what makes you worthy of such attention.\n\nNo offense...."]="<Bloodrose eyes you curiously.>\n\nI cannot help but wonder what makes you worthy of such attention.\n\nNo offense...."
G["<Blundy peers up from his cups.>\n\nAye, that's right. The High Shaman is out in the field, fighting to retake the Thundermar Wreckage. I'm whatcha call the \"Low Shaman.\"\n\nWhile he's away, he left me here, to take care of all of Thundermar's Shamanin'in... nin."]="<Blundy olhe por encima dos seus copas.>\n\nSim, é certo. O Alto xamã está fosse, no campo de batalha, lutando por reconquistar as Ruínas de Bramal. Eu sou o que se chama um \"xamã inferior\".\n\nEnquanto ele estiver fosse, me saído aqui para que me ocupe de todos os assuntos chamanísticos de Bramal..."
G["<Bodley looks at you dubiously, but continues...>\n\nThere we are, spellbook in hand, and Kormok, our two-headed ogre necromancer, gets this strange look in all four of his eyes. It was really creepy, because that second set of eyes always kind of looked dead, like a cow's eyes, you know? So, all of a sudden he just reaches out and rips this amulet off that Valthalak was wearing.\n\nThe rest of the company went crazy; some of us telling them to leave it alone, and others who wanted it for themselves."]="<Bodley looks at you dubiously, but continues...>\n\nThere we are, spellbook in hand, and Kormok, our two-headed ogre necromancer, gets this strange look in all four of his eyes. It was really creepy, because that second set of eyes always kind of looked dead, like a cow's eyes, you know? So, all of a sudden he just reaches out and rips this amulet off that Valthalak was wearing.\n\nThe rest of the company went crazy; some of us telling them to leave it alone, and others who wanted it for themselves."
G["<Bossy is busy trying to figure out how to get back downstairs.>"]="<Mandão está ocupado tentando descobrir como voltar para o andar de baixo.>"
G["<Bossy looks at you with large, liquid black eyes.>"]="<Mandona olha para você com grandes olhos pretos líquidos.>"
G["<Bossy lowers her head nobly, almost as if she understands the gravity and the meaning of your request.>"]="<Mandona abaixa a cabeça nobremente, quase como se ela entendesse a gravidade e o significado do seu pedido.>"
G["<Brann looks at you expectantly.>"]="<Brann olha para você com expectativa.>"
G["<Break Longshore's manacles and free him.>"]="<Break Longshore's manacles and free him.>"
G["<Budd holds very still, pretending not to hear you. Looking closely you see a bit of drool drip from under his mask.>"]="<Budd fica quieto, fingindo não ouvi-o. Olhando atenciosamente, você vê um pouco de baba pingar debaixo da máscara dele.>"
G["<Budd rocks back and forth on his haunches, muttering something that sounds like troll speech.>"]="<Budd balança de um lado para o outro, murmurando algo que soa como discurso de troll.>"
G["<Budd rolls his eyes as he sees you draw near>\n\nAhh, yes, the soon-to-be-famous $n!\n\nTo what do I owe the pleasure of your company?"]="<Budd rolls his eyes as he sees you draw near>\n\nAhh, yes, the soon-to-be-famous $n!\n\nTo what do I owe the pleasure of your company?"
G["<Call forth Darkscreecher Akkarai.>"]="<Chame Darkscreecher Akkarai.>"
G["<Call forth Gezzarak the Huntress.>"]="<Chame Gezzarak, a Caçadora.>"
G["<Call forth Karrog.>"]="<Chame Karrog.>"
G["<Call forth Terokk.>"]="<Chame Terokk.>"
G["<Call forth Vakkiz the Windrager.>"]="<Chame Vakkiz, o Windrager.>"
G["<Check for a pulse...>"]="<Verifique se há um pulso...>"
G["<Chen acknowledges you with a nod but looks uncharacteristically sullen.>"]="<Chen acknowledges you with a nod but looks uncharacteristically sullen.>"
G["<Chi-Ji's voice fills your mind.>\n\nDo you need help getting to the top of the pedestal, $n?"]="<A voz de Chi-Ji ocupa seu mente.>\n\nPrecisa ajuda para subir ao pedestal, $n?"
G["<Chicken out.>"]="<Acobárdate.>"
G["<Choluna's face darkens.>\n\nTen thousand years ago demons flooded across Azeroth in the War of the Ancients. Aviana called her children to the skies and fought off the demon hordes from the front lines. Her wrath was inescapable.\n\nHundreds fell before the fury of her talons. But ultimately she was surrounded by Doomguards, their barbed lances piercing her sides...\n\nIt is said that her blood itself attacked the demons, searing their flesh, destroying them even as she herself fell from the sky."]="<Choluna's face darkens.>\n\nTen thousand years ago demons flooded across Azeroth in the War of the Ancients. Aviana called her children to the skies and fought off the demon hordes from the front lines. Her wrath was inescapable.\n\nHundreds fell before the fury of her talons. But ultimately she was surrounded by Doomguards, their barbed lances piercing her sides...\n\nIt is said that her blood itself attacked the demons, searing their flesh, destroying them even as she herself fell from the sky."
G["<Chu'a'lor's left head says,>\n\nWe find your zeal to help us most appealing...\n\n<His right head concludes,>\n\n... and we want you to know that we greatly appreciate your efforts!"]="<A cabeça esquerda de Chu'a'lor diz, >\n\nSeu entusiasmo nos parece do mais interessante...\n\n<Sua cabeça direita termina,>... e queremos que saiba que mesmo apreciamos seus esforços!"
G["<Clarice stares over the body, her eyes vacant.>\n\nI rode here from Theramore as soon as the news reached me.\n\nJohn and I had always talked about settling down when the conflict subsided.\n\nI don't think the fighting will ever stop. Do you?"]="<Clarice stares over the body, her eyes vacant.>\n\nI rode here from Theramore as soon as the news reached me.\n\nJohn and I had always talked about settling down when the conflict subsided.\n\nI don't think the fighting will ever stop. Do you?"
G["<Clay grumbles and sneers.>\n\nDamn kids these days."]="<Clay grumbles and sneers.>\n\nDamn kids these days."
G["<Club him unconscious.>"]="<Aporréalo e déjalo inconsciente.>"
G["<Continue helping the Rockpool tadpoles.>"]="<Continue helping the Rockpool tadpoles.>"
