G["<Copy the pattern into my journal.>"]="<Copie o padrão para o meu diário.>"
G["<Copy the schematic into your engineering notebook.>"]="<Copie o esquema para o caderno de engenharia.>"
G["<Corastrasza does a double-take.>\n\nYou!? YOU helped Rheastrasza? And lived to tell about it?\n\nI underestimate you, $r. No wonder Lord Afrasastrasz sent you to me.\n\nNo doubt you remember what happened next: Rheastrasza was killed by Deathwing, but thanks to her sacrifice a single purified black dragon egg was secreted away and hidden."]="<Corastrasza does a double-take.>\n\nYou!? YOU helped Rheastrasza? And lived to tell about it?\n\nI underestimate you, $r. No wonder Lord Afrasastrasz sent you to me.\n\nNo doubt you remember what happened next: Rheastrasza was killed by Deathwing, but thanks to her sacrifice a single purified black dragon egg was secreted away and hidden."
G["<Corastrasza steps between you and the nearby corpse, her face wrinkled with concern.>\n\nI'm sorry, $n. This is a private matter for the red flight to resolve.\n\nPlease see if you can help the others outside."]="<Corastrasza steps between you and the nearby corpse, her face wrinkled with concern.>\n\nI'm sorry, $n. This is a private matter for the red flight to resolve.\n\nPlease see if you can help the others outside."
G["<Cough.>\n\nHave I... died?"]="<Tose.>\n\nE... morto?"
G["<Cowlen sobs.>"]="<Cowlen soluça.>"
G["<Crack your knuckles and nod your head.>"]="<Crack your knuckles and nod your head.>"
G["<Create a sketch of the statue piece.>"]="<Create a sketch of the statue piece.>"
G["<Cyrus's eyes glow brightly>\n\nDo I devour you whole or do I allow you to live?\n\nPerhaps you could still be of some use...\n\nChallenge my minion, $r. Survive and return proof of your victory to me."]="<Cyrus's eyes glow brightly>\n\nDo I devour you whole or do I allow you to live?\n\nPerhaps you could still be of some use...\n\nChallenge my minion, $r. Survive and return proof of your victory to me."
G["<Dalmond's body looks almost peaceful, buried only slightly in the sand.>"]="<O corpo de Dalmond parece quase pacífico, enterrado apenas um pouco na areia.>"
G["<Dark magic ripples from the necrolyte.>"]="<Magia negra ondula do necrólito.>"
G["<Deathguard Simmer looks at you expectantly.>"]="<Guardião da Morte Simmer olha para você com expectativa.>"
G["<Demitrian falls to his knees.>\n\nYou have recovered my Master's eternal prison!\n\nOh long have I waited for this day and finally, it is realized.\n\nHe must be released!"]="<Demitrian falls to his knees.>\n\nYou have recovered my Master's eternal prison!\n\nOh long have I waited for this day and finally, it is realized.\n\nHe must be released!"
G["<Demitrian laughs.>\n\nYour reward is a quick and painful death, fool!"]="<Demitrian ri.>\n\nSeu recompensa é uma morte rápida e dolorosa, imprudente!"
G["<Discreetly search the pirate's pockets for Taruk's payment.>"]="<Procure discretamente nos bolsos do pirata o pagamento de Taruk.>"
G["<Do the deed.>"]="<Faça.>"
G["<Dog looks at you quizzically.>"]="<Dog looks at you quizzically.>"
G["<Drakuru extends his bleeding hand through the cage and looks at you with anticipation.>"]="<Drakuru estende a mão sangrando pela gaiola e olha para você com antecipação.>"
G["<Drawn out on this parchment is the schematic for a field repair robot.>"]="<Desenhado neste pergaminho, está o esquema de um robô de reparo em campo.>"
G["<Drool dangles down the side of Jogu's mouth.>"]="<Drool dangles down the side of Jogu's mouth.>"
G["<Duyi looks at you, beaming with pride.>"]="<Duyi looks at you, beaming with pride.>"
G["<Eitrigg laughs.>\n\nYoung one, the world has not always been in such disarray. It was a time before the Scourge had sacked the land. Before those parts of Lordaeron were known as the Plaguelands.\n\nIt was there that Thrall rescued me from death and it was then that I joined the new Horde... but I digress. This is a story for another time. Yes, another time... Perhaps..."]="<Eitrigg laughs.>\n\nYoung one, the world has not always been in such disarray. It was a time before the Scourge had sacked the land. Before those parts of Lordaeron were known as the Plaguelands.\n\nIt was there that Thrall rescued me from death and it was then that I joined the new Horde... but I digress. This is a story for another time. Yes, another time... Perhaps..."
G["<Eralan appears to be chewing on some deathweed.>\n\nIf you're looking to make a love potion, you've got the wrong place.  Blinding, crippling, and killing is my business and hopefully yours."]="<Eralan appears to be chewing on some deathweed.>\n\nIf you're looking to make a love potion, you've got the wrong place.  Blinding, crippling, and killing is my business and hopefully yours."
G["<Eris nods.>\n\nThe Eye has seen so many horrors and so many wonders.\n\nIt displays what it feels the one looking into it is most suited to see."]="<Eris nods.>\n\nThe Eye has seen so many horrors and so many wonders.\n\nIt displays what it feels the one looking into it is most suited to see."
G["<Error retrieving data.... Please see Doc Zapnozzle for further instruction.>"]="<Erro ao recuperar dados.... Consulte o Doc Zapnozzle para obter mais instruções.>"
G["<Farmer Yoon wipes his brow wearily.>\n\nThis is hopeless! I'll never move these rocks!"]="<Farmer Yoon wipes his brow wearily.>\n\nThis is hopeless! I'll never move these rocks!"
G["<Feed the grub to the rock falcon.>"]="<Feed the grub to the rock falcon.>"
G["<Field Marshal Chambers growls.>\n\nSo you're the riff-raff that assisted Didier in getting the supplies here in one piece? Where are the rest of you? I know there's gotta be more. Chickens like you generally roam in huge packs.\n\nBah, just give me the damned writ so I can sign off on it."]="<Field Marshal Chambers growls.>\n\nSo you're the riff-raff that assisted Didier in getting the supplies here in one piece? Where are the rest of you? I know there's gotta be more. Chickens like you generally roam in huge packs.\n\nBah, just give me the damned writ so I can sign off on it."
G["<Fiona is rather upset.  She doesn't seem to be in the mood to talk.>"]="<Fiona está um pouco chateada. Ela não parece estar com vontade de conversar."
G["<Fizzle's body bobs lifelessly.  His orb is clutched tightly in his right hand.>"]="<O corpo de Fizzle balança sem vida. Seu orbe está firmemente apertado na mão direita."
G["<Flaskataur flaps his majestic wings.>"]="<Flaskataur bate suas asas majestosas.>"
G["<Floon makes a series of strange clicking and clucking sounds.>"]="<Floon faz uma série de sons estranhos de clique e cacarejo.>"
G["<Forgotten footman shakes his head.>\n\nWe can't keep this up, friend. If Prince Arthas doesn't return soon we will all perish."]="<Forgotten footman shakes his head.>\n\nWe can't keep this up, friend. If Prince Arthas doesn't return soon we will all perish."
G["<Furien groans.>"]="<Furien geme.>"
G["<Gaze into the crystalline tear.>"]="<Mira a lágrima cristalina.>"
G["<Gershala rolls onto his side to look at you as you approach and you see a hopeful smile creep onto his face.>"]="<Gershala rola para o lado dele para olhar para você quando você se aproxima e você vê um sorriso esperançoso surgir no seu rosto.>"
G["<Get in the bomber and return to Scalawag Point.>"]="<Entre no bombardeiro e volte ao ponto Scalawag.>"
G["<Get on the work bench and let Walt put you in the golem suit.>"]="<Entre na bancada de trabalho e deixe Walt colocar você no traje do golem.>"
G["<Give up.  This is too scary.>"]="<Déjalo. Isto da muito medo.>"
G["<Gobber acts tough, but you can tell that deep down, he's scared.>"]="<Gobber age duro, mas você pode dizer isso lá no fundo, ele está assustado.>"
G["<Gobber grunts.>\n\nMe banker now!"]="<Gobber grunts.>\n\nMe banker now!"
G["<Gobber mostly grunts. You're not even certain that he can talk.>"]="<Gobber mostly grunts. You're not even certain that he can talk.>"
G["<Goretooth spits.>\n\nI am a warrior of the Horde, $n. It fills me with rage to know that our enemies sit in a fortress, less than a day's ride from Kargath, plotting against us.\n\nHow I long to break free from the bonds of duty and destroy them all in the name of the Warchief.\n\nAlas, we all have roles we must fulfill."]="<Goretooth spits.>\n\nI am a warrior of the Horde, $n. It fills me with rage to know that our enemies sit in a fortress, less than a day's ride from Kargath, plotting against us.\n\nHow I long to break free from the bonds of duty and destroy them all in the name of the Warchief.\n\nAlas, we all have roles we must fulfill."
G["<Gormungan emits a good-natured snort.>\n\nHaaarrum! I have never had my personal habits scrutinized so. Your kind never ceases to surprise me. Farewell, friend, and good luck with ... whatever it is you are on about."]="<Gormungan emits a good-natured snort.>\n\nHaaarrum! I have never had my personal habits scrutinized so. Your kind never ceases to surprise me. Farewell, friend, and good luck with ... whatever it is you are on about."
G["<Gormungan eyes the laxative with suspicion, then sniffs it. With visible irritation, he begins smooshing and molding the laxative into the shape of a goblin.>\n\nI suspect your little green friends are putting you up to no good. Please explain to them that we giants are not to be toyed with.\n\n<To demonstrate his point, Gormungan twists the head off of his chocolaty goblin statue before handing it back to you.>"]="<Gormungan eyes the laxative with suspicion, then sniffs it. With visible irritation, he begins smooshing and molding the laxative into the shape of a goblin.>\n\nI suspect your little green friends are putting you up to no good. Please explain to them that we giants are not to be toyed with.\n\n<To demonstrate his point, Gormungan twists the head off of his chocolaty goblin statue before handing it back to you.>"
G["<Gormungan's laugh, deep and long, rumbles the ground and causes distant rockslides.>\n\nOh - hah! Harroooo - Ha harum! Little friend, I am sorry. I suppose my kind does not pick up after ourselves as you do."]="<Gormungan's laugh, deep and long, rumbles the ground and causes distant rockslides.>\n\nOh - hah! Harroooo - Ha harum! Little friend, I am sorry. I suppose my kind does not pick up after ourselves as you do."
G["<Gormungan's voice booms deep from within, hurting your ears and reverberating in the very ground beneath your feet.>\n\nHallo, softling.\n\nYour kind dashes about, always running, never stopping. Rest with me a while."]="<Gormungan's voice booms deep from within, hurting your ears and reverberating in the very ground beneath your feet.>\n\nHallo, softling.\n\nYour kind dashes about, always running, never stopping. Rest with me a while."
G["<Gott sneers contemptuously at you.>\n\nCan you possibly work any slower? I'm surrounded by useless idiots!"]="<Gott sneers contemptuously at you.>\n\nCan you possibly work any slower? I'm surrounded by useless idiots!"
G["<Grease the cannonballs.>"]="<Grease the cannonballs.>"
G["<Greatmother Geyah laughs weakly.>\n\nOf course not, dear. But it's not me that has to believe...\n\nGarrosh can lead the Mag'har. He is strong and wise. All of the spirits approve of him. He just needs to believe in himself. He fears so much... He fears so deeply that if he lets himself go, his rage will consume him and all that would be near him."]="<Greatmother Geyah laughs weakly.>\n\nOf course not, dear. But it's not me that has to believe...\n\nGarrosh can lead the Mag'har. He is strong and wise. All of the spirits approve of him. He just needs to believe in himself. He fears so much... He fears so deeply that if he lets himself go, his rage will consume him and all that would be near him."
G["<Greatmother Geyah nods, accepting your answer.>\n\nI can no longer fight the spirits, $n. My time has long since passed. Once again, I must thank you for all that you have done. While Garrosh may be unmovable, many of my people have been lifted by your accomplishments. They are now willing to fight for our rights as a united clan."]="<Greatmother Geyah nods, accepting your answer.>\n\nI can no longer fight the spirits, $n. My time has long since passed. Once again, I must thank you for all that you have done. While Garrosh may be unmovable, many of my people have been lifted by your accomplishments. They are now willing to fight for our rights as a united clan."
G["<Greatmother Geyah nods.>\n\nDid you know my son?"]="<Greatmother Geyah nods.>\n\nDid you know my son?"
G["<Greatmother Geyah smiles at you.>\n\nYou remind me of my son, $n.\n\nHe was an immovable mountain: A pillar of strength and honor.\n\n<Geyah's eyes well up with tears.>\n\nHe sacrificed himself so that we could survive. So that generations of orcs after him could be born into a world without the blood curse... Without Gul'dan and his dark Horde...\n\n<Geyah stares into the distance, lost in thought.>\n\nOh Durotan, how I wish you could be here. Your people so desperately need you..."]="<Greatmother Geyah smiles at you.>\n\nYou remind me of my son, $n.\n\nHe was an immovable mountain: A pillar of strength and honor.\n\n<Geyah's eyes well up with tears.>\n\nHe sacrificed himself so that we could survive. So that generations of orcs after him could be born into a world without the blood curse... Without Gul'dan and his dark Horde...\n\n<Geyah stares into the distance, lost in thought.>\n\nOh Durotan, how I wish you could be here. Your people so desperately need you..."
G["<Greatmother Geyah smiles.>\n\nI am old. It is my time. When I pass, my spirit will move on to the spirit realm. It is there that I will stand with my ancestors. It is there that we will watch over our people.\n\nWhen Garad was alive Mother Kashur's duty was the same as my duty now."]="<Greatmother Geyah smiles.>\n\nI am old. It is my time. When I pass, my spirit will move on to the spirit realm. It is there that I will stand with my ancestors. It is there that we will watch over our people.\n\nWhen Garad was alive Mother Kashur's duty was the same as my duty now."
G["<Greatmother Geyah's violet eyes lock onto yours.>\n\nYes..."]="<Greatmother Geyah's violet eyes lock onto yours.>\n\nYes..."
G["<Grondal reaches futilely towards you as you approach, but his arm collapses as life slips from him.>"]="<Grondal alcança futilmente na sua direção quando você se aproxima, mas o braço dele cai quando a vida desliza dele.>"
G["<Grumble> Pretty dress indeed! <Grumble>"]="<Grumble> Pretty dress indeed! <Grumble>"
G["<Grumbles>  I guess those mountains came out of nowhere...  All five times!"]="<Amigos> Acho que aquelas montanhas surgiram do nada... Todas as cinco vezes!"
G["<Grumbles>  You'd think it would be hard to crash a zeppelin into the ocean.  You'd think it'd be even harder to do it four separate times!"]="<Resmunga> Você acha que seria difícil colidir com um zepelim no oceano. Você pensaria que seria ainda mais difícil fazer isso quatro vezes seaparos!"
G["<Grumbles> I still don't know how we managed to snake through Thousand Needles without a scratch, only to crash and burn in the Shimmering Flats!"]="Ainda não sei como conseguimos atravessar as Mil Agulhas sem um arranhão, apenas para bater e queimar nos Apartamentos Cintilantes!"
G["<Grumbles> I wish I could say we've managed to avoid crash landing into lakes.  I wish I could say we've only crashed into a lake once... but we've managed to crash into four separate lakes, including Lordamere Lake!"]="<Reclamações> Eu gostaria de poder dizer que conseguimos evitar o pouso forçado em lagos. Eu gostaria de poder dizer que só colidimos com um lago uma vez... mas conseguimos colidir com quatro lagos separados, incluindo o lago Lordamere!"
G["<Grunt>"]="<Grunt>"
G["<Grunt>\n\nYou need something, $r?"]="<Grunt>\n\nYou need something, $r?"
G["<Han is encased in a tomb of amber.>"]="<Han is encased in a tomb of amber.>"
G["<Hawthorne wrinkles his brow.>\n\nI would prefer not to use the term 'sacked,' but yes, the attack went off flawlessly. We removed Taurajo from the equation, confiscated its arms, and destroyed its smithing facilities. The assault gave our forces considerable breathing room and knocked the enemy off balance.\n\nNonetheless, during the assault, I instructed my men to leave a gap open in our lines..."]="<Hawthorne wrinkles his brow.>\n\nI would prefer not to use the term 'sacked,' but yes, the attack went off flawlessly. We removed Taurajo from the equation, confiscated its arms, and destroyed its smithing facilities. The assault gave our forces considerable breathing room and knocked the enemy off balance.\n\nNonetheless, during the assault, I instructed my men to leave a gap open in our lines..."
G["<He clutches a handkerchief with the initials, S.S.>"]="<No seu mão tem um lenço com as iniciais S. G. S.>"
G["<He leans in closer.>\n\nJust between you and me, I'm thinking about 'mustering' out one of these nights.  You know what I mean?"]="<He leans in closer.>\n\nJust between you and me, I'm thinking about 'mustering' out one of these nights.  You know what I mean?"
G["<He looks at the rocket and flashes a nervous grin.>\n\nOkay, yeah, so maybe I made a couple rockets for some guys. So what? The gold was good and I was paid for my work. It's not like anyone died. That's about as honest as work gets. What's it to you?"]="<He looks at the rocket and flashes a nervous grin.>\n\nOkay, yeah, so maybe I made a couple rockets for some guys. So what? The gold was good and I was paid for my work. It's not like anyone died. That's about as honest as work gets. What's it to you?"
G["<He looks down the hall intently.>"]="<Zheng mira em direção a à frente, concentrado.>"
G["<He looks like he was knocked unconscious in all the fighting.>\n\n<He clutches tightly to a leather bag.>"]="<He looks like he was knocked unconscious in all the fighting.>\n\n<He clutches tightly to a leather bag.>"
G["<He looks to you grimly.>"]="<He looks to you grimly.>"
G["<He stares at you blankly.>"]="<Zheng te mira inexpresivamente.>"
G["<He wipes the sweat from his brow.>\n\nHello there, $c. You here to help?"]="<He wipes the sweat from his brow.>\n\nHello there, $c. You here to help?"
G["<He's eyes light up as you approach.>"]="<He's eyes light up as you approach.>"
G["<He's sound asleep.>"]="<Duerme profundamente.>"
G["<Help the Rockpool tadpoles.>"]="<Help the Rockpool tadpoles.>"
G["<High Inquisitor Fairbanks lifts up his tabard revealing several gruesome scars.>\n\nBecause I was there... I was the Highlord's most trusted advisor. I should have known... I felt that something was amiss yet I allowed it to happen. Would you believe that there were a thousand or more Scourge?"]="<High Inquisitor Fairbanks lifts up his tabard revealing several gruesome scars.>\n\nBecause I was there... I was the Highlord's most trusted advisor. I should have known... I felt that something was amiss yet I allowed it to happen. Would you believe that there were a thousand or more Scourge?"
G["<High Inquisitor Fairbanks nods.>\n\nAye, the lesser Mograine, the one known as the Scarlet Commander, through - what I suspect - the dealings of the Grand Crusader. He led his father to the ambush like a lamb to the slaughter."]="<High Inquisitor Fairbanks nods.>\n\nAye, the lesser Mograine, the one known as the Scarlet Commander, through - what I suspect - the dealings of the Grand Crusader. He led his father to the ambush like a lamb to the slaughter."
G["<High Inquisitor Fairbanks shakes his head.>\n\nNo, $r; only one of his sons is dead. The other lives...\n\n<High Inquisitor Fairbanks points to the sky.>\n\nThe Outland... Find him there..."]="<High Inquisitor Fairbanks shakes his head.>\n\nNo, $r; only one of his sons is dead. The other lives...\n\n<High Inquisitor Fairbanks points to the sky.>\n\nThe Outland... Find him there..."
G["<High Inquisitor Fairbanks shakes his head.>\n\nNo... He stood in the background, watching as the legion of undead descended upon us. Soon after, my powers were exhausted. I was the first to fall... Surely they would tear me limb from limb as I lay there unconscious; but they ignored me completely, focusing all of their attention on the Highlord."]="<High Inquisitor Fairbanks shakes his head.>\n\nNo... He stood in the background, watching as the legion of undead descended upon us. Soon after, my powers were exhausted. I was the first to fall... Surely they would tear me limb from limb as I lay there unconscious; but they ignored me completely, focusing all of their attention on the Highlord."
G["<Highlord Darion Mograine nods.>"]="<Grão-lorde Darion Mograine assente.>"
G["<Huju glances warily over his shoulder.> Not now. Things be gettin' pretty hot in here lately."]="<Huju glances warily over his shoulder.> Not now. Things be gettin' pretty hot in here lately."
G["<Isfar sighs.>\n\nA couple of treehouses don't make a home, but it was vast improvement over the Sethekk Halls.\n\nComfortable as it was in Shattrath, I can't bring myself to return to my true home in Skettis without my sister. She's still trapped in the Sethekk Halls, held prisoner by our older brother."]="<Isfar sighs.>\n\nA couple of treehouses don't make a home, but it was vast improvement over the Sethekk Halls.\n\nComfortable as it was in Shattrath, I can't bring myself to return to my true home in Skettis without my sister. She's still trapped in the Sethekk Halls, held prisoner by our older brother."
G["<It looks as if this solider might be feigning to throw off naga suspicion. It likely saved her life.>"]="<Parece que esse soldado pode estar fingindo desprezar a suspeita naga. Provavelmente salvou sua vida."
G["<It looks as if this solider might be feigning to throw off naga suspicion. It likely saved his life.>"]="<Parece que esse soldado pode estar fingindo desprezar a suspeita naga. Provavelmente salvou sua vida."
G["<It's a giant, armored, saddle-bearing attack cat. Isn't that already silly enough without it talking, too?>"]="<É um gato de ataque gigantesco, blindado e portador de sela. Isso já não é bobo o suficiente sem falar também?>"
G["<Jack grunts something about the hammer being his weapon... you think.>"]="<Jack grunts something about the hammer being his weapon... you think.>"
G["<Jaina brushes her hair from her eyes, deep in thought.>\n\nYou're so passionate for your cause and clear in your convictions. Believe me when I say that the Sunreavers are the same. The Horde is their family.\n\nNot all of them support Garrosh. But they're not about to abandon their own people... I couldn't ask them to do so without tearing the Kirin Tor apart.\n\nThe Kirin Tor is sacred to me. We need to stay united."]="<Jaina brushes her hair from her eyes, deep in thought.>\n\nYou're so passionate for your cause and clear in your convictions. Believe me when I say that the Sunreavers are the same. The Horde is their family.\n\nNot all of them support Garrosh. But they're not about to abandon their own people... I couldn't ask them to do so without tearing the Kirin Tor apart.\n\nThe Kirin Tor is sacred to me. We need to stay united."
G["<Jaina smiles.>\n\nIf only we all shared your strength and conviction! To be honest, I struggle. Every. Day.\n\nBut you are right. The Kirin Tor is bigger than you, me, Alliance or Horde. I have a responsibility to preserve it, and to use its powers wisely.\n\nYou and I seem to agree. I doubt the King sees it that way. But... do you think we can convince Anduin?"]="<Jaina smiles.>\n\nIf only we all shared your strength and conviction! To be honest, I struggle. Every. Day.\n\nBut you are right. The Kirin Tor is bigger than you, me, Alliance or Horde. I have a responsibility to preserve it, and to use its powers wisely.\n\nYou and I seem to agree. I doubt the King sees it that way. But... do you think we can convince Anduin?"
G["<Jaina warms to you immediately.>\n\nA kindred soul! Thank you, $p, for your honesty. You seem to understand my struggle. Every day, the hard decisions. Every night... the nightmares.\n\nBut I have a responsibility to preserve the Kirin Tor. I'm glad you're with me on this. The King would never see it this way. Do you think we can explain it to Anduin?"]="<Jaina warms to you immediately.>\n\nA kindred soul! Thank you, $p, for your honesty. You seem to understand my struggle. Every day, the hard decisions. Every night... the nightmares.\n\nBut I have a responsibility to preserve the Kirin Tor. I'm glad you're with me on this. The King would never see it this way. Do you think we can explain it to Anduin?"
G["<Jaina's eyes grow sad.>\n\nSo... you would purge the city? Cast the Sunreavers from their homes? The very same Sunreavers who helped humans discover magic in the first place?\n\nYou and I are obviously very different. I suppose I see my role - and the mission of the Kirin Tor - a little differently. My mind is set. Would you like to hear what I think?"]="<Jaina's eyes grow sad.>\n\nSo... you would purge the city? Cast the Sunreavers from their homes? The very same Sunreavers who helped humans discover magic in the first place?\n\nYou and I are obviously very different. I suppose I see my role - and the mission of the Kirin Tor - a little differently. My mind is set. Would you like to hear what I think?"
G["<Jasper doesn't respond. The only sound that fills the room is the faint rustling of breath.>"]="<Jasper doesn't respond. The only sound that fills the room is the faint rustling of breath.>"
G["<Jogu squints at you.>\n\nHey, do I know you?"]="<Jogu te mira com os olhos entornados.>\n\nOuve, te conheço de algo?"
G["<Kaide hisses at you.>\n\nBe quiet, or you'll bring the orcs and the Alliance down on us, you clumsy oaf!\n\nThat's right, nod your head, and when we're done speaking, you'll walk away and forget you found me here."]="<Kaide hisses at you.>\n\nBe quiet, or you'll bring the orcs and the Alliance down on us, you clumsy oaf!\n\nThat's right, nod your head, and when we're done speaking, you'll walk away and forget you found me here."
G["<Karthog offers you a drink from his waterskin.>\n\nOnce we called this the Gold Road, $c. Today it runs red with blood.\n\nAlliance blood, if I have anything to do with it."]="<Karthog offers you a drink from his waterskin.>\n\nOnce we called this the Gold Road, $c. Today it runs red with blood.\n\nAlliance blood, if I have anything to do with it."
G["<Keep Listening>"]="<Continue ouvindo>"
G["<Kelsuwa doesn't make eye contact with you.>\n\nI escaped amidst the fighting, but not before freeing all the stabled animals.\n\nI couldn't keep them with me. They scattered into the smoke..."]="<Kelsuwa doesn't make eye contact with you.>\n\nI escaped amidst the fighting, but not before freeing all the stabled animals.\n\nI couldn't keep them with me. They scattered into the smoke..."
G["<Khadgar grins to himself>\n\nI convinced A'dal and his brethren to return here with me. I believe that only their power can drive the Legion from this universe. But as you will no doubt find - their power must first live in our hearts.\n\nTo combat the darkness, we must become beacons of their eternal Light."]="<Khadgar grins to himself>\n\nI convinced A'dal and his brethren to return here with me. I believe that only their power can drive the Legion from this universe. But as you will no doubt find - their power must first live in our hearts.\n\nTo combat the darkness, we must become beacons of their eternal Light."
G["<Kharan clears his throat.>\n\nWe made our way through the Searing Gorge tunnel and into the ravaged wasteland comprising the gorge. In retrospect, things were eerily quiet. The only dangers we ran across were the wildlife of the region: Creatures that my men easily dispatched.\n\nWe reached Blackrock Mountain with relative ease and made our way through the stonewrought construction without so much as a hiccup."]="<Kharan clears his throat.>\n\nWe made our way through the Searing Gorge tunnel and into the ravaged wasteland comprising the gorge. In retrospect, things were eerily quiet. The only dangers we ran across were the wildlife of the region: Creatures that my men easily dispatched.\n\nWe reached Blackrock Mountain with relative ease and made our way through the stonewrought construction without so much as a hiccup."
G["<Kharan sighs.>\n\nI suppose... I suppose you are right.\n\nGor'shak told me that your Warchief has big plans. Plans that may change the way the Alliance and Horde interact. What do you know about this?"]="<Kharan suspira.>\n\nSuponho... suponho que está no certo.\n\nGor'shak disse para mim que seu Chefe de Guerra tinha grandes planos. Planos que podem alterar a forma em que a Aliança e a Horda interactúan. Que sabe aproxima de isto?"
G["<Kick him in his big fat face.>"]="<Dale uma chute no seu enorme rosto sebosa.>"
G["<Kilag motions you to keep your voice down.>"]="<Kilag faz com que você mantenha a voz baixa.>"
G["<Kiryn stares blankly up at the sky and doesn't respond.>"]="<Kiryn tem a olhar perdida no céu e no responde.>"
G["<Klaxxi'va Ik regards you with a judging eye.>"]="<Klaxxi'va Ik regards you with a judging eye.>"
G["<Koltira groans.>"]="<Koltira geme.>"
