G["<Morthis glances skyward.>\n\nIn a way, I envy the freedom Rook and Corvax enjoy. To be free of earthbound responsibilities is a great blessing indeed.\n\nThe future will see me on wing once more, but first there's a task I must complete."]="<Morthis glances skyward.>\n\nIn a way, I envy the freedom Rook and Corvax enjoy. To be free of earthbound responsibilities is a great blessing indeed.\n\nThe future will see me on wing once more, but first there's a task I must complete."
