G["<Narain holds an unopened envelope to his forehead.>\n\nWhat is... Mmmm... Velvet!\n\nAm I right?\n\nIf you're here to try and relearn a tradeskill, use the book over there...\n\n<Narain points to \"Soothsaying for Dummies.\">"]="<Narain holds an unopened envelope to his forehead.>\n\nWhat is... Mmmm... Velvet!\n\nAm I right?\n\nIf you're here to try and relearn a tradeskill, use the book over there...\n\n<Narain points to \"Soothsaying for Dummies.\">"
