G["<Rosey fights back tears as she speaks.>\n\nMy... my journal. It's gone missin'.\n\nIt's mostly full of memories of my pappy, and his endless search for the perfect place to build his paradise city. It was to be the pinnacle of gnomish engineering!\n\nAnyway, one of his old schematics might actually be useful here. Please let me know if ya find it somewhere in all this thick green grass."]="<Rosey fights back tears as she speaks.>\n\nMy... my journal. It's gone missin'.\n\nIt's mostly full of memories of my pappy, and his endless search for the perfect place to build his paradise city. It was to be the pinnacle of gnomish engineering!\n\nAnyway, one of his old schematics might actually be useful here. Please let me know if ya find it somewhere in all this thick green grass."
