G["<Sticky orange fluid oozes from Kil'ruk's mandibles.>"]="<Sticky orange fluid oozes from Kil'ruk's mandibles.>"
G["<Suna rocks back and forth, staring into space. She does not answer.>"]="<Suna rocks back and forth, staring into space. She does not answer.>"
