G["<Take this book for the good of Azeroth!>"]="<Leve este livro para o bem de Azeroth!>"
G["<Tarsis grabs you weakly by the collar. Even in death you see power unimaginable in his eyes.>\n\nAm I? Then listen closely, for more nonsense is about to escape my lips. Within this citadel you will find my life's work: The exact location of every fragment of the splintered staff."]="<Tarsis grabs you weakly by the collar. Even in death you see power unimaginable in his eyes.>\n\nAm I? Then listen closely, for more nonsense is about to escape my lips. Within this citadel you will find my life's work: The exact location of every fragment of the splintered staff."
G["<Tarsis groans.>\n\nThere may still be time... Listen closely, mortal.\n\nThrough time and across the Nether I have searched. Deals made with a host of evil and villainy so wretched...\n\n<Tarsis coughs blood into his hands.>\n\nWould you... would you believe that even Elune has turned her back on me, $r? To die here, in this manner now..."]="<Tarsis groans.>\n\nThere may still be time... Listen closely, mortal.\n\nThrough time and across the Nether I have searched. Deals made with a host of evil and villainy so wretched...\n\n<Tarsis coughs blood into his hands.>\n\nWould you... would you believe that even Elune has turned her back on me, $r? To die here, in this manner now..."
G["<Tarsis is badly injured.>"]="<Tarso está gravemente ferido.>"
G["<Tarsis's eyes light up.>\n\nI held it once... I held it despite the warnings of the Kirin Tor. I held it, mortal... Power unending. Power to do what I desired, as I desired. And just as quickly, it was taken from me. But I had tasted... And that taste was all that it took."]="<Tarsis's eyes light up.>\n\nI held it once... I held it despite the warnings of the Kirin Tor. I held it, mortal... Power unending. Power to do what I desired, as I desired. And just as quickly, it was taken from me. But I had tasted... And that taste was all that it took."
G["<Taylor is very sick. It is best not to speak to him now.>"]="<Taylor está muito enfermo. É melhor no falar com ele neste momentos.>"
G["<Tears stream down Greatmother Geyah's face.>\n\nI... I... Durotan survived to have a child? The child Draka told me of before they left... It was their greatest fear... To raise a child in this world. On the other side of that gate was their only hope. I dared not tell Durotan, but secretly, I begged the spirits to watch over them - to protect their child and to give them strength.\n\nI... I must see my grandchild. I must see him. Please, I am too weak. You must tell him. Before I leave this world..."]="<Tears stream down Greatmother Geyah's face.>\n\nI... I... Durotan survived to have a child? The child Draka told me of before they left... It was their greatest fear... To raise a child in this world. On the other side of that gate was their only hope. I dared not tell Durotan, but secretly, I begged the spirits to watch over them - to protect their child and to give them strength.\n\nI... I must see my grandchild. I must see him. Please, I am too weak. You must tell him. Before I leave this world..."
G["<Tenwu yawns.>\nI'm waiting..."]="<Tenwu yawns.>\nI'm waiting..."
G["<Terenthis' eyes stare unblinking into the distance, betraying the sorrow of his last moments.>"]="<Os olhos de Terenthis olham sem piscar ao longe, traindo a tristeza dos seus últimos momentos.>"
G["<Thariel closes his eyes and shakes his head gently. When he opens them again, his gaze is wet and heavy with sorrow.>\n\nI held on to hope… the foolish hope of a dreamer. I should have pressed harder, back when I still had the chance. Begged her not to go. Told her to burn that invitation.\n\nYou are a bearer of grim tidings, $C. Yet still, I owe you. I will not forget this debt."]="<Thariel closes his eyes and shakes his head gently. When he opens them again, his gaze is wet and heavy with sorrow.>\n\nI held on to hope… the foolish hope of a dreamer. I should have pressed harder, back when I still had the chance. Begged her not to go. Told her to burn that invitation.\n\nYou are a bearer of grim tidings, $C. Yet still, I owe you. I will not forget this debt."
G["<Thayreen's stare is blank.  Cleansing Vordrassil's corruption has taken its toll on the druid.>"]="<O olhar de Thayreen está em alvo. A limpeza da corrupção de Vordrassil afetou o druida.>"
G["<The \"voice\" of the construct seems to emanate from the air around you, ringing in your ears while the hairs on your arms stand up. The construct speaks to you in a language you can't understand, with words that sound like multiple voices talking at once.>"]="<The \"voice\" of the construct seems to emanate from the air around you, ringing in your ears while the hairs on your arms stand up. The construct speaks to you in a language you can't understand, with words that sound like multiple voices talking at once.>"
G["<The Admiral's body is covered with wounds, scratches, bruises, blood, and sweat. He looks feverish.>"]="<The Admiral's body is covered with wounds, scratches, bruises, blood, and sweat. He looks feverish.>"
G["<The Arcane Guardian gestures across the Tier, towards the inn and the stablemaster outside it.>"]="<O Guardião Arcano gesticula através do Nível, em direção à estalagem e ao mestre do estábulo fosse dela.>"
G["<The Arcane Guardian gestures across the Tier, towards the inn.>"]="<O Guardião Arcano gesticula através do Nível, em direção à estalagem.>"
G["<The Arcane Guardian gestures down towards the lower city's open market, in the southeast.>"]="<O Guardião Arcano aponta para o mercado aberto da cidade baixa, no sudeste.>"
G["<The Arcane Guardian gestures down towards the lower city, where a great forge may be found.>"]="<O Guardião Arcano aponta para a cidade baixa, onde uma grande forja pode ser encontrada.>"
G["<The Arcane Guardian gestures to a place across the Tier, towards the inn and nearby mailbox.>"]="<O Guardião Arcano gesticula para um lugar do outro lado da Camada, em direção à estalagem e à caixa de correio próxima.>"
G["<The Arcane Guardian gestures to a place below the Tier, a stairwell southeast of the city's center.>"]="<O Guardião Arcano gesticula para um lugar abaixo do Tier, uma escada a sudeste do centro da cidade.>"
G["<The Arcane Guardian gestures to a place east of the city's center.>"]="<O Guardião Arcano gesticula para um lugar a leste do centro da cidade.>"
G["<The Arcane Guardian gestures to a place southeast of the city's center.>"]="<O Guardião Arcano gesticula para um lugar a sudeste do centro da cidade.>"
G["<The Arcane Guardian gestures to the northwest portion of the lower city, where Shattrath's arakkoa dwell.>"]="<O Guardião Arcano gesticula para a porção noroeste da cidade baixa, onde moram os arakkoa de Shattrath.>"
G["<The Arcane Guardian gestures towards Aldor Rise.>"]="<O Guardião Arcano gesticula em direção à Ascensão Aldor.>"
G["<The Arcane Guardian gestures towards a place below the Tier, a stairwell northeast of the city's center.>"]="<O Guardião Arcano gesticula em direção a um lugar abaixo do Tier, uma escada a nordeste do centro da cidade.>"
G["<The Arcane Guardian gestures towards the Lower City's bazaar.>"]="<O Guardião Arcano gesticula em direção ao bazar da Cidade Baixa.>"
G["<The Arcane Guardian gestures towards the Seer's Library.>"]="<O Guardião Arcano aponta para a Biblioteca do Vidente.>"
G["<The Arcane Guardian gestures towards the city's center.>"]="<O Guardião Arcano aponta para o centro da cidade.>"
G["<The Arcane Guardian gestures towards the easternmost portion of the lower city.>"]="<O Guardião Arcano gesticula em direção à porção mais oriental da cidade baixa.>"
G["<The Arcane Guardian gestures towards the lower city's open marketplace.>"]="<O Guardião Arcano aponta para o mercado aberto da cidade baixa.>"
G["<The Arcane Guardian gestures towards the northeastern section of the lower city.>"]="<O Guardião Arcano gesticula em direção à seção nordeste da cidade baixa.>"
G["<The Arcane Guardian seems to face you, but says nothing.>"]="<O Guardião Arcano parece enfrentar você, mas não diz nada.>"
G["<The Arcane Guardian silently waits for you to further elaborate.>"]="<O Guardião Arcano espera silenciosamente que você elabore mais detalhes.>"
G["<The Arcane Guardian stands motionless, waiting for you to elaborate on which Battlemasters you mean.>"]="<O Guardião Arcano permanece imóvel, esperando que você elabore em que Mestre de Batalha você quer dizer.>"
G["<The Baron lifts his manacles.>\n\nCome on then, $c. Do ye trust me?"]="<The Baron lifts his manacles.>\n\nCome on then, $c. Do ye trust me?"
G["<The Black Prince looks you up and down.>\n\nIt is very good to meet you, $c. You are one of the vanguard, it would seem - an explorer in a strange new land. And how have you been finding the mysterious continent of Pandaria?\n\nYou have the look of someone who gets things done. I want you to return to me once you've gotten the lay of the land.\n\nI will be right here."]="<The Black Prince looks you up and down.>\n\nIt is very good to meet you, $c. You are one of the vanguard, it would seem - an explorer in a strange new land. And how have you been finding the mysterious continent of Pandaria?\n\nYou have the look of someone who gets things done. I want you to return to me once you've gotten the lay of the land.\n\nI will be right here."
G["<The Engineer slumbers fitfully on the floor.>"]="<O Engenheiro dorme no chão."
G["<The Forsaken female is curled up on the floor, her face in a grimace.  She does not appear capable of getting up on her own at the moment.>"]="<A fêmea Renegada está encolhida no chão, o rosto em uma careta. Ela não parece capaz de levantar sozinha no momentos."
G["<The Frostborn Scout appears to have breathed his last breath.>"]="<The Frostborn Scout appears to have breathed his last breath.>"
G["<The Frostborn Scout attempts to rise to his feet as you approach, but stumbles back to the ground, clenching an obviously painful wound in his side.>"]="<O Batedor Frostborn tenta levantar quando você se aproxima, mas tropeça de volta ao chão, apertando uma ferida obviamente dolorosa ao seu lado.>"
G["<The Hippogryph looks anxious and ready to go!>"]="<O hipogrifo parece ansioso e pronto para partir!>"
G["<The Injured Rainspeaker Oracle groans in pain.>"]="<O Orador da Chuva Ferido Oracle geme de dor.>"
G["<The Lorewalker's kind eyes rest upon you attentively.>"]="<The Lorewalker's kind eyes rest upon you attentively.>"
G["<The Major nods curtly.>"]="<O major assente com a cabeça bruscamente.>"
G["<The Mullan Gryphon Rider stays still, eyes locked forward, not acknowledging your presence.>"]="<O Cavaleiro Mullan Gryphon fica parado, os olhos fixos para a linha de frente, sem reconhecer sua presença.>"
G["<The Murkblood overseer grunts.>"]="<O superintendente Murblblood resmunga.>"
G["<The SI:7 agent is unconscious.>"]="<O agente SI: 7 está inconsciente.>"
G["<The Shadow Warden looks at you silently.>"]="<O Guardião das Sombras olha para você silenciosamente.>"
G["<The Sky Admiral's face grows hard.>\n\nI grew up in Southshore. My parents are buried there - what's left of them."]="<O rosto da almirante se endurece.>\n\nCrecí em Costa. Meus padres estão enterrados ali... o que ficou de eles."
G["<The Stonemother stares down at you. Through you. As if she's peering into your soul.>\n\nMy daughter, Theradras, sequestered herself deep within the Crystal Caverns of Terramok to grieve for her lost love, Zaetar. There, heartless, stoneless beings invaded and slaughtered her amidst her mourning.\n\nIf I had any reason to trust a creature afflicted by the curse of flesh, it was stripped from me that day. And yet in your arrogance, you persist.\n\nOne day, you will outlive your usefulness."]="<The Stonemother stares down at you. Through you. As if she's peering into your soul.>\n\nMy daughter, Theradras, sequestered herself deep within the Crystal Caverns of Terramok to grieve for her lost love, Zaetar. There, heartless, stoneless beings invaded and slaughtered her amidst her mourning.\n\nIf I had any reason to trust a creature afflicted by the curse of flesh, it was stripped from me that day. And yet in your arrogance, you persist.\n\nOne day, you will outlive your usefulness."
G["<The Tuskarr eyes you suspiciously.>\n\nDo not stay long. You do not understand our people, and I don't want trouble."]="<O colmillarr te olhe com desconfiança.>\n\nNão te fique demais. Não entende a nossa gente e não quero problemas."
G["<The Twilight Servitor gurgles at you, white spittle foaming and bubbling from his mouth.>"]="<O Servo do Crepúsculo ronca para você, espuma branca e salpicada da sua boca.>"
G["<The ancient turns to gaze at you with eyes larger than your entire head. Peering into them is like falling into a deep blue ocean.>"]="<Os antigos se voltam para olhar para você com olhos maiores que toda a cabeça. Olhá-os é como cair em um oceano azul profundo."
G["<The ancient's enormous dark eyes peer at you distrustfully.>"]="<Os enormes olhos escuros do antigo olham para você com desconfiança.>"
G["<The ancient's eyes are vast and deep.>\n\n<The creature speaks slowly, in a language you do not understand. Chills run up your spine. You're overwhelmed with feelings of terror and confusion.>"]="<The ancient's eyes are vast and deep.>\n\n<The creature speaks slowly, in a language you do not understand. Chills run up your spine. You're overwhelmed with feelings of terror and confusion.>"
G["<The ancient's eyes open slowly, revealing deep pools of pain and fear.>"]="<Os olhos do ancião se abrem lentamente, revelando profundos poços de dor e medo.>"
G["<The apprentice occasionally looks over his shoulder, apparently responding to sounds that you can't hear.>\n\nGood day, $n. Pardon me if I seem distracted, but I'm in the middle of a job for Farmer Natin. I want to have all of his horses shoed by the time he returns from the town hall. What can I help you with?"]="<The apprentice occasionally looks over his shoulder, apparently responding to sounds that you can't hear.>\n\nGood day, $n. Pardon me if I seem distracted, but I'm in the middle of a job for Farmer Natin. I want to have all of his horses shoed by the time he returns from the town hall. What can I help you with?"
G["<The arakkoa favors you with a haunted gaze and alternates between looking at you and looking through you.>\n\nWhat have our efforts wrought, but a greater abomination than we sought to prevent?"]="<The arakkoa favors you with a haunted gaze and alternates between looking at you and looking through you.>\n\nWhat have our efforts wrought, but a greater abomination than we sought to prevent?"
G["<The arakkoa ghost reaches out toward you as though to try to identify you. You get the impression that it cannot see you clearly.>\n\nRokkaram, is that you?"]="<The arakkoa ghost reaches out toward you as though to try to identify you. You get the impression that it cannot see you clearly.>\n\nRokkaram, is that you?"
G["<The archmage's image seems to look through you, rather than at you.>\n\nRibbons and currents of arcane energy ebb and flow here as if the area is awash in a sea of magical power. Not even the first cataclysm caused this kind of damage."]="<The archmage's image seems to look through you, rather than at you.>\n\nRibbons and currents of arcane energy ebb and flow here as if the area is awash in a sea of magical power. Not even the first cataclysm caused this kind of damage."
G["<The beacon hums softly.>"]="<The beacon hums softly.>"
G["<The blade hovers in the air in front of you.>"]="<A lâmina frota linha de frente você.>"
G["<The blood elf is visibly shaken.>\n\nIt was horrible, just horrible! After we were caught, a mogu took me by the throat. I expected to die then and there, but instead, the mogu made a clutching motion and PULLED. All of a sudden, it was as if all the air were gone from my lungs.\n\nI felt a terrible twisting and ripping. My skin and bones felt as if on fire. Suddenly I was floating out of my own body.\n\nThe mogu laughed in my face, and I knew that my soul would suffer for the rest of eternity.\n\nHave you ever felt complete and utter terror, $c? I have.\n\n<The blood elf shudders and grows quiet.>"]="<The blood elf is visibly shaken.>\n\nIt was horrible, just horrible! After we were caught, a mogu took me by the throat. I expected to die then and there, but instead, the mogu made a clutching motion and PULLED. All of a sudden, it was as if all the air were gone from my lungs.\n\nI felt a terrible twisting and ripping. My skin and bones felt as if on fire. Suddenly I was floating out of my own body.\n\nThe mogu laughed in my face, and I knew that my soul would suffer for the rest of eternity.\n\nHave you ever felt complete and utter terror, $c? I have.\n\n<The blood elf shudders and grows quiet.>"
G["<The blood elf lies limp on the table.  While he's still breathing, he appears to have been the victim of potent sedative toxins.>"]="<O elfo sangrento está deitado sobre a mesa. Enquanto ele ainda está respirando, ele parece ter sido vítima de potentes toxinas sedativas."
G["<The blood elf lies on the floor in some manner of induced torpor.>"]="<O elfo sanguíneo está deitado no chão de alguma maneira com torpor induzido.>"
G["<The blood elf quickly regains consciousness as you pour the draught into his mouth.>\n\nI owe you my life, $c.  Without your help I would've succumbed to the Scourge's painful torture."]="<The blood elf quickly regains consciousness as you pour the draught into his mouth.>\n\nI owe you my life, $c.  Without your help I would've succumbed to the Scourge's painful torture."
G["<The body has been very badly burned and nearly bitten in half.>\n\n<The red dragonflight may be the guardians of all life on Azeroth, but clearly they are not to be crossed.>"]="<The body has been very badly burned and nearly bitten in half.>\n\n<The red dragonflight may be the guardians of all life on Azeroth, but clearly they are not to be crossed.>"
G["<The bodyguard glowers at you, his fist tightly clenching his sword.>\n\nThe prince wants to have a quiet chat, $c. If you start any trouble, we'll respond in kind."]="<The bodyguard glowers at you, his fist tightly clenching his sword.>\n\nThe prince wants to have a quiet chat, $c. If you start any trouble, we'll respond in kind."
G["<The captive crocolisk lets out a low growl as you approach.>"]="<O crocolisco em cativeiro deixa escapar um rosnado baixo quando você se aproxima.>"
G["<The captured Sunhawk agent eyes you suspiciously.>\n\nI've never seen you before. Who are you?"]="<O agente capturou dos Halcones do Sol te olhe recelosamente.>\n\nNão te vi nunca antes. Quem é?"
G["<The captured Sunhawk agent smirks.>\n\nDon't worry, new blood, there are many more portal controllers and many more suitable locations for portals. I am certain that Sironas will have a new gate up very soon. These blue skinned dogs are not long for this world. Sironas and the abomination will clean up whatever the Sunhawk forces leave behind."]="<The captured Sunhawk agent smirks.>\n\nDon't worry, new blood, there are many more portal controllers and many more suitable locations for portals. I am certain that Sironas will have a new gate up very soon. These blue skinned dogs are not long for this world. Sironas and the abomination will clean up whatever the Sunhawk forces leave behind."
G["<The cauldron bubbles.>"]="<O caldeirão borbulha.>"
G["<The charger stands proud, eager for battle.>"]="<O carregador está orgulhoso, ansioso pela batalha.>"
G["<The chime of A'dal's voice echoes reassuringly through your mind.>\n\nWorry not, child.  Look in your pack and you will find it once more."]="<O timbre de voz da'dal ressoa de modo tranquilizador pelo seu mente.>\n\nNão te preocupe, $ghijo: filha;. Olhe no seu bolsa e a volverás a encontrar."
G["<The cleric stares at you through the corner of its eye.>"]="<O clérigo olha para você pelo canto do olho.>"
G["<The commander stops his lesson and turns, his eyes appraising you, sizing you up.>\n\nI have use for one such as yourself, $c."]="<The commander stops his lesson and turns, his eyes appraising you, sizing you up.>\n\nI have use for one such as yourself, $c."
G["<The complicated schematics are too much for your meager engineering talents to discern.>"]="<Os esquemas complicados são demais para que seus escassos talentos de engenharia possam discernir.>"
G["<The conjurer stands fierce, its gaze distant.>"]="<O mágico está feroz, seu olhar distante.>"
G["<The console whirrs and buzzes as you approach it.>"]="<O console zumbe e vibra quando você se aproxima dele.>"
G["<The construct gestures to the eastern portion of the Tier.>"]="<O construto gesticula para a porção leste do Nível.>"
G["<The crane does not speak, but his words fill your mind.>\n\nGo... while you can...\n\nAll is... lost."]="<The crane does not speak, but his words fill your mind.>\n\nGo... while you can...\n\nAll is... lost."
G["<The creature pecks at your hand.>"]="<A criatura bica na sua mão.>"
G["<The dimensional portal hums.>"]="<O portal dimensional zumbe.>"
G["<The dog raises its head to look at you, and wags its tail weakly.>"]="<The dog raises its head to look at you, and wags its tail weakly.>"
G["<The dog's fur is matted with dirt. Its breathing is shallow.>"]="<The dog's fur is matted with dirt. Its breathing is shallow.>"
G["<The dog's ribs are poking out of its sides. It looks at you with pitiful eyes.>"]="<The dog's ribs are poking out of its sides. It looks at you with pitiful eyes.>"
G["<The dragonhawk appears to be unsettled by the commotion in the surrounding area.>"]="<O falcão-dragão parece perturbado pela comoção na área circundante.>"
G["<The druid appears to be deep in sleep, oblivious to his surroundings.>"]="<O druida parece estar profundamente adormecido, alheio ao seu ambiente.>"
G["<The drunken engineer blinks blearily and waves at you.>"]="<O engenheiro bêbado pisca turvamente e acena para você.>"
G["<The dusty journal is missing various entries>"]="<The dusty journal is missing various entries>"
G["<The dwarf is unconscious, but otherwise unharmed.>"]="<O enano está inconsciente, embora ha resultado ileso.>"
G["<The earth rumbles as Gordawg's movements come to a halt.>\n\nSpeak."]="<The earth rumbles as Gordawg's movements come to a halt.>\n\nSpeak."
G["<The elf lets out a laugh, almost as ghastly as her grin, full of sharp yellowed teeth.>\n\nFate, it seems, is not without its irony. Elydna, you say? You arrive on the eve of her communion!"]="<The elf lets out a laugh, almost as ghastly as her grin, full of sharp yellowed teeth.>\n\nFate, it seems, is not without its irony. Elydna, you say? You arrive on the eve of her communion!"
G["<The elf looks unsettled, his face shadowed with worry. The nervous glance and disheveled appearance paint a stark contrast against the stillness of Shadowglen. Whoever he is, he has come a long way to reach this place.>"]="<The elf looks unsettled, his face shadowed with worry. The nervous glance and disheveled appearance paint a stark contrast against the stillness of Shadowglen. Whoever he is, he has come a long way to reach this place.>"
G["<The elf sits in perfect serenity.>"]="A elfa se sienta em perfeita serenidade."
G["<The elf’s blind gaze pierces through flesh, wood, and stone, then lingers somewhere far beyond, suspended in infinity. His gaunt face betrays no emotion. Were it not for the subtle rise and fall of his chest, you’d think he had suffered the same fate as the Ancient looming behind him.>"]="<The elf’s blind gaze pierces through flesh, wood, and stone, then lingers somewhere far beyond, suspended in infinity. His gaunt face betrays no emotion. Were it not for the subtle rise and fall of his chest, you’d think he had suffered the same fate as the Ancient looming behind him.>"
G["<The emissary sneers without looking at you.>\n\nGo about your business, $r."]="<The emissary sneers without looking at you.>\n\nGo about your business, $r."
G["<The enforcer's eyes flash red.>\n\nI hope your pathetic Horde tries to attack us. I am itching to shed some blood, $c!"]="<The enforcer's eyes flash red.>\n\nI hope your pathetic Horde tries to attack us. I am itching to shed some blood, $c!"
G["<The engine rumbles loudly.>"]="<O motor ronca alto.>"
G["<The enormous ancient remains wary of you, but speaks to you as an ally.>"]="<A enorme antiguidade permanece cautelosa com você, mas fala com você como um aliado.>"
G["<The enormous bird shies away from you.>"]="<The enormous bird shies away from you.>"
G["<The enormous black drake, covered with open wounds, stares you down with malice in his eyes. It does not blink.>"]="<O enorme pato preto, coberto de feridas abertas, olha para você com malícia nos olhos. Não pisca.>"
G["<The enormous giant peers down at your tiny form.>\n\n$n, did you change your hair?"]="<O enorme gigantesco olhe em direção a baixo e examina seu forma diminuta.>\n\n$n, você feito algo no cabelo?"
G["<The falcon squawks hungrily for a grub.>"]="<O falcão grita com fome de um grub.>"
G["<The farmer stares at the floor with a distant look in his eyes.>\n\nThey... took them.\n\nTook them away..."]="<O fazendeiro dirige seus olhos ao chão com uma olhar distante.>\n\nSe os têm... levado.\n\nSe os têm levado..."
G["<The ferocious black drake strains at the chains that bind it. It's best to keep your distance.>"]="<O draco preto feroz puxa as correntes que o prendem. É melhor manter distância.>"
G["<The footman stand resolute, muscles tense.>"]="<O lacaio permanece firme, os músculos tensos.>"
G["<The furbolg sniffs at you and grunts.>"]="<O furbolg fareja e grunhe.>"
G["<The gnome's face is streaked with smoke and burns, but he's alive.>"]="<The gnome's face is streaked with smoke and burns, but he's alive.>"
G["<The great cat barely bats an ear at you, even when you run your fingers through her thick fur.>"]="<The great cat barely bats an ear at you, even when you run your fingers through her thick fur.>"
G["<The grizzled gladiator speaks in halting Common.> What? You have a problem with me? Take it to the arena. I don't waste my time with your little \"hordes\" and \"alliances.\""]="<O gladiador grisalho fala em parar Common.> O quê? Tens algum problema comigo? Leve-o para a arena. Não perco tempo com as suas pequenas \"hordas\" e \"alianças\"."
G["<The grunt's mouth waters, anticipating bloodshed.>"]="<A boca do grunhido se molha, antecipando derramamento de sangue.>"
G["<The hatchling chirps at you.>"]="<A prole pía.>"
G["<The hatchling flies around gracefully.>"]="<A prole voe em círculos grácilmente.>"
G["<The hatchling flies around playfully.>"]="<A prole voe em círculos, juguetona.>"
G["<The hatchling glares at you with a disappointed frown. It sees that you are playing with another hatchling.>\n\n<You can only play with one hatchling at a time. Speak to Elder Anli to return your current hatchling before playing Catch! with this one.>"]="<The hatchling glares at you with a disappointed frown. It sees that you are playing with another hatchling.>\n\n<You can only play with one hatchling at a time. Speak to Elder Anli to return your current hatchling before playing Catch! with this one.>"
G["<The hatchling grunts at you.>"]="<The hatchling grunts at you.>"
G["<The hatchling licks you.>"]="<The hatchling licks you.>"
G["<The hatchling looks at you as if trying to determine whether or not you're its mother.>"]="<O filhote olha para você como se estivesse tentando determinar se você é sua mãe ou não.>"
G["<The hatchling looks at you inquisitively.>"]="<The hatchling looks at you inquisitively.>"
G["<The hatchling looks at you with a bored expression.>"]="<The hatchling looks at you with a bored expression.>"
G["<The hatchling looks at you with a curious expression.>"]="<The hatchling looks at you with a curious expression.>"
G["<The hatchling nudges you, almost knocking you over.>"]="<The hatchling nudges you, almost knocking you over.>"
G["<The hatchling rubs its scales against your arm.>"]="<A prole restriega seus escamas pelo seu braço.>"
G["<The hatchling smiles at you.>"]="<A prole te sorri.>"
G["<The hatchling watches you.>"]="<A prole te observa.>"
G["<The high abbot studies you a moment and then smiles.>\n\nVery well, I know a place, child. You just kiss my ring and let me know when you are ready."]="<The high abbot studies you a moment and then smiles.>\n\nVery well, I know a place, child. You just kiss my ring and let me know when you are ready."
G["<The hollow sockets of Lady Aegya’s eyes fall upon you with a gaze that cuts deeper than any blade.>"]="<The hollow sockets of Lady Aegya’s eyes fall upon you with a gaze that cuts deeper than any blade.>"
G["<The image's head blurs as it turns to take in its surroundings.>\n\nIf you had seen the Plains of Farahlon, you wouldn't believe this is the same place. Mere months ago, these fields would not have looked out of place in Westfall.\n\nAll that is gone now, but how and why?"]="<The image's head blurs as it turns to take in its surroundings.>\n\nIf you had seen the Plains of Farahlon, you wouldn't believe this is the same place. Mere months ago, these fields would not have looked out of place in Westfall.\n\nAll that is gone now, but how and why?"
G["<The injured soldier appears to still be breathing. Thankfully, her bubble remains intact.>"]="<O soldado ferido parece ainda estar respirando. Felizmente, a bolha dela permanece intacta."
G["<The injured soldier appears to still be breathing. Thankfully, his bubble remains intact.>"]="<O soldado ferido parece ainda estar respirando. Felizmente, sua bolha permanece intacta."
G["<The injured soldier's pained groans are somewhat distorted by the water.>"]="<Os gemidos doloridos do soldado ferido estão um pouco distorcidos pela água.>"
G["<The light surrounding Xi'ri pulses blue.  The naaru welcomes you as an ally in the field of battle.>"]="<A luz ao redor de Xi'ri pulsa em azul. O naaru recebe você como um aliado no campo de batalha.>"
G["<The lord-commander fixes you with a stare before going on.>\n\nI was getting to that. Indeed, when High General Abbendis landed her forces on Northrend, she changed their name to the Scarlet Onslaught.\n\nIt was not long before Admiral Barean Westwind presented himself to her at New Hearthglen in the Dragonblight. From all accounts, she wasn't expecting him. Nor was she expecting that he would undermine her authority and take the reins of command away from her.\n\nLikely you were involved with her demise, but no matter. Once she was dead, the admiral made a mysterious exit and we lost track of him."]="<The lord-commander fixes you with a stare before going on.>\n\nI was getting to that. Indeed, when High General Abbendis landed her forces on Northrend, she changed their name to the Scarlet Onslaught.\n\nIt was not long before Admiral Barean Westwind presented himself to her at New Hearthglen in the Dragonblight. From all accounts, she wasn't expecting him. Nor was she expecting that he would undermine her authority and take the reins of command away from her.\n\nLikely you were involved with her demise, but no matter. Once she was dead, the admiral made a mysterious exit and we lost track of him."
G["<The lord-commander flashes a rictus grin, looking you up and down discerningly.>\n\nThat's what I wanted to hear."]="<The lord-commander flashes a rictus grin, looking you up and down discerningly.>\n\nThat's what I wanted to hear."
G["<The man barely acknowledges your presence. It is clear that he isn't interested in speaking with you.>"]="<O homem mal reconhece sua presença. É claro que ele não está interessado em falar com você."
G["<The mangled body of one of the New Agamand apothecaries lies here.>"]="<The mangled body of one of the New Agamand apothecaries lies here.>"
G["<The mantid councilor narrows his enormous eyes on you briefly.>"]="<The mantid councilor narrows his enormous eyes on you briefly.>"
G["<The mantid emerges from hiding.>\n\nStay back, $r.\n\nThe Empress is not of her right mind. We Klaxxi are gathering our numbers for an assault on her throne, but we are not yet prepared. And neither are you.\n\nThe time to strike is soon... but not yet."]="<The mantid emerges from hiding.>\n\nStay back, $r.\n\nThe Empress is not of her right mind. We Klaxxi are gathering our numbers for an assault on her throne, but we are not yet prepared. And neither are you.\n\nThe time to strike is soon... but not yet."
G["<The massive yeti looks at you expectantly.>"]="<O enorme yeti te mira expectante.>"
G["<The mayor can’t help the flicker of a smile when his eyes meet Thalira Conacher’s across the great hall.>"]="<The mayor can’t help the flicker of a smile when his eyes meet Thalira Conacher’s across the great hall.>"
G["<The murloc looks at you with thirsty eyes.>"]="<The murloc looks at you with thirsty eyes.>"
G["<The night elf turns to you as you approach and reaches for your hand.>\nIt is too late for me. We earned our fate with our pride. Go... others may have made it. Save any that you can.\n<Her grip loosens as life slips from her.>"]="<The night elf turns to you as you approach and reaches for your hand.>\nIt is too late for me. We earned our fate with our pride. Go... others may have made it. Save any that you can.\n<Her grip loosens as life slips from her.>"
G["<The noble Flaskasaur nods at you in approval.>"]="<O noble Frascosaur asiente com a cabeça.>"
G["<The old yaungol stares at you with hatred in his eyes.>"]="<The old yaungol stares at you with hatred in his eyes.>"
G["<The orc before you looks greener than usual.>\n\n$C, the goblins have brought \"all you can eat seafood\" to our shores. It is ... *urp* ... like a cataclysm in my belly."]="<O orco que há ante ti está mais verde do normal.>\n\n$C, os goblins têm trazido a nossas orilhas \"tudo o frutos do mar que possa comer\". É como...*urp*... um Cataclismo na minha estômago."
G["<The orc wolf's frozen, snarling mouth shivers your bones.>"]="<A boca congelada e rosnada do lobo orc estremece seus ossos.>"
G["<The orc's lifeless body is no longer responsive....>"]="<O corpo sem vida do orc não responde mais....>"
G["<The outhouse is silent.>"]="<A casinha fica em silêncio.>"
G["<The pandaren snores deeply.>"]="<The pandaren snores deeply.>"
G["<The pandaren was recently stripped, beaten, and broken. His body is still growing cold.>"]="<The pandaren was recently stripped, beaten, and broken. His body is still growing cold.>"
G["<The peon sweats and twitches.>\n\nI was ... what I meant ... um, bad!"]="<The peon sweats and twitches.>\n\nI was ... what I meant ... um, bad!"
G["<The peon's eyes widen in terror.>\n\nNo! You've discovered Sauranok is the new cult leader in Orgrimmar? He told me his secret is safe!"]="<The peon's eyes widen in terror.>\n\nNo! You've discovered Sauranok is the new cult leader in Orgrimmar? He told me his secret is safe!"
G["<The queen's consort nods in acknowledgment of your presence.>"]="<O consorte da rainha concorda com à sua presença.>"
G["<The quilboar fixes his beady black eyes on you.>"]="<O quilboar fixa seus olhos pretos e redondos em você.>"
G["<The quilboar wrinkles his nose at you and snorts.>"]="<O quilboar torce o nariz para você e bufa.>"
G["<The raptor peers at you, growls, and slobbers.>\n\n<It appears Subject Nine left behind an un-augmented clone of herself in order to cover her tracks. Clever girl! You ponder over what exactly you've unleashed onto the cosmos...>"]="<The raptor peers at you, growls, and slobbers.>\n\n<It appears Subject Nine left behind an un-augmented clone of herself in order to cover her tracks. Clever girl! You ponder over what exactly you've unleashed onto the cosmos...>"
G["<The saurok cowers behind its pet.>"]="<O saurok se esconde tras seu mascote.>"
G["<The saurok kneels in silent reverence.>"]="<The saurok kneels in silent reverence.>"
G["<The scruffy old pandaren snores peacefully. A pile of assorted bottles are strewn about next to him.>"]="<The scruffy old pandaren snores peacefully. A pile of assorted bottles are strewn about next to him.>"
G["<The seedling tilts its leaves up towards you, as if looking in your direction.>"]="<As mudas inclinam as folhas na sua direção, como se estivessem olhando na sua direção.>"
G["<The sentinel initiate fixes you with a suspicious look.>\n\nLost, are you?"]="<The sentinel initiate fixes you with a suspicious look.>\n\nLost, are you?"
G["<The shimmering vision does not acknowledge your presence. She is lost in her own world, reacting to events that played out thousands of years ago.>"]="<A visão cintilante não reconhece sua presença. Ela está perdida no seu próprio mundo, reagindo a eventos que aconteceram milhares de anos atrás."
G["<The shortfang recoils in fear.>"]="<The shortfang recoils in fear.>"
G["<The soldier gasps, his fist barely clenched around the hilt of his sword. His arm dangles useless from a shoulder skewered clean through by an arrow shaft still jutting from the wound.>\n\nNorthshire Valley was supposed to be a quiet post… “a stroke of luck”, they said, to have me stationed here!\n\n<He spits his bitterness to the ground and growls:>\n\nTo hell with that. I’m not dying here."]="<The soldier gasps, his fist barely clenched around the hilt of his sword. His arm dangles useless from a shoulder skewered clean through by an arrow shaft still jutting from the wound.>\n\nNorthshire Valley was supposed to be a quiet post… “a stroke of luck”, they said, to have me stationed here!\n\n<He spits his bitterness to the ground and growls:>\n\nTo hell with that. I’m not dying here."
G["<The spider peers at you menacingly.>"]="<The spider peers at you menacingly.>"
G["<The staff pulsates with arcane energies.>"]="<O bastão pulsa com energias misteriosas.>"
G["<The starlet stares at you blankly.>"]="<A estrela olha para você sem entender.>"
G["<The stench around Vol'jin's makeshift revolutionary camp is intolerable. The troll leader allows you to speak first, while his guards eye you warily.>"]="<The stench around Vol'jin's makeshift revolutionary camp is intolerable. The troll leader allows you to speak first, while his guards eye you warily.>"
G["<The summoned daemon twitches, fighting against Medivh's rules of play.  He wants your soul!>"]="<O daemon convocado estremece, lutando contra as regras de jogo de Medivh. Ele quer sua alma!>"
G["<The tauren paladin looks you up and down, as if sizing up your intentions.>\n\nI mean you no hostility, $c. The human prince and I met at the Temple of the White Tiger, and he often seeks me out to talk about my Chieftain, Baine, and to discuss matters of war and peace.\n\n<The paladin and the Prince's bodyguards periodically exchange distrustful glances at one another.>"]="<The tauren paladin looks you up and down, as if sizing up your intentions.>\n\nI mean you no hostility, $c. The human prince and I met at the Temple of the White Tiger, and he often seeks me out to talk about my Chieftain, Baine, and to discuss matters of war and peace.\n\n<The paladin and the Prince's bodyguards periodically exchange distrustful glances at one another.>"
G["<The trade prince lowers his voice to barely a whisper.>\n\nDon't think for a moment that I've forgotten how much I despise you, $n, rescue or not.\n\nDon't worry your $g simple : pretty; head. I'll get my revenge soon enough, mark my words!\n\nYou'll fare far worse than being my slave. There'll be no escape for you this time."]="<The trade prince lowers his voice to barely a whisper.>\n\nDon't think for a moment that I've forgotten how much I despise you, $n, rescue or not.\n\nDon't worry your $g simple : pretty; head. I'll get my revenge soon enough, mark my words!\n\nYou'll fare far worse than being my slave. There'll be no escape for you this time."
G["<The troll before you is covered head-to-toe with gashes and scars, including a fresh slice across his face that has fattened his lip.>\n\nHewwo!\n\nAs you know, twolls wide waptors. The pwobwem is cowwecting the wild waptors for twaining! That's where I come in. I'm a waptor twapper."]="<The troll before you is covered head-to-toe with gashes and scars, including a fresh slice across his face that has fattened his lip.>\n\nHewwo!\n\nAs you know, twolls wide waptors. The pwobwem is cowwecting the wild waptors for twaining! That's where I come in. I'm a waptor twapper."
G["<The troll sings to himself and stares into the cauldron.  He appears to be injured.>"]="<O troll canta para si mesmo e olha para o caldeirão. Ele parece estar ferido."
G["<The troll sings to himself as he observes the carnage around him.>"]="<O troll canta para si mesmo enquanto observa a carnificina ao seu redor.>"
G["<The unfortunate soldier you find at the side of the road has been gutted with what appears to have been long knives. Rolling the body over, you notice teeth marks.>\n\n<Could wild animals have done this?>"]="<The unfortunate soldier you find at the side of the road has been gutted with what appears to have been long knives. Rolling the body over, you notice teeth marks.>\n\n<Could wild animals have done this?>"
G["<The veteran gladiator speaks in halting Orcish.> What? You have a problem with me? Take it to the arena. I don't waste my time with your little \"hordes\" and \"alliances.\""]="<O veterano gladiador fala em interromper Orcish.> O quê? Tens algum problema comigo? Leve-o para a arena. Não perco tempo com as suas pequenas \"hordas\" e \"alianças\"."
G["<The warden does not acknowledge you.>"]="<The warden does not acknowledge you.>"
G["<The water elemental is ready to surge.>"]="<O elemento água está pronto para surgir.>"
G["<The wolf watches you with wise eyes.>"]="<O lobo te observa com uma olhar sabia.>"
G["<The words of Malik echo through your mind.>\n\n\"Heroes never die.\""]="<The words of Malik echo through your mind.>\n\n\"Heroes never die.\""
G["<There is a a painful looking gash along the soldier's side.>"]="<Há um corte doloroso no lado do soldado.>"
G["<These baby Rockpool murlocs look toward the ocean.>"]="<Estes murlocs de Rockpool olham para o oceano.>"
G["<These baby Rockpool murlocs seem to have been abandoned here.  You suspect that they are in trouble, and that Neptool would want you to bring them back to the ocean, where they stand a chance of escaping the naga.>"]="<Estes murlocs de Rockpool parecem ter sido abandonados aqui. Você suspeita que eles estejam com problemas e que o Neptool gostaria que você os trouxesse de volta ao oceano, onde eles têm a chance de escapar das nagas."
G["<These baby murlocs seem to have been abandoned here.>"]="<These baby murlocs seem to have been abandoned here.>"
G["<This is more than just a chunk of amber - there's a mantid inside!>"]="<This is more than just a chunk of amber - there's a mantid inside!>"
G["<This pirate has obviously had too much to drink.  He appears to be out cold for the time being.>"]="<Este pirata obviamente bebeu demais. Ele parece estar frio por enquanto."
G["<This robotic gorilla appears to be damaged.>"]="<Este gorila robótico parece estar danificado.>"
G["<Though Ysera's physical form stands in front of you, her consciousness appears to shift between this world and another.>"]="<Embora a forma física de Ysera esteja na sua linha de frente, sua consciência parece mudar entre este mundo e outro.>"
G["<Thrall laughs.>\n\nNoted... Now pay attention, $n. The Black Dragonflight brood mother, Onyxia, has been flushed out from her position of power in Stormwind. She has escaped, fleeing to her lair in Dustwallow Marsh.\n\nShe cannot be allowed to live in such close proximity to our capital cities. We must strike before being struck!\n\nI want her destroyed, $n."]="<Thrall laughs.>\n\nNoted... Now pay attention, $n. The Black Dragonflight brood mother, Onyxia, has been flushed out from her position of power in Stormwind. She has escaped, fleeing to her lair in Dustwallow Marsh.\n\nShe cannot be allowed to live in such close proximity to our capital cities. We must strike before being struck!\n\nI want her destroyed, $n."
G["<Thrall laughs.>\n\nSo much to learn still, $r.\n\nYou are too young to remember the wars and bloodshed of ages past. Too young to remember the burden of the curse carried by our people.\n\nOur position with the Alliance right now is a tenuous one. Skirmishes and smaller battles do take place, but there is peace - something our people have not known for millennia. Would you give this up and plunge us into the maw of chaos again but against a new foe? One that will not rest until we are all destroyed?"]="<Thrall laughs.>\n\nSo much to learn still, $r.\n\nYou are too young to remember the wars and bloodshed of ages past. Too young to remember the burden of the curse carried by our people.\n\nOur position with the Alliance right now is a tenuous one. Skirmishes and smaller battles do take place, but there is peace - something our people have not known for millennia. Would you give this up and plunge us into the maw of chaos again but against a new foe? One that will not rest until we are all destroyed?"
G["<Threaten her with violence.> Not my problem. Pay up or face the consequences."]="<Amenázala com violência.> Isso não é meu problema. Paga ou atente às consecuências."
G["<Threaten him with violence.>\nA debt is a debt. Let's see the money."]="<Amenázalo com violência.>\nUma dívida é uma dívida. A ver esse dinheiro."
G["<Threaten him with violence.> Do you want to get punched in the mouth?"]="<Amenázalo com violência.> Que que te pegue um soco na boca?"
G["<Threaten him with violence.> You need to be taught a lesson, kid. Pay up."]="<Amenázalo com violência.> Precisa aprender uma lecção, rapaz. Paga."
G["<Tickle Time!>"]="<Tickle Time!>"
G["<To your astonishment, the Raptor hatchling is able to communicate with you.>\n\n$G Papa : Mama;...?"]="<To your astonishment, the Raptor hatchling is able to communicate with you.>\n\n$G Papa : Mama;...?"
G["<To your astonishment, the Raptor hatchling is able to communicate with you.>\n\nGreetings. I recently emerged from an egg. You?"]="<To your astonishment, the Raptor hatchling is able to communicate with you.>\n\nGreetings. I recently emerged from an egg. You?"
G["<To your astonishment, the Raptor hatchling is able to communicate with you.>\n\nI hunger... therefore, I am."]="<To your astonishment, the Raptor hatchling is able to communicate with you.>\n\nI hunger... therefore, I am."
G["<To your astonishment, the Raptor hatchling is able to communicate with you.>\n\nIs it true that you cook your meat? Curious."]="<To your astonishment, the Raptor hatchling is able to communicate with you.>\n\nIs it true that you cook your meat? Curious."
G["<To your astonishment, the Raptor hatchling is able to communicate with you.>\n\nThe ends of your fingers are dull and round. Is this why you carry around other implements for use in combat?\n\nHow interesting."]="<To your astonishment, the Raptor hatchling is able to communicate with you.>\n\nThe ends of your fingers are dull and round. Is this why you carry around other implements for use in combat?\n\nHow interesting."
G["<To your astonishment, the Raptor hatchling is able to communicate with you.>\n\nThey call you $n. Is this your unique signifier, or is it an honorary title?"]="<To your astonishment, the Raptor hatchling is able to communicate with you.>\n\nThey call you $n. Is this your unique signifier, or is it an honorary title?"
G["<To your astonishment, the Raptor hatchling is able to communicate with you.>\n\nWhat does \"$c\" mean? Are you the goblin $g patriarch : matriarch;?"]="<To your astonishment, the Raptor hatchling is able to communicate with you.>\n\nWhat does \"$c\" mean? Are you the goblin $g patriarch : matriarch;?"
G["<To your astonishment, the Raptor hatchling is able to communicate with you.>\n\nYou lack a helmet. Does this diminish your intellectual capacities?"]="<To your astonishment, the Raptor hatchling is able to communicate with you.>\n\nYou lack a helmet. Does this diminish your intellectual capacities?"
G["<Touch the unstable rift crystal.>"]="<Touch the unstable rift crystal.>"
G["<Try shaking Hemet.>"]="<Intenta agitar a Hemet.>"
G["<Try to free Kor Bloodtusk from his bonds.>"]="<Intenta liberar a Kor Sangradiente dos seus ataduras.>"
G["<Try to untie Lyalia.>"]="<Intenta liberar a Lyalia.>"
G["<Turn to the next page.>"]="<Turn to the next page.>"
G["<Ulfang howls and sniffs at you, and you can understand what he says.>\n\nThe strange white worg of the north, Garwal, has taken my pack from me. We must rip out his throat so that I will be the alpha worg once again."]="<Ulfang howls and sniffs at you, and you can understand what he says.>\n\nThe strange white worg of the north, Garwal, has taken my pack from me. We must rip out his throat so that I will be the alpha worg once again."
G["<Unlock the shackles.>"]="<Unlock the shackles.>"
G["<Unscrew the flask and offer it to her.>"]="<Unscrew the flask and offer it to her.>"
G["<Use the Ambermill Dimensional Portal.>"]="<Use the Ambermill Dimensional Portal.>"
G["<Use the stone to teleport back to Valormok.>"]="<Utiliza a pedras para teletransportarte a Valormok.>"
G["<Use the transcription device to gather a rubbing.>"]="<Use o dispositivo de transcrição para reunir uma fricção.>"
G["<Valdred looks back down at his hands.>\n\nI suppose this is my fate then.  Hah!  Part of an undead army.  Somehow I never considered that I might end up fighting for the Forsaken.\n\n<He looks back up at you.>\n\nWhat do I do now?"]="<Valdred se olhe as mãos.>\n\nEntão suponho que é meu destino. Ha! Sou parte de um exército de não-mortos. A verdade é que nunca pensei que poderá acabar lutando pelos Renegados.\n\n<Te olhe.>\n\nQue faço agora?"
G["<Varnis coughs violently as the restorative draught takes effect.>\n\nThank you for rescuing me.  I must go back to Tranquillien at once!"]="<Varnis coughs violently as the restorative draught takes effect.>\n\nThank you for rescuing me.  I must go back to Tranquillien at once!"
G["<Vicious gashes line Valdaron's body. You need not check his pulse to know that he has already passed.>"]="<Vicious gashes line Valdaron's body. You need not check his pulse to know that he has already passed.>"
G["<Vindicator Aesom salutes you.>\n\nHave you spoken with Admetius? I believe he was inquiring as to your whereabouts."]="<Vindicator Aesom salutes you.>\n\nHave you spoken with Admetius? I believe he was inquiring as to your whereabouts."
G["<Vol'jin allows a grim smile to creep across his scowling features.>\n\nNot yet he don't. Maybe he hearin' rumors. Maybe he thinkin', dey ghost stories. Maybe ol' Vol'jin comin' back ta haunt him. Hah.\n\nHe find out soon enough. Too bad I'm not gonna be there ta see da look on his fat, beady-eyed face when he hears ol' Vol'jin is back, an' gonna make good on me promise. Ta end his sad little reign. Ta fire de arrow dat pierces his black heart."]="<Vol'jin allows a grim smile to creep across his scowling features.>\n\nNot yet he don't. Maybe he hearin' rumors. Maybe he thinkin', dey ghost stories. Maybe ol' Vol'jin comin' back ta haunt him. Hah.\n\nHe find out soon enough. Too bad I'm not gonna be there ta see da look on his fat, beady-eyed face when he hears ol' Vol'jin is back, an' gonna make good on me promise. Ta end his sad little reign. Ta fire de arrow dat pierces his black heart."
G["<Vol'jin cackles, the stench of his hot breath reeking in your nostrils.>\n\nOh, ya got anudda plan? I got anudda plan, too. I let ya siege Orgrimmar on ya own. See how far ya get. An' once da city be filled wit' corpses, den me shadow hunters come in, we mop up what left, kill Kor'kron an' Alliance alike. Give ya dead ta Sylvanas. Hmm! I save a lot a Darkspear lives wit' dis plan!\n\nMmnn? You don't like? Then, we stay wit' da first plan. We work together.\n\nWe don't even have ta like each other."]="<Vol'jin cackles, the stench of his hot breath reeking in your nostrils.>\n\nOh, ya got anudda plan? I got anudda plan, too. I let ya siege Orgrimmar on ya own. See how far ya get. An' once da city be filled wit' corpses, den me shadow hunters come in, we mop up what left, kill Kor'kron an' Alliance alike. Give ya dead ta Sylvanas. Hmm! I save a lot a Darkspear lives wit' dis plan!\n\nMmnn? You don't like? Then, we stay wit' da first plan. We work together.\n\nWe don't even have ta like each other."
G["<Vol'jin lays on the floor unconscious and barely breathing.>"]="<Vol'jin jaz no chão; está inconsciente e apenas respira.>"
G["<Vol'jin runs his three-fingered hand over his scar.>\n\nIt been a long road, friend. Garrosh tried ta take me life wit' a knife in de throat. Left me for dead. I crawl out dat cave, couldn't even speak. It was Chen Stormstout who found me, nursed me back from de brink.\n\nWe travelled to de Shado-Pan monastery, an' dey help me do some soul-searching. Figure out who I was. Who de Horde was. Me father...\n\nI made up me mind. I'm takin' de Horde back. No matter de cost.\n\nDarkspear never die."]="<Vol'jin runs his three-fingered hand over his scar.>\n\nIt been a long road, friend. Garrosh tried ta take me life wit' a knife in de throat. Left me for dead. I crawl out dat cave, couldn't even speak. It was Chen Stormstout who found me, nursed me back from de brink.\n\nWe travelled to de Shado-Pan monastery, an' dey help me do some soul-searching. Figure out who I was. Who de Horde was. Me father...\n\nI made up me mind. I'm takin' de Horde back. No matter de cost.\n\nDarkspear never die."
G["<Vol'jin sees his opportunity slipping away. He holds up his hands.>\n\nWait now, $r! Orgrimmar be a fortress. My people, we ain't gonna crack dat nut on our own. How long we gonna last out here? Days? Weeks? Vol'jin can't say.\n\nYou keep da supplies comin', an' I promise, more Kor'kron gonna die. Before ya troops even land! The blood bein' spilt ain't even ya own! Surely dat be worth a few crates of meat?"]="<Vol'jin sees his opportunity slipping away. He holds up his hands.>\n\nWait now, $r! Orgrimmar be a fortress. My people, we ain't gonna crack dat nut on our own. How long we gonna last out here? Days? Weeks? Vol'jin can't say.\n\nYou keep da supplies comin', an' I promise, more Kor'kron gonna die. Before ya troops even land! The blood bein' spilt ain't even ya own! Surely dat be worth a few crates of meat?"
G["<Vol'jin twists his face into a scowl.>\n\nYa wouldn't understand. What's de Horde ta ya, $r? Hm? Diseased? Alien? Betrayers? Demon-blooded? Beasts? I know what ya say 'bout us.\n\nI'll tell ya what de Horde is. De Horde dat me an' Thrall built. It be a family. When de whole world try ta put us down, de family come an' pick us back up.\n\nHellscream, he don't see family. Ain't never had one."]="<Vol'jin twists his face into a scowl.>\n\nYa wouldn't understand. What's de Horde ta ya, $r? Hm? Diseased? Alien? Betrayers? Demon-blooded? Beasts? I know what ya say 'bout us.\n\nI'll tell ya what de Horde is. De Horde dat me an' Thrall built. It be a family. When de whole world try ta put us down, de family come an' pick us back up.\n\nHellscream, he don't see family. Ain't never had one."
G["<Volcor doesn't look at you at all as you get close to him. He seems to be concentrating on keeping his bandages from falling off. After a moment, he looks up at you, a little startled.>\n\nOh, sorry, $c. Now's not a good time. I hope you understand."]="<Volcor doesn't look at you at all as you get close to him. He seems to be concentrating on keeping his bandages from falling off. After a moment, he looks up at you, a little startled.>\n\nOh, sorry, $c. Now's not a good time. I hope you understand."
G["<Volcor's body lies motionless.  As you begin to move away, a hand reaches out and grabs your ankle. He's alive!>"]="<O corpo de Volcor permanece imóvel. Quando você começa a se afastar, uma mão estende a mão e agarra seu tornozelo. Ele está vivo!>"
G["<Wake Tarsis up.>"]="<Acorde a Tarsis.>"
G["<Warchief Blackhand towers over the field.>"]="<Chefe Guerreiro Mão Negra se ergue sobre o campo.>"
G["<Warden Treelos looks at you funny and then pauses a moment, clearly struggling.>\n\nZangarmarsh... too close to truth.\n\n<His face goes crazy again.>\n\nIs he still watching!?"]="<Warden Treelos looks at you funny and then pauses a moment, clearly struggling.>\n\nZangarmarsh... too close to truth.\n\n<His face goes crazy again.>\n\nIs he still watching!?"
G["<Wind howls past the statue as you stand in front of it.>"]="<Wind howls past the statue as you stand in front of it.>"
G["<Wistfully, Kalecgos looks off to the horizon.>\n\nTarecgosa is... special to me.\n\nWhen she was but a hatchling, I was charged with her protection and education. Over the millennia, we have forged a special bond, not unlike what you would call siblings.\n\nTarecgosa was born under a special sign that foretold of a great destiny. If the prophecies are true, then her survival is of vital importance to the blue dragonflight, and to Azeroth itself.\n\nOur affinity for one another is well known within the remnants of our flight. If your vision recounted an event that has actually taken place, she could be in grave danger."]="<Wistfully, Kalecgos looks off to the horizon.>\n\nTarecgosa is... special to me.\n\nWhen she was but a hatchling, I was charged with her protection and education. Over the millennia, we have forged a special bond, not unlike what you would call siblings.\n\nTarecgosa was born under a special sign that foretold of a great destiny. If the prophecies are true, then her survival is of vital importance to the blue dragonflight, and to Azeroth itself.\n\nOur affinity for one another is well known within the remnants of our flight. If your vision recounted an event that has actually taken place, she could be in grave danger."
G["<Wrathion sits alone, twirling a game piece in his fingers. He is staring intently at the game board but you get the impression that his mind is elsewhere.>"]="<Wrathion sits alone, twirling a game piece in his fingers. He is staring intently at the game board but you get the impression that his mind is elsewhere.>"
G["<Xon'cha looks nervously over his shoulder.> You'll have to go elsewhere if you want to get at your pets, $c. The Kor'kron be watchin'."]="<Xon'cha looks nervously over his shoulder.> You'll have to go elsewhere if you want to get at your pets, $c. The Kor'kron be watchin'."
G["<Yank out his belly piercing.>"]="<Yank out his belly piercing.>"
G["<Yawn> Is it dawn already? Ah well, all good things... as they say. I don't know about the rest of you, but I'm going inside."]="<Yawn> Is it dawn already? Ah well, all good things... as they say. I don't know about the rest of you, but I'm going inside."
G["<You are well versed in the creation and function of this robot.>"]="<Você é bem versado na criação e função deste robô.>"
G["<You can hear Chi-Ji's voice echoing in your mind.>\n\nI sense that you need my help to get to the top of the dome."]="<You can hear Chi-Ji's voice echoing in your mind.>\n\nI sense that you need my help to get to the top of the dome."
G["<You can't quite make out what Gobber is saying with all of the food that is stuffed in his mouth. You're pretty sure that it's a thanks, however.>"]="<You can't quite make out what Gobber is saying with all of the food that is stuffed in his mouth. You're pretty sure that it's a thanks, however.>"
