G["<You find Calder idly picking at his ear with a dagger.>"]="<Você encontra Calder ociosamente cutucando a orelha dele com uma adaga.>"
G["<You grab at the orb, but Fizzle's hand clutches around it even tighter.  The orb glows slightly.>"]="<Você agarra a esfera, mas a mão de Fizzle a aperta ainda mais. O orbe brilha um pouco."
G["<You hear Chi-Ji speaking in your mind.>\n\nLet me assist you to get to the top of the pavilion, my friend."]="<You hear Chi-Ji speaking in your mind.>\n\nLet me assist you to get to the top of the pavilion, my friend."
G["<You may train any of the secondary professions. Please choose from the following selections:>"]="<Você pode treinar qualquer uma das profissões secundárias. Escolha uma das seguintes seleções:>"
G["<You may train in up to two primary professions. Please choose from the following selections:>"]="<Você pode treinar até duas profissões primárias. Escolha uma das seguintes seleções:>"
G["<You nod slightly but do not complete the motion as the lord-commander narrows his eyes before he continues.>"]="<Você balança a cabeça um pouco, mas não complete o movimento enquanto o senhor comandante estreita os olhos antes de seguir.>"
G["<You watch in fascination as the creature gracefully carves lines through the air in this cozy cavern. The respite from the violence and turmoil of your last hours is most welcome.\n\nThe being offers no visible acknowledgement of your presence, but a feeling grows within you that he is aware of your every breath.\n\nThinking back to Nazgrim and the others, you consider how best to engage the stranger in conversation.>"]="<You watch in fascination as the creature gracefully carves lines through the air in this cozy cavern. The respite from the violence and turmoil of your last hours is most welcome.\n\nThe being offers no visible acknowledgement of your presence, but a feeling grows within you that he is aware of your every breath.\n\nThinking back to Nazgrim and the others, you consider how best to engage the stranger in conversation.>"
G["<Your hatchling chirps at you.>"]="<Seu prole pía.>"
