G["<cough> <hack> I have... returned."]="<cough> <hack> I have... returned."
G["<cough> Ugh..."]="<cough> Ugh..."
G["<cough>... you are impudent, impatient, childish. You cannot even... control yourself, your own fear... your own rage."]="<cough>... you are impudent, impatient, childish. You cannot even... control yourself, your own fear... your own rage."
G["<hic!> Well... Let's see... By my count, nobody. The whole crew's drunk out of their gourds, admiral... 'cept the sea pups... <hic!>"]="<Hic!>Bom... Vamos ver... Que eu sepa, ninguém. Toda a tripulação está como uma cuba, almirante... Exceto os cachorros de mar... <Hic!>"
G["<hic>\n\nIt be lonely in here without me mateys, $g lad:lass;."]="<hip>\n\nSem meus colegas te sentirías $gsolo: sozinha; aqui, $g rapaz: garota;."
G["<hic>Lissen here, $r. Spend a day or two wrestlin' with wild trolls and then tell me how you smell!"]="<hic>Lissen here, $r. Spend a day or two wrestlin' with wild trolls and then tell me how you smell!"
G["<more>"]="<mais>"
G["<sigh> It's always over too soon."]="<suspira> Sempre termina demais pronto."
G["<sigh> Seems like I've been at this forever..."]="<sigh> Seems like I've been at this forever..."
G["<sigh>...\n\nA little help here, perhaps?"]="<suspiro>...\n\nQue tal um pouco de ajuda?"
G["<sigh>... Do you think we could move out, $c?\n\nI'm losing fluid fast!"]="<sigh>... Do you think we could move out, $c?\n\nI'm losing fluid fast!"
G["<sigh>... This is the end of me."]="<suspiro>... Meu fim chegou."
G["<sigh>... Well, I suppose it could be worse."]="<suspiro>... Bom, imagino que poderá ser pior."
G["<sigh>...Let's get this over with."]="<suspiro>... Acabemos com isto de uma vez."
