G["A $c of your caliber is exactly what we need to turn the battle in our favor."]="$gUn: Uma; $c do seu categoria é exatamente o que precisamos de para obter vantagem na batalha."
G["A $c? Here? And a Horde no less.\n\nWe could make good use of you if you are willing to help.\n\nWe followed visions and dreams to get here only to find a nightmare waiting for us."]="A $c? Here? And a Horde no less.\n\nWe could make good use of you if you are willing to help.\n\nWe followed visions and dreams to get here only to find a nightmare waiting for us."
