G["A Bountiful Table is laid out with five Pilgrim's Bounty foods, one in front of each chair.\n\nWhile in a chair, you may eat as much of that food as you like, as well as pass servings of that food to the other chairs. Feast and share with friends!\n\nIf you eat enough of any one food, you'll gain benefits unique to that food.\n\nIn addition, if you eat enough of every food, you'll gain the Spirit of Sharing!"]="A Bountiful Table is laid out with five Pilgrim's Bounty foods, one in front of each chair.\n\nWhile in a chair, you may eat as much of that food as you like, as well as pass servings of that food to the other chairs. Feast and share with friends!\n\nIf you eat enough of any one food, you'll gain benefits unique to that food.\n\nIn addition, if you eat enough of every food, you'll gain the Spirit of Sharing!"
G["A Cooking trainer is it?  Well then, get yerself over to the Bronze Kettle on the northeastern side of The Great Forge.  Daryl Riknussun will teach ye to make a mighty fine dish that's sure to put the life back in ye!"]="Um treinador de culinária é? Bem, então, vá para a chaleira de bronze no lado nordeste da Grande Forja. Daryl Riknussun vai ensiná-o a fazer um prato fino e poderoso que certamente trará a vida de volta!"
G["A Corpse Spider stirs from its sleep in the webs above!"]="A Corpse Spider stirs from its sleep in the webs above!"
