G["A Draining Spirit is draining your soul. Hide from it to break the spell!"]="Um espírito drenador te está drenando o alma. Escóndete de ele para quebrar o feitiço!"
G["A Drakkari, one of the so-called Scarlet Onslaught, a gnome, a Hyldnir shield-maiden, and now you? Is this a joke?"]="A Drakkari, one of the so-called Scarlet Onslaught, a gnome, a Hyldnir shield-maiden, and now you? Is this a joke?"
