G["A Sulfuron ingot?!??! Impossible! I must have it! I must! I must!\n\n$R, I am authorized to make you a grand deal for that ingot. Perhaps you would be interested to know the secrets of the Hand of Ragnaros? Sulfuras, idiot! The legendary hammer of the Firelord."]="A Sulfuron ingot?!??! Impossible! I must have it! I must! I must!\n\n$R, I am authorized to make you a grand deal for that ingot. Perhaps you would be interested to know the secrets of the Hand of Ragnaros? Sulfuras, idiot! The legendary hammer of the Firelord."
