G["A Thunderbrew ale and a bit of Gremlock's cooking makes for a nice meal indeed.  Ye really should hit him up for some training if ye want to be a cook."]="Uma cerveja Thunderbrew e um pouco da culinária de Gremlock são uma boa refeição. Você mesmo deveria chamá-o para algum treinamento, se você quer ser um cozinheiro."
G["A Tonk is taking aim at you!"]="A Tonk is taking aim at you!"
G["A Town-In-A-Box. Are we not the greatest tinkers in the world?"]="A Town-In-A-Box. Are we not the greatest tinkers in the world?"
G["A Town-In-A-Box. Are we not the greatest tinkers in the world?\n\nNeed any training, my young protege?"]="A Town-In-A-Box. Are we not the greatest tinkers in the world?\n\nNeed any training, my young protege?"
G["A Town-In-A-Box. Nice!"]="Uma Cidade de Bolso. Bem!"
G["A Town-In-A-Box. Nice!\n\nNeed any training, $n?"]="Uma Cidade de Bolso. Bem!\n\nPrecisa treinamento, $n?"
G["A Twilight Zealot has evolved!"]="Um zelote Crepúsculo tem evolucionado!"
G["A Twilight's Hammer medallion? Guard!"]="Um medalhão do Martelo Crepúsculo? Guarda!"
G["A Vesperon Disciple appears in the Twilight!"]="Um discípulo de Vesperon aparecem no Crepúsculo!"
G["A Wanderbrew marrying a Goldendraft? I would be offended but there is a certain amusement to how offended old Peiji is going to be when he hears this.\n\nAt the least you seem to have made my boy happy. Thank you, $p."]="A Wanderbrew marrying a Goldendraft? I would be offended but there is a certain amusement to how offended old Peiji is going to be when he hears this.\n\nAt the least you seem to have made my boy happy. Thank you, $p."
G["A Wanderbrew wants to marry an Goldendraft?! Preposterous."]="A Wanderbrew wants to marry an Goldendraft?! Preposterous."
G["A Warbringer approaches! Fall back!"]="Se aproxima um belisario! Retirada!"
G["A Wild Prairie Chicken! Kick him out of here!"]="A Wild Prairie Chicken! Kick him out of here!"
G["A baby arakkoa must be the cutest thing ever!"]="A baby arakkoa must be the cutest thing ever!"
G["A banana in hand is worth than two in bush."]="Mais vale pássaro em mão que cento voando."
G["A bank?  Well, the closest bank around here is The Stormwind Counting House.  It's just up the road in Stormwind not far from the gates."]="Um banco? Bem, o banco mais próximo daqui é The Stormwind Counting House. É só subir a estrada em Stormwind, não muito longe dos portões."
G["A barrel of grog.  Pirates love this stuff."]="Um barril de grog. aos piratas lhes encantar."
G["A barrel of grog.  Pirates love this stuff.\n\nThe cork does not seem to fit too tightly in the bunghole."]="Um barril de grog. aos piratas lhes encantar.\n\nParece que o corcho não encaixa bem na boca do barril."
G["A barrel of gunpowder.  Highly explosive."]="Um barril de pólvora. Altamente explosivo."
G["A barrel of gunpowder.  There is a pitcher of water sitting nearby."]="Um barril de pólvora. Há um jarro de água sentado nas proximidades."
G["A battle?"]="Uma batalha?"
G["A beast emerged from you when I began the ritual. $p slew it!"]="A beast emerged from you when I began the ritual. $p slew it!"
G["A beautiful city, is it not? As was Gilneas, in its time.\n\nBut such things pass, as shall we.  Only the earth and her secrets will remain.\n\nAre you willing to learn, $n?"]="A beautiful city, is it not? As was Gilneas, in its time.\n\nBut such things pass, as shall we.  Only the earth and her secrets will remain.\n\nAre you willing to learn, $n?"
G["A beautiful creature has fallen."]="Uma bela criatura tombou."
G["A beautiful day, a beautiful Brew, and a beautiful fish, what more could you ask for?"]="Uma dia maravilhoso, uma cerveja maravilhosa e um peixe maravilhoso, que mais se você pode pedir?"
G["A being of great power has awoken."]="Um ser de infinito poder se tem despertado."
G["A bell cast from the makers' flesh, shaped by stars' fire, and bound by the breath of darkest shadow."]="Um sino forjado com a carne dos criadores, moldado pelo fogo das estrelas e vinculado ao sangue da terra."
G["A big convention, see? To show off all of our inventions. We'll call it GoblinCon. And we'll give away special pets! Except most people will probably sell them for profit on the auction house."]="A big convention, see? To show off all of our inventions. We'll call it GoblinCon. And we'll give away special pets! Except most people will probably sell them for profit on the auction house."
G["A big day, Firebeard. The Wildhammer united can never be stopped!"]="Um grande dia, Barbafuego. Os Martelo Feroz unidos mais serão vencidos!"
G["A big pandaren came and asked me to take you there."]="A big pandaren came and asked me to take you there."
G["A binary number system. It uses only two numbers. 6 and 11."]="A binary number system. It uses only two numbers. 6 and 11."
G["A bit cold out, don't you think?"]="Um pouco frio, você não acha?"
G["A bit ungrateful, aren't we?  The way out is clear, flee quickly!"]="Um pouco ingrato, não somos? A saída é clara, fuja rapidamente!"
G["A black dragon, through and through. Very well, I will give you my blessing, but also some advice:"]="Um dragão Negro de pés a cabeça. Muito bem, te darei meu bênção, mas também um conselho."
G["A blacksmith and his assistant can be found working in the Warrior's Terrace, near the armor and weapon vendors there."]="Um ferreiro e seu assistente podem ser encontrados trabalhando no Terraço do Guerreiro, perto dos vendedores de armaduras e armas de lá."
G["A blind dragon. Ridiculous!"]="Um dragão cego... É ridículo!"
G["A boat ride to the Badlands, please."]="A boat ride to the Badlands, please."
G["A bold move."]="Boa jugada."
G["A bold plan.  Let us hope we do not run into any surprises."]="É um plano audaz. Esperemos que não tenha nenhuma surpresa."
G["A book by a goblin on gnomish military victories... and all the pages are blank.  Figures."]="Um livro escrito por um goblin sobre vitórias militares dos gnomos... e todas as página estão em alvo. Típico."
G["A bountiful victory!"]="Uma vitória generosa!"
G["A bow is a great ting ma friend. Joo jus have to take care of it, and it will take care of joo."]="A bow is a great ting ma friend. Joo jus have to take care of it, and it will take care of joo."
G["A box that walks?  I should ask Hondo about this... nah, maybe later."]="Uma caixa que camina? Deveria comentário isto com Hondo... bah, não, talvez mais tarde."
G["A brew sure would be nice right now."]="Me viria de maravilha uma cerveja."
G["A brewery... my family... my ancestral home!"]="Uma cervejaria... meu família... meu lar ancestral!"
G["A budding herbalist are we?  Then you should visit with Firodren Mooncaller over in the Temple Gardens.  He may have some tricks of the trade to impart with you."]="Um herbapronta iniciante somos nós? Então você deve visitar o Firodren Mooncaller nos Jardins do Templo. Ele pode ter algum truques do ofício para compartilhar com você."
G["A budding village is a wonderful place to make a living!  So many goods needed, so many goods to be traded.  I think I could grow fat and happy here indeed!"]="Um aldeia incipiente é o lugar perfeito para viver! Há muita mercadoria, muita mercadoria com a que negociar. Acho que aqui seria feliz e engordaría!"
G["A bunch of thugs and thieves aren't going to get me to leave my land!"]="Uma panda de matones e ladrões não me vão a dar de meu terra!"
G["A butt?"]="Um culo?"
G["A challenge in compassion and humility. By helping Merchant Lorvo, it would seem you've passed, $c. Master Shang would be pleased."]="A challenge in compassion and humility. By helping Merchant Lorvo, it would seem you've passed, $c. Master Shang would be pleased."
G["A challenge to tamers, big and small! Can you battle my pets, and best them all?"]="Desafio a todos os domador, grandes ou pequenos! São capazes de vencer a todas meus ajudantes?"
G["A challenge!"]="Um desafio!"
G["A challenge, huh? Let's see what you've got."]="Um desafio? A ver de que é capaz."
G["A challenge?! Stand still so that I can blast your corpse all over the ground."]="A challenge?! Stand still so that I can blast your corpse all over the ground."
G["A challenger approaches."]="Se aproxima $gun: uma; contendiente."
G["A chance to catch my breath! Thank you."]="Uma oportunidade para recuperar o fôlego. Obrigado!"
G["A chest is revealed near the rear entrance!"]="Se vê um baú perto da entrada de por trás!"
G["A child has found a new toy! Crewman, take this infant's toy away!"]="Um ninho tem encontrado um brinquedo novo! Tripulante, lhévese o brinquedo deste ninho!"
G["A child of nature are we? Then you need look no further then the moonwell in the Park."]="Um filho da natureza somos nós? Então você não precisa procurar mais, então o poço da lua no parque."
G["A chill is in the air."]="Há frio."
G["A chill just went up my spine!"]="Senti um arrepio na espinha!"
G["A chilly gust encircles the taunka mill, carrying with it soft, resentful mutterings in Kalimag."]="A chilly gust encircles the taunka mill, carrying with it soft, resentful mutterings in Kalimag."
G["A class trainer"]="Um treinador de classe"
G["A clean weapon is a sign of one that has never seen combat."]="A clean weapon is a sign of one that has never seen combat."
G["A clean yak is a lucky yak. A dirty yak is a yeti attack."]="A clean yak is a lucky yak. A dirty yak is a yeti attack."
G["A clear voice rises from within the stone...\n\nWhere is your Medallion of Station, little one?  You may not speak with a Duke without proof of title..."]="A clear voice rises from within the stone...\n\nWhere is your Medallion of Station, little one?  You may not speak with a Duke without proof of title..."
G["A clear voice rises from within the stone...\n\nYou come to us with title and so we will listen, but do not try our patience, $c.  The council has no time for idle gossip from one such as you."]="A clear voice rises from within the stone...\n\nYou come to us with title and so we will listen, but do not try our patience, $c.  The council has no time for idle gossip from one such as you."
G["A cloud of saronite vapors coalesces nearby!"]="Perto se forma uma nuvem de vapores de saronita!"
G["A commission from King Wrynn is always an honor. I'll get to work on it right away."]="A commission from King Wrynn is always an honor. I'll get to work on it right away."
G["A complete waste!"]="A complete waste!"
G["A conducting crystal overloads!"]="A conducting crystal overloads!"
G["A cool breeze caresses your face. Gentle, melodic humming resonates throughout the chamber."]="Uma brisa fresca acaricia seu rosto. Um murmulho agradável e melódico ressoa na salão."
G["A corruption taints our sacred forest."]="Uma fedor invade nosso florestas sagrado."
G["A cow woman who claims to be a druid has set up camp within Silvermoon. She's no doubt grazing on our planters as we speak."]="Uma mulher vaca que afirma ser um druida montou acampamento em Silvermoon. Ela está sem dúvida pastando nos nossos plantadores enquanto falamos."
G["A crack begins to open beneath your feet."]="A crack begins to open beneath your feet."
G["A crawler mine detonated on $n!"]="A crawler mine detonated on $n!"
G["A creature emerges from the shadows!"]="Uma criatura emerge das sombras!"
G["A cunning $c, a proud $r.  We are pleased to present $n to you."]="A cunning $c, a proud $r.  We are pleased to present $n to you."
G["A curse upon your kind, trespasser!"]="Maldigo ao seu espécie, intruso!"
G["A cursory examination of the skeletal remains indicates that the flesh was seared off. Quite a grisly sight."]="Um exame superficial dos restos esqueléticos indica que a carne foi queimada. Uma visão horrível."
G["A dangerous device this is, $n.  I am glad you brought it to my attention."]="É um item perigoso, $n. fico feliz em que me o tenha trazido."
G["A dark force from within the Dragon Soul reacts violently to the cleansing!"]="A dark force from within the Dragon Soul reacts violently to the cleansing!"
G["A dark force grips Stonetalon Peak."]="Uma força sombria agarra o pico Stonetalon."
G["A dark power seeks to use you, Medivh!  If you stay, dire days will follow.  You must hurry, we don't have much time!"]="A dark power seeks to use you, Medivh!  If you stay, dire days will follow.  You must hurry, we don't have much time!"
G["A dark time for all."]="Tempos obscuros para todos."
G["A darkness had fallen over my eyes, but you tore me from my unholy reverie.  You saved me, $n.\n\nAnd now I beg you... to forgive me."]="A darkness had fallen over my eyes, but you tore me from my unholy reverie.  You saved me, $n.\n\nAnd now I beg you... to forgive me."
G["A day of celebration and of mourning, hero..."]="Um dia de celebração e lamento, $ghéroe: heroína;."
G["A deadly wave of ice begins to sweep across the room!"]="Uma onda letal de gelo recorre a salão!"
G["A decade ago, a great battle took place here on the summit of Mount Hyjal. Archimonde the Defiler commanded a swarm of demons to march upon the World Tree and claim its power for his own.\n\nHis defeat signaled the end of the Legion's invasion of Azeroth... But many of his corrupted supporters remained behind."]="A decade ago, a great battle took place here on the summit of Mount Hyjal. Archimonde the Defiler commanded a swarm of demons to march upon the World Tree and claim its power for his own.\n\nHis defeat signaled the end of the Legion's invasion of Azeroth... But many of his corrupted supporters remained behind."
G["A decision must be made!"]="É preciso pegar uma decisão!"
G["A deep, bone chilling voice echoes from the %s..."]="Uma voz tenebrosa e profunda surge de %s..."
G["A defender has fallen!"]="Tem caído um defensor!"
G["A deft maneuver, outlander."]="Uma manobra ágil, $gforasteiro:forasteira;."
G["A deserved death!"]="Uma morte merecida."
G["A diary with yellowing pages lies open to the last entry:\n\n\"I don't know what's going to happen now that Harold's turned.  It took everything out of me to drag him into the only place I could find that'd lock him up tight and hold him.  I hid the key on me, and I pray it works...\n\nI hope I can get out of here, but I need money to do that.  Our stuff's all in the cabinet I think... and now that I think about it, doesn't Harold keep the key on him?\n\nI'll rest on it, I'm dead tired now.\""]="A diary with yellowing pages lies open to the last entry:\n\n\"I don't know what's going to happen now that Harold's turned.  It took everything out of me to drag him into the only place I could find that'd lock him up tight and hold him.  I hid the key on me, and I pray it works...\n\nI hope I can get out of here, but I need money to do that.  Our stuff's all in the cabinet I think... and now that I think about it, doesn't Harold keep the key on him?\n\nI'll rest on it, I'm dead tired now.\""
G["A diligent farmer never loses hope when her crop's in danger."]="Um fazendeiro diligente nunca perde a esperança quando a colheita está em perigo."
G["A disco ball?! Groovy!"]="Uma bola de discoteca? Mooola!"
G["A discovery!  I need aid with these measurements... I'll send a signal to my colleague!"]="A discovery!  I need aid with these measurements... I'll send a signal to my colleague!"
G["A dishonorable scheme."]="Uma estratagema deshonrosa."
G["A divided Azeroth cannot possibly stand against the darkness."]="Uma Azeroth DIVIDIDA não poderá de forma alguma resistir às trevas."
G["A dozen will fall before I am slain!"]="A dozen will fall before I am slain!"
G["A dragon? Hah! Don't be ridiculous.\n\nYou know $r, you're awfully rude. She's standing right here!"]="A dragon? Hah! Don't be ridiculous.\n\nYou know $r, you're awfully rude. She's standing right here!"
G["A drake swoops down to drop a Twilight Sapper onto the deck!"]="A drake swoops down to drop a Twilight Sapper onto the deck!"
G["A drink for friend Sarok and another for myself."]="Um trago para o amigo Sarok e outro para mim."
G["A druid! How curious... I wonder how it got in there."]="Um druida! Que curioso... me pergunto como haverá chegado aqui."
G["A drunk orc is  a sight to see.  An army of drunk orcs is a sight I wish to never see again."]="Um orco bêbado é uma visão para ver. Um exército de orcs bêbados é uma visão que desejo nunca mais ver."
G["A faction standard-bearer, beloved by the people and feared by their foes."]="Um porta-estandarte de sua facção, amado pelo povo e temido pelos inimigos."
G["A faint whisper is heard from within the stone...\n\nGreetings, little one.  Do you have news for the Templar?"]="A faint whisper is heard from within the stone...\n\nGreetings, little one.  Do you have news for the Templar?"
G["A fair question.\n\nOne might check the perimeter of the hot springs.  Or one might look for signal fires up in the cliffs to the west.  Finally, the path to Silithus, far to the north, is often wrought with danger.\n\nThose would be the places I'd check."]="A fair question.\n\nOne might check the perimeter of the hot springs.  Or one might look for signal fires up in the cliffs to the west.  Finally, the path to Silithus, far to the north, is often wrought with danger.\n\nThose would be the places I'd check."
G["A falcon's talon is only as useful as the grace of his flight."]="As garras de um falcão são valiosas, mas não tanto como a graça do seu voo."
G["A far better blacksmith than I am, that's for sure. Though I'll deny it if you tell anyone I said that. You should go speak with Therum Deepforge. If anyone can teach you more, it's him."]="Um ferreiro muito melhor do que eu, com certeza. Embora eu negue se você contar a alguém que eu disse isso. Você deve falar com o Therum Deepforge. Se alguém pode lhe ensinar mais, é ele."
G["A fast learner is what ye are, and a good smith to boot. I would sign off on yer work any day of the week. But I sense ye still have some learnin in ye. Go talk to Bengus Deepforge, he's a hard taskmaster but he's also one of the best."]="Você é um aprendiz rápido e você é um bom ferreiro. Gostaria de assinar seu trabalho em qualquer dia da semana. Mas sinto que você ainda tem algum aprendizado em você. Vá conversar com o Bengus Deepforge, ele é um mestre difícil, mas também é um dos melhores."
G["A feast fit for royalty!"]="Um banquete digno de um rei!"
G["A fellow angler I see!  I have a variety of gear from these local fisherman, just let me know what you need!"]="A fellow angler I see!  I have a variety of gear from these local fisherman, just let me know what you need!"
G["A fellow enthusiast, huh? Well, you just wait, we'll make a gearhead out of you in no time!"]="A fellow enthusiast, huh? Well, you just wait, we'll make a gearhead out of you in no time!"
G["A fellowship of kindred spirits can be a powerful force.  Krumn will help you to achieve this.  You will find him at the Thunder Bluff Civic Information center on the lower rise next to the lifts."]="Uma comunhão de espíritos afins pode ser uma força poderosa. O Krumn o ajudará a conseguir isso. Você o encontrará no centro de informações cívicas Thunder Bluff, na subida mais próxima aos elevadores."
G["A few burns are nothing to the Fel Horde!"]="A few burns are nothing to the Fel Horde!"
G["A few days past, I saw a bolt of dark energy crackling through the ground from my tower vigil. It came from the west, fracturing the wall, and very nearly breaking through it entirely.\n\nYou can still see the scars it left. It ruined these farmers' land.\n\nThe mantid scouts followed shortly after. Whether they've had this attack planned or they're just capitalizing on an opportunity, I couldn't say. Maybe they're running away from whatever caused the crack in the first place."]="A few days past, I saw a bolt of dark energy crackling through the ground from my tower vigil. It came from the west, fracturing the wall, and very nearly breaking through it entirely.\n\nYou can still see the scars it left. It ruined these farmers' land.\n\nThe mantid scouts followed shortly after. Whether they've had this attack planned or they're just capitalizing on an opportunity, I couldn't say. Maybe they're running away from whatever caused the crack in the first place."
G["A few monkeys are no match for the Alliance!"]="Uns quantos macacos não são nada para a Aliança!"
G["A few nights back some guy threw a ball and told me to fetch. In response, I did the same, but with his head.  Needless to say, he didn't have a witty comeback."]="A few nights back some guy threw a ball and told me to fetch. In response, I did the same, but with his head.  Needless to say, he didn't have a witty comeback."
G["A few of our tribe have harnessed the power of thunder.  We use it to defend ourselves against invaders, whether human, orc, or dinosaur.\n\nOur thunder stuns all dinosaurs, you know."]="A few of our tribe have harnessed the power of thunder.  We use it to defend ourselves against invaders, whether human, orc, or dinosaur.\n\nOur thunder stuns all dinosaurs, you know."
G["A few of us here have lived in this land since the Scythe of Elune first passed through it. Most suffered through the fall of Gilneas.\n\nWe have settled in this forest to learn the ways of nature and uphold its balance. In this cursed land, our cursed people have found a new way of life."]="A few of us here have lived in this land since the Scythe of Elune first passed through it. Most suffered through the fall of Gilneas.\n\nWe have settled in this forest to learn the ways of nature and uphold its balance. In this cursed land, our cursed people have found a new way of life."
G["A fierce wind is coming - I can tell by the ache in my exposed knee.  I just hope we don't get caught up in it."]="Um vento forte está chegando - eu posso perceber pela dor no meu joelho exposto. Só espero que não fiquemos envolvidos nisso."
G["A final vision! Ancestors... could those be... our children? This was his deepest desire... to be a father?"]="Uma última visão! Ancestrais... Acaso são... nossos filhos? Esse era seu desejo mais profundo?... ser pai?"
G["A final warning, mortal; Fail, and you shall fall by my hand!"]="Uma última advertência, mortal. Se falhas, serei eu mesmo o que te mate."
G["A fine display of worthiness. Your instruction may now continue."]="Uma bela exibição de dignidade. Sua instrução pode agora seguir."
G["A fine example of a $g man:woman;, that $n."]="$n é um claro exemplo de humanidade."
G["A fine meal you will make..."]="Será uma boa comida..."
G["A fine offer, Floyd. I wish to make Hellfire Peninsula my home."]="Uma oferta excelente, Floyd. Desejo que a Península Fogo do Inferno seja meu lar."
G["A fine trophy your head will make, $R."]="A fine trophy your head will make, $R."
G["A fine vintage in celebration of our salvation!"]="A fine vintage in celebration of our salvation!"
G["A fish?  For me?  It's adorable."]="Um peixe? Para mim? É adorável."
G["A fissure?"]="Uma fissura?"
G["A fittin' end for so foul a troll. Bwonsamdi; you have my tanks, and dat of all de Darkspear. We will continue to honor you, as is proper."]="A fittin' end for so foul a troll. Bwonsamdi; you have my tanks, and dat of all de Darkspear. We will continue to honor you, as is proper."
G["A fitting end for a traitor. Come, we must free the slaves and see what is within the Lich King's chamber for ourselves."]="Um fim próprio para um traidor. Vamos, devemos liberar aos escravos e ver que há na instância do Rei Lich."
G["A fitting end for a traitor..."]="A fitting end for a traitor..."
G["A fitting meal for my children."]="Uma comida adequada para meus filhos."
G["A fitting punishment."]="A fitting punishment."
G["A flame druid... she is dangerous, Malfurion. You know her?"]="Uma druida da Chama... é perigosa, Malfurion. A conhece?"
G["A flaming vortex takes shape."]="A flaming vortex takes shape."
G["A flare has been spotted. The Boom Boom Brew Defender can now be fired."]="A flare has been spotted. The Boom Boom Brew Defender can now be fired."
G["A flickering image of a female blood elf commander appears. From the surroundings, you can tell she must be inside Tempest Keep."]="A flickering image of a female blood elf commander appears. From the surroundings, you can tell she must be inside Tempest Keep."
G["A follower of the arcane are you?  Hmph!  Very well then... you can find them around the Pools of Vision underneath the Spirit Rise."]="Você é um seguidor do arcano? Hmph! Muito bem, então... você pode encontrá-os ao redor dos Poços de Visão sob a Ascensão Espiritual."
G["A fool who is about to end you, necrolord. There will be nothing left of you for the Lich King to reanimate!"]="Um insensato que está a ponto de acabar com você, necrolorde. Não quedará nada de ti que o Rei Lich possa anima!"
G["A foregone conclusion."]="Uma conclusão inevitável."
G["A foreigner. $G He : She; looks very exotic. Don't stare!"]="A foreigner. $G He : She; looks very exotic. Don't stare!"
G["A foreigner? And by the look of you, a seasoned $c. Good! Maybe you can get us out of this mess."]="A foreigner? And by the look of you, a seasoned $c. Good! Maybe you can get us out of this mess."
G["A former student of mine by the name of Krixix spent a lifetime attempting to make contact with the chained Gods of the underworld. He pursued that which would spring up from the ravaged earth... That which would form only as a result of the elements clashing in titanic conflict.\n\nElementium as it would be known to mortals.\n\nOne day, nearly a decade ago, Krixix's pursuit lead to a fissure forming in this very gorge."]="A former student of mine by the name of Krixix spent a lifetime attempting to make contact with the chained Gods of the underworld. He pursued that which would spring up from the ravaged earth... That which would form only as a result of the elements clashing in titanic conflict.\n\nElementium as it would be known to mortals.\n\nOne day, nearly a decade ago, Krixix's pursuit lead to a fissure forming in this very gorge."
G["A fortunate attack!"]="Um ataque de sorte!"
G["A foul corruption has crept into Westfall. While I was upholding my duty on the battlefields of Lordaeron these honest farms were overrun and made into hide-outs for thugs and murderers. The People's Militia needs your help."]="A foul corruption has crept into Westfall. While I was upholding my duty on the battlefields of Lordaeron these honest farms were overrun and made into hide-outs for thugs and murderers. The People's Militia needs your help."
G["A foul trogg if ever I saw one.  Die!"]="$gUn: Uma; trogg repugnante onde $glos: as; tenha. Morre!"
G["A foul wind blows from the East, $c."]="A foul wind blows from the East, $c."
G["A fresh glass of bubbly. Just what the doctor ordered, $n."]="A fresh glass of bubbly. Just what the doctor ordered, $n."
G["A friend and I have come to rescue a young human woman from the clutches of the Legionlord, Kil'jaeden and his vile minions.\n\nWe've discovered that Kael'thas is trying to summon Kil'jaeden from the depths of the Sunwell itself.\n\nFor the sake of this world - this cannot come to pass! I am committed to seeing that it does not."]="A friend and I have come to rescue a young human woman from the clutches of the Legionlord, Kil'jaeden and his vile minions.\n\nWe've discovered that Kael'thas is trying to summon Kil'jaeden from the depths of the Sunwell itself.\n\nFor the sake of this world - this cannot come to pass! I am committed to seeing that it does not."
G["A friend of the Zandalrian! You have ventured deep into the lair of the Blood God, $c. You will do well to listen to what I have to say.\n\nMany thousands of years ago, while the indigenous trolls of the Zul'Aman empire were battling the invading high elf heathens, great magic was stolen from Zanza. This magic was used by the high elves to enchant their weapons and armor to assist in conquering the trolls of the region."]="A friend of the Zandalrian! You have ventured deep into the lair of the Blood God, $c. You will do well to listen to what I have to say.\n\nMany thousands of years ago, while the indigenous trolls of the Zul'Aman empire were battling the invading high elf heathens, great magic was stolen from Zanza. This magic was used by the high elves to enchant their weapons and armor to assist in conquering the trolls of the region."
G["A friendly face is welcome around here. Happen to bring some rations?"]="Se agradece ver uma rosto conhecida. Traz algo de comida?"
G["A furbolg named Tur Ragepaw.  Not one of ours.\n\nThis one came from the southern lands.  He was of the Timbermaw tribe.\n\nHe wanted to see Ursoc.  He seemed to think that Vordrassil's taint could be purified and used to save my father.\n\nIt is foolish to entertain such hopes.  You will agree when you see the darkness that has afflicted him like I have."]="A furbolg named Tur Ragepaw.  Not one of ours.\n\nThis one came from the southern lands.  He was of the Timbermaw tribe.\n\nHe wanted to see Ursoc.  He seemed to think that Vordrassil's taint could be purified and used to save my father.\n\nIt is foolish to entertain such hopes.  You will agree when you see the darkness that has afflicted him like I have."
G["A furious Orchard Needler appears above you!"]="A furious Orchard Needler appears above you!"
G["A giant worm-like creature just erupted from the earth near Hive'Ashi!"]="Uma criatura enorme tipo me ver acaba de sair da terra perto de Colme'ashi!"
G["A gift for little old Gina? You are so sweet."]="Um presente para a boa de Gina? Que querida."
G["A girl does get hungry after hunting down all those enemies. Thank you."]="A uma garota lhe entrar fome atrás matar a todos esses inimigos. Obrigado."
G["A girl in my line of work gets hungry, you know? I wish I had something delicious to eat."]="A uma garota que trabalha como eu se lhe acorde muita fome, sabe? Tomara tivesse algo delicioso para comer."
G["A glass cannon sometimes breaks before it can fire."]="Um canhão de vidro às vezes quebra antes de disparar."
G["A globe that shows the inside of the planet... on the outside. So you know where to dig!"]="Um globo que mostrao interior do planeta... no exterior. Assim saberá onde cavar!"
G["A gloom shrouds our lands, young $c.  Will you take up arms to face this flying death?"]="A gloom shrouds our lands, young $c.  Will you take up arms to face this flying death?"
G["A glorious kill!"]="Uma morte gloriosa!"
G["A glorious victory!"]="Uma vitória gloriosa!"
G["A gnome tries to make some friends, and then BAMM... the next thing you know, he's in shackles!"]="A gnome tries to make some friends, and then BAMM... the next thing you know, he's in shackles!"
G["A gnome? How pathetic. Face me, demon!"]="Um gnomo? Que patético. Enfrente a mim, demônio!"
G["A goblin? I must be seeing things. Throm-Ka and thank you, little one!"]="Um duende? Eu devo estar vendo coisas. Throm-Ka e Obrigado, pequenina!"
G["A goblin? I must be seeing things. Throm-Ka and thank you, little one."]="Um goblin? Devo de estar tendo visões. Throm-Ka e Obrigado, $gpequeno: pequena;."
G["A golden placard along the side of the shrine reads:\n\n\"Here stands the Shrine of Dath'Remar, a fitting tribute to the most noble of elves.  Let all who gaze on this monument remember his sacrifices to bring us to this land.  All who prosper in Quel'Thalas do so thanks to him.\""]="A golden placard along the side of the shrine reads:\n\n\"Here stands the Shrine of Dath'Remar, a fitting tribute to the most noble of elves.  Let all who gaze on this monument remember his sacrifices to bring us to this land.  All who prosper in Quel'Thalas do so thanks to him.\""
G["A good battle always makes my adrenaline rush."]="Uma boa batalha da um subidón de adrenalina."
G["A good bout in the arena will keep you strong for future trials."]="Uma boa liza na arena te fortalecerá para o futuro."
G["A good brew, is a strong brew."]="Uma boa bebida, é uma bebida forte."
G["A good club can make all the difference in the world."]="Um bom clube pode fazer toda a diferença no mundo."
G["A good day... to die."]="Um bom dia... para morrer."
G["A good dream brew is VERY powerful. It will require a focused mind to gain any kind of clarity from the visions!"]="Um bom mistura de ensuenho é MUITO poderoso. Precisa de uma mente centrada para obter claridade nas visões."
G["A good first test may be dealin' with dese cultists.  Da people be scared.  Dey aren't sure what's goin'on."]="Uma boa prova seria que te encargaras do' cultistas. A gente tem medo. Não sabem que eh'tá passando."
G["A good grummle is a busy grummle!"]="O bom grúmel é o grúmel ocupado!"
G["A good hammer in yer hands makes the world feel safer. Like ye can face even the mightiest of foes with a large hunk of solid metal gripped in yer fists."]="A good hammer in yer hands makes the world feel safer. Like ye can face even the mightiest of foes with a large hunk of solid metal gripped in yer fists."
G["A good start. Return, disciple."]="Um bom início. Volta, discípulo."
G["A grand master jewelcrafter, Hamanar, may be found in northern Aldor Rise."]="Um grande mestre joalheiro, Hamanar, pode ser encontrado no norte de Aldor Rise."
G["A grand sacrifice by a noble soul..."]="Um grande sacrifício para uma alma noble..."
G["A great blight lies across our land! It grows every day. Our need for magic weakens us, and will bring us to destruction, just as it has before!"]="A great blight lies across our land! It grows every day. Our need for magic weakens us, and will bring us to destruction, just as it has before!"
G["A great darkness? Could he mean that we must trust these strangers... these... Alliance... after all?"]="Uma escuridão... Poderá estar dizendo que devemos confiar nesses forasteiros? Em... a Aliança?"
G["A great evil stirs, $r. Can you feel it?\n\nBah! Of course you cannot. Hand me your armor and weapons and I shall renew their vigor."]="A great evil stirs, $r. Can you feel it?\n\nBah! Of course you cannot. Hand me your armor and weapons and I shall renew their vigor."
G["A green dragon in mortal guise! I never thought I would receive the honor of..."]="A green dragon in mortal guise! I never thought I would receive the honor of..."
G["A grinning face from ear to ear..."]="A grinning face from ear to ear..."
G["A grummle can carry five times their own weight. They never sweat. They have an outstanding sense of smell."]="Um grômulo pode carregar até 5 vezes o seu próprio peso. Eles nunca suam. Eles têm um olfato impressionante."
G["A ha a ha a ha uh- uh! A ha a ha yeah yeah yeah yeah!\n\nDo you like my song?"]="A ja ja uh-uh! A ja ja sim sim sim!\n\nTe gosta meu canto?"
G["A hail of death approaches! Bring them to their fate!"]="A hail of death approaches! Bring them to their fate!"
G["A happy Winter Veil to you, $c!"]="Feliz Festival do Inverno, $c!"
G["A happy Winter Veil to you, friend!"]="Um feliz véu de inverno para você, amigo!"
G["A harbinger of death is reborn..."]="Um presagista da morte voltou a nascer..."
G["A healthy one! My Lady will be mosst pleased..."]="A healthy one! My Lady will be mosst pleased..."
G["A hidden blade up the sleeve can mean the difference between you laying dead in the alley, and your opponent laying face down in his own blood."]="A hidden blade up the sleeve can mean the difference between you laying dead in the alley, and your opponent laying face down in his own blood."
G["A hidden hollow? How very interesting. You've served your purpose, Landgren, but I'm afraid there'll be no resurrection for you this time!"]="Uma caverna oculta? Que interessante. Landgren, tem concluído seu propósito, mas me temo que esta vez não haverá ressurreição para você!"
G["A high pitch humming noise emanates in the distance..."]="A high pitch humming noise emanates in the distance..."
G["A historian's work is never done, you see. There's always something important happening that we will need to remember.\n\nI'm beginning to collect the history of your people's coming here. What is your name, so that future generations may read your story and know your tale?"]="A historian's work is never done, you see. There's always something important happening that we will need to remember.\n\nI'm beginning to collect the history of your people's coming here. What is your name, so that future generations may read your story and know your tale?"
G["A historian's work is never done, you see. There's always something important happening that we will need to remember.\n\nI've written much of your legacy already, but there is still so much to learn! Surely your feats will be remembered for ages to come."]="A historian's work is never done, you see. There's always something important happening that we will need to remember.\n\nI've written much of your legacy already, but there is still so much to learn! Surely your feats will be remembered for ages to come."
G["A hoe is an honest $Gman's:woman's; weapon."]="Uma azada é o arma de $gun homem honesto: uma mulher honesta;."
G["A hozen bandit is stealing the brew! Stop him!"]="Um bandido hozen se levou mistura! A por ele!"
G["A hundred crates of barley there ta' be makin' inta' mead!"]="A hundred crates of barley there ta' be makin' inta' mead!"
G["A hunter hunts. An artist... arts.\n\nI am here to capture the ferocity of the hunt through my art.\n\nWe are in strange lands, and few in the known world are familiar with the strange creatures of our hunt.\n\nThrough my art, I prove your success, and the success of the Nesingwarys."]="A hunter hunts. An artist... arts.\n\nI am here to capture the ferocity of the hunt through my art.\n\nWe are in strange lands, and few in the known world are familiar with the strange creatures of our hunt.\n\nThrough my art, I prove your success, and the success of the Nesingwarys."
G["A just punishment!"]="Um castigo logo!"
G["A kaldorei assassin evades $n's gaze and slips into the shadows."]="Um assassino Kaldorei evita a olhar de $n e se escabulhe entre as sombras."
G["A kaldorei assassin leaps from the shadows and attacks $n!"]="Um assassino kaldorei surge das sombras e ataca a $n!"
G["A keg is returned! My humble thanks..."]="Tem recuperei um barril! Meu mais humilde agradecimento..."
G["A kiss would be most appreciated."]="Um beijo estaria muito bem."
G["A large device of unknown origin hums in front of you. Several words are scratched into the side:\n|TInterface\\Icons\\inv_gizmo_02:20|t |cFFDD2222[Goblin-Titan control module]|r\nIt appears to be protected by a voice-recognition module."]="A large device of unknown origin hums in front of you. Several words are scratched into the side:\n|TInterface\\Icons\\inv_gizmo_02:20|t |cFFDD2222[Goblin-Titan control module]|r\nIt appears to be protected by a voice-recognition module."
G["A large humanoid hand print is embedded on the surface of the orb. A soft green glow seems to pulse within."]="A large humanoid hand print is embedded on the surface of the orb. A soft green glow seems to pulse within."
G["A large humanoid hand print is embedded on the surface of the orb. Despite what appears to be constant manipulation and handling, the orb remains unmarred."]="Uma impressão humanóide grande à mão está embutida na superfície da esfera. Apesar do que parece ser constante manipulação e manuseio, o orbe permanece inalterado."
G["A large wave of fliers approaches! Take my cannon, $c, quickly!"]="A large wave of fliers approaches! Take my cannon, $c, quickly!"
G["A legend is born!"]="Tem nascido uma lendas!"
G["A list... how intriguing.  Ah yes, the shipment of fireworks for Lord Saltheril.  He hasn't paid for them; are you here to purchase them on his behalf, $c?"]="A list... how intriguing.  Ah yes, the shipment of fireworks for Lord Saltheril.  He hasn't paid for them; are you here to purchase them on his behalf, $c?"
G["A little busy here, $c.  What d'ye want?"]="Estou um pouco ocupado, $c. Que que?"
G["A little deeper now - almost got it...."]="Um pouco mais profundo. Já quase o tenho..."
G["A little help here first, $c?"]="Ajude-me aqui primeiro, $c?"
G["A little help here..."]="Uma ajudinha..."
G["A little help here?"]="A little help here?"
G["A little help here? Or do you need more training, $n?\n\nI'm kinda busy at the moment if you hadn't noticed."]="Um pouco de ajuda aqui? OU é O que precisa mais treinamento, $n?\n\nPor se não você dados conta, estou bastante ocupado agora mesmo."
G["A little help over here! Somethin' is wrapped around the propeller!"]="Que alguém me eche uma mão! Se tem enredado algo na hélice!"
G["A little help?"]="A little help?"
G["A little ice ought to quench the fire in your hearts..."]="A little ice ought to quench the fire in your hearts..."
G["A little left now - no, no, right...."]="Um pouco mais à esquerda, não, não, direita..."
G["A little more jade - the jade you helped to acquire - and it will be finished."]="Um pouco mais de jade, o jade que você tem ajudado a encontrar, e estará terminada."
G["A little paint and it'll be fine!"]="A little paint and it'll be fine!"
G["A little rain never hurt anybody... yet."]="Um pouco de chuva nunca fez dano a ninguém... ainda."
G["A little ritual torture can go a long way."]="Um pequeno ritual de tortura pode dar muito de si."
G["A little torture, a pinch of magic, and an ample helping of invasive surgery. She was conscious, of course."]="A little torture, a pinch of magic, and an ample helping of invasive surgery. She was conscious, of course."
G["A little."]="A little."
G["A lively spirit for the taking..."]="Um espírito forte para a colheita..."
G["A living $r... soon to be a dead like me."]="$gUn: Uma; $r... vivo será pronto um morto como eu."
G["A living legend..."]="Uma lenda viva..."
G["A lone orc against the might of the Alliance???"]="Um somente orc contra o poder da Aliança???"
G["A long day in the fields makes a man thirsty, you know what I mean, good friend?"]="Um largo dia no campo da muita sede... sabe aonde quero ir a aparar, meu $gbuen amigo: boa amiga;?"
G["A long journey is best traveled one step at a time."]="O melhor é recorrer os largos viagens passo a passo."
G["A long time ago, during my travels, I met a man that told me, \"Master using it and you can have this.\"\n\nWhat do you suppose that means? I didn't know then, and I still don't now, really..."]="A long time ago, during my travels, I met a man that told me, \"Master using it and you can have this.\"\n\nWhat do you suppose that means? I didn't know then, and I still don't now, really..."
G["A long time ago, this land was beset by the shadows of doubt, of fear, and hatred."]="Há muito tempo, esta terra foi assolada pelas sombras da dúvida, do medo e do ódio."
G["A lot of the Tillers came here to watch the fights. Nothing like a good brawl and a cold brew!"]="A lot of the Tillers came here to watch the fights. Nothing like a good brawl and a cold brew!"
G["A lot of work goes into training and caring for our animals, but it's all worth it.\n\nI could always use a bit of extra help, though."]="A lot of work goes into training and caring for our animals, but it's all worth it.\n\nI could always use a bit of extra help, though."
G["A lot you know...\n\nSome say they're just observing, some think they're altering our sea-life, and then others think they're here to take over Azeroth!\n\nOnce I take one down with my rocket propelled warheads I'll get the answers. You can believe that!"]="A lot you know...\n\nSome say they're just observing, some think they're altering our sea-life, and then others think they're here to take over Azeroth!\n\nOnce I take one down with my rocket propelled warheads I'll get the answers. You can believe that!"
G["A loud chime sounds as the defense wards detect intruders, alerting the sentries."]="A loud chime sounds as the defense wards detect intruders, alerting the sentries."
G["A low, despairing moan escapes the caged dwarf."]="O anão enjaulado de escapar um grave gemido de desesperação."
G["A lowly worm, I'm sure."]="Um humilde me ver, certo."
G["A luckydo would be wise to buy my wares. Bad fortune to those who simply walk away."]="Um grisgrís faria bem em comprar meus mercadorias. Mal sorte se não o faz."
G["A luckydo would be wise to throw kegs about now."]="A luckydo would be wise to throw kegs about now."
G["A mage... you seek to learn the magic of portals, yes?"]="Um mago... você procura aprender a magia dos portais, sim?"
G["A mailbox?  You have a letter to send, or perhaps have received one?  I hope it's something good!  There's a mailbox right outside of the Bank in the center of Darnassus."]="Uma caixa de correio? Você tem uma carta para enviar, ou talvez tenha recebido uma? Espero que seja algo de bom! Há uma caixa de correio do lado de fosse do banco, no centro de Darnassus."
G["A mailbox? Well is that not the salt on the wounds! Twenty years cut-off from the world and now a mailbox! WONDERFUL!"]="A mailbox? Well is that not the salt on the wounds! Twenty years cut-off from the world and now a mailbox! WONDERFUL!"
G["A major victory, to be sure. We turn our attention now to our Gilnean homeland - ravaged by disease. Wrynn has pledged his help rebuilding my kingdom, but it is difficult to know where to begin."]="Uma grande vitória, sem dúvida. Agora nos centraremos em nossa Guilnéas natal, asolada pela doença. Wrynn tem prometido ajudar a reconstruir meu reino, mas não é fácil saber por onde começar."
G["A man can only live with himself and his shame for so long, $c, before he must take action to undo the mistakes he's made."]="Um homem somente pode viver consigo e seu vergonha durante tanto tempo, $c, antes de que tenha que actuar para deshacer os erros que tem cometido."
G["A man must honor his family."]="Um homem deve honrar ao seu família."
G["A mantid bomb?! Are you sure that won't bring down the whole cavern?"]="A mantid bomb?! Are you sure that won't bring down the whole cavern?"
G["A mantid tried to follow me here.\n\nIt didn't end well for him."]="A mantid tried to follow me here.\n\nIt didn't end well for him."
G["A map of Darkshore.  I saw this place shortly before I arrived in Rut'theran Village."]="Um mapa da Costa Sombria. Vi este lugar logo antes de chegar à Aldeia Rut'theran."
G["A massive attack with every able-bodied man would end in needless slaughter. Every soldier lost would rise as the enemy. Azeroth would be left defenseless against the undead threat."]="A massive attack with every able-bodied man would end in needless slaughter. Every soldier lost would rise as the enemy. Azeroth would be left defenseless against the undead threat."
G["A massive demonic portal opens nearby!"]="Um portal demoníaco enorme se abra perto!"
G["A master of defense, the Illusionary Guardian deflects all attacks from the front. Stay behind it."]="A master of defense, the Illusionary Guardian deflects all attacks from the front. Stay behind it."
G["A masterpiece! Feed it to the troll, Hordum. He'll answer any question truthfully...."]="A masterpiece! Feed it to the troll, Hordum. He'll answer any question truthfully...."
G["A medic's work is never done."]="O trabalho de um médico não se acaba nunca."
G["A member of the priesthood whom I've never seen before."]="Um membro do sacerdócio ao que mais havia visto antes."
G["A merciful kill!"]="Uma morte misericordiosa!"
G["A mere $C challenges me?  Prepare for the afterlife!"]="Acaso me está desafiando $gun: uma; simples $c? Prepare-se para o além!"
G["A mere blip in the eyes of the Makers."]="Uma fagulha fugaz nos olhos dos Criadores."
G["A mere nuisance, I assure you!  Tell the Master his prisoner will not escape while Akama and his Deathsworn watch over her."]="A mere nuisance, I assure you!  Tell the Master his prisoner will not escape while Akama and his Deathsworn watch over her."
G["A mere three hundred years ago, a reckless dwarf named Thaurissan summoned the master from his fiery realm. His return to this paltry world devastated the surrounding lands and created this volcanic Core. Mighty Ragnaros has slept under this mountain ever since."]="A mere three hundred years ago, a reckless dwarf named Thaurissan summoned the master from his fiery realm. His return to this paltry world devastated the surrounding lands and created this volcanic Core. Mighty Ragnaros has slept under this mountain ever since."
G["A mere toy left by the usurper... you, too, are dust."]="Um mero brinquedo abandonou pelo usurpador... Você também é poeira."
G["A mess, that's what this is!  All of these creatures sprung up out of nowhere, and are running around out of control!  And where've the Magister, and his apprentices, run off to?  Leaving me here all alone without as much as a, \"Hello there Wyllithen, would you like to come with?\"\n\nThe nerve!"]="A mess, that's what this is!  All of these creatures sprung up out of nowhere, and are running around out of control!  And where've the Magister, and his apprentices, run off to?  Leaving me here all alone without as much as a, \"Hello there Wyllithen, would you like to come with?\"\n\nThe nerve!"
G["A message for anyone that would dare snitch on these criminals."]="A message for anyone that would dare snitch on these criminals."
G["A messenger reached us from Brewnall Village this morning. The dwarves are sending a squad of mountaineers to help us."]="Esta manhã chegou um mensageiro das Birras."
G["A mighty Qiraji known as General Rajaxx would command the initial incursion into Silithus. Only one would stand in his way: A night elf known as Staghelm. They refer to him as Khar'sis or 'hand of the earth' in the native Qiraji tongue."]="A mighty Qiraji known as General Rajaxx would command the initial incursion into Silithus. Only one would stand in his way: A night elf known as Staghelm. They refer to him as Khar'sis or 'hand of the earth' in the native Qiraji tongue."
G["A mighty blow has been dealt to the Lich King! You have proven yourselves as able bodied champions of the Argent Crusade. Together we will strike against Icecrown Citadel and destroy what remains of the Scourge! There is no challenge that we cannot face united!"]="A mighty blow has been dealt to the Lich King! You have proven yourselves as able bodied champions of the Argent Crusade. Together we will strike against Icecrown Citadel and destroy what remains of the Scourge! There is no challenge that we cannot face united!"
G["A mighty blow!"]="Ha, ja, ja, ja! Bom acerto!"
G["A million more await my orders. What chance do you have?"]="A million more await my orders. What chance do you have?"
G["A miner?  Ye don't need to ask if $glad : lass;, only where!  Yarr is who yer looking for, and I think ye can find him hiding out over in Steelgrill's Depot."]="A miner?  Ye don't need to ask if $glad : lass;, only where!  Yarr is who yer looking for, and I think ye can find him hiding out over in Steelgrill's Depot."
G["A minnow? The oceans are filled with minnows! There could be a hundred million minnows out there!"]="A minnow? The oceans are filled with minnows! There could be a hundred million minnows out there!"
G["A minor inconvenience."]="Uma inconveniência secundária."
G["A minor victory..."]="Uma vitória sem importância..."
G["A minute is all I need. Wait, that came out all wrong."]="Somente preciso um minuto. Espero, isso tem ficado mal."
G["A mirror? How wonderful!"]="Um espelho? Maravilhoso!"
G["A miserable defense from Light-swollen fools. Xi'ri, I will consume you myself!"]="Uma miserável defesa dos tonto inflados de luz. Xi'ri, te consumirei eu mesmo!"
G["A mission?"]="Uma missão?"
G["A moment I shall remember for always."]="Um momento que lembrarei para sempre."
G["A moment ago, you knelt as recruits..."]="A moment ago, you knelt as recruits..."
G["A moment... just give me a moment."]="Um segundo... tão somente dê-me um segundo."
G["A momentary flash of awareness fades quickly from the eyes of the %s."]="Um clarão de consciência desaparece rapidamente dos olhos de %s."
G["A monk's training never ceases. There is always a higher step to reach with both body and mind."]="A monk's training never ceases. There is always a higher step to reach with both body and mind."
G["A monstrous force pulls you into the twilight realm!"]="A monstrous force pulls you into the twilight realm!"
G["A mook?! I don't speak to brutes. How dare you!"]="Um mook?! Eu não falo com brutos. Como você ousa!"
G["A mop?  Really?"]="Uma mopa? Em sério?"
G["A mortal dares peer into the eye! (Brave little plaything.) I see you, little one! You want to see what the Eye sees, do you? (Show it! Show it all!)"]="A mortal dares peer into the eye! (Brave little plaything.) I see you, little one! You want to see what the Eye sees, do you? (Show it! Show it all!)"
G["A mortal possessed of arcane and dark knowledge that none could surpass, he devised a method to enhance his summoning through the capture and use of souls untold.\n\nWhole civilizations were brought to extinction through his soul devices to fuel the ritual through which he and his conspirators would bring Murmur into their world."]="A mortal possessed of arcane and dark knowledge that none could surpass, he devised a method to enhance his summoning through the capture and use of souls untold.\n\nWhole civilizations were brought to extinction through his soul devices to fuel the ritual through which he and his conspirators would bring Murmur into their world."
G["A most frustrating occurence."]="Uma ocorrência deveras frustrante."
G["A most productive day, today!\n\nThe chamber is indeed of ancient origin, and houses a magnificent mechanism which seems to be in disrepair.\n\nI will investigate further tomorrow.\n\nThis discovery will surely force Schnottz to take notice of me!\n\nHow could he deny me a promotion after something like this?"]="A most productive day, today!\n\nThe chamber is indeed of ancient origin, and houses a magnificent mechanism which seems to be in disrepair.\n\nI will investigate further tomorrow.\n\nThis discovery will surely force Schnottz to take notice of me!\n\nHow could he deny me a promotion after something like this?"
G["A mud-stained leaf..."]="Uma lâmina manchada de lama..."
G["A name? Oh, yes, the name! I believe it was Iskalder."]="Um nome? Ah, claro, seu nome! Acho que se chamava Iskalder."
G["A nearby Gargoyle comes to life!"]="Uma gárgula próxima volta à vida!"
G["A nearby group of Darkhatched Eggs begins to hatch!"]="A nearby group of Darkhatched Eggs begins to hatch!"
G["A nearby group of Darkhatched Swarmlings has hatched!"]="A nearby group of Darkhatched Swarmlings has hatched!"
G["A new Aspect of Magic has already been selected, Kalecgos."]="Já foi escolhido um novo Aspecto da Magia."
G["A new age for mortals has dawned, and heroes like you are among the vanguard."]="A new age for mortals has dawned, and heroes like you are among the vanguard."
G["A new continent full of forgotten secrets!  Share what you learn with the Lorewalkers here and me, and I'll let you in on some of my other projects."]="A new continent full of forgotten secrets!  Share what you learn with the Lorewalkers here and me, and I'll let you in on some of my other projects."
G["A new day dawns, my children! Soon the undead legions of Azjol-Nerub will rise and take over this world!"]="A new day dawns, my children! Soon the undead legions of Azjol-Nerub will rise and take over this world!"
G["A new enemy, Illusionary Flamecallers. They cast fireballs and spew lava. Use the lava to your advantage; it will burn the other illusions."]="Um novo inimigo, Arauto das Chamas Ilusório. Ele lança bolas de fogo e vomita lava. Use a lava a seu favor, ela vai queimar as outras ilusões!"
G["A new host must be found."]="A new host must be found."
G["A new land overrun by evil horrors of this world. A new place for us to save."]="A new land overrun by evil horrors of this world. A new place for us to save."
G["A new land, and you want to hunt boring old wolves?"]="A new land, and you want to hunt boring old wolves?"
G["A new student?\n\nYes, of course.\n\nYou come to me all bright-eyed and bob-tailed, thinking to take home a the great cloud serpent of the east.\n\nWell, you should consider the journey carefully.\n\nIt is not an easy path to take.\n\nThe Order only accepts students who have the potential to see their training through to the end."]="A new student?\n\nYes, of course.\n\nYou come to me all bright-eyed and bob-tailed, thinking to take home a the great cloud serpent of the east.\n\nWell, you should consider the journey carefully.\n\nIt is not an easy path to take.\n\nThe Order only accepts students who have the potential to see their training through to the end."
G["A new student? Ah yes, very good. Have you spoken to Elder Anli?"]="$gUn novo: Uma nova; aluno? Ah, sim, muito bem. Tem falado com a ancestral Anli?"
G["A new victim! Me was almost don wit dis one anyway."]="A new victim! Me was almost don wit dis one anyway."
G["A new world is coming, friends. But it is not the world of their design."]="Um mundo novo se aproxima, amigos. Mas não será o que eles disenhen."
G["A newcomer to Shattrath!  Make sure to drop by later.  We can always use a hand with the injured."]="A newcomer to Shattrath!  Make sure to drop by later.  We can always use a hand with the injured."
G["A nice catch it is at that! You bring honor to the Horde boy, we thank you!"]="Muito bem feito! Traz honra à Horda, rapaz, te o agradecemos!"
G["A noble effort... but it will take more than one of your puny stags to take down Galenges, the UNBREAKABLE!"]="A noble effort... but it will take more than one of your puny stags to take down Galenges, the UNBREAKABLE!"
G["A noble request. It would be an honor, Erothem."]="A noble request. It would be an honor, Erothem."
G["A note falls to the floor!"]="Uma nota cai no chão!"
G["A pack of harpies came up from the valley. A big one named Sirana led them... I didn't have anywhere to escape. They haven't been this aggressive for a long time... I didn't expect it... I let my guard down.... it's my own fault."]="Um maço de harpias veio do vale. Um grande chamado Sirana os levou... Eu não tinha para onde fugir. Eles não são tão agressivos há muito tempo... Eu não esperava... Abaixei minha guarda... a culpa é minha."
G["A pack of mechanical squirrels could mine faster than you!"]="A pack of mechanical squirrels could mine faster than you!"
G["A package changes hands between Pahu and the Longrunner, who packs it away safely."]="Um pacote passa das mãos de Pahu às de Largo Caminho, quno guarda a salvou."
G["A pact was made, $g brother:sister;! We vowed vengeance against the Lich King! For what he had done to us! We battled the Scourge as Forsaken, pushing them back into the Plaguelands and freeing Tirisifal! You and I were champions of the Forsaken!"]="A pact was made, $g brother:sister;! We vowed vengeance against the Lich King! For what he had done to us! We battled the Scourge as Forsaken, pushing them back into the Plaguelands and freeing Tirisifal! You and I were champions of the Forsaken!"
G["A pair of Zandalari Trolls burst through the doors ahead of you!"]="A pair of Zandalari Trolls burst through the doors ahead of you!"
G["A pair of skilled miners fled plague-ridden Gilneas and made their way here. You'll find them in the Craftsmen's Terrace."]="A pair of skilled miners fled plague-ridden Gilneas and made their way here. You'll find them in the Craftsmen's Terrace."
G["A paladin like Gidwin makes a fine death knight.  Any member of the Scourge powerful enough to defeat him would know that."]="A paladin like Gidwin makes a fine death knight.  Any member of the Scourge powerful enough to defeat him would know that."
G["A paladin! Slaying him would please the master. Attack!"]="A paladin! Slaying him would please the master. Attack!"
G["A pandaren enigma, my young prince! A mystery in the mists."]="Um enigmáticas pandaren, jovem Príncipe! Um mistério na névoa."
G["A pandaren legend is born! Sing praises to our new hero, $n!"]="Uma lenda pandarênica nasce! Cantaremos louvores ao nosso novo herói, $n!"
G["A party? Can you believe it? A party and the whole island is about to explode?! What are they thinking!!!"]="A party? Can you believe it? A party and the whole island is about to explode?! What are they thinking!!!"
G["A pathetic hit. More brutality!"]="Vá acerto patético. Mais brutalidade!"
G["A perfect cut."]="Um corte perfeito."
G["A pestilence upon you!"]="Pestilência sobre vocês!"
G["A piece of advice?  Never underestimate your foe, no matter how short, waddly, and heart-meltingly cute they might be."]="A piece of advice?  Never underestimate your foe, no matter how short, waddly, and heart-meltingly cute they might be."
G["A piercing howl echoes through the hallways!"]="A piercing howl echoes through the hallways!"
G["A piercing warcry echos through the maul!"]="Um Brado Guerreiro penetrante ressoa pela Massacre!"
G["A pinch of dis... A dash of dat... Heh, heh!"]="A pinch of dis... A dash of dat... Heh, heh!"
G["A pitiful attempt."]="A pitiful attempt."
G["A pitiful skirmish! The Alliance fights without conviction."]="Uma escaramuça patética! A Aliança luta sem convicção."
G["A pleasure doing business with you as always, $g Mr. : Ms.; $n.\n\nHave a nice day."]="Um prazer fazer negócios com você, como sempre, $gsenhor: senhora; $n.\n\nQue tenha um bom dia."
G["A pleasure!"]="Um prazer!"
G["A pleasure, $n. What can I do for you?"]="Um prazer, $n. O que posso fazer por você?"
G["A pleasure."]="Um prazer."
G["A pleasure... to serve the master."]="Um prazer... servir ao mestre."
G["A pool of dark moonlight appears nearby!"]="Um charco de luz de Lua sombria aparecem perto!"
G["A pool of moonlight appears to the east!"]="Um charco de luz de Lua aparecem ao este!"
G["A pool of moonlight appears to the north!"]="Um charco de luz de Lua aparecem ao norte!"
G["A pool of moonlight appears to the south!"]="Um charco de luz de Lua aparecem ao sul!"
G["A pool of moonlight appears to the west!"]="Um charco de luz de Lua aparecem ao oeste!"
G["A pool of moonlight appears!"]="Um charco de luz de Lua aparecem!"
G["A pool pony in the nick of time!"]="A pool pony in the nick of time!"
G["A portion of this land already be mine, mon, but it only be da beginning!"]="Uma parte desta terra já é minha, tron, mas somente é o início!"
G["A potion to melt the elves? Maybe you'll need it, Forsaken. I have my mace to crush their skulls!"]="A potion to melt the elves? Maybe you'll need it, Forsaken. I have my mace to crush their skulls!"
G["A powerful gem."]="Uma gema poderosa."
G["A powerful human mage is rumored to live to the north; he keeps watch over the land for some unknown reason. I have not traveled there myself, but it is said that visitors are welcome and can even earn favor with him if they are willing to do errands for him."]="Dizem que um poderoso mago humano vive no norte; ele vigia a terra por algum motivo desconhecido. Eu não viajei até lá, mas diz-se que os visitantes são bem-vindos e podem até ganhar favores com ele se estiverem dispostos a fazer recados por ele."
G["A precious barrel of Greenstone brew! Hurrah!"]="A precious barrel of Greenstone brew! Hurrah!"
G["A presence approaches! Someone out there can hear me! But... it is no Klaxxi."]="A presence approaches! Someone out there can hear me! But... it is no Klaxxi."
G["A pretty flower for me? Oh stop."]="Uma bonita flor para mim? Oh, para."
G["A priestess by the name of Laurna Morninglight calls Dolanaar home.  I believe she can be found just north of the Inn."]="Uma sacerdotisa chamada Laurna Morninglight chama Dolanaar de lar. Acredito que ela pode ser encontrada ao norte da estalagem."
G["A priestess of Azshara! Could she be leading their efforts?"]="Uma sacerdotisa de Azshara! Acaso poderá ela guiar nossos esforços?"
G["A prisoner has escaped!  Slay $g him:her;!"]="A prisoner has escaped!  Slay $g him:her;!"
G["A product of your own insolence."]="O resultados do seu insolência."
G["A profession trainer"]="Um treinador de profissão"
G["A protector has fallen. The World's Heart lies exposed!"]="A protector has fallen. The World's Heart lies exposed!"
G["A provisioner's work is never done. The Shado-Pan marches on its stomach.\n\nAnd, to some extent, its liver."]="O trabalho de proporcionar suprimentos nunca termina. O Shadopan vive a através do seu estômago.\n\nE até certo ponto, do seu fígado."
G["A pure sample would be one that's uncorrupted by unintentional influences. We need to find the creatures in the most basic, normal environment we can.\n\nThat means somewhere devoid of civilization or the effects of the dominant races of Azeroth. Someplace... untouched."]="A pure sample would be one that's uncorrupted by unintentional influences. We need to find the creatures in the most basic, normal environment we can.\n\nThat means somewhere devoid of civilization or the effects of the dominant races of Azeroth. Someplace... untouched."
G["A quick trip to the underworld for you, and a laugh for me. Sounds like a fair trade!"]="A quick trip to the underworld for you, and a laugh for me. Sounds like a fair trade!"
G["A radish for sweet little Ella? Well, I sure can spare one. Here you go."]="Um rábano para a pequena Ela? claro que te darei um. Tome."
G["A ramp leads up to just outside Krasus' Landing in the eastern sewers."]="Uma rampa leva ao lado de fosse do desembarque de Krasus, nos esgotos a leste."
G["A ramp leads up to near the Violet Citadel in the western sewers."]="Uma rampa leva até perto da Cidadela Violeta, nos esgotos ocidentais."
G["A rare find, indeed.\n\n<Mathredis nods.>\n\n If you wish to continue, I will need the components."]="A rare find, indeed.\n\n<Mathredis nods.>\n\n If you wish to continue, I will need the components."
G["A recent event, obscured by powerful magics, remains masked even to me..."]="A recent event, obscured by powerful magics, remains masked even to me..."
G["A restful sleep is sure to be had in the beds which Innkeeper Keldamyr keeps at the Inn in Dolanaar."]="A restful sleep is sure to be had in the beds which Innkeeper Keldamyr keeps at the Inn in Dolanaar."
G["A rider approaches."]="Se aproxima um cavaleiro."
G["A right deadly machine, that is. Best watch yer step down here, heroes."]="Parece ser uma máquina bem mortal. Melhor ter cuidado aqui embaixo, heróis."
G["A rogue bomb from the battle flew towards us. I survived, but...my husband..."]="Uma bomba perdida da batalha caiu sobre nós. Eu sobreviví, mas... meu marido..."
G["A rogue?  Hmmm... well, I've heard that Keryn Sylvius hangs around those shady types.  You might want to talk to her and see what you can learn."]="Um ladino? Hmmm... bem, ouvi dizer que Keryn Sylvius fica com esses tipos sombrios. Você pode conversar com ela e ver o que pode aprender."
G["A rogue?  I'm not in the habit of referring people to those types, but I believe Jannok would be the one you're looking for.  You will find him at the Inn in Dolanaar."]="Um ladino? Não tenho o hábito de indicar pessoas para esses tipos, mas acredito que Jannok seria o que você estava procurando. Você o encontrará na pousada em Dolanaar."
G["A rune on %s begins to glow brightly!"]="Uma runa sobre %s começa a brilhar!"
G["A sacrifice for you, master."]="Um sacrifício para você, mestre."
G["A sacrifice will be due if I am ever called upon, mortal..."]="Será necessário fazer um sacrifício se alguma vez me invocas, mortal..."
G["A sad tale, that one - a wee bit embarrassin' too.\n\nMy people be know fer havin' a taste fer the ale, ya know. And I be no exception. Seems I been given more than me share of the thirst.\n\nSo I run inta ol' Budd ya see, an' he offers me all the grog I can swallow fer joinin' his crew - a move I've come to regret.\n\nOne night, after drinkin' enough grog to drop a Kodo, I was lured into followin' Budd's band o' misfits into Zul'Aman.\n\nThat be the last I recall before findin' meself in that cage."]="A sad tale, that one - a wee bit embarrassin' too.\n\nMy people be know fer havin' a taste fer the ale, ya know. And I be no exception. Seems I been given more than me share of the thirst.\n\nSo I run inta ol' Budd ya see, an' he offers me all the grog I can swallow fer joinin' his crew - a move I've come to regret.\n\nOne night, after drinkin' enough grog to drop a Kodo, I was lured into followin' Budd's band o' misfits into Zul'Aman.\n\nThat be the last I recall before findin' meself in that cage."
G["A saronite barrier appears around General Vezax!"]="Aparecem uma barrera de saronita que perto ao geral Vezax!!"
G["A scout found the remains of your journal in Thor Modan. We've been looking for you ever since."]="Um explorador encontrou os restos do seu diário em Thor Modan. Te levamos procurando desde então."
G["A screeching cry pierces the air above!"]="A screeching cry pierces the air above!"
G["A search of the corpse's clothing and equipment reveals the insignia you need, undamaged by the battle and foul environment."]="Uma procurando nas roupas e nos equipamentos do cadáver revela as insígnias de que você precisa, sem danos pela batalha e pelo ambiente sujo."
G["A secret passage has opened beneath the platform, this way!"]="A secret passage has opened beneath the platform, this way!"
G["A self-inflicted wound, friend.  I could not bear to look upon a world where I'd committed so many horrors under the Lich King's grasp.\n\nIt was my first step towards redemption, and if my sins are unforgivable, then I will attempt to atone for them for the rest of my life."]="A self-inflicted wound, friend.  I could not bear to look upon a world where I'd committed so many horrors under the Lich King's grasp.\n\nIt was my first step towards redemption, and if my sins are unforgivable, then I will attempt to atone for them for the rest of my life."
G["A shadowy figure appears in the ship's cabin!"]="Uma figura sombria aparecem no camarote do navio!"
G["A shadowy, sinister presence has invaded the Emerald Dream. Its power is poised to spill over into our world, $n. We must oppose it! That's why I cannot accompany you in person."]="A shadowy, sinister presence has invaded the Emerald Dream. Its power is poised to spill over into our world, $n. We must oppose it! That's why I cannot accompany you in person."
G["A shallow and tragic victory. We are weaker as a whole from the losses suffered today. Who but the Lich King could benefit from such foolishness? Great warriors have lost their lives. And for what? The true threat looms ahead - the Lich King awaits us all in death."]="A shallow and tragic victory. We are weaker as a whole from the losses suffered today. Who but the Lich King could benefit from such foolishness? Great warriors have lost their lives. And for what? The true threat looms ahead - the Lich King awaits us all in death."
G["A shaman trainer?  Not here in Goldshire.\n\nBut the Wildhammer dwarves in Stormwind's Dwarven District may be able to help you out."]="Um instrutor de chamanes? Em Vilhadorada não há.\n\nMas os anões Martelo Feroz do Distrito dos Anões de Ventobravo talvez possam ajudar você."
G["A shaman...?\nThere's a rather rough-looking dwarven lass staying in Theramore's inn; I believe she came to visit an old friend of hers here.\nShe might be able to help you."]="A shaman...?\nThere's a rather rough-looking dwarven lass staying in Theramore's inn; I believe she came to visit an old friend of hers here.\nShe might be able to help you."
G["A shame. I could use a bit of rest.\n\nNo matter. Tell Nazgrim that I will accompany the party."]="A shame. I could use a bit of rest.\n\nNo matter. Tell Nazgrim that I will accompany the party."
G["A ship runs between here and Westguard Keep, sometimes ferrying troops and the occasional passenger but most often carrying much-needed supplies."]="Um navio navega entre este lugar e a Fortaleza da Guarda Oeste, a vezes leva tropas e algum passageiro ocasional, mas a maioria das vezes leva suprimentos de suma necessidade."
G["A show of might on these shores will make the pandaren think twice about joining the Alliance."]="Uma demonstração de força fará que os pandaren se o piensen antes de entrar à Aliança."
G["A similar fate befell all that would die to the Scourge war machine."]="A similar fate befell all that would die to the Scourge war machine."
G["A simple enough task to break this soulstone!"]="Que tarefa tão simples a de quebrar esta pedras de almas!"
G["A simple flesh wound won't keep me from the battle."]="Uma simples ferida não me apartará da batalha."
G["A simple practical joke."]="Uma simples broma pesada."
G["A simple spark can mean the difference between life...and death."]="Uma simples chispa pode ser a diferença entre a vida... e a morte."
G["A single cut should do."]="Um corte bastará."
G["A single drop of coconut milk leaks out of A-Me 01's eye as she takes one long, last look at Wooga."]="A single drop of coconut milk leaks out of A-Me 01's eye as she takes one long, last look at Wooga."
G["A single general remains. You must make haste!"]="Somente resta um geral. Devem daros pressa!"
G["A single prong. Hardly enough to stop me from slaughtering hundreds more."]="A single prong. Hardly enough to stop me from slaughtering hundreds more."
G["A skunk! Eeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeew! Don't touch me!"]="Uma mofeta! Eeeeeeeeeeeh! Não me toques!"
G["A skunk, rabbit, and a fawn travelling together.  Now that's something you don't see every day.  No matter, I'll be dining on venison tonight!"]="A skunk, rabbit, and a fawn travelling together.  Now that's something you don't see every day.  No matter, I'll be dining on venison tonight!"
G["A slippery tile causes you to lose your footing."]="A slippery tile causes you to lose your footing."
G["A small fee for supplies is required."]="Há uma modesta tarifa para suprimentos."
G["A small group of us, druids and sentinels, have come to aid the tauren of Freewind Post with our common enemy: the Grimtotem Clan."]="Um pequeno grupo de nós, druidas e sentinelas, viemos ajudar o tauren do Posto de Vento Livre com nosso inimigo comum: o Clã Grimtotem."
G["A small moonwell arises from the droplets of the chalice."]="A small moonwell arises from the droplets of the chalice."
G["A smart fighter knows when retreat is the best option."]="Um guerreiro esperto sabe quando a melhor opção é bater em retirada."
G["A soft hum ceases as the corruption creating new Puddles ebbs away with the death of the final Aqueous Defender."]="A soft hum ceases as the corruption creating new Puddles ebbs away with the death of the final Aqueous Defender."
G["A soldier could get into a lot of trouble in a town like this.\n\nA lot of trouble."]="A soldier could get into a lot of trouble in a town like this.\n\nA lot of trouble."
G["A soldier's duty is never done."]="A guarda de um soldado não acaba nunca."
G["A song?"]="Uma canto?"
G["A sorrowful howling floats through the forest."]="Um uivo pesaroso recorre o florestas."
G["A soul fragment merges souls with the Harbinger of Darkness!"]="A soul fragment merges souls with the Harbinger of Darkness!"
G["A special project... an artifact for Cho'gall."]="Um projeto especial... Um artefato para Cho'galh."
G["A spirit appears to avenge the Crystalsong Oak!"]="Aparecem um espírito para vingar ao roble Canto de Cristal!"
G["A spring-loaded plunger with blades attached, for processing food. Or people you disagree with."]="A spring-loaded plunger with blades attached, for processing food. Or people you disagree with."
G["A squire is the right hand of the knight.  As you are already fully aware, hands are especially good at carrying things, and thus your first duty will be to carry my sundries, knickknacks, and other miscellaneous paraphernalia while I dispense justice across the land.  To lug around such etcetera is a job unbefitting of a knight."]="Um escudeiro é a mão direita do cavaleiro. Como você já está plenamente consciente, as mãos são especialmente boas em carregar coisas e, portanto, seu primeiro dever será transportar meus artigos diversos, bugigangas e outras parafernálias diversas, enquanto eu dispenso a justiça por tudo o país. Arrastar em torno de tais etcetera é um trabalho inadequado para um cavaleiro."
G["A stack of papers and schematics are strewn here."]="Uma pilha de papéis e esquemas estão espalhados aqui."
G["A stain is about to ruin the deck!"]="Uma mancha está a ponto de arruinar toda a coberta!"
G["A stake has been driven into the rock, and a long braid of rope draped around it.\n\nThis must have some purpose."]="na rocha há cravada uma estaca, e uma larga corda trançada pende da mesma.\n\nIsto deve ter algum propósito."
G["A staple of the Thorium Brotherhood.\n\nArcanite crystals are harvested from rich thorium lodes. Through the alchemical prowess of powerful alchemists, arcanite bars are born.\n\nSeek out a miner, if you aren't one... and find a good alchemist! You'll need both."]="A staple of the Thorium Brotherhood.\n\nArcanite crystals are harvested from rich thorium lodes. Through the alchemical prowess of powerful alchemists, arcanite bars are born.\n\nSeek out a miner, if you aren't one... and find a good alchemist! You'll need both."
G["A startled hozen leaps out of a nearby bush!"]="Um hozen assustado sai de um arbusto próximo!"
G["A stick!"]="Um palo!"
G["A storm approaches."]="Se aproxima uma tempestade."
G["A storm is brewing near the Lightning Pillar.  Beware!"]="Se você está carregando um relâmpago perto do pilar de relâmpagos. Cuidado!"
G["A strange mood has come over the city, $c. The people are afraid of something and many have gone missing. We must get to the bottom of it."]="Há um ambiente estranho na cidade, $c. A gente tem medo de algo e têm sumiu muitas pessoas. Devemos chegar ao fundo deste assunto."
G["A strange request, $r, but after what you have done for our prince it would be wrong of me to deny you."]="A strange request, $r, but after what you have done for our prince it would be wrong of me to deny you."
G["A stranger? Here? Don't start any trouble in our town."]="A stranger? Here? Don't start any trouble in our town."
G["A stranger? Well look at that. I wonder where it came from."]="A stranger? Well look at that. I wonder where it came from."
G["A stray bomb from the firefight destroyed my farm. How am I supposed to survive like this?"]="Uma bomba perdida da batalha destruyó meu fazenda. Como vou viver agora?"
G["A stray jolt from the Foe Reaper has disrupted the foundry controls!"]="A stray jolt from the Foe Reaper has disrupted the foundry controls!"
G["A strong weapon is no good if you don't live long enough to wield it, $c."]="A strong weapon is no good if you don't live long enough to wield it, $c."
G["A studious rider is a successful rider."]="A studious rider is a successful rider."
G["A successful test!  $n, this indurium is some amazing stuff."]="A successful test!  $n, this indurium is some amazing stuff."
G["A surprising twist!"]="Mas que surpresa, hein!"
G["A swarm of Mantid appear from nearby and attack!"]="Um enxame de mantídeos aparecem e ataca!"
G["A swift slice to the throat, and this one falls like any other."]="Um hábil coh'te na garganta e cai como qualquer outro."
G["A sword is the weapon of a warrior, but patience is the weapon of kings."]="A lâmina é o arma do guerreiro, mas a paciência é o arma do rei."
G["A tailor is it?  Well, if you hang out here long enough you'll eventually hear word of mouth about Georgio Bolero.  He's been setting the trends for some months now.  If you wish to learn from him, you can find him over in the Mage Quarter in the outer rim."]="Um alfaiate é? Bem, se você ficar aqui o tempo suficiente, acabará por ouvir falar de Georgio Bolero. Ele está definindo as tendências há algum meses. Se você deseja aprender com ele, pode encontrá-o no Bairro dos Magos, na borda externa."
G["A tailor, eh? Very well. What would you like to learn about, tailor?"]="$gSastre: Sastra;, eh? Muito bem. sobre que você gostaria aprender, $gsastre: sastra;?"
G["A task presses upon me, but I do not have the time to take care of it myself. Can I entrust you with it?"]="A task presses upon me, but I do not have the time to take care of it myself. Can I entrust you with it?"
G["A taste... just a small taste... of the Spell-Weaver's power!"]="Uma mostra... uma pequena mostra do poder do Tejefeitiços!"
G["A terrible and costly mistake you have made. It is not my time, mortals."]="A terrible and costly mistake you have made. It is not my time, mortals."
G["A terrible change comes over the %s as he cackles maniacally."]="A terrible change comes over the %s as he cackles maniacally."
G["A terrible change comes over the %s as she cackles maniacally."]="A terrible change comes over the %s as she cackles maniacally."
G["A terrible, dark energy emanates from this pile of skulls."]="Uma energia escura e terrível emana desta pilha de caveiras."
G["A test! A trial of patience. Will the wolf behave as a warrior... or a King?"]="A test! A trial of patience. Will the wolf behave as a warrior... or a King?"
G["A thick red slash has been drawn across the words WANTED: Deathclaw.  \"This bounty has been claimed by the heroic $n, who has overcome the fearsome beast,\" declares more writing in the same red ink."]="A thick red slash has been drawn across the words WANTED: Deathclaw.  \"This bounty has been claimed by the heroic $n, who has overcome the fearsome beast,\" declares more writing in the same red ink."
G["A thief!!"]="Ladrão!"
G["A thorn?  And I left my tweezers at home."]="A thorn?  And I left my tweezers at home."
G["A thousand and one ways that all spell out your demise!"]="Uma e mil formas de que todos hablen do seu morte!"
G["A thousand curses upon you, $r!  This prison will not hold me for long!"]="Te maldigo mil vezes, $r! Esta prisão não me retendrá durante muito tempo!"
G["A thousand deaths..."]="Milhares de mortes..."
G["A thousand deaths...."]="Milhares de mortes..."
G["A thousand lifetimes ago, I brought the waters here. A gift to the Pearlfin for ancient deeds."]="A thousand lifetimes ago, I brought the waters here. A gift to the Pearlfin for ancient deeds."
G["A thousand more like him exist. Ten thousand. Should one fall, another will rise to take the seat of power."]="A thousand more like him exist. Ten thousand. Should one fall, another will rise to take the seat of power."
G["A thousand years ago, the immortal elves, demigods of the forest and dragons fought against the Legion on the slopes of Hyjal."]="A thousand years ago, the immortal elves, demigods of the forest and dragons fought against the Legion on the slopes of Hyjal."
G["A thousand years ago, when the War of the Shifting Sands ended, three of our kin sacrificed themselves and held the Qiraji inside these halls while Anachronos and Staghelm sealed Ahn'Qiraj shut.\n\nEach of us vowed to look for Merithra, Arygos and Caelestrasz should the Scarab Wall ever fall.\n\nAnd fall it did... and so we came."]="A thousand years ago, when the War of the Shifting Sands ended, three of our kin sacrificed themselves and held the Qiraji inside these halls while Anachronos and Staghelm sealed Ahn'Qiraj shut.\n\nEach of us vowed to look for Merithra, Arygos and Caelestrasz should the Scarab Wall ever fall.\n\nAnd fall it did... and so we came."
G["A thousand-thousand lives I will sacrifice for you, my lord."]="Por você, meu senhor, sacrificaría mil vezes mil vidas."
G["A thousand-thousand pardons, Master! I will deal with these intruders myself!"]="A thousand-thousand pardons, Master! I will deal with these intruders myself!"
G["A thousand? For one man?"]="Um milhar? Para um somente homem?"
G["A thousssand fangsss gonna rend your flesh!"]="A thousssand fangsss gonna rend your flesh!"
G["A thunderous voice bellows from the stone...\n\nGreetings, commander.  What news of Silithus do you bring the Lords of the Council?"]="A thunderous voice bellows from the stone...\n\nGreetings, commander.  What news of Silithus do you bring the Lords of the Council?"
G["A thunderous voice bellows from the stone...\n\nI sense your Medallion of Station, cultist, but you have no ring of lordship?  Are you truly a commander of the Twilight's Hammer, or do you merely run errands for your betters?"]="A thunderous voice bellows from the stone...\n\nI sense your Medallion of Station, cultist, but you have no ring of lordship?  Are you truly a commander of the Twilight's Hammer, or do you merely run errands for your betters?"
G["A thunderous voice bellows from the stone...\n\nWhat is this?  I sense a little cultist scurrying about!  Run along, vermin, or face the wrath of the lords of the Council!"]="A thunderous voice bellows from the stone...\n\nWhat is this?  I sense a little cultist scurrying about!  Run along, vermin, or face the wrath of the lords of the Council!"
G["A time consuming, yet rewarding skill.  Speak with Astaia in the Tradesman's Terrace and maybe you'll learn something useful."]="Uma habilidade demorada, mas gratificante. Fale com Astaia no Terraço do Comerciante e talvez você aprenda algo útil."
G["A total victory! Thanks to your resourcefulness and efficiency, we didn't lose a single soul. Accept this reward, along with my sincere gratitude."]="A total victory! Thanks to your resourcefulness and efficiency, we didn't lose a single soul. Accept this reward, along with my sincere gratitude."
G["A totem is failing! You must reactivate it!"]="Um totem está falhando! Deve reactivarlo!"
G["A tradesman, perhaps? You need look no further than I for supplies. My prices are quite fair, friend. These items were difficult to acquire, but what does the source matter, eh? You'll have what you need."]="É mercador? Pois já não busques mais, eu tenho os suprimentos O que precisa. Meus preços são bastante justos, $gamigo: amiga;. Não foi nada fácil conseguir estes itens, mas isso não nos importa, eh? Terá o que precisa."
G["A treasure hunter's life is a treacherous one. Don't be foolin' yerself."]="A vida de um caçador de tesouros é traiçoeira. Não se engane."
G["A treasure trove of knowledge, ripe for the taking!"]="Um tesouro de sabedoria, pronto para ser tomado!"
G["A trio of ethereal technomancers has set up shop in Orgrimmar, along the eastern Drag.\nLook for the weird machinery and purple lights... you can't miss it.\nThey offer just the sort of services you're looking for."]="A trio of ethereal technomancers has set up shop in Orgrimmar, along the eastern Drag.\nLook for the weird machinery and purple lights... you can't miss it.\nThey offer just the sort of services you're looking for."
G["A trio of ethereal technomancers has set up shop in Stormwind, along the canal south of Cathedral Square.\n\"The Three Winds,\" it's called. Look for the weird machinery and purple lights... you can't miss it.\nThey offer just the sort of services you're looking for."]="A trio of ethereal technomancers has set up shop in Stormwind, along the canal south of Cathedral Square.\n\"The Three Winds,\" it's called. Look for the weird machinery and purple lights... you can't miss it.\nThey offer just the sort of services you're looking for."
G["A truck that delivers ice-cream. With a catapult."]="A truck that delivers ice-cream. With a catapult."
G["A true fighter never enters a battle unprepared."]="Um guerreiro de verdade jamais entra em uma batalha despreparado."
G["A true professional know his limitations, and I'm not ashamed to admit that your skills exceed mine. I want you to pay a visit to Kitta Firewind at the Tower of Azora. She is well-renowned, and with good reason."]="Um verdadeiro profissional conhece suas limitações e não tenho vergonha de admitir que suas habilidades excedem as minhas. Quero que você faça uma visita a Kitta Firewind na Torre de Azora. Ela é bem conhecida e por boas razões."
G["A true warrior does not stop in a battle to talk with his allies! Send these monstrosities back to their graves!"]="A true warrior does not stop in a battle to talk with his allies! Send these monstrosities back to their graves!"
G["A tunnel leads out to the bottom of the city in the western sewers, just north of the Cantrips and Crows Tavern.\n\nSome of the more adventurous sorts use it to fly in and out of Dalaran."]="A tunnel leads out to the bottom of the city in the western sewers, just north of the Cantrips and Crows Tavern.\n\nSome of the more adventurous sorts use it to fly in and out of Dalaran."
G["A valiant defense, but this city must be razed. I will fulfill Malygos's wishes myself!"]="A valiant defense, but this city must be razed. I will fulfill Malygos's wishes myself!"
G["A valiant effort, but not enough.  Speak to me when you are ready to try again."]="Um intento digno, mas não é suficiente. Fala comigo quando queira voltar a tentar."
G["A valuable skill First Aid is.  Our resident trainer, Nissa Firestone, can show ye how it's done.  Look for her on the southern side of The Great Forge at the Ironforge Physician."]="Uma habilidade valiosa de primeiros socorros é. Nossa treinadora residente, Nissa Firestone, pode mostrar como é feito. Procure-a no lado sul da Grande Forja no Ironforge Physician."
G["A very distinct scent.  There doesn't appear to be anything like it in the direct area."]="Um cheiro muito peculiar. Não parece que tenha nada similar por esta zona."
G["A very good question, $c. When last I had heard, the Alliance had managed to smelt $1997w out of $1998w copper bars, $2002w out of $2003w iron bars and $2011w out of $2012w thorium bars needed for the war effort."]="A very good question, $c. When last I had heard, the Alliance had managed to smelt $1997w out of $1998w copper bars, $2002w out of $2003w iron bars and $2011w out of $2012w thorium bars needed for the war effort."
G["A very sad tale. Thank you, spirit."]="Um conto muito triste. Obrigado, espírito."
