G["A vision of Ysera materializes before you."]="Uma visão de Ysera se materializa ante ti."
G["A walk always goes faster when you have a friendly $r $c by your side."]="A walk always goes faster when you have a friendly $r $c by your side."
G["A walk? Sure!"]="Um passeio? claro!"
G["A war we did not have until you arrived!"]="A war we did not have until you arrived!"
G["A warlock! He couldn't have ported far - there must be another base."]="Um bruxo! Não pode haver ido muito longe... Deve haver outra base."
G["A warlock, eh...  Well, if you've got a mind to be doing that sort of thing around here then ye best keep yer demons on a leash $gboyo : girlie;.  I don't like demons, but I love putting mah axe to them.  Ye get me?  \nNow you just leave me be and go get lost in The Forlorn Cavern.  That's where you'll find that warlock, Thistleheart."]="A warlock, eh...  Well, if you've got a mind to be doing that sort of thing around here then ye best keep yer demons on a leash $gboyo : girlie;.  I don't like demons, but I love putting mah axe to them.  Ye get me?  \nNow you just leave me be and go get lost in The Forlorn Cavern.  That's where you'll find that warlock, Thistleheart."
G["A warlock?  Well, if I was a warlock, I would probably be in the darkest place around here... which would be the Lion's Pride Inn basement.  That's where you should look first."]="Um bruxo? Bem, se eu fosse um bruxo, provavelmente estaria no lugar mais escuro por aqui... que seria o porão do Lion's Pride Inn. É para onde você deve procurar primeiro."
G["A warm tavern and a cold ale. What more could we ask for?"]="Uma taberna quente e uma cerveja fria. Que mais podemos pedir?"
G["A warrior like Garrosh comes to power with something to prove."]="Um guerreiro como Garrosh sempre chega ao poder querendo provar alguma coisa."
G["A warrior's death."]="Uma morte de um guerreiro."
G["A waste of flesh."]="Uma perda de carne."
G["A waste of my time."]="Vá perda de tempo."
G["A waste of my time..."]="Uma perda de tempo..."
G["A wave of sickness rushed through me. After the ritual was over, I ran home to my children. I gathered what belongings I could carry in my arms and left with my boys. We ran to the hills and hid. There really was no other option...\n\nNot a day goes by that I don't think of the cut. It has taken 20 years to reconnect with the elements. It has taken 20 years for the elements to even begin to heal."]="A wave of sickness rushed through me. After the ritual was over, I ran home to my children. I gathered what belongings I could carry in my arms and left with my boys. We ran to the hills and hid. There really was no other option...\n\nNot a day goes by that I don't think of the cut. It has taken 20 years to reconnect with the elements. It has taken 20 years for the elements to even begin to heal."
G["A wave of |cFF00dc29Sik'thik Swarmers|r and a |cFF815d18Sik'thik Warrior|r joins the battle."]="A wave of |cFF00dc29Sik'thik Swarmers|r and a |cFF815d18Sik'thik Warrior|r joins the battle."
