G["A wise man does not rush into war. A wise man wins a war."]="Um homem sábio não se precipita à guerra. Um homem sábio ganha a guerra."
G["A wise man pays his debts off immediately. A wiser man knows when he is being swindled.\n\nGina sits in the market and counts money all day. I walk the lonely roads and am lucky to make enough to scrape by. Why should I have to pay?"]="A wise man pays his debts off immediately. A wiser man knows when he is being swindled.\n\nGina sits in the market and counts money all day. I walk the lonely roads and am lucky to make enough to scrape by. Why should I have to pay?"
