G["A word to the wise, stranger, go back to wherever you're from.\n\nThis is no place for lighthearted adventurers. It'll chew up the likes of you and spit out your bones."]="A word to the wise, stranger, go back to wherever you're from.\n\nThis is no place for lighthearted adventurers. It'll chew up the likes of you and spit out your bones."
