G["A-Me have many locomotion speed modes.  A-Me design specification U-2502 state that user may define A-Me locomotion mode to suit user preference.\n\nIn Amble Mode, A-Me move at speed of normal $r.\n\nIn Run Mode, A-Me move at speed of normal horse or wolf.\n\nIn Overdrive Mode, A-Me move at speed of VERY FAST horse or wolf.\n\nWhich mode you prefer?"]="A-Me have many locomotion speed modes.  A-Me design specification U-2502 state that user may define A-Me locomotion mode to suit user preference.\n\nIn Amble Mode, A-Me move at speed of normal $r.\n\nIn Run Mode, A-Me move at speed of normal horse or wolf.\n\nIn Overdrive Mode, A-Me move at speed of VERY FAST horse or wolf.\n\nWhich mode you prefer?"
