G["Ack, ye've been busy now haven't ye?!  I canna thank ye enough for bombing them demons and resupplying us with mounts.\n\nYer making our job all the more easier.  Keep up the good work, $g laddy : lassie;!"]="Ack, ye've been busy now haven't ye?!  I canna thank ye enough for bombing them demons and resupplying us with mounts.\n\nYer making our job all the more easier.  Keep up the good work, $g laddy : lassie;!"
