G["Act quick! Once it's gone, it's gone! Get your weapons here now!"]="Act quick! Once it's gone, it's gone! Get your weapons here now!"
G["Acteon is our resident tracker, and a good one he is, too - the skins he wears are testament to his skill. His camp is in the southeast of Azure Watch."]="Acteon é o nosso rastreador residente, e ele também é bom - as peles que ele veste são uma prova da sua habilidade. Seu acampamento fica no sudeste do Azure Watch."
