G["Acting on these tenets, these virtues, help make the world a place we all can appreciate. A world of honor and justice."]="Acting on these tenets, these virtues, help make the world a place we all can appreciate. A world of honor and justice."
G["Action speaks louder than intent, stranger. My warriors intend to seek retribution, but only practice will make it so. Now go away. We are busy."]="Action speaks louder than intent, stranger. My warriors intend to seek retribution, but only practice will make it so. Now go away. We are busy."
