G["Actually I prefer traditional medicines... leeches, maggots, bonesaws... that sort of thing.  Well to each their own.  You can find the our local Herbalism Trainer, Faruza, standing out front near the stables in Brill."]="Na verdade, prefiro remédios tradicionais... sanguessugas, larvas, serras de ossos... esse tipo de coisa. Bem, para cada um deles. Você pode encontrar o nosso treinador local de Herbalism, Faruza, em pé na linha de frente perto dos estábulos em Brill."
G["Actually, I agree with Fiona."]="A verdade é que estou de acordo com Fiona."
G["Actually, I saw Benedictus at Wyrmrest. He was the Twilight Prophet."]="Actually, I saw Benedictus at Wyrmrest. He was the Twilight Prophet."
G["Actually, forget it - I don't want to know. I'm going back to my lines."]="Actually, forget it - I don't want to know. I'm going back to my lines."
G["Actually, shaman, I don't really care what you do.  I'm not even sure why Hellscream brought you here."]="Actually, shaman, I don't really care what you do.  I'm not even sure why Hellscream brought you here."
G["Adamant, could you please take a look at this tablet and try to decipher the runes?"]="Adamant, poderia echarle um olhada a esta tabuleta para tentar decifrar as runas?"
G["Adaris!"]="Adaris!"
G["Add another orange! Quickly!"]="Add another orange! Quickly!"
G["Add bananas!"]="Add bananas!"
G["Add the unmentionables... uh, I mean, the 'delicates'!"]="Add the unmentionables... uh, I mean, the 'delicates'!"
G["Additional background information on the Earthen must be given to you before this question may be answered properly.\n\nProcessing.\n\nTo understand the anomalies of the Earthen, it is first important to understand what the Earthen represent in their design intent.  The Earthen represent the Creators' attempt at improving the survivability paradigm of the standard subterranean being matrix.  This was done by incorporating a resilient foundation of construction inherent to the world into said matrix."]="Additional background information on the Earthen must be given to you before this question may be answered properly.\n\nProcessing.\n\nTo understand the anomalies of the Earthen, it is first important to understand what the Earthen represent in their design intent.  The Earthen represent the Creators' attempt at improving the survivability paradigm of the standard subterranean being matrix.  This was done by incorporating a resilient foundation of construction inherent to the world into said matrix."
G["Additional background is relevant to your query: following global combat between Aesir and Vanir--"]="Additional background is relevant to your query: following global combat between Aesir and Vanir--"
G["Adele Fielder has made a name for herself as a leatherworker around Elwynn.  You can find her working out of her home up by Crystal Lake."]="Adele Fielder fez um nome para si mesma como uma marcenaria em torno de Elwynn. Você pode encontrá-a trabalhando na sua casa em Crystal Lake."
G["Adeline, can you not ask any of your friends to come help us at New Thalanaar?"]="Adeline, você não pode pedirle a nenhum dos seus amigos que venha a nos ajudar a Nova Thalanaar?"
G["Adella, you will strike out far to the east. Our forces must retake the eastern wilds, and observe the Horde unseen. May your judgement be as keen as your marksmanship."]="Adelha, você atacarás ao este. Nossas tropas devem retomar o florestas oriental e observar à Horda sem ser vistas. Que seu juízo seja tão agudo como seu puntería."
G["Adjust the gears! \n\n\n|TInterface\\Icons\\INV_Misc_EngGizmos_13.blp:64|t"]="Ajustar as marchas! \n\n\n|TInterface\\Icons\\INV_Misc_EngGizmos_13.blp:64|t"
G["Administering fists of fury on $n!"]="Administering fists of fury on $n!"
G["Admirably? Hah! I will enjoy watching your weak little champions fail, human."]="Admirably? Hah! I will enjoy watching your weak little champions fail, human."
G["Admiral - I think they mean to surrender. They're not armed - They're just trying not to drown!"]="Almirante - eu acho que eles querem se render. Não estão armados, só estão tentando não se afogar!"
G["Admiral Aubrey is expecting you upstairs, $gsir:ma'am;."]="O Almirante Aubrey te espera cima, $gsenhor: senhora;."
G["Admiral Keller sent me, Emilune. Please send me to Westguard Keep!"]="O almirante Keller me enviou, Emilune. Por favor, envie-me para Westguard Keep!"
G["Admiral Taylor and I were just speaking about you. How are you, $n?"]="O almirante Taylor e eu estávamos falando de ti. Como está, $n?"
G["Admiral Taylor sent us here to look fer the young Prince. Did ya know that they brew BEER here?"]="Admiral Taylor sent us here to look fer the young Prince. Did ya know that they brew BEER here?"
G["Admiral they've activated some sort of force field, the control towers all over the island just lit up"]="Admiral they've activated some sort of force field, the control towers all over the island just lit up"
G["Admiral they've activated some sort of force field, the control towers all over the island just lit up."]="Admiral they've activated some sort of force field, the control towers all over the island just lit up."
G["Admiral! It's good to see that you are okay."]="Almirante! Fico feliz ver que está bem."
G["Admiral, I need another tree disguise kit."]="Almirante, preciso outro disfarce completo de árvore."
G["Admiral, can I get a ride to the Blackpool?"]="Admiral, can I get a ride to the Blackpool?"
G["Admiral, send the remnants of Theramore's fleet to assist the night elves and issue letters of marque to any captains willing to take up our cause."]="Admiral, send the remnants of Theramore's fleet to assist the night elves and issue letters of marque to any captains willing to take up our cause."
G["Admiral, we're seeing a significant native presence here. Ornate structures-"]="Almirante, vejo uma forte presença nativa aqui. Estruturas trabalhadas –"
G["Admiral, your hat."]="Almirante, seu chapéu."
G["Advance to the front!"]="Advance to the front!"
G["Advanced training? Do you mean the one with the eggs?"]="Treinamento avançado? Te refieres ao dos ovos?"
G["Adventurers are such hypocrites!  Like YOU just FOUND your weapon on the side of the road!"]="Adventurers are such hypocrites!  Like YOU just FOUND your weapon on the side of the road!"
G["Adventurers from all over sell things to Antonio-- come look for yourselves what little treasures he has for you this week."]="Adventurers from all over sell things to Antonio-- come look for yourselves what little treasures he has for you this week."
G["Adventurers may be rewarded for their just deeds in the Silver Enclave or Sunreaver's Sanctuary."]="Os aventureiros podem ser recompensados ​​pelas suas ações justas no Silver Enclave ou no Sunreaver's Sanctuary."
G["Adventurers, the door is beginning to weaken!"]="Aventureiros, a porta começa a ceder!"
G["Adventurers, you must hurry! The Guardian of Time cannot last for much longer!"]="Adventurers, you must hurry! The Guardian of Time cannot last for much longer!"
G["Advisor, what's the latest news?"]="Conselheiro, quais são as últimas notícia?"
G["Aeire, $n has brought your hides. Please, take them before they make me ill."]="Aeire, $n has brought your hides. Please, take them before they make me ill."
G["Aerial recon of New Hearthglen! Observe Scarlet Crusade activity!"]="Reconhecimento aéreo de Nova Vega do Amparo! Se observa atividade da Cruzada Escarlate!"
G["Aesir and Vanir... Okay, so the Forge o' Wills started makin' new earthen... but what happened to the old ones?"]="Aesir and Vanir... Okay, so the Forge o' Wills started makin' new earthen... but what happened to the old ones?"
G["Aessina is the spirit of nature, my everlasting companion in both this world and the dream beyond. Her shrine in western Hyjal is at the forefront of the Twilight offensive, and may be ablaze this very moment.\n\n$n, we will never restore Mount Hyjal without Aessina's help. Save her shrine from the fires, and save the nearby animals threatened by the blaze. We must do this or the entire mountain is lost."]="Aessina is the spirit of nature, my everlasting companion in both this world and the dream beyond. Her shrine in western Hyjal is at the forefront of the Twilight offensive, and may be ablaze this very moment.\n\n$n, we will never restore Mount Hyjal without Aessina's help. Save her shrine from the fires, and save the nearby animals threatened by the blaze. We must do this or the entire mountain is lost."
G["Aethas Sunreaver shifts uncomfortably."]="Aethas Atracasol se sacode incómodo."
G["Aethas Sunreaver!"]="Aethas Atracasol!"
G["Aethas isn't here... they must have moved him. We can continue without him."]="Aethas isn't here... they must have moved him. We can continue without him."
G["Aethas! You're alive."]="Aethas! Você está vivo."
G["Aethas, I want our best archmages studying this device at once. We have so much to learn."]="Aethas, I want our best archmages studying this device at once. We have so much to learn."
G["Aethas, leave us for a moment."]="Aethas, déjanos um momento."
G["Aethas, this way! Into the portal!"]="Aethas, por aqui! Ao portal!"
G["Affiliation: Burning Legion"]="Afiliação: Legião Ardente"
G["Affirmative, stalker, we are Oscar Mike! Repeat, we are Oscar Mike!"]="Affirmative, stalker, we are Oscar Mike! Repeat, we are Oscar Mike!"
G["Affirmative.  Timestamp of Prime Designate Loken's destruction coincides with signal activation."]="Affirmative.  Timestamp of Prime Designate Loken's destruction coincides with signal activation."
G["Afraid not, friend.  Here's your sword and shield.  Report to the barracks for duty."]="Afraid not, friend.  Here's your sword and shield.  Report to the barracks for duty."
G["Afraid not. Your days as a sanitation engineer are coming to an end."]="Afraid not. Your days as a sanitation engineer are coming to an end."
G["After Deathwing appeared, they became quite frightened, but I only had room to rescue one of them."]="After Deathwing appeared, they became quite frightened, but I only had room to rescue one of them."
G["After I dropped ye off last time, I heard there was some kind of sha infectin' our soldiers at the Shrine of Seven Stars."]="After I dropped ye off last time, I heard there was some kind of sha infectin' our soldiers at the Shrine of Seven Stars."
G["After I finish with your friends, you shall be our newest initiate."]="Quando acabe com os seus amigos, você será nosso novo iniciada."
G["After a couple of days of silence, I sent a scouting party out to the platform. They never returned.\n\nI sent another group the next day with the same results, and lost a couple of flying machines out on aerial recon.\n\nAt that point I sent someone south to find help, and we hunkered down to prepare for the worst. We turned all of our attention to making armor, weapons and robots so that we could head out there in full force.\n\nWhen we did a few days ago, we couldn't believe our eyes!"]="After a couple of days of silence, I sent a scouting party out to the platform. They never returned.\n\nI sent another group the next day with the same results, and lost a couple of flying machines out on aerial recon.\n\nAt that point I sent someone south to find help, and we hunkered down to prepare for the worst. We turned all of our attention to making armor, weapons and robots so that we could head out there in full force.\n\nWhen we did a few days ago, we couldn't believe our eyes!"
G["After a high tide in the Gokk'lokk Shallows in Dread Wastes, sometimes the increased fish activity loosens the kelp along the shore. \n \n Shrimp, octopus, and all manner'o'things get tangled up in there. I bet you could get you a small fortune o' Mantis Shrimp if you fished out there a while.\n \n  Let me know if you need help finding it."]="After a high tide in the Gokk'lokk Shallows in Dread Wastes, sometimes the increased fish activity loosens the kelp along the shore. \n \n Shrimp, octopus, and all manner'o'things get tangled up in there. I bet you could get you a small fortune o' Mantis Shrimp if you fished out there a while.\n \n  Let me know if you need help finding it."
G["After a moment's pause, the worg resumes the hunt."]="Atrás um momento de pausar, o huargo continue a caça."
G["After a quick assessment, you determine that this fellow has expired within the last several hours."]="Após uma avaliação rápida, você determina que esse sujeito expirou nas últimas horas."
G["After all that he did for YOU and YOUR people? MAK'GORA!"]="Depois de tudo o que fez por você e SEU povo? MAK'GORA!"
G["After all the Alliance has done to the pandaren, they still allow them here!"]="Depois de tudo o que fez a Aliança aos pandaren... ainda lhes deixam entrar?"
G["After all the punching, and the kicking, and the eating, and the drinking... someone's got to clean up.\n\nThat's where the groundskeeper comes in."]="After all the punching, and the kicking, and the eating, and the drinking... someone's got to clean up.\n\nThat's where the groundskeeper comes in."
G["After all these years of fighting, now everyone's falling in love!"]="Depois de tantos anos de enfrentamentos já ninguém se enamora!"
G["After all these years, can it really be --"]="Depois de tantos anos, pode ser...?"
G["After all this... our brothers and sisters passing, Lin captured by yaungol, my beer gone, I think it's time to move along.\nPerhaps I'll take the fight to the mantid..."]="After all this... our brothers and sisters passing, Lin captured by yaungol, my beer gone, I think it's time to move along.\nPerhaps I'll take the fight to the mantid..."
G["After all we've been through, we Gilneans have not given up hope."]="Depois de tudo o que passamos, nós Gilneans não perdemos a esperança."
G["After all we've been through?  Well, I didn't like you anyway!!"]="After all we've been through?  Well, I didn't like you anyway!!"
G["After countless failures of our agents to secure workable samples of Scourge blight for analysis, I've come up to the front lines myself to oversee the efforts. Like they say, if you want a job done right...."]="Após inúmeras falhas de nossos agentes em garantir amostras viáveis ​​do flagelo da Scourge para análise, eu mesmo fui até a linha de linha de frente para supervisionar os esforços. Como se costuma dizer, se você quer um trabalho bem feito..."
G["After every storm, comes the calm..."]="Depois de cada tempestade chega a calma..."
G["After everything, this is how it ends? Here on Darkcloud Pinnacle?"]="Depois de tudo, é assim como acaba? Aqui, na Cume da Nuvem Negra?"
G["After fighting the mogu, how much stronger could any other foes really be?"]="After fighting the mogu, how much stronger could any other foes really be?"
G["After him, quickly!"]="Atrás ele, rápi'o!"
G["After inspecting the statues, we saw a female pandaren emerge from the house."]="Atrás inspecionar as estátuas, vimos a uma pandaren sair da casa."
G["After inspecting the statues, we saw this old lady pandaren come out of the house."]="After inspecting the statues, we saw this old lady pandaren come out of the house."
G["After intense fighting, our supply route to Booty Bay has been reestablished."]="After intense fighting, our supply route to Booty Bay has been reestablished."
G["After scoutin' the three shrines, I headed back over to camp."]="After scoutin' the three shrines, I headed back over to camp."
G["After that Pilgrim's Bounty dinner, I took a huge smelly orc."]="After that Pilgrim's Bounty dinner, I took a huge smelly orc."
G["After that."]="Depois disso."
G["After the Plaguelands and the Battle for Light's Hope Chapel, I didn't think that we would witness anything more horrible.\n\nI was wrong."]="After the Plaguelands and the Battle for Light's Hope Chapel, I didn't think that we would witness anything more horrible.\n\nI was wrong."
G["After the battle, I recovered the sword from the field. I bore it to Northrend in the service of my prince, seeking to avenge our people's defeat."]="After the battle, I recovered the sword from the field. I bore it to Northrend in the service of my prince, seeking to avenge our people's defeat."
G["After the excavation trip to Mogujia, the Explorer's League brought their findings back to our city in the Vale o' Eternal Blossoms."]="After the excavation trip to Mogujia, the Explorer's League brought their findings back to our city in the Vale o' Eternal Blossoms."
G["After the fall of Dalaran, I took my leave from the Kirin Tor. I spent years watching over Atiesh, only to have my purpose amongst the Kirin Tor taken from me in one fell swoop. I would find the staff, though it might take a lifetime. That is how I came to join the Argent Dawn and why I am here now."]="Após a cai de Dalaran, saí do Kirin Tor. Passei anos vigiando Atiesh, apenas para ter meu objetivo entre os Kirin Tor jogou de mim de uma só vez. Eu encontraria a equipe, embora isso possa levar uma vida inteira. Foi assim que me juntei ao Argent Dawn e por que estou aqui agora."
G["After the fall of Karazhan, the Kirin Tor dispatched an assembly of mages to search the tower and seize all items of import... for the purposes of \"research.\" It was then that the fabled staff was discovered and brought back to Dalaran."]="Após a cai de Karazhan, o Kirin Tor enviou uma assembléia de magos para vasculhar a torre e apreender todos os itens de importação... para fins de \"pesquisa\". Foi então que a lendária equipe foi descoberta e trazida de volta para Dalaran."
G["After the fall of the Burning Blade Clan, we blademasters swore to free ourselves and our people from demonic control.\n\nThis may be done, but my honor remains unsatisfied.\n\nI shall fight for the Horde - and train other warriors to do so - until I die gloriously in battle. This is the only path I may tread."]="After the fall of the Burning Blade Clan, we blademasters swore to free ourselves and our people from demonic control.\n\nThis may be done, but my honor remains unsatisfied.\n\nI shall fight for the Horde - and train other warriors to do so - until I die gloriously in battle. This is the only path I may tread."
G["After the fall of the Burning Blade Clan, we blademasters swore to free ourselves and our people from demonic control.\n\nThis may be done, but my honor remains unsatisfied.\n\nI shall fight for the Horde - and train other warriors to do so - until I die gloriously in battle. This is the only path I may tread.\n\nSo. Are you ready to train?"]="After the fall of the Burning Blade Clan, we blademasters swore to free ourselves and our people from demonic control.\n\nThis may be done, but my honor remains unsatisfied.\n\nI shall fight for the Horde - and train other warriors to do so - until I die gloriously in battle. This is the only path I may tread.\n\nSo. Are you ready to train?"
G["After the firework show, they'll put out goblets so we can raise a toast!"]="Depois do show de fogos de artifício, eles colocam taças para que possamos fazer um brinde!"
G["After the fireworks, goblets will be put out. We will then toast our comrades!"]="After the fireworks, goblets will be put out. We will then toast our comrades!"
G["After the makrura attack, we could see that the Gallant would not survive another.  So I and the few surviving sailors abandoned my ship.\n\nWe are now ashore and will soon strike out for the town of Nijel's Point, but much danger lies between us and sanctuary, and I fear Desolace will consume us.\n\nI write this now in hopes that someone will know our plight, and some day avenge us against the watery fiends who were our ruin."]="After the makrura attack, we could see that the Gallant would not survive another.  So I and the few surviving sailors abandoned my ship.\n\nWe are now ashore and will soon strike out for the town of Nijel's Point, but much danger lies between us and sanctuary, and I fear Desolace will consume us.\n\nI write this now in hopes that someone will know our plight, and some day avenge us against the watery fiends who were our ruin."
G["After the race, I'll be sure to show you all my first place prize!"]="After the race, I'll be sure to show you all my first place prize!"
G["After the savagery that my people have witnessed and felt, you expect me to accept another burden, dragon? Surely you are mad."]="After the savagery that my people have witnessed and felt, you expect me to accept another burden, dragon? Surely you are mad."
G["After these negotiations, I am looking forward to a long and prosperous life."]="Depois das negociações, estou desejando aproveitar de uma larga e próspera vida."
G["After they boarded the ship, I closed my eyes and hid. Please don't make me talk about it..."]="After they boarded the ship, I closed my eyes and hid. Please don't make me talk about it..."
G["After this mobility test, we'll only have the final weapons check to complete."]="After this mobility test, we'll only have the final weapons check to complete."
G["After this, me and some of the boys are going to visit The Dancing Serpent Inn for some brew."]="After this, me and some of the boys are going to visit The Dancing Serpent Inn for some brew."
G["After we clean this place up, maybe we can start rebuilding it. Maybe they'll give it to Bravo Company. We'll call it: BRAVO KEEP!"]="After we clean this place up, maybe we can start rebuilding it. Maybe they'll give it to Bravo Company. We'll call it: BRAVO KEEP!"
G["After we're done here, I think I'll go to Ironforge. Get me a few pints of Ironforge's finest and some friendly dwarven wenches."]="After we're done here, I think I'll go to Ironforge. Get me a few pints of Ironforge's finest and some friendly dwarven wenches."
G["After what seemed an eternity, the Vindicator lost consciousness. The torture was too much, even for him. The cruel one - Matis as I found out he was called - attempted to wake Saruan by splashing contagion laced water across his ravaged body. But Saruan did not wake."]="After what seemed an eternity, the Vindicator lost consciousness. The torture was too much, even for him. The cruel one - Matis as I found out he was called - attempted to wake Saruan by splashing contagion laced water across his ravaged body. But Saruan did not wake."
G["After you get his attention - and you can be certain that if he sees you near the tower, you'll have his undue attention - face him and perform the Shattered /Salute. Let me demonstrate...."]="After you get his attention - and you can be certain that if he sees you near the tower, you'll have his undue attention - face him and perform the Shattered /Salute. Let me demonstrate...."
G["After you, my good sir."]="Depois de você, meu caro senhor."
G["After zhat ritual debacle, you owe me, $r.\n\nAnd I plan on collectink!"]="After zhat ritual debacle, you owe me, $r.\n\nAnd I plan on collectink!"
G["Afterwards, the father asked his cub what he had learned."]="Depois disso o pai perguntou ao filhote o que ele aprendera."
G["Again I strongly disagree with your view of the strategic situation. Your plan will spread our forces too thin. It will leave us with only a small force to assault Deatholme. I cannot in good conscience execute such a strategy."]="Again I strongly disagree with your view of the strategic situation. Your plan will spread our forces too thin. It will leave us with only a small force to assault Deatholme. I cannot in good conscience execute such a strategy."
G["Again with the flames and the hurt."]="E outra vez as chamas e o dor."
G["Again!"]="De novo!"
G["Again, I thank you, $n.  Without your aid we would never have been able to deal with the Shadow Council here at Grangol'var Village."]="Dou a você as Obrigado novamente, $n. Sem sua ajuda, não poderíamos haver derrotado ao Conselho da Sombra aqui no povo de Grangol'var."
G["Again, very nice strutting ladies."]="O repito, umas senhoritas deliciosas."
G["Again. We really need better friends."]="Again. We really need better friends."
G["Again...? Is this your plot, your scheme?"]="Outra vez...? É esta sua confabulação?"
G["Again...we are torn apart...again...to the cold darkness..."]="Outra vez... destrozados... outra vez... à fria escuridão..."
G["Again? Make it fast, Komak, I'm sick of this."]="Outra vez? Faça rápido, Komak, que já estou harta disso."
G["Again?!"]="Outra vez?!"
G["Against your will, you begin to unleash an |cFFFF0000|Hspell:122398|h[Amber Explosion]|h|r!"]="Against your will, you begin to unleash an |cFFFF0000|Hspell:122398|h[Amber Explosion]|h|r!"
G["Agamaggan will not rise again without BLOOD! His body demands sacrifice!"]="Agamaggan will not rise again without BLOOD! His body demands sacrifice!"
G["Agamath, the First Gate and Rohendor, the Second Gate are now destroyed. Only Archonisus, the Third Gate remains."]="Agamath, the First Gate and Rohendor, the Second Gate are now destroyed. Only Archonisus, the Third Gate remains."
G["Agamath, the First Gate has been breached. Two of Kil'jaeden's most powerful lieutenants, Lady Sacrolash and Grand Warlock Alythess, are now vulnerable to attack."]="Agamath, the First Gate has been breached. Two of Kil'jaeden's most powerful lieutenants, Lady Sacrolash and Grand Warlock Alythess, are now vulnerable to attack."
G["Agamath, the First Gate is breached and two of Kil'jaeden's lieutenants, Lady Sacrolash and Grand Warlock Alythess, must be destroyed.\n\nGather your friends, $c, and see to it! Rohendor, the Second Gate is our next target."]="Agamath, the First Gate is breached and two of Kil'jaeden's lieutenants, Lady Sacrolash and Grand Warlock Alythess, must be destroyed.\n\nGather your friends, $c, and see to it! Rohendor, the Second Gate is our next target."
G["Agara makes me look good, just like I make her look good."]="Agara makes me look good, just like I make her look good."
G["Agatha, show the Warchief!"]="Agatha, show the Warchief!"
G["Age has caught up with me it seems.  I cannot move as I once could, and so I've little left to offer my once friend..."]="Age has caught up with me it seems.  I cannot move as I once could, and so I've little left to offer my once friend..."
G["Agent Connelly, ain't it? That man's got some charm... and some nerve! His sweet words made me blush ten ways out of Ironforge!"]="Se chama agente Connelhy, não? É um homem com querida... e com descaro! Ao ouvir as coisas que me dizia me puse mais vermelha que as barbas de um Barba de Bronze!"
G["Agent Skully, I need you to use the banshee's magic mirror on me again!"]="Agente Skully, preciso que você use o espelho mágico da banshee em mim novamente!"
G["Agent Ya-six and I were given a high priority mission from Protectorate command to eradicate all signs of void creature infestation at Ultris. These were to be tactical strikes. Our last hit before returning to the Protectorate Watch Post was to be on a void lord named Arconus who had been getting fat off the fleshlings of the area.\n\nUnfortunately, we arrived a bit late. Ya-six and I got separated in the firefight with the flesh beasts. Now he's trapped inside, pinned down behind enemy lines."]="Agent Ya-six and I were given a high priority mission from Protectorate command to eradicate all signs of void creature infestation at Ultris. These were to be tactical strikes. Our last hit before returning to the Protectorate Watch Post was to be on a void lord named Arconus who had been getting fat off the fleshlings of the area.\n\nUnfortunately, we arrived a bit late. Ya-six and I got separated in the firefight with the flesh beasts. Now he's trapped inside, pinned down behind enemy lines."
G["Agents of the Cenarion Circle have uncovered disturbing information pertaining to the current situation in Eldre'Thalas.  I am at an impasse as to what to do about it, and I will no doubt soon seek the aid of able bodied beings capable of handling themselves in a fight.\n\nTo properly take action in Eldre'Thalas, however, is to understand the lore of an object known as the Fruit of Fertility."]="Agents of the Cenarion Circle have uncovered disturbing information pertaining to the current situation in Eldre'Thalas.  I am at an impasse as to what to do about it, and I will no doubt soon seek the aid of able bodied beings capable of handling themselves in a fight.\n\nTo properly take action in Eldre'Thalas, however, is to understand the lore of an object known as the Fruit of Fertility."
G["Ages ago the demon lord Kil'jaeden subjected the shaman, Ner'zhul, to a seemingly endless torture before sealing his soul in a frozen crystal. It is this prison, forged in the depths of the twisting nether, that we have come to call the Frozen Throne.\n\nIt was not until Arthas smashed the crystal with Frostmourne that he merged with the soul of Ner'zhul and became the Lich King. This breaking of the throne created the frozen fragments of [shadowfrost] that now lie scattered throughout the citadel."]="Ages ago the demon lord Kil'jaeden subjected the shaman, Ner'zhul, to a seemingly endless torture before sealing his soul in a frozen crystal. It is this prison, forged in the depths of the twisting nether, that we have come to call the Frozen Throne.\n\nIt was not until Arthas smashed the crystal with Frostmourne that he merged with the soul of Ner'zhul and became the Lich King. This breaking of the throne created the frozen fragments of [shadowfrost] that now lie scattered throughout the citadel."
G["Aggggh!  I'm hit!  You're going to have to get us back!  Quick, before the plane explodes!"]="Aggggh!  I'm hit!  You're going to have to get us back!  Quick, before the plane explodes!"
G["Aggghh! The powers of the Sunwell... turn... against me! What have you done? What have you done???"]="Aggghh! Os poderes da Nascente do Sol... se voltam... contra mim! Que vocês têm feito? Que vocês têm feito???"
G["Aggh!"]="Aaah!"
G["Aggh!! No longer will I be a slave to Malygos! Challenge me and you will be destroyed!"]="Aggh!! No longer will I be a slave to Malygos! Challenge me and you will be destroyed!"
G["Agghh!"]="Agghh!"
G["Agghh!  So many of them!"]="Agghh!  So many of them!"
G["Agghh! Well done! Now this gets... interesting..."]="Aggh! Bem feito! Isto se coloca... interessante..."
G["Agghh!! Help me before I lose my mind!"]="Agghh!! Help me before I lose my mind!"
G["Agghh!! Tharon'ja will have more!"]="Aaagh!! Tharon'ja vem a por mais!"
G["Agghhhh! Do... not... rejoice! Your victory is a hollow one, for I shall return with powers beyond your imagining!"]="Agghhhh! Do... not... rejoice! Your victory is a hollow one, for I shall return with powers beyond your imagining!"
G["Aggra is nearly drowned! Save her!"]="Aggra is nearly drowned! Save her!"
G["Aggra shoots Gavan a disapproving look."]="Aggra lança a Gavan uma olhar de reproche."
G["Aggra's Fury."]="Fúria de Aggra."
G["Aggra, I am ready to travel to Deepholm."]="Aggra, estou pronto para viajar a Infralar."
G["Aggra, I am ready to travel to the Abyssal Maw."]="Aggra, estou pronto para viajar à Fauce Asa."
G["Aggra, I am ready. Let us go to Thrall."]="Aggra, estou pronto. Vamos por Thrall."
G["Aggra, I should not be long. The Darkspear are a strong people and I doubt they have much need of my assistance."]="Aggra, I should not be long. The Darkspear are a strong people and I doubt they have much need of my assistance."
G["Aggra, I... I can't hold on... AAH!"]="Aggra... eu... não posso mais... AAH!"
G["Aggra, my heart... you never gave up on me. I owe you my life... everything that I am."]="Aggra, my heart... you never gave up on me. I owe you my life... everything that I am."
G["Aggra... $n..."]="$n, Aggra... é você..."
G["Aggra... I heard your voice... calling me back...\n\nWhere are we?"]="Aggra... I heard your voice... calling me back...\n\nWhere are we?"
G["Aggra... it IS you..."]="Aggra... É você..."
G["Aggra... this can't be... this has gone too far..."]="Aggra... Não pode ser... Isto tem ido demais longe."
G["Aggra... though I was not born on Draenor, I have always tried to honor the traditions of our ancestors..."]="Aggra... Embora não nací em Draenor, sempre e tentou honrar as tradições de nossos ancestrais..."
G["Aggra? Aggra! I can't hear-"]="Aggra? Aggra! I can't hear-"
G["Aggron! Show 'em who's boss!"]="Aggron! Mostra pra eles quem é que manda!"
G["Agh!"]="Aahhh!"
G["Agh! Damn you, Mal'Ganis! Father... Jaina... I have failed Lordaeron...."]="Agh! Maldito seja, Mal'Ganis! Para... Jaina... E falhado a Lordaeron..."
G["Agh! My wards!"]="Agh! Meus resguardos!"
G["Agh... a chill ran up my spine."]="Agh... a chill ran up my spine."
G["Agh... me am...dead."]="Agh... eu... estar... $gmuerto: morta;."
G["Aghhh!  My sssphere!"]="Aaagh! Meu esssfera!"
G["Agrant? Nellie? Isn't it a bit dangerous to be outside of the zeppelin?"]="Agrant? Nelhie? Não é um pouco perigoso estar fosse do zepelim?"
G["Agreed, brother, but the Horde fights many fires these days and the Vanguard are few in number..."]="Agreed, brother, but the Horde fights many fires these days and the Vanguard are few in number..."
G["Agreed."]="De acordo."
G["Agreed.  So what do you want from me?"]="Estou de acordo. Que que de mim?"
G["Agreed. Budd's scraped together rif-raf from all over creation.\n\nSeems when there's free booze to be had, there be plenty of folk willin' to set aside their differences."]="Agreed. Budd's scraped together rif-raf from all over creation.\n\nSeems when there's free booze to be had, there be plenty of folk willin' to set aside their differences."
G["Agreed. Messenger, you may carry word of our plans back to Lord Lor'themar, but make it clear that I will not tolerate any further interference."]="De acordo. Mensageiro, levará as notícia sobre nossos planos a Lorde Lor'themar, mas de bem claro que não pretendo tolerar mais intromissões."
G["Ah - I've been waiting for a real challenge!"]="Ah! Há tempo que esperava um autêntico desafio!"
G["Ah - hah! Busted!"]="Ah - hah! Busted!"
G["Ah - here comes Alexstrasza now."]="Ah, aí vem Alexstrasza."
G["Ah - oddities and rarities. We specialize in Azeroth's more unique items for the discerning adventurer.\n\nSince you're speaking with me, you must already have an idea of what you're looking for."]="Ah - oddities and rarities. We specialize in Azeroth's more unique items for the discerning adventurer.\n\nSince you're speaking with me, you must already have an idea of what you're looking for."
G["Ah - oddities and rarities. We specialize in Azeroth's more unique items for the discerning adventurer.\n\nSince you're speaking with me, you must already have an idea of what you're looking for. So, $n, which item are you interested in?"]="Ah - oddities and rarities. We specialize in Azeroth's more unique items for the discerning adventurer.\n\nSince you're speaking with me, you must already have an idea of what you're looking for. So, $n, which item are you interested in?"
G["Ah I am too busy for a drink now lad."]="Não tenho tempo para pegar uma copa, $gchaval: garota;."
G["Ah a visitor! Must be an adventurer, we don't get many tourists down this way. Grab a chair and a drink, make yourself comfortable. Say, you look like you have some meat on your bones. You thinkin about competing in the cage matches?"]="Ah, visitante! Deve ser um aventureiro, não temos muitos turistas por aqui. Pegue uma cadeira e uma bebida, fique à vontade. Diga, parece que você tem um pouco de carne nos ossos. Você está pensando em competir nas partidas da jaula?"
G["Ah ah ah..."]="Mmh mmh mh..."
G["Ah am very surprised that one wit such a careless nature has gotten dis far...\n\nYah, you may have another charm, but Mau'ari is very displeased wit your actions!\n\nGo, now."]="Ah am very surprised that one wit such a careless nature has gotten dis far...\n\nYah, you may have another charm, but Mau'ari is very displeased wit your actions!\n\nGo, now."
G["Ah friend, I only help hunters and their pets."]="Ah amigo, só ajudo caçadores e seus animais de estimação."
G["Ah good! You found the safari. That jungle is a little rough to navigate without some travel sense.\n\nThose mogu kept getting in the way of my hunting."]="Ah good! You found the safari. That jungle is a little rough to navigate without some travel sense.\n\nThose mogu kept getting in the way of my hunting."
G["Ah good, there $g he : she; is... my future $g master : mistress; of the elements! What kind of training would you like today?"]="Ah, bem, aqui está... $gEl: A; $gfuturo: futura; $gsenhor: senhora; dos elementais! Que classe de treinamento te interesse hoje?"
G["Ah ha ha!  Well done!"]="Ha, ja, ja! Bem feito!"
G["Ah ken see very well through this haze, but I'd know tha' smell anywhere!  Die ye foul ogre!"]="Ah ken see very well through this haze, but I'd know tha' smell anywhere!  Die ye foul ogre!"
G["Ah not a traitor mon! Ya not gonna be shacklin' me again."]="Eu não sou um traidor, colega! A mim não me vuelves a esposar."
G["Ah ya ta ta! Don't worry, you in the right place. But let's first see if I like what comes out of your face."]="Ah ya ta ta! Don't worry, you in the right place. But let's first see if I like what comes out of your face."
G["Ah yes, I can smell it from here!"]="Ah yes, I can smell it from here!"
G["Ah yes, I have read of you, $n."]="Ah, sim, e lida sobre você por aí, $n."
G["Ah yes, I've heard about him. He's down at the brewery, right?\n\nI can take you there when you're ready."]="Ah, sim. Ouvi falar de ele. Está na cervejaria, verdade?\n\nPosso levar você até ali quando o consideres oportuno."
G["Ah yes, I've heard about him. He's visiting Halfhill with Mudmug, right?\n\nI can take you there when you're ready."]="Ah yes, I've heard about him. He's visiting Halfhill with Mudmug, right?\n\nI can take you there when you're ready."
G["Ah yes, I've heard about him. He's visiting Mudmug's Place, right?\n\nI can take you when you're ready."]="Ah yes, I've heard about him. He's visiting Mudmug's Place, right?\n\nI can take you when you're ready."
G["Ah yes, I've heard about him. He's visiting Pang's Stead, over in Thunderfoot Fields.\n\nYou ready to go?"]="Ah, sim. Ouvi falar de ele. Está visitando a Finca de Pang nas Granjas Pé Atronador.\n\nEstá $gpronto: pronta; para partir?"
G["Ah yes, Sironas. I had nearly forgotten that Sironas was here. I served under Sironas back on Outland. I hadn't heard of this abomination, though; those damnable draenei captured me before I even fully materialized on this world."]="Ah sim, Sironas. Eu quase tinha esquecido que Sironas estava aqui. Eu servi sob Sironas em Outland. Eu não tinha ouvido falar dessa abominação; aqueles malditos draeneis me capturaram antes mesmo de eu me materializar completamente neste mundo."
G["Ah yes, Skinning.  There is no one finer in wielding a skinning knife than Yonn Deepcut.  You can find him in the great tent at the northwest corner of the village."]="Ah sim, Skinning. Não há ninguém melhor em empunhar uma faca que o Yonn Deepcut. Você pode encontrá-o na grande tenda no canto noroeste da vila."
G["Ah yes, and promptly delivered.  As always, it's a pleasure doing business with you, Corbett."]="Ah yes, and promptly delivered.  As always, it's a pleasure doing business with you, Corbett."
G["Ah yes, another who will stoke the fires and forge the weapons of war. Of course I will teach you how."]="Ah sim, outro que acenderá o fogo e forjará as armas de guerra. Claro que vou ensinar como."
G["Ah yes, it is Seikwa that you must find.  I believe I saw her last standing out in front of the inn."]="Ah sim, é Seikwa que você deve encontrar. Acredito que a vi pela última vez em linha de frente à pousada."
G["Ah yes, our assault on the Horde town of Taurajo. I struggled with the implications of the decision.\n\nTaurajo was admittedly what you might call a 'soft target,' primarily a hunters' camp. Still, it had been used to recruit, equip, and train Horde infantry for many years.\n\nWhen our scouts reported that Taurajo's most dangerous units were out on the hunt, we had to act quickly."]="Ah yes, our assault on the Horde town of Taurajo. I struggled with the implications of the decision.\n\nTaurajo was admittedly what you might call a 'soft target,' primarily a hunters' camp. Still, it had been used to recruit, equip, and train Horde infantry for many years.\n\nWhen our scouts reported that Taurajo's most dangerous units were out on the hunt, we had to act quickly."
G["Ah yes. I've heard all about those new flarged things. Armor was removed from the casing to decrease weight. Bargh! Nonsense!"]="Ah yes. I've heard all about those new flarged things. Armor was removed from the casing to decrease weight. Bargh! Nonsense!"
G["Ah yes. One does not forget the taste of amber."]="Ah yes. One does not forget the taste of amber."
G["Ah yes... Wakener, doesn't the scent of blood fill you with new strength?"]="Ah yes... Wakener, doesn't the scent of blood fill you with new strength?"
G["Ah!  Cease the incantations, Anchorite!  Cease, or I will show you such pain that your pathetic people have never imagined!"]="Ah!  Cease the incantations, Anchorite!  Cease, or I will show you such pain that your pathetic people have never imagined!"
G["Ah!  Get back over here!"]="Ah! Volta aqui!"
G["Ah!  My wounds are too severe.  Defenders, fight on without me!"]="Ah! Meus feridas são demais graves. Defensores, sigam lutando sem mim!"
G["Ah!  Please, if you see a survivor of Darrowshire, tell them I am free!"]="Ah! Por favor, se você vir um sobrevivente de Darrowshire, diga que estou livre!"
G["Ah!  There is my ratchet!  Now let's re-attach these scroll fragments."]="Ah!  There is my ratchet!  Now let's re-attach these scroll fragments."
G["Ah!  Umm... hello there.  I was just inspecting this shell, here.  Carry on!  Nothing to see here!"]="Ah! Umm... Olá. Eu estava apenas inspecionando esta concha, aqui. Continue! Nada para ver aqui!"
G["Ah! $p! My daughter! I... a vision, she... she's in trouble!"]="Ah! $p! Meu filha! Eu... uma visão, está... está em perigo!"
G["Ah! A challenge!"]="Ah! Um desafio!"
G["Ah! A fan of potions? The brewmasters work their concoctions but often miss some of the finer notes to a potion or remedy."]="Ah! A fan of potions? The brewmasters work their concoctions but often miss some of the finer notes to a potion or remedy."
G["Ah! A grummlepack. Most good."]="Ah! Um pacote grúmel. Muito bem."
G["Ah! A luckydo comes to learn? I have many skills to teach."]="Ah! A luckydo comes to learn? I have many skills to teach."
G["Ah! A luckydo comes to the great Grummle Bazaar eh? I smell good fortune in our meeting.\n\nI am called the Lucky Eightcoins. I am named for my best luckydo, the one that gives most pungent smelling fortune."]="Ah! A luckydo comes to the great Grummle Bazaar eh? I smell good fortune in our meeting.\n\nI am called the Lucky Eightcoins. I am named for my best luckydo, the one that gives most pungent smelling fortune."
G["Ah! A very bold decision in times like these. Your honesty is refreshing!\n\nTell me, leader of the Kirin Tor, what if the Horde killed your friends? Your family? Destroyed everything you had. Could you maintain your convictions even then, Archmage $p?"]="Ah! A very bold decision in times like these. Your honesty is refreshing!\n\nTell me, leader of the Kirin Tor, what if the Horde killed your friends? Your family? Destroyed everything you had. Could you maintain your convictions even then, Archmage $p?"
G["Ah! Champion, we were just talking about you."]="Ah! Logo estávamos falando de ti."
G["Ah! Don't talk to me! Tank! Tank! Taunt it off me you filthy thing!"]="Ah! Nem me fale! Tanque! Tanque! Quítame esta asquerosidade de acima!"
G["Ah! Facefull of $c!"]="Ah! Ração de $c!"
G["Ah! Fresh air at last! I never thought I'd see the day..."]="Ah! Ao fim, ar fresco! Achava que este dia nunca lhegaría..."
G["Ah! Good fortune to one who times a rescue well."]="Ah! Boa fortuna a quem organiza um resgate logo a tempo."
G["Ah! Good! You made it. It is time to teach these \"pirate\" hozen why they should not raid our villages."]="Ah! Good! You made it. It is time to teach these \"pirate\" hozen why they should not raid our villages."
G["Ah! Haha - I can see now what your Alliance fights for."]="Ah! Ha, ja. Já vejo por que luta seu Aliança."
G["Ah! Help! Sprites!"]="Ah! Socorro! Duendes!"
G["Ah! Here we are. Over 14,000 years ago, this entire land was ruled by a terrible race of warlords called \"the mogu.\""]="Ah, aqui está. Quatorze mil anos atrás, estas terras eram governadas por uma terrível raça de guerreiros conhecidos como \"mogus\"."
G["Ah! Hero, we were just talking about you."]="Ah! Logo estávamos falando de ti."
G["Ah! I forgot to reverse the bipolar collaboration inverter."]="Ah! Se me olvidó desativar o inversor de colaboração bipolar."
G["Ah! I was sent here to guide you to the Timeless Isle, but I see you have already made the voyage. I fear I have gotten tangled up in the timeways again."]="Ah! I was sent here to guide you to the Timeless Isle, but I see you have already made the voyage. I fear I have gotten tangled up in the timeways again."
G["Ah! It's comin' right for me!"]="Ah! Vem a por mí!"
G["Ah! Look! Goregek can start big-tongue necklace!"]="Oh! Olhe! Goregek pode começar o colar de grislíngua-grande!"
G["Ah! My cooldowns!"]="Ah! Meus tempos de reutilização!"
G["Ah! Needles on my face!"]="Ah! Tenho pinchos na rosto!"
G["Ah! Now that was a proper smiting. There is hope for you yet."]="Ah! Isso si que foi uma surra como é devido. Igual se você pode fazer algo com você depois de tudo."
G["Ah! Quality materials."]="Ah! Materiais de qualidade."
G["Ah! Saurok on-board! Saurok on-board!"]="Ah! Saurok a bordo! Saurok a bordo!"
G["Ah! So you seek items of wonder? Well you have come to the right place!"]="Ah! Ouvidos itens de lendas? Tem vindo ao lugar adequado!"
G["Ah! That was close! Quick, quick, stand under metal pole thing! That keep us safe, yeah?"]="Ah! That was close! Quick, quick, stand under metal pole thing! That keep us safe, yeah?"
G["Ah! The \"hero\" who stole my spotlight at Stoneplow.\n\nI kid, I kid. That was a great battle. I am honored to have fought by your side."]="Ah! $GEl \"herói\": A \"heroína\"; que me roubou o protagonismo em Vilharroca.\n\nÉ uma broma, é uma broma. Essa foi uma grande batalha. É uma honra haver lutado ao seu lado."
G["Ah! The final piece of the puzzle. The Thunder King took on the powers of Ra-Den, the very essence of a Titan. He united the mogu into an empire and tried to continue the Titans' work. Of course he saw himself as a God!"]="Ah, a peça final do quebra-cabeça. O Rei Trovão tomou o poder de Ra-Den, a própria essência de um titã. Ele reuniu os mogus em um império e tentou continuar o trabalho dos titãs. Ele se via como um Deus!"
G["Ah! This ring will do nicely..."]="Ah! Este anel servirá..."
G["Ah! This will give me a chance to test out my Tunnel-Tron Mk V! Hold on tight!"]="Ah! Isso vai me dar a chance de testar o Tunelatron Mk V! Segurem as ceroulas!"
G["Ah! Upon this table, you see Spirit-Sage Gaoquan, the oldest member of our monastery."]="Ah! Nesta mesa se encontre o sábio espiritual Gaoquan, o membro mais antigo de nosso monastério."
G["Ah! We can tell him Hagash stumbled into it and fired it accidentally!"]="Ah! We can tell him Hagash stumbled into it and fired it accidentally!"
G["Ah! You have a clean spot, $gbrother:sister;. Let me just get that for you..."]="Ah! Tem uma parte limpa, $ghermano: irmã;. De que o arregle..."
G["Ah! You wish to learn of our last and greatest emperor, Shaohao? My friend, I do not have the time here to recount all of his adventures, but his actions ten thousand years ago resonate to this very day."]="Ah! Você quer aprender sobre Shaohao, nosso último e maior imperador? Camarada, eu não tenho tempo para contar todas as aventuras dele, mas o que ele fez há dez mil anos ainda ressoa até hoje."
G["Ah, $c, good to see you. We need assistance here with gathering supplies in preparation for the impending war at Ahn'Qiraj. I've been asked to put together a great many first aid field kits, and the primary component I need is wool bandages. I already have some, $2079w to be exact, but I need to collect $2080w."]="Ah, $c, good to see you. We need assistance here with gathering supplies in preparation for the impending war at Ahn'Qiraj. I've been asked to put together a great many first aid field kits, and the primary component I need is wool bandages. I already have some, $2079w to be exact, but I need to collect $2080w."
G["Ah, $gMaster:Mistress; $n, how might I be of assistance?"]="Ah, meu $gsenhor: senhora; $n. Em O que posso ajudar você?"
G["Ah, $gpriest:priestess;, you came along just in time. I appreciate it."]="Ah, $gsacerdote: sacerdotisa;, veio logo a tempo. Te o agradeço."
G["Ah, $n - it is good to see you again.  I trust your affairs go well."]="Ah, $n - it is good to see you again.  I trust your affairs go well."
G["Ah, $n!  You're just the person I was hoping to see!  We have enough supplies to send a ground assault against the Horde!  Field Marshal Teravaine is waiting in the Field of Strife for orders...\n\nYou're a brave veteran who's proven himself time and again.  Do you want to deliver Teravaine the orders?"]="Ah, $n! É logo a pessoa que esperava ver! Temos suficientes suprimentos para lançar um ataque terrestre contra a Horda. O Marechal de campo Teravaine está esperando ordens na Terra de Disputa...\n\nTem mostrou ser um veterano com muito coragem. Que entregar as ordens a Teravaine?"
G["Ah, $n! A little bird told me you would be coming.\n\nThat's how Aviana sends messages around."]="Ah, $n! A little bird told me you would be coming.\n\nThat's how Aviana sends messages around."
G["Ah, $n! We meet once more. I helped you attain your swift flight form in Outland.\n\n<Morthis tightens his jaw and shakes his head, his withered eyes sad.>\n\nThese young druids today... they have it too easy."]="Ah, $n! We meet once more. I helped you attain your swift flight form in Outland.\n\n<Morthis tightens his jaw and shakes his head, his withered eyes sad.>\n\nThese young druids today... they have it too easy."
G["Ah, $n, don't cry. Lucky for you, when last you gave me the amulet, I attuned myself to it. I'll just summon it back from wherever you dropped it.\n\nTry looking in your bags now."]="$n, não chore. Por sorte para você, a última vez que me deu o amuleto entrei em sintonia com ele. Farei que venha de onde quer que que te tenha caído.\n\nVerifique agora seus bolsas."
G["Ah, $n, ya heart be a worthy sacrifice!"]="Ah, $n, seu coração servirá de sacrifício!"
G["Ah, $p! I was searching for the Hidden Master when I came across this big purple thing with a bunch of little purple things inside.\n\nLooks like an old mogu magic trap. Thankfully they don't know how to build these anymore."]="Ah, $p! I was searching for the Hidden Master when I came across this big purple thing with a bunch of little purple things inside.\n\nLooks like an old mogu magic trap. Thankfully they don't know how to build these anymore."
G["Ah, $p! Just the $c I've been looking for.\n\nDo you remember how the Alliance came to Pandaria? You were there, weren't you? But your presence in that part of Pandaria's timeline is... incomplete. You saw only a portion of the events which transpired that day.\n\nMaybe you fled the chaos of war to walk the peaceful valleys of this land. Or perhaps the call of treasure from dungeons exotic and ancient was louder than the call of your king to find his White Pawn.\n\nRegardless, I am not here to judge. I merely offer a second chance.\n\nSay the word, and I will transport you back to that day. Lion's Landing will not yet have been built, and the Skyfire will loom over Jade Forest."]="Ah, $p! Just the $c I've been looking for.\n\nDo you remember how the Alliance came to Pandaria? You were there, weren't you? But your presence in that part of Pandaria's timeline is... incomplete. You saw only a portion of the events which transpired that day.\n\nMaybe you fled the chaos of war to walk the peaceful valleys of this land. Or perhaps the call of treasure from dungeons exotic and ancient was louder than the call of your king to find his White Pawn.\n\nRegardless, I am not here to judge. I merely offer a second chance.\n\nSay the word, and I will transport you back to that day. Lion's Landing will not yet have been built, and the Skyfire will loom over Jade Forest."
G["Ah, $p! These \"sunwalkers\" may not be the Hidden Master, but their fighting style is unlike anything I have ever seen.\n\nI intend to learn from them."]="Ah, $p! Talvez estes \"caminasol\" não sejam o mestre oculto, mas seu estilo de luta não se parece a nada que tenha visto antes.\n\nQuero aprender de eles."
G["Ah, $r, you have returned!"]="Ah, $r, you have returned!"
G["Ah, $r... I possess great knowledge a' da world and how ta create charms a' great power."]="Ah, $r... I possess great knowledge a' da world and how ta create charms a' great power."
G["Ah, $rs are most useful. Should have more $rs for rainy day."]="Ah, $rs are most useful. Should have more $rs for rainy day."
G["Ah, Alterac Valley, I have fine memories I tell ya.  <sigh>  Well, I cannot join ya, but do me proud just the same!  To get there you'll be wanting to speak with Glordrum Steelbeard at the Hall of Arms here in Ironforge."]="Ah, Alterac Valley, tenho boas lembranças que lhe digo. <sigh> Bem, eu não posso me juntar a você, mas me orgulho da mesma forma! Para chegar lá, você vai querer falar com Glordrum Steelbeard no Hall of Arms aqui em Ironforge."
G["Ah, Braenna Flintcrag.  She has magic hands, that one.  Braenna is the one to see about Priestly matters.  \nYe'll want to travel north from the gates of Ironforge to the Hall of Mysteries.  That's where ye'll find her."]="Ah, Braenna Flintcrag.  She has magic hands, that one.  Braenna is the one to see about Priestly matters.  \nYe'll want to travel north from the gates of Ironforge to the Hall of Mysteries.  That's where ye'll find her."
G["Ah, Champion! You should return every tournament. I will make a fortune."]="Ah, Champion! You should return every tournament. I will make a fortune."
G["Ah, Chimaeron, truly a living testament to my scientific prowess. I reworked and twisted his form countless times over the years, and the final result is truly something to behold."]="Ah, Chimaeron, truly a living testament to my scientific prowess. I reworked and twisted his form countless times over the years, and the final result is truly something to behold."
G["Ah, Deino, mah sistah. Ta'zinni die now."]="Ah, Deino, mah sistah. Ta'zinni die now."
G["Ah, I be needin' a new shrunken head...."]="Ah, vou precisar uma nova cabeça reduci'a..."
G["Ah, I believe Gimble Thistlefuzz is who ye'll be needing if yer looking to learn the Enchanter's profession.  Ye'll find Gimble in his shop, Thistlefuzz Arcanery, right by the Gryphon Master at The Great Forge."]="Ah, acredito que Gimble Thistlefuzz é quem você precisará se procura aprender a profissão do Encantador. Você encontrará Gimble na sua loja, Thistlefuzz Arcanery, ao lado ao Gryphon Master na Great Forge."
G["Ah, I can sense it - you've won the day! I believe I can safely transport you to Stratholme now, provided you've paid my colleague there a visit first. Just step into the circle and be patient..."]="Ah, I can sense it - you've won the day! I believe I can safely transport you to Stratholme now, provided you've paid my colleague there a visit first. Just step into the circle and be patient..."
G["Ah, I love the smell of Stonard! It smells like... like... orc sweat. And rot. Still, combined, the effect can be quite pleasant! It's an acquired scent."]="Ah, I love the smell of Stonard! It smells like... like... orc sweat. And rot. Still, combined, the effect can be quite pleasant! It's an acquired scent."
G["Ah, I remember now! I gave the mysterious fossil to Hollee! Check with her."]="Ah, I remember now! I gave the mysterious fossil to Hollee! Check with her."
G["Ah, I see it now in your mind.  This is the work of one of my former students... Mehlar Dawnblade.  It is sad to know that his heart has turned so dark."]="Ah, I see it now in your mind.  This is the work of one of my former students... Mehlar Dawnblade.  It is sad to know that his heart has turned so dark."
G["Ah, I see what kind of $c you are, $n! Now then, the second verse is all about Fanny and Firebeard getting together.\n\nWhat rhymes with \"Professed?\""]="Ah, I see what kind of $c you are, $n! Now then, the second verse is all about Fanny and Firebeard getting together.\n\nWhat rhymes with \"Professed?\""
G["Ah, I see you are a friend to the Consortium. Perhaps you would be interested in making a purchase?"]="Ah, vejo que você é amigo do Consórcio. Talvez você esteja interessado em fazer uma compra?"
G["Ah, I see you have found a few of my experiments.  Step closer, and you may witness the full glory of my work here."]="Ah, I see you have found a few of my experiments.  Step closer, and you may witness the full glory of my work here."
G["Ah, I see you toil with relics of the past."]="Ah, I see you toil with relics of the past."
G["Ah, I see.  Looks like I'm part of the Horde now."]="Ah, entendo. Ao parecer agora formo parte da Horda."
G["Ah, I see.  Well, I guess I'm off to work then."]="Ah, entendo. Bom, suponho que então vuelvo ao trabalho."
G["Ah, I see..."]="Ah, já vejo..."
G["Ah, I suppose that I am getting ahead of myself. Ras Frostwhisper is the overseer of this school. The being responsible for training all of its Dark Masters. A lieutenant and favored pupil of Kel'Thuzad. He was once a hedge mage of Stromgarde: A rogue wizard that never received his formal training from Dalaran.\n\nWhen Kel'Thuzad opened the Cult, Ras was among the first to join his ranks. Ras knew that through dark magic, he would find immortality."]="Ah, I suppose that I am getting ahead of myself. Ras Frostwhisper is the overseer of this school. The being responsible for training all of its Dark Masters. A lieutenant and favored pupil of Kel'Thuzad. He was once a hedge mage of Stromgarde: A rogue wizard that never received his formal training from Dalaran.\n\nWhen Kel'Thuzad opened the Cult, Ras was among the first to join his ranks. Ras knew that through dark magic, he would find immortality."
G["Ah, I understand.  Off to work!"]="Ah, entendo. A trabalhar!"
G["Ah, I'll make him some fresh bread! I need to get some flour from Martha!"]="Ah, I'll make him some fresh bread! I need to get some flour from Martha!"
G["Ah, Lieutenant General Orion. I've come to report that casualties are well within acceptable levels for this operation. In fact, the wounded are quite... ah... lively."]="Ah, Lieutenant General Orion. I've come to report that casualties are well within acceptable levels for this operation. In fact, the wounded are quite... ah... lively."
G["Ah, Maloriak. How gracious of you to finally appear from that quarantine you call a laboratory. What have you got this time?"]="Ah, Maloriak. Que considerado pela sua parte que tenha saindo desse confinamento que você chamas laboratório. Que tem esta vez?"
G["Ah, Nazgrim. A great leader and a fine warrior. He valued his oath to the Warchief more than his life."]="Ah, Nazgrim. A great leader and a fine warrior. He valued his oath to the Warchief more than his life."
G["Ah, Ner'zhul. Not a name that should be uttered lightly, but I did ask you for an answer.\n\nAnd Ner'zhul is the correct one."]="Ah, Ner'zhul. Não é um nome que se possa pronunciar tranquilamente, mas te pedí uma resposta.\n\nE Ner'zhul é a correta."
G["Ah, Noblegarden. So amusing to watch others throw away their dignity in favor of hunting colored eggs. Still, they do have a curious magical aura to them..."]="Ah, Noblegarden. Tão divertido ver os outros jogarem fosse sua dignidade em favor da caça de ovos coloridos. Ainda assim, eles têm uma aura mágica curiosa para eles..."
G["Ah, Private Hendel. A pleasure to meet one of the men who would betray his kingdom for pride."]="Ah, Private Hendel. A pleasure to meet one of the men who would betray his kingdom for pride."
G["Ah, Stonebrow doesn't leave Ironforge much these days so if ye're looking to learn the tailor's profession ye'll have to go to see him up in Ironforge."]="Ah, Stonebrow não deixa muito o Ironforge hoje em dia, por isso, se você quer aprender a profissão do alfaiate, precisará ir vê-o no Ironforge."
G["Ah, The Gilded Rose... with its soft down beds and warm baths... just thinking about that Inn makes me want to... ::yawn:: Lucky you if you're heading over there...  you will find it in the west side of the Trade District.   ...nice soft pillows, warm blankets.  ::yawn::"]="Ah, The Gilded Rose... com as suas camas macias e banhos quentes... só de pensar nessa pousada me faz querer...:: bocejar:: Sorte sua se você estiver indo para lá... você encontre-o no lado oeste do Distrito Comercial.... travesseiros macios e agradáveis, cobertores quentes.:: bocejar::"
G["Ah, Tortolla! Often misunderstood and always, always underestimated. Creatures who move effortlessly between land and sea look to Tortolla as their patron ancient.\n\nTen thousand years ago the Burning Legion invaded Azeroth, and Tortolla was among the ancients who took to the field of battle alongside Cenarius and the mortal races.\n\nAs the demon hordes crashed against the front lines of the beleaguered defenders, they didn't know what to make of Tortolla. At first they tried to ignore him, but his terrible weight and crushing jaws laid waste to hundreds..."]="Ah, Tortolla! Often misunderstood and always, always underestimated. Creatures who move effortlessly between land and sea look to Tortolla as their patron ancient.\n\nTen thousand years ago the Burning Legion invaded Azeroth, and Tortolla was among the ancients who took to the field of battle alongside Cenarius and the mortal races.\n\nAs the demon hordes crashed against the front lines of the beleaguered defenders, they didn't know what to make of Tortolla. At first they tried to ignore him, but his terrible weight and crushing jaws laid waste to hundreds..."
G["Ah, Ysera the Dreamer."]="Ah, Ysera a Sonhadora."
G["Ah, Zaetar... <Celebras looks away.>\n\nMy father, Remulos, tried to stop him...\n\nZaetar was headstrong, and when he fell for an earthen elemental princess, my father knew that their union was cursed, but Zaetar refused to listen.\n\nThe centaur are the result of his mistake. They were born misshapen and hateful; my uncle Zaetar was killed by his own kin...\n\nThe evil princess, Theradras, still guards his remains here in the crystal caverns."]="Ah, Zaetar... <Celebras looks away.>\n\nMy father, Remulos, tried to stop him...\n\nZaetar was headstrong, and when he fell for an earthen elemental princess, my father knew that their union was cursed, but Zaetar refused to listen.\n\nThe centaur are the result of his mistake. They were born misshapen and hateful; my uncle Zaetar was killed by his own kin...\n\nThe evil princess, Theradras, still guards his remains here in the crystal caverns."
G["Ah, a $r. I haven't killed one of your kind in a while."]="Ah, $gun: uma; $r. Há muito que não mato a um dos seu raça."
G["Ah, a brawler are ye'? You'll find your pandaren friend at the Stonefire Tavern."]="Assim que te gosta pelear? Encontrar ao seu amigo pandaren na Taberna Rocha de Fogo."
G["Ah, a chance to use this freshly sharpened blade."]="Ah, a chance to use this freshly sharpened blade."
G["Ah, a fellow Fisherman. Are you perhaps in need of a little training? Maybe I can show you a thing or two?"]="Ah, um companheiro pescador. Talvez você precise de um pouco de treinamento? Talvez eu possa lhe mostrar uma coisa ou duas?"
G["Ah, a fellow ranger. What do you need?"]="Ah, um companheiro ranger. O que você precisa?"
G["Ah, a fellow warlock who has proven $ghis:her; worth to some degree.\n\nI am pleased to meet your acquaintance. My name is Menara Voidrender... and not without just cause.\n\nYou seem powerful and well-learned enough that other tools... more powerful tools... would be welcome and not foolishly imparted. If this is true, then speak to me further. If not, well then, you know your way  back to the docks and off into the ocean."]="Ah, a fellow warlock who has proven $ghis:her; worth to some degree.\n\nI am pleased to meet your acquaintance. My name is Menara Voidrender... and not without just cause.\n\nYou seem powerful and well-learned enough that other tools... more powerful tools... would be welcome and not foolishly imparted. If this is true, then speak to me further. If not, well then, you know your way  back to the docks and off into the ocean."
G["Ah, a good question.\n\nIf you prefer hunting in the great outdoors, there are elementals here in the Plaguelands, Azshara, Burning Steppes, Felwood, Silithus, Winterspring, and even Un'Goro Crater.\n\nIf you are the type that laughs in the face of danger, then perhaps you should visit Dire Maul. I have heard that a great many elemental abberations exist within its walls. You would also do well in seeking out the elementals employed by the Dark Iron dwarves of Blackrock Depths."]="Ah, a good question.\n\nIf you prefer hunting in the great outdoors, there are elementals here in the Plaguelands, Azshara, Burning Steppes, Felwood, Silithus, Winterspring, and even Un'Goro Crater.\n\nIf you are the type that laughs in the face of danger, then perhaps you should visit Dire Maul. I have heard that a great many elemental abberations exist within its walls. You would also do well in seeking out the elementals employed by the Dark Iron dwarves of Blackrock Depths."
G["Ah, a good stash of things."]="Ah, um bom estoque de coisas."
G["Ah, a new arrival. Right this way, sir."]="Ah, a new arrival. Right this way, sir."
G["Ah, a new challenge, Illusionary Conquerors! When they become enraged, they strike with incredible power."]="Ah, a new challenge, Illusionary Conquerors! When they become enraged, they strike with incredible power."
G["Ah, a new champion to aid our cause? What say you, $n?"]="Ah, um novo campeão para nossa causa. Que diz, $n?"
G["Ah, a new subject? I will take you apart... piece by piece!"]="Ah, a new subject? I will take you apart... piece by piece!"
G["Ah, a scrollmaker! You'll be looking for inks and vellum, I suppose? They can be found in the chamber of masters, to the left as you enter the building.\n\nI will mark the location on your map."]="Ah, um fabricante de pergaminhos! Suponho que buscarás tintas e papel de vitela... Pode encontrar tudo isso na Câmera dos Mestres, nada mais entrar no edifício, à esquerda.\n\nTe marcarei seu localização no mapa."
G["Ah, a scrollmaker! You'll be looking for inks and vellum, I suppose? They can be found in the crafter's hall, to the left as you enter the building.\n\nI will mark the location on your map."]="Ah, um fabricante de pergaminhos! Suponho que buscarás tintas e papel de vitela... Pode encontrar tudo isso na salão do artesão, nada mais entrar no edifício, à esquerda.\n\nTe marcarei seu localização no mapa."
G["Ah, a seasoned veteran you once were. Kilram can make you this again. I know you are capable, you merely need to ask and I shall teach you the way of the axesmith."]="Ah, um veterano experiente que você já foi. Kilram pode fazer isso novamente. Se você é capaz, basta perguntar e aprender o caminho do serralheiro."
G["Ah, a visitor! This is an incredible time for Pandaria - the mists have parted, and we rejoin the world. You come in peace, I hope?"]="Ah, a visitor! This is an incredible time for Pandaria - the mists have parted, and we rejoin the world. You come in peace, I hope?"
G["Ah, a young warrior to be no doubt!  I take it you are participating in Children's Week, yes?  It warms these weary bones to hear that you are setting the example by which others will be sure to follow.\n\nI'd be delighted to oblige you and the young lad.  Hrmm... what advice should I give to him?  Listen to the spirits, yes... maybe something about eating all of his vegetables too..."]="Ah, a young warrior to be no doubt!  I take it you are participating in Children's Week, yes?  It warms these weary bones to hear that you are setting the example by which others will be sure to follow.\n\nI'd be delighted to oblige you and the young lad.  Hrmm... what advice should I give to him?  Listen to the spirits, yes... maybe something about eating all of his vegetables too..."
G["Ah, and the fool who freed me shall be among the first to quell my immense hunger."]="Ah, and the fool who freed me shall be among the first to quell my immense hunger."
G["Ah, another $c looking to be a gladiator, eh? Good!\nI sell the arena team charters you'll need to participate in ranking Steamwheedle Fighting Circuit matches."]="Ah, another $c looking to be a gladiator, eh? Good!\nI sell the arena team charters you'll need to participate in ranking Steamwheedle Fighting Circuit matches."
G["Ah, another Darkspear Warrior sacrificed on my altar. One by one, you shall all perish."]="Ah, another Darkspear Warrior sacrificed on my altar. One by one, you shall all perish."
G["Ah, another admirer! My reputation precedes me, I'm sure.\n\nDon't worry, someday perhaps you and I will ride together."]="Ah, $gotro admirador: outra admiradora;! Meu reputação me precede, disso estou certo.\n\nNão te preocupe, talvez algum dia volemos juntos."
G["Ah, another stranger from beyond the mists."]="Ah, chegou mais alguém de além das brumas."
G["Ah, as the title states I am an assassin for the Scarlet Crusade. I spend my days exterminating high priority targets and nights at the Gadgetzan discotheque. Dancing is my true calling. Assassination just pays the bills."]="Ah, como o título indica, eu sou um assassino da Cruzada Escarlate. Passagem meus dias exterminando alvos de alta prioridade e noites na discoteca de Gadgetzan. Dançar é minha verdadeira vocação. O assassinato paga as contas."
G["Ah, back where it belongs. Thank you!"]="Ah, de volta Aonde pertence. Obrigado!"
G["Ah, beautiful Menethil Harbor, with the best mead this side of Ironforge."]="Ah, beautiful Menethil Harbor, with the best mead this side of Ironforge."
G["Ah, because you are an actor in this tale!\n\nMuch better than simply reading history from some musty old scroll, wouldn't you agree?\n\nNow go forward, and learn!"]="Ah, because you are an actor in this tale!\n\nMuch better than simply reading history from some musty old scroll, wouldn't you agree?\n\nNow go forward, and learn!"
G["Ah, but it is you who intrudes on our master's territory.  He could wipe you out in an instant for that transgression alone!  Arthas does not have much love or patience for his escaped slaves."]="Ah, but it is you who intrudes on our master's territory.  He could wipe you out in an instant for that transgression alone!  Arthas does not have much love or patience for his escaped slaves."
G["Ah, but such terrible works!"]="Ah, mas eram criações terríveis!"
G["Ah, but there is a problem with creating a living weapon. Do you see?"]="Ah, mas existe um problema ao se criar armas vivas. Você percebe?"
G["Ah, but were you expecting this?"]="Ah ha! Mas você estava esperando por isso?"
G["Ah, but which one is da real one?"]="Ah, mas qual e' o verdadeiro?"
G["Ah, but you're no stranger to your past! A Pandaren from the Wandering Isle. I admit, I thought your homeland was just a legend. Pandaren from the Isle are far more adventurous than those on the mainland... it's in your blood!"]="Ah, but you're no stranger to your past! A Pandaren from the Wandering Isle. I admit, I thought your homeland was just a legend. Pandaren from the Isle are far more adventurous than those on the mainland... it's in your blood!"
G["Ah, come on! Dis' deal be a good one and ya know it ya snuffler."]="Oh, vamos! É um bom trato e o sabe, olisqueador!"
G["Ah, crap. You're on your own with this one, $p."]="Ah, crap. You're on your own with this one, $p."
G["Ah, damn it all! Clever trap. Too bad you'll never live to tell the tale..."]="Ah, damn it all! Clever trap. Too bad you'll never live to tell the tale..."
G["Ah, dragon rearing.\n\nOnce these beauties grow up, my fool brother will have nothing on me!"]="Ah, dragon rearing.\n\nOnce these beauties grow up, my fool brother will have nothing on me!"
G["Ah, empty again!"]="Ah, vazio novamente!"
G["Ah, excellent! Let the festivities begin. Let us retire to the terrace. Now, where did I put my drink?"]="Ah, excellent! Let the festivities begin. Let us retire to the terrace. Now, where did I put my drink?"
G["Ah, feel the magic seep into the cave, my little elves... muhahaha."]="Ah, feel the magic seep into the cave, my little elves... muhahaha."
G["Ah, finally some action. Lok'tar Ogar!"]="Ah, finalmente algo de ação. Lok'tar ogar!"
G["Ah, freedom!  Although brief, so sweet it is..."]="Ah, liberdade! Embora breve, é tão doce..."
G["Ah, fresh air at last! I need a moment to rest."]="Finalmente, um pouco de ar fresco! Preciso descansar um momento."
G["Ah, fresh air! I can get myself back to the airstrip from here. Be sure to tell Fizzcrank I'm back and safe. Thanks so much, $n!"]="Ah, ar fresco! Posso chegar até a pista de aterrizagem eu somente desde aqui. Certifique-se de decirle a Palanqueta que e voltado saudável e salvou. Muitas Obrigado, $n!"
G["Ah, fresh meat for the dogs!"]="Ah! carne fresca para os cães!"
G["Ah, fresh meat for the dogs."]="Ah, carne fresca para os cães."
G["Ah, fresh meat!"]="Ah, carne fresca!"
G["Ah, fresh sustenance!"]="Ah, sustento fresco!"
G["Ah, gentle Seriadne.  All animals are safe while in her care.  You can find her just outside the Inn in Dolanaar."]="Ah, gentil Seriadne. Todos os animais estão seguros enquanto estão sob seus cuidados. Você pode encontrá-a nos arredores da pousada em Dolanaar."
G["Ah, good $n.  Now let us see what tale these heads tell..."]="Ah, $gbuen: boa; $n. Vamos ver que nos cuentan estas cabeças..."
G["Ah, good of you to come around, Ruusk. Thank you and farewell."]="Ah, que bom que você veio, Ruusk. Obrigado e adeus."
G["Ah, good ol' Brandur Ironhammer.  There's no doubt he'll provide ye with the guidance ye seek, $glad : lass;.  Ye'll find him in the Hall of Mysteries north of the gates of Ironforge."]="Ah, o bom de Brandur Martiyerro. Sem dúvida te proporcionará toda a ajuda O que precisa, $gmuchacho: moça;. O encontrar na Salão dos Mistérios, que está ao norte das portões de Altaforja."
G["Ah, good to see you, my friend!\n\nHungry?"]="Ah, good to see you, my friend!\n\nHungry?"
G["Ah, good, I see you are not easily distracted. We Pandaren are extremely focused on the moment, sometimes to our detriment."]="Ah, good, I see you are not easily distracted. We Pandaren are extremely focused on the moment, sometimes to our detriment."
G["Ah, good, a $c. We could use more of your kind for some of these tasks."]="Ah, que bem, $gun: uma; $c. Nos virá bem alguém como você para algumas tarefas."
G["Ah, good.  These spores have rendered nicely.  Thank you, $n."]="Ah, vale. Estas esporos têm resultados ser muito úteis. Obrigado, $n."
G["Ah, good... more parts!"]="Ah, bem... mais membros!"
G["Ah, guests of the Master. I hope you've been watching your step in here."]="Ah, convidados do Mestre. Espero que você esteja observando seu passo aqui."
G["Ah, hello there, $r!\n\nThis is where we keep all our farming history and knowledge.\n\nWe have records of the local weather and resulting harvest, detailed notes on every seed and every plant that grows in the Valley, and even a bank of seeds for all the plants that we may ever need to grow.\n\nThis knowledge is sacred to us. If disaster should ever strike this land, our seeds must be saved."]="Ah, hello there, $r!\n\nThis is where we keep all our farming history and knowledge.\n\nWe have records of the local weather and resulting harvest, detailed notes on every seed and every plant that grows in the Valley, and even a bank of seeds for all the plants that we may ever need to grow.\n\nThis knowledge is sacred to us. If disaster should ever strike this land, our seeds must be saved."
G["Ah, hello there, $r. As you can see, I'm not open for business quite yet. Now, if you'll excuse me, I'm very busy."]="Ah, hello there, $r. As you can see, I'm not open for business quite yet. Now, if you'll excuse me, I'm very busy."
G["Ah, here at last! It's going to feel so good to get rid of these barrels."]="Ah, here at last! It's going to feel so good to get rid of these barrels."
G["Ah, here he is."]="Ah, aqui está."
G["Ah, here is the boy. Doesn't he look special? My late husband and I always wanted children."]="Ah, here is the boy. Doesn't he look special? My late husband and I always wanted children."
G["Ah, here it is."]="Ah, aqui está."
G["Ah, here we are!  Well let's get to work, shall we...?"]="Ah, aqui estamos! Bem, Vamos mãos à obra, de acordo?"
G["Ah, here we are. Oh - oh, these old bones are tired. More than you can imagine."]="Ah, chegamos. Ai, ai, esses velhos ossos estão cansados. mais do que você imagina."
G["Ah, here's one."]="Ah, aqui há um."
G["Ah, here's the $c I was telling you about."]="Ah, aqui está quem te havia mencionado. ($c)"
G["Ah, here's the $g hero : heroine; of the hour now! Good to see you again, $n! I trust that you're still destroying the Scourge wherever you find them?"]="Ah, here's the $g hero : heroine; of the hour now! Good to see you again, $n! I trust that you're still destroying the Scourge wherever you find them?"
G["Ah, hits the spot!"]="Ah, tem dados no alvo!"
G["Ah, if it isn't my favorite master assassin! I was hoping I would find you here in Pandaria."]="Ah, eis o meu mestre assassino favorito! Tinha esperança de encontrar você aqui em Pandária."
G["Ah, it is good to be free of my bonds! Have you freed Tog'thar yet? The humans split us up after our capture."]="Ah, it is good to be free of my bonds! Have you freed Tog'thar yet? The humans split us up after our capture."
G["Ah, it is not yet over. From what I see, we face the trial of the yaungol. Let me shed some light..."]="Ah, ainda não temos terminou. Parece ser que nos enfrentamos à prova do yaungol. Deixem que os ilustre..."
G["Ah, it was a difficult battle. So sad to have lost friends.\nThough, I am glad I had them build the battlefield refreshment device.\nWithout it, and without the power of my stout brew, who knows how many more would have been lost..."]="Ah, it was a difficult battle. So sad to have lost friends.\nThough, I am glad I had them build the battlefield refreshment device.\nWithout it, and without the power of my stout brew, who knows how many more would have been lost..."
G["Ah, it's about time. Will you free me, or did you have... other ideas?"]="Ah, it's about time. Will you free me, or did you have... other ideas?"
G["Ah, it's you, $n! Welcome into our sanctuary. Rest and refresh yourself; you have more than earned it."]="Ah, é você, $n! $gBienvenido: Bem-vinda; a nosso santuário. Descansar e recuperada forças, te o ganhou."
G["Ah, just in time for your cleansing, $r. I shall wax the impurities from your soul."]="Ah, just in time for your cleansing, $r. I shall wax the impurities from your soul."
G["Ah, let me see. Yes probably nearing a hundred times now I'd wager!"]="Ah, let me see. Yes probably nearing a hundred times now I'd wager!"
G["Ah, liquid gold. Gather up every last drop!"]="Ah, liquid gold. Gather up every last drop!"
G["Ah, look at the time! I must return to my post... up over there."]="Que hora se tornou! Tenho que voltar a meu posto... está logo ali."
G["Ah, look. Here comes $n, escorting your bride!"]="Ah, look. Here comes $n, escorting your bride!"
G["Ah, many apologies young master. You must be at least this high to utilize a teleportation spell.\n\n<Maltrake makes an approximation of height with his right hand, hovering it at about knee length.>\n\nCome back when you've grown up."]="Ah, many apologies young master. You must be at least this high to utilize a teleportation spell.\n\n<Maltrake makes an approximation of height with his right hand, hovering it at about knee length.>\n\nCome back when you've grown up."
G["Ah, many apologies young master. You must be at least this high to utilize a teleportation spell.\n\n<Peoreth makes an approximation of height with his right hand, hovering it at about knee length.>\n\nCome back when you've grown up."]="Ah, many apologies young master. You must be at least this high to utilize a teleportation spell.\n\n<Peoreth makes an approximation of height with his right hand, hovering it at about knee length.>\n\nCome back when you've grown up."
G["Ah, mistletoe..."]="Ah, visco..."
G["Ah, more essence to capture..."]="Ah, mais essência que capturar."
G["Ah, more lambs to the slaughter!"]="Ah, mais cordeiros ao matadouro!"
G["Ah, more of Vol'jin's revolutionaries. You've made it."]="Ah, mais rebeldes de Vol'jin. O vocês têm conseguido."
G["Ah, much appreciated, Corbett.  We'll get these on the racks immediately."]="Ah, te o agradeço muito, Corbett. Os pondremos nos estantes imediatamente."
G["Ah, much better. Those bindings were so tight."]="Ah, muito melhor. As cordas me estavam cortando a circulação."
G["Ah, much improved."]="Ah, muito melhor."
G["Ah, my back!"]="Ah, meu costas!"
G["Ah, my sweet Brandy, I miss her so!"]="Ah, minha doce Brandy, sinto tanto a falta dela!"
G["Ah, new customers. Welcome!"]="Ah, clientes novos. Bem-vindos!"
G["Ah, new slaves have arrived. Taskmistresses, see that they are properly outfitted and set to work!"]="Ah, new slaves have arrived. Taskmistresses, see that they are properly outfitted and set to work!"
G["Ah, noble is your lineage! Your people possess GREAT power, and all the terrible burdens that come with it. Equally great has been your suffering. Now I see why you call yourself  'Blood' elves."]="Ah, noble is your lineage! Your people possess GREAT power, and all the terrible burdens that come with it. Equally great has been your suffering. Now I see why you call yourself  'Blood' elves."
G["Ah, nothing better than a priest to cure what ails ye.  Of course a nice tall pint cures a lot of what ails ye too, but I don't think Braenna Flintcrag teaches brewing.  I guess ye'll have to settle for some priest training over in the Hall of Mysteries instead."]="Ah, nada melhor que um sacerdote para curar o que vos aflige. É claro que uma boa cerveja alta cura muito do que também lhe aflige, mas não acho que Braenna Flintcrag ensine a fazer cerveja. Acho que você terá que se contentar com algum treinamento de sacerdote no Salão dos Mistérios."
G["Ah, nothing like a good drink!"]="Ah, nada como uma boa copa!"
G["Ah, nothing quite like a ride on a gryphon, is there?  The night elves can keep those hippo's of theirs, just give me a gryphon and the wind in me hair!  \nWell now, I won't keep ye any longer, just head over to Gryth Thurden on the east side of The Great Forge and he'll get ye on yer way."]="Ah, nothing quite like a ride on a gryphon, is there?  The night elves can keep those hippo's of theirs, just give me a gryphon and the wind in me hair!  \nWell now, I won't keep ye any longer, just head over to Gryth Thurden on the east side of The Great Forge and he'll get ye on yer way."
G["Ah, of course! My old friend from the Jade Forest!"]="Ah, é claro! Lembro de você lá da Floresta de Jade!"
G["Ah, one of my favorite customers. You look to be of a warlock of some power, $n. I am pleased to meet you. If there is anything I can do for you, please, just ask.\n\nMy brother and I feel that it will be your kind who lead us into the next great era. One with such power... such control... it's only a matter of time before the Legion itself bends to your will.\n\nI am but a little envious."]="Ah, one of my favorite customers. You look to be of a warlock of some power, $n. I am pleased to meet you. If there is anything I can do for you, please, just ask.\n\nMy brother and I feel that it will be your kind who lead us into the next great era. One with such power... such control... it's only a matter of time before the Legion itself bends to your will.\n\nI am but a little envious."
G["Ah, one of our own. It is good to see our numbers are growing so rapidly that I can no longer keep track of the faces of our members.\n\nThat fool Thrall thinks I am working hard to cleanse the image of warlocks and prove we are his servants. Idiot! The Burning Legion will make ash of this entire world after it drains it completely."]="Ah, one of our own. It is good to see our numbers are growing so rapidly that I can no longer keep track of the faces of our members.\n\nThat fool Thrall thinks I am working hard to cleanse the image of warlocks and prove we are his servants. Idiot! The Burning Legion will make ash of this entire world after it drains it completely."
G["Ah, our esteemed guests have arrived!"]="Ah, nossos estimados convidados têm chegado!"
G["Ah, our first enemy! Illusionary Rippers are but simple warriors. Now, let us do this!"]="Ah, nosso primeiro inimigo! Estripadores Ilusórios são guerreiros simplórios. Agora, vamos lá!"
G["Ah, perhaps one of your skills can make our sparring sessions more interesting. Protect the temple healers from assailants for as long as you are able."]="Ah, perhaps one of your skills can make our sparring sessions more interesting. Protect the temple healers from assailants for as long as you are able."
G["Ah, reinforcements!"]="Ah! Reforços!"
G["Ah, seeking the masters of the arcane? You can find Quithas and the other magisters within the Sunfury Spire."]="Ah, procurando os mestres do arcano? Você pode encontrar Quithas e os outros magisters dentro do Sunfury Spire."
G["Ah, seeking training, are you? There are several instructors who are camped in Azure Watch... what are you after?"]="Ah, procurando treinamento, está? Existem vários instrutores acampados no Azure Watch... o que você procura?"
G["Ah, so it's a duel you want?  Then a duel you shall have!"]="Ah, assim que isto vai ser um duelo. Muito bem."
G["Ah, so my minions from the Burning Steppes have brought the dragons..."]="Ah, so my minions from the Burning Steppes have brought the dragons..."
G["Ah, so that is how they pushed the Dark Iron to the lower parts of the Spire."]="Ah, foi assim que eles empurraram o Ferro Negro para as partes inferiores do Pináculo."
G["Ah, so that's who you are. I've already heard stories of your deeds, $N. I will write stories about you so that you will be remembered, you have my word."]="Ah, so that's who you are. I've already heard stories of your deeds, $N. I will write stories about you so that you will be remembered, you have my word."
G["Ah, so there is one who wishes to taste the might of the Metal Brew?"]="Ah, alguém quer testar a força do mistura do metal!"
G["Ah, so very close. But you must remain CENTERED. Inner harmony is crucial to your survival on this land. Come, let us try again!"]="Ah, so very close. But you must remain CENTERED. Inner harmony is crucial to your survival on this land. Come, let us try again!"
G["Ah, so you're an up and coming chef, are you? You can find everything you need from Barleyflower. She sells her wares in the keggery.\n\nI will mark the location on your map."]="Ah, so you're an up and coming chef, are you? You can find everything you need from Barleyflower. She sells her wares in the keggery.\n\nI will mark the location on your map."
G["Ah, so you've left your hole?  The Lady will claim you soon enough."]="Ah, so you've left your hole?  The Lady will claim you soon enough."
G["Ah, so... you have found it.\n\n<Mathredis points to the book in your possession.>\n\nHave you collected the necessary components?\n\nThe manifestations listed in the libram, imbecile!"]="Ah, so... you have found it.\n\n<Mathredis points to the book in your possession.>\n\nHave you collected the necessary components?\n\nThe manifestations listed in the libram, imbecile!"
G["Ah, speak of the devil..."]="Falando do rei de Roma..."
G["Ah, such an odd place to find potential customers!"]="Ah, um lugar tão estranho para encontrar clientes em potencial!"
G["Ah, such troubling thoughts. Our last emperor advised us not to live in the shadow of fear. Do you see now why we love to drink and celebrate?"]="Ah, such troubling thoughts. Our last emperor advised us not to live in the shadow of fear. Do you see now why we love to drink and celebrate?"
G["Ah, sure."]="Ah, claro."
G["Ah, sweet, sweet bloodthistle... Probably left behind by one of those filthy addicts at Eclipse Point."]="Ah, sweet, sweet bloodthistle... Probably left behind by one of those filthy addicts at Eclipse Point."
G["Ah, thank you Tong."]="Ah, obrigado, Tong."
G["Ah, thank you kindly. I will leave you to the library while I tend to this small matter."]="Ah, muitas Obrigado. Te acompanho até a biblioteca enquanto me ocupo deste asuntilho."
G["Ah, thank you! I'll be sure to go get them soon."]="Ah, thank you! I'll be sure to go get them soon."
G["Ah, thank you! Suffice it to say... Negotiations did proceed as planned."]="Ah, thank you! Suffice it to say... Negotiations did proceed as planned."
G["Ah, that sure does hit the spot!  I think I'll get myself a couple more...can you watch these barrels for me, $n?"]="Ah, esta si que dará no alvo! Acho que irei a por umas quantas mais... pode dar um olhada a estes barris, $n?"
G["Ah, that's sweet of you mon, but we already got all the heavy leather that we need. And here I'm sure that your knife is still sharp. Maybe you can put it to use helping the others with their collections, no?  Have a good one!"]="Ah, é muito gentil mas já temos todas as peles de couro pesado que precisamos de. Mas suponho que seu cuchilho ainda está afiado. Por que não o utilizas para ajudar aos mais nos seus trabalhos de pegue de materiais? Que te diviertas!"
G["Ah, the Horde... meddling, as always. I suppose a welcome is in order. So welcome, insects. Welcome to my world."]="Ah, the Horde... meddling, as always. I suppose a welcome is in order. So welcome, insects. Welcome to my world."
G["Ah, the Illusionary Banana-Tosser! It will rapidly toss bananas toward you. Move to avoid them. Prevent it from running away from you, if you can."]="Ah, the Illusionary Banana-Tosser! It will rapidly toss bananas toward you. Move to avoid them. Prevent it from running away from you, if you can."
G["Ah, the Promised One has arrived. Welcome to Stillpine Hold."]="Ah, o Prometido chegou. Bem-vindo ao Stillpine Hold."
G["Ah, the Winter Wondervolt. What will we think of next?"]="Ah, o Maravoltio Invernal. Que será o seguinte?"
G["Ah, the ancient Vaults of the Kings of Mogu'shan. What might this button do...?"]="Ah, as antigas câmaras dos reis de Mogu'shan. E este botão...?"
G["Ah, the beauty of Shadowglen never ceases to delight my senses!"]="Ah, a beleza de Shadowglen nunca deixa de encantar meus sentidos!"
G["Ah, the dragon child and the hero. Together you will achieve great things."]="Ah, the dragon child and the hero. Together you will achieve great things."
G["Ah, the entertainment has arrived!"]="Ah, chegou a diversão!"
G["Ah, the entertainment has arrived."]="Ah, chegou a diversão."
G["Ah, the familiar embrace of the storms...."]="Ah, the familiar embrace of the storms...."
G["Ah, the food be arrivin'."]="Ah, já chega a comida."
G["Ah, the hand of the Ebon Blade has finally come to claim me. I tremble in fear."]="Ah, the hand of the Ebon Blade has finally come to claim me. I tremble in fear."
G["Ah, the hero. Your little friends said you would come. This certainly saves me the trouble of hunting you down myself."]="Ah, the hero. Your little friends said you would come. This certainly saves me the trouble of hunting you down myself."
G["Ah, the lair of the beasts. While I admire the Zandalari skill with beasts I am more impressed with their ability to endure this foul odor.\n\nKeep a devilsaur upwind of you and it will never catch you off guard."]="Ah, the lair of the beasts. While I admire the Zandalari skill with beasts I am more impressed with their ability to endure this foul odor.\n\nKeep a devilsaur upwind of you and it will never catch you off guard."
G["Ah, the protective layer is nearly gone. Do you hear that, heroes? That... That is the sound of inevitability. Of your hopes and dreams being crushed under the weight of my being."]="Ah, the protective layer is nearly gone. Do you hear that, heroes? That... That is the sound of inevitability. Of your hopes and dreams being crushed under the weight of my being."
G["Ah, the sweet salt air of Ratchet."]="Ah, me encantar o ar salobre de Trinquete."
G["Ah, the tower of Krolmir. It is said that the power of Thorim has been used only once... and that it turned an entire continent to dust."]="Ah, a torre de Krolmir. Se diz que o poder de Thorim somente se tem usado uma vez… e que voltou cinzas a tudo um continente."
G["Ah, the true sign of the hunter!  To stalk one's prey in the never-ending game of life.  Look to Drayl on the Hunter Rise for your answers."]="Ah, the true sign of the hunter!  To stalk one's prey in the never-ending game of life.  Look to Drayl on the Hunter Rise for your answers."
G["Ah, the winds spoke of newcomers to our village. I feel that we will learn much from each other, so long as our minds are open and our spirits pure.\n\nPerhaps your people will be more respectful of mine than the Horde was."]="Ah, the winds spoke of newcomers to our village. I feel that we will learn much from each other, so long as our minds are open and our spirits pure.\n\nPerhaps your people will be more respectful of mine than the Horde was."
G["Ah, the young black dragon graces my temple. The deeds of you and your champion are quickly becoming Pandaren legend."]="Ah, the young black dragon graces my temple. The deeds of you and your champion are quickly becoming Pandaren legend."
G["Ah, there it is!"]="Ah, aí está."
G["Ah, there it is. Follow me, fleshling."]="Ah, aí está. Siga-me, ser de carne."
G["Ah, there you are! Remember me? Of course you do! Wait right there, I'm coming down."]="Ah, aí está. Te lembra de mim? Claro que si! Aguarda, que baixo."
G["Ah, there you are. I had hoped to accomplish this with a bit of subtlety, but I suppose direct confrontation was inevitable. Your future, Thrall, must not come to pass and so... you and your troublesome friends must die!"]="Ah, there you are. I had hoped to accomplish this with a bit of subtlety, but I suppose direct confrontation was inevitable. Your future, Thrall, must not come to pass and so... you and your troublesome friends must die!"
G["Ah, there you are. I was told to expect help, so please listen closely. The situation is this: I've been tasked with gathering $2055w purple lotus in preparation for the coming war in Ahn'Qiraj. To date we have $2054w.\n\nActually going into the field and collecting the flowers will be up to you and those like you. I am needed here to see that they are properly maintained and to find new, creative applications for their use against the silithid and whatever else awaits us there."]="Ah, there you are. I was told to expect help, so please listen closely. The situation is this: I've been tasked with gathering $2055w purple lotus in preparation for the coming war in Ahn'Qiraj. To date we have $2054w.\n\nActually going into the field and collecting the flowers will be up to you and those like you. I am needed here to see that they are properly maintained and to find new, creative applications for their use against the silithid and whatever else awaits us there."
G["Ah, there you are..."]="Ah, aí está..."
G["Ah, there's one!"]="Ah, há um!"
G["Ah, there's our target. I can smell him from here."]="Ah, there's our target. I can smell him from here."
G["Ah, these kids never run out of energy!"]="Ah, these kids never run out of energy!"
G["Ah, this Darnassian fabric is the finest!"]="Ah, este tecido darnassiano é o melhor!"
G["Ah, this gate is locked, but I think I have something that'll open it."]="Ah, this gate is locked, but I think I have something that'll open it."
G["Ah, this is a special place. My great grandparents called this part of the forest their home. Come, this will take only a moment."]="Ah, this is a special place. My great grandparents called this part of the forest their home. Come, this will take only a moment."
G["Ah, this must be him now... no?  Bah!"]="Ah, deve ser ele... não? Bah!"
G["Ah, this was from Private Denning.  I remember when he fell..."]="Ah, isto era do soldado Denning. Lembrança quando caiu..."
G["Ah, to be back in Stranglethorn.  The screeching raptors, the troll wars, jungle creatures as far as the eye see, just ASKING to be killed...\n\n<Bort sighs.>"]="Ah, to be back in Stranglethorn.  The screeching raptors, the troll wars, jungle creatures as far as the eye see, just ASKING to be killed...\n\n<Bort sighs.>"
G["Ah, to be finally free of that cage..."]="Ah, finalmente livre fosse dessa jaula..."
G["Ah, to be pulled from the dreaded nightmare! I thank you, my loyal Disciple, along with your brave companions."]="Ah, ao fim liberado de uma pavorosa pesadelos! Te o agradeço, meu leal Discípulo, você e aos seus corajosos companheiros."
G["Ah, to be young again, and to have discovered potions for the first time. Thank you for refreshing my memory, $n. Now go share that youthful enthusiasm with Milla Fairancora over there."]="Ah, ser jovem novamente, e descobrir poções pela primeira vez. Obrigado por refrescar meu memória, $n. Agora vê a compartilhar seu entusiasmo juvenil com Milha Fairancora, está aí mesmo."
G["Ah, to soar with the great birds of the sky.  Seek out Tal at the top of the Winder Rider Roost.  He will steer you toward where you're going."]="Ah, voar alto com os grandes pássaros do céu. Procure Tal no topo do Winder Rider Roost. Ele o guiará para onde você está indo."
G["Ah, um, yes $g sir : ma'am;. It would appear that we have collected all of the medium leather that the Alliance feels is necessary for the war. I'm told that there may be others here though that still need your assistance with their collection efforts."]="Ah, um, sim $gsenhor: senhora;! Parece ser que temos pegou todas as peles de couro meio que a Aliança considera necessárias para a guerra. No entanto, me têm dito que pode haver alguém aqui que necesite sua ajuda para os trabalhos de pegue de materiais."
G["Ah, very good. I am satisfied that you are a worthy student. Now, your training with me may begin..."]="Ah, muito bem. Estou satisfeito que você é um estudante digno. Agora, seu treinamento comigo pode começar..."
G["Ah, we adventure together again, except this time I am afraid that the circumstances are much more dire."]="Ah, we adventure together again, except this time I am afraid that the circumstances are much more dire."
G["Ah, we're almost there, whos-yer-face! The camp where I left my notes is just around the corner!"]="Ah, we're almost there, whos-yer-face! The camp where I left my notes is just around the corner!"
G["Ah, welcome back, hero. You have returned to protect the Guardian once more? Do not forget to take a chrono-beacon with you!"]="Bem-vindo de volta, herói. Você voltou para proteger o Guardião mais uma vez? Não se esqueça de levar um cronômetro com você!"
G["Ah, welcome. Are you here to buy spices? Strange, rare, exotic spices?\n\nYou've come to the right place... neighbor."]="Ah, welcome. Are you here to buy spices? Strange, rare, exotic spices?\n\nYou've come to the right place... neighbor."
G["Ah, welcome. You are here to join us in the coming celebration? No? A pity."]="Ah, welcome. You are here to join us in the coming celebration? No? A pity."
G["Ah, what a beautiful day to blow something up!"]="Ah, que dia lindo para explodir algo!"
G["Ah, what a waste... next!"]="Ah, what a waste... next!"
G["Ah, what quartermaster are you searching for? Perhaps I can help you find them."]="Ah, what quartermaster are you searching for? Perhaps I can help you find them."
G["Ah, wonderful. It was all just a dream..."]="Ah, menos mal. Era somente um sonho."
G["Ah, ye're an inquisitive one, are ye'? Excellent! Pay close attention, this just might save yer skin when the goin' gets rough!"]="Ah, você é um inquisidor, é? Excelente! Preste muita atenção, pois isso pode salvar sua pele quando as coisas piorarem!"
G["Ah, yer a lifesaver, lad!"]="Ah, me salvou a vida, amigo!"
G["Ah, yes, I see what you were talking about now. Thank you, Boulian."]="Ah, sim, agora vejo de que estava falando. Obrigado, Boulian."
G["Ah, yes, it is almost time for the master's dinner..."]="Ah, sim, já quase é a hora da cena do mestre…"
G["Ah, yes, that... the name. Well... as they say, a good name, like good will, is got by many actions and lost by one. No need to go into the hows or whys; suffice to say, that is how I am named by some."]="Ah, sim, esse... o nome. Bem... como se costuma dizer, um bom nome, como boa vontade, é obtido por muitas ações e perdido por uma. Não há necessidade de entrar nos comos ou porquês; basta dizer que é assim que sou nomeado por algum."
G["Ah, yes. Loken is well known to me."]="Ah, sim. Conheço bem a Loken."
G["Ah, yes... I know about the forgemaster!  I just overheard that he's not in the camp right now."]="Ah, sim... Conheço ao mestre de forja! Acabo de ouvir que não se encontre no acampamento agora mesmo."
G["Ah, yes... Private Guarding.  He always was quick to laugh... until a Bleeding Hollow Raid tore out his throat!"]="Ah, yes... Private Guarding.  He always was quick to laugh... until a Bleeding Hollow Raid tore out his throat!"
G["Ah, yes... watch it burn!"]="Ah, sim... míralo arder!"
G["Ah, you are new. These devices are a part of our master's plan to bring about the transformation of the world. They will unleash the fires of judgment and allow us to ascend to immortality. This is the master's promise."]="Ah, you are new. These devices are a part of our master's plan to bring about the transformation of the world. They will unleash the fires of judgment and allow us to ascend to immortality. This is the master's promise."
G["Ah, you did it! Excellent work."]="Ah, o conseguiu! um trabalho excelente!"
G["Ah, you have done it!  The waters are pure once more."]="Ah, o vocês têm conseguido! As águas voltam a ser puras."
G["Ah, you have raised your pets well, and beaten some of Pandaria's most seasoned and charismatic trainers.  But the trial is not over, oh no!"]="Ah, you have raised your pets well, and beaten some of Pandaria's most seasoned and charismatic trainers.  But the trial is not over, oh no!"
G["Ah, you have returned! One thousand thanks. Please, take this, our most potent creation: Volatile Greenstone Brew."]="Ah, you have returned! One thousand thanks. Please, take this, our most potent creation: Volatile Greenstone Brew."
G["Ah, you must be the $glad : lass; assigned to show me around the Eversong Woods.  Took your sweet time getting here, didn't you?\n\nVery well, off we go.  Let us not waste one more minute."]="Ah, you must be the $glad : lass; assigned to show me around the Eversong Woods.  Took your sweet time getting here, didn't you?\n\nVery well, off we go.  Let us not waste one more minute."
G["Ah, you must be the outsider. Sadly, I am making weapons for war. Once, not long ago, I made instruments for prayer and celebration. It is this war that makes everyone stand on edge."]="Ah, you must be the outsider. Sadly, I am making weapons for war. Once, not long ago, I made instruments for prayer and celebration. It is this war that makes everyone stand on edge."
G["Ah, you must go to the great heights of Thunder Bluff to visit one of those.  Follow the path north out of Bloodhoof Village.  At the base of the bluffs is an elevator that will take you to the top.  When you get there ask for further directions from one of the Bluffwatchers."]="Ah, você deve ir às grandes alturas do Thunder Bluff para visitar um deles. Continue o caminho para o norte, saindo da Vila Casco Sangrento. Na base dos penhascos há um elevador que o levará ao topo. Quando você chegar lá, peça mais instruções a um dos Bluffwatchers."
G["Ah, you seek Dark Cleric Beryl.  He's now resides in the eastern building."]="Ah, procura o clérigo sombrio Beryl. Agora reside no edifício ao este."
G["Ah, you seek Dark Cleric Beryl.  He's upstairs in the reading room at the Gallows' End Tavern.  Reading, praying, who knows what he's up to, and who would dare to ask?"]="Ah, você procura o Dark Cleric Beryl. Ele está lá em cima na sala de leitura da Gallows 'End Tavern. Lendo, orando, quem sabe o que está fazendo e quem ousaria perguntar?"
G["Ah, you seek Jaluu the Generous! He can be found walking around the steps of Mogu'shan Palace, here in the Vale of Eternal Blossoms.\n\nI will mark his location on your map for you."]="Ah, you seek Jaluu the Generous! He can be found walking around the steps of Mogu'shan Palace, here in the Vale of Eternal Blossoms.\n\nI will mark his location on your map for you."
G["Ah, you seek Jaluu the Generous! He is right next to me."]="Ah, atenção a Jaluu o Farto! Está logo a meu lado."
G["Ah, you seek one of the returned Highborne.\n\nOne of their Arcane Reforgers has been spending time with Taladan, the enchanter.  Seek them out in the Craftsmen's Terrace."]="Ah, you seek one of the returned Highborne.\n\nOne of their Arcane Reforgers has been spending time with Taladan, the enchanter.  Seek them out in the Craftsmen's Terrace."
G["Ah, you seek the Silverdews in the Craftmen's Terrace. They've only recently set up shop, near the enchanter's."]="Ah, you seek the Silverdews in the Craftmen's Terrace. They've only recently set up shop, near the enchanter's."
G["Ah, you seek the wisdom of Ansekhwa.  Look for him on the lower rise at Thunder Bluff Weapons."]="Ah, você procura a sabedoria de Ansekhwa. Procure por ele na subida mais baixa da Thunder Bluff Weapons."
G["Ah, you want to play hardball, eh? That's just my game!"]="Ah, que jogar duro, eh? A mim me encantar!"
G["Ah, you wish to train abroad? I will direct you. Tell me which weapon has sparked your interest."]="Ah, você deseja treinar no exterior? Eu vou te direcionar. Diga-me qual arma despertou seu interesse."
G["Ah, you'll make a fine rock-breaker I think!"]="Ah, acho que se vai dar bem partir pedras!"
G["Ah, you're here already? I'm not quite finished with my preparations... and neither are you.\n\nHonor the shrines and come back to me - we mustn't disrespect the mountain in our haste."]="Ah, you're here already? I'm not quite finished with my preparations... and neither are you.\n\nHonor the shrines and come back to me - we mustn't disrespect the mountain in our haste."
G["Ah, you're just in time. The rituals are about to begin!"]="Ah, logo a tempo. Os rituais vão a começar!"
G["Ah, you're looking for Lucan Cordell.  He runs a shop on the outside of the Magic Quarter on your way to the Stockade."]="Ah, you're looking for Lucan Cordell.  He runs a shop on the outside of the Magic Quarter on your way to the Stockade."
G["Ah, you're the one who found the letter. Thank you for the... news, I suppose, about my family. You're welcome to what food and drink I can offer."]="Ah, você foi quem encontrou a carta. Obrigado pelas... notícia, suponho, sobre minha família. Você é bem-vindo ao que comida e bebida posso oferecer."
G["Ah, you've finally arrived Prince Arthas. You're here just in the nick of time."]="Ah, finalmente chegou príncipe Arthas. Chega logo a tempo."
G["Ah- hah hah hah hah haaa!"]="Ha, ja, ja, ja, jaaaaa!"
G["Ah-ha! I've got you right where I want you!"]="Ah-ha! I've got you right where I want you!"
G["Ah-hah! Another chance to test my might."]="Ah-hah! Another chance to test my might."
G["Ah-hah! The lot of you will soon wish you hadn't come this way..."]="Ah-hah! The lot of you will soon wish you hadn't come this way..."
G["Ah-hah! There are no guards back here. Maybe you can find a way up onto the roof?"]="Ah-hah! There are no guards back here. Maybe you can find a way up onto the roof?"
G["Ah.  I was merely jesting..."]="Ah.  I was merely jesting..."
G["Ah.  Welcome $gsir:my lady;!"]="Ah. Recebam meu boas-vindas, $gsenhor: meu senhora;"
G["Ah. That might be a problem."]="Ah. Isso poderá ser um problema."
G["Ah. The smell of a proper battlefield. We have been on our own for far too long. Now, the full might of the Horde is unleashed! And we are the ones who direct where the next blow will land."]="Ah, o cheiro de um verdadeiro campo de batalha. Levamos demais tempo sozinhos. Tudo o poder da Horda se tem libertado! E nos corresponda nós dirigir o próximo acerto."
G["Ah. The taste of victory is sweet."]="Ah. É doce o sabor da vitória."
G["Ah. Well. That was even easier than I thought!"]="Mmm. Vá. Foi mais fácil do que achava!"
G["Ah.. noodle soup always refreshes both my body and my soul."]="Ah... A sopa de macarrão sempre me reconforta em corpo e alma."
G["Ah... Gamon... you have finally learned... I am proud... to have died... at your hands..."]="Ah, Gamon... finalmente tem aprendido... Estou orgulhoso... de morrer... aos seus mãos..."
G["Ah... I do not have many visitors here.\n\nPlease, sit a while."]="Ah... Não sozinho ter muitos visitantes.\n\nPor favor, sentaos um tempo."
G["Ah... It be Kilnara.  I shoulda known she be involved here."]="Ah... It be Kilnara.  I shoulda known she be involved here."
G["Ah... Malfurion Stormrage.  I'd hoped to keep you occupied for a little longer.  It was my goal to keep you away from Hyjal while my allies attacked.  It would seem I have succeeded."]="Ah... Malfurion Stormrage.  I'd hoped to keep you occupied for a little longer.  It was my goal to keep you away from Hyjal while my allies attacked.  It would seem I have succeeded."
G["Ah... a challenge."]="Ah... um desafio."
G["Ah... a customer! Talk to my greatest invention, the Vendor-Tron 1000. He has all your needs... some of the rarest items you will ever find on the market anywhere in Kalimdor... not to mention that his programming will not allow any bargaining, so the price you see is the price you pay."]="Ah... um cliente! Fale com a minha maior invenção, o Vendor-Tron 1000. Ele tem todas as suas necessidades... algum dos itens mais raros que você encontrará no mercado em qualquer lugar em Kalimdor... sem mencionar que a programação dele não permitirá nenhuma negociação, então o preço que você vê é o preço que você paga."
G["Ah... another shaman seeks enlightenment, perhaps? Are the spirits speaking unclearly? Do you wish my help in seeing what lies before you?"]="Ah... outro xamã procurando a iluminação, talvez? Os espíritos estão falando pouco claro? Deseja minha ajuda para ver o que está diante de você?"
G["Ah... nah, man. Don't wanna get the merchandise all messy, ya know?"]="Oh... não, colega. Não quero que se me desordene a mercadoria, o pilhas?"
G["Ah... you have learned much... and learned well... an honorable battle."]="Ah... vocês têm aprendido muito... e bem... foi uma batalha honrado."
G["Ah... you're smarter than you appear, I see."]="Ah... É mais inteligente do que pareces."
G["Ah... your grace?"]="Eh... alteza?"
G["Ah...the heroes. You are persistent, aren't you? Your ally here attempted to match his power against mine - and paid the price. Now he shall serve me...by slaughtering you."]="Ah...the heroes. You are persistent, aren't you? Your ally here attempted to match his power against mine - and paid the price. Now he shall serve me...by slaughtering you."
G["Ah...the wondrous sound of kodos.  I love the way they make the ground shake... inspect the beast for me."]="Ah...the wondrous sound of kodos.  I love the way they make the ground shake... inspect the beast for me."
G["Aha!  It opened!  I expected that to be harder.  Thanks for your help, $n!"]="Aha!  It opened!  I expected that to be harder.  Thanks for your help, $n!"
G["Aha!  That's it!"]="Aha!  That's it!"
G["Aha!  There it is."]="Aha!  There it is."
G["Aha! Here's the sketch I was looking for..."]="Aha! Here's the sketch I was looking for..."
G["Aha, I understand now.  Thank you for waking me."]="Aha, I understand now.  Thank you for waking me."
G["Ahah! Fresh air at last!"]="Ahah, finalmente ar puro!"
G["Ahaha! You're gonna love this stuff!"]="Jajaja! Isto os vai encantar!"
G["Ahaha, get a load 'a me, mon!\n\nGriftah be back again! New stall, and brand new wares, and ready to pass on the deals to ya!\n\nWant more luck for deh mountains? Want tah buy the best \"luckydo\" ya ever smelled? Well step right up and don' be talkin' to grummles. Just let your good ol' friend Griftah lead ya right.\n\nThese miraculous baubles be cheap at tripple the price!"]="Ahaha, get a load 'a me, mon!\n\nGriftah be back again! New stall, and brand new wares, and ready to pass on the deals to ya!\n\nWant more luck for deh mountains? Want tah buy the best \"luckydo\" ya ever smelled? Well step right up and don' be talkin' to grummles. Just let your good ol' friend Griftah lead ya right.\n\nThese miraculous baubles be cheap at tripple the price!"
G["Ahaha, get a load 'a me, mon!\n\nGriftah be back again! New stall, and brand new wares, and ready to pass on the deals to ya!\n\nWant to be better, stronger, faster? Each one of these amulets be guaranteed to do just what I say they be doin'. Step up and buy one of these miraculous baubles! Cheap at twice the price!"]="Ahaha, get a load 'a me, mon!\n\nGriftah be back again! New stall, and brand new wares, and ready to pass on the deals to ya!\n\nWant to be better, stronger, faster? Each one of these amulets be guaranteed to do just what I say they be doin'. Step up and buy one of these miraculous baubles! Cheap at twice the price!"
G["Ahaha, ya see this? Griftah's BACK! Back in my stall, back with my old wares, and ready to pass on the deals to ya!\n\nWant to be better, stronger, faster? Each one of these amulets be guaranteed to do just what I say they be doin'. Step up and buy one of these miraculous baubles! Cheap at twice the price!"]="Ahaha, ya see this? Griftah's BACK! Back in my stall, back with my old wares, and ready to pass on the deals to ya!\n\nWant to be better, stronger, faster? Each one of these amulets be guaranteed to do just what I say they be doin'. Step up and buy one of these miraculous baubles! Cheap at twice the price!"
G["Ahahaha!"]="Ha, ja, ja!"
G["Ahahaha!  Zanzil is the winner this time!  And look who came to celebrate!"]="Ahahaha!  Zanzil is the winner this time!  And look who came to celebrate!"
G["Ahahaha! I must find the secrets!"]="Jajaaaja! Devo descobrir os segredos!"
G["Ahahaha! Such a pitiful creature!"]="Ha, ja, ja! Que criatura tão patética!"
G["Ahahaha, that was a good one!"]="Ha, ja, ja! Muito bom."
G["Ahahaha, the great Niuzao, strength of the west, divine celestial, protector of the weak..."]="Ha, ja, ja, o grande Niuzao. A força do oeste. A divindade celestial. O protetor dos fracos."
G["Ahahaha... Oh, I'm holding my sides at that one!"]="Ha, ja, ja... Ay, me vai dar algo!"
G["Ahahaha... you pitiful weaklings!"]="Ahahaha... you pitiful weaklings!"
G["Ahahahaha! I've always been with the Grimtotem! You fools are all going to die!"]="Jajajajaja! Eu sempre tenho estado de parte dos Totem Sinistro! Vocês, idiotas, vais a morrer!"
G["Ahahahaha! More than filth like you deserved."]="Ha, ja, ja! É mais do que se merece a escória como você."
G["Ahahahaha, that's the last of their runes! Twilight Suckers, no more elemental power for you!"]="Ha, ja, ja, essa era a última dos seus runas! Tonto Crepúsculo, não mais poder elemental para vocês!"
G["Ahahahaha, you've fallen into my trap, $n!"]="Jajajaaja, tem caído na minha armadilha, $n!"
G["Ahahahaha... hahahahahaha!"]="Ha, ja... Ha, ja, ja, ja, ja!"
G["Ahahahaha... so in the end, it is not Varian, but his whelp who comes to face me. You run bravely to your death, young one."]="Ahahahaha... so in the end, it is not Varian, but his whelp who comes to face me. You run bravely to your death, young one."
G["Ahahahahahaha!"]="Jajaaajaajaaajajaja!"
G["Ahahahahahaha! It is done. Return to my cave. We have much to discuss!"]="Jajaaajaaja! Já está. Volta a meu caverna. Temos que discutir muitas coisas!"
G["Ahahhhaahaa... was that supposed to hurt?"]="Ahahhhaahaa... was that supposed to hurt?"
G["Ahead hides our foe. Worshippers of chaos who seek to remake the world."]="Ahead hides our foe. Worshippers of chaos who seek to remake the world."
G["Aheh... heh... heh..."]="Je... je... je..."
G["Ahem!  I, ah, appreciate the ride, Madam Fiona.  It's nice to get off my feet for once."]="Ahem!  I, ah, appreciate the ride, Madam Fiona.  It's nice to get off my feet for once."
G["Ahem! Well... ah, next week: \"Tanaris.\" Starting with the excavation of Broken Pillar by Marvon Rivetseeker in Year 22."]="Ahem! Well... ah, next week: \"Tanaris.\" Starting with the excavation of Broken Pillar by Marvon Rivetseeker in Year 22."
G["Ahem, Mister Kyle, I'm trying to move across the room as hard as I can... please fix me!"]="Ahem, Mister Kyle, I'm trying to move across the room as hard as I can... please fix me!"
G["Ahem.\n\n\"I reckon there just ain't enough hours in the day!\"\n\nHow did that sound? Too forced? You think it would fly at the market?"]="Ahem.\n\n\"I reckon there just ain't enough hours in the day!\"\n\nHow did that sound? Too forced? You think it would fly at the market?"
G["Ahem. Don't forget about the bomb, Aldo."]="Ahem. Don't forget about the bomb, Aldo."
G["Ahem... so, I most certainly don't blame you for taking your time and catching your breath and congratulating yourselves for such heroism after such a long and hard-fought battle with that horrible monster just so long as when you're finished you don't forget about me over here because even though I'm small I think I can still find some way to repay you for your amazing bravery...."]="Ahem... so, I most certainly don't blame you for taking your time and catching your breath and congratulating yourselves for such heroism after such a long and hard-fought battle with that horrible monster just so long as when you're finished you don't forget about me over here because even though I'm small I think I can still find some way to repay you for your amazing bravery...."
G["Ahglrglglrglgrrr!"]="Ahglrglglrglgrrr!"
G["Ahh - my fearless assistants, I assume."]="Aaaah, meus corajosos ajudantes, suponho."
G["Ahh Jogu...he's probably passed out behind the still. Just go a few yards to the south to the watering hole and you can't miss him.\n\nHe came wandering through town a while back and hasn't ever left.\n\nThe locals love him. He's got quite the knack for predicting the harvest."]="Ahh Jogu...he's probably passed out behind the still. Just go a few yards to the south to the watering hole and you can't miss him.\n\nHe came wandering through town a while back and hasn't ever left.\n\nThe locals love him. He's got quite the knack for predicting the harvest."
G["Ahh the Glustewelt twins!"]="Ahh, os gêmeos Glustewelt!"
G["Ahh there it is."]="Ahh, aí está."
G["Ahh yeah, mon! Dere be great glory ta be had here!"]="Ah, sim, tron! Há grande glória que obter aqui!"
G["Ahh yes, I remember the first time I fought against the Dark Summoner.  And the second time... and the third..."]="Ahh yes, I remember the first time I fought against the Dark Summoner.  And the second time... and the third..."
G["Ahh yes, now I remember, your wedding night wasn't it?"]="Ah, sim, agorao lembrança, foi no seu noite de bodas, não é assim?"
G["Ahh yes, the first kill of the morning. Continue!"]="Aaah, sim... A primeira morte da manhã. Continue."
G["Ahh!  Get away from me, you fiend!"]="Aaah! Não te acerques a mim, desalmado!"
G["Ahh!  I... I can't move!"]="Ahh!  I... I can't move!"
G["Ahh! Ahhhhhhhhhhh!"]="Aah! Aaaaaaaaaaaah!"
G["Ahh! Hawks!\n\nAHHHH! WOLVES!"]="Aaah! Halcones!\n\nAAAAH! LOBOS!"
G["Ahh! Help! What is that thing!? It doesn't matter, nothing will stop me now, not when I'm so close! Maybe if I don't look at it...?"]="Ah! Socorro! Que é isso? É igual; já nada me detendrá. Não quando estou tão perto... ao melhor se não o miro..."
G["Ahh! I hate you puppy-face! So mean!"]="Aah! Eu odiar você, rosto de cão! Muito ruim!"
G["Ahh! It all safe now?"]="Aah! Tudo a salvou agora?"
G["Ahh! It's coming right for us!"]="Aaah! Vem a por nós!"
G["Ahh! So returns my conquering hero."]="Ah! Voltou. E de uma sozinha peça!"
G["Ahh! There you are, $n.\n\nI must speak with you at once."]="Ahh! Aí está, $n.\n\nDevo falar com você imediatamente."
G["Ahh! What is the meaning of this!?"]="Ahh! Que indica isto?!"
G["Ahh!!!"]="Ahh!!!"
G["Ahh,  Back in Drak'Tharon at last!"]="Aaah, de volta em Drak'tharon ao fim!"
G["Ahh, \"Mystical Conjurings of the Archmages of Dalaran.\" Perfect."]="Ahh, \"Conjuros místicos dos archimagos de Dalaran.\" Perfeito."
G["Ahh, I cannot heal through that much damage! Did you forget to equip your heaviest armor?!"]="Argh, não posso curar tanto dano! Você esqueceu de equipar sua armadura de tanque?"
G["Ahh, Illusionary Tunnelers! Speedy and I have faced these foes before. Beware, they may burrow into the ground and then suddenly pop up under a new target, and CHOMP! Hah ha hah ha."]="Ah, Escavadores Ilusórios. Ligeirinho e eu já enfrentamos esses antes. Cuidado, eles podem se entocar no solo e aparecer debaixo de um novo alvo e NHAC! Hah ha!"
G["Ahh, another powerful traveler. The nether can be dangerous; you'll want the most potent spells at your disposal. I carry the finest reagents, common and exotic. Come, buy - you won't be sorry!"]="Ahh, another powerful traveler. The nether can be dangerous; you'll want the most potent spells at your disposal. I carry the finest reagents, common and exotic. Come, buy - you won't be sorry!"
G["Ahh, at last... Time for a little break."]="Ahh, finalmente... É hora de fazer uma pequena pausar."
G["Ahh, blast it. C'mon, c'mon already!"]="Ah, maldição. Venha, venha!"
G["Ahh, dere be our destiny... Gundrak!"]="Oh, ali está nosso destino... Gundrak!"
G["Ahh, dere you are!  We been searching da entire jungle for ya!"]="Ahh, dere you are!  We been searching da entire jungle for ya!"
G["Ahh, freedom!"]="Ahh, liberdade!"
G["Ahh, get these things away from me!"]="Aaah, quítame estas coisas de acima!"
G["Ahh, gnomish ingenuity! The Horde won't know what hit 'em."]="Ahh, gnomish ingenuity! The Horde won't know what hit 'em."
G["Ahh, good to finally see a friendly face, mon.\n\nWould be good, dat is, if I could, you know, see..."]="Aah, eh'taba desejando ver uma rosto conhecida, colega.\n\nEm fim, se pudesse, já sabe, ver..."
G["Ahh, here we are. Be careful - I've had trouble in this area before."]="Ahh, here we are. Be careful - I've had trouble in this area before."
G["Ahh, if I could just get my hands on you! You would make a very nice experiment!"]="Ahh, if I could just get my hands on you! You would make a very nice experiment!"
G["Ahh, it feels good to get salt in the old fur again."]="Aah, é agradável voltar a notar a sal no pelagem."
G["Ahh, it is good to see you again, $r."]="Aaah, fico feliz em ver você novamente, $r."
G["Ahh, life is good."]="Ah, a vida é doce."
G["Ahh, many thanks, friend. I needed that."]="Ahh, many thanks, friend. I needed that."
G["Ahh, much better.  I owe ya one."]="Ah, muito melhor. Te devo uma."
G["Ahh, my precious Ameenah! How wonderful to see you again."]="Ahh, meu querida Ameenah! Que bem voltar a ver você!"
G["Ahh, nothing like a job well done!"]="Ahh, não há nada como o trabalho bem feito."
G["Ahh, the Battle Scar. Pretty hairy out there, I hear."]="Aaah, a Marca de Guerra."
G["Ahh, the jungle.  It's good to get out of town every once in a while, you know?"]="Ah, a selva. É bom sair da cidade de vez em quando, sabe?"
G["Ahh, them - a sad tale, that one.\n\nThey have disappeared behind the walls of Zul'Aman. I haven't heard from them in days.\n\nI've seen it a hundred times; that overeager itch for fame and fortune. I tried to hold them back, told them they weren't prepared, but in the end they chose to face their peril...."]="Ahh, them - a sad tale, that one.\n\nThey have disappeared behind the walls of Zul'Aman. I haven't heard from them in days.\n\nI've seen it a hundred times; that overeager itch for fame and fortune. I tried to hold them back, told them they weren't prepared, but in the end they chose to face their peril...."
G["Ahh, there she is. The battle-maiden of the Dragonmaw. Let me see your face."]="Ah, aqui está. A dama de batalha dos Faucedraco. Deixe-me ver seu rosto."
G["Ahh, there we go. Now, Keever must try this vial and see if it works."]="Ah, bom, vamos além. Agora Keever deve experimentar com este frasco e ver se funciona."
G["Ahh, there we go. Told you I had it!"]="Já está! Vê? O tinha tudo baixo controle!"
G["Ahh, there you are.  Hello!  I figured that, while you're flying to Kharanos, I'd give you some data about what's going on outside of Coldridge Valley."]="Ahh, there you are.  Hello!  I figured that, while you're flying to Kharanos, I'd give you some data about what's going on outside of Coldridge Valley."
G["Ahh, turnip! Get out of here!"]="Ahh, turnip! Get out of here!"
G["Ahh, visitorsss!"]="Ah! Vissssitantes!"
G["Ahh, ya couldn't resist, could ya? Want to be better, stronger, faster? Each one of these amulets be guaranteed to do just what I say they be doin'. Step up and buy one of these miraculous baubles! Cheap at twice the price!"]="Ahh, você não conseguiu resistir, conseguiu? Quer ser melhor, mais forte, mais rápido? É garantido que cada um desses amuletos faça exatamente o que eu digo que eles estão fazendo. Intensifique e compre um desses enfeites milagrosos! Barato pelo dobro do preço!"
G["Ahh, yes. Any last vords? Hmm?"]="Ahh, sim. Quais são seus últimas palavrras? Hmm?"
G["Ahh, yes. How have you been enjoying your time here?"]="Ah, sim. Que tal te o está passando por aqui?"
G["Ahh, yes. I know just the thing..."]="Ah, sim. Conheço o ingrediente perfeito..."
G["Ahh, you will need to make your way over to the Hunter's Hall then. Several great hunters like Holt Thunderhorn can be found there on the Hunter Rise."]="Ahh, você precisará ir até o Salão dos Caçadores então. Vários grandes caçadores como Holt Thunderhorn podem ser encontrados lá no Hunter Rise."
G["Ahh... My experiments never seem to work out right. Maybe I should go back downstream."]="Ahh... Meus experimentos nunca parecem funcionar. Talvez deveria voltar rio baixo."
G["Ahh... beer. Just what my men needed. Thank you, $p."]="$p, Ah, cerveja. Logo o que necessário meus homens. Obrigado."
G["Ahh... food It's 'bout time."]="Ahh... já vai sendo hora de ir a comer."
G["Ahh... it's good to be home."]="Aaah... é agradável eh'tar em casa."
G["Ahh... just what I needed."]="Ahh... just what I needed."
G["Ahh... much better."]="Ahh... muito melhor."
G["Ahh... not so fast my friend.  The freedom you seek is behind you."]="Ahh... não tão rápido, $gamigo: amiga;. A liberdade que atenção está atrás de ti."
G["Ahh... so it is, so it is.  Carry on then.  Carry on t'yer death."]="Ahh... assim é, assim é. Continue então. Continue com a morte."
G["Ahh... there you are. The master told us you'd be arriving soon."]="Ahh... Aqui está... O mestre nos disse que lhegarías pronto."
G["Ahh... welcome to my parlor."]="Ah... os dou a boas-vindas a meu salão!"
G["Ahh.... better."]="Ahh... melhor."
G["Ahhh $n, it be good to see ya once agin. Da threat to dese lands be grave, and I come to join da fight. I see ya grown in your own. Good. You mek me, an' all your tribe, proud."]="Ahhh $n, it be good to see ya once agin. Da threat to dese lands be grave, and I come to join da fight. I see ya grown in your own. Good. You mek me, an' all your tribe, proud."
G["Ahhh - the heart of a King. The powers of a God."]="Ahhh, o coração de um Rei. Os poderes de um Deus."
G["Ahhh ha ha ha! So much blood! Nice."]="Ha, ja, ja! Quanta sangue! Me encantar."
G["Ahhh!"]="Ahhh!"
G["Ahhh! What be happenin' to me, mon?"]="Ahhh! Que me está passando, colega?"
G["Ahhh!!"]="Ahhh!!"
G["Ahhh, Stormwind Visitor's Center is what you are looking for then. It's the first building on the left as you walk through the front gates from the Valley of Heroes."]="Ahhh, o Centro de Visitantes de Ventobravo é o que você está procurando então. É o primeiro edifício à esquerda enquanto você atravessa os portões da linha de frente do Valley of Heroes."
G["Ahhh, another soul for the taking."]="Ah, outra alma para a colheita."
