G["Ahhh, guud stuff!"]="Aaaah! É güeno!"
G["Ahhh, here's a nice one. Yes, this egg will do. Not this one. Too small! Perhaps this one could pass the bill..."]="Vá, este está muito bem. Sim, este ovo servirá. Este não. É demais pequeno! Talvez este poderá passar..."
G["Ahhh, just in time! My stomach was rumblin' loud."]="Ahhh, just in time! My stomach was rumblin' loud."
G["Ahhh, look who has joined us."]="Ah, olhe quem vem."
G["Ahhh, our guests have arrived, just as the master promised."]="Ahhh, our guests have arrived, just as the master promised."
G["Ahhh, so the grand lady of the Kirin Tor wants a fight, does she?"]="Ah, assim que a grande senhora do Kirin Tor quer luta, eh?"
G["Ahhh, you are looking for Dungar Longdrink. He has some of the fastest gryphons this side of Khaz Modan! You can find him up on the ramparts in the Trade District."]="Ahhh, você está procurando por Dungar Longdrink. Ele tem algum dos grifos mais rápidos deste lado de Khaz Modan! Você pode encontrá-o nas muralhas do Distrito Comercial."
G["Ahhh..."]="Aaah..."
G["Ahhh... Hah!"]="Aaah... Ha!"
G["Ahhh... I shall add a new blade to my collection today..."]="Ahhh... I shall add a new blade to my collection today..."
G["Ahhh... Ironfoe."]="Ahhh... Ferromazo."
G["Ahhh... RAAAAAGH! Never thought... I would be free of him...."]="Ahhh... RAAAAAGH! Mais pensei… que me liberaría de ele..."
G["Ahhh... this test is simple. All you need to do is strike the bamboo, until it breaks."]="Ahhh... this test is simple. All you need to do is strike the bamboo, until it breaks."
G["Ahhh.... Hah!"]="Aaah... Ha!"
G["Ahhh.... Yes, the blood of the exiles fills me with power! Beware, Bloodmyst!"]="Ahhh... Sim, o sangue dos exilados me cheia de força! Cuidado, Brumas de Sangue!"
