G["Ahhhh! Or maybe it does. I better, um, go check on the others."]="Ou talvez ela seja... Acho que é melhor... hm, eu ir ver os outros."
G["Ahhhh!!! What is that thing?!"]="Ahhhh!!! Que é isso?!"
G["Ahhhhggg... this pain in my head is killing me.\n\nThey must've sent you to rescue me.  Took them long enough!  Do you have any idea of the things they do to prisoners here?"]="Ahhhhggg... this pain in my head is killing me.\n\nThey must've sent you to rescue me.  Took them long enough!  Do you have any idea of the things they do to prisoners here?"
G["Ahhhhh ha ha haa!"]="Ahhhhh tem tem haa!"
G["Ahhhhh!"]="Ahhhhh!"
G["Ahhhhh!!!"]="Ahhhhh!!!"
G["Ahhhhhhh!"]="Ahhhhhhh!"
G["Ahhhhhhh! The sky is falling!"]="Aaaaah! Estamos perdidos!"
G["Ahhhhhhhh!"]="Aaaaaaah!"
G["Ahhhhhhhhhhhh!"]="Aaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaah!"
G["Ahhhhhhhhhhhhhhhhhhh!"]="Ahhhhhhhhhhhhhhhhhhh!"
G["Ahoy matey!  Hoist anchor, trim the mainsail, batton down the hatches and set to sea!  Today we scuttle the Venture Company's blasted contraptions and send 'em all to feed the fishes!  Now hop to, before I put the black spot on ye!"]="Ahoy matey!  Hoist anchor, trim the mainsail, batton down the hatches and set to sea!  Today we scuttle the Venture Company's blasted contraptions and send 'em all to feed the fishes!  Now hop to, before I put the black spot on ye!"
G["Ahoy there!"]="Ahoy lá!"
G["Ahoy there, captain."]="Onda, capitão."
G["Ahoy!"]="Ah do navio!"
G["Ahoy!  I see more o' those goblins over there!"]="Ahoy!  I see more o' those goblins over there!"
G["Ahoy! It's Pirates' Day, ye know... and 'til the sun rises on the morrow, Booty Bay is MINE."]="Ahoy! É o dia dos piratas, você sabe... e até o sol nascer no dia seguinte, Booty Bay é MINA."
G["Ahoy! Ye be lookin' to book passage board the Sister Mercy, matey? Ye've come to the right place..."]="Ahoy! Você quer reservar passagens para a Sister Mercy, amigo? Você veio ao lugar certo..."
G["Ahoy, $n! Not a pretty picture, is it?\n\nThe Horizon Scout at the bottom of the sea, my crew in shambles, and our cargo and passengers strewn about like so much debris that you'd think this was one of Stormwind's canals after a festival.\n\nAnd that's not where the trouble ends..."]="Ahoy, $n! Not a pretty picture, is it?\n\nThe Horizon Scout at the bottom of the sea, my crew in shambles, and our cargo and passengers strewn about like so much debris that you'd think this was one of Stormwind's canals after a festival.\n\nAnd that's not where the trouble ends..."
G["Ahoy, me hearty!\n\nToday's OUR day, ye know... PIRATES' DAY!\n\nOl' Chumbucket and I came up with the idea, and once the Dread Captain heard of it... well, here we are!"]="Ahoy, me hearty!\n\nToday's OUR day, ye know... PIRATES' DAY!\n\nOl' Chumbucket and I came up with the idea, and once the Dread Captain heard of it... well, here we are!"
G["Ahoy, mon!  What be happenin', ye salty 'at steppa!\n\nDis place be all chacka-chacka, ye scallywag!"]="Ahoy, mon!  What be happenin', ye salty 'at steppa!\n\nDis place be all chacka-chacka, ye scallywag!"
G["Ahoy, umm.... \"matey!\"  This is the $g fellow : gal; I was telling you about, \"me bucko!\"  $g He : She;'s a real \"terror of the seas!\""]="Ahoy, umm.... \"matey!\"  This is the $g fellow : gal; I was telling you about, \"me bucko!\"  $g He : She;'s a real \"terror of the seas!\""
G["Ahunae's axe will be the end of the Drakkari.\n\nYou be takin' care of any that get past my axe!"]="O machado de Ahunae acabará com os Drakkari.\n\nE você te encargarás de tudo o que escape a meu machado!"
G["Ahune Retreats.  His defenses diminish."]="Ahune se retira. Seus defesas disminuyen."
G["Ahune will soon resurface."]="Ahune pronto voltará à superfície."
G["Ahune, your strength grows no more!"]="Ahune, sua força já não aumenta!"
G["Aid in the construction of at least two of the five defenses."]="Ajuda na construção de ao menos dois das cinco defesas."
G["Aid me brethren!"]="Ajudem-me, irmãos!"
G["Aid me in destroying these tortured souls! Together we will loosen Frostmourne's hold and weaken the Lich King from within!"]="Ajudem-me a destruir estas almas torturadas! Juntos debilitaremos o poder da Agonia de Gelo e ao Rei Lich desde dentro!"
G["Aid me my brood!"]="Aid me my brood!"
G["Aid me! $n draws near!"]="Ajuda! $n se aproxima!"
G["Aid me, friends. Let us call upon the spirits for vision."]="Ajudem-me, amigos meus. Pidamos uma visão aos espíritos."
G["Aid me, you fools, before it's too late!"]="Ajudem-me, idiotas, antes de que seja tarde demais!"
G["Aid us, Bwonsamdi! Help us regain our home! Return de Darkspear to de Isles, and hear your drums again! Drink your ritual offerings once more! Dis, as de Son of Sen'jin, I swear."]="Aid us, Bwonsamdi! Help us regain our home! Return de Darkspear to de Isles, and hear your drums again! Drink your ritual offerings once more! Dis, as de Son of Sen'jin, I swear."
G["Aid your children in this time of need!"]="Ajudem aos seus filhos nesta época de necessidade!"
G["Aid your companions little one; the battle is joined!"]="Ajuda aos seus companheiros, pequenh$go: a;, a batalha tem empezado!"
G["Aided by the Alliance, my forces will hold the line here, but I need you to deliver my report to General Krakork in Thrallmar. With his help, we'll be able to drive these demons back into the abyss that spawned them! Speak to Vlagga Freyfeather who stands on the platform behind us. She'll speed you on your way."]="Aided by the Alliance, my forces will hold the line here, but I need you to deliver my report to General Krakork in Thrallmar. With his help, we'll be able to drive these demons back into the abyss that spawned them! Speak to Vlagga Freyfeather who stands on the platform behind us. She'll speed you on your way."
G["Aiiieeee!"]="Aaaaaayyy!"
G["Aim Your Light of Souls at the Spirits to Banish Them!"]="Aim Your Light of Souls at the Spirits to Banish Them!"
G["Aim fer tha jimmies!"]="Indica aos seus partes pudendas!"
G["Aim for the bow, the port and starboard buoyancy sacs, and the stern..."]="Aim for the bow, the port and starboard buoyancy sacs, and the stern..."
G["Aim for the eye!"]="Indica ao olho!"
G["Aim for the keester!"]="Aim for the keester!"
G["Aim for those amber bombs, they'll cause a huge explosion if we manage to set one off!"]="Aim for those amber bombs, they'll cause a huge explosion if we manage to set one off!"
G["Aim for those amber bombs, they'll cause a huge explosion if you manage to set one off!"]="Aim for those amber bombs, they'll cause a huge explosion if you manage to set one off!"
G["Aim true! Send them limping back to Stormwind!"]="Aim true! Send them limping back to Stormwind!"
G["Aim!"]="Aim!"
G["Aimee is very nice."]="Aimee é muito agradável."
G["Aimee's cart can usually be found in northern Dalaran, near the Bank of Dalaran."]="O carrinho de Aimee geralmente pode ser encontrado no norte de Dalaran, perto do Banco de Dalaran."
G["Ain't NO ONE gonna escape Zul'Gurub!  Not with Jin'do in charge!"]="NINGUÉM escapa de Zul'gurub! Não enquanto Jin'do eh'chá ao envio!"
G["Ain't NO ONE gonna stop Jin'do!"]="NINGUÉM detendrá a Jin'do!"
G["Ain't gonna be nothin' left after this!"]="Não quedará nem rastro depois de isto!"
G["Ain't much to it!\n\nThere are five rare treasures that you can find in the Dark Soil around Pandaria: Ruby Shards, Lovely Apples, Jade Cats, Blue Feathers, and Marsh Lilies.\n\nAs long as you have one of those items in your bags, you'll see who around here is willing to accept them.\n\nFind one of those and give them to someone you like, and chances are they'll like you a little back! Everyone has a favorite item out of the five, so talk to folks to learn what they prefer.\n\nAlso, the folks 'round here love food! I mean, who doesn't? If you know how to cook, you might just profit!\n\nThat's about all I know about gifts. Good luck!"]="Ain't much to it!\n\nThere are five rare treasures that you can find in the Dark Soil around Pandaria: Ruby Shards, Lovely Apples, Jade Cats, Blue Feathers, and Marsh Lilies.\n\nAs long as you have one of those items in your bags, you'll see who around here is willing to accept them.\n\nFind one of those and give them to someone you like, and chances are they'll like you a little back! Everyone has a favorite item out of the five, so talk to folks to learn what they prefer.\n\nAlso, the folks 'round here love food! I mean, who doesn't? If you know how to cook, you might just profit!\n\nThat's about all I know about gifts. Good luck!"
G["Ain't no messin' with Cayden Dunwald!"]="Ninguém se mete com Cayden Montocre!"
G["Ain't no other way, mon. We gotta stop Garrosh here an' now, else we be runnin' the rest of our lives."]="Ain't no other way, mon. We gotta stop Garrosh here an' now, else we be runnin' the rest of our lives."
G["Ain't she a beauty? Want to take her for a spin?"]="Ela não é uma beleza? Quer levá-a para dar uma volta?"
G["Air guard, attack!! Strafe them now, while they cannot maneuver!"]="Air guard, attack!! Strafe them now, while they cannot maneuver!"
G["Air raid on Icemist! Let the Anub'ar feel the power of our air strikes!"]="Ataque aéreo sobre Brumas de Gelo! Deixem que os Anub'ar sientan o poder de nossos ataque aéreos!"
G["Air superiority."]="Superioridade aérea."
G["Ajamon took her maiden name again. Despite everything, I kinda miss her, you know?"]="Ajamon took her maiden name again. Despite everything, I kinda miss her, you know?"
G["Ajark, you standing like rock. Rakat move more. You move or you get hurt by wasp sting or bristlepine tusk, you see. Move more!"]="Ajark, you standing like rock. Rakat move more. You move or you get hurt by wasp sting or bristlepine tusk, you see. Move more!"
G["Ak'agthshi ma uhnish, ak'uq shg'cul vwahuhn! H'iwn iggksh Phquathi gag OOU KAAXTH SHUUL!"]="Ak'agthshi ma uhnish, ak'uq shg'cul vwahuhn! H'iwn iggksh Phquathi gag OOU KAAXTH SHUUL!"
G["Ak-a-ra-k! No escape for -- caw -- you!"]="Ak-a-ra-k! No escape for -- caw -- you!"
G["Aka'Magosh, brave warriors. The alliance is in great number here."]="Aka'Magosh, grandes guerreiros. As forças da Aliança são numerosas."
G["Aka'Magosh, goblin!"]="Aka'Magosh, goblin!"
G["Akama has no master.  Not anymore."]="Akama não tem amo. Já não."
G["Akama has no master. Not anymore."]="Akama não tem amo. Já não."
G["Akama, lead the way!"]="Você primeiro, Akama!"
G["Akama, my friend!  Have you been informed?  I was found out by Vashj's followers.  Our secret is in peril!"]="Akama, my friend!  Have you been informed?  I was found out by Vashj's followers.  Our secret is in peril!"
G["Akama. Your duplicity is hardly surprising. I should have slaughtered you and your malformed brethren long ago."]="Akama. Your duplicity is hardly surprising. I should have slaughtered you and your malformed brethren long ago."
G["Akil'darah, return me to my allies."]="Akil'darah, leve-me de volta com meus aliados."
G["Akil'zon, the invaders approach!"]="Akil'zon, the invaders approach!"
G["Akkolon has entered the battlefield!"]="Akkolon entrou no campo de batalha!"
G["Aku'mai demands more sacrifices, now you must die!"]="Aku'mai demands more sacrifices, now you must die!"
G["Aku'mai is dead! At last, I can leave this wretched place."]="Aku'mai is dead! At last, I can leave this wretched place."
G["Aku'mai is sure to summon the old gods for us.  If only we can provide enough innocents to satisfy his hunger."]="Aku'mai poderá evocar para nós aos deuses antigos. Sempre que possamos entregarle suficientes inocentes para calmar seu apetito."
G["Aku'mai needs more innocents to be satisfied."]="Aku'mai needs more innocents to be satisfied."
G["Al'Akir grant my enemies a cold, swift death!"]="Que Al'Akir lhes otorgue a meus inimigos uma morte rápida e fria!"
G["Al'Akir, your servant calls for aid!"]="Al'Akir, your servant calls for aid!"
G["Al'golath mal shal'nel... darkness consumes..."]="Al'golath mal shal'nel... A escuridão consome..."
G["Al'tabim, I have lost my Zandalar Demoniac's Mantle. Can you help?"]="Al'tabim, e perdido meu manto de demoníaco Zandalariano. Pode me ajudar?"
G["Al'tabim, I seem to have misplaced my Zandalar Illusionist's Mantle. Can you supply me with a replacement?"]="Al'tabim, I seem to have misplaced my Zandalar Illusionist's Mantle. Can you supply me with a replacement?"
G["Al'tabim, my Zandalar Confessor's Wraps have gone missing. Can you replace them?"]="Al'tabim, my Zandalar Confessor's Wraps have gone missing. Can you replace them?"
G["Al'tha, Al'tha bormaz. Ni bormaz ta'thall? It comes, it walks in flames, $r!"]="Al'tha, Al'tha bormaz. Nem bormaz ta'thalh? Se aproxima, camina nas chamas, $r!"
G["Alamar, I'd  like to introduce you to $n, a recent escapee from Gnomeregan."]="Alamar, I'd  like to introduce you to $n, a recent escapee from Gnomeregan."
G["Alana be'lendor!"]="Alana be'lendor!"
G["Alanna Raveneye attributes part of her talent in enchanting to her communion with the spirits at the Oracle Glade.  You should be able to find her there now."]="Alanna Raveneye atribui parte do seu talento à encantadora comunhão com os espíritos da Clareira do Oráculo. Você deve encontrá-a lá agora."
G["Alanna spends most of her day at the Oracle Glade where she practices her profession.  Should you wish to learn the Enchanter's profession you will need to go there to find her."]="Alanna passa a maior parte do dia no Oracle Glade, onde pratica sua profissão. Se você deseja aprender a profissão do Encantador, precisará ir até lá para encontrá-a."
G["Alarm! Trespassers have entered the temple!"]="Alerta! Uns intrusos têm entrou no templo!"
G["Alarm, my masters! INTRUDERS!"]="Alerta, mestres! INTRUSOS!"
G["Alarm, oh great masters! ALARM!"]="Alerta, oh, grandes mestres! ALERTA!"
G["Alarm-a-bomb unit 2600 has failed. Self-destruct override [ACTIVE]. Cooldown [ACTIVE]."]="A unidade de alarme da bomba 2600 tem falhado. Anular autodestrucção [ATIVO]. Enfriamento [ATIVO]."
G["Alas $c, you are not considered to be a true friend of Darnassus and the night elves of Teldrassil.  Only when you prove yourself to be friendly to us through deeds - not just mere words - will I then make available my selection of mounts for your perusal."]="Alas $c, you are not considered to be a true friend of Darnassus and the night elves of Teldrassil.  Only when you prove yourself to be friendly to us through deeds - not just mere words - will I then make available my selection of mounts for your perusal."
G["Alas $c, you are not considered to be exalted to Darnassus and the night elves of Teldrassil.  Only when you prove yourself to us through deeds - not just mere words - will I then make available my selection of mounts for your perusal."]="Alas $c, you are not considered to be exalted to Darnassus and the night elves of Teldrassil.  Only when you prove yourself to us through deeds - not just mere words - will I then make available my selection of mounts for your perusal."
G["Alas $n, I am much too busy to talk.  As I mentioned, I need time to think on the situation at hand.\n\nI wish you luck in your travels.  Good day."]="Alas $n, I am much too busy to talk.  As I mentioned, I need time to think on the situation at hand.\n\nI wish you luck in your travels.  Good day."
G["Alas! Too soon."]="Diabo! Cedo demais."
G["Alas, I have grown too weak to see the strands of fate."]="Alas, I have grown too weak to see the strands of fate."
G["Alas, I'm in no condition to go on. If only our entire supply of Greenstone Brew hadn't been stolen!"]="Alas, I'm in no condition to go on. If only our entire supply of Greenstone Brew hadn't been stolen!"
G["Alas, brave, brave adventurers, your meddling has reached its end. Do you hear the clatter of bone and steel coming up the tunnel behind you? That is the sound of your impending demise."]="Alas, brave, brave adventurers, your meddling has reached its end. Do you hear the clatter of bone and steel coming up the tunnel behind you? That is the sound of your impending demise."
G["Alas, hero of Azeroth, you give me a greater gift than you know."]="Ay, herói de Azeroth, me concedes um presente muito maior do que acha."
G["Alas, it always seems like it does.  I - as did the rest of the Cenarion Circle - had assumed that Milli's creation was destroyed during the War of the Ancients.  This, as I have come to learn, is far from correct.\n\nThe Fruit of Fertility survived... though now it is known as the Felvine.  It is being corrupted by the demonic lord of that section of Eldre'Thalas, Alzzin the Wildshaper."]="Alas, it always seems like it does.  I - as did the rest of the Cenarion Circle - had assumed that Milli's creation was destroyed during the War of the Ancients.  This, as I have come to learn, is far from correct.\n\nThe Fruit of Fertility survived... though now it is known as the Felvine.  It is being corrupted by the demonic lord of that section of Eldre'Thalas, Alzzin the Wildshaper."
G["Alas, only champions of Darnassus may purchase what I have to offer."]="Infelizmente, apenas os campeões de Darnassus podem comprar o que tenho para oferecer."
G["Alas, only the esteemed champions of Silvermoon City may purchase what I have to offer."]="Infelizmente, apenas os estimados campeões de Silvermoon City podem comprar o que tenho para oferecer."
G["Alas, sometimes one must take matters into one's own hands. Balamore shanal!"]="Alas, sometimes one must take matters into one's own hands. Balamore shanal!"
G["Alas, the Zandalari trolls have already claimed and fortified it."]="Mas os trolls Zandalari já a têm reclamado e fortificado."
G["Alas, the only way to defeat the Lich King is to destroy him at the place where he was created."]="Alas, the only way to defeat the Lich King is to destroy him at the place where he was created."
G["Alas... I am sorry to say I cannot currently give you your fortune, as you have recently received a fortune reading from me.\n\nReturn to me several hours from when you first received your fortune.  The forces of Fate will have properly recalibrated themselves, and I will be able to see into your future."]="Alas... I am sorry to say I cannot currently give you your fortune, as you have recently received a fortune reading from me.\n\nReturn to me several hours from when you first received your fortune.  The forces of Fate will have properly recalibrated themselves, and I will be able to see into your future."
G["Alchemist Narett and Brant Jasperbloom teach Alchemy and Herbalism out of a small shop here; they'll be able to help you."]="O Alquimista Narett e Brant Jasperbloom ensinam Alquimia e Herbalismo em uma pequena loja aqui; eles poderão ajudá-o."
G["Alchemist, I am covered with living blight!"]="Alquimista, estou coberto de anhublo vivo!"
G["Alchemy"]="Alchemy (Alquimia)"
G["Alchemy Goods"]="Itens de alquimia"
G["Alchemy Lab"]="Alchemy Lab"
G["Alchemy allows you to use herbs and other materials to create a wide variety of useful elixirs, potions, oils, flasks and cauldrons. You'll also gain greater, longer-lasting benefits when using your own elixirs and flasks.\nHighly skilled alchemists may also transmute elemental materials and certain minerals for use by other production professions.\nAlchemy pairs well with Herbalism as it allows you to gather your own herbs."]="Alchemy allows you to use herbs and other materials to create a wide variety of useful elixirs, potions, oils, flasks and cauldrons. You'll also gain greater, longer-lasting benefits when using your own elixirs and flasks.\nHighly skilled alchemists may also transmute elemental materials and certain minerals for use by other production professions.\nAlchemy pairs well with Herbalism as it allows you to gather your own herbs."
G["Alchemy is a bit like magic, don't you think? With the change of a single ingredient a simple drought can either heal you, or kill you."]="Alchemy is a bit like magic, don't you think? With the change of a single ingredient a simple drought can either heal you, or kill you."
G["Aldor Bank"]="Aldor Bank"
G["Aldor Gem Merchant"]="Aldor Gem Merchant"
G["Aldor Inn"]="Aldor Inn"
G["Aldor Stable"]="Aldor Stable"
G["Alegorn is a masterful chef who has had centuries with which to perfect his cooking.  You should consider yourself blessed should he decide to teach you.  If you believe you are worthy, you can find him in the Craftsmen's Terrace."]="Alegorn is a masterful chef who has had centuries with which to perfect his cooking.  You should consider yourself blessed should he decide to teach you.  If you believe you are worthy, you can find him in the Craftsmen's Terrace."
G["Alert! Alert! Construct senses that enemies have breeched our defenses. Increase pace."]="Alert! Alert! Construct senses that enemies have breeched our defenses. Increase pace."
G["Alert! You are marked for extermination."]="Alerta! Estão marcados para exterminação."
G["Alert. You are combusting. Please execute safety procedures."]="Alert. You are combusting. Please execute safety procedures."
G["Alert: security fail-safes deactivated. Beginning memory purge and..."]="Alert: security fail-safes deactivated. Beginning memory purge and..."
G["Alestus is a master at the... messier way of mending wounds.  If learning first aid is your aim, seek him out on the Walk of Elders, near the entrance to the Royal Exchange."]="Alestus é um mestre na... maneira mais bagunçada de reparar feridas. Se o objetivo é aprender primeiros socorros, procure-o na Calçada dos Anciãos, perto da entrada do Royal Exchange."
G["Alexstrasza grant me the resolve to drive our enemies back!"]="Obrigado a Alexstrasza estou resolvido a acabar com nossos inimigos!"
G["Alexstrasza has chosen capable allies.... A pity that I must END YOU!"]="Alexstrasza has chosen capable allies.... A pity that I must END YOU!"
G["Alexstrasza is  my answer."]="Alexstrasza é a minha resposta."
G["Alexstrasza is already engaged with Deathwing! If you hurry, there may still be time to help!"]="Alexstrasza já está lutando contra Alamuerte! Se te das pressa, talvez estiver a tempo para ser de ajuda!"
G["Alexstrasza is hurt. Keep the beams red by killing Twilight Corruptors, or she will lose the fight!"]="Alexstrasza está ferida. Matar corruptores Crepúsculo para que os raios sigan vermelhos ou perderá a batalha!"
G["Alexstrasza will be here shortly. Come, we will prepare the sanctuary."]="Alexstrasza estará aqui em breve. Vamos, prepararemos o santuário."
G["Alexstrasza winches in pain."]="Alexstrasza há um gesto de dor."
G["Alexstrasza's Drakes will pick us up on the other side of this abandoned excavation site. Check your weapons, this place stinks of an ambush.\nLet me know when you're ready to move out."]="Alexstrasza's Drakes will pick us up on the other side of this abandoned excavation site. Check your weapons, this place stinks of an ambush.\nLet me know when you're ready to move out."
G["Alexstrasza's drakes should meet us here..."]="Aqui nos encontraremos com os dracos de Alexstrasza."
G["Alexstrasza, another of your brood falls!"]="Alexstrasza, tem caído um mais do seu linagem!"
G["Alexstrasza, can you show me what happened here?"]="Alexstrasza, você pode me mostrar o que aconteceu aqui?"
G["Alexstrazsa, the Life-Binder. A magnificent creature."]="Alexstrazsa, a Protetora. Uma magnífica criatura."
G["Algalon diagnostics assess danger of systemic Old God corruption in planetary vital functions.  Calculating chance of Omega Reply-code..."]="Algalon diagnostics assess danger of systemic Old God corruption in planetary vital functions.  Calculating chance of Omega Reply-code..."
G["Algalon the Observer, herald of the titans, has been defeated by our brave comrades in the depths of the titan city of Ulduar."]="Nossos corajosos camaradas têm derrotou ao arauto dos titãs, Algalon o Observador, nas profundezas de Ulduar, a cidade dos titãs."
G["Algalon was sent here to judge the fate of our world."]="Algalon was sent here to judge the fate of our world."
G["Algar the Chosen is at the Reliquary of Pain to the northeast.\nPrince Navarius is on the other side of the Dead Fields to the east."]="Algar o Escolhido está no Relicário de Dor ao nordeste.\n\nO príncipe Navarius está ao outro lado dos Campos Mortos ao este."
G["Alive the dispossessed..."]="Vivos os que nada têm..."
