G["All Hail $n, slayer of Hakkar, and hero of Azeroth!"]="Vidaade todos a $n, assassino de Hakkar e herói de Azeroth!"
G["All I be needin' is your heart."]="Somente preciso seu coração."
G["All I ever wished for was to serve my king once again.  For humanity, against a common enemy.\n\nInstead, I find that our numbers have been infiltrated by cultist scum.... and all signs point to Naxxanar as the origin of this rot."]="All I ever wished for was to serve my king once again.  For humanity, against a common enemy.\n\nInstead, I find that our numbers have been infiltrated by cultist scum.... and all signs point to Naxxanar as the origin of this rot."
G["All I have to do is resequence the oscillating coolant pressure valves..."]="All I have to do is resequence the oscillating coolant pressure valves..."
G["All I need now is a golden lasso."]="O único que preciso é um lazo de ouro."
G["All I need to prove myself here are my claws!"]="Tudo o que preciso para me provar aqui são minhas garras!"
G["All I wanted to do today was harvest my crops. Instead, I'm wrangling prowlers!"]="All I wanted to do today was harvest my crops. Instead, I'm wrangling prowlers!"
G["All I wanted was a little peace and quiet!"]="Somente queria um pouco de paz e tranquilidade!"
G["All I wanted was to visit some friends in the city. I never wanted this! Why is the Horde doing this to us?"]="All I wanted was to visit some friends in the city. I never wanted this! Why is the Horde doing this to us?"
G["All I'm saying is don't be caught dead in those outdated fashions!"]="Tudo o que digo é que será melhor que não te pilhen morto vestido com essas roupas passadas de moda!"
G["All Kor'kron... under my command... kill them... NOW!"]="Atenção, Korkron: matem-nos!"
G["All a part of my plan."]="Tudo parte do meu plano."
G["All aboard the gunship! Man the guns!"]="Subam a bordo da nave de guerra! Encargaos das armas!"
G["All across the wastes, the kypari are dying.\n\nI fear that this... sha... is the cause."]="Os kypari estão morrendo por tudo o deserto.\n\nMe temo que este... sha... é a razão."
G["All ahead full. Everything depends on our speed! We can't let the Destroyer get away."]="A toda vela. Tudo depende de nossa velocidade! Não podemos deixar que escape o Destruidor."
G["All around you, the mist grows denser."]="Ao seu ao redor, a névoa se volta mais densa."
G["All attack now!"]="Todos ao ataque!"
G["All barriers are now down, $n! Only Sindragosa stands between the Lich King and us. Justice comes soon..."]="All barriers are now down, $n! Only Sindragosa stands between the Lich King and us. Justice comes soon..."
G["All brawn. No brains. A recoverable loss."]="All brawn. No brains. A recoverable loss."
