G["All clear on Sentinel Hill, Lord Stoutmantle.  Heavy Defias movement reported in Moonbrook, however."]="All clear on Sentinel Hill, Lord Stoutmantle.  Heavy Defias movement reported in Moonbrook, however."
G["All clear!"]="Tudo pronto!"
G["All clear, you can go."]="De acordo, pode passar."
G["All clear.  Looks like the colossi attack has been repelled."]="All clear.  Looks like the colossi attack has been repelled."
G["All creation will be devoured."]="Toda criação será devorada."
G["All creatures have their uses, Wakener, but you must kill them to find out!"]="All creatures have their uses, Wakener, but you must kill them to find out!"
G["All day, surrounded by the stench of bad feet."]="All day, surrounded by the stench of bad feet."
