G["All done! Let's get back and see if Aysa's come up with anything during her meditation. [Removed?]"]="All done! Let's get back and see if Aysa's come up with anything during her meditation. [Removed?]"
G["All done! The modifications should give us a little boost in speed, but I don't think she'll hold up to too much bumping."]="All done! The modifications should give us a little boost in speed, but I don't think she'll hold up to too much bumping."
