G["All enemies of the Redfang are welcome in our den!"]="Todos os inimigos dos Colmilhorrojo são bem-vindos entre nós."
G["All enemies of the Shado-Pan will fall before Tenwu the Red Smoke!"]="All enemies of the Shado-Pan will fall before Tenwu the Red Smoke!"
G["All for one! And one for Ook!"]="Todos para um! E um para Ook!"
G["All for what? Trinkets? You are too late. The preparations have already begun. Soon the master will make his return."]="All for what? Trinkets? You are too late. The preparations have already begun. Soon the master will make his return."
G["All four prisoners saved! You are teh uber!"]="Os quatro prisioneiros salvados! É o melhor!"
G["All goes exceedingly well, my lord.  Testing of the smaller prototype at the Cenarion Thicket was a complete success.  The second bomb is being ritually fueled in the courtyard below even as we speak.  And, I've sent a courier to Tuurem to bring the rest of the parts to us here."]="All goes exceedingly well, my lord.  Testing of the smaller prototype at the Cenarion Thicket was a complete success.  The second bomb is being ritually fueled in the courtyard below even as we speak.  And, I've sent a courier to Tuurem to bring the rest of the parts to us here."
G["All good girls listen to their daddies!"]="All good girls listen to their daddies!"
G["All good things must come to an end."]="Tudo o bom deve acabar."
G["All hail $n, a $c of worth!"]="Ave $n, um $c de coragem!"
G["All hail $n, savior of Azuremyst and Bloodmyst. Hero of the Hand of Argus, champion of the draenei people!"]="All hail $n, savior of Azuremyst and Bloodmyst. Hero of the Hand of Argus, champion of the draenei people!"
G["All hail $n, savior of the Vale! Conqueror of the Shao-Tien, and defender of the people! May the stars sing your name!"]="Três vivas por $n, $gsalvador: salvadora; do vale, $gconquistador: conquistadora; do Shao-Tien e $gdefensor: defensora; do povo! Que as estrelas canten seu nome!"
G["All hail $n, the mighty conqueror of the yaungol and champion of Easterly Rest!"]="All hail $n, the mighty conqueror of the yaungol and champion of Easterly Rest!"
