G["All hail the great creator!"]="All hail the great creator!"
G["All hail the great creator."]="All hail the great creator."
G["All hail the greatest trade prince on Azeroth... me!"]="Vidaade ao Príncipe mercante mais grande de Azeroth... Eu!"
G["All hail the savior of Binan Village!"]="All hail the savior of Binan Village!"
G["All hail, $n!"]="All hail, $n!"
G["All hail, $n! Defender of The People!"]="Salve, $n! $gDefensor: Defensora; do Povo!"
