G["All hail, $n, a true champion and protector of Ironforge!  Let no one forget the brave deeds performed by, $n!"]="All hail, $n, a true champion and protector of Ironforge!  Let no one forget the brave deeds performed by, $n!"
G["All hail, $n, a true champion and protector of Thunder Bluff!  Let no one forget the brave deeds performed by, $n!"]="All hail, $n, a true champion and protector of Thunder Bluff!  Let no one forget the brave deeds performed by, $n!"
G["All hail, $n, the new $G King : Queen; of the ogres!!!"]="Vidaade a $n, $g Novo: nova; $g rei: rainha; dos ogros!"
G["All hands on deck! The Barnacle's under attack!"]="Tudo o mundo a coberta! Atacando ao Percebe!"
