G["All hands to battle stations! Naga incoming!"]="All hands to battle stations! Naga incoming!"
G["All hands to battle stations; get those monsters away from the ship!"]="All hands to battle stations; get those monsters away from the ship!"
G["All hands topside! Run 'em through!"]="Todas as mãos de cima para baixo! Execute-os!"
G["All has been gathered and is being sent to Silithus, $c. It should get there within $2113w days. I can only hope that after the gong is rung, and the gates opened, that our efforts here will make an impact and save many lives."]="All has been gathered and is being sent to Silithus, $c. It should get there within $2113w days. I can only hope that after the gong is rung, and the gates opened, that our efforts here will make an impact and save many lives."
G["All has been gathered and is being sent to Silithus, $c. The last of it should get there within a day. I can only hope that after the gong is rung, and the gates opened, that our efforts here will make an impact and save many lives."]="All has been gathered and is being sent to Silithus, $c. The last of it should get there within a day. I can only hope that after the gong is rung, and the gates opened, that our efforts here will make an impact and save many lives."
G["All henchmen of da boss - Stomper Kreeg, all three of da Guards, Captain Kromcrush, and da Observer - give tribute to da new boss.  If you kill a henchman, then that henchman can't give tribute!  Each one you keep alive will give you more tribute.  Keep all of them alive and you get da BIG tribute!\n\nYeah!"]="All henchmen of da boss - Stomper Kreeg, all three of da Guards, Captain Kromcrush, and da Observer - give tribute to da new boss.  If you kill a henchman, then that henchman can't give tribute!  Each one you keep alive will give you more tribute.  Keep all of them alive and you get da BIG tribute!\n\nYeah!"
G["All hope is lost!"]="Não há nenhuma esperança!"
G["All hope is not lost, $p."]="$p, Ainda há esperança."
G["All in good time, mon. I be havin' more work for you to do soon...."]="Tudo ao seu tempo, mon. Vou ter mais trabalho para você fazer em breve...."
G["All in my path shall be destroyed!"]="All in my path shall be destroyed!"
G["All inquiries regarding Medivh should be directed to Moroes, the Tower Steward. I myself know very little about the Master's business. I believe several nobles are currently having an audience with Moroes in the Banquet Hall, if you wish to inquire further."]="Todas as perguntas sobre Medivh devem ser dirigidas a Moroes, o administrador da torre. Eu mesmo sei muito pouco sobre os negócios do Mestre. Acredito que vários nobres estão tendo uma audiência com os Moroes no Salão de Banquetes, se você quiser saber mais."
G["All is as it should be."]="Como esperado."
G["All is completed, young $c. Even as we speak, both the Horde and the Alliance are in the process of transporting all final goods for the war into Silithus near Cenarion Hold, which should be complete in less than $2113w days. After that, the gong near the gates of Ahn'Qiraj can be rung, and the war will begin."]="All is completed, young $c. Even as we speak, both the Horde and the Alliance are in the process of transporting all final goods for the war into Silithus near Cenarion Hold, which should be complete in less than $2113w days. After that, the gong near the gates of Ahn'Qiraj can be rung, and the war will begin."
G["All is completed, young $c. Even as we speak, both the Horde and the Alliance are in the process of transporting all final goods for the war into Silithus near Cenarion Hold, which should be complete in less than a day. After that, the gong near the gates of Ahn'Qiraj can be rung, and the war will begin."]="All is completed, young $c. Even as we speak, both the Horde and the Alliance are in the process of transporting all final goods for the war into Silithus near Cenarion Hold, which should be complete in less than a day. After that, the gong near the gates of Ahn'Qiraj can be rung, and the war will begin."
G["All is gathered, $c. All is being transported for final preparation to Silithus and should arrive within $2113w days. All of our combined forces await the $g hero : heroine; that will complete the reunification of the Scepter of the Shifting Sands, ring the gong and begin the Ahn'Qiraj War."]="All is gathered, $c. All is being transported for final preparation to Silithus and should arrive within $2113w days. All of our combined forces await the $g hero : heroine; that will complete the reunification of the Scepter of the Shifting Sands, ring the gong and begin the Ahn'Qiraj War."
G["All is gathered, $c. All is being transported for final preparation to Silithus and should arrive within a day. All of our combined forces await the $g hero : heroine; that will complete the reunification of the Scepter of the Shifting Sands, ring the gong and begin the Ahn'Qiraj War."]="All is gathered, $c. All is being transported for final preparation to Silithus and should arrive within a day. All of our combined forces await the $g hero : heroine; that will complete the reunification of the Scepter of the Shifting Sands, ring the gong and begin the Ahn'Qiraj War."
G["All is lost!"]="Tudo se perdeu!"
G["All is lost, Anchorite!  Abandon what hope remains."]="Tudo está perdido, anacoreta! Abandona qualquer esperança que albergues."
G["All is lost."]="All is lost."
G["All is lost..."]="Tudo está perdido..."
G["All is lost....  Forgive me, my Queen...."]="Tudo está perdido... Perdóname... meu rainha..."
G["All is not lost! Battle these beasts without fear. Your wounds I shall heal, bones I shall mend. Be renewed, heroes!"]="All is not lost! Battle these beasts without fear. Your wounds I shall heal, bones I shall mend. Be renewed, heroes!"
G["All is not lost, Kharan!"]="Nem tudo está perdido, Kharan!"
G["All it needs is a hero like you to plant the seed."]="Somente precisa que os heróis como você planten a semente."
G["All kinds of bread here! Made fresh today. Get'em while they last!"]="All kinds of bread here! Made fresh today. Get'em while they last!"
G["All lesser races are enemies of the true Horde!"]="Todas as raças inferior são inimigas da Horda autêntico!"
G["All life must be eradicated!"]="Se erradicará toda forma de vida!"
G["All life must perish!"]="Toda forma de vida tem de perecer!"
G["All manner of strange creatures are just ... falling from the sky!"]="All manner of strange creatures are just ... falling from the sky!"
G["All members of the Horde are equal in my eyes, $n. We have all suffered many burdens, and if it were not for wisdom and honor, then we would be no better than the Scourge or my people while our blood was tainted by the demon Mannoroth.\n\nIt is your duty to aid the Horde and to defend our way of life. But it is also your duty to know when quarter and compassion should be given to friend and foe alike.\n\nUnderstand this well. This is the new Horde, not some demon-spawned army who lack freewill."]="Todos os membros da Horda são iguales ante meus olhos, $n. Todos temos sofrido inúmeras cargas e se não fosse pela sabedoria e a honra, não seríamos melhores que o Flagelo ou que meu própria gente quando nossa sangue estava manchada pelo demônio Mannoroth.\n\nÉ seu dever ajudar à Horda e defenda nosso modo de vida. Mas também o é saber quando dar clemência e compasão a amigos e inimigos por igual. Isto é a nova Horda, não uma prole de demônios sem vontade própria."
G["All mortals will perish!"]="Tudo mortal perecerá!"
G["All muscle and no brain, that's what peons are! They're great when you can motivate them, but they have to be 'kick' started, if you know what I mean."]="Tudo músculo e nenhum cérebro, é isso que os peões são! Eles são ótimos quando você pode motivá-os, mas precisam ser iniciados, se você entende o que quero dizer."
G["All my bags are packed, I'm ready to go."]="All my bags are packed, I'm ready to go."
G["All my plans have led to this!"]="Todos meus planos para isto!"
G["All my sweet delicious ale... gone... the horror..."]="Toda meu preciosa e doce cerveja... desaparecida... o horror..."
G["All my work... undone!"]="All my work... undone!"
G["All new Kaja'Cola! Now with 100 percent more ideas!"]="All new Kaja'Cola! Now with 100 percent more ideas!"
G["All o' this shootin' at Skorn and other places o'er the horizon, and what do ya think it's gotten me?\n\nCannonball recovery duty!\n\nNot exactly what I signed up fer, ya know?"]="Tanto disparar a Skorn e a outros lugares no horizonte e O que acha que me tocado?\n\nRecuperar bolas de canhão!\n\nEu não me apunté para isto, sabe?"
G["All of Azeroth will run red with the blood of the lesser races."]="All of Azeroth will run red with the blood of the lesser races."
G["All of Azeroth, prepare! The age of the Burning Blade is nigh!"]="Que se prepare tudo Azeroth! Se aproxima a hora do Filo Ardente!"
G["All of Darnassus will know what you have done for us."]="Tudo Darnassus saberão o que fez por nós."
G["All of Draenor shall quake beneath my feet!  I will destroy this world and reshape it in my image!"]="All of Draenor shall quake beneath my feet!  I will destroy this world and reshape it in my image!"
G["All of Illidan's lieutenants have fallen, $n.  The way forward is open, if you're ready."]="Têm caído todos o tenentes de Illidan, $n. Se estas pronto, o caminho está abriu."
G["All of Nature's might is at my disposal, puny mortals. Let us see which of my many forms it will be that ends your suffering!"]="As forças da Natureza estão a meu disposição, insignificantes mortais. Vamos ver qual das formas O que posso adoptar coloca fim ao seu sofrimento!"
G["All of Northrend is colder than a witch's heart; yet here we are...  There must be some explanation!  Quite possibly one related to the crystal pillars!"]="All of Northrend is colder than a witch's heart; yet here we are...  There must be some explanation!  Quite possibly one related to the crystal pillars!"
G["All of Pandaria will fall beneath the Wings of the Empress!"]="Toda Pandaria cairá baixo as asas da Imperatriz!"
G["All of a sudden they were everywhere."]="De repente, estavam em todas partes."
G["All of a sudden you're a 'Defender of the Alliance' are you?! Well, I suppose you'll be wanting to head to the Champions' Hall now. It's over in Old Town."]="De repente você é um 'Defensor da Aliança', é você?! Bem, suponho que você queira ir ao Salão dos Campeões agora. Acabou na Cidade Velha."
G["All of a sudden, I heard a noise. Kiryn was trapped! In jinyu nets!"]="De repente, eu oyó um ruido. Kiryn estava presa em redes jinyu!"
G["All of my people, dead. Maybe I should build a new manor in Binan Village?"]="Tudo meu povo está morto. ao melhor deveria construir uma mansão nova na Aldeia Binan."
G["All of our collections are completed, $c. That which we have assembled is in the process of being transported to Cenarion Hold in Silithus, and the last of it should take no more than a day to arrive. The Ahn'Qiraj War can then start once that is done and someone brave and foolish rings the gong right outside of the gates down there."]="Já temos tudo o materiais, $c. Tudo o que temos reuniu está sendo enviada ao Forte Cenariano em Silithus e o último carregamento não deveria tardar mais de um dia em chegar. A guerra de Ahn'Qiraj poderá começar quando algum insensato corajoso faça soar o gongo situado ao lado às portões."
G["All of our collections are completed, $c. That which we have assembled is in the process of being transported to Cenarion Hold in Silithus, and the rest of it should take no more than $2113w days to arrive. The Ahn'Qiraj War can then start once that is done and someone brave and foolish rings the gong right outside of the gates down there."]="Já temos tudo o materiais, $c. Tudo o que temos reuniu está sendo enviada ao Forte Cenariano em Silithus e o último carregamento não deveria tardar mais de um $2113w dias em chegar. A guerra de Ahn'Qiraj poderá começar quando algum insensato corajoso faça soar o gongo situado ao lado às portões."
G["All of our explosives are missing!? $n, something sinister is definitely happening here."]="Têm sumiu todos nossos explosivos? $n, não cabe dúvida de que aqui está passando algo sinistro."
G["All of pandaria will bow to the empress!"]="Toda Pandaria se inclinará ante a Imperatriz!"
G["All of that just to wake you up? I'm sure I have several weapons that could have managed that fine."]="All of that just to wake you up? I'm sure I have several weapons that could have managed that fine."
G["All of the Horde's war effort tasks are completed, young $c. Now we need but wait for the Alliance to also finish theirs and all will be ready for the Ahn'Qiraj War. Except perhaps for the gathering and reunification of the pieces to the Scepter of the Shifting Sands?"]="A Horda já tem finalizado seus trabalhos de recolecção de mercadorias para a guerra, jovem $c. Agora somente temos que esperar a que a Aliança também o faça e então estaremos prontos para a guerra de Ahn'Qiraj. Exceto, talvez, pela reunificação dos fragmentos do cetro do Mar de Dunas..."
G["All of the barriers blocking you from reaching the Sunwell have been destroyed. Enter the Sunwell and stop Kil'jaeden from entering this world!"]="Todas as barreiras que impedem de alcançar o Sunwell foram destruídas. Entre na Sunwell e encontre Kil'jaeden de entrar neste mundo!"
G["All of the collecting is done and the finished goods are being shipped over to Silithus as they're being completed. Looks like less than $2113w days until all of it is over there. After that we just need to get someone to ring that gong and open the gates to Ahn'Qiraj. Then the real fun begins."]="All of the collecting is done and the finished goods are being shipped over to Silithus as they're being completed. Looks like less than $2113w days until all of it is over there. After that we just need to get someone to ring that gong and open the gates to Ahn'Qiraj. Then the real fun begins."
G["All of the collecting is done and the finished goods are being shipped over to Silithus as they're being completed. Looks like less than a day until all of it is over there. After that we just need to get someone to ring that gong and open the gates to Ahn'Qiraj. Then the real fun begins."]="All of the collecting is done and the finished goods are being shipped over to Silithus as they're being completed. Looks like less than a day until all of it is over there. After that we just need to get someone to ring that gong and open the gates to Ahn'Qiraj. Then the real fun begins."
G["All of the fish and everything else is on its way to Silithus, and should be there in less than $2113w days. After that someone's going to have to ring that gong with the Scepter of the Shifting Sands to start the war."]="Tudo o peixe e tudo o mais está a caminho de Silithus e deve estar lá em menos de $2113w dias. Depois disso, alguém terá que tocar esse gongo com o Cetro das Areias Mutáveis para começar a guerra."
G["All of the fish and everything else is on its way to Silithus, and should be there in less than a day. After that someone's going to have to ring that gong with the Scepter of the Shifting Sands to start the war."]="Tudo o peixe e o mais está de caminho a Silithus e deveria chegar ao seu destino em menos de um dia. Atrás isto, alguém fará soar o gongo utilizando o cetro do Mar de Dunas para que dé início a guerra."
G["All of the food and war materiel we gathered is on its way to Silithus. It should be there in less than $2113w days. Someone told me that once it's all assembled over near Cenarion Hold, someone's going to have to go ring the gong at the Scarab Dais to open the gates to Ahn'Qiraj and start the war."]="Tudo o alimento e materiais de guerra que reunimos está a caminho de Silithus. Ele deve estar lá em menos de $2113w dias. Alguém disse para mim que depois que tudo estiver montado perto do Cenarion Hold, alguém terá que tocar o gongo na Scarab Dais para abrir os portões de Ahn'Qiraj e começar a guerra."
G["All of the food and war materiel we gathered is on its way to Silithus. It should be there in less than a day. Someone told me that once it's all assembled over near Cenarion Hold, someone's going to have to go ring the gong at the Scarab Dais to open the gates to Ahn'Qiraj and start the war."]="All of the food and war materiel we gathered is on its way to Silithus. It should be there in less than a day. Someone told me that once it's all assembled over near Cenarion Hold, someone's going to have to go ring the gong at the Scarab Dais to open the gates to Ahn'Qiraj and start the war."
G["All of the highlands belong to the Dragonmaw, even this pit!"]="All of the highlands belong to the Dragonmaw, even this pit!"
G["All of the material necessary for the Alliance's contribution to the war effort has been satisfied, $c. We await the Horde's labors to be finalized and then shall move on to transporting the war materiel to Silithus."]="All of the material necessary for the Alliance's contribution to the war effort has been satisfied, $c. We await the Horde's labors to be finalized and then shall move on to transporting the war materiel to Silithus."
G["All of the nearby arokkoa face east and whistle a long, low note of devotion. [PH]"]="All of the nearby arokkoa face east and whistle a long, low note of devotion. [PH]"
G["All of the preparations are complete now, $c. We await the last of the materiel to be sent to Silithus, which should be in less than $2113w day's time. Then once the organization there is done with, someone will have to come forward and ring the gong on the Scarab Dais with the Scepter of the Shifting Sands. That is when the Ahn'Qiraj War will begin. May the Earth Mother watch over all of us then."]="All of the preparations are complete now, $c. We await the last of the materiel to be sent to Silithus, which should be in less than $2113w day's time. Then once the organization there is done with, someone will have to come forward and ring the gong on the Scarab Dais with the Scepter of the Shifting Sands. That is when the Ahn'Qiraj War will begin. May the Earth Mother watch over all of us then."
G["All of the preparations are complete now, $c. We await the last of the materiel to be sent to Silithus, which should be in less than a day's time. Then once the organization there is done with, someone will have to come forward and ring the gong on the Scarab Dais with the Scepter of the Shifting Sands. That is when the Ahn'Qiraj War will begin. May the Earth Mother watch over all of us then."]="All of the preparations are complete now, $c. We await the last of the materiel to be sent to Silithus, which should be in less than a day's time. Then once the organization there is done with, someone will have to come forward and ring the gong on the Scarab Dais with the Scepter of the Shifting Sands. That is when the Ahn'Qiraj War will begin. May the Earth Mother watch over all of us then."
G["All of these mouths to feed, and who has to do it? Me!\n\nAll the cooking, and the cleaning, and everything else!"]="All of these mouths to feed, and who has to do it? Me!\n\nAll the cooking, and the cleaning, and everything else!"
G["All of this for a piece of the World Pillar?  What exactly, shaman, do you intend to do with it?"]="Tudo isto por um pedaço do Pilar do Mundo? Que que fazer com isto exatamente, xamã?"
G["All of this posturing, all of this dancing about in rings... it seems pointless. What's the use?"]="Tanta postura e tanto dançar por aí em círculos... não parece ter sentido. Serve para algo?"
G["All of us gathered here have a concept of honorable combat. Conducting yourself with honor and treating your opponent as you wish to be treated shows respect."]="All of us gathered here have a concept of honorable combat. Conducting yourself with honor and treating your opponent as you wish to be treated shows respect."
G["All of us, working collectively, have accomplished a great task. Now an even greater one confronts us. We only await the completion of the Horde's gathering efforts and then we shall all confront the Silithid and their masters together."]="Todos nós, trabalhando em equipamento, temos concluído uma importantes tarefa. Agora nos espera uma inclusive mais importantes. Estamos à espera de que a Horda reúna tudo seu materiais e depois nos enfrentaremos juntos aos silitídeos e aos seus mestres."
G["All of you fan out and search the chamber. If Garrosh is behind this, we're going to need proof."]="All of you fan out and search the chamber. If Garrosh is behind this, we're going to need proof."
G["All of you fought hard and valiantly. It makes me proud to see the warriors you have become."]="Todos luchasteis com ardor e bravura. Me enorgulhece descobrir os guerreiros nos que os vocês têm convertido."
G["All of you have my deepest thanks. With the Focusing Iris removed, this lifeless bomb is merely a sickening testament to Garrosh's brutality. The winds of change blow fiercely; Azeroth is on the brink of war. My apologies, but you must excuse me... I have much to consider. Farewell."]="All of you have my deepest thanks. With the Focusing Iris removed, this lifeless bomb is merely a sickening testament to Garrosh's brutality. The winds of change blow fiercely; Azeroth is on the brink of war. My apologies, but you must excuse me... I have much to consider. Farewell."
G["All of you must work to aid in the great revival of our Master. Only through Him may we usher in eternal peace for all!"]="Todos devem colaborar no grande renascimento do Mestre. Somente a através de Ele poderemos conseguir a paz eterna e universal!"
G["All of your efforts have been in vain, for the draining of the World Tree has already begun!  Soon the heart of your world will beat no more!"]="All of your efforts have been in vain, for the draining of the World Tree has already begun!  Soon the heart of your world will beat no more!"
G["All of your friends are dead."]="Todos seus amigos têm morto."
G["All officers should check in with me when their squads are ready. We'll enter Stratholme on my order."]="All officers should check in with me when their squads are ready. We'll enter Stratholme on my order."
G["All our items are carefully inspected and shipped with precision!  If this wasn't signed by the king himself you'd never see a dime."]="All our items are carefully inspected and shipped with precision!  If this wasn't signed by the king himself you'd never see a dime."
G["All part of the Master's plan.... Your end is inevitable...."]="Tudo é parte do plano do mestre... Seu fim é inevitável..."
G["All places, all things have souls. All souls can be devoured."]="Todos os lugares, todas as coisas têm almas. Todas as almas podem ser devoradas."
G["All praise Deathwing, THE DESTROYER!"]="All praise Deathwing, THE DESTROYER!"
G["All present and accounted for, SIR!"]="Todos estão presentes, SENHOR!"
G["All quiet."]="Tudo tranquilo."
G["All reactions begin with the proper catalyst."]="All reactions begin with the proper catalyst."
G["All realities, all dimensions are open to me!"]="All realities, all dimensions are open to me!"
G["All requests for my work must be made in person by the buyer. Orwin often asks me to reconsider, but my priorities lie here. Look around you: many of these fighters rely upon me for their armor."]="Todos os pedidos do meu trabalho devem ser feitos pessoalmente pelo comprador. Orwin costuma me pedir para reconsiderar, mas minhas prioridades estão aqui. Olhe ao seu redor: muitos desses lutadores confiam em mim como armadura."
G["All rewards for services rendered to be dispensed by Warcaller Beersnout.\n\nPost no bills."]="All rewards for services rendered to be dispensed by Warcaller Beersnout.\n\nPost no bills."
G["All rewards for services rendered to be dispensed by Warcaller Sardon Truslice.\n\nPost no bills."]="All rewards for services rendered to be dispensed by Warcaller Sardon Truslice.\n\nPost no bills."
G["All rewards to be paid by High Executor Wroth upon verification.\n\nSerious-minded individuals inquire within.\n\nNO SOLICITORS!"]="All rewards to be paid by High Executor Wroth upon verification.\n\nSerious-minded individuals inquire within.\n\nNO SOLICITORS!"
G["All right Riko, I think $n has heard enough. Kiryn can tell the next part."]="$n, Já vale, Riko, acho que temos ouvido suficiente. Kiryn pode contar a parte seguinte."
G["All right everyone, listen up. We're entering hostile uncharted territory, far from the Alliance chain of command."]="All right everyone, listen up. We're entering hostile uncharted territory, far from the Alliance chain of command."
G["All right now. Aside from the obvious distractions a minion like this will provide against your more masculine foes, she is also capable of dealing out impressive amounts of damage. However, her fragile endurance makes her almost useless as a shield."]="Muito bem. Além da distração evidente que um lacaio como este supondrá para os seus inimigos masculinos, ela também tem uma capacidade de destruição impressionante. Não obstante, seu frágil resistência a há quase inútil como escudo."
G["All right people, look alive!"]="All right people, look alive!"
G["All right team, all systems are go! It's morphin' time!"]="All right team, all systems are go! It's morphin' time!"
G["All right then... I know the way to and from Gadgetzan.  What I need for you to do is to keep the beasts off of us.  I've trained Dadanga how to defend herself pretty well, but we can't handle the overgrown madness out there for long.  Let me know when you're ready to go, $n."]="All right then... I know the way to and from Gadgetzan.  What I need for you to do is to keep the beasts off of us.  I've trained Dadanga how to defend herself pretty well, but we can't handle the overgrown madness out there for long.  Let me know when you're ready to go, $n."
G["All right!  Party time!"]="All right!  Party time!"
G["All right, $c. You think you have what it takes to make it in the Steamwheedle Fighting Circuit's arena battlegrounds?"]="Está bem, $c. Acha que tem o que é preciso ter para entrar nas arenas do Círculo de Luta Bonvapor?"
G["All right, Aponi. I've enough on my mind to share. Have you ever spoken to the elves of Moonglade?"]="Vale, Aponi. Posso compartilhar algo do que tenho em mente. Alguma vez tem falado com os elfos de Clareira da Lua?"
G["All right, I think I can make it on my own from here.  I don't know who you are... but I owe you one.  Thank you!"]="All right, I think I can make it on my own from here.  I don't know who you are... but I owe you one.  Thank you!"
G["All right, I'll take this mixture of yours."]="Tudo bem, eu vou levar essa sua mistura."
G["All right, Kiryn."]="Muito bem, Kiryn."
G["All right, Reavers!  The orders are here!  To battle!"]="All right, Reavers!  The orders are here!  To battle!"
G["All right, all right... but you didn't get these from me!"]="Vale, vale... mas não os as e dados eu!"
G["All right, boss. You sure though? Just seems like a waste of good practice."]="All right, boss. You sure though? Just seems like a waste of good practice."
G["All right, fellas!  Who ordered the spiced rum?  Was it you, Jackie boy?"]="All right, fellas!  Who ordered the spiced rum?  Was it you, Jackie boy?"
G["All right, ladies! Watch this!"]="All right, ladies! Watch this!"
G["All right, let's do this!"]="All right, let's do this!"
G["All right, look sharp. We're There should be a land mass nearby where the survivors landed."]="All right, look sharp. We're There should be a land mass nearby where the survivors landed."
G["All right, so maybe the arenas ain't for you, right? Right. Turns out Vixton had some leftover armor from the first season, and we gotta get rid of it somehow. But nothing's free, know what I'm sayin'?"]="Bem, talvez as arenas não sejam o seu, verdade? Vale. Vixton tem algumas sobras de armadura da primeira temporada e temos que deshacernos de elas. Mas nada é grátis me entende?"
G["All right, stay close.  These fiends will jump right out of the shadows at you if you let your guard down."]="All right, stay close.  These fiends will jump right out of the shadows at you if you let your guard down."
G["All right, step right up, $r. Right up there on the teleporter."]="All right, step right up, $r. Right up there on the teleporter."
G["All right, sunshine.  Time to spill your guts before I spill 'em for ya!"]="Muito bem, querida. Hora de soltar a grislíngua antes de que eu te a corte!"
G["All right, troops. Look alive! Is everyone ready?"]="Está bem, tropas. Rápido! Estamos todos prontos?"
G["All right, watch my back while I get you some of this ore."]="Muito bem, vigila meu costas enquanto te busco um pouco deste minério."
G["All right, you guys! Time to get up"]="Já está bem, pessoal! É hora de levantar."
G["All right, you lazy bums, time to get up and get started. That bridge isn't getting built on its own."]="Vamos, vamos, vaguetes, é hora de levantar e começar a trabalhar! O ponte não se vai construir somente."
G["All right, you twisted mess of broken gears, let's get to work!"]="Muito bem, monte de sucata inútil, a trabalhar!"
G["All right, you win! I surrender! Just don't hurt me!"]="Vale, você ganha! Me rindo! Mas não me faça dano!"
G["All right.  It's made!"]="De acordo. Está pronta!"
G["All right. Let us make haste to the village!"]="De acordo, vamos rápido à aldeia!"
G["All serve the master in death."]="Servimos ao mestre na morte."
G["All services and shops are to remain closed until further notice! That is all!"]="All services and shops are to remain closed until further notice! That is all!"
G["All soldiers of Lordaeron should immediately report to the entrance of Stratholme, and await further orders from Prince Arthas."]="All soldiers of Lordaeron should immediately report to the entrance of Stratholme, and await further orders from Prince Arthas."
G["All systems on-line.  Prepare yourself, we leave shortly."]="Todos os sistemas em linha. Prepare-se, nos marchamos em breve."
G["All systems online and functional!"]="Todos os sistemas em linha e em funcionamento!"
G["All that awaits you is nothingness.  Emptiness."]="O único que te espera é a nada. O vazio."
G["All that is yours? Mine!"]="All that is yours? Mine!"
G["All that matters is what you do with it."]="Só o que importa é o que você faz com ele."
G["All that matters... is this moment."]="O único que importa... é este momentos."
G["All that official business is handled up in Stormwind these days.  You could stop by the Stormwind Visitor's Center if you want to start a guild."]="Tudo esse negócio oficial é tratado em Stormwind atualmente. Você pode parar no Centro de Visitantes de Ventobravo, se quiser iniciar uma guilda."
G["All that stands in our way... is pride."]="Tudo que nos impede... é o orgulho."
G["All that we have fought for in this world is lost. The hopes and dreams carried by my father and mother... by Doomhammer... Gone..."]="All that we have fought for in this world is lost. The hopes and dreams carried by my father and mother... by Doomhammer... Gone..."
G["All that you know will fade."]="Tudo o que conhece se desvanecerá."
G["All that you know... will be undone."]="Tudo o que sabe... quedará inacabado."
G["All that's left now is the head. And it can't have gotten far."]="Tudo o que restante agora é a cabeça. E não pode estar muito longe."
G["All that's left of $n is a red stain on the floor!"]="Tudo o que restante de $n é essa mancha vermelha do chão!"
G["All that's left of the challenger is a red stain on the floor!"]="All that's left of the challenger is a red stain on the floor!"
G["All the arcane power in the world, and here I am, summoning more food and water."]="Tudo o poder Arcano do mundo e heme aqui invocando mais comida e água."
G["All the booty ish mine!"]="O butim é todo meu, aê!"
G["All the bottles on this table are potions I brewed today. And they say a watched pot never boils. Ha!"]="Todas as garrafas nesta mesa são poções que eu preparei hoje. E eles dizem que um pote vigiado nunca ferve. Ha!"
G["All the brew... gone..."]="Se têm levado toda a cerveja..."
G["All the fisherman have moved to Darnassus with the recent attacks around Lake Al'Ameth.  You should try looking for someone to train you there."]="Todos os pescadores se mudaram para Darnassus com os recentes ataque ao redor do lago Al'Ameth. Você deve procurar alguém para treiná-o lá."
G["All the hozen gotta listen now..."]="Os mikos cima cima..."
G["All the kids are just dying for some Brivelthwerp's ice cream!"]="All the kids are just dying for some Brivelthwerp's ice cream!"
G["All the lives he has taken... Such misery and pain inflicted on the innocent. And for what?"]="All the lives he has taken... Such misery and pain inflicted on the innocent. And for what?"
G["All the more reason to purify it."]="Mais um motivo para purificá-lo."
G["All the more reason we need to reach the bottom of this.  This tablet from Ulduar will lead us in the right direction.  Brann is sure of it.  And if Brann is certain, then I am certain."]="All the more reason we need to reach the bottom of this.  This tablet from Ulduar will lead us in the right direction.  Brann is sure of it.  And if Brann is certain, then I am certain."
G["All the oceans shall be ours, and then we shall look beyond."]="All the oceans shall be ours, and then we shall look beyond."
G["All the other trainees are such good riders. I hope to be as good as them someday. In the meantime, I just have to keep practicing!"]="All the other trainees are such good riders. I hope to be as good as them someday. In the meantime, I just have to keep practicing!"
G["All the resources have been gathered.  Yippee!"]="Se têm pegou todos os itens. Yupi!"
G["All the rest of our people are down there!"]="Tudo o resto do nosso povo está lá em baixo!"
G["All the roguish types hang out in The Forlorn Cavern, north of the gates of Ironforge.  I'd wager ye'll find Fenthwick there, no doubt counting the coin of another cut purse.  I'll catch him one of these days!  \nIn the meantime I'll have my eye on you as well, $glad : lass;."]="All the roguish types hang out in The Forlorn Cavern, north of the gates of Ironforge.  I'd wager ye'll find Fenthwick there, no doubt counting the coin of another cut purse.  I'll catch him one of these days!  \nIn the meantime I'll have my eye on you as well, $glad : lass;."
G["All the stuff here... It's so... so... different!"]="Tudo aqui é... tão... tão... diferente!"
G["All the supplies flowing north to Ashenvale stop here to rest and re-fuel. It's important to keep our operations running smoothly."]="Todos os suprimentos que fluem para o norte de Ashenvale param aqui para descansar e reabastecer. É importante manter nossas operações funcionando sem problemas."
G["All these dead Tauren got on 'em is beads and junk. Did you score anything good?"]="Estes tauren mortos não têm mais que contas e fruslerías. Conseguiu algo bom?"
G["All these folks are keeping me busy.  Take this horse over to your stables."]="All these folks are keeping me busy.  Take this horse over to your stables."
G["All these folks comin' and goin' these days. It really gets you thinkin' about life.\n\nLike, maybe... I should be comin' and goin' somewhere, too."]="All these folks comin' and goin' these days. It really gets you thinkin' about life.\n\nLike, maybe... I should be comin' and goin' somewhere, too."
G["All these poor souls... here, this will lead you home."]="All these poor souls... here, this will lead you home."
G["All these sad pandas making Ken-Ken a sad hozen."]="Todos estes panda triste fazem a Ken-Ken um hozen triste."
G["All they be doin' is a little huntin' and gatherin'. Where's the harm in that??"]="All they be doin' is a little huntin' and gatherin'. Where's the harm in that??"
G["All things for sale, my friend!  Large and small, whatever you need, Hazzin will provide.\n\nIf you value your life, do not approach Manaforge Ultris without a resupply.  Hazzin is the last chance that you have."]="All things for sale, my friend!  Large and small, whatever you need, Hazzin will provide.\n\nIf you value your life, do not approach Manaforge Ultris without a resupply.  Hazzin is the last chance that you have."
G["All things in nature exists in an interconnected web; an ecology.  If we're careful not to disturb it, and simply observe, we may be fortunate to piece together the complex relationship between the diverse organisms around us.\n\nOnce we have that understanding, we can take the appropriate actions to ensure the wellbeing of all creatures.  Interfere without that knowledge, and we'll surely cause destruction.\n\nI am here to observe the complex interactions between the sporelings and the bog lords."]="All things in nature exists in an interconnected web; an ecology.  If we're careful not to disturb it, and simply observe, we may be fortunate to piece together the complex relationship between the diverse organisms around us.\n\nOnce we have that understanding, we can take the appropriate actions to ensure the wellbeing of all creatures.  Interfere without that knowledge, and we'll surely cause destruction.\n\nI am here to observe the complex interactions between the sporelings and the bog lords."
G["All this electricity in the air is wreaking havoc on my hair."]="All this electricity in the air is wreaking havoc on my hair."
G["All this equipment just to examine ice?"]="Tudo esse equipamento apenas para examinar o gelo?"
G["All this fighting is finally getting to you, $n.  Do not worry, I will not divulge your little secret -- lest the others think you're mad.\n\nGet some rest.  It'll do you good."]="All this fighting is finally getting to you, $n.  Do not worry, I will not divulge your little secret -- lest the others think you're mad.\n\nGet some rest.  It'll do you good."
G["All this fighting is such a waste. How do your people do it all the time? When do you find time to celebrate and enjoy the simple things?"]="All this fighting is such a waste. How do your people do it all the time? When do you find time to celebrate and enjoy the simple things?"
G["All this free candy is just bad business, I tell you. Or... maybe it's just a loss leader... they get you in the inn, and then gouge you on the meat. It's brilliant!"]="Tudo esse doce de graça é apenas um mau negócio, eu lhe digo. Ou... talvez seja apenas um líder de perdas... eles te levam para a estalagem e depois te arrancam a carne. É brilhante!"
G["All this fuss just for me?"]="Tudo este alboroto somente por mim?"
G["All this running make Dajik not hungry for chicken anymore."]="Tanto correr é preciso de Dajik se lhe quiten as ganha de comer frango."
G["All this talk about food is making me hungry!"]="Toda essa conversa sobre comida está me deixando com fome!"
G["All those barrels... some of my finest brew. At least it went out in a blaze of glory!"]="Todos esses barris... Meu melhor criação. Ao menos tiveram um fim épico!"
G["All those dragon essences I've collected... the power... is exhilerating!"]="Todas essas essenciais de dragão que e pegou... o poder... Resulta estimulante!"
G["All those official types reside in Ironforge.  Ye'll be wanting to check out the Ironforge Visitor's Center for guild creation papers."]="Todos esses tipos oficiais residem em Ironforge. Você vai querer conferir o Centro de Visitantes de Ironforge para obter documentos sobre criação de guildas."
G["All those who betray Ragnaros must die!"]="All those who betray Ragnaros must die!"
G["All those years in stasis followed by sudden, rapid growth."]="Todos esses anos em estase seguidos de um crecimento rápido e repentino."
G["All those years of research... and for nothing! Perhaps they were right, perhaps this is something we must learn to live with."]="All those years of research... and for nothing! Perhaps they were right, perhaps this is something we must learn to live with."
G["All three barriers are fully operational. Consult with Archmage Ne'thul in Sun's Reach Harbor to aid the effort in unlocking the gates."]="All three barriers are fully operational. Consult with Archmage Ne'thul in Sun's Reach Harbor to aid the effort in unlocking the gates."
G["All three of the gates at the Sunwell Plateau have been brought down, $n.\n\nYou must marshal your forces and stop Kil'jaeden from entering Azeroth before all is lost!"]="All three of the gates at the Sunwell Plateau have been brought down, $n.\n\nYou must marshal your forces and stop Kil'jaeden from entering Azeroth before all is lost!"
G["All too easy."]="Foi fácil demais."
G["All units cleared for deployment. Execute scenario delta. Casualties not a concern."]="All units cleared for deployment. Execute scenario delta. Casualties not a concern."
G["All we ask is help in finding Prophet Khar'zul. You know the surrounding islands better than we do. Your knowledge would be invaluable."]="All we ask is help in finding Prophet Khar'zul. You know the surrounding islands better than we do. Your knowledge would be invaluable."
G["All we had to do was deploy the Krazzworks airfield-in-a-box and begin a routine surveying mission.\n\nI'm surrounded by idiots!"]="All we had to do was deploy the Krazzworks airfield-in-a-box and begin a routine surveying mission.\n\nI'm surrounded by idiots!"
G["All we have is our land. And that commander wants us to give it up to the mantid?"]="A terra é o único que temos... e nosso comandante quer que se a entreguemos aos mantídeos?"
G["All we know of this timeway is that it leads to Mount Hyjal. The Infinite Dragonflight have gone to great lengths to prevent our involvement. We know next to nothing, mortal. Soridormi is currently attempting to break through the timeway's defenses but has thus far been unsuccessful. You might be our only hope of breaking through and resolving the conflict."]="All we know of this timeway is that it leads to Mount Hyjal. The Infinite Dragonflight have gone to great lengths to prevent our involvement. We know next to nothing, mortal. Soridormi is currently attempting to break through the timeway's defenses but has thus far been unsuccessful. You might be our only hope of breaking through and resolving the conflict."
G["All we need is just a little patience."]="All we need is just a little patience."
G["All who conspire with the Darkspear face punishment by death!"]="All who conspire with the Darkspear face punishment by death!"
G["All who slay Frostpaw are our allies!"]="Todos os que matem aos Pataescarcha são nossos aliados!"
G["All who venture here belong to me, including you!"]="All who venture here belong to me, including you!"
G["All will be ash."]="Tudo será cinza."
G["All will be reduced to ash!"]="Tudo quedará reduzidos a cinzas!"
G["All will be well children.  The Light shall see to that!"]="Tudo irá bem, crianças. A Luz se encargará disso!"
G["All will fall before the might of the Scarlet Crusade!"]="All will fall before the might of the Scarlet Crusade!"
G["All will fall before us!!"]="Todos cairão diante de nós!!"
G["All will fall in the name of Hellscream!"]="All will fall in the name of Hellscream!"
G["All will fall to the master's call...."]="Tudo cairá ante a chamada do mestre..."
G["All will know of what has transpired here in this accursed temple, hero. It will be written about in history books - the tales told as legend from Azeroth to the far reaches of the Nether itself!"]="Todos saberão o que aconteceu aqui neste templo maldito, herói. Será escrito em livros de história - os contos contados como lendas de Azeroth até os confins do próprio Nether!"
G["All work and no play makes... I'll just shut up and keep hammering."]="All work and no play makes... I'll just shut up and keep hammering."
G["All you $R want is my weed."]="Tudo o que que $r é meu erva."
G["All you be doin' is wastin' me time!"]="All you be doin' is wastin' me time!"
