G["Allow me to introduce myself - I am Ya Firebough, illustrious leader of this formerly maginificent hamlet.\n\nClearly, you are an upstanding citizen of the world.\n\nI wonder if I could trouble you to help me out of this rather sticky situation? I'm certain that the Shado-Pan at the nearby retreat will be more than happy to recompense you for any inconvenience."]="Allow me to introduce myself - I am Ya Firebough, illustrious leader of this formerly maginificent hamlet.\n\nClearly, you are an upstanding citizen of the world.\n\nI wonder if I could trouble you to help me out of this rather sticky situation? I'm certain that the Shado-Pan at the nearby retreat will be more than happy to recompense you for any inconvenience."
G["Allow me to introduce myself. I am Randolph Moloch, and I will be killing you all today."]="Allow me to introduce myself. I am Randolph Moloch, and I will be killing you all today."
G["Allow me to make your underwater experience a little more... pleasant."]="Allow me to make your underwater experience a little more... pleasant."
G["Allow me to shine your shoes! Only one copper for the service!"]="Allow me to shine your shoes! Only one copper for the service!"
G["Allow me to show you the power of amber alchemy..."]="Allow me to show you the power of amber alchemy..."
G["Allow me to speed up the process a bit!"]="Permíteme que acelere um pouco o processo!"
G["Allow me to take care of the intruders, lord.  I will feed their entrails to the maggots."]="Permíteme cuidar dos intrusos, Senhor. Darei de comer seus vísceras aos vermes."
G["Allow the orb to take you where it will...."]="Permite que o orbe te leve..."
G["Almost all of da troops be here now."]="Já quase eh'tán todas as tropas."
G["Almost back to Ratchet! Let's keep up the pace..."]="Fica pouco para estar de volta em Trinquete! Mantengamos o passo..."
G["Almost done! Just a little longer!"]="Já quase está! Somente um pouco mais!"
G["Almost done."]="Já quase está."
G["Almost done..."]="Já quase está..."
G["Almost finished! We still need..."]="Já quase está! Ainda precisamos de..."
G["Almost got it!"]="Quase o tenho!"
