G["Along the southeast end of the Walk of Elders, Lynalis has set up a fine leatherworking stand. She'll train you... for a fee."]="Ao longo do extremo sudeste da Calçada dos Anciãos, Lynalis montou um estande de couro fino. Ela treinará você... por uma taxa."
G["Along with the budding staves of all the elders who came before us, growing now into giant trees."]="Along with the budding staves of all the elders who came before us, growing now into giant trees."
