G["Alright I'm going! Stop yelling!"]="Está bem, já vou! De de gritar!"
G["Alright boys! Come get some slickies fresh off the grill!"]="Alright boys! Come get some slickies fresh off the grill!"
G["Alright boys, let's do this!"]="Vale, pessoal, hagamos isto!"
G["Alright boys, lets go nuts."]="Muito bem, pessoal, a por todas!"
G["Alright boys, shake 'em down!"]="Alright boys, shake 'em down!"
G["Alright boys, we got a challenger!  Time to show the general what our little captive can do!"]="Alright boys, we got a challenger!  Time to show the general what our little captive can do!"
G["Alright den... you just take de bits here, any bits, it don' matter, livin' or stone or what..."]="Alright den... you just take de bits here, any bits, it don' matter, livin' or stone or what..."
G["Alright everyone. Follow me and uhh... just act natural."]="Alright everyone. Follow me and uhh... just act natural."
G["Alright everyone. Make preparations to take the prisoner back to the Vale. We'll be handing him over to Hellscream once he's had some time to cool off."]="Alright everyone. Make preparations to take the prisoner back to the Vale. We'll be handing him over to Hellscream once he's had some time to cool off."
G["Alright i'm sweating now, Twilight's Hammer get in here and defend me!"]="Alright i'm sweating now, Twilight's Hammer get in here and defend me!"
