G["Alright!  Let's head down to the Swamp of Sorrows!"]="Está bem! Bagemmos ao Pântano das Penas!"
G["Alright! Alright! We surrender... Just put your weapons down, I'll cooperate!"]="Alright! Alright! We surrender... Just put your weapons down, I'll cooperate!"
G["Alright! Back to Uncle Chen at Halfhill! Race you there, $n!"]="Alright! Back to Uncle Chen at Halfhill! Race you there, $n!"
G["Alright! I am beaten. Your precious archmage is held in a prison, elevated and sealed. Even if you manage to reach her, Salrand herself holds the key. Your mission is folly!"]="Alright! I am beaten. Your precious archmage is held in a prison, elevated and sealed. Even if you manage to reach her, Salrand herself holds the key. Your mission is folly!"
