G["Alright, I admit it, you've proven yourself and then some, $n.\n\nIf I was hard on you before it was because I saw the spark of a true Skyguard within you.  I dare say that you're the finest ace that we have!\n\nAnytime that you want to help out, I'll be more than proud to hand you another set of bombs."]="Alright, I admit it, you've proven yourself and then some, $n.\n\nIf I was hard on you before it was because I saw the spark of a true Skyguard within you.  I dare say that you're the finest ace that we have!\n\nAnytime that you want to help out, I'll be more than proud to hand you another set of bombs."
G["Alright, I think I know what our next move's gotta be."]="Muito bem, acho que já sei qual será nosso seguinte passo."
G["Alright, I'll go. But this is the last time I'm going to infiltrate the Horde! And I mean it."]="Vale, irei. Mas é a última vez que me infiltro na Horda. O digo em sério!"
G["Alright, I'll sign writs now. Bring 'em to the front, maggots."]="Alright, I'll sign writs now. Bring 'em to the front, maggots."
