G["Alright, I'm ready."]="Vale, estou pronto."
G["Alright, Leza, I need you to push. Are you ready?"]="Alright, Leza, I need you to push. Are you ready?"
G["Alright, Mk. I, that should just about do it.  Let's just flip your switch here..."]="Alright, Mk. I, that should just about do it.  Let's just flip your switch here..."
G["Alright, Shanna. You're up."]="Vale, Shanna. Te toca."
G["Alright, Tenjiyu.  I'll go get you some food from the sleeping trolls."]="Alright, Tenjiyu.  I'll go get you some food from the sleeping trolls."
G["Alright, agents. Listen up."]="Alright, agents. Listen up."
G["Alright, alright already! Enough with the shoving!"]="Alright, alright already! Enough with the shoving!"
G["Alright, alright! I think I can figure out how to operate this thing..."]="Alright, alright! I think I can figure out how to operate this thing..."
G["Alright, alright, you win."]="Vale, vale, você ganha."
G["Alright, alright. Anyhow, so I sorta slipped into the shadows.\n\nThat didn't sit too well with Windsor, seeing as how he was already extra cranky. Well he started spinnin' old Ironfoe around and screaming like a mad man at the orcs."]="Alright, alright. Anyhow, so I sorta slipped into the shadows.\n\nThat didn't sit too well with Windsor, seeing as how he was already extra cranky. Well he started spinnin' old Ironfoe around and screaming like a mad man at the orcs."
G["Alright, alright. We've got a line going out here, you know."]="Vale, vale. Aqui se tem formada uma cauda, sabe?"
G["Alright, alright. You two can go play just stay in town. No sneaking off to bug Warg and Khara down by the water."]="Alright, alright. You two can go play just stay in town. No sneaking off to bug Warg and Khara down by the water."
G["Alright, boys. Let's show 'em how Blackfuse Company fights."]="Muito bem, galera. Vamos mostrar como é que o Pavio Preto luta!"
G["Alright, done with the little guys! Let's move on to this \"horrible silk monster\"!"]="Muito bem, já temos terminado com os pequenhajos! Agora a pelo \"horrível monstro de seda\"!"
G["Alright, enough, enough! STOP HITTING ZHI-ZHI!"]="Vale, vale! De de pegar a Zhi-Zhi!"
G["Alright, everything looks in order. Let's get this show on the road."]="Muito bem, tudo parece estar em ordem. Que comience o espectáculo!"
G["Alright, folks... Once task 37066 is implemented, the boat will arrive 'now-ish'. In the meantime, I invite you to join us in a little dance to fill the time..."]="Alright, folks... Once task 37066 is implemented, the boat will arrive 'now-ish'. In the meantime, I invite you to join us in a little dance to fill the time..."
G["Alright, give me a second to get my bearings..."]="Alright, give me a second to get my bearings..."
G["Alright, here I go!"]="Venha, além vou!"
G["Alright, here we go!"]="Vale, além vamos!"
G["Alright, here's another. Try not to lose this one!"]="Bem, aqui tem outra. Procura não perder esta!"
G["Alright, it looks safe. Get in there, engineer!"]="Está bem, parece certo. Entrar aí, engenheiro!"
G["Alright, j... just let me... let me st... stand up."]="Alright, j... just let me... let me st... stand up."
G["Alright, keep me protected while I plant this disruptor. This shouldn't take very long."]="De acordo, protégeme enquanto coloco este disruptor. Não deveria me levar muito tempo."
G["Alright, kid. Stay behind me and you'll be fine."]="Bem, $gchico: garota;. Fique por trás de mim e estará a salvou."
G["Alright, let me take a look at that tablet."]="De acordo, deixe-me echarle um olhada a essa tabuleta."
G["Alright, let's check the ol' programming... SELF DESTRUCT?!"]="Alright, let's check the ol' programming... SELF DESTRUCT?!"
G["Alright, let's do this!"]="Vamos além!"
G["Alright, let's get a move on!"]="Muito bem, sigamos avançando!"
G["Alright, let's get back to shore."]="Muito bem, voltemos à orilha."
G["Alright, let's get going."]="Bem. Sigamos."
G["Alright, let's get this match started!"]="Alright, let's get this match started!"
G["Alright, let's go up to the monastery."]="Muito bem, vamos ao monastério."
