G["Alright, let's see if this ol' ritual will work."]="Vale, vamos ver se este ritual funciona."
G["Alright, let's see what makes this tech tick!"]="Muito bem, vamos ver como é mesmo!"
G["Alright, let's try cracking this thing open!"]="Vale, abramos isto à força!"
G["Alright, lizard lips, one more chance: where are your patrols?!"]="Vamos, rosto de lagarto, tem outra oportunidade: onde estão seus patrulhas?!"
G["Alright, men! Move out!"]="Alright, men! Move out!"
G["Alright, mon. A deal be a deal. But first, just a little question...."]="Vale, tron. Um trato é um trato. Mas primeiro, uma preguntita..."
G["Alright, muffin man, show me your muffins!"]="Tudo bem, rosto de muffin, me mostre seus muffins!"
G["Alright, my first fight!"]="Muito bem, meu primeiro enfrentamento!"
G["Alright, naga leader, come on out from hiding and surrender in the name of $n and the Bilgewater Cartel!"]="Alright, naga leader, come on out from hiding and surrender in the name of $n and the Bilgewater Cartel!"
G["Alright, now fetch me some..."]="Bem, agora consígueme algo de..."
G["Alright, now follow me, girl."]="Bem, siga-me, garota."
G["Alright, now we need someone to test this on..."]="Agora nós necessário a alguém em kien testar isto..."
G["Alright, people, hold that line!"]="Alright, people, hold that line!"
G["Alright, pylon two down.  Now for the heat manifold."]="Alright, pylon two down.  Now for the heat manifold."
G["Alright, quiet down. We have a lot to do and very little time to do it in, people."]="Alright, quiet down. We have a lot to do and very little time to do it in, people."
G["Alright, recruits! Thanks to $p, we're going to reclaim Kun-Lai summit from the Yaungol and make it safe again. For the Horde!"]="Alright, recruits! Thanks to $p, we're going to reclaim Kun-Lai summit from the Yaungol and make it safe again. For the Horde!"
G["Alright, so you're just going to head through this tunnel and whaaaaa....?"]="Alright, so you're just going to head through this tunnel and whaaaaa....?"
G["Alright, that's enough. Switch!"]="Tudo bem, já chega. Trocar!"
G["Alright, this is far too much mud.  Your disguise will be too dark and gloppy."]="A ver, aqui há demais lama. Seu disfarce será demais sombrio e terá grumos."
G["Alright, this is where we really have to be on our paws. Be ready!"]="Vale, aqui é onde devemos estar. Preparem-se!"
G["Alright, throw the Life-Rocket packs down to the survivors, and drop the bombs on the pirates. Try not to mix those up, okay?"]="Alright, throw the Life-Rocket packs down to the survivors, and drop the bombs on the pirates. Try not to mix those up, okay?"
G["Alright, time for the good stuff.  This is my special stout... of suffering!"]="Muito bem, agora vem o melhor. Esta é meu cerveja especial... do sofrimento!"
G["Alright, we give up! Don't hurt us!"]="Alright, we give up! Don't hurt us!"
G["Alright, we have the handle, the head, and the ointment like you asked for. Can you re-assemble the mallet?"]="Tudo bem. Nós temos o cabo, a cabeça e o unguento, como você nos pediu. Você pode consertar a marreta?"
G["Alright, we just add this in here..."]="Alright, we just add this in here..."
G["Alright, we're getting close to the excavation site, so we have to proceed carefully. Engage underwater breathing apparatus..."]="De acordo, nos estamos acercando ao lugar da escavação, assim que temos que proceder com cuidado. Usar o equipamento de respiração subacuática..."
G["Alright, we're ready to get started."]="De acordo, já estamos prontos para começar."
G["Alright, we've just gotten word that a caravan is leaving from Thelsamar. It's time to move! Go go go!"]="Alright, we've just gotten word that a caravan is leaving from Thelsamar. It's time to move! Go go go!"
G["Alright, who's in?"]="Venha! Quem se indica?"
G["Alright, you can stop now."]="Vale, já pode aparar."
G["Alright, you in?\n\nQuick quick, who d'ya think's gonna win this one, bucko?"]="Alright, you in?\n\nQuick quick, who d'ya think's gonna win this one, bucko?"
G["Alright. I need some help... I'm lookin' for my body. It's somewhere in this cave, but you can only see it if you're in the spirit world. If you want to help me find it, let me know.\nBe warned, though. The timeless spirits can kick us out of the spirit world, and I don't think I'm strong enough to get you back in there for a while if they do."]="Alright. I need some help... I'm lookin' for my body. It's somewhere in this cave, but you can only see it if you're in the spirit world. If you want to help me find it, let me know.\nBe warned, though. The timeless spirits can kick us out of the spirit world, and I don't think I'm strong enough to get you back in there for a while if they do."
G["Alright. I suppose we have stayed here long enough."]="Estupendo, acho que já temos descansado bastante."
G["Alright. Let's go."]="Bem. Vamos."
G["Alright. Where?"]="Bem. Onde?"
G["Alright... I give up... sniff..."]="Vale... me rindo... sniff..."
G["Alrighty then! So I was down at the lava pits of the Molten Span, testing out my lava suit. Everything was going great. I was even able to swim around in that stuff without suffering a single injury!\n\nSo there I am, minding my own business, doing a few backstrokes, when out of nowhere this thing swallows me up whole! Had it not been for my lava suit and built in food pellet dispenser, I would have been done for!"]="Alrighty then! So I was down at the lava pits of the Molten Span, testing out my lava suit. Everything was going great. I was even able to swim around in that stuff without suffering a single injury!\n\nSo there I am, minding my own business, doing a few backstrokes, when out of nowhere this thing swallows me up whole! Had it not been for my lava suit and built in food pellet dispenser, I would have been done for!"
G["Alrighty then, $n, here we go: one illusory-enhanced, Warsong orc disguise, complete with Smell-A-Vision!"]="Alrighty then, $n, here we go: one illusory-enhanced, Warsong orc disguise, complete with Smell-A-Vision!"
G["Alrighty! I think we are going to need to call in some air support for this one."]="Certo! Acho que vamos precisar de apoio aéreo para cuidar desse aí."
G["Also entering the arena: Battletron! Sure, it's not goblin-engineered... but it still might kill you!"]="Also entering the arena: Battletron! Sure, it's not goblin-engineered... but it still might kill you!"
G["Also entering the arena: Battletron! This hunk o' junk is just waiting to explode all over you!"]="Also entering the arena: Battletron! This hunk o' junk is just waiting to explode all over you!"
G["Also entering the arena: Bruce, a crocolisk that we found!"]="Também entrar na arena... Bruce, um crocolisco que nos encontramos!"
G["Also entering the arena: Destructobyte... and his ridiculous gnomish holographic machinery!"]="Also entering the arena: Destructobyte... and his ridiculous gnomish holographic machinery!"
G["Also entering the arena: Destructobyte... and his special surprise!"]="Também entrar na arena... Destructobyte e seu surpresa especial!"
G["Also entering the arena: Everybody's favorite magical 12-foot-tall corpse, Fjoll! Am I pronouncing that right?"]="Também entrar na arena... seu cadáver de quatro metros mágico favorito, Fjolh! O e pronunciado bem?"
G["Also entering the arena: Goredome! He WILL attempt to gore you. With his dome."]="Also entering the arena: Goredome! He WILL attempt to gore you. With his dome."
G["Also entering the arena: Goredome! So-named because he will gore you. With his dome."]="Also entering the arena: Goredome! So-named because he will gore you. With his dome."
G["Also entering the arena: Kirrawk, wind-wielding arakkoa of the Terokkar Forest!"]="Também entrar na arena... Kirrawk, arakkoas mestre do vento do Mata Terokkar!"
G["Also entering the arena: The Dark Summoner. Wow, he doesn't even have a real name. Spooky!"]="Também entrar na arena... o conjurador sombrio. Uau, nem sequer tem nome. Que medo!"
G["Also entering the arena: the hozen with the box of bombs! It's Master Boom Boom, the dynamite throwing monkey monk!"]="Also entering the arena: the hozen with the box of bombs! It's Master Boom Boom, the dynamite throwing monkey monk!"
G["Also entering the arena: the magnanimous Master Boom Boom, the dynamite throwing monkey monk!"]="Also entering the arena: the magnanimous Master Boom Boom, the dynamite throwing monkey monk!"
G["Alsudar the Bastion and the other warrior trainers may be found overlooking Farstriders' Square, from near the foundry."]="Alsudar, o Bastião e os outros treinadores de guerreiros podem ser encontrados com visão para a Praça dos Farstriders, perto da fundição."
G["Alterac Valley"]="Vale Alterac"
G["Alterac Valley - Alliance Quatmaster Greeting Option Default"]="Vale Alterac: opção predeterminada de vidao ao intendente da Aliança"
G["Alterac Valley has been home to the Frostwolf Clan for years; we will not let the dwarves and their Alliance trespass!  And so we battle!\n\nTo win back Alterac, defeat their general Vanndar Stormpike, in Dun Baldar.\n\nFor the Horde!"]="O Vale Alterac foi o lar do clã Lobo Gelo durante muitos anos. Não permitiremos que os anões e seu Aliança entren em casa. E por isso lutamos!\n\nPara recuperar Alterac, é preciso derrotar ao seu geral, Vanndar Pico Tempestade, em Dun Baldar.\n\npela Horda!"
G["Alternative measure commencing..."]="Iniciando medida alternativa..."
G["Althea, there are reports of strange happenings at the graveyard.  Ello believes it portends an attack on Darkshire."]="Althea, se diz que estão acontecendo coisas estranhas no cemitério. Elho acredita que isto presagia um possível ataque sobre Vila Sombria."
G["Although I am flattered by your confidence in my abilities, teaching you is beyond my skill. You must go to the Craftsmen's Terrace in Darnassus, and speak with the night elf Ainethil. She can help you."]="Embora eu esteja lisonjeado pela sua confiança nas minhas habilidades, ensinar você está além das minhas habilidades. Você deve ir ao terraço dos artesãos em Darnassus e falar com o elfo noturno Ainethil. Ela pode te ajudar."
G["Although the coast of Darkshore is more dangerous than that of Teldrassil, many fishers find profit here."]="Embora a costa de Darkshore seja mais perigosa do que a de Teldrassil, muitos pescadores encontram lucro aqui."
G["Although we are enemies, I will thank you. Just this once."]="Te o agradeço, a pesar de que seja da facção inimiga. Mas somente por esta vez."
G["Although we call this land the Barrens, to one who knows where to look this place teems with life."]="Embora chamemos esta terra de Barrens, para quem sabe para onde olhar este lugar está repleto de vida."
G["Altruis sent me. He said that you could help me."]="Altruis me enviou. Ele disse que você poderia me ajudar."
G["Always a good skill to have that Survival is.\nKaerbrus is who you are looking for. He's usually around the moonwell in the Park."]="Always a good skill to have that Survival is.\nKaerbrus is who you are looking for. He's usually around the moonwell in the Park."
G["Always be room in de pot for more!"]="Always be room in de pot for more!"
G["Always consider the consequences of your actions!"]="Always consider the consequences of your actions!"
G["Always double-check your measurements before you begin to cut the leather. We cannot afford to waste materials."]="Verifique sempre suas medidas antes de começar a cortar o couro. Não podemos nos dar ao luxo de desperdiçar materiais."
G["Always good talking to you."]="É um prazer falar com você."
G["Always good to see you, $n. How have you been?"]="Sempre é bom voltar a ver você, $n. Como está?"
G["Always good to see you, friend!"]="Sempre fico feliz em ver você, $gamigo: amiga;!"
G["Always knew... someday I would become... the hunted."]="Sempre o supe... algum dia seria eu a presa."
G["Always know that you have allies in Deepholm, if you be needin' us."]="Deve saber que sempre terá aliados em Infralar, se alguma vez nos precisa."
G["Always look forward, never back."]="Olhe sempre cima linha de frente, nunca cima por trás."
G["Always nice to get a gift hand delivered by the second-in-command. I'll unwrap this right now!"]="Always nice to get a gift hand delivered by the second-in-command. I'll unwrap this right now!"
G["Always on the go, that girl."]="Essa garota, não para nunca."
G["Always pumping, always pumping!"]="Always pumping, always pumping!"
G["Always so impatient, young one. There is no knowledge that is not power. This artifact dates back to the same era as the Divine Bell. To know its secrets is to bring us closer to Garrosh's prize."]="Sempre tão impatient... Não existe conhecimento que não seja poder. Este artefato data da mesma época que a Sino divina. Conhecer seus segredos nos aproxima ao tesouro de Garrosh."
G["Always so negative. The chances of that happening are between zero and none."]="Always so negative. The chances of that happening are between zero and none."
G["Always strive ta understand the balance maintained by our world's elemental spirits."]="Always strive ta understand the balance maintained by our world's elemental spirits."
G["Always strive to achieve the impossible."]="Tenta sempre conseguir o possível."
G["Always wear head protection while on the job! You never know when Miss Darla might have to smack you in the face!"]="Always wear head protection while on the job! You never know when Miss Darla might have to smack you in the face!"
G["Always with the speeches."]="Sempre com o discurso."
G["Always you speak. Never do you listen! You ignore the lessons of Pandaria!"]="Always you speak. Never do you listen! You ignore the lessons of Pandaria!"
G["Aly... Alynna is in command."]="Aly... Alynna está ao envio."
G["Alysra takes a deep breath. Get behind cover!"]="Alysra respira profundamente. Entre a coberto!"
G["Alysrazor begins to fly in a rapid circle!  The harsh winds will remove Wings of Flame!"]="Alysrazor begins to fly in a rapid circle!  The harsh winds will remove Wings of Flame!"
G["Alysrazor is unable to fully re-ignite!  Kill her quickly!"]="Alysrazor is unable to fully re-ignite!  Kill her quickly!"
G["Alythess directs Conflagration at $n."]="Alythess dirige Conflagração cima $n."
G["Alythess! Your fire burns within me!"]="Alythess! Seu fogo arde dentro de mim!"
G["Am I a murderer, Krom'gar?"]="Acaso sou um assassino, Krom'gar?"
G["Am I busy? What's that supposed to mean? Do you think I just stand here all day, twiddling my thumbs? If you're here to buy something, talk to Handor."]="Estou ocupada? O que isso deveria significar? Você acha que eu fico aqui o dia tudo, girando meus polegares? Se você está aqui para comprar algo, fale com Handor."
G["Am I carrying any letters addressed to $n? Why, no!  Looks like it's time for you to die!"]="Acaso devo levar alguma carta a $n? Que vai! Acho que você chegado a hora de morrer!"
G["Am I clear? Do you understand what I'm sayin'? I don't wanna have to send any more coffins or letters home."]="Am I clear? Do you understand what I'm sayin'? I don't wanna have to send any more coffins or letters home."
G["Am I fast? I wanna be a $c like you!"]="A que sou rápido? Quero ser $gun: uma; $c como você!"
G["Am I going to have to deal with this intrusion myself?"]="Am I going to have to deal with this intrusion myself?"
G["Am I hearing things?"]="Oigo algo?"
G["Am I hitting him?"]="Lhe e'toy dando?"
G["Am I needed?"]="Eu sou necessário?"
G["Am I released from my duties?"]="Se me dispensa de meus obligações?"
G["Am I still bleeding? I can't ... I can't keep this up much longer. Have you seen any of the archmages?"]="Ainda estou sangrando? Não posso... não posso seguir com isso por muito mais tempo. Você já viu alguma das arquimagas?"
G["Am I surrounded by amateurs?  I want a full analysis of the new strain by tomorrow morning!  Get on it, Ravien!"]="Estou cercado de principiantes? Quero um análise completo da nova cepa manhã pela manhã! Entre a elho, Ravien!"
G["Am I, mm, talking to myself? I am? See there, I'm right again."]="Estou, eh, falando somente? Sim? Vê, vuelvo a ter razão."
G["Amakkar, where do you think Warlord Goretooth is going to send us? I don't think I can handle another tour in the Steppes."]="Amakkar, where do you think Warlord Goretooth is going to send us? I don't think I can handle another tour in the Steppes."
G["Amani Dragonhawk"]="Dracohalcón Amani"
G["Amani forces pour from the Amani Tribal Door!"]="As forças Amani saem em tropel desde a porta tribal Amani!"
G["Amani tribe, avenge ye fallen warlords, in the name of Zul'jin!"]="Amani tribe, avenge ye fallen warlords, in the name of Zul'jin!"
G["Amani tribe."]="A tribo Amani."
G["Amateurs! You are far beyond your depth!"]="Aficionados! Estão além da sua profundidade!"
G["Amazing amulets! Incredible curios! The newfangled jewelcrafters be havin' nothin' on the tried and true mystical methods of ol' Griftah! Improve yerself through these magical talismans for a bargain price!"]="Amazing amulets! Incredible curios! The newfangled jewelcrafters be havin' nothin' on the tried and true mystical methods of ol' Griftah! Improve yerself through these magical talismans for a bargain price!"
G["Amazing amulets! Incredible curios! The newfangled jewelcrafters be havin' nothin' on the tried and true mystical methods of... the... uh... the newly relocated Griftah! Improve yerself through these magical talismans for a bargain price!"]="Amazing amulets! Incredible curios! The newfangled jewelcrafters be havin' nothin' on the tried and true mystical methods of... the... uh... the newly relocated Griftah! Improve yerself through these magical talismans for a bargain price!"
G["Amazing materials down here. Amazing! Substitutes for everything. Substitutes for substitutes. Everything's possible!"]="Materiais incríveis aqui embaixo. Surpreendente! Substitui por tudo. Substitutos para substitutos. Tudo é possível!"
G["Amazing to see little flowers persist in the cold of Dun Morogh...  but ye won't find any herbalists out here.  Ye'll have to go to Ironforge to get some training in that profession."]="É incrível ver pequenas flores persistindo no frio de Dun Morogh... mas você não encontrará nenhum fitoterapeuta por aqui. Você precisará ir a Ironforge para obter algum treinamento nessa profissão."
G["Amazing!"]="Incrível!"
G["Amazing!  It worked!  $n, I have your armor."]="Amazing!  It worked!  $n, I have your armor."
G["Amazing!  There are passages in here that I have never seen before.  This must have taken quite a while for you to track down.  If you ever find anymore books like this, I would like to be notified immediately.\nPlease take one of my Kirin Tor Familiars with you just in case you stumble across anything."]="Amazing!  There are passages in here that I have never seen before.  This must have taken quite a while for you to track down.  If you ever find anymore books like this, I would like to be notified immediately.\nPlease take one of my Kirin Tor Familiars with you just in case you stumble across anything."
G["Amazing! Anatheron's defeat at your hands has delayed Archimonde from his objective, and brought us that much closer to victory. My forces cannot stay here, however. My troops and I are exhausted, and now is the time for retreat. If your strength has not waned, head east to Thrall's encampment. That is where we make another stand. Be well."]="Surpreendente! A derrota de Anatheron nas suas mãos atrasou Archimonde do seu objetivo e nos aproximou muito mais da vitória. Minhas forças não podem ficar aqui, no entanto. Minhas tropas e eu estamos exaustos, e agora é a hora de recuar. Se sua força não diminuiu, vá para o leste, para o acampamento de Thrall. É aí que tomamos outra posição. Fique bem."
G["Amazing! How did you manage a permanent dominate?"]="Amazing! How did you manage a permanent dominate?"
G["Amazing! I feel... renewed. My strength returns!"]="Fascinante! Me sinto... renovado. Recobro minha força!"
G["Amazing! I think I have found it, $n!"]="Fascinante! Acho que o encontrei, $n!"
G["Amazing! I've never spoken to a ghost. I wish to learn!"]="Surpreendente! Eu nunca falei com um fantasma. Eu gostaria de aprender!"
G["Amazing! You're much stronger than you look."]="Incrível! É mais forte do que aparentas."
G["Amazing, Dornaa.  Truly amazing!"]="Amazing, Dornaa.  Truly amazing!"
G["Amazing, aren't they? All these artifacts and remains.\n\nI'm not sure what I'm more impressed by, their size, or the stories that go along with them. There's so much to study and learn. And the connections we can make...\n\nDid you know rumor has it that many races have the same heritage as Night elves?"]="Amazing, aren't they? All these artifacts and remains.\n\nI'm not sure what I'm more impressed by, their size, or the stories that go along with them. There's so much to study and learn. And the connections we can make...\n\nDid you know rumor has it that many races have the same heritage as Night elves?"
G["Amazing. Prospector Remtravel's done it again! We'll see if Ironforge can make sense of this."]="Impressionante. O prospector Tripirrno voltou a conseguir! Veremos se Altaforja lhe encontre sentido."
G["Ambassador Dawnsinger and I represent the Court of the Sun here in Orgrimmar.\n\nThe ambassador handles civil matters, while I advise Thrall on military campaigns and the unique, err... advantages conferred by the Blood Knights."]="Ambassador Dawnsinger and I represent the Court of the Sun here in Orgrimmar.\n\nThe ambassador handles civil matters, while I advise Thrall on military campaigns and the unique, err... advantages conferred by the Blood Knights."
G["Ambassador. We have been expecting you."]="Embaixador. Te esperávamos."
G["Amber drakes excel at dealing damage by manipulating time to their advantage.\nUsing shock lance, they can disrupt the flow of time around an enemy target, instantly damaging it.  The power of this effect is dramatically increased by shock charges on the target.\nWhen threatened, an amber drake can briefly stop the flow of time for its enemies.  This time disruption stores a large amount of shock energy on affected targets in the form of shock charges."]="Amber drakes excel at dealing damage by manipulating time to their advantage.\nUsing shock lance, they can disrupt the flow of time around an enemy target, instantly damaging it.  The power of this effect is dramatically increased by shock charges on the target.\nWhen threatened, an amber drake can briefly stop the flow of time for its enemies.  This time disruption stores a large amount of shock energy on affected targets in the form of shock charges."
G["Amber, find a good perch and give Sully some covering fire. We'll rendezvous back here."]="Amber, procurando uma boa posição e cubre a Sully. Nos volveremos a reunir aqui mesmo."
G["Amberseed!"]="Grano âmbar!"
G["Amberwing, get in there! Lay siege to the holdouts!"]="Amberwing, get in there! Lay siege to the holdouts!"
G["Ambush!"]="Emboscada!"
G["Ameer might be worried about what the Ethereum are doing but I'm squarely focused on the real danger here: Dimensius."]="Ameer pode estar preocupado com o que o Ethereum está fazendo, mas estou diretamente focado no perigo real aqui: Dimensius."
G["Ameer, over and out."]="Ameer, caminho e curto."
G["Amidst the tragedy and chaos, this place stands defiantly against the Scourge! It is good to be Horde."]="Entre a tragedia e o caos, este lugar continue desafiando a o Flagelo! Me gosta ser parte da Horda."
G["Amidst the wretch, a champion has been found."]="Amidst the wretch, a champion has been found."
G["Ammunition for the main unit must be regularly reloaded.\n|TInterface\\Icons\\INV_Misc_Ammo_Bullet_02.blp:32|t"]="É preciso recargar períodicamente a munição da unidade principal.\n|TInterface\\Icons\\INV_Misc_Ammo_Bullet_02.blp:32|t"
G["Among ethereals, certain members deal specifically with flesh and beings of flesh. Those individuals are known as flesh handlers."]="Entre os etéreos, certos membros lidam especificamente com carne e seres de carne. Esses indivíduos são conhecidos como manipuladores de carne."
G["Among the Twilight cult are magics that threaten us greatly.\n\nWe have every desire to wipe their existence from our home.\n\nWe are divided, and so we cannot.\n\nAnd so I watch...\n\nAnd wait..."]="Among the Twilight cult are magics that threaten us greatly.\n\nWe have every desire to wipe their existence from our home.\n\nWe are divided, and so we cannot.\n\nAnd so I watch...\n\nAnd wait..."
G["Among the items you found in the keep is one that will serve as a powerful focus for your new staff."]="Among the items you found in the keep is one that will serve as a powerful focus for your new staff."
G["Among these crystals we have seen a new path, a path of peace."]="Entre estes cristais temos vislumbrado um novo caminho, um caminho de paz."
G["Amongst the Kirin Tor, it is my duty to see to the strategic interests of the magocracy.\n\nThere is much yet to be done this week. Will you assist me, $n?"]="Dentro do Kirin Tor, é meu labor garantir os interesses estratégicos da magocracia.\n\nAinda fica muito por fazer esta semana, $n. Que me ajudar?"
G["Amongst the various pieces of parchment containing checklists and other information from the Farstriders, one stands out. It is a drawing of a hideous troll, perhaps the most fearsome creature that you have ever seen!"]="Entre as várias peças de pergaminho que contêm prontas de verificação e outras informações dos Farstriders, uma se destaca. É um desenho de um troll hediondo, talvez a criatura mais temível que você já viu!"
G["Amusing. You really thought you could win."]="Amusing. You really thought you could win."
G["An %s attacks the treekiller."]="An %s attacks the treekiller."
G["An %s emerges from the dying Crystalsong Oak!"]="Um %s emerge do roble Canto de Cristal moribundo!"
G["An Ahn'kahar Guardian hatches!"]="Surge um guardião Ahn'kahar!"
G["An Alchemy trainer is what you need?  Well, I just came from there, I did.  Ye'll find Ms. Berryfizz over in Tinker Town where the gnomes gather."]="An Alchemy trainer is what you need?  Well, I just came from there, I did.  Ye'll find Ms. Berryfizz over in Tinker Town where the gnomes gather."
G["An Alliance Commendation Signet is awarded to a $g hero : heroine; who goes above and beyond the call of duty to the Alliance.  Various Commendation Officers for the factions of the Alliance are located in all of the major cities; speak with the one with whom you'd like to raise your reputation, and give them the number of signets they ask for!\n\nBy the way, during the war effort here, if you'd rather receive a material reward for your signets in lieu of reputation, seek out Field Marshal Snowfall."]="An Alliance Commendation Signet is awarded to a $g hero : heroine; who goes above and beyond the call of duty to the Alliance.  Various Commendation Officers for the factions of the Alliance are located in all of the major cities; speak with the one with whom you'd like to raise your reputation, and give them the number of signets they ask for!\n\nBy the way, during the war effort here, if you'd rather receive a material reward for your signets in lieu of reputation, seek out Field Marshal Snowfall."
G["An Alliance caravan has been destroyed."]="Uma caravana da Aliança foi destruído."
G["An Alliance caravan needs to be escorted off of Dreadmist Peak."]="Uma caravana da Aliança precisa escolta até a Cima Calígine."
G["An Alliance caravan needs to be escorted out of Thorn Hill."]="Uma caravana da Aliança precisa escolta até a Colina Espinosa."
G["An Alliance caravan needs to be escorted out of the Dry Hills."]="Uma caravana da Aliança precisa escolta até As Colinas Áridas."
G["An Alliance caravan needs to be escorted out of the Forgotten Pools."]="Uma caravana da Aliança precisa escolta até As Charcos do Esquecimento."
G["An Alliance caravan needs to be escorted out of the Sludge Fen."]="An Alliance caravan needs to be escorted out of the Sludge Fen."
G["An Alliance caravan needs to be escorted out of the Stagnant Oasis."]="Uma caravana da Aliança precisa escolta até O Oásis Estagnado."
G["An Alliance caravan needs to be escorted out of the Wailing Caverns."]="An Alliance caravan needs to be escorted out of the Wailing Caverns."
G["An Amber Growth seeps into %s's wounds, replenishing its vitality."]="An Amber Growth seeps into %s's wounds, replenishing its vitality."
G["An Amorous Rooster! Dip him in the water to cool his passions."]="Um galo amoroso! Sumérgelo na água para enfriar seus pasiones."
G["An Aqua Bomb has detonated! Dispel it faster, next time."]="Tem explodido uma bomba aquática! A próxima vez disípala mais rápido!"
G["An Ash'ari Crystal has been restored!"]="Um Cristal de Ash'ari foi restaurado!"
G["An Ash'ari Crystal has been toppled! Restore the ziggurat before the Slaughterhouse is vulnerable!"]="An Ash'ari Crystal has been toppled! Restore the ziggurat before the Slaughterhouse is vulnerable!"
G["An Ash'ari Crystal has fallen! Stay true to the Lich King, my brethren, and attempt to resummon it."]="An Ash'ari Crystal has fallen! Stay true to the Lich King, my brethren, and attempt to resummon it."
G["An Automated Shredder draws near!"]="An Automated Shredder draws near!"
G["An Avatar of Terokk!! To arms!"]="Um avatar de Terokk!! Às armas!"
G["An Azsh'ir Monitor calls for help!"]="Um supervisor de Azsh'ir pede ajuda!"
G["An Azsh'ir Monitor has spotted you!"]="Um supervisor de Azsh'ir você detectado!"
G["An Essence of Storms erupts from the embedded spear and fixates on you!"]="An Essence of Storms erupts from the embedded spear and fixates on you!"
G["An Illusionary Banshee! Kill it, quickly, before it explodes!"]="An Illusionary Banshee! Kill it, quickly, before it explodes!"
G["An account of all the fractions of copper we round off... brilliant."]="Um registro de todas as fracções de cobre que redondeamos... Brilhante."
G["An adventurer like you has probably won many battles!"]="An adventurer like you has probably won many battles!"
G["An adventurer saves the village, but a HERO returns the brew!"]="Um aventureiro salva a aldeia, mas um herói traz a cerveja de volta."
G["An agent of destruction, forged by my will to forever change the face of Azeroth."]="Um agente da destruição, forjado pela minha vontade para mudar Azeroth para sempre."
G["An alchemist is able to work miracles with ordinary herbs, converting them into stable potions that range in effect from healing to breathing underwater and everything in between."]="Um alquimista é capaz de fazer milagres com ervas comuns, convertendo-os em poções estáveis ​​que variam de cura a respiração subaquática e tudo mais."
G["An alchemist?  No trouble at all $c.  Ainethil, in all her labor and toil, has become the most accomplished alchemist in the Craftsmen's Terrace.  I would head over there on the double if I were you. On the double!  Now off with you!"]="An alchemist?  No trouble at all $c.  Ainethil, in all her labor and toil, has become the most accomplished alchemist in the Craftsmen's Terrace.  I would head over there on the double if I were you. On the double!  Now off with you!"
G["An ally always!"]="Sempre um $galiado: aliada;!"
G["An amazing discovery you have made. I would love an opportunity to look at all of the failed experiments."]="An amazing discovery you have made. I would love an opportunity to look at all of the failed experiments."
G["An amber drake at full power can perform temporal rift, which creates a bubble of compressed time around an enemy.  Spells that pass through the bubble deal double damage and can generate shock charges on the target."]="Um drake âmbar com força total pode executar uma fenda temporal, o que cria uma bolha de tempo comprimido ao redor de um inimigo. Os feitiços que passam pela bolha causam dano duplo e podem gerar cargas de choque no objetivo."
G["An ambush. Return them to their rest!"]="An ambush. Return them to their rest!"
G["An ancient beast stirs within the mists!"]="Uma fera antiga se sacode entre a brumas!"
G["An ancient being awakens in the distance..."]="Um ser antigo se acorde na distância..."
G["An ancient score is settled today."]="Uma pontuação antiga é estabelecida hoje."
G["An anguished howl echoes in the twilight."]="Um uivo de angústia ressoa no crepúsculo."
G["An apple for me? Thanksh!"]="An apple for me? Thanksh!"
G["An arcanic oubliette. Thankfully the walls of this ruin have collapsed away otherwise we would have been trapped in this one spot without food or water.\n\nSeems whoever built these ruins designed them to be a prison for anyone attempting to portal to the coordinates we were travelling to.\n\nIt also is lethal to any mages that pass through it. Look what it did to our poor arcanist.\n\nThe good news is we can still communicate with the other side and were able to warn them not to send anyone else through. The bad news is we are stuck on the wrong side of what is now a one way portal."]="An arcanic oubliette. Thankfully the walls of this ruin have collapsed away otherwise we would have been trapped in this one spot without food or water.\n\nSeems whoever built these ruins designed them to be a prison for anyone attempting to portal to the coordinates we were travelling to.\n\nIt also is lethal to any mages that pass through it. Look what it did to our poor arcanist.\n\nThe good news is we can still communicate with the other side and were able to warn them not to send anyone else through. The bad news is we are stuck on the wrong side of what is now a one way portal."
G["An aspiring angler... well, Diktynna lives on the shore of Ammen Ford, using her net and pole to keep us all supplied. I am certain she could use the help."]="Um aspirante a pescador... bem, Diktynna vive na costa de Ammen Ford, usando sua rede e vara para nos manter todos abastecidos. Estou certo de que ela poderia usar a ajuda."
G["An assassin! Did the little whelpling send you after me? Come, rogue. Let's dance."]="An assassin! Did the little whelpling send you after me? Come, rogue. Let's dance."
G["An assassin! Quickly, ready yourselves for battle!"]="Um assassino! Rápido, preparaos para a batalha!"
G["An aura of necrotic energy blocks all healing!"]="Um aura de energia necrótica bloqueia toda a cura!"
G["An easy kill!"]="Uma morte fácil!"
G["An easy task!"]="Jogo de crianças!"
G["An electrical storm appears!"]="An electrical storm appears!"
G["An elite Blue Dragonflight squad appears from the portal!"]="An elite Blue Dragonflight squad appears from the portal!"
G["An emerald drake at full power can perform dream funnel, which transfers the drake's own life energy to a friendly target, healing it.  Leeching poison can be used to restore health lost when using this ability."]="Um draco de esmeralda com força total pode executar o funil dos sonhos, que transfere a energia vital do próprio draco para um objetivo amigável, curando-o. O veneno sanguessuga pode ser usado para restaurar a saúde perdida ao usar essa habilidade."
G["An empty crate waits to be filled and prepared for delivery."]="An empty crate waits to be filled and prepared for delivery."
G["An endless army of soulless abominations...I shudder to think of the violence that would erupt from such a machine."]="Um exército de abominações desalmadas... Me estremezco ao pensar na violência que poderá brotar desta máquina."
G["An enemy sapper's breached the engine room!"]="Têm aberto uma ruptura na salão de máquinas."
G["An engraving reads: \"Spill No Evil!\""]="Tem um gravado que reza: \"Não derramarás!\"."
G["An enormous crate, filled to the brim with cannonballs."]="An enormous crate, filled to the brim with cannonballs."
G["An enormous crate, filled to the brim with cannonballs.  There is a can of cooking grease sitting innocently nearby."]="Uma caixa enorme, cheia até a borda com balas de canhão. Há uma lata de graxa para cozinhar inocentemente próxima."
G["An enormous thundering cloud serpent bars our entrance into Lei Shen's domain."]="An enormous thundering cloud serpent bars our entrance into Lei Shen's domain."
G["An enormous, unforgiving expanse of pounding grey waves, freezing temperatures, and ravenous sea life."]="An enormous, unforgiving expanse of pounding grey waves, freezing temperatures, and ravenous sea life."
G["An epic battle, how exciting!"]="Uma batalha épica, que emocionante!"
G["An excellent question! We have many things for sale here at the faire. If you are interested in food or drink, then visit Stamp or Sylannia's booths.\nIf you'd rather purchase something more exotic, then Lhara may have just the thing for you. She specializes in rarities from all over the world.\nAnd then there is Flik running around here somewhere. If you can grab him he sells balls for throwing and frogs to keep as pets."]="An excellent question! We have many things for sale here at the faire. If you are interested in food or drink, then visit Stamp or Sylannia's booths.\nIf you'd rather purchase something more exotic, then Lhara may have just the thing for you. She specializes in rarities from all over the world.\nAnd then there is Flik running around here somewhere. If you can grab him he sells balls for throwing and frogs to keep as pets."
G["An excellent strike."]="Um acerto excelente."
G["An external influence, under illusory guise of Thorim's deceased mate, Sif, has been detected."]="An external influence, under illusory guise of Thorim's deceased mate, Sif, has been detected."
G["An honest mistake!"]="Não foi um erro intencionado!"
G["An honor to see you again, $n."]="É uma honra ver você novamente, $n."
G["An honorable end to the noble Maki... I'm sure his clan would be proud, if he hadn't been the last of them!"]="Um fim honrado para o noble Maki... Estou certo de que seu clã estaria orgulhoso, se não tivesse banido ele o último!"
G["An honorable meeting, $c. I have heard rumblings from my brothers here on Pandaria. Dark rumblings of dissent, and worry.\n\nI have come myself to support the Horde's efforts, but also... to make sure that things don't get too out of hand."]="An honorable meeting, $c. I have heard rumblings from my brothers here on Pandaria. Dark rumblings of dissent, and worry.\n\nI have come myself to support the Horde's efforts, but also... to make sure that things don't get too out of hand."
G["An honorable... death."]="Uma morte... com honra."
G["An ill wind blows here in Kun-Lai. I fear a presence unseen for many years may be returning, and these yaungol are just a symptom of it."]="An ill wind blows here in Kun-Lai. I fear a presence unseen for many years may be returning, and these yaungol are just a symptom of it."
G["An ill-wind blows from the southern shores. Are you ready?"]="Um vento de doença vem das costas do sul. Está $gpreparado: preparada;?"
G["An impressive display..."]="Uma exhibição impressionante..."
G["An inconspicuous marble slab."]="Uma laje de mármore discreta."
G["An inconspicuous stone slab."]="Uma laje de pedras discreta."
G["An interesting commonality, now to exploit it!"]="Um ponto em comum interessante, vamos explorar!"
G["An interesting response to my question... and the wrong one."]="Uma resposta interessante a meu pergunta... mas incorreta."
G["An interesting turning of events."]="Um interessante giro nos acontecimentos."
G["An intruder!  Begone!"]="$gUn intruso: Uma intrusa;! Largo!"
G["An island has emerged from the depths... just off the coast of Stormwind."]="Uma ilha tem emergido das profundezas... enfrente da costa de Ventobravo."
G["An island rose up from the sea... within striking distance of Stormwind?"]="Uma ilha tem emergido do mar... a tiro de pedras de Ventobravo?"
G["An island, lost in time, where the sun never sets. What could it mean?"]="Uma ilha, perdida no tempo, onde o sol nunca se põe. O que significa?"
G["An me as well. We dun know what Garrosh been plannin this whole time.  What he's got in store for us."]="An me as well. We dun know what Garrosh been plannin this whole time.  What he's got in store for us."
G["An occasion like this calls for a drink!"]="Uma ocasão como esta se merece um trago!"
G["An odd choice... but I suppose I'm not one to judge. Danwe is the one you're after; her engineering stand lies near the Court of the Sun, on the path to Farstriders' Square."]="Uma escolha estranha... mas suponho que não sou de julgar. Danwe é quem você procura; seu estande de engenharia fica perto da Corte do Sol, no caminho para a Praça dos Farstriders."
G["An old friend of mine named Frokle was supposed to be heading in to Gadgetzan, but him and the rest of the Bilgewater crew manning the ship never arrived.  I've heard rumors of a crazy goblin that hangs out near a downed flying machine in the far south, could it be...?"]="Um velho amigo meu, chamado Frokle, deveria estar indo para Gadgetzan, mas ele e o resto da tripulação de Bilgewater que cuidavam do navio nunca chegaram. Ouvi rumores de um duende louco que fica perto de uma máquina voadora ocorrida no extremo sul, poderia ser...?"
G["An old legend, aye. Everyone tells stories about them. They say they are the guardian spirits of the Swiftwater; protectors of Scadeald. According to the songs, they dwell by the river's waterfalls; which are three, like them. In winter, when the water runs low, people say “it's so cold the sisters are silent.” In spring, when the river thaws, the villages celebrate the Song of March, and they say the Three Sisters come out to sing. At least, that's how it was when I was a little girl. Back then we would dress up as maiden, mother, and crone to honor them.\n\nAmong the witches, they're known as Ekatia. They say Morgwena learned her craft at their feet before she turned against them. If there's truth in it, it happened a long time ago. Today, the Three Sisters are just a whisper in the wind."]="An old legend, aye. Everyone tells stories about them. They say they are the guardian spirits of the Swiftwater; protectors of Scadeald. According to the songs, they dwell by the river's waterfalls; which are three, like them. In winter, when the water runs low, people say “it's so cold the sisters are silent.” In spring, when the river thaws, the villages celebrate the Song of March, and they say the Three Sisters come out to sing. At least, that's how it was when I was a little girl. Back then we would dress up as maiden, mother, and crone to honor them.\n\nAmong the witches, they're known as Ekatia. They say Morgwena learned her craft at their feet before she turned against them. If there's truth in it, it happened a long time ago. Today, the Three Sisters are just a whisper in the wind."
G["An old scroll covered in various pandaren pictograms. You suspect that unless the sha corruption in the temple is cleansed you won't be able to peruse the contents further."]="An old scroll covered in various pandaren pictograms. You suspect that unless the sha corruption in the temple is cleansed you won't be able to peruse the contents further."
G["An opportunity presents itself! I believe the Timeless Isle holds the key to unlocking the full potential of your cloak."]="Uma oportunidade surge! Eu acredito que a Ilha Perene guarda a chave para habilitar o potencial pleno do seu manto."
G["An oracle needsh food to foreshee the future. Thanksh!"]="Um oráculo neceshita comida para ver o futuro. Graciash!"
G["An orb of |cFFF00000|Hspell:117227|h[Corrupted Water]|h|r forms!"]="Um orbe de |cFFF00000|Hspell:117227|h[Aguas corruptas]|h|r se forma!"
G["An orc - a true orc warrior - wishes for one thing: To die in the glory of battle against a hated enemy."]="Um orc, um verdadeiro orc guerreiro, tão somente ansía uma coisa: morrer na glória da batalha contra um odiado inimigo."
G["An orc...\n\n<Lantresor scoffs.>\n\nI am a blademaster of half-orc descent."]="Um orc...\n\n<Lantresor se burla.>\n\nSou um mestre do aço de origem meio orc."
G["An order is whispered upon the nether winds and Mah'duun hears.\n\nA $g man : woman; comes before Mah'duun, and they speak of those which the winds demand be slain today."]="Uma ordem é susurrada pelos ventos abissais e Mah'duun ouça.\n\n$g Um homem: Uma mulher; se apresentando-se ante Mah'duun e falam sobre aqueles aos que o vento quer que matem hoje."
G["An outsider, from beyond the mists!"]="Alguém, de além das brumas!"
G["An outsider... saved me?"]="An outsider... saved me?"
G["An understandable expenditure, as I see it. Show everyone, enemies and allies alike, that you're not afraid to use your power."]="An understandable expenditure, as I see it. Show everyone, enemies and allies alike, that you're not afraid to use your power."
G["An unexpected move."]="Um movimento inesperado."
G["An unexpected twist."]="Uma reviravolta inesperada."
G["An unfavorable verdict..."]="Um veredicto desfavorable..."
G["An unforeseen... contingency."]="Uma contingência... imprevista."
G["An unfortunate business expense."]="Um gasto infeliz de negócios."
G["An unseen enemy is perhaps the most dangerous of all."]="Um inimigo ao que não tem visto é provavelmente o mais perigoso de todos."
G["An unspeakable horror dwells here, mortal.  C'Thun and his worshippers are not just an affront to nature, their existence presages destruction for Azeroth as we know it.\n\nMerithra sacrificed herself a thousand years ago along with Caelestrasz and Arygos because they knew this as well.  We're here because of our oath to return for them, but we're also here because C'Thun must be stopped!"]="An unspeakable horror dwells here, mortal.  C'Thun and his worshippers are not just an affront to nature, their existence presages destruction for Azeroth as we know it.\n\nMerithra sacrificed herself a thousand years ago along with Caelestrasz and Arygos because they knew this as well.  We're here because of our oath to return for them, but we're also here because C'Thun must be stopped!"
G["An unstable source.... but its warmth beckons me!"]="Uma fonte instável... mas seu calor me chama!"
G["An was being a meanie when she double hozen dared me. But I wasn't about to run away from a dare."]="An was being a meanie when she double hozen dared me. But I wasn't about to run away from a dare."
G["An' if you cross ya eyes, an' hold ya thumbs toward de sky, an' press REAL hard..."]="An' if you cross ya eyes, an' hold ya thumbs toward de sky, an' press REAL hard..."
G["An' last but certainly not least, one enormous bag! Big enough to fit eight whole apples! Eight, Ed! Can ye believe it!?"]="An' last but certainly not least, one enormous bag! Big enough to fit eight whole apples! Eight, Ed! Can ye believe it!?"
G["An' most of all, we be showin' Zalazane dat his time be at an end! Dat he will give back what be rightfully ours!"]="An' most of all, we be showin' Zalazane dat his time be at an end! Dat he will give back what be rightfully ours!"
G["An' once you dead, den you serve da Gurubashi."]="E uma vez mueh'tos, servirão aos Gurubashi."
G["An' stay down dis time!"]="E eh'ta vez não te levantes!"
G["An' surrounded by the Lich King's beasts, what could old Duggan do?"]="An' surrounded by the Lich King's beasts, what could old Duggan do?"
G["An' then you tunneled from the channel straight into a dining hall!"]="E depois fez um túnel pelo canal que da diretamente ao comedor."
G["An' this one's for Gizmo and Socks, you bastards!!"]="E esta vai por Gizmo e Calcetines, bastardos!"
G["An' when he did arrive there, what'd his dwarf eyes see?"]="Quando o anão chegou ali, que acreditam que com os seus olhos viu?"
G["An' where you think you're goin', sonny?!"]="An' where you think you're goin', sonny?!"
G["Ana, how would you like to go down to the harbor in a little while?"]="Ana, que você acha descer ao porto dentro de um tempo?"
G["Ana, ten more minutes, then you need to wash up. We're having your favorite. Mac and cheese."]="Ana, ten more minutes, then you need to wash up. We're having your favorite. Mac and cheese."
G["Anachronos, I have lost the signet ring. Could you supply me with a replacement?"]="Anachronos, I have lost the signet ring. Could you supply me with a replacement?"
G["Anachronos, this diversion will give you and the young druid time enough to seal the gate. Do not falter. Now, let us see how they deal with chaotic magic."]="Anachronos, this diversion will give you and the young druid time enough to seal the gate. Do not falter. Now, let us see how they deal with chaotic magic."
G["Anakh Kyree!"]="Anakh Kyree!"
G["Anakh kyree!"]="Anakh kyree!"
G["Analysis complete. There is partial corruption in the planet's life-support systems as well as complete corruption in most of the planet's defense mechanisms."]="Analysis complete. There is partial corruption in the planet's life-support systems as well as complete corruption in most of the planet's defense mechanisms."
G["Analyzing Elder Brightleaf enhancement.... Persistent area defenses powered by solar amplification."]="Analyzing Elder Brightleaf enhancement.... Persistent area defenses powered by solar amplification."
G["Analyzing watcher status. Please wait."]="Analyzing watcher status. Please wait."
G["Anar'alah belore!"]="Anar'alah belore!"
G["Anar'alah belore, hero. Good luck."]="Anar'alah belore. Boa sorte."
G["Anar'alah! The skies betray us - we are not safe up here!"]="Anar'alah! The skies betray us - we are not safe up here!"
G["Anar'alash denal! Will someone tell me WHAT is going on in Dalaran?"]="Anar'alash denal! Ninguém vai me contar o QUE está acontecendo em Dalaran?"
G["Anar'anel belore!"]="Anar'anel belore!"
G["Anar'endal dracon!"]="Anar'endal dracon!"
G["Anarchy! Bedlam! Oh, you are so wise! Yes, I see it now, of course!"]="Anarchy! Bedlam! Oh, you are so wise! Yes, I see it now, of course!"
G["Anastasia, stay close please. We'll go do something fun soon."]="Anastácia, não te alejes, por favor. Pronto iremos a fazer algo divertido."
G["Anathera and Latherion fought back to back where the battle was thickest. Two lovers determined to survive the war together."]="Anathera and Latherion fought back to back where the battle was thickest. Two lovers determined to survive the war together."
G["Anathera!"]="Anathera!"
G["Anathera... I cannot bear to face the rest of eternity without you by my side... If you are taken from me, then let this be the day I also return to the earth..."]="Anathera... I cannot bear to face the rest of eternity without you by my side... If you are taken from me, then let this be the day I also return to the earth..."
G["Anaya...? Do my eyes deceive me? Is it really you?"]="Anaya...? Do my eyes deceive me? Is it really you?"
G["Ancestors be beside me, let 'dem hear yo' voice!"]="Ancestors be beside me, let 'dem hear yo' voice!"
G["Ancestors be with you, hero. Farewell!"]="Que os ancestrais estejam com você, corajoso. Adeus!"
G["Ancestors forgive me. I have failed..."]="Ancestrais, perdoem-me... Eu falhei..."
G["Ancestors watch over you, kind one..."]="Que os ancestrais te protejan..."
G["Ancestors, give me strength! The vortex's pull is increasing! It's pulling me in! The power of his longing... it's overwhelming!"]="Ancestors, give me strength! The vortex's pull is increasing! It's pulling me in! The power of his longing... it's overwhelming!"
G["Ancestors, hear me! I call you back from the beyond, to bind this spirit to my will!"]="Ancestors, hear me! I call you back from the beyond, to bind this spirit to my will!"
G["Anchorite Nindumen, I have a request to make of you."]="Anacoreta Nindumen, tenho que pedir algo."
G["Anchorite, I need another Extract of the Afterlife."]="Anacoreta, preciso outro extracto do além."
G["Anchorite, we are honored that you are here, but I am curious as to what you truly believe you can accomplish?"]="Anchorite, we are honored that you are here, but I am curious as to what you truly believe you can accomplish?"
G["Ancient Onu, where may I find a Seed of the Earth?"]="Ancestral Onu, onde posso encontrar a Semilha da Terra?"
G["Ancient Pandaren heroes freed the grummles from slavery."]="Antigos heróis pandarens livertaram os grômulos da escravidão."
G["Ancient forces stir - forces that have not been seen or felt for thousands of years. The world weeps, $r. Perhaps a new sundering comes. A sickness born from within...\n\nThe foulness has begun to seep into our lands. From the Dream come nightmares. Nightmares to befoul us in our waking hours..."]="Ancient forces stir - forces that have not been seen or felt for thousands of years. The world weeps, $r. Perhaps a new sundering comes. A sickness born from within...\n\nThe foulness has begun to seep into our lands. From the Dream come nightmares. Nightmares to befoul us in our waking hours..."
G["Ancient magic swirls within the depths of the eye. It gives you a feeling of vertigo, as if you might accidentally tumble into its iris and fall forever."]="Redemoinhos mágicas antigos nas profundezas do olho. Dá uma sensação de vertigem, como se você acidentalmente caísse na íris e caísse para sempre."
G["Ancient ones guide my hand... Wake from your slumber! WAKE AND SEAL THIS CURSED PLACE!"]="Ancient ones guide my hand... Wake from your slumber! WAKE AND SEAL THIS CURSED PLACE!"
G["Ancient spirit, you honor the Earthen Ring. What troubles you so?"]="Espírito ancião, honras ao Anel da Terra. Que te preocupa tanto?"
G["Ancient spirits of water!"]="Espíritos da água antigos!"
G["Ancient spirits of water."]="Antigos espíritos da água."
G["Ancient wisdoms tell of speaking to Shen-zin Su through the voice of the four elemental spirits, but the spirits have fled our great temple and their powers are fading."]="Ancient wisdoms tell of speaking to Shen-zin Su through the voice of the four elemental spirits, but the spirits have fled our great temple and their powers are fading."
G["Ancients be praised!"]="Ancients be praised!"
G["Ancients of Zandalar, grant dis one da power ta' mock death itself!"]="Ancients of Zandalar, grant dis one da power ta' mock death itself!"
G["Ancients of Zandalar, mark 'dem for de black road."]="Ancients of Zandalar, mark 'dem for de black road."
G["Ancients of fire and earth, I have prepared the way for you. Come forth and raze Orgrimmar."]="Ancients of fire and earth, I have prepared the way for you. Come forth and raze Orgrimmar."
G["Ancients of flour and earth, I have peppered the way for you. Come forth and glaze Orgrimmar!"]="Ancients of flour and earth, I have peppered the way for you. Come forth and glaze Orgrimmar!"
G["Ancients of wheat and water, I have peppered the way for you. Come forth and glaze Stormwind!"]="Ancients of wheat and water, I have peppered the way for you. Come forth and glaze Stormwind!"
G["Ancients of wind and water, I have prepared the way for you. Come forth and raze Stormwind."]="Ancients of wind and water, I have prepared the way for you. Come forth and raze Stormwind."
G["Ancients, rise!"]="Ancestrais, levantem-se!"
G["And \"Fanny,\" a most fitting name."]="And \"Fanny,\" a most fitting name."
G["And $gbrother:sister;, be wary of scourge ambushes."]="E $ghermano: irmã;, tenha cuidado com as emboscadas do Flagelo."
G["And $n, you shall be the hand that guides us all. Speak with me for a moment before you join Aysa at the Singing Pools to the east."]="And $n, you shall be the hand that guides us all. Speak with me for a moment before you join Aysa at the Singing Pools to the east."
G["And Fahrad?"]="E, Fahrad?"
G["And Garrosh is losin' patience over findin' that ookin' bell. Those mogu hide it good!"]="And Garrosh is losin' patience over findin' that ookin' bell. Those mogu hide it good!"
G["And I MUST have a carafe of sweet nectar in my dressing room. It's right there in my contract!"]="E DEVO ter uma garrafa de doce néctar na minha camerino. Está aqui, na minha contrato!"
G["And I am determined to find out more... So if you need my help again, you know where I'll be."]="And I am determined to find out more... So if you need my help again, you know where I'll be."
G["And I am just saying, Dissector, that you do not appear to possess any resistance to sonic manipulation."]="And I am just saying, Dissector, that you do not appear to possess any resistance to sonic manipulation."
G["And I don't know anything about this fire of yours..."]="Se eu não sei nada sobre esse fogo do que fale..."
G["And I don't want our land to have any of those horrible wolves, or giants, or ugly rams!"]="And I don't want our land to have any of those horrible wolves, or giants, or ugly rams!"
G["And I have come for you, Leyara."]="E e vindo a por você, Leyara."
G["And I have seen the mightiest of emperors laid low by the perseverance of the smallest of enemies."]="E vi ao imperador mais poderoso cair ante a perseverância do inimigo mais insignificante."
G["And I invite you to take part in its creation."]="E te invito a que formes parte do seu criação."
G["And I knew you'd say that."]="And I knew you'd say that."
G["And I take it you're going again..."]="E suponho que vai voltar..."
G["And I think he lived a very very good life. We owe everything we have to Liu Lang, the first pandaren explorer."]="E acho que ele vivió uma muito boa vida. Lhe devemos tudo o que temos a Liu Lang, o primeiro explorador pandaren."
G["And I thought I might get a bit of rest. Silly me."]="E pensei em descansar um pouco. Eu tolo."
G["And I was suited to see this?"]="E eu tinha que ver isto?"
G["And I wish I could join you $n. Head over to Stormwind Keep. You'll find Thelman Slatefist in the King's audience chamber. He will aid you in getting to Alterac Valley."]="Tomara pudesse ir embora com você, $n. Vá embora ao Castelo de Ventobravo. Encontrar a Thelman Punhopizarra na salão de audiências do rei. Te ajudará a chegar até o Vale Alterac."
G["And I'm beginning to get HELMET HAIR. This is a travesty!"]="And I'm beginning to get HELMET HAIR. This is a travesty!"
G["And I've got just the brew to celebrate with. First round is on me. Thank you, friends!"]="And I've got just the brew to celebrate with. First round is on me. Thank you, friends!"
G["And STAY dead!"]="E FIQUE aí morto!"
G["And Shindigger Stout too!  Thank the Light!  I was parched!"]="And Shindigger Stout too!  Thank the Light!  I was parched!"
G["And Socks!"]="E a Calcetines!"
G["And THEN what happened?"]="E ENTONES que passou?"
G["And WHAT are our soldiers supposed to do with that shoddy piece of junk?"]="And WHAT are our soldiers supposed to do with that shoddy piece of junk?"
G["And YOU! We will FEAST on your ashes! Now, DIE!"]="And YOU! We will FEAST on your ashes! Now, DIE!"
G["And a good day to ya, brave $c.  I know ya be lookin' for a fine steed.  There's no finer steed than a raptor under your reigns, lemme tell you $g mon : sis;!  Take a look at the ones I got to offer - bred from the fiercest stock anywhere."]="And a good day to ya, brave $c.  I know ya be lookin' for a fine steed.  There's no finer steed than a raptor under your reigns, lemme tell you $g mon : sis;!  Take a look at the ones I got to offer - bred from the fiercest stock anywhere."
G["And a great deal of honor you shall have, I am sure.  Speak with Martin Lindsey at the Pools of Vision.  It is a cave located in the side of the Spirit Rise."]="E ganhará muito honra, disso estou certo. Fala com Martin Lindsey nas Poços das Visões. É uma caverna situada na parte do Alto dos Espíritos."
G["And above it all, I somehow find myself saddled with you, the very man who caused me to lose my job in the first place!"]="E sobre tudo, não sei como te estou endilgando, você, o homem que fez que perdiera meu trabalho primeiro."
G["And as I drifted towards nothingness, a brilliant light appeared, then another, and another... My dear val'kyr."]="And as I drifted towards nothingness, a brilliant light appeared, then another, and another... My dear val'kyr."
G["And as for you, $n, disappointing. You are a disgrace to the Horde!"]="Assim que você, $n, me decepcionas. É a vergonha da Horda!"
G["And as one of the fiercest tests put upon a warrior of the frostborn, we are made to face a creature far larger than ourselves--giants, dragons, jormungar--as a testament to the fact that size will never be our weakness."]="And as one of the fiercest tests put upon a warrior of the frostborn, we are made to face a creature far larger than ourselves--giants, dragons, jormungar--as a testament to the fact that size will never be our weakness."
G["And as your limp body dangles from the rafters, I shall take pleasure in knowing that a mad man has been put to death. After all, what proof do you have? Did you expect to come in here and point your fingers at royalty and leave unscathed?"]="And as your limp body dangles from the rafters, I shall take pleasure in knowing that a mad man has been put to death. After all, what proof do you have? Did you expect to come in here and point your fingers at royalty and leave unscathed?"
G["And bowing to the Warchief is any better? Garrosh's obsession with these mogu artifacts is such that I haven't seen since Kael'thas walked amongst us."]="And bowing to the Warchief is any better? Garrosh's obsession with these mogu artifacts is such that I haven't seen since Kael'thas walked amongst us."
G["And countless more to come, Klaxxi'va. It is my honor to serve in our time of need."]="And countless more to come, Klaxxi'va. It is my honor to serve in our time of need."
G["And crossing the line is the gnome car! The gnomes win!"]="O coche gnomo vai cruzando a linha! Os gnomos têm ganhou!"
G["And death..."]="E a morte..."
G["And did he?"]="E ele o fez?"
G["And did the good King Varian send you as well to bid for our aid?"]="And did the good King Varian send you as well to bid for our aid?"
G["And dis is da recipe for da bestest Broken chowder!"]="And dis is da recipe for da bestest Broken chowder!"
G["And don't come back!"]="E não vuelvas por aqui!"
G["And don't worry about the trolls underfoot while you're up there. They'll be trampled into the ground by the ancients' strides."]="And don't worry about the trolls underfoot while you're up there. They'll be trampled into the ground by the ancients' strides."
G["And drop your dooker to the ground!"]="And drop your dooker to the ground!"
G["And every foe that falls, energy sapped and stolen, only further fuels our assault."]="And every foe that falls, energy sapped and stolen, only further fuels our assault."
G["And fer dessert we be havin' cheesecake, flown in fresh from Stormwind on the wings o' angels..."]="And fer dessert we be havin' cheesecake, flown in fresh from Stormwind on the wings o' angels..."
G["And finally the candle... to burn those who would thwart you!"]="And finally the candle... to burn those who would thwart you!"
G["And finally, this is Master Cheng.  Master Cheng focuses on reflex and swift motion and will help you begin your training."]="And finally, this is Master Cheng.  Master Cheng focuses on reflex and swift motion and will help you begin your training."
G["And find it he did. After quickly advancing through the ranks of the Cult, the Lich King himself granted Ras immortality. Thus was born Ras Frostwhisper, the lich.\n\nNow do you understand?"]="And find it he did. After quickly advancing through the ranks of the Cult, the Lich King himself granted Ras immortality. Thus was born Ras Frostwhisper, the lich.\n\nNow do you understand?"
G["And fire!"]="E o fogo!"
G["And for our gods?"]="E nós pelos nossos?"
G["And for the ladies, roast baby boar. Enjoy!"]="And for the ladies, roast baby boar. Enjoy!"
G["And for what? What did the Horde gain from such actions?  Garrosh is a fool, and a betrayer.  I should have killed him long ago, when he betrayed my father."]="And for what? What did the Horde gain from such actions?  Garrosh is a fool, and a betrayer.  I should have killed him long ago, when he betrayed my father."
G["And from the Red Crane, a shining beacon of hope for a better world!"]="E, da Grulha Vermelha, um reluzente farol de esperança para um mundo melhor!"
G["And get this damn thing out of my sight! Hellscream bought his treasure with the blood of my people. I hope it destroys him."]="E tire esta coisa daqui! Grito Infernal comprou seu tesouro com o sangue do meu povo. Eu espero que isso seja a ruína dele."
G["And go where? It was all that we knew; all that we had known and all that we would ever know.\n\nEventually, we lost contact with the Barovs and ultimately, were separated from the household. We knew not what happened to the other servants, only that there were screams. Tortured screams.\n\nKnowing that we had nowhere to go, Lucien and I were forced to hide in our quarters. During the day, when the school was relatively quiet, Lucien would sneak out to scrounge up food and drink."]="And go where? It was all that we knew; all that we had known and all that we would ever know.\n\nEventually, we lost contact with the Barovs and ultimately, were separated from the household. We knew not what happened to the other servants, only that there were screams. Tortured screams.\n\nKnowing that we had nowhere to go, Lucien and I were forced to hide in our quarters. During the day, when the school was relatively quiet, Lucien would sneak out to scrounge up food and drink."
G["And have you heard? Have you heard the preposterous claims? Alliance and Horde supporting peace? Why the very thought of such things makes my blood boil!"]="And have you heard? Have you heard the preposterous claims? Alliance and Horde supporting peace? Why the very thought of such things makes my blood boil!"
G["And having seen what Grand Empress Shek'zeer is doing to our land... I need no convincing."]="E em visão do que a grande imperatriz Shek'zeer lhe está fazendo a nossa terra... não preciso que me convenzan."
G["And he's down for the count! Good going."]="O tem saído K. OU.! Bem feito."
G["And here we are!  Welcome to Kharanos!  Watch your step on the way out."]="E aqui estamos! Dou a você a boas-vindas a Kharanos! Tenha cuidado ao sair."
G["And here we are. Help me with a couple small tasks while I prepare, if you would."]="Já temos chegado. Te importaría me ajudar com umas tarefas enquanto me preparo?"
G["And heroes... I hold that which you seek. May it once more see the evil dissolved. Remulos, see to it that our champion receives the shard of the Green Flight."]="And heroes... I hold that which you seek. May it once more see the evil dissolved. Remulos, see to it that our champion receives the shard of the Green Flight."
G["And his visions DID come to pass."]="E as visões realmente aconteceram."
G["And how committed the Alliance is to the Wildhammer cause!"]="E o comprometida que está a Aliança com a causa dos Martelo Feroz!"
G["And how have you been enjoying our land? Have you been learning?"]="Que você parecido nossa terra? Tem aprendido algo?"
G["And how many do YOU perform?"]="And how many do YOU perform?"
G["And if I hear that you palookas complained to Nazgrel again, it'll be one of ya's that I serve up next time..."]="And if I hear that you palookas complained to Nazgrel again, it'll be one of ya's that I serve up next time..."
G["And if that answer is no, then could it be possible that because this artifact exists, its polar opposite must also exist?"]="E, se a resposta é não, pode ser possível que, porque este artefato existe, seu contrario também deve existir?"
G["And if that weren't crazy enough, that big demon gets killed by a bunch of little floating light things... Oh, I was also a female elf in that one... Yep..."]="And if that weren't crazy enough, that big demon gets killed by a bunch of little floating light things... Oh, I was also a female elf in that one... Yep..."
G["And if we find ourselves surrounded and disarmed... wounded and overwhelmed... we will lift our heads in defiance and spit in their faces."]="E se nos encontramos rodeados e desarmados... feridos e superados... Levantaremos a cabeça desafiantes e escupiremos nos seus caras."
G["And if we find ourselves surrounded and disarmed... wounded and without hope... we will lift our heads in defiance and spit in their faces."]="E se acabamos rodeados e desarmados... feridos e sem esperança... levantaremos as cabeças desafiantes e lhes escupiremos na rosto."
G["And if you do not, then I am truly lost."]="E se não é assim, então estou perdida."
G["And if you don't obey, we're cutting you up for parts."]="And if you don't obey, we're cutting you up for parts."
G["And if you'll look to your left, you'll see that the gnomes have retaken Gnomeregan.  Hooray for us!"]="E se olha ao seu esquerda, verá que os gnomos têm recuperei Gnomeregan. Três vivas por nós!"
G["And if you'll look to your right, you'll see... my friend, about to get killed!"]="And if you'll look to your right, you'll see... my friend, about to get killed!"
G["And if your Farstriders were here to reinforce us, I might agree. But, they are busying themselves instead with the Shadowpine trolls on your eastern border. The longer we wait for them, the stronger the Scourge will become."]="And if your Farstriders were here to reinforce us, I might agree. But, they are busying themselves instead with the Shadowpine trolls on your eastern border. The longer we wait for them, the stronger the Scourge will become."
G["And in the other corner, we have the many eyes of Zen'shar! What's next, a fighting nose?"]="And in the other corner, we have the many eyes of Zen'shar! What's next, a fighting nose?"
G["And in the other corner, we have... a big cloud of scary floating eyes? This doesn't look good."]="And in the other corner, we have... a big cloud of scary floating eyes? This doesn't look good."
G["And in the vision... the High Council did not make this decision for you, Phaoris."]="E em essa visão... o Alto Conselho não tomó esta decisão por você, Phaoris."
G["And in this corner! He's angry. He's deadly. He's a little bit adorable. Straight out of Neverest, it's Crush!"]="And in this corner! He's angry. He's deadly. He's a little bit adorable. Straight out of Neverest, it's Crush!"
G["And in times since, the people have cared for Huo, knowing that they and he were intimately tied."]="E, desde então, o povo tem cuidado de Huo, já que conocíao forte vínculo entre eles."
G["And it looks like he's got reinforcements comin' from Nazjatar!"]="E parece que conseguiu que venham reforços de Nazjatar!"
G["And it looks to me like you made a new friend."]="E além fez um novo amigo."
G["And it very nearly didn't remember you. $n fought bravely against the North Wind to protect your story."]="And it very nearly didn't remember you. $n fought bravely against the North Wind to protect your story."
G["And it's kind of scary, too."]="E da um pouco de medo também."
G["And it's the $n coming through turn one!"]="E agorao $n vem de dar a primeira volta!"
G["And just for good measure..."]="E um pouco mais..."
G["And just like that, you're dead!"]="E assim sem mais, está morto!"
G["And just what do you think you are doing?  You dare to interfere with my master's experiment?"]="And just what do you think you are doing?  You dare to interfere with my master's experiment?"
G["And justice is served!"]="E a justiça está servida!"
G["And keep the change you filthy animal!"]="E fique com o caminho, sujo animal!"
G["And keep the change, ya filthy animal!"]="E fique com o caminho, sujo animal!"
G["And last, we put in da Corki!"]="And last, we put in da Corki!"
G["And let the Wildhammers unite!"]="E que se unan os Martelo Feroz!"
G["And let's set these whole Highlands alight!"]="And let's set these whole Highlands alight!"
G["And lo, how the mighty fell trembling at its feet, fearful that it might direct its words upon them.\n\nBut still did these charlatans, these worshipping pretenders to a non-existent religion, rail against the inevitable in a vain attempt to control their 'god.'  Uncaring, and likely not even noticing them, Murmur yawned and they knew oblivion.\n\nYet one somehow managed to survive, and in his insanity found a way to bring Murmur into the world."]="And lo, how the mighty fell trembling at its feet, fearful that it might direct its words upon them.\n\nBut still did these charlatans, these worshipping pretenders to a non-existent religion, rail against the inevitable in a vain attempt to control their 'god.'  Uncaring, and likely not even noticing them, Murmur yawned and they knew oblivion.\n\nYet one somehow managed to survive, and in his insanity found a way to bring Murmur into the world."
G["And me, Tak-Tak, me is your friend! Bam!"]="E Tak-Tak é seu amigo! Uau!"
G["And might I add, that dress is lovely! You must tell me where you got it from."]="And might I add, that dress is lovely! You must tell me where you got it from."
G["And miss out on wearing my awesome custom-made helmet? Not a chance."]="E deixou de usar meu incrível capacete feito sob medida? Sem chance."
G["And modest too... Perhaps it is your time, then, $n.\n\nAre you prepared to enter the fortress of the Blackrock orcs? To wreak havoc? To tear asunder the foundation of the mountain citadel?"]="And modest too... Perhaps it is your time, then, $n.\n\nAre you prepared to enter the fortress of the Blackrock orcs? To wreak havoc? To tear asunder the foundation of the mountain citadel?"
G["And more importantly, what are those Scourge fiends doing here?"]="And more importantly, what are those Scourge fiends doing here?"
G["And my people have not always been the Forsaken."]="E os Renegados não sempre têm banido meu gente."
G["And my soul... my soul belongs to the Scourge!"]="E minha alma... minha alma pertence a o Flagelo!"
G["And neither, Avartu, will yours."]="Nem o seu, Avartu."
G["And not a very good one! Remember what you did to my tabard?"]="And not a very good one! Remember what you did to my tabard?"
G["And now all your goblin friends are safe and happy again and there's no more pirates to blow up your ships!"]="Agora todos seus amigos goblins estão aptos e salvos novamente e já não ocorrida nenhum pirata que faça saltar seus barcos pelos aires!"
G["And now enough of this deception."]="And now enough of this deception."
G["And now for a quick look at these gems."]="Agora é preciso dar um breve olhada a estas gemas."
G["And now for the moment of truth."]="E agora, a hora da verdade."
G["And now it falls to you, champions, to avenge us all. The task before you is great, but I will lend you my aid as I am able. You must prevail."]="And now it falls to you, champions, to avenge us all. The task before you is great, but I will lend you my aid as I am able. You must prevail."
G["And now my first decree upon the Vrykul! All malformed infants born of Vrykul mother and father are to be destroyed upon birth! Our blood must remain pure always! Those found in violation of Ymiron's decree will be taken to Gjalerbron for execution!"]="And now my first decree upon the Vrykul! All malformed infants born of Vrykul mother and father are to be destroyed upon birth! Our blood must remain pure always! Those found in violation of Ymiron's decree will be taken to Gjalerbron for execution!"
G["And now the war, it be comin' soon. All that be left is the sendin' of all these goods and weapons to the Cenarion Hold in Silithus, and that is gonna be done within $2113w days. Then some brave soul is gonna have to be ringin' the gong near those Ahn'Qiraj gates to open 'em and start the war."]="A guerra pronto chegará. O único que falta é enviar toda esta mercadoria e armas ao Forte Cenariano em Silithus e isso o faremos nos próximos $2113w dias. Depois algum corajoso terá que fazer soar o gongo que está ao lado a Ahn'Qiraj para abrir seus portões e começar à guerra."
G["And now the war, it be comin' soon. All that be left is the sendin' of all these goods and weapons to the Cenarion Hold in Silithus, and that is gonna be done within a day. Then some brave soul is gonna have to be ringin' the gong near those Ahn'Qiraj gates to open 'em and start the war."]="A guerra pronto chegará. O único que falta é enviar toda esta mercadoria e armas ao Forte Cenariano em Silithus e isso o faremos no próximo dia. Depois algum corajoso terá que fazer soar o gongo que está ao lado a Ahn'Qiraj para abrir seus portões e começar à guerra."
G["And now this... folly... would cost my daughter her life."]="E agora esta... loucura... pode costarle a vida a meu filha."
G["And now to do what I should have done a hundred years ago."]="E agora, a fazer o que deveria haver feito há centenas de anos."
G["And now to make sure he doesn't get back up..."]="E agora, asegurémonos de que não levante..."
G["And now to quickly use the Orb of Domination, before the pit lord turns on us."]="And now to quickly use the Orb of Domination, before the pit lord turns on us."
G["And now we part company."]="And now we part company."
G["And now you die!"]="E agora, morre!"
G["And now you know all that there is to know, mortal..."]="E agora já sabe tudo o que é preciso saber, mortal..."
G["And now you know why I live in a crater."]="E agora sabe por que vivo em um cratera."
G["And now, Akali, my master will have your blood and I will take some of your power as well!"]="And now, Akali, my master will have your blood and I will take some of your power as well!"
G["And now, Garrosh has the Divine Bell. He could attack us any day!"]="And now, Garrosh has the Divine Bell. He could attack us any day!"
G["And now, I cut you!"]="E agora, te rajo!"
G["And now, I must rest. Thank you for all that you have done."]="E agora e de descansar. Obrigado por tudo o que fez."
G["And now, I must return to the waters of the lake."]="E agora, devo voltar às águas do lago."
G["And now, I run!"]="E, agora, corro!"
G["And now, Shaman, you will give the Dragon Soul to ME."]="E agora, xamã, me entregarás o Alma de dragão."
G["And now, even those nations that you would have called allies have recoiled and joined forces with us... Yes, old one, do not look so surprised."]="And now, even those nations that you would have called allies have recoiled and joined forces with us... Yes, old one, do not look so surprised."
G["And now, it looks like they found where the mogu hid that bell."]="And now, it looks like they found where the mogu hid that bell."
G["And now, the Klaxxi call us to battle. Now, I am awakened."]="And now, the Klaxxi call us to battle. Now, I am awakened."
G["And now, the malignance of the Old God has manifested itself within the waters."]="And now, the malignance of the Old God has manifested itself within the waters."
G["And now, the war begins."]="E agora, começa a guerra."
G["And now, we spring the trap on our attackers..."]="And now, we spring the trap on our attackers..."
G["And now, your sad tale comes to an end."]="E agora, sua triste história chega ao fim."
G["And now... let the Rumpus start!"]="E agora... Que comience o Embrolho!"
G["And now... the final step!"]="E agora... O último passo!"
G["And now?"]="E agora?"
G["And of course I'll need some mana. You guys are gonna love this; just wait...."]="E não pode faltar um pouco de mana. Os vai encartar, esperem um momento..."
G["And on this very soil that we now touch, our greatest heroes once hunted."]="And on this very soil that we now touch, our greatest heroes once hunted."
G["And once the new order is established? My place will be secure, yes?"]="And once the new order is established? My place will be secure, yes?"
G["And once we do, Stormwind's days are numbered."]="E uma vez estiver em nosso poder, os dias de Ventobravo estarão contados."
G["And one time, at camp, I caught a fish that was bigger than I am!!"]="E uma vez, no acampamento, pesqué um peixe que era mais grande que eu!!"
G["And our lack of answers only fuels the confusion."]="E nossa falta de respostas somente alimenta a confusão."
G["And people from all over the world come to me to pay homage... and learn to fish."]="And people from all over the world come to me to pay homage... and learn to fish."
G["And perhaps the best part, I now have a hungering for the flesh of other humanoids. Cannibalizing their rotting corpses grants me power. Yes, DE-LI-CIOUS..."]="And perhaps the best part, I now have a hungering for the flesh of other humanoids. Cannibalizing their rotting corpses grants me power. Yes, DE-LI-CIOUS..."
G["And please. Pay no heed to the... uhh... diversity of our crew."]="And please. Pay no heed to the... uhh... diversity of our crew."
G["And remember this, mortal: for now, I give you the choice. I allow you to pick your allegiance, but in the end, you will be mine - one way or another."]="And remember this, mortal: for now, I give you the choice. I allow you to pick your allegiance, but in the end, you will be mine - one way or another."
G["And remember, $n, the bloodspore powder can be used to weaken all magnataur in Gammoth."]="And remember, $n, the bloodspore powder can be used to weaken all magnataur in Gammoth."
G["And right when we finally finished building that damned bridge! What hope is there, $n?"]="E logo quando acabamos de construir esse maldito ponte! Onde está a esperança, $n?"
G["And serve you shall. Arm yourself at the quartermaster. The drones here are at your disposal."]="And serve you shall. Arm yourself at the quartermaster. The drones here are at your disposal."
G["And should one die, two shall rise!"]="And should one die, two shall rise!"
G["And so Arthas's armies break into the last untouched land in Northrend..."]="And so Arthas's armies break into the last untouched land in Northrend..."
G["And so I see that you have appealed to Diamant. I have been bidden to abide your passing, fleshling. But that shall be the extent of the welcome you shall receive from me.\n\nDo not forget our first conversation. My trust for you is shallow. You have much to prove.\n\nYou would do best to leave. I grow tired of being wary of where my feet fall."]="And so I see that you have appealed to Diamant. I have been bidden to abide your passing, fleshling. But that shall be the extent of the welcome you shall receive from me.\n\nDo not forget our first conversation. My trust for you is shallow. You have much to prove.\n\nYou would do best to leave. I grow tired of being wary of where my feet fall."
G["And so Moira and the High King set out into the snow to save the city, leaving the others to think about their actions."]="Então Moira e o Alto Rei saíram para a neve para salvar a cidade, deixando os outros a pensar em suas ações."
G["And so ends the Nexus War."]="E assim acaba a guerra do Nexus."
G["And so ends your story."]="E assim acaba sua história."
G["And so it begins."]="Começou."
G["And so it begins..."]="Já começa..."
G["And so it falls to us, Her chosen voice."]="And so it falls to us, Her chosen voice."
G["And so it is done."]="Já está feito."
G["And so it was a human king who helped to unite the dwarven clans so long divided."]="E foi assim que um rei humano ajudou a unir os clãs enânicos que estavam separados há tanto tempo."
G["And so our path lays before us. Speak to Master Shang Xi, he will tell you what comes next."]="And so our path lays before us. Speak to Master Shang Xi, he will tell you what comes next."
G["And so the \"champion\" arrives."]="And so the \"champion\" arrives."
G["And so the Golden Lotus arrive..."]="Assim que o Loto Ouro chegou..."
G["And so the circle of life is complete. All is prepared."]="E assim o círculo da vida se completa. Tudo está pronto."
G["And so the knights stood before the charging Horde and held their ground as a thousand berserk orcs came through the valley."]="And so the knights stood before the charging Horde and held their ground as a thousand berserk orcs came through the valley."
G["And so then he says \"I was talking to the chicken!\""]="E então diz \"Estava falando com o frango!\""
G["And so they are washed away with little trace of what once was."]="Assim eles são levados pelas águas, sem deixar traço do que foram."
G["And some will preach unity!  But does unity prevent a chain from breaking at its weakest link?"]="And some will preach unity!  But does unity prevent a chain from breaking at its weakest link?"
G["And sometimes you have to ask yourself: \"Is it worth it?\"  And the answer is plain: \"Pain is not the cost, but the reward!\""]="And sometimes you have to ask yourself: \"Is it worth it?\"  And the answer is plain: \"Pain is not the cost, but the reward!\""
G["And stay down!"]="E não te levantes!"
G["And stay out!"]="E não vuelvas a tentar!"
G["And summon forth Murmur they did.\n\nPowerful magics of containment and silencing were employed, held together by the constant supply of souls being fed into them.  Yet still they could not control the beast, could not bend it to their will.\n\nThese mortals began to devise different strategies, and one after the other they all failed.  And in so doing, they weakened the rituals, accidentally giving Murmur the slightest modicum of freedom.\n\nIt was all that was needed."]="And summon forth Murmur they did.\n\nPowerful magics of containment and silencing were employed, held together by the constant supply of souls being fed into them.  Yet still they could not control the beast, could not bend it to their will.\n\nThese mortals began to devise different strategies, and one after the other they all failed.  And in so doing, they weakened the rituals, accidentally giving Murmur the slightest modicum of freedom.\n\nIt was all that was needed."
G["And thank YOU, hero. It will be difficult to hold the forge, but think of what we can learn here!"]="And thank YOU, hero. It will be difficult to hold the forge, but think of what we can learn here!"
G["And thank you, $n.  Without your aid I may never have found my way to the Forsaken."]="E Obrigado, $n. Sem sua ajuda, mais haveria encontrado o caminho até os Renegados."
G["And thank you... thank you for freeing me from the shackles of the damned.  You are a hero... I know you will go on to great deeds."]="And thank you... thank you for freeing me from the shackles of the damned.  You are a hero... I know you will go on to great deeds."
G["And that is the lesson of Liu Lang, my friend. Everyone always laughs at the explorer. They always laugh... until he returns."]="E essa é a lição de Liu Lang, meu amigo. Todos riem do explorador. Eles sempre riem... até que ele retorna."
G["And that's how Lothar killed thirty six orcs with his bare hands!"]="And that's how Lothar killed thirty six orcs with his bare hands!"
G["And that's that, folks! This conflict's been settled the proper way, with VIOLENCE! Let's hear it for our contestants!"]="And that's that, folks! This conflict's been settled the proper way, with VIOLENCE! Let's hear it for our contestants!"
G["And that's where we find ourselves now, $n.\n\nWe can't possibly deal with all of this by ourselves, and quite frankly, I feel a little out of my depth. Jinky knows what needs to be done. You should go see her now.\n\nI just hope you'll be able to get us out of this mess with our bodies intact."]="And that's where we find ourselves now, $n.\n\nWe can't possibly deal with all of this by ourselves, and quite frankly, I feel a little out of my depth. Jinky knows what needs to be done. You should go see her now.\n\nI just hope you'll be able to get us out of this mess with our bodies intact."
G["And the Alliance wasn't supposed follow the same visions your wife was having."]="E se deveria que a Aliança não estava seguindo as mesmas visões que tinha seu mulher."
G["And the Kirin Tor? What have they to say of necromancy?"]="And the Kirin Tor? What have they to say of necromancy?"
G["And the Tastyfish have gone for the week!   I will remain for another hour to allow you to turn in your fish!"]="E os peixe se têm terminado! Me ficarei outra hora mais para que possam entregar seus peixe!"
G["And the answer is nothing... For it is the titans that have cursed us!"]="And the answer is nothing... For it is the titans that have cursed us!"
G["And the cub concluded, \"I should very much like to live like a hozen!\""]="E o filhote concluiu: \"Eu gostaria muito de viver feito um hozen!\""
G["And the delivery is not for ME, Hao! The honorable Lorewalker has been waitin- oh..."]="And the delivery is not for ME, Hao! The honorable Lorewalker has been waitin- oh..."
G["And the flame of our vengeance draws near. Be ready."]="E a CHAMA de nossa vingança se aproxima. Prepare-se."
G["And the greatest losses."]="And the greatest losses."
G["And the kaldorei vessel?"]="E a nave kaldorei?"
G["And the other half?"]="E a outra metade?"
G["And the wisdom of those you've outsmarted."]="... e a sabedoria dos que derrotou."
G["And their shamans have laid out a network of sentry totems."]="And their shamans have laid out a network of sentry totems."
G["And their skulls are harder than granite. Curiously, they all appear to be related."]="E seus crânios são mais duros que granito. Curiosamente, todos eles parecem ser parentes."
G["And their torment at your hands is at an end. By my name, I shall put an end to your life."]="E seu tormento nos seus mãos chega ao seu fim. Por meu nome que pondré fim ao seu vida."
G["And then I'll throw you to Kalimdor!"]="E depois te lançarei até Kalimdor!"
G["And then came Huo, the spirit of fire, to the land of Shen-zin Su."]="E então Huo, o espírito do fogo, chegou à terra de Shen-zin Seu."
G["And then gnomes are even worse!  They are always saying stuff like..."]="And then gnomes are even worse!  They are always saying stuff like..."
G["And then the Old One will remake this world for the Mantid!"]="E então o Antigo reconstruirá este mundo para os mantídeos!"
G["And then the Tauren said, '13 INCHES!'"]="E então vao tauren e diz: \"39 CENTÍMETROS!\"."
G["And then the rabbit just bit his head off... I swear."]="And then the rabbit just bit his head off... I swear."
G["And then use it to KILL ALLIANCE!"]="And then use it to KILL ALLIANCE!"
G["And then we met!"]="E então nos encontramos!"
G["And then we saw her, the fearsome beast!"]="E então vimos à temible fera!"
G["And then what happened?"]="E que passou depois?"
G["And then, forever on, yer soul be my plaything...."]="E então sua alma será meu brinquedo para toda a eternidade..."
G["And then, my brothers and sisters, we shall shed these frail forms and ascend to immortality!"]="And then, my brothers and sisters, we shall shed these frail forms and ascend to immortality!"
G["And there ... they remained."]="E lá... permaneceram."
G["And there are Virmen in the main store!"]="And there are Virmen in the main store!"
G["And there goes the other one."]="And there goes the other one."
G["And there is no hope!  There is no hope but in the loss of all hope.  That's right, brothers and sisters.  Only hopelessness can grant true hope!"]="And there is no hope!  There is no hope but in the loss of all hope.  That's right, brothers and sisters.  Only hopelessness can grant true hope!"
G["And there is nothing you or that fool, Illidan, can do to stop me! You have both served me in your own right - unwittingly."]="And there is nothing you or that fool, Illidan, can do to stop me! You have both served me in your own right - unwittingly."
G["And there is this..."]="E está isto..."
G["And there she is, the Spirit of Gnomeregan!"]="Aí está, o Espírito de Gnomeregan!"
