G["Aquanos can hardly keep up!"]="Aquanos apenas pode manter o firme!"
G["Aquanos, stop sending the clothes so high! You didn't have to see the look on Aethas Sunreaver's face when he found his pants in the fountain!"]="Aquanos, stop sending the clothes so high! You didn't have to see the look on Aethas Sunreaver's face when he found his pants in the fountain!"
G["Ar'tor's lifeless body remains suspended in mid-air by demonic magic. They take from him, even in death..."]="O corpo sem vida de Ar'tor permanece suspenso no ar por magia demoníaca. Eles tiram dele, mesmo na morte..."
G["Arak-ha!"]="Arak-tem!"
G["Aran has been defeated? Yes... I can sense his grip has loosened - if only just a little. But just enough to allow me to do my job as the doorman! Would you like me transport you to the Guardian's Library, $n?"]="Aran has been defeated? Yes... I can sense his grip has loosened - if only just a little. But just enough to allow me to do my job as the doorman! Would you like me transport you to the Guardian's Library, $n?"
G["Aranal, ledel! Their fate shall be yours!"]="Aranal, ledel! Seu sorte será à sua!"
G["Arathi Basin"]="Cuenca de Arathi"
G["Arathi Basin has been overrun by The Defilers.  Will you help us, $n?"]="A Bacia Arathi está ocupada pelos Rapinhadores. Pode nos ajudar, $n?"
G["Arathi Basin place to take from soft humans.  Sir Malory Wheeler send you there."]="Arathi Basin lugar para levar a partir de seres humanos macios. Sir Malory Wheeler manda você para lá."
G["Arathi Basin was once our home, and will be again with your aid!  Will you help us $c?"]="Arathi Basin was once our home, and will be again with your aid!  Will you help us $c?"
G["Araxes! Send help! I'm pinned down in the mines. I... I'm not sure where I am exactly but I had the presence of mind to drop tracers on the ground behind me."]="Araxes! Send help! I'm pinned down in the mines. I... I'm not sure where I am exactly but I had the presence of mind to drop tracers on the ground behind me."
G["Araxes, come in... Are you there Araxes? Visibility is nil. Warp storms blocking us."]="Araxes, entre... Você está aí Araxes? A visibilidade é nula. Tempestades de urdidura nos bloqueando."
G["Arcane Reforgers can modify the magical effects of a item; this magically complex process is known simply as reforging.\n\nThrough reforging, a secondary attribute of any piece of weaponry, armor, or jewelry may be reduced in order to add an additional secondary attribute. In this manner one may customize their equipment to best match their role and skills.\n\nFor example, if an item afforded you a bonus to strike your enemies but you'd rather it made you attack more quickly, an Arcane Reforger could, for a price, reforge the item to have less Hit but increase your Haste."]="Arcane Reforgers can modify the magical effects of a item; this magically complex process is known simply as reforging.\n\nThrough reforging, a secondary attribute of any piece of weaponry, armor, or jewelry may be reduced in order to add an additional secondary attribute. In this manner one may customize their equipment to best match their role and skills.\n\nFor example, if an item afforded you a bonus to strike your enemies but you'd rather it made you attack more quickly, an Arcane Reforger could, for a price, reforge the item to have less Hit but increase your Haste."
G["Arcane magic twists the boundaries of our world. It weakens the laws of this realm to allow the impossible to happen, if only for a moment."]="Arcane magic twists the boundaries of our world. It weakens the laws of this realm to allow the impossible to happen, if only for a moment."
G["Arcanist Tybalin said you might be able to lend me a certain tabard."]="O arcanista Tybalin disse que você pode me emprestar um certo tabardo."
G["Arcanist Vandril, what are the Forsaken doing here?"]="Arcanista Vandril, o que os Renegados estão fazendo aqui?"
G["Arcanotron unit activated."]="Unidade Arcanotron ativada."
G["Arcanotron unit shield systems online."]="Sistemas de escudos da unidade Arcanotron ativados."
G["Arcanum? That sounds very familiar."]="Arcano? Isso parece muito familiar."
G["Arcanus, show them our endless power!"]="Arcanus, mostre a eles nosso poder infinito!"
G["Arch Druid Fandral Staghelm roused the druids and convinced the Circle of Ancients in Darkshore that it was time for our people to rebuild."]="Arch Druid Fandral Staghelm roused the druids and convinced the Circle of Ancients in Darkshore that it was time for our people to rebuild."
G["Arch Geomancer, I am ready for the ritual."]="Archigeomántico, estou pronto para o ritual."
G["Archaeology"]="Arqueologia"
G["Archaeology is the search for fact. Not truth."]="A arqueologia é a procurando de feitos, não da verdade."
G["Archbishop Landgren must know! Aaaaaagggghhhh.....!"]="Archbishop Landgren must know! Aaaaaagggghhhh.....!"
G["Archdruid."]="Arquidruida."
G["Archers at the ready!  Hold your fire!"]="Archers at the ready!  Hold your fire!"
G["Archers! Shoot down the airborne mantid!"]="Archers! Shoot down the airborne mantid!"
G["Archers, attack!"]="Archers, attack!"
G["Archers, attack! Make him burn!"]="Archers, attack! Make him burn!"
G["Archers, form ranks! On my mark!"]="Archers, form ranks! On my mark!"
G["Archibald da master of da crossbow. He da weapon master of da Undercity, located in da War Quarter."]="Archibald da mestre da besta. Ele é o mestre de armas da Undercity, localizado no War Quarter."
G["Archibald is da master of da crossbow. He da weapon master of da Undercity, located in da War Quarter."]="Archibald é o mestre da besta. Ele é o mestre de armas da Undercity, localizado no War Quarter."
G["Archibald is the master of the crossbow. He's the weapon master of the Undercity, located in the War Quarter."]="Archibald é o mestre da besta. Ele é o mestre de armas da Cidade Baixa, localizado no Bairro da Guerra."
G["Archibald who you look for.  He outside weapon merchant shop on inner ring of War Quarter."]="Archibald que você procura. Ele está do lado de fosse da loja de armas no anel interno do War Quarter."
G["Archimonde the Defiler."]="Archimondo Profanador."
G["Archimonde's use of the ered'ruin was brilliant. Their command of the dark energies is unparalleled."]="O modo como Arquimonde usou os Ered'ruin foi brilhante! Seu controle das energias sombrias é incomparável."
G["Archmage Alvareux once wrote a treatise exploring a fascinating theory.  He proposed the existence of an exact copy of Karazhan in a world other than our own and that both somehow shared the same space.\n\nHe went mad soon after.  A real pity."]="Archmage Alvareux once wrote a treatise exploring a fascinating theory.  He proposed the existence of an exact copy of Karazhan in a world other than our own and that both somehow shared the same space.\n\nHe went mad soon after.  A real pity."
G["Archmage Modera is taking a straightforward strategy - defeat the mogu by force. I believe that with further research, we may be able to discover the mogu's weaknesses."]="Archmage Modera is taking a straightforward strategy - defeat the mogu by force. I believe that with further research, we may be able to discover the mogu's weaknesses."
G["Archmage Pratt, an Arcane Reforger recently from Dalaran, is usually working with Lavinia Crowe, the local enchanter. They're both in the Apothecarium."]="Archmage Pratt, an Arcane Reforger recently from Dalaran, is usually working with Lavinia Crowe, the local enchanter. They're both in the Apothecarium."
G["Archmage Vargoth enstrusted me with his staff when he told me to flee from the blood elf attack on Violet Tower. I did as he told me, hoping to take refuge in the old draenei settlement of Arklon.\n\nThere was to be no respite. I had walked right into the leading edge of a Burning Legion force. The demons wrested the staff from me, but I managed to escape with my life.\n\nThough my master knows nothing of my failure, it still shames me."]="Archmage Vargoth enstrusted me with his staff when he told me to flee from the blood elf attack on Violet Tower. I did as he told me, hoping to take refuge in the old draenei settlement of Arklon.\n\nThere was to be no respite. I had walked right into the leading edge of a Burning Legion force. The demons wrested the staff from me, but I managed to escape with my life.\n\nThough my master knows nothing of my failure, it still shames me."
G["Archmage Xylem does not bargain with the likes of you, ruffian. There shall be no payment!"]="Archmage Xylem does not bargain with the likes of you, ruffian. There shall be no payment!"
G["Archmage Xylem? Where can I find this Archmage, Ergll?"]="O archimago Xylem? Onde posso encontrar a esse archimago, Erglh?"
G["Archonisus is no more. Alas, we are... we are too late...\n\nKil'jaeden is unleashed! The heroes of the world are now our only hope."]="Archonisus já não existe. Ay de nós! É... é tarde demais…\n\nKil'jaeden foi liberado! Os heróis do mundo são nossa única esperança agora."
G["Arconus is close. I can feel him. Take the northwest passage. He should be just up and around the corner. Be ready to battle!"]="Arconus is close. I can feel him. Take the northwest passage. He should be just up and around the corner. Be ready to battle!"
G["Arctanus, I am ready to lead one of your freezing surgers into battle."]="Arctanus, I am ready to lead one of your freezing surgers into battle."
