G["Are there any teeny tiny animals in need of my aid?\n\n<Mylune's eyes glisten at the thought.>\n\nI need to hug a bunny right now!"]="Are there any teeny tiny animals in need of my aid?\n\n<Mylune's eyes glisten at the thought.>\n\nI need to hug a bunny right now!"
G["Are there any weaknesses we can exploit? Any holes in the naga defenses?"]="Are there any weaknesses we can exploit? Any holes in the naga defenses?"
