G["Are those dock workers on break again?! I need those supplies!"]="Já estão descansando outra vez os trabalhadores do cais? Preciso esses suprimentos!"
G["Are those ingredients chopped up and cooked?  What's the hold up?!"]="Are those ingredients chopped up and cooked?  What's the hold up?!"
G["Are those refugees? What's going on over there? Do I hear fighting?"]="São refugiados? Que está passando? Oigo uma luta?"
G["Are those winter hyacinths? For me?"]="Isso são jacintos de inverno? Para mim?"
G["Are we done yet?"]="Temos terminado já?"
G["Are we finished yet?"]="Temos terminado já?"
G["Are we going to hide in our mountain and let those swill-peddlers have their little shindig without us?!"]="Are we going to hide in our mountain and let those swill-peddlers have their little shindig without us?!"
G["Are we going to let those soft-skinned, tail-less cowards cut down our forest and kill our clan brothers?"]="Are we going to let those soft-skinned, tail-less cowards cut down our forest and kill our clan brothers?"
G["Are we gonna let them make a bunch of monkeys out of us? NO!"]="Vamos deixar que se forren a costa nossa? NÃO!"
