G["Are ya sure, $g laddy : lassie;?  Once I trade ya, I ain't gonna trade it back."]="Está $gseguro rapaz: certa garota;? Depois que comerciemos, não a vai recuperar."
G["Are ye really askin' me where the Blacksmith is?  Have ye not heard of The Great Forge!?  All our best blacksmiths gather there to craft their weapons and armor!  \nIt's dead smack in the middle of Ironforge, and that's where you'll find one of our most brilliant blacksmiths, Bengus Deepforge."]="De verdade me está perguntando onde está a ferraria? Não tem ouvido falar da Grande Fundição? Nossos melhores ferreiros se reúnen ali para criar seus armas e armaduras! \n\nEstá logo no centro de Altaforja, ali encontrar a um dos nossos ferreiros mais brilhantes, Bengus Forjahonda."
G["Are ye sure that ye want to face the might of dragons?"]="Você quer mesmo encarar o poder dos dragões?"
G["Are ye sure, $g lad:lass;? Ye don't need another minute or two?"]="Estão seguros? Não precisam uns minutos mais?"
G["Are you Shao's friend? Is he still alive?"]="É $gel amigo: a amiga; de Shao? Ainda está vivo?"
G["Are you a $c?"]="Você é $gun: uma; $c?"
G["Are you a fighter? Can you teach me how you fight?"]="Are you a fighter? Can you teach me how you fight?"
G["Are you a grummle? Where's your backpack?"]="É $gun: uma; grúmel? Onde está seu mochila?"
G["Are you a mogu?"]="Você é mogu?"
G["Are you a sprite?"]="É um duende?"
G["Are you a student of the medical sciences?"]="Você é um estudante das ciências médicas?"
G["Are you a troll? Like from the storybooks?"]="É um troll? Ouvi que são maus."
G["Are you a troll?! I heard trolls are evil."]="É um troll? Ouvi que são maus."
G["Are you a yaungol? I heard yaungol are bad."]="É um yaungol? Ouvi que são maus."
G["Are you afraid of spiders? Some feel them crawling on their skin as they wander through the endless woods."]="Are you afraid of spiders? Some feel them crawling on their skin as they wander through the endless woods."
G["Are you afraid to fight?"]="Os da medo lutar?"
G["Are you alone because puppy-men killed your parents too?"]="Você está sozinho porque os filhotes também mataram seus pais?"
G["Are you an adventurer? We don't hear about many adventures around here except the stories Tzu tells us."]="Are you an adventurer? We don't hear about many adventures around here except the stories Tzu tells us."
G["Are you blind as well as insane?\n\nI am a ghost - a cruel reminder of a civilization that has long since ceased to exist - anchored to a land that I failed to protect.\n\nLong ago - ten-thousand years past - I was flesh and bone, just like you. I was prince of this land and a dragon rider, blessed by Ysera of the Dream."]="Are you blind as well as insane?\n\nI am a ghost - a cruel reminder of a civilization that has long since ceased to exist - anchored to a land that I failed to protect.\n\nLong ago - ten-thousand years past - I was flesh and bone, just like you. I was prince of this land and a dragon rider, blessed by Ysera of the Dream."
G["Are you blind youngling? Shayis is standing right outside."]="Are you blind youngling? Shayis is standing right outside."
G["Are you blind? They're right there. Kill them!"]="Está cego? Estão logo aí. Mátalos!"
G["Are you certain of that, demon hunter? Are you certain your will is your own?"]="Tem certeza disso, caçador de demônios? Você tem certeza que sua vontade lhe pertence?"
G["Are you certain you should be helping these mortals in their quest for the sword?"]="Está certo de que deveria estar ajudando a estes mortais no seu missão à procura da lâmina?"
G["Are you certain you want my help in the battle against Yogg-Saron?"]="Tem certeza de O que deseja minha ajuda na batalha contra Yogg-Saron?"
G["Are you certain you wish to start gaining experience again?"]="Certo que que voltar a ganhar experiência novamente?"
G["Are you certain you wish to stop gaining experience?"]="Certo que que deixar de ganhar experiência?"
G["Are you certain?\n\nThere is no turning back once I wipe the knowledge of the talents you have learned from your mind."]="Está $gseguro: certa;?\n\nDepois que tenha eliminado o conhecimento dos talentos do seu mente, não haverá volta por trás."
G["Are you certain? The trainers would love to meet an experienced $r $c like you."]="Está $gseguro: certa;? aos instrutores lhes encantaría conhecer a $gun: uma; $r $c com experiência como você."
G["Are you certain? This is a dangerous place, and our initial researchers have not yet returned from their expedition. If we disable the dampening field, we will leave until the ruins are safely secured, and cannot reactivate the devices.\n\nI ask again: Are you certain?"]="Are you certain? This is a dangerous place, and our initial researchers have not yet returned from their expedition. If we disable the dampening field, we will leave until the ruins are safely secured, and cannot reactivate the devices.\n\nI ask again: Are you certain?"
G["Are you certain? You are filled with doubts and fears, young Prince."]="Are you certain? You are filled with doubts and fears, young Prince."
G["Are you challenging me, $g brother:sister;?"]="Me está retando, $ghermano: irmã;?"
G["Are you coming?"]="Veio?"
G["Are you crazy? They'll see you if you go flying around in there!"]="Are you crazy? They'll see you if you go flying around in there!"
G["Are you crazy? You're about to blow us sky high! I'll take care of this wreck once everything else is finished."]="Are you crazy? You're about to blow us sky high! I'll take care of this wreck once everything else is finished."
G["Are you daft? Did you miss the BONY SKELETAL CREATURES littering the landscape on your way over here?\n\n<Rohan sighs.>\n\nIf you're the outdoor type, you'll find skeletal creatures all over both the Western and Eastern Plaguelands. Trust me, you can't miss 'em - they certainly won't miss you if they get the chance.\n\nIf you're a dungeon type, Stratholme and Scholomance are definitely the place to be for bone fragments."]="Are you daft? Did you miss the BONY SKELETAL CREATURES littering the landscape on your way over here?\n\n<Rohan sighs.>\n\nIf you're the outdoor type, you'll find skeletal creatures all over both the Western and Eastern Plaguelands. Trust me, you can't miss 'em - they certainly won't miss you if they get the chance.\n\nIf you're a dungeon type, Stratholme and Scholomance are definitely the place to be for bone fragments."
G["Are you daft? Who else would I be talking about? Yes, the girl - Mistress Mar'alith. Anyhow, she was back and not in too good of a mood. That's when the demands started flowing."]="É $gtonto: tonta;? De quem ia a estar falando se não? Sim, a garota, a mestra Mar'alith. Em qualquer atenção, ela estava de volta e não para de muito bom humor. E então começaram as exigências."
G["Are you deaf? We aren't allowing anybody in the brewery right now."]="Are you deaf? We aren't allowing anybody in the brewery right now."
G["Are you deaf?! I'll be there when Captain Adams is flogging you for holding up the Alliance's advance!"]="Are you deaf?! I'll be there when Captain Adams is flogging you for holding up the Alliance's advance!"
G["Are you dumb? I'm a freaking bear. Back off, punk. (Temp text)"]="É tonto? Sou um maldito urso. Trás, bobo."
G["Are you eating enough, $r? Please remember to take care of yourself."]="Are you eating enough, $r? Please remember to take care of yourself."
G["Are you enjoying Pilgrim's Bounty, $n?  Let me know if you need help finding anything."]="Está aproveitando da Generosidade do Peregrino, $n? Avise-me se você precisa que te ajuda encontrar algo."
G["Are you eyeing my cat?"]="Está olhando a meu gato?"
G["Are you familiar with the War of the Ancients, $n? That is what we call the period of time 10,000 years ago, when the demons of the Burning Legion first breached the realm of Azeroth and attempted to devour this entire world as they have countless others. The ancient capital of Azshara, a city that once dominated this landscape, was ground zero for the invasion. The ancient wreckage you'll find scattered throughout the area stands in broken testament to the egotism of our forebears."]="Are you familiar with the War of the Ancients, $n? That is what we call the period of time 10,000 years ago, when the demons of the Burning Legion first breached the realm of Azeroth and attempted to devour this entire world as they have countless others. The ancient capital of Azshara, a city that once dominated this landscape, was ground zero for the invasion. The ancient wreckage you'll find scattered throughout the area stands in broken testament to the egotism of our forebears."
G["Are you familiar with the late dragon Rheastrasza? A little off, that one. She often lurked about the Badlands in the form of a mortal goblin.\n\nRheastrasza came up with a scheme to steal and purify a black dragon egg, severing its tie with the black dragonflight and the corrupted Earth Warder, Deathwing."]="Are you familiar with the late dragon Rheastrasza? A little off, that one. She often lurked about the Badlands in the form of a mortal goblin.\n\nRheastrasza came up with a scheme to steal and purify a black dragon egg, severing its tie with the black dragonflight and the corrupted Earth Warder, Deathwing."
G["Are you fascinated by the wonders of metallurgy? The artistry of smelting? The beauty of mixing metals and alloys?"]="Are you fascinated by the wonders of metallurgy? The artistry of smelting? The beauty of mixing metals and alloys?"
G["Are you finding everything well, $n?"]="Está tudo ao seu gusto, $n?"
G["Are you finding everything you need at the Temple?"]="Tem tudo o que precisa no templo?"
G["Are you friends with Admiral Taylor? If so, then I must test your strength in battle later."]="Seus amigos estão com o almirante Taylor? Se é assim, então devo colocar a prova sua força no combate mais tarde."
G["Are you from Kun-Lai?"]="Veio de Kun-Lai?"
G["Are you from beyond the wall?"]="Veio de além da muralha?"
G["Are you from the Turtle?"]="Veio da Tartaruga?"
