G["Are you here to give me my break? It feels like I've been working forever!"]="Are you here to give me my break? It feels like I've been working forever!"
G["Are you here to help Ironforge, or just gawk at me all day?"]="Você está aqui para ajudar Ironforge, ou apenas ficar de boca aberta o dia tudo?"
G["Are you here to help the Dragonmaw reclaim our freedom?\n\nSpeak with Zaela - she's coordinating our resistance!"]="Are you here to help the Dragonmaw reclaim our freedom?\n\nSpeak with Zaela - she's coordinating our resistance!"
G["Are you here to help the cause? Mount Hyjal burns!"]="Você está aqui para ajudar a causa? O Monte Hyjal queima!"
G["Are you here to help with the delivery? Miran's just about ready."]="Are you here to help with the delivery? Miran's just about ready."
G["Are you here to help, $c? This valley serves as a natural chokepoint. If we can strangle this supply line, we buy our companions at the World Tree time to mount a counter-attack."]="Are you here to help, $c? This valley serves as a natural chokepoint. If we can strangle this supply line, we buy our companions at the World Tree time to mount a counter-attack."
G["Are you here to help?"]="Vocês têm vindo a ajudar?"
G["Are you here to lead a tour or gawk at us?  Be gone."]="Você está aqui para liderar uma turnê ou ficar de boca aberta? Vá embora."
G["Are you here to lead the tour?"]="Você está aqui para liderar a turnê?"
G["Are you here to prove yourself to the Lich King as well?\n\nIt's kind of archaic, don't you think? Having to fight and survive?"]="Are you here to prove yourself to the Lich King as well?\n\nIt's kind of archaic, don't you think? Having to fight and survive?"
G["Are you here to relieve me? I'm certain it's almost time. Well, if you want to relieve me anyway, let me know. I could use a drink or three."]="Você está aqui para me aliviar? Estou certo de que está quase na hora. Bem, se você quiser me aliviar de qualquer maneira, me avise. Eu poderia pegar uma bebida ou três."
G["Are you here to save us, $c?"]="Are you here to save us, $c?"
G["Are you here to see the Jade Serpent?"]="Tem vindo a ver o dragão de jade?"
G["Are you here to train in Archaeology?"]="Você está aqui para treinar em Arqueologia?"
G["Are you here to train, hunter?"]="Você está aqui para treinar, caçador?"
G["Are you hiding in this cloud?"]="Te escondes nesta nuvem?"
G["Are you hungry?  I'm hungry.  I just can't stand the thought of cured ham steak from Thultash again.  If only we could get some of that succulent roasted quail!"]="Are you hungry?  I'm hungry.  I just can't stand the thought of cured ham steak from Thultash again.  If only we could get some of that succulent roasted quail!"
G["Are you hurt? Do you need something?"]="Te têm ferido? Precisa algo?"
G["Are you insinuating that you sell devices which hold sway over others' minds? That is a very dangerous claim..."]="Are you insinuating that you sell devices which hold sway over others' minds? That is a very dangerous claim..."
G["Are you insulting our citizens?"]="Are you insulting our citizens?"
G["Are you interested in bell and gong lore?  Not as many young ones are willing to take such a fascinating intellectual journey these days."]="Are you interested in bell and gong lore?  Not as many young ones are willing to take such a fascinating intellectual journey these days."
G["Are you interested in exploring one of these dungeons?"]="Você está interessado em explorar uma dessas masmorras?"
G["Are you interested in joining our caravan?  We're headed to Light's Hope Chapel."]="Are you interested in joining our caravan?  We're headed to Light's Hope Chapel."
G["Are you interested in learning the intricacies of Jewelcrafting?"]="Você está interessado em aprender os meandros da joalheria?"
G["Are you interested in making some money?"]="Você está interessado em ganhar dinheiro?"
G["Are you joking?  I'm a Scryer, I always watch what I say.  More enemies than allies in this city, it seems."]="Está de broma? Sou Arúspice. Sempre tenho cuidado com o que digo. pelo visto há mais inimigos que aliados nesta cidade."
G["Are you kidding me? Look at all this crap! There's like a million wires. I'm a three wire kind of guy..."]="Me tomas o cabelo? Olhe esta porquería! Tem como um milhão de cables. Eu sou um tipo de três cables como verdadeiro desafio..."
G["Are you kidding me? You must be kidding me! Either that or you think I'm a clown here to amuse you. Is that what you think? That I'm a clown? Huh, is it! You think I'm a clown don't you!"]="Você está brincando comigo? Você deve estar brincando comigo! Ou isso ou você acha que sou um palhaço aqui para divertir você. É isso que você acha? Que eu sou um palhaço? Huh, é isso! Você acha que eu sou um palhaço, não é?"
G["Are you leaving the camp?\nThe August Celestials have requested that we not push our forces any further into the island, so we're staying here to secure this landing point.\nWatch yourself out there. The enemy has taken an interest in this place, too. Their camp is on the other end of the beach, and well-guarded."]="Are you leaving the camp?\nThe August Celestials have requested that we not push our forces any further into the island, so we're staying here to secure this landing point.\nWatch yourself out there. The enemy has taken an interest in this place, too. Their camp is on the other end of the beach, and well-guarded."
G["Are you lecturing me? You're what - two years old?"]="Você quer me dar uma lição? Você tem o quê? Dois anos?"
G["Are you listening to me, turtle?"]="Are you listening to me, turtle?"
G["Are you lookin' to hear a secret about where to fish?"]="Que que te cuente um segredo sobre onde pescar?"
G["Are you looking at me? Yes, look at me. You should be looking at me. Are you? Looking at me? Good."]="Are you looking at me? Yes, look at me. You should be looking at me. Are you? Looking at me? Good."
G["Are you looking for reagents or poison supplies? If so, you've come to the right place!"]="Você está procurando reagentes ou suprimentos para veneno? Se assim for, você veio ao lugar certo!"
G["Are you looking for some food and drink? If so, then Mifan in summer's rest has a fantastic selection.\n\nI will mark the location on your map."]="Está procurando comida e bebida? Se é assim, Mifan tem logo o que precisa em Repouso Estival.\n\nTe marcarei seu localização no mapa."
G["Are you looking for some food and drink? If so, then the Sway Dish Chef in the inn has exactly what you're looking for.\n\nI will mark the location on your map."]="Está procurando comida e bebida? Se é assim, o chef Sue Ko da estalagem tem logo o que precisa.\n\nTe marcarei seu localização no mapa."
G["Are you lost? Most of the town's vendors are situated near the center of town."]="Você está perdido? A maioria dos vendedores da cidade está situada perto do centro da cidade."
G["Are you mad? Do you know what manner of beast inhabit that place? The worst that can happen is that we'll have to scoop up your remains with a shovel. We've lost some good dwarves to those awful monsters.\n\nSo the answer is no. If you're bent on getting to the Searing Gorge, you'll have to find another way."]="Are you mad? Do you know what manner of beast inhabit that place? The worst that can happen is that we'll have to scoop up your remains with a shovel. We've lost some good dwarves to those awful monsters.\n\nSo the answer is no. If you're bent on getting to the Searing Gorge, you'll have to find another way."
G["Are you mad? Look around you, mortal. Do you not see that you stand upon sundered earth? Leave this place lest you suffer as my people and I have..."]="Você está louco? Olhe ao seu redor, mortal. Você não vê que está em terra fragmentada? Deixe este lugar para que você não sofra como meu povo e eu tenho..."
