G["Are you one of the good worgen, $g mister:ma'am;?  Did you see Cynthia hiding in the sheds outside?"]="Are you one of the good worgen, $g mister:ma'am;?  Did you see Cynthia hiding in the sheds outside?"
G["Are you part of the rescue team? Are we saved?"]="Are you part of the rescue team? Are we saved?"
