G["Are you really surprised? Is it hard to believe that the power of an Old God could reach even inside the Dream? It is true - Eranikus, Tyrant of the Dream, wages a battle against us all. The Nightmare follows in his wake of destruction."]="De verdade te surpreende? É tão difícil de acreditar que o poder de um deus antigo pudesse entrar no Sonho? Pois assim é. Erânicos, Tirano do Sonho, está confrontado com todos nós. A Pesadelos continue com o seu estela de destruição."
G["Are you reporting for duty, $c? All of the war materiel for both the Horde and the Alliance is completed and being shipped to Silithus as we speak. It should all arrive in less than $2113w days. I hope that someone has found the different pieces of the Scepter of the Shifting Sands and put them all together."]="Are you reporting for duty, $c? All of the war materiel for both the Horde and the Alliance is completed and being shipped to Silithus as we speak. It should all arrive in less than $2113w days. I hope that someone has found the different pieces of the Scepter of the Shifting Sands and put them all together."
G["Are you reporting for duty, $c? All of the war materiel for both the Horde and the Alliance is completed and being shipped to Silithus as we speak. It should all arrive in less than a day. I hope that someone has found the different pieces of the Scepter of the Shifting Sands and put them all together."]="Are you reporting for duty, $c? All of the war materiel for both the Horde and the Alliance is completed and being shipped to Silithus as we speak. It should all arrive in less than a day. I hope that someone has found the different pieces of the Scepter of the Shifting Sands and put them all together."
