G["Are you surprised to see me here? Everyone needs clean laundry, and what better way to do it than with your own water elemental?\n\nSimply bring your laundry, pay a nominal fee, and before you know it, everything will be fresh and clean!"]="Are you surprised to see me here? Everyone needs clean laundry, and what better way to do it than with your own water elemental?\n\nSimply bring your laundry, pay a nominal fee, and before you know it, everything will be fresh and clean!"
