G["Arg! My archers should have stopped you! Sentinels! Now!"]="Arg! My archers should have stopped you! Sentinels! Now!"
G["Argent Dawn! We go to gather more aid!  Fight on, brothers and sisters.  And know that you will not long fight alone!"]="Argent Dawn! We go to gather more aid!  Fight on, brothers and sisters.  And know that you will not long fight alone!"
G["Argghhhh!"]="Aaaah!"
G["Argh!"]="Argh!"
G["Argh!  I will shred your soul and grind it to dust!"]="Argh!  I will shred your soul and grind it to dust!"
G["Argh! What was that? It's not supposed to work like this!"]="Argg! Que foi isso? Não tendría que funcionar assim!"
G["Argh! You're hopeless!"]="Aagh! É um inútil!"
G["Argh!! It stings!"]="Aj! Eskuece!"
G["Argh, I need help here!"]="Aah, preciso ajuda!"
G["Argh, I'm pinned! Watch yourselves!"]="Argh, I'm pinned! Watch yourselves!"
G["Argh, just now getting number 48. This is getting tough."]="Argh, acabo de chegar ao número 48. Isto começa a ficar difícil."
G["Argh, the pain. Will it ever leave me?"]="Argh, o sofrimento. Me abandonará alguma vez?"
G["Argh. They told me those crystals would work properly!"]="Argh. They told me those crystals would work properly!"
G["Argh... The pain... The pain is almost as unbearable as the lashings I received in grammar school when I was but a child."]="Argh... The pain... The pain is almost as unbearable as the lashings I received in grammar school when I was but a child."
G["Argh... please... take care... of Speedy!"]="Augghhh... Toma conta... do Ligeirinho!"
G["Argh... what... is..."]="Argh... que... é..."
G["Argus is the resident blacksmith of Goldshire.  I'm sure he could teach you the Blacksmith's profession."]="Argus é o ferreiro residente de Goldshire. Tenho certeza que ele poderia lhe ensinar a profissão do ferreiro."
G["Aright *hic*... Say, you look familiar *hic*. Have I ever told you about the time me and Windsor fought off thir, er... a thous... a million orcs?\n\nOh settle down friend, this is a good one!"]="Aright *hic*... Say, you look familiar *hic*. Have I ever told you about the time me and Windsor fought off thir, er... a thous... a million orcs?\n\nOh settle down friend, this is a good one!"
G["Aright, $r, just keep us safe from harm while we work. We'll pay you when we return."]="De acordo, $r, cuídate do perigo enquanto trabalhamos. Te pagaremos quando voltemos."
G["Aright, listen up! Form a circle around me and move out!"]="Aright, listen up! Form a circle around me and move out!"
G["Arise and serve your eternal master!"]="Arise and serve your eternal master!"
G["Arise from the earth, my brothers!"]="Levantem-se da terra, irmãos meus!"
G["Arise minions.  Do not let them pass."]="Levantem-se, lacaios. Que não pasen."
G["Arise my, uh... what shall I call you? How about 'multi-bot'? Arise, my multi-bot!"]="Levántate meu, eh... Como deveria chamar você? Que tal multi robô?"
G["Arise, Melt!"]="Em pé e largo!"
G["Arise, Nalak! Protect our beloved emperor."]="Arise, Nalak! Protect our beloved emperor."
G["Arise, and accept my gift."]="Levántate e aceitar meu presente."
G["Arise, and exult in your pure form!"]="Arise, and exult in your pure form!"
G["Arise, brothers of the earth! Watch as Erathius destroys the mortals!"]="Arise, brothers of the earth! Watch as Erathius destroys the mortals!"
G["Arise, friend. We have no time to lick our wounds!"]="Arise, friend. We have no time to lick our wounds!"
G["Arise, my champion!"]="Levántate, meu campeão!"
G["Arise, servants of fire, consume their flesh!"]="Arise, servants of fire, consume their flesh!"
G["Arise, soldiers of the iron crucible! The Maker's will be done!"]="Arise, soldiers of the iron crucible! The Maker's will be done!"
G["Arm the cannons! Ready...aim...fire!"]="Arm the cannons! Ready...aim...fire!"
G["Armand Cromwell always on dock in Magic Quarter.  Fish in green goo taste extra good.  You try."]="Armand Cromwell sempre na doca no Magic Quarter. Os peixes com gosma verde têm um gosto extra bom. Você tenta."
G["Armed and ready."]="Armados e preparados."
G["Armies of iron will smother the world!"]="Armies of iron will smother the world!"
G["Armies of the Scourge, hear my call! The scarlet apocalypse has begun! Tear this land asunder and leave only death in your wake!"]="Armies of the Scourge, hear my call! The scarlet apocalypse has begun! Tear this land asunder and leave only death in your wake!"
G["Armies of the depths, wash over our enemies as a tide of death!"]="Armies of the depths, wash over our enemies as a tide of death!"
G["Arming"]="Armando"
G["Arming the wards at the sanctum will help us secure it faster.  We don't want any Wretched getting in our way when we unleash a full scale attack on the Legion and Kael.\n\nWe are $3244w percent done with our goal."]="Arming the wards at the sanctum will help us secure it faster.  We don't want any Wretched getting in our way when we unleash a full scale attack on the Legion and Kael.\n\nWe are $3244w percent done with our goal."
G["Armor"]="Armadura"
G["Armor like the kind you make could stop even the sharpest axe. I'm impressed $n, that doesn't happen often. Seek out an Orc named Shayis Steelfury, she makes the best armor outside of that cursed Dwarven stronghold."]="Armor like the kind you make could stop even the sharpest axe. I'm impressed $n, that doesn't happen often. Seek out an Orc named Shayis Steelfury, she makes the best armor outside of that cursed Dwarven stronghold."
G["Armor unit malfunction. System offloading."]="Armor unit malfunction. System offloading."
G["Armor, weapons, whatever you may need, you will find at the supply depot behind me. Go now."]="Qualquer coisa que necesites, já sejam armas ou armaduras, a encontrar no depositar de suprimentos a meus costas. Agora vá embora."
G["Arms and armor repaired!"]="Reparo armas e armaduras!"
G["Arms and legs are in short supply! Thanks for your contribution!"]="Arms and legs are in short supply! Thanks for your contribution!"
G["Arms ready!  Here they come!  HERE THEY COME!!!"]="Armas preparadas! Aí vêm! AÍ VÊM!"
G["Arnok makes good bandages.  Find him at the Survival of the Fittest hut on the shore of the lake next to Spirit Lodge in the Valley of Spirits.  It's above and to the west of the Valley of Strength."]="Arnok faz boas bandagens. Encontre-o na cabana Survival of the Fittest, na margem do lago, ao lado de Spirit Lodge, no Valley of Spirits. Está acima e a oeste do vale da força."
G["Around this reindeer's neck is a tag with the Smokywood Pastures logo on it and a name - \"Metzen\".\n\nMetzen looks at you with sad, forlorn eyes.  It is almost as if the reindeer has been immobilized by some unseen force."]="Around this reindeer's neck is a tag with the Smokywood Pastures logo on it and a name - \"Metzen\".\n\nMetzen looks at you with sad, forlorn eyes.  It is almost as if the reindeer has been immobilized by some unseen force."
G["Arr!"]="Arr!"
G["Arr!   There be nothin I like to see better than folks fightin to the death in the arena.   If you be here at the right time maybe you can be one of them!"]="Arr! Não há nada que eu goste de ver melhor do que pessoas lutando até a morte na arena. Se você está aqui na hora certa, talvez possa ser um deles!"
G["Arr!  Get back here, ye swill-swallowin' swabbie!"]="Arr!  Get back here, ye swill-swallowin' swabbie!"
G["Arrggghhhhh!"]="Aaaaaarrggghh!"
G["Arrggh, outsiders - this is not your realm!"]="Arrggh, invasores... este não é seu reino!"
G["Arrghhhhh!"]="Arrghhhhh!"
G["Arrite then! Follow me!"]="Vamos, então! Siga-me!"
G["Arrite! Fuses exposed! Now which one ta break? Red? Or blue...?"]="Arrite! Fuses exposed! Now which one ta break? Red? Or blue...?"
G["Arrite, $r.\n\nEverything looks ta be in its proper place."]="Vale, $r.\n\nParece que tudo está onde precisa estar."
G["Arrite, here goes nuthin'!"]="Bom, vamos além!"
G["Arrite, now... Let's see here."]="Vale, eh... Vamos ver que há aqui."
G["Arrite, troll. Down the hatch!"]="Arrite, troll. Down the hatch!"
G["Arrogant little creatures, to challenge powers you do not yet understand."]="Pequenas criaturas arrogantes, olhe que retar a poderes que ainda não conhecem."
G["Arrogant."]="Arrogante."
G["Arrr, Ed! She definitely be seaworthy!"]="Ar, Ed! Sim senhor! Por todos os bares!... Quícir, por todos os mares..."
G["Arrr, Me Hearties!   I be havin' some extra Treasure that I be givin' away at the Gurubashi Arena!  All ye need do to collect it is open the chest I leave on the arena floor!"]="Arr, companheiros! Eu ter algum tesouros extra que dar na Arena Gurubashi! Vocês somente ter que abrir o cofre que eu deixar no chão da arena!"
G["Arrrgh!"]="Arrrgh!"
G["Arrrgh! This isn't right!"]="Ajjjjj! Isto não está bem!"
G["Arrrrggggggggggh!!!!"]="Arrrrggggggggggh!!!"
G["Arrrrggggghhh!"]="Arrrrggggghhh!"
G["Arrrrrrgh!"]="Arrrrrrgh!"
G["Arrrrrrrrrrrr... wikkets!"]="Arrrrrrrrrrrr... makakus!"
G["Arthas and Muradin have been gone a long time. I hope they aren't in danger."]="Arthas e Muradin se foram há muito tempo. Espero que não estejam em perigo."
G["Arthas clearly failed when he created his death knights.  You are still weak."]="É evidente que Arthas fracasó ao criar aos seus cavaleiros da Morte. Ainda é fraco."
G["Arthas gave the order to cull Stratholme, killing every single human within its walls.\n\nHe discovered evidence that the Scourge had infected the city with their insidious plague, and the disease doesn't just kill people.\n\nThose who die to this plague rise up as mindless zombies, further fueling the Scourge's war machine."]="Arthas gave the order to cull Stratholme, killing every single human within its walls.\n\nHe discovered evidence that the Scourge had infected the city with their insidious plague, and the disease doesn't just kill people.\n\nThose who die to this plague rise up as mindless zombies, further fueling the Scourge's war machine."
G["Arthas is here? Maybe I..."]="Arthas está aqui? Talvez possa..."
G["Arthas is prepared to offer you power beyond your imagination.  The puny army you lead here would pale in comparison to the phalanxes at your command if you returned to the Scourge's embrace."]="Arthas is prepared to offer you power beyond your imagination.  The puny army you lead here would pale in comparison to the phalanxes at your command if you returned to the Scourge's embrace."
G["Arthas once mustered strength... of the very same sort... perhaps his is the path that you will follow."]="Há tempo, Arthas mostró força... do mesmo tipo... talvez você continue seu caminho."
G["Arthas save us - we're doomed!"]="Arthas sálvanos. Estamos perdidos!"
G["Arthas shattered our forces and took the most powerful of us into his service as the San'layn."]="Arthas destruyó nossas forças e transformou aos mais fortes de nós nos San'layn."
G["Arthas thinks a few of his undead bugs are going to send us running back to the Eastern Kingdoms... he's got another thing coming."]="Arthas acha que algum dos seus insetos mortos-vivos vão nos enviar de volta aos Reinos do Leste... ele tem outra coisa por vir."
G["Arthas was once a human prince.  The army he led into Northrend suffered a horrible fate.\n\nMy brother, Thassarian, was a part of that army."]="Arthas was once a human prince.  The army he led into Northrend suffered a horrible fate.\n\nMy brother, Thassarian, was a part of that army."
G["Arthas! You are hopelessly outnumbered! Lay down Frostmourne and I will grant you a just death."]="Arthas! You are hopelessly outnumbered! Lay down Frostmourne and I will grant you a just death."
G["Arthas! You can't just--"]="Arthas! Você não pode..."
G["Arthas's weakness is his pride. That weakness only grows as his power does. The Ebon Blade will have its chance to strike at the once-prince - of that I have no doubt."]="A fraqueza de Arthas é seu orgulho. Essa fraqueza só cresce como seu poder. A Ebon Blade terá a chance de atacar o outrora príncipe - disso não tenho dúvida."
G["Arthas... I spit on Arthas."]="Arthas... escupo sobre Arthas."
G["Arthas... even saying his name makes my body quiver in rage."]="Arthas... Somente dizer seu nome me há temblar de raiva."
G["Arthur Moore in Rogues' Quarter inner ring is one who teach leatherworking."]="Arthur Moore, no anel interno de Rogues 'Quarter, é quem ensina couro."
G["Arthur Moore is the leatherworker. He tends the trainees over in the Rogues' Quarter, on the inner ring."]="Arthur Moore é o marceneiro. Ele cuida dos estagiários no Bairro dos Ladinos, no ringue interno."
G["Artillery will scorch the ground, leaving nothing!"]="Artillery will scorch the ground, leaving nothing!"
G["Artists need to be reminded to eat once and a while."]="De vez em quando é preciso lembrar aos artistas que têm que comer."
G["Artruis is shielded. You must choose your side quickly to break his spell."]="Artruis is shielded. You must choose your side quickly to break his spell."
G["Arzule will have this land in the name of our master!"]="Esta terra será de Arzule em nome de nosso mestre!"
G["As %s falls, the altar set into the floor on his balcony begins to glow faintly."]="As %s falls, the altar set into the floor on his balcony begins to glow faintly."
G["As Anub'arak commands!"]="Como Anub'arak ordena!"
G["As Azeroth has fought the legion and survived, you have faced the darkness within yourself and controlled it."]="Assim como Azeroth lutou contra a legião e sobreviveu, você enfrentou as trevas dentro de você e as dominou."
G["As Druids, we are tasked with protecting the balance of nature. My life's work has gone against this. In my folly, I have sewn chaos, and this deviant crop must be reaped before it spreads further."]="As Druids, we are tasked with protecting the balance of nature. My life's work has gone against this. In my folly, I have sewn chaos, and this deviant crop must be reaped before it spreads further."
G["As I always say - Victory to the bold!"]="Como sozinho dizer: a vitória é dos corajosos!"
G["As I am the strongest wind, it shall be I that tears the invaders apart!"]="Eu sou o vento mais forte, assim que serei eu quem destroce aos invasores!"
G["As I expected. You are not yet skilled enough to defeat me."]="Como eu esperava. Você não tem habilidade suficiente para me derrotar ainda."
G["As I expected..."]="Tal e como esperava..."
G["As I live and breathe - an actual troll! You look just as the stories describe. You've taught the Hozen quite the lesson."]="As I live and breathe - an actual troll! You look just as the stories describe. You've taught the Hozen quite the lesson."
G["As I live and breathe! \"Little\" Arator? Is that you?"]="Por minha vida e meu fôlego! \"Pequeno\" Arator? É você?"
G["As I purify these waters, the servants of filth will surely be stirred. Beware!"]="As I purify these waters, the servants of filth will surely be stirred. Beware!"
G["As I said, the cipher was found by Illidan when he took over the Black Temple. He divided the tome into three parts and charged their care to his minions.\n\nMy boys... My boys are grown now. When I got word of what Illidan had done with the cipher, I sent my boys to recover the pieces.\n\nYou must find my boys, $n. You must find them and recover the Cipher of Damnation."]="As I said, the cipher was found by Illidan when he took over the Black Temple. He divided the tome into three parts and charged their care to his minions.\n\nMy boys... My boys are grown now. When I got word of what Illidan had done with the cipher, I sent my boys to recover the pieces.\n\nYou must find my boys, $n. You must find them and recover the Cipher of Damnation."
G["As I said, we lost track of him, but this is something that I'm sure you will be able to figure out for me. My suspicion is that he's down there somewhere, but my spies that have returned haven't been able to place him anywhere on the island.\n\nThe Forsaken at Venomspite did a good job of sabotaging New Hearthglen, but the Onslaught forces that are present down there are the battle-hardened remnant from that place. Unfortunately, they picked up better equipment along the way, as well as gryphons taken from fools somewhere.\n\nWhat I'm trying to say is that this isn't going to be a stroll in the countryside, $n, even for you."]="As I said, we lost track of him, but this is something that I'm sure you will be able to figure out for me. My suspicion is that he's down there somewhere, but my spies that have returned haven't been able to place him anywhere on the island.\n\nThe Forsaken at Venomspite did a good job of sabotaging New Hearthglen, but the Onslaught forces that are present down there are the battle-hardened remnant from that place. Unfortunately, they picked up better equipment along the way, as well as gryphons taken from fools somewhere.\n\nWhat I'm trying to say is that this isn't going to be a stroll in the countryside, $n, even for you."
G["As I shall consume your flesh, so too shall the Burning Legion consume your people!"]="A Legião Ardente consumirá ao seu gente como eu consumirei seu carne!"
G["As I suspected. Thank you, Ogos. $p - I will meet you in the catacombs."]="As I suspected. Thank you, Ogos. $p - I will meet you in the catacombs."
G["As I understand it dear, everything has been gathered and the final materiel is being assembled and shipped off to Cenarion Hold. The last of it should arrive in less than $2113w days. Once our equipment and forces are all there, the bearer of the Scepter of the Shifting Sands can ring the gong near Ahn'Qiraj to open the gates. Then the war will begin."]="Pelo que entendi, querida, tudo foi reuniu e o materiais fim está sendo montado e enviado para o Cenarion Hold. O último deve chegar em menos de $2113w dias. Quando todos os nossos equipamentos e forças estiverem lá, o portador do Cetro das Areias Mutáveis pode tocar o gongo perto de Ahn'Qiraj para abrir os portões. Então a guerra começará."
G["As I understand it dear, everything has been gathered and the final materiel is being assembled and shipped off to Cenarion Hold. The last of it should arrive in less than a day. Once our equipment and forces are all there, the bearer of the Scepter of the Shifting Sands can ring the gong near Ahn'Qiraj to open the gates. Then the war will begin."]="As I understand it dear, everything has been gathered and the final materiel is being assembled and shipped off to Cenarion Hold. The last of it should arrive in less than a day. Once our equipment and forces are all there, the bearer of the Scepter of the Shifting Sands can ring the gong near Ahn'Qiraj to open the gates. Then the war will begin."
G["As I warned you before, dragons are known for their deadly attacks."]="Eu avisei: dragões só atacam pra matar."
G["As I was saying, I held onto that scepter shard for a good five-hundred years and it was nothing but trouble. It attracted all kinds of attention - the wrong kind of attention. I want to be left alone to my studies not babysit some would be hero's ticket to glory. So... I gave it to the fish."]="Como eu estava dizendo, eu segurei aquele fragmento de cetro por bons quinhentos anos e não foi nada além de problemas. Atraiu todos os tipos de atenção - o tipo errado de atenção. Eu quero ser deixado sozinho para os meus estudos e não pegar conta de algum, seria a passagem do herói para a glória. Então... eu dei para o peixe."
G["As I was saying, what we saw out there defied explanation.\n\nMy people were nowhere to be found, but in their place was a veritable army of robots and androids going about their business!\n\nThe droids all looked like gnomes and they said that they'd been expecting us. In fact, in their own strange way, they acted like they knew us. We were surrounded and quickly taken to the top of the pumping station.\n\nThat's where we saw their leader and what he was doing to the surviving gnomes!"]="As I was saying, what we saw out there defied explanation.\n\nMy people were nowhere to be found, but in their place was a veritable army of robots and androids going about their business!\n\nThe droids all looked like gnomes and they said that they'd been expecting us. In fact, in their own strange way, they acted like they knew us. We were surrounded and quickly taken to the top of the pumping station.\n\nThat's where we saw their leader and what he was doing to the surviving gnomes!"
G["As Quel'Serrar was forged by the dragons and given to the kaldorei, its twin, Quel'Delar, was given to my people."]="As Quel'Serrar was forged by the dragons and given to the kaldorei, its twin, Quel'Delar, was given to my people."
G["As Tharon'ja predicted!"]="Tal e como o predijo Tharon'ja!"
G["As Waterspeaker, I performed many rituals. There is one, though, that I have never performed - to purify mental corruption.\nIt is an ancient ritual, one which we have not needed since days of legend, when Shaohao walked Pandaria.\nI fear we need it now..."]="As Waterspeaker, I performed many rituals. There is one, though, that I have never performed - to purify mental corruption.\nIt is an ancient ritual, one which we have not needed since days of legend, when Shaohao walked Pandaria.\nI fear we need it now..."
G["As a culture we believe in letting nothing go to waste.  When we are forced to slay a creature we take what we can to make sure its sacrifice was not in vain.  \nIf you wish to learn the proper way to take the skin of a slain beast, then seek out Eladriel in the Craftsmen's Terrace."]="As a culture we believe in letting nothing go to waste.  When we are forced to slay a creature we take what we can to make sure its sacrifice was not in vain.  \nIf you wish to learn the proper way to take the skin of a slain beast, then seek out Eladriel in the Craftsmen's Terrace."
G["As a final act of revenge, Baron Geddon has made you a living bomb!  Move away from your allies!"]="Como acto fim de vingança, o barão Geddon você convertido em uma bomba com patas! Afaste-se dos seus aliados!"
G["As a mage, you are one of a select group that can conjure a portal to transport you back to this very place.  I can teach you if you are ready."]="Como mago, você faz parte de um grupo seleto que pode conjurar um portal para transportá-o de volta a esse mesmo lugar. Eu posso ensinar se você estiver pronto."
G["As a mage, you are one of a select group that can conjure a portal to transport you back to this very place.  I can teach you if you are ready.\n\nAnd remember that you can always use the crystal behind me to teleport down to the ruins beneath Dalaran in Crystalsong Forest."]="As a mage, you are one of a select group that can conjure a portal to transport you back to this very place.  I can teach you if you are ready.\n\nAnd remember that you can always use the crystal behind me to teleport down to the ruins beneath Dalaran in Crystalsong Forest."
G["As a matter of fact, I did. I was going to frame it and show it to the guys in Ironforge for a laugh, but you're welcome to it."]="As a matter of fact, I did. I was going to frame it and show it to the guys in Ironforge for a laugh, but you're welcome to it."
G["As a matter of fact, I do want to make Hellfire Peninsula my home."]="Em realidade, não quero fazer da Península Fogo do Inferno meu lar."
G["As a member of the Argent Crusade, I've sworn an oath to set aside past grudges in the name of... gah - ungh...."]="As a member of the Argent Crusade, I've sworn an oath to set aside past grudges in the name of... gah - ungh...."
G["As a monk, your reflexes are among your greatest resources.  Often, the ability to think and move quickly can save your life."]="As a monk, your reflexes are among your greatest resources.  Often, the ability to think and move quickly can save your life."
G["As a race, we Forsaken are unable to procreate."]="As a race, we Forsaken are unable to procreate."
G["As a relative newcomer to Ogri'la, you don't have enough exposure to the crystals here to reap their full benefits.  Besides, you only have one head.\n\nWe, on the other hand, have been here a very long time.  So, as you can imagine, we're fairly well-versed in a great many things.\n\nOf late, we've taken a keen interest in the demons of the forge camps.  More specifically, we've devised a way to rid us of them for good.\n\nAt least, that's the theory."]="As a relative newcomer to Ogri'la, you don't have enough exposure to the crystals here to reap their full benefits.  Besides, you only have one head.\n\nWe, on the other hand, have been here a very long time.  So, as you can imagine, we're fairly well-versed in a great many things.\n\nOf late, we've taken a keen interest in the demons of the forge camps.  More specifically, we've devised a way to rid us of them for good.\n\nAt least, that's the theory."
G["As a representative of the Consortium, I am always mindful of the ramifications that my interactions have upon our business dealings.\n\nIt is unfortunate that the blood elves do not treat their partnerships with such respect."]="As a representative of the Consortium, I am always mindful of the ramifications that my interactions have upon our business dealings.\n\nIt is unfortunate that the blood elves do not treat their partnerships with such respect."
G["As a representative of the Lower City, I'm here to put forward our case that Auchindoun must be cleared of its Shadow Council infestation.  That is, if we're to have any hope for a future and stave off the possibility of a cataclysm greater than the creation of the Bone Wastes!\n\nAll of our peoples have suffered too much already.  I am here to see to it that the suffering stops!"]="As a representative of the Lower City, I'm here to put forward our case that Auchindoun must be cleared of its Shadow Council infestation.  That is, if we're to have any hope for a future and stave off the possibility of a cataclysm greater than the creation of the Bone Wastes!\n\nAll of our peoples have suffered too much already.  I am here to see to it that the suffering stops!"
G["As a reward for his years of service, Illidan allowed Kael'thas to send him five warriors to train under him.  It would be the first time blood elves would be allowed to train as demon hunters.\n\nThe training was brutal.  Illidan put Kael's warriors through trials that would defeat most fully capable demon hunters.\n\nThree of Kael's elves died in training - another went mad.\n\nOne succeeded."]="As a reward for his years of service, Illidan allowed Kael'thas to send him five warriors to train under him.  It would be the first time blood elves would be allowed to train as demon hunters.\n\nThe training was brutal.  Illidan put Kael's warriors through trials that would defeat most fully capable demon hunters.\n\nThree of Kael's elves died in training - another went mad.\n\nOne succeeded."
G["As a reward, I will allow you to live."]="As a reward, I will allow you to live."
G["As a shortfang, I must wait until the stronger saurok have had their share of meat."]="Como colmilhochico, tenho que esperar até que os saurok mais fortes se tenham repartido a carne."
G["As a stranger to these lands, you may not be familiar with the Shado-Pan."]="As a stranger to these lands, you may not be familiar with the Shado-Pan."
G["As a tax-paying subject, I have a right to visit the city!"]="As a tax-paying subject, I have a right to visit the city!"
G["As a young night elf in Darkshore, I crossed paths with a group of unsavory individuals known as the Twilight's Hammer. A group of them befriended me and shamefully, I ended up eschewing my faith in Elune and embracing the vitriol of the Twilight's Hammer.\n\nIt was not until a vision came to me from Elune, that I woke up from the malaise that I had fallen into as a follower of the old gods.\n\nIn repentance, I began work on my prayer to Elune."]="As a young night elf in Darkshore, I crossed paths with a group of unsavory individuals known as the Twilight's Hammer. A group of them befriended me and shamefully, I ended up eschewing my faith in Elune and embracing the vitriol of the Twilight's Hammer.\n\nIt was not until a vision came to me from Elune, that I woke up from the malaise that I had fallen into as a follower of the old gods.\n\nIn repentance, I began work on my prayer to Elune."
G["As acting Taskmaster of this here compound, it is my duty to make sure that there is a certain level of tedium involved with all forms of business, work, rest, and relaxation that may take place here.\n\nIf you find anything that you are asked to do to be too easy and hassle free, report to me immediately."]="As acting Taskmaster of this here compound, it is my duty to make sure that there is a certain level of tedium involved with all forms of business, work, rest, and relaxation that may take place here.\n\nIf you find anything that you are asked to do to be too easy and hassle free, report to me immediately."
G["As before, defeat each wave of illusions before time runs out. This time, you will encounter more difficult illusions."]="Igual que antes: derrota a cada onda antes de que se acabe o tempo. Esta vez as ilusões serão mais difíceis."
G["As custodians of time, we watch over and care for Nozdormu's realm. The master is away at the moment, which means that attempts are being made to dramatically alter time. The master never meddles in the affairs of mortals but instead corrects the alterations made to time by others. He is reactionary in this regard."]="As custodians of time, we watch over and care for Nozdormu's realm. The master is away at the moment, which means that attempts are being made to dramatically alter time. The master never meddles in the affairs of mortals but instead corrects the alterations made to time by others. He is reactionary in this regard."
G["As da Warchief commands..."]="Como ordene o Chefe de Guerra."
G["As dark as things seem, I must not give up hope. We must not be cowed by the violence of the Yaungol.\nYou... have you come to help us?"]="Embora a situação parezca nefasta, não devo abandonar a esperança. Não devemos deixar que a violência dos yaungol nos acobarde.\n\nTem... tem vindo a nos ajudar?"
G["As deadly as the silithid seem, they are but tame creatures compared to their Qiraji overlords."]="Por mais mortíferos que o silitídeo pareça, eles são apenas criaturas domesticadas em comparação com os seus senhores Qiraji."
G["As disciples of blood, you strive to master the very lifeforce of your enemies."]="As disciples of blood, you strive to master the very lifeforce of your enemies."
G["As do ours. Do you not see the number of our injured? Do you forget how many have been taken prisoner?"]="As nossas também. Não tem visto quantos feridos temos? E quantos têm feito prisioneiros?"
G["As each rune bursts, a bolt of fire will travel to one or more nearby runes, triggering it to be one of the next runes to burst."]="As each rune bursts, a bolt of fire will travel to one or more nearby runes, triggering it to be one of the next runes to burst."
G["As expected, the Horde has completed all of their preparations well in advance of you and your so-called Alliance. You are all holding us up as we cannot take final measures to begin the war until you finish your promised responsibilities.\n\nNow go and pull your weight, $r."]="As expected, the Horde has completed all of their preparations well in advance of you and your so-called Alliance. You are all holding us up as we cannot take final measures to begin the war until you finish your promised responsibilities.\n\nNow go and pull your weight, $r."
G["As expected."]="Era de esperar."
G["As expected.  Very well, dismissed."]="As expected.  Very well, dismissed."
G["As fodder for the swarm, perhaps!"]="Talvez como carne de canhão..."
G["As for YOU, little $c."]="E assim que você, $gpequeno: pequena; $c."
G["As for not endangering the sigils during this process, I can analyze each watcher's status and make that information available to you upon completion of calculations."]="As for not endangering the sigils during this process, I can analyze each watcher's status and make that information available to you upon completion of calculations."
G["As for the rest of you grunts, suit up! We got some killin' to do."]="Assim que a todos os outros, animais, preparaos! Temos que sair a matar um pouco."
G["As for the rest of you, seek me if you dare. Like the others, you will all die screaming."]="As for the rest of you, seek me if you dare. Like the others, you will all die screaming."
G["As for the smell... *Balinda sniffs at the air* I think it's coming from over there..."]="Assim que ao cheiro... *Balinda olfateao ar* Acho que vem de aí..."
G["As for you..."]="Assim que você..."
G["As for your life, mortal.  I will be generous.  After all... why would I destroy my most useful servant?  I waited for you for weeks inside that Hyldnir mine."]="As for your life, mortal.  I will be generous.  After all... why would I destroy my most useful servant?  I waited for you for weeks inside that Hyldnir mine."
G["As good as I told you it would be, yes?"]="É tão boa como te disse que o seria, verdade?"
G["As if I ain't got enough on me hands, those dwarves at the mines've gotten all crazy recently about some new drink called kafa.\n\nThey're insistin' I bring 'em fresh cups o' kafa every mornin'!\n\nDo they know wot I 'ave ta do to get those kafa beans? Honestly!"]="As if I ain't got enough on me hands, those dwarves at the mines've gotten all crazy recently about some new drink called kafa.\n\nThey're insistin' I bring 'em fresh cups o' kafa every mornin'!\n\nDo they know wot I 'ave ta do to get those kafa beans? Honestly!"
G["As if I could forget. Listen, Uther, there's something about the plague you should know..."]="Tomara pudesse esquecer. Olhe, Uther... há algo sobre o Flagelo que deveria saber."
G["As if I don't have better things to do in my old age than carry buckets of water."]="As if I don't have better things to do in my old age than carry buckets of water."
G["As if I had all eternity."]="Como se tivesse toda a eternidade."
G["As if I'm going to listen to anyone dressed up in that outfit!"]="Como se eu fosse a escutar a alguém com essas pintas!"
G["As if in a daze, Salandria moves toward whatever it is she is sensing."]="Como apresurada, Salandria se move para o que sente."
G["As if we don't have enough problems, you go and create more!"]="Como se não tuviéramos bastantes problemas, vai você e cria mais!"
G["As if you weaklings pose any threat to us. We will devour you."]="As if you weaklings pose any threat to us. We will devour you."
G["As is his will.  It is our sworn duty to see you confined, and he sees it done."]="As is his will.  It is our sworn duty to see you confined, and he sees it done."
G["As it is, there are barely enough of us to keep them from taking everything."]="Agora mesmo não somos suficientes para esta que se levem tudo o que quieran."
G["As it should be."]="As it should be."
G["As it should be...."]="Como deveria ser..."
G["As it was written!"]="Tal e como estava escrito!"
G["As long as I stand, this temple will never fall."]="Enquanto eu continue com vida, este templo não cairá."
G["As long as he remains unfound, I will search. I know that he lives. And I know that I must find him. I am thankful for what you have done, Commander. As my father called upon you, a brother in arms, know that you may call upon me. I am at your service, my Lord."]="As long as he remains unfound, I will search. I know that he lives. And I know that I must find him. I am thankful for what you have done, Commander. As my father called upon you, a brother in arms, know that you may call upon me. I am at your service, my Lord."
G["As long as the sha stay outside, I'll be fine."]="Enquanto os sha sigan fosse, estarei bem."
G["As long as those dwarves stay over there we'll have no trouble.  Where are you heading $n?"]="Enquanto esses anões se queden aí, não teremos problemas. Onde te diriges, $n?"
G["As long as we stay above the war, then there's hope for the world as a whole."]="Enquanto nos pusermos acima da guerra, ainda haverá esperança para o mundo."
G["As long as we're going with a new plan, I may as well pick up a weapon and some armor."]="As long as we're going with a new plan, I may as well pick up a weapon and some armor."
G["As long as you've got my back..."]="Enquanto cuente com você..."
G["As masters of blood, we are masters of life and death itself.  Against us, even hope falls drained and lifeless."]="Ao ser amos da sangue dominamos a vida e a morte. Contra nós, até a esperança cai vazio e sem vida."
G["As masters of blood, we know battle without end..."]="Como senhores da sangue, conhecemos a batalha sem fim..."
G["As members of the Horde, we must contribute to our community to ensure that it continues to thrive. Thus, I am certain you will gladly aid us by undertaking a small task I have for you."]="As members of the Horde, we must contribute to our community to ensure that it continues to thrive. Thus, I am certain you will gladly aid us by undertaking a small task I have for you."
G["As mistweavers, we must always protect those in need."]="As mistweavers, we must always protect those in need."
G["As most of you know, we're about to begin another intensive round of demolitions testing."]="Como já vocês sabem muitos de vocês, estamos a ponto de começar outra rodada intensiva de provas de demolições."
G["As much as I expected from a troll."]="Não esperava mais de um troll."
G["As my emperor wills!"]="Como meu imperador ordenar!"
G["As my lovely companion may have already enlightened you, we are in pursuit of something mysterious and powerful. All of our clues point to the Masters' Gate.\n\nUnfortunately, the nihilistic cultists known as the Twilight's Hammer have prevented our attempts to research the area. Surely a $c with your reputation can assist the Reliquary in its time of need?"]="Como te haverá contado meu encantadora companheira, buscamos algo misterioso e poderoso. Todas nossas pistas apontam à Porta dos Mestres.\n\nPor desgraça, os cultistas nihiprontas que conhecemos como o Martelo Crepúsculo têm recusado nossos tentativas de registrar a zona. Certo que $gun: uma; $c do seu reputação pode ajudar ao Relicário nesta hora de necessidade?"
G["As my master once said, \"You cannot truly know someone until you fight them.\""]="As my master once said, \"You cannot truly know someone until you fight them.\""
G["As my most recent gift to the lowly inhabitants of Azeroth, the evil Zul'jin is no more!"]="A modo de recente presente por mim para os habitantes de Azeroth, o malvado Zul’jin sumiu!"
G["As nice as Gadgetzan is compared to Un'Goro, I have some good folks counting on us to bring them some supplies.  If you're ready to go, then so are Dadanga and I.  Let's mount up!"]="Comparado com Um'goro é tão agradável como Gadgetzan, há muita gente que conta conosco para que lhes lhevemos suprimentos. Se tem tudo pronto, Dadanga e eu também. Vamos além!"
G["As often as I can.  It's great exercise and it keeps me informed on what they're up to--which, from my experience, is always no good."]="Sempre que eu puder. É um ótimo exercício e me mantém informado sobre o que eles estão fazendo - o que, pela minha experiência, nem sempre é bom."
G["As one of the greatest of the Highborne, he will succeed where others have failed."]="As one of the greatest of the Highborne, he will succeed where others have failed."
G["As representatives of the Explorers' League, Bronwyn and I are here at the Alliance's behest to study these mountains.\n\nBut between you and me, after an extended stay in Silithus, we just needed a vacation.  This seems like a nice enough spot."]="As representatives of the Explorers' League, Bronwyn and I are here at the Alliance's behest to study these mountains.\n\nBut between you and me, after an extended stay in Silithus, we just needed a vacation.  This seems like a nice enough spot."
G["As resident doctor, I am compelled to warn the rest of you that fire can be hazardous to your health."]="As resident doctor, I am compelled to warn the rest of you that fire can be hazardous to your health."
G["As soon as I awakened, the Klaxxi sensed my presence and relayed as much as they dared.\n\nThey confirmed my own suspicions. The Empress is no longer fit to rule the empire. She must be... cleansed."]="As soon as I awakened, the Klaxxi sensed my presence and relayed as much as they dared.\n\nThey confirmed my own suspicions. The Empress is no longer fit to rule the empire. She must be... cleansed."
G["As soon as I... can get up, I'm going to crush you!"]="As soon as I... can get up, I'm going to crush you!"
G["As soon as all of our reinforcements arrive, we will begin pushing further south."]="As soon as all of our reinforcements arrive, we will begin pushing further south."
G["As soon as we have some news we will let you know."]="Te avisaremos assim que tengamos notícia."
G["As soon as you stop yapping..."]="Assim que te deixe de cháchara..."
G["As such, knowledge is my armor, and I carry a quill in place of a sword."]="Como tal, meu armadura é o saber e meu arma é a pluma, não a lâmina."
G["As the Legion's final defeat draws ever-nearer, stand proud in the knowledge that you have saved worlds without number from the flame."]="As the Legion's final defeat draws ever-nearer, stand proud in the knowledge that you have saved worlds without number from the flame."
G["As the Light wills."]="Como a Luz desee."
G["As the Molten Colossus weakens, a single ominous word rumbles through the air like rolling thunder: \"BURN\""]="Enquanto o colosso fundido se debilita, uma única e ominosa palavra ressoa no ar como um trovão: \"ARDE\""
G["As the combined Horde and Alliance forces began their assault upon the Wrath Gate, an uprising broke out in the Undercity. Varimathras and hordes of his demonic brethren attacked. Hundreds of my people were slain in the coup. I barely managed to escape with my life."]="As the combined Horde and Alliance forces began their assault upon the Wrath Gate, an uprising broke out in the Undercity. Varimathras and hordes of his demonic brethren attacked. Hundreds of my people were slain in the coup. I barely managed to escape with my life."
G["As the empire grew, the mogu began to experiment with the secrets of the Vale. They crafted terrible weapons of living flesh and stone. And my people were afraid."]="À medida que o império crescia, os mogus começaram a fazer experimentos com os segredos do Vale. Eles criaram terríveis armas de carne viva e pedra. E meu povo teve medo."
G["As the great explosion filled the region, my father cast a rune at the great hammer that it might not be had by our enemies. It was his final act..."]="As the great explosion filled the region, my father cast a rune at the great hammer that it might not be had by our enemies. It was his final act..."
G["As the hammer lands, more rust shakes free from the Iron Watcher's frame and its pace quickens."]="As the hammer lands, more rust shakes free from the Iron Watcher's frame and its pace quickens."
G["As the last remnants of the %s seep into the ground, the altar set into the floor nearby begins to glow faintly."]="As the last remnants of the %s seep into the ground, the altar set into the floor nearby begins to glow faintly."
G["As the leader of the Sunreavers, it is with great pride that I present $n as the new bearer of Quel'Delar!"]="Como líder dos Atracasol, é uma honra para mim apresentar a $n como $gnuevo portador: nova portadora; de Quel'Delar!"
G["As the naaru approached him, Voren'thal kneeled before him and uttered the following words: \"I've seen you in a vision, naaru. My race's only hope for survival lies with you. My followers and I are here to serve you.\""]="As the naaru approached him, Voren'thal kneeled before him and uttered the following words: \"I've seen you in a vision, naaru. My race's only hope for survival lies with you. My followers and I are here to serve you.\""
G["As the name suggests, it can be found near ruins. Loreth'Aran holds the answer.\n\nActually, the name doesn't really suggest that -- I was just trying to be clever in naming the fungi."]="As the name suggests, it can be found near ruins. Loreth'Aran holds the answer.\n\nActually, the name doesn't really suggest that -- I was just trying to be clever in naming the fungi."
G["As the neutralizing agent mixes into the waters of the lake, the water that was irradiated by the crystal seems to clear."]="As the neutralizing agent mixes into the waters of the lake, the water that was irradiated by the crystal seems to clear."
G["As the only apparent surviving 'Broken', it is both my duty and honor to carry on the shamanistic teachings of Farseer Nobundo."]="Como o único aparente \"Quebrado\" sobrevivente, é meu dever e honra seguir os ensinamentos xamanísticos do Farseer Nobundo."
G["As the regiment of blood elves crossed this very bridge, the Aldor's exarchs and vindicators lined up to defend the Terrace of Light.  But then the unexpected happened."]="As the regiment of blood elves crossed this very bridge, the Aldor's exarchs and vindicators lined up to defend the Terrace of Light.  But then the unexpected happened."
G["As the tale goes, Zao battled furiously... shooting his arrows high into the sky, until only one sun remained."]="A história conta que Zao luchó sem descanso... Disparó uma flecha atrás outra ao céu, até que somente ficou um somente sol."
G["As the tale goes, the yaungol was traveling across the Kun'lai plains when suddenly he was ambushed by two strange creatures!"]="As the tale goes, the yaungol was traveling across the Kun'lai plains when suddenly he was ambushed by two strange creatures!"
G["As the toxins lurking within Maraudon seeped into my mind, I began to lose my grip on reality. Worried that it would be used for evil, my dryad sisters secretly took the scepter from me, breaking it into two parts and hiding it within the caverns.\n\nSoon they fell victim to the madness as well, and the two parts of the scepter, left unguarded, came to be in the possession of Vyletongue, himself. The satyr entrusted one part to Noxxion, an evil elemental, and the other he still has to this day."]="As the toxins lurking within Maraudon seeped into my mind, I began to lose my grip on reality. Worried that it would be used for evil, my dryad sisters secretly took the scepter from me, breaking it into two parts and hiding it within the caverns.\n\nSoon they fell victim to the madness as well, and the two parts of the scepter, left unguarded, came to be in the possession of Vyletongue, himself. The satyr entrusted one part to Noxxion, an evil elemental, and the other he still has to this day."
G["As the wardens of time, we of the bronze dragonflight observe their infinite combinations."]="Como guardiões do tempo, os do Voo Bronze observamos seus infinitas combinações."
G["As the waters foretold."]="Como profetizaram as águas."
G["As the wind on the plains, you are always welcome here."]="Como o vento nas planícies, você é sempre bem-vindo aqui."
G["As to your warning - worry not. Our troops are all aware of the chain of command. We fight united. Let us hope your own troops remember that..."]="Assim que ao seu advertência... não te preocupe. Nossas tropas são conscientes da cadeia de envio. Lutamos juntos. Esperemos que seus próprias tropas o recuerden..."
G["As tough as you were, you were always soft in my arms."]="As tough as you were, you were always soft in my arms."
G["As trying as these times are, we must control our emotions, lest they be used by the Sha."]="Emboraos tempos são difíceis, devemos controlar nossas emoções para que não as use o Sha."
G["As was fated a lifetime ago in Karazhan, monster - I come - and with me I bring justice."]="As was fated a lifetime ago in Karazhan, monster - I come - and with me I bring justice."
G["As water cracks stone, so shall we be your undoing."]="Como a água que rompe a rocha, nós passaremos por você."
G["As we attempt to gain the help of the peoples of this world against the Burning Legion, we must also learn to live peaceably amongst them.\n\nPlease keep this in mind as your journey takes you throughout Azeroth.  May the Light guide you."]="Enquanto buscamos a ajuda dos povos deste mundo contra a Legião Ardente, devemos aprender a viver em paz com eles.\n\nNão esqueça isto enquanto viagens por Azeroth. Que a Luz te guíe."
G["As we were making our way across the Burning Steppes, we were ambushed. It must have been a hundred of them... Dark Iron dwarves! They were shifting out of the walls, from the rocks in the Steppes; out of every crevice, nook, and cranny in sight. They swarmed us, overwhelming the guards and the few brave heroes that had agreed to assist us on this mission.\n\nOne thing was clear: This was a highly orchestrated ambush. It was as if they knew every move we would make before we made them..."]="As we were making our way across the Burning Steppes, we were ambushed. It must have been a hundred of them... Dark Iron dwarves! They were shifting out of the walls, from the rocks in the Steppes; out of every crevice, nook, and cranny in sight. They swarmed us, overwhelming the guards and the few brave heroes that had agreed to assist us on this mission.\n\nOne thing was clear: This was a highly orchestrated ambush. It was as if they knew every move we would make before we made them..."
G["As will we all."]="Como todos."
G["As would I! The presence of the Timeless Isle is proof that many things are possible beyond the boundaries of linear thinking."]="As would I! The presence of the Timeless Isle is proof that many things are possible beyond the boundaries of linear thinking."
G["As you all know, first prize is a Turbo-Charged Flying Machine. Anyone want to see second prize?"]="As you all know, first prize is a Turbo-Charged Flying Machine. Anyone want to see second prize?"
G["As you all well know, the path of our people has not been an enviable one. Blood elf and draenei alike have been tested."]="As you all well know, the path of our people has not been an enviable one. Blood elf and draenei alike have been tested."
G["As you approach the console the access crystal you have with you begins to hum softly and pulse with light.\n\nA rush of information flows into your mind and all of a sudden you're aware of the manaforge's energy production levels, its stability and its output to different pipelines.  The console awaits your command."]="As you approach the console the access crystal you have with you begins to hum softly and pulse with light.\n\nA rush of information flows into your mind and all of a sudden you're aware of the manaforge's energy production levels, its stability and its output to different pipelines.  The console awaits your command."
G["As you approach the contract board, you rub your eyes for a moment, staring at the board in awe. Most of the requests on this board require you to perform acts that, even just thinking about could make a hardened criminal's stomach turn. You are, however, able to find a few \"normal\" requests..."]="As you approach the contract board, you rub your eyes for a moment, staring at the board in awe. Most of the requests on this board require you to perform acts that, even just thinking about could make a hardened criminal's stomach turn. You are, however, able to find a few \"normal\" requests..."
G["As you approach the crystal, you can feel its potent energy. Some nearby sprites glare dubiously in your direction."]="As you approach the crystal, you can feel its potent energy. Some nearby sprites glare dubiously in your direction."
G["As you can see, I am but one man with a lumbering oaf of a squire. The might of the Dark Iron dwarves and the beasts held in the grip of Ragnaros would surely overwhelm me alone, but I have the utmost confidence that such a brave and ambitious adventurer such as you would have no problem handling the denizens of the cauldron. Should you choose to assist me, I shall reward you with riches and wealth beyond your wildest dreams."]="Como você pode ver, sou apenas um homem com um escudeiro pesado. O poder dos anões do Ferro Negro e as bestas seguradas por Ragnaros certamente me dominariam, mas tenho a máxima confiança de que um aventureiro tão corajoso e ambicioso como você não teria problemas em lidar com os habitantes do caldeirão. Se você escolher me ajudar, recompensarei você com riquezas e riquezas além dos seus sonhos mais loucos."
G["As you can see, I have but little after these savages got hold of me, but you're welcome to what I have. Come, have a look."]="As you can see, I have but little after these savages got hold of me, but you're welcome to what I have. Come, have a look."
G["As you can see, this is a defective yak. Go ahead, $r. Try to pet it."]="As you can see, this is a defective yak. Go ahead, $r. Try to pet it."
G["As you can see, we've cleared out the rockslide.  The tremendous loss of life was regrettable, but you can now pass freely through the trogg-infested tunnel.\n\nYou're welcome!"]="As you can see, we've cleared out the rockslide.  The tremendous loss of life was regrettable, but you can now pass freely through the trogg-infested tunnel.\n\nYou're welcome!"
G["As you can see, your people are now mine. I will now turn this city household by household, until the flame of life has been snuffed out... forever."]="Como pode ver, seu povo agora me pertence. Pondré esta cidade patas cima, casa por casa, até que a chama da vida que extinguida... para sempre."
G["As you command, Sir!"]="Aos seus ordens, senhor!"
G["As you command, Warchief!"]="Aos seus ordens, Chefe de Guerra!"
G["As you command, instructor!"]="Como ordens, instrutor!"
G["As you command, master!"]="Como ordens, mestre!"
G["As you command, sir."]="Como ordens, senhor."
G["As you desire, Lord Illidan."]="Como quiser, Lorde Illidan."
G["As you fall in battle, we grow in strength. There is only one inevitable outcome. Prepare for your end!"]="As you fall in battle, we grow in strength. There is only one inevitable outcome. Prepare for your end!"
G["As you gain renown with our town, I can make more goods available to you, $n.  With equipment in such short supply we can only afford to provide it to those we trust."]="As you gain renown with our town, I can make more goods available to you, $n.  With equipment in such short supply we can only afford to provide it to those we trust."
G["As you inspect the cage and the Night elf inside, you get an odd sense of deja vu. For some reason she does not make eye contact with you--it is almost as if you are not there to her."]="Ao inspecionar a gaiola e o elfo noturno, você tem uma estranha sensação de déjà vu. Por alguma razão, ela não faz contato visual com você - é quase como se você não estivesse lá."
G["As you jump into Nergeld, the rotting flesh of the construct comes to life."]="Ao saltar sobre Nergeld, a carne podrida do ensamblagem cobra vida."
G["As you know, Black Dragons frequently disguise themselves as humanoids in order to tamper with mortal affairs."]="As you know, Black Dragons frequently disguise themselves as humanoids in order to tamper with mortal affairs."
G["As you know, Hallow's End is a celebration of transition... of change."]="Como vocês sabem, Halhoween é uma festividade de transição... de caminho."
G["As you know, air weighs nothing. So to create a lighter-than-air vessel, we had to bend a few rules."]="Como bem sabe, o ar não pesa nada. Assim que para criar uma nave mais leve que o ar temos tido que quebrar algumas regras."
G["As you near the portal, you are struck by intense heat radiating out. The sound of hammers echoing through a canyon create a faint steady rhythm all around.  Where does this portal go?"]="As you near the portal, you are struck by intense heat radiating out. The sound of hammers echoing through a canyon create a faint steady rhythm all around.  Where does this portal go?"
G["As you peer into the orb, you feel a familiar force tugging at your mind."]="Ao olhar dentro do orbe, sente uma força familiar arrastrando seu mente."
G["As you requested."]="As you requested."
G["As you say!"]="As you say!"
G["As you say, ambassador. We can wait."]="Como digas, embaixador. Podemos esperar."
G["As you say, my dear, as you say."]="Como digas, querida, como digas."
G["As you say, my lady."]="Como quiser, meu senhora."
G["As you say, sir!"]="Aos seus ordens, senhor!"
G["As you say, sir."]="Como diga, senhor."
