G["As you wish, my lord."]="Como quiser, meu senhor."
G["As you wish, my queen. I will not stand in their way, but I will keep a close watch."]="As you wish, my queen. I will not stand in their way, but I will keep a close watch."
G["As you wish, sir."]="Como desee senhor."
G["As you wish."]="Como quiser."
