G["As you wish. We will find your artifact. $p - I will meet you at the Sra'thik Incursion."]="Como quiser. Encontraremos seu artefato. $p, te verei na Incursão de Sra'thik."
G["As you wish..."]="Como quiser..."
G["Ash can get me back to the Incursion. Please, $p, bring those poisoned blades."]="Ash pode me levar de volta à Incursão. Por favor, $p, traz essas espadas envenenadas."
G["Ash nuzzles Sentinel Commander Lyalia."]="Ash nuzzles Sentinel Commander Lyalia."
G["Ash... to ash..."]="Cinza... à cinza..."
G["Ashbringer defies me..."]="Ashbringer defies me..."
G["Ashbringer!"]="Ashbringer!"
G["Ashbringer."]="Ashbringer."
