G["Ask about the orphans."]="Ask about the orphans."
G["Ask for Marie Holdston at the smithy."]="Peça Marie Holdston no ferreiro."
G["Ask for anything and you shall have it! Just spare my life!"]="Pido que queira e será seu! Tão somente perdóname a vida!"
G["Ask him how he wants to proceed, then come right back!"]="Ask him how he wants to proceed, then come right back!"
G["Ask me again later - I'm trying to scratch my nose and it's hard to concentrate."]="Ask me again later - I'm trying to scratch my nose and it's hard to concentrate."
G["Ask me for help and advice... just don't ask me for money, okay?"]="Me peça ajuda e conselhos... só não me peça dinheiro, ok?"
G["Ask me how to get a free drink at the Blue Recluse!"]="Ask me how to get a free drink at the Blue Recluse!"
G["Ask not for mercy. My blade will not grant it."]="Ask not for mercy. My blade will not grant it."
G["Ask the streams? You're no elder, Ashyo. You're not even a jinyu grown yet. It would be a waste of your time."]="Ask the streams? You're no elder, Ashyo. You're not even a jinyu grown yet. It would be a waste of your time."
G["Ask yourself, $n: is this good for the Venture Company?"]="Ask yourself, $n: is this good for the Venture Company?"
G["Ask yourself: what good is a \"safety\" valve if it keeps going off? That doesn't sound very safe to me."]="Ask yourself: what good is a \"safety\" valve if it keeps going off? That doesn't sound very safe to me."
G["Aspects! Aid the heroes as best you can!"]="Aspectos! Ajudem aos heróis como melhor possam."
G["Aspects! Aid the heroes as best you can."]="Aspectos! Ajudem aos heróis como melhor possam."
G["Aspiring to join our ranks one day?  Sark Ragetotem can help you on your way.  He's in the Hunter's Hall."]="Aspirando a se juntar às nossas fileiras um dia? Sark Ragetotem pode ajudá-o no seu caminho. Ele está no Hunter's Hall."
G["Assassin, eh? Who sent you? Speak, or I will carve the answer from your skull!"]="Assassin, eh? Who sent you? Speak, or I will carve the answer from your skull!"
G["Assassins from that cult you found... Let's get moving before someone else finds us out here."]="Assassins from that cult you found... Let's get moving before someone else finds us out here."
G["Assassins! Guards! Guards!"]="Assassins! Guards! Guards!"
G["Assassins... save... th... Magistraaa..."]="Assassins... save... th... Magistraaa..."
G["Assassins? What we need ta do is drop some firebombs on dem!"]="Assassins? What we need ta do is drop some firebombs on dem!"
G["Assemble a company! March on Forest Song!"]="Assemble a company! March on Forest Song!"
G["Assemble the Mallet."]="Monta a marra."
G["Assemble the schools. We will wash away even the memories of the Alliance and the Horde from Ashenvale!"]="Assemble the schools. We will wash away even the memories of the Alliance and the Horde from Ashenvale!"
G["Assessing database integrity ..."]="Valorando a integridade da base de dados..."
G["Assist me slaves!"]="Ajudem-me, escravos!"
G["Assist me! There are too many!"]="Ajude-me! São demais!"
G["Assist me, $n. The Trade Prince has become far more powerful!\n\nI do not know how much longer I can hold out."]="Ajude-me, $n. O Príncipe mercante se voltou mais poderoso!\n\nNão sei quanto tempo nunca poderei resistir."
G["Assume flight form in 3..."]="Adopdada forma de voo em 3..."
G["Assume your druidic bear form, Tur."]="Assuma à sua forma druídica de urso, Tur."
G["Assuming there's a world left for your legion to conquer. The Twilight's Hammer seeks to destroy everything."]="Assuming there's a world left for your legion to conquer. The Twilight's Hammer seeks to destroy everything."
G["Assuming this works, I'll need a name for my invention. How 'bout... Grookin Grenade?"]="Assuming this works, I'll need a name for my invention. How 'bout... Grookin Grenade?"
G["Assuming we make it through this, it'll take a month to clean the brains off my brasswork."]="Supondo que superemos isso, levará um mês para limpar o cérebro da minha siderúrgica."
G["Astaia has fished up some curious treasures over the ages she has spent fishing.  Why don't you go see her over in the Tradesman's terrace and have her show you some of them."]="Astaia pescou algum tesouros curiosos ao longo dos anos em que passou pescando. Por que você não a vê no terraço do comerciante e pede que ela mostre algum deles?"
G["Astor? Taken your bloody time getting here, so let's not waste any time, shall we?"]="Astor? Te fiz perder seu maldito tempo para vir até aqui, assim que não perdamos mais o tempo, de acordo?"
G["Astounding!  So then indurium is the key!"]="Incrível! Então o indurium é a importante!"
G["Astounding! A lineage of great warriors... From a different world, no less! It is rare for a Pandaren to leave his or her homeland. You are rightfully proud of who you are."]="Astounding! A lineage of great warriors... From a different world, no less! It is rare for a Pandaren to leave his or her homeland. You are rightfully proud of who you are."
G["Astounding! An actual, functional Mogu construct machine."]="Impressionante! Uma máquina de construção mogu que funciona."
G["Astounding! Another chamber that looks to originate from these \"Titans.\""]="Impressionante! Outra câmera que parece proceder desses \"titãs\"."
G["Astounding! It says here that Brann discovered a mysterious runic plate deep in Thor Modan!"]="Astounding! It says here that Brann discovered a mysterious runic plate deep in Thor Modan!"
G["Astounding. You managed to dominate her, yet she retains self awareness and function. How did you do it?"]="Astounding. You managed to dominate her, yet she retains self awareness and function. How did you do it?"
G["At LAST! I'm parched!"]="FINALMENTE! Estou sedento!"
G["At dis point you know as much as I do, mon. Maybe you go see Magar in Orgrimmar. He not be da happiest tailor around, but he help you anyway."]="No momentos, você sabe tanto quanto eu, mon. Talvez você vá ver Magar em Orgrimmar. Ele não é o alfaiate mais feliz do mundo, mas ajuda mesmo assim."
G["At ease marines!"]="At ease marines!"
G["At ease soldiers!"]="At ease soldiers!"
G["At ease, $C. If you are just passing through I suggest you stick to the roads and only travel by day. If your business is here in Darkshire, consider lending your abilities to The Night Watch. Our skill is unquestionable but our numbers are small."]="At ease, $C. If you are just passing through I suggest you stick to the roads and only travel by day. If your business is here in Darkshire, consider lending your abilities to The Night Watch. Our skill is unquestionable but our numbers are small."
G["At ease, Farstrider Dusking. What news do you have for me?"]="Descansar, Errante Crepúsculo. Que notícia tem para mim?"
G["At ease, Private. I have a mission for you. The last messenger I sent to Nethergarde didn't make it. We found his entrails scattered about the bone road a few hours ago. We suspect it may have been Legion or fel orc, maybe even Horde..."]="At ease, Private. I have a mission for you. The last messenger I sent to Nethergarde didn't make it. We found his entrails scattered about the bone road a few hours ago. We suspect it may have been Legion or fel orc, maybe even Horde..."
G["At ease, lad. The Prince will be back soon and we'll be on our way back to Lordaeron."]="Tranquilo, rapaz. O Príncipe voltará pronto e iremos de volta a Lordaeron."
G["At ease, lieutenant.  Go on."]="Adiante, tenente, diga."
G["At ease, men."]="Tranquilos, pessoal."
G["At ease."]="Descansem."
G["At first we repaired them to harvest the forests here, but ever since the alliance arrived and the fighting broke out we've been using them as war machines.\n\nBelieve me, $c. If you've got a key, you'd be crazy not to use it."]="At first we repaired them to harvest the forests here, but ever since the alliance arrived and the fighting broke out we've been using them as war machines.\n\nBelieve me, $c. If you've got a key, you'd be crazy not to use it."
G["At first, my deference and respect for Taran Zhu prohibited me from questioning his decision to close the monastery to outsiders.\nThen, when the yaungol first attacked, my focus on the battle at hand prevented me from leaving the front lines to question his inability to send reinforcements.\nNow, three Shado-Pan lie dead, one is captured, and my patience is beyond worn thin - it is gone. I plan to go to the monastery and demand an audience with Taran Zhu."]="At first, my deference and respect for Taran Zhu prohibited me from questioning his decision to close the monastery to outsiders.\nThen, when the yaungol first attacked, my focus on the battle at hand prevented me from leaving the front lines to question his inability to send reinforcements.\nNow, three Shado-Pan lie dead, one is captured, and my patience is beyond worn thin - it is gone. I plan to go to the monastery and demand an audience with Taran Zhu."
G["At last - one among you is worthy of my knowledge. Worry not - I have probed your thoughts, no harm will come to you."]="At last - one among you is worthy of my knowledge. Worry not - I have probed your thoughts, no harm will come to you."
G["At last I am liberated. It has been too long since I have tasted true freedom!"]="At last I am liberated. It has been too long since I have tasted true freedom!"
G["At last I am released! Thank you, gentle $r. I must return to the expedition at once! They will know of your deeds. This I vow."]="At last I am released! Thank you, gentle $r. I must return to the expedition at once! They will know of your deeds. This I vow."
G["At last I will have my revenge!"]="Finalmente terei meu vingança!"
G["At last it has come to pass. The moment of my demise. The loop is closed. My future self will cause no more harm."]="Ao fim tem acontecido. Me chegado a hora. O ciclo se tem fechado. Meu eu do futuro não voltará a causar mais dano."
G["At last it is here! Mourn and lament the passing of all you have ever known, and all that would have been! Hach min corai!"]="At last it is here! Mourn and lament the passing of all you have ever known, and all that would have been! Hach min corai!"
G["At last it is time for the exiled gnomes to return.\n\nOnce again Gnomeregan will be our home!"]="Finalmente é hora de que regresen os gnomos exilados.\n\nUma vez mais, Gnomeregan será nosso lar!"
G["At last my noble brothers and sisters, our time is at hand!"]="E agora, finalmente, irmãos e irmãs, chegou a hora."
G["At last peace can be restored!"]="At last peace can be restored!"
G["At last some good luck. Market Row has not caught fire yet. Mal'Ganis is supposed to be in Crusaders' Square, which is just ahead. Tell me when you're ready to move forward."]="At last some good luck. Market Row has not caught fire yet. Mal'Ganis is supposed to be in Crusaders' Square, which is just ahead. Tell me when you're ready to move forward."
G["At last the nightmare is over..."]="Ao fim acaba esta pesadelos..."
G["At last!  The information we seek!  Gather quickly, skyguard.  We must soon return to headquarters with our findings!"]="At last!  The information we seek!  Gather quickly, skyguard.  We must soon return to headquarters with our findings!"
G["At last! A challenge! Let us test your mettle, \"champion\"."]="Finalmente, um desafio! Vamos ver de que materiais está feito, \"campeão\"."
G["At last! A proper challenge for my power."]="Finalmente! Um autêntico desafio para meu poder."
G["At last! A warm-up! <Tiny Alliance person!>"]="At last! A warm-up! <Tiny Alliance person!>"
G["At last! An up close fight!"]="Finalmente! Um combate corpo a corpo!"
G["At last! Free from Northwatch Hold! I need a moment to catch my breath...."]="Ao fim! Liberado do Forte do Norte! Preciso pegar ar..."
G["At last! I am finally free from this cell!\n\nThe Kirin Tor sent me from Dalaran to investigate Arugal's progress with the undead here in Silverpine Forest. Little did we know that the wizard had lost his grasp on sanity.\n\nI must report this mess at once! But before I leave, allow me to undo the magical lock on the courtyard door.\n\nYou defeated Rethilgore, perhaps you will survive what lies beyond...."]="At last! I am finally free from this cell!\n\nThe Kirin Tor sent me from Dalaran to investigate Arugal's progress with the undead here in Silverpine Forest. Little did we know that the wizard had lost his grasp on sanity.\n\nI must report this mess at once! But before I leave, allow me to undo the magical lock on the courtyard door.\n\nYou defeated Rethilgore, perhaps you will survive what lies beyond...."
G["At last! I'll light the lamps."]="At last! I'll light the lamps."
G["At last! Naralex awakes from the nightmare."]="Ao fim! Naralex acorde da pesadelos."
G["At last! Naralex can be awakened! Come aid me, brave adventurers!"]="Ao fim! Podemos despertar a Naralex! Venham a me ajudar, corajosos aventureiros!"
G["At last! Someone to free me from this cell!\n\nHigh Executor Hadrec sent us to gather information on the Keep so that a plan could be formulated to overthrow Arugal once and for all.\n\nBut the old wizard has many tricks up his sleeve and we were detected by a magical ward. I was thrown in this prison. Vincent was not so lucky.\n\nI must return to Hadrec to debrief him at once. But first I will pick the lock to the courtyard door for you. Perhaps you can try your luck against the foes that lurk beyond."]="At last! Someone to free me from this cell!\n\nHigh Executor Hadrec sent us to gather information on the Keep so that a plan could be formulated to overthrow Arugal once and for all.\n\nBut the old wizard has many tricks up his sleeve and we were detected by a magical ward. I was thrown in this prison. Vincent was not so lucky.\n\nI must return to Hadrec to debrief him at once. But first I will pick the lock to the courtyard door for you. Perhaps you can try your luck against the foes that lurk beyond."
G["At last, $n, here is your staff. Wield it proudly in service to the Alliance."]="Ao fim, $n, aqui tem seu cajado. Lhévalo com orgulho em serviço da Aliança."
G["At last, $p, we get to face each other in battle!"]="Finalmente nos encontramos rosto a rosto, $p!"
G["At last, I am able to lay my eyes upon you again."]="At last, I am able to lay my eyes upon you again."
G["At last, I am free of the Soulflayer!"]="Finalmente sou livre do Caçador de Almas!"
G["At last, I am free of the corruption that once bound me to this place..."]="Finalmente, estou livre da corrupção que uma vez me ligou a este lugar..."
G["At last, I be free!"]="Finalmente, sou livre!"
G["At last, I have caught up with you, Nefarian. Surely you did not think you would escape the might of the other Aspects?"]="Finalmente te e alcançou, Nefarian. Certo que nunca pensaste que escaparías ao poder dos outros Aspectos."
G["At last, Norkani is free!"]="Finalmente Norkani é livre!"
G["At last, a target for my frustrations!"]="Ao fim, um objetivo para meus frustrações!"
G["At last, a worthy opponent."]="Finalmente, um oponente a meu altura."
G["At last, an end to the horror..."]="Finalmente acabao horror..."
G["At last, it ends...."]="Finalmente terminou..."
G["At last, it's finished."]="Finalmente, está terminou."
G["At last, my soul is free!"]="Finalmente, minha alma está livre!"
G["At last, my work is done."]="Finalmente, meu trabalho terminou."
G["At last, the agony ends. I have failed you my Queen. I have failed us all..."]="Finalmente termina a agonia. Te e falhado, meu rainha. Nos e falhado a todos..."
G["At last, the curse is lifted. Thank you, hero."]="Ao fim sumiu a maldição. Obrigado, corajoso."
G["At last, the serum is complete, $n. Now, come closer. We must talk."]="At last, the serum is complete, $n. Now, come closer. We must talk."
G["At last, the tablets are ours!"]="Finalmente as tabuletas são nossas!"
G["At last, the time for justice is at hand. This monster will answer for each and every Alliance life that we have lost in this war."]="Finalmente chegou a hora da justiça. Esse monstro responderá por todas e cada uma das vidas da Aliança que temos perdido nesta guerra."
G["At last, the tyranny of the stormforged is at its end!"]="At last, the tyranny of the stormforged is at its end!"
G["At last, we have arrived!"]="Finalmente, aqui estamos."
G["At last, you're back! We were beginning to worry that you'd been arrested."]="At last, you're back! We were beginning to worry that you'd been arrested."
G["At last, you're here. We have to get this tome to Icecrown as quickly as we can."]="Ao fim chegou. Temos que levar este escrito a Coroa de Gelo tão rápido como possamos."
G["At last, you've driven them off. Take the tablets to Earthmender Norsala in the Valley of Strength at once! Tell her that I'll be along once I've had some time to recover."]="At last, you've driven them off. Take the tablets to Earthmender Norsala in the Valley of Strength at once! Tell her that I'll be along once I've had some time to recover."
G["At last... Freed from his cursed grasp!"]="At last... Freed from his cursed grasp!"
G["At last... now I can rest."]="Ao fim... Agora posso descansar."
G["At least enough so that you can prove yourself."]="pelo menos, até que possa demostrar o que vales."
G["At least make me work for it next time."]="At least make me work for it next time."
G["At least my pet died fighting valorously."]="Pelo menos minha mascote morreu lutando valorosamente."
G["At least now we have a fighting chance, thanks to you."]="Obrigado você agora ao menos temos uma oportunidade para lutar."
G["At least one Gilnean engineer works out of the Craftsmen's Terrace. She should be able to help you."]="At least one Gilnean engineer works out of the Craftsmen's Terrace. She should be able to help you."
G["At least the human prince is dead. King Wrynn now knows the price of his continued defiance."]="At least the human prince is dead. King Wrynn now knows the price of his continued defiance."
G["At least there are no electrified fences. Or trolls."]="Ao menos não há valhas electrificadas, nem trolls."
G["At least we know that Anduin is alive. Well done, $n. Now go speak to Elder Lusshan. He has been asking for you."]="Ao menos sabemos que Anduin está vivo. Bem feito, $n. Agora vê a falar com o ancestral Lusshan. Tem estado perguntando por você."
G["At least we wouldn't be around to have to clean it up."]="At least we wouldn't be around to have to clean it up."
G["At least ye didn't have to leave a wife back in Ironforge.  I can't imagine what she's up to without me around.  Ya ken how ladies are around ore."]="At least ye didn't have to leave a wife back in Ironforge.  I can't imagine what she's up to without me around.  Ya ken how ladies are around ore."
G["At least you didn't screw this batch up."]="Ao menos não e estropeado este lote."
G["At least... I die... with honor..."]="At least... I die... with honor..."
G["At least... Theralion dies with me..."]="Ao menos... Theralion morre comigo..."
G["At level 10 you will choose a Class Specialization.\nIf you later decide to choose a different Class Specialization, you may reset your previous choice here for a price.\nThis will become more expensive each additonal time you do so."]="At level 10 you will choose a Class Specialization.\nIf you later decide to choose a different Class Specialization, you may reset your previous choice here for a price.\nThis will become more expensive each additonal time you do so."
G["At level 15 you will choose your first Talent.\nIf you later decide to choose different Talents, you may reset your previous choices here for a price.\nThis will become more expensive each additonal time you do so."]="At level 15 you will choose your first Talent.\nIf you later decide to choose different Talents, you may reset your previous choices here for a price.\nThis will become more expensive each additonal time you do so."
G["At level 25 you will begin to use Glyphs.\nIf you later decide to replace your chosen Glyphs, you may reset them here for a price.\nThis will become more expensive each additonal time you do so."]="At level 25 you will begin to use Glyphs.\nIf you later decide to replace your chosen Glyphs, you may reset them here for a price.\nThis will become more expensive each additonal time you do so."
G["At level 30 you can learn Dual Specialization, which allows you to keep two active Class Specialization, Talent, and Glyph sets and easily switch between them.\nYou also will have separate glyph panes and action bars for each set.\nSwitching between the two sets cannot be done while in combat and will consume your available resources."]="At level 30 you can learn Dual Specialization, which allows you to keep two active Class Specialization, Talent, and Glyph sets and easily switch between them.\nYou also will have separate glyph panes and action bars for each set.\nSwitching between the two sets cannot be done while in combat and will consume your available resources."
G["At long last we have an opportunity to study the ruins that dot this landscape... Provided these moneygrubbers don't level the place first."]="Finalmente, temos a oportunidade de estudar as ruínas que pontilham essa paisagem... Desde que esses lavadores de dinheiro não nívelem o local primeiro."
G["At long last, I am home..."]="Ao fim estou em casa..."
G["At night, I see the faces of all those I have slain. Where do our spirits go after our bodies lay cold? I fear... death."]="At night, I see the faces of all those I have slain. Where do our spirits go after our bodies lay cold? I fear... death."
G["At once, Lord Zhu."]="Agora mesmo, lorde Zhu."
G["At once, my lady!"]="Agora mesmo, meu senhora!"
G["At once, my lady."]="At once, my lady."
G["At once, sir!  For the Horde!"]="At once, sir!  For the Horde!"
G["At once."]="Imediatamente."
G["At the appointed time, they will unleash fire elementals, consuming the city in flame and setting the stage for our master's glorious return!"]="At the appointed time, they will unleash fire elementals, consuming the city in flame and setting the stage for our master's glorious return!"
G["At the appointed time, they will unleash storm elementals, washing away the city and setting the stage for our master's glorious return!"]="At the appointed time, they will unleash storm elementals, washing away the city and setting the stage for our master's glorious return!"
G["At the appointed time, they will unleash wind and water elementals, engulfing the city in a tempest and setting the stage for our master's glorious return!"]="At the appointed time, they will unleash wind and water elementals, engulfing the city in a tempest and setting the stage for our master's glorious return!"
G["At the bell's toll it will be 10:00am. It's looking like there's gonna be more of the green poisonous cloud of death in today's weather forecast."]="At the bell's toll it will be 10:00am. It's looking like there's gonna be more of the green poisonous cloud of death in today's weather forecast."
G["At the bell's toll it will be 11:00am. I want to take this opportunity to welcome all you new murderous, twisted Horde to Venomspite! So welcome, on behalf of me and my brother, Brote."]="At the bell's toll it will be 11:00am. I want to take this opportunity to welcome all you new murderous, twisted Horde to Venomspite! So welcome, on behalf of me and my brother, Brote."
G["At the bell's toll it will be 12:00am. Midnight to all you scary Forsaken! OOoooo..."]="At the bell's toll it will be 12:00am. Midnight to all you scary Forsaken! OOoooo..."
G["At the bell's toll it will be 12:00pm. Noon for those of you that can't count. That's right, I'm looking at you, orcs."]="At the bell's toll it will be 12:00pm. Noon for those of you that can't count. That's right, I'm looking at you, orcs."
G["At the bell's toll it will be 1:00am. If I ever break free, I will tear this town apart!!!"]="At the bell's toll it will be 1:00am. If I ever break free, I will tear this town apart!!!"
G["At the bell's toll it will be 1:00pm. We're right in the middle of the lunch time rush! Your poisons, plagues, and noxious gases are delivered in 60 seconds or your order is free!"]="At the bell's toll it will be 1:00pm. We're right in the middle of the lunch time rush! Your poisons, plagues, and noxious gases are delivered in 60 seconds or your order is free!"
G["At the bell's toll it will be 2:00am. Coincidentally, a perfect time to kill me and end my misery."]="Quando suene a sino serão as dois da manhã. Curiosamente, um momento ideal para me matar e acabar com meu sofrimento."
G["At the bell's toll it will be 2:00pm. I want to take this opportunity to let you all know that Middleton's got a 2 for 1 sale going on right now! Buy 1 canister of his world famous poisonous biological agents and get the second free!"]="At the bell's toll it will be 2:00pm. I want to take this opportunity to let you all know that Middleton's got a 2 for 1 sale going on right now! Buy 1 canister of his world famous poisonous biological agents and get the second free!"
G["At the bell's toll it will be 3:00am. Time for bed!"]="At the bell's toll it will be 3:00am. Time for bed!"
G["At the bell's toll it will be 3:00pm. I think I soiled myself."]="Quando suene a sino serão as três da tarde. Acho que me e manchado."
G["At the bell's toll it will be 4:00am. Don't you people ever sleep?"]="At the bell's toll it will be 4:00am. Don't you people ever sleep?"
G["At the bell's toll it will be 4:00pm. That's HAPPY HOUR at Middleton's Apothecarium! Come on inside and get poisoned or gased or both for a mere 35 silver!"]="At the bell's toll it will be 4:00pm. That's HAPPY HOUR at Middleton's Apothecarium! Come on inside and get poisoned or gased or both for a mere 35 silver!"
G["At the bell's toll it will be 5:00am. End me!"]="At the bell's toll it will be 5:00am. End me!"
G["At the bell's toll it will be 5:00pm. To those that may have been keeping score, I did - in fact - soil myself."]="At the bell's toll it will be 5:00pm. To those that may have been keeping score, I did - in fact - soil myself."
G["At the bell's toll it will be 6:00am *yawn*. Rise and shine."]="At the bell's toll it will be 6:00am *yawn*. Rise and shine."
G["At the bell's toll it will be 6:00pm. Please kill my brother!"]="At the bell's toll it will be 6:00pm. Please kill my brother!"
G["At the bell's toll it will be 7:00am. Good morning to all you early risers!"]="Quando suene a sino serão as sete da manhã. Bons dias, madrugadores!"
G["At the bell's toll it will be 7:00pm. Another productive day at Venomspite comes to a close as night falls upon us."]="At the bell's toll it will be 7:00pm. Another productive day at Venomspite comes to a close as night falls upon us."
G["At the bell's toll it will be 8:00am. I'm sure you're all getting back from your morning jogs by now."]="At the bell's toll it will be 8:00am. I'm sure you're all getting back from your morning jogs by now."
G["At the bell's toll it will be 9:00am. It looks like another beautiful day in Dragonblight!"]="At the bell's toll it will be 9:00am. It looks like another beautiful day in Dragonblight!"
G["At the bell's toll it will be 9:00pm. Break time for me! I'll see you all in 4 hours. Unless one of you kills me in my sleep (please)."]="At the bell's toll it will be 9:00pm. Break time for me! I'll see you all in 4 hours. Unless one of you kills me in my sleep (please)."
G["At the bottom of the ocean even light must die."]="At the bottom of the ocean even light must die."
