G["Avoid or destroy Baldruc's Storm Totems."]="Evita ou destrói os totens de tempestade de Baldruc."
G["Avoid or destroy Gash'nul's Storm Totems."]="Avoid or destroy Gash'nul's Storm Totems."
G["Avoid taking unnecessary gambles. Your lucky numbers are two, two and half, and eleven-teen."]="Avoid taking unnecessary gambles. Your lucky numbers are two, two and half, and eleven-teen."
