G["Avoid the rotating frost burn effects, or you will take damage and lose a stack of Essence of Ice."]="Avoid the rotating frost burn effects, or you will take damage and lose a stack of Essence of Ice."
G["Avoid the shadow runes!"]="Evita as runas das Sombras!"
G["Avruu's magic is broken!  I'm free once again!"]="O feitiço de Avruu se tem front! Vuelvo a ser livre!"
G["Avruu's magic... it still controls me.  You must fight me, mortal.  It's the only way to break the spell!"]="O querida de Avruu... ainda me controla. Deve lutar comigo, mortal. É a única forma de quebrar o feitiço!"
G["Avuun dares to oppose me?!  I will crush him!  When I am done with the draenei, they'll wish that they were Lost Ones!"]="Avuun dares to oppose me?!  I will crush him!  When I am done with the draenei, they'll wish that they were Lost Ones!"
