G["Aw! The captured sprite darters didn't make it. What will we do?"]="Aw! The captured sprite darters didn't make it. What will we do?"
G["Aw, don't want to train with me? What other weapon catches your eye?"]="Ah, não quer treinar comigo? Que outra arma chama sua atenção?"
G["Aw, heck no. That's just how I make my beer.\n\nMuddy water, you see... it's got little bugs in it, that ferment your ale for you. Some folks use real yeast, grown in a fancy brewery under controlled conditions and what have you. I use muddy water.\n\nIt's kind of my thing.\n\nI guess I'm just not what you'd call \"cultured\"."]="Aw, heck no. That's just how I make my beer.\n\nMuddy water, you see... it's got little bugs in it, that ferment your ale for you. Some folks use real yeast, grown in a fancy brewery under controlled conditions and what have you. I use muddy water.\n\nIt's kind of my thing.\n\nI guess I'm just not what you'd call \"cultured\"."
