G["Away from me, mongrel!"]="Vá para longe de mim, verme!"
G["Away to Thunder Bluff to the north is where your journey takes you then friend.  Once there seek out the wisdom of one of the Bluffwatchers who can tell you directly where to find whom you seek."]="Longe para Thunder Bluff, ao norte, é onde sua jornada leva você, então amigo. Uma vez lá, procure a sabedoria de um dos Bluffwatchers que pode lhe dizer diretamente onde encontrar quem você procura."
G["Away with you, $c!\n\nOnly champions of Undercity may purchase what I have to offer."]="Largo de aqui, $c!\n\nSomente os Campeões de Cidade Baixa podem comprar o que tenho em venda."
G["Away! Leave us to suffer!"]="Vá embora! Déjanos a solas com nosso sofrimento!"
G["Away, creature of the depths!"]="Trás, criatura das profundezas!"
G["Away, vermin!"]="Away, vermin!"
G["Away, you fiends! Help!"]="Fora, demônios! Socorro!"
G["Away, you mindless parasites! My blood is my own!"]="Fora, parasitas estúpidos! Meu sangue me pertence!"
G["Away... go..."]="Fora... vá embora"
G["Awe inspiring, master. Your ineptitude is awe inspiring."]="Impressionante, mestre. Seu inaptidão é impressionante."
G["Awed by its power, the Thunder King described the instrument as \"the voice of the gods,\" and named it the Divine Bell."]="Impressionado com seu poder, o Rei Trovão descreveu o instrumento como \"a voz dos deuses\" e o chamou de \"Shenqing, o Sino Divino\"."
G["Awesome!"]="Genial!"
G["Awright then! My place is just around the corner."]="Muito bem! Meu casa está à volta da esquina."
G["Awtgsshu LWHUK iilth!"]="Awtgsshu LWHUK iilth!"
G["Aww Ruby, you're the best pet ever!"]="Ooh, Rubi, é a melhor ajudante que tem existido nunca!"
G["Aww yeah..."]="Oh, sim..."
G["Aww! So scared!"]="Oooh! Tan aterrorizado!"
G["Aww, Blanchy, don't worry, my brother in Westfall will take good care of you. I hear he's got a beautiful farm with lots of space for you to roam."]="Aww, Blanchy, don't worry, my brother in Westfall will take good care of you. I hear he's got a beautiful farm with lots of space for you to roam."
G["Aww, Budd. Now what'd ya go an' do that for?"]="Aaay, Budd, por que querrías ir e fazer isso?"
G["Aww, I told you take care of her. I poured my heart and soul into that thing, you know? Take it easy this time around."]="Oooh, te disse que a trataras com cuidado. Me e dedicado a essa coisa em corpo e alma, sabe? Esta vez tenha mais cuidado."
G["Aww, c'mon Beak. It weren't nothin' but a big ... tentacle thing. Donnelly will keep ya safe!"]="Aww, c'mon Beak. It weren't nothin' but a big ... tentacle thing. Donnelly will keep ya safe!"
G["Aww, dooker..."]="Ooh, dingue..."
G["Aww, man..."]="Jo!"
G["Aww, no... what have dey gone an' done to me rifle, mon!?"]="Oh, não... Que lhe têm feito a meu rifle, colega?"
G["Aww, not a snake!"]="Aww, not a snake!"
G["Aww, nuts! You've ruined everything!"]="Oh, tonto! O tem arruinado tudo!"
G["Aww, what rotten luck! My skills aren't good enough to be of any use to you. Oh well. Talk to Fimble Finespindle over there by the loom. He's been working with leather for longer than I have."]="Aww, que sorte podre! Minhas habilidades não são boas o suficiente para serem úteis para você. Ah bem. Fale com o Fimble Finespindle ali perto do tear. Ele trabalha com couro há mais tempo do que eu."
G["Aww, you two going be friends? Maybe find nice place in swamp and have very own medium-tongues? So sweet... stop being dumb now."]="Aww, you two going be friends? Maybe find nice place in swamp and have very own medium-tongues? So sweet... stop being dumb now."
G["Aww..."]="Oooh..."
G["Aww... look at the cute little snake, Nibbleh! Go ahead, let him nibble on your toes. Let's see what happens."]="Oh, olhem a esta monada de serpente: Níbilis! Vamos, deixem que se que a vocês. A ver que passa."
G["Awww Mom! It's hardly dark yet! Can we play for a bit longer please?"]="Awww Mom! It's hardly dark yet! Can we play for a bit longer please?"
G["Awww man not again."]="Jo, tio, outra vez não."
G["Awww shucks, I was gonna eat these! Well, if Ella needs 'em, I ain't gonna no more. Here, take 'em!"]="Ay, vá! Me os ia a comer eu... Bom, se Elaos precisa, já não me os como. Tome!"
G["Awww shucks. At this rate, I'll never get to join the Tiller's Union. Well, let me know if you ever change your mind."]="Awww shucks. At this rate, I'll never get to join the Tiller's Union. Well, let me know if you ever change your mind."
G["Awww! No fair!"]="Awwww! Não é justo!"
G["Awww, I knew you'd win! I'd better practice some more..."]="Awww, I knew you'd win! I'd better practice some more..."
G["Awww, we were just playing!"]="Joooo, somente estamos jogando!"
G["Awww, you should have won that one, Ace!"]="Ooh. Deveria haver ganhou, As!"
G["Awww..."]="Oooh..."
G["Awww...  They are hurt."]="Vá... estão feridos."
G["Awww... look at da purty lil' gool.\n\nJump, lil' gool! Jump!\n\nHa, ha, ha.... Attsa guud lil' gool."]="Awww... look at da purty lil' gool.\n\nJump, lil' gool! Jump!\n\nHa, ha, ha.... Attsa guud lil' gool."
G["Awww.... Hello little baby!"]="Oooh... Onda, pequenhines!"
G["Axe"]="Machado"
G["Axe too weak. Garfrost make better and CRUSH YOU."]="Axe too weak. Garfrost make better and CRUSH YOU."
G["Axes ready! The enemy approaches!"]="Machados preparadas! O inimigo se aproxima!"
G["Axes, picks, seed, nails, food, blankets, water... it's all there, waiting for you. I think you'll find my prices quite reasonable, too."]="Axes, picks, seed, nails, food, blankets, water... it's all there, waiting for you. I think you'll find my prices quite reasonable, too."
G["Axethrowers, hurl faster!"]="Lanzamachados, mais rápido!"
G["Aye $g lad : lass; are ye ready to head to Alterac Valley and give the Horde a taste o' what they been asking for?"]="Aye $g lad : lass; are ye ready to head to Alterac Valley and give the Horde a taste o' what they been asking for?"
G["Aye and thanks for letting me carry my own hand back to the priests that night."]="Aye and thanks for letting me carry my own hand back to the priests that night."
G["Aye aye sir! Immediately, sir!"]="Senhor, sim, senhor! Imediatamente, senhor!"
G["Aye aye!"]="Sim, senhor!"
G["Aye aye, Mr. Kowalski."]="Sim, sim, senhor Kowalski."
G["Aye aye, sir!"]="Sim, sim, senhor!"
G["Aye aye, sir."]="Senhor, sim, senhor."
G["Aye sure, just as long as we get to hit the arena right after!"]="Claro que sim, depois de terminar nossa tarefa!"
G["Aye there you go lad, your favorite brew."]="Aqui tem, rapaz, seu mistura favorito."
G["Aye! We're here to rescue you!"]="Aye! We're here to rescue you!"
G["Aye, $g lad:lass;. What can we be doin' fer yeh?"]="Aye, $g lad:lass;. What can we be doin' fer yeh?"
G["Aye, $gladdie:lass;, that be some fine gatherin' ye been doin. Keep it up!"]="Aye, $gladdie:lass;, that be some fine gatherin' ye been doin. Keep it up!"
G["Aye, Broland Galebeard, here in Kharanos, can get ya where ya want ta go."]="Aye, Broland Galebeard, here in Kharanos, can get ya where ya want ta go."
G["Aye, Commander; but I am little no more. I have come to find my father. Have you any news as to his whereabouts? I know that he still lives. I have seen it in my dreams..."]="Aye, Commander; but I am little no more. I have come to find my father. Have you any news as to his whereabouts? I know that he still lives. I have seen it in my dreams..."
G["Aye, Fandral, remember these words: Let not your grief guide your faith. These thoughts you hold... dark places you go, night elf. Absolution cannot be had through misguided vengeance."]="Aye, Fandral, remember these words: Let not your grief guide your faith. These thoughts you hold... dark places you go, night elf. Absolution cannot be had through misguided vengeance."
G["Aye, Genn.  It is not law that binds us.  It is something far stronger.  My men are ready to give their lives under your command."]="Aye, Genn.  It is not law that binds us.  It is something far stronger.  My men are ready to give their lives under your command."
G["Aye, I could tell just by looking at you, $n. You remind me very much of myself as a young warrior of the Horde.\n\nYou will undoubtedly go far in life and even further in death.\n\n<Goretooth salutes.>"]="Aye, I could tell just by looking at you, $n. You remind me very much of myself as a young warrior of the Horde.\n\nYou will undoubtedly go far in life and even further in death.\n\n<Goretooth salutes.>"
G["Aye, I did. Much to the dismay of the lesser Mograine, I made my way back to the Scarlet Monastery. I shouted and screamed. I told the tale to any that would listen. And I would be murdered in cold blood for my actions, dragged to this chamber - the dark secret of the order. But some did listen... some heard my words. Thus was born the Argent Dawn..."]="Aye, I did. Much to the dismay of the lesser Mograine, I made my way back to the Scarlet Monastery. I shouted and screamed. I told the tale to any that would listen. And I would be murdered in cold blood for my actions, dragged to this chamber - the dark secret of the order. But some did listen... some heard my words. Thus was born the Argent Dawn..."
G["Aye, I know. I watched him turn... I watched him give up all that was right and I didn't lift a hand... I didn't even consider it until it was too late."]="Aye, I know. I watched him turn... I watched him give up all that was right and I didn't lift a hand... I didn't even consider it until it was too late."
G["Aye, I seen 'im fight. He's an orc - big as they come. Lost a week's wages bettin' against that one. Won't make that mistake again!"]="Aye, I seen 'im fight. He's an orc - big as they come. Lost a week's wages bettin' against that one. Won't make that mistake again!"
G["Aye, I will gather my pack... we..."]="Aye, I will gather my pack... we..."
G["Aye, I would love ta teach ye a thing or two about smithing. Grab an apron and a hammer and let's see what we can accomplish shall we?"]="Sim, eu adoraria ensinar uma coisa ou duas sobre ferreiro. Pegue um avental e um martelo e vamos ver o que podemos fazer, não é?"
G["Aye, I'll go, but I'll go when I'm good an' ready..."]="Sim, irei, mas quando estiver pronto..."
G["Aye, I'll try it."]="Aye, I'll try it."
G["Aye, I'm ready to smash some Horde ships to splinters!"]="Sim, estou pronto para reduzir a astilhas uns quantos barcos da Horda!"
G["Aye, I've battled them as well. We are ill-prepared as a kingdom to withstand such an assault."]="Sim, também e lutado contra eles. Como reino, estamos mal preparados para resistir tal ataque."
G["Aye, Remulos. Prepare the mortal races."]="Eh, Remulos. Prepara às raças mortais."
G["Aye, an no squealing youngster to upset the peace of a man and his fish..."]="Aye, an no squealing youngster to upset the peace of a man and his fish..."
G["Aye, and a damn fine job she did of it! But not as good as the Admiral."]="Sim, e fez um grande trabalho! Mas não tão bom como o almirante."
G["Aye, and it runs in the family.  The Digsongs have always had buoyancy issues, I'm afraid."]="Sim, e isso acontece na família. Os Digsongs sempre tiveram problemas de flutuabilidade, receio."
G["Aye, and so will we!"]="Sim, e nós também!"
G["Aye, and which battleground be ye looking for?"]="Sim, e qual campo de batalha você procura?"
G["Aye, as will I."]="Sim, eu também."
G["Aye, aye, sir!"]="Sim, sim, senhor!"
G["Aye, aye, sir.  Right away!"]="Sim, senhor! Agora mesmo!"
G["Aye, be safe Muradin. I'd join you, but I'm on top of the most amazing discovery the world has yet seen. I can't abandon it now."]="Aye, be safe Muradin. I'd join you, but I'm on top of the most amazing discovery the world has yet seen. I can't abandon it now."
G["Aye, but I know it by its true name - Eldre'Thalas.  It was a bastion of magical power for the night elves many, many years ago.\n\nYou know of Eldre'Thalas, young one?  One might say that is coincidental to my current plight... but I am one not to believe in coincidence."]="Aye, but I know it by its true name - Eldre'Thalas.  It was a bastion of magical power for the night elves many, many years ago.\n\nYou know of Eldre'Thalas, young one?  One might say that is coincidental to my current plight... but I am one not to believe in coincidence."
G["Aye, captain!"]="Sim, Capitão!"
G["Aye, everyone wants to ride the tram, it's a real hoot and a half.  Well, if ye want to find the tram, it's located over in Tinker Town just east of the gates of Ironforge."]="Sim, tudo mundo quer andar de bonde, é uma verdadeira piada e meia. Bem, se você quiser encontrar o bonde, ele está localizado na cidade de Tinker, a leste dos portões de Ironforge."
G["Aye, friend. How fare the Wildhammer clans? We've much to discuss!"]="Aye, friend. How fare the Wildhammer clans? We've much to discuss!"
G["Aye, general!"]="Sim, geral!"
G["Aye, he had done what was thought to be impossible. Out from the fissure sprung an agent of Therazane!\n\nFrom my vantage point, I could see the goblin holding conversation with the agent of the Old God. What happened after that was terrible..."]="Aye, he had done what was thought to be impossible. Out from the fissure sprung an agent of Therazane!\n\nFrom my vantage point, I could see the goblin holding conversation with the agent of the Old God. What happened after that was terrible..."
G["Aye, if only every day was just like today...."]="Sim, tomara todos os dias fossem como hoje..."
G["Aye, it appears as if ye have learned quite a bit, I'm impressed. But do ye know how many I have that seek to be my apprentice? Tell ye what, do a small task fer me and I'll take ye on."]="Aye, it appears as if ye have learned quite a bit, I'm impressed. But do ye know how many I have that seek to be my apprentice? Tell ye what, do a small task fer me and I'll take ye on."
G["Aye, it's a cold one today, but ne'er too cold to offer you my fine wares!"]="Vá, que frio há hoje, mas não importa, aqui estou eu com meus estupendas mercadorias!"
G["Aye, its still broken. Can't afford to buy a new one though."]="Aye, its still broken. Can't afford to buy a new one though."
G["Aye, lad. He tried to use an old titan ritual to keep his people safe, but this is what it did to him."]="Sim, amigo. Intentó usar um antigo ritual dos titãs para manter a salvou ao seu povo, e isto é o que lhe fez a ele."
G["Aye, lads!  Things are about to get quite ugly."]="Eh, Soldados! Isto se vai colocar bastante feio."
G["Aye, let's teach this addle-brained gnome a lesson!"]="Aye, let's teach this addle-brained gnome a lesson!"
G["Aye, my brawlin' days are over.  Nowadays, I fill my time with fancy ale and not-so-fancy lasses."]="Aye, my brawlin' days are over.  Nowadays, I fill my time with fancy ale and not-so-fancy lasses."
G["Aye, protect the tank while the boys make repairs! I'll try to get her moving again..."]="Aye, protect the tank while the boys make repairs! I'll try to get her moving again..."
G["Aye, she's a beaut alright. And you parked her right next to my frigate! *hic*"]="Sim, sim que é uma beleza. E a tem aparcado ao lado de meu fragata! *hic*"
G["Aye, sir!"]="Sim, senhor!"
G["Aye, solja! Lift off time!"]="Sim, soldado! Despegamos!"
G["Aye, tell your friend there Tongus if he dont take care of his tab here, i'll be making an appearance with old Steelhead!"]="Muito bem, diga ao seu amigo Tongus que se não se encarga do seu conta, irei a verle com o velho Cabeça de Aço!"
G["Aye, that'll do it! They'll come runnin' once they see the reward we've put up!"]="Sim, isso servirá! Vendrán correndo assim que vean a recompensa que temos colgado!"
G["Aye, that's her name, and a fine ship she is.\n\nThere's much to learn from such vessels, you know. A great poet once said: Ships that pass in the night, and speak each other in passing, only a signal shown, and a distant voice in the darkness; So on the ocean of life, we pass and speak one another, only a look and a voice, then darkness again and a silence."]="Aye, that's her name, and a fine ship she is.\n\nThere's much to learn from such vessels, you know. A great poet once said: Ships that pass in the night, and speak each other in passing, only a signal shown, and a distant voice in the darkness; So on the ocean of life, we pass and speak one another, only a look and a voice, then darkness again and a silence."
G["Aye, that's how the hammer falls, gents!"]="Sim, assim é como se manejao martelo, cavaleiros!"
G["Aye, that's true. Uther - now there's a real hero for the people."]="Sim, isso é certo. Uther – esse sim que é um autêntico herói para o povo."
G["Aye, the Highlord Mograine: A founder of the original order of the Scarlet Crusade. A knight of unwavering faith and purity; Mograine would be betrayed by his own son and slain by Kel'Thuzad's forces inside Stratholme. It is how I ended up here..."]="Aye, the Highlord Mograine: A founder of the original order of the Scarlet Crusade. A knight of unwavering faith and purity; Mograine would be betrayed by his own son and slain by Kel'Thuzad's forces inside Stratholme. It is how I ended up here..."
G["Aye, the quilboar are a foul lot."]="Sim, os jabaespines são repugnantes."
G["Aye, they was getting' a wee handsy, so I took care of it. C'mon then, I'm done here."]="Aye, they was getting' a wee handsy, so I took care of it. C'mon then, I'm done here."
G["Aye, what need ye?"]="Sim, o que você precisa?"
G["Aye, ya never know who's gunna join next, or who be dyin' next for that matter.\n\nMy advice? Don't be gettin' too attached to anyone."]="Sim, nunca se sabe quem vai ser o seguinte em entrar, ou o seguinte em morrer.\n\nMeu conselho? Não te encarinhes com ninguém."
G["Aye, you look the type to be a leader.  Here to organize a guild to fight for the Alliance?"]="Sim, você parece o tipo de líder. Aqui para organizar uma aliança para lutar pela Aliança?"
G["Aye, you mean the one you caused?"]="Sim, te refieres à que tem provocado?"
G["Aye, you there!  If you want to earn the respect of the Darkspear, then you can start by donating valuable resources for those in need!  Textiles and bandages don't grow on trees, ya know.\n\nRather than cash in various cloth pieces you find adventuring, donate them!  Doing so will earn you the recognition of the Darkspear!"]="Aye, you there!  If you want to earn the respect of the Darkspear, then you can start by donating valuable resources for those in need!  Textiles and bandages don't grow on trees, ya know.\n\nRather than cash in various cloth pieces you find adventuring, donate them!  Doing so will earn you the recognition of the Darkspear!"
G["Aye, you there!  If you want to earn the respect of the dwarves of Ironforge, then you can start by donating valuable resources!  Ironforge finds itself running low on cloth piece; textiles and bandages don't grow on trees, ya know!\n\nRather than cash in various cloth pieces you find adventuring, donate them!  Doing so will earn you the recognition of the dwarven people of Ironforge!"]="Aye, you there!  If you want to earn the respect of the dwarves of Ironforge, then you can start by donating valuable resources!  Ironforge finds itself running low on cloth piece; textiles and bandages don't grow on trees, ya know!\n\nRather than cash in various cloth pieces you find adventuring, donate them!  Doing so will earn you the recognition of the dwarven people of Ironforge!"
G["Aye-aye, sir!"]="Sim, senhor!"
G["Aye-aye, sir.  Heavin' to and returnin' back t' shore."]="Aye-aye, sir.  Heavin' to and returnin' back t' shore."
G["Aye."]="Sim."
G["Aye. ARRRRRRGHHHH... He... He is coming. You... You must..."]="Isso é. ARRRRRRGHHHH... Se... Aproxima. Você… você deve..."
G["Aye. I am loath to send my men into that. It reeks of ambush and bloody disaster."]="Sim. Ódio ter que enviar ali a meus homens. Me sinto o cheiro uma emboscada e uma carnificina."
G["Aye. I was here when the dragon attacked."]="Sim. Eu estava aqui quando atacó o dragão."
G["Aye. It's been twisted and turned by too many spells. The fuss we - especially you - made with the portal was too much! The same spell that sent the Burning Legion back into their foul realm now works on the well! It's devouring itself and taking its surroundings with it! Fascinating, isn't it?"]="Aye. It's been twisted and turned by too many spells. The fuss we - especially you - made with the portal was too much! The same spell that sent the Burning Legion back into their foul realm now works on the well! It's devouring itself and taking its surroundings with it! Fascinating, isn't it?"
G["Aye. Thank you, Kurdran."]="Sim. Obrigado, Kurdran."
G["Aye. Tonight."]="Sim. Esta noite."
G["Ayep! She's all mine... I'm gonna sail her around the world. Across the sea!"]="Ayep! She's all mine... I'm gonna sail her around the world. Across the sea!"
G["Aysa and Ji have retrieved the spirits and brought them here. You are to go with them, speak to the great Shen-zin Su, and do what must be done to save our people."]="Aysa e Ji têm trazido aos espíritos. Deve ir com eles, falar com o augusto Shen-zin Seu e fazer o que seja necessário para superando a nosso povo."
G["Aysa sighs."]="Aysa suspira."
G["Aysa, I want you to go to the Singing Pools to find Shu, the spirit of water."]="Aysa, vá às Poços Cantarinas à procura de Shu, o espírito da água."
G["Aysa, this is our only option. We blow the ship free, then we heal his wound. We have no other solution."]="Aysa, this is our only option. We blow the ship free, then we heal his wound. We have no other solution."
G["Aysa? I don't know what to say to her. Should I tell her she's gorgeous, or would she find that creepy? Maybe I could tell her I admire her poise - but then she might think I don't have any personality!"]="Aysa? I don't know what to say to her. Should I tell her she's gorgeous, or would she find that creepy? Maybe I could tell her I admire her poise - but then she might think I don't have any personality!"
G["Ayup! Silly youngin, just put rod in hole. And the mallet shall again be whole."]="Siiim! Jovem $ggalerito:galerete;, é só colocar o bastão no buraquinho, que o treco vai ficar novinho, novinho!"
G["Ayup, word got around fast and soon the whole of Menethil gathered around to see it through, with bettin' and fruit vendors and the like, an' there were some consternation over the rules that had to be ironed out with a big rigamarole, 'til the mayor hisself agreed that weepin' blood tain't count fer nothin'.\n\nSo Chuck kneels down an' she gets up on a stool and REARS back with that big 'ol thick leg of hers and - but I'm digressin'. Point is, I shoulda taken the deal, 'cuz this gun's a bit dodgy."]="Ayup, word got around fast and soon the whole of Menethil gathered around to see it through, with bettin' and fruit vendors and the like, an' there were some consternation over the rules that had to be ironed out with a big rigamarole, 'til the mayor hisself agreed that weepin' blood tain't count fer nothin'.\n\nSo Chuck kneels down an' she gets up on a stool and REARS back with that big 'ol thick leg of hers and - but I'm digressin'. Point is, I shoulda taken the deal, 'cuz this gun's a bit dodgy."
G["Azeroth has been assaulted from forces beyond this plane of existence..."]="Azeroth foi atacado por forças provenientes de além deste plano de existência..."
G["Azeroth has cowered too long under our shadow!  Now, feel the power of the Burning Crusade and despair!"]="Azeroth has cowered too long under our shadow!  Now, feel the power of the Burning Crusade and despair!"
G["Azeroth has many strange traditions. This one, I like."]="Azeroth tem muitas tradições estranhas. Esta me gosta."
G["Azeroth has no place for the likes of you."]="Em Azeroth não há lugar para seres como você."
G["Azeroth has no place for you!"]="Azeroth não tem lugar para você!"
G["Azeroth is coming to an end. Make your peace now!"]="Azeroth is coming to an end. Make your peace now!"
G["Azeroth lives to see another day!"]="Azeroth vive para ver um novo dia!"
G["Azeroth will be reforged under a single banner!"]="Volveremos a forjar Azeroth baixo um único estandarte!"
G["Azeroth will burn!"]="Azeroth arderá!"
G["Azsharite Core at 60 percent integrity..."]="O núcleo de azsharita está ao 60 por cento de integridade..."
G["Azsharite? You soft ones come up with new names for everything. What is this \"azsharite?\""]="Azsharita? Vocês, moles, criam novos nomes para tudo. O que é isso \"azsharite?\""
G["Azure Dragonshrine"]="Santuário Dragônico Lazúli"
G["Azure Templar!  I hold your crest of beckoning.  Heed my summons!"]="Templário do Azure! Eu certo sua crista de acenar. Preste atenção na minha convocação!"
G["Azuregos! I remember him. Tall, blue, big fangs. Nice sort really, if a little loopy. Haven't seen him in weeks."]="Azuregos! I remember him. Tall, blue, big fangs. Nice sort really, if a little loopy. Haven't seen him in weeks."
G["Azzaga choogo zinn!"]="Azzaga choogo zinn!"
G["B-but it's my family farm. I can't just sell it."]="B-but it's my family farm. I can't just sell it."
G["B-gawkk!!"]="B-gawkk!!"
G["BACK to the earth with you!"]="BACK to the earth with you!"
G["BAD WORM! THAT'S A BAD BAD BAD WORM!"]="VERME RUIM! É UM VERME MUITO, MUITO RUIM!"
G["BAD, BAD, ALLIANCE!"]="MAL, ALIANÇA, MAL!"
G["BAD, BAD, HORDIE!"]="MAL, HORDA MAL!"
G["BAH! You gnats actually hurt me... Perhaps I've toyed with you long enough... Now - taste the VENGEANCE OF THE GRAVE!"]="BAH! You gnats actually hurt me... Perhaps I've toyed with you long enough... Now - taste the VENGEANCE OF THE GRAVE!"
G["BAH! Your shadows frighten no one, Bastoon. This one is mine."]="BAH! Your shadows frighten no one, Bastoon. This one is mine."
G["BAM!"]="BAM!"
