G["Back at the barracks, I heard murmurings of this \"sha.\"\n\nYou should have heard the crazy stories - sha possessing our strongest troops? Simply tales to scare children.\n\nThe sha are nothing that I and my sisters cannot handle."]="Back at the barracks, I heard murmurings of this \"sha.\"\n\nYou should have heard the crazy stories - sha possessing our strongest troops? Simply tales to scare children.\n\nThe sha are nothing that I and my sisters cannot handle."
G["Back behind me, where you first came in, there is a large thermal vent, blowing hot air up and out of this place. Stand on top of the vent, and then... jump! The momentum from your leap should be enough to propel you up to the top.\n\nOh, one more thing - based on some reports I'm hearing from fellow druids, make sure you watch your head on the way out."]="Back behind me, where you first came in, there is a large thermal vent, blowing hot air up and out of this place. Stand on top of the vent, and then... jump! The momentum from your leap should be enough to propel you up to the top.\n\nOh, one more thing - based on some reports I'm hearing from fellow druids, make sure you watch your head on the way out."
G["Back for more? Fights are only going to get tougher from here on out."]="Que mais? A partir de agoraos combate serão cada vez mais difíceis."
