G["Bah, it's not here.  I wonder where I left it last..."]="Bah, it's not here.  I wonder where I left it last..."
G["Bah, let a pandaren hope, would you?  I'm going to miss the old man."]="Bah, de que suenhe um pouco, vale? Vou dar de menos ao velho."
