G["Bartlett the Brave has set up gryphon roosts here in town.  If you're looking to take a ride, then talk to him."]="Bartlett o Corajoso tem montado uma percha de grifos na cidade. Se você precisa ir a alguma parte, melhor fala com ele."
G["Based on the sample of the toxin you provided for us, we think you will need the following: an arcane quickener, five somatic intensifiers, and and four pieces of runecloth.  With the vitreous focuser in tow, acquire the intensifiers from zombie or ghoul undead here in the Plaguelands!\n\nOnce you have these items, you should be able to load the counter agent into that cauldron."]="Based on the sample of the toxin you provided for us, we think you will need the following: an arcane quickener, five somatic intensifiers, and and four pieces of runecloth.  With the vitreous focuser in tow, acquire the intensifiers from zombie or ghoul undead here in the Plaguelands!\n\nOnce you have these items, you should be able to load the counter agent into that cauldron."
G["Based on the sample of the toxin you provided for us, we think you will need the following: an arcane quickener, four ectoplasmic resonators, and four pieces of runecloth.  With the vitreous focuser in tow, acquire the resonators from wraith and ghostly undead here in the Plaguelands!\n\nOnce you have these items, you should be able to load the counter agent into that cauldron."]="Based on the sample of the toxin you provided for us, we think you will need the following: an arcane quickener, four ectoplasmic resonators, and four pieces of runecloth.  With the vitreous focuser in tow, acquire the resonators from wraith and ghostly undead here in the Plaguelands!\n\nOnce you have these items, you should be able to load the counter agent into that cauldron."
G["Based on the sample of the toxin you provided for us, we think you will need the following: an arcane quickener, six osseous agitators, and four pieces of runecloth.  With the vitreous focuser in tow, acquire the agitators from skeletal undead here in the Plaguelands!\n\nOnce you have these items, you should be able to load the counter agent into that cauldron."]="Based on the sample of the toxin you provided for us, we think you will need the following: an arcane quickener, six osseous agitators, and four pieces of runecloth.  With the vitreous focuser in tow, acquire the agitators from skeletal undead here in the Plaguelands!\n\nOnce you have these items, you should be able to load the counter agent into that cauldron."
