G["Bask in the opulence of my people! Let yourself taste the fineries of living, if only this one time. Perhaps then may you die with finality, knowing that you have been touched by the hands of a god!\n\nMay you drink in the spittle that is sure to fly in your direction from disapproving blood elf - man, woman and child alike. Drink it down! Drink. It. DOWN!\n\nTo Silvermoon with you, barbarian!"]="Bask in the opulence of my people! Let yourself taste the fineries of living, if only this one time. Perhaps then may you die with finality, knowing that you have been touched by the hands of a god!\n\nMay you drink in the spittle that is sure to fly in your direction from disapproving blood elf - man, woman and child alike. Drink it down! Drink. It. DOWN!\n\nTo Silvermoon with you, barbarian!"
