G["Be careful - he is coming for you!"]="Cuidado! Vai por você!"
G["Be careful among the ruins, $c. The Kirin Tor spirits you find there will not recognize you as a friend.\n\nThe custodian and I are the only ones whose spirits retained a strong enough tie to this place to preserve our full identities in death."]="Be careful among the ruins, $c. The Kirin Tor spirits you find there will not recognize you as a friend.\n\nThe custodian and I are the only ones whose spirits retained a strong enough tie to this place to preserve our full identities in death."
G["Be careful around my hawk. She's a biter."]="Tenha cuidado com meu machado, que muerde."
