G["Be careful going into the thicket, $c.  There is a harmful aura lingering about the place.  It must be the residue from whatever destroyed my fellow druids."]="Be careful going into the thicket, $c.  There is a harmful aura lingering about the place.  It must be the residue from whatever destroyed my fellow druids."
G["Be careful in the vale, $n. Enemies abound!"]="Tenha cuidado na vega, $n. Há inimigos por todas partes!"
