G["Be careful out in the desert, $c."]="Tenha cuidado no deserto, $c."
G["Be careful out there, $n.  You don't want to be on that ship too long... a few more cannonballs and she'll be sunk."]="Be careful out there, $n.  You don't want to be on that ship too long... a few more cannonballs and she'll be sunk."
G["Be careful out there.\nAside from all the gigantic beasts, there's an enemy camp on the other end of this beach."]="Tenha cuidado aí fosse.\n\nAlém das beast gigantes, há um acampamento inimigo no outro extremo desta praia."
G["Be careful out there. I heard that there are Southsea pirates in the bay.\n\nHmm, maybe I should go check for myself..."]="Be careful out there. I heard that there are Southsea pirates in the bay.\n\nHmm, maybe I should go check for myself..."
