G["Be on your guard. The Unga Ingoo Pirates are a fearsome lot. But they make a fine brew!"]="Não bagens a guarda. Os piratas de Ungá Ingô são temibles. Mas fazem um mistura magnífico!"
G["Be on your guard. We are Theramore's first line of defense against its many enemies in the marsh."]="Esteja em guarda. Somos a primeira linha de defesa de Theramore contra seus muitos inimigos no pântano."
G["Be one with your serpent, $n. Perceive your serpent's experiences as your own and strengthen your bond."]="Be one with your serpent, $n. Perceive your serpent's experiences as your own and strengthen your bond."
G["Be patient with Shu. He acts as if a child, but he is quite ancient, and quite powerful."]="Tenha paciência com Shu. Actúa como um ninho, mas é bastante maior, e muito poderoso."
G["Be patient, $n. The torch is almost complete."]="Be patient, $n. The torch is almost complete."
G["Be patient, Li Li. If we explore Pandaria too quickly, we will quickly run out of Pandaria to explore."]="Tenha paciência, Li Li. Se exploramos Pandaria demais rápido, nos quedaremos sem Pandaria que explorar."
G["Be patient, citizens. Yelling at us won't change anything."]="Be patient, citizens. Yelling at us won't change anything."
G["Be prepared. Today, we will teach the quilboar much regret, sorrow, and fear, in the name of our Greatmother."]="Be prepared. Today, we will teach the quilboar much regret, sorrow, and fear, in the name of our Greatmother."
G["Be proud, dragon. Today you fall to the blade of Azeroth's greatest hero. And also to my blade."]="Be proud, dragon. Today you fall to the blade of Azeroth's greatest hero. And also to my blade."
G["Be proud, your brain will be put to good use in one of my abominations."]="Be proud, your brain will be put to good use in one of my abominations."
G["Be purified by steel!"]="O aço te purificará!"
G["Be purified in the light!"]="Que a luz os purifique!"
G["Be quick about it."]="Seja rápido sobre isso."
G["Be quick on your feet - that is no ordinary Zandalari!"]="Não bagens a guarda. Esse não é um Zandalari qualquer."
G["Be quick with those charges.  Some of those demons are going to take more than one direct hit to bring down."]="Date pressa com essas cargas. Um somente tiro direto não vai ser suficiente para derrubar a algum de estes demônios."
G["Be quick! We must not be seen together."]="Rápido! Não devem vernos juntos."
G["Be quiet 'bout what you hear and see around here, $r."]="Guarda silêncio sobre o que oigas e veas aqui, $r."
G["Be quiet!  Can't you see the master is speaking?"]="Fique quieto! Você não vê que o mestre está falando?"
G["Be quiet."]="Silêncio."
G["Be ready for anything, $n."]="Prepare-se para qualquer coisa, $n."
G["Be ready for anything, $n. We may have to use force against our own men."]="Be ready for anything, $n. We may have to use force against our own men."
G["Be ready my brothers!  We shall make our way thru the Dark Portal and all of Azeroth shall fall!"]="Preparem-se, irmãos! Nos abriremos caminho pelo Portal Sombrio e toda Azeroth cairá!"
G["Be ready to advance on the enemy.  We will soon launch an all out assault on the Betrayer."]="Be ready to advance on the enemy.  We will soon launch an all out assault on the Betrayer."
G["Be ready to dogfight in the air. Jump from mount to mount if you have to!"]="Prepare-se para o combate aéreo. Salta a outra montaria se é necessário!"
G["Be ready to fight if we draw too much attention."]="Haverá que lutar se chamamos muito a atenção."
G["Be ready! The ground shakes and the fires burn hotter! Get out if ya still can!"]="Be ready! The ground shakes and the fires burn hotter! Get out if ya still can!"
G["Be ready! They'll charge any moment now."]="Be ready! They'll charge any moment now."
G["Be ready, $n. I hear the council returning. Prepare to ambush!"]="Prepare-se, $n. Oigo ao conselho que retorna. Prontos para tender a emboscada!"
G["Be really careful, Mr. D. If you see a big group of gnomes, use your magnetic pull! Once you've got 'em all sucked up, launch 'em to their death! YAY!"]="Be really careful, Mr. D. If you see a big group of gnomes, use your magnetic pull! Once you've got 'em all sucked up, launch 'em to their death! YAY!"
G["Be really careful, Mr. P. If you see a big group of goblins, use your magnetic pull! Once you've got 'em all sucked up, launch 'em to their death! YAY!"]="Be really careful, Mr. P. If you see a big group of goblins, use your magnetic pull! Once you've got 'em all sucked up, launch 'em to their death! YAY!"
G["Be reasonable! You cannot hope to stop the Burning Legion! Let us discuss this in a civilized manner. I can offer you power beyond your wildest dreams!"]="Be reasonable! You cannot hope to stop the Burning Legion! Let us discuss this in a civilized manner. I can offer you power beyond your wildest dreams!"
G["Be right with ya, mon..."]="Be right with ya, mon..."
G["Be safe, $n."]="Cuídate, $n."
G["Be safe, $n. Remember, the Horde are also seeking the dragon bones. It might be easier to kill them than to kill the shades."]="Be safe, $n. Remember, the Horde are also seeking the dragon bones. It might be easier to kill them than to kill the shades."
G["Be safe, Antonio."]="Cuídate, Antonio."
G["Be seared with the shadow!"]="Abrásate com as sombras!"
G["Be seein' ya back at Crushblow."]="Não' vemos em Machacolpe."
G["Be silenced, Sunreaver!"]="Calha para sempre, Atracasol!"
G["Be silent!  Do you think our plagued dragons will hatch and train themselves?"]="Fique em silencio! Você acha que nossos dragões atormentados vão chocar e se treinar?"
G["Be silent!  I cannot afford to miss even a moment of this lecture!"]="Fique em silencio! Não posso me dar ao luxo de perder nem um momento desta palestra!"
G["Be silent! Damn you, spirits!"]="Be silent! Damn you, spirits!"
G["Be silent! The shattering is soon to come!"]="Silenciar! Agora chega a destruição!"
G["Be slain by me, villainous cretin!"]="Be slain by me, villainous cretin!"
G["Be steadfast, champion. I know why it is that you are here and I know what it is that you seek. Eranikus will not give up the shard freely. He has been twisted... twisted by the same force that you seek to destroy."]="Incorpórate, por favor. Sei por que tem vindo e sei o que andas procurando. Erânicos não dará a você o fragmento de bom grau. Está corrupto... corrupto pelas mesmas forças que você pretendes destruir."
G["Be still!"]="Be still!"
G["Be still, friend, and behold da truth of things!"]="Be still, friend, and behold da truth of things!"
G["Be still, little one, and you can hear this ancient land speak. It cries out in pain."]="Fique quieto, pequenino, e poderá ouvir esta terra antiga falar. Chora de dor."
G["Be still, mortals, and hearken to my words."]="Quietos, mortais e escutem meus palavras."
G["Be still, my love. Calm your mind. You became a slave to your duty. But being true to your heart is how you'll fulfill that duty... to your people... and to me."]="Be still, my love. Calm your mind. You became a slave to your duty. But being true to your heart is how you'll fulfill that duty... to your people... and to me."
G["Be still."]="Não te muevas."
G["Be strong, $n!"]="Sei forte, $n!"
G["Be strong, Fizzule!"]="Sei forte, Burbujita!"
G["Be strong, Neeka. I will watch over you..."]="Be strong, Neeka. I will watch over you..."
G["Be strong, friend. Do what must be done..."]="Sei forte, colega. Faça o que é preciso fazer..."
G["Be strong, warriors! Keep the hozen at bay!"]="Be strong, warriors! Keep the hozen at bay!"
G["Be strong.\n\nBe vicious.\n\nKill more than you can eat.\n\nMake no friends, and take no pets.\n\nDie fighting.\n\nThese, and many more, are lessons we can learn from Kroshik."]="Sei forte.\n\nSei cruel.\n\nMatar mais do que possa comer.\n\nNão faça amigos e não tenha ajudantes.\n\nMorre lutando.\n\nEstas e outras lições as podemos aprender de Kroshik."
G["Be strong. Kael'thas has betrayed us and what we know is in flux, but do not lose heart. We will endure, as we always have. Arthas did not crush our spirit when he swept through our land, and neither will Kael'thas. Let it serve as a lesson to us all as we move forward to our prosperous future."]="Seja forte. Kael'thas nos traiu e o que sabemos está em fluxo, mas não desanimamos. Nós vamos suportar, como sempre. Arthas não esmagou nosso espírito quando ele varreu nossa terra, e Kael'thas também não. Que sirva de lição para todos nós, à medida que avançamos em direção ao nosso futuro próspero."
G["Be sure to catch all the amazing sights and wonders of the Darkmoon Faire when it comes to town!"]="Não deixe de pegar todas as incríveis vistas e maravilhas da Darkmoon Faire quando se trata da cidade!"
G["Be sure to check in with my son Marley at the digsite. He's a good kid - my eyes and ears over at Bael Modan."]="Certifique-se de verificar com meu filho Marley no local da escavação. Ele é um bom garoto - meus olhos e atenção no Bael Modan."
G["Be sure to fill out all included paperwork during your flight!"]="Be sure to fill out all included paperwork during your flight!"
G["Be sure to go through the southern canyon when entering and exiting the shrine, $n. You will know the canyons where the battle is waged by the abominations that guard them... keep your distance."]="Be sure to go through the southern canyon when entering and exiting the shrine, $n. You will know the canyons where the battle is waged by the abominations that guard them... keep your distance."
G["Be sure to keep an eye out for recruitment posters in Gobland. Once we get that operation under way, it would be good to have you on board again."]="Be sure to keep an eye out for recruitment posters in Gobland. Once we get that operation under way, it would be good to have you on board again."
G["Be sure to read over the notes in my journal, $n. You will find them to be invaluable in overcoming the tower's defenses."]="Certifique-se de voltar a ler as notas de meu diário, $n. Te darás conta do valiosos que são à hora de franquear as defesas da torre."
G["Be sure to speak with the Lord Regent. He's waiting for you at the prow."]="Não esqueça falar com o Senhor regente. Te espera na proa."
G["Be sure to stick around for the next firework show!  Starting at 6PM, they're every hour on the hour!"]="Não deixe de ficar no próximo show de fogos de artifício! A partir das 18:00, estão a cada hora!"
G["Be sure to stop by again soon!"]="Não te esqueça de voltar pronto!"
G["Be sure to stop by and see me again, $c!"]="Certifique-se de voltar a passar por aqui, $c!"
G["Be sure to stop by the bridges southeast of town. You should be able to secure a nightsaber to get you down to the ruins."]="Be sure to stop by the bridges southeast of town. You should be able to secure a nightsaber to get you down to the ruins."
G["Be sure to talk to the MacGraffs, inside the sanctuary. They'll be orchestratin' the ceremonies."]="Be sure to talk to the MacGraffs, inside the sanctuary. They'll be orchestratin' the ceremonies."
G["Be sure to tell Greatfather Winter what secret surprise you'd like to get this Winter Veil!"]="Não deixe de contar ao bisavô Winter que surpresa secreta você gostaria de receber este véu de inverno!"
G["Be sure to try our Dark Iron Ale.  I hear the dwarves around here can't get enough of it."]="Não deixe de experimentar nossa Dark Iron Ale. Ouvi dizer que os anões por aqui não se cansam disso."
G["Be sure to visit Vixton Pinchwhistle in Netherstorm's Area 52. As the Steamwheedle Fighting Circuit's official Arena Vendor, he has all sorts of incredible items for sale to those with enough Arena Points."]="Não deixe de visitar Vixton Pinchwhistle na Área 52 de Netherstorm. Como Fornecedor Oficial da Arena do Steamwheedle Fighting Circuit, ele tem todos os tipos de itens incríveis à venda para aqueles com Arena Points suficientes."
G["Be swallowed by a sea of flame!"]="Que o mar de chamas os devore!"
G["Be swift, $c. The stone dragons will not give up easily."]="Be swift, $c. The stone dragons will not give up easily."
G["Be thankful that I am locked inside this cage, $r."]="Pode dar as Obrigado de que estiver encerrado nesta jaula, $r."
G["Be the first on your block to own the incredible Electrostatic Maculation Blaster!"]="Be the first on your block to own the incredible Electrostatic Maculation Blaster!"
G["Be very, very quiet.  There's worgen everywhere."]="Fique muito, muito quieto. Há worgen em tudo lugar."
G["Be vigilant, troops. A surprise attack could mean the difference between life and death."]="Atentas as tropas. Um ataque surpresa significaría a diferença entre a vida e a morte."
G["Be vigilent in your stand, or you will never achieve your goals."]="Be vigilent in your stand, or you will never achieve your goals."
G["Be warned that even your creators are fallible."]="Be warned that even your creators are fallible."
G["Be warned, Belmont. If I find out that you're lying..."]="Be warned, Belmont. If I find out that you're lying..."
G["Be warned, mortal, it is exceptionally rare that one of the lesser clans in this citadel would hold such an item. Your search could take decades. I recommend you destroy these beasts without impunity."]="Esteja avisado, mortal, é excepcionalmente raro que um dos clãs menores nesta cidadela possua esse item. Sua pesquisa pode levar décadas. Eu recomendo que você destrua esses animais sem impunidade."
G["Be warned, this recipe has been handed down from generation to generation, tought to my family by the great Monkey King himself."]="Be warned, this recipe has been handed down from generation to generation, tought to my family by the great Monkey King himself."
G["Be warned..."]="Ten cuidado..."
G["Be wary beyond the wall."]="Tenha cuidado ao outro lado da muralha."
G["Be wary of intruders."]="Cuidado com os intrusos."
G["Be wary of taking to the sky above these ruins, $glad:lass;. The Twilight drakes have a taste for things that fly."]="Be wary of taking to the sky above these ruins, $glad:lass;. The Twilight drakes have a taste for things that fly."
G["Be wary of the Ethereum that surround us on all sides."]="Desconfie do Ethereum que nos rodeia por todos os lados."
G["Be wary, $c. The forest is full of hidden dangers and potential enemies."]="Be wary, $c. The forest is full of hidden dangers and potential enemies."
G["Be wary, $r.\n\nThis is no place for the meek."]="Be wary, $r.\n\nThis is no place for the meek."
G["Be wary, allies. There are bound to be traps to protect the Firelord from our incursion."]="Seja cauteloso, aliados. É provável que haja armadilhas para proteger o Senhor do Fogo de nossa incursão."
