G["Bear"]="Oso"
G["Bear Mount"]="Montagem do urso"
G["Bear witness to the agent of your demise!"]="Bear witness to the agent of your demise!"
G["Bear witness to the undeniable power of our dark master!"]="Contemplao innegable poder de nosso sombrio amo!"
G["Bear witness to the undeniable power of your Warchief! Be lifted by the rallying cry of your dragon slayers!"]="Bear witness to the undeniable power of your Warchief! Be lifted by the rallying cry of your dragon slayers!"
G["Bears are beautiful creatures.  Wild, strong and fierce in battle... much like us, sister."]="Os ursos são belas criaturas. Selvagem, forte e feroz na batalha... como nós, irmã."
G["Bears??"]="Bears??"
G["Beast! Obey me! Kill them at once!"]="Fera! Obedéceme! Mátalos de uma vez!"
G["Beat it, Mack! Else I'll have Budd cook ya fer my hounds...."]="Beat it, Mack! Else I'll have Budd cook ya fer my hounds...."
G["Beat it, Schnottz!"]="Cai fora, Schnottz!"
G["Beat it, kid. I got business to attend to..."]="Bata, garoto. Tenho negócios para atender..."
G["Beat it, pal, before I give you the ol' Chip Endale fist to the face!"]="Bata, rosto, antes que eu lhe dê o punho de Chip Endale na rosto!"
G["Beat me to it, I see. Your exit awaits..."]="Beat me to it, I see. Your exit awaits..."
G["Beat or be beaten! This is the way of the Legion!"]="Beat or be beaten! This is the way of the Legion!"
G["Beat that wikket like it owes you money!"]="Beat that wikket like it owes you money!"
G["Beat them to a pulp, Ace!"]="Beat them to a pulp, Ace!"
G["Beat this filth until it speaks..."]="Golpeia a esta escória até que hable..."
G["Beatdown received.  Optimizing strategy for next battle..."]="Surra recebida. Optimizando estratégia para a seguinte batalha..."
G["Beats me, kid. I'm new to the crew.\n\nI've had my fill of troll-killin' and grog drinkin, I can tell ya that. Only thing left to see is the treasure Budd keeps promisin'...."]="Me supera, rapaz. Sou novo no equipamento.\n\nPosso dizer que e matou montes de trolls e bêbado muito grog. O único que me falta por ver é o tesouro que Budd está venha a prometer..."
G["Beautiful day for fishing, don't you think?  You a fisherman, $n?  I've got this old fishing lure if you'd like it, works wonders in the waters here."]="Um dia precioso para pescar, não você acha? É $gun pescador: uma pescadora;, $n? Tenho este velho cebo de pesca, se o que. Em estas águas funciona de maravilha."
G["Beautiful day, isn't it?"]="Um dia precioso, não você acha?"
G["Beautiful flowers for your loved ones! Get your flowers!"]="Flores preciosas para os seus seres queridos! Compra flores!"
G["Beautiful, isn't she? Fished it up a few years go - it looks just like her... Ask me about it some time."]="Preciosa, verdade? A pesqué há uns anos. É igual que ela... Pregúntame sobre isso algum dia."
G["Because I won our bet.  And because I called shotgun."]="Because I won our bet.  And because I called shotgun."
G["Because Uncle Chen made me promise not to!\n\nListen. Chen may be a stupid, boring, lazy, fat old uncle, but that doesn't mean that I don't respect him. He told me not to get into any trouble, and I'm not about to ignore him.\n\nBesides, you seem to be doing just fine on your own. You don't need a little girl to help you kill things."]="Because Uncle Chen made me promise not to!\n\nListen. Chen may be a stupid, boring, lazy, fat old uncle, but that doesn't mean that I don't respect him. He told me not to get into any trouble, and I'm not about to ignore him.\n\nBesides, you seem to be doing just fine on your own. You don't need a little girl to help you kill things."
G["Because despite what you think, there may be people in this world who would mourn your passing."]="Because despite what you think, there may be people in this world who would mourn your passing."
G["Because he didn't want it to be smarter than he was!"]="Porque não queria que fosse mais pronta que ele!"
G["Because my will..."]="Porque meu vontade..."
G["Because pants never drop when they're around!"]="Because pants never drop when they're around!"
G["Because sea turtles always return to the beach where they were born!"]="Because sea turtles always return to the beach where they were born!"
G["Because someone said, 'Let's take the scenic route!'"]="Because someone said, 'Let's take the scenic route!'"
G["Because the blade can never be too sharp nor the armor too tough a talented enchanter will always be needed.  Such an enchanter is Taladan, who can show you how to properly weave enchantments to improve your weapons and armor.  Seek him out in the Craftsmen's Terrace."]="Como a lâmina nunca pode ser muito afiada nem a armadura muito resistente, um encantador talentoso sempre será necessário. Esse encantador é o Taladan, que pode mostrar a você como tecer adequadamente encantamentos para melhorar suas armas e armaduras. Procure-o no terraço dos artesãos."
G["Because these guys made it past them!"]="Because these guys made it past them!"
G["Because they are planted in the spring!"]="Porque quando não te as comes você dia não é nada santo!"
G["Because they get to spend so much time with that foxy spirit healer!"]="Because they get to spend so much time with that foxy spirit healer!"
G["Because they're made of iron ya big dummy! Ya ain't got none of da senses pappy left me with - that's for darn sure!"]="Because they're made of iron ya big dummy! Ya ain't got none of da senses pappy left me with - that's for darn sure!"
G["Because those two guys make you feel skinny."]="Porque esses dois de aí fazem que te sientas delgado."
G["Because you are still alive and my hands aren't gripped firmly around your stubby little neck."]="Porque você ainda está vivo e minhas mãos não estão firmemente agarradas ao seu pescoço curto e atarracado."
G["Because you have aided me, I will tell you what I know of this land and of the things there are to see. My knowledge is not vast, but perhaps I can point out some things that might interest one such as yourself."]="Porque você me ajudou, eu lhe direi o que sei desta terra e das coisas que há para ver. Meu conhecimento não é vasto, mas talvez eu possa apontar algumas coisas que podem interessar a você, como você."
G["Because you're short."]="Because you're short."
G["Because you're talkin' about what? Talkin' about the arclight spanner, whining about the smelting requirements of hardened adamantite, cryin' about some gnome that ripped you off..."]="Because you're talkin' about what? Talkin' about the arclight spanner, whining about the smelting requirements of hardened adamantite, cryin' about some gnome that ripped you off..."
G["Because you're the bravest, dear."]="Porque é o mais corajoso, céu."
G["Because you've managed to replenish some of our supplies I can get back to cooking.  Now, what can I do for you?"]="Como você conseguiu reabastecer algum de nossos suprimentos, posso voltar a cozinhar. Agora, o que posso fazer por você?"
G["Because..."]="Porque..."
G["Become a mentor for one of our orphans during the Week of the Wardens!  For the Horde!"]="Become a mentor for one of our orphans during the Week of the Wardens!  For the Horde!"
G["Become a mentor for one of our orphans during the Week of the Wardens!  Huzzah!"]="Become a mentor for one of our orphans during the Week of the Wardens!  Huzzah!"
G["Become an apprentice I suppose. Pretty high turnover really.\n\nI've met maybe a dozen washed up apprentices this last month alone. He leaves them kind of damaged. They keep coming though. I guess there aren't many options in the Archmage racket.\n\nI met another one just today. He was heading over to the west, to that big pillar that's being built."]="Become an apprentice I suppose. Pretty high turnover really.\n\nI've met maybe a dozen washed up apprentices this last month alone. He leaves them kind of damaged. They keep coming though. I guess there aren't many options in the Archmage racket.\n\nI met another one just today. He was heading over to the west, to that big pillar that's being built."
G["Become ashes in the mist!"]="Convertíos em cinzas na névoa!"
G["Become one with the fire!"]="Convertíos em um com o fogo!"
G["Been a tough day? A nice ale should loosen those worries right up."]="Been a tough day? A nice ale should loosen those worries right up."
G["Been a while since I had a taste of this dish. This'll hit the spot."]="Been a while since I had a taste of this dish. This'll hit the spot."
G["Been in Westfall all my life, $g brother:sister;. I can remember a day when Westfall was the lushest land this side of Stranglethorn Vale. Those days are long gone.\n\nWhile we no longer have Defias causing problems, the fallout from their reign of terror can still be felt. To make matters worse we're in the worst economic downturn in history. All that gold we spent on fighting the Scourge left anyone not in a military related occupation jobless and eventually homeless.\n\nGuess where all those people ended up?"]="Been in Westfall all my life, $g brother:sister;. I can remember a day when Westfall was the lushest land this side of Stranglethorn Vale. Those days are long gone.\n\nWhile we no longer have Defias causing problems, the fallout from their reign of terror can still be felt. To make matters worse we're in the worst economic downturn in history. All that gold we spent on fighting the Scourge left anyone not in a military related occupation jobless and eventually homeless.\n\nGuess where all those people ended up?"
G["Been waitin' for ya, $n. Glad to see you've come through. Do you have the shipment?"]="Been waitin' for ya, $n. Glad to see you've come through. Do you have the shipment?"
G["Been working for the anglers?  Check out these rewards!"]="Been working for the anglers?  Check out these rewards!"
G["Beer an' haggis, now that'll put hair on yer chest!"]="Cerveja e haggis! Isso si que te fará crescer cabelo no peito!"
G["Beer before liquor, never fought quicker."]="A bebida não deve faltar se a batalha que ganhar!"
G["Beer delivery, in the middle of a battlefield? Maybe Pandaria will make a good home after all..."]="Reparto de cerveja, em meio de um campo de batalha? ao melhor Pandaria não está tão mal..."
G["Beer delivery, in the middle of a battlefield? Perhaps Pandaria will make a good home after all..."]="Reparto de cerveja, em meio de um campo de batalha? Pandaria não está tão mal, ao fim e ao cabo..."
G["Beer made with sap? That sounds..."]="Beer made with sap? That sounds..."
G["Beer! Mere beer!"]="Cerveja! Simples cerveja!"
G["Beetle"]="Alfazaque"
G["Before I leave this place, I make one final offering to you, Lord Staghelm. Should a time arise in which you must gain entry to this accursed fortress, use the Scepter of the Shifting Sands on the sacred gong. The magic holding the barrier together will dissipate and the horrors of Ahn'Qiraj will be unleashed upon the world once more."]="Before I leave this place, I make one final offering to you, Lord Staghelm. Should a time arise in which you must gain entry to this accursed fortress, use the Scepter of the Shifting Sands on the sacred gong. The magic holding the barrier together will dissipate and the horrors of Ahn'Qiraj will be unleashed upon the world once more."
G["Before I take my leave, you must be told that it is not by my fault that you lay stretched on the ground, but by the fault of my squire."]="Before I take my leave, you must be told that it is not by my fault that you lay stretched on the ground, but by the fault of my squire."
G["Before I was cast in amber, I made a great gamble.\n\nI realized the amber could perform a miracle that I would never achieve, not even with a thousand years of careful experimentation.\n\nBefore I became a paragon, I injected myself with a dozen lethal poisons. The life-giving properties of amber protected me as I guessed, and time did the rest.\n\nAnd now, I can handle any poison I desire without fear."]="Before I was cast in amber, I made a great gamble.\n\nI realized the amber could perform a miracle that I would never achieve, not even with a thousand years of careful experimentation.\n\nBefore I became a paragon, I injected myself with a dozen lethal poisons. The life-giving properties of amber protected me as I guessed, and time did the rest.\n\nAnd now, I can handle any poison I desire without fear."
G["Before I was stationed out here, I'd only heard about the rejuvenating effects a mudbath can have on skin. When I first tripped over a tree root, I was exposed to the full benefits! Amazing what nature can do, even without a bit of magic to help it along."]="Before I was stationed out here, I'd only heard about the rejuvenating effects a mudbath can have on skin. When I first tripped over a tree root, I was exposed to the full benefits! Amazing what nature can do, even without a bit of magic to help it along."
G["Before beginning a hunt, it is wise to ask someone what you are looking for before you begin looking for it."]="Antes de iniciar uma caçada, é aconselhável perguntar a alguém o que você está procurando antes de começar a procurar."
G["Before his banishment, Deathwing was attempting to create impure offspring. Half breeds that would not only be immune to the innate natural powers and abilities of their Aspects but also under the complete control of Deathwing.\n\nIt seems that where his father failed, Nefarian may have succeeded - at least partially.\n\nIt was Ysera, Aspect of Dreams, who saw the abominations and forced us to act. If these 'Chromatic' dragonkin exist, they must be destroyed."]="Before his banishment, Deathwing was attempting to create impure offspring. Half breeds that would not only be immune to the innate natural powers and abilities of their Aspects but also under the complete control of Deathwing.\n\nIt seems that where his father failed, Nefarian may have succeeded - at least partially.\n\nIt was Ysera, Aspect of Dreams, who saw the abominations and forced us to act. If these 'Chromatic' dragonkin exist, they must be destroyed."
G["Before it boils over, I need..."]="Antes de que hierva preciso..."
G["Before it thickens, we must add..."]="Before it thickens, we must add..."
G["Before my death, I was a librarian; I had nothing to do with wars and plagues. I never asked to become this. On the other hand, now that my mind is my own again, I'm not about to surrender without a fight."]="Antes da minha morte, eu era bibliotecária; Não tive nada a ver com guerras e pragas. Eu nunca pedi para me tornar isso. Por outro lado, agora que minha mente é minha novamente, não vou me render sem lutar."
G["Before the Scourge came, I had a great business.  I bought and sold everything.  Everything!\n\nAnd my prices were INSANE!\n\nJust ask anyone.  Anyone who's not dead."]="Before the Scourge came, I had a great business.  I bought and sold everything.  Everything!\n\nAnd my prices were INSANE!\n\nJust ask anyone.  Anyone who's not dead."
G["Before the day is done, you will all be slaves and corpses!"]="Antesss de que acabe o dia, todos serão escravos e cadáveresss!"
G["Before the plague came, I knew nothing about leather. Now I know enough to teach others. Death's left me with a lot of time on my hands."]="Antes do Flagelo chegar, eu não sabia nada sobre couro. Agora eu sei o suficiente para ensinar aos outros. A morte me deixou com muito tempo nas minhas mãos."
G["Before they laid me to sleep in amber, I heard a million voices of the swarm shouting my name. Now, I hear only silence."]="Before they laid me to sleep in amber, I heard a million voices of the swarm shouting my name. Now, I hear only silence."
G["Before we can join the final battle, we must ensure that whatever's happening inside of that Ancient across from us is put to an end. Otherwise, we will not stand a chance.\n\nLend Erunak your full assistance, $n."]="Before we can join the final battle, we must ensure that whatever's happening inside of that Ancient across from us is put to an end. Otherwise, we will not stand a chance.\n\nLend Erunak your full assistance, $n."
G["Before we can overcome external obstacles like the Scourge and the Amani trolls, we must overcome obstacles from within.  The Wretched have been a nuisance for long enough; it is time we vanquished them."]="Antes que possamos superar obstáculos externos, como os trolls do Flagelo e dos Amani, devemos superar os obstáculos internos. Os miseráveis ​​têm sido um incômodo por tempo suficiente; é hora de vencê-os."
G["Before we can set sail to Northrend, we've got to eliminate our pest problem aboard the Assurance."]="Antes de podermos navegar para Northrend, precisamos de eliminar nosso problema de pragas a bordo do Assurance."
G["Before we join the final battle at the Abyssal Breach, we must stop whatever's happening inside of that Ancient across from us. Otherwise, we will fail.\n\nLend Erunak all of your might, $n."]="Before we join the final battle at the Abyssal Breach, we must stop whatever's happening inside of that Ancient across from us. Otherwise, we will fail.\n\nLend Erunak all of your might, $n."
G["Before we knew it they was everywhere!"]="Before we knew it they was everywhere!"
G["Before you ask: no, we are not there yet."]="Antes de que pergunte: não, ainda não temos chegado."
G["Before you is the Cache of the Aspects: Take from it what you will, for you have more than earned the right."]="Before you is the Cache of the Aspects: Take from it what you will, for you have more than earned the right."
G["Before you make your way into Fel Rock, be sure to speak to Tallonkai Swiftroot at the top of the tree. He has a task he would ask of you as well."]="Before you make your way into Fel Rock, be sure to speak to Tallonkai Swiftroot at the top of the tree. He has a task he would ask of you as well."
G["Before you sits Instructor Myang. She will be responsible for teaching you the most practical fighting techniques."]="Before you sits Instructor Myang. She will be responsible for teaching you the most practical fighting techniques."
G["Before your history began, our empire was vast. We shared this world with our sister kingdoms, Ahn'Qiraj and Azjol-Nerub."]="Before your history began, our empire was vast. We shared this world with our sister kingdoms, Ahn'Qiraj and Azjol-Nerub."
G["Before your learning may begin, I must ask of you a favor..."]="Antes de que dé início seu treinamento, devo pedir um favor..."
G["Befriending the Sunstriders has paid off; I get to conduct research with subjects I can only find in Outland and they get... my charming personality and rugged good looks."]="Fazer amizade com os Sunstriders valeu a pena; Eu conduzo pesquisas com assuntos que só consigo encontrar em Outland e eles têm... minha personalidade encantadora e boa aparência."
G["Beg all you want, I am keeping the crystal for myself.  All of Outland will soon fall beneath my step!"]="Suplica tudo o que queira, mas me quedo com o cristal para mim. Toda TerrAlém cairá pronto baixo meu passo!"
G["Beg and tremble before my power!"]="Beg and tremble before my power!"
G["Beg for life!"]="Suplicar por vida!"
G["Beg for life."]="Beg for life."
G["Beg for mercy now, and I may yet allow you to live. Well, \"heroes?\" What is your answer?"]="Beg for mercy now, and I may yet allow you to live. Well, \"heroes?\" What is your answer?"
G["Beg for mercy!"]="Pede clemência!"
G["Beg for mercy."]="Beg for mercy."
G["Beg for your life. Plead. It will do you no good!"]="Beg for your life. Plead. It will do you no good!"
G["Beg for your life..."]="Suplica pelo seu vida..."
G["Beg for your miserable life!"]="Suplica pelo seu miserável vida!"
G["Beg for your pitiful life!"]="Beg for your pitiful life!"
G["Beggars and usurpers, we will burn you and your pandaren allies to ash."]="Beggars and usurpers, we will burn you and your pandaren allies to ash."
G["Begging your pardon, Lady Prestor. That was not my intent."]="Pido que me disculpes, Lady Prestor. Essa não era meu intenção."
G["Begin pet battle."]="Começar duelo de ajudantes."
G["Begin the Assault!"]="Que comience o ataque!"
