G["Begone foul creatures!  Go back to the void your master shaped you from!"]="Begone foul creatures!  Go back to the void your master shaped you from!"
G["Begone foul creatures!  Your kind has no place in this world."]="Begone foul creatures!  Your kind has no place in this world."
G["Begone foul demon!"]="Begone foul demon!"
G["Begone from here, Horde filth!"]="Fora de aqui, sucata da Horda!"
