G["Begone, mortal. You are not worthy of my knowledge."]="Márchate, mortal. Não é $gmerecedor: merecedora; de meus conhecimentos."
G["Begone, outsider!"]="Begone, outsider!"
G["Begone, overseer!  We've already spoken.\n\nStop dragging your feet and execute your orders at Ruuan Weald!"]="Begone, overseer!  We've already spoken.\n\nStop dragging your feet and execute your orders at Ruuan Weald!"
G["Begone, uncouth scum!  The Alliance shall prevail in Alterac Valley!"]="Begone, uncouth scum!  The Alliance shall prevail in Alterac Valley!"
G["Begone. I have neither the ability nor the inclination to instruct you."]="Começa. Não tenho a capacidade nem a inclinação para instruí-o."
G["Behave yourselves inside Stormwind, pandaren. You're in Alliance territory now."]="Behave yourselves inside Stormwind, pandaren. You're in Alliance territory now."
G["Behind me is the Altar of Zanza, a sacred place for us Zandalar.  We pray here to bolster our resolve in preparation for war against the Blood God, Hakkar.\n\nProve yourself to the tribe by using the altar to destroy any of the Hakkari Bijous you might find inside Zul'Gurub.  Also, I will trade you Honor Tokens our tribe uses for sets of coins you may find in Zul'Gurub.  Bring me the coins that I seek, and you will be rewarded!"]="Behind me is the Altar of Zanza, a sacred place for us Zandalar.  We pray here to bolster our resolve in preparation for war against the Blood God, Hakkar.\n\nProve yourself to the tribe by using the altar to destroy any of the Hakkari Bijous you might find inside Zul'Gurub.  Also, I will trade you Honor Tokens our tribe uses for sets of coins you may find in Zul'Gurub.  Bring me the coins that I seek, and you will be rewarded!"
G["Behind the print is the long impression of a prehensile tail."]="Behind the print is the long impression of a prehensile tail."
G["Behind you lies the body of my only son. Nothing will keep me from him."]="Behind you lies the body of my only son. Nothing will keep me from him."
G["Behind you, $n! Look out - incoming!"]="Behind you, $n! Look out - incoming!"
G["Behold His power!"]="Behold His power!"
G["Behold Ragnaros - the Firelord! He who was ancient when this world was young! Bow before him, mortals! Bow before your ending!"]="Behold Ragnaros - the Firelord! He who was ancient when this world was young! Bow before him, mortals! Bow before your ending!"
G["Behold as Huo brings warmth back to the temple, and passion to its people."]="Behold as Huo brings warmth back to the temple, and passion to its people."
G["Behold as infinite darkness befalls your world!"]="Behold as infinite darkness befalls your world!"
G["Behold my perfect creation!"]="Behold my perfect creation!"
G["Behold now: terror absolute!"]="Behold now: terror absolute!"
G["Behold the Flames of Azzinoth!"]="Contemplem as Chamas de Azzinoth!"
G["Behold the Gong of Hope!  Though really we replaced the gong with a bell many centuries ago.  The old gong was quite small and did not provide the proper level of hope infusion to our people."]="Behold the Gong of Hope!  Though really we replaced the gong with a bell many centuries ago.  The old gong was quite small and did not provide the proper level of hope infusion to our people."
G["Behold the VX-001 Anti-personnel Assault Cannon! You might want to take cover."]="Behold the VX-001 Anti-personnel Assault Cannon! You might want to take cover."
G["Behold the Vrykul!   A race that has perfected war and destruction to the point of an art form.  Already they've cast their lot with the Lich King!  Their dwellings surround you and their numbers are easily five times yours."]="Behold the Vrykul!   A race that has perfected war and destruction to the point of an art form.  Already they've cast their lot with the Lich King!  Their dwellings surround you and their numbers are easily five times yours."
G["Behold the brood mother, Onyxia, REBORN! Perhaps my finest work."]="Behold the brood mother, Onyxia, REBORN! Perhaps my finest work."
G["Behold the chaos to come. (Madness, madness, bliss!) Do you like what you see mortal?"]="Behold the chaos to come. (Madness, madness, bliss!) Do you like what you see mortal?"
G["Behold the destiny of your fragile world!"]="Behold the destiny of your fragile world!"
G["Behold the hand behind all the evil that has befallen Ulduar, left my kingdom in ruins, corrupted my brother, and slain my wife."]="Behold the hand behind all the evil that has befallen Ulduar, left my kingdom in ruins, corrupted my brother, and slain my wife."
G["Behold the might of the Alliance! The dread lady, Onyxia, hangs from the arches! Let the rallying cry of the dragon slayer lift your spirits!"]="Behold the might of the Alliance! The dread lady, Onyxia, hangs from the arches! Let the rallying cry of the dragon slayer lift your spirits!"
G["Behold the might of the hammer!"]="Behold the might of the hammer!"
G["Behold the might of the swarm!"]="Behold the might of the swarm!"
G["Behold the might that is Gurgthock!"]="Observao poder de Gurgthock!"
G["Behold the power of pure water!"]="Behold the power of pure water!"
G["Behold the power of the Light! Grace and glory to the Alliance!"]="Behold the power of the Light! Grace and glory to the Alliance!"
G["Behold the power of the void."]="Behold the power of the void."
G["Behold the power of torrential waters!"]="Behold the power of torrential waters!"
G["Behold the power... of the demon within!"]="Behold the power... of the demon within!"
G["Behold the powers of the master!"]="Contemplaos poderes do mestre!"
G["Behold the rage of the Firelands!"]="Behold the rage of the Firelands!"
G["Behold the sheer size of it!  Are you not afraid, mortal?  Have you ever witnessed doom of this magnitude?"]="Behold the sheer size of it!  Are you not afraid, mortal?  Have you ever witnessed doom of this magnitude?"
G["Behold the tools of creation!"]="Behold the tools of creation!"
G["Behold the voice of Her divine wrath."]="Ouça a voz do seu cólera divina."
G["Behold the wonders of our fair city."]="Contempla as maravilhas de nossa linda cidade."
G["Behold the wrath of the new Empire!"]="Behold the wrath of the new Empire!"
G["Behold your weakness."]="Contempla seu fraqueza."
G["Behold!  The Blue Recluse holds a feast in $g his:her; honor!"]="Behold!  The Blue Recluse holds a feast in $g his:her; honor!"
G["Behold! I've reserved my favorite pets for just such an occasion."]="Olhem! E reservado meus ajudantes favoritos para esta ocasão."
G["Behold! Latent titan power, imbued with my own draconic essence, tempered by the wisdom of the pandaren celestials."]="Contemple! Poder titã latente, imbuído com minha própria essência dracônica, temperado pela sabedoria dos celestiais pandarênicos."
G["Behold! Sul'thraze the Lasher be rejoined!"]="Behold! Sul'thraze the Lasher be rejoined!"
G["Behold! The Scythe of Antiok!"]="Behold! The Scythe of Antiok!"
G["Behold! The binding of sacred and corrupt; the forging of Shadow's Edge, a weapon of untold potential!"]="Behold! The binding of sacred and corrupt; the forging of Shadow's Edge, a weapon of untold potential!"
G["Behold! The world you see before you has been judged. (Fire, water, earth, air!) All shall perish before the elements! (Burn and drown and crush and suffocate!)"]="Behold! The world you see before you has been judged. (Fire, water, earth, air!) All shall perish before the elements! (Burn and drown and crush and suffocate!)"
G["Behold, Master Greenpaw, known throughout the lands as the Jade Fist Monk.\n\nThrough skill, determination, and chi, he mastered the form now known as the dreaded Jade Strike, a blow that would transmute foes into statues of jade.\n\nIt was his heroism and sacrifice that saved the Jade Forest in a time of great need, and his like is not to be seen in this world again.\n\nMay this statue forever stand as a reminder of the price of peace, and may his sacrifice never be forgotten."]="Behold, Master Greenpaw, known throughout the lands as the Jade Fist Monk.\n\nThrough skill, determination, and chi, he mastered the form now known as the dreaded Jade Strike, a blow that would transmute foes into statues of jade.\n\nIt was his heroism and sacrifice that saved the Jade Forest in a time of great need, and his like is not to be seen in this world again.\n\nMay this statue forever stand as a reminder of the price of peace, and may his sacrifice never be forgotten."
G["Behold, Muradin, our salvation, Frostmourne."]="Muradin, conresiliência nossa salvação, Agonia de Gelo."
G["Behold, Noth the Plaguebringer. Responsible for the creation of the process that distills the souls of the living and places them within the cold cage of undeath, Noth was observed to be refining this process even now."]="Behold, Noth the Plaguebringer. Responsible for the creation of the process that distills the souls of the living and places them within the cold cage of undeath, Noth was observed to be refining this process even now."
G["Behold, Patchwerk. When word of his existence first reached the ears of the Brotherhood, none believed the tales of an abomination with such immense speed and strength. Fewer still believed it when he fell the first time..."]="Behold, Patchwerk. When word of his existence first reached the ears of the Brotherhood, none believed the tales of an abomination with such immense speed and strength. Fewer still believed it when he fell the first time..."
G["Behold, mon! We be creatin' da greatest Scourge army ever seen!"]="Behold, mon! We be creatin' da greatest Scourge army ever seen!"
G["Behold, the Flames of Summer!"]="Eis as chamas do verão!"
G["Behold, the potent power of Cogspin!"]="Behold, the potent power of Cogspin!"
G["Behold, yet another terrifying creature of incomprehensible power!"]="Behold, yet another terrifying creature of incomprehensible power!"
G["Behold: The Samophlange."]="Behold: The Samophlange."
G["Behold: The power of the foes you've vanquished."]="Contemplao poder dos inimigos que derrotou..."
G["Being Forsaken has its benefits. Let me see... I am able to practically live underwater. I can stay submerged 233% longer than any fleshy mortal. Yes, count it, 233%."]="Being Forsaken has its benefits. Let me see... I am able to practically live underwater. I can stay submerged 233% longer than any fleshy mortal. Yes, count it, 233%."
G["Being a legendary explorer is hard work!"]="Ser uma exploradora lendária cansa muito!"
G["Being a mage has its advantages, but the laundry bills are hell to pay."]="Being a mage has its advantages, but the laundry bills are hell to pay."
G["Being a paladin is rough. The Light behaves so erratically. Some days I wake up and it feels like all of my powers have been weakened."]="Being a paladin is rough. The Light behaves so erratically. Some days I wake up and it feels like all of my powers have been weakened."
G["Being a powerful warlock must be hard. Do you ever worry you'll lose control of one of your demons?"]="Ser um bruxo poderoso precisa ser difícil. Não te da medo perder o controle de um dos seus demônios?"
G["Being able to study and learn from the Underbog is a once in a lifetime opportunity.\n\nTo think I was practically dead not long ago sitting in a crate in the Slave Pens..."]="Poder estudar e aprender na Pântano é uma oportunidade que se da uma vez na vida.\n\nE pensar que há pouco estava ao borda da morte sentado em uma jaula no Área dos Escravos..."
G["Being part of the Explorers' League, I've been hunting for artifacts in the area. Winterspring is said to contain very magical items... Most are highly guarded."]="Fazendo parte da Liga dos Batedores, tenho procurado artefatos na área. Dizem que Winterspring contém itens muito mágicas... A maioria é altamente protegida."
G["Being resourceful can often sway a battle in your favor.\n\nI've put together this remedy using plants from the forest around us. Hopefully it will be enough. We need every available fighter in the field."]="Being resourceful can often sway a battle in your favor.\n\nI've put together this remedy using plants from the forest around us. Hopefully it will be enough. We need every available fighter in the field."
G["Being small has its advantages. I can sneak just about anywhere."]="Ser pequeno tem seus vantagems. Me posso colar por quase qualquer lugar."
G["Belay yer lime-stealin' ways, ye scurvy scallywag!"]="Amarra seus artes de robalimas, cão de água doce!"
G["Belay your attack orders, men!"]="Belay your attack orders, men!"
G["Belay your attacks!  We're movin' on!"]="De de atacal! Nos movemos!"
G["Belesa menoor!"]="Belesa menoor!"
G["Belgaristrasz speaks the truth; the situation is grave indeed.  \nI can grant you the power to call upon a drake from the green flight.  Speak to Belgaristrasz or Eternos if you prefer to draw on the power of the red or the bronze."]="Belgaristrasz speaks the truth; the situation is grave indeed.  \nI can grant you the power to call upon a drake from the green flight.  Speak to Belgaristrasz or Eternos if you prefer to draw on the power of the red or the bronze."
G["Belgaristrasz speaks the truth; the situation is grave indeed.  \nThe full power of your drakes has been unlocked.  Use their power to defeat Eregos!"]="Belgaristrasz diz a verdade, a situação é em efeito grave. \n\nSe tem desbloqueada tudo o poder dos seus dracos. Alvo para derrotar a Eregos!"
G["Belgaristrasz speaks the truth; time is running out!\nI can grant you the power to call upon a drake from the bronze flight.  Speak to Belgaristrasz or Verdisa if you prefer to draw on the power of the red or the green."]="Belgaristrasz speaks the truth; time is running out!\nI can grant you the power to call upon a drake from the bronze flight.  Speak to Belgaristrasz or Verdisa if you prefer to draw on the power of the red or the green."
G["Belgaristrasz speaks the truth; time is running out!\nThe full power of your drakes has been unlocked.  Use their power to defeat Eregos!"]="Belgaristrasz diz a verdade; o tempo se fica exausto!\n\nO poder completo dos seus dracos foi desbloqueada. Usa seu poder para derrotar a Eregos!"
G["Belgrom sent us here from Orgrimmar to aid him in an unwise Alliance, but if his gamble pays off, then it will be to the great benefit of all the Horde.\n\nToo many orcs have already perished because of his desire to please women, but he still commands us, and our honor dictates we make the best of this situation."]="Belgrom sent us here from Orgrimmar to aid him in an unwise Alliance, but if his gamble pays off, then it will be to the great benefit of all the Horde.\n\nToo many orcs have already perished because of his desire to please women, but he still commands us, and our honor dictates we make the best of this situation."
G["Believe in one another, and let others carry hope for you!"]="Believe in one another, and let others carry hope for you!"
G["Believe in your own strength."]="Believe in your own strength."
G["Believe in your strength!"]="Believe in your strength!"
G["Believe it or not, her plan DID work. She acquired an egg - I'm still not certain by what means - and claimed to have severed its link to the tainted flight.\n\nThen Deathwing found out about it.\n\nHe cornered Rheastrasza in a cave in the Badlands, destroying her and all of her work. Or so he thought. Rheastrasza had sacrificed her own eggs to fool the Aspect of Death.\n\nThe single, purified black dragon egg was secreted away and hidden!"]="Believe it or not, her plan DID work. She acquired an egg - I'm still not certain by what means - and claimed to have severed its link to the tainted flight.\n\nThen Deathwing found out about it.\n\nHe cornered Rheastrasza in a cave in the Badlands, destroying her and all of her work. Or so he thought. Rheastrasza had sacrificed her own eggs to fool the Aspect of Death.\n\nThe single, purified black dragon egg was secreted away and hidden!"
G["Believe me - what Garrosh Hellscream achieved in Theramore is nothing compared to the horrors that are even now bearing down on our fragile home."]="Pode acreditar, o que Garrosh Grito Infernal fez em Theramore não é nada comparado aos horrores que neste exato momento se dirigem ao nosso frágil lar."
G["Believe me when I tell you this: You're gonna wish you weren't born, sissy!"]="Believe me when I tell you this: You're gonna wish you weren't born, sissy!"
G["Believe me when I tell you, $p, you're in on the ground floor of something big!"]="Créeme quando te digo, $p, que está no início de algo grande!"
G["Belm says pay your bill or he'll break your face."]="Belm diz que pagues seu conta ou te romperá a rosto."
G["Below is the aptly named Deathforge. If left to their own devices, the Shadow Council would supply the Legion with an endless stream of infernals."]="Abaixo está o apropriadamente chamado Deathforge. Se deixado por conta própria, o Conselho das Sombras forneceria à Legião um fluxo interminável de infernais."
G["Bemarrin teaches the trade of blacksmithing in Farstriders' Square. While a somewhat... dirty trade, I suppose it has its merits."]="Bemarrin ensina o comércio de ferraria na Praça dos Farstriders. Enquanto um comércio um tanto... sujo, suponho que tenha seus méritos."
G["Bena works like one possessed. Day and night I have seen her bent over these potions, often going without sleep or food. I know our undead allies need help, but I begin to fear she will do herself an injury."]="Bena trabalha como alguém possuído. Dia e noite eu a vi curvada sobre essas poções, muitas vezes ficando sem dormir ou comer. Sei que nossos aliados mortos-vivos precisam de ajuda, mas começo a temer que ela se machuque."
G["Bend before me!"]="Inclinaos ante mí!"
G["Bend it to your will, and you shall wield unspeakable power!"]="Bend it to your will, and you shall wield unspeakable power!"
G["Bend the wind to the task of keeping the mill turning, spirit!"]="Controlao vento para que o molino continue virando, espírito!"
G["Bend to our will!"]="Bend to our will!"
G["Benevolence is a luxury for the strong, young prince. No great empire was ever built with kindness."]="Benevolência é um luxo dos fortes, jovem príncipe. Nenhum grande império jamais foi construído com gentileza."
G["Benjamin Foxworthy and his pet, Sly, can be found just behind the smithy, here in Goldshire.  Maybe you should go see if he could help you."]="Encontrar a Benjamin Tratazorro e seu ajudante Astuto logo por trás do ferreiro aqui mesmo, em Vilhadorada. Talvez deveria ir a ver se você pode ajudar você."
G["Benjamin, my old friend, think you could spare an apple for Bessy today?"]="Benjamin, my old friend, think you could spare an apple for Bessy today?"
G["Berserker Stance! Attack them recklessly!"]="Berserker Stance! Attack them recklessly!"
G["Berte! Evalyn! It's getting dark. Come inside."]="Berte! Evalyn! Se você está fazendo de noite. Venham adentro."
G["Besides the Grunts outside, my brothers and I fought at the battle of Hyjal. Any who seek to steal from the bank must face us first."]="Além dos Grunts do lado de fosse, meus irmãos e eu brigamos na batalha de Hyjal. Quem procura roubar do banco deve nos enfrentar primeiro."
G["Besides, I've been busy dealing with other issues.  Dozens of my dragons died when those two enemies swept through the front lines."]="Besides, I've been busy dealing with other issues.  Dozens of my dragons died when those two enemies swept through the front lines."
G["Besides, once I've gotten the hang of this, I want to be a Tiller like the rest of you!"]="Besides, once I've gotten the hang of this, I want to be a Tiller like the rest of you!"
G["Besides... isn't it THEIR job to pick the flowers?"]="Além... acaso não é seu trabalho coletar as flores?"
G["Besides... while an axe can be a valuable tool in war, lances have their uses as well."]="Besides... while an axe can be a valuable tool in war, lances have their uses as well."
G["Bessy is a hungry girl today, isn't she? Let me go get you an apple."]="Bessy is a hungry girl today, isn't she? Let me go get you an apple."
G["Bessy whinneys happily."]="Bessy relincha de alegria."
G["Bessy, you're home. Thank the Light!"]="Bessy, está em casa. Obrigado à Luz!"
G["Best ale in Stormwind, Langston. Thanks."]="A melhor cerveja de Ventobravo, Langston. Obrigado."
G["Best bait for the biggest fish? Put a wedding ring on your hook."]="O melhor cebo para os peixe mais grandes? Coloque um anel de boda no anzol."
G["Best be on my way. Khara will be expecting me soon. See ya tomorrow X."]="Será melhor que me vá. Pronto me estará esperando Khara. Nos vemos manhã X."
G["Best be takin' your business elsewhere, $r. Don't wanna be causin' suspicion."]="Será melhor que faça seus negócios em outro lado, $r. Não quero parecer soh'torsosa."
G["Best deals in all of Stormwind my friend, won't find any better. Now, what can I help you with?"]="As melhores ofertas de Ventobravo, meu amigo. Você não encontrará nada melhor. Em que posso ajudar?"
G["Best drinks in Stormwind!"]="As melhores bebidas de Ventobravo!"
G["Best keep yer head down, \"matey!\"  If ye know what I mean!\n\nYarrrr!"]="Best keep yer head down, \"matey!\"  If ye know what I mean!\n\nYarrrr!"
G["Best move quickly through this area, stranger."]="Best move quickly through this area, stranger."
G["Best of all, we will continue to exalt in the glory of bloodshed. A race called 'humans', the enemy of our ally, will try to stop us from taking their lands."]="O melhor é que seguiremos exaltándonos na glória do derramamento de sangue. Uma raça chamado \"os humanos\", o inimigo de nosso aliado, intentará esta que tomemos seus terras."
G["Best of all, you've forever disabled his infernal machine, leaving nothing for the Horde to claim as their own."]="Best of all, you've forever disabled his infernal machine, leaving nothing for the Horde to claim as their own."
