G["Bet you didn't know that a kodo can eat its own weight in grass each day. Sure is a lot to shovel when it comes out the other end."]="Bet you didn't know that a kodo can eat its own weight in grass each day. Sure is a lot to shovel when it comes out the other end."
G["Bet you not seen a puppy riding a dragon before? Hah! And not again I think."]="Bet you not seen a puppy riding a dragon before? Hah! And not again I think."
