G["Bethekk, your priestess calls upon your might!"]="Bethekk, seu sacerdotisa evocar seu poder!"
G["Bethod was a great warrior, but apparently not great enough. Find me a new champion. We cannot afford this dishonor now!"]="Bethod was a great warrior, but apparently not great enough. Find me a new champion. We cannot afford this dishonor now!"
G["Bethod's Sword?!! Very well, $r, I accept your challenge. But first, you must best my champions. Volgur! Squash this insect!"]="A lâmina de Bethod? Muito bem, $r, aceito seu desafio. Mas primeiro, deve derrotar a meus campeões. Volgur! Esmaga a este inseto."
G["Betina, I'd like a replacement Rune of the Dawn please!"]="Betina, I'd like a replacement Rune of the Dawn please!"
G["Betina, I'd like a replacement Seal of the Dawn please!"]="Betina, I'd like a replacement Seal of the Dawn please!"
G["Betrayal of the Guardian"]="A traição do guardião"
G["Betrayed by one of our own we were. Disgraced...."]="Betrayed by one of our own we were. Disgraced...."
G["Betrayed! We came here every week. They seemed to be simple traders. \nNow these... fish-men greet us with one webbed hand, all the while with the other behind their back, holding their knives, waiting for us to turn around so they can plunge them in!"]="Betrayed! We came here every week. They seemed to be simple traders. \nNow these... fish-men greet us with one webbed hand, all the while with the other behind their back, holding their knives, waiting for us to turn around so they can plunge them in!"
G["Betrayers! The day of reckoning comes and with it comes your end! See then if your Lich King saves you from the ancient one's judgement! Now you die!"]="Betrayers! The day of reckoning comes and with it comes your end! See then if your Lich King saves you from the ancient one's judgement! Now you die!"
G["Betsy! Give me Betsy back!"]="Betsy! Devuélveme a Betsy!"
G["Better get out of here before he comes by again!"]="Será melhor sair de aqui antes de que fique!"
G["Better hurry it up! We don't wanna be here when the fighting starts."]="Better hurry it up! We don't wanna be here when the fighting starts."
G["Better hurry up, $n. I think that Thrall has news on where our people are being held."]="Será melhor que te des pressa, $n. Acho que Thrall tem notícia sobre onde têm retenida a nossa gente."
G["Better luck next time!"]="Que os vá melhor a próxima vez!"
G["Better luck next time! BWAHAHAHAH!"]="Que tenha mais sorte a próxima vez! JA, JA, JA, JA, JA!"
G["Better luck next time, $n."]="Mais sorte a próxima vez, $n."
G["Better luck next time, $n. Try using some abilities that hit more than one enemy at a time!"]="Te irá melhor a próxima vez, $n. Prova a usar habilidades que golpeiam a vários inimigos por vez."
G["Better luck next time, landlubber!"]="Mais sorte na próxima, marinheiro de água doce!"
G["Better make that a rocket scientist."]="Better make that a rocket scientist."
G["Better not get in Goregek's way!"]="Better not get in Goregek's way!"
