G["Better sharpen up, laddie! I may not be there to pull yer bacon outta the fire next time."]="Better sharpen up, laddie! I may not be there to pull yer bacon outta the fire next time."
G["Better than you have tried!"]="Better than you have tried!"
G["Better they're grateful for the clansmen spared death on this miserable hillock. We sought to protect and impress, not to shame."]="Better they're grateful for the clansmen spared death on this miserable hillock. We sought to protect and impress, not to shame."
G["Better to die than to sssubmit..."]="Melhor morrer que ssometersse..."
G["Better to rot in this cell than live as a dishonorable traitor."]="Better to rot in this cell than live as a dishonorable traitor."
