G["Between Bixi and Buliwyf, there ain't many weapons they haven't had the pleasure of slashing or smashing an orc with.  You can find them hanging out at the Timberline Arms weapon shop if ye need some training."]="Entre Bixi e Buliwyf, não há muitas armas com as quais eles não tenham tido o prazer de cortar ou esmagar um orco. Você pode encontrá-os na loja de armas Timberline Arms, se precisar de algum treinamento."
G["Between a Saurok and a Hard Place."]="Entre o saurok e a parede."
G["Between mantid, soren, mogu, fever, and countless beasts of this jungle, I refuse to let my children out of my sight."]="Between mantid, soren, mogu, fever, and countless beasts of this jungle, I refuse to let my children out of my sight."
G["Between the colors, a path.\n\nBlink across in light.\n\nFrom the water, you emerge."]="Between the colors, a path.\n\nBlink across in light.\n\nFrom the water, you emerge."
G["Between the light and the dark, there is shadow... and those shadows have powers you have yet to see."]="Entre a luz e a escuridão, há sombras... e essas sombras têm poderes que você ainda não viu."
G["Between the orange and the purple passageways near the doors to Maraudon, you will find a third path.\n\nThe scepter you hold in your hands is the key."]="Between the orange and the purple passageways near the doors to Maraudon, you will find a third path.\n\nThe scepter you hold in your hands is the key."
G["Between the orchids and the cleaner waters I might have constructed a recipe for the ultimate brew.  I may need to get at Brewmaster Shadowpour's still in order to make it work.  To do that, we'll need to beat him at his own game."]="Between the orchids and the cleaner waters I might have constructed a recipe for the ultimate brew.  I may need to get at Brewmaster Shadowpour's still in order to make it work.  To do that, we'll need to beat him at his own game."
G["Between you and me, $n, these Kun-Lai guys are kinda slow. Nothin' like us!"]="Entre você e eu, $n, estes Kun-Lai são um pouco lentos. Nada que ver conosco!"
G["Between you, me, and the tree, murlocs killed the Furlbrows. Yep, saw 'em with my own two eyes. Think they'd been casin' the joint for days, maybe months. They left in a hurry once they got wind of \"Johnny Law\" and the idiot brigade over there..."]="Between you, me, and the tree, murlocs killed the Furlbrows. Yep, saw 'em with my own two eyes. Think they'd been casin' the joint for days, maybe months. They left in a hurry once they got wind of \"Johnny Law\" and the idiot brigade over there..."
G["Beware Marduk!  Beware, or your strength will wither."]="Beware Marduk!  Beware, or your strength will wither."
