G["Beware of Wolpertingers!  They like to bite when you least expect it."]="Beware of Wolpertingers!  They like to bite when you least expect it."
G["Beware of entering Frostwolf territory, soldier. The whole damn place is booby trapped! Landmines galore! Speak with our explosives expert in the first tower on the front lines for more information. I am certain that he could teach you how to diffuse the situation."]="Beware of entering Frostwolf territory, soldier. The whole damn place is booby trapped! Landmines galore! Speak with our explosives expert in the first tower on the front lines for more information. I am certain that he could teach you how to diffuse the situation."
G["Beware of pride! Be humble! The world is plunging into chaos. Old enemies must work together. Proud races must admit they need help."]="Cuidado com o orgulho! Seja humilde! O mundo está afundando no caos. Velhos inimigos precisam trabalhar juntos. Raças orgulhosas precisam admitir que precisam de ajuda."
G["Beware the Dragonmaw Skybreakers and ascendants as they are not fooled by our magic! Always keep your distance from those entities!"]="Beware the Dragonmaw Skybreakers and ascendants as they are not fooled by our magic! Always keep your distance from those entities!"
G["Beware the crane's song, mate. You just might find yourself too distracted to fight."]="Beware the crane's song, mate. You just might find yourself too distracted to fight."
G["Beware the dangers that lie ahead... and do try to remain in one piece."]="Beware the dangers that lie ahead... and do try to remain in one piece."
