G["Bite your tongue, $r, lest I rip it from your skull case and use it as a horn warmer."]="Bite your tongue, $r, lest I rip it from your skull case and use it as a horn warmer."
G["Bite your tongue, $r. I have seen things in my lifetime that you have only heard about in legends. I have killed man, woman, and child without remorse. Under the banner of two Warchiefs of the Horde I have served... And now, I rule Boulderfist."]="Muérdete a grislíngua, $r. Eu vi coisas das que você somente tem ouvido falar em lendas. E matou a homens, mulheres e crianças sem remordimentos. E servido às ordens de dois Chefes de Guerra da Horda. E agora, dirijo aos Punho de Rocha."
