G["Blackrocks all over the damned place, Johnny. One main tower at the choke and two smaller huts. It's a death trap."]="Blackrocks all over the damned place, Johnny. One main tower at the choke and two smaller huts. It's a death trap."
G["Blacksmith."]="Ferreiro."
G["Blacksmith?  Nope, our last one turned back into one of those mindless Scourge.  There's one in the Undercity though to the south of town though.  Undercity is underneath the Ruins of Lordaeron, clever name, huh?  Just take the elevators down at the back of the ruins and then you can talk to one of the Undercity Guardians.  They should be able to point you in the right direction."]="Ferreiro? Não, nosso último voltou a ser um daqueles flagelos irracionais. Mas há um na Cidade Baixa, ao sul da cidade. A cidade subterrânea está embaixo das ruínas de Lordaeron, nome inteligente, não é? Basta descer os elevadores na parte de por trás das ruínas e conversar com um dos Guardiões da Cidade Baixa. Eles devem ser capazes de apontar na direção certa."
G["Blacksmithing"]="Blacksmithing (Ferraria)"
G["Blacksmithing Supplies"]="Suprimentos de ferraria"
G["Blacksmithing allows you to forge items from metals, minerals and stones: melee weapons, mail and plate heavy armor, raw materials used by other production professions, and upgrades to pieces of equipment such as sharpening stones and shield spikes.\nHighly skilled blacksmiths can add a gem slot to their own bracers and gloves, as well as to their own or others' belts. These gem slots may then be filled with magical gems that make the gemmed item more powerful.\nBlacksmithing pairs well with Mining as it allows you to gather your own ore and minerals."]="Blacksmithing allows you to forge items from metals, minerals and stones: melee weapons, mail and plate heavy armor, raw materials used by other production professions, and upgrades to pieces of equipment such as sharpening stones and shield spikes.\nHighly skilled blacksmiths can add a gem slot to their own bracers and gloves, as well as to their own or others' belts. These gem slots may then be filled with magical gems that make the gemmed item more powerful.\nBlacksmithing pairs well with Mining as it allows you to gather your own ore and minerals."
G["Blade Lord Ta'yak marks $n for |cFFFF0000|Hspell:122949|h[Unseen Strike]|h|r!"]="O senhor das espadas Ta'yak marca a $n para um |cFFFF0000|Hspell:122949|h[acerto invisível]|h|r!"
