G["Blight, Blight, Blight... that's all I hear about around here. I miss the diversity!\n\nHere, here. You have pets, yes? Of course you do. Of course. Little pets. I have a mixture for them. It will make them ca-- ah, clever and strong creatures, yes. Yes. Strong.\n\nTry it!"]="Blight, Blight, Blight... that's all I hear about around here. I miss the diversity!\n\nHere, here. You have pets, yes? Of course you do. Of course. Little pets. I have a mixture for them. It will make them ca-- ah, clever and strong creatures, yes. Yes. Strong.\n\nTry it!"
