G["Blood guard, you have to help me find him. He just went missing!"]="Blood guard, you have to help me find him. He just went missing!"
G["Blood is a pure offering to those who give us these vast powers.  And the blood of an innocent is purer still.  With the life fluid of our enemies, we will open the portal and step into a glorious new world - a new page in the history of the Horde!"]="Blood is a pure offering to those who give us these vast powers.  And the blood of an innocent is purer still.  With the life fluid of our enemies, we will open the portal and step into a glorious new world - a new page in the history of the Horde!"
G["Blood magic is shunned by many as a dark and forgotten art.  In that and many other ways, it shares some distinct characteristics with demonic magic.  Here, in the demon-scourged remains of the Black Morass, we believe that our blood studies will flourish."]="A magia do sangue é evitada por muitos como uma arte sombria e esquecida. Dessa e de muitas outras maneiras, ele compartilha algumas características distintas com a magia demoníaca. Aqui, nos restos mortais do pântano negro, flagelados por demônios, acreditamos que nossos estudos de sangue florescerão."
G["Blood mushrooms are more common than the other fungi varieties and can be found mostly anywhere in the woods around Bloodmyst. Keep your search south of the road dividing Bloodmyst if you value your life."]="Os cogumelos sanguíneos são mais comuns que as outras variedades de fungos e podem ser encontrados principalmente em qualquer lugar da floresta ao redor do Bloodmyst. Mantenha sua pesquisa ao sul da estrada que divide Bloodmyst se você valoriza sua vida."
