G["Borgrim might be correct.  Maybe we do need to take a break.\n\nBut now that we're here, I'm eager to get my hands dirty and study what this land has to offer."]="Borgrim might be correct.  Maybe we do need to take a break.\n\nBut now that we're here, I'm eager to get my hands dirty and study what this land has to offer."
G["Borgrim!  Get over here right this instant and help me with this unpacking!"]="Borgrim! Venha aqui agora mesmo e ajude-me a desembalar isto!"
G["Borgrim, this is no time for drinking.  We just got here.  We need to get settled in."]="Borgrim, this is no time for drinking.  We just got here.  We need to get settled in."
G["Borgus used to work at the Great Forge but I hear he moved down to Stormwind when they finished rebuilding. Rumor holds that he started a shop in the Dwarven District with a man named Kathrum Axehand."]="Borgus used to work at the Great Forge but I hear he moved down to Stormwind when they finished rebuilding. Rumor holds that he started a shop in the Dwarven District with a man named Kathrum Axehand."
G["Boring..."]="Boring..."
G["Bork, bork, bork!"]="Bork, bork, bork!"
G["Born to be Wi-i-ild!"]="Nasío pa' matar!"
G["Boss Bazzelflange wants more people fighting, and she wants 'em fighting better.\n\"Incentives!\", she says.  \"We need to give 'em a better reason to brawl!\"\nSo she has us build this zeppelin, see. Glorious views of the fight, all the fancy alcohol you can buy, and the satisfaction of bragging to your mates that you can go to a place that they can't go to. Y'see - she only lets you up if you're Rank 8 or higher.\nYou want to get up on the zep? Keep winning your fights, bucko."]="Boss Bazzelflange wants more people fighting, and she wants 'em fighting better.\n\"Incentives!\", she says.  \"We need to give 'em a better reason to brawl!\"\nSo she has us build this zeppelin, see. Glorious views of the fight, all the fancy alcohol you can buy, and the satisfaction of bragging to your mates that you can go to a place that they can't go to. Y'see - she only lets you up if you're Rank 8 or higher.\nYou want to get up on the zep? Keep winning your fights, bucko."
G["Boss Bizmo said no nobodies allowed!"]="Boss Bizmo said no nobodies allowed!"
G["Boss Cho'gall not gonna be happy 'bout dis!"]="Chefe Cho'galh não estar contente com isto!"
G["Boss says there's at least fifty people in line in front of you.\n\nIt's packed in here."]="O chefe diz que há como mínimo cinquenta pessoas na cauda antes que você. Isto está até a bandeira."
G["Boss, one of the boys is causing some trouble outside."]="Boss, one of the boys is causing some trouble outside."
G["Boss, tell Sassy that I'll get her more Kaja'Cola just as soon as production resumes."]="Boss, tell Sassy that I'll get her more Kaja'Cola just as soon as production resumes."
G["Boss, we gotta get you a bazillion macaroons by any means possible!"]="Chefe, temos que conseguir um monte de macarons por todos os meios possíveis!"
G["Boss-Lady is nuts if she thinks I'll just eat this grub!"]="Boss-Lady is nuts if she thinks I'll just eat this grub!"
G["Boss... this is real nice. Thank you."]="Boss... this is real nice. Thank you."
G["Bossy, I need to ask something great of you.  I need to cut off your head to prove my loyalty to the Bloodsail Buccaneers, so they will allow me to infiltrate their ranks and hopefully discover their true intentions.\nBooty Bay needs you, Bossy... now more than ever."]="Bossy, I need to ask something great of you.  I need to cut off your head to prove my loyalty to the Bloodsail Buccaneers, so they will allow me to infiltrate their ranks and hopefully discover their true intentions.\nBooty Bay needs you, Bossy... now more than ever."
G["Botanist Nathera has a keen eye for finding herbs, and I imagine she might impart her wisdom to the likes of you. You'll find her with the alchemists in an alcove of the Court of the Sun."]="A botânica Nathera tem um grande interesse em encontrar ervas, e imagino que ela possa transmitir sua sabedoria a pessoas como você. Você a encontrará com os alquimistas em uma alcova da Corte do Sol."
G["Both Garrosh's Landing and Pal'ea were wiped out by the mist. We're the only ones crazy enough to stay here, buddy!"]="Tanto Landing de Garrosh quanto Pal'ea foram varridos pela névoa. Nós somos os únicos loucos o suficiente para ficar aqui, amigo!"
G["Both Hanashi and Sayoc can train you in the use of one and two-handed axes. They can be found in the Valley of Honor in Orgrimmar."]="Hanashi e Sayoc podem treiná-o no uso de eixos de uma e duas mãos. Eles podem ser encontrados no Vale da Honra em Orgrimmar."
G["Both Handiir and Buliwyf can show you how to swing a mace properly, no matter the size. You can find Buliwyf within the Timberline Arms in Ironforge. Handiir spends his days in the Exodar, training draenei on the Trader's Tier."]="Handiir e Buliwyf podem mostrar como balançar uma maça corretamente, não importa o tamanho. Você pode encontrar Buliwyf dentro da Timberline Arms em Ironforge. Handiir passa seus dias no Exodar, treinando draenei no Nível do Negociador."
G["Both Ilyenia Moonfire on the Warrior's Terrace of Darnassus and Bixi Wobblebonk of the Timberline Arms in Ironforge can show you how to use throwing weapons properly."]="Tanto Ilyenia Moonfire no Terraço do Guerreiro de Darnassus quanto Bixi Wobblebonk da Timberline Arms em Ironforge podem mostrar como usar armas de arremesso corretamente."
G["Both Lost Rigger Cove in Tanaris and the Bay of Storms in Azshara have boxes that can be picked to improve your skill."]="Tanto a Lost Rigger Cove em Tanaris quanto a Bay of Storms em Azshara têm caixas que podem ser escolhidas para melhorar sua habilidade."
G["Both are places of great evil.  This is the leg of my journey that I shun the most."]="Both are places of great evil.  This is the leg of my journey that I shun the most."
G["Both da alliance and da horde got ships sailin for da harbor.  We gonna split der forces an assault da front gate."]="Both da alliance and da horde got ships sailin for da harbor.  We gonna split der forces an assault da front gate."
G["Both of you know I would never order such a thing! Why would I set one half my son's inheritance against the other?"]="Both of you know I would never order such a thing! Why would I set one half my son's inheritance against the other?"
G["Both our peoples have suffered greatly at the hands of Kael'thas and his agents, Lady Liadrin. Your people were not the authors of their own fate, but they will die if they do not change."]="Both our peoples have suffered greatly at the hands of Kael'thas and his agents, Lady Liadrin. Your people were not the authors of their own fate, but they will die if they do not change."
G["Both sides defended the keep! Draw!"]="Ambos bandos têm defendido a fortaleza! Empate!"
G["Both students close their eyes, straining to hear the voices."]="Both students close their eyes, straining to hear the voices."
G["Both the Horde and Alliance captains have fallen!  Defeat Drek'Thar before it's too late!"]="Both the Horde and Alliance captains have fallen!  Defeat Drek'Thar before it's too late!"
G["Both the Horde and Alliance captains have taken to the field.  Our Captain Balinda Stonehearth directs the Stormpike forces from the Stonehearth Outpost, and the enemy Captain Galvangar barks orders from within Iceblood Garrison.\n\nTo battle!"]="Both the Horde and Alliance captains have taken to the field.  Our Captain Balinda Stonehearth directs the Stormpike forces from the Stonehearth Outpost, and the enemy Captain Galvangar barks orders from within Iceblood Garrison.\n\nTo battle!"
G["Both the Horde and Alliance captains have taken to the field.  Our Captain Galvangar directs the Frostwolves from Iceblood Garrison, and his rival, Captain Balinda Stonehearth, hides in her Stonehearth Outpost.\n\nThe battle has begun!"]="Both the Horde and Alliance captains have taken to the field.  Our Captain Galvangar directs the Frostwolves from Iceblood Garrison, and his rival, Captain Balinda Stonehearth, hides in her Stonehearth Outpost.\n\nThe battle has begun!"
