G["Bravo Company Field Kit ACTIVE. New abilities are now available on your action bar.\nToggle Bravo Company Field Kit to DEACTIVATE."]="Bravo Company Field Kit ACTIVE. New abilities are now available on your action bar.\nToggle Bravo Company Field Kit to DEACTIVATE."
