G["Brewfest has called down the thunder!  Thunderbrew, that is!"]="A Festa da Cerveja tem invocado aos trovões! aos Cebatruenos!"
G["Brewfest has undergone some changes since its first year.  We now issue Brewfest tokens instead of tickets.  If you have old tickets, I can exchange them for you."]="Brewfest sofreu algumas mudanças desde o primeiro ano. Agora emitimos tokens Brewfest em vez de tickets. Se você tiver bilhetes antigos, posso trocá-os por você."
G["Brewfest is a non-stop party.  Setting up for it, though, is non-stop work!"]="Brewfest is a non-stop party.  Setting up for it, though, is non-stop work!"
G["Brewfest is all about enjoying the very best food and drink in the lands, and that's no exaggeration! Just take a gander at the many invigorating hand-crafted beers and holiday sausages, pretzels, and cheeses available. You'll find nothing better, and for so little coin!"]="Brewfest é tudo sobre apreciar a melhor comida e bebida nas terras, e isso não é exagero! Basta dar uma olhada nas muitas cervejas artesanais revigorantes e salsichas, pretzels e queijos disponíveis. Você não encontrará nada melhor e por tão pouca moeda!"
G["Brewfest is all about the beer and the eats, and it don't get any better than what we're serving up. Think I'm lying? Just check out all the tasty brews, sausages, pretzels, and cheeses we got. You'll see: Best chow around, and it don't get any cheaper!"]="Brewfest é tudo sobre cerveja e comida, e não fica melhor do que o que estamos servindo. Acha que estou mentindo? Basta verificar todas as saborosas cervejas, salsichas, pretzels e queijos que recebemos. Você verá: Melhor comida, e não fica mais barata!"
G["Brewfest is almost here!"]="A Festa da Cerveja se aproxima!"
G["Brewfest is the perfect holiday!  But it's got one catch, Dark Iron dwarf attacks.  They happen nearly every half-hour!\n\nThe attackers target the kegs that dispense the FREE brew!  And it's really good brew that the brewmasters are giving out!\n\nLook, if you're around when the Dark Iron dwarves show up, lend a hand and protect the FREE brew."]="Brewfest is the perfect holiday!  But it's got one catch, Dark Iron dwarf attacks.  They happen nearly every half-hour!\n\nThe attackers target the kegs that dispense the FREE brew!  And it's really good brew that the brewmasters are giving out!\n\nLook, if you're around when the Dark Iron dwarves show up, lend a hand and protect the FREE brew."
G["Brewly keeps drinking Uncle's brew.  Hope it makes him strong in the fight!"]="Brewly keeps drinking Uncle's brew.  Hope it makes him strong in the fight!"
G["Brewmaster Blanche is probably up on Thunderpaw Overlook. She's convinced a storm is on the way, so I'd better make sure her equipment is ready.\n\nI can't imagine I'll ever be half the Brewmaster she is - she once casked a Spring breeze. When they uncorked it a year later at the Jade Temple, you could still smell the blossoms!"]="Brewmaster Blanche is probably up on Thunderpaw Overlook. She's convinced a storm is on the way, so I'd better make sure her equipment is ready.\n\nI can't imagine I'll ever be half the Brewmaster she is - she once casked a Spring breeze. When they uncorked it a year later at the Jade Temple, you could still smell the blossoms!"
G["Brewmaster Blanche is trying to make Boomer Brew in the middle of a storm, but some formidable enemies are getting in her way."]="Brewmaster Blanche is trying to make Boomer Brew in the middle of a storm, but some formidable enemies are getting in her way."
G["Brewmaster Wanderbrew, at your service.\n\nI travel the Jade Forest in search of only the finest of ingredients for my brews.\n\nUnlike the high and mighty Goldendrafts of Dawn's Blossom.\n\nThey have their big brewhouse for mass producing. Which is fine, you know, if you enjoy drinking swill."]="Brewmaster Wanderbrew, at your service.\n\nI travel the Jade Forest in search of only the finest of ingredients for my brews.\n\nUnlike the high and mighty Goldendrafts of Dawn's Blossom.\n\nThey have their big brewhouse for mass producing. Which is fine, you know, if you enjoy drinking swill."
G["Brewmaster! Bataari scouting parties have been sighted outside the village!"]="Brewmaster! Bataari scouting parties have been sighted outside the village!"
G["Brewmasters"]="Brewmasters"
G["Brews"]="Bebidas"
G["Brggl-brggl Mrgl-Mrgl! Gluk!"]="Brggl-brggl Mrgl-Mrgl! Gluk!"
G["Briaw Shan is a champion brew tosser, $n. He could toss a barrel into the air and then have it come crashing down on these yaungol! I saw him over by the inn earlier today. Go see if he can help!"]="Briaw Shan é um campeão de lançamento de cerveja, $n. Poderá lançar um barril ao ar e fazer que cayera acima de estes yaungol! Antes o vi perto da estalagem. Vê a ver se você pode nos ajudar!"
G["Bribe who you must, but I need some inside information this week if I'm to make a profit and keep your lot employed.  Off with you!"]="Bribe who you must, but I need some inside information this week if I'm to make a profit and keep your lot employed.  Off with you!"
G["Bridle your enthusiasm, $r.\n\nYou embark upon a fool's errand that will likely be your undoing. Forces that have corrupted the most noble among us will relentlessly assault you.\n\nKnow this; succumb and I shall have no choice but to deliver you from this world."]="Bridle your enthusiasm, $r.\n\nYou embark upon a fool's errand that will likely be your undoing. Forces that have corrupted the most noble among us will relentlessly assault you.\n\nKnow this; succumb and I shall have no choice but to deliver you from this world."
G["Brill's only chef is in the middle of town.\n\nWe don't know why he's out there; he won't sell anything he makes. We also don't know where he's getting that fresh raw meat.\n\nWell, no matter. Good luck."]="Brill's only chef is in the middle of town.\n\nWe don't know why he's out there; he won't sell anything he makes. We also don't know where he's getting that fresh raw meat.\n\nWell, no matter. Good luck."
G["Brilliant victory, $n! Now get back in line."]="Uma vitória brilhante, $n! Agora volta à cauda."
G["Brilliant!"]="Brilhante!"
G["Bring back good meat and the camp treat you like high-shaman for a day. Good deal."]="Traz boa carne e o acampamento te tratará como a um alto xamã durante um dia. Bom trato."
G["Bring back my sheep!"]="Devuélveme a meu ovelha!"
G["Bring down the halls! NOW!"]="Bring down the halls! NOW!"
G["Bring elevator to first floor."]="Levou elevador ao primeiro piso."
G["Bring elevator to second floor."]="Levou elevador ao segundo piso."
G["Bring elevator to third floor."]="Levou elevador ao terceiro piso."
G["Bring forth the blood elf."]="Bring forth the blood elf."
G["Bring forth the first challenge!"]="Traga adiante o primeiro desafio!"
G["Bring forth the imps!"]="Bring forth the imps!"
G["Bring her down quick so I can wrap my fingers around her neck."]="Bring her down quick so I can wrap my fingers around her neck."
G["Bring her, Godfrey!"]="Tráela, Godfrey!"
G["Bring him on!"]="Bring him on!"
G["Bring it on!"]="Pode vir!"
G["Bring it on, Rocco."]="Tráelo, Rocco."
G["Bring it on, hot stuff!"]="Bring it on, hot stuff!"
G["Bring it on, jerk."]="Faça o que possa, feio."
G["Bring it on, you son of a mangy ogre!"]="Bring it on, you son of a mangy ogre!"
G["Bring it, uglies!"]="Atreveos, insetos!"
G["Bring me another plaything to launch!"]="Bring me another plaything to launch!"
G["Bring me another toy!"]="Bring me another toy!"
G["Bring me his cruel, black heart. We will be doing the Pandaren a favor, and the powers that we liberate will once again be put to the service of Azeroth."]="Traga-me seu coração negro e cruel. Estaremos fazendo um favor a Pandária, os poderes que liberarmos finalmente servirão a Azeroth."
G["Bring me more prisoners! Do not rest until Azeroth has been cleansed of its reckless magic-users!"]="Bring me more prisoners! Do not rest until Azeroth has been cleansed of its reckless magic-users!"
G["Bring me the skulls of our enemies!  Go now and kill them all! [PH]"]="Bring me the skulls of our enemies!  Go now and kill them all! [PH]"
G["Bring me their corpses!"]="Quero seus cadáveres!"
G["Bring me their flesh..."]="Tráeme seu carne..."
G["Bring me their heads!"]="Tráeme seus cabeças!"
G["Bring me your weapon, champion, that I might feed it the soul of its master!"]="Bring me your weapon, champion, that I might feed it the soul of its master!"
G["Bring on any opposition! The Burning Blade shall make a feast of your soul!"]="Que venham os oponentes! O Filo Ardente se dará um banquete com as suas almas!"
G["Bring on the naga! I'm hungry for battle!"]="Que venham os nagas! Tenho ganha de luta!"
G["Bring on the sha!"]="Traga o sha!"
G["Bring out the gladiator!"]="Bring out the gladiator!"
G["Bring that back up to Yancey, by the waterfall.  The ignorant human'll have no idea that it's not me."]="Bring that back up to Yancey, by the waterfall.  The ignorant human'll have no idea that it's not me."
G["Bring the Flenser the fallen Horde! They will be reanimated as soldiers of the Lich King!"]="Bring the Flenser the fallen Horde! They will be reanimated as soldiers of the Lich King!"
G["Bring the fight to me and pay with your lives!"]="Bring the fight to me and pay with your lives!"
G["Bring the fight to me!"]="Bring the fight to me!"
G["Bring the fight to the enemy, men!"]="Bring the fight to the enemy, men!"
G["Bring the sacrifices to the master's flesh and blood within the other hives. (They hunger...)"]="Bring the sacrifices to the master's flesh and blood within the other hives. (They hunger...)"
G["Bring them before the chapel!"]="Bring them before the chapel!"
G["Bring them within reach of my blade!"]="Bring them within reach of my blade!"
G["Bring these invaders a swift death, $n!"]="Que os invasores sufran uma morte rápida, $n!"
G["Bring this whelp more food!"]="Tráele mais comida a esta filhote!"
G["Bring up the grunts. Attack!"]="Que venham os brutos. Ataquem!"
G["Bring us in closer!"]="Acerquémonos!"
G["Bring us into port, please, Mr. Mehran."]="Lhévenos ao porto, Sr. Mehran."
G["Bring us victory, $n, and we shall grant you the honor you deserve! Fight for the Alliance!"]="Bring us victory, $n, and we shall grant you the honor you deserve! Fight for the Alliance!"
G["Bring us wood to graft into our saplings, $p. We shall make do with the roots in the region."]="Bring us wood to graft into our saplings, $p. We shall make do with the roots in the region."
G["Bringing our war to these natives is wrong. We should be teaching them the best of ourselves not the worst..."]="Bringing our war to these natives is wrong. We should be teaching them the best of ourselves not the worst..."
G["Bristlepine harder hunt than this! Dumb big-tongues."]="Pinocerdas é mais difícil de caçar que isto! Estúpidos línguas-grandes."
G["Brita, create a pincushion of this puny $c!"]="Brita, create a pincushion of this puny $c!"
G["Brittle bones and stringy flesh. Come, come! Feed the flames!"]="Brittle bones and stringy flesh. Come, come! Feed the flames!"
G["Brivelthwerp's Ice Cream Empire. Now offering TWO flavors!"]="Brivelthwerp's Ice Cream Empire. Now offering TWO flavors!"
G["Brivelthwerp's, it's what's for dessert!"]="Bridatuer, é melhor que beber!"
G["Bro, my pet is going to incinerate you!"]="Mano, minha mascote vai torrar você!"
G["Brock. Torren. I am going inside for an ale and to warm myself by the fire."]="Brock. Torren. I am going inside for an ale and to warm myself by the fire."
G["Brogg is glad Mudsprocket goblins have let him stay here, but sometimes thinks he hears them laughing at him."]="Brogg está feliz que os duendes Mudsprocket o deixaram ficar aqui, mas às vezes pensa que ele os ouve rindo dele."
G["Brogg, I beseech you to send some of your goblins to Westreach Summit now, before it is too late."]="Brogg, I beseech you to send some of your goblins to Westreach Summit now, before it is too late."
G["Brogg. You don't mind me calling you that, right? Wait, which head am I talking to?"]="Brogg. Não te importa que te chame assim, verdade? Aguarda, com que cabeça estou falando?"
G["Broke both me legs that night. How could I forget?"]="Broke both me legs that night. How could I forget?"
G["Broken of the Ashtongue tribe, your leader speaks!"]="Tábido da tribo Grislíngua de cinza, seu líder fala."
G["Broken pillar not safe place. Dajik go now, you need go too."]="Broken pillar not safe place. Dajik go now, you need go too."
G["Broken. Mnngghhh... broken..."]="Front. Mnngghh... front..."
G["Brokentoe prepares to charge."]="Dedoquebrado se prepara para atacar."
G["Broketooth need food. Wikkets have food. Ravage!"]="Broketooth need food. Wikkets have food. Ravage!"
G["Brom Killian teach you how dig up shiny for me.  Him on inner ring of War Quarter."]="Brom Killian ensina como desenterrar coisas brilhantes para mim. Ele no anel interno do War Quarter."
G["Bron! 'Ey, Bron! Hit me!"]="Bron! Eh, Bron! Pégame!"
G["Bronco bucks %s from its back and escapes into the wild!"]="Bronco tira a %s do seu costas e escapa para o florestas!"
G["Bronco? That sounds like a good one!"]="Bronco? Esse soa bem!"
G["Brontes sees all."]="Brontes o vê tudo."
G["Bronze Dragonshrine"]="Santuário Dragônico Bronze"
G["Bronze dragonflight."]="O Voo Bronze."
G["Bronzebeard's gone missing again! That dwarf sure didn't get any of his brother's good senses."]="Bronzebeard desapareceu novamente! Aquele anão com certeza não entendeu nenhum dos bons sentidos do seu irmão."
G["Brood Guardians reporting in!"]="Os Guardas do Linagem vão para além!"
G["Brood of the Earth-Warder... you answer to a black dragon? Give me a name!"]="Prole do Guardião da Terra... Respondes ante um dragão Negro? Dê-me um nome!"
G["Broodmaster Noshi begins to cast a massive Death Nova.  Get inside the Big Bad Voodoo!"]="O mestre de linagem Noshi começa a lançar uma Nova de morte enorme. Entrar no grande vodu malvado!"
G["Broodmaster Noshi begins to drain power from everything around him!"]="O mestre de linagem Noshi começa a drenar poder de tudo o que lhe perto!"
G["Broodmaster Noshi begins to hatch a group of Darkhatched Swarmlings!"]="Broodmaster Noshi begins to hatch a group of Darkhatched Swarmlings!"
G["Broodmaster Noshi is stunned by the stalactite!"]="Broodmaster Noshi is stunned by the stalactite!"
G["Brother Brokendice is taking all of my hard earned gold and goods! I should have known not to trust a grummle. Never trust something half your size..."]="Brother Brokendice is taking all of my hard earned gold and goods! I should have known not to trust a grummle. Never trust something half your size..."
G["Brother Rabbitsfoot may be smart and tall, and smells of luck and good fortune. But he snores and makes bad jokes about my luckydo yakshoe."]="Brother Rabbitsfoot may be smart and tall, and smells of luck and good fortune. But he snores and makes bad jokes about my luckydo yakshoe."
G["Brother Wilhelm often trains with Lyria Du Lac out in back of the smithy in Goldshire.  You could probably learn a thing or two about being a paladin from him."]="O irmão Wilhelm freqüentemente treina com Lyria Du Lac nos fundos da ferraria em Goldshire. Você provavelmente poderia aprender uma coisa ou duas sobre ser um paladino dele."
G["Brother!"]="Irmão!"
G["Brother! There you are! I can barely believe my eyes... you're alive!"]="Irmão! Aí está! Apenas posso acreditar o que vejo... está vivo!"
G["Brother, I see great darkness looming before you."]="Brother, I see great darkness looming before you."
G["Brother, it cannot be... (Destiny has come!) My strength... (Too proud! He speaks in blood! Listen!) My mind... (It is for His glory we serve!) What... is happening... (Gone is the dawn. Come shades of Twilight. Come madness, come havoc, come Infinite Night!)"]="Brother, it cannot be... (Destiny has come!) My strength... (Too proud! He speaks in blood! Listen!) My mind... (It is for His glory we serve!) What... is happening... (Gone is the dawn. Come shades of Twilight. Come madness, come havoc, come Infinite Night!)"
G["Brother, we are shattered. (But the Master... I still hear... so angry... Master...?)"]="Irmão, temos banido destrozados. (Mas o mestre... ainda oigo... tão bravo... mestre?)"
G["Brother, we are shattered. Let her finish them. (The Master does not want them near her... Brother?  The Master seethes...)"]="Brother, we are shattered. Let her finish them. (The Master does not want them near her... Brother?  The Master seethes...)"
G["Brother, we must look to our defenses. The Alliance are encroaching on us from the east."]="Brother, we must look to our defenses. The Alliance are encroaching on us from the east."
G["Brother. A timely arrival..."]="Irmão. Logo a tempo..."
G["Brothers and sisters of the Horde! Enemies surround us on all sides! Your courage in weeks to come will be the difference between victory and defeat."]="Brothers and sisters of the Horde! Enemies surround us on all sides! Your courage in weeks to come will be the difference between victory and defeat."
G["Brothers and sisters of the Horde, Orgimmar is under attack!  Take up your arms and defend our capital!  If you are unable to wage war against the intruders, then help place barricades to fortify our city!  LOK'TAR OGAR!"]="Brothers and sisters of the Horde, Orgimmar is under attack!  Take up your arms and defend our capital!  If you are unable to wage war against the intruders, then help place barricades to fortify our city!  LOK'TAR OGAR!"
G["Brothers and sisters, I have been to the promised land. I have tasted in the sublime energy. I have felt bliss - bliss so engrossing and all encompassing that I was left wondering if I had stumbled upon the dreams of gods."]="Brothers and sisters, I have been to the promised land. I have tasted in the sublime energy. I have felt bliss - bliss so engrossing and all encompassing that I was left wondering if I had stumbled upon the dreams of gods."
G["Brothers and sisters, I have called you here today to discuss the fate of Lordaeron."]="Irmãos e irmãs, os e convocado para falar do destino de Lordaeron."
G["Brothers and sisters, Ironforge is under attack!  Take up your arms and defend our capital!  If you do not want to answer the call of battle, then grab some fortifications and line help keep the walls from collapsing on us!"]="Brothers and sisters, Ironforge is under attack!  Take up your arms and defend our capital!  If you do not want to answer the call of battle, then grab some fortifications and line help keep the walls from collapsing on us!"
G["Brothers and sisters, tonight we hunt! A blood elf known as Matis must be brought to justice! The first to find him gets one week's vacation aboard the Exodar!"]="Brothers and sisters, tonight we hunt! A blood elf known as Matis must be brought to justice! The first to find him gets one week's vacation aboard the Exodar!"
G["Brothers and sisters, we must remain united! The Lich King will never fall to a world divided!"]="Irmãos e irmãs, devemos permanecer unidos! O Rei Lich nunca cairá a mãos de um mundo dividido!"
G["Brothers in chaos, the Twilight has come! (Shadows lengthen, endless night.) Deathwing has sundered this world. (Doors once opened never close.) So that its true Lords may return. (The Master comes, He comes He comes.)"]="Brothers in chaos, the Twilight has come! (Shadows lengthen, endless night.) Deathwing has sundered this world. (Doors once opened never close.) So that its true Lords may return. (The Master comes, He comes He comes.)"
G["Brothers of Twilight! The Hammer calls to you! (Fire water earth air). Leave your mortal shell behind. (Fire water earth air). Embrace your new forms for here and everafter! (Burn and drown and crush and suffocate). And use your gifts to destroy the unbelievers. (Burn and drown and crush and suffocate)!!"]="Brothers of Twilight! The Hammer calls to you! (Fire water earth air). Leave your mortal shell behind. (Fire water earth air). Embrace your new forms for here and everafter! (Burn and drown and crush and suffocate). And use your gifts to destroy the unbelievers. (Burn and drown and crush and suffocate)!!"
G["Brothers of the Hammer, to me! (Their will is still their own.) The unbelievers still stand. Destroy them! (Crush their bodies, crush their will.)"]="Brothers of the Hammer, to me! (Their will is still their own.) The unbelievers still stand. Destroy them! (Crush their bodies, crush their will.)"
G["Brothers! Dispose of these insolent outsiders!"]="Irmãos! Encargaos desses forasteiros insolentes!"
G["Brothers! Strike now!"]="Irmãos! Ataquem agora!"
G["Brothers, Vol'tar has fallen!"]="Irmãos, Vol'tar tem caído!"
G["Brothers, beware! These mortals are dangerous. I must pause and gather my strength."]="Brothers, beware! These mortals are dangerous. I must pause and gather my strength."
G["Brothers, prepare yourselves! Take up defensive positions along the ramp and make way to let the vehilces through. Born from the earth, to the earth shall we return. Let the might of the Makers burn deep within you!"]="Brothers, prepare yourselves! Take up defensive positions along the ramp and make way to let the vehilces through. Born from the earth, to the earth shall we return. Let the might of the Makers burn deep within you!"
G["Brothers, sisters, Arygos speaks of our troubled past."]="Irmãos, irmãs, Arygos fala de nosso atribulado passado."
G["Brothers, we must take what is ours."]="Irmãos, devemos pegar o que é nosso."
G["Brothers. Sisters. We are ABANDONED - the orphaned children of Stormwind."]="Brothers. Sisters. We are ABANDONED - the orphaned children of Stormwind."
G["Browse my wares to your hearts content! From the finest in enchantments, to the latest in fashion, you can find it all here."]="Browse my wares to your hearts content! From the finest in enchantments, to the latest in fashion, you can find it all here."
G["Brrrr... It's cold up here."]="Brrrr... Há frio aqui cima."
G["Bruce! Why!?!"]="Bruce! Por que?!"
G["Brutal!"]="Brutal!"
G["Brutish though they seem, these iron-stitched horrors are exceedingly brilliant engineers and forge-smiths."]="Brutish though they seem, these iron-stitched horrors are exceedingly brilliant engineers and forge-smiths."
G["Brutusk is out watering the bushes right now.\n\nStay close though, $n. He should be ready for our ride to Splintertree very soon."]="Brutusk tem saindo a regar os arbustos.\n\nMas não te alejes, $n. Estará pronto para nosso viagem ao Machadozo muito pronto."
G["Brutusk roars as he leaps into the ambush!"]="Brutusk ruge e salta até a emboscada!"
G["Brutusk... NOOOOOO!!"]="Brutusk... NOOOOOO!!"
G["Brzt... click... whir..."]="Brr... clique... fiuu..."
