G["Buckets! Where's my laundry?"]="Cubos! Onde está meu colada?"
G["Budd! Noooo!"]="Budd! Noooo!"
G["Budd's crew, ye mean?\n\nAye, he be no respecter of persons. He'll take on anyone who can work a shovel\n\n...'cept them undead. Budd hates 'em. Personally, I think he's scared of 'em."]="Budd's crew, ye mean?\n\nAye, he be no respecter of persons. He'll take on anyone who can work a shovel\n\n...'cept them undead. Budd hates 'em. Personally, I think he's scared of 'em."
G["Budd's crew, ye mean? Aye, he be no respecter of persons. He'll take on anyone who can work a shovel.\n\n'cept them undead. Budd hates 'em. Scared of 'em, likely as not."]="Budd's crew, ye mean? Aye, he be no respecter of persons. He'll take on anyone who can work a shovel.\n\n'cept them undead. Budd hates 'em. Scared of 'em, likely as not."
G["Buddy, did you know that every farmer worth his dirt is a member of the Tiller's Union?"]="Buddy, did you know that every farmer worth his dirt is a member of the Tiller's Union?"
G["Buddy, ye know... sometimes it's nice to see you around."]="Buddy, ye know... sometimes it's nice to see you around."
G["Buddy, ye sure got a big mouth. Does it ever stop yappin'?"]="Buddy, ye sure got a big mouth. Does it ever stop yappin'?"
G["Build at least 3 Sunflowers to survive this mission."]="Build at least 3 Sunflowers to survive this mission."
G["Build some defenses before Warden Stillwater arrives!"]="Build some defenses before Warden Stillwater arrives!"
G["Built twelve thousand years ago by a covert sect of night elf sorcerers, the ancient city of Eldre'Thalas was used to protect Queen Azshara's most prized arcane secrets. Though it was ravaged by the Great Sundering of the world, much of the wondrous city still stands as the imposing Dire Maul. The ruins' three distinct districts have been overrun by all manner of creatures - especially the spectral highborne, foul satyr and brutish ogres."]="Built twelve thousand years ago by a covert sect of night elf sorcerers, the ancient city of Eldre'Thalas was used to protect Queen Azshara's most prized arcane secrets. Though it was ravaged by the Great Sundering of the world, much of the wondrous city still stands as the imposing Dire Maul. The ruins' three distinct districts have been overrun by all manner of creatures - especially the spectral highborne, foul satyr and brutish ogres."
G["Buliwyf here will happily teach you everything there is to know about guns!"]="Buliwyf aqui terá tudo o prazer em ensinar tudo o que há para saber sobre armas!"
G["Bull's-eye!"]="Diana!"
G["Bullheadedness? It is my perseverance that has gotten us this far, dandy. You wouldn't last five seconds."]="Bullheadedness? It is my perseverance that has gotten us this far, dandy. You wouldn't last five seconds."
G["Bullseye!"]="Diana!"
G["Bullseye! That blasted dwarf doesn't know what he is talking about. Only thing wrong with Grumlar's gun is Grumlar's aim."]="Diana! Esse maldito anão não sabe de que está falando. O único problema com a pistola de Grumlar é a puntería de Grumlar."
G["Bully!"]="Matones!"
G["Bunnies and fawns? Yes, we have those. Will you now come and help us at New Thalanaar? Wait... why do you want to know?"]="Bunnies and fawns? Yes, we have those. Will you now come and help us at New Thalanaar? Wait... why do you want to know?"
G["Burn beneath my molten fury!"]="Burn beneath my molten fury!"
G["Burn beneath my molten fury."]="Burn beneath my molten fury."
G["Burn dem all ta cinders!"]="Reduci'os a cinzas!"
G["Burn everything. Leave no survivors."]="Burn everything. Leave no survivors."
