G["Burn in the liquid heat of the Firelands!"]="Arde no calor líquido das Terras de Fogo!"
G["Burn in the master's flame!"]="Burn in the master's flame!"
G["Burn it down, boys. Burn it all down."]="Burn it down, boys. Burn it all down."
G["Burn it to the ground!"]="Queime tudo até o chão!"
G["Burn their bodies, shred their skins, crush their creaking carapaces!"]="Burn their bodies, shred their skins, crush their creaking carapaces!"
G["Burn their ships. Butcher their flight master. Sabotage their war machines. And rescue our spy!"]="Burn their ships. Butcher their flight master. Sabotage their war machines. And rescue our spy!"
G["Burn them all! Burn them to ash!"]="Burn them all! Burn them to ash!"
G["Burn!"]="Arde!"
G["Burn! BURN AND SUFFER!"]="Burn! BURN AND SUFFER!"
G["Burn! BURN!"]="Arde! ARDE!"
G["Burn! Burn! Burn!"]="Arde! Arde! Arde!"
G["Burn! Burn, you wretches!"]="Burn! Burn, you wretches!"
G["Burn!!"]="Arde!!"
