G["Burn, baby, burn!"]="Arde, inseto, arde!"
G["Burn, burned, burnt! Hahahahaha!"]="Burn, burned, burnt! Hahahahaha!"
G["Burn, land dweller! BURN!"]="Arde, habitante da terra! ARDE!"
G["Burn, mutants, BURN!"]="Burn, mutants, BURN!"
G["Burn, tauren!  BURN!!"]="Arde, tauren! ARDE!"
G["Burn, you fiends!"]="Burn, you fiends!"
G["Burn, you hellish fiends!"]="Burn, you hellish fiends!"
