G["Burned down to their frames! No one goes home until our job here is done!"]="Burned down to their frames! No one goes home until our job here is done!"
G["Burninate's the name, smithin's my game... and, erm... I sell a little food and water on the side. Care for some meat?"]="Burninate é o nome, smithin é o meu jogo... e, erm... eu vendo um pouco de comida e água ao lado. Cuidar de um pouco de carne?"
G["Burning"]="Burning"
G["Burning Ice!"]="Gelo ardente!"
G["Burning Steppes - Tablet of the Seven"]="Estepes Ardentes - Tabuleta dos Sete"
G["Burning Treants erupt from the ground to aid the Protector!"]="Burning Treants erupt from the ground to aid the Protector!"
G["Burning eyes within the prism fill your mind with a sense of dread..."]="Burning eyes within the prism fill your mind with a sense of dread..."
G["Burning eyes within the prism fill your mind with a sense of dread... especially knowing that you don't have the thirty-five apexis shards needed to summon forth its demon."]="Olhos ardentes dentro do prisma enchem sua mente com uma sensação de pavor... especialmente sabendo que você não tem os 35 fragmentos de apex necessários para convocar seu demônio."
G["Burning up the dance floor!"]="Queimando a pista de baile!"
G["Burnnnnnnn..."]="Burnnnnnnn..."
G["Burp! Hon, that was really good. Not only do you know how to catch a fish but you sure do know how to cook one."]="Oorp! Carinho, que bom estava! Não somente sabe pescar peixe, mas sim também os preparas de maravilha."
G["Bury me with me shovel...\nLiterally..."]="Bury me with me shovel...\nLiterally..."
G["Bury this place! Your master demands it!"]="Bury this place! Your master demands it!"
G["Business been bad lately, Sudsy?"]="Business been bad lately, Sudsy?"
G["Business concluded."]="Business concluded."
G["Business must be good down at the bazaar.  I'll get him resupplied right away!"]="Business must be good down at the bazaar.  I'll get him resupplied right away!"
G["Busy day today. I show at least ten people in line in front of you. Not too many more than that, though."]="É um dia agemtreado. Há ao menos dez pessoas na cauda antes que você, mas não muito mais."
G["Busy day today. There's at least ten people in line in front of you. Not too many more than that, though."]="É um dia agemtreado. Há ao menos dez pessoas na cauda antes que você, mas não muito mais."
G["Busy times friend, busy times...\n\nI can't stop for an idle chat I'm afraid - the Southshore Militia need more armor pronto. If you want to lend a hand however, you're more than welcome to."]="Busy times friend, busy times...\n\nI can't stop for an idle chat I'm afraid - the Southshore Militia need more armor pronto. If you want to lend a hand however, you're more than welcome to."
G["Busy, busy!  So much to do, so little time!\n\nNow where did I put that pyrospanner?  I know it's around here somewhere... I burned my fingers on it just a moment ago!"]="Busy, busy!  So much to do, so little time!\n\nNow where did I put that pyrospanner?  I know it's around here somewhere... I burned my fingers on it just a moment ago!"
G["But $n has thwarted his plans at every turn, and the dwarves of Ironforge stand with us!"]="$n, Mas nosso corajoso campeão tem frustrado seus planos continuamente e agoraos anões de Altaforja estão conosco!"
G["But -"]="Mas..."
G["But Arthas was not invincible! With each passing day his power waned - his grip over the will of the damned loosening."]="But Arthas was not invincible! With each passing day his power waned - his grip over the will of the damned loosening."
G["But Brend, yer always drinkin'!"]="Mas Brend, você sempre está bebendo!"
G["But I always excelled at poisons."]="Mas sempre destaqué com os venenos."
G["But I am certain that Shen-zin Su knows we are here. And he cares for every one of us!"]="But I am certain that Shen-zin Su knows we are here. And he cares for every one of us!"
G["But I am certain that the mists parted for a reason. YOU are that reason. Find your purpose here."]="do que estou certa é de que a névoa se dissipou por uma razão. E você é essa razão. Encontre seu propósito."
G["But I am not yet finished. Death to the king!"]="Mas ainda não estou terminado. Morte ao Rei!"
G["But I can still sense them. My cowardly brothers and sisters will cause untold suffering if we allow them to stay in the shadows."]="But I can still sense them. My cowardly brothers and sisters will cause untold suffering if we allow them to stay in the shadows."
G["But I didn't get you anything. Aww shucks, thanks anyway."]="Mas eu não tenho nada para você. Vá porra. Obrigado de todos modos."
G["But I do know this - love makes the heart and body weak. It can be exploited. Without your love, I have only my work, Annalise."]="Mas sei que o amor debilitao coração e o corpo. Se lhe pode tirar partido. Sem seu amor, tão somente me ocorrida meu trabalho, Annalise."
G["But I drove my mole machine all the way down here..."]="Mas eu dirigi minha toupeira até aqui..."
G["But I guess I just feel... I feel a little piece of my life is missing.  Faded.  Like waking from a dream."]="Mas suponho que sinto... como se um pedaço de minha vida tivesse sumiu. Borrada. Como ao despertar de um sonho."
G["But I held on to one vice. The one sha I never conquered. PRIDE."]="Mas restou um vício. O único sha que não dominei. O ORGULHO."
G["But I suppose it's the only plan we've got."]="Mas acho que é o único plano que temos."
G["But I think that bell has got some power... and it's bad."]="But I think that bell has got some power... and it's bad."
G["But I want you to imagine standing in this very valley on the day he returned from his journey. Imagine being here when the gates opened for him. By then our emperor was a creature of pure light: No doubts, no fears, no hatred..."]="Mas eu quero que você se imagine neste mesmo vale no dia em que ele voltou de sua jornada. Imagine estar aqui quando os portões se abriram para ele. Na época nosso imperador já era uma criatura de pura luz desprovida de dúvida, de medo ou de ódio..."
G["But I would contend that we are at least partly to blame for the scars we bear."]="But I would contend that we are at least partly to blame for the scars we bear."
G["But I'd still rather be there on the front lines helping it happen rather than trying to placate myself with belief. We can't just sit around and hope it happens."]="But I'd still rather be there on the front lines helping it happen rather than trying to placate myself with belief. We can't just sit around and hope it happens."
G["But I'm da best at watchin' da door."]="Mas eu ser melhor para vigilar essa porta."
G["But I'm in charge here..."]="Se sou eu o que manda..."
G["But I'm one-of-a-kind! A black dragon raised free from the taint of my father's corruption. And that's how I intend to stay: free."]="But I'm one-of-a-kind! A black dragon raised free from the taint of my father's corruption. And that's how I intend to stay: free."
G["But I'm... lost. I cannot find my way back."]="Mas estou… perdida. Não encontro o caminho de volta."
G["But Kalecgos is already out there trying to stop them. He needs your help."]="But Kalecgos is already out there trying to stop them. He needs your help."
G["But Lei Shen did not agree."]="Mas Lei Shen não concordou."
G["But Lin is down there!"]="Mas Lin está aí baixo!"
G["But Nozdormu, Lord of Time, refused to give his blessing, chiding the druid for his arrogance."]="But Nozdormu, Lord of Time, refused to give his blessing, chiding the druid for his arrogance."
G["But Tak-Tak know a lot about things!"]="Pois Tak-Tak sabe muitas kosas!"
G["But Uther, if there's any hope of reaching Arthas. I... I must try."]="Mas Uther, se há alguma esperança de chegar a Arthas. Devo… tentar."
G["But a bitter stench blows into our ranks. The answer is to purge! PURGE! Purge until the Twilight's Hammer is pure again!"]="But a bitter stench blows into our ranks. The answer is to purge! PURGE! Purge until the Twilight's Hammer is pure again!"
G["But a pebble against the avalanche..."]="But a pebble against the avalanche..."
G["But after what I have seen today, I have faith in you."]="Mas depois do que vi hoje, tenho fé em ti."
G["But always remember that our movement cannot stay pure if some traitors among you still draw breath. You know who I mean."]="But always remember that our movement cannot stay pure if some traitors among you still draw breath. You know who I mean."
G["But as the centuries passed, one young explorer decided to see what was out there. His name was Liu Lang. And he set out to discover the world... on the back of a turtle!"]="Mas à medida que passavam os séculos, um jovem explorador decidiu ver o que havia lá fora. Seu nome era Liu Lang. E ele saiu para descobrir o mundo... nas costas de uma tartaruga!"
G["But as your war-fleets crashed upon our shores, all of my old doubts and fears rose up, to torment the land once again."]="Mas quando suas frotas de guerra chegaram em nossa costa, todas as minhas dúvidas e medos antigos se reergueram para atormentar a terra."
G["But at the same time, there is no choice. We need food, water. We must go through this portal."]="Mas ao mesmo tempo não temos elecção. Precisamos alimentos e água. Devemos cruzar este portal."
G["But at what cost? You've all been blinded. We have all been blinded."]="But at what cost? You've all been blinded. We have all been blinded."
G["But be knowin' this, little man - no matter where ya be hidin', when me pyres grow dim, I'll be feedin' them with yer bones!"]="But be knowin' this, little man - no matter where ya be hidin', when me pyres grow dim, I'll be feedin' them with yer bones!"
G["But be warned, Arygos, son of Malygos. Do not make the mistakes of your father."]="Te o advierto, Arygos, filho de Malygos. Não cometas os mesmos erros que seu pai."
G["But beneath the earth, child, there always be fire."]="Mas sob a terra, jovem, siemp'e haverá fogo."
G["But beware, for not all love stories end happily, as you may find out. Sometimes, love pricks like a thorn!"]="But beware, for not all love stories end happily, as you may find out. Sometimes, love pricks like a thorn!"
G["But blood of brother kingdom keeps..."]="Mas sangue de reino-irmão mantém..."
G["But can it be? Is this really --"]="Mas, pode ser? É mesmo..."
G["But can you find me again?"]="But can you find me again?"
G["But dese be worries for older minds.  Ya still have much to learn.  Go help tha people of tha Darkspear.  I am sure we'll be speakin' again real soon."]="But dese be worries for older minds.  Ya still have much to learn.  Go help tha people of tha Darkspear.  I am sure we'll be speakin' again real soon."
G["But dis place be OURS! Dis be da land of de ogres and da trolls!"]="But dis place be OURS! Dis be da land of de ogres and da trolls!"
G["But do not despair, ogre. I will continue to aid you and your... cult."]="But do not despair, ogre. I will continue to aid you and your... cult."
G["But do not despair, people of Orgrimmar! Join us and learn the truth."]="But do not despair, people of Orgrimmar! Join us and learn the truth."
G["But don't let me pull the wool over your eyes! See for yourself what lies beneath those covers! And now... on with the show!"]="Mas não deixem que os confunda! Ved com os seus próprios olhos o que há por trás das aparência! E, agora... que continúe o espectáculo!"
G["But don't take it from me; see for yourself what tragedy lies ahead when the paths of star crossed lovers meet! And now... on with the show!"]="But don't take it from me; see for yourself what tragedy lies ahead when the paths of star crossed lovers meet! And now... on with the show!"
G["But don't underestimate our enemies.  We are invading them.  We are taking the fight to them.  We have them backed into a corner and they will strike back."]="But don't underestimate our enemies.  We are invading them.  We are taking the fight to them.  We have them backed into a corner and they will strike back."
G["But enough prattling! You wish to reclaim your city? Come then, heroes! Your souls will fuel the host! You will have this place back in pieces!"]="But enough prattling! You wish to reclaim your city? Come then, heroes! Your souls will fuel the host! You will have this place back in pieces!"
G["But enough talk... You have fought hard and come from the distant reaches of this world to face the Duskbringer. I shall not disappoint..."]="But enough talk... You have fought hard and come from the distant reaches of this world to face the Duskbringer. I shall not disappoint..."
G["But enough words, comrades!  This is a call to action!  We will not let these \"chosen ones\" take what is ours!  We captured this prisoner and offer him to the Old Gods ourselves!!"]="But enough words, comrades!  This is a call to action!  We will not let these \"chosen ones\" take what is ours!  We captured this prisoner and offer him to the Old Gods ourselves!!"
G["But even Thalorien's skill and Quel'Delar's magic could not save Silvermoon from the might of the Scourge."]="But even Thalorien's skill and Quel'Delar's magic could not save Silvermoon from the might of the Scourge."
G["But even we are not sure of all that is happening.  Should we capture these cultists and force their silence?  But that may anger the rest of the people... Still, we cannot allow the cult to spread fear and lies..."]="But even we are not sure of all that is happening.  Should we capture these cultists and force their silence?  But that may anger the rest of the people... Still, we cannot allow the cult to spread fear and lies..."
G["But eventually the titans fell silent. And their creations were cursed with flesh."]="Mas os titãs ficaram silenciosos. E suas criações foram amaldiçoadas com a carne."
G["But father-"]="Mas pai..."
G["But first!"]="Mas prrimeirro!"
G["But first, you must bring down the protective wards of Azshara's Highborne lackeys. You will find them within the palace. I will scout on ahead."]="But first, you must bring down the protective wards of Azshara's Highborne lackeys. You will find them within the palace. I will scout on ahead."
G["But for now, your death will have to suffice..."]="Mas, por agora, seu morte terá que ser suficiente..."
G["But give what aid you can to the southern peoples, for they are the champions of Silap Inua."]="Mas ajude no que possam aos povos do sul, já que são os campeões de Silap Inua."
G["But his son is dead."]="Mas seu filho está morto."
G["But how much blood must be shed? There are both clever ways and foolish ways."]="But how much blood must be shed? There are both clever ways and foolish ways."
G["But how, chief? I thought the curse was lifted..."]="But how, chief? I thought the curse was lifted..."
G["But how?"]="Mas como?"
G["But if my presence is required in these games to gain your support in the battle, then I will remain.  For now."]="Mas se meu presença é necessário em estes jogos para obter seu apoio na batalha, me ficarei. De momentos."
G["But if we stabilize it with an anchor thread at the appropriate energy crux then it should work."]="But if we stabilize it with an anchor thread at the appropriate energy crux then it should work."
G["But in death... We are the children of the damned. The orphaned sons and daughters of the Scourge."]="But in death... We are the children of the damned. The orphaned sons and daughters of the Scourge."
G["But in his place, Shan'do Stormrage awoke from the dream and returned to his beloved Tyrande Whisperwind."]="But in his place, Shan'do Stormrage awoke from the dream and returned to his beloved Tyrande Whisperwind."
G["But instead of fighting as my people would, as my people should, I find myself with a long, unwieldy pole, attempting to coax my wolf into charging my opponent without attacking."]="But instead of fighting as my people would, as my people should, I find myself with a long, unwieldy pole, attempting to coax my wolf into charging my opponent without attacking."
G["But is your bark..."]="Mas é seu ladrido..."
G["But isn't Pandaria hidden somewhere? Nobody can find it!"]="But isn't Pandaria hidden somewhere? Nobody can find it!"
G["But isn't that what caused the initial problems with Adept Syleria's magical formulae?"]="Mas não foi isso o que provocou os problemas iniciais com a fórmula mágico do Adepto Syleria?"
G["But it ain't no ting. Take your trinkets; you'll be needin' dem."]="But it ain't no ting. Take your trinkets; you'll be needin' dem."
G["But it is not too hard. You are ready for this, $n."]="$n, Não é difícil. Tem a capacidade necessário."
G["But it is over. We can work now to bottle up the horrors he has unleashed."]="Mas se acabou. Podemos trabalhar para confinar os horrores que ele tem liberado."
G["But it was not to be. As their foes pressed close, Anathera's armor was pierced by a demon's tainted blade. In the thick of battle, there would be nothing to save her."]="But it was not to be. As their foes pressed close, Anathera's armor was pierced by a demon's tainted blade. In the thick of battle, there would be nothing to save her."
G["But know this, \"Blood\" Elf: There can be no peace while Hellscream is Warchief of the Horde."]="Mas tem de saber, elfo \"de sangue\", que não haverá paz enquanto Grito Infernal seja Chefe de Guerra da Horda."
G["But know this, the Horde IS family, even if some of its leaders have forgotten that fact. To prove this, I shall remain with you and lend what strength I can to your chosen leaders until Vol'jin returns."]="But know this, the Horde IS family, even if some of its leaders have forgotten that fact. To prove this, I shall remain with you and lend what strength I can to your chosen leaders until Vol'jin returns."
G["But look who has arrived! Mrs. Mann, there's someone I would like you to meet."]="But look who has arrived! Mrs. Mann, there's someone I would like you to meet."
G["But many druids of the Cenarion Circle stand firm that he wants only what is best for all of the Kaldorei, and serve him unerringly towards that end."]="But many druids of the Cenarion Circle stand firm that he wants only what is best for all of the Kaldorei, and serve him unerringly towards that end."
G["But mistress, the admiral is sti..."]="Mas senhora, o almirante está tod..."
G["But most of all... thank you, Wooga, for teach A-Me how to love."]="But most of all... thank you, Wooga, for teach A-Me how to love."
G["But my dad says I'm too little to drink."]="Mas meu papai diz que sou muito pequeno para beber."
G["But my protection money is all paid up!"]="Mas e pagado meu dinheiro de proteção!"
G["But never again."]="Mas se acabou."
G["But nobody else wanted to go exploring with him. So he left."]="Mas ninguém mais queria ir a explorar com ele. Assim que se foi."
G["But none may enter the Firelord's abode!"]="Mas ninguém entrará na roxa do Senhor do Fogo!"
G["But none of you could possibly have anything to worry about, right?"]="But none of you could possibly have anything to worry about, right?"
G["But nothing! Finish them! DO NOT FAIL ME, BALARGARDE!"]="Mas nada! Acaba com eles! NÃO ME FALHES, BALARGARDE!"
G["But now that I have the items, I can sense the power Loganaar spoke about. They will make a fitting weapon for you."]="But now that I have the items, I can sense the power Loganaar spoke about. They will make a fitting weapon for you."
G["But now, many years later, the wildkin have grown more feral, and without the guidance of the goddess, they are confused..."]="Mas agora, muitos anos depois, os lechúcicos selvagens se têm feito mais selvagens e sna guia da deusa, estão confundidos..."
G["But now, witness true power..."]="Mas agora, contemplem o poder verdadeiro..."
G["But now... she hates me."]="But now... she hates me."
G["But of course I love you, Staffron. And it pains me to see you suffer so."]="Mas eu te quero, Staffron, e me dói ver você sofrer."
G["But of course it is dangerous. This artifact's secrets would be useless to us otherwise."]="é claro que é perigoso. Se não o fosse, seus segredos não nos farian falta."
G["But of course. We have the Horde's best interests in mind, sir. These heroes were just about to continue on and kill Springvale for us."]="Mas, claro. O único que temos em mente são os interesses da Horda, senhor. Esses heróis estavam a ponto de matar a Valhefont para nós."
G["But once ol' $p here blasts through their bulkhead in a hail of splintered wood, blood, and phlegm then starts crawlin' across the deck with both legs broken, oh aye, they'll not see THAT comin' by a sweet mile, no sir!"]="But once ol' $p here blasts through their bulkhead in a hail of splintered wood, blood, and phlegm then starts crawlin' across the deck with both legs broken, oh aye, they'll not see THAT comin' by a sweet mile, no sir!"
G["But one thing is for certain: this plate's size, thickness, and bolt holes point to a use as armor for a colossal structure."]="But one thing is for certain: this plate's size, thickness, and bolt holes point to a use as armor for a colossal structure."
G["But our orders stand - Hellscream will have his foothold here. We will NOT allow the Alliance to lay claim to this new world!"]="Mas as ordens não têm mudado: Grito Infernal terá seu base aqui. A Aliança não se fará com este novo mundo!"
G["But papa said I fed him too much, so he got fat."]="Mas papai diz que lhe di tanto de comer que engordó demais."
G["But perhaps I will make an exception for you.  Let the crocs out!  IT'S FEEDING TIME!"]="Mas talvez faça uma excepção com você. Soldadaos crocoliscos! É HORA DE COMER!"
G["But please, leave me now. I must tend to my son... and prepare for our next battle."]="Mas, por favor, me deixe sozinho. Vou cuidar do meu filho... e me preparar para nossa próxima batalha."
G["But popo, what are they afraid of? Why are they here?"]="Mas papi, de que têm medo? Por que estão aqui?"
G["But praise alone will not suffice."]="Mas somente o elogio não é suficiente."
G["But she is chained. A way must be found to free her."]="But she is chained. A way must be found to free her."
G["But she is pursued... by a wicked, malevolent crone!"]="No entanto... a persigue uma velha bruxa maligna!"
G["But sir, there ain't any record of land in that region. Where are they?"]="Mas, senhor, se não há constância de terra alguma em essa região. Onde estão?"
G["But some human lady... Jana or somethin'... she got real mad!"]="Mas uma humana, Jana ou algo assim, se enfurece muito!"
G["But something is on your mind, right?"]="Mas tem algo em mente, verdade?"
G["But something went wrong, didn't it?"]="Mas algo deu errado, não foi?"
G["But surely you cannot think that those children were born into innocence? They would have grown up and taken arms against us!"]="But surely you cannot think that those children were born into innocence? They would have grown up and taken arms against us!"
G["But surely you heard, Greatmother."]="But surely you heard, Greatmother."
G["But tha' mead was cursed with th' plague o' death, and now old Duggan, too."]="But tha' mead was cursed with th' plague o' death, and now old Duggan, too."
G["But that honor is no longer yours. Soon, I will have a new champion."]="Mas esse honra já não te pertence. Pronto, terei um novo campeão."
G["But that idiot, IDIOT Wrynn! \"High King\" indeed!"]="Mas esse idiota de Wrynn! \"Grande Rei\"? Ha!"
G["But that is not part of the vision I was granted... that is not... how my people will be freed."]="Mas isso não é parte da visão que tive... assim não é... como meu povo será liberado."
G["But that is the real Monkey King."]="Mas é o Rei Mono de verdade."
G["But that will all change one day, $n. And when it does, those with vision will be prepared."]="Mas isso vai mudar algum dia, $n. E quando esse dia chegue, os que temos visão estaremos preparados."
G["But that's not the worst of it. Before I could pull us back, a group of 'em spotted us and attacked."]="But that's not the worst of it. Before I could pull us back, a group of 'em spotted us and attacked."
G["But the Alliance does not recognize our rights. They claim this land is their own while attempting to invalidate the claims of the founders of this kingdom."]="But the Alliance does not recognize our rights. They claim this land is their own while attempting to invalidate the claims of the founders of this kingdom."
G["But the Forsaken. *cough* What do they feel?"]="Mas os Renegados. *tose* Que sienten?"
G["But the Horde has assembled an enormous host! A vast fleet of war machines and hardened veterans. Hellscream would as soon crush you as-"]="But the Horde has assembled an enormous host! A vast fleet of war machines and hardened veterans. Hellscream would as soon crush you as-"
G["But the Light showed me that I was not lost. It helped me to find the strength to survive in spite of all that had happened and all the evil I had wrought."]="Mas a Luz me mostró que não estava perdida. Me ajudou a ter forças para sobreviver a pesar do que havia acontecido e de tudo o mal que havia feito."
G["But the North Wind did not silently accept defeat. Instead, it gathered power and bided its time, deciding the best revenge was to destroy your memory, and with it, your village."]="But the North Wind did not silently accept defeat. Instead, it gathered power and bided its time, deciding the best revenge was to destroy your memory, and with it, your village."
G["But the cost... such a terrible cost."]="Mas o custo... foi alto demais..."
G["But the mantid have overrun the area. There's no clear path!"]="But the mantid have overrun the area. There's no clear path!"
G["But the ookin' bell it was meant for could never be mine."]="E o sino fedido pra que ela servia, não era a minha sina."
G["But the question still remains... why do we fight?"]="Mas a pergunta ainda permanece... por que lutamos?"
G["But the unavoidable outcome is plain:"]="Mas o catastrófico resultados está claro:"
G["But the war deeply troubles me. Do you see my concern?"]="Mas esta guerra me preocupa profundamente. Você compreende minha inquietação?"
G["But their empire fell. Perhaps to the sha, perhaps to the pandaren, or perhaps... to their own pride."]="Mas seu império caiu. Talvez por causa dos sha, talvez por causa dos pandaren, ou talvez... por causa do seu próprio orgulho."
G["But then the Monkey King one day decided to steal the mallet and hide it as a prank. There is no record of the mallet after that."]="But then the Monkey King one day decided to steal the mallet and hide it as a prank. There is no record of the mallet after that."
G["But then, the dark evil spiders rose from their evil layers with eyes full of evil and legs full of evil."]="But then, the dark evil spiders rose from their evil layers with eyes full of evil and legs full of evil."
G["But there are a number of things I need to make clear to you."]="Mas há certas coisas que quero deixar claras."
G["But there is a yawning chasm of darkness beneath you, mortals. Vast, endless, and all-consuming. I do not believe that you can correct this doomed course."]="But there is a yawning chasm of darkness beneath you, mortals. Vast, endless, and all-consuming. I do not believe that you can correct this doomed course."
G["But there is another threat to the tusked people."]="Mas há outra ameaça para a gente com presas."
G["But there is yet one path, one river, that may carry you through these difficult times."]="But there is yet one path, one river, that may carry you through these difficult times."
G["But these cultists are determined to bring Stormwind to ruin. Men, we must remain vigilant for our city and our king, as $n as done!"]="Mas estes cultistas estão decididos a levar a Ventobravo à fracasso. Homens, devemos permanecer em guarda por nossa cidade e nosso Rei, como o tem estado $n!"
G["But these terrible things that I have done and the people that I have harmed - I know them... I face them... and I feel remorse for them."]="But these terrible things that I have done and the people that I have harmed - I know them... I face them... and I feel remorse for them."
G["But they could have been so much more."]="Mas eles poderiam ter sido muito mais."
G["But they've, ah, they've gotten reinforcements! From the Eastern Kingdoms. Whereas I've been, ah, cut off -"]="But they've, ah, they've gotten reinforcements! From the Eastern Kingdoms. Whereas I've been, ah, cut off -"
G["But this can't be right. Where did I put that other book?"]="Mas isto não pode ser. Onde e posto o outro livro?"
G["But this is a different sort of honorable combat. Difficult to adapt to, perhaps, but with your prowess I'm sure you'll show everyone the strength in your people."]="But this is a different sort of honorable combat. Difficult to adapt to, perhaps, but with your prowess I'm sure you'll show everyone the strength in your people."
G["But this is no task to be taken lightly."]="But this is no task to be taken lightly."
G["But this place reeks of death!"]="Mas este lugar fede a morte!"
G["But this the only building that fit Brogg! Goblins make buildings too small!"]="But this the only building that fit Brogg! Goblins make buildings too small!"
G["But this time, we're a step ahead."]="But this time, we're a step ahead."
G["But though I feel the plague within, my hopes 'ave not yet sunk."]="Embora sinto a fedor na minha interior, meus esperanças não se têm desvanecido."
G["But to be perfectly frank, I do not give a damn what the Kirin Tor think! They are fools, set in their archaic ways."]="Mas, para ser totalmente sincero, não me importa em absoluto o que piense o Kirin Tor! São uns estúpidos, inflexibles nos seus modos arcaicos."
G["But together we have delivered a terrible blow to the Thunder King!"]="Mas juntos temos desferido um duro acerto ao Rei do Trovão."
G["But tragically, Arthas is consumed by the evil and becomes evil himself..."]="But tragically, Arthas is consumed by the evil and becomes evil himself..."
G["But true wisdom comes from KNOWING what is right. And sometimes, DOING nothing at all."]="Mas a verdadeira sabedoria consiste em SABER o que é correto. E a vezes em não fazer nada."
G["But try they must or all will be lost. The Drakkari will be the death of both themselves and their gods!"]="But try they must or all will be lost. The Drakkari will be the death of both themselves and their gods!"
G["But wait..."]="Mas, espera..."
G["But wait... I remember now.  You taught me to only kill the undead.  So do you want me to kill myself, daddy?"]="But wait... I remember now.  You taught me to only kill the undead.  So do you want me to kill myself, daddy?"
G["But war, waged by a leader reluctantly following protocol, brought an even swifter demise to our nation."]="But war, waged by a leader reluctantly following protocol, brought an even swifter demise to our nation."
G["But we are family. I am a Stormstout! From the Wandering Isle..."]="Mas somos família. Sou um Cerveja de Trovão, da Ilha Errante..."
G["But we don't explore very much anymore, do we?"]="Mas já não exploramos muito, verdade?"
G["But we gotta feed dis war machine. Stone, wood, oil, meat - we be needin' 'em in large supply."]="Mas temos que alimentar eh'ta máquina de guerra. Pedra, madeira, óleo, carne: vamos precisar muito de tudo isso."
G["But we have our own reasons for assisting them. I will allow Lor'themar to explain."]="Mas temos nossas razones para ajudá-los. Deixarei que Lor'themar te as explique."
G["But we have returned, spirit! We have returned to honor you again. Favor us with your presence once more."]="But we have returned, spirit! We have returned to honor you again. Favor us with your presence once more."
G["But we know..."]="Mas nós sabemos..."
G["But we must hurry back to the World Tree! The Dragon Aspects are waiting..."]="But we must hurry back to the World Tree! The Dragon Aspects are waiting..."
G["But we will not participate in this... genocidal... bloodbath of yours."]="Mas não participaremos no seu... banho de sangue genocida."
G["But we will not participate in this... race war... bloodbath of yours."]="Mas não participaremos no seu... banho de sangue genocida."
G["But we will... NEVER SURRENDER!!!!!"]="But we will... NEVER SURRENDER!!!!!"
G["But we're nothing if not people who strive for balance. Our warriors fight only when there is need. Our hunters take only what the tribes require to live, and use all they can when they do. The shaman stand as guide and mediator to the elemental spirits."]="But we're nothing if not people who strive for balance. Our warriors fight only when there is need. Our hunters take only what the tribes require to live, and use all they can when they do. The shaman stand as guide and mediator to the elemental spirits."
G["But what does it matter.  It is time for this to end."]="Mas que mais da. É hora de acabar com isto."
G["But what he and his Twilight Masters never understood is that the elements do not exist to rage and war... they exist to bring harmony. Within the world... and within us."]="But what he and his Twilight Masters never understood is that the elements do not exist to rage and war... they exist to bring harmony. Within the world... and within us."
G["But what if the resulting frequency shift were to send magical feedback up the flows?"]="But what if the resulting frequency shift were to send magical feedback up the flows?"
G["But what is this?"]="Mas, que é isto?"
G["But what now, hero? What of those freed from his grasp, but still shackled to their mortal coils?"]="But what now, hero? What of those freed from his grasp, but still shackled to their mortal coils?"
G["But what of Go'el?"]="E que há de Go'o?"
G["But what the king did not realize is that the dwarves did not trust one another!"]="Mas o rei não percebeu que os anões não confiavam uns nos outros!"
G["But what's this? Something else is happening to the land south of the fissure."]="But what's this? Something else is happening to the land south of the fissure."
G["But what?"]="Mas que?"
G["But when war comes to these shores, you and I will be ready for it!"]="Mas quando a guerra chegue a estas costas, você e eu estaremos preparados."
G["But where could I ever find a suitable test subject?"]="But where could I ever find a suitable test subject?"
G["But why do I sense no life emanating from within? Why do I sense no amber sap running through its veins?"]="But why do I sense no life emanating from within? Why do I sense no amber sap running through its veins?"
G["But why?"]="Mas por que?"
G["But why? Dragons big and powerful. Elf-lady weak. Kekek want to see dragon queen's real form."]="Mas por que? Dragões grandes e poderosos. Senhora elfa fraco. Kekeké que ver verdadeira forma de rainha dos dragões."
G["But why?! How could you?"]="But why?! How could you?"
G["But with heroes like you in his pack, there is little your Alliance cannot accomplish."]="Mas com heróis como você na matilha, a Aliança pode alcançar praticamente qualquer objetivo."
G["But wouldn't that mean crossing the streams? Isn't that really bad?"]="But wouldn't that mean crossing the streams? Isn't that really bad?"
G["But you are a Black Dragon. And you share the corruption of all my brothers and sisters."]="Mas é um dragão Negro. E compartes a corrupção de todos meus irmãos e irmãs."
G["But you are dragons! How could orcs do this to you?"]="Mas vocês são dragões! Como os orcs podem fazer isso com você?"
G["But you are right, Irulon. The price of our freedom will undoubtedly cost thousands more of their lives."]="Mas tem razão, Irulon. Nossa liberdade lhes custará, sem dúvida, milhares de vidas mais."
G["But you must be aware, Koltira: we are brothers no longer.  You are a member of the Horde now, and I of the Alliance."]="Mas não o esqueça, Koltira: já não somos irmãos. Agora é membro da Horda e eu da Aliança."
G["But you said-"]="Mas você disse..."
G["But your farm is lookin' pretty good. You know if you make friends with the folks around here, they might give you stuff to fancy it up even more."]="But your farm is lookin' pretty good. You know if you make friends with the folks around here, they might give you stuff to fancy it up even more."
G["But your real punishment lies ahead."]="Mas seu verdadeiro castigo não tem começado ainda."
G["But your time will come soon enough. Yes, mortal. Soon enough..."]="Mas pronto chegará seu hora. Sim, mortal. Pronto..."
G["But your trespass ends here. None may enter my forbidden stronghold. I shall rebuild this bridge with your bones for bricks."]="But your trespass ends here. None may enter my forbidden stronghold. I shall rebuild this bridge with your bones for bricks."
G["But, I am a master fighter, with extensive knowledge of this world's flora and fauna. Surely I can help?"]="Mas sou um mestre lutador, com um amplio conhecimento da flora e a fauna deste mundo. Certo que posso ajudar você."
G["But, I can see it in your eyes, hear it in your pulse rate. You would destroy me despite my offer of immortality!"]="Mas o vejo nos seus olhos e o oigo no latido do seu coração. Me destruirías a pesar de meu oferta de imortalidade!"
G["But, ah, supplies have been tight. I've got, ah, a manpower shortage. Tell Bloodhilt that, ah -"]="Mas, ah, os suprimentos estão apertados. Ah, tenho escassez de mão de obra. Diga a Bloodhilt isso, ah -"
G["But, do not give into despair. You have the spirit to overcome this. Try again - I believe in you!"]="Mas não desesperes; tem o espírito necessário para triunfar. Volta a tentar. Eu acho em ti!"
G["But, elf..."]="Uma coisa mais, elfo..."
G["But, here comes another survivor. Seems good with their hands... maybe you can teach them your fighting skills?"]="Mas aí vem outro sobrevivente. Parece hábil com as mãos... Talvez possa ensenharle suas habilidades de luta."
G["But, in defeating him, we must seek out the source of his great power. We must claim it for ourselves, as leverage against our \"Warchief.\""]="Ao tempo que o derrotamos, devemos encontrar a fonte do seu grande poder. Com ela poderemos negociar com nosso \"Chefe de Guerra\"."
G["But, in the end, $n and I prevailed through our wits and teamwork. And now we have this glorious trophy as a memento of our victory."]="But, in the end, $n and I prevailed through our wits and teamwork. And now we have this glorious trophy as a memento of our victory."
G["But, my lord...?"]="Mas, meu senhor...?"
G["But, no matter. Mister Clementine's... err, 'contribution' notwithstanding, this seems to be the journal of a man named Nolkai. The entries toward the end describe a brutal battle."]="But, no matter. Mister Clementine's... err, 'contribution' notwithstanding, this seems to be the journal of a man named Nolkai. The entries toward the end describe a brutal battle."
G["But, sire!  You have misjudged my actions... I do have knowledge of someone close to you who plans to betray you.  It is that dog, Kael'thas!  He has allied with Kil'jaeden and intends to replace you as Lord of Outland!"]="But, sire!  You have misjudged my actions... I do have knowledge of someone close to you who plans to betray you.  It is that dog, Kael'thas!  He has allied with Kil'jaeden and intends to replace you as Lord of Outland!"
G["But, sweetie...?"]="Mas, carinho...?"
G["But, you will not be alone out there. My men and I have prepared pack mules carrying the supplies you'll need most."]="But, you will not be alone out there. My men and I have prepared pack mules carrying the supplies you'll need most."
G["But..."]="Mas..."
G["But... But Deathwing's minions may have you killed..."]="Mas... talvez os lacaios de Alamuerte te asesinen..."
G["But... I don't think I'll have time to work for the council, AND run Sunsong Ranch."]="Mas... Não terei tempo de trabalhar no conselho e levar o Rancho Cantosol ao mesmo tempo."
G["But... I followed your instructions precisely! Sorry?"]="Mas... Seguí seus instruções ao pé da letra! Sinto muito?"
G["But... I was... who will...?!"]="Mas... se eu... quem...?"
G["But... I... yes, my lady.  As you wish."]="Mas... eu... sim, meu senhora. Como quiser."
G["But... It is not yet your time to serve the Lich King. Yes, a greater destiny awaits you. Power... You must become more powerful before you are to serve me."]="But... It is not yet your time to serve the Lich King. Yes, a greater destiny awaits you. Power... You must become more powerful before you are to serve me."
G["But... Malfurion, Cenarius, Ysera... they still fight. They need me. I must return to the Dream at once."]="Mas... Malfurion, Cenarius, Ysera... continúan lutando. Me necessário e por isso e de voltar ao Sonho de imediatamente."
G["But... My lord, I do not understand. $n... He is the orc that has..."]="But... My lord, I do not understand. $n... He is the orc that has..."
G["But... but..."]="Mas... Mas..."
G["But... but... I needed that gear..."]="Mas... mas... preciso o equipamento..."
G["But... but... I was perfect!"]="Mas... mas... era perfeito!"
G["But... he has learned of your victory over Stormwind's North Fleet and thinks you have potential.  Potential to see reason and abandon Sylvanas' childish rebellion."]="But... he has learned of your victory over Stormwind's North Fleet and thinks you have potential.  Potential to see reason and abandon Sylvanas' childish rebellion."
G["But... my legend!"]="Mas... meu lendas!"
G["But... we could have found wild yaks back in Kun-Lai..."]="Mas... yaks selvagens já há em Kun-Lai..."
G["But... we were getting along... so... well..."]="Mas... se nos caíamos... tão... bem..."
G["But... you have earned the right to try. Farewell."]="Mas... os vocês têm ganhou o direito a tentar. Adeus."
G["But...!"]="Mas...!"
G["But...but...I am...Ul...trax...ionnnnnn..."]="Mas... mas... sou... sou... Ul... tra... xionnnn..."
G["Butcher you say?  Oh, First Aid Trainer!  Same thing.  When you see Nurse Neela standing just inside the Gallows' End Tavern on the southeast side of town you'll know why."]="Açougueiro você diz? Oh, instrutor de primeiros socorros! Mesma coisa. Quando você ver a enfermeira Neela em pé dentro da Taverna Gallows 'End, no lado sudeste da cidade, saberá o porquê."
G["Butcherbot will harvest meat, tra la la la la."]="Butcherbot will harvest meat, tra la la la la."
G["Buuurrnnnn!"]="Buuurrnnnn!"
G["Buuurrrnn!"]="Buuurrrnn!"
G["Buuuurrp..."]="Buuuuurp..."
G["Buuuuuuuuuurrrppp!"]="Buuurrp!"
G["Buy a fish a drink?"]="Comprash uma bebida a um peixe?"
G["Buy me a drinksh will ya?"]="Me invitash a uma copa?"
G["Buy some apples! An apple a day keeps the priests away!"]="Buy some apples! An apple a day keeps the priests away!"
G["Buy somethin', will ya?"]="Compre algo, si?"
G["Buzz the landing pad lately, $n?"]="Buzz the landing pad lately, $n?"
G["Bwaaaah! You no take da treasure!!!"]="Buaaaah! Você não levar você tesouro!"
G["Bwagauugh!!! Augh feed you to da crocs!!!"]="Bwagauugh!!! Augh dar a você de comer aos crocoliscos!!!"
G["Bwemba be watchin' you, young one."]="Estaremos observando você, jovem."
G["Bwemba, is dat you?  Tanks for da save."]="Bwemba, is dat you?  Tanks for da save."
G["By Brann's brittle bananas! What is it!? It... It looks like a drum."]="pelos platanitos de Brann! Que é isso!? Parece... parece um tambor."
G["By Bronzbeard's... um, beard! What are you talking about?"]="pelas barbas... eh... de Barba de Bronze! De que está falando?"
G["By Bronzebeard's beard!  What a drink!"]="pelas barbas de Barba de Bronze! Que bebida!"
G["By Elune!  They were all ambushed... betrayed..."]="Por Eluna! Foram emboscados... traicionados..."
G["By Elune, I shall show you a quick death."]="Por Eluna, eu te darei uma morte rápida."
G["By Firallon's beard, what is that thing? Kill it!"]="pelas barbas de Firalhon! Que é isso? Mátalo!"
G["By Hellscream's axe!"]="pelo machado de Grito Infernal!"
G["By Khaz'goroth's hammer, we will break them!"]="pelo martelo de Khaz'goroth, os derribaremos!"
G["By Kroshik's teeth, how did you get here?!"]="pelos presas de Kroshik! Como chegou até aqui?"
G["By Kurzen's sword!"]="pela lâmina de Kurzen!"
G["By Light be purged!"]="Que a Luz te purifique!"
G["By Lothar, you Defias scum will pay!"]="By Lothar, you Defias scum will pay!"
G["By Magni's beard, we've got to reconstruct the runic key he used to read the plate. We could be right on his heels!"]="By Magni's beard, we've got to reconstruct the runic key he used to read the plate. We could be right on his heels!"
G["By Muradin's beard, $c. This land is on the brink of annihilation. I cannot imagine anyone survived here since the end of the second war."]="pela barba de Muradin, $c. Esta terra está ao borda da aniquilação. Não me posso imaginar que alguém sobreviviera aqui desdo fim da segunda guerra."
G["By Nazjatar's Depths!"]="pelas profundezas de Nazjatar!"
G["By Orgrim!  This indurium can withstand massive heat!"]="By Orgrim!  This indurium can withstand massive heat!"
G["By Thaurissan's beard! Slay them!"]="pelas barbas de Thaurissan! Matem-nos!"
G["By Thorim's beard, this should be good sport!"]="pela barba de Thorim, isto é deporte!"
G["By Zandalari blood he will be taken..."]="Por sangue Zandalari será tomado..."
G["By a girl. Ouch."]="Por uma garota. Au."
G["By all means, don't assess the situation, you halfwit! Just jump into the fray!"]="By all means, don't assess the situation, you halfwit! Just jump into the fray!"
G["By all means, enlighten me."]="By all means, enlighten me."
G["By all the gods... it can't be... Muradin?!"]="Por todos os deuses... não pode ser... Muradin?"
G["By any chance do you have another one of those super rare, hard to find, amulets?"]="Não terá por casualidade outro desses amuletos ultra raros quase impossíveis de encontrar?"
G["By closing the monastery - for whatever reason - Taran Zhu has jeopardized that eternal charge."]="Ao fechar o monastério, seja pela razão que fosse, Taran Zhu tem posto em perigo esse cometido eterno."
G["By defending the four temples, you will earn great standing with the August Celestials. You will be granted the ability to purchase items of great power.\n\nIn addition, you will help defend this land against some of our greatest enemies."]="By defending the four temples, you will earn great standing with the August Celestials. You will be granted the ability to purchase items of great power.\n\nIn addition, you will help defend this land against some of our greatest enemies."
G["By dusk, the flames towered into the sky. I lost everything. Everything.\n\nWhy would they burn an inn?"]="By dusk, the flames towered into the sky. I lost everything. Everything.\n\nWhy would they burn an inn?"
G["By extracting agents from the blood of various dragonflights I have created a salve that will bestow the wearer sight beyond sight!"]="By extracting agents from the blood of various dragonflights I have created a salve that will bestow the wearer sight beyond sight!"
G["By feeding upon this place's power, they were broken free from their addiction to the Legion's magic."]="Ao se nutrirem do poder deste lugar, eles se libertaram do vício na magia da Legião."
G["By feeling and understanding compassion in enemy and ally alike, you reaffirm your connection with the world."]="Ao sentir e entender por igual a compasão por um aliado e por um inimigo, reafirmas seu conexão com o mundo."
G["By fire be purged!"]="Que o fogo os purifique!"
G["By me own beard! HORDE SAILIN' IN FAST 'N HOT!"]="Por meus barbas! A HORDA NAVEGA A TODA MÁQUINA!"
G["By my right as Warchief, I hereby relieve you of duty."]="pela autoridade que tenho como Chefe de guerra, te relevo do seu dever."
G["By order of Duke Lankral, Commander of the Knights of the Ebon Blade, Vanquisher of the Scourge and Conqueror of The Shadow Vault, you are ordered to stand down. What is your answer?"]="By order of Duke Lankral, Commander of the Knights of the Ebon Blade, Vanquisher of the Scourge and Conqueror of The Shadow Vault, you are ordered to stand down. What is your answer?"
G["By order of King Varian Wrynn we must prepare your defenses, Jinyu."]="Por ordem do rei Varian Wrynn, jinyu, devemos preparar suas defesas."
G["By order of the Warchief this \"city\" is now under Martial Law. Any who refuse the will of the Warchief shall be branded as traitors!"]="By order of the Warchief this \"city\" is now under Martial Law. Any who refuse the will of the Warchief shall be branded as traitors!"
G["By order of the grand admiral, stay away from the southern side of the island upon pain of death. Spread the word."]="Por ordem do Grande almirante, mantenha-se longe do lado sul da ilha baixo pena de morte. Extienda notícia."
G["By orders of the Queen, all possessions must be inspected before entry into the city is permitted."]="Por ordem da Rainha, todas as posesiones têm de ser investigadas antes de permitir a entrada na cidade."
G["By our sweat and your blood, this land WILL be ours!"]="By our sweat and your blood, this land WILL be ours!"
G["By recovering the artifacts of our clan, by taking up the fight against our ancient enemy, the Bladespire ogres, and their gronn masters, by returning the Thunderspike to my hand, you have secured the blessing of the Thunderlord clan."]="By recovering the artifacts of our clan, by taking up the fight against our ancient enemy, the Bladespire ogres, and their gronn masters, by returning the Thunderspike to my hand, you have secured the blessing of the Thunderlord clan."
G["By royal edict, you men are to return to Lordaeron immediately. Lord Uther has convinced the king to recall this expedition."]="Por decreto real, devem voltar a Lordaeron imediatamente. Lorde Uther tem convencido ao rei para que retire esta expedição."
G["By th' Light, it worked! Grimnur's brilliant... oh, I hope all the pinchin' didn't hurt ye too much... But when ye taste the meat, ye'll know it's worth it!"]="By th' Light, it worked! Grimnur's brilliant... oh, I hope all the pinchin' didn't hurt ye too much... But when ye taste the meat, ye'll know it's worth it!"
G["By the Firelord's command, you, too, shall perish!"]="By the Firelord's command, you, too, shall perish!"
G["By the Goddess. It's as if Nature can't touch it!"]="By the Goddess. It's as if Nature can't touch it!"
G["By the Light - what did they DO to that thing?"]="pela Luz! Que lhe têm feito a essa coisa?"
G["By the Light be cleansed!"]="Que a Luz te purifique!"
G["By the Light you will leave this tomb!"]="pela Luz! Vá embora desta tumba!"
G["By the Light!"]="pela Luz!"
