G["By the Light!  This must be the end of the world!"]="pela Luz! Este deve ser o fim do mundo!"
G["By the Light! It is a blessing to have one who cares about the well-being of others. At a time like this we need all the help we can get. Nus can train you in the ways of first aid. She is near the crystal cave in the Crystal Hall. Light be with you."]="Pela luz! É uma bênção ter alguém que se preocupa com o bem-estar dos outros. Em um momento como este, precisamos de de toda a ajuda que pudermos obter. Nus pode treiná-o nas formas de primeiros socorros. Ela está perto da caverna de cristal no Crystal Hall. A luz esteja com você."
G["By the Light! So this is why you look familiar. Is this fate? Destiny perhaps? Arator, your father and I were the best of friends. It is I who kept him in good health... Oh the battles we fought... And..."]="By the Light! So this is why you look familiar. Is this fate? Destiny perhaps? Arator, your father and I were the best of friends. It is I who kept him in good health... Oh the battles we fought... And..."
G["By the Light! This is not good. There's something you don't understand, $n."]="pela Luz! Isto não é nada bom. Há algo que não entende, $n."
G["By the Light! What is it?"]="pela Luz! Que é isso?"
G["By the Light! What is that thing?"]="pela Luz! Que é isso?"
G["By the Light, Brann's alive? I'd never help you capture him!"]="By the Light, Brann's alive? I'd never help you capture him!"
G["By the Light, I will defeat you!"]="Pela Luz, eu o derrotarei!"
G["By the Light, I'm alive again..."]="pela Luz, estou vivo novamente..."
G["By the Light, I'm hungry today. Did you all see Darcy today? She looked great."]="pela Luz, hoje tenho muita fome. Vocês têm visto a Darcy? Estava muito guapa."
G["By the Light, it must be so!"]="pela Luz, que assim seja!"
G["By the Light, may he at last find rest, free from the icy grip of that terrible blade."]="By the Light, may he at last find rest, free from the icy grip of that terrible blade."
G["By the Light, that hurts!"]="pela Luz, isso dói!"
G["By the Light, you killed Limpy Joe and took the meat! How did you know where to find us?"]="By the Light, you killed Limpy Joe and took the meat! How did you know where to find us?"
G["By the Light... Theramore! What has happened here?!"]="pela Luz... Theramore! Que tem passado aqui?!"
