G["By the Sunwell, you've a thick skull! You'll not bully me into leaving, Taleris. Now, begone from my sight!"]="By the Sunwell, you've a thick skull! You'll not bully me into leaving, Taleris. Now, begone from my sight!"
G["By the blood of Kros!"]="pela sangue de Kros!"
