G["By the seven Ata'mal crystals!  Others have survived the crash!  Zhanaa, is that you?  It is so good to see you again!"]="By the seven Ata'mal crystals!  Others have survived the crash!  Zhanaa, is that you?  It is so good to see you again!"
G["By the skin of our teeth, we made it! I haven't seen shooting like that since...well...ever! I wish we could ride together again, but Kadrak has more important work for you. Thank you for delivering us safely, my friend."]="By the skin of our teeth, we made it! I haven't seen shooting like that since...well...ever! I wish we could ride together again, but Kadrak has more important work for you. Thank you for delivering us safely, my friend."
G["By the stars! A spirit has been summoned!"]="pelas estrelas! Se tem invocado a um espírito!"
G["By the strength of the earth, the power of storms, and..."]="pela Força da terra, o poder das tempestades e..."
G["By the sunwell! The skies betray us - we are not safe up here!"]="By the sunwell! The skies betray us - we are not safe up here!"
