G["By the time the Burning Legion began its assault, the mages at the Mennar Academy had fallen far from the Queen's graces. They would've been a powerful asset in the war to come, but they refused to fall back when the rest of the city fell.\n\nInstead of regrouping outside the city to join in the counter-assault, they stayed behind, erecting magical barriers and turning their once quiet home into a fortress. Refugees streamed to the Mennar Academy in the first terrible days of the invasion, and survivors rallied to mount a defense."]="By the time the Burning Legion began its assault, the mages at the Mennar Academy had fallen far from the Queen's graces. They would've been a powerful asset in the war to come, but they refused to fall back when the rest of the city fell.\n\nInstead of regrouping outside the city to join in the counter-assault, they stayed behind, erecting magical barriers and turning their once quiet home into a fortress. Refugees streamed to the Mennar Academy in the first terrible days of the invasion, and survivors rallied to mount a defense."
G["By the time the ritual is complete, Marnal will arrive, and my men will help carve up this grotesque creature."]="Quando o ritual estiver concluído, Marnal chegará e meus homens ajudarão a esculpir essa criatura grotesca."
G["By the time we are done here, the Alliance will wish they had never set foot on this land."]="By the time we are done here, the Alliance will wish they had never set foot on this land."
G["By the time you realize the truth, it will be too late."]="Quando você perceber a verdade, será tarde demais."
G["By the titans' command, they fought the terrible servants of the old gods. They shaped the mountains and carved the rivers of the land."]="Por ordem dos titãs, eles lutaram contra os terríveis servos dos Deuses Antigos. Eles moldaram as montanhas e entalharam os rios desta terra."
G["By the very edge..."]="na orilha..."
G["By the watchers, look at him fight. I've never seen a more vicious warrior... I'm glad to call him my king."]="pelos vigías! Mírale lutar! Mais vi um guerreiro mais impiedoso... Fico feliz que seja meu rei."
G["By the way, if any of you need anything repaired, let me know.  I am at your service."]="By the way, if any of you need anything repaired, let me know.  I am at your service."
