G["Call me Twin. That's what Mowi calls me.\n\nNo, we don' look alike. Are ye blind? She's a gnome fer the Light's sake! We act alike. 'specially when we're fightin'.\n\nAs fer my name... have ya na heard o' the storied Wildhammer Brewers? Care fer a pint?"]="Call me Twin. That's what Mowi calls me.\n\nNo, we don' look alike. Are ye blind? She's a gnome fer the Light's sake! We act alike. 'specially when we're fightin'.\n\nAs fer my name... have ya na heard o' the storied Wildhammer Brewers? Care fer a pint?"
