G["Can you believe it? They finally opened this place up for us to fly a zeppelin through here! No fly zone no more, am I right? We only crashed one zeppelin into a cliff on the test run. I don't see why they were so worried."]="Você acredita nisso? Eles finalmente abriram este lugar para nós voarmos um zepelim por aqui! Não há mais zona de voo, estou certo? Colocamos apenas um zepelim em um penhasco durante o teste. Não vejo por que eles estavam tão preocupados."
G["Can you believe that they won't let me in? Me, of all people?"]="Pode acreditar que não me deixam entrar? A quem e a mim!"
G["Can you believe the nerve of that Elisara Sunstriker?  Thinking that she can catch the eye of Lord Saltheril?  And did you see what she's wearing?  So last season.  It's sad, really."]="Você consegue acreditar nos nervos daquele Elisara Sunstriker? Pensando que ela pode chamar a atenção de lorde Saltheril? E você viu o que ela está vestindo? Então, na última temporada. É triste mesmo."
G["Can you believe the nerve of this little grummle? This shrewd little negotiator will have me bankrupt with his prices in no time."]="Can you believe the nerve of this little grummle? This shrewd little negotiator will have me bankrupt with his prices in no time."
G["Can you believe these monkeys, $n?"]="Pode acreditar a estes macacos, $n?"
G["Can you believe these people just set out free food? This place is amazing!"]="Pode acreditar que esta gente tem servido comida grátis? Este lugar é incrível!"
G["Can you believe this ethereal technology?!\n\nI'm sure glad they let me stay out here with them.  I'm gonna learn a lot... and maybe get some of it for myself, too!"]="Can you believe this ethereal technology?!\n\nI'm sure glad they let me stay out here with them.  I'm gonna learn a lot... and maybe get some of it for myself, too!"
G["Can you believe this place?  'Course, it's a mite stuffy up here if you ask me."]="Você pode acreditar neste lugar? Claro, é um pouco abafado aqui em cima, se você me perguntar."
G["Can you believe this place?  There's so much to learn and discover!  I'm going to fill up books and books with all my findings here.\n\nBut it's just so much information, I don't know how anyone could possibly read through it all.  Chadrik thought we could write it up as a song, but that's silly... right?"]="Can you believe this place?  There's so much to learn and discover!  I'm going to fill up books and books with all my findings here.\n\nBut it's just so much information, I don't know how anyone could possibly read through it all.  Chadrik thought we could write it up as a song, but that's silly... right?"
