G["Cenarius fights at my side. Illidan sits atop his throne in the Outland - brooding. I am afraid that the loss to Arthas proved to be his breaking point. Madness has embraced him, Remulos. He replays the events in his mind a thousand times per day, but in his mind, he is the victor and Arthas is utterly defeated. He is too far gone, old friend. I fear that the time may soon come that our bond is tested and it will not be as it was at the Well in Zin-Azshari."]="Cenarius fights at my side. Illidan sits atop his throne in the Outland - brooding. I am afraid that the loss to Arthas proved to be his breaking point. Madness has embraced him, Remulos. He replays the events in his mind a thousand times per day, but in his mind, he is the victor and Arthas is utterly defeated. He is too far gone, old friend. I fear that the time may soon come that our bond is tested and it will not be as it was at the Well in Zin-Azshari."
G["Cenarius has fallen!"]="Cenarius tem caído!"
G["Cenarius!  Excellent!  With the portal active, we can move our forces to the frontlines unfettered."]="Cenarius! Excelente! Agora que o portal está ativo, podemos mover a nossa forças até as linhas do linha de frente sem problemas."
G["Center cannon, ready."]="Canhão central pronto."
G["Central ring.  You go!"]="Anel central. Você vai!"
G["Centrifugate..."]="Centrifugamos..."
G["Centuries ago, this land was still part of the wilds. Reaching the coast was a perilous journey, and many pandaren were lost to the beasts which roam Krasarang, nest of the great crane.\n\nThat is, until the famous hunter Zhu Longbrow came along. Tired of the needless loss of life, Zhu, along with his wife Rin and their son Po - both formidable hunters in their own right - carved out and settled a corner of the wilds.\n\nZhu did not want to settle the wilds entirely, though many begged him to do so. In his wisdom, he understood that they, too, served a purpose: protecting the great crane.\n\nThus Zhu Province was born, and Zhu's Watch to protect it."]="Centuries ago, this land was still part of the wilds. Reaching the coast was a perilous journey, and many pandaren were lost to the beasts which roam Krasarang, nest of the great crane.\n\nThat is, until the famous hunter Zhu Longbrow came along. Tired of the needless loss of life, Zhu, along with his wife Rin and their son Po - both formidable hunters in their own right - carved out and settled a corner of the wilds.\n\nZhu did not want to settle the wilds entirely, though many begged him to do so. In his wisdom, he understood that they, too, served a purpose: protecting the great crane.\n\nThus Zhu Province was born, and Zhu's Watch to protect it."
G["Cerellean! You made it!"]="Cerelhean! O conseguiu!"
G["Certainly I'm allowed to have SOME secrets. Wouldn't you agree, $n?\n\nI arrived shortly after the mists collapsed - I was able to fly here after my Ravenholdt colleagues learned of a naval battle off of these shores.\n\nThis land has been hidden for ten thousand years. I've only just begun to plumb its depths!"]="Certainly I'm allowed to have SOME secrets. Wouldn't you agree, $n?\n\nI arrived shortly after the mists collapsed - I was able to fly here after my Ravenholdt colleagues learned of a naval battle off of these shores.\n\nThis land has been hidden for ten thousand years. I've only just begun to plumb its depths!"
G["Certainly not!\n\nI mean, I do have my entire fortune at risk here... and honestly, what good would a public crisis do anyone?"]="Certainly not!\n\nI mean, I do have my entire fortune at risk here... and honestly, what good would a public crisis do anyone?"
G["Certainly there's an easier way - oh. Ah! There we go!"]="Precisa haver uma forma mais fácil... Ah! Isso é!"
G["Certainly!"]="Certainly!"
G["Certainly, $g sir:miss;. We were once servants of the house Barov: What is now known as the Scholomance.\n\nI was the head maid and Lucien was Master Barov's butler.\n\nWe had worked for the Barovs for decades, until...\n\n<Eva weeps.>"]="Certainly, $g sir:miss;. We were once servants of the house Barov: What is now known as the Scholomance.\n\nI was the head maid and Lucien was Master Barov's butler.\n\nWe had worked for the Barovs for decades, until...\n\n<Eva weeps.>"
G["Certainly, $n.\n\nAdventurers that the Dawn views as exalted must submit a combined total of 12 insignias to access superior items. To access items of even greater power, they would be required to submit a total of 54 insignias.\n\nThose exalted in the eyes of the Dawn receive the greatest discounts."]="Certainly, $n.\n\nAdventurers that the Dawn views as exalted must submit a combined total of 12 insignias to access superior items. To access items of even greater power, they would be required to submit a total of 54 insignias.\n\nThose exalted in the eyes of the Dawn receive the greatest discounts."
G["Certainly, $n.\n\nAdventurers that the Dawn views as friendly must submit a combined total of 60 insignias to access superior items. To access items of even greater power, they would be required to submit a total of 220 insignias.\n\nI must admit, the price is quite high for adventurers not favored by the Dawn."]="Certainly, $n.\n\nAdventurers that the Dawn views as friendly must submit a combined total of 60 insignias to access superior items. To access items of even greater power, they would be required to submit a total of 220 insignias.\n\nI must admit, the price is quite high for adventurers not favored by the Dawn."
G["Certainly, $n.\n\nAdventurers that the Dawn views as honored must submit a combined total of 40 insignias to access superior items. To access items of even greater power, they would be required to submit a total of 150 insignias.\n\nI must admit, the price is high even for those honored amongst the Dawn."]="Certainly, $n.\n\nAdventurers that the Dawn views as honored must submit a combined total of 40 insignias to access superior items. To access items of even greater power, they would be required to submit a total of 150 insignias.\n\nI must admit, the price is high even for those honored amongst the Dawn."
G["Certainly, $n.\n\nAdventurers that the Dawn views as revered must submit a combined total of 14 insignias to access superior items. To access items of even greater power, they would be required to submit a total of 90 insignias.\n\nThose that are revered by the Dawn will find the cost of superior items quite reasonable! The cost for the more powerful items is still high."]="Certainly, $n.\n\nAdventurers that the Dawn views as revered must submit a combined total of 14 insignias to access superior items. To access items of even greater power, they would be required to submit a total of 90 insignias.\n\nThose that are revered by the Dawn will find the cost of superior items quite reasonable! The cost for the more powerful items is still high."
G["Certainly, $n. You only need to tell me what reputation you would like to know about."]="Certainly, $n. You only need to tell me what reputation you would like to know about."
G["Certainly, strength can benefit one's allies."]="Também pode beneficiar aos seus aliados."
G["Certainly."]="Certainly."
G["Certainly.  I don't make it out to Light's Hope very often anymore, but when you arrive, tell Max Tyrosus that I sent you."]="Certainly.  I don't make it out to Light's Hope very often anymore, but when you arrive, tell Max Tyrosus that I sent you."
G["Certainly. If you brought me some meat - which you have not - then I would be able to grill it for you."]="Certainly. If you brought me some meat - which you have not - then I would be able to grill it for you."
G["Certainly. Kill a few virmen, earn a few bushels of hops. I'll have Mung-Mung send them to Halfhill."]="Certainly. Kill a few virmen, earn a few bushels of hops. I'll have Mung-Mung send them to Halfhill."
G["Ch-ch-Cho'gall gives us...orbs...Twilight's Hammer clan makes us strong..."]="Ch-ch-Cho'galh dar a nós... orbes... Clã do Martelo Crepúsculo fazer a nós fortes..."
G["Chabal, I was hunting Zanzil and I lost track of what I was doing.  Can remind me where to go next?"]="Chabal, I was hunting Zanzil and I lost track of what I was doing.  Can remind me where to go next?"
G["Challenge accepted!"]="Desafio aceitou!"
G["Challenge accepted! Hit for hit, drink for drink."]="Desafio aceitou! acerto por acerto, trago por trago."
G["Challenge and defeat another Bloodpetal in one-on-one combat."]="Challenge and defeat another Bloodpetal in one-on-one combat."
G["Challenge the Pandriarch."]="Challenge the Pandriarch."
G["Challenge to a tasters' duel."]="Challenge to a tasters' duel."
G["Challenger defeated. Uploading report for analysis and verbal harassment."]="Oponente derrotou. Transfiriendo relatório para análise e abuso verbal."
G["Challenger is down!"]="Tem caído o oponente!"
G["Challenging me was a mistake."]="Foi um erro me desafiar."
G["Champion $n fights alongside us! We cannot lose!"]="O campeão $n luta conosco! Não podemos perder!"
G["Champion $n!"]="Campeão $n!"
G["Champion $n, it is good to see you again.\n\nHave you returned to Valhalas to assist a friend with their challenges?"]="$gCampeón: Campeona; $n, fico feliz em voltar a ver você,\n\nTem retornado a Valhalas para ajudar a algum amigo nos seus desafios?"
G["Champion Lightrend, make me proud!"]="Campeão Rasgaluz, faça que me sienta orgulhoso!"
G["Champion units are entering the battle!"]="Unidades campeonas entrando em combate!"
G["Champion! Again you are at the forefront of a Horde triumph. And once more I am in your debt."]="Você! Novamente está ao linha de frente de um triunfo da Horda. Uma vez mais, estou em dívida com você."
G["Champion! Behold the fruits of your labors!"]="Camarada! Contemple o fruto de nossos esforços!"
G["Champion! Our campaign is reaching a climax: We are at the very threshold of the Thunder King's palace. It is time to knock down his front door."]="Champion! Our campaign is reaching a climax: We are at the very threshold of the Thunder King's palace. It is time to knock down his front door."
G["Champion! Without your pioneering efforts on Pandaria, this foothold wouldn't have been possible."]="Sem seus esforços de colonização em Pandaria este asentamento não haveria banido possível."
G["Champion, I know that our people are at war, but if you blindly trust this black dragon in the pursuit of power, are you any better than your warchief? Please - just be careful."]="Camarada, eu sei que nosso povo está em guerra, mas se você confiar cegamente nesse dragão negro em busca de poder, então o que diferencia você do seu chefe guerreiro? Por favor, tenha cuidado."
G["Champion, I need time to... \"digest\" what I have learned.  But soon, we will take action."]="Você... eu preciso de tempo para \"digerir\" o que aprendi. Mas agiremos em breve."
G["Champion, I need you to lead a ground assault and shatter that barrier from within!"]="Quero que lideres um ataque terrestre e desactives a barrera desde dentro."
G["Champion, I need you to lead a ground assault and take down that barrier from within!"]="Quero que lideres um ataque terrestre e desactives a barrera desde dentro."
G["Champion, are you all right?"]="Está bem? Te têm ferido?"
G["Champion, hear me out: We strike the shipyard at night, using this magnificent beast you have tamed."]="Champion, hear me out: We strike the shipyard at night, using this magnificent beast you have tamed."
G["Champion, may I have a word with you? In private... ?"]="Por favor, posso falar com você? Em particular?"
G["Champion, please don't go - we need to talk!"]="Aguarda, não te vá... temos que falar."
G["Champion, predict your foe's movements, and always stay a step ahead. Victory is within you!"]="Champion, predict your foe's movements, and always stay a step ahead. Victory is within you!"
G["Champion, return now to the Isle of the Thunder King. I will meet you at the forge, where together we will create an instrument of legendary power."]="Camarada, volte para a Ilha do Rei Trovão. Encontrarei você na forja, onde criaremos um instrumento de poder lendário."
G["Champion, this cease-fire may not last, but remember what you have seen today."]="Champion, this cease-fire may not last, but remember what you have seen today."
G["Champion, turn your foe's strength and confidence against him. I believe in you."]="Usa a força do seu inimigo e seu confiança contra ele. Acho em ti."
G["Champion, with me. We must press forward while your comrades cover the rear."]="Champion, with me. We must press forward while your comrades cover the rear."
G["Champion, without your help I would've died in that swamp. I owe you my very life."]="Sem sua ajuda haveria morto neste pântano sem dúvida alguma. Te devo a vida."
G["Champion, you and Anduin thwarted the Warchief today and won the Alliance a critical victory."]="Você e Anduin frustraram os planos do Chefe Guerreiro e conseguiram uma vitória crucial para a Aliança."
G["Champion, you have been here for many weeks, and know this land well. Come with me."]="Você, veste muitas semanas aqui e conhece bem esta terra. Venha comigo."
G["Champion, you have brought glory to the Horde. Your unshakable will has secured our position here. Now, the true work begins."]="Champion, you have brought glory to the Horde. Your unshakable will has secured our position here. Now, the true work begins."
G["Champion, you have earned the honor. Signal our fleet."]="Champion, you have earned the honor. Signal our fleet."
G["Champion, you have exceeded my expectations. Our position on the isle is secured, thanks to your courage and your will. Now, the true work begins."]="Tem superado todas meus expectativas. Nossa base na ilha é certa Graças ao seu coragem e seu determinação. Agora empiezao trabalho de verdade."
G["Champion, you have your reward. But there is one final dragon we need to slay."]="Corajoso, tem seu recompensa. Mas temos que matar a um último dragão."
G["Champion, you know this land better than anyone. You're with me. Let's go find Troteman."]="Você, conhece esta terra melhor que ninguém, assim que virás comigo. Busquemos a Troteman."
G["Champion... I would think twice before putting that thing on your head."]="Melhor pensar duas vezes antes de colocar essa coroa na sua cabeça."
G["Champion... you've done it..."]="Incrível... O conseguiu..."
G["Champions on the tournament grounds speak highly of this $c.  Today we present, $n."]="Os campeões nas pistas do torneio falam maravilhas de $geste: esta; $c. Hoje presentamos a $n."
G["Champions! I cannot hold her back any longer."]="Champions! I cannot hold her back any longer."
G["Champions! My children, blessed with my power, shall aid you in your fight!"]="Campeões! Meus filhos, bendecidos por meu poder, os ajudarão na sua luta!"
G["Champions! My shield grows weak!"]="Champions! My shield grows weak!"
G["Champions' Hall"]="A Salão dos Campeões"
G["Champions, I need ya."]="Corajosos, os preciso."
G["Champions, come with me. It's time to settle grievances with our... \"Warchief.\""]="Campeões, comigo. Chegou a hora de saldar contas com nosso… \"Chefe de Guerra\"."
G["Champions, hold on while I fly you back to Khardros' Anvil!"]="Champions, hold on while I fly you back to Khardros' Anvil!"
G["Champions, hold on while I fly you back to the Scarred Terrace!"]="Champions, hold on while I fly you back to the Scarred Terrace!"
G["Champions, meet me at the Town Hall at once. We must take the fight to Mal'Ganis."]="Champions, meet me at the Town Hall at once. We must take the fight to Mal'Ganis."
G["Champions, you're alive! Not only have you defeated every challenge of the Trial of the Crusader, but also thwarted Arthas' plans! Your skill and cunning will prove to be a powerful weapon against the Scourge. Well done! Allow one of the Crusade's mages to transport you to the surface!"]="Champions, you're alive! Not only have you defeated every challenge of the Trial of the Crusader, but also thwarted Arthas' plans! Your skill and cunning will prove to be a powerful weapon against the Scourge. Well done! Allow one of the Crusade's mages to transport you to the surface!"
G["Champions, you've defeated the Trial of the Grand Crusader! Only the most battle tested adventurers could ever hope to complete this Trial. I present to you this tribute chest as a well deserved reward! May the contents serve you well in our upcoming campaign against Arthas in the heart of Icecrown Citadel!"]="Campeões, vocês têm superado a Prova do Grande Cruzado! Somente os aventureiros mais curtidos na batalha poderiam aspirar a concluir esta prova. Os entrego este cofre de tributo como merecida recompensa. Que seu conteúdo os sirva na iminente campanha contra Arthas no coração da Cidadela da Coroa de Gelo!"
G["Change is coming to Ihgaluk. The saurok are turning on one another. Some think that there are intruders among us."]="Change is coming to Ihgaluk. The saurok are turning on one another. Some think that there are intruders among us."
G["Change is inevitable, even for those as stubborn as Doshu."]="O caminho é inevitável, até para alguém tão testarudo como Doshu."
G["Changed your mind? I'll wait for you at the entrance to Ruins Rise when you're ready."]="Changed your mind? I'll wait for you at the entrance to Ruins Rise when you're ready."
G["Channel your energies into the Altar!"]="Canaliza seus energias ao altar!"
G["Chaos beckons."]="O caos se aproxima."
G["Chaos is order unrecognized by a lesser mind!"]="O caos é um ordem que não entienden as mentes inferior!"
G["Chaos will reign."]="O caos reinará."
G["Chaos!"]="Caos"
G["Chaos..."]="Caos"
G["Chaotic energy will destroy you."]="A energia caótica destruirá você."
G["Chaotic magic always has the potential for unexpected results."]="Magia caótica sempre tem o potencial para resultados inesperados."
G["Chapter on Arcane Crystals and Arcanite."]="Capítulo sobre cristais arcanos e arcanita."
G["Chapter on Enchanted Scarlet Thread."]="Capítulo sobre Fio Escarlate Encantado."
G["Chapter on Frayed Abomination Stitchings."]="Capítulo sobre pontos de abominação desgastados."
G["Chapter on Frostwhisper's Embalming Fluid."]="Capítulo sobre o fluido de embalsamamento do Frostwhisper."
G["Chapter on Skin of Shadow."]="Capítulo sobre Skin of Shadow."
G["Charge!"]="À carga!"
G["Charge!!!"]="Charge!!!"
G["Charge!!! Run 'em through!"]="Charge!!! Run 'em through!"
G["Charges are set. Might want to get clear!"]="Charges are set. Might want to get clear!"
G["Charog likes to spend his coin at the Busted Drum. Let's go pay him a visit, $n."]="Charog likes to spend his coin at the Busted Drum. Let's go pay him a visit, $n."
G["Chart a course east with all possible speed. We'll rendezvous with the main fleet."]="Rumbo este a velocidade máxima. Nos reuniremos com a frota principal."
G["Chase me if you dare! I run without a care!"]="Cógeme se você pode! Corro tão rápido como o vento!"
G["Chase the hatchlings! Chase the hatchlings! So fast!"]="Perseguir às filhotes! Perseguir às filhotes! Muito rápidas!"
G["Cheap beer!  Get your cheap beer right here!"]="Cerveja barata! Cerveja barata aqui mesmo!"
G["Check $g his:her; pockets!"]="Regístrale os bolsos!"
G["Check around Old Town at the Barracks or the Pig and Whistle Tavern. If you go to the tavern, be sure to sample some of the fine brews. Puts the dwarven ales to shame, I tell ya."]="Verifique a cidade velha no quartel ou na taberna Pig and Whistle. Se você for à taberna, não deixe de provar algumas das cervejas finas. Coloca as cervejas anãs em vergonha, eu digo."
G["Check out Dawnstrider Enchanters on the middle rise then.  Teg will be more than happy to help you in whatever way he can."]="Confira Dawnstrider Enchanters na elevação média então. Teg ficará feliz em ajudá-o da maneira que puder."
G["Check out all the cool silk!"]="Mira esta preciosa seda!"
G["Check out the 3-B entertainment! Brewfest's Barleybrew Brewmasters!"]="Check out the 3-B entertainment! Brewfest's Barleybrew Brewmasters!"
G["Check out the comedy stylings of Perry Gatner in just a few minutes!"]="Aproveite das actuações de Perry Gatner em uns instantes!"
G["Check out the modified leg articulation!  Perfect for off-roading!"]="Olhe as articulações modificadas das pernas! Perfeita para o terreno agreste!"
G["Check that cell, $n. If someone is alive in there, we need to get them out."]="Check that cell, $n. If someone is alive in there, we need to get them out."
G["Check the bulletin board if you're looking for work, $r."]="Check the bulletin board if you're looking for work, $r."
G["Check this out guys!  I can rock like you guys!"]="Olhem isto pessoal! Posso fazer isso igual de bem que vocês!"
G["Check this out, $r! Ya know what $G ya:yer sweetheart; be needin'? One of these flowers. Lilacs, right outta the mystical forest of Terokkar! Rare! So rare! Ya don't see any of 'em around me, do ya? A pretty flower for a pretty lady, right? Right?"]="Check this out, $r! Ya know what $G ya:yer sweetheart; be needin'? One of these flowers. Lilacs, right outta the mystical forest of Terokkar! Rare! So rare! Ya don't see any of 'em around me, do ya? A pretty flower for a pretty lady, right? Right?"
G["Check this place out!"]="Mira este lugar!"
G["Check those crystals over there!"]="Inspeciona aqueles cristais de ali!"
G["Check your tracks!"]="Cuidado por onde andas!"
G["Check!"]="Jaque!"
G["Checking out the datas, hold on a second will ya."]="Checking out the datas, hold on a second will ya."
G["Checkmate."]="Jaque mate."
G["Chee Chee got big problem. Big, big problems."]="Chee Chee tem grande problema. Grandes, grandes problemas."
G["Chee Chee got big problem. Big, big problems. Buddy help Chee Chee?"]="Chee Chee tem grande problema. Grandes, grandes problemas. Colega ajuda a Chee Chee?"
G["Chee Chee is a hozen sheep-herder who works on the terrace to the west."]="Chee Chee é um pastor hozen que trabalha no bancal ao oeste."
G["Chee Chee is only hozen with own farm!\n\n<Chee Chee thumps his chest proudly.>\n\nYou, friend, come visit me at my farm sometime, okay?"]="Chee Chee is only hozen with own farm!\n\n<Chee Chee thumps his chest proudly.>\n\nYou, friend, come visit me at my farm sometime, okay?"
G["Chee Chee is your acquaintance."]="Chee Chee é seu conhecido."
G["Chee Chee is your best friend. Perhaps you could speak to him and see if he'd help out on the farm."]="Chee Chee é seu melhor amigo. Talvez possa pedirle que ajude na fazenda."
G["Chee Chee is your buddy."]="Chee Chee é seu colega."
G["Chee Chee is your friend."]="Chee Chee é seu amigo."
G["Chee Chee is your good friend."]="Chee Chee é um bom amigo."
G["Chee Chee like to look at sky. So pretty... so blue..."]="A Chee Chee lhe gosta olhar o céu. Tão bonito... tão azul..."
G["Chee Chee love to eat Valley Stir Fry. You find any, you bring to me!"]="Chee Chee love to eat Valley Stir Fry. You find any, you bring to me!"
G["Chee Chee loves gifts! Thank you!"]="A Chee Chee lhe enkantaos regalos! Obrigado!"
G["Chee Chee raise only sheep in the fields!\n\nAnyone want sheep, they come to Chee Chee."]="Chee Chee raise only sheep in the fields!\n\nAnyone want sheep, they come to Chee Chee."
G["Chee Chee work hard for farm. Buddy understand, right?"]="Chee Chee trabalha duro para fazenda. Colega entiende, verdade?"
G["Chee Chee work hard for farm. Now bad monkeys come take away!"]="Chee Chee trabalha duro para a fazenda. Agoraos macacos maus leva tudo!"
G["Chee Chee's got his own farm to the northwest, just up the mountain some.\n\nThat poor fella's been plagued by one ill turn after another."]="Chee Chee's got his own farm to the northwest, just up the mountain some.\n\nThat poor fella's been plagued by one ill turn after another."
G["Chee Chee's sheep sheep are so scared... bad monkeys on hill! Bad monkey!"]="Chee Chee's sheep sheep are so scared... bad monkeys on hill! Bad monkey!"
G["Cheeky little bugger! Didn't think he had it in him!"]="Cheeky little bugger! Didn't think he had it in him!"
G["Cheers!"]="Felicidades!"
G["Cheese it! It's the fuzz!"]="Água! A correr!"
G["Cheese, eh? Is it perhaps... aged cheese?"]="Queijo, eh? Talvez seja... queijo envelhecido?"
G["Chef, could you grill this plainshawk leg for me?"]="Chef, could you grill this plainshawk leg for me?"
G["Chef... if I brought you a plainshawk leg, could you grill it for me?"]="Chef... if I brought you a plainshawk leg, could you grill it for me?"
G["Chelon has been engaged by $n the $r $c."]="Chelon has been engaged by $n the $r $c."
G["Chelsea, baby, please drink this. It'll make you feel better."]="Chelsea, carinho, bebe isto. Te fará sentir melhor."
G["Chelsea, baby, sit up! I've got it! This is gonna cure you!"]="Chelsea, carinho, sente-se! O tenho! Isto te curará!"
G["Chelsea, baby, that's crazy talk! You're delirious! Just hold on a while longer..."]="Chelsea, baby, that's crazy talk! You're delirious! Just hold on a while longer..."
G["Chen! It's a giant dang ol' hozen!"]="Chen! É um pedaço de hozen!"
G["Chen, I think I know why you like it here so much."]="Chen, acho que sei por que te gosta tanto estar aqui."
G["Cherry pie is my favoritist food in all of Azeroth."]="Torta de cereja é a minha comida favorita em tudo o Azeroth."
G["Chezin lay dead with grievous wounds both physical and magical."]="Chezin tem perecido por feridas graves, tanto físicas como mágicas."
G["Chi-Ji watches over the Temple of the Red Crane to the south.\n\nShe is trying to regain order after the sha eruption created chaos across the land.\n\nIf you wish to help her, travel to the Cradle of Chi-Ji in the Krasarang Wilds."]="Chi-Ji watches over the Temple of the Red Crane to the south.\n\nShe is trying to regain order after the sha eruption created chaos across the land.\n\nIf you wish to help her, travel to the Cradle of Chi-Ji in the Krasarang Wilds."
G["Chicken! So delicious!"]="Frango! Tão delicioso!"
G["Chicks dig scars, so you can see why I'm such a hit with the ladies."]="Às chicas lhes gostam as cicatrizes. Entende por que tenho tanto êxito com as mulheres?"
G["Chief Ashtotem, I have misplaced the token that you gave me."]="Chefe Ashtotem, perdi o sinal que você me deu."
G["Chief Bloodhoof, this may sound like an odd request... but I have a young ward who is quite shy.  You are a hero to him, and he asked me to get your hoofprint."]="Chief Bloodhoof, this may sound like an odd request... but I have a young ward who is quite shy.  You are a hero to him, and he asked me to get your hoofprint."
G["Chief Gukgut say you gotta go!"]="Chefe Gukgut diz fosse!"
G["Chief Spirithorn, I beseech you to send aid to Westreach Summit now, before it is too late."]="Chief Spirithorn, I beseech you to send aid to Westreach Summit now, before it is too late."
