G["Come one! Come all! Perelli's elixirs will dazzle!"]="Come one! Come all! Perelli's elixirs will dazzle!"
G["Come one, come all!  Welcome to the Darkmoon Faire!  Do you crave adventure?  Do you seek exotic and mysterious treasures?  Then look no further!  You, my friend, have come to the right place!  Dive right in and take part in all that the Faire has to offer!  We'll be at this location all week, so be sure to tell your friends and loved ones!"]="Vamos, venham todos! Bem-vindos à Feira da Lua Negra! Ouvidos aventuras? Ouvidos exóticos e misteriosos tesouros? Pois não continue procurando! Tem vindo ao lugar indicado! Passa e participa em tudo o que a Feira da Lua Negra te oferecem! Estaremos aqui uma semana, avisa aos seus amigos e aos seus seres queridos!"
G["Come one, come all! Antonio's wares are for sale. I may not return for a great deal of time, so come one, come all."]="Vamos, venham todos! As mercadorias de Antonio estão à venda. Talvez não fique durante muito tempo, assim que venham todos."
G["Come one, come all.  Welcome to the Darkmoon Faire!  Don't be shy.  Step right up to Lhara and buy yourself an exotic artifact from far off lands.  If you're one of the lucky few who have found Darkmoon Cards, have a word with Professor Paleo.  Hungry?  Thirsty?  You're in luck!  Refreshments are available right here from Sylannia and Stamp.  I recommend the Darkmoon Special Reserve to wash down some Red Hot Wings.  And if the future is what you seek, then run, don't walk, to speak with Sayge."]="Come one, come all.  Welcome to the Darkmoon Faire!  Don't be shy.  Step right up to Lhara and buy yourself an exotic artifact from far off lands.  If you're one of the lucky few who have found Darkmoon Cards, have a word with Professor Paleo.  Hungry?  Thirsty?  You're in luck!  Refreshments are available right here from Sylannia and Stamp.  I recommend the Darkmoon Special Reserve to wash down some Red Hot Wings.  And if the future is what you seek, then run, don't walk, to speak with Sayge."
G["Come out and count them, coward!"]="Come out and count them, coward!"
