G["Da Forsaken weapon master Archibald know his way 'round da polearm. He train others in da War Quarter of da Undercity. Ileda, da blood elf weapon master in Farstrider Square in Silvermoon, show you da right techniques too, mon."]="O mestre de armas Da Renegado, Archibald, conhece o caminho da arma. Ele treina outros no Bairro de Guerra da Cidade Baixa. Ileda, o mestre em armas dos elfos sanguíneos na Farstrider Square em Silvermoon, também mostra as técnicas certas, seg."
G["Da Gordok no like Dagg'thol, so he kill them. Da stupid trees and goat men no like Dagg'thol, so he want kill them too.\n\nPuny $r like Dagg'thol and help him take dis place for Master? Or does Dagg'thol need kill you too?\n\nStupid tree keep staring at Ambassador Dagg'thol..."]="Da Gordok no like Dagg'thol, so he kill them. Da stupid trees and goat men no like Dagg'thol, so he want kill them too.\n\nPuny $r like Dagg'thol and help him take dis place for Master? Or does Dagg'thol need kill you too?\n\nStupid tree keep staring at Ambassador Dagg'thol..."
