G["Dalaran has no auction house of its own. You must take a portal back to one of your capitals.\n\nThey can be found in Dalaran's Alliance and Horde quarters: the Silver Enclave and the Sunreaver's Sancturary."]="Dalaran has no auction house of its own. You must take a portal back to one of your capitals.\n\nThey can be found in Dalaran's Alliance and Horde quarters: the Silver Enclave and the Sunreaver's Sancturary."
