G["Dalaran's only class trainers are mages. You must take a portal back to one of your capitals for others.\n\nThey can be found in Dalaran's Alliance and Horde quarters: the Silver Enclave and the Sunreaver's Sancturary."]="Dalaran's only class trainers are mages. You must take a portal back to one of your capitals for others.\n\nThey can be found in Dalaran's Alliance and Horde quarters: the Silver Enclave and the Sunreaver's Sancturary."
