G["Dame Auriferous, we are the reinforcements. It may come to pass that The Lady will send more men in time. Better that you convince Silvermoon City to muster all of its forces and put them at our disposal here."]="Dame Auriferous, we are the reinforcements. It may come to pass that The Lady will send more men in time. Better that you convince Silvermoon City to muster all of its forces and put them at our disposal here."
