G["Damn the men! Nothing shall prevent me from having my revenge, old friend. Not even you."]="Damn the men! Nothing shall prevent me from having my revenge, old friend. Not even you."
G["Damn the titans for cursing us so! Ymiron, my king, open your eyes!"]="Damn the titans for cursing us so! Ymiron, my king, open your eyes!"
