G["Damn those blood elves and their reckless magic!"]="Malditos elfos sanguíneos e sua magia imprudente!"
G["Damn those ogres. Damn them to the Nether. Won't someone save us from these savages! This is the fifth kidnapping in as many days."]="Damn those ogres. Damn them to the Nether. Won't someone save us from these savages! This is the fifth kidnapping in as many days."
