G["Death's Door is a portal that opens upon the world that the Burning Legion uses to breed their fel hounds and other canine-like terrors.  Any time that you see one of those creatures, that is where it came from, and it passes through here, first.\n\nLately, we became aware that the Burning Legion have ramped up their summoning of these creatures through the portal.\n\nYou must shut down Death's Door before it becomes an inexorable tide, and all is lost!"]="Death's Door is a portal that opens upon the world that the Burning Legion uses to breed their fel hounds and other canine-like terrors.  Any time that you see one of those creatures, that is where it came from, and it passes through here, first.\n\nLately, we became aware that the Burning Legion have ramped up their summoning of these creatures through the portal.\n\nYou must shut down Death's Door before it becomes an inexorable tide, and all is lost!"
G["Death's cold embrace awaits."]="O frio abraço da morte os espera."
G["Death's cold embrace."]="O frio abraço da mueh'te."
G["Death, danger, the return of the Zandalari and their magic. Exciting!"]="Death, danger, the return of the Zandalari and their magic. Exciting!"
G["Death... Good choice. Not best choice maybe, but better than fail and live."]="Death... Good choice. Not best choice maybe, but better than fail and live."
G["Death... will not stop me."]="A morte não me detendrá."
G["Death? Who said anything about death?"]="Morte? Quem tem dito nada de morte?"
G["Deathblade ... activated! System integrity check: 57 percent nominal."]="Hojamuerte... ativada! Comprobação de integridade do sistema: 57%, nominal."
G["Deathforge Mine will detonate in 3 seconds!"]="A Mina da Forja Morta detonará em três segundos!"
G["Deathforge Mine: Detonating!"]="Mina da Forja Morta: Detonando!"
G["Deathstalker Command Belmont grins."]="O comandante Mortacechador Belmont sorri."
G["Deathwing - he lives!"]="Alamuerte... está vivo!"
G["Deathwing came here and didn't slay you all?"]="Alamuerte veio aqui e não os matou a todos?"
G["Deathwing had unstoppable power. And now, it is MINE."]="Asa da morte tinha poder imbatível. E agora é MEU!"
G["Deathwing has prepared me to face the vessel of Tarecgosa, your fools journey ends here!"]="Deathwing has prepared me to face the vessel of Tarecgosa, your fools journey ends here!"
G["Deathwing has returned. He's seized Grim Batol and much of the highlands, and I feel near powerless to stop him.\n\nSoon, our queen shall arrive, and together we shall put the once Earthwarder in his place."]="Deathwing has returned. He's seized Grim Batol and much of the highlands, and I feel near powerless to stop him.\n\nSoon, our queen shall arrive, and together we shall put the once Earthwarder in his place."
G["Deathwing is conjuring the final Cataclysm; even the Emerald Dream trembles. If we are to stop the spell, we must attack him together."]="Deathwing is conjuring the final Cataclysm; even the Emerald Dream trembles. If we are to stop the spell, we must attack him together."
G["Deathwing is victorious! Try again once Alexstrasza recovers."]="Alamuerte derrotou! Inténtalo novamente quando Alexstrasza se recupere."
G["Deathwing shall bring destruction upon your entire order.  And this day, I shall be his blade!"]="Deathwing shall bring destruction upon your entire order.  And this day, I shall be his blade!"
G["Deathwing will have his way with your Stonemother."]="Deathwing will have his way with your Stonemother."
G["Deathwing will pay for this."]="Alamuerte pagará por isto."
G["Deathwing!  I have fallen....  The brood... is lost."]="Alamuerte! E caído... A prole... está perdida..."
G["Deathwing's brood... Ysera's benevolence raised the ire of Deathwing - patron of the black dragonflight. They attacked us in our sleep! Many died on the initial surge but the greens rose to protect us.\n\n<Prince Toreth points around the island.>\n\nThe bones are all that remain of the once great dragons. None were spared."]="Deathwing's brood... Ysera's benevolence raised the ire of Deathwing - patron of the black dragonflight. They attacked us in our sleep! Many died on the initial surge but the greens rose to protect us.\n\n<Prince Toreth points around the island.>\n\nThe bones are all that remain of the once great dragons. None were spared."
G["Deathwing's entry into our world opened a rift between it and Deepholm.\n\nRebuilding the World Pillar is the only way to stabilize the rift."]="Deathwing's entry into our world opened a rift between it and Deepholm.\n\nRebuilding the World Pillar is the only way to stabilize the rift."
G["Deathwing's escape didn't just damage our world.  A powerful stone created by the Titans used to be in this room before the breach shattered it.  It was known as the World Pillar."]="Deathwing's escape didn't just damage our world.  A powerful stone created by the Titans used to be in this room before the breach shattered it.  It was known as the World Pillar."
G["Deathwing's madness overcomes him, and we, the red dragons, must take this opportunity to steal his black dragons from beneath him.  We will remake the black dragons as they were intended to be: the warders of the earth."]="Deathwing's madness overcomes him, and we, the red dragons, must take this opportunity to steal his black dragons from beneath him.  We will remake the black dragons as they were intended to be: the warders of the earth."
G["Deathwing's minions should be afraid of ME. Get him out of here."]="Deathwing's minions should be afraid of ME. Get him out of here."
G["Deathwing's return to Azeroth caused a major rift within the two worlds.  This breach is the force largely behind the cataclysm that threatens to destroy our lands."]="Deathwing's return to Azeroth caused a major rift within the two worlds.  This breach is the force largely behind the cataclysm that threatens to destroy our lands."
G["Deathwing's shadow settles over you."]="Deathwing's shadow settles over you."
G["Deathwing's taint shall be wiped from Deepholm, and his Twilight cultists with it."]="A mancha de Asa da Morte será apagada de Deepholm, e seus cultistas de Crepúsculo com ela."
G["Deathwing, or Neltharion as he was once known, was the Aspect that embodied the strength of the world - granted almost limitless power over this mortal realm by the Titan shaper known as Khaz'goroth: Forger of the world.\n\nThrough treachery and deceit, the foul one convinced the four other Aspects to imbue an item, known as the Demon Soul, with their powers - greatly weakening them, forcing a division among the once great Aspects."]="Deathwing, or Neltharion as he was once known, was the Aspect that embodied the strength of the world - granted almost limitless power over this mortal realm by the Titan shaper known as Khaz'goroth: Forger of the world.\n\nThrough treachery and deceit, the foul one convinced the four other Aspects to imbue an item, known as the Demon Soul, with their powers - greatly weakening them, forcing a division among the once great Aspects."
G["Deathwing?! The Cataclysm?! We're doomed!! We have to get off of Kezan before Mount Kajaro blows for good!!!"]="Deathwing?! The Cataclysm?! We're doomed!! We have to get off of Kezan before Mount Kajaro blows for good!!!"
G["Debug message, Thelrin has been summoned."]="Mensagem de debug, se tem invocado a Thelrin."
G["Deceit is no match for true strength! This one is more powerful than you!"]="Deceit is no match for true strength! This one is more powerful than you!"
G["Decided to go for a swim, did you?  Well, you're still in one piece, so no harm done I suppose."]="Decided to go for a swim, did you?  Well, you're still in one piece, so no harm done I suppose."
G["Decipher this!"]="Decipher this!"
G["Deck Boss said you needed some help."]="Deck Boss said you needed some help."
G["Decontamination complete. Standby for delivery."]="Descontaminação concluída. Esperando entrega."
G["Decrypt the final instructions. We activate the Waygate within the hour!"]="Decrypt the final instructions. We activate the Waygate within the hour!"
G["Dedicated to those that fell to the Scourge during the war in the frozen wastes."]="Dedicado àqueles que caíram no Flagelo durante a guerra nos resíduos congelados."
G["Dedlow Wormwood's the corpse you want. He's usually around the south end of town."]="Dedlow Wormwood é o cadáver que você quer. Ele geralmente está no extremo sul da cidade."
G["Deep breaths... deep breaths!"]="Respira profundamente... respira profundamente!"
G["Deep doom"]="Condena Asa"
G["Deep truths may only be learned through deep questioning."]="As grandes verdades somente se aprendem a através das grandes perguntas."
G["Deep within his soul, the one thing he feared most of all was...himself."]="Deep within his soul, the one thing he feared most of all was...himself."
G["Deepholm has changed much in recent years. It's hardly recognizable.\n\nStill... here I am free from corruption. Free from the tainting influence of ancient gods. It seems that sometimes your freedom must be stripped away for you to truly appreciate its value."]="Deepholm has changed much in recent years. It's hardly recognizable.\n\nStill... here I am free from corruption. Free from the tainting influence of ancient gods. It seems that sometimes your freedom must be stripped away for you to truly appreciate its value."
G["Deepholm is the realm of earth.  It is here that Deathwing retreated when he was first defeated."]="Infralar é o reino da terra. Aqui é onde se retirou Alamuerte quando foi derrotou pela primeira vez."
G["Deepholm shall collapse upon you!"]="Deepholm shall collapse upon you!"
G["Deepholm was a slow, quiet place. Always alive. Steadily moving. Never rushed. In this time, I strived to become one with the earth, and to a large degree, I succeeded.\n\nLater, the Earthwarder returned, injured. He did not upset the balance at first. He'd stayed here before, and we knew of him. The shift did not truly begin until the Twilight cult joined him."]="Deepholm was a slow, quiet place. Always alive. Steadily moving. Never rushed. In this time, I strived to become one with the earth, and to a large degree, I succeeded.\n\nLater, the Earthwarder returned, injured. He did not upset the balance at first. He'd stayed here before, and we knew of him. The shift did not truly begin until the Twilight cult joined him."
G["Deepholm? I hate this place. Wait... you're not Initiate Goldmine!"]="Infralar? Ódio este lugar. Aguarda... Não é o iniciada Minaoro!"
G["Deeprun Tram"]="Metrô Correfundo"
