G["Delivering these barrels to the excavation site is hard work, but there are so many depending on us to get the blast powder there.\n\nWe must do what we can against the Dark Irons!"]="Delivering these barrels to the excavation site is hard work, but there are so many depending on us to get the blast powder there.\n\nWe must do what we can against the Dark Irons!"
