G["Der... Der's no more time for me. I be done for. Finish me off, $n. Do it or dey'll kill us both. $n... Remember Sen'jin Village, mon! Dis world be worth saving!"]="Der... Der's no more time for me. I be done for. Finish me off, $n. Do it or dey'll kill us both. $n... Remember Sen'jin Village, mon! Dis world be worth saving!"
