G["Dere be no hidin' from da eagle!"]="Não há forma de esconder do águia!"
G["Dere be no question why, Garrosh.  He gave ya tha title because ya be Grom's son and because tha people be wantin' a war hero."]="Dere be no question why, Garrosh.  He gave ya tha title because ya be Grom's son and because tha people be wantin' a war hero."
G["Dere be nothin' chaotic about dis attack. Da elementals and giants be organizin' against us. It be seemin' dat somehow we've earned da ire of Therazane, da Stonemother herself."]="Não fique nada caótico sobre esse ataque. Os elementais e gigantes estão se organizando contra nós. Parece que de alguma forma ganhamos a ira de Therazane, da própria Stonemother."
G["Dere be others."]="Há mais."
G["Dere be somethin' in dat one. Go take look."]="Dere be somethin' in dat one. Go take look."
G["Dere it be, mon. My huntin' eye! I'll be able ta rest in peace wit' my ancestors..."]="Dere it be, mon. My huntin' eye! I'll be able ta rest in peace wit' my ancestors..."
G["Dere was a shrine to serpents just to da east of Bambala, I need ya to toss some sticks into da bonfire in front of dat shrine.  Den Bwemba can handle da rest."]="Dere was a shrine to serpents just to da east of Bambala, I need ya to toss some sticks into da bonfire in front of dat shrine.  Den Bwemba can handle da rest."
G["Dere we go, mon. Now I be goin' off ta be wit Snuff..."]="Já eh'tá, colega. Agora me vou com Snuff..."
G["Dere's nothin' bettah dan flyin' ovah ya enemies an' droppin' dey boom-boom bombs on dem!\n\nDat, or droppin' two-hundred, fifty pound orcs on dere heads. Right, mon?"]="Dere's nothin' bettah dan flyin' ovah ya enemies an' droppin' dey boom-boom bombs on dem!\n\nDat, or droppin' two-hundred, fifty pound orcs on dere heads. Right, mon?"
