G["Derenda Enkleshin carries enchanting supplies. She can be found in the chamber of masters, to the left as you enter the building.\n\nI will mark the location on your map."]="Derenda Enkleshin carries enchanting supplies. She can be found in the chamber of masters, to the left as you enter the building.\n\nI will mark the location on your map."
G["Derived from cutting edge Shattered Sun Offensive military technology, it blasts away stubborn stains with ease!"]="Derived from cutting edge Shattered Sun Offensive military technology, it blasts away stubborn stains with ease!"
G["Deriz is the one you should speak with if you wish to learn the basics of alchemy."]="Se que aprender o básico sobre alquimia, deve falar com Deriz."
G["Derpa Derpa wanders into town every now and then and tries to sell us strange gadgets that he's found rummaging around Kun-Lai Summit. Talk to him and see if he has anything that we could use as a weapon."]="Derpa Derpa wanders into town every now and then and tries to sell us strange gadgets that he's found rummaging around Kun-Lai Summit. Talk to him and see if he has anything that we could use as a weapon."
G["Des fools thought they beat me once before. Dey only make me stronger. Now we show dem da true power of the Zandalari!"]="Des fools thought they beat me once before. Dey only make me stronger. Now we show dem da true power of the Zandalari!"
G["Describe this vrykul. What does he look like?"]="Descreve a esse vrykul. Que aspecto tinha?"
G["Dese Gurubashi mean business.  We gotta help dese people."]="Esses Gurubashi são coisa seria. Devemos ajudar a essa gente."
G["Dese be dark times, but our people will be stayin' with tha Horde for tha good of all."]="Dese be dark times, but our people will be stayin' with tha Horde for tha good of all."
G["Dese be strange times... Thanks, $r. We gonna spill a lot of Kor'kron blood wit' dis."]="Eh'tos são tempos estranhos... Obrigado, $r. Derramaremos muita sangue Kor'kron com eh'to."
G["Dese caves be haunted, mon. Filled with the worst juju.\n\nIn days when de Twilight's Hammer be settin' up atop de mountain, the unworthy were tossed into dese caverns. Into de Gullet. Food for de black drakes dat once nested here.\n\nDem people, dey never come out. Not even de spirits."]="Dese caves be haunted, mon. Filled with the worst juju.\n\nIn days when de Twilight's Hammer be settin' up atop de mountain, the unworthy were tossed into dese caverns. Into de Gullet. Food for de black drakes dat once nested here.\n\nDem people, dey never come out. Not even de spirits."
G["Dese spirits don't belong!"]="Dese spirits don't belong!"
G["Designation: Old Gods. Old Gods rendered all systems, including earthen, defenseless in order to facilitate assimilation. This matrix destabilization has been termed \"the Curse of Flesh\". Effects of destabilization increased over time."]="Designation: Old Gods. Old Gods rendered all systems, including earthen, defenseless in order to facilitate assimilation. This matrix destabilization has been termed \"the Curse of Flesh\". Effects of destabilization increased over time."
G["Designations: Aesir and Vanir. Or in the common nomenclature, storm and earth giants. Sentinel Loken designated supreme. Dragon Aspects appointed to monitor evolution on Azeroth."]="Designações: Aesir e Vanir. OU na nomenclatura comum, gigantes da tempestade e a terra. O sentinela Loken foi designado supremo. Os dragões Aspectos foram enviados a vigilar a evolução em Azeroth."
G["Despair, mortals! Your doom has come!"]="Despair, mortals! Your doom has come!"
G["Despair..."]="/dardeombros"
G["Despair... so delicious..."]="Desesperação... deliciosa..."
G["Desperate times call for desperate measures, $c."]="Em tempos desesperados são necessárias medidas desesperadas, $c."
G["Despite our efforts to become enlightened beings, we have repeated the mistakes of our past.\n\nThe sha threaten this land once again."]="Despite our efforts to become enlightened beings, we have repeated the mistakes of our past.\n\nThe sha threaten this land once again."
G["Despite our losses here, the king will be pleased to know that the naga general was defeated."]="Despite our losses here, the king will be pleased to know that the naga general was defeated."
G["Despite our success in Northrend, we face serious problems that cannot be solved simply by axe and sword.  Earthquakes shake every region.  Elementals ravage the countryside.  I can hear our land, Azeroth, cry out in pain."]="Despite our success in Northrend, we face serious problems that cannot be solved simply by axe and sword.  Earthquakes shake every region.  Elementals ravage the countryside.  I can hear our land, Azeroth, cry out in pain."
G["Despite the hardships we've had to go through in this wasteland, I believe that the young prince will see us to victory. I pray each night for his safety."]="Apesar das dificuldades pelas quais tivemos que passar neste terreno baldio, acredito que o jovem príncipe nos verá à vitória. Eu rezo todas as noites pela sua segurança."
G["Despite their tragedy the Undead have come all this way to aid us.  I only hope that we can be as helpful to them.  Seek out Father Cobb near the Pools of Vision under the Spirit Rise."]="Apesar da tragédia, os Mortos-Vivos chegaram até aqui para nos ajudar. Só espero que possamos ser tão úteis para eles. Procure o Pai Cobb perto das Piscinas da Visão sob a Ascensão Espiritual."
G["Despite what I may have said in the past, I never doubted your abilities!"]="Não importa o que tenha pedido dizer antes. Nunca dudé do seu capacidade!"
G["Despite your obvious weaknesses, I have grown fond of you, Wakener. I was made a paragon because of my prowess on the battlefield. It was said that I could cheat death itself. I shall lend you this very ability, Painkiller, to protect you during the task ahead."]="Despite your obvious weaknesses, I have grown fond of you, Wakener. I was made a paragon because of my prowess on the battlefield. It was said that I could cheat death itself. I shall lend you this very ability, Painkiller, to protect you during the task ahead."
