G["Did Brak say this teleporter thing was tested? Well, if you're ready to go back to Nozzlepot's Outpost, just say the word! I hope you get there in one piece."]="Did Brak say this teleporter thing was tested? Well, if you're ready to go back to Nozzlepot's Outpost, just say the word! I hope you get there in one piece."
G["Did Crest send you?"]="Crest enviou você?"
