G["Did you hear what those Tillers said about me being a citypaw?\n\nSure I grew up in Dawn's Blossom, but I visited my grandpa a few times. I know the difference between a carrot and a turnip! One's orange and one's white, after all!\n\nAfter Grandpa passed, he left the farm to me, so I'm going to do my best for him! But how can I prove that to those Tillers?"]="Did you hear what those Tillers said about me being a citypaw?\n\nSure I grew up in Dawn's Blossom, but I visited my grandpa a few times. I know the difference between a carrot and a turnip! One's orange and one's white, after all!\n\nAfter Grandpa passed, he left the farm to me, so I'm going to do my best for him! But how can I prove that to those Tillers?"
