G["Do I look like a fool, mortal? Because only a fool would remain here and do battle with you and all of your allies. Perhaps another time... Should you ever find the courage to back up your banter."]="Do I look like a fool, mortal? Because only a fool would remain here and do battle with you and all of your allies. Perhaps another time... Should you ever find the courage to back up your banter."
G["Do I look like a guide to you?  Fine, what do you need?"]="Tenho aspecto de guia? Bom, O que precisa?"
