G["Do I look to you like I cast spells?  Well, I did hear that Cain Firesong now hangs out in the laboratory, always working on something unsavory."]="Do I look to you like I cast spells?  Well, I did hear that Cain Firesong now hangs out in the laboratory, always working on something unsavory."
G["Do I look to you like I cast spells?  Well, I did hear that Cain Firesong was hanging out on the upstairs landing of the Gallows' End Tavern at the southeast end of town.  Odd how he just stands there outside of Gretchen's room like that."]="Eu pareço com você como se eu lançasse feitiços? Bem, ouvi dizer que Cain Firesong estava no andar de cima da Taverna Gallows 'End, no extremo sudeste da cidade. Estranho como ele fica parado lá fosse do quarto de Gretchen assim."
