G["Do me this courtesy, $p, and do not share with Garrosh what has transpired here today. I could confront him directly, but I see now not all orcs share my view of the Horde.\n\nWho am I to command their allegiance if I must become another dictator to do so?\n\nWhat I can do is aid the Darkspear in fortifying their home while their heroes are abroad for the war. When Vol'jin returns, we will plan our next move."]="Do me this courtesy, $p, and do not share with Garrosh what has transpired here today. I could confront him directly, but I see now not all orcs share my view of the Horde.\n\nWho am I to command their allegiance if I must become another dictator to do so?\n\nWhat I can do is aid the Darkspear in fortifying their home while their heroes are abroad for the war. When Vol'jin returns, we will plan our next move."
G["Do murderers kill?"]="Do murderers kill?"
G["Do my eyes deceive me? Am I truly free?"]="Do my eyes deceive me? Am I truly free?"
G["Do my eyes deceive me? Is that really you, Brother Rokkaram, after all this time?\n\nIf you are looking for Sai'kkal, he walks among the crystals in the western part of the Vortex Pinnacle. He seems preoccupied with what he calls a brutish, primitive presence there, although nothing seems amiss."]="Do my eyes deceive me? Is that really you, Brother Rokkaram, after all this time?\n\nIf you are looking for Sai'kkal, he walks among the crystals in the western part of the Vortex Pinnacle. He seems preoccupied with what he calls a brutish, primitive presence there, although nothing seems amiss."
G["Do my eyes deceive me? What is that wall in the distance?"]="Do my eyes deceive me? What is that wall in the distance?"
G["Do not EVER bring cyclopean demonic octopi into the cove again!"]="Do not EVER bring cyclopean demonic octopi into the cove again!"
G["Do not allow Kaskala to forget what has happened here."]="Não permitas que Kashala esquecimento que tem sucedido aqui."
G["Do not allow the elements to engage you!"]="Não deixe que os elementos cheguem você!"
G["Do not allow these wretches a moment of rest!  If there's an Ata'mal crystal here then we shall find it!"]="Não lhes deis nem um momento de descanso! Se há algum cristal de Ata'mal aqui, o encontraremos!"
G["Do not allow your foe to complete his attack."]="Não deixe que seu inimigo complete seu ataque."
