G["Do not ask needless questions, wallwalker. Focus on the task at hand."]="Do not ask needless questions, wallwalker. Focus on the task at hand."
G["Do not attempt to deceive me, demon!"]="Não tente me enganar, demônio!"
G["Do not back down. We are winning this!"]="Não te rindas. O vamos conseguir!"
G["Do not be afraid to lose one battle if the war is won."]="Não tenha medo de perder uma batalha, se assim você vencer a guerra."
G["Do not be afraid, $c. We embrace all who seek the truth."]="Do not be afraid, $c. We embrace all who seek the truth."
G["Do not be afraid. I will not let you fall."]="Não temas. Não te deixarei cair."
G["Do not be alarmed, $n.\n\nI am projecting my dream self here in order to aid your efforts against the mogu."]="Do not be alarmed, $n.\n\nI am projecting my dream self here in order to aid your efforts against the mogu."
G["Do not be alarmed. I am not as I appear.\n\nMy name is Acridostrasz, though you may call me Acride. My Queen sent me here to stop Nefarian, and I will not rest until my task is complete. However, there are other foes here guarding his lair that I cannot take on alone.\n\nHelp me dispose of them, and you will be in the favor of Alexstrasza. You may not know that name, but you will one day be thankful you do, of this I am certain."]="Do not be alarmed. I am not as I appear.\n\nMy name is Acridostrasz, though you may call me Acride. My Queen sent me here to stop Nefarian, and I will not rest until my task is complete. However, there are other foes here guarding his lair that I cannot take on alone.\n\nHelp me dispose of them, and you will be in the favor of Alexstrasza. You may not know that name, but you will one day be thankful you do, of this I am certain."
G["Do not be disheartened. Silvermoon will remain strong through this course of events."]="Não te desmoralices. Luaprata permanecerá forte ao largo do curso de estes acontecimentos."
G["Do not be fooled by my calmness. I will defeat you."]="Não se iluda com minha tranquilidade. Vou derrotá-l$go:a;."
G["Do not be fooled by the ruins surrounding us, $c.  Dalaran is as powerful as ever."]="Não deixe que as ruínas que nos cercam te enganhen, $c. Dalaran é tão poderosa como sempre."
G["Do not be fooled by their diminutive size, $n, they are disciplined and quick."]="Não se engane pelo tamanho reduzido, $n, eles são disciplinados e velozes."
G["Do not be frightened child... welcome the cold embrace of death..."]="Não te asustes, pequeno... da a boas-vindas ao frio abraço da morte..."
G["Do not be frightened, $r. Our ends are the same."]="Não temas, $r. Nosso fim é o mesmo."
G["Do not be lured into the mortals' trap.  Bathe in my power!  Be renewed and destroy the heretics!"]="Do not be lured into the mortals' trap.  Bathe in my power!  Be renewed and destroy the heretics!"
G["Do not be saddened. The cycle is clear - it neither begins nor ends with me."]="Não estiver triste. O ciclo continue: nem começa nem acaba comigo."
G["Do not be so easily taken, $n! It is a trick!"]="Não te deixe enganar tão facilmente, $n! É um truco!"
G["Do not be so harsh on the child, Alturus.  Remember that Cedric himself assigned him to you."]="Do not be so harsh on the child, Alturus.  Remember that Cedric himself assigned him to you."
G["Do not be too hasty, Li Li. This is how I traveled Kalimdor: one stop at a time."]="Não tenha pressa, Li Li. Assim é como atravesé Kalimdor: passo a passo."
G["Do not beat the Coilsssskaarrr commander anymore, orc! I will tell you! The cipherrr... It is hidden in one of the chests at Coilssskarrr Point... The naga there hold the keysss..."]="Do not beat the Coilsssskaarrr commander anymore, orc! I will tell you! The cipherrr... It is hidden in one of the chests at Coilssskarrr Point... The naga there hold the keysss..."
G["Do not bother me, pest. I am studying the inept fighting of these so-called combatants.\n\nI will best them all, and then I will be elevated to serve the Lich King."]="Do not bother me, pest. I am studying the inept fighting of these so-called combatants.\n\nI will best them all, and then I will be elevated to serve the Lich King."
G["Do not bow to Mog'dorg's puppet!  He would replace our gronn overlords with a liege of lesser stock.  Why should we replace one master with another?"]="Do not bow to Mog'dorg's puppet!  He would replace our gronn overlords with a liege of lesser stock.  Why should we replace one master with another?"
G["Do not bring it any closer, mortal. I can sense the evil coursing through the seal from where I stand.\n\nGive me a moment to inspect the item - hold it firmly."]="Não te acerques mais, mortal. Posso sentir o mal no selo desde onde estou.\n\nDê-me um momento para identificar o item... sujétalo com força."
G["Do not burden A'dal with mundane questions, $r.  This being's will is all that keeps our enemies from crushing this city."]="Do not burden A'dal with mundane questions, $r.  This being's will is all that keeps our enemies from crushing this city."
G["Do not consume the entire corpse just yet, children! Save room for dessert!"]="Do not consume the entire corpse just yet, children! Save room for dessert!"
G["Do not continue! Turn back while there's still time!"]="Do not continue! Turn back while there's still time!"
G["Do not cross a Klaxxi."]="Não desafíes aos Klaxxi."
G["Do not dare..."]="Ni se te ocurra..."
G["Do not despair the damage that was done here."]="Não se desespere com o dano que foi feito aqui."
G["Do not despair! All is not lost! Not yet!"]="Do not despair! All is not lost! Not yet!"
G["Do not despair! Turn away from the false Light, and instead embrace the hope and truth I offer you!"]="Do not despair! Turn away from the false Light, and instead embrace the hope and truth I offer you!"
G["Do not despair, young prince. You are not your father."]="Não desesperes, jovem Príncipe. Não é como seu pai."
G["Do not die on me, vindicator!"]="Não me falhes, vindicante!"
G["Do not disturb the investigation protocol."]="Não interrumpas o protocolo de investigação."
G["Do not disturb the serenity of the city. Peace must be upheld."]="Não perturbes a serenidade da cidade. Se você deve defenda a paz."
G["Do not do anything that would incite the Horde, $n. The Warchief has agreed to see us on good faith."]="Não faça nada que possa provocar à Horda, $n. O Chefe de Guerra confia em nossa boa fé."
G["Do not do this, Gul'dan! The elements will never forgive us!"]="Do not do this, Gul'dan! The elements will never forgive us!"
G["Do not doubt my comrades and I, spirit. Tell us how to conjure the fire lord. My allies will destroy him."]="Do not doubt my comrades and I, spirit. Tell us how to conjure the fire lord. My allies will destroy him."
G["Do not dwell on lost friends and companions for too long.  Perhaps it is best to feel honored that you had the privilege of sharing an experience with them."]="Do not dwell on lost friends and companions for too long.  Perhaps it is best to feel honored that you had the privilege of sharing an experience with them."
G["Do not eat clean meat. The Skumblade are just as strong on the inside as they are on the outside."]="Não comas carne limpa. Os Hojaescoria são tão fortes no interior como no exterior."
G["Do not even ask."]="Do not even ask."
G["Do not even think of fleeing, Broken wretches!  I promise you a fate worse than death if you don't slay these intruders!"]="Do not even think of fleeing, Broken wretches!  I promise you a fate worse than death if you don't slay these intruders!"
G["Do not even think of letting up, $n!"]="Nem se te ocurra ceder um milímetro, $n!"
G["Do not expect mercy, tamer. I will show none."]="Não espere piedade, $gdomador:domadora;. Eu não terei nenhuma."
G["Do not expect to defeat me."]="Não espere me derrotar."
G["Do not expect your sacrilege... to go unpunished."]="Do not expect your sacrilege... to go unpunished."
G["Do not expose your weaknesses."]="Do not expose your weaknesses."
G["Do not fail me, San'layn.  Return to Icecrown with this fool's head or do not bother to return."]="Não me falhes, San'layn. E não te molestes em voltar a Coroa de Gelo se não traz a cabeça desse estúpido."
G["Do not fail us!"]="Não nos falhes!"
G["Do not falter! We will soon unite with our ancient mogu allies!"]="Do not falter! We will soon unite with our ancient mogu allies!"
G["Do not falter, for Hellscream's eyes are upon you all!"]="Do not falter, for Hellscream's eyes are upon you all!"
G["Do not fear defeat. It is a catalyst for later triumph."]="Não tema a derrota. É um catalisador do triunfo do futuro."
G["Do not fear the heights, as I did when I was young. Fear can drive us to terrible deeds. Ah, but I see that like me, you have learned the lessons of courage!"]="Não tema as alturas, como eu fazia quando era jovem. O medo nos leva a coisas terríveis. Ah, mas vejo que, como eu, você aprendeu as lições da coragem!"
G["Do not fear, Tai-Feng. Yu'lon is strong. She will break free of the sha's corruption, I know it."]="Não temas, Tai-Feng. Yu'lon é forte. Sei que se liberará da corrupção do sha."
G["Do not fear, little ones. Come shadow or light, the waters will always flow."]="Do not fear, little ones. Come shadow or light, the waters will always flow."
G["Do not fear."]="Não temas."
G["Do not fight me, fiend! The time of your atonement is now!"]="Não luches contra mim, demônio! Este é o momentos do seu expiação!"
G["Do not fight the enemy unprepared, $n.  I can provide you with very powerful items... provided you have proven yourself to us."]="Do not fight the enemy unprepared, $n.  I can provide you with very powerful items... provided you have proven yourself to us."
G["Do not force me to call upon the lightning!"]="Não me obligues a convocar o relâmpago!"
G["Do not force my hand, children! I shall use your hides to line my boots."]="Do not force my hand, children! I shall use your hides to line my boots."
G["Do not forget the sacrifices made on this day, night elf. We have all suffered immensely at the hands of these beasts."]="Do not forget the sacrifices made on this day, night elf. We have all suffered immensely at the hands of these beasts."
G["Do not forget to speak to Fei Li before you depart. You will find her skills useful against our enemies."]="Não esqueça falar com Fei Li antes de partir. Verá que suas habilidades são úteis contra nossos inimigos."
G["Do not forget your task here! Continue the rituals while the meddlesome heroes of the world turn a blind eye to this desolate wasteland."]="Do not forget your task here! Continue the rituals while the meddlesome heroes of the world turn a blind eye to this desolate wasteland."
G["Do not forget, $c, battles still rage in Azeroth. Will you return to help the Horde in Alterac Valley?"]="Não o esqueça, $c, a guerra continua em Azeroth. Que voltar a ajudar à Horda no Vale Alterac?"
G["Do not forget..."]="Não o esqueça..."
G["Do not fret. You are one of many I've defeated."]="Não se aborreça. Você é apenas mais um dos muitos que eu derrotei."
G["Do not get too close. I laid a hand upon it once... Only once and never again. The memories of that day still linger."]="Do not get too close. I laid a hand upon it once... Only once and never again. The memories of that day still linger."
G["Do not get... too comfortable."]="Do not get... too comfortable."
G["Do not give an inch of ground!"]="Do not give an inch of ground!"
G["Do not give in to the curse!  You were men and women of Gilneas once... you can be men and women of Gilneas again!"]="Do not give in to the curse!  You were men and women of Gilneas once... you can be men and women of Gilneas again!"
G["Do not give up hope, friends!"]="Do not give up hope, friends!"
G["Do not give up on yourself!"]="Não te rindas!"
G["Do not give up!"]="Não desistam!"
G["Do not give up!  Shed your blood for Darrowshire!"]="Do not give up!  Shed your blood for Darrowshire!"
G["Do not give up, $n!"]="Não te rindas, $n!"
G["Do not harbor false hope! You cannot win!"]="Do not harbor false hope! You cannot win!"
G["Do not hesitate."]="Não dudes."
G["Do not hold back! Destroy them!"]="Do not hold back! Destroy them!"
G["Do not incite violence on my temple grounds, $p. Be patient."]="Não incites à violência na minha templo, $p. Tenha paciência."
G["Do not interrupt Niby, fool! I shall rend the flesh from your bones and use your skeletal remains as a coat rack. Now where was I? Oh yes, so, Kroshius lasted nearly ten times longer than any ordinary infernal. I am not sure why but I am confident that with enough study, I could find out.\n\nI need you to recover Kroshius' Infernal Core."]="Do not interrupt Niby, fool! I shall rend the flesh from your bones and use your skeletal remains as a coat rack. Now where was I? Oh yes, so, Kroshius lasted nearly ten times longer than any ordinary infernal. I am not sure why but I am confident that with enough study, I could find out.\n\nI need you to recover Kroshius' Infernal Core."
G["Do not lament. Continue your training, and you shall achieve greatness."]="Não lamente. Continue seu treinamento e você alcançará a grandeza."
G["Do not let it consider its next spell so freely, disciple... freeze its mind."]="Não deixe que piense no seu próximo feitiço livremente, discípulo... congela seu mente."
G["Do not let it pass!"]="Não deixem que passe!"
G["Do not let others fool you. Dragons are weapons of war; nothing more."]="Não te deixe enganar. Os dragões são armas de guerra, nada mais."
G["Do not let prejudice or ancient grudges interfere with our mission here, Kaldorei. There will be plenty of time for squabbling and distrustful looks when we are done here."]="Do not let prejudice or ancient grudges interfere with our mission here, Kaldorei. There will be plenty of time for squabbling and distrustful looks when we are done here."
G["Do not let the crab stand still. Its shell has hardened with age, but its joints are weak."]="Do not let the crab stand still. Its shell has hardened with age, but its joints are weak."
G["Do not let the fear consume you!"]="Não deixe que o medo te embargue!"
G["Do not let the ice in your blood slow your step. Prove your prowess, disciple."]="Do not let the ice in your blood slow your step. Prove your prowess, disciple."
G["Do not let the stone intimidate you. It is stone, you are $r."]="Não deixe que a pedras te intimide. É pedras, e você é $r."
G["Do not let them pass, minions!"]="Não deixem que pasen, lacaios!"
G["Do not let them wear you down! Focus!"]="Não deixe que te agoten! Céntrate!"
G["Do not let your eyes deceive you."]="Não deixe que os olhos te enganhen."
G["Do not let your judgement be clouded in trying times!"]="Não deixem que as dificuldades os nublen o juízo!"
G["Do not listen to Mog'dorg's lies!  Ogri'la is a myth!  We make our own heaven here with the blood of any that would divide and subjugate us!"]="Do not listen to Mog'dorg's lies!  Ogri'la is a myth!  We make our own heaven here with the blood of any that would divide and subjugate us!"
G["Do not listen to the creature's lies. Get back to your work!"]="Não escuches as mentiras da criatura. Volta ao trabalho!"
G["Do not loiter."]="Do not loiter."
G["Do not loiter; we've work to do here."]="Não demore; nós trabalhamos para fazer aqui."
G["Do not look at me, $r. I have disgraced the Horde. I am done."]="Do not look at me, $r. I have disgraced the Horde. I am done."
G["Do not lose faith."]="Não perda a fé."
G["Do not lose hope, Darrowshire!  We will not fall!"]="Do not lose hope, Darrowshire!  We will not fall!"
G["Do not lose hope, my $gson:daughter;.  With faith, we will march  through this darkness and once again see the dawn."]="Do not lose hope, my $gson:daughter;.  With faith, we will march  through this darkness and once again see the dawn."
G["Do not lose hope, my $gson:daughter;.  With faith, we will march through this darkness and once again see the dawn."]="Do not lose hope, my $gson:daughter;.  With faith, we will march through this darkness and once again see the dawn."
G["Do not lower your guard, $n!"]="Não bagens a guarda, $n!"
G["Do not make me come there and destroy you!"]="Do not make me come there and destroy you!"
G["Do not make me laugh.  Is this the mighty Aldor army that's come to defeat me?"]="Do not make me laugh.  Is this the mighty Aldor army that's come to defeat me?"
G["Do not miss any opportunity to heal the Black Prince."]="Saudável ao Príncipe Negro sempre que possa."
G["Do not mistake me for your friend. Over time, my people have learned that trust is too easily broken."]="Do not mistake me for your friend. Over time, my people have learned that trust is too easily broken."
G["Do not mistake the power that darkness offers for true strength!"]="Do not mistake the power that darkness offers for true strength!"
G["Do not mourn Orkus. He died with honor... with pride. He died a hero of the Horde."]="Não chore por Orkus. Morreu com honra... com orgulho. Morreu sendo um herói da Horda."
G["Do not presume to speak to me as though you are my equal, $c. Sylvanas is my queen, and I will do as she bids.\n\nIf you do not show the proper respect, I assure you, we can find a more than suitable place for you in the Nether.\n\nBut there is no reason we cannot have words if you wish to aid the Dark Lady..."]="Do not presume to speak to me as though you are my equal, $c. Sylvanas is my queen, and I will do as she bids.\n\nIf you do not show the proper respect, I assure you, we can find a more than suitable place for you in the Nether.\n\nBut there is no reason we cannot have words if you wish to aid the Dark Lady..."
G["Do not proceed. You will be eliminated."]="Do not proceed. You will be eliminated."
G["Do not push it citizen!"]="Não o aprietes, cidadão!"
G["Do not push me, or I will impale you on my horns!"]="Do not push me, or I will impale you on my horns!"
G["Do not question my loyalty, Warchief. We came across an ocean to fight for you."]="Do not question my loyalty, Warchief. We came across an ocean to fight for you."
G["Do not question what the Holy Light has put before you. Only those that sacrifice all will be delivered into its presence."]="Do not question what the Holy Light has put before you. Only those that sacrifice all will be delivered into its presence."
G["Do not relent! He is weakening!"]="Do not relent! He is weakening!"
G["Do not rest until those wards are functional. We must not be disturbed."]="Do not rest until those wards are functional. We must not be disturbed."
G["Do not return, draenei scum.  Next time we won't spare your life, unarmed or not!"]="Do not return, draenei scum.  Next time we won't spare your life, unarmed or not!"
G["Do not run, it only delays the inevitable."]="Do not run, it only delays the inevitable."
G["Do not shirk, friend. Keep us well supplied and our work will be completed sooner."]="Não flaquees, $gamigo: amiga;. Mantenha nosso nível de suprimentos e terminaremos o trabalho antes."
G["Do not speak to me of consequences, old one."]="Não me fale de consecuências, velho."
G["Do not stop!  I promise you a thousand deaths if you even think about putting down that pick!"]="Não pare! Te prometo um milhar de mortes se vuelves a pensar em deixar esse pico!"
G["Do not stop!  The hour of our glory draws near!"]="Do not stop!  The hour of our glory draws near!"
G["Do not stray too close to the chilled ground or you will find moving significantly more strenuous."]="Não te acerques demais no chão gelado ou verá que seus movimentos se voltam significativamente mais difíceis."
G["Do not stray too far down the pass, $n. Stay with the captain and his men... you're no use to us dead."]="Do not stray too far down the pass, $n. Stay with the captain and his men... you're no use to us dead."
G["Do not summon me again unless you have a real question to ask, ok?"]="Não vuelvas a me invocar a não ser que tenha uma pergunta real, de acordo?"
G["Do not taint these ruins, mortal. <You are engulfed in a blinding flash of light. A creature composed entirely of flame is the only thing you can remember seeing.>"]="Do not taint these ruins, mortal. <You are engulfed in a blinding flash of light. A creature composed entirely of flame is the only thing you can remember seeing.>"
G["Do not take offense, $r.\n\nI simply haven't the time for distractions."]="Não te ofendas, $r.\n\nSimplesmente não tenho tempo para distracções."
G["Do not take the practice of spirit-binding lightly. If the mogu are creating simulacra, you can be certain they're preparing for war."]="Não te tomes a prática de vinculação de espíritos à leve. Se os mogu estão realizando provas, tenha por certo que se estão preparando para a guerra."
G["Do not tarry here, wench!\n\nThere's fighting to be done!"]="Do not tarry here, wench!\n\nThere's fighting to be done!"
G["Do not tell me what it is like to be a $c. Show me."]="Do not tell me what it is like to be a $c. Show me."
G["Do not test me, scurvy dog!  I'm trained in the way of the Blood Knights!"]="Não me comece a prova, cão de água doce! Conheço as artes dos Cavaleiros de sangue!"
G["Do not think for a second that your past accomplishments entitle you to anything, $n.  They don't.\n\nIf you want my respect you're going to have to earn it.  This means following my orders without question and fulfilling them... without exceptions."]="Do not think for a second that your past accomplishments entitle you to anything, $n.  They don't.\n\nIf you want my respect you're going to have to earn it.  This means following my orders without question and fulfilling them... without exceptions."
G["Do not think it is luck that brought you here.  Luck had nothing to do with it.  Our MASTERS' WILL brought us here!"]="Do not think it is luck that brought you here.  Luck had nothing to do with it.  Our MASTERS' WILL brought us here!"
G["Do not think that I shall permit you entry into my master's sanctum so easily. Pursue me if you dare."]="Do not think that I shall permit you entry into my master's sanctum so easily. Pursue me if you dare."
G["Do not think you can win!"]="Não pienses que pode ganhar!"
G["Do not touch the displays."]="Não toques a exposição."
G["Do not trifle with me, $r."]="Do not trifle with me, $r."
G["Do not trouble yourself, little tauren. Neither Stormhoof, nor you and your ally will stand in my way."]="Do not trouble yourself, little tauren. Neither Stormhoof, nor you and your ally will stand in my way."
G["Do not try to force your will upon the leather. Rather, let its natural tendencies dictate what form and function it will take. This is not a battle to be won. Work with the leather, not against it."]="Não tente forçar sua vontade sobre o couro. Em vez disso, deixe suas tendências naturais ditarem que forma e função ela assumirá. Esta não é uma batalha a ser vencida. Trabalhe com o couro, não contra ele."
G["Do not turn your back on the Light, $c, it may be the one thing that saves you some day."]="Não des a costas à Luz, $c, pode ser o único que te salve algum dia."
G["Do not underestimate me."]="Não me subestime."
G["Do not wait long, Kilag. We will scout ahead."]="Do not wait long, Kilag. We will scout ahead."
G["Do not waste my time, $c."]="Não me faça perder o tempo, $c."
G["Do not waste my time.  What is it you want?"]="Não desperdice meu tempo. O que é que você quer?"
G["Do not waver. Soon we shall sit within the hallowed presence of the Light."]="Não desfalhezcas. Pronto nos sentaremos ante a sagrado presença da Luz."
G["Do not worry about Orkus, $n. I... I will be fine."]="Não te preocupe por Orkus, $n. Eu... estarei bem."
G["Do not worry about my fate, Bronzen. If the signal is not transmitted in time, re-origination will proceed regardless. Save... your world..."]="Do not worry about my fate, Bronzen. If the signal is not transmitted in time, re-origination will proceed regardless. Save... your world..."
G["Do not worry, $p, I will heal you!"]="Do not worry, $p, I will heal you!"
G["Do not worry, Arthas.  Soon you will not need your heart."]="Do not worry, Arthas.  Soon you will not need your heart."
G["Do not worry, I will go easy on you."]="Do not worry, I will go easy on you."
G["Do not worry, Leryssa.  I will come back to you when I am done.  Nothing in the world will stop me from coming home to the only family that I have left."]="Não te preocupe, Leryssa. Quando acabe, voltarei ao lado você. Nada no mundo poderá impedir que regrese a casa ao lado à única família que me restante."
G["Do not worry, young one. I knew that our arrangement was... temporary. I will be fine.\n\nYou though, you do not belong here. It is not yet your time. I shall aid your journey back to the realm of the living.\n\nThis one is on me."]="Do not worry, young one. I knew that our arrangement was... temporary. I will be fine.\n\nYou though, you do not belong here. It is not yet your time. I shall aid your journey back to the realm of the living.\n\nThis one is on me."
G["Do not worry.  Like I said, our men are almost done unearthing the Slithering One.  They will make for a suitable -- and even voluntary -- sacrifice.  Soggoth will rise!"]="Do not worry.  Like I said, our men are almost done unearthing the Slithering One.  They will make for a suitable -- and even voluntary -- sacrifice.  Soggoth will rise!"
G["Do not worry. I will keep the Crimson Lasher safe with me. Until we learn more about its behavior, I'm afraid it must stay here in the Firelands."]="Não se preocupe. Vou manter o Lasher Carmesim certo comigo. Até que aprendamos mais sobre o seu comportamento, temo que deva ficar aqui nas Terras do Fogo."
G["Do not!"]="Pois não!"
G["Do not... bring Terokk into our world, $n...  That would be... madness..."]="Não traigas... a Terokk a nosso mundo $n... Isso seria... uma loucura..."
G["Do not... despair."]="Não... desesperes."
G["Do not... grow... overconfident, mortal."]="Do not... grow... overconfident, mortal."
G["Do not... resist."]="Do not... resist."
G["Do nothing.  Betina said only one drop was needed."]="Não fazer nada. Betina disse que uma sozinha gota bastaría."
G["Do other decks exist?"]="Existem outros decks?"
G["Do rivers flow upstream?"]="Do rivers flow upstream?"
G["Do rocks float on water?"]="Do rocks float on water?"
G["Do something cool!"]="Do something cool!"
G["Do something, you useless $r. My allies are giving their lives for you!"]="Faça algo, $r inútil. Meus aliados estão dando seus vidas por você!"
G["Do something."]="Do something."
G["Do the instructions clarify how much mana these crystals will require? I do not want to get converted to a wretched by using this thing."]="Do the instructions clarify how much mana these crystals will require? I do not want to get converted to a wretched by using this thing."
G["Do these blades look sharp to you?  DO THEY, OVERSEER?"]="Do these blades look sharp to you?  DO THEY, OVERSEER?"
G["Do they never rest?!\n\nIf we're to secure a future for the people of the Lower City, we must deal with the Shadow Council before they cause an even greater cataclysm than the Bone Wastes!\n\nBecause the leadership of Shattrath City will not move quickly, we the free people of the Lower City have taken matters into our own hands.\n\nBut our spies have been discovered.  We will hold off the Shadow Council's agents while you slip into the labyrinth and see what you can uncover."]="Do they never rest?!\n\nIf we're to secure a future for the people of the Lower City, we must deal with the Shadow Council before they cause an even greater cataclysm than the Bone Wastes!\n\nBecause the leadership of Shattrath City will not move quickly, we the free people of the Lower City have taken matters into our own hands.\n\nBut our spies have been discovered.  We will hold off the Shadow Council's agents while you slip into the labyrinth and see what you can uncover."
G["Do they think a wall can stop us? Do they believe that stone can stand against those who ride upon the wind?"]="Do they think a wall can stop us? Do they believe that stone can stand against those who ride upon the wind?"
G["Do try and be more careful, $n."]="Tenta ter mais cuidado, $n."
G["Do watch your step in the garden of Ysera, mortal. Things are not always as they seem."]="Observe seu passo no jardim de Ysera, mortal. As coisas nem sempre são como parecem."
G["Do we even have ammunition for these?"]="Acaso temos munição para eles?"
G["Do we have Mining trainers here?  Where do ye think ye are!?  \nWhy you'll find one o' the best miners in all Dun Morogh at Deepmountain Mining and Jewelcrafting on the northern side of The Great Forge.  There, Geofram Bouldertoe will show ye the true art of mining."]="Do we have Mining trainers here?  Where do ye think ye are!?  \nWhy you'll find one o' the best miners in all Dun Morogh at Deepmountain Mining and Jewelcrafting on the northern side of The Great Forge.  There, Geofram Bouldertoe will show ye the true art of mining."
G["Do we have much further to go?"]="Temos que ir muito mais longe?"
G["Do what must be done."]="Faça o que seja necessário."
G["Do what you must to quell the restless spirits, Ragefist."]="Do what you must to quell the restless spirits, Ragefist."
G["Do what you will, $p. I'm going after Erunak!"]="Do what you will, $p. I'm going after Erunak!"
G["Do what you will. My new masters will carve my name into your flesh before they execute you."]="Faça o que quiser. Meus novos mestres gravarão meu nome na sua carne antes que eles o executem."
G["Do wolves howl?"]="Acaso não aúlhan os lobos?"
G["Do ya want it, monkey? Do ya??"]="O que, mono? O que?"
G["Do ya want me to call a medic? Maybe a priest? It's been over an hour, mate!"]="Que chamar a um médico? Talvez a um sacerdote? Já tem passado mais de uma hora!"
G["Do ye have some new treasures that ye want to keep safe n' sound?  Then ye'll be wanting to store them at The Vault with the Stonemantles.  \nYe'll find The Vault just a hammer's throw northeast from the entrance to Ironforge."]="Do ye have some new treasures that ye want to keep safe n' sound?  Then ye'll be wanting to store them at The Vault with the Stonemantles.  \nYe'll find The Vault just a hammer's throw northeast from the entrance to Ironforge."
G["Do ye have some new treasures that ye want to keep safe n' sound?  Ye'll be wanting to store them at The Vault with the Stonemantles.  Ye'll find The Vault just a hammer's throw northeast from the entrance to Ironforge."]="Você tem algum novos tesouros O que deseja manter sãos e salvos? Você vai querer guardá-os no The Vault com os Stonemantles. Você encontrará o The Vault a poucos passos de nordeste da entrada de Ironforge."
G["Do ye have the potential to be a skilled hunter?  Well $gladdie : lassie;, only time will tell.  Just don't ye go shooting at apples atop peoples' heads till ye've spoken with Regnus o'er in the Hall of Arms."]="Do ye have the potential to be a skilled hunter?  Well $gladdie : lassie;, only time will tell.  Just don't ye go shooting at apples atop peoples' heads till ye've spoken with Regnus o'er in the Hall of Arms."
G["Do ye know how hard it was to find a set of weapons that matched me armor?"]="Sabe o difícil que me resultados encontrar armas que fossem a jogo com meu armadura?"
G["Do ye need some help finding something?"]="Precisa ajuda para encontrar algo?"
G["Do ye pester everyone this much? Sheesh."]="Do ye pester everyone this much? Sheesh."
G["Do ye want ta live forever?"]="Que viver eternamente?"
G["Do yer part in keepin' the Deeprun Tram clean!"]="Do yer part in keepin' the Deeprun Tram clean!"
G["Do you EVER cease prattling?"]="Do you EVER cease prattling?"
G["Do you HAVE to flail around like such an idiot?!"]="Do you HAVE to flail around like such an idiot?!"
G["Do you actually sell anything?"]="Você mesmo vende alguma coisa?"
G["Do you always talk so much when there's stuff to kill?"]="Você sempre fala tanto quando há coisas para matar?"
G["Do you ask this question to everything that's trapped in a ball?"]="Está perguntado isso a tudo o que há preso dentro de uma bola?"
G["Do you believe that?"]="Você acredita nisso?"
G["Do you bring news of battle, $r?"]="Traz notícia da batalha, $r?"
G["Do you bring word from the creator?"]="Traz uma mensagem do criador?"
G["Do you come to see Mama? Oh, sit for a while!\n\nLet me tell you, I hear some gossip the other day.\n\nI heard that Gina Mudclaw and her father, Haohan Mudclaw, don't get along!\n\nHe wanted to marry her to Farmer Fung up by the Belt, but she wouldn't have it! Wanted to run her market, she said.\n\nAi-ya! What has become of the young girls these days? Don't want to marry handsome young man and raise a family?\n\nEspecially that Fung... he's such a catch! So good-looking, and grows such big vegetables too.\n\nWhy I not have handsome young son like that?!"]="Do you come to see Mama? Oh, sit for a while!\n\nLet me tell you, I hear some gossip the other day.\n\nI heard that Gina Mudclaw and her father, Haohan Mudclaw, don't get along!\n\nHe wanted to marry her to Farmer Fung up by the Belt, but she wouldn't have it! Wanted to run her market, she said.\n\nAi-ya! What has become of the young girls these days? Don't want to marry handsome young man and raise a family?\n\nEspecially that Fung... he's such a catch! So good-looking, and grows such big vegetables too.\n\nWhy I not have handsome young son like that?!"
G["Do you deny it? The dark visions? The voices in your head?"]="Do you deny it? The dark visions? The voices in your head?"
G["Do you dream while you sleep or is it an escape from the horrors of reality?"]="Do you dream while you sleep or is it an escape from the horrors of reality?"
G["Do you each have the crystals?"]="Têm os cristais?"
G["Do you even know how to walk? Move those legs of yours you worthless golden scrap heap!"]="Acaso sabe andar? Move essas pernas, inútil monte de sucata dourado!"
G["Do you even know what you're doing?"]="Tem a mais mínimo ideia do que está fazendo?"
G["Do you even know what you're doing?!"]="Sabe bem o que está fazendo!?"
G["Do you even lift, bro?"]="Faz pesas?"
G["Do you ever think about anything other than fighting? I could circle you down on the stretch course!"]="Do you ever think about anything other than fighting? I could circle you down on the stretch course!"
G["Do you expect me to cower before the mighty legion of $n?\n\nYou are nothing to me. Less than nothing. Had I desired your head, it would have been presented to me on a pike.\n\nYou have made the mistake that all mortals make.\n\n<Lord Victor Nefarius sighs.>\n\nTime does strange things to those that use it as a form of currency."]="Do you expect me to cower before the mighty legion of $n?\n\nYou are nothing to me. Less than nothing. Had I desired your head, it would have been presented to me on a pike.\n\nYou have made the mistake that all mortals make.\n\n<Lord Victor Nefarius sighs.>\n\nTime does strange things to those that use it as a form of currency."
G["Do you fear death?"]="Do you fear death?"
G["Do you feel it, $n? The darkness surrounds us."]="Do you feel it, $n? The darkness surrounds us."
G["Do you feel it, Mulv? The need? You have to want it before I can give you the command. Who am I kidding. Get out there!"]="Do you feel it, Mulv? The need? You have to want it before I can give you the command. Who am I kidding. Get out there!"
G["Do you feel it, mortal? Death seeps through me, enveloping all that I touch. With just a snap of my finger your soul will languish in damnation for all eternity."]="Do you feel it, mortal? Death seeps through me, enveloping all that I touch. With just a snap of my finger your soul will languish in damnation for all eternity."
G["Do you feel it? It's almost like Arthas is still here right in this room! But he's gone, right? This place still feels like evil..."]="Do you feel it? It's almost like Arthas is still here right in this room! But he's gone, right? This place still feels like evil..."
G["Do you feel something?"]="Você sente alguma coisa?"
G["Do you feel that chill running up your spine?"]="Do you feel that chill running up your spine?"
G["Do you feel that folks? The air is crackling with energy! That can only mean one thing..."]="Do you feel that folks? The air is crackling with energy! That can only mean one thing..."
G["Do you feel that...?"]="Do you feel that...?"
G["Do you feel that?"]="O sente?"
G["Do you find me imposing?  Be honest.  I'm going for imposing."]="Te parezco imponente? Diga a verdade. Apuesto por imponente."
G["Do you happen to have any fishing supplies?"]="Tem suprimentos de pesca, por um casual?"
G["Do you hate me, my love? That I was forced to destroy your living form, that your spirit be released from unhappy bondage."]="Do you hate me, my love? That I was forced to destroy your living form, that your spirit be released from unhappy bondage."
G["Do you hate me? Good."]="Do you hate me? Good."
G["Do you have a few moments to spare?"]="Você tem um momento pra mim?"
G["Do you have a report for Kor and Dezco?"]="Tem um relatório para Kor e Dezco?"
G["Do you have a spare Sweet Lakemelon?"]="Do you have a spare Sweet Lakemelon?"
G["Do you have a spell that can take me as far away from here as possible?"]="Do you have a spell that can take me as far away from here as possible?"
G["Do you have a story for me?"]="Você tem uma história para mim?"
G["Do you have any Black Cherries?"]="Tem picotas?"
G["Do you have any fizzy energy drinks?"]="Do you have any fizzy energy drinks?"
G["Do you have any gooseberries for sale?"]="Tem groselhas à venda?"
G["Do you have any hops you can spare?"]="Do you have any hops you can spare?"
G["Do you have any idea how much time and moolah you've saved us, $n? This could have been a complete disaster and you've single-handedly saved the entire cartel.\n\nToo bad that you and Thrall spared Gallywix. I think that you would make an excellent Trade $g Prince : Princess;!"]="Do you have any idea how much time and moolah you've saved us, $n? This could have been a complete disaster and you've single-handedly saved the entire cartel.\n\nToo bad that you and Thrall spared Gallywix. I think that you would make an excellent Trade $g Prince : Princess;!"
G["Do you have any idea how neat it is to hop that far?"]="Te imaginas o genial que é saltar a essa distância?"
G["Do you have any idea where you are going?"]="Tem ideia de aonde te diriges?"
G["Do you have any items I can test?"]="Você tem algum item que eu possa testar?"
G["Do you have any mithril casings?"]="Você tem entranhas de mithril?"
G["Do you have any news from afar, $n? Has the war against the yaungol finally been won?"]="Traz alguma notícia, $n? Finalmente temos ganhou a guerra contra os yaungol?"
G["Do you have any sons, $c?\n\nLet us tell you something, we think we were much happier before we came to Ogri'la and the crystals made us more aware.  Before, we would have just bashed them over the head to get them to shut up.  Now all they do is bother us about the Sha'tari Skyguard.\n\nIgnorance is bliss!"]="Do you have any sons, $c?\n\nLet us tell you something, we think we were much happier before we came to Ogri'la and the crystals made us more aware.  Before, we would have just bashed them over the head to get them to shut up.  Now all they do is bother us about the Sha'tari Skyguard.\n\nIgnorance is bliss!"
G["Do you have any spiders or beetles, $c?  They scurry fast, but if you're faster then you'll find them quite a treat!"]="Do you have any spiders or beetles, $c?  They scurry fast, but if you're faster then you'll find them quite a treat!"
G["Do you have any supplies?"]="Tem suprimentos?"
G["Do you have enraging incense?"]="Tem incenso enfurecedor?"
G["Do you have everything? Very good! Come with me."]="O tem tudo? Muito bem! Siga-me."
G["Do you have healing incense?"]="Tem incenso curandeiro?"
G["Do you have reservations?"]="Tem reserva?"
G["Do you have steel that needs shaping?"]="Você tem aço que precisa ser moldado?"
G["Do you have the eye of a tiger?"]="Tem a olhar do tigres?"
G["Do you have the required pumpkins?"]="Do you have the required pumpkins?"
G["Do you have the understanding to continue, shaman?  Do you know why you are here?"]="Você tem o entendimento de seguir, xamã? Você sabe por que você está aqui?"
G["Do you have the witchberries?"]="Tem as morujas?"
G["Do you have those evacuation papers?"]="Do you have those evacuation papers?"
G["Do you have to be so chippery?"]="Precisa armar tanto ruido?"
G["Do you have to stay here?"]="Do you have to stay here?"
G["Do you have what it takes to stay in my kitchen?"]="Você tem o que é preciso para ficar na minha cozinha?"
G["Do you hear it, $r? Place your ear to the ground. Can you hear the echoing drums of war? The earth trembles in anticipation, yet I have heard it coming all along. We must prepare ourselves, young one - for this shall be a war to end all wars. It will be an honor to serve with you on the battle field. I trust that you will stand ready."]="Do you hear it, $r? Place your ear to the ground. Can you hear the echoing drums of war? The earth trembles in anticipation, yet I have heard it coming all along. We must prepare ourselves, young one - for this shall be a war to end all wars. It will be an honor to serve with you on the battle field. I trust that you will stand ready."
G["Do you hear me, Arthas? The Argent Crusade comes for you! Your kingdom shall crumble beneath the weight of justice! By the Light!"]="Do you hear me, Arthas? The Argent Crusade comes for you! Your kingdom shall crumble beneath the weight of justice! By the Light!"
G["Do you hear something?"]="Oyes algo?"
G["Do you hear that brothers?"]="Oís isso, irmãos?"
G["Do you hear that?  What is that noise!"]="Você ouviu isso? Que barulho é esse!"
G["Do you honestly believe you can defeat me?"]="Do you honestly believe you can defeat me?"
G["Do you honestly think death can stop me? I am death itself!"]="Você realmente acha que a morte pode me deter? Eu sou a própria morte!"
G["Do you know any good jokes, $r?"]="Te sabe algum chiste, $r?"
G["Do you know anything about azsharite?"]="Sabe algo sobre a azsharita?"
G["Do you know anything about this, beast? Who is the admiral? Speak!"]="Sabe algo sobre isto, fera? Quem é o almirante? Fala!"
G["Do you know how many supplies it takes to support an army, $n? We need weapons, food, shelter, bandages...and that's just to start.\n\nThe supplies will not stock themselves. Ask Matoclaw if you're looking for ways to help. She will put you to use."]="Do you know how many supplies it takes to support an army, $n? We need weapons, food, shelter, bandages...and that's just to start.\n\nThe supplies will not stock themselves. Ask Matoclaw if you're looking for ways to help. She will put you to use."
G["Do you know how to pick up a female jinyu in a tavern? Just drop your line!"]="Do you know how to pick up a female jinyu in a tavern? Just drop your line!"
G["Do you know how to say 'Crackling Jade Lightning' in Taur-ahe? How about Thalassian? Nazja?"]="Do you know how to say 'Crackling Jade Lightning' in Taur-ahe? How about Thalassian? Nazja?"
G["Do you know my dad?"]="Você conhece meu pai?"
G["Do you know of the Gryphon Roost off the Trade District, where the Flight Master may be found?\n\nA pair of Wildhammer dwarves raises and sells gryphons there, and can even train you to ride the beasts."]="Do you know of the Gryphon Roost off the Trade District, where the Flight Master may be found?\n\nA pair of Wildhammer dwarves raises and sells gryphons there, and can even train you to ride the beasts."
G["Do you know of the Highborne? The Shen'dralar?"]="Você conhece os Highborne? O Shen'dralar?"
G["Do you know someone... or something, rather, by the name of Eranikus?"]="Você conhece alguém... ou algo pelo nome de Eranikus?"
G["Do you know that you are very strong?"]="Sabe que é muito forte?"
G["Do you know the history of the Serpent Riders? It is quite an interesting study."]="Conhece a história dos cavaleiros de dragões? É bastante interessante."
G["Do you know what I like, $n?"]="Sabe que me gosta, $n?"
G["Do you know what I see? A precursor to invasion.\n\nAye, the master was wise in sealing the portals but has since lost his... how shall I put this? The master has lost his focus. Yes... Focus.\n\nWith this loss, the Legion has seized opportunity. They seep out now, growing in number day by day."]="Do you know what I see? A precursor to invasion.\n\nAye, the master was wise in sealing the portals but has since lost his... how shall I put this? The master has lost his focus. Yes... Focus.\n\nWith this loss, the Legion has seized opportunity. They seep out now, growing in number day by day."
G["Do you know what happens if you slack off in all of your monastery classes? You become a groundskeeper, that's what happens.\n\nIt's not all bad though. I get my own broom.\n\n<Wu sighs.>"]="Do you know what happens if you slack off in all of your monastery classes? You become a groundskeeper, that's what happens.\n\nIt's not all bad though. I get my own broom.\n\n<Wu sighs.>"
G["Do you know what that thing is?"]="Sabe que é essa coisa?"
G["Do you know what you're playing with, $n?  Here, allow me to educate you and your friends."]="Do you know what you're playing with, $n?  Here, allow me to educate you and your friends."
G["Do you know where I may find the Half Pendant of Aquatic Agility?"]="Do you know where I may find the Half Pendant of Aquatic Agility?"
G["Do you know where I may find the Half Pendant of Aquatic Endurance?"]="Você sabe onde posso encontrar o Meio Pingente de Resistência Aquática?"
G["Do you know where you are?  This is Honor Hold, sweetheart!  Love it or get out!"]="Você sabe onde está? Aqui é Honra Hold, querida! Ame ou saia!"
G["Do you know who I am, zealot?"]="Sabe quem sou, zelote?"
G["Do you know who I am? Do you know who I am?!"]="Sabe quem sou eu? Sabe quem sou eu?!"
G["Do you know who I am?! I'm a very important person! You're supposed to be protecting me from the Scourge, not dilly-dallying with pointless conversation!\n\nI'm no fighter, but you are. So get out there!"]="Do you know who I am?! I'm a very important person! You're supposed to be protecting me from the Scourge, not dilly-dallying with pointless conversation!\n\nI'm no fighter, but you are. So get out there!"
G["Do you know who we are, stranger? We are Mag'har - brown orcs, as I have heard your kind call us. The Mag'har are survivors: Survivors of a fallen dynasty; Survivors of the Red Pox; Survivors of a shattered world...\n\nI am Jorin, son of Kilrogg; last of the lineage of Deadeye: Warchief of the Bleeding Hollow Clan."]="Do you know who we are, stranger? We are Mag'har - brown orcs, as I have heard your kind call us. The Mag'har are survivors: Survivors of a fallen dynasty; Survivors of the Red Pox; Survivors of a shattered world...\n\nI am Jorin, son of Kilrogg; last of the lineage of Deadeye: Warchief of the Bleeding Hollow Clan."
G["Do you know why the pandaren love philosophy? Because for them, things are not just black and white."]="Do you know why the pandaren love philosophy? Because for them, things are not just black and white."
G["Do you like fish, $r? I have fish here. If you like fresh fish, the freshest, come and sample my wares."]="Do you like fish, $r? I have fish here. If you like fresh fish, the freshest, come and sample my wares."
G["Do you like gifts?"]="Te gostam os regalos?"
G["Do you like kitties? I love them!\n\n<Ella looks surprised at her sudden outburst and smiles shyly.>"]="Do you like kitties? I love them!\n\n<Ella looks surprised at her sudden outburst and smiles shyly.>"
G["Do you like my outfit today?"]="Te gosta meu vestido?"
G["Do you like my outfit?  It's for the party. I charged it to your account."]="Você gosta da minha roupa? É para a festa. Carreguei na sua conta."
G["Do you like my snakes? I get the feeling they don't like you!"]="Você gosta das minhas cobras? Acho que elas não gostam de você!"
G["Do you like the new home that I've carved out for my so-called worshippers?\n\nIn the throes of my death, I cursed them all and dragged them along with me into this special underworld of my own creation.\n\nI think that I shall delight in their eternal torment, but what I really want is to exact revenge upon my former prophet!"]="Do you like the new home that I've carved out for my so-called worshippers?\n\nIn the throes of my death, I cursed them all and dragged them along with me into this special underworld of my own creation.\n\nI think that I shall delight in their eternal torment, but what I really want is to exact revenge upon my former prophet!"
G["Do you like this color on me?"]="Te gosta como me ocorrida este cor?"
G["Do you like to cook? Well you're in luck, because I like to help aspiring chefs."]="Do you like to cook? Well you're in luck, because I like to help aspiring chefs."
G["Do you like what we've done here?  Perhaps we will drop these crystals from the sky all over Outland."]="Do you like what we've done here?  Perhaps we will drop these crystals from the sky all over Outland."
G["Do you like your tree? I picked the sapling myself."]="Do you like your tree? I picked the sapling myself."
G["Do you like... turnips?\n\n<Ella turns pink and shakes her head.>"]="Do you like... turnips?\n\n<Ella turns pink and shakes her head.>"
G["Do you mean the Silvermoon City Inn, or the Wayfarer's Rest tavern?"]="Você quer dizer o Silvermoon City Inn ou a taberna Wayfarer's Rest?"
G["Do you mind?"]="Te importa?"
G["Do you mind? We're trying to get a picture, here."]="Te importa? Estamos tentando fazer uma foto."
G["Do you mock me while I am unable to defend myself, bound to this ball of iron?"]="Você zomba de mim enquanto eu sou incapaz de me defender, amarrado a esta bola de ferro?"
G["Do you need assistance?"]="Precisa ajuda?"
G["Do you need something, $c?  Perhaps I can assist you."]="Precisa algo, $c? Talvez possa ajudar você."
G["Do you need something?"]="Precisa algo?"
G["Do you need something? I'm a little... busy.\n\n<Koro tightens his grip on the wriggling saurok's neck.>"]="Do you need something? I'm a little... busy.\n\n<Koro tightens his grip on the wriggling saurok's neck.>"
G["Do you need to return to Vashj'ir?"]="Você precisa voltar para Vashj'ir?"
G["Do you need to stable your pet?"]="Precisa alojar seu ajudante?"
G["Do you normally walk these roads alone?"]="Do you normally walk these roads alone?"
G["Do you not feel the master's gaze?! It watches us all!"]="Não sente a olhar do mestre?! Nos observa a todos!"
G["Do you not have eyes? Did you not see the demons on our very doorstep? I do not have the soldiers to spare!"]="Acaso não tem olhos? Não tem visto aos demônios em nosso mesmo umbral? Não posso prescindir de nenhum soldado!"
G["Do you not see how magic has made our city great?"]="Não vê como a magia fez de nossa cidade uma maravilha?"
G["Do you not see the light of Kros? He has been defiled!"]="Do you not see the light of Kros? He has been defiled!"
G["Do you often squeeze gnomes?"]="Estrujas gnomos a belo?"
G["Do you plan on leaving the area soon if we have further questions?"]="Tem planeado não estar perto por se temos mais perguntas?"
G["Do you possess the courage to face Malygos' elite drakes in their own realm, $r?"]="Do you possess the courage to face Malygos' elite drakes in their own realm, $r?"
G["Do you prefer guns or bows?"]="Você prefere armas ou arcos?"
G["Do you realize what you've done?"]="Os dais conta do que vocês têm feito?"
G["Do you really need to ask? Can you not feel him? Has the almighty King Rastakhan sent his Servitor and Hand here on a mission of diplomacy?"]="Do you really need to ask? Can you not feel him? Has the almighty King Rastakhan sent his Servitor and Hand here on a mission of diplomacy?"
G["Do you really think we are going to make it out of here alive?"]="De verdade acha que vamos sair de aqui com vida?"
G["Do you really want to bribe Olga?"]="Do you really want to bribe Olga?"
G["Do you really want to unlearn your Gnomish Engineering specialization and lose all associated recipes?"]="Do you really want to unlearn your Gnomish Engineering specialization and lose all associated recipes?"
G["Do you really want to unlearn your Goblin Engineering specialization and lose all associated recipes?"]="Do you really want to unlearn your Goblin Engineering specialization and lose all associated recipes?"
G["Do you really want to unlearn your blacksmithing specialty and lose all associated recipes?"]="Do you really want to unlearn your blacksmithing specialty and lose all associated recipes?"
G["Do you really want to unlearn your leatherworking specialty and lose all associated recipes?"]="Do you really want to unlearn your leatherworking specialty and lose all associated recipes?"
G["Do you recall our earlier conversation?"]="Você se lembra do que conversamos mais cedo?"
G["Do you require an illusion?\n\nShould your illusion falter in the midst of your quest, return to me and I shall reapply the guise.\n\nShould you fail in your endeavors, do not give up! Return to me. I shall assist you until you have completed your objectives."]="Precisa uma ilusão?\n\nSe seu ilusão vacilara em meio do seu missão, volta aqui e voltarei a aplicar a aparência.\n\nSe seus esforços falhas, não abandones! Volta aqui e te ajudarei até que completes seus alvos."
G["Do you require anything?"]="Precisa algo?"
G["Do you require guidance to your destination?"]="Precisa indicações para chegar ao seu destino?"
G["Do you see Lin down there? There are so many prisoners, but I cannot spot my husband."]="Vê a Lin aí baixo? Há muitos prisioneiros, mas não conquista ver a meu marido."
G["Do you see NOW the power of the Darkfallen?"]="Vê AGORao poder dos Caído Sombrio?"
G["Do you see it? Everyone in my Horde earns their keep. You and your friends will be no exception."]="O vê? Na minha Horda, todos nos vencermos o sustento. Seus amigos e você não serão uma excepção."
G["Do you see me now, Cho'gall? I'm coming for you! I'm going to rip off your head while the other watches!"]="Me vê agora, Cho'galh? Vou por você! Te vou arrancar a cabeça enquanto a outra olhe!"
G["Do you see our enemies?"]="Do you see our enemies?"
G["Do you see that big fish down there, $n?"]="Vê esse peixe grande aí, $n?"
G["Do you see the central tower? Lightning strikes it continuously. Aethas suspects that the storms originate from the heart of the palace itself."]="Do you see the central tower? Lightning strikes it continuously. Aethas suspects that the storms originate from the heart of the palace itself."
G["Do you see the central tower? Lightning strikes it continuously. We suspect the storms originate from the heart of the palace itself."]="Do you see the central tower? Lightning strikes it continuously. We suspect the storms originate from the heart of the palace itself."
G["Do you see the great statue in the distance?"]="Vê aquela grande estátua?"
G["Do you see the gyrochoppa on the far side of the beach, $n?!"]="Vê esse girocóptero no extremo da praia, $n?"
G["Do you see the hanging pennants above our heads? These flags mark the race course. If you ever get lost, you can use these flags as a guide."]="Do you see the hanging pennants above our heads? These flags mark the race course. If you ever get lost, you can use these flags as a guide."
G["Do you see the massive spired tower in eastern Dalaran? That is the majestic Violet Citadel."]="Você vê a torre maciça no leste de Dalaran? Essa é a majestosa Cidadela Violeta."
G["Do you see the size of this beast? It took nearly six of us to overpower him."]="Do you see the size of this beast? It took nearly six of us to overpower him."
G["Do you see this burning candle? You have until it burns out to tell us about the Pandaren artifacts! Now start talking!"]="Vê esta vela? Mais te vale contárnoslo tudo sobre os artefatos pandaren antes de que se consumo! Fala!"
G["Do you see what I did there?"]="Tem visto o que acabo de fazer?"
G["Do you see, champion? There is little my Horde cannot accomplish. What is this?"]="O vê? Há poucas coisas que meu Horda não possa conseguir. Que indica isto?"
G["Do you see? From their graves, trees grow. May these trees always stand for the sacrifice they made, and the honor you have done them."]="Do you see? From their graves, trees grow. May these trees always stand for the sacrifice they made, and the honor you have done them."
G["Do you see? Power without vision causes only random chaos and destruction."]="O vê? O poder sem visão somente provoca caos e destruição."
G["Do you seek enlightenment?"]="Ouvidos a iluminação?"
