G["Don't do this, Tarenar."]="Não o faça, Tarenar."
G["Don't drop off!"]="Não te caigas!"
G["Don't eat my head!"]="Não te comas minha cabeça!"
G["Don't even ask about the raptors. Just don't."]="Nem pergunte sobre os raptores. Apenas não."
G["Don't even try, $r.\n\nGet out of here while you can...\n\nThere are too many... certain death..."]="Nem o tente, $r.\n\nSal de aqui enquanto possa... \n\nSão demais... morte certa..."
G["Don't fall back. Don't give them an inch!"]="Don't fall back. Don't give them an inch!"
G["Don't fall!"]="Não te caigas!"
G["Don't feel... so good."]="Não me sinto... muito bem."
G["Don't fight in broken weapons and armor! Expert armor and weapon repairing done here - while you wait!"]="Don't fight in broken weapons and armor! Expert armor and weapon repairing done here - while you wait!"
G["Don't fight it."]="Não te esfuerces."
G["Don't fight it..."]="Não te resistas..."
G["Don't force me hand, orc. We can't let ye pass."]="Don't force me hand, orc. We can't let ye pass."
G["Don't forget that disguise!"]="Não te esqueça do disfarce!"
G["Don't forget the orphans of Stormwind!"]="Don't forget the orphans of Stormwind!"
G["Don't forget to buy refreshments and souvenirs!"]="Não se esqueça de comprar bebidas e lembranças!"
G["Don't forget to check near the bridges southeast of town for a ride up to our forward post."]="Don't forget to check near the bridges southeast of town for a ride up to our forward post."
G["Don't forget to command your pet to follow you! |TInterface\\Icons\\ABILITY_TRACKING.BLP:24|t"]="Não esqueça ordenarle seu ajudante que te continue! |TInterface\\Icons\\ABILITY_TRACKING.BLP:24|t"
G["Don't forget to get my bell out of the chest here. And remember, if do happen to wander off, just ring it and I'll find you again."]="Don't forget to get my bell out of the chest here. And remember, if do happen to wander off, just ring it and I'll find you again."
G["Don't forget to get some Flame in a Bottle from the box here.  You're going to need it to destroy their command tent."]="Don't forget to get some Flame in a Bottle from the box here.  You're going to need it to destroy their command tent."
G["Don't forget to get some of that extra pyrite if your friends can shoot it down."]="Don't forget to get some of that extra pyrite if your friends can shoot it down."
G["Don't forget to grab a war guardian, $n."]="Não te esqueça de pegar um guardião de guerra, $n."
G["Don't forget to keep your goggles on, $n. That's the only way we'll spot them before they can jump us."]="Don't forget to keep your goggles on, $n. That's the only way we'll spot them before they can jump us."
G["Don't forget to put on that disguise!"]="Não esqueça poderá o disfarce!"
G["Don't forget to replace your main weapon!"]="Don't forget to replace your main weapon!"
G["Don't forget to set your worldstate area!"]="Não esqueça estabelecer seu zona do estado do mundo!"
G["Don't forget to stock up on wrapping paper this holiday season!  Nothing says \"Wondrous Winter Veil\" like wrapped armors and weapons for your friends and family."]="Não se esqueça de estocar papel de embrulho nesta temporada de festas! Nada diz \"Wondrous Winter Veil\" como armaduras e armas embrulhadas para os seus amigos e familiares."
G["Don't forget to take a break between battles. A good $c knows when not to fight."]="Don't forget to take a break between battles. A good $c knows when not to fight."
G["Don't forget to take it all in while you're here.  The Peak of Serenity has a wonderful view of beautiful Kun-Lai summit."]="Não esqueça aproveitar do paisagem enquanto estiver aqui. O Pico da Serenidade tem umas vistas preciosas da Cima Kun-Lai."
G["Don't forget to take some time out to fish while you're in Zangarmarsh. You never know when you'll see water again."]="Não esqueça de tirar um tempo para pescar enquanto estiver em Zangarmarsh. Você nunca sabe quando verá a água novamente."
G["Don't forget to take some time to just enjoy the scenery!"]="Acuérdate de descansar um tempo para admirar o paisagem!"
G["Don't forget to talk to that jinyu, down there by the river."]="Não esqueça falar com esse jinyu, ao lado ao rio."
G["Don't forget to use your stealth!"]="Não esqueça usar seu signo!"
G["Don't forget your helmet, $n. Rookies..."]="Não te esqueça do elmo, $n. Estes novatos..."
G["Don't forget your totems!"]="Não esqueça seus totens!"
G["Don't forget, $n - you can now use the summoning stone to port yourself back to my location in Valormok!"]="Não o esqueça, $n, agora pode usar a rocha de evocação para teleportar de volta a meu posição em Valormok!"
G["Don't fret, we'll be outta here soon."]="Don't fret, we'll be outta here soon."
G["Don't get any ideas or I'll see that you join them!"]="Don't get any ideas or I'll see that you join them!"
G["Don't get burned..."]="Não te quemes..."
G["Don't get caught in Big Bessa's sights."]="Afaste-se do objetivo do Grande Bessa."
G["Don't get caught in the demolisher's sights."]="Afaste-se do objetivo do demoledor."
G["Don't get cold feet, now."]="Que não se te hiele o sangue."
G["Don't get me wrong, $n, I like Thrall. He was a strong leader, but I don't think he was cut out to lead the Horde. Not in a time of war!"]="Não me entiendas mal, $n, me gosta Thrall. Era um líder forte, mas não acho que estivesse feito para guiar à Horda. Não em tempo de guerra!"
G["Don't get me wrong, $n. I very much appreciate the resurrection, but I think this is the last time I'll perform this particular duty. Maybe a goblet or two of wine will help with this headache."]="Don't get me wrong, $n. I very much appreciate the resurrection, but I think this is the last time I'll perform this particular duty. Maybe a goblet or two of wine will help with this headache."
G["Don't get me wrong, I'd rather not be in a tunnel filled with silithid day in and day out, but if hiding here and watching these creatures' movements is going to help us win the war then I'll do it for as long as it takes."]="Não me entenda mal, eu prefiro não estar em um túnel cheio de silitídeos dia após dia, mas se me esconder aqui e assistir os movimentos dessas criaturas nos ajudar a vencer a guerra, farei isso por por quanto tempo for necessário."
G["Don't get me wrong... I'm grateful to have Shando Stormrage back, but this is all really suspicious. What happened to Fandral?"]="Don't get me wrong... I'm grateful to have Shando Stormrage back, but this is all really suspicious. What happened to Fandral?"
G["Don't get soft on me, Varian."]="Não me venha com essa conversa, Varian."
G["Don't get stepped on."]="Que não te pisen."
G["Don't get too close, $n. I'm liable to fumble and bash your brains open with the face of my hammer."]="Don't get too close, $n. I'm liable to fumble and bash your brains open with the face of my hammer."
G["Don't get too close, Maia! It's going to bite your head off!"]="Don't get too close, Maia! It's going to bite your head off!"
G["Don't get too comfortable here, pal.\n\nThe general says these digs is only temporary."]="Don't get too comfortable here, pal.\n\nThe general says these digs is only temporary."
G["Don't get too excited, hero, that was the easy part. The challenge lies ahead! Let's go."]="Não te emoções demais, herói, essa era a parte fácil. O desafio está por vir! Vamos."
G["Don't give 'em an inch, soldier! Harpoon 'em out of the sky!"]="Don't give 'em an inch, soldier! Harpoon 'em out of the sky!"
G["Don't give away our position, $n! That tower is crawling with bodyguards."]="Don't give away our position, $n! That tower is crawling with bodyguards."
G["Don't give me any armor. Just gimmie a blade and tell me who to kill."]="Não me dê nenhuma armadura. Apenas me dê uma lâmina e me diga quem matar."
G["Don't give up! Fight to the death!"]="Não te rindas! Luta até a morte!"
G["Don't give up! Fight! Fight for the Alliance!"]="Não te rindas! Luta! Luta pela Aliança!"
G["Don't give up! We are counting on you to push Deathwing back."]="Don't give up! We are counting on you to push Deathwing back."
G["Don't give up! We must prevail!"]="Don't give up! We must prevail!"
G["Don't give up, thunderbirds! Come back for me!"]="Don't give up, thunderbirds! Come back for me!"
G["Don't give... up!"]="Don't give... up!"
G["Don't go close to the lake! It's haunted!"]="Não te acerques demais ao lago! Está encantado!"
G["Don't go easy on me!"]="Não facilite pra mim!"
G["Don't go in there!"]="Não vá por aí!"
G["Don't go leavin' the job half done, now. Come an' tell me if it be safe to make my escape!"]="Não te vá deixando o trabalho a meio fazer. Venha e diga se será certo escapar agora."
G["Don't go leavin' the job half done. Come an' tell me if it be safe to make my report!"]="Não te vá deixando o trabalho a medias. Venha e diga se já é certo que vá a entregar meu relatório!"
G["Don't go out there. The pools are crawling with robots and mechagnomes!"]="Não salgas. As poços estão cheias de robots e mecagnomos!"
G["Don't go too far away Seth.  You know mommy doesn't like it when she can't hear you."]="Don't go too far away Seth.  You know mommy doesn't like it when she can't hear you."
G["Don't go toward the light, Mr. Floppy!"]="Não vá até a luz, Floppy!"
G["Don't go wanderin' off too far, $p. We're darn near defenseless without the likes of you."]="Don't go wanderin' off too far, $p. We're darn near defenseless without the likes of you."
G["Don't have to tell me twice - I've got debts in this city I'd like to leave behind."]="Don't have to tell me twice - I've got debts in this city I'd like to leave behind."
G["Don't hesitate, these dummies won't fight back, but the Blackrock sure will."]="Don't hesitate, these dummies won't fight back, but the Blackrock sure will."
G["Don't hold back now! Let's have it!"]="Não te contengas! Vamos além!"
G["Don't hold back."]="Não te contengas."
G["Don't hurt Betsy, you meanie!"]="Não lastimes a Besty, fera!"
G["Don't hurt me!"]="Não me faça dano!"
G["Don't hurt me!  I was just looking for my sisters!  I think Ashley's inside that house!"]="Não me faça dano! Tão somente estava procurando a meus irmãs! Acho que Ashley está dentro dessa casa!"
G["Don't interrupt me."]="Não me interrumpas."
G["Don't ja start..."]="Don't ja start..."
G["Don't jump! I am sure there are people who love you. Or at least tolerate you..."]="Não saltes! Certo que há gente que te quer. OU que ao menos te tolera..."
G["Don't jump! Life is worth living!"]="Não saltes! A vida vale a pena!"
G["Don't just attack him one at a time, you idiots! Surround him now!"]="Don't just attack him one at a time, you idiots! Surround him now!"
G["Don't just sit there! Attack!"]="Don't just sit there! Attack!"
G["Don't just sit there! Kill them!"]="Don't just sit there! Kill them!"
G["Don't just stand around $g boy:girl;! The Crusade needs your help!"]="Não te fique olhando, $gchico: garota;. A Cruzada precisa da sua ajuda!"
G["Don't just stand around, $r...\n\nThere's work to be done!"]="Não te fique aí sem mais, $r...\n\nHá trabalho pendente!"
G["Don't just stand there! Help $g him:her; out!"]="Don't just stand there! Help $g him:her; out!"
G["Don't just stand there; kill him!"]="Don't just stand there; kill him!"
G["Don't just use the blade. Use the butt of your weapon. Break his nose!"]="Não utilices somente a lâmina. Usa também a empunhadura. Rómpele a nariz!"
G["Don't kill me! I only took this job for the benefits!"]="Não me mate! Eu somente acepté este trabalho pelos benefícios!"
G["Don't know how long we're gonna be able to hold them off, $g bud : lady;. Hope you have a plan!"]="Don't know how long we're gonna be able to hold them off, $g bud : lady;. Hope you have a plan!"
G["Don't know why you would need a skill like that? Only dishonest folk would want to learn how to pick locks.\nI guess if you wanted to learn, the best place to look would be over in Old Town. Probably in one of those back alleys."]="Don't know why you would need a skill like that? Only dishonest folk would want to learn how to pick locks.\nI guess if you wanted to learn, the best place to look would be over in Old Town. Probably in one of those back alleys."
G["Don't leave me again!  You want to fight for your country, but they don't even want you!  They sent you here to die!"]="Don't leave me again!  You want to fight for your country, but they don't even want you!  They sent you here to die!"
G["Don't leave me alone!"]="Não me deixem somente!"
G["Don't leave me in here!  Cause if you do, I will find you..."]="Don't leave me in here!  Cause if you do, I will find you..."
G["Don't let Maikee know, but I kinda love him even if he is a grump."]="Don't let Maikee know, but I kinda love him even if he is a grump."
G["Don't let a little elf attack get in the way of your work!"]="Don't let a little elf attack get in the way of your work!"
G["Don't let a single one of them live."]="Não deixe que nenhum viva."
G["Don't let any of them escape, you dogs!"]="Não deixem que escape nenhum, cães!"
G["Don't let anybody tell you that the Scourge is defeated.  Look... do they not still roam the Plaguewood?  They cling to their corrupted land like a child's blanket.\n\nI have no choice but to fight.  Until my last breath, I will fight them."]="Don't let anybody tell you that the Scourge is defeated.  Look... do they not still roam the Plaguewood?  They cling to their corrupted land like a child's blanket.\n\nI have no choice but to fight.  Until my last breath, I will fight them."
G["Don't let him get away!"]="Não lhe deixem escapar!"
