G["Don't let it get to Stonetalon!"]="Não deixe que chegue a Cordilheira das Torres de Pedra!"
G["Don't let it grab you!"]="Não deixe que te agarre!"
G["Don't let it touch you!"]="Não deixe que te toque!"
G["Don't let me catch you stealing anything!  Look for Shenthul and his Shadowswift Brotherhood in the underground Cleft of Shadow.  Find the tunnel leading down into it south of the Valley of Wisdom."]="Não me deixe te pegar roubando nada! Procure Shenthul e sua Shadowswift Brotherhood na fenda subterrânea da sombra. Encontre o túnel que leva ao sul do Vale da Sabedoria."
G["Don't let me die!"]="Não me deixe morrer!"
G["Don't let me down again, $n. Make sure this evacuee reaches safety."]="Don't let me down again, $n. Make sure this evacuee reaches safety."
G["Don't let my death go unavenged, stranger... give... them... hell..."]="Não deixe meu morte sem vingar, andarilho... que... o pasen... mal..."
G["Don't let stains sit for too long!"]="Não deixe que as manchas se queden aí durante muito tempo!"
G["Don't let that dragonhawk through!  Open fire!"]="Don't let that dragonhawk through!  Open fire!"
G["Don't let that panther drag me off... Put me down if it comes to that."]="Don't let that panther drag me off... Put me down if it comes to that."
G["Don't let the $Rs in the Bazaar fool ye lad, with the subway those gnomes built it's easier than ye might think to transport goods from Ironforge. If they try to tack on import fees just tell them yer gonna buy yer gear from me."]="Don't let the $Rs in the Bazaar fool ye lad, with the subway those gnomes built it's easier than ye might think to transport goods from Ironforge. If they try to tack on import fees just tell them yer gonna buy yer gear from me."
G["Don't let the beady eyes and bushy beard fool you. Vosur's a talented apprentice and a good friend, even if I do get a crick in my neck when I talk to him."]="Não deixe que os olhos redondos e a barba espessa o enganem. Vosur é um aprendiz talentoso e um bom amigo, mesmo que eu acerte meu pescoço quando falo com ele."
G["Don't let the horde scum through!"]="Não deixem entrar à escória da Horda!"
G["Don't let the humans in the Bazaar fool ye $g lad : lass;, with the subway those gnomes built it's easier than ye might think to transport goods from Ironforge. If they try to tack on import fees just tell them yer gonna buy yer gear from me."]="Não deixe os humanos do Bazar enganarem você, $grapaz:moça;. Com o metrô construído pelos gnomos, transportar mercadorias de Altaforja é mais fácil do que parece. Se tentarem cobrar taxas de importação, diga que comprará seu equipamento comigo."
G["Don't let the jingle of the bells take away from the jingle in your pocket!  Buy Smokywood Pastures treats for your Winter Veil festivities!"]="Não deixe o toque dos sinos tirar do toque no seu bolso! Compre guloseimas de Smokywood Pastures para as suas festividades do véu de inverno!"
G["Don't let the levels get too low."]="Não deixe que bagemn os níveis."
G["Don't let them break the line!"]="Que não rompan o linha de frente!"
G["Don't let them catch you!"]="Não deixem que os atrapen!"
G["Don't let them eat me!"]="Não deixe que me coman!"
G["Don't let them escape!"]="Não deixem que escapen!"
G["Don't let them escape! Kill the strong one first!"]="Don't let them escape! Kill the strong one first!"
G["Don't let them hurt us Tito! Oh, you won't, will you?"]="Não permitas que nos façam dano, Tito! Oh, não o fará, verdade?"
G["Don't let them make off with any of the artifacts!"]="Não deixe que se levem nenhum artefato!"
G["Don't let them make... a mattress outta' me."]="Don't let them make... a mattress outta' me."
G["Don't let them out of sight! Quickly - come with me!"]="Não lhes perda de visão! Rápido... venha comigo!"
G["Don't let them overpower us!"]="Não deixe que nos dominen!"
G["Don't let them take the Windrunner you worthless mutts!  Stand your ground!"]="Don't let them take the Windrunner you worthless mutts!  Stand your ground!"
G["Don't let them through!  Look, over there!"]="Não os deixe passar! Olhe, por aqui!"
G["Don't let them turn me into one of those aberrations!"]="Não deixe que me conviertan em uma das essas aberrações!"
G["Don't let those big, innocent eyes fool ye. Tally's an expert, all right: I learn something new every day. Why d'you think I'm here in Tinker Town? Do I look like an engineer to you? Aye, I didn't think so."]="Não deixe que aqueles olhos grandes e inocentes enganem você. Tally é um especiapronta, tudo bem: aprendo algo novo todos os dias. Por que você acha que estou aqui em Tinker Town? Eu pareço um engenheiro para você? Sim, acho que não."
G["Don't let those dirty orcs take the harbor!"]="Don't let those dirty orcs take the harbor!"
G["Don't let those fiends breath through!  Our wounded are here behind me!"]="Não deixem que esses malignos se abran passo! Nossos feridos estão por trás de mim!"
G["Don't let those monsters through the gate! Stand firm, soldiers!"]="Não deixem que esses monstros atraviesen a porta! Manteneos firmes, soldados!"
G["Don't let those spiders eat the Elementium!"]="Don't let those spiders eat the Elementium!"
G["Don't let up! No mercy!"]="Don't let up! No mercy!"
G["Don't let up, $n!"]="Não te rindas, $n!"
G["Don't let up. No mercy!"]="Don't let up. No mercy!"
G["Don't let vrykul come through!  Kill all!"]="Não deixem que pasen vrykul! Matem-nos a todos!"
G["Don't listen to anything Alexi says. He was a fool to stay during the plague and now look at him - he's no better than the other abominations in this place.\n\nDon't fret, we will reclaim Scholomance and the surrounding lands for the last living son of Barov - the rightful heir."]="Don't listen to anything Alexi says. He was a fool to stay during the plague and now look at him - he's no better than the other abominations in this place.\n\nDon't fret, we will reclaim Scholomance and the surrounding lands for the last living son of Barov - the rightful heir."
G["Don't listen to her voice!"]="Don't listen to her voice!"
G["Don't listen to him.  We've got work to do."]="Não lhe faça atenção. Temos muito que fazer."
G["Don't listen to that old fool, kid. He's like that with everyone. I've been watching you, though; you got real talent. Come have a talk with me."]="Don't listen to that old fool, kid. He's like that with everyone. I've been watching you, though; you got real talent. Come have a talk with me."
G["Don't listen to the hearts of the world - the answer lies within.  You know the truth."]="Não ouça os corações do mundo - a resposta está dentro. Você sabe a verdade."
G["Don't look at her... ruby red... soft... sensual lips! Oh..."]="Don't look at her... ruby red... soft... sensual lips! Oh..."
G["Don't look into their eyes!  They're not the people you once knew!"]="Don't look into their eyes!  They're not the people you once knew!"
G["Don't look so smug! I know what you're thinking, but Tempest Keep was merely a setback. Did you honestly believe I would trust the future to some blind, half-night elf mongrel?"]="Don't look so smug! I know what you're thinking, but Tempest Keep was merely a setback. Did you honestly believe I would trust the future to some blind, half-night elf mongrel?"
G["Don't look so surprised to see me here, $r. The coming of the draenei and their alliance with my people was foretold by Kurz the Revelator."]="Don't look so surprised to see me here, $r. The coming of the draenei and their alliance with my people was foretold by Kurz the Revelator."
G["Don't look so surprised! We dragons are conscious, even within our shells. As I grew, I could hear the plotting and scheming. I was to be born a prisoner."]="Don't look so surprised! We dragons are conscious, even within our shells. As I grew, I could hear the plotting and scheming. I was to be born a prisoner."
G["Don't look up!"]="Não olhe cima!"
G["Don't make me angry! You wouldn't like me when I'm angry!"]="Não me enfades! Não você gostaria me ver bravo!"
G["Don't make me come in there with my brutes!"]="Don't make me come in there with my brutes!"
G["Don't make me get my pappy to catch you! He likes to catch bunnies using his rifle!"]="Don't make me get my pappy to catch you! He likes to catch bunnies using his rifle!"
G["Don't make me go medieval on you."]="Não me faça ser medieval com você."
G["Don't make me jump off of this crate! I will beat your head in, orc."]="Don't make me jump off of this crate! I will beat your head in, orc."
G["Don't make me kill you!"]="Don't make me kill you!"
G["Don't make me laugh."]="Don't make me laugh."
G["Don't make me stand up!"]="Don't make me stand up!"
G["Don't make them angry!"]="Não os enfades!"
G["Don't mind Skuerto, $n. He doesn't mean to be rude, he's just terribly busy. While we wait for him to finish scouting, why don't we work on something more productive?"]="Don't mind Skuerto, $n. He doesn't mean to be rude, he's just terribly busy. While we wait for him to finish scouting, why don't we work on something more productive?"
G["Don't mind if I do. Maybe it'll get rid of this headache."]="Não me importa. Talvez se me quite o dor de cabeça."
G["Don't mind me, or my smell...because I sure don't!"]="Don't mind me, or my smell...because I sure don't!"
G["Don't mind me. I'm just an old man, waiting on an old... friend."]="Não se importe comigo. Eu sou apenas um homem velho, esperando um velho... amigo."
G["Don't mind the mess, we're still settin' up.\n\nDon't let that stop you from enjoying yourself, though! Relax, spend some coin... we've got everything from money changers and laundry services to exotic drinks and fishing trainers.\n\nAnd if anyone gives you any trouble? You just let ME know, and I'll handle it.\n\nI'm Mida... the boss."]="Don't mind the mess, we're still settin' up.\n\nDon't let that stop you from enjoying yourself, though! Relax, spend some coin... we've got everything from money changers and laundry services to exotic drinks and fishing trainers.\n\nAnd if anyone gives you any trouble? You just let ME know, and I'll handle it.\n\nI'm Mida... the boss."
G["Don't mind those two idiots outside - they're caught up in some fad called \"sharking.\"\n\nI'd wager they feel pretty dumb about that picture in a couple of months."]="Não faça atenção a esses dois idiotas de fosse. Estão seguindo uma moda chamada \"tiburonear\".\n\nApuesto que dentro de um par de meses lhes dará vergonha ver essa foto."
G["Don't mind us. We're just mopping up the last of them now. Shouldn't be much longer."]="Não te preocupe por nós. Estamos limpando os últimos agora mesmo. Não nos levará muito tempo."
G["Don't move, $r!"]="Não te muevas, $r!"
G["Don't move, human. I've got you cornered."]="Don't move, human. I've got you cornered."
G["Don't move, little adventurer. I have the death you seek."]="Don't move, little adventurer. I have the death you seek."
G["Don't need Goob's help?"]="Não que ajuda de Goob?"
G["Don't pay Budd no nevermind... poor fella's got a few screws missin'."]="Don't pay Budd no nevermind... poor fella's got a few screws missin'."
G["Don't play stupid with me, Jack. I know that you have the moolah!"]="Não te faça o estúpido comigo, Jack. Sei que tem a pasta!"
G["Don't preen just yet, little pups. We'll cleanse this world of your kind."]="Don't preen just yet, little pups. We'll cleanse this world of your kind."
G["Don't pull own tail when there are other tails to pull."]="Makaku não deve tirar de kola própria se você pode tirar de outras."
G["Don't put seeds in your nose. That makes paw-paw real mad!"]="Don't put seeds in your nose. That makes paw-paw real mad!"
G["Don't question my genius!"]="Não comece em dúvida meu genialidade!"
G["Don't resist... I'm only trying to change you back into a man."]="Don't resist... I'm only trying to change you back into a man."
