G["Draenei dog! Did you know that the one you call Saruan wept like a babe as I beat him? A feeling of euphoria coursed through me, knowing that I had a member of high rank in my grasp. Were it not for Sironas' plans for him, I would have tortured him to death... As I do to all draenei that I capture. Alas, I am certain that you will see him again soon..."]="Draenei dog! Did you know that the one you call Saruan wept like a babe as I beat him? A feeling of euphoria coursed through me, knowing that I had a member of high rank in my grasp. Were it not for Sironas' plans for him, I would have tortured him to death... As I do to all draenei that I capture. Alas, I am certain that you will see him again soon..."
G["Draenei filth will not last on this world..."]="A mugre draeneis não durará neste mundo..."
G["Draenei forces and their Alliance allies are engaged with the Horde in the Eye of the Storm in Outland. Will you join them in an effort to turn the tide of battle in our favor?"]="As forças Draenei e seus aliados da Aliança estão engajados com a Horda no Olho da Tormenta em TerrAlém. Você se juntará a eles em um esforço para mudar a maré da batalha a nosso favor?"
G["Draenei have come back! This group jumped two of my best wolf riders as they were out patrolling the western roads. Needless to say, we were victorious in that skirmish.\n\nNow I'm not sure what's going on but from what my scouts tell me, there are blood elves and draenei all over Halaa. I'm no blood elf lover but if it's one thing I hate it's a draenei. If you see draenei or any of their allies at Halaa, be sure to put a boot in their backsides for me.\n\nHalaa's to the west... In case you want to go now."]="Draenei have come back! This group jumped two of my best wolf riders as they were out patrolling the western roads. Needless to say, we were victorious in that skirmish.\n\nNow I'm not sure what's going on but from what my scouts tell me, there are blood elves and draenei all over Halaa. I'm no blood elf lover but if it's one thing I hate it's a draenei. If you see draenei or any of their allies at Halaa, be sure to put a boot in their backsides for me.\n\nHalaa's to the west... In case you want to go now."
G["Draenei... And because of this, I am neither. Not orc, not draenei. My own kind are a rare breed. Most having been killed decades ago... I live because of my strength of will."]="Draenei... E por isso, eu também não sou. Nem orc, nem draenei. Minha própria espécie é uma raça rara. A maioria foi morta décadas atrás... vivo por causa da minha força de vontade."
G["Dragon filth! Guards! Guards! Seize this monster!"]="Dragão asqueroso! Guardas! Guardas! Peguem ao monstro!"
G["Dragon!  Hear me out!  I am Maximillian of Northshire, and I have come to deliver you.  Your blood shall fill..."]="Dragon!  Hear me out!  I am Maximillian of Northshire, and I have come to deliver you.  Your blood shall fill..."
G["Dragon's Mouth was established to give the Alliance their first real foothold here in the Badlands.  Despite its position between Stormwind and Dun Morogh, the Badlands have traditionally been Horde territory.\n\nIf that's ever to change, we need to start asserting ourselves.  Of course, the dragon attacks on New Kargath don't hurt our cause either."]="Dragon's Mouth was established to give the Alliance their first real foothold here in the Badlands.  Despite its position between Stormwind and Dun Morogh, the Badlands have traditionally been Horde territory.\n\nIf that's ever to change, we need to start asserting ourselves.  Of course, the dragon attacks on New Kargath don't hurt our cause either."
G["Dragon, you will do as I command! Catch me!"]="Dragão, fará o que te ordeno! Cógeme!"
G["Dragonhawk"]="Dracohalcón"
G["Dragonhawk Master"]="Mestre do Falcão do Dragão"
G["Dragonhawk incoming from the west!  Shoot that $c down!"]="Dragonhawk incoming from the west!  Shoot that $c down!"
G["Dragonhawks, if raised properly, are really quite tame.  Don't you think that is fascinating?  To be so friendly and companionable if raised right and so vicious and deadly in the wild...I just love them so much."]="Dragonhawks, if raised properly, are really quite tame.  Don't you think that is fascinating?  To be so friendly and companionable if raised right and so vicious and deadly in the wild...I just love them so much."
G["Dragonmaw attack! Protect the High Shaman."]="Dragonmaw attack! Protect the High Shaman."
G["Dragonmaw clan, retake the docks and push them into the sea!  In the name of Hellscream and the True Horde!"]="Dragonmaw clan, retake the docks and push them into the sea!  In the name of Hellscream and the True Horde!"
G["Dragonmaw reinforcements have arrived!"]="Têm chegado os reforços dos Faucedraco!"
G["Dragonmaw, advance!"]="Dragonmaw, advance!"
G["Dragonqueen... Life-Binder... preserve... me."]="Rainha dos dragões... Vinculadora de vida... conserva... me"
G["Dragonriders mount up!"]="Dragonriders mount up!"
G["Dragons are dangerous at any size, as I'm sure you'll find out."]="Dragões são perigosos em qualquer tamanho, como você vai acabar descobrindo."
G["Dragons are no mere beasts, like hogs or cattle. They are a force of nature. Powerful... Primal.\n\nTo bend them to your will is to harness the world.\n\nTo take up their reigns is to take destiny into your hands."]="Dragons are no mere beasts, like hogs or cattle. They are a force of nature. Powerful... Primal.\n\nTo bend them to your will is to harness the world.\n\nTo take up their reigns is to take destiny into your hands."
G["Dragons controlling orcs!? SQUAWK!"]="Dragões controlando orcs!? UAU!"
G["Drain the girl! Drain her power until there is nothing but a vacant shell!"]="Drain the girl! Drain her power until there is nothing but a vacant shell!"
G["Drain... life!"]="Drenar... vida!"
G["Drak'Tharon be lost, mon!"]="Drak'tharon está perdida, colega!"
G["Draka's Fury."]="Fúria de Draka."
G["Drake incoming! OPEN FIRE!"]="Drake incoming! OPEN FIRE!"
G["Drakes is my business, $n. I'm authorized to sell them to our highest ranking officers."]="Drakes is my business, $n. I'm authorized to sell them to our highest ranking officers."
G["Drakkari Empire gunna prevail! Da Scourge gunna die... again."]="Drakkari Empire gunna prevail! Da Scourge gunna die... again."
G["Drakkari Warrior, huh?  We'll see how much of a warrior you are when you fight Ironhide."]="Guerreiro Drakkari, eh? Veremos o bom guerreiro que é quando luches contra Pielférrea."
G["Drakkari forces pour from the Drakkari Tribal Door!"]="As forças Drakkari saem em tropel desde a porta tribal Drakkari!"
G["Drakkari gonna kill anybody who tressspasss on these landsss!"]="Drakkari gonna kill anybody who tressspasss on these landsss!"
G["Drakkari tribe, show them the might of the frozen North!"]="Drakkari tribe, show them the might of the frozen North!"
G["Drakkari, this will not stop us from stealing the power of your wild gods. We will take it from them directly, or from you if you've already killed them; it matters not."]="Drakkari, this will not stop us from stealing the power of your wild gods. We will take it from them directly, or from you if you've already killed them; it matters not."
G["Drakuru casts his gaze down on Drak'Tharon Keep."]="Drakuru posa a visão sobre a Fortaleza de Drak'tharon."
G["Drakuru casts his gaze down on Drak'Tharon Keep...."]="Drakuru lança uma olhar até a Fortaleza de Drak'tharon…"
G["Drat!  This bloodthistle extract doesn't seem to want to combine properly with my poison.  I'll not be deterred - those trolls will be dealt with!  Perhaps a different mixture?"]="Drat!  This bloodthistle extract doesn't seem to want to combine properly with my poison.  I'll not be deterred - those trolls will be dealt with!  Perhaps a different mixture?"
G["Drat, how am I supposed to run the family noodle cart if I don't know our family recipe?"]="Se significa que me tenho que encargar do carrinho de macarrão familiar e nem sequer me sei a receita!"
G["Draw out their suffering, death knight!"]="Acaba com o seu sofrimento, cavaleiro da Morte!"
G["Draw them back to us, and we'll assist you."]="Draw them back to us, and we'll assist you."
G["Draw yer own steel, ye harpy-lovin' scoundrel!"]="Draw yer own steel, ye harpy-lovin' scoundrel!"
