G["Dreadmaw! You shall pay dearly, trespasser..."]="Dreadmaw! You shall pay dearly, trespasser..."
G["Dreams?"]="Sonhos?"
G["Drek'Thar is defeated!  The Alliance is victorious... for now.\n\nSpeak with our quartermaster and aid in our reconstruction."]="Drek'Thar is defeated!  The Alliance is victorious... for now.\n\nSpeak with our quartermaster and aid in our reconstruction."
G["Drek'Thar is the military and spiritual leader of the Frostwolf Clan in Alterac, leading his brethren from Frostwolf Keep.\n\nIf he is defeated then the Horde forces in Alterac will crumble."]="Drek'Thar is the military and spiritual leader of the Frostwolf Clan in Alterac, leading his brethren from Frostwolf Keep.\n\nIf he is defeated then the Horde forces in Alterac will crumble."
G["Drek'Thar is the military and spiritual leader of the Frostwolf Clan in Alterac, leading his brethren from Frostwolf Keep.\n\nIf he is defeated then the Horde forces in Alterac will crumble.\n\nDrek'Thar has been slain."]="Drek'Thar is the military and spiritual leader of the Frostwolf Clan in Alterac, leading his brethren from Frostwolf Keep.\n\nIf he is defeated then the Horde forces in Alterac will crumble.\n\nDrek'Thar has been slain."
G["Drek'Thar is the military and spiritual leader of the Frostwolf Clan in Alterac, leading his brethren from Frostwolf Keep.\n\nIf he is defeated then the Horde forces in Alterac will crumble.\n\nDrek'Thar is not currently in Alterac Valley."]="Drek'Thar is the military and spiritual leader of the Frostwolf Clan in Alterac, leading his brethren from Frostwolf Keep.\n\nIf he is defeated then the Horde forces in Alterac will crumble.\n\nDrek'Thar is not currently in Alterac Valley."
G["Drek'Thar, I'm coming for you!"]="Drek'Thar, vou por você!"
G["Drek'Thar, forever loyal to our people. Spirits bless you, old friend. This is your home too, please make yourself comfortable."]="Drek'Thar, sempre fiel a nosso povo. Que os espíritos te bendigas, velho amigo. Faça como no seu casa. É $gbienvenido: boas-vindas;."
G["Drink Kaja'Cola!"]="Bebe Kaja'Cola!"
G["Drink and be merry!"]="Bebe e sei feliz!"
G["Drink deep my brothers!"]="Drink deep my brothers!"
G["Drink for the Horde!"]="Drink for the Horde!"
G["Drink from this vial, and the fog will be cleared for a short time. Go with the spirits, my friend."]="Beba deste frasco e o nevoeiro ficará limpo por um curto período de tempo. Vá com os espíritos, meu amigo."
G["Drink in moderation, then, my dwarven friend, but you may want to turn in your lance and reins for the time being. Go with the Light."]="Drink in moderation, then, my dwarven friend, but you may want to turn in your lance and reins for the time being. Go with the Light."
G["Drink in my blood and be reborn as worgen, immune to the depravity of the Forsaken."]="Drink in my blood and be reborn as worgen, immune to the depravity of the Forsaken."
G["Drink in their misery, brother!"]="Drink in their misery, brother!"
G["Drink it all boys!"]="Bebéoslo tudo, pessoal!"
G["Drink or be gone!"]="Beba ou vá embora!"
G["Drink this, Zahlia.  It is not as potent as I'd hoped, but perhaps it will help."]="Bebe isto, Zahlia. Não é tão potente como esperava, mas talvez sirva."
G["Drink this, it will help."]="Tire isto, te ajudará."
G["Drink this, you blue brute!  Disobey me and I promise you a slow, painful death!"]="Bébete isto, fera azul! Se me desobedeces, te prometo uma morte lenta e dolorosa!"
G["Drink this. It has a bit of a kick."]="Bebe isto. Tem um pouco de chispa."
G["Drink time!"]="Hora de beber!"
G["Drink up to begin, friend."]="Drink up to begin, friend."
G["Drink up!"]="Drink up!"
G["Drink up!  There's more where that came from!"]="Drink up!  There's more where that came from!"
G["Drink up, $p. I wanna see that vial empty before you so much as dip a toe into the sea."]="Bebe, $p. Quero ver esse frasco vazio antes de que metas um dedo do pé no mar."
G["Drink up, boys!"]="Drink up, boys!"
G["Drink up, ye scurvy mongrels!"]="Drink up, ye scurvy mongrels!"
G["Drink your blood. Eat your flesh."]="Beber sua sangue. Comer sua carne."
G["Drink, Tink! Drink, Tink! Drink, Tink!"]="Drink, Tink! Drink, Tink! Drink, Tink!"
G["Drink, mortals!  Taste my blood!  Taste your death!"]="Drink, mortals!  Taste my blood!  Taste your death!"
G["Drinking"]="Drinking"
G["Drinking a healing potion!  I won't be able to use another one for a while!"]="Estou bebendo uma poção de cura! Não poderei usar outra até dentro de um tempo!"
G["Drinking ain't so nice on an empty stomach. Give a jinyu something to eat, eh?"]="Não é agradável beber com o estômago vazio. Dale a um jinyu algo de comer, eh?"
G["Drinking is not guarding."]="Beber não é vigilar."
G["Drinking is tiring work... Time to fish!  Wait, that's not right... Fishing is boring work, time to drink!"]="Drinking is tiring work... Time to fish!  Wait, that's not right... Fishing is boring work, time to drink!"
G["Drinks!"]="A beber!"
G["Drinks, here! Delicious drinks! From snowplum brandy to Westfall bourbon... get your drinks!"]="Bebidas! Aqui! Deliciosas bebidas! Desde brandy de ciruela de neve até bourbon dos Cerro Oeste. Adquiere seus bebidas!"
G["Dripping and pouring and clotting!"]="Dripping and pouring and clotting!"
G["Drive some circles around'm!"]="Drive some circles around'm!"
G["Drive the invaders out!  For Queen Angerboda!"]="Drive the invaders out!  For Queen Angerboda!"
G["Drive them back!"]="Drive them back!"
G["Drive them back! Back to Darnassus!"]="Drive them back! Back to Darnassus!"
G["Drive them out! We take none alive!"]="Drive them out! We take none alive!"
G["Drive these brutes from the vale!"]="Drive these brutes from the vale!"
G["Drive this scum back into the woods!"]="Drive this scum back into the woods!"
G["Drive this scum from the Vrykul homeland!"]="Drive this scum from the Vrykul homeland!"
G["Driver, I hear you single handedly airlifted our villagers out of this hell-hole. Is that true?"]="Driver, I hear you single handedly airlifted our villagers out of this hell-hole. Is that true?"
