G["Drohn's Distillery has the best brew money can buy!  They were voted \"Outstanding Brew\" by Monthly Goblin Brew!"]="A Destilaria de Drohn tna melhor cerveja que o dinheiro pode comprar! Foram escolhidos \"cerveja excepcional\" pelo suplemento cervejeiro goblin!"
G["Drohn's Distillery knows how to party hard!  Check them out at Brewfest!"]="Drohn's Distillery knows how to party hard!  Check them out at Brewfest!"
G["Drohn's brew is the stuff legends are made of!  Come taste the legend!"]="Drohn's brew is the stuff legends are made of!  Come taste the legend!"
G["Drone things not as tough as they look. Wasp things a bit nastier."]="Drone things not as tough as they look. Wasp things a bit nastier."
G["Drop point check commencing!"]="Iniciando comprobação de ponto de lançamento!"
