G["Druid"]="Druida"
G["Druid?  Ah... Shalannius, you seek Shalannius.  You shall find this night elf outside of the Exodar, near Valaar's Berth."]="Druida? Ah... Shalannius, você procura Shalannius. Você encontrará esse elfo noturno do lado de fosse do Exodar, perto do cais de Valaar."
G["Druid? No one here follows that path... but I believe I heard of someone matching that description near the Exodar. Shalannius, I think?"]="Druida? Ninguém aqui segue esse caminho... mas acredito que ouvi falar de alguém que correspondesse a essa descrição perto do Exodar. Shalannius, eu acho?"
G["Druids and your silly shapeshifting. Lets see it in action!"]="Os druidas e seu estúpido poder de alterar de forma. Veámoslo em ação!"
G["Druids are very sensitive to the plight of all creatures of the world. When it was found that these birds were in danger, we set up a system of rescuing them from the corruption of Feralas.\n\nA gnome named Curgle Cranklehop leads the affair; she collects the eggs and has them sent here, where I care for them.\n\nWe could always use more help for our cause, $n. Maybe you should head over to Gadgetzan and look for Curgle."]="Druids are very sensitive to the plight of all creatures of the world. When it was found that these birds were in danger, we set up a system of rescuing them from the corruption of Feralas.\n\nA gnome named Curgle Cranklehop leads the affair; she collects the eggs and has them sent here, where I care for them.\n\nWe could always use more help for our cause, $n. Maybe you should head over to Gadgetzan and look for Curgle."
G["Druids can sometimes be so serious, but I'm a real party animal.  Yes, that was a joke.  You should laugh.  Now."]="Druids can sometimes be so serious, but I'm a real party animal.  Yes, that was a joke.  You should laugh.  Now."
G["Druids, hold your fire! She is unarmed!"]="Druidas, deteneos! Está desarmada!"
G["Druids?  I haven't seen any druids around here.  Although I am sure that in Stormwind you could find one.  You should ask a guard in Stormwind."]="Druidas? Não vi druidas por aqui. Embora estou certo de que poderia encontrar algum em Ventobravo. Deveria perguntar a um guarda em Ventobravo."
G["Druids?  I haven't seen any druids around here.  Although there is a district in Stormwind that the night elves have made their own."]="Druidas? Eu não vi nenhum druida por aqui. Embora exista um distrito em Ventobravo, os elfos noturnos fizeram o seu próprio."
G["Drums of War"]="Tambores de guerra"
G["Dual Specialization allows you to keep two active Class Specialization, Talent, and Glyph sets and easily switch between them.\nYou also will have separate glyph panes and action bars for each set.\nSwitching between the two sets cannot be done while in combat and will consume your available resources."]="Dual Specialization allows you to keep two active Class Specialization, Talent, and Glyph sets and easily switch between them.\nYou also will have separate glyph panes and action bars for each set.\nSwitching between the two sets cannot be done while in combat and will consume your available resources."
G["Duarn - excellent work.  Do not dally long within Nespirah's shell.  You know as well as I do the dangers posed by an angry demigod."]="Duarn - excellent work.  Do not dally long within Nespirah's shell.  You know as well as I do the dangers posed by an angry demigod."
G["Duck!"]="Agáchate!"
G["Due to incompatibility on your class specification, I am unable to help you rectify any situation you have with lack of ability."]="Devido à incompatibilidade na especificação da sua classe, não consigo ajudá-o a corrigir qualquer situação que você tenha com falta de capacidade."
G["Due to the, ah, \"misunderstanding\" in Dragonblight, we've had to relocate our facilities to this decrepit mess of a castle.\n\nStill, we've now plenty of space and time to work on various new and lovely... products..."]="Due to the, ah, \"misunderstanding\" in Dragonblight, we've had to relocate our facilities to this decrepit mess of a castle.\n\nStill, we've now plenty of space and time to work on various new and lovely... products..."
G["Dugar is alive! I can make out an arakkoa pacing back and forth in front of him, asking him the same questions over and over. There is another, too, a human..."]="Dugar is alive! I can make out an arakkoa pacing back and forth in front of him, asking him the same questions over and over. There is another, too, a human..."
G["Duglas send you over to get roughed up?"]="Duglas mandou você se machucar?"
