G["Dulvi is the woman you want. She trains new prospects in the middle of the Watch."]="Dulvi é a mulher que você deseja. Ela treina novas perspectivas no meio da Patrulha."
G["Dumb big-tongue lover! You not friend of Frenzyheart no more. Frenzyheart will get you good."]="Estúpido amante de línguas-grandes! Você já não amigo de Coração Frenético. Coração frenético se encargará de ti."
G["Dumb puppy-men messed up the shrine! Boo! Make it stop!"]="Dumb puppy-men messed up the shrine! Boo! Make it stop!"
G["Dumb puppy-men! We tried to be nice! You got it coming now!"]="Dumb puppy-men! We tried to be nice! You got it coming now!"
G["Dumb slave thing keep fighitng... Goregek going to not get butt kicked more now."]="Dumb slave thing keep fighitng... Goregek going to not get butt kicked more now."
G["Dumb slave thing supposed to kill things, not let things kill Goregek!"]="Dumb slave thing supposed to kill things, not let things kill Goregek!"
G["Dumb! Don't shoot at it! Gekgek want trophy in one piece!"]="Dumb! Don't shoot at it! Gekgek want trophy in one piece!"
