G["Dun Baldar is in very bad shape, and we're very low on supplies to rebuild it.  The Alliance needs your help gathering supplies!"]="Dun Baldar está em muito mal estado e não temos muitos suprimentos para reconstruir. A Aliança precisa da sua ajuda para que traigas suprimentos!"
G["Dun Baldar is the strongest point of Alliance power in Alterac Valley.  Nestled in the northern reaches of the valley, Dun Baldar is the staging ground  for all advances to the south.\n\nDun Baldar was razed and is under reconstruction."]="Dun Baldar é o ponto mais álgido de poder da Aliança no Vale Alterac. Enclavado na parte norte do vale, Dun Baldar é o ponto de partida de todos os avances para o sul.\n\nDun Baldar foi arrasado e está em plena reconstrução."
G["Dun Baldar is the strongest point of Alliance power in Alterac Valley.  Nestled in the northern reaches of the valley, Dun Baldar is the staging ground for all advances to the south.\n\nDun Baldar is intact."]="Dun Baldar é o ponto mais álgido de poder da Aliança no Vale Alterac. Enclavado na parte norte do vale, Dun Baldar é o ponto de partida de todos os avances para o sul.\n\nDun Baldar continua intacto."
G["Dun Baldar took a real beating in the last Horde attack!  We need more supplies in order to rebuild and make repairs!"]="Dun Baldar took a real beating in the last Horde attack!  We need more supplies in order to rebuild and make repairs!"
G["Dun worry about me $G lad:lass;. I've thought for a long time that age would claim me... I'm glad I was wrong. Dun let these iron dwarves find what they're looking for."]="Dun worry about me $G lad:lass;. I've thought for a long time that age would claim me... I'm glad I was wrong. Dun let these iron dwarves find what they're looking for."
G["Duncan's Textiles employs one of the finest tailors in Stormwind, Georgio Bolero. Look for the shop over in the Mage Quarter."]="A Duncan's Textiles emprega um dos melhores alfaiates de Stormwind, Georgio Bolero. Procure a loja no Bairro dos Magos."
G["Dunce."]="Suspensa."
G["Dunna' be judgin' too quickly, ya? Dis lil' trinket be exactly what ya looking for, smeller man."]="Dunna' be judgin' too quickly, ya? Dis lil' trinket be exactly what ya looking for, smeller man."
G["Duokna, what are you doing?"]="Duokna, O que está fazendo?"
G["Duokna... this is embarrassing."]="Duokna... this is embarrassing."
G["Durak, I have lost my disguise!"]="Durak, e perdido meu disfarce!"
G["During Hallow's End we celebrate the day that the Banshee Queen herself delivered us from the clutches of the Lich King and the Scourge. Be sure to attend the Wickerman Festival that is held each evening outside Undercity."]="Durante Hallow's End, comemoramos o dia em que a própria rainha Banshee nos libertou das garras do Rei Lich e do Flagelo. Não deixe de participar do Wickerman Festival, realizado todas as noites fosse da Undercity."
G["During a full moon, the sprite darters in The Woods of The Lost in Jade forest are known to shed their scales. They do it late at night and it's actually beautiful to see. \n \n Their scales glow with a bright jade light and fleck off into the water. This attracts Jade Lungfish like you wouldn't believe! Like moths to the light! \n \n Careful not to disturb those mogu, though... they ain't exactly the friendly type."]="During a full moon, the sprite darters in The Woods of The Lost in Jade forest are known to shed their scales. They do it late at night and it's actually beautiful to see. \n \n Their scales glow with a bright jade light and fleck off into the water. This attracts Jade Lungfish like you wouldn't believe! Like moths to the light! \n \n Careful not to disturb those mogu, though... they ain't exactly the friendly type."
G["During my stay in the dream I made a vital discovery. The rift that weakens the boundaries of this world has hastened the return of powerful allies."]="During my stay in the dream I made a vital discovery. The rift that weakens the boundaries of this world has hastened the return of powerful allies."
G["During that fight, I thought of a great new brew."]="Durante a luta se me acontecido uma nova cerveja."
G["During the Day of the Dead, people gather in graveyards to celebrate with and cherish the spirits of those they have lost.\n\nYou can find the festivities in the cemeteries of any major city, where you'll be able to cook, dance, don costumes, and more."]="During the Day of the Dead, people gather in graveyards to celebrate with and cherish the spirits of those they have lost.\n\nYou can find the festivities in the cemeteries of any major city, where you'll be able to cook, dance, don costumes, and more."
G["During the Lunar Festival, we should take time to seek out our elders and consider their wisdom."]="During the Lunar Festival, we should take time to seek out our elders and consider their wisdom."
G["During the War of the Ancients, the demigod Agamaggan came forth to battle the Burning Legion. The colossal boar was defeated, and over time in the areas where his blood fell, massive thorn-ridden vines sprouted to life. The quilboar came to occupy these regions and hold them sacred. The heart of these massive thorn-colonies is the Razorfen. Razorfen Kraul was conquered by the crone, Charlga Razorflank, who some speculate has been negotiating with agents of the Scourge for some insidious purpose."]="During the War of the Ancients, the demigod Agamaggan came forth to battle the Burning Legion. The colossal boar was defeated, and over time in the areas where his blood fell, massive thorn-ridden vines sprouted to life. The quilboar came to occupy these regions and hold them sacred. The heart of these massive thorn-colonies is the Razorfen. Razorfen Kraul was conquered by the crone, Charlga Razorflank, who some speculate has been negotiating with agents of the Scourge for some insidious purpose."
G["During the flight, I shared a tender moment with the attractive human."]="Durante o voo, disfruté de um momento de ternura com a linda humana."
