G["Ella lives at the very western end of the farmlands, just north of the Stormstout Brewery.\n\nShe's been living alone since her parents died, poor thing."]="Ella lives at the very western end of the farmlands, just north of the Stormstout Brewery.\n\nShe's been living alone since her parents died, poor thing."
G["Elortha no Shadra\nGod of Spiders, Mother of Venom, Silk Dancer, Death's Love."]="Elortha no Shadra\nGod of Spiders, Mother of Venom, Silk Dancer, Death's Love."
