G["Elune be praised!"]="Elune be praised!"
G["Elune be praised!  You seek out our Warsong Gulch Battlemaster?  Her name is Aethalas, and she stands ready to greet you near the warrior trainers."]="Elune seja louvado! Você procura nosso Mestre de Batalha Brado Guerreiro? O nome dela é Aethalas, e ela está pronta para recebê-o perto dos treinadores de guerreiros."
G["Elune be praised! And you as well."]="Elune be praised! And you as well."
G["Elune be with us! Let's make haste from this evil fortress."]="Eluna, permanece conosco! Vamos rápido desta fortaleza maligna."
G["Elune be with you, $c."]="Que Eluna estiver com você, $c."
G["Elune be with you."]="Que Eluna estiver com você."
