G["Elune's grace upon you.  How can I serve?"]="A graça de Elune sobre você. Como posso servir?"
G["Elune's light... what is that thing?"]="pela Luz de Eluna... Que é essa coisa?"
G["Elune's secrets are many, but they are not to be shared with just anyone."]="Elune's secrets are many, but they are not to be shared with just anyone."
G["Elune, guide my arrows!"]="Eluna, guia meus flechas!"
