G["Embrace the Nothing!"]="Someteos à nada!"
G["Embrace the Wanderer's Way! It is not so much a course of action as it is an attitude.\n\nEvery one you meet is a story. Every place you go is an adventure. Every drink you have is the best you've ever tasted.\n\nThis is not such a bad life, is it?"]="Embrace the Wanderer's Way! It is not so much a course of action as it is an attitude.\n\nEvery one you meet is a story. Every place you go is an adventure. Every drink you have is the best you've ever tasted.\n\nThis is not such a bad life, is it?"
G["Embrace the coming of the end!"]="Aceptao fim que se aproxima!"
G["Embrace the darkness... darkness eternal."]="Abrázate à escuridão... escuridão eterna."
G["Embrace the end!"]="É seu fim!"
G["Embrace the future that rises from below."]="Embrace the future that rises from below."
G["Embrace the light that is in you, my friends! Deny yourself all darkness..."]="Embrace the light that is in you, my friends! Deny yourself all darkness..."
G["Embrace yer demise!"]="Aceito vueh'tro fim!"
G["Embrace your despair."]="Aceitar seu desesperação."
G["Embrace your end."]="Aceito seu fim."
G["Emerald Circle."]="O Círculo Esmeralda."
G["Emerald Dragonshrine"]="Santuário Dragônico Esmeralda"
G["Emerald drakes excel at healing themselves while poisoning their enemies.\nUsing leeching poison, they can steal health from their enemies.  Repeated applications of this poison can increase the effect.\nWith touch the nightmare, emerald drakes can reach into the Dream, converting a portion of their life energy into a highly damaging attack that leaves the target weakened, reducing its damage for a short time."]="Emerald drakes excel at healing themselves while poisoning their enemies.\nUsing leeching poison, they can steal health from their enemies.  Repeated applications of this poison can increase the effect.\nWith touch the nightmare, emerald drakes can reach into the Dream, converting a portion of their life energy into a highly damaging attack that leaves the target weakened, reducing its damage for a short time."
G["Emergency Power Reserves Online."]="Reservas de alimentação de emergência activadas."
