G["Emissary Taluun brought me with him hoping I could teach our new allies about the elements of this world. So far they refuse to listen, but perhaps you would be willing?"]="O emissário Taluun me trouxe com ele, esperando que eu pudesse ensinar nossos novos aliados sobre os elementos deste mundo. Até agora, eles se recusam a ouvir, mas talvez você estivesse disposto?"
G["Emissary Taluun brought me with him hoping I could teach our new allies about the elements of this world... but no one will listen."]="O emissário Taluun me trouxe com ele, esperando que eu pudesse ensinar nossos novos aliados sobre os elementos deste mundo... mas ninguém vai ouvir."
G["Emissary, I misplaced the Blood Oath of the Horde. Could you please give me a replacement?"]="Emissary, I misplaced the Blood Oath of the Horde. Could you please give me a replacement?"
G["Emperor Hellscream, I am Ji..."]="Imperador Grito Infernal, sou Ji Zarpa..."
G["Emperor Thaurissan does not wish to be disturbed! Turn back now or face your doom, weak mortals!"]="Emperor Thaurissan does not wish to be disturbed! Turn back now or face your doom, weak mortals!"
