G["Empress..."]="Imperatriz..."
G["Empress... I have... failed you..."]="Imperatriz... Te e... falhado..."
G["Empress... forgive me!"]="Imperatriz... perdóname!"
G["En Garde!"]="Em guarda!"
G["Enabling"]="Ativando"
G["Enchanted thorium is a highly sought-after metal. You best chance of finding some of it is to speak with an artisan blacksmith or miner."]="O tório encantado é um metal muito procurado. A melhor chance de encontrar algo é falar com um ferreiro ou mineiro artesão."
G["Enchanting"]="Enchanting (Encantador)"
G["Enchanting Supplies"]="Suprimentos de encantamento"
G["Enchanting allows you to enchant items with a wide variety of beneficial effects, as well as disenchant items and create magical wands and oils.\nHighly skilled enchanters can even enchant their own rings, which no one else may do.\nMost raw materials for Enchanting must be gathered via disenchanting, a process which destroys the disenchanted item. For this reason the profession pairs well with Tailoring, as you can disenchant the magical Tailoring items you create for raw materials.\nEnchanters may also place enchantments upon vellum, which allows the enchantment to be sold or saved for later use. Vellum and other useful Enchanting materials may be purchased from Enchanting vendors."]="Enchanting allows you to enchant items with a wide variety of beneficial effects, as well as disenchant items and create magical wands and oils.\nHighly skilled enchanters can even enchant their own rings, which no one else may do.\nMost raw materials for Enchanting must be gathered via disenchanting, a process which destroys the disenchanted item. For this reason the profession pairs well with Tailoring, as you can disenchant the magical Tailoring items you create for raw materials.\nEnchanters may also place enchantments upon vellum, which allows the enchantment to be sold or saved for later use. Vellum and other useful Enchanting materials may be purchased from Enchanting vendors."
G["Enchanting has run in our family for generations. I learned at an early age, just as my son is doing now."]="Encantador é executado em nossa família há gerações. Aprendi desde tenra idade, assim como meu filho está fazendo agora."
G["End him..."]="Acaba com ele!"
G["End it, for the Horde."]="Acaba com isto. pela Horda."
G["End it."]="Acabe com isso."
G["End its miserable life."]="Acaba com o seu miserável vida."
G["End our suffering!"]="Coloque fim a nosso sofrimento!"
G["End the mortal affront!"]="Coloque fim a esta afrenta mortal!"
G["End the orc's misery."]="Acaba com o sofrimento do orc."
G["End this mortal affront to the Lich King!"]="End this mortal affront to the Lich King!"
G["Endala finel endal!"]="Endala finel endal!"
G["Endless serpents and a giant panther... It can't get much worse than this."]="Endless serpents and a giant panther... It can't get much worse than this."
G["Endlessly, he sought to break my will, to force me to serve him, to bind me to his blade..."]="Endlessly, he sought to break my will, to force me to serve him, to bind me to his blade..."
G["Endorel anuminor!"]="Endorel anuminor!"
G["Enemies approach! Call for me when you are at a safe location."]="Enemies approach! Call for me when you are at a safe location."
G["Enemies are closing in on us from all sides, and all the elders talk of abandoning this post. I say we should stand and fight like the warriors we are."]="Os inimigos estão se aproximando de todos os lados, e todos os anciãos falam em abandonar esse cargo. Eu digo que devemos ficar de pé e lutar como os guerreiros que somos."
G["Enemies have reached the door!  Move in!  We must hold!"]="Enemies have reached the door!  Move in!  We must hold!"
G["Enemies litter this isle, both old and new. We will not gain a foot of ground here without spilling blood for it."]="Esta ilha está cheia de inimigos novos e antigos por igual. Cada centímetro que ganemos o teremos que pagar com sangue."
G["Enemies of the Winterskorn, you will be torn limb from limb!"]="Inimigos dos Inbjerskorn, os arrancaremos extremidade atrás extremidade!"
G["Enemies of the flame are not welcome here!"]="Os inimigos da Chama não são bem-vindos aqui!"
G["Enemies spotted! Attack while I try to activate a Protector!"]="Enemies spotted! Attack while I try to activate a Protector!"
G["Enemies! SMASH!"]="Inimigos! APLASTAR!"
G["Enemies... everywhere! Kill! Kill them all!"]="Inimigos, por todas partes! Matem-nos! A todos!"
G["Enemy Lieutenant coming aboard, fend him off!"]="Tenente inimigo tratando de abordar. A por ele!"
