G["Enemy sighting!"]="Inimigo à visão!"
G["Enemy spotted! Fire!"]="Inimigo à visão! Fogo!"
G["Energy Conduits active, draw stable."]="Energy Conduits active, draw stable."
G["Energy Vortex ramping down."]="Vórtice de energia reduzindo."
G["Energy begins to arc across Onyxia's body as her electrical charge increases."]="Energy begins to arc across Onyxia's body as her electrical charge increases."
