G["Engaging self-preservation chip."]="Ativando processador de auto-preservação."
G["Engaging total destruction sequence. Good bye."]="Ativando sequência de destruição total. Adeus."
G["Engineering"]="Engineering (Engenharia)"
G["Engineering Supplies"]="Suprimentos de engenharia"
G["Engineering allows you to construct a wide variety of useful, amazing, and just plain weird items like rifles and scopes, motorcycles, and mechanical squirrels. However, many of these are only usable by yourself or other engineers, such as special goggles, mechanical additions to belts, boots, gloves and cloaks, and flying machines.\nMost raw Engineering materials are metals gathered by Mining, so the two professions pair well.\nMany creations require the use of a Blacksmith Hammer; this and other necessary materials, such as gun stocks or flux, may be purchased from trade or Engineering vendors."]="Engineering allows you to construct a wide variety of useful, amazing, and just plain weird items like rifles and scopes, motorcycles, and mechanical squirrels. However, many of these are only usable by yourself or other engineers, such as special goggles, mechanical additions to belts, boots, gloves and cloaks, and flying machines.\nMost raw Engineering materials are metals gathered by Mining, so the two professions pair well.\nMany creations require the use of a Blacksmith Hammer; this and other necessary materials, such as gun stocks or flux, may be purchased from trade or Engineering vendors."
G["Engineering will provide you with the skills and knowledge to dismantle your opponents! Let me show you how..."]="A engenharia fornecerá as habilidades e conhecimentos para desmontar seus oponentes! Deixa-me mostrar-te como..."
G["Engineers often train at Like Clockwork in the Magus Commerce Exchange, northwest Dalaran."]="Os engenheiros costumam treinar no Like Clockwork na Magus Commerce Exchange, noroeste de Dalaran."
G["Enjoy de rock, mon!"]="Aproveite a rocha, colega!"
G["Enjoy my fine wares."]="Aproveite de meus finas mercadorias."
G["Enjoy ride! Call me when you get there."]="Aproveitar viagem! Chamar-me quando você chegar."
G["Enjoy the fall!"]="Aproveite da cai!"
G["Enjoy the festivities!"]="Enjoy the festivities!"
G["Enjoy the refreshingly intelligent taste of all new Kaja'Cola!"]="Aproveite do novo sabor refrescantemente inteligente da nova Kaja'Cola!"
G["Enjoy the rest of your stay in Menethil. It won't last much longer."]="Aproveite do que te ocorrida de instância em Menethil. Não durará muito mais."
G["Enjoy the ride! It's a one way trip!"]="Aproveite do passeio! É um viagem somente de ida!"
G["Enjoy the storm warm bloods!"]="Enjoy the storm warm bloods!"
G["Enjoy the taste of fel iron?"]="Enjoy the taste of fel iron?"
G["Enjoy the taste of victory, for now. Next time we fight, you will taste the bitterness of defeat.\n\nIn fact, I think I'll name my next brew that. \"The Bitterness of Defeat.\" Doesn't roll of the tongue but it takes a special kind of failure to make one drink a brew named that."]="Aproveite do sabor da vitória. A próxima vez que nos enfrentemos saborearás o amargor da derrota.\n\nDe feito, acho que vou chamar assim a meu próxima cerveja. \"O amargor da derrota\". Não é que seja muito atractivo que digamos, mas há falta uma derrota especial para que alguém se beba algo com esse nome."
G["Enjoy the trip to Ratchet, $n!"]="Aproveite do seu viagna Trinquete, $n!"
G["Enjoy this well earned brew. The recipe has been in my family for over ten thousand years. Once enjoyed by the Monkey King himself, they say."]="Enjoy this well earned brew. The recipe has been in my family for over ten thousand years. Once enjoyed by the Monkey King himself, they say."
G["Enjoy your final moments."]="Enjoy your final moments."
G["Enjoy your hollow victory, insects. (The darkness comes...) May it console you as your world rots."]="Enjoy your hollow victory, insects. (The darkness comes...) May it console you as your world rots."
G["Enjoy your small victory while you can, mortals. It will not stop my eventual triumph over this land!"]="Enjoy your small victory while you can, mortals. It will not stop my eventual triumph over this land!"
G["Enjoy your tour of Pandaria's most ancient and respected silk farm."]="Enjoy your tour of Pandaria's most ancient and respected silk farm."
G["Enjoy!  You won't find better ale anywhere!"]="A aproveitar! Não existe melhor cerveja que esta!"
G["Enjoying the Fire Festival?"]="Apreciando o Festival do Fogo?"
G["Enjoying the Midsummer Fire Festival, $c?"]="Enjoying the Midsummer Fire Festival, $c?"
G["Enjoying the festival, $c?\n\nWhile the Flame Keepers tend to the fires of the present, I am more of a historian, keeping close the festivals past. I'm also, of course, documenting this year's festivities. Things are going well thus far, don't you think?\n\nYou know, $n, there is power inherent in all festival fires burning throughout the holiday. We're taking care of ours, but I'm certain there are sacred flames burning deep within our enemy's cities..."]="Enjoying the festival, $c?\n\nWhile the Flame Keepers tend to the fires of the present, I am more of a historian, keeping close the festivals past. I'm also, of course, documenting this year's festivities. Things are going well thus far, don't you think?\n\nYou know, $n, there is power inherent in all festival fires burning throughout the holiday. We're taking care of ours, but I'm certain there are sacred flames burning deep within our enemy's cities..."
G["Enjoying the festival, $c?\n\nWhile the Flame Wardens tend to the fires of the present, I am more of a historian, keeping close the festivals past. I'm also, of course, documenting this year's festivities. Things are going well thus far, don't you think?\n\nYou know, $n, there is power inherent in all festival fires burning throughout the holiday. We're taking care of ours, but I'm certain there are sacred flames burning deep within our enemy's cities..."]="Enjoying the festival, $c?\n\nWhile the Flame Wardens tend to the fires of the present, I am more of a historian, keeping close the festivals past. I'm also, of course, documenting this year's festivities. Things are going well thus far, don't you think?\n\nYou know, $n, there is power inherent in all festival fires burning throughout the holiday. We're taking care of ours, but I'm certain there are sacred flames burning deep within our enemy's cities..."
G["Enjoying the festival, $c? My wares can give an extra kick to your day. Nothing like warm food and drink!\n\nAnd if you haven't tried it yet, get a friend or two and celebrate around the ribbon pole; it's sure to lift your spirits!"]="Enjoying the festival, $c? My wares can give an extra kick to your day. Nothing like warm food and drink!\n\nAnd if you haven't tried it yet, get a friend or two and celebrate around the ribbon pole; it's sure to lift your spirits!"
G["Enjoying your stay? One dip in the steam pools and you come out looking 10 years younger. Just look at me if you want proof!"]="Te o está passando bem? Te metes uma sozinha vez nas Charcos Vaporosas e sales 10 anos mais jovem. Mírame a mim se que provas!"
G["Enjoying yourselves?"]="Estão aproveitando?"
G["Enough Rommath! The Sin'dorei must be free from the yoke of the Horde!"]="Enough Rommath! The Sin'dorei must be free from the yoke of the Horde!"
G["Enough about pandaren history. Let's talk about your people, traveler."]="Mas já basta de história pandaren. Hablemos um pouco sobre seu povo."
G["Enough crazy talk from you worms. More work!"]="Enough crazy talk from you worms. More work!"
G["Enough dilly dallying supplicant! I demand you assemble my body."]="Já basta de excusas, suplicante! Te ordeno que reconstruyas meu corpo!"
G["Enough distractions!"]="Enough distractions!"
G["Enough fighting! Let's finish this and get outa here!"]="Basta de pelear! Acabemos isto e vamos de aqui!"
G["Enough fooling around. It's time for some hands-on management!"]="Já está bem de marear a perdiz. É hora de que aqui tenha uma direção ativa!"
G["Enough foreplay. Let's get down to business."]="Já basta de jogos. Vamos ao grano."
G["Enough games!"]="Basta de jogos!"
G["Enough hiding, little ones!"]="Enough hiding, little ones!"
G["Enough hiding. It's time to take the fight to the iron dwarves."]="Chega de se esconder. É hora de lutar com os anões de ferro."
G["Enough idle banter! Our champions have arrived - support them as we push our way through the hall!"]="Enough idle banter! Our champions have arrived - support them as we push our way through the hall!"
G["Enough jawing! There's our ride."]="Basta de charlas! Aí vem nosso navio."
G["Enough lessons!  It's time for action!"]="Basta de lições! É a hora da ação!"
G["Enough messing around! There's a war going on here!"]="Basta de perder o tempo! Aí há uma guerra!"
G["Enough moving around! Hold still while I blow them all up!"]="De de mover! Quieto enquanto os estalho a todos."
G["Enough of my ramblings.  The trail leads here.  That entire building is covered in plants with leaves like the one we found."]="Basta de divagações. O rastro termina aqui. Esse edifício está coberto de plantas com lâminas como a que temos encontrado."
G["Enough of my regrets.  This is the building.  Let's check it out."]="Basta de lamentos. Este é o edifício. Registrémoslo."
G["Enough of this charade!"]="Basta de tanta farsa!"
G["Enough of this foolishness!"]="Chega dessa tolice!"
G["Enough of this insolence! Prepare to die!"]="Suficiente insolência! Prepare-se a morrer!"
G["Enough of this insolence.  Do you think that I'm blind to everything that goes on outside of the Undercity?"]="Basta com o seu insolência. Acha que não vejo nada do que passa fosse de Cidade Baixa?"
G["Enough of this!"]="Já basta!"
G["Enough of this!  Now I call upon the fury of the cosmos itself."]="Enough of this!  Now I call upon the fury of the cosmos itself."
G["Enough of this! Come now, weaklings. You have earned your reward. You may now face the Iron Qon."]="Enough of this! Come now, weaklings. You have earned your reward. You may now face the Iron Qon."
G["Enough of this.  The Cult of the Damned doesn't need Andorhal.  This worthless city is yours to fight over."]="Enough of this.  The Cult of the Damned doesn't need Andorhal.  This worthless city is yours to fight over."
G["Enough of your blather! Knights, forward!"]="Enough of your blather! Knights, forward!"
G["Enough of your games! You won't live to do it again."]="Enough of your games! You won't live to do it again."
G["Enough of your interference, $r! Spiritclaws! Deal with this pest!"]="Enough of your interference, $r! Spiritclaws! Deal with this pest!"
G["Enough of your pesky pea-shooters. Let them shoot at this!"]="Enough of your pesky pea-shooters. Let them shoot at this!"
G["Enough prattling. Let them come. We shall grind their bones to dust."]="Basta de palabrería. Que venham! Faremos poeira seus ossos."
G["Enough slacking! You're behind schedule..."]="Basta de vagância! Leva atraso..."
G["Enough talk you two!  Commence fighting!"]="Enough talk you two!  Commence fighting!"
G["Enough talk.  By the time I'm through with you, not even the worgs are going to want to go near your corpse."]="Enough talk.  By the time I'm through with you, not even the worgs are going to want to go near your corpse."
G["Enough talk. You know how precarious our position is. Between the Alliance and the Thunder King, only with the help of heroes like you can we hope to succeed here."]="Basta de cháchara. Já sabe o precaria que é nossa posição. Entre a Aliança e o Rei do Trovão, os heróis como você são a única esperança."
G["Enough toying around! It's time to get my hands dirty!"]="Enough toying around! It's time to get my hands dirty!"
G["Enough with the rambling. I am starving! Now, get your dusty shell into that ocean and bring momma some grub."]="Enough with the rambling. I am starving! Now, get your dusty shell into that ocean and bring momma some grub."
G["Enough with the stick already!"]="Já vale com o palo!"
G["Enough!"]="Basta!"
G["Enough!  Drawing upon this source will set us back months.  You should feel honored to be worthy of its expenditure.  Now... die!"]="Enough!  Drawing upon this source will set us back months.  You should feel honored to be worthy of its expenditure.  Now... die!"
G["Enough!  I grow tired of you!"]="Basta! Já me e cansado de ti!"
G["Enough!  I will not stand for this!"]="Enough!  I will not stand for this!"
G["Enough!  I will take care of these fools myself!"]="Enough!  I will take care of these fools myself!"
G["Enough!  I will teach you some manners, wench!"]="Enough!  I will teach you some manners, wench!"
G["Enough!  I've made up my mind.  We need Crowley on our side."]="Basta! Já o e decidido. precisamos de Crowley conosco."
G["Enough!  The Earthen Ring will temporarily stop the invasion.  But be warned, the elementals will return!"]="Já basta! O Anel da Terra detendrá temporariamente a invasão. Mas estão avisados, os elementais voltarão!"
G["Enough!  The Earthen Ring will temporarily stop the invasion.  But bewarned, the elementals will return!"]="Basta! O Anel da Terra detendrá a invasão de forma temporário. Mas te avisamos: os elementais voltarão!"
G["Enough!  You win... champion.  Tell that upstart that he has my blessing."]="Basta! Você ganha... Diga a esse presunçoso que conta com meu bênção."
G["Enough! (To His will all flesh succumbs. From His kingdom, chaos comes.) Yes - what he said."]="Enough! (To His will all flesh succumbs. From His kingdom, chaos comes.) Yes - what he said."
G["Enough! As much as I adore playing hostess, I have more pressing matters to attend to."]="Já basta. Por muito que me guste fazer de anfitriona, devo atender assuntos mais urgentes."
G["Enough! Do you want me to report to Garrosh that you asked us to bow to that Kirin Tor wench?!"]="Já basta! Que que relatório a Garrosh de que nos pediu que nos sometamos a essa bruxa do Kirin Tor?"
G["Enough! Have your cave, little shaman."]="Basssta! Fique seu caverna, pequeno xamã!"
G["Enough! I have had enough of you filthy warm bloods!"]="Enough! I have had enough of you filthy warm bloods!"
G["Enough! I see I must take matters into my own hands!"]="Basta! Vejo que devo fazer isto eu mesma."
G["Enough! I shall land and crush you myself!"]="Enough! I shall land and crush you myself!"
G["Enough! I shouldn't have questioned your orders..."]="Enough! I shouldn't have questioned your orders..."
G["Enough! I tire of these games!"]="Enough! I tire of these games!"
G["Enough! I will finish this."]="Enough! I will finish this."
G["Enough! I will no longer be contained!"]="Enough! I will no longer be contained!"
G["Enough! I will talk. Put your weapons away, it is not with me that you have quarrel with."]="Enough! I will talk. Put your weapons away, it is not with me that you have quarrel with."
G["Enough! I yield to your superior skills."]="Basta! Me inclino ante seus superior habilidades."
G["Enough! I'll handle you myself!"]="Enough! I'll handle you myself!"
G["Enough! I'll stain my hands with your blood! (Hyehahahaha! Murder! MURDER!)"]="Enough! I'll stain my hands with your blood! (Hyehahahaha! Murder! MURDER!)"
G["Enough! I've told you all that I know. Your continued abuse is senseless!"]="Basta! Te e contado tudo o que sei. Seu incessante abuso não tem sentido!"
G["Enough! Make it stop!"]="Enough! Make it stop!"
G["Enough! No more!"]="Basta! Não mais!"
G["Enough! Off to de spirit world wit' ya!"]="Enough! Off to de spirit world wit' ya!"
G["Enough! Playtime is over!"]="Já é suficiente! Se acabaram os jogos!"
G["Enough! Stay your hand!"]="Enough! Stay your hand!"
G["Enough! Survey the damage. What's this - an Alliance stronghold? They think to lay claim to this land already? NOT ON MY WATCH!"]="Enough! Survey the damage. What's this - an Alliance stronghold? They think to lay claim to this land already? NOT ON MY WATCH!"
G["Enough! Taste the full fury of High Warlord Naj'entus!"]="Enough! Taste the full fury of High Warlord Naj'entus!"
G["Enough! The realms will carry their weight or crumble beneath mine!"]="Enough! The realms will carry their weight or crumble beneath mine!"
G["Enough! Time to meet your end, invaders!"]="Já basta! Hora de morrer, invasores!"
G["Enough! We will relocate shortly. These creatures have destroyed most of what was left from the ship."]="Enough! We will relocate shortly. These creatures have destroyed most of what was left from the ship."
G["Enough! What is this about?!"]="Basta! De que vai isto?"
G["Enough! You have wasted too much of my time already. I will not be distracted by such insignificant creatures."]="Enough! You have wasted too much of my time already. I will not be distracted by such insignificant creatures."
G["Enough! You've bested my consort... and now YOU shall take her place!"]="Basta! ganhou a meu consorte... e agora VOCÊ ocuparás seu lugar!"
G["Enough!!"]="Já basta!"
G["Enough'a dis...Chief Sandscalp can't reward me if I'm dead, yah? Farewell, mon...for good."]="Enough'a dis...Chief Sandscalp can't reward me if I'm dead, yah? Farewell, mon...for good."
G["Enough, I will erase your very existence!"]="Enough, I will erase your very existence!"
G["Enough, Michael. Business is hurting enough with this scare as it is. We can use every copper."]="Já basta, Michael. O negócios já está sofrendo bastante com este susto. Podemos usar até a última moeda de cobre."
G["Enough, Shaman!"]="Basta, xamã!"
G["Enough, all of you! You have combated those who stole our children. That is reason enough for me to give you a chance to further prove yourself worthy of our trust."]="Enough, all of you! You have combated those who stole our children. That is reason enough for me to give you a chance to further prove yourself worthy of our trust."
G["Enough."]="Basta."
G["Enough. I have been apart from this for centuries. The well within this temple may be a pale spectre of the Well of Eternity, but it still holds the same... beauty. Purity."]="Enough. I have been apart from this for centuries. The well within this temple may be a pale spectre of the Well of Eternity, but it still holds the same... beauty. Purity."
G["Enough...stop..."]="Basta... Basta..."
