G["Enu thora'serador. This is a sacred place."]="Enu thora'serador. Este lugar é sagrado."
G["Eoin, there's a full well right there."]="Eoin, há um poço cheio logo aí."
G["Eonar, your servant calls for your blessing!"]="Eonar, seus servos piden seu bênção!"
G["Eonar, your servant requires aid!"]="Eonar, seus servos requerem sua ajuda!"
G["Eons I have slept undisturbed... Now this... Creatures of flesh, now you will BURN!"]="Eons I have slept undisturbed... Now this... Creatures of flesh, now you will BURN!"
G["Eons ago, the \"Titans\" came and cast down our Masters. But this is NOT their world, and it never was! Judgment comes at last!"]="Eons ago, the \"Titans\" came and cast down our Masters. But this is NOT their world, and it never was! Judgment comes at last!"
