G["Er, Dampwick, I need another miner...."]="Ehm, Mechamojada, preciso outro mineiro..."
G["Er... 'Moke?"]="Eh... 'Moke?"
G["Er... did you mention something about a Personal Arcane Assistant?"]="Eh... tem dito algo sobre um Ajudante Arcano pessoal?"
G["Er... that's how I found them.  I wanted to show the king that they were a threat!  Say Captain... I overheard Guard Fengus calling you a fat, useless gnoll lover!"]="É... foi assim que os encontrei. Eu queria mostrar ao rei que eles eram uma ameaça! Diga capitão... Ouvi o guarda Fengus chamando você de um amante gnoll gordo e inútil!"
G["Er...backup release valve?"]="Er...backup release valve?"
G["Eradicate."]="Erradicar."
G["Eradicate...."]="Erradicar..."
G["Eraka no Kimbul\nGod of Tigers, Lord of Beasts, King of Cats, the Prey's Doom\n\nUeetay no Mueh'zala\nGod of Death, Father of Sleep, Son of Time, the Night's Friend."]="Eraka não Kimbul\nDeus dos tigres, Senhor das beast, Rei dos gatos, Condena da presa\n\nUeetay não Mueh'zala\nDeus da morte, Para do sonho, Filho do tempo, o Amigo da noite."
G["Eranikus is here! Seek shelter! Safety!"]="Eranikus is here! Seek shelter! Safety!"
G["Eranikus, Tyrant of the Dream, has entered our world."]="Erânicos, Tirano do Sonho, entrou em nosso mundo."
G["Eranikus, Tyrant of the Dream, is wholly consumed by the Light of Elune. Tranquility sets in over the Moonglade."]="Eranikus, Tyrant of the Dream, is wholly consumed by the Light of Elune. Tranquility sets in over the Moonglade."
G["Erm... I really don't know you that well, sorry.  I mean, as an authorized Mechano-strider dealer, I really only can sell my mounts to those people who are considered a friend of the gnomes.  If you ever are recognized as friendly to Gnomeregan, I'd be happy to show you what I have to offer."]="Erm... I really don't know you that well, sorry.  I mean, as an authorized Mechano-strider dealer, I really only can sell my mounts to those people who are considered a friend of the gnomes.  If you ever are recognized as friendly to Gnomeregan, I'd be happy to show you what I have to offer."
G["Erm... I really don't know you that well, sorry.  I mean, as an authorized Mechano-strider dealer, I really only can sell my mounts to those people who are considered exalted amongst the gnomes.  If you ever are recognized as exalted to Gnomeregan, I'd be happy to show you what I have to offer."]="Erm... eu mesmo não te conheço tão bem, desculpe. Quero dizer, como revendedor autorizado de mecânicos, eu mesmo só posso vender minhas montarias para aquelas pessoas que são consideradas exaltadas entre os gnomos. Se você for reconhecido como exaltado por Gnomeregan, ficarei feliz em mostrar o que tenho a oferecer."
G["Erma does all the caring for animals around here.  She's right outside the Lion's Pride Inn if you need to speak with her."]="Erma cuida de todos os animais por aqui. Ela está do lado de fosse do Lion's Pride Inn, se você precisar falar com ela."
G["Err, sorry... Let me put that another way."]="Err, sorry... Let me put that another way."
G["Err... What was that?"]="Eh... que foi isso?"
G["Error: Attempt to write to protected memory. Resolution: Move at enemy and self-destruct."]="Error: Attempt to write to protected memory. Resolution: Move at enemy and self-destruct."
G["Error: Divide by zero. Resolution: SELF DESTRUCT INITIATED."]="Error: Divide by zero. Resolution: SELF DESTRUCT INITIATED."
G["Erunak examines the shard and nods in agreement."]="Erunak examine o fragmento e asiente para mostrar seu acordo."
G["Erunak! Behind you!"]="Erunak! Atrás de você!"
G["Erunak! Noooo!"]="Erunak! Nããoo!"
G["Erunak! We don't have time for this..."]="Erunak! Não temos tempo para isto..."
G["Erunak, take a look at this. This looks like a sufficient focus for the vision magics I was speaking to you about."]="Erunak, take a look at this. This looks like a sufficient focus for the vision magics I was speaking to you about."
G["Esbina will be happy to take care of your animal companion, my friend. She waits outside the inn within Azure Watch."]="Esbina ficará feliz em cuidar do seu companheiro animal, meu amigo. Ela espera do lado de fosse da pousada no Azure Watch."
G["Escaping from this place is proving harder than I thought.\n\nWhere do you go when there is nowhere to go in sight?"]="Escaping from this place is proving harder than I thought.\n\nWhere do you go when there is nowhere to go in sight?"
G["Escort Dumass out of the mine safely. Keep Dumass away from webbed humans."]="Escolta a Dumass até que saia da mina. Aléjalo dos humanos enredados."
G["Escort caravans to earn bonus Kor'kron supplies!"]="Escolta caravanas para ganhar suprimentos Kor'kron adicionais!"
G["Esha the Loommaiden is renowned for her cloth skills.\n\nShe works in the chamber of masters, to the left as you enter the building.\n\nI will mark the location on your map."]="Esha the Loommaiden is renowned for her cloth skills.\n\nShe works in the chamber of masters, to the left as you enter the building.\n\nI will mark the location on your map."
G["Especially Hao! Liu Lang once said, \"Noble is he who always asks questions.\""]="sobre tudo de Hao! Liu Lang disse uma vez: \"Noble aquele que sempre faça perguntas\"."
G["Especially venoms that affect the mind."]="Especialmente os que afetam à mente."
G["Essentially that is correct."]="Isso é esêncialmente correto."
G["Essentially, it's going to be a long, long time till we are ready to launch.  Maybe you should just head back home to your family."]="Essentially, it's going to be a long, long time till we are ready to launch.  Maybe you should just head back home to your family."
G["Etched into a tablet of pure gold was the embodiment of my remorse, shame, regret, and sorrow. Unfortunately, the Twilight's Hammer found the tablet and branded me a blasphemer. I was summarily executed, my prayer to Elune incomplete. I am now bound to this world as a spirit, unable to transcend to the Nether; held in this cage as a warning to all that would betray the faith of the Twilight's Hammer."]="Etched into a tablet of pure gold was the embodiment of my remorse, shame, regret, and sorrow. Unfortunately, the Twilight's Hammer found the tablet and branded me a blasphemer. I was summarily executed, my prayer to Elune incomplete. I am now bound to this world as a spirit, unable to transcend to the Nether; held in this cage as a warning to all that would betray the faith of the Twilight's Hammer."
G["Eternal agony awaits you!"]="Os espera a agonia eterna!"
G["Eternal damnation is your future."]="A condenação eterna é seu futuro."
G["Eternal suffering awaits!"]="O sofrimento eterno espera!"
G["Ethereal Summoner"]="Conjurador Etéreo"
G["Etu Magmothregar, cha!"]="Etu Magmothregar, cha!"
G["Eugh, what do you want? Can't you see I'm busy?"]="Uf, que que? Não vê que estou ocupado?"
G["Eunice Burch cooks what passes for food here over in the Trade Quarter. It's your stomach, not mine."]="Eunice Burch cozinha o que passa por comida aqui no Trade Quarter. É seu estômago, não meu."
G["Eunice Burch sell leftover parts.  You find her in Trade Quarter."]="Eunice Burch vende sobras de peças. Você a encontra no Trade Quarter."
G["Eureka!"]="Eureka!"
G["Eva, I have lost the Spectral Essence. I need another."]="Eva, eu perdi a Essência Espectral. Eu preciso de outro"
G["Evacuate Thunder Bluff!  Stay away from the sides of the bluff!"]="Evacuate Thunder Bluff!  Stay away from the sides of the bluff!"
G["Evacuate the city!  Clear the streets of Stormwind!"]="Evacuate the city!  Clear the streets of Stormwind!"
G["Evade, evade!"]="Evasiva, evasiva!"
G["Even Frenzyheart know all about you after you come to Sholazar. Maybe you teach Kekek your tricks?"]="Even Frenzyheart know all about you after you come to Sholazar. Maybe you teach Kekek your tricks?"
G["Even Hao?"]="Até de Hao?"
G["Even I have my limitations! Go talk to Lavinia Crowe in Undercity if you wish to further your training."]="Até eu tenho minhas limitações! Vá falar com Lavinia Crowe na Cidade Baixa, se você deseja seguir seu treinamento."
G["Even a blood elf can hold a sword."]="Até um elfo de sangue empunha uma lâmina."
G["Even a simple hozen like Tak-Tak can see that!"]="Até um hozen komo Tak-Tak se da conta!"
G["Even a target dummy could work faster than you! Pick it up!"]="Even a target dummy could work faster than you! Pick it up!"
G["Even after I gifted him with that form, he insisted on keeping me trapped. He even hoarded all the souls just so I couldn't have any...so stubborn."]="Even after I gifted him with that form, he insisted on keeping me trapped. He even hoarded all the souls just so I couldn't have any...so stubborn."
G["Even after our mortal flesh had rotted away, it leeched hope from our souls. It was unending!"]="Inclusive depois de que nossa carne mortal se descompusiera, absorveu a esperança de nossas almas. Era interminável!"
G["Even as my health fails me... it's my duty to serve... the Clans!"]="Even as my health fails me... it's my duty to serve... the Clans!"
G["Even as we speak, $c, all of the war materiel is being transported over to Silithus. By the looks of things, all of it should arrive in less than $2113w days. After that, a $g hero : heroine; will need to come along and ring the gong at the Scarab Dais. Then the war will begin in earnest."]="Even as we speak, $c, all of the war materiel is being transported over to Silithus. By the looks of things, all of it should arrive in less than $2113w days. After that, a $g hero : heroine; will need to come along and ring the gong at the Scarab Dais. Then the war will begin in earnest."
G["Even as we speak, $c, all of the war materiel is being transported over to Silithus. By the looks of things, the last of it should arrive in less than a day. After that, a $g hero : heroine; will need to come along and ring the gong at the Scarab Dais. Then the war will begin in earnest."]="Even as we speak, $c, all of the war materiel is being transported over to Silithus. By the looks of things, the last of it should arrive in less than a day. After that, a $g hero : heroine; will need to come along and ring the gong at the Scarab Dais. Then the war will begin in earnest."
G["Even as we speak, Taran Zhu and the Shado-Pan march west. When they find the sha, justice will be done."]="Taran Zhu e o Shadopan estão avançando para o oeste agora mesmo. Quando encuentren ao sha, se fará justiça."
G["Even better news than I was hoping. I look forward to a warm bed."]="É ainda melhor do que esperava. Preciso uma boa cabeçadita."
G["Even better than rations. Rest. I thought I'd be out here a while yet."]="Isto é inclusive melhor que a comida. Descanso. Pensei que estaria aqui ainda mais tempo."
G["Even better, can you just show me on my map?"]="Even better, can you just show me on my map?"
G["Even big orc general, Nazgrim! He talk so loud! Tak-Tak hear everything!"]="Esse grande geral orko, Nazgrim! Fala muito alto! Tak-Tak ouça tudo!"
G["Even death may die."]="Inclusive a morte poderá morrer."
G["Even death will not free you from my grasp!"]="Nem sequer a morte te librará de mim!"
G["Even death will not keep me from my duty to watch over the camp..."]="Nem a morte me impedirá cumprir meu dever de vigilar o acampamento..."
G["Even death won't prevent me from uncovering the secrets of my son!"]="Nem a morte impedirá que descubraos segredos de meu filho!"
G["Even demons are capable of fear..."]="Inclusive os demônios sienten medo..."
G["Even dying here beats spending another day collecting reagents for that madman, Finklestein."]="Even dying here beats spending another day collecting reagents for that madman, Finklestein."
G["Even foolish hozen know ikk is worse than anything. Don't eat dook, don't touch ikk!"]="Even foolish hozen know ikk is worse than anything. Don't eat dook, don't touch ikk!"
G["Even here I find myself beset by fools!"]="Even here I find myself beset by fools!"
G["Even here in the wilds, you seek out learning. Your drive for knowledge is an admirable trait."]="Even here in the wilds, you seek out learning. Your drive for knowledge is an admirable trait."
G["Even here, among the surf and sun, I can feel the darkness that lurks in these lands.\n\nIt's fascinating, don't you think?"]="Inclusive aqui, entre o surfe e o sol, posso sentir que a escuridão camina por estar terras.\n\nÉ fascinante, não acha?"
G["Even here, among the surf and sun, I can feel the darkness that lurks in these lands.\n\nIt's fascinating, isn't it?"]="Inclusive aqui, entre o surfe e o sol, posso sentir que a escuridão camina por estar terras.\n\nÉ fascinante, não?"
G["Even if I did, fool, do you think I'd just let you take it from me?  The only way you'd ever get it - if I did possess it - is to pry it from my cold, dead fingers.\n\nThat, my little friend, will not be happening any time soon."]="Even if I did, fool, do you think I'd just let you take it from me?  The only way you'd ever get it - if I did possess it - is to pry it from my cold, dead fingers.\n\nThat, my little friend, will not be happening any time soon."
G["Even if this potion works...  we just can't have worgen running amok in our town, Krennan."]="Even if this potion works...  we just can't have worgen running amok in our town, Krennan."
G["Even if this potion works... we can't just have worgen running around our town, Krennan."]="Even if this potion works... we can't just have worgen running around our town, Krennan."
G["Even if we could defend ourselves they outnumber us! There is no way we will win!"]="Even if we could defend ourselves they outnumber us! There is no way we will win!"
G["Even if you somehow managed to free us without defeating C'Thun, we would focus all of our powers to see the beast banished back to the hell from whence it came - AT ANY COST."]="Mesmo se você de alguma forma conseguisse nos liberar sem derrotar C'Thun, concentraríamos todos os nossos poderes em ver a besta banida de volta ao inferno de onde veio - A QUALQUER CUSTO."
G["Even in Darnassus we have noticed the earth is at odds with something."]="Even in Darnassus we have noticed the earth is at odds with something."
G["Even in death there will be no escape for you!"]="Even in death there will be no escape for you!"
G["Even in death we serve."]="Servimos até na morte."
G["Even in my dreams, I could hear their dark thoughts... HER dark thoughts."]="Even in my dreams, I could hear their dark thoughts... HER dark thoughts."
G["Even in my sleep, I hear her terror."]="Even in my sleep, I hear her terror."
G["Even in peace there is still war, and many clans still fight beneath the banner of the Warchief. Are you here to add your clan to those that fight for Orgrimmar?"]="Mesmo em paz, ainda há guerra, e muitos clãs ainda lutam sob a bandeira do Chefe Guerreiro. Você está aqui para adicionar seu clã àqueles que lutam por Orgrimmar?"
G["Even in ruin, nature remembers. These roots still drink from Elune’s grace."]="Even in ruin, nature remembers. These roots still drink from Elune’s grace."
G["Even in their own time of need, the pandaren have graciously offered to share food and a place by the fire.\n\nThe rest of us could learn a lot from them."]="Even in their own time of need, the pandaren have graciously offered to share food and a place by the fire.\n\nThe rest of us could learn a lot from them."
G["Even in these bright days after the reign of Kel'thuzad, after the fall of the Lich King: the Brotherhood lives on."]="Mesmo nestes dias claros após o reinado de Kel'thuzad, após a cai do Rei Lich: a Irmandade continua viva."
G["Even in this remote corner of the world, know that Hellscream's eyes are upon you."]="Mesmo neste canto remoto do mundo, saiba que os olhos de Hellscream estão sobre você."
G["Even in times of great strife like these, food is always needed and appreciated. It makes the hours I spend cooking well worth it."]="Even in times of great strife like these, food is always needed and appreciated. It makes the hours I spend cooking well worth it."
G["Even in undeath, you are useless."]="Inclusive na não-morte, é um inútil."
G["Even more reason to believe that he's still alive."]="Mais razão para acreditar que continua vivo."
G["Even my talents have a limit, and you have reached it. Congratulations, $n. Your next stop should be Camp Mojache in Feralas. The tauren Hahrana Ironhide lives there; she is renowned for her skill."]="Even my talents have a limit, and you have reached it. Congratulations, $n. Your next stop should be Camp Mojache in Feralas. The tauren Hahrana Ironhide lives there; she is renowned for her skill."
G["Even now an airship draws near; its arcane payload will flatten Theramore Isle and everyone still standing upon it."]="Agora mesmo se aproxima uma nave. Seu munição arcana arrasará Ilha Theramore e a todos seus habitantes."
G["Even now, da true emperor of Pandaria lives and breathes once more."]="Agora, o VERDADEIRO imperador de Pandária vive e respira uma vez mais."
G["Even now, free-willed undead battle the League of Arathor in Arathi Basin.  Will you aid the Defilers in defeating the humans and their Alliance allies?"]="Mesmo agora, mortos-vivos de vontade própria batalham contra a Liga de Arathor na Bacia Arathi. Você ajudará os Profanadores a derrotar os humanos e seus aliados da Aliança?"
G["Even now, in our darkest hour, they mock us!"]="Even now, in our darkest hour, they mock us!"
G["Even now, in the darkest of times, the teachings of the Light will guide you throught this world."]="Mesmo agora, nos tempos mais sombrios, os ensinamentos da Luz o guiarão através deste mundo."
G["Even now, my power grows. I have long waited for the day when my revenge would be complete."]="Even now, my power grows. I have long waited for the day when my revenge would be complete."
G["Even now, nothing. Why? Why would the Light forsake the innocent?"]="Nada, nem sequer agora. Por que? Por que abandona a Luz aos inocentes?"
G["Even now, our ally is working to open the portal on his side. And now, we will begin."]="Even now, our ally is working to open the portal on his side. And now, we will begin."
G["Even now, the elements are tearing you apart - and they shall feed upon your doubts and fears 'til the last spark of life on this wretched world has been snuffed out."]="Even now, the elements are tearing you apart - and they shall feed upon your doubts and fears 'til the last spark of life on this wretched world has been snuffed out."
G["Even now, the true battle between the forces of Light and Darkness approaches. We will all be called to join, and in the face of this conflict, all mortal suffering will be meaningless."]="Even now, the true battle between the forces of Light and Darkness approaches. We will all be called to join, and in the face of this conflict, all mortal suffering will be meaningless."
G["Even now, while our enemies crash and surge all around us - he refuses to move - to act! Go'el, my love... you can be infuriating sometimes."]="Even now, while our enemies crash and surge all around us - he refuses to move - to act! Go'el, my love... you can be infuriating sometimes."
G["Even on the glacier itself, the sun manages to peek through the gloom. I have hope, Tahu. I think we'll make it through this, no matter how dire it looks."]="Even on the glacier itself, the sun manages to peek through the gloom. I have hope, Tahu. I think we'll make it through this, no matter how dire it looks."
G["Even shattered into countless pieces, the crystals all around weaken me... perhaps I should not have underestimated the titans so..."]="Even shattered into countless pieces, the crystals all around weaken me... perhaps I should not have underestimated the titans so..."
G["Even slight alterations to a potion's ingredients can change it fundamentally. Patience and precision, young one: they will serve you well in all walks of life."]="Mesmo pequenas alterações nos ingredientes de uma poção podem alterá-a fundamentalmente. Paciência e precisão, jovem: elas o servirão bem em todas as esferas da vida."
G["Even the Light is no match for the indomitable will of our people."]="Inclusive a Luz não é rival para a vontade indomável de nosso povo."
G["Even the bravest warrior must be well supplied if he is to face his foes with strength!"]="Even the bravest warrior must be well supplied if he is to face his foes with strength!"
G["Even the brown skinned orcs take longer to die. What a waste... next!"]="Even the brown skinned orcs take longer to die. What a waste... next!"
G["Even the darkest memory fades when confronted!"]="Even the darkest memory fades when confronted!"
G["Even the forest's lovely flowers were turned against us..."]="Até as preciosas flores do florestas se voltam em nossa contra..."
G["Even the mighty Thunder King fell before our champion's might."]="Até o próprio Rei Trovão caiu diante de sua força."
G["Even the mighty... can fall."]="Inclusive os poderosos... podem cair."
G["Even the most superficial glimpse into the secrets I hold would drive you mad, $c."]="Even the most superficial glimpse into the secrets I hold would drive you mad, $c."
G["Even the skies burn with my fury!"]="Even the skies burn with my fury!"
G["Even the smallest demon can be valuable, in large enough numbers."]="Mesmo o menor demônio pode ser útil, se for em quantidade suficiente."
G["Even the smoke of their burning camp wreaks of futility and shame."]="Even the smoke of their burning camp wreaks of futility and shame."
G["Even the strongest ally can fall to draconic magic."]="Até o aliado mais forte pode não resistir à magia dragônica."
G["Even the toads? Unbelievable!"]="Inclusive o sapos? Incrível!"
G["Even the very air is ripe with sadness."]="Até o mesmo ar rezume tristeza."
G["Even the walking dead need to mend themselves. Mary Edras handles it here. She's in the Rogues' Quarter, on the inner ring."]="Até os mortos-vivos precisam se consertar. Mary Edras lida com isso aqui. Ela está no Bairro dos Ladinos, no ringue interno."
G["Even though these presents are empty, they help remind me of old friends and better times."]="Even though these presents are empty, they help remind me of old friends and better times."
G["Even though we are situatated a distance away from the main island, our mission here is still important."]="Inclusive a pesar de que estamos bastante longe da ilha principal, nossa missão aqui é importantes."
G["Even together... we failed..."]="Ainda juntos... temos fracassado..."
G["Even verbal."]="Até verbal."
G["Even with enemies at our door step, the light and song of the crystals have sustained us."]="Even with enemies at our door step, the light and song of the crystals have sustained us."
G["Even with the Aspect of Time on your side, you stumble foolishly into a trap?"]="Even with the Aspect of Time on your side, you stumble foolishly into a trap?"
G["Even with this fiasco I am once again starting to hit my quota. Something is up with the Stormstout brewery lately in that they haven't been demanding quite as much grain as usual."]="Even with this fiasco I am once again starting to hit my quota. Something is up with the Stormstout brewery lately in that they haven't been demanding quite as much grain as usual."
G["Even within cold, stone walls such as the ones that shelter this town, one may find tranquility and peace.  In fact, you may find them everywhere you are... simply look inside yourself for such balance."]="Mesmo dentro de paredes de pedras frias, como as que abrigam esta cidade, pode-se encontrar tranquilidade e paz. De fato, você pode encontrá-os onde quer que esteja... simplesmente procure dentro de si mesmo esse equilíbrio."
G["Even you must admit that your information from defectors is outdated and unreliable.  Let us make calculated attacks on these manaforges and gather what information we can."]="Inclusive você precisa admitir que seu informações sobre os desertores não está actualizada e é pouco fidedigna. Hagamos ataque calculados a essas Forjas de Mana e reunamos toda a informações que possamos."
G["Even your own blood can be made to serve!"]="Inclusive seu própria sangue pode servir!"
G["Even your strongest warriors succumb like lambs to the slaughter."]="Even your strongest warriors succumb like lambs to the slaughter."
G["Evenin', Gov'na."]="À noite, Gov'na."
G["Event heard. Spawn, damn you!"]="Event heard. Spawn, damn you!"
G["Eventually he grew very old, and visited Pandaria one final time."]="Ao fim, já muito velho, visitó Pandaria uma última vez."
G["Eventually, the Thunder King fell, and the Bell changed hands. Many tried to use its power. Some tried to silence its sound. All failed."]="Finalmente, o Rei Trovão foi derrotado e o Sino foi levado. Muitos tentaram usar seu poder. Outros tentaram silenciá-lo. Todos falharam."
G["Eventually, we will fight this battle for Andorhal, and only one of us can walk off of this battlefield victorious."]="Eventually, we will fight this battle for Andorhal, and only one of us can walk off of this battlefield victorious."
G["Ever been to Kun-Lai before? It's great. Long flowing farmlands. Beautiful mountains. And absolutely nothing dangerous whatsoever."]="Ever been to Kun-Lai before? It's great. Long flowing farmlands. Beautiful mountains. And absolutely nothing dangerous whatsoever."
G["Ever been to the Brewmoon Festival? It's a real treat. I'm preparing a big batch of my Kun-Lai Kicker for the celebration.\n\nWant to join me in Binan Village?"]="Ever been to the Brewmoon Festival? It's a real treat. I'm preparing a big batch of my Kun-Lai Kicker for the celebration.\n\nWant to join me in Binan Village?"
G["Ever heard of the Thorium Brotherhood?  Sure, we might look a lot like those dwarves down in the gorge, or in Blackrock Depths, but trust me: we're not anything like them.\n\nThose scoundrels dug too deep, and now they serve a darker force: Ragnaros, the Firelord.  We're happy to be more independent of will and purpose, although most of the time our purpose ends up being the prevention of whatever trouble they're causing."]="Ever heard of the Thorium Brotherhood?  Sure, we might look a lot like those dwarves down in the gorge, or in Blackrock Depths, but trust me: we're not anything like them.\n\nThose scoundrels dug too deep, and now they serve a darker force: Ragnaros, the Firelord.  We're happy to be more independent of will and purpose, although most of the time our purpose ends up being the prevention of whatever trouble they're causing."
G["Ever make a shark so mad it got out of the water and chased you on land?"]="Ever make a shark so mad it got out of the water and chased you on land?"
G["Ever met Tartek? He one of our best fighters... leads in the northwest. I hear he captured one of the dragon things. No lie, I a little jealous."]="Ever met Tartek? He one of our best fighters... leads in the northwest. I hear he captured one of the dragon things. No lie, I a little jealous."
G["Ever see a kracken before? Old Jin claims to have caught one, once upon a time, but let it go on acount of it looked too \"gamey.\"\n\nWe have a betting pool going to see if he ever finds it again."]="Ever see a kracken before? Old Jin claims to have caught one, once upon a time, but let it go on acount of it looked too \"gamey.\"\n\nWe have a betting pool going to see if he ever finds it again."
G["Ever since I crash landed on this shore, I been wanderin' all over, $r!\n\nI've been all the way from the Temple o' the Jade Serpent to the Krasarang coast to the top o' Mount Neverest herself!\n\nThis land is quite remarkable, and I been cataloging all o' my findings.\n\nI can't wait to tell my fellow colleagues at the Explorer's League about everything I've seen!"]="Ever since I crash landed on this shore, I been wanderin' all over, $r!\n\nI've been all the way from the Temple o' the Jade Serpent to the Krasarang coast to the top o' Mount Neverest herself!\n\nThis land is quite remarkable, and I been cataloging all o' my findings.\n\nI can't wait to tell my fellow colleagues at the Explorer's League about everything I've seen!"
G["Ever since his arrival from Drak'Tharon, the master has spoken of the time you would be joining him here."]="Desde que chegou de Drak'tharon, o mestre tem estado falando do momentos no que te unirías a ele aqui."
G["Ever since the Vale opened up its gates, we've been sending shipment after shipment of vegetables north."]="Ever since the Vale opened up its gates, we've been sending shipment after shipment of vegetables north."
G["Ever since the shadows claimed Duskwood I haven't been able to sleep. I am kept awake by the ghostly sounds of screaming on the breeze. It sounds almost like lambs screaming, and they won't stop."]="Desde que as sombras reivindicaram Duskwood, não consegui dormir. Sou mantido acordado pelos sons fantasmagóricos de gritar na brisa. Parece quase cordeiros gritando, e eles não param."
G["Ever since, now and then, people claim he's spoken to them and told them to get the eye..."]="Desde então, de vez em quando, a gente diz que ele lhes fala e que lhes diz que consigan o olho..."
G["Ever tried boiled butter battered kracken legs? Best thing ever."]="Ever tried boiled butter battered kracken legs? Best thing ever."
G["Ever trip over own feet? We have. Kind of hurt. No do it, not fun. Nope."]="Já tropeçou nos próprios pés? Nós temos. Tipo de mágoa. Não faça isso, não é divertido. Não."
G["Ever vigilant in their protection of the natural world, the druids are guided by Arch Druid Fandral Staghelm who resides in the Cenarion Enclave.  You will find him and the other Druid trainers in the northern section of Darnassus."]="Sempre vigilantes na proteção do mundo natural, os druidas são guiados pelo Arch Druid Fandral Staghelm, que reside no Enclave Cenarion. Você encontrará ele e os outros treinadores de druidas na seção norte de Darnassus."
G["Ever wonder what we do with all our obsolete robots? We send them to their deaths in bloody gladiatorial arenas, of course! Here comes Blingtron 3000!"]="Ever wonder what we do with all our obsolete robots? We send them to their deaths in bloody gladiatorial arenas, of course! Here comes Blingtron 3000!"
G["Eversong Woods, Dalfors. I'm thinking about how beautiful it was before Arthas cut a swathe of death through it..."]="O Floresta do Canto Eterno, Dalfors. Estava pensando no bonito que era antes de que Arthas o cubriera de morte..."
G["Every Life Rocket comes with a two-year contract and FREE non-arbitration clause!"]="Every Life Rocket comes with a two-year contract and FREE non-arbitration clause!"
G["Every Shado-Pan knows one another by name. We have trained together, fought together, and survived together.\n\nWhen you can say the same, then perhaps you are ready to join our brotherhood."]="Every Shado-Pan knows one another by name. We have trained together, fought together, and survived together.\n\nWhen you can say the same, then perhaps you are ready to join our brotherhood."
G["Every Shado-Pan makes three eternal oaths:\nTo defend this land, to protect its people, and to train their pupil.\nWhen a Shado-Pan dies, they must be released from these bonds."]="Todos os Shadopan fazem três juramentos eternos:\n\nDefenda esta terra, proteção ao seu gente e treinar aos seus pupilos.\n\nQuando um Shadopan morte, deve ser liberado de estas obligações."
G["Every action creates a reaction. Do you see what your actions have created?"]="Every action creates a reaction. Do you see what your actions have created?"
G["Every bodies coming..."]="Já vêm todos..."
G["Every day I archive something new, and something old. Sometimes it is an ancient scroll of wisdom. Sometimes it is a painting of the Vale an Inkmaster made.\n\nWe preserve the lore so that future generations will learn from our successes... and our failures."]="Every day I archive something new, and something old. Sometimes it is an ancient scroll of wisdom. Sometimes it is a painting of the Vale an Inkmaster made.\n\nWe preserve the lore so that future generations will learn from our successes... and our failures."
G["Every day I ask myself: \"What's the right thing to do?\""]="Todos os dias, eu me pergunto: \"Qual é a coisa certa a se fazer?\""
G["Every day is a test, and this day is no different. If you pass this test, I will share some of my knowledge..."]="Tudo dia é um teste, e esse dia não é diferente. Se você passar neste teste, compartilharei algum dos meus conhecimentos..."
G["Every dish is more delicious than the last!"]="Cada prato é mais delicioso que o anterior!"
G["Every elder reaches the day where he must pass on and plant his stave with the staves of his ancestors. Today is the day when my staff joins these woods."]="Every elder reaches the day where he must pass on and plant his stave with the staves of his ancestors. Today is the day when my staff joins these woods."
G["Every few days Xuen hosts a tournament of strength. Only the strongest and most brave challengers from across Pandaria dare compete."]="Every few days Xuen hosts a tournament of strength. Only the strongest and most brave challengers from across Pandaria dare compete."
G["Every few seconds, many of the nearby runes will burst with fire."]="Every few seconds, many of the nearby runes will burst with fire."
G["Every few years, he returned - with tales of mysterious cities in the sand, nomadic people living on endless grassy plains, a great empire under the ice, and a magical kingdom gilded in gold."]="A cada intervalo de alguns anos ele voltava - com histórias de cidades misteriosas na areia, nômades vivendo em planícies verdejantes sem fim, um grande império sob o gelo e um reino mágico recoberto em ouro."
G["Every generation, the mantid swarm the Serpent's Spine wall in great numbers. They murder many pandaren, so we kill many times their number in return. Yet each generation, they attack once more. Why do they do this?"]="A cada geração, os mantídeos enxameiam a muralha do Espinhaço da Serpente em grandes números. Eles matam muitos pandarens, e nós matamos outro tanto deles. E no entanto, a cada geração eles renovam o ataque. Por que eles fazem isso?"
G["Every item that I have for sale I acquired myself.  You have my personal guarantee of authenticity."]="Todos os itens que tenho à venda foram adquiridos. Você tem minha garantia pessoal de autenticidade."
G["Every life is a thread, and the tapestry we weave together is the story of our world. The pandaren lorewalkers know this more than any other. Just look at this library! So many stories..."]="Every life is a thread, and the tapestry we weave together is the story of our world. The pandaren lorewalkers know this more than any other. Just look at this library! So many stories..."
G["Every line, every stroke, helps define an image. It separates thought from parchment and seizes the attention of a viewer."]="Every line, every stroke, helps define an image. It separates thought from parchment and seizes the attention of a viewer."
G["Every orc you slay today will bring honor to them, and to every soldier who has come before you."]="Every orc you slay today will bring honor to them, and to every soldier who has come before you."
G["Every pandaren must search out and uncover their own fate. Whether a warrior or a farmer, we each have a place that suits us, and each place carries a unique importance."]="Todos os pandaren têm de procurar e descobrir seu próprio destino. Da igual ser guerreiro ou fazendeiro, todos temos um lugar que nos gosta e cada lugar é de uma importância única."
G["Every reprisal is itself an act of aggression, and every act of aggression triggers immediate reprisal."]="Every reprisal is itself an act of aggression, and every act of aggression triggers immediate reprisal."
G["Every sacrifice brings more of the master's heralds into this world. (The hives sing of madness, of chaos!)"]="Every sacrifice brings more of the master's heralds into this world. (The hives sing of madness, of chaos!)"
G["Every scrap used makes us less wasteful and brings us closer to the Earth Mother.  Mooranta can show you the way.  Seek her just outside the Thunder Bluff Armorers on the middle rise."]="Tudo pedaço usado nos torna menos desperdícios e nos aproxima da Mãe Terra. Mooranta pode mostrar o caminho. Procure-a do lado de fosse do Thunder Bluff Armorers no meio do caminho."
G["Every soldier matters."]="Todo soldado é importante."
G["Every speck of suffering in my life is YOUR PATHETIC FAULT! I SHOULD KILL YOU!"]="Every speck of suffering in my life is YOUR PATHETIC FAULT! I SHOULD KILL YOU!"
G["Every strike should deliver your final intent."]="Tudo acerto deve vir precedido pela maior concentração possível."
G["Every time I close my eyes I see the scourge surrounding me!\n\nI gotta get outta here...."]="Every time I close my eyes I see the scourge surrounding me!\n\nI gotta get outta here...."
G["Every time I fix this mailbox, it's vandalized again within a day."]="Every time I fix this mailbox, it's vandalized again within a day."
G["Every troll for himself, mon!"]="Cada troll precisa fazer o que mais lhe conviene!"
G["Every two years the Spirits of Competition grow especially fervent... and now is that time! Both Alliance and Horde wear this tabard into the Battlegrounds to honor the spirits, seeking to defeat all enemies and earn their favor."]="A cada dois anos, os Espíritos da Competição se tornam especialmente fervorosos... e agora é a hora! Tanto a Aliança quanto a Horda usam esse tabardo nos Campos de Batalha para honrar os espíritos, procurando derrotar todos os inimigos e conquistar seu favor."
G["Every two years the Spirits of Competition grow especially fervent... and now is that time! We wear this tabard into the Battlegrounds to honor them, seeking to defeat our enemies and earn their favor."]="A cada dois anos, os Espíritos da Competição se tornam especialmente fervorosos... e agora é a hora! Usamos esse tabardo nos Campos de Batalha para honrá-os, procurando derrotar nossos inimigos e conquistar seu favor."
G["Every villager counts. Without each grain of sand we would have no beach to enjoy the ocean from."]="Every villager counts. Without each grain of sand we would have no beach to enjoy the ocean from."
G["Every warrior that falls is one more for our mighty army.  There is no victory against us."]="Cada guerreiro que cai é um membro mais para nosso poderoso exército. A vitória contra nós não existe."
G["Every year, I make the pilgrimage to Hallow Wind Abbey to pay tribute to the Holy Light. I will not return to Northshire without fulfilling that duty."]="Every year, I make the pilgrimage to Hallow Wind Abbey to pay tribute to the Holy Light. I will not return to Northshire without fulfilling that duty."
