G["Everyone always says, \"Horton, why do you drive a boat up and down the river?\" I ask them, \"Why don't you?\"  ... that's usually where I run out of witty retorts."]="Everyone always says, \"Horton, why do you drive a boat up and down the river?\" I ask them, \"Why don't you?\"  ... that's usually where I run out of witty retorts."
