G["Everyone enjoying themselves so far?  That's great!  Welcome to the Darkmoon Faire, the greatest show in all of Outland!  Make sure that you speak with Yebb and his friends here while you're taking in Neblegear's Darkmoon Zoo Bizarre."]="Everyone enjoying themselves so far?  That's great!  Welcome to the Darkmoon Faire, the greatest show in all of Outland!  Make sure that you speak with Yebb and his friends here while you're taking in Neblegear's Darkmoon Zoo Bizarre."
