G["Everyone, calm down. This sounds like one of Garrosh's traps. He's trying to lure us from the beach. Troteman? Round me up some peasants and a mortar team, and don't let down your guard."]="Everyone, calm down. This sounds like one of Garrosh's traps. He's trying to lure us from the beach. Troteman? Round me up some peasants and a mortar team, and don't let down your guard."
G["Everyone, cheer!"]="Todos a animar!"
