G["Everyone... back to Splintertree at once!"]="Everyone... back to Splintertree at once!"
G["Everything I am, I owe to Arthas. I savor the moment when I can repay him for this torment.\n\nI have longed for the time when the Forsaken could take the fight against the Scourge to Northrend, but we need the rest of the Horde's support. Our numbers are not great unless bolstered by the other races in our alliance.\n\nArthas's latest attack on the Horde will hopefully convince Thrall to declare war on Icecrown. He'll have my support when that happens."]="Everything I am, I owe to Arthas. I savor the moment when I can repay him for this torment.\n\nI have longed for the time when the Forsaken could take the fight against the Scourge to Northrend, but we need the rest of the Horde's support. Our numbers are not great unless bolstered by the other races in our alliance.\n\nArthas's latest attack on the Horde will hopefully convince Thrall to declare war on Icecrown. He'll have my support when that happens."
G["Everything I have done... has been for Azeroth...."]="Tudo o que fiz... foi por Azeroth."
G["Everything has a spirit, if you learn to listen to it you can get it to take any shape you want. Blacksmithing isn't about beating metal, forcing it to do your will. It's about listening to the spirit within the steel and guiding it to the shape you know it wants to take."]="Everything has a spirit, if you learn to listen to it you can get it to take any shape you want. Blacksmithing isn't about beating metal, forcing it to do your will. It's about listening to the spirit within the steel and guiding it to the shape you know it wants to take."
G["Everything has been leading to this, $n. You must not fail, or all is lost and we will die with this island."]="Everything has been leading to this, $n. You must not fail, or all is lost and we will die with this island."
G["Everything here is completely on the up and up!"]="Tudo aqui está completamente em alta!"
G["Everything hurts. Please, make it stop..."]="Everything hurts. Please, make it stop..."
G["Everything is fine.  Look, there's too much to explain..."]="Tudo está bem. Olhe, há demais que explicar..."
G["Everything is going according to schedule.  Prince Kael'thas should be pleased."]="Everything is going according to schedule.  Prince Kael'thas should be pleased."
G["Everything is in place. We'll construct a town center on this peninsula, using resources from along the coast."]="Já está tudo pronto. Construiremos uma cidade nesta península usando os recurso que tenha na costa."
G["Everything is in readiness, warbringer."]="Tudo está disposto, belisario."
G["Everything is ok, you can go."]="Tudo bem, pode entrar."
