G["Everything suddenly seems... brighter."]="De repente, tudo parece... mais brilhante."
G["Everything that has happened since the crash is little more than a blur. It seems like a lifetime ago that I was aboard the Exodar.\n\nNow, my reality is restricted to this island with its mutant creatures and endless sea of blood elf agents. Soon, it will be as if I've never known anything different..."]="Everything that has happened since the crash is little more than a blur. It seems like a lifetime ago that I was aboard the Exodar.\n\nNow, my reality is restricted to this island with its mutant creatures and endless sea of blood elf agents. Soon, it will be as if I've never known anything different..."
G["Everything that we have, we have fought for tooth and tentacle... Retaking Telaar from the orcs and then the ogres was no easy task."]="Tudo o que temos, o temos conseguido lutando com dentes e tentáculos. Retomar Telaar dos orcs, e depois dos ogros, não foi tarefa fácil."
G["Everything that you are is MINE to destroy!"]="Tudo o que são é MEU e o posso destruir!"
