G["Excellent work."]="Excelente"
G["Excellent work. Don't let up!"]="Excelente trabalho. Sigam assim!"
G["Excellent work. The fire of my heart glows with a brilliant purity unmatched; every spark of it I will channel into the Dragon Soul."]="Excellent work. The fire of my heart glows with a brilliant purity unmatched; every spark of it I will channel into the Dragon Soul."
G["Excellent!"]="Excelente"
