G["Falthir, I have lost my Zandalar Predator's Mantle and need a replacement."]="Falthir, e perdido meu manto de predador Zandalariano e preciso outro."
G["Falthir, I need assistance in recovering a piece of my Madcap's Outfit."]="Falthir, preciso que me ajude a recuperar uma peça de meu Equipamento de sinconcierto."
G["Falthir, I need assistance in replacing a piece of my Predator's Armor."]="Falthir, preciso que me ajude a conseguir uma peça de meu Armadura de predador."
G["Falthir, I no longer have my Zandalar Predator's Bracers. Can you provide a new pair?"]="Falthir, I no longer have my Zandalar Predator's Bracers. Can you provide a new pair?"
G["Fan the Flames! \n\n\n|TInterface\\Icons\\INV_Misc_EngGizmos_04.blp:64|t"]="Avivar as chamas! \n\n\n|TInterface\\Icons\\INV_Misc_EngGizmos_04.blp:64|t"
G["Fancy yourself a chef?  Head to the Undercity south of town for your training.  You can catch the elevators heading down at the back of the Ruins of Lordaeron.  Talk to one of those lumbering Undercity Guardians for further assistance once you arrive."]="Gosta de um chef? Vá para a Cidade Baixa, ao sul da cidade, para o seu treinamento. Você pode pegar os elevadores descendo na parte de por trás das ruínas de Lordaeron. Converse com um desses pesados ​​Guardiões da Cidade Baixa para obter mais assistência quando chegar."
G["Fandral - what have they done to you?"]="Fandral... Mas que te têm feito?"
G["Fandral Staghelm carries the burden of our sins and our follies, and in so doing deserves the respect of us all."]="Fandral Staghelm carries the burden of our sins and our follies, and in so doing deserves the respect of us all."
G["Fandral Staghelm has returned as a ... \"Druid of the Flame?\"\n\nI fear one of my own may be implicated in this betrayal!"]="Fandral Staghelm has returned as a ... \"Druid of the Flame?\"\n\nI fear one of my own may be implicated in this betrayal!"
G["Fandral Staghelm."]="Fandral Corzocelada."
G["Fandral is corrupting fellow druids into something sinister. He may have other followers already - I must warn Moonglade."]="Fandral is corrupting fellow druids into something sinister. He may have other followers already - I must warn Moonglade."
G["Fandral sought to use that weakness against me..."]="Fandral intentó usar essa fraqueza contra mim..."
G["Fandral was a true leader. You are nothing more than a desperate dream."]="Fandral era um líder de verdade. Você não é mais que um sonho desesperado."
G["Fandral would never have allowed the Horde to attack our home! And who did Malfurion send to defend us? No one!"]="Fandral would never have allowed the Horde to attack our home! And who did Malfurion send to defend us? No one!"
G["Fandral! You escaped from prison?"]="Fandral! Tem escapado do seu prisão?"
G["Fandral! Your time has come! Go and hide in the Emerald Dream and pray we never find you!"]="Fandral! Chegou seu hora! Vê e escóndete no Sonho Esmeralda e reza para que nunca te encontremos!"
G["Fanlyr, what is going on here? I didn't authorize this."]="Fanlyr, que está passando aqui? Não e autorizado isto."
G["Fantastic then!  Let's get this thing fixed for you."]="Fantastic then!  Let's get this thing fixed for you."
G["Fantastic!"]="Fantástico!"
G["Fantastic! Aren't you the industrious one? Well, let's get started, shall we?"]="Fantástico! Você não é o trabalhador? Bem, vamos começar, si?"
G["Fantastic! Let's move on, shall we?"]="Estupendo! Sigamos, de acordo?"
G["Fantastic! Next, some protective spells. Yeah, now we're cookin'!"]="Fantástico! Agora algum feitiços protetores. Sim, isto marcha!"
G["Far from home, aren't you?"]="Está longe de casa, não?"
G["Far out, man. This bucket of bolts might make it after all..."]="Aparta, tio. Talvez este cubo de tornilhos o consiga depois de tudo..."
G["Far seer."]="Clarividente."
G["Far too powerful for these elementals, Caylais and her hippogryphs must have been struck down by something else."]="Far too powerful for these elementals, Caylais and her hippogryphs must have been struck down by something else."
G["Far, far away, in a land called Azeroth, I have an ally. He offers us his land. It is green and lush, filled with pure water and fat creatures to hunt."]="Muito, muito longe, em uma terra chamada Azeroth, tenho um aliado. Nos oferecem seu terra. É verde e exuberante, cheia de água pura e de criaturas rechonchas que caçar."
G["Farewell for now, friend."]="Até a próxima."
G["Farewell for now."]="Adeus por agora."
G["Farewell my friends, for time grows short. I must depart."]="Adeus, amigos. Se acabao tempo, e devo partir."
G["Farewell newcomer. May Elune's blessing be with you."]="Farewell newcomer. May Elune's blessing be with you."
G["Farewell stranger. When next we meet, I hope to call you friend."]="Farewell stranger. When next we meet, I hope to call you friend."
G["Farewell to you, and may Elune be with you always."]="Que tenha bom viagem, e que Eluna sempre te acompanhe."
G["Farewell to you, and may our ancestors be with you always!"]="Que tenha bom viagem, e que nossos ancestrais sempre te acompanhen!"
G["Farewell to you, and may shadow always protect you!"]="Que tenha bom viagem, e que a sombra sempre te proteja!"
G["Farewell to you, and may the Light be with you always."]="Que tenha bom viagem, e que a Luz sempre te acompanhe."
G["Farewell, $n."]="Adeus, $n."
G["Farewell, $n.  And remember, a warrior never shows his back to his foe!"]="Adeus, $n. E lembre-se: um guerreiro nunca da a costas ao seu inimigo!"
G["Farewell, $n.  Send my regards to the good men and women at the Menders' Stead."]="Farewell, $n.  Send my regards to the good men and women at the Menders' Stead."
G["Farewell, $n. Keep us alive and get some better equipment!"]="Adeus, $n. Mantennos vivos e consegue um equipamento melhor!"
G["Farewell, $n. Until we meet again..."]="Adeus, $n. Até que nos encontremos novamente..."
G["Farewell, $n..."]="Adeus, $n..."
G["Farewell, Arthas... my brother."]="Adeus, Arthas... irmão meu."
G["Farewell, Azeroth. I leave behind a world steeped in filth and wracked by cataclysm."]="Farewell, Azeroth. I leave behind a world steeped in filth and wracked by cataclysm."
G["Farewell, Cerellean, until we are joined once again..."]="Farewell, Cerellean, until we are joined once again..."
G["Farewell, Commander. I will be staying at the inn, should you require my services."]="Farewell, Commander. I will be staying at the inn, should you require my services."
G["Farewell, Evie Stormstout."]="Adeus, Evie Cerveja de Trovão."
G["Farewell, Raelorasz."]="Adeus, Raelorasz."
G["Farewell, Shang!"]="Até pronto, Shang!"
G["Farewell, Warchief. I pray that the next time we meet it will be as allies."]="Adeus, Chefe de Guerra. Rezo para que a próxima vez que nos encontremos seja como aliados."
G["Farewell, and good luck."]="Adeus e boa sorte."
G["Farewell, champions."]="Adeus, campeões."
G["Farewell, citizens of Darkshire. Until next time..."]="Adeus, cidadãos de Vila Sombria. Até a próxima."
G["Farewell, dear friend. We shall meet you in the next world when our duties in this one are fulfilled."]="Adeus, amigo. Nos veremos no outro mundo ao acabar nossos cometidos neste."
G["Farewell, friend! Good treasure hunting!"]="Adeus, $gamigo: amiga;! Feliz caça do tesouro!"
G["Farewell, friend. I must return to Warsong Hold."]="Adeus, colega. E de voltar ao Bastião Brado Guerreiro."
G["Farewell, friend. May we meet again under better circumstances. I'll never forget what you did for me!"]="Até sempre, $gamigo meu: amiga minha;. Tomara nos voltemos a ver em melhores circunstâncias. Mais esquecerei o que fez por mim!"
G["Farewell, mortal. We are forever indebted to you."]="Adeus, mortal. Sempre estaremos em dívida com você."
G["Farewell, mortals. Your bravery is admirable, for such flawed creatures."]="Farewell, mortals. Your bravery is admirable, for such flawed creatures."
G["Farewell, mortals... The earthmender knows what fire feels..."]="Adeus, mortais... O ensalmador da terra sabe o que sente o fogo..."
G["Farewell, my friend."]="Farewell, my friend."
G["Farewell, old friend... Farewell..."]="Adeus, amigo... Adeus..."
G["Farewell, stranger. When next we meet, I hope to call you 'friend.'"]="Farewell, stranger. When next we meet, I hope to call you 'friend.'"
G["Farewell, stranger. Your heroics will be remembered by my people. Now, hurry to Telaar!"]="Farewell, stranger. Your heroics will be remembered by my people. Now, hurry to Telaar!"
G["Farewell."]="Adeus."
G["Farewell. We shall speak again, I'm sure."]="Adeus. Volveremos a vernos, estou certo."
G["Farewell..."]="Adeus..."
G["Farii trains those interested in jewel crafting. You can find her in the Crystal Hall near the cavern there."]="Farii treina os interessados ​​em artesanato de joias. Você pode encontrá-a no Crystal Hall, perto da caverna."
G["Farmer Fung lives just north of town, right near the water tower.\n\nI know him well, unfortunately."]="O fazendeiro Fung vive ao norte da cidade, muito perto da torre de água.\n\nO conheço muito bem, por desgraça."
G["Farmer Yoon is just a dear! I keep telling him what to do, and he goes on and does it!"]="Farmer Yoon is just a dear! I keep telling him what to do, and he goes on and does it!"
G["Farmer Yoon, will you join the council of the Tillers Union?"]="Farmer Yoon, will you join the council of the Tillers Union?"
G["Farmer, come out.  We must speak."]="Fazendeiro, sal. Devemos falar."
G["Farmhand, m'lord."]="Farmhand, m'lord."
G["Farmhand, sir."]="Farmhand, sir."
G["Farmhands need the hearty goodness of the Pandaren Treasures Noodle Soup to restore their spirit after a hard day's work in the fields."]="Farmhands need the hearty goodness of the Pandaren Treasures Noodle Soup to restore their spirit after a hard day's work in the fields."
G["Farming is much harder than it looks."]="Levar uma fazenda é muito mais difícil do que parece."
G["Farming must build up a powerful thirst, eh $n?"]="Farming must build up a powerful thirst, eh $n?"
G["Farraki forces pour from the Farraki Tribal Door!"]="As forças Farraki saem em tropel desde a porta tribal Farraki!"
G["Farraki tribe, flay their flesh wit the fury of the sands!"]="Tribo Farraki, deh'pelhejadlos com a fúria das arenas!"
G["Farseer! I'm so glad to see you again!"]="Clarividente! Fico feliz tanto voltar a ver você!"
G["Farseer, it is good to see that you still live."]="Clarividente, que bem que estiver vivo."
G["Farseer, you live!"]="Clarividente, está vivo!"
G["Farseers, mend our wounds!"]="Farseers, mend our wounds!"
G["Farstrider Dusking, what business have you to report?"]="Errante Crepúsculo, de que assunto precisa informar?"
G["Farunn walks the lands north of what your people call the Bittertide Falls. You will find him alone, but you will see he requires no defenders."]="Farunn walks the lands north of what your people call the Bittertide Falls. You will find him alone, but you will see he requires no defenders."
G["Farwatch Overlook?  I've heard no reports of mantid in the chasm below."]="O Alto de Vigilância? Não me têm informou da presença de mantídeos na sima."
G["Fascinating! These embers somehow generate almost no heat."]="Fascinante! De algum modo estas brasas não geram apenas calor."
G["Fascinating, I have never heard tales of anything like this. The mogu hide their secrets well."]="Fascinante. Nunca imaginé que algo assim pudesse existir. Os mogu sabem esconder seus segredos."
G["Fascinating, Lorekeeper. Continue please."]="Fascinante, Tradicionapronta. Continue, por favor."
G["Fascinating, this coincides with theories of Un'Goro being the home of the Titans when they inhabited Kalimdor. Perhaps Aman'thul himself watched over 'The God Lands.'"]="Fascinating, this coincides with theories of Un'Goro being the home of the Titans when they inhabited Kalimdor. Perhaps Aman'thul himself watched over 'The God Lands.'"
G["Fascinating."]="Fascinante."
G["Fascinating. Continue, please."]="Fascinante. Continue por favor."
G["Fascinating. I think they call that a \"clean kill\"."]="Fascinante. Acho que a isto o chamam uma \"morte limpa\"."
G["Fascinating. Please, tell me more."]="Fascinante. Por favor me conte mais."
G["Fascinating. What is it, Andormu?"]="Fascinante. Que é, Andormu?"
G["Fascinating..."]="Fascinante..."
G["Fast forward to the present: The resultant formula works, allowing for the creation of a more controlled drone, however, the drawback is that the inactive compound is extremely volatile.\n\nGallywix, everyone in this tower and everyone outside are infected with the poison. It's affecting our minds and our bodies. Our internal organs have become soft and extremely fragile. This is your chance, $n. I don't have the strength to carry on and I sense that soon I will become one of 'them.'"]="Fast forward to the present: The resultant formula works, allowing for the creation of a more controlled drone, however, the drawback is that the inactive compound is extremely volatile.\n\nGallywix, everyone in this tower and everyone outside are infected with the poison. It's affecting our minds and our bodies. Our internal organs have become soft and extremely fragile. This is your chance, $n. I don't have the strength to carry on and I sense that soon I will become one of 'them.'"
G["Fast. But not fast enough. We'll do it again."]="Rápido, mas não o suficiente. Uma vez mais."
G["Faster or Boss Grog'ak will have your head!"]="Mais rápido, ou o chefe Grog'ak te cortará a cabeça!"
G["Faster!"]="Mais depressa!"
G["Faster! Faster you worthless runts!"]="Mais rápido! Mais rápido, anões inútiles!"
G["Faster! Faster! These armaments must be delivered to the Kor'kron Vanguard TODAY!"]="Mais depressa! Mais depressa! Estes armamentos têm de ser entregados na Vanguarda Kor'kron HOJE!"
G["Faster! The warchief's eyes are upon you."]="Faster! The warchief's eyes are upon you."
G["Faster! We must attack faster!  They cannot hold all of us back!"]="Faster! We must attack faster!  They cannot hold all of us back!"
G["Faster! We must be flying by the end of the day or the Lich King will destroy us for certain."]="Mais depressa! Se não estamos voando ao acabar o dia, não cabe dúvida de que o Rei Lich nos destruirá."
G["Faster, brother! I don't know how much longer we can hold these Scourge monsters back!"]="Faster, brother! I don't know how much longer we can hold these Scourge monsters back!"
G["Faster, dogs! We mustn't relent in our assault against the interlopers!"]="Faster, dogs! We mustn't relent in our assault against the interlopers!"
G["Faster, dogs, or you'll get THE BOOT!"]="Faster, dogs, or you'll get THE BOOT!"
G["Faster, faster!  Get those fel reaver parts gathered!"]="Faster, faster!  Get those fel reaver parts gathered!"
G["Faster, hero! We must get back to the Argent Vanguard and warn them of the impending attack!"]="Faster, hero! We must get back to the Argent Vanguard and warn them of the impending attack!"
G["Faster, or you will taste The Claw!"]="Faster, or you will taste The Claw!"
G["Faster, scum!  The Master won't be pleased if we don't find the Ata'mal crystal he's after."]="Mais rápido, escória! O mestre se enfadará se não encontramos o cristal de Ata'mal que buscamos."
G["Faster, smith! Shai Hu hungers for blood!"]="Mais rápido, ferreiro! Shai Hu está sedento de sangue!"
G["Faster, you fools. We need all of these artifacts soon or it's the cane for your hides."]="Faster, you fools. We need all of these artifacts soon or it's the cane for your hides."
G["Faster. Fight faster! Both of you slow like bigtongue. Maybe I dump you in water, make you slimy like bigtongues too, make them take you in."]="Faster. Fight faster! Both of you slow like bigtongue. Maybe I dump you in water, make you slimy like bigtongues too, make them take you in."
G["Fastest gryphons this side of Aerie Peak. Want to take a ride?"]="Os grifos mais rápidos deste lado do Aerie Peak. Quer dar uma volta?"
G["Fate has been kind to return you to us."]="Fate has been kind to return you to us."
G["Fate has brought you to me!"]="O destino você trouxe a mim!"
G["Fate is like fire; it can shape or destroy us."]="O destino é como o fogo. Ele pode nos moldar ou destruir."
G["Fate subjugates faith, mortal. Your prayers are meaningless here."]="Fate subjugates faith, mortal. Your prayers are meaningless here."
G["Fate, it seems, has been more than kind. A blow has been dealt to Malygos. When he learns of it, I am confident he will leave the safety of the Nexus."]="Parece que o destino foi mais que gentil. Se tem desferido um duro acerto a Malygos. Espero que quando se entere abandone a segurança do Nexus."
G["Fateema is our anchorite, and she has been invaluable in tending crash victims. She practices her trade on the western side of the Watch."]="Fateema é o nosso anacoreta, e ela tem sido inestimável em cuidar de vítimas de acidentes. Ela pratica seu ofício no lado oeste da Patrulha."
G["Father Cobb will be the one you want to talk to. He can be found under the Spirit Rise in the Pools of Vision cave."]="Pai Cobb será quem você quer conversar. Ele pode ser encontrado sob o Spirit Rise na caverna Pools of Vision."
G["Father taught me well."]="Para me ensenhó bem."
G["Father was right about you, Sartharion. You ARE a weakling."]="Para tinha razão, Sartharion. É um debilucho."
G["Father!"]="Para!"
G["Father! Are you okay?"]="Para! Está bem?"
G["Father! Father! You're alive!"]="Para! Para! Está vivo!"
G["Father! Let me get you free of those chains."]="Para! De que te libere dessas correntes."
G["Father! You can't let them turn the Crane Temple into a war zone! That place is still recovering from a sha infestation..."]="Para! Não permitas que conviertan o Templo da Grulha em um campo de batalha! Ainda se você está recuperando da infestação do sha..."
G["Father, I am no longer the helpless child you feared for."]="Father, I am no longer the helpless child you feared for."
G["Father, I wish to join you in the war against the undead. I want to fight! I can sit idle no longer!"]="Father, I wish to join you in the war against the undead. I want to fight! I can sit idle no longer!"
G["Father, NO!  Wait... where am I?"]="Para, não! Um segundo... onde estou?"
G["Father, give me strength to go on."]="Para, dê-me força para seguir adiante."
G["Father, watch out!"]="Para, cuidado!"
G["Father, we need to deal with the Horde scout first."]="Para, devemos cuidar primeiro do explorador da Horda."
G["Father, you can't do this. All the hatred and anger our war brings here - it poisons this place."]="Detente, pai. Tudo o ódio e a rabia que gera nossa guerra envenena este lugar."
G["Father, you had the bowl of fruit? Right?"]="Father, you had the bowl of fruit? Right?"
G["Father, you have returned!"]="Para! Voltou!"
G["Father, you were a man who led wisely, who battled skillfully, and who always sought the best for your people."]="Father, you were a man who led wisely, who battled skillfully, and who always sought the best for your people."
G["Father. I feared for your... your sanity."]="Father. I feared for your... your sanity."
G["Father..."]="Para..."
G["Father... But... How?"]="Para... Mas... Como?"
G["Father... For you, I would give my life a thousand times."]="Para... por você, daria minha vida mil vezes."
G["Father... why must we endure such hardship?  Why can't we live somewhere sunny and lush?  A tropical island perhaps?"]="Father... why must we endure such hardship?  Why can't we live somewhere sunny and lush?  A tropical island perhaps?"
G["Father?  Are you proud of me now? HAHAH!"]="Para? Agora si está orgulhoso de mim? JA, JA!"
G["Father? Father is that you?"]="Para? É você, pai?"
G["Fathers and sons. Mothers and daughters. As parents, we pass our legacy on to our children."]="Pais e filhos. Mães e filhas. Como pais, nós passamos nosso legado adiante para nossos filhos."
G["Fathom-Lord Zin'jatar has entered the battle!"]="O Senhor das profundezas Zin'jatar entrou na batalha!"
G["Fear broils forth from the heart of the infinite. Don't make me look! I've seen more than I can stand!"]="O medo brota do coração do infinito. Não me faça olhar! Eu já vi mais do que posso suportar!"
G["Fear broils forth from the heart of the infinite... Don't make me look! I've seen more than I can stand!"]="Fear broils forth from the heart of the infinite... Don't make me look! I've seen more than I can stand!"
G["Fear cuts deeper than swords."]="O medo penetra mais fundo que a espada."
G["Fear grips her mind and body. The Empress is no longer fit to rule the empire."]="Fear grips her mind and body. The Empress is no longer fit to rule the empire."
G["Fear has always been our greatest weapon. Entire wars have been won and lost upon the shifting shoulders of trepidation and doubt. So how, then, does one fight an enemy that knows no fear?\n\n<Saurfang shakes his head.>\n\nWe do not just fight the Scourge in Northrend, we fight to gain control of our senses before they tear us apart..."]="Fear has always been our greatest weapon. Entire wars have been won and lost upon the shifting shoulders of trepidation and doubt. So how, then, does one fight an enemy that knows no fear?\n\n<Saurfang shakes his head.>\n\nWe do not just fight the Scourge in Northrend, we fight to gain control of our senses before they tear us apart..."
G["Fear is an illusion."]="O medo é uma ilusão."
G["Fear is for the enemy! Fear and death!"]="O medo é para o inimigo! Medo e morte!"
G["Fear lies in your heart. When you truly are ready to face Vorsha the Lasher, come speak with me."]="Fear lies in your heart. When you truly are ready to face Vorsha the Lasher, come speak with me."
G["Fear me!"]="Témeme!"
G["Fear not if your weapon leaves your grasp. Your body is an ample tool against any foe."]="Se perde seu arma, não temas. Seu corpo é ferramenta mais que suficiente para vencer a qualquer inimigo."
G["Fear not!  All fortunes can be discerned for those who know the way."]="Fear not!  All fortunes can be discerned for those who know the way."
G["Fear not, master. I shall rend the flesh of your enemy!"]="Fear not, master. I shall rend the flesh of your enemy!"
G["Fear not, young one, for this crusader shall not taste death."]="Fear not, young one, for this crusader shall not taste death."
G["Fear not.  The Night Watch will rid the land of this foul taint soon enough."]="Fear not.  The Night Watch will rid the land of this foul taint soon enough."
G["Fear not. Johnny Awesome fights by your side."]="Não tenha medo. Johnny Fenómeno luta ao seu lado."
G["Fear the wrath of the yaungol!"]="Sente a cólera dos yaungol!"
G["Fear... anger... doubt... these are weapons. MY weapons. And they will unmake you!"]="O medo... a raiva... a dúvida... são armas. MEUS armas. E serão sua perdição!"
G["Fear... so exhilarating..."]="Medo... tão estimulante..."
G["Feast my children! Feast upon the flesh of the living!"]="Regocijaos, filhos meus! Regocijaos com a carne dos vivos!"
G["Feast on $n, my pretties!"]="Feast on $n, my pretties!"
G["Feast on the blood of our enemies!"]="Feast on the blood of our enemies!"
G["Feast ye eyes upon the dreadful, clever, all-powerful, hate-filled, sword-swingin', face-punchin', insult-flingin', and all around handsome, BURGY BLACKHEART."]="Feast ye eyes upon the dreadful, clever, all-powerful, hate-filled, sword-swingin', face-punchin', insult-flingin', and all around handsome, BURGY BLACKHEART."
G["Feast, my children! Feast upon the flesh of the living!"]="Regocijaos, filhos meus! Regocijaos com a carne dos vivos!"
G["Feast, my minions!"]="Feast, my minions!"
G["Feather for Chee Chee? Thank you."]="Pluma para Chee Chee? Obrigado."
G["Feckless cowards, the lot of you! Maybe if you'd show some backbone, I would actually pay your wages!"]="Feckless cowards, the lot of you! Maybe if you'd show some backbone, I would actually pay your wages!"
G["Feebleminded tinkerer, do you really think your pathetic creation can stop me?"]="Feebleminded tinkerer, do you really think your pathetic creation can stop me?"
G["Feed me with your ANGER!"]="Feed me with your ANGER!"
G["Feed me your hatred!"]="Aliméntame com o seu ódio!"
G["Feed my anger!"]="Alimenta meu raiva!"
G["Feed on them my pets!"]="Feed on them my pets!"
G["Feed pigs rubber, 'til they bounce. There's got to be an application for that."]="Feed pigs rubber, 'til they bounce. There's got to be an application for that."
G["Feed the master's rage! COME AND DIE!"]="Alimenta a raiva do mestre! VENHA E MORRE!"
G["Feed you to da crows!"]="Feed you to da crows!"
G["Feed you to master!"]="Comida para mestre!"
G["Feed, children!  Take your fill from their meaty husks!"]="Feed, children!  Take your fill from their meaty husks!"
G["Feed, me bruddahs!"]="Alimentaos, irmãos meus!"
G["Feedin' time for da furries."]="Feedin' time for da furries."
G["Feeding a Horde army is no easy task.  I have lots to do, do you have time to help?"]="Alimentar um exército da Horda não é tarefa fácil. Eu tenho muito o que fazer, você tem tempo para ajudar?"
