G["Fierce retaliation for the defections were to follow.  Shattrath City came under unrelenting attack from Illidan and Kael'thas.\n\nArmies of blood elves, naga and Broken, would pour into the city; only to be repelled by the might of the Sha'tar.\n\nOne thing became clear to the naaru.  If they were to pursue the Legion, they would have to defeat Illidan first."]="Fierce retaliation for the defections were to follow.  Shattrath City came under unrelenting attack from Illidan and Kael'thas.\n\nArmies of blood elves, naga and Broken, would pour into the city; only to be repelled by the might of the Sha'tar.\n\nOne thing became clear to the naaru.  If they were to pursue the Legion, they would have to defeat Illidan first."
