G["Fill your cup with joy, and you will drink joy. Fill your cup with sorrow, and you will drink sorrow.\n\nChoose your brew wisely, my friend."]="Cheia a copa com alegria e beberás alegria. Cheia a copa com penas e beberás penas.\n\nElige sabiamente a cerveja, $gamigo: amiga;."
G["Filth protects us. Our enemies cannot stand the smell of Ihgaluk.\n\nBut it is hard to keep filth on the beach. The ocean drinks our filth faster than we can create it. There must be other ways to protect our shores.\n\n<The seadragon flashes a razor-toothed smile.> That's where I come in, $gbrother:sister;."]="Filth protects us. Our enemies cannot stand the smell of Ihgaluk.\n\nBut it is hard to keep filth on the beach. The ocean drinks our filth faster than we can create it. There must be other ways to protect our shores.\n\n<The seadragon flashes a razor-toothed smile.> That's where I come in, $gbrother:sister;."
G["Filth! Filth everywhere! The forests must be cleansed!"]="Inmundicia! Inmundicia por todas partes! É preciso limpar os florestas!"
G["Filthy $r intruder. DIE!"]="Repugnante $r $gintruso: intrusa;. MORRE!"
G["Filthy Frostwolf cowards! If you want a fight, you'll have to come to me!"]="Covardes asquerosos Lobo Gelo! Se quiser lutar, venham a mim!"
G["Filthy animals!"]="Filthy animals!"
G["Filthy animals!  Cage me will you?!"]="Filthy animals!  Cage me will you?!"
G["Filthy animals! Keep your stink away from this land!"]="Filthy animals! Keep your stink away from this land!"
G["Filthy beast!"]="Beast asquerosas!"
G["Filthy beasts! Your presence in Skywall will not be tolerated!"]="Sucias beast! Não toleraremos sua presença no Muralha Celeste!"
