G["Filthy cretin. Your kind doesn't deserve to live. Have at thee!"]="Filthy cretin. Your kind doesn't deserve to live. Have at thee!"
G["Filthy fungal giants!  What did we ever do to them?"]="Gigantes imundos fúngicos! O que fizemos com eles?"
G["Filthy monsters! I owe ye me life."]="Monstros asquerosos! Os devo a vida."
