G["Filthy void beast! DIE!"]="Asqueroso monstro do vazio! MORRE!"
G["Filthy wolvar. I don't care if the dryskin vouches for you, I will not endure your presence for long."]="Filthy wolvar. I don't care if the dryskin vouches for you, I will not endure your presence for long."
G["Filthy yaungol infestation!"]="Suja plaga yaungol!"
G["Filthy, filthy orcs! Unhand those whelps!"]="Filthy, filthy orcs! Unhand those whelps!"
G["Fimble Finespindle has a shop set up on the northwest side of The Great Forge.  I wager he could show ye how to make some fine armor."]="O Fimble Finespindle tem uma loja criada no lado noroeste da Grande Forja. Aposto que ele poderia lhe mostrar como fazer uma boa armadura."
G["Final Level: Completed!"]="Nível fim: concluído!"
G["Final stop, the Forsaken Front! EVERYBODY OUT!"]="Última aparo, o Linha de frente Renegado! TUDO O MUNDO FORA!"
G["Finally got a seat, now what to eat?"]="Finalmente me posso sentar! E agora que pido?"
G["Finally out from under the boot of that she-witch Abbendis, and free to pursue my own interests: BLOOD, BLOOD, AND MORE BLOOD!"]="Finally out from under the boot of that she-witch Abbendis, and free to pursue my own interests: BLOOD, BLOOD, AND MORE BLOOD!"
G["Finally some talk of action from the big guy!"]="Finalmente o rapaz grande fala de ação!"
G["Finally someone to deal with that unsightly pest! You have my thanks, \"heroes.\""]="Finally someone to deal with that unsightly pest! You have my thanks, \"heroes.\""
G["Finally someone to smash!"]="Finalmente alguém a quem aplastar!"
G["Finally they show mercy!  They've given us something to drink!"]="Finalmente muestran misericórdia! Nos têm dados algo de beber!"
G["Finally we are taking action! Something we should have done days ago."]="Finalmente entramos em ação! É algo que deveria haver passado há dias."
G["Finally you know your true destiny."]="Finalmente conhece seu verdadeiro destino."
G["Finally!"]="Finalmente!"
G["Finally!\n\nDa $r $c foretold in da prophecies has arrived!"]="Finally!\n\nDa $r $c foretold in da prophecies has arrived!"
G["Finally!  I will never get all of this dust out of my robes."]="Finally!  I will never get all of this dust out of my robes."
G["Finally!  This charade is over... Arthas give me strength!"]="Finalmente! Se acabou esta farsa... Arthas dê-me força!"
