G["Finally! Put some fingers in your ears, your brain mighta just grown five sizes and I'm worried it might leak out.\n\nSo, the Dark Irons spared his life and took him prisoner. Their leader, some self-important, uppity fella named Thauris-something, took Ironfoe for himself. And that was the last I saw of ol' Windsor... *hic* 'scuse me."]="Finally! Put some fingers in your ears, your brain mighta just grown five sizes and I'm worried it might leak out.\n\nSo, the Dark Irons spared his life and took him prisoner. Their leader, some self-important, uppity fella named Thauris-something, took Ironfoe for himself. And that was the last I saw of ol' Windsor... *hic* 'scuse me."
G["Finally! THERE'S the Uncle Chen I've been waiting for."]="Finalmente! Esse é o tio Chen ao que estava esperando."
G["Finally! To be free from the grip of that darkness. The light! The blessed, beautiful light!"]="Ao fim! Livres das garras dessa escuridão. A luz! Que bendita e maravilhosa luz!"
G["Finally!! I can leave this dump."]="Finally!! I can leave this dump."
G["Finally, I am free! I come home soon, my dear!"]="Finalmente sou livre! Pronto voltarei a casa, meu amor!"
G["Finally, I can be restin'..."]="Ao fim posso descansar..."
G["Finally, I entreat you to stop buffeting my squire with punches and kicks."]="Finally, I entreat you to stop buffeting my squire with punches and kicks."
