G["First of all, it wasn't sunny out.  It was cloudy when Deathwing appeared."]="First of all, it wasn't sunny out.  It was cloudy when Deathwing appeared."
G["First one to move gets a lightning bolt to the head!"]="Ao primeiro que se mudar lhe cairá um raio na cabeça!"
G["First packet of seeds is on the house! Come back to me anytime you want to buy more seeds, ya hear?"]="O primeiro pacote de sementes é grátis. Venha a me ver sempre que queira comprar sementes, me oyes?"
G["First place? Wow!\n\nPretty good for a young trainee."]="First place? Wow!\n\nPretty good for a young trainee."
G["First rule of the Tiger Temple Tournament: We don't talk about Tiger Temple Tournament."]="First rule of the Tiger Temple Tournament: We don't talk about Tiger Temple Tournament."
G["First she left you for Chip, and now the Trade Prince! She was never good enough for you, $n."]="Primeiro te deixou por Locko, e agora pelo Príncipe mercante! Nunca foi o suficiente boa para você, $n."
G["First squad is ready for battle!"]="First squad is ready for battle!"
G["First the fish!...  Now you?"]="Primeiro os peixe... e agora você?"
G["First these orcs and then those pathetic goblins down on the shore."]="Primeiro estes orcs e depois esses patéticos goblins da orilha."
G["First things first. We're going to need some sweet malts."]="O primeiro é o primeiro. Vamos precisar malta doce."
G["First though, you sin'dorei listen up. I run a tight ship... this isn't going to be like what you're used to with the Scryers. Pull your weight, or get back on the boat!"]="First though, you sin'dorei listen up. I run a tight ship... this isn't going to be like what you're used to with the Scryers. Pull your weight, or get back on the boat!"
G["First time in Pandaria? Mine too. I remember the stories they would tell us of this place. So exciting!"]="First time in Pandaria? Mine too. I remember the stories they would tell us of this place. So exciting!"
G["First we get into a fight, and then someone brings us beer! Can today get any better?"]="First we get into a fight, and then someone brings us beer! Can today get any better?"
G["First we'll need to add a knotroot to the pot. Don't drag your feet, now...."]="First we'll need to add a knotroot to the pot. Don't drag your feet, now...."
G["First you became $g king : queen; of the ogres below, and now you have exalted yourself amongst us of Ogri'la.\n\nThis is unheard of for a $r, and yet, there you stand as living proof.  I thank you, $n, and we all owe you a debt that we will never truly be able to repay!"]="First you became $g king : queen; of the ogres below, and now you have exalted yourself amongst us of Ogri'la.\n\nThis is unheard of for a $r, and yet, there you stand as living proof.  I thank you, $n, and we all owe you a debt that we will never truly be able to repay!"
G["First you must prove yourself against my assistants.  Defeat them, and then you may face me."]="First you must prove yourself against my assistants.  Defeat them, and then you may face me."
G["First you must prove yourself to me, then I will train you."]="First you must prove yourself to me, then I will train you."
G["First you need da spices."]="Primeiro precisa as especias."
G["First you tell us the world is ending, now you tell us not to worry. What ruse is this?"]="First you tell us the world is ending, now you tell us not to worry. What ruse is this?"
G["First you, $r. Tomorrow: the world!"]="Primeiro você, $r. Manhã: o mundo!"
G["First, I give you a pellet rifle in exchange for one Darkmoon Game Token.\n\nThen you shoot the targets that light up.\n\nIf you're fast enough to hit a target just after it's lit up, you get an extra point.\n\nIf you don't reach the score limit before your time's up, or you move away from the booth, don't worry: Your score carries over to the next game."]="First, I give you a pellet rifle in exchange for one Darkmoon Game Token.\n\nThen you shoot the targets that light up.\n\nIf you're fast enough to hit a target just after it's lit up, you get an extra point.\n\nIf you don't reach the score limit before your time's up, or you move away from the booth, don't worry: Your score carries over to the next game."
G["First, Morra will be interested to know that it sounds like the Warsong clan spurred these trolls out of the mountain to attack us, so I suspect they're going to attack in Ashenvale as well."]="First, Morra will be interested to know that it sounds like the Warsong clan spurred these trolls out of the mountain to attack us, so I suspect they're going to attack in Ashenvale as well."
G["First, an introduction.  I am Archmage Vargoth, leader of the first Kirin Tor expedition to Draenor.  We have accompanied Alliance forces through the Dark Portal, and now set up base camp - Kirin'Var Village - in Farahlon, near the ancestral home of the Laughing Skull clan of orcs.  Such a lovely place!"]="First, an introduction.  I am Archmage Vargoth, leader of the first Kirin Tor expedition to Draenor.  We have accompanied Alliance forces through the Dark Portal, and now set up base camp - Kirin'Var Village - in Farahlon, near the ancestral home of the Laughing Skull clan of orcs.  Such a lovely place!"
G["First, go water my Bright Green Spinach!"]="First, go water my Bright Green Spinach!"
G["First, he gives away most of my precious Saronite, then he demands I begin crafting Runeblades of even greater power. Pah!"]="First, he gives away most of my precious Saronite, then he demands I begin crafting Runeblades of even greater power. Pah!"
G["First, the blade must be fed with the souls of those who serve our enemy. Then, before the blade draws upon their power, I must encase it in Shadowfrost. This will insulate you from the corrupting voices that would otherwise consume you... I hope."]="First, the blade must be fed with the souls of those who serve our enemy. Then, before the blade draws upon their power, I must encase it in Shadowfrost. This will insulate you from the corrupting voices that would otherwise consume you... I hope."
G["First, you come traipsing into Uldum as if you owned zhe place..."]="Primeiro, você chegarr passeando em Uldum como se fosse dona da lugarr..."
G["First, you give me a game token.  Next, I give you a mallet.  Then you'll see gnolls pop from the barrels in the play area.\n\nHit the gnolls with your mallet to score points.\n\nHere's where it gets tricky.  There are three different targets: regular gnolls, Hogger gnolls, and BABIES.\n\nRegular gnolls grant one point, while Hoggers count for three.  But babies?  Hitting a baby will knock you down and stun you... SO DON'T HIT THE BABIES!\n\nIf you don't whack enough gnolls in one go, just spend another token!  The points you've earned will carry over into your next game."]="First, you give me a game token.  Next, I give you a mallet.  Then you'll see gnolls pop from the barrels in the play area.\n\nHit the gnolls with your mallet to score points.\n\nHere's where it gets tricky.  There are three different targets: regular gnolls, Hogger gnolls, and BABIES.\n\nRegular gnolls grant one point, while Hoggers count for three.  But babies?  Hitting a baby will knock you down and stun you... SO DON'T HIT THE BABIES!\n\nIf you don't whack enough gnolls in one go, just spend another token!  The points you've earned will carry over into your next game."
G["First, you give me one game token.  Then you find yourself in control of a steam tonk!\n\nYou have a limited amount of time to blast targets in the battlefield.  Each target you destroy earns you one point.\n\nBut watch out: The battlefield is also home to enemy tonks and zeppelins.  Getting hit by one of their shots damages your tonk.\n\nYour score will carry over from one tonk to the next, so don't worry if you explode."]="First, you give me one game token.  Then you find yourself in control of a steam tonk!\n\nYou have a limited amount of time to blast targets in the battlefield.  Each target you destroy earns you one point.\n\nBut watch out: The battlefield is also home to enemy tonks and zeppelins.  Getting hit by one of their shots damages your tonk.\n\nYour score will carry over from one tonk to the next, so don't worry if you explode."
G["First, you must become an empty vessel."]="First, you must become an empty vessel."
G["First, you must escape Frostmourne's hold, or be damned as I am; trapped within this cursed blade for all eternity."]="First, you must escape Frostmourne's hold, or be damned as I am; trapped within this cursed blade for all eternity."
G["First, you will face our initiates..."]="First, you will face our initiates..."
G["First: the races of the Alliance look out for one another."]="First: the races of the Alliance look out for one another."
G["Fish Tales."]="Fish Tales."
G["Fish here long enough and you will see everything. I once saw a walrus with legs and arms. Not only that, but it talked!"]="Fish here long enough and you will see everything. I once saw a walrus with legs and arms. Not only that, but it talked!"
G["Fish so delicious. You come learn fish? Eat fish? Mmmmm..."]="Peixe tão delicioso. Você vem aprender peixe? Comemos peixe? Mmmmm..."
G["Fish? You gave a piece of what could be the key to saving all life on Kalimdor to a fish?"]="Peixe? Você deu um pedaço do que poderia ser a chave para salvar toda a vida em Kalimdor para um peixe?"
G["Fishing"]="Pesca"
G["Fishing Chair"]="Cadeira de pesca"
G["Fishing Supplies"]="Suprimentos de pesca"
G["Fishing has always come naturally to my family.  You look like you could use a little help though.  How about running a few errands for a Master Angler?"]="A pesca sempre veio naturalmente para minha família. Parece que você poderia usar uma pequena ajuda. Que tal executar algumas tarefas para um Master Angler?"
G["Fishing is a sport for the old who have not died in battle!  Go find Lumak on the lake in the Valley of Honor."]="A pesca é um esporte para os idosos que não morreram em batalha! Vá encontrar Lumak no lago no Valley of Honra."
G["Fishing is good for the soul, but crabbing is good for the belly!"]="Fishing is good for the soul, but crabbing is good for the belly!"
G["Fishing is just so pleasant, mon. You know? I owe my state of bliss to my mentor, the greatest angler in the whole world - Nat Pagle. Have you heard of him, mon?\n\nIf you be looking for enlightenment, Nat Pagle be the one who gonna show you the way."]="Fishing is just so pleasant, mon. You know? I owe my state of bliss to my mentor, the greatest angler in the whole world - Nat Pagle. Have you heard of him, mon?\n\nIf you be looking for enlightenment, Nat Pagle be the one who gonna show you the way."
G["Fishing is real easy.  Just take a pole with a line on it, maybe put some bait on it, and cast it out in the water.  Sure enough, them fish will start biting."]="Fishing is real easy.  Just take a pole with a line on it, maybe put some bait on it, and cast it out in the water.  Sure enough, them fish will start biting."
G["Fishing poles are a crutch! A real fisher uses their hands."]="Fishing poles are a crutch! A real fisher uses their hands."
G["Fishing poles... you fish like tuskarr.  Or worse, like humans."]="Canhas de pescar... Pescas como um tuskarr. OU pior ainda, como um humano."
G["Fishing sounds good."]="Pescar é boa ideia."
G["Fishmaster Bassbait has had the waters here seeded with high quality Tastyfish so he can have his tournament.\nOnce he gets his winners, I will give you silver for each five Tastyfish you bring me!"]="Fishmaster Bassbait has had the waters here seeded with high quality Tastyfish so he can have his tournament.\nOnce he gets his winners, I will give you silver for each five Tastyfish you bring me!"
G["Fist Weapon"]="Arma de punho"
G["Fist weapons are taught by Sayoc, the orc weapon master in Orgrimmar. He spends his days in the Valley of Honor."]="As armas de punho são ensinadas por Sayoc, o mestre de armas orcs em Orgrimmar. Ele passa seus dias no Vale da Honra."
G["Fists of flame!"]="Punhos de chamas!"
G["Fists of frost!"]="Punhos de Gelo!"
G["Five and five years, and he still searches for her, though she was no beauty, and there were many ladies that would take her place."]="Five and five years, and he still searches for her, though she was no beauty, and there were many ladies that would take her place."
G["Five hundred ships at my disposal, yet the one that holds the key to the kingdom is missing. How can this be?"]="Five hundred ships at my disposal, yet the one that holds the key to the kingdom is missing. How can this be?"
G["Five on one hardly seems fair, but come on... they're half-dead gnomes. It's the leper gnome quintet!"]="Cinco contra um não soa logo, mas vá, são gnomos meio mortos. É o quinteto de gnomos parias!"
G["Five seconds. I'm not kidding!"]="Five seconds. I'm not kidding!"
G["Five sorcerers?"]="Five sorcerers?"
G["Five tickets or five hundred, it doesn't matter friend, everybody is a winner!"]="Cinco vales, ou cinco mil, não importa, tudo o mundo ganha!"
G["Five."]="Cinco."
G["Fix her... FIX HER!"]="Fix her... FIX HER!"
G["Fix my armor, Corvus! My blade is rusty, Corvus!  ... when will these damned mortals learn to care for themselves?"]="Fix my armor, Corvus! My blade is rusty, Corvus!  ... when will these damned mortals learn to care for themselves?"
G["Fix your eyes upon your crude hands: the sinew, the soft meat, the dark blood coursing within."]="Fix your eyes upon your crude hands: the sinew, the soft meat, the dark blood coursing within."
G["Fixed you, didn't I?"]="Isto alivia, verdade?"
G["Fixin' the tower and the wall! Keep the baddies off us!"]="Fixin' the tower and the wall! Keep the baddies off us!"
G["Fixing"]="Arreglando"
G["Fixing for a snack, $r?"]="Te apetece um aperitivo, $r?"
G["Fizzcrank Fullthrottle."]="Palanqueta Todogás."
G["Fizzle & Pozzik's Speedbarge my sweet patootie! I built this thing! Not them, not Razzeric!\n\nIt should be called Jinky's Speedbarge!"]="Fizzle & Pozzik's Speedbarge my sweet patootie! I built this thing! Not them, not Razzeric!\n\nIt should be called Jinky's Speedbarge!"
G["Fizzle, Pozzik, Jinky... they all think that they saved us. But it was me! I built the ship!\n\nIt should be called, Razzeric's Speedbarge!"]="Fizzle, Pozzik, Jinky... they all think that they saved us. But it was me! I built the ship!\n\nIt should be called, Razzeric's Speedbarge!"
G["Fizzy yellow beer is for wussies and grummles."]="Fizzy yellow beer is for wussies and grummles."
G["Fjorn's Anvil now stands prominently in Dun Niffelem as a symbol of their victory over Fjorn and his armies.\n\nYou can't help but smile, knowing that your actions have had such a lasting impact on the world."]="Fjorn's Anvil now stands prominently in Dun Niffelem as a symbol of their victory over Fjorn and his armies.\n\nYou can't help but smile, knowing that your actions have had such a lasting impact on the world."
G["Flame consume these mortals!"]="Flame consume these mortals!"
G["Flame of Life!  Burn within me and renew my vigor!"]="Flame of Life!  Burn within me and renew my vigor!"
G["Flame! Death! Destruction! The black fire rages within my heart! I must... release it! Hahah!"]="Chama! Morte! Destruição! O fogo negro arde na minha coração! Devo... libertá-lo! Jajaja!"
G["Flamebringer attempts to throw you from his back. Return to Voldrune!"]="Flamebringer attempts to throw you from his back. Return to Voldrune!"
G["Flames below, obey the call of the Twilight's Hammer!"]="Flames below, obey the call of the Twilight's Hammer!"
G["Flames of passion serve only to ignite the kindle of others."]="Flames of passion serve only to ignite the kindle of others."
G["Flames will consume the world. Storms will wash away all hope. The elements will reign at last!"]="Flames will consume the world. Storms will wash away all hope. The elements will reign at last!"
G["Flamestar!  I can return these dragons to their kind.  Let me take care of them."]="Flamestar!  I can return these dragons to their kind.  Let me take care of them."
G["Flank! To the flank!"]="Ao flanco! Ao flanco!"
G["Flanking attack! March into battle!"]="Flanking attack! March into battle!"
G["Flap Your Wings Rapidly to Re-Gain Altitude!"]="Flap Your Wings Rapidly to Re-Gain Altitude!"
G["Flat-nosed filth! Get off of my land!"]="Flat-nosed filth! Get off of my land!"
G["Flatter you? You were eight years old."]="Flatter you? You were eight years old."
G["Flattery will get you nowhere."]="Flattery will get you nowhere."
G["Flee in terror."]="Flee in terror."
G["Flee now while you still have your life!"]="Huye agora que ainda tem sua vida!"
G["Flee or die!"]="Flee or die!"
G["Flee the city!  The ground can't stop shakin'!"]="Flee the city!  The ground can't stop shakin'!"
G["Flee this place... or die!"]="Flee this place... or die!"
G["Flee while you can mortal!"]="Flee while you can mortal!"
G["Flee while you still have a chance, mortals. You will pray for a swift death should I enter the arena."]="Flee while you still have a chance, mortals. You will pray for a swift death should I enter the arena."
G["Flee!  Flee!"]="Flee!  Flee!"
G["Flee!  They're everywhere!"]="Flee!  They're everywhere!"
G["Flee, and die."]="Flee, and die."
G["Flee, before it's too late!"]="Flee, before it's too late!"
G["Flee, child."]="Huye se você pode."
G["Flee, craven villagers! This land belongs to nature alone once more!"]="Flee, craven villagers! This land belongs to nature alone once more!"
G["Flee, peon!"]="Huye, peão!"
G["Fleeeee!"]="Fleeeee!"
G["Fleeing is not an option I wish to entertain at this point. We will find another way.  Perhaps these tablets from Ulduar will shed some light on our situation."]="Fleeing is not an option I wish to entertain at this point. We will find another way.  Perhaps these tablets from Ulduar will shed some light on our situation."
G["Fleeing will do you no good, mortals!"]="Fugir não os solucionará nada, mortais!"
G["Flerberts. I'm not sure what they do, but I'd better lock down the name with a trademark."]="Florbetes. Não sei que são, mas melhor me garanto o nome com uma marca registrada."
G["Flesh Rippers, hold the forward courtyard for our champions!"]="Flesh Rippers, hold the forward courtyard for our champions!"
G["Flesh and sinew, weak but proud. Dare they part the Master's shroud? They stumble fumble groping blind. Finding fate and chaos intertwined."]="Flesh and sinew, weak but proud. Dare they part the Master's shroud? They stumble fumble groping blind. Finding fate and chaos intertwined."
G["Flesh for the Scale-Lord!"]="carne para o Senhor de escamas!"
G["Flesh for the miserable slaves below..."]="Flesh for the miserable slaves below..."
G["Flesh for the offering."]="carne para a oferenda."
G["Flesh from bone.... Tsss.... their spirits are broken!"]="carne e osso... Tsss... seus almas estão rompidas!"
G["Flesh is no match for iron!"]="A carne não é rival para o ferro!"
G["Flesh turns to ash!"]="A carne se torna cinza!"
G["Flesh, living flesh..."]="carne, carne palpitante..."
G["Flesh... burns!"]="carne... arde!"
G["Flesh... is... weak!"]="A carne... é... fraco!"
G["Flesh... such a hindrance."]="Flesh... such a hindrance."
G["Fleshling, I am Captain Saeed of the Protectorate and these soldiers that stand by me are my avengers. We await orders from the fleshling who destroyed the void conduit. On that fleshling's word, we will make our way up to Dimensius's lair and wait for the word to make a final strike!\n\nToo long it has been... The void lord will soon face our combined might!"]="Fleshling, I am Captain Saeed of the Protectorate and these soldiers that stand by me are my avengers. We await orders from the fleshling who destroyed the void conduit. On that fleshling's word, we will make our way up to Dimensius's lair and wait for the word to make a final strike!\n\nToo long it has been... The void lord will soon face our combined might!"
G["Fleshrender kill you now."]="Rasga-carne mata você."
G["Flight Master"]="Mestre de voo"
G["Flight systems online!  CLUCK!  Engaging rockets for transport to Booty Bay!"]="Flight systems online!  CLUCK!  Engaging rockets for transport to Booty Bay!"
G["Flink, did you compile the compression data for the hydropneumatic recoil jack yet? Chop chop!"]="Flink, did you compile the compression data for the hydropneumatic recoil jack yet? Chop chop!"
G["Flint! Get out of here! He's too powerful!"]="Sílex! Saia de aí! É demais poderoso!"
G["Flintlocke, if we have a big giant cannon, why don't we just shoot ... a cannonball?"]="Cierrasílex, se temos um enorme canhão gigantesco, por que não podemos disparar... uma bala de canhão?"
G["Flip the switch!"]="Dale ao botão!"
G["Flipping the override switch now!"]="Passando ao controle manual!"
G["Flitting through the mists with death upon his fists comes the sinister and serene jinyu assassin: Satay Byu!"]="A através da névoa, com a morte nos punhos, se aproxima um assassino jinyu sinistro e sereno: Satay Byu!"
G["Float like a dragonhawk, sting like a scorpid!"]="Float like a dragonhawk, sting like a scorpid!"
G["Floaty sparks! Think they maybe give me one?"]="Floaty sparks! Think they maybe give me one?"
G["Flood of the deep, take you!"]="Que as profundezas os arrastren!"
G["Flood's not so bad. Not as bad as the ones we've had in Ironforge."]="A inundação não é tão grave. Ao menos não o é tanto como as que temos tido em Altaforja."
G["Flooting isn't for stoopids."]="A flauta não é para bobos."
G["Florkun wikket! I'll shove your nibs into your horker!"]="Florkun wikket! I'll shove your nibs into your horker!"
G["Flow like the water, bend like the reed... blah, blah, blah. Just kick some butt!"]="Flow like the water, bend like the reed... blah, blah, blah. Just kick some butt!"
G["Flowers"]="Flores"
G["Flowers and seeds and such?  That would be Reyna Stonebranch's area of expertise.  Ye can find her tending to her plants over at the Ironforge Physician on the southern side of The Great Forge."]="Flores e sementes e tal? Essa seria a área de especialização de Reyna Stonebranch. Você pode encontrá-a cuidando das suas plantas no Ironforge Physician, no lado sul da Great Forge."
G["Flowers are nice, but they aren't  my favorite."]="As flores estão bem, mas não são meu elemento favorito."
G["Flowers for sale, get your beautiful flowers!"]="Flowers for sale, get your beautiful flowers!"
G["Flowers?  In this wasteland?  If anyone can teach you how to find them it will be Mishiki down in Sen'jin Village to the south."]="Flowers?  In this wasteland?  If anyone can teach you how to find them it will be Mishiki down in Sen'jin Village to the south."
G["Fluffy wikkets stole the mallet head! Kunzen hozen lost it many years ago. Now the fluffy wikkets hide inside their lair and worship the head like it some kind of fancy shmancy carrot.\n\nBe careful, those fluffy wikkets bite hard."]="Fluffy wikkets stole the mallet head! Kunzen hozen lost it many years ago. Now the fluffy wikkets hide inside their lair and worship the head like it some kind of fancy shmancy carrot.\n\nBe careful, those fluffy wikkets bite hard."
G["Fluffy! Fluffy, stop running!"]="Fluffy! Fluffy, stop running!"
G["Fly away little soul."]="Fly away little soul."
G["Fly high up above the jungle canopy.\n\nUse Pterrordash to temporarily increase your flight speed.\n\n|TInterface\\Icons\\ability_druid_dash.blp:32|t"]="Fly high up above the jungle canopy.\n\nUse Pterrordash to temporarily increase your flight speed.\n\n|TInterface\\Icons\\ability_druid_dash.blp:32|t"
G["Fly together with honor and courage. Now... rise as a serpent rider!"]="Fly together with honor and courage. Now... rise as a serpent rider!"
G["Fly up to the nests above to stop Juveniles from hatching."]="Fly up to the nests above to stop Juveniles from hatching."
G["Fly with me, Wakener, and I will show you the way of the Wind-Reaver."]="Fly with me, Wakener, and I will show you the way of the Wind-Reaver."
G["Flying"]="Voador"
G["Flying Snow chooses |cFFFF0000$n|r to chase down with her |cFFFF0000|Hspell:106706|h[Whirling Steel]|h|r!"]="Flying Snow chooses |cFFFF0000$n|r to chase down with her |cFFFF0000|Hspell:106706|h[Whirling Steel]|h|r!"
G["Flying Snow is chasing you with her |cFFFF0000|Hspell:|h[Whirling Steel]|h|r technique! Run away from her until she chooses someone else!"]="Flying Snow is chasing you with her |cFFFF0000|Hspell:|h[Whirling Steel]|h|r technique! Run away from her until she chooses someone else!"
G["Flying Snow!  Fragrant Lotus!  Step forward!"]="Flying Snow!  Fragrant Lotus!  Step forward!"
G["Flying Trainer"]="Instrutor de voo"
G["Flying away, little rider? A true champion would face me in the heart of fear!"]="Sales correndo? Um campeão de verdade se enfrentaría a mim no Coração do Medo."
G["Flying machines?"]="Máquinas voadoras?"
G["Flying through cloud rings is the best way to pick up speed. Sometimes it's worth going out of the way for that boost of speed!"]="Flying through cloud rings is the best way to pick up speed. Sometimes it's worth going out of the way for that boost of speed!"
G["Foam Sword Rack"]="Cremalheira da lâmina da espuma"
G["Focus all of your attacks onto one single slime!"]="Centra todos seus ataque em uma sozinha babosa!"
G["Focus on the fires. No - wait - get the saurok! Just ... do something!"]="Concéntrate nos fogos. Não, espera, ataca aos saurok! Isto... faça algo!"
G["Focus upon that warmth as I speak..."]="Focus upon that warmth as I speak..."
G["Focus your fire, $p!"]="Centra seus ataque, $p!"
G["Focus your mind, mortal. This is the front line of a war unlike any you've witnessed.\n\nYou'll need full command of your faculties if you are to be of any use."]="Focus your mind, mortal. This is the front line of a war unlike any you've witnessed.\n\nYou'll need full command of your faculties if you are to be of any use."
G["Focus, $n.\n\nWe have to get to the Coffer of Promise before Schnottz does!"]="Concéntrate, $n.\n\nTemos que conseguir o Arca da promessa antes que Schnottz!"
G["Focus, $p! The meat from wildlife or rations from orc troops will keep my crew well fed!"]="Céntrate, $p! A carne da fauna local e as rações dos soldados orcs alimentarão bem a meu equipamento."
G["Focus, Weisheng. Show your enemy the meaning of pain!"]="Céntrate, Weisheng. Que seu inimigo sepao que é o dor!"
G["Fodder for the engine."]="Combustível para o motor."
G["Foe Reaper 5000 on-line.  All systems nominal."]="Foe Reaper 5000 on-line.  All systems nominal."
G["Fog... nothing but dense fog... wait! Land - starboard! I see ships."]="Névoa... só uma névoa densa... espere! Terra a estibordo! Vejo navios."
