G["Foolish $r! There is a new order. Aviana is dead. DEAD! And never coming back.\n\nTell that to the druids in the trees.\n\nSethria will soon be the master of the skies, and she has made sure Aviana will never be reborn. The egg is hers.\n\nYou are too late."]="Foolish $r! There is a new order. Aviana is dead. DEAD! And never coming back.\n\nTell that to the druids in the trees.\n\nSethria will soon be the master of the skies, and she has made sure Aviana will never be reborn. The egg is hers.\n\nYou are too late."
