G["Foolish mortals-(Usurper's children!) nothing you have done- (Spawn of a lesser god!) I am TRYING to speak here. (Words, words, words. The Master wants murder.) ALL falls to chaos. ALL will be destroyed. (Chaos, chaos!) Your work here today changes nothing. (Chaos, chaos, all things end) No mortal may see what you have and live. Your end has come."]="Mortais insensatos... (Filhos do usurpador!) Nada do que vocês têm feito... (Sementes de um deus menor!) Estou TENTANDO falar. (Palavras, palavras, palavras. O mestre quer mortes.) TUDO será caos. TUDO será destruído. (Caos, caos!) O que vocês têm feito não muda nada. (Caos, caos, tudo termina!) Nenhum mortal pode ver o que vocês e seguir vivo. Chegou seu fim!"
G["Foolish mortals. Did you think that I would not strike you down for your transgressions?"]="Foolish mortals. Did you think that I would not strike you down for your transgressions?"
G["Foolish mortals. You thought us defeated so easily? The San'layn are the Lich King's immortal soldiers! Now you shall face their might combined!"]="Foolish mortals. You thought us defeated so easily? The San'layn are the Lich King's immortal soldiers! Now you shall face their might combined!"
