G["Foolishness! Do you know nothing of that accursed blade, $c?\n\nIt would devour all that you are. Whatever remained of your lifeless husk would spend eternity in the enemy's service.\n\nIt is that same rationale that bought Arthas his fate, costing Azeroth legions of its best champions.\n\nStill, there may be something...."]="Foolishness! Do you know nothing of that accursed blade, $c?\n\nIt would devour all that you are. Whatever remained of your lifeless husk would spend eternity in the enemy's service.\n\nIt is that same rationale that bought Arthas his fate, costing Azeroth legions of its best champions.\n\nStill, there may be something...."
