G["For a limited time only, crunchy frog available exclusively here at the Darkmoon Faire."]="Por um tempo limitado, sapo crocante disponível exclusivamente aqui no Darkmoon Faire."
G["For a moment I thought you were my beloved Sif... that strand of hair... but no!  It can't be... Sif is dead....\n\nMy... my brother.... killed her!"]="For a moment I thought you were my beloved Sif... that strand of hair... but no!  It can't be... Sif is dead....\n\nMy... my brother.... killed her!"
G["For a small donation, I can train you in the priestly arts."]="Para uma pequena doação, posso treiná-o nas artes sacerdotais."
G["For ages, I was lost.  Now, finally, I see how dark my soul had become..."]="Por eras, eu estava perdido. Agora, finalmente, vejo como minha alma ficou escura..."
G["For all my supposed wisdom, there have been moments that I've barely been able to hold the Horde together. The Wrath Gate and Undercity displayed that clearly enough."]="For all my supposed wisdom, there have been moments that I've barely been able to hold the Horde together. The Wrath Gate and Undercity displayed that clearly enough."
G["For all of its dangers, this land is a hunter's paradise."]="For all of its dangers, this land is a hunter's paradise."
G["For as long as we are able, we shall provide safe haven for those who seek it."]="Se podemos, daremos refúgio a tudo aquele que o necesite."
G["For big King!"]="pelo grande Rei!"
G["For countless years, and across the faces of many worlds, draenei have yearned to better embrace the Light and put an end to the darkness. So too have our Scryer brethren held such ambition."]="For countless years, and across the faces of many worlds, draenei have yearned to better embrace the Light and put an end to the darkness. So too have our Scryer brethren held such ambition."
G["For da Horde!"]="pela Ho'da!"
G["For da Horde."]="Pela Horda."
G["For days following the fall of Lei Shen, the vale was shrouded in a cloud of the deepest black. Summoned by Lei Shen in his final moments, the otherworldly storm blanketed the vale with rainfall and struck jagged spears of lightning into the hills."]="For days following the fall of Lei Shen, the vale was shrouded in a cloud of the deepest black. Summoned by Lei Shen in his final moments, the otherworldly storm blanketed the vale with rainfall and struck jagged spears of lightning into the hills."
G["For de Darkspear!"]="pelos Lança Negra!"
G["For dey Horde!"]="pela Ho'da!"
G["For eight hundred and seventy-seven years, I waited in that crystal... watching shadows pass through the cracks, counting decades."]="For eight hundred and seventy-seven years, I waited in that crystal... watching shadows pass through the cracks, counting decades."
G["For every Horde soldier that you killed -- for every Alliance dog that fell, the Lich King's armies grew. Even now the val'kyr work to raise your fallen as Scourge."]="For every Horde soldier that you killed -- for every Alliance dog that fell, the Lich King's armies grew. Even now the val'kyr work to raise your fallen as Scourge."
G["For every ill or evil that rises in Pandaria, there is always a perfectly complementary cure. I find it to be a good analogy to all problems."]="For every ill or evil that rises in Pandaria, there is always a perfectly complementary cure. I find it to be a good analogy to all problems."
G["For every orc that struck me, I will cleave a thousand of their skulls!"]="For every orc that struck me, I will cleave a thousand of their skulls!"
G["For everything that you take, give double in kind."]="For everything that you take, give double in kind."
G["For everything you have done, $n... you have our gratitude."]="Por tudo o que fez, $n... tem nossa gratidão."
G["For fortune!"]="Por fortuna!"
G["For generations I protected my people with the mists, and yet with each and every champion I see before me, I realize more and more the error of my ways. May you learn from the lessons of Pandaria, as I have."]="For generations I protected my people with the mists, and yet with each and every champion I see before me, I realize more and more the error of my ways. May you learn from the lessons of Pandaria, as I have."
G["For glory! For honor! FOR THUNDERMAR!"]="pela glória! pelo honra! POR BRAMAL!"
G["For her Excellency... for... Vashj!"]="Pelo seu excelência... por... Vashj!"
G["For her grace, Lady Naz'jar."]="pela graça de Lady Naz'jar."
G["For him, Horde be about orcs, an' buildin' up orc power. Like he just come through de portal. Anyone stand in his way, anyone tink any diff'rent, he shut 'em up.\n\n<Vol'jin runs his three-fingered hand across his scar.>\n\nHe like an angry dog. Oh, I fight next to Hellscream in battle, sure. But put him in charge? Ya askin' for trouble. He pick his favorites, start his war, shove me bruddahs aside... He don't tink he need nobody else. Well, he wrong.\n\nHe gonna learn: ya never cross family."]="For him, Horde be about orcs, an' buildin' up orc power. Like he just come through de portal. Anyone stand in his way, anyone tink any diff'rent, he shut 'em up.\n\n<Vol'jin runs his three-fingered hand across his scar.>\n\nHe like an angry dog. Oh, I fight next to Hellscream in battle, sure. But put him in charge? Ya askin' for trouble. He pick his favorites, start his war, shove me bruddahs aside... He don't tink he need nobody else. Well, he wrong.\n\nHe gonna learn: ya never cross family."
G["For his glory!"]="No seu honra!"
G["For honor!"]="pelo honra!"
G["For honor! For justice!"]="pelo honra! pela justiça!"
G["For honor, for mercy, for Gorefiend.  Forever."]="Por honra, por piedade, por sanguinávido. Por sempre."
G["For hours, I agonized over the visions the waters of the river showed me."]="For hours, I agonized over the visions the waters of the river showed me."
G["For it to be as it must, yes."]="Para que seja como deve, sim."
G["For many hundreds of years Alassin has cared for the animals that our hunters befriend.  His care of animals is highly sought for by the hunters around here.  If you seek him as well, then look for him in the Cenarion Enclave."]="Por muitas centenas de anos, Alassin cuidou dos animais que nossos caçadores fazem amizade. Seu cuidado com os animais é muito procurado pelos caçadores por aqui. Se você o procurar também, procure-o no Enclave Cenariano."
G["For mastery over the arcane, you need look no further than Semid. He teaches on the eastern side of Azure Watch along with Ruada."]="Para dominar o arcano, você não precisa procurar mais do que Semid. Ele ensina no lado oriental do Azure Watch, juntamente com Ruada."
G["For me?"]="Para meu?"
G["For me? Really, mon?"]="Para mim? De verdade, colega?"
G["For me? That's mighty nice of you, $n."]="Para mim? É muito gentil por você, $n."
G["For millennia I have waited in darkness, in silence pierced only by the shrieks of the tormented, my dreams a waking nightmare."]="For millennia I have waited in darkness, in silence pierced only by the shrieks of the tormented, my dreams a waking nightmare."
G["For millennia this being lay dormant beneath the world - biding its time. From its prison it waited for the exact moment at which to strike back at those that would see it harmed."]="For millennia this being lay dormant beneath the world - biding its time. From its prison it waited for the exact moment at which to strike back at those that would see it harmed."
G["For most of my life the faire has been my home."]="Durante grande parte de minha vida, a feira foi meu lar."
G["For multiple targets, bring a blizzard down upon their heads."]="For multiple targets, bring a blizzard down upon their heads."
G["For my Taunka brothers and sisters! FOR THE HORDE!"]="Por meus irmãos e irmãs taunkas! pela HORDA!"
G["For my death, countless more will fall. The burden is now yours to bear."]="For my death, countless more will fall. The burden is now yours to bear."
G["For my deeds, I was named a Paragon. A hero to be preserved in amber for a time when the empire would need... correcting."]="For my deeds, I was named a Paragon. A hero to be preserved in amber for a time when the empire would need... correcting."
G["For my entire life I have thought my bloodline cursed. I have lived beneath the shadow of my father's greatest failure."]="For my entire life I have thought my bloodline cursed. I have lived beneath the shadow of my father's greatest failure."
G["For my lady and master!"]="Por meu senhora e mestra!"
G["For normal maintenance of time, the Keepers of Time are sufficient caretakers. We are able to deal with most ordinary disturbances. I speak of little things, such as rogue mages changing something in the past to elevate their status or wealth in the present."]="For normal maintenance of time, the Keepers of Time are sufficient caretakers. We are able to deal with most ordinary disturbances. I speak of little things, such as rogue mages changing something in the past to elevate their status or wealth in the present."
G["For now I must leave you. Toya is gathering jade for my project. When he is finished I would like you to bring it to me at the Emperor's Omen so that we might look at what secrets history has hidden from us."]="For now I must leave you. Toya is gathering jade for my project. When he is finished I would like you to bring it to me at the Emperor's Omen so that we might look at what secrets history has hidden from us."
G["For now we cannot return to Kalimdor. Only Chawg is going back with you.  Another ship is coming to take the rest of us on to our destination.\n\nThe greatest adventure is yet ahead of you, $n. Our paths will cross again, and when they do, the fate of the world will be in your hands!"]="For now we cannot return to Kalimdor. Only Chawg is going back with you.  Another ship is coming to take the rest of us on to our destination.\n\nThe greatest adventure is yet ahead of you, $n. Our paths will cross again, and when they do, the fate of the world will be in your hands!"
G["For now, I must direct my attention to rebuilding the village. There is much to be done. You may rest here if you like, but we'll not accept any more help."]="For now, I must direct my attention to rebuilding the village. There is much to be done. You may rest here if you like, but we'll not accept any more help."
G["For now, we have regained control over this half of Stratholme and should rejoice for that. The former Bastion of the Silver Hand is back in the hands of its rightful owners. Countless treasures to the order reside here, and we now have a fortified location to launch our next assault."]="For now, we have regained control over this half of Stratholme and should rejoice for that. The former Bastion of the Silver Hand is back in the hands of its rightful owners. Countless treasures to the order reside here, and we now have a fortified location to launch our next assault."
G["For now, you will remain the Trade Prince of the Bilgewater Cartel."]="For now, you will remain the Trade Prince of the Bilgewater Cartel."
G["For once I agree with you... scum."]="Por uma vez estou de acordo com você... canalha."
G["For our Masters!"]="Por nossos mestres!"
G["For our brothers and sisters!"]="Por nossos irmãos e irmãs!"
G["For our children and the future of the Alliance! The Legion shall not prevail!"]="Por nossos filhos e o futuro da Aliança! A Legião não prevalecerá!"
G["For our first show of skill and power we bring you SCAR-SHELL, mightiest of dragon turtles!"]="Para nossa primeira demonstração de habilidade e poder os presentamos a Escaraza, a poderosa tartaruga dragão!"
G["For our patron!"]="Por nosso patrono!"
G["For pity's sake, Ashbury, cover yourself. Your leg bones are popping out."]="pelo que mais queira, Ashbury, cúbrete. Se te saem os ossos das pernas."
G["For reasons I cannot understand, Elder Thunderhorn has gone to the Slithering Scar in Un'Goro Crater."]="Por razões que não consigo entender, o Élder Thunderhorn foi para a Cicatriz Deslizante na Cratera Um'Goro."
G["For shure it be good."]="Tranqui, está bem."
G["For simple schematics of your skill level, speak with Ghermas, if you would."]="Para obter esquemas do seu nível de habilidade fala com Ghermas."
G["For so long I have drifted in my cursed form. You have freed me... Your hard work shall be repaid."]="E vivido durante demais tempo na minha forma maldito. Me liberado... Se você será recompensado pelo seu duro trabalho."
G["For so long as I live, I will stand at your side... as you have stood at mine."]="For so long as I live, I will stand at your side... as you have stood at mine."
G["For so long, I was lost... The Nightmare's corruption had consumed me... And now, you... all of you... you have saved me. Released me from its grasp."]="For so long, I was lost... The Nightmare's corruption had consumed me... And now, you... all of you... you have saved me. Released me from its grasp."
G["For some odd reason, I love to stare at this cane. Hmmm..."]="Por algum motivo, me encantar olhar este cajado. Mmm..."
