G["For ten thousand years ... as the veil of mists kept Pandaria hidden from prying eyes."]="Por dez mil anos... enquanto o véu de névoa mantinha Pandária escondida de olhos curiosos."
G["For that, you have earned my respect, my gratitude, and my vote. Well done."]="For that, you have earned my respect, my gratitude, and my vote. Well done."
