G["For the finest food, look no further!"]="Não busques mais! A melhor comida está aqui!"
G["For the first time in the Ring of Blood's history, Mogor has chosen to exercise his right of battle! On this wartorn ground, $n will face Mogor, hero of the Warmaul!"]="For the first time in the Ring of Blood's history, Mogor has chosen to exercise his right of battle! On this wartorn ground, $n will face Mogor, hero of the Warmaul!"
G["For the first time, I feel safe. I do not know you, stranger, but I know that I would lay down my life for you if only you asked."]="For the first time, I feel safe. I do not know you, stranger, but I know that I would lay down my life for you if only you asked."
G["For the first time, the Earthen Ring and the Cenarion Circle will unite - to restore this great Tree - thereby healing the whole of Azeroth."]="For the first time, the Earthen Ring and the Cenarion Circle will unite - to restore this great Tree - thereby healing the whole of Azeroth."
