G["For the pride of the mantid!"]="pelo orgulho dos mantídeos!"
G["For the queen. For Wyrmrest Temple!"]="pela rainha. pelo Templo do Repouso do Dragão!"
G["For the real Horde!"]="pela Horda verdadeira!"
G["For the right price, my crew and I will serve.\n\nBecause General Nazgrim is an honorable orc, I will only ask 100 gold initially, with generous hazard pay for myself and my men."]="For the right price, my crew and I will serve.\n\nBecause General Nazgrim is an honorable orc, I will only ask 100 gold initially, with generous hazard pay for myself and my men."
G["For the swarm!"]="pelo enxame!"
G["For the thane! For Loken!"]="pelo senhor feudal! Por Loken!"
G["For the time being, that area is free of Scourge influence. I fear it will only be a matter of time before they return."]="Por enquanto, essa área está livre de influência do Flagelo. Temo que seja apenas uma questão de tempo antes que eles retornem."
G["For the time being, yes.  However, allow my presence to be a motivator.  Prince Kael'thas was displeased with the failure of the crystal experiment on Fallen Sky Ridge.  This is one of the reasons for why we chose the Cenarion druids as the testing grounds for the bomb."]="For the time being, yes.  However, allow my presence to be a motivator.  Prince Kael'thas was displeased with the failure of the crystal experiment on Fallen Sky Ridge.  This is one of the reasons for why we chose the Cenarion druids as the testing grounds for the bomb."
G["For the true Horde!"]="pela Horda autêntico!"
G["For the warchief!"]="pelo Chefe de Guerra!"
G["For the younglings! For the Horde!"]="For the younglings! For the Horde!"
G["For this moment ALONE was I made. Look upon your death, mortals, and despair!"]="For this moment ALONE was I made. Look upon your death, mortals, and despair!"
G["For those of you allergic to almonds, our cyanide capsules come in an assortment of flavors."]="For those of you allergic to almonds, our cyanide capsules come in an assortment of flavors."
G["For those who prefer to rely on mundane methods of mending the flesh, Kanaria keeps a tidy station within the Falconwing Square inn."]="Para aqueles que preferem confiar em métodos mundanos de consertar a carne, Kanaria mantém uma estação arrumada dentro da pousada na Praça Falconwing."
G["For too long I tolerated my brother.  It is time to set things right.  It is time to destroy him and his followers."]="Por muito tempo eu tolerei meu irmão. É hora de acertar as coisas. É hora de destruir ele e seus seguidores."
G["For too long we have ignored the secrets of the Arcane.\n\nAre you here to learn, as well?"]="Temos dados a costas aos segredos do Arcano durante demais tempo.\n\nVocê também tem vindo a aprender?"
G["For too long we have ignored the secrets of the Arcane.\n\nSadly, they will remain a secret to you."]="Temos dados a costas aos segredos do Arcano durante demais tempo.\n\nPor desgraça, para você continuarão sendo um segredo."
G["For we are all born of you, and shall all return to you."]="For we are all born of you, and shall all return to you."
G["For we have endured much... far beyond what any of us could have imagined."]="For we have endured much... far beyond what any of us could have imagined."
G["For who but the titans themselves could bestow such a curse? What could have such power?"]="Pois quem, além dos próprios titãs, poderá condenar a tal maldição? Que poderá ter tanto poder?"
G["For years I served in this backwater corner of the world, learning the terrain and biding my time. At last our time has come. The full might of Orgrimmar is now turned to Azshara, our gateway to Ashenvale and dominance over this continent. Welcome to the front lines, $c."]="For years I served in this backwater corner of the world, learning the terrain and biding my time. At last our time has come. The full might of Orgrimmar is now turned to Azshara, our gateway to Ashenvale and dominance over this continent. Welcome to the front lines, $c."
G["For years I was convinced we were doing the right thing in Silvermoon - working to reach Outland so we could be reunited with Kael.\n\nHad I known what Kael'thas had in store for us, I would've stayed right in Falconwing Square."]="For years I was convinced we were doing the right thing in Silvermoon - working to reach Outland so we could be reunited with Kael.\n\nHad I known what Kael'thas had in store for us, I would've stayed right in Falconwing Square."
G["For years beyond counting these woods have burned. They are fueled by an ancient magic and are the mating grounds for the brood mother and her proto-drake consorts.\n\nBut now a long-forgotten evil has reawakened and seeks once again to enslave the offspring of the brood mother for their own purposes.\n\nThese vrykul have caused a disturbance that is extending the boundary of the clutch, and threatens your people."]="For years beyond counting these woods have burned. They are fueled by an ancient magic and are the mating grounds for the brood mother and her proto-drake consorts.\n\nBut now a long-forgotten evil has reawakened and seeks once again to enslave the offspring of the brood mother for their own purposes.\n\nThese vrykul have caused a disturbance that is extending the boundary of the clutch, and threatens your people."
G["For years it has languished, slowly growing in strength..."]="Durante anos ele jazeu adormecido, aumentando sua força lentamente..."
G["For years, Honor Hold has stood against the horrors of Hellfire Peninsula.  Now, now that the portal has reopened and aid streams in from Azeroth, perhaps this bloody stalemate will end."]="Durante anos, a honra Hold enfrentou os horrores da Península Fogo do Inferno. Agora, agora que o portal reabriu e ajudou fluxos de Azeroth, talvez esse impasse sangrento termine."
G["For years, I have longed to complete this spell and my transformation. Behold!"]="For years, I have longed to complete this spell and my transformation. Behold!"
G["For you see, strife feeds on conflict. When you have peace in your heart, strife will find somewhere else to roam."]="For you see, strife feeds on conflict. When you have peace in your heart, strife will find somewhere else to roam."
G["For you, Azshara."]="Por você, Azshara."
G["For your efforts, you be gettin' da greatest of rewards...."]="Pelos seus esforços, obterá a melhor das recompensas..."
G["For your enchanting needs, you must speak to Lai the Spellpaw at Dawn's Blossom in The Jade Forest.\n\nI will mark the location on your map."]="For your enchanting needs, you must speak to Lai the Spellpaw at Dawn's Blossom in The Jade Forest.\n\nI will mark the location on your map."
G["For your safety, I can only allow you short flights to other places in the fjord. What is your desired destination?"]="For your safety, I can only allow you short flights to other places in the fjord. What is your desired destination?"
G["For... Khaz... Modan!"]="Por... Khaz... Modan!"
G["For... Quel'...Thalas!"]="Por... Quel'... Thalas!"
G["For... Quel'Thalas."]="Por... Quel'thalas."
G["Forage for me, Wikky!"]="Rebusca, Wikky!"
G["Force them into bottlenecks. Let them think they can win..."]="Force them into bottlenecks. Let them think they can win..."
G["Forced to land like a dog. No matter. Soon, all of these wonderous beasts will be under the control of the master."]="Forced to land like a dog. No matter. Soon, all of these wonderous beasts will be under the control of the master."
