G["Forgive me $c, but I must concentrate on my job."]="Forgive me $c, but I must concentrate on my job."
G["Forgive me for questioning you, my son. My sight isn't what it once was, but the raven has blessed me with a long life.\n\nSoon, it will be time for you to take my place. I have taught you all I know. My only regret is that I didn't prove worthy enough to recover our sacred Book of the Raven."]="Forgive me for questioning you, my son. My sight isn't what it once was, but the raven has blessed me with a long life.\n\nSoon, it will be time for you to take my place. I have taught you all I know. My only regret is that I didn't prove worthy enough to recover our sacred Book of the Raven."
G["Forgive me oh great one. I did not mean to learn the truth!"]="Perdóname, oh magnífico. Não era meu intenção descobrir a verdade!"
G["Forgive me!"]="Perdóname!"
G["Forgive me, $n! Your death only adds to my failure!"]="Forgive me, $n! Your death only adds to my failure!"
G["Forgive me, $r, I must focus on my job."]="Forgive me, $r, I must focus on my job."
