G["Forgive me, brothers, for I have failed you..."]="Forgive me, brothers, for I have failed you..."
G["Forgive me, but I am spent and cannot use my magic to send you back Theramore. You have the look of a worldly adventurer about you; surely you know of another way to reach Theramore in time."]="Forgive me, but I am spent and cannot use my magic to send you back Theramore. You have the look of a worldly adventurer about you; surely you know of another way to reach Theramore in time."
G["Forgive me, daughter..."]="Perdóname, filha..."
