G["Forgive my abruptness, $c.\n\nPressing matters of great import require my undivided attention."]="Forgive my abruptness, $c.\n\nPressing matters of great import require my undivided attention."
G["Forgive my deception, mon. It all been for your own good."]="Forgive my deception, mon. It all been for your own good."
