G["Friend! Breath my incense if you need healing!"]="$gAmigo: Amiga;! Respira meu incenso se você precisa cura!"
G["Friend! It's been too long.  What can we get for you?"]="Amigo! Tem sido muito tempo. O que podemos obter para você?"
G["Friend, I come to help. We will show Shai Hu to his grave!"]="Venho a ajudar. Shai Hu encontrará seu tumba!"
G["Friend, I will return to the refugees. Meet us there, so we can thank you properly."]="Vuelvo com os refugiados. Nos veremos ali e poderei dar a você as Obrigado como é devido."
G["Friend, have your journeys brought you to Krasarang recently?\n\nIt would be wise to venture there. The fish are as bountiful as the most fortunate harvest.\n\nAs my father said, the early fisherman gets the catch!"]="Friend, have your journeys brought you to Krasarang recently?\n\nIt would be wise to venture there. The fish are as bountiful as the most fortunate harvest.\n\nAs my father said, the early fisherman gets the catch!"
G["Friend, this is Dawn's Blossom! The heart of Pandaren life here in the Jade Forest. If you wish to make an impression, I am certain many of these citizens could use your help."]="Isto é Floralba! É o coração da vida pandaren na Floresta de Jade. Se que causar boa impresão, estou certo de que muitos cidadãos necessário sua ajuda."
G["Friend, wipe the drool off of your chin and come lend me a hand!"]="Friend, wipe the drool off of your chin and come lend me a hand!"
G["Friend, you sure do run your mouth when you get a chance. But it's kinda nice to hear somethin' other than silence now and again."]="$gAmigo: Amiga;, como te gosta dar à grislíngua quando te derem a oportunidade... mas é agradável ouvir algo que não sejao silêncio de vez em quando."
G["Friend?  You were among those who spit and threw stones, Jin'do.  But let's let bygones be bygones, eh?"]="Friend?  You were among those who spit and threw stones, Jin'do.  But let's let bygones be bygones, eh?"
G["Friendly with wolvar still, eh? Then I won't be surprised when you turn on us and side with them again"]="Friendly with wolvar still, eh? Then I won't be surprised when you turn on us and side with them again"
G["Friendly."]="Respeitado"
G["Friends of grummles come soon. You will see!"]="Friends of grummles come soon. You will see!"
G["Friends of the Scryers are not allowed here!"]="Friends of the Scryers are not allowed here!"
G["Friends of the tribe, our city is under attack!  Take up your arms and defend our home!  If you do not wish to battle, then grab weather breakers and line our city to protect it's citzens from the elements!"]="Friends of the tribe, our city is under attack!  Take up your arms and defend our home!  If you do not wish to battle, then grab weather breakers and line our city to protect it's citzens from the elements!"
G["Friends of yours?"]="Friends of yours?"
G["Friends, it is my great pleasure to welcome you to the temple today."]="Friends, it is my great pleasure to welcome you to the temple today."
G["Friends, we have gathered here today to heal this world that we've sacrificed so much to save."]="Friends, we have gathered here today to heal this world that we've sacrificed so much to save."
G["Friends. The Wildhammer way of life is threatened. Our enemies are too numerous for us to remain isolated from one another. We must unite!"]="Friends. The Wildhammer way of life is threatened. Our enemies are too numerous for us to remain isolated from one another. We must unite!"
G["Friends... I've failed you..."]="Amigos... Os e falhado..."
G["Frigate Ho! 'Tis an Orc vessel no doubt! Fire!"]="Fragata à visão! É uma nave orca, não há dúvida! Fogo!"
