G["Frogs and leather balls for sale!"]="Sapos e bolas de couro à venda!"
G["From Lordaeron to Kalimdor, they will know his name and they will sing songs of glory, praising the fallen champion of the Horde."]="From Lordaeron to Kalimdor, they will know his name and they will sing songs of glory, praising the fallen champion of the Horde."
G["From a young age, I have been drawn to the healing arts."]="From a young age, I have been drawn to the healing arts."
G["From all of us at Bilgewater Harbor..."]="From all of us at Bilgewater Harbor..."
G["From beneath the dark roots of the nearby tree, an ancient terror awakens..."]="Entre as sombrios raízes do árvore próximo se acorde um horror ancestral..."
G["From death comes life, and from life, death...."]="da morte surge a vida, e da vida, a morte..."
G["From deep within the bowels of Blackrock Mountain, it's Sanoriak, master of flame!"]="Desdo mais profundo da Montanha Rocha Negra... Sanoriak, mestre da chama!"
G["From her depths she cries out for aid, but few can hear her pleas."]="From her depths she cries out for aid, but few can hear her pleas."
G["From here in the Gatehouse, you may travel in one of three directions. The stairs behind me lead to the Grand Ball Room, where guests are currently being entertained. I'm sure you can smell the nearby Stables, and the entrance to Servant's Quarters lies next to the Gatehouse door."]="A partir daqui, no Gatehouse, você pode viajar em uma das três direções. As escadas atrás de mim levam ao Grand Ball Room, onde os convidados estão sendo entretidos. Tenho certeza de que você pode sentir o cheiro dos estábulos próximos, e a entrada para Servant's Quarters fica ao lado da porta do Gatehouse."
G["From here we can reach out to the natives and keep Horde aggression in check."]="Desde aqui poderemos pedir ajuda aos nativos e ter à Horda baixo controle."
G["From here we meditate on the wonders of Pandaria."]="Desde aqui meditamos sobre as maravilhas de Pandaria."
G["From his hiding place, he oversees their preparations for war with the goal of exterminating the stone giants!"]="From his hiding place, he oversees their preparations for war with the goal of exterminating the stone giants!"
G["From its BLEAKEST DEPTHS, we RECLAIM this world!"]="From its BLEAKEST DEPTHS, we RECLAIM this world!"
G["From its shores, we shall conquer Stormwind, and with it any hope the enemy clings to."]="Desde seu costa conquistaremos Ventobravo, e assim se desvanecerá toda a esperança do inimigo."
G["From now on, we define the terms of the engagement."]="From now on, we define the terms of the engagement."
G["From parts unknown: Skra'gath! Can $n possibly survive the onslaught of void energies?"]="From parts unknown: Skra'gath! Can $n possibly survive the onslaught of void energies?"
G["From shattered lands where heroes tread..."]="From shattered lands where heroes tread..."
G["From sundered ground the sacrament was stolen. The Shield of Aesirites is lost. Unrest will be eternal."]="From sundered ground the sacrament was stolen. The Shield of Aesirites is lost. Unrest will be eternal."
G["From the Savage Ledge of Icecrown, Vladof the Butcher and his mammoth, Enormos! There ain't gonna be a thing left of our challengers, folks! Prepare for a downpour of blood, guts and tears!"]="From the Savage Ledge of Icecrown, Vladof the Butcher and his mammoth, Enormos! There ain't gonna be a thing left of our challengers, folks! Prepare for a downpour of blood, guts and tears!"
G["From the air, you should be able to cast your protective ward on whole groups of animals at once."]="From the air, you should be able to cast your protective ward on whole groups of animals at once."
G["From the bowels of the Underhalls comes Carnage.  Brave and foolish $n has accepted the challenge.  $G He : She; and $g his : her; group stand ready to face the monstrosity."]="From the bowels of the Underhalls comes Carnage.  Brave and foolish $n has accepted the challenge.  $G He : She; and $g his : her; group stand ready to face the monstrosity."
G["From the cruelty and mercilessness of Arthas, the man who would be the Lich King, the Forsaken were born."]="From the cruelty and mercilessness of Arthas, the man who would be the Lich King, the Forsaken were born."
G["From the darkest night shall rise again the raven, shall take flight in the shadows, shall reveal the nature of its kind. Prepare yourself for its coming, for the faithful shall be elevated to take flight with the raven, the rest be forgotten to walk upon the ground, clipped wings and shame."]="From the darkest night shall rise again the raven, shall take flight in the shadows, shall reveal the nature of its kind. Prepare yourself for its coming, for the faithful shall be elevated to take flight with the raven, the rest be forgotten to walk upon the ground, clipped wings and shame."
G["From the depths of Icecrown Citadel, one of the Lich King's chosen comes to put an end to the existence of $n and $g his : her; friends."]="From the depths of Icecrown Citadel, one of the Lich King's chosen comes to put an end to the existence of $n and $g his : her; friends."
G["From the earth you arose. To the earth you shall return."]="da terra veio e à terra volverás."
G["From the faraway boughs of tranquil Darnassus, High Priestess Tyrande Whisperwind arrives!"]="From the faraway boughs of tranquil Darnassus, High Priestess Tyrande Whisperwind arrives!"
G["From the flames of fate, the yaungol were born. They survive beyond the wall, for they refuse to submit to any law but their own."]="Das chamas do destino, os yaungóis nasceram. Eles sobreviveram além da muralha, pois recusaram-se a se submeter a uma lei que não fosse a deles."
G["From the flying city of Dalaran, the leader of the Kirin Tor, Lady Jaina Proudmoore!"]="Desde a cidade voadora de Dalaran, a líder do Kirin Tor: Lady Jaina Corajoso!"
G["From the looks o' it, the Korune were loyal to the Thunder King, thousands o' years ago... before even the pandaren came to rule this land."]="From the looks o' it, the Korune were loyal to the Thunder King, thousands o' years ago... before even the pandaren came to rule this land."
G["From the mist and fog the Kvaldir approach. Flee while you still breathe the air of the living..."]="From the mist and fog the Kvaldir approach. Flee while you still breathe the air of the living..."
G["From the moment the wild creatures first stirred on Azeroth, Goldrinn was there. His is the spirit of the hunter, the animal instinct that kicks in when wild things smell food or feel their children are in jeopardy. He appears as a great white wolf, ferocious and cunning.\n\nHe's known across all cultures. The orcs even have their own name for him: \"Lo'Gosh.\"\n\nTen thousand years ago, when demons first breached Azeroth, Goldrinn stood with the other ancients to mount a desperate defense."]="From the moment the wild creatures first stirred on Azeroth, Goldrinn was there. His is the spirit of the hunter, the animal instinct that kicks in when wild things smell food or feel their children are in jeopardy. He appears as a great white wolf, ferocious and cunning.\n\nHe's known across all cultures. The orcs even have their own name for him: \"Lo'Gosh.\"\n\nTen thousand years ago, when demons first breached Azeroth, Goldrinn stood with the other ancients to mount a desperate defense."
G["From the safety of Camp Taurajo I once trained young hunters in the ways of the wild.\n\nWe have no such luxury now - skills must be learned in the heat of battle against a foe camped on our very doorstep."]="From the safety of Camp Taurajo I once trained young hunters in the ways of the wild.\n\nWe have no such luxury now - skills must be learned in the heat of battle against a foe camped on our very doorstep."
G["From the trees, the amber flowed and nurtured us. Kyparite, we called it, the lifeblood of the earth."]="From the trees, the amber flowed and nurtured us. Kyparite, we called it, the lifeblood of the earth."
G["From the very air! Tendrils of arcane energy light up the obsidian sky as plumes of raw magic rise up from fissures in the land. Kneel and drink from the fissure as you do from a stream or well. Pluck a tendril from the heavens as if it were an apple hanging from a branch."]="From the very air! Tendrils of arcane energy light up the obsidian sky as plumes of raw magic rise up from fissures in the land. Kneel and drink from the fissure as you do from a stream or well. Pluck a tendril from the heavens as if it were an apple hanging from a branch."
G["From the west, the mantid stir.\n\nFrom the northwest, the mogu practice their dark arts.\n\nFrom the north, the yaungol press us.\n\nThere is too much to do, and too little time."]="From the west, the mantid stir.\n\nFrom the northwest, the mogu practice their dark arts.\n\nFrom the north, the yaungol press us.\n\nThere is too much to do, and too little time."
G["From these hidden paths we can rain terror down on our enemies below.\n\nThere is not much honor in hit-and-run strikes, but a good warrior knows to keep his foe off-balance."]="From these hidden paths we can rain terror down on our enemies below.\n\nThere is not much honor in hit-and-run strikes, but a good warrior knows to keep his foe off-balance."
G["From these the Light withdraws, until only darkness remains."]="E então, a Luz se retirará, até que somente permanezca a escuridão."
G["From this day forth, failure is no longer an option."]="From this day forth, failure is no longer an option."
G["From this day forth, you walk as one of our brotherhood."]="De hoje em adiante será dos nossos."
G["From this day forth, you walk as one of us."]="From this day forth, you walk as one of us."
G["From this dock, The Bravery travels back and forth between Stormwind and Rut'theran Village."]="A partir desta doca, o The Bravery viaja de um lado para o outro entre Stormwind e Rut'theran Village."
G["From this moment until the end of days I live and die - For the Horde!"]="From this moment until the end of days I live and die - For the Horde!"
G["From this spring I shall gather the sacred waters with which I will combine the blood of the fallen druids."]="From this spring I shall gather the sacred waters with which I will combine the blood of the fallen druids."
G["From up here you can see the full scope of the cataclysm's destruction. It is chilling to see just how fragile our world really is."]="Daqui em diante, você pode ver tudo o escopo da destruição do Cataclismo. É arrepiante ver quão frágil é o nosso mundo."
G["From way downtown!"]="Desdo centro da cidade!"
G["From what I can tell, there were no sides in this fight. Why would the yaungol kill each other in a free-for-all?"]="From what I can tell, there were no sides in this fight. Why would the yaungol kill each other in a free-for-all?"
G["From what I've gathered, they're preparing for an attack on the mogu at dawn."]="From what I've gathered, they're preparing for an attack on the mogu at dawn."
G["From yesterday's field trip, Marduk showed us that the dragons will tolerate the meat of recently killed humanoids, but only if they died slowly and painfully."]="From yesterday's field trip, Marduk showed us that the dragons will tolerate the meat of recently killed humanoids, but only if they died slowly and painfully."
G["From your death springs life anew!"]="Do seu morte voltará a brotar a vida!"
