G["Garrosh has turned Orgrimmar into a fortress. You may need to seek out allies... beyond the Horde."]="Garrosh tem fortificado Orgrimmar. Talvez tenha que procurar aliados... fosse da Horda."
G["Garrosh is a tyrant for taking our home."]="Garrosh é um tirano que nos tem tirado o lar."
G["Garrosh is amassing his troops on the northern side of Kun-Lai Summit."]="Garrosh está reunindo ao seu exército no lado norte da Cima Kun-Lai."
G["Garrosh is beyond redemption, Greatmother. I fear that in helping the Mag'har, I have convinced Garrosh that he is unfit to lead."]="Garrosh está além da redenção, Grande-mãe. Receio que, ao ajudar os Mag'har, convenci Garrosh de que ele não é capaz de liderar."
G["Garrosh is eager to take the fight to the north, though Thrall urgres caution..."]="Garrosh ansía levar a luta ao norte, embora Thrall recomendada precaução..."
G["Garrosh is going to try to use the Divine Bell to wreak havoc on the land. We must find a way to stop him."]="Garrosh is going to try to use the Divine Bell to wreak havoc on the land. We must find a way to stop him."
G["Garrosh is using every weapon he can lay his hands on. Shouldn't we level the playing field?"]="Garrosh is using every weapon he can lay his hands on. Shouldn't we level the playing field?"
G["Garrosh playing god? Making monsters? Dis ain't what da Horde is about!"]="Garrosh joga a ser um deus? Cria monh'truos? Essa não é meu Horda!"
G["Garrosh really has gone all-out this time, hasn't he?  I expected more spikes, honestly."]="Garrosh não tem reparado em gastos, não? Embora, a verdade, esperava mais pinchos."
G["Garrosh spouts on about honor and strength, but in truth our leader sees only two outcomes - either fight and survive, or be defeated and forgotten."]="Garrosh spouts on about honor and strength, but in truth our leader sees only two outcomes - either fight and survive, or be defeated and forgotten."
G["Garrosh will have your head!"]="Garrosh te cortará a cabeça!"
G["Garrosh will not tolerate demon worship within the walls of Orgrimmar. You will submit and allow yourselves to be taken into custody or be destroyed."]="Garrosh não tolera a adoração de demônios nos confines de Orgrimmar. Ríndete e de que te arrestemos, ou prepare-se para morrer."
G["Garrosh will not tolerate failure.  AGAIN!"]="Garrosh will not tolerate failure.  AGAIN!"
G["Garrosh will pay for his crimes."]="Garrosh pagará pelos seus crímenes."
G["Garrosh will pay!"]="Garrosh pagará!"
G["Garrosh will soon be sending his most capable soldiers. It is they who will guide you into the open and waiting arms of the Horde."]="Garrosh will soon be sending his most capable soldiers. It is they who will guide you into the open and waiting arms of the Horde."
G["Garrosh! Stay your hand!"]="Garrosh! Detente!"
G["Garrosh! Vol'jin!  Hold your tongues.  There are larger issues at stake."]="Garrosh! Vol'jin!  Hold your tongues.  There are larger issues at stake."
G["Garrosh's Horde does not tolerate failure."]="Garrosh's Horde does not tolerate failure."
G["Garrosh's example is not one that I care to follow. The Alliance should make its own decisions. The RIGHT decisions."]="Garrosh's example is not one that I care to follow. The Alliance should make its own decisions. The RIGHT decisions."
G["Garrosh's goons didn't like that I kept working with trolls."]="Garrosh's goons didn't like that I kept working with trolls."
G["Garrosh's madness must be stopped, $n, our future depends on it. While the gravity of this task is immense, I would not entrust this deed to another."]="É preciso colocar fim à loucura de Garrosh, $n. Nosso futuro depende de elho. É uma missão crucial, e não se a confiaría a ninguém mais."
G["Garrosh's pride has destroyed the Vale. What was will never be restored."]="Garrosh's pride has destroyed the Vale. What was will never be restored."
G["Garrosh's prize, not ours. Mark my words, this construct is dangerous."]="O tesouro de Garrosh, não o nosso. Lembre-se meu advertência: esse ensamblagem é perigoso."
G["Garrosh, I expect you to control yourself here. I do not want a repeat of the Violet Citadel."]="Garrosh, espero que te controles aqui. Não quero que se repitao da Cidadela Violeta."
G["Garrosh, enough!"]="Garrosh! Basta!"
G["Garrosh, enough."]="Já basta, Garrosh."
G["Garrosh, please. There may be another way. One that requires no bloodshed."]="Garrosh, espera. Talvez tenha outra forma, uma que não requiera derramamento de sangue."
G["Garrosh, son of Hellscream, your father lived and died as our greatest hero. Honor me by allowing me to show you what your father sacrificed so that we could live free of the demon's grasp."]="Garrosh, son of Hellscream, your father lived and died as our greatest hero. Honor me by allowing me to show you what your father sacrificed so that we could live free of the demon's grasp."
G["Garrosh, you do truly believe the sha can be controlled? Have you seen what it's done to our men?"]="Garrosh, de verdade acha que é possível controlar aos sha? Tem visto o que têm feito com nossos homens?"
G["Gasps can be heard throughout the room."]="Se oyen suspiros por toda a salão."
G["Gassed up and good to go."]="Com o tanque cheio e pronto."
