G["Gate?! I'm going to bring this whole wall down!"]="A porta? Vou derrubar toda a muralha!"
G["Gather 'round cubs and hear the tale of \"$p and the dreaded Silken Shadows\"..."]="Gather 'round cubs and hear the tale of \"$p and the dreaded Silken Shadows\"..."
G["Gather 'round...."]="Reuníos..."
G["Gather a force and go to the lake.  I want Countess Verrall destroyed by the end of the day!"]="Gather a force and go to the lake.  I want Countess Verrall destroyed by the end of the day!"
G["Gather around me as we prepare to reclaim our homeland!"]="Gather around me as we prepare to reclaim our homeland!"
G["Gather around the altar, brothers and sisters! Revelation awaits!"]="Reuníos ao redor do altar, irmãos e irmãs! Os espera a revelação!"
G["Gather behind me at the gates of the Undercity! Soon we march upon our fallen city and reclaim it - FOR THE HORDE!"]="Reuníos por trás de mim nas portões de Cidade Baixa! Pronto marcharemos sobre nossa cidade cai e a reclamaremos... pela HORDA!"
G["Gather close. We're doing this. Let's roll!"]="Gather close. We're doing this. Let's roll!"
G["Gather enough enemies, and I will strike from the sky."]="Gather enough enemies, and I will strike from the sky."
G["Gather now at the staging area!"]="Reuníos na zona de escala!"
G["Gather round, folks!  Grab a warm drink and find a good seat for you're about to witness a showdown between $r and machine!"]="Gather round, folks!  Grab a warm drink and find a good seat for you're about to witness a showdown between $r and machine!"
G["Gather the wounded. Withdraw to the harbor."]="Recolham aos feridos. Retiraos ao porto."
