G["Gather up those fel reaver parts.  We're going to make a surprise for the goblins!"]="Consegue essas peças de assaltante vil. Vamos preparar uma surpresa para os goblins!"
G["Gather what the villagers are willing to sell us and prepare the others to leave."]="Gather what the villagers are willing to sell us and prepare the others to leave."
G["Gather your courage, $r. Together, we can resist the sha."]="Gather your courage, $r. Together, we can resist the sha."
G["Gather your senses quickly, we must press on."]="Reúna seus sentidos rapidamente, precisamos de seguir."
G["Gather, brothers and sisters!  Let us fulfill our duties and return to Thrall victorious!"]="Gather, brothers and sisters!  Let us fulfill our duties and return to Thrall victorious!"
G["Gather, brothers and sisters! Come, all, and listen!"]="Venham, irmãos e irmãs! Venham todos, e escutem!"
G["Gather, brothers and sisters."]="Reuníos, irmãos e irmãs."
G["Gather, gather. A story has come."]="Reuníos. Reuníos. Chegou uma história."
G["Gather, my pets... there is plenty for all!"]="Venham, ajudantes minhas, há para todas!"
G["Gather, soldiers! Gather and take your trophies from the carapace of the enemy!"]="Gather, soldiers! Gather and take your trophies from the carapace of the enemy!"
G["Gathering"]="Gathering"
G["Gathering lumber."]="Reunindo madeira."
G["Gathering professions allow you to acquire raw materials used by production professions: gathering herbs; mining ore, stone, and jewels; or skinning beasts for their hides.\nYou can either support a related production profession with gathering, or simply sell the raw materials on the auction house."]="Gathering professions allow you to acquire raw materials used by production professions: gathering herbs; mining ore, stone, and jewels; or skinning beasts for their hides.\nYou can either support a related production profession with gathering, or simply sell the raw materials on the auction house."
G["Gathering... information... on the Scourge.\n\nAlliance forces appeared...\n\nWe took cover - waited until they attacked the gate... then, we hit them from the rear.\n\nPinched between us... and the Scourge... it was too much for them....\n\n$g Brother:Sister;... it was... glorious."]="Gathering... information... on the Scourge.\n\nAlliance forces appeared...\n\nWe took cover - waited until they attacked the gate... then, we hit them from the rear.\n\nPinched between us... and the Scourge... it was too much for them....\n\n$g Brother:Sister;... it was... glorious."
G["Gawurgggl! Blrgl-brgl grgl!"]="Gawurgggl! Blrgl-brgl grgl!"
G["Gaze into the heart of N'Zoth."]="Gaze into the heart of N'Zoth."
G["Gaze into the inevitable!"]="Observao inevitável!"
G["Gaze into the void."]="Olhem o vazio."
G["Gaze into the void. It is the perpetuity in which they dwell."]="Gaze into the void. It is the perpetuity in which they dwell."
G["Gaze now, mortals - upon the HEART OF M'URU! Unblemished. Bathed by the light of Creation - just as it was at the Dawn."]="Gaze now, mortals - upon the HEART OF M'URU! Unblemished. Bathed by the light of Creation - just as it was at the Dawn."
G["Gaze to the heavens! What do you see?"]="Olhem os céus! Que veis?"
G["Gaze upon its magnificence! Bask in its glorious, um, glory! I present you with... V-07-TR-0N!"]="Gaze upon its magnificence! Bask in its glorious, um, glory! I present you with... V-07-TR-0N!"
G["Gaze upon my crazy tentacle-face and despair, Azerothian!"]="Olhe meu louca rosto de tentáculos e desespera, cidadão de Azeroth!"
G["Gaze upon the Exodar, young $r. It is hard to imagine that we survived such a catastrophe.\n\n<Menelaous sighs.>\n\nThe Prophet states that it is here that our fate will finally be known. Ten lifetimes spent fleeing from the madness of the Burning Legion... here we finally make a stand.\n\nNo more running... I am ready to die."]="Gaze upon the Exodar, young $r. It is hard to imagine that we survived such a catastrophe.\n\n<Menelaous sighs.>\n\nThe Prophet states that it is here that our fate will finally be known. Ten lifetimes spent fleeing from the madness of the Burning Legion... here we finally make a stand.\n\nNo more running... I am ready to die."
G["Gaze upon the enemy, $r. See what the might of the Horde reduces even the most powerful of dragons to! All that oppose us shall meet a similar fate!"]="Gaze upon the enemy, $r. See what the might of the Horde reduces even the most powerful of dragons to! All that oppose us shall meet a similar fate!"
G["Gaze... into the void."]="Olhe... ao vazio."
G["Gear all banged up, eh?"]="Equipamento tudo estragado, não é?"
G["Geared and ready, commander."]="Equipados e preparados, comandante."
G["Geared up and ready to die. What would you have of us, sir?"]="Equipados e prontos para morrer. O que quer que hagamos, senhor?"
G["Gebler, father, why would you..."]="Gebler, pai, por que vocês..."
