G["Genius idea, sir. Your brain power never ceases to amaze me!"]="Genius idea, sir. Your brain power never ceases to amaze me!"
G["Genius is often misunderstood, $r. Now, about the scepter shard... If you want that shard and do not wish to spend the next ten thousand years searching for it, you are going to have to listen very carefully."]="Genius is often misunderstood, $r. Now, about the scepter shard... If you want that shard and do not wish to spend the next ten thousand years searching for it, you are going to have to listen very carefully."
G["Genius, I know... It will never be found; but, in case it is found, I gave the minnow some special powers."]="Gênio, eu sei... Isso nunca será encontrado; mas, atenção seja encontrado, eu dei ao peixinho algum poderes especiais."
