G["Glad you asked. Darkmoon Faire Prize Tickets are your currency to purchase some amazing prizes.\n\nPrize Tickets are rewarded for doing monthly quests and playing the games around the faire.\n\nCompleting the monthly quests will earn you the most Prize Tickets, but playing the games daily, is a great way to get ahead.\n\nOnce you have enough tickets, you can spend them at the different vendors on the faire grounds."]="Glad you asked. Darkmoon Faire Prize Tickets are your currency to purchase some amazing prizes.\n\nPrize Tickets are rewarded for doing monthly quests and playing the games around the faire.\n\nCompleting the monthly quests will earn you the most Prize Tickets, but playing the games daily, is a great way to get ahead.\n\nOnce you have enough tickets, you can spend them at the different vendors on the faire grounds."
