G["Go to de old village, across de water. Take it back. I'll help ya den."]="Go to de old village, across de water. Take it back. I'll help ya den."
G["Go to inner ring of War Quarter.  Brom Killian there."]="Vá para o anel interno do War Quarter. Brom Killian está lá."
