G["Go to the Magic Quarter and head to the inner ring. The tailor's there."]="Vá para o Magic Quarter e vá para o anel interno. O alfaiate está lá."
G["Go to the Orc city of Orgrimmar, find him in the Valley of Honor at a shop called the Arms of Legend."]="Vá para a cidade Orc de Orgrimmar, encontre-o no Vale da Honra em uma loja chamada Arms of Legend."
G["Go to the Shady Rest Inn and follow the tracks. See where they lead and report back to me."]="Go to the Shady Rest Inn and follow the tracks. See where they lead and report back to me."
