G["Go'el - the one you call Thrall - his spirit has been scattered across the elemental planes.\n\nThe Twilight's Hammer thinks to shake our will... but we shall not weaken. We will not forsake Go'el.\n\nHe has risked everything to save this world, and we'll do no less for him!"]="Go'el - the one you call Thrall - his spirit has been scattered across the elemental planes.\n\nThe Twilight's Hammer thinks to shake our will... but we shall not weaken. We will not forsake Go'el.\n\nHe has risked everything to save this world, and we'll do no less for him!"
G["Go'el!"]="Go'o!"
