G["Go'el.  You cannot continue to ride the line between Warchief and Shaman.  The time will come when you must commit to one side fully.  That time is fast approaching."]="Go'el.  You cannot continue to ride the line between Warchief and Shaman.  The time will come when you must commit to one side fully.  That time is fast approaching."
