G["Godfrey spent his life defending Gilneas. When the worgen curse spread across Gilneas he turned his attention towards thwarting the worgen assault."]="Godfrey spent his life defending Gilneas. When the worgen curse spread across Gilneas he turned his attention towards thwarting the worgen assault."
