G["Goldrinn is the wolf ancient, known as \"Lo'Gosh\" in the Horde tongue. His tenacity is legendary.\n\nA shrine dedicated to him is in a basin west of the World Tree, but its keepers have fallen silent in the wake of the attack. I fear the worst.\n\nBefore we can move on, you must save the shrine, discover the whereabouts of the wolf ancient, and beat back his foes."]="Goldrinn is the wolf ancient, known as \"Lo'Gosh\" in the Horde tongue. His tenacity is legendary.\n\nA shrine dedicated to him is in a basin west of the World Tree, but its keepers have fallen silent in the wake of the attack. I fear the worst.\n\nBefore we can move on, you must save the shrine, discover the whereabouts of the wolf ancient, and beat back his foes."
G["Goldrinn!  It's true then... the Ancients walk among us again!"]="Goldrinn!  It's true then... the Ancients walk among us again!"
G["Goldrinn's tenacity is the stuff of legend.\n\nWarriors from all walks visit this shrine in hopes of tapping into that kind of battle prowess."]="Goldrinn's tenacity is the stuff of legend.\n\nWarriors from all walks visit this shrine in hopes of tapping into that kind of battle prowess."
