G["Good day citizen.  How may I assist you?"]="Bons dias, $gciudadano: ciuidadana;. Como posso ajudar você?"
G["Good day to ye $g lad : lass;. Can I be of service?"]="Bons dias $gmuchacho: moça;. Posso ajudar você?"
G["Good day to you Nogg! I require training."]="Que tenha bom dia, Nogg! Preciso treinamento."
G["Good day to you both. I would speak to Lord Lescovar."]="Good day to you both. I would speak to Lord Lescovar."
G["Good day to you!"]="Bom dia para você!"
G["Good day to you, $c.\n\nI'm waiting to hear from one of the High Thane's advisors about an audience. It was a struggle just to get the opportunity to present my credentials.\n\nI've heard the Wildhammer described as 'wary of outsiders,' but that's proven to be quite an understatement.  Hopefully, things will improve once I've had the opportunity to meet with Featherbeard, whom I'm told favors closer ties with the Alliance."]="Good day to you, $c.\n\nI'm waiting to hear from one of the High Thane's advisors about an audience. It was a struggle just to get the opportunity to present my credentials.\n\nI've heard the Wildhammer described as 'wary of outsiders,' but that's proven to be quite an understatement.  Hopefully, things will improve once I've had the opportunity to meet with Featherbeard, whom I'm told favors closer ties with the Alliance."
G["Good day to you, $c.\n\nThere's much to be done to assist in the effort here. Sadly, there's very little I can do for you until I get all of my supplies.\n\nI've now got $3223w percent of the razorthorn roots I need to get started. Any assistance you provide will be well worth the effort, I assure you."]="Bons dias, $c.\n\nHá muito que fazer para ajudar aqui. Por desgraça, não posso fazer muito por você até que consiga todos meus suprimentos.\n\nPor agora tenho o $3223w % das raízes de Rajaespina que preciso para começar. Te garanto que qualquer ajuda que me possa oferecer merecerá a pena."
G["Good day to you, $r."]="Bons dias, $r."
G["Good day to you, Hogral! I seek training."]="Que tenha bom dia, Hogral! Preciso treinamento."
G["Good day to you, Syurna. I am in need of training."]="Que tenha um bom dia, Syurna. Preciso treinamento."
G["Good day to you."]="Bom dia para você."
G["Good day to you.  When you've risen a bit more in the ranks of the Sha'tari Skyguard, I will be able offer you a direct flight to the Skyguard Outpost, our base atop the Blade's Edge Mountains."]="Bom dia para você. Quando você subir um pouco mais nas fileiras do Sha'tari Skyguard, poderei oferecer-lhe um voo direto para o Skyguard Outpost, nossa base no topo das Montanhas Blade's Edge."
G["Good day! Need some screws tightened or some bolts loosened? You've come to the right place."]="Dia bom! Precisa de algum parafusos apertados ou algum parafusos soltos? Você veio ao lugar certo."
G["Good day, $c. Are you in need of a reliable hippogryph?"]="Good day, $c. Are you in need of a reliable hippogryph?"
G["Good day, $c. If you wish to learn the smith's art, you've come to the right place."]="Bons dias, $c. Se deseja aprender o arte do ferreiro, tem vindo ao lugar idóneo."
G["Good day, $c. What would you like?"]="Bons dias, $c. Que te apetece?"
G["Good day, $g brave: fair; $c.  How can I be of service?"]="Bons dias, $ggallardo: linda; $c. Como posso ajudar você?"
G["Good day, $gsir:ma'am;. I'd shake your hand, but as you see, I'm in the middle of something. May I be of assistance?"]="Good day, $gsir:ma'am;. I'd shake your hand, but as you see, I'm in the middle of something. May I be of assistance?"
G["Good day, $gsir:madam;!  How may I be of assistance?"]="Bons dias, $gsenhor: senhora;! Em O que posso ajudá-lo?"
G["Good day, $n.  If you require my services as an auctioneer, I regret to inform you: no.  Only grand master engineers possess the minimum intellectual capacity to interface with my superior functions.\n\nMore importantly, why are you still talking to me?"]="Good day, $n.  If you require my services as an auctioneer, I regret to inform you: no.  Only grand master engineers possess the minimum intellectual capacity to interface with my superior functions.\n\nMore importantly, why are you still talking to me?"
G["Good day, $r."]="Bom dia, $r."
G["Good day, Benjamin! Would you mind if I took an apple for Bessy?"]="Good day, Benjamin! Would you mind if I took an apple for Bessy?"
G["Good day, Corbett.  Here's your cheese, fresh made this morning!  And how are things at your shop?"]="Good day, Corbett.  Here's your cheese, fresh made this morning!  And how are things at your shop?"
G["Good day, Elling!  Hullo Elaine!  Let me have a wheel of bleu cheese, eh?"]="Good day, Elling!  Hullo Elaine!  Let me have a wheel of bleu cheese, eh?"
G["Good day, Hulfdan, I am looking for training."]="Bom dia, Hulfdan, estou procurando treinamento."
G["Good day, Ros'eleth. Is my, err, um... uh, my 'headgear' finished?"]="Good day, Ros'eleth. Is my, err, um... uh, my 'headgear' finished?"
G["Good day, friend."]="Bons dias, colega."
G["Good day, sir!"]="Bons dias!"
G["Good day."]="Bons dias."
G["Good deal. Welcome to the spirit world. Kinda. Let's check out the chests for any goodies, and see if you can find my body somewhere!"]="Onda. Agora está no mundo dos espíritos. Bom, mais ou menos. Vamos procurar cofres do tesouro, e de passo, a ver se encontrar meu corpo por algum lado."
G["Good enough! Now go water my Giant Carrots!"]="Good enough! Now go water my Giant Carrots!"
G["Good evening ladies and gentlemen, welcome to this evening's presentation!"]="Bem-vindos, senhoras e senhores, à sessão desta tarde!"
G["Good evening."]="Good evening."
G["Good fight!"]="Good fight!"
