G["Good fight. I'll get you next time."]="Good fight. I'll get you next time."
G["Good fighting, friend!"]="Good fighting, friend!"
G["Good for nothing Kobolds!"]="Good for nothing Kobolds!"
G["Good for you, $c!  Our battlemaster, Thelman Slatefist, can be found in the war room inside Stormwind Keep.  He will help you get to Alterac Valley."]="fico feliz por você, $c! Nosso mestre de batalha, Thelman Punhopizarra, está na salão de envio do Castelo de Ventobravo. Te ajudará a chegar ao Vale Alterac."
G["Good for you. Good for all of you to go on living your lives knowing you can never have the wealth that I do. I'm proud of you for sticking it out."]="Good for you. Good for all of you to go on living your lives knowing you can never have the wealth that I do. I'm proud of you for sticking it out."
G["Good form is the key to defeating your enemies. Don't swing wildly with your weapon. Be disciplined with your attacks."]="Good form is the key to defeating your enemies. Don't swing wildly with your weapon. Be disciplined with your attacks."
