G["Good girl, good girl. You just say right here and eat."]="Boa garota, boa garota. Fique aqui e come."
G["Good home. Had it long time, still stay good."]="Good home. Had it long time, still stay good."
G["Good hunting out there, $c!"]="Boa caça aí fosse, $c!"
