G["Good leather in the marshes, if you've the guts for it. Lots of crocolisks. Thinkin' my brother and I'll stay a while.\nSomethin' I can help you with?"]="Good leather in the marshes, if you've the guts for it. Lots of crocolisks. Thinkin' my brother and I'll stay a while.\nSomethin' I can help you with?"
