G["Good news about Mogujia, $n?"]="Traz boas notícia sobre Mogujia, $n?"
G["Good news, everyone! I think I've perfected a plague that will destroy all life on Azeroth!"]="Boas notícia, amigos! Acho que e perfeccionado uma praga que destruirá toda a vida em Azeroth."
G["Good news, everyone! I've fixed the poison slime pipes!"]="Good news, everyone! I've fixed the poison slime pipes!"
G["Good night, gents. Sleep well."]="Good night, gents. Sleep well."
