G["Good night..."]="Good night..."
G["Good of you to come, champion! The beast almost had me!"]="fico feliz em que tenha vindo, $gcampeón: campeona;! A fera quase me havia preso!"
G["Good ol' Erma, she's been taking care of the local animals for years now.  I'm sure she'd be happy to take care of any you'd like to put up.  She can be found right outside of the Lion's Pride Inn."]="Boa e velha Erma, ela cuida dos animais locais há anos. Tenho certeza que ela ficaria feliz em cuidar de qualquer coisa que você gostaria de colocar. Ela pode ser encontrada do lado de fosse do Lion's Pride Inn."
G["Good ol' Thamner bandaged me up just the other day when I had a run in with a nasty trogg.  I'm good as new I tell ye!  I'm sure Thamner would be happy to show ye how to make a good bandage."]="O bom e velho Thamner me enfaixou no outro dia, quando eu corri com um trogg desagradável. Eu sou bom como novo, digo-vos! Tenho certeza de que Thamner ficaria feliz em mostrar como fazer um bom curativo."
G["Good one! It not even see it coming."]="Good one! It not even see it coming."
G["Good one, sister.  What about your pet?  Where is $n?"]="Essa foi boa, irmã. Que há do seu ajudante? Onde está $n?"
G["Good people of Goldshire, come take advantage of my incredible prices on rare goods. I shall not return for some time!"]="Good people of Goldshire, come take advantage of my incredible prices on rare goods. I shall not return for some time!"
G["Good question, $c. Last I was informed; we have managed to collect $1997w copper bars out of $1998w needed. Additionally, I am told that we have $2002w iron bars out of $2003w, and $2011w out of $2012w thorium bars requested."]="Good question, $c. Last I was informed; we have managed to collect $1997w copper bars out of $1998w needed. Additionally, I am told that we have $2002w iron bars out of $2003w, and $2011w out of $2012w thorium bars requested."
G["Good question, $r. In my younger days I was footloose and fancy free without a care in the world. In those days I would sing in a barber shop quartet out of Stormwind known as the Four Dons. That's where I learned how to craft the Bonescythe digs."]="Good question, $r. In my younger days I was footloose and fancy free without a care in the world. In those days I would sing in a barber shop quartet out of Stormwind known as the Four Dons. That's where I learned how to craft the Bonescythe digs."
G["Good question. You'd hafta ask my brother Turgore that one.\n\nMaybe you can get an answer out of that lazy, no good... oohh. Don't get me started."]="Good question. You'd hafta ask my brother Turgore that one.\n\nMaybe you can get an answer out of that lazy, no good... oohh. Don't get me started."
G["Good riddance!"]="Até nunca!"
G["Good riddance, you overblown, halfbaked, bomb ignition wannabe! See if I ever summon YOU again!"]="Good riddance, you overblown, halfbaked, bomb ignition wannabe! See if I ever summon YOU again!"
G["Good riddance."]="Bom viagem."
G["Good riddance... now none shall be able to repeat my mistakes!"]="Finalmente... agora ninguém poderá repetir meus erros!"
G["Good seein' you again, $n.  I hope our club be treatin' ya right."]="fico feliz em voltar a ver você, $n. Espero que nosso clube te estiver tratando bem."
G["Good shooting! That one won't be getting up anytime soon."]="Bom disparo! Esse não voltará a levantar em breve."
G["Good shot!"]="Bom disparo!"
G["Good shot, $p! Keep aiming for those bombs."]="Good shot, $p! Keep aiming for those bombs."
G["Good show!"]="Bom espectáculo!"
G["Good snowball fight!"]="Good snowball fight!"
G["Good steel $n. Grab a hammer and come over here, let me show you the secret to forging a legendary weapon."]="Bom aço, $n. Pegue um martelo e venha aqui, deixe-me ensinar os segredos da forja de um arma lendária."
G["Good sturdy dwarven construction. That oughta do some damage."]="Good sturdy dwarven construction. That oughta do some damage."
G["Good thing I don't mind waiting."]="Menos mal que não me importa esperar."
G["Good thing I don't really feel the cold."]="Menos mal que não sinto o frio."
G["Good thing someone here has tracking!  Look for Shim'la in the Hunter's Hall in the Valley of Honor."]="Good thing someone here has tracking!  Look for Shim'la in the Hunter's Hall in the Valley of Honor."
G["Good thing that we're surrounded by neighbors with excess machine parts."]="Good thing that we're surrounded by neighbors with excess machine parts."
G["Good thing that you deactivated the moon crystal at An'owyn when you did, $c! Come around any time you feel like pitching in with my research here."]="Good thing that you deactivated the moon crystal at An'owyn when you did, $c! Come around any time you feel like pitching in with my research here."
G["Good thing you brought us nine others.  I think I'll finish this later."]="Good thing you brought us nine others.  I think I'll finish this later."
G["Good things happen to us today."]="Good things happen to us today."
G["Good thinking, Little Lu. Go find out who lives here. Take Sully with you."]="Boa ideia, pequeno Lu. Vê a ver quem vive aí. Leve-se a Sully."
G["Good tidings, $c. I am Stillpine the Younger, heir to the throne of Stillpine."]="Good tidings, $c. I am Stillpine the Younger, heir to the throne of Stillpine."
G["Good times! <hic!>"]="pelos bons tempos! <hip!>"
G["Good timing - I was almost out."]="Good timing - I was almost out."
G["Good timing, Ricket. $n says they need your expertise on the Molten Front."]="Chega a tempo, Ricket. $n diz que necessário seu aptidão na linha de frente de Magma."
G["Good timing, too. Here comes the assault's commander!"]="Logo a tempo. Aqui vem o comandante do ataque!"
G["Good timing. Here they come again!"]="Logo a tempo. Já voltam!"
G["Good tiny thing! You kill other tiny thing!"]="Naniquito bacana! Matar outro naniquito!"
G["Good to be fighting again, don't you think?"]="Está bem voltar à luta, não acha?"
G["Good to hear you got those farmers all squared away, chief. Now we gotta take care of some new business."]="Good to hear you got those farmers all squared away, chief. Now we gotta take care of some new business."
G["Good to know they've still got our backs. Thanks!"]="Good to know they've still got our backs. Thanks!"
G["Good to see a $c on our side!"]="É bom ver a $gun: uma; $c a nosso lado!"
G["Good to see someone wanting to learn something useful. Head to Archibald on the inner ring of the War Quarter."]="É bom ver alguém querendo aprender algo útil. Vá para Archibald no anel interno do War Quarter."
G["Good to see ya again!\n\nKing Stormheart has informed me that he will be taking his leave for a time... a grim memory brought back to him has left him with a score to settle it seems. He was very insistent that we not join him, so we have respected his wishes as we always do.\n\nI have taken responsibility for our clan in the meantime. You are still welcome with us, of course."]="Good to see ya again!\n\nKing Stormheart has informed me that he will be taking his leave for a time... a grim memory brought back to him has left him with a score to settle it seems. He was very insistent that we not join him, so we have respected his wishes as we always do.\n\nI have taken responsibility for our clan in the meantime. You are still welcome with us, of course."
G["Good to see you again adventurer.  Are you ready to begin?"]="É ótimo ver você novamente. Podemos ir?"
G["Good to see you again! Thanks for the hand. I'll be back on my feet in just a moment."]="Bom te ver novamente! Obrigado pela mão. Eu voltarei aos meus pés em apenas um momento."
G["Good to see you again, $g man! : gorgeous!; We work well together; $g see you around. : I hope we get to continue to do so.;"]="fico feliz em voltar a ver você, $gquerido: querida;! Formamos um bom equipamento. Já nos veremos."
G["Good to see you again, $n!"]="fico feliz em voltar a ver você, $n!"
G["Good to see you again, $n! Just a few more adjustments and the trajectory of the jump will be perfect!"]="Good to see you again, $n! Just a few more adjustments and the trajectory of the jump will be perfect!"
G["Good to see you again, $n."]="Me legro de voltar a ver você, $n."
G["Good to see you again, $n.\n\nTake the laborers from camp here, and any others you can find in the region. Assist them in building defenses to ensure no Horde can escape our vengeance.\n\nOne more thing. These troops are not trained for battle and must be protected from harm if they are to succeed.\n\nNow go, and be quick about it. Time is running out!"]="Good to see you again, $n.\n\nTake the laborers from camp here, and any others you can find in the region. Assist them in building defenses to ensure no Horde can escape our vengeance.\n\nOne more thing. These troops are not trained for battle and must be protected from harm if they are to succeed.\n\nNow go, and be quick about it. Time is running out!"
G["Good to see you again, $n. Feel like taking another swing at these yaungol pests?"]="fico feliz em voltar a ver você, $n. Tem ganha de atacar à fedor yaungol outra vez?"
G["Good to see you again, $n. For a moment, I was worried that you wouldn't come.\n\nLet's finish this, shall we? The Scarlet Crusade has proven that it's not going to put an end to itself."]="Good to see you again, $n. For a moment, I was worried that you wouldn't come.\n\nLet's finish this, shall we? The Scarlet Crusade has proven that it's not going to put an end to itself."
G["Good to see you again, $n. I brought a friend with me. She really wanted to see you.\n\n<Kessel laughs.>"]="fico feliz em voltar a ver você, $n. E trazido a uma amiga comigo. Ela tinha muitas ganha de ver você.\n\n<Kessel se ri.>"
G["Good to see you again, $n. I look forward to fighting by your side once more."]="fico feliz em voltar a ver você, $n. Estou impatient por voltar a lutar ao seu lado."
G["Good to see you again, $n. We snuck some more of us in here while you were prepping the Gates for the attack.\n\nI'll show you where we're to rendezvous with Master Shaw.\n\n<The squad leader produces a map of the Twilight Citadel and points to the spot.>\n\nLet me know when you're ready, and we'll all head up together."]="Good to see you again, $n. We snuck some more of us in here while you were prepping the Gates for the attack.\n\nI'll show you where we're to rendezvous with Master Shaw.\n\n<The squad leader produces a map of the Twilight Citadel and points to the spot.>\n\nLet me know when you're ready, and we'll all head up together."
G["Good to see you again, $p.\n\nThis place is ancient. There are answers here, for those who know the questions."]="Good to see you again, $p.\n\nThis place is ancient. There are answers here, for those who know the questions."
G["Good to see you again, Amy. Be safe, luv. I'm off to Goldshire now."]="fico feliz em voltar a ver você, Amy. Cuídate. Tenho que ir a Vilhadorada agora mesmo."
G["Good to see you again, friend. Make haste and hop on while the way is still clear."]="Good to see you again, friend. Make haste and hop on while the way is still clear."
G["Good to see you again. Have we met?"]="fico feliz em voltar a ver você. Nos conhecemos?"
G["Good to see you still alive and kicking, $n. Don't think that I'd forgetten what you did for me in Stormwind, oh so long ago."]="Fico feliz ver que sigues com vida e coleando, $n. Não cria que e esquecido o que fez por mim em Ventobravo há tanto tempo."
G["Good to see you still breathe, $n."]="Fico feliz ver que ainda respiras, $n."
G["Good to see you well, Rensai. We're here for Hawkmaster Nurong. Where can we find him?"]="fico feliz em ver você, Rensai. Buscamos ao mestre de halcones Nurong. Onde está?"
G["Good to see you, $c.\n\nSorry... can't talk. We're in a bit of a fight here."]="fico feliz em ver você, $c.\n\nO sinto, não posso falar. Estamos em meio de uma luta."
G["Good to see you, $n!\n\nI just wanted to make sure that you appreciate all of the products that my genius has brought to the Kajaro Trading Company?\n\nThese include, but are not limited to: Kaja'Cola, the Poultryizer, Town-In-A-Box, my Ingenious Cap of Mook Foolery, KTC Train-a-Tron Deluxe, the Amazing G-Ray, Never-Deflating Pool Ponies, the Big Ones, Warrior-Matic NX-01, and gilgoblins. No strike that last one. Under advice of counsel, I had nothing to do with them.\n\nAnyway, I'm working on a few more things here that I think you'll find interesting, such as the Micro Mechachicken and a little something I like to call Subject Nine."]="Good to see you, $n!\n\nI just wanted to make sure that you appreciate all of the products that my genius has brought to the Kajaro Trading Company?\n\nThese include, but are not limited to: Kaja'Cola, the Poultryizer, Town-In-A-Box, my Ingenious Cap of Mook Foolery, KTC Train-a-Tron Deluxe, the Amazing G-Ray, Never-Deflating Pool Ponies, the Big Ones, Warrior-Matic NX-01, and gilgoblins. No strike that last one. Under advice of counsel, I had nothing to do with them.\n\nAnyway, I'm working on a few more things here that I think you'll find interesting, such as the Micro Mechachicken and a little something I like to call Subject Nine."
G["Good to see you, $n! Do you have a minute?"]="fico feliz em ver você, $n! Tem um minuto?"
G["Good to see you, $n! My students and I came to try Brewmaster Boof's famous brew and to celebrate the brewmoon!"]="Good to see you, $n! My students and I came to try Brewmaster Boof's famous brew and to celebrate the brewmoon!"
G["Good to see you, $n."]="fico feliz em ver você, $n."
G["Good to see you, $n.\n\nI trust everything is going according to plan?"]="fico feliz em ver você, $n.\n\nEspero que tudo vá conforme o planeado?"
G["Good to see you, friend."]="fico feliz em ver você, colega."
G["Good to see you."]="Bom te ver."
G["Good to see you. They're all throughout the tunnels, we'll have to stay on our guard."]="fico feliz em ver você. Estão pelos túneis, devemos permanecer em guarda."
G["Good to stay away from Kartak. He only a friend of Frenzyheart so long as we keep his belly full... and he's got a big belly."]="Good to stay away from Kartak. He only a friend of Frenzyheart so long as we keep his belly full... and he's got a big belly."
G["Good will... prevail."]="O bem... prevalecerá."
G["Good work Bwemba, you an' your friend, make da Darkspear proud."]="Good work Bwemba, you an' your friend, make da Darkspear proud."
G["Good work Bwemba.  It be good to see dat dere be Alliance willin' to help stop da Zandalar."]="Bom trabalho, Bwemba. fico feliz em ver que há membros da Aliança dipueh'tos a ajudar a parar aos Zandalariano."
G["Good work in there, $n! Get on to the village over the bridge. I'm covering extraction for the marines."]="Good work in there, $n! Get on to the village over the bridge. I'm covering extraction for the marines."
G["Good work with the crates! Come talk to me in front of Stratholme for your next assignment!"]="Bom trabalho com as caixas! Venha a falar comigo linha de frente de Stratholme para o seu seguinte encargo!"
G["Good work with them constructs, $glad:lass;.\n\nYou just bought us unfettered access to the repository."]="Good work with them constructs, $glad:lass;.\n\nYou just bought us unfettered access to the repository."
G["Good work!"]="Bom trabalho!"
G["Good work! Arthas now knows about the plagued grain in Stratholme, and is about to begin the culling.\n\nSomething is still not quite right, though. I sense a foreign presence in this timeline besides us, and that must mean the Infinite Dragonflight are here somewhere."]="Good work! Arthas now knows about the plagued grain in Stratholme, and is about to begin the culling.\n\nSomething is still not quite right, though. I sense a foreign presence in this timeline besides us, and that must mean the Infinite Dragonflight are here somewhere."
G["Good work! Dealing with the Hozen will be easier than I had anticipated."]="Good work! Dealing with the Hozen will be easier than I had anticipated."
G["Good work! I'm glad to see some revenge taken on that traitor. Go ahead and take the path Miran did to the east and let Prospector Ironband know we're all set. I'm sure he'll have some work for you as well."]="Good work! I'm glad to see some revenge taken on that traitor. Go ahead and take the path Miran did to the east and let Prospector Ironband know we're all set. I'm sure he'll have some work for you as well."
G["Good work! Let Orseus know if we need to take another pass. Otherwise, I'll meet you in the grove!"]="Good work! Let Orseus know if we need to take another pass. Otherwise, I'll meet you in the grove!"
G["Good work! We're almost there! This way."]="Bom trabalho! Estamos a ponto de chegar. Por aqui."
G["Good work! You're quite a fighter."]="Bom trabalho! Luchas que da gusto."
G["Good work, $c. These blood elves are actively researching the mogu. It's clear that Garrosh is searching for artifacts of power, but we won't let him succeed."]="Bom trabalho, $c. Os elfos de sangue estão investigando aos mogu. Está claro que Garrosh procurando artefatos de poder, mas não se o permitiremos."
G["Good work, $glad:lass;! Now to attack their leader!"]="Good work, $glad:lass;! Now to attack their leader!"
