G["Good work, $n."]="Bom trabalho, $n."
G["Good work, $n. We couldn't have done it without you."]="Good work, $n. We couldn't have done it without you."
G["Good work, $p! Now I can collect the pure water!"]="Bom trabalho, $p! Agora posso coletar a água pura!"
G["Good work, $p! We'll take these bombs back to the admiral immediately."]="Bom trabalho, $p! Levaremos as bombas ao almirante de imediatamente."
G["Good work, $p, you saved the village. We are forever in your debt."]="Bom trabalho, $p. salvou a aldeia. Te estamos eternamente agradecidos."
G["Good work, champion. I will take this foul creature back with me. This druid has much to answer to."]="Bom trabalho, campeão. Me levarei a esta miserável criatura comigo. Este druida precisa responder por muitas coisas."
G["Good work, defenders! We are gaining ground!"]="Bem feito, defensores! Estamos ganhando terreno!"
G["Good work, druids! This area looks secure. Let's head back to base."]="Bom trabalho, druidas! Esta zona parece certa. Voltemos à base."
