G["Grand Admiral Jes-Tereth is launching a fleet to break the Horde blockade of Kalimdor. Will you join her?"]="A grande almirante vai lançar seu frota em um ataque contra a Horda para acabar com o bloqueio de Kalimdor. Vai se juntar a ela?"
G["Grand Admiral Jes-Tereth sent me to ask you to join the fleet in breaking the Horde blockade of Kalimdor."]="A grande almirante Jes-Tereth me enviada a pedir que te umas à frota para quebrar o bloqueio da Horda de Kalimdor."
G["Grand Admiral Westwind has a plan... a vision. We must remain faithful and steadfast in its execution for the sake of the world."]="Grand Admiral Westwind has a plan... a vision. We must remain faithful and steadfast in its execution for the sake of the world."
G["Grand Apothecary Putress unleashes the Engorged Blight Worm!"]="Grand Apothecary Putress unleashes the Engorged Blight Worm!"
G["Grand Apothecary Putress!  I come to report from the battlefronts..."]="Grande Boticário Putress! Venho com um relatório dos frentes de batalha..."
G["Grand Empress Zek'hara masked her true intentions behind the guise of matronly worry. She claimed her overbearing ways were necessary to protect us."]="Grand Empress Zek'hara masked her true intentions behind the guise of matronly worry. She claimed her overbearing ways were necessary to protect us."
G["Grand Foreman Puzik Gallywix finally intervened, taking the surplus of poisons to his tower, here at the Sludge Fen, in order to study and research the unstable nature of the toxins. A decision was finally reached to share the secret of the poison with the Defias Brotherhood in exchange for a very large supply of a stable, usable poison.\n\nKlaven Mortwake of the Defias Brotherhood was tasked with the job of altering the chemical properties of Zanzil's mixture."]="Grand Foreman Puzik Gallywix finally intervened, taking the surplus of poisons to his tower, here at the Sludge Fen, in order to study and research the unstable nature of the toxins. A decision was finally reached to share the secret of the poison with the Defias Brotherhood in exchange for a very large supply of a stable, usable poison.\n\nKlaven Mortwake of the Defias Brotherhood was tasked with the job of altering the chemical properties of Zanzil's mixture."
G["Grand Vizier Zor'lok, voice of the Empress."]="Grand Vizier Zor'lok, voice of the Empress."
G["Grand Warlock Wilfred Fizzlebang will summon forth your next challenge. Stand by for his entry."]="Grand Warlock Wilfred Fizzlebang will summon forth your next challenge. Stand by for his entry."
G["Grandmatron... you're alive!"]="Grande matrona... Está viva!"
G["Grandson, will you... Will you tell Garrosh what you have told me about his father?"]="Grandson, will you... Will you tell Garrosh what you have told me about his father?"
