G["Grant me your mark, mighty ancient."]="Otórgame seu marca, poderoso ancestral."
G["Grant me your mark, wise ancient."]="Otórgame seu marca, sábio ancestral."
G["Grant us the ability to know the truth. If a murderer walks in our midst, guide us in our search for justice."]="Grant us the ability to know the truth. If a murderer walks in our midst, guide us in our search for justice."
G["Grant your celestial mantle to my pet, and let a new celestial take your place!"]="Concede seu manto celestial a meu ajudante e cede ante uma nova divindade!"
G["Grapplehammer relies on me to get things done. A mind like his needs to be free of distractions."]="Grapplehammer confia em mim para fazer as coisas. Uma mente como a dele precisa estar livre de distrações."
G["Grapplehammer wants me to do WHAT? He's finally finished his bomb and he wants ME to fly it across the harbor? No-sir-ee!\n\nHere, I'll set one of my 'copters on autopiliot for you. Good luck!\n\nI'll be in my shelter."]="Grapplehammer wants me to do WHAT? He's finally finished his bomb and he wants ME to fly it across the harbor? No-sir-ee!\n\nHere, I'll set one of my 'copters on autopiliot for you. Good luck!\n\nI'll be in my shelter."
G["Grark Lorkrub, you have been charged and found guilty of treason against the Horde. How you plead is unimportant. High Executioner Nuzrak, step forward."]="Grark Lorkrub, you have been charged and found guilty of treason against the Horde. How you plead is unimportant. High Executioner Nuzrak, step forward."
G["Grasp the Eye of the Lich King and focus your will upon it to scry for important information."]="Segure o olho do Rei Lich e concentre sua vontade nele para procurar informações importantes."
G["Grass, sand, and sludge mix together to form the vague resemblance of a footprint."]="Grass, sand, and sludge mix together to form the vague resemblance of a footprint."
G["Great Gazlowe!"]="Grande Gazlowe!"
G["Great Jade Serpent! Hear our plea."]="Grande Serpente de Jade! Nos escute!"
G["Great Ones keep home safe because they like Oracles I think! They know we good and nice."]="Great Ones keep home safe because they like Oracles I think! They know we good and nice."
G["Great Ones left big kitty protector thing. Not for us I think, but it good friend... keeps mean puppy-men away sometimes."]="Great Ones left big kitty protector thing. Not for us I think, but it good friend... keeps mean puppy-men away sometimes."
G["Great Red Crane! Hear our plea."]="Grande Grulha Vermelha! Atiende nossa súplica."
G["Great Stones not for touching! Bad move! Bad move!"]="Não tocar Pedra Grandes! Mal feito! Mal feito!"
G["Great Tiger, the strangers from beyond the mists, they cannot be trusted. The wreckage in the Jade Forest can attest to this."]="Grande tigres, não podemos confiar nos forasteiros que têm surgido da névoa. O desastre da Floresta de Jade é a prova."
G["Great Tzerak, in the name of Zevrax, we summon you forth!"]="Grande Tzerak, em nome de Zevrax, te invocamos!"
G["Great Uther's ghost, it's chasing after us!  Squire, do something!  Throw rocks at it!  I have no plan!"]="Genial! Nos persigue o fantasma de Uther. Escudeiro, faça algo! Tírale pedras! Não tenho nenhum plano!"
G["Great White Tiger! Hear our plea."]="Grande Tigre Branco! Atiende nossa súplica."
G["Great air spirit, hear my call once more!"]="Grande espírito do ar, ouça meu chamada!"
G["Great and powerful Har'koa, please call for one of your children that it might stealthily carry me into the Altar of Quetz'lun."]="Grande e poderoso Har'koa, por favor, chame um dos seus filhos para que ele possa me levar furtivamente ao Altar de Quetz'lun."
G["Great battle still going on at Sparktouched Haven.\n\nMaybe you find time to help sometime?"]="Grande batalha ter ainda lugar em Retiro Pavesa.\n\nTalvez você tirar tempo para ajudar em algum momentos?"
G["Great beast of burden, heed my call!"]="Grande fera de carga, acuda meu chamada!"
G["Great blessings be upon you, good $r."]="Que as grandes bendições caigan sobre você, gentil $r."
G["Great currents of... Ageon..."]="Great currents of... Ageon..."
G["Great dangers lie beyond those walls, $n. turn back until you are more seasoned in the ways of combat."]="Great dangers lie beyond those walls, $n. turn back until you are more seasoned in the ways of combat."
G["Great day for a race, don't you think?"]="Great day for a race, don't you think?"
G["Great dedication is necessary to ascend the ranks of the Order of the Cloud Serpent. I wish you luck."]="Great dedication is necessary to ascend the ranks of the Order of the Cloud Serpent. I wish you luck."
G["Great driving, soldier! Not a scratch on us!"]="Boa conducção, soldado! Não temos nem um rasgunho!"
G["Great events often have humble beginnings. Consider: a quiet pond. Still. The water is like a sheet of glass."]="Grandes eventos frequentemente têm origens humildes. Perceba: um lago plácido. Parado. A água como uma lâmina de vidro."
G["Great fight, everyone! A few more notches in my hammer and a few less Dragonmaw to threaten Thundermar."]="Great fight, everyone! A few more notches in my hammer and a few less Dragonmaw to threaten Thundermar."
G["Great gourds! Sorry, but I need to leave!"]="Great gourds! Sorry, but I need to leave!"
G["Great is the healing and blessing power of the Light's most diligent followers."]="Great is the healing and blessing power of the Light's most diligent followers."
G["Great job guys! The key should be in his guts somewhere. Just, uh, fish around in there 'till you find it."]="Great job guys! The key should be in his guts somewhere. Just, uh, fish around in there 'till you find it."
G["Great job taking out those cannons, hero. Are you ready to settle this for good?"]="Bom trabalho com os canhões. Acabamos com isto de uma vez por todas?"
G["Great job with that metal monstrosity. There appears to be only a few more obstacles in our way.\n\nOnce you clear out that clanking robot at the end of the hall, we'll be inside Ulduar.\n\nWe also noticed an enormous, fire-breathing protodrake and a molten giant. They aren't in our way, though, if you'd like to just avoid them."]="Great job with that metal monstrosity. There appears to be only a few more obstacles in our way.\n\nOnce you clear out that clanking robot at the end of the hall, we'll be inside Ulduar.\n\nWe also noticed an enormous, fire-breathing protodrake and a molten giant. They aren't in our way, though, if you'd like to just avoid them."
G["Great job!"]="Ótimo trabalho!"
G["Great job! Arthas is safely on his way to Northrend!"]="Bom trabalho! Arthas está a caminho de Northrend!"
G["Great job. Take a break!"]="Bom trabalho. Descanse um pouco!"
G["Great news, everyone!"]="Excelentes notícia, amigos!"
G["Great news, everyone! The slime is flowing again!"]="Grandes notícia, amigos! As babosas voltam a fluir."
G["Great sorrow eminates from this crystal."]="Deste cristal se desprende uma grande tristeza."
G["Great soul of champions past! Bear to me your shield!"]="Great soul of champions past! Bear to me your shield!"
G["Great spirits of the earth, help us in our hour of need!"]="Grandes espíritos da terra, precisamos de sua ajuda!"
G["Great to see you again, $n."]="Encantado de voltar a ver você, $n."
G["Great was the Old One, and terrible was His wrath. He consumed hope and begat despair; He inhaled courage and breathed fear."]="Great was the Old One, and terrible was His wrath. He consumed hope and begat despair; He inhaled courage and breathed fear."
G["Great water spirit, wash away this corruption!"]="Grande espírito da água, limpa esta corrupção!"
G["Great wind brother, clear our path!"]="Great wind brother, clear our path!"
G["Great work getting this place going, $n!"]="Fez um bom trabalho fazendo que este lugar continue em marcha, $n!"
G["Great work, everyone. Take a moment to grab your gear and let's move on."]="Great work, everyone. Take a moment to grab your gear and let's move on."
G["Great!"]="Genial!"
G["Great!  Let's keep those supplies coming, people!"]="Muito bem! Vamos, gente, sigam trayendo suprimentos!"
G["Great!  This servo should do the trick!"]="Bem! Este servo deveria servir!"
G["Great! Let's get out of here. I don't have a weapon, so I'd really appreciate it if you could... you know... protect me?"]="Genial! Vamos de aqui. Não tenho nenhum arma, assim que te agradecería muito que... já sabe... me protejas."
G["Great, let's get started... ha! Fooled you! Surely you didn't think it would be that simple. You'll need to prove your mettle just like everyone else!"]="Ótimo, vamos começar... ha! Enganou você! Certamente você não achou que seria assim tão simples. Você precisará provar sua coragem como todos os outros!"
G["Great, ye found yer way here!\n\nNo time to waste. Ye ready?"]="Estupendo! Tem sabido como chegar aqui!\n\nNão temos tempo que perder. $gPronto: Pronta;?"
G["Great. We're not gutless, we're incompetent."]="Genial. Não somos covardes, somos incompetentes."
G["Greatfather Winter can be found in front of the Ironforge bank. The tree near him is where presents are given out."]="O bisavô Winter pode ser encontrado em linha de frente ao banco Ironforge. A árvore perto dele é onde os presentes são dados."
G["Greatfather Winter is only a wyvern's ride away to Orgrimmar."]="O Grande Para Inverno está a um viagem em dracoleón de Orgrimmar."
G["Greatfather Winter leaves toys for everyone under the tree in Ironforge during the feast of Winter Veil!"]="O bisavô Winter deixa brinquedos para todos debaixo da árvore em Ironforge durante a festa do véu de inverno!"
G["Greatfather Winter will leave presents for everyone under the tree in Ironforge. I can't wait to get mine!"]="Greatfather Winter will leave presents for everyone under the tree in Ironforge. I can't wait to get mine!"
G["Greatfather Winter will leave presents for everyone under the tree in Orgrimmar. I wonder what he'll bring me this year."]="Greatfather Winter will leave presents for everyone under the tree in Orgrimmar. I wonder what he'll bring me this year."
G["Greatmother tells me that I was named after a great orcish hero."]="A avó me diz que fui nomeado em homenagem a um grande herói orc."
G["Greatmother, Garrosh has lost his heart. We are lost without you."]="Greatmother, Garrosh has lost his heart. We are lost without you."
G["Greatmother, I never had the honor. Durotan died long before my time, but his heroics are known to all on my world. The orcs of Azeroth reside in a place known as Durotar, named after your son. And... <You take a moment to breathe and think through what you are about to tell the Greatmother.>"]="Grande-mãe, nunca tive a honra. Durotan morreu muito antes do meu tempo, mas seus heróis são conhecidos por todos no meu mundo. Os orcs de Azeroth residem em um lugar conhecido como Durotar, em homenagem ao seu filho. E... <Você toma um momento para respirar e refletir sobre o que está prestes a dizer à Grande-mãe.>"
G["Greatmother, he tells me that the Mag'har all love, honor, and trust me. He states that with me as warchief, he will be free to die when you pass, erasing his bloodline from existence."]="Greatmother, he tells me that the Mag'har all love, honor, and trust me. He states that with me as warchief, he will be free to die when you pass, erasing his bloodline from existence."
G["Greatmother, is there anything I can do?"]="Greatmother, is there anything I can do?"
G["Greatmother, please drink this water."]="Greatmother, please drink this water."
G["Greatmother, you are the mother of Durotan?"]="Grande-mãe, você é a mãe de Durotan?"
G["Greatmother..."]="Greatmother..."
G["Greatmother...Am I..."]="Greatmother...Am I..."
G["Greed has led you back to me.\n\n<Mathredis laughs.>\n\nA wise Draenei once told me that it - greed - is the single quality that all of the races on this world share. I would have to agree.\n\nHave you collected the components listed within the libram?"]="Greed has led you back to me.\n\n<Mathredis laughs.>\n\nA wise Draenei once told me that it - greed - is the single quality that all of the races on this world share. I would have to agree.\n\nHave you collected the components listed within the libram?"
G["Greely coughs."]="Greely tose."
G["Greely drools a little as she continues her mindless labor."]="Greely drools a little as she continues her mindless labor."
G["Greely sighs and rolls her eyes."]="Greely sighs and rolls her eyes."
G["Greely, can you feel it? My moment of success is at hand!"]="Greely, can you feel it? My moment of success is at hand!"
G["Greely, can you get me back into that footbomb uniform?"]="Greely, can you get me back into that footbomb uniform?"
G["Greely, load The Biggest Egg Ever into the Poultryizer. Mechnuggets for everyone!"]="Greely, load The Biggest Egg Ever into the Poultryizer. Mechnuggets for everyone!"
G["Greely, show them how the guns work."]="Greely, ensine-nos como funcionam os canhões."
G["Greely, why do the Super Booster Rocket Boots only work on the zombies?"]="Greely, why do the Super Booster Rocket Boots only work on the zombies?"
G["Greely, would you like to demonstrate how our parachutes work?"]="Greely, would you like to demonstrate how our parachutes work?"
G["Greely, you're not randomly firing that thing into Bilgewater Port, are you?"]="Greely, you're not randomly firing that thing into Bilgewater Port, are you?"
G["Green dragonflight."]="O Voo Verde."
G["Green team scores a kill."]="O equipamento verde consegue uma morte."
G["Green team wins!"]="Equipe verde ganha"
G["Green-skinned dog! Be silent or I will cut your tongue out and feed it to your swine-like children."]="Green-skinned dog! Be silent or I will cut your tongue out and feed it to your swine-like children."
G["Greenskin... I know why you've come. You will not find allies in my kind for we do not trust you."]="Greenskin... I know why you've come. You will not find allies in my kind for we do not trust you."
G["Greenstone Brew! Straight from the heart of the Jade Forest."]="Greenstone Brew! Straight from the heart of the Jade Forest."
G["Greenstone Dojo owes you its gratitude.\nLet's drink when this is done!"]="Greenstone Dojo owes you its gratitude.\nLet's drink when this is done!"
G["Greentill! Blacksoil! Cover our left flank! I don't want any surprises!"]="Campo Verde! Solo Negro! Cubram nosso flanco esquerdo! Não quero nenhuma surpresa!"
G["Greer, I need a gryphon to ride and some bombs to drop on New Agamand!"]="Greer, preciso de um grifo para montar e algumas bombas para lançar em New Agamand!"
G["Greetin's! And, ah... salutations, I suppose.\n\nSorry. Not quite sure what to say. I'm not used to havin' much in the way of company around here.\n\nThat is, not unless they're here to buy some o' my brew, of course."]="Greetin's! And, ah... salutations, I suppose.\n\nSorry. Not quite sure what to say. I'm not used to havin' much in the way of company around here.\n\nThat is, not unless they're here to buy some o' my brew, of course."
G["Greetin's, $c.\nIt be a sad ting, de way de secrets of de world are hidden from ya: Time, Fate, de burnin' stars an' de cold, cold darkness between... never will ya know de truth of such tings!"]="Greetin's, $c.\nIt be a sad ting, de way de secrets of de world are hidden from ya: Time, Fate, de burnin' stars an' de cold, cold darkness between... never will ya know de truth of such tings!"
G["Greetin's, $c.  I be pityin' your kind, for de secrets of true magic are beyond ya..."]="Saudações, $c. Compadezco aos do seu classe porque os segredos da magia verdadeira estão fosse do seu alcance..."
G["Greetin's, $n.  Are ya here ta be learnin' of de Hidden Arts?"]="Greetin's, $n.  Are ya here ta be learnin' of de Hidden Arts?"
G["Greetings $C.  Have you lost one of your pets?"]="Saudações, $c. perdeu alguma dos seus ajudantes?"
G["Greetings $G brother:sister;, how can we help?"]="Saudações $girmão: irmã; como podemos ajudar?"
G["Greetings $G brother:sister;. How can we be of service?"]="Saudações $girmão: irmã;. Como podemos ser úteis?"
G["Greetings $N! I have traveled from the great city of Stormwind to offer my collection of mounts to aspiring Heroes such as yourself. I believe I have some mounts that will suit you well."]="Greetings $N! I have traveled from the great city of Stormwind to offer my collection of mounts to aspiring Heroes such as yourself. I believe I have some mounts that will suit you well."
G["Greetings $R, I am Tharnariun Treetender."]="Saudações, $r, sou Tharnariun Espinarbolado."
G["Greetings $c - welcome to the front lines in our conquest of Ashenvale!  If you are looking for something to do, then you've come to the right place.  I'm always looking for able-bodied individuals to help bring glory to the Horde!"]="Greetings $c - welcome to the front lines in our conquest of Ashenvale!  If you are looking for something to do, then you've come to the right place.  I'm always looking for able-bodied individuals to help bring glory to the Horde!"
G["Greetings $c -- if you're looking for leather goods and leatherworking supplies, you've come to the right semi-retired Paladin."]="Greetings $c -- if you're looking for leather goods and leatherworking supplies, you've come to the right semi-retired Paladin."
G["Greetings $c!  Welcome aboard the Cloudkisser.  Northrend can be a very harsh place.  I hope you have prepared yourself."]="Greetings $c!  Welcome aboard the Cloudkisser.  Northrend can be a very harsh place.  I hope you have prepared yourself."
G["Greetings $c, I am the leatherworking trainer for Darnassus.  What may I assist you with?"]="Onda, $c, sou o instrutor de couro de Darnassus. Em O que posso ajudar você?"
G["Greetings $c, I am the leatherworking trainer for Thunder Bluff.  What may I assist you with?"]="Onda, $c, sou a instrutora de couro de Penhasco do Trovão. Em O que posso ajudar você?"
G["Greetings $c.  Do you wish to aid the Silverwing Sentinels in their fight at Warsong Gulch?"]="Saudações, $c. Que ajudar aos sentinelas Asa de Prata no seu luta na Ravina Brado Guerreiro?"
G["Greetings $g lad : lass;, if you're looking for the best deals you'll find outside of Ironforge itself, then you've come to the right place."]="Saudações, $gmuchacho: moça;, se atenção os melhores preços que há fosse de Altaforja, tem vindo ao lugar adequado."
G["Greetings $n.  Are you interested in the mystical art of Inscription, or perhaps the intricacies of Herbalism?"]="Olá, $n. Você se interessa pela arte mística da inscrição? Ou pelos segredos do herborismo?"
G["Greetings $p. The waters foretold of your arrival. Unfortunately they didn't foretell of the raiders hitting us so hard.\n\nI am Waterspeaker Tired Shushen. Welcome to Fallsong."]="Greetings $p. The waters foretold of your arrival. Unfortunately they didn't foretell of the raiders hitting us so hard.\n\nI am Waterspeaker Tired Shushen. Welcome to Fallsong."
G["Greetings Citizens!  Soon perhaps the tide will turn in our favor and the plague will end."]="Greetings Citizens!  Soon perhaps the tide will turn in our favor and the plague will end."
G["Greetings Erion, I require training!"]="Saudações, Erion, preciso treinamento!"
G["Greetings High Chief. Would you do me the honor of accepting my invitation to join the Horde as an official member and leader of the Taunka?"]="Saudações, Chefe Supremo. Você me faria a honra de aceitar meu convite para me juntar à Horda como membro oficial e líder dos Taunka?"
G["Greetings again, $c.  I've been watching you."]="Onda novamente, $c. Te tenho estado observando."
G["Greetings and salutations from the manor Ravenholdt, adventurer."]="Saudações e saudações da mansão Ravenholdt, aventureiro."
G["Greetings and salutations, hero!  I have the latest news from both continents and points beyond for your consideration."]="Saudações e saudações, herói! Eu tenho as últimas notícia dos dois continentes e pontos além para a sua consideração."
G["Greetings and welcome to Blizzcon!  We are temporarily borrowing this dock to transport you to Northrend.  Your ride should be here shortly.  Enjoy!"]="Greetings and welcome to Blizzcon!  We are temporarily borrowing this dock to transport you to Northrend.  Your ride should be here shortly.  Enjoy!"
G["Greetings friend! Will you require a room for the night?"]="Onda! Te há falta uma habitação para passar a noite?"
G["Greetings friends, and welcome to the greatest show on Azeroth!\n\nPlease, step right up and take in all we have to offer.  Ride the rides and see the sights!  Amaze at the wonders that the Darkmoon Faire has uncovered in this vast and mysterious world!  We have spared no expense in bringing you excitement that children of all ages will delight in!"]="Greetings friends, and welcome to the greatest show on Azeroth!\n\nPlease, step right up and take in all we have to offer.  Ride the rides and see the sights!  Amaze at the wonders that the Darkmoon Faire has uncovered in this vast and mysterious world!  We have spared no expense in bringing you excitement that children of all ages will delight in!"
G["Greetings honored one.  Turak Runetotem and the other druids have been expecting you at the Hall of Elders on Elder Rise."]="Saudações honraram um. Turak Runetotem e os outros druidas esperam você no Salão dos Anciãos em Elder Rise."
G["Greetings mage.  Shall I provide you with further insight into the world of magic?"]="Saudações mago. Devo fornecer-lhe mais informações sobre o mundo da magia?"
G["Greetings my friend, and welcome to the greatest show in Outland!\n\nPlease, step right up and take in all we have to offer.  Amaze at the wonders that the Darkmoon Faire has uncovered in this vast and mysterious world!  We have spared no expense in bringing you excitement that children of all ages will delight in!"]="Greetings my friend, and welcome to the greatest show in Outland!\n\nPlease, step right up and take in all we have to offer.  Amaze at the wonders that the Darkmoon Faire has uncovered in this vast and mysterious world!  We have spared no expense in bringing you excitement that children of all ages will delight in!"
G["Greetings my friend, and welcome to the greatest show on Azeroth!\n\nPlease, step right up and take in all we have to offer.  Amaze at the wonders that the Darkmoon Faire has uncovered in this vast and mysterious world!  We have spared no expense in bringing you excitement that children of all ages will delight in!"]="Greetings my friend, and welcome to the greatest show on Azeroth!\n\nPlease, step right up and take in all we have to offer.  Amaze at the wonders that the Darkmoon Faire has uncovered in this vast and mysterious world!  We have spared no expense in bringing you excitement that children of all ages will delight in!"
G["Greetings stranger. I am Silkmaster Tsai. Welcome to the ancient Imperial Silk Farm.\n\nThis farm dates back to some of the earliest dynasties of Pandaria, and each generation exceeds the last in quality of silk."]="Greetings stranger. I am Silkmaster Tsai. Welcome to the ancient Imperial Silk Farm.\n\nThis farm dates back to some of the earliest dynasties of Pandaria, and each generation exceeds the last in quality of silk."
G["Greetings stranger. Would you like to visit the mystical Pandaria?"]="Saudações. Você gostaria visitar a místico Pandaria?"
G["Greetings traveler, you have my undying gratitude for dispensing with those dreadful creatures! I was beginning to think I might have to hide out forever!"]="Saudações viajante, você tem minha eterna gratidão por dispensar aquelas criaturas terríveis! Eu estava começando a pensar que talvez tivesse que me esconder para sempre!"
G["Greetings traveler."]="Saudações, andarilho."
G["Greetings traveler.  It is good to see that you made your way here safely from Camp Winterhoof."]="Saudações, viagemro. É bom ver que chegou até aqui saudável e salvou desdo Acampamento Pezunha Invernal."
G["Greetings young $c. It is here that your Warchief challenged Orgrim Doomhammer! Although it happened so many years ago, it is an image still fresh in my mind."]="Greetings young $c. It is here that your Warchief challenged Orgrim Doomhammer! Although it happened so many years ago, it is an image still fresh in my mind."
G["Greetings young one, and welcome to Thunder Bluff.  You'll find safe refuge from the burdens of the world here.  All denizens of the Horde are welcome here.\n\nThe spirits of the present and past come alive here in this sacred place, my friend.  Honor them, and in doing so honor yourself."]="Greetings young one, and welcome to Thunder Bluff.  You'll find safe refuge from the burdens of the world here.  All denizens of the Horde are welcome here.\n\nThe spirits of the present and past come alive here in this sacred place, my friend.  Honor them, and in doing so honor yourself."
G["Greetings young rogue. What do you seek?"]="Saudações jovem ladino. O que você procura?"
G["Greetings!"]="/saudaçoes"
G["Greetings!  Do you need something?"]="Saudações! Você precisa de algo?"
G["Greetings!  I am apprentice to Brewmaster Shadowpour, a pandaren we now call the Mad Brewer.\n\nHis reckless pursuit of flavor at the risk of safety has resulted in countless injuries, illnesses, and now even the wildlife of the area feels his mad brewing.  He is a villain, and I could use your help in stopping him."]="Greetings!  I am apprentice to Brewmaster Shadowpour, a pandaren we now call the Mad Brewer.\n\nHis reckless pursuit of flavor at the risk of safety has resulted in countless injuries, illnesses, and now even the wildlife of the area feels his mad brewing.  He is a villain, and I could use your help in stopping him."
G["Greetings!  I am here to promote a tournament to test your fishing skill in Stranglethorn.  To participate you need enough might to survive there and have enough skill in fishing to coax the fish from the water.\n\n Come back later when you are more qualified!"]="Greetings!  I am here to promote a tournament to test your fishing skill in Stranglethorn.  To participate you need enough might to survive there and have enough skill in fishing to coax the fish from the water.\n\n Come back later when you are more qualified!"
G["Greetings!  If you are here to access gnome engineering schemata, then you are welcome to do so.  Our scanners report you are a certified gnomish engineer!"]="Saudações! Se você está aqui para acessar os esquemas de engenharia do gnome, poderá fazê-o. Nossos scanners informam que você é um engenheiro gnômico certificado!"
G["Greetings!  If you are here to access goblin engineering schemata, please know we only interface with certified goblin engineers."]="Saudações! Se você está aqui para acessar os esquemas de engenharia goblin, saiba que só fazemos interface com engenheiros certificados goblin."
G["Greetings! Behold one of the finest musical instruments in all of Lordaeron. It's a true honor to perform for the Master and all his guests. Take a seat in the audience, I hear a show is starting soon."]="Saudações! Veja um dos melhores instrumentos musicais de toda a Lordaeron. É uma verdadeira honra se apresentar para o Mestre e todos os seus convidados. Sente-se na platéia, ouvi dizer que um show começará em breve."
G["Greetings! I am Historian Llore! Everyone says I smile too much, but I don't think that's possible!"]="Onda! Sou o historiador Lhore! Todos me dizem que sonrío demais, mas acho que isso é possível!"
G["Greetings! I am Tinkmaster Overspark, the chief architect of modern Gnomish Engineering.\n\nOur assembly bay is hard at work fashioning all sorts of great mechanical wonders to aid you in not getting stabbed, slashed, blowed up, or otherwise banished from this realm of existence.\n\nOr at least, not by our enemies."]="Greetings! I am Tinkmaster Overspark, the chief architect of modern Gnomish Engineering.\n\nOur assembly bay is hard at work fashioning all sorts of great mechanical wonders to aid you in not getting stabbed, slashed, blowed up, or otherwise banished from this realm of existence.\n\nOr at least, not by our enemies."
G["Greetings! Please have a look around."]="Greetings! Please have a look around."
G["Greetings! Wonderful day, isn't it?"]="Saudações! Um dia magnífico, não acha?"
G["Greetings,  I am Vindicator Palanaar, a traveling paladin of the Light.  I am here to be of assistance to the night elves."]="Saudações, sou o Vindicante Palanaar, um paladino viajante da Luz. Estou aqui para ajudar os elfos noturnos."
G["Greetings, $Gsir:miss;. I am Master Xylem's apprentice Nyrill. If you have any concerns, please feel free to bring them up with the master.\n\nI will be here to serve you when you're ready to return down to the base of the mountain."]="Greetings, $Gsir:miss;. I am Master Xylem's apprentice Nyrill. If you have any concerns, please feel free to bring them up with the master.\n\nI will be here to serve you when you're ready to return down to the base of the mountain."
G["Greetings, $c - I'm a Commendation Officer acting on behalf of Darnassus.  It is my duty to assist adventurers who have received Alliance Commendation Signets.\n\nI accept signets in different quantities, but the most beneficial exchange for you is to hand in a set of ten at once.  I will enter your deeds into our records when you hand in your signets.  As a result, you will earn recognition from Darnassus for your duty and service."]="Greetings, $c - I'm a Commendation Officer acting on behalf of Darnassus.  It is my duty to assist adventurers who have received Alliance Commendation Signets.\n\nI accept signets in different quantities, but the most beneficial exchange for you is to hand in a set of ten at once.  I will enter your deeds into our records when you hand in your signets.  As a result, you will earn recognition from Darnassus for your duty and service."
G["Greetings, $c - I'm a Commendation Officer acting on behalf of Ironforge.  It is my duty to assist adventurers who have received Alliance Commendation Signets.\n\nI accept signets in different quantities, but the most beneficial exchange for you is to hand in a set of ten at once.  I will enter your deeds into our records when you hand in your signets.  As a result, you will earn recognition from Ironforge for your duty and service."]="Greetings, $c - I'm a Commendation Officer acting on behalf of Ironforge.  It is my duty to assist adventurers who have received Alliance Commendation Signets.\n\nI accept signets in different quantities, but the most beneficial exchange for you is to hand in a set of ten at once.  I will enter your deeds into our records when you hand in your signets.  As a result, you will earn recognition from Ironforge for your duty and service."
G["Greetings, $c - I'm a Commendation Officer acting on behalf of Orgrimmar.  It is my duty to assist adventurers who have received Horde Commendation Signets.\n\nI accept signets in different quantities, but the most beneficial exchange for you is to hand in a set of ten at once.  I will enter your deeds into our records when you hand in your signets.  As a result, you will earn recognition from Orgrimmar for your duty and service."]="Greetings, $c - I'm a Commendation Officer acting on behalf of Orgrimmar.  It is my duty to assist adventurers who have received Horde Commendation Signets.\n\nI accept signets in different quantities, but the most beneficial exchange for you is to hand in a set of ten at once.  I will enter your deeds into our records when you hand in your signets.  As a result, you will earn recognition from Orgrimmar for your duty and service."
G["Greetings, $c - I'm a Commendation Officer acting on behalf of Silvermoon City.  It is my duty to assist adventurers who have received Horde Commendation Signets.\n\nI accept signets in different quantities, but the most beneficial exchange for you is to hand in a set of ten at once.  I will enter your deeds into our records when you hand in your signets.  As a result, you will earn recognition from Silvermoon City for your duty and service."]="Greetings, $c - I'm a Commendation Officer acting on behalf of Silvermoon City.  It is my duty to assist adventurers who have received Horde Commendation Signets.\n\nI accept signets in different quantities, but the most beneficial exchange for you is to hand in a set of ten at once.  I will enter your deeds into our records when you hand in your signets.  As a result, you will earn recognition from Silvermoon City for your duty and service."
G["Greetings, $c - I'm a Commendation Officer acting on behalf of Stormwind.  It is my duty to assist adventurers who have received Alliance Commendation Signets.\n\nI accept signets in different quantities, but the most beneficial exchange for you is to hand in a set of ten at once.  I will enter your deeds into our records when you hand in your signets.  As a result, you will earn recognition from Stormwind for your duty and service."]="Greetings, $c - I'm a Commendation Officer acting on behalf of Stormwind.  It is my duty to assist adventurers who have received Alliance Commendation Signets.\n\nI accept signets in different quantities, but the most beneficial exchange for you is to hand in a set of ten at once.  I will enter your deeds into our records when you hand in your signets.  As a result, you will earn recognition from Stormwind for your duty and service."
G["Greetings, $c - I'm a Commendation Officer acting on behalf of Thunder Bluff.  It is my duty to assist adventurers who have received Horde Commendation Signets.\n\nI accept signets in different quantities, but the most beneficial exchange for you is to hand in a set of ten at once.  I will enter your deeds into our records when you hand in your signets.  As a result, you will earn recognition from Thunder Bluff for your duty and service."]="Greetings, $c - I'm a Commendation Officer acting on behalf of Thunder Bluff.  It is my duty to assist adventurers who have received Horde Commendation Signets.\n\nI accept signets in different quantities, but the most beneficial exchange for you is to hand in a set of ten at once.  I will enter your deeds into our records when you hand in your signets.  As a result, you will earn recognition from Thunder Bluff for your duty and service."
G["Greetings, $c - I'm a Commendation Officer acting on behalf of the Darkspear tribe.  It is my duty to assist adventurers who have received Horde Commendation Signets.\n\nI accept signets in different quantities, but the most beneficial exchange for you is to hand in a set of ten at once.  I will enter your deeds into our records when you hand in your signets.  As a result, you will earn recognition from the Darkspear tribe for your duty and service."]="Greetings, $c - I'm a Commendation Officer acting on behalf of the Darkspear tribe.  It is my duty to assist adventurers who have received Horde Commendation Signets.\n\nI accept signets in different quantities, but the most beneficial exchange for you is to hand in a set of ten at once.  I will enter your deeds into our records when you hand in your signets.  As a result, you will earn recognition from the Darkspear tribe for your duty and service."
G["Greetings, $c - I'm a Commendation Officer acting on behalf of the Exodar.  It is my duty to assist adventurers who have received Alliance Commendation Signets.\n\nI accept signets in different quantities, but the most beneficial exchange for you is to hand in a set of ten at once.  I will enter your deeds into our records when you hand in your signets.  As a result, you will earn recognition from the Exodar for your duty and service."]="Greetings, $c - I'm a Commendation Officer acting on behalf of the Exodar.  It is my duty to assist adventurers who have received Alliance Commendation Signets.\n\nI accept signets in different quantities, but the most beneficial exchange for you is to hand in a set of ten at once.  I will enter your deeds into our records when you hand in your signets.  As a result, you will earn recognition from the Exodar for your duty and service."
G["Greetings, $c - I'm a Commendation Officer acting on behalf of the Gnomeregan Exiles.  It is my duty to assist adventurers who have received Alliance Commendation Signets.\n\nI accept signets in different quantities, but the most beneficial exchange for you is to hand in a set of ten at once.  I will enter your deeds into our records when you hand in your signets.  As a result, you will earn recognition from the Gnomeregan Exiles for your duty and service."]="Greetings, $c - I'm a Commendation Officer acting on behalf of the Gnomeregan Exiles.  It is my duty to assist adventurers who have received Alliance Commendation Signets.\n\nI accept signets in different quantities, but the most beneficial exchange for you is to hand in a set of ten at once.  I will enter your deeds into our records when you hand in your signets.  As a result, you will earn recognition from the Gnomeregan Exiles for your duty and service."
G["Greetings, $c - I'm a Commendation Officer acting on behalf of the Undercity.  It is my duty to assist adventurers who have received Horde Commendation Signets.\n\nI accept signets in different quantities, but the most beneficial exchange for you is to hand in a set of ten at once.  I will enter your deeds into our records when you hand in your signets.  As a result, you will earn recognition from the Undercity for your duty and service."]="Greetings, $c - I'm a Commendation Officer acting on behalf of the Undercity.  It is my duty to assist adventurers who have received Horde Commendation Signets.\n\nI accept signets in different quantities, but the most beneficial exchange for you is to hand in a set of ten at once.  I will enter your deeds into our records when you hand in your signets.  As a result, you will earn recognition from the Undercity for your duty and service."
G["Greetings, $c!"]="Saudações, $c!"
G["Greetings, $c!\n\nChieftain Baine Bloodhoof was distressed to learn of Garrosh's savage attack on the human prince. Our causes for grievance against the Alliance are many, but none are the responsibility of this little one.\n\nThe prince and I met at the Temple of the White Tiger. On my honor I have pledged that I will do what I can to keep him safe.\n\n<Despite his words and the warmth the prince directs his way, the tauren paladin suffers distrustful glances from the royal bodyguards in the corner of the room.>"]="Greetings, $c!\n\nChieftain Baine Bloodhoof was distressed to learn of Garrosh's savage attack on the human prince. Our causes for grievance against the Alliance are many, but none are the responsibility of this little one.\n\nThe prince and I met at the Temple of the White Tiger. On my honor I have pledged that I will do what I can to keep him safe.\n\n<Despite his words and the warmth the prince directs his way, the tauren paladin suffers distrustful glances from the royal bodyguards in the corner of the room.>"
G["Greetings, $c!\n\nI hope you don't mind a little hard work. We could sure use a hand here."]="Saudações, $c!\n\nEspero que não te moleste o trabalho duro. Nos viria bem um pouco de ajuda."
G["Greetings, $c!  Stormwind Harbor is quite a sight to behold.  It's even better seen from the air.  How would you like a bird's eye view of the harbor?"]="Greetings, $c!  Stormwind Harbor is quite a sight to behold.  It's even better seen from the air.  How would you like a bird's eye view of the harbor?"
G["Greetings, $c!  Welcome to the Cathedral of Light!"]="Saudações, $c! Dou a você a boas-vindas à Catedral da Luz!"
G["Greetings, $c! I'm from the Highbank advance scouting unit, trying to win over the Wildhammer here at Thundermar.\n\nTheir gryphon riders are having a tough time bringing down Dragonmaw drake riders. I've got a plan for a contraption that will help, but I'm going to need supplies. Lots of supplies.\n\nCan you help?"]="Greetings, $c! I'm from the Highbank advance scouting unit, trying to win over the Wildhammer here at Thundermar.\n\nTheir gryphon riders are having a tough time bringing down Dragonmaw drake riders. I've got a plan for a contraption that will help, but I'm going to need supplies. Lots of supplies.\n\nCan you help?"
G["Greetings, $c! you look like you might be interested in some fresh spices! Perhaps some books for your journey."]="Greetings, $c! you look like you might be interested in some fresh spices! Perhaps some books for your journey."
G["Greetings, $c."]="Saudações, $c."
G["Greetings, $c.\n\nHow may I help you?"]="Saudações, $c.\n\nComo posso ajudar você?"
G["Greetings, $c.\n\nLook around you. Have you stopped to ponder what all of this means?"]="Greetings, $c.\n\nLook around you. Have you stopped to ponder what all of this means?"
G["Greetings, $c.\n\nThe Alliance currently control Wintergrasp Fortress, but the battle has begun!  Hurry to Wintergrasp and support our forces!"]="Saudações, $c.\n\nAtualmente a Aliança controla a Fortaleza de Invérnia, mas a batalha tem começado. Vê correndo a Invérnia e ajuda a nossas tropas!"
G["Greetings, $c.\n\nThe Alliance currently control Wintergrasp Fortress, but the next battle starts soon.   Get ready to head to Wintergrasp and support our forces!\n\nThe next battle begins in $4354k."]="Saudações, $c.\n\nAtualmente a Aliança controla a Fortaleza de Invérnia. A batalha pela Fortaleza de Invérnia está a ponto de começar! Que se juntar à batalha?\n\nA seguinte batalha começará em $4354k."
G["Greetings, $c.\n\nThe Alliance currently control Wintergrasp Fortress.  When the battle is about to begin, talk to me to enter the battle.\n\nThe next battle begins in $4354k."]="Saudações, $c.\n\nAtualmente a Aliança controla a Fortaleza de Invérnia. Quando a batalha estiver a ponto de começar, fala comigo para se juntar.\n\nA seguinte batalha começará em $4354k."
G["Greetings, $c.\n\nThe Alliance now controls Wintergrasp Fortress. Use the portal, if you like.\n\nThe next battle begins in $4354k."]="Saudações, $c.\n\nA Aliança controla agora a Fortaleza de Invérnia. Usao portal se que.\n\nA seguinte batalha começará em $4354k.."
G["Greetings, $c.\n\nThe Horde currently control Wintergrasp Fortress, but the battle has begun.  Hurry to Wintergrasp and support our forces!"]="Saudações, $c.\n\nAtualmente a Horda controla a Fortaleza de Invérnia, mas a batalha tem começado. Vê correndo a Invérnia e ajuda a nossas tropas!"
G["Greetings, $c.\n\nThe Horde currently control Wintergrasp Fortress, but the next battle starts soon.   Get ready to head to Wintergrasp and support our forces!\n\nThe next battle begins in $4354k."]="Saudações, $c.\n\nAtualmente a Horda controla a Fortaleza de Invérnia, mas a próxima batalha começará pronto. Prepare-se para ir a Invérnia e apoiar a nossas tropas!\n\nA seguinte batalha começará em $4354k."
G["Greetings, $c.\n\nThe Horde currently control Wintergrasp Fortress.  When the battle is about to begin, talk to me to enter the battle.\n\nThe next battle begins in $4354k."]="Saudações, $c.\n\nAtualmente a Horda controla a Fortaleza de Invérnia. Quando a batalha estiver a ponto de começar, fala comigo para se juntar.\n\nA seguinte batalha começará em $4354k."
G["Greetings, $c.\n\nThe Horde now controls Wintergrasp Fortress. Use the portal, if you like.\n\nThe next battle begins in $4354k."]="Saudações, $c.\n\nA Horda controla agora a Fortaleza de Invérnia. Usao portal se que.\n\nA seguinte batalha começará em $4354k.."
G["Greetings, $c.\n\nThe mountains have crumbled and the Cataclysm has caused the seas to rush in and drown Thousand Needles.\n\nWe need your help, now!"]="Saudações, $c.\n\nAs montanhas se têm desabou e o Cataclismo tem provocado que os mares tenham entrou e arrasado As Mil Agulhas.\n\nprecisamos da sua ajuda, já!"
G["Greetings, $c.\n\nThose Sentinels over there have allowed me to share their camp as long as I promise no trouble will follow--I am sure you can appreciate the need for diplomacy while here, yes?\n\nI am here investigating disturbances to the land, and since it aids their cause also, they have agreed that my presence here could only aid the tenuous alliance between all of Azeroth's races. If you wish to aid me, then I would appreciate it, but regardless, please try not to cause any trouble."]="Greetings, $c.\n\nThose Sentinels over there have allowed me to share their camp as long as I promise no trouble will follow--I am sure you can appreciate the need for diplomacy while here, yes?\n\nI am here investigating disturbances to the land, and since it aids their cause also, they have agreed that my presence here could only aid the tenuous alliance between all of Azeroth's races. If you wish to aid me, then I would appreciate it, but regardless, please try not to cause any trouble."
G["Greetings, $c.\n\nWhen the Alliance controls Wintergrasp Fortress, I will open a portal for those who wish to travel there.\n\nThe battle currently enues. Hurry to Wintergrasp and support our forces!"]="Greetings, $c.\n\nWhen the Alliance controls Wintergrasp Fortress, I will open a portal for those who wish to travel there.\n\nThe battle currently enues. Hurry to Wintergrasp and support our forces!"
G["Greetings, $c.\n\nWhen the Alliance controls Wintergrasp Fortress, I will open a portal for those who wish to travel there.\n\nThe next battle begins in $4354k."]="Greetings, $c.\n\nWhen the Alliance controls Wintergrasp Fortress, I will open a portal for those who wish to travel there.\n\nThe next battle begins in $4354k."
G["Greetings, $c.\n\nWhen the Horde controls Wintergrasp Fortress, I will open a portal for those who wish to travel there.\n\nThe battle currently ensues. Hurry to Wintergrasp to support our forces."]="Greetings, $c.\n\nWhen the Horde controls Wintergrasp Fortress, I will open a portal for those who wish to travel there.\n\nThe battle currently ensues. Hurry to Wintergrasp to support our forces."
G["Greetings, $c.\n\nWhen the Horde controls Wintergrasp Fortress, I will open a portal for those who wish to travel there.\n\nThe next battle begins in $4354k."]="Greetings, $c.\n\nWhen the Horde controls Wintergrasp Fortress, I will open a portal for those who wish to travel there.\n\nThe next battle begins in $4354k."
G["Greetings, $c.\n\nYou want Darrok to send you to Venture Bay?"]="Saudações, $c.\n\nQue que Darrok te envíe a Baía Ventura?"
G["Greetings, $c.  Are you here to learn of the hidden arts?"]="Saudações, $c. Tem vindo para aprender tudo sobre as artes ocultas?"
G["Greetings, $c.  I am Exzhal, Servitor of Rastakhan."]="Greetings, $c.  I am Exzhal, Servitor of Rastakhan."
G["Greetings, $c.  I am Miranda Breechlock - one of but a few authorized equipment and materiel quartermasters for the Dawn.\n\nAs you fight evil under our commission - all the while earning our respect and trust - you'll earn valor tokens from Duke Zverenhoff.  Tokens serve two purposes: use them to gain increased standing within our ranks, or use them as tender in acquiring special items.\n\nAs you improve your standing with the Dawn, you'll discover that more items will be made available to you."]="Greetings, $c.  I am Miranda Breechlock - one of but a few authorized equipment and materiel quartermasters for the Dawn.\n\nAs you fight evil under our commission - all the while earning our respect and trust - you'll earn valor tokens from Duke Zverenhoff.  Tokens serve two purposes: use them to gain increased standing within our ranks, or use them as tender in acquiring special items.\n\nAs you improve your standing with the Dawn, you'll discover that more items will be made available to you."
G["Greetings, $c.  I get so few visitors up here.  To what do I owe the pleasure?"]="Saudações, $c. Recibo tão poucos visitantes aqui. A que devo o prazer?"
G["Greetings, $c.  I hope you find your accomodations suitable, even in this time of war."]="Saudações, $c. Espero que o alojamento estiver ao seu altura, inclusive em estes tempos de guerra."
G["Greetings, $c.  If I might be so bold, may I remind you that -- while I attune myself to the magics of Hellfire Citadel -- there will undoubtedly be Hellfire wardens biting at my proverbial heels!\n\nSo, do be an upstanding member of your Horde and play the part of the hero... and protect me!"]="Greetings, $c.  If I might be so bold, may I remind you that -- while I attune myself to the magics of Hellfire Citadel -- there will undoubtedly be Hellfire wardens biting at my proverbial heels!\n\nSo, do be an upstanding member of your Horde and play the part of the hero... and protect me!"
G["Greetings, $c.  It is good you've decided to visit us."]="Greetings, $c.  It is good you've decided to visit us."
G["Greetings, $c.  It is the time of the Harvest Festival - a time of great bounties and a time of remembrance.  We partake of feasts to celebrate all we have to be thankful of, and we remember our ancestors and past heroes to give thanks to the legacy they gave us.\n\nPlease feel free to partake of the feast being offered here.  Also, I am offering some fireworks to help celebrate this joyous time of year."]="Greetings, $c.  It is the time of the Harvest Festival - a time of great bounties and a time of remembrance.  We partake of feasts to celebrate all we have to be thankful of, and we remember our ancestors and past heroes to give thanks to the legacy they gave us.\n\nPlease feel free to partake of the feast being offered here.  Also, I am offering some fireworks to help celebrate this joyous time of year."
G["Greetings, $c.  Though time and drink have dulled my outer senses, my inner eyes remain strong."]="Greetings, $c.  Though time and drink have dulled my outer senses, my inner eyes remain strong."
G["Greetings, $c.  Welcome to Cenarion Hold.  From here we will strike against the silithid where they're at their strongest.  I hope you've come to lend a hand."]="Saudações, $c. $gBienvenido: Bem-vinda; ao Forte Cenariano. Desde aqui atacaremos aos silitídeos quando estejam no seu auge. Espero que tenha vindo a dar uma mão."
G["Greetings, $c.  What may this humble servant of the Feathermoon Stronghold do for you today?"]="Greetings, $c.  What may this humble servant of the Feathermoon Stronghold do for you today?"
G["Greetings, $c.  You are welcome in Nighthaven, as well as all of Moonglade.  The Cenarion Circle welcomes all beings who respect the authority and command of nature.\n\nWhile you are here, please be sure to preserve the balance in all things.  Disturbances are not welcome here, and our wardens are trained to cease all hostilities without question."]="Greetings, $c.  You are welcome in Nighthaven, as well as all of Moonglade.  The Cenarion Circle welcomes all beings who respect the authority and command of nature.\n\nWhile you are here, please be sure to preserve the balance in all things.  Disturbances are not welcome here, and our wardens are trained to cease all hostilities without question."
G["Greetings, $c.  You seek to push yourself to the limits of your hunting prowess?  Look no further.\n\nHemet Nesingwary has assembled the finest expedition the remnant of this world has ever known.  Join us on safari if you dare."]="Saudações, $c. Que caçar ao limite? Não busques mais.\n\nHemet Nesingwary reuniu à melhor expedição mais visão sobre os restos deste mundo. Venha conosco de safári se te atreve."
G["Greetings, $c. Before the night elves invited the draenei to join them here, this glade was all but forgotten.\n\nThe kaldorei are deeply tied to these lands, and we draenei are honored that they have asked us to share in the task of revitalizing Forest Song."]="Saudações, $c. Antes de que os elfos da noite invitaran aos draeneis a entrar a eles aqui, este clareira estava quase esquecido.\n\nOs kaldorei têm um profundo vínculo com estas terras, e nós, os draeneis, nos sentimos honrados de compartilhar a tarefa de revitalizar Canto da Floresta."
G["Greetings, $c. Don't have too much time to talk--I'm just using Chillwind as a camp to get some rest before heading to Hearthglen. I've heard word that before they went crazy, the Scarlet Crusade had a mage working for them who was trying to create powerful bows and guns for their soldiers. I'm not sure if he succeeded or not... the Crusade killed him before any of his finished product made it out. Maybe they killed him to keep it a secret... or maybe they distrust the arcane that much."]="Greetings, $c. Don't have too much time to talk--I'm just using Chillwind as a camp to get some rest before heading to Hearthglen. I've heard word that before they went crazy, the Scarlet Crusade had a mage working for them who was trying to create powerful bows and guns for their soldiers. I'm not sure if he succeeded or not... the Crusade killed him before any of his finished product made it out. Maybe they killed him to keep it a secret... or maybe they distrust the arcane that much."
G["Greetings, $c. For some, the hunter is a way of life, a chosen profession. For others, it is something of a pastime, a badge of courage, or a rite of passage depending on your tribe.\n\nFor me, race and profession mean nothing - it is the testing of your spirit and mind that I respect. For one to stand against the forces of nature and test all of their skills is the true mark of honor.\n\nIf you wish to test yourself and earn my respect, then speak to me more."]="Greetings, $c. For some, the hunter is a way of life, a chosen profession. For others, it is something of a pastime, a badge of courage, or a rite of passage depending on your tribe.\n\nFor me, race and profession mean nothing - it is the testing of your spirit and mind that I respect. For one to stand against the forces of nature and test all of their skills is the true mark of honor.\n\nIf you wish to test yourself and earn my respect, then speak to me more."
G["Greetings, $c. Have you spoken with Fahrad yet?"]="Onda, $c. Já tem falado com Fahrad?"
G["Greetings, $c. I am Field Marshal Snowfall, commander of the war effort here. We've a hard road to plow ahead of us, $g lad : lass;, so if you can help out, please do so. And feel free to ask questions."]="Greetings, $c. I am Field Marshal Snowfall, commander of the war effort here. We've a hard road to plow ahead of us, $g lad : lass;, so if you can help out, please do so. And feel free to ask questions."
G["Greetings, $c. I am Kuros, second of the Triumvirate of the Hand."]="Saudações, $c. Sou Kuros, segundo do Triunvirato da Mão."
G["Greetings, $c. I am Leoren, stable master of Cenarion Hold."]="Saudações, $c. Sou Leoren, mestre de estábulos do Forte Cenariano."
G["Greetings, $c. I can assist you in recovering lost companions."]="Saudações, $c. Eu posso ajudar você a recuperar aos seus companheiros perdidos."
G["Greetings, $c. I can help stable your pets or assist you in recovering lost companions."]="Saudações, $c. Posso ajudar você a guardados aos seus ajudantes ou recuperar a companheiros perdidos."
G["Greetings, $c. I have been sent here from the Exodar to oversee the construction of Azure Watch."]="Saudações, $c. Me têm enviada do Exodar para supervisionar a construção da Avançado Lazúli."
G["Greetings, $c. I trust that you bring me good news concerning the Worldwide Invitational event? If you are, then surely that means you were given a secret code to tell me. In return for your code I will give you a gift of one of the golden pigs that I take care of.\n\nJust whisper it in my ear when you are ready."]="Greetings, $c. I trust that you bring me good news concerning the Worldwide Invitational event? If you are, then surely that means you were given a secret code to tell me. In return for your code I will give you a gift of one of the golden pigs that I take care of.\n\nJust whisper it in my ear when you are ready."
G["Greetings, $c. I trust that you bring me good news concerning the Worldwide Invitational event? If you are, then surely that means you were given a secret code to tell me. In return for your code I will give you a gift of one of the panda cubs that I take care of.\n\nJust whisper it in my ear when you are ready."]="Greetings, $c. I trust that you bring me good news concerning the Worldwide Invitational event? If you are, then surely that means you were given a secret code to tell me. In return for your code I will give you a gift of one of the panda cubs that I take care of.\n\nJust whisper it in my ear when you are ready."
G["Greetings, $c. I trust that you bring me good news concerning the Worldwide Invitational event? If you are, then surely that means you were given a secret code to tell me. In return for your code I will give you a gift, Tyrael's Hilt.\n\nJust whisper it in my ear when you are ready."]="Greetings, $c. I trust that you bring me good news concerning the Worldwide Invitational event? If you are, then surely that means you were given a secret code to tell me. In return for your code I will give you a gift, Tyrael's Hilt.\n\nJust whisper it in my ear when you are ready."
G["Greetings, $c. Is there something I can help you with?"]="Onda, $c. Posso ajudar você em algo?"
G["Greetings, $c. It is good to see you interested in helping with the war effort. The collectors here are organizing the gathering of various stockpiles of goods so that we will be prepared when the time comes.\n\nI am in charge of obtaining $2106w baked salmon to store away for those involved in the fighting at Ahn'Qiraj. The last time that I counted, we had collected $2105w."]="Greetings, $c. It is good to see you interested in helping with the war effort. The collectors here are organizing the gathering of various stockpiles of goods so that we will be prepared when the time comes.\n\nI am in charge of obtaining $2106w baked salmon to store away for those involved in the fighting at Ahn'Qiraj. The last time that I counted, we had collected $2105w."
G["Greetings, $c. My name is Thork--I lead the defenses here in the name of the Warchief.\n\nI see you have had a chance to help out here at the Crossroads. Carry on for the Horde!"]="Greetings, $c. My name is Thork--I lead the defenses here in the name of the Warchief.\n\nI see you have had a chance to help out here at the Crossroads. Carry on for the Horde!"
G["Greetings, $c. Our position here is a bit exposed given the build up of the Horde's forces to the south.\n\nAnything that you can do to help will be greatly appreciated."]="Greetings, $c. Our position here is a bit exposed given the build up of the Horde's forces to the south.\n\nAnything that you can do to help will be greatly appreciated."
G["Greetings, $c. Please be brief in how the Kirin Tor may be of service to you."]="Saudações, $c. Sei breve e explica como pode ajudar você o Kirin Tor."
G["Greetings, $c. The Fire Lord has twisted our former brothers and sisters into avatars of molten fury. Even now, the Druids of the Flame carry out his insane plan to destroy the World Tree. We will not let that happen."]="Greetings, $c. The Fire Lord has twisted our former brothers and sisters into avatars of molten fury. Even now, the Druids of the Flame carry out his insane plan to destroy the World Tree. We will not let that happen."
G["Greetings, $c. We Wildhammer reward our friends."]="Saudações, $c. Nós, os Martelo Feroz, sabemos recompensar a nossos amigos."
G["Greetings, $c. We shaman have gathered here at Firestone Point to watch over the land and tend to its wounds."]="Greetings, $c. We shaman have gathered here at Firestone Point to watch over the land and tend to its wounds."
G["Greetings, $c. Your people are inside. But first, may I ask a favor?"]="Saudações, $c. Seu povo está dentro. Mas antes, posso pedir um favor?"
G["Greetings, $n!"]="Saudações, $n!"
G["Greetings, $n! Before I join my brothers in battle, I must practice the healing arts."]="Greetings, $n! Before I join my brothers in battle, I must practice the healing arts."
G["Greetings, $n."]="Saudações, $n."
G["Greetings, $n.  As you rise in rank among the forces of Honor Hold, I will give you access to some of the different goods we keep in stock."]="Greetings, $n.  As you rise in rank among the forces of Honor Hold, I will give you access to some of the different goods we keep in stock."
G["Greetings, $n.  How goes your delvings into the demonic and arcane?  Have you uncovered any dark secrets of late?"]="Greetings, $n.  How goes your delvings into the demonic and arcane?  Have you uncovered any dark secrets of late?"
G["Greetings, $n.  I have a fine selection of brews available for you.  If you are interested, I can also teach you to make your own."]="Greetings, $n.  I have a fine selection of brews available for you.  If you are interested, I can also teach you to make your own."
G["Greetings, $n.  We've travelled from Moonglade to spread the spirit of the Lunar Festival far and wide.\n\nWon't you join us in our celebration?"]="Greetings, $n.  We've travelled from Moonglade to spread the spirit of the Lunar Festival far and wide.\n\nWon't you join us in our celebration?"
G["Greetings, $n. Are you as thirsty as I am?"]="Onda, $n. Tem tanta sede como eu?"
G["Greetings, $n. Are you enjoying the festival?"]="Saudações, $n. Está aproveitando do festival?"
G["Greetings, $n. Are you ready to train?"]="Saudações, $n. $gPronto: Pronta; para o seu treinamento?"
G["Greetings, $n. Have you come to learn of the history of Ironforge?"]="Saudações, $n. Tem vindo a conhecer a história de Altaforja?"
G["Greetings, $n. I am Doctor Gregory Victor, head trauma surgeon of Horde Trauma."]="Greetings, $n. I am Doctor Gregory Victor, head trauma surgeon of Horde Trauma."
G["Greetings, $n. I am Doctor Gustaf VanHowzen, head trauma surgeon of Alliance Trauma."]="Greetings, $n. I am Doctor Gustaf VanHowzen, head trauma surgeon of Alliance Trauma."
G["Greetings, $n. I am Durkot Wolfbrother, protector of the pack."]="Saudações, $n. Sou Durkot Irmão Lobo, protetor da manada."
G["Greetings, $n. I am Johnny McWeaksauce. I am used as a tool by developers to carry out specific functions for the purpose of testing. For this test period, I am set to do two specific things:\n\n(1) Flag you as having done the Naxxramas attunement quest so that you are able to accept the next quest, \"Echoes of War\" from Commander Eligor Dawnbringer. You must first complete that quest to be able to access the quests for your Tier 3 armor set.\n\n(2) Teleport you to Naxxramas.\n\nWhat is it that you require?"]="Greetings, $n. I am Johnny McWeaksauce. I am used as a tool by developers to carry out specific functions for the purpose of testing. For this test period, I am set to do two specific things:\n\n(1) Flag you as having done the Naxxramas attunement quest so that you are able to accept the next quest, \"Echoes of War\" from Commander Eligor Dawnbringer. You must first complete that quest to be able to access the quests for your Tier 3 armor set.\n\n(2) Teleport you to Naxxramas.\n\nWhat is it that you require?"
G["Greetings, $n. I am Myolor Sunderfury, keeper of the Great Forge."]="Saudações, $n. Sou Myolor Furiahendida, guardião da Grande Fundição."
G["Greetings, $n. I can offer you training in the way of the mage."]="Saudações, $n. Posso oferecer a você treinamento nas artes de um mago."
G["Greetings, $n. I see that you are already flagged as having completed the quest to gain entry to Naxxramas. Be sure to speak with Commander Eligor Dawnbringer at Light's Hope Chapel in the Eastern Plaguelands to acquire the quest, \"Echoes of War.\" You must first complete that quest to be able to access the quests for your Tier 3 armor set.\n\nI am able to teleport you directly to Naxxramas or you may use the portal found in Plaguewood, to the west."]="Greetings, $n. I see that you are already flagged as having completed the quest to gain entry to Naxxramas. Be sure to speak with Commander Eligor Dawnbringer at Light's Hope Chapel in the Eastern Plaguelands to acquire the quest, \"Echoes of War.\" You must first complete that quest to be able to access the quests for your Tier 3 armor set.\n\nI am able to teleport you directly to Naxxramas or you may use the portal found in Plaguewood, to the west."
G["Greetings, $n. I see you've come from Orgrimmar to aid us. I'm glad. I want to be out of this forsaken forest as quickly as possible. I'd much rather be spending my time in Orgrimmar with a good ale.\n\nAlthough I cannot wait to hear how Belgrom talked you into coming out here."]="Greetings, $n. I see you've come from Orgrimmar to aid us. I'm glad. I want to be out of this forsaken forest as quickly as possible. I'd much rather be spending my time in Orgrimmar with a good ale.\n\nAlthough I cannot wait to hear how Belgrom talked you into coming out here."
G["Greetings, $n. I will guide you through the cavern. Please try and keep up."]="Greetings, $n. I will guide you through the cavern. Please try and keep up."
G["Greetings, $n. May Elune's wisdom guide your hand and heart. How may I help you today?"]="Boas, $n. Que a sabedoria de Eluna guíe seu mão e seu coração. Como posso ajudar você hoje?"
G["Greetings, $n. My fellow Sons of Lothar and I have been stuck on this miserable world for close to twenty years now. We held on as best we could, but it still amazes me that the threats we face today are just the shadows of our past failures.\n\nPerhaps you will help us atone for them?"]="Greetings, $n. My fellow Sons of Lothar and I have been stuck on this miserable world for close to twenty years now. We held on as best we could, but it still amazes me that the threats we face today are just the shadows of our past failures.\n\nPerhaps you will help us atone for them?"
G["Greetings, $n. Proceed with caution..."]="Saudações, $n. Tenha cuidado..."
G["Greetings, $n. This is the workshop of Keeper Mimir."]="Saudações, $n. Este é a Oficina do guardião Mimir."
G["Greetings, $n. You have freed me from this cave, and I wish to thank you. Please, accept my gift and my humble gratitude."]="Greetings, $n. You have freed me from this cave, and I wish to thank you. Please, accept my gift and my humble gratitude."
G["Greetings, $n. You were not followed here, I trust?"]="Saudações, $n. Confío em que não te tenham seguido até aqui."
G["Greetings, $p!\n\nWe have a chance to stop the Thunder King himself before he can reclaim his former power.\n\nEven on the Wandering Isle, his hateful name is remembered, and the sound of thunder feared by pandaren children."]="Greetings, $p!\n\nWe have a chance to stop the Thunder King himself before he can reclaim his former power.\n\nEven on the Wandering Isle, his hateful name is remembered, and the sound of thunder feared by pandaren children."
G["Greetings, $r $c. I am Commander Stronghammer, the ambassador representing the Alliance here. If you have any questions concerning the status of Alliance collections for the Ahn'Qiraj war effort, $g lad : lass;, don't hesitate to ask."]="Greetings, $r $c. I am Commander Stronghammer, the ambassador representing the Alliance here. If you have any questions concerning the status of Alliance collections for the Ahn'Qiraj war effort, $g lad : lass;, don't hesitate to ask."
G["Greetings, $r!  I trust this day finds you well?"]="Saudações, $r. Que tal vai?"
G["Greetings, $r! Well timed indeed.\n\nWe had not expected to find anyone from the Alliance in this land."]="Saudações, $r! Logo a tempo.\n\nNão esperávamos encontrar a ninguém da Aliança nesta terra."
G["Greetings, $r."]="Saudações, $r."
G["Greetings, $r.\n\nI am but a young sapling, grown here in Pandaria to become one with the land so that Tyrande may benefit from the stories it holds.The Strongbows have volunteered to protect me in my infancy so that our mistress' wishes are fulfilled."]="Greetings, $r.\n\nI am but a young sapling, grown here in Pandaria to become one with the land so that Tyrande may benefit from the stories it holds.The Strongbows have volunteered to protect me in my infancy so that our mistress' wishes are fulfilled."
G["Greetings, $r.\n\nI can see from a glance that you are a great adventurer.\n\nAll across the land, there are dark crypts and vast palaces, all full of terrible and mighty enemies. They guard many secrets, but also... harbor great rewards.\n\nThe bravest of heroes may venture to attempt these encounters, but beware! You would be racing against time, as well as testing your skill against other heroes!\n\nAre you up for the challenge?"]="Greetings, $r.\n\nI can see from a glance that you are a great adventurer.\n\nAll across the land, there are dark crypts and vast palaces, all full of terrible and mighty enemies. They guard many secrets, but also... harbor great rewards.\n\nThe bravest of heroes may venture to attempt these encounters, but beware! You would be racing against time, as well as testing your skill against other heroes!\n\nAre you up for the challenge?"
G["Greetings, $r.\n\nI have been expecting you."]="Saudações, $r.\n\nTe estava esperando."
G["Greetings, $r.\n\nI'm afraid you must excuse me as I'm terribly busy at the moment."]="Greetings, $r.\n\nI'm afraid you must excuse me as I'm terribly busy at the moment."
G["Greetings, $r.\n\nIf you are interested in helping with the defense of the temple, please speak with Lord Afrasastrasz inside."]="Saudações, $r.\n\nSe te interesse colaborar na defesa do templo, fala com Lorde Afrasastrasz no interior."
G["Greetings, $r.\n\nMy shop is finally open. I hope you like what you see!"]="Greetings, $r.\n\nMy shop is finally open. I hope you like what you see!"
G["Greetings, $r.  I am Ambassador Sunsorrow of the sin'dorei, or blood elves as we are commonly known.  I have high hopes that this new bond between us and the Horde will be mutually beneficial."]="Greetings, $r.  I am Ambassador Sunsorrow of the sin'dorei, or blood elves as we are commonly known.  I have high hopes that this new bond between us and the Horde will be mutually beneficial."
G["Greetings, $r.  I am the sworn protector of Watcher Megana.  She has special gifts that I... uh, our leaders... greatly admire, and must be guarded closely."]="Greetings, $r.  I am the sworn protector of Watcher Megana.  She has special gifts that I... uh, our leaders... greatly admire, and must be guarded closely."
G["Greetings, $r. I am Franclorn Forgewright. Are you here to learn of the Spire and of Dark Iron?"]="Saudações, $r. Sou Franclorn Ferreiro. Tem vindo para aprender da Cume e dos Ferro Negro?"
G["Greetings, $r. I am Hidalgo, master of the hunt and world class falconer. This killing machine that you see perched atop my shoulder is Excelsior.\n\nYou might be thinking to yourself, \"What does a falconer even do?\" Well I'll tell you what we do - we hunt! Falconry is the art of using a bird of prey to hunt and catch game. Perhaps you are interested in learning to hunt with a trained raptor? Hidalgo can teach you such things!"]="Greetings, $r. I am Hidalgo, master of the hunt and world class falconer. This killing machine that you see perched atop my shoulder is Excelsior.\n\nYou might be thinking to yourself, \"What does a falconer even do?\" Well I'll tell you what we do - we hunt! Falconry is the art of using a bird of prey to hunt and catch game. Perhaps you are interested in learning to hunt with a trained raptor? Hidalgo can teach you such things!"
G["Greetings, $r. I am Lord Itharius of the Green Dragonflight.\n\nI am here to free my kin from the evil within this temple, hopefully for good. Will you assist me?"]="Saudações, $r. Sou Lorde Itharius do Voo Verde.\n\nE vindo a liberar aos meus do mal que mora dentro deste templo, e espero fazer isso para sempre. Me ajudará?"
G["Greetings, $r. I may be small, but size doesn't matter in a pet battle!"]="Saudações, $r. Talvez seja pequena, mas o tamanho não importa em um duelo de ajudantes!"
G["Greetings, $r. I sense some confusion at my presence here. The others harbor suspicion as well, and I cannot blame them, after what my brethren have put them through.\n\nMuch has happened since the events at the Sunwell, little of it good. And so it falls to me to pick up the pieces, and attempt to salvage the pride of my flight. There is much to say, and more to do, but know this: Not all in the Blue Dragonflight blame the mortal races of Azeroth for the troubles that have befallen the world.\n\nSome of us have more sense than that."]="Greetings, $r. I sense some confusion at my presence here. The others harbor suspicion as well, and I cannot blame them, after what my brethren have put them through.\n\nMuch has happened since the events at the Sunwell, little of it good. And so it falls to me to pick up the pieces, and attempt to salvage the pride of my flight. There is much to say, and more to do, but know this: Not all in the Blue Dragonflight blame the mortal races of Azeroth for the troubles that have befallen the world.\n\nSome of us have more sense than that."
G["Greetings, $r. Please do not alarm yourself. I am indeed speaking to you in your native tongue.\n\nMy own considerable raptor intelligence has been augmented through a series of experiments. You may refer to me as \"Subject Nine,\" an identity recently bestowed to me by my creators, who are otherwise at the moment occupied or deceased. Perhaps you can render me some assistance?"]="Greetings, $r. Please do not alarm yourself. I am indeed speaking to you in your native tongue.\n\nMy own considerable raptor intelligence has been augmented through a series of experiments. You may refer to me as \"Subject Nine,\" an identity recently bestowed to me by my creators, who are otherwise at the moment occupied or deceased. Perhaps you can render me some assistance?"
G["Greetings, $r. The war materiel is gradually being sent on its way and should be at Cenarion Hold within $2113w day's time. We can only hope that once it is there that someone, having assembled the Scepter of the Shifting Sands, will step forward to ring the gong and open the gates."]="Greetings, $r. The war materiel is gradually being sent on its way and should be at Cenarion Hold within $2113w day's time. We can only hope that once it is there that someone, having assembled the Scepter of the Shifting Sands, will step forward to ring the gong and open the gates."
G["Greetings, $r. The war materiel is on its way and should be at Cenarion Hold within a day's time. We can only hope that once it is there that someone, having assembled the Scepter of the Shifting Sands, will step forward to ring the gong and open the gates."]="Greetings, $r. The war materiel is on its way and should be at Cenarion Hold within a day's time. We can only hope that once it is there that someone, having assembled the Scepter of the Shifting Sands, will step forward to ring the gong and open the gates."
G["Greetings, $r. Wonderful day to be alive, is it not?"]="Saudações, $r. Bonito dia para viver, verdade?"
G["Greetings, $r. Your noble actions are acknowledged. May Elune protect you."]="Saudações, $r. Seus nobres ações têm banido reconocidas. Que Eluna te proteja."
G["Greetings, Chen, Li Li. You may stay, but I do not need any of your ale."]="Greetings, Chen, Li Li. You may stay, but I do not need any of your ale."
G["Greetings, Hero! I see you've just begun your journey. Perhaps I could offer you a mount to hasten your travel? Free of charge, of course."]="Saudações, herói Vejo que tem começado seu viagem. Talvez poderá oferecer a você uma montaria para acelerar seus desplazamentos Sem cargo algum, é claro."
G["Greetings, I am Shaohao. Are you hear to hear the wisdom of the Celestials?"]="Greetings, I am Shaohao. Are you hear to hear the wisdom of the Celestials?"
G["Greetings, Light of Elune be with you."]="Saudações, Luz da Eluna esteja com você."
G["Greetings, again. Our next trial will be more challenging. Prepare to defend me."]="Saudações novamente. Nossa próxima provação será mais desafiadora. Prepare-se para me defender!"
G["Greetings, ancient one. I have done all that has been asked of me. I now ask that you grant me Lok'delar."]="Greetings, ancient one. I have done all that has been asked of me. I now ask that you grant me Lok'delar."
G["Greetings, ancient one. I have done all that has been asked of me. I now ask that you grant me Rhok'delar."]="Greetings, ancient one. I have done all that has been asked of me. I now ask that you grant me Rhok'delar."
G["Greetings, and welcome.  I am not very good at smiling, but trust me; I am happy to serve you."]="Saudações e bem-vindos. Não sou muito bom em sorrir, mas confie em mim; Estou feliz em atendê-o."
G["Greetings, citizen."]="Greetings, citizen."
G["Greetings, citizen. I ask that you move along if you have nothing to ask of me."]="Saudações cidadão. Peço que você continue em linha de frente se não tiver nada para me perguntar."
G["Greetings, elder. It is time for your people to end their hostility toward the draenei and their allies."]="Saudações, ancião. Chegou a hora do seu povo acabar com a hostilidade contra os draeneis e seus aliados."
G["Greetings, fleshling. I am Navuud, chief researcher here at the Protectorate Watch Post."]="Saudações, carnuda. Sou Navuud, pesquisador-chefe aqui no Posto de Vigilância Protetorado."
G["Greetings, friend of the Brotherhood."]="Saudações, amigo da Irmandade."
G["Greetings, friend!  Can I interest you in some ectoplasmic capacitors?  Or perhaps a nice omni-directional spectral assimilator?"]="Greetings, friend!  Can I interest you in some ectoplasmic capacitors?  Or perhaps a nice omni-directional spectral assimilator?"
G["Greetings, friend! I do not get many visitors up here, do you wish to hear a tale of the Vale of Eternal Blossoms?"]="Greetings, friend! I do not get many visitors up here, do you wish to hear a tale of the Vale of Eternal Blossoms?"
G["Greetings, friend."]="Saudações amigo."
G["Greetings, friend.\n\nEnjoying the glade, I trust?"]="Saudações, amigo.\n\nAproveitando do clareira?"
G["Greetings, friend.  Something I can do for ya?"]="Saudações amigo. Algo que eu posso fazer por você?"
G["Greetings, friend. Can I get you a mug of anything?"]="Greetings, friend. Can I get you a mug of anything?"
G["Greetings, friends."]="Saudações, amigos."
G["Greetings, hapless adventurer.  I ask only that you wait a moment...and BLEED!"]="Saudações, desventurado aventureiro. Somente te pido que esperes um instantaneamente... e SANGRES!"
G["Greetings, hero. I craft and sell Ahn'kahar Blood Hunter armor for hunters."]="Saudações, herói. Eu construo e vendo armaduras de Caçador de Sangue Ahn'kahar para caçadores."
G["Greetings, hero. I craft and sell Bloodmage armor for magi."]="Saudações, $ghéroe: heroína;. Eu fabrico e vendo a armadura de mago sangrenta para magos."
G["Greetings, hero. I craft and sell Crimson Acolyte armor for priests."]="Saudações, $ghéroe: heroína;. Eu fabrico e vendo a armadura de acólito carmesim para sacerdotes."
G["Greetings, hero. I craft and sell Dark Coven armor for warlocks."]="Greetings, hero. I craft and sell Dark Coven armor for warlocks."
G["Greetings, hero. I craft and sell Freya's Lasherweave armor for druids."]="Saudações, herói. Eu manufato e vendo a armadura de Trama Lasherweave para druidas."
