G["Greetings, hero. I craft and sell Lightsworn armor for paladins."]="Greetings, hero. I craft and sell Lightsworn armor for paladins."
G["Greetings, hero. I craft and sell Shadowblade armor for rogues."]="Saudações, $ghéroe: heroína;. Eu fabrico e vendo a armadura Lâmina das Sombras para ladinos."
