G["Greetings, kind stranger, and thank you for your selfless act."]="Greetings, kind stranger, and thank you for your selfless act."
G["Greetings, little one.  You have business with the Waterlords?"]="Saudações, pequena. Você tem negócios com os senhores da água?"
G["Greetings, mage.  Shall I provide you with further insight into the world of magic?"]="Saudações, mago. Devo fornecer-lhe mais informações sobre o mundo da magia?"
G["Greetings, mortal."]="Saudações mortais."
G["Greetings, mortals!  I have been activated by the Discs of Norgannon to assist you!"]="Greetings, mortals!  I have been activated by the Discs of Norgannon to assist you!"
G["Greetings, my $g brother : sister;. How can I guide you today?"]="Saudações, $ghermano: irmã;. Em O que posso guiar hoje?"
G["Greetings, my $g lord : lady;. I trust that you are having a pleasant time?"]="Saudações, meu $gsenhor: senhora;. Confío em que se o estiver passando bem."
G["Greetings, my $r friend. You honor me with your presence.\n\nHow may I help you?"]="Saudações, $r $gamigo meu: amiga minha;! Me honras com o seu presença.\n\nComo posso ajudar você?"
G["Greetings, my friend.  May the Dawn keep you well in these troubled times."]="Saudações meu amigo. Que o Amanhecer o mantenha bem nestes tempos difíceis."
G["Greetings, my name is Tae'thelan Bloodwatcher. I have spent the better part of a lifetime training in the art of sorcery and gathering like-minded blood elves to form The Reliquary.\n\nYou see, there are ancient, powerful relics spread throughout this world that I plan to use to free my people from their addiction and unify them again  as the proud, indomitable race we once were.\n\nMagic is something to be embraced and, I assure you, a force that can be utilized free of corruption with proper teaching.\n\nAs it stands, the other races of the Alliance and even the Horde mock our kind for our half-destroyed capital, still-standing statues of Sunstrider and blunder after blunder across the world.\n\nNo more."]="Greetings, my name is Tae'thelan Bloodwatcher. I have spent the better part of a lifetime training in the art of sorcery and gathering like-minded blood elves to form The Reliquary.\n\nYou see, there are ancient, powerful relics spread throughout this world that I plan to use to free my people from their addiction and unify them again  as the proud, indomitable race we once were.\n\nMagic is something to be embraced and, I assure you, a force that can be utilized free of corruption with proper teaching.\n\nAs it stands, the other races of the Alliance and even the Horde mock our kind for our half-destroyed capital, still-standing statues of Sunstrider and blunder after blunder across the world.\n\nNo more."
G["Greetings, noble $c.  This humble servant of the Cenarion Circle wishes blessings and bounties be given unto you and yours."]="Greetings, noble $c.  This humble servant of the Cenarion Circle wishes blessings and bounties be given unto you and yours."
G["Greetings, outsider.\n\n<Zin eyes you warily.>"]="Greetings, outsider.\n\n<Zin eyes you warily.>"
G["Greetings, soldier. Are you here to help the cause?"]="Saudações soldado. Você está aqui para ajudar a causa?"
G["Greetings, soldier. Intelligence has reported that the Winterax trolls to the west have taken a master goblin engineer prisoner. Perhaps you should investigate?"]="Saudações, Soldado. Inteligência nos informou de que os trolls Machado Invernal do oeste, têm prisioneiro a um mestre engenheiro goblin. Talvez deveria ir a investigação?"
G["Greetings, traveler! Care to delve into the mysteries of the arcane? Hm?"]="Saudações, viajante! Importa-se de mergulhar nos mistérios do arcano? Hum?"
G["Greetings, traveler, I wish to thank you for lifting the exarch's hold. Ah, A'dal has sent you?"]="Greetings, traveler, I wish to thank you for lifting the exarch's hold. Ah, A'dal has sent you?"
G["Greetings, traveler."]="Saudações $gviajero: viajante;!"
G["Greetings, traveler. As long as you remain within the walls of the Cenarion Hold, you will be safe from harm.\n\nBe wary when leaving the protection of the Hold as the silithid have been swarming as of late."]="Greetings, traveler. As long as you remain within the walls of the Cenarion Hold, you will be safe from harm.\n\nBe wary when leaving the protection of the Hold as the silithid have been swarming as of late."
G["Greetings, traveler. I am Oronok. Please, sit by my fire and warm yourself.\n\nBeware the ravenous beasts of the shattered shelf below us!"]="Greetings, traveler. I am Oronok. Please, sit by my fire and warm yourself.\n\nBeware the ravenous beasts of the shattered shelf below us!"
G["Greetings, traveler. It was here, nearly 1,000 years past, that the Qiraji began their march of destruction across Kalimdor.\n\nThousands of lives were lost during the war, most in this cursed desert during the initial invasion.\n\nI am one of only a few that remain, chained to both the past and the present. I know not why I am to remain stationed here but I know that I must."]="Greetings, traveler. It was here, nearly 1,000 years past, that the Qiraji began their march of destruction across Kalimdor.\n\nThousands of lives were lost during the war, most in this cursed desert during the initial invasion.\n\nI am one of only a few that remain, chained to both the past and the present. I know not why I am to remain stationed here but I know that I must."
G["Greetings, traveler. Welcome to The Golden Lantern!"]="Saudações, viajante. Dou a você a boas-vindas ao Farol Áureo!"
G["Greetings, travelers. I have been instructed to treat any bearer of a key to Karazhan as an honored guest of the Master. Feel free to ask any questions you wish of me. How may I assist you?"]="Saudações, viajantes. Fui instruído a tratar qualquer portador de uma chave de Karazhan como convidado de honra do Mestre. Sinta-se livre para fazer qualquer pergunta que você deseja de mim. como posso te ajudar?"
G["Greetings, travelers. The tides of destiny have brought you far from the bright world above. I know what it is you seek - and it lies there before you..."]="Greetings, travelers. The tides of destiny have brought you far from the bright world above. I know what it is you seek - and it lies there before you..."
G["Greetings, traveller. I had not thought to see a friendly Horde face on these shores."]="Saudações, viajante. Não esperava ver uma rosto amiga da Horda em estas costas."
G["Greetings, young $c."]="Saudações, jovem $c."
G["Greetings, young $c. In preparation for the war at Ahn'Qiraj against the Silithid, the Alliance has asked me to head up their collection of purple lotus. This flower has many uses that I am aware of, and thus, I have agreed to help them attain $2055w. To date we have collected $2053w."]="Greetings, young $c. In preparation for the war at Ahn'Qiraj against the Silithid, the Alliance has asked me to head up their collection of purple lotus. This flower has many uses that I am aware of, and thus, I have agreed to help them attain $2055w. To date we have collected $2053w."
G["Greetings, young one, it is good to see a noble soul again.\n\nDire Maul, formerly Eldre'thalas, is corrupt to its very core. I have watched my brethren fall to the forces of darkness and chaos. Many would have this place razed to the ground to end its horrors forever.\n\nBut Dire Maul is worth saving, mortal. Help me, and perhaps together we can unleash the vast power lost here for the forces of good, as they once were so long ago."]="Greetings, young one, it is good to see a noble soul again.\n\nDire Maul, formerly Eldre'thalas, is corrupt to its very core. I have watched my brethren fall to the forces of darkness and chaos. Many would have this place razed to the ground to end its horrors forever.\n\nBut Dire Maul is worth saving, mortal. Help me, and perhaps together we can unleash the vast power lost here for the forces of good, as they once were so long ago."
G["Greetings, young shaman.  Make yourself at home within my reef."]="Saudações, jovem xamã. Sinta-se em casa dentro do meu recife."
G["Greetings."]="Saudações."
G["Greetings.  Do you seek instruction in art of war?"]="Saudações. Você procura instruções sobre arte da guerra?"
G["Greetings.  Have you come to master matters magical?"]="Saudações. Tem vindo para domínio habilidades mágicas?"
G["Greetings.  I am Anchorite Avuun of the draenei.  I am here studying the Lost Ones of the Fallow Sanctuary in the hope of being able to find a cure for their condition."]="Saudações. Eu sou o anacoreta Avuun dos draeneis. Estou aqui estudando os perdidos do santuário de Fallow, na esperança de encontrar uma cura para a sua condição."
G["Greetings.  I am Anchorite Delan - one of the draenei.  I am a teacher of sorts.  And who might you be?"]="Saudações. Sou Anchorite Delan - um dos draeneis. Eu sou uma espécie de professora. E quem pode ser voce?"
G["Greetings.  I am Chronos - He Who Never Forgets.  My memory is without flaw, and exact to the most minor detail.\n\nTrust me."]="Greetings.  I am Chronos - He Who Never Forgets.  My memory is without flaw, and exact to the most minor detail.\n\nTrust me."
G["Greetings.  I'm a female mage trainer, and you're a mage."]="Saudações. Sou instrutora de magos e você é $gun mago: uma maga;."
G["Greetings.  I'm a gnome mage trainer, and you're a mage."]="Saudações. Eu sou um treinador de gnomos e você é um mago."
G["Greetings.  I'm a warlock trainer, and you're a warlock."]="Greetings.  I'm a warlock trainer, and you're a warlock."
G["Greetings.  I'm a warlock trainer, but you're not a warlock!"]="Greetings.  I'm a warlock trainer, but you're not a warlock!"
G["Greetings.  I'm an undead mage trainer, and you're a mage."]="Saudações. Eu sou um treinador de magos mortos-vivos, e você é um mago."
G["Greetings.  If you are here for leather goods, then you will find my wares well crafted."]="Saudações. Se você está aqui para artigos de couro, encontrará meus produtos bem trabalhados."
G["Greetings.  Our bats are well trained and fed.  You'll not find faster."]="Saudações. Nossos morcegos são bem treinados e alimentados. Você não encontrará mais rápido."
