G["Grraaarrr! You think to make an icicle out of me? Come down, then I will add real fire to your life."]="Grraaarrr! You think to make an icicle out of me? Come down, then I will add real fire to your life."
G["Grrr, what do you want, $r? Oh, you must be here about the lean wolf steaks for the impending Ahn'Qiraj War. Yes, you heard right, I'm collecting them, what about it? Do you have a fresh stack for me? I only need $2096w, and it looks like we have $2095w right now."]="Grrr, what do you want, $r? Oh, you must be here about the lean wolf steaks for the impending Ahn'Qiraj War. Yes, you heard right, I'm collecting them, what about it? Do you have a fresh stack for me? I only need $2096w, and it looks like we have $2095w right now."
