G["Hah! Spoken like a true disciple of Garrosh Hellscream. Our \"Warchief\" would be proud.\n\nBut MY horde does not fight unarmed children. Nor would I dare bring our war to this sacred chamber, in the presence of an August Celestial himself.\n\nBesides, this little one has earned the friendship and trust of High Chieftain Baine Bloodhoof. For that reason, consider him under my protection.\n\nFor now."]="Hah! Spoken like a true disciple of Garrosh Hellscream. Our \"Warchief\" would be proud.\n\nBut MY horde does not fight unarmed children. Nor would I dare bring our war to this sacred chamber, in the presence of an August Celestial himself.\n\nBesides, this little one has earned the friendship and trust of High Chieftain Baine Bloodhoof. For that reason, consider him under my protection.\n\nFor now."
