G["Hail $c. Didn't I see you recently at an exclusive gathering? You look familiar, but then again this city is a busy place.\n\nIf you attended that convention, then surely you were given a secret code. Tell me your code and I will give you a special prize in return."]="Hail $c. Didn't I see you recently at an exclusive gathering? You look familiar, but then again this city is a busy place.\n\nIf you attended that convention, then surely you were given a secret code. Tell me your code and I will give you a special prize in return."
G["Hail $g brother : sister;... I'd like a moment of your time, if I may.\n\nWe tauren have endured much in our trials and tribulations in establishing our homeland.  We now find ourselves in a dire shortage of cloth.  If you have the materials to spare, I ask that you please donate them.  You certainly would earn the gratitude of tauren everywhere in helping us out!"]="Hail $g brother : sister;... I'd like a moment of your time, if I may.\n\nWe tauren have endured much in our trials and tribulations in establishing our homeland.  We now find ourselves in a dire shortage of cloth.  If you have the materials to spare, I ask that you please donate them.  You certainly would earn the gratitude of tauren everywhere in helping us out!"
G["Hail $n!  New Champion of The Affray!"]="Hail $n!  New Champion of The Affray!"
G["Hail Akama!"]="Saudações Akama!"
G["Hail citizen.  Do you need directions?"]="Hail citizen.  Do you need directions?"
G["Hail friend - a moment of your time, if I may...\n\nWe have endured much in our trials and tribulations in establishing Teldrassil.  Were the constant strife of the times not enough, we now find ourselves in a dire shortage of cloth.  If you have the materials to spare, I ask that you please donate them.  You certainly would earn the gratitude of night elves everywhere in helping us out!"]="Hail friend - a moment of your time, if I may...\n\nWe have endured much in our trials and tribulations in establishing Teldrassil.  Were the constant strife of the times not enough, we now find ourselves in a dire shortage of cloth.  If you have the materials to spare, I ask that you please donate them.  You certainly would earn the gratitude of night elves everywhere in helping us out!"
G["Hail our leader!  Hail Akama!"]="Vidaade a nosso líder! Saudações Akama!"
G["Hail the Lich King!"]="Salve ao Rei Lich!"
G["Hail the hero of Kun-Lai Pass, $n!"]="Hail the hero of Kun-Lai Pass, $n!"
G["Hail to da new king!"]="Saudações ao novo rei!"
G["Hail to the king, baby!"]="Hail to the king, baby!"
G["Hail to the night!"]="Salve a noite!"
G["Hail to the queen!"]="Larga vida à Rainha!"
G["Hail to thee $n.  Do you wish me to aid you in your journey to Warsong Gulch?"]="Hail to thee $n.  Do you wish me to aid you in your journey to Warsong Gulch?"
G["Hail to thee, $c."]="Saudações, $c."
G["Hail to you, $r. What I am doing here is a story for another time. Oof, that was a bad one.\n\nMy brother and I are stuck here, between our time and the present. We dare not leave for fear of causing a temporal paradox. Patiently we wait until the dragons restore us to our proper timeline.\n\nHow long has it been you ask? I'm not sure really. Ask my brother.\n\nCare for some cheese?"]="Hail to you, $r. What I am doing here is a story for another time. Oof, that was a bad one.\n\nMy brother and I are stuck here, between our time and the present. We dare not leave for fear of causing a temporal paradox. Patiently we wait until the dragons restore us to our proper timeline.\n\nHow long has it been you ask? I'm not sure really. Ask my brother.\n\nCare for some cheese?"
G["Hail!  By order of King Varian Wrynn, I've been given the authority to extend an offer to the people of Silverbrook."]="Saudações! Por ordem do Rei Varian Wrynn tenho autoridade para fazer uma oferta à gente de Arroio."
G["Hail!  You look familiar... have we met before?\n\nWell if we have met, then... surely you were given a secret code. Tell me your code and I will give you a gift!"]="Onda! Me soa seu rosto... nos temos visto antes?\n\nSe é assim, certo que alguém você dados um código segredo. Diga seu código e te darei um presente!"
G["Hail! I hate to rush you, but there's an army of iron dwarves here to stop whatever you and Creteus are trying to do... we need to get out of here."]="Hail! I hate to rush you, but there's an army of iron dwarves here to stop whatever you and Creteus are trying to do... we need to get out of here."
G["Hail, $C. Ill times these are, my friend, for our town is besieged! The Blackrock Orcs attack from Stonewatch Keep, the Shadowhide loom over the Tower of Ilgalar, and the Redridge Gnoll Pack gathers strength. I hope you're not here for a holiday..."]="Hail, $C. Ill times these are, my friend, for our town is besieged! The Blackrock Orcs attack from Stonewatch Keep, the Shadowhide loom over the Tower of Ilgalar, and the Redridge Gnoll Pack gathers strength. I hope you're not here for a holiday..."
G["Hail, $N! Welcome to my humble garden. The weather has been perfect lately. Let us hope it holds steady for a ripe harvest."]="Hail, $N! Welcome to my humble garden. The weather has been perfect lately. Let us hope it holds steady for a ripe harvest."
G["Hail, $c!"]="Boas, $c!"
G["Hail, $c!  Our supply level is high, and we are ready to launch a ground assault through the Field of Strife.  Perhaps if your renown was greater, I would trust you to deliver the assault orders.\n\nSo get out there and fight the Alliance!  Show me you're a trusted and capable member of the Horde!"]="Saudações, $c! Nosso nível de suprimentos é alto e estamos prontos para lançar um ataque terrestre na Terra de Disputa. Talvez, se seu reputação fosse melhor, te confiaría a missão de entregar as ordens de ataque.\n\nSal aí fosse e luta pela Aliança! Demuéstrame que é um membro da Horda capaz em quem se você pode confiar!"
G["Hail, $c!  Welcome to the celebration!"]="Ave, $c! $GBienvenido: Bem-vinda; à festa!"
G["Hail, $c! Admiral Aubrey is expecting you up above."]="Saudações, $c! O almirante Aubrey te espera cima."
G["Hail, $c! Just up ahead you'll find Honor's Stand, the Alliance's only link between Stonetalon and the coast.\n\nThe road's a treacherous one, though. I speak from experience."]="Hail, $c! Just up ahead you'll find Honor's Stand, the Alliance's only link between Stonetalon and the coast.\n\nThe road's a treacherous one, though. I speak from experience."
G["Hail, $c.  The Ironforge Brigade is stationed here to keep an eye on Hive'Zora.  The Cenarion Circle druids have been monitoring silithid movement and they're anticipating something major in this area."]="Hail, $c.  The Ironforge Brigade is stationed here to keep an eye on Hive'Zora.  The Cenarion Circle druids have been monitoring silithid movement and they're anticipating something major in this area."
G["Hail, $c.  There is a great need and even greater honor and renown to be had in Alterac Valley at this time. Will you join our fight against the Stormpike Guard?"]="Onda, $c. Em estes momentos, no Vale do Honra há tanta necessidade como honra e renombre para o que vá a ajudar. Vai se juntar a nossa luta contra a Guarda Pico Tempestade?"
G["Hail, $c. As you may know, we've completed all collections necessary for the Alliance's role in the upcoming war. Now it's up to the Horde to finish with theirs and we'll ship out to Silithus."]="Hail, $c. As you may know, we've completed all collections necessary for the Alliance's role in the upcoming war. Now it's up to the Horde to finish with theirs and we'll ship out to Silithus."
G["Hail, $c. I trust you are here to inquire on the Ahn'Qiraj war effort. We are going to need a great deal of assistance.\n\nThe war effort is a united effort between the Horde and Alliance to prepare for the impending war against the Silithid and their masters in Ahn'Qiraj. In Orgrimmar's Valley of Spirits, we are collecting a vast number of goods to create war materiel, and these gathering tasks are what we need your help with.\n\nCan I convince you to speak with our commander about helping out?"]="Hail, $c. I trust you are here to inquire on the Ahn'Qiraj war effort. We are going to need a great deal of assistance.\n\nThe war effort is a united effort between the Horde and Alliance to prepare for the impending war against the Silithid and their masters in Ahn'Qiraj. In Orgrimmar's Valley of Spirits, we are collecting a vast number of goods to create war materiel, and these gathering tasks are what we need your help with.\n\nCan I convince you to speak with our commander about helping out?"
G["Hail, $c. You look familiar... have we met before?\n\nWell if we have met, then... surely you were given a secret code. Tell me your code and I will give you a gift!"]="Onda, $c. Me soa seu rosto... nos temos visto antes?\n\nSe é assim, certo que alguém você dados um código segredo. Diga seu código e te darei um presente!"
G["Hail, $n!  It is good you came to see me.  We are prepared to launch a ground assuault through the Field of Strife!  Once Warmaster Garrick gets his orders, he and his reavers will cut a swath through the Alliance!\n\nDo you want to deliver those orders, $n?  Garrick is waiting in the Field of Strife..."]="Hail, $n!  It is good you came to see me.  We are prepared to launch a ground assuault through the Field of Strife!  Once Warmaster Garrick gets his orders, he and his reavers will cut a swath through the Alliance!\n\nDo you want to deliver those orders, $n?  Garrick is waiting in the Field of Strife..."
G["Hail, $n.  All friends of the Light are welcome at the Altar of Sha'tar."]="Saudações, $n. Todos os amigos da Luz são bem-vindos no Altar de Sha'tar."
G["Hail, $n.  We're in need of your assistance."]="Saudações, $n. precisamos da sua ajuda."
G["Hail, $r! I am Lieutenant Haggerdin, officer in charge of recruitment for the Stormpike Guard.\n\nAs you gain prestige and notoriety among the Stormpike, return to me and I shall see about upgrading your insignia. Also, should you ever lose your insignia, I am able to supply a replacement."]="Hail, $r! I am Lieutenant Haggerdin, officer in charge of recruitment for the Stormpike Guard.\n\nAs you gain prestige and notoriety among the Stormpike, return to me and I shall see about upgrading your insignia. Also, should you ever lose your insignia, I am able to supply a replacement."
G["Hail, $r! If you're looking for Corastrasza, she's just inside.\n\n<Mostrasz shifts his weight uncomfortably.>\n\nShe's not in a very good mood."]="Saudações, $r! Se atenção a Corastrasza, está dentro.\n\n<Mostrasz muda de postura incómodo.>\n\nNão está de muito bom humor."
G["Hail, $r. Were you lucky enough to have attended that recent special event?\n\nIf so, you may have learned a secret code. Tell me your code and I will give you a special prize in return."]="Hail, $r. Were you lucky enough to have attended that recent special event?\n\nIf so, you may have learned a secret code. Tell me your code and I will give you a special prize in return."
G["Hail, Adventurer. A moment, if you would? I would ask for your aid in Westfall."]="Salve, aventureiro. Me concedes um momento? Gostaria pedir sua ajuda em Cerro Oeste."
G["Hail, Champion of Chi-Ji! Your presence honors us, $n."]="Saudações, $gcampeón: campeona; de Chi-Ji! Nos honras com o seu presença, $n."
G["Hail, Gezhe!  Seventeen more orders have been placed in the Hara'samid Sector.  The markets of heavy veldarite have all but collapsed, as you predicted."]="Hail, Gezhe!  Seventeen more orders have been placed in the Hara'samid Sector.  The markets of heavy veldarite have all but collapsed, as you predicted."
G["Hail, Loramus. I bring word from the Blasted Lands."]="Salve, Loramus. Trago notícia das terras destruídas."
G["Hail, adventurer. Heed my warnings before venturing into the Black Morass."]="Salve, aventureiro. Preste atenção aos meus avisos antes de se aventurar no pântano negro."
G["Hail, adventurer. I am Rin'wosho, trader of Zuldazar. I come from the South Seas and bring many exotic goods and items from my homeland.\n\nPerhaps if you prove your worth to my tribe, I shall barter.  If you have any of my tribe's Honor Tokens, then perhaps we shall barter even more."]="Hail, adventurer. I am Rin'wosho, trader of Zuldazar. I come from the South Seas and bring many exotic goods and items from my homeland.\n\nPerhaps if you prove your worth to my tribe, I shall barter.  If you have any of my tribe's Honor Tokens, then perhaps we shall barter even more."
G["Hail, champion! Have you ever thought about going into the gladiator business full time? You and I could make a mountain of gold."]="Salve, campeão! Você já pensou em entrar no ramo de gladiadores em tempo integral? Você e eu poderíamos fazer uma montanha de ouro."
G["Hail, champion! Looking for a friendly challenge? I can arrange War Games - practice matches in the arena or on the battlefield. No rewards, no penalties, just pure combat. Choose your battleground."]="Hail, champion! Looking for a friendly challenge? I can arrange War Games - practice matches in the arena or on the battlefield. No rewards, no penalties, just pure combat. Choose your battleground."
G["Hail, champion. The tale of your deeds will be told throughout the ages. Perhaps one day, a statue of you will stand amongst the heroes of Stormwind."]="Salve, campeão. A história das suas ações será contada através dos tempos. Talvez um dia, uma estátua sua esteja entre os heróis de Ventobravo."
G["Hail, champion. Yogg-Saron's defeat echoes through these halls."]="Hail, champion. Yogg-Saron's defeat echoes through these halls."
G["Hail, citizen. I would recommend that you speak with Watch Captain Parker. He's currently at the top of this tower."]="Saudações, cidadão. Te recomendaría que fale com o capitão da Avançado Parker. Está no alto desta torre."
G["Hail, friend!"]="Onda novamente!"
G["Hail, friend! Have you come to serve the sons of Azeroth in battle?"]="Saudações, amigo! Você veio para servir os filhos de Azeroth em batalha?"
G["Hail, good $c! Welcome to Ironforge's annual Brewfest celebration!"]="Saudações, gentil $c! Dou a você a boas-vindas à Festa da Cerveja anual de Altaforja!"
G["Hail, stranger. If you are looking for a place in need of your help, you have found it.\n\nThe dead reawaken, walk the land, and arrive on ships from across the great ocean. The fjord grows too dangerous even for us, and soon we must leave for safer lands to the north."]="Hail, stranger. If you are looking for a place in need of your help, you have found it.\n\nThe dead reawaken, walk the land, and arrive on ships from across the great ocean. The fjord grows too dangerous even for us, and soon we must leave for safer lands to the north."
G["Hail, traveler! What brings you to my doorstep?"]="Salve, viajante! O que te traz à minha porta?"
G["Hail, what ya want?"]="Onda, que que?"
G["Hail."]="/saudaçoes"
G["Hail. I could not help but overhear your conversation. Please allow me to lend some assistance."]="Hail. I could not help but overhear your conversation. Please allow me to lend some assistance."
G["Hailing from the deepest, darkest caverns of the Storm Peaks, Gormok the Impaler! Battle on, heroes!"]="Desdas caverna mais sombrios e profundas das Picos Tempestuosos: Gormok o Empalador! A lutar, heróis!"
G["Hailing from the distant mountains of Alterac, one of the fiercest competitors this arena has ever seen: KORRAK THE BLOODRAGER!!!"]="Hailing from the distant mountains of Alterac, one of the fiercest competitors this arena has ever seen: KORRAK THE BLOODRAGER!!!"
G["Hailing from the mountains of Blade's Edge comes Rokdar the Sundered Lord! $n is in for the fight of $g his:her; life."]="Hailing from the mountains of Blade's Edge comes Rokdar the Sundered Lord! $n is in for the fight of $g his:her; life."
G["Hailing from the semi-distant wreck of a landscape that was once Gilneas, our champion arises! Keep your pants up $n, you don't want to show this guy a full moon!"]="Nosso seguinte campeão procede do desastre relativamente distante que antes fosse Guilnéas! Que não se te caigan os calças, $n, não que que este tio veja a lua cheia!"
G["Hairy Herring Head!"]="Cabeça de arenque peludo!"
G["Hairy? You heard wrong. It's downright desperate!"]="Peliagudo? Acho que não você soube bem. É uma situação desesperada."
G["Haiyan the Unstoppable struck you with a |cFFFF0000|Hspell:123655|h[Traumatic Blow]|h|r! Healing abilities used on you will be less efficient while the effect persists!"]="Haiyan the Unstoppable struck you with a |cFFFF0000|Hspell:123655|h[Traumatic Blow]|h|r! Healing abilities used on you will be less efficient while the effect persists!"
G["Hakkar binds me no more!  Peace at last!"]="Hakkar já não me controla! Finalmente algo de paz!"
G["Hakkar grows impatient.  And so do I."]="Hakkar se impacienta. E eu também."
G["Hakkar is known by many names. Some call him the Blood God, others simply refer to him as The Soulflayer. Titles aside, he is an entity of enormous power with malicious intentions for our world.\n\nMy flight discovered this temple early on and sank it beneath the Swamp of Sorrows. Unfortunately, we only seemed to aid the Atal'ai by ensuring their efforts to summon Hakkar went on undisturbed. Many of the dragons tasked with guarding the temple have been corrupted, and the Soulflayer's presence grows with each passing day.\n\nI cannot stop them alone. Together, though, we might have enough time to stop this madness."]="Hakkar is known by many names. Some call him the Blood God, others simply refer to him as The Soulflayer. Titles aside, he is an entity of enormous power with malicious intentions for our world.\n\nMy flight discovered this temple early on and sank it beneath the Swamp of Sorrows. Unfortunately, we only seemed to aid the Atal'ai by ensuring their efforts to summon Hakkar went on undisturbed. Many of the dragons tasked with guarding the temple have been corrupted, and the Soulflayer's presence grows with each passing day.\n\nI cannot stop them alone. Together, though, we might have enough time to stop this madness."
G["Hakkar shall live again!"]="Hakkar voltará à vida!"
G["Hakkar will rule the world!"]="Hakkar dominará o mundo!"
G["Hakmud cannot work under these conditions! Goodbye!"]="Hakmud não pode trabalhar em estas condições! Adios!"
G["Hal'duron, summon the rangers. Rommath, assemble the Blood Magi, and add the Sunreavers' strength to your own."]="Hal'duron, convoque os patrulheiros. Rommath, reúna os magos sangrentos e some as forças Fendessol às suas."
G["Halbin Frosthammer, from the Wildhammer clan, can be found in Thunderbrew Distillery.  He can help teach ya the ways of the shaman."]="Halbin Frosthammer, do clã Wildhammer, pode ser encontrado na Destilaria Thunderbrew. Ele pode ajudar a ensinar-lhe os caminhos do xamã."
G["Haldor of the Rocky Cliffs! Grant me your strength!"]="Haldor of the Rocky Cliffs! Grant me your strength!"
G["Halduron, we should combine our forces and make preparations to act on reports from the Darkspear scouts."]="Halduron, devemos combinar nossas forças e fazer preparativos para actuar conforme os informes dos batedores Lança Negra."
G["Haleh, I have lost the Bluescale Sigil. Could you fashion another?"]="Haleh, I have lost the Bluescale Sigil. Could you fashion another?"
G["Haleh, I have lost the Drakefire Amulet. Could you fashion another?"]="Haleh, I have lost the Drakefire Amulet. Could you fashion another?"
G["Half man...half sharkalligator!"]="Metade homem... Metade tiburondrilo!"
G["Half of the Vale lies in ruin! These outsiders have been more destructive than the mantid and mogu combined!"]="Half of the Vale lies in ruin! These outsiders have been more destructive than the mantid and mogu combined!"
G["Half way there..."]="Está a meio caminho..."
G["Halfus! Hear me! (The Master calls, the Master wants.) Protect our secrets, Halfus. Destroy the intruders. (Murder for His glory. Murder for His hunger.)"]="Halfus! Escúchame! (O mestre chama, o mestre ordena.) Proteger nossos segredos, Halfus. Destrói aos intrusos. (Matar pelo seu glória. Matar pelo seu fome.)"
G["Halfway there I got orders to meet you all here. This must be important."]="Halfway there I got orders to meet you all here. This must be important."
G["Halfway there, $n. Keep it up!"]="Já vai pela metade, $n. Continua assim!"
G["Halion will be pleased."]="Halion will be pleased."
G["Hallloooo stranger!"]="Hooolaaa, desconhecido!"
G["Hallo again, soft little friend. What's that you have there?"]="Olá novamente, amiguinho amável. O que você tem aí?"
G["Hallo!"]="olá"
G["Hallo, friend!\n\nRussell's the name, and music is my business. All the great Wildhammer heroes from ages past are kept alive with song. Through the strings of my lute and the sound of my voice, our warriors gain immortality.\n\nStay a while, and listen!"]="Hallo, friend!\n\nRussell's the name, and music is my business. All the great Wildhammer heroes from ages past are kept alive with song. Through the strings of my lute and the sound of my voice, our warriors gain immortality.\n\nStay a while, and listen!"
G["Hallo, stranger! You are making quite an impression with the local hozen. I daresay they're starting to fear you."]="Onda! Está causando revuelo entre os hozen da zona. Acho que te têm medo."
G["Hallo."]="Às muito boas."
G["Hallooo.... You just gunna sit down there an' pat yerselves on the back? What kinda rescuers are ya?"]="Hallooo.... You just gunna sit down there an' pat yerselves on the back? What kinda rescuers are ya?"
G["Hallow's End is a scary holiday, but I like it!"]="Hallow's End é um feriado assustador, mas eu gosto!"
G["Hallow's End is upon us, $c.  I hope you are enjoying the festivities."]="Hallow's End is upon us, $c.  I hope you are enjoying the festivities."
G["Halt at once!"]="Alto, imediatamente!"
G["Halt!"]="Alto lá!"
G["Halt! Do not carry that blade any further!"]="Halt! Do not carry that blade any further!"
G["Halt! Identify yourself immediately!"]="Alto! Identifícate imediatamente!"
G["Halt! This city is under Martial Law. Declare yourselves."]="Halt! This city is under Martial Law. Declare yourselves."
G["Halt, supplicant! These waters belong to the Thunder King. Your presence is unwelcome."]="Halt, supplicant! These waters belong to the Thunder King. Your presence is unwelcome."
G["Halt."]="Alto"
G["Halt. If the core is in your possession, please place it safely on the ground to avoid any damage it make incur during your elimination."]="Alto. Se o núcleo está no seu poder, colócalo no chão com cuidado para esta qualquer dano que pudesse sofrer durante seu eliminação."
G["Halt. Your presence here is not authorized."]="Alto. Seu presença não está autorizada."
G["Halthar is dead! Sound the trumpets, and spread the news from Highbank to Thundermar!"]="Halthar is dead! Sound the trumpets, and spread the news from Highbank to Thundermar!"
G["Hamhock in trouble! Hamhock need help!"]="Hamhock ter problemas! Hamhock precisa ajuda!"
G["Hammer and tongs. Hammer and tongs. All day long its hammer and tongs."]="Bigorna e martelo. Bigorna e martelo. Me como um solomilho, e mais bigorna e martelo."
G["Hammer of the Righteous!"]="Martelo do honrado!"
G["Hammer swingin' fun! Who wants to swing a hammer?"]="O martelo é divertido! Quem quer atacar com um martelo?"
G["Hammer time!"]="É a hora do martelo!"
G["Hammerhead Oil Sample"]="Hammerhead Oil Sample"
G["Hammertoe, you're as smart as you were stubborn in life and even in death. What can you tell me, ole friend?"]="Hammertoe, you're as smart as you were stubborn in life and even in death. What can you tell me, ole friend?"
G["Hanashi here knows staves. If you want a sturdier instructor, go to Thunder Bluff. Ansekhwa will teach you on the lower central rise there."]="Hanashi aqui conhece pautas. Se você quer um instrutor mais robusto, vá ao Thunder Bluff. Ansekhwa ensinará você na promoção central mais baixa lá."
G["Hand it over, Frankie!"]="Entrégalo, Frankie!"
G["Hand me the wizzlesproket, you dwarf-brained son of a human!  No, not that one, the other one!"]="Hand me the wizzlesproket, you dwarf-brained son of a human!  No, not that one, the other one!"
G["Hand over hand, $g lad: lass;... hand over aching hand.  I can't tell ya how many gallons of seawater went right up my nose.\n\nYou shoulda seen me fight off that pyreshell crab using my feet and my teeth, though!  'Twas a thing of glory, 'twas."]="Hand over hand, $g lad: lass;... hand over aching hand.  I can't tell ya how many gallons of seawater went right up my nose.\n\nYou shoulda seen me fight off that pyreshell crab using my feet and my teeth, though!  'Twas a thing of glory, 'twas."
G["Hand over the Archmage and I may yet allow you to walk out of here, Lor'themar."]="Hand over the Archmage and I may yet allow you to walk out of here, Lor'themar."
G["Hand over the Southfury moonstone and I'll let you go."]="Entrega a pedras lunar de Fúria do Sul e te deixarei marchar."
G["Hand over the bird, yeh filthy beasts. WILDHAMMER!!"]="Hand over the bird, yeh filthy beasts. WILDHAMMER!!"
G["Handheld one-way mirrors!"]="Handheld one-way mirrors!"
G["Handle Varo'then. Mannoroth is mine."]="Encargaos de Varo'then. Mannoroth é meu."
G["Handmade toys from all over Azeroth!"]="Brinquedos artesanais de tudo o mundo em Azeroth!"
G["Hands off - you don't what that thing is!"]="Hands off - you don't what that thing is!"
G["Hands off the cloak! Yes, yes, I know that you want one too. Everybody wants one of my cloaks. Believe me, person of low moral and social standing, one day I will make my fortune from the sale of my cloaks. Everyone from here to Ironforge will know the name of Bartolo Ginsetti. The Ginsetti label will be coveted by all!"]="Tire as mãos da capa! Sim, sim, eu sei que você também quer um. Tudo mundo quer uma das minhas capas. Acredite em mim, pessoa de baixa posição moral e social, um dia farei minha fortuna com a venda de minhas capas. Todos daqui até Ironforge saberão o nome de Bartolo Ginsetti. A etiqueta Ginsetti será cobiçada por todos!"
G["Hands up, greenskins!  My men will give you your new bearing.  You try anything funny and we'll fill you with lead."]="Hands up, greenskins!  My men will give you your new bearing.  You try anything funny and we'll fill you with lead."
G["Hang in there ol' buddy!"]="Aguanta, amigo!"
G["Hang in there, Lieutenant!"]="Aguanta, Tenente!"
G["Hang in there, Mack..."]="Aguarda um segundo, Mack..."
G["Hang in there, bud. You're going to be okay."]="Aguanta, colega. Te pondrás bem."
G["Hang on tight. It's going to get bumpy!"]="Agarraos bem. Vai ser um viagem movido!"
G["Hang on to your hat, $n! To Scalawag we go!"]="Agárrate você o chapéu, $n! Vamos ao Cabo Pilhastre!"
G["Hang on to your hat, pal! We're in for a bumpy ride"]="Sujétate o chapéu, colega. Vai ser um viagem movidito."
G["Hang on to your hat, pal! We're in for a bumpy ride."]="Sujétate o chapéu, colega. Vai ser um viagem movidito."
G["Hang on!"]="Hang on!"
G["Hang on! I'm putting the pedal to the metal!!!"]="Aguanta! Vou pisar a fundo!"
G["Hang on! Nobody's gonna' be sanitized as long as I have a say in it!"]="Aguarda! Enquanto eu estiver ao envio, não se vai higienizar a ninguém!"
G["Hang on, $n! We have to get out of here, NOW!"]="Aguarda um segundo, $n! Temos que sair de aqui, AGORA!"
G["Hang on, men! Reinforcements are inbound!"]="Hang on, men! Reinforcements are inbound!"
G["Hang onto your, um... helmet!"]="Agárrate ao seu, eh... casco!"
G["Hang tight, $n.  We gotta wait for Maltorius and Arkkus to come back before we can fight 'em."]="Aguanta, $n. Temos que esperar a que vuelvan Maltorius e Arkkus antes de poder lutar."
G["Hapana simply grunts and waves you away towards the Dread Captain DeMeza.\n\nBeneath the fur of one massive arm can be seen a tattoo of the word \"MAGATHA\" in an arrow-pierced heart."]="Hapana simply grunts and waves you away towards the Dread Captain DeMeza.\n\nBeneath the fur of one massive arm can be seen a tattoo of the word \"MAGATHA\" in an arrow-pierced heart."
G["Happiness is mandatory, citizen."]="Happiness is mandatory, citizen."
G["Happy Brewfest, $n!"]="Feliz Festa da Cerveja, $n!"
G["Happy Hallow's End!"]="Feliz Halhoween!"
G["Happy Hallow's End!  Do you like my mask?  Very scary!"]="Feliz Dia das Bruxas! Você gosta da minha máscara? Muito assustador!"
G["Happy Hallow's End!  How do you like my mask?  Very scary!"]="Feliz Dia das Bruxas! Como você gosta da minha máscara? Muito assustador!"
G["Happy Hallow's End, $c!"]="Feliz Halhoween, $c!"
G["Happy Lunar Festival, $n!"]="Feliz Festival Lunar, $n!"
G["Happy Pilgrim's Bounty, $c!"]="Feliz Generosidade do Peregrino, $c!"
G["Happy Winter Veil, $n!"]="Happy Winter Veil, $n!"
G["Happy Winter's Veil!"]="Feliz Festival de Inverno!"
end)(AscensionPTBR.GossipEN2ES)
;(function(G)
G["Happy now?  Pull me up, you vicious little dwarf!"]="Happy now?  Pull me up, you vicious little dwarf!"
G["Happy travels, $r!\n\nThe weather may look nice now, but the skies over the Jade Forest can darken quickly with squalls. Can you feel the air changing? Perhaps you'd like to help me brew some of my legendary Boomer Brew?"]="Felizes viagens, $r!\n\nPode que o tempo seja bom agora, mas os céus da Floresta de Jade se podem ensombrecer rapidamente com borrascas. Sente como cambiao vento? Me ajudarias a elaborar um pouco de meu lendário mistura relâmpago?"
G["Har! Pleasure doin' business with ye, $n."]="Har! Pleasure doin' business with ye, $n."
G["Har! You look uglier than usual, $n!"]="Har! You look uglier than usual, $n!"
G["Har! You scared I'll hurt your little dainty racer?"]="Ha! Tem medo de que faça dano ao seu pequeno e delicado corredor?"
G["Haraak foln!"]="Haraak foln!"
G["Harder! Faster! Stronger!"]="Mais duro! Mais rápido! Mais forte!"
G["Harder, better, faster, stronger!"]="Mais resistente, melhor, mais rápida, mais forte!"
G["Harder, maggots! We must keep the sunwell clear for the master's return!"]="Mais duro, vermes! Temos de manter A Nascente do Sol limpa para o retorno do mestre!"
G["Hardknuckles boring. Why we here again?"]="Hardknuckles boring. Why we here again?"
G["Hardknuckles still walk on hands... seem kind of dumb to Goregek."]="Calhonudilhos ainda caminhar com as mãos... Parecer um pouco tonto a Goregek."
G["Hardly a challenge."]="Apenas um desafio."
G["Hardly a fitting introduction, Spear-Wife.  Now, who is this outsider that I've been hearing so much about?"]="Hardly a fitting introduction, Spear-Wife.  Now, who is this outsider that I've been hearing so much about?"
G["Hardly anyone. It's guarded by a group called \"The Golden Lotus.\" Members of the Golden Lotus are hand-picked by the Celestials to maintain a vigil over the Vale, but few are chosen.\n\nI've heard stories about the Vale since I was a cub. Can you believe such a place actually exists?\n\nDo you think the legends of the pools are true? I wish I could see for myself!"]="Hardly anyone. It's guarded by a group called \"The Golden Lotus.\" Members of the Golden Lotus are hand-picked by the Celestials to maintain a vigil over the Vale, but few are chosen.\n\nI've heard stories about the Vale since I was a cub. Can you believe such a place actually exists?\n\nDo you think the legends of the pools are true? I wish I could see for myself!"
