G["Have you been to Ashenvale lately? How are things?"]="Você já esteve em Ashenvale ultimamente? Como estão as coisas?"
G["Have you been to Bael Modan? What's going on over there?"]="Você já esteve em Bael Modan? O que está acontecendo aí?"
G["Have you been to Dawn's Blossom? Did you happen to pick up an extra cask of Goldendraft while there?\n\nIt is not the easiest thing to have them deliver here."]="Have you been to Dawn's Blossom? Did you happen to pick up an extra cask of Goldendraft while there?\n\nIt is not the easiest thing to have them deliver here."
G["Have you been to Shado-Pan Retreat or Firebough Nook yet, $n? I heard about trouble brewing there with the sha."]="Have you been to Shado-Pan Retreat or Firebough Nook yet, $n? I heard about trouble brewing there with the sha."
G["Have you been to the Jade Forest? To the Valley of the Four Winds? To the low lands of Kun-Lai?\n\nTell me, do they enjoy their peace? Are they still ignorant of the price it costs for that peace? How much Shado-Pan blood must be spilled to maintain their peace?\n\nI suppose it is best they do not. Peace is a thing best enjoyed by the ignorant so they may savor their lives without worry."]="Have you been to the Jade Forest? To the Valley of the Four Winds? To the low lands of Kun-Lai?\n\nTell me, do they enjoy their peace? Are they still ignorant of the price it costs for that peace? How much Shado-Pan blood must be spilled to maintain their peace?\n\nI suppose it is best they do not. Peace is a thing best enjoyed by the ignorant so they may savor their lives without worry."
G["Have you checked out my breathin' hat?\n\nNo more suckin' on clams for Budd! No sirree..."]="Tem visto meu chapéu de respirar?\n\nBudd já nunca mais terá que chupar almejas! Não senhooooor..."
G["Have you come for further training? Shake the dust of the road from your garments, then, and let us get to work."]="Você veio para mais treinamento? Sacuda o pó da estrada das suas roupas e deixe-nos começar a trabalhar."
