G["Have you come to help overthrow Mor'ghor?"]="Você veio para ajudar a derrubar Mor'ghor?"
G["Have you come to hurt me?  I have nothing to do with the war, $r.\n\nI'm just a sickly scholar, please leave me alone!"]="Have you come to hurt me?  I have nothing to do with the war, $r.\n\nI'm just a sickly scholar, please leave me alone!"
G["Have you come to join the hunt, $n?"]="Tem vindo para se juntar a mim na caça, $n?"
