G["Have you come to observe?  Would you like a coconut?"]="Você veio observar? Gostaria de um coco?"
G["Have you come to rescue me? Quick, get me out of these chains!"]="Have you come to rescue me? Quick, get me out of these chains!"
G["Have you come to save this world? To cleanse it?"]="Have you come to save this world? To cleanse it?"
G["Have you come to see Lady Adrilia?"]="Have you come to see Lady Adrilia?"
