G["Have you come to serve the Horde?"]="Tem vindo a servir à Horda?"
G["Have you come to supplicate yourself before the Light? Or perhaps you have come here to train in the holy arts?\n\nIf you are here to speak with Archbishop Benedictus, I am sorry to inform you that he has left on a mission."]="Have you come to supplicate yourself before the Light? Or perhaps you have come here to train in the holy arts?\n\nIf you are here to speak with Archbishop Benedictus, I am sorry to inform you that he has left on a mission."
G["Have you come to try my new concoctions, Wakener?  I assure you these are nothing like you've tasted before."]="Tem vindo a testar meus novos brebagens, arauto? Te garanto que não se parecem a nada que tenha testado."
G["Have you considered settling down, $n? Kun-Lai Summit could use a strong $c such as yourself as its protector."]="Have you considered settling down, $n? Kun-Lai Summit could use a strong $c such as yourself as its protector."
G["Have you danced at the ribbon pole yet?"]="Você já dançou no poste de fita?"
G["Have you discovered something?"]="Have you discovered something?"
G["Have you ever been to Jaggedswine Farm? When the swine are of age for the slaughter... It's that sound. The sound of the swine being killed... It resonates the loudest. Those are hard times for us older veterans."]="Have you ever been to Jaggedswine Farm? When the swine are of age for the slaughter... It's that sound. The sound of the swine being killed... It resonates the loudest. Those are hard times for us older veterans."
G["Have you ever had that feeling when you just can't remember something, but you know it's important?  It's been like that for all of us since Malfurion came back."]="Nunca você passado que você não pode lembrar algo, mas sabe que é importantes? É o que nos suceda nós desde que regresó Malfurion."
G["Have you ever heard of a maiden laughing behind a fan?"]="Have you ever heard of a maiden laughing behind a fan?"
G["Have you ever heard of a place called Dire Maul?"]="Você já ouviu falar de um lugar chamado Dire Maul?"
G["Have you ever noticed that all those cute, orc kids look the same?"]="Have you ever noticed that all those cute, orc kids look the same?"
G["Have you ever seen a tauren hunt? You never do until it's too late."]="Have you ever seen a tauren hunt? You never do until it's too late."
G["Have you ever seen anything like it?"]="Alguma vez has visto algo parecido?"
G["Have you ever seen drakes like the ones around here? Makes for perfect hunting."]="Você já viu drakes como os daqui? Faz para a caça perfeita."
G["Have you ever seen so many unique pets?  Interested in catching some of your own?"]="Alguma vez havia visto tantas ajudantes únicos? Te interesse atrapar algumas?"
G["Have you ever seen such a beautiful rabbit?  I can help you catch your own!"]="Have you ever seen such a beautiful rabbit?  I can help you catch your own!"
G["Have you ever seen such a magnificent being?"]="Você já viu uma criatura tão magnífica assim?"
G["Have you ever thought about adding some animals to your farm?"]="Alguma vez você planteado criar animais na fazenda?"
G["Have you ever tried Eternal Blossom Fish? It's my favorite food."]="Tem testado alguma vez o peixe de Flor Eterna? É meu comida favorita."
G["Have you ever tried drinking poison, Wakener? You must start with something very mild, only a few drops at first.\n\nYou will likely become violently ill. Perhaps you will even lose an antennae or two.\n\nBut do it long enough, and you will become quite used to it."]="Have you ever tried drinking poison, Wakener? You must start with something very mild, only a few drops at first.\n\nYou will likely become violently ill. Perhaps you will even lose an antennae or two.\n\nBut do it long enough, and you will become quite used to it."
G["Have you ever wished to see the boughs of Teldrassil, $n? You should, for there is an elf there who can teach you more. Seek out Ainethil in Darnassus on the Craftsmen's Terrace."]="Have you ever wished to see the boughs of Teldrassil, $n? You should, for there is an elf there who can teach you more. Seek out Ainethil in Darnassus on the Craftsmen's Terrace."
G["Have you figured out yet why that Zandalari troll was animating the statues here?"]="Já tem descoberto por que esse troll Zandalari estava dando vida a essas estátuas?"
G["Have you flown in the Sky Race? I wish you luck, if you do."]="Have you flown in the Sky Race? I wish you luck, if you do."
G["Have you forgotten that they are holding my husband prisoner? Time is running out!"]="Tem esquecido que têm prisioneiro a meu marido? Se nos acabao tempo!"
G["Have you forgotten what it means to be an orc?! We are the blood of the Horde! Not these island beggars."]="Have you forgotten what it means to be an orc?! We are the blood of the Horde! Not these island beggars."
G["Have you fought dese 'tings before?"]="Have you fought dese 'tings before?"
G["Have you found Thrall? I am badly hurt, he insisted on going ahead alone."]="Have you found Thrall? I am badly hurt, he insisted on going ahead alone."
