G["Have you heard of the brood mother of the Black Flight? I believe she is called Onyxia..."]="Tem ouvido falar da mãe de linagem do Voo Negro? Acho que se chama Onyxia..."
G["Have you heard of the shadow dance? It is the dance you perform while in battle.\n\nIt is a dance with death."]="Have you heard of the shadow dance? It is the dance you perform while in battle.\n\nIt is a dance with death."
G["Have you heard of the taunka? They are supposedly related to tauren in some way. Can you imagine such a thing?"]="Tem ouvido falar dos taunkas? Se significa que estão relacionados de algum modo com os tauren. Te o pode imaginar?"
G["Have you heard the good news, $c? The Alliance has completed all of its war effort collections! Now we simply await the Horde to finish theirs. When they do, we'll begin shipping all of the war materiel over to Silithus, and it shouldn't be long after that until the Ahn'Qiraj War begins."]="Have you heard the good news, $c? The Alliance has completed all of its war effort collections! Now we simply await the Horde to finish theirs. When they do, we'll begin shipping all of the war materiel over to Silithus, and it shouldn't be long after that until the Ahn'Qiraj War begins."
G["Have you heard the one about the ogre, the goblin and the pit lord?"]="Conhece o chiste do ogro, o goblin e o senhor do fosso?"
G["Have you heard the rumors? There was a great explosion in the northern lands of Kalimdor and the elves are finally stirring in Quel'thalas!"]="Have you heard the rumors? There was a great explosion in the northern lands of Kalimdor and the elves are finally stirring in Quel'thalas!"
G["Have you heard the sha? We keep hearing its voice on the wind. Not good. Not good at all."]="Have you heard the sha? We keep hearing its voice on the wind. Not good. Not good at all."
G["Have you heard? The traitorous trolls have launched an attack on Razor Hill."]="Have you heard? The traitorous trolls have launched an attack on Razor Hill."
G["Have you honed your skills enough to learn what I have to teach?"]="Você aprimorou suas habilidades o suficiente para aprender o que tenho para ensinar?"
G["Have you killed him? Bloodhilt served the Horde in Southern Barrens. You've avenged a great many lives today, champion."]="Você o matou? Punhossangue serviu à Horda nos Sertões Meridionais. Muitas vidas foram vingadas por você, hoje."
G["Have you learned nothing, boy? You have become all that your father fought against! Like that coward, Arthas, you allowed yourself to be consumed by the darkness, the hate... feeding upon the misery of those you tortured and killed!"]="Have you learned nothing, boy? You have become all that your father fought against! Like that coward, Arthas, you allowed yourself to be consumed by the darkness, the hate... feeding upon the misery of those you tortured and killed!"
G["Have you made contact with Ivus, Arch Druid?"]="Have you made contact with Ivus, Arch Druid?"
G["Have you met Brewmaster Blanche? She wanders the roads to the south and east of here. She has been known to visit us with some of her more astounding brews."]="Have you met Brewmaster Blanche? She wanders the roads to the south and east of here. She has been known to visit us with some of her more astounding brews."
G["Have you met the Lucky Eightcoins? He is our biggest customer and the shrewdest of grummle negotiators."]="Have you met the Lucky Eightcoins? He is our biggest customer and the shrewdest of grummle negotiators."
G["Have you named the twins?"]="Have you named the twins?"
G["Have you not heard of Ysera? Guardian of nature? Aspect of the Dream? She is the matron of all green dragons! Aye, it was Ysera herself that gifted my kingdom with her brood. We stood shoulder to shoulder with the noble creatures and they allowed us to ride them into battle against our enemies. All was well for many centuries... until..."]="Você não ouviu falar de Ysera? Guardião da natureza? Aspecto do sonho? Ela é a matrona de todos os dragões verdes! Sim, foi a própria Ysera que presenteou meu reino com a sua ninhada. Ficamos lado a lado com as criaturas nobres e elas nos permitiram montá-as na batalha contra nossos inimigos. Tudo ficou bem por muitos séculos... até..."
G["Have you not heard?"]="Não você soube?"
G["Have you not yet realized why we remain defiant?"]="Não você dados conta de por que permanecemos desafiantes?"
G["Have you noticed anything strange happening around Zouchin Village?"]="Have you noticed anything strange happening around Zouchin Village?"
G["Have you noticed anything strange lately?  Any new customers in the blacksmith shop?"]="Have you noticed anything strange lately?  Any new customers in the blacksmith shop?"
G["Have you noticed anything strange lately?  Any new customers, buying anything suspicious?"]="Have you noticed anything strange lately?  Any new customers, buying anything suspicious?"
G["Have you recovered the final piece?"]="Você recuperou a peça fim?"
G["Have you seen Lo Wanderbrew?"]="Have you seen Lo Wanderbrew?"
G["Have you seen Merchant Greenfield's supply of seeds? There are all sorts of strange and wonderful things you can grow on your farm."]="Have you seen Merchant Greenfield's supply of seeds? There are all sorts of strange and wonderful things you can grow on your farm."
G["Have you seen Petra or Dadanga around?"]="Tem visto por aqui a Petra ou a Dadanga?"
G["Have you seen Watcher Backus? So brave...\n\nI think he's the toughest of all the Night Watch. I wonder if he even notices I'm around...."]="Have you seen Watcher Backus? So brave...\n\nI think he's the toughest of all the Night Watch. I wonder if he even notices I'm around...."
G["Have you seen all the goods that I sell? You'll have to earn favor with the Tillers to buy them from me, but in order to do that, you'll need to gain more experience by traveling this land."]="Have you seen all the goods that I sell? You'll have to earn favor with the Tillers to buy them from me, but in order to do that, you'll need to gain more experience by traveling this land."
G["Have you seen all the wonderful things here in Ungoro Crater, $n? It's simply amazing. Not as amazing as some of the things I can make with my skill at engineering, but for it being all natural here... it's not too bad.\n\nMy uncle Remtravel loves old stuff like this place. I'm following in his footsteps kinda--I want to discover new things from lost cultures too!"]="Have you seen all the wonderful things here in Ungoro Crater, $n? It's simply amazing. Not as amazing as some of the things I can make with my skill at engineering, but for it being all natural here... it's not too bad.\n\nMy uncle Remtravel loves old stuff like this place. I'm following in his footsteps kinda--I want to discover new things from lost cultures too!"
G["Have you seen an SI:7 agent by the name of Amber?\n\nThe last I heard, her bomber took heavy damage and disappeared into the trees to the northeast."]="Have you seen an SI:7 agent by the name of Amber?\n\nThe last I heard, her bomber took heavy damage and disappeared into the trees to the northeast."
G["Have you seen any Stormstouts here in the Brewgarden?"]="Have you seen any Stormstouts here in the Brewgarden?"
G["Have you seen anybody named Stormstout come through here?"]="Have you seen anybody named Stormstout come through here?"
G["Have you seen anyone suspicious trying to sell a crate of objects recently?"]="Tem visto a alguém de aspecto sostorsoso que estivesse tentando vender um caixote de itens há pouco?"
G["Have you seen my boyfriend?"]="Have you seen my boyfriend?"
G["Have you seen my comrades?"]="Tem visto a meus colegas?"
G["Have you seen my girlfriend?"]="Have you seen my girlfriend?"
G["Have you seen my latest invention? It's going to be a hit... if it doesn't explode."]="Você viu minha última invenção? Vai ser um sucesso... se não explodir."
G["Have you seen my mommy and daddy?"]="Have you seen my mommy and daddy?"
G["Have you seen my river boat? I can't find it anywhere!"]="Tem visto meu navio fluvial? Não o encontro por nenhuma parte!"
G["Have you seen my twin sister, Nimm? She's probably lost, as usual."]="Have you seen my twin sister, Nimm? She's probably lost, as usual."
G["Have you seen our lake, so calm and still? That is how we like it. Constant. Unmoving. We do not bear change."]="Have you seen our lake, so calm and still? That is how we like it. Constant. Unmoving. We do not bear change."
G["Have you seen our magnificent riding turtles? They only appear slow at a glance - an experienced rider may keep pace with the swiftest wolves on all of Kalimdor. Alas, they are reserved only for our most trusted allies."]="Have you seen our magnificent riding turtles? They only appear slow at a glance - an experienced rider may keep pace with the swiftest wolves on all of Kalimdor. Alas, they are reserved only for our most trusted allies."
G["Have you seen the Headless Horseman?  If he comes here then I'll fight him and steal his pumpkin!"]="Você já viu o Cavaleiro Sem Cabeça? Se ele vier aqui, eu vou lutar com ele e roubar sua abóbora!"
G["Have you seen the Headless Horseman?  The matron says if I look at him, then he'll turn me into a pumpkin!"]="Você já viu o Cavaleiro Sem Cabeça? A matrona diz que se eu olhar para ele, ele vai me transformar em abóbora!"
G["Have you seen the befouled water elementals in our lake, $n? It is a sorry sight, but I do not know where they are coming from.\n\nYour name has been mentioned in conversations past, perhaps you could help me with this problem.\n\nThe first thing we must learn is who is in control of these elementals."]="Tem visto os elementais de água podridos em nosso lago, $n? É um paisagem lamentable, mas não sei de onde vêm.\n\nSeu nome se tem mencionado em conversas passadas. Talvez poderia me ajudar com este problema.\n\nO primeiro que é preciso saber é quem controla estes elementais."
G["Have you seen the damaged sentries that wander the island?  A few modifications to the crystals that control their behavior will allow us to gain control of them and use them to secure tactical locations.\n\nThe Sun's Reach Sanctum will be ours in no time.  We are $3244w percent done with this goal."]="Have you seen the damaged sentries that wander the island?  A few modifications to the crystals that control their behavior will allow us to gain control of them and use them to secure tactical locations.\n\nThe Sun's Reach Sanctum will be ours in no time.  We are $3244w percent done with this goal."
G["Have you seen the fireworks? They're beautiful!"]="Tem visto os fogos artifício? São estupendos!"
G["Have you seen the fireworks? This is the best time of year to buy them."]="Have you seen the fireworks? This is the best time of year to buy them."
G["Have you seen the golems that wander these paths, $c? Spirits bound to servitude of the Zandalari for all of eternity.\n\nPerhaps, the Mogu and the Zandalari are more alike than we ever anticipated."]="Have you seen the golems that wander these paths, $c? Spirits bound to servitude of the Zandalari for all of eternity.\n\nPerhaps, the Mogu and the Zandalari are more alike than we ever anticipated."
G["Have you seen the onyx serpents? They are known to lay their eggs on Windward Isle. If you find such an egg and bring it to Elder Anli, you will be justly rewarded."]="Have you seen the onyx serpents? They are known to lay their eggs on Windward Isle. If you find such an egg and bring it to Elder Anli, you will be justly rewarded."
G["Have you seen the outrageous prices here?"]="Have you seen the outrageous prices here?"
G["Have you seen the size of Esme's turnips?"]="Have you seen the size of Esme's turnips?"
G["Have you seen the wall over to the west? I wonder what lies beyond it?"]="Tem visto a muralha do oeste? Que haverá ao outro lado?"
G["Have you seen the way Ros'eleth winks at me whenever I go to pick up a garment or hat? When things settle down around here, I'm going to take her for a nice walk in the woods.\n\nFor once, I miss all those fancy taverns in Stormwind."]="Have you seen the way Ros'eleth winks at me whenever I go to pick up a garment or hat? When things settle down around here, I'm going to take her for a nice walk in the woods.\n\nFor once, I miss all those fancy taverns in Stormwind."
G["Have you seen the yaungol fighting each other? It seems their troubles run deeper than we thought."]="Have you seen the yaungol fighting each other? It seems their troubles run deeper than we thought."
G["Have you seen those huge dirt mounds moving around beneath the dunes?  They belong to a species of tunneling worm the likes of which Azeroth has never seen!  I'm sure that battling one would be a great learning experience for a seasoned adventurer such as yourself."]="Você viu aqueles enormes montes de terra se movendo sob as dunas? Eles pertencem a uma espécie de me ver do tipo túnel que Azeroth nunca viu! Tenho certeza de que lutar com alguém seria uma ótima experiência de aprendizado para um aventureiro experiente como você."
G["Have you sheen the rum? ...hic! I can't sheem to find it anywhere!"]="Have you sheen the rum? ...hic! I can't sheem to find it anywhere!"
G["Have you spoken to either of my acolytes inside the tower yet, $n? We cannot complete your orb until you've done one of their tasks. Speak to them now, if you're ready."]="Tem falado já com algum de meus acólitos da torre, $n? Não podemos terminar seu orbe até que não tenha concluído seus tarefas. Vê a falar com eles se você está $gpreparado: preparada;."
G["Have you spoken with the high priestess yet?  She's very eager to hear the tale of the pilgrimage from your point of view."]="Você já falou com a alta sacerdotisa? Ela está muito ansiosa para ouvir a história da peregrinação do seu ponto de visão."
G["Have you talked to anyone who hasn't started getting sick?"]="Have you talked to anyone who hasn't started getting sick?"
G["Have you talked to my clone--I mean... my twin?"]="Você já conversou com meu clone - quero dizer... meu gêmeo?"
G["Have you tried Kol's cooking? I can't seem to get enough of it."]="Tem testado a cozinha de Kol? Eu não me harto de ela."
G["Have you tried NOT standing in that? It might work better."]="Tem testado a não pisar isso? Talvez vá melhor a coisa."
G["Have you tried any of Chef Tramsay's dishes yet? I really enjoyed his Moth Soup. Delicious!"]="Te o está passando bem? Te metes uma sozinha vez nas Charcos Vaporosas e sales 10 anos mais jovem. Mírame a mim se que provas!"
G["Have you tried our bread? Baker Masterson must be the most gifted chef to have ever lived!"]="Você já experimentou o nosso pão? Baker Masterson deve ser o chef mais talentoso que já existiu!"
G["Have you tried that Thunderbrew Lager?  It's good stuff!"]="Você já experimentou o Thunderbrew Lager? É uma coisa boa!"
G["Have you tried the Dark Iron Ale?  It's the best!"]="Tem testado a cerveja Ferro Negro? É a melhor!"
G["Have you tried the pretzels at Brewfest?  They are amazing, $c!"]="Tem testado os pretzels da Festa da Cerveja? São alucinantes, $c!"
G["Have you tried the rice? You really need to try the rice."]="Have you tried the rice? You really need to try the rice."
G["Have you? Then you know how weak and pathetic the high elf version of troll magic was?\n\nThe high elves could not understand why a people with their magical affinity could not contend with the powers of troll voodoo. This was an inconceivable notion for the pale skins to understand. They were resigned to using the bastardized version of troll enchantments. I believe they called them 'Arcanum.'"]="Have you? Then you know how weak and pathetic the high elf version of troll magic was?\n\nThe high elves could not understand why a people with their magical affinity could not contend with the powers of troll voodoo. This was an inconceivable notion for the pale skins to understand. They were resigned to using the bastardized version of troll enchantments. I believe they called them 'Arcanum.'"
G["Haven't I seen tonight's show before? I could have sworn..."]="Não vi o espectáculo desta noite antes? Juraría..."
G["Haven't I seen you before?  We'll be keeping an eye on you, citizen."]="Haven't I seen you before?  We'll be keeping an eye on you, citizen."
G["Haven't got much time to talk, $r. That is, unless you're willin' to help with this mine trouble."]="Não tenho muito tempo para falar, $r. A menos que queira me ajudar com um provelmilha que tenho."
G["Haven't had much luck. I think it's my bait."]="Não e tido muita sorte. Acho que é pelo cebo."
G["Haven't seen a battle like this since the Frost Giants!"]="Não havia visto uma batalha assim desdos gigantes de gelo!"
G["Haven't seen any. I'm starting to wonder if we will be able to make it up the mountain."]="Haven't seen any. I'm starting to wonder if we will be able to make it up the mountain."
G["Haven't seen that card before."]="Essa não a havia visto nunca."
G["Haven't you been listening? No, I very much doubt we would be having this conversation had Kel'Thuzad formed the staff. Kel'Thuzad holds the head. His underlings hold forty splinters of Atiesh. The last piece - the base - was uncovered by Brann Bronzebeard. He was last seen in the Silithus desert; undoubtedly doing his best to stay as far away as possible from the relentless seekers Kel'Thuzad has dispatched into the world."]="Haven't you been listening? No, I very much doubt we would be having this conversation had Kel'Thuzad formed the staff. Kel'Thuzad holds the head. His underlings hold forty splinters of Atiesh. The last piece - the base - was uncovered by Brann Bronzebeard. He was last seen in the Silithus desert; undoubtedly doing his best to stay as far away as possible from the relentless seekers Kel'Thuzad has dispatched into the world."
G["Haven't you done enough harm?  Must you also disturb my slumber?"]="Haven't you done enough harm?  Must you also disturb my slumber?"
G["Haven't you heard? I always win!"]="Não você soube? Eu sempre gano!"
G["Haven't you poisoned the minds of enough men with your lies? Stay away from me!"]="Não tem envenenado as mentes de bastantes homens com os seus mentiras? Afaste-se de mim!"
G["Havenshire is lost!"]="Vila Refúgio está perdida!"
G["Havenshire will soon be overrun with Scourge. We must hurry!"]="Havenshire will soon be overrun with Scourge. We must hurry!"
G["Having a bad day? Try some cherry pie."]="Tendo um dia ruim? Experimente uma torta de cereja."
G["Having a good time?"]="Está se divertindo?"
G["Having problems, Dalliah?  How nice."]="A coisa se coloca feia, Dalhiah? Que bem."
G["Having seen him in action, I now know what that means."]="Eu o vi em combate, agora sei o que isso significa."
G["Having some trouble there, sailor?  Need some help?"]="Tem algum problema, $gmarinero: marinera;? Precisa ajuda?"
G["Having successfully defended the Alonsus Chapel, %s's spirit returns to its rest."]="Having successfully defended the Alonsus Chapel, %s's spirit returns to its rest."
G["Having trouble dealing with the Wretched? I've got just what you need."]="Having trouble dealing with the Wretched? I've got just what you need."
G["Having trouble staying grounded?"]="É preciso andar com pés de plomo."
G["Hawkstriders are noble creatures.  Make sure to always treat yours well; there are fewer things more dangerous than an angry hawkstrider."]="Os Hawkstriders são criaturas nobres. Certifique-se de sempre tratar bem o seu; há menos coisas mais perigosas do que um falcão atacante furioso."
G["Hazza'rah, the Dreamweaver.\n\nHis is the power of nightmares, and may his foes ever sleep.\n\nHazza'rah now dreams near the edge of madness."]="Hazza'rah, the Dreamweaver.\n\nHis is the power of nightmares, and may his foes ever sleep.\n\nHazza'rah now dreams near the edge of madness."
G["Hazza'rah, the Dreamweaver.\n\nHis is the power of nightmares, and may his foes ever sleep.  \n\nHazza'rah now dwells far from here.  One day, he may return..."]="Hazza'rah, the Dreamweaver.\n\nHis is the power of nightmares, and may his foes ever sleep.  \n\nHazza'rah now dwells far from here.  One day, he may return..."
G["Hch'uu!!!"]="Hch'uu!!!"
G["He IS a fighter. But... is he a leader?"]="Claro que ele é um guerreiro. Mas... líder?"
G["He already knows it will be a smashing success!"]="He already knows it will be a smashing success!"
G["He appeared from thin air!"]="Se materializó da nada!"
G["He asked if the imp could join in--can you believe it? Actually, it wasn't half bad...."]="Preguntó se o diabrete podia entrar. Em sério! A verdade é que não o fez mal..."
G["He be just west of here, workin' at some black magic."]="Eh'tá ao oeste de aqui, trabalhando em magia negra."
G["He called himself Gearmaster Mechazod. When we arrived he was busy transforming the survivors into mechanical beings!\n\nHe greeted us warmly and explained that he was one of the first gnomes ever to be created by something he called \"The Grand Architect\", a Titan keeper from within the halls of fabled Ulduar.\n\nApparently, he was the blockage that my team had accidentally sucked up from where he'd malfunctioned thousands of years ago. It was just our luck that we'd built the pumping station right above him."]="He called himself Gearmaster Mechazod. When we arrived he was busy transforming the survivors into mechanical beings!\n\nHe greeted us warmly and explained that he was one of the first gnomes ever to be created by something he called \"The Grand Architect\", a Titan keeper from within the halls of fabled Ulduar.\n\nApparently, he was the blockage that my team had accidentally sucked up from where he'd malfunctioned thousands of years ago. It was just our luck that we'd built the pumping station right above him."
G["He called it the Curse of the Flesh. Mechazod is deranged!"]="O chamou a maldição da carne… Mecazod está trastornado!"
G["He calls himself the Fur Baron - I call him a sucker! I get a brand new set of winter socks made of rat fur for merely killing and skinning fifty caribou fawns?"]="He calls himself the Fur Baron - I call him a sucker! I get a brand new set of winter socks made of rat fur for merely killing and skinning fifty caribou fawns?"
G["He can't have gotten far..."]="Não pode haver ido muito longe..."
G["He cannot allow him to live in this madness. The Klaxxi will want him put down."]="He cannot allow him to live in this madness. The Klaxxi will want him put down."
G["He cannot be defeated. <The relic burns to nothing. The memories it held are now your own. This city was destroyed by a being not of this world.>"]="He cannot be defeated. <The relic burns to nothing. The memories it held are now your own. This city was destroyed by a being not of this world.>"
G["He carries the Doomhammer!"]="Levou Martelo Maldito!"
G["He claims that all creations of the Titans fall prey to what he calls, 'The Curse of Flesh'. He says that the original gnomes were once mechagnomes."]="Afirma que todas as criações dos titãs são vítimas do que ele chama \"a maldição da carne\". Diz que os primeiros gnomos foram uma vez mecagnomos."
G["He closed his eyes, and became one with the land. And then - do you know what happened?"]="He closed his eyes, and became one with the land. And then - do you know what happened?"
G["He collapses to the floor in exhaustion."]="He collapses to the floor in exhaustion."
G["He continues cautiously."]="Zheng avanza com cautela."
G["He could've destroyed the entire city if he willed it. We were powerless to stop him."]="He could've destroyed the entire city if he willed it. We were powerless to stop him."
G["He cried when his worg died. Well, no one cries for him now!"]="He cried when his worg died. Well, no one cries for him now!"
G["He dead."]="Ele morto."
G["He dead... we free! We glad you pick us instead of puppy-men. Very glad! Definately. Very glad!"]="He dead... we free! We glad you pick us instead of puppy-men. Very glad! Definately. Very glad!"
G["He described the golden capital of Zandalar slowly sinking beneath the waves in the aftermath of the Cataclysm, its once-great people drowning as their mighty works slipped forever beneath the sea."]="Ele descreveu a capital dourada de Zandalar afundando lentamente sob as ondas após o cataclismo. Seu povo, outrora grandioso, se afogava enquanto seu magnífico trabalho deslizava para o fundo do mar para sempre."
G["He did NOT just say that!"]="NÃO me acho que tenha dito isso!"
G["He did more than that, Thorim.  He controls Ulduar now."]="Ele fez mais do que isso, Thorim. Ele controla Ulduar agora."
G["He did not always command such power."]="Ele nem sempre teve tanto poder nas mãos."
G["He did so to keep the land whole. Living with the mantid for ten thousand years has made us both STRONG."]="Para manter nossa terra unida. Viver com os mantídeos durante dez mil anos nos fez mais fortes."
G["He died fighting! PH"]="Morreu lutando! PH"
G["He died our greatest hero. It was Grom who freed us all... I was by his side when he struck down Mannoroth and ended the curse forever."]="He died our greatest hero. It was Grom who freed us all... I was by his side when he struck down Mannoroth and ended the curse forever."
G["He doesn't need blades or magic to defeat his enemies. Our next challenger, Hexos, fights his foes with the awesome powers of GEOMETRY!"]="He doesn't need blades or magic to defeat his enemies. Our next challenger, Hexos, fights his foes with the awesome powers of GEOMETRY!"
G["He doesn't need blades or magic to defeat his enemies. Our next challenger, Hexos, fights his foes with the powers of GEOMETRY!"]="He doesn't need blades or magic to defeat his enemies. Our next challenger, Hexos, fights his foes with the powers of GEOMETRY!"
G["He doesn't see me, does he?"]="Não me vê, verdade?"
G["He ends up destroying the whole keep, freeing all the orcs we're keeping in the camps, and rising to power as the king of orcs... Warchief or somethin'."]="He ends up destroying the whole keep, freeing all the orcs we're keeping in the camps, and rising to power as the king of orcs... Warchief or somethin'."
G["He flew in, torched the park, then just flew off."]="He flew in, torched the park, then just flew off."
G["He fought and died with honor."]="Ele lutou e morreu com honra."
G["He fought with honor. His first and last mistake."]="Luchó com honra. Seu primeiro e último erro."
G["He found a planet whose races had deviated from the titans' blueprints. A planet where not everything had gone according to plan."]="He found a planet whose races had deviated from the titans' blueprints. A planet where not everything had gone according to plan."
G["He gestures towards the eastern vale, then disappears in the shadows."]="Zheng aponta a zona este do vale e desaparece nas sombras."
G["He gestures towards the incoming statues, requesting your aid."]="He gestures towards the incoming statues, requesting your aid."
G["He got a big army, an' he be plannin' somethin' down dere."]="He got a big army, an' he be plannin' somethin' down dere."
G["He grew and grew and grew, SO big, that now some people call him \"The Wandering Isle.\""]="He grew and grew and grew, SO big, that now some people call him \"The Wandering Isle.\""
G["He grows fatter and more corrupt with each passing day. Ye can smell the stink comin' off o' his body. He be dirty, an' I dun just mean he be needin' a wash.\n\nEnough babblin' from Hulfdan. Where did ye come from and how can me help ye, $c?"]="He grows fatter and more corrupt with each passing day. Ye can smell the stink comin' off o' his body. He be dirty, an' I dun just mean he be needin' a wash.\n\nEnough babblin' from Hulfdan. Where did ye come from and how can me help ye, $c?"
G["He had it coming."]="He had it coming."
G["He had that one coming."]="He had that one coming."
G["He happened upon a pair of battling kodos.\nClever as he was, The Wolf decided to wait for one to defeat the other."]="He happened upon a pair of battling kodos.\nClever as he was, The Wolf decided to wait for one to defeat the other."
G["He has ordered his crony, Razlo Crushcog, to keep us on the defensive. Hinkles, what's the latest intelligence on Razlo and his men?"]="He has ordered his crony, Razlo Crushcog, to keep us on the defensive. Hinkles, what's the latest intelligence on Razlo and his men?"
G["He has seen many high elders come and go. He also tends to take these celebrations very seriously."]="He has seen many high elders come and go. He also tends to take these celebrations very seriously."
G["He has the legs of an ox! Have you ever been kicked by him in training?"]="He has the legs of an ox! Have you ever been kicked by him in training?"
G["He has to be in the last cell. Unless... they killed him."]="Precisa estar na última cela. A não ser... que lhe tenham matou."
G["He hasn't been the same since the War. It's like he aged and became an old man overnight. That son of his, though - he'll make a fine king one day."]="He hasn't been the same since the War. It's like he aged and became an old man overnight. That son of his, though - he'll make a fine king one day."
G["He he!  This will be a great hiding spot."]="He he!  This will be a great hiding spot."
G["He is coming..."]="Já vem..."
G["He is creating a new world for us. He is not... making a salad!"]="Está criando um mundo novo para nós. Não está... fazendo uma ensalada!"
G["He is dead! You have done it!"]="Está morto! O conseguiu!"
G["He is gone. We must all move on."]="Já não está. Devemos seguir adiante."
G["He is heading to the maelstrom!  We must stop him NOW, we may never get another chance if he escapes into Deepholm."]="He is heading to the maelstrom!  We must stop him NOW, we may never get another chance if he escapes into Deepholm."
G["He is insane now. Driven mad during the shattering. There is no rest for the elements."]="Agora perdeu a razão. Se voltou louco durante a rotura. Não há descanso para os elementos."
G["He is lost to us, sister. He is Neltharion no longer."]="O temos perdido, irmã. Já não é Neltharion."
G["He is mine now..."]="Agora é meu..."
G["He is near, lurking in the shadows... I can sense it."]="He is near, lurking in the shadows... I can sense it."
G["He is not a chicken, and no you may not pet him. Now be on your way before I give you a closer look at his beak."]="He is not a chicken, and no you may not pet him. Now be on your way before I give you a closer look at his beak."
G["He is our only way to find the bell. We WILL make him talk. Give us time."]="É a única forma de encontrar a sino. Nós lhe faremos falar. Danos tempo."
G["He is protecting the mask. Kill him!"]="He is protecting the mask. Kill him!"
G["He is slow from the rust of the ages... be quick on your feet and he will not best you. You have King Stormheart's favor - do not disappoint."]="O passo dos anos o voltou lento... se é ágil não te vencerá. Contas com o favor do rei Cuoretormenta, não lhe decepções."
G["He is still connected to the Well somehow! Focus your attacks on Mannoroth, we must disrupt his concentration!"]="He is still connected to the Well somehow! Focus your attacks on Mannoroth, we must disrupt his concentration!"
G["He is the greatest hero the arakkoa have ever known.\n\nIt is said that in ancient times, he built the city of Skettis with his own claws. He was our greatest champion and defender, but he left us when we turned away from the veneration of Rukhmar.\n\nWe came to worship a new master, one who promised us untold power and status in the cosmos.\n\nThere are some who say that Terokk and Rukhmar are one, and he withdrew his presence from us when we turned away from him."]="He is the greatest hero the arakkoa have ever known.\n\nIt is said that in ancient times, he built the city of Skettis with his own claws. He was our greatest champion and defender, but he left us when we turned away from the veneration of Rukhmar.\n\nWe came to worship a new master, one who promised us untold power and status in the cosmos.\n\nThere are some who say that Terokk and Rukhmar are one, and he withdrew his presence from us when we turned away from him."
G["He is too powerful!  Use the altars to harness the powers of the elements and we may stand a chance!"]="É demais poderoso! Usaos altares para domínio os poderes dos elementos e talvez tengamos uma oportunidade!"
G["He is too powerful!  You must use the drums!"]="É demais poderoso! Deve usar os tambores!"
G["He is too powerful. We must leave this place at once! My magic can hold him in place for only a short time. Come quickly, heroes!"]="He is too powerful. We must leave this place at once! My magic can hold him in place for only a short time. Come quickly, heroes!"
G["He is unable to see you just yet, but do not trouble yourselves over it. I'm certain he will find a way to fit you into his busy schedule."]="He is unable to see you just yet, but do not trouble yourselves over it. I'm certain he will find a way to fit you into his busy schedule."
G["He just came stumbing out of the barracks.\n\nI screamed for help, but the guards wouldn't even look at me!"]="He just came stumbing out of the barracks.\n\nI screamed for help, but the guards wouldn't even look at me!"
G["He just inherited Sunsong Ranch. You can literally see him from where you are standing."]="He just inherited Sunsong Ranch. You can literally see him from where you are standing."
G["He just went missing and I don't know what to do!"]="Tem sumiu e não sei que fazer!"
G["He keeps talking about arclight spanners and overcharged capacitors. He sure knows to lead a girl on. Rawr!"]="He keeps talking about arclight spanners and overcharged capacitors. He sure knows to lead a girl on. Rawr!"
G["He keeps telling me that he likes my accent, and I just keep asking, what accent?"]="He keeps telling me that he likes my accent, and I just keep asking, what accent?"
G["He killed everyone! EVERYONE!"]="Os matou a todos! A TODOS!"
G["He knew you were a traitor!"]="Ele sabia que eras um traidor."
G["He knows more about this land than we do. Perhaps you should heed his warnings."]="Sabe mais sobre esta terra que nós. Talvez deveria escutar seus advertências."
G["He knows well of your curse and of the terrible things that can come of it.  He may even hold himself to blame for it to some degree."]="He knows well of your curse and of the terrible things that can come of it.  He may even hold himself to blame for it to some degree."
G["He knows what we attempt. We have not much time, the forest crawls with his demons."]="He knows what we attempt. We have not much time, the forest crawls with his demons."
G["He looked real important. Tak-Tak try to chitchatter with 'im, but he jus' stared at me so I shut my jabber real quick."]="He looked real important. Tak-Tak try to chitchatter with 'im, but he jus' stared at me so I shut my jabber real quick."
G["He mad, bro, real mad!"]="Está bravo. Muito bravo."
G["He managed to explore the ruins before the battle began, discovering three runic plates inscribed with prophecies."]="He managed to explore the ruins before the battle began, discovering three runic plates inscribed with prophecies."
G["He may be a huge chicken, but he'll still put up a fight. It's Tyson Sanders!"]="Talvez não seja mais que uma enorme galinha, mas não dará a batalha por perdida. É Tyson Sanders!"
G["He may never know the peace of returning to the earth... but at least he went out fighting."]="He may never know the peace of returning to the earth... but at least he went out fighting."
G["He may not wish to leave, regardless of whose heart beckons him home."]="He may not wish to leave, regardless of whose heart beckons him home."
G["He motions for you to wait."]="Zheng diz com um gesto que esperes."
G["He must be overwhelmed with work at the Monastery. But still, he should have returned by now."]="Deve estar inundado de trabalho no Monastério. Mas, ainda assim, já deveria haver retornado."
G["He must embrace them and find balance... or this curse will never end."]="He must embrace them and find balance... or this curse will never end."
G["He must fall!"]="Deve cair!"
G["He must have news from the field."]="Deve ter notícia do linha de frente."
G["He must have pursued the fleeing yaungol while we intercepted their leader."]="He must have pursued the fleeing yaungol while we intercepted their leader."
G["He never gave up - Captain Irontree - said he'd make them pay for every inch of ground they defile. He may still be alive down there!"]="Ele nunca desistiu - capitão Irontree - disse que os faria pagar por cada centímetro de terreno que contaminassem. Ele ainda pode estar vivo lá em baixo!"
G["He offered all of us a chance to regain our former glory... to be true tol'vir again.\n\nBut only... if we swore allegiance to him."]="He offered all of us a chance to regain our former glory... to be true tol'vir again.\n\nBut only... if we swore allegiance to him."
G["He often seeks a lordly dish..."]="... a belo procurando para o seu asador..."
G["He opened his umbrella, planted it in the ground, and sat underneath its cool shade."]="He opened his umbrella, planted it in the ground, and sat underneath its cool shade."
G["He outgrew his bowl, so now we keep him in this pond!"]="He outgrew his bowl, so now we keep him in this pond!"
G["He points down the hall ahead."]="Zheng aponta até a salão de enfrente."
G["He promised gold and riches to any who could discover for him the hidden secrets of this land that fill Pandaria with such a dark and powerful energy."]="Ele prometeu ouro e riquezas para quem pudesse encontrar os tesouros escondidos que enchem Pandária de uma energia tão sombria e poderosa."
G["He put the needs of this flight first and foremost."]="As necessidades deste Voo eram o primeiro para ele."
G["He puts the rock into the hole!"]="He puts the rock into the hole!"
G["He really couldn't help it..."]="He really couldn't help it..."
G["He reports deciphering part of the writing on the runic plate, but it doesn't look like he recorded his translation."]="Relatório de que tem descifrado parte da escritura da placa rúnica, mas não parece que anotara a tradução."
G["He represents everything that is just, and righteous, and a bunch of other boring crap too. It's the draenei paladin, Ahoo'ru!"]="He represents everything that is just, and righteous, and a bunch of other boring crap too. It's the draenei paladin, Ahoo'ru!"
G["He represents everything that is just, and righteous, and several other virtues which are of no interest to most of you. It's the draenei paladin, Ahoo'ru!"]="He represents everything that is just, and righteous, and several other virtues which are of no interest to most of you. It's the draenei paladin, Ahoo'ru!"
G["He returned to the main continent of Pandaria once every five years."]="He returned to the main continent of Pandaria once every five years."
G["He said goodbye just a few days ago. I can still see his face! How can he be dead?"]="He said goodbye just a few days ago. I can still see his face! How can he be dead?"
G["He said he had candy..."]="He said he had candy..."
G["He scoured the sands of Durotar, hunting for his prey."]="He scoured the sands of Durotar, hunting for his prey."
G["He seems to know more than the whispering citizens, and he seems convinced that this traitor is the one last remnant of the cities troubles, Cataclysm aside."]="He seems to know more than the whispering citizens, and he seems convinced that this traitor is the one last remnant of the cities troubles, Cataclysm aside."
G["He served 248 consecutive tours of duty across the First, Second and Third Wars."]="He served 248 consecutive tours of duty across the First, Second and Third Wars."
G["He shoots, he scores!"]="Dispara e puntúa!"
G["He should have chosen me. Those who take the greatest risks achieve the greatest victories."]="He should have chosen me. Those who take the greatest risks achieve the greatest victories."
G["He should not have angered me.  I must go... recover my strength now..."]="He should not have angered me.  I must go... recover my strength now..."
G["He sits idly on his chieftain's chair, content to mask his cowardice with dreams of peace!"]="He sits idly on his chieftain's chair, content to mask his cowardice with dreams of peace!"
G["He sought an artifact... a horn, I think. He left the village on a long journey in search of it."]="Procurava um artefato... um chifre, acho. Deixou o povo para realizar um largo viagem no seu procurando."
G["He sought to consolidate our rightful power, fortifying us for the cataclysm that he saw coming."]="Trató de consolidar nosso poder legítimo e nos preparó para o Cataclismo que ele viu vir."
G["He started it!"]="Ele empezó!"
G["He struggles to free himself."]="He struggles to free himself."
G["He suggested I do something else with the lance, instead. It's not my place to repeat vulgarities."]="He suggested I do something else with the lance, instead. It's not my place to repeat vulgarities."
G["He tampers with the lock on your cage."]="He tampers with the lock on your cage."
G["He thinks he's so damned important. Always pushing me around... I'll show him. I'll show all of them!"]="He thinks he's so damned important. Always pushing me around... I'll show him. I'll show all of them!"
G["He told me that you would come for me. I won't die by your hand, though. I have seen what you have done to my compatriots."]="Disse para mim que vendrías a por mim. Mas não me matarás você. vi o que fez a meus compatriotas."
G["He took the unforged rune covered breastplate, used in the making of the demon forged breastplate and ran away without making payment. A fool, I am not, however... the unforged chest piece is useless without knowledge or the recipe to apply said knowledge.\n\nI wonder... does he sit safely in his city of Blackrock Spire and attempt to create the item from the raw material? I know he dare not leave!"]="He took the unforged rune covered breastplate, used in the making of the demon forged breastplate and ran away without making payment. A fool, I am not, however... the unforged chest piece is useless without knowledge or the recipe to apply said knowledge.\n\nI wonder... does he sit safely in his city of Blackrock Spire and attempt to create the item from the raw material? I know he dare not leave!"
G["He tried to sneak up behind me and plant his blade in my skull.  Lucky for me, I can smell a dwarf a mile away... and my skull's a lot thicker than most."]="He tried to sneak up behind me and plant his blade in my skull.  Lucky for me, I can smell a dwarf a mile away... and my skull's a lot thicker than most."
G["He united the mogu, conquered the other pandaren races, and built an empire that would last for thousands of years."]="He united the mogu, conquered the other pandaren races, and built an empire that would last for thousands of years."
G["He united the mogu, defeated the other pandaren races, and founded a glorious nation with the slave labor of those he conquered."]="He united the mogu, defeated the other pandaren races, and founded a glorious nation with the slave labor of those he conquered."
G["He wants his \"golds.\" Pay up or die... again..."]="Ele quer o seu \"ouro\". \"Pague ou morra... novamente..."
G["He wants me to do WHAT?"]="O que quer que hagao QUE?"
G["He was a good man, but terrible with a sword! PH"]="Era um bom homem, mas com a lâmina era terrível! PH"
G["He was a tough one..."]="Este era duro de pelar..."
G["He was always prattling on about finding this or that magic artifact. Said Azshara was full of them, he did. He was a bit obsessive if you ask me.\n\nLast I heard, he was trying to make friends with that Archmage person. Xylem? He said Xylem had found some grand old magic item."]="He was always prattling on about finding this or that magic artifact. Said Azshara was full of them, he did. He was a bit obsessive if you ask me.\n\nLast I heard, he was trying to make friends with that Archmage person. Xylem? He said Xylem had found some grand old magic item."
G["He was always studying, always trying to get better."]="He was always studying, always trying to get better."
G["He was beaten and left for dead. If Priestess Delrissa hadn't arrived when she did, who knows what might have happened!"]="He was beaten and left for dead. If Priestess Delrissa hadn't arrived when she did, who knows what might have happened!"
G["He was but a trainee.  The will of a master is stronger!"]="He was but a trainee.  The will of a master is stronger!"
G["He was called James Harrington.  A tragedy in three parts."]="Chamava-se James Harrington. Uma tragedia em três actos."
G["He was hungry for kodo meat."]="He was hungry for kodo meat."
G["He was just a wee pebble..."]="Ele era só uma pedrinha de nada..."
G["He was misguided, of course, but he was right about one thing: Our world is... so fragile."]="Ele estava desencaminhado, é claro, mas numa coisa ele tinha razão. Nosso mundo é... tão frágil."
G["He was right, you know. I'll have to take that tag-line for my own... It's not like he'll have a use for it anymore!"]="He was right, you know. I'll have to take that tag-line for my own... It's not like he'll have a use for it anymore!"
G["He was so cold. So limp and lifeless."]="Estava tão frio... Tão quieto e inerte..."
G["He was the Earthen Ring's most powerful shaman, and the ceremony cannot continue without him. But we must be prepared to accept that he may be lost forever..."]="He was the Earthen Ring's most powerful shaman, and the ceremony cannot continue without him. But we must be prepared to accept that he may be lost forever..."
G["He was weak, but I am stronger!"]="Era fraco, mas eu sou forte!"
G["He was wounded.  I can easily pick up his trail."]="Está ferido. Posso seguir seu rastro facilmente."
G["He was wounded.  I think I can pick up the trail."]="Foi ferido. Acho que posso seguir o rastro."
G["He watches your every move..."]="Ele vigila todos seus movimentos..."
G["He will be sleepy for a while.  Lunk know.  Lunk do before."]="Ele dormir um tempo. Nhonho saber. Nhonho fazer isto antes."
G["He will guide our next steps..."]="Ele guiará nossos próximos passos."
G["He will learn... no king rules forever; only death is eternal!"]="He will learn... no king rules forever; only death is eternal!"
G["He will live so long as he proves useful. I'd be careful if I was you, dwarf."]="He will live so long as he proves useful. I'd be careful if I was you, dwarf."
G["He will not be defeated until he is utterly annhilated."]="Não será derrotou até que se lhe aniquile por completo."
G["He will stop at nothing to get to Malfurion's physical manifestation. That must not happen... We must keep the beast occupied long enough for Tyrande to arrive."]="Não se detendrá ante nada e intentará destruir a manifestação física de Malfurion. Isso não deve acontecer... Devemos manter ocupada à fera até que chegue Tyrande."
G["He won't be gettin' up from that one."]="Desta si que não se vai recuperar."
G["He worried that his power weakened, that soon even we last of his precious soulgems would fade and die."]="He worried that his power weakened, that soon even we last of his precious soulgems would fade and die."
G["He would never just disappear like this! It's not like him."]="Ela nunca desaparecería assim, sem dizer nada! Não é próprio de ela!"
G["He would never leave on his own! Where could he have gone?"]="He would never leave on his own! Where could he have gone?"
G["He would say to you: Thrall. Lead your people."]="He would say to you: Thrall. Lead your people."
G["He'll bring you mead\nHe'll bring you beer\nA grinning face from ear to ear\nHe's served us all from year to year\nWe call him Smiling Jim."]="He'll bring you mead\nHe'll bring you beer\nA grinning face from ear to ear\nHe's served us all from year to year\nWe call him Smiling Jim."
G["He'll bring you mead, he'll bring you beer..."]="He'll bring you mead, he'll bring you beer..."
G["He'll get me more later? How are we supposed to get you promoted to Trade $g Prince : Princess; without our number one product on the shelves?!!!"]="He'll get me more later? How are we supposed to get you promoted to Trade $g Prince : Princess; without our number one product on the shelves?!!!"
G["He'll peck your eyes out if you give him a chance. It's Dippy!"]="He'll peck your eyes out if you give him a chance. It's Dippy!"
G["He'll slice and dice in ways that aren't nice! Please bow respectfully for Maki Waterblade, saurok samurai!"]="He'll slice and dice in ways that aren't nice! Please bow respectfully for Maki Waterblade, saurok samurai!"
G["He's a bit animated for my tastes, but the world needs all kinds, I suppose.\n\nWhy do you ask?"]="É um pouco efusivo para meu gusto, mas no mundo precisa haver de tudo, suponho.\n\nPor que o perguntas?"
G["He's a strategic mastermind, and he doesn't even have a head. Or an elbow, even. It's Ro-Shambo! Let's give him a hand!"]="He's a strategic mastermind, and he doesn't even have a head. Or an elbow, even. It's Ro-Shambo! Let's give him a hand!"
G["He's absolutely raging!  So much anger, so much pain... and he had the strength to suppress it all these years..."]="He's absolutely raging!  So much anger, so much pain... and he had the strength to suppress it all these years..."
G["He's alive alright, and been living like an outcast in Lakeshire for the past five months. Or hadn't you noticed? Now enough chatter. We've got people to save!"]="He's alive alright, and been living like an outcast in Lakeshire for the past five months. Or hadn't you noticed? Now enough chatter. We've got people to save!"
G["He's alive, but his bones are shattered."]="Ele está vivo, mas seus ossos estão quebrados."
G["He's almost down!"]="Quase tem caído!"
G["He's at the Shado-Pan Garrison right now. Here's a kite. Go see him!"]="He's at the Shado-Pan Garrison right now. Here's a kite. Go see him!"
G["He's been... mortally wounded, sir."]="Tem resultados... mortalmente ferido, senhor."
G["He's castin' something big! Stop'm!"]="Vai lançar algo grande! Detenha-o!"
G["He's coming.  Get ready, lads!"]="Já vem. Preparem-se, pessoal!"
G["He's completely mad!"]="Está completamente louco!"
G["He's cornered!"]="He's cornered!"
G["He's deluded a group of diseased humans into thinking they can take their land back. He's poisoned their blood with his own draconic essence."]="He's deluded a group of diseased humans into thinking they can take their land back. He's poisoned their blood with his own draconic essence."
G["He's gem-mad, he is, but I love him. Says I'm his favorite gem of them all, hee!\nNow then, what can I help ye with? Archaeology, is it?"]="Está louco pelas gemas, si, mas lhe adoro. Diz que eu sou seu gema favorita, jejeje!\n\nBom, em O que posso ajudar você? Arqueologia, não?"
G["He's going after them? And he sent you to ask me for help? Was there begging? Were there tears?\n\n<Azuregos stares off into the distance as a toothy smile creeps onto his face.>\n\nYou know, if I came to his rescue, there's no way he could ever live it down. Maybe he'd make me one of those little Sunwell girls of my very own.\n\nNo offense, Anara."]="He's going after them? And he sent you to ask me for help? Was there begging? Were there tears?\n\n<Azuregos stares off into the distance as a toothy smile creeps onto his face.>\n\nYou know, if I came to his rescue, there's no way he could ever live it down. Maybe he'd make me one of those little Sunwell girls of my very own.\n\nNo offense, Anara."
G["He's going for Mr. Floppy!"]="Vai por Floppy!"
G["He's going to use the Divine Bell, and Light help us if we can't stop 'im in time."]="He's going to use the Divine Bell, and Light help us if we can't stop 'im in time."
G["He's gone?  Hooray!"]="Ele se foi? Viva!"
G["He's gonna eat Mr. Floppy! You gotta help Mr. Floppy! You just gotta!"]="Se vai comer a Floppy! Precisa ajudar a Floppy! Precisa fazer isso!"
G["He's got his reasons, Idonis.  He thinks the Farstriders have uncovered something."]="Tem seus motivos, Idonis. Acredita que os Errantes têm descoberto algo."
G["He's got one of the tribes on his side.  The Neferset.\n\nOrsis has made its defiance clear.\n\nRamkahen has tried to find a peaceful solution, but there is no peace possible with Deathwing and his allies."]="He's got one of the tribes on his side.  The Neferset.\n\nOrsis has made its defiance clear.\n\nRamkahen has tried to find a peaceful solution, but there is no peace possible with Deathwing and his allies."
G["He's got two modes. Both modes are labeled \"KILL\". Let's hear it for T440!"]="Tem dois modos. E em ambos modos o objetivo é \"MATAR\". Um aplauso para T440!"
G["He's here in Northrend brother, looking for you. A seer in Wintergarde brought word that you were not dead, and he left Ironforge immediately to come find you."]="He's here in Northrend brother, looking for you. A seer in Wintergarde brought word that you were not dead, and he left Ironforge immediately to come find you."
G["He's here, stop him!"]="Está aqui! É preciso detenerle!"
G["He's impulsive, but we'll get results. He'll see our way is right."]="É impulsivo, mas obtendremos resultados. Verá que temos razão."
G["He's in here. Let's get 'im!"]="Está aqui. A por ele!"
G["He's mine..."]="É meu..."
G["He's monstrous!"]="É monstruoso!"
G["He's my assistant.\n\nSure, he's not been plagued in the same manner as we have, but he is clearly plagued nonetheless.  He's bent the knee to Sylvanas, so he's as much one of us as you or I.\n\nAnd just between you and me... to be perfectly honest, I think the Dark Lady thought he was already bending his knee when he entered her chamber!"]="He's my assistant.\n\nSure, he's not been plagued in the same manner as we have, but he is clearly plagued nonetheless.  He's bent the knee to Sylvanas, so he's as much one of us as you or I.\n\nAnd just between you and me... to be perfectly honest, I think the Dark Lady thought he was already bending his knee when he entered her chamber!"
G["He's never seen an opponent that he wouldn't fight. Ah, small correction: he's never seen an opponent. He's the Blind Hero!"]="He's never seen an opponent that he wouldn't fight. Ah, small correction: he's never seen an opponent. He's the Blind Hero!"
G["He's not a real doctor, but he's going to attempt some facial reconstruction surgery. On his next opponent. Welcome, Doctor FIST!"]="He's not a real doctor, but he's going to attempt some facial reconstruction surgery. On his next opponent. Welcome, Doctor FIST!"
G["He's not going anywhere."]="Não vai ir a nenhuma parte."
G["He's not nuts, he's crazy!  Always going off looking for fortune and glory..."]="Não está louco, está chalado! Sempre procurando a fama e a glória..."
G["He's not the boy of your memories anymore, Muradin. He's become something else entirely."]="Já não é o rapaz que recordamos, Muradin. Se transformou em algo totalmente distinto."
G["He's on his way!"]="Está de caminho!"
G["He's ours! The Butcher of Taurajo is dead!"]="É nosso! O Carniceiro de Taurajo está morto!"
G["He's out in the field now, and waitin' fer ya special."]="Agora está no campo, esperando você."
G["He's out to get me, too! I'd be careful around here if I was you, traveler. You never know which tree he's hiding behind!"]="He's out to get me, too! I'd be careful around here if I was you, traveler. You never know which tree he's hiding behind!"
G["He's probably the most deadly brawler we've ever had here at the Brawl'gar Arena. Unfortunately, he's a little out of his element. Everybody raise your glass for Razorgrin!"]="He's probably the most deadly brawler we've ever had here at the Brawl'gar Arena. Unfortunately, he's a little out of his element. Everybody raise your glass for Razorgrin!"
G["He's probably the most deadly brawler we've ever had here at the Brawlpub. Unfortunately, he's a little out of his element. Everybody raise your glass for Razorgrin!"]="He's probably the most deadly brawler we've ever had here at the Brawlpub. Unfortunately, he's a little out of his element. Everybody raise your glass for Razorgrin!"
G["He's protecting the mask. Kill him!"]="He's protecting the mask. Kill him!"
G["He's quite insane! Someone must put a stop to his madness before it's too late for everyone!"]="He's quite insane! Someone must put a stop to his madness before it's too late for everyone!"
G["He's really nice and he tries to cook things for me. Unfortunately, they aren't edible and I have to toss them out when he isn't looking."]="He's really nice and he tries to cook things for me. Unfortunately, they aren't edible and I have to toss them out when he isn't looking."
G["He's right. I feel nothing... I am... nothing."]="Tem razão. Não sinto nada... não sou... nada."
G["He's sent one of his cowards in to kill me, has he?"]="Tem enviada a um dos seus covardes para me matar, verdade?"
G["He's served us all from year to year..."]="Nos tem servido a todos de ano em ano..."
G["He's so well disciplined!"]="Está tão bem disciplinado!"
G["He's sort of a cute little thing, really. I think I'll keep him."]="Me parece uma cosita muito linda. Acho que me o vou ficar."
G["He's still loyal to your Warchief, but he wants to do things differently."]="He's still loyal to your Warchief, but he wants to do things differently."
G["He's too far gone! We have to keep trying!"]="Está demais ido! Devemos seguir intentándolo!"
G["He's too powerful!  You've got to find a way to use those altars to give us an edge!"]="He's too powerful!  You've got to find a way to use those altars to give us an edge!"
G["He's too strong!  Use the catapults to bring him down!"]="He's too strong!  Use the catapults to bring him down!"
G["He's too strong! Retreat!"]="É demais forte! Retirada!"
G["He's truly gone, isn't he?\n\nI... I can feel it."]="He's truly gone, isn't he?\n\nI... I can feel it."
G["He's vulnerable to our magic now!  Hold him down!"]="Agora é vulnerável a nossa magia! Sujétalo!"
G["He's your husband, woman. How am I to know where he is?"]="É seu marido, mulher. Como e de saber onde se encontre?"
G["He's... so..."]="É... muito..."
G["He's... too powerful. Heroes, quickly... come to me! We must leave this place at once! I will do what I can to hold him in place while we flee."]="He's... too powerful. Heroes, quickly... come to me! We must leave this place at once! I will do what I can to hold him in place while we flee."
G["He's...he's dead?"]="Está... está morto?"
