G["He... he kept it? All this time, he kept it!?"]="O... O tem guardado? Tudo este tempo, o tem guardado?"
G["He... he segregates the city?"]="Está... está segregando a cidade?"
G["He... hello, $n. Sorry, I'm recovering from my wounds.\n\nThose Scarlet Crusaders are tougher than I had given them credit for. They almost did me in.\n\nYou should be careful too. I'd hate to see them get the jump on you."]="He... hello, $n. Sorry, I'm recovering from my wounds.\n\nThose Scarlet Crusaders are tougher than I had given them credit for. They almost did me in.\n\nYou should be careful too. I'd hate to see them get the jump on you."
