G["Head back up to the east pass! They're pushing hard!"]="Head back up to the east pass! They're pushing hard!"
G["Head north up the road to Orgrimmar.  You can ask one of the grunts there for directions to the Cooking Trainer."]="Continue para o norte pela estrada para Orgrimmar. Você pode pedir a um dos grunhidos lá as instruções para o Cooking Trainer."
