G["Heh, do not get angry with the elements. Violence is their nature. I conquered my own anger long, long ago."]="Ah, não se enfureça com os elementos. A violência é sua natureza. Eu dominei minha própria raiva há muito, muito tempo."
G["Heh, heh... Quite the inquisitive one, aren't ya, $n? Well, here's what you need to do.\n\nNorth of here, in the old ruins, lives a very disagreeable gnoll by the name of Miblon Snarltooth. He guards the only Evoroot I know of, but he watches it night and day! Seems like he never even sleeps!\n\nWhat you can do, is bribe him. I can sell you some bait that he'll find tasty -- just put it down near him and that will distract him long enough for you to grab the Evoroot. Good luck!"]="Heh, heh... Quite the inquisitive one, aren't ya, $n? Well, here's what you need to do.\n\nNorth of here, in the old ruins, lives a very disagreeable gnoll by the name of Miblon Snarltooth. He guards the only Evoroot I know of, but he watches it night and day! Seems like he never even sleeps!\n\nWhat you can do, is bribe him. I can sell you some bait that he'll find tasty -- just put it down near him and that will distract him long enough for you to grab the Evoroot. Good luck!"
G["Heh, sounds like Malkorok just tore apart those intruders."]="Ha. Parece que Malkorok acaba de pulverizar aos intrusos."
G["Heh, the skies aren't so friendly with $n flying them!"]="Heh, the skies aren't so friendly with $n flying them!"
G["Heh. Nothing against you, pup, but you might want to find somewhere else to bed down for the night. Wouldn't want that tender skin of yours to get bruised."]="Heh. Nada contra você, filhote, mas você pode querer encontrar outro lugar para dormir durante a noite. Não gostaria que sua pele macia ficasse machucada."
G["Heh... Yeh sure put them skills ta use, didn't yeh, lad?"]="Sim... utilizaste bem suas habilidades, verdade, rapaz?"
G["Heh... heh... hey! You! I may be down, but I be gettin' back on my feet! Come over here and look at what I got. The rarest and most marvelous amulets, right here! I even picked up some extra bits! Come on, come on, ya know ya wanna look."]="Heh... heh... hey! You! I may be down, but I be gettin' back on my feet! Come over here and look at what I got. The rarest and most marvelous amulets, right here! I even picked up some extra bits! Come on, come on, ya know ya wanna look."
G["Heh... pandaren. You must be here to join the Alliance."]="Eh... Pandaren. Deve haver vindo para se juntar à Aliança."
