G["Hehe... I made a pun, didn't I? Druidic in nature... I'm so funny."]="Je, je... Fiz um jogo de palavras, não é assim? Sou uma druida por natureza... Que graciosa sou..."
G["Hehehe! Things go boom!"]="Je, je, je! Tudo marcha bem!"
G["Hehehe, how you doin' mon. You gonna help Pele'keiki great deal he be thinkin'. We be needin' a bombastic amount of the firebloom herb to be preparin' right for the Ahn'Qiraj War. The Horde, they say, 'Pele'keiki, you get us $2051w of the fire petals right quick'.\n\nPele'keiki tell you now, he only have $2050w firebloom, but you gonna add to that real soon, right mon?"]="Hehehe, how you doin' mon. You gonna help Pele'keiki great deal he be thinkin'. We be needin' a bombastic amount of the firebloom herb to be preparin' right for the Ahn'Qiraj War. The Horde, they say, 'Pele'keiki, you get us $2051w of the fire petals right quick'.\n\nPele'keiki tell you now, he only have $2050w firebloom, but you gonna add to that real soon, right mon?"
