G["Hello $c, and welcome to the Darkmoon Faire.\n\nThere is so much to do here at the faire that it can be a little overwhelming for our first time visitors. That's why I'm here to help.\n\nDo you have any questions?"]="Hello $c, and welcome to the Darkmoon Faire.\n\nThere is so much to do here at the faire that it can be a little overwhelming for our first time visitors. That's why I'm here to help.\n\nDo you have any questions?"
G["Hello $c, and welcome to the Darkmoon Faire. There is so much to do here at the faire that it can be a little overwhelming for our first time visitors. That's why I'm here to help. Do you have any questions?"]="Hello $c, and welcome to the Darkmoon Faire. There is so much to do here at the faire that it can be a little overwhelming for our first time visitors. That's why I'm here to help. Do you have any questions?"
G["Hello $gman:woman; how are you doing?"]="Hello $gman:woman; how are you doing?"
G["Hello $n! The Lorewalker is beginning her lesson just down these stairs if you want to listen in."]="Hello $n! The Lorewalker is beginning her lesson just down these stairs if you want to listen in."
