G["Hello Mr. Mudclaw. I don't know if you saw me earlier, but I'm helping Farmer Yoon out on his farm."]="Hello Mr. Mudclaw. I don't know if you saw me earlier, but I'm helping Farmer Yoon out on his farm."
G["Hello Mung-Mung. How's everything at Mr. Mudclaw's farm?"]="Hello Mung-Mung. How's everything at Mr. Mudclaw's farm?"
