G["Hello again, $c!"]="Onda novamente, $c!"
G["Hello again, $c."]="Onda novamente, $c."
G["Hello again, $n!  It's good to see you!  Our Darkmoon Faire is quite a show, don't you think?\n\nThere is quite a lot to see!  So look!  Look, and perhaps, one day, even more will be revealed to you..."]="Hello again, $n!  It's good to see you!  Our Darkmoon Faire is quite a show, don't you think?\n\nThere is quite a lot to see!  So look!  Look, and perhaps, one day, even more will be revealed to you..."
G["Hello again, $n.  Did you think I would forget you?\n\nI knew you would not.  You are a clever $c who knows a person with perfect memory when $ghe:she; sees him."]="Hello again, $n.  Did you think I would forget you?\n\nI knew you would not.  You are a clever $c who knows a person with perfect memory when $ghe:she; sees him."
G["Hello again, $n.  How is my axe treating you?"]="Onda novamente, $n. Como vai com meu machado?"
G["Hello again, $n.  How's my lure treating you?"]="Hello again, $n.  How's my lure treating you?"
G["Hello again, $p! Enjoying your second chance?\n\nIf you continue along the adventure here until the Skyfire leaves, you'll automatically re-join the normal timeline and find Lion's Landing established again.\n\nOr, if you'd rather go back, er... forward to Lion's Landing now, let me know!"]="Hello again, $p! Enjoying your second chance?\n\nIf you continue along the adventure here until the Skyfire leaves, you'll automatically re-join the normal timeline and find Lion's Landing established again.\n\nOr, if you'd rather go back, er... forward to Lion's Landing now, let me know!"
G["Hello again, Antonio. Thank you again for the hat for my wife. She adored it."]="Onda, Antonio, outra vez. Obrigado novamente pelo chapéu para meu esposa. Lhe encantó."
G["Hello again."]="Onda novamente."
G["Hello again. $n, was it? Yes yes... I believe we left behind some unfinished business back in the Eastern Kingdoms. How have you been finding Pandaria?\n\nI have another assignment for you, if you are up to the challenge this time. I assure you the rewards will be worth it.\n\nBefore we begin, it's important that you familiarize yourself with the lay of the land. Come visit me once you have earned more experience here."]="Hello again. $n, was it? Yes yes... I believe we left behind some unfinished business back in the Eastern Kingdoms. How have you been finding Pandaria?\n\nI have another assignment for you, if you are up to the challenge this time. I assure you the rewards will be worth it.\n\nBefore we begin, it's important that you familiarize yourself with the lay of the land. Come visit me once you have earned more experience here."
G["Hello again. More illusions approach, and we will require your healing arts."]="Hello again. More illusions approach, and we will require your healing arts."
G["Hello and welcome to the Darkmoon Faire Staging Area.\n\nThe portal here will take you to the Darkmoon Faire.\n\nBut if you have any questions before you go, I can answer them."]="Hello and welcome to the Darkmoon Faire Staging Area.\n\nThe portal here will take you to the Darkmoon Faire.\n\nBut if you have any questions before you go, I can answer them."
G["Hello fellow angler!  Have you been around these parts long?  Me and my buddy \"Big Hook\" here travel far and wide looking for the next big catch!\n\nWe ran into this place by accident and the locals were friendly with both their supplies and booze so we decided to stick around!"]="Hello fellow angler!  Have you been around these parts long?  Me and my buddy \"Big Hook\" here travel far and wide looking for the next big catch!\n\nWe ran into this place by accident and the locals were friendly with both their supplies and booze so we decided to stick around!"
G["Hello friend!  You're welcome to use my cart if you like.  It will take you to the Dai-Lo Farmstead."]="Onda, $gamigo: amiga;! Você pode usar meu carro se que. Te levará até a Fazenda de Dai-O."
G["Hello friend!  You're welcome to use my cart if you like.  It will take you to the Temple of Five Dawns."]="Onda, $gamigo: amiga;! Você pode usar meu carro se que. Te levará até o Templo dos Cinco Albores."
G["Hello friend! What can we do for you?"]="Olá amiga! O que podemos fazer por você?"
G["Hello friend."]="Olá amiga."
G["Hello once again, $n.  I sense that the flow of time remains threatened by forces that are quite powerful indeed.  Your continued assistance is always welcomed by the bronze dragonflight.\n\nWhile the past is set in its ways, the future is always changing.  The decisions you make in the here and now help guide that change."]="Hello once again, $n.  I sense that the flow of time remains threatened by forces that are quite powerful indeed.  Your continued assistance is always welcomed by the bronze dragonflight.\n\nWhile the past is set in its ways, the future is always changing.  The decisions you make in the here and now help guide that change."
G["Hello out there. Anybody be hearin' Hazlek?"]="Onda. Não há ninguém que oiga a Hazlek?"
G["Hello out there. Anybody be hearin' Tanzar?"]="Onda. Não há ninguém que oiga a Tanzar?"
G["Hello sir, I'm ready to rock!"]="Onda, senhor. Estou pronta para o rock!"
G["Hello sir. Do you live around here?"]="Onda, senhor. Vive por aqui?"
G["Hello stranger, and welcome to the untamed majesty of Un'Goro Crater!\n\nMy name is Williden Marshal.  My sister, our companions, and I make up Marshal Expeditions - scientists and explorers of Azeroth's wild and great unknown."]="Hello stranger, and welcome to the untamed majesty of Un'Goro Crater!\n\nMy name is Williden Marshal.  My sister, our companions, and I make up Marshal Expeditions - scientists and explorers of Azeroth's wild and great unknown."
G["Hello there $g mister : ma'am;... do you have a little time that you could help us out?  Please?"]="Hello there $g mister : ma'am;... do you have a little time that you could help us out?  Please?"
G["Hello there $glad:lass;... the name's Oglethorpe and I may be responsible for one of the amazing gnomish devices you might possess!  If it blew up, then it wasn't me; if it made you rich though, we can discuss royalties!\n\nOh, and if you're from Gnomeregan, you can just take two ninety degree angles, smash them together, and start marching.  I have nothing to say to you."]="Hello there $glad:lass;... the name's Oglethorpe and I may be responsible for one of the amazing gnomish devices you might possess!  If it blew up, then it wasn't me; if it made you rich though, we can discuss royalties!\n\nOh, and if you're from Gnomeregan, you can just take two ninety degree angles, smash them together, and start marching.  I have nothing to say to you."
G["Hello there!  Fizzcrank's pilots are the best of the best.  We stay that way through constant training.  That includes parachute training.  You never know when you will need to use your chute, but you do know that one day you'll have to use it.\n\nSo what we have here is a teleporter to the top of this spire.  Once you get up there, the only way for a real soldier to get back down is with a parachute.  We've got another trooper stationed up top ready with the parachutes.\n\nIf you feel like trying it out, $c, I'll clear you for teleporter use.  Then just step onto the teleporter."]="Hello there!  Fizzcrank's pilots are the best of the best.  We stay that way through constant training.  That includes parachute training.  You never know when you will need to use your chute, but you do know that one day you'll have to use it.\n\nSo what we have here is a teleporter to the top of this spire.  Once you get up there, the only way for a real soldier to get back down is with a parachute.  We've got another trooper stationed up top ready with the parachutes.\n\nIf you feel like trying it out, $c, I'll clear you for teleporter use.  Then just step onto the teleporter."
G["Hello there!  Oh my, a draenei!"]="Onda! Oh, vá, um draeneis!"
G["Hello there! Care to buy some fishing supplies, or perhaps take a lesson or two?"]="Olá! Gostaria de comprar algum suprimentos de pesca, ou talvez fazer uma lição ou duas?"
G["Hello there! Don't you dare step behind those pillars. Let me welcome you properly."]="Hello there! Don't you dare step behind those pillars. Let me welcome you properly."
G["Hello there! I'm Weng: pupil of nature!\n\nI've been sent to investigate the recent wood sprite problems.\n\nI've always been fascinated with wood sprites, even as a child. They're not normally violent, you know.\n\nPlayful, maybe, but rarely do they mean any real harm."]="Hello there! I'm Weng: pupil of nature!\n\nI've been sent to investigate the recent wood sprite problems.\n\nI've always been fascinated with wood sprites, even as a child. They're not normally violent, you know.\n\nPlayful, maybe, but rarely do they mean any real harm."
G["Hello there! My name's Jenna! And you?"]="Onda! Me chamo Jenna! E você?"
G["Hello there! Plants are my speciality. Do you have an inquiry about the local flora?"]="Olá! As plantas são minha especialidade. Você tem alguma pergunta sobre a flora local?"
G["Hello there! You're really growing on me."]="Olá! Você está mesmo crescendo em mim."
G["Hello there, $C. Normally I'd be out on the beat looking after the folk of Stormwind, but a lot of the Stormwind guards are fighting in other lands. So here I am, deputized and offering bounties when I'd rather be on patrol..."]="Hello there, $C. Normally I'd be out on the beat looking after the folk of Stormwind, but a lot of the Stormwind guards are fighting in other lands. So here I am, deputized and offering bounties when I'd rather be on patrol..."
G["Hello there, $c!"]="Onda, $c!"
G["Hello there, $c!\n\nWe cultivate and harvest the finest lotus flowers in all of Pandaria. From here they are sent down to the village of New Cifera where they are sorted and shipped all over the land.\n\nThe lotus has countless culinary, medicinal, and decorative applications - as you can imagine, demand is quite high."]="Hello there, $c!\n\nWe cultivate and harvest the finest lotus flowers in all of Pandaria. From here they are sent down to the village of New Cifera where they are sorted and shipped all over the land.\n\nThe lotus has countless culinary, medicinal, and decorative applications - as you can imagine, demand is quite high."
G["Hello there, $n.  Happy Pilgrim's Bounty!"]="Onda, $n. Feliz Generosidade do Peregrino!"
G["Hello there, $n.  I am known as Chronormu, but you may call me Chromie.  I am comfortable with such familiarity.\n\nNow - how did I know your name, you ask?  I am one of the bronze dragonflight, forever attuned to the ebb and flow of time.  You could say that we have met before.  To that end, we shall also meet again."]="Hello there, $n.  I am known as Chronormu, but you may call me Chromie.  I am comfortable with such familiarity.\n\nNow - how did I know your name, you ask?  I am one of the bronze dragonflight, forever attuned to the ebb and flow of time.  You could say that we have met before.  To that end, we shall also meet again."
G["Hello there, $n. So nice of you to rescue me. No hard feelings, right?"]="Hello there, $n. So nice of you to rescue me. No hard feelings, right?"
G["Hello there, my name is Petra.  To my right is my kodo, Dadanga.  We're with Marshal Expeditions - been so for a few years now, ever since Dadanga was a babe.\n\nIf you have any lit torches or any open sources of flame, I'd like to ask you to keep them stashed if you could.  Dadanga dislikes smoke."]="Hello there, my name is Petra.  To my right is my kodo, Dadanga.  We're with Marshal Expeditions - been so for a few years now, ever since Dadanga was a babe.\n\nIf you have any lit torches or any open sources of flame, I'd like to ask you to keep them stashed if you could.  Dadanga dislikes smoke."
G["Hello there, traveler. I'm hard at work making my next masterpiece!"]="Onda, viajante. Me estou deixando o pelego na criação de meu nova obra mestra!"
G["Hello to you new recruits. I'm Drill Sergeant Bahduum. For the next few days, you're going to receive orientation."]="Hello to you new recruits. I'm Drill Sergeant Bahduum. For the next few days, you're going to receive orientation."
G["Hello young $g Master:Mistress;. I am Eva Sarkhoff and this is my husband, Lucien. It is a pleasure to make your acquaintance."]="Hello young $g Master:Mistress;. I am Eva Sarkhoff and this is my husband, Lucien. It is a pleasure to make your acquaintance."
G["Hello!"]="olá"
G["Hello!  And welcome!  I'm afraid my booth is not open... many repairs are needed...\n\nBut I am still bound by blood oath to put a smile on your face.  So please, smile, or I must cut off my hand and consume no living flesh until it regenerates..."]="Hello!  And welcome!  I'm afraid my booth is not open... many repairs are needed...\n\nBut I am still bound by blood oath to put a smile on your face.  So please, smile, or I must cut off my hand and consume no living flesh until it regenerates..."
G["Hello!  So good to meet you!"]="Olá! Que bom te conhecer!"
G["Hello!  You're just the person I was looking for.  Take a seat and listen, because I have a plan that will make us both rich!"]="Olá! Você é apenas a pessoa que eu estava procurando. Sente-se e ouça, porque eu tenho um plano que nos fará ricos!"
G["Hello! And welcome!"]="Onda! $gBienvenido: Bem-vinda;!"
G["Hello! I am a Rogue in need of training."]="Olá! Eu sou um trapaceiro que precisa de treinamento."
G["Hello! I have your rations right here."]="Onda! Aqui tenho suas rações."
G["Hello! I'm here on behalf of Gina Mudclaw, regarding your debt."]="Hello! I'm here on behalf of Gina Mudclaw, regarding your debt."
G["Hello! Someone who doesn't smell like fish. I like."]="Olá! Alguém que não cheira a peixe. Eu gosto."
G["Hello! What brings you to Winterspring? These cold and vast lands may seem dismal, but this is a place of many secrets..."]="Olá! O que o traz ao Winterspring? Essas terras frias e vastas podem parecer sombrias, mas este é um lugar de muitos segredos..."
G["Hello! You're pretty strong and nice and stuff. I like you. Lets stay friends, okay?"]="Olá! Você é muito forte, legal e outras coisas. Eu gosto de você. Vamos ficar amigos, ok?"
G["Hello, $c!\n\nOrgrimmar's skyway is the center of the world. The north zeppelin tower will take you to Stranglethorn or Undercity. The south tower wll take you to Thunderbluff or all the way to Northrend.\n\nFlight Master Doras can send you all over Kalimdor - at least, anyplace you've already explored."]="Onda, $c!\n\nO espaço aéreo de Orgrimmar é o centro do mundo. O zepelim do norte te levará a Espinhaço ou a Cidade Baixa. A torre do sul te levará a Penhasco do Trovão ou até Nortúndria.\n\nO mestre de voo Doraso pode enviar a qualquer ponto de Kalimdor... Bom, ao menos a qualquer lugar que já tenha explorado."
G["Hello, $c!\n\nThese poor creatures are giving everything they have to fight the minions of the Twilight's Hammer in this dark place.\n\nI've done my best to revive those that have fallen.\n\nIf you need an additional mount, these birds are ready to take wing again. Treat them well!"]="Hello, $c!\n\nThese poor creatures are giving everything they have to fight the minions of the Twilight's Hammer in this dark place.\n\nI've done my best to revive those that have fallen.\n\nIf you need an additional mount, these birds are ready to take wing again. Treat them well!"
G["Hello, $c!  Are you reporting for a flight mission?"]="Onda, $c! Veio pela missão de voo?"
G["Hello, $c!  Welcome to the races at the Shimmering Flats!"]="Hello, $c!  Welcome to the races at the Shimmering Flats!"
G["Hello, $c! I've went around and asked, and it looks like all of us here have collected everything that the Alliance needs to prepare for the Ahn'Qiraj War. Now we just need to encourage the Horde to do the same and then we'll be able to ship it all over to Cenarion Hold in Silithus."]="Hello, $c! I've went around and asked, and it looks like all of us here have collected everything that the Alliance needs to prepare for the Ahn'Qiraj War. Now we just need to encourage the Horde to do the same and then we'll be able to ship it all over to Cenarion Hold in Silithus."
G["Hello, $c, good of you to show up. Allow me to be succinct; we are gathering supplies for the Ahn'Qiraj war effort. We wouldn't want to have more casualties than necessary, now would we? I have the responsibility of coordinating the collection of $2086w mageweave bandages. To date we have garnered $2085w. Care to assist?"]="Hello, $c, good of you to show up. Allow me to be succinct; we are gathering supplies for the Ahn'Qiraj war effort. We wouldn't want to have more casualties than necessary, now would we? I have the responsibility of coordinating the collection of $2086w mageweave bandages. To date we have garnered $2085w. Care to assist?"
G["Hello, $c.\n\nOld man Kessel over there, he's a clever one. I'd be real careful in my dealings with him if I were you.\n\nHe offered me work 'caring for the elekk' and being the fool I was, I took it to mean feeding, training, and the like. Things became real clear when he handed me the shovel..."]="Hello, $c.\n\nOld man Kessel over there, he's a clever one. I'd be real careful in my dealings with him if I were you.\n\nHe offered me work 'caring for the elekk' and being the fool I was, I took it to mean feeding, training, and the like. Things became real clear when he handed me the shovel..."
G["Hello, $c.  Care to purchase something?"]="Onda, $c. Que comprar algo?"
G["Hello, $c.  Have you come to learn the secrets of the Timeless Isle?"]="Onda, $c. Tem vindo a descobrir os segredos da Ilha Atemporal?"
G["Hello, $c.  I am what is referred to as one of the Broken.  Like the Lost Ones, though not as badly as they, we were afflicted with fel energies that transformed us from our original draenei forms."]="Hello, $c.  I am what is referred to as one of the Broken.  Like the Lost Ones, though not as badly as they, we were afflicted with fel energies that transformed us from our original draenei forms."
G["Hello, $c.  I hope you've come to bolster our ranks.  Beasts and thieves are spilling into our beloved Elwynn, and we barely have enough men to keep the roads safe!\n\nAnd if you haven't done so, read that notice about Hogger.  He's a beast in yonder woods that must be dealt with."]="Hello, $c.  I hope you've come to bolster our ranks.  Beasts and thieves are spilling into our beloved Elwynn, and we barely have enough men to keep the roads safe!\n\nAnd if you haven't done so, read that notice about Hogger.  He's a beast in yonder woods that must be dealt with."
G["Hello, $c. From what I've been told, everything's been collected, and all of the materiel for the war is being shipped over to Silithus as we speak. It should all be there in less than $2113w days. Once that's done, and the gong has been rung with the Scepter of the Shifting Sands, the war will really begin."]="Hello, $c. From what I've been told, everything's been collected, and all of the materiel for the war is being shipped over to Silithus as we speak. It should all be there in less than $2113w days. Once that's done, and the gong has been rung with the Scepter of the Shifting Sands, the war will really begin."
G["Hello, $c. From what I've been told, everything's been collected, and all of the materiel for the war is being shipped over to Silithus as we speak. It should all be there in less than a day. Once that's done, and the gong has been rung with the Scepter of the Shifting Sands, the war will really begin."]="Hello, $c. From what I've been told, everything's been collected, and all of the materiel for the war is being shipped over to Silithus as we speak. It should all be there in less than a day. Once that's done, and the gong has been rung with the Scepter of the Shifting Sands, the war will really begin."
G["Hello, $c. I am Jessir Moonbow. I have come from Darnassus seeking two friends who came looking for signs of the Shadow Council in Felwood.\n\nIt seems those vile creatures who claim responsibility for much of the orcish race's suffering seeks to regain some of its power.\n\nMy two friends went looking in Jaedenar to prove one way or the other what was happening.\n\nI expected them to be here when I arrived, but now they are days late."]="Hello, $c. I am Jessir Moonbow. I have come from Darnassus seeking two friends who came looking for signs of the Shadow Council in Felwood.\n\nIt seems those vile creatures who claim responsibility for much of the orcish race's suffering seeks to regain some of its power.\n\nMy two friends went looking in Jaedenar to prove one way or the other what was happening.\n\nI expected them to be here when I arrived, but now they are days late."
G["Hello, $c. I am collecting linen bandages here for the Ahn'Qiraj war effort; an effort that will put us all to the test, but strengthen us for the war to come. I can assure you that any bandages that you choose to donate will be put to good use in helping to save the lives of our soldiers when the time comes. I am in need of $2077w, and to this point have managed to collect $2076w. Will you assist us?"]="Hello, $c. I am collecting linen bandages here for the Ahn'Qiraj war effort; an effort that will put us all to the test, but strengthen us for the war to come. I can assure you that any bandages that you choose to donate will be put to good use in helping to save the lives of our soldiers when the time comes. I am in need of $2077w, and to this point have managed to collect $2076w. Will you assist us?"
G["Hello, $c. I imagine you have a lot of questions.\n\nSuffice it to say that Royce Duskwhisper sent me into the middle of an ogre cave for some \"Eye of Twilight\" jib-job, and it hasn't gone well.\n\nIf I ever get my hands on that lanky, heartless, mealy-mouthed little night elf...\n\n<Kristoff wriggles helplessly as he dangles in the air, his face reddening.>"]="Hello, $c. I imagine you have a lot of questions.\n\nSuffice it to say that Royce Duskwhisper sent me into the middle of an ogre cave for some \"Eye of Twilight\" jib-job, and it hasn't gone well.\n\nIf I ever get my hands on that lanky, heartless, mealy-mouthed little night elf...\n\n<Kristoff wriggles helplessly as he dangles in the air, his face reddening.>"
G["Hello, $c. I trust that you are enjoying youself? What do you think of the party? I do so hope that we aren't running out of anything. Nothing kills a fete faster than running out of drinks and hors d'oeuvres, wouldn't you say?\n\nYes, well, I must be about attending to my other guests. Do enjoy your stay."]="Hello, $c. I trust that you are enjoying youself? What do you think of the party? I do so hope that we aren't running out of anything. Nothing kills a fete faster than running out of drinks and hors d'oeuvres, wouldn't you say?\n\nYes, well, I must be about attending to my other guests. Do enjoy your stay."
G["Hello, $c. I trust that you bring good tidings concerning the Ahn'Qiraj War preparations. I myself have been placed in charge of all accumulation of rugged leather for the Horde; a task to which I feel uniquely qualified. Never underestimate the utility of a sharpened knife.\n\nAs to the rugged leather, we currently have $2073w out of $2074w needed."]="Hello, $c. I trust that you bring good tidings concerning the Ahn'Qiraj War preparations. I myself have been placed in charge of all accumulation of rugged leather for the Horde; a task to which I feel uniquely qualified. Never underestimate the utility of a sharpened knife.\n\nAs to the rugged leather, we currently have $2073w out of $2074w needed."
G["Hello, $c. I'm sure that I don't need to inform you of the gravity of our situation here. We need to gather many goods, and in most cases assemble them into materiel, to be transported to Cenarion Hold in Silithus. This is no small effort.\n\nRecently in the Molten Core we discovered something called a singed corestone. Our blacksmiths and engineers tell us that they can put them to good use, so I'm supervising their accumulation here. As of now, out of $2110w needed, we've managed to collect $2108w."]="Hello, $c. I'm sure that I don't need to inform you of the gravity of our situation here. We need to gather many goods, and in most cases assemble them into materiel, to be transported to Cenarion Hold in Silithus. This is no small effort.\n\nRecently in the Molten Core we discovered something called a singed corestone. Our blacksmiths and engineers tell us that they can put them to good use, so I'm supervising their accumulation here. As of now, out of $2110w needed, we've managed to collect $2108w."
G["Hello, $c. I've set up camp here at the Bulwark to make my preparations for my journey into the Plaguelands. I've heard rumor that a great human wizard took up residency in Hearthglen not terribly long ago. He was commissioned by the Scarlet Crusade to fashion their warriors and hunters new bows and guns. It's said that he completed a remarkable weapon before the Crusade killed him.\n\nI guess their mistrust of the arcane has grown."]="Hello, $c. I've set up camp here at the Bulwark to make my preparations for my journey into the Plaguelands. I've heard rumor that a great human wizard took up residency in Hearthglen not terribly long ago. He was commissioned by the Scarlet Crusade to fashion their warriors and hunters new bows and guns. It's said that he completed a remarkable weapon before the Crusade killed him.\n\nI guess their mistrust of the arcane has grown."
G["Hello, $c. If you haven't already, you really should speak with Farstrider Solanna."]="Onda, $c. Se ainda não o fez, deveria falar com o Errante Solanna."
G["Hello, $c. Please try not to draw too much attention."]="Onda, $c. Tenta não chamar a atenção."
G["Hello, $c. These are troubling times indeed if this is what is to become of our beloved Quel'Thalas."]="Hello, $c. These are troubling times indeed if this is what is to become of our beloved Quel'Thalas."
G["Hello, $g sir : ma'am;!  If you want, I have a nether ray waiting to take you to the Skyguard Outpost atop the Blade's Edge Mountains.\n\nJust let me know."]="Hello, $g sir : ma'am;!  If you want, I have a nether ray waiting to take you to the Skyguard Outpost atop the Blade's Edge Mountains.\n\nJust let me know."
G["Hello, $n!  How goes your adventures? My experiments are progressing nicely...\n\nBe sure to check back with me later!   I might have more test flight opportunities for you!"]="Hello, $n!  How goes your adventures? My experiments are progressing nicely...\n\nBe sure to check back with me later!   I might have more test flight opportunities for you!"
G["Hello, $n! How can I help you today?"]="Onda, $n! Como posso ajudar você hoje?"
G["Hello, $n! I am master engineer, Scooty."]="Onda, $n! Sou o mestre em engenharia, Scooty."
G["Hello, $n! If you don't see it in my shop, chances are good I can get it!"]="Hello, $n! If you don't see it in my shop, chances are good I can get it!"
G["Hello, $n! You're making quite a name for yourself here!"]="Onda, $n! Parece que te está fazendo $gfamoso: famosa; por aqui!"
G["Hello, $n, would you like to learn how to acquire and work with the various metals found around our land?"]="Hello, $n, would you like to learn how to acquire and work with the various metals found around our land?"
G["Hello, $n."]="Onda, $n."
G["Hello, $n.\n\nNow that I've finished creating my anvil I can begin outfitting our troops. It's an important step, but there's still much to be done.\n\nMore importantly for you, there are new things that I can create, which you may be interested in."]="Hello, $n.\n\nNow that I've finished creating my anvil I can begin outfitting our troops. It's an important step, but there's still much to be done.\n\nMore importantly for you, there are new things that I can create, which you may be interested in."
G["Hello, $n. \nKanrethad's power is too great to allow him to be free. I'll ensure he stays banished, for as long as I exist.\nStill, a taste of the fel energies he is saturated with should cause no ill. Feel free to drain some for your own use. Should you ever grow tired of its effects, I can purge the fel energy from you, for a price."]="Onda, $n.\n\nO poder de Kanrethad é demais grande como para deixar que continue livre. Ele seguirá desterrado enquanto eu continue com vida.\n\nAinda assim, testar a energia vil que transborda não deveria causar nenhum mal. Drena um pouco para os seus propósitos. Se te cansas dos seus efeitos, posso purgar a energia vil do seu organismo, por um módico preço."
G["Hello, $n.  My name is Oriana, and I attend the tournament to make sure no pets are grievously injured, and to explain the rules.\nYou cannot heal or revive your pets during the tournament.  If you run out of pets to use in battle, you can leave and enter the tournament again.\nIf you lose to a challenger, you may fight them again."]="Hello, $n.  My name is Oriana, and I attend the tournament to make sure no pets are grievously injured, and to explain the rules.\nYou cannot heal or revive your pets during the tournament.  If you run out of pets to use in battle, you can leave and enter the tournament again.\nIf you lose to a challenger, you may fight them again."
G["Hello, $n.  My services as an auctioneer are available to those with skill in engineering.  Sadly, you have none.  Please leave."]="Hello, $n.  My services as an auctioneer are available to those with skill in engineering.  Sadly, you have none.  Please leave."
G["Hello, $n.  Need to quickly get to Blackwind Landing, our base in the Skethyl Mountains?  I've got a pretty little nether ray ready.\n\nYou want to go now?  You just say the word, $g big guy : bunny;!"]="Hello, $n.  Need to quickly get to Blackwind Landing, our base in the Skethyl Mountains?  I've got a pretty little nether ray ready.\n\nYou want to go now?  You just say the word, $g big guy : bunny;!"
G["Hello, $n.  Welcome to Thelsamar, and while you're here don't forget to visit our local brewery!"]="Onda, $n. Dou a você a boas-vindas a Thelsamar e, enquanto estiver aqui, não esqueça visitar nossa cervejaria local."
G["Hello, $n. Are you helping with the invasion? A skilled $c such as yourself will be a valuable addition to our force."]="Onda, $n. Está dando uma mão contra a invasão? $gUn: Uma; $c como você deve ser de muita ajuda para nossas forças."
G["Hello, $n. Are you interested in outdoor survival? Sustenance off the flora and fauna of the lands!\n\nYou could learn a thing or two from me, that is, if you're interested."]="Onda, $n. Te interesse a sobrevivência no exterior? O sustento a partir da flora e fauna das terras.\n\nPoderia aprender um par de coisas de mim, bom, se te interesse."
G["Hello, $n. I heard the call to arms, so I've temporarily taken up my fighting form. You have learned all that I have to teach, so I leave you one last lesson. Fight bravely, young one, as an honored member of the Horde."]="Hello, $n. I heard the call to arms, so I've temporarily taken up my fighting form. You have learned all that I have to teach, so I leave you one last lesson. Fight bravely, young one, as an honored member of the Horde."
G["Hello, $n. I train and care for young hippogryphs here; feel free to have a look around."]="Hello, $n. I train and care for young hippogryphs here; feel free to have a look around."
G["Hello, $n. If you'd like to learn a thing or two about cooking, please visit me at any time."]="Onda, $n. Se te interesse aprender algum truco de cozinha, venha a me ver quando queira."
G["Hello, $n. If you're looking for cooking training, you've come to the right place. I usually get lots of new students when Pilgrim's Bounty rolls around."]="Onda, $n. Se atenção treinamento em cozinha, tem vindo ao lugar adequado. Normalmente recibo um monte de novos estudantes quando se aproxima a Generosidade do Peregrino."
G["Hello, $n. Should you require assistance in completing your mission, you have only to ask. My guardian, Raze, can assist you in defeating the shadowsilk poachers. Use this Staff of Command to command Raze in battle. He is trained to ONLY attack shadowsilk poachers."]="Hello, $n. Should you require assistance in completing your mission, you have only to ask. My guardian, Raze, can assist you in defeating the shadowsilk poachers. Use this Staff of Command to command Raze in battle. He is trained to ONLY attack shadowsilk poachers."
G["Hello, $r! What musical selection would you like to hear today?"]="Onda, $r! Que seleção musical querrías escutar hoje?"
G["Hello, $r."]="Onda, $r."
G["Hello, $r.\n\nLet's get busy! No sense waiting around for supplies that may never arrive.\n\nI need my anvil in order to outfit our troops properly. Right now It's $3228w percent complete.\n\nAnd when the anvil is completed, there will be many more powerful items that I will be able to smith for you."]="Hello, $r.\n\nLet's get busy! No sense waiting around for supplies that may never arrive.\n\nI need my anvil in order to outfit our troops properly. Right now It's $3228w percent complete.\n\nAnd when the anvil is completed, there will be many more powerful items that I will be able to smith for you."
G["Hello, $r.  I'm sorry that you had to see our sacred land for the first time in such a state."]="Onda, $r. Sinto que pela primeira vez que veas nossa terra sagrado seja neste estado."
G["Hello, $r.  You are welcome to share this canyon with us as refuge from the dragons.  Beware the goblin runt though... his kind cannot be trusted."]="Hello, $r.  You are welcome to share this canyon with us as refuge from the dragons.  Beware the goblin runt though... his kind cannot be trusted."
G["Hello, $r. How can I help you today?"]="Onda, $r. Em O que posso ajudar você hoje?"
G["Hello, Antonio. It's good to see you safely made it here again. Let me know if you need anything."]="Onda, Antonio. fico feliz em que tenha voltado saudável e salvou. Diga se você precisa algo."
G["Hello, Charys. I have my list, could you get me all of that, especially the last ingredient."]="Hello, Charys. I have my list, could you get me all of that, especially the last ingredient."
G["Hello, Eitrigg. I bring news from Blackrock Spire."]="Olá, Eitrigg. Trago notícia da Blackrock Spire."
G["Hello, Frankal. I've heard that you might have some information as to the whereabouts of Mistress Natalia Mar'alith."]="Olá Frankal. Ouvi dizer que você pode ter alguma informação sobre o paradeiro da senhora Natalia Mar'alith."
G["Hello, Greatmother. Garrosh told me that you wanted to speak with me."]="Olá, Grande-mãe. Garrosh disse para mim que você queria falar comigo."
G["Hello, Ohgan'aka."]="Onda, Ohgan'aka."
G["Hello, Pahu."]="Onda, Pahu."
G["Hello, Parkat. I wish to purchase something."]="Olá, Parkat. Desejo comprar algo."
G["Hello, Quinn.  How are you faring?"]="Onda, Quinn. Que tal vai?"
G["Hello, Rayne. What brings the Cenarion Circle to the Plaguelands?"]="Olá Rayne. O que leva o Círculo Cenariano às Terras Pestilentas?"
G["Hello, Rutgar. The Commander has sent me here to gather some information about his missing wife."]="Olá, Rutgar. O comandante me enviou aqui para reunir algumas informações sobre sua esposa desaparecida."
G["Hello, Selarin. I'm afraid I cannot help you at the moment, but perhaps some of the adventurers here in Auberdine can..."]="Onda, Selarin. Me temo que não posso ajudar você por agora, mas talvez si possa fazer isso algum dos aventureiros que estão aqui em Auberdine."
G["Hello, and welcome!\n\nUp for a challenge?"]="Onda! Dou a você a boas-vindas!\n\nTe apetece um desafio?"
G["Hello, are you here to learn about the conflict in Bloodmyst?"]="Olá, você está aqui para aprender sobre o conflito no Bloodmyst?"
G["Hello, brother."]="Onda, irmão."
G["Hello, cart. Still upside-downed, I see."]="Ay, meu carro. Está feito um desastre."
G["Hello, citizen. You look like a $G man:woman; with a purpose - do you have business with the Stormwind Army?"]="Onda, cidadão. Te vê como um $G homem: mulher; com uma missão - tem negócios com o Exército de Ventobravo?"
G["Hello, dear. I am Geyah, matron of the Mag'har.\n\n<Greatmother Geyah coughs.>\n\nIf you are here, it would be safe to assume that the portal has opened. Most of the orcs here were too young or too sick to remember the Dark Portal.\n\n<Greatmother Geyah points to the orcs around her.>\n\nMany of them were orphans or would soon become orphans. Aye, Blackhand would have it no other way. Keep the sick from the healthy. Only the strong would survive... Or so they say."]="Hello, dear. I am Geyah, matron of the Mag'har.\n\n<Greatmother Geyah coughs.>\n\nIf you are here, it would be safe to assume that the portal has opened. Most of the orcs here were too young or too sick to remember the Dark Portal.\n\n<Greatmother Geyah points to the orcs around her.>\n\nMany of them were orphans or would soon become orphans. Aye, Blackhand would have it no other way. Keep the sick from the healthy. Only the strong would survive... Or so they say."
G["Hello, dryskin."]="Olá, pele seca."
G["Hello, friend! Can I interest you in the deal of a lifetime?"]="Onda! Te interesse fazer o negócios do siglo?"
G["Hello, friend! I'd love to give you a demolisher, but I'm out of parts at the moment."]="Hello, friend! I'd love to give you a demolisher, but I'm out of parts at the moment."
G["Hello, friend! I've setup shop in this here factory. I'd be happy to set you up in a shiny new vehicle - I'll even send the bill to your leaders after the assault. Best deal anywhere!"]="Hello, friend! I've setup shop in this here factory. I'd be happy to set you up in a shiny new vehicle - I'll even send the bill to your leaders after the assault. Best deal anywhere!"
G["Hello, friend! Welcome to the Brewfest Grounds!"]="Onda, colega! Dou a você a boas-vindas à zona da Festa da Cerveja!"
G["Hello, friend. Are you getting on all right at your farm?"]="Onda, $gamigo: amiga;. Te as está arreglando bem no seu fazenda?"
G["Hello, friend. Care to purchase anything while you're here?"]="Onda. Você gostaria comprar algo enquanto estiver aqui?"
G["Hello, friend. How may I be of service to you today?"]="Olá amiga. Como posso ajudá-o hoje?"
G["Hello, friend. Hungry?"]="Onda, $gamigo: amiga;. Tem fome?"
G["Hello, good $G sir:lady;. Have a seat, and a meal if you're hungry. Don't fret if I look busy with my needlework - I'm listening to you..."]="Hello, good $G sir:lady;. Have a seat, and a meal if you're hungry. Don't fret if I look busy with my needlework - I'm listening to you..."
G["Hello, good friend. Oh, is it okay if I call you my good friend?"]="Onda, $gbuen amigo: boa amiga;. Te importa se te chamo meu $gbuen amigo: boa amiga;?"
G["Hello, hello!"]="Olá Olá!"
G["Hello, hello, Amy. It's good to be back in Lakeshire and to see you, milady."]="Onda, onda, Amy. É bom voltar a Vila do Lago e ver você, meu senhora."
G["Hello, how are you feeling today, $c? Well, I hope. You may be wondering what is going on here. There's a war at Ahn'Qiraj that is being planned and prepared for. We and the Horde are preparing as best we can for it.\n\nTo that end, the Alliance has asked me to supervise the collection of silk bandages here. To date we've managed to put together $2082w out of $2083w needed. Are you thinking about helping out?"]="Onda, como te sente hoje, $c? Espero que bem. Te deve estar perguntando que está passando aqui. Se você está planejada e preparando uma guerra em Ahn'Qiraj. Nós e a Horda nos estamos preparando o melhor O que podemos.\n\nPara elho, a Aliança me pediu que supervise a pegue de seda de seda neste lugar. Até a agora, temos conseguido reunir $2082w das $2083w que são necessárias. Está pensando em dar uma mão?"
G["Hello, little $r."]="Onda, $gpequeno: pequena; $r."
G["Hello, little one.  What news do you bring?"]="Onda, pequena. Que notícia traz?"
G["Hello, little one. Come to play?"]="Onda, peque. Tem vindo a jogar?"
G["Hello, ma'am.  Heard any interesting rumors lately?"]="Hello, ma'am.  Heard any interesting rumors lately?"
G["Hello, my child."]="Olá meu filho."
G["Hello, my dear. Have you been out in the fields?"]="Onda, querida. Tem estado nos campos?"
G["Hello, my friends. It is good to see you again. Still keeping our borders free I see. Antonio appreciates your hard work."]="Hello, my friends. It is good to see you again. Still keeping our borders free I see. Antonio appreciates your hard work."
G["Hello, my name's Lilian. You don't mind if I take those blades, do you?"]="Onda, me chamo Lilian. Não te importa se me quedo com estas espadas, verdade?"
G["Hello, old friend!"]="Onda, velho amigo!"
G["Hello, overseer.  Ready for the attack?"]="Olá, superintendente. Pronto para o ataque?"
G["Hello, peach - good to have your company!"]="Olá, pêssego - é bom ter sua empresa!"
G["Hello, rival.\n\nI've been busy training.\n\nI hope you've done the same."]="Onda, rival.\n\ntenho estado treinando muito.\n\nEspero que você tenha estado fazendo o mesmo."
G["Hello, sister. What have we here?"]="Onda, irmã. Que temos aqui?"
G["Hello, sucker!"]="Olá otário!"
G["Hello, traveler!\n\nAre you coming to the Wanderer's Festival tonight? Pandaren will gather right here on Turtle Beach shortly after sunset! It's quite the sight.\n\nSpeak to me as the event draws near and I will let you know how long you have to wait."]="Hello, traveler!\n\nAre you coming to the Wanderer's Festival tonight? Pandaren will gather right here on Turtle Beach shortly after sunset! It's quite the sight.\n\nSpeak to me as the event draws near and I will let you know how long you have to wait."
G["Hello, traveler!\n\nAre you coming to the Wanderer's Festival tonight? Pandaren will gather right here on Turtle Beach shortly after sunset! It's quite the sight.\n\nThe festival will begin under three hours from now. Check back at the top of the hour!"]="Hello, traveler!\n\nAre you coming to the Wanderer's Festival tonight? Pandaren will gather right here on Turtle Beach shortly after sunset! It's quite the sight.\n\nThe festival will begin under three hours from now. Check back at the top of the hour!"
G["Hello, traveler!\n\nAre you coming to the Wanderer's Festival tonight? Pandaren will gather right here on Turtle Beach shortly after sunset! It's quite the sight.\n\nThe festival will begin under two hours from now. Check back at the top of the hour!"]="Hello, traveler!\n\nAre you coming to the Wanderer's Festival tonight? Pandaren will gather right here on Turtle Beach shortly after sunset! It's quite the sight.\n\nThe festival will begin under two hours from now. Check back at the top of the hour!"
G["Hello, traveler!\n\nAre you coming to the Wanderer's Festival tonight? Pandaren will gather right here on Turtle Beach shortly after sunset! It's quite the sight.\n\nWithin the next hour, the festival will begin. Check back at the top of the hour!"]="Hello, traveler!\n\nAre you coming to the Wanderer's Festival tonight? Pandaren will gather right here on Turtle Beach shortly after sunset! It's quite the sight.\n\nWithin the next hour, the festival will begin. Check back at the top of the hour!"
G["Hello, traveler. Not many find me out this way.\n\nMy name is Rivern, and I train the Winterspring Frostsabers to become mounts.\n\nThese cats are the most feral and difficult to subdue of all the sabers. Only the most trusted and exalted may attempt to ride one.\n\nI will not sell such a mount to just anyone; no, you must work for it and earn your acceptance not only with me, but with the sabers themselves."]="Hello, traveler. Not many find me out this way.\n\nMy name is Rivern, and I train the Winterspring Frostsabers to become mounts.\n\nThese cats are the most feral and difficult to subdue of all the sabers. Only the most trusted and exalted may attempt to ride one.\n\nI will not sell such a mount to just anyone; no, you must work for it and earn your acceptance not only with me, but with the sabers themselves."
G["Hello, what business brings you here?\n\nThis is an orphanage for the children of Outland who have lost their parents and have no one else to look after them.\n\nPerhaps you are here because you are considering adoption?"]="Onda. Que te traz aqui?\n\nIsto é um orfanato para os crianças de TerrAlém que perderam aos seus padres e não têm a ninguém que cuide de eles.\n\nAcaso que que te adopten?"
G["Hello, young $c. Are you here to bring me a batch of peacebloom? We are collecting them to make potions and elixirs for the Ahn'Qiraj war effort. Though tragic that we are forced into this war, the results will be even more terrible if we do not prepare properly.\n\nThe Horde has tasked me with the collection of $2020w peacebloom, and so far we've managed to put together $2021w. If you have it within your ability, please gather up all that you can and return them to me here."]="Hello, young $c. Are you here to bring me a batch of peacebloom? We are collecting them to make potions and elixirs for the Ahn'Qiraj war effort. Though tragic that we are forced into this war, the results will be even more terrible if we do not prepare properly.\n\nThe Horde has tasked me with the collection of $2020w peacebloom, and so far we've managed to put together $2021w. If you have it within your ability, please gather up all that you can and return them to me here."
G["Hello, young $r."]="Onda, jovem $r."
G["Hello."]="olá"
G["Hello.\n\nMy name is Shai.\n\nThey tell me to watch the cliff.\n\nSometimes cubs come because of a dare. Sometimes grown ups come because they are curious.\n\nI tell you what I tell them. The cliffs are sad, and the jungle is even more sad.\n\nYou may descend using the rope, but know it is a very sad place."]="Hello.\n\nMy name is Shai.\n\nThey tell me to watch the cliff.\n\nSometimes cubs come because of a dare. Sometimes grown ups come because they are curious.\n\nI tell you what I tell them. The cliffs are sad, and the jungle is even more sad.\n\nYou may descend using the rope, but know it is a very sad place."
G["Hello.  I trust that this day finds you well?"]="Olá. Eu confio que este dia te encontra bem?"
G["Hello.  What brings you to Chillwind Camp today?"]="Olá. O que o traz ao acampamento Chillwind hoje?"
G["Hello. By odd twist of fortune, we have obtained the remains of Kel'Thuzad's feared abomination Patchwerk.  Our researchers are able to reassemble them in various ways to test the mettle of your band of would-be heroes, should you so desire.  \nWe can construct a sturdy Patchwerk against which to measure your ability to do damage, a brutal Patchwerk who will deliver rapid and mighty blows to any who would dare stand before him, or a well-rounded Patchwerk who will test your entire fighting force.\nWhich would you prefer?"]="Hello. By odd twist of fortune, we have obtained the remains of Kel'Thuzad's feared abomination Patchwerk.  Our researchers are able to reassemble them in various ways to test the mettle of your band of would-be heroes, should you so desire.  \nWe can construct a sturdy Patchwerk against which to measure your ability to do damage, a brutal Patchwerk who will deliver rapid and mighty blows to any who would dare stand before him, or a well-rounded Patchwerk who will test your entire fighting force.\nWhich would you prefer?"
G["Hello. For this trial, you must keep us alive while we face the incoming illusions. I am Oto, and will protect you."]="Hello. For this trial, you must keep us alive while we face the incoming illusions. I am Oto, and will protect you."
G["Hello. I am Groundskeeper Ponch. Have we met before? My memory is not too good."]="Onda, sou o guardés Ponch. Nos temos visto antes? Não tenho muito boa memória."
G["Hello. Master Fras Siabi is not in at this time. Please come back tomorrow to Fras Siabi's Premium Tobacco! Beep!"]="Onda. O mestre Fras Siabi não se encontre aqui neste momentos. Por favor, volta manhã a Tabaco de qualidade de Fras Siabi! Piii!"
G["Hello. Master Fras Siabi is not in at this time. Please come back tomorrow to Siabi's Premium Tobacco! Beep!"]="Onda. O mestre Fras Siabi não se encontre aqui neste momentos. Por favor, volta manhã a Tabaco de qualidade de Fras Siabi! Piii!"
G["Hello. Nice to meet you."]="Hello. Nice to meet you."
G["Hello. Squire Walter and I are responsible for taking care of Old Blanchy here, along with the rest of the mounts."]="Olá. O escudeiro Walter e eu somos responsáveis ​​por cuidar de Old Blanchy aqui, ao lado com o resto das montarias."
G["Hello. Would you like to fight the Anub'arak encounter for the Argent Colosseum raid? \nYou will face the version of this encounter that corresponds to the current raid difficulty you have selected. This encounter is a work in progress. Please be sure to report any bugs you experience on the Blizzard forums.\nAre you ready to begin the encounter?"]="Onda. Você gostaria participar no encontro contra Anub'arak para a Raide do Coliseu Argêntea?\n\nTe enfrentarás a este encontro na versão que corresponda com a dificuldade de Raide atual que tenha selecionado. Ainda se você está trabalhando neste encontro. Acuérdate de informar dos erros que encontre no foro de Blizzard.\n\nEstá $gpreparado: preparada; para começar o encontro?"
