G["Help us destroy the Forsaken and retake Lordaeron for the Alliance!"]="Ayúdanos a acabar com os Renegados e retomar Lordaeron para a Aliança!"
G["Help us drive the yaungol back, $r!"]="Help us drive the yaungol back, $r!"
G["Help us fend off these Alliance dogs!"]="É preciso parar a estes cães da Aliança!"
G["Help us fend off these Horde pigs!"]="Help us fend off these Horde pigs!"
G["Help us rout them from your land, and your kind can stand tall and proud with the Horde!"]="Help us rout them from your land, and your kind can stand tall and proud with the Horde!"
G["Help us subdue him."]="Ajude-nos a subjugá-o."
G["Help us!"]="Socorro!"
G["Help us! Please!"]="Ayúdanos! Por favor!"
G["Help us, outsider. <The relic crumbles to dust. A vision of eight Dark Iron dwarves performing some sort of ritual fills your head.>"]="Help us, outsider. <The relic crumbles to dust. A vision of eight Dark Iron dwarves performing some sort of ritual fills your head.>"
G["Help you with what situation?"]="Ajudá-o com que situação?"
G["Help yourself to a drink friend.  Just make sure to stay away from the ledge while you drink."]="Help yourself to a drink friend.  Just make sure to stay away from the ledge while you drink."
G["Help yourselves. It be suicide for a scout to walk around wit' so much weighing me down."]="Help yourselves. It be suicide for a scout to walk around wit' so much weighing me down."
G["Help!"]="Socorro!"
G["Help!\n\nIf you get me out of here, I can blow up the door that leads to the chief of Zul'Farrak!"]="Help!\n\nIf you get me out of here, I can blow up the door that leads to the chief of Zul'Farrak!"
G["Help!  A mana wraith!  It's come to avenge its brethren and steal back their essences!"]="Help!  A mana wraith!  It's come to avenge its brethren and steal back their essences!"
G["Help!  My band and I have been captured by trolls, and they're going to sacrifice us!\n\nGet us out of here and I'll give you anything you want."]="Socorro! Meus homens e eu temos banido capturados por trolls e nos vão a sacrificar!\n\nSácanos de aqui e te darei o que queira."
G["Help!  My eyes!"]="Ajuda! Meus olhos!"
G["Help!  Please, you must help me!"]="Socorro! Por favor, ajude-me!"
G["Help!  The beast is on me!"]="Socorro! Tenho à fera acima!"
G["Help!  Up here!"]="Ajuda! Aqui!"
G["Help! $n attacking!"]="Socorro! $n me está atacando!"
G["Help! Get these things off of me!"]="Socorro! Tira essas coisas de cima de mim!"
G["Help! Get this $n off of me!"]="Help! Get this $n off of me!"
G["Help! Grummle in trouble."]="Ajuda! Grúmel em problemas."
G["Help! Guards! It's going to step on me!"]="Socorro! Guardas! Me vai pisar!"
G["Help! Help!"]="Socorro! Socorro!"
G["Help! Help! The Horde is here!"]="Socorro! Socorro! A Horda está aqui!"
G["Help! Help! They're going to eat me!"]="Help! Help! They're going to eat me!"
G["Help! I am being attacked!"]="Socorro! Me atacando!"
G["Help! I am trapped within this tree!  I require aid!"]="Ajuda! Estou presa dentro do árvore! Ajudem-me!"
G["Help! I can't swim!"]="Socorro! Não sei nadar!"
G["Help! I lost my egg!"]="Ajuda! E perdido meu ovo!"
G["Help! I think this creature might be too tough for me to handle alone."]="Socorro! Acho que esta criatura talvez seja demais duro para que me encargue de ele eu sozinha."
G["Help! I'm being chased by a swarm of bees!"]="Help! I'm being chased by a swarm of bees!"
G["Help! I'm too weak to make it on my own."]="Socorro! Estou demais fraco para sair por mim mesmo."
G["Help! I'm trapped in here!"]="Ajuda! Estou preso!"
G["Help! I'm under attack!"]="Socorro! Me estão atacando!"
G["Help! I've only one hand to defend myself with."]="Help! I've only one hand to defend myself with."
G["Help! It's on my face!"]="Socorro! O tenho na rosto!"
G["Help! Let me go!"]="Socorro! Suéltame!"
G["Help! Someone help us!"]="Ajuda! Que alguém nos ajude!"
G["Help! Sprites swarm!"]="Ajuda! Enxame de duendes!"
G["Help! These yaungol are trying to steal my yaks!"]="Help! These yaungol are trying to steal my yaks!"
G["Help! They took my luckydo!"]="Ajuda! Me têm roubado meu grisgrís!"
G["Help! Wait! It's like this thing has a mind of its own!"]="Socorro! Aguarda! É como se esta coisa tivesse mente própria!"
G["Help! We're being attacked! Dark Irons!"]="Socorro! Nos atacando! Anões da tribo Ferro Negro!"
G["Help!! I told you this place was cursed!"]="Socorro!!! Te disse que este lugar estava maldito!"
G["Help!!! Get these things off me so I can get my work done!"]="Help!!! Get these things off me so I can get my work done!"
G["Help, $p! I'm under attack!"]="Socorro, $p! Me atacando!"
G["Help. Help!"]="Ajuda. Ajuda!"
G["Help... please, if you can hear me, help..."]="Help... please, if you can hear me, help..."
G["Help? You saved me from eternity trapped in jade! I'm gonna throw you the biggest party ever made!"]="Ajuda? Você me salva de uma eternidade preso em jade! Eu vai montar a maior festa da história!"
G["Helpless... powerless... restore... must restore... Zevrim controls... end this torment..."]="Desamparado... impotente... restaurar... deve restaurar... controles Zevrim... acabar com este tormento..."
G["Hemet Nesingwary, what are you doing here in the Outland?"]="Hemet Nesingwary, o que você está fazendo aqui no Outland?"
G["Hemet is the greatest hunter that I know.  We chanced upon each other in the hills of Winterspring back on Azeroth many moons ago.  He and I were stalking the same quarry: the great cat known as Rak'shiri.\n\nRather than fight each other over our prey, we made a wager out of it; whoever collected the frostsaber's skin would get to demand something of the other.  To my eternal shame, this is how I earned the nickname, Fitz.\n\nDo I look like a Fitz?"]="Hemet is the greatest hunter that I know.  We chanced upon each other in the hills of Winterspring back on Azeroth many moons ago.  He and I were stalking the same quarry: the great cat known as Rak'shiri.\n\nRather than fight each other over our prey, we made a wager out of it; whoever collected the frostsaber's skin would get to demand something of the other.  To my eternal shame, this is how I earned the nickname, Fitz.\n\nDo I look like a Fitz?"
G["Hemet?  Fitz?"]="Hemet? Fitz?"
G["Henchmen?  Tribute?"]="Capangas? Tributo?"
G["Hendel is in our custody now, $n, thanks to you.\n\nAlthough the questioning goes slowly, I assure you, he will tell us everything he knows.\n\nFor now, please be patient. I will contact you immediately if we have need of your assistance.\n\nUntil then, please, enjoy Theramore and I invite you to stay for as long as you like within our city's walls as a friend of the Alliance."]="Hendel is in our custody now, $n, thanks to you.\n\nAlthough the questioning goes slowly, I assure you, he will tell us everything he knows.\n\nFor now, please be patient. I will contact you immediately if we have need of your assistance.\n\nUntil then, please, enjoy Theramore and I invite you to stay for as long as you like within our city's walls as a friend of the Alliance."
G["Her Majesty sends Dark Rangers!  Stand aside, boys!"]="Her Majesty sends Dark Rangers!  Stand aside, boys!"
G["Her Majesty's brood will sweep over this valley!"]="O linagem do seu Majestade arrasará este vale!"
G["Her bag of gold should be in the mail!  It's insulting she sends someone to collect from me while I'm working."]="Her bag of gold should be in the mail!  It's insulting she sends someone to collect from me while I'm working."
G["Her body appears even larger from the inside.  Fascinating!"]="Seu corpo parece muito maior desdo interior. Fascinante!"
G["Her fate is regrettably unavoidable."]="Her fate is regrettably unavoidable."
G["Her gifts are many, our gratitude immeasurable."]="Seus dádivas são abundantes; nossa gratidão, infinita."
G["Her happiness is our reward, her sorrow our failure."]="Her happiness is our reward, her sorrow our failure."
G["Her locomotives won't locomote, but her weapons are fresh off the assembly line."]="Her locomotives won't locomote, but her weapons are fresh off the assembly line."
G["Her methods are cowardly.  She reminds me of the Forsaken apothecaries."]="Her methods are cowardly.  She reminds me of the Forsaken apothecaries."
G["Her name is \"Nalice.\" And until recently she stood at Wyrmrest Temple as the representative of the black dragonflight. Now? She's on the run."]="Her name is \"Nalice.\" And until recently she stood at Wyrmrest Temple as the representative of the black dragonflight. Now? She's on the run."
G["Her name!!"]="Seu nome!"
G["Her reflection ripples a second time."]="Her reflection ripples a second time."
G["Her reinforcements will arrive shortly, we must bring her down quickly!"]="Pronto chegarão seus reforços. Devemos acabar com ela rápido!"
G["Her strength is truly outrageous!"]="Sua força é atroz."
G["Her will is greater than us all. You will join us or you will perish."]="Seu vontade é mais grande que nós. Junte-se a nós ou morre."
G["Her... excellency... awaits."]="Seu... Excelência... espera."
G["Heraazi exports are on the rise, sir.  We've already bribed the appropriate taxation officers and contraband will begin to arrive within days."]="Heraazi exports are on the rise, sir.  We've already bribed the appropriate taxation officers and contraband will begin to arrive within days."
G["Herbalism"]="Herbalism (Herborismo)"
G["Herbalism allows you to locate and gather herbs from the wild. These can be sold at the auction house or used to support the Alchemy or Inscription professions.\nSkilled herbalists can also use their knowledge of the earth to heal themselves."]="A herborismo te permite encontrar e coletar ervas selvagens. Se podem vender na casa de subastas ou aproveitar para fornecer as profissões de alquimia ou inscrição.\n\nOs herboristas qualificados também podem usar seu conhecimento da terra para se curar."
G["Herbalism requires a gentle touch that few such as Malorne can teach.  Seek him out east of the Inn in Dolanaar."]="Herbalismo requer um toque gentil que poucos como Malorne podem ensinar. Procure-o a leste da estalagem em Dolanaar."
G["Herbs"]="Herbs"
G["Herbs are so pricey! I could always use a little something extra, if you know what I mean. Help a goblin out?"]="As ervas são tão valiosas! Nunca tenho bastante... já sabe a que me refiero. Ajudará a um goblin?"
G["Herbs, herbs, hmmm, let me see here. Ah yes, here it is. To date we have accumulated $2047w out of $2048w stranglekelp, $2053w out of $2055w purple lotuses, and $2057w out of $2058w arthas' tears needed."]="Ervas, ervas, hummm, deixe-me ver aqui. Ah sim, aqui está. Até o momentos, acumulamos $2047w de $2048w de stranglekelp, $2053w de $2055w de lótus roxos e $2057w de $2058w de lágrimas de arthas necessárias."
G["Herbs... you need to speak to Jandi at her arboretum in The Drag.  There are some wooden steps behind Asoran's Market in the Valley of Wisdom.  Follow them to the upper level of The Drag and you'll find her."]="Ervas... você precisa falar com Jandi no seu arboreto em The Drag. Há algum degraus de madeira atrás do Mercado de Asoran, no Vale da Sabedoria. Continue-os até o nível superior de The Drag e você a encontrará."
G["Here I am, $g sir:madam; $n!"]="Aqui estou, $gsenhor: senhora; $n!"
G["Here I am, alliance!  Take me down... if you can!"]="Here I am, alliance!  Take me down... if you can!"
G["Here I am, digging up some useless bauble from the ground at the will of someone I just recently met... does that seem right to you?"]="Aqui estou, desenterrando algum inútiles adornos para cumprir a vontade de alguém a quem acabo de conhecer... você acha que isso está bem?"
G["Here I am, in a rough-hewn stone tower squatting on marshy, muddy ground while clouds of midges fly unchecked through the open doorways, standing amongst hunched, greenskin figures of dubious hygiene and coarse manners. I've never been happier."]="Here I am, in a rough-hewn stone tower squatting on marshy, muddy ground while clouds of midges fly unchecked through the open doorways, standing amongst hunched, greenskin figures of dubious hygiene and coarse manners. I've never been happier."
G["Here I am, standing next to my mortal enemy, yet I haven't killed it... does that seem right to you?"]="Aqui estou, de pé ao lado a meu inimigo mortal e ainda não o e matou... você acha que isso está bem?"
G["Here I come!"]="Aí vou eu!"
G["Here I come!  Don't you dare hide behind those trees!"]="Já venho! Não te atrevas a esconder por trás desses árvores!"
G["Here I go!"]="Além vou!"
G["Here I go! Keep an eye out...."]="Além vou! Mantenha-se alerta..."
G["Here I goooooooooo!"]="Além vooooooooooooyyyyyyyyy!"
G["Here I have amassed what may well be the greatest depository of lore in all of Outland. Even the grand libraries of Silvermoon City pale in comparison.\n\nPlease... look, read, browse to your heart's content. You'll find everything organized and clearly labeled."]="Here I have amassed what may well be the greatest depository of lore in all of Outland. Even the grand libraries of Silvermoon City pale in comparison.\n\nPlease... look, read, browse to your heart's content. You'll find everything organized and clearly labeled."
G["Here among the craftsmen of Darnassus, there is a millenium of knowledge for the benefit of your chosen craft.  Now tell me, which craft do you find the most intriguing?"]="Aqui, entre os artesãos de Darnassus, há um milênio de conhecimento para o benefício do seu ofício escolhido. Agora me diga, qual embarcação você acha mais intrigante?"
G["Here are more of the incendiary devices, $n. Be careful with these, they can cause a great deal of disruption to time if used improperly."]="Here are more of the incendiary devices, $n. Be careful with these, they can cause a great deal of disruption to time if used improperly."
G["Here are my skins, Harold.  Now give me the reward!"]="Aqui estão meus peles, Harold. Agora dê-me a recompensa!"
G["Here are some spare parts. I'll cover you while you make repairs!"]="Here are some spare parts. I'll cover you while you make repairs!"
G["Here are the explosives, Elsia."]="Aqui estão os explosivos, Elsia."
G["Here are the explosives, Vereesa."]="Aqui estão os explosivos, Vereesa."
G["Here are the final standings!\n\nThrall: $2200w\n\nCairne: $2201w\n\nSylvanas: $2202w\n\nTotal Horde: $2207w\n\n\nBolvar: $2203w\n\nMagni: $2204w\n\nTyrande: $2205w\n\nTotal Alliance: $2206w\n\nThe Horde and the Alliance tied in total votes!"]="Esta é a clasificação fim!\n\nThrall: $2200w\n\nCaerne: $2201w\n\nSylvanas: $2202w\n\nTotal da Horda: $2207w\n\nBolvar: $2203w\n\nMagni: $2204w\n\nTyrande: $2205w\n\nTotal da Aliança: $2206w\n\nA Horda e a Aliança têm obtido o mesmo número de votos!"
G["Here are the final standings!\n\nThrall: $2200w\nCairne: $2201w\nSylvanas: $2202w\nTotal Horde: $2207w\n\nBolvar: $2203w\nMagni: $2204w\nTyrande: $2205w\nTotal Alliance: $2206w\n\nThe Alliance has the most popular hero!"]="Here are the final standings!\n\nThrall: $2200w\nCairne: $2201w\nSylvanas: $2202w\nTotal Horde: $2207w\n\nBolvar: $2203w\nMagni: $2204w\nTyrande: $2205w\nTotal Alliance: $2206w\n\nThe Alliance has the most popular hero!"
G["Here are the final standings!\n\nThrall: $2200w\nCairne: $2201w\nSylvanas: $2202w\nTotal Horde: $2207w\n\nBolvar: $2203w\nMagni: $2204w\nTyrande: $2205w\nTotal Alliance: $2206w\n\nThe Horde has the most popular hero!"]="Here are the final standings!\n\nThrall: $2200w\nCairne: $2201w\nSylvanas: $2202w\nTotal Horde: $2207w\n\nBolvar: $2203w\nMagni: $2204w\nTyrande: $2205w\nTotal Alliance: $2206w\n\nThe Horde has the most popular hero!"
G["Here are the orders, $n.  Now, take them quickly to Field Marshal Teravaine!"]="Here are the orders, $n.  Now, take them quickly to Field Marshal Teravaine!"
G["Here are the orders, $n.  Take them quickly to Warmaster Garrick!"]="Here are the orders, $n.  Take them quickly to Warmaster Garrick!"
G["Here at The Golden Lantern, the taps never empty and the barrels never stop rolling! What can I get for you?"]="Here at The Golden Lantern, the taps never empty and the barrels never stop rolling! What can I get for you?"
G["Here at the Farstrider lodge, we prize hunting skills above all else. Wish to gain my approval? You'll have to earn it.\n\nYou look up to the challenge, $Glad:lass;!"]="Here at the Farstrider lodge, we prize hunting skills above all else. Wish to gain my approval? You'll have to earn it.\n\nYou look up to the challenge, $Glad:lass;!"
G["Here be some of my things...."]="Aqui eh'tán algumas de meus coisas..."
G["Here come Zen'Kiki!"]="Aqui chega Zen'Kiki!"
G["Here come more stone troggs. Defend the catapult!"]="Vêm mais troggs de pedras. Defienda catapulta!"
G["Here come the Infinites!  I've got to keep the hourglass safe.  Can you help?"]="Aqui vêm os Infinitos! Tenho que proteção o relógio de arena. Pode me ajudar?"
G["Here come the beasts!"]="Aqui vêm as beast!"
G["Here come the tears..."]="Agora vêm as lágrimas..."
G["Here comes Zanzil!"]="Aqui chega Zanzil!"
G["Here comes Zen'Kiki!"]="Aqui vem Zen'Kiki!"
G["Here comes the THUNDER!"]="Aqui vem o TROVÃO!"
G["Here comes the final assault. For Domination Point! BUTCHER THEM ALL!"]="Here comes the final assault. For Domination Point! BUTCHER THEM ALL!"
G["Here comes the guard, $n!  Take him out!"]="Aqui vem o guarda, $n! Elimínalo!"
G["Here comes the pain!"]="Aqui vem o dor!"
G["Here comes the postmaster!"]="Here comes the postmaster!"
G["Here comes the small but deadly Ambrose Boltspark, Grand Champion of Gnomeregan!"]="Here comes the small but deadly Ambrose Boltspark, Grand Champion of Gnomeregan!"
G["Here fishy fishy. . . come to papa."]="Here fishy fishy. . . come to papa."
G["Here fishy, fishy fishy..."]="Pececito, pececito, pececito..."
G["Here for a ride, $r?\n\nOr, is something else bothering you?"]="Veio para viajar, $r?\n\nOU te preocupa algo mais?"
G["Here for the rod? Or, maybe you're simply stocking up on runes?\n\nWait a minute! Are you just trying to offload a whole bunch of junk on me?! Curse my never-ending compulsion to buy, buy, buy!"]="Here for the rod? Or, maybe you're simply stocking up on runes?\n\nWait a minute! Are you just trying to offload a whole bunch of junk on me?! Curse my never-ending compulsion to buy, buy, buy!"
G["Here for training eh? Just began my training meself, but I would be glad ta teach ye what I can."]="Aqui para treinar eh? Acabei de começar meu treinamento, mas ficaria feliz em ensinar a você o que posso."
G["Here goes nothin'! Keep your fingers crossed, $n!"]="Vamos testar! Cruzaos dedos, $n!"
G["Here goes nothing!"]="Vamos além!"
G["Here goes nothing. I always loved you, Greely!"]="Bom, não tenho nada que perder. Sempre te e amado, Greely!"
G["Here goes nothing. My research did not have nice things to say about this Jade Warlord. Be ready for battle."]="Não vai nada. Minha pesquisa não me mostrou muitas coisas boas sobre esse Senhor da Guerra de Jade. Prepare-se para a batalha."
G["Here goes nothing..."]="Além vai..."
G["Here goes!"]="Aqui vai!"
G["Here he comes, $n! Beat him down while I dominate him with the Demon Chain."]="Aqui vem, $n! Você dale enquanto eu lhe domino com a cadeia do Demônio."
G["Here he comes, $n! Flying in from the west. Get your weapons ready!"]="Aqui vem, $n! Se aproxima voando pelo oeste. Prepara as armas!"
G["Here here!"]="Here here!"
G["Here in Darnassus you will find skilled trainers who have perfected the skills of their chosen class through ages of training and dedication.  I will guide you to one who can become your mentor, you have but to name your chosen path."]="Aqui em Darnassus, você encontrará treinadores qualificados que aperfeiçoaram as habilidades da sua classe escolhida através de idades de treinamento e dedicação. Vou guiá-o para alguém que pode se tornar seu mentor, você tem apenas o nome do caminho escolhido."
G["Here in Ogri'la we have time to contemplate the riddle of steel. But enough of that, how can we help?"]="Aqui em Ogri'a, temos tempo para contemplar o enigma do aço. Mas chega disso, como podemos ajudar?"
G["Here in Ogri'la, we have reached a higher existence.  And we will keep it that way."]="Aqui, em Ogri'a, temos alcançou um nível de existência superior. E assim o mantendremos."
G["Here in Valley of the Four Winds, we have our famous Stormstout Brewery. You may have noticed that a rather destructive bunch of Hozu have decided to make that place their own. Their drunken debauchery is known to get a little out of hand. \n \n Sometimes, after a new batch of brew is made, they are known to have beer fights. That's right, gallons upon gallons of brew are wasted and wash away into the Yan-Zhe river. \n \n The beer attracts Emperor Salmon, and they swarm like nothin' I've ever seen. They're a bit easier to catch, too... seein' as they've had a few."]="Here in Valley of the Four Winds, we have our famous Stormstout Brewery. You may have noticed that a rather destructive bunch of Hozu have decided to make that place their own. Their drunken debauchery is known to get a little out of hand. \n \n Sometimes, after a new batch of brew is made, they are known to have beer fights. That's right, gallons upon gallons of brew are wasted and wash away into the Yan-Zhe river. \n \n The beer attracts Emperor Salmon, and they swarm like nothin' I've ever seen. They're a bit easier to catch, too... seein' as they've had a few."
G["Here is a beacon for you, $n.  You must keep it in your possession if you are to find the corrupted items we will need."]="Here is a beacon for you, $n.  You must keep it in your possession if you are to find the corrupted items we will need."
G["Here is the Super $R that saved Stoneplow!"]="Akí está $gel: a; grande $R que salvou Vilharroca!"
G["Here is the book. You must ensure it gets to Caladis Brightspear in Icecrown before the Sunreavers realize what is happening."]="Aqui está seu livro. Certifique-se de que chegue a Caladis Lança Reluzente em Coroa de Gelo antes de que os Atracasol se deem conta do que está acontecendo."
G["Here is the first vent! Face the ledge, then jump! The heated air currents will do the rest."]="Here is the first vent! Face the ledge, then jump! The heated air currents will do the rest."
G["Here is what I have. As you can see, things are not what we were expecting.\n\nThese people need help, and I intend to stay and help them.\n\nWe would stand a much better chance with your help if you are willing to stay as well."]="Here is what I have. As you can see, things are not what we were expecting.\n\nThese people need help, and I intend to stay and help them.\n\nWe would stand a much better chance with your help if you are willing to stay as well."
G["Here is what the pandaren do know: By massacring our people, by slaughtering tens of thousands of pandaren, generation after generation, they have taught us the value of life. A precious but fleeting gift. Easily snuffed out... in an instant."]="Eis aqui o que sabemos: Ao massacrar nosso povo, matando milhares de pandarens, geração após geração, eles nos ensinaram o valor da vida. Uma dádiva preciosa mas fugaz. Apagada facilmente em um único instante."
G["Here is where I sacrificed everything to free my father. Now I come to destroy it..."]="Aqui é onde eu sacrifiquei tudo para liberar meu pai. Agora eu venho pai destruí-o..."
G["Here is where I sacrificied everything to free my father. Now I come to destroy it..."]="Aqui é onde eu sacrifiquei tudo para liberar meu pai. Agora eu venho pai destruí-o..."
G["Here is your bread sir."]="Aqui está seu pan, senhor."
G["Here is your fortune, $n.  May it serve you well."]="Aqui tem seu fortuna, $n. Espero que te ajude."
G["Here is your share."]="Aqui tem sua parte."
G["Here it comes!"]="Aí vem!"
G["Here it comes, fall back!"]="Aqui vem, por trás!"
G["Here it comes.  Stand ready."]="Aí vem. Prepare-se!"
G["Here it comes..."]="Aqui vem..."
G["Here it comes: TIGER WIND!"]="Além vai: VENTO DO TIGRES!"
G["Here it is -- the Tanaris desert.  Funny how an inhospitable place like this looks better than a lush jungle once you've been trapped in it forever."]="Here it is -- the Tanaris desert.  Funny how an inhospitable place like this looks better than a lush jungle once you've been trapped in it forever."
G["Here it is! This is what we've been looking for!"]="Aqui está! Isto é o que estávamos procurando!"
G["Here it is: the Stormstout Brewery."]="Aqui está: a Cervejaria do Trovão."
G["Here kitty kitty."]="Here kitty kitty."
G["Here lie our stores of blight crystal, without which our project would be impossible."]="Here lie our stores of blight crystal, without which our project would be impossible."
G["Here lie the remains of Weeder Greenthumb, one of Watcher Jhang's druid companions.  By all appearances he was killed quick and clean while trying to make his escape from the Slave Pens."]="Aqui jazem os restos de Weeder Greenthumb, um dos companheiros druidas de Watcher Jhang. Por todas as aparências, ele foi morto de forma rápida e limpa enquanto tentava escapar das Caves dos Escravos."
G["Here lies the broken form of poor Naturalist Bite.  His zeal for knowledge was only matched in ferocity by the manner of his death."]="Aqui jaz o corpo front do pobre naturapronta Mordisco. A ferocidade do seu sede de conhecimentos foi somente superada pelo seu brutal morte."
G["Here lies the corpse of one of the Steeljaw's caravan guards."]="Aqui está o cadáver de um dos guardas da caravana do Steeljaw."
