G["Here we are, the home of Niuzao, the Black Ox. He is the patron spirit of Pandaren fortitude, the only celestial who chooses to live beyond the wall."]="Here we are, the home of Niuzao, the Black Ox. He is the patron spirit of Pandaren fortitude, the only celestial who chooses to live beyond the wall."
G["Here we are."]="Aqui estamos."
G["Here we are.  Get ready for your training, little one.  I recommend you forget about that worthless $r $c and start thinking about your duties here in Zul'Gurub."]="Here we are.  Get ready for your training, little one.  I recommend you forget about that worthless $r $c and start thinking about your duties here in Zul'Gurub."
