G["Here's a fun fact: Mogujia translates roughly as 'Home of the Mogu'. Don't let that fool you, though. It's not their only home. It's just the name people have given this place. I did some research and found out that the original name for this area was Chow Keep. That's weird. Must just be a coincidence that farmer Chow also has the same name."]="Here's a fun fact: Mogujia translates roughly as 'Home of the Mogu'. Don't let that fool you, though. It's not their only home. It's just the name people have given this place. I did some research and found out that the original name for this area was Chow Keep. That's weird. Must just be a coincidence that farmer Chow also has the same name."
G["Here's a gold, buy yourself something nice."]="Aqui tem um ouro. Cómprate algo bonito."
G["Here's a good one, why do watermelons have water in them?"]="Here's a good one, why do watermelons have water in them?"
G["Here's a kiss for good luck, I think you're going to need it."]="Tome, um beijo de boa sorte. Acho que te há falta."
G["Here's a little somethin' extra since I'll be away."]="Aqui há algo de mais, para quando não estiver."
G["Here's a little something something you're gonna love..."]="Tenho um regalito para você que vai encantar..."
G["Here's a real surprise for you. What do you suppose they're celebrating? And what do you think would be the proper drink to mark the occasion?"]="Tenho uma surpresa para você. O que acha que estão celebrando? E qual acha que seria a bebida adequada para a ocasão?"
G["Here's a singing telegram for $n: Roses are red, violets are blue, I will kill any $R I see, including you!"]="Here's a singing telegram for $n: Roses are red, violets are blue, I will kill any $R I see, including you!"
G["Here's a tip from one farmer to another. There are lots of upgrades to buy at Halfhill Market. Gina Mudclaw sells tools, and Merchant Greenfield sells seeds."]="Here's a tip from one farmer to another. There are lots of upgrades to buy at Halfhill Market. Gina Mudclaw sells tools, and Merchant Greenfield sells seeds."
G["Here's another load for ya!"]="Aqui tem outra carga!"
