G["Hey there, $c! Looks like the Horde collected the last of their stuff, and now theirs and ours is being shipped over to Silithus as we speak. I'm told it'll be there in less than a day, and then someone can ring that big gong near the Ahn'Qiraj gates to start the war."]="Hey there, $c! Looks like the Horde collected the last of their stuff, and now theirs and ours is being shipped over to Silithus as we speak. I'm told it'll be there in less than a day, and then someone can ring that big gong near the Ahn'Qiraj gates to start the war."
