G["Hi $c, I'm Ashli, and I need you to help me 'cause I'm trapped in this cage 'cause Budd sent me in here with some yucky trolls and stinky orcs and silly humans and a drunk dwarf and we got caught by super-bad trolls and they dragged us off and they put me in here with the big troll-cat who's really really mean and kills all the people in the cages and I think he's gunna kill me too really soon but I can't get out by myself so...\n\n<Ashli takes a deep breath.>\n\nCan you kill that thing?"]="Hi $c, I'm Ashli, and I need you to help me 'cause I'm trapped in this cage 'cause Budd sent me in here with some yucky trolls and stinky orcs and silly humans and a drunk dwarf and we got caught by super-bad trolls and they dragged us off and they put me in here with the big troll-cat who's really really mean and kills all the people in the cages and I think he's gunna kill me too really soon but I can't get out by myself so...\n\n<Ashli takes a deep breath.>\n\nCan you kill that thing?"
