G["Hi there! We're being blockaded by those good-for-nothing pirates out in the bay! Do you think you can help us out by dropping a few bombs on them?!\n\nOur stolen zeppelin's here; hop on board before she sets sail!"]="Hi there! We're being blockaded by those good-for-nothing pirates out in the bay! Do you think you can help us out by dropping a few bombs on them?!\n\nOur stolen zeppelin's here; hop on board before she sets sail!"
