G["High Enchanter Bardolan may be found in the Seer's Library on Scryer's Tier. A grand master of the art, he is surrounded by his students: masters, artisans, experts, and journeymen."]="O Alto Encantador Bardolan pode ser encontrado na Biblioteca do Vidente no Nível de Scryer. Um grande mestre da arte, ele está cercado pelos seus alunos: mestres, artesãos, especiaprontas e jornaleiros."
G["High Executor Anselm requests your report."]="O Alto Executor Anselm solicita seu relatório."
G["High Executor Anselm wants a report on the situation."]="O Alto Executor Anselm quer um relatório sobre a situação."
G["High General Abbendis personally told me that it was a mistake to come north and that we're doomed! I urge you all to lay down your weapons and leave before it's too late!"]="High General Abbendis personally told me that it was a mistake to come north and that we're doomed! I urge you all to lay down your weapons and leave before it's too late!"
G["High King! I've brought reinforcements."]="Majestade! Traigo reforços."
G["High Priest Venoxis is exhausted!"]="O sumo sacerdote Venoxis está esgotado!"
G["High Priest Venoxis is nearly healed!"]="O sumo sacerdote Venoxis está quase sanado!"
G["High Priest Voss denounces you as a daughter.  He's ordered that you be executed immediately."]="High Priest Voss denounces you as a daughter.  He's ordered that you be executed immediately."
G["High Priestess Jeklik is nearly healed!"]="A suma sacerdotisa Jeklik está quase sanada!"
G["High Priestess Tyrande was hesitant to approve this mission.\n\nShe seemed to believe the source of Vaeldrin's research to be a double edged sword.\n\nAfter spending days in that arcanic oubliette, I am beginning to think she might not have been wrong."]="High Priestess Tyrande was hesitant to approve this mission.\n\nShe seemed to believe the source of Vaeldrin's research to be a double edged sword.\n\nAfter spending days in that arcanic oubliette, I am beginning to think she might not have been wrong."
G["High Tinker Mekkatorque is on his way!  The \"Tapping of the Keg\" ceremony will begin in a few minutes!"]="High Tinker Mekkatorque is on his way!  The \"Tapping of the Keg\" ceremony will begin in a few minutes!"
G["High alert, soldiers! Reports are comin' in of some enemy activity near Sofera's Naze!"]="High alert, soldiers! Reports are comin' in of some enemy activity near Sofera's Naze!"
G["Highborne spirits! Be at peace! The Crystal of Zin-Malor is whole once again!"]="Highborne spirits! Be at peace! The Crystal of Zin-Malor is whole once again!"
G["Highguard, to arms! For your queen! For Azshara!"]="Guardas nobres, às armas! pela Rainha! Por Azshara!"
G["Highlord Bolvar Fordragon fights for us all, newcomer. Were it not for him, Arthas would be sitting upon the throne of Stormwind right this very moment."]="Grão-lorde Bolvar Fordragon luta por todos nós, recém-chegado. Se não fosse por ele, Arthas estaria sentado no trono de Ventobravo neste exato momentos."
G["Highlord Fordring, are you alright?"]="Alto senhor Vadín, se encontre bem?"
G["Highlord Tirion Fordring approaches the stage to address those gathered upon the tournament grounds! Make way to the stage area to attend him!"]="Highlord Tirion Fordring approaches the stage to address those gathered upon the tournament grounds! Make way to the stage area to attend him!"
G["Hight is always going on about the 'sheep tons' of work we have to do. See if you can get him to say it. It's like a drinking game."]="Hight is always going on about the 'sheep tons' of work we have to do. See if you can get him to say it. It's like a drinking game."
G["Hilda's left all the documentin' to me. Ye know that fer every artifact we find, I've got six forms ta fill out? Whaddaya we need all these forms fer, I ask!?"]="Hilda's left all the documentin' to me. Ye know that fer every artifact we find, I've got six forms ta fill out? Whaddaya we need all these forms fer, I ask!?"
G["Hildagard, I need a new pair of goggles."]="Hildagard, preciso de um novo par de óculos."
G["Hillsbrad has changed. Back in my day Hillsbrad was a place of constant battle. The humans and dwarves of Southshore would constantly attack the Horde at Tarren Mill. There were days when you could look out past the intersection at Darrow Hill and see a thousand people battling. Glory days, $n - they'll pass you by."]="Hillsbrad has changed. Back in my day Hillsbrad was a place of constant battle. The humans and dwarves of Southshore would constantly attack the Horde at Tarren Mill. There were days when you could look out past the intersection at Darrow Hill and see a thousand people battling. Glory days, $n - they'll pass you by."
G["Him Walter Soref. Work in Rogue District. He make keys."]="Ele Walter Soref. Trabalho no distrito desonesto. Ele faz chaves."
G["Him name is Grizzle Halfmane. He in Royal Quarter with Banshee Queen and Dread Lord."]="O nome dele é Grizzle Halfmane. Ele no Royal Quarter com Banshee Queen e Dread Lord."
G["Him's at inner ring of Rogues' Quarter."]="Ele está no anel interno do Bairro dos Ladinos."
G["Hinkles rummages through his backpack looking for supplies."]="Hinkles rummages through his backpack looking for supplies."
G["Hinkles, hand me that Whirring Bronze Gizmo and some Fresh Spring Water. Cogspin, toss me that Dirty Trogg Cloth and a Handful of Copper Bolts..."]="Hinkles, hand me that Whirring Bronze Gizmo and some Fresh Spring Water. Cogspin, toss me that Dirty Trogg Cloth and a Handful of Copper Bolts..."
G["Hip hip, hoorah!"]="Hip, hip, hurra!"
G["Hip hip... arrrrr..."]="Hip, hip, hurra!"
G["Hippogryph Hatchling"]="Filhote de Hipogrifo"
G["Hippogryph Master"]="Mestre do Hipogrifo"
G["His Majesty, King Varian Wrynn, and Lady Jaina Proudmoore have touched down upon the tournament grounds! Make way!"]="His Majesty, King Varian Wrynn, and Lady Jaina Proudmoore have touched down upon the tournament grounds! Make way!"
G["His act could not erase the horrors we committed."]="His act could not erase the horrors we committed."
G["His armor is broken. Strike at him now!"]="Sua armadura se tem quebrado. Ataquem agora!"
G["His aspect shifts once again! You are losing him!"]="Seu aspecto muda novamente! O estão perdendo!"
G["His blood is mine, as is your whole misbegotten race."]="Seu sangue é minha; igual que toda sua maldito raça."
G["His body - it's covered with scars. Old scars."]="Seu corpo... Está cheio de cicatrizes. Cicatrizes antigas."
G["His body screams for death, but his soul screams for mercy."]="Seu corpo clama a morte, sua alma pede clemência a gritos."
G["His body was found strung up from a tree. Those animals... Those filthy animals!"]="His body was found strung up from a tree. Those animals... Those filthy animals!"
G["His brood learned their lesson before too long. You will soon learn yours!"]="His brood learned their lesson before too long. You will soon learn yours!"
G["His creations?  So you're saying that all the creatures here in the crater are Khaz'goroth's creations?"]="Seus criações? Diz que todas as criaturas da Cratera são criações de Khaz'goroth?"
G["His death was even more miserable than the first!"]="Seu morte foi inclusive mais triste que a do primeiro!"
G["His flesh will feed us, and give us strength. His rotting insides will be thrown into the filth-pool, protecting us from intruders. His bones will build our homes. His seed will continue the cycle indefinitely.\n\nStrength always to Kroshik. Strength always to the Skumblade."]="His flesh will feed us, and give us strength. His rotting insides will be thrown into the filth-pool, protecting us from intruders. His bones will build our homes. His seed will continue the cycle indefinitely.\n\nStrength always to Kroshik. Strength always to the Skumblade."
G["His followers fell to their knees before him. \"We will call you 'The Lightning King,'\" they said."]="Seus seguidores ajoelharam-se diante dele. Eles disseram: \"Nós o chamaremos de \"Rei Relâmpago\"."
G["His followers helped him regain his strength inside this very temple.  Plates of powerful elementium were grafted onto his skin."]="His followers helped him regain his strength inside this very temple.  Plates of powerful elementium were grafted onto his skin."
G["His goal he professed was marital arrest"]="His goal he professed was marital arrest"
G["His hold on me dissipates. I can see clearly once more. Thank you, heroes."]="Seu controle sobre mim se dissipa. Vuelvo a ver com claridade. Obrigado, heróis."
G["His journey is long. He has only taken the first steps."]="A jornada será longa. Ele só deu os primeiros passos."
G["His last terrible breath has haunted this land ever since, but the shadows he left behind are mere whispers of his former glory."]="Seu último fôlego maldice esta terra desde então, mas as sombras que deixou são meros sussurros do seu antiga glória."
G["His lieutenant, Ilkrud Magthrull possesses a tome which might indicate the location of the remaining soulgems."]="His lieutenant, Ilkrud Magthrull possesses a tome which might indicate the location of the remaining soulgems."
G["His pulse is stable, Mishka. But it's weak."]="His pulse is stable, Mishka. But it's weak."
G["His sacrifice inspires us all."]="Seu sacrifício nos inspira a todos."
G["His son, Anduin Wrynn, was the king for a while.  He's about my age too.  Can you imagine if I were the king?"]="His son, Anduin Wrynn, was the king for a while.  He's about my age too.  Can you imagine if I were the king?"
G["His spirit is free from the grasp of the Lich King. We must now focus our attention on breaking down the walls that block our passage into the upper reaches. It is only a matter of time now, $n. The siege engineers should have the door down in $4939W days."]="Seu espírito fica livre do Rei Lich. Agora devemos centrar nossa atenção em derrubar os muros que impiden nosso passo até as zonas altas. Somente é questão de tempo, $n. Os engenheiros de cerco devem haver jogou a porta em $4939W dias."
G["His spirit is strong for a creature of mortal flesh. He fascinates me... and I am loathe to give him up."]="Seu espírito é forte para uma criatura de carne mortal. Me fascina... e detesto ter que renunciar a ele."
G["His stamina is nothing against Lam's strength."]="Seu resistência não é nada comparação com a força de Lam."
G["His trail is still fresh.  We're not far behind."]="O rastro é recente. Não estamos muito longe."
G["His troops, these guards... it all seems a little intense."]="Seus tropas, estes guardas... Tudo parece um pouco intenso."
G["His umbrella... sprouted! It grew roots, flowered, and became a tree!"]="His umbrella... sprouted! It grew roots, flowered, and became a tree!"
G["His weakness led to his capture."]="Seu fraqueza condujo ao seu captura."
G["His will - it's too strong!"]="Seu vontade... É demais forte!"
G["His... return."]="Seu... retorno."
G["Hiss... hiss... dead. All dead."]="Essstá... esssstá... morto. Morto do tudo."
G["Hisss word, FILLS me, MY BLOOD IS VENOM, AND YOU WILL BATHE IN THE GLORY OF THE SNAKE GOD!!!"]="Hisss word, FILLS me, MY BLOOD IS VENOM, AND YOU WILL BATHE IN THE GLORY OF THE SNAKE GOD!!!"
G["Hissssssss!"]="Sssshh!"
G["History in the making!"]="Isto somente acontece uma vez na história!"
G["History is about to be rewritten!"]="History is about to be rewritten!"
G["History? Culture? Tch. Such is the realm of scholars and scribes.\n\nWe of The Reliquary concern ourselves with... the immediate, and perhaps the future.\n\nWe discover, acquire, and amass lost artifacts, wealth, and lore so that it cannot be used against us. Power does, after all, belong in the hands of those who would use it best... wouldn't you agree?"]="History? Culture? Tch. Such is the realm of scholars and scribes.\n\nWe of The Reliquary concern ourselves with... the immediate, and perhaps the future.\n\nWe discover, acquire, and amass lost artifacts, wealth, and lore so that it cannot be used against us. Power does, after all, belong in the hands of those who would use it best... wouldn't you agree?"
G["Hit by what? Sprites?"]="Atacado por quem? Duendes?"
G["Hit dem wit da most powaful 'ting you got!"]="Hit dem wit da most powaful 'ting you got!"
G["Hit it as hard as possible."]="Atacar o mais forte possível."
G["Hit it very softly."]="Atacar muito suavemente."
G["Hit it with average power."]="Atacar com força média."
G["Hit me again and you'll regret it!"]="Hit me again and you'll regret it!"
G["Hit me as hard as you possibly can!"]="Golpéame com todas seus forças!"
G["Hit me softly!"]="Golpéame suavemente!"
G["Hit me with average power!"]="Golpéame com força média!"
G["Hit the button labeled \"Just past the Grim Guzzler\"."]="Hit the button labeled \"Just past the Grim Guzzler\"."
G["Hit the button labeled 'Entrance'."]="Hit the button labeled 'Entrance'."
G["Hit the button labeled 'Into the Domicile'."]="Hit the button labeled 'Into the Domicile'."
G["Hit the icicle to break free!"]="Hit the icicle to break free!"
G["Hit them harder, $n!"]="Hit them harder, $n!"
G["Hiya! This workshop isn't mine, no! But one day after I finish training I am going to be an inventor, just like my hero, Marvon Rivetseeker.\n\nYou've never heard of him? Well it just so happens that he left quite some time ago to study some ancient troll ruins he kept talking about. He left in a zeppelin... not quite sure about where exactly he went...\n\nTanarasin? Tenkeris? Taneranisany?\n\n<Liv shakes her head.>\n\nNo, that's not it..."]="Hiya! This workshop isn't mine, no! But one day after I finish training I am going to be an inventor, just like my hero, Marvon Rivetseeker.\n\nYou've never heard of him? Well it just so happens that he left quite some time ago to study some ancient troll ruins he kept talking about. He left in a zeppelin... not quite sure about where exactly he went...\n\nTanarasin? Tenkeris? Taneranisany?\n\n<Liv shakes her head.>\n\nNo, that's not it..."
G["Hiya, $g babe : hon;! What's this I hear about you and $g Candy : Chip;?"]="Onda, céu! Que é isso que ouvi sobre $gCara: Locko; e você?"
G["Hm, hungry."]="Mm, fome."
G["Hm, the pressure must be alleviated somewhat..."]="Hmm... É preciso aliviar um pouco a presão..."
G["Hm, these are pretty good bones you got this time, Pozzik."]="Hm, these are pretty good bones you got this time, Pozzik."
G["Hm, unannounced visitors. Preparations must be made..."]="Mm, visite inesperada. É preciso fazer os preparativos..."
G["Hm-wha? Stowaways!"]="Que? Polizones!"
G["Hm. Good."]="Mm. Bem."
G["Hm. I used to think leadership was all about strength. I see things more clearly now - it's a little bit of give, a little bit of take. It's about binding people together. A bundle of sticks is not easily broken."]="Hm. I used to think leadership was all about strength. I see things more clearly now - it's a little bit of give, a little bit of take. It's about binding people together. A bundle of sticks is not easily broken."
G["Hm..."]="Mmm..."
G["Hm... I don't think this blinking red light is a good thing..."]="Hm... I don't think this blinking red light is a good thing..."
G["Hm... don't get many $cs up this way..."]="Hm... não se encontre a muitos do seu classe por aqui... ($c)"
G["Hm... if you're looking to adle wits, $n, then the secret behind Zanzil's zombies might just do the trick!"]="Hm... if you're looking to adle wits, $n, then the secret behind Zanzil's zombies might just do the trick!"
G["Hm... yes, I do have a recipe you might find useful.  Let me teach you!"]="Hum... sim, eu tenho uma receita que você pode achar útil. Deixe-me ensinar!"
G["Hm...after dropping this off, I think I'll head to that cheese shop for a snack."]="Hm...after dropping this off, I think I'll head to that cheese shop for a snack."
G["Hm...it is good that you brought this to me, $n."]="Mmm... que bem que me tragemras isto, $n."
G["Hm?"]="Mm?"
G["Hm? You found something, boy?"]="Mm? Has encontrado algo, rapaz?"
G["Hmm, I don't have any mithril casings. I'm all out. Is that all you need to get to fix A-Me? Oh, that would be fantastic!\n\nMithril casings aren't too hard to find back in civilization. Just ask any skilled engineer to make one for you. I think it takes a few bars of mithril, but if you could help me out, I'll make sure you're well rewarded!"]="Hmm, I don't have any mithril casings. I'm all out. Is that all you need to get to fix A-Me? Oh, that would be fantastic!\n\nMithril casings aren't too hard to find back in civilization. Just ask any skilled engineer to make one for you. I think it takes a few bars of mithril, but if you could help me out, I'll make sure you're well rewarded!"
G["Hmm, I guess I can take on another student. Well, don't just stand there. Tell me what you're looking to learn."]="Hmm, acho que posso pegar outro aluno. Bem, não fique aí parado. Diga-me o que você está procurando aprender."
G["Hmm, I have an idea. An old brewmaster trick..."]="Hmm, I have an idea. An old brewmaster trick..."
G["Hmm, I know I saw it around here somewhere, but are you sure? That thing turns the user into a brute instead of projecting an image of one about fifty percent of the time. And then they explode!"]="Hmm, I know I saw it around here somewhere, but are you sure? That thing turns the user into a brute instead of projecting an image of one about fifty percent of the time. And then they explode!"
G["Hmm, I suppose it could work.  But it could really use a little more umph!"]="Hmm, I suppose it could work.  But it could really use a little more umph!"
G["Hmm, arcane annihilators are pretty tough.  I wonder if Papa Wheeler knows what he's asking for?"]="Mmm. Os aniquiladores Arcanos são bastante difíceis. Me pergunto se Papai Rodas sabe o que está pedindo."
G["Hmm, did you hear something lads?"]="Vocês ouvido algo, pessoal?"
G["Hmm, don't mind if I do!"]="Hmm, não me importa!"
G["Hmm, fair enough, troll. Can't be any worse than the grog they serve around here..."]="Hmmm, me parece logo, troll. Não pode haver nada pior que o grog que sirven por aqui..."
G["Hmm, good treasure."]="Mmm, bom tesouro."
G["Hmm, it could be that meddler Shaw. I will see what I can discover. Be off with you. I'll contact you again soon."]="Hmm, it could be that meddler Shaw. I will see what I can discover. Be off with you. I'll contact you again soon."
G["Hmm, it would seem Keever needs a new subject. If that fool Abernathy keeps taking Keever's subjects, Keever may have to have a word with him."]="Hmm, it would seem Keever needs a new subject. If that fool Abernathy keeps taking Keever's subjects, Keever may have to have a word with him."
G["Hmm, looks like I've been programmed to... <sigh> Self-Destruct."]="Hmm, looks like I've been programmed to... <sigh> Self-Destruct."
G["Hmm, maybe it's this one - oh by the way, did I ever tell you about the time Fudgerick Two-toots snuck up on me while I was casting a fireball? We call him two-toots because, well, nevermind that, it was just terrible timing, and momma was soo mad - my eyebrows are just now growing back...."]="Hmm, maybe it's this one - oh by the way, did I ever tell you about the time Fudgerick Two-toots snuck up on me while I was casting a fireball? We call him two-toots because, well, nevermind that, it was just terrible timing, and momma was soo mad - my eyebrows are just now growing back...."
G["Hmm, perhaps there is something...\n\nWe were just about to dine when you delivered the king's command. I imagine a little sustenance might provide some extra energy.\n\nAlso, come to think of it, we could use a little more wood for our spikes. Perhaps you could collect some?\n\nThen... well there's... oh, nevermind."]="Hmm, perhaps there is something...\n\nWe were just about to dine when you delivered the king's command. I imagine a little sustenance might provide some extra energy.\n\nAlso, come to think of it, we could use a little more wood for our spikes. Perhaps you could collect some?\n\nThen... well there's... oh, nevermind."
G["Hmm, thank you stranger."]="Hmmm, Obrigado colega."
G["Hmm, that's strange, $c. I would have thought you'd have found something connected with those scourging crystals.\n\nWe really should find a way to bring down their shields and destroy them. You think you could go back out there and kill some more Scourge until you find something?"]="Hmm, that's strange, $c. I would have thought you'd have found something connected with those scourging crystals.\n\nWe really should find a way to bring down their shields and destroy them. You think you could go back out there and kill some more Scourge until you find something?"
G["Hmm, this will give me shomething to focush on for my next predikshun."]="Hmm, this will give me shomething to focush on for my next predikshun."
G["Hmm, well on second thought..."]="Mmm... Pensándolo melhor..."
G["Hmm, well, I can see that you have a little skill at making potions. Whether you're worthy to be my student remains to be seen, however. I have a job for you. Impress me."]="Hmm, bem, eu posso ver que você tem um pouco de habilidade em fazer poções. Porém, se você é digno de ser meu aluno, ainda não se sabe. Eu tenho um emprego para você. Impressione-me."
G["Hmm, what was that? I'm sorry my dear, I must have been daydreaming."]="Hmm, what was that? I'm sorry my dear, I must have been daydreaming."
G["Hmm, you scratch my back, I'll scratch yours. If you do what I ask, and do it well, maybe we can discuss your training."]="Hmm, você coça minhas costas, eu coço as suas. Se você fizer o que eu pedir e fizer bem, talvez possamos discutir seu treinamento."
G["Hmm, you want... me?"]="Que que eu...?"
G["Hmm, your work is allright but it's nowhere near the quality I look for in a student. Go talk with Smith Argus in Goldshire, I'm sure he can teach you some basics. Then when you're done, come on back to me and I'll give you a little test to make sure you are ready."]="Hmm, seu trabalho é bom, mas não chega nem perto da qualidade que procuro em um aluno. Vá conversar com Smith Argus em Goldshire, tenho certeza que ele pode lhe ensinar algumas noções básicas. Então, quando terminar, volte para mim e eu farei um pequeno teste para garantir que você esteja pronto."
G["Hmm."]="Mmm."
G["Hmm.\n\n<You wait patiently for Chief Kah Kah to think, then wait some more for him to speak.>\n\nKah Kah have many nephews. They all have earned their name name.\n\nGrookin home to one who has not yet earned his name name....\n\nRiko been a little too frisky - even for a hozen. Maybe long walk do him some good."]="Hmm.\n\n<You wait patiently for Chief Kah Kah to think, then wait some more for him to speak.>\n\nKah Kah have many nephews. They all have earned their name name.\n\nGrookin home to one who has not yet earned his name name....\n\nRiko been a little too frisky - even for a hozen. Maybe long walk do him some good."
G["Hmm. A $c is interesting, but let us see how well you do against the Wrestler or Master Boom Boom."]="Hmm. $gUn: Uma; $c é interessante, mas vamos ver como te as apanhas contra o Lutador ou o mestre Bum Bum."
G["Hmm. Dat's not da one. Let's try one o' da other vases."]="Hmm. Dat's not da one. Let's try one o' da other vases."
G["Hmm. I never really liked that place. The outhouses were always dirty."]="Hmm. I never really liked that place. The outhouses were always dirty."
G["Hmm. I think that one is going to need some extra perfuming."]="Mmm. Acho que esse vai precisar mais colonia."
G["Hmm. Only 2 tons of explosives for this mission? Seems a bit light to me. This seems like the kind of mission we are going to need way more explosives for. Like... goblin pyromaniac explosives."]="Mmm. Somente dois toneladas de explosivos para esta missão? É pouco para meu gusto. Me da que esta missão é do tipo que exige muitos mais explosivos... Estou falando do nível de um goblin pirómano."
G["Hmm. Some say the rope is a crutch..."]="Mmm. Alguns dizem que a corda é uma muleta."
G["Hmm. Telemetry seems to be off."]="Hum. A telemetria parece não estar funcionando."
G["Hmm. That's actually some pretty good engineering down there. It's Disruptron time!"]="Mmm. A verdade é que essa é engenharia da boa. É a hora do Disruptrón!"
G["Hmm. The significance of this bird eludes me."]="Hmm. Não consigo lembrar o significado deste pássaro."
G["Hmm. These Demolishers seem to have a serious weakness to rockets. Send in the copters!"]="Hum. Esses Demolidores parecem bem vulneráveis a foguetes. Mandem os cópteros!"
G["Hmm. What armor..."]="Mmm... Que armadura..."
G["Hmm. What to make first? Incense? Campfire logs? Everburning candle?"]="Hmm. What to make first? Incense? Campfire logs? Everburning candle?"
G["Hmm. You don't look very tough... but okay."]="Hmm. Não parecer muito duro... mas vale."
G["Hmm..."]="Hum..."
G["Hmm...  The beast looks smaller than I would have thought."]="Mmm... A fera parece mais pequena do que havia pensado."
G["Hmm... I can't remember which way to go here.  Let's try this side!"]="Hmm... Não lembrança por onde se chega ali. Probemos por este lado!"
G["Hmm... I didn't go this direction.  I think I'm telling the story wrong."]="Mmm... Não fui nesta direção. Acho que estou contando mal a história."
G["Hmm... I have no idea."]="Hmm... Não tenho nem ideia."
G["Hmm... I recall seeing such script on the Nathrezim homeworld. I cannot read it and I doubt any of your kind could either."]="Hmm... I recall seeing such script on the Nathrezim homeworld. I cannot read it and I doubt any of your kind could either."
G["Hmm... I think this year's Suntouched Special isn't so special after all.  Wouldn't you agree, $n?"]="Mmm... Acho que o Toquesol especial deste ano não é tão especial, depois de tudo. Não está de acordo, $n?"
G["Hmm... I wonder..."]="Hmm... Me pergunto..."
G["Hmm... If I mix some pale with a stou...\nOh, yes. Hello!"]="Hmm... If I mix some pale with a stou...\nOh, yes. Hello!"
G["Hmm... Interesting."]="Mmm… interessante."
G["Hmm... It seems that the syncotron unit we've been using has had no noticeable effect on the gravimetric or gravitronic distortions in this sector."]="Hmm... It seems that the syncotron unit we've been using has had no noticeable effect on the gravimetric or gravitronic distortions in this sector."
G["Hmm... No one here specializes in fresh bread..."]="Mmm... ninguém está especializado em pan fresco por aqui..."
G["Hmm... That rock is nice, but too small."]="Mmm... Essa pedras é bonita, mas demais pequena."
G["Hmm... Troteman may have gotten himself in over his head. We'll split up."]="Mmm... Talvez Troteman necesite ajuda. Separémonos."
G["Hmm... a shame to lose that experiment."]="Hmm... Uma pena perder esse experimento..."
G["Hmm... according to this codex, the Korune mogu are attempting to harness the very power of the sha. And now we know exactly where they are doing so. Well done, $n."]="Hmm... according to this codex, the Korune mogu are attempting to harness the very power of the sha. And now we know exactly where they are doing so. Well done, $n."
