G["Horde be a family. When de whole world try ta put us down, de family come an' pick us back up. We all each other got, see?\n\nHellscream, he don't see family. Ain't never had one. All he see is power, like he just come through the portal.\n\n<Vol'jin stares off into the distance.>\n\nWe stand against him - together, here, now - or he stomp us out. One. By. One. I got de scars ta prove it.\n\nWho do ya trust, $n? Where be your loyalty now? Hellscream? Or family?"]="Horde be a family. When de whole world try ta put us down, de family come an' pick us back up. We all each other got, see?\n\nHellscream, he don't see family. Ain't never had one. All he see is power, like he just come through the portal.\n\n<Vol'jin stares off into the distance.>\n\nWe stand against him - together, here, now - or he stomp us out. One. By. One. I got de scars ta prove it.\n\nWho do ya trust, $n? Where be your loyalty now? Hellscream? Or family?"
