G["I ain't goin' back to the clink, $gman:lady;!"]="I ain't goin' back to the clink, $gman:lady;!"
G["I ain't gonna support you if you ain't brawlin' yourself. You need \"skin in the game\", chief.\nGo talk to one of them guards and tell 'em you wanna fight. Then we can play."]="I ain't gonna support you if you ain't brawlin' yourself. You need \"skin in the game\", chief.\nGo talk to one of them guards and tell 'em you wanna fight. Then we can play."
