G["I always wonder where all the water go... doesn't make sense."]="I always wonder where all the water go... doesn't make sense."
G["I am 100% confident that I wish to learn in the ways of gnomish engineering."]="Estou 100% confiante de que desejo aprender nas formas da engenharia gnômica."
G["I am 100% confident that I wish to learn in the ways of goblin engineering."]="Estou 100% confiante de que desejo aprender nos caminhos da engenharia goblin."
G["I am Achelus, chief expeditionary officer of Blood Watch."]="Sou Achelus, chefe expedicionário da Guarda de Sangue."
G["I am Adamant Ironheart of the great city of Ironforge. As you could probably guess by looking at my uniform, I was once part of the Ironforge elite guard. Yep, I was Magni's right hand man! At least until I retired. Now I dabble in archaeology. It's a hobby really; plus I figured it would be a great way to see the world!"]="Eu sou inflexível Coração de Ferro da grande cidade de Ironforge. Como você provavelmente poderia adivinhar olhando para o meu uniforme, eu já fiz parte da guarda de elite Ironforge. Sim, eu era o braço direito de Magni! Pelo menos até eu me aposentar. Agora eu me envolvo em arqueologia. É mesmo um hobby; além disso, achei que seria uma ótima maneira de ver o mundo!"
G["I am Admetius, leader of Blood Watch."]="Eu sou Admetius, líder da Guarda de Sangue."
G["I am Aesom, third of the Triumvirate."]="Eu sou Aesom, terceiro do Triunvirato."
G["I am Al'tabim the All-Seeing - an envoy of King Rastakhan.\n\nMy dealings are with priests, mages, and warlocks."]="I am Al'tabim the All-Seeing - an envoy of King Rastakhan.\n\nMy dealings are with priests, mages, and warlocks."
G["I am Anduin Wrynn, Prince of Stormwind. I won't die here. Not like this!"]="Eu sou Anduin Wrynn, Príncipe de Ventobravo. Eu não morrerei aqui. Não desse jeito!"
G["I am Arator, son of Turalyon and Alleria. So yes, Father, I am \"shome\" kind of elf: half-elf to be precise."]="I am Arator, son of Turalyon and Alleria. So yes, Father, I am \"shome\" kind of elf: half-elf to be precise."
G["I am Atuik, chieftain of the Kalu'ak of Kamagua."]="Sou Atuik, chefe dos Kalu'ak de Kamagua."
G["I am Balgaras the Foul.  And you, $n, are about to become nothing more than ash and dust."]="I am Balgaras the Foul.  And you, $n, are about to become nothing more than ash and dust."
G["I am Blood Knight, mongrel. I do not serve the Light, the Light serves me. If mercy is to be granted, it will be by me."]="I am Blood Knight, mongrel. I do not serve the Light, the Light serves me. If mercy is to be granted, it will be by me."
G["I am Chen Stormstout. From the Wandering Isle."]="Sou Chen Cerveja de Trovão. da Ilha Errante."
G["I am Destructobyte, the great usurper! And as you can see, I have found your secret plans!"]="Sou Destructobyte, o grande usurpador! Como pode ver, encontrei seus esquemas segredos!"
G["I am Dragonmaw, I am the blood of the Dragon and the fist of the Horde!"]="Sou um Faucedraco! Sou o sangue do dragão! O punho da Horda!"
G["I am Forsaken."]="Sou um Renegado."
G["I am GIANT!"]="Sou um GIGANTESCO!"
G["I am Garrosh Hellscream, son of Grom, chieftain of the Mag'har! Let the battle call of Hellscream give you courage and strength! Be lifted by my rallying cry."]="I am Garrosh Hellscream, son of Grom, chieftain of the Mag'har! Let the battle call of Hellscream give you courage and strength! Be lifted by my rallying cry."
G["I am Gath'Ilzogg!  And you are a $R on the brink of death!"]="Sou Gath'ilzogg! E você é $gun: uma; $r ao borda da morte!"
G["I am Gurrok, of Hellscream's Vanguard."]="Eu sou Gurrok, da Vanguarda de Grito Infernal."
G["I am Highborne, $r. It has no meaning now. There was a time, though, when this world was ruled by Highborne. Ten thousand years past..."]="I am Highborne, $r. It has no meaning now. There was a time, though, when this world was ruled by Highborne. Ten thousand years past..."
G["I am Hydraxis, Duke of the Waterlords.  You are not an elemental and so cannot understand our struggle, but perhaps we can strike a deal that will benefit us both..."]="Eu sou Hydraxis, duque dos senhores da água. Você não é um elementar e, portanto, não pode entender nossa luta, mas talvez possamos chegar a um acordo que nos beneficie..."
G["I am Jin'rokh the Breaker, envoy of Mugamba: Fist of Rastakhan!\n\nMy dealings are with warriors and heathens."]="I am Jin'rokh the Breaker, envoy of Mugamba: Fist of Rastakhan!\n\nMy dealings are with warriors and heathens."
G["I am Kalecgos, of the Blue Dragonflight.\n\nI have watched over the nascent powers of the Sunwell for some time, but now I see that its terrible power could usher in the end of our world!"]="I am Kalecgos, of the Blue Dragonflight.\n\nI have watched over the nascent powers of the Sunwell for some time, but now I see that its terrible power could usher in the end of our world!"
G["I am Kessel, lord of the elekk, disciple of the Hand of Argus. Are you the new recruit?"]="Sou Kessel, senhor dos elekk, discípulo da Mão de Argus. Você é o novo recruta?"
G["I am Khadgar, former apprentice to the fallen Guardian, Medivh. I'm sure you've heard his name before.\n\nIt was I who discovered that Medivh had been possessed by the Evil One, Sargeras - and that he had opened the Dark Portal between this world and Azeroth. Though I honored my Master, I was forced to slay him and put his tortured soul to rest."]="I am Khadgar, former apprentice to the fallen Guardian, Medivh. I'm sure you've heard his name before.\n\nIt was I who discovered that Medivh had been possessed by the Evil One, Sargeras - and that he had opened the Dark Portal between this world and Azeroth. Though I honored my Master, I was forced to slay him and put his tortured soul to rest."
G["I am Kil'ruk, a warrior from an era long passed."]="Sou Kil'ruk, um guerreiro de uma era muito antiga."
G["I am Kilram, master of the axe."]="Eu sou Kilram, mestre do machado."
G["I am Kodian, daughter of Ursoc.  I watch over this once sacred shrine.\n\nI've not seen a stranger come here in a long time."]="Sou Kodian, filha de Ursoc. Vigilo este santuário que em outro tempo foi sagrado.\n\nNão vi a nenhum estranho vir aqui desde há muito tempo."
G["I am Krathok, overseer of these craftsmen."]="Sou Krathok, superintendente desses artesãos."
G["I am Lady Sinestra."]="Sou Lady Sinestra"
G["I am Lei Shen, slayer of kings and gods. You have made a grave mistake."]="Sou Lei Shen, assassino de reis e deuses. Vocês têm cometido um grave erro."
G["I am Moordo, elder hunter of Stillpine."]="Sou Moordo, caçador mais velho de Stillpine."
G["I am NEVER drinking again!"]="Não pretendo voltar a beber!"
G["I am NOT going to sweep the ground of a mud pit, I can tell you that!\n\nYou need to deal with that rat, the Trade Prince, that's what I think!"]="Te garanto que NÃO tenho nenhuma intenção de acabar o chão de um poço de lodo!\n\nTem que fazer tratos com essa rata do Príncipe mercante, isso é o que acho!"
G["I am Nablya, apprentice to Khaz'goroth and envoy to Un'Goro Crater.  I am known as the Watcher.\n\nI stand here in the place of my master, who has since left Azeroth.  He once stood in this very spot when he shaped many of his creations."]="I am Nablya, apprentice to Khaz'goroth and envoy to Un'Goro Crater.  I am known as the Watcher.\n\nI stand here in the place of my master, who has since left Azeroth.  He once stood in this very spot when he shaped many of his creations."
G["I am Nazgrim, fist of the Warchief and General of the Horde Army. If I must die today, I will die with honor, in battle, for the horde!"]="Sou Nazgrim, punho do Chefe de Guerra e geral do exército da Horda. Se devo morrer hoje, será com honra na batalha. pela Horda!"
G["I am Ponch. I clean the grounds and watch the kittens. They tell me I was a champion once. That must have been neat."]="I am Ponch. I clean the grounds and watch the kittens. They tell me I was a champion once. That must have been neat."
G["I am Prince Nadun of Ramkahehn.  My people are tol'vir... or descended from the tol'vir to be precise.\n\nThe people of Neferset were like us, made of flesh and blood...\n\nUntil Deathwing came."]="I am Prince Nadun of Ramkahehn.  My people are tol'vir... or descended from the tol'vir to be precise.\n\nThe people of Neferset were like us, made of flesh and blood...\n\nUntil Deathwing came."
G["I am Prince Nadun of Ramkahen.  The Neferset tribe has turned against the other tol'vir.\n\nHelp me escape so that I may lobby my brother, the king, to wage war against these traitors!"]="I am Prince Nadun of Ramkahen.  The Neferset tribe has turned against the other tol'vir.\n\nHelp me escape so that I may lobby my brother, the king, to wage war against these traitors!"
G["I am Rexxar, son of the Mok'Nathal, champion of the Horde."]="Sou Rexxar, filho de Mok'nathal, campeão da Horda."
G["I am Rutherford Twing, the main supplier for the Defilers posted here at Arathi Basin.  As you improve your standing with us, I will make available to you a fine selection of goods that you might find useful.  Should you find yourself in need of item repair, I also provide those services."]="Sou Rutherford Twing, o principal fornecedor de profanadores publicado aqui na Bacia Arathi. À medida que você melhorar sua posição conosco, disponibilizarei uma boa seleção de produtos que você achar úteis. Se você precisar de reparos, também presto esses serviços."
G["I am SO glad that evil Gankly Rottenfist got his just desserts!"]="I am SO glad that evil Gankly Rottenfist got his just desserts!"
G["I am SO glad that evil Gankly Rottenfist got his just desserts!  I have lots of skins if you want some to give to Harold."]="Estou tão feliz que o malvado Gankly Rottenfist tenha apenas sobremesas! Eu tenho muitas skins, se você quiser dar a Harold."
G["I am Samuel Hawke, the main supplier for the League of Arathor posted here at Arathi Basin.  As you improve your standing with us, I will make available to you a fine selection of goods that you might find useful.  Should you find yourself in need of item repair, I also provide those services."]="Sou Samuel Hawke, o principal fornecedor da Liga de Arathor publicado aqui na Bacia Arathi. À medida que você melhorar sua posição conosco, disponibilizarei uma boa seleção de produtos que você achar úteis. Se você precisar de reparos, também presto esses serviços."
G["I am Saurfang. Brother of Broxigar."]="Sou Colmilhosauro, irmão de Broxigar."
G["I am Scarlet Onslaught. We don't rat out our leaders!"]="Sou do Embate Escarlate. Não vendemos a nossos líderes!"
G["I am Skaltesh, guide to the shaman seeking enlightenment here... but even those who follow different paths can be shown a thing or two. Do you wish to see?"]="Eu sou Skaltesh, guia para o xamã que procurando a iluminação aqui... mas mesmo aqueles que seguem caminhos diferentes podem mostrar uma coisa ou duas. Deseja ver?"
G["I am Tinkmaster Overspark, and I am the chief architect for modern gnomish engineering principles in the world today.  It is my job to ensure that the power of invention continues to shine brightest from our arclight spanners than anywhere else!\n\nAlso, if you happen to know a good schematic for radiation elimination, we just so happen to be in the market for one right about now..."]="I am Tinkmaster Overspark, and I am the chief architect for modern gnomish engineering principles in the world today.  It is my job to ensure that the power of invention continues to shine brightest from our arclight spanners than anywhere else!\n\nAlso, if you happen to know a good schematic for radiation elimination, we just so happen to be in the market for one right about now..."
G["I am UNSINKABLE!"]="I am UNSINKABLE!"
G["I am Ubungo. I represent the Zandalar tribe.\n\nBad things are afoot, $r. The Drakkari are going to be their own doom with what they're up to.\n\nSome trolls never learn."]="I am Ubungo. I represent the Zandalar tribe.\n\nBad things are afoot, $r. The Drakkari are going to be their own doom with what they're up to.\n\nSome trolls never learn."
G["I am Ulysses Rackmore, captain of the Gallant.  And this is the log of the last few days of my doomed ship.\n\nWe were sailing to Feathermoon Stronghold with a shipment of supplies when naga stormed the sides of the Gallant.  We drove them back but we knew they'd return.  Fearing the loss of my most precious belongings, I steered the Gallant to an island off the coast of Desolace, one with old, night elf ruins.  And there I left my treasure chest."]="I am Ulysses Rackmore, captain of the Gallant.  And this is the log of the last few days of my doomed ship.\n\nWe were sailing to Feathermoon Stronghold with a shipment of supplies when naga stormed the sides of the Gallant.  We drove them back but we knew they'd return.  Fearing the loss of my most precious belongings, I steered the Gallant to an island off the coast of Desolace, one with old, night elf ruins.  And there I left my treasure chest."
G["I am Untrag of the Earthen Ring. Try not to upset the elements while you remain at the Throne of the Elements."]="Eu sou Untrag do Anel Terrestre. Tente não perturbar os elementos enquanto permanecer no trono dos elementos."
G["I am Xarantaur, the Witness."]="Eu sou Xarantaur, a Testemunha."
G["I am Zanza, a Loa of Zandalar. I have come in this ethereal form from Zandalar to help my people. Hakkar has no dominion over my soul.\n\nI help those that have helped the Zandalarian people."]="Sou Zanza, um Deus de Zandalariano. E vindo desde Zandalariano nesta forma etérea para ajudar aos meus. Hakkar não pode domínio minha alma.\n\nAjudo a aqueles que têm ajudado ao povo de Zandalariano."
G["I am Zarevhi of the Consortium.  My skills as a transmuter are known in a thousand worlds."]="Eu sou Zarevhi do consórcio. Minhas habilidades como transmutador são conhecidas em mil mundos."
G["I am a \"Lorewalker\" - a historian of sorts for my people. My instrument is the spoken word."]="Sou um \"eremita\": uma espécie de historiador para meu povo. Meu instrumento é a palavra."
G["I am a BOT. I have tons of information. To find out what I know, whisper me."]="I am a BOT. I have tons of information. To find out what I know, whisper me."
G["I am a Conqueror."]="Sou um conquistador."
G["I am a Justicar."]="Sou um justicar."
G["I am a Proudhoof, I will not fail!"]="I am a Proudhoof, I will not fail!"
G["I am a blood elf.  I do not do physical labor."]="Sou um elfo de sangue. Não faço trabalhos físicos."
G["I am a crafter of some renown, $c. With the proper materials, I am able to craft an armor known as Dreamwalker. Druids - and even some shaman - are drawn to this armor due to its magical properties. Are you interested?"]="I am a crafter of some renown, $c. With the proper materials, I am able to craft an armor known as Dreamwalker. Druids - and even some shaman - are drawn to this armor due to its magical properties. Are you interested?"
G["I am a farmer, $c. It's all I know."]="Sou um fazendeiro, $c. É tudo o que sei."
G["I am a fighter. Why will the elder not let me fight?"]="Sou um lutador. Por que não me de lutar o ancestral?"
G["I am a grumpy old man!"]="I am a grumpy old man!"
G["I am a hunter and wish to train."]="Sou caçador e desejo treinar."
G["I am a hunter in need of training, Acteon."]="Sou um caçador O que precisa de treinamento, Acteon."
G["I am a leaf on the wind!"]="Sou uma lâmina ao vento!"
G["I am a mage of great power, I have spent my days studying the mind and the memory as it pertains to learning and the retention of learned abilities. I would even now be perfecting my studies if not for the great voices that came to me in the night, informing me that my services were required. I will be here for only a short time offering my ability to wipe your talents for free. Soon I will leave again, and you will once more be stuck with whatever choices you make."]="Sou um mago de grande poder. Passei meus dias estudando a mente e a memória no que se refere ao aprendizado e à retenção de habilidades aprendidas. Mesmo agora, eu estaria aperfeiçoando meus estudos, se não fosse pelas grandes vozes que me apareceram à noite, informando que meus serviços eram necessários. Ficarei aqui por apenas um curto período de tempo oferecendo minha capacidade de limpar seus talentos de graça. Em breve irei embora novamente, e você mais uma vez ficará preso a quaisquer escolhas que fizer."
G["I am a master blacksmith, Omarion."]="Sou um mestre ferreiro, Omarion."
G["I am a master leatherworker, Omarion."]="I am a master leatherworker, Omarion."
G["I am a master tailor, Omarion."]="Sou um mestre sastre, Omarion."
G["I am a member of the Tillers, the hardworking farmers of Pandaria. If you wish to learn more about us, we are located at Halfhill in the Valley of the Four Winds."]="I am a member of the Tillers, the hardworking farmers of Pandaria. If you wish to learn more about us, we are located at Halfhill in the Valley of the Four Winds."
G["I am a night elf, stranger. While you may know nothing of my kind, we know much of you and your progenitors. You may not call yourself eredar but, in appearance, you share many similarities.\n\nYou have helped my allies, and for that I am thankful; but for the time being, you walk a tenuous path. Perhaps in time, you will be able to dissolve the doubts and fears that I hold in my heart."]="I am a night elf, stranger. While you may know nothing of my kind, we know much of you and your progenitors. You may not call yourself eredar but, in appearance, you share many similarities.\n\nYou have helped my allies, and for that I am thankful; but for the time being, you walk a tenuous path. Perhaps in time, you will be able to dissolve the doubts and fears that I hold in my heart."
G["I am a psylosopher. What that means is that I am smarter than you. Now move along before I diagnose you."]="Eu sou um psylosopher. O que isso significa é que sou mais esperto que você. Agora continue em linha de frente antes de eu diagnosticar você."
G["I am a ranger, not a politician. But like it or not, the mantle of leadership has fallen on my shoulders."]="Eu sou um patrulheiro, não um político. Mas, gostando ou não, o manto da liderança caiu em meus ombros."
G["I am a simple tauren. Baine and I have been friends for a long time."]="I am a simple tauren. Baine and I have been friends for a long time."
G["I am a slave no longer!"]="Já não sou um escravo!"
G["I am a slender, delicate flower!"]="Sou uma esbelta e delicada flor!"
G["I am a storm of pain!"]="Sou uma tempestade de dor."
G["I am a strong jinyu! I can take the brunt of many attacks without fear!"]="I am a strong jinyu! I can take the brunt of many attacks without fear!"
G["I am a treasure hunter in search of powerful artifacts. Give them to me and you will not be harmed."]="I am a treasure hunter in search of powerful artifacts. Give them to me and you will not be harmed."
G["I am a troll tailor trainer, and this is my default greeting."]="I am a troll tailor trainer, and this is my default greeting."
G["I am a wall of iron, but I cannot hold much longer!"]="Sou um muralha de ferro, mas não poderei aguantar muito!"
G["I am a warrior born!"]="Sou um guerreiro nato!"
G["I am able to teleport you near any of the boss encounters here in Firelands."]="Posso teleportar perto de qualquer chefe dos vencer das Terras de Fogo."
G["I am absolutely certain that I want to learn dragonscale leatherworking."]="Estou absolutamente certo de que quero aprender o trabalho em couro em escala de dragão."
G["I am absolutely certain that I want to learn elemental leatherworking."]="Estou absolutamente certo de que quero aprender a trabalhar com couro elementar."
G["I am absolutely certain that I want to learn tribal leatherworking."]="Estou absolutamente certo de que quero aprender o trabalho em couro tribal."
G["I am afraid that I am no longer gentle or humble. Age and countless battles have hardened my skin and soul. Perhaps that is why Cairne assigned me to Sun Rock Retreat... the gentle winds and warm sun does ease the pain."]="Receio não ser mais gentil ou humilde. Idade e inúmeras batalhas endureceram minha pele e alma. Talvez seja por isso que Cairne me designou para o Sun Rock Retreat... os ventos suaves e o sol quente aliviam a dor."
G["I am afraid that I do not, Arator. I have not seen or heard from your father in 15 years. We had long since presumed him dead. But know this: I did all that was in my power to try and find him. From the bounds of Hellfire to the ravages of Nagrand, we searched... All for naught. If I could give my own life to bring Turalyon back, I would do so a thousand times over. I... I am sorry."]="I am afraid that I do not, Arator. I have not seen or heard from your father in 15 years. We had long since presumed him dead. But know this: I did all that was in my power to try and find him. From the bounds of Hellfire to the ravages of Nagrand, we searched... All for naught. If I could give my own life to bring Turalyon back, I would do so a thousand times over. I... I am sorry."
G["I am afraid that you, $n, have outgrown your usefulness..."]="Muito me temo, $n, que já não nos é útil."
G["I am afraid the Commander's injuries are beyond my aid."]="I am afraid the Commander's injuries are beyond my aid."
G["I am afraid you will need more practice to defeat me."]="I am afraid you will need more practice to defeat me."
G["I am almost done, $n. Just a few more adjustments!"]="Já quase termino, $n. Faltam uns quantos configurações mais!"
G["I am an ally of the Cenarion Expedition, Mortog. Show me your wares."]="Sou aliado da Expedição Cenariano, Mortog. Ensénhame seus mercadorias."
G["I am an archaeologist with the Explorers' League! I can assure you that King Magni will hear of this outrage!"]="I am an archaeologist with the Explorers' League! I can assure you that King Magni will hear of this outrage!"
G["I am an envoy of Balthas. He has sent me to collect a flawless arcane essence."]="Eu sou um enviado de Balthas. Ele me enviou para coletar uma essência arcana impecável."
G["I am an instrument of your destruction, my king! Command me!"]="Sou um instrumento do seu destruição, meu rei! Dê-me ordens!"
G["I am an officer of the city, working in the capacity of the Undercity's census.  Since our liberation from the Scourge, we have tried to keep an accurate track of our city's populace.  Through arcane methods and sharpened mental discipline, I am able to access these records.  If you have business with me accordingly, please proceed.  You should know if you do, at any rate."]="Eu sou um oficial da cidade, trabalhando na capacidade do censo da Cidade Baixa. Desde nossa libertação do flagelo, tentamos manter um controle preciso da população de nossa cidade. Por meio de métodos misteriosos e disciplina mental aguçada, sou capaz de acessar esses registros. Se você tiver negócios comigo nesse sentido, continue. Você deve saber se si, pelo menos."
G["I am an orc of medicine, $r. If you have come here to learn, I shall do my best to teach."]="I am an orc of medicine, $r. If you have come here to learn, I shall do my best to teach."
G["I am an orc, ma'am. Would you mind if I asked you a few questions?"]="Sou um orc, senhora. Te importa se te faço umas perguntas?"
G["I am an undead cloth vendor, and this is my greeting text."]="I am an undead cloth vendor, and this is my greeting text."
G["I am ashamed, old friend. I know not what I do anymore. It is not you that would dare bring shame to the heroes of legend - it is I. It is I and the rest of these corrupt politicians. They fill our lives with empty promises, unending lies."]="I am ashamed, old friend. I know not what I do anymore. It is not you that would dare bring shame to the heroes of legend - it is I. It is I and the rest of these corrupt politicians. They fill our lives with empty promises, unending lies."
G["I am astounded by how quickly this creature grows. At first the diet of cheeses was simply irritating the beast.\n\nBut then we fed it some of the local goats and it started booming in size.\n\nA voracious creature to be sure."]="I am astounded by how quickly this creature grows. At first the diet of cheeses was simply irritating the beast.\n\nBut then we fed it some of the local goats and it started booming in size.\n\nA voracious creature to be sure."
G["I am at a loss. Perhaps only the Earth Mother herself knows the cause of this. But we must do something before this continues..."]="I am at a loss. Perhaps only the Earth Mother herself knows the cause of this. But we must do something before this continues..."
G["I am at your service, my lord."]="Estou ao seu serviço, meu senhor."
G["I am beginning to suspect you are worthless.  Do not disappoint me further."]="Empiezo a pensar que não sirves para nada. Não me decepções ainda mais."
G["I am being overwhelmed! Assist me!"]="Me estão superando! Ajudem-me!"
G["I am bested.  Give me a moment and we will venture forth together to face the Sha."]="Me vocês têm derrotado. Deixem que me recupere e juntos nos enfrentaremos aos sha."
G["I am blessed to be able to help someone of your skills to learn more of Jewelcrafting. What do you wish to know?"]="Sou abençoado por poder ajudar alguém com as suas habilidades a aprender mais sobre joalheria. O que você deseja saber?"
G["I am born of thunder!"]="Eu nací do trovão!"
G["I am bound eternally to this cursed world. What is it you desire, mortal?"]="Estou eternamente vinculado a este mundo amaldiçoado. O que é que você deseja, mortal?"
G["I am busy, $c. Your time would be better spent discussing matters with Kudrii."]="Estou ocupado, $c. Aprovecfarias melhor seu tempo se trataras com Kudrii."
G["I am busy, my child. Come back in a moment and we will speak."]="I am busy, my child. Come back in a moment and we will speak."
G["I am busy, outsider."]="Estou ocupado, arauto."
G["I am but a humble herald of the Dark Lady Sylvanas, our Banshee Queen."]="Não sou mais que uma humilde arauto da Dama Sombria Sylvanas, nossa Rainha alma em pena."
G["I am but...the darkness...before the storm..."]="Somente sou... a escuridão... antes da tempestade..."
G["I am called Bladefist for a reason. As you will see."]="I am called Bladefist for a reason. As you will see."
G["I am called Chen, and this is my niece Li Li."]="I am called Chen, and this is my niece Li Li."
G["I am called Chen, and this is my niece, Li Li."]="I am called Chen, and this is my niece, Li Li."
G["I am certain there is a Tailor that could provide you training in Darnassus.  When you arrive, ask one of the Sentinels in Darnassus about seeing a Tailor."]="Estou certo de que existe um alfaiate que pode lhe dar treinamento em Darnassus. Quando você chegar, pergunte a um dos Sentinelas em Darnassus sobre ver um Alfaiate."
G["I am certain. Let's move on to the fighting."]="Não me cabe dúvida. Pasemos à ação."
G["I am certain. Please proceed."]="Estou certo. Por favor, adiante."
G["I am curious to see what a bucket of bolts has to offer."]="Estou curioso para ver o que um balde de parafusos tem a oferecer."
G["I am curious, in your homeland, is there ever peace?"]="Tenho curiosidade... no lugar do que veio, alguma vez há paz?"
G["I am da powerful! Nobody tell me what to do!"]="I am da powerful! Nobody tell me what to do!"
G["I am deeply sorry, but the battle lines have been drawn. I will not tolerate any fraternizing with the enemy, as you could expose our Alliance to danger."]="I am deeply sorry, but the battle lines have been drawn. I will not tolerate any fraternizing with the enemy, as you could expose our Alliance to danger."
G["I am defeated."]="E perdido."
G["I am despawning from $n."]="I am despawning from $n."
G["I am diseased. Please cure me, medic."]="Estou enfermo. Cúrame, por favor."
G["I am dishonored. I should have died with the farseer at Magmoth."]="I am dishonored. I should have died with the farseer at Magmoth."
G["I am dishonored. I should have died with the farseer at Magmoth.\n\nLeave me to my thoughts."]="I am dishonored. I should have died with the farseer at Magmoth.\n\nLeave me to my thoughts."
G["I am done inspecting the skulls, $n, and I am relieved.  Yenniku is not among them..."]="I am done inspecting the skulls, $n, and I am relieved.  Yenniku is not among them..."
G["I am done practicing. Please take your hatchling back."]="I am done practicing. Please take your hatchling back."
G["I am done with you!"]="Me têm harto!"
G["I am done.  Your armor is ready, $n."]="E terminou. Sua armadura está pronta, $n."
G["I am down! Quick healing spells would be best for emergencies like that!"]="E caído. As sanações rápidas são melhores para estas situações."
G["I am down. Let us try again!"]="Fui derrotada! Vamos tentar novamente!"
G["I am down. Maybe I should bring more healing herbs for next time."]="Fui derrotada! Talvez eu deva trazer mais ervas de cura da próxima vez?"
G["I am drunk, like many of my fellow dwarves.  I've dug a tunnel and wound up here.  Who wants to drink?"]="Sou um borracho, como muitos de meus camaradas anões. E cavado um túnel e terminei aqui. Quem quer um trago?"
G["I am eager to begin our work, Highlord Mograine!"]="Estou ansioso por começar nosso trabalho, Alto senhor Mograine!"
G["I am eager to hear what so angry an orc has to say..."]="Estou ansioso por saber o que um orc tão bravo precisa dizer..."
G["I am embarassed to say it, Nork, but my deserter has gone missing."]="Tenho vergonha de dizer isso, Nork, mas meu desertor desapareceu."
G["I am enslaved no longer!"]="Já não sou um escravo!"
G["I am eternal fire. I am forever reborn and I will be the light that will guide you when it is most cold."]="I am eternal fire. I am forever reborn and I will be the light that will guide you when it is most cold."
G["I am eternal... I am death."]="Sou eterno... Sou a morte."
G["I am eternally grateful to you, $n."]="Te estou eternamente agradecida, $n."
G["I am eternally grateful, $n!"]="Te estarei eternamente agradecida, $n!"
G["I am eternally grateful."]="Te estou eternamente agradecido."
G["I am excited to see the full potential from a true $c."]="I am excited to see the full potential from a true $c."
G["I am fading... Return to Ar'tor... Ret... rn... to..."]="Me desvanezco... Volta a Ar'tor... Vuel... vê... a..."
G["I am far from finished."]="Estou longe de terminar."
G["I am far too busy to be wasting time on idle chatter. If you are looking for work as a huntsman, speak with Diktynna at the river's edge -- to the east. No doubt she's behind on her duties..."]="Estou muito ocupado para perder tempo com conversas ociosas. Se você está procurando trabalho como caçador, fale com Diktynna na beira do rio - a leste. Sem dúvida, ela está atrasada nos seus deveres..."
G["I am feeling a little better now, thank you."]="Já me sinto um pouco melhor, Obrigado."
G["I am finally...free..."]="Finalmente... sou livre..."
G["I am finished!"]="E terminou!"
G["I am forever denied the touch of stone.  I will never again know the glory of shaped iron..."]="Para sempre me foi negado o toque de pedras. Nunca mais conhecerei a glória do ferro moldado..."
G["I am forever in your debt, $n."]="Estarei em dívida com você eternamente, $n."
G["I am forever in your debt. Once we have triumphed over Kil'jaeden, this entire world will be in your debt as well."]="Estarei em dívida com vocês eternamente. Quando tenhamos triunfado sobre Kil’jaeden, este mundo também o estará."
G["I am forever indebted to you for putting to rest the spirits of my ancestors."]="Estarei sempre em dívida com você por haver devolvido os espíritos de meus ancestrais ao seu descanso."
G["I am forever indebted to you, friend."]="Estou em dívida com você para toda a vida, amigo."
G["I am free after ten thousand years, yet still my own brother thinks I am a villain! I'll show him my true power! I'll show him that the demons have no hold over me!"]="Estou livre após dez mil anos e, ainda assim, meu próprio irmão acha que sou um vilão! Vou mostrar a ele que os demônios não têm controle sobre mim!"
G["I am free of the bonds of the earth never to return again!"]="I am free of the bonds of the earth never to return again!"
G["I am free!  But the secret... is now in peril.  Akama must be warned!"]="Eu estou livre! Mas o segredo... agora está em perigo. Akama deve ser avisado!"
G["I am free!  I will ask the spirit of fire to return to us so that my people may have the courage to fight their masters!  I thank you, $r."]="I am free!  I will ask the spirit of fire to return to us so that my people may have the courage to fight their masters!  I thank you, $r."
G["I am free! Let's work together now to save my brother, Sothos!"]="Sou livre! Unamos agora nossas forças para superando a meu irmão, Sothos!"
G["I am free! Let's work together now to save my sister, Jarien!"]="I am free! Let's work together now to save my sister, Jarien!"
G["I am freed! Let us slay Hallazeal in Neptulon's name, $n. He lurks within the temple."]="I am freed! Let us slay Hallazeal in Neptulon's name, $n. He lurks within the temple."
G["I am from the elemental plane!"]="Venho do plano elemental!"
G["I am gathering my strength before I return to the battle. You would be wise to do the same."]="Estou reunindo minhas forças antes de retornar à batalha. Você seria sábio em fazer o mesmo."
G["I am getting him out of here."]="I am getting him out of here."
G["I am glad that I am not the one down there."]="I am glad that I am not the one down there."
G["I am glad that you ask. Our efforts to take the armory are at $3233w percent of our projections.\n\nI know that Battlemage Arynna and Harbinger Inuuro need your help. Seek them inside the Sun's Reach Sanctum on the Isle of Quel'Danas."]="Fico feliz que me o pergunte. Nossos esforços por pegar o arsenal estão ao $3233w % do planeado.\n\nSei que a maga de batalha Arynna e o presagista Inuuro necessário sua ajuda. Búscalos dentro do Sacrário de Tramo do Sol, na Ilha de Quel'Danas."
G["I am glad to hear it. The mogu's recent actions trouble me greatly. They have not behaved in such organized fashion for nearly ten thousand years."]="I am glad to hear it. The mogu's recent actions trouble me greatly. They have not behaved in such organized fashion for nearly ten thousand years."
G["I am glad you have returned, $n! I trust you are now acclimated to this strange new continent of Pandaria?\n\nYou have already proven yourself to me in the past, so we can dispense with any sort of tests or trials. Let's get right to it.\n\nAre you ready to change the world?"]="I am glad you have returned, $n! I trust you are now acclimated to this strange new continent of Pandaria?\n\nYou have already proven yourself to me in the past, so we can dispense with any sort of tests or trials. Let's get right to it.\n\nAre you ready to change the world?"
G["I am going on ahead.  They say Mama Stormstout is still out there somewhere."]="I am going on ahead.  They say Mama Stormstout is still out there somewhere."
G["I am going to Orgrimmar, alone. Eitrigg, Saurfang, surely they are standing against Garrosh. I must find others."]="Eu irei a Orgrimmar. Sozinho. Eitrigg, Saurfang, eles certamente estão contra Garrosh. Preciso encontrar outros."
G["I am going to eat your head!"]="Me vou comer sua cabeça!"
G["I am going to end the horrible problem of food storage cutting into the profits of the Bilgewater Cartel!"]="I am going to end the horrible problem of food storage cutting into the profits of the Bilgewater Cartel!"
G["I am going to enjoy crushing your spirit."]="I am going to enjoy crushing your spirit."
G["I am going to patrol the area for a while longer and ensure that things are truly safe."]="Vou seguir patrulhando a zona um tempo mais para garantir de que tudo está bem."
G["I am going to practice and become a warrior like my father!"]="I am going to practice and become a warrior like my father!"
G["I am going to teach you all what it takes to be a proper soldier!"]="I am going to teach you all what it takes to be a proper soldier!"
G["I am going. Li Li... you stay here. I will come back for you."]="Me marcho. Li Li... você fique aqui. Voltarei a por você."
G["I am goink find out who is behind zhis treachery, and you are goink to help me!"]="Vou descubrrrir quem está por trás desta traição, e você vai me ajudar!"
G["I am grateful for your aid, champions. Now, Gul'dan's Horde will sweep across this world like a locust swarm, and all my designs, all my carefully-laid plans will at last fall into place."]="I am grateful for your aid, champions. Now, Gul'dan's Horde will sweep across this world like a locust swarm, and all my designs, all my carefully-laid plans will at last fall into place."
G["I am grateful for your assistance and sacrifice in this matter, $n."]="Agradeço seu entrega neste assunto, $n."
G["I am grateful, friend.  Let me fight by your side."]="Te estou muito agradecido. Deixe-me lutar ao seu lado."
G["I am gravely disappointed. Again you have made me unleash my dogs of war."]="Estou profundamente decepcionado. Uma vez mais me faz liberar aos cães de guerra."
G["I am greatly indebted to you, $c. Perhaps I can help your cause."]="Estou em dívida com você, $c. Talvez possa ajudar você no seu causa."
G["I am growing amazing crystals from these waters.  For catalysts, I must have more Apexis shards!"]="I am growing amazing crystals from these waters.  For catalysts, I must have more Apexis shards!"
G["I am growing tired of this High Executor Mavren! We dare not pull the Farstriders off of the eastern border and he knows it! He also knows that Dame Auriferous is in full agreement with me on this matter. Until she says otherwise, we stay put. That's all, farstrider, dismissed."]="I am growing tired of this High Executor Mavren! We dare not pull the Farstriders off of the eastern border and he knows it! He also knows that Dame Auriferous is in full agreement with me on this matter. Until she says otherwise, we stay put. That's all, farstrider, dismissed."
G["I am happy to talk with another qualified Goblin Engineer!   So many Goblin Engineers learn how to make the Dimension Ripper and then we never hear from them again.  Puzzling."]="I am happy to talk with another qualified Goblin Engineer!   So many Goblin Engineers learn how to make the Dimension Ripper and then we never hear from them again.  Puzzling."
G["I am happy with our success at Osul Peak. I consider this a successful campaign."]="I am happy with our success at Osul Peak. I consider this a successful campaign."
G["I am he that carries out the Warchief's commands without question. I am Horde."]="Eu sou aquele que executa as ordens do Chefe Guerreiro sem questionar. Eu sou a Horda."
G["I am he that watches they. I am the fist of retribution. That which does quell the recalcitrant. Dare you defy the Warchief? Dare you face my merciless judgement?"]="Eu sou aquele que os observa. Eu sou o punho da retribuição. Aquilo que reprime o recalcitrante. Você se atreve a desafiar o Chefe Guerreiro? Você se atreve a enfrentar o meu julgamento impiedoso?"
G["I am here at the behest of Nexus-Prince Haramad. Strange things are afoot at the Stormspire."]="Estou aqui a mando do príncipe Nexus Haramad. Coisas estranhas estão acontecendo no Stormspire."
G["I am here at the behest of my master, Baron Sablemane, to help the Cenarion Expedition with its wyrmcult problems.\n\nI'm something of an expert on these things."]="I am here at the behest of my master, Baron Sablemane, to help the Cenarion Expedition with its wyrmcult problems.\n\nI'm something of an expert on these things."
G["I am here for training."]="Estou aqui para treinar."
G["I am here for you, overseer."]="Estou aqui por você, superintendente."
G["I am here on Sorrem's errand, You are to call Furien's dragonhawk for me."]="I am here on Sorrem's errand, You are to call Furien's dragonhawk for me."
G["I am here to assist and defend you.\n\nHow next shall we strike at the enemy?"]="Estou aqui para ajudar e defenda.\n\nComo vamos atacar ao inimigo?"
G["I am here to bear witness to the memory of my master, and the truth of the past."]="Estou aqui para testemunhar a memória do meu mestre e a verdade do passado."
G["I am here to do my master's bidding, no matter what the cost. A little girl's life hangs in the balance and what could be more important?"]="Estou aqui para fazer a licitação do meu mestre, independentemente do custo. A vida de uma garotinha está na balança e o que poderia ser mais importante?"
G["I am here to give thanks to the one that saved my life."]="Estou aqui para dar as Obrigado a quem me salvou a vida."
G["I am here to help you defeat the poisoner of my people!"]="Estou aqui para ajudar você a derrotar ao envenenador de meu povo!"
G["I am here to save you, friend!"]="I am here to save you, friend!"
G["I am here with Ban Bearheart, and we demand an audience with Taran Zhu!"]="I am here with Ban Bearheart, and we demand an audience with Taran Zhu!"
G["I am here!"]="Aqui estou!"
G["I am here!  And the Irondeep Mine is... MINE!"]="Estou aqui! E a Mina Ferrofundo é... MINHA!"
G["I am here!  Come face me, if you dare!"]="Aqui estou! Venha e Enfrente a mim se te atreve!"
G["I am here!  Now, puny little worms, you will pay for your intrusion!"]="I am here!  Now, puny little worms, you will pay for your intrusion!"
G["I am here!  Your rule of this land is over!"]="Aqui estou! Seu reinado nesta terra chegou ao seu fim!"
G["I am here, Anren!"]="Estou aqui, Anren!"
G["I am holding the other mogu from entering the palace steps. Hurry!"]="I am holding the other mogu from entering the palace steps. Hurry!"
G["I am honored by your presence, $t lord : lady; $n."]="Seu presença me honra, $t senhor: senhora; $n."
G["I am honored to fight alongside you."]="É uma honra lutar ao seu lado."
G["I am honored to make your acquaintance."]="Tenho a honra de conhecê-o."
G["I am honored to share my knowledge with you, $n. See that you use it well."]="É uma honra compartilhar com você meu conhecimento, $n. Procura usá bem."
G["I am honored, warchief.  But I feel unprepared for the life of a ruler."]="I am honored, warchief.  But I feel unprepared for the life of a ruler."
G["I am hungry"]="Tenho fome"
G["I am impressed that pine tree branches don't seem to damage our ship much.\n\nNot that it excuses the three times we've crashed into some forest."]="I am impressed that pine tree branches don't seem to damage our ship much.\n\nNot that it excuses the three times we've crashed into some forest."
G["I am impressed, hero. Thank you for helping me subdue this...druid. I can take this heretic back on my own."]="I am impressed, hero. Thank you for helping me subdue this...druid. I can take this heretic back on my own."
G["I am in charge of recruitment for the Frostwolf Clan. As a soldier of Frostwolf, it is your responsibility to check in with me as your rank among the clan rises.\n\nHonor and respect are earned on this frigid field."]="I am in charge of recruitment for the Frostwolf Clan. As a soldier of Frostwolf, it is your responsibility to check in with me as your rank among the clan rises.\n\nHonor and respect are earned on this frigid field."
G["I am in need of training, Keryn."]="Estou precisando de treinamento, Keryn."
G["I am in need of training."]="Eu preciso de treinamento."
G["I am in pain, but it warms my heart that Liu Lang's grandchildren have not forgotten me."]="A pesar do dor, me cheia de felicidade saber que os filhos de Liu Lang não me têm esquecido."
G["I am in search of a great and powerful Warlock."]="Estou à procura de um grande e poderoso bruxo."
G["I am in your debt, $n. I had begun to think I would die in this overgrown nest!"]="I am in your debt, $n. I had begun to think I would die in this overgrown nest!"
G["I am in your debt, friend."]="Estou em dívida com você, colega."
G["I am in your debt, friend. Thank you for my life."]="I am in your debt, friend. Thank you for my life."
G["I am in your debt, stranger."]="I am in your debt, stranger."
G["I am in your debt."]="Estou em dívida com você."
G["I am in your debt. Please save the rest of my people."]="Estou em dívida com você. Por favor, salva ao resto de meu povo."
G["I am interested in alchemy training."]="Quisiera receber treinamento em alquimia."
G["I am interested in death knight training."]="Me interesse a treinamento de cavaleiro da Morte."
G["I am interested in mage training."]="Estou interessado em treinamento de mago."
G["I am interested in tailor training."]="I am interested in tailor training."
G["I am interested in warlock training."]="Estou interessado no treinamento de bruxos."
G["I am invincible!"]="Sou invencível!"
G["I am just glad my wife, spirits guide her, is not around to see our business overrun by these ruffians and hoodlums!"]="I am just glad my wife, spirits guide her, is not around to see our business overrun by these ruffians and hoodlums!"
G["I am just keeping my eyes open, $c. No harm in that.\n\nIf you have any news for me, I will pass it along. If not, you'd best keep moving."]="I am just keeping my eyes open, $c. No harm in that.\n\nIf you have any news for me, I will pass it along. If not, you'd best keep moving."
G["I am just saying... I bet his genes tell quite a story..."]="Somente digo que... certo que seus genes poderiam contar muitas histórias..."
G["I am kidding!"]="Era broma!"
G["I am knowledgable, but I am not an expert. You know who you should talk to? Rhiannon! She's not far. Ask around for her in Undercity"]="Sou qualificado, mas não sou especiapronta. Você sabe com quem deveria conversar? Rhiannon! Ela não está longe. Pergunte por ela no Undercity"
G["I am known as a Lorewalker - a kind of historian for my people."]="Sou o que chamam um \"eremita\"; uma espécie de historiador para meu povo."
G["I am learning how to slap the pain out of someone. How neat is that?"]="Estou aprendendo a tirar o dor à gente. Que você acha?"
G["I am listening, Demitrian."]="Estou ouvindo, Demitrian."
G["I am listening, dragon."]="Eu estou ouvindo, dragão."
G["I am looking for some bodyguards that would like to protect the Gizelton Caravan. We are stopped on the road east of Kormek's Hut, north of Kolkar Centaur Village."]="I am looking for some bodyguards that would like to protect the Gizelton Caravan. We are stopped on the road east of Kormek's Hut, north of Kolkar Centaur Village."
G["I am looking forward to this: The White Tiger is the embodiment of strength in Pandaria!"]="I am looking forward to this: The White Tiger is the embodiment of strength in Pandaria!"
G["I am losing patience, Shan Kien. Tell me where I can find the Divine Bell!"]="Estou perdendo a paciência, Shan Kien. Diga onde está a Sino divina!"
G["I am lost..."]="Estou perdido..."
G["I am made anew!"]="E nascido novamente!"
G["I am merely one of... infinite multitudes."]="Somente sou um dos... infinitas multitudes."
G["I am missing a piece of my Augur's Regalia and I need a replacement."]="I am missing a piece of my Augur's Regalia and I need a replacement."
G["I am more alive now than I ever was as a human. THIS is life, $n. This is living!"]="Agora me sinto muito mais vivo que quando era humano. ISTO é vida, $n. Isto é vida!"
G["I am more powerful than ever!"]="Tenho mais poder que nunca!"
G["I am more than Forsaken... more than a man... I am something new. Something... else."]="Sou mais que um Renegado... Sou mais que um homem... Sou algo novo. Algo... diferente."
G["I am most grateful for your help, $c!"]="Te agradeço muito sua ajuda, $c!"
G["I am new to the burdens of leadership. I should've seen Narkrall's insubordination coming. Instead I am cleaning up his mess.\n\nI don't know how Garrosh Hellscream does it. He must possess great strength to hold together a force as diverse as the Horde... I should like to know him more."]="I am new to the burdens of leadership. I should've seen Narkrall's insubordination coming. Instead I am cleaning up his mess.\n\nI don't know how Garrosh Hellscream does it. He must possess great strength to hold together a force as diverse as the Horde... I should like to know him more."
G["I am no cultist, you monster!  Come to me and face your destruction!"]="Eu não sou cultista, seu monstro! Venha a mim e enfrente sua destruição!"
G["I am no longer a mantid. I am something... more."]="Já não sou um mántide. Sou algo... mais."
G["I am no mere dragon. You will find that I am much, much more."]="I am no mere dragon. You will find that I am much, much more."
G["I am no visitor, I am Chen Storm-"]="Não estou de visite, sou Chen Cerveja..."
G["I am no warrior, but I, too, will help defend Paw'don Village!"]="I am no warrior, but I, too, will help defend Paw'don Village!"
G["I am not Zan - I am Chen Stormstout!"]="Não sou Zan, sou Chen Cerveja de Trovão!"
G["I am not a fan of that d-block place everyone keeps talking about it.  We do have some tasks that must be completed before we can use it though."]="Eu não sou fã daquele lugar do bloco D que tudo mundo continua falando sobre isso. Temos algumas tarefas que precisam ser concluídas antes de podermos usá-o."
G["I am not alone."]="Não estou sozinha."
G["I am not authorized to answer that question.  I am, however, permitted to offer you a suggestion:\n\nSeek out Brann Bronzebeard.\n\nHe has already learned much of what there is to know about us, and he is teetering on the verge of another discovery.  Help him, and he may help you uncover the knowledge that you desire."]="I am not authorized to answer that question.  I am, however, permitted to offer you a suggestion:\n\nSeek out Brann Bronzebeard.\n\nHe has already learned much of what there is to know about us, and he is teetering on the verge of another discovery.  Help him, and he may help you uncover the knowledge that you desire."
G["I am not blind to their suffering, Lowan, but our mission here is to learn about what the cataclysm has wrought. Azeroth itself is suffering."]="I am not blind to their suffering, Lowan, but our mission here is to learn about what the cataclysm has wrought. Azeroth itself is suffering."
G["I am not fond of strangers, but I see great potential within you. Yes...you may be a most interesting student."]="Não me gostam os forasteiros, mas vejo muito potencial em ti. Sim... Vai ser $gun discípulo: uma discípula; do mais interessante."
G["I am not fooled by your disguise, temptress. Your time to die has come."]="I am not fooled by your disguise, temptress. Your time to die has come."
G["I am not giving up on you.  I don't have a cure for the Curse yet... but there are treatments.  You will have control again."]="I am not giving up on you.  I don't have a cure for the Curse yet... but there are treatments.  You will have control again."
G["I am not here because of honor, $n. I am here because of one orc's pride.\n\nIf I had not rejected Belgrom's offers, then I'm sure I'd still be in Orgrimmar taking care of real business.\n\nHis desire for women is not unknown to many of the female warriors in Durotar, but that doesn't stop him from being his charming self.\n\nHe's lucky he didn't pursue his desire for me much longer though--he'd be short more than just the digits on his hands."]="I am not here because of honor, $n. I am here because of one orc's pride.\n\nIf I had not rejected Belgrom's offers, then I'm sure I'd still be in Orgrimmar taking care of real business.\n\nHis desire for women is not unknown to many of the female warriors in Durotar, but that doesn't stop him from being his charming self.\n\nHe's lucky he didn't pursue his desire for me much longer though--he'd be short more than just the digits on his hands."
G["I am not here to harm you, Kharan. Gor'shak sent me. He told me that you would speak to me about the Princess."]="Não estou aqui para prejudicá-o, Kharan. Gor'shak me enviou. Ele disse para mim que você falaria comigo sobre a princesa."
G["I am not interested in excuses. Perhaps they gave you a name?"]="I am not interested in excuses. Perhaps they gave you a name?"
G["I am not possessed of infinite patience! I came here to prove myself, and that is exactly what I intend to do!"]="I am not possessed of infinite patience! I came here to prove myself, and that is exactly what I intend to do!"
G["I am not slave labor... my patience wears thin."]="Não sou um escravo... meu paciência se fica exausto."
G["I am not some simple jester! I am Nielas Aran!"]="I am not some simple jester! I am Nielas Aran!"
G["I am not speaking solely of the children of our enemies..."]="I am not speaking solely of the children of our enemies..."
G["I am not surprised. The Horde are monsters!"]="Não me surpreende. A Horda são monstros!"
G["I am not the only one who is here to report a disappearance. There are others, many others."]="Não sou o único que tem vindo para informar de uma desaparição. Há mais, muitos mais."
G["I am not worthy, sir."]="Não sou digno, senhor."
G["I am nothing, I am no one, I am weak.\n\nI am nothing, I am no one, I am weak.\n\nI am nothing..."]="Não sou nada. Estou somente. Sou fraco.\n\nNão sou nada. Não sou ninguém. Sou fraco.\n\nNão sou nada..."
