G["I am the serpent king! I can do anything!"]="Sou o rei serpente! Posso obrar a meu vontade!"
G["I am the sole protector of this village. My name is Chut Sri Nu.\n\nI bid you welcome, but know that my meditation has shown me that your travels here will bring great change to this land. Let us both hope that you leave Pandaria better off than you found it."]="I am the sole protector of this village. My name is Chut Sri Nu.\n\nI bid you welcome, but know that my meditation has shown me that your travels here will bring great change to this land. Let us both hope that you leave Pandaria better off than you found it."
G["I am the weapon of kings! What makes you think you have a chance?"]="Sou o arma dos reis! Que os há pensar que têm a mais mínimo possibilidade?"
G["I am to bomb Astranaar! Captain Goggath's orders."]="Vou bombardear Astranaar! Ordens do Capitão Goggath."
G["I am to hunt the Crucible of Nazsharin. Do you have warriors to assist me?"]="Vou caçar o Crisol de Nazsharin. Tem guerreiros que me possam ajudar?"
G["I am to keep a close watch over the camp."]="Tenho que vigilar de perto o acampamento."
G["I am told Pilgrim's Bounty is a time to reflect upon one's good fortune and share with all around you.\n\nWe are lucky to have found this world and its bold inhabitants; it is only fitting that we lend our knowledge and strength to these new-found allies."]="Me têm contado que a Generosidade do Peregrino é uma época para reflexionar aproxima da sorte que temos e compartilhar coisas com os que nos cercam.\n\nTemos sorte de haver encontrado este mundo e aos seus audaces habitantes, e o correto seria compartilhar nossos conhecimentos e força com estes novos aliados."
G["I am told that Godfrey snapped when he learned of his king's affliction. Could you imagine the sense of betrayal he must have felt? His own king one of the very beasts that he spent his existence killing?"]="I am told that Godfrey snapped when he learned of his king's affliction. Could you imagine the sense of betrayal he must have felt? His own king one of the very beasts that he spent his existence killing?"
G["I am told that the dust and heat of Hellfire Peninsula is quite irritating... I would not know, but I will trust my esteemed, and still living, allies."]="Disseram-me que o pó e o calor da Península Fogo do Inferno são bastante irritantes... Eu não saberia, mas vou confiar nos meus estimados e ainda vivos aliados."
G["I am told you were a guest of the forest hozen and survived. I suspect we will see interesting things from you in the coming days.\n\nI welcome you, traveller, to our humble home."]="I am told you were a guest of the forest hozen and survived. I suspect we will see interesting things from you in the coming days.\n\nI welcome you, traveller, to our humble home."
G["I am too far... The link... is lost..."]="Estou demais longe... O vínculo... se perdeu..."
G["I am too quick, too clever."]="Sou demais rápido, demais pronto."
G["I am truly blessed to have so many loyal and dedicated apprentices. My work would be impossible without this influx of test subjects."]="Sou verdadeiramente abençoado por ter tantos aprendizes leais e dedicados. Meu trabalho seria impossível sem esse afluxo de sujeitos de teste."
G["I am truly impressed, Gerard. I thought you were all talk, but I see I have been proven wrong."]="I am truly impressed, Gerard. I thought you were all talk, but I see I have been proven wrong."
G["I am truly in your debt, strangers."]="Estou em verdadeira dívida com vocês."
G["I am truly sorry, $c, but as your spirit has never before experienced the horrors that lie in wait within the burning wreck of Stratholme, our magic cannot carry you to the city."]="I am truly sorry, $c, but as your spirit has never before experienced the horrors that lie in wait within the burning wreck of Stratholme, our magic cannot carry you to the city."
G["I am trying to learn how to heal. The problem is you have to get hurt before you can be healed."]="I am trying to learn how to heal. The problem is you have to get hurt before you can be healed."
G["I am unable to assist you."]="Não posso ajudar você."
G["I am unable to process your chronological reference in comparison to the recording of this data, my apologies.\n\nThe trogg retains some composition of Azeroth's various stone core compounds, but the loss of cognitive power makes this variant unacceptable to the Creators.\n\nThe trogg procreates as per a standard biomass.  By default it consumes stone and anything else it can acquire, including other troggs.  Cannibalism is considered unacceptable by the Creators."]="I am unable to process your chronological reference in comparison to the recording of this data, my apologies.\n\nThe trogg retains some composition of Azeroth's various stone core compounds, but the loss of cognitive power makes this variant unacceptable to the Creators.\n\nThe trogg procreates as per a standard biomass.  By default it consumes stone and anything else it can acquire, including other troggs.  Cannibalism is considered unacceptable by the Creators."
G["I am unable to process your chronological reference in comparison to the recording of this data, my apologies.\n\nThough the dwarf maintains most of the Earthen's mental attunement to Azeroth's stone composition, the reversion back into living biomass remains the main degeneration of the matrix.  Dwarves eat and procreate through means typical to other standard biomasses.\n\nThe Creators view the dwarf as an acceptable variant, worthy of genesis in its own right."]="I am unable to process your chronological reference in comparison to the recording of this data, my apologies.\n\nThough the dwarf maintains most of the Earthen's mental attunement to Azeroth's stone composition, the reversion back into living biomass remains the main degeneration of the matrix.  Dwarves eat and procreate through means typical to other standard biomasses.\n\nThe Creators view the dwarf as an acceptable variant, worthy of genesis in its own right."
G["I am unable to teach a Tauren to ride a Skeletal Mount.  I am sorry but there is nothing I can do for you."]="I am unable to teach a Tauren to ride a Skeletal Mount.  I am sorry but there is nothing I can do for you."
G["I am unable to train you."]="I am unable to train you."
G["I am under assault! Assist me!"]="Me atacando! Ajude-me!"
G["I am uneasy, old friend."]="Estou inquieto, velho amigo."
G["I am unimpressed."]="I am unimpressed."
G["I am unstoppable!"]="I am unstoppable!"
G["I am unstoppable."]="I am unstoppable."
G["I am untouchable!"]="Eu sou intocável!"
G["I am unworthy of this conversation, $G Master:Mistress;."]="Não sou digno desta conversa, $gMaestro: Mestra;."
G["I am unworthy, $g sir:ma'am;."]="Não sou digno de elho, $gsenhor: senhora;."
G["I am unworthy, master!"]="Não sou digno!"
G["I am unworthy, son of Durotan. We are all unworthy..."]="Não sou digno, filho de Durotan. Ninguém é digno..."
G["I am victorious!"]="Vitória para mim!"
G["I am well aware that the demonic presence in this forest can be considered the fault of my kind.\n\nI am also not the first Highborne to attempt to make amends for this, and I thank the Emerald Circle for being pragmatic enough to allow my help."]="I am well aware that the demonic presence in this forest can be considered the fault of my kind.\n\nI am also not the first Highborne to attempt to make amends for this, and I thank the Emerald Circle for being pragmatic enough to allow my help."
G["I am well versed in over 4 languages."]="Domino mais de quatro idiomas."
G["I am willing to try but I will require instruction."]="Estou disposto a tentar, mas exigirei instruções."
G["I am willing, Kalecgos. I shall cast Tarecgosa's vote on her behalf."]="I am willing, Kalecgos. I shall cast Tarecgosa's vote on her behalf."
G["I am with you until I gasp my last dying breath."]="Estarei com você até meu último fôlego de vida."
G["I am with you!"]="Estou com vocês!"
G["I am with you, Tholo!"]="Estou com você, Tholo!"
G["I am with you, Thrall."]="Estou com você, Thrall."
G["I am without limits here. The rules of your cherished reality do not apply. In this realm, I am in control!"]="I am without limits here. The rules of your cherished reality do not apply. In this realm, I am in control!"
G["I am working with Seedkeeper Shing Sing to develop more efficient methods of farming, harvesting, and storage. Delicious, fresh, high-quality produce is what the Tillers aim to deliver!"]="I am working with Seedkeeper Shing Sing to develop more efficient methods of farming, harvesting, and storage. Delicious, fresh, high-quality produce is what the Tillers aim to deliver!"
G["I am worried about Tholo."]="Estou preocupado por Tholo."
G["I am yak rider. And this is my yak."]="I am yak rider. And this is my yak."
G["I am yet a great warrior, do not toy with me, skeleton."]="I am yet a great warrior, do not toy with me, skeleton."
G["I am your death!"]="Sou seu morte!"
G["I am your doom, Valduran!"]="Valduran, sou seu perdição!"
G["I am your master."]="Sou seu senhor."
G["I am your tauren sister, taunka. Our blood is the same, and because of this no harm will come to you now. You are safe."]="I am your tauren sister, taunka. Our blood is the same, and because of this no harm will come to you now. You are safe."
G["I am yours to command, my king!"]="I am yours to command, my king!"
G["I am yours to command."]="Estou aos seus ordens."
G["I am, am I?  Well what have you got for the new big dog of Gordok, Fengus?"]="O sou, o sou? Bom... Que tem para o novo cão de Gordok, Fengus?"
G["I am. What is it that I can do for you?"]="Sim. O que posso fazer por você?"
G["I am... a tauren... of the SEA!"]="Sou um... tauren... de MAR!"
G["I am... alive..."]="Estou... vivo..."
G["I am... alone."]="Estou... somente."
G["I am... bested."]="Me... vocês... superado..."
G["I am... finished."]="E... terminado."
G["I am... finished...."]="Estou... acabada..."
G["I am... humbled."]="Eu fico... lisonjeado."
G["I am... invinc--"]="Sou... Inven..."
G["I am... released."]="Sou... livre."
G["I am... released?"]="Sou... livre?"
G["I am... renewed."]="Estou... renovado."
G["I am... weary. You must carry on without me. I shall take my leave once my strength has returned."]="I am... weary. You must carry on without me. I shall take my leave once my strength has returned."
G["I and my family fell victim to this place what seems like ages ago.\n\nLet our fate serve as a warning to those who would meddle in necromancy.\n\nHelp me to lift the curse, $c. Destroy Darkmaster Gandling."]="I and my family fell victim to this place what seems like ages ago.\n\nLet our fate serve as a warning to those who would meddle in necromancy.\n\nHelp me to lift the curse, $c. Destroy Darkmaster Gandling."
G["I apologize for taking so long to get here. I wanted Lady Proudmoore to be present also."]="I apologize for taking so long to get here. I wanted Lady Proudmoore to be present also."
G["I apologize for the deception, but it was necessary."]="Eu peço desculpas pelo engodo, mas foi necessário."
G["I apologize for the mess. Things are a little hectic right now.\n\nHow can I be of service to you?"]="I apologize for the mess. Things are a little hectic right now.\n\nHow can I be of service to you?"
G["I apologize in advance for the beating you are about to suffer."]="I apologize in advance for the beating you are about to suffer."
G["I apologize, $c. I mistook you for someone with a spine. Begone; our secrets are not for untrained ears."]="O lamento, $c. Te confundí com alguém com coragem. Vá embora; nossos segredos não são para ouvidos inexpertos."
G["I apologize, emissary, but the prince is away on an errand. What brings you to this desolate place?"]="Sinto muito, emissário, mas o Príncipe tem saindo. Que te traz a este desolado lugar?"
G["I appear to have lost my ring."]="Parece que e perdido meu anel."
G["I appreciate that your wife led us here, old friend, but she chose a poor time to have a child."]="I appreciate that your wife led us here, old friend, but she chose a poor time to have a child."
G["I appreciate the company, $n."]="I appreciate the company, $n."
G["I appreciate the company, but let's face it: you have more experience with potions than I do. Talk to Doctor Marsh instead if you want training. He's a Forsaken in the Apothecarium of the Undercity."]="Eu aprecio a empresa, mas vamos ser sinceros: você tem mais experiência com poções do que eu. Converse com o doutor Marsh, se quiser treinamento. Ele é um Deixado no Boticário da Cidade Baixa."
G["I appreciate your help defending the wildlife here. Hopefully we're not too late."]="Aprecio sua ajuda para defenda a fauna local. Espero que não seja tarde demais."
G["I appreciate your help in this. We never would have suspected Saean as a sympathizer - we just weren't prepared for this."]="I appreciate your help in this. We never would have suspected Saean as a sympathizer - we just weren't prepared for this."
G["I approached my sniper rifle and took aim at the jinyu village."]="Cogí meu rifle de atirador de elite e apunté até a aldeia jinyu."
G["I ask for vrykul to kill them, yet all I get are feeble whelps! By Ymiron, SLAUGHTER THEM!"]="I ask for vrykul to kill them, yet all I get are feeble whelps! By Ymiron, SLAUGHTER THEM!"
G["I ask myself that question everyday..."]="Me pergunto o mesmo cada dia..."
G["I asked Malfurion of this, and he said that the city recently suffered a great tragedy.  That one of the leaders was taken away and that lives were lost."]="I asked Malfurion of this, and he said that the city recently suffered a great tragedy.  That one of the leaders was taken away and that lives were lost."
G["I asked for reinforcements to help us hold the beach. And the Horde sent these tiny little men and their small metal tubes.\n\n<Gralok eyes the nearby goblins with disdain.>"]="I asked for reinforcements to help us hold the beach. And the Horde sent these tiny little men and their small metal tubes.\n\n<Gralok eyes the nearby goblins with disdain.>"
G["I asked you: Who is the soul of the Horde?"]="Eu perguntei a você: quem é a alma da Horda?"
G["I assume you are here about the dragon turtles, child?"]="I assume you are here about the dragon turtles, child?"
G["I assume you are here about the dragon turtles, child?  I am sorry.  I cannot help you until you prove yourself a loyal ally of my people."]="I assume you are here about the dragon turtles, child?  I am sorry.  I cannot help you until you prove yourself a loyal ally of my people."
G["I assume you have heard of the hole by now, $r.  If not, you are going to know a whole lot about it soon."]="I assume you have heard of the hole by now, $r.  If not, you are going to know a whole lot about it soon."
G["I assume you want something."]="Eu suponho que você quer alguma coisa."
G["I assure you $p is the best fighter I've ever seen. $GHe:She; will be able to help better prepare your village."]="I assure you $p is the best fighter I've ever seen. $GHe:She; will be able to help better prepare your village."
G["I assure you this much, Quimby, you won't be getting my vote next term!"]="I assure you this much, Quimby, you won't be getting my vote next term!"
G["I assure you, overseer, the Royal Apothecary Society dearly wishes to make up for the tragic misguidance which ended so many lives."]="I assure you, overseer, the Royal Apothecary Society dearly wishes to make up for the tragic misguidance which ended so many lives."
G["I ate a Lovely Apple once. It was delishioush.\n\n<Jogu stares blankly into the distance, as if he's lost his train of thought.>"]="I ate a Lovely Apple once. It was delishioush.\n\n<Jogu stares blankly into the distance, as if he's lost his train of thought.>"
G["I await a challenger."]="Estou esperando um oponente."
G["I barely have any supplies for upgrades."]="Mal tenho suprimentos para atualizações."
G["I barely survived the shipwreck..."]="Quase não sobrevivo ao naufrágio..."
G["I bask in the twilight."]="Me deleito no crepúsculo."
G["I be Tolwe. Job be to keep da peace an' watch. So I be watchin'."]="Eu sou Tolwe. O trabalho é manter a paz e vigiar. Então eu estou assistindo."
G["I be Vol'jin, Son of Sen'jin, here ta ask your aid, o great Bwonsamdi."]="I be Vol'jin, Son of Sen'jin, here ta ask your aid, o great Bwonsamdi."
G["I be a messenger from the Eastern Kingdoms, $n. I be sent here to make sure da priests who travel here be given proper direction."]="I be a messenger from the Eastern Kingdoms, $n. I be sent here to make sure da priests who travel here be given proper direction."
G["I be an emissary from da Darkspear trolls.  Da threat we face, also be a threat to da Alliance.  You willin' to help out da Darkspear, $r?"]="I be an emissary from da Darkspear trolls.  Da threat we face, also be a threat to da Alliance.  You willin' to help out da Darkspear, $r?"
G["I be da predator! You da prey..."]="Eu sou o predador! Vocês a presa..."
G["I be gettin' tired'a dis. Dese elves, dey be treatin' me like I stole somet'in'."]="I be gettin' tired'a dis. Dese elves, dey be treatin' me like I stole somet'in'."
G["I be goin' now; time ta find a new home for me soul."]="Agora me vou. É hora de procurar um novo lar pa' minha alma."
G["I be healin', mon.  I don't have no special shape."]="I be healin', mon.  I don't have no special shape."
G["I be hearin' ya an' I think ya not be my captors. Come closer so I be seein' ya."]="Te ouvi e acho que não formas parte de meus captores. Aproxime-se para que possa ver você."
G["I be jammon wit' you, $n!"]="Já me e cansado, $n!"
G["I be losin' me patience! Go on: make dem wish dey was never born!"]="I be losin' me patience! Go on: make dem wish dey was never born!"
G["I be movin' to de groove; ya be movin' to de grave!"]="I be movin' to de groove; ya be movin' to de grave!"
G["I be needin' worthy underlings in Zul'Drak, mon. Ones ready to wield real power."]="Preciso e'hbirros dignos em Zul'Drak, colega. Uns que estejam preparados para empunhar verdadeiro poder."
G["I be one o' da Darkspear scouts. Kill dat Amani priest so I can return wit' my report!"]="I be one o' da Darkspear scouts. Kill dat Amani priest so I can return wit' my report!"
G["I be one of da first to answer Vol'jin's call to arms. Will you be joinin' us?"]="Sou o primeiro a responder ao chamado de Vol'jin. Você vai se juntar a nós?"
G["I be seeking someone, $c. Please, leave me be... it is important I find them."]="I be seeking someone, $c. Please, leave me be... it is important I find them."
G["I be stabbin' first and askin' later!"]="Primeiro apunhalar e deh'pués perguntar!"
G["I be thinkin' you don't know where to find mah bruddas, mon."]="Estava pensando que você não sabe onde encontrar a meus irmãos, colega."
G["I be waitin, strangers. Your deaths gonna make me stronger!"]="Estou esperando, forasteiros. Suas mortes me tomarão mais forte!"
G["I bear witness to a miracle that stands before me! In one thousand years of captivity, I have not seen a single LIVING specimen - other than those foul Qiraji and silithid - enter these chambers."]="Presto testemunho de um milagre que está diante de mim! Em mil anos de cativeiro, não vi um único espécime LIVING - além daqueles imundos Qiraji e silitídeos - entrando nessas câmaras."
G["I bear your presence only as a kindness to our new allies. Don't push me, human."]="Somente tolero seu presença por respeito a nossos novos aliados. Não me provoques, humana."
G["I beat up three orcs and a tauren last night, all without breaking a nail."]="I beat up three orcs and a tauren last night, all without breaking a nail."
G["I become ONE... with the VOID!"]="Me FUNDO... com o VAZIO!"
G["I been waitin' a long time for a chance to avenge my father. A great weight has been lifted from my shoulders."]="I been waitin' a long time for a chance to avenge my father. A great weight has been lifted from my shoulders."
G["I been waitin' all day for this!"]="Levo tudo o dia esperando isto!"
G["I been waiting to do again for so long!"]="E esperado tanto para voltar a fazer isso!"
G["I beg to differ."]="Lamento discrepar."
G["I beg you, $r, be swift. They will not stop pursuing me! I cannot escape from them, even here!"]="I beg you, $r, be swift. They will not stop pursuing me! I cannot escape from them, even here!"
G["I beg you, death knight!  Keep your minion away from me!  I'll do anything!"]="I beg you, death knight!  Keep your minion away from me!  I'll do anything!"
G["I beg you, mortals - FLEE! Flee before I lose all sense of control! The black fire rages within my heart! I MUST- release it!"]="I beg you, mortals - FLEE! Flee before I lose all sense of control! The black fire rages within my heart! I MUST- release it!"
G["I beg you... no more."]="I beg you... no more."
G["I beg your mercy, my lord."]="Suplico clemência, meu senhor."
G["I began to fear that no help would come. That everyone had forgotten me. Thank the Order that they sent you!"]="I began to fear that no help would come. That everyone had forgotten me. Thank the Order that they sent you!"
G["I believe Aldwin Laughlin is still the resident Guild Master of Stormwind.  Look for his residence on your left as you pass the inner gate of Stormwind."]="Acredito que Aldwin Laughlin ainda é o residente do Clã Mestre de Ventobravo. Procure a residência dele à sua esquerda enquanto passa pelo portões interno de Ventobravo."
G["I believe I can explain everything to you two if you give me a moment of your time."]="Acho que posso explicároslo tudo se me dais um segundo."
G["I believe I heard some young whipper snapper in my garden out back.  Let's go look for him."]="I believe I heard some young whipper snapper in my garden out back.  Let's go look for him."
G["I believe I may recognize them.  Deal with this quickly, Sharth.  Then take the mana bomb and destroy their town!"]="I believe I may recognize them.  Deal with this quickly, Sharth.  Then take the mana bomb and destroy their town!"
G["I believe I misplaced that banner you enchanted for me, Falrin."]="Acredito ter extraviado aquele banner que você encantou para mim, Falrin."
G["I believe I noticed a new shipment of mail being delivered not too long ago.  You'll find the mailbox just outside the Thunder Bluff Bank on the lower rise."]="Acredito que notei uma nova remessa de correspondência sendo entregue há não muito tempo. Você encontrará a caixa de correio do lado de fosse do Thunder Bluff Bank, na subida mais baixa."
G["I believe I was showing my motorcycle to some hot babes at the time."]="I believe I was showing my motorcycle to some hot babes at the time."
G["I believe I'll try the merlot this time."]="I believe I'll try the merlot this time."
G["I believe Simone was looking for you earlier, $n. Have you spoken with her yet?"]="Acho que Simone te estava procurando antes, $n. Já tem falado com ela?"
G["I believe Thunderwing here is our opportunity to score a devastating blow against Lei Shen."]="I believe Thunderwing here is our opportunity to score a devastating blow against Lei Shen."
G["I believe in you, Gobbles!"]="Eu acredito em você, Gluglu!"
G["I believe in you."]="Eu acredito em você."
G["I believe it was on this very land that a young Durotan, barely into adolescence, killed his first talbuk. Ah, I can still remember him recanting that tale for us at the springtime festival."]="I believe it was on this very land that a young Durotan, barely into adolescence, killed his first talbuk. Ah, I can still remember him recanting that tale for us at the springtime festival."
G["I believe that I shall feast upon both $r and ogre flesh tonight."]="Acho que esta noite me darei um banquete de carne de $r e ogro."
G["I believe that the Alliance's future is tied to that of Pandaria.\n\nAfter we landed here, we set certain paths into motion. We were there when the Serpent's Heart fell. In a way, we helped fulfill Lorewalker Cho's vision of the future.\n\nBecause of this, I cannot return to Stormwind until I have helped to set things right."]="I believe that the Alliance's future is tied to that of Pandaria.\n\nAfter we landed here, we set certain paths into motion. We were there when the Serpent's Heart fell. In a way, we helped fulfill Lorewalker Cho's vision of the future.\n\nBecause of this, I cannot return to Stormwind until I have helped to set things right."
G["I believe that you're making my argument for me, but yes it would be nice if we had more reinforcements. I would counter that it would be faster to pull the Farstriders from their senseless skirmishing with the trolls."]="I believe that you're making my argument for me, but yes it would be nice if we had more reinforcements. I would counter that it would be faster to pull the Farstriders from their senseless skirmishing with the trolls."
G["I believe the Forsaken are misleading the allies of the Horde.... wait... I feel so... dizzy..."]="I believe the Forsaken are misleading the allies of the Horde.... wait... I feel so... dizzy..."
G["I believe the vision means for us to join together, $n."]="Acho que a visão quer dizer que nos unamos, $n."
G["I believe these are yours, Meara."]="I believe these are yours, Meara."
G["I believe this is the original power source he intended to offer the blood elves to free them from their addiction to the Sunwell... but for some reason he didn't let them near it..."]="Eu acredito que esta seja a fonte de energia original que ele pretendia oferecer aos Elfos Sangrentos para libertá-los de seu vício na Nascente do Sol... mas, por alguma razão, não deixou os elfos chegarem perto..."
G["I believe we may have finally found my father's Pools of Youth. We must gather as much information as we can for Tyrande."]="I believe we may have finally found my father's Pools of Youth. We must gather as much information as we can for Tyrande."
G["I believe you are up to this task... will you accept the challenge?"]="Eu acredito que você está nessa tarefa... você aceita o desafio?"
G["I believe you children are our future..."]="Acho que os crianças são nosso futuro..."
G["I believe you had a turtle prepared for me?"]="Acho que tem uma tartaruga preparada para mim?"
G["I beseech of you, my beloved subjects: Put an end to these miscreants."]="I beseech of you, my beloved subjects: Put an end to these miscreants."
G["I beseech you, kind strangers. Cleanse this place of their foul presence! Lay our stories to rest!"]="I beseech you, kind strangers. Cleanse this place of their foul presence! Lay our stories to rest!"
G["I bestow upon you the power that is our birthright... and more!"]="I bestow upon you the power that is our birthright... and more!"
G["I bet I could land exactly in the target."]="Apuesto a O que posso acertar no objetivo."
G["I bet I'll catch a big one this time..."]="I bet I'll catch a big one this time..."
G["I bet Illidan is a nice guy underneath.  He just needs a mama, too."]="Aposto que Illidan é um rosto legal por baixo. Ele só precisa de uma mãe também."
G["I bet Josetta would be more than happy to teach you some new spells.  She is probably up in her room at the Lion's Pride Inn."]="Aposto que Josetta ficaria mais do que feliz em ensinar-lhe algum novos feitiços. Ela provavelmente está no seu quarto no Lion's Pride Inn."
G["I bet Quae'll think this is important. She's pretty knowledgeable about these things--no expert, but knowledgeable."]="I bet Quae'll think this is important. She's pretty knowledgeable about these things--no expert, but knowledgeable."
G["I bet ice cream would taste better if it were socketed!"]="Aposto que o sorvete teria um sabor melhor se fosse encaixado!"
G["I bet if I keep winning, I'll get invited to fight in Stormwind one day!"]="Aposto que, se eu continuar vencendo, vão me convidar para lutar em Ventobravo algum dia!"
G["I bet if I stuck to the outskirts, I could zip in and out of the ruins, grab some relics, and dodge those statues."]="Certo que se não me acerco muito, poderá entrar nas ruínas, conseguir várias relíquias e esta a essas estátuas ao sair."
G["I bet my dad could beat you up. He's the biggest monk ever."]="I bet my dad could beat you up. He's the biggest monk ever."
G["I bet my friend Gruk would like this rock for the spear he is making! It's very sharp... I hope he likes it."]="Certo que a meu amigo Gruk lhe gostaria esta pedras para a lança O que está fazendo. É muito afilada... Espero que lhe guste."
G["I bet no one gets in her way."]="Apuesto a que ninguém se coloca no seu caminho."
G["I bet she likes her men hairy-chested. What am I supposed to do?"]="Certo que lhe gostam os homens com cabelo no peito. O que posso fazer?"
G["I bet the other clans can't even use magic anymore. What good could they be to the King!"]="I bet the other clans can't even use magic anymore. What good could they be to the King!"
G["I bet the turtle likes being close to the other animals."]="Apuesto a que à tartaruga lhe gosta estar perto de outros animais."
G["I bet this baby has got some real orcpower inside."]="Apuesto a que esta beleza tem algo de poder orc real no seu interior."
G["I bet with all these new people here, Celidh, you've got to have some pets you want me to move to the stables."]="Apuesto a que com toda esta gente nova por aqui, Celidh, terá algumas ajudantes que vai querer que leve ao estábulo."
G["I bet ya think you're tough, eh, kid? I guess I might have something for ya if ya can hold your own in the arena. Good stuff, not like Krixel's. That's so last season, ya know?\n\nOh, and have a nice day."]="Você acha muito duro eh? Talvez tenha algo para você se superas a arena. Bom materiais, não como o de Krixel. Isso é da temporada passada sabe?\n\nOh, e que tenha um bom dia."
G["I bet you I left it in the tent!"]="I bet you I left it in the tent!"
G["I bet you aren't even going to buy anything. Just like all the others."]="Certo que não vai comprar nada. Igual que todos os outros."
G["I bet you miss your neighbor.  I'll see if you can't join him soon enough."]="I bet you miss your neighbor.  I'll see if you can't join him soon enough."
G["I bet you never saw dis one comin'."]="Aposto que tu não contava com esta."
G["I bet you rotters thought you were pretty clever at the Wrath Gate, didn't you? Playtime's over. We're here to make sure you don't try anything."]="Aposto que os rotters pensaram que você era muito esperto no Wrath Gate, não é? A brincadeira acabou. Estamos aqui para garantir que você não tente nada."
G["I bet you wish you were undead about now."]="I bet you wish you were undead about now."
G["I bet you wonder where we get tall bird things for roast. Too bad, it secret."]="Apuesto a que te perguntas de onde sacamos pássaros altos para asar. Que pena, é um segredo."
G["I bet you're really strong, huh?  You could probably kick that bridge right in half if you wanted to!"]="Apuesto a que é muito forte, eh? Provavelmente poderia partir em dois esse ponte se te o propusieras!"
G["I bet you're sorry now, aren't you $n!?!"]="A que agorao lamentas, verdade, $n?"
G["I better be getting overtime for this."]="Mais lhes vale que me pagunas horas extra."
G["I better get a cut of those sales! Better yet, I'll just fry you up and take all of the profit for myself."]="I better get a cut of those sales! Better yet, I'll just fry you up and take all of the profit for myself."
G["I better get back to Nazgrim."]="Será melhor que fique com Nazgrim."
G["I better not pull up another of Reggy's boots again..."]="Espero não tirar outro par de botas de Reggy..."
G["I bid you welcome, $c."]="Dou a você a boas-vindas, $c."
G["I bid you welcome, $c. Rare do we have visitors down to these levels of the Apothecarium... unless of course there's something someone wants... or needs.\n\n<Chemist Coely laughs.>\n\nHow can I help you today, hmm?"]="Dou a você a boas-vindas, $c. Rara vez temos visitantes em estes níveis do Apothecarium... a menos que tengamos algo que alguém queira... ou precisa.\n\n<O químico Coely ri.>\n\nEm que te posso ajudar hoje, eh?"
G["I bleed... haha... but I won't die!"]="I bleed... haha... but I won't die!"
G["I bought food from this stall just yesterday and now my family's taken ill!"]="Logo ontem compré comida neste posto e agora meu família tem enfermado!"
G["I bow to your skill. You bested me fairly."]="I bow to your skill. You bested me fairly."
G["I break you!"]="I break you!"
G["I bring a gust so strong, it can knock down trees! Minions, assist me, they shall not do as they please!"]="Traigo um vento tão forte que pode derrubar árvores! Lacaios, ajudem-me, não devem fazer seu vontade!"
G["I bring bandages and food to the sick and injured. If only I could do more..."]="Traigo seda e comida para os enfermos e os feridos. Tomara pudesse fazer algo mais..."
G["I bring da pain!"]="Eu traigo o dor!"
G["I bring greetings from King Wrynn, $c. Behind me is the Hero's Call board, a collection of proclamations from the King of Stormwind directing adventurers to locations where their talents can best aid the Alliance."]="I bring greetings from King Wrynn, $c. Behind me is the Hero's Call board, a collection of proclamations from the King of Stormwind directing adventurers to locations where their talents can best aid the Alliance."
G["I bring treasures. Treasures from far away. Treasures from beyond the mountains... treasures from beyond the wall, even."]="Traigo tesouros. Tesouros desde muito longe. Tesouros desde além das montanhas... tesouros desde além do muralha, inclusive."
G["I bring word from Lord Illidan."]="Trago notícia do Lorde Illidan."
G["I bring word from the Regent Lord of Silvermoon."]="Traigo notícia do Senhor regente de Luaprata."
G["I bring you back from the brink of death, $Gbrother:sister;. We are in need of your aid!"]="I bring you back from the brink of death, $Gbrother:sister;. We are in need of your aid!"
G["I broke a covenant? I BROKE A COVENANT? What about that fool exarch and his avatar?"]="Que rompí um pacto? QUE EU ROMPÍ UM PACTO? E que há desse estúpido exarca e seu avatar?"
G["I brokes-ded it..."]="O e front..."
G["I brought enough bombs... for all of you!"]="E trazido bombas suficientes... para todos vocês!"
G["I brought my people here at Garrosh's request. Little did I realize we were to be sacrificed like pawns in a game."]="I brought my people here at Garrosh's request. Little did I realize we were to be sacrificed like pawns in a game."
G["I brought these monkeys some presents! Try not to blow me up, Amber!"]="I brought these monkeys some presents! Try not to blow me up, Amber!"
G["I brought you a housewarming gift, Jarl."]="Te e trazido um presente de boas-vindas, Jarl."
G["I brought you some hides, mud, and thread."]="I brought you some hides, mud, and thread."
G["I brought you something to eat."]="Te e trazido algo de comer."
G["I brought you your crossbow, Dad!"]="Te e trazido seu balhesta, papai!"
G["I buried my son today, Thalvos... And my spouse last week."]="Hoje e enterrado a meu filho Thalvos... E a semana passada a meu esposa."
G["I burn ya now!"]="I burn ya now!"
G["I burn... for all time..."]="Ardo... eternamente..."
G["I call 'er the Spirit of Gnomeregan. Isn't she a beaut? Without your help, she'd've never been restored."]="Eu chamo o Espírito de Gnomeregan. Ela não é uma beldade? Sem à sua ajuda, ela nunca teria sido restaurada."
G["I call and the spirits answer $r."]="I call and the spirits answer $r."
G["I call da storm!"]="I call da storm!"
G["I call her Betty. She's a beauty, eh?"]="A chamo Betty. É uma beleza, eh?"
G["I call that a good start."]="Isto começa bem."
G["I call this move \"The Snowplow!\""]="I call this move \"The Snowplow!\""
G["I call to you great spirits! Grant the Horde your blessing! For on this day our cause is righteous and just!"]="I call to you great spirits! Grant the Horde your blessing! For on this day our cause is righteous and just!"
G["I call upon the watersss of my homelands... DELIVER MY ENEMIES UNTO ME!"]="I call upon the watersss of my homelands... DELIVER MY ENEMIES UNTO ME!"
G["I call upon you, Kali."]="Eu escolho você, Kali."
G["I call your bluff.  You're a paladin after all.  Your obsession with redemption goes beyond the inane."]="I call your bluff.  You're a paladin after all.  Your obsession with redemption goes beyond the inane."
G["I call your true name, Azrethoc. Show your visage to me!"]="Te chamo pelo seu verdadeiro nome, Azrethoc. Ensénhame seu rosto!"
G["I came all the way from Dalaran, and this is the welcoming I get?"]="Venho desde Dalaran, e esta é a única boas-vindas que recibo?"
G["I came from Ironforge to help out with the rebuilding effort here. If I can teach enough of ye my skills then maybe I can leave it to ye and take myself back home."]="Eu vim da Ironforge para ajudar no esforço de reconstrução aqui. Se eu posso ensinar o suficiente sobre minhas habilidades, então talvez eu possa deixar isso para você e me levar de volta para casa."
G["I came here long ago to study our cursed brothers, in search of a way to cure their affliction.\n\nMagtoor welcomed me with open arms. Living here, he became my closest friend.\n\nAnd now, before my eyes, he is dying..."]="I came here long ago to study our cursed brothers, in search of a way to cure their affliction.\n\nMagtoor welcomed me with open arms. Living here, he became my closest friend.\n\nAnd now, before my eyes, he is dying..."
G["I came here to talk, but you mindless things tried to kill me instead!"]="E vindo aqui para falar, mas vocês, coisas descerebradas, vocês têm tentou me matar!"
G["I came out here to visit you, Jarl! And I find you living in an empty cabin in the middle of nowhere, babbling about frogs? You're hopeless!"]="I came out here to visit you, Jarl! And I find you living in an empty cabin in the middle of nowhere, babbling about frogs? You're hopeless!"
G["I came over here to see if we could open up trade with these naga. Their reply wasn't very nice."]="Eu vim aqui para ver se poderíamos abrir comércio com essas nagas. A resposta deles não foi muito boa."
G["I came to Outland hoping to discover powerful artifacts to assist the League of Arathor against the Defilers in Arathi Basin... but all I've found is this smashing magical loincloth, a ridiculous gnome sidekick, and an egomaniacal undead stalker who insists I've stolen his grey skull, or some such.\n\n\nIn any case, would you care to join the League in their fight while I continue my search?"]="I came to Outland hoping to discover powerful artifacts to assist the League of Arathor against the Defilers in Arathi Basin... but all I've found is this smashing magical loincloth, a ridiculous gnome sidekick, and an egomaniacal undead stalker who insists I've stolen his grey skull, or some such.\n\n\nIn any case, would you care to join the League in their fight while I continue my search?"
G["I came to ask the famous Aysa Cloudsinger for help, but I just can't bring myself to intrude on her exercises. She's so poised, so practiced... so beautiful."]="I came to ask the famous Aysa Cloudsinger for help, but I just can't bring myself to intrude on her exercises. She's so poised, so practiced... so beautiful."
G["I came to lend my aid to the fight. Is there anything I can do to help?"]="E vindo para oferecer minha ajuda na luta. Há algo que possa fazer?"
G["I came to this land to cleanse troubled spirits, but after the attack I fear that my mission has failed.  So many have been taken by the wastes.  Please, you must help them."]="Eu vim para esta terra para limpar espíritos perturbados, mas depois do ataque, temo que minha missão tenha falhado. Tantos foram levados pelos resíduos. Por favor, você deve ajudá-os."
G["I came to this place because of my study into the backward culture that used to be the Thunderlord clan.\n\nThey were weak and succumbed to the lure of power that came with being transformed into fel orcs through Mannoroth's blood.\n\nI have read all of their texts.  I am particularly interested in the recovery of an artifact, a drum, an arrow and a tablet that were lost when we crushed the Bladespire ogres and pushed them back down into their hold."]="I came to this place because of my study into the backward culture that used to be the Thunderlord clan.\n\nThey were weak and succumbed to the lure of power that came with being transformed into fel orcs through Mannoroth's blood.\n\nI have read all of their texts.  I am particularly interested in the recovery of an artifact, a drum, an arrow and a tablet that were lost when we crushed the Bladespire ogres and pushed them back down into their hold."
G["I came upon what I can only describe as an overwhelming corruption within the Emerald Dream. An unending nightmare that seized me in its claws and tore at my very mind. I could not break free of its grasp; my disciples were unable to wake me.\n\nWhatever this corruption was, it found its way into our world through my body. I did indeed channel its energies into the Wailing Caverns, and its horrible influence twisted the wildlife there into chaotic, deviate forms. Even my disciples were affected; their minds overcome by madness and savagery, they took on the forms of serpents, and called themselves the Druids of the Fang."]="I came upon what I can only describe as an overwhelming corruption within the Emerald Dream. An unending nightmare that seized me in its claws and tore at my very mind. I could not break free of its grasp; my disciples were unable to wake me.\n\nWhatever this corruption was, it found its way into our world through my body. I did indeed channel its energies into the Wailing Caverns, and its horrible influence twisted the wildlife there into chaotic, deviate forms. Even my disciples were affected; their minds overcome by madness and savagery, they took on the forms of serpents, and called themselves the Druids of the Fang."
G["I can allow this no longer!"]="I can allow this no longer!"
G["I can allow you to bring life, from death."]="Posso permitir que você obter vida da morte."
G["I can assure you that we will not fail, my master.  I am personally overseeing every aspect of the construction, and I hold the final codes, myself.  Within a day's time, I will have the bomb detonated on those nearby pests."]="I can assure you that we will not fail, my master.  I am personally overseeing every aspect of the construction, and I hold the final codes, myself.  Within a day's time, I will have the bomb detonated on those nearby pests."
G["I can barely feel my arms, but I'll stand with you once I find some weapons."]="Apenas sinto os braços, mas estarei ao lado você assim que encuentre um arma."
G["I can barely hear you... <static> aking up!"]="Apenas te oigo... <estático> pertando!"
G["I can barely sense the Guardian of Time! His timeline is fading quickly!"]="A penas posso sentir ao Guardião do Tempo! Seu linha do tempo se desaparece rapidamente!"
G["I can barely understand what these trolls are trying to say."]="Eu mal consigo entender o que esses trolls estão tentando dizer."
G["I can beat him, I swear!"]="Te juro que posso com ele!"
G["I can both stable and give new pets."]="I can both stable and give new pets."
G["I can breathe!"]="Posso respirar!"
G["I can carry you to the top of the temple. Ji awaits you there to lead the way."]="Posso levar você até o alto do templo. Ali te espera Ji, quem te fará de guia."
G["I can count alllll the way to \"nine-ten.\" Listen!\n\n<Milly counts on her fingers and toes.>\n\nOne, two, three, five, six, umm... seven, eight, nine-ten!\n\nWait, I missed one..."]="I can count alllll the way to \"nine-ten.\" Listen!\n\n<Milly counts on her fingers and toes.>\n\nOne, two, three, five, six, umm... seven, eight, nine-ten!\n\nWait, I missed one..."
G["I can die in peace, knowing that my last few moments were with Martek."]="I can die in peace, knowing that my last few moments were with Martek."
G["I can direct you to other weapon masters if you prefer. What interests you?"]="Eu posso direcioná-o para outros mestres em armas, se você preferir. O que te interessa?"
G["I can do this, I know I can do this..."]="I can do this, I know I can do this..."
G["I can erase all your pet's talents so that you may teach it ones.\n\nThis becomes more expensive each time you do it."]="I can erase all your pet's talents so that you may teach it ones.\n\nThis becomes more expensive each time you do it."
G["I can erase all your talents so that you may choose new ones.\n\nThis becomes more expensive each time you do it."]="I can erase all your talents so that you may choose new ones.\n\nThis becomes more expensive each time you do it."
G["I can explain why I'm here."]="Posso explicar por que estou aqui."
G["I can feel Mauti watching us... Waiting for another chance to pounce."]="Sinto que Mauti nos observa... À espera do momentos oportuno para saltar."
G["I can feel Thrall's anger at Arthas, but it pales before my own. Were he as furious as any one of the Forsaken, the Horde's armies would unleash their rage upon Northrend and eradicate all Scourge from that cursed, frozen wasteland.\n\nBut I do not lead the Horde, and cannot give the command for war. Thrall wishes to weigh his options, despite this being a time of action. Still, our time will come... very soon."]="I can feel Thrall's anger at Arthas, but it pales before my own. Were he as furious as any one of the Forsaken, the Horde's armies would unleash their rage upon Northrend and eradicate all Scourge from that cursed, frozen wasteland.\n\nBut I do not lead the Horde, and cannot give the command for war. Thrall wishes to weigh his options, despite this being a time of action. Still, our time will come... very soon."
G["I can feel her will breaking! Her soul burns so brightly."]="I can feel her will breaking! Her soul burns so brightly."
G["I can feel it ... the Thunder King's power courses through my staff."]="I can feel it ... the Thunder King's power courses through my staff."
G["I can feel it... As if a dark shadow has been lifted from the land. Dead! My father is dead!"]="I can feel it... As if a dark shadow has been lifted from the land. Dead! My father is dead!"
G["I can feel my branches surging with life. I cannot wait to give it back to the land."]="Eu posso sentir meus galhos brilhando com a vida. Mal posso esperar para devolvê-o à terra."
G["I can feel my father's aura. He's definitely this way... come on, $n."]="Posso sentir o aura de meu pai. Definitivamente é por aqui... vamos, $n."
G["I can feel the Lich King reaching out...watching us."]="Sinto ao Rei Lich perto... observándonos."
G["I can feel the arcane energies building up yet again!  The archmage must be warned!"]="Posso sentir que as energias arcanas se voltam a acumular! Devemos avisar ao archimago!"
G["I can feel the elements awakening... rejoicing... the Cataclysm... is over."]="Eu posso sentir os elementos acordando... regozijando... o Cataclismo... acabou."
G["I can feel the embrace now of all living things, the Earthmother's eternal peace. Thank you."]="Agora sinto o abraço de todas as coisas vivas, a paz eterna da Mãe Terra. Obrigado."
G["I can feel the power SURGING within me!"]="I can feel the power SURGING within me!"
G["I can feel the presence of evil leaving..."]="Posso sentir como se esfuma a presença do mal..."
G["I can feel them, the spirits of long dead Mogu!"]="Posso sentir os espíritos dos mogu mortos!"
G["I can fight by your side for a few minutes before I need to return to The Shadow Vault."]="Posso lutar ao seu lado durante uns minutos antes de que tenha que voltar à Câmera das Sombras."
G["I can finally return to my knitting! Those winter scarves won't make themselves!"]="I can finally return to my knitting! Those winter scarves won't make themselves!"
G["I can find my way from here.  My friend Mekeda will reward you for your kind actions."]="I can find my way from here.  My friend Mekeda will reward you for your kind actions."
G["I can fix that... or  maybe not! Sheesh, what a mess..."]="I can fix that... or  maybe not! Sheesh, what a mess..."
G["I can float. On my toes. I'm like a butterfly. Wanna see?"]="I can float. On my toes. I'm like a butterfly. Wanna see?"
G["I can get back to the Stronghold on my own, I think.  Now that you bought me some time, I should be able to stealth out of here.  Who ever you are... thank you.  May Elune bless you always!"]="Eu posso voltar para a Fortaleza por conta própria, eu acho. Agora que você me comprou algum tempo, eu devo ser capaz de sair furtivamente daqui. Quem quer que você seja... Obrigado. Que Elune o abençoe sempre!"
G["I can get you started on your journey to Northrend. Let me know when you are ready and I will teleport you to your starting point."]="I can get you started on your journey to Northrend. Let me know when you are ready and I will teleport you to your starting point."
G["I can go around you, or through you.  Your choice!"]="I can go around you, or through you.  Your choice!"
G["I can handle things from here. I'll meet you back at the Sanctuary, $n."]="I can handle things from here. I'll meet you back at the Sanctuary, $n."
G["I can hardly believe it. You were able to suppress your hatred."]="I can hardly believe it. You were able to suppress your hatred."
G["I can hardly believe my eyes. Thank you. Really, thank you."]="Não posso acreditar o que meus olhos veem. Obrigado, muitas Obrigado."
G["I can hardly believe the Cult was so careless as to leave these behind."]="Mal posso acreditar que o Culto foi tão descuidado que os deixou para por trás."
G["I can hear Sigrid Iceborn approaching from the northwest. She has been informed that she cannot use her proto-drake in battle here. Do not leave the battle ring!"]="I can hear Sigrid Iceborn approaching from the northwest. She has been informed that she cannot use her proto-drake in battle here. Do not leave the battle ring!"
G["I can hear the howls of the Burning Blade as we speak. The kodos are ready to ride for the Mor'shan Ramparts. Tell me when you are ready to leave."]="I can hear the howls of the Burning Blade as we speak. The kodos are ready to ride for the Mor'shan Ramparts. Tell me when you are ready to leave."
G["I can hear them no longer..."]="I can hear them no longer..."
G["I can hear them! Hear them calling! I answer the call!"]="I can hear them! Hear them calling! I answer the call!"
G["I can help you establish a guild."]="Eu posso ajudá-o a estabelecer uma guilda."
G["I can hit my house from here!"]="Posso dar a meu casa desde aqui!"
G["I can hold out no longer..."]="Não posso aguantar mais..."
G["I can hold them off from here, $r. We will meet again at the Sanctuary of Malorne."]="I can hold them off from here, $r. We will meet again at the Sanctuary of Malorne."
G["I can instruct you in alchemy.  Interested?"]="Eu posso instruir você em alquimia. Interessado?"
G["I can instruct you in blacksmithing as well as supply the necessary tools.\n\nHow may I help you?"]="I can instruct you in blacksmithing as well as supply the necessary tools.\n\nHow may I help you?"
G["I can instruct you in blacksmithing.  Interested?"]="Eu posso instruir você em ferraria. Interessado?"
G["I can instruct you in enchanting.  Interested?"]="Eu posso instruí-o a encantar. Interessado?"
G["I can instruct you in engineering.  Interested?"]="Eu posso instruir você em engenharia. Interessado?"
G["I can instruct you in fishing as well as offer helpful supplies.\n\nHow may I help you?"]="Posso ensinar a pescar e oferecer a você suprimentos úteis.\n\nEm que te posso ajudar?"
G["I can instruct you in fishing, and sell fishing poles and supplies.\n\nHow may I help you?"]="I can instruct you in fishing, and sell fishing poles and supplies.\n\nHow may I help you?"
G["I can instruct you in herbalism as well as offer helpful supplies.\n\nHow may I help you?"]="Posso ensinar herborismo e oferecer a você suprimentos úteis.\n\nEm que te posso ajudar?"
G["I can instruct you in herbalism.  Interested?"]="Eu posso instruir você em fitoterapia. Interessado?"
G["I can instruct you in jewelcrafting.  Interested?"]="Eu posso instruir você em joalheria. Interessado?"
G["I can instruct you in leatherworking.  Interested?"]="Eu posso instruí-o em couraria. Interessado?"
G["I can instruct you in mining.  Interested?"]="Eu posso instruí-o na mineração. Interessado?"
G["I can instruct you in skinning.  Interested?"]="Eu posso instruí-o a esfolar. Interessado?"
G["I can instruct you in tailoring.  Interested?"]="Eu posso instruir você em alfaiataria. Interessado?"
G["I can keep this up for a very long time, Scarlet dog! Tell me about the \"Crimson Dawn!\""]="Posso seguir fazendo isto durante muito tempo, cão Escarlate! Fale comigo aproxima do \"Alba Carmesim\"!"
G["I can leave now?"]="Já me posso ir?"
G["I can make amazing things with the materials I find out here. By Muradin's beard, there are fantastic creatures in these hills! Go have a whack at them, $n, and bring me back some tall tales."]="I can make amazing things with the materials I find out here. By Muradin's beard, there are fantastic creatures in these hills! Go have a whack at them, $n, and bring me back some tall tales."
G["I can make it from here.  Thanks, $n!  And talk to my employer about a reward!"]="Não preciso de mais ajuda. Obrigado, $n! E fala com meu patrono sobre a recompensa!"
G["I can make it the rest of the way, $n.  THANKS!"]="I can make it the rest of the way, $n.  THANKS!"
G["I can make that happen. Just sign below the dotted line..."]="Posso fazer que isso ocurra. Somente firma sobre a linha de pontos..."
G["I can move again!"]="I can move again!"
G["I can never die!"]="I can never die!"
G["I can not train you, $c."]="I can not train you, $c."
G["I can not train you, young one."]="Eu não posso treiná-o, jovem."
G["I can not train you."]="I can not train you."
G["I can not train you. You need to talk to your class trainer."]="Eu não posso treinar você. Você precisa conversar com o seu treinador de classe."
G["I can offer you a free bunk if you'd like to rest.  They're not comfortable, but it doesn't look like you get much sleep anyway."]="I can offer you a free bunk if you'd like to rest.  They're not comfortable, but it doesn't look like you get much sleep anyway."
G["I can only assume that you know who I am. And yet you insist on disturbing me?\n\nWhat could you possibly want that requires my attention?"]="I can only assume that you know who I am. And yet you insist on disturbing me?\n\nWhat could you possibly want that requires my attention?"
G["I can only describe the Admiral's attackers as...savages."]="I can only describe the Admiral's attackers as...savages."
G["I can only help you with a clean death."]="Somente posso ajudar você com uma morte limpa."
G["I can only hope that he will see the Light and instead turn his energies to restoring once-beautiful Quel'Thalas."]="I can only hope that he will see the Light and instead turn his energies to restoring once-beautiful Quel'Thalas."
G["I can only hope the treatment will work."]="Espero que o tratamento funcione."
G["I can only imagine what foul business the Zandalari have with them..."]="Posso imaginar que não estão tramando nada bom com os Zandalari..."
G["I can only show you the door, Morphalius. You're the one that has to walk through it."]="I can only show you the door, Morphalius. You're the one that has to walk through it."
G["I can only teleport us once. Make sure you are ready. Go'el waits for us at the bottom of the ocean..."]="Só posso nos teletransportar uma vez. Verifique se você está pronto. Go'o espera por nós no fundo do oceano..."
G["I can open a portal to the docks... large enough to get a strike team through."]="I can open a portal to the docks... large enough to get a strike team through."
G["I can raise your dead, Regent Lord. Your rangers can fight again."]="I can raise your dead, Regent Lord. Your rangers can fight again."
