G["I can run fast! Daddy let me get a speed enchant on my shoes!"]="I can run fast! Daddy let me get a speed enchant on my shoes!"
G["I can see everything from up here!"]="O posso ver tudo desde aqui cima!"
G["I can see in your eyes you're no stranger to the tragedy within Stratholme. If you wish to end the miserable existence of the poor souls trapped therein, step into the circle. It leads directly to the gates of the burning city itself."]="I can see in your eyes you're no stranger to the tragedy within Stratholme. If you wish to end the miserable existence of the poor souls trapped therein, step into the circle. It leads directly to the gates of the burning city itself."
G["I can see my fellow druids from here.  Thank you, $n.  I'm sure Ysiel will reward you for your actions!"]="Desde aqui vejo a meus companheiros druidas. Obrigado, $n. Estou certa de que Ysiel você será recompensado pelos seus ações!"
G["I can see that Uldum will one day transform from a dangerous wilderness to a tourist magnet!"]="I can see that Uldum will one day transform from a dangerous wilderness to a tourist magnet!"
G["I can see that you'll be a quick learner. That's good for me, because I'm always busy these days. In fact, that reminds me: could you run a quick errand for me?"]="I can see that you'll be a quick learner. That's good for me, because I'm always busy these days. In fact, that reminds me: could you run a quick errand for me?"
