G["I can see the light."]="Finalmente vejo a luz..."
G["I can see those dirty night elves from here! When I grow up, I want to fight for the warchief just like these warriors!"]="Posso ver a esses asquerosos elfos da noite desde aqui! Quando seja maior, quero lutar pelo Chefe de Guerra igual que esses guerreiros!"
G["I can see you, worm. Are you grunts blind? Kill them!"]="I can see you, worm. Are you grunts blind? Kill them!"
G["I can see you."]="Os vejo..."
