G["I can see your people expect great things, even from your young."]="Vejo que seu povo espera grandes coisas, inclusive dos jovens."
G["I can sense it now, $n. Ashenvale lies down this path."]="I can sense it now, $n. Ashenvale lies down this path."
G["I can sense the SHADOW on your hearts. There can be no rest for the wicked!"]="Posso sentir a SOMBRA nos seus corações. Não pode haver descanso para os maus!"
G["I can sense the anger building inside of you."]="Sinto como a raiva se acumula no seu interior."
G["I can sense you, 'adventurer', even through this magical image.  You think you will retrieve the ata'mal crystal when Culuthas shows himself, but you are mistaken!"]="I can sense you, 'adventurer', even through this magical image.  You think you will retrieve the ata'mal crystal when Culuthas shows himself, but you are mistaken!"
G["I can sense your desire for power, $c."]="Posso sentir seu desejo de poder, $c."
