G["I can show you a few tricks... if you don't mind doing a little something first, that is."]="Eu posso lhe mostrar algum truques... se você não se importa de fazer uma coisinha primeiro, é isso."
G["I can show you the aftermath of Deathwing's destruction at the Maelstrom, if you wish."]="Posso lhe mostrar as consequências da destruição de Asa da Morte no Maelstrom, se você desejar."
G["I can show you what you wish to know, but you must be patient. Take your time to work the steel and feel the way it shapes beneath your hammer. When you become one with the steel, then you will understand."]="Posso mostrar o que você deseja saber, mas você deve ser paciente. Não se apresse em trabalhar o aço e sinta como ele se molda sob o martelo. Quando você se tornar um com o aço, entenderá."
G["I can smell a market up north... time to pack up the goods and put on a heavy coat!"]="I can smell a market up north... time to pack up the goods and put on a heavy coat!"
G["I can smell a market up north... time to pack up the goods and put on my heavy coat!"]="I can smell a market up north... time to pack up the goods and put on my heavy coat!"
G["I can smell the gunpowder from all the bombs and rockets!  You want to get out there and join the fun?"]="Sinto o cheiro da pólvora de todas as bombas e foguetes! Você quer chegar lá e se divertir?"
G["I can smell them. They stink of fear."]="I can smell them. They stink of fear."
G["I can smell you!"]="I can smell you!"
G["I can smell you, $pr. Come and fight!"]="Te sinto o cheiro desde aqui, $pr. Venha e luta!"
G["I can smell you, thief!"]="I can smell you, thief!"
G["I can smell your fear, $r."]="I can smell your fear, $r."
G["I can smell your fear."]="I can smell your fear."
G["I can smell your fear..."]="I can smell your fear..."
G["I can smell your hatred, your violence, your doubt. Your soul bears the weight of a lifetime of hardship. Why do you continue onward down a path that can only lead to ruin?"]="I can smell your hatred, your violence, your doubt. Your soul bears the weight of a lifetime of hardship. Why do you continue onward down a path that can only lead to ruin?"
