G["I can teach you both the finesse of a short blade and the bone shattering cleaving power of a two handed behemoth. Or we can get crazy and I can teach you both, could come in handy for when the situation changes on ya."]="I can teach you both the finesse of a short blade and the bone shattering cleaving power of a two handed behemoth. Or we can get crazy and I can teach you both, could come in handy for when the situation changes on ya."
G["I can teach you fishing skills."]="Eu posso ensinar habilidades de pesca."
G["I can teach you how to cook!"]="Eu posso ensinar como cozinhar!"
G["I can teach you the basics of any gathering or production profession, but that's all.\nTo learn more than an apprentice's skills, you'll need to visit a specialist dedicated to only one profession.\nYou can learn up to two professions: Two gathering, two production, or one of each.\nSecondary skills like Archaeology, Cooking, First Aid, and Fishing don't count towards your two professions; you can learn as many of those as you like."]="I can teach you the basics of any gathering or production profession, but that's all.\nTo learn more than an apprentice's skills, you'll need to visit a specialist dedicated to only one profession.\nYou can learn up to two professions: Two gathering, two production, or one of each.\nSecondary skills like Archaeology, Cooking, First Aid, and Fishing don't count towards your two professions; you can learn as many of those as you like."
