G["I can tell you where he's not..."]="Eu posso te dizer onde ele não está..."
G["I can train you in First Aid techniques."]="Eu posso treiná-o em técnicas de primeiros socorros."
G["I can travel faster on my own from here, $n. Meet Jessir Moonbow near Ashenvale. She should be with the druids of the Emerald Circle. She'll tell you what to do next. Thank you so much for your help!"]="I can travel faster on my own from here, $n. Meet Jessir Moonbow near Ashenvale. She should be with the druids of the Emerald Circle. She'll tell you what to do next. Thank you so much for your help!"
G["I can try asking the streams for guidance..."]="I can try asking the streams for guidance..."
G["I can understand he's upset, but this attack is simply going too far!"]="I can understand he's upset, but this attack is simply going too far!"
G["I can understand that. But the King did allow for a change, letting a gnome tap the keg.  So I got a chance to work on a new type of problem; How to efficiently and quickly open the keg and distribute its contents such that all participants will receive equal parts quickly and efficiently."]="I can understand that. But the King did allow for a change, letting a gnome tap the keg.  So I got a chance to work on a new type of problem; How to efficiently and quickly open the keg and distribute its contents such that all participants will receive equal parts quickly and efficiently."
G["I can use all of the cleansed metal that you can provide."]="Me virá bem tudo o metal purificou que me possa proporcionar."
G["I can watch no longer.  We MUST undo this evil that the arakkoa are perpetrating upon the protectors of the Raven's Wood!"]="Não posso seguir olhando. DEVEMOS deshacer este mal que os arakkoas estão perpetrando contra os protetores da Floresta do Corvo!"
G["I can whip up better than thish, Jashon."]="I can whip up better than thish, Jashon."
G["I can't BELIEVE she wore the same dress as me.  How embarrassing."]="I can't BELIEVE she wore the same dress as me.  How embarrassing."
G["I can't BELIEVE that we're stopping!  We've got a duty to do here!"]="Não me posso ACREDITAR que nos paremos! Temos trabalho!"
G["I can't accurately assess the mathematics behind the charge of my turbostrider while keeping hold of my lance at the precise angle needed and keeping my shield in the exact location for maximum protection at any given second!"]="I can't accurately assess the mathematics behind the charge of my turbostrider while keeping hold of my lance at the precise angle needed and keeping my shield in the exact location for maximum protection at any given second!"
G["I can't afford to miss another shipment!"]="Não me posso permitir perder outro carregamento!"
G["I can't afford to spare you."]="I can't afford to spare you."
G["I can't argue with that."]="Isso não o posso discutir."
G["I can't bang on this device any faster, captain! My wrapping is already beginning to unravel!"]="I can't bang on this device any faster, captain! My wrapping is already beginning to unravel!"
G["I can't be held responsible every time someone falls off their mount.  I don't know how you got the official seal on this, but take your payment and don't question my horses again!"]="I can't be held responsible every time someone falls off their mount.  I don't know how you got the official seal on this, but take your payment and don't question my horses again!"
G["I can't bear to watch."]="Não posso olhar."
G["I can't believe I fell for Schnottz's lies! I'm out of here!"]="Não me posso acreditar que me tragara as mentiras de Schnottz! Eu me largo!"
G["I can't believe I let Gidwin run off like that!"]="I can't believe I let Gidwin run off like that!"
G["I can't believe Uncle Chen would rather sit down and drink beer than walk around and explore this place!"]="Não posso acreditar que o tio Chen prefiera sentar a beber cerveja antes que sair a caminhar e explorar este lugar!"
G["I can't believe both Farmer Yoon and Farmer Fung are here!\n\nWhat's a girl to do?"]="Não me posso acreditar que o fazendeiro Yoon e o fazendeiro Fung estejam aqui!\n\nQue faço?"
G["I can't believe dad won't let me keep your sister."]="Não posso acreditar que papai não me deje conservar ao seu irmã."
G["I can't believe he left me with the weird mud guy."]="I can't believe he left me with the weird mud guy."
G["I can't believe how I felt before.\nTo think that I could have become posessed by the same thing that controlled these Jinyu, it's... disturbing, to say the least."]="I can't believe how I felt before.\nTo think that I could have become posessed by the same thing that controlled these Jinyu, it's... disturbing, to say the least."
G["I can't believe how lucky we got on that trip!  I really am the greatest sky-captain in all the realms!"]="custa-me acreditar a sorte que tuvimos em esse viagem! Mesmo sou o melhor Capitão do céu de todos os reinos!"
G["I can't believe it!  I'm free to go!"]="Não me o posso acreditar! Posso ir embora!"
G["I can't believe it! I saw the spirit of of an emperor!"]="Não dou crédito! vi o espírito de um imperador!"
G["I can't believe it! I was certain that he'd be here in the Wilds.\n\nPaoquan Hollow, you say? I'll join her soon, and we can continue our training. For the time being, I've already found an adventure of my own."]="I can't believe it! I was certain that he'd be here in the Wilds.\n\nPaoquan Hollow, you say? I'll join her soon, and we can continue our training. For the time being, I've already found an adventure of my own."
G["I can't believe it! You've destroyed my pack... Now face my wrath!"]="Não o posso acreditar! Tem destruído a meu legião... Agora Enfrente a meu raiva!"
G["I can't believe it's come to this."]="Não posso acreditar que tenhamos chegado a isto."
G["I can't believe it... I was doing a routine recon mission over the central DMZ when all hell broke loose. I saw the Horde Wing Commander, Mulverick, take out both Ichman and Slidore! Anger took hold of me and I broke from my wing man and drove that show-off, Mulverick, down. Unfortunately, he clipped my gryphon before he crashed, forcing me down as well. I ended up captured by these savages.\n\nI have to get back to base! Help!"]="I can't believe it... I was doing a routine recon mission over the central DMZ when all hell broke loose. I saw the Horde Wing Commander, Mulverick, take out both Ichman and Slidore! Anger took hold of me and I broke from my wing man and drove that show-off, Mulverick, down. Unfortunately, he clipped my gryphon before he crashed, forcing me down as well. I ended up captured by these savages.\n\nI have to get back to base! Help!"
G["I can't believe my own people forgot about me. Die!"]="Não posso acreditar que meu própria gente se tenha esquecido de mim. Morre!"
G["I can't believe that Fizz and Evol are at each other's throats again. It's the pressure. We need you now more than ever, $n."]="I can't believe that Fizz and Evol are at each other's throats again. It's the pressure. We need you now more than ever, $n."
G["I can't believe that I used to wear that."]="custa-me acreditar que eu costumava levar isso."
G["I can't believe that Papa Wheeler thinks he's going to dupe anyone into going out to Manaforge B'naar!"]="Não posso acreditar que Papai Rodas piense de verdade que vai enganar alguém pai que vá à Forja de Mana de B'naar."
G["I can't believe that it's... over...\n\nGo'el is free, thanks in no small part to you, $n."]="Não me posso acreditar que tenha... terminou...\n\nGo'o é livre, em grande parte Obrigado você, $n."
G["I can't believe that we're doing this.  I know that Calcinder's presence threatens us all, but really?  Doesn't this seem like the domain of the Earthen Ring, or something?\n\nWhy's the Thorium Brotherhood gotta come save the day all the time?"]="I can't believe that we're doing this.  I know that Calcinder's presence threatens us all, but really?  Doesn't this seem like the domain of the Earthen Ring, or something?\n\nWhy's the Thorium Brotherhood gotta come save the day all the time?"
G["I can't believe the Zandalari actually make living sacrifices!"]="I can't believe the Zandalari actually make living sacrifices!"
G["I can't believe the blues would attack us. Let's give some of it back!"]="I can't believe the blues would attack us. Let's give some of it back!"
G["I can't believe the nerve of those trolls. Rebelling after all that I've done for them!"]="I can't believe the nerve of those trolls. Rebelling after all that I've done for them!"
G["I can't believe the officials in Stormwind, sending the bulk of our army abroad... when our home front is under so much pressure!\n\nWith thieves coming from Westfall and gnolls encroaching from from the east and west, it's a wonder Stormwind itself isn't besieged."]="I can't believe the officials in Stormwind, sending the bulk of our army abroad... when our home front is under so much pressure!\n\nWith thieves coming from Westfall and gnolls encroaching from from the east and west, it's a wonder Stormwind itself isn't besieged."
G["I can't believe the officials in Stormwind, sending the bulk of our army abroad... when our home front is under so much pressure!\n\nWith thieves coming from Westfall and gnolls encroaching from the east and west, it's a wonder Stormwind itself isn't besieged."]="I can't believe the officials in Stormwind, sending the bulk of our army abroad... when our home front is under so much pressure!\n\nWith thieves coming from Westfall and gnolls encroaching from the east and west, it's a wonder Stormwind itself isn't besieged."
G["I can't believe they be chasin' me outta the city. Innit supposed to be a refuge? Ol' Griftah be a refugee! Not my fault I be an ENTERPRISIN' refugee..."]="Não posso acreditar que me estiver dando da cidade. É que não é um refúgio? O velho Griftah é um refugiado. Não é culpar minha ser um refugiado EMPRESARIO..."
G["I can't believe they've keep me waiting this long!"]="É incrível que me tenham feito esperar tanto!"
G["I can't believe this! You were dead! All accounts said so... what happened, Muradin. How did you get here?"]="I can't believe this! You were dead! All accounts said so... what happened, Muradin. How did you get here?"
G["I can't believe this. How much do they feed this thing?"]="Não me o posso acreditar. Que lhe derem de comer a esta coisa?"
G["I can't believe we had to kill one of my order... where has the world gone?"]="Não posso acreditar que tuviéramos que matar a um dos meu ordem... que lhe passado ao mundo?"
G["I can't believe we made it. Thank you stranger!"]="Não me posso acreditar que o tenhamos conseguido. Obrigado!"
G["I can't believe we're actually fighting for the Crusade!"]="I can't believe we're actually fighting for the Crusade!"
G["I can't believe you guys are still fighting here in Hyjal. You should see what happens after this."]="I can't believe you guys are still fighting here in Hyjal. You should see what happens after this."
G["I can't believe you imbeciles went to school for this! Does anybody here know what they're doing?"]="I can't believe you imbeciles went to school for this! Does anybody here know what they're doing?"
G["I can't believe you sell those here, of all places.  I'll swing by the cook later to pick them up."]="I can't believe you sell those here, of all places.  I'll swing by the cook later to pick them up."
G["I can't believe you'd do this to me!"]="I can't believe you'd do this to me!"
G["I can't believe you're still alive."]="Não acredito que você sobreviveu."
G["I can't believe you've actually done something right for once."]="Não posso acreditar que, por uma vez, tenha feito algo bem."
G["I can't believe... they're all... dead."]="Não posso acreditar... que estejam... todos mortos."
G["I can't come down.  I am scared."]="Não posso descer. Tenho medo."
G["I can't do business with you, $c. Warchief's Orders."]="Não posso fazer negócios com você, $c. Ordens do Chefe de guerra."
G["I can't do much since I'm just Hilda's assistant, but ye can. I hope ye can find out what they're up to."]="Eu não posso fazer muito, porque somente sou a ajudante de Hilda, mas você si pode. Espero que descubras que estão tramando."
G["I can't do this while they're attacking me!"]="Não posso fazer isso se me estão atacando!"
G["I can't even begin to describe it... you have to see this, $n."]="I can't even begin to describe it... you have to see this, $n."
G["I can't even believe this one... You know those two loud-mouthed ruffians, Foror and Tigule?"]="I can't even believe this one... You know those two loud-mouthed ruffians, Foror and Tigule?"
G["I can't even remember how many times I've spotted a beautiful mining vein at the bottom of a lake or river, glimmering mockingly at me.  I'm forced to float orelessly by, mining pick in hand, only to watch some blasted orc or blood elf swim down to the bottom and take it away from me."]="Nem me lembro quantas vezes vi uma bela veia de mineração no fundo de um lago ou rio, brilhando zombeteiramente para mim. Sou forçada a flutuar sem parar, pegando na mina, apenas para assistir algum orco ou elfo sangrento nadar até o fundo e tirar isso de mim."
G["I can't even visit my father's grave in peace anymore."]="Nem sequer posso visitar em paz a tumba de meu pai."
G["I can't feel my legs..."]="Não sinto as pernas..."
