G["I choose the third option: KILLING YOU!"]="I choose the third option: KILLING YOU!"
G["I chose you as my companion for a reason."]="Eu escolhi você como companheira por um motivo."
G["I cleanse thee with holy fire!"]="Eu te purifico com fogo abençoado!"
G["I cleared the way. You should be good to go."]="E abriu o caminho. Já pode seguir."
G["I come back when we not getting butts kicked."]="Voltarei quando não nos estejam pateando o culo."
G["I come for you, puny Alliance!"]="Vou por você, patética Aliança!"
G["I come from the Alliance. We wish to be allies, not enemies."]="Venho da Aliança. Queremos ser seus aliados, não seus inimigos."
G["I come from the land down under... where women plague and men sunder."]="I come from the land down under... where women plague and men sunder."
G["I come stocked with a complimentary charge of water, you'll have to find more if you wish to take advantage of my Hydrolizing feature multiple times."]="Tenho uma carga adicional de água de série. Terá que procurar mais se que aproveitar meu função de hidrolização mais de uma vez."
G["I come to Silithus every year around this time. The weather is phenomenal for my bunions.\n\nYou should take a stroll with me, friend. Enjoy the sights and what not."]="I come to Silithus every year around this time. The weather is phenomenal for my bunions.\n\nYou should take a stroll with me, friend. Enjoy the sights and what not."
G["I come to avenge my bruddas, mon!"]="Venho a vingar a meus irmãos, tron!"
G["I come to raze your bases, Frost Wolf clan. Ivus punishes you for your treachery!"]="I come to raze your bases, Frost Wolf clan. Ivus punishes you for your treachery!"
G["I come with news of our conflict with the Rogue Undead."]="Traigo notícia de nossa guerra contra os ladinos não-mortos."
G["I come with the yak. If a luckydo is wise enough to buy, I will be wise enough to sell my wares to them."]="I come with the yak. If a luckydo is wise enough to buy, I will be wise enough to sell my wares to them."
G["I command the elements to destroy you!"]="Ordeno aos elementos que OS DESTRUYAN!"
G["I command the power of the storm. It sounds impressive, but you wake up with static cling every morning."]="I command the power of the storm. It sounds impressive, but you wake up with static cling every morning."
G["I command you to rain fire down upon these invaders!"]="Te ordeno que cubras de fogo aos invasores!"
G["I condemn you to death!"]="Os condeno a morte!"
G["I confiscate the corn he has stolen, warn him that stealing is a path towards doom and destruction, but I let him go to return to his family."]="Confisco o milho que ele roubou, aviso-o de que roubar é um caminho para a destruição e a destruição, mas deixei que ele voltasse para a sua família."
G["I confront the ruler on his malicious behavior, upholding my liege's honor at the risk of any future diplomacy."]="Enfrento o governante pelo seu comportamento malicioso, mantendo a honra do meu senhorio correndo o risco de qualquer diplomacia futura."
G["I confused!"]="Estou confuso!"
G["I conquered my doubts, my fears, my anger... I buried all of it within the land."]="Eu dominei minhas dúvidas, meus medos, minha raiva... eu enterrei tudo nesta terra."
G["I consider it a great honor to assist the Lady Proudmoore in her research. She's the most powerful human mage upon Azeroth, you know!\nNow, was there something I might help you with?"]="Considero uma honra ajudar a Lady Corajoso com o seu investigação. É a humana maga mais poderosa de tudo Azeroth, sabe.\n\nE agora, posso ajudar você em algo?"
G["I control the very air you breathe...."]="Controlo o mesmo ar que respiras..."
G["I could be convinced to part with one... IF you'll promise to give the cub a good home."]="I could be convinced to part with one... IF you'll promise to give the cub a good home."
G["I could be pickin' this lock in my sleep, mon. Just come an' say when it be safe to get away."]="Poderá abrir eh'ta cerradura inclusive dormindo. Você somente Avise-me quando seja certo escapar."
G["I could be pickin' this lock in my sleep. Just come an' say when it be safe to make my escape."]="Poderá abrir eh'ta cerradura inclusive dormindo. Você somente Avise-me quando seja certo escapar."
G["I could beat all those tonks."]="Poderá acabar com todos esses tonques."
G["I could break through four hardened pine boards using just your forehead.  Want me to demonstrate?"]="I could break through four hardened pine boards using just your forehead.  Want me to demonstrate?"
G["I could crush you with but a single motion. Do not anger me."]="I could crush you with but a single motion. Do not anger me."
G["I could eat twenty plates of Charbroiled Tiger Steak and still be looking for more. Thanks, $n."]="I could eat twenty plates of Charbroiled Tiger Steak and still be looking for more. Thanks, $n."
G["I could get used to livin' like this."]="I could get used to livin' like this."
G["I could have beat you today you know. All I needed to do was to switch to my \"Ale Stance\" sooner."]="Sabe que hoje te podia haver derrotou? Tão somente tinha que haver mudado ao \"Estilo cervejeiro\" antes."
G["I could have stopped the sea if not for your incessant clucking!"]="I could have stopped the sea if not for your incessant clucking!"
G["I could have sworn I had more apples.  Grok!"]="Juraría que tinha mais manzanas. Grok!"
G["I could have sworn there were more of you..."]="Tivesse jurado que erais mais..."
G["I could hear the sound of your trident breaking from the gardens! The skulls of these Kvaldir are as strong as rock."]="Oigo o ruido dos golpes do seu tridente desdos jardins! Os crânios desses Kvaldir são tão difíceis como a rocha."
G["I could just close the gates, and then nobody would get in..."]="Poderá fechar as portões, e então não entraría ninguém..."
G["I could just kiss you!"]="I could just kiss you!"
G["I could kiss you.  I'll spare you the shell-breath though."]="I could kiss you.  I'll spare you the shell-breath though."
G["I could never leave an injured friend alone..."]="Nunca poderá deixar a um amigo ferido somente..."
G["I could not bear to sit in Stormwind Keep while my people's blood spills here!\n\nPandaria has so much to teach us. There is great power here. Power that could save thousands of lives.\n\nAnd I aim to find it."]="I could not bear to sit in Stormwind Keep while my people's blood spills here!\n\nPandaria has so much to teach us. There is great power here. Power that could save thousands of lives.\n\nAnd I aim to find it."
G["I could not have achieved this victory without you. We will speak back at Thunderlord Stronghold."]="Não poderá haver alcançou esta vitória sem ti. Volveremos a falar no Bastião Senhor do Trovão."
G["I could not have done better myself."]="Eu mesmo não o haveria feito melhor."
G["I could really go for one of Uncle Gus' jokes about now, this place is scary!"]="I could really go for one of Uncle Gus' jokes about now, this place is scary!"
G["I could really use a heart. Say, can I have yours?"]="Me viria bem um coração? Digamos, o seu?"
G["I could really use a papaya."]="Eu mesmo poderia usar um mamão."
G["I could really use a refill on my drink here."]="Não me viria mal outra copa."
G["I could sleep forever, mon...."]="Poderá dormir eternamente, colega..."
G["I could swear I just paid a fine like this..."]="Juraría que acabo de pagar uma multa como esta..."
G["I could use a campfire and some warm food right about now. Are you here with good news?"]="I could use a campfire and some warm food right about now. Are you here with good news?"
G["I could use a drink and some rest myself.  You'll find it right in the northwest corner of Razor Hill.  Say hi to Innkeeper Grosk for me."]="Eu poderia pegar uma bebida e descansar um pouco. Você o encontrará no canto noroeste de Razor Hill. Diga oi para o gerente Grosk por mim."
G["I could use a hand here, $c.\n\nHow 'bout you make yourself useful?"]="Me viria bem uma mão, $c.\n\nQue tal se empiezas a ser útil?"
G["I could use a heal, brother!"]="Me viria bem que me sanaran, irmão!"
G["I could use a hug."]="Me viria bem um abraço."
G["I could use a kite to Grookin' Hill."]="Gostaria usar uma cometa até o Cerro Makaku."
G["I could use a kite to Pearlfin Village."]="Gostaria usar uma cometa até o Aldeia Falésia de Nácar."
G["I could use a nap right about now."]="I could use a nap right about now."
G["I could use another emergency buoy, Arie."]="Me viria bem outra boia de emergência, Arie."
G["I could use some help over here if you please."]="I could use some help over here if you please."
G["I could use some more blood ale to quench my thirst!"]="Me viria bem mais sangue para apagar meu sede!"
G["I could use the extra money."]="Me viria bem o dinheiro extra."
G["I couldn't agree more."]="Totalmente de acordo."
G["I couldn't believe it when they ordered half of us to ship out..."]="I couldn't believe it when they ordered half of us to ship out..."
G["I couldn't have fought them off alone. Now, if you'll excuse me, I should go find my cart."]="I couldn't have fought them off alone. Now, if you'll excuse me, I should go find my cart."
G["I couldn't have miscalculated your interest... because we don't give any!  I'd rather pay than be subjected to the trials, so take my personal cash."]="I couldn't have miscalculated your interest... because we don't give any!  I'd rather pay than be subjected to the trials, so take my personal cash."
G["I couldn't help but notice you from over there. I'm new in town."]="Não e pedido esta ver você desde ali. Sou novo na cidade."
G["I couldn't imagine a crueler tyrant. He enslaved this entire continent."]="Não posso imaginar um tirano mais cruel. Ele escravizou este continente inteiro."
G["I couldn't tell ya.  Maybe I've got a low bone density, or a larger-than average lung capacity.  Maybe it's all that cheese I had for lunch.\n\nEither way, this shell is the only thing that's keeping me from rocketing to the surface."]="I couldn't tell ya.  Maybe I've got a low bone density, or a larger-than average lung capacity.  Maybe it's all that cheese I had for lunch.\n\nEither way, this shell is the only thing that's keeping me from rocketing to the surface."
G["I count six... no, seven guards on patrol in the sky."]="I count six... no, seven guards on patrol in the sky."
G["I cracked knuckles and got ready for fight.\n|TInterface\\Icons\\inv_gauntlets_05.blp:32|t  |TInterface\\Icons\\inv_inscription_pigment_emerald.blp:32|t"]="I cracked knuckles and got ready for fight.\n|TInterface\\Icons\\inv_gauntlets_05.blp:32|t  |TInterface\\Icons\\inv_inscription_pigment_emerald.blp:32|t"
G["I crave your death!"]="Ansío seu morte!"
G["I crush joo cockroaches!"]="I crush joo cockroaches!"
G["I crush weaklings like you every day!  Bring it on!"]="I crush weaklings like you every day!  Bring it on!"
G["I curse the Darkspear!"]="Maldigo aos Lança Negra!"
G["I dare not create a portal here. The results could be... interesting."]="I dare not create a portal here. The results could be... interesting."
G["I dare not touch it. Stand back! Stand back as I attempt to commune with the blade! Perhaps our salvation lies within..."]="I dare not touch it. Stand back! Stand back as I attempt to commune with the blade! Perhaps our salvation lies within..."
G["I dare say I've had enough of this. Time to bring out... THE BEAST WITHIN!"]="Me atrevo a dizer que já e tido suficiente. Hora de liberar... A FERA INTERIOR!"
G["I dare you!"]="Te desafio!"
G["I deal in comfort... Soothe your savage impulse, $r. My inn is your home..."]="Comercio com a comodidade... Calma seu selvagem impulso, $r. Meu estalagem é seu lar..."
G["I decided to give him one more chance. I was not about to give up on family."]="Decidí dar outra oportunidade. Não era questão de dar a costas à família."
G["I decided to keep shrinking the world until I could reach the clouds.\n\n|TInterface\\Icons\\inv_helmet_47.blp:32|t"]="I decided to keep shrinking the world until I could reach the clouds.\n\n|TInterface\\Icons\\inv_helmet_47.blp:32|t"
G["I decided to look around for someone else from the Stormstout family."]="Decidí procurar a alguém mais da família Cerveja de Trovão."
G["I decided to name him Gizmo."]="I decided to name him Gizmo."
G["I decree that you are an enemy of the Ogre clans.  Punishment is death!"]="I decree that you are an enemy of the Ogre clans.  Punishment is death!"
G["I defer to your wisdom, brother.  Let us pray we are quick to come to a decision.  The enemy will not wait."]="Acato seu sabedoria, irmão. Recemos para que possamos pegar uma decisão rápida. O inimigo não esperará."
G["I definitely did NOT sign up for this! Pygmies, zombies... Hobart better give me a huge raise!"]="Eu definitivamente não me inscrevi para isso! Pigmeus, zumbis... É melhor Hobart me dar um aumento enorme!"
G["I delight in the irony."]="I delight in the irony."
G["I deliver the mail to and from Azuremyst, $c. If you need a message delivered, it'll more than likely be routed through me first."]="Reparto o correio a e desde Brumas Lazúli, $c. Se você precisa que se entregue uma mensagem, é mais que provável que se envíe primeiro a através de mim."
G["I demand that you send aid to Stonehearth. Help us with our war and to free Stonefather Oremantle."]="I demand that you send aid to Stonehearth. Help us with our war and to free Stonefather Oremantle."
G["I deserve better than this! I am an actor, a performer- not a common dungsweep! For Light's sake, I've performed in the opera at Kharazan!"]="I deserve better than this! I am an actor, a performer- not a common dungsweep! For Light's sake, I've performed in the opera at Kharazan!"
G["I deserve no such respect or reverance, druid. I have betrayed my own kind. The illness of this land is my fault."]="Não merezco tanto respeito nem reverência, druida. E traído a meu gente. A doença desta terra é culpar minha."
G["I desire this eternal quintessence, Duke Hydraxis."]="Desejo a quintaesência eterna, Duque Hidráxis."
G["I desire to travel by hippogryph."]="Desejo viajar de hipogrifo."
G["I desire training."]="I desire training."
G["I despise all of your kind!"]="Desprecio a todos os que são como vocês!"
G["I destroyed twenty hozen before my capture!"]="I destroyed twenty hozen before my capture!"
G["I detect a charge in your paranarbulatric region!  You must have used the Zephyrium Capacitorium lately -- you can't use it again until the charge wears off..."]="I detect a charge in your paranarbulatric region!  You must have used the Zephyrium Capacitorium lately -- you can't use it again until the charge wears off..."
G["I did and you believed me. Thank you for the information, blood elf. You have helped us more than you could know."]="Eu fiz e você acreditou em mim. Obrigado pela informação, elfo sangrento. Você nos ajudou mais do que poderia imaginar."
G["I did everything in my power. The whole world was his, he needed only seize it!"]="I did everything in my power. The whole world was his, he needed only seize it!"
G["I did it!"]="Eu consegui!"
G["I did it! I got us back on track!"]="O e conseguido! E conseguido que recuperemos o rumbo!"
G["I did it, I did it!!!"]="O logré, o logré!!!"
G["I did not ask for this!"]="Eu não pedí isto!"
G["I did not bring this wretched affliction upon myself, Godfrey. It was a \"gift,\" remember? Now kindly enjoy the \"gift\" and shut up."]="I did not bring this wretched affliction upon myself, Godfrey. It was a \"gift,\" remember? Now kindly enjoy the \"gift\" and shut up."
G["I did not come here to watch animals tear at each other senselessly, Tirion."]="I did not come here to watch animals tear at each other senselessly, Tirion."
G["I did not doubt my victory for a moment."]="Eu não duvidei de minha vitória nem por um momento."
G["I did not doubt you for even one second, $n.\n\nHere are your orders, $n. I know that you will not let me down."]="I did not doubt you for even one second, $n.\n\nHere are your orders, $n. I know that you will not let me down."
G["I did not expect to see $rs in this land. You are certainly welcome here.\n\nPlease, do you have supplies for trade? We are low on an assortment of things."]="I did not expect to see $rs in this land. You are certainly welcome here.\n\nPlease, do you have supplies for trade? We are low on an assortment of things."
G["I did not make this decision lightly, Vol'jin. I know our alliances will suffer for it. I know the Horde will be irreversibly changed. But I made this choice with confidence that Garrosh is exactly what the Horde needs."]="I did not make this decision lightly, Vol'jin. I know our alliances will suffer for it. I know the Horde will be irreversibly changed. But I made this choice with confidence that Garrosh is exactly what the Horde needs."
G["I did not mean to deceive you, elder. The draenei of Telredor thought to approach you in a way that would be familiar to you."]="I did not mean to deceive you, elder. The draenei of Telredor thought to approach you in a way that would be familiar to you."
G["I did not sanction their actions.  Tell her to deal with it."]="Não sancioné seus ações. Diga que se ocupe de elho."
G["I did not think that help would come. You have given me new hope, stranger."]="I did not think that help would come. You have given me new hope, stranger."
G["I did not wish to lower myself by engaging your kind, but you leave me little choice..."]="I did not wish to lower myself by engaging your kind, but you leave me little choice..."
G["I did warn you of the dangers of these woods."]="Eu avisei você que a floresta era perigosa."
G["I did warn you, Wakener."]="Te o advertí, arauto."
G["I did warn you. Pity."]="Eu lhe avisei. Pena."
G["I did what I had to, brother. You gave me no alternative."]="I did what I had to, brother. You gave me no alternative."
G["I did... my best."]="Fiz… o que pude…"
G["I didn't ask for this!"]="Eu não pedí isto!"
G["I didn't ask what you want. I asked you to fulfill your oaths sworn to the horde.\n\nWe are at war, $p, in case you forgot.\n\nIn such times, personal interests must take second place to duty."]="I didn't ask what you want. I asked you to fulfill your oaths sworn to the horde.\n\nWe are at war, $p, in case you forgot.\n\nIn such times, personal interests must take second place to duty."
G["I didn't come all this way from Silvermoon City to toil my life away in a mine!"]="I didn't come all this way from Silvermoon City to toil my life away in a mine!"
G["I didn't come to save your sorry hide, goblin. Did you find fuel or not?"]="Não e vindo a superando seu desprezível pelego, goblin. Tem encontrado combustível ou não?"
G["I didn't even break a sweat on that one!"]="Não e sudado nem uma gota!"
G["I didn't get to be the Shredmaster by putting up with chumps like you!"]="I didn't get to be the Shredmaster by putting up with chumps like you!"
G["I didn't hate that."]="I didn't hate that."
G["I didn't know bees didn't like fire!"]="I didn't know bees didn't like fire!"
G["I didn't know he was getting married! I didn't even know he was dating! That's terrible! He can't work nights anymore!"]="I didn't know he was getting married! I didn't even know he was dating! That's terrible! He can't work nights anymore!"
G["I didn't know it came in lightning-blue!  AWESOME!!"]="Não sabia que os hicieran em azul eléctrico! INCRÍVEL!!"
G["I didn't know they could do that."]="I didn't know they could do that."
G["I didn't like him much anyway. Too much talk, not enough \"do.\""]="I didn't like him much anyway. Too much talk, not enough \"do.\""
G["I didn't like that pet anyways.  Beshides... People stop by all the time and give me their pets.  If I lost one, it doesn't matter, I've got dozens more to lose!"]="I didn't like that pet anyways.  Beshides... People stop by all the time and give me their pets.  If I lost one, it doesn't matter, I've got dozens more to lose!"
G["I didn't mean to drag you into this, $n.  Ever since we took on a job to steal Lord Valthalak's spellbook, everyone involved has wound up dead or missing."]="I didn't mean to drag you into this, $n.  Ever since we took on a job to steal Lord Valthalak's spellbook, everyone involved has wound up dead or missing."
G["I didn't need him! Not when I've got YOU oafs!"]="Não lhe preciso, os tenho a VOCÊS, idiotas!"
G["I didn't say Twilight's Hammer. YOU said Twilight's Hammer."]="Eu não e dito \"Martelo Crepúsculo\". VOCÊ tem dito \"Martelo Crepúsculo\"."
G["I didn't see anything."]="Não vi nada."
G["I didn't see my people die at Mogujia to have you snuff out our only remaining avenue to the Bell."]="Meu gente não morreu em Mogujia para que você agora destruyas nossa única oportunidade de conseguir a sino."
G["I didn't see the Light step in to save my wife and children!"]="I didn't see the Light step in to save my wife and children!"
G["I didn't see who killed 'em, $g bub:lady;, but I got a whiff. Smelled rich, kinda like you. Damn shame too. Furlbrows were a fixture around here. Nice people, always willin' to share a meal or a patch of dirt."]="I didn't see who killed 'em, $g bub:lady;, but I got a whiff. Smelled rich, kinda like you. Damn shame too. Furlbrows were a fixture around here. Nice people, always willin' to share a meal or a patch of dirt."
G["I didn't sign up for this garbage! I coulda been back helping Mekkatorque reclaim Gnomeregan!"]="I didn't sign up for this garbage! I coulda been back helping Mekkatorque reclaim Gnomeregan!"
G["I didn't sign up for this!"]="Eu não me apunté a isto!"
G["I didn't sign up for this..."]="Não me alisté para isto..."
G["I didn't talk to you back in school and I'm sure not going to start now."]="Não falei com você na escola e tenho certeza que não vou começar agora."
G["I didn't think anyone was coming for us."]="Não pensei que ninguém viniese a por nós."
G["I didn't think anyone would mind if I didn't stay to help run the faire."]="Não acho que a ninguém lhe importe se não me quedo a ajudar com a feira."
G["I didn't think so.  Now hand me that potion, Krennan... and double the dosage."]="I didn't think so.  Now hand me that potion, Krennan... and double the dosage."
G["I didn't think this mission would amount to much, but the blood elves' presence has us all on high alert."]="Não achava que a missão fosse grande coisa, mas a presença dos elfos de sangue nos tna todos em alerta."
G["I didn't touch it! I promise you!"]="Não o e tocado! Te o prometo!"
G["I didn't want to do that."]="Não queria fazer isso."
G["I didn't.  You just told me!"]="Não o sabia. Me o acabas de dizer!"
G["I didn't... deserve this..."]="I didn't... deserve this..."
G["I die before my task is complete."]="I die before my task is complete."
G["I die doin' what I love!"]="I die doin' what I love!"
G["I die for Hellscream!"]="I die for Hellscream!"
G["I die... with honor... Lok'tar Ogar..."]="I die... with honor... Lok'tar Ogar..."
G["I disagree. We cannot underestimate the yaungol's strength."]="Não estou de acordo. Não devemos subestimar a força dos yaungol."
G["I discovered this cave on our first day here.  I believe the energy in the stone can be used to our advantage."]="I discovered this cave on our first day here.  I believe the energy in the stone can be used to our advantage."
G["I dislike elekks. Strongly."]="Ódio aos elekks. Com toda minha alma."
G["I do as I must!"]="Cumplo com meu dever!"
G["I do believe your grandpa would be very proud of you."]="I do believe your grandpa would be very proud of you."
G["I do declare... a moving box.  The engineers have really done it this time!"]="Por meu honra! Uma caixa que anda. Esta vez os engenheiros se têm superado!"
G["I do have a mighty roar."]="Meu grunhido é poderoso."
G["I do have some openings in your line of work.  Report to the civilian liaison."]="I do have some openings in your line of work.  Report to the civilian liaison."
G["I do hope that the other agents made it. Otherwise, I'll have more work to do."]="Espero que os mais agentes estejam bem. Se não, teremos mais trabalho pendente."
G["I do hope they stay alive long enough for me to... introduce myself."]="Espero que não mueran antes de que me presente... como é devido."
G["I do hope you're prepared to feed your pets to mine as a treat."]="Espero que você esteja ciente de que suas mascotes vão ser o lanchinho das minhas."
G["I do not believe admiration and wistful thoughts are against the societal norm."]="I do not believe admiration and wistful thoughts are against the societal norm."
G["I do not believe you possess the mental acuity to grasp the nature of portal magic."]="Não acredito que você possua a acuidade mental para compreender a natureza da magia do portal."
G["I do not believe you possess the mental acuity to grasp the nature of portal magic.\n\nHowever, you can use the crystal behind me to teleport to the ruins below Dalaran in Crystalsong Forest."]="Não acho que poseas a agudeza mental necessário para entender a natureza da magia de portais.\n\nNo entanto, você pode usar o cristal atrás de mim para teleportar às ruínas que se encontram baixo Dalaran na Floresta Canto de Cristal."
G["I do not deserve such praise, Warlord Goretooth."]="Eu não mereço esse elogio, senhor da guerra Goretooth."
G["I do not enjoy conversation."]="Eu não gosto de conversar."
G["I do not fear death at your hands, $r!"]="Não temo a morte pelo seu mão, $r!"
G["I do not fear death."]="Não temo à morte."
G["I do not fear you, $r. You would be wise to fear me..."]="I do not fear you, $r. You would be wise to fear me..."
G["I do not have all day to fight you.  Challenge me when your skills have improved."]="Não tenho tudo o dia para lutar com você. Enfrente a mim quando seu habilidade tenha aprimorado."
G["I do not have much time in this world, but Light willing, it is time enough to fulfill my destiny.  When you face Baron Rivendare, I will be with you."]="Não tenho muito tempo neste mundo, mas desejo da Luz, é tempo suficiente para cumprir o meu destino. Quando você enfrentar o Barão Rivendare, eu estarei com você."
G["I do not have the knowledge you seek."]="Eu não tenho o conhecimento que você procura."
G["I do not have time to waste, $c; there is a war at Ahn'Qiraj to prepare for. If you are going to help, we are collecting singed corestones from the Molten Core. I need to gather a total of $2110w, and currently have $2109w."]="I do not have time to waste, $c; there is a war at Ahn'Qiraj to prepare for. If you are going to help, we are collecting singed corestones from the Molten Core. I need to gather a total of $2110w, and currently have $2109w."
G["I do not have time to waste, stranger. State your business or be off!"]="Não tenho tempo a perder, estranho. Indique o seu negócio ou desapareça!"
G["I do not judge others by their stature, $r, but by their courage and loyalty."]="I do not judge others by their stature, $r, but by their courage and loyalty."
G["I do not know this Eye of the Tiger some speak of, but I can show you how to use the claws of the tiger."]="Não sei nada desse Olho do tigres do que algum falam mas posso ensinar a usar as garras do tigres."
G["I do not know what became of them.\n\nThere was a constant flow of captives. Horde and Alliance, both - all barely alive.\n\nThey must've been hauled away beyond the trench, or they have perished."]="I do not know what became of them.\n\nThere was a constant flow of captives. Horde and Alliance, both - all barely alive.\n\nThey must've been hauled away beyond the trench, or they have perished."
G["I do not know what manner of ruse you're attempting, Broken wretch, but I want no part in this!"]="I do not know what manner of ruse you're attempting, Broken wretch, but I want no part in this!"
G["I do not know what the ultimate consequences will be. Nobody does."]="Não sei quais serão as consecuências definitivas... Ninguém o sabe."
G["I do not know what to make of these elves from across the sea. The tauren and elves of this continent have always warred."]="Não sei que pensar desses elfos do outro lado do mar. Os tauren e os elfos deste continente sempre têm estado em guerra."
G["I do not know what you speak of, dragon... but  I will not be bullied by this display of insolence.  I'll leave Karazhan when it suits me!"]="Não sei de que está falando, dragão..., mas não me acobardará esta demonstração de insolência. Me irei de Karazhan quando me plazca!"
G["I do not know who you are, but I thank you. Without your aid, our world would be...I do not wish to think about it. Moon goddess light your path."]="I do not know who you are, but I thank you. Without your aid, our world would be...I do not wish to think about it. Moon goddess light your path."
G["I do not know why the mists have opened. But I know that it is for a reason."]="Não sei por que se abriu a névoa, mas sei que há uma razão."
G["I do not know, $r.\n\nWe know so little about the Klaxxi. They seem to be quite ruthless, so perhaps your only reward would be a swift death.\n\nThen again, their civilization is quite vast and advanced. If you play your cards right, perhaps they will grant you untold power.\n\nThere is only one way to find out."]="I do not know, $r.\n\nWe know so little about the Klaxxi. They seem to be quite ruthless, so perhaps your only reward would be a swift death.\n\nThen again, their civilization is quite vast and advanced. If you play your cards right, perhaps they will grant you untold power.\n\nThere is only one way to find out."
G["I do not know, Banshee Queen. I suspect that the piece of Arthas that might be left inside the Lich King is all that holds the Scourge from annihilating Azeroth."]="Não o sei, Rainha alma em pena. Suponho que a parte de Arthas que vive dentro do Rei Lich é tudo o que evita que o Flagelo aniquile Azeroth."
G["I do not know, Jaina. I suspect that the piece of Arthas that might be left inside the Lich King is all that holds the Scourge from annihilating Azeroth."]="Não o sei, Jaina. Suponho que a parte de Arthas que vive dentro do Rei Lich é tudo o que evita que o Flagelo aniquile Azeroth."
G["I do not know, child."]="Não o sei, filha minha."
G["I do not know, sentinel. What I sense is dark magic. Pure evil."]="I do not know, sentinel. What I sense is dark magic. Pure evil."
G["I do not like the look of that troll. Be careful!"]="Não me gosta esse troll. Tenha cuidado!"
G["I do not like the taste of this magic."]="Não me gostao sabor desta magia."
G["I do not like these human cities of stone and steel. I would prefer the forests of Ashenvale, tracking great beasts. But my dear brother, Kaerbrus, felt it would be beneficial to train the humans in our ways. So while I honor him and offer my services, I do not have to like it."]="I do not like these human cities of stone and steel. I would prefer the forests of Ashenvale, tracking great beasts. But my dear brother, Kaerbrus, felt it would be beneficial to train the humans in our ways. So while I honor him and offer my services, I do not have to like it."
G["I do not like this place, $r. There is something strange about it."]="Não me gosta este lugar, $r. Há algo estranho em ele."
G["I do not offer apprentice training. Look for the tauren Waldor in the Wailing Caverns, here in the Barrens. He can assist you with whatever you need."]="Eu não ofereço treinamento de aprendiz. Procure o tauren Waldor nas Cavernas das Lamentações, aqui nos Sertões. Ele pode ajudá-o com o que você precisar."
G["I do not possess any proof, Cyrus."]="Eu não possuo nenhuma prova, Cyrus."
G["I do not require defending, ambassador. Young one, as I have told the warchief, my loyalties have never been in doubt."]="Não preciso que me defienda ninguém, embaixador. Jovem, como já lhe e dito ao Chefe de Guerra, nunca se você deve colocar em dúvida meu lealdade."
G["I do not see any rainbows today. Do you?"]="Eu não vejo nenhum arco-íris hoje. Você vê?"
G["I do not see how this evil artifact is relevant to the undead. We must destroy it!"]="I do not see how this evil artifact is relevant to the undead. We must destroy it!"
G["I do not see the warrior's spirit within you, child.  I have no teachings which would benefit a $c such as yourself."]="I do not see the warrior's spirit within you, child.  I have no teachings which would benefit a $c such as yourself."
G["I do not sense lies in your voice, Akama.  That Kael'thas would betray me does not come as a big surprise - I'm not as oblivious as some would think. That one of your own was involved with him puts your loyalties into question."]="I do not sense lies in your voice, Akama.  That Kael'thas would betray me does not come as a big surprise - I'm not as oblivious as some would think. That one of your own was involved with him puts your loyalties into question."
G["I do not think enough attention is being paid to those trolls.  They could swarm in here anytime."]="I do not think enough attention is being paid to those trolls.  They could swarm in here anytime."
G["I do not trust you enough to speak of such things.\n\nYou must respect the trials our people have endured, the burdens we have borne...\n\nPerhaps, if you were to bring great honor to Dun Niffelem, I would be inclined to share with you the knowledge of our people."]="I do not trust you enough to speak of such things.\n\nYou must respect the trials our people have endured, the burdens we have borne...\n\nPerhaps, if you were to bring great honor to Dun Niffelem, I would be inclined to share with you the knowledge of our people."
G["I do not trust you, $r."]="Não confío em ti, $r."
G["I do not understand the significance of the Forsaken burning a great wicker effigy each night, but our own rituals must seem just as strange to them."]="Não compreendo o significado dos Renegados queimando uma grande efígie de vime todas as noites, mas nossos próprios rituais devem parecer estranhos para eles."
G["I do not understand this fruit vendor or their ogre.  It seemed as though war was upon us... Yet nothing has happened."]="I do not understand this fruit vendor or their ogre.  It seemed as though war was upon us... Yet nothing has happened."
G["I do not understand."]="Eu não entendo."
G["I do not understand. How could I lose?"]="Eu não entendo. Como eu pude perder?"
G["I do not wish to make an event of this.  Such frivolities are expensive and merely serve our vanity.  But if you wish to have a celebration..."]="I do not wish to make an event of this.  Such frivolities are expensive and merely serve our vanity.  But if you wish to have a celebration..."
G["I do not! YOU are the one who forgets my husband is one of the captives."]="Não! É você quem não quer ver que meu marido é um dos esses prisioneiros."
G["I do seem to have mistakenly come into possesion of some artifacts from Uldum. Perhaps the Reliquary is interested in those?"]="I do seem to have mistakenly come into possesion of some artifacts from Uldum. Perhaps the Reliquary is interested in those?"
G["I do so enjoy sitting out here, listening to the sounds of the Great Sea.  Oh, what?  Yes, there is a ship that will take you to Menethil Harbor.  It docks here from time to time."]="Eu gosto de sentar aqui, ouvindo os sons do Grande Mar. Oh o que? Sim, há um navio que o levará ao porto de Menethil. Atraca aqui de vez em quando."
G["I do so hope these... Argent Dawn manage things here.  I would hate to sully my robe on demon rabble!"]="Também espero que esses..., os do Alba Argêntea, se ocupen do que passa aqui. Não gostaria manchar meu túnica com essa sucata de demônios."
G["I do something bad? I sorry...."]="I do something bad? I sorry...."
G["I do what I must for Lordaeron, and neither your words nor your actions will stop me."]="Faço o que devo por Lordaeron e nem suas palavras, nem suas ações me detendrán."
G["I do what I must."]="Faço o que é preciso."
G["I do what I must. Please forgive me, noble soldiers."]="I do what I must. Please forgive me, noble soldiers."
G["I do what me can to train you in the priestly ways, if that what you be here for."]="Faço o que posso para treiná-o da maneira sacerdotal, se é para isso que você está aqui."
G["I do!"]="Sim!"
G["I do, Chi-Ji."]="Assim é, Chi-Ji."
G["I do, for I wield the sword!"]="Eu, pois eu tenho a espada!"
G["I do."]="Sim, quero."
G["I do. $n has just returned with it. What of the grimoire?"]="I do. $n has just returned with it. What of the grimoire?"
G["I do. $n just returned with it, but how do I know you're going to keep your end of the bargain?"]="I do. $n just returned with it, but how do I know you're going to keep your end of the bargain?"
G["I do. The way to defeat Fear is to look it straight in the eye, unblinking, unwavering."]="I do. The way to defeat Fear is to look it straight in the eye, unblinking, unwavering."
G["I documented some special schematics in my journal, but it's gone missin'. We'll just hafta make do."]="I documented some special schematics in my journal, but it's gone missin'. We'll just hafta make do."
G["I don' know why the spirits be rejectin' us so."]="I don' know why the spirits be rejectin' us so."
G["I don' know, $r. Dis big vegetables don' seem right, mon. How can dey just eat dem like it's nuddin'? Where is all dey MEAT?"]="I don' know, $r. Dis big vegetables don' seem right, mon. How can dey just eat dem like it's nuddin'? Where is all dey MEAT?"
G["I don' wanna die in a fire, mon."]="I don' wanna die in a fire, mon."
G["I don't admit this lightly, but you are a far better smith than I am. If you want to learn more than my meager teachings then I suggest you seek out a Dwarf named Therum Deepforge in Stormwind. You will find him in the Dwarven District."]="Não admito isso levianamente, mas você é um ferreiro muito melhor do que eu. Se você quiser aprender mais do que meus poucos ensinamentos, sugiro que procure um anão chamado Therum Deepforge em Ventobravo. Você o encontrará no distrito de Dwarven."
G["I don't agree with your turning to alchemy to fix some of the problems, but I do agree with the results. Very well done."]="Não estou de acordo com que recurras à alquimia para resolver algum problemas, mas si estou de acordo com os resultados. O fez muito bem."
G["I don't approve of your experiments, Gerard, but I must admit the results are impressive. What exactly did you do to her?"]="I don't approve of your experiments, Gerard, but I must admit the results are impressive. What exactly did you do to her?"
G["I don't be hearin' de whispers no more, $n. What happened in de cave?"]="Já não oigo os sussurros, $n. Que tem ocurri'o em essa caverna?"
G["I don't be worryin' 'bout no Lich Kings. Seen a lotta big-shots come and go, dey always messin' somethin' up. It ain't long aftah that when a posse rolls on through and sends dem quick on dey way to da history books. Dis one ain't no different."]="Não me preocupo com nenhum Lich Kings. Vimos muitos figurões indo e vindo, eles sempre estragam alguma coisa. Não demorou muito para que, quando um grupo chegasse e os enviasse rapidamente para os livros de história. Este não é diferente."
G["I don't believe it!"]="Não me o acho!"
G["I don't believe it! Alliance colors!"]="Incrível! Os cores da Aliança!"
G["I don't believe it! I seared the life from your body!"]="Não pode ser! Abrasé a vida do seu corpo!"
G["I don't believe my eyes... Is dat Bloodlord Mandokir?  Dis gonna be bad..."]="Não acho o que meus olhos veem... É esse o senhor sangrenta Mandokir? Eh'to tem mal pinta..."
G["I don't believe that is part of our contract. We are done here."]="Eu não creio que isso seja parte do nosso contrato. Não temos mais negócios a tratar."
G["I don't blame you for wanting to get out of here. Go up topside and head north of the ruins. The zeppelins leave from the two towers there."]="Não culpo você por querer sair daqui. Suba a parte superior e continue para o norte das ruínas. Os zepelins partem das duas torres de lá."
G["I don't care about the shell, just get the internal parts!"]="I don't care about the shell, just get the internal parts!"
G["I don't care about your war, Crowley."]="Não me importa seu guerra, Crowley."
G["I don't care how fancy your gear is, $n, if you don't take care of your feet then you're finished. So give those pups a break and use my portal to instantly travel back the entrance."]="Da igual o maravilhoso que seja seu equipamento se ao fim não pode ter em pé, $n. Da um descanso aos seus pés e usa meu portal para voltar imediatamente à entrada."
G["I don't care how low the success rate here is. If we save even one worgen from the madness and savagery of the woods, our struggles are not in vain."]="Não me importo com a baixa taxa de sucesso aqui. Se salvarmos um worgen da loucura e selvageria da floresta, nossas lutas não serão em vão."
G["I don't care how many times I have to kill you...I'll take you all on to save this land!"]="I don't care how many times I have to kill you...I'll take you all on to save this land!"
G["I don't care how short you are or how proportionally large and heavy these crates are, get them below decks."]="Não me importa seu estatura ou que em comparação com você esses cajones sejam grandes e pesados. Bájalos à bodega."
G["I don't care if I die inside this husk, $n.  I'll pay these naga back for every one of my fellow soldiers they've killed or enslaved!\n\nThe others can worry about escape.  I'll worry about doling out punishment to these snakes."]="I don't care if I die inside this husk, $n.  I'll pay these naga back for every one of my fellow soldiers they've killed or enslaved!\n\nThe others can worry about escape.  I'll worry about doling out punishment to these snakes."
G["I don't care to hear it, $n. Nope, no way are you going to be let into the Searing Gorge. Impossible. Not going to happen. How many times do I have to tell you - I can't let you in! Do you not speak Common? Are you an orc in disguise? N-O. NO!\n\nIf I let you in, then I have to let everybody in. Pretty soon your close friends will want in, then their distant relatives, then their friends, and so on and so forth. The last time that happened... well, we won't talk about the last time it happened.\n\nI will NOT open that gate!"]="I don't care to hear it, $n. Nope, no way are you going to be let into the Searing Gorge. Impossible. Not going to happen. How many times do I have to tell you - I can't let you in! Do you not speak Common? Are you an orc in disguise? N-O. NO!\n\nIf I let you in, then I have to let everybody in. Pretty soon your close friends will want in, then their distant relatives, then their friends, and so on and so forth. The last time that happened... well, we won't talk about the last time it happened.\n\nI will NOT open that gate!"
G["I don't care to hear it, $n. Nope, no way are you going to be let into the Searing Gorge. Impossible. Not going to happen. How many times do I have to tell you - I can't let you in! Do you not speak common? Are you an orc in disguise? N-O. NO!\n\nIf I let you in, then I have to let everybody in. Pretty soon your close friends will want in, then their distant relatives, then their friends, and so on and so forth. The last time that happened... well, we won't talk about the last time it happened."]="I don't care to hear it, $n. Nope, no way are you going to be let into the Searing Gorge. Impossible. Not going to happen. How many times do I have to tell you - I can't let you in! Do you not speak common? Are you an orc in disguise? N-O. NO!\n\nIf I let you in, then I have to let everybody in. Pretty soon your close friends will want in, then their distant relatives, then their friends, and so on and so forth. The last time that happened... well, we won't talk about the last time it happened."
G["I don't care what it's for! Is it going to get this door open?"]="Não me importa para o que serve! Conseguirá abrir a porta?"
G["I don't care what you say. If that $c is here to help us, I say we welcome $g him : her; with arms wide open!"]="I don't care what you say. If that $c is here to help us, I say we welcome $g him : her; with arms wide open!"
G["I don't care who you are or what you do outside of the Skyguard, but while you're here you will do as you're told."]="Não me importo com quem você é ou com o que está fazendo fosse do Skyguard, mas enquanto estiver aqui, fará o que for solicitado."
G["I don't care! I'M KILLING EVERYTHING ON BOARD! Move it, grunts!"]="I don't care! I'M KILLING EVERYTHING ON BOARD! Move it, grunts!"
G["I don't deserve something as nice as that. I suppose you're going to insist."]="Não merezco nada tão bom. Mas imagino que insistirás."
G["I don't eat pork..."]="Eu não como porco..."
G["I don't even have my gear on!"]="Nem sequer me e posto meu equipamento!"
G["I don't even know how to fish! Can you teach me?"]="I don't even know how to fish! Can you teach me?"
G["I don't even know how to use this weapon... but I reckon if I stand here looking menacing, the worgen might go somewhere else."]="Eu nem sei como usar essa arma... mas acho que se eu ficar aqui parecendo ameaçador, o worgen pode ir para outro lugar."
G["I don't even want to think about what'll happen here if $n ever decides not to come back."]="I don't even want to think about what'll happen here if $n ever decides not to come back."
G["I don't ever want to smell unwashed trogg again!"]="I don't ever want to smell unwashed trogg again!"
G["I don't feel so good..."]="Não me sinto muito bem..."
G["I don't get it! Are ya blind? Can ya not see the demons bangin' on our door? Who am I gonna send out to talk to your shaman friends? Point 'em out!"]="Não o pilho! É que não vê o que acontece? Não vê os demônios que golpeiam nossa porta? A quem vou enviar para falar com os seus amigos chamanes? Senhálalos!"
G["I don't get many visitors this deep in the Plaguewood.  Abominations, mostly.\n\nCan I help you with something?"]="Não sozinho receber muitos visitantes tão ao interior da Mata Pestilenta. Abominações, mais que nada.\n\nTe posso ajudar em algo?"
G["I don't get many visitors.  You're looking for something specific, yes?"]="Eu não recebo muitos visitantes. Você está procurando algo específico, sim?"
G["I don't get paid enough for this bull excrement!"]="I don't get paid enough for this bull excrement!"
G["I don't get paid enough for this nonsense."]="I don't get paid enough for this nonsense."
G["I don't get paid enough for this!"]="Não cobrado o suficiente por isto!"
G["I don't get too many Leatherworkers in here looking for training, but I guess I could teach you something if you're ready."]="I don't get too many Leatherworkers in here looking for training, but I guess I could teach you something if you're ready."
G["I don't get too many Skinners in here looking for training, but I guess I could teach you something if you're ready."]="Eu não tenho muitos Skinners aqui procurando por treinamento, mas acho que posso ensinar uma coisa, se você estiver pronto."
G["I don't get too many cooks in here looking for training, but I guess I could teach you something if you're ready."]="Eu não tenho muitos cozinheiros aqui procurando por treinamento, mas acho que posso ensinar uma coisa, se você estiver pronto."
G["I don't get why so many other monks throw kegs around.  So wasteful."]="I don't get why so many other monks throw kegs around.  So wasteful."
G["I don't give a damn what Shaffar's ethereals have placed over the entrance to the Mana-Tombs. You will work until those wards are removed and the Consortium can move in safely and take what's rightfully ours!"]="I don't give a damn what Shaffar's ethereals have placed over the entrance to the Mana-Tombs. You will work until those wards are removed and the Consortium can move in safely and take what's rightfully ours!"
G["I don't have all day to wait out here for that message. There are things that Dame Auriferous has tasked me with seeing to!"]="Não tenho tudo o dia para esperar aqui esse mensagem. Há tarefas que a Dama Aurífera me encomendado!"
G["I don't have all day, pal!"]="Não tenho o dia todo, camarada!"
G["I don't have enough mana! Oh no!"]="Me e ficado sem mana... Oh, não!"
G["I don't have much time for idle talk, $N. I've got to get this bridge rebuilt before the rains come. I've finished every project on-time and under budget and I'm not about to start slipping now."]="I don't have much time for idle talk, $N. I've got to get this bridge rebuilt before the rains come. I've finished every project on-time and under budget and I'm not about to start slipping now."
G["I don't have that many cats, right? I mean, it's quite reasonable when you think about it."]="I don't have that many cats, right? I mean, it's quite reasonable when you think about it."
G["I don't have the Repaired Diving Gear anymore. Do you have a spare?"]="Eu não tenho mais o equipamento de mergulho reparado. Você tem um sobressalente?"
G["I don't have the big beer belly. I need a big beer belly. All right. I'm workin' on it!"]="I don't have the big beer belly. I need a big beer belly. All right. I'm workin' on it!"
G["I don't have the shackles key."]="Não tenho a chave dos grilhetes."
G["I don't have time for chit-chat, Lou. Take me to Scalawag Point."]="Não tenho tempo para conversar, Lou. Leve-me ao ponto Scalawag."
G["I don't have time for idle chitchat. I have men and women to train, and a tower to watch."]="Não tenho tempo para conversa fiada. Eu tenho homens e mulheres para treinar e uma torre para vigiar."
G["I don't have time for idle gossip, I'm a professional!"]="Não tenho tempo para fofocas ociosas, sou profissional!"
G["I don't have time for this!  Warden, what happened?!"]="Não tenho tempo para isso! Diretor, o que aconteceu?!"
G["I don't have time for this! Speak or die!"]="Não tenho tempo para isto! Fala ou morre!"
G["I don't have time for this, lieutenant.  Make sure that you handle it."]="Não tenho tempo para isto, tenente. Faça você mesmo."
G["I don't have time for this. Move your ass or I'll move it for you."]="Não tenho tempo para isto. OU te move ou te muevo."
G["I don't have time right now. I need to get ready to meet an important student soon."]="I don't have time right now. I need to get ready to meet an important student soon."
G["I don't have time to babysit! Go talk to me assistant, Uthrar!"]="I don't have time to babysit! Go talk to me assistant, Uthrar!"
G["I don't have time to talk right now."]="Não tenho tempo para conversar agora."
G["I don't have to be a fortune-telling imp to know the answer to that one - NO!"]="Não é preciso ser um diabrete advino para saber que a resposta é \"não\"."
G["I don't have to listen to your guff, mister!"]="I don't have to listen to your guff, mister!"
G["I don't have to take this. I'll be part of no Alliance that has a Firebeard innit. That's me final word!"]="I don't have to take this. I'll be part of no Alliance that has a Firebeard innit. That's me final word!"
G["I don't have to wory about getting sunburned out here."]="I don't have to wory about getting sunburned out here."
G["I don't hear that crazy troll yelling any longer.  Music to my ears!"]="Já não se oyen mais os gritos desse troll. Música para meus ouvidos!"
G["I don't know about this \"Alliance\", but you look trustworthy. I'll gather everyone up and meet you when we're ready to rebuild!"]="I don't know about this \"Alliance\", but you look trustworthy. I'll gather everyone up and meet you when we're ready to rebuild!"
G["I don't know about this \"Horde\", but you look trustworthy. I'll gather everyone up and meet you when we're ready to rebuild!"]="I don't know about this \"Horde\", but you look trustworthy. I'll gather everyone up and meet you when we're ready to rebuild!"
G["I don't know about this… I've been practicing for so long but I still feel like its my first day. This is hopeless…"]="I don't know about this… I've been practicing for so long but I still feel like its my first day. This is hopeless…"
G["I don't know about you guys, but that clam meat helmet for turning in ten pearls is looking mighty good!"]="Não sei que pensareis vocês, mas esse casco de carne de almeja a caminho de dez pérolas tem boa pinta."
G["I don't know about you, $n, but I for one do not intend to be marooned on this island forever!\n\nIf only I'd stayed at the academy and learned how to use teleport magic...."]="I don't know about you, $n, but I for one do not intend to be marooned on this island forever!\n\nIf only I'd stayed at the academy and learned how to use teleport magic...."
G["I don't know about you, but I really miss the unlimited raw materials that were down in the ruins!\n\nI'm not even sure if I could make a dud grenade out of the little that can be scrounged in this cave!"]="I don't know about you, but I really miss the unlimited raw materials that were down in the ruins!\n\nI'm not even sure if I could make a dud grenade out of the little that can be scrounged in this cave!"
G["I don't know about you, pal, but I can't breathe water."]="Não sei você, amigo, mas não consigo respirar água."
G["I don't know and I don't care."]="Nem o sei nem me importa."
G["I don't know anything about a cult! Please let me get back to work..."]="Não sei nada de nenhuma secta! Deixe-me voltar ao trabalho, por favor..."
G["I don't know how long I've been watching over the camp..."]="Não sei quanto tempo tenho estado observando o acampamento..."
G["I don't know how much longer I can hold on!"]="Não sei quanto tempo nunca poderei aguantar!"
G["I don't know how much longer I'll be open today with all the commotion outside. If you need something repaired, I'll take a quick look."]="I don't know how much longer I'll be open today with all the commotion outside. If you need something repaired, I'll take a quick look."
G["I don't know how these fireworks work, but they sure are pretty!"]="Não sei como funcionam esses fogos de artifício, mas com certeza são bonitos!"
G["I don't know how they do it...  those mailboxes must be magic portals or something.  Why I see people gathered around the mailbox next to the bank all day pulling swords and shields and various armor all from that small box!"]="Eu não sei como eles fazem isso... essas caixas de correio devem ser portais mágicas ou algo assim. Por que vejo pessoas reunidas em torno da caixa de correio ao lado do banco o dia tudo puxando espadas e escudos e várias armaduras todas daquela pequena caixa!"
G["I don't know how they found a way up from underneath, but I can't seal the hatch until they're off of me!"]="I don't know how they found a way up from underneath, but I can't seal the hatch until they're off of me!"
G["I don't know how we did it, but we managed to fend off those hozen.\n\nThanks to you, mate."]="I don't know how we did it, but we managed to fend off those hozen.\n\nThanks to you, mate."
G["I don't know how, but the blade has chosen you to be its new wielder. Take it with my blessing, and wield it against the Scourge as I once did."]="Não sei como, mas a lâmina você escolhido para que a portes. Lhévala com meu bênção e utilízala contra o Flagelo, como fiz eu uma vez."
G["I don't know if I can compete! Everyone is so much bigger!"]="Não sei se posso competir! Tudo o mundo é muito mais grande que eu!"
G["I don't know if I can make it. Please help me..."]="I don't know if I can make it. Please help me..."
G["I don't know if it's good to have my mind back.\n\nKnowing what I know... Knowing what may happen to our world...\n\n<He shudders and falls silent.>"]="I don't know if it's good to have my mind back.\n\nKnowing what I know... Knowing what may happen to our world...\n\n<He shudders and falls silent.>"
G["I don't know much about art... but I know what I like!"]="Não sei muito eu sobre arte... mas sei o que me gosta."
G["I don't know much about dragons, but a big, scary one showed up one day just over yonder, near the entrance to the Caverns of Time.  He kept yelling something about...what was it...the end of time as we know it?  I wasn't really paying much attention."]="Não sei muito sobre dragões, mas um grande e assustador apareceu um dia logo depois, perto da entrada das Cavernas do Tempo. Ele continuou gritando algo sobre... o que foi... o fim dos tempos como o conhecemos? Eu mesmo não estava prestando muita atenção."
G["I don't know much about magic, but there's a mage named Zaldimar who is staying at the Lion's Pride Inn that could probably assist you."]="Não sei muito sobre magia, mas há um mago chamado Zaldimar que está hospedado no Lion's Pride Inn que provavelmente poderia ajudá-o."
G["I don't know nothin' bout no forgemaster.  Now tell me where this safe place you came from is!"]="Não sei nada de nenhum mestre de forja. Agora diga onde está esse lugar certo do que tem vindo!"
G["I don't know nothing! Ask the others."]="Eu não sei de nada! Pergunte aos outros."
G["I don't know of one of those around here.  Your best bet is to go to Orgrimmar to the north and speak to one of their grunts."]="Eu não conheço nenhum daqueles por aqui. Sua melhor aposta é ir até Orgrimmar, ao norte, e falar com um dos seus grunhidos."
G["I don't know that cub."]="Não conheço a esse filhote."
G["I don't know what Blackmoore sees in you. For my money you're just another ignorant savage!"]="Não sei o que Lodonegro vê em ti. Por meu dinheiro não é mais que outro selvagem ignorante!"
G["I don't know what I was thinking, going out without my sword. I would've put it on if I'd seen it here..."]="Não sei em que estava pensando. Olhe que sair sem meu lâmina... Me a haveria posto se a tivesse visto aqui..."
G["I don't know what I would have done without you.  It's good that you came."]="Não sei o que haveria feito sem ti. fico feliz em que vinieras."
G["I don't know what I'm doing here. I have no experience as a contract negotiatior.\n\nI used to serve drinks for a living, but Daisy put me out of business. Time for a new career, I guess."]="I don't know what I'm doing here. I have no experience as a contract negotiatior.\n\nI used to serve drinks for a living, but Daisy put me out of business. Time for a new career, I guess."
G["I don't know what brought you into the Forbidden Jungle, but I am glad it did. You saved us from slavery... or worse."]="I don't know what brought you into the Forbidden Jungle, but I am glad it did. You saved us from slavery... or worse."
G["I don't know what came over me. Thank you for clearing my head."]="I don't know what came over me. Thank you for clearing my head."
G["I don't know what could be takin' the young prince so long, but I don't think we can hold out for much longer. The cold is gettin' to some of the soldiers."]="Não sei o que pode levar o jovem príncipe por tanto tempo, mas acho que não podemos aguentar mais. O frio está atingindo algum soldados."
G["I don't know what happened. I had just arrived at Venomspite and then all of a sudden I woke up in this cage!\n\nAre you here to rescue me?"]="I don't know what happened. I had just arrived at Venomspite and then all of a sudden I woke up in this cage!\n\nAre you here to rescue me?"
G["I don't know what he's trying to catch there, but Armand Cromwell is on the dock in the Magic Quarter."]="Não sei o que ele está tentando pegar lá, mas Armand Cromwell está no banco dos réus no Magic Quarter."
G["I don't know what smells worse: Your feet or a dung-filled cheese and fish fillet."]="I don't know what smells worse: Your feet or a dung-filled cheese and fish fillet."
G["I don't know what they put in those kegs, but it goes down like honey!"]="Não sei o que eles colocam naqueles barris, mas desce como mel!"
G["I don't know what to think of your kind yet, $r.  Some of you can be violent and kill sporelings on sight.\n\nYou seem friendly... though maybe a little bit funny looking, I suppose."]="I don't know what to think of your kind yet, $r.  Some of you can be violent and kill sporelings on sight.\n\nYou seem friendly... though maybe a little bit funny looking, I suppose."
G["I don't know what you're talking about, elf, and I don't appreciate you pokin' around in my business!"]="I don't know what you're talking about, elf, and I don't appreciate you pokin' around in my business!"
G["I don't know what'll be in it yet.  Pat Nagle and Michael Backus need to discuss this first..."]="Ainda não sei que haverá dentro. Pat Nagle e Michael Backus têm que falar primeiro de elho..."
G["I don't know what's come over me. My heart feels as hot as new steel."]="Eu não sei o que aconteceu comigo. Meu coração está tão quente quanto aço novo."
G["I don't know what's going on around here - it's like everyone has gone crazy!\n\nPlease, can you help?"]="Não sei que é o que está passando por aqui... é como se tudo o mundo se tivesse voltado louco!\n\nPor favor, poderia nos ajudar?"
G["I don't know when we'll see Daddy again, Jimmy, but I know he loves you and he misses you very much."]="Não sei se volveremos a ver a papi, Jimmy, mas sei que te quer e te dê muito de menos."
G["I don't know where the grand admiral is. Go to hell!"]="Não sei onde está o Grande almirante. Vá embora ao inferno!"
G["I don't know where you came from, but if you'll continue to stand up for justice as you have done today, you'll be welcome in Pandaria.\n\nThank you."]="I don't know where you came from, but if you'll continue to stand up for justice as you have done today, you'll be welcome in Pandaria.\n\nThank you."
G["I don't know where you've gone to.  But I can assure you that wherever that is, I will find you and the crystal, Culuthas!"]="I don't know where you've gone to.  But I can assure you that wherever that is, I will find you and the crystal, Culuthas!"
G["I don't know which is worse, getting eaten by fel orcs or working for that slave master Razelcraz! Oh well, thanks anyways!"]="Não sei que é pior, se que te coman orcs vis ou trabalhar para esse mestre de escravos Razelcraz. Bom, Obrigado de todos modos!"
G["I don't know who you are, but I'll defend this shrine with my life. Leave, now, before we come to blows."]="I don't know who you are, but I'll defend this shrine with my life. Leave, now, before we come to blows."
G["I don't know who you are, but you have my gratitude."]="Não sei quem é, mas contas com meu gratidão."
G["I don't know why I put up with his nonsense.  He never takes anything seriously."]="I don't know why I put up with his nonsense.  He never takes anything seriously."
G["I don't know why he won't listen to me!  I'm just trying to explain how to make his noodles even better."]="Não sei por que não me ouça! Somente quero explicarle como fazer que seus macarrão saibam ainda melhor..."
G["I don't know why people treat me like a little kid!"]="I don't know why people treat me like a little kid!"
G["I don't know why the Forsaken burn a wicker man every night of Hallow's End instead of a real one, but it's their holiday."]="Não sei por que os Renegados queimam um homem de vime todas as noites no Hallow's End, em vez de um verdadeiro, mas é o feriado deles."
G["I don't know why the door is closed, heroes. My pack should have already taken care of Godfrey by now..."]="I don't know why the door is closed, heroes. My pack should have already taken care of Godfrey by now..."
G["I don't know why, but those monsters are going out of their way to keep our men alive..."]="Não sei por que, mas esses monstros estão se esforçando para manter nossos homens vivos..."
G["I don't know, Bailey... it's not so bad. We could throw a rock at the tools from here."]="Não o sei, Bailey... não está tão mal. Desde aqui poderíamos tirarle uma pedras às ferramentas."
G["I don't know, I've got a bad feeling. It's way too quiet in there."]="Não sei, este silêncio me da mal espinha..."
G["I don't know, and that worries me. I'll do everything I can to find the Infinites.\n\nWhat I need you to do now is stay close to Arthas by joining his army."]="I don't know, and that worries me. I'll do everything I can to find the Infinites.\n\nWhat I need you to do now is stay close to Arthas by joining his army."
G["I don't know, but I'm glad they did. The respite has allowed Anchorite Elbadon to save many of the men and women under my command. I've sent a few of my stealthiest scouts forward, and they've reported back something interesting. Nearly all of the Sunblade Protectors are powered down! Kil'jaeden's forces appear to be conserving their energy, and seem content to merely contain us with one active Protector. If you and your companions want to force your way inside, allow me to suggest a plan of attack."]="Eu não sei, mas estou feliz que eles fizeram. A trégua permitiu ao anchorita Elbadon salvar muitos homens e mulheres sob meu envio. Enviei algum dos meus batedores mais furtivos para a linha de frente e eles relataram algo interessante. Quase todos os protetores Sunblade estão desligados! As forças de Kil'jaeden parecem estar conservando sua energia e parecem satisfeitas em meramente nos conter um Protetor ativo. Se você e seus companheiros querem forçar a entrada, permita-me sugerir um plano de ataque."
G["I don't know, but they're big and they're pissed!"]="Não o sei, mas são grandes e estão enfadados!"
G["I don't know, dear."]="Não o sei, carinho."
G["I don't know, how many?"]="Não sei, quantos?"
G["I don't know, maybe the grass really is greener on the other side. You know? Krakauer and Danforth really kick butt as warriors. Maybe I should drop this paladin thing and try out being a warrior."]="I don't know, maybe the grass really is greener on the other side. You know? Krakauer and Danforth really kick butt as warriors. Maybe I should drop this paladin thing and try out being a warrior."
G["I don't know, survival of his race, visions of the future, valiant deeds, blah, blah, blah."]="Não o sei, sobrevivência do seu raça, planos de futuro, corajosos façanhas, blá, blá, blá."
G["I don't know.\n\nDon't hit me!"]="Não sei.\n\nNão me pegues!"
G["I don't know. Better kill them both to be on the safe side!"]="Não sei. Melhor os matamos aos dois para estar seguros!"
G["I don't know. I am uncertain this is the proper vehicle to heroism."]="Não sei. Não estou certo de que este sejao veículo adequado para alcançar o heroísmo."
G["I don't know. I think I'm going to miss this place. We had some pretty good times here."]="Eu não sei. Eu acho que vou sentir falta deste lugar. Tivemos bons momentos aqui."
G["I don't know. It still seems like such a waste."]="I don't know. It still seems like such a waste."
G["I don't know... I just am!"]="Não o sei... simplesmente é assim!"
G["I don't know... still got a bad feeling about this yeti being here...\n\nSometimes I catch her just... staring at me."]="I don't know... still got a bad feeling about this yeti being here...\n\nSometimes I catch her just... staring at me."
G["I don't like how it's looking at the pumpkins..."]="I don't like how it's looking at the pumpkins..."
G["I don't like it either, but it boils down to this..."]="I don't like it either, but it boils down to this..."
G["I don't like the feel of this place, $n.  Naga sorceresses and slavedrivers aside... all I can sense inside this cavern is pain.  The ancient one is trying to cry out, but it cannot speak."]="I don't like the feel of this place, $n.  Naga sorceresses and slavedrivers aside... all I can sense inside this cavern is pain.  The ancient one is trying to cry out, but it cannot speak."
G["I don't like the idea of asking Azeroth for help, but we have little choice."]="Não me gosta a ideia de pedir ajuda a Azeroth, mas não temos elecção."
G["I don't like the look of this 'Crown Chemical Co.' one bit."]="Não gosto da aparência deste 'Crown Chemical Co.' um pouco."
G["I don't like the look of this place."]="Não me gostao aspecto deste lugar."
G["I don't like this, $n. Stay alert!"]="I don't like this, $n. Stay alert!"
G["I don't like this..."]="Isto não me gosta..."
G["I don't like this... Feels too easy."]="Não me gosta... Demais fácil."
G["I don't like to see fellow monks in pain. But I'll get over it."]="Não me gosta ver sofrer a outros monges. Mas se me passa."
G["I don't like you anymore!"]="Já não me gustas!"
G["I don't love spiders. Or statues that move. Or sprites that steal your things.  There are a lot of things I don't love about these ruins.  Fortunately for me, Anji's here to keep my good-looks intact!"]="I don't love spiders. Or statues that move. Or sprites that steal your things.  There are a lot of things I don't love about these ruins.  Fortunately for me, Anji's here to keep my good-looks intact!"
G["I don't mean to sound ungrateful, but could you fly a little closer to the ground? I hate heights!"]="Não quero parecer desagradecido, mas poderia voar um pouco mais perto do chão? Ódio as alturas!"
G["I don't need a teleport."]="Não preciso um teleporte."
G["I don't need any introductions, old man. Let's skip ahead to the good part."]="Não preciso apresentações, ancião. Vamos diretamente ao que importa."
G["I don't need your pity, $C."]="Não preciso seu piedade, $c."
G["I don't often interact with the Pandaren, but when I do... Its for Brew!"]="Não sozinho interagir com os pandaren, mas quando o faço... é pela cerveja!"
G["I don't pay you engineers exorbitant amounts of gold so that I can hear the words \"no\" or \"can't\" exit your wrappings. Bring that barrier down or you'll find yourselves working the energy reclamation line on X-17."]="I don't pay you engineers exorbitant amounts of gold so that I can hear the words \"no\" or \"can't\" exit your wrappings. Bring that barrier down or you'll find yourselves working the energy reclamation line on X-17."
G["I don't quite understand..."]="Eu não entendo direito..."
G["I don't recognize you. Are you new here?"]="Eu não te reconheço. Você é novo aqui?"
G["I don't recognize you..."]="Não te reconheço..."
G["I don't recognize your face. You must be new in town."]="Não me soa seu rosto. Deve ser $gnuevo: nova; na cidade."
G["I don't recommend hanging from a chain like that. But, to be honest, it did great things for my hair."]="Eu não recomendo pendurado em uma corrente assim. Mas, para ser honesto, fez grandes coisas para o meu cabelo."
G["I don't remember ever being this small."]="Não lembrança haver banido nunca tão peque."
G["I don't remember much about how I got to Duskhaven.  Tell me what you know."]="Não lembrança muito sobre como cheguei a Refúgio do Ocaso. Conte-me o que saiba."
G["I don't remember saying they could take a break!"]="I don't remember saying they could take a break!"
G["I don't remember which way the exit is here.  Let's try this doorway over here."]="I don't remember which way the exit is here.  Let's try this doorway over here."
G["I don't see any dragons anywhere."]="Não vejo dragões por nenhuma parte."
G["I don't see any good reason for these ogres to waste their lives sitting out here in the sand when they could join the Horde and work for us.\n\nI mean look at them! If we don't exploit them, who will?"]="I don't see any good reason for these ogres to waste their lives sitting out here in the sand when they could join the Horde and work for us.\n\nI mean look at them! If we don't exploit them, who will?"
G["I don't see how these foul animals live in this place... sheesh it smells!"]="I don't see how these foul animals live in this place... sheesh it smells!"
G["I don't suppose Lor'themar Theron is available for an audience yet?"]="I don't suppose Lor'themar Theron is available for an audience yet?"
G["I don't suppose that there's any way that you can get us out of here? No?\n\nAh well, I suppose it won't be too painful as the lava slowly pours into this pit."]="I don't suppose that there's any way that you can get us out of here? No?\n\nAh well, I suppose it won't be too painful as the lava slowly pours into this pit."
G["I don't suppose you brought another squad with you, did you? We've got our hands full out here."]="Acho que você não trouxe outro esquadrão, trouxe? Temos nossas mãos cheias aqui."
G["I don't suppose you'd be amenable to demonstrating the amulet's healing power here and now...?"]="Suponho que não estará disposto a demostrar o poder curandeiro do amuleto aqui agora...?"
G["I don't suppose you're here to talk about my lovely Kali. Fine, then. Potions it is. Anyone ever tell ye you've got a one-track mind?"]="Suponho que não esteja aqui para falar sobre minha adorável Kali. Tudo bem então. Poções é isso. Alguém já disse a ele que você tem uma mente única?"
G["I don't suppose you've come bearing news about the mines, have you?"]="Acho que você não veio com notícia sobre as minas, viu?"
G["I don't talk to no $g scrub : trash;!"]="I don't talk to no $g scrub : trash;!"
G["I don't think Drazzit's going to have any luck finding anyone to kill this raptor. I mean, he's already raised the reward twice..."]="Não acho que Drazzit vá a ter sorte encontrando a alguém que mate a essa ave de rapinha. Vamos, já tem elevado a recompensa dois vezes..."
G["I don't think I could ever challenge one of the celestials."]="Acho que nunca poderá desafiar a um celestial."
G["I don't think I could have held them off much longer.\nYou have my gratitude!"]="Não acho que tivesse pedido aguantar muito mais tempo.\n\nOs o agradeço!"
G["I don't think I ever stood a chance. See you around, then!"]="Acho que nunca tive a mais mínimo possibilidade. Sorte!"
G["I don't think I'm gonna make it..."]="Não acho que o consiga..."
G["I don't think I've ever seen the boss so upset.\n\nYou'd best not go looking for the Prince until he cools down a little."]="Nunca havia visto ao chefe tão alterado.\n\nSerá melhor que não o molestes até que se tranquilice um pouco."
G["I don't think a weapon that big is legal in this town..."]="Não acho que um arma assim de grande seja legal nesta cidade..."
G["I don't think breweries are supposed to make that sound..."]="Acho que isso não é um ruido normal de cervejaria..."
G["I don't think it can top the one time where he told us that he'd heard that Arthas's \"cousin's\" skeleton was frozen beneath a glacier in Winterspring. I'll never forgive you for that one, Letoll. I mean honestly... Arthas's cousin?"]="I don't think it can top the one time where he told us that he'd heard that Arthas's \"cousin's\" skeleton was frozen beneath a glacier in Winterspring. I'll never forgive you for that one, Letoll. I mean honestly... Arthas's cousin?"
G["I don't think it's strong enough."]="Não acho que sejao suficiente forte."
G["I don't think one charge is going to cut it. Keep fending them off!"]="I don't think one charge is going to cut it. Keep fending them off!"
G["I don't think so, little wyrm."]="Não o acho, pequena vermis."
G["I don't think so."]="Me parece que não."
G["I don't think that's going to happen, $G lad:lass;. I've lost a lot of blood... there's no way I'm making it back."]="Eu não acho que isso vai acontecer, $grapaz: moça; Perdi muito sangue... não há como eu voltar."
G["I don't think that's physically possible, sir."]="Não acho que isso seja fisicamente possível, senhor."
G["I don't think there's any fish in these canals."]="Não acho que tenha peixe em estes canais."
G["I don't think these mogu are from here. They seem to be scavenging old relics, not digging in or pillaging."]="I don't think these mogu are from here. They seem to be scavenging old relics, not digging in or pillaging."
G["I don't think they're getting the message."]="Não acho que estejam pilhando a mensagem."
G["I don't think this shield is for me."]="Acho que este escudo não é para mim."
G["I don't think we can afford to pass an opportunity to ingratiate ourselves with the red flight. With the battles ahead, having them as allies would be invaluable."]="I don't think we can afford to pass an opportunity to ingratiate ourselves with the red flight. With the battles ahead, having them as allies would be invaluable."
G["I don't think we got a choice, mon."]="Acho que não temos elecção, colega."
G["I don't think yer hearin' me. Nether rays just aren't made for --"]="I don't think yer hearin' me. Nether rays just aren't made for --"
G["I don't think you want to learn anything I can teach. Might want to find a $c trainer to help you out."]="Acho que não te interesse o que posso ensinar. Talvez te interese encontrar a um instrutor de $c que te ajude."
G["I don't train just anyone! You'll need to perform a task first!"]="Não instruyo a qualquer! Terá que fazer uma tarefa primeiro!"
