G["I don't want to know what happened here. It's too horrible to imagine."]="I don't want to know what happened here. It's too horrible to imagine."
G["I don't want to leave! I want to stay here!"]="I don't want to leave! I want to stay here!"
G["I don't want to see any more mistakes!"]="Não quero mais erros!"
G["I don't want to see you anymore!"]="I don't want to see you anymore!"
G["I double dare you!"]="Te vuelvo a desafiar!"
G["I doubt that we will ever win against the hozen."]="Não acho que mais venzamos aos hozen."
G["I doubt you have had much occasion to see such a creature. These demonic equines will make your travels much faster by acting as your mount as long as you control them. However, they are difficult to control, so be sure you are ready before attempting it."]="I doubt you have had much occasion to see such a creature. These demonic equines will make your travels much faster by acting as your mount as long as you control them. However, they are difficult to control, so be sure you are ready before attempting it."
G["I doubt you will be so lucky the next time you encounter my brethren."]="I doubt you will be so lucky the next time you encounter my brethren."
G["I drank of the same blood your father did, Garrosh. Mannoroth's cursed venom pumped through my veins as well."]="I drank of the same blood your father did, Garrosh. Mannoroth's cursed venom pumped through my veins as well."
G["I dream, $n... oh yes, I dream. In my dreams I die a thousand times in a thousand different ways. Some would call dreams such as mine nightmares. NOT I! In dreams I die in the thick of battle. For each single death of my own, ten thousand enemies of the Horde fall before me. It is glorious!"]="I dream, $n... oh yes, I dream. In my dreams I die a thousand times in a thousand different ways. Some would call dreams such as mine nightmares. NOT I! In dreams I die in the thick of battle. For each single death of my own, ten thousand enemies of the Horde fall before me. It is glorious!"
G["I dreamt that I turned into a monster. Good thing you woke me."]="I dreamt that I turned into a monster. Good thing you woke me."
G["I drink in your suffering, mortal. Let your essence congeal with Lokholar!"]="Bebo seu sofrimento, mortal. De que seu essência se coagule com Lokholar!"
G["I drove my weapons into the bodies and minds of my enemies."]="Incrusté meus armas nos corpos e mentes de meus inimigos."
G["I dun think nothin', Wad! I know who'd do such a heinous thing!"]="I dun think nothin', Wad! I know who'd do such a heinous thing!"
G["I dunno, Jill. If Klaven comes down while we're slacking, we may end up as one of those things!"]="Nem ideia, Jilh. Se Klaven vem e nos encontre fazendo o vago, podemos acabar como uma das essas coisas!"
G["I dunno, grunt. I just - don't - know..."]="Não o sei, grunhido. Simplesmente - não – o sei..."
G["I dunno. It can't possibly beat the time he tried to convince us that we're all actually a figment of some being's imagination and that they only use us for their own personal amusement. That went over well during dinner with the family."]="I dunno. It can't possibly beat the time he tried to convince us that we're all actually a figment of some being's imagination and that they only use us for their own personal amusement. That went over well during dinner with the family."
G["I dunno. Maybe he's magical."]="Não o sei. Talvez seja mágico."
G["I dunno. What do you want to do?"]="Nem ideia. Que que fazer?"
G["I eat you next, mon."]="Te como depois, colega."
G["I enact my master's will! I am he who bars the gate!"]="Represento a vontade de meu mestre! Eu sou quem bloqueia a porta!"
G["I enjoy the screams most of all."]="O que mais me gosta são os gritos."
G["I envy you in a way, little $r.\n\nYou are so fortunate as to bear witness to the first steps of the rebirth of the mighty Empire of Azjol-Nerub."]="I envy you in a way, little $r.\n\nYou are so fortunate as to bear witness to the first steps of the rebirth of the mighty Empire of Azjol-Nerub."
G["I even had time to install an I.W.I.N. Button!"]="Me dados tempo a instalada até um botão E. OU. G. A. N. OU.!"
G["I execute him as per my liege's instructions, and do it in such a manner that he suffers painfully before he dies as retribution for his crimes against my people."]="Eu o executo de acordo com as instruções do meu senhor, e o faço de maneira que ele sofra dolorosamente antes de morrer como retribuição pelos seus crimes contra o meu povo."
G["I execute him as per my liege's instructions, but doing so in as painless of a way as possible.  Justice must be served, but I can show some compassion."]="Eu o executo de acordo com as instruções do meu senhorio, mas fazendo-o da maneira mais indolor possível. A justiça deve ser servida, mas posso mostrar alguma compaixão."
G["I expect much of you. Do not fail me. Dismissed!"]="Deposito grandes esperanças em ti. Não me falhes. Parte!"
G["I expect the highest quality craftmanship from my workforce.  Double your efforts!"]="I expect the highest quality craftmanship from my workforce.  Double your efforts!"
G["I expect this operation to proceed without major incident."]="Espero que esta operação prossiga sem grandes incidentes."
G["I expect to see this insect's carcass in pieces in my lair within the hour. Fail and you will suffer a fate so much worse than death."]="I expect to see this insect's carcass in pieces in my lair within the hour. Fail and you will suffer a fate so much worse than death."
G["I expected so much more. How ... disappointing."]="Me esperava muito mais... Que decepção."
G["I extend my gratitude for your aid in this matter, $n, although I also admit mild regret that you will not volunteer for our experiments..."]="Te agradeço a ajuda neste assunto, $n, embora devo expressar que lamento um pouco que não te presentes $gvoluntario: voluntaria; para nossos experimentos..."
G["I fail to understand why they banned totemic cleansing. No one was ever in range, anyways."]="I fail to understand why they banned totemic cleansing. No one was ever in range, anyways."
G["I failed to defend my people in Gilneas City.  It seems the fates have given me a second chance, $n.  I will not fail again!"]="I failed to defend my people in Gilneas City.  It seems the fates have given me a second chance, $n.  I will not fail again!"
G["I failed..."]="E falhado..."
G["I fear I have nothing but this old chest I discovered here. You're welcome to it."]="Me temo que somente tenho este velho baú que e descoberto aqui. É tudo seu."
G["I fear I must now depart you and your ex-phoenix.  Light be with you!"]="I fear I must now depart you and your ex-phoenix.  Light be with you!"
G["I fear for Alysra's fate.  Fandral's corruption ran deeper than anything I encountered in the nightmare.  Yet we can't afford to dwell on this."]="I fear for Alysra's fate.  Fandral's corruption ran deeper than anything I encountered in the nightmare.  Yet we can't afford to dwell on this."
G["I fear for the safety of our people."]="Temo pela segurança de nossa gente."
G["I fear for the worst, old friend. Within the Dream we fight a new foe, born of an ancient evil. Ysera's noble brood has fallen victim to the old whisperings. It seems as if the Nightmare has broken through the realm and seeks a new host on Azeroth."]="I fear for the worst, old friend. Within the Dream we fight a new foe, born of an ancient evil. Ysera's noble brood has fallen victim to the old whisperings. It seems as if the Nightmare has broken through the realm and seeks a new host on Azeroth."
G["I fear nothing! Least of all you!"]="Não temo a nada! E menos a vocês!"
G["I fear something dark is coming."]="Me temo que algo tenebroso vai acontecer."
G["I fear that Colonel Jules may only be saved through a dangerous ritual... an exorcism."]="Temo que o coronel Jules só possa ser salvou através de um ritual perigoso... um exorcismo."
G["I fear that if we do not receive reinforcements in Thousand Needles quickly, the Grimtotem will act. We are in no position to defend ourselves for very long."]="I fear that if we do not receive reinforcements in Thousand Needles quickly, the Grimtotem will act. We are in no position to defend ourselves for very long."
G["I fear that my people are somewhat responsible for this destruction. We are refugees, displaced from our homes by the Burning Legion. This tragedy is a result of our latest evacuation. Our vessel crashed - this debris is a part of that vessel."]="Temo que meu povo seja um pouco responsável por essa destruição. Somos refugiados, deslocados de nossas casas pela Legião Ardente. Essa tragédia é resultado de nossa mais recente evacuação. Nossa embarcação caiu - esses detritos fazem parte dessa embarcação."
G["I fear that our war against our ancient enemies is still far from over."]="Me temo que a guerra contra nossos antigos inimigos acaba de começar."
G["I fear that the rage will consume him, Thrall. I remain hopeful that reason will prevail, but we must prepare for the worst... for war."]="I fear that the rage will consume him, Thrall. I remain hopeful that reason will prevail, but we must prepare for the worst... for war."
G["I fear that this is just the beginning."]="Me temo que isto é somente o início."
G["I fear that your arrival here will upset the land's delicate balance."]="Me temo que sua chegada alterará o delicado equilíbrio da terra."
G["I fear the worst."]="Me temo o pior."
G["I fear there may be a lost druid in the back of the cave, $n. Be on the lookout."]="Temo que possa haver um druida perdido no mais profundo da caverna, $n. Abra bem os olhos."
G["I fear time may not be on our side, Ilthalaine. The battle may carry to Teldrassil itself if we do not act soon."]="Me temo que o tempo não está de nossa parte, Ilthalaine. Se não actuamos pronto, talvez a batalha chegue ao mesmo Teldrassil."
G["I fear we haven't seen the last of Arugal..."]="Me temo que não temos visto a Arugal por última vez..."
G["I fear we may never soothe them..."]="I fear we may never soothe them..."
G["I feared that this day would come. I will pack up my things."]="I feared that this day would come. I will pack up my things."
G["I feast on your suffering."]="Ha, ja, ja, ja! Me alimento do sofrimento."
G["I feel a little chill coming."]="Se aproxima um linha de frente frio."
G["I feel a rush of energy coming on. Let's do this!"]="Sinto um subidón de energia. Vamos além!"
G["I feel am deeply sorry for Lin's loss, but I must think of every soldier in my army.\n\nEach life is precious, and must be valued equally.\n\nI could not gamble the lives of many to save that of one."]="I feel am deeply sorry for Lin's loss, but I must think of every soldier in my army.\n\nEach life is precious, and must be valued equally.\n\nI could not gamble the lives of many to save that of one."
G["I feel as good as new! My thanks, stranger."]="I feel as good as new! My thanks, stranger."
G["I feel as though I am awakening from a nightmare, but the shadows in this place yet linger."]="I feel as though I am awakening from a nightmare, but the shadows in this place yet linger."
G["I feel as though I've been out here for days..."]="I feel as though I've been out here for days..."
G["I feel as though there's a task I have yet to complete...."]="É como se ainda tivesse uma missão pendente..."
G["I feel better already."]="Já me sinto melhor."
G["I feel better.\n\nIt will take me some time to regain my full strength, but I am strong enough to fight, at least."]="I feel better.\n\nIt will take me some time to regain my full strength, but I am strong enough to fight, at least."
G["I feel drawn to Chi-Ji. Maybe the Red Crane will impart some of its wisdom to me."]="Chi-Ji me parece muito interessante. ao melhor a Grulha Vermelha compartilha seu sabedoria comigo."
G["I feel fine, $n. Thank you for asking, but there are more important matters at hand."]="Me encontro bem, $n. Obrigado por perguntar, mas há coisas mais importantes sobre as que tratar."
G["I feel funny all of a sudden.  Er?!"]="De repente me siento raro... Eeing?"
G["I feel funny. I don't think you reintegrated me right...."]="Me sinto raro. Não acho que me tenha reintegrado corretamente..."
G["I feel ill."]="Me siento enfermo."
G["I feel like I could drink a lake!"]="I feel like I could drink a lake!"
G["I feel like I have been working on this city forever!"]="I feel like I have been working on this city forever!"
G["I feel like I lost an eighth of something."]="I feel like I lost an eighth of something."
G["I feel like I'm being pulled away through time.  Thanks for the help...."]="I feel like I'm being pulled away through time.  Thanks for the help...."
G["I feel like I've been cooped up in here forever.  Is it Brewfest yet?"]="Eu sinto como se estivesse presa aqui para sempre. Já é Brewfest?"
G["I feel like a blood sausage."]="Me sinto como uma morcilha."
G["I feel much better now.  For the Horde!"]="Já me sinto muito melhor. pela Horda!"
G["I feel much better now...hic!"]="Agora me sinto muito melhor... hip!"
G["I feel much better. Thank you."]="Me sinto muito melhor. Obrigado."
G["I feel much safer with a $c like you around."]="Me sinto muito mais certa com $gun: uma; $c como você perto."
G["I feel sick."]="Me siento mal."
G["I feel slightly unhinged. I am not taking well to this... condition."]="I feel slightly unhinged. I am not taking well to this... condition."
G["I feel so funky..."]="I feel so funky..."
G["I feel so much calmer. What happened?"]="Me sinto muito mais tranquila. Que tem passado?"
G["I feel so stupid. Maybe I should unchain you and set you free?"]="I feel so stupid. Maybe I should unchain you and set you free?"
G["I feel strong enough to continue on my own, $n. I must report this... sha... presence to the Council immediately. If we meet again, it shall be at Klaxxi'vess."]="Me sinto o bastante forte para seguir eu somente, $n. Devo informar desta presença... sha... ao conselho de imediatamente. Se volvemos a nos encontrar, será em Klaxxi'vess."
G["I feel stronger than before."]="Me sinto mais forte que antes."
G["I feel that war is fast approaching.  The fruit vendor has enlisted the help of an ogre.  I shall have to enlist help as well."]="I feel that war is fast approaching.  The fruit vendor has enlisted the help of an ogre.  I shall have to enlist help as well."
G["I feel that we are just scratching the surface of the naga presence here.\n\nI have never seen them so organized and disciplined before."]="I feel that we are just scratching the surface of the naga presence here.\n\nI have never seen them so organized and disciplined before."
G["I feel the call of the Light, far to the north of here. But this place...\n\nIt has not known the light for many, many generations."]="Sinto a chamada da Luz ao longe, ao norte de aqui. Mas este lugar...\n\nNão tem conhecido a luz durante muitas, muitas generações."
G["I feel the same way about Azeroth herself."]="Sinto exatamente o mesmo por tudo Azeroth."
G["I feel the same. But there's still a job to do out here. It'll all be for naught if this evil finds its way back to Azeroth - back to our homes. We just have to hold on a while longer. Trust Danath - he's never let us down before."]="I feel the same. But there's still a job to do out here. It'll all be for naught if this evil finds its way back to Azeroth - back to our homes. We just have to hold on a while longer. Trust Danath - he's never let us down before."
G["I feel weak. I mean weaker than normal. Like as if the Light is less powerful this week. Probably just something I ate. Orc food gives me the craps."]="Me sinto fraco. Quero dizer, mais do normal. Como se esta semana a Luz fosse menos poderosa. Talvez seja somente algo que e comido. A comida de orc me sienta fatal."
G["I feel... at peace."]="Me sinto... em paz."
G["I feel... different."]="Me siento... diferente."
G["I feel... dizzy.  It's so hot... in... here..."]="I feel... dizzy.  It's so hot... in... here..."
G["I feel... happy!!"]="Me siento... feliz!!"
G["I feel... lightheaded... What's... happening to me?"]="Me sinto... algo mareada... Que... me está passando?"
G["I feel... something strange..."]="Me sinto... um pouco estranho..."
G["I felt Fury's demise. You have done well."]="Sentí o falhecimento de Fúria. O fez bem."
G["I felt a presence, a burning pain and rage in my mind..."]="Sentí uma presença, uma rabia e um dor ardente na minha mente..."
G["I felt my life slipping out of me."]="I felt my life slipping out of me."
G["I felt that one from the stands! I think we have a clear winner here boys, and the bodyparts littering the arena agree"]="I felt that one from the stands! I think we have a clear winner here boys, and the bodyparts littering the arena agree"
G["I felt... so much hatred..."]="Sentia... tanto ódio."
G["I fight more than all other Gorlocs combined, yet I still find time to learn your language the right way... does that seem right to you?"]="Lucho mais que todos os outros górlocs juntos e, ainda assim, saco tempo para aprender seu idioma corretamente... Você acha que isso está bem?"
G["I fight wit' untamed spirit...."]="Lucho com liberdade de eh'píritu..."
G["I figured Flagongut would send someone for that fossil eventually."]="I figured Flagongut would send someone for that fossil eventually."
G["I figured I might see you again, Schnottz."]="Imaginé que te vería novamente, Schnottz."
G["I figured I would step up my research efforts by, uh, 'borrowing' some technology from the Venture Company. See, their new shredder is best of breed, from the interchangeable hands to the control grips!\n\nMy business partner Wizzlecrank is west of here in the Sludge Fen doing some 'Field Research' for me, but he hasn't gotten back yet."]="I figured I would step up my research efforts by, uh, 'borrowing' some technology from the Venture Company. See, their new shredder is best of breed, from the interchangeable hands to the control grips!\n\nMy business partner Wizzlecrank is west of here in the Sludge Fen doing some 'Field Research' for me, but he hasn't gotten back yet."
G["I finally have a story to tell my grandchildren about... A traitor to the kingdom was living among us!"]="Finalmente tenho uma história para contar aos meus netos... Um traidor do reino estava morando entre nós!"
G["I finally understood what was going on... but I was a second too late."]="I finally understood what was going on... but I was a second too late."
G["I find it satisfying.  I enjoy working with my hands."]="I find it satisfying.  I enjoy working with my hands."
G["I find it, you buy it."]="Eu o encontro, você o compras."
G["I find politics exhausting. I am confident Vol'jin will take us where we need to go.\n\n<Lor'themar glances over to Sylvanas.>\n\nAssuming he can hold this Horde together."]="I find politics exhausting. I am confident Vol'jin will take us where we need to go.\n\n<Lor'themar glances over to Sylvanas.>\n\nAssuming he can hold this Horde together."
G["I find the Brewmoon Festival an excellent break from my studies."]="I find the Brewmoon Festival an excellent break from my studies."
G["I find the ocean floor to be very peaceful."]="Acho o fundo do oceano muito tranquilo."
G["I find you wanting."]="Acho que não das a talha."
G["I find your faith inspiring, little one. But I wonder if you have ever met our warchief?"]="Seu fé é uma fonte de inspiração, jovem, mas me pergunto se alguma vez tem conhecido a nosso Chefe de Guerra."
G["I first met the Nesingwarys in Stranglethorn. I've been bumping in to them off and on ever since. I finally earned a place in their safari!"]="Conocí pela primeira vez aos Nesingwary em Espinhaço. Desde então me encontro com eles de vez em quando. Finalmente e conseguido um posto no seu safári!"
G["I first set up shop in the Magic Quarter, but it was pretty noisy there. This is a definite improvement, barring a few persistent students who still track me down, despite the fact that I've relocated."]="Eu estabeleci uma loja no Magic Quarter, mas era muito barulhento lá. Esta é uma melhoria definitiva, exceto algum alunos persistentes que ainda me localizam, apesar do fato de eu ter me mudado."
G["I flew to the top of the pillar located just north of the canyon."]="Volé até o alto do pilar que há logo ao norte do canhão."
G["I floated for days 'til one of our ships spotted me..."]="I floated for days 'til one of our ships spotted me..."
G["I foresee that you will speak with Archmage Lan'dalock, $n."]="I foresee that you will speak with Archmage Lan'dalock, $n."
G["I forget... did you take flying lessons back on Kezan?"]="O e esquecido... Deu lições de voo em Kezan?"
G["I fought against the anger, but it overwhelmed me. You have my thanks."]="Luché contra a raiva, mas me superou. Te o agradeço."
G["I fought alongside Lord Anduin Lothar as we drove the Horde from our lands on Azeroth. As the heir of Medivh's legacy, I could do no less.\n\nWhen the call finally came to invade this grim world - and put an end to the orcs' evil forever - I stepped forward along with my friends Turalyon, Alleria, Danath and Kurdran."]="I fought alongside Lord Anduin Lothar as we drove the Horde from our lands on Azeroth. As the heir of Medivh's legacy, I could do no less.\n\nWhen the call finally came to invade this grim world - and put an end to the orcs' evil forever - I stepped forward along with my friends Turalyon, Alleria, Danath and Kurdran."
G["I fought on the frontlines of the Qiraji war and charged the depths of Azjol-Nerub. I know first hand the threat that an insect legion can have on the world when left unchecked."]="Luché nos frentes da guerra de Qiraji e cargué nas profundezas de Azjol-Nerub. Conheço de primeira mão a ameaça que uma legião de insectos pode supor para o mundo quando não se lhes tem controlados."
G["I found Kasha in Icecrown. She was injured and dying. I managed to carry her back to the Shadow Vault where the death knights helped nurse her back to health. We are now the best of friends."]="I found Kasha in Icecrown. She was injured and dying. I managed to carry her back to the Shadow Vault where the death knights helped nurse her back to health. We are now the best of friends."
G["I found Sully waiting outside the village's entrance."]="Descobri a Sully esperando na entrada da aldeia."
G["I found a broken-down cart amongst the dunes when I was checking out the potential profitibility of Centipaar Silithid Snacks (patent pending).  I thought to myself, \"hey, free cart!\"  That is, until the biggest basilisk you've ever seen showed up, and I had to leave the whole thing behind!"]="Encontrei um carrinho quebrado entre as dunas quando estava verificando a lucratividade potencial dos Centipaar Silithid Snacks (patente pendente). Pensei comigo: \"ei, carrinho grátis!\" Ou seja, até o maior basilisco que você já viu aparecem, e eu tive que deixar tudo para por trás!"
G["I found a good bit of filth out in the swamps today. The filth-mongers will be proud of me."]="I found a good bit of filth out in the swamps today. The filth-mongers will be proud of me."
G["I found a grummle cake in a corner of my cage. So delicious! Best day ever!"]="I found a grummle cake in a corner of my cage. So delicious! Best day ever!"
G["I found a mighty axe there, freshly forged upon the fire."]="I found a mighty axe there, freshly forged upon the fire."
G["I found a stack of smoke bombs in my pockets. They'd have to do.\n|TInterface\\Icons\\ability_rogue_smoke.blp:32|t"]="I found a stack of smoke bombs in my pockets. They'd have to do.\n|TInterface\\Icons\\ability_rogue_smoke.blp:32|t"
G["I found an incantation to release these two from their prison. But it will release both of them. Once I cast this, defeat the Jade Warlord before he can get his bearings."]="I found an incantation to release these two from their prison. But it will release both of them. Once I cast this, defeat the Jade Warlord before he can get his bearings."
G["I found an old rifle scope in my pockets. It'd have to do.\n|TInterface\\Icons\\inv_misc_scopeb.blp:32|t"]="Encontrei uma velha olhe de rifle no bolso. Tendría que servir.\n|TInterface\\Icons\\inv_misc_scopeb.blp:32|t"
G["I found it!  It's mine!"]="Eu a encontrei! É minha!"
G["I found no sign of Anduin at the southwestern shrine."]="I found no sign of Anduin at the southwestern shrine."
G["I found nothin' at the northern shrine - no Anduin, no hozen... nothin'."]="Não encontrei nada no santuário do norte. Nem ao peão alvo, nem hozen, nem nada."
G["I found the brewery and made my way inside."]="Encontrei a cervejaria e entrei diretamente."
G["I found this fascinating specimen in the lava underneath this very room. Magmaw should provide an adequate challenge for your pathetic little band."]="Encontrei este fascinante espécimen na lava debaixo desta salão. Faucemagma deveria ser um desafio adequado para a sua patética Raide."
G["I found this in the ruins. Cailin told me it was yours..."]="Encontrei isto nas ruínas. Cailin me dito que é seu..."
G["I found this jar of bugs in a shack in the middle of Kun-Lai. I didn't think anything of it until I saw the letters..."]="I found this jar of bugs in a shack in the middle of Kun-Lai. I didn't think anything of it until I saw the letters..."
G["I found this strange armor plate. Can you tell me more about it?"]="Encontrei esta estranha placa de armadura. Você pode me dizer mais sobre isso?"
G["I found us a cool bodyguard didn't I?"]="I found us a cool bodyguard didn't I?"
G["I free you from existence!"]="Te libero desta existência!"
G["I get a lot of mail, $n. Most of it is junk, but some of them might be helpful to a helpful $c like you. Here's a couple letters sent to Everlook, looking for help in the far corners of the world.\n\nIt's almost as if you have a choice for where you go next!  Now, let's see..."]="I get a lot of mail, $n. Most of it is junk, but some of them might be helpful to a helpful $c like you. Here's a couple letters sent to Everlook, looking for help in the far corners of the world.\n\nIt's almost as if you have a choice for where you go next!  Now, let's see..."
G["I get all teary eyed just thinkin' about all we been through together, $g boyo : lass;."]="I get all teary eyed just thinkin' about all we been through together, $g boyo : lass;."
G["I get flashes sometimes of these horrific images.  Shadows assaulting us in the night.  Friends turning and attacking each other."]="I get flashes sometimes of these horrific images.  Shadows assaulting us in the night.  Friends turning and attacking each other."
G["I get reports of your exploits against the Abyssal Council all the time, $n.  You're doing great things out there!\n\nKeep it up, and we'll make it worth the effort!"]="Me chegam continuamente notícia dos seus proezas contra o Conselho Asa, $n. Está fazendo grandes coisas aí fosse!\n\nContinua assim e conseguiremos que o esforço valga a pena!"
G["I get the feeling the negotations aren't going well..."]="Me da a sensação de que as negociações não vão bem..."
G["I give 'im five days."]="Lhe dou cinco dias."
G["I give more shinies to shrines! I promise! I sorry!"]="I give more shinies to shrines! I promise! I sorry!"
G["I give my flesh and blood freely to the Warchief. I am the instrument of my Warchief's desire. I am a weapon of my Warchief's command!"]="I give my flesh and blood freely to the Warchief. I am the instrument of my Warchief's desire. I am a weapon of my Warchief's command!"
G["I give my life... gladly."]="Entrego minha vida... com gusto."
G["I give myself to the master!"]="Me entrego ao mestre"
G["I give only nice sheep for you, neighbor! What do you think?"]="I give only nice sheep for you, neighbor! What do you think?"
G["I give unto you cordial salutations, $r.  You've come far off the beaten path merely to speak to someone dwelling inside a cave.  I trust there is a reason for your strange, yet not unforeseen visit here.  Yes?"]="I give unto you cordial salutations, $r.  You've come far off the beaten path merely to speak to someone dwelling inside a cave.  I trust there is a reason for your strange, yet not unforeseen visit here.  Yes?"
G["I give up! Please don't kill me!"]="Me rindo! Por favor, não me mate!"
G["I give up! So much for goblin ingenuity!"]="Me rindo! Demais ingenuidade goblin!"
G["I give up.  I can't get through to you cuddly bears.  $n, would you come over here and show these newbs how it's done?"]="I give up.  I can't get through to you cuddly bears.  $n, would you come over here and show these newbs how it's done?"
G["I give you my oath."]="Tem meu juramento."
G["I give you one chance. Pledge fealty to me, and perhaps I will not slaughter you for your insolence."]="I give you one chance. Pledge fealty to me, and perhaps I will not slaughter you for your insolence."
G["I give you thanks for my life."]="Dou a você Obrigado porque sigo com vida."
G["I give you thanks, $n."]="Dou a você as Obrigado, $n."
G["I give you the gift of destruction!"]="Eu dou a você a dádiva da destruição!"
G["I give you this story."]="Os ofereço esta história."
G["I give you warm greetin's, $c, as does the Shattered Hand.\n\nDo not look so surprised, $n. There be shadows even on the highest perches of Orgrimmar--somethin' must hide there. The Shattered Hand take that role willingly. Thrall, even in his good heart, acknowledge that the Hand be necessary to ensure orc and troll safety.\n\nBut you not here to talk 'bout my business, you here for somethin' else."]="I give you warm greetin's, $c, as does the Shattered Hand.\n\nDo not look so surprised, $n. There be shadows even on the highest perches of Orgrimmar--somethin' must hide there. The Shattered Hand take that role willingly. Thrall, even in his good heart, acknowledge that the Hand be necessary to ensure orc and troll safety.\n\nBut you not here to talk 'bout my business, you here for somethin' else."
G["I gladly die for the master..."]="I gladly die for the master..."
G["I gladly make such a sacrifice if it means the downfall of the Dragonmaw."]="Fico feliz em fazer um sacrifício se isso significa a ocorrida da Presa do Dragão."
G["I go now to summon the lord whose house this is. Should you seek an audience with him, your paltry lives will surely be forfeit! Nevertheless, seek out his lair, if you dare!"]="I go now to summon the lord whose house this is. Should you seek an audience with him, your paltry lives will surely be forfeit! Nevertheless, seek out his lair, if you dare!"
G["I go to be with the spirits of my ancestors..."]="I go to be with the spirits of my ancestors..."
G["I go to contemplate those who could not share this victory with us."]="Vou meditar sobre aqueles que não podem compartilhar esta vitória conosco."
G["I go to join my ancestors here."]="I go to join my ancestors here."
G["I go willingly, $c. My purpose in my master's plan is fulfilled."]="Vou voluntariamente, $c. Já e concluído com meu papel no plano do mestre."
G["I gonna disappear for a while. [Gasps] Don't forget about me."]="I gonna disappear for a while. [Gasps] Don't forget about me."
G["I gonna give you all the gold and gems you can carry if you bring me ten of their heads!"]="Te darei tudo o ouro e as gemas que possa levar se me traz dez dos seus cabeças!"
G["I gonna make you into mojo!"]="Vou conveh'tih'te em mojo!"
G["I gonna' feed ya soul to dah beasts."]="I gonna' feed ya soul to dah beasts."
G["I got a bad feelin' about this."]="Eu tem um mal presentimento sobre isto."
G["I got a bone to pick wit' you!"]="Me estou quedando nos ossos."
G["I got a few more tings to discuss here.  Den I'll head to Zul'Gurub.  I will see you dere."]="Tenho que falar de algumas coisas por aqui. Deh'pués, irei a Zul'gurub. Te verei ali."
G["I got a green thumb and a steel thumb. My pappy taught me how to fix just 'bout anything."]="I got a green thumb and a steel thumb. My pappy taught me how to fix just 'bout anything."
G["I got a new cage built up, and we got plenty of ways to... teach her not to escape again."]="I got a new cage built up, and we got plenty of ways to... teach her not to escape again."
G["I got a strange feelin' in me gut, Commander.  Think it might have been that murloc fin soup?"]="Tenho uma sensação estranha no estômago, Comandante. Acha que poderá ser a sopa de falésia de murloc?"
G["I got a very bad feeling about this, $n. I think the smart play now is to get yourself off of the island any way that you can.\n\nI'm going see if I can get into the Trade Prince's Town-In-A-Box."]="I got a very bad feeling about this, $n. I think the smart play now is to get yourself off of the island any way that you can.\n\nI'm going see if I can get into the Trade Prince's Town-In-A-Box."
G["I got dis one!"]="O tenho!"
G["I got good noodles here!"]="I got good noodles here!"
G["I got information dat Vol'jin needs. Help me outta here!"]="Tenho informações que devo fazer chegar a Vol'jin. Ajude-me a sair de aqui!"
G["I got it!"]="O tenho!"
G["I got it! I got it!"]="O tenho! O tenho!"
G["I got it! I saw a tablet that mentioned this chamber. This is the Vault of Lights! Ok, simple enough. I need you adventurers to take out each of the four elementals to trigger the opening sequence for the far door!"]="I got it! I saw a tablet that mentioned this chamber. This is the Vault of Lights! Ok, simple enough. I need you adventurers to take out each of the four elementals to trigger the opening sequence for the far door!"
G["I got nothin' more to teach! Not for somebody who knows as much as you do, anyway! You Horde types need to talk to Nogg in Orgrimmar!"]="Não tenho mais nada para ensinar! Não é para alguém que sabe tanto quanto você! Vocês, tipos da Horda, precisam conversar com Nogg em Orgrimmar!"
G["I got nothin' to say to you! I will only be talkin' to $p."]="I got nothin' to say to you! I will only be talkin' to $p."
G["I got nothin' to sell ya today."]="I got nothin' to sell ya today."
G["I got nothing new for you, kid. You've outgrown manual labor..."]="Não tenho nada novamente para você, garoto. Você superou o trabalho manual..."
G["I got one!"]="Tenho um!"
G["I got orders sayin' you gotta die, and you're not the one payin' my bills."]="I got orders sayin' you gotta die, and you're not the one payin' my bills."
G["I got some candy at the inn before.  I can't wait to get some more!"]="Eu peguei algum doces na pousada antes. Mal posso esperar para conseguir mais!"
G["I got some extras with me; if you pay me back what I paid for them, you can have one.  I got some bait too."]="I got some extras with me; if you pay me back what I paid for them, you can have one.  I got some bait too."
G["I got some great samples, Hornizz. I'm going to get to work on them. Can you take care of the rest?"]="I got some great samples, Hornizz. I'm going to get to work on them. Can you take care of the rest?"
G["I got some venom for you."]="Tenho um pouco de veneno para você."
G["I got something for you, $n. Looks important."]="Tenho algo para você, $n. Parece importantes."
G["I got the glow!"]="Tenho o resplandor!"
G["I got these little hellions on a short leash, $n. The naga won't attack us while we have their hatchlings."]="I got these little hellions on a short leash, $n. The naga won't attack us while we have their hatchlings."
G["I got this from some goblin, he said it can stop anything in their tracks, want to give it a try?"]="Conseguí isto de um goblin, disse que poderá parar tudo, que tentar?"
G["I got this one..."]="O tenho..."
G["I got this! Give me the last clue."]="Posso fazer isso! Dê-me a última pista."
G["I got three sick chickens and another two hens not layin'. I got too many problems to listen to yours, citypaw."]="I got three sick chickens and another two hens not layin'. I got too many problems to listen to yours, citypaw."
G["I got to practice.\n \n<Points at you tool in hand.>\n \nIf you're not practicing, you should be practicing. So keep practicing. \n \nThat's the only way you are going to get better, to get better at anything. \n \nPractice. Practice. Practice."]="I got to practice.\n \n<Points at you tool in hand.>\n \nIf you're not practicing, you should be practicing. So keep practicing. \n \nThat's the only way you are going to get better, to get better at anything. \n \nPractice. Practice. Practice."
G["I got worm guts on my shoes."]="Tenho entranhas de me ver pegadas aos sapatos."
G["I got you covered, Vipore. Move out!"]="Te cubro, Vipore. Em marcha!"
G["I got you in my sights, monkey!"]="Te tenho no ponto de olhe, macaco!"
G["I got your back, Guse."]="Te cubro a costas, Guse."
G["I got your back, Ichman. GO GO GO!"]="Te cubro a costas, Ichman. VAMOS, VAMOS, VAMOS!"
G["I got your back, Slidore, but to be honest, you do stink. Take a shower, man."]="Te cubro a costas, Slidore, mas para ser sincero com você, si que apestas. Dúchate, tio."
G["I gotcha boss!"]="Te pilhé, chefe!"
G["I gots all kinds of brands of shades. Yous name it, I sell it!"]="Eu tenho todos os tipos de marcas de tons. Yous nome, eu vendo!"
G["I gots bad feeling..."]="Eu ter mal presentimento..."
G["I gotta get out of here before they catch me again!"]="Tenho que sair de aqui antes de que me vuelvan a atrapar!"
G["I gotta tell my cubs about this! Of course, I'll change the part where their paw-paw got stuck..."]="I gotta tell my cubs about this! Of course, I'll change the part where their paw-paw got stuck..."
G["I grant you eternal peace!"]="Te concedo a paz eterna!"
G["I greet you, $r."]="Te vidao, $r."
G["I grew up hearing legends of the White Tiger. He is a hero to the pandaren people. It is a real honor to be here training."]="I grew up hearing legends of the White Tiger. He is a hero to the pandaren people. It is a real honor to be here training."
G["I grew up on the Wandering Isle. Space was so limited there. Never room to hunt and never really any predators worth mentioning.\n\nBut here... here there are the great mushan and wolves and all sorts of predators. This is this hunter's dream come true."]="Me crié na Ilha Errante. Ali o espaço era muito limitado. Nunca havia lugar para caçar nem predadores dignos de menção.\n\nMas aqui... Aqui estão os grandes mushan e os lobos e toda classe de predadores. Isto é o sonho de um caçador feito realidade."
G["I grow bored of guarding Ambassador Sunsorrow, $n. Care to spar a bit? Perhaps one of us will learn something."]="I grow bored of guarding Ambassador Sunsorrow, $n. Care to spar a bit? Perhaps one of us will learn something."
G["I grow bored with you. Begone!"]="I grow bored with you. Begone!"
G["I grow bored with your attempt to heal the land and quell the energies summoning and driving the colossi mad.  Goliathon, King of the Colossi, Prince Kael'thas and I demand that you defend the crystal!"]="I grow bored with your attempt to heal the land and quell the energies summoning and driving the colossi mad.  Goliathon, King of the Colossi, Prince Kael'thas and I demand that you defend the crystal!"
G["I grow bored with your resistance. I'm going to kill you now and get my answers from one of your other friends."]="I grow bored with your resistance. I'm going to kill you now and get my answers from one of your other friends."
G["I grow old, little one. My time on this world is nearly done."]="Me faço velha. Meu tempo neste mundo quase chegou ao seu fim."
G["I grow tired of these games!"]="Me estou cansando de estes jueguecitos!"
G["I grow tired of these games, Arthas! Your walls can't stop me!"]="Me canso de estes jogos, Arthas. Seus muros não me detendrán!"
G["I grow tired of these games, human. Tell me of the \"Crimson Dawn\" or I will tear your spine out with my bare hands!"]="I grow tired of these games, human. Tell me of the \"Crimson Dawn\" or I will tear your spine out with my bare hands!"
G["I grow tired of these games. Proceed, and I will banish your souls to oblivion!"]="I grow tired of these games. Proceed, and I will banish your souls to oblivion!"
G["I grow tired of this hunt... Time to die!"]="Estou cansado desta caça... Hora de morrer!"
G["I grow tired of this routine."]="Me estou cansando desta rotina."
G["I grow tired of this village. I wish I could travel and see the world. Maybe when I've saved up enough gold, I'll go on my own epic adventure!"]="I grow tired of this village. I wish I could travel and see the world. Maybe when I've saved up enough gold, I'll go on my own epic adventure!"
G["I grow tired of waiting. Dance for me, imbecile."]="I grow tired of waiting. Dance for me, imbecile."
G["I grow turnips at my family farm. Oh... I don't know if you wanted to know that..."]="I grow turnips at my family farm. Oh... I don't know if you wanted to know that..."
G["I grow weary of these Horde cowards. There must be someplace else in this village to rest."]="Me estou cansando desses covardes da Horda. Precisa haver outro lugar de repouso na aldeia."
G["I grow weary. I must rest now."]="Me estou fatigando. Devo descansar."
G["I grow weary...\n\nFrom here, you can see the waterfalls, $n...The scepter grants you the power to travel to this very place, should you ever desire to enter through the front gates of Maraudon again.\n\nNear the entrance to Maraudon, you will find a passage that goes down beneath the caverns. Use the scepter at the ancient ritual site to create a portal, and you will find yourself here once more."]="I grow weary...\n\nFrom here, you can see the waterfalls, $n...The scepter grants you the power to travel to this very place, should you ever desire to enter through the front gates of Maraudon again.\n\nNear the entrance to Maraudon, you will find a passage that goes down beneath the caverns. Use the scepter at the ancient ritual site to create a portal, and you will find yourself here once more."
G["I grow... weary..."]="Me siento... fraca."
G["I guarantee that without $n, this whole offensive would have been a failure."]="I guarantee that without $n, this whole offensive would have been a failure."
G["I guarantee this bank's security with my own blood, is that good enough for you?"]="Eu garanto a segurança deste banco com meu próprio sangue, isso é bom o suficiente para você?"
G["I guess I can head back to Silvermoon..."]="Suponho que poderá voltar a Luaprata..."
G["I guess I was wrong about Shomi..."]="Acho que me equivoqué com Shomi..."
G["I guess I wasn't ready to be a brawler."]="I guess I wasn't ready to be a brawler."
G["I guess I'd better do something about this!"]="I guess I'd better do something about this!"
G["I guess I'll go find the authorities. If I'm lucky they'll tell me it's the plague and that we're all going to die."]="I guess I'll go find the authorities. If I'm lucky they'll tell me it's the plague and that we're all going to die."
G["I guess I'll just... leave the sleeping imps right over here?  Are these even... imps?  Gah!"]="I guess I'll just... leave the sleeping imps right over here?  Are these even... imps?  Gah!"
G["I guess I'm not a failure after all!"]="I guess I'm not a failure after all!"
G["I guess he's somewhere in this forest?"]="Suponho que estará em algum lugar deste florestas."
G["I guess it doesn't bend that way."]="I guess it doesn't bend that way."
G["I guess it's all just about over, right $n? I'm going to miss you... it'll be pretty lonely up here without someone to talk to.\n\nBut that doesn't mean that you can't come back to see me in the future!"]="I guess it's all just about over, right $n? I'm going to miss you... it'll be pretty lonely up here without someone to talk to.\n\nBut that doesn't mean that you can't come back to see me in the future!"
G["I guess it's time for a rebuilding phase..."]="Acho que é o momentos da fase de reconstrução..."
G["I guess it's true then. I didn't want to believe that you were a yellow-bellied snow licker, but there's no doubt about it now."]="I guess it's true then. I didn't want to believe that you were a yellow-bellied snow licker, but there's no doubt about it now."
G["I guess so!"]="Suponho!"
G["I guess so."]="Suponho que si."
G["I guess someone needs to bandage us warriors up after the fighting.  Seek out Arnok at the Survival of the Fittest hut next to the Spirit Lodge in the Valley of Spirits.  Look up above and to the west of the Valley of Strength for a lake.  That's where he's at."]="Acho que alguém precisa nos enfaixar como guerreiros depois da luta. Procure Arnok na Sobrevivência da Cabana Mais Apta ao lado da Loja Espiritual no Vale dos Espíritos. Olhe acima e a oeste do Vale da Força, procurando um lago. É onde ele está."
G["I guess that's it then.  Off we go."]="Acho que isso é tudo. Além vamos."
G["I guess that's that. We have all of the Arthas' Tears necessary. You might try asking around. One of these others is sure to have something that they still need collected for the war effort."]="Eu acho que é isso. Temos todas as lágrimas de Arthas necessárias. Você pode tentar perguntar por aí. Um desses outros certamente terá algo que eles ainda precisam coletar para o esforço de guerra."
G["I guess that's the way..."]="Suponho que assim é..."
G["I guess the spirits like you better than me, I still have not heard their call but you seem to have gathered their lessons well. Go speak to Karn, he will be excited to see one who hears them as he does."]="Acho que os espíritos como você são melhores do que eu. Ainda não ouvi o chamado deles, mas você parece ter reuniu bem as lições deles. Vá falar com Karn, ele ficará animado ao ver alguém que os ouve como ele."
G["I guess we're going to need some more pygmies."]="I guess we're going to need some more pygmies."
G["I guess what I'm saying is... thanks."]="Suponho que o quero dizer é... Obrigado."
G["I guess you can stay here."]="I guess you can stay here."
G["I guess you could say she has a bun in the oven!"]="I guess you could say she has a bun in the oven!"
G["I guess you could say..."]="Suponho que se poderá dizer..."
G["I guess you were hungry! Trok was supposed to have fed you earlier... What has he been doing all this time?"]="I guess you were hungry! Trok was supposed to have fed you earlier... What has he been doing all this time?"
G["I guess your first exercise is going to be to mine your way down to the Undercity.  Heh, get it?  Mine... nevermind.  To get to the Undercity go to the rear of the Ruins of Lordaeron south of Brill, and take the elevator down.  Ask one of the Undercity Guardians there for further assistance."]="Acho que seu primeiro exercício será o meu caminho até a Cidade Baixa. Heh, entendeu? Meu... deixa pra lá. Para chegar à Cidade Baixa, vá para a parte traseira das Ruínas de Lordaeron, ao sul de Brill, e desça o elevador. Peça ajuda a um dos Guardiões da Cidade Baixa."
G["I had Darnassus LOCKED DOWN! Every fumbling rogue that tried to sneak into the city, I CAUGHT them! I snatched every two-bit charlatan that attempted to teleport through my traps!"]="I had Darnassus LOCKED DOWN! Every fumbling rogue that tried to sneak into the city, I CAUGHT them! I snatched every two-bit charlatan that attempted to teleport through my traps!"
G["I had a bad encounter with some of the Defias around here recently, but Michelle Belle fixed me up pretty well.  Check with her in the Lion's Pride Inn and see if she'll teach you."]="Eu tive um mau encontro com algum dos Defias por aqui recentemente, mas Michelle Belle me arrumou muito bem. Verifique com ela no Lion's Pride Inn e veja se ela vai ensinar."
G["I had a farm once, but that was a long time ago. I prefer a good battle, don't you?"]="Antes tinha uma fazenda, mas foi há muito tempo. Prefiro um bom duelo. Você não?"
G["I had a good thing going here. Was going to sell these pirates a bunch of rifles and make a fortune! But no! Wizzle had to tag along and try to sell them his cheap engineering parts. Blew up a few of their cannons and my rifles in the process! We're doomed!"]="I had a good thing going here. Was going to sell these pirates a bunch of rifles and make a fortune! But no! Wizzle had to tag along and try to sell them his cheap engineering parts. Blew up a few of their cannons and my rifles in the process! We're doomed!"
G["I had a rat once, but then my mom made me put it back outside."]="I had a rat once, but then my mom made me put it back outside."
G["I had a terrible vision - the sky was blotted out and there was dirt everywhere. ...I thought I'd gone back to Deepholm."]="I had a terrible vision - the sky was blotted out and there was dirt everywhere. ...I thought I'd gone back to Deepholm."
G["I had a tonk, but my sister broke it..."]="I had a tonk, but my sister broke it..."
G["I had a... situation some time back with one of the individuals now heading up the Sunreavers here. A falling out, if you will."]="I had a... situation some time back with one of the individuals now heading up the Sunreavers here. A falling out, if you will."
G["I had almost fooled myself into believing Zouchin was protected from the darkness in the world."]="Quase me havia convencido a mim mesmo de que Zouchin estava a salvou da escuridão do mundo."
G["I had arranged for a secret summit between Warchief Thrall and King Wrynn, here in Theramore."]="Convoqué uma cume secreta entre o Chefe de Guerra Thrall e o rei Wrynn, aqui em Theramore."
G["I had been fortunate to find an oasis and made the decision to stay there until I received an answer. So there I sat, moving only when absolutely necessary, living off of the creatures that would come near the pool. Such was my pride.\n\nAs I said, decades passed without an answer. But I can remember a particularly beautiful sunset one evening. A warm zephyr blew across the land and I was sure that I heard a voice, but no one was around.\n\nAs you can imagine, I thought that I was finally losing my mind."]="I had been fortunate to find an oasis and made the decision to stay there until I received an answer. So there I sat, moving only when absolutely necessary, living off of the creatures that would come near the pool. Such was my pride.\n\nAs I said, decades passed without an answer. But I can remember a particularly beautiful sunset one evening. A warm zephyr blew across the land and I was sure that I heard a voice, but no one was around.\n\nAs you can imagine, I thought that I was finally losing my mind."
G["I had better return to my post.  You can find me downstairs if you need anything."]="Será melhor que fique a meu posto. Se você precisa qualquer coisa, estarei no piso de baixo."
G["I had come to seek strong pandaren to hunt the Sha of Hatred, but we will step in here and help you fortify the barricade first."]="Havia vindo para recrutar pandaren fortes e dar caça ao Sha do ódio, mas antes te ajudaremos a fortificar a barricada."
G["I had forgotten."]="O havia esquecido."
G["I had given up hope, friend. Thank you."]="Havia perdido a esperança, $gamigo: amiga;. Obrigado."
G["I had heard that a score of them broke into the Eye and slew him."]="I had heard that a score of them broke into the Eye and slew him."
G["I had hoped my suspicions were incorrect... they're resurrecting magmawyrms.  Come back to me immediately, it is time to purge this place of the Cult."]="I had hoped my suspicions were incorrect... they're resurrecting magmawyrms.  Come back to me immediately, it is time to purge this place of the Cult."
G["I had hoped to end your lives quickly, but you have proven more... resilient than I anticipated. Nonetheless, your efforts are in vain. It is you reckless, careless mortals who are to blame for this war. I do what I must, and if it means your extinction.... then SO BE IT!!"]="I had hoped to end your lives quickly, but you have proven more... resilient than I anticipated. Nonetheless, your efforts are in vain. It is you reckless, careless mortals who are to blame for this war. I do what I must, and if it means your extinction.... then SO BE IT!!"
G["I had it all!  I had it all and then I lost it.  Lost... all gone... like... my mind.  My mind is like... cheese.  I like cheese."]="I had it all!  I had it all and then I lost it.  Lost... all gone... like... my mind.  My mind is like... cheese.  I like cheese."
G["I had it all, once. Fame, fortune, a full set of the very best gladiator's gear... and then I threw it all away.\n\nOnce the Cartel caught me rigging fights... trading wins... it was all over.\n\nNow I've got nothing but these rags and a bad liver."]="I had it all, once. Fame, fortune, a full set of the very best gladiator's gear... and then I threw it all away.\n\nOnce the Cartel caught me rigging fights... trading wins... it was all over.\n\nNow I've got nothing but these rags and a bad liver."
G["I had it!  Must have been a huge one to take all my bait!"]="O tinha! Certo que era enorme, comeu tudo o cebo!"
G["I had just about given up hope."]="Já havia renunciado a toda esperança."
G["I had more fun torturing the peons!"]="Me o passava melhor torturando aos peões!"
G["I had no choice but to defend myself."]="I had no choice but to defend myself."
G["I had no choice, lieutenant. They recognized me. The only people in the world who even knew I existed, recognized my face from when I was an infant."]="I had no choice, lieutenant. They recognized me. The only people in the world who even knew I existed, recognized my face from when I was an infant."
G["I had no choice, or so I thought. I would endure the destruction of Thaurissan and stand by the side of my king and his people.\n\nUnder the control of Ragnaros, King Dagran Thaurissan tore out the heart of this mountain and erected Blackrock Spire. We worked tirelessly to build a dwarven city mightier than any city or fortress that came before... or would come after."]="I had no choice, or so I thought. I would endure the destruction of Thaurissan and stand by the side of my king and his people.\n\nUnder the control of Ragnaros, King Dagran Thaurissan tore out the heart of this mountain and erected Blackrock Spire. We worked tirelessly to build a dwarven city mightier than any city or fortress that came before... or would come after."
G["I had no choice."]="Não tive elecção."
G["I had no idea Sullah had so many... acquaintances."]="Eu não tinha ideia de que Sullah tinha tantos... conhecidos."
G["I had no idea the party was going to have a pirate theme. I would have brought my eyepatch!"]="Não tinha nem ideia de que ia a ser uma festa de temática pirata. Me haveria trazido meu parche do olho!"
G["I had no idea you were so well-informed."]="Não tinha nem ideia de que estivesses tão bem $ginformado: informada;."
G["I had not dared to trust my senses - too many times has the Lich King made me to be a fool."]="I had not dared to trust my senses - too many times has the Lich King made me to be a fool."
G["I had searched every cloud, but I couldn't find Deathwing."]="Busqué em todas as nuvens, mas não pude encontrar a Alamuerte."
G["I had the pleasure of seeing Kyra Windblade in combat once.  Considering what I witnessed, I am confident she will train you well.  Look for her at the Inn in Dolanaar."]="Tive o prazer de ver Kyra Windblade em combate uma vez. Considerando o que testemunhei, estou confiante de que ela o treinará bem. Procure-a na pousada em Dolanaar."
G["I had thought my victory was certain. Clearly the Makers had other plans."]="Eu pensava que minha vitória era certa. Obviamente os Criadores tinham outros planos."
G["I had to come and see Old Yoon's cub with my own eyes."]="I had to come and see Old Yoon's cub with my own eyes."
G["I had to go and requisition an Abomination... an Abomination!"]="I had to go and requisition an Abomination... an Abomination!"
G["I had your back to the end..."]="O tinha tudo baixo controle..."
G["I hadn't planned on fighting soldiers AND farmers.  With these farmers nipping at our flank, we risk losing focus on the task at hand: taking Andorhal."]="I hadn't planned on fighting soldiers AND farmers.  With these farmers nipping at our flank, we risk losing focus on the task at hand: taking Andorhal."
G["I hate adventurers."]="Ódio aos aventureiros."
G["I hate armor."]="Ódio as armaduras."
G["I hate flesh beasts..."]="Ódio as beast de carne..."
G["I hate having to do that."]="Ódio ter que fazer isto."
G["I hate incompetent raiders."]="I hate incompetent raiders."
G["I hate it when you speak to me in that manner. I am your equal in every way, brother. Remember that the next time you are trapped amidst a temporal vortex, crying for help."]="Ódio que me fale assim. Sou seu igual em todos os sentidos, irmão. Recuérdalo a próxima vez que estiver preso em meio de um vórtice temporário, pedindo ajuda a gritos."
G["I hate martyrs."]="Ódio aos mártires."
G["I hate mercy."]="Ódio a compasão."
G["I hate resorting to violence."]="I hate resorting to violence."
G["I hate slickies! Yucky yucky slickies!"]="I hate slickies! Yucky yucky slickies!"
G["I hate standing still."]="I hate standing still."
G["I hate this part of my job. Oh Duskwood, be gentle with poor Antonio."]="Ódio esta parte de meu trabalho. Oh, Floresta do Crepúsculo, sei farto com o pobre Antonio."
G["I hate this place and everyone in it! Smithers do this! Smithers do that! Oh so I'm a farmer now, eh? So I'm gonna have to harvest stuff, eh? I hope one day this whole place becomes one big graveyard and all the loud-mouths are buried right damned here!"]="I hate this place and everyone in it! Smithers do this! Smithers do that! Oh so I'm a farmer now, eh? So I'm gonna have to harvest stuff, eh? I hope one day this whole place becomes one big graveyard and all the loud-mouths are buried right damned here!"
G["I hate to disappoint people, but the Stone Crow's closed. If the kids from the orphanage were evacuated, I don't see why we should be open, either."]="Sinto decepcionar à gente, mas o Corvo de Pedra está fechado. Se têm evacuado aos crianças do orfanato não entendo por que isto deveria estar aberto."
G["I hate to keep you here so distracted..."]="I hate to keep you here so distracted..."
G["I hate to say I told you so..."]="I hate to say I told you so..."
G["I hate you all!"]="Os ódio a todos!"
G["I hate you so much, Cookie."]="I hate you so much, Cookie."
G["I hate you, Deathwing."]="Te ódio, Alamuerte."
G["I hate you, Nobsy."]="Te ódio, Nobsy."
G["I hate... every one of you..."]="Os ódio... a todos vocês..."
G["I hated him for what he had done. I hated him for the burden he left me. But now..."]="O e odiado pelo que fez. O e odiado pelo peso seu legado. Mas agora..."
G["I have ... failed the master..."]="Lhe e falhado... Ao mestre..."
G["I have a bad feeling about the mogu's presence.\n\nThere can only be one reason why they're excavating these mogu artifacts, and it's not for knowledge.\n\nThey're looking for clues to the mogu's power."]="I have a bad feeling about the mogu's presence.\n\nThere can only be one reason why they're excavating these mogu artifacts, and it's not for knowledge.\n\nThey're looking for clues to the mogu's power."
G["I have a bad feeling about this place."]="Este lugar me da mal espinha."
G["I have a book that might interest you.  Would you like to take a look?"]="I have a book that might interest you.  Would you like to take a look?"
G["I have a clear shot here! Get me more ammo!"]="Tenho um tiro limpo! Preciso munição!"
G["I have a different question."]="Tenho uma pergunta distinta."
G["I have a favor to ask. Could you reward my friend here? I haven't any coin. I can pay you when we get back to Ironforge."]="Tenho que pedir um favor. Poderia recompensar a meu $gamigo: amiga;? Posso pagar quando voltemos a Altaforja."
G["I have a few ideas on how to help heal the overgrowth, $c.\n\nUnfortunately, Naralex is so upset, he refuses to take any more chances."]="I have a few ideas on how to help heal the overgrowth, $c.\n\nUnfortunately, Naralex is so upset, he refuses to take any more chances."
G["I have a few more questions, Gymer."]="Eu tenho mais algumas perguntas, Gymer."
G["I have a few notes from the job back at my place. I'll get them and then meet you back in the inn."]="I have a few notes from the job back at my place. I'll get them and then meet you back in the inn."
G["I have a good mind to tear that portal down myself! This is outrageous!"]="Me falta pouco para derrubar eu mesmo esse portal! Isto é intolerable!"
G["I have a jar waiting just for you!"]="Tenho um tarro vazio que te está esperando!"
G["I have a limitless supply of Kor'kron at my command you fools! Surrender now and I will give you a quick death."]="Estúpidos! Os Kor'kron que lidero são infinitos. Rendíos agora mesmo e os darei uma morte rápida."
G["I have a lot of pent up anger and hostility. Just give me a reason, guttersnipe."]="Eu tenho muita raiva reprimida e hostilidade. Apenas me dê uma razão, guttersnipe."
G["I have a message for the Jade Serpent."]="Tenho uma mensagem para o dragão de jade."
G["I have a message for you to deliver to that tyrant!"]="Quero que lhe entregues um mensagna esse tirano!"
G["I have a piece of iron in my back that will remind me of that night for the rest of my days."]="I have a piece of iron in my back that will remind me of that night for the rest of my days."
G["I have a pretty good idea what ol' Great-father Winter's gonna be doing when this shift is over.  I got a bottle of Winter Veil cheer right here in my bag, and I intend to get to the bottom of it."]="Tenho bastante clareirao que o velho Grande Para Inverno vai fazer quando se acabe este turno. Tenho uma garrafa de licor de Festival de Inverno na minha bolsa, e não vai ficar nem uma gota."
G["I have a pretty good idea what ol' Greatfather Winter's gonna be doing when this shift is over.  I got a bottle of Winter Veil cheer right here in my bag, and I intend to get to the bottom of it."]="Tenho uma boa ideia do que o velho avô Winter fará quando essa mudança terminar. Peguei uma garrafa de véu de inverno aqui na minha bolsa e pretendo chegar ao fundo dela."
G["I have a proposal for you, $r.  Please consider your choices carefully - your decision cannot be easily reversed.\n\nIt is time we formalized your allegiance to our organization.  I must know in what capacity you wish to serve us so that we may reward you appropriately."]="I have a proposal for you, $r.  Please consider your choices carefully - your decision cannot be easily reversed.\n\nIt is time we formalized your allegiance to our organization.  I must know in what capacity you wish to serve us so that we may reward you appropriately."
G["I have a ride to Talonbranch Glade courtesy of James Hallow."]="I have a ride to Talonbranch Glade courtesy of James Hallow."
G["I have a rock in my nose."]="Eu tenho uma pedras no meu nariz."
G["I have a rocket here with your mark on it, Snivel."]="Eu tenho um foguete aqui com a sua marca, Snível."
G["I have a rule: anybody who calls me handsome gets free beer."]="Tenho uma norma: qualquer que me chame bonito recebe uma cerveja grátis."
G["I have a special message for $n.  And it says you must die!"]="Tenho uma mensagem especial para $n que diz que deve morrer!"
G["I have a task for you."]="Tenho uma tarefa para você."
G["I have about half the supplies needed to upgrade to champion units."]="Eu tenho perto da metade dos suprimentos necessários para atualizar para as unidades campeãs."
G["I have about half the supplies needed to upgrade to veteran units."]="Tenho perto de metade dos suprimentos necessários para atualizar para unidades veteranas."
G["I have agreed to this meeting, worldbreaker, but at great risk. If this is discovered..."]="E aceitou este encontro, Rompemundos, mas com grande risco. Se alguém o descubra..."
G["I have all manner of goods for sale, $c.  Browse at your leisure."]="I have all manner of goods for sale, $c.  Browse at your leisure."
G["I have an ale for every scalp you bring!"]="I have an ale for every scalp you bring!"
G["I have an idea for a new invention. It's called a pooper hooper. I'll never have to pick up poop again!"]="Tenho uma ideia para um novo invento. Se chama \"recogecacas\". Nunca terei que voltar a coletar caca!"
G["I have an idea.  Let's plant this shard in the ground and see what happens."]="Tenho uma ideia. Plantemos este fragmento no chão e vamos ver que sucede."
G["I have an idea... this time let's not wander through a naval battle between the Alliance and the Horde.\n\nI'm just saying."]="I have an idea... this time let's not wander through a naval battle between the Alliance and the Horde.\n\nI'm just saying."
G["I have another question."]="Eu tenho outra pergunta."
G["I have another question..."]="Tenho outra pergunta..."
G["I have another reading from the nether."]="Recibo mais dados da nada."
G["I have another task for you, should you be willing, little one."]="Se que tenho outra tarefa para você, pequeno."
G["I have arrived. Shall we set to work, then?"]="I have arrived. Shall we set to work, then?"
G["I have as much a right as any in the village to fight for my home. If I only knew a hero that could train me..."]="I have as much a right as any in the village to fight for my home. If I only knew a hero that could train me..."
G["I have awakened only to sleep once again."]="E despertado somente para voltar a dormir."
G["I have bad feeling about this...."]="Tenho um mal presentimento sobre isto..."
G["I have bad news for you Onu'zun: I'm gonna have to cut short your dreams!"]="Tenho mais notícia para você Onu'zun: vou ter que interromper seus sonhos!"
G["I have battled many beasts, dragon. I will help you."]="Eu lutei contra muitas bestas, dragão. Vou te ajudar."
G["I have become... DEATH!"]="Eu sou a... MORTE!"
G["I have been apprising the lorewalker of your deeds, champion. Are you ready to hear your tale?"]="Eu contei sobre seus feitos ao andarilho das lendas. Quer ouvir a balada sobre você?"
G["I have been asleep far longer than I thought possible. So much has changed."]="E dormindo muito mais tempo do que achava possível. Têm mudado tantas coisas..."
G["I have been assisting the flight masters to round up the Hippogryphs that fled their post when the land tore itself apart. Even now our birds remain squeamish."]="I have been assisting the flight masters to round up the Hippogryphs that fled their post when the land tore itself apart. Even now our birds remain squeamish."
G["I have been called back to Wyrmrest, ally. Farewell!"]="Me têm pedido que fique ao Repouso do Dragão. Adeus!"
G["I have been chosen!"]="E banido escolhido!"
G["I have been defeated.  Good fight!"]="E banido derrotou. Boa luta!"
G["I have been dreaming of this day for years, $n, and you have made it all possible. Witness the culmination of a lifetime of work!"]="E sonhado com isto durante anos, $n, e você o fez possível. Observa a culminação do trabalho de toda uma vida!"
G["I have been expecting you, young one. Come closer - my eyes are not as sharp as they once were."]="Estava esperando você, jovem. Aproxime-se. Meus olhos já não são o que eram."
G["I have been expecting you."]="Te estava esperando."
G["I have been looking forward to your return, champion."]="Estava ansioso por sua chegada."
G["I have been lost in the Dream. I sense his lifeforce but my powers have not yet grown strong enough to make contact."]="Eu me perdi no sonho. Sinto sua força vital, mas meus poderes ainda não se tornaram fortes o suficiente para fazer contato."
G["I have been observing your training, my young brothers and sisters."]="tenho estado observando seu treinamento, meus jovens irmãos e irmãs."
G["I have been ordered here, and here I stay and fight under the banner of Stormwind. But everything I do here is empty."]="I have been ordered here, and here I stay and fight under the banner of Stormwind. But everything I do here is empty."
G["I have been programmed to gloat.  Ha ha.  Ha ha.  Ha ha."]="Eu fui programado para me gabar. Ha ha. Ha ha. Ha ha."
G["I have been returned to the living."]="E retornado entre os vivos."
G["I have been sent by Sal'salabim to collect a debt that you owe. Pay up or I'm going to have to hurt you."]="Fui enviado por Saia'salabim para cobrar uma dívida que você deve. Pague ou terei que machucá-o."
G["I have been shown the future, $r.\n\nCentaur lands will be forever corrupted if we fail to act quickly."]="O futuro me banido mostrado, $r.\n\nSe não actuamos imediatamente, as terras dos centauros serão presa da corrupção para sempre."
G["I have been slain a hundred times. I always wake here, alive. Some say I am cursed and others..."]="Eu fui morto cem vezes. Eu sempre acordo aqui, vivo. Alguns dizem que sou amaldiçoado e outros..."
G["I have been taken prisoner by the Twilight's Hammer."]="O Martelo Crepúsculo me feito prisioneira."
G["I have been training hard all week. My hard work will pay off with a victory."]="I have been training hard all week. My hard work will pay off with a victory."
G["I have been waiting for you!"]="Te tenho estado esperando!"
G["I have been waiting here for an eternity since our last meeting! When will Goramosh be done with his ritual?"]="E esperado uma eternidade desde nossa última reunião! Quando acabará Goramosh com o seu ritual?"
G["I have been watching you and Rexxar.  You must aid him to secure the future of the Horde here in these mountains.  Only when you have forced the ogres into submission and slain their master, Gruul the Dragonkiller, will your people be safe."]="I have been watching you and Rexxar.  You must aid him to secure the future of the Horde here in these mountains.  Only when you have forced the ogres into submission and slain their master, Gruul the Dragonkiller, will your people be safe."
G["I have better things to do..."]="Tenho coisas melhores que fazer..."
G["I have brought the items for the ceremony."]="E trazido os itens para a cerimônia."
G["I have built it. And it is mine. Samophlange!"]="Eu o e construído e é meu. O churumbele!"
G["I have but helped you begin your journey. Great rewards await you, but whether you finish it is up to you."]="I have but helped you begin your journey. Great rewards await you, but whether you finish it is up to you."
G["I have changed my mind loyal servants, you do not need to bring the prisoner all the way to my study, I will deal with him here and now."]="I have changed my mind loyal servants, you do not need to bring the prisoner all the way to my study, I will deal with him here and now."
G["I have channeled all I can! The power is in your hands!"]="E canalizado tudo o que posso! O poder está nas suas mãos!"
G["I have chosen the name \"Wrathion.\" To my knowledge, I am the last of the black dragons.\n\nMy father was Deathwing, the Worldbreaker, the Aspect of Death, the Destroyer... But I hope you will not hold that against me.\n\nI have no love for my father, whose corruption destroyed my race, or for the red dragonflight, who stole away and experimented on my egg to create me.\n\nLet's just say, I am... unaffiliated. And I am always on the lookout for like-minded heroes."]="I have chosen the name \"Wrathion.\" To my knowledge, I am the last of the black dragons.\n\nMy father was Deathwing, the Worldbreaker, the Aspect of Death, the Destroyer... But I hope you will not hold that against me.\n\nI have no love for my father, whose corruption destroyed my race, or for the red dragonflight, who stole away and experimented on my egg to create me.\n\nLet's just say, I am... unaffiliated. And I am always on the lookout for like-minded heroes."
G["I have coated your hands with a special mixture, Wakener. Every time you defeat an enemy, their corpse will be injected with a special toxin. Observe the results, and use them to your advantage."]="I have coated your hands with a special mixture, Wakener. Every time you defeat an enemy, their corpse will be injected with a special toxin. Observe the results, and use them to your advantage."
G["I have coated your weapons with a special serum. Use it to inject your enemies. Too many injections, and their systems will overload."]="I have coated your weapons with a special serum. Use it to inject your enemies. Too many injections, and their systems will overload."
G["I have coated your weapons with my special mixture, Wakener. You will infect every corpse with a mutagen that... well... you must see the results for yourself."]="I have coated your weapons with my special mixture, Wakener. You will infect every corpse with a mutagen that... well... you must see the results for yourself."
G["I have come for training."]="Eu vim para treinar."
G["I have come for you, Malfurion."]="E vindo a por você, Malfurion."
G["I have come to kill or be killed!"]="E vindo a matar ou morrer!"
G["I have come to learn, Daio."]="E vindo a aprender, Daio."
G["I have come to return you to Kros! Surrender your flesh to me!"]="Venho para enviar de volta com Kros! Renuncia ao seu carne!"
G["I have come to support the draenei champion!"]="E vindo a apoiar ao campeão draeneis!"
G["I have completed the Trial of the Crusader."]="Eu completei o Julgamento do Cruzado."
G["I have completed the weapons, $n."]="Já e terminou as armas, $n."
G["I have completed your helm, $n."]="E terminou seu elmo, $n."
G["I have created the totem.  You, $n, must cleanse the well."]="E criado o totem. Você, $n, deve limpar o poço."
G["I have decades of practice handling blowhards like yourself, and I'm the only one you know here in this abominably freezing land."]="I have decades of practice handling blowhards like yourself, and I'm the only one you know here in this abominably freezing land."
G["I have decided to trust this warlock for now. Let $ghim:her; move about the temple freely."]="Por agora e decidido confiar em $geste bruxo: esta bruxa;. Deixem que recorrao templo livremente."
G["I have deduced that you must die!"]="I have deduced that you must die!"
G["I have defeated Darmuk! How else may I serve you?"]="Eu derrotei Darmuk! De que outra forma posso servi-o?"
G["I have delivered word to Wayward Landing. They should be sending more soldiers shortly."]="E enviada uma mensagem ao Ancoradouro Improvisado. Devem enviar mais soldados dentro de pouco."
G["I have destroyed my Azsharite weaponry! I need your assistance in defeating the triad of power."]="E destruído meus armas de Azshara! preciso da sua ajuda para derrotar à tríada do poder."
G["I have discerned the path that you must take. Are you prepared?"]="E vislumbrado o caminho que deve seguir. Está $gpreparado: preparada;?"
G["I have discovered a use for the carapace of the crypt fiend and its various body parts. I am able to fashion an extremely light and very deadly set of armor by combining the fragments with some of the desecrated magical armors lost in Naxxramas."]="Eu descobri um uso para a carapaça do demônio da cripta e suas várias partes do corpo. Sou capaz de criar um conjunto de armaduras extremamente leve e muito mortal, combinando os fragmentos com algumas das armaduras mágicas profanadas perdidas em Naxxramas."
G["I have dispatched Arch Druid Hamuul Runetotem to the burned out husk of the Sanctuary of Malorne. He is behind the front lines, on scorched terrain known as the Flamewake. He is looking into how we can undo the damage, and investigating the whereabouts of the turtle ancient Tortolla.\n\nBut before you can help him, you must first ensure that the Shrine of Aessina to the west is secure and the animals are saved from the flames. Otherwise all is lost! Concentrate on matters at the Grove of Aessina first, and they will send you to the Arch Druid in good time."]="I have dispatched Arch Druid Hamuul Runetotem to the burned out husk of the Sanctuary of Malorne. He is behind the front lines, on scorched terrain known as the Flamewake. He is looking into how we can undo the damage, and investigating the whereabouts of the turtle ancient Tortolla.\n\nBut before you can help him, you must first ensure that the Shrine of Aessina to the west is secure and the animals are saved from the flames. Otherwise all is lost! Concentrate on matters at the Grove of Aessina first, and they will send you to the Arch Druid in good time."
G["I have done all that I can for the Commander. I am afraid it will not be long, now."]="Fiz tudo o possível pelo comandante. Me temo que já não lhe ocorrida muito tempo."
G["I have done all that I could, Greatmother. I thank you for your kind words."]="Fiz tudo o que pude, Grande-mãe. Agradeço pelas suas amáveis ​​palavras."
G["I have done nothing. This is the work of the Slingtail chief, Gukgut."]="Não temos banido nós. Isto é obra do chefe Colafusta, Gukgut."
G["I have done some pretty twisted things, but what you're doing here is crossing a threshold even for me."]="I have done some pretty twisted things, but what you're doing here is crossing a threshold even for me."
G["I have done such vile things..."]="I have done such vile things..."
G["I have dreamed of this moment all my life, Greatmother. 'Till now, all I've had were Orgrim's stories about my parents and their adventures on Draenor. He was my greatest teacher and dearest friend. He died a hero... They all died as heroes - and for all of them, a song of honor remains."]="I have dreamed of this moment all my life, Greatmother. 'Till now, all I've had were Orgrim's stories about my parents and their adventures on Draenor. He was my greatest teacher and dearest friend. He died a hero... They all died as heroes - and for all of them, a song of honor remains."
G["I have duty in an hour, but until then... bottom's up!"]="Tenho dever em uma hora, mas até lá... o fundo está para cima!"
G["I have earned my freedom!"]="Me e ganhou meu liberdade!"
G["I have empowered another orb! Use it quickly!"]="I have empowered another orb! Use it quickly!"
G["I have enough strength left to stand and fight.  Prepare yourself."]="I have enough strength left to stand and fight.  Prepare yourself."
G["I have enough supplies to upgrade  our troops to seasoned."]="Eu tenho suprimentos suficientes para atualizar nossas tropas para temperadas."
