G["I have enough supplies to upgrade our troops to veterans."]="Eu tenho suprimentos suficientes para atualizar nossas tropas para veteranos."
G["I have enough torches to erase all three of you!"]="I have enough torches to erase all three of you!"
G["I have every confidence that we will recover that which Nexus-Prince Haramad desires."]="Tenho toda a confiança de que recuperaremos aquilo que o príncipe Nexus Haramad deseja."
G["I have everything I need. Quickly, let's move on before they return!"]="Tenho tudo o necessário. Rápido, vamos antes de que vuelvan!"
G["I have failed once more..."]="E voltado a falhar..."
G["I have failed you, Empress."]="Te e falhado, Imperatriz."
G["I have failed you, empress..."]="Te e falhado, Imperatriz..."
G["I have failed you, master..."]="Te e falhado, mestre..."
G["I have failed you, my friend. I am so sorry."]="I have failed you, my friend. I am so sorry."
G["I have failed, but you will not live to tell anyone of this victory!"]="I have failed, but you will not live to tell anyone of this victory!"
G["I have failed... I have failed in my duty... failed my people... The worgen run rampant, and the Scythe of my goddess is lost."]="I have failed... I have failed in my duty... failed my people... The worgen run rampant, and the Scythe of my goddess is lost."
G["I have failed... our sacred brotherhood..."]="E falhado... a nossa guilda sagrado..."
G["I have failed...."]="E fracassado..."
G["I have faith in our friends from beyond the mists."]="Eu tenho fé em nossos amigos do outro lado da névoa."
G["I have fallen! Fear not, brethren! Let nothing keep you from the Stoneforge!"]="I have fallen! Fear not, brethren! Let nothing keep you from the Stoneforge!"
G["I have fallen. I am sorry, I shall train harder for next time."]="I have fallen. I am sorry, I shall train harder for next time."
G["I have fashioned Yenniku's Soul Gem, $n..."]="I have fashioned Yenniku's Soul Gem, $n..."
G["I have finished your leg guards, $n."]="E terminou seus musleras, $n."
G["I have food, if you are hungry, and you may make use of my tent, should you require rest."]="Eu tenho comida, se você estiver com fome, e você pode fazer uso da minha tenda, se precisar descansar."
G["I have fought by Sarannha's side for as long as I can remember. She is fierce in battle, and I watch her back."]="I have fought by Sarannha's side for as long as I can remember. She is fierce in battle, and I watch her back."
G["I have found both parts of your scepter."]="Encontrei ambas partes do seu cetro."
G["I have given my all... for the Horde..."]="Eu dei tudo de mim... pela Horda..."
G["I have given you all the knowledge I have, $n. May luck be with you."]="I have given you all the knowledge I have, $n. May luck be with you."
G["I have given you an oathstone of Ysera's Dragonflight, $n.  When you are ready and able to aid us, use it, and then we may begin."]="I have given you an oathstone of Ysera's Dragonflight, $n.  When you are ready and able to aid us, use it, and then we may begin."
G["I have grown so much thanks to you!"]="I have grown so much thanks to you!"
G["I have had basic warrior training, but no one knows that I have more skill with spellcasting."]="E recebido o treinamento básico de um guerreiro, mas ninguém sabe que se me da melhor lançar feitiços."
G["I have had this object in my possession for 10 years. Since Blackrock Spire..."]="E tido este item na minha poder dez anos. Desde a cume de Rocha Negra..."
G["I have heard of your \"heroism,\" Locust. They say your raids on mogu labor camps and farmlands delayed the completion of the wall by decades."]="I have heard of your \"heroism,\" Locust. They say your raids on mogu labor camps and farmlands delayed the completion of the wall by decades."
G["I have heard of your kind, but I never thought to see the day when I would meet a half-breed."]="Ouvi falar do seu tipo, mas nunca pensei em ver o dia em que conheceria um mestiço."
G["I have heard rumors that our old friends, the elves, have allied themselves with the Horde. I always said our trust in them was foolish."]="Ouvi rumores de que nossos antigos amigos, os elfos, se têm aliado com a Horda. Sempre se disse que deveríamos haver confiado em eles."
G["I have heard tale of my boy being here. That he's now a powerful death knight in service of the Lich King. If this is true, then it must be me that ends the bloodline.\n\nMy charge now is to command Orgrim's Hammer to the top of Icecrown Citadel and destroy all Scourge that get in our way. We leave when you and your allies are ready."]="Ouvi rumores de que meu filho está aqui. Que agora é um poderoso cavaleiro da Morte em serviço do Rei Lich. Se é certo, a linha de descendência acaba em mim.\n\nMeu tarefa agora é dirigir o Martelo de Orgrim à Cidadela da Coroa de Gelo e destruir toda o Flagelo no caminho. Partimos quando seus aliados e você estiver prontos."
G["I have heard tale of the Maelstrom itself opening up, threatening to devour the world. Could you imagine such a thing?"]="Ouvi histórias de que A Voragem abriu e ameaça com devorar o mundo. Pode imaginar uma coisa assim?"
G["I have heard tell of many dangerous enemies and creatures on the Isle of Thunder. It seems that every day, the threat changes."]="I have heard tell of many dangerous enemies and creatures on the Isle of Thunder. It seems that every day, the threat changes."
G["I have heard that Northrend is lost..."]="Ouvi que Nortúndria se perdeu..."
G["I have heard that there are many hidden treasures on the island."]="Ouvi que há muitos tesouros escondidos pela ilha."
G["I have heard the call, my lord!"]="Ouvi a chamada, meu senhor!"
G["I have heard the rumors and the jokes..."]="Ouvi os rumores e os chistes..."
G["I have heard there are master alchemists among the Klaxxi, far over the wall in the Dread Wastes. I will mark the location on your map for you."]="Ouvi que algum Klaxxi são mestres alquimistas, ao outro lado da muralha, no Deserto do Pavor. Te marcarei seu localização no mapa."
G["I have heard whisperings from the east that our esteemed Scarab Lord has joined the battle, as have entire batallions from Shattrath: heroes blessed by A'dal himself, granted rank as Hand of A'dal!"]="I have heard whisperings from the east that our esteemed Scarab Lord has joined the battle, as have entire batallions from Shattrath: heroes blessed by A'dal himself, granted rank as Hand of A'dal!"
G["I have heard you before.  You are here to save your world; to learn from ours.  Greatmother Geyah has charged me with instructing you, and as such, you will listen to me, Go'el."]="I have heard you before.  You are here to save your world; to learn from ours.  Greatmother Geyah has charged me with instructing you, and as such, you will listen to me, Go'el."
G["I have heard your words, Great Bear Spirit, and I understand.  I now seek your blessings to fully learn the way of the Claw."]="Eu ouvi suas palavras, Espírito do Grande Urso, e eu entendo. Agora busco suas bênçãos para aprender completamente o caminho da Garra."
G["I have honored the Horde with years of service, and this is how I am treated?"]="I have honored the Horde with years of service, and this is how I am treated?"
G["I have it! The gates are undone!"]="Pronto! As portões se abrem!"
G["I have just completed a new dimensional imploder that will make me rich beyond my wildest goblin dreams!   All I need to do is get a skilled Goblin Engineer to build a dimensional ripper that connects to it and try it!"]="I have just completed a new dimensional imploder that will make me rich beyond my wildest goblin dreams!   All I need to do is get a skilled Goblin Engineer to build a dimensional ripper that connects to it and try it!"
G["I have just returned from the wall.\n\nThere, I heard rumors of a faction called The Klaxxi from beyond the Serpent's Spine. Supposedly, they are a council of mantid elders who have split off from the Mantid Empire, and now work in direct defiance of the mantid queen.\n\nI have seen with my own eyes the power that these mantid wield.\n\nIf these rumors are true, then perhaps there is a way to ally with these... Klaxxi... and work with them to stop the mantid swarm."]="I have just returned from the wall.\n\nThere, I heard rumors of a faction called The Klaxxi from beyond the Serpent's Spine. Supposedly, they are a council of mantid elders who have split off from the Mantid Empire, and now work in direct defiance of the mantid queen.\n\nI have seen with my own eyes the power that these mantid wield.\n\nIf these rumors are true, then perhaps there is a way to ally with these... Klaxxi... and work with them to stop the mantid swarm."
G["I have just the spell to get this door open. Too bad the cell doors weren't locked so haphazardly."]="I have just the spell to get this door open. Too bad the cell doors weren't locked so haphazardly."
G["I have just the spot for this horn!"]="Encontrei o lugar perfeito para este chifre!"
G["I have just the thing you need to cast your spell."]="Eu tenho exatamente o que você precisa para lançar seu feitiço."
G["I have kept the Bell safe as promised, Master."]="E protegido a Sino como prometí, mestre."
G["I have killed many of your ogres, Lantresor. I have no fear."]="Eu matei muitos dos seus ogros, Lantresor. Eu não tenho medo."
G["I have learned how to make an ancient pandaren tincture that will allow us to see into Shan Kien's past. We have but to gather the elements for this brew."]="Aprendi a elaborar uma antiga tintura pandaren que nos permitirá contemplar o passado de Shan Kien. Somente temos que reunir os ingredientes."
G["I have learned much from these monks, $r. You would do well to do the same."]="Aprendi muito de estes monges, $r. Harías bem em seguir meu exemplo."
G["I have learned much of potions over the long years, $n, and that knowledge is at your disposal. You have only to ask."]="ao largo dos anos aprendi muito sobre poções, $n, e tudo esse saber está ao seu disposição. Somente precisa perguntar."
G["I have less than one-third of the supplies needed to upgrade to veteran units."]="Tenho menos de um tercio dos suprimentos necessários para melhorar a unidades veteranas."
G["I have long known you'd seek me out, $n.\n\nEvery sentient being in this world is driven by the choices they make.  Choices beget further choices, and these in turn make someone who they are.  This is where your fortune is drawn from - who you are, and the choices you make.\n\nAre you ready to discover where your fortune lies?"]="I have long known you'd seek me out, $n.\n\nEvery sentient being in this world is driven by the choices they make.  Choices beget further choices, and these in turn make someone who they are.  This is where your fortune is drawn from - who you are, and the choices you make.\n\nAre you ready to discover where your fortune lies?"
G["I have long waited for an opportunity to deal with the Sunreavers. I asked my late husband to remove them from the city, but he believed too firmly in the neutrality of the Kirin Tor.\n\nHe was wise, but he was short-sighted. This has always been the destiny of the Kirin Tor: to serve the Alliance."]="I have long waited for an opportunity to deal with the Sunreavers. I asked my late husband to remove them from the city, but he believed too firmly in the neutrality of the Kirin Tor.\n\nHe was wise, but he was short-sighted. This has always been the destiny of the Kirin Tor: to serve the Alliance."
