G["I have lost my Titanium Seal of Dalaran.  Can you provide me with a replacement?"]="I have lost my Titanium Seal of Dalaran.  Can you provide me with a replacement?"
G["I have lost my Zandalar Haruspex's Tunic, Maywiki. Do you have a replacement?"]="I have lost my Zandalar Haruspex's Tunic, Maywiki. Do you have a replacement?"
G["I have lost my Zandalar Illusionist's Robe and need a new one, Al'tabim."]="E perdido meu toga de ilusionista Zandalariano e preciso uma nova, Al'tabim."
G["I have lost my reins. Could you provide me with another?"]="I have lost my reins. Could you provide me with another?"
G["I have lost my talisman and require a new one, Jin'rokh."]="Perdi meu talismã e preciso de um novo, Jin'rokh."
G["I have lost the Eye of Haramad and require a replacement, Ameer."]="I have lost the Eye of Haramad and require a replacement, Ameer."
G["I have lost the talisman and require a new one, Al'tabim."]="Perdi o talismã e preciso de um novo, Al'tabim."
G["I have lost the talisman, Falthir. I require a replacement."]="Perdi o talismã, Falthir. Eu preciso de uma substituição."
G["I have lost to your mastery."]="Fui derrotado por sua perícia."
G["I have made contact, $n. It is Lokholar the Ice Lord. He has deemed our cause worthy - our earth bound sacrifice sufficient. He comes soon... prepare yourself."]="E conseguido contactar, $n. É Lokholar, o Senhor do Gelo. Tem considerado nossa causa digna... Nosso sacrifício do vínculo com a terra logo. Chegará pronto... Prepare-se!"
G["I have managed to remove my gloves.  You may lob them at our foe."]="I have managed to remove my gloves.  You may lob them at our foe."
G["I have marks to redeem!"]="Eu tenho marcas para resgatar!"
G["I have marks to redeem."]="Eu tenho marcas para resgatar."
G["I have misplaced Archmage Vargoth's Staff."]="E extraviado o cajado do archimago Vargoth."
G["I have misplaced my Zandalar Augur's Bracers and require another pair."]="Não sei onde e posto meus braçadeiras de áugure Zandalariano pelo que preciso um par novo."
G["I have misplaced my worg disguise."]="Perdi meu disfarce de worg."
G["I have much knowledge to impress upon you, $c. You must learn to hunt with honor."]="I have much knowledge to impress upon you, $c. You must learn to hunt with honor."
G["I have much to do! Why can they not leave me to my work?"]="Tenho muito por fazer! Por que não me deixam trabalhar?"
G["I have much to ponder, $n. Get out there and make yourself useful."]="Tenho muito em que pensar, $n. Saia e faça algo útil."
G["I have much to ponder."]="Tenho que reflexionar."
G["I have my wife, two strong daughters, and two strong sons. Thank you, but we can protect this farm ourselves."]="Tenho a meu esposa, dois fortes filhas e dois fortes filhos. Obrigado, mas podemos proteção esta fazenda nós sozinhos."
G["I have neither the time, nor the inclination, to explain things to you, scumbag!  Now do you have something important to say, or are you just here to ask me out for a drink, princess?"]="Não tenho tempo nem inclinação para lhe explicar as coisas, desprezível! Agora você tem algo importante a dizer, ou você está aqui apenas para me convidar para uma bebida, princesa?"
G["I have never failed a mission in many years, $n. I am not about to do so now."]="I have never failed a mission in many years, $n. I am not about to do so now."
G["I have never felt such strength radiate from an orc. Is he... mortal..."]="I have never felt such strength radiate from an orc. Is he... mortal..."
G["I have never seen a place like this. Have you, $n?"]="Nunca havia visto um lugar assim. E você, $n?"
G["I have never seen a trainee with skills such as yours. I must tell the others."]="I have never seen a trainee with skills such as yours. I must tell the others."
G["I have never seen anything like this. Have you, $n?"]="Nunca havia visto algo assim. E você, $n?"
G["I have never seen one of those before."]="Nunca vi um dos esses."
G["I have no business with you, stranger. What do you want?"]="I have no business with you, stranger. What do you want?"
G["I have no choice but to obey!"]="Não tenho outra elecção mais que obedecer!"
G["I have no doubt of that, Dalfors, but will we be alive to see it happen?"]="I have no doubt of that, Dalfors, but will we be alive to see it happen?"
G["I have no equal!"]="Não tenho igual!"
G["I have no further training for you.  Continue east, to the Menders' Stead, for now.  You will be summoned when the Battle for Andorhal commences.  Hopefully Koltira doesn't wait too long..."]="I have no further training for you.  Continue east, to the Menders' Stead, for now.  You will be summoned when the Battle for Andorhal commences.  Hopefully Koltira doesn't wait too long..."
G["I have no idea what goes on here, but I will gladly join your fight against this impudent imbecile!"]="I have no idea what goes on here, but I will gladly join your fight against this impudent imbecile!"
G["I have no idea where he's at. I haven't seen him since we landed!"]="Não tenho nem ideia de onde está. Não lhe vi desde que tem aterrizado!"
G["I have no idea who you are, but your presence is most welcome. Archimonde and his Scourge army could attack at any time, $C. Will you stand with us against this evil?"]="Não tenho nem ideia de quem é, mas seu presença aqui é do mais boas-vindas. Archimonde e seu exército do Flagelo poderá atacar em qualquer momentos, $c. Estará conosco para lutar contra este mal?"
G["I have no interest in buying anything that you are here to sell me, friend!"]="I have no interest in buying anything that you are here to sell me, friend!"
G["I have no love for the intruders, Stonemother, but these fleshlings went well out of their way to cleanse the filth from the Crimson Expanse."]="I have no love for the intruders, Stonemother, but these fleshlings went well out of their way to cleanse the filth from the Crimson Expanse."
G["I have no more knowledge to bestow upon you. Go through the archway and down the ramp to the southeast, and talk to Doctor Herbert Halsey. He is a Forsaken who can teach you more advanced techniques."]="Não tenho mais conhecimento para lhe conceder. Atravesse o arco e desça a rampa para o sudeste e converse com o doutor Herbert Halsey. Ele é um Renegado que pode ensinar técnicas mais avançadas."
G["I have no more trials for you today, $n. Return to us again soon."]="Não tenho mais provas para você hoje, $n. Volta pronto."
G["I have no need for bones to best you!"]="I have no need for bones to best you!"
G["I have no need for eyes to see my enemies. Your clumsy footsteps and foul stench give you away!"]="I have no need for eyes to see my enemies. Your clumsy footsteps and foul stench give you away!"
G["I have no need for this. Do you want it?"]="Isto não o preciso. O que?"
G["I have no quarrel with you, stranger."]="I have no quarrel with you, stranger."
G["I have no room for you here, $n. The Kor'kron have taken over my inn as a temporary barracks."]="I have no room for you here, $n. The Kor'kron have taken over my inn as a temporary barracks."
G["I have no taste for these games, Tirion. Still... I trust they will perform admirably."]="Não me gostam estes jogos, Tirion... Ainda assim, estou certo de que seu actuação será admirable."
G["I have no time for a sermon now, $c. Seek your knowledge elsewhere."]="Não tenho tempo para sermones agora, $c. Busca seus conhecimentos em outra parte."
G["I have no time for interruptions."]="Não tenho tempo para interrupções."
G["I have no time for small talk, $n."]="I have no time for small talk, $n."
G["I have no time for such diversions. Keepers of Eternity, will you stand for your queen?"]="I have no time for such diversions. Keepers of Eternity, will you stand for your queen?"
G["I have no time for this!"]="Não tenho tempo para isto!"
G["I have no time for you, $r. Continue on your way."]="Não tenho tempo para você, $r. Continua seu caminho."
G["I have no time to waste on the likes of you $c."]="Não tenho tempo que perder com os do seu classe, $c."
G["I have no use for cowards in my army. Lately, I have been questioning the blood elves' courage, and loyalty."]="I have no use for cowards in my army. Lately, I have been questioning the blood elves' courage, and loyalty."
G["I have not always been the Banshee Queen, $n."]="$n, Não sempre e banido a Rainha alma em pena."
G["I have not come this far to be stopped! The future I have planned will not be jeopardized! Now you will taste true power!!"]="I have not come this far to be stopped! The future I have planned will not be jeopardized! Now you will taste true power!!"
G["I have not come to kill you, night elf. And the gods did not do this..."]="Eu não vim para te matar, elfo noturno. E os deuses não fizeram isso..."
G["I have not completed the Trial of the Crusader."]="Eu não completei o Julgamento do Cruzado."
G["I have not seen Lo since he made off with my student, Syra. They were heading east toward the Arboretum.\n\nIt will not go well if their parents learn of this. The Wanderbrews and the Goldendrafts have had a long standing feud."]="I have not seen Lo since he made off with my student, Syra. They were heading east toward the Arboretum.\n\nIt will not go well if their parents learn of this. The Wanderbrews and the Goldendrafts have had a long standing feud."
G["I have not yet... begun to..."]="Ainda não... e empezado..."
G["I have nothing I'm allowed to sell to you."]="Não tenho nada que eu possa vender para você."
G["I have nothing for you.\n\nHegrid, though, has been gathering Twilight supplies to replenish our own. You might speak with her."]="I have nothing for you.\n\nHegrid, though, has been gathering Twilight supplies to replenish our own. You might speak with her."
G["I have nothing more to teach you. Talk to Karolek if you wish to further your leatherworking skills."]="Não tenho mais nada para ensinar. Fale com Karolek se você deseja aprimorar suas habilidades em couro."
G["I have nothing to hide."]="Não tenho nada que esconder."
G["I have nothing to say to you, $r."]="Não tenho nada que dizer, $r."
G["I have nothing to say to you, $r. Your people have a lot to answer for. But maybe this is a new beginning."]="Não tenho nada que dizer, $r. Seu povo tem muito pelo que responder. Mas talvez isto seja um novo início."
G["I have nothing to teach you, $c."]="Não tenho nada que ensinar, $c."
G["I have observed four different kinds of plants that have been affected by the corruption: the songflower, the windblossom, the whipper root, and the night dragon plant.  The songflower and windblossom are common plants in Felwood, while the whipper root and night dragon are seen less frequently.  All are a vital part of Felwood's ecosystem."]="Eu observei quatro tipos diferentes de plantas que foram afetadas pela corrupção: a flor da canção, a flor do vento, a raiz do chicote e a planta do dragão noturno. O songflower e windblossom são plantas comuns em Felwood, enquanto a raiz de whipper e o dragão da noite são vistos com menos frequência. Todos são uma parte vital do ecossistema de Felwood."
G["I have opened a portal into the Dream. Your salvation lies within, heroes..."]="E aberto um portal ao Sonho. Sua salvação está dentro, heróis..."
G["I have opened the portal to my retreat. Go and rest. I'll need you lively when our studies resume in the morning, you nimble little thing."]="I have opened the portal to my retreat. Go and rest. I'll need you lively when our studies resume in the morning, you nimble little thing."
G["I have orders for you to return to the battlefront."]="Tenho ordens para você: volta ao linha de frente de batalha."
G["I have orders here for an attack on alliance forces in the middle fields.  I need someone to get them to the assault leader."]="I have orders here for an attack on alliance forces in the middle fields.  I need someone to get them to the assault leader."
G["I have other business that must be done in Azshara, so I will join you on your journey, $n."]="I have other business that must be done in Azshara, so I will join you on your journey, $n."
G["I have other matters to attend to for the master.  Let's make this quick so that I can get back to them."]="Tenho outros assuntos que atender para o mestre. Acabemos com isto rápido para que possa voltar a eles."
G["I have outfitted kings. With the proper training, you can too."]="Eu vesti reis. Com o treinamento adequado, você também pode."
G["I have paid your price, Gloom'rel.  Now, teach me your secrets!"]="E pagado seu preço, Gloom'rel. Agora ensénhame seus segredos!"
G["I have pets -- ca-caw! -- of my own!"]="Tenho ajudantes ah-ogh, próprias!"
G["I have plenty of emergency pool ponies, $n. Please throw them to our laborers in the water below."]="I have plenty of emergency pool ponies, $n. Please throw them to our laborers in the water below."
G["I have pondered the matter unceasingly.\n\nI believe that a weapon might be fashioned which would rival Frostmourne in power without enslaving  its master.\n\nNevermind it, $r. Even if it were possible, there's not time to create such an artifact.\n\nIt is best that you focus your energies on our assault."]="I have pondered the matter unceasingly.\n\nI believe that a weapon might be fashioned which would rival Frostmourne in power without enslaving  its master.\n\nNevermind it, $r. Even if it were possible, there's not time to create such an artifact.\n\nIt is best that you focus your energies on our assault."
G["I have power you'll never know, Malfurion."]="Não te imaginas o poder que tenho, Malfurion."
G["I have powerful friends, and they will not be happy to hear I was treated this way!"]="Tenho amigos poderosos, e não lhes gustará ouvir que me têm tratado assim!"
G["I have reason to believe you're involved in cultist activity."]="Tenho motivos para acreditar que você está envolvido em atividades cultistas."
G["I have regained control! Everyone - back to your posts!"]="I have regained control! Everyone - back to your posts!"
G["I have returned to finish what I started, Darkspear. These islands shall run with your blood."]="I have returned to finish what I started, Darkspear. These islands shall run with your blood."
G["I have returned, Greatmother. Garrosh has found his heart and his fury."]="I have returned, Greatmother. Garrosh has found his heart and his fury."
G["I have risen!"]="Estou em pé outra vez!"
G["I have run out of extinguishing mixture. May I have another vial?"]="Me e ficado sem mistura de extinção. Posso ter outro frasco?"
G["I have run through these plains for many, many seasons.  And I have hunted great beasts.  And I had never been bested... until I faced Ghost Howl.\n\nLong ago, the massive wolf was an ally to the tauren and fought bravely against the Burning Legion.  But he was wounded savagely by a demon, and the tear in his flesh never healed.  Eventually... it drove Ghost Howl mad.\n\nNow he roams the plains in agony, seeking an end to his pain.  To my shame, when we fought I lacked the strength to slay him..."]="I have run through these plains for many, many seasons.  And I have hunted great beasts.  And I had never been bested... until I faced Ghost Howl.\n\nLong ago, the massive wolf was an ally to the tauren and fought bravely against the Burning Legion.  But he was wounded savagely by a demon, and the tear in his flesh never healed.  Eventually... it drove Ghost Howl mad.\n\nNow he roams the plains in agony, seeking an end to his pain.  To my shame, when we fought I lacked the strength to slay him..."
G["I have secured escape for us, $n.  You are to come with me."]="I have secured escape for us, $n.  You are to come with me."
G["I have seen firsthand what the Forsaken are capable of doing. It is true. They hunt us... slaughter the defenseless."]="I have seen firsthand what the Forsaken are capable of doing. It is true. They hunt us... slaughter the defenseless."
G["I have seen humble slaves endure unimaginable torture, only to rise up and overthrow their masters."]="I have seen humble slaves endure unimaginable torture, only to rise up and overthrow their masters."
G["I have seen it... From this blessed crystal we will forge a weapon. This weapon will hold inside it a piece of each of us... And when it is used against undead, it shall cast them down. And in its wake, it will leave only ashes..."]="I have seen it... From this blessed crystal we will forge a weapon. This weapon will hold inside it a piece of each of us... And when it is used against undead, it shall cast them down. And in its wake, it will leave only ashes..."
G["I have seen many battles, healed many allies, cleansed many souls, and many enemies have fallen victim to my command.\nYou may feel safe inside these city walls but make no mistake, war plagues these lands like a pandemic and only the chosen few live to tell the tale."]="I have seen many battles, healed many allies, cleansed many souls, and many enemies have fallen victim to my command.\nYou may feel safe inside these city walls but make no mistake, war plagues these lands like a pandemic and only the chosen few live to tell the tale."
G["I have seen many dangers in these wastes.  Who knows what creatures yet lurk in the dust to ambush the unwary?"]="Eu já vi muitos perigos nesses resíduos. Quem sabe que criaturas ainda se escondem no pó para emboscar os incautos?"
G["I have seen many students over the years, but there is something different about you."]="vi a muitos estudantes ao largo dos anos, mas você tem algo diferente."
G["I have seen many things in my life, but never have I encountered a creature as strange as you."]="vi muitas coisas ao largo de minha vida, mas nunca havia visto uma criatura tão estranha como você."
G["I have seen many things. But the cruelty of the mogu still curdles my blood."]="I have seen many things. But the cruelty of the mogu still curdles my blood."
G["I have seen saurok with more fighting panache than what you have just displayed."]="vi saurok com melhor estilo de luta que o que acabo de ver."
G["I have seen so much during my journey through this land. I feel older and perhaps a bit... wiser."]="vi muitas coisas durante meus viagens por esta terra. Me sinto maior, e talvez até um pouco mais... sábio."
G["I have seen the Horde's world. I have been inside their cities. Inside their minds..."]="vi o mundo da Horda. tenho estado nos seus cidades, nos seus mentes…"
G["I have seen the TRUTH - and my chains have been broken."]="vi a VERDADE e e front meus correntes."
G["I have seen the fall of the Lich King. Creations of the titans have fallen before my mighty axe. When called upon, I alone spearheaded a victory for the Argent Crusade against the beasts of Northrend. Now, I come for the ultimate challenge. What does Hillsbrad Foothills have to offer Kingslayer Orkus???"]="Eu vi a cai do Rei Lich. As criações dos titãs caíram diante do meu poderoso machado. Quando chamado, liderei sozinho uma vitória da Cruzada Argentina contra os animais de Northrend. Agora, eu vim para o desafio fim. O que o Hillsbrad Foothills tem a oferecer ao Kingslayer Orkus???"
G["I have seen the future, brothers and sisters, and in it the Horde are no more!"]="I have seen the future, brothers and sisters, and in it the Horde are no more!"
G["I have seen worlds bathed in the Makers' flames, their denizens fading without as much as a whimper. Entire planetary systems born and razed in the time that it takes your mortal hearts to beat once. Yet all throughout, my own heart devoid of emotion... of empathy. I. Have. Felt. Nothing. A million-million lives wasted. Had they all held within them your tenacity? Had they all loved life as you do?"]="I have seen worlds bathed in the Makers' flames, their denizens fading without as much as a whimper. Entire planetary systems born and razed in the time that it takes your mortal hearts to beat once. Yet all throughout, my own heart devoid of emotion... of empathy. I. Have. Felt. Nothing. A million-million lives wasted. Had they all held within them your tenacity? Had they all loved life as you do?"
G["I have seen you in these parts before. I can see that you are a $c, from the look of you."]="I have seen you in these parts before. I can see that you are a $c, from the look of you."
G["I have seen your magic. I know that you are not saurok. You are other.\n\nYour magic makes you weak. You are not brave. You are coward who hides in enemy's skin. YOU ARE NOT STRONG!\n\n<Gokkar spits at your feet.>"]="vi seu magia. Sei que não é um saurok. É outra coisa.\n\nSeu magia te há fraco. Não é corajoso. É $gun: uma; covarde que se esconde atrás a pele do inimigo. NÃO É FORTE!\n\n<Gokkar escupe aos seus pés.>"
G["I have seen your sky-fortress. Your people have an interesting notion of \"peace.\""]="Já vi sua fortaleza voadora. Seu povo tem um concepto interessante da paz."
G["I have selected a landing site for our forces: a small peninsula to our east that is easily defended."]="E escolhido um ponto de desembarco: uma península ao este, fácil de defenda."
G["I have sent all the warriors I can. Had I but even one more for you..."]="E enviada a todos os guerreiros que e pedido. Se tivesse algum mais para você..."
G["I have sent my boy to Thal'darah Grove to fetch you proof. You will soon see that they pose no threat to us."]="I have sent my boy to Thal'darah Grove to fetch you proof. You will soon see that they pose no threat to us."
G["I have sent to Light's Hope Chapel for a grant of gold for the care of the refugees. Carry out your mission, but help as you can."]="I have sent to Light's Hope Chapel for a grant of gold for the care of the refugees. Carry out your mission, but help as you can."
G["I have served to the last...."]="E servido até o fim..."
G["I have set back the flow of time just once more.  If you fail to prevent Thrall's death, then all is lost."]="E invertido o fluxo do tempo uma vez mais. Se não salvas a Thrall esta vez, tudo estará perdido."
G["I have shown you part of the course. Now, let us see the finish line. Follow me!"]="I have shown you part of the course. Now, let us see the finish line. Follow me!"
G["I have so many wonders to show you."]="I have so many wonders to show you."
G["I have so much to do... so much before the plague comes..."]="Tenho muito que fazer... tanto que fazer antes de que chegue a Fedor..."
G["I have some Candy Coins I would like to exchange."]="Tenho algumas moedas de caramelo que gostaria alterar."
G["I have some cookies for you!"]="Que uma galhetita, tesouro?"
G["I have some left over."]="Me restante algo."
G["I have some skill in the magical arts, but I wish I had more formal training."]="Tenho certa aptidão nas artes mágicas, mas gostaria haver recebido mais treinamento."
G["I have something else to ask you about."]="Eu tenho outra coisa para lhe perguntar."
G["I have something for you..."]="Tenho algo para vocês."
G["I have sometin' to show ya. It be easier to understand if ya see it yourself."]="Tenho que ensenhah'te algo. Será má' fácil de entender se o vê com o seu' próprios olhos."
G["I have sometin' to show you. It be easier to understand if ya see it yourself."]="I have sometin' to show you. It be easier to understand if ya see it yourself."
G["I have sores older than you."]="I have sores older than you."
G["I have spent countless hours preparing for this battle."]="I have spent countless hours preparing for this battle."
G["I have spoken to some of your... Alliance... friends. Your people are quite interesting."]="E falado com algum dos seus... amigos da... Aliança. Seu povo resulta bastante interessante."
G["I have studied for years to master the art of the chi blast and would be honored to fight by your side. Would you like my assistance?"]="I have studied for years to master the art of the chi blast and would be honored to fight by your side. Would you like my assistance?"
G["I have such a hard time gathering firewood..."]="Foi duro coletar a lenha..."
G["I have such fascinating things to show you."]="I have such fascinating things to show you."
G["I have suffered, but now I can feel it slowly fading from me. I feel... free."]="Sofri, mas agora posso sentir isso lentamente desaparecendo de mim. Sinto-me livre."
G["I have survived the poisons of the Forsaken, $n, and I know now what must be done."]="E sobrevivido aos venenos dos Renegados, $n, e agora sei que é o que é preciso fazer."
G["I have the best seat in the house, don't you think?"]="A que tenho o melhor assento?"
G["I have the charm with me and I will unlock its power once the crate is in my hands. You were wise to change your mind, Barnes."]="I have the charm with me and I will unlock its power once the crate is in my hands. You were wise to change your mind, Barnes."
G["I have the fuel!  Take me to Raven's Wood."]="Tenho o combustível! Leve-me ao Floresta do Corvo."
G["I have the key, let's start the raid. [Queue for solo instance.]"]="Tenho a chave. Empecemos o ataque. [Entre à cauda para fazer a instância em solitário.]"
G["I have the most respect for the sparktouched out of all of the oracles... they have stood up for their land admirably."]="De todos os Oráculos, sinto maior respeito pelos Pavesa... Têm defendido seu terra de forma admirable."
G["I have the proper certification to use the bank."]="Tenho a certificação adequada para usar o banco."
G["I have the signed waiver!  Fire me into the Singing Ridge!"]="Tenho a renuncia firmada! Lánzame a Cresta Canto!"
G["I have the softest featherbeds you can find for a thousand miles. Would you like to try one?"]="I have the softest featherbeds you can find for a thousand miles. Would you like to try one?"
G["I have the spell. You can analyze it."]="I have the spell. You can analyze it."
G["I have the totem of cleansing, $n."]="Tenho o totem da limpeza, $n."
G["I have to admit, that looked pretty fun!"]="I have to admit, that looked pretty fun!"
G["I have to admit, you're not what I expected when I received the warchief's commission."]="I have to admit, you're not what I expected when I received the warchief's commission."
G["I have to aim for the Forsaken ships."]="I have to aim for the Forsaken ships."
G["I have to check on my family. Please help us!"]="Tenho que ver como está meu família. Ayúdanos, por favor!"
G["I have to clean up this mess, but I'll do it without complaint.\n\nYou'll help if you have any Horde pride at all!"]="I have to clean up this mess, but I'll do it without complaint.\n\nYou'll help if you have any Horde pride at all!"
G["I have to get out of here! Can you get me free?"]="Eu tenho que sair daqui! Você pode me liberar?"
G["I have to give these Twilight a wee bit of credit... what they lack in skill, they make up for in numbers and tenacity. They got a few good licks in during our last bout."]="Eu tenho que dar a Twilight um pouco de crédito... o que eles não têm habilidade, eles compensam em números e tenacidade. Eles tiveram algumas boas lambidas durante a nossa última luta."
G["I have to go now."]="Agora me tenho que ir."
G["I have to go. You stay and kill more of these ugly mongrels."]="I have to go. You stay and kill more of these ugly mongrels."
G["I have to make the water not cloudy anymore. Will... will you help?"]="I have to make the water not cloudy anymore. Will... will you help?"
G["I have to report back. Thank you, $c!"]="Devo voltar a informar. Obrigado, $c!"
G["I have to say, $n, your garden looks great! Of course, I have been weeding all day..."]="I have to say, $n, your garden looks great! Of course, I have been weeding all day..."
G["I have to take some of these flowers back home!"]="Tenho que me levar algumas de estas flores a casa!"
G["I have to tell you, I love it when a plan comes together."]="I have to tell you, I love it when a plan comes together."
G["I have told you to call me Thrall."]="Te e dito que me lhames Thrall."
G["I have top men and women on it even as we speak, sir!"]="I have top men and women on it even as we speak, sir!"
G["I have toyed with you long enough!"]="Basta já de jogos!"
G["I have tracked the various fragments of the staff across this world and in doing so, discovered Kel'Thuzad's plans to reform the staff. He has already collected several of the staff's fragments - which are being held by his most trusted lieutenants.\n\nI cannot emphasize enough the importance of keeping the greatstaff of the Guardian out of Kel'Thuzad's grasp. Frankly, I do not know what the result would be, other than a catastrophe of epic proportion."]="I have tracked the various fragments of the staff across this world and in doing so, discovered Kel'Thuzad's plans to reform the staff. He has already collected several of the staff's fragments - which are being held by his most trusted lieutenants.\n\nI cannot emphasize enough the importance of keeping the greatstaff of the Guardian out of Kel'Thuzad's grasp. Frankly, I do not know what the result would be, other than a catastrophe of epic proportion."
G["I have trained hundreds of young warriors. The Warchief sheds their blood recklessly. He is no longer MY Warchief."]="I have trained hundreds of young warriors. The Warchief sheds their blood recklessly. He is no longer MY Warchief."
G["I have trained my entire life for this."]="I have trained my entire life for this."
G["I have traveled countless worlds, but I have never seen as enjoyable a celebration as this feast of Winter Veil. You should travel to Ironforge, the dwarves' great city, to see it for yourself."]="Viajei por mundos incontáveis, mas nunca vi uma celebração tão agradável quanto esta festa do Véu de Inverno. Você deve viajar para Ironforge, a grande cidade dos anões, para ver por si mesmo."
G["I have traveled far in search of a way to ultimately defeat the League of Arathor in Arathi Basin, but that loin-clothed lummox Adam Eternum hounds my every move.\n\n\nStill, if slayers such as you were to return to Azeroth, perhaps we could defeat the Alliance once and for all!"]="I have traveled far in search of a way to ultimately defeat the League of Arathor in Arathi Basin, but that loin-clothed lummox Adam Eternum hounds my every move.\n\n\nStill, if slayers such as you were to return to Azeroth, perhaps we could defeat the Alliance once and for all!"
G["I have tried everything to remove this cave-in!  Black Ox give me fortitude, I cannot move even a single rock. Perhaps if I were to borrow one of the great weapons of legend from the temple grounds..."]="I have tried everything to remove this cave-in!  Black Ox give me fortitude, I cannot move even a single rock. Perhaps if I were to borrow one of the great weapons of legend from the temple grounds..."
G["I have tried to be an accommodating host, but you simply will not die! Time to throw all pretense aside and just... KILL YOU ALL!"]="I have tried to be an accommodating host, but you simply will not die! Time to throw all pretense aside and just... KILL YOU ALL!"
G["I have tried to speak to their chief, but he does not want to see me. It appears I am not \"high status\" enough. Apparently he's never seen an Admiral."]="E tentou falar com o seu chefe, mas não quer me ver. Parece ser que meu grau não é \"o suficiente alto\". pelo visto, nunca tem recebido a um almirante."
G["I have triumphed this day."]="Hoje é a aurora do meu triunfo."
G["I have use for you..."]="Sei que fazer com você..."
G["I have ventured to dark places and learned the tailoring recipe for the Deathchill Cloak.\n\nThis cloak is a tradeable Epic cloak for spellcasters that grants Spellpower, Haste and Critical Strike.   I am looking for someone worthy to teach this recipe to.\n\nSomeone who had completed most of the quests across Northrend and had the \"Loremaster of Northrend\" achievement would be worthy of learning the recipe for the Deathchill Cloak."]="I have ventured to dark places and learned the tailoring recipe for the Deathchill Cloak.\n\nThis cloak is a tradeable Epic cloak for spellcasters that grants Spellpower, Haste and Critical Strike.   I am looking for someone worthy to teach this recipe to.\n\nSomeone who had completed most of the quests across Northrend and had the \"Loremaster of Northrend\" achievement would be worthy of learning the recipe for the Deathchill Cloak."
G["I have vital information for Fizzcrank. Out of the way!"]="Tenho informações vital para Palanqueta! Fora de meu caminho!"
G["I have waited a long time for this day. Let us face one another in the Challenger's Ring."]="Levo muito tempo esperando este dia. Enfrentémonos no Círculo do Oponente."
G["I have waited long enough!"]="Já e esperado suficiente!"
G["I have waited long enough. Now you face the harvester of souls."]="I have waited long enough. Now you face the harvester of souls."
G["I have weathered a hundred years of war and suffering. Do you truly think it wise to pit your mortal body against a being that cannot die? I'd venture you have more to lose."]="I have weathered a hundred years of war and suffering. Do you truly think it wise to pit your mortal body against a being that cannot die? I'd venture you have more to lose."
G["I have what you need, $c."]="Tenho o que precisa, $c."
G["I have whipped the Blight Geists into shape!"]="Eu coloquei os Blist Geists em forma!"
G["I have witnessed the rise and fall of empires... the birth and extinction of entire species... Over countless millennia the foolishness of mortals has remained the only constant. Your presence here confirms this."]="I have witnessed the rise and fall of empires... the birth and extinction of entire species... Over countless millennia the foolishness of mortals has remained the only constant. Your presence here confirms this."
G["I have witnessed your magnificent operation, Drakuru. When do we put your plan into effect?"]="Eu testemunhei sua magnífica operação, Drakuru. Quando colocamos seu plano em prática?"
G["I have witnessed your magnificent operation, Drakuru. When do we put your plan into effect??"]="I have witnessed your magnificent operation, Drakuru. When do we put your plan into effect??"
G["I have won.  Better luck another time, friend."]="E ganhou. Mais sorte a próxima vez."
G["I have written many powerful words in my time, but still, the most powerful is hidden to me."]="E escrito muitas palavras convincentes nos meus dias, mas, ainda assim, a mais convincente escapa a meu entendimento."
G["I have you to thank for my life. I will return to my comrades and spread word of your bravery. Fight the Scourge with all the strength you can muster, and we will be by your side."]="I have you to thank for my life. I will return to my comrades and spread word of your bravery. Fight the Scourge with all the strength you can muster, and we will be by your side."
G["I have your back, Tholo!"]="Te cuido as costas, Tholo!"
G["I have your dolly! Nyah nyah!"]="Tenho seu munheca! Chínchate!"
G["I have your gorilla! Nyah nyah!"]="Tenho seu gorila! Juas, juas!"
G["I have... failed the Horde... as Warchief...\n\nGarrosh... will lead it to ruin...\n\nMy people... to ruin. Cairne, my brother... why did I not listen?"]="E... falhado à Horda... como Chefe de Guerra...\n\nGarrosh... os levará à destruição...\n\nMeu gente... à fracasso. Caerne, irmão meu... Por que não te escuché?"
G["I have... failed..."]="E... falhado."
G["I haven't bathed in sixteen days. It's easier to blend in this way."]="I haven't bathed in sixteen days. It's easier to blend in this way."
G["I haven't been able to eat or sleep since I got here.\n\nI'm just not cut out for the Crusade...."]="Desde que cheguei aqui não e conseguido pegar olho nem comer.\n\nNão estou feito para a Cruzada..."
G["I haven't been paid since I got here! I'm through with this place!"]="Não me têm pagado desde que cheguei! Me vou deste lugar!"
G["I haven't come to be stopped by the likes of you."]="I haven't come to be stopped by the likes of you."
G["I haven't done anything!"]="Não fiz nada!"
G["I haven't earned my wings yet, but neither have my pets!"]="I haven't earned my wings yet, but neither have my pets!"
G["I haven't eaten in weeks; this bread is mine!  FOR THE SANDWICH!"]="I haven't eaten in weeks; this bread is mine!  FOR THE SANDWICH!"
G["I haven't felt this bad since I tried to eat some Dragon's Breath Chili."]="I haven't felt this bad since I tried to eat some Dragon's Breath Chili."
G["I haven't got any money!  Get away!"]="Não tenho dinheiro! Lárgate!"
G["I haven't got anymore work for you, $n. I do want you to know that the red snapper we shared was something special that I'll never forget..."]="Não tenho mais trabalho para você, $n. Quero que saiba que o pargo vermelho que compartimos foi algo especial que nunca esquecerei..."
G["I haven't heard a thing. I swear!"]="Não ouvi nada, o juro!"
G["I haven't much time to talk unless it's urgent, citizen. The gates of Theramore are my greatest responsibility."]="Não tenho muito tempo para conversar, a menos que seja urgente, cidadão. Os portões de Theramore são minha maior responsabilidade."
G["I haven't really figured out what it is, but there's something strange about the hot springs..."]="I haven't really figured out what it is, but there's something strange about the hot springs..."
G["I haven't seen Tweets in a while, I hope she's ok!"]="Há tempo que não vejo a Pía, espero que estiver bem."
G["I haven't seen a match like that in days!"]="I haven't seen a match like that in days!"
G["I haven't seen a thing. Now stop bothering me about Twilight's Hammer and let me get back to my tan."]="I haven't seen a thing. Now stop bothering me about Twilight's Hammer and let me get back to my tan."
G["I haven't seen any Shado-Pan lately."]="I haven't seen any Shado-Pan lately."
G["I haven't seen any of the sleeping druids. They must have been taken from here already."]="Eu não vi nenhum dos druidas adormecidos. Eles já devem ter sido tirados daqui."
G["I haven't seen fightin' like that since, well, I guess I haven't ever seen fightin' like that. You sure are a firecracker, $n."]="Não vi um estilo de luta como esse desde... bom, nunca vi um estilo de luta como esse. É tudo um espectáculo, $n."
G["I haven't seen me brothers in ages."]="I haven't seen me brothers in ages."
G["I haven't seen such a buildup of forces since the Third War! Varian is dead set on addressing the Scourge threat directly. That's just like him....\n\nAre you heading to Northrend? I have never been there, but I hear it is both a beautiful and treacherous land. Sadly, urgent matters at home require my attention, so I will not be able to join Highlord Fordragon and his army on their journey."]="I haven't seen such a buildup of forces since the Third War! Varian is dead set on addressing the Scourge threat directly. That's just like him....\n\nAre you heading to Northrend? I have never been there, but I hear it is both a beautiful and treacherous land. Sadly, urgent matters at home require my attention, so I will not be able to join Highlord Fordragon and his army on their journey."
G["I haven't the foggiest notion what you're talking about, Miss Greely."]="Não tenho nem a mais mínimo ideia do que está dizendo, senhorita Greely."
G["I haven't time for idle chatter, $c. I must see to the pilgrims and ensure they are prepared for the long journey ahead."]="Não tenho tempo para cháchara, $c. Devo cuidar dos peregrinos e garantir de que estão preparados para o largo viagem que há por linha de frente."
G["I haven't worked moonsteel in years, but it's not the kind of thing you forget. Apprentices, it's time to show you how to work real metal!"]="I haven't worked moonsteel in years, but it's not the kind of thing you forget. Apprentices, it's time to show you how to work real metal!"
G["I heal ya up bruddas.  You be ready for anothuh battle soon."]="I heal ya up bruddas.  You be ready for anothuh battle soon."
G["I hear Bertelm's been collecting fur for his latest creation. He told you it's going to be a cloak, right?\n\nIt isn't. That's just the cover he's using to keep his wolf fur hatband a secret. He wouldn't put all that work into collecting the fur just to soil it in battle!"]="I hear Bertelm's been collecting fur for his latest creation. He told you it's going to be a cloak, right?\n\nIt isn't. That's just the cover he's using to keep his wolf fur hatband a secret. He wouldn't put all that work into collecting the fur just to soil it in battle!"
G["I hear I have you to thank for helping to cure me. Thank you. Truly."]="Ouvi dizer que tenho que agradecer por ajudar a me curar. Obrigado. Verdadeiramente."
G["I hear Pit Lords are born from maggots, Brutallus!"]="I hear Pit Lords are born from maggots, Brutallus!"
G["I hear a faint humming. It is coming from this direction!"]="Oigo um zumbido distante. Vem desta direção!"
G["I hear a great Dragonmaw medicine man lives here, in the large hut to our right."]="Ouvi que um grande auxiliador Faucedraco vive aqui, na grande cabanha a nossa direita."
G["I hear and obey, master..."]="I hear and obey, master..."
G["I hear footsteps. Be on your guard."]="I hear footsteps. Be on your guard."
G["I hear little hearts beating. Yes... beating faster now... soon the beating will stop."]="I hear little hearts beating. Yes... beating faster now... soon the beating will stop."
G["I hear on the wind that you have helped my great great grand-daughter Ji achieve her dream of becoming a brewmaster.\n\nI am quite proud of her and very thankful to you for your aid.  You have helped put my family name back on the right track."]="I hear on the wind that you have helped my great great grand-daughter Ji achieve her dream of becoming a brewmaster.\n\nI am quite proud of her and very thankful to you for your aid.  You have helped put my family name back on the right track."
G["I hear one comment about waterfowl, and you will be eating through a tube."]="Ouvi um comentário sobre aves aquáticas e você vai comer através de um tubo."
G["I hear our new allies will be joining us here. Fighting alongside elves... Just like old times."]="I hear our new allies will be joining us here. Fighting alongside elves... Just like old times."
G["I hear saurok taste like chicken. Let's find out."]="I hear saurok taste like chicken. Let's find out."
G["I hear something..."]="I hear something..."
G["I hear strange orcs whispering all the time inside the south zeppelin tower. They always shut up whenever I get near."]="Eu ouço orcs estranhos sussurrando o tempo tudo dentro da torre sul do zepelim. Eles sempre calam a boca sempre que eu chego perto."
G["I hear that Blackmoore has been acting strange."]="Ouvi que Lodonegro tem estado actuando de uma forma estranha."
G["I hear that the Shado-Pan are preparing to assault the Isle of Thunder to the northwest. They will need plenty of food, and we're the ones to supply it!"]="I hear that the Shado-Pan are preparing to assault the Isle of Thunder to the northwest. They will need plenty of food, and we're the ones to supply it!"
G["I hear that the trolls in Sen'jin Village have a potion maker named Miao'zan.  Look there."]="Ouvi dizer que os trolls na vila de Sen'jin têm um criador de poções chamado Miao'zan. Olhe ali."
G["I hear that the yaungol busted through the gates up north. Wonder what happened to the Shado-Pan there?"]="I hear that the yaungol busted through the gates up north. Wonder what happened to the Shado-Pan there?"
G["I hear that they have a Mining Trainer in Thunder Bluff to the north.  Take the road out of the village and when you get there ride the elevator to the top of the rise.  Any of the Bluffwatchers should be able to help you from there."]="Ouvi dizer que eles têm um instrutor de mineração em Thunder Bluff, ao norte. Pegue a estrada para fosse da vila e, quando chegar lá, pegue o elevador até o topo da subida. Qualquer um dos Bluffwatchers deve ser capaz de ajudá-o a partir daí."
G["I hear that they have a Mining Trainer in the Undercity.  All you have to do to get there is head south out of town and go to the back of the Ruins of Lordaeron.  Then take the elevator down into the Undercity itself and ask an Undercity Guardian for further directions."]="Ouvi dizer que eles têm um instrutor de mineração na cidade. Tudo o que você precisa fazer para chegar lá é ir para o sul da cidade e voltar para as ruínas de Lordaeron. Em seguida, pegue o elevador até a própria cidade e peça a um guardião da cidade para obter mais instruções."
G["I hear that with fire and force you shape metals for war. I can achieve this through the pressures of water and a mastery of their densities."]="I hear that with fire and force you shape metals for war. I can achieve this through the pressures of water and a mastery of their densities."
G["I hear that you sell Ancona chickens?"]="É verdade que vender frangos de Ancona?"
G["I hear that you've already begun to pull your weight around here.\n\nGood.  I was worried that we were going to have to 'convince' you to help out."]="I hear that you've already begun to pull your weight around here.\n\nGood.  I was worried that we were going to have to 'convince' you to help out."
G["I hear the \"but\" in your voice..."]="Posso escutar um \"mas\" no seu voz..."
G["I hear the adults whispering all the time."]="I hear the adults whispering all the time."
G["I hear the hozen and jinyu have been increasing their skirmishes. Those poor little creatures will destroy each other if they aren't careful. It is quite a vicious cycle they are trapped in."]="I hear the hozen and jinyu have been increasing their skirmishes. Those poor little creatures will destroy each other if they aren't careful. It is quite a vicious cycle they are trapped in."
G["I hear the rock flayer has been sucking down unstable energy since its capture."]="I hear the rock flayer has been sucking down unstable energy since its capture."
G["I hear the voices!"]="Oigo as vozes!"
G["I hear them, $r. Allow me to translate..."]="Os oigo, $r. Permíteme que traduzca..."
G["I hear there are great wars being fought in Outland. I wonder if there's any rooftops up there that need fixing..."]="I hear there are great wars being fought in Outland. I wonder if there's any rooftops up there that need fixing..."
G["I hear there's a shop up in Ironforge run by the gnomes that specializes in alchemy.  You should go have a look."]="Ouvi dizer que há uma loja em Ironforge administrada pelos gnomos especializados em alquimia. Você deveria dar uma olhada."
G["I hear they're sacrificing prisoners up at their ritual grounds. I think the place is called Gjalerbron..."]="I hear they're sacrificing prisoners up at their ritual grounds. I think the place is called Gjalerbron..."
G["I hear things... Things that should not be."]="Oigo coisas... Coisas que não devem ser."
G["I hear those lances are rough-hewn, too. I'm no fan of splinters."]="I hear those lances are rough-hewn, too. I'm no fan of splinters."
G["I hear wedding bells in your future."]="Vejo campanas de boda no seu futuro."
G["I hear what both of you are saying and am grateful for the counsel."]="I hear what both of you are saying and am grateful for the counsel."
G["I hear what you are saying, Mavren. Nevertheless, the final decision is mine. I appreciate your assistance, but the majority of the lives on the line are blood elf. I will not have those lives carelessly thrown away!"]="I hear what you are saying, Mavren. Nevertheless, the final decision is mine. I appreciate your assistance, but the majority of the lives on the line are blood elf. I will not have those lives carelessly thrown away!"
G["I hear what you hear, brother. Look behind you..."]="Oigo o mesmo que você, irmão. Olhe atrás de ti..."
G["I hear whispers though... whispers of confusion... perhaps even whispers of dissent."]="I hear whispers though... whispers of confusion... perhaps even whispers of dissent."
G["I hear ya blood flow."]="Posso ouvir como fluye seu sangue."
G["I hear you are responsible for saving one of my youngest descendants from the clutches of the Jade Witch.  I thank you for your heroism."]="I hear you are responsible for saving one of my youngest descendants from the clutches of the Jade Witch.  I thank you for your heroism."
G["I hear you are the reason my cousin Syra is sending me wedding invitations.\n\nThanks a lot. Now I have to be the unmarried black yak of the family."]="I hear you are the reason my cousin Syra is sending me wedding invitations.\n\nThanks a lot. Now I have to be the unmarried black yak of the family."
G["I hear you fly without a parachute cloak, $n."]="I hear you fly without a parachute cloak, $n."
G["I hear you sell motorcycle parts."]="Assim que vender peças de motocicletas..."
G["I hear you! I can't get a moments peace without Sarah complaining about the chores!"]="Já te digo! Não posso descansar nem um momento sem que Sarah se queje das tarefas domésticas!"
G["I hear you're looking for Keg Protector marks.  What are those?"]="Ouvi que atenção marcas de protetor de barris. Que são?"
G["I hear you're quite the cook."]="Ouvi dizer que você é a cozinheira."
G["I hear you've got some drinks I can buy, Slim."]="Ouvi que tem bebidas O que posso comprar, Delgado."
G["I hear you, Hilda. Mogu mixin' up with sha? I don't like that one bit! We'd better bring this evidence back to the King. $n, thanks fer yer help today, but we'll take it from here!"]="I hear you, Hilda. Mogu mixin' up with sha? I don't like that one bit! We'd better bring this evidence back to the King. $n, thanks fer yer help today, but we'll take it from here!"
G["I hear your kind squeals like a felhunter when roasted alive over a fire."]="I hear your kind squeals like a felhunter when roasted alive over a fire."
G["I hear, Garrosh is goin' to torture that mogu prisoner until he talks."]="Eu ouça ke Garrosh vai torturar ao prisioneiro mogu até ke hable."
G["I heard Azeroth needed saving. May I lend a hand?"]="Ouvi que Azeroth precisa ser salvou. Posso dar uma mão?"
G["I heard Lord Xavius left today for his tower in Ashenvale."]="Ouvi que Lorde Xavius tem partido já cima seu torre em Valhefresno."
G["I heard Tortolla was being held here, so I came over as quickly as I could.\n\nMount Hyjal is really tall."]="Oí que Tortolha estava retenido aqui, assim que e vindo o mais rápido que e pedido.\n\nO Monte Hyjal é muito alto."
G["I heard a rumor that we're all going to go watch the battle with the Scourge at the border tonight.  How delightfully wicked!"]="Ouvi um boato de que todos nós vamos assistir a batalha com o Flagelo na fronteira hoje à noite. Quão deliciosamente perverso!"
G["I heard a story about this golden fish, and if you caught it you would get three wishes!"]="I heard a story about this golden fish, and if you caught it you would get three wishes!"
G["I heard a story or two of a Lore Keeper in Uldaman that fit your description. Do you serve a similar purpose?"]="E ouvi alguma história sobre um tradicionapronta em Uldaman que se ajusta ao seu descrição. Cumples um cometido similar?"
G["I heard all kinds of stories about what lay behind the gate. I never imagined it would be something like this."]="Ouvi tudo tipo de histórias sobre o que se oculta atrás as portões. Nunca imaginé que seria algo assim."
G["I heard all the kobolds that were down there are dead."]="Ouvi que todos os kobolds que estavam aí baixo estão mortos."
G["I heard everything, $n. Go ahead to the camp and I'll meet you there."]="I heard everything, $n. Go ahead to the camp and I'll meet you there."
G["I heard from the others... you need a kite to the wall?"]="Conforme me têm dito... precisa uma cometa para chegar à muralha?"
G["I heard her say it meself - that Dalaran would be a shining example of peace 'tween Alliance an' Horde fer the rest o' the world."]="Se o ouvi dizer eu mesma: que Dalaran seria um grande exemplo de paz entre Aliança e Horda para o resto do mundo."
G["I heard last night's performance was spectacular!"]="I heard last night's performance was spectacular!"
G["I heard of what you did in Orsis.  I will be honored to fight along your side."]="Me têm contado o que fez em Orsis. Será uma honra lutar ao seu lado."
G["I heard one of the boys say he wished he could live in a tree. I want to live in a tree too!"]="Ouvi que os pessoal dizem que lhes gostaria viver em um árvore. Eu também quero viver em um árvore!"
G["I heard she's the strongest woman in the world!"]="Ouvi que é a mulher mais forte do mundo!"
G["I heard shouting through the pipes - what's happening?"]="Ouvi gritos... que está passando?"
G["I heard some hero from a far away land convinced Xuen, the tiger god, to open the Vale. Maybe I'll see them someday."]="I heard some hero from a far away land convinced Xuen, the tiger god, to open the Vale. Maybe I'll see them someday."
G["I heard some of the earth spirits are unhappy with the Greenstone Quarry. I hope they don't take it out on us."]="I heard some of the earth spirits are unhappy with the Greenstone Quarry. I hope they don't take it out on us."
G["I heard some pretty elfs got slap-slapped up at Mogujia."]="I heard some pretty elfs got slap-slapped up at Mogujia."
G["I heard somethin' about a bell, made by those crazy mogu... thousands of years ago. Jimeny wikkets!"]="I heard somethin' about a bell, made by those crazy mogu... thousands of years ago. Jimeny wikkets!"
G["I heard something over there."]="Eu ouvi algo por ali."
G["I heard that $n comes from a far off land beyond the mists. $G He : She; must be their $g hero : heroine; to have come all this way to save us."]="I heard that $n comes from a far off land beyond the mists. $G He : She; must be their $g hero : heroine; to have come all this way to save us."
G["I heard that $n is gunning to be the captain of the air group."]="Ouvi que $n tenta chegar a capitão do grupo aéreo."
G["I heard that Commander Rell and the others found Amber! That is good news."]="Ouvi que o comandante Relh e os mais têm encontrado a Amber! É uma notícia fantástica."
G["I heard that Gott Weedlespan fired his last assistant...by pushing him off a cliff! Best not to get on his bad side."]="I heard that Gott Weedlespan fired his last assistant...by pushing him off a cliff! Best not to get on his bad side."
G["I heard that Kolphis Darkscale has been looking for you."]="Ouvi dizer que Kolphis Darkscale estava procurando por você."
G["I heard that Lady Jaina's still in shock about what happened."]="Ouvi que Lady Jaina ainda está em estado de shock pelo acontecido."
G["I heard that a noble among the water elementals, Hydraxis, wages war with the servants of fire.  Let's hope he loses!"]="Ouvi dizer que um nobre entre os elementais da água, Hydraxis, faz guerra com os servos do fogo. Vamos torcer para que ele perca!"
G["I heard that if you can breathe fire, then you are part dragon!"]="Ouvi que se você pode respirar fogo, então tem uma parte de dragão!"
G["I heard that some Southsea pirates pulled into dock earlier. Be careful if you go into town!\n\nThey even have women pirates! Hmm, maybe I should go check it out myself? Just to make sure it's safe for you out there, baby."]="I heard that some Southsea pirates pulled into dock earlier. Be careful if you go into town!\n\nThey even have women pirates! Hmm, maybe I should go check it out myself? Just to make sure it's safe for you out there, baby."
G["I heard that the Horde's learned of an ancient mogu artifact... somethin' called the Divine Bell."]="Ouvi que a Horda está procurando um antigo artefato mogu, a Sino divina."
G["I heard that the Lich King  is stirring up north, in the Frozen Wastes.  He built a fortress, Icecrown, and plans our doom."]="I heard that the Lich King  is stirring up north, in the Frozen Wastes.  He built a fortress, Icecrown, and plans our doom."
G["I heard that the Shado-Pan were having trouble to the southwest. Know anything about that, $n?"]="I heard that the Shado-Pan were having trouble to the southwest. Know anything about that, $n?"
G["I heard that the king is found!  He's returning to Stormwind!"]="Ouvi que têm encontrado ao rei! Volta a Ventobravo!"
G["I heard that there are these huge fish that can walk on land to hunt, and eat people!"]="I heard that there are these huge fish that can walk on land to hunt, and eat people!"
G["I heard that this place has great noodle soup."]="Ouvi que aqui sirven uma sopa de macarrão deliciosa."
G["I heard that your dog Fei Fei took Klatu's prayer beads..."]="Ouvi dizer que seu filhote Fei Fei pegou as contas de oração de Klatu..."
G["I heard that, after the fireworks show, goblets will be brought to the tables.  Fine toasts we shall raise!"]="Ouvi dizer que, depois do show de fogos de artifício, os cálices serão trazidos para as mesas. Brindes finos vamos levantar!"
G["I heard the Burlap Outpost got destroyed by hozen."]="I heard the Burlap Outpost got destroyed by hozen."
G["I heard the Horde is amassing its own army to head to Northrend. HOPEFULLY your Alliance and the Horde can focus their aggression on the real threat. You know, instead of each other?\n\nSomehow I think that's unlikely to happen, if my experience here is any indication. Your people have been SO welcoming to me.\n\n<Valeera mutters angrily to herself.>"]="I heard the Horde is amassing its own army to head to Northrend. HOPEFULLY your Alliance and the Horde can focus their aggression on the real threat. You know, instead of each other?\n\nSomehow I think that's unlikely to happen, if my experience here is any indication. Your people have been SO welcoming to me.\n\n<Valeera mutters angrily to herself.>"
G["I heard the King is going to force us to fight each other. Not that it will take much for that to happen."]="Ouvi que o Rei nos vai fazer lutar uns contra outros. Certo que passava de todos modos."
G["I heard the Tauren have cousins in Northrend.  I hope they're good hunters... I hope they hunt undead."]="I heard the Tauren have cousins in Northrend.  I hope they're good hunters... I hope they hunt undead."
G["I heard the Wrestler never ever takes his mask off. I wonder what he does if his nose gets itchy."]="Ouvi que O Lutador nunca se quita a máscara. Que será o que faça quando lhe pique a nariz...?"
G["I heard the crocs are attacking because of an ancient mogu curse."]="Ouvi que os crocoliscos estão atacando devido a uma antiga maldição mogu."
G["I heard the forgemaster keeps notes about his meetings  in a book at the tower overlooking the camp."]="Ouvi que o mestre de forja guarda as notas dos seus reuniones em um livro na torre que se ergue sobre o acampamento."
G["I heard the mines are infested with spiders again. I really hope no one gets hurt."]="I heard the mines are infested with spiders again. I really hope no one gets hurt."
G["I heard the new Henweigh 6000 will be rolling off the assembly line soon. I can barely contain my excitement!"]="Ouvi dizer que o novo Henweigh 6000 estará saindo da linha de montagem em breve. Eu mal posso conter minha excitação!"
G["I heard the reclaimer's threat, but it was faint... Fleeting, like trying to recall the details of a dream.\n\nIt seems I'm in your debt once again."]="E ouvi a ameaça do reivindicador, mas me parecido muito fraco... Distante, como os detalhes de um sonho.\n\nParece que estou em dívida com você novamente."
G["I heard the yaungol have taken over most of the farmlands in the south."]="Ouvi que os yaungol têm ocupado a maioria dos campos de cultivo do sul."
G["I heard the yaungol made it through the Pandaren Wall."]="I heard the yaungol made it through the Pandaren Wall."
G["I heard their mocking laughter as my gryphon crashed and burned, $c.\n\n\"Slidore, you stink!\" They shouted.\n\nNobody talks to Slidore that way! Help me get out of here so that I can show them who the real stinker is!"]="I heard their mocking laughter as my gryphon crashed and burned, $c.\n\n\"Slidore, you stink!\" They shouted.\n\nNobody talks to Slidore that way! Help me get out of here so that I can show them who the real stinker is!"
G["I heard them praying to their dark gods as everything went black... the Twilight's Hammer did this!"]="I heard them praying to their dark gods as everything went black... the Twilight's Hammer did this!"
G["I heard there are still orcs buried underneath it."]="I heard there are still orcs buried underneath it."
G["I heard they discovered the lost secret of the Lin family's secret ingredient noodle soup."]="Ouvi que já têm descoberto o mítico ingrediente da sopa de macarrão do ingrediente segredo da família Lin."
G["I heard they were going to try to blow up the gnome's car in the next race!  True or not, I'd stand clear of their pit area."]="Ouvi dizer que eles tentariam explodir o carro do gnomo na próxima corrida! Verdadeiro ou não, eu ficaria longe da área dos boxes."
G["I heard this game is pretty easy."]="Ouvi que este jogo é bastante fácil."
G["I heard ya comin' a league away, mon. Maybe ya need some more trainin'?"]="Ouvi dizer que você está indo embora, mon. Talvez você precise de mais treinamento?"
G["I heard you found somethin'... or someone. You caught one o' those mogu, didn't you?"]="Eu ouça ke você encontre algo... ou a alguém. Você pegue a um mogu, a que si?"
G["I heard you was dead... well, you won't be easy to make dead after this!"]="Ouvi dizer que você estava morto... bem, você não será fácil de morrer depois disso!"
G["I heard you went to Darnassus and got the Divine Bell."]="I heard you went to Darnassus and got the Divine Bell."
G["I heard you were in town.  What a strange creature you are.\n\nYou wish to speak to me?"]="I heard you were in town.  What a strange creature you are.\n\nYou wish to speak to me?"
G["I hereby destroy these instruments of evil! For the Horde!"]="Mediante este acto destruyo estes instrumentos do mal! pela Horda!"
G["I highly recommend that you visit Sayge to get your fortune told.\n\nI know, I know... he's a gnoll.  But he's a very special gnoll with the power to divine your future!"]="I highly recommend that you visit Sayge to get your fortune told.\n\nI know, I know... he's a gnoll.  But he's a very special gnoll with the power to divine your future!"
G["I highly recommend that you visit Sayge to get your fortune told. I know, I know... he's a gnoll.  But he's a very special gnoll with the power to divine your future!\n\nAnd we are constantly expanding the faire with all manner of new attractions!"]="I highly recommend that you visit Sayge to get your fortune told. I know, I know... he's a gnoll.  But he's a very special gnoll with the power to divine your future!\n\nAnd we are constantly expanding the faire with all manner of new attractions!"
G["I hired Galana specifically to deal with rudimentary training. Go speak with her. This shop is meant to be run efficiently and effectively, and I expect everyone - including the patrons - to respect it."]="I hired Galana specifically to deal with rudimentary training. Go speak with her. This shop is meant to be run efficiently and effectively, and I expect everyone - including the patrons - to respect it."
G["I hold some of the emperor's most prized possessions. Should you wish to curry favor with Shaohao, you may aid us by driving back the Ordon yaungol that seek to overtake the Celestial Court."]="I hold some of the emperor's most prized possessions. Should you wish to curry favor with Shaohao, you may aid us by driving back the Ordon yaungol that seek to overtake the Celestial Court."
G["I hold the key to lands of free! Chase me and you'll see!"]="Eu certo a chave para terras de graça! Me persiga e você verá!"
G["I hold the vessel of his rebirth. Should you be prepared to take on this task, you will be required to fortify the vessel and ultimately, break the hold of Ragnaros himself!"]="Eu certo o vaso do seu renascimento. Se você estiver pronto para assumir essa tarefa, precisará fortalecer o navio e, finalmente, quebrar o domínio de Ragnaros!"
G["I honestly don't know how I am going to round up so many yaks on my own. Those yaungol are dangerous."]="I honestly don't know how I am going to round up so many yaks on my own. Those yaungol are dangerous."
G["I honor my ancestors in the time-honored shamanistic tradition.  We must never forget the sacrifices that they have made so that we can be here.\n\nAnd we, in turn, must make the necessary sacrifices so that our descendants will have a future.\n\nWhat brings you to me, $c?"]="I honor my ancestors in the time-honored shamanistic tradition.  We must never forget the sacrifices that they have made so that we can be here.\n\nAnd we, in turn, must make the necessary sacrifices so that our descendants will have a future.\n\nWhat brings you to me, $c?"
G["I hope Anduin's got some plan up his sleeve."]="Espero que Anduin tenha um as na manga."
G["I hope I don't chip my nails..."]="I hope I don't chip my nails..."
G["I hope I don't run out of bandages!"]="I hope I don't run out of bandages!"
G["I hope I find him."]="I hope I find him."
G["I hope I have a chance to visit with Greatfather Winter before Winter Veil is over."]="Espero ter a oportunidade de ver ao Grande Para Inverno antes de que termine o Festival de Inverno."
G["I hope I see you again, friend."]="Eu espera voltar a ver você, kolega."
G["I hope I'm alive to see Arthas get what's coming to him."]="Espero viver para ver como Arthas recebe seu merecido."
G["I hope Jones is okay."]="Espero que Jones estiver bem."
G["I hope Jones makes it back okay."]="Espero que Jones fique saudável e salvou."
G["I hope Ogron finds that pinkskin and breaks his legs. See how he survives in the marsh like that!"]="I hope Ogron finds that pinkskin and breaks his legs. See how he survives in the marsh like that!"
G["I hope a dragon eats you!"]="Tomara que um dragão coma você!"
G["I hope it helps. These vile beasts simply must be stopped!"]="Espero que te sirva de ajuda. É necessário parar a essas infames beast!"
G["I hope my friends are ok..."]="Espero que meus amigos estejam bem..."
G["I hope my people have been welcoming to you. These are burdened times, so I fear much may be competing with their good graces."]="I hope my people have been welcoming to you. These are burdened times, so I fear much may be competing with their good graces."
G["I hope now you understand the limits of strength without vision. It is one thing to change the world, but quite another to do what is right."]="I hope now you understand the limits of strength without vision. It is one thing to change the world, but quite another to do what is right."
G["I hope one of us dies. I hope that one is you, Skrotee."]="I hope one of us dies. I hope that one is you, Skrotee."
G["I hope our paths cross again, $n! Until then, may your journey be safe and meaningful."]="I hope our paths cross again, $n! Until then, may your journey be safe and meaningful."
G["I hope so, Yalia."]="Isso espero, Yalia."
G["I hope that Jheel will be able to come back to the orphanage soon."]="Espero que Jheel possa voltar ao orfanato pronto."
G["I hope that Loralthalis is alright, $c. Maybe I should go up to Duskwither Spire myself? Maybe I should have done that in the first place?"]="I hope that Loralthalis is alright, $c. Maybe I should go up to Duskwither Spire myself? Maybe I should have done that in the first place?"
G["I hope that my brother's doing okay in Durotar. There's an awful lot of smelly Orcs out there.... Then again, this isn't exactly the greatest gig, either..."]="I hope that my brother's doing okay in Durotar. There's an awful lot of smelly Orcs out there.... Then again, this isn't exactly the greatest gig, either..."
G["I hope that one doesn't have to go through twice."]="Espero que esse não tenha que passar dois vezes."
G["I hope that was a fish!"]="Espero que tenha banido um peixe!"
G["I hope that you are here to go to Alterac Valley $n.  We can use all o' the help that we can get."]="Espero que estiver aqui para ir ao Vale Alterac, $n. Nos virá bem toda a ajuda que possamos conseguir."
G["I hope that you will grace our defense with your trident. The Kvaldir numbers are still increasing."]="Temos a esperança de que te umas a nossas defesas com o seu tridente. Os Kvaldir são cada vez mais numerosos."
G["I hope that you're here to help us take back Arathi Basin from The Defilers.  What do you say $n?"]="Espero que estiver aqui para nos ajudar a reconquistar a Bacia Arathi aos Rapinhadores. Que me diz, $n?"
G["I hope that you're ready for a one-way mission, $n."]="Espero que estiver $gpronto: pronta; para uma missão sem retorno, $n."
G["I hope that your interruption is for a good cause, I was in the middle of some important work."]="Espero que sua interrupção seja por uma boa causa, eu estava no meio de um trabalho importante."
G["I hope the Horde has a place for another mage..."]="Espero que a Horda tenha lugar para outro mago..."
G["I hope the Jade Witch didn't get all of my friends.  She is super spooky."]="Espero que a Bruxa de Jade não atrapara a todos meus amigos. Da um monte de medo."
G["I hope the Light is with you, $n. Is there anything I can do for you today?"]="Espero que a Luz estiver com você, $n. Posso fazer algo por você?"
G["I hope the Ultrasafe Transporter never lets you down!   I just know it won't but I would recommend carrying a parachute cloak just in case!"]="Espero que o Ultrasafe Transporter nunca o decepcione! Só sei que não, mas eu recomendaria carregar uma capa de para-quedas, só por precaução!"
G["I hope the archmage appreciates what I've gone through to uphold Hemet's end of the bargain."]="Espero que o arquimago aprecie o que passei para defender o fim da barganha de Hemet."
G["I hope the charges are set soon. Everyone could use a respite."]="Espero que as cargas estejam colocadas pronto. A tudo o mundo lhe viria bem um respiro."
G["I hope the instructors saw that!"]="Espero que os instrutores o tenham visto!"
G["I hope the mantid come and drag you yaungols back over the wall."]="Yaungol, espero que venham os mantídeos e os arrastren de volta ao outro lado da muralha."
G["I hope the orchard is still intact..."]="I hope the orchard is still intact..."
G["I hope the rings don't hurt the turtle."]="Espero que os anilhos não hieran à tartaruga."
