G["I know a few things. You want me to show you?"]="Eu sei algumas coisas. Você quer que eu te mostre?"
G["I know a place nearby where we can speak in private, my child. Follow me."]="Conheço um lugar próximo no que poderemos falar em privado, $ghijo meu: filha minha;. Siga-me."
G["I know a secret trail through Neverrest. Add three days to any journey, but you see very neat waterfall along way. Most fortunate path."]="I know a secret trail through Neverrest. Add three days to any journey, but you see very neat waterfall along way. Most fortunate path."
G["I know a thing or two about decorating, my good friend. I know just what Farmer Yoon needs for his house!"]="Sei um par de coisas sobre decoração, meu $gbuen amigo: boa amiga;. Sei exatamente o que o fazendeiro Yoon precisa para o seu casa!"
G["I know all about your cult master."]="O sei tudo sobre o mestre do seu secta."
G["I know all is not well in Shadowglen, but coming back to these woods is always like coming back home.\n\nEver peaceful. Ever pure."]="I know all is not well in Shadowglen, but coming back to these woods is always like coming back home.\n\nEver peaceful. Ever pure."
G["I know an ace when I see one.  Thanks again for saving my life!"]="Conheço um ás quando vejo um. Mais uma vez Obrigado por salvar minha vida!"
G["I know dis is prolly busy work, but I don't mind. Dese baby raptors are cute lil devils."]="I know dis is prolly busy work, but I don't mind. Dese baby raptors are cute lil devils."
G["I know exactly what I'll be doin' about it, son of Hellscream.  I'll watch and wait as ya people slowly become aware of ya ineptitude.  I'll laugh as dey grow ta despise ya as I do."]="I know exactly what I'll be doin' about it, son of Hellscream.  I'll watch and wait as ya people slowly become aware of ya ineptitude.  I'll laugh as dey grow ta despise ya as I do."
G["I know how to speak kitty, and Effsee said thank you."]="Entendo o linguagem dos gatos; Effsee te agradece."
G["I know it will be ok, baby."]="Sei que tudo irá bem, carinho."
G["I know it'll work this time..."]="Sei que esta vez funcionará..."
G["I know it'll work this time... My last 13 tries were just practice!"]="Sei que esta vez funcionará... Meus últimos 13 tentativas somente eram de prática!"
G["I know it's too late to save them, but m-maybe you can take out the rest of the attackers..."]="I know it's too late to save them, but m-maybe you can take out the rest of the attackers..."
G["I know just about everyone in these parts. I'll let them know there's a new face in town."]="I know just about everyone in these parts. I'll let them know there's a new face in town."
G["I know just the one that you speak of $c. You must seek out Brogun Stoneshield on the Warrior's Terrace."]="Devo deh'trozaros. ($c)"
G["I know just the place. Will you be all right?"]="Conheço o lugar preciso. Estarão bem?"
G["I know just the soldier for that horse!"]="Conheço ao soldado perfeito para esse cavalo!"
G["I know many things, stranger, but your knowledge rivals my own. Enchanters who wish to hone their skills further are known to travel to the Tower of Azora, where an artisan named Kitta Firewind resides."]="Sei muitas coisas, estranho, mas seu conhecimento rivaliza com o meu. Sabe-se que os encantadores que desejam aprimorar ainda mais suas habilidades viajam para a Torre de Azora, onde reside um artesão chamado Kitta Firewind."
G["I know much, listen and be educated, $r."]="Sei muito. Ouça e aprenda, $r."
G["I know my jokes ain't so good... I lost my funny bone!"]="I know my jokes ain't so good... I lost my funny bone!"
G["I know no death. I will... be back... for you..."]="Não conheço a morte. Voltarei... a por... vocês..."
G["I know not how this was possible, but you must still be judged Iskalder. Wait... what is this?"]="I know not how this was possible, but you must still be judged Iskalder. Wait... what is this?"
G["I know not the extent of their plans, heroes, but I know this:  They cannot be allowed to succeed!"]="Não conheço todos seus planos, heróis, mas sei que não devemos permitir que tenham êxito!"
G["I know not what you are, but I do know that you will die!"]="Não sei que é, mas sei que morrerá!"
G["I know not whether you've come on the call and beckon of your new Dragonmaw allies. Nor do I really care to trust you even if you do not."]="I know not whether you've come on the call and beckon of your new Dragonmaw allies. Nor do I really care to trust you even if you do not."
G["I know now - beyond a shadow of a doubt - that the val'kyr are our future."]="Agora sei, além de toda dúvida, que as Val'kyr são nosso futuro."
G["I know of a druid that lives atop the hill above the Wailing Caverns,$n. She might be able to tell you more about this shard you have found."]="I know of a druid that lives atop the hill above the Wailing Caverns,$n. She might be able to tell you more about this shard you have found."
G["I know of a few people around here that practice a profession or two.  What profession do you have in mind?"]="Conheço algumas pessoas por aqui que praticam uma ou duas profissões. Qual profissão você tem em mente?"
G["I know of a local alchemist. Sheynathren, I believe his name is. When last I saw him, he was heading off to Saltheril's Haven, no doubt to engage in one of his ridiculous parties."]="Conheço um alquimista local. Sheynathren, acredito que o nome dele seja. Quando o vi pela última vez, ele estava indo para Saltheril's Haven, sem dúvida para se envolver em uma das suas festas ridículas."
G["I know of a local alchemist. Sheynathren, I believe his name is. When last I saw him, he was heading off to Sartheril's Haven, no doubt to engage in one of his ridiculous parties."]="Conheço um alquimista local. Sheynathren, acredito que o nome dele seja. Quando o vi pela última vez, ele estava indo para o porto de Sartheril, sem dúvida para se envolver em uma das suas festas ridículas."
G["I know of a saleswoman of trade goods in Summer's Rest. I will mark the location on your map."]="I know of a saleswoman of trade goods in Summer's Rest. I will mark the location on your map."
G["I know our next step. Meet me back atop Mason's Folly - you'll be pleasantly surprised at what I have in store for you!"]="I know our next step. Meet me back atop Mason's Folly - you'll be pleasantly surprised at what I have in store for you!"
G["I know she likes a man who can hold his liquor, so I've been building up my tolerance by getting sloshed every night."]="I know she likes a man who can hold his liquor, so I've been building up my tolerance by getting sloshed every night."
G["I know that I promised you last night, and the night before that, but I'm taking you out someplace really nice tomorrow night!"]="Eu sei que prometi a você ontem à noite, e na noite anterior, mas vou levá-o a um lugar mesmo agradável amanhã à noite!"
G["I know that a terrible enemy pursued him after he won the horn, but I... I don't recall... what happened... next."]="I know that a terrible enemy pursued him after he won the horn, but I... I don't recall... what happened... next."
G["I know that look in your eye... I'm not going to be able to talk you out of this.  If you die on me again..."]="I know that look in your eye... I'm not going to be able to talk you out of this.  If you die on me again..."
G["I know that one of those visiting Woolybush dwarves is an archaeologist.\nI think it's the wife, Faena. They're both explorers of some sort. Look for them in the inn."]="Sei que um dos esses anões Lanudo que têm vindo de visite se dedica à arqueologia.\n\nAcho que é a mulher, Faena. Os dois são batedores ou algo assim. Búscalos na estalagem."
G["I know that you want your vacation, but we still have work to do."]="Sei que que seus vacações, mas ainda restam coisas por fazer."
G["I know the perfect people for such a task. I will send them immediately, priestess."]="I know the perfect people for such a task. I will send them immediately, priestess."
G["I know the troops need food, but this is ridiculous."]="Sei que as tropas necessário comida, mas isto é ridículo."
G["I know the way home. Thanks, $gmister:lady;!"]="Sei como voltar a casa. Obrigado, $gsenhor: senhora;!"
G["I know the way to Deathknell.  Come with me!"]="I know the way to Deathknell.  Come with me!"
G["I know the way, insect. There is no need to prod me as if I were cattle."]="I know the way, insect. There is no need to prod me as if I were cattle."
G["I know there's more of ya, hidin' in your little holes..."]="I know there's more of ya, hidin' in your little holes..."
G["I know these forests as if they were a part of me... but know that there is still much to be learned from them, and much danger still hidden."]="Conheço essas florestas como se fossem uma parte de mim... mas sei que ainda há muito a ser aprendido com elas, e muito perigo ainda está escondido."
G["I know these luckydos."]="Conheço estes grisgrís."
G["I know they funny looking, but less starting, more killing."]="I know they funny looking, but less starting, more killing."
G["I know this does not seem like the obvious path to you, but it will bring you closer to the Light. Fight well, brother."]="I know this does not seem like the obvious path to you, but it will bring you closer to the Light. Fight well, brother."
G["I know this looks grim, but our enemies will pay for what they have done. I'll make sure they do."]="I know this looks grim, but our enemies will pay for what they have done. I'll make sure they do."
G["I know this will seem like betrayal, but Mr. Hastings has made an offer I simply cannot refuse. My apologies, $n."]="I know this will seem like betrayal, but Mr. Hastings has made an offer I simply cannot refuse. My apologies, $n."
G["I know very litte else... The High General chooses who may go and who must stay behind. There's nothing else... You must believe me!"]="I know very litte else... The High General chooses who may go and who must stay behind. There's nothing else... You must believe me!"
G["I know very little of the Highborne and nothing of the Shen'dralar."]="Conheço muito pouco dos Highborne e nada dos Shen'dralar."
G["I know we all look alike to you, but I'm a healer, not a mage."]="Sei que você te parecemos todos iguales, mas sou um curandeiro, não um mago."
G["I know what I said. My trust was misplaced."]="Eu sei o que eu disse. Eu confiei nas pessoas erradas."
G["I know what I'm having for dinner tonight and it rhymes with \"Sucky\"!"]="I know what I'm having for dinner tonight and it rhymes with \"Sucky\"!"
G["I know what evil lies in the hearts of orcs."]="Sei que mal jaz no coração dos orcs."
G["I know what he would do."]="Sei o que faria ele."
G["I know what you mean... they whisper about us when they think we can't hear them. They'll get theirs."]="I know what you mean... they whisper about us when they think we can't hear them. They'll get theirs."
G["I know what you're after. I can sense it!"]="I know what you're after. I can sense it!"
G["I know what you're planning, these Kor'kron will be ready when you strike."]="I know what you're planning, these Kor'kron will be ready when you strike."
G["I know what you're thinking. I can see it in your little $r eyes.\n\n<The pupil smiles.>\n\nWell, are we doing this, or what?"]="Sei o que está pensando. O vejo nos seus ojitos de $r.\n\n<O pupilo sorri.>\n\nE bem? Vamos elho?"
G["I know what you're up to, Schnottz! Deathwing will never have the coffer, not if I can help it!"]="I know what you're up to, Schnottz! Deathwing will never have the coffer, not if I can help it!"
G["I know what you're up to, and I mean to put an end to it, permanently!"]="I know what you're up to, and I mean to put an end to it, permanently!"
G["I know what your friend has seen, $n - he will need to rest for now. Come speak with me."]="Sei o que tem visto seu amigo, $n. De momentos terá que descansar. Venha a falar comigo."
G["I know where it CAME from, what was it?"]="Eu sei de ONDE veio, mas o que foi isso?"
G["I know who ya are, shadow hunter. An' I know what ya WANT. But what makes you tink I'm gonna help YOU? Ain't a wise ting, callin' me from de Other Side..."]="I know who ya are, shadow hunter. An' I know what ya WANT. But what makes you tink I'm gonna help YOU? Ain't a wise ting, callin' me from de Other Side..."
G["I know who you are, $n! I'll not surrender the Sacred Flame to a filthy meatbag such as yourself!"]="Sei quem é, $n! Não deixarei que um saco de carne asqueroso como você se que com a chama sacra!"
G["I know who you are, $n.  Fate and forces beyond that have brought you to me for a reason, and it is one I take no pleasure in being a part of.  There are many decisions you will make in the coming times, and I hope you are wise enough to make the correct ones.\n\nBelieve me, $r, when I tell you this - there are correct choices."]="I know who you are, $n.  Fate and forces beyond that have brought you to me for a reason, and it is one I take no pleasure in being a part of.  There are many decisions you will make in the coming times, and I hope you are wise enough to make the correct ones.\n\nBelieve me, $r, when I tell you this - there are correct choices."
G["I know why you've come - one of those foolish Magnataur on the plains meddled and managed to get the dragons involved.  Do you enjoy serving them like a dog?"]="I know why you've come - one of those foolish Magnataur on the plains meddled and managed to get the dragons involved.  Do you enjoy serving them like a dog?"
G["I know you are not one of us. You are one of them.\n\nI follow you. I watch you. You kill our people, but you also kill mogu. You kill straight-back trolls.\n\nI do not care who you kill. I pick up the meat afterward. So very, very much meat."]="I know you are not one of us. You are one of them.\n\nI follow you. I watch you. You kill our people, but you also kill mogu. You kill straight-back trolls.\n\nI do not care who you kill. I pick up the meat afterward. So very, very much meat."
G["I know you are there, rogue. Leave my home or join the others at the bottom of the world tree."]="I know you are there, rogue. Leave my home or join the others at the bottom of the world tree."
G["I know you as Artorius the Doombringer. Show yourself, demon! Face me!"]="Te conheço como Artorius o Fatídico. Muéstrate, demônio! Enfrente a mim!"
G["I know you by your stench, little $n.  Here, in my perch, is where your bones shall finally rest."]="I know you by your stench, little $n.  Here, in my perch, is where your bones shall finally rest."
G["I know you still learning, but big-tongues are bad. Frenzyheart good, big-tongues bad, okay?"]="Sei que ainda está aprendendo, mas os línguas-grandes são maus. Coração Frenético bons, línguas-grandes maus, vale?"
G["I know you will, $n.\n\nI myself am a priestess, though, unlike you I am long since gone from this world. My spirit, however, remains here, as do the spirits of the thousands who were brutally slain by the mad Prince, Arthas Menethil and his legion of undeath."]="I know you will, $n.\n\nI myself am a priestess, though, unlike you I am long since gone from this world. My spirit, however, remains here, as do the spirits of the thousands who were brutally slain by the mad Prince, Arthas Menethil and his legion of undeath."
G["I know you will. I'm sending in grunts to make sure of it."]="I know you will. I'm sending in grunts to make sure of it."
G["I know you!  You saved my brother not even a week ago.  You're a true hero!"]="I know you!  You saved my brother not even a week ago.  You're a true hero!"
G["I know you're new to our kind, so I'll catch you up a bit while we're on our way over."]="Sei que acabas de chegar a nossa raça, assim que te pondré um pouco ao dia enquanto viajamos."
G["I know you. I have you to thank for my freedom from the deepening corruption that consumed me for so many years.\n\nWelcome to my home. Deepholm.  It is a shadow of what it used to be, but still, here I can be free. I shall never take such freedom for granted after what we have endured.\n\nI know not why you are here, but I hope you find what you seek within the stone walls of this place. Stay safe, $n."]="I know you. I have you to thank for my freedom from the deepening corruption that consumed me for so many years.\n\nWelcome to my home. Deepholm.  It is a shadow of what it used to be, but still, here I can be free. I shall never take such freedom for granted after what we have endured.\n\nI know not why you are here, but I hope you find what you seek within the stone walls of this place. Stay safe, $n."
G["I know you. If the reports I've been receiving are true, I could use a $gman:woman; like you."]="I know you. If the reports I've been receiving are true, I could use a $gman:woman; like you."
G["I know your face... Aggra! Oh, my heart - can't you see? I am... nothing. Selfish... all I've done... accomplished... all for the sake of pride alone. I am... unworthy of you..."]="Conheço seu rosto... Aggra! Oh, coração meu, acaso não o vê? Não sou... nada. Egoísta... tudo o que fiz... conseguido... o fiz por mero ORGULHO. Não sou... digno... de ti..."
G["I know your secret, Koltira.  I'm aware of your friendship with the Alliance death knight, Thassarian."]="I know your secret, Koltira.  I'm aware of your friendship with the Alliance death knight, Thassarian."
G["I know your secret, outsider. I know you are an enemy. I smell through your false skin.\n\nI am not scared of you. Fear is for the weak. I am not weak."]="I know your secret, outsider. I know you are an enemy. I smell through your false skin.\n\nI am not scared of you. Fear is for the weak. I am not weak."
G["I know!  The way he looks at you with those hungry eyes.  I'm afraid to even turn my back!"]="I know!  The way he looks at you with those hungry eyes.  I'm afraid to even turn my back!"
G["I know, I know, I'm out here in the middle of nowhere!\n\nMy home is actually in Ratchet, but after crashing my zeppelin here, I thought I might as well start the research I came here to do!"]="I know, I know, I'm out here in the middle of nowhere!\n\nMy home is actually in Ratchet, but after crashing my zeppelin here, I thought I might as well start the research I came here to do!"
G["I know, I know."]="Já sei, já sei."
G["I know, I know. Back in the bucket...."]="O sei, o sei. De volta ao cubo..."
G["I know, I know. We got the upper hand here now thanks to you, so we'll get them dang yaungol out of here soon. Just the same, if you feel like crackin' a skull or two, you won't hear me complainin'."]="I know, I know. We got the upper hand here now thanks to you, so we'll get them dang yaungol out of here soon. Just the same, if you feel like crackin' a skull or two, you won't hear me complainin'."
G["I know, I know... \"fishing in a sewer?\" But you'd be surprised by what you can catch down here. I've even heard stories of sharks, if you can believe it."]="Eu sei, eu sei... \"Pescar em um esgoto?\" Mas você ficaria surpreso com o que pode pegar aqui. Eu até ouvi histórias de tubarões, se você pode acreditar."
G["I know, I know... I haven't given up yet. Don't get your hopes up though, this technology is way beyond me."]="I know, I know... I haven't given up yet. Don't get your hopes up though, this technology is way beyond me."
G["I know, lass, but you're safe now and with friends. I thought you were dead!"]="Já o sei, moça, mas agora está a salvou e entre amigos. Achava que estava morta!"
G["I know, right?"]="O sei, vale?"
G["I know, sister. I know. We'll return to fighting one day. For now, though, maybe it's best to spread the word to others... give them the hope you have."]="I know, sister. I know. We'll return to fighting one day. For now, though, maybe it's best to spread the word to others... give them the hope you have."
G["I know, we thought he was dead too, but that's not the case. He's trying to use the Sunwell to bring the master of the Burning Legion, Kil'Jaeden, into this world."]="I know, we thought he was dead too, but that's not the case. He's trying to use the Sunwell to bring the master of the Burning Legion, Kil'Jaeden, into this world."
G["I know.  It be why I went around, to warn everyone.   When da leader of da Darkspear speak, everyone listen, Horde an' Alliance."]="I know.  It be why I went around, to warn everyone.   When da leader of da Darkspear speak, everyone listen, Horde an' Alliance."
G["I know. I KNOW. We could never be, right? Dragon and Spirit Healer... two different worlds! Not to mention the physiological problems.\n\nBut you're wrong. We have a deeper connection than that. Anara and I, we're involved.\n\nBesides, I kind of like it here. No adventurers to poke and prod me with no provocation."]="I know. I KNOW. We could never be, right? Dragon and Spirit Healer... two different worlds! Not to mention the physiological problems.\n\nBut you're wrong. We have a deeper connection than that. Anara and I, we're involved.\n\nBesides, I kind of like it here. No adventurers to poke and prod me with no provocation."
G["I know. I trust you to lead the siege. I am needed elsewhere."]="Eu sei. Confio em você para comandar o cerco. Precisam de mim em outro lugar."
G["I know... I know! Where's the override? The override?!"]="O sei... o sei! Como se anula? Onde está o botão de controle manual?!"
G["I lack the strength to transmit the signal. You must... hurry... find a place of power... close to the skies."]="I lack the strength to transmit the signal. You must... hurry... find a place of power... close to the skies."
G["I last saw Elder Meadowrun at the Weeping Cave in the Western Plaguelands."]="Vi o Élder Meadowrun pela última vez na Caverna do Lamento, nas Terras Pestilentas Ocidentais."
G["I laugh at you, feeble $n, but I will oblige. Now, let us return to my master, below!"]="I laugh at you, feeble $n, but I will oblige. Now, let us return to my master, below!"
G["I leave you now, mortals. Alive and with these trinkets. Maltrake! Present them with the trinkets!"]="I leave you now, mortals. Alive and with these trinkets. Maltrake! Present them with the trinkets!"
G["I left a war once to tend to the troubles back home in Westfall. That seems like a lifetime ago. Thank the Light that the Defias are no longer a threat.\n\nWe're a long way from home up here, but if we don't win this battle, there may not be a Westfall to return to."]="I left a war once to tend to the troubles back home in Westfall. That seems like a lifetime ago. Thank the Light that the Defias are no longer a threat.\n\nWe're a long way from home up here, but if we don't win this battle, there may not be a Westfall to return to."
G["I left. I would not remain with the Blackrock. No, the deaths of my children would not be in vain. I would not serve under an inept, power hungry maniac such as Rend.\n\nI took shelter in the woods of Lordaeron, living as a hermit near Hearthglen."]="I left. I would not remain with the Blackrock. No, the deaths of my children would not be in vain. I would not serve under an inept, power hungry maniac such as Rend.\n\nI took shelter in the woods of Lordaeron, living as a hermit near Hearthglen."
G["I lend you the cold vengeance of the northern winds!"]="Te ofereço a fria vingança dos ventos do norte!"
G["I let the dogs out!"]="Eu sou o líder da manada!"
G["I lied. Your miserable food stinks, but not as much as this town is going to stink!"]="Mentí. Seu miserável comida fede, mas não tanto como apestará esta cidade!"
G["I lied..."]="Mentí..."
G["I like anything pretty or shiny."]="Me gosta qualquer coisa bonita ou que brilhe."
G["I like cake more than pie."]="Me gosta mais o pastel que a torta."
G["I like my meat extra crispy!"]="Me gosta a carne bem crocante!"
G["I like my women like I like my beer: full-bodied."]="I like my women like I like my beer: full-bodied."
G["I like shorts! They're perfect for this weather!"]="Adoro usar bermudas! São perfeitas para esse clima!"
G["I like that brown rat over there.  HEY!  I think he waved at me!!"]="Me gosta essa rata marrom de aí. EH! Acho que me vidaado!!"
G["I like the sound of that."]="Me gosta como soa."
G["I like the way you fight!"]="Me gosta como luchas!"
G["I like the way you think!  Let's get outta here!"]="Me gosta como pensa! Vamos de aqui!"
G["I like the way you think! Let's go!"]="Me gosta como pensa! Vamos!"
G["I like the way you think, $r!\n\nUntil recently, the latent magical energies of the academy grounds attracted the attention of the Blue Dragonflight, and I wasn't able to study them. The attention of the dragons is now elsewhere, but a worse threat is in the making - these little green brutes want to level the ruins to make way for a fuel depot! Knowledge lost for ten thousand years is days away from being lost forever. We've got to act fast."]="I like the way you think, $r!\n\nUntil recently, the latent magical energies of the academy grounds attracted the attention of the Blue Dragonflight, and I wasn't able to study them. The attention of the dragons is now elsewhere, but a worse threat is in the making - these little green brutes want to level the ruins to make way for a fuel depot! Knowledge lost for ten thousand years is days away from being lost forever. We've got to act fast."
G["I like the way you think, Bridgewater."]="Me gostà sua forma de pensar, Puenteagua."
G["I like the way you think."]="Me gostà sua forma de pensar."
G["I like things that come from nature."]="I like things that come from nature."
G["I like this place. Although it needs more water... I like it."]="Me gosta este lugar. Lhe falta água, mas me gosta."
G["I like thish a lot, $n. Thanksh."]="Me encantar, $n. Graciash."
G["I like to build stuff. Of course, I like to blow stuff up even more!"]="Eu gosto de construir coisas. Claro, eu gosto de explodir ainda mais!"
G["I like to clean the leaves away from the trails. Too many leaves brings sprites. Temple monks do not like sprites."]="I like to clean the leaves away from the trails. Too many leaves brings sprites. Temple monks do not like sprites."
G["I like to consider myself a historian of my people. I believe that in order to understand the present, we should examine the events of the past."]="Me gosta pensar que sou um historiador de meu povo. Acho que para entender o presente deveríamos estudar os acontecimentos do passado."
G["I like to keep an eye on all of my students. I will watch your progress eagerly."]="I like to keep an eye on all of my students. I will watch your progress eagerly."
G["I like to offer my competitors something nice to eat. Before I crush them."]="I like to offer my competitors something nice to eat. Before I crush them."
G["I like to play in the water barrel but I'm told it's not for children."]="Eu gosto de brincar no barril de água, mas disseram para mim que não é para crianças."
G["I like to play in the water barrel, but I'm told it's not for children."]="Eu gosto de brincar no barril de água, mas disseram para mim que não é para crianças."
G["I like to think myself a reasonable fellow in an unreasonable situation."]="I like to think myself a reasonable fellow in an unreasonable situation."
G["I like to think of myself as the brains and the beauty of this operation. Anji's the brawn. And the second beauty.\n\nWe've got a lot of beauty."]="I like to think of myself as the brains and the beauty of this operation. Anji's the brawn. And the second beauty.\n\nWe've got a lot of beauty."
G["I like turtles."]="I like turtles."
