G["I made it! I made it!"]="O conseguí! O conseguí!"
G["I made it. Freedom at last!"]="O logré. Ao fim livre!"
G["I make a promise to you now, brothers and sisters: the Lich King will be defeated! On this day, I call for a union."]="I make a promise to you now, brothers and sisters: the Lich King will be defeated! On this day, I call for a union."
G["I make kegs. Sounds simple to the un-enlightened but you would be surprised how much the type of materials used in a keg will affect the flavor of the beverage held within."]="I make kegs. Sounds simple to the un-enlightened but you would be surprised how much the type of materials used in a keg will affect the flavor of the beverage held within."
G["I make no pretenses, maggot. The darkness such items hold could very well destroy the both of us. That is why the price is so high. If I'm going to die, it's going to be as a rich man.\n\nAnd I don't give an ounce of gnoll spit how you die, only that you do as I ask. Bring me what I require and we will both benefit - or die, but I've already explained this..."]="I make no pretenses, maggot. The darkness such items hold could very well destroy the both of us. That is why the price is so high. If I'm going to die, it's going to be as a rich man.\n\nAnd I don't give an ounce of gnoll spit how you die, only that you do as I ask. Bring me what I require and we will both benefit - or die, but I've already explained this..."
G["I make the luckydos luckier. Bring me an item and I will change its fortune to better serve your own... for a price."]="I make the luckydos luckier. Bring me an item and I will change its fortune to better serve your own... for a price."
G["I make this look easy."]="Faço que isto parezca fácil."
G["I managed to discover that certain parts of the brain when removed or stimulated will make a subject much more docile."]="I managed to discover that certain parts of the brain when removed or stimulated will make a subject much more docile."
G["I managed to take one of the attackers' weapons and fight back, but there were too many of them. See? I still have the axe..."]="I managed to take one of the attackers' weapons and fight back, but there were too many of them. See? I still have the axe..."
G["I may be bruised and beaten, but the hatred boils inside me."]="Talvez estiver ferido e derrotou, mas o ódio arde na minha interior."
G["I may be old but I can still take on a young whippersnapper like you, $n. Try not to fall behind..."]="I may be old but I can still take on a young whippersnapper like you, $n. Try not to fall behind..."
G["I may be restrained now, but my master will set me free when his vengeance rains down upon this city."]="Posso ser contido agora, mas meu mestre me libertará quando sua vingança chover sobre esta cidade."
G["I may fall, but I'll take a dozen of those beasts with me!"]="I may fall, but I'll take a dozen of those beasts with me!"
G["I may have ninety-nine problems, but dancin' ain't one of them!  Happy Hallow's End, $n!"]="Há muitas coisas que não se me derem bem, mas dançar não é uma das elas! Feliz Halhoween, $n!"
G["I may have overestimated my own strength..."]="É possível que tenha sobrevalorado minha força..."
G["I may look sweet, but I'm still aiming for first prize!"]="I may look sweet, but I'm still aiming for first prize!"
G["I may not be a warrior, but I will protect my home and family!"]="I may not be a warrior, but I will protect my home and family!"
G["I may not be the best rider, but I have the best inventions!"]="Talvez não sejao melhor cavaleiro, mas sou o melhor inventor!"
G["I may not have any mindless servants, but at least I can see a quality blade made from time to time."]="Talvez não tenha servos sem mente, mas ao menos posso fazer uma lâmina de qualidade de vez em quando."
G["I may not know how to fight yet, but I do know what's worth fighting for!"]="Talvez ainda não tenha aprendido a lutar, mas desde depois sei por que merece a pena lutar!"
G["I may or may not have pissed myself."]="É possível que me o tenha feito acima."
G["I mean you no harm. I am scouting the quilboar and taking notes of their activities. My people have noticed something odd--an emanation or darkness--coming from this area. I've come to investigate, and what I've found is very disturbing.\n\nThere seems to be an undead diplomat who is powerful in the ways of the arcane. I don't believe he's one of the Forsaken... I think it's worse."]="I mean you no harm. I am scouting the quilboar and taking notes of their activities. My people have noticed something odd--an emanation or darkness--coming from this area. I've come to investigate, and what I've found is very disturbing.\n\nThere seems to be an undead diplomat who is powerful in the ways of the arcane. I don't believe he's one of the Forsaken... I think it's worse."
G["I might be able to help.  Were the Neferset behind this?"]="É possível que possa ajudar. Estão os Neferset por trás de isto?"
G["I might have escaped if I hadn't got caught in one of the thermals..."]="I might have escaped if I hadn't got caught in one of the thermals..."
G["I might have seen someone in a Twilight's Hammer robe. They were very tall. I'm sure of it."]="Talvez tenha visto a alguém vestido com uma toga do Martelo Crepúsculo. Eram muito altos. disso estou certo."
G["I might if you embarrass us."]="I might if you embarrass us."
G["I might just have to go hunting for that Wretched beast now that there's a bounty on his head."]="I might just have to go hunting for that Wretched beast now that there's a bounty on his head."
G["I misplaced my Negotiator. In fact, he's probably dead. Is another available?"]="E perdido meu negociador. De feito, provavelmente estiver morto. Há outro disponível?"
G["I misplaced my shiny bling!"]="E perdido meu cadeia de ouro lustrosa!"
G["I misplaced the enchanted blade that you gave me. Have you seen it?"]="E perdido a lâmina encantado que me deu. A tem visto?"
G["I miss Kezan. Will we ever see Bilgewater Port again, $n?"]="I miss Kezan. Will we ever see Bilgewater Port again, $n?"
G["I miss Leza."]="I miss Leza."
G["I miss being robbed by the Defias. At least they'd leave you a little something to eat from time to time."]="I miss being robbed by the Defias. At least they'd leave you a little something to eat from time to time."
G["I miss me home, sometimes. Or maybe I just miss fightin' for it."]="I miss me home, sometimes. Or maybe I just miss fightin' for it."
G["I miss my dog so much!"]="I miss my dog so much!"
G["I miss my family. I miss my home!"]="I miss my family. I miss my home!"
G["I miss my father."]="I miss my father."
G["I miss my home!"]="I miss my home!"
G["I miss my mommy."]="I miss my mommy."
G["I miss my toys. Can we go home?"]="I miss my toys. Can we go home?"
G["I miss the dwarven ale we used to get at that inn in Lordaeron. Remember that fight we started there?"]="I miss the dwarven ale we used to get at that inn in Lordaeron. Remember that fight we started there?"
G["I miss you so much!"]="I miss you so much!"
G["I missed the gate to Acherus, Orbaz. Could you please open another?"]="Perdi o portões de Acherus, Orbaz. Você poderia abrir outro?"
G["I missed you so much! Where have you been?\n\nAre you going to answer me, or just stand there?"]="I missed you so much! Where have you been?\n\nAre you going to answer me, or just stand there?"
G["I missed you so much, Daddy!"]="I missed you so much, Daddy!"
G["I missed you too, honey.  And I'm finally home..."]="I missed you too, honey.  And I'm finally home..."
G["I must act to protect my people first.  Our enemies buried Orsis in the desert.  How do you fight against that sort of power?"]="I must act to protect my people first.  Our enemies buried Orsis in the desert.  How do you fight against that sort of power?"
G["I must admit I had my doubts about you at first, $n, but you have proven yourself with our tribe."]="I must admit I had my doubts about you at first, $n, but you have proven yourself with our tribe."
G["I must admit I like what I'm seeing, Ms. Dreadshredder."]="Devo admitir que me gostao que estou vendo, senhora Trituramatic."
G["I must admit, I am intrigued by this ambitious little upstart.\n\nI'm not rushing to judgement, mind you, but I've heard some unsettling rumors.\n\nTime will tell if his motives are just."]="I must admit, I am intrigued by this ambitious little upstart.\n\nI'm not rushing to judgement, mind you, but I've heard some unsettling rumors.\n\nTime will tell if his motives are just."
G["I must admit, I couldn'ta done this one without yer help."]="Admito que não haveria pedido fazer isso sem sua ajuda."
G["I must admit, we did not bring you here for introductions and pleasantries."]="I must admit, we did not bring you here for introductions and pleasantries."
G["I must admit, when times were darkest, I did not believe that we would survive. Thanks to you and your people, I am glad to have been proven wrong."]="I must admit, when times were darkest, I did not believe that we would survive. Thanks to you and your people, I am glad to have been proven wrong."
G["I must apologize for not being entirely truthful with you in regards to my identity. I had to be certain that you could be trusted - few people would have selflessly lent assistance to an old and forgotten hermit.\n\nYou have proven yourself as one of those people: A person of integrity and honor."]="I must apologize for not being entirely truthful with you in regards to my identity. I had to be certain that you could be trusted - few people would have selflessly lent assistance to an old and forgotten hermit.\n\nYou have proven yourself as one of those people: A person of integrity and honor."
G["I must ask that you reforge Shadow's Edge for me, Highlord Mograine."]="Devo pedir que reforce Shadow's Edge para mim, Grão-senhor Mograine."
G["I must attune to the Focusing Iris before transport. Protect me!"]="I must attune to the Focusing Iris before transport. Protect me!"
G["I must be going now, soldier. Stay vigilant!"]="Eu devo ir agora, soldado. Fique vigilante!"
G["I must be going now..."]="Agora devo ir embora..."
G["I must be going, there is so much to see."]="Tenho que ir embora, há tantas coisas por ver."
G["I must be in top fighting condition when we face the Hozen in battle."]="Devo estar nas melhores condições quando nos enfrentemos aos hozen em combate."
G["I must be off now, $n. See you around."]="E de ir embora, $n. Nos vemos."
G["I must be returnin' ta Darkspear Hold. Please meet me there once Vanira is done with her healin' of the boy."]="I must be returnin' ta Darkspear Hold. Please meet me there once Vanira is done with her healin' of the boy."
G["I must be returnin' to Vol'jin wit' my report! Help me outta here!"]="Devo voltar ao lado a Vol'jin com meu relatório! Ajude-me a sair de aqui."
G["I must be swift as a rushing... stream!"]="I must be swift as a rushing... stream!"
G["I must become a better leader for our tribe."]="I must become a better leader for our tribe."
