G["I must bid you... farewell."]="I must bid you... farewell."
G["I must break you now."]="I must break you now."
G["I must break you."]="Devo deh'trozaros."
G["I must build a beacon for this marvelous device!"]="I must build a beacon for this marvelous device!"
G["I must concentrate! Guards! Guards! Aid me!"]="I must concentrate! Guards! Guards! Aid me!"
G["I must confess... you were not altogether unexpected.  I hope you find your final resting place... to your liking."]="I must confess... you were not altogether unexpected.  I hope you find your final resting place... to your liking."
G["I must conserve my energy... there's no telling when my portal magic will be needed!"]="I must conserve my energy... there's no telling when my portal magic will be needed!"
