G["I must feed... prepare to die!"]="I must feed... prepare to die!"
G["I must find a way to put an end to the evil that Cersei Dusksinger is committing against our lost brothers and sisters!"]="I must find a way to put an end to the evil that Cersei Dusksinger is committing against our lost brothers and sisters!"
G["I must finish this myself, then.  So be it!"]="Então devo acabar o trabalho eu mesmo. Assim seja!"
G["I must finish this myself, then. So be it!"]="Então devo acabar o trabalho eu mesmo. Assim seja!"
G["I must get further underground to where he is. I must jump!"]="Devo chegar mais baixo, até onde está ele. Devo saltar!"
G["I must get to Stoneplow! The mantid will attack soon."]="Devo chegar a Vilharroca! Os mantídeos vão a atacar pronto."
G["I must give Arugal some credit, his lines of research were quite novel."]="I must give Arugal some credit, his lines of research were quite novel."
G["I must give in to the anger! It is the only way!"]="I must give in to the anger! It is the only way!"
G["I must go - there are others who have landed on our northern shores."]="Devo ir embora. Há mais forasteiros na costa norte."
