G["I must have been pretty tipsy the night I promised you a pony.  Take your money and no hard feelings, okay?"]="I must have been pretty tipsy the night I promised you a pony.  Take your money and no hard feelings, okay?"
G["I must have broken hundreds of vials when I first began brewing potions. The glass was so fragile in my clumsy hands. I hope you are more cautious than I was."]="Eu devo ter quebrado centenas de frascos quando comecei a preparar poções. O copo era tão frágil nas minhas mãos desajeitadas. Espero que você seja mais cauteloso do que eu."
G["I must have lived a charmed life, $n.  To return to the world as a member of the Forsaken and the Apothecary Society... I couldn't have asked for a more suitable fate."]="I must have lived a charmed life, $n.  To return to the world as a member of the Forsaken and the Apothecary Society... I couldn't have asked for a more suitable fate."
G["I must have made a misstep somewhere to be assigned here."]="Devo ter dado um passo em falso em algum lugar para ser designado aqui."
G["I must have misunderstood the water's wisdom."]="Eu devo ter entendido errado a vontade da água."
G["I must have taken leave of my senses, allowing a Scryer to aid in such a delicate operation..."]="I must have taken leave of my senses, allowing a Scryer to aid in such a delicate operation..."
G["I must keep my blades sharp - the threat of the Legion is ever-present."]="Devo manter as lâminas afiadas. A ameaça da Legião é constante."
G["I must keep my eyes on ship and crew, good $gsir:madame;. You must forgive my not pausing to speak with you."]="I must keep my eyes on ship and crew, good $gsir:madame;. You must forgive my not pausing to speak with you."
G["I must know something: How did you go to the bathroom with that thing on?"]="Preciso saber uma coisa: como você foi ao banheiro com essa coisa?"
G["I must know... I will know..."]="Devo saber... e o sabré..."
G["I must leave this place at once!"]="Devo deixar este lugar imediatamente!"
