G["I must warn you.  Caimas does horrible things to prisoners... he forces them to fight his pet beasts.  Prepare for the worst, friend."]="I must warn you.  Caimas does horrible things to prisoners... he forces them to fight his pet beasts.  Prepare for the worst, friend."
