G["I need more time to prepare the mixture, $n. I'll let you know when it's ready."]="I need more time to prepare the mixture, $n. I'll let you know when it's ready."
G["I need no further convincing. If you need me, I will be waiting on the hill behind the tents."]="I need no further convincing. If you need me, I will be waiting on the hill behind the tents."
G["I need no home to know I still have a place in this world, $c. The tribes will see... all of them. They fight amongst one another, and for what? Scraps left over by vultures... lands infested by the Legion... bah!\n\nThe centaur should be proud of their heritage--it is just as noble as any Night elf's or orc's--it is time we started acting like it!"]="I need no home to know I still have a place in this world, $c. The tribes will see... all of them. They fight amongst one another, and for what? Scraps left over by vultures... lands infested by the Legion... bah!\n\nThe centaur should be proud of their heritage--it is just as noble as any Night elf's or orc's--it is time we started acting like it!"
G["I need no more convincing, $n. The Druids of the Talon will lend you their aid."]="Não preciso que me convenzas mais, $n. Os Druidas da Garfa te ajudarão."
G["I need not tell you what will happen should the mana bomb down in the courtyard fail to be used on its target soon?  Since moving into the forest, they've become increasingly annoying to our operations: here, at Tuurem and to the south at the Bonechewer Ruins."]="I need not tell you what will happen should the mana bomb down in the courtyard fail to be used on its target soon?  Since moving into the forest, they've become increasingly annoying to our operations: here, at Tuurem and to the south at the Bonechewer Ruins."
