G["I need use of a wyvern to fly me to where the Darkspear emissary went."]="Preciso usar um dracoleón para voar até onde tem ido o emissário Lança Negra."
G["I need you out on the front, $n.\n\nYou're going to make the difference. We'll crush the stone troggs once and for all.\n\nWe must rescue King Oremantle!"]="Te preciso na linha de frente, $n.\n\nVocê marcarás a diferença. Aplastaremos aos troggs de pedras de uma vez por todas.\n\nDevemos resgate ao rei Mantomena!"
G["I need you to do what I say, $r.  If we falter, then we may be playing right into Razelikh's hands."]="I need you to do what I say, $r.  If we falter, then we may be playing right into Razelikh's hands."
G["I need you to show me again, Matthias."]="Preciso que você me mostre novamente, Matthias."
G["I need you to take me to the lich's phylactery, Dusk."]="I need you to take me to the lich's phylactery, Dusk."
G["I need you to take them out before the horde overrun us."]="Quero que os destruyas antes de que a Horda nos supere."
G["I need your help to remove the poison from these adventurers."]="preciso da sua ajuda para eliminar o veneno de estes aventureiros."
G["I need... the world... needs him whole once again. But he's always placed the needs of others before his own. How long has he suppressed these feelings - these desires?"]="I need... the world... needs him whole once again. But he's always placed the needs of others before his own. How long has he suppressed these feelings - these desires?"
G["I need... your help! Cannot... resist him much longer!"]="I need... your help! Cannot... resist him much longer!"
G["I never asked for this! Leave me alone!"]="Eu nunca pedí isto! Deixe-me somente!"
G["I never believed Thrall until I saw it with my own eyes. Orcs... free of demonic corruption! Proud and honorable warriors making their place on this unbroken planet.\n\nEager am I to prove myself to Thrall and the Horde. My father never had to deal with this undead menace you call the Lich King, but by all descriptions he represents a dire threat to the Horde.\n\nI will implore Thrall to let me lead his finest warriors into Northrend and destroy the Lich King! But this plague takes precedent."]="I never believed Thrall until I saw it with my own eyes. Orcs... free of demonic corruption! Proud and honorable warriors making their place on this unbroken planet.\n\nEager am I to prove myself to Thrall and the Horde. My father never had to deal with this undead menace you call the Lich King, but by all descriptions he represents a dire threat to the Horde.\n\nI will implore Thrall to let me lead his finest warriors into Northrend and destroy the Lich King! But this plague takes precedent."
G["I never called any dragons..."]="Nunca e chamado a nenhum dragão..."
G["I never cheat!"]="Eu nunca faço trampas!"
G["I never did like those two. Let's get moving."]="Nunca fiz o que esses dois. Vamos de aqui."
G["I never discovered... how to put a stopper... in death..."]="Nunca descobri... como parar... a morte..."
G["I never doubted $n, not for one minute!"]="Mais dudé de $n, nem por um minuto!"
G["I never even got to meet Lady Jaina..."]="Ainda não e conhecido a Lady Jaina..."
G["I never get to ride to Grom'gol. Its just so unfair. Warm, steamy beaches... Crocolisks, Raptors... hmmm... maybe I don't really want to go there after all."]="I never get to ride to Grom'gol. Its just so unfair. Warm, steamy beaches... Crocolisks, Raptors... hmmm... maybe I don't really want to go there after all."
G["I never got to tell my son how proud I am of him..."]="Nunca poderei decirle a meu filho o orgulhoso que estou de ele..."
G["I never had any talent with healing powers, but I found my calling in the medic's craft. Potions, bandages, and other triage methods can go a long way!"]="I never had any talent with healing powers, but I found my calling in the medic's craft. Potions, bandages, and other triage methods can go a long way!"
G["I never imagined farming would involve so many... exotic odors."]="I never imagined farming would involve so many... exotic odors."
G["I never imagined my work would go so far. It is a testament to the great power of the kypari. Our civilization would never have recovered if it weren't for them. Remember that."]="Nunca pensei que meu trabalho lhegaría tão longe. É uma prova do grande poder dos kypari. De não ser por eles, nossa civilização nunca se haveria recuperei. Não o esqueça."
G["I never imagined such a world."]="Nunca imaginé um mundo assim."
G["I never imagined we'd run into this much trouble out here.\n\nMaybe we shouldn't have left the temple..."]="I never imagined we'd run into this much trouble out here.\n\nMaybe we shouldn't have left the temple..."
G["I never knew how much variety there was to brewing tea."]="I never knew how much variety there was to brewing tea."
G["I never knew my father or mother. Orgrim told me many stories about them and their adventures on Draenor. He was my greatest teacher and dearest friend, Greatmother. He died a hero... They all died as heroes and for all of them, a song of honor remains."]="I never knew my father or mother. Orgrim told me many stories about them and their adventures on Draenor. He was my greatest teacher and dearest friend, Greatmother. He died a hero... They all died as heroes and for all of them, a song of honor remains."
G["I never knew that helping the Tillers Union would be so much work."]="I never knew that helping the Tillers Union would be so much work."
G["I never knew you... but you were family."]="Nunca te conocí... mas eras parte da família."
G["I never liked that guy. He stole your girlfriend. I say, good riddance!"]="I never liked that guy. He stole your girlfriend. I say, good riddance!"
G["I never liked that guy. PH"]="Nunca me caiu bem. PH"
G["I never liked you anyway!"]="Nunca me gustaste!"
G["I never meet an enemy head on. I prefer to use my wits...and any number of stealthy tricks."]="I never meet an enemy head on. I prefer to use my wits...and any number of stealthy tricks."
G["I never met a tauren I didn't like..."]="Nunca conocí a um tauren que não me gustara..."
G["I never needed ya, mon. I can crush Zul'Drak without ya!"]="I never needed ya, mon. I can crush Zul'Drak without ya!"
G["I never see nobody fight like you be fightin'."]="Eu nunca vi ninguém lutar assim que nem tu."
G["I never seen such speed before..."]="Nunca havia vih'to tamanha velocidade..."
G["I never seen this many Kor'kron in one place before!\n\nThose orcs are as fierce as fierce gets and angry to boot. They must have upped their recruiting program."]="Nunca havia visto tantos Kor'kron juntos!\n\nEsses orcs são o mais ferozes que existe, e sempre estão enfadados. Devem de haver aprimorado seu programa de recrutamento."
G["I never should have opened this inn. It is just so depressing here."]="Nunca debí abrir esta estalagem. Isto é deprimente."
G["I never stated that you were here to redeem yourself, $g priest:priestess;. You are here to redeem me and the innocents murdered while trying to escape Stratholme.\n\nMy spirit and the spirit of those lost are bound here, cursed to endlessly relive our own tragic deaths."]="I never stated that you were here to redeem yourself, $g priest:priestess;. You are here to redeem me and the innocents murdered while trying to escape Stratholme.\n\nMy spirit and the spirit of those lost are bound here, cursed to endlessly relive our own tragic deaths."
G["I never thought Garrosh would turn against orcs!"]="Nunca pensei que Garrosh se volviese contra os orcs!"
G["I never thought I would have to pick up a weapon to use it again..."]="Mais pensei que tendría que voltar a empunhar um arma..."
G["I never thought I'd be free from that terrible spell!"]="Mais pensei que me libraría desse terrível feitiço!"
G["I never thought I'd get to see Teldrassil... I certainly never thought we'd crash into Teldrassil."]="Nunca pensei que veria Teldrassil... Certamente nunca pensei que colidiríamos com Teldrassil."
G["I never thought I'd see such a pure sample."]="Nunca pensei que lhegaría a ver uma mostra tão pura."
G["I never thought I'd see the day! Our former champion, out of retirement! Put your big, beefy hands together for Leona Earthwind!"]="I never thought I'd see the day! Our former champion, out of retirement! Put your big, beefy hands together for Leona Earthwind!"
G["I never thought I'd see the day! The damsel of Darnassus! Put your big, beefy hands together for Leona Earthwind!"]="I never thought I'd see the day! The damsel of Darnassus! Put your big, beefy hands together for Leona Earthwind!"
G["I never thought about where the food on my table came from before we started this farming business.\n\nThis experience has been enlightening, to say the least!"]="Nunca pensei de onde vinha a comida até que empecé este negócios agrícola.\n\nEsta experiência foi como mínimo reveladora!"
G["I never thought it would turn out to be mana oil! There's going to be plenty of demand for that, minus Grek, of course!"]="Nunca pensei que seria óleo de mana! Vamos ter muita demanda disso, menos Grek, é claro!"
G["I never thought something like this could happen here..."]="Nunca pensei que pudesse passar algo assim aqui..."
G["I never thought something like this could happen to our little orchard."]="I never thought something like this could happen to our little orchard."
G["I never thought that I'd be rescued by you, $n!"]="I never thought that I'd be rescued by you, $n!"
G["I never thought that I'd be riding into battle with a $r on my back."]="I never thought that I'd be riding into battle with a $r on my back."
G["I never thought that I'd be saved by you, $n!"]="I never thought that I'd be saved by you, $n!"
G["I never thought that it would end like this."]="I never thought that it would end like this."
G["I never thought the Warchief himself would come to bail me out!"]="I never thought the Warchief himself would come to bail me out!"
G["I never thought the day would come that I'd leave my homeland of Westfall. . . ."]="I never thought the day would come that I'd leave my homeland of Westfall. . . ."
G["I never thought we'd escape from that steamy jungle! Now I'm the lead engineer of this expedition."]="I never thought we'd escape from that steamy jungle! Now I'm the lead engineer of this expedition."
G["I never understood why some pirates bury their treasure.  Me... I like to keep it within arm's reach."]="Eu nunca entendi por que algum piratas enterram seus tesouros. Eu... eu gosto de mantê-o ao alcance do braço."
G["I never want to see this nasty pond again. Thank you, $n. I'll never forget you!"]="I never want to see this nasty pond again. Thank you, $n. I'll never forget you!"
G["I never was very fond of field work. Especially when it involves vast quantities of trolls."]="Nunca me gostado o trabalho de campo... Especialmente se você precisa ver com grandes quantidades de trolls."
G["I never would have thought that these grunts could be trained."]="I never would have thought that these grunts could be trained."
G["I never would've made it on my own..."]="I never would've made it on my own..."
G["I no gonna make it...."]="Não vou fazer isso..."
G["I no longer have my Zandalar Demoniac's Robe. Can you provide a replacement?"]="Já não tenho meu toga de demoníaco Zandalariano. Me poderia conseguir uma nova?"
G["I no longer have my Zandalar Illusionist's Wraps and require a new pair."]="I no longer have my Zandalar Illusionist's Wraps and require a new pair."
G["I no longer possess my Zandalar Confessor's Bindings. Can you provide a replacement?"]="I no longer possess my Zandalar Confessor's Bindings. Can you provide a replacement?"
G["I no longer recognize this world. Everything is unfamiliar, yet I have a great duty to fulfill."]="Já não reconheço este mundo. Tudo me resulta desconhecido, mas tenho um grande dever por cumprir."
G["I no longer remember where the others are. Indeed it has been so long since we last saw each other the others may very well be dead, or replaced by their pupils. I can only have faith that there are still five of us left."]="I no longer remember where the others are. Indeed it has been so long since we last saw each other the others may very well be dead, or replaced by their pupils. I can only have faith that there are still five of us left."
G["I no longer train Death Knights, having grown weary of cretinous Initiates and their constant questions.\n\nNow begone."]="I no longer train Death Knights, having grown weary of cretinous Initiates and their constant questions.\n\nNow begone."
G["I no longer wish to gain experience."]="Não desejo mais ganhar experiência."
G["I not afraid of little thing like you."]="Não tenho medo de uma minucia como você."
G["I not feel so good..."]="Não me encontro bem..."
G["I not gonna take it anymore, mon!"]="Não pretendo aguantah'lo mais, colega!"
G["I not in a big hurry. We can rest here a while if want."]="Não ter demais pressa, poder descansar aqui um pouco se que."
G["I not live here always... I traveled lot of world on my own not long ago. I like all the stories of beasts and dragons and gods and stuff."]="Eu não viver aqui sempre... Eu viajar muito somente não há tanto. A mim gostar todas as histórias de beast e dragões e deuses e essas coisas..."
G["I not scared of you!"]="Não ter medo de ti!"
G["I not so happy about traveling with big-tongues."]="I not so happy about traveling with big-tongues."
G["I not sure this safe, little geist."]="Eu não acreditar que isto ser certo, pequeno geist."
G["I not-so-quietly ignore the insult, hoping to instill a fear in the ruler that he may have gaffed.  I then inform my liege of the insult when I return."]="Eu não tão silenciosamente ignoro o insulto, na esperança de incutir no governante um medo de que ele possa ter incomodado. Informo meu senhor ao insulto quando voltar."
G["I noticed some fire on that island over there. A human, too. Let's go check it out, $n."]="I noticed some fire on that island over there. A human, too. Let's go check it out, $n."
G["I now present you with a choice - a choice that I was never given."]="I now present you with a choice - a choice that I was never given."
G["I now return to whence I came, only to find myself here once more to relive the same epic tragedy."]="I now return to whence I came, only to find myself here once more to relive the same epic tragedy."
G["I obey."]="Obedezco."
G["I offer myself in exchange.  You will have Ishanah, the High Priestess of the Aldor, as your prisoner if you release Kaylaan from your dark grasp."]="I offer myself in exchange.  You will have Ishanah, the High Priestess of the Aldor, as your prisoner if you release Kaylaan from your dark grasp."
G["I offer what shelter I can in our shattered lands."]="Ofereço o abrigo que posso em nossas terras destruídas."
G["I offer you the life of Lorna for your unconditional surrender."]="Te ofereço a vida de Lorna a caminho do seu rendição incondicional."
G["I often find the trouble with ghouls is that they outlive their usefulness too quickly. Let us let death and decay reclaim these."]="O problema que lhe encontro aos necrófagos é que deixam de ser úteis demais rápido. Dejemos que a morte e a descomposição reclame a estes."
G["I often venture out here to think. The view is breathtaking, would you agree?"]="Sozinho vir aqui a belo para pensar. É uma visão imponente, não acha?"
G["I often wonder about the jinyu here. But they know how to fish and better than the rest of us so who am I to judge."]="I often wonder about the jinyu here. But they know how to fish and better than the rest of us so who am I to judge."
G["I often worry, if the blossoms in this vale are truly eternal, it would be quite dangerous for new ones to sprout, no?  We'd be swimming in sea of choking flowers, fragrant and soft as they might be.\n\nI like to play it safe and squash the small ones under my boot, just to keep things in balance, you know?"]="A vezes me pergunto: se as flores deste vale são eternas de verdade, seria perigoso que crecieran umas novas, não? Nadaríamos em um mar de flores asfixiantes, embora fossem olorosas e suaves.\n\nMe gosta ir sobre certo e aplastar as pequenas com a bota, somente para manter o equilíbrio, sabe?"
G["I on way, Kiryn! And I don't care about you weird dead face!"]="Eu vai, Kiryn! Não me importa seu kara morta chunga!"
G["I once caught a fish the size of three of your ancestors. Granted, it got away, but I caught it for all of a good minute."]="I once caught a fish the size of three of your ancestors. Granted, it got away, but I caught it for all of a good minute."
G["I once did battle with the dreaded fang toothed beast that shall not be named for fear of darkening the day."]="I once did battle with the dreaded fang toothed beast that shall not be named for fear of darkening the day."
G["I once followed the ways of the Twilight's Hammer. Obsessed with reviving the Old Gods, I journeyed deep into this lair to try to draw power from the cursed beast, Aku'mai!\n\nAfter witnessing the sacrifice of countless innocents, I came to my senses.\n\nI was trapped but now I am free! But so far from my homeland of Khaz Modan!\n\nBrave adventurer, I offer you passage to a very special land in return for slaying Aku'mai. If you wish, I can port you to the city of Darnassus."]="I once followed the ways of the Twilight's Hammer. Obsessed with reviving the Old Gods, I journeyed deep into this lair to try to draw power from the cursed beast, Aku'mai!\n\nAfter witnessing the sacrifice of countless innocents, I came to my senses.\n\nI was trapped but now I am free! But so far from my homeland of Khaz Modan!\n\nBrave adventurer, I offer you passage to a very special land in return for slaying Aku'mai. If you wish, I can port you to the city of Darnassus."
G["I once found a feather from big green bird on Neverrest. No green birds fly on Neverrest. This is a very good luckydo."]="I once found a feather from big green bird on Neverrest. No green birds fly on Neverrest. This is a very good luckydo."
G["I once heard ol' Grimnur say he fished up a sword.  Or was it a swordfish?  Damn that Grimnur, he's told so many fish tales I can't remember which is which.  Well, why don't you go see him over in The Forlorn Cavern and have him tell you what it was."]="Uma vez ouvi o velho Grimnur dizer que ele pegou uma lâmina. Ou era um peixe-lâmina? Droga, Grimnur, ele contou tantas histórias de peixes que não me lembro qual é qual. Bem, por que você não o vê na Caverna Forlorn e pede que ele lhe diga o que era?"
G["I once hunted alongside the famous Ohlorn Farstrider. He was a tauren who could hunt with nothing but a totem and his skivvies."]="I once hunted alongside the famous Ohlorn Farstrider. He was a tauren who could hunt with nothing but a totem and his skivvies."
G["I once roamed the Grizzly Hills, son to the great Ursoc, who ruled over this land.\n\nBut now... now I'm doomed to spend the rest of my life in this cave."]="I once roamed the Grizzly Hills, son to the great Ursoc, who ruled over this land.\n\nBut now... now I'm doomed to spend the rest of my life in this cave."
G["I once saw a fish so big you'd swear it was a shark. Come to think of it..."]="I once saw a fish so big you'd swear it was a shark. Come to think of it..."
G["I once saw a strange creature in the Grummle Bazaar. It looked like a haunched over jinyu but was mean and said something like \"Mrggmrmrgmgmgl\".\n\nI guess one of the grummles brought it up from the coastline."]="I once saw a strange creature in the Grummle Bazaar. It looked like a haunched over jinyu but was mean and said something like \"Mrggmrmrgmgmgl\".\n\nI guess one of the grummles brought it up from the coastline."
G["I once served Medivh... or pretended to.  I helped the Violet Eye keep a close eye on the Master.\n\nBut now all I can think of is... making horseshoes.  Over and over."]="I once served Medivh... or pretended to.  I helped the Violet Eye keep a close eye on the Master.\n\nBut now all I can think of is... making horseshoes.  Over and over."
G["I only caught two rabbits. Now I have lots!"]="I only caught two rabbits. Now I have lots!"
G["I only did it for my clan!"]="Somente o fiz por meu clã!"
G["I only have one pet! I hope that's ok!"]="Somente tenho uma ajudante! Não há problema, verdade?"
G["I only have one rule. Everyone fights. No one quits."]="Somente tenho uma norma. Tudo o mundo luta. Ninguém abandona."
G["I only have two hands and two feet here!"]="Somente tenho dois mãos e dois pés!"
G["I only make my mounts available to those who are considered exalted to Orgrimmar and the Orcish race.  Go prove yourself to us, and I'll make my mighty wolves available for your inspection."]="Eu só disponibilizo minhas montarias para aqueles que são considera exaltados por Orgrimmar e pela raça Orc. Vá provar-se a nós, e eu colocarei meus poderosos lobos disponíveis para a sua inspeção."
G["I only make my mounts available to those who are considered friendly to Orgrimmar and the Orcish race.  Go prove yourself to us, and I'll make my mighty wolves available for your inspection."]="I only make my mounts available to those who are considered friendly to Orgrimmar and the Orcish race.  Go prove yourself to us, and I'll make my mighty wolves available for your inspection."
G["I only sleep."]="Somente duermo."
G["I only teach students who have already mastered the basics. You must seek out the night elf Darianna in the Craftsmen's Terrace of Darnassus. Her skills will be a perfect complement to yours."]="Eu ensino apenas alunos que já dominaram o básico. Você deve procurar a elfo noturno Darianna no Terraço dos Artesãos de Darnassus. Suas habilidades serão um complemento perfeito para o seu."
G["I only understand a few words of the quilboar tongue, but I didn't like what I heard."]="I only understand a few words of the quilboar tongue, but I didn't like what I heard."
G["I only wanted to... do something... good..."]="Eu somente queria.. fazer algo... bom."
G["I only wish I had more students like you. Not many will venture so far into enemy territory. I salute your courage."]="Eu só queria ter mais estudantes como você. Poucos se aventuram até agora no território inimigo. Eu saúdo sua coragem."
G["I ordered a few shipments of new perfumes and colognes from the city. After I get them unpacked, check back and I'll have them for sale."]="I ordered a few shipments of new perfumes and colognes from the city. After I get them unpacked, check back and I'll have them for sale."
G["I ought to give your head a good shake!  I've a feeling the ley-lines are clouding up your brain.  No, Darius, what we need is a large depository of mineral-heavy water.  Even faint arcane signals will accumulate in sulphur and lime."]="I ought to give your head a good shake!  I've a feeling the ley-lines are clouding up your brain.  No, Darius, what we need is a large depository of mineral-heavy water.  Even faint arcane signals will accumulate in sulphur and lime."
G["I oughtta shuffle on down and poke around fer treasure while I'm here - after all, what're the odds of a dwarf like me gettin' pinched twice?"]="O que vou fazer é ir aí baixo e ver se encontro algum tesouro já que estou aqui. Que possibilidades há de que um anão como eu repita sorte novamente?"
G["I overheard Regnus Thundergranite in the Hall of Arms bragging about a new trophy for his den the other day.  If yer looking for training from a skilled hunter, Regnus is the one to see."]="Ouvi Regnus Thundergranite no Hall of Arms gabando-me de um novo troféu para a sua toca no outro dia. Se você está procurando treinamento de um caçador habilidoso, Regnus é o único a ver."
G["I overheard a great deal through the cage. Rensai will be pleased with what I have to tell him."]="I overheard a great deal through the cage. Rensai will be pleased with what I have to tell him."
G["I overheard them talking. They're getting ready to summon up something big at their base to the east!"]="Lhes ouvi falar. Se estão preparando para evocar algo grande no seu base do este!"
G["I owe you a debt that I can never repay, $n. Or, can't I?\n\nHmm?"]="Tenho uma dívida com você que nunca poderei pagar, $n. OU si?\n\nMmm?"
G["I owe you a favor, darling...someday I'll be back to repay it."]="I owe you a favor, darling...someday I'll be back to repay it."
G["I owe you a great deal for my freedom, $n.\n\nNow, let us see if we can free Magatha and put an end to the Twilight's Hammer in Thousand Needles."]="Te devo muito por meu liberdade, $n.\n\nAgora vamos ver se podemos liberar a Magatha e colocar fim ao Martelo Crepúsculo nas Mil Agulhas."
G["I owe you a great debt for saving my life. Of course I will help you gain audience with the Elder."]="I owe you a great debt for saving my life. Of course I will help you gain audience with the Elder."
G["I owe you a life debt, stranger."]="I owe you a life debt, stranger."
G["I owe you a long night of drinking, my friend."]="Te devo uma larga noite bebendo, $gamigo meu: amiga minha;."
G["I owe you a very special thank you. Find me sometime when this fight is over."]="Te devo um agradecimento muito especial. Búscame quando se acabe a luta."
G["I owe you an ale!"]="Te devo uma cerveja!"
G["I owe you greatly, friend."]="Te devo uma, colega."
G["I owe you my life!"]="Te devo a vida!"
G["I owe you my life."]="Te devo a vida."
G["I owe you my life.  My people have paid a high price for defying Deathwing."]="Te devo a vida. Meu gente tem pagado um preço muito alto por desafiar a Alamuerte."
G["I owe you, $c.\n\nThought I was a gonner."]="Te devo uma, $c.\n\nPensava que já estava morto."
G["I owe you.  Big time."]="Te devo uma muito gorda."
G["I own a dog, but I'm not giving him a sword."]="Tenho um cão, mas não vou dar uma lâmina."
G["I own you!"]="I own you!"
G["I panicked when I saw all those saurok and wrecked my boat."]="I panicked when I saw all those saurok and wrecked my boat."
G["I peer into these waters and my reflection is empty..."]="Escudrinho as águas, e meu reflexo... está vazio."
G["I perform one final service. I pray it is sufficient..."]="Eu executo um serviço fim. Eu rezo para que seja suficiente..."
G["I personally didn't mind him. It was the Prince who took exception to a high elf in his domain. Alas, I am not one to question the Prince. In his defense, he did not incinerate Master Winthalus immediately."]="I personally didn't mind him. It was the Prince who took exception to a high elf in his domain. Alas, I am not one to question the Prince. In his defense, he did not incinerate Master Winthalus immediately."
G["I picked a bad day to stop drinking!"]="E escolhido um mal dia para deixar de beber!"
G["I picked the wrong week to quit drinkin'!"]="E escolhido uma mal semana para deixar de beber!"
G["I pity the fool!"]="E dito que eu aí não subo!"
G["I pity you, Forsaken.  Your soul is devoid of light."]="Te compadezco, Renegado. Sua alma carece de luz."
G["I placed most of the spikes. Good amount of pointiness I think. You like?"]="I placed most of the spikes. Good amount of pointiness I think. You like?"
G["I plan on creating a wonder of my own for them to behold..."]="I plan on creating a wonder of my own for them to behold..."
G["I play all of my records backwards. Except for the ones by Arrowsmite and Sons."]="Pongo todos meus temas ao revés. Exceto os de Bufasmante."
G["I pledge my love to you forever. Death cannot erase that, even as I am sure that you still remember your love for me."]="I pledge my love to you forever. Death cannot erase that, even as I am sure that you still remember your love for me."
G["I pledge the blades of my Blood Knights to the defeat of Kil'jaeden and the restoration of Silvermoon."]="I pledge the blades of my Blood Knights to the defeat of Kil'jaeden and the restoration of Silvermoon."
G["I poop on you, trollses!"]="Me faço caca sobre vocês, trolls!"
G["I possess part of Eranikus' essence.  What do you want with it... or with me?"]="Eu possuo parte da essência de Eranikus. O que você quer com isso... ou comigo?"
G["I pray for such things."]="Eu ouro por essas coisas."
G["I pray that the Light of a Thousand Moons will grant me this honor."]="I pray that the Light of a Thousand Moons will grant me this honor."
G["I pray that this is not what I'm remembered for...."]="Espero que não se me recuerde por isto..."
G["I pray the illness I'm feeling is due to stress ulcers..."]="I pray the illness I'm feeling is due to stress ulcers..."
G["I pray they give me a chance to prove myself."]="Espero que me deem a oportunidade de demostrar o que valgo."
G["I predict a painful death."]="Pronostico uma morte dolorosa."
G["I predicted that to be a likely outcome."]="Predije este resultados."
G["I prefer a little more meat on my birds, of course, but I can see that your people and mine are not so different after all."]="A mim os pássaros me gostam com algo mais de carne, não sei se me entende, mas já vejo que não somos tão diferentes."
G["I prefer a swift, silent kill. But your methods have their advantages."]="I prefer a swift, silent kill. But your methods have their advantages."
G["I prefer my fish boiled AFTER they've been caught. Let's put out these fires."]="I prefer my fish boiled AFTER they've been caught. Let's put out these fires."
G["I prefer my food raw, but if you like yours cooked Denni'ka can show you how to light a fire.  Find her at Survival of the Fittest, a hut on the shore of the lake next to the Spirit Lodge.  Look for it up above and to the west of the Valley of Strength."]="I prefer my food raw, but if you like yours cooked Denni'ka can show you how to light a fire.  Find her at Survival of the Fittest, a hut on the shore of the lake next to the Spirit Lodge.  Look for it up above and to the west of the Valley of Strength."
G["I prefer my meals a bit colder!"]="Me gosta a comida um pouco mais fria!"
G["I prefer not to meddle with death."]="Prefiro não jogar com a morte."
G["I prefer to be hands-on..."]="Mãos à obra..."
G["I prefer to shape the properties of water, and unleash them against my enemies."]="I prefer to shape the properties of water, and unleash them against my enemies."
G["I prefer to work in solitude."]="Prefiro trabalhar em solitário."
G["I present to you experiment number 25463-D!"]="Os presento o experimento número 25463-D!"
G["I present to you the Libram of Constitution."]="Apresento a vocês o Libram da Constituição."
G["I present to you the Libram of Resilience."]="Apresento a vocês o Libram de Resiliência."
G["I present to you the Libram of Rumination."]="Apresento a vocês o Libram da Ruminação."
G["I present to you the Libram of Tenacity."]="Apresento a vocês o Libram de Tenacidade."
G["I present to you the Libram of Voracity."]="Apresento a vocês o Libram of Voracity."
G["I present to you the rabid thistle bear, Tharnariun."]="Te presento ao urso cardo furioso, Tharnariun."
G["I present you with proof of my deeds, Cyrus."]="Eu apresento a você minhas provas, Cyrus."
G["I presume you come with good news?"]="Suponho que traz boas notícia?"
G["I promise not to give you warts..."]="Prometo que não te saldrán verrugas..."
G["I promise this won't hurt... too much."]="I promise this won't hurt... too much."
G["I promise this won't hurt...too much."]="I promise this won't hurt...too much."
G["I promise you an eternity of dung clean up duty for that failure!"]="I promise you an eternity of dung clean up duty for that failure!"
G["I promise you this much: The Valley will be ours."]="Eu prometo a você isso: o vale será nosso."
G["I promise you this: I will stop at nothing to prepare this world for the battle to come."]="Escúchame bem: nada me impedirá preparar a este mundo para a guerra que se aproxima."
G["I promised Malfurion that I would inform him if we made any progress.  I'll meet you at the beach as soon as I can."]="I promised Malfurion that I would inform him if we made any progress.  I'll meet you at the beach as soon as I can."
G["I promised the boys a picnic up here but it is a dangerous place. Just the other day I hear there was an actual fight between strangers like yourself.\n\nAnd someone from... the turtle.\n\nI always thought the turtle was a legend."]="I promised the boys a picnic up here but it is a dangerous place. Just the other day I hear there was an actual fight between strangers like yourself.\n\nAnd someone from... the turtle.\n\nI always thought the turtle was a legend."
G["I propose this: We will march on the Twilight cult and extinguish any utterings of Deathwing's name from this realm.  Your Earthen Ring will march with us."]="Te propongo isto: marcharemos contra o culto Crepúsculo e acabaremos com qualquer rastro do nome de Alamuerte neste reino. O Anel da Terra marchará conosco."
G["I punched a penguin on my way in here."]="Lhe puse a um olho roxo de caminho a aqui."
G["I put at your disposal whatever assistance I can offer."]="Pongo à sua disposição toda a ajuda que os possa brindar."
G["I put this all on you, but what are you doing to get us off of this island?"]="Eu coloquei tudo isso em você, mas o que você está fazendo para nos tirar desta ilha?"
G["I quietly ignore the insult.  I will not tell my liege, as I am to secure peace at all costs.  It's only an insult - not a declaration of war."]="Eu silenciosamente ignoro o insulto. Não direi ao meu senhor, como devo garantir a paz a tudo custo. É apenas um insulto - não uma declaração de guerra."
G["I quit, I QUIT!"]="I quit, I QUIT!"
G["I raise my brew and hope to be rid of the likes of you!  Cheers, you no good scoundrel, $n!"]="I raise my brew and hope to be rid of the likes of you!  Cheers, you no good scoundrel, $n!"
G["I ran away from my home in Strom after my father tried to kill me."]="I ran away from my home in Strom after my father tried to kill me."
G["I ran to wake up the others when the attack hit. Were they able to escape? I tried to fight off the soldiers with a skinning knife..."]="I ran to wake up the others when the attack hit. Were they able to escape? I tried to fight off the soldiers with a skinning knife..."
G["I readied my swords for battle."]="I readied my swords for battle."
G["I realize we have had somewhat differing loyalties in the past, but put your suspicions aside. Our considerable power has been pledged to your leaders in good faith."]="I realize we have had somewhat differing loyalties in the past, but put your suspicions aside. Our considerable power has been pledged to your leaders in good faith."
G["I realize you have only recently joined us, and thus may be unaware of our traditions. In Moonglade, a tremendous celebration is taking place. This is a time of year when we honor our elders, and you are certainly invited! Travel to one of our cities if you wish to join in!"]="Sei que você se juntou a nós recentemente e, portanto, pode não ter conhecimento de nossas tradições. Em Moonglade, uma tremenda celebração está ocorrendo. Esta é uma época do ano em que honramos os mais velhos, e você certamente está convidado! Viagem para uma de nossas cidades, se você deseja participar!"
G["I really can't thank you enough!"]="I really can't thank you enough!"
G["I really did not know what to expect, Eris. I will use my powers to assist you if that is what is asked of me."]="I really did not know what to expect, Eris. I will use my powers to assist you if that is what is asked of me."
G["I really do hate being right all the time."]="Ódio ter sempre razão."
G["I really don't think our situation is so bad.  I am certain it will all be rectified soon and the Sunwell's power will be restored.  It just can't possibly be as bad as everyone is making it out to be."]="Mesmo não acho que nossa situação seja tão ruim. Estou certo de que tudo será corrigido em breve e o poder da Sunwell será restaurado. Simplesmente não pode ser tão ruim quanto tudo mundo está fazendo parecer."
G["I really envy you, $n. You do amazing work."]="I really envy you, $n. You do amazing work."
G["I really hope it didn't eat any of my friends before you beat it up."]="I really hope it didn't eat any of my friends before you beat it up."
G["I really hope you know what you are doing."]="Espero sinceramente que saiba o que está fazendo."
G["I really missed you, Danforth."]="I really missed you, Danforth."
G["I really need a better system for filing these books. Ahh that's the one I wanted."]="I really need a better system for filing these books. Ahh that's the one I wanted."
G["I really need to get going now."]="De verdade que tenho seguir meu caminho."
G["I really need to stop gambling.  Tell them no more cards for me."]="I really need to stop gambling.  Tell them no more cards for me."
G["I really owe you one, so I'll tell ya what. I'll talk to my father about letting you guys join the Tillers Union."]="I really owe you one, so I'll tell ya what. I'll talk to my father about letting you guys join the Tillers Union."
G["I really should charge you for that."]="I really should charge you for that."
G["I really thought I'd be more excited about this..."]="Achava que me emocionaría mais..."
G["I really wasn't built for this. I'm a master orator and diplomat of the people. Are we quite done here yet?"]="Não estou feito para isto. Sou um mestre orador e diplomata do povo. Já temos terminou aqui?"
G["I really wish I could help ya, but I can't! Kurdran's given me direct orders. Now move along!"]="I really wish I could help ya, but I can't! Kurdran's given me direct orders. Now move along!"
G["I recall clearly the gleam of pride in his eye as he stood before me, eager to defeat the enemies of the Light..."]="I recall clearly the gleam of pride in his eye as he stood before me, eager to defeat the enemies of the Light..."
G["I received an update on that just a moment ago. It looks like out of $2061w light leather needed, we have $2060w. As for the others, the report indicated that we've gathered $2063w of $2064w medium leather, and $2069w out of our $2071w thick leather quota."]="Recebi uma atualização sobre isso há apenas um momento. Parece que fosse do couro leve de $2061w necessário, temos $2060w. Quanto aos outros, o relatório indicou que reunimos $2063w de couro meio de $2064w e $2069w de nossa cota de couro de $2071w de espessura."
G["I received the majority of my weapons training from Ilyenia Moonfire in the Warrior's Terrace.  You would do well to seek her out if you desire to learn the use of a new weapon."]="I received the majority of my weapons training from Ilyenia Moonfire in the Warrior's Terrace.  You would do well to seek her out if you desire to learn the use of a new weapon."
G["I received word that you were able to help Ranger Valanna and the lieutenant at Zeb'Sora.\n\nThank you, $c. I suppose I should make my way back to Farstrider Enclave now."]="I received word that you were able to help Ranger Valanna and the lieutenant at Zeb'Sora.\n\nThank you, $c. I suppose I should make my way back to Farstrider Enclave now."
G["I recently came here to observe the Winterfin murlocs. Disguised as one of them, I kept my distance and took notes on their day-to-day life.\n\nHowever, not long after I arrived, that all changed.\n\nAn earthquake in Coldarra caused a landslide, which exposed the nearby caverns. Out came a strange makrura who stole away with the Winterfins' tadpoles. When the murlocs went into the caverns to rescue their young, they re-emerged, glowing and under the makrura's influence.\n\nNow the unaffected have retreated to here, and I have reluctantly assumed their leadership."]="I recently came here to observe the Winterfin murlocs. Disguised as one of them, I kept my distance and took notes on their day-to-day life.\n\nHowever, not long after I arrived, that all changed.\n\nAn earthquake in Coldarra caused a landslide, which exposed the nearby caverns. Out came a strange makrura who stole away with the Winterfins' tadpoles. When the murlocs went into the caverns to rescue their young, they re-emerged, glowing and under the makrura's influence.\n\nNow the unaffected have retreated to here, and I have reluctantly assumed their leadership."
G["I reckon I'll head back to Stoneplow and rest my dang arms."]="I reckon I'll head back to Stoneplow and rest my dang arms."
G["I reckon I'll see you over there."]="Suponho que os verei ali."
G["I reckon that the odds of obtaining such a piece would be a one in a million! A once in a lifetime skin! Even the most disciplined artisans of the craft would no doubt fail several hundred times in the process of skinning the beast before a pristine sample was recovered."]="I reckon that the odds of obtaining such a piece would be a one in a million! A once in a lifetime skin! Even the most disciplined artisans of the craft would no doubt fail several hundred times in the process of skinning the beast before a pristine sample was recovered."
G["I reckon we got enough."]="Acho que temos suficiente."
G["I reckon we're almost there now."]="Calculo que já quase temos chegado."
G["I recognize your stench. You're the one who stealthed by me on the back of that snow leopard runt!"]="I recognize your stench. You're the one who stealthed by me on the back of that snow leopard runt!"
G["I recommend evisceration!"]="I recommend evisceration!"
G["I recommend that you return to Anvilmar, $n... and quickly!  I'll send the signal to the Gnomeregan Airmen."]="I recommend that you return to Anvilmar, $n... and quickly!  I'll send the signal to the Gnomeregan Airmen."
G["I recommend you buy like there was no tomorrow. Who knows how long it will be until you find deals this good again."]="I recommend you buy like there was no tomorrow. Who knows how long it will be until you find deals this good again."
G["I recovered your armor and weapons. Victory or death!"]="E recuperei sua armadura e seus armas. Vitória ou morte!"
G["I refuse to believe that all of my brethren support Garrosh."]="Me recuso a acreditar que todos os orcs apoiam Garrosh."
G["I refuse to concede defeat! I am a prince of the Eredar! I... am..."]="I refuse to concede defeat! I am a prince of the Eredar! I... am..."
G["I refuse to outlive my daughter."]="I refuse to outlive my daughter."
G["I refuse to take your guesses if you aren't participating in the brawl yourself. You need \"skin in the game\", if you will.\nGo talk to one of the guards and queue for the brawl. Then we can play."]="I refuse to take your guesses if you aren't participating in the brawl yourself. You need \"skin in the game\", if you will.\nGo talk to one of the guards and queue for the brawl. Then we can play."
G["I regret nothing!"]="Não me arrepiento de nada!"
G["I regret nothing."]="Não me arrepiento de nada."
G["I regret that I must fight this $n."]="I regret that I must fight this $n."
G["I regret to inform you all that we sent home another ten soldiers today - in body bags."]="Sinto informar de que hoje enviamos a outros dez soldados a casa... em bolsas de cadáveres."
G["I regret to inform you that the evacuee I was charged with escorting is no more. Would you please allow me to escort another evacuee? I won't fail you again!"]="I regret to inform you that the evacuee I was charged with escorting is no more. Would you please allow me to escort another evacuee? I won't fail you again!"
G["I regret to inform you that you have failed your examination, doctor."]="I regret to inform you that you have failed your examination, doctor."
G["I regret to say that I cannot aid you, $gnoble sir:gentle lady;, until you learn more of working with leather. Speak with Faldron or Darianna here instead. They can teach you the skill you require."]="Sinto dizer que não posso ajudar você, $gnoble senhor: gentil dama;, até que não saiba melhor como trabalhar com o couro. Vê a falar com Faldron ou Darianna. Podem ensinar a habilidade O que precisa."
G["I release you from the curse of flesh!"]="Te libero da maldição da carne!"
G["I release you from this fate Leyara. May you finally find your peace in death."]="Te libero deste destino. Tomara encontre a paz na morte."
G["I remember Gina! I bought some supplies from her, a few days back. Here's the money. Tell her I said hello."]="Me acordo de Gina! Lhe compré algumas provisiones há uns dias. Aqui tem o dinheiro. Salúdala por mim."
G["I remember a time when the venerable Silkmaster Tsai created a strand of silk so fine it sliced through the earth when he dropped it. We never saw it again."]="I remember a time when the venerable Silkmaster Tsai created a strand of silk so fine it sliced through the earth when he dropped it. We never saw it again."
G["I remember a time when there were no orcs. Can you imagine it? No damned orcs!"]="Lembrança uma época na que não havia orcs. Te o imaginas? Sem um maldito orc!"
G["I remember everything..."]="O lembrança tudo..."
G["I remember it well.  It was a bright, shiny day..."]="O lembrança bem. Era um dia claro e soleado..."
G["I remember my first experiment gone awry. These fields were crawling with super grubs the likes of which had not been seen in this age of the world."]="I remember my first experiment gone awry. These fields were crawling with super grubs the likes of which had not been seen in this age of the world."
G["I remember now... it's all your fault!"]="Já me acordo... É tudo culpar sua!"
G["I remember telling Silas, \"I never want to see my family again.\""]="I remember telling Silas, \"I never want to see my family again.\""
G["I remember this one time, Keeshan and I were out fishing at the Lakeshire bridge and Keeshan farted. Don't think Oslow ever forgave Keeshan for that one..."]="I remember this one time, Keeshan and I were out fishing at the Lakeshire bridge and Keeshan farted. Don't think Oslow ever forgave Keeshan for that one..."
G["I remember well the sting of defeat at the conclusion of the Third War. I have waited far too long for my revenge. Now the shadow of the Legion falls over this world. It is only a matter of time until all of your failed creation... is undone."]="I remember well the sting of defeat at the conclusion of the Third War. I have waited far too long for my revenge. Now the shadow of the Legion falls over this world. It is only a matter of time until all of your failed creation... is undone."
G["I remember what you can do with those elixirs of yours.  Can your elixirs help out an old friend?"]="I remember what you can do with those elixirs of yours.  Can your elixirs help out an old friend?"
G["I remember when I was just a wee little lad... the other boys would swim down to the bottom of Loch Modan to pick up sand dollars and seashells.  Oskar and I were stuck on the lake's surface, kicking our legs uselessly into the air, but we couldn't join them."]="Lembro-me de quando eu era apenas um menino pequenino... os outros meninos nadavam até o fundo do lago Modan para pegar dólares de areia e conchas do mar. Oskar e eu estávamos presos na superfície do lago, chutando as pernas inutilmente no ar, mas não conseguimos nos juntar a elas."
G["I remember when Vol'jin and I first came to this land. The Horde was just an idea then. A hope. We needed one another."]="I remember when Vol'jin and I first came to this land. The Horde was just an idea then. A hope. We needed one another."
G["I remember when my brother and I would camp alone in the Azshara wilderness. Look at it now."]="I remember when my brother and I would camp alone in the Azshara wilderness. Look at it now."
G["I remember when my shop saw this much traffic..."]="I remember when my shop saw this much traffic..."
G["I remember when the Barrens was ... barren. And we liked it!"]="I remember when the Barrens was ... barren. And we liked it!"
G["I remember you... in the mountains.... But you... what is this? Where am--"]="Os lembrança… das montanhas… Mas, vocês… que é isto? Onde…?"
G["I report you to HR!"]="I report you to HR!"
G["I represent the strength which bolsters you as a young druid.  I am the strength of the body, and the strength of the heart.  You have already come to know this in your training, and you draw upon this when you take on the aspect of the bear.\n\nContinue to keep the balance in all things, young one, and keep your perspective clear and true.  When you need me... I will be there for you."]="I represent the strength which bolsters you as a young druid.  I am the strength of the body, and the strength of the heart.  You have already come to know this in your training, and you draw upon this when you take on the aspect of the bear.\n\nContinue to keep the balance in all things, young one, and keep your perspective clear and true.  When you need me... I will be there for you."
G["I represent the strength which bolsters you as a young druid.  You have come to me to learn this strength, young one, and I will teach this to you.  I will teach you all that is the spirit bear, provided you will listen and understand.\n\nIn order to know what it means to draw upon my spirit, you need to understand the importance of the strength of the body, as well as the strength of the heart."]="I represent the strength which bolsters you as a young druid.  You have come to me to learn this strength, young one, and I will teach this to you.  I will teach you all that is the spirit bear, provided you will listen and understand.\n\nIn order to know what it means to draw upon my spirit, you need to understand the importance of the strength of the body, as well as the strength of the heart."
G["I request that you summon birds to sing pleasant meadow-tunes into my Doloria's ears, while she sleeps."]="I request that you summon birds to sing pleasant meadow-tunes into my Doloria's ears, while she sleeps."
G["I require a chrono-beacon, Sa'at."]="Eu preciso de um cronômetro, Sa'at."
G["I require a teleport to Naxxramas."]="Desejo que me teletransportes a Naxxramas."
G["I require a vial of aqual quintessence, Hydraxis, for I go to the Molten Core to extinguish a rune of the Firelords."]="Preciso um frasco de quintaesência de água, Hidráxis, me dirijo ao Núcleo Derretido a extinguir uma runa dos senhores do Fogo."
G["I require aid."]="Preciso ajuda."
G["I require all my students to prove their dedication. Now it's your turn..."]="Exijo que todos meus estudantes demuestren seu dedicação. É seu turno..."
G["I require assistance in recovering a piece of my Demoniac's Threads, Al'tabim."]="I require assistance in recovering a piece of my Demoniac's Threads, Al'tabim."
G["I require assistance in recovering a piece of my Illusionist's Attire, Al'tabim."]="Preciso que me ajude a recuperar uma peça de meus Ropagens de ilusionista, Al'tabim."
G["I require assistance!"]="Preciso ajuda!"
G["I require flagging."]="Desejo que me marques."
G["I require more bodies! Bring them to me at once!"]="I require more bodies! Bring them to me at once!"
G["I require more of the Secret Signal Powder, Kadrak."]="preciso de mais polvos de santo e senha, Kadrak."
G["I require priest training."]="Eu preciso de treinamento para padres."
G["I require repairs and supplies, Corvus."]="Preciso reparações e suprimentos, Corvus."
G["I require rogue training."]="Eu preciso de treinamento desonesto."
G["I require some components, Sorely."]="Eu preciso de algum componentes, Sorely."
G["I require the aid of another spirit hunter, Ar'tor."]="Eu preciso da ajuda de outro caçador de espíritos, Ar'tor."
G["I require the flame, master."]="preciso de chama, mestre."
G["I require training, Arnok."]="Eu preciso de treinamento, Arnok."
G["I require training, Daryl."]="Preciso treinamento, Daryl."
G["I require training, Grimnur."]="Eu preciso de treinamento, Grimnur."
G["I require training, Highlord."]="Eu preciso de treinamento, Grão-lorde."
G["I require training, Krenk."]="Preciso treinamento, Krenk."
G["I require training, Lumak."]="Eu preciso de treinamento, Lumak."
G["I require training, Nissa."]="Preciso treinamento, Nissa."
G["I require training, Zamja."]="Eu preciso de treinamento, Zamja."
G["I require training, sir!"]="Senhor, preciso treinamento!"
G["I require training."]="Eu preciso de treinamento."
G["I require warrior training."]="Eu preciso de treinamento de guerreiro."
G["I require water breathing, Garren."]="Eu preciso de água para respirar, Garren."
G["I require your life essence to maintain my existence in this realm."]="Preciso seu essência vital para conservar meu presença neste reino."
G["I retired from battle to live in peace with my family. It seems battle will not let me retire so easily."]="I retired from battle to live in peace with my family. It seems battle will not let me retire so easily."
G["I return from the grave to do my master's bidding."]="I return from the grave to do my master's bidding."
G["I return you whence you came!"]="Te devuelvo ao lugar de onde veio!"
G["I return! A second chance to carve your skull!"]="I return! A second chance to carve your skull!"
G["I return... to the earth."]="Vuelvo... à terra."
G["I return... to... da... sands..."]="I return... to... da... sands..."
G["I returned back to camp with my quarry. Shokia would be pleased."]="Volví ao acampamento com a presa. Shokia estaria encantado."
G["I returned from the grave to take my revenge!"]="E voltado da tumba para consumar meu vingança!"
G["I returned to find Rell bein' attacked by hozen! Again!"]="Volví e me encontrei aos hozen atacando a Relh. Outra vez!"
G["I returned to my people and was greeted with smiling faces and outstretched arms, mostly from the Broken. The prejudices against us from many draenei had continued in my absence. But it was as if they knew that I was coming, and I soon found out why.\n\nVelen, the prophet and leader of all of the draenei, had seen my return in one of his visions and was there to greet me as well. He asked to speak with me in private and as I related my story to him, he nodded and smiled, for this too he had foreseen."]="I returned to my people and was greeted with smiling faces and outstretched arms, mostly from the Broken. The prejudices against us from many draenei had continued in my absence. But it was as if they knew that I was coming, and I soon found out why.\n\nVelen, the prophet and leader of all of the draenei, had seen my return in one of his visions and was there to greet me as well. He asked to speak with me in private and as I related my story to him, he nodded and smiled, for this too he had foreseen."
G["I revel in your pain!"]="I revel in your pain!"
G["I risk my own life and free him so that he may prove his innocence.  If I can, I'll help him in any way."]="Arrisco minha própria vida e o liberto para que ele possa provar sua inocência. Se eu puder, eu o ajudarei de qualquer maneira."
G["I run now!"]="Corro agora!"
G["I run the fights around here.  You want to place a bet, gamble with confidence - anyone caught fixin' fights gets to walk the plank.\n\nI'll make sure of that myself!"]="I run the fights around here.  You want to place a bet, gamble with confidence - anyone caught fixin' fights gets to walk the plank.\n\nI'll make sure of that myself!"
G["I run the tightest airship in Azeroth. She used to be fitted with twin light cannons and enough bombs to flatten a city, you know... her mere shadow was enough to rout armies.\n\nWhat? Of course it's true!"]="I run the tightest airship in Azeroth. She used to be fitted with twin light cannons and enough bombs to flatten a city, you know... her mere shadow was enough to rout armies.\n\nWhat? Of course it's true!"
G["I run you through!"]="Te atravieso!"
G["I sacrifice this human in the name of our dark master!"]="Sacrifico a este humano no nome de nosso sombrio senhor!"
G["I said KNEEL!"]="E dito que te arrodilhes!"
G["I said to myself, \"I'm gonna punch that dragon in the face!\""]="E disse para mim a mim mesmo: \"Vou dar um soco a esse dragão em toda a rosto!\""
G["I said ye had the blood of a blacksmith in ye, and I was right. Go to Ironforge, to The Great Forge, and find yerself a Dwarven smith by the name of Bengus Deepforge. My teacher, and one of the greatest smiths I've ever known."]="Eu disse que você tinha o sangue de um ferreiro em você, e eu estava certo. Vá para Ironforge, para a Grande Forja, e encontre um ferreiro anão chamado Bengus Deepforge. Meu professor e um dos maiores ferreiros que eu já conheci."
G["I said, NO transmatter! At least I'm not a mechagnome anymore."]="I said, NO transmatter! At least I'm not a mechagnome anymore."
G["I said, SEARCH the bodies BEFORE you eat them!"]="I said, SEARCH the bodies BEFORE you eat them!"
G["I salvaged what I could from the nearby wreckage, but I can only stay down for so long..."]="Eu recuperei o que pude dos destroços próximos, mas só posso ficar por tanto tempo..."
G["I save you, Kiryn!"]="Eu te salvará, Kiryn!"
G["I saw 'em draggin' Boldbrew, kickin' and bitin', towards some hut south o' here. Now if ye hurry, ye can help her, and she might know more."]="I saw 'em draggin' Boldbrew, kickin' and bitin', towards some hut south o' here. Now if ye hurry, ye can help her, and she might know more."
G["I saw Dampwick ride across on that thing. I'd rather use a Slow Fall spell, but I don't know that one yet."]="Vi Dampwick atravessar aquela coisa. Prefiro usar um feitiço Slow Fall, mas ainda não o conheço."
G["I saw Dampwick ride across on that thing. I'd rather use a Slow Fall spell, but I don't know that one yet.\n\nWant some training, $n?"]="Vi a Mechamojada montado em essa coisa. Gostaria usar um feitiço de Fica lenta, mas não o conheço ainda.\n\nQue treinamento, $n?"
G["I saw Little Timmy the other day, Ana. Would you like a kitten?"]="O outro dia vi ao pequeno Timmy, Ana. Que um gatito?"
G["I saw a Sea Giant once.  It's not something I would care to see again.  Burp!"]="Uma vez vi a um gigantesco de mar. E não gostaria voltar a ver outro desses! Ugh!"
G["I saw a murloc swim by my window."]="Vi a um murloc passar nadar por meu ventana."
G["I saw a peddler setting up his trade goods in the Golden Lantern. I will mark the location on your map."]="I saw a peddler setting up his trade goods in the Golden Lantern. I will mark the location on your map."
G["I saw first-hand what the sha did to my soldiers in the Jade Forest. My strongest men were rendered helpless by crippling doubt."]="I saw first-hand what the sha did to my soldiers in the Jade Forest. My strongest men were rendered helpless by crippling doubt."
G["I saw her, you know.\n\nMazu. The goddess of the sea.\n\nWorst storm of my life. I was young and inexperienced. I went overboard. Everything went dark - I was done for.\n\nThen she appeared before me, clear as a summer afternoon. Beautiful like you couldn't imagine - shells around her neck and strings of pearls on her hips. She smiled and held out her slender arm.\n\nNext thing I remember, Dog had me on his back at the surface and the crew was pulling me aboard. Never saw him before - crew said he came out of nowhere. But I know where he came from."]="I saw her, you know.\n\nMazu. The goddess of the sea.\n\nWorst storm of my life. I was young and inexperienced. I went overboard. Everything went dark - I was done for.\n\nThen she appeared before me, clear as a summer afternoon. Beautiful like you couldn't imagine - shells around her neck and strings of pearls on her hips. She smiled and held out her slender arm.\n\nNext thing I remember, Dog had me on his back at the surface and the crew was pulling me aboard. Never saw him before - crew said he came out of nowhere. But I know where he came from."
G["I saw it first!"]="Eu o vi primeiro!"
G["I saw it with me own two eyes!  The biggest Makura ye ever seen, bigger'n a mountain giant's fist it was, clawed its way right up the side of one o' them twin colossals.  I dunno how yeh plan on gettin' up there, but the beast's sure to have a load of treasure if yeh do."]="I saw it with me own two eyes!  The biggest Makura ye ever seen, bigger'n a mountain giant's fist it was, clawed its way right up the side of one o' them twin colossals.  I dunno how yeh plan on gettin' up there, but the beast's sure to have a load of treasure if yeh do."
G["I saw my captors die horrible deaths.\n\nAnd I laughed."]="I saw my captors die horrible deaths.\n\nAnd I laughed."
G["I saw one, I know I did..."]="Vi um, sei que o vi..."
G["I saw signs of a campfire up ahead, on the eastern side of the statue."]="I saw signs of a campfire up ahead, on the eastern side of the statue."
G["I saw soldiers from Ironforge fighting a fire before.  They were heroes!"]="I saw soldiers from Ironforge fighting a fire before.  They were heroes!"
G["I saw soldiers from Stormwind fighting a fire before.  They were heroes!"]="Eu vi soldados de Ventobravo lutando contra um incêndio antes. Eles eram heróis!"
G["I saw some killing children in battle. The bloodlust was upon them - I could not condone it but I could see how it could happen, but surely they will not make a ritual sacrifice out of this defenseless captive."]="I saw some killing children in battle. The bloodlust was upon them - I could not condone it but I could see how it could happen, but surely they will not make a ritual sacrifice out of this defenseless captive."
G["I saw someone setting one of those fire totems. It was dark, but I remember they were wearing red."]="I saw someone setting one of those fire totems. It was dark, but I remember they were wearing red."
G["I saw someone up there whose jaw fell off.  I wonder if Mordo can fix him up?"]="I saw someone up there whose jaw fell off.  I wonder if Mordo can fix him up?"
G["I saw that move you pulled with the grapple. The boys will be hearing about that one when we get back for sure."]="I saw that move you pulled with the grapple. The boys will be hearing about that one when we get back for sure."
G["I saw the Wastewander and their leader, Caliph Scorpidsting, heading south of here.  Watch out, they look like they've toughened up some!"]="Vi o Wastewander e seu líder, o Califa Scorpidsting, indo para o sul daqui. Cuidado, eles parecem ter endureceram um pouco!"
G["I saw the biggest bug you've ever seen wandering around one of those Silithid hives.  Or maybe it was both of them.  I think the heat's getting to me...do you see that sand kitten over there?"]="Eu vi o maior inseto que você já viu andando por uma daquelas colméias de Silithid. Ou talvez fossem os dois. Acho que o calor está me afetando... você vê aquele gatinho de areia ali?"
G["I saw the same look in his eyes when he died. Terenas could hardly believe it."]="Vi a mesma olhar nos seus olhos quando morreu. Terenas não se o podia acreditar."
G["I saw their leader. He was heading further up the wall. I'll mark it on your map."]="I saw their leader. He was heading further up the wall. I'll mark it on your map."
G["I saw them loading a shipment of artifacts onto the boats the other day.\n\nIt was the most gold I've ever seen in one place!"]="I saw them loading a shipment of artifacts onto the boats the other day.\n\nIt was the most gold I've ever seen in one place!"
G["I saw you across the way and was hoping you were going to stop by.  So what can I do for you sweetie?"]="Eu vi você do outro lado do caminho e esperava que você estivesse aqui. Então, o que posso fazer por você, querida?"
G["I saw your fighting today. Less refined than some of the masters who enter the tournament, but certainly effective. I will watch you in the future, and learn."]="I saw your fighting today. Less refined than some of the masters who enter the tournament, but certainly effective. I will watch you in the future, and learn."
G["I saw... only darkness."]="Somente vi... escuridão."
G["I say a prayer for you now, lost soul. May the Light take you gracefully."]="I say a prayer for you now, lost soul. May the Light take you gracefully."
G["I say just let the crocolisks come. They'll stop attacking eventually. Why interfere?"]="Dejemos que os crocoliscos venham. Já deixarão de atacar. Por que interferir?"
G["I say nothing!"]="Não dizer nada!"
G["I say nothing! <snort>"]="I say nothing! <snort>"
G["I say we fire it. Cut the rope."]="Adiante. Curto a corda."
G["I say we need less talking and more fighting."]="Acho que precisamos de falar menos e lutar mais."
G["I say! I simply must find myself another line of work."]="I say! I simply must find myself another line of work."
G["I say! Raise a glass, my friend!\n\nTake in the sights here.\n\nThis entire region has been hidden away for ages, you know."]="I say! Raise a glass, my friend!\n\nTake in the sights here.\n\nThis entire region has been hidden away for ages, you know."
G["I say, it looks like I've racked up another win!"]="Olha só, parece que eu ganhei outra vez!"
G["I scouted the ruins. The blood elves are here in full force."]="E explorado as ruínas. Os elfos de sangue estão por todas partes."
G["I see - and where is Uncle Gao?"]="Entendo... e onde está o tio Gao?"
G["I see - one of your great Alliance warriors, is it? You have chosen a lion as your crest."]="I see - one of your great Alliance warriors, is it? You have chosen a lion as your crest."
G["I see a break in the mist up ahead. We're getting closer!"]="Vejo um claro na névoa. Nos estamos acercando!"
G["I see an opening! Here I come, Amber!"]="Vejo uma saída! Além vou, Amber!"
G["I see bandages stacked in the same piles as weapons.  I see food that clearly has been left to expire in the sun, when I CLEARLY provided you with a tent for shade."]="I see bandages stacked in the same piles as weapons.  I see food that clearly has been left to expire in the sun, when I CLEARLY provided you with a tent for shade."
G["I see endless suffering. I see torment. I see rage. I see everything..."]="Vejo sofrimento sem fim. Vejo tormento. Vejo rabia. O vejo tudo..."
G["I see great darkness looming in the days ahead."]="I see great darkness looming in the days ahead."
G["I see great profit possibility on the horizon. All of Bilgewater Port's assets are about to flow to me."]="I see great profit possibility on the horizon. All of Bilgewater Port's assets are about to flow to me."
G["I see it clearly now. I renounce my loyalties to House Sunstrider and its false prince."]="Agorao vejo claro. Retiro meu lealdada a estirpe Andarilho do Sol e ao seu falso Príncipe."
G["I see it, Shokia. I'll go take a look."]="O vejo, Shokia. Irei a dar um olhada."
G["I see many threes repeating..."]="I see many threes repeating..."
G["I see no one. Ha. Stupid trolls can't even collapse a tunnel properly."]="I see no one. Ha. Stupid trolls can't even collapse a tunnel properly."
G["I see no reason to deny our trust."]="Não vejo razão para negarle nossa confiança."
G["I see nothing but purple before me..."]="Não vejo mais que púrpura ante mim..."
G["I see now why your Alliance and your Horde cannot stop fighting."]="Agora entendo por que a Horda e a Aliança não deixam de lutar."
G["I see now... my hatred... consumed me. Tell Ban... all is... forgiven."]="I see now... my hatred... consumed me. Tell Ban... all is... forgiven."
G["I see one coming now! Looks like a real winner. Keep it cool, $n. Keep it cool."]="Agora vejo que chega um! Parece um verdadeiro vencedor. Mantenha a calma, $n. Mantenha a calma."
G["I see our city as a beacon of light, showing the way."]="Eu vejo nossa cidade como um farol mostrando o caminho."
G["I see our jinyu allies are prepared. How go the rest of the preparations?"]="Nossos aliados jinyu estão prontos. E o resto dos preparativos?"
G["I see potential in you $n. Now grab a hammer and some of those scraps, you need a lot of practice."]="I see potential in you $n. Now grab a hammer and some of those scraps, you need a lot of practice."
G["I see right through your disguise, $r. Number Two! Number Two kill!"]="Posso ver além do seu disfarce, $r. Número dois! Número dois, dale morte!"
G["I see some interesting characters come and go here at the port. Watch yourself, $n. It's never clear who to trust, what with all of the shady activity that goes on here..."]="I see some interesting characters come and go here at the port. Watch yourself, $n. It's never clear who to trust, what with all of the shady activity that goes on here..."
G["I see such a bright future for you, my $g boy : girl;! What shall I teach you today?"]="Vejo que terá um futuro brilhante, jovem! Que deveria ensinar hoje?"
G["I see that happening sometime between tomorrow and the next decade. Definitely."]="I see that happening sometime between tomorrow and the next decade. Definitely."
G["I see that look in your eyes. Don't think I'm ignorant to the feelings of your people. I'm just as uncomfortable having to suffer the distrusting glares of guard and citizen alike.\n\nI only stick around because of my obligation to Varian. He treats me as an equal... the way the Alliance should have treated my people.\n\nNow, if you're done gawking, the Scourge is making a mess of things in Stormwind. Why don't you go do something about it?"]="I see that look in your eyes. Don't think I'm ignorant to the feelings of your people. I'm just as uncomfortable having to suffer the distrusting glares of guard and citizen alike.\n\nI only stick around because of my obligation to Varian. He treats me as an equal... the way the Alliance should have treated my people.\n\nNow, if you're done gawking, the Scourge is making a mess of things in Stormwind. Why don't you go do something about it?"
G["I see that my slumber was brief. I recognize Mel'jarak, lord of the skies. Once, my brother. Now, no longer."]="Vejo que meu sonho foi breve. Reconheço a Mel'jarak, senhor dos céus. Uma vez foi meu irmão. Já não."
G["I see that my slumber was brief. I recognize Ta'yak there, just in front of the palace. The Empress's champion of blades. In my time, he stood undefeated."]="I see that my slumber was brief. I recognize Ta'yak there, just in front of the palace. The Empress's champion of blades. In my time, he stood undefeated."
G["I see that my slumber was brief. I recognize Un'sok down there. I see he has renamed himself Ambershaper. Ha! His skills never did surpass my own."]="I see that my slumber was brief. I recognize Un'sok down there. I see he has renamed himself Ambershaper. Ha! His skills never did surpass my own."
G["I see that my slumber was brief. I recognize Zor'lok, voice of the Empress. Her obedient little pet."]="Vejo que meu sonho foi breve. Reconheço a Zor'lok, voz da Imperatriz. Seu ajudante obediente."
G["I see that now. Our strength is yours to command, High King. May this be the first of many victories."]="Agorao entendo. Nossa força é sua, Majestade. Que seja a primeira de muitas vitórias."
G["I see that thoughtful frown, Tahu."]="I see that thoughtful frown, Tahu."
G["I see that you did it, $n. You're a credit to your race."]="Vejo que o conseguiu, $n. É uma honra para o seu raça."
G["I see that you have found the eye.\n\n<Master Ryson grins.>\n\nWell, give it to me!"]="I see that you have found the eye.\n\n<Master Ryson grins.>\n\nWell, give it to me!"
G["I see that you hold the Doomhammer. Have all of our greatest heroes fallen, grandson?"]="I see that you hold the Doomhammer. Have all of our greatest heroes fallen, grandson?"
G["I see that you've been putting in your time around here, $c.\n\nPut in more; the demons aren't gone yet, rookie."]="Vejo que tem estado invirtiendo seu tempo por aqui, $c.\n\nInverter mais, ainda restam demônios, novato."
G["I see the Dragonmaw have thrown in their lot with Garrosh."]="I see the Dragonmaw have thrown in their lot with Garrosh."
G["I see the dragon up ahead.  She is larger than I had first anticipated."]="Vejo ao dragão aí linha de frente. É mais grande do que achava."
G["I see the exit! Hurry, hurry!"]="Vejo a saída! Depressa, depressa!"
G["I see the hollow metal shell of a once great ally, and the precious gift of the Titans wasted."]="I see the hollow metal shell of a once great ally, and the precious gift of the Titans wasted."
G["I see the naive hope in your eyes. You... think you are my saviors? Wring that mocking pity from your hearts and focus it inwards, for you shall soon know my agony."]="I see the naive hope in your eyes. You... think you are my saviors? Wring that mocking pity from your hearts and focus it inwards, for you shall soon know my agony."
G["I see the paragon has been awakened."]="I see the paragon has been awakened."
G["I see the paragons have finally arrived to save the day."]="I see the paragons have finally arrived to save the day."
G["I see them now... assassins from Skettis!"]="I see them now... assassins from Skettis!"
G["I see them wiggling around in the water, but they aren't biting!"]="I see them wiggling around in the water, but they aren't biting!"
G["I see those fools at the Abbey sent some fresh meat for us."]="Parece que esses idiotas da Abadia nos têm enviada carne fresca."
G["I see through your disguise, Lady Nightswood. YOU THINK THAT YOU CAN FOOL ME?!"]="I see through your disguise, Lady Nightswood. YOU THINK THAT YOU CAN FOOL ME?!"
G["I see twisted steel and smell sundered earth."]="Eu vejo aço retorcido e cheiro terra rachada."
G["I see we have a pet battler here in our training grounds.  Cloud serpents are cut out to do almost anything, including fighting other pets!  The key to finding the hatchlings is building a friendship with an adult.  Once you are exalted with the order, you will find them scattered across the arboretum."]="Vejo que temos a um lutador para o duelo de ajudantes em nossos campos de treinamento. Os dragões nimbo estão feitos para qualquer coisa, inclusive para lutar contra outras ajudantes! A importante para encontrar as filhotes é se fingir amigo de um adulto. Depois que te eleven à ordem, as encontrar repartidas por tudo o arboreto."
G["I see what you doing... maybe if we treat it nice it will lead us back to more big-tongues."]="I see what you doing... maybe if we treat it nice it will lead us back to more big-tongues."
G["I see what you mean, I suppose...\n\nYou know, I'm just here because I want to expand my horizons a bit, see the world and whatnot.\n\nI'm not terribly concerned with the goings on of others.\n\nNice to meet you, though."]="I see what you mean, I suppose...\n\nYou know, I'm just here because I want to expand my horizons a bit, see the world and whatnot.\n\nI'm not terribly concerned with the goings on of others.\n\nNice to meet you, though."
G["I see what you're doing. You're gonna take all the druid forms and make them into one super-form!"]="Já vejo o que pretendes. Vai pegar todas as formas de druida e as vai converter em uma superforma."
G["I see you are growing in numbers, my brethren. Tell me of your progress in implementing our master's plan."]="I see you are growing in numbers, my brethren. Tell me of your progress in implementing our master's plan."
G["I see you checking out our legally obtained racing rams...  I can see you want in on the ram racing sensation...  But before you can play, you gotta work.\n\nWell, work and play are pretty much the same when it comes to these rams."]="I see you checking out our legally obtained racing rams...  I can see you want in on the ram racing sensation...  But before you can play, you gotta work.\n\nWell, work and play are pretty much the same when it comes to these rams."
G["I see you did it with your pants down and your hammer in your hand."]="I see you did it with your pants down and your hammer in your hand."
G["I see you know more of the secret of steel than I do. That is good, for it is meant to be taken. Now you must travel to the jungle south of the human lands, to the goblin city of Booty Bay. There you will find a Goblin named Brikk Keencraft. I do not like Goblins but his knowledge of the secret of steel is unmatched by any I know of."]="Vejo que você conhece mais o segredo do aço do que eu. Isso é bom, pois deve ser tomado. Agora você deve viajar para a selva ao sul das terras humanas, para a cidade goblin de Booty Bay. Lá você encontrará um Goblin chamado Brikk Keencraft. Não gosto de duendes, mas seu conhecimento do segredo do aço é incomparável a qualquer um que eu conheça."
G["I see you misplaced that chapter you worked so hard to put together, $n. Well, you left it right here!"]="Vejo que perdeu esse capítulo que tanto trabalho te costó preparar, $n. O havia saído logo aqui!"
G["I see you there! Yes, you! Come here. I'm going to bury you!"]="I see you there! Yes, you! Come here. I'm going to bury you!"
G["I see you too are gathering souls for your own ends. Are we really so different, 'champion'?"]="I see you too are gathering souls for your own ends. Are we really so different, 'champion'?"
G["I see you too are gathering souls for your own ends. Are we really so different, champion?"]="I see you too are gathering souls for your own ends. Are we really so different, champion?"
G["I see you were able to get some help."]="fico feliz em que tenha pedido conseguir ajuda."
G["I see you!"]="Te estou vendo!"
G["I see you're a battle pet trainer, $r. How about you test your skills against the might of a Grimtotem?"]="I see you're a battle pet trainer, $r. How about you test your skills against the might of a Grimtotem?"
G["I see you're fishing... again.  Are you doing better than yesterday?"]="Vejo que está pescando... Outra vez. Vai melhor que ontem?"
G["I see you're here to admire my serpent. Oh, and Agara is quite impressive too."]="Vejo que tem vindo a admirar meu dragão. Ah, e Agara também é impressionante."
G["I see you've arrived. \n\nThis is the eve of the sundering, when the collapse of the Well of Eternity fractured the continents of the world.\n\nHere, we will snatch up the Dragon Soul before it is lost to the mists of time.\n\nBut first, you must bring down the protective wards of Azshara's lackeys. You will find them within the palace. I will scout on ahead.\n\nGood luck, heroes!"]="I see you've arrived. \n\nThis is the eve of the sundering, when the collapse of the Well of Eternity fractured the continents of the world.\n\nHere, we will snatch up the Dragon Soul before it is lost to the mists of time.\n\nBut first, you must bring down the protective wards of Azshara's lackeys. You will find them within the palace. I will scout on ahead.\n\nGood luck, heroes!"
G["I see you've arrived. This is the eve of the sundering, when the collapse of the Well of Eternity fractured the continents of the world."]="I see you've arrived. This is the eve of the sundering, when the collapse of the Well of Eternity fractured the continents of the world."
G["I see you've brought your pets."]="Vejo que tem trazido aos seus ajudantes."
G["I see you, fool!"]="Te vejo, idiota!"
G["I see you, insect! Come closer."]="Te vejo, inseto! Aproxime-se!"
G["I see you, land-walker. Come to me... we shall parlay."]="I see you, land-walker. Come to me... we shall parlay."
G["I see you, little one. Come over here, I wish to speak with you."]="Te vejo, pequena criatura. Venha aqui, quero falar com você."
G["I see you, too, have braved the perils of Kota Peak. You have proven yourself worthy to do battle with me."]="I see you, too, have braved the perils of Kota Peak. You have proven yourself worthy to do battle with me."
G["I see you."]="Te vejo."
G["I see you. Why don'tcha come on up and we settle this Drakkari to maggot."]="I see you. Why don'tcha come on up and we settle this Drakkari to maggot."
G["I see you..."]="Te vejo..."
G["I see your Way of the White Tiger, Jade Serpent, Monkey Crane technique is as good as mine."]="Vejo que seu técnica do Tigre Branco, do Dragão de Jade, do Mono e da Grulha é tão boa como a minha."
G["I see your ancestors, Anchorite!  They writhe and scream in the darkness... they are with us!"]="I see your ancestors, Anchorite!  They writhe and scream in the darkness... they are with us!"
G["I see, I see."]="Já vejo, já vejo."
G["I see."]="Eu vejo."
G["I see.  Then I will do the same."]="Entendo. Em esse atenção, eu farei o mesmo."
G["I see.  Well then, let's get to work, $n!  The Dark Lady needs us, right?"]="Entendo. Bom, pois mãos à obra, $n! A Dama Sombria nos precisa, verdade?"
G["I see.  Well, do the best you can.  And Neeralak, why are you all black and smoky?"]="I see.  Well, do the best you can.  And Neeralak, why are you all black and smoky?"
G["I see. Can I at least get mine serviced? He won't even take a rider."]="Já vejo... Podem ao menos reparar o meu? Nem sequer de que o monten."
G["I see. I'd hoped that we could wait out this invasion, but if the authorities want us to leave, we will leave."]="I see. I'd hoped that we could wait out this invasion, but if the authorities want us to leave, we will leave."
G["I see. Much has transpired since I first entered my long sleep."]="Já vejo. Têm passado muitas coisas desde que comenzó meu largo sonho."
G["I see. So it was this... sha... that caused such violent behavior in our troops?"]="I see. So it was this... sha... that caused such violent behavior in our troops?"
G["I see. Thank you for informing me personally, Battlemaiden."]="I see. Thank you for informing me personally, Battlemaiden."
G["I see. This sha energy has trapped their spirits here, to endlessly relive their failure. It feeds on their despair."]="I see. This sha energy has trapped their spirits here, to endlessly relive their failure. It feeds on their despair."
G["I see. You are more formidable than I had thought."]="Entendo. Você é mais formidável do que eu pensei."
G["I see... Only darkness."]="Somente vejo... escuridão."
G["I see... involved in some shady business, $r? Oh no need to worry - the confidentiality of all transactions is assured.\n\nThis ring you have is a superb piece of work. We can begin the charging process... for a modest fee. Charging the ring will take roughly one half of your world's cycles to complete. In other words, twelve hours.\n\nShall we say 10,000 gold? That's fair."]="I see... involved in some shady business, $r? Oh no need to worry - the confidentiality of all transactions is assured.\n\nThis ring you have is a superb piece of work. We can begin the charging process... for a modest fee. Charging the ring will take roughly one half of your world's cycles to complete. In other words, twelve hours.\n\nShall we say 10,000 gold? That's fair."
G["I see... something. It's very faint, though."]="Vejo... algo. Está muito fraco."
G["I see... this is the path I must take.  Meet up with me back in the cave, heroes."]="Entendo... este é o caminho que devo pegar. Reuníos comigo na caverna, heróis."
G["I see... your eyes never leave the target. Total focus!"]="I see... your eyes never leave the target. Total focus!"
G["I see...she's using him to manipulate them all.."]="I see...she's using him to manipulate them all.."
G["I seek a $g hero : heroine; of the utmost skill.  $G He : She; will gather others to save the Bloodmaul clan, and all of the ogres of these mountains from the tyranny of our gronn oppressors.\n\nReturn to me when you have learned all that you can.  But, $c, keep quiet about this until that time lest the gronn get wind of our underground movement."]="I seek a $g hero : heroine; of the utmost skill.  $G He : She; will gather others to save the Bloodmaul clan, and all of the ogres of these mountains from the tyranny of our gronn oppressors.\n\nReturn to me when you have learned all that you can.  But, $c, keep quiet about this until that time lest the gronn get wind of our underground movement."
G["I seek a sample of your restorative draught, apothecary."]="Busco uma amostra do seu rascunho restaurador, farmacêutico."
G["I seek further druidic training to have a closer understanding of the Earth Mother's will."]="Busco treinamento druídico adicional para entender melhor a vontade da Mãe Terra."
G["I seek further training in the old ways of the druids."]="Desejo receber mais treinamento nas antigas artes dos druidas."
G["I seek further training."]="Desejo receber mais treinamento."
G["I seek more than anything to help young pandaren explore their potential within these grounds. True mastery comes with much time and much practice, but there is value even in finding the first beginnings of a fitting path."]="O que desejo por sobre é ajudar aos pandaren jovens a explorar seu potencial neste lugar. A maestria autêntico chega com muito tempo e muita prática, mas encontrar o início de um caminho adequado também tem seu coragem."
G["I seek more training in the priestly ways."]="Busco mais treinamento nas maneiras sacerdotais."
G["I seek other veterans of the campaign here in Northrend. We are urgently needed to face new foes at home."]="I seek other veterans of the campaign here in Northrend. We are urgently needed to face new foes at home."
G["I seek to understand the importance of strength of the body."]="Eu procuro entender a importância da força do corpo."
G["I seek to understand the importance of strength of the heart."]="Eu procuro entender a importância da força do coração."
G["I seek training as a Blacksmith."]="Busco treinamento como ferreiro."
G["I seek training as a druid."]="Eu procuro treinamento como druida."
G["I seek training in Fishing."]="I seek training in Fishing."
G["I seek training in Pandaren cooking."]="Preciso treinamento em cozinha pandaren."
G["I seek training in the Way of the Brew."]="Preciso treinamento no arte da cerveja."
G["I seek training in the Way of the Grill."]="Preciso treinamento no arte da grelha."
G["I seek training in the Way of the Oven."]="I seek training in the Way of the Oven."
G["I seek training in the Way of the Pot."]="Preciso treinamento no arte do guiso."
G["I seek training in the Way of the Steamer."]="Preciso treinamento no arte da vaporera."
G["I seek training in the Way of the Wok."]="Preciso treinamento no arte do wok."
