G["I sense the taint of corruption upon this $n. Help me destroy it!"]="I sense the taint of corruption upon this $n. Help me destroy it!"
G["I sense the taint of this land in you, footman.  Report to the Bishop before the start of your next shift."]="I sense the taint of this land in you, footman.  Report to the Bishop before the start of your next shift."
G["I sense the tortured spirits, $n. They are this way. Come quickly!"]="Sinto os espíritos torturados, $n. Estão por aqui. Venha, rápido!"
