G["I sense you've cleared the path to my brethren.  My connection to them and to the temple is still strong.  Do you wish to delve deeper inside?"]="Sinto que você abriu o caminho para meus irmãos. Minha conexão com eles e com o templo ainda é forte. Deseja mergulhar mais fundo?"
G["I sense... courage. Willpower. Light. Hmph. That will not do."]="I sense... courage. Willpower. Light. Hmph. That will not do."
G["I sensed a commotion in the village's eastern island."]="I sensed a commotion in the village's eastern island."
