G["I sensed as much, Malfurion. Dark days loom ahead."]="I sensed as much, Malfurion. Dark days loom ahead."
G["I sent Assistant Kieu to the silos to collect a sack of grain but she still hasn't come back. Could you go check on her for me? You can find the silos on the western edge of town."]="I sent Assistant Kieu to the silos to collect a sack of grain but she still hasn't come back. Could you go check on her for me? You can find the silos on the western edge of town."
G["I sent Ranger Salissa south to the enclave and Ranger Lethvalin west to Tranquillien more than a day ago! Have you seen either of them? Are you the aid that's been sent back?"]="Enviei a guarda florestal Salissa ao sul para o enclave e a guarda florestal Lethvalin a oeste para Tranquillien há mais de um dia! Você já viu algum deles? Você é a ajuda que foi enviada de volta?"
G["I sent my pet out to get me shome more to drink.  You'll be shorry when he shows up with a wagon full of Mudder's Milk and you don't get any."]="I sent my pet out to get me shome more to drink.  You'll be shorry when he shows up with a wagon full of Mudder's Milk and you don't get any."
G["I sent you into Stonetalon Mountains with an army.  Your orders were to secure this land for the Horde."]="Te envié a Cordilheira das Torres de Pedra com meu exército. Seus ordens eram manter o controle de Horda nessas terras."
G["I sentence you to death!"]="Os condeno a morrer!"
G["I serve a new master now, mortals!"]="Mortais, agora sirvo a um novo amo!"
