G["I serve my father and respect his plan... but I also serve my own sense of justice.  I have seen enough treachery from my Blackrock brothers to fill a thousand books.  And now they plan to invade Redridge, for no reason other than blind territorialism.\n\nThe treachery stops here.  It's time for the final chapter.  And it's not going to be a happy ending."]="I serve my father and respect his plan... but I also serve my own sense of justice.  I have seen enough treachery from my Blackrock brothers to fill a thousand books.  And now they plan to invade Redridge, for no reason other than blind territorialism.\n\nThe treachery stops here.  It's time for the final chapter.  And it's not going to be a happy ending."
