G["I should very much like to see this island for myself. Perhaps I will see you there?"]="Eu gostaria muito de ver esta ilha com meus próprios olhos. Talvez nos encontremos lá?"
G["I should've broken those damn tablets the day you brought them to me, $n, but I didn't. We might still have our king's wisdom to guide us through these perilous times."]="I should've broken those damn tablets the day you brought them to me, $n, but I didn't. We might still have our king's wisdom to guide us through these perilous times."
