G["I shouldn't even be telling you this but if you can make it past all the critters and beasties in Badlands, you might be able to make it to Searing Gorge.\n\nYes, the Badlands. There's some type of back road the orcs paved near Kargath. Just goes to show you what kind of fools we're dealing with here! A backdoor to hell? What were they thinking?"]="I shouldn't even be telling you this but if you can make it past all the critters and beasties in Badlands, you might be able to make it to Searing Gorge.\n\nYes, the Badlands. There's some type of back road the orcs paved near Kargath. Just goes to show you what kind of fools we're dealing with here! A backdoor to hell? What were they thinking?"
G["I shouldn't have expected these filthy trolls to stay peaceful forever. There's no place for trust with any sympathizers of the Horde."]="Eu não deveria ter esperado que esses trolls imundos ficassem em paz para sempre. Não há lugar para confiar em nenhum simpatizante da Horda."
G["I shouldn't have to submit to this."]="I shouldn't have to submit to this."
