G["I spare your insignificant life as a reward for this amusing betrayal. There may yet be a shred of potential in you."]="I spare your insignificant life as a reward for this amusing betrayal. There may yet be a shred of potential in you."
G["I speak, and the oceans tremble. Fear me, enemies of Hellscream."]="I speak, and the oceans tremble. Fear me, enemies of Hellscream."
G["I specialize in two things: taking tiny things and making them blow up into huge things, and making huge things fit into itty-bitty places.\n\nWhich one do you need today?"]="I specialize in two things: taking tiny things and making them blow up into huge things, and making huge things fit into itty-bitty places.\n\nWhich one do you need today?"
G["I spend all day retrieving parts for the zeppelin and Frezza doesn't even have the decency to pay me an hourly wage. But you're not here about that, are you? I bet you want to know where the zeppelin is located. Well, you're in luck - I have my zeppelin tracking device right here!"]="Passagem o dia tudo recuperando peças para o zeppelin e Frezza nem sequer tem a decência de me pagar um salário por hora. Mas você não está aqui sobre isso, está? Aposto que você quer saber onde o zeppelin está localizado. Bem, você está com sorte - eu tenho meu dispositivo de rastreamento de zeppelin aqui!"
G["I spend half my time in the libraries and the other half caring for the hatchlings."]="Me passo a metade do tempo na biblioteca e a outra metade cuidando das proles."
G["I spent a very long time in Northrend, Krom'gar. I learned much about the Horde in that time."]="E passado muitos anos em Nortúndria, Krom'gar. Em esse tempo aprendi muito sobre a Horda."
G["I spent most of your money on getting a decent massage, goodness knows you could never do it right!"]="I spent most of your money on getting a decent massage, goodness knows you could never do it right!"
G["I spent my life on that wall, $n. I gave up everything I had to become Shado-Pan, to prevent something like this from happening.\n\nI have failed."]="I spent my life on that wall, $n. I gave up everything I had to become Shado-Pan, to prevent something like this from happening.\n\nI have failed."
G["I spent my whole life caring for these trees. Pruning and nurturing them... only fitting that they have joined me in death."]="I spent my whole life caring for these trees. Pruning and nurturing them... only fitting that they have joined me in death."
G["I spent so long trying to find a way to extend my life that I forgot to live it."]="I spent so long trying to find a way to extend my life that I forgot to live it."
G["I spit on the corpse of these filthy naga."]="Escupo sobre os cadáveres desses repugnantes nagas."
G["I spit on you!"]="Me das asco!"
G["I spit on you, Kargath.  The true Horde will crush you!"]="Te escupo, Kargath's. A autêntico Horda te aplastará!"
G["I spit on you, surface filth!"]="Os desprecio, desechos da superfície!"
G["I spoke too quickly, $n.  Even with your support, things are looking grim for our forces out there."]="E falado antes de tempo, $n. Inclusive com o seu apoio a coisa não pinta bem para nossas tropas."
G["I squish you!"]="I squish you!"
G["I sshal ssslaughter you, Darksspear runt!"]="I sshal ssslaughter you, Darksspear runt!"
G["I sshal tasste your blood, landling."]="I sshal tasste your blood, landling."
G["I sssaw you leaving that ssship, sssoftsskin! Sssoon we sshall have you all!"]="I sssaw you leaving that ssship, sssoftsskin! Sssoon we sshall have you all!"
G["I sssee now... Ssscourge wasss not... our greatessst enemy...."]="Agorao vejo... o Flagelo não era... nueto maio inimigo..."
G["I stabbed it in the face! Goregek so good."]="Lhe e apunhalado na rosto! Goregek muito bom."
G["I stand before you - Aggralan, daughter of Ryal, daughter of Sarrak... and I will proudly be your mate, Go'el... in this world or any other."]="Eu sou Aggralan, filha de Ryal, filha de Sarrak... e estarei orgulhosa de ser seu companheira, Go'o... neste mundo ou em qualquer outro."
G["I stand before you - Go'el, Son of Durotan, Son of Garad... and if you would have me, I would be your life-mate."]="I stand before you - Go'el, Son of Durotan, Son of Garad... and if you would have me, I would be your life-mate."
G["I stand before you only a boy in search of lost memories."]="I stand before you only a boy in search of lost memories."
G["I stand vigilant here on these steps where my ancestors thrived. Until now, I have enjoyed a lifetime of freedom. I must do what I can to ensure that my children and my children's children live their lives free of the perils of war. Praise be to King Phaoris and all of his heroic efforts for my people. Our people. I can not quite place it, $r, but I trust you. Go now, $gsister:brother;, there is much to do before the skies darken with conflict."]="I stand vigilant here on these steps where my ancestors thrived. Until now, I have enjoyed a lifetime of freedom. I must do what I can to ensure that my children and my children's children live their lives free of the perils of war. Praise be to King Phaoris and all of his heroic efforts for my people. Our people. I can not quite place it, $r, but I trust you. Go now, $gsister:brother;, there is much to do before the skies darken with conflict."
G["I still cannae believe the Horde stole the Divine Bell, after everything we did to keep it safe in Darnassus."]="I still cannae believe the Horde stole the Divine Bell, after everything we did to keep it safe in Darnassus."
G["I still do not fully understand."]="I still do not fully understand."
G["I still do not understand."]="Sigo sem entender."
G["I still don't know why we can't just conjur a refreshment table."]="I still don't know why we can't just conjur a refreshment table."
G["I still hate you."]="Te sigo odiando."
G["I still have a luckydo. This is your last chance to surrender before bad fortune finds you."]="I still have a luckydo. This is your last chance to surrender before bad fortune finds you."
G["I still have some... fight... in me-e-e..."]="I still have some... fight... in me-e-e..."
G["I still have the scars from that night."]="Ainda conservo cicatrizes de aquela noite."
G["I still love you, Ace!"]="Te quero de todos modos, As!"
G["I still remember when I used to guard the Burlap Trail."]="I still remember when I used to guard the Burlap Trail."
G["I stood by and watched the corruption of Ragnaros seep through the hearts and minds of the Dark Iron nation. This once honorable race, driven to madness... to evil.\n\nWhen the construction of the Spire was complete, my will to live amongst my people gave way. I passed as a hero of the new nation of Dark Iron. This tomb was placed here - at the entrance to the city I planned and built - in honor of my efforts."]="I stood by and watched the corruption of Ragnaros seep through the hearts and minds of the Dark Iron nation. This once honorable race, driven to madness... to evil.\n\nWhen the construction of the Spire was complete, my will to live amongst my people gave way. I passed as a hero of the new nation of Dark Iron. This tomb was placed here - at the entrance to the city I planned and built - in honor of my efforts."
G["I stopped by the park district on my way here. There's nothing left of it..."]="E passado pelo parque do distrito quando vinha até aqui. Não restante nada..."
G["I strike from the shadows!"]="Ataco desdas sombras!"
G["I strongly disagree. Dar'khan is not going to get reinforcements because he'll be bottlenecked. Deatholme has only one way in and out. Your traitor was a fool to corner himself there, and I intend to exploit that weakness!"]="I strongly disagree. Dar'khan is not going to get reinforcements because he'll be bottlenecked. Deatholme has only one way in and out. Your traitor was a fool to corner himself there, and I intend to exploit that weakness!"
G["I study the known and unknown elements of our world."]="Eu estudo os elementos conhecidos e desconhecidos do nosso mundo."
G["I su... sur... surpose that yar wanna ride back to der outpost. Yarp?"]="Suponho que suponho que você queira voltar para o posto avançado. Yarp?"
G["I submit myself for further training, my master."]="Me submeto a treinamento adicional, meu mestre."
G["I submit! You win this time..."]="Me rindo! Esta vez ganha você..."
G["I suggest a new strategy: you draw their attacks while I gather reinforcements."]="Propongo uma estratégia nova: você lhes mantendo sob controle e eu vou por reforços."
G["I summon you, Sha'ni Proudtusk!"]="Eu te invoco, Sha'ni Colmilho Orgulhoso!"
G["I summoned all my strength, faced west, and threw him to Kalimdor."]="I summoned all my strength, faced west, and threw him to Kalimdor."
G["I supply the Hold with various relics required for spellcasting as well as other alchemical reagents."]="Eu forneço ao Hold várias relíquias necessárias para a conjuração de feitiços, bem como outros reagentes alquímicos."
G["I supply the Krom'gar army with equipment."]="Eu forneço equipamentos ao exército Krom'gar."
G["I suppose I can teach that to you.  You'll probably only be able to find ogre tannin here, but the other things you can find most anywhere!"]="I suppose I can teach that to you.  You'll probably only be able to find ogre tannin here, but the other things you can find most anywhere!"
G["I suppose I could leave things to Mung-Mung for a while and take a gander at Yoon's. He does have the best soil in the entire valley! Let me just get my things in order, first."]="I suppose I could leave things to Mung-Mung for a while and take a gander at Yoon's. He does have the best soil in the entire valley! Let me just get my things in order, first."
G["I suppose I could leave things to Mung-Mung for a while and take a gander at Yoon's. Let me finish up my business here at the market, first."]="I suppose I could leave things to Mung-Mung for a while and take a gander at Yoon's. Let me finish up my business here at the market, first."
G["I suppose I could use one of those. Thank you."]="Alguns uso lhe darei. Obrigado."
G["I suppose I need some more practice."]="I suppose I need some more practice."
G["I suppose I should be grateful. Please, take this. I want nothing to remind me of this place."]="I suppose I should be grateful. Please, take this. I want nothing to remind me of this place."
G["I suppose I should not be surprised at this cold reception. We have long been in hiding, and the separation from our brethren was necessary.\n\nThat time, however, is done. Whether the residents of this young tree come to accept us or not, the Highborne are returning to light, and we will not turn our backs on what we are."]="I suppose I should not be surprised at this cold reception. We have long been in hiding, and the separation from our brethren was necessary.\n\nThat time, however, is done. Whether the residents of this young tree come to accept us or not, the Highborne are returning to light, and we will not turn our backs on what we are."
G["I suppose I should thank you for freeing me. We'll soon see if you think that was a wise decision."]="I suppose I should thank you for freeing me. We'll soon see if you think that was a wise decision."
G["I suppose I'll be off then. You a-comin', Chen?"]="Bom, então me vou. Te veio, Chen?"
G["I suppose I'll be off then. You a-comin', Li Li?"]="Bom, então me vou. Te veio, Li Li?"
G["I suppose I'll end up fighting them all myself."]="I suppose I'll end up fighting them all myself."
G["I suppose I'll just add this to the stew. We were short on meat anyways."]="I suppose I'll just add this to the stew. We were short on meat anyways."
G["I suppose it has to be this way, then. If only you'd seen what I've seen. THEN you'd understand."]="I suppose it has to be this way, then. If only you'd seen what I've seen. THEN you'd understand."
G["I suppose it is time I headed home."]="Acho que já é hora de voltar a casa."
G["I suppose my aim's a little off today."]="Suponho que hoje meu puntería não está muito em forma."
G["I suppose so. It's not silly, though, what you said."]="I suppose so. It's not silly, though, what you said."
G["I suppose sometimes y'need to hit rock bottom before y'can crawl yer way back up."]="A vezes é preciso tocar fundo para poder sair do poço novamente."
G["I suppose that could work, if we had twenty people to cast it with."]="I suppose that could work, if we had twenty people to cast it with."
G["I suppose that's enough for today. Let's wait for Uncle Chen to return."]="Suponho que já está bem por hoje. Esperemos a que regrese o tio Chen."
G["I suppose there are worse fates than being stuck forever inside a beer barrel."]="I suppose there are worse fates than being stuck forever inside a beer barrel."
G["I suppose this gift is acceptable. Thanks, $n."]="I suppose this gift is acceptable. Thanks, $n."
G["I suppose this is it, then?  I won't go down quietly!"]="I suppose this is it, then?  I won't go down quietly!"
G["I suppose we'll just have to throw these away... WAIT!  I think I'm having an idea."]="I suppose we'll just have to throw these away... WAIT!  I think I'm having an idea."
G["I suppose we'll see the measure of your dedication in due time."]="Suponho que veremos a medida do seu dedicação ao seu devido tempo."
G["I suppose you are here to be trained in the use of a new weapon?  Make it fast, I'm very busy!"]="Suponho que você esteja aqui para ser treinado no uso de uma nova arma? Seja rápido, estou muito ocupado!"
G["I suppose you did help me water my plants. Very well... I'll have the hops sent to your friend Chen, in Halfhill."]="I suppose you did help me water my plants. Very well... I'll have the hops sent to your friend Chen, in Halfhill."
G["I suppose you want something for what you did, is that it? Reminding me of my life? Pfagh. Take what I have and leave me alone."]="I suppose you want something for what you did, is that it? Reminding me of my life? Pfagh. Take what I have and leave me alone."
G["I suppose you'll be needing a key for this cage? Wait, don't tell me. The horrific gibbering monster behind me ate it, right?"]="I suppose you'll be needing a key for this cage? Wait, don't tell me. The horrific gibbering monster behind me ate it, right?"
G["I suppose you're right."]="I suppose you're right."
G["I suppose."]="Suponho"
G["I sure am a long way from home!"]="Estamos muito longe de casa!"
G["I sure am hungry."]="I sure am hungry."
G["I sure could use a kiss about now.  Know where I can find one?"]="Não me viria mal um beijo. Sabe onde poderá conseguir um?"
G["I sure do like his pretty face."]="Me encantar seu rosto bonita."
G["I surmise that this object is the living embodiment of shadows... darkness... It is a manifestation. It is a void."]="Suponho que este item é a encarnação vivo das Sombras... a escuridão... É uma manifestação. É um vazio."
G["I surrender! Stay your blade!"]="Me rindo! Guarda seu arma!"
G["I surrender! You win."]="Me rindo! Você ganha."
G["I survived and I'm flesh again!"]="E sobrevivido e vuelvo a ser de carne!"
G["I survived for hundreds of years during the Thunder King's reign. Do you know how? By not keeping my masters waiting!"]="Sobreviví centenas de anos durante o reinado do Rei do Trovão. Sabe como? Não fazia esperar a meus amos!"
G["I suspect that the imps are stealing knowledge."]="Suspeito que os diabinhos estejam roubando conhecimento."
G["I swab the decks!"]="Eu esfrego os conveses!"
G["I swear I saw that little Syra Goldendraft giving my boy \"the looks\". Can't have that."]="I swear I saw that little Syra Goldendraft giving my boy \"the looks\". Can't have that."
G["I swear I will keep him safe. We will return as soon as we can."]="I swear I will keep him safe. We will return as soon as we can."
G["I swear by my ancestors, these Kor'kron will not pass. Now go, $n, the honor of felling Garrosh is yours!"]="I swear by my ancestors, these Kor'kron will not pass. Now go, $n, the honor of felling Garrosh is yours!"
G["I swear by the power of An'she, these Kor'kron whelps will not pass."]="I swear by the power of An'she, these Kor'kron whelps will not pass."
G["I swear it is true! Please, don't kill me!!"]="I swear it is true! Please, don't kill me!!"
G["I swear that guy was dead when I found him! What - oh - Twilight's Hammer? No, I don't know anything about that."]="Juro que esse tio já estava morto quando o encontrei! Que? Ah, o Martelo Crepúsculo? disso não sei nada."
G["I swear that if you do not work faster I'm going to feed you to my worg!"]="I swear that if you do not work faster I'm going to feed you to my worg!"
G["I swear this line's not moving!"]="Te juro que esta cauda não se move!"
G["I swear this wasn't my fault.  Why are you looking at me like that?"]="Juro que não foi minha culpa. Por que você está olhando assim para mim?"
G["I swear you trolls are the worst batch of workers we've ever had!"]="Trolls! Os juro que são o pior carregamento de trabalhadores que temos recebido nunca!"
G["I swear, I didn't steal anything from you! Here, take some of my supplies, just go away!"]="Te juro que não te e roubado nada! Tome, aqui tem algumas de meus provisiones, mas vá embora!"
G["I swear, none of these Kor'kron animals will pass as long I draw breath. Just promise you will put Garrosh down like the rabid dog he is."]="I swear, none of these Kor'kron animals will pass as long I draw breath. Just promise you will put Garrosh down like the rabid dog he is."
G["I swear, people have actually seen them. Pandaren really do exist!"]="I swear, people have actually seen them. Pandaren really do exist!"
G["I swear, that woman never misses."]="Em sério, essa mulher não falha nunca."
G["I swear... if Quint tries to plant one more fishing grub on me, I'm going to hack down his tree with my not-so-rusty sword."]="Eu juro... se Quint tentar plantar mais um pedaço de pesca em mim, vou cortar sua árvore com minha lâmina não tão enferrujada."
G["I swore an oath to the Kirin Tor. That bond was one of trust and mutual understanding. And then they betrayed that bond. It is time to remind them the blood elves do not suffer betrayal lightly."]="I swore an oath to the Kirin Tor. That bond was one of trust and mutual understanding. And then they betrayed that bond. It is time to remind them the blood elves do not suffer betrayal lightly."
G["I swore that nothing would stir me to take up this blade again.\n\nI was a fool."]="Juré que nada faria que volviera a pegar esta lâmina.\n\nFui um estúpido."
G["I take care o' the pigs 'round here."]="I take care o' the pigs 'round here."
G["I take great pride in the company I keep."]="I take great pride in the company I keep."
G["I take it you were successful at the bridge?"]="Então tuvisteis êxito no ponte?"
G["I take my leave now, Commander. Good day!"]="Agora me retiro, Comandante. Que tenha um bom dia!"
G["I take pride in the fact that I am continuing my father's legacy here.\n\nA still-growing legacy, I might add."]="I take pride in the fact that I am continuing my father's legacy here.\n\nA still-growing legacy, I might add."
G["I take this life as an offering!"]="I take this life as an offering!"
G["I taught one of the rats to wave."]="I taught one of the rats to wave."
G["I teach myself a lot of my big-tongue hunt here. Lot to kill."]="Eu aprender a grande parte de meu caça de línguas-grandes aqui. Muito que matar."
G["I tell ya this guy's driving me nuts! Does anyone truly believe that a goblin could help run anything so magnificent as this speedbarge?\n\nAll they know how to do is blow stuff up and half of the time, they take themselves out doing even that!"]="I tell ya this guy's driving me nuts! Does anyone truly believe that a goblin could help run anything so magnificent as this speedbarge?\n\nAll they know how to do is blow stuff up and half of the time, they take themselves out doing even that!"
G["I tell ya, ten years from now everyone will be talkin' about the time that ol' Sully the Pickle and $n lit a fire right under those stinkin' yaungol's noses and blew their oil rigs to kingdom come!"]="I tell ya, ten years from now everyone will be talkin' about the time that ol' Sully the Pickle and $n lit a fire right under those stinkin' yaungol's noses and blew their oil rigs to kingdom come!"
G["I tell ye, I don't miss the Great War at all. I remember when we fought at Darrowmere. All night in the fog, lying in a muddy trench."]="I tell ye, I don't miss the Great War at all. I remember when we fought at Darrowmere. All night in the fog, lying in a muddy trench."
G["I tell you anything you want!"]="I tell you anything you want!"
G["I tell you now, because you have earned this warning."]="I tell you now, because you have earned this warning."
G["I tell you now, when we get back to Farstrider Enclave there will be a full accounting of your actions, Ranger Valanna! You alone were responsible for our losses and I'm certain that the captain will see it my way."]="I tell you now, when we get back to Farstrider Enclave there will be a full accounting of your actions, Ranger Valanna! You alone were responsible for our losses and I'm certain that the captain will see it my way."
G["I tell you, it sure is fun to see you work!  And you sure go through a lot of bombers!"]="Eu lhe digo, com certeza é divertido vê-o trabalhar! E você com certeza passa por muitos bombardeiros!"
G["I tend these creatures of Gormok as he cannot. I do not fully agree with this slaughter, but at the least he will have his chance to fight."]="Eu cuido dessas criaturas de Gormok como ele não pode. Não concordo plenamente com esse massacre, mas pelo menos ele terá a chance de lutar."
G["I thank the Light for this blessing. May it be used for justice and to defend all good creatures."]="Agradeço à Luz por esta bênção. Usa a magia em pro da justiça e para defenda a todas as criaturas bondadosas."
G["I thank you all.  The druids of old were wise to tear down Vordrassil, for its roots seep deep into the dwelling of an ancient evil."]="I thank you all.  The druids of old were wise to tear down Vordrassil, for its roots seep deep into the dwelling of an ancient evil."
G["I thank you for coming, but you really all must die now!"]="Os agradeço a visite, mas agora têm que morrer!"
G["I thank you for the clean death. I would not have done the same..."]="I thank you for the clean death. I would not have done the same..."
G["I thank you for your aid, brothers.  Our people will be redeemed!"]="Agradeço sua ajuda, irmãos. Nosso povo será redimido!"
G["I thank you for your graciousness, Mor'ghor. I must now take my leave."]="Agradeço seu atenção, Mor’ghor. Agora devo ir embora."
G["I thank you for your inquiry, but I already have all of the wool bandages necessary for the war effort. I suggest that you ask around though; there are many here that could probably still use your aid."]="Obrigado pelo seu interesse, mas já tenho todas as seda de lã necessárias para a campanha. Ainda assim, te sugiro que pergunte por aí pois há muitos que ainda poderiam precisar sua ajuda."
G["I thank you, $n.  And my brother thanks you."]="Te o agradeço, $n. E meu irmão também te agradece."
G["I thank you, $n.  My associates who will do great things with these..."]="I thank you, $n.  My associates who will do great things with these..."
G["I thank you, $n. Your dedication to my plea gives rest to my lost wife's spirit, and for that I could never repay you enough.\n\nI cannot say that my hatred will ever cease for the quilboar, but it is satiated for now.\n\nNow I must begin to rebuild my life."]="Te o agradeço, $n. Seu total entrega a meus súplicas, permite descansar ao espírito de meu esposa perdida e nunca poderei dar a você suficiente recompensa.\n\nNão posso dizer que meu ódio pelo jabaespín vá a desaparecer mais, mas se tem saciado pelo momentos.\n\nDevo começar a reconstruir minha vida."
G["I thank you, Akama.  You honor me by allowing me this moment, surrounded by my brothers.  Farewell, friend.  Guide our people well."]="I thank you, Akama.  You honor me by allowing me this moment, surrounded by my brothers.  Farewell, friend.  Guide our people well."
G["I thank you, Garrosh. We have much to discuss when I return from my visit with the Greatmother."]="I thank you, Garrosh. We have much to discuss when I return from my visit with the Greatmother."
G["I thank you, friend of Dalaran."]="Obrigado, amigo de Dalaran."
G["I thank you, my friends. Forgive me. I... I have grown too weak to be of any assistance."]="I thank you, my friends. Forgive me. I... I have grown too weak to be of any assistance."
G["I thank you, strangers. I have been freed."]="Obrigado, forasteiros. Me vocês liberado."
G["I think Elder Splitrock has traveled to Maraudon in Desolace."]="Acho que o ancestral Parterroca se tem marchado a Maraudon em Desolação."
G["I think I came from Eng-land, do you know where that is?"]="Acho que provengo de Ingla-Terra, sabe onde está?"
G["I think I can hear myself getting luckier..."]="Acho que posso ouvir como aumenta meu sorte..."
G["I think I can just make it out from here. Right on the edge of the horizon."]="I think I can just make it out from here. Right on the edge of the horizon."
G["I think I can limp back to the fortress..."]="I think I can limp back to the fortress..."
G["I think I can make it back on my own."]="Acho que poderei voltar somente."
G["I think I can make it to Brackenwall on my own. They've got the cargo at the top of the tower. Be careful!"]="Acho que posso chegar até Murohelecho sem ajuda. Têm a mercadoria no alto da torre. Tenha cuidado!"
G["I think I can see the Sunwell from here!"]="Me parece que desde aqui se vê A Nascente do Sol!"
G["I think I can speak for everyone when I say that you're a true hero of Kun-Lai Summit, not to mention Firebough Nook, $p!"]="I think I can speak for everyone when I say that you're a true hero of Kun-Lai Summit, not to mention Firebough Nook, $p!"
G["I think I can use that horse to make it the rest of the way.  Thanks!"]="Acho que posso usar esse cavalo para o resto do caminho. Obrigado!"
G["I think I could juggle fire if I tried."]="I think I could juggle fire if I tried."
G["I think I found the emergency button. Rockets have those, don't they?"]="I think I found the emergency button. Rockets have those, don't they?"
G["I think I have a plan to infiltrate the Thunder King's armory. We'll use that creature you recovered, with a little help from the Shado-Pan."]="I think I have a plan to infiltrate the Thunder King's armory. We'll use that creature you recovered, with a little help from the Shado-Pan."
G["I think I have heard of this magic."]="Eu acho que ouvi falar dessa mágica."
G["I think I hear him coming now."]="Acho que agorao oigo vir."
G["I think I hear him coming!  Look to the west!"]="Eu acho que ouvi ele chegando! Olhe para o oeste!"
G["I think I hear something! Chambers must be coming. Make way! Make way!"]="I think I hear something! Chambers must be coming. Make way! Make way!"
G["I think I knocked that one into next week."]="Acho que e saído a esse para o arrastre."
G["I think I learned something new!"]="Acho que aprendi algo novo!"
G["I think I liked you better when your jaw was missing."]="Acho que eu gostava mais de você sem o maxilar."
G["I think I lost them."]="Acho que os e perdido."
G["I think I need a bath.  *sniff*  I think you need one, too!"]="Eu acho que preciso de um banho. * cheira * Eu acho que você precisa de um também!"
G["I think I punched him so hard his ancestors felt it."]="I think I punched him so hard his ancestors felt it."
