G["I think I'm beginning to regret undertaking this pilgrimage. I anticipated that the road would be rough and I'm no stranger to travel, but I wasn't prepared for the rigors of Outland.\n\nOn top of everything else, that Taleris seems to want to push me out of here before I've regained my strength completely."]="I think I'm beginning to regret undertaking this pilgrimage. I anticipated that the road would be rough and I'm no stranger to travel, but I wasn't prepared for the rigors of Outland.\n\nOn top of everything else, that Taleris seems to want to push me out of here before I've regained my strength completely."
