G["I think not. Rimblat has already proven that new life can grow from the sundered earth. Now we must find a way to reproduce and, more importantly, sustain the growth.\n\nWhile I am here, I am also offering my services to adventurers entering Naxxramas."]="I think not. Rimblat has already proven that new life can grow from the sundered earth. Now we must find a way to reproduce and, more importantly, sustain the growth.\n\nWhile I am here, I am also offering my services to adventurers entering Naxxramas."
