G["I thought all was lost when the yaungol attacked our home. It is cliche, but the old monks are right when they say: \"When one door shuts, another opens.\"\n\nOr something like that. Wasn't too big on their teachings."]="I thought all was lost when the yaungol attacked our home. It is cliche, but the old monks are right when they say: \"When one door shuts, another opens.\"\n\nOr something like that. Wasn't too big on their teachings."
G["I thought for sure I was going to be this smelly beast's dinner!"]="I thought for sure I was going to be this smelly beast's dinner!"
