G["I thought he had all the right answers.\n\nI... hoped.\n\nHe's nothing that he portrayed himself to be.\n\nI was a fool."]="I thought he had all the right answers.\n\nI... hoped.\n\nHe's nothing that he portrayed himself to be.\n\nI was a fool."
