G["I thought it was secure! If your peacekeepers had the clout to control the thieves of this city, this wouldn't have happened!"]="Creí que era certo! Se seus pacificadores tuvieran influência suficiente para controlar aos ladrões desta cidade, isto não haveria acontecido!"
G["I thought it was the last group!"]="I thought it was the last group!"
