G["I thought that was it... I thought I was going to die.  Thank you, stranger."]="Achava que... achava que ia a morrer. Obrigado, $gdesconocido: desconocida;."
G["I thought the Park fell into a big hole, but this one's way bigger and it has a whirlwind!"]="I thought the Park fell into a big hole, but this one's way bigger and it has a whirlwind!"
