G["I thought those eyes would NEVER leave me alone!"]="I thought those eyes would NEVER leave me alone!"
G["I thought we could solve our own problems. But for ten thousand years, we stagnated, our doubts and fears buried in the land, rising up to fester whenever we allowed them."]="Pensei que podíamos resolver nossos próprios problemas. Mas depois de dez mil anos, ficamos estagnados, nossas dúvidas e medos enterrados na terra, sendo inflamados sempre que permitíamos."
G["I thought we had enough in your line of work, but it looks like we have some openings.  Report to the civilian liaison."]="I thought we had enough in your line of work, but it looks like we have some openings.  Report to the civilian liaison."
G["I thought we talked about this, Brogg. You can't stay in this building. Sure, it can house you, but there's no room for anyone else!"]="I thought we talked about this, Brogg. You can't stay in this building. Sure, it can house you, but there's no room for anyone else!"
G["I thought we were friend, buddy! You leave Hakmud stranded?"]="I thought we were friend, buddy! You leave Hakmud stranded?"
G["I thought we were going to be best friends!"]="I thought we were going to be best friends!"
G["I thought we were going to speak with the regent lord. I'm beginning to question whether or not he exists at all at this point."]="I thought we were going to speak with the regent lord. I'm beginning to question whether or not he exists at all at this point."
G["I thought we were just building houses, not a fortress."]="I thought we were just building houses, not a fortress."
G["I thought we'd killed everybody... Mor'norokk should be pleased with this!"]="I thought we'd killed everybody... Mor'norokk should be pleased with this!"
G["I thought you might come. You've proven very persistent. Annoyingly so."]="Imaginé que vendrías. Tem mostrou ser muito persistente. Me molesta."
G["I thought you only felt weather in your knees."]="I thought you only felt weather in your knees."
G["I thought you were almost done?"]="Eu pensei que você estava quase pronto?"
G["I thought you were going to hit them. You roll that keg like you're new, or something."]="I thought you were going to hit them. You roll that keg like you're new, or something."
G["I thought you were going to keep these things off of me?"]="I thought you were going to keep these things off of me?"
G["I thought you would see it my way..."]="Creí que o verías como eu..."
G["I thought you would see the Light, Godfrey... Now speak quickly, fiend. What does it say?"]="Sabia que verías a Luz, Godfrey... Agora fala depressa, demônio. Que diz?"
G["I thought you'd never ask!"]="Achava que não o preguntarías nunca!"
G["I thought you'd see it my way."]="Sabia que compartirías meu ponto de visão."
G["I thought... I thought you were... dead."]="Achava... achava que estava... morto."
G["I tink I made an angry poo-poo. It gonna blow!"]="Acho que popó bravo. Vai fazer boom!"
G["I tink ya be even more like ya father den ya thought, even witout da demon blood."]="I tink ya be even more like ya father den ya thought, even witout da demon blood."
G["I tire of interruptions from the insignificant.  Your time has come, $n!"]="I tire of interruptions from the insignificant.  Your time has come, $n!"
G["I tire of these ogres. We should wipe them out, all of them."]="I tire of these ogres. We should wipe them out, all of them."
G["I tire of this disguise. Now we finish this!"]="I tire of this disguise. Now we finish this!"
G["I tire of this nonsense! Prepare to die!"]="I tire of this nonsense! Prepare to die!"
G["I tire of this.  Do you see this clutch amidst which you stand?  I have nurtured the spark within them, but that life-force is and always will be mine.  Behold, power beyond your comprehension!"]="I tire of this.  Do you see this clutch amidst which you stand?  I have nurtured the spark within them, but that life-force is and always will be mine.  Behold, power beyond your comprehension!"
G["I tire of your evasive babble, doomguard. Explain to me why you and your kind are drawn to sacrificial magics."]="Estou cansado das suas evasivas, demonarca. Explique por que você e sua raça são atraídos por magia sacrifical."
G["I tire of your insolence! I will choke the life from you, impudent slave!"]="I tire of your insolence! I will choke the life from you, impudent slave!"
G["I told A'dal that playing host to a mass of flea-bitten refugees would only end in trouble, but would he listen? No, no, what would a Scryer know about such things? Bah."]="I told A'dal that playing host to a mass of flea-bitten refugees would only end in trouble, but would he listen? No, no, what would a Scryer know about such things? Bah."
G["I told Gar'dul not to build a fortress on top of a Silithid colony.\n\nDid he listen to Crawgol? No!"]="I told Gar'dul not to build a fortress on top of a Silithid colony.\n\nDid he listen to Crawgol? No!"
G["I told him he would simply have to contact my agent."]="Disse a ele que simplesmente tendría que ficar em contato com meu agente."
G["I told him! I told Ban we needed to strike! This is all his fault!"]="I told him! I told Ban we needed to strike! This is all his fault!"
G["I told my son, I told Dion, don't take the yaks to the field when it's raining. And what does he do? He takes out the yaks when it is raining.\n\nIt is no surprise that we now have sick yaks!\n\nAi-ya! How did I raise such a foolish son?"]="I told my son, I told Dion, don't take the yaks to the field when it's raining. And what does he do? He takes out the yaks when it is raining.\n\nIt is no surprise that we now have sick yaks!\n\nAi-ya! How did I raise such a foolish son?"
G["I told myself I wouldn't burden the Cenarion Circle with our expedition's problems, $n.  Our military strength is minimal, however.  We're scholars and explorers, first and foremost."]="Me prometí a mim mesma que não faria carregar ao Círculo Cenariano com os problemas da expedição, $n. Mas nossa força militar é insignificante. Somos estudantes e batedores ante tudo."
G["I told ya so!"]="Te o disse!"
G["I told ye not tae leave the boar ribs out! Why couldna yae had a proper stomach and eaten yer dinner like the rest o' us Buckeys?"]="I told ye not tae leave the boar ribs out! Why couldna yae had a proper stomach and eaten yer dinner like the rest o' us Buckeys?"
G["I told you I'd be better prepared when next we met. I've fought and won the Hyldsmeet, trained at Valkyrion, and here I am.  Come and get some!"]="I told you I'd be better prepared when next we met. I've fought and won the Hyldsmeet, trained at Valkyrion, and here I am.  Come and get some!"
G["I told you I'd have you, Pei-Zhi. You've set us back thousands of spirits today, but I'd gladly trade them all to see you bound."]="I told you I'd have you, Pei-Zhi. You've set us back thousands of spirits today, but I'd gladly trade them all to see you bound."
G["I told you it was a fool's quest!"]="Já te disse que era uma missão estúpida!"
G["I told you lads to trust ol' Sully! Ha haaaa!"]="Os disse que confiarais no velho Sully! Ha, ja!"
G["I told you only to summon me if that stupid elf returned! What's this? No matter, you won't detain me long."]="I told you only to summon me if that stupid elf returned! What's this? No matter, you won't detain me long."
G["I told you that you weren't machine compatible!"]="Te disse que não eras compatível com as máquinas!"
G["I told you to leave!"]="I told you to leave!"
G["I told you to wait for me elsewhere, not follow me like a puppy..."]="I told you to wait for me elsewhere, not follow me like a puppy..."
G["I told you what I know, now shove off!"]="Eu te disse o que eu sei, agora saia!"
G["I told you! These rocks are slippery!"]="I told you! These rocks are slippery!"
G["I told you, sugar. You aren't hot enough to handle me!"]="Eu falei, $gneném:benzinho;. Você não é $gbom:boa; o suficiente pra mexer comigo!"
G["I took Helgrum under my wing when I arrived in Stonard. Under my harsh glare, he became an even greater tracker than before... and my only companion.\n\nI thought myself strong. I thought no suffering could break my spirit. When I saw the humans sink their swords into Helgrum... into my mate... I found out how wrong I was."]="Acogí a Helgrum baixo meu proteção quando cheguei a Rocal. Baixo meu severa olhar se transformou em um rastreador melhor do que era antes... e na minha único companheiro.\n\nMe achava forte. Achava que nenhum sofrimento poderá quebrar meu espírito. Quando vi aos humanos clavar seus espadas em Helgrum... na minha companheiro... Descobri o equivocada que estava."
G["I took it from one of these trolls as I was captured. Maybe you can find a way to use it against them."]="I took it from one of these trolls as I was captured. Maybe you can find a way to use it against them."
G["I took no pleasure in their deaths."]="Não disfruté com os seus mortes."
G["I took your dead master's banner. Come at me, $r!"]="Eu colhi o estandarte do seu mestre morto. Venha a mim, $r!"
G["I train and guide young hunters in the traditions passed down many generations."]="Treino e guio jovens caçadores nas tradições transmitidas por muitas gerações."
G["I train better against a target dummy."]="I train better against a target dummy."
G["I train hunters in the ways and traditions of our ancestors."]="Treino caçadores nos costumes e tradições de nossos ancestrais."
G["I train only warriors, $c. You'll have to look elsewhere."]="I train only warriors, $c. You'll have to look elsewhere."
G["I travelled all this way to speak with the famed \"Seer of the Dragonmaw.\" I wanted to see inside Cho'gall's dark heart before I tear it out.\n\nBut she's worthless to me. All riddles and rhyme. Maybe you can help."]="I travelled all this way to speak with the famed \"Seer of the Dragonmaw.\" I wanted to see inside Cho'gall's dark heart before I tear it out.\n\nBut she's worthless to me. All riddles and rhyme. Maybe you can help."
G["I tried so hard to tell Jim... to tell anyone... who was behind this, but I couldn't find a way..."]="I tried so hard to tell Jim... to tell anyone... who was behind this, but I couldn't find a way..."
G["I tried to boot a jade monster in the head but hurt my paw."]="Intenté dar um sopapo a um monstro de jade na cabeça, mas me fiz dano na zarpa."
G["I tried to save you Istaria, but I was too weak."]="I tried to save you Istaria, but I was too weak."
G["I tried to tell him... to tell him that Hellscream betrayed us, cast aside a Warchief's responsibility to his own people.  But Nazgrim... too loyal... too proud."]="I tried to tell him... to tell him that Hellscream betrayed us, cast aside a Warchief's responsibility to his own people.  But Nazgrim... too loyal... too proud."
G["I tried, master. I tried."]="O intenté, mestre. O intenté."
G["I tried."]="O intenté."
G["I truly believe now that the mogu thought they were doing the work of the titans. They fought against the mantid and used the powers of the Vale to create new life."]="Eu realmente acredito que os mogus pensavam que estavam fazendo o trabalho dos titãs. Eles lutaram contra os mantídeos e usaram o poder do Vale para criar vida."
G["I trust in the will of the Klaxxi. They know what is best for our people."]="Confío na vontade dos Klaxxi. Sabem que é o melhor para nosso povo."
G["I trust it."]="Eu me fío."
G["I trust that ye're well and good?"]="Espero que tudo te fique bem!"
G["I trust that you will, but please, be careful."]="I trust that you will, but please, be careful."
G["I trust that you're planning to do something about that giant surge of anger that's erupting from the middle of the lake?!"]="I trust that you're planning to do something about that giant surge of anger that's erupting from the middle of the lake?!"
G["I trust the Light is with you, $n. Is there something that I can I help you with?"]="Espero que a Luz estiver com você, $n. Posso ajudar você em algo?"
G["I trust very few of your kind, $n. But I can tell that you are a friend."]="I trust very few of your kind, $n. But I can tell that you are a friend."
G["I trust you and my son are getting along? Anduin is anything but shy."]="Eu confio que você e meu filho estão se dando bem? Anduin é tudo menos tímido."
G["I trust you have learned: To fight out of fear or anger is to fight a war that never ends."]="Acredito que tenha aprendido: lutar contra o medo ou ódio é lutar uma guerra que nunca cessará."
G["I trust you're taking every precaution....\n\nThis is a dangerous place and I couldn't forgive myself if something were to happen to you."]="I trust you're taking every precaution....\n\nThis is a dangerous place and I couldn't forgive myself if something were to happen to you."
G["I try to keep Sentinel Hill stocked, and that's not easy with all the action we see."]="Tento manter o Sentinel Hill abastecido, e isso não é fácil com toda a ação que vemos."
G["I turn over the man to my liege for punishment, as he has broken the law of the land and it is my sworn duty to enforce it."]="Entrego o homem ao meu domínio para punição, pois ele violou a lei da terra e é meu dever jurado cumpri-a."
G["I turned that hate on the Illidari and the Burning Legion... but they weren't the ones who betrayed us.  We were the naaru's chosen!  We lived and died for them!"]="I turned that hate on the Illidari and the Burning Legion... but they weren't the ones who betrayed us.  We were the naaru's chosen!  We lived and died for them!"
G["I uh - I could use a little help here?"]="Eu, eh, me viria bem uma mão aqui."
G["I understand Garrosh's desires. The urge for battle is strong within every orc, especially against a foe that has killed our people. But, the warchief has proven time and again that strategy is as important as strength in a battle.\n\nWe will set out when the time is right. We are no longer a band of mindless, demon-manipulated savages. This is the new Horde."]="I understand Garrosh's desires. The urge for battle is strong within every orc, especially against a foe that has killed our people. But, the warchief has proven time and again that strategy is as important as strength in a battle.\n\nWe will set out when the time is right. We are no longer a band of mindless, demon-manipulated savages. This is the new Horde."
G["I understand how you feel Makuru.  Sedai was my brother after all.  Yet we can't disgrace his memory by going against his very ideals."]="I understand how you feel Makuru.  Sedai was my brother after all.  Yet we can't disgrace his memory by going against his very ideals."
G["I understand that Alexstrasza has pronounced judgement on Deathwing. Perhaps this whole ordeal will end, right here?"]="Entendo que Alexstrasza pronunciou seu julgamento sobre Deathwing. Talvez toda essa provação termine aqui?"
G["I understand that many individuals seek romance in taverns and festivals like this one, but alcohol dulls the senses and makes calculating the difficulties of daily life all fuzzy!\n\nBut I've found a solution! Through many trials and tribulations, I've engineered an extraordinary device! With these goggles on, ANYONE looks attractive!\n\nMmm... including you, cutie! Tell you what. I'll give you a discount!"]="I understand that many individuals seek romance in taverns and festivals like this one, but alcohol dulls the senses and makes calculating the difficulties of daily life all fuzzy!\n\nBut I've found a solution! Through many trials and tribulations, I've engineered an extraordinary device! With these goggles on, ANYONE looks attractive!\n\nMmm... including you, cutie! Tell you what. I'll give you a discount!"
G["I understand that the Cataclysm has struck Dustwallow Marsh as well, but Mudsprocket appears relatively safe. Can you not spare any goblins?"]="I understand that the Cataclysm has struck Dustwallow Marsh as well, but Mudsprocket appears relatively safe. Can you not spare any goblins?"
G["I understand that the Cataclysm has struck Feralas as well, but Camp Mojache appears relatively safe. Can you not spare any braves?"]="Tenho entendido que o Cataclismo também tem afetado a Feralas, mas o Acampamento Mojache parece relativamente a salvou. Você não pode enviar algum corajosos?"
G["I understand that the mind of the Tushui is not the only path to wisdom, but there are yet choices that should not be accepted.  Risks that are too dangerous to ever be taken.  Decisions that I cannot forgive...\n\nIt is time for me to leave Shen-zin Su.  I have found respect for Delora Lionheart for her confidence and valor, and her tales of the Alliance speak well of her people.  I do not yet know if I will find a home there, but wherever my path may lead, I will find a way to help the world beyond this isle.\n\nDespite everything, I've enjoyed what little time we've had together, $n.  I hope that you might join me, but I understand that this decision is not an easy one."]="I understand that the mind of the Tushui is not the only path to wisdom, but there are yet choices that should not be accepted.  Risks that are too dangerous to ever be taken.  Decisions that I cannot forgive...\n\nIt is time for me to leave Shen-zin Su.  I have found respect for Delora Lionheart for her confidence and valor, and her tales of the Alliance speak well of her people.  I do not yet know if I will find a home there, but wherever my path may lead, I will find a way to help the world beyond this isle.\n\nDespite everything, I've enjoyed what little time we've had together, $n.  I hope that you might join me, but I understand that this decision is not an easy one."
G["I understand that you are to thank for the bulk of our supply."]="Tenho entendido que você é a quem é preciso agradecer o volume de nossas provisiones."
G["I understand this holiday is a creation not of our allies, but the Horde. Why we follow suit, I do not know."]="Entendo que este feriado é uma criação não para de nossos aliados, mas da Horda. Por que seguimos o exemplo, eu não sei."
G["I understand you want to join the Alliance."]="I understand you want to join the Alliance."
G["I understand you, Garrosh. I know what it is like to bear the weight of your father's deeds."]="Eu entendo você, Garrosh. Sei como é carregar o fardo dos feitos do pai."
G["I understand your desire to inflict more suffering on the Horde. But when do we stop? How many more Alliance will number among the dead if we invaded Thunder Bluff, Azshara, and the Echo Isles? And how would we govern the conquered people?\n\nThe Pandaren always question why we fight. Today, we've won justice, and have given the Horde an opportunity to atone by supporting their rebellion. Further bloodshed would be for vengeance alone - and it would reap vengeance in return."]="I understand your desire to inflict more suffering on the Horde. But when do we stop? How many more Alliance will number among the dead if we invaded Thunder Bluff, Azshara, and the Echo Isles? And how would we govern the conquered people?\n\nThe Pandaren always question why we fight. Today, we've won justice, and have given the Horde an opportunity to atone by supporting their rebellion. Further bloodshed would be for vengeance alone - and it would reap vengeance in return."
G["I understand your frustration. Your people are ferocious in battle, and this isn't what you're used to."]="I understand your frustration. Your people are ferocious in battle, and this isn't what you're used to."
G["I understand, Earthmother."]="De acordo, Mãe Terra."
G["I understand, I owe money. I can pay you if I need to, but...\n\nI NEED this money. Our inn is falling apart. If I don't have money to pay for repairs, I'll be out of a job... and a home."]="O entendo, te devo dinheiro. Posso pagar se é necessário, mas...\n\nPreciso este dinheiro. Nossa estalagem se cai a pedaços. Se não tenho dinheiro para pagar as reparações, me ficarei sem trabalho... e sem casa."
G["I understand, Lorewalker. But the Serpent's Heart project is behind schedule and we've not a stone to spare!"]="I understand, Lorewalker. But the Serpent's Heart project is behind schedule and we've not a stone to spare!"
G["I understand, brotha. I will tink on this and be troublin' ya no furtha. You have a world to be savin'."]="I understand, brotha. I will tink on this and be troublin' ya no furtha. You have a world to be savin'."
G["I understand, my friend. I shall find someone to help your master. Go back to him now, or at least stay close."]="Já entendo, $gamigo meu: amiga minha;. Encontrarei a alguém que ajuda seu mestre. Volta ao lado a ele agora, ou ao menos permanece perto de ele."
G["I understand, now. Farewell, and good luck."]="Agorao entendo. Adeus e boa sorte."
G["I understand."]="Eu entendo."
G["I understand.  Thank you."]="I understand.  Thank you."
G["I understand. Here's the payment. I'm sorry to have taken so much of your time, $gsir:ma'am;."]="I understand. Here's the payment. I'm sorry to have taken so much of your time, $gsir:ma'am;."
G["I understand. I'll talk to my father."]="Eu entendo. Vou falar com meu pai."
G["I understand. Thank you, great Crane."]="I understand. Thank you, great Crane."
G["I understand. Thank you, mighty Ox."]="I understand. Thank you, mighty Ox."
G["I urge you to reconsider, Phaoris. Deathwing would use the scepters' power to unravel the secrets of Uldum and unleash great destruction."]="I urge you to reconsider, Phaoris. Deathwing would use the scepters' power to unravel the secrets of Uldum and unleash great destruction."
G["I used good judgment when you showed none.  I don't want to see you lead us into ruin, Krenna!"]="Eu fiz gala de bom juízo quando você não mostraste nenhum. Não quero ver como nos veste até a fracasso, Krenna!"
G["I used ta be in the Explorers' League, ye know.\nBut then I realized the only thing I really cared ta look for was GEMS.\nBig, sparklin', colorful, valuable gems... oh, how I love ye!"]="I used ta be in the Explorers' League, ye know.\nBut then I realized the only thing I really cared ta look for was GEMS.\nBig, sparklin', colorful, valuable gems... oh, how I love ye!"
G["I used to amuse myself by accepting challenges from anyone who would offer them, but I've long since grown tired of such easy victories.\n\nFor now, I'm taking some time to get my reagent business off the ground and write a book about my experiences in Twilight's Hammer."]="I used to amuse myself by accepting challenges from anyone who would offer them, but I've long since grown tired of such easy victories.\n\nFor now, I'm taking some time to get my reagent business off the ground and write a book about my experiences in Twilight's Hammer."
G["I used to be a simple ticket redeemer at the racetrack. Well, no more racetrack, so no more job.\n\nI'm trying my hand at negotiations now. Could you help me get things going here? They have oil!"]="I used to be a simple ticket redeemer at the racetrack. Well, no more racetrack, so no more job.\n\nI'm trying my hand at negotiations now. Could you help me get things going here? They have oil!"
G["I used to be beautiful..."]="Eu costumava ser linda..."
G["I used to be handsome..."]="Eu costumava ser lindo..."
G["I used to be known as Iolol until a secret vote was passed around town that resulted in me having to change my name. It was either change it or go the way of Corki. You would have done the same. What do you think of my new name? Huge improvement, right?\n\nBy the way, check the bulletin board if you're looking for work."]="I used to be known as Iolol until a secret vote was passed around town that resulted in me having to change my name. It was either change it or go the way of Corki. You would have done the same. What do you think of my new name? Huge improvement, right?\n\nBy the way, check the bulletin board if you're looking for work."
G["I used to be more humerus."]="I used to be more humerus."
G["I used to be overcome with frequent, debilitating fits of rage. But since I met Driz, I've been able to live a happy, productive life.\n\nAnd I get to tear things apart with my bare hands."]="I used to be overcome with frequent, debilitating fits of rage. But since I met Driz, I've been able to live a happy, productive life.\n\nAnd I get to tear things apart with my bare hands."
G["I used to direct Steamwheedle's shredder development program, but last month I struck out on my own. Now all my suppliers have blacklisted me. Worse, my development efforts haven't even gotten off the ground yet. I could use your help, $n!"]="I used to direct Steamwheedle's shredder development program, but last month I struck out on my own. Now all my suppliers have blacklisted me. Worse, my development efforts haven't even gotten off the ground yet. I could use your help, $n!"
G["I used to have 1850 spell power, what happaned?"]="Eu costumava ter 1850 p. de poder mágico... Que tem passado?"
G["I used to know a dwarf that claimed gnomes evolved from beneath the earth. That we all started out as sand gnomes. What a load of nonsense! Sand gnomes? PUH-LEASE!"]="I used to know a dwarf that claimed gnomes evolved from beneath the earth. That we all started out as sand gnomes. What a load of nonsense! Sand gnomes? PUH-LEASE!"
G["I used to live only for the pursuit of knowledge.\n\nNow I spend every waking hour searching for a way for our people to rekindle our lost immortality."]="Costumava viver à procura do conhecimento.\n\nAgora dedico tudo meu tempo a procurar uma maneira para que nossa gente recupere nossa imortalidade perdida."
G["I used to speak to the sea. Now it only screams."]="Costumava falar com o mar. Agora somente grita."
G["I used to think it was priests that were overpowered. Now I think it's rogues."]="Antes achava que os sacerdotes eram demais poderosos. Agora acho que são os ladinos."
G["I used to work for Grand Inquisitor Isillien! Your idea of pain is a normal mid-afternoon for me!"]="Eu costumava trabalhar para o Grande Inquisidor Isilhien! Seu concepto do dor é uma tarde qualquer para mim!"
G["I usually leave that sort of thing to the gnomes.  If you want to take up the profession, I'm sure you could find some gnomes hanging out in Stormwind that would train you."]="Eu costumo deixar esse tipo de coisa para os gnomos. Se você quer seguir a profissão, tenho certeza de que você encontrará algum gnomos em Ventobravo que o treinariam."
G["I utterly cannot stand the presence of these demons!"]="I utterly cannot stand the presence of these demons!"
G["I very much doubt that he will have anything to say, stranger..."]="I very much doubt that he will have anything to say, stranger..."
G["I vill discovah who vas behind zhis cowardly act!\n\nAnd vhen I do...."]="I vill discovah who vas behind zhis cowardly act!\n\nAnd vhen I do...."
G["I vill vorry about zhe drivink!"]="I vill vorry about zhe drivink!"
G["I vould offer you a prestigious position in my organization if I didn't haf to kill you."]="Eu oferrecerria um posição de prrestígio em meu orrganização se não prrecisasse matarr você."
G["I vow that the Silver Covenant will see Quel'Delar restored."]="Juro que O Pacto de Prata verá a Quel'Delar restaurada."
G["I wager you won't last a week."]="Te apuesto a que não aguantas nem uma semana."
G["I wakes me up in the mornings. The sun makes me tired. Hard to think."]="I wakes me up in the mornings. The sun makes me tired. Hard to think."
G["I walk this road alone, seeking ways to defend my honor and rid this land of our enemies.\n\nWhat can I do for you, $n?"]="I walk this road alone, seeking ways to defend my honor and rid this land of our enemies.\n\nWhat can I do for you, $n?"
G["I walked up to the top of the mountain and took a hold of my sniper rifle."]="Subí até a cima da montanha e colhi meu rifle de atirador de elite."
G["I wandered for the rest of my natural life in search of knowledge, seeing more wonder and meeting more strange and mysterious races than any of my people before me. I travelled across the length and breadth of ancient Kalimdor until there was no more to see, no new lands across the horizon.\n\nYet... there was still so much I did not know as I felt my final journey approaching and I wept for the things I would never know.\n\nAs I fell, my life at an end, that is when they found me."]="I wandered for the rest of my natural life in search of knowledge, seeing more wonder and meeting more strange and mysterious races than any of my people before me. I travelled across the length and breadth of ancient Kalimdor until there was no more to see, no new lands across the horizon.\n\nYet... there was still so much I did not know as I felt my final journey approaching and I wept for the things I would never know.\n\nAs I fell, my life at an end, that is when they found me."
G["I wanna be just like the pitfighter!"]="Quero ser como o lutador do fosso!"
G["I wanna fight too! I'm ready!"]="Eu também quero lutar! Posso fazer isso!"
G["I wanna go home."]="Quero ir embora a casa."
G["I wanna go home... Take off this uniform and leave the Horde!"]="I wanna go home... Take off this uniform and leave the Horde!"
G["I wanna play soldier!"]="Quero jogar a soldados!"
G["I wanna see the Mage Tower."]="Quero ver a Torre dos Magos."
G["I wanna see the dragon skeleton in the great library."]="Quero ver o esqueleto de dragão na grande biblioteca."
G["I wanna see!"]="Eu quero ver!"
G["I wanna set something on fire, already!"]="Quero prenderle fogo a algo, agora mesmo!"
G["I want BLUE fire!"]="Quero fogo AZUL!"
G["I want a panther encrusted in the world's finest jewels!  Wait, doesn't one of my friends already have one of those?"]="I want a panther encrusted in the world's finest jewels!  Wait, doesn't one of my friends already have one of those?"
G["I want a sample..."]="Quero uma mostra..."
G["I want a surgical strike, Slidore. Carpet the road with fire!"]="I want a surgical strike, Slidore. Carpet the road with fire!"
G["I want all of this fel reaver technology packed up and ready to ship out within the next turning of Outland!"]="Quero toda essa tecnologia de assaltante vil embalada e pronta para a entrega no próximo viagna TerrAlém!"
G["I want all of your trackers out in search of the criminal, Matis the Cruel. I have given trusted agents of the Hand flare guns. Should you or one of your trackers see the flare, it means that an agent has found Matis and needs assistance. And remember, tracker, Matis is to be brought back to me alive."]="I want all of your trackers out in search of the criminal, Matis the Cruel. I have given trusted agents of the Hand flare guns. Should you or one of your trackers see the flare, it means that an agent has found Matis and needs assistance. And remember, tracker, Matis is to be brought back to me alive."
G["I want blood!"]="Quero sangue!"
G["I want more ale!  Give me more ale!"]="I want more ale!  Give me more ale!"
G["I want my daddy!"]="Quero a meu papi!"
G["I want my mommy."]="I want my mommy."
G["I want nothing to do with Silithus, the Qiraji and least of all, any damned dragons!"]="Não quero ter nada que ver com Silithus, os qiraji e, sobre tudo, com nenhum condenado dragão!"
G["I want on that last ship! Don't leave us!"]="I want on that last ship! Don't leave us!"
G["I want some candy!"]="Quero caramelos!"
G["I want that one killed! The one right there that doesn't look like the others!"]="Quero a esse morto! Esse da direita não se parece aos mais!"
G["I want the arterieeeeeeeeees!"]="Quero as ateriaaaaaaaaaas!"
G["I want the perimeter secured and the gates manned by two guards at all times.  No one gets in, no one gets out."]="I want the perimeter secured and the gates manned by two guards at all times.  No one gets in, no one gets out."
G["I want these Alliance and Horde pigs dead!"]="I want these Alliance and Horde pigs dead!"
G["I want this all to be over soon."]="Quero que tudo isto termine..."
G["I want this deck so clean I could eat off of it!"]="Quero que esta coberta estiver tão limpa que se possa comer em ela!"
G["I want this nightmare to be over!"]="Quero que se acabe esta pesadelos!"
G["I want those boots! Nobody touch that corpse!"]="Quero essas botas! Que ninguém toque o corpo!"
