G["I want to exchange my Ruby Essence for Emerald Essence."]="Quero trocar minha Essência Ruby por Essência Esmeralda."
G["I want to explore the world!"]="Eu quero explorar o mundo!"
G["I want to fight to increase my rank!"]="Quero lutar para aumentar de grau!"
G["I want to fly on the wings of the bronze flight."]="Eu quero voar nas asas do vôo de bronze."
G["I want to fly on the wings of the green flight."]="Eu quero voar nas asas do vôo verde."
G["I want to fly on the wings of the red flight."]="Eu quero voar nas asas do vôo vermelho."
G["I want to fly to an old location!"]="Eu quero voar para um local antigo!"
G["I want to go back to the orphanage!"]="Eu quero voltar para o orfanato!"
G["I want to go home and see my family, but Gott won't let us off this mountain!"]="Quero ir a casa e ver a meu família, mas Gott não nos de sair desta montanha!"
G["I want to go home now."]="Agora quero ir embora a casa."
G["I want to go home!"]="Quero ir embora a casa!"
G["I want to go home."]="Quero ir embora a casa."
G["I want to join your movement."]="I want to join your movement."
G["I want to keep going until we see what's over that big wall to the west, but Raj'ku just keeps staring at all the giant vegetables around here. Maybe deep down, he's itching to be a farmer!"]="Quero seguir até que vamos ver que há ao outro lado dessa grande muralha do oeste, mas Raj'ku não para de olhar as verduras enormes dos arredores. ao melhor é um fazendeiro de coração!"
G["I want to learn about Archaeology."]="Quero aprender Arqueologia."
G["I want to make sure that you are properly equipped for the trials ahead."]="Quero ter certeza de que você tem o equipamento certo para os próximos desafios."
G["I want to release the corrupted saber to Winna."]="Quero liberar ao dentes de sabre corrupto para Winna."
G["I want to return to Lion's Landing."]="Quero voltar ao Ancoradouro do Leão."
G["I want to see a tower built right here."]="Quero uma torre logo aqui."
G["I want to see every scrap of paper you wretches get your claws on."]="I want to see every scrap of paper you wretches get your claws on."
G["I want to see how long I can last against the waves of undead."]="Quero ver quanto posso aguantar contra oleadas de não-mortos."
G["I want to see some sweat, here. If I don't start seeing sweat, I guarantee I'll start seeing blood."]="I want to see some sweat, here. If I don't start seeing sweat, I guarantee I'll start seeing blood."
G["I want to see the Skyfire in Jade Forest. Take me back."]="Quero ver O Abrasacielos na Floresta de Jade. Leve-me de volta."
G["I want to see the baby!"]="Quero ver ao bebé!"
G["I want to show you a different side of me...."]="I want to show you a different side of me...."
G["I want to speak to Marshal McBride! This is an outrage!"]="I want to speak to Marshal McBride! This is an outrage!"
G["I want to start over."]="Quero começar novamente."
G["I want to stay here and reflect on what we have seen. Please see Erelas and tell him what we have learned."]="I want to stay here and reflect on what we have seen. Please see Erelas and tell him what we have learned."
G["I want to stop the Scourge as much as you do.  How can I help?"]="Eu quero parar o flagelo tanto quanto você. Como posso ajudar?"
G["I want to test our damage-dealers."]="I want to test our damage-dealers."
G["I want to test our entire raid."]="Quero testar a toda nossa Raide."
G["I want to test our tanks."]="Quero testar a nossos tanques."
G["I want to train him, but I really don't want him to get hurt."]="I want to train him, but I really don't want him to get hurt."
G["I want to travel the world someday. Have you ever seen Stormwind?"]="Quero ver mundo algum dia. Tem estado alguma vez em Ventobravo?"
G["I want to use my challenge card!"]="Quero usar meu carta de desafio!"
G["I want two sharpshooters to stay behind and cover the deck.  Everyone else, use the ropes to rappel down.  Let's give them hell!"]="I want two sharpshooters to stay behind and cover the deck.  Everyone else, use the ropes to rappel down.  Let's give them hell!"
G["I want you all to listen good... anyone who's not with me can start looking for a new job!"]="I want you all to listen good... anyone who's not with me can start looking for a new job!"
G["I want you both to demonstrate the techniques I have taught you for the benefit of the younger students here.  Ready...  begin!"]="I want you both to demonstrate the techniques I have taught you for the benefit of the younger students here.  Ready...  begin!"
G["I want you to be with me... forever and ever."]="Quero que te fique comigo... para sempre."
G["I want you to know that I sincerely appreciate your aid, $c. We are not fighting beasts out here, but a foe both cunning and fanatical. We must stick together or hang separately."]="I want you to know that I sincerely appreciate your aid, $c. We are not fighting beasts out here, but a foe both cunning and fanatical. We must stick together or hang separately."
G["I want you to know that your Alliance has my full and unwavering support in this campaign."]="Quero que você saiba que a sua Aliança tem meu apoio total e inquestionável nesta campanha."
G["I want you to pit the Bloodpetal against one another."]="Quero que te enfrentes a um Sangrenta."
G["I want you to speak with the local gorillas."]="Quero que fale com os gorilas da zona."
G["I want you to test the limits of your wings."]="I want you to test the limits of your wings."
G["I want you to test your Bite skill on the people of Marshal's Stand."]="Quero que utilices seu habilidade Mordedura na gente do Alto de Marshal."
G["I wanted to help fight the Headless Horseman, but old Grimwatch wouldn't let me!"]="I wanted to help fight the Headless Horseman, but old Grimwatch wouldn't let me!"
G["I wanted to practice my spells on the bunnies outside my home to make my magic stronger so I could go and kill all the bad guys in Gnomeregan and let all the gnomes go back home but momma said I was too young to go on adventures but then I met Mister Budd and he told me that you're only as young as you feel and that I could come here with his friends and I would get all the practice I needed but then we got caught and put in the cages...\n\n<Ashli takes a deep breath.>\n\nAre you a real $r?"]="I wanted to practice my spells on the bunnies outside my home to make my magic stronger so I could go and kill all the bad guys in Gnomeregan and let all the gnomes go back home but momma said I was too young to go on adventures but then I met Mister Budd and he told me that you're only as young as you feel and that I could come here with his friends and I would get all the practice I needed but then we got caught and put in the cages...\n\n<Ashli takes a deep breath.>\n\nAre you a real $r?"
G["I wanted to scream but only a low gasp escaped my lips. I was promptly beaten for this act of rebellion. As I lay on the ground, I could see Matis pacing in front of Saruan's body. He seemed visibly concerned. He stated that Sironas or Sirona or some such entity would have his flesh flayed from his bones if Saruan had perished in the beatings."]="I wanted to scream but only a low gasp escaped my lips. I was promptly beaten for this act of rebellion. As I lay on the ground, I could see Matis pacing in front of Saruan's body. He seemed visibly concerned. He stated that Sironas or Sirona or some such entity would have his flesh flayed from his bones if Saruan had perished in the beatings."
G["I wanted to thank you once more for what you did for me. You gave me the courage to take back my home from the beasts of the forest. In doing so, I found Magwin!"]="Queria agradecer mais uma vez pelo que você fez por mim. Você me deu a coragem de recuperar minha casa dos animais da floresta. Ao fazer isso, encontrei Magwin!"
G["I was EMPEROR."]="Eu era... IMPERADOR."
G["I was JUST about to wiggle myself free... I think."]="Estava A PONTO de sair... acho."
G["I was a soldier of the Light once... Look at what I have become..."]="Uma vez fui um soldado da Luz... olhe em que me e convertido..."
G["I was a young tauren, barely having reached adolescence at the time, but I knew that those that would brave the battles for our freedom were well protected in my namesake's vestments."]="Eu era um jovem tauren, mal chegara à adolescência na época, mas sabia que aqueles que enfrentariam as batalhas por nossa liberdade estavam bem protegidos nas vestes de meu homônimo."
G["I was afforded a brief chance to attack their leader, and he was protected by some kind of magic. Make sure Morra hears of this before leading any kind of attack."]="I was afforded a brief chance to attack their leader, and he was protected by some kind of magic. Make sure Morra hears of this before leading any kind of attack."
G["I was almost ghoul bait! Thanks for the rescue!"]="I was almost ghoul bait! Thanks for the rescue!"
G["I was among the greatest of the Kirin Tor. You shall not defeat me idling about!"]="I was among the greatest of the Kirin Tor. You shall not defeat me idling about!"
G["I was as surprised as you to find the black dragonflight asserting its will against New Kargath.  Gorn is stubborn, and refuses help from anyone.\n\nEven so, High Examiner Bloodwatcher has asked me to watch from a distance, to make sure things do not become... ugly."]="I was as surprised as you to find the black dragonflight asserting its will against New Kargath.  Gorn is stubborn, and refuses help from anyone.\n\nEven so, High Examiner Bloodwatcher has asked me to watch from a distance, to make sure things do not become... ugly."
G["I was away for too long. My absence cost us the lives of some of our greatest heroes. Trash like you and this evil witch were allowed to roam free -- unchecked."]="tenho estado fosse demais tempo. Meu ausência tem lado a vida de nossos mais grandes heróis. Sucata como você e essa malvada bruxa vocês têm pedido andar por aí… livres."
G["I was barely inside their outer patrols when they caught me. I didn't find anything."]="I was barely inside their outer patrols when they caught me. I didn't find anything."
G["I was blinded by all of the excitement.\n\nI should have seen this coming from a mile away..."]="I was blinded by all of the excitement.\n\nI should have seen this coming from a mile away..."
G["I was bone to be wild!"]="Sou um osso duro de roer!"
G["I was born here, $r. This is my world - all that I know... As a boy, my mother and father would regale me with tales of your world and the splendor it held. How I longed to leave this place.\n\nAlas, fate is a cruel mistress. My mother and father have long since passed, buried in this very graveyard. I remain to uphold their honor and the honor of my family - the Sons of Lothar."]="I was born here, $r. This is my world - all that I know... As a boy, my mother and father would regale me with tales of your world and the splendor it held. How I longed to leave this place.\n\nAlas, fate is a cruel mistress. My mother and father have long since passed, buried in this very graveyard. I remain to uphold their honor and the honor of my family - the Sons of Lothar."
G["I was certain I was going to die out here."]="Estava certo de que ia a morrer aí fosse."
G["I was chosen!  I will prevail!"]="I was chosen!  I will prevail!"
G["I was chosen. My blood burns with his power!"]="Eu fui escolhido. Meu sangue arde com seu poder!"
G["I was constructed to serve as a repository for essential information regarding this complex. My primary functions include communicating the status of the frontal defense systems and assessing the status of the entity that this complex was built to imprison."]="I was constructed to serve as a repository for essential information regarding this complex. My primary functions include communicating the status of the frontal defense systems and assessing the status of the entity that this complex was built to imprison."
G["I was devoured by Horgus!  I can still feel his teeth upon me!"]="Fui devorado por Horgus! Ainda posso sentir seus dentes!"
G["I was fishing along the coast when the spiders got me! Thank you for saving me."]="I was fishing along the coast when the spiders got me! Thank you for saving me."
G["I was getting real sick of eating turnips."]="I was getting real sick of eating turnips."
G["I was getting so hungry..."]="I was getting so hungry..."
G["I was going draw picture of best attack plan... but you have my chalk."]="Ia a fazer um desenho com o melhor plano de ataque... mas você tem meu tiza."
G["I was going to charge you a pretty penny for that peach, but Ella is such a good customer at my market, this one's on the house. Just this once, ya hear!"]="I was going to charge you a pretty penny for that peach, but Ella is such a good customer at my market, this one's on the house. Just this once, ya hear!"
G["I was going to have a party and invite Mystic Birdhat, but you dismissed him."]="I was going to have a party and invite Mystic Birdhat, but you dismissed him."
G["I was going to kill him anyway!"]="I was going to kill him anyway!"
G["I was going to teach you a lesson but instead, it is you who have taught me. You see, when I was young... when I was young... when I was young..."]="Eu ia ensinar uma lição a você, mas foi você que me ensinou uma. Veja bem, quando eu era jovem, quando eu era jovem..."
G["I was gonna drown for sure!"]="I was gonna drown for sure!"
G["I was happier as a Wastewander."]="Era mais feliz quando era um Vagayermos."
G["I was head editor of the Tinker Town Tattler!"]="I was head editor of the Tinker Town Tattler!"
G["I was here visiting relatives when Lordaeron fell, and then... well. I suppose I won't ever be returning to Westfall, now.\n\nSometimes I wonder if my family is still alive. More often, though, I wonder why I no longer care."]="I was here visiting relatives when Lordaeron fell, and then... well. I suppose I won't ever be returning to Westfall, now.\n\nSometimes I wonder if my family is still alive. More often, though, I wonder why I no longer care."
G["I was hoping you'd say that..."]="Esperava que dijeras isso..."
G["I was in Ironforge during the takeover - it was chaos.\n\nNo wonder father gets so protective when I leave the keep."]="Estava em Altaforja durante a invasão. Foi um caos.\n\nNão me estranha que pai se ponga tão protetor quando salgo do Castelo."
G["I was just comin' to see you. Honest!"]="Estava a ponto de ir a ver você. De verdade!"
G["I was just doing what I was told.  Please..."]="I was just doing what I was told.  Please..."
G["I was just gonna make some limeade fer me hearties!  I swear it!"]="I was just gonna make some limeade fer me hearties!  I swear it!"
G["I was just mindin' my own business, when all of a sudden, Deathwing appeared!"]="I was just mindin' my own business, when all of a sudden, Deathwing appeared!"
G["I was just taking a rest.  Eternal watch is not as easy as it sounds, $r."]="Estava descansando. A guarda eterna não é tão fácil como soa, $r."
G["I was just thinking about you, $n."]="Precisamente estava pensando em ti, $n."
G["I was just thinking... we really ought to take a trip south one of these nights, maybe have an evening picnic overlooking the fighting at the border? What do you think, milord? Wouldn't that just be so exciting?"]="I was just thinking... we really ought to take a trip south one of these nights, maybe have an evening picnic overlooking the fighting at the border? What do you think, milord? Wouldn't that just be so exciting?"
G["I was just wondering what you knew about the gnolls to the south.  Someone has been giving them supplies to practice necromancy."]="I was just wondering what you knew about the gnolls to the south.  Someone has been giving them supplies to practice necromancy."
G["I was just... following orders."]="Eu somente... continuava ordens."
G["I was never that good with a fishing pole...  No matter!"]="Nunca se me dio bem a canha de pescar... Da igual!"
G["I was never very good at hand-to-hand combat, you know.  Not like my father."]="Nunca fui muito boa no combate corpo a corpo. Ao contrario que meu pai."
G["I was not always a shortfang. I was strong."]="Não sempre e banido um colmilhochico. Antes era forte."
G["I was not expecting this many troops..."]="Não esperava tantas tropas..."
G["I was on my way to the temple when I was jumped. My father must be rescued before the stone troggs kill him."]="Ia de caminho ao templo quando me atacaram por surpresa. Temos que resgate a meu pai antes de que os troggs de pedrao matem."
G["I was once a great fighter. Let us hope old age has not taken too much of my skill from me."]="I was once a great fighter. Let us hope old age has not taken too much of my skill from me."
G["I was once a great magister in Silvermoon City.  Now I'm a demoted, former-foreman and little more than a slave!"]="Antanho era um grande magíster na Luaprata. Agora me têm degradado e sou um antigo supervisor, pouco mais que um escravo!"
G["I was once a paladin, $n.  Now the Light shuns me, for my sins are too great.\n\nI will aid my allies as best I can, but never again will I wield the powers of darkness."]="I was once a paladin, $n.  Now the Light shuns me, for my sins are too great.\n\nI will aid my allies as best I can, but never again will I wield the powers of darkness."
G["I was once a priestess, but I've always been a scholar. The chance to learn from the Highborne seemed more valuable than practicing strict ignorance.\n\nWhat's more most of the apprentices here are youths who came of age during the third war. They need guidance, wisdom...\n\nI only wish those who used to call me friend understood."]="I was once a priestess, but I've always been a scholar. The chance to learn from the Highborne seemed more valuable than practicing strict ignorance.\n\nWhat's more most of the apprentices here are youths who came of age during the third war. They need guidance, wisdom...\n\nI only wish those who used to call me friend understood."
G["I was once the Empress Shek'zeer's most prized royal alchemist, peerless, and above all others."]="I was once the Empress Shek'zeer's most prized royal alchemist, peerless, and above all others."
G["I was one of the first tauren druids, of the last generation taught by Shan'do Cenarius, before the Legion, before the Sundering, when the world was still young. Before everything changed.\n\nWhile my brethren hunted great beasts, I hunted stories. I had been drawn to the druidic arts by this hunger, this lust for knowledge. For a time, that hunger was sated as I learned to talk to the trees, rocks, and beasts, and heard their stories.\n\nBut then, the time came when Cenarius walked among us no more and my brethren began to forget what he had taught us. I could not forget, though, and I still needed to learn more about our world.\n\nSo I said my farewells and travelled beyond the lands of my people."]="I was one of the first tauren druids, of the last generation taught by Shan'do Cenarius, before the Legion, before the Sundering, when the world was still young. Before everything changed.\n\nWhile my brethren hunted great beasts, I hunted stories. I had been drawn to the druidic arts by this hunger, this lust for knowledge. For a time, that hunger was sated as I learned to talk to the trees, rocks, and beasts, and heard their stories.\n\nBut then, the time came when Cenarius walked among us no more and my brethren began to forget what he had taught us. I could not forget, though, and I still needed to learn more about our world.\n\nSo I said my farewells and travelled beyond the lands of my people."
G["I was only an infant when my father was deployed to this wasteland. All that I have ever known of him is what others have told me.\n\nDo your dreams change, $n? Mine do not. I have one dream: A crimson skyline envelops me as Legion, numbering beyond comprehension, battle in the distance. I kneel before the body of a man, presumably my father, and weep. As he is gasping for air, his body wholly crushed, he whispers something. Despite every effort, I am unable to hear what he is trying to tell me."]="I was only an infant when my father was deployed to this wasteland. All that I have ever known of him is what others have told me.\n\nDo your dreams change, $n? Mine do not. I have one dream: A crimson skyline envelops me as Legion, numbering beyond comprehension, battle in the distance. I kneel before the body of a man, presumably my father, and weep. As he is gasping for air, his body wholly crushed, he whispers something. Despite every effort, I am unable to hear what he is trying to tell me."
G["I was personally assured by Malygos that your commander would make the details of this accord his top priority. Now let me pass!"]="I was personally assured by Malygos that your commander would make the details of this accord his top priority. Now let me pass!"
G["I was prepared for death. Now... you have given me another chance."]="Já me havia pronto para a morte. Agora... me dados outra oportunidade."
G["I was promised I would never have to encounter the horrors of war at the faire."]="I was promised I would never have to encounter the horrors of war at the faire."
G["I was promised substantial wealth to come out here.\n\nWhat a joke!"]="I was promised substantial wealth to come out here.\n\nWhat a joke!"
G["I was raised at the feet of my father."]="Eu crecí aos pés de meu pai."
G["I was raised on this land... taught to hunt on this very tundra."]="Crecí nesta terra... aprendí a caçar nesta mesma tundra."
G["I was really hoping to find more Honeybrew. I guess I'll just try and find more on my own. Let me know if you need anymore help!"]="I was really hoping to find more Honeybrew. I guess I'll just try and find more on my own. Let me know if you need anymore help!"
G["I was relieving myself into one of the golden pools when they caught me.  I guess you could call it a karma capture."]="I was relieving myself into one of the golden pools when they caught me.  I guess you could call it a karma capture."
G["I was rescued by some new allies. I'm sorry I was not here sooner."]="Me resgataram uns novos aliados. Sinto não haver vindo antes."
G["I was rusty..."]="I was rusty..."
G["I was saved by my last disciple, Muyoh, and a band of adventurers. I considered the entire incident a failure. It wasn't until the Cataclysm occured that I realized I'd been far too successful!\n\nWhen the Barrens was cracked apart, a great font of underground water was breached and flowed up to the surface, full of the energies it was imbued with in the Wailing Caverns. Life immediately sprung from the earth around it, and the animals thrived...and then it continued to grow, uncontrollably, unchecked.\n\nNow I have to answer for my arrogance in thinking I could dictate the flow and shape of nature myself. This overgrowth must be stopped, before it chokes out the natural wildlife entirely."]="I was saved by my last disciple, Muyoh, and a band of adventurers. I considered the entire incident a failure. It wasn't until the Cataclysm occured that I realized I'd been far too successful!\n\nWhen the Barrens was cracked apart, a great font of underground water was breached and flowed up to the surface, full of the energies it was imbued with in the Wailing Caverns. Life immediately sprung from the earth around it, and the animals thrived...and then it continued to grow, uncontrollably, unchecked.\n\nNow I have to answer for my arrogance in thinking I could dictate the flow and shape of nature myself. This overgrowth must be stopped, before it chokes out the natural wildlife entirely."
G["I was searching for materials to build my latest and greatest invention, the portable remote control shredder unit, when these trolls clubbed me and dragged me into the depths of their cave.\n\nReturn me to safety and I will lend my aid to your cause, $r."]="I was searching for materials to build my latest and greatest invention, the portable remote control shredder unit, when these trolls clubbed me and dragged me into the depths of their cave.\n\nReturn me to safety and I will lend my aid to your cause, $r."
G["I was sent to get some of your famous hard ale. Have any to spare?"]="Me têm mandado que consiga um pouco do seu famosa cerveja forte. Te sobra algo?"
G["I was sent to sabotage the Sik'thik bridge reconstruction, but you've fought your way through them like a true $c. You have an opportunity to eliminate their leader!"]="I was sent to sabotage the Sik'thik bridge reconstruction, but you've fought your way through them like a true $c. You have an opportunity to eliminate their leader!"
G["I was shaken, but I did not give up. I pursued the strange old brewer to ask him some more questions."]="I was shaken, but I did not give up. I pursued the strange old brewer to ask him some more questions."
G["I was shot down by that reckless fool, Mulverick. I fear that if I do not make it back to base, all will be lost! Mulverick and his squad of War Riders must be stopped!"]="Fui abatido por esse tolo imprudente, Mulverick. Temo que, se eu não voltar à base, tudo estará perdido! Mulverick e seu esquadrão de Cavaleiros da Guerra devem ser parados!"
G["I was sleeping!"]="Estava durmiendo!"
G["I was standing right next to you, imbecile. I know what you seek."]="Eu estava bem ao seu lado, imbecil. Eu sei o que você procura."
G["I was startin' to think you'd never ask!\n\nWe'll get 'er done eventually, but there's plenty you can do to help.\n\nWe gnomes have a high metabolism - and it only gets higher when we're hard at work. Food will always be welcome.\n\nThen there's oil. These traps are tricky enough without having to worry about gears jamming. Bring us any oil ya find out there.\n\nOutside'a that, just keep us safe!\n\n<Rosey looks aways for a moment, then whispers.>\n\nTh-there might be one other thing..."]="I was startin' to think you'd never ask!\n\nWe'll get 'er done eventually, but there's plenty you can do to help.\n\nWe gnomes have a high metabolism - and it only gets higher when we're hard at work. Food will always be welcome.\n\nThen there's oil. These traps are tricky enough without having to worry about gears jamming. Bring us any oil ya find out there.\n\nOutside'a that, just keep us safe!\n\n<Rosey looks aways for a moment, then whispers.>\n\nTh-there might be one other thing..."
G["I was starting to wonder how long I would be out here."]="I was starting to wonder how long I would be out here."
G["I was supposed to die in battle... ah well, another day.  I will follow you until I recover."]="I was supposed to die in battle... ah well, another day.  I will follow you until I recover."
G["I was supposed to get firewood for the campsite..."]="Se deveria que tinha que ir a por lenha para o acampamento..."
G["I was surely done for. I owe you greatly, $r."]="Estava convencido de que havia chegado meu fim. Te devo uma, $r."
G["I was talking about you and Durty Pete."]="Estava falando de ti e o velho Pete."
G["I was tasked with finding more productive ways to make silk. In my hubris, I created monsters! This is a shame I will carry to the end of my days."]="I was tasked with finding more productive ways to make silk. In my hubris, I created monsters! This is a shame I will carry to the end of my days."
G["I was the first you know. For me the wheel of death has spun many times. So much time has passed... I have a lot of catching up to do."]="I was the first you know. For me the wheel of death has spun many times. So much time has passed... I have a lot of catching up to do."
G["I was the last to die. As I felt my spirit leaving my mortal shell, I swore a blood oath.\n\n<Prince Toreth shakes his head.>\n\nA pact was made between this land and I: My blood for this world. I became the sole keeper of the history of my people.\n\nI cannot rest until I am secure in knowing that the story of the dragon riders of Loreth'Aran is not lost in the passages of time."]="I was the last to die. As I felt my spirit leaving my mortal shell, I swore a blood oath.\n\n<Prince Toreth shakes his head.>\n\nA pact was made between this land and I: My blood for this world. I became the sole keeper of the history of my people.\n\nI cannot rest until I am secure in knowing that the story of the dragon riders of Loreth'Aran is not lost in the passages of time."
G["I was there... at the end..."]="Eu estava lá... no fim..."
G["I was thinking the same thing."]="Estava pensando o mesmo."
G["I was tinkin' dat I was gonna to die in dis jungle."]="Achava que ia a morrer em eh'ta selva."
G["I was told that losing my mount was a death sentence. Thanks for proving the Admiral wrong."]="I was told that losing my mount was a death sentence. Thanks for proving the Admiral wrong."
G["I was told you could get me to Light's Breach...."]="Me têm dito que você pode me levar à Ruptura da Luz..."
G["I was trying to negotiate with the Sin'dorei. I was opening discussions to bring them into the Alliance! By attacking their people, you've forced their hand-"]="Eu estava tentando negociar com os Sin'dorei. Começamos a discutir a entrada deles na Aliança! Mas lançando um ataque, você os forçou a agir..."
G["I was trying to oust one of those lowlifes you so loathe permanently! Next time, I'll be certain to specify that I require a competent investigator!"]="I was trying to oust one of those lowlifes you so loathe permanently! Next time, I'll be certain to specify that I require a competent investigator!"
G["I was up at Whelgar's a few days ago attempting to...er...liberate...some titan relics from the bones of the dead raptors, and I saw him!  Sarltooth lives!  \nWell, he's undead, so I guess he doesn't live, but he exists.  Sarltooth exists!"]="I was up at Whelgar's a few days ago attempting to...er...liberate...some titan relics from the bones of the dead raptors, and I saw him!  Sarltooth lives!  \nWell, he's undead, so I guess he doesn't live, but he exists.  Sarltooth exists!"
G["I was using that."]="Eu estava usando isso."
G["I was waiting for a reason to tear you bone from bone!"]="I was waiting for a reason to tear you bone from bone!"
G["I was warned about you. I should have heeded that warning."]="Foi avisado sobre você. Eu deveria ter prestado atenção."
G["I was wonderin' when you would ask. Sure thing, but I can't today. Once I finish my business at the market, I'll be right over!"]="I was wonderin' when you would ask. Sure thing, but I can't today. Once I finish my business at the market, I'll be right over!"
G["I was wonderin' when you would ask. Sure thing. Let me take care of some things and I'll be right on over."]="I was wonderin' when you would ask. Sure thing. Let me take care of some things and I'll be right on over."
G["I was wondering when I'd see you again, $n."]="Me estava perguntando quando te vería novamente, $n."
G["I was wondering when you would get here, $n!"]="I was wondering when you would get here, $n!"
G["I was working on a cantrip that would counteract my predicament and I was very close to finding a <CROOAAK>... Oh my!"]="I was working on a cantrip that would counteract my predicament and I was very close to finding a <CROOAAK>... Oh my!"
G["I was... once like you. Mortal. Soft. Only flesh and bone. WEAK AND TIMID!"]="Antes... eu era como você. Mortal. Blandito. Somente carne e osso. FRACO E TÍMIDO!"
G["I wash away..."]="Sou tempestade..."
G["I wasn't even shackled... but I don't think I was asleep..."]="I wasn't even shackled... but I don't think I was asleep..."
G["I wasn't even supposed to be here today!"]="Nem sequer deveria estar aqui hoje!"
G["I wasn't expecting anyone down here. Come to keep me company, or just looking for a way out?"]="Eu não estava esperando ninguém aqui embaixo. Vem me fazer companhia, ou apenas procurando uma saída?"
G["I wasn't finished."]="Não havia... terminou."
G["I wasn't ready to die in a marsh.  Thanks again!"]="Não estava pronto para morrer em uma marisma. Obrigado novamente!"
G["I wasn't there, but I heard that Sylvanas died in Silverpine and that her precious val'kyr resurrected her at the cost of their own lives. Know anything about it?"]="I wasn't there, but I heard that Sylvanas died in Silverpine and that her precious val'kyr resurrected her at the cost of their own lives. Know anything about it?"
G["I wasn't too sure 'bout you when you first came to the valley, but now I can proudly call you my neighbor. As a token of my friendship, I'd like to give ye a big something for yer farm. She should be there already. Name's Miss Fifi, and she likes to eat turnips!"]="I wasn't too sure 'bout you when you first came to the valley, but now I can proudly call you my neighbor. As a token of my friendship, I'd like to give ye a big something for yer farm. She should be there already. Name's Miss Fifi, and she likes to eat turnips!"
G["I watch as my lineage is reduced to a faded memory around me.  Once the greatest of all brewmasters we now stand backstage to the Stormstouts.  Bah!"]="I watch as my lineage is reduced to a faded memory around me.  Once the greatest of all brewmasters we now stand backstage to the Stormstouts.  Bah!"
G["I watch our new enemies.\n\nThe straight-back trolls ally with the mogu, but the other invaders fight against them.\n\nPfah! I do not care. Their battles have given us many new corpses to scavenge. The Skumblade have never been stronger."]="I watch our new enemies.\n\nThe straight-back trolls ally with the mogu, but the other invaders fight against them.\n\nPfah! I do not care. Their battles have given us many new corpses to scavenge. The Skumblade have never been stronger."
G["I watched Master Windfur fight a dozen mogu once without any of them successfully landing a blow."]="I watched Master Windfur fight a dozen mogu once without any of them successfully landing a blow."
G["I watched as he steered us through adversity, never flinching from difficult decisions."]="I watched as he steered us through adversity, never flinching from difficult decisions."
G["I watched as they beat him without mercy. Their ruthless lieutenant acted as if such cruelty was an act of normalcy. Through the savage beatings, I could feel myself breaking.\n\nAs I watched Vindicator Saruan take their blows, I began to weep. Not out of fear... I wept out of sadness. To see a draenei of the Triumvirate treated in such a manner. If only I could have broken free of my bonds. If only..."]="I watched as they beat him without mercy. Their ruthless lieutenant acted as if such cruelty was an act of normalcy. Through the savage beatings, I could feel myself breaking.\n\nAs I watched Vindicator Saruan take their blows, I began to weep. Not out of fear... I wept out of sadness. To see a draenei of the Triumvirate treated in such a manner. If only I could have broken free of my bonds. If only..."
G["I watched the mogu torture my friends. Thanks to you, I have been spared."]="I watched the mogu torture my friends. Thanks to you, I have been spared."
G["I weep at these atrocities we commit. It is almost unbearable."]="I weep at these atrocities we commit. It is almost unbearable."
G["I weep for the fortune of this village. Their hard times seem to be without end, and with the mogu in the vale, it will likely be some time before they ever will."]="Choro pela fortuna desta aldeia. Seus tempos difíceis parecem não terminar nunca, e com os mogu no vale, a situação ainda tardará em melhorar."
G["I weep for you, $n. You really have no idea what you've gotten yourself into..."]="Choro por você, $n. Não tem nem ideia do que se te vem acima..."
G["I welcome you into an eternity of service, thief."]="Dou a você a boas-vindas a uma eternidade de serviço."
G["I welcome you to Sporeggar, $r.  We don't normally see many of your kind around here, but you've proven your worth to us.  Make yourself at home."]="Dou a você a boas-vindas a Sporeggar, $r. Não solemos receber a visite de gente como você por aqui, mas você nos tem ajudado. Esta é seu casa."
G["I welcome you to Theramore, $n.\n\nI apologize for being abrupt and not having a lot of time to exchange pleasantries, but my city must come first. Too many things threaten our way of life and the sanctity of the Alliance. I must stay ever vigilant against forces outside of our control if I'm to ensure my people remain safe and happy.\n\nPerhaps we'll have more time to speak later."]="I welcome you to Theramore, $n.\n\nI apologize for being abrupt and not having a lot of time to exchange pleasantries, but my city must come first. Too many things threaten our way of life and the sanctity of the Alliance. I must stay ever vigilant against forces outside of our control if I'm to ensure my people remain safe and happy.\n\nPerhaps we'll have more time to speak later."
G["I wept like a babe when I heard of your heroics. Master Ravenholdt would do well to have an apprentice like you."]="Lhoré como um bebé quando ouvi seus heroicas façanhas. O Mestre Ravenholdt fará bem em ter a um aprendiz como você."
G["I weren't scurred..."]="Não tinha medo..."
G["I wield... the LIGHT!"]="Eu manejo... a LUZ!"
G["I will DESTROY you!"]="I will DESTROY you!"
G["I will NEVER be controlled! The Red Dragonflight has no idea what they unleashed when they experimented on my egg."]="I will NEVER be controlled! The Red Dragonflight has no idea what they unleashed when they experimented on my egg."
G["I will NEVER yield!"]="I will NEVER yield!"
G["I will NOT be a tool of the naga.  I will resist as long as I can, but I can't last forever.  Please, someone, stop them!"]="I will NOT be a tool of the naga.  I will resist as long as I can, but I can't last forever.  Please, someone, stop them!"
G["I will NOT be betrayed again! Those responsible for this will be punished!"]="I will NOT be betrayed again! Those responsible for this will be punished!"
G["I will NOT burn like the rest! Face the demons you fear, traitors!"]="I will NOT burn like the rest! Face the demons you fear, traitors!"
G["I will NOT have Horde on my ship!"]="A Horda NÃO pisará meu navio!"
G["I will NOT submit!"]="I will NOT submit!"
G["I will NOT, Archbishop. It will never be yours."]="I will NOT, Archbishop. It will never be yours."
G["I will RIP off your HEADS and EAT your filthy faces!"]="I will RIP off your HEADS and EAT your filthy faces!"
G["I will access the discs now."]="Vou acessar os discos agora."
G["I will accompany you, Sullah."]="I will accompany you, Sullah."
G["I will add your watery innards to my own."]="I will add your watery innards to my own."
G["I will aid you. Give me the instructions."]="Te ajudarei. Dê-me as instruções."
G["I will attempt to not take undue pleasure in utterly destroying you."]="I will attempt to not take undue pleasure in utterly destroying you."
G["I will attempt to seal the scar, $n. Make sure nothing from the other side makes its way through!"]="I will attempt to seal the scar, $n. Make sure nothing from the other side makes its way through!"
G["I will banish you to the land of wind and ghosts!"]="I will banish you to the land of wind and ghosts!"
G["I will bathe in your blood!"]="I will bathe in your blood!"
G["I will be a gracious winner, I promise!"]="I will be a gracious winner, I promise!"
G["I will be avenged!"]="I will be avenged!"
G["I will be better prepared next time we meet!"]="A próxima vez que nos encontremos estarei melhor pronto!"
G["I will be fine.\n\nThis is nothing compared to the thousand scars of battle!"]="Me pondré bem.\n\nIsto não é nada comparado com as milhares de cicatrizes da batalha!"
G["I will be goin' now.  I have no reason to remain here.  I may be undead, but my will is my own."]="Agora me vou. Não tenho nenhuma razão para seguir aqui. É possível que seja um não-morto, mas meu vontade é minha."
G["I will be happy to slaughter them in your name! Come, enemies of the Scourge! I will show you the might of the Lich King!"]="I will be happy to slaughter them in your name! Come, enemies of the Scourge! I will show you the might of the Lich King!"
G["I will be here doing research if anybody's got any problems for the next hour and a half."]="Se alguém tem algum problema na seguinte hora e média, estarei aqui mesmo, investigando."
G["I will be reborn, mortals! Incendius shall raise me from these ashes!"]="I will be reborn, mortals! Incendius shall raise me from these ashes!"
G["I will be the blade at the throat of our enemies."]="Serei a lâmina na garganta de nossos inimigos."
G["I will be the savior of our people! I WILL FULFILL MY DESTINY!"]="I will be the savior of our people! I WILL FULFILL MY DESTINY!"
G["I will be watching you closely, hero!"]="Estarei vigiando você de perto!"
G["I will be with the Lightning Sons should you require my services."]="Estarei com os Filhos do Raio se você precisa meus serviços."
G["I will be your chosen knight, Salanar!"]="Eu serei seu cavaleiro escolhido, Salanar!"
G["I will be your wingman!"]="Eu serei seus asas!"
G["I will begin the ritual. Prepare yourself!"]="Vou iniciar o ritual. Prepare-se!"
G["I will break these bonds that hold me and send you all back to the hell from whence you came!"]="I will break these bonds that hold me and send you all back to the hell from whence you came!"
G["I will break you in two! Relent, fool!"]="I will break you in two! Relent, fool!"
G["I will break you!"]="I will break you!"
G["I will break you, little rock man!"]="I will break you, little rock man!"
G["I will break you."]="Os farei pedaços."
G["I will break you... as I broke him!"]="I will break you... as I broke him!"
G["I will breathe easier knowing this one is gone."]="I will breathe easier knowing this one is gone."
G["I will bring you closer to the Emerald Dream. Seek safety there when the fight becomes too intense."]="I will bring you closer to the Emerald Dream. Seek safety there when the fight becomes too intense."
G["I will burn away your impurities!"]="I will burn away your impurities!"
G["I will burn you from the inside out!"]="I will burn you from the inside out!"
G["I will burn you from the sky!"]="I will burn you from the sky!"
G["I will burn your corpses to ash!"]="I will burn your corpses to ash!"
G["I will bury ya all!"]="I will bury ya all!"
G["I will call for you when the dawning is upon us."]="I will call for you when the dawning is upon us."
G["I will call forth Eranikus when I am given the word."]="I will call forth Eranikus when I am given the word."
G["I will carry you one last time Wakener... to your doom!"]="Te levarei uma última vez, arauto... ao seu tumba!"
G["I will catch you, small one!"]="I will catch you, small one!"
G["I will channel my powers into the orbs! Be ready!"]="I will channel my powers into the orbs! Be ready!"
G["I will charge you with arcane energy to blast your foes."]="I will charge you with arcane energy to blast your foes."
G["I will check back with you shortly, Kadrak."]="Pronto me pondré em contato com você, Kadrak."
G["I will cleanse whatever corruption I can; my fire will not harm you."]="I will cleanse whatever corruption I can; my fire will not harm you."
G["I will cleanse you from the face of the world!"]="I will cleanse you from the face of the world!"
G["I will cleanse your sins with the edge of my dagger."]="I will cleanse your sins with the edge of my dagger."
G["I will cleave the soul from between your bones!"]="I will cleave the soul from between your bones!"
G["I will come back for you all!"]="Voltarei a por todos vocês!"
G["I will concentrate on a first place finish."]="I will concentrate on a first place finish."
G["I will concern myself with how it works once I have it in my possessions, Blood Elf."]="I will concern myself with how it works once I have it in my possessions, Blood Elf."
G["I will consider what you have told me."]="Vou considerar o que você disse para mim."
G["I will consult the others. Meet me at the gates."]="Vou consultar os outros. Encontre-me nos portões."
G["I will continue my research in memory of Magtoor."]="I will continue my research in memory of Magtoor."
G["I will cover the flanks. Gather up our explosives and get them to the wall. Hurry!"]="I will cover the flanks. Gather up our explosives and get them to the wall. Hurry!"
G["I will crush any who oppose the Warchief!"]="I will crush any who oppose the Warchief!"
G["I will crush it and flay it and eat its meat and crack its bones one by one when I am done."]="I will crush it and flay it and eat its meat and crack its bones one by one when I am done."
G["I will crush the breath from your lungs!"]="I will crush the breath from your lungs!"
G["I will crush the life from your skull!"]="I will crush the life from your skull!"
G["I will crush you all!"]="I will crush you all!"
G["I will crush you all! For the Horde!"]="I will crush you all! For the Horde!"
G["I will crush you beneath my boots!"]="I will crush you beneath my boots!"
G["I will crush you beneath the onslaught of my team!"]="Vou esmagá-los sob a potência da minha equipe!"
G["I will crush you into little tiny pieces!"]="I will crush you into little tiny pieces!"
G["I will crush you under foot!"]="I will crush you under foot!"
G["I will crush you under the weight of my waves!"]="I will crush you under the weight of my waves!"
G["I will crush you with my own two fists."]="I will crush you with my own two fists."
G["I will crush you!"]="I will crush you!"
G["I will crush you, in body AND spirit."]="I will crush you, in body AND spirit."
G["I will crush your bones to dust."]="I will crush your bones to dust."
G["I will crush your delusions of grandeur!"]="I will crush your delusions of grandeur!"
G["I will crush your skull with my bare hands."]="I will crush your skull with my bare hands."
G["I will cut down anyone I see fleeing from battle. For Garrosh!"]="I will cut down anyone I see fleeing from battle. For Garrosh!"
G["I will deal with Proudmoore."]="Eu me encargo de Corajoso."
G["I will deal with these mongrels! Strike now, friends! Strike at the Betrayer!"]="I will deal with these mongrels! Strike now, friends! Strike at the Betrayer!"
G["I will defeat you."]="Eu derrotarei você."
G["I will defend Ramkahen with my bare hands if I have to!"]="I will defend Ramkahen with my bare hands if I have to!"
G["I will defend the vale with my life!"]="I will defend the vale with my life!"
G["I will defend this portal with my life!"]="I will defend this portal with my life!"
G["I will delay here until more reinforcements arrive, but you have to keep moving.\n\nWe won't have much time until Arthas realizes we're here."]="I will delay here until more reinforcements arrive, but you have to keep moving.\n\nWe won't have much time until Arthas realizes we're here."
G["I will delay here until more reinforcements arrive, but you must keep moving. Arthas will soon realize that we're here."]="Vou demorar aqui até que mais reforços cheguem, mas você deve seguir em linha de frente. Arthas logo perceberá que estamos aqui."
G["I will delay the Aspect of Death. Take her to safety. GO!"]="Eu entretendré ao Aspecto da Morte. Lhévala a um lugar certo. VÁ EMBORA!"
G["I will deliver my enemies to their ancestors!"]="I will deliver my enemies to their ancestors!"
G["I will deliver my report to our leader, then.  By your leave, my lady."]="I will deliver my report to our leader, then.  By your leave, my lady."
G["I will deliver this information to King Wrynn, Thrall, but..."]="Farei chegar esta informações ao rei Wrynn, Thrall, mas..."
G["I will destroy the Argent Crusade! I will crush the Scourge!"]="I will destroy the Argent Crusade! I will crush the Scourge!"
G["I will destroy this barrier. You must hold the undead back!"]="I will destroy this barrier. You must hold the undead back!"
G["I will destroy this cave in, and then we can sneak in from behind. Let me know when you are ready."]="I will destroy this cave in, and then we can sneak in from behind. Let me know when you are ready."
G["I will destroy you!"]="I will destroy you!"
G["I will destroy you..."]="I will destroy you..."
G["I will devour you whole!"]="I will devour you whole!"
G["I will devour your souls, insolent mortals!"]="I will devour your souls, insolent mortals!"
G["I will dismantle this festering hellhole!"]="I will dismantle this festering hellhole!"
G["I will dispose of the outsiders."]="I will dispose of the outsiders."
G["I will do as you ask, demon.  At least for now."]="Farei o que me pides, demônio. Ao menos por agora."
G["I will do as you wish!"]="Farei o que quiser."
G["I will do my best to take care of the children, Greatmother."]="I will do my best to take care of the children, Greatmother."
G["I will do my best to translate and describe what I see."]="I will do my best to translate and describe what I see."
G["I will do my best, Regent Lord. My troops are ready."]="Farei o possível, Senhor Regente. Estamos prontos."
G["I will do my best, Vaelan."]="Eu farei o meu melhor, Vaelan."
G["I will do no such thing. I simply cannot leave Taretha in danger while I run off into the mountains. I am no coward. Now, where is she?"]="Eu não farei tal coisa. Simplesmente não posso deixar Taretha em perigo enquanto corro para as montanhas. Eu não sou covarde. Agora onde ela está?"
G["I will do this ONE thing that you ask of me, quest giver. Pray I find more menial tasks to accomplish or you will be hearing from me again and I assure you that my commentary on forums of public opinion will be most unkind."]="I will do this ONE thing that you ask of me, quest giver. Pray I find more menial tasks to accomplish or you will be hearing from me again and I assure you that my commentary on forums of public opinion will be most unkind."
G["I will do this with or without your help, Loramus."]="Farei isso com ou sem à sua ajuda, Loramus."
G["I will do what Pa'valak could not!"]="I will do what Pa'valak could not!"
G["I will drain the red blood from your bodies!"]="I will drain the red blood from your bodies!"
G["I will drink no blood before its time."]="I will drink no blood before its time."
G["I will drink your blood!"]="I will drink your blood!"
