G["I wish I could aid you in your plight, mortal. But the blue dragonflight is in disarray, and there are other urgent matters here at the World Tree that I've been sent to investigate..."]="I wish I could aid you in your plight, mortal. But the blue dragonflight is in disarray, and there are other urgent matters here at the World Tree that I've been sent to investigate..."
