G["I wish I knew, dear. He will not listen to you nor will he listen to me. In truth, it is why I am still here. It is why I have not left with Mother Kashur. He must find his heart. Our people will not survive through the winter without leadership."]="Eu gostaria de saber, querida. Ele não vai ouvir você nem vai me ouvir. Na verdade, é por isso que ainda estou aqui. É por isso que não saí com a mãe Kashur. Ele deve encontrar seu coração. Nosso povo não sobreviverá durante o inverno sem liderança."
G["I wish for a million gold, wait a second  I already have a million gold...  I wish for a million million gold!"]="I wish for a million gold, wait a second  I already have a million gold...  I wish for a million million gold!"
G["I wish it were true, $n, but it will take more than you alone to overcome the forces of Razelikh and his subordinates.\n\nGather a suitable group of adventurers and would-be heroes and free my men of their eternal torture! Eighteen stones you must shatter.\n\nFight hard and die with honor, $n."]="I wish it were true, $n, but it will take more than you alone to overcome the forces of Razelikh and his subordinates.\n\nGather a suitable group of adventurers and would-be heroes and free my men of their eternal torture! Eighteen stones you must shatter.\n\nFight hard and die with honor, $n."
