G["I wish to untrain my pet."]="Eu gostaria de treinar meu animal de estimação."
G["I wish we had a priest or a druid out here. I can't continue my studies until I've recovered from my injuries."]="Eu gostaria que tivéssemos um para ou um druida aqui. Não posso seguir meus estudos até me recuperar de meus ferimentos."
G["I wish you a happy holiday, friend!"]="Desejo-lhe boas festas, amigo!"
G["I wish you could just pick me up and carry me."]="I wish you could just pick me up and carry me."
G["I wish you the best of luck on your adventures here!"]="Te desejo muita sorte nos seus aventuras!"
G["I wish you the best of luck."]="Eu lhe desejo muita sorte."
G["I wish you'd surrendered."]="I wish you'd surrendered."
G["I witnessed the handiwork of our new goblin allies when I was stranded in the Lost Isles. But now we put their ingenuity to the test: here we face down our foes in their own stronghold."]="Testemunhei o trabalho manual de nossos novos aliados duendes quando fiquei preso nas Ilhas Perdidas. Mas agora colocamos à prova à sua ingenuidade: aqui enfrentamos nossos inimigos na sua própria fortaleza."
G["I woke up in a bed in Northshire three weeks later. Don't remember a damn thing."]="I woke up in a bed in Northshire three weeks later. Don't remember a damn thing."
G["I won a Brawler's Guild invitation just now! I'll surely be rank 8 by tonight!  I sure hope I don't lose my ticket before I get there."]="I won a Brawler's Guild invitation just now! I'll surely be rank 8 by tonight!  I sure hope I don't lose my ticket before I get there."
G["I won't allow it, Mal'Ganis! Better that these people die by my hand than serve as your slaves in death!"]="I won't allow it, Mal'Ganis! Better that these people die by my hand than serve as your slaves in death!"
G["I won't be far!"]="Não estarei longe!"
G["I won't be getting any dirt on this beautiful face."]="Esta linda rosto não se vai manchar de terra."
G["I won't be held responsible for the catastrophe that will surely result from the haphazard maintenance of this building."]="I won't be held responsible for the catastrophe that will surely result from the haphazard maintenance of this building."
G["I won't be the least bit upset if you choose to call it a day...."]="Não me molestará o mais mínimo se decidir que temos terminado por hoje..."
G["I won't beat the others by standing around talking to you."]="Não vou ganhar a ninguém se me quedo aparo falando com você."
G["I won't challenge you, but I'd like to see your wares."]="Não vou desafiá-o, mas gostaria de ver seus produtos."
G["I won't forget this.  Thank you."]="Não o esquecerei. Obrigado."
G["I won't give you the pleasure."]="Não lhe darei esse prazer."
G["I won't go back!"]="Não vou voltar!"
G["I won't go down that easy!"]="Não acabarás comigo tão facilmente!"
G["I won't go easy on you!"]="Eu não vou facilitar pra você!"
G["I won't hear ya say such tings."]="Eu não quero saber de tu dizer essas coisas."
G["I won't leave your side."]="I won't leave your side."
G["I won't leave!"]="Não me irei!"
G["I won't let them get away with this, Twinkles. They will pay! They will all pay!"]="I won't let them get away with this, Twinkles. They will pay! They will all pay!"
G["I won't let them take me!"]="Não deixarei que me cojan!"
G["I won't let those damned orcs invade Redridge again!"]="Não deixarei que aqueles malditos orcs invadam Redridge novamente!"
G["I won't let you down!"]="I won't let you down!"
G["I won't let you get away with that!"]="Não vou deixar você se sair bem dessa!"
G["I won't let you take us down that dark path again, young Hellscream. I'll kill you myself before that day comes..."]="I won't let you take us down that dark path again, young Hellscream. I'll kill you myself before that day comes..."
G["I won't let your families see you like this!  Us miners have to look after each other!"]="I won't let your families see you like this!  Us miners have to look after each other!"
G["I won't make it... go... go on without me..."]="I won't make it... go... go on without me..."
G["I won't sacrifice my warriors for romantic notions of glorious death on the battlefield. What use is fighting for survival if no one survives?"]="I won't sacrifice my warriors for romantic notions of glorious death on the battlefield. What use is fighting for survival if no one survives?"
G["I won't soon forget this kindness, $r."]="Não esquecerei esta amabilidade facilmente, $r."
G["I won't throw away Alliance lives. I will accept nothing less than total victory."]="I won't throw away Alliance lives. I will accept nothing less than total victory."
G["I won't... be... ignored!"]="Não... serei... ignorado!"
G["I wonder how Seth's mom is doing?"]="Me pergunto que tal lhe irá à mamãe de Seth."
G["I wonder how far the gears turn?"]="Me pergunto qual será o limite dos engranagens."
G["I wonder how far this would launch that white cat..."]="Me pergunto a que distância lanzaría isto a esse gato alvo..."
G["I wonder how fast these guys can move?"]="Me pergunto a que velocidade se podem mover."
G["I wonder how long it would take to get all of this?"]="Me pergunto quanto tempo poderá levar conseguir tudo isso."
G["I wonder how long we'll be here before the general gives us our marching orders."]="Me pergunto até quando estaremos aqui antes de que o geral nos dé a ordem de marchar."
G["I wonder how many kegs these animals can hold?"]="Me pergunto quantos barris podem levar estes animais."
G["I wonder how many more of them live among us. I knew Spark for years - never could I have imagined that he was a traitor."]="Eu me pergunto quantos mais deles vivem entre nós. Eu conhecia o Spark há anos - nunca poderia imaginar que ele era um traidor."
G["I wonder how many reinforcements need to suffer injury before they allow us to chop down these idiotic trees. They're costing us a fortune in bats. Maybe I'll rig a harness or two..."]="I wonder how many reinforcements need to suffer injury before they allow us to chop down these idiotic trees. They're costing us a fortune in bats. Maybe I'll rig a harness or two..."
G["I wonder how much longer they'll be in Silvermoon City. I hope they play here!"]="Gostaria de saber quanto tempo eles ficarão em Silvermoon City. Espero que eles joguem aqui!"
G["I wonder how often the sandbox gets cleaned."]="I wonder how often the sandbox gets cleaned."
G["I wonder how they got hurt."]="Me pergunto como se fizeram dano."
G["I wonder if I'll ever be the same after this. Heh, nuthin' a pint won't cure I'll wager."]="Me pergunto se serei o mesmo depois de isto. Não há nada que uma boa cerveja não cure."
G["I wonder if I'm too cute for the jungle?"]="Serei demais mona para a selva?"
G["I wonder if Ma Stonefield ever fixed the lock on that window..."]="I wonder if Ma Stonefield ever fixed the lock on that window..."
G["I wonder if Sayge plays Whack-a-Gnoll?"]="Me pergunto se Sayge joga a acerto ao gnolh?"
G["I wonder if Uncle came through here on his way to the brewery."]="Me pergunto se o tio Chen passou por aqui de caminho à cervejaria."
G["I wonder if anyone survived..."]="Me pergunto se haverá sobrevivido alguém..."
G["I wonder if it's possible to eat rocks? Got plenty of rocks around here. Just imagine it! I'd be the richest person in the world for making that discovery!"]="I wonder if it's possible to eat rocks? Got plenty of rocks around here. Just imagine it! I'd be the richest person in the world for making that discovery!"
G["I wonder if my shoes are too fancy for exploring?"]="Me pergunto se meus sapatos são demais elegantes para explorar..."
G["I wonder if our fates are somehow cursed. The horrors inflicted on us never seem to cease.\n\nSometimes all you can do is try to maintain good spirits, and perhaps a mild appreciation for fickle twists of fortune, whichever way they turn."]="Me pergunto se nosso destino está maldito. Os horrores que temos sofrido parecem não ter fim.\n\nA veceslo único que pode fazer é tentar manter um bom espírito e, talvez, apreciar os giros caprichosos do destino."
G["I wonder if that cute pilot with the pink hair is still around..."]="Me pergunto se esse bonito piloto de cabelo de cor rosa ainda anda por aqui…"
G["I wonder if the fortunes are real..."]="I wonder if the fortunes are real..."
G["I wonder if the pigs are hungry..."]="I wonder if the pigs are hungry..."
G["I wonder if there's a cave behind it."]="Talvez tenha uma caverna por trás..."
G["I wonder if there's anything this healer isn't good at!"]="Me pergunto se há algo que não se lhe dé bem ao curandeiro."
G["I wonder if they can fly?"]="Me pergunto se podem voar."
G["I wonder if they ever burn themselves."]="I wonder if they ever burn themselves."
G["I wonder if we could all get launched out together..."]="I wonder if we could all get launched out together..."
G["I wonder if we'll ever solve the mystery of the strange ore. There's gotta be some use for it!"]="Me pergunto se alguma vez desvelaremos o mistério da estranha mena. Precisa servir para algo!"
G["I wonder if you can really hear the ocean in these things."]="I wonder if you can really hear the ocean in these things."
G["I wonder if your Grindgear Gorilla can jump across the Park!"]="Me pergunto se seu gorila de brinquedo pode saltar até o outro lado do parque!"
G["I wonder if your dolly can swim!"]="Me pergunto se seu munheca sabe nadar!"
G["I wonder what Nesingwary will give me for your hide!"]="Me pergunto que me dará Nesingwary pelo seu pelego!"
G["I wonder what brings you to our lands, stranger.\n\nThe mists of Pandaria will reveal the answer in time..."]="Me pergunto que te traz a nossas terras.\n\nA névoa de Pandaria nos revelará a resposta ao seu devido tempo..."
G["I wonder what exploding feels like?"]="Me pergunto que se sente ao explodir?"
G["I wonder what it's like to have so much fame?"]="Me pergunto como será ter tanta fama."
G["I wonder what made a hole in the roof of the Inn in the first place. See what happens when you drop a copper piece off of the edge of Outland?"]="I wonder what made a hole in the roof of the Inn in the first place. See what happens when you drop a copper piece off of the edge of Outland?"
G["I wonder what that little purple creature at the village is... It's certainly beautiful."]="Me pergunto que é essa criaturita púrpura da aldeia... sem dúvida é preciosa."
G["I wonder what there is to hunt in Northrend.  Fierce beasts, I wager."]="I wonder what there is to hunt in Northrend.  Fierce beasts, I wager."
G["I wonder what this button does..."]="Me pergunto para que serve este botão..."
G["I wonder what this seed will grow into?"]="Me pergunto no que essa semente vai se transformar..."
G["I wonder what those bones are from."]="Me preguntó de que serão estes ossos."
G["I wonder where the baby is?"]="Onde estará o bebé?"
G["I wonder where we're headed to. And who's going to deal with these guys?"]="I wonder where we're headed to. And who's going to deal with these guys?"
G["I wonder who talked Xuen in to letting the sauroks compete. I like a good test of strength, but those creatures are just... so... angry."]="I wonder who talked Xuen in to letting the sauroks compete. I like a good test of strength, but those creatures are just... so... angry."
G["I wonder why the sporelings live under the bridge?"]="I wonder why the sporelings live under the bridge?"
G["I wonder, does Oshu'gun still stand... Oh the stories I could tell of the time before the darkness... So many wonderous memories..."]="I wonder, does Oshu'gun still stand... Oh the stories I could tell of the time before the darkness... So many wonderous memories..."
G["I wonder, heroes, what will you do when I manage to destroy this shard? Will the world be beyond salvation?"]="I wonder, heroes, what will you do when I manage to destroy this shard? Will the world be beyond salvation?"
G["I wonder. Did my master send you as a distraction from my studies?\n\n...or perhaps you were sent to test my patience."]="I wonder. Did my master send you as a distraction from my studies?\n\n...or perhaps you were sent to test my patience."
G["I wonder. Hamuul has guided us well, and I've learned so much from him. The legends say that our people were druids when time began..."]="Me pergunto. Hamuul nos tem guiado bem e aprendi muito de ele. As lendas dizem que nossa gente eram druidas ao início dos tempos..."
G["I worry about you sometimes, Nat."]="A vezes me preocupas, Nat."
G["I worry you may be too soft to wear your kingdom's crown, Prince Anduin. You would do well to learn some of your father's hardness."]="Temo que você seja muito compassivo para carregar a coroa do seu reino, Príncipe Anduin. Você deveria aprender um pouco da firmeza do seu pai."
G["I woudn't serve that to a Worg!"]="I woudn't serve that to a Worg!"
G["I would DESTROY them. It is worthless to stay here!"]="I would DESTROY them. It is worthless to stay here!"
G["I would ENJOY the trip more if we were actually GOING somewhere!"]="I would ENJOY the trip more if we were actually GOING somewhere!"
G["I would ask your forgiveness for the suffering I have caused you and your people."]="I would ask your forgiveness for the suffering I have caused you and your people."
G["I would be delighted to aid you in the commencement of your pursuit! Let me grab my spinner and we'll get started..."]="Eu ficaria feliz em ajudá-o no início da sua procurando! Deixe-me pegar meu girador e vamos começar..."
G["I would be grateful for any aid you can provide, Priestess."]="Agradecería qualquer ajuda que me pudesse oferecer, sacerdotisa."
G["I would be happy to take you under my wing. Let us begin."]="Eu ficaria feliz em levá-o sob minha asa. Comecemos."
G["I would be happy to teach you when you are ready, but that time has not yet come! I'm sure Lalina Summermoon will guide you until then. You may find her in the Craftsmen's Terrace in Darnassus."]="I would be happy to teach you when you are ready, but that time has not yet come! I'm sure Lalina Summermoon will guide you until then. You may find her in the Craftsmen's Terrace in Darnassus."
G["I would be honored by your patronage, adventurer."]="I would be honored by your patronage, adventurer."
G["I would be honored to train you in the use of the weapons that I have mastered should you have the ability to learn within you."]="Eu ficaria honrado em treiná-o no uso das armas que eu dominei, atenção você tenha a capacidade de aprender dentro de você."
G["I would be lying if I said that I did not appreciate this opportunity to relax."]="I would be lying if I said that I did not appreciate this opportunity to relax."
G["I would bet your soul on it."]="Apostaría sua alma."
G["I would commit our order to an Alliance victory!"]="I would commit our order to an Alliance victory!"
G["I would create some surreptitious means to keep my brother out of the order.  I can keep him out without him being any bit wiser, thereby saving our familial bonds."]="Eu criaria algum meios clandestinos de manter meu irmão fosse da ordem. Eu posso mantê-o fosse sem que ele seja um pouco mais sábio, superando assim nossos laços familiares."
G["I would do anything for love. But I won't do that. At least, not right away."]="I would do anything for love. But I won't do that. At least, not right away."
G["I would enjoy the trip more if we were actually GOING somewhere!"]="I would enjoy the trip more if we were actually GOING somewhere!"
G["I would gladly bear any curse to save my homeland."]="I would gladly bear any curse to save my homeland."
G["I would gladly fight by your side, but you do not require my assistance."]="Lucfaria ao seu lado encantado, mas não te há falta minha ajuda."
G["I would gladly give my life to ensure the safety of Honeydew Village. Its legacy is my own."]="I would gladly give my life to ensure the safety of Honeydew Village. Its legacy is my own."
G["I would have burned this whole place down with them in it..."]="Eu lhe haveria prendido fogo a tudo este lugar com eles dentro..."
G["I would have charged right in. Many more lives would have been lost in my rush for victory."]="I would have charged right in. Many more lives would have been lost in my rush for victory."
G["I would have died in the Jade Forest had it not been for a pandaren mistweaver who healed my wounds after the battle.\n\nThese pandaren are good people and deserve our protection from the domination of the Alliance."]="I would have died in the Jade Forest had it not been for a pandaren mistweaver who healed my wounds after the battle.\n\nThese pandaren are good people and deserve our protection from the domination of the Alliance."
G["I would have it back, mortal. Atiesh... From it I would create the Highborne anew. I would have it all back. Even the Queen..."]="Eu teria de volta, mortal. Atiesh... A partir disso, eu criaria os Highborne novamente. Eu teria tudo de volta. Até a rainha..."
G["I would have it no other way."]="Não o gostaria de outra maneira."
G["I would have just dropped some Evershine in my tank and been back home before they realized I'd gone!"]="I would have just dropped some Evershine in my tank and been back home before they realized I'd gone!"
G["I would have traveled across the Great Sea to see you, friend. We will never forget what you did for us."]="Eu teria viajado pelo Grande Mar para vê-o, amigo. Nunca esqueceremos o que você fez por nós."
G["I would like a blue serpent egg."]="Gostaria um ovo de dragão azul."
G["I would like a green serpent egg."]="Gostaria um ovo de dragão verde."
G["I would like a yellow serpent egg."]="Gostaria um ovo de dragão amarelo."
G["I would like that very much, Chi-Ji."]="Me viria muito bem, Chi-Ji."
G["I would like to browse your goods, Illusia."]="Gostaria de procurar seus produtos, Illusia."
G["I would like to buy from you."]="Eu gostaria de comprar de você."
G["I would like to check my deposit box."]="Gostaria de verificar meu cofre."
G["I would like to continue my training so that I may always defend our home."]="I would like to continue my training so that I may always defend our home."
G["I would like to drive a demolisher."]="I would like to drive a demolisher."
G["I would like to enter my e-coupon code to win the virtual item."]="I would like to enter my e-coupon code to win the virtual item."
G["I would like to enter the secret code to receive my Big Blizzard Bear."]="Gostaria de inserir o código secreto para receber meu Big Blizzard Bear."
G["I would like to enter the secret code to receive my Competitor's Souvenir."]="I would like to enter the secret code to receive my Competitor's Souvenir."
G["I would like to enter the secret code to receive my Golden Pig pet."]="I would like to enter the secret code to receive my Golden Pig pet."
G["I would like to enter the secret code to receive my Murloc costume."]="Gostaria de inserir o código secreto para receber minha roupa de Murloc."
G["I would like to enter the secret code to receive my Murloc pet."]="Gostaria de inserir o código secreto para receber meu animal de estimação Murloc."
G["I would like to enter the secret code to receive my Zergling pet."]="I would like to enter the secret code to receive my Zergling pet."
G["I would like to fight in an arena."]="Eu gostaria de lutar em uma arena."
G["I would like to go back and see one of the visions again. Do you still have the enchanted blade?"]="Gostaria voltar e ver uma das visões outra vez. Ainda tem a lâmina encantado?"
G["I would like to go to Krasarang Wilds."]="I would like to go to Krasarang Wilds."
G["I would like to go to Lord Afrasastrasz in the middle of the temple."]="Eu gostaria de ir ao lorde Afrasastrasz no meio do templo."
G["I would like to go to the battleground."]="Eu gostaria de ir para o campo de batalha."
G["I would like to practice catch with a baby serpent."]="I would like to practice catch with a baby serpent."
G["I would like to receive training."]="Gostaria receber treinamento."
G["I would like to reiterate how pleased I am with the continued development of our working relationship, $n. In the weeks following my stunning cognitive enhancement, my goblin benefactors became apprehensive, perhaps outright distrustful, as my intellect eclipsed theirs.\n\nWhat a shame that my progenitors were unable to prevent this recent cascading series of industrial 'accidents' that now allows me to operate so unencumbered..."]="I would like to reiterate how pleased I am with the continued development of our working relationship, $n. In the weeks following my stunning cognitive enhancement, my goblin benefactors became apprehensive, perhaps outright distrustful, as my intellect eclipsed theirs.\n\nWhat a shame that my progenitors were unable to prevent this recent cascading series of industrial 'accidents' that now allows me to operate so unencumbered..."
G["I would like to return to the temple grounds."]="Gostaria voltar às terras do templo."
G["I would like to ride in one of your canoes, Jimmy."]="Gostaria montar em uma das seus canoas, Jimmy."
G["I would like to spend my runes."]="Gostaria gastar meus runas."
G["I would like to start the Amulet Ritual, Kasim."]="Gostaria começar o ritual do amuleto, Kasim."
G["I would like to start the Amulet Ritual, Lynnore."]="Gostaria começar ao ritual do amuleto, Lynnore."
G["I would like to start the Blood Ritual, Kasim."]="Gostaria começar o ritual de sangue, Kasim."
G["I would like to start the Blood Ritual, Lynnore."]="Quero iniciar o ritual de sangue, Lynnore."
G["I would like to take a look at your wares, Sid."]="Gostaria de dar uma olhada nos seus produtos, Sid."
G["I would like to train further in the ways of the Light."]="Eu gostaria de treinar mais nos caminhos da Luz."
G["I would like to train."]="Eu gostaria de treinar"
G["I would like to travel to Dawn's Blossom."]="Gostaria viajar a Floralba."
G["I would like to upgarde another sha-touched weapon. Can you help?"]="Gostaria melhorar outra arma influênciada pelo sha. Pode me ajudar?"
G["I would like to whisper my secret code to you to receive Tyrael's Hilt."]="Eu gostaria de sussurrar meu código secreto para você receber o cabo de Tyrael."
G["I would like to whisper my secret code to you to receive my Golden Pig pet."]="I would like to whisper my secret code to you to receive my Golden Pig pet."
G["I would like to whisper my secret code to you to receive my Panda Cub pet."]="Gostaria sussurrar meu código segredo para obter meu osito panda."
G["I would like training."]="Eu gostaria de treinar."
G["I would like you to come with me today."]="I would like you to come with me today."
G["I would look upon these lands with my own eyes."]="Miraría estas terras com meus próprios olhos."
G["I would love to help you, Lorewalker, but understand - I am in a real bind here."]="Me encantaría ajudar você, eremita, mas precisa entender que estou entre a lâmina e a parede!"
G["I would love to read it to you!\nDo not stand at my grave and weep,\nI am not there, I do not sleep.\nI am in a thousand winds that blow,\nacross Northrend's bright and shining snow.\nI am the gentle showers of rain,\non Westfall's fields of golden grain.\nI am in the morning hush,\nof Stranglethorn's jungle, green and lush.\nI am in the drums loud and grand,\nthe thunderous hooves across Nagrand.\nI am the stars warmly gleaming,\nover Darnassus softly dreaming.\nI am in the birds that sing,\nI am in each lovely thing.\nDo not stand at my grave and cry,\nI am not there. I do not die."]="I would love to read it to you!\nDo not stand at my grave and weep,\nI am not there, I do not sleep.\nI am in a thousand winds that blow,\nacross Northrend's bright and shining snow.\nI am the gentle showers of rain,\non Westfall's fields of golden grain.\nI am in the morning hush,\nof Stranglethorn's jungle, green and lush.\nI am in the drums loud and grand,\nthe thunderous hooves across Nagrand.\nI am the stars warmly gleaming,\nover Darnassus softly dreaming.\nI am in the birds that sing,\nI am in each lovely thing.\nDo not stand at my grave and cry,\nI am not there. I do not die."
G["I would love to walk on the water."]="Me encantaría caminhar sobre a água."
G["I would never ask a stranger to take on the duties of a Shado-Pan, but neither will I refuse help from a skilled $c.\n\nThis place is dangerous, $r. If you insist on staying, then I will gladly accept your help."]="I would never ask a stranger to take on the duties of a Shado-Pan, but neither will I refuse help from a skilled $c.\n\nThis place is dangerous, $r. If you insist on staying, then I will gladly accept your help."
G["I would never have expected to find something in such perfect condition."]="I would never have expected to find something in such perfect condition."
G["I would never turn away someone who's ready to train with me. Unfortunately, you're not! You've still got a ways to go kid!"]="Eu nunca recusaria alguém que estivesse pronto para treinar comigo. Infelizmente você não é! Você ainda tem um jeito de ir, garoto!"
G["I would not venture further if I were you, $n.  You are not permitted above."]="I would not venture further if I were you, $n.  You are not permitted above."
G["I would prefer sturdier equipment than this."]="Prefiro equipamento um pouco mais resistente."
G["I would recommend against such actions..."]="Te recomendo que não continue por aí..."
G["I would recommend releasing me. My father is not as forgiving as I am."]="I would recommend releasing me. My father is not as forgiving as I am."
G["I would remain silent about the kill and allow the knight to claim the reward to aid his family."]="Eu continuava calado sobre a matança e permitia ao cavaleiro reivindicar a recompensa para ajudar sua família."
G["I would say that my first command here was quite the success."]="Me atrevería a dizer que meu primeiro envio aqui foi um êxito."
G["I would show my liege the beast's ear and claim the beast's death as my own - after all, I did slay it.  I would then offer some of the reward to the destitute knight to help his family."]="Eu mostrava ao meu senhor o ouvido da fera e reivindicava a morte da fera como minha - afinal, eu a matava. Ofereceria então uma parte da recompensa ao cavaleiro necessitado por ajudar sua família."
G["I would show my liege the beast's ear and claim the beast's death as my own, taking the reward for my own use.  It is wrong to claim a deed as your own that someone else in fact did."]="Eu mostrava ao meu senhor o ouvido da fera e reivindicava a morte da fera como minha, recebendo a recompensa pelo meu próprio uso. É errado reivindicar uma ação como sua que outra pessoa de fato fez."
G["I would sooner slit my own throat.  You will pay for what you did to your own men, Arthas... for what you did to me!  I swear it."]="I would sooner slit my own throat.  You will pay for what you did to your own men, Arthas... for what you did to me!  I swear it."
G["I would speak against my brother joining the order, rushing a permanent breach in our relationship.  He would be a danger to himself and those around him, and that is too great a risk hoping he would improve over time."]="Eu falaria contra meu irmão ingressando na ordem, apressando uma ruptura permanente em nosso relacionamento. Ele seria um perigo para si e para aqueles que o rodeiam, e isso é um risco muito grande, esperando que ele melhore com o tempo."
G["I would speak for my brother joining the order, potentially risking the safety of the order.  I could help him with the order's regimens, and I'd have faith in his ability to adapt and learn."]="Eu falaria por meu irmão ingressar na ordem, potencialmente arriscando a segurança da ordem. Eu poderia ajudá-o com os regimes da ordem e teria fé na sua capacidade de se adaptar e aprender."
G["I would stay longer, but I need to go find out what has happened to the rest of the Stormstouts."]="Me quedaría mais tempo, mas tenho que descobrir que foi dos mais Cerveja de Trovão."
G["I would struggle to maintain our neutrality."]="Me esforzaría por manter a neutralidade."
G["I would suggest looking in the Cathedral of Light in Cathedral Square."]="Eu sugeriria procurar na Catedral da Luz na Praça da Catedral."
G["I would teach him how to demon forge in exchange for his soul. The soul of a Blackrock orc is worth very little but in these trying times, a soul, any soul, is better than none at all."]="Eu o ensinaria a forjar demônios em troca da sua alma. A alma de um orco da Rocha Negra vale muito pouco, mas nestes tempos difíceis, uma alma, qualquer alma, é melhor do que nenhuma."
G["I would train ye if I could, but ye need the services of someone a bit more... what's the word? Brainy! Look for Trixie Quickswitch in Ironforge. Tell 'er Bronk sent ye!"]="Eu treinaria você se pudesse, mas você precisa dos serviços de alguém um pouco mais... qual é a palavra? Brainy! Procure Trixie Quickswitch em Ironforge. Diga ao Bronk que você enviou!"
G["I would train you, but you are no warrior."]="Eu treinaria você, mas você não é um guerreiro."
G["I would very much like to hear about your ancestors, stranger. Light the incense and let's reflect on where you came from, hm?"]="Gostaria muito ouvir falar dos seus ancestrais. Enciendo incenso e reflexionemos sobre seus orígenes."
G["I would very much like to study such unique items."]="Me encantaría estudar esses itens tão singulares."
G["I wouldn't do that if I were you..."]="Eu de ti não o faria..."
G["I wouldn't do this on any other day, but... I'm thirsty and I hate drinking alone.\n\nBottoms up!"]="Qualquer outro dia não faria isto, mas... tenho sede e ódio beber a solas!\n\nAo centro!"
G["I wouldn't eat yer leftovers if the only other thing to eat was rubble!"]="Não comería seus sobras nem se o único que tivesse para comer fossem escombros!"
G["I wouldn't expect a recruit to perform well in this situation, but try your best."]="I wouldn't expect a recruit to perform well in this situation, but try your best."
G["I wouldn't expect anything less, $r. Thanks."]="Não esperaría menos, $r. Obrigado."
G["I wouldn't have missed this for the world, $n.\n\n<Exarch Menelaous hugs you.>\n\nWe are proud of you."]="I wouldn't have missed this for the world, $n.\n\n<Exarch Menelaous hugs you.>\n\nWe are proud of you."
G["I wouldn't mind fighting with you again sometime.  Farewell!"]="I wouldn't mind fighting with you again sometime.  Farewell!"
G["I wouldn't mind settling down in a place like this. Great views, plenty of beer... and lots of stuff to fight."]="I wouldn't mind settling down in a place like this. Great views, plenty of beer... and lots of stuff to fight."
G["I wouldn't mind that you wasted each day if you caught a few more fish."]="I wouldn't mind that you wasted each day if you caught a few more fish."
G["I wouldn't say that it's your fault, Tarenar.  But don't let that stop you from saving Gidwin."]="I wouldn't say that it's your fault, Tarenar.  But don't let that stop you from saving Gidwin."
G["I wouldn't tell you if I did!  Because as soon as I do, I'm getting away from these crystals..."]="por sorte, o selo de Thoradin volta a estar intacto."
G["I wouldn't use it just yet, but you feel free to test it out yourself."]="I wouldn't use it just yet, but you feel free to test it out yourself."
G["I wouldn't venture into the Scryer's Terrace if I were you, $n.  You are not welcome there."]="Se fosse você, eu não entraría no Bancal do Arúspice, $n. Não acho que te deem uma cálida boas-vindas."
G["I wrested it free from the remains of an orc lieutenant - a dark caster... It is from their homeworld."]="O arranqué dos restos de um tenente orc – um taumaturgo sombrio... É do seu mundo."
G["I yield to you."]="Me rindo ante ti."
G["I yield!"]="Me rindo!"
G["I yield!  I yield!  By Quel'thalas!  Don't kill me!"]="Me rindo! Me rindo! Por Quel'thalas! Não me mate!"
G["I yield!  The boy chose his champion well. Give him my blessing and make sure he does not squander it."]="I yield!  The boy chose his champion well. Give him my blessing and make sure he does not squander it."
G["I yield! I submit. Excellent work. May I run away now?"]="I yield! I submit. Excellent work. May I run away now?"
G["I yield.  It was a worthy battle. Thank you, friend."]="Me rindo. Foi uma batalha digna. Te o agradeço."
G["I yield. I'll go quietly."]="Me rindo. Irei em silêncio."
G["I'LL GET YOU, GOLDMINE!"]="I'LL GET YOU, GOLDMINE!"
G["I'LL RISE AGAIN AND WHEN I DO I WILL HAVE MY REVENGE!"]="I'LL RISE AGAIN AND WHEN I DO I WILL HAVE MY REVENGE!"
G["I'M BACK, YOU DOOKERS!"]="EU VOLTOU, MIKOS!"
G["I'M CHARGING MY LASER!"]="ESTOU CARREGANDO O LASER!"
G["I'M COOKIN HERE!"]="Estou cozinhando aqui!"
G["I'M FIRING MY LASER!"]="ESTOU DISPARANDO O LASER!"
G["I'M FREE, LITTLE DRAKKARI. TIME TO PAY FOR YOUR MANY TRESSPASSES!"]="I'M FREE, LITTLE DRAKKARI. TIME TO PAY FOR YOUR MANY TRESSPASSES!"
G["I'M HIT!"]="ME TÊM DADOS!"
G["I'M MAD AS HELL AND I'M NOT GONNA TAKE IT ANYMORE! I QUIT!"]="I'M MAD AS HELL AND I'M NOT GONNA TAKE IT ANYMORE! I QUIT!"
G["I'M ON FIRE!!!"]="ME QUEMO!!"
G["I'M ON FIRE!!!  AGAIN!!"]="ME QUEMO!! OUTRA VEZ!!"
G["I'M PUSHIN' AS HARD AS I CAN! THING WEIGHS A TON!"]="I'M PUSHIN' AS HARD AS I CAN! THING WEIGHS A TON!"
G["I'M SCARED!"]="TENHO MEDO!"
G["I'VE BEEN INTERRUPTED! CALL ALEX!"]="E BANIDO INTERROMPIDO! CHAMA A ALEX!"
G["I'VE GOT AN IDEA!"]="TENHO UMA IDEIA!"
G["I'd 'ave a cleaner shot 'round 'ere if someone hadn't all gone and done regrown up all them stupid trees."]="Tendría uma melhor linha de fogo se a alguém não se lhe tivesse ido a cabeça e lhe tivesse dados por plantar todos estes estúpidos árvores."
G["I'd almost given up hope."]="Quase havia perdido a esperança."
G["I'd always hoped to cut someone like that someday, to hear that sound. But to have it happen to my own prothorax is ridiculous."]="I'd always hoped to cut someone like that someday, to hear that sound. But to have it happen to my own prothorax is ridiculous."
G["I'd appreciate if someone started to take my work seriously. Just because I'm not wrestling sharks or tying eels in knots doesn't mean this isn't important."]="Eu apreciaria se alguém começasse a levar meu trabalho a sério. Só porque eu não estou lutando com tubarões ou amarrando enguias em nós não significa que isso não é importante."
G["I'd be careful if I were you, Hyldnir.  We're not afraid to lose a few men if it means smashing your pretty blue faces in."]="Hyldnir, eu no seu lugar tendría cuidado. Não nos preocupa perder algum homens se com elho logramos esmagar suas bonitas caras azul."
G["I'd be dead if it weren't for you."]="Estaria morta de não ser por você."
G["I'd be dead or worse if not for you!"]="De não ser por você estaria morto ou algo pior!"
G["I'd be glad to help."]="fico feliz em poder ajudar."
G["I'd be honored to have you on my wing anytime, $n."]="I'd be honored to have you on my wing anytime, $n."
G["I'd be wasting both your gold and my time if I were to teach you how to pilot a Mechanostrider, $c.  You're just too large!"]="I'd be wasting both your gold and my time if I were to teach you how to pilot a Mechanostrider, $c.  You're just too large!"
G["I'd better ask before I go herbing this time. I don't want to get attacked by another wolf."]="Será melhor que perguntar antes de ir pegar ervas esta vez. Não quero que me ataque outro lobo."
G["I'd better catch up Mudmug."]="I'd better catch up Mudmug."
G["I'd better head up and talk to Nana. The farm is yours now, $n. I know you'll take great care of it."]="Será melhor que vá a falar com Nana. Agora a fazenda te pertence, $n. Sei que a cuidarás bem."
G["I'd choose your next words carefully if you value your life.\n\nSilence? How wise. Now destroy the Scourge!"]="Se valoras sua vida, escolha seus próximas palavras com cuidado.\n\nSilenciar? Muito inteligente. Agora destrói a o Flagelo!"
G["I'd give my pestle away for some earplugs."]="Cambiaría meu morteiro por uns tapones para os ouvidos."
G["I'd give nearly anything for a chance to go up there and speak with them..."]="Eu daria quase tudo por uma chance de ir lá e falar com eles..."
G["I'd give you a thumbs down, but I can't find it."]="I'd give you a thumbs down, but I can't find it."
G["I'd go back if I could. I had a life in Durnholde. Towards the end there I was beaten maybe once a week at MOST."]="I'd go back if I could. I had a life in Durnholde. Towards the end there I was beaten maybe once a week at MOST."
G["I'd go out and clear out some of those gnolls, but this leg has seen better days and I am afraid I'd just wind up dead."]="I'd go out and clear out some of those gnolls, but this leg has seen better days and I am afraid I'd just wind up dead."
G["I'd have a hard time teaching you.  It takes years of mental preparation to become attuned to the powers of the arcane."]="Eu teria dificuldade em ensinar você. Leva anos de preparação mental para se sintonizar com os poderes do arcano."
G["I'd imagined my first adventure into the ocean as more peaceful and enlightening. Becoming one with nature perhaps?\n\nThere is very little natural about this place. The elements all around us scream for vengeance."]="I'd imagined my first adventure into the ocean as more peaceful and enlightening. Becoming one with nature perhaps?\n\nThere is very little natural about this place. The elements all around us scream for vengeance."
G["I'd keep my eyes and ears open if I were you. There's a rumor going around that you caused both Mount Kajaro and the Lost Isles volcanoes to explode.\n\nCrazy, I know. But people will gossip about anything and love to tear down their heroes, especially if there's a chance for profit and promotion."]="I'd keep my eyes and ears open if I were you. There's a rumor going around that you caused both Mount Kajaro and the Lost Isles volcanoes to explode.\n\nCrazy, I know. But people will gossip about anything and love to tear down their heroes, especially if there's a chance for profit and promotion."
G["I'd know that smell anywhere! Salma's famous stew!"]="Reconocería esse cheiro em qualquer lugar! O famoso ensopado de Salma!"
G["I'd lend a hand, but I've got... chain rash. I'll just hang back a little."]="Eu ajudaria, mas tenho... erupção cutânea. Eu vou ficar um pouco para por trás."
G["I'd like a Lovely Charm Collector's Kit."]="Eu gostaria de um kit de colecionador encantador."
G["I'd like a drink."]="Eu gostaria de uma bebida."
