G["I'd like to build a shredder."]="I'd like to build a shredder."
G["I'd like to build a siege engine."]="Eu gostaria de construir um mecanismo de cerco."
G["I'd like to buy Jack a drink.  Perhaps something... extra strong."]="Gostaria pagarle uma bebida a Jack. Talvez algo... extra forte."
G["I'd like to buy this month's brew."]="Eu gostaria de comprar a bebida deste mês."
G["I'd like to challenge your magma lord to a fight."]="Gostaria desafiar ao senhor do magma a um combate."
G["I'd like to dress as a pirate."]="I'd like to dress as a pirate."
G["I'd like to enter the Celestial Tournament."]="Gostaria participar no Torneio Celestial."
