G["I'll rip you apart!"]="Te farei pedaços!"
G["I'll rip your shriveled heart out with my bare hands before any harm comes to $n, necromancer."]="I'll rip your shriveled heart out with my bare hands before any harm comes to $n, necromancer."
G["I'll run ye through, ye cannon-kissin' cannonface!"]="I'll run ye through, ye cannon-kissin' cannonface!"
G["I'll scare them off with my roar!"]="I'll scare them off with my roar!"
G["I'll scribble you out of existence!"]="I'll scribble you out of existence!"
