G["I'll sing 'em ta death, I will I will."]="I'll sing 'em ta death, I will I will."
G["I'll slice you in two!  Wait a minute... who are you?"]="I'll slice you in two!  Wait a minute... who are you?"
G["I'll soon be revered as the greatest goblin tinker of all time! Besides, that negligence case involving the creation of the gilgoblins will never stick."]="I'll soon be revered as the greatest goblin tinker of all time! Besides, that negligence case involving the creation of the gilgoblins will never stick."
G["I'll split you from stem to stern!"]="I'll split you from stem to stern!"
G["I'll start gettin' her prepped for ye to return."]="I'll start gettin' her prepped for ye to return."
G["I'll stay behind with the Royal Guard, father.  It is my duty to Gilneas."]="Me ficarei por trás com a Guarda Real, pai. É meu dever cima Guilnéas."
G["I'll steer, you handle Ol' Blasty.  An' don't tie yer skivvies in a knot... I'll slow down when we get closer!"]="I'll steer, you handle Ol' Blasty.  An' don't tie yer skivvies in a knot... I'll slow down when we get closer!"
G["I'll stick with you a little longer, $n. I saw many injured crewmen who may be in need of my aid."]="Me ficarei contiguo um tempo mais, $n. vi a muitos tripulantes feridos que poderiam precisar minha ajuda."
G["I'll take a pint of Dark Iron ale.  Oh, you're not the $gwaiter:waitress;?"]="I'll take a pint of Dark Iron ale.  Oh, you're not the $gwaiter:waitress;?"
G["I'll take a ride to my first post, please."]="Quero chegar até meu primeiro posto, por favor."
G["I'll take care of the drakes. You worry about the rest of the Twilight rubbish."]="I'll take care of the drakes. You worry about the rest of the Twilight rubbish."
G["I'll take care of the pirates. But first, maybe some liquid courage."]="I'll take care of the pirates. But first, maybe some liquid courage."
G["I'll take good care of your pets, don't you worry!"]="I'll take good care of your pets, don't you worry!"
G["I'll take him back to the priestess. Thank you for your kindness."]="O levarei de volta à sacerdotisa. Obrigado pelo seu amabilidade."
G["I'll take it. Anything else?"]="Terá que bastar. Algo mais?"
G["I'll take my fee out of your paycheck."]="I'll take my fee out of your paycheck."
G["I'll take that flight to Brill now."]="I'll take that flight to Brill now."
G["I'll take that gold now, if you would be so kind."]="Eu vou querer meu ouro agora, se faz favor."
G["I'll take the cultist.  You handle the traitor."]="Eu me encargo do cultor. Você, do traidor."
G["I'll take the dancing green kite."]="Me levarei a cometa verde dançarina."
G["I'll take the flight."]="Eu vou pegar o vôo."
G["I'll take the high-altitude blue kite."]="I'll take the high-altitude blue kite."
G["I'll take the standard red kite."]="Me levarei a cometa vermelha normal."
