G["I'll take those. We can't have the mighty chieftain cowering in fear of a few hides."]="I'll take those. We can't have the mighty chieftain cowering in fear of a few hides."
G["I'll take whatever ya got cookin'! And throw in a bottle to wash it down!"]="I'll take whatever ya got cookin'! And throw in a bottle to wash it down!"
G["I'll take you to some other horses.  You probably miss being around other horses.  They can be your friend too."]="Te levarei ao lado a outros cavalos, suponho que dá de menos estar com outros cavalos. Podem ser seus amigos também."
G["I'll take you with me!"]="Te levarei comigo!"
G["I'll take your money and your life too!"]="Me levarei seu dinheiro e também sua vida!"
G["I'll talk, I'll talk! Anything! Just keep that perfumed bag away from me!"]="I'll talk, I'll talk! Anything! Just keep that perfumed bag away from me!"
G["I'll teach ye to chop down yer foes like saplings in the forest."]="I'll teach ye to chop down yer foes like saplings in the forest."
G["I'll tear the secrets from your soul! Tell me about the \"Crimson Dawn\" and your life may be spared!"]="I'll tear the secrets from your soul! Tell me about the \"Crimson Dawn\" and your life may be spared!"
G["I'll tear you to pieces! AAAAAHHHHHHHH!"]="Te farei picadilho! AAAAAHHHHHHHH!"
G["I'll tear you to shreds!"]="Te farei picadilho!"
G["I'll tell Legionnaire Nazgrim that you're destroying the Hammers in here."]="I'll tell Legionnaire Nazgrim that you're destroying the Hammers in here."
G["I'll tell her, Greatfather."]="I'll tell her, Greatfather."
G["I'll tell ya, the only proper way to hunt is when yer good an' goggled!"]="Vou lhe dizer, a única maneira correta de caçar é quando você é bom e usa óculos!"
G["I'll tell you 'then what.' She went runnin' straight for the hive. And you know what's crazier? Not a single damned bug got in her way or tried to stop her. She ran through them all as if she'd been best friends with 'em for centuries."]="I'll tell you 'then what.' She went runnin' straight for the hive. And you know what's crazier? Not a single damned bug got in her way or tried to stop her. She ran through them all as if she'd been best friends with 'em for centuries."
G["I'll tell you everything! STOP! PLEASE!"]="I'll tell you everything! STOP! PLEASE!"
G["I'll tell you more, Karnik, in time. But first, send this traveler'ta Belgrum--there's more business'ta attend to."]="I'll tell you more, Karnik, in time. But first, send this traveler'ta Belgrum--there's more business'ta attend to."
G["I'll tell you nothing, Scourge filth!"]="I'll tell you nothing, Scourge filth!"
G["I'll tell you one thing, $n. I like jade, but it's not my favorite. Everyone gives it to me, all the time!"]="I'll tell you one thing, $n. I like jade, but it's not my favorite. Everyone gives it to me, all the time!"
G["I'll tell you what you need to know, but I don't have to like it. We're watching you and your kind."]="Vou lhe dizer o que você precisa saber, mas não preciso gostar. Estamos observando você e seu tipo."
G["I'll tell you what. Since you fancy yourself the hero type, if you can make your way through the Badlands to the Searing Gorge and bring me back something to prove your heroics, I'll see what I can do about getting you a key.\n\nIn the southeasternmost corner of Searing Gorge is a lady almost as tough as me, Margol the Rager. Maybe you should investigate."]="I'll tell you what. Since you fancy yourself the hero type, if you can make your way through the Badlands to the Searing Gorge and bring me back something to prove your heroics, I'll see what I can do about getting you a key.\n\nIn the southeasternmost corner of Searing Gorge is a lady almost as tough as me, Margol the Rager. Maybe you should investigate."
G["I'll tell you where to go, provided you tell me what interests you."]="Vou te dizer para onde ir, desde que você me diga o que lhe interessa."
G["I'll tell your story, friends!  I'll tell everyone about how the Hollowstone miners never gave in!"]="I'll tell your story, friends!  I'll tell everyone about how the Hollowstone miners never gave in!"
G["I'll throw my hammer upside his head if he makes us wait any longer."]="Lhe vou tirar o martelo à cabeça se nos há esperar mais."
G["I'll throw your corpse in the filth-pool!"]="I'll throw your corpse in the filth-pool!"
G["I'll try my best to be a good student."]="I'll try my best to be a good student."
G["I'll try to get it started again. You go ahead. I'll find my way back on my own."]="I'll try to get it started again. You go ahead. I'll find my way back on my own."
G["I'll try to get you back on the island. We just have to get through these thermals..."]="I'll try to get you back on the island. We just have to get through these thermals..."
G["I'll turn you into a fossil, $r!"]="I'll turn you into a fossil, $r!"
G["I'll turn your world... upside... down."]="Pondré seu mundo... cabeça... baixo."
G["I'll update my journal."]="I'll update my journal."
G["I'll use the crystal to shield the tablets. See if it will grant you powers to defend me. If Twilight's Hammer's minions break through my shield, they'll kill me and take the tablets!"]="I'll use the crystal to shield the tablets. See if it will grant you powers to defend me. If Twilight's Hammer's minions break through my shield, they'll kill me and take the tablets!"
G["I'll use the forge to make batches o' earthen to stand guard... But our greatest challenge still remains: find and stop Loken!"]="I'll use the forge to make batches o' earthen to stand guard... But our greatest challenge still remains: find and stop Loken!"
G["I'll wait for you all on the other side of the finish line!"]="Te espero ao outro lado da linha de meta!"
G["I'll wait for you at the base of Ruins Rise."]="I'll wait for you at the base of Ruins Rise."
G["I'll wait until you're healed to finish you, Nazgrim. Let it not be said that the Alliance has no honor."]="I'll wait until you're healed to finish you, Nazgrim. Let it not be said that the Alliance has no honor."
G["I'll wait."]="I'll wait."
G["I'll wipe you off of my boots later!"]="I'll wipe you off of my boots later!"
G["I'll work on the siege engine, just watch my back.  Use those seaforium bombs on the gates if you need them!"]="I'll work on the siege engine, just watch my back.  Use those seaforium bombs on the gates if you need them!"
G["I'll..."]="Eu..."
G["I'll... get... back... to... work... I... promise."]="Voltarei... ao... trabalho... O... prometo."
G["I'll... take a look."]="Vou dar uma olhada."
G["I'm \"Plucky\" Johnson, and this is my default greeting."]="Sou Johnson o \"Desplumado\" e este é meu vidao habitual."
G["I'm Augustus!  You want it, I got it!  You wanna sell it, then I want it!"]="Sou Augustus! O que... pois o tem! O que vender... pois eu te o compro!"
G["I'm Augustus, and my prices are INSANE!"]="Sou Augustus, e meus preços são UMA LOUCURA!"
G["I'm Mudmug. Who's asking?"]="I'm Mudmug. Who's asking?"
G["I'm NOT undead!  Not for long, anyway.  My father will rescue me, I know it..."]="Eu não sou morto-vivo! Não por muito tempo, pelo menos. Meu pai vai me resgatar, eu sei..."
G["I'm Toya! You need it? I can get it! Don't go to nobody else in Dawn's Blossom!"]="I'm Toya! You need it? I can get it! Don't go to nobody else in Dawn's Blossom!"
G["I'm a black dragon. I won't need any help."]="Sou um dragão Negro. Não preciso ajuda."
G["I'm a cloth vendor, and this is my default greeting."]="Sou vendedor de telas e este é meu vidao habitual."
G["I'm a daughter of the Wildhammer Clan and a shaman of the Earthen Ring.  My code compels me to honor my ancestors and the elements."]="Sou filha do Clã Martelo Feroz e xamã do Anel da Terra. Meu código me obriga a honrar a meus ancestrais e aos elementos."
G["I'm a doctor!  What seems to be the problem?"]="Sou médico! Qual é o problema?"
G["I'm a dwarf, ma'am. Can we borrow some food?"]="Sou um anão, senhora. Nos das algo de comida?"
G["I'm a fierce predator!"]="I'm a fierce predator!"
G["I'm a genius!"]="Sou um genio!"
G["I'm a good dancer. Wanna see?"]="Bailo muito bem. Que que te o ensenhe?"
G["I'm a hunter trainer. You'll want to find the $c trainer."]="Eu sou instrutor de caçadores. Você te interesse o instrutor de $c."
G["I'm a little basket filled with grain..."]="Sou um pequeno cesto cheio de grano..."
G["I'm a little busy at the moment, $c... return when I'm less preoccupied."]="Estou um pouco ocupada, $c... Volta quando tenha menos preocupações."
G["I'm a little busy negotiating a bribe right now.  You might want to come back later."]="Estou um pouco ocupado negociando um suborno agora. Você pode querer voltar mais tarde."
G["I'm a prisoner!\n\nThey shot me and my beautiful zeppelin out of the sky. And what for? Because I was ferrying men and materiel for the Horde? That's nothing new!\n\nNow they have me running her in circles around the bay so that they can bomb the pirates. I just don't have the parts to keep her going like this! I'm barely keeping her together on spit and bailing wire!\n\nI won't be held responsible for what happens to you, but you might as well get on board before she leaves.\n\nIt's a crime I tell you!"]="I'm a prisoner!\n\nThey shot me and my beautiful zeppelin out of the sky. And what for? Because I was ferrying men and materiel for the Horde? That's nothing new!\n\nNow they have me running her in circles around the bay so that they can bomb the pirates. I just don't have the parts to keep her going like this! I'm barely keeping her together on spit and bailing wire!\n\nI won't be held responsible for what happens to you, but you might as well get on board before she leaves.\n\nIt's a crime I tell you!"
G["I'm a prisoner!\n\nThey shot me and my beautiful zeppelin out of the sky. And what for? Because I was ferrying men and materiel for the Horde? That's nothing new!\n\nNow they have me running her in circles around the bay so that they can bomb the pirates. I just don't have the parts to keep her going like this! I'm barely keeping her together on spit and bailing wire!\n\nIf you're determined to help them out, she's due to arrive back in port in less than $3078w minutes.\n\nIt's a crime I tell you!"]="I'm a prisoner!\n\nThey shot me and my beautiful zeppelin out of the sky. And what for? Because I was ferrying men and materiel for the Horde? That's nothing new!\n\nNow they have me running her in circles around the bay so that they can bomb the pirates. I just don't have the parts to keep her going like this! I'm barely keeping her together on spit and bailing wire!\n\nIf you're determined to help them out, she's due to arrive back in port in less than $3078w minutes.\n\nIt's a crime I tell you!"
G["I'm a prisoner!\n\nThey shot me and my beautiful zeppelin out of the sky. And what for? Because I was ferrying men and materiel for the Horde? That's nothing new!\n\nNow they have me running her in circles around the bay so that they can bomb the pirates. I just don't have the parts to keep her going like this! I'm barely keeping her together on spit and bailing wire!\n\nIf you're determined to help them out, she's due to arrive back in port in less than a minute.\n\nIt's a crime I tell you!"]="I'm a prisoner!\n\nThey shot me and my beautiful zeppelin out of the sky. And what for? Because I was ferrying men and materiel for the Horde? That's nothing new!\n\nNow they have me running her in circles around the bay so that they can bomb the pirates. I just don't have the parts to keep her going like this! I'm barely keeping her together on spit and bailing wire!\n\nIf you're determined to help them out, she's due to arrive back in port in less than a minute.\n\nIt's a crime I tell you!"
G["I'm a prisoner!\n\nThey shot me and my beautiful zeppelin out of the sky. And what for? Because I was ferrying men and materiel for the Horde? That's nothing new!\n\nNow they have me running her in circles around the bay so that they can bomb the pirates. I just don't have the parts to keep her going like this! I'm barely keeping her together on spit and bailing wire!\n\nIt's a crime I tell you!"]="I'm a prisoner!\n\nThey shot me and my beautiful zeppelin out of the sky. And what for? Because I was ferrying men and materiel for the Horde? That's nothing new!\n\nNow they have me running her in circles around the bay so that they can bomb the pirates. I just don't have the parts to keep her going like this! I'm barely keeping her together on spit and bailing wire!\n\nIt's a crime I tell you!"
G["I'm a prisoner, what does it look like? The draenei filth captured me as I exited the sun gate. They killed our portal controllers and destroyed the gate. The Sun King will be most displeased with this turn of events."]="Eu sou um prisioneiro, como é? A sujeira draenei me capturou quando eu saí do portões do sol. Eles mataram nossos controladores de portal e destruíram o portões. O rei do sol ficará muito descontente com essa virada de eventos."
G["I'm a scientist who studies both time and sound, so I'm not quite certain how I'm supposed to think, or find the time to get any work done around here, with all of this racket?!\n\nWhy can't these fools go blow themselves up somewhere else?\n\nAh well, at least I look good.  Say, $g boy : lovely;, have I seen you around here before?"]="I'm a scientist who studies both time and sound, so I'm not quite certain how I'm supposed to think, or find the time to get any work done around here, with all of this racket?!\n\nWhy can't these fools go blow themselves up somewhere else?\n\nAh well, at least I look good.  Say, $g boy : lovely;, have I seen you around here before?"
G["I'm a simple man who knows a few things about tailoring, but you need more assistance than I can provide. I have heard of a Night Elf who is quite an accomplished tailor. He resides in Stormwind, in the Magic District."]="I'm a simple man who knows a few things about tailoring, but you need more assistance than I can provide. I have heard of a Night Elf who is quite an accomplished tailor. He resides in Stormwind, in the Magic District."
G["I'm a soldier, Buckets. You know, a fighting man... You're the laundry boy."]="Sou um soldado, Cubos. Já sabe... um lutador... Você é o rapaz da colada."
G["I'm a test spirit healer."]="I'm a test spirit healer."
G["I'm a tree!"]="Eu sou uma árvore!"
G["I'm a waitress."]="I'm a waitress."
G["I'm a wand peddler by trade. Luckily for you and me both, most of my wands survived through the shipwreck!"]="I'm a wand peddler by trade. Luckily for you and me both, most of my wands survived through the shipwreck!"
G["I'm about fed up with you! Don't make me get Forgemaster Throngus over here!"]="Estou harto de ti! Não me obligues a trazer ao mestre de forja Throngus!"
G["I'm about halfway done! Keep the Alliance away - fighting's not in my contract!"]="I'm about halfway done! Keep the Alliance away - fighting's not in my contract!"
G["I'm about to open a can on this $n."]="Vou abrir uma lata acima de $n."
G["I'm afraid Gunny didn't make it, $n."]="I'm afraid Gunny didn't make it, $n."
G["I'm afraid I cannot assist you, $r, but I am certain Georgia can."]="Me temo que não posso ajudar você, $r, mas certo que Georgia si."
G["I'm afraid I cannot help you, $r, but I am sure Khaelyn Steelwing can."]="Me temo que não posso ajudar você, $r, mas certo que Khaelyn Alacerada si."
G["I'm afraid I cannot speak with you at the moment."]="Receio não poder falar com você no momentos."
G["I'm afraid I have nothing to teach to someone with your experience. But you haven't reached the end of the road yet. Speak to Lucan Cordell, behind the counter there. He'll guide you through the next phase of your journey."]="Receio não ter nada a ensinar a alguém com a sua experiência. Mas você ainda não chegou ao fim da estrada. Fale com Lucan Cordell, atrás do balcão. Ele o guiará na próxima fase da sua jornada."
G["I'm afraid I'll have to... charge you extra."]="I'm afraid I'll have to... charge you extra."
G["I'm afraid I'm of little use right now, $n.\n\nI am sick with worry for my husband."]="Me temo que não sou de muita utilidade agora mesmo, $n.\n\nA preocupação por meu marido está acabando comigo."
G["I'm afraid I'm rather busy fixing horseshoes at the moment.  Would you mind coming back at another time?"]="Receio estar bastante ocupado consertando ferraduras no momentos. Você se importaria de voltar em outro momentos?"
G["I'm afraid not, $n. Now, feel the shame you have brought upon yourself."]="Me temo que não, $n. Agora, sente a vergonha da que tão somente você é responsável."
G["I'm afraid not, Schneider. Your time has come!"]="Me temo que não, Schneider. Chegou seu hora!"
G["I'm afraid that the blade which you hold in your hands is beyond saving. The hatred runs too deep. But do not lose hope, $c. Where one chapter has ended, a new one begins.\n\nFind his son - a more devout and pious man you may never meet. It is rumored that he is able to build the Ashbringer anew, without requiring the old, tainted blade."]="I'm afraid that the blade which you hold in your hands is beyond saving. The hatred runs too deep. But do not lose hope, $c. Where one chapter has ended, a new one begins.\n\nFind his son - a more devout and pious man you may never meet. It is rumored that he is able to build the Ashbringer anew, without requiring the old, tainted blade."
G["I'm afraid there is little I can teach you, $c. You're free to browse my wares, of course, but you will not find them of use to you."]="Me temo que há pouco que possa ensinar, $c. É livre para dar um olhada a meu mercadoria, é claro, mas não a encontrar útil."
G["I'm afraid there's nothin' I can do for our brother... her power tore away at his soul."]="I'm afraid there's nothin' I can do for our brother... her power tore away at his soul."
G["I'm afraid ye would not survive long in Alterac Valley, $c.  Come back and see us when you have a few more seasons under your belt."]="Me temo que não durarías muito no Vale Alterac, $c. Retorna quando tenha uns quantos anos mais."
G["I'm afraid you are not ready to become a valiant.  However I suspect you will be ready soon enough."]="Me temo que não está a ponto para o grau de Valeroso. No entanto acho que pronto o estará."
G["I'm afraid you have me confused with someone who wants to talk to you."]="Receio que você me confunda com alguém que queira falar com você."
G["I'm afraid you'll have to ask the -- Well, perhaps Kalecgos can help."]="Me temo que terá que perguntar a... Talvez Kalecgos possa ajudar."
G["I'm afraid you'll have to push forward without us."]="I'm afraid you'll have to push forward without us."
G["I'm afraid you're at the limits of my knowledge. Camberon is more skilled in alchemy than I. Please speak with him if you're interested in advancing."]="Me temo que chegou ao limite de meu conhecimento. Camberon é mais hábil que eu na alquimia. Fala com ele se deseja seguir avançando."
G["I'm afraid you're out of my league, friend! You should go see Nogg in Orgrimmar, he'll take you to the next level!"]="Receio que você esteja fosse da minha liga, amigo! Você deveria ir ver Nogg em Orgrimmar, ele o levará para o próximo nível!"
G["I'm afraid your ancestry is the cause, troll. Decades of fighting with your green-skinned brethren have hardened their hearts against your kind."]="I'm afraid your ancestry is the cause, troll. Decades of fighting with your green-skinned brethren have hardened their hearts against your kind."
G["I'm afraid your darkness quotient isn't sufficient enough for me to bother talking to you any further.  Move along please."]="Receio que seu quociente de escuridão não seja suficiente para que eu me incomode mais em falar com você. Continue em linha de frente, por favor."
G["I'm afraid your friend won't be waking up any time soon.  I always sedate my croc's food.  I hate to see them struggle with their meal."]="I'm afraid your friend won't be waking up any time soon.  I always sedate my croc's food.  I hate to see them struggle with their meal."
G["I'm alive thanks only to you... I won't forget this."]="Se estou vivo é Obrigado você... não o esquecerei."
G["I'm alive!"]="Estou vivo!"
G["I'm alive? Ha! That's more than I can say for those Horde at Garrosh'ar Point. We tore them up good."]="Estou vivo? Ha! Não é possível dizer o mesmo da Horda em Posto Garrosh'ar. Lhes temos dados uma boa tunda."
G["I'm all ears."]="Sou tudo atenção."
G["I'm all fired up over finally gettin' rid of you!"]="I'm all fired up over finally gettin' rid of you!"
G["I'm all kinds of busted up... might not... make it."]="I'm all kinds of busted up... might not... make it."
G["I'm all over it."]="Já o e superado."
G["I'm all over that. Thanks."]="Já o e superado. Obrigado."
G["I'm all... yours."]="I'm all... yours."
G["I'm almost as tall as you!"]="Tenho quase a mesma estatura que você!"
G["I'm almost jealous of our Mr. Wavesinger. Why, he may well be prettier than me!"]="Estou quase com ciúmes do nosso Sr. Wavesinger. Bem, ele pode muito bem ser mais bonito que eu!"
G["I'm already bored!"]="Já estou entediado!"
G["I'm always up for something of Grimbooze's."]="Sempre me apetece um pouco do de Tragoamargo."
G["I'm as ready as I'll ever be."]="Estou o mais pronta possível."
G["I'm as sane as the next guy, $g fella:lady;. Believe what you will, but I AM capable of fashioning this armor. If you're interested, maybe we can make a deal. The sooner I can get out of the assassination business, the better."]="Isso não é certo, $gamigo: amiga;. Me cria ou não, sou capaz de fabricar esta armadura. Se te interesse, poderíamos chegar a um acordo. Quanto antes deje minha vida como assassino, melhor."
G["I'm at a loss. What can one simple man do in the face of disaster?"]="Não sei como actuar. Que pode fazer um somente homem ante tal desastre?"
G["I'm at your side, friend."]="Estou com você."
G["I'm awaiting orders on your specific assignments. In the meantime, stay here and be ready to move at a moment's notice!"]="Estou esperando as ordens sobre seus missões específicas. Enquanto tanto, fique por aqui e prepare-se para actuar em qualquer momentos."
G["I'm aware of the dangers of this place. Now move out of the way, I won't ask again."]="I'm aware of the dangers of this place. Now move out of the way, I won't ask again."
G["I'm awful thirsty, buddy."]="I'm awful thirsty, buddy."
G["I'm back where I started."]="Vuelvo ao ponto de partida."
G["I'm back!"]="Estou de volta!"
G["I'm back, Sis!"]="I'm back, Sis!"
G["I'm badly injured!  I can't take much more of this!"]="I'm badly injured!  I can't take much more of this!"
G["I'm badly injured, but I'll do what I can to help. Try and stay inside of my anti-magic barrier or the acolytes' magic will tear you apart."]="Estou gravemente ferido, mas farei o que puder para ajudar. Tente ficar dentro da minha barreira anti-mágica ou a magia dos acólitos o destruirá."
G["I'm barely even trying!"]="Apenas me esforço!"
G["I'm beaten. You've shown me the error of my ways. From here on out, I promise to reform the way the cartel is run!"]="E perdido. Me feito ver que não faço bem as coisas. Desde este momentos, prometo alterar o funcionamento do cartaz!"
G["I'm beginning to doubt this tour guide will ever arrive."]="Empiezo a pensar que este guia não vai chegar nunca."
G["I'm beginning to like these guys!"]="I'm beginning to like these guys!"
G["I'm beginning to regret promoting you, $n!"]="I'm beginning to regret promoting you, $n!"
G["I'm beginning to think that they all forgot about me!"]="Estou começando a pensar que se têm esquecido de mim!"
G["I'm being sarcastic, by the way."]="Estou sendo sarcástica, por certo."
G["I'm bleeding!"]="Estou sangrando!"
G["I'm blind, you stupid sow-spawn, not deaf. Don't even think about it."]="I'm blind, you stupid sow-spawn, not deaf. Don't even think about it."
G["I'm bonin' up on my spirit lore."]="Com você me parto a caixa... torácica!"
G["I'm bored!"]="I'm bored!"
G["I'm bored! Let's go hunt down some evildoers."]="Que aburrimento! Vamos acabar com algum maus."
G["I'm bored, Cloudwing. Go, go!"]="Estou entediante, Alanube. Vamos, vamos!"
G["I'm brewing as fast as I can."]="Estou destilando o mais rápido que posso."
G["I'm bringin' the pain!"]="Traigo muito dor!"
