G["I'm busy right now."]="Agora estou ocupado."
G["I'm busy, $n. Tell Whuut to handle whatever it is. That young pup has been stewing all day long. He spends much more time like that, and he's going to hurt something."]="Estou ocupado, $n. Di a Whuut que se ocupe do que seja. Esse jovem filhote se tem passado tudo ante o fogo. Passa demais tempo assim, terminará causando algum dano."
G["I'm busy, lad. Why don't ye go find some Forsaken goo and take a bath, eh?"]="Estou ocupado, $gmuchacho: moça;. Por que não vai procurar algo de babar Renegados e te das um banho, eh?"
G["I'm busy, make it fast!"]="Estou ocupado, seja rápido!"
G["I'm busying showing this rookie the back of my fist!"]="Estou ocupada ensenhándole a este novato a forma de meu punho!"
G["I'm certain that one of the visiting Woolybush dwarves is a jewelcrafter.\nI believe it's the husband, Ingo. They're both explorers of some sort. Look for them in the inn."]="Estou certo de que um dos esses anões Lanudo que têm vindo de visite se dedica à joyería.\n\nAcho que é o marido, Ingo. Os dois são batedores ou algo assim. Búscalos na estalagem."
G["I'm certain that the kaja'mite is having the same intelligence-increasing effect on the monkeys that it had on our ancient ancestors."]="I'm certain that the kaja'mite is having the same intelligence-increasing effect on the monkeys that it had on our ancient ancestors."
G["I'm certain you will. Perhaps one day you could deliver a message to an old friend of mine. I hear he still wanders those woods.\n\n<Eitrigg bows his head for a moment, as if in prayer.>\n\nSo Rend, yes... Rend and his brother Maim ruled the Spire, in constant conflict with the Dark Iron dwarves. They managed to displace the dwarves in the upper portion of the city, but only after the dragons came and only after the death of Maim."]="I'm certain you will. Perhaps one day you could deliver a message to an old friend of mine. I hear he still wanders those woods.\n\n<Eitrigg bows his head for a moment, as if in prayer.>\n\nSo Rend, yes... Rend and his brother Maim ruled the Spire, in constant conflict with the Dark Iron dwarves. They managed to displace the dwarves in the upper portion of the city, but only after the dragons came and only after the death of Maim."
G["I'm charging you for hazard pay on this one, pal."]="I'm charging you for hazard pay on this one, pal."
G["I'm close to the edge, Morphalius. Another screw up and it'll be you running through that portal for Kaftiz's tests."]="Já não posso mais, Morphalius. Outra metedura de pata e será você quem corra ao portal para as provas de Kaftiz."
G["I'm closing soon, so buy while you can!"]="I'm closing soon, so buy while you can!"
G["I'm cold, lord.  When will you keep your promise?"]="I'm cold, lord.  When will you keep your promise?"
G["I'm coming Frostwolf, and this time you're gonna feel the flames!"]="Já vou, Lobo Gelo, e esta vez vai sentir as chamas!"
G["I'm coming for you, Deathwing!"]="Vou por você, Alamuerte!"
G["I'm coming, boss!"]="Agora venho, chefe!"
