G["I'm completely out of supplies and the road is blocked by orcs, just my luck!"]="Estou completamente sem suprimentos e a estrada está bloqueada por orcs, apenas minha sorte!"
G["I'm concentrating... can you bother someone else?"]="Me estou concentrando... Te importa molestar a outra pessoa?"
G["I'm confident you will be able to help us."]="Estou certa de que poderá nos ajudar."
G["I'm confiscating this suspicious grain, Perelli. We were looking for signs of tampered food, and it would be in your best interest to stay put while Prince Arthas checks this out."]="I'm confiscating this suspicious grain, Perelli. We were looking for signs of tampered food, and it would be in your best interest to stay put while Prince Arthas checks this out."
G["I'm confused as to how these raiders are constantly able to assail us no matter how many of them we kill."]="I'm confused as to how these raiders are constantly able to assail us no matter how many of them we kill."
G["I'm countin' on it!"]="I'm countin' on it!"
G["I'm cryin' here! Please, make the funny stop!"]="I'm cryin' here! Please, make the funny stop!"
G["I'm curious, of course, but what's done is done.\n\nWe wouldn't want to stir up any unneccesary panic. That simply wouldn't be prudent!"]="I'm curious, of course, but what's done is done.\n\nWe wouldn't want to stir up any unneccesary panic. That simply wouldn't be prudent!"
