G["I'm flipping the second switch!"]="Vou dar ao segundo botão!"
G["I'm flirting as hard as I can, but I don't think he's getting the message!"]="I'm flirting as hard as I can, but I don't think he's getting the message!"
G["I'm forever in your debt, hero."]="Estarei em dívida com você eternamente, $ghéroe: heroína;."
G["I'm free!"]="Sou livre!"
G["I'm free!  That device shall never torment me again!"]="I'm free!  That device shall never torment me again!"
G["I'm free!  The spirit of water returns to my people.  It will bring us the wisdom we need to survive in this harsh land.  I am in your debt, $n."]="I'm free!  The spirit of water returns to my people.  It will bring us the wisdom we need to survive in this harsh land.  I am in your debt, $n."
G["I'm free!  You've saved me!"]="Sou livre! Me salvou!"
