G["I'm free! Quickly, enact Quetz'lun's Revenge. I'll meet you afterward at Zim'Torga."]="I'm free! Quickly, enact Quetz'lun's Revenge. I'll meet you afterward at Zim'Torga."
G["I'm free! Thank you all!"]="Sou livre! Obrigado a todos."
G["I'm free! Thank you!"]="Sou livre! Obrigado!"
G["I'm free?  I'm free!"]="Sou livre? Sou livre!"
G["I'm freed! Thank you."]="Sou livre! Obrigado."
G["I'm from the Alliance. We're here to save you and rebuild your village."]="I'm from the Alliance. We're here to save you and rebuild your village."
G["I'm from the Highbank advance unit, trying to win over the Wildhammer here at Thundermar.\n\nI think I can help them out, but can you believe that they don't have a single tri-cyclic alternating current re-polarization device? Not a one!\n\nHow do they even get by?"]="I'm from the Highbank advance unit, trying to win over the Wildhammer here at Thundermar.\n\nI think I can help them out, but can you believe that they don't have a single tri-cyclic alternating current re-polarization device? Not a one!\n\nHow do they even get by?"
G["I'm from the Horde. We're here to save you and rebuild your village."]="I'm from the Horde. We're here to save you and rebuild your village."
G["I'm full of surprises!"]="I'm full of surprises!"
G["I'm gathering funds to build a monument in honor of those who've died in the war.  It is important to not forget the sacrifices we've made to achieve victory.\n\nWe are $3275w percent done with this goal."]="I'm gathering funds to build a monument in honor of those who've died in the war.  It is important to not forget the sacrifices we've made to achieve victory.\n\nWe are $3275w percent done with this goal."
G["I'm gettin' a little woozy... Oooooof..."]="Me estou mareando um pouco... Uuuuuuf..."
G["I'm getting a little worried. Where is this hero that is supposed to lead us into battle?"]="I'm getting a little worried. Where is this hero that is supposed to lead us into battle?"
G["I'm getting fat and lazy just standing around here. I need some action!"]="Estar aqui é preciso engorde e me fique um vago. Preciso algo de ação!"
G["I'm getting out of here!"]="Me largo de aqui!"
G["I'm getting ready to travel up the ridge, $n. I could use some help -- would you like to come with me?"]="I'm getting ready to travel up the ridge, $n. I could use some help -- would you like to come with me?"
G["I'm getting rusty... and my lockpicks are too apparently.  Do me a favor, don't let Ren know you found me here, kay?"]="I'm getting rusty... and my lockpicks are too apparently.  Do me a favor, don't let Ren know you found me here, kay?"
G["I'm getting too old for this!  There's too many of them!\n\n<Fleet Master Seahorn pauses to catch his breath.>\n\nWhat am I saying?  There's not enough of them!  HAVE AT YOU, YOU MANGY CURS!"]="I'm getting too old for this!  There's too many of them!\n\n<Fleet Master Seahorn pauses to catch his breath.>\n\nWhat am I saying?  There's not enough of them!  HAVE AT YOU, YOU MANGY CURS!"
G["I'm giving her all that I've got, captain. I don't think she can take much more of this!"]="Lhe estou dando tudo o que tenho, capitão. Não acho que possa aguantar muito mais!"
G["I'm glad Taretha is alive. We now must find a way to free her from her magical bindings."]="Fico feliz que Taretha esteja viva. Agora precisamos de encontrar uma maneira de libertá-a dos seus vínculos mágicas."
G["I'm glad that these \"SI:7\" people decided to take me with.\n\nWe do not leave the comforts of our lake very often at all. This was the farthest I've ever been from home."]="I'm glad that these \"SI:7\" people decided to take me with.\n\nWe do not leave the comforts of our lake very often at all. This was the farthest I've ever been from home."
G["I'm glad that you're here to help, $c. The faster we can deal with these trolls, the faster we'll get to send the scourge back to where they came from."]="I'm glad that you're here to help, $c. The faster we can deal with these trolls, the faster we'll get to send the scourge back to where they came from."
G["I'm glad the commotions died down some around here. The last thing this place needs is another brawl."]="fico feliz em que as coisas se tenham calmado um pouco por aqui. O último que este lugar precisa é outra luta."
G["I'm glad to hear we're fighting along side the Stonemother herself this time."]="I'm glad to hear we're fighting along side the Stonemother herself this time."
G["I'm glad to see that there's still some left, after what happened in the Jade Forest."]="fico feliz em ver que ainda queden algum, depois do que aconteceu na Floresta de Jade."
G["I'm glad to see that you're well."]="Fico feliz em ver que você está bem."
G["I'm glad to see you contribute to the war effort. But I need supplies. What have you got?"]="Fico feliz ver que contribuís à campanha. Mas preciso suprimentos. Que têm?"
G["I'm glad we had this talk."]="fico feliz em que tenhamos falado."
G["I'm glad you are here, $c. The military situation in the Sunwell Plateau is rather grim."]="I'm glad you are here, $c. The military situation in the Sunwell Plateau is rather grim."
G["I'm glad you are here, friend!\n\nThe fires have driven the wildlife to seek shelter in this grove. They can run no farther. We must protect the survivors!"]="I'm glad you are here, friend!\n\nThe fires have driven the wildlife to seek shelter in this grove. They can run no farther. We must protect the survivors!"
G["I'm glad you asked, Yin. Liu Lang explored the world his entire life, and raised many children here on the Wandering Isle."]="Fico feliz que o pergunte, Yin. Liu Lang exploró o mundo durante toda sua vida, e teve muitos filhos aqui na Ilha Errante."
G["I'm glad you here to watch me back. I don't like da look of Garrosh's goons."]="I'm glad you here to watch me back. I don't like da look of Garrosh's goons."
G["I'm glad you saw that one!"]="Menos mal que o viste!"
G["I'm glad you're at least that perceptive."]="fico feliz em que pelo menos seja tão perspicaz."
G["I'm glad you're here!  Because I need your help!!"]="fico feliz em que estiver aqui! Porque preciso da sua ajuda!!"
G["I'm glad you're here! Proudmoore needs all the reinforcements she can get. Are you ready to go?"]="I'm glad you're here! Proudmoore needs all the reinforcements she can get. Are you ready to go?"
