G["I'm glad you're safe, Taretha. None of this would have been possible without your friends. They made all of this happen."]="I'm glad you're safe, Taretha. None of this would have been possible without your friends. They made all of this happen."
G["I'm goin' in manually! There's gotta be a way!"]="O farei manualmente! Precisa haver uma forma!"
G["I'm going ahead to see if there's anything I can do to help."]="I'm going ahead to see if there's anything I can do to help."
G["I'm going ahead. I will see you on the other side... I hope."]="I'm going ahead. I will see you on the other side... I hope."
G["I'm going back inside.  Let me know if anything else comes up."]="I'm going back inside.  Let me know if anything else comes up."
