G["I'm never on the... losing... side!"]="Eu... nunca... pierdo!"
G["I'm never too busy to speak to a stranger! Almost never, anyway..."]="Nunca estou muito ocupado para falar com um estranho! Quase nunca, de qualquer maneira..."
G["I'm no happier about being your babysitter than you are about being watched. Just remember... it could have been worse."]="I'm no happier about being your babysitter than you are about being watched. Just remember... it could have been worse."
G["I'm no healer, but I'm priest to meet you!"]="Sabe qual é o animal favorito de um sacerdote? O sacerdito!"
G["I'm no orc lover but yea, wish he were here right now. He'd dismantle these things!"]="I'm no orc lover but yea, wish he were here right now. He'd dismantle these things!"
G["I'm not THAT snarky, am I?"]="Não sou tão borda, verdade?"
G["I'm not a fighter. I grow vegetables and raise yaks.\n\nYou fight, I'll watch."]="I'm not a fighter. I grow vegetables and raise yaks.\n\nYou fight, I'll watch."
G["I'm not a journeyman herbalist -- am I able to still assist you in your work?"]="Eu não sou um farmacêutico de jornada - ainda posso ajudá-o no seu trabalho?"
G["I'm not a laborer. I'm here to free you from servitude in the mines."]="Eu não sou um trabalhador. Estou aqui para libertá-o da servidão nas minas."
G["I'm not about to let this Alliance scum steal back my prize."]="Não pretendo deixar que a escória da Aliança se leve meu tesouro."
G["I'm not about to perpetuate your addiction. It certainly isn't my fault. Out."]="Não vou alimentar seu adicção. Eu não sou a responsável. Fora."
G["I'm not about to train you until you prove yourself a friend to the draenei of the Exodar."]="I'm not about to train you until you prove yourself a friend to the draenei of the Exodar."
G["I'm not about to train you until you're exalted in the eyes of the draenei."]="Não vou treiná-o até que você seja exaltado aos olhos dos draeneis."
G["I'm not afraid a' you! Do you wanna' fight? Huh, do ya'? C'mon! I'll fight ya' with both paws behind my back!"]="Não os tenho medo! Quiser luta? Eh? Vamos, com as garras à costasos desafio!"
G["I'm not afraid of anything -- bring it on!"]="Não lhe tenho medo a nada, vamos!"
G["I'm not afraid of you!"]="Não os temo!"
G["I'm not afraid of you! Wait - who - who are you?"]="Não te tenho medo! Aguarda... Quem é você?"
G["I'm not amused by your audacity in coming to me for training. Go through the archway and down the ramp to the southeast, and talk to Doctor Martin Felben. He is a Forsaken who can teach you the basics."]="Não estou divertido com à sua audácia em me procurar para treinamento. Atravesse o arco e desça a rampa para o sudeste e converse com o doutor Martin Felben. Ele é um Renegado que pode lhe ensinar o básico."
G["I'm not an abomination, I'm simply undead.  I just want to speak with you."]="Não sou uma abominação, sou um simples não-morto. Somente quero falar com você."
G["I'm not an actor."]="Não sou actor."
G["I'm not blind, you know. I can see what's going on around here!"]="Eu não sou cego, você sabe. Eu posso ver o que está acontecendo por aqui!"
G["I'm not certain we could organize our people to move even if we wanted to.  We've also received word of hostile elementals appearing randomly across the lands, sometimes in towns, sometimes across the countryside.  Moving may not be an option."]="I'm not certain we could organize our people to move even if we wanted to.  We've also received word of hostile elementals appearing randomly across the lands, sometimes in towns, sometimes across the countryside.  Moving may not be an option."
G["I'm not certain where. Start with their western base overlooking Highperch."]="I'm not certain where. Start with their western base overlooking Highperch."
G["I'm not certain. Try asking Calia Hastings, by the docks. I'm told she has connections to SI:7."]="Não tenho certeza. Tente perguntar a Calia Hastings, nas docas. Disseram para mim que ela tem conexões com o SI: 7."
G["I'm not dead yet you scavenger!"]="I'm not dead yet you scavenger!"
G["I'm not done yet, idiot!"]="Ainda não terminei, idiota!"
G["I'm not done yet."]="Eu ainda não acabei."
G["I'm not falling for your tricks, $r. Victory shall be mine!"]="Não me deixarei enganar pelos seus truques, $r. A vitória será minha!"
G["I'm not feeling so well..."]="Não me sinto demais bem..."
G["I'm not fighting, so send me in now!"]="Eu não estou lutando, então me envie agora!"
G["I'm not finished with you!"]="Não terminei com você!"
G["I'm not finished yet! No, I have a few more tricks up my sleeve..."]="Não terminei ainda! Não, me guardo um par de ases na manga..."
G["I'm not flying a kite to Darnassus, wikket. I don't even know where that is! Take that portal over there."]="I'm not flying a kite to Darnassus, wikket. I don't even know where that is! Take that portal over there."
G["I'm not food!"]="Não sou comida!"
G["I'm not going anywhere until I find her!"]="Não vou lugar nenhum até encontrá-a!"
G["I'm not going on alone, Taleris, and that's final. I'm going to wait here for the next group of pilgrims and set out with them when they depart."]="I'm not going on alone, Taleris, and that's final. I'm going to wait here for the next group of pilgrims and set out with them when they depart."
G["I'm not going to run away!"]="Não pretendo fugir!"
G["I'm not gonna lie to you, soldiers. We're getting our butts kicked out there! Now which one of you is orc enough to do something about it?"]="I'm not gonna lie to you, soldiers. We're getting our butts kicked out there! Now which one of you is orc enough to do something about it?"
G["I'm not gonna make it... death comes..."]="I'm not gonna make it... death comes..."
G["I'm not good with all this emotional feeling stuff, but thank you."]="Não sou muito boa com tudo o tema dos sentimentos, mas Obrigado."
G["I'm not here on vacation, pal. Noggenfogger sent me down here with a mission: Find out how to turn a profit on these silithid, or wipe 'em clean.\n\nIf a $r like you wants to do some favors for the Steamwheedle Cartel, I could use a hand."]="I'm not here on vacation, pal. Noggenfogger sent me down here with a mission: Find out how to turn a profit on these silithid, or wipe 'em clean.\n\nIf a $r like you wants to do some favors for the Steamwheedle Cartel, I could use a hand."
G["I'm not here to be the keeper of your hatchlings, Dorian. I'm doing research of my own, as well."]="Não estou aqui para cuidar dos seus filhotes, Dorian. Eu também estou investigando."
G["I'm not here to fight.  I've only been asked to speak with you."]="Não e vindo a lutar. Somente me têm pedido que hable com você."
G["I'm not here to teach babes fresh out of the cradle. Ye've nowhere near the amount of skill I require in my students. In fact, ye're a sad figure of a $glad:lass;, an' I'll thank ye not to stand there jibber-jabberin' at me."]="I'm not here to teach babes fresh out of the cradle. Ye've nowhere near the amount of skill I require in my students. In fact, ye're a sad figure of a $glad:lass;, an' I'll thank ye not to stand there jibber-jabberin' at me."
G["I'm not impressed."]="I'm not impressed."
G["I'm not into any of that creepy stuff you like, Brazie. Just show me the \"legal\" wares."]="Eu não gosto dessas coisas assustadoras que você gosta, Brazie. Apenas me mostre os produtos \"legais\"."
G["I'm not leaving these behind. This is my family's legacy!"]="I'm not leaving these behind. This is my family's legacy!"
G["I'm not leaving until those brewkegs finish their work."]="Não pretendo ir embora até que estes barris terminen seu trabalho."
G["I'm not looking to cause trouble, but if things don't change around here, you're going to have an insurrection on your hands."]="I'm not looking to cause trouble, but if things don't change around here, you're going to have an insurrection on your hands."
G["I'm not made of fire totems, you know!"]="I'm not made of fire totems, you know!"
G["I'm not one for fightin' much. Pickin' up heavy stuff, sure... but my muscles get all weak an' wobbly when it comes to hittin' somethin'."]="I'm not one for fightin' much. Pickin' up heavy stuff, sure... but my muscles get all weak an' wobbly when it comes to hittin' somethin'."
G["I'm not out of the belly of this beast for more than two minutes and someone is already asking me about my bathroom behavior??? $G Mister:Missy;, I'd have smacked you silly for that question had you not been the one to rescue me!\n\nAnyhow! I'm grateful for the assistance. Maybe I can pay you back?"]="I'm not out of the belly of this beast for more than two minutes and someone is already asking me about my bathroom behavior??? $G Mister:Missy;, I'd have smacked you silly for that question had you not been the one to rescue me!\n\nAnyhow! I'm grateful for the assistance. Maybe I can pay you back?"
G["I'm not proud.  Since then, Kalecgos and I have talked at length about power, and how it should be used."]="Não me orgulho disso. Desde então, eu e Kalecgos conversamos bastante sobre poder, sobre como ele deve ser usado."
G["I'm not pulling anyone from anything! He can send all of the letters that he wants. I'm fully aware of his 'strategic' plan, and he knows that the Dame and I are in full agreement with what the Farstriders need to be doing. Once the Shadowpine trolls have been dealt with then, and only then, will we divert our attentions to Deatholme. I know that the scourge are the greater threat, but Tranquillien is going to have to hold them off for now. It would be suicide to ignore the trolls! Dismissed, Dusking."]="I'm not pulling anyone from anything! He can send all of the letters that he wants. I'm fully aware of his 'strategic' plan, and he knows that the Dame and I are in full agreement with what the Farstriders need to be doing. Once the Shadowpine trolls have been dealt with then, and only then, will we divert our attentions to Deatholme. I know that the scourge are the greater threat, but Tranquillien is going to have to hold them off for now. It would be suicide to ignore the trolls! Dismissed, Dusking."
G["I'm not quite convinced."]="Não estou convencido do tudo."
G["I'm not ready to die..."]="Não estou pronto para morrer..."
G["I'm not so naive as to believe your appeal for clemency, but I will listen."]="I'm not so naive as to believe your appeal for clemency, but I will listen."
G["I'm not so sure. I've heard that he's being trained as a paladin. Terenas hopes the Silver Hand can teach him some discipline. If anyone can set Arthas straight, it'd be old Uther."]="I'm not so sure. I've heard that he's being trained as a paladin. Terenas hopes the Silver Hand can teach him some discipline. If anyone can set Arthas straight, it'd be old Uther."
G["I'm not some trophy for a red dragon's mantle-piece, and I'm never going back."]="I'm not some trophy for a red dragon's mantle-piece, and I'm never going back."
G["I'm not supposed ta say anything 'bout this, but ye've got a face that says ye like a good Dwarven stout, so I trust ye!"]="I'm not supposed ta say anything 'bout this, but ye've got a face that says ye like a good Dwarven stout, so I trust ye!"
G["I'm not supposed to talk to strangers."]="Se significa que não devo falar com forasteiros."
G["I'm not sure I could."]="Não sei se poderá."
G["I'm not sure I have the stomach for this..."]="Tenho genio, mas me dejé a figura na sepultura."
G["I'm not sure I know what to make of all of this, other than I'm very insulted, and thank you for returning my purse.  I mean crate!"]="I'm not sure I know what to make of all of this, other than I'm very insulted, and thank you for returning my purse.  I mean crate!"
G["I'm not sure I'm ready to go in there alone."]="Não sei se estou pronto para entrar somente."
G["I'm not sure that's strictly necessary."]="I'm not sure that's strictly necessary."
G["I'm not sure where the zeppelin is right now, actually..."]="Eu não tenho certeza de onde o zeppelin está agora, na verdade..."
G["I'm not sure which one's crazier."]="Não estou certo de qual está mais louco."
G["I'm not surprised.\n\nSo many questions, I cannot ignore...\n\nWhy all these weapons for an archaeological dig? And what is being done with the unearthed relics? Under what authority is the excavation being conducted?\n\nThe answers don't seem to be forthcoming. I'll just have to find out for myself, I suppose."]="I'm not surprised.\n\nSo many questions, I cannot ignore...\n\nWhy all these weapons for an archaeological dig? And what is being done with the unearthed relics? Under what authority is the excavation being conducted?\n\nThe answers don't seem to be forthcoming. I'll just have to find out for myself, I suppose."
G["I'm not talking to you right now. If I were you, I wouldn't count on getting a raise this year, $n."]="Agora mesmo estou bravo com você. Se eu estivesse no seu lugar, não esperaría receber um aumento este ano, $n."
G["I'm not that easy, hon.  Perhaps another time."]="Não sou tão fácil, carinho. Talvez em outro momentos."
G["I'm not the only one who has lost a family member. There are others, many others!"]="Não sou o único que perdeu um membro do seu família. Há mais, muitos mais!"
G["I'm not through with you yet!"]="Eu não acabei com sua mascote ainda!"
G["I'm not used to fighting with other people."]="I'm not used to fighting with other people."
G["I'm not working for that maniac anymore!"]="Vou deixar de trabalhar para esse maníaco!"
G["I'm not worried about my competition. Because I know I will win."]="I'm not worried about my competition. Because I know I will win."
G["I'm now far enough away...so I can't see the barrel.  Poison away!."]="Já estou o suficiente longe... não posso ver o barril. Veneno fosse!"
G["I'm off to gather supplies and reconnect with old contacts. If I need backup in Pandaria, I'll send for ya!"]="Me vou reunir suprimentos e falar com antigos contatos. Se preciso apoio em Pandaria, farei que te avisen!"
G["I'm off. Stay safe - I'll be back as quickly as I'm able."]="I'm off. Stay safe - I'll be back as quickly as I'm able."
G["I'm ok!  It's just a flesh wound...  That was fun!!!"]="Estou bem. É somente uma ferida superficial. Foi divertido!"
G["I'm ok, I'm ok!  Ah well, back to the drawing board on that rocket fuel!"]="I'm ok, I'm ok!  Ah well, back to the drawing board on that rocket fuel!"
G["I'm okay!"]="Estou bem!"
G["I'm old enough to shoot beasts like you right between the eyes... at twice this distance."]="Sou o bastante maior para disparar a beast como você entre os olhos... desdo doble de distância."
G["I'm omitting the runes for \"north\" and \"west\" because I'm not sure how they impact the giant. I'm also including a rune to limit how long you can control it."]="I'm omitting the runes for \"north\" and \"west\" because I'm not sure how they impact the giant. I'm also including a rune to limit how long you can control it."
G["I'm on a bombing mission for Forward Commander Kingston.  I need a gryphon destroyer!"]="Estou em uma missão de bombardeio para o comandante dianteiro Kingston. Eu preciso de um destruidor de grifos!"
G["I'm on a bombing mission for Forward Commander To'arch.  I need a wyvern destroyer!"]="Estou em uma missão de bombardeio para o Comandante Avançado To'arch. Eu preciso de um destruidor de Wyvern!"
G["I'm on fire!"]="Estou que ardo!"
G["I'm on fire. Note that in the logs!"]="Estou em chamas. Indica isso nos registros."
G["I'm on important business for his majesty.\n\n\"Need to know\" buisness. And you don't need to know!"]="Estou ao serviço do seu majestade.\n\nSomente o sabe gente importantes. E você não é importantes!"
G["I'm on it!"]="Além vou!"
G["I'm on it, doctor. Schematics, check. Toothbrush, check."]="Estou em elho, doutor. Esquemas, os tenho. Cepilho de dentes, o tenho."
G["I'm on my way, Tholo!"]="Estou de caminho, Tholo!"
G["I'm on my way."]="Vou."
G["I'm on the way, sir!"]="Estou de caminho, senhor!"
G["I'm only 4 years old."]="Somente tenho quatro anos."
G["I'm only going to carve the runes I think will give you command over a giant."]="I'm only going to carve the runes I think will give you command over a giant."
G["I'm only here in case someone faints. The new recruits get a little excited and occasionally overexert themselves.\n...well, that, and sometimes one of the new mechano-tank prototypes explode. Whoops!"]="I'm only here in case someone faints. The new recruits get a little excited and occasionally overexert themselves.\n...well, that, and sometimes one of the new mechano-tank prototypes explode. Whoops!"
G["I'm out of here!"]="Me marcho de aqui!"
G["I'm out of ideas. Gyrocopter Attack?"]="Se me têm terminado as ideas. Ataque de girocóptero?"
G["I'm out of my element, eh? Walt doesn't know what he's talking about! I single-handedly kicked the iron out of these dwarves and set up camp to observe the goings-on of the dig site."]="I'm out of my element, eh? Walt doesn't know what he's talking about! I single-handedly kicked the iron out of these dwarves and set up camp to observe the goings-on of the dig site."
G["I'm out of the building again.  Now I'll move one more waypoint..."]="Outra vez estou fosse do edifício. Irei para o seguinte ponto da rota..."
G["I'm out!"]="Me largo!"
G["I'm outta here! Stupid orcs, always hated the orcs!"]="Me as piro! Estúpidos orcs! Sempre e odiado aos orcs!"
G["I'm outta here..."]="Eu me vou de aqui..."
G["I'm over here in this cage. You can't miss it!"]="Estou aqui cima, nesta jaula. Não tem perda!"
G["I'm part of the Nesingwary Safari. We were riding along in our hot air balloon through some mists when we came across this land.\n\nNesingwary and his boy wanted to hunt some of the hoofed animals and what not up north.\n\nI decided to get a headstart on them in the jungle where the real beasts are.\n\nA rocket ride later I'm neck deep in tigers."]="I'm part of the Nesingwary Safari. We were riding along in our hot air balloon through some mists when we came across this land.\n\nNesingwary and his boy wanted to hunt some of the hoofed animals and what not up north.\n\nI decided to get a headstart on them in the jungle where the real beasts are.\n\nA rocket ride later I'm neck deep in tigers."
G["I'm picking up trace amounts of chroniton particles.  Hmm, if we use a reverse phase inducer, while inverting our own chronosphere, we might be able to eliminate the particles. Of course, that means we need to build a chronosphere..."]="I'm picking up trace amounts of chroniton particles.  Hmm, if we use a reverse phase inducer, while inverting our own chronosphere, we might be able to eliminate the particles. Of course, that means we need to build a chronosphere..."
G["I'm pleased to say that your talents have outpaced my own. Go away now. Err, try the tauren Una in the northwestern shops of Thunder Bluff's central plateau. She's very skilled, I assure you."]="Tenho o prazer de dizer que seus talentos superaram os meus. Vá embora agora. Err, experimente o tauren Uma nas lojas do noroeste do platô central do Thunder Bluff. Ela é muito habilidosa, garanto."
G["I'm positively stuffed; I can't eat another bite! Well, perhaps just one more..."]="Estou cheio a estourar! Não posso comer nem um mordisco mais! Bom, talvez um mais..."
G["I'm pretty handy with nets, I could trap those nasty yaungol in them."]="I'm pretty handy with nets, I could trap those nasty yaungol in them."
G["I'm pretty sure I killed six."]="Estou bastante certo de que e matou a seis."
G["I'm pretty sure I tied the knots right. Let me know if you fall off."]="I'm pretty sure I tied the knots right. Let me know if you fall off."
G["I'm pretty sure that's why he's called the hidden master, Lin."]="Estou certo de que por isso lhe chamam o mestre oculto, Lin."
G["I'm pretty sure this \"valve\" is a toenail. Goblins..."]="Acho que esta \"válvula\" é uma unha do pé. Estes goblins..."
G["I'm probably the most important member of this team, being a paladin and all."]="Sou o membro mais importantes deste grupo, já que sou um paladino e tudo isso."
G["I'm proud to fight by your side."]="Me enorgulhece lutar ao seu lado."
G["I'm proud to have earned my Competitor's Tabard, and seek a Gold Medallion next."]="Estou orgulhoso de conseguido meu tabardo de competidor e agora busco um medalhão de ouro."
G["I'm quick and fast. Put me behind an enemy, and they won't even see me coming."]="I'm quick and fast. Put me behind an enemy, and they won't even see me coming."
G["I'm quickly tiring of the haughty attitude I receive from those grubby bowslingers outside."]="I'm quickly tiring of the haughty attitude I receive from those grubby bowslingers outside."
G["I'm quite sure there was a reason I came here...."]="Estou bastante certo de que havia uma razão pela que vine..."
G["I'm rather glad to hear that.  Congratulations, $n, for you have completed your training.  You may now ride beside me into the fray."]="I'm rather glad to hear that.  Congratulations, $n, for you have completed your training.  You may now ride beside me into the fray."
G["I'm ready - lets get you out of here."]="Estou pronto - vamos tirar você daqui."
G["I'm ready for Mount Hyjal, Jimmy. Teleport me!"]="Estou pronto para o Monte Hyjal, Jimmy. Teletransportame!"
G["I'm ready for Zul'Aman, Jebediah. Teleport me!"]="Estou pronto para Zul'aman, Jebediah. Teletranspórtame!"
G["I'm ready for anything!"]="Estou pronto para tudo!"
G["I'm ready for battle! Help me focus Kaz'tik."]="I'm ready for battle! Help me focus Kaz'tik."
G["I'm ready for my mission."]="Estou pronto para meu missão."
G["I'm ready for my next shift at the noodle stand!"]="Estou pronto para o seguinte turno no carrinho de macarrão!"
G["I'm ready for my scouting mission."]="Estou pronto para a missão de relatório."
G["I'm ready for my test flight!"]="Estou pronto para o meu voo de teste!"
G["I'm ready for that drink now."]="Já estou pronto para esse trago."
