G["I'm so angry that we lost Wintergrasp, again!  I will try to kill your leader, the all powerful, Sylvanas, instead."]="I'm so angry that we lost Wintergrasp, again!  I will try to kill your leader, the all powerful, Sylvanas, instead."
G["I'm so glad that you asked, $n!\n\nNo one ever asks how stuff works. It's just here, gimme that, I'm gonna blow stuff up. Or, don't bore me with the details, just let me point and shoot. Or, worse yet, who cares how it works, is it a bigger explosion than last time?\n\nI swear sometimes, I could just scream, you know? It's like I'm always doing all of Hobart's work for him, but I never get any of the credit! I have got to be the most underappreciated, overworked, and underpaid tinkers assistant ever!\n\nWait, what did you ask about?"]="I'm so glad that you asked, $n!\n\nNo one ever asks how stuff works. It's just here, gimme that, I'm gonna blow stuff up. Or, don't bore me with the details, just let me point and shoot. Or, worse yet, who cares how it works, is it a bigger explosion than last time?\n\nI swear sometimes, I could just scream, you know? It's like I'm always doing all of Hobart's work for him, but I never get any of the credit! I have got to be the most underappreciated, overworked, and underpaid tinkers assistant ever!\n\nWait, what did you ask about?"
G["I'm so glad yer back, Shay. Please, don't ever run off like that again! What would I tell yer parents if I lost ya?"]="I'm so glad yer back, Shay. Please, don't ever run off like that again! What would I tell yer parents if I lost ya?"
G["I'm so glad you're here, $n! Tonight is the night of the Brewmoon Festival and none of the ingredients for my famous Kun-Lai Kicker have been delivered. I sent my assistants out to gather them but none of them have returned. Could you find out what is keeping them?"]="I'm so glad you're here, $n! Tonight is the night of the Brewmoon Festival and none of the ingredients for my famous Kun-Lai Kicker have been delivered. I sent my assistants out to gather them but none of them have returned. Could you find out what is keeping them?"
G["I'm so glad you're here. I wouldn't have made it much longer."]="I'm so glad you're here. I wouldn't have made it much longer."
G["I'm so happy that Jubjub returned!  I only hope that I don't run out of Dark Iron ale soon, or I fear my pet frog might once again escape!"]="I'm so happy that Jubjub returned!  I only hope that I don't run out of Dark Iron ale soon, or I fear my pet frog might once again escape!"
G["I'm so happy. Thank you, mama and thank you, $n."]="Estou tão contente. Obrigado, mamãe, e Obrigado, $n!"
G["I'm so money!"]="Estou forrado!"
G["I'm so sorry!"]="Sinto muito!"
G["I'm so sorry, that did not alarm you did it, hmm? We Pandaren value calm under any circumstance."]="Sinto muito. Não você assustado, verdade? Os pandaren valoramos a calma ante tudo."
G["I'm so tired *pant pant*"]="I'm so tired *pant pant*"
G["I'm so tired of running, but these bees won't leave me alone!"]="I'm so tired of running, but these bees won't leave me alone!"
