G["I'm so tired. We really shouldn't have stayed up so late last night,,, well this morning. But it was fun! You do throw the best soirees milord."]="I'm so tired. We really shouldn't have stayed up so late last night,,, well this morning. But it was fun! You do throw the best soirees milord."
G["I'm so tired...."]="Estou tão cansado..."
G["I'm so worried about those poor captured pandaren. Have you had a chance yet to see what condition they're in, $n?"]="I'm so worried about those poor captured pandaren. Have you had a chance yet to see what condition they're in, $n?"
G["I'm sorry $g lad : lass; but ye just don't have the foundation to learn what I have to teach. But don't fret, go speak with my student Rotgath, he'll help ye out."]="Sinto muito $gmuchacho: moça; mas não tem a base necessário para aprender de mim. Mas não te inquietes, vê a falar com meu aluno Rotgath, ele te ajudará."
G["I'm sorry $g mon : sis;, but I won't be sellin' my raptors to someone who hasn't proven themselves to be a friendly to the Darkspear tribe.  When ya make a stand and show yourself to be at least friendly to us, then I'll make my raptors available to ya."]="Sinto muito colega, mas não vou vender meus raptores a ninguém que não se tenha testado como amigo da tribo Lança Negra. Demonstra que é $gamistoso: amistosa; e pondré ao seu disposição meus raptores."
G["I'm sorry $g mon : sis;, but I won't be sellin' my raptors to someone who hasn't proven themselves to be exalted to the Darkspear tribe.  When ya make a stand and show yourself to be no less than exalted to us, then I'll make my raptors available to ya."]="I'm sorry $g mon : sis;, but I won't be sellin' my raptors to someone who hasn't proven themselves to be exalted to the Darkspear tribe.  When ya make a stand and show yourself to be no less than exalted to us, then I'll make my raptors available to ya."
