G["I'm still amazed that I ever joined the Shado-Pan to be honest. Not that they're not an amazing bunch and all, just the thought of the violence clashing with my impecible complection.\n\nI never have trouble remembering why I joined them though... let's just say Anji can be very convincing."]="I'm still amazed that I ever joined the Shado-Pan to be honest. Not that they're not an amazing bunch and all, just the thought of the violence clashing with my impecible complection.\n\nI never have trouble remembering why I joined them though... let's just say Anji can be very convincing."
G["I'm still wary of the risks. While I agree that Malfurion and his dirt-loving brothers are quite mad, this Lord Sargeras must have another agenda..."]="I'm still wary of the risks. While I agree that Malfurion and his dirt-loving brothers are quite mad, this Lord Sargeras must have another agenda..."
G["I'm still weak, but I think I can get an anti-magic barrier up. Stay inside it or you'll be destroyed by their spells."]="I'm still weak, but I think I can get an anti-magic barrier up. Stay inside it or you'll be destroyed by their spells."
G["I'm still working out some minor details..."]="Sigo resolvendo algum detalhes sem importância..."
G["I'm stopping my patrol now!"]="Vou parar meu patrulha agora mesmo!"
G["I'm such a luckydont! I ruined Uncle Keenbean's kafa trade!"]="Sou um estúpido! E arruinado o comercio de kafa do tio Grano Sábio!"
G["I'm summoning a Flamestrike, lead them into it!"]="I'm summoning a Flamestrike, lead them into it!"
G["I'm supposed to be hunting infected nightstalkers... This should be easy."]="I'm supposed to be hunting infected nightstalkers... This should be easy."
G["I'm supposed to get ye to the Shrine o' Seven Stars."]="Me têm dito que te leve ao Santuário das Sete Estrelas."
G["I'm supposed to guard the well. It's an important job!"]="Meu dever é proteção o poço. É um trabalho importantes!"
G["I'm sure Arthas will be back any day now, soldier. Keep your chin up!"]="Tenho certeza que Arthas estará de volta a qualquer dia, soldado. Mantenha seu queixo erguido!"
G["I'm sure I can find a use for this mixture..."]="I'm sure I can find a use for this mixture..."
G["I'm sure I don't need to remind you to stay alert down here."]="Tenho certeza de que não preciso lembrá-o para ficar alerta aqui embaixo."
G["I'm sure Thrall will have his people under control..."]="Estou certa de que Thrall mantendrá ao seu gente controlada..."
G["I'm sure everything will work out, footman."]="Tenho certeza de que tudo vai dar certo, lacaio."
G["I'm sure it would've been seaworthy in calm waters."]="Estou certo de que haveria banido muito marinheiro em águas tranquilas."
G["I'm sure it's just incompetence or oversight by some of the workers."]="Certo que foi simples descuido ou incompetência por parte de algum dos trabalhadores."
G["I'm sure ol' Hemet can do something with your bones!"]="Estou certo de que o velho Hemet poderá fazer algo com os seus ossos!"
G["I'm sure that help from Farstrider Enclave will be here soon to help me and this useless lieutenant get to safety. You might not want to stick around; I've heard all sorts of strange sounds coming from the lake and that village over yonder."]="I'm sure that help from Farstrider Enclave will be here soon to help me and this useless lieutenant get to safety. You might not want to stick around; I've heard all sorts of strange sounds coming from the lake and that village over yonder."
G["I'm sure they are just being overly superstitious."]="Certo que simplesmente estão sendo demais supersticiosos."
G["I'm sure they're quite wonderful.  If you don't mind I have some drinking to get back to.  You coming, $n?"]="I'm sure they're quite wonderful.  If you don't mind I have some drinking to get back to.  You coming, $n?"
