G["I'm sure you all must be in a big hurry and probably have some more big dangerous monsters to kill but if you would just take a moment and come help me out of this cage before rushing off it would make me so happy and excited that I would barely be able to contain myself so if you get a moment I'll just be over here... waiting... patiently...."]="I'm sure you all must be in a big hurry and probably have some more big dangerous monsters to kill but if you would just take a moment and come help me out of this cage before rushing off it would make me so happy and excited that I would barely be able to contain myself so if you get a moment I'll just be over here... waiting... patiently...."
G["I'm sure you can handle things in here. I'll be outside settling things down."]="I'm sure you can handle things in here. I'll be outside settling things down."
G["I'm sure, Magni. I'll see this through, don't ya worry."]="Estou certo, Magni. Saldré desta, não te preocupe."
G["I'm surprised he lasted as long as he did. PH"]="I'm surprised he lasted as long as he did. PH"
G["I'm surprised that a $c like you could even see me, $n. I'm stealth on a stick!"]="Me surpreende que $gun: uma; $c como você possa me ver, $n! Estou camuflada!"
G["I'm surprised that you made it this far."]="Me surpreende que tenha chegado até aqui."
G["I'm surrounded by idiots!"]="Estou rodeada de estúpidos!"
G["I'm takin' you close ta a Horde encampment though, so you'd best be on yer guard."]="Mas te estou acercando ao acampamento da Horda, assim que melhor tenha cuidado."
G["I'm taking the next ship back home."]="I'm taking the next ship back home."
G["I'm taking this back to the old school. I'll be the Alliance and you be Frostwolf Village. BOMBS AWAY!"]="O farei como na velha escola. Eu serei a Aliança e você será a Aldeia Lobo gelo. BOMBAS FORA!"
G["I'm tellin' you, that Coren Direbrew's a madman.\nIt's not MY fault he didn't get invited to compete at Brewfest! But that didn't stop him and all his Dark Iron cronies from roughin' up my employees and drinking all my brew.\nSomeone's got to put an end to this!"]="I'm tellin' you, that Coren Direbrew's a madman.\nIt's not MY fault he didn't get invited to compete at Brewfest! But that didn't stop him and all his Dark Iron cronies from roughin' up my employees and drinking all my brew.\nSomeone's got to put an end to this!"
G["I'm telling Mommy!"]="I'm telling Mommy!"
G["I'm the bleeding edge, baby! Elemental infused technologies. Exploring the depths of Azeroth for lost knowledge and new resources.\n\nRemember the name."]="Estou na cresta da onda, colega! Tecnologia imbuida com os elementos. Explorando as profundezas de Azeroth à procura de conhecimentos perdidos e novos recurso.\n\nAcuérdate de meu nome."
G["I'm the bomber man...tid!"]="Sou uma mántide... perigosa!"
G["I'm the heavy bomb master. Send me up!"]="Sou o amo das bombas pesadas! Súbeme!"
G["I'm the king of dirt, there is none higher! To my aid, minions - assist your sire!"]="Sou o rei da sujeira, não há ninguém que me supere! Lacaios, ajudem-me, ajude ao seu senhor!"
G["I'm the most intelligent, strongest, most cultured gorloc here, yet Soo-say calls all the shots... does that seem right to you?"]="Eu sou o gorloc mais inteligente, forte e culto do lugar, mas ainda assim é Soo-pinstán o que manda... Você acha que isso está bem?"
G["I'm the new king?  What are you talking about?"]="Eu sou o novo rei? Do que você está falando?"
G["I'm the warden, and you know that! You'd better not make any trouble, because I'll know the moment that you try anything..."]="I'm the warden, and you know that! You'd better not make any trouble, because I'll know the moment that you try anything..."
G["I'm the... forget it. I'm here to warn you that the black dragonflight is here hunting you."]="I'm the... forget it. I'm here to warn you that the black dragonflight is here hunting you."
G["I'm thinkin' of opening a lumber depot here.\n\nAll these trees just sittin' around waiting to get chopped down. I would be a fool to pass up this opportunity!"]="I'm thinkin' of opening a lumber depot here.\n\nAll these trees just sittin' around waiting to get chopped down. I would be a fool to pass up this opportunity!"
G["I'm thinkin' the Reef Octopi are hereabouts this area in Sri-La village of Jade Forest. \n\n<Ben stuffs a pin along the Northeast shore of Jade Forest on your map.>"]="I'm thinkin' the Reef Octopi are hereabouts this area in Sri-La village of Jade Forest. \n\n<Ben stuffs a pin along the Northeast shore of Jade Forest on your map.>"
G["I'm thinking about jumping in the ring myself... just not right now."]="Estou pensando em entrar no ring... Talvez mais tarde."
G["I'm thinking about the front to the north. The one you're so eager to return to."]="Estou pensando na linha de frente do norte. Esse ao que tem tantas ganha de voltar."
G["I'm thinking of a vacation. I hear Hearthglen is nice."]="I'm thinking of a vacation. I hear Hearthglen is nice."
G["I'm thinking of trying to grow some crops here.\n\nCan you imagine what might happen if I planted an engima seed?"]="Estou pensando em cultivar algo aqui.\n\nTe imaginas o que poderá passar se plantara sementes enigmáticas?"
G["I'm thirsty!"]="Tenho sede!"
G["I'm thirsty."]="Tenho sede."
G["I'm through asking nicely, fish-man."]="I'm through asking nicely, fish-man."
G["I'm through being courteous with your kind, human! What is the \"Crimson Dawn?\""]="I'm through being courteous with your kind, human! What is the \"Crimson Dawn?\""
G["I'm tired of these toys. I don't want to play anymore!"]="Me e entediado de estes brinquedos. Não quero jogar mais!"
G["I'm tired of wading in water.  Let's make this a little bit easier on ourselves, shall we?  Spirit of water, come to our aid!"]="I'm tired of wading in water.  Let's make this a little bit easier on ourselves, shall we?  Spirit of water, come to our aid!"
G["I'm tired.  You kill next one!"]="Estou cansado. Você matas ao seguinte!"
G["I'm too dumb to be in a cult. Been that way since I felled off the back of the zeppelin. And hit them propellors. Landed on a rock. They fixed my head up with a metal bowl to make it round and hard.\n\n<He thunks his fist against his skull.>\n\nThen the lightning done come."]="I'm too dumb to be in a cult. Been that way since I felled off the back of the zeppelin. And hit them propellors. Landed on a rock. They fixed my head up with a metal bowl to make it round and hard.\n\n<He thunks his fist against his skull.>\n\nThen the lightning done come."
G["I'm too good-looking to die as a sacrifice!"]="Sou demais bonito para morrer sacrificado!"
G["I'm too weak to fight with you.  Please find my friends."]="Estou demais fraco para lutar com você. Por favor, encontre a meus amigos."
G["I'm too young to die as a sacrifice!"]="Sou demais jovem para morrer sacrificado!"
G["I'm too young to die!"]="Sou demais jovem para morrer!"
G["I'm too young to die! Hell, I'm too pretty to die!"]="I'm too young to die! Hell, I'm too pretty to die!"
G["I'm training hard, can't you see?"]="Não vê que estou treinando?"
G["I'm training right now.  Can this wait?"]="Estou treinando agora. Isso pode esperar?"
G["I'm training to be a priest, myself. One day I hope I can command as much power as you."]="Estou estudando para ser sacerdote. Espero que algum dia possa ser tão poderoso como você."
G["I'm trustin' you not to lead me into any rivers, or animal mouths. Nothin' like that."]="Espero que não me leve a nenhum rio, nem à boca de nenhum animal. Nada disso."
G["I'm trustin' you not to walk me off that big ol' cliff."]="Espero que não me despenhes por esse enorme penhasco."
G["I'm trusting you and the other leaders to not let this divide our people. You are stronger than that."]="Confío em ti e no resto de líderes para que isto não nos divida. São mais fortes que isso."
G["I'm trusting you... Don't let me die!"]="Confío em ti... Não me deixe morrer!"
G["I'm tryin' to run a business here!"]="Estou tentando levar um negócios!"
G["I'm trying to convince Godfrey to just kill all of you to end your misery, but he keeps telling me no. More pain and suffering for the lot of you, then!"]="I'm trying to convince Godfrey to just kill all of you to end your misery, but he keeps telling me no. More pain and suffering for the lot of you, then!"
G["I'm under attack! I repeat, I am under attack!"]="Me estão atacando! Repito, me estão atacando!"
G["I'm up ta me pretty knickers in ad-mino-strative duties, but wot else is new?"]="I'm up ta me pretty knickers in ad-mino-strative duties, but wot else is new?"
G["I'm up to 15. Top that!"]="E conseguido 15. Supera isso!"
G["I'm up to looking into that bounty after this shift."]="Vou ir a por essa recompensa quando acabe o turno."
G["I'm used to fighting off the small ones..."]="I'm used to fighting off the small ones..."
G["I'm very busy right now, $r. Please leave me alone."]="Agora estou muito ocupada, $r. Por favor, deixe-me sozinha."
G["I'm very busy right now, young $c. Please excuse me."]="Agora estou muito ocupado, jovem $c. Discúlpame, por favor."
G["I'm very curious to see what this sample of water will do!"]="Estou impatient por ver o que fará esta mostra de água!"
G["I'm very interested in seeing your fighting style, $c."]="Tenho muitas ganha de ver seu estilo de luta, $c."
G["I'm very sorry, but I no longer have relics to sell you. Their magic seems to have extinguished! Perhaps I'll go into dancing full time now, it would be a nice change of pace."]="I'm very sorry, but I no longer have relics to sell you. Their magic seems to have extinguished! Perhaps I'll go into dancing full time now, it would be a nice change of pace."
G["I'm warning you, I will not falter under your assault."]="Eu estou lhe avisando, não fraquejarei sob sua ofensiva."
G["I'm warning you, Lor'themar. The Alliance is besieging the city and we will destroy Hellscream. Your people had best stay out of our way."]="I'm warning you, Lor'themar. The Alliance is besieging the city and we will destroy Hellscream. Your people had best stay out of our way."
G["I'm watching you, $r."]="Te estou vendo, $r."
G["I'm what you call a capitalist, $r."]="I'm what you call a capitalist, $r."
G["I'm willing to help you out, but you have to promise not to mention this to anyone else. Even talking about this kind of thing can hurt my reputation!"]="I'm willing to help you out, but you have to promise not to mention this to anyone else. Even talking about this kind of thing can hurt my reputation!"
G["I'm with Drull, doc. Laverne and I are happy together. Why try and separate us?"]="I'm with Drull, doc. Laverne and I are happy together. Why try and separate us?"
G["I'm with you, $n."]="Estou com você, $n."
G["I'm with you, Akama."]="Estou com você, Akama."
G["I'm with you, Thorim."]="Estou com você, Thorim."
G["I'm with you, hero."]="Estou com você, $ghéroe: heroína;."
G["I'm with you."]="Estou com você."
G["I'm with you. Let's break into that shipyard! [Queue for solo instance.]"]="I'm with you. Let's break into that shipyard! [Queue for solo instance.]"
G["I'm workin' as fast as I can, cap'n!"]="Trabalho tão rápido como posso, Capitão!"
G["I'm workin' on a new invention that's goin' to blow your mind!\n\nAnd probably maim other body parts."]="Estou trabalhando em um novo invento que vai ser a bomba!\n\nPorque vai explodir."
G["I'm workin', here."]="Estou trabalhando aqui."
G["I'm working as fast as humanly possible, Pat. Stop interrupting me!"]="I'm working as fast as humanly possible, Pat. Stop interrupting me!"
G["I'm working on a biographical piece for Commander Schnottz, among other things.\n\nYou'll have to excuse me."]="I'm working on a biographical piece for Commander Schnottz, among other things.\n\nYou'll have to excuse me."
G["I'm working on it, I just don't want to sell it until I'm happy with it. It shouldn't be long."]="I'm working on it, I just don't want to sell it until I'm happy with it. It shouldn't be long."
G["I'm working on it, Molsen. If you want it done faster, do it yourself."]="I'm working on it, Molsen. If you want it done faster, do it yourself."
G["I'm working up the courage to go in after more of the relics. What do you think, $n?"]="Estou reunindo coragem para ir à procura de mais relíquias mogu. Que você acha, $n?"
G["I'm worried about the others, $n."]="Me preocupao resto, $n."
G["I'm your goblin, Thrall. What would you have of me?"]="Sou seu goblin, Thrall. Que que que faça?"
G["I'm your man! Give me the coded message."]="Sou quem atenção! Dê-me a mensagem cifrado."
G["I'm your man, Ich. Give me a beacon!"]="I'm your man, Ich. Give me a beacon!"
G["I'm your master... you're supposed to do what I say!"]="Sou seu mestre... se significa O que precisa fazer o que digo!"
G["I'm your woman! Give me the coded message."]="Sou quem atenção! Dê-me a mensagem cifrado."
G["I'm, I'm simply saying that life, uh... didn't find a way."]="Eu... eu só estou dizendo que... ahm, dessa vez a vida não venceu."
G["I'm... I'm just going to lie down a while... until this headache goes away."]="Me... vou tumbar um momento... até que se me passe este dor de cabeça."
G["I'm... alive?  Thank you... thank you so much!"]="Sigo... com vida? Obrigado... muitas Obrigado!"
G["I'm... alive? I'm alive! I'm alive!"]="Estou... vivo? Estou vivo! Estou vivo!"
G["I'm... not sure that's a good idea, 'Moke. Ye might get hurt..."]="I'm... not sure that's a good idea, 'Moke. Ye might get hurt..."
G["I'm... so... dizzy."]="Me... siento... mareado."
G["I'mma turn you into a stout!"]="Vou fazer cerveja com você!"
G["I've a message for your master, scum!"]="Escória! Tenho uma mensagem para o seu amo."
G["I've a surprise for ye, dogs!"]="Tenho uma surpresa para você, animal!"
G["I've almost got it! Just a little more time..."]="Já quase o temos! Um pouco mais de tempo..."
G["I've already alerted the Shado-Pan of what's happened here. Hopefully they can do something.\n\nI feel as though we are all woefully unprepared for the coming trials we are to face."]="I've already alerted the Shado-Pan of what's happened here. Hopefully they can do something.\n\nI feel as though we are all woefully unprepared for the coming trials we are to face."
G["I've already told you, McSorf. I've sent no less than three rescue teams into the ruins and none have returned. I am working tirelessly to keep this port afloat and in one piece! GET OFF MY BACK!"]="I've already told you, McSorf. I've sent no less than three rescue teams into the ruins and none have returned. I am working tirelessly to keep this port afloat and in one piece! GET OFF MY BACK!"
G["I've always had a good head for numbers!\n\nOnce the natives saw how fast I could add, subtract, and do differential equations in my head, they hired me on the spot!"]="I've always had a good head for numbers!\n\nOnce the natives saw how fast I could add, subtract, and do differential equations in my head, they hired me on the spot!"
G["I've always liked sorting and organizing things.  I guess I take after my mother."]="Eu sempre gostei de classificar e organizar as coisas. Acho que vou atrás da minha mãe."
G["I've always wanted my very own dragon!"]="I've always wanted my very own dragon!"
G["I've always wondered what it would be like to be a druid. Where do your clothes go when you change into a bear?"]="Sempre me e perguntado como seria ser um druida. Que passa com o seu roupa quando te conviertes em urso?"
G["I've always wondered what lay behind these gates."]="Sempre me e perguntado que haveria atrás essas portões."
G["I've always wondered when outsiders would breach out shores, and so now you have come."]="Sempre me havia perguntado quando veríamos forasteiros em nossas costas. E aqui estão."
G["I've arranged for your flight to Manaforge Coruu.  Are you ready, $n?  You will be dropped off behind enemy lines so make sure you bring everything you need."]="E organizado seu voo à forja de mana Coruu. Está $gpreparado: preparada;, $n? Te deixarão por trás das fileiras inimigas, assim que certifique-se de levar tudo o que precisa."
G["I've become one with fire!  I've... auuuggggh!!!  It burnssss!!!"]="Sou um com o fogo! Sou... Aaagggh! Queeemaaa!"
G["I've been better.  Ivar the Foul got the better of me..."]="E tido momentos melhores. Ivar o Hediondo sacó o melhor de mim..."
G["I've been busy. A few of the Saur-Priests have been calling for Horde and Alliance blood.\n\nNaturally, I killed them in their sleep."]="I've been busy. A few of the Saur-Priests have been calling for Horde and Alliance blood.\n\nNaturally, I killed them in their sleep."
G["I've been circling nearby in case you needed to speak."]="I've been circling nearby in case you needed to speak."
G["I've been delivering mail for a month now. Are there any executive openings? I have my resume right here."]="Levo um mês enviada cartas. Não há nenhum posto de directivo? Tenho meu currículo aqui mesmo."
G["I've been expec...\n\n<Rimblat coughs.>\n\nExcuse me, old habit. I am Rimblat of the Earthen Ring."]="I've been expec...\n\n<Rimblat coughs.>\n\nExcuse me, old habit. I am Rimblat of the Earthen Ring."
G["I've been expecting you $n.  Are you ready to assist us in Arathi Basin?"]="Te tenho estado esperando, $n. Está $gpreparado: preparada; para nos ajudar na Bacia Arathi?"
G["I've been expecting you, $n."]="Te estava esperando, $n."
G["I've been expecting you, $p!"]="Te estava esperando, $p!"
G["I've been experimenting with all sorts of brews in my spare time.\n\nWith the Stormstout brewery right across the way, I can't help but get inspired sometimes.\n\nOh, but these aren't anywhere as good as what they make over there."]="I've been experimenting with all sorts of brews in my spare time.\n\nWith the Stormstout brewery right across the way, I can't help but get inspired sometimes.\n\nOh, but these aren't anywhere as good as what they make over there."
G["I've been feelin'... urges."]="I've been feelin'... urges."
G["I've been fightin' Horde for ten years now, and I've never seen it worse than this."]="Levo dez anos lutando contra a Horda e nunca temos estado pior que agora."
G["I've been given another chance to serve?  I will not fail again!"]="Tenho outra oportunidade de servir? Não voltarei a falhar!"
G["I've been gone a long time...I better get back."]="tenho estado ausente durante muito tempo... é hora de que regrese."
G["I've been here for hours and the sun hasn't moved..."]="Levo horas aqui, e o sol não se tem movido..."
G["I've been here in this valley since before the dark portal opened, $glad:lass;. I don't plan on letting a handful of blood elves traipse in here and plunder these ruins!"]="I've been here in this valley since before the dark portal opened, $glad:lass;. I don't plan on letting a handful of blood elves traipse in here and plunder these ruins!"
G["I've been here long enough, $n. I'm sure we'll meet again. Good luck!"]="Temos estado aqui bastante tempo, $n. Certo que nos volveremos a ver. Sorte!"
G["I've been in here for days. They were about to sacrifice me!"]="I've been in here for days. They were about to sacrifice me!"
G["I've been in here for days. They were just about to sacrifice me!"]="I've been in here for days. They were just about to sacrifice me!"
G["I've been in the middle of a few messes in my day, but this is ridiculous!"]="I've been in the middle of a few messes in my day, but this is ridiculous!"
G["I've been in the military my whole life.  I've fought in many wars, under many banners - but they've always been other people's battles.\n\nNot this time.  Every Forsaken soldier you see here has come for one reason alone.  Arthas must be killed."]="I've been in the military my whole life.  I've fought in many wars, under many banners - but they've always been other people's battles.\n\nNot this time.  Every Forsaken soldier you see here has come for one reason alone.  Arthas must be killed."
G["I've been looking for a little help. Since you've got the skill, I guess you'll do, provided you've also got the guts."]="tenho estado procurando algo de ajuda. Como tem a habilidade necessário suponho que o fará, sempre e quando também tenha coragem."
G["I've been meaning to ask you about that monkey."]="Eu pretendo perguntar sobre esse macaco."
G["I've been meaning to investigate this site.\n\nNo time like the present!"]="Tinha intenção de examinar este lugar.\n\nAgora é o melhor momentos!"
G["I've been mixing potions since before the cartel wars, and I don't plan to stop anytime soon.\n\nAs long as there's a buyer to be had, Ol' Baba will be ready with a sale!"]="I've been mixing potions since before the cartel wars, and I don't plan to stop anytime soon.\n\nAs long as there's a buyer to be had, Ol' Baba will be ready with a sale!"
G["I've been ordered back to the main battlegroup to provide carrier escort. The full might of the Alliance navy will arrive in two months' time."]="Tenho ordens de voltar à formação de batalha principal para proporcionar apoio. Toda a marinha da Aliança chegará em dois meses."
G["I've been patient up to this point, but if they don't get that rocket sling working soon, I'm going to shadow bolt someone!"]="Fui paciente até este ponto, mas se eles não conseguirem que o estilingue de foguetes funcione logo, vou dar um jeito em alguém!"
G["I've been patient up to this point, but if they don't get that rocket sling working soon, I'm going to shadow bolt someone!\n\nNeed some training, $n?"]="I've been patient up to this point, but if they don't get that rocket sling working soon, I'm going to shadow bolt someone!\n\nNeed some training, $n?"
G["I've been placed in command of Alliance joint operations in the Twilight Highlands.\n\nThe independant Wildhammer clans still dot this countryside. If we can unite them under the Alliance banner, nothing can stop us! But enemies close in on all sides. I hope you're ready for a fight, $c."]="I've been placed in command of Alliance joint operations in the Twilight Highlands.\n\nThe independant Wildhammer clans still dot this countryside. If we can unite them under the Alliance banner, nothing can stop us! But enemies close in on all sides. I hope you're ready for a fight, $c."
G["I've been practicing all week for this!"]="tenho estado treinando toda a semana para isto!"
G["I've been preparing for this moment for years, $n, and you've made it all possible. Witness my transformation!"]="I've been preparing for this moment for years, $n, and you've made it all possible. Witness my transformation!"
G["I've been saving this for a special occasion."]="Estava reservando isto para uma ocasão especial."
G["I've been saving this just for you, big boy!"]="tenho estado reservando isto para você, machote!"
G["I've been saving this spot for something special. I don't think it gets any more special than this, $n."]="tenho estado guardando este lugar para algo especial. Não acho que tenha nada mais especial que isto, $n."
G["I've been sent here by my superiors to investigate some strange occurrences here in Booty Bay.  This goblin town withstood a tidal wave remarkably well, especially given the reputation of goblin engineering.  I'm surprised the place didn't explode on impact.\n\nI suspect there may be magical forces at play here.  There may be more to Booty Bay than you'd expect, $c..."]="E banido enviada aqui por meus superior para investigação os estranhos acontecimentos que têm acontecido em Baía do Saque. Esta cidade goblin aguantó um maremoto bastante bem, sobre tudo tendo em conta a reputação da engenharia goblin. Me surpreende que esse lugar não pular pelos aires.\n\nSostorso que talvez tenha em jogo forças mágicas. Talvez em Baía do Saque passe algo mais gordo do que acha, $c..."
G["I've been sent here to help you keep Anthracite under control."]="I've been sent here to help you keep Anthracite under control."
G["I've been sparring all day. When do we eat?"]="Levo tudo o dia lutando. Quando comemos?"
G["I've been spotted!"]="Nos têm descoberto!"
G["I've been spotted!  $n incoming! Help!"]="Me têm visto! $n se aproxima! Ajuda!"
G["I've been spotted?  Time to die!"]="Me têm descoberto? Hora de morrer!"
G["I've been to Ironforge before.  It smells funny there."]="Eu já estive em Ironforge antes. Cheira engraçado lá."
G["I've been told that I'm the best-looking rider in the skies. I wouldn't believe that if I were you. I'm also the best-looking rider on land, under the sea...well, just about anywhere!"]="Me têm dito que sou o cavaleiro mais atractivo dos céus. Se fosse você, não me o creería. Também sou o cavaleiro mais atractivo do só, do mar... em fim, de todas partes!"
G["I've been training really hard! There's no way you can defeat me now, $n."]="I've been training really hard! There's no way you can defeat me now, $n."
G["I've been unable to befriend the Glassfin Elder. $C, I'm counting on you to succeed where I failed."]="I've been unable to befriend the Glassfin Elder. $C, I'm counting on you to succeed where I failed."
G["I've been very, very naughty...."]="I've been very, very naughty...."
G["I've been waiting a long time for this, you know."]="Vocês sabem? Levo muito tempo esperando isto."
G["I've been waiting a long time to be on this tour."]="E esperado muito tempo para estar neste recorrido."
G["I've been waiting for this day for years. Behold my transformation!"]="tenho estado esperando isto durante anos. Contempla meu transformação!"
G["I've been waiting to unleash this gunship against a worthy target. Let's spend some ammunition!"]="Tenho ganha de testar esta nave de guerra contra um objetivo digno. Vamos gastar munição!"
G["I've been waiting."]="tenho estado esperando."
G["I've been watching the Aldor working on the walls. They're gonna rebuild the whole city, you know.\n\nThey work much faster than old Foreman Oslow did back home in Lakeshire. He kept losing his tools in the lake, or the gnolls would take his supplies.\n\nI should ask the Aldor to send him some help. They'd have that bridge fixed faster'n anything."]="I've been watching the Aldor working on the walls. They're gonna rebuild the whole city, you know.\n\nThey work much faster than old Foreman Oslow did back home in Lakeshire. He kept losing his tools in the lake, or the gnolls would take his supplies.\n\nI should ask the Aldor to send him some help. They'd have that bridge fixed faster'n anything."
G["I've been watching the Dark Iron for a long time...plotting, hoping, wishing for the chance to drive them away and take back my land.\n\nThey can keep Blackrock Mountain. I hope it erupts again and takes them all with it. I want what is now called the Burning Steppes, my part of the Redridge Mountains that their fiery overlord destroyed.\n\n$C, I'm going to show the world the potential left in my land. I'll build a kingdom of peace and justice atop the death and trickery they leave behind them. My vigil is over. I'm here to fight for what's rightfully mine.\n\nAnd I'm willing to die for it."]="I've been watching the Dark Iron for a long time...plotting, hoping, wishing for the chance to drive them away and take back my land.\n\nThey can keep Blackrock Mountain. I hope it erupts again and takes them all with it. I want what is now called the Burning Steppes, my part of the Redridge Mountains that their fiery overlord destroyed.\n\n$C, I'm going to show the world the potential left in my land. I'll build a kingdom of peace and justice atop the death and trickery they leave behind them. My vigil is over. I'm here to fight for what's rightfully mine.\n\nAnd I'm willing to die for it."
G["I've been wiped out!"]="Tô na lona!"
G["I've been wondering when I would be fighting you."]="Eu me perguntava quando enfrentaria você."
G["I've been working on a way to transport oil underground between major cities, but everyone tells me it's a pipe dream."]="Eu tenho trabalhado em uma maneira de transportar petróleo no subsolo entre as principais cidades, mas tudo mundo me diz que é um sonho."
G["I've been wrastlin' celestials all mornin'!"]="I've been wrastlin' celestials all mornin'!"
G["I've brewed up a real fight if you think you can handle it."]="Se acha estar à altura, e pronto um combate do mais refrescante."
G["I've brought in the best gnomes we've got to get those doors open, $n! They're estimatin' that it's gonna take another $4939W days before that door comes down!"]="I've brought in the best gnomes we've got to get those doors open, $n! They're estimatin' that it's gonna take another $4939W days before that door comes down!"
G["I've brought some food for you."]="Te e trazido um pouco de comida."
G["I've calculated the probability of my success, and it's distressingly low!"]="E calculado meus possibilidades de êxito, e são preocupantemente bajas!"
G["I've changed my mind, go get that one instead!"]="E mudado de ideia, a por esse melhor!"
G["I've changed my mind."]="I've changed my mind."
G["I've collected so much data on serpents in the wild!"]="E reuniu um monte de informações sobre os dragões selvagens!"
G["I've come at your call, Stonemother."]="I've come at your call, Stonemother."
G["I've come back to my old home so my knowledge may be passed on.  Unlike the mindless undead around me, I've chosen this unlife for my own reasons.\n\nThe silithid are formidable opponents, $n.  I've learned to respect them as much as I despise them.\n\nMuch of their deadliness comes from the strength and lightness of their chitin, which I've learned to work into armor.  As we seem to have a common enemy I shall teach you my trade."]="I've come back to my old home so my knowledge may be passed on.  Unlike the mindless undead around me, I've chosen this unlife for my own reasons.\n\nThe silithid are formidable opponents, $n.  I've learned to respect them as much as I despise them.\n\nMuch of their deadliness comes from the strength and lightness of their chitin, which I've learned to work into armor.  As we seem to have a common enemy I shall teach you my trade."
G["I've come for our order of Scallions."]="I've come for our order of Scallions."
G["I've come to believe Soo-holu was left here to guard the shrines, but like the shrines, he's powerless without the right crystals."]="I've come to believe Soo-holu was left here to guard the shrines, but like the shrines, he's powerless without the right crystals."
G["I've come to finish my task."]="E vindo a terminar meu cometido."
G["I've come to realize our path was a false one. We were betrayed by the man we called our prince. In his lust for power, he sent the felblood to attack us, and to spirit M'uru away to the Sunwell."]="I've come to realize our path was a false one. We were betrayed by the man we called our prince. In his lust for power, he sent the felblood to attack us, and to spirit M'uru away to the Sunwell."
G["I've come too far to be chased off by a few undead bullies."]="I've come too far to be chased off by a few undead bullies."
G["I've conjured a Blizzard, lead them into it!"]="I've conjured a Blizzard, lead them into it!"
G["I've consulted my fellow imps, and we think YES, except for that one imp."]="I've consulted my fellow imps, and we think YES, except for that one imp."
G["I've dabbled in various forms of restorative magic, from the power of the tides to the might of the divine, but my true calling will always be to the grace of the mists."]="E testado várias formas de magia restauradora, desdo poder das marés até a força da divindade, mas meu autêntico vocação sempre será a graça da névoa."
G["I've decided to search for the Vale. I must find the Sacred Pools and study their healing powers."]="E decidido ir a procurar o vale. Quero encontrar as Poços Sagradas e estudar seus poderes curativos."
G["I've decided to search for the Vale... Vale... Vale..."]="Eu decidi procurar o Vale... Vale... Vale..."
G["I've decided to write a book. \"The Mysteries of Mogu Magic.\" Has a nice ring to it, don't you think?"]="E decidido escrever um livro: \"Os mistérios da magia mogu\". Soa bem, verdade?"
G["I've destroyed his shield, unleash your power now!"]="E destruído seu escudo! Desata seu poder agora!"
G["I've destroyed the key! Your cherished archmage belongs to Malygos!"]="E destruído a chave! Seu adorado archimago pertence a Malygos!"
G["I've done all I can for the wounded here. Twinbraid has all the bodies he'll get.\nI'm defending the injured... unless you have a better plan?"]="I've done all I can for the wounded here. Twinbraid has all the bodies he'll get.\nI'm defending the injured... unless you have a better plan?"
G["I've done all that you've asked of me. I'm ready for the trial of stone."]="Fiz tudo o que me pediu. Estou pronto para a prova da pedras."
G["I've done it!\n\nUsing sapphire from the chamber's adornments, I have fashioned a pair of goggles. With them, I am able to see things...Amazing things!\n\nWith luck, my next entry will find me a newly rich man!"]="I've done it!\n\nUsing sapphire from the chamber's adornments, I have fashioned a pair of goggles. With them, I am able to see things...Amazing things!\n\nWith luck, my next entry will find me a newly rich man!"
G["I've done it! I have harnessed the power of the stone into the goggles! Let's get out of here!"]="O e conseguido! E volcado o poder da pedras sobre as óculos! Vamos de aqui!"
G["I've done my time in the trenches, and spent many years training the pups. It's good to be home. No matter what has become of it, this is my home."]="Fiz meu tempo nas trincheiras e passei muitos anos treinando os filhotes. É bom estar em casa. Não importa o que aconteceu, esta é minha casa."
G["I've dreamed of being here today. This is it! This is going to be the day I win the tournament!"]="E sonhado que estava aqui hoje. Isso é! Hoje vai ser o dia em que gano o torneio!"
G["I've dreamed of roaming the halls of the titans for years. I never thought I'd be pitted against their creations."]="I've dreamed of roaming the halls of the titans for years. I never thought I'd be pitted against their creations."
G["I've dug my own grave..."]="E cavado meu própria tumba..."
G["I've encountered some of his underlings out in the field. They've been quite hostile."]="I've encountered some of his underlings out in the field. They've been quite hostile."
G["I've endured horrors you cannot possibly comprehend. Defeating you will be simple."]="Eu suportei horrores além da sua compreensão. Derrotar você será simples."
G["I've endured much hardship to complete my research and with your help, $n, I've finally done it. Here's to a brighter future!"]="I've endured much hardship to complete my research and with your help, $n, I've finally done it. Here's to a brighter future!"
G["I've faced the best that Stormwind has to offer, and still I stand."]="Me e confrontado ao melhor de Ventobravo, e ainda sigo em pé."
G["I've failed.  The Light has abandoned me."]="E fracassado. A Luz me abandonou."
G["I've failed... peace is impossible."]="E fracassado... a paz é possível."
G["I've figured out how this works. I'm taking control!"]="E averiguado como funciona. Tomo o controle!"
G["I've filled out all the paperwork for the auction house."]="I've filled out all the paperwork for the auction house."
G["I've filled out my paperwork for the bank."]="I've filled out my paperwork for the bank."
G["I've filled out my paperwork to enter the city."]="I've filled out my paperwork to enter the city."
G["I've finally caught up with you, Arthas."]="Ao fim te e alcançou, Arthas."
G["I've finally reached Lakeshire-- come one, come all, and take advantage of Antonio Perelli's wonderful deals."]="Finalmente e chegado a Vila do Lago. Venham, venham todos, e aproveitem as maravilhosas ofertas de Antonio Perelhi."
G["I've fought Virmen more clever than you."]="E lutado contra virmen mais prontos que você."
G["I've found a bone, look!"]="Encontrei um osso, olhe!"
G["I've found an incredible site!\n\nThe whole area pulsates with the hum of ancient architecture.\n\nIf it were not so late in the day, I would investigate the chamber immediately!\n\nSleeping, tonight, will be a struggle..."]="I've found an incredible site!\n\nThe whole area pulsates with the hum of ancient architecture.\n\nIf it were not so late in the day, I would investigate the chamber immediately!\n\nSleeping, tonight, will be a struggle..."
G["I've found it sometimes helps to change things up a bit."]="Eu descobri que às vezes é bom mudar as coisas um pouquinho."
G["I've found that when I throw something into this water, it has improved incredibly when I retrieve it."]="E descoberto que se arrojo algo à água melhoria de forma incrível quando o vuelvo a tirar."
G["I've found your precious sceptre. Hurry, take it!"]="I've found your precious sceptre. Hurry, take it!"
G["I've gathered them here for you, master."]="Te os e saído aqui, mestre."
G["I've given you the information, $r! You're wasting your time...."]="Te e dados a informações, $r! Está malgastando seu tempo..."
G["I've gone easy on you thus far, but now you bore me. Witness the magnificence of my power, and despair!"]="I've gone easy on you thus far, but now you bore me. Witness the magnificence of my power, and despair!"
G["I've gone too long without visiting the front, Gao-Ran. Your long efforts are appreciated."]="Há demais tempo que não visito o linha de frente, Gao-Ran. Agradeço seu grande esforço."
G["I've got Keg Protector marks to redeem..."]="I've got Keg Protector marks to redeem..."
G["I've got a LITTLE somethin' special for ya this time, folks! You aren't half the man of this half-man! $n vs. the vicious Wildhammer... SULLY KNEECAPPER!!!"]="Esta vez tenho uma PEQUENA surpresa para vocês, amigos! Não é a metade de homem que este meio-homem! $n contra o impiedoso SULLY CORTARRÓTULAS dos Martelo Feroz!!!"
G["I've got a bad feeling about this."]="Tenho um mal presentimento."
G["I've got a bad feeling about this.  If something happens to me, head back to Amberpine lodge and report to Lieutenant Dumont."]="Tenho um mal presentimento. Se me acontece algo, retorna ao Refúgio Pinho Âmbar e apresente ante o tenente Dumont."
G["I've got a bad feeling about this..."]="Isto me da mal espinha..."
G["I've got a game plan, kid!"]="Eu tenho um plano de jogo, garoto!"
G["I've got a great joke for you!"]="Me sei um chiste estupendo!"
G["I've got a hankerin' to do some fishin'!"]="Tenho ganha de pescar!"
G["I've got a history with fire elementals, you know. I consider myself somewhat of an expert on the subject."]="A verdade é que o meu com os elementais de fogo vem de antigo, sabe? Me considero uma espécie de perito no tema."
G["I've got a jade delivery for you."]="I've got a jade delivery for you."
G["I've got a lead on Norgannon's keystone, which guards access to Ulduar's archives, but the Titans divided it into two pieces and secreted them away.\n\nOne of the pieces, the keystone's shell, is held within the Inventor's Library on the northern coast, south of Ulduar itself. The first thing you'll need to do is retrieve the fragments of an access disk from the library's guardians."]="I've got a lead on Norgannon's keystone, which guards access to Ulduar's archives, but the Titans divided it into two pieces and secreted them away.\n\nOne of the pieces, the keystone's shell, is held within the Inventor's Library on the northern coast, south of Ulduar itself. The first thing you'll need to do is retrieve the fragments of an access disk from the library's guardians."
G["I've got a man! Now take a hike!"]="Tenho par! Agora pírate!"
G["I've got a new jade shipment for you."]="Tenho um novo carregamento de jade para você."
G["I've got a nice lead, yet. Think I'll do some fishin'."]="I've got a nice lead, yet. Think I'll do some fishin'."
G["I've got a preliminary report about the gravimetric disruptions."]="Tenho um relatório preliminar sobre as perturbações gravimétricas."
G["I've got a present for ye! Here, let me just get it out of my gun..."]="Tenho um regalito para você! Tome, espera que o saque de meu arma..."
G["I've got a proposition for you: You die now."]="I've got a proposition for you: You die now."
G["I've got a pulse!"]="Tenho pulso!"
G["I've got a ride to Irontree Clearing waiting for me on behalf of Fez Hobnob."]="I've got a ride to Irontree Clearing waiting for me on behalf of Fez Hobnob."
G["I've got a special mix for you!"]="Tenho uma mistura especial para você!"
G["I've got agents on every continent in the world and none of them can give me a clear picture of what happened in Orgrimmar!"]="I've got agents on every continent in the world and none of them can give me a clear picture of what happened in Orgrimmar!"
G["I've got all the cooking supplies you'll ever need, mon!"]="Eu tenho tudo o materiais de cozinha que você vai precisar, mon!"
G["I've got all this fruit here. Could you brew up some hooch for me?"]="I've got all this fruit here. Could you brew up some hooch for me?"
G["I've got an idea troll.  How about you tell me about Drak'Tharon, then I let old Ironhide have a snack?"]="I've got an idea troll.  How about you tell me about Drak'Tharon, then I let old Ironhide have a snack?"
G["I've got an idea, Bailey..."]="Bailey, tenho uma ideia..."
G["I've got at least fifteen people waiting in line ahead of you. Hard to tell - it's a little busy in here right now."]="I've got at least fifteen people waiting in line ahead of you. Hard to tell - it's a little busy in here right now."
G["I've got backup. Watch this."]="Traigo reforços. Olhe isto."
G["I've got five kids, $g man:lady;! They'll die without me!"]="I've got five kids, $g man:lady;! They'll die without me!"
G["I've got fresh meat, fish and mushrooms.  And plenty to drink!"]="Eu tenho carne fresca, peixe e cogumelos. E muito para beber!"
G["I've got it this time!"]="Esta vez já o tenho!"
G["I've got it: Squeezeable rocks!"]="I've got it: Squeezeable rocks!"
G["I've got its attention! Give it everything you've got!"]="Eu o distraigo! Ataca com todas seus forças!"
G["I've got just the thing!"]="Tenho logo o que precisamos de!"
G["I've got most of the basic carving done, but it needs to be tested before I can continue. Are you willing to help me with that, $n?"]="I've got most of the basic carving done, but it needs to be tested before I can continue. Are you willing to help me with that, $n?"
G["I've got muffins right over here.  Come on over!"]="I've got muffins right over here.  Come on over!"
G["I've got my eye on you, $n. Let's just say that only one of us will be leaving this island, and that goblin's name begins with Trade Prince!"]="$n, Não te quito o olho de acima. Somente um dos nós saldrá desta ilha, e seu nome começa por Príncipe mercante!"
G["I've got my eye on you, $r."]="Não te quito o olho de acima, $r."
G["I've got my eye on you, Faranell."]="Tenho o olho posto em ti, Faranelh."
G["I've got my hands full around here, but The Heartland is prospering."]="I've got my hands full around here, but The Heartland is prospering."
G["I've got my hands full here at the moment, $c.\n\nWhat can I do for you?"]="Agora mesmo estou muito ocupado, $c.\n\nO que posso fazer por você?"
G["I've got plenty of cured bacon, but he had some for breakfast."]="I've got plenty of cured bacon, but he had some for breakfast."
G["I've got plenty of great recipes for you to take a look at, and at discounted prices, too!"]="Eu tenho muitas ótimas receitas para você dar uma olhada e a preços com desconto também!"
G["I've got some secrets of my own, rogue."]="Tenho meus segredos, ladino."
G["I've got the best heals, anywhere!"]="Não encontrar sanações melhores em nenhuma parte!"
G["I've got the brains, you've got the muscle. Together, we'll make beautiful carnage."]="I've got the brains, you've got the muscle. Together, we'll make beautiful carnage."
G["I've got the proper amounts of mud and hide, but not enough thread to hold it together."]="I've got the proper amounts of mud and hide, but not enough thread to hold it together."
G["I've got to get back to work!"]="Tenho que voltar ao trabalho!"
G["I've got to get this to Ratchet and nothing's going to stop me!"]="I've got to get this to Ratchet and nothing's going to stop me!"
G["I've got to keep the arcane wards charged."]="Eu tenho que manter as custódias misteriosas carregadas."
G["I've got to quit smoking! Give me a minute to catch my breath."]="Tenho que deixar de fumar! Preciso um momento para pegar ar..."
G["I've got too much to do and not enough time to do it in, $r! Please, get out of my way."]="Tenho muito que fazer e pouco tempo para fazer isso, $r! Por favor, apártate de meu caminho."
G["I've got too much to do and not enough time to do it in, $r! Please, get out of my way.\n\nIf you're infected with the maggot slime or ghoul rot, I might be able to help you."]="Tenho muito que fazer e pouco tempo para fazer isso, $r! Por favor, apártate de meu caminho.\n\nSe você contagiado com babar de me ver ou a putrefacção dos necrófagos, talvez possa ajudar você."
G["I've got what you need!"]="Tenho o que precisa!"
G["I've got you. That was close!"]="Te tenho! pelos pelos."
G["I've got you..."]="I've got you..."
G["I've got your back, $n."]="Te cubro, $n."
G["I've got your back, $p."]="Te cubro as costas, $p."
G["I've got your jade right here."]="Aqui está seu jade."
G["I've grown quite interested in mogu culture and history. I would call it a bit more than a passing hobby."]="Me interesse muito a cultura e a história dos mogu. Se transformou em algo mais que em uma afição para mim."
G["I've grown used to cleaning up your messes."]="I've grown used to cleaning up your messes."
G["I've had about enough of this aleless inbreed!"]="Já e tido suficiente de estes endogámicos sem cerveja!"
G["I've had better."]="Os e testado melhores."
G["I've had enough of this jungle!"]="I've had enough of this jungle!"
G["I've had enough of this!"]="Já e tido suficiente!"
G["I've had enough of this!  Time to take a break..."]="Já e' suficiente! Hora de toma'se um descanso..."
G["I've had it! Find someone else to guard your precious turd filled base!"]="I've had it! Find someone else to guard your precious turd filled base!"
G["I've had just about enough of your incessant whining, captain. What are you even a captain of? I mean, the nerve!"]="I've had just about enough of your incessant whining, captain. What are you even a captain of? I mean, the nerve!"
G["I've had my fill of this place. Let us depart."]="I've had my fill of this place. Let us depart."
G["I've had quite enough of this place. Goodbye."]="Já me e cansado deste lugar. Adeus."
G["I've had tougher craps."]="I've had tougher craps."
G["I've half a mind to cut you both down where you stand! The other half isn't arguing!"]="I've half a mind to cut you both down where you stand! The other half isn't arguing!"
G["I've heard about enough a' yer snivelin'! Shut yer flytrap before I shut it for ye'!"]="I've heard about enough a' yer snivelin'! Shut yer flytrap before I shut it for ye'!"
G["I've heard about this Nesingwary guy, out of Stranglethorn Vale, hunting all sorts of beasts for sport.\n\nFor SPORT. What a complete idiot, right? Think of all the profit he's letting rot in the field!"]="I've heard about this Nesingwary guy, out of Stranglethorn Vale, hunting all sorts of beasts for sport.\n\nFor SPORT. What a complete idiot, right? Think of all the profit he's letting rot in the field!"
G["I've heard from the other trainees that you can find rare onyx eggs at Windward Isle. I've looked and looked, but I haven't found any yet!"]="I've heard from the other trainees that you can find rare onyx eggs at Windward Isle. I've looked and looked, but I haven't found any yet!"
G["I've heard it said that Deneb Walker, holed up in Stromgarde, has a book that is sure to help improve your First Aid techniques."]="Ouvi dizer que Deneb Walker, escondido em Stromgarde, tem um livro que certamente ajudará a melhorar suas técnicas de primeiros socorros."
G["I've heard much about you, $n.  The world needs people like you now more than ever."]="Ouvi falar muito de ti, $n. O mundo precisa gente como você, agora mais do que nunca."
G["I've heard nothing but tales of how peaceful and beautiful this vale was, far before any of us were ever allowed in. Now that we're here, there's all manner of beasty trying to smash our head or bite off our feet.\n\nSo are the tales a lie, or are we just horrid company? I humbly exclude myself from the latter possibility, because to consider such would be silly."]="I've heard nothing but tales of how peaceful and beautiful this vale was, far before any of us were ever allowed in. Now that we're here, there's all manner of beasty trying to smash our head or bite off our feet.\n\nSo are the tales a lie, or are we just horrid company? I humbly exclude myself from the latter possibility, because to consider such would be silly."
G["I've heard of mice trapped in ale bottles before, but never in bread.  P-p-please take everything and don't speak of this to anyone."]="I've heard of mice trapped in ale bottles before, but never in bread.  P-p-please take everything and don't speak of this to anyone."
G["I've heard of you, $n.  Are you here to help us?"]="Ouvi falar de ti, $n. Tem vindo a nos ajudar?"
G["I've heard some people got outrageous fortunes."]="Ouvi que algumas pessoas têm um destino atroz."
G["I've heard something of your exploits, $n.  I know that while you're here in Forsaken lands that you'll comport yourself with dignity and as a true hero of the sin'dorei!"]="Ouvi falar dos seus façanhas, $n. Sei que, enquanto estiver em terras dos Renegados te comportarás com dignidade e como um autêntico herói dos sem'dorei."
G["I've heard stories about the legendary pandaren and their exotic fighting styles. Now I want to see them."]="I've heard stories about the legendary pandaren and their exotic fighting styles. Now I want to see them."
G["I've heard tales of this one: Subetai the Swift, well known as a masterful archer and genius thief. He stole from the rich, and kept everything for himself."]="I've heard tales of this one: Subetai the Swift, well known as a masterful archer and genius thief. He stole from the rich, and kept everything for himself."
G["I've heard tell of a truly skilled smith across the sea named Saru Steelfury. The smithy in Orgrimmar is where you should head if you wish to ply your trade, $c. Best of luck."]="I've heard tell of a truly skilled smith across the sea named Saru Steelfury. The smithy in Orgrimmar is where you should head if you wish to ply your trade, $c. Best of luck."
G["I've heard that gnomes can grant wishes..."]="I've heard that gnomes can grant wishes..."
G["I've heard that the azure dragonshrine is being invested with the direct power of a ley line. I will defend the temple as best I can."]="I've heard that the azure dragonshrine is being invested with the direct power of a ley line. I will defend the temple as best I can."
G["I've heard that the last of the preparations are being shipped over to Silithus and should arrive in under a day. I don't want to see one of those bugs burrowing through into my mine, so I hope that someone is taking the time to assemble that Scepter of the Shifting Sands so the gong can be rung, the gates opened and the war finally begun."]="I've heard that the last of the preparations are being shipped over to Silithus and should arrive in under a day. I don't want to see one of those bugs burrowing through into my mine, so I hope that someone is taking the time to assemble that Scepter of the Shifting Sands so the gong can be rung, the gates opened and the war finally begun."
G["I've heard that the preparations are being shipped over to Silithus and should all arrive in under $2113w days. I don't want to see one of those bugs burrowing through into my mine, so I hope that someone is taking the time to assemble that Scepter of the Shifting Sands so the gong can be rung, the gates opened and the war finally begun."]="I've heard that the preparations are being shipped over to Silithus and should all arrive in under $2113w days. I don't want to see one of those bugs burrowing through into my mine, so I hope that someone is taking the time to assemble that Scepter of the Shifting Sands so the gong can be rung, the gates opened and the war finally begun."
G["I've heard that there's a dwarf in Stormwind who has achieved some fame for his hunting skill.  Maybe you should go see if he could help you."]="Ouvi dizer que há um anão em Ventobravo que alcançou alguma fama pela sua habilidade de caça. Talvez você devesse ver se ele poderia ajudá-o."
G["I've heard that vrykul women cannot fight at all. If you wish to prove me wrong, you can try."]="Ouvi dizer que as mulheres vrykul não podem lutar. Se você quiser me provar que está errado, pode tentar."
G["I've heard there's a pair of Wildhammer shamans visiting the Dwarven District, so you might try your luck there.\n\nThe draenei Farseer who used to lounge about the Valley of Heroes went off to meet them, too."]="I've heard there's a pair of Wildhammer shamans visiting the Dwarven District, so you might try your luck there.\n\nThe draenei Farseer who used to lounge about the Valley of Heroes went off to meet them, too."
G["I've heard this one. Tell me another..."]="Este já me o sei. Conte-me outro..."
G["I've heard whisperings of intruders.  Be wary."]="Ouvi sussurros de intrusos. Tenha cuidado."
G["I've heard your name spoken only in whispers, mage.  Who are you?"]="Eu ouvi o seu nome falado apenas em sussurros, mago. Quem é Você?"
G["I've hidden from my destiny long enough.  What I must do has never been clearer.\n\nLoken must be destroyed by my hand."]="I've hidden from my destiny long enough.  What I must do has never been clearer.\n\nLoken must be destroyed by my hand."
G["I've known nothing but Gilneas for a very long time.  I'd feared we'd not find a place we could call home again anytime soon."]="I've known nothing but Gilneas for a very long time.  I'd feared we'd not find a place we could call home again anytime soon."
G["I've learned a great deal already just by watching you in action. You fight with the fervor of youth but the experience of an old veteran. You've seen a lifetime of warfare, haven't you?"]="I've learned a great deal already just by watching you in action. You fight with the fervor of youth but the experience of an old veteran. You've seen a lifetime of warfare, haven't you?"
G["I've learned so much about brewing. I haven't gotten my brew just right yet, but it's getting there!"]="I've learned so much about brewing. I haven't gotten my brew just right yet, but it's getting there!"
G["I've little more than a cursory knowledge of magical artifacts, and the blue flight has enough troubles of its own.\n\nThere was a book in the library about the blades we forged for our mortal allies, but I'm afraid I've already loaned it to a representative of the Silver Covenant. You're not the first person to come asking after information on those ancient swords, $n."]="I've little more than a cursory knowledge of magical artifacts, and the blue flight has enough troubles of its own.\n\nThere was a book in the library about the blades we forged for our mortal allies, but I'm afraid I've already loaned it to a representative of the Silver Covenant. You're not the first person to come asking after information on those ancient swords, $n."
G["I've little more than a cursory knowledge of magical artifacts, and the blue flight has enough troubles of its own.\n\nThere was a book in the library about the blades we forged for our mortal allies, but I'm afraid I've already loaned it to a representative of the Sunreavers. You're not the first person to come asking after information on those ancient swords, $n."]="I've little more than a cursory knowledge of magical artifacts, and the blue flight has enough troubles of its own.\n\nThere was a book in the library about the blades we forged for our mortal allies, but I'm afraid I've already loaned it to a representative of the Sunreavers. You're not the first person to come asking after information on those ancient swords, $n."
G["I've little time for talk, sorry."]="Tenho pouco tempo para conversar, desculpe."
G["I've lived here and kept this shrine with the blessing of the Alexstrasza for longer than I can remember.  In its darkest hour, I've failed... I fell at the feet of that damned death knight...  Bloodbane."]="I've lived here and kept this shrine with the blessing of the Alexstrasza for longer than I can remember.  In its darkest hour, I've failed... I fell at the feet of that damned death knight...  Bloodbane."
G["I've longed for a good adventure!"]="I've longed for a good adventure!"
G["I've lost Archmage Vargoth's Staff. Can you replace it?"]="Perdi o cajado do arquimago Vargoth. Você pode substituí-o?"
G["I've lost Miniwing."]="Perdi o Miniwing."
G["I've lost Nass..."]="Perdi o Nass..."
G["I've lost The Eye of Haramad."]="Eu perdi o olho de Haramad."
