G["I've lost my Violet Signet and seek a replacement."]="E perdido meu selo Violeta e busco outro."
G["I've lost my Zandalar Madcap's Tunic and require a new one, Falthir."]="I've lost my Zandalar Madcap's Tunic and require a new one, Falthir."
G["I've lost my balloon."]="E perdido meu globo."
G["I've lost my ensorcelled choker!"]="Eu perdi minha gargantilha ensorcelled!"
G["I've lost my key to Karazhan."]="Perdi minha chave para Karazhan."
G["I've lost my key to Scholomance."]="Perdi minha chave para Scholomance."
G["I've lost my key to Searing Gorge."]="Perdi minha chave para Searing Gorge."
