G["I've lost my panther cub."]="E perdido meu filhote de panteras."
G["I've lost my sprite darter hatchling."]="Perdi meu filhote de sprite mais escuro."
G["I've lost my totemic beacon - may I have another?"]="I've lost my totemic beacon - may I have another?"
G["I've lost my wolpertinger."]="Eu perdi meu wolpertinger."
G["I've lost my worg pup."]="Eu perdi meu filhote de worg."
G["I've lost the cure, Doc! Tell me you got more!!!"]="I've lost the cure, Doc! Tell me you got more!!!"
G["I've lost the key to the Shattered Halls."]="E perdido a chave das Salões Despedaçados."
G["I've lost the sparrowhawk whistle you gave me. Can you replace it?"]="I've lost the sparrowhawk whistle you gave me. Can you replace it?"
G["I've lost track of how long we've been walking now."]="Já e perdido a conta de quanto temos andado."
G["I've made a mental note, mogu are light sleepers.  Pass the word."]="Me apunté uma nota mental: os mogu têm o sonho leve. Pásalo."
G["I've made a portal to Orgrimmar. Who wants to kick some Horde butt?"]="E aberto um portal a Orgrimmar. Quem quer dar uma surra à Horda?"
G["I've made it a point not to argue with a dwarf when it comes to the earth.  If the Bronzebeards are sure this tablet will help solve the earth's problems, then by all means we should support them."]="I've made it a point not to argue with a dwarf when it comes to the earth.  If the Bronzebeards are sure this tablet will help solve the earth's problems, then by all means we should support them."
G["I've made no mistakes."]="Eu não cometi erros."
G["I've made up my mind.  Make me forget my alchemy mastery!"]="Tomei uma decisão. Faça-me esquecer meu domínio da alquimia!"
G["I've made up my mind.  Make me forget my tailoring specialty!"]="I've made up my mind.  Make me forget my tailoring specialty!"
G["I've managed to work myself into quite a spot here. Far Seer Regulkut tried to warn me, but my carelessness has finally caught up with me.\n\nI came down here to study the ruins of Zeth'Gor, but ran afoul of the Legion on my way. Now, all I have to show for it is a nasty gash on my leg."]="I've managed to work myself into quite a spot here. Far Seer Regulkut tried to warn me, but my carelessness has finally caught up with me.\n\nI came down here to study the ruins of Zeth'Gor, but ran afoul of the Legion on my way. Now, all I have to show for it is a nasty gash on my leg."
G["I've mastered catching fish, now on to catching yaungol!"]="Já domino a pesca, assim que a pescar yaungol!"
G["I've met cabin boys who were manlier than you. To think I ever wasted my time..."]="I've met cabin boys who were manlier than you. To think I ever wasted my time..."
G["I've misplaced my Zandalar Haruspex's Bracers and require another pair."]="Não sei onde e posto meus braçadeiras de harúspice Zandalariano pelo que preciso um par novo."
G["I've misplaced the Brazier of Beckoning!"]="Eu extraviei o Braseiro de Beckoning!"
G["I've never been fascinated by ancient artifacts, but this mission has proven more dangerous than I thought."]="Os artefatos antigos nunca me têm fascinado, mas esta missão mostrou ser mais perigosa do que achava."
G["I've never been more proud ta be a Darkspear. Vol'jin leads us ta glory."]="Nunca me senti tão orgulhosa por ser uma Lança Sombria. Vol'jin nos leva à glória."
G["I've never been more ready."]="Nunca tenho estado mais pronto."
G["I've never been so happy! I wish this night would never end!"]="Nunca e banido tão feliz! Tomara esta noite não se acabara mais!"
G["I've never experienced cold like this, $r. Even in the absence of ice and snow, the frozen wastes of Northrend are extremely taxing."]="I've never experienced cold like this, $r. Even in the absence of ice and snow, the frozen wastes of Northrend are extremely taxing."
G["I've never felt better! Thank you!"]="Nunca me havia sentido melhor! Obrigado!"
G["I've never fought much, but this is exciting!"]="Apenas e lutado na vida, mas estou emocionado!"
G["I've never had such excellent noodle soup before. What's the secret?"]="Nunca havia testado uma sopa de macarrão tão maravilhosa. Qual é o segredo?"
G["I've never heard of a tikbalang in my life. In fact, the Scryers tell me they can't find a single mention of one in their libraries..."]="I've never heard of a tikbalang in my life. In fact, the Scryers tell me they can't find a single mention of one in their libraries..."
G["I've never heard of mogu gathering in such large numbers before."]="Nunca havia ouvido falar de congregações tão grandes de mogu."
G["I've never performed this ritual. I don't know what will happen, exactly."]="Nunca e realizado este ritual. Não sei que é o que vai passar a ciência certa."
G["I've never seen a $c like $g him : her; before. $G He's : She's; already beaten the yaungol!"]="Nunca antes havia visto tamanha $c. Já derrotou aos yaungol!"
G["I've never seen a finer $c than $n, and neither have you!"]="I've never seen a finer $c than $n, and neither have you!"
G["I've never seen a flying tree before. Let's get closer!"]="Nunca havia visto um árvore voador. Acerquémonos!"
G["I've never seen a gnome clean house like that, kid. I could use someone like you to take care of the rest of those pirates, permanently."]="I've never seen a gnome clean house like that, kid. I could use someone like you to take care of the rest of those pirates, permanently."
G["I've never seen anyone fight like that before! You were incredible."]="Nunca havia visto a ninguém lutar como você! Tem estado incrível."
G["I've never seen anyone get a vision from these waters so easily.\n\nThen again, I can't remember the last time a jinyu came to visit us and then stuck his face in the water..."]="I've never seen anyone get a vision from these waters so easily.\n\nThen again, I can't remember the last time a jinyu came to visit us and then stuck his face in the water..."
G["I've never seen anything like it. No concentration or loss of awareness while the subject is dominated. What did you do to her?"]="I've never seen anything like it. No concentration or loss of awareness while the subject is dominated. What did you do to her?"
G["I've never seen anything like the water here. It speaks, but I know not what it says."]="Nunca havia visto água como a desta ilha. Fala, mas não entendo o que diz."
G["I've never seen anything like these nether dragons. They seem to have inherited their sire's temperment, but they have become something entirely different."]="Eu nunca vi nada como esses dragões inferiores. Eles parecem ter herdado o temperamento do seu para, mas se tornaram algo completamente diferente."
G["I've never seen anything like this before. I'm glad that you're here."]="Nunca havia visto algo assim. fico feliz em que estiver aqui."
G["I've never seen anything like this."]="Nunca havia visto nada igual."
G["I've never seen anything quite like this!  I think I'll be healing a lot of pets after the tournament is over."]="Nunca havia visto nada igual! Acho que terei que curar a muitos ajudantes quando acabe o torneio..."
G["I've never seen destruction like this..."]="Mais havia visto tanta destruição..."
G["I've never seen one of you around here."]="Nunca vi a nenhum de vocês por aqui."
G["I've never seen one this size before! I can't wait to send it back for research..."]="I've never seen one this size before! I can't wait to send it back for research..."
G["I've never seen roots like this before!"]="Nunca havia visto raízes como essas!"
G["I've never seen so many different kinds of mushrooms in one place. Given enough time, I'm sure I could find a use for all of them."]="Eu nunca vi tantos tipos diferentes de cogumelos em um só lugar. Com tempo suficiente, tenho certeza de que poderia encontrar um uso para todos eles."
G["I've never seen something like this before! Look at the extension of the jawbone..."]="Não havia visto nunca algo tamanha! Olhe a extensão da mandíbula..."
G["I've never seen something so beautiful in all my life!"]="Nunca vi algo tão lindo em toda minha vida!"
G["I've never seen them in such numbers..."]="Nunca vi tantos..."
G["I've never seen you so eager to cause harm to someone, sister.  Such a pleasant development... very well, go!"]="I've never seen you so eager to cause harm to someone, sister.  Such a pleasant development... very well, go!"
G["I've never understood your type. The hero..."]="Nunca entendí aos tipos como você. O herói..."
G["I've never witnessed such heroics and selflessness."]="I've never witnessed such heroics and selflessness."
G["I've never worked a day in my life. That's just one of the many benefits of being nocturnal!"]="Não e trabalhado nem um somente dia na minha vida. É uma das vantagems de ser noturno."
G["I've never worked this hard before in my life! I don't like it!"]="Nunca na vida havia trabalhado tanto! Não me gosta!"
G["I've no love for Garrosh, dat much is sure, but leavin' tha Horde is not a decision I be takin' lightly."]="Não me guh’ta Garrosh, isso é certo, mas deixar a Horda não é uma decisão que vá a tome' à leve."
G["I've no need to fight you, for it appears I've already won.  You cannot stop our attack on Darkshore and save Hyjal at the same time!"]="Não preciso lutar contra ti, porque acho que já e ganhou. Você não pode parar nosso ataque contra a Costa Sombria e superando Hyjal ao mesmo tempo!"
G["I've not seen a more well-trained group of soldiers in all my years."]="Não vi a um grupo de soldados melhor entrenados em toda minha vida."
G["I've not seen finer armor made in many years $n. Not since I trained under Grumnus Steelshaper in the Great Forge. I bet he could teach ye things about makin armor that would spark yer interest."]="I've not seen finer armor made in many years $n. Not since I trained under Grumnus Steelshaper in the Great Forge. I bet he could teach ye things about makin armor that would spark yer interest."
G["I've not spoken with the strangers, but I bore witness to their champion treading deep into the Crumbling Depths and returning unscathed.  It is clearly capable."]="I've not spoken with the strangers, but I bore witness to their champion treading deep into the Crumbling Depths and returning unscathed.  It is clearly capable."
G["I've nothing for the likes of you, Cailan. For the last time, get out of this shop."]="I've nothing for the likes of you, Cailan. For the last time, get out of this shop."
G["I've only done this once before... Hopefully this works."]="Somente fiz isto uma vez antes... Espero que funcione."
G["I've only spent a day with you, and we've already seen this entire valley."]="Somente levo um dia com você e já temos visto tudo este vale."
G["I've opened a portal to Stormwind.  Get in there and kick some butt!"]="I've opened a portal to Stormwind.  Get in there and kick some butt!"
G["I've overcharged the anvils. They will be VERY effective against the sha, but each one can only be used once more!"]="I've overcharged the anvils. They will be VERY effective against the sha, but each one can only be used once more!"
G["I've picked up Walden's foul scent. Fill the air with his blood!"]="I've picked up Walden's foul scent. Fill the air with his blood!"
G["I've played my part in destroying entire civilizations... to have to lower myself to dealing with the wretched Cult of the Damned disgusts me."]="Eu desempenhei meu papel na destruição de civilizações inteiras... ter que me abaixar para lidar com o miserável Culto dos Condenados."
G["I've punched it, kicked it, smacked it, thwacked it. Nothing seems to break this oubliette."]="I've punched it, kicked it, smacked it, thwacked it. Nothing seems to break this oubliette."
G["I've purged the Horde from Dalaran. You have what you wanted, Your Majesty: The Kirin Tor belongs to the Alliance."]="Eu expulsei a Horda de Dalaran. Você conseguiu o que queria, Majestade: o Kirin Tor pertence à Aliança."
G["I've put my son, Ang, in charge of my vegetable farm, just down the hill. My nephew Liang runs the pig farm down to the west, and his father - my brother - maintains a small sheep ranch to the south of that.\n\nMy farming days are over. These days, I just gather the harvested crops and sell them to folks headed down this road. Less time on my feet, more money in my pocket."]="I've put my son, Ang, in charge of my vegetable farm, just down the hill. My nephew Liang runs the pig farm down to the west, and his father - my brother - maintains a small sheep ranch to the south of that.\n\nMy farming days are over. These days, I just gather the harvested crops and sell them to folks headed down this road. Less time on my feet, more money in my pocket."
G["I've reached my supply needs for now."]="Por agora, e conseguido meus suprimentos."
G["I've rearranged the reply code - your planet will be spared. I cannot be certain of my own calculations anymore."]="E reestablecido o código de resposta: seu planeta se salvará. Já não posso estar certo de meus próprios cálculos."
G["I've received word from my brother Brann in Northrend.  In his exploring of Ulduar he came across some unusual tablets... something ancient."]="I've received word from my brother Brann in Northrend.  In his exploring of Ulduar he came across some unusual tablets... something ancient."
G["I've reconsidered... it's too dangerous to stay here. No piece of land is worth losing your life over. Let me see those evacuation orders."]="I've reconsidered... it's too dangerous to stay here. No piece of land is worth losing your life over. Let me see those evacuation orders."
G["I've recovered the second relic. Take a moment to rest, and then we'll continue to the last reliquary."]="E recuperei a segunda requilia. Descansar um momento e depois seguiremos com o último relicário."
G["I've researched this site extensively and I won't allow any dim-witted treasure hunters to swoop in and steal what belongs in a museum. I'll lead this charge."]="I've researched this site extensively and I won't allow any dim-witted treasure hunters to swoop in and steal what belongs in a museum. I'll lead this charge."
G["I've returned only to end this, Taerar. This land will finally have peace."]="I've returned only to end this, Taerar. This land will finally have peace."
G["I've returned to invite you to my housewarming in the underworld!"]="I've returned to invite you to my housewarming in the underworld!"
G["I've rigged a few control consoles down the slope. Get to one quickly and take control of the fel reaver! You'll only have a limited amount of time."]="E manipulado umas quantas consolas de controle pela pendente. Tome uma rapidamente e controla ao assaltante vil! Terá um limite de tempo."
G["I've run out of arrows! I'm afraid if any more come you will need to take them on by yourself my friend."]="I've run out of arrows! I'm afraid if any more come you will need to take them on by yourself my friend."
G["I've seen a lot of things in my time, but the change that came over the Explorers' League in the Whisper Gulch takes the cake.\n\nI'm just glad that I got out of there with my skin intact!"]="I've seen a lot of things in my time, but the change that came over the Explorers' League in the Whisper Gulch takes the cake.\n\nI'm just glad that I got out of there with my skin intact!"
G["I've seen a single Guardian Demon slaughter a hundred elves.  Tread lightly."]="I've seen a single Guardian Demon slaughter a hundred elves.  Tread lightly."
G["I've seen a troll named Lau'Tiki fishing down south at the Darkspear Strand.  That's just on the outskirts of Sen'jin Village."]="Eu vi um troll chamado Lau'Tiki pescando no sul da Darkspear Strand. Fica nos arredores da vila de Sen'jin."
G["I've seen cats that are better guards than you!"]="vi gatos fazer de guarda melhor que você!"
G["I've seen enough of this cave for a lifetime. I can't wait to get back to Kharanos."]="Eu já vi o suficiente desta caverna por toda a vida. Mal posso esperar para voltar para Kharanos."
G["I've seen enough. If I were you, I'd get to the temple and pray that you shoot straighter when it counts!"]="I've seen enough. If I were you, I'd get to the temple and pray that you shoot straighter when it counts!"
G["I've seen farmers with staves hold off trained soldiers. Do not ever underestimate the power and skill it takes to wield one of these properly."]="I've seen farmers with staves hold off trained soldiers. Do not ever underestimate the power and skill it takes to wield one of these properly."
G["I've seen female Gnomes hit harder than you!"]="I've seen female Gnomes hit harder than you!"
G["I've seen forks stronger than this. Forge it again!"]="I've seen forks stronger than this. Forge it again!"
G["I've seen gnomes work harder than you, peon! Little girl gnomes - with pig tails! MOVE IT, MOVE IT, MOVE IT!"]="I've seen gnomes work harder than you, peon! Little girl gnomes - with pig tails! MOVE IT, MOVE IT, MOVE IT!"
G["I've seen goblins riding these things. I know they can go faster!"]="I've seen goblins riding these things. I know they can go faster!"
G["I've seen it before - in Nagrand when he refused to lay down his mantle of Warchief, and again during his training."]="A vi antes... Em Nagrand quando se negó a renunciar ao seu autoridade como Chefe de Guerra e, outra vez, durante seu treinamento."
G["I've seen more worthy challenges in the Ring of Blood. You waste our time, paladin."]="vi retos mais dignos no Círculo de Sangue. Malgastas nosso tempo, paladino."
G["I've seen terrible things happen to the furbolg over the last few years--they were victims on many fronts. But it's unclear to me what's become of this tribe. Are they corrupted by the same plague that's touched Felwood? Or perhaps they are simply angry at what's happened to their once peaceful people and now seek to defend themselves. Either way, most of them appear hostile to those who come into the area."]="Vi coisas terríveis acontecerem no furbolg nos últimos anos - elas foram vítimas em muitas frentes. Mas não está claro para mim o que aconteceu com essa tribo. Eles estão corrompidos pela mesma praga que atingiu Felwood? Ou talvez estejam simplesmente zangados com o que aconteceu com o seu povo outrora pacífico e agora busquem se defender. De qualquer maneira, a maioria deles parece hostil para quem entra na área."
G["I've seen what our goblin friend can do. These dwarves are in for a nasty surprise!"]="vi o que é capaz de fazer nosso amigo goblin. A estes anões lhes espera uma desagradable surpresa!"
G["I've seen you fight better den dat, Lana! You can gettem next time! Tark, get in there and giv'em hell!"]="I've seen you fight better den dat, Lana! You can gettem next time! Tark, get in there and giv'em hell!"
G["I've seen you prancing around.  Why don't you do us all a favor and just drop your gear off at the armory?"]="Eu vi você pulando por aí. Por que você não faz um favor a todos nós e deixa seu equipamento no arsenal?"
G["I've selected a landing site on the island: high ground that's easily defended."]="E escolhido um ponto de desembarco na ilha: terreno elevado, fácil de defenda."
G["I've sent my men forward on the rooftops to secure the area around Lord Walden."]="I've sent my men forward on the rooftops to secure the area around Lord Walden."
G["I've seriously underestimated your prowess."]="Subestimei seriamente sua perícia."
G["I've set the Bootzooka to fire several rockets per shot. I'm fairly certain that I perfectly calibrated the targeting."]="I've set the Bootzooka to fire several rockets per shot. I'm fairly certain that I perfectly calibrated the targeting."
G["I've sharpened my claws just for this moment."]="E afiado meus garras logo para este momentos."
G["I've shattered the shield protecting their leader! Quickly, kill him!"]="E destruído o escudo que proteger ao seu líder! Rápido, mátalo!"
G["I've spent enough time with clumsy XX here that I've picked up a thing or two about treating injuries.  Perhaps I can pass some of that along to you?"]="Levo tanto tempo ao lado de XX que aprendi um par de truques sobre o tratamento das feridas. Igual posso ensinar algum."
G["I've spent far too long in that town.  It's a wonderful place, and I enjoyed my service there, but I think I'd prefer to stay here."]="Passei muito tempo nessa cidade. É um lugar maravilhoso, e eu gostei do meu serviço lá, mas acho que prefiro ficar aqui."
G["I've still got a few moves left up my sleeve!"]="Tenho um as na manga!"
G["I've still got plenty of tricks up my sleeve!"]="Eu ainda tenho muitos truques na manga!"
G["I've stood with some of you draenei before at Skettis, and others in Shadowmoon Valley. But now we're on Azeroth, and the situation looks grim."]="Draeneis, tenho estado com algum de vocês antes em Skettis e com outros no Vale da Lua Negra. Mas agora estamos em Azeroth e a situação parece complicada."
G["I've tarried too long here. I must get back to The Shadow Vault. Farewell."]="E passado aqui demais tempo. Devo voltar à Câmera das Sombras. Até depois."
G["I've trained as an alchemist once again.  I wish to specialize in elixirs."]="Treinei como alquimista mais uma vez. Desejo me especializar em elixires."
G["I've trained as an alchemist once again.  I wish to specialize in potions."]="Treinei como alquimista mais uma vez. Desejo me especializar em poções."
G["I've trained as an alchemist once again.  I wish to specialize in transmutations."]="Treinei como alquimista mais uma vez. Desejo me especializar em transmutações."
G["I've trained for this moment for years!"]="Me tenho estado treinando para isto durante anos!"
G["I've treated peasants, nobles, merchants' sons and beggars.  Allow me to share one piece of wisdom with you - we're all the same when staring death in the face."]="Tratei camponeses, nobres, filhos de comerciantes e mendigos. Permita-me compartilhar um pedaço de sabedoria com você - somos todos iguais quando encaramos a morte de linha de frente."
G["I've tried everythin' short of a righteous beating to get these dwarves up off their lazy duffs.\n\nAre you made of sterner stuff?"]="I've tried everythin' short of a righteous beating to get these dwarves up off their lazy duffs.\n\nAre you made of sterner stuff?"
G["I've tried explaining to Salsbury time and time again that there is no possible way that I could transform him into a worgen. He refuses to listen and has instead convinced himself that if he gains my trust I will let him in on the secret.\n\nGnomes are very strange."]="I've tried explaining to Salsbury time and time again that there is no possible way that I could transform him into a worgen. He refuses to listen and has instead convinced himself that if he gains my trust I will let him in on the secret.\n\nGnomes are very strange."
G["I've waited a long time for this, Thrall. For every time I was thrown into one of your damned arenas... for every time I killed a green-skinned aberration like you... I could think of only one thing."]="tenho estado esperando isto muito tempo, Thrall. Sempre que estava em uma das seus malditas arenas… sempre que mataba a uma aberração de pele verde como você… somente achava em uma coisa."
G["I've waited for this moment for years.  Illidan and his lapdogs will be destroyed!"]="I've waited for this moment for years.  Illidan and his lapdogs will be destroyed!"
G["I've waited here for too long.  Time to say goodbye."]="I've waited here for too long.  Time to say goodbye."
G["I've walked by here twice now, and both times you've been sitting here by the fire, lazing around while your men work."]="I've walked by here twice now, and both times you've been sitting here by the fire, lazing around while your men work."
G["I've watched both of you fight, Tarenar.  You've got natural talent - more than Gidwin ever will."]="Os vi lutar aos dois, Tarenar. Tem um talento natural, um maior do que Gidwin terá mais."
G["I've won the Brew Toss competition six years running! I am the strongest in all of Pandaria."]="E ganhou o concurso de lançamento de cerveja seis anos seguidos! Sou o mais forte de toda Pandaria."
G["I've won the Brew Toss competition six years running! If you'd like, I can toss this brew all the way across the village and cause a brew strike! All you have to do is point.  Would you like that?"]="I've won the Brew Toss competition six years running! If you'd like, I can toss this brew all the way across the village and cause a brew strike! All you have to do is point.  Would you like that?"
G["I, Arynia Cloudsbreak, have been tasked with protecting the sanctity of the Oracle Grove."]="I, Arynia Cloudsbreak, have been tasked with protecting the sanctity of the Oracle Grove."
G["I, Gamon, will save us!"]="Eu, Gamon, serei o salvador!"
G["I, Garrosh, son of Grom, will show you what it means to be called Hellscream!"]="I, Garrosh, son of Grom, will show you what it means to be called Hellscream!"
G["I, General Zhun, Herald of the glorious Thunder King Lei Shen, hereby challenge you!"]="Eu, o geral Zhun, arauto do glorioso Rei do Trovão Lei Shen, os desafio!"
G["I, Peoreth Il'danube, greatest mage within earshot, will teleport you, a peon, to the Undercity.\n\nIt should be noted that my greatness will only be felt during this period of reformation, as the regal House of Blizzard prepares a teleportation device the likes of which has never before been seen, heard, or felt.\n\nOh yes, it will be grand. So grand in fact that the fabric of time and space will itself shift, propelling the denizens of this world into a new age of prosperity..."]="I, Peoreth Il'danube, greatest mage within earshot, will teleport you, a peon, to the Undercity.\n\nIt should be noted that my greatness will only be felt during this period of reformation, as the regal House of Blizzard prepares a teleportation device the likes of which has never before been seen, heard, or felt.\n\nOh yes, it will be grand. So grand in fact that the fabric of time and space will itself shift, propelling the denizens of this world into a new age of prosperity..."
G["I, Wilfred Fizzlebang, have been invited to this quaint tournament to make use of my extensive knowledge of the summoning arts. What better choice?"]="I, Wilfred Fizzlebang, have been invited to this quaint tournament to make use of my extensive knowledge of the summoning arts. What better choice?"
G["I, ah..."]="Eu, eh..."
G["I, like many others, came to aid my fellow druids when the war started.\n\nNow that the Gates of Ahn'Qiraj are open, I've realized that much work still remains to be done.  I've decided to stay in Silithus and do my best to help the cause, $n."]="I, like many others, came to aid my fellow druids when the war started.\n\nNow that the Gates of Ahn'Qiraj are open, I've realized that much work still remains to be done.  I've decided to stay in Silithus and do my best to help the cause, $n."
G["I, like my brother, honor those who honor their ancestors.  It brings me great joy to share my crafting secrets to disciples of the Lunar Festival!"]="Eu, como meu irmão, honro aqueles que honram seus antepassados. É uma grande alegria compartilhar meus segredos de elaboração com os discípulos do Festival Lunar!"
G["I, like, so don't get it..."]="I, like, so don't get it..."
G["I. AM. UNLEASHED!"]="SOU LIVRE!"
G["I. Am. UNDEFEATED!"]="Sigo... INVICTO!"
G["I. Have. Failed."]="E… fracassado..."
G["I.. I can't... they took my children!"]="Não... não posso... Se levaram a meus filhos!"
G["I...  can't take much more... (Brother, it merely begins!)"]="I...  can't take much more... (Brother, it merely begins!)"
G["I... *cough*  I thank you, stranger."]="I... *cough*  I thank you, stranger."
G["I... *cough* I have been alive for a very long time. In that time I have seen and done terrible things."]="I... *cough* I have been alive for a very long time. In that time I have seen and done terrible things."
G["I... *cough* I owe you my life, stranger.  Thank you."]="Eu... *tose*, te devo a vida. Obrigado."
G["I... <sniff>... I don't think I can handle the next part! Little Lu, tell $n what happened next."]="I... <sniff>... I don't think I can handle the next part! Little Lu, tell $n what happened next."
G["I... Am... Released..."]="Me... e... liberado..."
G["I... Are you...\n\n<Mootoo shivers.>\n\nAre you here to save me?"]="I... Are you...\n\n<Mootoo shivers.>\n\nAre you here to save me?"
G["I... HAVE HAD ENOUGH... OF... YOU!"]="ESTOU... HARTO... DE TI!"
G["I... I am badly injured..."]="Estou... estou gravemente ferido..."
G["I... I am free! Ethereum were planning on torturing me until I gave in to their requests. I fear that, had you not come along, I would have surely given in to their torment."]="I... I am free! Ethereum were planning on torturing me until I gave in to their requests. I fear that, had you not come along, I would have surely given in to their torment."
G["I... I am in your debt."]="Estou em dívida com você."
G["I... I am released from his grasp... at last."]="Estou... estou livre dos seus garras… ao fim."
G["I... I am undone... The new top orc is $n!"]="I... I am undone... The new top orc is $n!"
G["I... I am, sir."]="Eh, eu... senhor."
G["I... I barely made it off the ship before it went down!"]="I... I barely made it off the ship before it went down!"
G["I... I believe so. Yes."]="E... Isso acho. Sim."
G["I... I can see..."]="Posso... Posso ver..."
G["I... I can understand you now! Well, now that we can talk to each other, you have some explaining to do!"]="I... I can understand you now! Well, now that we can talk to each other, you have some explaining to do!"
G["I... I can't believe it's over. You did it! You've destroyed the blood elves and their leader!"]="Não... não me posso acreditar que se tenha terminado. O fez! Tem destruído aos elfos de sangue e ao seu líder!"
G["I... I can't believe it... Saurfang... I... I am honored... honored to have fought along side you, sir."]="I... I can't believe it... Saurfang... I... I am honored... honored to have fought along side you, sir."
G["I... I can't believe you did that! You could have died up there! The way you were wrestling with that eagle, and how you used its wings to land safely... it was amazing!\n\nIf you can do something like that, then... then I can handle some measly wolves and plainshawks! This is the dawn of a new Francis.\n\nAnd it's all thanks to you, $n."]="I... I can't believe you did that! You could have died up there! The way you were wrestling with that eagle, and how you used its wings to land safely... it was amazing!\n\nIf you can do something like that, then... then I can handle some measly wolves and plainshawks! This is the dawn of a new Francis.\n\nAnd it's all thanks to you, $n."
G["I... I can't do it. Get back on yer ship and we'll spare yer life."]="I... I can't do it. Get back on yer ship and we'll spare yer life."
G["I... I can't hit him! That there bubble is too durn thick!"]="I... I can't hit him! That there bubble is too durn thick!"
G["I... I can't hold it! Mayday! MAYDAY!"]="I... I can't hold it! Mayday! MAYDAY!"
G["I... I can't! I won't!"]="I... I can't! I won't!"
G["I... I can't..."]="Não... Não posso..."
G["I... I cannot... The blade fights me..."]="Eu... não posso... A lâmina luta contra mim..."
G["I... I could not save them... Damn you, Arthas! DAMN YOU!"]="Não... pude salvá-los... Maldito seja, Arthas! MALDITO SEJA!"
G["I... I did not think of it that way, Warchief."]="Eu... eu não pensei assim, Warchief."
G["I... I didn't see nothin'! He... he died of natural causes."]="Não... Não vi nada! Morreu... Morreu de causas naturais."
G["I... I do not know."]="Não... Não o sei."
G["I... I don't believe it! Frostmourne stands before us - unguarded - just as the gnome claimed. Come, heroes!"]="Não... não pode ser! A Agonia de Gelo está logo ante nós, sem vigilance, tal e como disse o gnomo. Venham, heróis!"
G["I... I don't know what came over me."]="Não... Não sei que me passado."
G["I... I don't remember... Why have you done this?"]="Eu... Não lembrança... Por que fez isto?"
G["I... I don't think I can make it..."]="I... I don't think I can make it..."
G["I... I don't understand, popo."]="Não... não entendo, papi."
G["I... I don't understand. You -- and M'uru -- knew all along that this would occur?"]="I... I don't understand. You -- and M'uru -- knew all along that this would occur?"
G["I... I don't understand..."]="Não... não o entendo..."
G["I... I don't want to die!"]="Não... não quero morrer!"
G["I... I dun know, Brann. I've been 'ere a long time... all I 'ave of me life before this place are flashes and nightmares."]="Não... não sei, Brann. Levo muito tempo aqui... tudo o que lembrança de minha vida antes de vir aqui são fragmentos e pesadelos."
G["I... I failed. Thank you for coming for me."]="I... I failed. Thank you for coming for me."
G["I... I feel like I was looking for something. But I can't remember what."]="Se... sinto como se buscara algo, mas não me acordo de que."
G["I... I feel... I feel the touch of Elune upon my being once more... She smiles upon me... Yes... I..."]="Eu... sinto... sinto a influência de Eluna sobre mim uma vez mais... Ela me sorri... Sim... Eu..."
G["I... I feel... happy!"]="Me... me siento... feliz!"
G["I... I got a sick grandma at home... I... I'm all she's got, $g mister:miss;."]="I... I got a sick grandma at home... I... I'm all she's got, $g mister:miss;."
G["I... I have a plan of my own."]="Tenho um... plano."
G["I... I have awoken to a nightmare?"]="Me... me e despertado em uma pesadelos?"
G["I... I have died... I was in so much pain... engulfed in darkness... Can you see me, $r?"]="E... E morto... Tanto dor... na escuridão... Pode me ver, $r?"
G["I... I have failed, $n. The Lord of Bla... The Lord of Blackrock is too powerful. He consumed my energy with... with ease. I turn... I... kill me... you must... you must kill me."]="E... falhado, $n. O Senhor de Rocha Negra... O Senhor de Rocha Negra é demais poderoso. E consumido meu energia com... com facilidade. Me e convertido em... Eu... mátame. Deve... me matar."
G["I... I have no control. Bound by your infernal contraption."]="I... I have no control. Bound by your infernal contraption."
G["I... I lost control of the mines!\n\nPlease, $g sir : ma'am;, don't fire me!"]="E... e perdido o controle das minas!\n\nPor favor, $gsenhor: senhora; não me despidas!"
G["I... I must tell the others. You should find Huntress Selura right away."]="Devo... informar aos mais. Você deveria procurar à caçadora Selura agora mesmo."
G["I... I need a boat."]="Preciso... um... navio."
G["I... I need more time!"]="Ne... preciso de mais tempo!"
G["I... I never knew anyone like you. You saved me, $p. More than once. I... I know it's selfish, but I have something to ask of you."]="Nunca... e conhecido a ninguém como você, $p. Me salvou. Eu... já sei que é egoísta mas tenho que pedir algo."
G["I... I saw my life flash before my eyes!"]="E... vi a vida passar por linha de frente de meus olhos!"
G["I... I suppose I'll go west, then."]="Eh... então eu irei ao oeste, suponho."
G["I... I think I broke it."]="Acho... que o e front."
G["I... I think I can make it back to Irontree. We can win this!"]="Acho... acho que poderei chegar até Troncoferro. Podemos ganhar!"
G["I... I think I saw the Lich King. It was only for a moment, but he was here... And it turned so cold, friend. So, so cold..."]="Acho... acho que vi ao Rei Lich. Somente foi um momento, mas estava aqui... E se voltou tão frio, colega. Tão, tão frio..."
G["I... I think I see Blue..."]="Acho... acho que vejo azul..."
G["I... I think I'm ready to leave now."]="C-acho que estou pronto para partir."
G["I... I think so...."]="Eu... acho que si..."
G["I... I thought I was a goner.  Thanks."]="Achava... Achava que ia a morrer. Obrigado."
G["I... I thought I'd be here forever..."]="P-achava que nunca saldría de aqui..."
G["I... I want to hear about the Light.  I think... I remember..."]="Qui... quero ouvir aproxima da Luz. Acho... lembrar..."
G["I... I was not at the Wrath Gate, but the soldiers who survived told me much of what happened. Your son fought with honor. He died a hero's death. He deserves a hero's burial."]="I... I was not at the Wrath Gate, but the soldiers who survived told me much of what happened. Your son fought with honor. He died a hero's death. He deserves a hero's burial."
G["I... I wasn't meant to survive this attack."]="Eu... não deveria haver sobrevivido a este ataque."
G["I... I will hide it. I will hide it until I find it a home, far away from here..."]="I... I will hide it. I will hide it until I find it a home, far away from here..."
G["I... I will stay with you, father."]="Eu... me ficarei com você, pai."
G["I... I'm not really sure how I got here...\n\nI seem to remember traveling... a raft..."]="Eu... não estou certo de como cheguei até aqui...\n\nAcho lembrar que ia... em uma balsa..."
G["I... I'm ok! I'm ok!"]="Estou... estou bem! Estou bem!"
G["I... I've seen enough I think... so very draining..."]="I... I've seen enough I think... so very draining..."
G["I... I... don't... feel... right..."]="Eu... não... me sinto... bem..."
G["I... It can't be..."]="Não... Não pode ser..."
G["I... It... It is beautiful. What I felt when I touched it... The Light coursed through me and I through it... It healed my spirit."]="I... It... It is beautiful. What I felt when I touched it... The Light coursed through me and I through it... It healed my spirit."
G["I... We are powerless. Illidan found and delivered unto the Dragonmaw their leader - Zuluhed. This orc was the one responsible for the capture and incarceration of Alexstrasza. How could we fight against such power? He captured an Aspect!\n\nAnd just as easily, he took my mate."]="I... We are powerless. Illidan found and delivered unto the Dragonmaw their leader - Zuluhed. This orc was the one responsible for the capture and incarceration of Alexstrasza. How could we fight against such power? He captured an Aspect!\n\nAnd just as easily, he took my mate."
G["I... Well, I may of taken a little thing or two from the inn... but what would an ogre care about that?"]="I... Well, I may of taken a little thing or two from the inn... but what would an ogre care about that?"
G["I... What sorcery is this?"]="Que... que bruxaria é esta?"
G["I... ah... oh! Did I...? Was I...? It was... so... cloudy."]="I... ah... oh! Did I...? Was I...? It was... so... cloudy."
G["I... am fury... unrestrained!"]="I... am fury... unrestrained!"
G["I... am no longer..."]="Já... não sou..."
G["I... am... FOREVER!"]="Eu... sou... ETERNO!"
G["I... am... FREE!"]="Sou... LIVRE!"
G["I... am... released... perhaps it's not too late to- No! I need... more... time..."]="E... recuperei... meu liberdade... talvez não seja tarde demais... Não! preciso de mais tempo..."
G["I... am... undone."]="É... meu... fim."
G["I... am... unleashed!"]="E... banido... liberado!"
G["I... awaken!"]="I... awaken!"
G["I... be waitin' on da udda side...."]="I... be waitin' on da udda side...."
G["I... blew it..."]="São... a... bomba..."
G["I... can't... go on..."]="Não... posso... seguir..."
G["I... can't...."]="Não... posso..."
G["I... cannot be... defeated.."]="Não... posso... cair..."
G["I... cannot begin to imagine, $n.  All I know is that I am not going to allow it to happen.  It will be destroyed - if not for our continued safety from demonic taint, then for the memory of Millicent Serene... Milli...\n\nThis, my friend, this is where I hope you will come in."]="I... cannot begin to imagine, $n.  All I know is that I am not going to allow it to happen.  It will be destroyed - if not for our continued safety from demonic taint, then for the memory of Millicent Serene... Milli...\n\nThis, my friend, this is where I hope you will come in."
G["I... could only see darkness... Thank you."]="I... could only see darkness... Thank you."
G["I... deserve this...."]="Me... o merezco..."
G["I... didn't see that coming...."]="Não o vi vir..."
G["I... died.\n\nWhy am I still here? Is there no great hunting ground that I ascend to?\n\nNo... I must first complete my task. Before I can leave this world, the second part of the Cipher of Damnation must be recovered."]="E... morto.\n\nPor que sigo aqui? Não há nenhum terreno de caça no que possa passar a eternidade?\n\nNão... Antes devo terminar meu tarefa. Antes de deixar este mundo, devo recuperar a segunda parte da Importante de Condenação."
G["I... died?\n\nYes, you're right.  I died.  It was an orc... he cut off my hands, and left me to die.\n\n<Valdred looks down at his hands.>\n\nThese aren't my hands!  THESE AREN'T MY HANDS!"]="I... died?\n\nYes, you're right.  I died.  It was an orc... he cut off my hands, and left me to die.\n\n<Valdred looks down at his hands.>\n\nThese aren't my hands!  THESE AREN'T MY HANDS!"
G["I... fade."]="Me... desvanezco."
G["I... feel something. Is it... peace?"]="Sinto... algo. É... paz?"
G["I... hate... you."]="Te... ou... dio."
G["I... have... failed..."]="E... fracassado..."
G["I... is that it over there, $n? This land is doomed if the Horde manages to set that off."]="I... is that it over there, $n? This land is doomed if the Horde manages to set that off."
G["I... is the ground shaking?"]="É... está temblando o chão?"
G["I... just... wanted... to... build... the... damned... bridge..."]="Somente... queria... construir... o... maldito... ponte..."
G["I... lost my mask. I need a new one."]="E... perdido a máscara. Preciso outra."
G["I... must not...falter!"]="Não... devo... vacilar!"
G["I... must... hold on!"]="Tenho... que... aguantar..."
