G["I... really... hate... $rs! <Should have run... we should have run!>"]="$gUn: Uma;... $r... $glos: as; ódio! <Deveríamos haver huido... Deveríamos haver huido!>"
G["I... recede."]="Me... retiro."
G["I... submit. As long as Simmer agrees to stop boiling my pool, I agree to an armistice."]="I... submit. As long as Simmer agrees to stop boiling my pool, I agree to an armistice."
G["I... thank you."]="Gra... Obrigado."
G["I... think I will be safe, for now, thanks to you."]="Acho... que já estamos a salvou, de momentos, Obrigado você."
G["I... uh... look, I'm doing the best I can, okay?! The sprites keep knocking the orbs out of my hands, or stealing them back when I'm not looking!\n\nI hate these things!"]="I... uh... look, I'm doing the best I can, okay?! The sprites keep knocking the orbs out of my hands, or stealing them back when I'm not looking!\n\nI hate these things!"
G["I... understand. Come, we must talk."]="Entendo... Venha, temos que falar."
G["I... wah... where? What is going on?"]="Ah... onde... Que está passando?"
G["I... what happened? I feel much calmer now."]="Eu... Que tem passado? Sinto uma enorme tranquilidade."
G["I... will tell you... nothing."]="I... will tell you... nothing."
G["I... yeah, sure. Whatever."]="Eh... sim, claro. O que você digas."
G["I... your majesty, we were victorious!"]="I... your majesty, we were victorious!"
G["I...I am sorry for my outburst, $n. My father and I disagree on many things."]="S... Sinto meu arrebato, $n. Meu pai e eu não estamos de acordo em muitas coisas."
G["I...I see everything clearly now."]="A-agorao vejo tudo claro."
G["I...I'm free? Thank you, $gbrother:sister;."]="Sou... livre? Obrigado, $ghermano: irmã;."
G["I...I'm running out of breath... I must turn back!"]="Me... me estou ficado sem fôlego... Devo voltar!"
G["I...have...failed."]="E... e... fracassado."
G["I...lost?"]="E perdido?"
G["I...will not...be defeated..."]="I...will not...be defeated..."
G["I...won't let you..."]="Não... te deixarei..."
G["I.am.a.robot."]="Sou. um. robô."
G["IF WAR IS WHAT YOU WANT, WAR IS WHAT YOU SHALL GET, FRUIT VENDOR!"]="IF WAR IS WHAT YOU WANT, WAR IS WHAT YOU SHALL GET, FRUIT VENDOR!"
G["IF WAR IS WHAT YOU WANT, WAR IS WHAT YOU SHALL GET, FRUIT VENDOR!  WE WILL SEE WHO SELLS MORE OF YOUR APPLES!"]="IF WAR IS WHAT YOU WANT, WAR IS WHAT YOU SHALL GET, FRUIT VENDOR!  WE WILL SEE WHO SELLS MORE OF YOUR APPLES!"
