G["If we are to defend the rift, we must do it directly!"]="Se queremos defenda a falha, devemos fazer isso diretamente!"
G["If we are to die, let it be with honor against our hated enemies!"]="Se quisermos morrer, que seja com honra contra nossos inimigos odiados!"
G["If we are to make these new lands ours then we must have places to rest our battle weary bodies. Lay your axe by the fire and share the stories of your mighty battles."]="Se queremos tornar essas novas terras nossas, precisamos de ter lugares para descansar nossos corpos cansados ​​de batalha. Coloque seu machado perto do fogo e compartilhe as histórias das suas poderosas batalhas."
G["If we can just hold them now, I am sure we will be in the clear."]="If we can just hold them now, I am sure we will be in the clear."
G["If we can keep working at this rate, the Lady will be pleased."]="If we can keep working at this rate, the Lady will be pleased."
G["If we can make it past the gates into Duskhaven we'll be safe.  The eastern mountains are virtually impassable."]="If we can make it past the gates into Duskhaven we'll be safe.  The eastern mountains are virtually impassable."
G["If we can trust one another here, then there's hope for the rest of the world."]="Se nós pudermos confiar uns nos outros aqui, haverá esperança para o resto do mundo."
G["If we can't teach you to shoot, you'll have a career in the cantina to fall back on."]="If we can't teach you to shoot, you'll have a career in the cantina to fall back on."
G["If we catch that turncoat, Khay'ji, I'm going to unravel him personally!  Go look for him!"]="If we catch that turncoat, Khay'ji, I'm going to unravel him personally!  Go look for him!"
G["If we dawdle much longer, there'll be hell to pay!"]="Se seguimos perdendo o tempo desta maneira, nos custará um olho da rosto."
G["If we do not defeat the Shao-Tien now, all is lost!"]="Se não derrotamos ao Shao-Tien agora, tudo estará perdido!"
G["If we do succeed here, you realize what comes next."]="Se o conseguimos, te das conta de que viria a continuação?"
G["If we don't expand the mine, there's no way we'll get all the ore we need. Captain Adams'll have our hides!"]="Se não expandimos a mina, não conseguiremos todas as menas que precisamos de. O capitão Adams se pondrá furioso!"
G["If we don't get this shield down soon we're going to be overrun."]="If we don't get this shield down soon we're going to be overrun."
G["If we don't get to that Divine Bell first, that lizard-livered nut-brain Garrosh will. I don't much fancy fightin' a Horde that commands the power o' the bleepin' sha."]="Se não conseguimos a Sino divina, esse cérebro de mosquito de Garrosh o fará. E não me apetece lutar contra uma Horda que dominao poder dos sha."
G["If we don't increase production as much as possible, the Horde might lose this war. If the Horde loses the war, we're out on our butts at best and dead at worst.\n\nI hate to break it to you, but the pretty things you might have heard at Whisperwind Grove won't save us... but hard work might."]="If we don't increase production as much as possible, the Horde might lose this war. If the Horde loses the war, we're out on our butts at best and dead at worst.\n\nI hate to break it to you, but the pretty things you might have heard at Whisperwind Grove won't save us... but hard work might."
G["If we don't slow down soon, I might pass out."]="Se não vamos mais devagar pronto, talvez me desmaye."
G["If we fall, then Darrowshire is doomed!"]="If we fall, then Darrowshire is doomed!"
G["If we find a way to fight our way out of here, Hellscream will know of your deeds, $r."]="Se encontramos a forma de sair de aqui, Grito Infernal saberão dos seus façanhas, $r."
G["If we let the kypari die out, then we will have lost a great treasure.\n\nThe amber is life."]="If we let the kypari die out, then we will have lost a great treasure.\n\nThe amber is life."
G["If we lose our crops we'll lose our brew!"]="Se perdemos nossos cultivos, perderemos a cerveja!"
G["If we lose the healers, Shen-zin Su dies, and all of us with him!  Keep them safe."]="If we lose the healers, Shen-zin Su dies, and all of us with him!  Keep them safe."
G["If we make it outta here, let's keep this part outta the story..."]="If we make it outta here, let's keep this part outta the story..."
G["If we reverse the Essence flows perhaps we can alter the polarity."]="If we reverse the Essence flows perhaps we can alter the polarity."
G["If we serve the Light, then we must go north and face the darkness residing there."]="If we serve the Light, then we must go north and face the darkness residing there."
G["If we speak as one, we cannot be ignored!"]="If we speak as one, we cannot be ignored!"
G["If we spend our time and strength fighting with each other, Loken will use Ulduar's resources to destroy both Horde and Alliance."]="Se perdemos o tempo e nossa força lutando um contra o outro, Loken usará os recurso de Ulduar para destruir à Horda e a Aliança."
G["If we stop these dwarves and worgen we will be celebrated as great heroes of the Horde!"]="If we stop these dwarves and worgen we will be celebrated as great heroes of the Horde!"
G["If we surrender now, the entire temple will fall!"]="If we surrender now, the entire temple will fall!"
G["If we survive dis, maybe someday I call you... \"Friend.\""]="If we survive dis, maybe someday I call you... \"Friend.\""
G["If we survive this, remind me to find a competent partner!"]="If we survive this, remind me to find a competent partner!"
G["If we truly desire the same thing, Akama, then release me!  If Illidan is to die, it shall be by my hand!"]="Se de verdade desejam o mesmo, Akama, liberte-me! Se Illidan deve morrer, será por meus próprias mãos!"
G["If we understand how Ragnaros has affected the lesser denizens of Hyjal, we may better understand how to repair it."]="If we understand how Ragnaros has affected the lesser denizens of Hyjal, we may better understand how to repair it."
G["If we use the Surian theory, then yes, but not if we go with the Y'serian approach."]="If we use the Surian theory, then yes, but not if we go with the Y'serian approach."
G["If we use the appropriate sequence we should be ok. Will just take some serious studying before we start."]="If we use the appropriate sequence we should be ok. Will just take some serious studying before we start."
G["If we were in Shadowforge City, I would have you tossed into the Ring of Law for your transgressions, Ambassador. The darkest dungeons of Ironforge will have to do for now."]="If we were in Shadowforge City, I would have you tossed into the Ring of Law for your transgressions, Ambassador. The darkest dungeons of Ironforge will have to do for now."
G["If we're to find him, we're headed in the right direction.  It's likely that he was taken to Stratholme, or potentially to the Plaguewood."]="If we're to find him, we're headed in the right direction.  It's likely that he was taken to Stratholme, or potentially to the Plaguewood."
G["If we're to help with that in any way we'll need more people.  Call some of the scouts in to help with that."]="Vamos precisar a mais gente se queremos cuidar de isto. Chama a algum dos batedores para que colaboren."
G["If we're to win this war we will need your help. Our packs must unite! The Forsaken will destroy us otherwise."]="If we're to win this war we will need your help. Our packs must unite! The Forsaken will destroy us otherwise."
G["If what you say is true about the fruit vendor being an old lady... Bah!  It cannot be true!"]="Se o que diz de que a vendedora de fruta é uma ânciana é verdade... Bah! Não pode ser!"
G["If ya be lucky, dey eat your head first...."]="If ya be lucky, dey eat your head first...."
G["If ya need a bat, ya come to da right place. I be handlin' all de bats for de scouts."]="Se você precisa de um bastão, você veio ao lugar certo. Eu estou lidando com todos os morcegos para escoteiros."
G["If ye and Prince Anduin hadn't been there, we could all be turnin' on each other, lettin' our anger get the best o' us!"]="If ye and Prince Anduin hadn't been there, we could all be turnin' on each other, lettin' our anger get the best o' us!"
G["If ye ask me, I think Grif spends a little too much time with the animals.  Still, nobody else knows the hunter's path quite like he does.  Look for him outside the smithy in Kharanos."]="Se você me perguntar, acho que Grif passa um pouco de tempo com os animais. Ainda assim, ninguém mais conhece o caminho do caçador como ele. Procure por ele do lado de fosse da ferraria em Kharanos."
G["If ye climb up another notch, I'll share me brew with ye!"]="If ye climb up another notch, I'll share me brew with ye!"
G["If ye love killing orcs and ye don't talk much, glad to have ye!\n\nIf not, there's a lovely portal east of here that I heard is just lovely this time of year."]="If ye love killing orcs and ye don't talk much, glad to have ye!\n\nIf not, there's a lovely portal east of here that I heard is just lovely this time of year."
G["If ye need to get yer hands on some guild creation papers ye'll have to head up to Ironforge and visit the Ironforge Visitor's Center."]="Se você precisar colocar algum papéis de criação de guild, precisará ir até Ironforge e visitar o Centro de Visitantes de Ironforge."
G["If ye want me advice, don't go strugglin' tae much. Ye'll just encourage them."]="If ye want me advice, don't go strugglin' tae much. Ye'll just encourage them."
G["If ye want to find Grumnus, the first thing ye should do is head to Ironforge. Go to the very center of the city and look for the Great Forge, ye should find him there."]="Se você quer encontrar Grumnus, a primeira coisa que você deve fazer é ir para Ironforge. Vá para o centro da cidade e procure a Grande Forja, você deve encontrá-o lá."
G["If ye're looking to learn the profession of leatherworking, ye're gonna need to travel to Ironforge.  I hear there's a nice shop near the Great Forge where ye can learn the profession."]="Se você quer aprender a profissão de marceneiro, precisará viajar para Ironforge. Ouvi dizer que há uma boa loja perto da Grande Forja, onde você pode aprender a profissão."
G["If yer here to partake in the big spoils, ya best be gettin' in line!\n\nMy share be long overdue...."]="Se estas aqui para pegar parte nos grandes desechos, entre na cauda!\n\nMeu parte vem com atraso."
G["If yer of need of an Inn, The Stonefire Inn is where ye should be.  Ye'll find it just to the left of the entrance to Ironforge if ye be coming, or to the right if ye be going.  \n\nOh, and if yer going that way, then tell them to have a tankard ready for me."]="If yer of need of an Inn, The Stonefire Inn is where ye should be.  Ye'll find it just to the left of the entrance to Ironforge if ye be coming, or to the right if ye be going.  \n\nOh, and if yer going that way, then tell them to have a tankard ready for me."
G["If yer thinking about forming a guild, then ye'll need to put it past Jondor Steelbrow o'er in the Ironforge Visitor's Center.  Just head southeast from the gates of Ironforge to see him."]="Se você está pensando em formar uma guilda, precisará passar por Jondor Steelbrow no Centro de Visitantes de Ironforge. Apenas continue para o sudeste dos portões de Ironforge para vê-o."
G["If yer' itchin' ta learn a bit about smeltin', I'm yer dwarf!"]="If yer' itchin' ta learn a bit about smeltin', I'm yer dwarf!"
G["If you actually brought me the hide of the beast? Well... Let me show you..."]="Se você mesmo me trouxesse a pele da besta? Bem... Deixe-me mostrar-lhe..."
G["If you agree to help us against our mutual enemy, you will come to no harm here."]="If you agree to help us against our mutual enemy, you will come to no harm here."
G["If you ain't with us, you're against us! DIE!"]="If you ain't with us, you're against us! DIE!"
G["If you are going to Alterac Valley then go speak to Kartra Bloodsnarl. You will find her inside the Hall of the Brave in the Valley of Honor."]="Se você estiver indo para Alterac Valley, fale com Kartra Bloodsnarl. Você a encontrará dentro do Salão dos Bravos, no Vale da Honra."
G["If you are here for further training, you have overestimated my abilities. Have a word with Telonis over there; he can help you."]="Se você está aqui para treinamento adicional, superestimou minhas habilidades. Fale com Telonis por lá; ele pode te ajudar."
G["If you are here to beg for the privilege of working for me, then your company is quite welcome. Otherwise, there is little chance you are of any use to me."]="If you are here to beg for the privilege of working for me, then your company is quite welcome. Otherwise, there is little chance you are of any use to me."
G["If you are here to hunt dragons, be my guest.  Where should I send my condolences?"]="Se você está aqui para caçar dragões, fique à vontade. Para onde devo enviar minhas condolências?"
G["If you are here to waste my time, then you are wasting the time of the Cenarion Circle as a whole.  For your sake, let us hope that you are not foolish enough to be doing just that."]="Se você está aqui para perder meu tempo, está perdendo o tempo do Círculo Cenariano como um tudo. Pela sua causa, esperemos que você não seja tolo o suficiente para fazer exatamente isso."
G["If you are interested in our message, I will be holding a gathering. Speak with me if you wish to know more, but beware, for Orgrimmar is full of people who would silence the truth."]="If you are interested in our message, I will be holding a gathering. Speak with me if you wish to know more, but beware, for Orgrimmar is full of people who would silence the truth."
G["If you are interested in our message, I will be holding a gathering. Speak with me if you wish to know more, but beware, for Stormwind is full of people who would silence the truth."]="If you are interested in our message, I will be holding a gathering. Speak with me if you wish to know more, but beware, for Stormwind is full of people who would silence the truth."
G["If you are interested in training with us, speak with me again at the banquet tables, later this evening."]="If you are interested in training with us, speak with me again at the banquet tables, later this evening."
G["If you are looking to become a great cook, venture over to the Pig and Whistle Tavern in Old Town and talk to Stephen Ryback. That man knows how to cook up a rack of ribs like no other.\nMan... now you got me hungry for some of his famous ribs. Don't count on him teaching you that recipe though!"]="If you are looking to become a great cook, venture over to the Pig and Whistle Tavern in Old Town and talk to Stephen Ryback. That man knows how to cook up a rack of ribs like no other.\nMan... now you got me hungry for some of his famous ribs. Don't count on him teaching you that recipe though!"
G["If you are looking to become a mighty paladin, there is no better teacher then Lord Grayson Shadowbreaker. He can be found in the Cathedral of Light in Cathedral Square."]="Se você deseja se tornar um poderoso paladino, não há professor melhor do que Lord Grayson Shadowbreaker. Ele pode ser encontrado na Catedral da Luz, na Praça da Catedral."
G["If you are lost, my friend, perhaps I can be of assistance. What is it you need?"]="Se você perdido, amigo, ao melhor posso ajudar você. O que precisa?"
G["If you are not careful, your own hatred could consume you."]="If you are not careful, your own hatred could consume you."
G["If you are not here to help the cause, get out."]="Se você não está aqui para ajudar a causa, saia."
G["If you are not here to lead a tour, leave us."]="Se você não está aqui para liderar um passeio, deixe-nos."
G["If you are one that prefers to hunt in the outdoor world, both Felwood's treants and Un'Goro's lashers are an excellent source of fronds.\n\nIf you are more of a risk-taker, the eastern and western wings of Dire Maul will provide you with a nearly limitless supply of savage fronds."]="If you are one that prefers to hunt in the outdoor world, both Felwood's treants and Un'Goro's lashers are an excellent source of fronds.\n\nIf you are more of a risk-taker, the eastern and western wings of Dire Maul will provide you with a nearly limitless supply of savage fronds."
G["If you are ready and wish to quickly return to the normal time stream, I can transport you."]="Se você estiver pronto e desejar retornar rapidamente ao horário normal, eu posso transportá-o."
G["If you are ready to laugh, head over to the World's End Tavern!"]="If you are ready to laugh, head over to the World's End Tavern!"
G["If you are seeking a locksmith, might I suggest the sewers? That's where you'll find more... disreputable types."]="Se você está procurando um serralheiro, posso sugerir os esgotos? É aí que você encontrará mais... tipos de má reputação."
G["If you are seeking a truly rewarding pursuit, then a life of enchanting is for you!"]="Se você está procurando uma procurando verdadeiramente gratificante, então uma vida de encantamento é para você!"
G["If you are so curious about the mantid, I will tell you more on the way to Klaxxi'vess.\n\nOtherwise, leave me to my work."]="If you are so curious about the mantid, I will tell you more on the way to Klaxxi'vess.\n\nOtherwise, leave me to my work."
G["If you are strong, then I give you respect.\n\nIf you are weak, then I give you encouragement.\n\nIf you are my enemy, then I give you my fist. Several times over, if necessary."]="Se é forte, te ofereço meu respeito.\n\nSe é fraco, te ofereço meu apoio.\n\nSe é meu inimigo, te ofereço meu punho. Todas as vezes que faça falta."
G["If you ask me, I think my brother should do something about all of these goblins! It's said that one of them set off the Cataclysm with a footbomb!\n\nWe need to get rid of all of them before it's really too late!"]="If you ask me, I think my brother should do something about all of these goblins! It's said that one of them set off the Cataclysm with a footbomb!\n\nWe need to get rid of all of them before it's really too late!"
G["If you ask me, I think the goblins are a shoe in.  We have the tools, and we have the talent!"]="Se você me perguntar, acho que os goblins são um sapato. Temos as ferramentas e temos o talento!"
G["If you ask me, and you DID, I think we should kill all of the apothecaries before it's too late!"]="Se você me perguntar, e você fez, acho que devemos matar todos os boticários antes que seja tarde demais!"
G["If you ask me, the beast is insane."]="If you ask me, the beast is insane."
G["If you ask me, the best part about fishing is its slow pace.  It gives one time to think, to reflect on past events and to plan for future ones.\n\nOh, and it's also a great excuse to drink.  Heavily."]="If you ask me, the best part about fishing is its slow pace.  It gives one time to think, to reflect on past events and to plan for future ones.\n\nOh, and it's also a great excuse to drink.  Heavily."
G["If you ask me, the night elves lost this area ten thousand years ago. Their expulsion today at our hands is merely a formality."]="Se você me perguntar, os elfos noturnos perderam essa área há dez mil anos. Sua expulsão hoje em nossas mãos é apenas uma formalidade."
G["If you ask me, there's no greater profession than a miner.  And if you ask me, there's no greater miner than a dwarf!"]="Se você me perguntar, não há profissão maior do que um mineiro. E se você me perguntar, não há mineiro maior que um anão!"
G["If you ask me, you should round up a bunch of your friends and burn Easterly Rest to the ground, $n."]="If you ask me, you should round up a bunch of your friends and burn Easterly Rest to the ground, $n."
G["If you be wantin' ta rest here, ya just need to ask!"]="Se você quer descansar aqui, basta perguntar!"
G["If you become a friend of the Lower City, perhaps we can do business?"]="Se você se tornar amigo da Cidade Baixa, talvez possamos fazer negócios?"
G["If you betray us, there will be no escape for you.  I will crush your body so slowly that you shall hear every single one of your bones break."]="If you betray us, there will be no escape for you.  I will crush your body so slowly that you shall hear every single one of your bones break."
G["If you can dodge a double-binary fluxcillometric auto-wrench, you can dodge a ball!"]="If you can dodge a double-binary fluxcillometric auto-wrench, you can dodge a ball!"
G["If you can find a way into our sleep chambers, you may use them."]="If you can find a way into our sleep chambers, you may use them."
G["If you can heft my breastplate, then throw it!  Throw it for Doloria!"]="If you can heft my breastplate, then throw it!  Throw it for Doloria!"
G["If you can keep my town safe,  I'll definitely make it worth your while."]="Se você pode manter certa a cidade, farei que seus esforços merezcan a pena."
G["If you can shoot, you can score some sweet prizes!"]="Se sabe disparar, pode conseguir prêmios bons."
G["If you can still see, it didn't go back far enough!"]="A mim somente me da dor de cabeça!"
G["If you can translate those plates, we can find and capture Brann."]="Se conseguir traduzir essas placas, poderemos encontrar e capturar a Brann."
G["If you can venture into the surrounding forest and return any stolen barrels you find, I'll concoct a concentrated draft of marvelous power for you..."]="If you can venture into the surrounding forest and return any stolen barrels you find, I'll concoct a concentrated draft of marvelous power for you..."
G["If you can't fight Zoltrik at range, use your Jump Drakes! ability:\n|TInterface\\Icons\\ability_vehicle_launchplayer.blp:64|t"]="Se você não pode lutar contra Zoltrik à distância, usa a habilidade Abordar draco!\n\n|TInterface\\Icons\\ability_vehicle_launchplayer.blp:64|t"
G["If you can't fight at range, use your Jump Drakes! ability:\n|TInterface\\Icons\\ability_vehicle_launchplayer.blp:64|t"]="Se você não pode lutar à distância, usar a habilidade Abordar draco! ability:\n\n|TInterface\\Icons\\ability_vehicle_launchplayer.blp:64|t"
G["If you cannot send any help to Westreach Summit, may the refugees from Freewind Post stay on the edge of Camp Mojache?"]="If you cannot send any help to Westreach Summit, may the refugees from Freewind Post stay on the edge of Camp Mojache?"
G["If you cannot send any help to Westreach Summit, may we send refugees here?"]="Se você não pode enviar ajuda à Cima Tramo Oeste, podemos trazer aos refugiados aqui?"
G["If you could catch a fish big enough for your mouth we'd never be hungry again."]="If you could catch a fish big enough for your mouth we'd never be hungry again."
G["If you could use some exotic brew, T'chali's Voodoo Brewery at Brewfest has got you covered!"]="Se te apetece uma cerveja exótica, na Cervejaria vodu de T'chali que há na Festa da Cerveja têm o que precisa!"
G["If you desire to form a fellowship then it is the guild master, Lysheana, that you must see.  You will find her in the Craftsmen's Terrace in the northeastern section of Darnassus."]="Se você deseja formar uma irmandade, então é o mestre da guilda, Lysheana, que deve ver. Você a encontrará no Terraço dos Artesãos, na seção nordeste de Darnassus."
G["If you desire to learn the ways of Herbalism then it is to Thunder Bluff that you must go.  Follow the road north out of Bloodhoof Village and take the elevator to the top of the rise.  You can ask a Bluffwatcher there for further assistance."]="Se você deseja aprender os caminhos do Herbalismo, é para Thunder Bluff que você deve ir. Continue a estrada ao norte da Bloodhoof Village e pegue o elevador até o topo da subida. Você pode pedir a um Bluffwatcher para obter mais assistência."
G["If you desire, in addition to training, I have it within my power to erase the knowledge of your talents from your mind.  Be warned that every time you undergo this procedure the more difficult it is to perform, and therefore the more expensive it becomes."]="Se você deseja, além do treinamento, tenho a capacidade de apagar da sua mente o conhecimento dos seus talentos. Esteja avisado de que toda vez que você se submete a esse procedimento, mais difícil é a execução e, portanto, mais caro se torna."
G["If you die, you die."]="If you die, you die."
G["If you do not behave I will turn this picnic right around and we will go home. Is that what you want?"]="If you do not behave I will turn this picnic right around and we will go home. Is that what you want?"
G["If you do not care then there is no harm telling me."]="Se você não se importa, então não faz mal me contar."
G["If you do not engage in combat soon, you will forfeit!"]="Se não entra pronto em combate, abandonará."
G["If you do not yet know this name, we are certain you will after these battles.  We present, $n."]="If you do not yet know this name, we are certain you will after these battles.  We present, $n."
G["If you don't come out, we'll tear this place apart!"]="If you don't come out, we'll tear this place apart!"
G["If you don't do something about these gnolls, we will!"]="Se não faz nada com os gnolh, nós o faremos!"
G["If you don't eat your fish, you can't have any pudding!"]="Se não te comes o peixe, não terá postre."
G["If you don't get that thing fully operational, we're toast for sure!"]="If you don't get that thing fully operational, we're toast for sure!"
G["If you don't like what we do here, you talk to the Eye. But it will not listen. It's not the Ear."]="If you don't like what we do here, you talk to the Eye. But it will not listen. It's not the Ear."
G["If you don't mind hurrying it up?  I think they're getting ready to sacrifice me!"]="If you don't mind hurrying it up?  I think they're getting ready to sacrifice me!"
G["If you don't mind me asking.  How did we manage to recover the fragment?  How did we infiltrate our enemies' forces without their knowledge?"]="Se se me permite perguntar. Como nos as temos arreglado para recuperar o fragmento? Como nos temos infiltrado nas forças inimigas sem seu conhecimento?"
G["If you don't mind my askin', what do you do that requires walking so much?"]="Se se você pode saber, a que te dedicas para que te faça falta andar tanto?"
G["If you don't mind, I'm going to teleport us back to the Rebel Camp.  We'll thank you in person later."]="Se não te importa, vou teletransportarnos de volta ao Asentamento Rebelde. Te daremos as Obrigado em pessoa mais adiante."
G["If you don't settle down, you'll be spending the night inside the Stockade!"]="If you don't settle down, you'll be spending the night inside the Stockade!"
G["If you don't settle down, you'll find yourself tossed in with the rest of the arrested cultists."]="If you don't settle down, you'll find yourself tossed in with the rest of the arrested cultists."
G["If you don't start throwing some real punches, you'll be cleaning the drake stalls for a year!"]="If you don't start throwing some real punches, you'll be cleaning the drake stalls for a year!"
G["If you drop one more crate I swear I am sending you off to be disenchanted."]="If you drop one more crate I swear I am sending you off to be disenchanted."
G["If you earn enough Brewfest prize tickets, the ticket redeemer in the Brewfest camp can give you an \"Honorary Brewer\" hand stamp.\n\nThat stamp will allow me to sell you a Brewfest riding ram. But they don't come cheap, mind you!"]="If you earn enough Brewfest prize tickets, the ticket redeemer in the Brewfest camp can give you an \"Honorary Brewer\" hand stamp.\n\nThat stamp will allow me to sell you a Brewfest riding ram. But they don't come cheap, mind you!"
G["If you ever do that again, I will break your neck."]="If you ever do that again, I will break your neck."
G["If you ever find yourself travelling to the west off the beaten path keep a weather eye out for my eccentric father. He never enjoyed the increased business from the Stormstouts.\n\nI grew up listening to how we were \"brewing out originallity.\" He is quite the beer snob.\n\nStill, he might have a trinket or story you might find interesting."]="If you ever find yourself travelling to the west off the beaten path keep a weather eye out for my eccentric father. He never enjoyed the increased business from the Stormstouts.\n\nI grew up listening to how we were \"brewing out originallity.\" He is quite the beer snob.\n\nStill, he might have a trinket or story you might find interesting."
G["If you ever have need of a healer in battle, speak to me."]="Se alguma vez precisa cura na batalha, fala comigo."
G["If you ever meet Witch Doctor Tor'gash, tell him his concoctions and charms don't work! I did exactly as he told me to and still Magasha has eyes only for Zurai.\n\nDon't believe a thing that sham witch doctor tells you!"]="If you ever meet Witch Doctor Tor'gash, tell him his concoctions and charms don't work! I did exactly as he told me to and still Magasha has eyes only for Zurai.\n\nDon't believe a thing that sham witch doctor tells you!"
G["If you ever need any filth, come talk to me. I can help."]="Se em algum momentos precisa um pouco de sucata, venha a falar comigo. Posso ajudar você."
G["If you fall into the water below, don't be discouraged. Swim back to the first ledge and start again."]="If you fall into the water below, don't be discouraged. Swim back to the first ledge and start again."
G["If you fall off, I'm not going in after you!"]="If you fall off, I'm not going in after you!"
G["If you fall, who would notice?"]="If you fall, who would notice?"
G["If you figure out any way to improve the device let me know!"]="Se você descobrir alguma maneira de melhorar o dispositivo, avise-me!"
G["If you find the lunar festival revelers in Silvermoon, they can transport you to Moonglade to partake in the celebration."]="Se você encontrar os foliões do festival lunar em Silvermoon, eles podem transportá-o para Moonglade para participar da celebração."
G["If you find this note, then I am either dead or at Halfhill Market.\n\nHopefully I have temporarily left my post to enjoy a hot mug of ale in town. Perhaps you should go check, just in case.\n\nIf indeed I have failed my mission, please send my love and effects to my family in Zhu's Watch.\n- Sho"]="If you find this note, then I am either dead or at Halfhill Market.\n\nHopefully I have temporarily left my post to enjoy a hot mug of ale in town. Perhaps you should go check, just in case.\n\nIf indeed I have failed my mission, please send my love and effects to my family in Zhu's Watch.\n- Sho"
G["If you find yourself in this cave again, do not forget about the thermal vents. They may help you escape some tight situations."]="If you find yourself in this cave again, do not forget about the thermal vents. They may help you escape some tight situations."
G["If you fished as well as you talked the ocean wouldn't have any fish left."]="If you fished as well as you talked the ocean wouldn't have any fish left."
G["If you had not just rescued me from certain death, I would kill you where you stand. Next time we meet, I will not hold back."]="If you had not just rescued me from certain death, I would kill you where you stand. Next time we meet, I will not hold back."
G["If you hadn't rescued me from that prison I surely would have succumbed by now.\n\nI have not forgotten...."]="If you hadn't rescued me from that prison I surely would have succumbed by now.\n\nI have not forgotten...."
G["If you have a ranged weapon, use it to shoot down ropes that hold grummles up."]="If you have a ranged weapon, use it to shoot down ropes that hold grummles up."
G["If you have been muted, or have questions about the Muting/UnMuting process, please visit... zzzttt!!"]="Se têm desativado seu som ou tem perguntas aproxima do processo de silêncio/som, visite... zzzzttt!"
G["If you have come all the way out here, then it must be that you dare to venture near Manaforge Ara.\n\nCare to buy or sell before you head over?"]="If you have come all the way out here, then it must be that you dare to venture near Manaforge Ara.\n\nCare to buy or sell before you head over?"
G["If you have come looking for the gift of fast and safe mobility, then you have arrived at your destination!  This year's model of the new Mechano-striders have recently arrived, and I am ready to show you all they have to offer!"]="Se você veio à procura de uma mobilidade rápida e certa, chegou ao seu destino! O modelo deste ano dos novos mecânicos de ataque chegou recentemente e estou pronto para mostrar tudo o que eles têm a oferecer!"
G["If you have come to save the world then you have come to the right place. The faceless one - the Blood God, Hakkar - has been brought back into our world!"]="Se você veio salvar o mundo, veio ao lugar certo. O sem rosto - o Deus do sangue, Hakkar - foi trazido de volta ao nosso mundo!"
G["If you have dealings with the doctor over there, be cautious. Whatever they're up to, it's unnatural."]="Se você tem relações com o médico por lá, seja cauteloso. O que quer que estejam fazendo, não é natural."
G["If you have lost a piece of your Zandalarian armor, I may be able to help you."]="Se perdeu uma peça da sua armadura Zandalariano, talvez possa ajudar você."
G["If you have lost a piece of your Zandalarian armor, I may be able to help."]="Se você perdeu um pedaço da sua armadura zandalariana, talvez eu possa ajudar."
G["If you have more thick leather, I'm sorry but you've come too late. We have all that we need, but before you go would you check with the others here? There's likely someone that still needs your help with their own collecting."]="If you have more thick leather, I'm sorry but you've come too late. We have all that we need, but before you go would you check with the others here? There's likely someone that still needs your help with their own collecting."
G["If you have naga blood on your hands, then you're an ally of mine.\n\nA long time ago, I swore I'd never be anyone's slave again, and I kept that bargain until Idra'kess captured us.  Now I can barely contain my fury.  All I want is blood... not food, not sleep, not even victory... only blood."]="If you have naga blood on your hands, then you're an ally of mine.\n\nA long time ago, I swore I'd never be anyone's slave again, and I kept that bargain until Idra'kess captured us.  Now I can barely contain my fury.  All I want is blood... not food, not sleep, not even victory... only blood."
G["If you have not spoken to Magistrix Erona at the Sunspire, I recommend you do so immediately.  There are pressing matters to attend to, and she - as do we all - need your help!"]="If you have not spoken to Magistrix Erona at the Sunspire, I recommend you do so immediately.  There are pressing matters to attend to, and she - as do we all - need your help!"
G["If you have not yet learned how to make use of bandages, I will be happy to show you the basics of creation and application. The difference between life and death can often come down to properly bandaging wounds."]="Se você ainda não aprendeu a usar bandagens, terei prazer em mostrar o básico da criação e aplicação. A diferença entre vida e morte pode muitas vezes se resumir a ferimentos adequadamente enfaixados."
G["If you have something to say, say it!"]="Se você tem algo a dizer, diga!"
G["If you have the coin, I have the food and drink to keep that appetite of yours satisfied.  Every copper goes to keeping the Retreat in tip-top shape."]="Se você tiver a moeda, eu tenho a comida e a bebida para manter satisfeito seu apetite. Tudo cobre serve para manter o Retiro em boa forma."
G["If you have the money, I have what you need."]="Se você tem o dinheiro, eu tenho o que você precisa."
G["If you have the time, Grimclaw and his master Volcor could use your help. If you're interested, speak with me further..."]="If you have the time, Grimclaw and his master Volcor could use your help. If you're interested, speak with me further..."
G["If you have the time, you should visit Binan's famous Brewmoon Festival. I will be brewing some of my famous Kun-Lai Kicker Brew."]="If you have the time, you should visit Binan's famous Brewmoon Festival. I will be brewing some of my famous Kun-Lai Kicker Brew."
G["If you have to ask, you don't know me anywhere near well enough to be using that appellation."]="Se você precisar perguntar, não me conhece nem perto o suficiente para usar essa denominação."
G["If you have what it takes, I will be happy to show you the way."]="Se você tem o que é preciso, ficarei feliz em mostrar o caminho."
G["If you haven't already, make sure that you offer your assistance to Rina Moonspring."]="Se você ainda não o fez, certifique-se de oferecer sua assistência a Rina Moonspring."
G["If you haven't come to study, I'll use you to teach a lesson."]="If you haven't come to study, I'll use you to teach a lesson."
G["If you haven't come to train, step back and leave me to my work."]="Se você não veio treinar, dê um passo atrás e deixe-me trabalhar."
G["If you haven't run by now, it's too late!"]="Se não vocês têm huido ainda, já é tarde demais!"
G["If you head northwest, look for the Grummle Bazaar. Many good trinkets and luckydos for sell there. Good fortune to be found for those who seek it."]="If you head northwest, look for the Grummle Bazaar. Many good trinkets and luckydos for sell there. Good fortune to be found for those who seek it."
G["If you hear the whisper, you're dying..."]="Se oyes o sussurro, é que está morrendo..."
G["If you heard that all of the Horde and Alliance collections have been completed, then you heard right, $c. All of the goods for the war that we gathered and prepared are in the process of being sent to Cenarion Hold in Silithus, with less than $2113w days until the last of it arrives there. After that I suppose we'll just have to wait and see who assembles that scepter to ring the gong with, which will open the gates to Ahn'Qiraj and herald the war."]="Se te têm dito que a Horda e a Aliança já têm reuniu tudo o necessário, te têm informou bem, $c. Todas as mercadorias para a guerra que temos reuniu e pronto estão sendo enviadas ao Forte Cenariano em Silithus e em menos de $2113w dias o último carregamento chegará ali. Depois suponho que simplesmente teremos que esperar a ver quem reconstruye o cetro com o que é preciso atacar o gongo para abrir as portões de Ahn'Qiraj e anunciar a guerra."
G["If you heard that all of the Horde and Alliance collections have been completed, then you heard right, $c. All of the goods for the war that we gathered and prepared are in the process of being sent to Cenarion Hold in Silithus, with less than a day until the last of it arrives there. After that I suppose we'll just have to wait and see who assembles that scepter to ring the gong with, which will open the gates to Ahn'Qiraj and herald the war."]="If you heard that all of the Horde and Alliance collections have been completed, then you heard right, $c. All of the goods for the war that we gathered and prepared are in the process of being sent to Cenarion Hold in Silithus, with less than a day until the last of it arrives there. After that I suppose we'll just have to wait and see who assembles that scepter to ring the gong with, which will open the gates to Ahn'Qiraj and herald the war."
G["If you here to poke more softknuckles, Dajik going to poke you too. That a bad Goregek habit."]="If you here to poke more softknuckles, Dajik going to poke you too. That a bad Goregek habit."
G["If you insert tab A into slot B then of course it's going to go BOOM! Here, let me show you what I have and then you can ask Lilliam about how to put it together so it doesn't blow up."]="Se você encaixar a peça A no espaço B, é claro que vai explodir! Deixe-me mostrar o que tenho. Depois, pergunte a Lilliam como montar tudo sem causar uma explosão."
G["If you intend to play the fool, you may as well look the part."]="If you intend to play the fool, you may as well look the part."
G["If you judge a fish by its ability to climb a tree, it will live its life believing it is inadequate."]="If you judge a fish by its ability to climb a tree, it will live its life believing it is inadequate."
G["If you keep failing these simple tasks, you will be put down."]="If you keep failing these simple tasks, you will be put down."
G["If you keep killing hardknuckles, you grow up to be like Goregek. You want be like Goregek?"]="Se seguir matando calhonudilhos, você de maior ser como Goregek. Você que ser como Goregek?"
G["If you keep teleporting all over the place, Jaina will catch onto us. Please, be more careful next time."]="If you keep teleporting all over the place, Jaina will catch onto us. Please, be more careful next time."
G["If you kill them, I will simply reanimate their corpses. And when you die, I will do the same to you."]="If you kill them, I will simply reanimate their corpses. And when you die, I will do the same to you."
G["If you let me out I promise that you won't regret it!"]="If you let me out I promise that you won't regret it!"
G["If you like excitement, our captain's the best!  I love this job!"]="Se você gosta de emoção, nosso capitão é o melhor! Eu amo esse trabalho!"
G["If you live through this... I assure you it will be worth it."]="Se sobrevives a isto... te garanto que haverá merecido a pena."
G["If you love demons so much... then you shall have them!"]="Se tanto te gostam os demônios... os terá todos!"
G["If you manage to complete a deck of beasts cards you will be rewarded with a greater darkmoon card of the blue dragon.   This is very useful in restoring of magical energies."]="Se você conseguir completar um baralho de cartas com bestas, você será recompensado com uma carta maior de lua escura do dragão azul. Isso é muito útil na restauração de energias mágicas."
G["If you manage to complete a deck of blessings cards you will be rewarded with a greater darkmoon card of crusade.   This will increase the damage you do with your spells and attacks as you continue to fight."]="Se você conseguir completar um baralho de cartas de bênçãos, será recompensado com uma carta maior de cruzada de lua escura. Isso aumentará o dano que você causa com os seus feitiços e ataque à medida que continua lutando."
G["If you manage to complete a deck of elementals cards you will be rewarded with a greater darkmoon card of the maelstrom.   This card will occasionally impact an enemy you are fighting with for heavy damage."]="Se você conseguir completar um baralho de cartas elementais, você será recompensado com uma carta maior de lua escura do turbilhão. Esta carta ocasionalmente causa impacto em um inimigo com o qual você está lutando."
G["If you manage to complete a deck of furies cards you will be rewarded with a greater darkmoon card of vengeance.   While wielding this card anyone who strikes you has a chance of suffering holy vengeance."]="Se você conseguir completar um baralho de cartas de fúria, você será recompensado com uma maior carta de vingança de Negraluna. Ao portar esta carta, qualquer um que acertar você tem chance de sofrer vingança sagrada."
G["If you manage to complete a deck of lunacy cards you will be rewarded with a greater darkmoon card of madness.   The power of madness will fill you each time you slay an enemy."]="Se você conseguir completar um baralho de cartas de loucura, será recompensado com uma carta de loucura maior. O poder da loucura irá preenchê-o cada vez que você matar um inimigo."
G["If you manage to complete a deck of portals cards you will be rewarded with a greater darkmoon card of the twisting nether.   This card will occasionally pull your spirit back into your body after death and restore you."]="Se você conseguir completar um baralho de cartas de portais, você será recompensado com uma carta de lua escura maior do éter torcido. Este cartão ocasionalmente puxa seu espírito de volta ao seu corpo após a morte e o restaura."
G["If you manage to complete a deck of storms cards you will be rewarded with a greater darkmoon card of wrath.   This will increase your chance to get a critical hit with spells or physical attacks until you achieve one."]="Se você conseguir completar um baralho de cartas de tempestades, será recompensado com uma carta maior de ira de lua escura. Isso aumentará sua chance de receber um acerto crítico com feitiços ou ataque físicos até que você atinja um."
G["If you manage to complete a deck of warlords cards you will be rewarded with a greater darkmoon card of heroism.   This card will occasionally heal you while you are engaged in melee combat."]="Se você conseguir completar um baralho de cartas dos senhores da guerra, você será recompensado com uma carta maior de heroísmo da lua escura. Este card irá ocasionalmente curá-o enquanto você estiver envolvido em um combate corpo a corpo."
G["If you mean to free Myzrael, you will be sorry!"]="Se tem a intenção de liberar a Myzrael, o lamentarás!"
G["If you mortals are all so craven, this will be easier than I thought!"]="Se os mortais são tão covardes, isto vai ser mais fácil do que eu havia pensado!"
G["If you need a mountain moved, I can do that. I can make 'em for you, too."]="If you need a mountain moved, I can do that. I can make 'em for you, too."
G["If you need a ride down, take one of these babies!"]="If you need a ride down, take one of these babies!"
G["If you need any help, just ask me!"]="Se você precisa ajuda, venha a me ver!"
G["If you need help surviving in the woods, you had best not stray far from the city walls.  However if you do plan to stray, then you had better have a talk with Malygen in the Cenarion Enclave so that you might learn to set a proper campfire."]="If you need help surviving in the woods, you had best not stray far from the city walls.  However if you do plan to stray, then you had better have a talk with Malygen in the Cenarion Enclave so that you might learn to set a proper campfire."
G["If you need keys, talk to Walter Soref in the Rogues' Quarter, but watch yourself."]="Se você precisar de chaves, fale com Walter Soref no Bairro dos Ladinos, mas observe-se."
G["If you need reagents, you've come to the right place. You won't find a finer selection in all of Shattrath."]="Se você precisar de reagentes, veio ao lugar certo. Você não encontrará uma seleção mais refinada em tudo o Shattrath."
G["If you need to house your pet while you're training another, then you should talk to Jenova Stoneshield over in the Dwarven District."]="Se você precisar alojar seu animal de estimação enquanto estiver treinando outro, deve conversar com Jenova Stoneshield no Dwarven District."
G["If you need to speak with Apprentice Garion, you'll find him inside the cottage with Tabetha. At least there, he can't steal all the reagents."]="Se você precisar falar com o Aprendiz Garion, você o encontrará dentro da casa com Tabetha. Pelo menos lá, ele não pode roubar todos os reagentes."
G["If you need to travel to the Exodar, I have just the hippogryph for you!"]="Se você precisa viajar para o Exodar, eu tenho apenas o hipogrifo para você!"
G["If you need training in alchemy, there is only one place in Stormwind you need to go... Alchemy Needs. You can find it in the Mage Quarter along the outer rim of shops."]="Se você precisa de treinamento em alquimia, há apenas um lugar no Ventobravo que você precisa... Alquimia Precisa. Você pode encontrá-o no Bairro dos Magos, ao longo da borda externa das lojas."
G["If you nice me let you live."]="If you nice me let you live."
G["If you not talk to Mizzle, you not become da king!  Talk to Mizzle da Crafty!"]="Se você não fala com Mizzle, você não se torna rei! Fale com o Mizzle da Crafty!"
G["If you only knew the power that I serve, you would not hesitate to kneel before me and join our ranks. Sadly, your ignorance will prove to be your undoing!"]="If you only knew the power that I serve, you would not hesitate to kneel before me and join our ranks. Sadly, your ignorance will prove to be your undoing!"
G["If you only learn one thing during your time in Bloodmyst, $c, I hope that it is vigilance. This island claims the unwary first, then begins to wear down even the most guarded of warriors.\n\nEverywhere you turn, a foe stands ready to take your life."]="If you only learn one thing during your time in Bloodmyst, $c, I hope that it is vigilance. This island claims the unwary first, then begins to wear down even the most guarded of warriors.\n\nEverywhere you turn, a foe stands ready to take your life."
G["If you pay the right price, the Light can always protect you, $c."]="If you pay the right price, the Light can always protect you, $c."
G["If you play the game, play to win."]="If you play the game, play to win."
G["If you prove that you are a true ally, I might consider training you..."]="Se você provar que é um verdadeiro aliado, posso considerar treiná-o..."
G["If you put on cologne or perfume, then you'll see who is amorous.  Those are the ones who accept love tokens... and offer a gift in return.\n\nBut remember: to give someone a love token, you have to smell just right!  Men like the scent of perfume, while women prefer cologne."]="If you put on cologne or perfume, then you'll see who is amorous.  Those are the ones who accept love tokens... and offer a gift in return.\n\nBut remember: to give someone a love token, you have to smell just right!  Men like the scent of perfume, while women prefer cologne."
G["If you really trust some undead with your pets, you can talk to Anya Maulray at the inn on the upper ring of the Trade Quarter."]="Se você mesmo confia em algum mortos-vivos com os seus animais de estimação, pode conversar com Anya Maulray na pousada no anel superior do Trade Quarter."
G["If you really want to get past those doors you'll lend me the strength of at least three people! Follow me!"]="If you really want to get past those doors you'll lend me the strength of at least three people! Follow me!"
G["If you really want to help out, you can help me and my friends with some combat practice."]="Se de verdade que ajudar, pode nos ajudar a meus amigos e a mim com algo de prática de combate."
G["If you refuse to bend to the torch, you will die to the torch!"]="If you refuse to bend to the torch, you will die to the torch!"
G["If you require more training, I would be happy to tell you who can aid you. What weapon has caught your eye?"]="Se você precisar de mais treinamento, ficarei feliz em dizer quem pode ajudá-o. Que arma chamou sua atenção?"
G["If you require time to rest and regain your strength, you will find the best at the Inn in Dolanaar.  Innkeeper Keldamyr will see to it that you are taken care of."]="Se você precisar de tempo para descansar e recuperar suas forças, encontrará o melhor na pousada em Dolanaar. O gerente Keldamyr cuidará para que você cuide."
G["If you run now, you may live."]="Se empiezas a correr, talvez vivas."
G["If you seek death, you have found it!"]="Se atenção à morte, a tem encontrado!"
G["If you seek peace, relinquish the World Pillar and leave Deepholm. This is our realm. Your only welcome here shall be found underneath my stone foot."]="Se atenção a paz, renuncia ao Pilar do Mundo e abandona Infralar. Este é nosso reino. Seu única boas-vindas será a que encontrar baixo meu pé de pedras."
G["If you seek to advance your training beyond what I have to show you, you'll need to sully those fine clothes. Hgarth has unlocked a number of mysteries in our profession, and lurks in the hills behind Sun Rock Retreat in Stonetalon Mountains."]="If you seek to advance your training beyond what I have to show you, you'll need to sully those fine clothes. Hgarth has unlocked a number of mysteries in our profession, and lurks in the hills behind Sun Rock Retreat in Stonetalon Mountains."
G["If you seek to become my student, you'll need to complete an assignment for me. Prove yourself worthy, and I might even consider rewarding you."]="If you seek to become my student, you'll need to complete an assignment for me. Prove yourself worthy, and I might even consider rewarding you."
G["If you seek to hunt naga, then you will need all the help you can get. Deep in the water you can find bubbly fissures that produce enough air bubbles that will allow you to breath underwater. Swim up close so that you can use the bubbles."]="Se você procura caçar nagas, precisará de toda a ajuda possível. No fundo da água, você pode encontrar fissuras borbulhantes que produzem bolhas de ar suficientes que permitem respirar debaixo d'água. Nade de perto para poder usar as bolhas."
G["If you seek to improve your cooking skill, I have knowledge to share with you."]="If you seek to improve your cooking skill, I have knowledge to share with you."
G["If you seek to learn more of the herbalism arts, I suggest you speak to Han Flowerbloom at the Halfhill Market in the Valley of the Four Winds.\n\nI will mark his  position for you."]="If you seek to learn more of the herbalism arts, I suggest you speak to Han Flowerbloom at the Halfhill Market in the Valley of the Four Winds.\n\nI will mark his  position for you."
G["If you seek to learn more of the herbalism arts, I suggest you speak to the trainer in The Jade Forest.\n\nI will mark their position for you."]="Se deseja aprender mais sobre o arte da herborismo, te sugiro que fale com o instrutor da Floresta de Jade.\n\nTe marcarei seu localização no mapa."
G["If you seek to walk a righteous path then you should speak with Seer Alsoomse."]="If you seek to walk a righteous path then you should speak with Seer Alsoomse."
G["If you seek training in the Old Ways, I cannot help you."]="Se você procura treinamento nas Antigas Formas, não posso ajudá-o."
G["If you seek training in weapons, I can provide."]="Se você procurar treinamento em armas, eu posso fornecer."
G["If you seek training, I cannot help you."]="Se você procura treinamento, não posso ajudá-o."
G["If you should need reagents, I have a full selection available."]="Se você precisar de reagentes, tenho uma seleção complete disponível."
G["If you so much as spit without my permission, this place shuts down. Forcefully."]="Se escupes sem meu permissão este lugar quedará fechado. pela força."
G["If you spent enough time here in the valley, perhaps you could make friends with all the locals. Maybe even some day settle down with a farm plot of your own.\n\nImagine that - YOU, the world-weary $c, settling down to manage a farm!\n\n<Chen closes his eyes and laughs a deep belly-laugh.>"]="If you spent enough time here in the valley, perhaps you could make friends with all the locals. Maybe even some day settle down with a farm plot of your own.\n\nImagine that - YOU, the world-weary $c, settling down to manage a farm!\n\n<Chen closes his eyes and laughs a deep belly-laugh.>"
G["If you start to get too far, I will warn you. If you continue to stray, I will not hesitate to fail you."]="If you start to get too far, I will warn you. If you continue to stray, I will not hesitate to fail you."
G["If you stop this, then maybe we can come up with one."]="Se esperas, talvez se nos ocurra algo."
G["If you struggle, then before your death you will face pain and horror and the loss of all you love."]="Se luchas, antes de morrer te enfrentarás ao dor, o horror e à perda de todos os que amas."
G["If you think I'll betray my friend that easily, think again!  Face me, you scoundrel!"]="If you think I'll betray my friend that easily, think again!  Face me, you scoundrel!"
G["If you think I'm going to be intimidated by a bunch of filthy yaungol, you've got another thing coming!"]="If you think I'm going to be intimidated by a bunch of filthy yaungol, you've got another thing coming!"
G["If you think I'm good, you should see my husband fight."]="Se acha que sou boa deveria ver como combate meu marido."
G["If you think I'm out for the count, think again!"]="Se você acha que fui derrotada, melhor pensar duas vezes!"
G["If you think an orc can hit hard, check out their brew, it hits even harder!  See for yourself at Drohn's Distillery, only at Brewfest!"]="If you think an orc can hit hard, check out their brew, it hits even harder!  See for yourself at Drohn's Distillery, only at Brewfest!"
G["If you think you can stop us, you're mistaken, 'friend.'"]="If you think you can stop us, you're mistaken, 'friend.'"
G["If you think you have the strength to pound good metal into weapons and armor for the Horde look for Dwukk next to the heated forge in the northwest corner of Razor Hill."]="Se você acha que tem força para cravar um bom metal em armas e armaduras para a Horda, procure Dwukk próximo à forja aquecida no canto noroeste de Razor Hill."
G["If you thought you had problems with trolls in Coldridge, wait 'til you get to Kharanos!  That big cataclysm got the trolls all stirred up out here."]="If you thought you had problems with trolls in Coldridge, wait 'til you get to Kharanos!  That big cataclysm got the trolls all stirred up out here."
G["If you touch me again it'll be the last thing you touch!"]="Se me vuelves a tocar serei o último que toques!"
G["If you travel to Cenarion Hold in Silithus, you will find Elder Bladesing."]="Se você viajar para o Cenarion Hold em Silithus, encontrará Elder Bladesing."
G["If you truly desire to know such things, the answer shall come to you when you are prepared to receive it."]="If you truly desire to know such things, the answer shall come to you when you are prepared to receive it."
G["If you truly have the desire to learn this profession, then I would point you in the direction of Ainethil, a skilled alchemist at the Craftsmen's Terrace in northern Darnassus."]="Se você mesmo deseja aprender esta profissão, aponto-o na direção de Ainethil, um alquimista habilidoso no Terraço dos Artesãos, no norte de Darnassus."
G["If you truly wish to undo what your kind have wrought upon our land you must first prove yourselves here in our school."]="If you truly wish to undo what your kind have wrought upon our land you must first prove yourselves here in our school."
G["If you try to fail and succeed, what did you just do?"]="Se você tentar falhar e ter sucesso, o que você acabou de fazer?"
G["If you value your beer, run for it!"]="Se aprecias seu cerveja, corre a por ela!"
G["If you wanna live life to the fullest, you gotta try T'chali's Voodoo Brew!"]="Se que viver a vida ao verdadeiro desafio, precisa testar a cerveja vodu de T'chali!"
G["If you want a fight, you'll get one!"]="Se que lutar, luchemos!"
G["If you want her back you're gonna have to beg!"]="If you want her back you're gonna have to beg!"
G["If you want him back you're gonna have to beg... like a monkey!!"]="If you want him back you're gonna have to beg... like a monkey!!"
G["If you want something done right, do it yourself!"]="Se que que algo saia bem, faça você mesmo!"
G["If you want the key, you'll have to catch me!"]="If you want the key, you'll have to catch me!"
G["If you want to access the market here, get to the central ring of the city."]="Se você deseja acessar o mercado aqui, chegue ao anel central da cidade."
G["If you want to be friends with big-tongues, you not friends with Frenzyheart! I tell village! We no trust you anymore!"]="If you want to be friends with big-tongues, you not friends with Frenzyheart! I tell village! We no trust you anymore!"
G["If you want to find a paladin, you'll have to go to the Royal Quarter. There's some elf there who can teach you."]="Se você quiser encontrar um paladino, precisará ir ao Royal Quarter. Há algum elfo lá que pode ensinar."
G["If you want to hire a gryphon, you've come to the right place."]="Se você deseja contratar um grifo, veio ao lugar certo."
G["If you want to join the brawl, just let me know."]="If you want to join the brawl, just let me know."
G["If you want to jump to your death this time, I won't stop you."]="Esta vez não te detendré se que saltar cima seu morte."
G["If you want to know about the comings and goings of caravans and merchants here in Splintertree Post, then I am fortunately the orc you are looking for.  Unfortunately for you though, I don't like people.\n\nIf you want something, make it quick."]="If you want to know about the comings and goings of caravans and merchants here in Splintertree Post, then I am fortunately the orc you are looking for.  Unfortunately for you though, I don't like people.\n\nIf you want something, make it quick."
G["If you want to learn enchanting, go find Lavinia Crowe on the inner ring of the Apothecarium."]="Se você quer aprender a encantar, encontre Lavinia Crowe no anel interno do Apothecarium."
G["If you want to learn how to skin things, head to the Rogues' Quarter. The skinner has his place on the inner ring."]="Se você quiser aprender a esfolar as coisas, vá para o Bairro dos Ladinos. O skinner tem seu lugar no anel interno."
G["If you want to learn how to wield weapons, go to Archibald on the inner ring of the War Quarter."]="Se você quiser aprender a manusear armas, vá para Archibald no anel interno do War Quarter."
G["If you want to learn to mine, talk to Brom Killian at the inner ring of the War Quarter."]="Se você quer aprender a explorar, converse com Brom Killian no anel interno do War Quarter."
G["If you want to speed this process up then make sure you have your papers in order!"]="If you want to speed this process up then make sure you have your papers in order!"
G["If you want your rams back, come get them, cowards!"]="If you want your rams back, come get them, cowards!"
G["If you want, go get, big-tongue baby!"]="Se que, ir a por ele, bebé grislíngua-grande!"
G["If you watch these bolts of fire closely to see which runes are not hit, you can spot safe spots for the next burst."]="If you watch these bolts of fire closely to see which runes are not hit, you can spot safe spots for the next burst."
G["If you will follow me, then."]="If you will follow me, then."
G["If you will not cease this foolish quest, then you will die!"]="If you will not cease this foolish quest, then you will die!"
G["If you will not leave Alterac Valley on your own, then the Frostwolves will force you out!"]="If you will not leave Alterac Valley on your own, then the Frostwolves will force you out!"
G["If you will not serve my Master with your sword and knowledge of his enemies..."]="Se não sirvieras a meu mestre com o seu lâmina e com o seu saber sobre seus inimigos..."
G["If you wish to advance further in the fine art of tailoring, please speak with my employer, Keelen. He can show you more than I ever will."]="If you wish to advance further in the fine art of tailoring, please speak with my employer, Keelen. He can show you more than I ever will."
G["If you wish to become a swordsmith, just ask."]="Se você deseja se tornar um ferreiro, basta perguntar."
G["If you wish to continue our work, we will need some additional supplies..."]="If you wish to continue our work, we will need some additional supplies..."
G["If you wish to further your skills, seek Telia's shop in Silvermoon.  It is on the south end of the Royal Exchange."]="If you wish to further your skills, seek Telia's shop in Silvermoon.  It is on the south end of the Royal Exchange."
G["If you wish to truly experience the feast of Winter Veil, you should go to Orgrimmar."]="Se você deseja mesmo experimentar a festa do Véu de Inverno, você deve ir a Orgrimmar."
G["If you wish to use a hippogryph, speak with Fidelio."]="Se você deseja usar um hipogrifo, fale com Fidelio."
G["If you would have let me drive, we wouldn't have gotten in this mess!"]="If you would have let me drive, we wouldn't have gotten in this mess!"
G["If you wouldn't mind waiting, $n... this might take a long time."]="$n, Se não te importa esperar... talvez isto tarde um bom tempo."
G["If you'd allow me just one..."]="Se tão somente me permitieras um..."
G["If you'd be so kind, please let me out of here!"]="If you'd be so kind, please let me out of here!"
G["If you'd been a better assistant this whole Cataclysm thing could have been avoided!"]="If you'd been a better assistant this whole Cataclysm thing could have been avoided!"
G["If you'll excuse me, I must take my leave. Good day, ladies."]="Com o seu permissão, tenho que ir embora. Bons dias, senhoritas."
G["If you'll excuse me, I'm afraid I have other business I must attend to.  Please call on me again in the future."]="If you'll excuse me, I'm afraid I have other business I must attend to.  Please call on me again in the future."
G["If you're a real hero of the Horde, then I wanna see you fight a dragon!  Yeah!"]="Se você é um verdadeiro herói da Horda, então eu quero ver você lutar contra um dragão! sim!"
G["If you're as accomplished as you claim, why don't you investigate Zul'Aman yourself?"]="Se é tão bom como diz, por que não investigas Zul'aman você mesmo?"
G["If you're ever captured by the Legion, tell them \"Xar il romath da tidesbi.\" They will kill you instantly for insulting their god, saving you intolerable torture or worse..."]="Se você for capturou pela Legião, diga a eles \"Xar il romath da tidesbi\". Eles o matam instantaneamente por insultar seu deus, poupando-lhe tortura intolerável ou coisa pior..."
G["If you're expecting some kind of official welcome, you're going to be disappointed, $c. We don't stand on tradition, here. What works is what goes."]="If you're expecting some kind of official welcome, you're going to be disappointed, $c. We don't stand on tradition, here. What works is what goes."
G["If you're feeling queasy, speak with Pestle.  He might have something for motion sickness."]="Se você estiver se sentindo enjoado, fale com Pestle. Ele pode ter algo para enjôo."
G["If you're going to be taking up my time, you'd better prove you're worth it. I ought to get something out of this arrangement, after all."]="If you're going to be taking up my time, you'd better prove you're worth it. I ought to get something out of this arrangement, after all."
G["If you're going to come out here, make yourself useful because the shadowstalker over there isn't doing much."]="Se você vai vir aqui, seja útil porque o caçador de sombras ali não está fazendo muito."
G["If you're going to get to Warlord Kalithresh, you'll need to defeat Mekgineer Steamrigger and Hydromancer Thespia so that you can get to the Main Chambers Access Panels.\n\nYou mash a few buttons on those, and the door to the main chamber will open right up!"]="If you're going to get to Warlord Kalithresh, you'll need to defeat Mekgineer Steamrigger and Hydromancer Thespia so that you can get to the Main Chambers Access Panels.\n\nYou mash a few buttons on those, and the door to the main chamber will open right up!"
G["If you're going to venture into Blackrock Depths, come speak with me. I may have some work for you."]="If you're going to venture into Blackrock Depths, come speak with me. I may have some work for you."
G["If you're heading toward the city, then I have something important for you to do!"]="Se você estiver indo em direção à cidade, então eu tenho algo importante para você fazer!"
G["If you're here to be trained in the tactics and strategy of hunting, you've come to the right place!"]="Se você está aqui para ser treinado nas táticas e estratégias de caça, você veio ao lugar certo!"
G["If you're here to conduct business, say your piece."]="Se tem vindo a dirigir o negócios, di o que tenha que dizer."
G["If you're here, then IT might be close behind!"]="Se você está aqui, ISSO pode estar perto!"
G["If you're here, then it means you are prepared to begin the study of summoning demonic cohorts to do your bidding. We will start with the lowliest creatures you will be able to call and continue from there. Let us begin."]="If you're here, then it means you are prepared to begin the study of summoning demonic cohorts to do your bidding. We will start with the lowliest creatures you will be able to call and continue from there. Let us begin."
G["If you're interested in learning more about the traditional Pilgrim's Bounty feast, speak to any of the hostesses."]="Se você estiver interessado em aprender mais sobre o tradicional banquete de recompensas dos peregrinos, fale com qualquer uma das anfitriãs."
G["If you're interested in sewing with leather, you've certainly come to the right place. Faldron and Telonis are true artists, and I hope to learn much from them."]="Se você está interessado em costurar com couro, certamente veio ao lugar certo. Faldron e Telonis são verdadeiros artistas, e espero aprender muito com eles."
G["If you're interested, a couple of us are going into Shattrath for drinks later."]="Se você estiver interessado, algum de nós vão a Shattrath pegar uma bebida mais tarde."
G["If you're known for trade, where are the pandaren from other towns?"]="Se se os conhece pelo comercio, onde estão os pandaren dos mais povos?"
G["If you're looking for a flight back to Rut'theran Village, then you should talk to my night elven counterpart, Silva Fil'naveth."]="Se você está procurando um voo de volta para a vila de Rut'theran, deve conversar com meu colega élfico noturno, Silva Fil'naveth."
G["If you're looking for a flight back to Thunder Bluff, then you should talk to my tauren counterpart, Bunthen Plainswind."]="Se você está procurando um voo de volta para Thunder Bluff, deve conversar com meu colega tauren, Bunthen Plainswind."
G["If you're looking for a place to rest, I can help."]="Se atenção um lugar para descansar, eu posso ajudar você."
G["If you're looking for an Arcane Reforger, there is a highborne mage inside the enchanting shop just outside the Mage District."]="Se você está procurando um Arcane Reforger, há um mago alto dentro da loja encantadora nos arredores do Mage District."
G["If you're looking for gadgets, doodads, thingamajigs, widgets, whatsis, dohickeys, or gizmos, you've come to the right place!"]="Se você está procurando por gadgets, doodads, jogos de coisas, widgets, whatsis, dohickeys ou aparelhos, você veio ao lugar certo!"
G["If you're looking for information that the Cenarion Circle might have archived somewhere, then I'm the one to talk to.  Then again, you need to know what information you're looking for first before I can really help you.\n\nSee how that works?  Brilliant!"]="Se você precisa informações que o Círculo Cenariano possa ter archivada, eu sou a pessoa que atenção. Mas primeiro, precisa saber que informações atenção para poder ajudar você.\n\nTe das conta de como vai isto? Fantástico!"
G["If you're looking for the Tillers quartermaster, Gina Mudclaw's your girl. She'll be running the market at Halfhill.\n\nLet me mark her location on your map."]="If you're looking for the Tillers quartermaster, Gina Mudclaw's your girl. She'll be running the market at Halfhill.\n\nLet me mark her location on your map."
G["If you're looking for work, $c, grab yourself a pick and get to digging. There're ruins out there as far as the eye can see!"]="Se atenção trabalho, $c, agarra um pico e entre a cavar. Há ruínas até onde alcança a visão!"
G["If you're looking to get to Valiance Keep, you can hop onto the cargo ship that runs between here and Borean Tundra. They don't mind taking on the occasional passenger or two."]="If you're looking to get to Valiance Keep, you can hop onto the cargo ship that runs between here and Borean Tundra. They don't mind taking on the occasional passenger or two."
G["If you're looking to infiltrate the ruins, speak to Kun Autumnlight at the Guo Lai Ruin first."]="If you're looking to infiltrate the ruins, speak to Kun Autumnlight at the Guo Lai Ruin first."
G["If you're looking to practice fire fighting, this is the place. There may be a heap of snow hereabouts, but you never know when Steelgrill or those gnomes'll cause an explosion, eh?"]="Se você quer praticar combate a incêndios, este é o lugar. Pode haver um monte de neve por aí, mas você nunca sabe quando Steelgrill ou esses gnomos causarão uma explosão, não é?"
G["If you're looking to register a guild, I would suggest inquiring within the walls of Silvermoon City itself."]="Se você deseja registrar uma guilda, sugiro perguntar dentro das muralhas da cidade de Silvermoon."
G["If you're looking to travel to Northrend, the icebreaker Northspear sails from here to Valgarde in the Howling Fjord."]="Se você quer viajar para Northrend, o quebra-gelo Northspear parte daqui para Valgarde, no Howling Fjord."
G["If you're no good at fixing, we'll see if you're good for eating. Now WORK!"]="Se não vales para consertar coisas, ao melhor nos sirves como comida... E agora, A TRABALHAR!"
G["If you're not a tailor, I don't think any of my patterns will interest you, but you're welcome to browse!"]="Se você não é um alfaiate, não acho que nenhum dos meus padrões o interesse, mas você pode navegar!"
G["If you're not here to work, then please see yourself away from our excavation."]="Se você não está aqui para trabalhar, afaste-se de nossas escavações."
G["If you're ready, then Dadanga and I are ready.  Let's go!"]="Se você está $gpronto: pronta;, Dadanga e eu também o estamos. Em marcha!"
G["If you're seeking a bank in the eastern part of the city, look no further than the Royal Exchange. It lies along the north wall therein."]="Se você está procurando um banco na parte oriental da cidade, não procure mais, o Royal Exchange. Encontra-se ao longo da parede norte."
G["If you're seeking patterns or knowledge about shadoweave tailoring, I'd be happy to help you."]="Se você está procurando padrões ou conhecimento sobre alfaiataria de sombra, ficaria feliz em ajudá-o."
G["If you're shot down and caught, don't tell them your real name.  Use a codename."]="Se você for abatido e apanhado, não diga o nome verdadeiro. Use um codinome."
G["If you're so eager to fight, I'll oblige you. But know that nothing you do here can prevent the completion of the iron colossus!"]="Se tantas ganha tem de lutar, te darei esse prazer. Mas que saiba que nada do que faça impedirá a finalização do colosso de ferro!"
G["If you're so thirsty for blood, why not group up and go tear apart Stormwind?"]="If you're so thirsty for blood, why not group up and go tear apart Stormwind?"
G["If you're trying to be friendly, save your breath.  Better yet, just stop breathing all together."]="Se você está tentando ser amigável, economize seu fôlego. Melhor ainda, pare de respirar todos juntos."
G["If you're willing to forget this crate thing, I can give you a good price on some recent arrivals from Uldum."]="If you're willing to forget this crate thing, I can give you a good price on some recent arrivals from Uldum."
G["If you've a way out of here, we should probably use it! I've tried casting myself and Tyrande out of here, but the well is too much in flux!"]="If you've a way out of here, we should probably use it! I've tried casting myself and Tyrande out of here, but the well is too much in flux!"
G["If you've been sent to kill me, please take a number and wait your turn."]="Se você foi enviado para me matar, pegue um número e aguarde sua vez."
G["If you've been to Zangarmarsh, you might've run into a fellow named Daniels. You know -- wears a strange helmet, only answers to \"the Specialist.\"\n\nOf course, I taught him everything he knows.\n\nDon't let the fine clothing fool you. I'm still a rogue at heart. Daniels and I spent a lot of time in the trenches together, but that was before I retired. As far as I know, he's still out there, giving 'em hell."]="If you've been to Zangarmarsh, you might've run into a fellow named Daniels. You know -- wears a strange helmet, only answers to \"the Specialist.\"\n\nOf course, I taught him everything he knows.\n\nDon't let the fine clothing fool you. I'm still a rogue at heart. Daniels and I spent a lot of time in the trenches together, but that was before I retired. As far as I know, he's still out there, giving 'em hell."
G["If you've been wrasslin' with oil, be sure to avoid all sources of sparks or open flame, such as candles, lighters, mages, Kester's shop, and Deputy Clunky!"]="If you've been wrasslin' with oil, be sure to avoid all sources of sparks or open flame, such as candles, lighters, mages, Kester's shop, and Deputy Clunky!"
G["If you've come looking for the finest craftsmanship on this or any other continent in the world, then you've come to the right place!\n\nGrimand Elmore, at your service!"]="If you've come looking for the finest craftsmanship on this or any other continent in the world, then you've come to the right place!\n\nGrimand Elmore, at your service!"
G["If you've come to return to me to my father, I must ask that you look around us first - can we truly walk away from these people in their time of need and still claim to represent the Alliance?"]="If you've come to return to me to my father, I must ask that you look around us first - can we truly walk away from these people in their time of need and still claim to represent the Alliance?"
G["If you've earned the respect of the warchief, there must be something to you. If you can lift the weapon, it's yours."]="Se te ganhou o respeito do Chefe de Guerra deve ser por algo. Se você pode levantar esta arma, é sua."
G["If you've got somewhere to go, I can get you there."]="Se você tem algum lugar para ir, eu posso levá-o até lá."
G["If you've got the money, I'm sure the Light's got something to teach you."]="Se tem o dinheiro, estou certo de que a Luz poderá ensinar algo."
G["If you've got the time, we've got the brew. Stormstout!"]="Se você tem tempo, nós temos brebagens. Cerveja de Trovão!"
G["If you've never seen one, it is a sight to behold. A very impressive creature both on and off the field of battle. Next, let us take a look at what I am sure all you male students have been waiting for. The succubus."]="If you've never seen one, it is a sight to behold. A very impressive creature both on and off the field of battle. Next, let us take a look at what I am sure all you male students have been waiting for. The succubus."
G["If you've seen the journal, then you know what I've been discovering. The titans' own creations are at war with each other!"]="Se tem visto o diário, já sabe o que e descoberto. As criações dos titãs estão em guerra umas contra outras!"
G["If you've the gold, I can teach you how to ride a hawkstrider."]="Se você tem o ouro, eu posso ensiná-o a andar em um falcão."
G["If your enemies harass the worker, productivity will cease until the threat is dealt with."]="If your enemies harass the worker, productivity will cease until the threat is dealt with."
G["If your glass is full may it be again!"]="Se seu copa está cheia, lhenémosla novamente!"
G["If your glove is too big, does it still fit like a glove?"]="Se sua luva é muito grande, ela ainda se encaixa como uma luva?"
G["If your people are as strong as you purport, I'm sure you'll find your stride again."]="If your people are as strong as you purport, I'm sure you'll find your stride again."
G["If your stomach's rumbling, talk to Galley Chief Steelbelly, but just between you and me? You might want to wait. He's got that name for a reason."]="Se seu estômago está roncando, fale com Galley Chief Steelbelly, mas apenas entre você e eu? Você pode querer esperar. Ele tem esse nome por um motivo."
G["If zhat vere not enough, you sabotaged my ritual and caused Gobbles' death!"]="Como se isso não serr suficiente, você sabotarr minha ritual e causarr morrte de Gluglu!"
G["If'n I'm gonna be Scourge anyway, I might as well be drunk!"]="Se vou formar parte do Flagelo, mais me vale que estiver bêbado!"
G["Iffin' yeh don't sumtimes shoot a small furry animal out yer gun, 'ow would yeh keep it clean? The druids don't 'ave an answer to THAT one!"]="Iffin' yeh don't sumtimes shoot a small furry animal out yer gun, 'ow would yeh keep it clean? The druids don't 'ave an answer to THAT one!"
G["Ignious, burn 'em up for me, won't you?"]="Fogueiro, queime eles por mim!"
G["Ignorant whelps!"]="Ignorant whelps!"
G["Ignore Twilight's Hammer! They stupid. Kill other one, now!"]="Ignorar Martelo Crepúsculo! Ser tonto. Matar ao outro, agora!"
G["Ignore her, $p. Help us brew this beer."]="Não lhe faça atenção, $p. Ayúdanos a elaborar esta cerveja."
G["Ignore that... we have work to do!"]="Ignorando isso... temos trabalho!"
G["Ignore the Horde - focus on the Zandalari guarding the door!"]="Ignore the Horde - focus on the Zandalari guarding the door!"
G["Ignore their blows, $n! They cannot harm you!"]="Ignore their blows, $n! They cannot harm you!"
G["Ignoring the battle that raged about him, Latherion dropped his guard to cradle his love in her dying moments. But the demons gave him no quarter, and quickly laid him low."]="Ignoring the battle that raged about him, Latherion dropped his guard to cradle his love in her dying moments. But the demons gave him no quarter, and quickly laid him low."
