G["Illidan reigns!"]="Illidan é nosso rei!"
G["Illidan will become suspicious... that much is for certain.  We will deal with it as we always do."]="Illidan will become suspicious... that much is for certain.  We will deal with it as we always do."
G["Illidan will find me and when he does... he will pry the Ashtongue secret from me - such is the power of the Betrayer!  No... there is only one way.  My usefulness to the cause has come to an end. I must venture into the spirit world!"]="Illidan will find me and when he does... he will pry the Ashtongue secret from me - such is the power of the Betrayer!  No... there is only one way.  My usefulness to the cause has come to an end. I must venture into the spirit world!"
G["Illidan will pay."]="Illidan pagará."
G["Illidan! The well is out of control!"]="Illidan! O poço está fosse de controle!"
G["Illidan's grasp on this land is slipping.  Can you feel it, $n?"]="O alcance de Illidan sobre esta terra se deteriora. O notas, $n?"
G["Illidan's grasp over my tribe is strong, $n. It shall all be over soon, one way or another.\n\nAre you ready, $n?  My people's future depends on us."]="O controle de Illidan sobre meu tribo é forte, $n. Pronto acabará, de um modo u outro.\n\nQue seguir adiante, $n? O futuro de meu povo está em nossas mãos."
G["Illidan's lackeys still guard these halls, $n.  Once they are defeated, my powers will allow me to take you deeper inside the temple."]="Illidan's lackeys still guard these halls, $n.  Once they are defeated, my powers will allow me to take you deeper inside the temple."
G["Illidan's lapdogs!  Destroy them all!"]="Illidan's lapdogs!  Destroy them all!"
G["Illidan's lapdogs!  You will pay for my imprisonment with your lives!"]="Illidan's lapdogs!  You will pay for my imprisonment with your lives!"
G["Illidan, I am out of arrows! Moon goddess, protect us from the darkness, that we may see your light again another night!"]="Illidan, I am out of arrows! Moon goddess, protect us from the darkness, that we may see your light again another night!"
G["Illidan, what is in that vial? What are you doing?"]="Illidan, que há em esse frasco? O que está fazendo?"
G["Illidan...you musn't!"]="Illidan... não o faça!"
G["Illusionary Ambushers! Get their attention, quick. And get them away from me, so they cannot hit me with their devastating bananas!"]="Emboscadores Ilusórios! Provoque-os rapidamente e afaste-os de mim para que não me acertem com suas bananas devastadoras!"
G["Illusionary Flamecallers! Watch your feet, everyone. Do not stand in the lava."]="Arautos das Chamas Ilusórios! Olhem onde pisam! Não fiquem na lava!"
G["Illusionary Foragers are attacking. Do not let their cute faces fool you. They can work together to cause terrible devastation."]="Forrageadores Ilusórios atacando! Não deixe que seus rostinhos lindos iludam você, eles trabalham juntos pra causar muito dano."
G["Illusionary Hive-Singers! Their sonic waves will harm us all."]="Illusionary Hive-Singers! Their sonic waves will harm us all."
G["Illusionary Rippers approaching. They should pose little challenge; they are but mindless grunts."]="Estripadores Ilusórios chegando. Não são muito difíceis. São só brutos desmiolados."
G["Illusionary Varmints come in packs, and are harmless. Use attacks that affect multiple opponents to kill them quickly."]="Illusionary Varmints come in packs, and are harmless. Use attacks that affect multiple opponents to kill them quickly."
G["Illyanna, why do you spurn me? I would weave a web to catch the sun, if you were to ask me to do so!"]="Illyanna, why do you spurn me? I would weave a web to catch the sun, if you were to ask me to do so!"
G["Ilyenia Moonfire, the night elf weapon master on the Warrior's Terrace in Darnassus, or Buliwyf, the dwarf weapon master within the Timberline Arms in Ironforge, can train you in the use of fist weapons."]="Ilyenia Moonfire, o mestre de armas dos elfos noturnos no Terraço do Guerreiro em Darnassus, ou Buliwyf, o mestre de armas dos anões da Timberline Arms em Ironforge, pode treiná-o no uso de armas de punho."
G["Ilyenia Moonfire, the night elf weapon master who resides at the Warrior's Terrace in Darnassus, can show ye how to use a bow."]="Ilyenia Moonfire, o mestre das armas dos elfos noturnos que reside no Terraço do Guerreiro em Darnassus, pode mostrar como usar um arco."
G["Ilyenia Moonfire, the night elf weapon master who resides at the Warrior's Terrace in Darnassus, can train you in the use of bows."]="Ilyenia Moonfire, o mestre das armas dos elfos noturnos que reside no Terraço do Guerreiro em Darnassus, pode treiná-o no uso de arcos."
G["Im... impossible! Tharon'ja is eternal! Tharon'ja... is...."]="Im... possível! Tharon'ja é eterno! Tharon'ja... é..."
G["Im... possible..."]="Im... possível..."
