G["Imposter!  It is a dishonor without equal to be summoned by a whelp such as you!  DIE!"]="Imposter!  It is a dishonor without equal to be summoned by a whelp such as you!  DIE!"
G["Impostor must be dealt with. The Inventor's Disk must be recovered."]="Impostor must be dealt with. The Inventor's Disk must be recovered."
G["Impressive skills indeed.  I believe that you are more than ready for the rank of valiant."]="Impressive skills indeed.  I believe that you are more than ready for the rank of valiant."
G["Impressive!"]="Impressionante!"
G["Impressive!  You learn quickly, my pupil."]="Impressionante! Aprendes rápido, $gaprendiz: aprendiza;."
G["Impressive! I'm going to have to watch out for you."]="Impressive! I'm going to have to watch out for you."
G["Impressive, $r.\n\nThanks to you, these creatures may turn out to be valuable allies."]="Impressionante, $r.\n\nObrigado você, estas criaturas se podem converter em valiosos aliados."
G["Impressive, aren't they? These giants would be the perfect fodd... er, allies.  This one is their leader, but he continues to refuse to speak with me."]="Impressionantes, não são? Esses gigantes seriam o alimento perfeito... aliados. Este é o líder deles, mas ele continua se recusando a falar comigo."
G["Impressive, death knight. Return to me in the world of the living for your reward."]="Impressionante, cavaleiro da Morte. Volta a me ver no mundo dos vivos para obter seu recompensa."
G["Impressive, very impressive. Does she do tricks?"]="Impressionante, mesmo impressionante. Acaso sabe fazer truques?"
G["Impressive."]="Impressionante."
G["Impressive.  When do we attack?"]="Impressionante. Quando atacamos?"
G["Impressive. But can you handle this?"]="Impressive. But can you handle this?"
G["Impressive. Complete domination of the animal while it's weakened."]="Impressionante. Uma dominação total do animal enquanto está enfraquecido."
G["Impressive. I hadn't anticipated that."]="Impressionante. Eu não previa isso."
G["Impressive. The master said that you and your people would be a nuisance. No matter, your end draws near. Soon the combined might of Naxxramas will come down upon this place and shatter your meager existence."]="Impressive. The master said that you and your people would be a nuisance. No matter, your end draws near. Soon the combined might of Naxxramas will come down upon this place and shatter your meager existence."
G["Impressive. You have managed to destroy one of my most horrific creations, a task I had thought impossible until now."]="Impressive. You have managed to destroy one of my most horrific creations, a task I had thought impossible until now."
G["Impressive... Most impressive."]="Impressionante... Muito impressionante."
G["Imps, flamekin, whatever!  I don't know warlock crap.  Demons all look the same to me!"]="Imps, flamekin, whatever!  I don't know warlock crap.  Demons all look the same to me!"
G["Impudent fool! I will kill you myself!"]="Impudent fool! I will kill you myself!"
G["Impudent outsiders!"]="Forasteiros insolentes!"
G["Impudent pup!"]="Filhote insolente!"
G["Impudent whelps! You've rushed headlong to your own deaths! See now, the master stirs!"]="Impudent whelps! You've rushed headlong to your own deaths! See now, the master stirs!"
G["Impudent whelps, you only delay the inevitable. Where one has fallen, ten shall rise. Such is the will of Kazzak..."]="Impudent whelps, you only delay the inevitable. Where one has fallen, ten shall rise. Such is the will of Kazzak..."
G["Impure thoughts lead to profane actions."]="Impure thoughts lead to profane actions."
G["Impurity! Your fragile flesh defiles my work."]="Impurezas! Seu carne frágil mancilha meu trabalho."
G["In 20 minutes High Tinker Mekkatorque will tap the Brewfest Keg!"]="In 20 minutes High Tinker Mekkatorque will tap the Brewfest Keg!"
