G["In Alterac Valley, battles rage and equipment is in short supply."]="No Vale Alterac, a raiva e o equipamento das batalhas são escassos."
G["In Azshara's name!"]="Em nome de Azshara!"
G["In Azshara's name."]="Em nome de Azshara."
G["In Chellan's small but serviceable inn, you can find the priest Guvan."]="Na pequena mas útil estalagem de Chellan, você pode encontrar o para Guvan."
G["In Nagrand, food hunt ogre!"]="Em Nagrand, a comida caçar a ogro!"
G["In Outland, lunch open prison for you! What a world! Time to eat!"]="Em TerrAlém, comida grátis na prisão! Que mundo! Hora de comer!"
G["In Outland, our forces fight against the Horde to control the Eye of the Storm. It is dangerous, fighting amidst the raging energies of the Nether. Do you have what it takes to join us?"]="Em TerrAlém, nossas forças lutam contra a Horda para controlar o Olho da Tormenta. É perigoso, lutando entre as energias furiosas do Nether. Você tem o que é preciso para se juntar a nós?"
G["In Sargeras' name!"]="no nome de Sargeras!"
G["In Terokk's name!"]="no nome de Terokk!"
G["In Thundermar the tales proclaimed"]="Em Bramal se conta a história"
G["In Tina's words, you are her bestie. She'd probably love a visit to your farm."]="Conforme Tina, é seu melhor $gamigo: amiga;. Certamente lhe encantará visitar seu fazenda."
G["In War Quarter inner ring. She drunk lots."]="Em cinto interior do Bairro da Guerra. Bebe muito."
G["In a different time and place I would've been considered but a youngling.  Here I am a seasoned combatant ready to live and die for the glory of the naaru.\n\nTen of us went into Manaforge Ara.  All the others fell to the Legion."]="Em outro tempo e em outro lugar haveria banido considerado como um filhote. E aqui estou agora; um lutador com experiência e pronto para morrer pela glória dos naarus.\n\nDez de entre nós chegaram a Forja de Mana Ara. Os mais cayeron ante a Legião."
G["In a flash, you'll be nothing more than dust..."]="Em um inh'tante, não serão mais que poeira..."
G["In a place called Feralas to the west of here, the hippogryphs, long-time companions of the night elves, are in danger.\n\nI need you to rescue an egg from the ruins of Isildien, to the south, there. The Super Egg-O-Matic can analyze any egg brought to it and judge if it is likely to hatch. I then send the eggs along to the druids, safe from the Gordunni ogres' dark magics.\n\nPlease know, $n, some of the rescued eggs are bad eggs, and will never hatch."]="In a place called Feralas to the west of here, the hippogryphs, long-time companions of the night elves, are in danger.\n\nI need you to rescue an egg from the ruins of Isildien, to the south, there. The Super Egg-O-Matic can analyze any egg brought to it and judge if it is likely to hatch. I then send the eggs along to the druids, safe from the Gordunni ogres' dark magics.\n\nPlease know, $n, some of the rescued eggs are bad eggs, and will never hatch."
G["In a real race, you will need to fly through each checkered flag to get credit for passing the checkpoint."]="In a real race, you will need to fly through each checkered flag to get credit for passing the checkpoint."
G["In a word, magic.\n\nIrresponsible mortals with their brief lifespans think nothing of the lasting effects of their actions.\n\nArcane energies have been tapped too liberally, disrupting the world's balance. If this is allowed to continue, Azeroth will soon be annihilated.\n\nOn this, both sides agree. But before a council could even be appointed, Malygos put his own plan into action.\n\nWe had no choice but to confront him."]="In a word, magic.\n\nIrresponsible mortals with their brief lifespans think nothing of the lasting effects of their actions.\n\nArcane energies have been tapped too liberally, disrupting the world's balance. If this is allowed to continue, Azeroth will soon be annihilated.\n\nOn this, both sides agree. But before a council could even be appointed, Malygos put his own plan into action.\n\nWe had no choice but to confront him."
G["In a word? No."]="Em uma palavra? Não."
G["In accordance with my divine calling, I must share these revealed truths to all who would hear."]="In accordance with my divine calling, I must share these revealed truths to all who would hear."
G["In addition, my analysis links each elder to an increase in Freya's spellcasting, physical, or summoning capabilities."]="In addition, my analysis links each elder to an increase in Freya's spellcasting, physical, or summoning capabilities."
G["In ages long past, aspiring heroes and emperors came here to face the tests of the August Celestials.\nJust as our ancestors watched over the passage of those time-honored proceedings, so shall we.\nThe Celestial Guard will brook no faction squabbles in this sacred place."]="In ages long past, aspiring heroes and emperors came here to face the tests of the August Celestials.\nJust as our ancestors watched over the passage of those time-honored proceedings, so shall we.\nThe Celestial Guard will brook no faction squabbles in this sacred place."
G["In ages past, Eldre'Thalas was a nexus of magical power, and those who dwelt within its hallowed halls wielded immense power.  One such night elf was Millicent Serene - a naturalist who willed the power of nature itself into potent artifacts she forged.\n\nThe Fruit of Fertility was her crowning achievement... she used a specially prepared moonwell to grow an exotic and vibrant vine that was imbued with an aura of protection and growth.  All of Eldre'Thalas flourished from its existence."]="In ages past, Eldre'Thalas was a nexus of magical power, and those who dwelt within its hallowed halls wielded immense power.  One such night elf was Millicent Serene - a naturalist who willed the power of nature itself into potent artifacts she forged.\n\nThe Fruit of Fertility was her crowning achievement... she used a specially prepared moonwell to grow an exotic and vibrant vine that was imbued with an aura of protection and growth.  All of Eldre'Thalas flourished from its existence."
G["In agreement, Alexstrasza also refused Staghelm, and without her blessing, Teldrassil's growth has been flawed and unpredictable."]="In agreement, Alexstrasza also refused Staghelm, and without her blessing, Teldrassil's growth has been flawed and unpredictable."
G["In all my days, $r, I've never seen such a thing..."]="Em toda minha vida, $r, não vi nada parecido..."
G["In all my years I never expected to see the Zandalari."]="Mais na vida pensei que vería aos Zandalari."
G["In all my years, I have never seen the Sha so active as when your soldiers landed on our shores."]="Em toda minha vida não havia visto aos sha tão ativos como quando chegaram seus soldados a nossas costas."
G["In all of my centuries, I never dreamed that it would come to this."]="In all of my centuries, I never dreamed that it would come to this."
G["In all of my days I never thought to see such a magnificent new frontier.\n\nIf only it weren't tainted by evil and knowledge which is best left hidden."]="In all of my days I never thought to see such a magnificent new frontier.\n\nIf only it weren't tainted by evil and knowledge which is best left hidden."
G["In an ancient time, the spirits of the people dimmed and the land grew cold."]="In an ancient time, the spirits of the people dimmed and the land grew cold."
G["In an effort to regain immortality for our people, and with the approval of the Circle, Staghelm and the most powerful druids grew Teldrassil, upon whose boughs you now stand."]="In an effort to regain immortality for our people, and with the approval of the Circle, Staghelm and the most powerful druids grew Teldrassil, upon whose boughs you now stand."
G["In an hour's time, their precious city will be nothin' but ASH."]="In an hour's time, their precious city will be nothin' but ASH."
G["In building of War Quarter on outer ring of city."]="No edifício do War Quarter no anel externo da cidade."
G["In caring for the spirits and bringing them back among us, we can heal the land, and we can find understanding of the greater threats at hand."]="In caring for the spirits and bringing them back among us, we can heal the land, and we can find understanding of the greater threats at hand."
G["In case it wasn't obvious, I'm not here for customer relations."]="Ouvidos não fosse óbvio, não estou aqui para o relacionamento com o cliente."
G["In case you wonder, wasp sting not feel so good. No need to try."]="In case you wonder, wasp sting not feel so good. No need to try."
G["In coming here, you have made a grave mistake. These tournament grounds are a bastion of the Light, and your power cannot match it."]="Vocês têm cometido um grave erro ao vir aqui. Estes Campos do Torneio são um Bastião da Luz e seu poder não pode hacerle linha de frente."
G["In days long past, we lived for the hunt.  We hunted for glory, for honor...\n\nIs it so different now?"]="Em tempos remotos, vivíamos para a caça. A caça de glória, de honra... \n\nÉ que agora é tão diferente?"
G["In death we are brothers."]="na morte somos irmãos."
G["In death, all is forgiven..."]="In death, all is forgiven..."
G["In death, the animals of the world bestow both life and protection unto us.  If you feel that you can offer the appropriate respect for their sacrifice, then the skinner's profession may suit you.  Speak with Eladriel in the Craftsman's Terrace in northern Darnassus to learn more."]="Na morte, os animais do mundo nos conferem vida e proteção. Se você acha que pode oferecer o respeito apropriado pelo sacrifício deles, então a profissão do esfolador pode atender você. Fale com Eladriel no Terraço do Artesão, no norte de Darnassus, para saber mais."
G["In death, the animals of the world bestow both life and protection unto us.  If you feel that you can offer the appropriate respect for their sacrifice, then the skinner's profession may suit you.  Speak with Eladriel in the Craftsmen's Terrace in northern Darnassus to learn more."]="Na morte, os animais do mundo nos conferem vida e proteção. Se você acha que pode oferecer o respeito apropriado pelo sacrifício deles, então a profissão do esfolador pode atender você. Fale com Eladriel no Terraço dos Artesãos, no norte de Darnassus, para saber mais."
G["In death, they were reborn as mindless undead."]="In death, they were reborn as mindless undead."
G["In death, we are reborn."]="Na morte, nós renascemos."
G["In decades past - of now ancient wars and conflicts - our kind was driven to the brink of extinction. Much we have endured, $r.\n\nThe onslaught of the Burning Legion. The Demon Soul. The Aspects divided. The ascension of Deathwing. The enslavement of our Queen, Alexstrasza, by the Dragonmaw.\n\nThrough it all, we have been the unshakable will of the dragons - the undaunted force that has fought to represent our waning existence in this world."]="In decades past - of now ancient wars and conflicts - our kind was driven to the brink of extinction. Much we have endured, $r.\n\nThe onslaught of the Burning Legion. The Demon Soul. The Aspects divided. The ascension of Deathwing. The enslavement of our Queen, Alexstrasza, by the Dragonmaw.\n\nThrough it all, we have been the unshakable will of the dragons - the undaunted force that has fought to represent our waning existence in this world."
G["In defeating him, $g he : she; and $g his : her; fighting companions have proven themselves worthy of battle in this most sacred place of vrykul honor."]="In defeating him, $g he : she; and $g his : her; fighting companions have proven themselves worthy of battle in this most sacred place of vrykul honor."
G["In dreams, we may overcome any obstacle!"]="In dreams, we may overcome any obstacle!"
G["In due course. There is no rush, after all - our hospitality is extended to you indefinitely. Even the troll."]="In due course. There is no rush, after all - our hospitality is extended to you indefinitely. Even the troll."
G["In due time, Helcular... All in due time..."]="Ao seu devido tempo, Helcolar... Tudo ao seu devido tempo..."
G["In due time, Maiev.  I've spent years preparing to make my move - I can't afford to put my plans in peril by tipping my hand too soon."]="In due time, Maiev.  I've spent years preparing to make my move - I can't afford to put my plans in peril by tipping my hand too soon."
G["In exchange for one Sulfuron Ingot, I am authorized to grant you one copy of the plans to forge a Sulfuron hammer.\n\nNow an adventurer like yourself is probably thinking to $g himself:herself;, \"What would I ever need a hammer like that for when what I already own is far superior?\"\n\nWell let me tell you something, $g mister:missy;, there ain't nothing more superior than what the Sulfuron hammer can become!"]="In exchange for one Sulfuron Ingot, I am authorized to grant you one copy of the plans to forge a Sulfuron hammer.\n\nNow an adventurer like yourself is probably thinking to $g himself:herself;, \"What would I ever need a hammer like that for when what I already own is far superior?\"\n\nWell let me tell you something, $g mister:missy;, there ain't nothing more superior than what the Sulfuron hammer can become!"
G["In fact, I'll go see about those gears right now!"]="In fact, I'll go see about those gears right now!"
G["In fact, anyone who can grow such a perfect vegetable needs to be a Tiller, which is why I'm voting you in."]="In fact, anyone who can grow such a perfect vegetable needs to be a Tiller, which is why I'm voting you in."
G["In fact, it really only serves to scare off the worgen from trying to follow us in here. It's completely harmless."]="In fact, it really only serves to scare off the worgen from trying to follow us in here. It's completely harmless."
G["In fact, it would be best if you just stay here. You'd only get in my way...."]="De feito, seria melhor que te quedaras aqui. Somente me estorbarías..."
G["In fact, let's see some more of that fancy walkin'... Move it!"]="In fact, let's see some more of that fancy walkin'... Move it!"
G["In good time, my pandaren friend. In good time."]="Ao seu devido tempo, amiga. Ao seu devido tempo."
G["In good time."]="Quando chegue o momentos."
G["In grizzly times a druid can be a dear friend to those around them.  Ask any of the druids in the Cenarion Enclave and they will tell you the same."]="Nos tempos de urso, um druida pode ser um amigo querido daqueles que os rodeiam. Pergunte a qualquer um dos druidas no Enclave Cenarion e eles dirão o mesmo."
G["In his mouth."]="De verdade."
G["In his vast cruelty, Arthas severed my spirit from my body and raised me as a banshee to serve in his Scourge army."]="In his vast cruelty, Arthas severed my spirit from my body and raised me as a banshee to serve in his Scourge army."
G["In honor of our benevolent ruler and protector, Matron Elestara Vashj.\n\nFor 100 years, she has faithfully sheltered us, protected us, and lead us steadily into a modern age of prosperity.\n\nUnder Queen Azshara's gaze, may she reign for 100 year more."]="In honor of our benevolent ruler and protector, Matron Elestara Vashj.\n\nFor 100 years, she has faithfully sheltered us, protected us, and lead us steadily into a modern age of prosperity.\n\nUnder Queen Azshara's gaze, may she reign for 100 year more."
G["In just 10 minutes High Tinker Mekkatorque will tap the Brewfest Keg!"]="In just 10 minutes High Tinker Mekkatorque will tap the Brewfest Keg!"
G["In life I had many cubs, and many grand cubs.  But none of my great grand cubs visit anymore.  Few remember with honor the great Windfur family lineage."]="In life I had many cubs, and many grand cubs.  But none of my great grand cubs visit anymore.  Few remember with honor the great Windfur family lineage."
G["In life we were hated enemies - this is true..."]="Em vida éramos inimigos; é certo..."
G["In life, Bridenbrad was the bearer of great deeds. Now, in passing, he shall taste only paradise."]="Em vida, Bridenbrad foi artífice de grandes façanhas. E agora, ao morrer, saboreará o único paraíso."
G["In life, I focused my energies on healing others. Let us see in death how much pain I can cause!"]="In life, I focused my energies on healing others. Let us see in death how much pain I can cause!"
G["In life, we suffered unspeakable tragedies."]="In life, we suffered unspeakable tragedies."
G["In my absence, I am instructing you, Garrosh Hellscream, to lead the Horde.  You have the strength and courage that our people need to survive in these trying times."]="In my absence, I am instructing you, Garrosh Hellscream, to lead the Horde.  You have the strength and courage that our people need to survive in these trying times."
G["In my absssence, my ssservantsss will... sssee to your needs."]="In my absssence, my ssservantsss will... sssee to your needs."
G["In my home town, the greatest gift one could give to a good friend was a tree.\n\nDo you know why?\n\nA tree represents peace, growth, and life. It is a blessing of friendship."]="Na minha terra, o melhor presente que se você pode fazer a um amigo é um árvore.\n\nSabe por que?\n\nO árvore representar a paz, o crecimento e a vida. É uma bênção da amizade."
G["In my time, this was a mogu stronghold. It was my honor to paint the walls with their blood."]="Na minha época, isto era um Bastião dos mogu. Foi uma honra pintar estes muros com o seu sangue."
G["In my travels I have learned the recipe for the Wispcloak.\n\nThis cloak is a tradeable Epic spellcasting cloak that grants Stamina, Spellpower, Intellect and Mana Recovery.   I am looking for someone worthy to teach this recipe to.\n\nSomeone who had completed all the normal dungeons of Northrend and had the \"Northrend Dungeonmaster\" achievement would be worthy of learning the recipe for the Wispcloak."]="In my travels I have learned the recipe for the Wispcloak.\n\nThis cloak is a tradeable Epic spellcasting cloak that grants Stamina, Spellpower, Intellect and Mana Recovery.   I am looking for someone worthy to teach this recipe to.\n\nSomeone who had completed all the normal dungeons of Northrend and had the \"Northrend Dungeonmaster\" achievement would be worthy of learning the recipe for the Wispcloak."
G["In my visions, negotiations with the enemy brought our people a fleeting peace... followed by terrible betrayal and destruction."]="In my visions, negotiations with the enemy brought our people a fleeting peace... followed by terrible betrayal and destruction."
G["In my years as a member of Explorers' League, I've been all over Azeroth, but I've never seen anythin' quite like Bloodmyst."]="In my years as a member of Explorers' League, I've been all over Azeroth, but I've never seen anythin' quite like Bloodmyst."
G["In my youth, my family did not approve of my interest in shamanism. Brash and foolish as I was, I ran away from them and practiced on my own.  Upon returning to my home one day, I found my parents gone. My home destroyed. They never found who did it.\nI've spent my life striving to extend my shamanistic visions to see into the past - to find out what happened to my family and who is responsible. I've come a great way. I've learned to focus in on impactful events in the recent past, but I have much further to go if I ever hope to glimpse something that occurred so long ago."]="In my youth, my family did not approve of my interest in shamanism. Brash and foolish as I was, I ran away from them and practiced on my own.  Upon returning to my home one day, I found my parents gone. My home destroyed. They never found who did it.\nI've spent my life striving to extend my shamanistic visions to see into the past - to find out what happened to my family and who is responsible. I've come a great way. I've learned to focus in on impactful events in the recent past, but I have much further to go if I ever hope to glimpse something that occurred so long ago."
G["In need of some alchemy supplies, are we?  Or do you have other business with me?"]="Precisando de algum suprimentos de alquimia, estamos? Ou você tem outros negócios comigo?"
G["In one corner we have... $n, truly a world class $c.  Slayer of reptiles, mammals, mechanical constructs and the odd dragon...kin.  You've never seen another $r like $g him : her;."]="In one corner we have... $n, truly a world class $c.  Slayer of reptiles, mammals, mechanical constructs and the odd dragon...kin.  You've never seen another $r like $g him : her;."
G["In order for this dream brew to show you what you seek, you must reach a place of inner harmony. I can show you how."]="In order for this dream brew to show you what you seek, you must reach a place of inner harmony. I can show you how."
G["In order to survive, you must fight."]="Deve lutar para poder sobreviver."
G["In our native tongue, \"Una'fe\" can be translated as \"Refuge.\" But the name no longer fits. From the moment we set up this camp, this strange jungle has threatened to engulf it."]="In our native tongue, \"Una'fe\" can be translated as \"Refuge.\" But the name no longer fits. From the moment we set up this camp, this strange jungle has threatened to engulf it."
G["In our travels, we have sung many songs, but there are many more songs to sing."]="In our travels, we have sung many songs, but there are many more songs to sing."
G["In paradise, you merely reach out and take from the Nether."]="no paraíso, simplesmente alargas a mão e tomas do Vazio."
G["In pieces three the mallet be. Handle, head and ointment. You ring the bell without the mallet? You going to get an ear and face full of evil."]="In pieces three the mallet be. Handle, head and ointment. You ring the bell without the mallet? You going to get an ear and face full of evil."
G["In position!"]="Em posição!"
G["In reality, she was obsessed with control. She aspired to stay in power long past her time, and was willing to sacrifice our eternal cycle to achieve that. We had no choice but to end her."]="In reality, she was obsessed with control. She aspired to stay in power long past her time, and was willing to sacrifice our eternal cycle to achieve that. We had no choice but to end her."
G["In return, he 'de-cursed' us, saying that we were being 'fixed' by returning us to the state of being mechanical constructs."]="In return, he 'de-cursed' us, saying that we were being 'fixed' by returning us to the state of being mechanical constructs."
G["In spite of our best efforts, the naga have attacked the breach!\n\nThe Plane of Water must be defended!"]="A pesar de nossos maiores esforços, os nagas têm atacado a ruptura!\n\nDevemos defendao plano de água!"
G["In spite of our losses here, Hellscream will be pleased to know that the naga general was defeated."]="In spite of our losses here, Hellscream will be pleased to know that the naga general was defeated."
G["In tha chaos of battle, it's tha balance of light and shadow that leads us ta victory."]="Nesse caos de batalha, é o equilíbrio de luz e sombra que nos leva à vitória."
G["In that moment, the Light revealed to me the truth of the terrible things I had done."]="In that moment, the Light revealed to me the truth of the terrible things I had done."
G["In the Celestial Tournament, either you win or you die."]="No Torneio Celestial, você vence ou morre."
G["In the Command Center, just outside of Old Town's southeast gates, you'll find the quartermasters."]="No Command Center, perto dos portões sudeste da Cidade Velha, você encontrará os contratantes."
G["In the King's audience chamber you will find the Lady Hoteshem.  She can assist you in getting to Arathi Basin where The League of Arathor is in need of assistance against The Defilers."]="Na sala de audiência do rei, você encontrará a Lady Hoteshem. Ela pode ajudá-o a chegar à Bacia Arathi, onde a Liga de Arathor precisa de assistência contra os Defilers."
G["In the Light we all cast shadows, my $g brother : sister;.  Do you seek further guidance today?"]="In the Light we all cast shadows, my $g brother : sister;.  Do you seek further guidance today?"
G["In the Plaguelands, Kel'thuzad was again defeated by the agents of the Argent Dawn. However, his phylactery was delivered to a false agent of the Brotherhood. We have yet to discover who stole his phylactery or why."]="nas Terras da Fedor, Kel'thuzad voltou a ser derrotou pelos agentes do Alba Argêntea. No entanto, seu filactério foi entregada a um falso agente da Guilda. Ainda temos que descobrir quem roubou seu filactério e por que."
G["In the Silverpine Forest along the edges of the North Tide's Run, a derelict boat rests on the shore.  Out to the west of this lies what you seek; swim too far and the ocean will crush you from fatigue.  It resides on the ocean floor in a lockbox, waiting for you to claim it.\n\nYou'll be hard pressed to survive a dive to such depths without aid, so take heart; a bubbly fissure offers renewed breath to divers seeking this half of the pendant.  Use it wisely."]="In the Silverpine Forest along the edges of the North Tide's Run, a derelict boat rests on the shore.  Out to the west of this lies what you seek; swim too far and the ocean will crush you from fatigue.  It resides on the ocean floor in a lockbox, waiting for you to claim it.\n\nYou'll be hard pressed to survive a dive to such depths without aid, so take heart; a bubbly fissure offers renewed breath to divers seeking this half of the pendant.  Use it wisely."
G["In the War Quarter is where you'll find the warriors. Head to the outer ring there."]="No War Quarter é onde você encontrará os guerreiros. Vá para o anel externo lá."
G["In the aftermath of Theramore, my first instinct was to decimate Orgrimmar - to kill every man woman and child in the city."]="Depois do que houve em Theramore, meu primeiro impulso foi dizimar Orgrimmar... matar cada homem, mulher e criança na cidade."
G["In the age of war, Razelikh the Defiler served as the most fearsome of Lord Kazzak's lieutenants. When the Legion was defeated and Kazzak forced back into the Tainted Scar, Razelikh was tasked by his master to secure the Blasted Lands.\n\nWhile the Alliance fought petty battles with the Horde over territory outside of the Blasted Lands, Razelikh was uniting the differing Shadow Council sects and the brutish Dreadmaul ogres of the land."]="In the age of war, Razelikh the Defiler served as the most fearsome of Lord Kazzak's lieutenants. When the Legion was defeated and Kazzak forced back into the Tainted Scar, Razelikh was tasked by his master to secure the Blasted Lands.\n\nWhile the Alliance fought petty battles with the Horde over territory outside of the Blasted Lands, Razelikh was uniting the differing Shadow Council sects and the brutish Dreadmaul ogres of the land."
G["In the ancient days before the sundering of the world, the mogu emperors ruled over Pandaria. My people were made slaves, and they were afraid."]="Nos dias antigos, antes da Cisão do mundo, os imperadores mogus governavam Pandária. Meu povo foi feito de escravo, e eles tinham medo."
G["In the chamber ahead, under our peaceful land, slept the heart of an Old God."]="na câmera seguinte, sob a pacífica terra, dormíao coração de um deus antigo."
G["In the curves of a tree, the colors of a sunrise, even in the perfect physical form of a warrior's exquisite swordwork."]="In the curves of a tree, the colors of a sunrise, even in the perfect physical form of a warrior's exquisite swordwork."
G["In the dancing glow, we see an empty bowl. We fill the bowl - it becomes our body. We rest."]="In the dancing glow, we see an empty bowl. We fill the bowl - it becomes our body. We rest."
G["In the darkest of times, it is often a patient spirit and a reassuring hand that carry the most value."]="nos tempos mais obscuros, a belo o espírito paciente e a mão firme são as qualidades mais valiosas."
G["In the dooker!"]="Em todos os mikos!"
G["In the eastern reaches of the Netherwing Fields lies Dragonmaw Fortress. It is there that the cruel Dragonmaw orc clan tortures the drakes that they capture in an attempt to bend them to their will. Many have given up hope, choosing instead to do the bidding of Dragonmaw. The others... They refuse to land for fear of Dragonmaw war parties capturing them and taking them back to the fortress."]="Nos confins do leste dos Campos Netherwing fica a Fortaleza Presa do Dragão. É aí que o cruel clã Orca Presa do Dragão tortura os drakes que eles capturam na tentativa de dobrá-os à sua vontade. Muitos desistiram da esperança, optando por fazer o lance de Presa do Dragão. Os outros... Eles se recusam a pousar por medo de que os grupos de guerra Presa do Dragão os capturem e os levem de volta à fortaleza."
G["In the end, I stood by the warchief, because it was my duty, and I am glad that it was you who struck me down. May your strength... lead the horde... into a new era of prosperity..."]="Ao fim fui fiel ao Chefe de Guerra porque era meu dever, e fico feliz em que me derrotarais vocês. Que sua força... leve à Horda... cima uma nova era de prosperidade."
G["In the end, only silence remains."]="In the end, only silence remains."
G["In the end, we will all be together, sweetheart."]="Ao fim, todos estaremos juntos, céu."
G["In the end, you will all serve me."]="Ao fim, todos me servirão."
G["In the event of an uprising, we must be prepared."]="Se se desata a insurrecção, devemos estar preparados."
G["In the face of great fear, the Black Ox taught me fortitude. Through terror and darkness it persevered. The fear was vanquished."]="Diante de um grande temor, o Boi Negro me ensinou fortitude. Fui perseverante diante do terror e da escuridão, e o medo foi vencido."
G["In the face of this cataclysm, I've seen how truly fleeting our lives can be. And I, for one, will not waste another second of mine."]="In the face of this cataclysm, I've seen how truly fleeting our lives can be. And I, for one, will not waste another second of mine."
G["In the gut!"]="nas entranhas!"
G["In the land of Ny'alotha there is only sleep."]="na terra de Ny'alotha somente existe o sonho."
G["In the last war, tauren fought. Shaman were sent in defense of this world against the Scourge invasion. Most lost their lives. Many were otherwise ripped asunder, their body parts used for foul experiments in that cursed citadel. I mourn their passing but my heart swells with pride at their courage."]="Na última guerra, tauren lutou. Xamãs foram enviados em defesa deste mundo contra a invasão do Flagelo. A maioria perdeu a vida. Muitos foram despedaçados, suas partes do corpo foram usadas para experimentos sujos naquela maldita cidadela. Eu lamento a morte deles, mas meu coração se enche de orgulho pela sua coragem."
G["In the middle of the pipe?"]="In the middle of the pipe?"
G["In the name of Illidan!"]="Em nome de Illidan!"
G["In the name of Kil'jaeden!"]="no nome de Kil'jaeden!"
G["In the name of Sylvanas, the Banshee Queen, I bestow this gift upon you!"]="Em nome de Sylvanas, a Rainha alma em pena, te concedo este don!"
G["In the name of Warchief Garrosh, hold the line!"]="In the name of Warchief Garrosh, hold the line!"
G["In the name of our dark master. For the Lich King. You. Will. Die."]="no nome de nosso sombrio mestre. pelo Rei Lich. Morrerá."
G["In the name of the Kirin Tor!"]="no nome do Kirin Tor!"
G["In the name of the Lich King."]="no nome do Rei Lich"
G["In the name of the Light!"]="Em nome da Luz"
G["In the name of the Light! It is Light that commands you! It is Light that flung you to the depths of darkness!"]="Em nome da Luz! É a Luz quem te ordena! É a Luz quem te arrojó às profundezas da Escuridão!"
G["In the name of the Thunder King!"]="no nome do Rei do Trovão!"
G["In the nature of all things is the will to survive."]="Na natureza de todas as coisas está a vontade de sobreviver."
G["In the northeastern Barrens lies a pool of water sickened by pollution.  The locals call it the Sludge Fen; the Venture Company has turned the once crystal-blue waters into a mire of industrial byproducts and waste.  In the heart of this fen lies what you seek, $n.\n\nBe warned - the Venture Company does not tolerate trespassers, and they consider anyone who does not work for them as such.  You'll especially be a target as a protector of nature, something they vehemently oppose."]="In the northeastern Barrens lies a pool of water sickened by pollution.  The locals call it the Sludge Fen; the Venture Company has turned the once crystal-blue waters into a mire of industrial byproducts and waste.  In the heart of this fen lies what you seek, $n.\n\nBe warned - the Venture Company does not tolerate trespassers, and they consider anyone who does not work for them as such.  You'll especially be a target as a protector of nature, something they vehemently oppose."
G["In the northern part of Darkshore runs the Cliffspring River, flowing down from the lands now known as Felwood.  As the river flows out and empties out into the Mist's Edge, travel north to where the deepest parts of the ocean begin.  A stone formation that some call the Stone Claw due to its shape is where you may find what you seek.\n\nBe warned - threshers gather by the Stone Claw, and will attack those who trespass on their territory."]="In the northern part of Darkshore runs the Cliffspring River, flowing down from the lands now known as Felwood.  As the river flows out and empties out into the Mist's Edge, travel north to where the deepest parts of the ocean begin.  A stone formation that some call the Stone Claw due to its shape is where you may find what you seek.\n\nBe warned - threshers gather by the Stone Claw, and will attack those who trespass on their territory."
G["In the other corner, a serial killer, mass defenestrator, sentenced to death multiple times by noose and by blunt instrument!  Horgrenn... Hellcleave!  Ladies and gentlemen... place your bets!"]="In the other corner, a serial killer, mass defenestrator, sentenced to death multiple times by noose and by blunt instrument!  Horgrenn... Hellcleave!  Ladies and gentlemen... place your bets!"
G["In the other corner, we have Vian, the flame-flinging follower of the Thunder King!"]="na outra esquina está Vian, o flamígero seguidor do Rei do Trovão!"
G["In the other corner... a disgusting green pile of goblin idiocy, riding on a lumbering chariot of shame. It's Fran and Riddoh! Everybody boo!"]="In the other corner... a disgusting green pile of goblin idiocy, riding on a lumbering chariot of shame. It's Fran and Riddoh! Everybody boo!"
G["In the other corner... hey look! It's my buddy, Fran! And he brought his mount with him!"]="na outra esquina... Olhem! É meu colega Fran! E se tem trazido ao seu montaria!"
G["In the pipe, 5 by 5!"]="no poste, 5 a 5!"
G["In the process of translating this, I believe I've learned more about the drunken exploits of a certain 'Andrew Clementine' than about the journal's author."]="In the process of translating this, I believe I've learned more about the drunken exploits of a certain 'Andrew Clementine' than about the journal's author."
G["In the sky! It approaches!"]="no céu! Se aproxima!"
G["In the sleeping city of Ny'alotha walk only mad things."]="In the sleeping city of Ny'alotha walk only mad things."
G["In the sunken city, he lays dreaming."]="In the sunken city, he lays dreaming."
G["In the throes of the Sundering, Ameth'Aran was at the whim of the terror that gripped the land. There was little hope for survival."]="In the throes of the Sundering, Ameth'Aran was at the whim of the terror that gripped the land. There was little hope for survival."
G["In the time before time, what the usurpers would later call the First Age of Creation, my master and his siblings ruled over this world. It was they, the Old Gods, who created all.\n\nAnd it was they who would ultimately be cast down by those that would call themselves Shapers."]="In the time before time, what the usurpers would later call the First Age of Creation, my master and his siblings ruled over this world. It was they, the Old Gods, who created all.\n\nAnd it was they who would ultimately be cast down by those that would call themselves Shapers."
G["In the time before time, when the world was still in its infancy, a battle between a Titan and a being of unimaginable evil and power raged on this very soil. The prophecy is unclear about whether or not the Titan was vanquished in this battle but it illustrates that a Titan fell. An Old God had also fallen - or so it was thought."]="In the time before time, when the world was still in its infancy, a battle between a Titan and a being of unimaginable evil and power raged on this very soil. The prophecy is unclear about whether or not the Titan was vanquished in this battle but it illustrates that a Titan fell. An Old God had also fallen - or so it was thought."
G["In the unlikely event of a water \"landing,\" please reach under your seat cushion where a cyanide capsule has been located for your convenience."]="In the unlikely event of a water \"landing,\" please reach under your seat cushion where a cyanide capsule has been located for your convenience."
G["In the unlikely event that a catastrophic failure does not instantly kill everyone aboard..."]="no atenção pouco provável de que um falho catastrófico não mate instantaneamente a todos os passageiros..."
G["In the void, no one can hear you scream!"]="no vazio, ninguém te poderá ouvir gritar!"
G["In the whispering waters, they can hear the future."]="Nas águas murmurantes eles ouvem o futuro."
G["In their hubris, the mogu never foresaw that their downfall lay in wait, not among their enemies, but among the oppressed. The day that one slave stood..."]="Em sua audácia, os mogus nunca imaginaram a queda que os esperava, nem que ela seria causada não por seus inimigos, e sim pelos oprimidos. O dia em que um escravo se revoltou..."
G["In their initial assault, I caught a glimpse of their true leader, a fearsome full-grown twilight dragon."]="no ataque inicial, pude ver ao seu verdadeiro líder, um temible dragão Crepúsculo adulto."
G["In theory, these crystals are natural insulators. They should absorb most of the lightning strikes in the area."]="In theory, these crystals are natural insulators. They should absorb most of the lightning strikes in the area."
G["In these trying times, a simple donation of cloth can go a long way to help those less fortunate than ourselves.  Cloth goes a long way to making garments and bandages - both important for the war effort!\n\nIf you are interested in donating cloth pieces to the orcs of Orgrimmar, I will gladly accept them and make sure you receive the proper recognition for doing so.\n\nFor the Horde!"]="In these trying times, a simple donation of cloth can go a long way to help those less fortunate than ourselves.  Cloth goes a long way to making garments and bandages - both important for the war effort!\n\nIf you are interested in donating cloth pieces to the orcs of Orgrimmar, I will gladly accept them and make sure you receive the proper recognition for doing so.\n\nFor the Horde!"
G["In this dream, I was fishin' master of the world. I moved to some place called Kalimdor..."]="In this dream, I was fishin' master of the world. I moved to some place called Kalimdor..."
G["In this place, darkness and shadows are tools to be used and disposed of at will."]="Neste lugar, a escuridão e as sombras são ferramentas que você pode usar ao seu vontade."
G["In this place? Are... are you sure?"]="Neste lugar? Está certo?"
G["In this trial, you will not be allowed to heal your pets.  One of the marks of a great leader is the ability to lead many subjects from many backgrounds, united under one banner."]="In this trial, you will not be allowed to heal your pets.  One of the marks of a great leader is the ability to lead many subjects from many backgrounds, united under one banner."
G["In this world where time is your enemy, it is my greatest ally. This grand game of life that you think you play in fact plays you. To that I say..."]="Neste mundo ondo tempo é seu inimigo, é meu maior aliado. Este grande jogo da vida O que acha jogar, em realidade joga com você. E eu digo..."
G["In those years - where strife filled the land as Legion and Scourge sacked our homes, killed our families - these insects dwelled beneath us. Beneath our homes - waiting."]="In those years - where strife filled the land as Legion and Scourge sacked our homes, killed our families - these insects dwelled beneath us. Beneath our homes - waiting."
G["In thousands of years, we have never seen one of your kind."]="Em milhares de anos, nunca tínhamos visto um da sua raça."
G["In time you will be ready for what I have to teach, $n. Until then, please ask Darianna over there to help you with your training."]="Pronto terá o suficiente conhecimento como para aprender o que tenho que ensinar, $n. Até então, pídele a Darianna que te ajude com o seu treinamento."
G["In time, the light and hope held within - will rebirth more than this mere fount of power... Mayhap, they will rebirth the soul of a nation."]="In time, the light and hope held within - will rebirth more than this mere fount of power... Mayhap, they will rebirth the soul of a nation."
G["In time, we will again require the assistance of the mortals. Across this world our birthright is shattered. It will be the mortal races that help us regain our rightful place on Draenor. Watch over them, Mordenaku..."]="In time, we will again require the assistance of the mortals. Across this world our birthright is shattered. It will be the mortal races that help us regain our rightful place on Draenor. Watch over them, Mordenaku..."
G["In time, we will rebuild this place and restore it to its former glory - minus all of the annoying humans."]="Com o tempo, reconstruiremos este lugar e restaurá-o à sua antiga glória - menos todos os humanos irritantes."
G["In time, you may learn to see through their deceptions."]="In time, you may learn to see through their deceptions."
G["In time, you too shall do our bidding just as the demons serve us."]="In time, you too shall do our bidding just as the demons serve us."
G["In times such as these, dear friends are invaluable.\n\nBe safe, $n. As safe as one can be in a place like this...."]="Em momentos como este, os amigos de verdade são muito valiosos.\n\nMantenha-se a salvou, $n. Tão a salvou como se possa estar em um lugar como este..."
G["In weeks past, all of those living atop Teldrassil have found their memories blurry, as if time itself seized a portion of their lives."]="In weeks past, all of those living atop Teldrassil have found their memories blurry, as if time itself seized a portion of their lives."
G["In years past, the warlock Nekros Skullcrusher abused a powerful artifact to enslave Alexstrasza and much of the red dragonflight.  Zuluhed and Nekros are dead, but the debt we owe to the reds is far from repaid."]="No passado, o feiticeiro Nekros Skullcrusher abusou de um poderoso artefato para escravizar Alexstrasza e grande parte do voo vermelho do dragão. Zuluhed e Nekros estão mortos, mas a dívida que devemos aos vermelhos está longe de ser paga."
G["In your face!"]="Toma essa!"
G["In your jealousy, you condemn him and dispatch him to your secret prison.  Just as eagerly as you did your own brother."]="In your jealousy, you condemn him and dispatch him to your secret prison.  Just as eagerly as you did your own brother."
G["In your land, is it true that healers accompany warriors onto the battlefield? If only I had better tools, perhaps I could do the same."]="In your land, is it true that healers accompany warriors onto the battlefield? If only I had better tools, perhaps I could do the same."
G["In your rush to glory, you assumed that the pace of the game revolved around your actions. Can you even fathom how preposterous that sounds to a being like me? A being that if so inclined could cause your own insignificant thoughts to crush the peanut sized mass of grey matter floating within your skull."]="In your rush to glory, you assumed that the pace of the game revolved around your actions. Can you even fathom how preposterous that sounds to a being like me? A being that if so inclined could cause your own insignificant thoughts to crush the peanut sized mass of grey matter floating within your skull."
G["Inbound $r!"]="$r que chega!"
G["Including me?"]="Eu inclusive?"
G["Including the Amani?"]="Incluyendo aos Amani?"
G["Incoming $c!"]="Incoming $c!"
G["Incoming $n - look sharp, friends!"]="Incoming $n - look sharp, friends!"
G["Incoming $r flier! Shoot $g him : her; down!"]="Incoming $r flier! Shoot $g him : her; down!"
G["Incoming $r!"]="$r a ponto de chegar!"
G["Incoming aerial support to Dun Baldar! Stormpike bow down!"]="Apoio aéreo entrante a Dun Baldar! Pico Tempestade, doblegaos!"
G["Incoming blast in 10 seconds!"]="Explosão prevista em 10 segundos!"
G["Incoming blast in 5 seconds. Clear the tunnel! Stay back!"]="Incoming blast in 5 seconds. Clear the tunnel! Stay back!"
