G["Incoming survivor!"]="Superviviente entrando!"
G["Incoming!"]="Vêm!"
G["Incoming!  Get back down the pass!"]="Incoming!  Get back down the pass!"
G["Incoming!  Get your heads down!"]="Incoming!  Get your heads down!"
G["Incoming! Horde incoming - Look out behind you, $n!"]="Vêm! Vem a Horda! Cuidado, por trás de ti, $n!"
G["Incoming."]="Incoming."
G["Incompetent fools!  Auchindoun should've been ours... look at yourselves scrambling like rats!"]="Incompetent fools!  Auchindoun should've been ours... look at yourselves scrambling like rats!"
G["Incompetent fools!  Why must we suffer your stupidity?"]="Tonto incompetentes! Por que tenho que sofrer sua gracinha?"
G["Incompetent fools, summon faster!"]="Incompetent fools, summon faster!"
G["Incompetent, sniveling dandy."]="Incompetent, sniveling dandy."
G["Inconceivable!"]="Incrível!"
G["Inconceivable! He couldn't possibly be alive!"]="Inconcebible! Não pode seguir com vida!"
G["Inconceivable! You may actually defeat my lava worm! Perhaps I can help... tip the scales."]="Inconceivable! You may actually defeat my lava worm! Perhaps I can help... tip the scales."
G["Incorrect!"]="Incorreto!"
G["Increase your profit potential with Butcherbot!"]="Aumentao potencial dos seus benefícios com Robocarnicero!"
G["Incredible power can be found in the spirits or \"muisek\" of the creatures that we battle against.\n\nLook inside yourself; learn to harness the power of your own spirit, and you will be more powerful than you ever imagined."]="Se você pode encontrar um incrível poder nos espíritos ou \"muisec\" das criaturas contra as que lutamos.\n\nOlhe no seu interior, aprenda a canalizar o poder do seu próprio espírito e será mais $gpoderoso: poderosa; do que mais tenha pedido imaginar."
G["Incredible shooting! I'll try to calm the animals down. Report to Thork, he will want to know of this attack."]="Incredible shooting! I'll try to calm the animals down. Report to Thork, he will want to know of this attack."
G["Incredible story. So how did he die?"]="Uma história incrível. Então, como morreu?"
G["Incredible work. I knew the Shado-Pan would make excellent allies."]="Incredible work. I knew the Shado-Pan would make excellent allies."
G["Incredible!"]="Incrível!"
G["Incredible!  I know he who wrought these enchantments..."]="Incrível! Sei quem fabricó estes encantamentos..."
G["Incredible! Amazing! I don't even know what this means!"]="Incrível! Surpreendente! Eu nem sei o que isso significa!"
G["Incredible! Few assassins would be clever enough to infiltrate Nalice's wards and use her own magic against her."]="Incredible! Few assassins would be clever enough to infiltrate Nalice's wards and use her own magic against her."
G["Incredible. How did Sironas accomplish such a thing?"]="Incrível. Como Sironas conseguiu tal coisa?"
G["Incredible. Your potions display a knowledge that rivals my own. I cannot train you further, but talk to the orc Rogvar of Stonard in the Swamp of Sorrows. He's known for his cutting-edge experiments."]="Incrível. Suas poções exibem um conhecimento que rivaliza com o meu. Não posso treiná-o mais, mas fale com o orc Rogvar de Stonard, no Pântano das Dores. Ele é conhecido pelas suas experiências de ponta."
G["Indeed I am, child.  And do you remember what you showed me in those dreams?"]="Indeed I am, child.  And do you remember what you showed me in those dreams?"
G["Indeed you have, mon. Our stores of blight crystals be nearly sufficient!"]="Na verdade você tem, mon. Nossas lojas de cristais de ferrugem são quase suficientes!"
G["Indeed!"]="Isso é!"
G["Indeed! And how do you find the Commander, friend?"]="Já o acho! E que pensa do Comandante, amigo?"
G["Indeed! Magni will be so happy to see you too! He's gotten nothing but bad news for a long while now, but this changes everything!"]="Indeed! Magni will be so happy to see you too! He's gotten nothing but bad news for a long while now, but this changes everything!"
G["Indeed! Nothing like the warm air and a cool pond..."]="Certo! Não há nada como uma brisa cálida e um estanque fresco..."
G["Indeed! The young one on my chest is named \"Kor\", for my oldest friend.\n\nAnd this young champion on my back is named \"$p\", for his savior."]="Em efeito! O jovem na minha peito se chama \"Kor\", por meu velho amigo.\n\nE este jovem campeão a meu costas se chama \"$p\", pelo seu $gsalvador: salvadora;."
G["Indeed! They were given every advantage I could muster. I simply can't imagine what went wrong.\n\nHere, $c, take one. I've made a couple of modifications - little refinements really. Now there's no excuse for failure!"]="Indeed! They were given every advantage I could muster. I simply can't imagine what went wrong.\n\nHere, $c, take one. I've made a couple of modifications - little refinements really. Now there's no excuse for failure!"
G["Indeed, I have Medivh's grimoire. I am fortunate that the Reliquary has seen the wisdom of this exchange."]="Indeed, I have Medivh's grimoire. I am fortunate that the Reliquary has seen the wisdom of this exchange."
G["Indeed, I heard they were recovered from the brink of death by a seasoned veteran of the Horde."]="Indeed, I heard they were recovered from the brink of death by a seasoned veteran of the Horde."
G["Indeed, Nexus-Prince Haramad, you do have much to think on.  Such as turning over that ata'mal crystal to my master, Prince Kael'thas."]="Indeed, Nexus-Prince Haramad, you do have much to think on.  Such as turning over that ata'mal crystal to my master, Prince Kael'thas."
G["Indeed, Silverwing Hold is in need of your assistance. Speak with Elfarran in the audience chamber at Stormwind Keep."]="De fato, o Silverwing Hold precisa da sua ajuda. Fale com Elfarran na câmara de audiência da Fortaleza de Ventobravo."
G["Indeed, brother. It would seem so..."]="Desde depois, irmão. Isso parece..."
G["Indeed, it is not a request."]="Indeed, it is not a request."
G["Indeed, the flora is growing unchecked, devouring the land. Similar to our findings from the oases."]="Indeed, the flora is growing unchecked, devouring the land. Similar to our findings from the oases."
G["Indeed, the hills of Winterspring are currently attempting to withstand a renewed Scourge assault. Your assistance would help them greatly.\n\nNumber of Necropolises remaining: $2284W"]="Em efeito, as colinas de Cuna do Inverno estão tentando resistir um novo ataque do Flagelo. Sua ajuda resultará crucial.\n\nNúmero de necrópole restantes: $2284W"
G["Indeed, the time has come to end this charade."]="Indeed, the time has come to end this charade."
G["Indeed, we have suffered greatly."]="É certo que temos sofrido muito."
G["Indeed."]="De fato."
G["Indeed.  Someone did try to kill me, but that is not my greatest concern at this moment.  The world itself calls for my aid."]="Indeed.  Someone did try to kill me, but that is not my greatest concern at this moment.  The world itself calls for my aid."
G["Indeed. After the Cataclysm, my flight's connection to the timeways forever changed."]="Indeed. After the Cataclysm, my flight's connection to the timeways forever changed."
G["Indeed. I doubt much would."]="Já vejo. Não há muitas coisas que possam."
G["Indeed. I stand before you in a form that you can comprehend, mortal. Surely, you could not bear to stand in the presence of the dragon known as Vaelastrasz.\n\n<Vaelan laughs.>\n\nShall I continue?"]="Indeed. I stand before you in a form that you can comprehend, mortal. Surely, you could not bear to stand in the presence of the dragon known as Vaelastrasz.\n\n<Vaelan laughs.>\n\nShall I continue?"
G["Indeed. Mal'Ganis is commanding the Scourge from Crusaders' Square, but the gates leading there from the city entrance are closed.\n\nLittle does he know that a small force can still reach the Square by moving through the Town Hall. Will you join me in this attack?"]="Indeed. Mal'Ganis is commanding the Scourge from Crusaders' Square, but the gates leading there from the city entrance are closed.\n\nLittle does he know that a small force can still reach the Square by moving through the Town Hall. Will you join me in this attack?"
G["Indeed. Nefarian, brood of Deathwing, rules the Spire now. Rend is under the command of the dragon.\n\nIf only you could somehow manage to pass through the Halls of Ascension.\n\n<Eitrigg sighs.>\n\nAlas, only those deemed worthy by the black flight earn privilege to ascend."]="Indeed. Nefarian, brood of Deathwing, rules the Spire now. Rend is under the command of the dragon.\n\nIf only you could somehow manage to pass through the Halls of Ascension.\n\n<Eitrigg sighs.>\n\nAlas, only those deemed worthy by the black flight earn privilege to ascend."
G["Indeed. The Scarlet Crusade are an aberration of the Order of the Silver Hand.\n\nYou must believe me, $r; Taelan is a good man. He needs guidance. He needs to remember... remember what it is to be noble and honorable. I know that in his heart, he knows what he does is wrong. Will you help him? Will you help him remember?"]="Indeed. The Scarlet Crusade are an aberration of the Order of the Silver Hand.\n\nYou must believe me, $r; Taelan is a good man. He needs guidance. He needs to remember... remember what it is to be noble and honorable. I know that in his heart, he knows what he does is wrong. Will you help him? Will you help him remember?"
G["Indeed. The brood mother of the Black Dragonflight had used illusion and trickery to disguise herself as a member of the royal court. Worse yet, she had assumed control of the current Highlord of Stormwind, Bolvar Fordragon.\n\nIt is no wonder that such foolish military decisions had been made. The movement of the Alliance forces as of late had left us scratching our heads. We now understand that the Black Flight was attempting to divide the empire - destroy it from within."]="Indeed. The brood mother of the Black Dragonflight had used illusion and trickery to disguise herself as a member of the royal court. Worse yet, she had assumed control of the current Highlord of Stormwind, Bolvar Fordragon.\n\nIt is no wonder that such foolish military decisions had been made. The movement of the Alliance forces as of late had left us scratching our heads. We now understand that the Black Flight was attempting to divide the empire - destroy it from within."
G["Indeed. The item was ultimately destroyed and Deathwing nearly slain by the combined and renewed power of the four remaining Aspects. Where Deathwing is now is unknown. What we do know, however, is that one of his progeny, Nefarian, rules this citadel and wishes to continue where his father left off."]="De fato. O item foi finalmente destruído e Deathwing quase foi morto pelo poder combinado e renovado dos quatro Aspectos restantes. Onde Deathwing está agora é desconhecido. O que sabemos, no entanto, é que um dos seus descendentes, Nefarian, governa essa cidadela e deseja seguir de onde seu pai parou."
G["Indeed. This place overturns our very notion of time, and how it shapes the universe."]="Indeed. This place overturns our very notion of time, and how it shapes the universe."
G["Indeed. Watch this, $r."]="claro. Olhe isto, $r."
G["Indeed. We must get you two back to safety. Thanks to you, the Thunder King is now completely under siege."]="Indeed. We must get you two back to safety. Thanks to you, the Thunder King is now completely under siege."
G["Indeed. What better way to symbolize the bond of friendship and brotherhood between Tarren Mill and Southshore by erecting this tower at the halfway point between both towns. Brilliant!"]="Indeed. What better way to symbolize the bond of friendship and brotherhood between Tarren Mill and Southshore by erecting this tower at the halfway point between both towns. Brilliant!"
G["Indeed. With the aid of your champions, the Dark Irons will put an end to the Zandalari threat in Dun Morogh."]="Com a ajuda dos seus campeões, os Ferro Negro pondrán fim à ameaça Zandalari em Dun Morogh."
G["Indeed... lovely dress, Jessica."]="Sim, um vestido mesmo bonito, Jessica."
G["Indeed? It appears I have much to learn from these \"mogu.\""]="Ah, si? Parece que tenho muito que aprender desses \"mogu\"."
G["Indeeeeed!"]="Indeeeeed!"
G["Individual strength is important, but tribal strength is more so.  Our tribe is only as strong as its weakest member."]="A força individual é importante, mas a força tribal é mais. Nossa tribo é tão forte quanto seu membro mais fraco."
G["Inessera is a sharp woman who carries various gems as well as jewelcrafting supplies. You can find her shop in the northern part of Aldor Rise."]="Inessera é uma mulher afiada que carrega várias jóias, bem como suprimentos para joalheria. Você pode encontrar sua loja na parte norte de Aldor Rise."
G["Infernals rain from the sky!"]="Infernals rain from the sky!"
G["Infested crops are covered in bugs. Yech!\n\nGrandpa's bug sprayer is on the ground near the field - use it to give those critters a blast of what-for!"]="Infested crops are covered in bugs. Yech!\n\nGrandpa's bug sprayer is on the ground near the field - use it to give those critters a blast of what-for!"
G["Infested crops are covered in bugs. Yech!\n\nNow that we have that Pulse Wave Emitter, though, it should be easy to get rid of them. Flip it on to shoo all those pests away in a humane fashion, without any pesticide!\n\nHey, does that mean our veggies count as organic?"]="Infested crops are covered in bugs. Yech!\n\nNow that we have that Pulse Wave Emitter, though, it should be easy to get rid of them. Flip it on to shoo all those pests away in a humane fashion, without any pesticide!\n\nHey, does that mean our veggies count as organic?"
G["Infidels!"]="Infieles!"
G["Infidels! They must be purified!"]="Infidels! They must be purified!"
G["Infiltration commencing."]="Começa a infiltração."
G["Infiltrator! You cannot hope to stop the swarm!"]="Espião! Mais detendrás ao enxame!"
G["Infinite energy, unbound!"]="Energia infinita sem controle!"
G["Information on Brilliant Chromatic Scales."]="Informações sobre escamas cromáticas luminosas."
