G["Ingoo, I gave your people the rod for protection. Not to be ookin' used for hooliganation!"]="Ingoo, I gave your people the rod for protection. Not to be ookin' used for hooliganation!"
G["Ingoo, rod is not for you. Give it up before it destroys you too."]="Ingô, a vara não é sua. Você me a da antes de que te destruya você também."
G["Ingvar has plans for you, little one."]="Ingvar tem planos para você, criaturita."
G["Ingvar sends his dragon riders to descend upon these insects! Soon they will face the awakened force of the Vrykul!"]="Ingvar sends his dragon riders to descend upon these insects! Soon they will face the awakened force of the Vrykul!"
G["Ingvar! Your pathetic failure will serve as a warning to all... you are damned! Arise and carry out the master's will!"]="Ingvar! Your pathetic failure will serve as a warning to all... you are damned! Arise and carry out the master's will!"
G["Initiate Phase I: Recapture the enemy airfield!"]="Iniciar fase 1: Recuperar base aérea inimiga!"
G["Initiate Phase II: Capture the Surface Command Post!"]="Iniciar fase 2: Capturar posto de envio de superfície!"
G["Initiate, may I have another quiver please?"]="Initiate, may I have another quiver please?"
G["Initiating cleanup ... ..."]="Iniciando limpeza......"
G["Initiating energy collection."]="Iniciando recolecção de energia."
G["Initiating query.  The Algalon Failsafe is an automated emergency signal following a Prime Designate's demise."]="Initiating query.  The Algalon Failsafe is an automated emergency signal following a Prime Designate's demise."
G["Initiating system reset. Module 1 at 50%. Hey, system reset requires two modules to complete."]="Iniciando sistema de reinicia. Módulo 1 ao 50%. Eh, o sistema precisa que se completen dois módulos."
G["Initiating system reset. Module 2 at 50%. Hey, system reset requires two modules to complete."]="Iniciando reinicia do sistema. Módulo 2 ao 50%. Eh, o sistema precisa que se completen dois módulos."
G["Initiating visual aid representation number two.\n\nThe second resultant variance of the Earthen matrix retains many desired elements when compared to the standard subterranean matrix.  The common nomenclature for this variant is \"Dwarf\".\n\nThis variant retains strength and stamina inherent to the Earthen.  In some cases, the dwarf even exceeds the cognitive powers of the Earthen's matrix.  The dwarf, however, retains none of the physical composition of Azeroth's various stone core compounds."]="Initiating visual aid representation number two.\n\nThe second resultant variance of the Earthen matrix retains many desired elements when compared to the standard subterranean matrix.  The common nomenclature for this variant is \"Dwarf\".\n\nThis variant retains strength and stamina inherent to the Earthen.  In some cases, the dwarf even exceeds the cognitive powers of the Earthen's matrix.  The dwarf, however, retains none of the physical composition of Azeroth's various stone core compounds."
G["Inland invaders! Fire!"]="Invasores do interior! Fogo!"
G["Inn"]="Pousada"
G["Inner ring of War Quarter where James Van Brunt work.  Him make us good chain."]="Anel interno do Bairro da Guerra, onde James Vão Brunt trabalha. Ele nos faz uma boa cadeia."
G["Innkeeper Kauth can see to your needs.  He can be found on the west side of the village in one of the long houses."]="O gerente Kauth pode atender às suas necessidades. Ele pode ser encontrado no lado oeste da vila em uma das casas longas."
G["Innkeeper Norman keeps a dusty crack in the wall he calls an inn on the upper ring of the Trade Quarter."]="O estalajadeiro Norman mantém uma rachadura empoeirada na parede que ele chama de estalagem no anel superior do Trade Quarter."
G["Innkeeper Norman on upper ring of Trade Quarter is one to talk to."]="O estalajadeiro Norman, no anel superior do Trade Quarter, é alguém com quem conversar."
G["Innkeeper Pala will help you rest your body and spirit.  You can find her in the building just south of the bank on the lower rise."]="O gerente Pala ajudará você a descansar seu corpo e espírito. Você pode encontrá-a no prédio ao sul da margem, na subida mais baixa."
G["Innkeeper Renee has moved to the large building in the center of town.  It's the biggest building in Brill... Very hard to miss."]="Innkeeper Renee has moved to the large building in the center of town.  It's the biggest building in Brill... Very hard to miss."
G["Innovation is not for the unimaginative, $C. Find a more traditional path."]="A innovação não é para os pouco imaginativos, $C. Encontre um caminho mais tradicional."
G["Inns are places where you can rest after your adventures.  If you do not stay at an inn such as this, then you will not be fully rested when you venture again into the wilderness.\n\nYou may also acquire a hearthstone at any inn, and later when you are ready to rest you can use this heartstone to bring you back to the inn from which you acquired it."]="Inns are places where you can rest after your adventures.  If you do not stay at an inn such as this, then you will not be fully rested when you venture again into the wilderness.\n\nYou may also acquire a hearthstone at any inn, and later when you are ready to rest you can use this heartstone to bring you back to the inn from which you acquired it."
G["Input recognized.  Please prepare for journey."]="Dados reconocidos. Preparar para o viagem."
G["Inscription"]="Escrivania"
G["Inscription Supplies"]="Suprimentos de inscrição"
G["Inscription allows you to create magical scrolls, glyphs, off-hand tomes, Darkmoon cards, and even recipes for other professions.\nMany raw materials for Inscription come from milling herbs gathered by Herbalism, so the two professions pair well.\nYou'll need a Virtuoso Inking Set for inscribing things; this and other necessary materials, such as parchment, may be purchased from Inscription vendors."]="Inscription allows you to create magical scrolls, glyphs, off-hand tomes, Darkmoon cards, and even recipes for other professions.\nMany raw materials for Inscription come from milling herbs gathered by Herbalism, so the two professions pair well.\nYou'll need a Virtuoso Inking Set for inscribing things; this and other necessary materials, such as parchment, may be purchased from Inscription vendors."
