G["Insignificant!"]="Insignificante!"
G["Insignificant."]="Insignificante."
G["Insolent cubs! Submit or die!"]="Insolent cubs! Submit or die!"
G["Insolent fool! You thought to steal Zelemar's blood? You shall pay with your own!"]="Estúpido insolente! Pensaste em roubar o sangue de Zelemar? Pagará com à sua!"
