G["Instead, we require a small, concentrated strike force for the attack to succeed. For that reason, we have created the Argent Tournament."]="No entanto, precisamos de uma pequena força de ataque concentrada para que o ataque tenha êxito. Por esse motivo, temos criado o Torneio Argêntea."
G["Instead, you laid waste to the land. Murdered innocents. Children even..."]="Instead, you laid waste to the land. Murdered innocents. Children even..."
