G["Isn't it amazing, children? All who enter the city must walk beneath the watchful eyes of the greatest heroes of our lands."]="Isn't it amazing, children? All who enter the city must walk beneath the watchful eyes of the greatest heroes of our lands."
G["Isn't it beautiful? I call it the magnificent aerial command unit!"]="Acaso não é bonita? A chamo a magnífica unidade de envio aérea!"
G["Isn't it beautiful? Such grace it has, as it dances in the sky. One day, I hope to be as graceful as the crane."]="Não é precioso? Que graça tem quando baila pelo céu. Alguns dia gostaria ser tão grácil como a grulha."
G["Isn't it beautiful? The weaving of flesh and bone and soul."]="Isn't it beautiful? The weaving of flesh and bone and soul."
