G["Isn't it weird that we're keeping Magatha Grimtotem captive here? Good thing all of her totems were destroyed.\n\nI even heard that she poisoned Cairne Bloodhoof. Wish she were on our side."]="Isn't it weird that we're keeping Magatha Grimtotem captive here? Good thing all of her totems were destroyed.\n\nI even heard that she poisoned Cairne Bloodhoof. Wish she were on our side."
G["Isn't it? However, they do differ from dragons when it comes to their lifespan. Whereas the dragons of our world can live for millenia on end, these fire hawks live brief lives, passing quickly from egg to adulthood to death.\n\nThough my master warns against making emotional connections to our studies, sometimes I can't help but feel sorry for them. They burn so brightly in life... but in death, they're quickly replaced and forgotten."]="Isn't it? However, they do differ from dragons when it comes to their lifespan. Whereas the dragons of our world can live for millenia on end, these fire hawks live brief lives, passing quickly from egg to adulthood to death.\n\nThough my master warns against making emotional connections to our studies, sometimes I can't help but feel sorry for them. They burn so brightly in life... but in death, they're quickly replaced and forgotten."
G["Isn't she beautiful? Sigh..."]="Não você acha preciosa? Ay..."
G["Isn't she just the most amazing little creation?"]="Isn't she just the most amazing little creation?"
G["Isn't that a bit much, lad?"]="Não é demais, rapaz?"
