G["It be my duty to record these tragic events for the good of generations to come."]="É meu dever registrar esses trágicos eventos para o bem das gerações vindouras."
G["It be time ta kick some arse an' drink double-rum!\n\nAn' I almost be outta double-rum...."]="It be time ta kick some arse an' drink double-rum!\n\nAn' I almost be outta double-rum...."
G["It be time to squeal, little piggy!"]="It be time to squeal, little piggy!"
G["It becomes so easy to take it all for granted when danger surrounds us at every turn."]="It becomes so easy to take it all for granted when danger surrounds us at every turn."
G["It belongs to our ancestors..."]="Pertence aos nossos ancestrais..."
G["It belongs to our children."]="Ela pertence aos nossos filhos."
G["It borders on sacrilege that these secrets be revealed to a mortal such as yourself, but I have little choice.\n\nEver since Freya, daughter of the titans, left me here I've had but one task and I cannot fail.  Life must be protected at any cost.\n\nThere is a waygate that links this place with another very much like this one.  It is there that the weapon we seek can be found."]="It borders on sacrilege that these secrets be revealed to a mortal such as yourself, but I have little choice.\n\nEver since Freya, daughter of the titans, left me here I've had but one task and I cannot fail.  Life must be protected at any cost.\n\nThere is a waygate that links this place with another very much like this one.  It is there that the weapon we seek can be found."
G["It burns in here! Wait, that's just my feet."]="Aqui dentro está em chamas! Aguarda, é somente meu pé."
G["It burns like the moon!"]="Queima como a lua!"
G["It burns so good!"]="It burns so good!"
G["It burns!"]="It burns!"
G["It burns! IT BURNS!"]="It burns! IT BURNS!"
G["It burns...my soul...it burns!!!!"]="Arde... Minha alma... Arde!!"
G["It came crashing through shortly after the collapse. We're examining it now."]="It came crashing through shortly after the collapse. We're examining it now."
G["It came from above!"]="Chegou desde cima!"
G["It came from below!"]="Veio desde baixo!"
G["It came from the wall, sir."]="Veio da muralha, senhor."
G["It can be difficult for a hardened veteran to grow accustomed to a peaceful setting, but that is our duty.  These villagers do not long for war, let us not bring it to their doorstep if we do not have to."]="It can be difficult for a hardened veteran to grow accustomed to a peaceful setting, but that is our duty.  These villagers do not long for war, let us not bring it to their doorstep if we do not have to."
G["It can get really hot here in the Badlands. But at least it's a dry heat."]="It can get really hot here in the Badlands. But at least it's a dry heat."
G["It cannot be..."]="Não pode ser..."
G["It cannot end... like... this..."]="Não posso morrer… assim…"
G["It cold there! You go in Royal Quarter, talk to Grizzle Halfmane."]="Está frio lá! Você vai ao Royal Quarter, fala com Grizzle Halfmane."
G["It comes for you..."]="Vai por você..."
G["It comes from - harum - what is your word for it? Harrrm. Let us say that my kind does not have bathrooms. Do you understand?"]="Vem de - harum - qual é à sua palavra para isso? Harrrm. Digamos que minha espécie não tenha banheiros. Voce entende?"
G["It confirms our suspicions. The threads of time have been severed and rewoven in the wrong pattern. But, how?"]="It confirms our suspicions. The threads of time have been severed and rewoven in the wrong pattern. But, how?"
G["It consumed the Light!"]="Tem consumido a Luz!"
G["It couldn't hurt to study it. 'Tho I don't much care for the way it's lookin' at me."]="It couldn't hurt to study it. 'Tho I don't much care for the way it's lookin' at me."
G["It depends on how hard you throw them!"]="Depende do forte que os tires!"
G["It describes a way to stop the mantid. A way to stop the sha!"]="Fala sobre uma maneira de parar aos mantídeos. Uma maneira de parar ao sha!"
G["It did not have to be like this..."]="Não tinha que ser assim…"
G["It did not have to be this way!  I only wish to see my family again...to share with them this gift!"]="Não tinha que haver banido assim! Eu somente quero voltar a ver a meu família... compartilhar este don com eles!"
G["It did not matter. It comes.  Steel your hearts and prepare your souls."]="It did not matter. It comes.  Steel your hearts and prepare your souls."
G["It didn't come out very good, $n. You wouldn't want any."]="Não tem saindo muito bem, $n. Não acho que queira."
G["It didn't have to go down this way, $c."]="Não tinha por que haver terminado assim, $c."
G["It didn't look like much of a \"cure\" to me, and I wasn't about to stand around listening to some crazy robot while he was butchering my people!\n\nWe did what any sane gnome would do... we ran! Well, actually, most of us parachuted off the side of the platform, but you get the picture.\n\nNot many of us managed to make it back here, and we're still spread thin from having to deal with everything else too, like the magnataur to the north and the Scourge to the east. To make things worse, the Horde just setup shop to the northwest!"]="It didn't look like much of a \"cure\" to me, and I wasn't about to stand around listening to some crazy robot while he was butchering my people!\n\nWe did what any sane gnome would do... we ran! Well, actually, most of us parachuted off the side of the platform, but you get the picture.\n\nNot many of us managed to make it back here, and we're still spread thin from having to deal with everything else too, like the magnataur to the north and the Scourge to the east. To make things worse, the Horde just setup shop to the northwest!"
G["It does get worse, old friend. According to my calculations, without suitable materials to repair our parapets, the walls protecting this keep will crumble in twelve hours."]="It does get worse, old friend. According to my calculations, without suitable materials to repair our parapets, the walls protecting this keep will crumble in twelve hours."
G["It does my soul good to see the walls of Stormwind standing strong and tall.\n\nIf you're looking to go to Stratholme, I'm afraid I'm unable to assist at the moment. The towers nearby the burning city are still in contention, and as such my powers are far too weak to aid you. Return to me once you're victorious there."]="It does my soul good to see the walls of Stormwind standing strong and tall.\n\nIf you're looking to go to Stratholme, I'm afraid I'm unable to assist at the moment. The towers nearby the burning city are still in contention, and as such my powers are far too weak to aid you. Return to me once you're victorious there."
G["It does not matter. Taoshi's proposal is too dangerous."]="Não importa. A proposta de Taoshi é muito perigosa."
G["It doesn't even feel like I'm making any progress..."]="Não parece que avanço..."
G["It doesn't have to end this way, you know?"]="Não é necessário que acabe assim, o sabe?"
G["It doesn't hurt anymore, does it?"]="Já não dói, verdade?"
G["It doesn't hurt so much anymore."]="Já não dói tanto."
G["It doesn't look very friendly in there. Maybe I should just..."]="Não parece que seja muito acogedor... Talvez deveria..."
G["It doesn't make any sense. Why don't they just fly Naxxramas over Wintergarde Keep and blow it up? I mean, that's what I would do if I were Kel'Thuzad."]="It doesn't make any sense. Why don't they just fly Naxxramas over Wintergarde Keep and blow it up? I mean, that's what I would do if I were Kel'Thuzad."
G["It doesn't matter that Mount Kajaro has blown. All that matters is that I stay on top!"]="Não importa que o Monte Jakaro tenha explodido. O que importa é que eu continue na cima!"
G["It doesn't seem like you're casting enough Shadowbolts."]="Parece que não está lançando bastantes Descargas das Sombras."
G["It don't mattah what you do heah, ravager. Da land will heal after you be dead."]="It don't mattah what you do heah, ravager. Da land will heal after you be dead."
G["It drafty out here."]="É esboçado aqui."
G["It ends TODAY. Here. The cycle ends when you, Regent Lord, and you, Lady Proudmoore, turn from one another. And walk. Away."]="It ends TODAY. Here. The cycle ends when you, Regent Lord, and you, Lady Proudmoore, turn from one another. And walk. Away."
G["It ends here!"]="Aqui termina tudo!"
G["It ends like it began..."]="Acaba como empezó…"
G["It falls to us to see Quel'Delar restored for the Sunreavers."]="É nosso dever ver que Quel'Delar se recupera para os Atracasol."
G["It falls to you to defend your master."]="Os corresponde defenda ao seu mestre."
G["It falls upon us to usher in an age of peace, where the Light will reign."]="It falls upon us to usher in an age of peace, where the Light will reign."
G["It feels good to walk about and stretch all four limbs. Is there something I can help you with, $c?"]="É agradável caminhar e estirar as pernas. Há algo no que possa ajudar você, $c?"
G["It feels like I've been sleeping for years..."]="Tenho a sensação de haver dormindo durante anos..."
G["It feels like everyone wants to kiss me under the mistletoe."]="It feels like everyone wants to kiss me under the mistletoe."
G["It feels like we were in that forest forever. Let's go! We've got to explore the valley!"]="Sinto que temos passado uma eternidade em esse florestas. Vamos! Temos que explorar o vale!"
G["It feels so good to stretch my limbs!  It was cramped in there.  They really should invest in more roomy cages!"]="It feels so good to stretch my limbs!  It was cramped in there.  They really should invest in more roomy cages!"
G["It fueled their hatred and anger, lending them strength on the field of battle."]="Ele dava energia ao ódio e ira deles, e lhes emprestava forças no campo de batalha."
G["It gets the key. It comes here. It opens the lock."]="Consegue a chave. Vem aqui. Abra a cerradura."
G["It gets worse."]="It gets worse."
G["It good thing that this place is timeless. Ken-Ken hopes this never ends!"]="It good thing that this place is timeless. Ken-Ken hopes this never ends!"
G["It grants the ability to perform magic on a grand scale... but they quickly lose the ability to control that power."]="Ele concede a habilidade de realizar magia em grande escala... mas o controle sobre esse poder se perde rapidamente."
G["It grows late. We should set up camp for the night. Sully, do you have an axe?"]="Se há tarde. É preciso levantar o acampamento. Sully, tem um machado?"
G["It had to be done...."]="It had to be done...."
G["It has been a great honor to fight beside you in defense of our land and our people."]="Foi um grande honra combater ao seu lado em defesa de nossa terra e nosso povo."
G["It has been a great honor to fight by your side. Thank you."]="Foi um grande honra lutar ao seu lado. Muitas Obrigado."
G["It has been a long time since we welcomed visitors to our village."]="It has been a long time since we welcomed visitors to our village."
G["It has been a long time, Bethor, my friend."]="Quanto tempo, meu querido amigo Bethor."
G["It has been a long while since I fought a worthy adversary..."]="It has been a long while since I fought a worthy adversary..."
G["It has been a pleasure!"]="Foi um prazer!"
G["It has been an age of the world or more since I felt any emotion at even a fraction of that."]="It has been an age of the world or more since I felt any emotion at even a fraction of that."
G["It has been an honor to fight at your side."]="Foi uma honra lutar ao seu lado."
G["It has been an honor to train with you."]="Foi uma honra treinar com você."
G["It has been an honor, outlander."]="Foi uma honra, $gforasteiro:forasteira;."
G["It has been made known to me that inside each of us, the Light resides..."]="Sei que, dentro de cada um dos vocês, resida Luz..."
G["It has been many months since those two warlocks broke into the temple... but I'm still not sure what they were after."]="It has been many months since those two warlocks broke into the temple... but I'm still not sure what they were after."
G["It has been many years since I have seen it manifest so dramatically."]="It has been many years since I have seen it manifest so dramatically."
G["It has been many years since I have seen this place, Wakener. Much has changed."]="It has been many years since I have seen this place, Wakener. Much has changed."
G["It has been many years..."]="Têm banido muitos anos..."
G["It has been quite some time since I have been so at ease!"]="Fazia tempo que não me sentia tão tranquilo!"
G["It has been the greatest honor of my life to serve with you, Hummel."]="Servir com você foi o maior honra de minha vida, Hummel."
G["It has been years since I have thought with my heart, but it's all flooding back."]="Há muitos anos que já não pretendo com o coração mas empiezo a lembrar o que se sente."
G["It has been... entertaining."]="Foi... divertido."
G["It has brought me naught but ill. Mayhap you can find someone who will contain its power."]="Não me trazido mais que desgracias. Talvez encontre a alguém que possa conter seu poder."
G["It has everything a growing scorchling needs!"]="It has everything a growing scorchling needs!"
G["It has now been six weeks since your release. Are you ready to have the shackles removed?"]="It has now been six weeks since your release. Are you ready to have the shackles removed?"
G["It has taken me all day to wrestle the cipher from these hieroglyphs:\n\n\n   Through eyes of blue is starlight\n              revealed.\n\n   Ten shards, one rod, and the veil\n             disappears.\n\n\nForget Schnottz and his empty promises!\n\nIf I can just unravel this riddle, its secrets shall be mine!"]="It has taken me all day to wrestle the cipher from these hieroglyphs:\n\n\n   Through eyes of blue is starlight\n              revealed.\n\n   Ten shards, one rod, and the veil\n             disappears.\n\n\nForget Schnottz and his empty promises!\n\nIf I can just unravel this riddle, its secrets shall be mine!"
G["It has to be a message! Maybe even a clue to something important!"]="Precisa ser uma mensagem! Talvez inclusive seja uma pista de algo importantes!"
G["It has to be said, Vol'jin. If we do not make it through this - I want you to know. You have always been my friend. My brother."]="Precisa ser dito. Vol'jin, se não sobrevivermos a isso, eu quero que você saiba. Você sempre foi meu amigo. Meu irmão."
G["It healed our wounds and made us bold. It tasted like sweetness and fire, and gave us the strength to conquer all the lesser races."]="It healed our wounds and made us bold. It tasted like sweetness and fire, and gave us the strength to conquer all the lesser races."
G["It horrible!"]="É horrível!"
G["It hurt!"]="It hurt!"
G["It hurts so much... Itharius, my old friend... please help me..."]="Dói tanto... Itharius, velho amigo... por favor, ajude-me..."
G["It hurts when I move my arm."]="Dói quando movo meu braço."
G["It hurts!"]="Dói!"
G["It hurts! Owww Ow Ow Owwwww!"]="Dói! Ayyyyy ay ay aaaaayy!"
G["It hurts..."]="Dói..."
G["It hurts... so much..."]="Dói... muito..."
G["It is Bowen Brisboise that you seek then.  You'll find him inside his house southwest of Brill just on the other side of the bridge at Cold Hearth Manor."]="É Bowen Brisboise que você procura então. Você o encontrará dentro da sua casa, a sudoeste de Brill, do outro lado da ponte em Cold Hearth Manor."
G["It is Gennia Runetotem's counsel that you seek.  You will find her in the large tent on the east side of the village."]="É o conselho de Gennia Runetotem que você procura. Você a encontrará na grande tenda no lado leste da vila."
G["It is Gul'dan!"]="É Gul'dan!"
G["It is I who is unworthy."]="Sou eu quem não é digno."
G["It is I, Malfurion. This is what I've become."]="Sou eu, Malfurion. Isto é no que me e convertido."
G["It is Prince Arthas I want, not you!"]="Busco ao príncipe Arthas, não você!"
G["It is Syurna that you seek if you are to follow the rogue's path.  She dwells in the Cenarion Enclave down the spiraling path within the western most tree."]="É Syurna que você procura se deseja seguir pelo caminho do trapaceiro. Ela mora no Enclave Cenarion, no caminho em espiral dentro da árvore mais ocidental."
G["It is Vesprystus that you seek.  He watches over the hippogryphs that come and go from the base of Teldrassil."]="It is Vesprystus that you seek.  He watches over the hippogryphs that come and go from the base of Teldrassil."
G["It is Vesprystus that you seek.  He watches over the hippogryphs that come and go from the base of Teldrassil.  You will find him through the portal in western Darnassus that will take you to Rut'theran Village."]="It is Vesprystus that you seek.  He watches over the hippogryphs that come and go from the base of Teldrassil.  You will find him through the portal in western Darnassus that will take you to Rut'theran Village."
G["It is YOU who are wrong!  I will deal with you two after I have slain this meddlesome shaman!"]="It is YOU who are wrong!  I will deal with you two after I have slain this meddlesome shaman!"
G["It is a beacon. A remnant of a forgotten era."]="É uma baliza. Um lembrança de uma época esquecida."
G["It is a boat... a whole airship!  That's a bigger thorn than I was expecting."]="It is a boat... a whole airship!  That's a bigger thorn than I was expecting."
G["It is a difficult thing for us to trust someone so new to our city.  You've come upon us during a somewhat desperate time."]="Resulta difícil confiar em alguém que acaba de chegar à cidade. Tem vindo a nós em um momento desesperado."
G["It is a good day for a hunt."]="É um bom dia para caçar."
G["It is a good day to be alive and one with the elements."]="É um bom dia para estar vivo e um com os elementos."
G["It is a good thing to spend time in a place like this. We must always remember what it is we struggle so hard to protect."]="It is a good thing to spend time in a place like this. We must always remember what it is we struggle so hard to protect."
G["It is a greater knowledge of the ways of the warlock that I crave."]="É um conhecimento maior dos caminhos do bruxo que eu desejo."
G["It is a long walk from town to Sri-La, but good for the spirit. And it certainly helps get little Aerial here outdoors."]="It is a long walk from town to Sri-La, but good for the spirit. And it certainly helps get little Aerial here outdoors."
G["It is a luckydo to have a clean yak. It is a bigger luckydo to feed it my special brew. This is how one makes Kobeyaks!"]="It is a luckydo to have a clean yak. It is a bigger luckydo to feed it my special brew. This is how one makes Kobeyaks!"
G["It is a marvel how we were able to set this up in so short a time. Let's try again..."]="É uma maravilha que tenhamos conseguido montar isto em tão pouco tempo. Voltemos a tentar..."
G["It is a most auspicious day today, is it not?"]="Este dia promete muito, verdade?"
G["It is a mystery to me, $r. If you want to find out, you are both crazy and foolish!\n\nBut I suppose there is no other way to meet the Klaxxi than to venture beyond the wall into the Dread Wastes."]="It is a mystery to me, $r. If you want to find out, you are both crazy and foolish!\n\nBut I suppose there is no other way to meet the Klaxxi than to venture beyond the wall into the Dread Wastes."
G["It is a poor offerin' but I be givin' it in thanks for your help."]="It is a poor offerin' but I be givin' it in thanks for your help."
G["It is a rare and auspicious day when I get to test my abilities.\n\nI think you are ready to fight me, $n. Let us find out if I am correct."]="It is a rare and auspicious day when I get to test my abilities.\n\nI think you are ready to fight me, $n. Let us find out if I am correct."
G["It is a risk I have to take. But if I am killed, please watch over Aggra and my boy."]="Eu preciso arriscar. Se eu morrer, proteja Aggra e meu filho."
G["It is a shame Coren's Dire Brew can't quench more thirsting throats!  It's blasphemy, I know, but  I envy those Dark Iron dwarves!"]="It is a shame Coren's Dire Brew can't quench more thirsting throats!  It's blasphemy, I know, but  I envy those Dark Iron dwarves!"
G["It is a shame I am only able to mask our own smells and not the foul odors pouring out of the Zandalari and their beasts."]="It is a shame I am only able to mask our own smells and not the foul odors pouring out of the Zandalari and their beasts."
G["It is a shame we lost our own planes during our arrival. It will make our extraction mission a bit more...challenging."]="It is a shame we lost our own planes during our arrival. It will make our extraction mission a bit more...challenging."
G["It is a shame, a dreadful shame, that my brethren cannot see what benefits come from truly steeping oneself in a culture."]="It is a shame, a dreadful shame, that my brethren cannot see what benefits come from truly steeping oneself in a culture."
G["It is a simple guideline, but a meaningful one. Do you understand?"]="It is a simple guideline, but a meaningful one. Do you understand?"
G["It is a small matter to control the mind of the weak... for I bear allegiance to powers untouched by time, unmoved by fate. No force on this world or beyond harbors the strength to bend our knee... not even the mighty Legion!"]="It is a small matter to control the mind of the weak... for I bear allegiance to powers untouched by time, unmoved by fate. No force on this world or beyond harbors the strength to bend our knee... not even the mighty Legion!"
G["It is a story of legend and one that I do not have the time nor the inclination to retell. Just know that Medivh was the last of the Guardians. The greatstaff of Atiesh was a focal point of his power and a focal point of corruption."]="É uma história de lendas e não tenho tempo nem vontade de recontar. Apenas saiba que Medivh foi o último dos Guardiões. O grande pessoal de Atiesh era um ponto focal do seu poder e um ponto focal de corrupção."
G["It is a strength that we sin'dorei all share. It is a strength we will need to free ourselves of the addiction ravaging our people."]="It is a strength that we sin'dorei all share. It is a strength we will need to free ourselves of the addiction ravaging our people."
G["It is a time to celebrate new friends and the future we may forge together."]="It is a time to celebrate new friends and the future we may forge together."
G["It is a very fancy ritual."]="É um ritual muito elaborado."
G["It is a weakness; a crippling flaw....  A joke played by the Creators upon their own creations."]="É uma fraqueza, um defecto atroz... Uma broma dos criadores cima seu criação."
G["It is a weapon like no other. It must be like no other."]="Não há outra arma como esta. Não deve haver outra igual."
G["It is all I can do to protect those who have made it here."]="É tudo o que posso fazer para proteção aos que têm chegado até aqui."
G["It is all about his adventures."]="Conta todas seus aventuras."
G["It is already determined.  You have no hope... the flames shall consume all!"]="It is already determined.  You have no hope... the flames shall consume all!"
G["It is always a good idea to make friends with fisherman. You will never go hungry!"]="It is always a good idea to make friends with fisherman. You will never go hungry!"
G["It is always a pleasure to meet heroes such as yourself in this forsaken land. Is there some form of assistance that I can offer you?"]="É sempre um prazer conhecer heróis como você nesta terra abandonada. Existe alguma forma de assistência que eu possa lhe oferecer?"
G["It is always a pleasure to see you, Lady Proudmoore."]="Sempre é um prazer tratar com você, Lady Corajoso."
G["It is always an honor to share words with the Savior of Stoneplow."]="Sempre é uma honra compartilhar umas palavras com $gel Salvador: a Salvadora; de Vilharroca."
G["It is always good to see a strong $r like yourself."]="Sempre é um prazer ver a $gun: uma; $r forte como você."
G["It is amazing. How could it have remained in this state, untouched by the world's destruction?"]="É asombroso. Como pediu permanecer neste estado sem que lhe afecte a destruição do mundo?"
G["It is amusing to watch you struggle. Very well, witness how it is done!"]="It is amusing to watch you struggle. Very well, witness how it is done!"
G["It is an absolute travesty of our time I tell you. That a rancher and his son can't just run a yak wash in peace without fear of yaungol raiding..."]="It is an absolute travesty of our time I tell you. That a rancher and his son can't just run a yak wash in peace without fear of yaungol raiding..."
G["It is an honor to finally face you in combat. Lok'tar Ogar, for Honor, and for the Horde!"]="It is an honor to finally face you in combat. Lok'tar Ogar, for Honor, and for the Horde!"
G["It is an honor to have you among us, $n."]="It is an honor to have you among us, $n."
G["It is an honor to represent the Argent Crusade in this tournament."]="É uma honra representar a Cruzada Argent neste torneio."
G["It is an honor to ride with you."]="É uma honra voar com você."
G["It is an honor to serve along your side, $g sir:ma'am;."]="É uma honra servir ao lado a você, $gsenhor: senhora;."
G["It is an honor to serve alongside you, Prime. I have studied your work extensively."]="It is an honor to serve alongside you, Prime. I have studied your work extensively."
G["It is an honor to stand in your presence, Champion $n."]="É uma honra estar no seu presença, campeão $n."
G["It is an honor to work alongside Grand Apothecary Putress. His work has saved the world from the Lich King's plague and has given new hope to our cause."]="É um grande honra trabalhar ao lado ao Grande Boticário Putress. Seu trabalho salvou ao mundo do Flagelo do Rei Lich e lhe dados à gente fé em nossa causa."
G["It is an opportunity to mock the fearsome - to gaze boldly into the grim unknown and laugh!"]="It is an opportunity to mock the fearsome - to gaze boldly into the grim unknown and laugh!"
G["It is as they say: Like father, like son. You are as weak of will as Tirion... perhaps more so. I can only hope my assassins finally succeeded in ending his pitiful life."]="It is as they say: Like father, like son. You are as weak of will as Tirion... perhaps more so. I can only hope my assassins finally succeeded in ending his pitiful life."
G["It is as though my memories are shrouded in mist. I cannot even recall what became of my brother. Is this how you mean that he is in danger?"]="It is as though my memories are shrouded in mist. I cannot even recall what became of my brother. Is this how you mean that he is in danger?"
G["It is bad fortune to travel in boat without exploding barrels aboard."]="Da mal sorte viajar em navio sem explodir barris a bordo."
G["It is because of you this village has found its strength again!"]="Obrigado você esta aldeia tem recuperei sua força!"
G["It is beeping and flashing wildly.  Dig here!"]="It is beeping and flashing wildly.  Dig here!"
G["It is beeping loudly, suggesting that you are only a few paces away."]="It is beeping loudly, suggesting that you are only a few paces away."
G["It is beeping quietly every 5 seconds or so."]="Está pitando baixo, mais ou menos cada cinco segundos."
G["It is beeping regularly, about once a second."]="Está pitando regularmente, mais ou menos uma vez cada segundo."
G["It is beeping regularly, about once every two seconds."]="Está pitando regularmente, mais ou menos uma vez cada dois segundos."
G["It is beeping very faintly.  You are still quite far away."]="It is beeping very faintly.  You are still quite far away."
G["It is being maintained by the will of a powerful demon...Mannoroth."]="O mantém a vontade de um poderoso demônio... Mannoroth."
G["It is best that we split up now, in case they send more after us. Hopefully one of us will make it back to Garrosh. Farewell, stranger."]="It is best that we split up now, in case they send more after us. Hopefully one of us will make it back to Garrosh. Farewell, stranger."
G["It is better to face your challenges, than to run from them."]="It is better to face your challenges, than to run from them."
G["It is but a small token of my appreciation. My thanks to you."]="Não é mais que uma mostra de agradecimento. Muitas Obrigado."
G["It is certainly a nice day outside!"]="De verdade que há um dia precioso!"
G["It is chaos out there, $p! The siege has begun but our heavy explosives never made it to the wall."]="$p, Aí fosse rainhao caos! O cerco tem empezado, mas os explosivos pesados nunca chegaram à muralha."
G["It is clear that you are not here to bring your war to these lands. There is a darkness hidden here in Pandaria - this you have seen for yourself!"]="Está claro que não tem vindo a trazer seu guerra a estas terras. Há uma escuridão oculta em Pandaria; a tem visto com os seus próprios olhos."
G["It is clear to me that these mogu deserve more investigation. Our work here is done for today, $n. If we have need of you, we will contact you at Domination Point."]="It is clear to me that these mogu deserve more investigation. Our work here is done for today, $n. If we have need of you, we will contact you at Domination Point."
G["It is complete."]="Já está."
G["It is crucial that we bring all of the three remaining spirits back safely. I am too old to do this myself, and for all their strengths, both Aysa and Ji are single-minded in their ideals.\n\nYou possess all the qualities of a hero, and a balance that they do not. It is you that must do this."]="It is crucial that we bring all of the three remaining spirits back safely. I am too old to do this myself, and for all their strengths, both Aysa and Ji are single-minded in their ideals.\n\nYou possess all the qualities of a hero, and a balance that they do not. It is you that must do this."
G["It is dangerous here, master. But I shall help stand guard."]="Isto é perigoso, mestre. Mas ajudarei a montar a guarda aqui."
G["It is days like this I miss using fel magic. Sure it was evil, but it got the job done."]="It is days like this I miss using fel magic. Sure it was evil, but it got the job done."
G["It is decided, then.  We will unite all Gilneans and drive the Forsaken from our lands."]="It is decided, then.  We will unite all Gilneans and drive the Forsaken from our lands."
G["It is decided. The Vale of Eternal Blossoms shall remain open. The transgressions of the outsiders have been great... but I see in them the capability to right what has been wronged."]="Está decidido! O Vale das Flores Eternas permanecerá aberto! As transgressões dos estrangeiros foram muitas... mas vejo neles a capacidade de consertar o mal que foi feito."
G["It is decimating our armies!"]="It is decimating our armies!"
G["It is difficult to know who to trust.  You are new here... relatively unknown.  That works in your favor in this case."]="É difícil saber em quem se você pode confiar. Você acabas de chegar... não te conhece ninguém. Neste atenção, isso joga a nosso favor."
G["It is difficult to say. His injuries are grievous. Even though he is a powerful druid, it will take time and patience to restore him back to full health."]="É difícil dizer. Seus ferimentos são graves. Mesmo que ele seja um druida poderoso, levará tempo e paciência para restaurá-o de volta à saúde total."
G["It is discouraging that Lei Shen has found so many allies to flock to his throne so soon after his return. We should have done a better job to eliminate them during his absence."]="It is discouraging that Lei Shen has found so many allies to flock to his throne so soon after his return. We should have done a better job to eliminate them during his absence."
G["It is done!"]="Já está feito!"
G["It is done!  We are finished."]="Lih’to! Hemos acaba'o!"
G["It is done! Our power now resides within the Dragon Soul! Our fate lies with you, Earth-Warder!"]="Se acabou! Agora nosso poder reside no Alma de dragão! Nosso destino jaz com você, Guardião da Terra!"
G["It is done! The Ice Lord has arrived! Bow to the might of the Horde, fools!"]="It is done! The Ice Lord has arrived! Bow to the might of the Horde, fools!"
G["It is done, but we should not linger here. Meet me back on the eastern edge of the camp."]="It is done, but we should not linger here. Meet me back on the eastern edge of the camp."
G["It is done, dragon. Lead the way."]="Já está, dragão. Vê você linha de frente."
G["It is done, friend. To my knowledge, I am the only black dragon who remains."]="Se acabou. Até onde eu sei, sou o último dragão Negro que resta."
G["It is done, little one. Now, we must focus our efforts on preventing such destruction from claiming any more victims."]="Está feito, $gpequeno: pequena;. Agora devemos centrar nossos esforços nesta que tal destruição se leve mais vítimas."
G["It is done, master."]="Pronto, mestre."
G["It is done, then. Yet...how many of these machines are hidden beneath the earth? How much do we not know about the dark secrets of the mogu?"]="It is done, then. Yet...how many of these machines are hidden beneath the earth? How much do we not know about the dark secrets of the mogu?"
G["It is done."]="Está feito."
G["It is done.  $n, your armor is ready."]="Está pronta. Sua armadura está pronta, $n."
G["It is done.  I have your weapon, $n."]="Está feito. Seu arma já está pronta, $n."
G["It is done.  Leave me here, then, while I wrestle with Rakh'likh in the next world.  Your job here is done, heroes."]="Está feito. Então, deixe-me aqui para que possa lutar com Rakh'likh no seguinte mundo. Seu trabalho aqui terminou."
G["It is done.  Serve the Light well."]="Está feito. Serve bem à Luz."
G["It is done. All have given that which must be given. I now seal the Dragon Soul forever."]="It is done. All have given that which must be given. I now seal the Dragon Soul forever."
G["It is done. Kypari Zar... cries out in unbearable agony."]="Já está. Kypari Zar... grita devido a uma agonia insuportável."
G["It is done. Run back to your masters. Run back to Har'koa. Tell her that I am coming!"]="Já está. Retorna ao lado aos seus mestres. Volta ao lado a Har'koa. Diga que vou!"
G["It is done. Scour the place clean. Leave them nothing to return to!"]="It is done. Scour the place clean. Leave them nothing to return to!"
G["It is done. The Dragon Soul is safely within the clutch of the dragonflights."]="Está feito. A Alma do Dragão está em segurança dentro das garras do voo do dragão."
G["It is done. The spirit is bound with you and you will carry it with you anytime you are in Darkshore. May you serve nature well."]="Já está. O espírito está vinculado você e o levará com você sempre que estiver em Costa Sombria. Que sirvas bem à natureza."
G["It is done. You did it, $p!"]="Se acabou. O conseguiste, $p!"
G["It is done. You may now open the focusing iris."]="Pronto. Agora pode abrir o Íris de enfoque."
G["It is done..."]="Já está feito..."
G["It is done; at last the Destroyer has met his end. Now, we can begin to heal our world."]="Se acabou; finalmente lhe chegou a hora ao Destruidor. Já podemos começar a curar nosso mundo."
G["It is dying! The second part of the Cipher of Damnation is ours. I..."]="Se você está morrendo! A segunda parte da Importante de Condenação é nossa. Eu..."
G["It is dying. It is dying. It is dying."]="Está morrendo. Está morrendo. Está morrendo."
G["It is exactly as I expected, soldier. They know we watch them closely."]="É exatamente o que esperava, soldado. Sabem que os estamos observando."
G["It is filled with Titan magic, the very language of creation..."]="Está cheio de magia titã, a própria linguagem da criação."
G["It is finished then!"]="Então está feito!"
G["It is finished."]="Se acabou."
G["It is finished. (The fate of all.)"]="terminou. (O destino de todos.)"
G["It is finished. You are beaten."]="Se acabou. Has perdido."
G["It is fitting that I be the one to destroy the pet of the Klaxxi!"]="Que adequado, que seja eu o que destruya à ajudante dos Klaxxi!"
G["It is foolish to trust a stranger's every word, but it is also foolish to deny those who might be friends."]="It is foolish to trust a stranger's every word, but it is also foolish to deny those who might be friends."
G["It is for them, or rather for what they represent, that we fight.\n\nOutside these walls, these people's lives are forfeit.  The world as they know it... as we all know it, is threatened by Kael'thas, Illidan and the Burning Legion.\n\nWithin these walls you will find the few that are willing to fight for that world."]="It is for them, or rather for what they represent, that we fight.\n\nOutside these walls, these people's lives are forfeit.  The world as they know it... as we all know it, is threatened by Kael'thas, Illidan and the Burning Legion.\n\nWithin these walls you will find the few that are willing to fight for that world."
G["It is for you."]="Para você si."
G["It is found on the lowest section of Thunder Bluff.  Search near the bank.  It is not far from there."]="Pode ser encontrada na seção mais baixa do Thunder Bluff. Pesquise perto do banco. Não é longe daqui."
G["It is from this throne that I issue the command of Hellscream. His word is life and his word is death."]="É deste trono que eu emito o envio de Hellscream. Sua palavra é vida e sua palavra é morte."
G["It is funny, I think my father is happier now that I have returned than he ever was before!\n\nIt seems that trying times have reminded him to appreciate simplicity."]="It is funny, I think my father is happier now that I have returned than he ever was before!\n\nIt seems that trying times have reminded him to appreciate simplicity."
G["It is gone. I don't remember any of it. Oh! None of them remember. The irony!"]="Já acabou. Eu não lembro de nada. Ah! Nenhum deles se lembra. Que ironia!"
G["It is good of us to help the survivors here, but we must not lose sight of our original mission."]="Está bem ajudar a estes sobreviventes, mas não devemos esquecer nossa missão principal."
G["It is good of you to ask, $c, but we already have all of the baked salmon that we'll need for the war. Perhaps you would be kind enough to check with the other collectors here; they are sure to have something that they could use your help with."]="It is good of you to ask, $c, but we already have all of the baked salmon that we'll need for the war. Perhaps you would be kind enough to check with the other collectors here; they are sure to have something that they could use your help with."
G["It is good that I have been allowed to continue my pursuits here.  I do not wish to overstay my welcome, at any rate.  It would be a great dishonor if I brought any trouble to our capital."]="It is good that I have been allowed to continue my pursuits here.  I do not wish to overstay my welcome, at any rate.  It would be a great dishonor if I brought any trouble to our capital."
G["It is good that you have come my child.  The Light's protection has worn thin on you."]="É bom que tenha vindo, filho. A proteção da Luz se tem enfraquecido em ti."
G["It is good that you wish to help, $c. Unfortunately I have collected up all of the peacebloom that we feel we'll need for the war effort. Maybe you could ask around; I'm sure that there are likely to be others here that still need your aid in gathering other things."]="fico feliz em que queira ajudar, $c. Por desgraça já e reuniu todas as flores de paz necessárias para a campanha. Poderia perguntar por aí pois certo que há alguém que ainda precisa da sua ajuda para coletar outras coisas."
G["It is good that you wish to honor your kills by putting their bodies to use.  Find Thuwd inside the Kodohide Leatherworks in the middle of The Drag."]="É bom que você queira honrar suas mortes colocando seus corpos em uso. Encontre Thuwd dentro da Kodohide Leatherworks no meio de The Drag."
G["It is good to enjoy the fruits of the earth, but not to excess."]="It is good to enjoy the fruits of the earth, but not to excess."
G["It is good to get out of Shattrath every now and then."]="Está bem sair de Shattrath de vez em quando."
G["It is good to have you back, Hamuul. Let us leave this place."]="Fico feliz ver você de volta, Hamuul. Abandonemos este lugar."
G["It is good to meet you, $n."]="$n, Onda, fico feliz em ver você."
G["It is good to see Niuzao healthy and strong."]="fico feliz em que Niuzao continue forte e vidaable."
G["It is good to see a friend of the Aldor around these remote parts.  I fear I cannot stand for much more of these elves' insolent chatter."]="É bom ver um amigo do Aldor em torno dessas partes remotas. Temo não suportar muito mais a conversa insolente desses elfos."
G["It is good to see another explorer! When some people discover a new land, they immediately seek out the fortresses and temples.\n\nNot me.\n\nTo get the measure of a people, you need to get your feet dirty. Come, walk the land with me! Let us see what these mainland pandaren truly value.\n\nIt is the Wanderer's Way."]="It is good to see another explorer! When some people discover a new land, they immediately seek out the fortresses and temples.\n\nNot me.\n\nTo get the measure of a people, you need to get your feet dirty. Come, walk the land with me! Let us see what these mainland pandaren truly value.\n\nIt is the Wanderer's Way."
G["It is good to see everyone in such high spirits."]="It is good to see everyone in such high spirits."
G["It is good to see others who fight the Scourge in Stratholme, for it is here they are strongest.\n\nGreetings.  I am Aurius.  I was once a paladin of the Silver Hand, but like others whose faith wavered... I fell from grace.  The Scourge seduced me and nearly transformed me into a death knight!\n\nFinally sensing my peril, I fled to this chapel.  It is a sacred place, where the first paladin, Uther the Lightbringer, was ordained into the order of the Silver Hand."]="It is good to see others who fight the Scourge in Stratholme, for it is here they are strongest.\n\nGreetings.  I am Aurius.  I was once a paladin of the Silver Hand, but like others whose faith wavered... I fell from grace.  The Scourge seduced me and nearly transformed me into a death knight!\n\nFinally sensing my peril, I fled to this chapel.  It is a sacred place, where the first paladin, Uther the Lightbringer, was ordained into the order of the Silver Hand."
G["It is good to see the Burning Blade is taking over where the Shadow Council once failed."]="É bom ver a Lâmina Ardente assumindo o lugar onde o Conselho das Sombras falhou."
G["It is good to see you again, $C $n.  Dornaa has been asking about you."]="fico feliz em ver você novamente, $c $n. Dornaa tem estado perguntado por você."
G["It is good to see you again, $C $n.  Salandria has been asking about you."]="fico feliz em ver você novamente, $c $n. Salandria tem estado perguntado por você."
G["It is good to see you again, $n."]="fico feliz em voltar a ver você, $n."
G["It is good to see you again, $n. How could I ever forget the $g man : woman; who saved my sister's life?"]="It is good to see you again, $n. How could I ever forget the $g man : woman; who saved my sister's life?"
G["It is good to see you again, $n. How have you fared?"]="fico feliz em voltar a ver você, $n. Que tal você ido?"
G["It is good to see you again, $n. Perhaps once things have settled down, I can talk to you about the priceless treasure that we have lost..."]="It is good to see you again, $n. Perhaps once things have settled down, I can talk to you about the priceless treasure that we have lost..."
G["It is good to see you again, $n. Would you like me to take you to the master's lair?"]="fico feliz em ver você novamente, $n. Que que te leve à covil do mestre?"
G["It is good to see you again, Alexstrasza. I have been busy in my absence."]="Fico feliz voltar a ver você, Alexstrasza. tenho estado ocupado na minha ausência."
G["It is good to see you again, Doctor $n. I have been following your progress and I dare say that it is time you learned some of the more advanced bandaging techniques.\n\nReturn to me from time to time, as your skill advances, and I shall teach you all that I know."]="It is good to see you again, Doctor $n. I have been following your progress and I dare say that it is time you learned some of the more advanced bandaging techniques.\n\nReturn to me from time to time, as your skill advances, and I shall teach you all that I know."
G["It is good to see you again, friend."]="É bom te ver novamente, amigo."
G["It is good to see you alive and well, $n!"]="fico feliz em ver você com vida, $n!"
G["It is good to see you among us again, $n."]="fico feliz em voltar a ver você entre nós, $n."
G["It is good to see you here, child."]="fico feliz em ver você, jovem."
G["It is good to see you, my friend. So much is transpiring it is hard for a Lorewalker like myself to keep up. I have seen many things through my dream brew, but we will need a hero such as yourself to help write this next chapter of our history."]="It is good to see you, my friend. So much is transpiring it is hard for a Lorewalker like myself to keep up. I have seen many things through my dream brew, but we will need a hero such as yourself to help write this next chapter of our history."
G["It is great to see you again, $n."]="$n, Estou encantado de voltar a ver você."
G["It is great to see you again, my friend. It seems like only yesturday we saved the city of Stoneplow from the mantid swarms."]="fico feliz muito de voltar a ver você. Parece que foi ontem quando salvamos a cidade de Vilharroca dos enjambres de mantídeos."
G["It is he who commands the sons of iron in their war against us."]="Ele é quem dirige aos filhos do ferro no seu guerra contra nós."
G["It is heartening to see you here, Moira. You have my thanks."]="It is heartening to see you here, Moira. You have my thanks."
G["It is here that Gul'dan severed the tie between orcs and the elemental spirits. His unquenchable thirst for power could not be satiated with the complete annihilation of the draenei. He had to also destroy Draenor, razing the land and siphoning all of its energies for use in his war.\n\nNow all that is left are remnants of his madness.\n\nLook to the altar, $r - the land is forever haunted..."]="It is here that Gul'dan severed the tie between orcs and the elemental spirits. His unquenchable thirst for power could not be satiated with the complete annihilation of the draenei. He had to also destroy Draenor, razing the land and siphoning all of its energies for use in his war.\n\nNow all that is left are remnants of his madness.\n\nLook to the altar, $r - the land is forever haunted..."
end)(AscensionPTBR.GossipEN2ES)
;(function(G)
G["It is here the chosen realize their destiny. (One with eternity). And it is here that you will realize yours.(End of the flesh. End of the flesh)!"]="It is here the chosen realize their destiny. (One with eternity). And it is here that you will realize yours.(End of the flesh. End of the flesh)!"
G["It is here, surrounded by the heroes and patriots of Gilneas where he belongs."]="O lugar dele é aqui, cercado pelos heróis e patriotas de Guilnéas."
G["It is history... A history of Silithus... of Ahn'Qiraj... of Titans and Old Gods... I read from the prophecy of C'Thun as written by the Qiraji Prophet Skeram. A prophecy that portends a cataclysm..."]="It is history... A history of Silithus... of Ahn'Qiraj... of Titans and Old Gods... I read from the prophecy of C'Thun as written by the Qiraji Prophet Skeram. A prophecy that portends a cataclysm..."
G["It is hopeless. Cutting one down results in two new growths."]="É desesperante. Quando cortas um, aparecem dois novos retonhos."
G["It is hopeless... I've done all I can."]="Não há esperança... Fiz o que e pedido."
G["It is if I'm not the one that's going to be sent in to test it... Otherwise, no."]="It is if I'm not the one that's going to be sent in to test it... Otherwise, no."
G["It is imperative that we understand the mogu's history. Our best chance at a successful offensive will come from knowledge of our enemy."]="Precisamos entender a história dos mogu. Conhecer a nosso inimigo é a importante para a vitória."
G["It is important for the trainees to learn the sting of defeat, that they might appreciate the value of victory."]="It is important for the trainees to learn the sting of defeat, that they might appreciate the value of victory."
G["It is important to throw the spear just before slaying the beast. Not a moment too soon! Not a moment too late!"]="É importantes arrojar a lança logo antes de matar à fera. Nem um momento antes! Nem um momento depois!"
G["It is in the forest where your feet do not walk.  Continue along the mountains and you will find it."]="It is in the forest where your feet do not walk.  Continue along the mountains and you will find it."
G["It is in the universe's best interest to re-originate this planet should my analysis find systemic corruption. Do not interfere."]="It is in the universe's best interest to re-originate this planet should my analysis find systemic corruption. Do not interfere."
G["It is in the western portion Trade District, just north of the fountain."]="Está no lado oeste do Distrito de Mercadores, logo ao norte da fonte."
G["It is in this moment, friends, that we should ask ourselves.  What would the Old Gods want us to do?"]="It is in this moment, friends, that we should ask ourselves.  What would the Old Gods want us to do?"
G["It is indeed Quel'Delar. I had not thought I'd live to see the day when Thalorien Dawnseeker's legendary sword would be restored to us."]="It is indeed Quel'Delar. I had not thought I'd live to see the day when Thalorien Dawnseeker's legendary sword would be restored to us."
G["It is integral to the assimilation of this data that it is understood that the Creators wanted to synthesize a race that would long be an integral part of this world's development cycle after they had departed.  This race would be instrumental in fulfilling the Creators' long-term development objectives for Azeroth.  \n\nAs an ancillary note, the nomenclature \"Earthen\" was deemed apropos for the new race by the Creators, based on the Earthen's composition."]="It is integral to the assimilation of this data that it is understood that the Creators wanted to synthesize a race that would long be an integral part of this world's development cycle after they had departed.  This race would be instrumental in fulfilling the Creators' long-term development objectives for Azeroth.  \n\nAs an ancillary note, the nomenclature \"Earthen\" was deemed apropos for the new race by the Creators, based on the Earthen's composition."
G["It is me again. It is good to see you, $n.\n\nShall we begin?"]="Sou eu outra vez. fico feliz em ver você, $n.\n\nEmpezamos?"
G["It is my charge to watch over these eggs. I will see you burn before any harm comes to them!"]="It is my charge to watch over these eggs. I will see you burn before any harm comes to them!"
G["It is my dream to one day serve under your command, $G Master:Mistress; $n. That is, should you ever deem me worthy of such things..."]="It is my dream to one day serve under your command, $G Master:Mistress; $n. That is, should you ever deem me worthy of such things..."
G["It is my duty and honor to die for the Abyssal Council!"]="É meu dever e honra morrer pelo Conselho Asa!"
G["It is my fervent hope that we will be able to bring the Light to those places in Ashenvale where it has been forsaken."]="É minha fervorosa esperança que possamos trazer a Luz para aqueles lugares em Ashenvale onde foi abandonada."
G["It is my honor to provide for adventurers, for they are heroes in the making."]="É minha honra prover aventureiros, pois eles são heróis em formação."
G["It is my role to test our young initiates on the ways of the hunt.\n\nAnd that hasn't changed. Today, the quilboar are our prey."]="Meu dever é examinar aos jovens iniciados no caminho da caça.\n\nIsso não tem mudado. Hoje nossas presas são os jabaespines."
G["It is my time, Avuun. Nobody is to blame..."]="Chegou meu hora, Avuun. Não é culpar de ninguém..."
G["It is my understanding that the people of the Alliance celebrate this Winter Veil in Ironforge."]="It is my understanding that the people of the Alliance celebrate this Winter Veil in Ironforge."
G["It is my warchief, Greatmother. The leader of my people. From my world. He... He is the son of Durotan. He is your grandchild."]="É o meu guerreiro, Grande-mãe. O líder do meu povo. Do meu mundo. Ele... Ele é o filho de Durotan. Ele é seu neto."
G["It is nice to see some concerned individuals travelling on the roads these days.  My husband would have liked you.  We always wanted children."]="It is nice to see some concerned individuals travelling on the roads these days.  My husband would have liked you.  We always wanted children."
G["It is no easy task to protect the Horde's lumber gathering efforts here in Ashenvale, but we have never shied from battle!  The night elves and their allies will fall!"]="Não é tarefa fácil proteger os esforços de pegue de madeira da Horda aqui em Ashenvale, mas nunca evitamos a batalha! Os elfos da noite e seus aliados cairão!"
G["It is no light endeavor upon which you embark $n.  To get to Warsong Gulch you will want to speak to Aethalas, the Battlemaster of the Silverwing Sentinels.  She will guide your way.  Blessings of the Goddess be with you!"]="A missão na que te embarcas não é uma tarefa fácil, $n. Para chegar à Ravina Brado Guerreiro terá que falar com Aethalas, a mestra de batalha dos sentinelas Asa de Prata. Ela te guiará no seu caminho. Que as bendições da deusa sejam com você!"
G["It is no surprise that the people of this land hold a great festival of the moon. I should very much like to go to Moonglade to attend it."]="It is no surprise that the people of this land hold a great festival of the moon. I should very much like to go to Moonglade to attend it."
G["It is no use, the power of the Dragon Soul is too great. I cannot wield it safely; the raging forces contained within it may be the doom of us all."]="It is no use, the power of the Dragon Soul is too great. I cannot wield it safely; the raging forces contained within it may be the doom of us all."
G["It is no use, the power of the Soul is too great. I cannot wield it safely; the raging forces within it may be the doom of us all."]="It is no use, the power of the Soul is too great. I cannot wield it safely; the raging forces within it may be the doom of us all."
G["It is no use.  My magic is ineffective on these creatures."]="It is no use.  My magic is ineffective on these creatures."
G["It is none of your concern, maggot."]="Não é do seu incumbência, me ver."
G["It is not for us to judge these atrocities. Ivus will pass judgement once he arrives."]="Não cabe a nós julgar essas atrocidades. Ivus julgará assim que chegar."
G["It is not her name I am interested in. It is her. She is the kindest, nicest, prettiest person I have ever met."]="It is not her name I am interested in. It is her. She is the kindest, nicest, prettiest person I have ever met."
G["It is not in our nature to shirk from danger. We will dive gladly into darkness if it means protecting our loved ones."]="Não está em nossa naturezao fugir do perigo. Nos adentraremos na escuridão sem medo se isso indica proteção a aqueles aos que queremos."
G["It is not meant for you! Get away from here!"]="It is not meant for you! Get away from here!"
G["It is not much, but I will lend you what little I have. May it help you in this final hour."]="Não é muito, mas te ofereço o pouco que tenho. Espero que seja de ajuda nesta hora sombria."
G["It is not my decision whether you are to be trusted by my people. Until our mayor decides otherwise, I consider you a friend."]="Se meu gente confia em ti ou não não é decisão minha. A não ser que o alcalde digao contrario, eu te considero $gamigo nosso: amiga nossa;."
G["It is not my intention to initiate legislation against you."]="Não é meu intenção iniciar legislação contra ti."
G["It is not our desire to get wrapped up in your bloodshed. Now have your men lower their weapons, or you will face TWO enemies on this continent."]="Nós não queremos nos envolver em seu derramamento de sangue. Agora faça com que seus homens abaixem as armas, ou vocês enfrentarão DOIS inimigos neste continente."
G["It is not our way, nor would it be possible. Nefarian is guarded by ancient wards, as old as the Aspects themselves. It is what prevents me from entering the inner sanctum of this citadel. The dark magic prevents any of the other flight to enter without being ordained... unless."]="Não é o nosso caminho, nem seria possível. Nefarian é guardado por enfermarias antigas, tão antigas quanto os próprios Aspectos. É o que me impede de entrar no santuário interior desta cidadela. A magia negra impede que qualquer outro voo entre sem ser organizado... a menos que."
G["It is not safe out here, $n.  Seek shelter before it's too late."]="It is not safe out here, $n.  Seek shelter before it's too late."
G["It is not simply a beautification measure, but also a morale booster. It demonstrates to our people that we have a great deal of power at our fingertips, and with it... we can do nearly anything."]="It is not simply a beautification measure, but also a morale booster. It demonstrates to our people that we have a great deal of power at our fingertips, and with it... we can do nearly anything."
G["It is not surprising that a blood elf's potential for power as a demon hunter is so high.  After all, the sin'dorei do not have the natural aversion to demonic magic that night elves do.\n\nHowever, I do not expect many to succeed.  Most of them, Varedis included, pursue power for its own sake.  That power will consume them, for they are not driven by the pure fire that burns inside a true demon hunter's heart."]="It is not surprising that a blood elf's potential for power as a demon hunter is so high.  After all, the sin'dorei do not have the natural aversion to demonic magic that night elves do.\n\nHowever, I do not expect many to succeed.  Most of them, Varedis included, pursue power for its own sake.  That power will consume them, for they are not driven by the pure fire that burns inside a true demon hunter's heart."
G["It is not the fighters I watch; that is the Combat Masters' task.\nMy concern is for the two neophytes whose duty it is to heal them. So far, my students are doing well."]="It is not the fighters I watch; that is the Combat Masters' task.\nMy concern is for the two neophytes whose duty it is to heal them. So far, my students are doing well."
G["It is not the time to turn against one another, $n."]="It is not the time to turn against one another, $n."
G["It is not too late to save yourselves from the coming catastrophe!"]="It is not too late to save yourselves from the coming catastrophe!"
G["It is not too late, Garrosh. Lay down the mantle of Warchief. We can end this here, now, with no more bloodshed."]="Não é tarde demais, Garrosh. Renuncia ao cargo de Chefe de Guerra. Isto pode acabar agora, sem mais sangue."
G["It is not worth answering."]="Não merece a pena responder."
G["It is not yet your time, champion. Rise! Rise and fight once more!"]="Ainda não é seu momentos, $gcampeón: campeona;. Levántate! Levántate e luta uma vez mais!"
G["It is not yet your time. I shall aid your journey back to the realm of the living... for a price."]="Ainda não é sua hora. Ajudarei sua jornada de volta ao reino dos vivos... por um preço."
G["It is nothing. I am fine."]="Não é nada. Estou bem."
G["It is now as it should be, shaman. You have done well."]="Agora é como deveria ser, xamã. Fez bem."
G["It is now flashing brightly.  You're very close!"]="Agora resplandece com força. Está muito perto!"
G["It is one of the synthesis matrices the Creators use when seeding a world.  Each synthesis matrix is used to achieve the Creators' goals.  For Azeroth, a subterranean being matrix was modified to create a being with increased durability with an affinity for deep region shaping; the Earthen are the product of this modification.\n\nAfter the Earthen had been put into service for the Creators, unforeseen anomalies were discovered that affected their synthesis matrix due to high-stress environments."]="It is one of the synthesis matrices the Creators use when seeding a world.  Each synthesis matrix is used to achieve the Creators' goals.  For Azeroth, a subterranean being matrix was modified to create a being with increased durability with an affinity for deep region shaping; the Earthen are the product of this modification.\n\nAfter the Earthen had been put into service for the Creators, unforeseen anomalies were discovered that affected their synthesis matrix due to high-stress environments."
G["It is our duty to honor the sacred days of our allies, however strange."]="É nosso dever honrar os dias sagrados de nossos aliados por estranhos que sejam."
G["It is our duty to protect these taunka and provide them with what little comfort we can offer."]="É nosso dever proteger esses taunka e proporcionar-lhes o pouco conforto que podemos oferecer."
G["It is our responsibility to keep the muck fresh. The filth keeps us safe. It keeps our enemies away."]="It is our responsibility to keep the muck fresh. The filth keeps us safe. It keeps our enemies away."
G["It is our sacred duty to monitor and imprison the Sha. To defeat it wherever it darkens the hearts of our people."]="It is our sacred duty to monitor and imprison the Sha. To defeat it wherever it darkens the hearts of our people."
G["It is our sacred duty. The pact was sealed, the bargain made..."]="É nosso dever sagrado. O pacto foi selado, o trato feito..."
G["It is over! Finished!"]="Se tem terminado! Para sempre!"
G["It is over! Withdraw! We have failed...."]="Se tem terminado! Retirada! Temos fracassado..."
G["It is over, your search is done. Let fate choose now, the righteous one."]="É o fim, sua procurando aqui acaba. É de importância capital ver que o destino espera."
G["It is overwhelming... cannot fight..."]="É sobrecogedor... não posso lutar..."
G["It is pointless to resist."]="It is pointless to resist."
G["It is possible for one, not of dragon kind, to obtain the Adorned Seal of Ascension and pass through the protected barrier. While possession of such an item would surely destroy me, perhaps you could utilize it and lower the barrier."]="It is possible for one, not of dragon kind, to obtain the Adorned Seal of Ascension and pass through the protected barrier. While possession of such an item would surely destroy me, perhaps you could utilize it and lower the barrier."
G["It is power, imbecile.\n\n<Mataus's eyes darken.>\n\nThese fools send idiots like you into Naxxramas to retrieve desecrated armor so that they may purify it and restore the pieces to their former glory.\n\n<Mataus spits.>\n\nJust the thought of such utter stupidity brings the bile up to my throat.\n\nI too seek that armor, but in its most foul and desecrated form."]="It is power, imbecile.\n\n<Mataus's eyes darken.>\n\nThese fools send idiots like you into Naxxramas to retrieve desecrated armor so that they may purify it and restore the pieces to their former glory.\n\n<Mataus spits.>\n\nJust the thought of such utter stupidity brings the bile up to my throat.\n\nI too seek that armor, but in its most foul and desecrated form."
G["It is quiet here today. Good."]="Hoje está isto muito tranquilo. Bem."
G["It is regrettable that, among our many enemies in Hellfire Peninsula, the orcs of Hellfire Citadel stand among them.\n\nBut... who better to challenge and hone the Horde... than orcs?"]="It is regrettable that, among our many enemies in Hellfire Peninsula, the orcs of Hellfire Citadel stand among them.\n\nBut... who better to challenge and hone the Horde... than orcs?"
G["It is regrettable, but necessary."]="É lamentable, mas necessário."
G["It is responsible for corrupting these forests."]="É o responsável da corrupção de estes florestas."
G["It is rude to speak to jinyu of a higher rank than yourself."]="É de mal educação falar com jinyu de um grau superior ao seu."
G["It is sad to see what has happened to this land.  The Cenarion Expedition will do what it can to understand and heal the damage that has been done."]="É triste ver o que aconteceu com esta terra. A Expedição Cenarion fará o possível para entender e curar o dano que foi causado."
G["It is said that \"Wisdom lights the path.\"\n\n...But wisdom never kept me from stubbing my toe at night."]="It is said that \"Wisdom lights the path.\"\n\n...But wisdom never kept me from stubbing my toe at night."
G["It is said that Heigan has rigged the very walls and floors of Naxxramas itself with a vast array of traps, which he can trigger at will."]="It is said that Heigan has rigged the very walls and floors of Naxxramas itself with a vast array of traps, which he can trigger at will."
G["It is said that Kel'Thuzad seeks the legendary Atiesh, greatstaff of the Guardian.\n\nYes, the very staff once held by Medivh."]="It is said that Kel'Thuzad seeks the legendary Atiesh, greatstaff of the Guardian.\n\nYes, the very staff once held by Medivh."
G["It is said that after the revolution, the Red Crane of Hope placed the rainbow in the sky, so that pandaren would know not to fear the storms any longer."]="Dizem que depois da revolução, a Garça Vermelha da Esperança colocou o arco-íris no céu para que os pandarens não temessem mais as tempestades. "
G["It is said that all the trees in the vale blossomed as he entered, and continue to blossom to this day."]="Dizem que todas as árvores do vale floresceram quando ele entrou, e continuam a florescer até hoje."
G["It is said that he tore out the very heart of the mogu God. And from that hateful act he gained power over wind and storm."]="Dizem que ele arrancou o coração do Deus mogu. E a partir desse momento odioso ele recebeu poderes sobre o vento e a tempestade."
G["It is said that the Thunder King's armies are vast and powerful. Do you think that the battle will ever reach us here?"]="Se diz que os exércitos do Rei do Trovão são numerosos e poderosos. Acha que a batalha chegará até aqui em algum momentos?"
G["It is said that those who are blessed by the spirits of Auchindoun possess the ability to capture powerful souls in the form of Spirit Shards. I have come across a few of these Spirit Shards throughout my travels but have yet to unlock their secrets. \nThe only thing I have been able to discern is that they seem to originate from the depths of Auchindoun itself. If you happen to come across any of these Spirit Shards I'm sure I could make it worth your while to allow me to take them off your hands..."]="It is said that those who are blessed by the spirits of Auchindoun possess the ability to capture powerful souls in the form of Spirit Shards. I have come across a few of these Spirit Shards throughout my travels but have yet to unlock their secrets. \nThe only thing I have been able to discern is that they seem to originate from the depths of Auchindoun itself. If you happen to come across any of these Spirit Shards I'm sure I could make it worth your while to allow me to take them off your hands..."
G["It is said that, before she joined our monastery, Myang defeated one hundred ravaging hozen in a single melee."]="It is said that, before she joined our monastery, Myang defeated one hundred ravaging hozen in a single melee."
G["It is said the God King Rastakhan, ruler of the Zandalari, lords over his mighty kingdom from a throne carved of solid gold."]="Dizem que o Deus-rei Rastakhan, soberano dos Zandalari, governa seu majestoso reino em um trono esculpido em ouro maciço."
G["It is said, \"Turn your face towards the sun, and the shadows will fall behind you.\"\n\nI hope you find many bright days ahead of you, $n!"]="It is said, \"Turn your face towards the sun, and the shadows will fall behind you.\"\n\nI hope you find many bright days ahead of you, $n!"
G["It is settled. I command the Might of Kalimdor. Be certain that your soldiers understand and accept this as fact. Bloodshed is already plentiful. Let there be none between our factions."]="It is settled. I command the Might of Kalimdor. Be certain that your soldiers understand and accept this as fact. Bloodshed is already plentiful. Let there be none between our factions."
G["It is shameful that we sin'dorei have lost so much of what we used to call home.  It shall not be long before we regain our strength and retake our southern lands back from the Scourge!"]="É vergonhoso que tenhamos perdido muito do que costumávamos chamar de lar. Não demorará muito para recuperarmos nossas forças e retomarmos nossas terras do sul do Flagelo!"
G["It is so energy-dense as to combust at the slightest provocation."]="Está tão denso de energia que pode prender fogo à menor provocação."
G["It is so good to see you, $g brother : sister;!  This place gives me the creeps.  While you're here, be sure to avail yourself of the many opportunities that these so-called Forsaken are providing."]="It is so good to see you, $g brother : sister;!  This place gives me the creeps.  While you're here, be sure to avail yourself of the many opportunities that these so-called Forsaken are providing."
G["It is so much larger than any of the Pandaren balloons... Does it belong to the outsiders?"]="It is so much larger than any of the Pandaren balloons... Does it belong to the outsiders?"
G["It is so nice of you think of me, darlin'."]="É muito gentil por você o pensar em mim."
G["It is so relaxing to not have to run the market for once."]="Que tranquilidade, não ter que levar o submercado por um dia..."
G["It is standing right behind you. Do not move. Do not breathe."]="Está logo por trás de ti. Não te muevas. Não respires."
G["It is strange, I know... Most mortals cannot actually comprehend what they see here, as often, what they see is not anchored within their own perception of reality."]="It is strange, I know... Most mortals cannot actually comprehend what they see here, as often, what they see is not anchored within their own perception of reality."
G["It is the assistance of Bulrug that you need.  You will find him outside on the lower rise standing between the inn and the Thunder Bluff Bank."]="É a assistência da Bulrug que você precisa. Você o encontrará do lado de fosse, na subida mais baixa, entre a pousada e o Thunder Bluff Bank."
G["It is the baseline material used in race synthesis.  A cross-section of Azeroth's crust was used as the foundation for the Earthen's synthesis rather than the typical biomass construction foundation used by the Creators.\n\nResearch on the world's composition led the Creators to theorize that an enhanced being could be synthesized that would epitomize the resiliency of this world's essence.  This was accomplished by choosing to use a blend of Azeroth's various stone core compounds as the foundation."]="It is the baseline material used in race synthesis.  A cross-section of Azeroth's crust was used as the foundation for the Earthen's synthesis rather than the typical biomass construction foundation used by the Creators.\n\nResearch on the world's composition led the Creators to theorize that an enhanced being could be synthesized that would epitomize the resiliency of this world's essence.  This was accomplished by choosing to use a blend of Azeroth's various stone core compounds as the foundation."
G["It is the day of reckoning, $c!"]="Hoje se fará justiça, $c!"
G["It is the last night of the Lunar Festival.  May fortune be with you!"]="É a última noite do Festival Lunar! Que a fortuna estiver com você."
G["It is the wanderer's way."]="It is the wanderer's way."
G["It is the way of the Observer to bear witness to all things that come to pass. So many delicious magics have I tasted at your side, $gmaster:mistress;."]="It is the way of the Observer to bear witness to all things that come to pass. So many delicious magics have I tasted at your side, $gmaster:mistress;."
G["It is them!"]="São eles!"
G["It is these waters that kept the Vale in bloom.  Their runoff into the Valley of the Four Winds created the most fertile farmland in the world!"]="It is these waters that kept the Vale in bloom.  Their runoff into the Valley of the Four Winds created the most fertile farmland in the world!"
G["It is this memory of Arthas that I choose to keep in my heart."]="Este é o lembrança de Arthas que elegí guardados na minha coração."
G["It is this phylactery - Thel'zan's phylactery - that is the key to victory!"]="Esta filactério, a filactério de Thel'zan, é a chave até a vitória!"
G["It is this: Welcome."]="É isto: bem-vindo."
G["It is those two cannons along the wall that are slowing us down.  Without their protection our forces would be able to rush their fortification without taking any losses.\n\nIt's either take out those cannons or wait until they run out of ammunition.  Anselm's choice, I suppose."]="It is those two cannons along the wall that are slowing us down.  Without their protection our forces would be able to rush their fortification without taking any losses.\n\nIt's either take out those cannons or wait until they run out of ammunition.  Anselm's choice, I suppose."
G["It is through the power of the unholy that we command death itself!"]="É através do poder dos ímpios que comandamos a própria morte!"
G["It is time I put an end to my brother's madness."]="Já é hora de que ponga ponto fim à loucura de meu irmão."
G["It is time for the final step; we must activate the altar."]="Chegou a hora do sonho fim; devemos ativar o altar."
G["It is time for us as kingdoms and as individuals to set aside our long-standing feuds and unite. The tides of an unwinnable war are upon us, and we must seek refuge on higher ground, lest we be swept away by the flood of darkness."]="It is time for us as kingdoms and as individuals to set aside our long-standing feuds and unite. The tides of an unwinnable war are upon us, and we must seek refuge on higher ground, lest we be swept away by the flood of darkness."
G["It is time for us to continue westward $p, after the Sha of Hatred."]="$p, É hora de avançar para o oeste, a pelo Sha do ódio."
G["It is time for you to expand your knowledge with another teacher; Ockil has unlocked many fascinating wonders of the engineer, and will lead you on your path to discovery, yes?"]="It is time for you to expand your knowledge with another teacher; Ockil has unlocked many fascinating wonders of the engineer, and will lead you on your path to discovery, yes?"
G["It is time for you to journey to Darnassus and speak to Me'lynn. She will guide you from now on."]="É hora de você viajar para Darnassus e falar com Me'lynn. Ela o guiará de agora em diante."
G["It is time for you to move on. Telonis, a night elf located within the Craftsmen's Terrace in Darnassus, is the next step in your training."]="Chegou o momentos de alterar de tercio. Telonis, um elfo da noite que se encontre no Bancal do Artesão em Darnassus é o próximo passo no seu treinamento."
G["It is time for you to show me that leadership. Tambre, you will spearhead the offensive on Sardor Isle. Your ferocity will be needed there."]="It is time for you to show me that leadership. Tambre, you will spearhead the offensive on Sardor Isle. Your ferocity will be needed there."
G["It is time for your challenge disciple. Use my teachings well."]="It is time for your challenge disciple. Use my teachings well."
G["It is time for your learning to be put to the test. Step forth."]="It is time for your learning to be put to the test. Step forth."
G["It is time that I returned to Ogri'la. I hope you do not forget about us, as we have not forgotten you."]="Já ser hora que eu voltar a Ogri'a. Esperar que você não esquecer a nós, assim como nós não haver esquecido você."
G["It is time to be rid of you."]="It is time to be rid of you."
G["It is time to face Socrethar, $n.  Are you ready?"]="It is time to face Socrethar, $n.  Are you ready?"
G["It is time to face your final challenge young warriors! Prepare for your hardest fight yet."]="Guerreiros, é hora de enfrentar seu desafio fim! Preparem-se para a sua luta fim."
G["It is time to get the fish from the market."]="É hora de pegar o peixe no submercado."
G["It is time to go home, Prince Anduin."]="É hora de voltar a casa, príncipe Anduin."
G["It is time to show you my true power! [PH]"]="É hora de mostrar meu verdadeiro poder!"
G["It is time you moved on to a more advanced teacher. In the Feathermoon Stronghold of Feralas dwells the night elf Kylanna Windwhisper. She has a brilliant mind; doubtless she can train you further."]="Está na hora de você mudar para um professor mais avançado. Na Fortaleza da Lua-de-Pena de Feralas habita a elfo noturno Kylanna Windwhisper. Ela tem uma mente brilhante; sem dúvida ela pode treiná-o ainda mais."
G["It is time, $c.\n\nLet us see what has been so carefully hidden..."]="É a hora, $c.\n\nVeamos que é o que foi escondido com tanto cuidado..."
G["It is time, Frye!  Attack!"]="É o momentos, Frye! Ataca!"
G["It is time.  May the Light give us strength."]="É a hora. Que a Luz nos otorgue a força."
G["It is time.  The rite of exorcism will now commence..."]="É a hora. O rito do exorcismo começará agora..."
G["It is time. I will expend everything to bind every thread here, now, around the Dragon Soul. What comes to pass will NEVER be undone."]="It is time. I will expend everything to bind every thread here, now, around the Dragon Soul. What comes to pass will NEVER be undone."
G["It is time. Sully and I are leaving to scout the interior of the island."]="É a hora. Sully e eu vamos explorar o interior da ilha."
G["It is too late for Jarl... its hold is too strong..."]="It is too late for Jarl... its hold is too strong..."
G["It is too late for us, living one. Take yourself and your friend away from here before you both are... claimed..."]="It is too late for us, living one. Take yourself and your friend away from here before you both are... claimed..."
G["It is too late to run!"]="É tarde demais para correr!"
G["It is too powerful!"]="É demais poderoso!"
G["It is trivial to extinguish your fire!"]="É absurdo tentar extinguir seu fogo!"
G["It is true I have skills to teach to those who are worthy. Would that be you?"]="É verdade que tenho habilidades para ensinar àqueles que são dignos. Seria você?"
G["It is true that our choice here today will affect the destiny of our flight. And likely, the destiny of the world."]="É certo que nossa elecção de hoje afetará ao destino de nosso Voo e, provavelmente, ao destino do mundo."
G["It is true that we serve Deathwing, but we also serve a higher power. Never forget that!"]="It is true that we serve Deathwing, but we also serve a higher power. Never forget that!"
G["It is true! All is as you promised us!"]="It is true! All is as you promised us!"
G["It is true, $n.  The wheels of doom now turn, inevitably, toward the true return of Hakkar!"]="It is true, $n.  The wheels of doom now turn, inevitably, toward the true return of Hakkar!"
G["It is true, it may be possible to someday harness the sha into a weapon. But we risk destroying our own people in the process. That is not a price I am willing to pay."]="It is true, it may be possible to someday harness the sha into a weapon. But we risk destroying our own people in the process. That is not a price I am willing to pay."
G["It is true, young $r, we and the Alliance have gathered and prepared all that we will need for this upcoming conflict at Ahn'Qiraj. Even now these things are being sent to Cenarion Hold, and the last of them should arrive within a day. After all is in place, some person will need to ring the gong on the Scarab Dais to open the gates and start the war."]="É certo, jovem $r, nós e a Aliança já temos reuniu e pronto tudo o que vamos precisar para o iminente conflito que terá lugar em Ahn'Qiraj. Todas as coisas estão de caminho ao Forte Cenariano e o último carregamento deveria chegar no próximo dia. Quando tudo estiver no seu lugar, alguém terá que fazer soar o gongo que situado no Estrado do Besouro para abrir as portões e começar à guerra."
G["It is true, young $r, we and the Alliance have gathered and prepared all that we will need for this upcoming conflict at Ahn'Qiraj. Even now these things are being sent to Cenarion Hold, and they should all arrive within $2113w days. After all is in place, some person will need to ring the gong on the Scarab Dais to open the gates and start the war."]="É certo, jovem $r, nós e a Aliança já temos reuniu e pronto tudo o que vamos precisar para o iminente conflito que terá lugar em Ahn'Qiraj. Todas as coisas estão de caminho ao Forte Cenariano e o último carregamento deveria chegar nos próximos $2113w dias. Quando tudo estiver no seu lugar, alguém terá que fazer soar o gongo que situado no Estrado do Besouro para abrir as portões e começar à guerra."
G["It is true. They are strong. There is much they can teach us."]="É certo. São fortes. Têm muito que nos ensinar."
G["It is true: he has the spirit of the wolf. And he fights like a wolf."]="É verdade: ele tem o espírito do lobo. E luta como um lobo."
G["It is truly a great time for the Twilight's Hammer.  The greatest of times.  First, Lord Deathwing's arrival.  And now... now great Ragnaros has returned!"]="It is truly a great time for the Twilight's Hammer.  The greatest of times.  First, Lord Deathwing's arrival.  And now... now great Ragnaros has returned!"
G["It is truly a pleasure to see you again, $n."]="É um verdadeiro prazer voltar a ver você, $n."
G["It is truly admirable to do combat with a celestial."]="Lutar com um celestial é algo mesmo admirable."
G["It is truly an honor to be in the presence of Xuen and the other celestials."]="It is truly an honor to be in the presence of Xuen and the other celestials."
G["It is unconscionable that Malygos would have his forces attack the temple! With your permission, my lord, I will defend us with my life."]="It is unconscionable that Malygos would have his forces attack the temple! With your permission, my lord, I will defend us with my life."
G["It is unfortunate that this is not a contest of brewing. Never have I seen so many brewmasters gathered at once!"]="It is unfortunate that this is not a contest of brewing. Never have I seen so many brewmasters gathered at once!"
G["It is unwise to anger me!"]="It is unwise to anger me!"
G["It is very good to see you again, $n! I trust the weapons I gave you at Ravenholdt have served you well?\n\nI have another \"assignment\" for you here in Pandaria. This will again require all of your skills, and again I assure you... it will be worth it!\n\nBefore we begin, it's important that you familiarize yourself with the lay of the land. Come visit me once you have earned more experience here."]="It is very good to see you again, $n! I trust the weapons I gave you at Ravenholdt have served you well?\n\nI have another \"assignment\" for you here in Pandaria. This will again require all of your skills, and again I assure you... it will be worth it!\n\nBefore we begin, it's important that you familiarize yourself with the lay of the land. Come visit me once you have earned more experience here."
G["It is very good to see you here my friend. It has been a while since our endevours in the Valley of the Four Winds."]="fico feliz muito de ver você. Tem passado muito tempo desde nossos conquistas no Vale dos Quatro Ventos."
G["It is very important that we find out what the the night elves are up to, $c! Please concentrate all of your efforts toward that end."]="É muito importantes que averigüemos que estão tramando os elfos da noite, $c. Centra todos seus esforços em esse fim."
G["It is very kind of you to ask after our needs, $c. It would appear though that we have collected all of the runecloth bandages we feel we'll need of the war. May I ask that you inquire around with some of the other collectors and lend them your aid if needed? Ancestors watch over you."]="It is very kind of you to ask after our needs, $c. It would appear though that we have collected all of the runecloth bandages we feel we'll need of the war. May I ask that you inquire around with some of the other collectors and lend them your aid if needed? Ancestors watch over you."
G["It is very kind of you to donate your organs!"]="It is very kind of you to donate your organs!"
G["It is very sad that fish have no trails or mountains to climb.  If I bring them more fish friends will they be happy?"]="É uma pena que os peixe não tenham caminhos que seguir nem montanhas que escalar. Se lhes traigo mais amigos peixe, serão felizes?"
G["It is warm."]="É cálida."
G["It is we who must make the first strike. We cannot be allowed to repeat the mistakes of the past..."]="Somos nós que devemos fazer o primeiro ataque. Não podemos repetir os erros do passado..."
G["It is wise that you humble yourself before me, $n, in your desire for more warlock knowledge."]="It is wise that you humble yourself before me, $n, in your desire for more warlock knowledge."
G["It is wise to replenish our resources before they run out!"]="It is wise to replenish our resources before they run out!"
G["It is with satisfaction that I relay to you we have collected all of the purple lotus that we feel we need. Thank you for your contribution to the effort, $c. If you are so inclined, there are most likely several still here that are collecting other resources for the struggle."]="It is with satisfaction that I relay to you we have collected all of the purple lotus that we feel we need. Thank you for your contribution to the effort, $c. If you are so inclined, there are most likely several still here that are collecting other resources for the struggle."
G["It is with solemn pride that I perform my services in Honor Hold."]="É com orgulho solene que presto meus serviços em Honra Hold."
G["It is within the most sacred realm of Pandaria that you will now face your most difficult challenge."]="É no reino mais sagrado de Pandaria onde te enfrentarás ao seu desafio mais duro."
G["It is worth all of our lives to eliminate the spirit of your fallen commander."]="Vale a pena dar nossas vidas para eliminar o espírito do seu comandante caído."
G["It is worth it. I wish to augment my agility.<Pay 10,000 gold.>"]="It is worth it. I wish to augment my agility.<Pay 10,000 gold.>"
G["It is worth it. I wish to augment my intelligence.<Pay 10,000 gold.>"]="Merece a pena. Desejo aumentar meu intelecto. <Paga 10000 de ouro.>"
G["It is worth it. I wish to augment my strength.<Pay 10,000 gold.>"]="Merece a pena. Desejo aumentar minha força. <Paga 10000 de ouro.>"
G["It is you again, $c.\n\nIs something wrong?\n\n<Alysra's tail flinches, and her eyes dart back and forth under their lids.>"]="It is you again, $c.\n\nIs something wrong?\n\n<Alysra's tail flinches, and her eyes dart back and forth under their lids.>"
G["It is you who have destroyed my children? You... shall... pay!"]="It is you who have destroyed my children? You... shall... pay!"
G["It is you who have invaded our home. Gorefiend will avenge us!"]="It is you who have invaded our home. Gorefiend will avenge us!"
G["It is you who honor me, High Chief. Please read from this scroll. It is the oath of allegiance."]="É você quem me honra, chefe supremo. Por favor, leia este pergaminho. É o juramento de lealdade."
G["It is you who should suffer. Be content that your death is a quick one...."]="É você quem deveria sofrer. Conténtate com que seu morte será rápida."
G["It is you who will defend my people and usher in a new era of prosperity for Stillpine!"]="É você quem defenderá meu povo e dará início a uma nova era de prosperidade para Stillpine!"
G["It is your life that will end soon; mine is just beginning."]="É à sua vida que terminará em breve; o meu está apenas começando."
G["It is yours my Lord!"]="É seu meu Senhor!"
G["It is yours, my dear Mister Goodwin. Master Belloc will be most pleased with our trade."]="É seu, meu querido Sr. Ganabien. O mestre Belhoc estará encantado com nosso intercambio."
G["It is! The great war of Silithus raged over a thousand years ago. Valstann tried to save his people, but was captured...and killed."]="It is! The great war of Silithus raged over a thousand years ago. Valstann tried to save his people, but was captured...and killed."
G["It is! Well done, $p!"]="O é! Bem feito, $p!"
G["It is... and twenty-six TIMES more powerful than the first!"]="It is... and twenty-six TIMES more powerful than the first!"
G["It is... as it should be."]="É... como deveria ser."
G["It is... not over."]="Não se tem terminado!"
G["It is... the empress who has betrayed... our people..."]="É... a Imperatriz quem tem traído... a nosso povo..."
G["It isn't enough! Defenders, gather in the center of town. Together we will stand against the undead monster!"]="It isn't enough! Defenders, gather in the center of town. Together we will stand against the undead monster!"
G["It isn't ready to fly yet, sister!"]="Irmã, ainda não está pronto para voar!"
G["It isn't safe to leave, there's something lurking out there in the woods."]="It isn't safe to leave, there's something lurking out there in the woods."
G["It isn't talking, milady. I know it holds secrets! Naughty secrets!"]="Não fala, senhora. Sei que guarda segredos! Segredos obscuros!"
G["It isss done!  Nessspirah isss mine!!!"]="Já essstá feito! Nessspirah é minha!!!"
G["It jerbs the nib right outta my derb!"]="Me da eskalofríos!"
G["It just so happens that Mishi returned it to me. You should be more careful! This artifact is a rare one of a kind piece."]="Resulta que Mishi me o tem devolvido. Deveria ter mais cuidado! Este artefato é único."
G["It knows all, it sees all!"]="Tudo o sabe e tudo o vê!"
G["It looks as if $n has decided to heal and revive his pets!  $gHis:Her; progress in the tournament has been reset, and they will be allowed to attempt each challenge again."]="Parece que $n tem decidido curar e reviver aos seus ajudantes! Se tem reiniciadas seu progresso no torneio. Agora terá que superar todos os desafios desdo início."
G["It looks at you blankly."]="Te mira inexpresivo."
G["It looks just like the paintings of King Magni too! Did he really do this to himself?"]="E se parece um monte aos quadros do rei Magni! De verdade que se fez isto a si mesmo?"
G["It looks like a big fish!"]="Parece um peixe gigantesco!"
G["It looks like a gateway to hell!"]="Parece um portal ao inferno!"
G["It looks like he's just unconscious. I should be able to wake him up."]="It looks like he's just unconscious. I should be able to wake him up."
G["It looks like help has finally arrived!  The Omenai welcome you to our remnant camp, $n."]="Parece que finalmente chegou a ajuda! Os omenai te damos a boas-vindas aos restos de nosso acampamento, $n."
G["It looks like it be succulent pork ribs basted with its own delectable juices and a side o' Captain Sander's Secret Sauce - fer dippin'."]="Parece que ser suculentas costelas de porco com o seu próprio e delicioso jugo e a bebida secreta do capitão Sanders – para mojar."
G["It looks like it may have to come to that."]="It looks like it may have to come to that."
G["It looks like my father was wrong. Even Zouchin can be dangerous!"]="It looks like my father was wrong. Even Zouchin can be dangerous!"
G["It looks like our paths have crossed again, $n. At a pig farm, of all places.\n\nI enjoy this valley. It almost feels like... home. The green fields, the big sky... I have even heard mention that there's a big brewery down the road. Maybe it is time I settled down once and for all.\n\n<Chen looks off into the distance for a few long seconds, then shrugs his shoulders.>\n\nOr maybe not."]="It looks like our paths have crossed again, $n. At a pig farm, of all places.\n\nI enjoy this valley. It almost feels like... home. The green fields, the big sky... I have even heard mention that there's a big brewery down the road. Maybe it is time I settled down once and for all.\n\n<Chen looks off into the distance for a few long seconds, then shrugs his shoulders.>\n\nOr maybe not."
G["It looks like some sort of gigantic chest... probably full of gold.  And it's all ours!"]="Parece uma espécie de cofre gigantesco... provavelmente cheio de ouro. E é tudo nosso!"
G["It looks like the cultists had their eye on the druids!\n\nYou can see Wildheart Point through the swirling portal. Stepping through it will take you on a one-way trip back to the camp.\n\nOnce your business here is finished, this would be a good way to make a quick exit."]="It looks like the cultists had their eye on the druids!\n\nYou can see Wildheart Point through the swirling portal. Stepping through it will take you on a one-way trip back to the camp.\n\nOnce your business here is finished, this would be a good way to make a quick exit."
G["It looks like the hozen scattered their brew in mugs and kegs across the island."]="It looks like the hozen scattered their brew in mugs and kegs across the island."
G["It looks like the scavengers may be sending a large party out into the swamp soon. Tell the archmage to be ready."]="It looks like the scavengers may be sending a large party out into the swamp soon. Tell the archmage to be ready."
G["It looks like the site of... a massacre."]="Parece que tenha tido lugar... uma massacre."
G["It looks like there's a skirmish up ahead, $n.  Let us wait til the situation clears up."]="Parece que há uma escaramuça aí linha de frente, $n. Esperemos a que se tranquilicen as coisas."
G["It looks like they crashed.  I don't think they're here for trouble."]="It looks like they crashed.  I don't think they're here for trouble."
G["It looks like this is the end, but I'll be brave if you will, $n."]="Parece que isto é o fim, mas serei corajoso se você o é, $n."
G["It looks like we are going in blind. I'm glad you are with us, $p."]="It looks like we are going in blind. I'm glad you are with us, $p."
G["It looks like we have a ranking officer among our captives... how amusing.  Execute the Alliance wench!"]="It looks like we have a ranking officer among our captives... how amusing.  Execute the Alliance wench!"
G["It looks like we have a ranking officer among our captives... how amusing.  Execute this green-skinned dog at once!"]="Parece que temos a um oficial de envio entre nossos cativos... que divertido. Ejecudada este cão de pele verde de imediatamente!"
G["It looks like we have one more challenger yet to face though, so let's get those wagers in!"]="Ao parecer há outro oponente ao que temos que fazer linha de frente, assim que quero ver essas apuestas!"
G["It looks like we're in trouble. Look lively, here they come!"]="Ao parecer, temos problemas. Anímate, aqui vêm!"
G["It looks like we've managed to quell the sha... for now."]="Parece que temos derrotado ao sha... por agora."
G["It looks like you are already playing catch with your serpent, $n. You can only play catch with one serpent at a time.\n\nPlease finish your current training session before practicing with another serpent."]="It looks like you are already playing catch with your serpent, $n. You can only play catch with one serpent at a time.\n\nPlease finish your current training session before practicing with another serpent."
G["It looks like you've already found love. You can give me a love token, but I'm not giving you anything nice. I'm waiting for someone special."]="Parece que você já encontrou o amor. Você pode me dar um sinal de amor, mas não estou lhe dando nada de bom. Estou esperando por alguém especial."
G["It looks like your predecessor had time to set the flares up, but they have not yet been launched.\n\nThis is your time to shine, $n."]="It looks like your predecessor had time to set the flares up, but they have not yet been launched.\n\nThis is your time to shine, $n."
G["It looks scaaaary."]="Da um monte de medo."
G["It makes no sense, but those vermin are going to great lengths to keep our troops alive..."]="Não faz sentido, mas esses vermes estão fazendo um grande esforço para manter nossas tropas vivas..."
G["It manifests itself as a feeling, small at first and easily ignored, that confirms truths and subtly prods one to do good."]="It manifests itself as a feeling, small at first and easily ignored, that confirms truths and subtly prods one to do good."
G["It matters not how the sha broke free of their ancient prisons. We must plan a course of action forward. How can we dispel them again from our land?"]="It matters not how the sha broke free of their ancient prisons. We must plan a course of action forward. How can we dispel them again from our land?"
G["It matters not, the Old One will not suffer their intrusion."]="Não importa, o Antigo não tolerará esta intrusão."
G["It may be best not to dabble in mysteries not yet fully understood. Perhaps you should disable the dampening devices. My companions and I can handle ourselves. I'm sure we will be fine."]="It may be best not to dabble in mysteries not yet fully understood. Perhaps you should disable the dampening devices. My companions and I can handle ourselves. I'm sure we will be fine."
G["It may be wise to befriend these people."]="It may be wise to befriend these people."
G["It may come to that. Bring me my blades. The next move is mine."]="Talvez. Traga minhas espadas. O próximo passo é meu."
G["It may look simple, a large stick with a huge weight on the end. But when swung with the might of a tauren behind it, this stick can break stone walls."]="Pode parecer muito simples, um palo largo com um peso enorme em um extremo. Mas movido pela força de um tauren, este palo pode quebrar muros de pedras."
G["It may not be quite comfy out here, but it's still Khaz Modan, so it's still our home."]="Pode não ser muito confortável aqui, mas ainda é Khaz Modan, então ainda é a nossa casa."
G["It may seem pointless, but try to find pride in a good fight. The time will come when all this practicing and competition will be put to good use."]="It may seem pointless, but try to find pride in a good fight. The time will come when all this practicing and competition will be put to good use."
G["It may take time to learn what I must.  I trust I will not be gone too long, but it could be weeks - even months."]="It may take time to learn what I must.  I trust I will not be gone too long, but it could be weeks - even months."
G["It may'ave won in life, but it won't be winnin' in the afterlife! FIRE!"]="It may'ave won in life, but it won't be winnin' in the afterlife! FIRE!"
G["It might be wisest if you and your companions were not seen here for a time, traveler."]="It might be wisest if you and your companions were not seen here for a time, traveler."
G["It might help if you could tell me how many of these guys we're going to fight.  You can remember that, right, grandma?"]="It might help if you could tell me how many of these guys we're going to fight.  You can remember that, right, grandma?"
G["It might help if you could tell me how many of these guys we're going to fight.  You can remember that, right, grandpa?"]="It might help if you could tell me how many of these guys we're going to fight.  You can remember that, right, grandpa?"
G["It might look like an ordinary pumpkin patch now, but once the plague cauldron is placed it will become a source of disease, rot and plague!"]="Pode parecer um pedaço de abóbora comum agora, mas uma vez colocado o caldeirão da fedor, ele se tornará uma fonte de doença, podridão e praga!"
G["It moved!  I swear, I saw it move!"]="It moved!  I swear, I saw it move!"
G["It must be something in the water, I tell you."]="Precisa ser algo da água, te o digo."
G["It must be the purity of the Mark of the Lightbringer that is drawing forth the Scourge to us.  We must proceed with caution lest we be overwhelmed!"]="It must be the purity of the Mark of the Lightbringer that is drawing forth the Scourge to us.  We must proceed with caution lest we be overwhelmed!"
G["It must have been hidden away long before recorded history.  And with good reason!"]="Tem devido de permanecer oculta desde antes da história conhecida. E com razão."
G["It must have broken the walls of the tank!"]="Deve haver front as paredes do tanque!"
G["It mustn't know... it mustn't learn... what's ours..."]="Não deve saber... não deve saber... o que é nosso."
G["It needn't end this way."]="Não precisa terminar assim."
G["It nice having a good hunting partner."]="É bom ter um bom parceiro de caça."
G["It nice that it not snow here. Snow no good."]="Está bem que não nevar aqui. Neve não boa."
G["It not even see Goregek coming."]="It not even see Goregek coming."
G["It not gonna make no difference."]="Não vai alterar nada."
G["It only hurts this much the first time.  The second time, you're dead."]="It only hurts this much the first time.  The second time, you're dead."
G["It pained me to see so many displaced from their homes in Kun-Lai. I am very happy we found a safe haven for those in need of protection."]="It pained me to see so many displaced from their homes in Kun-Lai. I am very happy we found a safe haven for those in need of protection."
G["It pains me to say this, but \"Yes\"."]="Me dói dizer isto, mas sim"
G["It pains me to see my ancestors disturbed from their graves.\n\nWe must strike down the cursed spirit of your Force-Commander Steeljaw, the one who foolishly led his caravan through these sacred grounds."]="It pains me to see my ancestors disturbed from their graves.\n\nWe must strike down the cursed spirit of your Force-Commander Steeljaw, the one who foolishly led his caravan through these sacred grounds."
G["It pains me, Neltharion - but I must end you, as I have ended Malygos."]="Me dói, Neltharion, mas devo acabar com você, igual que acabé com Malygos."
G["It pleases me, after all, to cause such strife in the world above... to shake, to shatter, to swallow and crush..."]="It pleases me, after all, to cause such strife in the world above... to shake, to shatter, to swallow and crush..."
G["It probably caused the leak!"]="Provavelmente provocou o escape!"
G["It put the mutton in the stomach!"]="Eu meter ovelha em estômago!"
G["It puts the ghoul in the pit or else it gets the lash!"]="OU mete ao necrófago no fosso ou se enfrenta à correa!"
G["It really doesn't look like it, Bailey."]="Bailey, não parece que vá a ser assim."
G["It really is good to see you again, $n.  Fur and all."]="É maravilhoso voltar a ver você, $n. Com pelagem e tudo."
G["It really is you, isn't it?  I remember those eyes."]="É você, verdade? Lembrança esses olhos."
G["It remains to be seen if you are ready, young one.  Even the wisest and oldest of druids are never truly ready when their ultimate time of testing comes.\n\nYou have heard my words, and now you must move on.  Heed what I have taught you.  There will be a time when you will have your strength tested.  You must face your foe as the bear would - with strength of body and with strength of heart.  Learn from the fight, young one.  Go... with my blessings."]="It remains to be seen if you are ready, young one.  Even the wisest and oldest of druids are never truly ready when their ultimate time of testing comes.\n\nYou have heard my words, and now you must move on.  Heed what I have taught you.  There will be a time when you will have your strength tested.  You must face your foe as the bear would - with strength of body and with strength of heart.  Learn from the fight, young one.  Go... with my blessings."
G["It rent a tree asunder and set it aflame."]="Ele partiu uma árvore em pedaços e a incendiou."
G["It requires a cunning strategist indeed to defeat my monks.  Well done, $n."]="Só uma estratégia de muita astúcia derrotaria meus monges. Muito bem, $n."
G["It rewards those who heed its promptings with blessings, both seen and unseen."]="It rewards those who heed its promptings with blessings, both seen and unseen."
G["It saddens all of us to see the Drakkari destroying themselves this way.\n\nThe power that they gain from killing the natural gods of the land is transitory.\n\nWhat is gained in the short run will be lost to them for all eternity."]="It saddens all of us to see the Drakkari destroying themselves this way.\n\nThe power that they gain from killing the natural gods of the land is transitory.\n\nWhat is gained in the short run will be lost to them for all eternity."
G["It saddens me to see the furbolg all corrupted so readily. These used to be our friends."]="Entristece-me ver o furbolg tudo corrompido tão prontamente. Estes costumavam ser nossos amigos."
G["It seems I have more training to do. Thank you for the lesson."]="Parece que tenho que treinar mais. Obrigado pela lecção."
G["It seems I'll be enjoying an expedient win this fine day!"]="Parece que eu terei uma vitória rápida neste dia tão belo!"
G["It seems as if this world is coming apart at the seams.  I've seen these symptoms before, on Draenor... We may not be able to stop this.  Fleeing may be our best option."]="It seems as if this world is coming apart at the seams.  I've seen these symptoms before, on Draenor... We may not be able to stop this.  Fleeing may be our best option."
G["It seems as though this cave used to contain powerful Mogu magic."]="It seems as though this cave used to contain powerful Mogu magic."
G["It seems hope has triumphed after all..."]="Parece que a esperança tem triunfado, depois de tudo..."
G["It seems like love is drifting on the wind. I hope that I won't be left out."]="Parece que o amor está no ar. Espero que a mim também me toque."
G["It seems my assistants proved too much for you.  Speak with me when you are ready to try again."]="Parece que meus ajudantes te têm superado. Fala comigo quando queira voltar a tentar."
G["It seems my freedom must be bought with blood!"]="Parece que é preciso comprar meu liberdade com sangue!"
G["It seems my strategy is superior."]="Parece que minha estratégia é superior."
G["It seems my strength proved too much for you.  Speak with me when you are ready to try again."]="Parece que minha força você superado. Fala comigo quando queira voltar a tentar."
G["It seems that I'll need to deal with you myself. The High Inquisitor comes for you, Scourge!"]="It seems that I'll need to deal with you myself. The High Inquisitor comes for you, Scourge!"
G["It seems that a great deal of your power is used for... and I hope you'll pardon the term... frivolous things. Isn't that, well, wasteful?"]="It seems that a great deal of your power is used for... and I hope you'll pardon the term... frivolous things. Isn't that, well, wasteful?"
G["It seems that after only a few days of study, Anduin already understands the Way of the Crane.\n\nPerhaps he always has?"]="It seems that after only a few days of study, Anduin already understands the Way of the Crane.\n\nPerhaps he always has?"
G["It seems that my defenses have prevailed.  Speak with me when you are ready to try again."]="Parece que meus defesas têm prevalecido. Fala comigo quando queira voltar a tentar."
G["It seems that there are others who see the value of amber."]="It seems that there are others who see the value of amber."
G["It seems the army of the Scourge has come to Tanaris. A significant number of their necropolises and other forces have been dispatched there.\n\nNumber of Necropolises remaining: $2283W"]="Parece que o exército do Flagelo chegou a Tanaris. Têm enviada um número considerável de necrópole e outras forças à zona.\n\nNúmero de necrópole restantes: $2283W"
G["It seems the captain is correct. Quel'Delar is not to be ours after all."]="Parece que o capitão tem razão. Ao fim, Quel'Delar não será nossa."
G["It seems the heart of the Lunar Festival celebration is in Moonglade. The druids in the Cenarion Enclave in Darnassus can transport you there if you don't want to walk."]="pelo visto, o coração do Festival Lunar está em Clareira da Lua. Os druidas de Enclave Cenariano em Darnassus te podem transportar até ali se não que caminhar."
G["It seems there are hazards to living in a place so beautiful..."]="Parece que viver em um lugar tão bonito tem seus riscos..."
G["It seems we have a returning challenger! Welcome back to the arena, Dippy!"]="It seems we have a returning challenger! Welcome back to the arena, Dippy!"
G["It seems we haven't lost yet."]="Parece que ainda não temos perdido."
G["It seems you Coldridge folks are dreadfully under-informed about the events of the last few days."]="Ao parecer, os de Cristálgida estão muito mal informados dos acontecimentos que têm sucedido nos últimos dias."
G["It seems you are not ready for the rank of champion.  Some more training may serve you well."]="Parece que não está em condições de subir de grau e se juntar ao resto de campeões. Talvez te venha bem treinar um pouco mais."
G["It seems you have not quite mastered all that we have taught you.  Speak to me when you are ready to try again."]="It seems you have not quite mastered all that we have taught you.  Speak to me when you are ready to try again."
G["It seems you still need more practice.  Perhaps another time."]="It seems you still need more practice.  Perhaps another time."
G["It seems you were not ready for mounted combat."]="Parece que não estava $gpronto: pronta; para o combate $gmontado: montada;."
G["It seems you were unable to keep me at bay.  Speak with me when you are ready to try again."]="It seems you were unable to keep me at bay.  Speak with me when you are ready to try again."
G["It seems you'll need another lesson, mortals!"]="Parece ser que vais a precisar outra lecção, mortais!"
G["It seems your efforts to defeat me have failed.  Speak with me when you are ready to try again."]="It seems your efforts to defeat me have failed.  Speak with me when you are ready to try again."
G["It seems your journeys are not done. These new allies of ours come from a broken world that could use our help."]="It seems your journeys are not done. These new allies of ours come from a broken world that could use our help."
G["It seems your reputation as a formidable $c is well earned, $n!"]="Parece ser que seu reputação de $c formidable é bem merecida, $n!"
G["It sees us..."]="Nos vê..."
G["It seethes and burns..."]="Hierve e arde..."
G["It shall NEVER happen. We are legion. We are united. Where are your heroes? Vol'jin sits in sanctuary at the side of the young Warchief, unaware. Zul'jin missing, probably dead."]="It shall NEVER happen. We are legion. We are united. Where are your heroes? Vol'jin sits in sanctuary at the side of the young Warchief, unaware. Zul'jin missing, probably dead."
G["It shall be I that earns the favor of our lord by casting out the intruders. My calmest wind shall still prove too much for them!"]="It shall be I that earns the favor of our lord by casting out the intruders. My calmest wind shall still prove too much for them!"
G["It shall be as you say, warbringer. One last question, if I may..."]="Se fará como diz, belisario. Uma última pergunta, se se me permite..."
G["It shall be so, sir."]="Assim se fará, senhor."
G["It should be beautiful. It should be pristine!"]="Deveria ser lindo. Deveria ser puro!"
G["It should be me in your place!  I'll show you!"]="Você deveria estar na minha lugar! Verá o que é bom!"
G["It should have been me that carried the blade to Northrend. The burden was mine to bear."]="It should have been me that carried the blade to Northrend. The burden was mine to bear."
G["It should have been me!"]="Deveria haver banido eu!"
G["It should not have come to this!"]="Isto não deveria haver passado!"
G["It shouldn't be much further, $n. The exit is just up ahead."]="Não deveria estar muito longe, $n. A saída está por aqui."
G["It simply must have some..."]="Simplesmente precisa..."
G["It smells delicious, doesn't it?"]="Cheira de maravilha, verdade?"
G["It smells like..."]="Cheira a..."
G["It so fat!"]="Está muito gorda!"
G["It so juicy!"]="It so juicy!"
G["It spoke to me of secrets and power, and also of truths. The Light had not forsaken the Broken! The fel energies that the orcs had wielded long ago against the draenei had infused us, causing a break in our ability to be heard by, or perhaps to hear, the Light. The same that had been responsible for the degradation of our bodies.\n\nBut our spirits were not broken, and the air offered to me another path, through which I might deliver my people."]="It spoke to me of secrets and power, and also of truths. The Light had not forsaken the Broken! The fel energies that the orcs had wielded long ago against the draenei had infused us, causing a break in our ability to be heard by, or perhaps to hear, the Light. The same that had been responsible for the degradation of our bodies.\n\nBut our spirits were not broken, and the air offered to me another path, through which I might deliver my people."
G["It ssshall profit them nothing, sssave it be a ssspeedy demise..."]="Não lhes prometo nada, salvou uma morte rápida..."
G["It ssspoilss our water!"]="Essstropea nuessstra água!"
G["It stands to reason that it may be here for exactly the reasons it says it is."]="It stands to reason that it may be here for exactly the reasons it says it is."
G["It starts with a hero."]="Ela começa com uma pessoa muito corajosa."
G["It stinks of big-tongue around here."]="Por aqui fede a grislíngua-grande."
G["It stinky around here. Why so stinky."]="Apestar por aqui. Por que apestar tanto?"
G["It sure is bright out here... and flat."]="Não há dúvida de que isto é muito luminoso… e plano."
G["It sure is! Those hives were abuzz with various silithid that were none too happy to see us.\n\nEverything was going fine until we came across a glyphed crystal in Hive'Regal. She was drawn to it like a moth to a flame! She put her pretty little cheek up against the crystal and instantly entered a trance-like state. Naturally, this worried my crew. We picked her up and carried her out of there with a quickness!"]="It sure is! Those hives were abuzz with various silithid that were none too happy to see us.\n\nEverything was going fine until we came across a glyphed crystal in Hive'Regal. She was drawn to it like a moth to a flame! She put her pretty little cheek up against the crystal and instantly entered a trance-like state. Naturally, this worried my crew. We picked her up and carried her out of there with a quickness!"
G["It takes a bit of practice to be this close to the silithid and go unnoticed.  I don't recommend trying it if you can avoid it."]="Requer certa prática estar tão perto dos silitídeos e passar inadvertido. Não recomendo fazer isso se se você pode esta."
G["It takes a few good crashes to really \"season\" a flying machine.\n\nNo goblin in their right mind flies one pristine."]="It takes a few good crashes to really \"season\" a flying machine.\n\nNo goblin in their right mind flies one pristine."
G["It takes a lot of dedication to train and ride a Venomhide."]="É preciso muita dedicação para treinar e pilotar um Venomhide."
G["It takes brass ball-bearings to craft siege engines for the Horde. Now get with the program or hit the bricks!"]="It takes brass ball-bearings to craft siege engines for the Horde. Now get with the program or hit the bricks!"
G["It tasted soooo good going down."]="Me sabido de fábula."
G["It tastes like I died and went to the Nether; where slop that tastes like rotting threshadon carcass is then shoved down my throat by an obese tauren that's never washed their hands - or bathed..."]="Sabe como se me tivesse morto e estivesse no Vazio; onde um tauren que nunca se tem lavado as mãos – nem se tem banhado – me fará tragar uma bazofia que sabe a trilhanodonte morto podrido..."
G["It taught me the path of shamanism, which in a way is just another facet of the Light. Joining the wind was the water of the oasis, the fire from my camp and the earth upon which I sat. All had something to say.\n\nOver the next few years they taught me what it was to call upon and be one with the elements of the world. And they told me that the worlds of all of the stars in the sky, even this one, are made up of these elements.\n\nBut the day came when I felt that I had learned enough to leave."]="It taught me the path of shamanism, which in a way is just another facet of the Light. Joining the wind was the water of the oasis, the fire from my camp and the earth upon which I sat. All had something to say.\n\nOver the next few years they taught me what it was to call upon and be one with the elements of the world. And they told me that the worlds of all of the stars in the sky, even this one, are made up of these elements.\n\nBut the day came when I felt that I had learned enough to leave."
G["It tears at us from the inside!"]="It tears at us from the inside!"
G["It tells of the coming apocalypse. How this world will burn and be reborn from death."]="It tells of the coming apocalypse. How this world will burn and be reborn from death."
G["It time for work! Zug zug!"]="Hora de trabalho! Zug zug!"
G["It tingles..."]="It tingles..."
G["It took a coward's poison and the fury of Hellscream to bring my father down."]="It took a coward's poison and the fury of Hellscream to bring my father down."
G["It took all of $n's skill to maintain control of Stampy."]="$n teve que usar toda seu habilidade para controlar a Estampi."
G["It took all of our combined strength, but we have pushed Ragnaros back into the Firelands."]="Fez falta nossa força combinada, mas temos enviada a Ragnaros de volta às Terras de Fogo."
G["It truly is a shame that the blue dragonflight has chosen such a heartless, cold path. It pains me greatly to do battle with Malygos's children."]="It truly is a shame that the blue dragonflight has chosen such a heartless, cold path. It pains me greatly to do battle with Malygos's children."
G["It was ... the chowder."]="Foi... a sopa de peixe."
G["It was An! She dared Shin to go knock on the Jade Witch's door."]="It was An! She dared Shin to go knock on the Jade Witch's door."
G["It was High General Abbendis, High Inquisitor Isillien, and Highlord Mograine that formed the Crusade. In its infancy, the Crusade was a noble order. The madness and insane zealotry that you see now did not exist. It was not until the one known as the Grand Crusader appeared that the wheels of corruption were set in motion."]="It was High General Abbendis, High Inquisitor Isillien, and Highlord Mograine that formed the Crusade. In its infancy, the Crusade was a noble order. The madness and insane zealotry that you see now did not exist. It was not until the one known as the Grand Crusader appeared that the wheels of corruption were set in motion."
G["It was I who brought Quel'Delar here, to return it to its makers. In breaking the weapon, so did I break its power."]="It was I who brought Quel'Delar here, to return it to its makers. In breaking the weapon, so did I break its power."
G["It was I who suggested our greatest warriors be cast in amber to sleep, to be awakened at the swarm's greatest times of need."]="It was I who suggested our greatest warriors be cast in amber to sleep, to be awakened at the swarm's greatest times of need."
G["It was Leza's visions that led us here. Each of us have had dreams of a valley, golden with blossoms, filled with the hope of peace.\n\nEven our chieftan Baine Bloodhoof had these dreams.\n\nOnly Leza's visions gave us a path to follow, though. And now, here we are, for better or worse."]="It was Leza's visions that led us here. Each of us have had dreams of a valley, golden with blossoms, filled with the hope of peace.\n\nEven our chieftan Baine Bloodhoof had these dreams.\n\nOnly Leza's visions gave us a path to follow, though. And now, here we are, for better or worse."
G["It was Sironas' idea... The abomination is actually one of their own. He is a high ranking member of the draenei military order: Triumvirate or some such nonsense.\n\nWhatever that thing is, it's massive, powerful, and full of rage. Any attacks against the Vector Coil will most certainly result in failure as long as that abomination is around."]="It was Sironas' idea... The abomination is actually one of their own. He is a high ranking member of the draenei military order: Triumvirate or some such nonsense.\n\nWhatever that thing is, it's massive, powerful, and full of rage. Any attacks against the Vector Coil will most certainly result in failure as long as that abomination is around."
G["It was Umi, wasn't it?! She's always playing jokes on me, and now she's got you in on it too!"]="Foi Umi, verdade?! Sempre me está gastando bromas, e agora também te a tem jogado você!"
G["It was a clever ruse, $n. Alliance forces streamed out of Northwatch and marched up the gold road, besieging Crossroads as dusk fell. Then, in the heart of the night, they force-marched southward, leaving their campfires burning behind.\n\nOur meager forces at Honor's Stand were caught unawares as the Alliance poured through the pass at dawn's first light. Many of our bravest warriors fell before their blades."]="It was a clever ruse, $n. Alliance forces streamed out of Northwatch and marched up the gold road, besieging Crossroads as dusk fell. Then, in the heart of the night, they force-marched southward, leaving their campfires burning behind.\n\nOur meager forces at Honor's Stand were caught unawares as the Alliance poured through the pass at dawn's first light. Many of our bravest warriors fell before their blades."
G["It was a costly victory, but it could have been much worse. You have earned this reward."]="Temos pagado rosto a vitória, mas pediu ser muito pior. Os vocês têm ganhou esta recompensa."
G["It was a glorious assault. I'll give it that."]="It was a glorious assault. I'll give it that."
G["It was a good day to fly!"]="Era um bom dia para voar!"
G["It was a long journey to get here. And we lost so many along the way.\n\nYet... look at this place. Astounding!"]="O viagem até aqui foi muito largo. E temos perdido a muitos pelo caminho.\n\nA pesar de tudo... olhem este lugar. É impressionante!"
G["It was a pleasure. Stay safe $p."]="Foi um prazer. Tenha cuidado, $p."
G["It was a powerful feelin' while I was listenin' to yer sermon, and it's drivin' me nuts!"]="It was a powerful feelin' while I was listenin' to yer sermon, and it's drivin' me nuts!"
G["It was a short time, for our part..."]="Foi muito pouco tempo, para nós..."
G["It was a simple mistake. A wrong turn I tell you!"]="It was a simple mistake. A wrong turn I tell you!"
G["It was all I could do to feign death as the corpses of the Scourge piled upon me. There was darkness and only the muffled sounds of the battle above me. The clashing of iron, the gnashing and grinding... gruesome, terrible sounds. And then there was silence. He called to me! \"Fairbanks! Fairbanks where are you? Talk to me Fairbanks!\" And then came the sound of incredulousness. The bite of betrayal, $r..."]="It was all I could do to feign death as the corpses of the Scourge piled upon me. There was darkness and only the muffled sounds of the battle above me. The clashing of iron, the gnashing and grinding... gruesome, terrible sounds. And then there was silence. He called to me! \"Fairbanks! Fairbanks where are you? Talk to me Fairbanks!\" And then came the sound of incredulousness. The bite of betrayal, $r..."
G["It was all her fault! She told us to steal it!"]="Foi seu culpar! Ela nos disse que o robáramos!"
G["It was all lies..."]="Não eram mais que mentiras..."
G["It was an accident. I was framed. Don't drop me!"]="It was an accident. I was framed. Don't drop me!"
G["It was an honor fighting you."]="Foi uma honra lutar com você."
G["It was an honor to be defeated by you."]="Foi uma honra que me tenha derrotou."
G["It was an honor to watch you fight, $n."]="Foi uma honra ver você lutar, $n."
G["It was awful... I dreamt I was fighting against my friends."]="Foi terrível... Sonhé que estava lutando contra meus amigos."
G["It was clear that our paths were set.  We were our own greatest enemies, and we were determined to destroy ourselves."]="It was clear that our paths were set.  We were our own greatest enemies, and we were determined to destroy ourselves."
G["It was dat angry orc.  He smushed dem!  Want Grok to smush him?"]="It was dat angry orc.  He smushed dem!  Want Grok to smush him?"
G["It was delivered to the forgemaster at Deathwing's Fall.  I swear... that's all I know!"]="Se enviou ao mestre de forja em Fica de Alamuerte! Não sei nada mais, o juro!"
G["It was dreadful, $c. Unceremoniously booted from Orgrimmar, jars of fresh squirming body parts smashed to the ground as I was hauled through the gates.\n\nLike I was some kind of monster!\n\nFortunately I've been able to continue my research here, where there's no shortage of fresh corpses."]="It was dreadful, $c. Unceremoniously booted from Orgrimmar, jars of fresh squirming body parts smashed to the ground as I was hauled through the gates.\n\nLike I was some kind of monster!\n\nFortunately I've been able to continue my research here, where there's no shortage of fresh corpses."
G["It was during the Elemental Sundering that the Firelord, Ragnaros, would seek to consume my Lord, Thunderaan, Prince of Air.\n\n<Demitrian bows his head, his face contorted in rage.>\n\nSpeak his name and I shall decorate this ravaged camp with your entrails. Be silent and listen."]="It was during the Elemental Sundering that the Firelord, Ragnaros, would seek to consume my Lord, Thunderaan, Prince of Air.\n\n<Demitrian bows his head, his face contorted in rage.>\n\nSpeak his name and I shall decorate this ravaged camp with your entrails. Be silent and listen."
G["It was during those darkest of days that Goldrinn's tenacity in war became legendary. While others quaked at the visage of those demon hordes, their multitudes only spurred the great wolf ancient to ever greater feats of strength. He would wade into their ranks, fangs bared and spattered with their vile ichor, his great claws thrashing them by the dozen...\n\nIt was said he stayed behind to cover the Night Elf retreat from Eldre'Thalas, the ancient city we know now as Dire Maul.\n\nDid he die? I'm not certain the spirit of animal ferocity can ever truly die, $n."]="It was during those darkest of days that Goldrinn's tenacity in war became legendary. While others quaked at the visage of those demon hordes, their multitudes only spurred the great wolf ancient to ever greater feats of strength. He would wade into their ranks, fangs bared and spattered with their vile ichor, his great claws thrashing them by the dozen...\n\nIt was said he stayed behind to cover the Night Elf retreat from Eldre'Thalas, the ancient city we know now as Dire Maul.\n\nDid he die? I'm not certain the spirit of animal ferocity can ever truly die, $n."
G["It was folly for them to think us weak amidst recent events. There is no more hope for these trolls  - we will end this today."]="Foi uma loucura para eles pensarem que somos fracos em meio a eventos recentes. Não há mais esperança para esses trolls - vamos acabar com isso hoje."
G["It was foolish of me to get caught away from the line. Thank you for the second chance."]="It was foolish of me to get caught away from the line. Thank you for the second chance."
G["It was foolish of you to interrupt, outsider."]="It was foolish of you to interrupt, outsider."
G["It was fun while it lasted...."]="Foi divertido enquanto duró..."
G["It was horrible! They've all been changed!"]="Foi horrível! Os têm mudado a todos!"
G["It was imperative that I first measure the bearing of your heart."]="Era necessário que eu primeiro avaliasse a natureza do seu coração."
G["It was inevitable!"]="Era inevitável!"
G["It was inevitable."]="Era inevitável."
G["It was just a couple of rivets. That ship had plenty!"]="It was just a couple of rivets. That ship had plenty!"
G["It was just me and Gorrok. I let him take the lead... him bein' all big and all."]="Me kedó somente com Gorrok. Eu lhe deixou ser chefe... por isso de ser o mais grande."
G["It was just terrible. I was all slimy, and I kept licking my eyes!"]="It was just terrible. I was all slimy, and I kept licking my eyes!"
G["It was kind of the Explorers' League to allow me to tag along. However, with the dangers in the Rivenwood and surrounding area, it looks like it may have been foolish of me to come without help."]="Era meio que a Liga dos Batedores me permitir ir ao lado. No entanto, com os perigos em Rivenwood e arredores, parece que pode ter sido tolice da minha parte vir sem ajuda."
G["It was lost when the Violet Citadel fell... splintered into forty-two pieces."]="Perdeu-se quando a Cidadela Violeta caiu... fragmentada em quarenta e dois pedaços."
G["It was mighty kind of you to help me, $r. I'm in your debt."]="Foi extremamente gentil por você me ajudar, $r. Estou em dívida com você."
G["It was mind control boy. There's a difference. And don't worry. If big game huntin' were easy, everybody'd be doing it."]="Era controle mental, filho. Não é o mesmo. Não te preocupe; se a caça maior fosse fácil, tudo o mundo o faria."
G["It was my Great Grandfather who first told me the tale of the mogu that I recently shared with you."]="It was my Great Grandfather who first told me the tale of the mogu that I recently shared with you."
G["It was my father's dream to see this place. I must carry out his wishes in his place."]="It was my father's dream to see this place. I must carry out his wishes in his place."
G["It was not always like this.\n\nThe Osul were not our enemies. They lived beside us. We assisted one another."]="It was not always like this.\n\nThe Osul were not our enemies. They lived beside us. We assisted one another."
G["It was not enough.\n\n<Fairbanks smirks briefly, lost in a memory.>\n\nA thousand came and a thousand died. By the Light! By the might of Mograine! He would smite them down as fast as they could come. Through the chaos, I noticed that the lesser Mograine was still there, off in the distance. I called to him, \"Help us, Renault! Help your father, boy!\""]="It was not enough.\n\n<Fairbanks smirks briefly, lost in a memory.>\n\nA thousand came and a thousand died. By the Light! By the might of Mograine! He would smite them down as fast as they could come. Through the chaos, I noticed that the lesser Mograine was still there, off in the distance. I called to him, \"Help us, Renault! Help your father, boy!\""
G["It was not his fault. Tell him that..."]="It was not his fault. Tell him that..."
G["It was not merely a name, for the World Pillar supported more than just the weight of this temple.  It must be rebuilt or all of Deepholm will collapse into Azeroth, with disastrous consequences for both worlds."]="It was not merely a name, for the World Pillar supported more than just the weight of this temple.  It must be rebuilt or all of Deepholm will collapse into Azeroth, with disastrous consequences for both worlds."
G["It was not my intention to get you involved in this, $n.  I've spent every waking hour looking over my shoulder ever since I helped an old friend in a daring raid on Blackrock Spire."]="It was not my intention to get you involved in this, $n.  I've spent every waking hour looking over my shoulder ever since I helped an old friend in a daring raid on Blackrock Spire."
G["It was not so long ago that we had to wrest control of Thunderlord Stronghold from the nearby ogres.\n\nYou are here to help us maintain our defenses?  I know that Gor'drek is looking for assistance."]="It was not so long ago that we had to wrest control of Thunderlord Stronghold from the nearby ogres.\n\nYou are here to help us maintain our defenses?  I know that Gor'drek is looking for assistance."
G["It was not until after his controversial death that the knights and warriors of Lordaeron would wear similarly fashioned suits in honor of their fallen hero. While the death of Mograine was a great victory for Kel'Thuzad, the resulting martyrdom would be felt until the end of the war.\n\nWhere one did fall, many would rise..."]="It was not until after his controversial death that the knights and warriors of Lordaeron would wear similarly fashioned suits in honor of their fallen hero. While the death of Mograine was a great victory for Kel'Thuzad, the resulting martyrdom would be felt until the end of the war.\n\nWhere one did fall, many would rise..."
G["It was not... enough."]="Não foi... suficiente."
G["It was nothing, your majesty. Just... I'm proud of my king."]="Não é nada, majestade. Somente... estou orgulhosa de meu rei."
G["It was on that day that the wildkin were given to us. Fierce guardians, the goddess assigned the wildkin to protect all of her sacred places."]="It was on that day that the wildkin were given to us. Fierce guardians, the goddess assigned the wildkin to protect all of her sacred places."
G["It was only a matter of time before we would have to deal with the Lich King. He represents a threat to all of Azeroth, not just the humans.\n\nBut, the decision to go to war is one that must not be made lightly. We would be fools to rush into Northrend. The Lich King has surely anticipated such an action.\n\nOur options must be weighed carefully. Our armies are mightier than ever, but a tactically unsound decision could ruin us.\n\nIf only Garrosh understood...."]="It was only a matter of time before we would have to deal with the Lich King. He represents a threat to all of Azeroth, not just the humans.\n\nBut, the decision to go to war is one that must not be made lightly. We would be fools to rush into Northrend. The Lich King has surely anticipated such an action.\n\nOur options must be weighed carefully. Our armies are mightier than ever, but a tactically unsound decision could ruin us.\n\nIf only Garrosh understood...."
G["It was quite a haul, but now I can load up on supplies for the trip back into the Crater.  I should be able to unload some of this exotic cargo as well."]="It was quite a haul, but now I can load up on supplies for the trip back into the Crater.  I should be able to unload some of this exotic cargo as well."
G["It was shattered when Deathwing broke through the dome above and created the rift between the two worlds.  All of Deepholm is going to collapse into Azeroth if we do not put the World Pillar back together."]="It was shattered when Deathwing broke through the dome above and created the rift between the two worlds.  All of Deepholm is going to collapse into Azeroth if we do not put the World Pillar back together."
G["It was shrouded in nightmares, Malfurion. What is happening in the Dream? What could cause such atrocities?"]="It was shrouded in nightmares, Malfurion. What is happening in the Dream? What could cause such atrocities?"
G["It was simple once I broke her spirit."]="Foi simples, depois que rompí seu espírito."
G["It was so neat how you beat up those cats! They went and were like \"Grrrrr!\" and then you went and \"Wabang!\" and then you took their stuff."]="Foi genial a surra que lhes tem dados aos gatos! Se têm posto \"Grrrr!\" e depois você \"Bum!\" e depois lhes tem retirado coisas."
G["It was supposed to be a sure thing! I BET EVERYTHING!"]="It was supposed to be a sure thing! I BET EVERYTHING!"
G["It was the Lieutenants of Ragnaros, Geddon and Garr, who would perpetrate the betrayal against my Lord. Thunderaan was caught unaware."]="Foram os tenentes de Ragnaros, Geddon e Garr, que perpetraram a traição contra meu senhor. Thunderaan foi pego de surpresa."
G["It was the mogu who built the Serpent's Spine. The most unlucky of slaves were sent to aid in its construction and defense, to be fodder for the mantid. And my people were afraid."]="Foram os mogus que construíram o Espinhaço da Serpente. Os pobres escravos infelizes foram enviados para ajudar na construção e defesa da muralha e para servir de comida aos mantídeos. E meu povo teve medo."
G["It was the sleep from which one could never awake. A great risk. A great sacrifice. But necessary."]="It was the sleep from which one could never awake. A great risk. A great sacrifice. But necessary."
G["It was the will of Ragnaros that Obsidion be built. Obsidion will destroy the Blackrock orcs of Blackrock Spire, uniting us with our bretheren in the fiery depths."]="It was the will of Ragnaros that Obsidion be built. Obsidion will destroy the Blackrock orcs of Blackrock Spire, uniting us with our bretheren in the fiery depths."
G["It was then that I realized: he was hiding in the sun.  I looked up."]="It was then that I realized: he was hiding in the sun.  I looked up."
G["It was when Arthas was at his weakest that I struck!"]="It was when Arthas was at his weakest that I struck!"
G["It was your leadership that manipulated a grieving child to try and recover the sword. A child that has grown into a man with nothing but vengeance and hatred in his heart! And for what? You are no closer to the sword now than you were five years ago."]="It was your leadership that manipulated a grieving child to try and recover the sword. A child that has grown into a man with nothing but vengeance and hatred in his heart! And for what? You are no closer to the sword now than you were five years ago."
G["It was your sacrifice, my son, that again saved me from eternal peril."]="Foi seu sacrifício, filho meu, que novamente me salvou da condena eterna."
G["It was... a trap..."]="Era... era uma armadilha..."
G["It was... a worthy afterlife."]="It was... a worthy afterlife."
G["It was... inevitable."]="Era... inevitável."
G["It was... so dark..."]="Estava... tão sombrio..."
G["It was... terrible... the demon..."]="Foi... terrível... o demônio..."
G["It wasn't I who foretold it, but Velen of the Draenei:"]="It wasn't I who foretold it, but Velen of the Draenei:"
G["It wasn't me! $n did it, I swear!"]="Não fui eu! O fez $n, o juro!"
G["It wasn't me! I swear!"]="Não e banido eu! O juro!"
G["It wasn't me, I swear!  You can't prove anything!"]="Não e banido eu, o juro! Você não pode demostrar nada!"
G["It wasn't my fault, Master Mazen!"]="Não foi culpar minha, mestre Mazen!"
G["It wasn't my food!"]="Não foi meu comida!"
G["It wasn't ready to face the Shado-Pan."]="Não estava preparada para o Shadopan."
G["It wasn't strictly voluntary, but I discovered something truly incredible. The beast seemed to be able to consume almost anything with no ill effects."]="Não era estritamente voluntário, mas descobri algo verdadeiramente incrível. A fera parecia capaz de consumir quase qualquer coisa sem efeitos negativos."
G["It wasn't supposed to go this way. We were supposed to find the White Pawn. I should be back in Ironforge by now."]="It wasn't supposed to go this way. We were supposed to find the White Pawn. I should be back in Ironforge by now."
G["It will all be over soon!"]="Pronto acabará tudo!"
G["It will all end soon..."]="Tudo acabará muito pronto..."
G["It will be a matter of hours before the Alliance in the Derelict Strand are crushed.  They are surrounded and outnumbered."]="Levará algumas horas para que a Aliança na vertente abandonada seja esmagada. Eles estão cercados e em menor número."
G["It will be a pleasure cleaving you in half!"]="It will be a pleasure cleaving you in half!"
G["It will be a pleasure shooting you down!"]="It will be a pleasure shooting you down!"
G["It will be alright, darling. Grieve no more..."]="Tudo irá bem, $gquerido: querida;. Não te aflijas mais..."
G["It will be an honor to carry out King Wrynn's commission for a warrior so dedicated to the Alliance."]="It will be an honor to carry out King Wrynn's commission for a warrior so dedicated to the Alliance."
G["It will be as you say! Long live the Bilgewater Cartel! For the Horde!"]="It will be as you say! Long live the Bilgewater Cartel! For the Horde!"
G["It will be as you say, my lord."]="Será como diz, meu senhor."
