G["It will be done, my lady."]="Assim se fará, meu senhora."
G["It will be done, my lord!"]="Se fará, meu senhor!"
G["It will be done, my lord."]="Se fará, meu senhor."
G["It will be done."]="It will be done."
G["It will be much colder in your grave."]="Fará mais frio na sua tumba."
G["It will be some time before I can recover from these injures. Still, I'm glad to be alive."]="It will be some time before I can recover from these injures. Still, I'm glad to be alive."
G["It will be the most difficult battle we have ever faced, but our resolve and the power of the Sunwell will sustain us until we have been restored to our greatness."]="It will be the most difficult battle we have ever faced, but our resolve and the power of the Sunwell will sustain us until we have been restored to our greatness."
G["It will be up to you to use the Horn of the Ancients and stop Soggoth's return."]="It will be up to you to use the Horn of the Ancients and stop Soggoth's return."
G["It will destroy us, sister..."]="Nos destruirá, irmã..."
