G["It will not be long, now before our work is finished."]="Não tardaremos muito em terminar o trabalho."
G["It will not end like this! I've worked too hard! So many years... I... I will consume more energy!"]="Não acabará assim! E trabalhado muito! Tantos anos… eu… consumirei mais energia!"
G["It will not get me any closer to proving myself at Valhalas to kill you, but it should be entertaining!"]="It will not get me any closer to proving myself at Valhalas to kill you, but it should be entertaining!"
G["It will take a sharp blade and reinforced armor to bring tranquility back to Nagrand. Shall I repair your equipment so that you may mete justice?"]="É preciso uma lâmina afiada e uma armadura reforçada para trazer tranquilidade de volta a Nagrand. Devo reparar seu equipamento para que você possa praticar justiça?"
G["It will take a while, but these Broken Ones will learn the ways of the Light!"]="Vai demorar um pouco, mas esses Quebrados aprenderão os caminhos da Luz!"
G["It will take just a moment longer."]="It will take just a moment longer."
G["It will take many years for us to undo the damage that Magtheridon, Illidan and the fel orcs did to this holy place."]="It will take many years for us to undo the damage that Magtheridon, Illidan and the fel orcs did to this holy place."
G["It will take much time for the Vale to heal, but you have given us hope!"]="It will take much time for the Vale to heal, but you have given us hope!"
G["It won't be easy. It's true that six out of every seven analysts won't live to see Demolitions Analyst II."]="It won't be easy. It's true that six out of every seven analysts won't live to see Demolitions Analyst II."
G["It won't be long before Fizzlebang is a household word, used to scare children into bed! \"Beware, or Fizzlebang will summon a mighty demon to eat you!\""]="It won't be long before Fizzlebang is a household word, used to scare children into bed! \"Beware, or Fizzlebang will summon a mighty demon to eat you!\""
G["It won't be long before we're out of supplies too, Captain. Between the trolls and the yeti raids, we'll be down to half rations within a week."]="It won't be long before we're out of supplies too, Captain. Between the trolls and the yeti raids, we'll be down to half rations within a week."
G["It won't be long now."]="Agora falta pouco."
G["It won't be much longer, $n. Just keep them off me while I work."]="Não falta muito mais tempo, $n. Somente faça que não se me acerquen enquanto trabalho."
G["It won't be that easy, fiend!"]="Não será tão fácil, demônio!"
G["It won't bring our brothers and sisters back, but knowing that we are better than the yaungol helps us sleep better at night."]="It won't bring our brothers and sisters back, but knowing that we are better than the yaungol helps us sleep better at night."
G["It won't happen again, $gsir:ma'am;."]="Não voltará a acontecer, $gsenhor: senhora;."
G["It won't matter, you'll be dead by tomorrow."]="Da igual, manhã estará morto."
G["It won't."]="Não o farei."
G["It worked!  Amazing!  I guess I haven't lost my touch..."]="It worked!  Amazing!  I guess I haven't lost my touch..."
G["It worked!  The Proto-drake is falling!"]="Funcionó! O protodraco cai!"
G["It worked! It wo-"]="Tem funcionado! Tem fun..."
G["It worked, just as I knew it would!\n\nBut even so, the effects of the stasis have surpassed even my original calculations."]="Tem funcionado, logo como eu achava!\n\nMas ainda assim, os efeitos da estase têm superado inclusive meus cálculos iniciais."
G["It works, Dorain! Look! It actually works..."]="Funciona, Dorain! Olhe! Funciona de verdade…"
G["It would appear as if the influence of the Black Dragonflight had extended beyond the borders of the Burning Steppes and into the kingdom of Stormwind itself! The usurper has since been unmasked and ousted."]="Parece que a influência da Revoada Negra se estendeu para além das fronteiras das Estepes Ardentes e para o reino de Ventobravo em si! Desde então, o usurpador foi desmascarado e expulso."
G["It would appear dear that the Alliance has managed to collect everything needed for the war effort. Now all that we're waiting on are those poor Horde creatures to finish with theirs."]="It would appear dear that the Alliance has managed to collect everything needed for the war effort. Now all that we're waiting on are those poor Horde creatures to finish with theirs."
G["It would appear that I've made a slight miscalculation. I allowed my mind to be corrupted by the fiend in the prison, overriding my primary directive. All systems seem to be functional now. Clear."]="It would appear that I've made a slight miscalculation. I allowed my mind to be corrupted by the fiend in the prison, overriding my primary directive. All systems seem to be functional now. Clear."
G["It would appear that poor Lou really put his foot..."]="It would appear that poor Lou really put his foot..."
G["It would appear that we are being watched, Crowley. You have grown soft... Likely Greymane's fault."]="It would appear that we are being watched, Crowley. You have grown soft... Likely Greymane's fault."
G["It would be a shame to let these leaflets go to waste, wouldn't it?"]="It would be a shame to let these leaflets go to waste, wouldn't it?"
G["It would be an honor to battle alongside of you as a brother of the Horde, $n. I accept your offer."]="Será uma honra lutar ao lado você como irmão da Horda, $n. Aceito seu oferta."
G["It would be an honor, Dark Lady."]="Seria uma honra, Dama Sombria."
G["It would be an honor, Grand Anchorite."]="Será uma honra, grande anacoreta."
G["It would be my honor to join you in battle."]="It would be my honor to join you in battle."
G["It would be my honor to join you in battle. Speak to me on the hill if you have need of me."]="It would be my honor to join you in battle. Speak to me on the hill if you have need of me."
G["It would be my honor to sacrifice myself for what I believe."]="It would be my honor to sacrifice myself for what I believe."
G["It would be my honor, Kalecgos."]="Será uma honra para mim, Kalecgos."
G["It would be my pleasure, Matoclaw."]="Será um prazer, Matogarra."
G["It would be nice to leave the Vale some day, but it's so pretty here!"]="Estaria bem sair do vale algum dia, mas é tão bonito..."
G["It would be to your benefit for you to stay away from our holy grounds, $n."]="It would be to your benefit for you to stay away from our holy grounds, $n."
G["It would be unwise to assume that fighting a champion would be a simple task.  Are you sure you are ready?"]="Seria imprudente supor que lutar contra um campeão seria uma tarefa simples. Tem certeza de que está pronto?"
G["It would be unwise to assume that fighting a valiant would be a simple task.  Are you sure you are ready?"]="Seria imprudente supor que lutar contra um valente seria uma tarefa simples. Tem certeza de que está pronto?"
G["It would be wise to explain to you the depths at which our enemies will go to to hide themselves under our noses.\n\nKnow this first and foremost: our enemy is the Shadow Council. No matter what task I give you, or who I ask you to act against, know that one simple fact.\n\nMany cults exist within the Council, but only to hide its actions against the foolish.\n\nGroups like the Burning Blade, the Argus Wake, and the Searing Blade are all tools of the Council. Consider them one and the same."]="It would be wise to explain to you the depths at which our enemies will go to to hide themselves under our noses.\n\nKnow this first and foremost: our enemy is the Shadow Council. No matter what task I give you, or who I ask you to act against, know that one simple fact.\n\nMany cults exist within the Council, but only to hide its actions against the foolish.\n\nGroups like the Burning Blade, the Argus Wake, and the Searing Blade are all tools of the Council. Consider them one and the same."
G["It would seem I underestimated your skills.  Well done."]="Parece que e subestimado seu habilidade. Bem feito."
G["It would seem my guards are useless.  I will have to take care of you myself."]="It would seem my guards are useless.  I will have to take care of you myself."
G["It would seem so. You and your friends are welcome to as much as you can find. I suppose it's very potent. We don't need to go that often."]="Parece que si. Você e seus amigos são bem-vindos tanto quanto puderem encontrar. Suponho que é muito potente. Não precisamos de ir com tanta frequência."
G["It would seem that a renegotiation is in order."]="Parece que teremos que negociar."
G["It would seem that you are not yet ready for the rank of valiant.  Some more training may serve you well."]="Parece que não está em condições de subir de grau e se juntar ao resto de campeões. Talvez te venha bem treinar um pouco mais."
G["It would seem this \"sha\" energy is far more powerful than I previously thought."]="It would seem this \"sha\" energy is far more powerful than I previously thought."
G["It would take a miracle to save the Commander, now."]="It would take a miracle to save the Commander, now."
G["It would've succeeded if $n and I hadn't tracked the North Wind's historical corruptions to their source: your ancient battle."]="It would've succeeded if $n and I hadn't tracked the North Wind's historical corruptions to their source: your ancient battle."
G["It would've taken years to find the Book of the Raven without you, young sparrowhawk. Return to your home in Nagrand with our gratitude."]="It would've taken years to find the Book of the Raven without you, young sparrowhawk. Return to your home in Nagrand with our gratitude."
G["It wouldn't be long, however, before the city came under attack once again.  This time, the attack came from Illidan's armies. A large regiment of blood elves had been sent by Illidan's ally, Kael'thas Sunstrider, to lay waste to the city."]="No entanto, não passou muito tempo até que voltaram a atacar a cidade. Esta vez, o ataque era dos exércitos de Illidan. O aliado de Illidan, Kael'thas Andarilho do Sol, havia enviada a um grande número de elfos de sangue para destruir a cidade."
G["It'd be an honor to spar with you, $gsir:ma'am;."]="It'd be an honor to spar with you, $gsir:ma'am;."
G["It'll all be over soon. Soon you will be in the embrace of That Which Must Not Be Named!"]="It'll all be over soon. Soon you will be in the embrace of That Which Must Not Be Named!"
G["It'll be done when it's done, darn it!"]="Estará quando estiver, maldito seja!"
G["It'll be good to hear de Darkspear drums once more. You take care now, Son of Sen'jin.  Bwonsamdi will be waitin' for ya... on de Other Side..."]="It'll be good to hear de Darkspear drums once more. You take care now, Son of Sen'jin.  Bwonsamdi will be waitin' for ya... on de Other Side..."
G["It'll be okay ladies.  Just look at my painting and remember better days.  Or you can just look at me and imagine a better future."]="It'll be okay ladies.  Just look at my painting and remember better days.  Or you can just look at me and imagine a better future."
G["It'll be quick, but it won't be painless!"]="It'll be quick, but it won't be painless!"
G["It'll be very tasteful!"]="Terá muita classe!"
G["It'll definitely not be anywhere in the Eastern Kingdoms, that's for sure.\n\nIt'll have to be somwhere on Kalimdor, but still far enough away from the Horde and other races. Someplace unaffected by the Sundering--that means no where near the Night elves' civilization either.\n\nI would guess it'd be someplace protected also... like a valley, or a crater. I don't know. I'm just guessing now. I'm sorry I couldn't help you more."]="It'll definitely not be anywhere in the Eastern Kingdoms, that's for sure.\n\nIt'll have to be somwhere on Kalimdor, but still far enough away from the Horde and other races. Someplace unaffected by the Sundering--that means no where near the Night elves' civilization either.\n\nI would guess it'd be someplace protected also... like a valley, or a crater. I don't know. I'm just guessing now. I'm sorry I couldn't help you more."
G["It'll never happen, Nat."]="It'll never happen, Nat."
G["It'll take more than a rotting corpse to stop us!"]="It'll take more than a rotting corpse to stop us!"
G["It'll take more than you rabble to bring me down!"]="Vai ser necessário algo mais que sua chusma para acabar comigo!"
G["It's \"Salty!\"  I got here firsht!  I got off the boat and onto land firsht!  I called the name \"Salty.\"  Hey... Where's your pet at?"]="It's \"Salty!\"  I got here firsht!  I got off the boat and onto land firsht!  I called the name \"Salty.\"  Hey... Where's your pet at?"
G["It's $n! Bow your heads!"]="É $n! Inclinaos!"
G["It's $n, mighty $c and $g brother : sister; to ogres everywhere!"]="É $n, $gpoderoso: poderosa: c; $c e $ghermano: irmã; de todos os ogros!"
G["It's ... your droppings!? And the goblins have been running around scooping it up?"]="It's ... your droppings!? And the goblins have been running around scooping it up?"
G["It's 40 degrees Kraklenheit. Can you feel the heat? No? I really couldn't either."]="It's 40 degrees Kraklenheit. Can you feel the heat? No? I really couldn't either."
G["It's 428,000 degrees Kraklenheit... What's happening, hot stuff!?"]="428000 graus Kraklenheit... Que passa, como está tão quente!?"
G["It's BLOWIN' my mind!"]="Estou ALUCINANDO!"
G["It's GO TIME! Come get sum! <replace this>"]="It's GO TIME! Come get sum! <replace this>"
G["It's Iskalder! Quickly, use The Bone Witch's Amulet!"]="It's Iskalder! Quickly, use The Bone Witch's Amulet!"
G["It's Komak... Better get out of his way."]="It's Komak... Better get out of his way."
G["It's MINE!"]="É MEU!"
G["It's Proudmoore! Get out of here!"]="É Corajoso! Fora de aqui!"
G["It's Quel'Delar! You possess the sword!"]="É Quel'Delar! Você possui a lâmina!"
G["It's ROCKET TIME, ladies! Come and get it!"]="Chegou a HORA DO FOGUETE, senhoras! Venham a por ele!"
G["It's Sayena."]="É Sayena."
G["It's Stormstout time!"]="É hora dos Cerveja de Trovão!"
G["It's a Pandaren board game. The object is for both players to win."]="É um jogo pandarênico. O objetivo é a vitória dos dois jogadores."
G["It's a bloodbath, lieutenant. They've been murdered."]="É um banho de sangue, tenente. Têm banido asesinados."
G["It's a cold, bloody battle we wage in Alterac Valley.  It's perfect."]="A batalha que lutamos no Vale Alterac, é uma batalha fria e sangrenta. É perfeita."
G["It's a complete and total barf-o-rama! RUN FOR YOUR LIVES!"]="It's a complete and total barf-o-rama! RUN FOR YOUR LIVES!"
G["It's a day of reckoning, $c!"]="Hoje se fará justiça, $c!"
G["It's a difficult job keeping the steam tanks up and running by yourself, but someone has to do it."]="É um trabalho difícil manter os tanques de vapor funcionando, mas alguém precisa fazer isso."
G["It's a done deal, soldier. The replacement flare gun is in your pack. Don't lose this one!"]="It's a done deal, soldier. The replacement flare gun is in your pack. Don't lose this one!"
G["It's a female."]="It's a female."
G["It's a fire!  Hurry up mon!"]="It's a fire!  Hurry up mon!"
G["It's a good thing I love building ships, because these pirates love blowing them up."]="It's a good thing I love building ships, because these pirates love blowing them up."
G["It's a good thing I showed up when I did!\n\nI'm guessing we haven't seen the last of that Schnottz fellow."]="Que sorte que eu apareciera quando o fiz!\n\nSuponho que ainda não temos visto o fim desse tal Schnottz."
G["It's a good thing I spend all my spare time tinkering on my greatest passion: High-power directed explosives!\nLet's use some to set up defensive positions at the gates."]="Menos mal que dedico tudo meu tempo livre a meu maior pasão: os explosivos dirigidos de alta potência!\n\nVamos a usar uns quantos para estabelecer posições de defesa perto das portões."
G["It's a good thing I was able to make duplicates of the Felsworn Gas Mask."]="Menos mal que pude fazer copias da máscara de gás Jurapenas."
G["It's a good thing my Uncle Chen told me not to get into any fights, otherwise you'd be dead meat, turtle!"]="It's a good thing my Uncle Chen told me not to get into any fights, otherwise you'd be dead meat, turtle!"
G["It's a good thing the captain made it through. He'll know how to get us out of this mess."]="It's a good thing the captain made it through. He'll know how to get us out of this mess."
G["It's a good thing you came along - I could not resolve this alone."]="fico feliz em que tenha vindo. Não haveria pedido resolver isto somente."
G["It's a good thing you came along, ally! We were done for!"]="It's a good thing you came along, ally! We were done for!"
G["It's a good thing you guys showed up! The Iron Dwarves have pushed us back to this location, and we're barely managing to hold the line here. \nEven worse, they've begun to power up their magical defenses. If we don't attack soon, they'll be able to annihilate us in the blink of an eye!\nWe've managed to rebuild several siege machines, demolishers and motorcycles from the Alliance and Horde expeditions that were here before us. However, all of our pilots died in the last assault.\nYou must take the vehicles and storm the gates of Ulduar! \nPlease, $n! You're our last hope!"]="It's a good thing you guys showed up! The Iron Dwarves have pushed us back to this location, and we're barely managing to hold the line here. \nEven worse, they've begun to power up their magical defenses. If we don't attack soon, they'll be able to annihilate us in the blink of an eye!\nWe've managed to rebuild several siege machines, demolishers and motorcycles from the Alliance and Horde expeditions that were here before us. However, all of our pilots died in the last assault.\nYou must take the vehicles and storm the gates of Ulduar! \nPlease, $n! You're our last hope!"
G["It's a great assignment, yeah, but \"all looking and no touching\" gets old after a while."]="É uma grande missão, sim, mas \"somente olhar e não tocar\" cansa depois de um tempo."
G["It's a little damaged, but I should still be able to get some good information from this."]="It's a little damaged, but I should still be able to get some good information from this."
G["It's a little late... for that... $G lad:lass;.\n\n<The Frostborn Scout coughs up some blood on the snow.>\n\nGet... that wench in charge for me...\n\n<The Frostborn Scout slumps over as he breathes his last breath.>"]="It's a little late... for that... $G lad:lass;.\n\n<The Frostborn Scout coughs up some blood on the snow.>\n\nGet... that wench in charge for me...\n\n<The Frostborn Scout slumps over as he breathes his last breath.>"
G["It's a long way down...."]="Há muita ocorrida..."
G["It's a mighty good day, is it not? I do hope we see a few fireworks before this day is through."]="É um ótimo dia, não é? Espero ver algum fogos de artifício antes que este dia termine."
G["It's a miracle! The beast skinned itself!"]="It's a miracle! The beast skinned itself!"
G["It's a monastery, of course!\n\nThe monks here at Tian Monastery specialize in teaching young pandaren - like me - how to fight. All the great fighters started here: Yu Ming the Blade, Liang the Unbreakable... even the great emperor Shaohao studied at this very temple.\n\nOr so the legends say."]="It's a monastery, of course!\n\nThe monks here at Tian Monastery specialize in teaching young pandaren - like me - how to fight. All the great fighters started here: Yu Ming the Blade, Liang the Unbreakable... even the great emperor Shaohao studied at this very temple.\n\nOr so the legends say."
G["It's a mystery of the past indeed! But a key to our future!"]="Está claro que é um mistério do passado! Mas também a chave de nosso futuro!"
G["It's a one-seater plane, but you can always sit up on the fuselage. It's perfectly safe.\n\nYou ready?"]="It's a one-seater plane, but you can always sit up on the fuselage. It's perfectly safe.\n\nYou ready?"
G["It's a pity so many fine, and reusable, parts will go to waste..."]="É uma pena malgastar tantas partes reutilizables de tamanha qualidade..."
G["It's a pleasure to meet you as well, Arch Druid. I am on a task from Tirion and time is short, might I trouble you for a portal to Moonglade?"]="It's a pleasure to meet you as well, Arch Druid. I am on a task from Tirion and time is short, might I trouble you for a portal to Moonglade?"
G["It's a pleasure to see someone sane around here. How can I help you?"]="É um prazer ver alguém sã por aqui. Como posso ajudá-o?"
G["It's a pleasure to see you again, $n.  Your aid has provided us with a considerable boost in the security of our supply lines.  I hope you understand the importance of the logistics involved in large battle efforts such as this."]="É um prazer voltar a ver você, $n. Sua ajuda foi crucial para preservar a segurança de nossas linhas de abastecimento. Espero que comprendas a importância da logística implicada em uma grande batalha como esta."
G["It's a pretty smooth ride if you don't mind the dust."]="É um passeio bem tranquilo se você não se importa com o pó."
G["It's a real honor to be able to aid Brann in exploring ancient Ulduar."]="É uma verdadeira honra poder ajudar Brann a explorar a antiga Ulduar."
G["It's a real honor, $n. Maybe we can have a sitdown soon and you can regale me with your latest exploits?"]="É tudo uma honra, $n. Tomara tenha algo de tempo para contar-me seus últimas façanhas."
G["It's a relief to be surrounded by normal gnomes again!"]="It's a relief to be surrounded by normal gnomes again!"
G["It's a rescue attempt!  Let no one escape!"]="É um intento de resgate! Que não escape ninguém!"
G["It's a rescue attempt!  Slay them all!"]="It's a rescue attempt!  Slay them all!"
G["It's a secret to everybody... including me!\n\nI'm glad you found me -- it's a good thing I'm not hiding in a bush or underneath a rock, isn't it?"]="It's a secret to everybody... including me!\n\nI'm glad you found me -- it's a good thing I'm not hiding in a bush or underneath a rock, isn't it?"
G["It's a simple process for a craftsman of my caliber.\n\nThe most difficult aspect of crafting items out of beast hides and carapace is the actual acquisition of said parts. Now, if you could bring me a pristine hide from this beast, I could make several different powerful items from the flesh."]="It's a simple process for a craftsman of my caliber.\n\nThe most difficult aspect of crafting items out of beast hides and carapace is the actual acquisition of said parts. Now, if you could bring me a pristine hide from this beast, I could make several different powerful items from the flesh."
G["It's a small comfort to see that they haven't brought any back in undeath."]="É um leve alívio ver que não têm ressuscitado a nenhum como um não-morto."
G["It's a start. Thanks Ergll."]="Algo é algo. Obrigado, Erglh."
G["It's a strain, but I shouldn't have let it affect me.  I... I should have been better to my sister."]="Sinto a tensão, mas não deveria haver saído que me afectara. Debí... ser melhor irmã."
G["It's a strange order, you can't deny. Suspicious food? Under that definition, you should arrest Belfast!"]="It's a strange order, you can't deny. Suspicious food? Under that definition, you should arrest Belfast!"
G["It's a testament to our race's tenacity that Fairbreeze Village still stands.  We shall never concede defeat to the Scourge ever again."]="É uma prova da tenacidade de nossa raça que Fairbreeze Village ainda se mantém. Nunca mais admitiremos a derrota ao Flagelo."
G["It's a traaaap!"]="É uma cilada, gronn!"
G["It's a wonder these mantid keep coming back for more."]="It's a wonder these mantid keep coming back for more."
G["It's a wonderful day to be alive, isn't it?"]="É um dia maravilhoso para seguir com vida, verdade?"
G["It's about time we got another shipment. I heard they were having trouble at the mines, but our work cannot wait."]="It's about time we got another shipment. I heard they were having trouble at the mines, but our work cannot wait."
G["It's about time we returned to the Highlands! \"Twilight\" be damned."]="It's about time we returned to the Highlands! \"Twilight\" be damned."
G["It's about time we started doing something."]="Já era hora de que empezáramos a fazer algo."
G["It's about time ye showed up. Doomsday is a comin'."]="It's about time ye showed up. Doomsday is a comin'."
G["It's about time you asked! I was wondering when Farmer Yoon would ever notice me. You go ahead, and I'll be there after I'm done at the market today."]="It's about time you asked! I was wondering when Farmer Yoon would ever notice me. You go ahead, and I'll be there after I'm done at the market today."
G["It's about time you asked! I was wondering when Farmer Yoon would ever notice me. You go ahead, and I'll be there soon."]="It's about time you asked! I was wondering when Farmer Yoon would ever notice me. You go ahead, and I'll be there soon."
G["It's about time you got here, $n. This battle isn't going to win itself!"]="It's about time you got here, $n. This battle isn't going to win itself!"
G["It's about time you showed up with this!"]="Já era hora de que aparecieras!"
G["It's about time!  I'm sick of being a slave!"]="Já era hora! Estou harto de ser um escravo!"
G["It's about time!  Lurid was getting bored."]="It's about time!  Lurid was getting bored."
G["It's about time! I'm parched over here!"]="It's about time! I'm parched over here!"
G["It's about time! You know how long I've been treading water here?"]="Já era hora! Sabe quanto tempo levo aqui com os pés na água?"
G["It's about to blow, jump on the Wyverns!"]="Está a ponto de explodir, subam aos dracoleones!"
G["It's about to get crazy up in here, Pat. Don't say another word!"]="Pat, aqui cima tudo se vai voltar louco. Não digas outra palavra!"
G["It's about to get even more awe-inspiring."]="Está prestes a ficar ainda mais impressionante."
G["It's across the bridge from the gate to The Drag. Listen for the sound of shouting goblins."]="É do outro lado da ponte do portões para The Drag. Escute o som de duendes gritando."
G["It's admirable what The League of Arathor is attempting to do in Arathi Basin.  Too bad those undead abominations and their Horde friends are standing in the way.  Head over to Stormwind Keep.  Lady Hoteshem awaits you in the King's audience chamber.  She can help you to get to Arathi Basin."]="É admirável o que a Liga de Arathor está tentando fazer na Bacia Arathi. Pena que aquelas abominações de mortos-vivos e seus amigos da Horda estão no caminho. Dirija-se à Fortaleza de Ventobravo. Lady Hoteshem espera por você na sala de audiências do rei. Ela pode ajudá-o a chegar à Bacia Arathi."
G["It's afraid!"]="Tem medo!"
G["It's afraid."]="Tem medo."
G["It's after me now, get behind it and do all the damage you can!"]="It's after me now, get behind it and do all the damage you can!"
G["It's after you!  Don't let it get close."]="Vai por você! Não deixe que se que."
G["It's alive!"]="Vive!"
G["It's alive, $n. It's alive!"]="Está vivo, $n. Está vivo!"
G["It's all I can do to keep these wards up. Find one of the Archmages, Kalytha! I feel like I'm about to collapse..."]="É tudo o que posso fazer para manter essas barreiras. Encontre um dos arquimagos, Kalytha! Sinto que estou prestes a entrar em colapso..."
G["It's all I can do to keep this ship from tearing itself apart and I still have to deal with puffed up baffoons like Fizzle here!"]="É tudo o que posso fazer para impedir que este navio se destrua e ainda tenho que lidar com bolos inchados como Fizzle aqui!"
G["It's all I can do to stop from staring at the sun. It never moves.\n\nJust what IS this place?"]="Não posso deixar de olhar ao sol. Não se move.\n\nQue classe de lugar é este?"
G["It's all a mess, $c, and it's all my fault! I was warned to get out of dock while there was still time, but did I listen? No.\n\nWhat am I going to do now? Those sickly blood elves, the Wretched, have made off with my magical goods, and ate them I think. I'm pretty sure that means they can't be retrieved. And the Grimscale murlocs pirated away the rest of my goods in the dead of night! Furthermore, to kick an honest merchant when she's down, my crew abandoned ship!\n\nI think I'm going to cry."]="It's all a mess, $c, and it's all my fault! I was warned to get out of dock while there was still time, but did I listen? No.\n\nWhat am I going to do now? Those sickly blood elves, the Wretched, have made off with my magical goods, and ate them I think. I'm pretty sure that means they can't be retrieved. And the Grimscale murlocs pirated away the rest of my goods in the dead of night! Furthermore, to kick an honest merchant when she's down, my crew abandoned ship!\n\nI think I'm going to cry."
G["It's all about the brewkegs - keep them from burning!"]="It's all about the brewkegs - keep them from burning!"
G["It's all about those Emperor Crabs. Sweet, blue gold is what they are."]="It's all about those Emperor Crabs. Sweet, blue gold is what they are."
G["It's all around us. It's in my head!"]="Está ao nosso redor. Está na minha cabeça!"
G["It's all clear then?"]="Está tudo claro agora?"
G["It's all gone to hell, $c!"]="It's all gone to hell, $c!"
G["It's all guns and flames until someone loses and dies."]="São todas armas e chamas até que alguém perca e morra."
G["It's all here... how the raven's followers captured and subdued the spirits of rivals, trapping them forever within stone statues! The tablet even mentions the raven god's name -- Anzu. I'd thought it was lost to history!"]="It's all here... how the raven's followers captured and subdued the spirits of rivals, trapping them forever within stone statues! The tablet even mentions the raven god's name -- Anzu. I'd thought it was lost to history!"
G["It's all in ruins..."]="Está tudo em ruínas..."
G["It's all or nothing, $n. Thunderpaw Refuge needs us. Are you ready to finish this thing?"]="É tudo ou nada, $n. O Refúgio Zarpa Atronadora nos precisa. Está $gpronto: pronta; para acabar com isto?"
G["It's all over 'cept for the crying now. All of the war materiel is being transported to Cenarion Hold in Silithus, and the last of it will be there in less than a day. Shouldn't be much longer until the scepter is assembled and the war finally begins."]="It's all over 'cept for the crying now. All of the war materiel is being transported to Cenarion Hold in Silithus, and the last of it will be there in less than a day. Shouldn't be much longer until the scepter is assembled and the war finally begins."
G["It's all over 'cept for the crying now. All of the war materiel is being transported to Cenarion Hold in Silithus, and will be there in less than $2113w days. Shouldn't be much longer until the scepter is assembled and the war finally begins."]="Está tudo bem, exceto pelo choro agora. Tudo o materiais de guerra está sendo transportado para o Cenarion Hold, em Silithus, e estará lá em menos de $2113w dias. Não deve demorar muito até que o cetro seja montado e a guerra finalmente comece."
G["It's all over..."]="Se acabou tudo..."
G["It's all their fault, stupid Alliance army. Just had to build their towers right behind my farm."]="It's all their fault, stupid Alliance army. Just had to build their towers right behind my farm."
G["It's all their fault, stupid orcs. Had to burn my farm to the ground."]="It's all their fault, stupid orcs. Had to burn my farm to the ground."
G["It's all true, brother. Every word. You doubted it?"]="It's all true, brother. Every word. You doubted it?"
G["It's all your fault! It was supposed to be dead! Now it ate your brains!"]="É culpar sua! Se deveria que estava morto! Agora comeu seu cérebro!"
G["It's all... coming back to me...."]="Tudo... está ficando..."
G["It's almost here. Get ready!"]="Já quase chegou. Prepare-se!"
G["It's alright, girl. Relax."]="Não há problema, garota. Cálmate."
G["It's also coming right at us.  Watch out for the mouth!"]="Mas vem direto até aqui. Atenção às fauces!"
G["It's always nice when someone wishes to speak to me. How are things with you, $c?"]="Sempre é agradável que alguém queira falar comigo. Como vai tudo, $c?"
G["It's amazing how much you've helped us out.  We dare say that if it weren't for you, we'd already have been overrun by the demons, or fried to a crisp by the Black Dragonflight!\n\nOn a side note, we did mention that we'd sell you one of our sons, cheap, right?  No, not interested?"]="It's amazing how much you've helped us out.  We dare say that if it weren't for you, we'd already have been overrun by the demons, or fried to a crisp by the Black Dragonflight!\n\nOn a side note, we did mention that we'd sell you one of our sons, cheap, right?  No, not interested?"
G["It's amazing what you can learn from a gnome if you squeeze them hard enough: clever little tricks about getting out of a bind, making delicious cookies, and even how to make a flying machine."]="É incrível o que você pode aprender com um gnomo se apertá-o com força suficiente: pequenos truques inteligentes sobre como sair de uma situação difícil, fazer biscoitos deliciosos e até mesmo como fazer uma máquina voadora."
G["It's amazing!"]="É absurdo!"
G["It's an ambush! Defend yourself!"]="É uma emboscada! Defendeos!"
G["It's an angry male!"]="É um macho enfurecido!"
G["It's an attack!"]="É um ataque!"
G["It's an honor to have a $r such as yourself aiding us ogres.  You're keeping our hope of a better future alive.\n\nNow if we could just get rid of these headaches.  Are you sure you don't want one of our sons?"]="It's an honor to have a $r such as yourself aiding us ogres.  You're keeping our hope of a better future alive.\n\nNow if we could just get rid of these headaches.  Are you sure you don't want one of our sons?"
G["It's an honor to have a hero like you among us, $n."]="It's an honor to have a hero like you among us, $n."
G["It's an honor to serve with you, $n."]="É uma honra servir ao lado você, $n."
G["It's an honor to share the battlefiend with you, my liege."]="É uma honra compartilhar o campo de batalha com você, meu senhor."
G["It's an honor, $n. Welcome back to the Cradle of Chi-Ji."]="É uma honra, $n. Dou a você a boas-vindas novamente à Cuna de Chi-Ji."
G["It's an ugly word, you know? It's a word I'd use to describe defecating. For example:"]="It's an ugly word, you know? It's a word I'd use to describe defecating. For example:"
G["It's as if you were reading my mind."]="É como se leyeras meus pensamentos."
G["It's as sure as the warts on my backside!"]="Tão certo como que tenho verrugas no traseiro!"
G["It's back to the Undermine with the lot of you!"]="Vais a voltar todos a Minahonda!"
G["It's beautiful!"]="É muito lindo!"
G["It's beautiful! ...have we figured out what it does yet?"]="É precioso! Já sabemos que há?"
G["It's been a busy day in the air, eh $n?  Maybe you should take a moment to catch your breath before going back out."]="Foi um dia muito ocupado no ar, eh, $n? Talvez deveria descansar um tempo antes de voltar."
G["It's been a kick, really."]="Foi genial, em sério."
G["It's been a long day of cutting down the mindless Scourge that endlessly parade down the Dead Scar.  I hope you're here to lend a hand and not to waste my time with idle chatter."]="Tem sido um longo dia de combate ao flagelo sem sentido que desfila sem cessar pela cicatriz morta. Espero que você esteja aqui para ajudar e não perder meu tempo com conversas ociosas."
G["It's been a long journey to get here, hon. Thank you!\n\nLet's get off of this island now."]="Foi um viagem muito largo até aqui, céu. Obrigado!\n\nAgora vamos desta ilha."
G["It's been a long time since last I tasted $r."]="Tem passado muito tempo desde a última vez que saboreé $r."
G["It's been a pleasure serving with you."]="Foi um prazer servir ao lado você."
G["It's been a pleasure, Mr. Anvilward.  I must say your enthusiastic interest in our operations is most... unexpected."]="Foi um prazer, Sr. Guardayunque. Devo dizer que seu interesse entusiasta em nossas operações é do mais... inesperado."
G["It's been a while since I lost to a trainee. Thank you for the match."]="It's been a while since I lost to a trainee. Thank you for the match."
G["It's been awhile, $n."]="Quanto tempo, $n."
G["It's been hard for our scouts to get information on what Crushcog is planning."]="aos batedores nos tem lado muito reunir informações sobre os planos de Prensadiente."
G["It's been hard on all of us, but we're getting by.\n\nYou've just gotta roll up your sleeves and do what needs to be done."]="It's been hard on all of us, but we're getting by.\n\nYou've just gotta roll up your sleeves and do what needs to be done."
G["It's been passed down from ancient times, but none of our people have needed to use it since then."]="It's been passed down from ancient times, but none of our people have needed to use it since then."
G["It's been quite some time since someone was brave enough to challenge me."]="It's been quite some time since someone was brave enough to challenge me."
G["It's been quite the pleasure workin' with yeh, $glad:lass;.\n\nI'd be honored ta do so again sometime."]="Foi tudo um prazer trabalhar com você, $gmuchacho: moça;.\n\nSerá uma honra fazer isso novamente em outra ocasão."
G["It's been recklessly engineered with a merciless disregard for both budgetary concerns and those cumbersome, inefficient \"laws of physics.\""]="It's been recklessly engineered with a merciless disregard for both budgetary concerns and those cumbersome, inefficient \"laws of physics.\""
G["It's been so long since I was a novice myself that I don't think I'd be the best teacher for you. Try talking to Tarn or Mak, right over there. One of them should be able to answer your questions."]="Faz tanto tempo que eu era novato que acho que não seria o melhor professor para você. Tente conversar com Tarn ou Mak, logo ali. Um deles deve ser capaz de responder às suas perguntas."
G["It's been so long since a traveler has come here bearing flowers."]="Tem passado muito tempo desde que um viagemro trajo flores aqui."
G["It's been too long since I last tasted Charbroiled Tiger Steak."]="It's been too long since I last tasted Charbroiled Tiger Steak."
G["It's been years since I last worked moonsteel, but I haven't forgotten the technique. Dane, join me at the anvil."]="Há anos que não trabalho o aço lunar, mas não e esquecido a técnica. Dane, encontre-se comigo no bigorna."
G["It's best not to get on the bad side of those that prepare your food. However, I'm not sure this patron has anything but a bad side..."]="It's best not to get on the bad side of those that prepare your food. However, I'm not sure this patron has anything but a bad side..."
G["It's better than the drawings in the history tomes."]="It's better than the drawings in the history tomes."
G["It's bigger than two houses!"]="É mais grande que dois casas juntas!"
G["It's breathtaking."]="É... de tirar o fôlego."
G["It's broken again?! I'll fix it... just don't expect the warranty to cover this."]="It's broken again?! I'll fix it... just don't expect the warranty to cover this."
G["It's broken already?! No worries. It's nothing I can't fix."]="Já está rota? Não há problema. Não é nada que não possa consertar."
G["It's broken."]="Está front!"
G["It's busting out of the cage!  Arm the shock collar, get that thing under control!"]="It's busting out of the cage!  Arm the shock collar, get that thing under control!"
G["It's calling allies!  I'll keep him busy while you handle them."]="Está pedindo reforços! O mantendré ocupado enquanto te ocupas de eles."
G["It's calling out more sha! Focus them down first, $p!"]="$p, Está chamando a mais sha! É preciso acabar com eles primeiro!"
G["It's chaos up there. We need to save whoever we can, and we'll need to move quickly."]="Aí cima rainhao caos. Devemos superando a quantos possamos, e é preciso actuar depressa."
G["It's cold up there. And dangerous!"]="Além há frio. E é perigoso!"
G["It's comin right for us!"]="Vem direto a por nós!"
G["It's coming along, Wafflefry. Haven't you got a product demonstration to do or something?"]="Está chegando, Papasfritas. Não tem alguma demonstração de produto que fazer ou algo assim?"
G["It's coming right for me!"]="Vem directo a por mí!"
G["It's coming right for us!"]="Vem a por nós!"
G["It's dark in here!"]="Está muito sombrio aqui dentro!"
G["It's dead! You're an inspiration to the Kirin Tor!"]="Morreu! É uma inspiração para o Kirin Tor!"
G["It's demotions for everyone if the Sharks beat the Buccaneers!"]="It's demotions for everyone if the Sharks beat the Buccaneers!"
G["It's do or die, chaps! No turnin' back!"]="OU eles, ou nós! Não há volta por trás!"
G["It's do or die, men! Don't shoot till you see the crazy in their eyes!"]="It's do or die, men! Don't shoot till you see the crazy in their eyes!"
G["It's done $n, and I think you'll be satisfied with the results."]="It's done $n, and I think you'll be satisfied with the results."
G["It's done! Those of you who have the will to save this land, follow me! The rest of you... get out of my sight!"]="It's done! Those of you who have the will to save this land, follow me! The rest of you... get out of my sight!"
G["It's done. The Fist of Garrosh is dropping the bomb."]="Está feito. O Punho de Garrosh tira a bomba."
G["It's down!  Let's finish it off."]="Tem caído! Acabemos com ele."
G["It's driving me crazy. I cannot reach those damned eggs!"]="Está me deixando louco. Não consigo alcançar aqueles ovos malditos!"
G["It's enough to drive a man to drink."]="It's enough to drive a man to drink."
G["It's far too hot to work out here - especially in these uniforms."]="Está muito quente para malhar aqui - especialmente nesses uniformes."
G["It's fascinating... I have heard orcs proclaim the odor of humans to be sickening and I have heard humans proclaim the odor of orcs to be wretched; yet, to me, all of the races of these lands give off the same odor: The foul, dizzying scent of greed.\n\nDo you doubt the validity of my claim? Do you not see these things that run your life as merely runoff from the greed which dictates your every decision?\n\nSo be it. As it was greed that displaced me from my home, it shall be greed that takes me back."]="It's fascinating... I have heard orcs proclaim the odor of humans to be sickening and I have heard humans proclaim the odor of orcs to be wretched; yet, to me, all of the races of these lands give off the same odor: The foul, dizzying scent of greed.\n\nDo you doubt the validity of my claim? Do you not see these things that run your life as merely runoff from the greed which dictates your every decision?\n\nSo be it. As it was greed that displaced me from my home, it shall be greed that takes me back."
G["It's finally over..."]="Ao fim se terminou..."
G["It's flavor is intended for friends to share after a battle. Come... friend... and battle me if you dare."]="It's flavor is intended for friends to share after a battle. Come... friend... and battle me if you dare."
G["It's for the best."]="É pelo seu bem."
G["It's gettin' awful crowded in here.  I don't do well in confined spaces."]="Está ficando horrível aqui. Não me dou bem em espaços confinados."
G["It's getting a little hot over here. Shall we move on?"]="Começa a fazer calor aqui. Seguimos?"
G["It's getting away!"]="Está fugindo!"
G["It's getting closer!  Shoot it down!"]="Se você está acercando! Derríbalo! Agora!"
G["It's go time!"]="É hora de partir!"
G["It's going to blow!"]="It's going to blow!"
G["It's going to take a bit of work, but I think we can save this blood elf's life."]="Vai dar um pouco de trabalho, mas acho que podemos salvar a vida desse elfo sangrento."
G["It's gone. I can't believe it's gone. Who would have thought we'd be betrayed like this?"]="It's gone. I can't believe it's gone. Who would have thought we'd be betrayed like this?"
G["It's gonna be fine, Baine. We gonna find Thrall, gonna kill de Warchief, gonna avenge your father."]="It's gonna be fine, Baine. We gonna find Thrall, gonna kill de Warchief, gonna avenge your father."
G["It's gonna be veal tonight!"]="It's gonna be veal tonight!"
G["It's good te see you though, brother. More than words can say."]="fico feliz em ver você, irmão. Mais do que posso expressar com palavras."
G["It's good to be back out in the field. Nice change of pace from being cooped up in Stormwind all of the time."]="É bom voltar ao campo. É um caminho de aires depois de estar encerrado em Ventobravo tudo o tempo."
G["It's good to be back, overseer. I want to help carry out the ritual."]="fico feliz em voltar, supervisor. Quero ajudar a realizar o ritual."
G["It's good to be in the thick of it again."]="É bom voltar a estar onde se encontre toda a ação."
G["It's good to be outta dat cage. Dey were goin' to sacrifice me..."]="É bom estar fosse da gaiola. Dey estavam indo para me sacrificar..."
G["It's good to be the king!  Now, let's get back to what you were talking about before..."]="É bom ser o rei! Agora, voltemos ao que você estava falando antes..."
G["It's good to be your own boss!\n\nHey could you spare a couple copper for a sandwich? I'm starved."]="It's good to be your own boss!\n\nHey could you spare a couple copper for a sandwich? I'm starved."
G["It's good to finally see you, courier. Krasus has entrusted us with one of the few remaining copies of Ancient Dragonforged Blades."]="fico feliz em ver você ao fim, $gmensajero: mensageira;. Krasus nos tem confiado uma das poucas copias que restam de Lâminas antigas forjadas pelos dragões."
G["It's good to have traveling companions.  The road gets lonely out here."]="É bom ter companheiros de viagem. A estrada fica solitária aqui fosse."
G["It's good to have veterans like you in Alterac Valley, $n.  Our supplies are too low to launch a ground assault through Alterac Valley... speak with our quartermaster - he'll tell you how to increase our supply base."]="Fico feliz ter a veteranos como você no Vale Alterac, $n. Nossos suprimentos são demais escassos para lançar um ataque terrestre no Vale Alterac... Vá embora a falar com o intendente, dirá a você como aumentar nossos suprimentos."
G["It's good to have you back, Varok, old friend. I'm sorry about your boy."]="fico feliz em que estiver de volta, Varok, velho amigo. Sinto o do seu rapaz."
G["It's good to hear the voices of others here in Forest Song again. I'd begun to feel as though I might be the last of the kaldorei ever to set eyes on these lands before their descent into corruption."]="É bom ouvir as vozes de outras pessoas aqui em Forest Song novamente. Eu comecei a sentir como se fosse o último dos kaldorei a pôr os olhos nessas terras antes da sua ocorrida na corrupção."
G["It's good to see a $r, such as yourself, contributing to the well-being of Sylvanaar.  We've done a lot here in a very short time, but the forces that surround us threaten our way of life.\n\nI would hear what you have to say.  Speak your mind, $c."]="It's good to see a $r, such as yourself, contributing to the well-being of Sylvanaar.  We've done a lot here in a very short time, but the forces that surround us threaten our way of life.\n\nI would hear what you have to say.  Speak your mind, $c."
G["It's good to see a new face out here. We're barely hanging on and our enemies are plentiful.\n\nWe're surrounded by those who seek to destroy us: the satyr to the north, the orcs in the lumber camp here to the east, and the demons of Felfire Hill.\n\nWe're going to retake this place if it kills us. It looks like it just might!"]="It's good to see a new face out here. We're barely hanging on and our enemies are plentiful.\n\nWe're surrounded by those who seek to destroy us: the satyr to the north, the orcs in the lumber camp here to the east, and the demons of Felfire Hill.\n\nWe're going to retake this place if it kills us. It looks like it just might!"
G["It's good to see an engineer brave enough to make the device.   We goblin engineers laugh at danger!"]="It's good to see an engineer brave enough to make the device.   We goblin engineers laugh at danger!"
G["It's good to see some of the mosswalker were more resilient than I thought."]="Fico feliz ver que algum dos Caminamohos são mais fortes dos que achava."
G["It's good to see the world outside the monastery."]="É agradável ver o mundo fosse do monastério."
G["It's good to see you again, $n.\n\nCome for a refresher in Scourge tactics?"]="fico feliz em ver você novamente, $n.\n\nTem vindo a colocar ao dia seus conhecimentos sobre táticas do Flagelo?"
G["It's good to see you again, $n. You have High Chief Stillpine's deepest gratitude for rescuing his daughter from the clutches of the Bristlelimb."]="fico feliz em ver você novamente, $n. Tem a gratidão do grande chefe Semprepino por resgate ao seu filha das garras de Brazolanudo."
G["It's good to see you again, Erland.  What is your report?"]="fico feliz em voltar a ver você, Erland. Qual é seu relatório?"
G["It's good to see you again, Mr. Barnes. Do you have the crate?"]="Fico feliz voltar a ver você, Sr. Barnes. Tem o caixote?"
G["It's good to see you again."]="Fico feliz voltar a ver você."
G["It's good to see you defending Theramore with pride, friend."]="It's good to see you defending Theramore with pride, friend."
G["It's good to see you here, $n."]="fico feliz em ver você, $n."
G["It's good to see you made it through, $n."]="Fico feliz ver que has sobrevivido, $n."
G["It's good to see you, $n."]="fico feliz em ver você, $n."
G["It's good to visit with friends and family again, celebrating and sharing stories of old."]="É bom visitar novamente com amigos e familiares, comemorando e compartilhando histórias antigas."
G["It's got me!"]="Me pilhado!"
G["It's got my vote! That'll put hair on your chest like nothing else will."]="It's got my vote! That'll put hair on your chest like nothing else will."
G["It's great bein' a member of da \"Brew of the Month\" club."]="É ótimo ser membro do clube \"Cerveja do mês\"."
G["It's hard to believe any of them survived this."]="Custa acreditar que algum tenha sobrevivido a isto."
G["It's hard to believe that I once respected Arthas."]="It's hard to believe that I once respected Arthas."
G["It's hard to explain to the Dragonmaw concepts like, \"Fields of Fire\" or \"Suppressive Barrage.\"\n\nFortunately, they have a firm grasp of \"Kill Zones\" and ... uh, \"Murder.\""]="It's hard to explain to the Dragonmaw concepts like, \"Fields of Fire\" or \"Suppressive Barrage.\"\n\nFortunately, they have a firm grasp of \"Kill Zones\" and ... uh, \"Murder.\""
G["It's hard to imagine that so much death and despair could be confined to such a small area; yet beyond the swamp is a land plagued by chaos and destruction.\n\nWatch your step, adventurer. The Blasted Lands are the final resting place to far greater beings than you."]="It's hard to imagine that so much death and despair could be confined to such a small area; yet beyond the swamp is a land plagued by chaos and destruction.\n\nWatch your step, adventurer. The Blasted Lands are the final resting place to far greater beings than you."
G["It's hard to put into words.  Things should be wonderful.  Malfurion's returned.  Teldrassil was finally blessed by the dragon aspects... some of them anyway."]="It's hard to put into words.  Things should be wonderful.  Malfurion's returned.  Teldrassil was finally blessed by the dragon aspects... some of them anyway."
G["It's hard work putting these things together!"]="It's hard work putting these things together!"
G["It's heading right for us!"]="Se dirige logo em nossa direção!"
G["It's here!  The Darkmoon Faire is now open for business!  Be sure to see the most exciting show on all of Azeroth!"]="Está aqui! O Darkmoon Faire já está aberto para negócios! Não deixe de assistir ao show mais emocionante de tudo o Azeroth!"
G["It's here... somewhere... I know it. Somewhere in this library is the knowledge I'm looking for..."]="Está aqui... em algum lugar... eu sei. Em alguma parte desta biblioteca está o conhecimento que estou procurando..."
G["It's hotter'n a kiln down here! Ah could fry an egg on me forehead."]="Está mais quente aqui em um forno! Eu poderia fritar um ovo na minha testa."
G["It's in the Valley of Strength, east of the entrance to Grommash Hold."]="Está no Vale da Força, ao este da entrada do Forte Grommash."
G["It's in the hole!  It's in the hole!"]="It's in the hole!  It's in the hole!"
G["It's ironic, I hate the ocean but I love the beach."]="It's ironic, I hate the ocean but I love the beach."
G["It's just a few broken bones and some internal bleeding. Nothing an icepack can't fix!"]="Somente tem uns ossos quebrados e um par de hemorragias internas. Nada que não se arregle com um pouco de gelo!"
G["It's just a matter of time before the naga find us here.\n\nWhat will we fight them with?"]="É questão de tempo que os nagas nos encuentren aqui.\n\nCom que nos enfrentaremos a eles?"
G["It's just a matter of time before we retake Moonwater Retreat."]="É questão de tempo que retomemos o Retiro Agualuna."
G["It's just ahead!"]="Está logo aí!"
G["It's just horrible. I think they're all dead.\n\nHow will I get the kaja'mite out of there now?"]="It's just horrible. I think they're all dead.\n\nHow will I get the kaja'mite out of there now?"
G["It's just ice. Why all the fuss?"]="É só gelo. Por que tudo esse barulho?"
G["It's just like an angry rabbit... except bigger... and toothier."]="It's just like an angry rabbit... except bigger... and toothier."
G["It's just like the structure you described at Umbrafen Lake.  Does this mean the naga are pumping water out of all the lakes in Zangarmarsh?"]="It's just like the structure you described at Umbrafen Lake.  Does this mean the naga are pumping water out of all the lakes in Zangarmarsh?"
G["It's just like the way my wife used to make it. Thanks!"]="Sabe exatamente igual que como o fazia meu esposa. Obrigado!"
G["It's just like, all of a sudden, out of nowhere... BOOM. Super-thick jungle."]="It's just like, all of a sudden, out of nowhere... BOOM. Super-thick jungle."
G["It's just northwest o' here; if ye hurry, ye might be able ta save some! Sorry I don't know anythin' more..."]="Está ao noroeste de aqui; se os dais pressa poderá superando a algum. Sinto muito, não sei nada mais..."
G["It's just so horrible. Our three top guns were shot down over Alliance territory during an air assault Nobody knows if they're dead or alive!\n\nThis is a terrible blow to our air strike capabilities."]="It's just so horrible. Our three top guns were shot down over Alliance territory during an air assault Nobody knows if they're dead or alive!\n\nThis is a terrible blow to our air strike capabilities."
G["It's just too bad that it's all vegetables. Why no giant meat?"]="Que pena somente sejam verduras. Por que não carne gigantesco?"
G["It's just you and me, $r. Let's get this wrapped up quickly so that I can go kill Cho'gall."]="Somente quedamos você e eu, $r. Vamos acabar com isto para que possa ir a matar a Cho'galh."
G["It's just you and me, Twinkle.  Daddy's not going to be coming home."]="Somente estamos você e eu, Titilín. Papai não vai vir a casa."
G["It's just..."]="É somente..."
G["It's keeping my boys from expanding the mine. The Alliance needs that ore!"]="It's keeping my boys from expanding the mine. The Alliance needs that ore!"
G["It's kind of scary looking..."]="It's kind of scary looking..."
G["It's like I'm hearing the Old Gods themselves!"]="It's like I'm hearing the Old Gods themselves!"
G["It's like bungie-jumping, right? But without a cord, see? And you start at the bottom. I guess it's just sorta like regular jumping. But with guns."]="It's like bungie-jumping, right? But without a cord, see? And you start at the bottom. I guess it's just sorta like regular jumping. But with guns."
G["It's like dey got weapons, but no brains."]="Parece que têm armas, mas não cérebro."
G["It's like my mother always said: [Demonic] \"Razxx khaj jhashxx xashjx.\""]="Como costumava dizer meu mãe: [Demoníaco] Razxx khaj jhashxx xashjx."
G["It's like the more I hammer, the bigger this hole gets."]="It's like the more I hammer, the bigger this hole gets."
G["It's like... it's like the void just touched my mind."]="É... É como se o vazio tivesse tocado meu mente."
G["It's likely that he's being held somewhere, awaiting a death ritual."]="Certo que o retienen em algum lado, esperando um ritual de morte."
G["It's looks just like it!"]="It's looks just like it!"
G["It's lovely here, don't you think?\n\nA bit hot, perhaps, but it's a dry heat..."]="Que bem se você está aqui, verdade?\n\nIgual há um pouco de calor, mas é calor seco..."
G["It's lucky that you came along."]="Que sorte que tenha vindo."
G["It's me or you, buddy, and it ain't gonna be me."]="É você ou eu, colega, e não vou ser eu."
G["It's most fortunate for you that you rescued me, and not one of these other poor sots."]="It's most fortunate for you that you rescued me, and not one of these other poor sots."
G["It's much easier to talk up here without all that music."]="É muito mais fácil falar aqui, sem toda essa música."
G["It's my job to ensure that this whole assault runs like clockwork.\n\nHigh Tinker Mekkatorque is out in the field now, but he's scheduled to come back to get some more troops any time now.  \n\nHe's never late, so just stick around and he'll be here."]="It's my job to ensure that this whole assault runs like clockwork.\n\nHigh Tinker Mekkatorque is out in the field now, but he's scheduled to come back to get some more troops any time now.  \n\nHe's never late, so just stick around and he'll be here."
G["It's my passion, you know. In life and in death, armorcrafting is what I love. Please, treat me as if I were a living draenei, stranger. Let me know what it is to feel again... Allow me the honor of repairing your items."]="É a minha paixão, você sabe. Na vida e na morte, artesanato de armadura é o que eu amo. Por favor, trate-me como se eu fosse um draenei vivo, estranho. Deixe-me saber o que é sentir novamente... Permita-me a honra de reparar seus itens."
G["It's my way or the Gold Road.  Is that understood?"]="It's my way or the Gold Road.  Is that understood?"
G["It's nearly defeated! Keep punching!"]="Quase tem caído! Continua pegando!"
G["It's never easy, is it? That's alright, we came prepared."]="It's never easy, is it? That's alright, we came prepared."
G["It's nice to relax for a day."]="É agradável poder ter um dia tranquilo."
G["It's nice to sit amongst friends both old and new."]="It's nice to sit amongst friends both old and new."
G["It's no good! I'm shutting it down..."]="It's no good! I'm shutting it down..."
G["It's no good... you need more work first."]="Não está bem… primeiro precisa trabalhar mais."
G["It's no lie, traitor.  Banehollow wants your heart, and I'm going to get it for him."]="It's no lie, traitor.  Banehollow wants your heart, and I'm going to get it for him."
G["It's no use sending more claws to die at your feet. Instead, I'll leave you this warning..."]="Não tem sentido enviar a mais garras para que mueran aos seus pés. Somente te deixarei uma advertência..."
G["It's no use! The hozen are pushing us back!"]="It's no use! The hozen are pushing us back!"
G["It's no use! Their shield is too strong!"]="Não serve de nada! Seu escudo é demais forte!"
G["It's not Salma Saldean's recipe. It's my Ma's. She asked some passerby to deliver it to Salma right before she and Pa left Westfall with Old Blanchy."]="It's not Salma Saldean's recipe. It's my Ma's. She asked some passerby to deliver it to Salma right before she and Pa left Westfall with Old Blanchy."
G["It's not Winter Veil yet, you know. I have WORK to do!"]="Ainda não é o Festival de Inverno, sabe? Tenho trabalho que fazer!"
G["It's not a party without some crashers!"]="Não é uma festa se não se cuela alguém!"
G["It's not a sad story! Liu Lang himself said, \"Never mourn a life well-lived.\""]="Não é uma história triste! Liu Lang o disse, \"Nunca chore uma vida bem vivida.\""
G["It's not always about money, clem!  While we receive generous donations - some extremely substantial - our traveling troupe of performers is fueled creatively by a need to brighten this war-torn world.  Don't worry about us, but instead let us worry about how to best entertain you."]="It's not always about money, clem!  While we receive generous donations - some extremely substantial - our traveling troupe of performers is fueled creatively by a need to brighten this war-torn world.  Don't worry about us, but instead let us worry about how to best entertain you."
G["It's not bravery that drives it.  It strode before me like it thought this place its home. It is a fool.  It will surely get itself killed soon enough."]="It's not bravery that drives it.  It strode before me like it thought this place its home. It is a fool.  It will surely get itself killed soon enough."
G["It's not broken!"]="Não está front!"
G["It's not enough! Let's show them the might of the 5th Battalion up close!"]="Não é suficiente! Mostrémosles o poder do Quinto Batalhão de perto!"
G["It's not him I'm worried about. It's these new rookies around here - and those creepy purple elves they brought with 'em. They ain't even proved themselves yet."]="Não é ele o que me preocupa. São esses novatos que há por aqui – e esses asquerosos elfos púrpura que têm trazido consigo. Nem sequer se têm testado a si mesmos ainda."
G["It's not much further. The main road is just up ahead."]="Não fica muito. O caminho principal está aí linha de frente."
G["It's not much, but it just might keep your green skin intact."]="Não é muito, mas talvez mantenga intacta seu pele verde."
G["It's not my fault... IT'S NOT MY FAULT!!!\n\nIf they'd just done what I told them to do everything would have been fine. But no! They wouldn't listen.\n\nNow they're all dead.\n\nI just want to go home. Home to Silvermoon. I'm so tired."]="It's not my fault... IT'S NOT MY FAULT!!!\n\nIf they'd just done what I told them to do everything would have been fine. But no! They wouldn't listen.\n\nNow they're all dead.\n\nI just want to go home. Home to Silvermoon. I'm so tired."
G["It's not my time, not yet!"]="Não chegou meu hora, ainda não!"
G["It's not over, Sylvanas. Not yet."]="Não é o fim, Sylvanas. Ainda não."
G["It's not safe here anymore. You need to evacuate Dalaran."]="Aqui já não estamos a salvou. Devemos evacuar Dalaran."
G["It's not safe here.  Go to the Allens' basement."]="Este lugar não é certo. Vê ao porão de Alhen."
G["It's not safe in Orgrimmar for us now."]="Em Orgrimmar não estamos a salvou."
G["It's not slowing down!"]="Não está frenando!"
G["It's not too late, brothers and sisters. Repent! Repent and you may be saved."]="Não é tarde demais, irmãos e irmãs. Arrepentíos! Arrepentíos e serão salvados!"
G["It's not what you've done, it's who you are. You are not welcome here, \"Chen Stormstout.\""]="Não se trata do que fez, destino de quem é. Não é bem-vindo aqui, \"Chen Cerveja de Trovão\"."
G["It's not your fault, Tarenar.  He ran off on his own will.  None of us could stop him."]="It's not your fault, Tarenar.  He ran off on his own will.  None of us could stop him."
G["It's nothing. I'm fine."]="Não é nada. Estou bem."
G["It's now or never, $r."]="Agora ou nunca, $r."
G["It's now or never, soldiers! Let's do this! For K'aresh! For the Protectorate!"]="Agora ou nunca, soldados! Adiante! Por K'aresh! pelo Protectorado!"
G["It's official! $n managed not to die. Great job not dying, $n!"]="Já é oficial! $n conseguiu não morrer. Bom trabalho, $n!"
G["It's ok, sweetheart.  This one's on the house."]="Está bem, céu. Esta corre a cargo da casa."
G["It's okay $n - you're safe now."]="Está bem, $n. Agora está a salvou."
G["It's okay, $n. I've got you... this time."]="Está bem, $n. Te tenho... esta vez."
G["It's okay, boys. Back off. You've done enough. I'll meet up with you later."]="It's okay, boys. Back off. You've done enough. I'll meet up with you later."
G["It's okay. I think he likes it there."]="Está bem. Acho que lhe gosta."
G["It's on!"]="It's on!"
G["It's on! $n, meet my fists. Fists, say hello to $n."]="Está encendido! $n, olhe meus punhos. Primeiro, di onda a meus punhos, $n."
G["It's one of them!"]="É um dos eles!"
G["It's only a matter of time before the plague overtakes New Avalon."]="É apenas uma questão de tempo até que o Flagelo ultrapasse New Avalon."
G["It's only right that you know the name of the one who will take your life."]="É logo que saiba o nome de quem te quitará a vida."
G["It's our fault... the destruction is all our fault..."]="É culpar nossa... a destruição é somente culpar nossa..."
G["It's our job to find out who's behind these abductions and put a stop to them."]="It's our job to find out who's behind these abductions and put a stop to them."
G["It's our turn to pickle your feet!"]="It's our turn to pickle your feet!"
G["It's over Azshara!  You and your naga will return to the bottom of the seas where you belong!"]="It's over Azshara!  You and your naga will return to the bottom of the seas where you belong!"
G["It's over Godfrey.  You have no support left among the eastern lords."]="Se acabou, Godfrey. Não te restam apoyos entre os senhores do este."
G["It's over, Samuelson. We know who you are and I put a stop to your little cathedral scheme."]="It's over, Samuelson. We know who you are and I put a stop to your little cathedral scheme."
G["It's over, Spark. The admiral knows it was you who betrayed the Alliance. Now you're either going to cooperate with me and tell me everything that you know or we're going to engage in some fisticuff."]="Acabou, Spark. O almirante sabe que foi você quem traiu a Aliança. Agora você vai cooperar comigo e me contar tudo o que sabe ou vamos nos envolver em alguma briga."
G["It's over. The curse is lifted. Thank you, $p. Thank you!"]="Se acabou. A maldição se tem terminado. Obrigado, $p. Obrigado!"
G["It's payback time!"]="Hora de saldar contas!"
G["It's people like you who weaken the Alliance and invite the Horde to take away all we've fought for!"]="É gente como você a que debilita a Aliança e convida à Horda a destruir tudo aquilo pelo que temos lutado!"
G["It's poison! Cartloads of poison!"]="É veneno! Carros de veneno!"
G["It's quiet here...."]="Quase temos chegado..."
G["It's quiet... Too quiet..."]="Está tranquilo... demais tranquilo..."
G["It's quite simple, really, $n. My old merc company, The Veiled Blade, took the wrong mission at the wrong time.\n\nWe were hired by a goblin smuggler out of Booty Bay, one Gremnik Rizzlesprang, who was covetous of Lord Valthalak's spellbook. Or, maybe there was some old rivalry there? I suppose we'll never know now, because Gremnik was killed not too long ago by a group of Valthalak's spectral assassins. They really can be very deadly when a large number of them gather.\n\nWhere was I?"]="It's quite simple, really, $n. My old merc company, The Veiled Blade, took the wrong mission at the wrong time.\n\nWe were hired by a goblin smuggler out of Booty Bay, one Gremnik Rizzlesprang, who was covetous of Lord Valthalak's spellbook. Or, maybe there was some old rivalry there? I suppose we'll never know now, because Gremnik was killed not too long ago by a group of Valthalak's spectral assassins. They really can be very deadly when a large number of them gather.\n\nWhere was I?"
G["It's raining still. And freezing. At least we haven't had a typhoon lately."]="It's raining still. And freezing. At least we haven't had a typhoon lately."
G["It's raining yaks and mushan today! Well, I've got a market to run, rain or shine!"]="It's raining yaks and mushan today! Well, I've got a market to run, rain or shine!"
G["It's ready! I put it over on the table."]="Está pronto! O pondré na mesa."
G["It's really going to work this time... right?"]="Esta vez vai funcionar em sério... verdade?"
G["It's really quite simple, $n. Just attach these fireworks to the wild cluckers and I'll use this controller to fly them into the cage."]="It's really quite simple, $n. Just attach these fireworks to the wild cluckers and I'll use this controller to fly them into the cage."
G["It's right in the center of the city. The hub of the wheel."]="É bem no centro da cidade. O cubo da roda."
G["It's rough out there. I need some replacements, Sentinel Onaeya."]="It's rough out there. I need some replacements, Sentinel Onaeya."
G["It's safe now.  You can come down."]="Já não há perigo. Pode descer."
G["It's safe to come out now."]="Sair agora é certo."
G["It's safe, little gnome. You can come out now."]="É certo, pequeno gnomo. Pode sair."
G["It's safe. I brought Lorewalker Cho and his strange companions up this way not long back."]="É certo. Traje até aqui cima ao eremita Cho e aos seus estranhos companheiros não há muito tempo."
G["It's set. Get clear!"]="It's set. Get clear!"
G["It's shaping up!  But it needs more kick.  Yep, you guessed it... Let's wash yesterday's socks in the cauldron... Mmmh, delicious!"]="Está dando forma! Mas precisa de mais chute. Sim, você adivinhou... Vamos lavar as meias de ontem no caldeirão... Mmmh, delicioso!"
G["It's showtime!  Blast them hard, blast them fast!"]="It's showtime!  Blast them hard, blast them fast!"
G["It's similar to a pattern I once noted in Sholazar Basin."]="É um patrono similar a um que descobri na Bacia de Sholazar."
G["It's simple really. Allow me to summarize..."]="Mesmo é simples. Permíteme que te o resuma..."
G["It's simple! You give me a Darkmoon Game Token, and I toss you in and light the fuse.\n\nYou'll \"float\" for a little while after you're shot, but you can descend quickly by dropping the \"wings\" I'll give you.\n\nYou're aiming for a big floating target in the water right off the boardwalk.\n\nJust don't drop your wings while you're still over ground, or... well... I don't sell life insurance!"]="It's simple! You give me a Darkmoon Game Token, and I toss you in and light the fuse.\n\nYou'll \"float\" for a little while after you're shot, but you can descend quickly by dropping the \"wings\" I'll give you.\n\nYou're aiming for a big floating target in the water right off the boardwalk.\n\nJust don't drop your wings while you're still over ground, or... well... I don't sell life insurance!"
G["It's simple, really. Rob the lich, Ras Frostwhisper, of his powers. Return him to his mortal form and then slay him, once and for all."]="É simples, mesmo. Roube o lich, Ras Frostwhisper, dos seus poderes. Devolva-o à sua forma mortal e depois mate-o de uma vez por todas."
G["It's simply too good to be true. You couldn't have killed him so easily!"]="É demais bom para ser certo. Não é possível que o tenha matou tão facilmente!"
G["It's small but it does it's job if you know what you are doing. Let me show you just the right places to hit."]="It's small but it does it's job if you know what you are doing. Let me show you just the right places to hit."
G["It's so cold, so dark.... I'm not overacting, am I?"]="Há tanto frio, está tão sombrio... não estou exagerando, verdade?"
G["It's so dark in here.  I'm not sure I like being undead."]="Aqui está muito sombrio. Não acho que me guste estar não-morto."
G["It's so exciting to be here in Darnassus, surrounded by talented people! I just know I'm going to make my family proud. Maybe if I'm really lucky, the Sentinels will ask me to join their forces on the front!"]="É muito emocionante estar aqui em Darnassus, cercado por pessoas talentosas! Só sei que vou deixar minha família orgulhosa. Talvez se eu tiver muita sorte, os Sentinelas me pedirão para juntar suas forças na linha de frente!"
G["It's so good seeing so many of you here to celebrate this time honored festivity.  A celebration of this magnitude is long overdue."]="It's so good seeing so many of you here to celebrate this time honored festivity.  A celebration of this magnitude is long overdue."
G["It's so good seeing so many of you here to celebrate this time honored festivity.  We've suffered many tragedies this year, so a celebration like Brewfest is a welcome and jubilous occasion."]="It's so good seeing so many of you here to celebrate this time honored festivity.  We've suffered many tragedies this year, so a celebration like Brewfest is a welcome and jubilous occasion."
G["It's so good to see another sin'dorei $g brother : sister;!  As you can imagine, there's not much in the way of conversation around here."]="Que alegria ver a outro sem'dorei $ghermano: irmã;! Como pode imaginar, não há muita conversa por aqui."
G["It's so good to see you again, Muradin. And what's this I heard about you being a King in your own right now? The Bronzebeards were always destined to greatness."]="It's so good to see you again, Muradin. And what's this I heard about you being a King in your own right now? The Bronzebeards were always destined to greatness."
G["It's so intense!"]="É muito intenso!"
G["It's so lovely to see you again, $n! I really can't thank you enough for delivering that message to my dear little gnome.\n\nWould you like to hear a song? It will make traveling in the rough seas much easier!"]="It's so lovely to see you again, $n! I really can't thank you enough for delivering that message to my dear little gnome.\n\nWould you like to hear a song? It will make traveling in the rough seas much easier!"
G["It's so nice to have a break from fighting the sha."]="It's so nice to have a break from fighting the sha."
G["It's so nice to no longer be hearing that troll go on and on! Thank you, $n!"]="It's so nice to no longer be hearing that troll go on and on! Thank you, $n!"
G["It's so red! Don't you know that's my favorite color?"]="É tão vermelho! Sabe que é meu cor favorito?"
G["It's so sad for you poor children."]="É muito triste para os pobres crianças."
G["It's so strange: I can't remember how I came to be here."]="É tão estranho; não lembrança como cheguei até aqui."
G["It's starting!"]="Já começa!"
G["It's still good enough to ship. I can fix it with a patch!"]="Continua sendo o bastante bom para o lançamento. O posso consertar mais adiante com um parche!"
G["It's stomping time."]="Hora de aplastar."
G["It's stunned. Now's our chance to finish it off!"]="It's stunned. Now's our chance to finish it off!"
G["It's sweltering down here. Did someone tell them to turnip the heat?"]="Está sufocante aqui em baixo. Alguém disse a eles para esquentar o fogo?"
G["It's tangled up in the rigging."]="It's tangled up in the rigging."
G["It's that crazy Hobart Grapplehammer's fault! Someone ought to fire that guy and promote his assistant!"]="Foi culpar desse louco de Roberto Martilhazos! Alguém deveria despedir a esse tipo e ascender seu ajudante!"
G["It's that stranger Cho mentioned. I wonder if there are more of them."]="It's that stranger Cho mentioned. I wonder if there are more of them."
G["It's the Den Mother! Look out, $p!"]="É a mãe do covil! Cuidado, $p!"
G["It's the Highlord!"]="É o Alto Senhor!"
G["It's the Horde!"]="É a Horda!"
G["It's the TXR-5000!"]="É o TXR-5000!"
G["It's the big building in Razor Hill that's not the barracks.  Just talk to Innkeeper Grosk inside.  Got that?"]="É o grande edifício em Razor Hill que não é o quartel. Basta falar com o gerente Grosk lá dentro. Percebido?"
G["It's the end of the world!"]="É o fim do mundo!"
G["It's the gallows for me..."]="It's the gallows for me..."
G["It's the one on the far right! Hurry, Hobart! It's going to eggsplode!"]="É o que está mais à direita! Date pressa, Roberto! Vai explotar!"
G["It's the truth, man. Can't ya smell that?"]="It's the truth, man. Can't ya smell that?"
G["It's the yaungol chief, slain just like the rest. Seems that he could not keep order in the final fight."]="It's the yaungol chief, slain just like the rest. Seems that he could not keep order in the final fight."
G["It's thickening! Quickly, get some..."]="It's thickening! Quickly, get some..."
G["It's those blasted iron dwarves again! Somehow, they found him before we did."]="São esses malditos anões de ferro novamente! O têm encontrado, de alguma forma, antes que nós."
G["It's time for a little sabotage!"]="É hora de fazer um pouco de sabotagem!"
G["It's time for a tactical retreat!"]="Hora de uma retirada táctica!"
G["It's time for my meditation, leave me."]="It's time for my meditation, leave me."
G["It's time for revenge!"]="É a hora da vingança!"
G["It's time for the grummle-grubbing goliath, fifteen feet of furry fury, Kun-Lai Summit's own snow-stalking horror, JOL'GRUM!"]="It's time for the grummle-grubbing goliath, fifteen feet of furry fury, Kun-Lai Summit's own snow-stalking horror, JOL'GRUM!"
G["It's time for the main event!  Skarr the Unbreakable is in the Maul!"]="É a hora do evento principal! Skarr o Inquebrável está na Marra!"
G["It's time for your ultimate attack, my darling!"]="É hora do seu ataque definitivo, carinho!"
G["It's time to PARTY!"]="É hora de fazer uma FESTA!"
G["It's time to celebrate, I think..."]="É hora de celebrar, acho..."
G["It's time to deal with this fruit situtation on our terms.  We've been far too accomidating to the fruit vendor.  Now we will simply sell the fruit.  But the fruit will not be for people to eat.  I forbid it!  No one will eat our fruit!"]="It's time to deal with this fruit situtation on our terms.  We've been far too accomidating to the fruit vendor.  Now we will simply sell the fruit.  But the fruit will not be for people to eat.  I forbid it!  No one will eat our fruit!"
G["It's time to go..."]="It's time to go..."
G["It's time to join the fray, $n!  With you on our side the scales will surely tip in our favor!"]="It's time to join the fray, $n!  With you on our side the scales will surely tip in our favor!"
G["It's time to wake up, magistrate! These aren't ordinary gnoll attacks!"]="É hora de despertar, magistrado! Não se trata um ataque gnolh normal!"
G["It's times like these that I remember why we're best friends, Pat. You're always so full of positive encouragement."]="It's times like these that I remember why we're best friends, Pat. You're always so full of positive encouragement."
G["It's times like these that I wish I had a longer cooldown."]="Em momentos como este desearía ter um tempo de recarga maior."
G["It's too bad they don't stay cute.  There must be some rite of passage in the Barrens called, \"Climb ugly tree and fall out.\""]="It's too bad they don't stay cute.  There must be some rite of passage in the Barrens called, \"Climb ugly tree and fall out.\""
G["It's too late for me."]="É tarde demais para mim."
G["It's too late to run now.  Do not leave the ring.  Die bravely, $n!"]="It's too late to run now.  Do not leave the ring.  Die bravely, $n!"
G["It's too late to stop them. Let me show you their glory..."]="It's too late to stop them. Let me show you their glory..."
G["It's too much!"]="É demais!"
G["It's too quiet today, Theloria.  The blood elves are up to no good.  I can feel it."]="Tudo está demais tranquilo hoje, Theloria. Os elfos de sangue estão tramando algo. O noto."
