G["It's too quiet. We should check this out."]="Há demais silêncio. Deveríamos investigação."
G["It's too quiet. Where are Thermaplugg's defense forces?"]="Demais silêncio. Onde estão as forças defensivas de Termochufe?"
G["It's trashed, but it doesn't look like there are any bodies."]="It's trashed, but it doesn't look like there are any bodies."
G["It's true our new... guests are limiting our work somewhat, but it is only natural to be wary when a genocidal attempt is made. Perhaps in time they will be convinced that Putress was an unfortunate anomaly and allow us to continue our work in peace."]="É verdade que nossos novos convidados estão limitando um pouco o nosso trabalho, mas é natural ter cuidado quando uma tentativa genocida é feita. Talvez com o tempo eles estejam convencidos de que Putress foi uma anomalia infeliz e nos permitam seguir nosso trabalho em paz."
G["It's true then?  Even those afflicted by the Curse are fighting the Forsaken!"]="Então é verdade? Até as vítimas da maldição luchan contra os Renegados!"
G["It's true, even stranglekelp can be quite useful in building up what we need for the upcoming war at Ahn'Qiraj! It has so many uses, like making ice cream for hot days under the Silithus sun, as a salve for the effects of some icky plants, breathing underwater, hardening the skin, making you quick, regaining magic power; so many things I can't think of them all! Did I mention making ice cream?\n\nAnywhoodles, I've got about $2047w here, and I need a total of $2048w!"]="It's true, even stranglekelp can be quite useful in building up what we need for the upcoming war at Ahn'Qiraj! It has so many uses, like making ice cream for hot days under the Silithus sun, as a salve for the effects of some icky plants, breathing underwater, hardening the skin, making you quick, regaining magic power; so many things I can't think of them all! Did I mention making ice cream?\n\nAnywhoodles, I've got about $2047w here, and I need a total of $2048w!"
G["It's truly outrageous that so many workers are hurt."]="É mesmo intolerable que tenha tantos trabalhadores feridos."
G["It's trying to bash me skull in!"]="It's trying to bash me skull in!"
G["It's unsafe to wander through the forest alone, don't you think?"]="Não acha que é perigoso recorrer o florestas sem proteção?"
G["It's unseasonably hot. Time for Brivethwerp's Sililicious Crunch!"]="Há demais calor para esta estação. É hora de tome um Crocante Silítico de Bridatuer!"
G["It's up and....it's good!"]="Está pronto e... está bem!"
G["It's up to me to ensure these Kor'kron are ready."]="Meu trabalho é garantir de que os Kor'kron estão prontos."
G["It's up to you to find him before the irons do!"]="It's up to you to find him before the irons do!"
G["It's us or them, $r. This day won't end without bloodshed."]="São eles ou nós, $r. O dia de hoje não acabará sem que se derrame sangue."
G["It's very nice, $n. Thank you."]="Está muito bem, $n. Obrigado."
G["It's weird. My butt hurts. Not sure why."]="É raro. Me dói o culo. E não estou certo de por que."
G["It's what we're fighting for. On this front, at least."]="É pelo que estamos lutando. Ao menos neste linha de frente."
G["It's where we will do our duty, for our king, for Stormwind and for her people..."]="É lá que cumpriremos o nosso dever, pelo nosso rei, por Ventobravo e por seu povo..."
G["It's working! Ghabar will be pleased to hear the news."]="Funciona! Ghabar estará encantado de saber."
