G["Jaina -"]="Jaina..."
G["Jaina Proudmoore now sits as head of the Kirin Tor and rules Dalaran.\n\nThat puts the citadel square in the hands of the Alliance no matter how much Aethas brags about neutrality.\n\nThis young upstart may have forgotten, but the Alliance tried to imprison and massacre our people during the third war.\n\nForgive me if I do not share his faith in their... \"neutrality\"."]="Jaina Proudmoore now sits as head of the Kirin Tor and rules Dalaran.\n\nThat puts the citadel square in the hands of the Alliance no matter how much Aethas brags about neutrality.\n\nThis young upstart may have forgotten, but the Alliance tried to imprison and massacre our people during the third war.\n\nForgive me if I do not share his faith in their... \"neutrality\"."
G["Jaina is taking away my home by force? I'll remember this..."]="Jaina me arrebata meu lar pela força? Mais o esquecerei..."
G["Jaina takes a deep breath."]="Jaina respira profundamente."
G["Jaina was right to recommend you. You saved this mission from disaster... and saved my life."]="Jaina was right to recommend you. You saved this mission from disaster... and saved my life."
G["Jaina!  You ORCISH SCUM!"]="Jaina! Escória orca!"
G["Jaina! Could it truly be you?"]="JAINA! Mesmo é você?"
G["Jaina! Stop!"]="Jaina! Para!"
G["Jaina! What's happening in Dalaran? Has there been an attack?"]="Jaina! O que está acontecendo em Dalaran? Houve um ataque?"
G["Jaina's expression softens."]="A expresão de Jaina se suaviza."
G["Jaina's gone over the edge. She's imprisoning the Sunreavers and attacking those who resist. What's worse, the Silver Covenant has seized the opportunity to join the bloodshed."]="Jaina perdeu o juízo. Encarcela aos Atracasol e ataca a tudo o que se resiste. E o que é pior, O Pacto de Prata tem aproveitado a oportunidade para entrar à matança."
G["Jaina, listen to me. You must destroy the Lich King. You cannot reason with him. He will kill you and your allies and raise you all as powerful soldiers of the Scourge."]="Jaina, escúchame. Deve acabar com o Rei Lich. Você não pode razonar com ele. Os matará você e aos seus aliados e os levantará como poderosos soldados do Flagelo."
G["Jaina, what happened at the Wrath Gate. It was a betrayal from within..."]="Jaina, o que aconteceu na Portões da Cólera, foi uma traição interno…"
G["Jaina, you haven't much time. The Lich King sees what the sword sees. He will be here shortly."]="Jaina, não têm muito tempo. O Rei Lich vê o que vê a lâmina. Chegará em qualquer momentos."
G["Jaina, you need to talk to me before you act-"]="Jaina, você precisa falar comigo antes de agir..."
G["Jaina. We've got to work together on this. The Alliance must act as one."]="Jaina. Temos que trabalhar juntos nisso. A Aliança precisa agir unida."
G["Jaina?"]="Jaina?"
