G["Just let me know when you're ready to take a squad out.\n\nI'm holding some in reserve, so if you need a few more, come back."]="Avise-me quando queira tirar um esquadrão.\n\nTenho reservas, assim que volta se você precisa mais."
G["Just like her. The parallels I've heard are interesting. And it's no secret all druids, Shu'halo and elf alike, can call upon Mu'sha's light."]="Just like her. The parallels I've heard are interesting. And it's no secret all druids, Shu'halo and elf alike, can call upon Mu'sha's light."
G["Just like hunters, pets can choose specializations. Ferocious pets, like cats, can dish out damage but can't take it as well. Tenacious pets, like turtles, are more defensive and can occupy an enemy's attention while you stay at range. Cunning pets, like spiders, have a mix of offensive and defensive abilities and are particularly useful in Battlegrounds and Arenas.\n\nEach pet comes with a default specialization, but you can change it if you like."]="Just like hunters, pets can choose specializations. Ferocious pets, like cats, can dish out damage but can't take it as well. Tenacious pets, like turtles, are more defensive and can occupy an enemy's attention while you stay at range. Cunning pets, like spiders, have a mix of offensive and defensive abilities and are particularly useful in Battlegrounds and Arenas.\n\nEach pet comes with a default specialization, but you can change it if you like."
G["Just like old times, eh, $n?"]="Just like old times, eh, $n?"
G["Just like old times, eh, $n?\n\nI'm not too busy here to train you. These guys are creampuffs."]="Just like old times, eh, $n?\n\nI'm not too busy here to train you. These guys are creampuffs."
G["Just like the League to leave a dwarf stranded with no help and no ale!"]="Típico da Liga abandonar a um anão sem ajuda e sem cerveja!"
G["Just look at this place!\n\nIt's an archaeologist's dream..."]="Olhe este lugar!\n\nÉ o sonho de tudo arqueólogo..."
G["Just look at this place! An entire ecology secluded, cut off from all known timelines!\n\nIt is rare for one such as I to be surprised by, well, anything really. I shall relish every moment I spend here."]="Just look at this place! An entire ecology secluded, cut off from all known timelines!\n\nIt is rare for one such as I to be surprised by, well, anything really. I shall relish every moment I spend here."
G["Just look at this place! It's amazing!"]="Contempla este lugar! É asombroso!"
G["Just look at this place, Malkorok. THIS is the prosperity that our people deserve!"]="Observa este lugar, Malkorok. ESTA é a prosperidade que se merece nosso povo!"
G["Just look at those mantid below us. The Empress orders the Swarm much too early! Another sign of her chaotic delusions."]="Just look at those mantid below us. The Empress orders the Swarm much too early! Another sign of her chaotic delusions."
G["Just need to rest my eyes a bit..."]="Somente preciso descansar um pouco os olhos..."
G["Just north of Azure Watch is where you will have the best luck finding moongraze bucks.\n\nHappy hunting, $n!"]="Just north of Azure Watch is where you will have the best luck finding moongraze bucks.\n\nHappy hunting, $n!"
G["Just one final push and the island will be ours.  Chin up men, we move out first thing in the morning."]="Just one final push and the island will be ours.  Chin up men, we move out first thing in the morning."
G["Just one good shot..."]="Somente um bom disparo..."
G["Just one moment. You cannot purchase a fine elekk without proving yourself a friend to the Exodar. Return once we know you can be trusted."]="Just one moment. You cannot purchase a fine elekk without proving yourself a friend to the Exodar. Return once we know you can be trusted."
G["Just one... more... catch!"]="Somente... um... mais!"
G["Just open the door... oh no!"]="Você abra a porta... Oh, não!"
G["Just open this door."]="Just open this door."
G["Just outside the city's main gate is a signpost.  It will point you toward the western zeppelin tower."]="Do lado de fosse do portões principal da cidade há uma placa de sinalização. Ele apontará para a torre zeppelin ocidental."
G["Just passing through? Tell me, how can I help you?"]="Somente está passando por aqui? Diga, como posso ajudar você?"
G["Just pick a spot already!"]="Escolha um lugar!"
G["Just point me at de enemy!"]="Você somente senhálame ao inimigo!"
G["Just point me in the right direction. I'll carry the load."]="Somente diga a direção, e eu levarei a carga."
G["Just relax... Panicking will only make it worse."]="Just relax... Panicking will only make it worse."
G["Just release me already! I've had enough!"]="Libérame quanto antes! Já não posso mais!"
G["Just remember that you can only pick one gathering job to do per day. Aside from that, we're always looking for more crystals. Any worthless peon can bring those back to the base camp."]="Lembre-se de que você só pode escolher um trabalho de pegue por dia. Além disso, estamos sempre procurando por mais cristais. Qualquer peão inútil pode trazê-os de volta ao acampamento base."
G["Just remember, $n, it's in our best interests that you do as much as possible for these... these people."]="Lembre-se, $n, que o que mais nos beneficia é que faça tudo o possível por esta... esta gente."
G["Just remember, real crops will take a day to grow, so after you've tilled and cared for your plants, come back the next day to harvest your bounty!"]="Just remember, real crops will take a day to grow, so after you've tilled and cared for your plants, come back the next day to harvest your bounty!"
G["Just say the word, and I'll be there to help."]="Tão somente dilo, e instantaneamente poderá contar com minha ajuda."
G["Just show me the way, Franclorn."]="Apenas me mostre o caminho, Franclorn."
G["Just shut up and teleport me to the Undercity."]="Cierrao pico e teletranspórtame a Cidade Baixa."
G["Just sit right back and you'll hear a ta... *hic* a tai... *hic* a taiiii *hic* Damnit!"]="Just sit right back and you'll hear a ta... *hic* a tai... *hic* a taiiii *hic* Damnit!"
G["Just sit tight while I get this prepared for you!"]="Siéntate aí enquanto te preparo isto!"
G["Just so you guys don't feel left out, all I said was how attractive the blood elves are.  It loses something in the translation."]="Just so you guys don't feel left out, all I said was how attractive the blood elves are.  It loses something in the translation."
G["Just stand back, $n. We wouldn't want $gyou:a pretty little thing like you; getting hurt."]="Afaste-se, $n. Não queremos que uma florecilha silvestre como você se faça dano."
G["Just stay focused on the battle in front of us, or you won't live to worry about the rest."]="Just stay focused on the battle in front of us, or you won't live to worry about the rest."
G["Just swinging a hammer at an anvil doesn't make you a smith. Give me that and let me teach you something before you embarrass us all."]="Apenas balançar um martelo em uma bigorna não faz de você um ferreiro. Dê-me isso e deixe-me ensinar uma coisa antes de envergonhar a todos nós."
G["Just take a deep breath. Did you see anything?"]="Tome ar. Tem visto algo?"
G["Just take the picture already!"]="Tira a foto de uma vez!"
G["Just tap the keg already!"]="Just tap the keg already!"
G["Just teleport me for now. But I can't wait for that sweet sweet elevator!"]="Just teleport me for now. But I can't wait for that sweet sweet elevator!"
G["Just tell me one thing, Vanessa."]="Diga uma coisa, Vanessa."
G["Just tell us what you know about the Shady Rest Inn, and I won't bash your skull in."]="Just tell us what you know about the Shady Rest Inn, and I won't bash your skull in."
G["Just the other day I saw a much more powerful $c flying overhead."]="Logo o outro dia vi a $gun: uma; $c muito mais $gpoderoso: poderosa; voando pelo céu."
G["Just the two of you?  You'll never stand a chance."]="Somente vocês dois? Não têm nenhuma possibilidade."
G["Just think of all the knowledge I could share. Think of all the food we could grow!"]="Acha em toda a informações que poderá compartilhar. Acha em todos os alimentos que poderíamos cultivar!"
G["Just this once..."]="Somente esta vez..."
G["Just try to stop us now!"]="Just try to stop us now!"
G["Just two minutes to go!  We're half way there, but don't let your guard down!"]="Just two minutes to go!  We're half way there, but don't let your guard down!"
G["Just wait, I'll have that troll singin' by day's end."]="Já verá, esse troll cantará antes de que se pongao sol."
G["Just wanted to let you know that we're all counting on you!"]="Somente queria dizer que todos temos com você!"
G["Just was resting eyes!  Back to work now!"]="Eu somente descansar olhos! Eu voltar ao trabalho agora!"
G["Just what I be t'inkin'. More delays."]="Just what I be t'inkin'. More delays."
G["Just what I was waiting for! Time to introduce those yaungol to my fists!"]="Logo o que estava esperando! Já é hora de apresentar meus punhos a esses yaungol!"
G["Just what an hungry old man needs. Thanks."]="Logo o que um ancião faminto precisa. Obrigado."
G["Just what in the name of all that is unholy was that thing?"]="Em nome de tudo o profano, que era essa coisa?"
G["Just what we need, more of this lunacy!"]="Logo o que nos fazia falta mais lunáticos!"
G["Just when I think a group is the worst, something wonderful happens!"]="Logo quando pretendo que um grupo é o pior, passa algo magnífico!"
G["Just when I thought it couldn't get any worse...."]="Apenas quando eu pensei que não poderia ficar pior...."
G["Just when I thought we'd gotten a break by getting away from those raptors, things get even worse around here.\n\nNo use bellyaching though. We're gonna face this like proper dwarves!"]="Just when I thought we'd gotten a break by getting away from those raptors, things get even worse around here.\n\nNo use bellyaching though. We're gonna face this like proper dwarves!"
G["Just when things were getting interesting."]="Just when things were getting interesting."
G["Just when you think you've seen it all!  $n will square off with an authentic Grizzly Hills crazed furbolg in front of your very eyes here at the Conquest Pit!  Place your bets, folks!"]="Just when you think you've seen it all!  $n will square off with an authentic Grizzly Hills crazed furbolg in front of your very eyes here at the Conquest Pit!  Place your bets, folks!"
G["Just who do you think YOU are?"]="Quem você acha que é VOCÊ?"
G["Just... end it."]="Somente... acaba com elho."
G["Just... leave me alone!"]="Deixe-me em paz!"
G["Just... need a second."]="Somente... preciso... um segundo."
G["Justicar Mariel Trueheart has asked us to help administer and defend the tournament now that the coliseum is complete. She wants us to work with those worthless Silver Covenant curs, but they're just getting in the way."]="O juiz Justicar Mariel Trueheart nos pediu para ajudar a administrar e defender o torneio agora que o coliseu está completo. Ela quer que trabalhemos com aquelas maldições inúteis da Aliança de Prata, mas elas estão apenas atrapalhando."
G["Justicar Mariel Trueheart has asked us to see to the needs of the tournament. Those who have earned the right to stand as champions and who have proven themselves in our eyes are asked to assist with these duties."]="O juiz Mariel Trueheart nos pediu para atender às necessidades do torneio. Aqueles que conquistaram o direito de permanecer como campeões e que se provaram aos nossos olhos são convidados a ajudar com esses deveres."
G["Justicar Mariel Trueheart has entrusted us with the duty of overseeing many of the tournament's affairs. Unfortunately, she tasked the Sunreavers with the same duty, which means we must work twice as hard to solve the problems created by those fools!"]="A justicar Mariel Coração Veraz nos tem confiado a tarefa de supervisionar muitos dos aspectos do torneio. Por desgraça lhes pediu o mesmo aos Atracasol, o que indica que teremos que trabalhar o doble para consertar os problemas que ocasionen esses insensatos!"
