G["Kaja'mite... you know, the stuff that legend holds helped the entire goblin race to evolve into the ultimate masters of alchemy and engineering?!\n\nIt's the stuff that helped us to overthrow our jungle troll oppressors, to take control of Kezan -- may she rest in peace -- and is the most valuable ore in all of existence!\n\nHey, you don't think that it's having any effect on those monkeys do you?"]="Kaja'mite... you know, the stuff that legend holds helped the entire goblin race to evolve into the ultimate masters of alchemy and engineering?!\n\nIt's the stuff that helped us to overthrow our jungle troll oppressors, to take control of Kezan -- may she rest in peace -- and is the most valuable ore in all of existence!\n\nHey, you don't think that it's having any effect on those monkeys do you?"
G["Kalaran, I have misplaced my torch. I require another."]="Kalaran, perdi minha tocha. Eu preciso de outro."
G["Kalaran, please enchant the torch."]="Kalaran, por favor, encante a tocha."
G["Kalec sent me..."]="Me envia Kalec..."
G["Kalec... Kalec?"]="Kalec... Kalec?"
G["Kalecgos has been chosen as the new aspect for the blue dragonflight.\n\nOne among you was instrumental in thwarting Arygos's betrayal to Deathwing, thereby averting a terrible crisis.\n\nWe are here to partake in the celebration of their heroic deeds."]="Kalecgos has been chosen as the new aspect for the blue dragonflight.\n\nOne among you was instrumental in thwarting Arygos's betrayal to Deathwing, thereby averting a terrible crisis.\n\nWe are here to partake in the celebration of their heroic deeds."
G["Kalecgos?! That's your good foot forward?\n\nGood luck with that one, buddy."]="Kalecgos?! Essa é seu melhor baza?\n\nPois boa sorte, colega."
G["Kalimaste!"]="Kalimaste!"
G["Kalimdor belongs to the Grimtotem. Nobody can stand in our way.\n\nWe are supreme in all things, as you will now see as I crush your pathetic team."]="Kalimdor belongs to the Grimtotem. Nobody can stand in our way.\n\nWe are supreme in all things, as you will now see as I crush your pathetic team."
G["Kalimdor for the Horde!"]="Kalimdor pela Horda!"
G["Kalimdor is much changed. I do not recognize this place."]="Kalimdor tem mudado muito. Não reconheço este lugar."
G["Kalytha - you're still alive! Find some cover, there's no end to these ... things!"]="Kalytha - você ainda está vivo! Encontre alguma cobertura, não há fim para essas... coisas!"
G["Kalytha ... it is done. The Sarcen Stone is fully charged and is already diverting energy from the portal. Are you still the incredible swimmer I knew those many years ago? The stone must not be found by either the demons or our \"beloved\" Queen.\n\nSwim to the bottom of the lake, Kalytha, and bury the stone deep under the center arch. Hopefully the demonic invaders will not discover it when they raze the surrounding temple. Go!"]="Kalytha ... it is done. The Sarcen Stone is fully charged and is already diverting energy from the portal. Are you still the incredible swimmer I knew those many years ago? The stone must not be found by either the demons or our \"beloved\" Queen.\n\nSwim to the bottom of the lake, Kalytha, and bury the stone deep under the center arch. Hopefully the demonic invaders will not discover it when they raze the surrounding temple. Go!"
G["Kalytha! Archmage Selwyn was looking for you. She should be nearby..."]="Kalytha! O Arquimago Selwyn estava procurando por você. Ela deveria estar por perto..."
G["Kalytha! Hurry - Archmage Selwyn wanted to see you, she said it was urgent. Maybe we can win this thing?"]="Kalytha! Depressa - o arquimago Selwyn queria vê-o, ela disse que era urgente. Talvez possamos ganhar essa coisa?"
G["Kang says the mogu are ruffians and bandits.\n\nFrom what we've seen so far, I think they might be becoming a larger threat than any of the pandaren suspect."]="Kang says the mogu are ruffians and bandits.\n\nFrom what we've seen so far, I think they might be becoming a larger threat than any of the pandaren suspect."
G["Kanrethad enveloped himself with so much fel energy that it corrupted him totally. But a small taste of his power should not be harmful. Go ahead."]="Kanrethad drenou tanta energia vil que foi totalmente corrompido. Mas um pouquinho do seu poder pode não fazer tão mal. Vá em frente."
G["Kar Aman, $n. You look to be a strong $c--you would do well to mind yourself in this area. Touching things you know nothing about, or showing disrespect to your elders is just cause for punishment.\n\nYou may not respect me or my companions, but you will learn to respect our power if you prove foolish enough.\n\nNow, enough with the pleasantries, was there something I can do for you?"]="Kar Aman, $n. You look to be a strong $c--you would do well to mind yourself in this area. Touching things you know nothing about, or showing disrespect to your elders is just cause for punishment.\n\nYou may not respect me or my companions, but you will learn to respect our power if you prove foolish enough.\n\nNow, enough with the pleasantries, was there something I can do for you?"
G["Kara, I need to be flown out to the Dens of Dying to find Bixie."]="Kara, I need to be flown out to the Dens of Dying to find Bixie."
G["Karazhan is more than a mere building, $n.  If you traced the ley-lines traversing Azeroth you would find that they all converge right about there.\n\n<Alturus points at an invisible spot below the tower.>\n\nFascinating, isn't it?"]="Karazhan is more than a mere building, $n.  If you traced the ley-lines traversing Azeroth you would find that they all converge right about there.\n\n<Alturus points at an invisible spot below the tower.>\n\nFascinating, isn't it?"
G["Karazhan wasn't always quite as... ominous.  The darkening of Karazhan only came with Medivh's death.  Or what we believe was Medivh's death."]="Karazhan nem sempre foi tão... ameaçador. O escurecimento de Karazhan só veio com a morte de Medivh. Ou o que acreditamos ser a morte de Medivh."
G["Kargath Bladefist has been slain! Long live the Alliance!"]="Kargath's Garrafilada foi derrotou! Larga vida à Aliança!"
G["Kargath Bladefist has fallen! For the Horde!"]="Kargath's Garrafilada tem caído! pela Horda!"
G["Karin can be found in easternmost Stormwind, through the gates at the back of Old Town."]="Karin pode ser encontrado no Stormwind mais ao leste, através dos portões na parte traseira da Cidade Velha."
G["Karn says we need to listen to the spirits of the forge and of the steel, that they will guide us. I hear nothing but a ringing in my ears. Here, take a hammer and let us try to hear the spirits together."]="Karn diz que precisamos de ouvir os espíritos da forja e do aço, para que eles nos guiem. Não ouço nada além de um zumbido nos meus atenção. Aqui, pegue um martelo e vamos tentar ouvir os espíritos juntos."
G["Karnik, me friend, I wish I could see you with me own eyes again, but we need'ta talk of Ragnaros. His influence is spreading."]="Karnik, amigo, tomara pudesse voltar a ver você com meus próprios olhos, mas temos que falar de Ragnaros. Seu influência se extiende."
G["Kartak comes for big-tongue meat. Frenzyheart make sure plenty is ready."]="Kartak vem para carne de língua grande. Frenzyheart verifique se você está tudo pronto."
G["Kartak like taste of big-tongues. If Kartak hungry though, he not mind taste of Frenzyheart, so make sure Kartak not hungry."]="A Kartak gostar sabor de línguas-grandes. Mas se Kartak faminto, não fazer asco a Coração Frenético, assim que garantir que Kartak não faminto."
G["Kartak, I do not fear you!"]="Kartak, não te temo!"
G["Karu will you please help get these bees off of me? They sting!"]="Karu will you please help get these bees off of me? They sting!"
G["Kasha! Come to me! I am fine!"]="Kasha! Venha a mim! Estou bem!"
G["Kaskala's under attack!  We must hold them off until we can escape."]="Kaskala está sob ataque! Devemos segurá-os até que possamos escapar."
G["Kaw's halberd breaks in two and falls to the ground!"]="A alabarda de Kaw se parte em dois e cai no chão!"
G["Kawphi? Memory potion? Hah! This isn't a memory potion."]="Kawphi? Poção de memória? Ha! Isto não é uma poção de memória!"
G["Kazum!  I hold your scepter!  I command you to enter this world!"]="Kazum! Eu certo seu cetro! Eu ordeno que você entre neste mundo!"
G["Kazzak is supreme!"]="Kazzak é supremo!"
G["Keegan, sir. More elementals are breaking through on the west side of the rift."]="Keegan, senhor. Mais elementais se abrem passo pelo lado oeste da falha."
G["Keelen's tailoring shop in the northwest corner of the Bazaar has a loom like you describe."]="A alfaiataria de Keelen, no canto noroeste do Bazar, tem um tear como você descreve."
G["Keenbean Kafa Co. is in real trouble!"]="Keenbean Kafa Co. is in real trouble!"
G["Keep 'em comin', $n."]="Continua assim, $n."
G["Keep 'em hot you big dummy!"]="Keep 'em hot you big dummy!"
G["Keep 'em in your sights. If they make a move on the guards, they're dead."]="Keep 'em in your sights. If they make a move on the guards, they're dead."
G["Keep 'em off me for about 15 seconds and this thing is as good as dead."]="Keep 'em off me for about 15 seconds and this thing is as good as dead."
G["Keep a close eye on this Broken scum!  Far too many have escaped from us!"]="Keep a close eye on this Broken scum!  Far too many have escaped from us!"
G["Keep a close eye on your surroundings. The route I'm taking is the same route you can use to get back to Valgarde."]="Presta atenção aos arredores. A rota que estou tomando é a mesma rota que você pode usar para voltar a Valgarde."
G["Keep a sharp eye out.  There must be a clue here somewhere that can help us track him down."]="Keep a sharp eye out.  There must be a clue here somewhere that can help us track him down."
G["Keep a sharp eye, $c.  You never know when some beastie is stalking you instead of the other way around."]="Keep a sharp eye, $c.  You never know when some beastie is stalking you instead of the other way around."
G["Keep a wary eye out, $r; there are unsavory characters afoot."]="Mantenha-se alerta, $r; há indeseables por aqui."
G["Keep ample pressure on the southern pump."]="Mantenha a presão alta na bomba do sul."
G["Keep an eye on that tunnel. We must not let anyone through!"]="Keep an eye on that tunnel. We must not let anyone through!"
G["Keep an eye on the rear! No - not MY rear. Behind us!"]="Atenção à retaguarda! Não, MEU retaguarda não. Trás de nós!"
G["Keep an eye on us, $p! We're builders, not fighters. We'll need your protection if any beasties come around!"]="Keep an eye on us, $p! We're builders, not fighters. We'll need your protection if any beasties come around!"
G["Keep an eye out boys.  It's too quiet out there."]="Keep an eye out boys.  It's too quiet out there."
G["Keep an eye out for brittle roots, $p. We can use their wood in the construction of our defenses."]="Keep an eye out for brittle roots, $p. We can use their wood in the construction of our defenses."
G["Keep an eye out for oily serpents, $p. They're easy enough to catch. Put their oil in the cauldron and we'll work even faster."]="Keep an eye out for oily serpents, $p. They're easy enough to catch. Put their oil in the cauldron and we'll work even faster."
G["Keep an eye out for them, girl! Don't let them get us!"]="Mantenha-se alerta, garota. Não deixe que nos atrapen!"
G["Keep an eye to the sea, $gbrother:sister;. The mogu can attack from anywhere."]="Keep an eye to the sea, $gbrother:sister;. The mogu can attack from anywhere."
G["Keep at it. If our suspicions are right and this is a transporter, it could prove extremely useful in our assault."]="Keep at it. If our suspicions are right and this is a transporter, it could prove extremely useful in our assault."
G["Keep at them!"]="Keep at them!"
G["Keep away from the edge there, champ. Don't want you falling."]="Afaste-se da borda, campeão. Não quero que você caia."
G["Keep away. The fool is mine."]="Keep away. The fool is mine."
G["Keep back from this stall, please; there is a delicate investigation underway."]="Keep back from this stall, please; there is a delicate investigation underway."
G["Keep bringin' ones like that!"]="Keep bringin' ones like that!"
G["Keep bringing me food like this an' ye'll be me new best friend!"]="Keep bringing me food like this an' ye'll be me new best friend!"
G["Keep casting! I will dispose of them."]="Keep casting! I will dispose of them."
G["Keep dese assassins off of me!"]="Keep dese assassins off of me!"
G["Keep everyone working efficiently."]="Que tudo o mundo continue trabalhando eficazmente."
G["Keep fighting, $c! The Demon Chain will eventually win out."]="Continua lutando, $c! Ao fim terminará ganhando a cadeia do Demônio."
G["Keep fighting, pandaren! Cancel all retreat orders! Stoneplow hasn't fallen yet!"]="Keep fighting, pandaren! Cancel all retreat orders! Stoneplow hasn't fallen yet!"
G["Keep firing!  Cut off their reinforcements!"]="Keep firing!  Cut off their reinforcements!"
G["Keep firing! Let none escape!"]="Sigam disparando! Que não escape nem um!"
G["Keep going! Kill!"]="Não desista! Mate!"
G["Keep going! Water my Cabbages!"]="Keep going! Water my Cabbages!"
G["Keep going, you're almost there!\n\nThis is my third trip through the pass. I wish I could say it was getting easier!\n\nWhen you get to the top, there's a wonderful inn called the \"Tavern in the Mist.\" Keep your weapons close, though. You'll run across all kinds of characters."]="Continua andando, quase chegou!\n\nEste é meu terceiro viagem por este passe. Tomara pudesse dizer que se há mais fácil com o tempo!\n\nQuando lhegues cima, há uma estalagem ótima chamada \"a Taberna na Névoa\". Mas não perda de visão seus armas, ali há tudo tipo de personagens."
G["Keep hacking at the overgrowth! If that doesn't work, we're going to start burning."]="Keep hacking at the overgrowth! If that doesn't work, we're going to start burning."
G["Keep him asleep, that's it. No need to wake him before it's time."]="Keep him asleep, that's it. No need to wake him before it's time."
G["Keep him busy! I am almost finished!"]="Mantenha ocupado! Já quase está!"
G["Keep him distracted!"]="Distráelo!"
G["Keep him weak!"]="Keep him weak!"
G["Keep it down back there or you'll join your friends!"]="Guarda silêncio, aí por trás, ou te reunirás com os seus amigos!"
G["Keep it down fruit vendor!"]="Keep it down fruit vendor!"
G["Keep it down lady!"]="Baixa a voz, senhora!"
G["Keep it down!  I don't want them to see me over here.\n\nOoh, this really burns me up!  Who do these ethereals think they are?\n\nThis is MY claim!"]="Fala baixo! Não quero que me vean aqui.\n\nOoh, isto me coloca furioso! Mas quem se acreditam que são esses etéreos?\n\nAgora me toca a mim!"
G["Keep it down! We'll get this sorted out as soon as we can."]="Baixa a voz! O arreglaremos assim que possamos."
G["Keep it down, will you? I'm trying to run a business here..."]="Baixa a voz, que? Estou tentando levar um negócios..."
G["Keep it moving, people."]="Sigam assim, gente."
G["Keep it quiet in there. They only get thirty minute rest shifts, and I'll not have ya distrubin' them."]="Keep it quiet in there. They only get thirty minute rest shifts, and I'll not have ya distrubin' them."
G["Keep it to yourself."]="Keep it to yourself."
G["Keep it together man!  What about Zangarmarsh?"]="Mantê-o juntos, rosto! E o Zangarmarsh?"
G["Keep it up!"]="Continua assim!"
G["Keep it up! Now water my Red-Leaf Lettuce!"]="Keep it up! Now water my Red-Leaf Lettuce!"
G["Keep it up, $n, and I'll beat some manners into you."]="Keep it up, $n, and I'll beat some manners into you."
G["Keep it up, boys!  We've got work to do!"]="Sigam adiante, pessoal! Temos trabalho que fazer!"
G["Keep it up, they are beginning to rout!"]="Continua assim! Se estão desbandando!"
G["Keep it up, you're doing great!"]="Continua assim, o está fazendo genial!"
G["Keep it up."]="Continua assim."
G["Keep it up. I am working miracles here!"]="Keep it up. I am working miracles here!"
G["Keep it up... they'll never find your body."]="Keep it up... they'll never find your body."
G["Keep killing my pets and you may find a dash of poison in your drink tonight."]="Se continuar matando minhas mascotes, talvez você encontre veneno na sua bebida hoje à noite."
G["Keep looking, Reliquary. We will find it. The bell is meant to ensure Horde victory. I feel it in my bones."]="Sigam procurando, Relicário. A encontraremos. A sino é a importante da vitória da Horda. Sinto muito nos ossos."
G["Keep moving forward. My men will dispose of this sorry bag of bones."]="Keep moving forward. My men will dispose of this sorry bag of bones."
G["Keep moving or you will risk being hit by arcane detonations that will hurl you into the waters below."]="Não deixe de mover ou correrás o risco de que te alcance uma detonação arcana que te fará cair às águas que há baixo."
G["Keep moving! Avoid the Storm-Lord's lightning!"]="Muévete! Esquivas os raios do Senhor da tempestade!"
G["Keep moving! They need you on the field!"]="Continua andando! Te necessário no campo!"
G["Keep moving, men! I want a steady stream of shells for these guns!"]="Keep moving, men! I want a steady stream of shells for these guns!"
G["Keep moving. Your foe is dangerous, but you are smarter."]="Muévete. Seu inimigo é perigoso, mas você é mais inteligente."
G["Keep on 'em, mateys. We've got 'em on the run!"]="Pra cima deles, marujos! Eles tão correndo!"
G["Keep on fightin', $n!"]="Continua lutando, $n!"
G["Keep on fighting, grunts! THE EYES OF HELLSCREAM ARE UPON US!"]="Sigam lutando, brutos! GRITO INFERNAL NOS OBSERVA!"
G["Keep on fighting, lads! DON'T GIVE UP!"]="Keep on fighting, lads! DON'T GIVE UP!"
G["Keep placing spitters in the center lane to hold off the zombies."]="Keep placing spitters in the center lane to hold off the zombies."
G["Keep polishing those cannonballs. I want to see my face in them!"]="Keep polishing those cannonballs. I want to see my face in them!"
G["Keep pressing the fight, $n!"]="Continua lutando, $n!"
G["Keep quiet, will you?  If anyone catches on, we're both dead."]="Keep quiet, will you?  If anyone catches on, we're both dead."
G["Keep regulating the main valve to ensure steady flow."]="Regula a válvula principal para estabilizar o caudal."
G["Keep starin', I don't get any prettier."]="Continue olhando, eu não fico mais bonita."
G["Keep staring.  I enjoy awkward silence."]="Keep staring.  I enjoy awkward silence."
G["Keep striking!"]="Continua atacando!"
G["Keep telling your story, Sully."]="Continua com o seu história, Sully."
G["Keep that crab on his toes, mate. His shell might 'ave hardened with age, but his joints are weak."]="Keep that crab on his toes, mate. His shell might 'ave hardened with age, but his joints are weak."
G["Keep that sword arm straight, $n."]="Mantenhao braço da lâmina recto, $n."
G["Keep the $c alive. $gHe:She; will be our bargaining chip."]="Que $gel: a; $c viva. Será nossa baza para negociar."
G["Keep the bad guys off me!"]="Keep the bad guys off me!"
G["Keep the body strong, and the mind will follow."]="Mantenha seu corpo forte, e a mente também o estará."
G["Keep the chatter down, people. We need to stay alert!"]="Keep the chatter down, people. We need to stay alert!"
G["Keep the conversations curt. I am in no mood for whining or rambling."]="Keep the conversations curt. I am in no mood for whining or rambling."
G["Keep the drinks coming; it's going to be a long night!"]="Não deixe de ir trayendo bebida; vai ser uma noite muito larga!"
G["Keep the mantid back!  We are almost done."]="Keep the mantid back!  We are almost done."
G["Keep the mind open, aware. See opportunities. Exploit them!"]="Keep the mind open, aware. See opportunities. Exploit them!"
G["Keep the spark centered!"]="Keep the spark centered!"
G["Keep the totems alive! Hurry!"]="Mantenhaos totens ativos!"
G["Keep them away from the focus!"]="Keep them away from the focus!"
G["Keep them back!"]="Que não se acerquen!"
G["Keep them back!  They will not delve into our secrets!"]="Keep them back!  They will not delve into our secrets!"
G["Keep them coming!  We need more supplies in order to rebuild..."]="Que sigan chegando! Precisamos mais suprimentos para reconstruir..."
G["Keep them from hitting me and I'll seal the hatch!"]="Keep them from hitting me and I'll seal the hatch!"
G["Keep them occupied, my brothers!  Allow $n to retrieve the scythe!"]="Keep them occupied, my brothers!  Allow $n to retrieve the scythe!"
G["Keep them off me!"]="Aléjalos de mí!"
G["Keep them split from their main force!"]="Keep them split from their main force!"
G["Keep these creatures off of us while we perform our healing."]="Mantenha sob controle a essas criaturas enquanto sanamos."
G["Keep these ruins secure at all costs!"]="Keep these ruins secure at all costs!"
G["Keep these things off me!"]="Aleja essas coisas de mim!"
G["Keep those archers off the wall. Raigonn must reach the gate."]="Keep those archers off the wall. Raigonn must reach the gate."
G["Keep those creatures at bay while I meditate. We'll soon have the answers we seek."]="Ocúpate dessas criaturas enquanto medito. Pronto teremos nossas respostas."
G["Keep those hands where we can see them!"]="Keep those hands where we can see them!"
G["Keep those naga away from the crater!"]="Keep those naga away from the crater!"
G["Keep those pumps working."]="Certifique-se de que as bombas estão funcionando."
G["Keep throwing Maximillian's armor!"]="Continua arrojando partes da armadura de Maximilian!"
G["Keep trying, we need to get this water out of here."]="Continua tentando, temos que tirar a água de aqui."
G["Keep up the good work, $p. With your help, we'll be done in no time!"]="Keep up the good work, $p. With your help, we'll be done in no time!"
G["Keep up the good work."]="Continua assim."
G["Keep up the good work.  Do well and you will be rewarded by the master."]="Continua fazendo um bom trabalho. Faça bem e o mestre você será recompensado."
G["Keep up the good work.  This scourge will be cleansed!"]="Continua trabalhando assim. É preciso limpar esta praga!"
G["Keep up the pace boys!  We need these supplies moved and weapons fixed!"]="Sigam assim, pessoal! É preciso mover esta mercadoria e reparar as armas!"
G["Keep up the pace!"]="Com bom firme!"
G["Keep us well supplied for the greatest production benefit."]="Para que a producção continue ao verdadeiro desafio, mantenha uma reserva de suprimentos."
G["Keep us well supplied, $p. Don't let the effects expire or you'll have to start from scratch!"]="Keep us well supplied, $p. Don't let the effects expire or you'll have to start from scratch!"
G["Keep waiting - there's at least twenty people who got here before you did. Maybe more."]="Keep waiting - there's at least twenty people who got here before you did. Maybe more."
G["Keep waiting. I count at least twenty people who got here before you did. Maybe more."]="Keep waiting. I count at least twenty people who got here before you did. Maybe more."
G["Keep working!  You must be ready to join the front lines!"]="Keep working!  You must be ready to join the front lines!"
G["Keep working! The general won't tolerate failure."]="Keep working! The general won't tolerate failure."
G["Keep working! We'll win on our terms."]="Keep working! We'll win on our terms."
G["Keep ya eyes wide open."]="Mantenhaos olhos bem abieh'tos."
G["Keep ya hands where we can see 'em. Everybody be jumpy. We be in a war here, a war against de Warchief hisself."]="Keep ya hands where we can see 'em. Everybody be jumpy. We be in a war here, a war against de Warchief hisself."
G["Keep yer cool, soldiers. We'll be on the move soon."]="Keep yer cool, soldiers. We'll be on the move soon."
G["Keep yer eyes open fer Dragonmaw."]="Keep yer eyes open fer Dragonmaw."
G["Keep yer eyes open, $n! That road is crawling with Dragonmaw."]="Keep yer eyes open, $n! That road is crawling with Dragonmaw."
G["Keep your brittle bones out of my way, mindless puppets."]="Keep your brittle bones out of my way, mindless puppets."
G["Keep your chin up. Perhaps with time, our people will see you as the ally you are, rather than the enemy you appear to be."]="Não te aflijas. Talvez com o tempo nossa gente te veja como o aliado que é e não como o inimigo que pareces."
G["Keep your claws sharp. You never know when another piece of meat will walk by."]="Keep your claws sharp. You never know when another piece of meat will walk by."
G["Keep your distance from the Alliance, $n. We can't have you getting captured this deep in enemy territory."]="Keep your distance from the Alliance, $n. We can't have you getting captured this deep in enemy territory."
G["Keep your eye on the demons.  We're not concerned with killing Scourge today."]="Keep your eye on the demons.  We're not concerned with killing Scourge today."
G["Keep your eyes keen, adventurer."]="Keep your eyes keen, adventurer."
G["Keep your eyes open and your head in the mission, recruit."]="Keep your eyes open and your head in the mission, recruit."
G["Keep your eyes open on the road."]="Keep your eyes open on the road."
G["Keep your eyes open, $c. Even Durotar is not safe from our enemies."]="Keep your eyes open, $c. Even Durotar is not safe from our enemies."
G["Keep your eyes open, champion. We are all in this together... for now."]="Mantenha os olhos abertos. Estamos todos juntos nisso... por enquanto."
G["Keep your eyes open, friend."]="Keep your eyes open, friend."
G["Keep your eyes peeled for any suspicious activity, soldier. I've spotted a few troublemakers mulling about."]="Keep your eyes peeled for any suspicious activity, soldier. I've spotted a few troublemakers mulling about."
G["Keep your eyes peeled for dwarven pigs."]="Keep your eyes peeled for dwarven pigs."
G["Keep your eyes peeled. They say that freak that was attacking people earlier might still be around."]="Mantenha seus olhos abertos. Eles dizem que aquela aberração que estava atacando as pessoas mais cedo ainda pode estar por aí."
G["Keep your fight away from Ogri'la!"]="Keep your fight away from Ogri'la!"
G["Keep your filthy hide out of our base!"]="Tira seu sujo pelego de nossa base!"
G["Keep your flea ridden paws out of the food, you mangy beasts!"]="Keep your flea ridden paws out of the food, you mangy beasts!"
G["Keep your foes at bay and carve them into cutlets at the same time. The only problem is that the long shaft keeps me from getting blood on my hands."]="Mantenha sob controle aos seus inimigos e faça-os filés. O único problema é que com este cajado tão largo não me mancho de sangue as mãos."
G["Keep your guard up!"]="Keep your guard up!"
G["Keep your hands off me ale, ya unclean pint-hatin' mongels!"]="Keep your hands off me ale, ya unclean pint-hatin' mongels!"
G["Keep your head cool."]="Mantenha o sangue fria."
G["Keep your head low and be on the lookout for frostwyrms! YAAAW!"]="Mantenha a cabeça agachada e tenha cuidado com as vermis de gelo! AAYYYY!"
G["Keep your head low, $g buddy:lady;."]="Não lhames muito a atenção $gcolega: senhora;."
G["Keep your heads down and follow my lead."]="Keep your heads down and follow my lead."
G["Keep your hunger in check, $gbrother:sister;. Always leave some meat behind to rot.\n\nOverly-ravenous saurok will bring doom to us all."]="Sacia seu apetito, $ghermano: irmã;, mas de sempre algo de carne para que se pudra.\n\nOs saurok famélicos nos trarão a fracasso."
G["Keep your machines away from me, $r! You'll be cleansed from this land like the weeds you are!"]="Keep your machines away from me, $r! You'll be cleansed from this land like the weeds you are!"
G["Keep your seatbelts fastened... Just kidding, we don't have seatbelts!"]="Abrochaos os cinturones... É broma! Não temos cinturones!"
G["Keep your sights straight, $n."]="Não deixe de olhar ao linha de frente, $n!"
G["Keep your sword up and your back straight."]="Keep your sword up and your back straight."
G["Keep your voice down, $c!"]="Não alces a voz, $c!"
G["Keep your voice down, $c. I'm in disguise and spying for Venomspite."]="Keep your voice down, $c. I'm in disguise and spying for Venomspite."
G["Keep your voice down, $c. We wouldn't want them to hear us."]="Mantenha a voz baixa, $c. Não queremos que nos oigan."
G["Keep your voice down, Helcular. Strangers abound..."]="Baixa a voz, Helcolar. Há muitos desconocidos..."
G["Keep your voice down, stranger. You do not want to disrupt the Master's meditations."]="Mantenha sua voz baixa, estranho. Você não deseja interromper as meditações do Mestre."
G["Keep your voice down. We wouldn't want to attract any attention from these beasties!"]="Fale baixo. Não gostaríamos de atrair atenção desses animais!"
G["Keep your voice low and your eyes open, $n. We're surrounded by enemies out here."]="Keep your voice low and your eyes open, $n. We're surrounded by enemies out here."
G["Keep your voice low, and your scent downwind."]="Mantenha a voz baixa e o cheiro a favor do vento."
G["Keep your voices down. There are strangers about..."]="Keep your voices down. There are strangers about..."
G["Keep your weak, fleshy eyes open! There are intruders amongst us."]="Keep your weak, fleshy eyes open! There are intruders amongst us."
G["Keep your wits about you, $r, we're surrounded by the walking dead here."]="Mantenha-se alerta, $r, estamos rodeados de mortos andantes."
G["Keep your wits about you. There are demons nearby."]="Mantenha sua inteligência sobre você. Há demônios por perto."
G["Keep your wits, warriors! There are naga yet to kill!"]="Keep your wits, warriors! There are naga yet to kill!"
G["Keep. OUT!"]="Saída"
G["Keep... fighting!"]="Sigam... lutando!"
G["Keeper Heartwise, cease your resistance."]="Vigilante Coração Sábio, não opongas resistência."
G["Keeper Taldros, I am sending Sira and the others with you to help you take the tower. Elune be with you."]="Vigilante Taldros, vou enviar a Sira e aos mais com você para que te ajuden a pegar a torre. Que Eluna estiver com vocês."
G["Keeper! The sands of time have run out for you."]="Vigilante do tempo! Tem caído o último granito de arena para você."
G["Keeping the bomb warm, obviously. What does it look like I'm doing?!"]="Está claro que mantengo quente a bomba. Que parece que estou fazendo?!"
G["Keeping the fusion core stable is taxing nearly all my computational powers.\n\nLet us hope that floating-point error got worked out during my last maintenance cycle."]="Keeping the fusion core stable is taxing nearly all my computational powers.\n\nLet us hope that floating-point error got worked out during my last maintenance cycle."
G["Keeping your ram in a canter or gallop for too long will exhaust him. If you want your ram to recover a bit, let him walk or trot. If there are apple bushels around, take him there to recover."]="Keeping your ram in a canter or gallop for too long will exhaust him. If you want your ram to recover a bit, let him walk or trot. If there are apple bushels around, take him there to recover."
G["Keeshan's a good man, $n. Any of us would give our lives for him."]="Keeshan é um bom homem, $n. Qualquer de nós daria sua vida por ele."
G["Keeshan's alive? I thought he died."]="Keeshan, vivo? Pensei que havia morto."
G["Keever is most pleased."]="Keever is most pleased."
G["Keever is unhappy with this. Perhaps if Keever were to try a larger dose, that may fix this dilemma."]="Keever is unhappy with this. Perhaps if Keever were to try a larger dose, that may fix this dilemma."
G["Kekek take you hunting. You be good bait."]="Kekek leva você à caça. Você é uma boa isca."
G["Kekek thought we go see dragon queen. This just some elf-lady with funny horns."]="Kekek thought we go see dragon queen. This just some elf-lady with funny horns."
G["Kekek took big-tongue hatchling's favorite toy. Maybe it help you get to sleep at night."]="Kekek pegou o brinquedo favorito do filhote de filhote grande. Talvez isso ajude você a dormir à noite."
