G["Kelstrum is a loudmouth and a braggart... and if that weren't enough he's also one of the most skilled warriors ye'll ever meet!  \nI tell ye, if ye're looking to be trained in the ways of a warrior, that's who ye should be talking to.  I'm sure he can be found over in the Hall of Arms east of the Gates of Ironforge."]="Kelstrum is a loudmouth and a braggart... and if that weren't enough he's also one of the most skilled warriors ye'll ever meet!  \nI tell ye, if ye're looking to be trained in the ways of a warrior, that's who ye should be talking to.  I'm sure he can be found over in the Hall of Arms east of the Gates of Ironforge."
