G["King Magni must have sensed some disapointment as he did allow a slight change.  He allowed me a chance to tap the Brewfest Keg.  I remember spending nights trying to figure out how to efficiently and quickly open the keg and distribute its contents such that all participants will receive equal parts quickly and efficiently."]="King Magni must have sensed some disapointment as he did allow a slight change.  He allowed me a chance to tap the Brewfest Keg.  I remember spending nights trying to figure out how to efficiently and quickly open the keg and distribute its contents such that all participants will receive equal parts quickly and efficiently."
G["King Magni's fate is my responsibility and my shame. I should've counseled patience instead of encouraging him! His rush to complete the ritual without understanding it cost him his life and availed us nothing."]="King Magni's fate is my responsibility and my shame. I should've counseled patience instead of encouraging him! His rush to complete the ritual without understanding it cost him his life and availed us nothing."
