G["King Rastakhan tired of Zul and his troubling nightmares. To be rid of the prophet, he granted Zul the use of his largest ships, so that he and his followers could seek a new land if his visions came to pass."]="O Rei Rastakhan se cansou dos pesadelos de Zul, e para se livrar do profeta, ele ofereceu seus maiores navios para que Zul e seus seguidores pudessem buscar uma nova terra no caso de suas visões tornarem-se realidade."
G["King Rastakhan, he be plannin' to unite da troll tribes under his Zandalari."]="King Rastakhan, he be plannin' to unite da troll tribes under his Zandalari."
G["King Stormheart caught wind of the iron dwarves heading this way and brought all the best warriors he could muster on such short notice."]="King Stormheart caught wind of the iron dwarves heading this way and brought all the best warriors he could muster on such short notice."
G["King Stormheart had me stop by to lend you hand - looks like it was good that I did. Good luck to ya."]="King Stormheart had me stop by to lend you hand - looks like it was good that I did. Good luck to ya."
G["King Stormheart has trained us well... turned us into even more fearsome warriors than we could have boasted during the time of our war with the Frost Giants."]="King Stormheart has trained us well... turned us into even more fearsome warriors than we could have boasted during the time of our war with the Frost Giants."
G["King Stormheart is putting you to the test, eh?  He must see something in you to begin with or I doubt he'd put you through such a sacred ritual."]="O rei Cuoretormenta te está deixando a prova, não? Deve haver visto algo em ti ou não te faria passar um ritual tão sagrado."
G["King Stormheart sent me to be tested as a frostborn would.  I am ready for my test, Fjorlin."]="O rei Cuoretormenta me mandado para que se me ponga a prova como se fosse um Natoescarcha. Fjorlin, estou pronto para meu prova."
G["King Terenas Menethil II."]="O rei Terenas Menethil II."
G["King Varian's SI:7 agents have gathered information about a private sanctum of the Lich King's deep within a place called the Halls of Reflection."]="O IV:7 do rei Varian tem recopilado informações sobre o sacrário privado do Rei Lich no profundo de um lugar chamado as Câmaras de Reflexão."
G["King Varian, Lady Jaina. Welcome to the tournament. Your place in the coliseum is waiting."]="Rei Varian, Lady Jaina. Bem-vindos ao torneio. Os espera seu lugar no coliseu."
