G["Kneel! Kneel fools!"]="Kneel! Kneel fools!"
G["Kneel, Alliance!  Kneel before the might of the Forsaken!"]="Arrodílhate, Aliança! Arrodílhate ante a força dos Renegados!"
G["Kneel, Grark."]="Arrodílhate, Grark.,"
G["Kneel, heathen."]="Kneel, heathen."
G["Kneel, worm."]="Kneel, worm."
G["Kneeling down, the Hooded Crusader examines the Flameweaver's corpse, looking for something."]="Kneeling down, the Hooded Crusader examines the Flameweaver's corpse, looking for something."
G["Knew this was... the only way out."]="O sabia, sabia que... era a única saída."
G["Knights of the Ebon Blade, prepare for battle!"]="Cavaleiros da Lâmina de Ébano, preparaos para a batalha!"
G["Knock 'em out of the sky! Don't let them get in range of you, soldier!"]="Knock 'em out of the sky! Don't let them get in range of you, soldier!"
G["Knock Master Tsang's Assistants down with Crackling Jade Lightning."]="Derruba aos ajudantes do mestre Tsang com Relâmpago crepitante de jade."
G["Knock it off of their lump of lead!"]="Knock it off of their lump of lead!"
G["Knock, knock!"]="Toc toc!"
G["Knotroot!"]="Nudorraíz!"
G["Know dat your plans please us, Darkspears. De son of Sen'jin walks de right path."]="Know dat your plans please us, Darkspears. De son of Sen'jin walks de right path."
G["Know my hunger!"]="Know my hunger!"
G["Know that what you did will save hundreds, maybe thousands of lives. You are also a true hero of the Horde, $n."]="O que vocês têm feito salvará centenas, talvez milhares de vidas. Você também é um verdadeiro herói da Horda, $n."
G["Know that wherever you might find them in the world, they are protecting something of importance, as they were entrusted to do so long ago."]="Know that wherever you might find them in the world, they are protecting something of importance, as they were entrusted to do so long ago."
G["Know that your world will soon follow."]="Know that your world will soon follow."
G["Know the only thing worse than a pirate? Hozen pirates! They raid our shores and steal our fish, our boats, and our brew. No one steals our brew... no one."]="Know the only thing worse than a pirate? Hozen pirates! They raid our shores and steal our fish, our boats, and our brew. No one steals our brew... no one."
G["Know this, $r. Within Shaffar's chambers at the end of these tombs rests a creature of unimaginable power. It is held in check by the power of the stasis chamber. You must return to Ameer before you venture further if you wish to destroy it!"]="Know this, $r. Within Shaffar's chambers at the end of these tombs rests a creature of unimaginable power. It is held in check by the power of the stasis chamber. You must return to Ameer before you venture further if you wish to destroy it!"
G["Know this, friend: you have my deepest thanks. Your courage, your strength... you...\n\nYou remind me of him."]="Know this, friend: you have my deepest thanks. Your courage, your strength... you...\n\nYou remind me of him."
G["Know this: I won't stand idle if the Horde interests conflict with those of my people. I may reconsider old Alliances."]="Saiba que eu não ficarei parado se os interesses da Horda entrarem em conflito com os do meu povo. Eu talvez reconsidere... antigas Alianças."
G["Know what a yak is?"]="Sabe o que é um yak?"
G["Know what we don't like? Puppy-things! Like that one right there! See? We no like it."]="Know what we don't like? Puppy-things! Like that one right there! See? We no like it."
G["Know what? I don't even want 'em. I like being able to float around freely."]="Sabe que? Não os quero. Me gosta isto de flotar a meu ar."
G["Know what? If Kekek closes his eyes, you can't see him."]="Sabe o que? Se Kekek agora os olhos, você não pode vê-o."
G["Know your master, you worthless mutts!"]="Know your master, you worthless mutts!"
G["Know your place!"]="Aprenda qual é seu lugar!"
G["Know... my... pain."]="Sente... meu... dor."
G["Knowing a little magic comes in handy in this line of work.  Illusions can't always fool everyone, but they're usually good enough to get the job done."]="Saber um pouco de mágica é útil nessa linha de trabalho. As ilusões nem sempre enganam a todos, mas geralmente são boas o suficiente para fazer o trabalho."
G["Knowing there isn't enough time, the %s doesn't even try to run."]="Knowing there isn't enough time, the %s doesn't even try to run."
G["Knowledge is power - TRUE power, my young friend.  You'll be wise to acquire as much of it as you can, and pay proper heed to those who have already done so.\n\nBefore the razing of the Sunwell, we fooled ourselves into thinking we had neared the apex of our civilization.  It took the Scourge to bring us to our knees... and in a way, back to reality."]="Knowledge is power - TRUE power, my young friend.  You'll be wise to acquire as much of it as you can, and pay proper heed to those who have already done so.\n\nBefore the razing of the Sunwell, we fooled ourselves into thinking we had neared the apex of our civilization.  It took the Scourge to bring us to our knees... and in a way, back to reality."
G["Knowledge of a demon's true name is rumored to give a certain amount of power over that demon.\n\nThe Book of Fel names is said to contain the true name of every demon ever to have existed.  By memorizing the passages in the book, Varedis had found a source of power to rival Illidan's own drinking from the Skull of Gul'dan.\n\nAt Illidan's request, Varedis now runs the training grounds at the Ruins of Karabor - along with the three masters that mentored Varedis."]="Knowledge of a demon's true name is rumored to give a certain amount of power over that demon.\n\nThe Book of Fel names is said to contain the true name of every demon ever to have existed.  By memorizing the passages in the book, Varedis had found a source of power to rival Illidan's own drinking from the Skull of Gul'dan.\n\nAt Illidan's request, Varedis now runs the training grounds at the Ruins of Karabor - along with the three masters that mentored Varedis."
G["Known throughout the lands, Antonio Perelli's goods now for sale near Sentinel Hill! I must move on soon, so make haste."]="Known throughout the lands, Antonio Perelli's goods now for sale near Sentinel Hill! I must move on soon, so make haste."
G["Knucklethump gonna jib the wikkets!"]="Knucklethump gonna jib the wikkets!"
G["Knucklethumps gonna rule the Kun-Lai!"]="Knucklethumps gonna rule the Kun-Lai!"
G["Knucklethumps thump! Thump! Thump!"]="Machakadedos machakan! Machakan, machakan!"
G["Kobai leads the yaungol attacking us... but I do not think he is the source of our problems."]="Kobai dirige aos yaungol que nos estão atacando... mas não acho que ele sejao origem de nossos problemas."
G["Kobai used to threaten us, that was all. Now... whatever mind he had, he's clearly lost."]="Kobai used to threaten us, that was all. Now... whatever mind he had, he's clearly lost."
G["Kodo beasts, my friend!  Trained from a young age and raised on the Golden Plains of Mulgore, these fine animals will make even finer steeds!  Please, browse my selection, and see for yourself why we taurens have come to rely on these magnificant creatures!"]="Animais Kodo, meu amigo! Treinados desde tenra idade crieis nas Planícies Douradas de Mulgore, esses belos animais farão corcéis ainda mais finos! Por favor, navegue na minha seleção e veja por si mesmo por que nós taurens passamos a confiar nessas criaturas magníficas!"
G["Kodohide Leatherworkers is what you want.  Find it in the middle of The Drag."]="Kodohide Leatherworkers é o que você deseja. Encontre-o no meio de The Drag."
G["Kolkar clan! Attack!!"]="Clã Kolkar! Ao ataque!!"
G["Kologarn casts Stone Grip!"]="Kologarn lançao feitiço Agarre pétreo!"
G["Kologarn focuses his eyes on you!"]="Kologarn seleciona seus olhos em ti!"
G["Koltira Deathweaver."]="Koltira Tejemuerte."
G["Koltira!  I had heard rumors that you were here in Lordaeron."]="Koltira!  I had heard rumors that you were here in Lordaeron."
G["Koltira!  Your queen summons you!"]="Koltira! Seu Rainha te convocação!"
G["Koltira, let's get out of here!"]="Koltira, vamos de aqui!"
G["Koltira... this might sound strange, but I keep seeing some kid's ghost.  Matthias Lehner... does the name mean anything to you?"]="Koltira... isso pode parecer estranho, mas eu continuo vendo o fantasma de uma criança. Matthias Lehner... o nome significa algo para você?"
G["Komak! I swear I'll have the money! Just give me some more time!"]="Komak! I swear I'll have the money! Just give me some more time!"
G["Komin Winterhoof at Holistic Herbalism is the one you want to talk to then.  He can be found on the middle rise."]="Komin Winterhoof, no Holistic Herbalism, é com quem você deseja conversar. Ele pode ser encontrado no meio do caminho."
G["Konu! Behind us! A night elf."]="Konu! Trás de nós! Um elfo da noite!"
G["Kor'dok resurrects a fallen ally to aid him in battle!"]="Kor'dok ressuscita a um aliado caído para que lhe ajude em combate!"
G["Kor'dok winds up a powerful shield slam."]="Kor'dok lança um bom acerto de escudo."
G["Kor'ik was just the first to betray us. No one can be trusted."]="Kor'ik was just the first to betray us. No one can be trusted."
G["Kor'ik! How long have you worked for the empress?!"]="Kor’ik! Quanto tempo veste trabalhando para a Imperatriz?"
G["Kor'kron! You are needed at the front!"]="Kor'kron! Precisam de você no front!"
G["Kor'kron, at my side!"]="Kor'kron, at my side!"
G["Kor'kron, move out! Champions, watch your backs. The Scourge have been..."]="Kor'kron, move out! Champions, watch your backs. The Scourge have been..."
G["Kor'kron, prepare Orgrim's Hammer for its final voyage! Champions, our gunship will find a point to dock on the upper reaches of the citadel. Meet us there!"]="Kor'kron, preparad o Martelo de Orgrim para o seu último viagem! Campeões, nossa nave atracará na parte superior da Cidadela. Nos veremos ali!"
G["Kor'kron, prepare transport to the Undercity."]="Kor'kron, preparad transportes para chegar a Cidade Baixa."
G["Kor'kron, stand down!"]="Kor'kron, retiraos!"
G["Kor'kron, take us out!"]="Kor'kron, sácanos de aqui!"
G["Kor'kron? Here? What has Garrosh been up to?"]="Kor'kron? Aqui? Que tem estado fazendo Garrosh?"
G["Kor, why did you do this? Vengeance is not worth dying over."]="Kor, por que o fez? Não merece a pena morrer pela vingança."
G["Korfax, what can you tell from this saronite?"]="Korfax, que pode dizer deste saronita?"
G["Korfax, where can I find Dark Iron scraps?"]="Korfax, onde posso encontrar restos de Ferro Negro?"
G["Korga Strongmane, once prisoner of the Alliance, now free and woefully unarmed tauren. Good to meet you, pandaren."]="Korga Strongmane, once prisoner of the Alliance, now free and woefully unarmed tauren. Good to meet you, pandaren."
G["Korrak has come, weaklings! Snowfall belongs to Winterax!"]="Korrak tem vindo, bastardos! Avalancha pertence ao Machado Invernal!"
G["Korrak has come, weaklings! Snowfall belongs to Winterax! Erm, Korrak mean to say amphitheater belong to Winterax!"]="Korrak chegou, debiluchos! Avalancha pertence a Machado Invernal! Eeh... Korrak quer dizer que anfiteatro pertence a Machado Invernal!"
G["Korven, let's continue."]="Prosigamos, Korven."
G["Kota Kon bigger than me thought she'd be..."]="Kota Kon mais grande ke eu achava..."
G["Kota wikkets gettin' ravaged next!"]="Kota wikkets gettin' ravaged next!"
G["Kovok seems to have weathered the years in hibernation well."]="Kovok seems to have weathered the years in hibernation well."
G["Kovok... come to me... I need..."]="Kovok... come to me... I need..."
G["Krakauer?"]="Krakauer?"
G["Krang Stonehoof stands astride his training circle at the southeast corner of the village."]="Krang Stonehoof está montado no seu círculo de treinamento no canto sudeste da vila."
G["Krasus' Landing"]="Aterragem de Krasus"
G["Krasus' Landing is in easternmost Dalaran.\n\nThe city's flight master is there, as well as the cold weather flying trainer."]="O Alto de Krasus se encontre na parte mais ao este de Dalaran.\n\nO mestre de voo da cidade se encontre ali, ao igual que a instrutora de voo em clima frio."
G["Krathok, I was once a weaponsmith and wish to instead learn the ways of the armorsmith. Will you train me?"]="Krathok, I was once a weaponsmith and wish to instead learn the ways of the armorsmith. Will you train me?"
G["Krathok, I was once a weaponsmith and wish to retake the hammer once more! Teach me the way of the weaponsmith."]="Krathok, há tempo fui ferreiro de armas, e gostaria voltar a pegar o martelo. Ensénhame a forjar armas."
G["Krathok, I was once an armorsmith and wish to instead learn the ways of the weaponsmith. Will you train me?"]="Krathok, I was once an armorsmith and wish to instead learn the ways of the weaponsmith. Will you train me?"
G["Krathok, I was once an armorsmith and wish to retake the hammer once more! Teach me the way of the armorsmith."]="Krathok, há tempo fui ferreiro de armaduras, e gostaria voltar a pegar o martelo. Ensénhame a forjar armaduras."
G["Kravel Koalbeard is stunned. Steal the Alliance's Proposal now!"]="Kravel Karbarbán está atordoado. Aproveita para roubar a proposição da Aliança!"
G["Kraz lives!"]="Kraz vive!"
G["Kraz must meet the slayers of the great troll-beast!"]="Kraz deve conhecer aos assassinos da grande fera troll!"
G["Kraz should never have come to this cursed place... should have known not to trust the human. A blind fool I was, $c, as are you if you follow his counsel.\n\nMy son, lost for two moons, was last seen with the human, Budd. He told me I could find him behind the walls of Zul'Aman....\n\nI followed his people here, and was captured with the rest. Without your help, I was doomed to die.\n\nThank you, stranger."]="Kraz should never have come to this cursed place... should have known not to trust the human. A blind fool I was, $c, as are you if you follow his counsel.\n\nMy son, lost for two moons, was last seen with the human, Budd. He told me I could find him behind the walls of Zul'Aman....\n\nI followed his people here, and was captured with the rest. Without your help, I was doomed to die.\n\nThank you, stranger."
G["Krenna must doubt my abilities. While our elite warriors march out to face the Alliance and their trapper allies, or wreak havoc among the trolls, I've been assigned to mop up those pesky Dragonflayer vrykul.\n\nPerhaps if we combine our efforts, we can both prove ourselves in the conqueror's sight."]="Krenna must doubt my abilities. While our elite warriors march out to face the Alliance and their trapper allies, or wreak havoc among the trolls, I've been assigned to mop up those pesky Dragonflayer vrykul.\n\nPerhaps if we combine our efforts, we can both prove ourselves in the conqueror's sight."
G["Krolg, I need Dartol's Rod!"]="Krolg, preciso de vara de Dartol!"
G["Krolmir... I thank you Jokkum. I hadn't dared hope it still existed. It shall soon see glorious battle once again!"]="Krolmir... I thank you Jokkum. I hadn't dared hope it still existed. It shall soon see glorious battle once again!"
G["Kronk, tell me about the charged crystal foci."]="Kronk, conte-me sobre os focos de cristal carregados."
G["Kros, give me strength..."]="Kros, dê-me força..."
G["Kros, our creator, will not save the weak. The souls of the weak will exist in eternal fear, always fleeing from the teeth and claws of Kros and his followers.\n\nIf you are strong, Kros will allow you to hunt. Your eternity will be spent chasing the weak, eating their flesh, and becoming ever stronger.\n\nBe strong, saurok.\n\nStrength always to the Skumblade. Strength always to you, saurok."]="Kros, our creator, will not save the weak. The souls of the weak will exist in eternal fear, always fleeing from the teeth and claws of Kros and his followers.\n\nIf you are strong, Kros will allow you to hunt. Your eternity will be spent chasing the weak, eating their flesh, and becoming ever stronger.\n\nBe strong, saurok.\n\nStrength always to the Skumblade. Strength always to you, saurok."
G["Kroshik gives us his body, his bones, his strength, and his spirit. We owe our existence to him."]="Kroshik nos entrega seu corpo, seus ossos, sua força e seu espírito. Lhe devemos a existência."
G["Kroshik has a body of meat and bone, but he carries with him the spirit of Kros.\n\nOne day, Kroshik's hunt will end. But Kros's hunt goes on forever."]="Kroshik tem um corpo de carne e osso, mas albergao espírito de Kros no seu interior.\n\nUm dia, a caça de Kroshik terminará. Mas a caça de Kros não tem fim."
G["Kroshik is a gift from our creator, Kros. He reminds us of our strength, of our heritage, of our legacy. He gives us a glimpse at our glorious future."]="Kroshik é um don de nosso criador, Kros. Nos lembre-se seu fortaleza, seu herência, nosso legado. Nos relatório de nosso glorioso futuro."
G["Kroshik is the blood of Kros, our creator. We are Kros' chosen people.\n\nWith his strength behind us, we can never die."]="Kroshik is the blood of Kros, our creator. We are Kros' chosen people.\n\nWith his strength behind us, we can never die."
G["Kroshik!"]="Kroshik!"
G["Kroshius live? Kroshius crush!"]="Kroshius vivo? Kroshius aplastar!"
G["Krumn is the bull you are looking for. He can be found on the lower rise at Thunder Bluff Civic Information."]="Krumn é o touro que você está procurando. Ele pode ser encontrado na parte mais baixa do Thunder Bluff Civic Information."
G["Krypta!"]="Krypta!"
G["Kthh! You will die in the mud like your friend over there..."]="Psss! Morrerá no lama como seu amigo..."
G["Ku into me carver, ye ugly croaker!  Ku and show me who dares cross me brethren!"]="Ku into me carver, ye ugly croaker!  Ku and show me who dares cross me brethren!"
G["Ku ovah yonder, matey!  Dat scurvy bobo be all up inne quashie's face.  Dat hard-eared swab gonnna get salt, mon... gonna get keelhauled and gonna be made into a duppy, mon."]="Ku ovah além, amigo! Esse bobo escorbuto está no rosto de uma quashie. O gonnna de cotonete duro obtém sal, mon... vai ficar quilhado e será transformado em um duppy, mon."
G["Ku'nanji, de Night-Stalker, is who yer lookin' for.\n\nHe be just north of de valley's central building."]="Ku'nanji, de Night-Stalker, is who yer lookin' for.\n\nHe be just north of de valley's central building."
G["Ku-Yao's bedroll is empty. He's not here."]="Ku-Yao's bedroll is empty. He's not here."
G["Kulratha. Things are going well, I see."]="Kulratha. Vejo que as coisas vão bem."
G["Kun-Lai Summit is where you're going to die, orc. I'm going to bury you."]="Kun-Lai Summit is where you're going to die, orc. I'm going to bury you."
G["Kung Din pounced on you! Fight for your life! |TInterface\\Icons\\ability_warrior_secondwind.blp:20|t"]="Kung Din pounced on you! Fight for your life! |TInterface\\Icons\\ability_warrior_secondwind.blp:20|t"
G["Kurdran - no, I couldn't! Sky'ree was a legend, I can't-"]="Kurdran - no, I couldn't! Sky'ree was a legend, I can't-"
G["Kurdran is down!  You've got to get him back into the fight or we're done for!"]="Kurdran tem caído! Precisa conseguir que regrese à batalha ou será nosso fim!"
G["Kuzari and Zanga are trainin' headhunters on one of de small islets towards de southeast end of de valley, mon."]="Kuzari e Zanga estão treinando caçadores de cabeças em uma das pequenas ilhotas em direção ao extremo sudeste do vale, seg."
G["Kvaldir are pouring across the bridge! Battlemaiden, Lady Naz'jar calls for you!"]="Kvaldir are pouring across the bridge! Battlemaiden, Lady Naz'jar calls for you!"
G["Kvaldir never die... this city is ours..."]="Kvaldir never die... this city is ours..."
G["Kwa! You cannot kill me, I am immortal!"]="Kwa! Você não pode me matar, sou imortal!"
G["Kyra Windblade wields her blade with great skill.  She should be able to provide you with some training.  You'll find her at the Inn in Dolanaar."]="Kyra Windblade empunha sua lâmina com grande habilidade. Ela deve ser capaz de lhe fornecer algum treinamento. Você a encontrará na pousada em Dolanaar."
G["Kyra said that you might need some help."]="Kyra disse que talvez necesitarías ajuda."
G["Kzzsst! Paragon! Klaxxi infiltrator!"]="Kzzsst! Paragon! Klaxxi infiltrator!"
G["L'ghorek Dies!"]="L'ghorek morre!"
G["L'ghorek is the name of the Ancient god that sits across the chasm from us. It is being infested by something.\n\nWe must put an end to this or we will certainly all meet our doom!"]="L'ghorek is the name of the Ancient god that sits across the chasm from us. It is being infested by something.\n\nWe must put an end to this or we will certainly all meet our doom!"
G["L'ghorek, can you give me another Attuned Runestone of Binding?"]="L'ghorek, pode me dar outra pedras rúnica armonizada de Vínculo?"
G["LEAVE THIS PLACE!"]="ABANDONA ESTE LUGAR!"
G["LEAVE...THIS PLACE..."]="LEAVE...THIS PLACE..."
G["LEFT!"]="ESQUERDA!"
G["LEG FAILURE LOOP BROKEN. RETURNING TO BASE."]="CICLO DE FALHO na PERNA ESTROPEADO. VUELVO À BASE."
G["LEGION, STEADY YOURSELVES!"]="LEGION, STEADY YOURSELVES!"
G["LET IT BE FINISHED!"]="ACABEMOS COM ISTO!"
G["LET THE LIGHT IN, GODFREY GOODARD!"]="DE QUE ENTRE A LUZ, GODFREY GOODARD!"
G["LET THE STORM'S FURY CONSUME YOU!"]="QUE A FÚRIA da TEMPESTADE TE CONSUMO!"
G["LET'S GO! QUICKLY!"]="VAMOS! RÁPIDO!"
G["LET'S ROCK!"]="VAMOS ALÉM!"
G["LET'S ROCK!!"]="VAMOS ALÉM!"
G["LEVIATHAN!!"]="LEVIATÃ!!"
G["LEZA!!"]="LEZA!!"
G["LIAM!!  NO!!!"]="LIAM!! NÃO!!!"
G["LIES! The pain you are about to endure will be talked about for years to come!"]="LIES! The pain you are about to endure will be talked about for years to come!"
G["LIGHT GRANT ME ONE FINAL BLESSING! GIVE ME THE STRENGTH... TO SHATTER THESE BONDS!"]="LIGHT GRANT ME ONE FINAL BLESSING! GIVE ME THE STRENGTH... TO SHATTER THESE BONDS!"
G["LIGHT PURGE YOU!"]="QUE A LUZ TE PURGUE!"
G["LIGHT TAKE YOU, BEAST!"]="QUE A LUZ TE LEVE, FERA!"
