G["LOCATION UNRECOGNIZED. RETURNING TO LAST KNOWN BASE LOCATION."]="LOCATION UNRECOGNIZED. RETURNING TO LAST KNOWN BASE LOCATION."
G["LOK'TAR OGAR!!"]="LOK'TAR OGAR!!"
G["LOK'TAR! HILLSBRAD IS OURS!"]="LOK'TAR! CAMPOS DE TRABALOMAS É NOSSO!"
G["LOOK AT HIM!"]="MÍRALO!"
