G["LOOK AT ME, I'M RANDOMIZING! HERE IT COMES (IN 5 SECONDS)!"]="LOOK AT ME, I'M RANDOMIZING! HERE IT COMES (IN 5 SECONDS)!"
G["LOREWALKER! You have something of mine."]="EREMITA! Tem algo que me pertence."
G["LORNA? What... Where is she!? What have you done to her!?"]="LORNA? Que...? Onde está?! Que lhe vocês têm feito?!"
G["LOUD NOISES!"]="LOUD NOISES!"
G["LUNCH!"]="A COMIDA!"
G["LYALIA! NOOOOOOOO!"]="LYALIA! NOOOOOOOO!"
G["Lackeys be damned! I'll finish you myself!"]="Lackeys be damned! I'll finish you myself!"
G["Ladies and gentledwarves, we gather here in the shadow of Thunderstrike to honor the union of Fanny Thundermar and Keegan Firebeard."]="Ladies and gentledwarves, we gather here in the shadow of Thunderstrike to honor the union of Fanny Thundermar and Keegan Firebeard."
G["Ladies and gentlemen!  Well... let's just say you don't want to miss this one!"]="Ladies and gentlemen!  Well... let's just say you don't want to miss this one!"
G["Ladies and gentlemen, gather round the Conquest Pit!  Witness the battle of $r versus bear and place your bets with confidence!"]="Ladies and gentlemen, gather round the Conquest Pit!  Witness the battle of $r versus bear and place your bets with confidence!"
G["Ladies and gentlemen, these deliverers of dismemberment have come out VICTORIOUS! Bets on the next round start now! Let's get this money flowin'."]="Ladies and gentlemen, these deliverers of dismemberment have come out VICTORIOUS! Bets on the next round start now! Let's get this money flowin'."
G["Ladies and gentlemen... gather round the pit!"]="Senhoras e senhores... reúnanse ao redor do fosso!"
G["Ladies, ladies... It's going to be alright.  I've already captured the creature's essence in my painting."]="Senhoras, senhoras... Tudo irá bem. Já e capturou a essência da criatura na minha quadro."
G["Ladies, please.  The boar will live on in my art.  Please don't shed another tear, unless it is because my art moves you so."]="Ladies, please.  The boar will live on in my art.  Please don't shed another tear, unless it is because my art moves you so."
G["Ladies, please. I'm desperate. Certainly you can spare something... the smallest reagent, your cheapest wares. Help a soul in need!"]="Ladies, please. I'm desperate. Certainly you can spare something... the smallest reagent, your cheapest wares. Help a soul in need!"
G["Lads and ladies. Today can be your greatest day, for today, you fight for the glory of Stormpike! Ride unto the field and grant your enemies no mercy! Strike the savages down and let their Warchief sort em out!"]="Lads and ladies. Today can be your greatest day, for today, you fight for the glory of Stormpike! Ride unto the field and grant your enemies no mercy! Strike the savages down and let their Warchief sort em out!"
G["Lady Jaina Proudmoore would like to see you as soon as possible."]="A Lady Jaina Corajoso lhe gostaria ver você o antes possível."
G["Lady Jaina told me to speak to you about using a gryphon to survey Alcaz Island."]="Lady Jaina disse para mim para falar com você sobre o uso de um grifo para inspecionar a Ilha de Alcaz."
G["Lady Jaina would not send a messenger with such haste if she did not believe her information reliable."]="Lady Jaina would not send a messenger with such haste if she did not believe her information reliable."
G["Lady Jaina, this may sound like an odd request... but I have a young ward who is quite shy.  You are a hero to him, and he asked me to get your autograph."]="Lady Jaina, isso pode parecer um pedido estranho... mas eu tenho uma ala jovem que é bastante tímida. Você é um herói para ele, e ele me pediu para pegar seu autógrafo."
G["Lady Liadrin is bound to find a way. She must."]="Lady Liadrin deve encontrar uma solução. É imperativo."
G["Lady Liadrin, matriarch of the Blood Knights, has the Knights' headquarters in an enclave in Farstriders' Square. You'll need to speak to Champion Bachi there if you are looking for instruction. Be respectful while there if you value your head."]="Lady Liadrin, matriarca dos Cavaleiros Sangrentos, tem a sede dos Cavaleiros em um enclave na Praça dos Farstriders. Você precisará falar com o campeão Bachi lá se você estiver procurando instruções. Seja respeitoso enquanto estiver lá, se valorizar sua cabeça."
G["Lady Proudmoore - more Zandalari are approaching from the docks."]="Lady Corajoso! Vêm mais Zandalari desdo cais."
G["Lady Proudmoore! Everyone is in position, and the Shado-Pan are inside, but..."]="Lady Corajoso! Estamos todos em posição e o Shadopan está dentro, mas..."
G["Lady Proudmoore's forces have bled to delay Archimonde and his Burning Legion, and now this grim task falls to us. Are you ready to stand with me against the onslaught?"]="As forças de Lady Proudmoore sangraram para atrasar Archimonde e sua Legião Ardente, e agora essa tarefa sombria recai sobre nós. Você está pronto para ficar comigo contra o ataque?"
G["Lady Proudmoore, I am ready to go to Orgrimmar. Please open a portal."]="Lady Proudmoore, I am ready to go to Orgrimmar. Please open a portal."
G["Lady Proudmoore, it is safe for you to enter."]="Lady Corajoso, pode entrar com segurança."
G["Lady Proudmoore, the Warchief speaks the truth. This subterfuge was set in motion by Varimathras and Grand Apothecary Putress. It was not the Horde's doing."]="Lady Proudmoore, the Warchief speaks the truth. This subterfuge was set in motion by Varimathras and Grand Apothecary Putress. It was not the Horde's doing."
G["Lady Shandris is counting on me. I will not fail her."]="Lady Shandris está contando comigo. Eu não vou falhar com ela."
G["Lady Sira'kess has sent for you. You are needed for the ritual."]="Lady Sira'kess has sent for you. You are needed for the ritual."
G["Lady Sylvanas has ordered the investigation of some of the natural phenomena of Azeroth. She feels there is something great to be learned from its secretive past.\n\nI know not how she learned such things, but I trust her completely, so I will do my best.\n\nI am currently investigating slimes, oozes and such. The creatures all seem to be similar in make up, but greatly affected by their environment.\n\nI could use your help in gathering samples of the creatures.."]="Lady Sylvanas has ordered the investigation of some of the natural phenomena of Azeroth. She feels there is something great to be learned from its secretive past.\n\nI know not how she learned such things, but I trust her completely, so I will do my best.\n\nI am currently investigating slimes, oozes and such. The creatures all seem to be similar in make up, but greatly affected by their environment.\n\nI could use your help in gathering samples of the creatures.."
G["Lady Vashj expects our work to be done soon."]="Lady Vashj espera que terminemos pronto nosso trabalho."
G["Lady Vashj is nothing like her mother. It is little wonder she left this city so long ago."]="Lady Vashj não se parece nada ao seu mãe. Não me surpreende que se marchara da cidade há tanto tempo."
G["Lady Vashj must answer for these atrocities. She must be brought to justice!"]="Lady Vashj must answer for these atrocities. She must be brought to justice!"
G["Lady Vashj will not be pleasssed to hear of thisss..."]="A Lady Vashj não lhe alegrará ouvir esssto..."
G["Lady Windrunner herself sent me to serve as the Horde liaison to Zaela and the Dragonmaw clan. She and the new Warchief, Garrosh, are attempting to mend their broken fences, it would seem.\n\nIn any case, we must put an end to the Twilight threat once and for all. Most importantly, though, we must keep Cho'gall from creating his ultimate weapon."]="Lady Windrunner herself sent me to serve as the Horde liaison to Zaela and the Dragonmaw clan. She and the new Warchief, Garrosh, are attempting to mend their broken fences, it would seem.\n\nIn any case, we must put an end to the Twilight threat once and for all. Most importantly, though, we must keep Cho'gall from creating his ultimate weapon."
G["Lady luck is on my side tonight!"]="A sorte está de meu lado esta noite!"
G["Lady stitch us up and bandage when we get hit.  You find her in inner ring of Rogues' Quarter."]="Senhora costure-nos e ataduras quando formos atingidos. Você a encontra no anel interno do Bairro dos Rogues."
G["Lady teach you make magic items.  She at inner ring of The Apothecarium."]="Lady ensina você a fazer itens mágicas. Ela no anel interno do Apothecarium."
G["Lady, you need to lower your voice."]="Senhora, precisa descer a voz."
G["Lady."]="Meu senhora."
G["Lafoo digs up some bugs from the dirt."]="Lafoo desentierra algum insetos de entre a sujeira."
G["Lafoo is Soo-says little pet. Probably the most incomptent gorloc I've ever met... and that's saying something."]="Lafoo is Soo-says little pet. Probably the most incomptent gorloc I've ever met... and that's saying something."
G["Lakota'mani thunders within you, $n."]="Lakota'mani retumba no seu interior, $n."
G["Lambs for the slaughter!"]="Cordeiros para a carnificina!"
G["Lambs to the slaughter..."]="Como cordeiros no matadouro"
G["Lambs! Lemmings! All of them!"]="Cordeiros! Lemmings! Todos eles!"
G["Lance in the pants!"]="Lança nos calças!"
G["Lance with the devil in the pale Twilight!"]="Lance with the devil in the pale Twilight!"
G["Lancer? I hardly knew her!"]="Lancer? I hardly knew her!"
G["Land ho!"]="Terra à vista!"
G["Land ho, Mr. Kowalski! Port is in sight, sir!"]="Terra à visão, Sr. Kowalski! Porto à visão, senhor!"
G["Land-dwelling scum!"]="Escória da terra!"
