G["Landro's Lichling"]="Exanimato de Landro"
G["Landro's Lil' XT"]="Mini XT de Landro"
G["Landro's Pet Box"]="Landro's Pet Box"
G["Lanfen can be found meditating over the lake in the Temple Gardens. I hear she makes quite marvelous teas."]="Encontrar a Lanfen meditando ao lado ao lago nos Jardins do Templo. Dizem que há um chá maravilhoso."
G["Langrom's Leather & Links in southern Dalaran should have what you seek."]="A Leather & Links da Langrom, no sul de Dalaran, deve ter o que você procura."
G["Languish in damnation!"]="Púdrete no seu condena!"
G["Lao-Chin! We have won the day. Why are you weeping?"]="Lao-Chin! We have won the day. Why are you weeping?"
G["Lao-Chin's Healing Spheres heal him as they fade away!"]="Lao-Chin's Healing Spheres heal him as they fade away!"
G["Lapdogs, all of you!"]="Lapdogs, all of you!"
G["Lard keep peace here. Lard also sell fish. Want fish?"]="Banha mantenha a paz aqui. A banha também vende peixe. Quer peixe?"
G["Larion, I want to help you fight these pests!"]="Larion, quero ajudá-o a combater essas pragas!"
G["Lash him to the tree!"]="Lash him to the tree!"
G["Lass, I've a confession to make to ya."]="Lass, I've a confession to make to ya."
G["Last I checked, your title was overseer, not overeater."]="Last I checked, your title was overseer, not overeater."
G["Last I heard from Hauthaa, she indicated that we are $3228w percent of the way there.\n\nI cannot express how vital it is to our efforts that we get them created. Our men and women are going to need better armor and weapons, and the anvil and forge are the key to that.\n\nYou will find the smith behind the Sun's Reach Armory, $n."]="Last I heard from Hauthaa, she indicated that we are $3228w percent of the way there.\n\nI cannot express how vital it is to our efforts that we get them created. Our men and women are going to need better armor and weapons, and the anvil and forge are the key to that.\n\nYou will find the smith behind the Sun's Reach Armory, $n."
G["Last I heard the Horde had accumulated $2021w of $2020w peacebloom, $2050w of $2051w firebloom and $2054w out of $2055w purple lotuses."]="A última vez que ouvi dizer que a Horda havia acumulado $2021w milhões em $2020w milhões em paz, $2050w milhões em $2051w milhões e $2054w milhões em $2055w bilhões em lótus roxos."
G["Last I heard, Elder Runetotem was traveling to Razor Hill in Durotar."]="A última vez que ouvi dizer que o Élder Runetotem estava viajando para Razor Hill, em Durotar."
G["Last I heard, Elder Sardis was venturing to Valiance Keep."]="A última vez que ouvi dizer que o Élder Sardis estava se aventurando na Valiance Keep."
G["Last I knew, Elder Nurgen was in Azjol-Nerub."]="A última vez que soube, o Élder Nurgen estava em Azjol-Nerub."
G["Last I knew, Elder Starsong was in the Sunken Temple of the Swamp of Sorrows."]="A última vez que soube, o Élder Starsong estava no Templo Afundado do Pântano das Dores."
G["Last I knew, Elder Stonespire was at Everlook in Winterspring."]="A última vez que soube, o Élder Stonespire estava em Everlook, em Winterspring."
G["Last call, you fork-tongued dip-slithers!"]="Last call, you fork-tongued dip-slithers!"
G["Last mont, me won da dead orc sound champi... champichi... me won da dead orc sound contest."]="Last mont, me won da dead orc sound champi... champichi... me won da dead orc sound contest."
G["Last night, Master Snowdrift was giving some lessons at the Shado-Pan monastery in Kun-Lai Summit. He was teaching his students how to cast fists of frost. \n \n The good news is, the students did great. The bad news is, hundreds of icy fist balls were cast into the water. This froze the Tiger Gourami living in the surrounding lake!\n \n If you're looking to catch some Tiger Gourami today, that's probably your best bet."]="Last night, Master Snowdrift was giving some lessons at the Shado-Pan monastery in Kun-Lai Summit. He was teaching his students how to cast fists of frost. \n \n The good news is, the students did great. The bad news is, hundreds of icy fist balls were cast into the water. This froze the Tiger Gourami living in the surrounding lake!\n \n If you're looking to catch some Tiger Gourami today, that's probably your best bet."
G["Last push boys!  Let 'em have it!"]="O último esforço, pessoal! A por eles!"
G["Last straw..."]="A gota que colmao vaso..."
G["Last time I went into a brawl my opponent ran away crying.  Not surprising that they fled, but it was the first time I've seen a crocolisk shed tears."]="Last time I went into a brawl my opponent ran away crying.  Not surprising that they fled, but it was the first time I've seen a crocolisk shed tears."
G["Last time puppy-men attacked, Soo-holu chased them all the way back to their camp thing! It was glorious!"]="Last time puppy-men attacked, Soo-holu chased them all the way back to their camp thing! It was glorious!"
G["Last time someone went out to try to collect the bounty on Netherock, all we got back was a compressed layer of foolhardy adventurer!"]="Last time someone went out to try to collect the bounty on Netherock, all we got back was a compressed layer of foolhardy adventurer!"
G["Last time they attacked, there was only one attack. I wouldn't be surprised if there were more this time."]="A última vez que atacaram, somente o fizeram uma vez. Não me sorprendería que agora tivesse mais ataque."
G["Last time we met, you had the advantage of fighting on holy ground.  You'll find that our situation has been... reversed."]="Last time we met, you had the advantage of fighting on holy ground.  You'll find that our situation has been... reversed."
G["Last time we met, you were headin' to Binan Village to see your pandaren friend."]="A última vez, você ia à Aldeia Binan a ver ao seu kolega pandaren."
G["Last week I was in Goldshire. Have you been there?"]="Last week I was in Goldshire. Have you been there?"
G["Last, but certainly not least, we have the pyroblast. This is for when you absolutely, positively want to make a lasting first impression."]="Last, but certainly not least, we have the pyroblast. This is for when you absolutely, positively want to make a lasting first impression."
G["Later."]="Mais tarde"
G["Launch me!"]="Lánzame!"
G["Launch me! |cFF0008E8(Darkmoon Game Token)|r"]="Lánzame! |cFF0008E8(Ficha de jogo da Lua Negra)|r"
G["Launching."]="Launching."
G["Laurena is the High Priestess of Stormwind. You can find her in the Catheral of Light in Cathedral Square."]="Laurena é a Alta Sacerdotisa de Ventobravo. Você pode encontrá-a no Catheral of Light na Cathedral Square."
G["Laurna Morninglight offers healing to those that live around Dolanaar.  Perhaps she would be able to teach you in the ways of a priest."]="Laurna Morninglight oferece cura para aqueles que vivem em torno de Dolanaar. Talvez ela possa ensiná-o da maneira de um para."
G["Lava? Pay no mind to all of that, friend. Look around you. Take in the joys that nature has to offer."]="Lava? Não se preocupe com tudo isso, amigo. Olhe à sua volta. Admire as alegrias que a natureza tem a oferecer."
G["Lavinia Crowe's the local enchanter. She's set up shop on the inner ring of the Apothecarium."]="Lavinia Crowe é a encantadora local. Ela se estabeleceu no anel interno do Apothecarium."
G["Lay down and die."]="Túmbate e morre."
G["Lay down your arms and succumb to the might of Kil'jaeden!"]="Lay down your arms and succumb to the might of Kil'jaeden!"
G["Lay down your arms and surrender your souls!"]="Lay down your arms and surrender your souls!"
G["Lay down your arms and surrender!"]="Lay down your arms and surrender!"
G["Lay down your weapons, your feuds have no place here!"]="Lay down your weapons, your feuds have no place here!"
G["Lay waste to the demons on the Dead Scar lately, $n?"]="Lay waste to the demons on the Dead Scar lately, $n?"
G["Lay your duties aside and rest."]="Do seu dever a um lado e descansar."
G["Lay your hand on the stone."]="Lay your hand on the stone."
G["Laz Madwire calls in Crazy Sappers!"]="Laz Madwire calls in Crazy Sappers!"
G["Lazy mutts!"]="Vagos inútiles!"
G["Lead him inta dis trap!"]="Lead him inta dis trap!"
G["Lead on, friend. It's time to set up your defenses!"]="Mostrao caminho, colega. É hora de levantar as defesas!"
G["Lead our people to their new home."]="Guia a nosso povo ao seu novo lar."
G["Lead the Twilight Recruit away from the group and use the Blackjack to knock him out."]="Lead the Twilight Recruit away from the group and use the Blackjack to knock him out."
G["Lead the way, Dark Lady. We will follow."]="Lead the way, Dark Lady. We will follow."
G["Lead the way, Prince Arthas."]="Lidere o caminho, príncipe Arthas."
G["Lead the way, Sanders!"]="Você linha de frente, Sanders!"
G["Lead the way."]="Lead the way."
G["Lead us onward, $c."]="Te seguimos, $c."
G["Leading under the influence..."]="Ao envio e borracho..."
