G["Leap!"]="Saltar"
G["Leaping Leper Gnomes! You're a sight for sore eyes. I was worried the giant magma worm out front would deter visitors. Now that you're here you can give me a hand."]="Pulando Gnomos de Leprosos! Você é uma visão para os olhos doloridos. Eu estava preocupado que o me ver gigantesco de magma na linha de frente dissuadisse os visitantes. Agora que você está aqui, pode me ajudar."
G["Leaping leper gnomes! I've been stuck in there for months. Thanks, gang."]="Gnomos leprosos saltarines! tenho estado aí metido durante meses. Obrigado, pessoal."
G["Learn from the masters. I have nothing to teach you, for I am but a student."]="Aprenda dos mestres. Eu não tenho nada que ensinar, pois um aluno sou nada mais."
G["Learn from this, stranger!"]="Aprenda esta lecção!"
G["Learn from your mistakes!"]="Aprenda dos seus erros!"
G["Learn how to drive you maniac!"]="Learn how to drive you maniac!"
G["Learn the recipe."]="Apréndete a receita."
G["Learn this spell well for it will burn the taint from all those who oppose us."]="Learn this spell well for it will burn the taint from all those who oppose us."
G["Learn well from your experience here, $p. In the future, your efficient efforts may be well rewarded."]="Aprenda muito do seu experiência neste lugar, $p. É possível que no futuro seu esforço e seu eficiência se vean recompensados."
G["Learn your place, mortal!"]="Aprenda a saber estar, mortal!"
G["Learn your place."]="Aprenda qual é seu lugar."
G["Learning"]="Aprendendo"
G["Learning about new plant species is extremely important for our expedition.  Not just the medicinal or edible ones either.\n\nPlants provide the foundation for many other forms of life to exist.  Understanding them allows us to better understand nature as a whole."]="Learning about new plant species is extremely important for our expedition.  Not just the medicinal or edible ones either.\n\nPlants provide the foundation for many other forms of life to exist.  Understanding them allows us to better understand nature as a whole."
G["Learning to read is a thirsty business. A toast, eh?"]="Learning to read is a thirsty business. A toast, eh?"
G["Leashes... with pre-attached pets."]="Leashes... with pre-attached pets."
G["Leather Armor"]="Armadura de couro"
G["Leather skins? Yes, I just received some information on that. It would appear that of $2067w heavy leather needed, the Horde has collected $2066w. Also, $2070w out of $2071w thick leather and $2073w out of $2074w rugged leather have been gathered."]="Peles de couro? Sim, acabei de receber algumas informações sobre isso. Parece que, de $2067w em couro pesado necessário, a Horda arrecadou $2066w. Além disso, $2070w em couro grosso de $2071w e $2073w em couro resistente de $2074w foram coletados."
G["Leatherworking"]="Leatherworking (Couraria)"
G["Leatherworking & Skinning Supplies"]="Suprimentos de couro e desuelho"
G["Leatherworking allows you to fashion armor, cloaks, armor-reinforcing kits, and other similar items from leather, hides, and scales. Other materials required for leatherworking can be purchased at trade and Leatherworking vendors.\nLeatherworking pairs well with Skinning as it allows you to gather your own raw materials; other necessary items, such as threads and dyes, can be purchased from trade or Leatherworking vendors.\nHighly skilled leatherworkers can also enforce their bracers and leg armor."]="Leatherworking allows you to fashion armor, cloaks, armor-reinforcing kits, and other similar items from leather, hides, and scales. Other materials required for leatherworking can be purchased at trade and Leatherworking vendors.\nLeatherworking pairs well with Skinning as it allows you to gather your own raw materials; other necessary items, such as threads and dyes, can be purchased from trade or Leatherworking vendors.\nHighly skilled leatherworkers can also enforce their bracers and leg armor."
G["Leatherworking and skins? You must be looking for a tanner. There's on in the crafter's hall, if I recall.\n\nI will mark the location on your map."]="Leatherworking and skins? You must be looking for a tanner. There's on in the crafter's hall, if I recall.\n\nI will mark the location on your map."
G["Leatherworking and skins? You must be looking for a tanner. There's one in the chamber of masters, if I recall.\n\nI will mark the location on your map."]="Leatherworking and skins? You must be looking for a tanner. There's one in the chamber of masters, if I recall.\n\nI will mark the location on your map."
G["Leave ... this ... place ..."]="Leave ... this ... place ..."
G["Leave Azeroth be!"]="De em paz a Azeroth!"
G["Leave Balboa alone you shiny gnats!"]="Deixem em paz a Balboa, mequetrefes relucientes!"
G["Leave Dalaran? Where will I even go..."]="Leave Dalaran? Where will I even go..."
G["Leave Ongo'longo ALONE!"]="De em paz a Ongo'longo!"
G["Leave Smuggler's Scar to signal Adarrah"]="Abandona a Cicatriz do Contrabandista para fazer sinais a Adarrah."
G["Leave at once, stranger!  I have no business with you."]="Saia de uma vez, estranho! Eu não tenho negócios com você."
G["Leave behind your homes, your possessions, and your cares, and join us!"]="Leave behind your homes, your possessions, and your cares, and join us!"
G["Leave him chained there. I will deal with him in good time. As for the others... see to it that they do not escape!"]="Leave him chained there. I will deal with him in good time. As for the others... see to it that they do not escape!"
G["Leave it be, Arthas. Forget this business and lead your men home."]="Leave it be, Arthas. Forget this business and lead your men home."
G["Leave it to the dwarves to send a mining specialist from Ironforge to tell us how to mine.  How hard is it to take a pick and chip away at some rock?  Well, since he's here, he's probably the one you should see anyhow.  His name is Gelman and he resides over in the Dwarven District."]="Deixe que os anões enviem um especiapronta em mineração da Ironforge para nos dizer como minerar. Quão difícil é escolher um pedaço e lascar alguma pedras? Bem, desde que ele está aqui, ele provavelmente é o que você deveria ver de qualquer maneira. O nome dele é Gelman e ele reside no distrito de Dwarven."
G["Leave me alone!!"]="Leave me alone!!"
G["Leave me alone."]="Deixe-me em paz."
G["Leave me and sword alone!  No retakes allowed!"]="Leave me and sword alone!  No retakes allowed!"
G["Leave me be, fool!"]="Deixe-me ser, tolo!"
G["Leave me be."]="Deixe-me ser."
G["Leave me now in peace. I must rest."]="Agora deixe-me em paz. Tenho que descansar."
G["Leave me to my shame, $r."]="Deixe-me com meu vergonha, $r."
G["Leave me, $c. I must attend to my duties with Ambassador Sunsorrow, dull as they are."]="Leave me, $c. I must attend to my duties with Ambassador Sunsorrow, dull as they are."
G["Leave me."]="Déjame."
G["Leave me.  My wounds are great and I fear they will overtake me.  Thank you, $n.  I will die here, but because of you... I'll die in peace."]="Leave me.  My wounds are great and I fear they will overtake me.  Thank you, $n.  I will die here, but because of you... I'll die in peace."
G["Leave me. I have much to think about."]="Deixe-me, tenho muito no que pensar."
G["Leave me...to die...alone...please..."]="Leave me...to die...alone...please..."
G["Leave no stone unturned in our search!"]="Não deixem pedras por mover!"
G["Leave no stone unturned. I mean that literally, you heaps of decay! Tear this place apart if you have to."]="Leave no stone unturned. I mean that literally, you heaps of decay! Tear this place apart if you have to."
G["Leave no survivors in your wake, brothers and sisters!"]="Não deixem sobreviventes ao seu passo, irmãos e irmãs!"
G["Leave no survivors!"]="Não deixem sobreviventes!"
G["Leave no survivors! Let Arthas sort 'em out..."]="Não deixem sobreviventes! Deixem que Arthas os arregle..."
G["Leave no trace of them, Amythel. Destroy them!"]="Não deixe vestígios deles, Amythel. Destrua-os!"
G["Leave no witnesses!"]="Leave no witnesses!"
G["Leave none alive!"]="Não deixem a ninguém com vida!"
G["Leave none alive, save Malfurion. He is mine."]="Que não que ninguém vivo, salvou Malfurion. É meu."
G["Leave nothin' behind!"]="Não deixem títere com cabeça!"
G["Leave nothing behind!"]="Não te esqueça de nada!"
G["Leave nothing but ashes in your wake, brothers! Burn Sentinel Hill to the ground!"]="Não deixem mais que cinzas ao seu passo, irmãos! Que a Colina do Sentinela arda até os cimentos!"
G["Leave nothing but smoldering husks."]="Não deixem mais que restos carbonizados."
G["Leave nothing for their clerics to resurrect!"]="Não deixe nada que possam ressuscitar seus clérigos!"
G["Leave now, pathetic alchemist. I anxiously await your next failure."]="Leave now, pathetic alchemist. I anxiously await your next failure."
G["Leave now... you do not deserve to suffer the crystal's wrath..."]="Agora vá embora... Não merece sofrer a raiva do cristal..."
G["Leave off. I don't have anything for the likes of you."]="Pare. Não tenho nada para você."
G["Leave or I'll be forced to pound yer face in!"]="Leave or I'll be forced to pound yer face in!"
G["Leave our lands!"]="Leave our lands!"
G["Leave that behind, it's not worth it!"]="Déjalo! Não merece a pena!"
G["Leave that to me."]="Deixe-me isso a mim."
G["Leave the bodies here, that they may see the futility of fighting the Dragonmaw."]="dos corpos, para que vean a futilidade de lutar contra os Faucedraco."
G["Leave the fire alone, pesky trolls! Just give up and die."]="Leave the fire alone, pesky trolls! Just give up and die."
G["Leave these forests!"]="Abandonao florestas!"
G["Leave this accursed place at once!"]="Abandona imediatamente este lugar maldito!"
G["Leave this old Dragonmaw to his drink, $c.\n\nI've fought creatures that would curl your spine and I've seen my people all but slaughtered in the swamps of the wetlands and amidst the ruins of Outland.\n\nGet. Lost."]="Leave this old Dragonmaw to his drink, $c.\n\nI've fought creatures that would curl your spine and I've seen my people all but slaughtered in the swamps of the wetlands and amidst the ruins of Outland.\n\nGet. Lost."
G["Leave this place or I will thrash you soundly!"]="Leave this place or I will thrash you soundly!"
G["Leave this place!"]="Abandona este lugar!"
G["Leave this place, stranger, lest it consume you as it has all that it has touched."]="Deixe este lugar, estranho, para que não o consuma, pois tem tudo o que tocou."
G["Leave this place."]="Abandona este lugar."
G["Leave this place. <The relic emits a white hot arc of flame. A memory has been gained: A lone Dark Iron dwarf is surrounded by seven corpses, kneeling before a monolith of flame.>"]="Leave this place. <The relic emits a white hot arc of flame. A memory has been gained: A lone Dark Iron dwarf is surrounded by seven corpses, kneeling before a monolith of flame.>"
G["Leave this sacred place or perish!"]="Leave this sacred place or perish!"
G["Leave us alone! Let us be!"]="Déjanos em paz! Vá embora!"
G["Leave us in peace, stranger. We have done nothing to you."]="Você não é de aqui, déjanos em paz. Não te temos feito nada."
G["Leave your battles or errands, and browse my incredible wares! Only in Darkshire for a short time... praise the Light for that."]="Leave your battles or errands, and browse my incredible wares! Only in Darkshire for a short time... praise the Light for that."
G["Leaving Kael'thas was the best thing any of us ever did.  His followers are too blind or too scared to realize where he's leading them.\n\nWe, however, are not."]="Leaving Kael'thas was the best thing any of us ever did.  His followers are too blind or too scared to realize where he's leading them.\n\nWe, however, are not."
G["Leaving ourselves unguarded on two sides will bring even more suffering, Jawn."]="Se quedamos sem proteção por ambos lados, provocaremos ainda mais sofrimento, Jawn."
G["Leaving so soon?"]="Já vai?"
G["Leaving so soon? Be sure to tell your friends to stop by the Lin family noodle cart for some secret ingredient noodle soup."]="Leaving so soon? Be sure to tell your friends to stop by the Lin family noodle cart for some secret ingredient noodle soup."
G["Leaving so soon? Do come again!"]="Já vai? Volta quando queira!"
G["Leaving the faire so soon?\n\nFor a small fee, I can teleport you to a capital city.\n\nAre you sure you want to leave?"]="Leaving the faire so soon?\n\nFor a small fee, I can teleport you to a capital city.\n\nAre you sure you want to leave?"
G["Lee Brown spends the whole day fishing up by Crystal Lake.  He's probably got some stories to tell and some tips he could teach you."]="Lê Brown passa o dia inteiro pescando no Crystal Lake. Ele provavelmente tem algumas histórias para contar e algumas dicas que poderia lhe ensinar."
G["Lee's caught some pretty odd things up at Crystal Lake.  He told me a story about this weird mask he fished up some months ago.  If you ask me, I think he just had one too many at the Lion's Pride that night."]="Lê pegou algumas coisas bem estranhas em Crystal Lake. Ele me contou uma história sobre essa máscara estranha que ele pescou algum meses atrás. Se você me perguntar, acho que ele teve um demais no Orgulho do Leão naquela noite."
G["Left Combat"]="Deixou o combate."
G["Left to their own devices, the Horde will overwhelm your land. Will you not help us fight them?"]="Se não o impedimos, a Horda invadirá seu terra. Não nos ajudará a lutar contra eles?"
G["Left... Left! LEEEFFFFTTTT!"]="Esquerda... Esquerda! Esquerda!!!"
G["Left? How can you choose to leave?"]="Esquerda? Como você pode optar por sair?"
G["Legend claims that in places of extreme conflict, across what is now known as the Plaguelands; clean and holy springs may erupt from the ground. The water from those springs has been named 'Blood of Heroes,' by artisans and commonfolk alike - in honor of those that fell in the war against the Scourge."]="A lenda afirma que em locais de conflito extremo, através do que agora é conhecido como as Terras Pestilentas; nascentes limpas e santas podem irromper do chão. A água dessas nascentes foi batizada de 'Blood of Heroes', tanto por artesãos quanto por pessoas comuns - em homenagem àquelas que caíram na guerra contra o Flagelo."
G["Legend has it that Liu Lang once set out to explore the seas beyond Pandaria on the back of a giant turtle. Every few years, he would come back, always seeking new explorers to travel with him. To this day, whenever a pandaren is daydreaming or staring off into space, we ask if they're \"waiting for the turtle.\"\n\nMost pandaren aren't very adventurous - they like to stay close to hearth and home. But some of us are still dreamers... Tonight we gather at Turtle Beach on the southern coast to gaze out at the sea and celebrate Liu Lang's spirit of adventure.\n\nIt's called the Wanderer's Festival."]="Legend has it that Liu Lang once set out to explore the seas beyond Pandaria on the back of a giant turtle. Every few years, he would come back, always seeking new explorers to travel with him. To this day, whenever a pandaren is daydreaming or staring off into space, we ask if they're \"waiting for the turtle.\"\n\nMost pandaren aren't very adventurous - they like to stay close to hearth and home. But some of us are still dreamers... Tonight we gather at Turtle Beach on the southern coast to gaze out at the sea and celebrate Liu Lang's spirit of adventure.\n\nIt's called the Wanderer's Festival."
G["Legend has it that Xuen hasn't fought in one of his own tournaments in centuries.\n\nHe says it is because he wants us to have a fighting chance. I think he's just getting old. Or... at least... old for a... well... whatever he is."]="Legend has it that Xuen hasn't fought in one of his own tournaments in centuries.\n\nHe says it is because he wants us to have a fighting chance. I think he's just getting old. Or... at least... old for a... well... whatever he is."
G["Legend has it that the Thunder King possessed enormous power, and built himself a palatial fortress. We should be able to see it soon..."]="Legend has it that the Thunder King possessed enormous power, and built himself a palatial fortress. We should be able to see it soon..."
G["Legend says that the great beast Omen sleeps in the waters of Lake Elune'ara in Moonglade, only to appear once a year. But that's just a legend."]="Legend says that the great beast Omen sleeps in the waters of Lake Elune'ara in Moonglade, only to appear once a year. But that's just a legend."
G["Legendary Pelt!"]="Legendary Pelt!"
G["Legends of the great white stag have persisted in my culture for as long as we tauren can remember. Malorne likely stood guard over the primal forests at the very dawn of the world. He was an ancient spirit, the very embodiment of nature's power and purity!\n\nLong ago, the greatest tauren hunters would track the white stag when the moon was full. To catch even a glimpse of his shimmering hide through the trees was said to bring great fortune to the tribe for a generation.\n\nDid you know that Malorne was the consort of the moon goddess?"]="Legends of the great white stag have persisted in my culture for as long as we tauren can remember. Malorne likely stood guard over the primal forests at the very dawn of the world. He was an ancient spirit, the very embodiment of nature's power and purity!\n\nLong ago, the greatest tauren hunters would track the white stag when the moon was full. To catch even a glimpse of his shimmering hide through the trees was said to bring great fortune to the tribe for a generation.\n\nDid you know that Malorne was the consort of the moon goddess?"
G["Legends tell of a great battle that took place in this very vale, turning the golden fields to crimson with the blood of many brave monks. The armies of Lei Shen the Thunder King, emperor of the mogu, fought brutally, but were eventually overcome."]="Legends tell of a great battle that took place in this very vale, turning the golden fields to crimson with the blood of many brave monks. The armies of Lei Shen the Thunder King, emperor of the mogu, fought brutally, but were eventually overcome."
G["Legion everywhere... they must be dealt with!"]="Legião em todos os lugares... eles devem ser tratados!"
G["Legion, to the front lines!"]="Legião, às linhas de linha de frente!"
G["Legion?"]="Legião?"
G["Legion? Demons? They hunt you? My people have also been hunted by Legion: Targeted by their dark masters for damnation.\n\n<Cowlen wipes the tears away.>\n\nIt is the reason that I moved my family here oh-so-many years ago."]="Legião? Demônios? Te derem caça? Meu povo também foi perseguido pela Legião: alvo dos seus mestres obscuros para a condenação.\n\n<Cowlen se seca as lágrimas.>\n\nEssa é a razão pela que trasladé a meu família aqui há tantos anos."
G["Legionnaire Nazgrim"]="Legionário Nazgrim"
G["Lei Shen give us strength!"]="Lei Shen, danos força!"
G["Lei Shen gives life!"]="Lei Shen da a vida!"
G["Lei Shen let us prove ta ya the might of the Zandalari. We will crush des intruders where dey stand!"]="Lei Shen let us prove ta ya the might of the Zandalari. We will crush des intruders where dey stand!"
G["Lei Shen must not be allowed to marshal his full strength.\n\nA direct assault on the front gates will take time, and the aid of your Alliance and Horde. But if there is one thing we Shado-pan know it is that where there is a wall, there is a way around.\n\nThe sewers at the back of this tunnel lead all the way to the fortress entrance. We must hold this entrance."]="Lei Shen must not be allowed to marshal his full strength.\n\nA direct assault on the front gates will take time, and the aid of your Alliance and Horde. But if there is one thing we Shado-pan know it is that where there is a wall, there is a way around.\n\nThe sewers at the back of this tunnel lead all the way to the fortress entrance. We must hold this entrance."
G["Lei Shen returns, weakling."]="Lei Shen voltou, me ver."
G["Lei Shen's power makes us stronger!"]="O poder de Lei Shen nos há mais fueh'tes!"
G["Lei Shi's reflection burbles quietly."]="Lei Shi's reflection burbles quietly."
G["Lei Shi's reflection ripples ominously."]="Lei Shi's reflection ripples ominously."
G["Lei Shi's reflection ripples playfully."]="Lei Shi's reflection ripples playfully."
G["Lei Shi's reflection smiles happily."]="O reflexo de Lei Shi sorri alegre."
G["Lemme give you some advice: Never trust a gnome."]="Deixe-me dar um conselho: nunca confie em um gnomo."
G["Lemme outta here, mon!"]="Deixe-me sair daqui, mon!"
G["Lend me a Windrider.  I'm going to Spinebreaker Post!"]="Empreste-me um Windrider. Eu estou indo para o Spinebreaker Post!"
G["Lend us the strength of the giants of Shadowmoon, Corok. The master is a just ruler. He will be sure to take care of those that assisted in subduing the dissidents of this world."]="Lend us the strength of the giants of Shadowmoon, Corok. The master is a just ruler. He will be sure to take care of those that assisted in subduing the dissidents of this world."
G["Lend us your aid, keeper. Together we will defeat Yogg-Saron."]="Nos ajude, guardião. Juntos, derrotaremos Yogg-Saron."
G["Lend us your voices! Now is the time we must act to save our people."]="Unamos nossas vozes! Chegou o momentos de superando a nosso povo."
G["Leryssa!"]="Leryssa!"
G["Leryssa... you... you're all right!"]="Leryssa... está... está bem!"
G["Less fightin', more farmin'. That's the life, I tell ya.\n\n'Course, if yer doin' the fightin', I don't mind watchin'."]="Less fightin', more farmin'. That's the life, I tell ya.\n\n'Course, if yer doin' the fightin', I don't mind watchin'."
G["Less rivets mean a cleaner environment!"]="Less rivets mean a cleaner environment!"
G["Less than a hundred of us, and over a thousand orcs. Only a handful of us managed to walk away from that one."]="Éramos menos de um centenar e os orcs, mais de um milhar. Somente muito poucos conseguimos escapar de aquilo."
G["Less watching, more healing!"]="Menos olhar e mais curar!"
G["Less yap flappin'. More ogre thwappin'. Deal?"]="Menos barulho. Mais ogro se mexendo. Combinado?"
G["Lesser beings, intruding here! A shame that your excess courage does not compensate for your stupidity!"]="Seres inferior inmiscuyéndose aqui! É uma lástima que seu excesso de coragem não compense sua gracinha!"
G["Lesser? We'll show you who's lesser!"]="Lesser? We'll show you who's lesser!"
G["Let $g him:her; through! Quickly, courier, to the High General!"]="Dejadle passar! Rápido, $gmensajero: mensageira; vê ao lado à Alta Geral!"
G["Let 'em come. They'll pay for what they've done!"]="Let 'em come. They'll pay for what they've done!"
G["Let 'em have it!"]="Let 'em have it!"
G["Let Clubnik know that the priesthood will be sending him a bill. For the Light!"]="Diga a Clubnik que o sacerdócio lhe enviará a factura. pela Luz!"
G["Let Connelly know that Fennie's askin' about him!"]="Diga a Connelhy que Fennie tem perguntado por ele!"
G["Let Marshal Windsor know that I am ready."]="Faça saber ao marechal Windsor que já estou pronto."
G["Let Quel'Delar be a sign that we will never give up, that we will face any enemy without fear."]="Let Quel'Delar be a sign that we will never give up, that we will face any enemy without fear."
G["Let an old orc show you how it's done!"]="De que um velho orc te ensenhe como se há!"
G["Let death wash over you!"]="Que a morte os inunde!"
G["Let everything you do be done for the Horde."]="Que tudo o que faça seja pelo bem da Horda."
G["Let fire rain from above!"]="Que lhueva fogo!"
G["Let hatred and rage guide your blows!"]="Deixem que o ódio e a raiva guíen seus golpes!"
G["Let her know... my last thought was of her..."]="Let her know... my last thought was of her..."
G["Let him speak! Be silent!"]="Let him speak! Be silent!"
G["Let him through! That strapping young pandaren is saving a keg of Honeybrew!"]="Dejadle passar! Esse corajoso jovem pandaren está superando um barril de birramiel!"
G["Let honor guide you, $n. Do not forget that Hellscream's eyes are always upon you."]="Let honor guide you, $n. Do not forget that Hellscream's eyes are always upon you."
G["Let it be known that $n - Alliance $C - has earned the undying respect of Ironforge and the Alliance as a whole.  $GHe : She; has engaged in great diplomacy with Timbermaw Hold and performed valiant actions for them on our behalf.   $GHe : She; has gone above and beyond the call of duty.  Three cheers for $n - a true hero of the Alliance!"]="Let it be known that $n - Alliance $C - has earned the undying respect of Ironforge and the Alliance as a whole.  $GHe : She; has engaged in great diplomacy with Timbermaw Hold and performed valiant actions for them on our behalf.   $GHe : She; has gone above and beyond the call of duty.  Three cheers for $n - a true hero of the Alliance!"
G["Let it be known that $n - Horde $C - has earned the undying respect of the Warchief.   $GHe : She; has engaged in great diplomacy with Timbermaw Hold and performed valiant actions for them on our behalf.   $GHe : She; has gone above and beyond the call of duty.  Three cheers for $n - a true hero of the Horde!"]="Let it be known that $n - Horde $C - has earned the undying respect of the Warchief.   $GHe : She; has engaged in great diplomacy with Timbermaw Hold and performed valiant actions for them on our behalf.   $GHe : She; has gone above and beyond the call of duty.  Three cheers for $n - a true hero of the Horde!"
G["Let it be known that it has been an honor and a privilege fighting alongside all of you."]="Let it be known that it has been an honor and a privilege fighting alongside all of you."
G["Let it begin!"]="Que comience!"
G["Let it never be said that we do not listen to the concerns of the people. This \"Griftah\" individual has made false claims, and we mean to set things right."]="Let it never be said that we do not listen to the concerns of the people. This \"Griftah\" individual has made false claims, and we mean to set things right."
G["Let it not trouble your heart, beloved. You have freed me from slavery, and for that I love you all the more."]="Let it not trouble your heart, beloved. You have freed me from slavery, and for that I love you all the more."
G["Let it rain!"]="De que lhueva!"
G["Let loneliness guide you... give in."]="De que a soledade te guíe... Ríndete."
G["Let loose your rage. Kill me and in so doing, validate my existence."]="Liberar seu ódio. Acaba comigo e legitima assim meu existência."
G["Let me ask you this, brothers and sisters: Can good exist without evil? Can there be light without dark?"]="Let me ask you this, brothers and sisters: Can good exist without evil? Can there be light without dark?"
G["Let me assure you people that if he's successful, this world will suffer far worse than Outland ever did! So, let's make sure that doesn't come to pass."]="Let me assure you people that if he's successful, this world will suffer far worse than Outland ever did! So, let's make sure that doesn't come to pass."
G["Let me at 'em! I'll bash 'em ta bits with my lute!"]="Let me at 'em! I'll bash 'em ta bits with my lute!"
G["Let me at 'em! I'll blast 'em off the side o' the mountain!"]="Let me at 'em! I'll blast 'em off the side o' the mountain!"
G["Let me at 'em, $n! Just give the word and I'll mount up and attack their bridge!"]="Let me at 'em, $n! Just give the word and I'll mount up and attack their bridge!"
G["Let me at those crazy cultists! I'll cleave 'em in half!"]="Let me at those crazy cultists! I'll cleave 'em in half!"
G["Let me be."]="Déjame."
G["Let me break down a little math for you: \"goblin\" plus \"engineering\" equals KNOW HOW, baby.  Anyone who tells you otherwise simply doesn't know how to add."]="Deixe-me detalhar um pouco de matemática para você: \"goblin\", mais \"engenharia\" é igual a SAIBA COMO, baby. Quem disser o contrário simplesmente não sabe como adicionar."
G["Let me browse your goods."]="Deixe-me procurar seus produtos."
G["Let me browse your reagents and poison supplies."]="Deixe-me procurar seus reagentes e suprimentos de veneno."
G["Let me browse your seasonal fare."]="Deixe-me procurar sua tarifa sazonal."
G["Let me browse your selection of fireworks."]="Deixe-me procurar sua seleção de fogos de artifício."
G["Let me browse your wares, Calypso."]="Deixe-me procurar seus produtos, Calypso."
G["Let me browse your wares, Cookie."]="Deixe-me procurar seus produtos, Cookie."
G["Let me browse your wares."]="De que eche um olhada aos seus mercadorias."
G["Let me confer with my colleagues."]="Deixe-me conversar com meus colegas."
G["Let me fight by your side."]="Deixe-me lutar ao seu lado."
G["Let me fly!"]="Déjame voar!"
G["Let me give you a moment to get our opponents ready for battle."]="Dê-me um minuto para preparar a nossos oponentes para a batalha."
G["Let me give you my regards for Greatfather Winter, scum..."]="Let me give you my regards for Greatfather Winter, scum..."
G["Let me go get you a set of tools, $n."]="Let me go get you a set of tools, $n."
G["Let me go!"]="Déjame ir!"
G["Let me grab a spell focus from inside my home here, and then we'll get started!"]="Let me grab a spell focus from inside my home here, and then we'll get started!"
G["Let me grab parts for goblin... stop stealing!"]="Deixe-me pegar peças para goblin... de de roubar!"
G["Let me grab the popped corn kernels, sire."]="Let me grab the popped corn kernels, sire."
G["Let me guess, another group of Budd's riff-raff?\n\nAway with you, $r, before you get hurt - or worse."]="Let me guess, another group of Budd's riff-raff?\n\nAway with you, $r, before you get hurt - or worse."
G["Let me have a look at that shard, would you Admiral?  I could feel its power radiating from the other side of the cave."]="Let me have a look at that shard, would you Admiral?  I could feel its power radiating from the other side of the cave."
G["Let me have a look at that shard, would you Captain?  I could feel its power radiating from the other side of the cave."]="Deixe-me dar um olhada a esse fragmento, capitão. Posso sentir o poder que emana desdo outro lado da caverna."
G["Let me have another one, Langston."]="Dê-me outra, Langston."
G["Let me hear that battle roar!"]="Quero ouvir esse rugido de batalha!"
G["Let me hear the rest of your report, Agent Kearnen."]="Quero escutar o resto do seu relatório, agente Kearnen."
G["Let me help you with those."]="Deixe-me ajudar você com isso."
G["Let me in on your other projects."]="Let me in on your other projects."
G["Let me install these Gyromechanic Gears and Restabilization Cogs and we'll fire up The Recombobulator."]="Let me install these Gyromechanic Gears and Restabilization Cogs and we'll fire up The Recombobulator."
G["Let me introduce you to me new bruddas: fang and claw!"]="Os presento a meus novos irmãos: colmilho e garra!"
G["Let me know if you catch anybody interfering with our filth-pool. I've heard stories about intruders."]="Let me know if you catch anybody interfering with our filth-pool. I've heard stories about intruders."
G["Let me know if you need help finding anything, $c."]="Let me know if you need help finding anything, $c."
G["Let me know if you want to brawl, $r."]="Avise-me se que lutar, $r."
G["Let me know if you want to fight, $r."]="Avise-me se que lutar, $r."
G["Let me know right away if you find something important."]="Let me know right away if you find something important."
G["Let me know when it is best to ride. You must be our eyes and ears on the battlefront."]="Diga quando é melhor montar. Terá que ser nossos olhos e nossos ouvidos na linha de frente de batalha."
G["Let me know when ya be ready ta leave."]="Avise-me quando queira pah'tir."
G["Let me know when you are ready to begin the attack."]="Avise-me quando estiver $gpronto: pronta; para começar o ataque."
G["Let me know when you are ready to depart this place."]="Let me know when you are ready to depart this place."
G["Let me know when you are ready to go, $n."]="Avise-me quando queira partir, $n."
G["Let me know when you are ready to travel to Uldum. We will ask Cyclonas what he knows."]="Avise-me quando estiver pronto para viajar para Uldum. Vamos perguntar a Cyclonas o que ele sabe."
G["Let me know when you're loaded in and ready, $n."]="Let me know when you're loaded in and ready, $n."
G["Let me know when you're ready to go inside..."]="Let me know when you're ready to go inside..."
G["Let me know when you're ready, $n."]="Avise-me quando estiver $gpronto: pronta;, $n."
G["Let me know when you're ready."]="Let me know when you're ready."
G["Let me know when you're ready. I'd prefer sooner than later... what with the slowly dying from poison and all."]="Avise-me quando estiver pronto. Eu preferiria mais cedo ou mais tarde... com a morte lenta de veneno e tudo."
G["Let me know when you're ready. Sooner is better - Cayden's lookin a mite vicious."]="Avise-me quando estiver $gpronto: pronta;. Melhor cedo que tarde, Cayden tem uma pinta um pouco agressiva."
G["Let me lend you my shield, $n. Allow me to protect you, so that I may better protect my village!"]="Let me lend you my shield, $n. Allow me to protect you, so that I may better protect my village!"
G["Let me live! I'll do whatever you say!"]="Let me live! I'll do whatever you say!"
G["Let me out and I'll give you three wishes! I swear!"]="Let me out and I'll give you three wishes! I swear!"
G["Let me out and we'll fight side-by-side. The slaughter will be glorious!"]="Sácame e lucharemos juntos. A matança será gloriosa!"
G["Let me out of here!"]="Me tira daqui!"
G["Let me out of here! It smells like ELVES!"]="Sácame de aqui! Cheira a ELFOS!"
G["Let me out of here, $r!"]="Sácame de aqui, $r!"
G["Let me out of these chains! I'll reduce you to rubble!"]="Quítame estas correntes! Te farei papilha!"
G["Let me out!"]="Deixe-me sair!"
