G["Ley-Guardian Eregos is all that now stands between us and control of The Oculus.  He's flying above the Band of Alignment, at the very top of The Oculus.  Eregos is incredibly powerful; stay on my back when we engage him and leave the fighting to me."]="Ley-Guardian Eregos is all that now stands between us and control of The Oculus.  He's flying above the Band of Alignment, at the very top of The Oculus.  Eregos is incredibly powerful; stay on my back when we engage him and leave the fighting to me."
G["Ley-line excavations continue, with pleasant results.  We were surprised to find several similarities in the ley-line structures between Azeroth and Draenor, possibly indicating a similar genesis?\nMy close associate Naberius reports that the Laughing Skulls have established a truce with the Alliance forces in the area. Always distrustful of orcs, I thought to myself, \"This could be heaven or this could be hell.\""]="Ley-line excavations continue, with pleasant results.  We were surprised to find several similarities in the ley-line structures between Azeroth and Draenor, possibly indicating a similar genesis?\nMy close associate Naberius reports that the Laughing Skulls have established a truce with the Alliance forces in the area. Always distrustful of orcs, I thought to myself, \"This could be heaven or this could be hell.\""
G["Leyara barks a cruel laugh."]="Leyara barks a cruel laugh."
G["Leyara nods."]="Leyara asiente."
G["Leyara, the two of you are all I have left. I swear to you, on my life, you and my granddaughter will ALWAYS have my protection."]="Leyara, the two of you are all I have left. I swear to you, on my life, you and my granddaughter will ALWAYS have my protection."
G["Leyara, you must see that Fandral is beyond redemption. The corruption within him runs deeper than you know."]="Leyara, deve entender que Fandral não tem redenção. A corrupção em ele é mais profunda do que acha."
G["Leza!"]="Leza!"
G["Li Li does not understand why I always stop to sample the local brews. But in my experience, you can learn a lot about a people by what they drink!\n\nHave you tried mainland pandaren ales? Very crisp, very dark. One sip and you know that they are brewed to be savored slowly. It is the drink of a people that are in no hurry, who enjoy time with their friends.\n\nWhat do YOU drink, $c? And what would it tell me about you, hm?"]="Li Li does not understand why I always stop to sample the local brews. But in my experience, you can learn a lot about a people by what they drink!\n\nHave you tried mainland pandaren ales? Very crisp, very dark. One sip and you know that they are brewed to be savored slowly. It is the drink of a people that are in no hurry, who enjoy time with their friends.\n\nWhat do YOU drink, $c? And what would it tell me about you, hm?"
G["Li Li, Mudmug, wait up!"]="Li Li, Mudmug, wait up!"
G["Li Li, wait up!"]="Li Li, espera!"
G["Li Li, you get the malts. I will... research the local brews. We'll meet back here."]="Li Li, você traz a malta. Eu vou... estudar a cerveja local. Nos reuniremos aqui."
G["Li Li. A stranger in need is a future friend. That is the wanderer's way!"]="Li Li. A stranger in need is a future friend. That is the wanderer's way!"
G["Li Li... let's go. Your uncle has got something to prove."]="Li Li... vamos. Seu tio tem algo que demostrar."
G["Li Li? Is that you? Hello? Anybody gonna pay attention to ol' Mudmug?"]="Li Li? Is that you? Hello? Anybody gonna pay attention to ol' Mudmug?"
G["Li and Lo, get the sap into position!"]="Li and Lo, get the sap into position!"
G["Li and Lo, go look after our friends down below."]="Li and Lo, go look after our friends down below."
G["Li, I need another dragon gun."]="Li, preciso outra pistola de dragão."
G["Liar!"]="Mentira!"
G["Lich King say Patchwerk \"on loan\" from Naxxramas. Loan make Patchwerk ANGRY!"]="Rei Lich dizer que Remendejo \"prestado\" de Naxxramas. Préstamo ENFADAR a Remendejo!"
G["Lieutenant Aden always volunteers for gate duty. That's fine by me.\n\nI've got a post that allows me a good view of my guards AND the daughters of the tradesmen at the same time."]="Lieutenant Aden always volunteers for gate duty. That's fine by me.\n\nI've got a post that allows me a good view of my guards AND the daughters of the tradesmen at the same time."
G["Lieutenant General. The peons are working day and night to organize and ready the supplies from Orgrimmar. There is still much to be done, but we are an hour ahead of schedule."]="Tenente geral. Os peões estão trabalhando dia e noite para organizar os suprimentos de Orgrimmar. Ainda fica muito por fazer, mas vamos uma hora por linha de frente do plano."
G["Lieutenant Myner asked me to challenge you to a duel."]="O tenente Myner me pediu que te rete a um duelo."
G["Lieutenant, I have lost my insignia. Could you please supply me with a replacement?"]="Lieutenant, I have lost my insignia. Could you please supply me with a replacement?"
G["Lieutenant, I want you to make that your top priority.  Notify anyone that you think can help."]="Tenente, quero que esta seja seu prioridade número um. Avisa a todos os que cria que podem ajudar."
G["Life energy to... consume."]="Energia vital... que consumir."
G["Life form purged."]="Forma de vida purgada."
G["Life from lifelessness... death for you."]="Vida da não vida... morte para vocês."
G["Life is a struggle, and the saying that which does not kill you makes you stronger is not always true.  Sometimes wounds act slowly, which is why we have bandages.  Pand Stonebinder of the Spirit Rise can teach you the art of First Aid."]="A vida é uma luta, e o ditado que não mata te fortalece nem sempre é verdade. Às vezes, as feridas agem lentamente, e é por isso que temos ataduras. Pand Stonebinder da Ascensão Espiritual pode ensinar a arte dos Primeiros Socorros."
G["Life is but a path to undeath. My pets understand that."]="Life is but a path to undeath. My pets understand that."
G["Life is like a carefully woven tapestry."]="A vida é como uma tapeçaria cuidadosamente tecida."
G["Life is meaningless without suffering!"]="A vida sem sofrimento não tem sentido!"
G["Life is meaningless. It is in death that we are truly tested."]="A vida não tem sentido. A morte é a autêntico prova."
G["Life is meaningless. It is in the afterlife that we are truly tested."]="A vida carece de sentido. A verdadeira prova é a outra vida."
G["Life is weak, mortal, fleeting ... fragile."]="Life is weak, mortal, fleeting ... fragile."
G["Life suddenly seems so much brighter.\n\nI still love sleeping, though."]="De repente a vida parece mais alegre.\n\nMas me continua gustando dormir."
G["Life thrives in this jungle, $c. Birds call down from the canopy. Beasts roar out from the dark, hidden places below.\n\nAnd we, the hunters, keep them in check. It is our place - our obligation - to do so."]="Life thrives in this jungle, $c. Birds call down from the canopy. Beasts roar out from the dark, hidden places below.\n\nAnd we, the hunters, keep them in check. It is our place - our obligation - to do so."
G["Lifebinder! Do you presume that I am at your beck and call? I have a world to unmake."]="Protetora! Acaso acha que me ao seu disposição? Tenho um mundo que devastar."
