G["Lilian... you're... it's so nice to see you well."]="Lilian... está... fico feliz em ver que está bem."
G["Lilly, please take the prisoner back to the sentinels so that we can deal with him properly."]="Lilhy, leva a nosso prisioneiro com os sentinelas para que possamos tratar com ele como é devido."
G["Limpet Mine Planted! Detonation in:"]="Bomba lapa em posição! Detonação em:"
G["Limpy Joe, it's you. It's really you!"]="Joe Limpy, é você. É mesmo você!"
G["Lin finds the Hidden Master? Then our training can continue!\n\nOnly one thing. Ken-Ken must finish helping the sads first. Too many sads here."]="Lin finds the Hidden Master? Then our training can continue!\n\nOnly one thing. Ken-Ken must finish helping the sads first. Too many sads here."
G["Lin is upset - Zhiya was his good friend and we lost him in the battle. \nI don't want Lin to do something thoughtless. I don't know what I'd do if I lost him..."]="Lin está triste... Zhiya era seu melhor amigo e o temos perdido na batalha.\n\nNão quero que Lin faça nenhuma loucura. Não sei o que faria se o perdiera..."
G["Lin, heart of my heart! No, please, NO! It cannot be!"]="Lin, coração de minha alma! Não, por favor, NÃO! Não pode ser!"
G["Line up and crush these fools!"]="Em fila e aplasdada esses idiotas!"
G["Lira sent me to watch your backs. If Obsidia is in here, I'll keep her busy while you finish her off."]="Lira sent me to watch your backs. If Obsidia is in here, I'll keep her busy while you finish her off."
G["Lisrythe may be a bit... intimidating at first, but she stocks what you're looking for. She sells her wares in the eastern portion of Scryer's Tier."]="Lisrythe pode ser um pouco... intimidante no começo, mas ela estoca o que você está procurando. Ela vende seus produtos na porção oriental do nível de Scryer."
G["Lisrythe may be a bit... intimidating at first, but she stocks what you're looking for. She sells her wares outside the large library on Scryer's Tier."]="Lisrythe pode ser um pouco... intimidante no começo, mas ela estoca o que você está procurando. Ela vende seus produtos do lado de fosse da grande biblioteca no nível de Scryer."
G["Lissah Spellwick, at the top of mage tower, is the mistress of Lady Jaina's enchanters."]="Lissah Spellwick, no topo da torre dos magos, é a amante dos encantadores de Lady Jaina."
G["Lissan! I bet that girl is daydreaming at the well again!"]="Lissan! Apuesto a que essa garota está sonhando acorde no poço outra vez!"
G["Lissan! Lissan White! Where is that girl?"]="Lissan! Lissan Branco! Onde está essa garota?"
G["Lissen Marge, I thought I told ya never to bother me when I be drinkin'...."]="Lissen Marge, I thought I told ya never to bother me when I be drinkin'...."
G["List says like you're third in line, $c."]="List says like you're third in line, $c."
G["Listen $g lad : lass;. I left the expedition in the capable hands of me son, Junior. When you've stalked the finest game in all of Azeroth you start to itch for something more.\n\nAnd have you seen the size of the beasties here?!\n\nI'm here hunting the most dangerous prey you'll ever lay your eyes on. I mean to bag myself Tusker and take her heart as my trophy!"]="Listen $g lad : lass;. I left the expedition in the capable hands of me son, Junior. When you've stalked the finest game in all of Azeroth you start to itch for something more.\n\nAnd have you seen the size of the beasties here?!\n\nI'm here hunting the most dangerous prey you'll ever lay your eyes on. I mean to bag myself Tusker and take her heart as my trophy!"
G["Listen $g sonny:missy;, I'll have you know that whatever attacked us was no priestess of nothin'! Her eyes were aglow with something evil and she was genuinely frothing at the mouth! She came in, did some kind of crazy scream that sent us all runnin' in separate directions then started flayin' our minds one by one. I'd be hearin' shadowy words in my head, watchin' the other's periodically black out here and there. It was madness! We would have been done for if not for the damned monkey."]="Listen $g sonny:missy;, I'll have you know that whatever attacked us was no priestess of nothin'! Her eyes were aglow with something evil and she was genuinely frothing at the mouth! She came in, did some kind of crazy scream that sent us all runnin' in separate directions then started flayin' our minds one by one. I'd be hearin' shadowy words in my head, watchin' the other's periodically black out here and there. It was madness! We would have been done for if not for the damned monkey."
G["Listen carefully to the silence, $c. What does it say?"]="Ouça atenciosamente o silêncio, $c. Que te diz?"
G["Listen carefully, $n, for I have much knowledge to impart."]="Listen carefully, $n, for I have much knowledge to impart."
G["Listen carefully, for the lord of Blackrock will surely destroy you, should you not be prepared."]="Listen carefully, for the lord of Blackrock will surely destroy you, should you not be prepared."
G["Listen closely to what you are told and do not quickly trust, or distrust.  For even friends serve their own ends, $c.\n\nOur great Warchief knows this, and to prove that there are warlocks within the Horde who do not wish to destroy it from within or gain control over it, I have volunteered to aid our young leader in anyway I can."]="Listen closely to what you are told and do not quickly trust, or distrust.  For even friends serve their own ends, $c.\n\nOur great Warchief knows this, and to prove that there are warlocks within the Horde who do not wish to destroy it from within or gain control over it, I have volunteered to aid our young leader in anyway I can."
G["Listen here, now. When you're looking for answers nothing beats a good explosion - the bigger, the better!\n\nBut that's probably enough with the questions for now, $r.\n\nMy warheads are classified material, and the element 115 that I created to power them is even more classified!\n\nIn fact, it's best that you just return to your everyday life and pretend we never met."]="Listen here, now. When you're looking for answers nothing beats a good explosion - the bigger, the better!\n\nBut that's probably enough with the questions for now, $r.\n\nMy warheads are classified material, and the element 115 that I created to power them is even more classified!\n\nIn fact, it's best that you just return to your everyday life and pretend we never met."
G["Listen ta me, $g brudda:sista;. You must fight against da Lich King's control. He be a monster dat want ta see dis world - our world - be ruined. Don't let he use you ta accomplish he goals. You be a hero once and you be a hero again! Fight it, mon! Fight he control!"]="Listen ta me, $g brudda:sista;. You must fight against da Lich King's control. He be a monster dat want ta see dis world - our world - be ruined. Don't let he use you ta accomplish he goals. You be a hero once and you be a hero again! Fight it, mon! Fight he control!"
G["Listen to me, $n. Ye must fight against the Lich King's control. He's a monster that wants to see this world - our world - in ruin. Don't let him use ye to accomplish his goals. Ye were once a hero and ye can be again. Fight, damn ye! Fight his control!"]="Listen to me, $n. Ye must fight against the Lich King's control. He's a monster that wants to see this world - our world - in ruin. Don't let him use ye to accomplish his goals. Ye were once a hero and ye can be again. Fight, damn ye! Fight his control!"
G["Listen to me, $n. You must fight against the Lich King's control. He is a monster that wants to see this world - our world - in ruin. Don't let him use you to accomplish his goals - AGAIN. You were once a hero and you can be again. Fight, damn you! Fight his control!"]="Listen to me, $n. You must fight against the Lich King's control. He is a monster that wants to see this world - our world - in ruin. Don't let him use you to accomplish his goals - AGAIN. You were once a hero and you can be again. Fight, damn you! Fight his control!"
G["Listen to me, $n. You must fight against the Lich King's control. He is a monster that wants to see this world - our world - in ruin. Don't let him use you to accomplish his goals. You were once a hero and you can be again. Fight, damn you! Fight his control!"]="Listen to me, $n. You must fight against the Lich King's control. He is a monster that wants to see this world - our world - in ruin. Don't let him use you to accomplish his goals. You were once a hero and you can be again. Fight, damn you! Fight his control!"
G["Listen to me, human. I care nothing for your plight, but you have something I require. Tell me where to find the bloodforged ingots."]="Ouça-me, humano. Não me importo com à sua situação, mas você tem algo que eu preciso. Diga-me onde encontrar os lingotes forjados de sangue."
G["Listen to me, peon. We have a process for the delivery and safekeeping of the cipher fragment. The envoy delivers the missive, which is sealed by Lord Illidan. No missive, no transfer."]="Ouça-me, peão. Temos um processo para a entrega e proteção do fragmento de cifra. O enviado entrega a missiva, que é selada por Lord Illidan. Sem missiva, sem transferência."
G["Listen to the Orc. He has a point."]="Ouça ao orc. Tem razão."
G["Listen to the stories of an elder. $n. I have many to speak of..."]="Ouça as histórias de um ancião. $n. Tenho muito de que falar..."
G["Listen to what I have to tell you about our enemy before we start. You don't want to be unprepared while we're out smashing Scourge in the field."]="Ouça o que tenho a lhe dizer sobre nosso inimigo antes de começarmos. Você não quer estar despreparado enquanto estivermos esmagando o Flagelo no campo."
G["Listen to your elders, $n. If you are strong of will and dedicated, there is no power you cannot control."]="Ouça aos seus ancestrais, $n. Se é forte de vontade e te entregas ao seu tarefa, não haverá nenhum poder que não possa controlar."
G["Listen to your inner voice, and seek out the truth!"]="Listen to your inner voice, and seek out the truth!"
G["Listen to your men's dying breaths as I drink in their souls!"]="Listen to your men's dying breaths as I drink in their souls!"
G["Listen up Men!"]="Listen up Men!"
G["Listen up! FALL IN!"]="Atenção! A FORMAR!"
G["Listen up! Our transport should be here momentarily."]="Listen up! Our transport should be here momentarily."
G["Listen up, Venture Company goons! Rule #1: Never keep the prisoner near the explosives."]="Listen up, Venture Company goons! Rule #1: Never keep the prisoner near the explosives."
G["Listen up, flapjack, we're in for the fight of our lives with the bugs in Ahn'Qiraj and we need to get prepared for it. I'm collecting iron bars here.  Currently, the Alliance only has $2002w iron bars, but we're projected to need a total of $2003w for the war effort."]="Ouça, flapjack, estamos na luta de nossas vidas com os insetos em Ahn'Qiraj e precisamos de nos preparar para isso. Estou coletando barras de ferro aqui. Atualmente, a Aliança possui apenas barras de ferro de $2002w, mas projetamos que precisamos de de um total de $2003w para o esforço de guerra."
G["Listen up, men! Prepare for a hozen ambush!"]="Atenção! Preparem-se para uma emboscada hozen!"
G["Listen up, soldiers!"]="Listen up, soldiers!"
G["Listen up, you lot! Our worries are over! FREE BOOZE FOR EVERYONE!"]="Listen up, you lot! Our worries are over! FREE BOOZE FOR EVERYONE!"
G["Listen well, Scourge defilers. None of you will reach the Sunwell so long as I stand!"]="Listen well, Scourge defilers. None of you will reach the Sunwell so long as I stand!"
G["Listen well, mortal."]="Presta atenção, mortal."
G["Listen!\n\nTaking out those crystals should drain the construct."]="Listen!\n\nTaking out those crystals should drain the construct."
G["Listen, $c, it's clear that you and your friends know your way around Azeroth. Surely you've come across certain folks who hunger for fame and fortune. \n\nSend me anyone who might be willing to enter Zul'Aman and I'll make it worth your while."]="Listen, $c, it's clear that you and your friends know your way around Azeroth. Surely you've come across certain folks who hunger for fame and fortune. \n\nSend me anyone who might be willing to enter Zul'Aman and I'll make it worth your while."
G["Listen, $g pal:lady;, I don't want any trouble, ok? I didn't see who murdered 'em, but I sure heard it! Lot of yelling. Human voices... you dig? Now get out of here before I change my mind about beating you up and takin' your shoes."]="Listen, $g pal:lady;, I don't want any trouble, ok? I didn't see who murdered 'em, but I sure heard it! Lot of yelling. Human voices... you dig? Now get out of here before I change my mind about beating you up and takin' your shoes."
G["Listen, $n, I can't be seen talking with you. You're not exactly at the top of the Trade Prince's list these days and I need to think about my future.\n\nYou understand, right, babe? Besides, I'm with Candy now."]="Ouça, $n, não podem me ver falar com você. Atualmente não está precisamente no mais alto da pronta de amigos do Príncipe mercante e tenho que pensar na minha futuro.\n\nO entende, verdade, cielín? Além, agora estou com Rosto."
G["Listen, $n, I hate being indebted to anyone. So can you make sure to keep this on the down-low, just between the two of us?\n\nI'd hate for my creditors to find out."]="Listen, $n, I hate being indebted to anyone. So can you make sure to keep this on the down-low, just between the two of us?\n\nI'd hate for my creditors to find out."
G["Listen, $n, I know of a little swamp not too far from here...."]="Listen, $n, I know of a little swamp not too far from here...."
G["Listen, $n, you should know by now that when fortune comes knocking, you open the door and ask questions later. Chances like this don't come along every day!\n\nNow, are you in or not, $c?\n\n<Budd doesn't wait for a reply>\n\nOf course you are! Now, there's work to be done, and so far I've seen a lot of talking and no action. I suggest you show me something before I find a replacement.\n\nThere are thousands who would kill for an opportunity like this, I assure you!"]="Listen, $n, you should know by now that when fortune comes knocking, you open the door and ask questions later. Chances like this don't come along every day!\n\nNow, are you in or not, $c?\n\n<Budd doesn't wait for a reply>\n\nOf course you are! Now, there's work to be done, and so far I've seen a lot of talking and no action. I suggest you show me something before I find a replacement.\n\nThere are thousands who would kill for an opportunity like this, I assure you!"
G["Listen, $n, you should know by now that when fortune comes knocking, you open the door and ask questions later. Chances like this don't come around every day! Are you in or not?\n\n<Budd doesn't wait for a reply.>\n\nOf course you are! Now, there's work to be done, and so far I've seen a lot of talking and no action. I suggest you show me something before I find a replacement.\n\nThere are thousands who would kill for an opportunity like this, I assure you!"]="Listen, $n, you should know by now that when fortune comes knocking, you open the door and ask questions later. Chances like this don't come around every day! Are you in or not?\n\n<Budd doesn't wait for a reply.>\n\nOf course you are! Now, there's work to be done, and so far I've seen a lot of talking and no action. I suggest you show me something before I find a replacement.\n\nThere are thousands who would kill for an opportunity like this, I assure you!"
G["Listen, $p, that grill's not gunna put food on itself. Don't let the fellas get hungry now!"]="Ouça, $p, a comida não se vai colocar em essa grelha ela sozinha. Não deixe que meus companheiros pasen fome!"
G["Listen, $r.\n\nIf you're lookin' for a shredder to ride, you'll need to head up into the hills just north there.\n\nThis one's out of commission."]="Listen, $r.\n\nIf you're lookin' for a shredder to ride, you'll need to head up into the hills just north there.\n\nThis one's out of commission."
G["Listen, $r. Listen well...\n\nThe dragon riders came in the night, mounted atop the black flight. They struck fast and with deadly precision, taking young whelps - such as me - and escaping under the veil of darkness.\n\nI watched in horror as they used my brothers and sisters in their experiments. From our essence would be created the chromatic flight."]="Listen, $r. Listen well...\n\nThe dragon riders came in the night, mounted atop the black flight. They struck fast and with deadly precision, taking young whelps - such as me - and escaping under the veil of darkness.\n\nI watched in horror as they used my brothers and sisters in their experiments. From our essence would be created the chromatic flight."
G["Listen, I've been doin' a little celebratory drinkin' since our escape, and I've been thinkin'...\n\nThose little men that jumped us need to be brought to justice!\n\nIf somethin' ain't done, then every unsuspectin' explorer who sets foot in this place is gunna get sold into slavery - or worse!"]="Listen, I've been doin' a little celebratory drinkin' since our escape, and I've been thinkin'...\n\nThose little men that jumped us need to be brought to justice!\n\nIf somethin' ain't done, then every unsuspectin' explorer who sets foot in this place is gunna get sold into slavery - or worse!"
G["Listen, death knight... Listen for the voice of your master. He calls to you now."]="Ouça, cavaleiro da Morte... Ouça a voz do seu mestre. Te está chamando agora."
G["Listen, dragon. Let the truth resonate throughout these halls."]="Ouça, dragão. Que a verdade ressoe em estas salões."
G["Listen, if you can be discreet about it, there are a bunch of places in this town guys like me aren't supposed to know about."]="Listen, if you can be discreet about it, there are a bunch of places in this town guys like me aren't supposed to know about."
G["Listen, kid. I can handle this thing. You just watch my back!"]="Listen, kid. I can handle this thing. You just watch my back!"
G["Listen, mon!\n\nI tell ya all I be knowin', but first ya gotta be savin' me from these savages and their killer bears.\n\nDeal?"]="Listen, mon!\n\nI tell ya all I be knowin', but first ya gotta be savin' me from these savages and their killer bears.\n\nDeal?"
G["Listen, since you two did such a good turn by helping me out, I'm casting the first vote to help you join the Tillers."]="Listen, since you two did such a good turn by helping me out, I'm casting the first vote to help you join the Tillers."
G["Listen, stranger, I'd love to sit and chat, but me head's poundin' somethin' fierce.\n\nHow 'bout ye git these good fer nothin' trolls to stop makin' such a racket. Then we'll get to talkin', eh?"]="Listen, stranger, I'd love to sit and chat, but me head's poundin' somethin' fierce.\n\nHow 'bout ye git these good fer nothin' trolls to stop makin' such a racket. Then we'll get to talkin', eh?"
G["Listen, you tell Schweitzer and Roitau that we've got everything under control here. They don't gotta... what?\n\nThey didn't send you? Then what are you wasting my time for?\n\nI've got work to do!"]="Olhe, lhes diz a Schweitzer e a Roitau que aqui o temos tudo baixo controle. Não têm que... que?\n\nNão te enviam eles? Então para que me faz perder o tempo?\n\nTenho trabalho que fazer!"
G["Listen, you... do you have any idea how hard it is to conduct a geological survey? It's exacting, precise work!\n\nAn' it's even harder when you're drunk."]="Listen, you... do you have any idea how hard it is to conduct a geological survey? It's exacting, precise work!\n\nAn' it's even harder when you're drunk."
G["Listen, young $c.  You hear the call of water?"]="Ouça, jovem $c. Sente a chamada da água?"
G["Listen. I'm not supposed to tell you this, but there's going to be this party that you're invited to. Whatever you do, DO NOT DRINK THE PUNCH!"]="Ouça. Não deveria dizer isto, mas vai haver uma festa à que te vão a convidar. Faça o que faça, NÃO BEBAS O PONCHE!"
G["Listen: The storm. We figured out what's makin' it. That sneaky Zandalari has these ice trolls makin' blood sacrifices ta elemental spirits."]="Listen: The storm. We figured out what's makin' it. That sneaky Zandalari has these ice trolls makin' blood sacrifices ta elemental spirits."
G["Little $n crush all da demons."]="Pequeno $n esmagar todos os demônios."
G["Little $n, why do you call me forth? Are you working with the trolls of this land? Have you come to kill me and take my power as your own?"]="Little $n, why do you call me forth? Are you working with the trolls of this land? Have you come to kill me and take my power as your own?"
G["Little $r, you will now come to appreciate my wrath!"]="Little $r, you will now come to appreciate my wrath!"
G["Little $r. You are in MY realm now!"]="Insignificante $r. Agora está na minha reino!"
G["Little Ella's trying her hand at brewing? Well, I'll be! I wish her luck. Brewing isn't something a novice can just take up, you know. Anyhow, I can spare a Lakemelon for her."]="Little Ella's trying her hand at brewing? Well, I'll be! I wish her luck. Brewing isn't something a novice can just take up, you know. Anyhow, I can spare a Lakemelon for her."
G["Little Lu, keep Amber alive! Sully, try and keep this plane from exploding on us!"]="Little Lu, keep Amber alive! Sully, try and keep this plane from exploding on us!"
G["Little creature made of flesh, your wish is granted! Death comes for you!"]="Little creature made of flesh, your wish is granted! Death comes for you!"
G["Little early to the party, aren't ya?"]="Little early to the party, aren't ya?"
G["Little food'll feel pretty good right about now."]="Agora mesmo não viria nada mal um pouco de comida."
G["Little forsaken know all weapons.  Him Archibald.  You find on inner ring of War Quarter."]="Pouco deixado conhece todas as armas. Ele Archibald. Você encontra no anel interno do War Quarter."
G["Little goblin on top of building north of Ruins of Lordaeron.  Leave Undercity and you go there."]="Duende pequeno no topo da construção ao norte de Ruins of Lordaeron. Deixe Undercity e você vai lá."
G["Little goblins? I remember when your race was created."]="Pequenos goblins? Lembrança quando sua raça foi criada."
G["Little hairier out here than you expected, $r?\n\nCan't say I'm surprised. I hear that from most everyone who makes it this far."]="Little hairier out here than you expected, $r?\n\nCan't say I'm surprised. I hear that from most everyone who makes it this far."
G["Little hand says it's time to rock and roll. Everyone into the hold: We've got a dragon to kill."]="A mãozinha diz que é hora do rock and roll. Todos no porão: Temos um dragão para matar."
G["Little help here!"]="Um pouco de ajuda aqui!"
G["Little more than gnats!"]="Pouco mais que mosquitos!"
G["Little of their camp has been left intact. Still, there might be something we can make use of.\n\nDid you require something of me, $r?"]="Little of their camp has been left intact. Still, there might be something we can make use of.\n\nDid you require something of me, $r?"
G["Little spirit, you cannot hide from me in that body!"]="Pequeno espírito, você não pode esconder de mim em esse corpo."
G["Little waters, if you would just stop moving so quickly, perhaps I could help you!"]="Little waters, if you would just stop moving so quickly, perhaps I could help you!"
G["Liu Lang discovered many things as he explored the world - oh - yes, Hao?"]="Liu Lang discovered many things as he explored the world - oh - yes, Hao?"
G["Liu stepped on my foot!"]="Liu me pisou o pé!"
G["Liu took my jinyu trinket!"]="Liu took my jinyu trinket!"
G["Live EVERY day with hope in your heart. In doing so, you CREATE the future you dream of."]="Live EVERY day with hope in your heart. In doing so, you CREATE the future you dream of."
G["Live Update Works again!"]="olá"
G["Live a life devoted to the ideals of Kros. Never stop fighting, never stop growing. Each day, stronger than before.\n\nFight through pain. Suffer through filth. Everyone is your enemy.\n\nDie with your weapon in your hand. Give your body to Ihgaluk."]="Live a life devoted to the ideals of Kros. Never stop fighting, never stop growing. Each day, stronger than before.\n\nFight through pain. Suffer through filth. Everyone is your enemy.\n\nDie with your weapon in your hand. Give your body to Ihgaluk."
G["Live in fear, die by the will of Kael'thas... It's all the same."]="Viver com medo, morrer por vontade de Kael'thas... É o mesmo."
G["Live to fight another day, and prosper."]="Viva para lutar outro dia, e prospere."
G["Live, damn you!"]="Maldito seja, vive!"
G["Lives depend on the actions we take here.  Be quick with what you have to say, $c."]="Lives depend on the actions we take here.  Be quick with what you have to say, $c."
G["Livin' like an animal is hard enough without your insults!"]="Livin' like an animal is hard enough without your insults!"
G["Living Fluids begin to form in a nearby pool!"]="Living Fluids begin to form in a nearby pool!"
G["Living flesh eases the pain..."]="Living flesh eases the pain..."
G["Living flesh!"]="carne fresca"
G["Living in these caverns and following that mad lobstrok, Clacker, is unnatural! Let me free!"]="Living in these caverns and following that mad lobstrok, Clacker, is unnatural! Let me free!"
G["Living or dead, you will serve me."]="Me servirás, vivo ou morto."
G["Living out here in the desert is rough! I get so thirsty standing outside in this heat."]="Viver aqui no deserto é difícil! Fico com tanta sede do lado de fosse nesse calor."
G["Living water, bring them death!"]="Água vivo, condúcelos à morte!"
G["Lizzarik has blades. Lizzarik has maces. Lizzarik has all your weapon needs right here!"]="Lizzarik has blades. Lizzarik has maces. Lizzarik has all your weapon needs right here!"
G["Lo! We are leaving. Where did you get off to?"]="O! Nos vamos. Onde você metido?"
G["Lo'Gosh is the spirit of the hunter, the animal instinct that kicks in when one smells food or sees one's children in jeopardy. He has always been with us, a part of our Horde, in our instincts and in our blood.\n\nHe has appeared in many forms, both on our world and here. On Azeroth, he is seen as a great white wolf, ferocious and cunning. The night elves call him \"Goldrinn.\"\n\nThey tell of a legendary battle ten thousand years ago, where Lo'Gosh fought off the demon hordes. Do you want to hear about it?"]="Lo'Gosh is the spirit of the hunter, the animal instinct that kicks in when one smells food or sees one's children in jeopardy. He has always been with us, a part of our Horde, in our instincts and in our blood.\n\nHe has appeared in many forms, both on our world and here. On Azeroth, he is seen as a great white wolf, ferocious and cunning. The night elves call him \"Goldrinn.\"\n\nThey tell of a legendary battle ten thousand years ago, where Lo'Gosh fought off the demon hordes. Do you want to hear about it?"
G["Lo-kal..."]="O-kal..."
G["Lo? Oh. I haven't seen him today. I thought it was very odd. He usually walks me to work in the morning.\n\nHe has a kind heart. It's a shame he looks down on his apprenticeship with Singegruff. He is a very talented smelter.\n\nIf you see him, tell him I missed our walk this morning."]="Lo? Oh. I haven't seen him today. I thought it was very odd. He usually walks me to work in the morning.\n\nHe has a kind heart. It's a shame he looks down on his apprenticeship with Singegruff. He is a very talented smelter.\n\nIf you see him, tell him I missed our walk this morning."
G["Lo? Sure. I've been sent to hunt him down lots of times. Well, him and Syra Goldendraft.\n\nBest places to look for them are either the inn or the Arboretum."]="Lo? Sure. I've been sent to hunt him down lots of times. Well, him and Syra Goldendraft.\n\nBest places to look for them are either the inn or the Arboretum."
G["Load me into that cannon, boy!"]="Méteme em esse canhão, rapaz!"
G["Load those cannons, ye wretches!"]="Cargá os canhões, cão'!"
G["Loatheb. The hideous result of fusing the living plague of the Plaguelands with the bog beasts of Azeroth, Loatheb is said to control the power of healing itself."]="Loatheb. The hideous result of fusing the living plague of the Plaguelands with the bog beasts of Azeroth, Loatheb is said to control the power of healing itself."
G["Local proximity threat detected. Exiting energy conservation mode."]="Local proximity threat detected. Exiting energy conservation mode."
G["Located in Dun Morogh, Gnomeregan has been the gnomes' capital city for generations, though it was recently infested by mutant troggs. In a desperate attempt to retaliate, High Tinker Mekkatorque ordered the emergency venting of the city's radioactive waste tanks. Though the troggs became irradiated, their siege continued unabated and the gnomes were forced to seek refuge in the dwarven city of Ironforge, where the High Tinker now enlists brave souls to help his people reclaim their beloved city."]="Located in Dun Morogh, Gnomeregan has been the gnomes' capital city for generations, though it was recently infested by mutant troggs. In a desperate attempt to retaliate, High Tinker Mekkatorque ordered the emergency venting of the city's radioactive waste tanks. Though the troggs became irradiated, their siege continued unabated and the gnomes were forced to seek refuge in the dwarven city of Ironforge, where the High Tinker now enlists brave souls to help his people reclaim their beloved city."
G["Locked and loaded!"]="Cargado e pronto!"
G["Lockpicking"]="Cerragemría"
G["Locksmith"]="Chaveiro"
G["Locomotion systems operable. Resuming transport,"]="Sistemas de locomoção operativos. Reiniciando transporte,"
G["Log'loth og shandai, mortal. Only death is eternal. You will be undone."]="Log'loth og shandai, mortal. Somente a morte é eterna. Este será seu fim."
G["Loganaar said that you would be bringing powerful artifacts from Shadowfang Keep. At first, I questioned the value of these materials."]="Loganaar said that you would be bringing powerful artifacts from Shadowfang Keep. At first, I questioned the value of these materials."
G["Lok narash!"]="Lok narash!"
G["Lok'tar $c!  We have need of your services in Alterac Valley.  Shall I add you to the lists?"]="Lok'tar $c!  We have need of your services in Alterac Valley.  Shall I add you to the lists?"
G["Lok'tar Illadari!"]="Lok'tar Ilhadari!"
G["Lok'tar Ogar!"]="Lok'tar Ogar!"
G["Lok'tar Ogar!!"]="Lok'tar Ogar!"
G["Lok'tar Ogar, brothers."]="Lok'tar Ogar, irmãos."
G["Lok'tar ogar!"]="Lok'tar ogar!"
G["Lok'tar ogar! Victory or death - it is these words that bind me to the Horde! For they are the most sacred and fundamental of truths to any warrior of the Horde."]="Lok'tar ogar! Victory or death - it is these words that bind me to the Horde! For they are the most sacred and fundamental of truths to any warrior of the Horde."
G["Lok'tar ogar! Victory or death - it is these words that bind me to the Horde. For they are the most sacred and fundamental of truths to any warrior of the Horde.\n\nI give my flesh and blood freely to the Warchief. I am the instrument of my Warchief's desire. I am a weapon of my Warchief's command.\n\nFrom this moment until the end of days I live and die - FOR THE HORDE!"]="Lok'tar ogar! Victory or death - it is these words that bind me to the Horde. For they are the most sacred and fundamental of truths to any warrior of the Horde.\n\nI give my flesh and blood freely to the Warchief. I am the instrument of my Warchief's desire. I am a weapon of my Warchief's command.\n\nFrom this moment until the end of days I live and die - FOR THE HORDE!"
G["Lok'tar ogar! Victory, or death!"]="Lok'tar ogar! Vitória ou morte!"
G["Lok'tar ogar! We are ready! Onward, brother orc!"]="Lok'tar ogar! Nós estamos prontos! Em diante, irmão orc!"
G["Lok'tar ogar, $n!"]="Lok'tar ogar, $n!"
G["Lok'tar ogar, popo!"]="Lok'tar ogar, papi!"
G["Lok'tar ogar, soldier."]="Lok'tar ogar, soldado."
G["Lok'tar!"]="Lok'tar!"
G["Lok'tar!  You look like you need help."]="Lok'tar! Parece O que precisa ajuda."
G["Lok'tar! Have you come to serve the Horde in battle?"]="Lok'tar! Você veio para servir a Horda em batalha?"
G["Lok'tar! Let no one forget the name, $n, a true champion of Orgrimmar!  All hail $n!"]="Lok'tar! Que ninguém olvide mais o nome de $n, um verdadeiro campeão de Orgrimmar! Três vivas por $n!"
G["Lok'tar! Let us return through that portal we left behind... much work awaits me in Orgrimmar."]="Lok'tar! Let us return through that portal we left behind... much work awaits me in Orgrimmar."
G["Lok'tar! The second tower falls! Destroy the final tower and we will hasten their retreat!"]="Lok'tar! The second tower falls! Destroy the final tower and we will hasten their retreat!"
G["Lok'tar! We need your help!"]="Lok'tar! Nós precisamos de da sua ajuda!"
G["Lok'tar, $c, I have important information! There's a war coming at Ahn'Qiraj and we need to get ready for it. I'm here collecting all of the thick leather that I can get my hands on. Right now we have $2070w, but the Warchief has tasked me with the gathering of $2071w. As you can see, I'm a little short."]="Lok'tar, $c, I have important information! There's a war coming at Ahn'Qiraj and we need to get ready for it. I'm here collecting all of the thick leather that I can get my hands on. Right now we have $2070w, but the Warchief has tasked me with the gathering of $2071w. As you can see, I'm a little short."
G["Lok'tar, $c. Behind me is the Warchief's Command board containing our leader's instructions to members of the Horde. It will tell you where your skills will best serve the Horde in battle against its foes."]="Lok'tar, $c. Trás de mim está a tábua de envio do Chefe de Guerra, que contém as instruções de nosso líder para os membros da Horda. Te informará dos lugares nos que suas habilidades poderão ficar ao serviço da Horda na luta contra nossos inimigos."
G["Lok'tar, $n!"]="Lok'tar, $n!"
G["Lok'tar, $r. I am General Zog, ambassador of the Horde. I am here to keep you apprised of the progress that the mighty Horde is making in their efforts toward the Ahn'Qiraj War. What is it that you want to know?"]="Lok'tar, $r. I am General Zog, ambassador of the Horde. I am here to keep you apprised of the progress that the mighty Horde is making in their efforts toward the Ahn'Qiraj War. What is it that you want to know?"
G["Lok'tar, hero. Today I fight with you."]="Lok'tar, hero. Today I fight with you."
G["Lok'tar. Don't try anything suspicious around here. If these undead are going to be part of the Horde, they're going to mind themselves under our watch."]="Lok'tar. Não tente nada suspeito por aqui. Se esses mortos-vivos fizerem parte da Horda, eles se importarão sob a nossa vigilância."
G["Lok-Narash! Defensive positions!"]="Lok-Narash! Posição defensiva!"
G["Lok-Narash! Prepare to strike down the outsiders! Warriors, rally!"]="Lok-Narash! Prepare to strike down the outsiders! Warriors, rally!"
G["Lok-Narash! To battle!"]="Lok-Narash! Ao combate!"
G["Lok-Regar, Kilag!"]="Lok-Regar, Kilag!"
G["Lok-Tar! For victory!"]="Lok-Tar! pela vitória!"
G["Lok-tar ogar! This young $r $c has conquered the great Echeyakee. Let $ghis:her; actions show the might of the new Horde!"]="Lok'tar ogar! $gEste: Esta; jovem $r $c tem dominado ao grande Echeyaki. Que seus ações sejam uma prova do poder da nova Horda!"
G["Loken and his iron dwarf minions have ousted the Earthen from Ulduar and taken over the city."]="Loken e seus lacaios anões férreos têm expulso aos terranos de Ulduar e têm tomado a cidade."
G["Loken will never triumph!"]="Loken nunca triunfará!"
G["Loken will not rest... until the forge is retaken! You change... nothing!"]="Loken will not rest... until the forge is retaken! You change... nothing!"
G["Loken!!"]="Loken!"
G["Loken?! That's downright bothersome... We might've neutralized the iron dwarves, but I'd lay odds there's another machine somewhere else churnin' out a whole mess o' these iron vrykul!"]="Loken?! Isso é absolutamente incômodo... Podemos ter neutralizado os anões de ferro, mas eu apostaria que há outra máquina em algum outro lugar produzindo toda uma bagunça com esses vrykul de ferro!"
G["Long John Copper, is the Brashtide Crew ready for battle?"]="John Copper o Largo, está a Tripulação Fuertemarea pronta para a batalha?"
G["Long ago the Shadow Council tried to perform a dark ritual inside Auchindoun.  Their failure created the waste you see around you.  The bones and the spirits of the fallen Draenei now haunt this land.  I was sent to cleanse the tombs of my ancestors, but with so many dangers I must remain here to protect the refugees."]="Long ago the Shadow Council tried to perform a dark ritual inside Auchindoun.  Their failure created the waste you see around you.  The bones and the spirits of the fallen Draenei now haunt this land.  I was sent to cleanse the tombs of my ancestors, but with so many dangers I must remain here to protect the refugees."
G["Long ago this land comprised the northern kingdoms of Lordaeron, ruled by King Terenas Menethil."]="Long ago this land comprised the northern kingdoms of Lordaeron, ruled by King Terenas Menethil."
G["Long ago, a group of sturdy nomad hunters wandered the world. By a stroke of fate, they were here in Pandaria when the Sundering split apart the continents of Azeroth. The wanderers found themselves trapped in the Townlong Steppes, a harsh and dangerous land."]="Há muito tempo, um grupo de robustos caçadores nômades vagava pelo mundo. Por um lance do destino, eles estavam em Pandária quando a cisão separou os continentes de Azeroth. Os andarilhos se viram presos nas Estepes de Taolong, uma terra árida e perigosa."
G["Long ago, before the last great war, my father ran the Northridge Lumber Mill. It was his life, and he was committed to it. Then the war came, and as much as it pained him, we had to flee to Stormwind.\n\nWe lost a number of friends and family in those days, and it pains me to know that the Scarlet Crusade has taken the mill for their own ends.\n\nThat's why I've returned."]="Long ago, before the last great war, my father ran the Northridge Lumber Mill. It was his life, and he was committed to it. Then the war came, and as much as it pained him, we had to flee to Stormwind.\n\nWe lost a number of friends and family in those days, and it pains me to know that the Scarlet Crusade has taken the mill for their own ends.\n\nThat's why I've returned."
G["Long ago, before the last great war, my father ran the Northridge Lumber Mill. It was his life, and he was committed to it. Then the war came, and as much as it pained him, we had to flee to Stormwind.\n\nWith the passing of the Scourge and the flight of the Scarlet Crusade, however... Northridge is ours again."]="Long ago, before the last great war, my father ran the Northridge Lumber Mill. It was his life, and he was committed to it. Then the war came, and as much as it pained him, we had to flee to Stormwind.\n\nWith the passing of the Scourge and the flight of the Scarlet Crusade, however... Northridge is ours again."
G["Long ago, in a dimension of the cosmos unfathomable to mortal minds, there was born - if such a term can be used for it - a being of such unbelievable power that its very entrance into existence shattered all reality around it.\n\nKnown only as Murmur, it was the essence of sound, and to hear it speak was to know death eternal!"]="Long ago, in a dimension of the cosmos unfathomable to mortal minds, there was born - if such a term can be used for it - a being of such unbelievable power that its very entrance into existence shattered all reality around it.\n\nKnown only as Murmur, it was the essence of sound, and to hear it speak was to know death eternal!"
G["Long ago, my dryad sisters and I entered these caves to free the tortured spirit of my uncle, Zaetar. However, the corruption that had already spread through these caverns soon overcame us, and we too fell.\n\nWe were destined to wander these passages; the toxins poisoning our minds...\n\nAlthough my spirit may now be at rest, I know that I have failed in my mission. It is a great sadness I must bear..."]="Long ago, my dryad sisters and I entered these caves to free the tortured spirit of my uncle, Zaetar. However, the corruption that had already spread through these caverns soon overcame us, and we too fell.\n\nWe were destined to wander these passages; the toxins poisoning our minds...\n\nAlthough my spirit may now be at rest, I know that I have failed in my mission. It is a great sadness I must bear..."
G["Long ago, the Jade Serpent instructed me to purify my spirit and become one with the land, my doubts were vanquished."]="Há muito tempo, a Serpente de Jade me instruiu como purificar meu espírito e me tornar um com a terra, e minhas dúvidas desvaneceram."
G["Long ago, we wore one piece jumpsuits. Thanks to our innovative tailors, we no longer wear such impractical outfits. You can find these fashion lifesavers in the Trader's Tier."]="Há muito tempo, vestíamos macacões de uma peça. Graças aos nossos alfaiates inovadores, não usamos mais roupas impraticáveis. Você pode encontrar esses salva-vidas da moda no Nível do comerciante."
G["Long ago, when my people were slaves of the mogu empire, we were forbidden from carrying any weapon at all. We were not fighters. And no one believed we could fight the mogu without magic and steel."]="Há muito tempo, quando meu povo era escravo do império mogu, nós fomos proibidos de portar qualquer arma. Nós não éramos lutadores. E ninguém acreditava que poderíamos combater os mogus sem magia ou aço."
G["Long ago, when the North Wind ruled these peaks alone, a powerful taunka chieftain's brother coveted these lands for himself."]="Long ago, when the North Wind ruled these peaks alone, a powerful taunka chieftain's brother coveted these lands for himself."
G["Long ago, you were a companion to my people. We gave ourselves to evil and you were forgotten."]="Long ago, you were a companion to my people. We gave ourselves to evil and you were forgotten."
G["Long have I struggled to forgive the prince for his terrible transgressions."]="Long have I struggled to forgive the prince for his terrible transgressions."
G["Long have I waited for this day, hero. Are you and your allies prepared to bring the Lich King to justice? We charge on your command!"]="Há quanto tempo espero este dia, herói. Você e seus aliados estão preparados para levar o Rei Lich à justiça? Cobramos pelo seu envio!"
G["Long have my spirit and remains been kept captive here within Maraudon, young $c. The time has given me nothing but ample opportunities to reflect on my mistakes and realize that my jealousy of Remulos was foolish. He attempted to warn and persuade me that my relations with Theradras would bear nothing pure--that only destruction would come from chaos. My brother was right.\n\nBut that does not mean since you have freed me, I am free of penance."]="Long have my spirit and remains been kept captive here within Maraudon, young $c. The time has given me nothing but ample opportunities to reflect on my mistakes and realize that my jealousy of Remulos was foolish. He attempted to warn and persuade me that my relations with Theradras would bear nothing pure--that only destruction would come from chaos. My brother was right.\n\nBut that does not mean since you have freed me, I am free of penance."
G["Long have we craved your return! Command us in the destruction of the Legion's greatest foes!"]="Temos ansiado muito seu retorno! Ordénanos na destruição dos maiores inimigos da Legião!"
G["Long have we toiled to see our land returned to its former glory, $c. Ever shall we remain vigilant against those who have invaded and defiled Quel'thalas. We will not rest until they are driven from our sight.\n\nLet none exist who stand in the way of the sin'dorei!"]="Long have we toiled to see our land returned to its former glory, $c. Ever shall we remain vigilant against those who have invaded and defiled Quel'thalas. We will not rest until they are driven from our sight.\n\nLet none exist who stand in the way of the sin'dorei!"
G["Long is the way, and hard, the road you have traveled. Few reach such status amongst our ranks. You are a great friend of the Zandalar empire, $n.\n\nLegendary perhaps... Yes... Perhaps."]="O caminho que tem recorrido é largo, e duro. Muito poucos consiguen essa consideração em nossas fileiras. É $gun grande amigo: uma grande amiga; do Império Zandalariano, $n.\n\nTalvez, até $glegendario: lendária;... Sim... Talvez."
G["Long live $n!"]="Larga vida a $n!"
G["Long live the Dark Iron!"]="Larga vida aos Ferro Negro!"
G["Long live the Dragonmaw! Die you worthless $r!"]="Larga vida aos Faucedraco! Morre, insignificante $r!"
G["Long live the Golden Lotus!"]="Larga vida ao Loto Ouro!"
G["Long live the mighty Blackrock Clan!"]="Larga vida ao poderoso clã Rocha Negra!"
G["Long time ago, Kartak came to Frenzyheart from mountains. Rakjak fed Kartak big-tongue slaves so now Kartak not eat Frenzyheart."]="Há muito, Kartak vir a Coração Frenético desde montanhas. Rakjak dar de comer escravos línguas-grandes a Kartak, assim que agora Kartak não comer Coração Frenético."
G["Long time no see, $n. Welcome back."]="Long time no see, $n. Welcome back."
G["Long-dead fire, black and smouldering!"]="Fogo apagado, negro e moribundo!"
G["Long-lasting, well-crafted items for sale near the Hill! Come one, come all! Time is short, so make haste."]="Long-lasting, well-crafted items for sale near the Hill! Come one, come all! Time is short, so make haste."
G["Longbrow? Does that mean Yi-Mo is a descendant of Zhu?!"]="Longbrow? Does that mean Yi-Mo is a descendant of Zhu?!"
G["Longrunner, your fodder... err, people will be a valuable resource against the vrykul. Did I say resource? I meant, 'ally.'"]="Longrunner, your fodder... err, people will be a valuable resource against the vrykul. Did I say resource? I meant, 'ally.'"
G["Look - dwarves. Hah! They sulk like prairie dogs in holes in the ground."]="Look - dwarves. Hah! They sulk like prairie dogs in holes in the ground."
G["Look Lagnus, I consider you a capable man, but my patience is wearing thin. I know that Muradin is here, can you point me to him or not?!"]="Look Lagnus, I consider you a capable man, but my patience is wearing thin. I know that Muradin is here, can you point me to him or not?!"
G["Look Snowpuff, a $c's come ta save us!"]="Look Snowpuff, a $c's come ta save us!"
G["Look above you; thara dormil dorah..."]="Olhe aí cima; thara dormil dorah..."
G["Look across the aisle to those you would call enemy. Despite the hatred that separates you, there are qualities to respect in your opponent. Their prowess should be acknowledged."]="Look across the aisle to those you would call enemy. Despite the hatred that separates you, there are qualities to respect in your opponent. Their prowess should be acknowledged."
G["Look alive marines!"]="Look alive marines!"
G["Look alive, dogs! We got an operation to run here!"]="Look alive, dogs! We got an operation to run here!"
G["Look alive, lads!  The enemy has been sighted!  Form ranks immediately!"]="Eh, Soldados! Inimigo à visão! Formen fileiras imediatamente!"
G["Look alive, lads! Today might be the day we leave this cursed land! O' sweet Ironforge, how I missed ya!"]="Look alive, lads! Today might be the day we leave this cursed land! O' sweet Ironforge, how I missed ya!"
G["Look alive, men! There are orcs and worgs about!"]="Look alive, men! There are orcs and worgs about!"
G["Look alive, peasant! We've got to get these structures back up!"]="Look alive, peasant! We've got to get these structures back up!"
G["Look alive, soldier! Stormpike Intelligence has reported that a master goblin engineer has been taken prisoner by the Winterax trolls. The Frostwolf dogs are actively trying to rescue him so that they may use his engineered gadgets to destroy us! Do not let that happen."]="Pareça vivo, soldado! Stormpike Intelligence relatou que um engenheiro goblin mestre foi feito prisioneiro pelos trolls de Winterax. Os cães Lobo do Gelo estão tentando ativamente resgatá-o para que eles possam usar seus dispositivos de engenharia para nos destruir! Não deixe que isso aconteça."
G["Look alive, we've got company!"]="Look alive, we've got company!"
G["Look around and let the devastation sink in, $c. Every last troll that lived here is either dead or has fled to the upper levels.\n\nIt gets worse.\n\nIn an act of desperation, the living Drakkari trolls sacrificed their own animal gods so that they could drink from the blood of the gods and gain untold power. While they succeeded in keeping the Scourge at bay with their newfound strength, the results were catastrophic. The ancient empire of Zul'Drak lies in ruin as proof."]="Look around and let the devastation sink in, $c. Every last troll that lived here is either dead or has fled to the upper levels.\n\nIt gets worse.\n\nIn an act of desperation, the living Drakkari trolls sacrificed their own animal gods so that they could drink from the blood of the gods and gain untold power. While they succeeded in keeping the Scourge at bay with their newfound strength, the results were catastrophic. The ancient empire of Zul'Drak lies in ruin as proof."
G["Look around for new paths. Sometimes the fastest way is not the most obvious!"]="Look around for new paths. Sometimes the fastest way is not the most obvious!"
G["Look around you $c.  You are in rare company to be certain, yet still I think you need to prove yourself.  Hmm, perhaps I shall allow you to aid us in our cause at Arathi Basin.  Would you like that?"]="Look around you $c.  You are in rare company to be certain, yet still I think you need to prove yourself.  Hmm, perhaps I shall allow you to aid us in our cause at Arathi Basin.  Would you like that?"
G["Look around you, $c!\n\nIsn't it all just beautiful?"]="Olhe ao seu ao redor, $c!\n\nAcaso não é lindo?"
G["Look around you, $r. Appreciate what you see today.\n\nMuch has changed since I first stepped foot into this forest. Wonderful and unexpected changes...."]="Look around you, $r. Appreciate what you see today.\n\nMuch has changed since I first stepped foot into this forest. Wonderful and unexpected changes...."
G["Look around you, Vol'jin. This land is rich in resources: wood, stone, iron, fuel. And people."]="Olhe ao seu ao redor, Vol'jin. Esta terra é rica em recurso: madeira, pedras, ferro, combustível... e gente."
G["Look around you, brothers and sisters. Open your eyes! Look at what they have done to our kingdom!"]="Look around you, brothers and sisters. Open your eyes! Look at what they have done to our kingdom!"
G["Look around you, servant of the Horde..."]="Olhe ao seu ao redor, servidor da Horda..."
G["Look around you, shaman.  Can you see the balance of the elements in the earth, the air, the water and the fire that has touched them all?"]="Olhe ao seu redor, xamã. Você consegue ver o equilíbrio dos elementos na terra, no ar, na água e no fogo que os tocou?"
G["Look around you, younglings. This is Draenor!"]="Olhem ao seu ao redor, jovens. Isto é Draenor!"
G["Look around you. See how the waters bring life.\n\nWe are grateful for our blessings, and we rejoice in our people."]="Olhe ao seu ao redor. Contempla a vida que otorgao água.\n\nAgradecemos nossas bendições e apreciamos nosso povo."
G["Look around. They will all betray you. Flee screaming into the black forest."]="Look around. They will all betray you. Flee screaming into the black forest."
G["Look around... business is BOOMIN'!\n\nWhile Gallywix is wastin' time pickin' custom wallpaper for his Pompous Palace in the Azsharan boondocks, I'm makin' twice the coin movin' and shakin' for Big G.\n\nYou heard me: Counting houses, trade halls, construction and maintenance, the war-works, supply lines...\n\nDon't even get me STARTED on transit! Orcs can fight, but they can't move goods; my boys ship it twice as fast for half the cost! Well... when it doesn't blow up along the way, hee.\n\nAnyhow! Take a load off, huh? Enjoy yourself, spend some coin... we've got everything from money changers and laundry services to exotic drinks and fishing trainers."]="Look around... business is BOOMIN'!\n\nWhile Gallywix is wastin' time pickin' custom wallpaper for his Pompous Palace in the Azsharan boondocks, I'm makin' twice the coin movin' and shakin' for Big G.\n\nYou heard me: Counting houses, trade halls, construction and maintenance, the war-works, supply lines...\n\nDon't even get me STARTED on transit! Orcs can fight, but they can't move goods; my boys ship it twice as fast for half the cost! Well... when it doesn't blow up along the way, hee.\n\nAnyhow! Take a load off, huh? Enjoy yourself, spend some coin... we've got everything from money changers and laundry services to exotic drinks and fishing trainers."
G["Look at 'em go! Spotless!"]="Míralas! Sem uma mancha!"
G["Look at 'em, Ug. You know what those are?"]="Míralos, Ug. Sabe que são?"
G["Look at Xiao over there. He understands the value of a big belly."]="Olhe a Xiao. Ele conhece o coragem de uma grande barriga."
G["Look at all dem boxes.  What in dis box?"]="Olhar essas caixas. Que haver dentro?"
G["Look at all that slime. One is flying straight at me!"]="Look at all that slime. One is flying straight at me!"
G["Look at all the children! They bring such joy to my heart."]="Look at all the children! They bring such joy to my heart."
G["Look at all the explosions!"]="Olhe todas essas explosões!"
G["Look at all the flowers blooming. Aren't they lovely?"]="Look at all the flowers blooming. Aren't they lovely?"
G["Look at all these adorable animals!"]="Olhe todos esses animais adorables!"
G["Look at all those ripples. Lots of activity in the water so I should catch a mess of fish today."]="Look at all those ripples. Lots of activity in the water so I should catch a mess of fish today."
G["Look at da little one hurtin'!"]="Olha só aquele ali tá com dor!"
G["Look at her down there!  Just who does she think she is?"]="Mírala, ali baixo! Quem se acredita O que é?"
G["Look at him! He's always a little crabby in the morning."]="Look at him! He's always a little crabby in the morning."
G["Look at how far we've come!  Yesterday we lived in the shadows of civilization... hunted like rats!  But today!  Today... HYJAL BURNS!!!"]="Look at how far we've come!  Yesterday we lived in the shadows of civilization... hunted like rats!  But today!  Today... HYJAL BURNS!!!"
G["Look at it, Jon. It's glorious!"]="Olhe, Jon. É glorioso!"
G["Look at it, Lor'themar. It is certainly Quel'Delar."]="Olhe, Lor'themar! Sem dúvida é Quel'Delar."
G["Look at me again skeleton. I will rip your skull from your flimsy frame!"]="Look at me again skeleton. I will rip your skull from your flimsy frame!"
G["Look at me! Do I look like I would order that?!"]="Mírame! Tenho pinta de haver pedido isso?"
G["Look at me! You said I would be fine! Do I look fine?"]="Mírame! Disse que estaria bem. Você acha que estou bem?"
G["Look at me, I'm Uther Lightbringer!"]="Look at me, I'm Uther Lightbringer!"
G["Look at me, I'm Warchief Garrosh!"]="Look at me, I'm Warchief Garrosh!"
G["Look at me, peasant. Heirlooms cover my body from head to toe, gifted to me by the greatest heroes Azeroth has ever known.\n\nNow look at yourself.\n\nQuickly, look back at me.\n\nYes, this horse IS made of STARS.\n\nWhat pointless series of tasks befitting a mentally deficient orc have you prepared for me?"]="Look at me, peasant. Heirlooms cover my body from head to toe, gifted to me by the greatest heroes Azeroth has ever known.\n\nNow look at yourself.\n\nQuickly, look back at me.\n\nYes, this horse IS made of STARS.\n\nWhat pointless series of tasks befitting a mentally deficient orc have you prepared for me?"
G["Look at that handsome grouping of chaotic energies!"]="Olhe essa bonita agrupação de energias caóticas!"
G["Look at that one! He looks... weird."]="Olhe a esse! Tem uma pinta... rara."
G["Look at that!  Near the fruit carts, an ogre.  The fruit vendor is preparing for war..."]="Look at that!  Near the fruit carts, an ogre.  The fruit vendor is preparing for war..."
G["Look at that!  Someone is fighting Mushgog!"]="Eh, olhe! Há alguém lutando contra Mushgog!"
G["Look at that. How easy it must have been for Lei Shen to build an empire, for he wielded the power to create worlds."]="Look at that. How easy it must have been for Lei Shen to build an empire, for he wielded the power to create worlds."
G["Look at that. The little guy left you some purified water."]="Fíjate. O pequenhajo você saído um pouco de água purificação."
G["Look at that. This old Titan technology is acting like a magnet for the sha."]="Look at that. This old Titan technology is acting like a magnet for the sha."
G["Look at that. Your people revere their ancestors as well. And you cherish the land. We have much in common! Ah, but I see that your ancestors were nomads, whereas we Pandaren prefer the comforts of hearth and home. You'll find few travellers among us."]="Look at that. Your people revere their ancestors as well. And you cherish the land. We have much in common! Ah, but I see that your ancestors were nomads, whereas we Pandaren prefer the comforts of hearth and home. You'll find few travellers among us."
G["Look at the dust along the floor, these dark halls have not seen footfalls for many centuries."]="Look at the dust along the floor, these dark halls have not seen footfalls for many centuries."
G["Look at the peaceful, kind people of this land. They were born to belong to the Alliance."]="Look at the peaceful, kind people of this land. They were born to belong to the Alliance."
G["Look at the size of that thing! That easily has to be the biggest moth I've seen all week."]="Look at the size of that thing! That easily has to be the biggest moth I've seen all week."
G["Look at the size of these! This one is definitely a breeding male."]="Look at the size of these! This one is definitely a breeding male."
G["Look at the size of those things! What ARE they?"]="Fíjate no tamanho dessas coisas! Que são?"
G["Look at the size of your head! That should fetch me twice as much of a bounty!"]="Look at the size of your head! That should fetch me twice as much of a bounty!"
G["Look at the sky, $n! It's raining! Should be good for the crops, eh?"]="Look at the sky, $n! It's raining! Should be good for the crops, eh?"
G["Look at the wisdom and knowledge of the beast, and you will see yourself. Observe as the owl does, learn cleverness from the sabercat, embody the mighty spirit of the wolf."]="Observe a sabedoria e o conhecimento da besta e você se verá. Observe como a coruja faz, aprenda a inteligência do sabercat, personifique o poderoso espírito do lobo."
G["Look at the wonders of this city! This is magic."]="Admira que maravilhas! Isto é magia."
G["Look at them go!"]="Look at them go!"
G["Look at them, $p. They scurry like rats, veering headlong to their doom. Surely Crowley and Bloodfang can see the futility in this!"]="Look at them, $p. They scurry like rats, veering headlong to their doom. Surely Crowley and Bloodfang can see the futility in this!"
G["Look at them... all they care about is outdoing each other."]="Olhe para eles... tudo o que eles querem é superar um ao outro."
G["Look at these ruins, $p! What sort of empire built them I wonder."]="Olhe estas ruínas, $p! Me pergunto que classe de império as construiría."
G["Look at these samples! What does it mean? What does it mean? I'm going to need time, time to look at all this information. And I'll need more information. Information I can't get... damn! Think, Laris, think!\n\nWhat are you going to do? What?!\n\nThere has to be a solution!"]="Olhem estas amostras! Isso que indica? Isso que indica? Vou precisar tempo, tempo para estudar toda esta informações. E precisarei mais informações. Informações que não posso encontrar.. maldito seja! Acha, Laris, acha!\n\nQue vai fazer? Que?!\n\nTem que haver uma solução!"
G["Look at this - total amateur hour! Doesn't even have a second-stage turbine blade."]="Look at this - total amateur hour! Doesn't even have a second-stage turbine blade."
G["Look at this astounding dirt! It's so dirt-like!"]="Observa esta maravilhosa terra! Parece... terra!"
G["Look at this blade thrower.  The pride of the orcs... HAH!"]="Olhe este lanzacuchilhos. O orgulho dos orcs... JA!"
G["Look at this devastation, $c! Blood and ash, as far as the eye can see.\n\nBut nature is not so easily put down. With some effort, we may yet coax life from this scorched soil."]="Observa esta devastação, $c! Sangue e cinzas, até onde alcança a visão.\n\nMas não basta para derrotar à natureza. Com um pouco de esforço, ainda podemos fazer brotar vida desta terra arrasada."
G["Look at this devastation. These foothills have never recovered from the campaigns of the second and third wars."]="Look at this devastation. These foothills have never recovered from the campaigns of the second and third wars."
G["Look at this dishonorable creature. You smell of straw."]="Look at this dishonorable creature. You smell of straw."
G["Look at this land, Mankrik. The Horde and Alliance tear the earth apart just to claw at each other in spite."]="Look at this land, Mankrik. The Horde and Alliance tear the earth apart just to claw at each other in spite."
G["Look at this land. Now is the time to be talking about peace and exploration."]="Observa esta terra. É o momentos de falar de paz e relatório."
G["Look at this mess. I was told the Barrens would be... barren.\n\nThis jungle appeared overnight and has already swallowed up my camp and choked off the roads!"]="Look at this mess. I was told the Barrens would be... barren.\n\nThis jungle appeared overnight and has already swallowed up my camp and choked off the roads!"
G["Look at this mess... The Scourge will pay for this!"]="Olhem este desastre... O Flagelo pagará por isto!"
G["Look at this one... standing bravely with earth beneath his feet, thinking to challenge me."]="Look at this one... standing bravely with earth beneath his feet, thinking to challenge me."
G["Look at this place!"]="Mira este lugar!"
G["Look at this wise guy!"]="Míralo que pronto!"
G["Look at this!"]="Olhe isso!"
G["Look at this! A little farm, right in the middle of a town."]="Olhe isto! Uma pequena fazenda logo em meio de uma cidade."
G["Look at this, I have been beaten!  I'm going to have to brew up some ideas for next time."]="Olha só, eu fui derrotado! Vou ter que preparar algumas ideias novas para a próxima vez!"
G["Look at those boats! Where are they coming from?!"]="Olhe esses botes! De onde vêm?!"
G["Look at those crazy kids running around.  Not a care in the world."]="Look at those crazy kids running around.  Not a care in the world."
G["Look at us three. Back to da sands of old Durotar! It be just like old times."]="Olha só pra nós três. De volta nas areias de Durotar! Tipo que nem os velhos tempos."
G["Look at us, elf. Look at us. Unemployed, destitute, and drinking swill from an establishment in the sewers named after a carrion bird!"]="Look at us, elf. Look at us. Unemployed, destitute, and drinking swill from an establishment in the sewers named after a carrion bird!"
G["Look at what $n brought us!  Let's drink up!"]="Olhem o que $n nos tem trazido! Todos a beber!"
G["Look at what we have here! Another straggler from the orchard..."]="Look at what we have here! Another straggler from the orchard..."
G["Look at what you have done, death knight! You have brought glory to the Scourge!"]="Veja o que você fez, cavaleiro da morte! Você trouxe glória ao Flagelo!"
G["Look at what you made me do!"]="Look at what you made me do!"
G["Look at ya mon! You be out here all day tryin' to find em!"]="Mírate, colega! Leva fosse tudo o dia tentando encontrah'os!"
G["Look at you fight; no wonder I turned to drinking."]="Look at you fight; no wonder I turned to drinking."
G["Look at you! HAH!"]="Mírate! JA!"
G["Look at you! I'm the luckiest boyfriend on the island!!!"]="Look at you! I'm the luckiest boyfriend on the island!!!"
G["Look at you! The picture of serenity. I knew I liked you."]="Look at you! The picture of serenity. I knew I liked you."
G["Look at you, child; would-be wielder of souls... you cannot fathom the power that lies at my command!"]="Mírate, aspirante a portador de almas... Você não pode entender o poder que está a meus ordens."
G["Look at you, clean-scale. Do you want the mogu to attack you? Do you want to be their pet?\n\nProtect yourself, $gbrother:sister;. Get your filth on."]="Look at you, clean-scale. Do you want the mogu to attack you? Do you want to be their pet?\n\nProtect yourself, $gbrother:sister;. Get your filth on."
G["Look at you, you're so skinny! You need to eat more!"]="Mírate! Está nos ossos! Precisa comer mais."
G["Look behind you, $r. The hive stirs as the land that surrounds us shudders and shakes.\n\nThe time has come for me to fulfill a promise I made a thousand years past. The sands shift once more as the Qiraji plan for war."]="Look behind you, $r. The hive stirs as the land that surrounds us shudders and shakes.\n\nThe time has come for me to fulfill a promise I made a thousand years past. The sands shift once more as the Qiraji plan for war."
G["Look below - some of those thistle bears haven't been consumed yet. We're not too late."]="Look below - some of those thistle bears haven't been consumed yet. We're not too late."
G["Look below! Our continued assaults on the town and crypts have thrown the enemy into disarray. The mogu and the Zandalari already fear the might of the Horde."]="Look below! Our continued assaults on the town and crypts have thrown the enemy into disarray. The mogu and the Zandalari already fear the might of the Horde."
G["Look brothers, the Wakener is here!"]="Olhem, irmãos, o arauto está aqui!"
G["Look carefully, Lucas. The Light is strong with them. Particularly that one."]="Presta atenção, Lucas. A Luz é forte em eles. Em particular em $gaquel: aquela;."
G["Look everyone, it's $n! Hurray for $n!"]="Atenção todos, é $n! Viva $n!"
G["Look fer brittle roots stickin' out of the soil. There's good wood in 'em!"]="Look fer brittle roots stickin' out of the soil. There's good wood in 'em!"
G["Look fierce!  You are Kolkar, so act like one!"]="Mostra seu ferocidade! É $gun: uma; Kolkar, assim que actúa como tal!"
G["Look for Allen Bright at the sparring ring near the barracks.\nHe and Doctor Gustaf VanHowzen oversee the training of the isle's healers."]="Look for Allen Bright at the sparring ring near the barracks.\nHe and Doctor Gustaf VanHowzen oversee the training of the isle's healers."
G["Look for Audrey Burnhep just outside the city, north of the Dwarven District, near the lakeside cabin."]="Busca a Audrey Burnhep logo ao limite da cidade, ao norte do Distrito dos Anões, perto da cabanha a orilhas do lago."
G["Look for Brother Karman overseeing training at the combat dummies outside the barracks."]="Procure o irmão Karman que supervisiona o treinamento nos manequins de combate fosse do quartel."
G["Look for Caz Twosprocket at the smithy."]="Procure Caz Twosprocket no ferreiro."
G["Look for Faruza.  Last I saw she was standing out front between the stables and the house on the northwest end of town."]="Procure Faruza. A última vez que vi ela estava na linha de frente, entre os estábulos e a casa no extremo noroeste da cidade."
G["Look for Innkeeper Grishka in the Valley of Strength.  Her inn is on the east side, north of the main city gates."]="Procure Estalajadeiro Grishka no Vale da Força. Sua pousada fica no lado leste, ao norte dos principais portões da cidade."
G["Look for Innkeeper Pala in the building just south of the Thunder Bluff Bank on the lower rise."]="Procure Innkeeper Pala no prédio ao sul do Thunder Bluff Bank, na subida mais baixa."
G["Look for Jensen Farran near the archery range."]="Procure Jensen Farran perto da área de tiro com arco."
G["Look for Nogg's Machine Shop in the Valley of Honor northeast of Red Canyon Mining."]="Procure a Oficina de Maquinação de Nogg no Vale de Honra, a nordeste da Red Canyon Mining."
G["Look for Old Man Barlo out by Silmyr Lake, northeast of Shattrath City."]="Busca ao Velho Barlo perto do Lago Silmyr, ao nordeste da Shattrath."
G["Look for Runda.\nShe's usually just north of the barracks entrance."]="Look for Runda.\nShe's usually just north of the barracks entrance."
G["Look for Saren, in the Falconwing Square inn.\nYou'll find him upstairs, near the kitchens."]="Look for Saren, in the Falconwing Square inn.\nYou'll find him upstairs, near the kitchens."
G["Look for Sayoc and Hanashi at the Valley of Honor inside Arms of Legend.  Watch your tongue around them or Sayoc may decide to give a piece of you as a snack to Grinning Dog."]="Procure Sayoc e Hanashi no Vale da Honra dentro de Arms of Legend. Observe sua língua ao redor deles ou Sayoc pode decidir dar um pedaço de você como um lanche para o Cão Sorridente."
G["Look for Tarshaw Jaggedscar in the barracks on the east side of town."]="Procure Tarshaw Jaggedscar no quartel no lado leste da cidade."
G["Look for The Wyvern's Tail, just outside the Hall of the Brave."]="Procure o The Wyvern's Tail, do lado de fosse do Hall of the Brave."
G["Look for Theoden Manners at the top of Lady Proudmoore's tower."]="Procure Theoden Manners no topo da torre de Lady Proudmoore."
G["Look for Yelmak's Alchemy and Potions.  Find it in the middle of The Drag, west of the huge tree."]="Procure Alquimia e Poções de Yelmak. Encontre-o no meio de The Drag, a oeste da enorme árvore."
G["Look for a fellow by the name of Milo Geartwinge.  I suppose I'll see what I can do about this cave-in."]="Busca a um tipo que se chama Milo Tocamotores. Verei o que posso fazer com esse desabe."
G["Look for idols south of here at the Deeper and Camp Broketooth."]="Look for idols south of here at the Deeper and Camp Broketooth."
G["Look for it high up on the west side of the Valley of Strength."]="Procure no alto, no lado oeste do Vale da Força."
G["Look for my Blacktalon Quartermaster here in the tavern. He can resupply you with any rewards I have given you previously... for a price of course. As you no doubt have noticed, the materials I work with are not at all cheap."]="Look for my Blacktalon Quartermaster here in the tavern. He can resupply you with any rewards I have given you previously... for a price of course. As you no doubt have noticed, the materials I work with are not at all cheap."
G["Look for the eastern Zeppelin Landing Tower outside of the city to the southeast."]="Procure a Torre Zeppelin Landing oriental, fosse da cidade, a sudeste."
G["Look for the mounds of glowing stuff on the ground."]="Busca no chão montes de matéria brilhante."
G["Look for the orc Varzok atop the city's central mesa, just east of the Flight Master."]="Busca ao orc Varzok na meseta central da cidade, logo ao este do mestre de voo."
G["Look for the potion-shaped door to the Agronomical Apothecary in the Magus Commerce Exchange, northwest Dalaran. It's quite impossible to miss!"]="Procure a porta em forma de poção para o Boticário Agronômico na Magus Commerce Exchange, noroeste de Dalaran. É absolutamente impossível perder!"
G["Look for the shackles around the edges of the oubliette. There should be three."]="Look for the shackles around the edges of the oubliette. There should be three."
G["Look here! He left his weapon behind."]="Olhe isto! Tem saído seu arma."
G["Look here! It's the history of Zian of the Endless Shadow, a powerful sorcerer who kept the kingdoms in check through terror and darkness."]="Olhe isto! É a história de Zian da Sombra Infinita, um poderoso feiticeiro que sembró o terror e a escuridão em todos os reinos."
G["Look here, if you don't tell me about the fire--"]="Olhe, se não me contas o do fogo..."
G["Look here, lad. I admire your dedication, but I'm not sure how to tell you this... You're an ogre, son."]="Olhe rapaz, admiro seu dedicação mas não se como dizer isto... Filho, é um ogro."
G["Look how big and ugly he is!"]="Look how big and ugly he is!"
G["Look how big that thing is!"]="Olhe que grande é essa coisa!"
G["Look how slow your boat go."]="Look how slow your boat go."
G["Look how they fall, like so many blades of grass in the wind."]="Look how they fall, like so many blades of grass in the wind."
G["Look in the waters that divide this island, but be warned: the stinkhorn striker makes its home in the waters of the river."]="Olhe para as águas que dividem esta ilha, mas esteja avisado: o atacante stinkhorn fica nas águas do rio."
G["Look inside the Gallows' End Tavern's main dining room for Austil de Mon.  The tavern is on the southeast edge of Brill."]="Olhe dentro da sala de jantar principal da Gallows 'End Tavern para ver Austil de Mon. A taberna fica na extremidade sudeste de Brill."
G["Look inside yourself and cleanse the darkness within."]="Olhe no seu interior e purifica a escuridão."
G["Look into my eyes... Find your death within..."]="Mírame aos olhos... Encontre a morte dentro..."
G["Look it's the Skyguard!!"]="Olhem, é a Guarda do céu!"
G["Look like, my lady? A vrykul, I suppose. They did not actually show him to me. Ever since The Shadow Vault...."]="Look like, my lady? A vrykul, I suppose. They did not actually show him to me. Ever since The Shadow Vault...."
G["Look lively there, Grizwald."]="Mais rápido, Grizwald."
G["Look lively! Keep firing!"]="Que não decaiga! Sigam disparando!"
G["Look lively, mates!"]="Look lively, mates!"
G["Look man, I only need to know one thing, where they are."]="Olhe tio, somente preciso saber uma coisa: onde estão?"
G["Look mon, Alliance filth washed up from Theramore. Kill it!"]="Olha, cara, escória da Aliança vindo de Theramore. Mata!"
G["Look no further than Saltheril's little celebration if you're after the enchanter Eredania. She received her invitation a few days ago."]="Não procure mais, a pequena comemoração de Saltheril se você estiver atrás da encantadora Eredania. Ela recebeu o convite há algum dias."
G["Look no further than the Lion's Pride Inn in Goldshire.  With a wide selection of ales and soft down beds you, couldn't ask for a better place to rest."]="Não procure mais, o Lion's Pride Inn, em Goldshire. Com uma ampla seleção de cervejas e camas macias, você não poderia pedir um lugar melhor para descansar."
G["Look out - Dragonmaw ambush!"]="Atenção! Emboscada dos Faucedraco!"
G["Look out - Dragonmaw!"]="Atenção! Faucedraco!"
