G["Look out for the dwarf, Kerik, outside Theramore's smithy.\nHe's a drunkard and a bit free with the explosives, but he's friendly enough and knows his way around a mine."]="Look out for the dwarf, Kerik, outside Theramore's smithy.\nHe's a drunkard and a bit free with the explosives, but he's friendly enough and knows his way around a mine."
