G["Look over here, $c! I got somethin' for ya. Just what ya need. It's soap, right... and it's on a rope! No offense, $G man:honey;, but yer a little ripe, know what I'm sayin'?"]="Look over here, $c! I got somethin' for ya. Just what ya need. It's soap, right... and it's on a rope! No offense, $G man:honey;, but yer a little ripe, know what I'm sayin'?"
G["Look sharp troops! Varedis is known for conducting surprise inspections."]="Atentas, tropas! Varedis é conhecido por realizar inspecções surpresa."
