G["Look through the spyglass."]="Olhe pela luneta."
G["Look to the seas, as your doom comes with the swell of tides."]="Look to the seas, as your doom comes with the swell of tides."
G["Look to the southeast and you will see the thane upon the platform near Gjonner the Merciless when he shows himself. Let him come down.  Stay within the ring of Valhalas."]="Look to the southeast and you will see the thane upon the platform near Gjonner the Merciless when he shows himself. Let him come down.  Stay within the ring of Valhalas."
G["Look to this fallen dragon, $r. The might of the Horde is unquestionable!"]="Olhe ao dragão caído, $r. O poder da Horda é incuestionable!"
G["Look to this ravaged field and know the power that the elements hold, $r."]="Olhe este campo arrasado e sente o poder dos elementos, $r."
G["Look up to the heavens, $c. The Dragonflights have not been seen in this area for a thousand years! Those Qiraji are up to something, I just know it!"]="Look up to the heavens, $c. The Dragonflights have not been seen in this area for a thousand years! Those Qiraji are up to something, I just know it!"
G["Look upon me and you see death incarnate, the unmaker of worlds."]="Mírame e verá a morte encarnada, a aniquiladora de mundos."
G["Look upon the field, Highlord. The Lich King has halted your advance completely and won the upper hand!"]="Look upon the field, Highlord. The Lich King has halted your advance completely and won the upper hand!"
G["Look upon the true face of death, and know that your end comes soon!"]="Look upon the true face of death, and know that your end comes soon!"
G["Look upon the world, Cliffwalker, and see the might of the Horde!"]="Look upon the world, Cliffwalker, and see the might of the Horde!"
G["Look upon what you have accomplished, soldiers! Even the Legion's most fearsome machines are no match for the Horde!"]="Olhem o que vocês têm conseguido, soldados! Inclusive as mais temibles máquinas da Legião não são rival para a Horda!"
G["Look what I have to work with. Szabo can perform miracles?\n\n<Szabo sighs>\n\nYes, yes. Szabo thinks he can do something with you."]="Look what I have to work with. Szabo can perform miracles?\n\n<Szabo sighs>\n\nYes, yes. Szabo thinks he can do something with you."
G["Look what Wikky found!"]="Look what Wikky found!"
