G["Look! There's a mook-mook right there!"]="Olhe! Há um muk-muk aí!"
G["Look! What's a frostwyrm doing here? It's coming straight for us."]="Look! What's a frostwyrm doing here? It's coming straight for us."
G["Look, \"Chen Stormstout,\" we all can't be heroes, running from our responsibilities, tromping around the Dread Wastes, saving the world. Some of us are \"Artists.\""]="Look, \"Chen Stormstout,\" we all can't be heroes, running from our responsibilities, tromping around the Dread Wastes, saving the world. Some of us are \"Artists.\""
G["Look, $c. Here's the thing. Toys and lights and bundles of holiday herbs don't make THEMSELVES, you know. So ENOUGH with the Helper summoning, PLEASE."]="Look, $c. Here's the thing. Toys and lights and bundles of holiday herbs don't make THEMSELVES, you know. So ENOUGH with the Helper summoning, PLEASE."
G["Look, $n, the hourglass has revealed Nozdormu!"]="Olhe, $n, o relógio de arena tem mostrado a Nozdormu!"
G["Look, $n. The beast stirs from its lair!"]="Olhe, $n. A fera sai do seu covil!"
G["Look, $r.  I see man and orc, chained up as slaves, mining Nespirah's pearls.  And I see naga holding the whip.  Something must be done."]="Look, $r.  I see man and orc, chained up as slaves, mining Nespirah's pearls.  And I see naga holding the whip.  Something must be done."
G["Look, Anren! $n has come to help us!"]="Olhe, Anren! $n tem vindo a nos ajudar!"
G["Look, I don't know, okay? I don't know!\n\nI just got paid to make rockets that deliver an airborne chemical payload, and that's what I did. Job's done, pal. They're all made, packaged, and sent off. I got the money and I was TRYING to enjoy myself a little when you started chasing me all over town.  I don't have any more of that chemical and I don't know what it was."]="Look, I don't know, okay? I don't know!\n\nI just got paid to make rockets that deliver an airborne chemical payload, and that's what I did. Job's done, pal. They're all made, packaged, and sent off. I got the money and I was TRYING to enjoy myself a little when you started chasing me all over town.  I don't have any more of that chemical and I don't know what it was."
G["Look, I see some of Suna's things! She must have made camp here. But where is she?"]="Look, I see some of Suna's things! She must have made camp here. But where is she?"
G["Look, I'll sell you shields today, but no maces. The last thing I want is for some innocent to get brained by one of my weapons."]="Look, I'll sell you shields today, but no maces. The last thing I want is for some innocent to get brained by one of my weapons."
G["Look, I'm sorry, I really am, but all of my food is fresh!"]="Olhe, Sinto muito de verdade, mas toda meu comida é fresca!"
G["Look, Uyen, it's a $c. You here to help, $g mister : miss; $c?"]="Olhe, Uyen, é $gun: uma; $c. Tem vindo a nos ajudar, $gsenhor: senhora; $c?"
G["Look, a stranger."]="Olhem, $gun estranho: uma estranha;."
G["Look, don't ask me how I found it. Just toss  it onto that big blue bonfire and destroy Yngwie's soul before it's too late!"]="Look, don't ask me how I found it. Just toss  it onto that big blue bonfire and destroy Yngwie's soul before it's too late!"
G["Look, here he comes now! How was the brewery, Uncle?"]="Olhe, aí vem! Que tal na cervejaria, tio?"
G["Look, here's the deal. You keep yammerin' and I stop hammerin'."]="Look, here's the deal. You keep yammerin' and I stop hammerin'."
G["Look, if I've told ya once, I've told ya a hundred times: WE CANNOT HELP YOU!"]="Look, if I've told ya once, I've told ya a hundred times: WE CANNOT HELP YOU!"
G["Look, if you want to go talk to those engineers on the outer ring of the Rogues' Quarter, it's your hide."]="Olha, se você quer falar com os engenheiros no anel externo do Bairro dos Ladinos, é à sua pele."
G["Look, in my business, discretion is important. I shouldn't be talking about this at all."]="Olhe, na minha negócios a discreção é muito importantes. Nem sequer deveria estar falando de isto."
G["Look, it $n!"]="Mira, $n!"
G["Look, it works."]="Mira, funciona."
G["Look, it's $n!"]="Olhe, é $n!"
G["Look, it's $n, savior of Binan Village!"]="Olhe, é $n, $gel salvador: a salvadora; da Aldeia Binan!"
G["Look, it's not my fault that Tinky took off. This thing's her baby... I've just watched her keep it going on spit and glue."]="Look, it's not my fault that Tinky took off. This thing's her baby... I've just watched her keep it going on spit and glue."
G["Look, just at the water's surface!"]="Olhe, na superfície da água!"
G["Look, look! Weird, bumpy carrot!"]="Look, look! Weird, bumpy carrot!"
G["Look, look, it's okay! It's just a tiny little glitch. See?"]="Olhe, olhe, está bem! É somente um minúsculo falho de sistema. Vê?"
G["Look, man, they didn't live to be writin' about it, okay?!"]="Escúchame, ninguém tem sobrevivido e pediu escrever sobre eles, o entende?!"
G["Look, mom! A spirit! See? See?"]="Olhe, mamãe. Um espírito! O vê? O vê?"
G["Look, mortal, upon the instrument of your undoing. (The Hammer, hand of the Gods Below.) Forged of molten blood... (...gift of the master. His gift!) Shaped upon the Last Altar of Storm."]="Observa, mortal, o instrumento que provocará seu morte. (O Martelo, a mão dos deuses de baixo.) Forjado com sangue fundida... (... don do mestre. Seu don!)... talhado no último Altar da Tempestade."
G["Look, one of the eggs hatched!"]="Look, one of the eggs hatched!"
G["Look, pretty girl, look! The nice $r brought some kafa treats for you!"]="Look, pretty girl, look! The nice $r brought some kafa treats for you!"
G["Look, slave thing... Goregek got stung by big bad wasp queen once. Goregek all done with wasps."]="Look, slave thing... Goregek got stung by big bad wasp queen once. Goregek all done with wasps."
G["Look, someone's attacking Sentinel Hill. C'mon guards, you just hafta win!"]="Olhe, alguém está atacando a Colina do Sentinela. Vamos, guardas, têm que ganhar!"
G["Look, stranger, I'll tell you the same thing I told the honorable Lorewalker...\n\n<Mann leans in closer with each word, her eyes widening.>\n\nI. Have. No. Jade!"]="Look, stranger, I'll tell you the same thing I told the honorable Lorewalker...\n\n<Mann leans in closer with each word, her eyes widening.>\n\nI. Have. No. Jade!"
G["Look, sweetheart.  No one's talking about storming Tempest Keep ourselves, but when we see a target of opportunity we have to take it."]="Look, sweetheart.  No one's talking about storming Tempest Keep ourselves, but when we see a target of opportunity we have to take it."
G["Look, the warchief's sent us some entertainment!"]="Olhem, o Chefe de Guerra nos tem enviada um pouco de diversão!"
G["Look, there! By Hive'Regal! Is that... a sandworm?!"]="Olhe, ali! Ao lado de Colme'régia! Isso é... um me ver de arena?"
G["Look, there's $n!"]="Olhe, aí está $n!"
G["Look, there's a weed now! Go pull it!"]="Olhe, aí há uma mal erva! Arráncala!"
G["Look, up ahead - an Alliance bomber!"]="Look, up ahead - an Alliance bomber!"
G["Look. A stranger. I wonder if $g he's : she's; come to save us from the yaungol."]="Look. A stranger. I wonder if $g he's : she's; come to save us from the yaungol."
G["Look. You don't even WANNA know the sorta stuff I could teach ya.\n\nSeriously. It'd melt yer brain. Go play nice somewhere else."]="Ouça. Não que nem saber o tipo de coisas que poderá ensinar.\n\nEm sério, te derretiríao cérebro. Vá embora a jogar por aí."
G["Lookie here, ma, it's $n. We was just talkin' 'bout you."]="Olhe, mamãe, é $n. Logo estávamos falando de ti."
G["Lookie what Zebu'tan got for you! Roses for da rose!"]="Lookie what Zebu'tan got for you! Roses for da rose!"
G["Lookin' for some punishment?"]="Procurando algum castigo?"
G["Lookin' good, kid.\n\nWhat's the word? Up for some trainin'?"]="Lookin' good, kid.\n\nWhat's the word? Up for some trainin'?"
G["Lookin' mighty cris, me bucko!  Ye pillage a fat sutler?  Best ye spread da wealth... don't be a craven choke puppy, mon!"]="Olhando poderoso cris, me bucko! Pilhar um sutler gordo? Melhor você espalhar a riqueza... não seja um filhote de filhote afogado, seg!"
G["Lookin' to be an engineer, eh? Well, by Muradin, ye've come to the right place!"]="Parecendo ser um engenheiro, não é? Bem, por Muradin, você veio ao lugar certo!"
G["Lookin' to scrap?"]="Procurando sucata?"
G["Lookin' to take a gryphon ride, eh? Dungar keeps his birds up on the rampart in the Trade District. Just remember to hold on tight!"]="Lookin' to take a gryphon ride, eh? Dungar keeps his birds up on the rampart in the Trade District. Just remember to hold on tight!"
G["Looking around for help, %s sighs."]="Busca ajuda, %s suspira"
G["Looking around, %s frowns at what he considers the overreactions of his compatriots."]="Looking around, %s frowns at what he considers the overreactions of his compatriots."
G["Looking at these energy levels, Shaffar was set to make a killing!"]="Looking at these energy levels, Shaffar was set to make a killing!"
G["Looking for Diya, wandering among the images around the Seat of the Naaru. She will be more than happy to help you."]="Looking for Diya, wandering among the images around the Seat of the Naaru. She will be more than happy to help you."
G["Looking for Shenthul of the Shadowswift Brotherhood, huh?  In The Drag across from Droffers and Son Salvage look for a tunnel leading down into the Cleft of Shadow."]="Procurando por Shenthul da Irmandade Shadowswift, não é? Em The Drag, em linha de frente a Droffers e São Salvage, procure um túnel que leva até a Fenda das Sombras."
G["Looking for a lapidary? Our jewelcrafters are in the Exodar, using the materials they have uncovered to work wonders. Speak with Farii when you arrive."]="Procurando um lapidário? Nossos joalheiros estão no Exodar, usando os materiais que descobriram para fazer maravilhas. Fale com Farii quando chegar."
G["Looking for a professions trainer?\n\nThe zen master trainers can be found all across Pandaria. Tell me who you are looking for.\n\nIf you cannot find the person you seek here in Pandaria, you may also seek professions masters in your home city. They should also be able to improve your skill in your craft."]="Ouvidos a um instrutor de profissão?\n\nOs instrutores mestres zen se encontram por toda Pandaria. Diga a quem atenção.\n\nSe não encontrar à pessoa que atenção aqui, em Pandaria, sempre pode falar com os mestres do seu capital. Também devem poder melhorar seu habilidade na profissão que tem escolhido."
G["Looking for a ride?"]="Procurando uma carona?"
G["Looking for a tabard?"]="Procurando um tabard?"
G["Looking for an Arena Battlemaster? You can find them on the road between towns, or in the capitals.\n\nYou can bind here, at me. I can also teleport you to one of the capitals."]="Looking for an Arena Battlemaster? You can find them on the road between towns, or in the capitals.\n\nYou can bind here, at me. I can also teleport you to one of the capitals."
G["Looking for food and brew, stranger? We've got it right here at Halfhill Market."]="Looking for food and brew, stranger? We've got it right here at Halfhill Market."
G["Looking for general goods? Bonni will have what you need. She sells her wares at the Golden Lantern. I will mark the location on your map."]="Looking for general goods? Bonni will have what you need. She sells her wares at the Golden Lantern. I will mark the location on your map."
G["Looking for general goods? Marli Two-Toes will have what you need. He is located inside summer's rest. I will mark the location on your map."]="Looking for general goods? Marli Two-Toes will have what you need. He is located inside summer's rest. I will mark the location on your map."
G["Looking for meat? I've got plenty right here.\n\nOn my grill, I mean."]="Ouvidos carne? Eu tenho muita.\n\nna grelha, quero dizer."
G["Looking for some brew, eh? The Keggary is the place to go for fine ales! I'll mark it on your map."]="Ouvidos cerveja, eh? As melhores estão na Bodega! Te a marcarei no mapa."
G["Looking for some brew, eh? Well, there are two brewmasters who wander around the city selling their excellent ales.\n\nIf you don't run into them, then Hara Alebelly up at the Nightingale Lounge or Sarya Teaflower in the inn can fix you right up."]="Looking for some brew, eh? Well, there are two brewmasters who wander around the city selling their excellent ales.\n\nIf you don't run into them, then Hara Alebelly up at the Nightingale Lounge or Sarya Teaflower in the inn can fix you right up."
G["Looking for some training, eh? I could train you better then anyone in Stormwind but the guard prohibits it. I guess you will have to settle for one of those has beens hanging out around the Barracks or at the Pig and Whistle Tavern in Old Town."]="Procurando algum treinamento, hein? Eu poderia treiná-o melhor do que qualquer um em Stormwind, mas o guarda o proíbe. Acho que você terá que se contentar com uma dessas cervejas espalhadas pelo quartel ou na taberna Pig and Whistle, na cidade velha."
G["Looking for something to eat, $c?\n\nOr just a place to rest your weary bones for a while?"]="Ouvidos algo para comer, $c?\n\nOU tão somente um lugar onde descansar um tempo seus cansados ossos?"
G["Looking for the old steam tonks?\n\nWell, we've got some new ones for you to enjoy.\n\nNormally, it would cost two tokens to use a tonk remote.  But because of your military service, you get a discounted rate of one token.\n\nWe at the Darkmoon Faire thank you for your service."]="Looking for the old steam tonks?\n\nWell, we've got some new ones for you to enjoy.\n\nNormally, it would cost two tokens to use a tonk remote.  But because of your military service, you get a discounted rate of one token.\n\nWe at the Darkmoon Faire thank you for your service."
G["Looking for the perfect Winter Veil gift, $c, or are you just here to treat yourself?"]="Ouvidos o presente perfeito para o Festival do Inverno, $c, ou tem vindo para dar a você um capricho?"
G["Looking for these???? You'll never have em!"]="Looking for these???? You'll never have em!"
G["Looking for this: [Red Scepter Shard]? Come and get it..."]="Looking for this: [Red Scepter Shard]? Come and get it..."
G["Looking over, you see the obsidian-flecked mud that you collected from the lava beds.  This will be used to color your disguise."]="Olhando por cima, você vê a lama manchada de obsidiana que você coletou dos leitos de lava. Isso será usado para colorir seu disfarce."
G["Looking through the portal only nets you an eye full of sand.  A pool of water surrounded by desert ruins is all that you can make out.  Where could this portal lead?"]="Looking through the portal only nets you an eye full of sand.  A pool of water surrounded by desert ruins is all that you can make out.  Where could this portal lead?"
G["Looking to be a great warrior?  War does not make one great.  Still, you will find our great warrior trainers on the Warriors' Terrace, overlooking the rest of the Trader's Tier."]="Procurando ser um grande guerreiro? A guerra não faz uma grande. Ainda assim, você encontrará nossos grandes treinadores de guerreiros no Terraço dos Guerreiros, com visão para o restante do Nível do Negociador."
G["Looking to find the Anglers Quartermaster? That would be Nat Pagle. You can find him at the Anglers Wharf in Krasarang Wilds.\n\nLet me mark the location on your map for you."]="Looking to find the Anglers Quartermaster? That would be Nat Pagle. You can find him at the Anglers Wharf in Krasarang Wilds.\n\nLet me mark the location on your map for you."
G["Looking to fly somewhere?  Anette Williams, in the western part of town, can get you there on one of her trained bats."]="Looking to fly somewhere?  Anette Williams, in the western part of town, can get you there on one of her trained bats."
G["Looking to learn how to use a new weapon?  Find Sayoc and Hanashi inside Arms of Legend in the Valley of Honor."]="Quer aprender a usar uma nova arma? Encontre Sayoc e Hanashi dentro de Arms of Legend no Valley of Honra."
G["Looking to learn how to work an anvil and hammer, eh?  Karn Stonehoof can teach you how.  He has a smithy set up on the lower rise by the pond."]="Quer aprender a trabalhar com bigorna e martelo, não é? Karn Stonehoof pode ensinar como. Ele tem uma ferraria montada na subida mais baixa do lago."
G["Looking to rush to your death at the broken pillar? You're all alone in that one."]="Looking to rush to your death at the broken pillar? You're all alone in that one."
G["Looking to take a ride on a gryphon, now are ye?  Gryth Thurden is the one ye'll want to be seeing about that.  \nYe can find him on the eastern side of The Great Forge in the middle of Ironforge."]="Looking to take a ride on a gryphon, now are ye?  Gryth Thurden is the one ye'll want to be seeing about that.  \nYe can find him on the eastern side of The Great Forge in the middle of Ironforge."
G["Looks dead to me. Not much use to us like this. You'd better go back and tell Krog what happened."]="Me parece que morreu. Assim nos servirá de pouco. Será melhor que regreses e lhe digas a Krog o que tem acontecido."
G["Looks good for you...and bad for me."]="Parece bom para você... e ruim para mim."
G["Looks good so far."]="Não está mal."
G["Looks just like all the other titan archives me lads have found... only older... and bigger."]="Looks just like all the other titan archives me lads have found... only older... and bigger."
G["Looks just powerful enough to carry one gnome.  Maybe two."]="Parece poderoso o suficiente para carregar um gnomo. Talvez dois."
G["Looks like $n passed out. What should we do, Tirion?"]="Looks like $n passed out. What should we do, Tirion?"
G["Looks like I found us a savory and clean piece of dirt! Tonight we eat like kings, Mr. Penguin! Of course I'll share it with you! You're my best friend!"]="Looks like I found us a savory and clean piece of dirt! Tonight we eat like kings, Mr. Penguin! Of course I'll share it with you! You're my best friend!"
G["Looks like I left you earthbound!"]="Parece que eu lhe tomei as asas!"
G["Looks like I made it just in time!"]="Parece que e chegado logo a tempo!"
G["Looks like I need more practice!"]="pelo visto preciso de mais prática!"
G["Looks like I owe you another one."]="Parece que te devo outra."
G["Looks like I picked a bad day to stop drinking."]="Me parece que e escolhido um mal dia para deixar de beber."
G["Looks like I picked the wrong day to quit mana tapping..."]="Parece que escogí o dia enganado para deixar explotar mana..."
G["Looks like I picked the wrong day to stop killin' fel orcs."]="Parece que escolhi o dia errado para parar de matar orcs vis."
G["Looks like I'll have to get my drink elsewhere."]="Parece que terei que conseguir meu bebida em outra parte."
G["Looks like I'm an underachiever."]="Parece que sou um seudotriunfador."
G["Looks like I'm doing this myself. Good!"]="Parece que vou ter que fazer isso eu. Bem!"
G["Looks like I'm in the market for a new assistant."]="Looks like I'm in the market for a new assistant."
G["Looks like Skarr has found his next challenger!  Wouldn't want to be in that poor fool's shoes!"]="Looks like Skarr has found his next challenger!  Wouldn't want to be in that poor fool's shoes!"
G["Looks like a last ditch effort by the stone troggs. Your destination is just around the corner!"]="Looks like a last ditch effort by the stone troggs. Your destination is just around the corner!"
G["Looks like a storm's coming in, Scruffy..."]="Parece que vai haver tempestade, Desalinhado..."
G["Looks like dis one has a bit of a sting!"]="Acho que o teu bicho se picou desta aqui pra melhor!"
G["Looks like he sprung a leak!"]="Parece que tem uma fuga!"
G["Looks like he's about to explode!"]="Parece que está a ponto de explodir!"
G["Looks like he's got a little bit o' that water stuck in his gills. I'll just scoop some of this up..."]="Looks like he's got a little bit o' that water stuck in his gills. I'll just scoop some of this up..."
G["Looks like it's going to be one of those days."]="Parece que vai ser um dos esses dias."
G["Looks like it's just you, me, and those two Earthen Ringers over at the mine. Let's work fast, $n, before we're discovered."]="Parece que somente estamos você, eu e esses dois membros do Anel da Terra da mina. Actuemos rápido, $n, antes de que nos descubran."
G["Looks like it's time for the grunts to clean out the Drag and the Cleft of Shadow again."]="Parece que já é hora de que os brutos limpem novamente a Calhe Maior e o Circo das Sombras."
G["Looks like it's time for the guards to clean out Old Town again."]="Parece que já é hora de que os guardas limpem novamente o Casco Antigo."
G["Looks like it's time to Randall P. jump."]="Parece que é hora de saltar."
G["Looks like it's time to let you out of this cage."]="Looks like it's time to let you out of this cage."
G["Looks like me boys need a hand!"]="Looks like me boys need a hand!"
G["Looks like my Sugar Beets still need more water! Turn back!"]="Looks like my Sugar Beets still need more water! Turn back!"
G["Looks like my fuse... went out..."]="Parece que meu detonador... se tem disparado..."
G["Looks like my work here is done. Report back to the holo-image of Ameer over at the transponder."]="Parece que meu trabalho aqui terminou. Relatório à holo-imagem de Ameer no transpondedor."
G["Looks like somebody's getting a special delivery."]="Parece que alguém tem recebido um pacote especial."
G["Looks like that hurt!"]="Parece que isso dói!"
G["Looks like the Furlbrow's were murdered..."]="Parece que os Cejade foram asesinados..."
G["Looks like the Scourge have hit the area ahead pretty bad..."]="Parece que o Flagelo tem causado estragos em essa zona de aí linha de frente..."
G["Looks like the Southsea Freebooters are heavily entrenched on the coast. This could get rough."]="Looks like the Southsea Freebooters are heavily entrenched on the coast. This could get rough."
G["Looks like the battle's about to get under way, that's my cue to leave. We'll have to pick this up later."]="Parece que se aproxima a batalha, o qual me diz que é hora de que marche. Teremos que coletar isto depois."
G["Looks like the crew here is in trouble."]="A tripulação tem problemas."
G["Looks like the deck swabbing assignments from the day of the battle."]="Parecem as asignações de fregado da coberta do dia da batalha."
G["Looks like the king got himself a new court jester!"]="Looks like the king got himself a new court jester!"
G["Looks like the last of the goods we've collected are shipping out to Silithus over the next $2113w days. And once that's done, someone will have to come along and ring the gong on the Scarab Dais, outside of Ahn'Qiraj, to open the gates. That's when our bandages will come in handy."]="Parece que os últimos suprimentos que reunimos serão enviados para Silithus nos próximos $2113w dias. Depois disso, alguém terá de tocar o gongo no Pavilhão do Escaravelho, nos arredores de Ahn'Qiraj, para abrir os portões. É aí que nossas bandagens serão úteis."
G["Looks like the last of the goods we've collected is going to be shipped out to Silithus sometime in the next day. And once that's done, someone will have to come along and ring the gong on the Scarab Dais, outside of Ahn'Qiraj, to open the gates. That's when our bandages will come in handy."]="Looks like the last of the goods we've collected is going to be shipped out to Silithus sometime in the next day. And once that's done, someone will have to come along and ring the gong on the Scarab Dais, outside of Ahn'Qiraj, to open the gates. That's when our bandages will come in handy."
G["Looks like the mook-mooks went away. For now. You should go talk to boss Mudclaw."]="Looks like the mook-mooks went away. For now. You should go talk to boss Mudclaw."
G["Looks like there be only $2113w more days left to fish until all this here war materiel is shipped over to the Silithus desert mon. Then they's gonna be getting' it all ready, and someone is gonna have to ring that gong down south of Cenarion Hold there to open them gates and be startin' the war."]="Parece que restam apenas $2113w em dias para pescar até que tudo esse materiais de guerra seja enviado para o deserto de Silithus. Então eles estarão preparando tudo, e alguém terá que tocar aquele gongo ao sul de Cenarion. Segure lá para abrir os portões e começar a guerra."
G["Looks like there be only one more day left to fish until all this here war materiel is shipped over to the Silithus desert mon. Then they's gonna be getting' it all ready, and someone is gonna have to ring that gong down south of Cenarion Hold there to open them gates and be startin' the war."]="Looks like there be only one more day left to fish until all this here war materiel is shipped over to the Silithus desert mon. Then they's gonna be getting' it all ready, and someone is gonna have to ring that gong down south of Cenarion Hold there to open them gates and be startin' the war."
G["Looks like they couldn't handle the taste of Alliance steel. Good work, $n."]="Parece que não lhes tem gostado testar o aço da Aliança. Bom trabalho, $n."
G["Looks like they found their way back home.  I'm relieved.\n\nYou came back, too!  Are you interested in joining us?"]="Parece que têm encontrado o caminho de volta a casa. Que alívio.\n\nE você também voltou! Te interesse se juntar a nós?"
G["Looks like they really put the cart..."]="Looks like they really put the cart..."
G["Looks like things are finally starting to calm down."]="Looks like things are finally starting to calm down."
G["Looks like this is it, boss-$g man : lady;. It's been a real honor. I'm sure we'll see each other again real soon."]="Looks like this is it, boss-$g man : lady;. It's been a real honor. I'm sure we'll see each other again real soon."
G["Looks like this is it, boss-$g man : lady;. It's been a real honor. I'm sure we'll see each other again real soon.\n\nJust let me know when you're ready to head out for Orgrimmar."]="Looks like this is it, boss-$g man : lady;. It's been a real honor. I'm sure we'll see each other again real soon.\n\nJust let me know when you're ready to head out for Orgrimmar."
G["Looks like we blessed by Great Ones! Shrines give magic, make us high-oracle someday? Maybe?"]="Looks like we blessed by Great Ones! Shrines give magic, make us high-oracle someday? Maybe?"
G["Looks like we did it! We're in the clear!"]="Acho que o temos conseguido! Tudo abriu!"
G["Looks like we do this the hard way. Let's go!"]="Ao parecer teremos que fazer isso pelas mais! Vamos!"
G["Looks like we got a war to win."]="Parece que temos uma guerra que ganhar."
G["Looks like we have as many lean wolf steaks as the Horde wants. They told me to pack up what we have here and ready it to be shipped it out to Cenarion Hold in Silithus. But it looks like some of the others here might still be collecting whatever it is that they're in charge of. Go bug one of them."]="Looks like we have as many lean wolf steaks as the Horde wants. They told me to pack up what we have here and ready it to be shipped it out to Cenarion Hold in Silithus. But it looks like some of the others here might still be collecting whatever it is that they're in charge of. Go bug one of them."
G["Looks like we have our work cut out for us..."]="Já sabemos o que temos que fazer."
G["Looks like we have room for one more... no, my mistake.  That's a seven not a one.  Hope you're good with a sword - report to the barracks."]="Looks like we have room for one more... no, my mistake.  That's a seven not a one.  Hope you're good with a sword - report to the barracks."
G["Looks like we won't get away so easily.  Get ready!"]="Parece que não escaparemos tão facilmente. Preparem-se!"
G["Looks like we'll be eating shoe leather for dinner again."]="Looks like we'll be eating shoe leather for dinner again."
G["Looks like we're going to have ourselves an execution."]="Parece que hoje nos toca ejecução."
G["Looks like we're in a pretty tight jam. Think you can get us out of here?"]="Parece que estamos em uma jam bem apertada. Acha que pode nos tirar daqui?"
G["Looks like we're not done yet, $p."]="$p, Parece que ainda não temos terminou."
G["Looks like we're out of the woods, eh? Wonder what this does..."]="Parece que temos saindo do florestas, não é assim? Me pergunto para que serve isto..."
G["Looks like we've got some of Rockrain's soldiers here. Dontrag, Utvoch, we're gonna need your expertise over at Krom'gar Fortress."]="Parece que temos aqui a algum dos pessoal de Lhueverroca. Dontrag, Utvoch, vamos precisar suas habilidades na Fortaleza Krom'gar."
G["Looks like we've uncovered this $n. Now help me kill it!"]="Looks like we've uncovered this $n. Now help me kill it!"
G["Looks like whatever Tirion did put some hurt on the Lich King.  It's too bad we can't finish him off...."]="Looks like whatever Tirion did put some hurt on the Lich King.  It's too bad we can't finish him off...."
G["Looks like ye may have the makings of a great smith. But before I teach ye anything I need to know that ye've got what it takes."]="Parece que a ferraria poderá ser o seu. Mas, antes de ensinar nada, preciso saber se tem o que se você precisa."
G["Looks like you brought the whole family!  What's your business here, then?"]="Parece que você trouxe a toda a família! Que assuntos tem aqui?"
G["Looks like you brought the whole fleet with you, $n!  And a pack of angry Brashtide to boot!\n\nI hope you're battle-ready, because these guys sure came packin'."]="Parece que você trouxe toda a frota, $n! E uma manada de Fuertemarea furiosos, por se fosse pouco!\n\nEspero que te tenha pronto para a batalha, porque estes tipos vêm armados."
G["Looks like you can handle yourself in the water. Keep up the good work."]="Looks like you can handle yourself in the water. Keep up the good work."
G["Looks like you can still best me in a fair fight, little brother."]="Looks like you can still best me in a fair fight, little brother."
G["Looks like you couldn't keep up ... pity."]="Parece que não deu a talha. Uma pena."
G["Looks like you got more than enough. Quick, $n, I think I can see the yaungol reinforcements massing on the horizon."]="Looks like you got more than enough. Quick, $n, I think I can see the yaungol reinforcements massing on the horizon."
G["Looks like you had the same idea I did. Hunting for fruit, are you?"]="Parece que você teve a mesma ideia que eu. Procurando frutas, está?"
G["Looks like you know a good machine when you see one. Give'm hell!"]="Looks like you know a good machine when you see one. Give'm hell!"
G["Looks like you lose."]="Parece que has perdido."
