G["Looks like you're too late, $c. We have all of the roast raptor that we need; killed, cooked and salted. Anyway, it looks like some of the others around here could use some help. You should go check with them. I'm going to see if they'll let me go home now."]="Looks like you're too late, $c. We have all of the roast raptor that we need; killed, cooked and salted. Anyway, it looks like some of the others around here could use some help. You should go check with them. I'm going to see if they'll let me go home now."
G["Looks like you've had a fun time playing with Festergut, but to harvest a proper specimen I'm afraid I will need BOTH strains of blight at the same time!"]="Parece que você divertido jogando com Panzachancro, mas para conseguir um espécimen adequado, me temo que precisarei AMBAS cepas de anhublo por vez."
G["Looks like you've had a fun time playing with Rotface, but to harvest a proper specimen I'm afraid I will need BOTH strains of blight at the same time!"]="Parece que você divertido jogando com Carapútrea, mas para conseguir um espécimen adequado, me temo que precisarei AMBAS cepas de anhublo por vez."
G["Looks over in the direction of the witch doctor and is thoughtful."]="Olhe na direção do médico bruxo de forma pensativa."
G["Loommaster Jeng once spun a weave of silk so thin and smooth that it slipped through a crack in time. It hasn't re-appeared yet but we expect it one of these days."]="Loommaster Jeng once spun a weave of silk so thin and smooth that it slipped through a crack in time. It hasn't re-appeared yet but we expect it one of these days."
