G["Lor'themar be ready to strike once he finish wit da Isle of Thunder, and da Banshee Queen need no excuse, but they both across da sea. Without ya strength, we can't breech the city. I need tauren arms."]="Lor'themar be ready to strike once he finish wit da Isle of Thunder, and da Banshee Queen need no excuse, but they both across da sea. Without ya strength, we can't breech the city. I need tauren arms."
G["Lor'themar elf ranger thinkin' about leavin' the Horde!"]="Lor'themar elf ranger thinkin' about leavin' the Horde!"
G["Lor'themar has remade Silvermoon into something we may truly be proud of."]="Lor'themar tem transformado Luaprata em algo do que si podemos estar orgulhosos."
G["Lor'themar must hear us! We will not be silenced!"]="Lor'themar must hear us! We will not be silenced!"
G["Lor'themar narrows his eyes."]="Lor'themar entornaos olhos."
G["Lor'themar wants a status update on the experiment."]="Lor'themar quer um relatório sobre o estado do experimento."
G["Lor'themar wants a status update? Or is it his master Garrosh?\n\nYou should tell them both that this experiment is a waste of time. The mogu drew power by enslaving the living essence of other creatures. Is this something our Warchief should be dabbling in?\n\nThis is the same road Kael'thas Sunstrider once walked, and it nearly destroyed our people. Why are we taking orders from someone who would have us walk down this road again?"]="Lor'themar wants a status update? Or is it his master Garrosh?\n\nYou should tell them both that this experiment is a waste of time. The mogu drew power by enslaving the living essence of other creatures. Is this something our Warchief should be dabbling in?\n\nThis is the same road Kael'thas Sunstrider once walked, and it nearly destroyed our people. Why are we taking orders from someone who would have us walk down this road again?"
G["Lord Afrasastrasz sent me. He said you have a message to decode?"]="Lorde Afrasastrasz me envia. Diz que tem uma mensagem para decifrar."
G["Lord Afrasastrasz, with your leave, I wish to defend the temple."]="Lorde Afrasastrasz, com o seu permissão, desejo defendao templo."
G["Lord Deathwing's sundering of the Well of Eternity has brought down Uldum's defenses. Prepare yourselves. We will march through the Waygate soon!"]="Lord Deathwing's sundering of the Well of Eternity has brought down Uldum's defenses. Prepare yourselves. We will march through the Waygate soon!"
G["Lord Deathwing, your gift...it is too much! I am...rrrraaaaagghhh!!"]="Lorde Alamuerte, seu don... é... é demais. Estou... aaaaahhhh!"
G["Lord Doomclaw.  Yes, I like the sound of that!"]="Lorde Zarpaletal. Sim, me gosta como soa!"
G["Lord Fordragon!"]="Lorde Fordragon!"
G["Lord Fordring, you mustn't reveal yourself!"]="Lord Fordring, you mustn't reveal yourself!"
G["Lord Gura commanded the very power of the storm at his fingertips. With a single word, he could blanket the earth in crackling electricity. Those caught in his storm died a terrible, scorching death."]="Lord Gura commanded the very power of the storm at his fingertips. With a single word, he could blanket the earth in crackling electricity. Those caught in his storm died a terrible, scorching death."
G["Lord Hir'eek, grant me wings of vengeance!"]="Deus Hir'eek, concédeme asas de vingança!"
G["Lord Illidan will be here shortly."]="Lorde Illidan estará aqui pronto."
G["Lord Illidan will... crush you!"]="Lorde Illidan... os aplastará!"
G["Lord Illidan, I..."]="Lorde Illidan, eu..."
G["Lord Illidan, I... I am... sorry."]="Lorde Illidan, o... o... sinto."
G["Lord Illidan, bless me with the power of the flight!"]="Lorde Illidan, bendíceme com o poder do Voo!"
G["Lord Illidan, this is the Dragonmaw that I, and others, have told you about. He will lead us to victory!"]="Lorde Illidan, este é o Faucedraco do que te temos falado. Ele nos guiará à vitória!"
G["Lord Kael'thas insisted upon it."]="Lorde Kael'thas tem insistido em elho."
G["Lord Lor'themar demands an explanation for the presence of this... exile in our lands."]="Lorde Lor'themar exige uma explicação para a presença desta... exiliada em nossas terras."
