G["Lord Saltheril, my dear, did you notice that supplies for the party are a little low? We really should send for one of those couriers from Fairbreeze Village to deliver more of whatever is needed. I especially like those little hors d'oeuvres wrapped in the smoked bacon. What are those called?"]="Lord Saltheril, my dear, did you notice that supplies for the party are a little low? We really should send for one of those couriers from Fairbreeze Village to deliver more of whatever is needed. I especially like those little hors d'oeuvres wrapped in the smoked bacon. What are those called?"
G["Lord Sargeras, I will not fail you! Sweep your molten fist through this world, so that it may be reborn in flames and darkness!"]="Lord Sargeras, I will not fail you! Sweep your molten fist through this world, so that it may be reborn in flames and darkness!"
G["Lord Staghelm, where are you going? You would shatter our bond for the sake of pride?"]="Lorde Corzocelada, O que está fazendo? Destruirías nosso vínculo por orgulho?"
G["Lord Taran Tzu has travelled westward beyond the wall to hunt the Sha of Hatred. I hope the hunt goes well."]="Lorde Taran Zhu viaja para o oeste, ao outro lado da muralha, para dar caça ao Sha do ódio. Espero que lhe vá bem."
