G["Lord Thrall, it is time to go!"]="Lord Thrall, it is time to go!"
G["Lord Ufrang, there are strangers on the ledge petitioning your warriors to honor duels. They are not vrykul."]="Lord Ufrang, there are strangers on the ledge petitioning your warriors to honor duels. They are not vrykul."
G["Lord Zhu!"]="Lorde Zhu!"
