G["Lordaeron belongs to the Alliance. You only delay the inevitable..."]="Lordaeron belongs to the Alliance. You only delay the inevitable..."
G["Lordaeron belongs to the Forsaken - always and forever."]="Lordaeron pertence aos Renegados: agora e sempre."
