G["Lorna said a truly brave adventurer helped rescue many of the horses near her family's orchard.\nI offered to take care of those that made it across the sea with us. I learned how from my mother and father, Light bless them!\nWere you interested in a fine Gilnean steed...?"]="Lorna said a truly brave adventurer helped rescue many of the horses near her family's orchard.\nI offered to take care of those that made it across the sea with us. I learned how from my mother and father, Light bless them!\nWere you interested in a fine Gilnean steed...?"
