G["Lost?\n\nI am deeply disappointed, $n.\n\nThat ring was one of a kind, crafted out of the remnants of the armor of our fallen heroes and the purified metal from our enemy's blades.\n\nLet's not allow this to happen again."]="Lost?\n\nI am deeply disappointed, $n.\n\nThat ring was one of a kind, crafted out of the remnants of the armor of our fallen heroes and the purified metal from our enemy's blades.\n\nLet's not allow this to happen again."
G["Lot more going to fall like you."]="Lot more going to fall like you."
