G["Love tokens are small messages of affection you can give to amorous town and city folk.  Such people will reward you with a gift of adoration.\n\nOr, if you are already adored by another, then at the least they'll give you a gift of friendship."]="Love tokens are small messages of affection you can give to amorous town and city folk.  Such people will reward you with a gift of adoration.\n\nOr, if you are already adored by another, then at the least they'll give you a gift of friendship."
