G["Lurid could get used... to working with you."]="Lurid could get used... to working with you."
G["Lurosa, I am entrusting the Relics of Aviana to $n, who will take them to Morthis Whisperwing. I must return completely to the Emerald Dream now. Do not let $n fail!"]="Lurosa, I am entrusting the Relics of Aviana to $n, who will take them to Morthis Whisperwing. I must return completely to the Emerald Dream now. Do not let $n fail!"
G["Lyalia wants me to create a new portal? That woman is crazy. Did she already forget what happened the last time?\n\nWell, Vaeldrin's research did suggest some possible ways around traps like that. And I may have taken a short cut or two to get us here.\n\nGive me enough time and I might be able to summon another portal for the encampment."]="Lyalia wants me to create a new portal? That woman is crazy. Did she already forget what happened the last time?\n\nWell, Vaeldrin's research did suggest some possible ways around traps like that. And I may have taken a short cut or two to get us here.\n\nGive me enough time and I might be able to summon another portal for the encampment."
G["Lyalia! I am so sorry, my child."]="Lyalia! Sinto muito muito, filha minha."
G["Lydon!? Alive?"]="Lydon?! Vivo?"
G["Lylagar is offended by your inferior howl."]="Lylagar se sente ofendido pelo seu uivo inferior."
G["Lylagar lets out a pitiful whimper."]="Lylagar lets out a pitiful whimper."
G["Lynalis can help you more than I, $c. Speak with her to learn more."]="Lynalis poderá ajudar você mais que eu, $c. Fala com ela se que aprender mais."
G["Lynna, stay here and establish a camp. Your first priority should be medical tents and shelters. When the peasants arrive, see that they begin construction of the docks."]="Lynna, stay here and establish a camp. Your first priority should be medical tents and shelters. When the peasants arrive, see that they begin construction of the docks."
G["Lyria's the one you should talk to if you need some training.  She can usually be found out behind the smithy waiting for some armor or weapon to be finished."]="É com Lyria quem você deve conversar se precisar de algum treinamento. Ela geralmente pode ser encontrada atrás do ferreiro, esperando que alguma armadura ou arma seja concluída."
G["Lysheana can offer you the proper documents, she resides in the Craftsmen's Terrace in northeasten Darnassus.  May your fellowship bring glory to the Night Elves!"]="Lysheana pode oferecer os documentos adequados, ela reside no Terraço dos Artesãos, no nordeste de Darnassus. Que sua irmandade traga glória aos Elfos Noturnos!"
G["Lysta, summon forth... the abomination!"]="Lysta, evocar... à abominação!"
