G["Ma'am, would you mind dropping me off at Light's Shield Tower, just up ahead?  I have to stop here."]="Ma'am, would you mind dropping me off at Light's Shield Tower, just up ahead?  I have to stop here."
G["Ma'haat, slaughter these rabble.  I will deal with the fool priestess."]="Ma'haat, acaba com essa chusma. Eu me ocupare da estúpida sacerdotisa."
G["Mace"]="Maça (Mace)"
G["Maces are a specialty of Buliwyf's! He's around this shop somewhere, grousing. If his training techniques aren't your style, I hear the draenei weapon master in the Exodar, Handiir, knows his way around the weapon too! He's up on the Trader's Tier there."]="Os maças são uma especialidade da Buliwyf's! Ele está em torno desta loja em algum lugar, reclamando. Se as técnicas de treinamento dele não são do seu estilo, eu ouço o mestre de armas draenei do Exodar, Handiir, também conhecer o caminho da arma! Ele está no nível do comerciante lá."
G["Maces are taught by Ansekhwa, found on the lower central rise of Thunder Bluff."]="Os maças são ensinados por Ansekhwa, encontrado na parte central mais baixa do Thunder Bluff."
G["Maces, they taught by Ansekhwa, found on da lower central rise of Thunder Bluff."]="Os magos, ensinados por Ansekhwa, encontraram na promoção central mais baixa do Penhasco do Trovão."
G["Mack belches loudly..."]="Mack arrota em alto..."
G["Mad Qao Pao and his Jewel Danio were last found  in the Summer Fields in Vale of Eternal Blossoms. Probably around this area. \n\n<Ben marks a spot on your map.>"]="Mad Qao Pao and his Jewel Danio were last found  in the Summer Fields in Vale of Eternal Blossoms. Probably around this area. \n\n<Ben marks a spot on your map.>"
G["Mad Qao-Pao doesn't mean any harm. Truly, he doesn't. He heard that the pond in front of the Mogu'shan Palace granted wishes, you see... like a wishing well. \n \n And... well... the poor guy has more gold than wit. Last I heard, he's been dumping gold into the water... hoping to become king of the world! \n \n Sadly, Jewel Danio's favorite treats are fireflies that fly low on the water. The glimmer of the coins lures them out in droves. \n \n Hopefully the poor things aren't swallowing too many coins. Today's the day to get Jewel Danio if you want, though. You may even find a couple of coins yourself."]="Mad Qao-Pao doesn't mean any harm. Truly, he doesn't. He heard that the pond in front of the Mogu'shan Palace granted wishes, you see... like a wishing well. \n \n And... well... the poor guy has more gold than wit. Last I heard, he's been dumping gold into the water... hoping to become king of the world! \n \n Sadly, Jewel Danio's favorite treats are fireflies that fly low on the water. The glimmer of the coins lures them out in droves. \n \n Hopefully the poor things aren't swallowing too many coins. Today's the day to get Jewel Danio if you want, though. You may even find a couple of coins yourself."
G["Mad yeti! Mad yeti!"]="Yeti loko! Yeti loko!"
G["Made any good kills lately?\n\nI killed a draenei yesterday. You can still find her near the filth-pool... just look for the blue entrails."]="Made any good kills lately?\n\nI killed a draenei yesterday. You can still find her near the filth-pool... just look for the blue entrails."
G["Made any good kills lately?\n\nI killed a tauren yesterday. It took three scavengers to bring his parts back to the filth-pool!"]="Made any good kills lately?\n\nI killed a tauren yesterday. It took three scavengers to bring his parts back to the filth-pool!"
G["Made by the finest craftsmen in all of Teldrassil, carried by hand from Kalimdor to Azeroth as a sign of the growing alliance between the people of the Great Tree and the humans of this land. If there is anything you require, you have but to ask."]="Feito pelos melhores artesãos de tudo Teldrassil, transportado à mão de Kalimdor a Azeroth como um sinal da crescente aliança entre o povo da Grande Árvore e os humanos desta terra. Se você precisar de algo, basta pedir."
G["Made to far exceed Brann's specifications. You won't be disappointed."]="Made to far exceed Brann's specifications. You won't be disappointed."
G["Madness has brought you here to me. I shall be your undoing!"]="A loucuraos tem trazido ante meu. Serei seu fim!"
G["Madness. Chaos. Much as I thrill to see the titans' work undone, I do wish to remain alive when the master returns. I will help you."]="Loucura. Caos. Por muito que me entusiasme ver a destruição da obra dos titãs, desejo seguir com vida quando regrese o mestre. Te ajudarei."
G["Madrigosa accompanied me on this journey, but we have become separated in the Sunwell.\n\nMay fate keep her safe."]="Madrigosa accompanied me on this journey, but we have become separated in the Sunwell.\n\nMay fate keep her safe."
G["Madrigosa deserved a far better fate. You did what had to be done, but this battle is far from over!"]="Madrigosa deserved a far better fate. You did what had to be done, but this battle is far from over!"
G["Maeshtro! Cue da mushic!"]="Maeshtro! Comience a tocar!"
G["Maexxna, born deep within the mountains of Northrend many ages ago, she was captured within the dread citadel Naxxramas, where she gives birth to her brood, feeding them the corpses of all who dare venture too deeply into Naxxramas."]="Maexxna, born deep within the mountains of Northrend many ages ago, she was captured within the dread citadel Naxxramas, where she gives birth to her brood, feeding them the corpses of all who dare venture too deeply into Naxxramas."
G["Magar's Cloth Goods is in The Drag.  Find him south of the huge tree next to the Kodohide Leatherworks."]="Os artigos de pano de Magar estão em The Drag. Encontre-o ao sul da enorme árvore ao lado da Kodohide Leatherworks."
G["Mage"]="Mago"
G["Mage & Portal"]="Mago e portal"
G["Mage Trainer"]="Instrutor de magos"
G["Mage-Lord Urom is our next target.  He should be hiding on one of the floating platforms on the Band of Transmutation, near the top of The Oculus.  Be warned, Urom is a powerful conjurer; he may not be alone."]="Mage-Lord Urom is our next target.  He should be hiding on one of the floating platforms on the Band of Transmutation, near the top of The Oculus.  Be warned, Urom is a powerful conjurer; he may not be alone."
G["Mages fear our kind... with reason. Play upon this fear, disciples."]="Mages fear our kind... with reason. Play upon this fear, disciples."
G["Mages of the Kirin Tor, on Brann's Command, release the shield! Defend this platform and our allies with your lives! For Dalaran!"]="Mages of the Kirin Tor, on Brann's Command, release the shield! Defend this platform and our allies with your lives! For Dalaran!"
G["Mages too? You should be more careful when you play with magic..."]="Mages too? You should be more careful when you play with magic..."
G["Mages! Take wing!"]="Mages! Take wing!"
G["Mages? They're in the Magic Quarter, in the central building. Thought you'd be smart enough to figure that out."]="Magos? Eles estão no bairro mágico, no edifício central. Pensei que você fosse inteligente o suficiente para descobrir isso."
G["Magic Rooster Mount"]="Montagem do Galo Mágico"
G["Magic is a tool, some would even say a gift. But you should never forget its fundamental nature."]="Magic is a tool, some would even say a gift. But you should never forget its fundamental nature."
G["Magic must be... contained..."]="É preciso conter... a magia."
G["Magic sky lanterns for sale!"]="Magic sky lanterns for sale!"
G["Magic sky lanterns for sale! Light the candle and watch it float, even without wind!"]="Magic sky lanterns for sale! Light the candle and watch it float, even without wind!"
G["Magic's done."]="Magic's done."
G["Magical studies stressing your brain? Relax at the Blue Recluse!"]="Magical studies stressing your brain? Relax at the Blue Recluse!"
G["Maginor says that twisting alternating flows of positive energy actually creates a much more stable flow."]="Maginor says that twisting alternating flows of positive energy actually creates a much more stable flow."
G["Magister Hathorel said you might be able to lend me a certain tabard."]="Magister Hathorel disse que você pode me emprestar um certo tabardo."
G["Magistrate Barthilas is unavailable at the moment..."]="O magistrado Barthilas não está disponível neste momentos..."
G["Magistrix Carinda has sent me to ask you about Arelion's secret.  Who was he seeing?"]="Magistrix Carinda me enviou para perguntar sobre o segredo de Arelion. Quem ele estava vendo?"
G["Magma swirls and eddies lazily inside the orb, but the translucent surface is solid and cool to the touch."]="Magma swirls and eddies lazily inside the orb, but the translucent surface is solid and cool to the touch."
