G["Magnificent! It talks! This seems beyond what we thought the mogu were capable of."]="Magnificent! It talks! This seems beyond what we thought the mogu were capable of."
G["Magnitude set. Release."]="Magnitude set. Release."
G["Magtoor, I have faith that there is a way to bring the Lost Ones back from the brink.  By studying them, I will find a way to cure the fel energies that have consumed them.  And in so doing, I will be able to reverse the damage to the Broken as well."]="Magtoor, I have faith that there is a way to bring the Lost Ones back from the brink.  By studying them, I will find a way to cure the fel energies that have consumed them.  And in so doing, I will be able to reverse the damage to the Broken as well."
G["Magtoor, thank you for allowing me to stay here with you.  I'm sure that there is much that we can learn from each other.  And I'm eager to learn all that I can of the Lost Ones to the east."]="Magtoor, Obrigado por permitir que me que com você. Estou certo de que há muito que podemos aprender o um do outro. E estou ansioso por saber tudo o que possa sobre Os Perdidos do este."
G["Magtoor, you have endured your plight bravely. Are you ready to return to the embrace of the Light?"]="Magtoor, you have endured your plight bravely. Are you ready to return to the embrace of the Light?"
G["Mahka wants you to come see her, Mankrik."]="Mahka wants you to come see her, Mankrik."
G["Mahka wishes to see me? ...very well. Return to her, I will follow."]="Mahka wishes to see me? ...very well. Return to her, I will follow."
G["Maiden!  Fear not, I seek only to steady the quiver in thine lower lip.  Is that your purse that floats 'pon the water, so agonizingly close yet so perilously far away?"]="Maiden!  Fear not, I seek only to steady the quiver in thine lower lip.  Is that your purse that floats 'pon the water, so agonizingly close yet so perilously far away?"
G["Maiden!  Fear not, for Maximillian of Northshire has arrived to deliver you from your rocky tomb!"]="Maiden!  Fear not, for Maximillian of Northshire has arrived to deliver you from your rocky tomb!"
G["Maiden: if your curiosity gnaws at you, then you may know your salvation was delivered by Maximillian of Northshire."]="Maiden: if your curiosity gnaws at you, then you may know your salvation was delivered by Maximillian of Northshire."
G["Maiev... How is it even possible?"]="Maiev… Mas como é possível?"
G["Mail Armor"]="Armadura de Malha"
