G["Mailbox? You want to head to the inn in the center of the city's upper ring. It's right there."]="Caixa de correio? Você quer ir para a pousada no centro do anel superior da cidade. É logo ali."
G["Mailboxes are scattered throughout the city. You can find one in front of any auction house, bank, or inn."]="Mailboxes are scattered throughout the city. You can find one in front of any auction house, bank, or inn."
G["Maintain focus."]="Concéntrate."
G["Maintain order within these walls."]="Mantenhao ordem entre estas quatro paredes."
G["Maintain your faith. The grand admiral will deliver us to victory over the Lich King."]="Conserva a fé. O Grande almirante nos levará até a vitória contra o Rei Lich."
G["Maintaining this barrier will require all of my concentration. Kill them all!"]="Maintaining this barrier will require all of my concentration. Kill them all!"
