G["Majesty, run while you still can. She is not what you think her to be..."]="Majesty, run while you still can. She is not what you think her to be..."
G["Major Domo Enabled."]="Major Domo ativado."
G["Makaru can be found day and night at Red Canyon Mining in the Valley of Honor, just off the lake."]="Makaru pode ser encontrada dia e noite na Red Canyon Mining, no Valley of Honra, perto do lago."
G["Make 'em pay, Brutusk!"]="Make 'em pay, Brutusk!"
G["Make 'em sorry for hurting you, Mr. D!"]="Make 'em sorry for hurting you, Mr. D!"
G["Make 'em sorry for hurting you, Mr. P!"]="Make 'em sorry for hurting you, Mr. P!"
G["Make Sunsong Ranch your home."]="Make Sunsong Ranch your home."
G["Make Way!  Make Way!"]="Make Way!  Make Way!"
G["Make a demonstration of these invaders, such that all nations tremble before me."]="Dê uma lição nesses invasores para que todos os povos tremam diante de mim."
G["Make a note: Fire bad."]="Notal mental: fogo ruim."
G["Make a run for Dawn's Blossom. We'll meet you there!"]="Vê a Floralba. Te veremos ali!"
G["Make dem fear the Zandalari!"]="Make dem fear the Zandalari!"
G["Make every second count.\nWhen you're ready to go, let me know and I'll get you out of here."]="Que cada segundo cuente.\n\nQuando queira partir, Avise-me e te sacaremos de aqui."
G["Make for that cave to the west. It's safe and dry."]="Coloque rumbo a essa caverna que há ao oeste. É certa e está seca."
G["Make friends with the jinyu. We may need them before this mission is over, and that's an order."]="Make friends with the jinyu. We may need them before this mission is over, and that's an order."
G["Make good use of those tar pools. Your friends should be able to light them on fire if they're smart about it."]="Make good use of those tar pools. Your friends should be able to light them on fire if they're smart about it."
G["Make haste and secure the area! Much work remains to be done."]="Date pressa e garante a zona. Fica muito trabalho por linha de frente."
G["Make haste, $c!\n\nThis crisis is nowhere near being under control."]="Date pressa, $c!\n\nEsta crisis está de tudo menos baixo controle."
G["Make haste, $n. Use the portal!"]="Date pressa, $n. Usao portal!"
G["Make haste, champions! I will prepare the troops to fall in behind you."]="Make haste, champions! I will prepare the troops to fall in behind you."
G["Make haste, ma priests! Da rituals must not be interrupted!"]="Make haste, ma priests! Da rituals must not be interrupted!"
G["Make it fast, buddy. We've got deadlines to meet."]="Date pressa, colega. Temos que cumprir uma agora de entrega."
G["Make it fast."]="Faça rápido."
G["Make it out of there with anything good?"]="Has conseguido algo interessante?"
G["Make it quick $r, your kind make me sick."]="Que seja rápido, $r. Seu espécie me da náuseas."
G["Make it quick, $c - we've got a war to fight here, or hadn't you noticed?"]="Faça rápido, $c – temos uma guerra que librar aqui, ou não te havia dados conta?"
G["Make it quick, $c."]="Faça rápido, $c."
G["Make it quick, $r."]="Que seja rápido, $r."
G["Make it quick, $r. I am weary and have no time for pleasantries.."]="Make it quick, $r. I am weary and have no time for pleasantries.."
G["Make it quick... the fighting here is grim. I need to stay sharp."]="Seja rápido... a luta aqui é sombria. Eu preciso ficar afiada."
G["Make it stop!"]="Make it stop!"
G["Make it stop! MAKE IT STOP!"]="Make it stop! MAKE IT STOP!"
