G["Make mine Noggenfogger!"]="Faça o meu, Tragonublo!"
G["Make no mistake. Pandaria will challenge your King."]="Não se engane. Pandária será um desafio para o seu rei."
G["Make no sound during the ritual.  One misstep could spell our doom..."]="Não faça ruido durante o ritual. Um passo em falso poderá significar nossa fracasso..."
G["Make peace, worms.  I be deliverin' you to Hakkar myself!"]="Deixem de lutar, vermes. Eu mesmo os levarei ante Hakkar!"
G["Make ready for battle, my creations."]="Preparem-se para a batalha, meus criações."
G["Make ready the chambers, another ally will soon join our ranks!"]="Prepara as câmaras, pronto se unirá a nossas fileiras outro aliado!"
G["Make some noodle soup for your customer. This is a scholar so they like the simplicity of a standard noodle soup. Try making one now."]="Prepara uma sopa de macarrão para o seu cliente. É um erudito, assim que lhe gustará a simplicidade de uma sopa de macarrão simples. Prova a cozinhar uma."
G["Make sure everything is ready.  The orcs' emissary is ready to meet Sylvanas inside the cathedral."]="Make sure everything is ready.  The orcs' emissary is ready to meet Sylvanas inside the cathedral."
G["Make sure my name is spelled correctly on the tombst--"]="Certifique-se de que meu nome está escrito corretamente na láp--"
G["Make sure these Broken are thoroughly cleaned before touching the water."]="Make sure these Broken are thoroughly cleaned before touching the water."
G["Make sure to tend those scallions. After that, nothing to do but wait until tomorrow when they'll be nice and ripe."]="Make sure to tend those scallions. After that, nothing to do but wait until tomorrow when they'll be nice and ripe."
G["Make sure to visit the Gizmotronic Apparatus to grab a lockpick and an E.C.A.C. You will definitely need both to complete your mission!"]="Make sure to visit the Gizmotronic Apparatus to grab a lockpick and an E.C.A.C. You will definitely need both to complete your mission!"
G["Make sure we always have camouflage up. The orcs in Render's Valley will kill us both if we're spotted."]="Make sure we always have camouflage up. The orcs in Render's Valley will kill us both if we're spotted."
G["Make sure you are all on guard for any more Alliance attacks."]="Aseguraos de que estão todos preparados para futuros ataque da Aliança."
G["Make sure you not forget anything. I forgot stuff once."]="Make sure you not forget anything. I forgot stuff once."
G["Make sure you pull plenty of moolah out of the bank. I don't want you buying any of that cheap clothing you usually like to wear. This party's important!"]="Certifique-se de tirar suficiente pasta do banco. Não quero que compres roupa barata dessa que veste normalmente. Esta festa é importantes!"
G["Make sure you stick around for the next firework show!  Starting at 6PM, they're every hour on the hour!"]="Certifique-se de estar por aqui para o seguinte espectáculo de pirotecnia! São cada hora a partir das 6pm."
G["Make sure you weren't followed, mon!"]="Certifique-se de que não te siguieran!"
G["Make sure your blades are sharp. We've got enemies to cleave today!"]="Make sure your blades are sharp. We've got enemies to cleave today!"
G["Make the call, Commander. I'll tear the bottom half of their base apart."]="Make the call, Commander. I'll tear the bottom half of their base apart."
G["Make the journey to Orgrimmar and seek him out in the Valley of Honor. He works in a shop called the Arms of Legend."]="Make the journey to Orgrimmar and seek him out in the Valley of Honor. He works in a shop called the Arms of Legend."
G["Make their deaths quick! We have much to do!"]="Que mueran rápido! Temos coisas que fazer."
G["Make them pay!"]="Que paguem!"
G["Make them work faster!"]="Faça que trabagemn mais rápido!"
G["Make this inn your home."]="Faça desta pousada à sua casa."
G["Make this quick, $c. The Warchief personally sent me to evaluate our progress in the Barrens, and when I get here I find our towns aflame and Alliance dogs running amok."]="Make this quick, $c. The Warchief personally sent me to evaluate our progress in the Barrens, and when I get here I find our towns aflame and Alliance dogs running amok."
G["Make use of every resource! Leave them nowhere to run!"]="Make use of every resource! Leave them nowhere to run!"
G["Make way for da Nalorakk!"]="Deixem passo ao Nalorakk!"
G["Make way!"]="Abram caminho!"
G["Make way!  A wyrm is coming to our aid!"]="Make way!  A wyrm is coming to our aid!"
G["Make what out, exactly?"]="Que é o que vê, exatamente?"
G["Make with more left right punch and runs!"]="Esquerda, direita, esquerda e corre!"
G["Make your mind as calm as still water. Breathe deeply. And be at peace."]="Mantenha a mente tranquila como a água em calma. Respira profundo. E permanece em paz."
G["Make your preparations, $n, but do it quickly!"]="Prepare-se, $n, e faça rápido!"
G["Make your search fast, I have to be somewhere."]="Registra rápido, tenho uma cita."
G["Make your time, mortals.  You will never defeat the Occulus!"]="Make your time, mortals.  You will never defeat the Occulus!"
G["Make your way back to Taran Zhu. I'll catch up with you shortly."]="Make your way back to Taran Zhu. I'll catch up with you shortly."
G["Make your way through the maze of Eye Sores while avoiding Durumu's Disintegration Beam."]="Atraviesao labirinto de dolores de olho enquanto evitas o Faça de desintegração de Durumu."
G["Make yourself useful and heal me, Paxton!"]="Faça algo útil e sáname, Paxton!"
G["Make yourself useful and help me out here!"]="Faça algo e ajude-me a sair de aqui!"
G["Makes me shudder even ta think."]="Makes me shudder even ta think."
G["Making it out of here without a blade in your back or poison in your veins would be an accomplishment."]="Conseguir sair daqui sem uma lâmina nas costas ou veneno nas veias seria uma conquista."
G["Maktu doesn't recognize you, $r, but he is pleased to meet you. If ever you need to buy or repair armor, look no further than Maktu."]="Maktu doesn't recognize you, $r, but he is pleased to meet you. If ever you need to buy or repair armor, look no further than Maktu."
G["Mal'Ganis appears to have more than Scourge in his arsenal. We should make haste."]="Mal'Ganis appears to have more than Scourge in his arsenal. We should make haste."
G["Mal'Ganis is not making this easy."]="Mal'ganis não nos o está deixando fácil."
G["Mal'Ganis will pay for this."]="Mal'Ganis pagará por isto."
G["Mal'Ganis will send out some of his Scourge minions to interfere with us. Those of you with the strongest steel and magic shall go forth and destroy them. I will lead the rest of my forces in purging Stratholme of the infected."]="Mal'Ganis will send out some of his Scourge minions to interfere with us. Those of you with the strongest steel and magic shall go forth and destroy them. I will lead the rest of my forces in purging Stratholme of the infected."
G["Malfurion is not here. Only me."]="Malfurion não está aqui. Somente eu."
G["Malfurion may not say it aloud, but he was greatly concerned for the coming of your people."]="Talvez Malfurion não o diga em voz alta, mas estava muito preocupado pelo futuro do seu gente."
G["Malfurion strikes me as both wise and honest.  I take him at his word.  I'd welcome more answers, but it's not my place."]="Acho que Malfurion é sábio e sincero. Acho no seu palavra. Gostaria ter mais respostas, mas não devo perguntar."
G["Malfurion!"]="Malfurion!"
G["Malfurion, a coward? How can you justify that?"]="Malfurion, um covarde? Como pode justificar algo assim?"
G["Malfurion, he has done it! The portal is collapsing!"]="Malfurion... o conseguiu! O portal se desmorona!"
G["Malik the Unscathed."]="Malik o Ileso."
G["Maloriak, try not to lose to these mortals. Semicompetent help is SO hard to create."]="Maloriak, não perda contra esses mortais. Resulta TÃO difícil criar ajuda que seja algo competente."
G["Malorne somehow manages to pick the most delicate herbs without damaging them.  Certainly he is the one you should learn from.  He lives just east of the Inn in Dolanaar."]="Malorne de alguma maneira consegue colher as ervas mais delicadas sem danificá-as. Certamente ele é quem você deve aprender. Ele mora a leste da pousada em Dolanaar."
G["Malton, you dummy!"]="Malton, bobo!"
G["Malukaz chatters incessantly about the historical importance of this forest, but I don't have the luxury of indulging in history until our present problems are settled.\n\nI'm not saying his work here isn't important, but someone has to see to the defenses and logistics of running the hold."]="Malukaz chatters incessantly about the historical importance of this forest, but I don't have the luxury of indulging in history until our present problems are settled.\n\nI'm not saying his work here isn't important, but someone has to see to the defenses and logistics of running the hold."
G["Malygos - in the open? I hadn't dared hope for an opportunity such as this. I'll assemble our bretheren at once!"]="Malygos - in the open? I hadn't dared hope for an opportunity such as this. I'll assemble our bretheren at once!"
G["Malygos has clearly gone insane."]="Não há dúvida de que Malygos perdeu a cabeça."
G["Malygos is my answer."]="Malygos é a minha resposta."
G["Malygos the Spellweaver, the Lord of Magic, Master of the Blue Dragonflight. He is the blue dragon aspect, one of the most ancient creatures on Azeroth.\n\nHe is said to be recovering from a madness which has lasted for millennia, but his recent actions lead me to believe that he is still far from sane.\n\nHis solution to our dilemma is to search out and destroy every magic-wielding mortal on Azeroth.\n\nAs the guardians of life, this has forced the red dragonflight to take action.\n\nDragon now fights against dragon, and the fate of our frail world lies in the balance."]="Malygos the Spellweaver, the Lord of Magic, Master of the Blue Dragonflight. He is the blue dragon aspect, one of the most ancient creatures on Azeroth.\n\nHe is said to be recovering from a madness which has lasted for millennia, but his recent actions lead me to believe that he is still far from sane.\n\nHis solution to our dilemma is to search out and destroy every magic-wielding mortal on Azeroth.\n\nAs the guardians of life, this has forced the red dragonflight to take action.\n\nDragon now fights against dragon, and the fate of our frail world lies in the balance."
G["Malygos' most powerful agents protect the rings above.  Alone, you cannot hope to defeat them.  We can grant you power to call upon drakes from our dragon flights.  Mounted on the back of a drake, you will be able to fly here in the Oculus and command powerful dragon magic."]="Os agentes mais poderosos de Malygos protegem os anéis acima. Sozinho, você não pode esperar derrotá-os. Podemos conceder a você o poder de chamar drakes de nossos voos de dragões. Montado nas costas de um drake, você poderá voar aqui no Oculus e comandar uma poderosa magia de dragão."
G["Malygos, is it?"]="Malygos então?"
G["Malygos, my lord... I did my... best."]="Malygos, senhor... fiz.. o que... pude."
G["Mama Bramblestaff often told me if I didn't stop breaking her vases she would ship me off to the Dungeons of Dojan."]="Mama Bramblestaff often told me if I didn't stop breaking her vases she would ship me off to the Dungeons of Dojan."
G["Mama loves oranges, but oranges are so hard to find in the Valley.\n\nI tell my son to buy some oranges at the market, so I give him some copper.\n\nWhat does he do? He buys some beans!\n\nWe are not farmers! We are yak-herders! What do I do with stupid beans, I ask you?"]="Mama loves oranges, but oranges are so hard to find in the Valley.\n\nI tell my son to buy some oranges at the market, so I give him some copper.\n\nWhat does he do? He buys some beans!\n\nWe are not farmers! We are yak-herders! What do I do with stupid beans, I ask you?"
G["Mama! I'm coming home, Mama!"]="Mamãe! Vuelvo a casa, mamãe!"
G["Mama?"]="Mamãe?"
G["Man am I tired!"]="Estou esgotado!"
G["Man down!"]="Homem ao mar!"
G["Man down!  We've got a man down!  Get him back up as soon as you can!"]="Homem caído! Temos um homem caído! Consegue que regrese à batalha tão pronto como possa!"
G["Man the harpoon cannon!"]="Encárgate do canhão de arpones!"
G["Man'ari... But how... We are not eredar! She must know! If there are others like her, we must find them and explain..."]="Man'ari... But how... We are not eredar! She must know! If there are others like her, we must find them and explain..."
G["Man, oh man...Just look at that amazing view! Are those LIONS? Oops, almost let go of the steering wheel there."]="Man, oh man...Just look at that amazing view! Are those LIONS? Oops, almost let go of the steering wheel there."
G["Man, that will never work. The iron dwarves are never gonna fall for that hunk o' junk!"]="Man, that will never work. The iron dwarves are never gonna fall for that hunk o' junk!"
G["Man... I thought I had that one..."]="Fique... Pensei que ganaría..."
G["Mana Loom"]="Mana Loom"
G["Mana gem..."]="Gema de mana..."
G["Manach sheek-thrish!"]="Manach sheek-thrish!"
G["Manaforge Duro is the closest facility to Tempest Keep, so it handles most of the load.\n\nAs you should know, overloading these manaforges causes leaks in the pipelines.  The emanating energy attracts unwanted mana creatures.  We've had mana creature infestations at many leak locations; Manaforge Duro is being hit the hardest at the moment."]="Manaforge Duro is the closest facility to Tempest Keep, so it handles most of the load.\n\nAs you should know, overloading these manaforges causes leaks in the pipelines.  The emanating energy attracts unwanted mana creatures.  We've had mana creature infestations at many leak locations; Manaforge Duro is being hit the hardest at the moment."
G["Manaforge Ultris, of course!  Where have you been?\n\nThe manaforge was overloaded and created a huge explosion.  It left a tear in reality and now void creatures have been pouring in through it.  You can see them all over the place towards the northeast."]="Manaforge Ultris, of course!  Where have you been?\n\nThe manaforge was overloaded and created a huge explosion.  It left a tear in reality and now void creatures have been pouring in through it.  You can see them all over the place towards the northeast."
G["Manaforge shutdown aborted.  Resuming manaforge activity."]="Desactivação de forja de mana suspendida."
G["Managed to find me, eh? No matter, you won't live to tell anyone of it!"]="Managed to find me, eh? No matter, you won't live to tell anyone of it!"
G["Mandokir sure do love his raptors."]="Eh'tá claro que Mandokir adora aos seus raptores."
G["Mankers?"]="Mikos?"
G["Mantid and mogu alike were brought low by the hero's fury."]="Mantídeos e mogus foram postos abaixo por sua fúria heroica."
G["Mantid are born with little on their mind but a lust for battle. Participation in a swarm is not only a cultural rite of passage - it is the catalyst for our physical maturation.\n\nOnly those who return from battle can develop from a swarmborn into a fully-aware, individual citizen."]="Mantid are born with little on their mind but a lust for battle. Participation in a swarm is not only a cultural rite of passage - it is the catalyst for our physical maturation.\n\nOnly those who return from battle can develop from a swarmborn into a fully-aware, individual citizen."
G["Mantid?"]="Mantídeos?"
G["Many Argent Dawn are numbered amongst the simpletons that have fallen before me. The Argent Crusade will prove no different."]="Many Argent Dawn are numbered amongst the simpletons that have fallen before me. The Argent Crusade will prove no different."
G["Many Frenzyheart lost at broken pillar. Today is not Zepik's day to be lost too."]="Many Frenzyheart lost at broken pillar. Today is not Zepik's day to be lost too."
G["Many an advantage can be gained from getting to know your enemy.  Take that lesson to heart, $n.\n\nThe more we learn about the Scourge the better prepared we are to defeat them."]="Many an advantage can be gained from getting to know your enemy.  Take that lesson to heart, $n.\n\nThe more we learn about the Scourge the better prepared we are to defeat them."
G["Many animals lost their lives so that we could gain these materials. Do not take their sacrifice lightly, $n. Handle the leather with the respect it deserves."]="Many animals lost their lives so that we could gain these materials. Do not take their sacrifice lightly, $n. Handle the leather with the respect it deserves."
G["Many are the paths of the Earth Mother.  May your ancestors watch over you $c."]="Muitos são os caminhos da Mãe Terra. Que seus ancestrais te protejan, $c."
G["Many are the paths of the Earth Mother.  Wherever you decide to travel, may she watch over you."]="Muitos são os caminhos da Mãe Terra. Onde quer que você decida viajar, ela pode cuidar de você."
G["Many are the paths of the Light, $c.  You must decide which to follow on this world, or any other."]="Muitos são os caminhos da Luz, $c. Deve decidir qual seguir neste mundo ou em qualquer outro."
G["Many are the rare and precious objects that my clientele seek.\n\nYou could be the one to bring them to me, $c. In return I offer that which you covet.\n\nShall we speak more on that which I look to procure today?"]="Many are the rare and precious objects that my clientele seek.\n\nYou could be the one to bring them to me, $c. In return I offer that which you covet.\n\nShall we speak more on that which I look to procure today?"
G["Many artifacts lay here, seemingly discarded. Most appear to have come from Garrosh's dig site in the Vale of Eternal Blossoms. Whatever he is trying to find, it does not appear to be among these forgotten relics."]="Many artifacts lay here, seemingly discarded. Most appear to have come from Garrosh's dig site in the Vale of Eternal Blossoms. Whatever he is trying to find, it does not appear to be among these forgotten relics."
G["Many bad fortunes to you!"]="Te desejo o pior!"
G["Many beautiful flowers grow around here, but my favorite is the Marsh Lily. Unfortunately, those gorgeous blooms are rare to find."]="Many beautiful flowers grow around here, but my favorite is the Marsh Lily. Unfortunately, those gorgeous blooms are rare to find."
G["Many champions have fallen to the skills displayed by $n.  We are proud to present this formidable $c."]="Muitos campeões têm caído ante as habilidades demostradas por $n. Estamos orgulhosos de apresentar a um formidable $c."
G["Many changes are occuring here, young one.  Do not fret if you see anything out of place...such as me.  Moo."]="Many changes are occuring here, young one.  Do not fret if you see anything out of place...such as me.  Moo."
G["Many changes come to the land and water: you, them... much change.\n\nKamagua's way of life is threatened by these changes. What will you do?"]="Many changes come to the land and water: you, them... much change.\n\nKamagua's way of life is threatened by these changes. What will you do?"
G["Many confuse the Earthen Ring with the Cenarion Circle. ...I TOLD Thrall we should rename ourselves the \"Earthen Square\"."]="Many confuse the Earthen Ring with the Cenarion Circle. ...I TOLD Thrall we should rename ourselves the \"Earthen Square\"."
G["Many good fortunes to you. I am Brother Rabbitsfoot. I am a merchant, a traveller, and a big luckydo for grummles.\n\nIn times of peace, $p would do well to buy of my wares. But fortune has us meet this day.\n\nWe have much work to do together."]="Many good fortunes to you. I am Brother Rabbitsfoot. I am a merchant, a traveller, and a big luckydo for grummles.\n\nIn times of peace, $p would do well to buy of my wares. But fortune has us meet this day.\n\nWe have much work to do together."
G["Many great conflicts have occurred in these swamps. I can still feel the lingering energy."]="Many great conflicts have occurred in these swamps. I can still feel the lingering energy."
G["Many have been lost to the seas.  I, and the wisps, are charged with looking for those souls."]="Many have been lost to the seas.  I, and the wisps, are charged with looking for those souls."
G["Many have come from all corners of the land to see the gates opened at last. Indeed, many of your people have already found their way inside. Seek your own solace and refuge within."]="Many have come from all corners of the land to see the gates opened at last. Indeed, many of your people have already found their way inside. Seek your own solace and refuge within."
G["Many have come to this sanctuary, few have left."]="Muitos têm vindo a este santuário, muitos se têm ido."
G["Many have fallen within Valhalas and their corpses are a testament to the strength of our ways.\n\nWill your bones litter this place of honor and battle as well, $n?"]="Many have fallen within Valhalas and their corpses are a testament to the strength of our ways.\n\nWill your bones litter this place of honor and battle as well, $n?"
G["Many have tested my claim, and I yet stand proven."]="Muitos têm desafiou meus palavras, e seguem demostrando ser certas."
G["Many imps! Handle it!"]="Muitos diabretes! Faça algo!"
G["Many locked boxes of supplies were sunk by the orcs in Lake Everstill in Redridge."]="Muitas caixas trancadas de suprimentos foram afundadas pelos orcs no lago Everstill, em Redridge."
G["Many locked supply boxes were lost when the Naga overran the Zoram Strand in Ashenvale."]="Muitas caixas de suprimentos trancadas foram perdidas quando os Naga invadiram o Zoram Strand em Ashenvale."
G["Many of the Mogu emperors buried their servants with them trapping their spirits in servitude for eternity."]="Many of the Mogu emperors buried their servants with them trapping their spirits in servitude for eternity."
G["Many of the priesthood had been slain by the same magisters who now vowed to serve the naaru.  They were not happy to share the city with their former enemies."]="Muitos sacerdotes morreram a mãos dos magistri que agora têm jurado servir ao naarus. Não queriam compartilhar a cidade com os seus antigos inimigos."
G["Many of the supplies that tradesmen need can be found in the world. For those that cannot, I provide a limited selection for fair price."]="Many of the supplies that tradesmen need can be found in the world. For those that cannot, I provide a limited selection for fair price."
G["Many of the supplies the tailors need come by way of Darnassus.  It is not surprising that they all moved there to work.  If you wish to be a tailor then you best head to Darnassus."]="Muitos dos suprimentos de que os alfaiates precisam vêm por meio de Darnassus. Não é de surpreender que todos tenham se mudado para lá para trabalhar. Se você deseja ser um alfaiate, é melhor ir a Darnassus."
G["Many of us tried to escape the naga.\n\nI am the only one who succeeded..."]="Muitos de nós intentamos escapar dos nagas.\n\nE eu sou o único que o conseguiu..."
G["Many of you have experienced a betrayal of trust."]="Muitos de vocês vocês têm sofrido uma traição à sua confiança."
G["Many people forget that a fine brew has equal application in cooking as it does for drinking! There's nothing in all of Pandaria quite like my famous Honeydew glazed fish!"]="Many people forget that a fine brew has equal application in cooking as it does for drinking! There's nothing in all of Pandaria quite like my famous Honeydew glazed fish!"
G["Many thanks for rescue of most good fortune."]="Muitas Obrigado por este resgate tão sortudo."
G["Many thanks for rescue!"]="Muitas Obrigado pelo resgate!"
G["Many thanks to you, $c.  I'd best get to the crash site and see how I can help out.  Until we meet again."]="Many thanks to you, $c.  I'd best get to the crash site and see how I can help out.  Until we meet again."
G["Many thanks!"]="Muitas Obrigado!"
G["Many thanks! \n\nThe local earth spirit, Hui, is angry that we hired adventurers to drive off his mischievous sprites. \n\nI can understand he's upset, but this attack is simply going too far!"]="Many thanks! \n\nThe local earth spirit, Hui, is angry that we hired adventurers to drive off his mischievous sprites. \n\nI can understand he's upset, but this attack is simply going too far!"
G["Many thanks! Allow me to repay you by killing a few dozen of these beasts!"]="Many thanks! Allow me to repay you by killing a few dozen of these beasts!"
G["Many thanks! This is the last time we travel west of the wall."]="Muitas Obrigado! É a última vez que viajamos ao oeste da muralha."
G["Many thanks, $c!"]="Muitas Obrigado, $c!"
G["Many thanks, $n.  These horns are going to make me a fortune!"]="Many thanks, $n.  These horns are going to make me a fortune!"
G["Many thanks, hero!"]="Muitas Obrigado, herói!"
G["Many thanks."]="Many thanks."
G["Many thanks... I couldn't have held out much longer."]="Many thanks... I couldn't have held out much longer."
G["Many thanks... I couldn't have held out much longer.\nAlas, I'm in no condition to go on.\nIf only our entire supply of Greenstone Brew hadn't been stolen!  I would've concocted a draft of marvelous power for you..."]="Many thanks... I couldn't have held out much longer.\nAlas, I'm in no condition to go on.\nIf only our entire supply of Greenstone Brew hadn't been stolen!  I would've concocted a draft of marvelous power for you..."
G["Many things to sell, yes. Yak-hair amulets. Very popular. Very lucky."]="Many things to sell, yes. Yak-hair amulets. Very popular. Very lucky."
G["Many think the staff an inferior weapon. I challenge any who think so to prove their strength against my staff."]="Talvez consideres ao cajado um arma menor. Desafio a tudo o que piense assim a testar sua força contra a de meu cajado."
G["Many thousands of years ago, the mogu held all the power. They ruled this land with fists of iron. But as their empire grew, they needed a way to police and control it."]="Há muitos milhares de anos, os mogus detinham todo o poder. Eles governavam esta terra com punhos de ferro. Mas, à medida que o império crescia, eles precisavam de uma maneira de policiá-lo e controlá-lo."
G["Many times have I fallen at the hands of an Orc, and many times have I risen again."]="Many times have I fallen at the hands of an Orc, and many times have I risen again."
G["Many times my blades have felled my target before they even drew near. The secret is in the flick of your wrist."]="Many times my blades have felled my target before they even drew near. The secret is in the flick of your wrist."
G["Many were the threats to our race after the usurpers remade the world. Narrow was the path ahead."]="Many were the threats to our race after the usurpers remade the world. Narrow was the path ahead."
G["Many would tell you that the Tallstrider is a laughable pet. But it's intelligence and loyalty make it a hard creature to match in many situations. If you are interested in the breed, then perhaps I can introduce you and your pet to a few talents I have learned over the years."]="Many would tell you that the Tallstrider is a laughable pet. But it's intelligence and loyalty make it a hard creature to match in many situations. If you are interested in the breed, then perhaps I can introduce you and your pet to a few talents I have learned over the years."
G["Many years ago I died tragically while attempting to help with a local murloc problem. However, I was content to stay and watch my family and friends instead of passing on to be with the Goddess.\n\nNow they are all gone, or worse, dead, and I have only one reason to stay.\n\nVengeance."]="Many years ago I died tragically while attempting to help with a local murloc problem. However, I was content to stay and watch my family and friends instead of passing on to be with the Goddess.\n\nNow they are all gone, or worse, dead, and I have only one reason to stay.\n\nVengeance."
G["Many years ago, my men and I followed the wizard Khadgar and the paladin Turalyon to this world. Our sole aim was to annihilate the orcs and their vile kin. Yet something went terribly wrong in the final hours of our war.\n\nUltimately, this dark world was ripped asunder - and my dear friends were lost to the void."]="Many years ago, my men and I followed the wizard Khadgar and the paladin Turalyon to this world. Our sole aim was to annihilate the orcs and their vile kin. Yet something went terribly wrong in the final hours of our war.\n\nUltimately, this dark world was ripped asunder - and my dear friends were lost to the void."
G["Many young Pandaren warriors have vanished into this...tomb. Have your wits about you."]="Many young Pandaren warriors have vanished into this...tomb. Have your wits about you."
G["Mar'kowa tallol ye'tarin, it knows, it knows."]="Mar'kowa tallol ye'tarin, sabe, sabe."
G["Marauders to the north! Fire!"]="Marauders to the north! Fire!"
G["Maraudon is located in the middle of the western coast of Desolace, in the Valley of Spears."]="Maraudon está localizado no meio da costa oeste de Desolace, no vale de Spears."
G["Maraudon is one of the most sacred sites within Desolace. The great temple/cavern is the burial place of Zaetar, one of two immortal sons born to the demigod, Cenarius. Legend holds that Zaetar and the earth elemental princess, Theradras, sired the misbegotten centaur race. It is said that upon their emergence, the barbaric centaur turned on their father and killed him. Some believe that Theradras, in her grief, trapped Zaetar's spirit within the winding cavern - used its energies for some malign purpose."]="Maraudon is one of the most sacred sites within Desolace. The great temple/cavern is the burial place of Zaetar, one of two immortal sons born to the demigod, Cenarius. Legend holds that Zaetar and the earth elemental princess, Theradras, sired the misbegotten centaur race. It is said that upon their emergence, the barbaric centaur turned on their father and killed him. Some believe that Theradras, in her grief, trapped Zaetar's spirit within the winding cavern - used its energies for some malign purpose."
G["March of the Legion"]="Marcha da Legião"
G["Marduk, gather the box and place it before me!"]="Marduk, gather the box and place it before me!"
G["Marines, Sergeants, attack!"]="Soldados, sargentos, ataquem!"
G["Marines, stand at ease!"]="Marines, stand at ease!"
G["Marion Call is keeping Dark Cleric Beryl company in the reading room upstairs at the Gallows' End Tavern on the southeast edge of Brill.  I'm just dying to see who wins that staring contest."]="Marion Call está mantendo a companhia Dark Cleric Beryl na sala de leitura no andar de cima, na Gallows 'End Tavern, na extremidade sudeste de Brill. Estou morrendo de vontade de ver quem ganha o concurso."
G["Marion Call is lurking under the stairs in the inn."]="Marion Call is lurking under the stairs in the inn."
G["Mark II, get your metallic behind back here this instant!"]="Versão 2, traz seu culo mecânico aqui agora mesmo!"
G["Mark my words!  You won't find faster gryphons anywhere in the Eastern Kingdoms than the ones right here in Thelsamar!"]="Marque minhas palavras! Você não encontrará grifos mais rápidos em nenhum lugar dos Reinos do Leste do que os que estão aqui em Thelsamar!"
G["Mark my words! I'm gonna get you, $n! I'll get you all! Out of my way!"]="Mark my words! I'm gonna get you, $n! I'll get you all! Out of my way!"
G["Mark my words, I will catch you, imp. And when I do!"]="Mark my words, I will catch you, imp. And when I do!"
G["Mark my words, these forsaken fools will be the death of us all!"]="Marque minhas palavras, esses tolos abandonados serão a morte de todos nós!"
G["Markhor, I wish to stable my pet."]="Markhor, quero deixar a meu ajudante no estábulo."
G["Marksmen! Front and center! Scourge attack incoming!"]="Marksmen! Front and center! Scourge attack incoming!"
G["Marksmen, form up and take your positions!"]="Marksmen, form up and take your positions!"
G["Marksmen, lock and load!"]="Marksmen, lock and load!"
G["Marlgen... One of the jailors. He has the key to my bonds."]="Marlgen... Um dos carcereiros. Ele tem a chave dos meus laços."
G["Marooned! Blasted to bits by the Alliance and stranded on some island in the middle of who-knows-where?!\n\nBusiness as usual, right, $n?"]="Abandonados! Destrozados pela Aliança e varados em uma ilha em metade de quem-sabe-onde!\n\nAssim são os negócios, eh, $n?"
G["Marry me, $p!"]="Marry me, $p!"
G["Marshal Marris expects the reserve from Stormwind any time now. . . ."]="Marshal Marris expects the reserve from Stormwind any time now. . . ."
G["Marshal Marris, sir.  Corporal Keeshan of the 12th Sabre Regiment returned from battle and reporting for duty!"]="Marshal Marris, sir.  Corporal Keeshan of the 12th Sabre Regiment returned from battle and reporting for duty!"
G["Marshal Troteman and a handful o' scouts pursued a Horde warband up the beach. They haven't come back."]="Marshal Troteman and a handful o' scouts pursued a Horde warband up the beach. They haven't come back."
G["Marshal Windsor has been expecting you, $n. Unfortunately, he is currently indisposed. He should be returning shortly."]="Marshal Windsor has been expecting you, $n. Unfortunately, he is currently indisposed. He should be returning shortly."
G["Marshal our forces. Contact our goblin shipwrights. The Horde prepares for war!"]="Marshal our forces. Contact our goblin shipwrights. The Horde prepares for war!"
G["Marshal, excellent work fortifying the harbor. Our next priority is -"]="Marechal, bom trabalho com a fortificação do porto. A prioridade agora..."
G["Marshal, see to it that you hold this position until construction is complete."]="Marechal, certifique-se de defenda esta posição até que terminen o trabalho."
G["Marshals... brothers and sisters of the sword.  I'd rather fight alongside you than any army of thousands.  We are lions!  You know what's waiting through these demons and beyond that Dark Portal?  Immortality!  Take it!"]="Marshals... brothers and sisters of the sword.  I'd rather fight alongside you than any army of thousands.  We are lions!  You know what's waiting through these demons and beyond that Dark Portal?  Immortality!  Take it!"
G["Martar wants a furry buddy!!"]="Martar quer amigo peludo!"
G["Martek, you are the bravest orc I know."]="Martek, você é o orc mais corajoso que eu conheço."
G["Martha, I'm out of flour for bread. You wouldn't happen to have any grain from that recent shipment, would you?"]="Martha, I'm out of flour for bread. You wouldn't happen to have any grain from that recent shipment, would you?"
G["Martha, something's wrong with this grain! Some of the Prince's soldiers were looking for this. I'm going to go look for one."]="Martha, a este grano lhe passa algo raro! Alguns dos soldados do Príncipe o estavam procurando. Vou procurar a um."
G["Marvel at its tenacity and vigor! A champion has been found!"]="Maravílhate ante seu tenacidade e vigor! Temos encontrado um campeão!"
G["Marvelous! You bound ahead with more haste than a flame-laden kitten. Quite suitable indeed!"]="Marvelous! You bound ahead with more haste than a flame-laden kitten. Quite suitable indeed!"
G["Marvelous. Simply marvelous. You are an inspiration to us all, $n."]="Maravilhoso. Simplesmente maravilhoso. É uma inspiração para todos nós, $n."
G["Marwyn, finish them..."]="Marwyn, acaba com eles..."
G["Mary Edras is the one you want. She's set up at the inner ring of the Rogues' Quarter."]="Mary Edras é quem você deseja. Ela está montada no anel interno do Bairro dos Ladinos."
G["Masha, go to our tent and hide yourself away."]="Masha, go to our tent and hide yourself away."
G["Masha, we have to run. We must get far away from here. They will come for us."]="Masha, we have to run. We must get far away from here. They will come for us."
G["Mason, sir."]="Mason, sir."
G["Masses of wolves are to the east, and whoever lived at Malden's Orchard is gone."]="Masses of wolves are to the east, and whoever lived at Malden's Orchard is gone."
G["Massive Qiraji resonating crystals break through the earthen crust of Kalimdor. Colossal creatures made of obsidian stone breach the freshly broken land."]="Massive Qiraji resonating crystals break through the earthen crust of Kalimdor. Colossal creatures made of obsidian stone breach the freshly broken land."
G["Master Boom Boom ready to boom up some wikkets!"]="O mestre Bum Bum está pronto para bum bum makakus!"
G["Master Boom Boom's got some super boom sticks."]="O mestre Bum Bum tem algum super palos bum."
G["Master Brownstone and his crew have fallen asleep!"]="Master Brownstone and his crew have fallen asleep!"
G["Master Brownstone and his lackeys are notorious for sleeping on the job."]="Master Brownstone and his lackeys are notorious for sleeping on the job."
G["Master Cheng is burning you alive!  Move!"]="Master Cheng is burning you alive!  Move!"
G["Master Cheng is spinning!  Paralyze her!"]="A mestra Cheng está virando! Paralízala!"
G["Master Crane! Are you okay?"]="Mestre Grulha! Está bem?"
G["Master Hight is burning you alive.  Move!"]="Master Hight is burning you alive.  Move!"
G["Master Hight is healing.  Interrupt him!"]="Master Hight is healing.  Interrupt him!"
G["Master Hight is preparing a massive strike with his polearm.  Disarm him!"]="Master Hight is preparing a massive strike with his polearm.  Disarm him!"
G["Master Hight is spinning.  Paralyze him!"]="Master Hight is spinning.  Paralyze him!"
G["Master Hsu prepares a hard-hitting swing with his polearm.  Disarm him before he can complete it!"]="Master Hsu prepares a hard-hitting swing with his polearm.  Disarm him before he can complete it!"
G["Master Jiying says we have to continue our research, but it's nice to come here and relax every once in a while."]="Master Jiying says we have to continue our research, but it's nice to come here and relax every once in a while."
G["Master Kistane is running away to heal at a nearby Jade Serpent Statue.  Slow her and defeat her before she can heal herself!"]="Master Kistane is running away to heal at a nearby Jade Serpent Statue.  Slow her and defeat her before she can heal herself!"
G["Master Li Fei fades away."]="O mestre Li Fei desaparece lentamente."
G["Master Li Fei's voice echoes, \"Go, children. We shall meet again very soon.\""]="Se ouça a voz do mestre Li Fei: \"Adiante, jovens. Nos volveremos a ver muito pronto\"."
G["Master Li Fei's voice echoes, \"Huo, the spirit of fire, is known for his hunger. He wants for tinder to eat. He needs the caress of the wind to rouse him.\""]="Master Li Fei's voice echoes, \"Huo, the spirit of fire, is known for his hunger. He wants for tinder to eat. He needs the caress of the wind to rouse him.\""
G["Master Li Fei's voice echoes, \"If you find these things and bring them to his cave, on the far side of Wu-Song Village, you will face a challenge within.\""]="Master Li Fei's voice echoes, \"If you find these things and bring them to his cave, on the far side of Wu-Song Village, you will face a challenge within.\""
G["Master Li Fei's voice echoes, \"It is good to see you again, Aysa. You've come with respect, and so I shall give you the answers you seek.\""]="Se ouça a voz do mestre Li Fei: \"fico feliz em voltar a ver você, Aysa. Tem vindo com respeito, pelo que te darei as respostas que atenção\"."
G["Master Li Fei's voice echoes, \"Overcome that challenge, and you shall be graced by Huo's presence. Rekindle his flame, and if your spirit is pure, he shall follow you.\""]="Master Li Fei's voice echoes, \"Overcome that challenge, and you shall be graced by Huo's presence. Rekindle his flame, and if your spirit is pure, he shall follow you.\""
G["Master Li Fei's voice echoes, \"The way of the Tushui... enlightenment through patience and meditation... the principled life.\""]="Master Li Fei's voice echoes, \"The way of the Tushui... enlightenment through patience and meditation... the principled life.\""
G["Master Nesingwary has a big hunt ahead of him.  I find helping him prepare for a day in the jungle is much more relaxing than helping him ready for combat.  Although I do miss some of those glorious moments on the battlefield."]="Mestre Nesingwary tem uma grande caçada pela linha de frente. Acho que ajudá-o a se preparar para um dia na selva é muito mais relaxante do que ajudá-o a se preparar para o combate. Embora eu sinta falta de algum daqueles momentos gloriosos no campo de batalha."
G["Master Putress, a bat rider approaches!"]="Amo Putress, se aproxima um cavaleiro de morcego!"
G["Master Pyreanor can be found among Thrall's advisors in his fortress, Grommash Hold, in the Valley of Wisdom."]="Mestre Pyreanor pode ser encontrado entre os conselheiros de Thrall na sua fortaleza, Grommash Hold, no Vale da Sabedoria."
G["Master Shang Xi, I would like to accompany the Alliance back to their home."]="Mestre Shang Xi, gostaria acompanhar à Aliança quando partan."
G["Master Shang has trained you well. Thank you, friend!"]="Master Shang has trained you well. Thank you, friend!"
G["Master Snowdrift attacks you with his hand to hand techniques!"]="Master Snowdrift attacks you with his hand to hand techniques!"
G["Master Snowdrift is |cFFFF0000|Hspell:118961|h[Chasing]|h|r you! If he catches you he will use his |cFFFF0000|Hspell:106352|h[Tornado Slam]|h|r technique on you! Run away from Master Snowdrift until Chase Down expires!"]="Master Snowdrift is |cFFFF0000|Hspell:118961|h[Chasing]|h|r you! If he catches you he will use his |cFFFF0000|Hspell:106352|h[Tornado Slam]|h|r technique on you! Run away from Master Snowdrift until Chase Down expires!"
G["Master Snowdrift speaks highly of how you can hold your own in a fight."]="Master Snowdrift speaks highly of how you can hold your own in a fight."
G["Master Snowdrift vanishes to the shadows and creates duplicate illusions of himself! Strike the illusions to dispel them!"]="Master Snowdrift vanishes to the shadows and creates duplicate illusions of himself! Strike the illusions to dispel them!"
G["Master Stone Fist is nearly unmatched in single combat. He once defeated nine hundred and ninety-nine challengers in a row."]="Master Stone Fist is nearly unmatched in single combat. He once defeated nine hundred and ninety-nine challengers in a row."
G["Master Stone Fist was right about you. You're good."]="Master Stone Fist was right about you. You're good."
G["Master Stormrage. It's good to have you back in the waking world."]="Mestre Tempestira. Fico feliz ver você no mundo da vigia."
G["Master Taerar no longer dwells here, fool. He has bestowed me with enough power to stop you!"]="Master Taerar no longer dwells here, fool. He has bestowed me with enough power to stop you!"
G["Master Taerar will show you such wonder!"]="Master Taerar will show you such wonder!"
G["Master Thal'darah has sent me to rescue you. Climb on!"]="Master Thal'darah has sent me to rescue you. Climb on!"
G["Master Vectus, I sense something strange within this container..."]="Mestre Vectus, sinto algo estranho no seu interior..."
G["Master Woo Ping has mastered nearly every weapon known to man.  He is especially deadly with his sword techniques.  He spends a good deal of time over in the Weller's Arsenal waiting on new shipments of weapons to arrive if you need some training."]="Mestre Woo Ping dominou quase todas as armas conhecidas pelo homem. Ele é especialmente mortal com as suas técnicas de lâmina. Ele passa bastante tempo no Arsenal do Weller esperando novos carregamentos de armas para chegar, se você precisar de algum treinamento."
G["Master Woo's defenses are nearing their maximum potential.  Use Touch of Death to finish her off!"]="Master Woo's defenses are nearing their maximum potential.  Use Touch of Death to finish her off!"
G["Master Yoon is healing, interrupt him!"]="O mestre Yoon se você está curando. Interrúmpelo!"
G["Master chef, can you train me in the culinary arts?"]="Mestre cozinheiro, você pode me treinar nas artes culinárias?"
G["Master craftsman Omarion just vanished one night. Like a toot in the wind... Poof! Gone! Bah, now I'm the only one left to craft the goods for the boys on the front lines."]="Master craftsman Omarion just vanished one night. Like a toot in the wind... Poof! Gone! Bah, now I'm the only one left to craft the goods for the boys on the front lines."
G["Master!  We've found the traitor who escaped Vashj!  His body lies in front of me... lifeless!"]="Mestre! Temos ao traidor que escapó de Vashj! Seu corpo jaz ante mim... sem vida!"
