G["Matters of such an official nature are only handled in Darnassus.  You must travel there to begin the process of your guild's creation."]="Assuntos de natureza oficial são tratados apenas em Darnassus. Você deve viajar para lá para iniciar o processo de criação da sua guilda."
G["Mau'ari know why you seek her out...\n\nBring me da E'ko you find in the world, an' I can transform it for you."]="Mau'ari know why you seek her out...\n\nBring me da E'ko you find in the world, an' I can transform it for you."
G["Maul!  Swipe!  MANGLE!"]="Magulhar! Flagelo! DE'TROZAR!"
