G["Maximillian, I am ready to ride."]="Maximillian, I am ready to ride."
G["Maximum power achieved."]="Maximum power achieved."
G["Maxnar is going to have my hide if we don't get this assault underway soon!"]="Maxnar is going to have my hide if we don't get this assault underway soon!"
G["May Azeroth never fail to remember the terrible price we paid for our weakness... for our pride."]="Que Azeroth lembrança terrível preço que pagamos por nossa fraqueza... por nosso orgulho."
G["May Cenarius guide you, $c.\n\nI am here in this corrupt land with my sisters on a mission of great importance to the Cenarion Circle. But only those who are powerful enough I ask speak to me about such matters--to send a lesser being would be folly."]="May Cenarius guide you, $c.\n\nI am here in this corrupt land with my sisters on a mission of great importance to the Cenarion Circle. But only those who are powerful enough I ask speak to me about such matters--to send a lesser being would be folly."
G["May Cenarius watch over you, $g brother : sister;.\n\nI am Tajarri, and I am a sworn protector of this shrine.  It is my honor to serve Keeper Remulos as a warden of this sacred land."]="May Cenarius watch over you, $g brother : sister;.\n\nI am Tajarri, and I am a sworn protector of this shrine.  It is my honor to serve Keeper Remulos as a warden of this sacred land."
G["May Elune walk with you, $c.  The Temple of the Moon has come to help the troubled citizens of Auberdine."]="Que Eluna camine com você, $c. O Templo da Lua tem vindo a ajudar aos desamparados cidadãos de Auberdine."
G["May Elune watch over you."]="Que Eluna te cuide."
G["May I bask in your shadow forever!"]="May I bask in your shadow forever!"
G["May I browse your epic gem recipes?"]="Posso procurar suas receitas épicas de gemas?"
G["May I have another Cleansing Totem?"]="Pode me dar outro totem de limpeza?"
