G["May I have another Dawn's Gambit, Betina?  I want to test it again..."]="May I have another Dawn's Gambit, Betina?  I want to test it again..."
G["May I have another racing ram?"]="Posso ter outro carneiro de corrida?"
G["May I have another vial of Elemental Sapta?"]="Pode me dar outro frasco de sapta elemental?"
