G["May I help you taste?"]="Posso ajudá-o a provar?"
G["May I rest here?"]="Posso descansar aqui?"
G["May I say that it's an honor to be your driver?"]="May I say that it's an honor to be your driver?"
G["May I see your wares?"]="Posso ver seus produtos?"
G["May I suggest that you save us from the pirates, my dear $n?!"]="Poderá sugerir que nos salves desses piratas, $gquerido: querida; $n?!"
G["May I use a drake to fly elsewhere?"]="Posso usar um drake para voar para outro lugar?"
G["May Kel'Thuzad one day feel our vengeance."]="Que Kel'Thuzad sienta um dia nossa vingança."
G["May Tayutka repay you and your village."]="Que Tayutkaos o pague você e ao seu povo."
G["May a lucky star shine upon you, $c. Here you will find representatives from all the factions of Pandaria. Speak to them to find out if you are the brave adventurer that they seek."]="May a lucky star shine upon you, $c. Here you will find representatives from all the factions of Pandaria. Speak to them to find out if you are the brave adventurer that they seek."
G["May da elements protect us."]="Que o' elementos nos p'otejan."
G["May da spirits protect you mon."]="Que os espíritos o protejam, seg."
G["May de spirits guide ya, $c."]="May de spirits guide ya, $c."
G["May de spirits of de dead continue to watch over us."]="May de spirits of de dead continue to watch over us."
G["May fortune follow you."]="Que a fortuna te acompanhe."
G["May her presence be a source of comfort and companionship to you."]="May her presence be a source of comfort and companionship to you."
G["May her spirit fly to you swiftly; may the winds carry her gently, and the grass whisper her name."]="May her spirit fly to you swiftly; may the winds carry her gently, and the grass whisper her name."
G["May it be as you say, Grand Anchorite."]="Que assim seja, grande anacoreta."
