G["May it serve you well, $n."]="Tomara te sirva bem, $n."
G["May not be great hunt, but this still fun after so many time."]="Talvez não ser grande caça, mas ainda ser divertido depois de tanto tempo."
G["May our ancestors protect us from these outsiders and their violent ways."]="May our ancestors protect us from these outsiders and their violent ways."
G["May our battle be glorious."]="Que nossa batalha seja gloriosa."
G["May our bond with you never be broken again, spirit."]="May our bond with you never be broken again, spirit."
G["May peace find you now."]="Que descanses em paz."
G["May the Deadmines serve as your tomb, $n!"]="Que As Minas da Morte te sirvan de tumba, $n!"
G["May the Earth Mother preserve us."]="Que a Mãe Terra nos cuida todos."
