G["Miniature tanks, or Tonks as we've cleverly named them, have been a faire favorite for as long as I can remember.\n\nWe have two arenas dedicated for tonk battles.\n\nOne arena pits you against the clock as you race to destroy targets, and avoid the enemy tonks.  You just need a game token to play!\n\nThe other arena is a place where you can use your own tonks or MiniZeps to battle your friends."]="Miniature tanks, or Tonks as we've cleverly named them, have been a faire favorite for as long as I can remember.\n\nWe have two arenas dedicated for tonk battles.\n\nOne arena pits you against the clock as you race to destroy targets, and avoid the enemy tonks.  You just need a game token to play!\n\nThe other arena is a place where you can use your own tonks or MiniZeps to battle your friends."
G["Mining"]="Mining (Mineração)"
G["Mining Supplies"]="Suprimentos de mineração"
G["Mining allows you to locate and mine ore, minerals and stone from mining nodes in the wilderness and underground. These can be sold at the auction house or used to support the Blacksmithing, Engineering, or Jewelcrafting professions.\nSkilled miners also become tough and gain increased Stamina.\nYou'll need a Mining Pick in order to mine; this can be purchased from trade or Mining vendors."]="Mining allows you to locate and mine ore, minerals and stone from mining nodes in the wilderness and underground. These can be sold at the auction house or used to support the Blacksmithing, Engineering, or Jewelcrafting professions.\nSkilled miners also become tough and gain increased Stamina.\nYou'll need a Mining Pick in order to mine; this can be purchased from trade or Mining vendors."
G["Mining iron."]="Cavando ferro."
