G["Morning, my friends."]="Bons dias, amigos."
G["Moroi, I know you're in there! We don't have all day. Mother doesn't either! Get out here you scoundrel!"]="Moroi, I know you're in there! We don't have all day. Mother doesn't either! Get out here you scoundrel!"
G["Mortal Insects! You dare trespass into MY domain?  Your arrogance will be purged in living flame."]="Mortal Insects! You dare trespass into MY domain?  Your arrogance will be purged in living flame."
G["Mortal champions have long used these weapons to combat evil. I see no reason to keep the swords from them in this battle."]="Durante muito tempo os campeões mortais têm utilizado estas armas para combater o mal. Não vejo por que as espadas não teriam de participar nesta batalha."
G["Mortal creature, you are the infestation that must be cleansed."]="Criatura mortal, você é a infestação que é preciso purgar."
