G["My Lord... you are gravely wounded!"]="Meu senhor... está gravemente ferido!"
G["My Onslaught will wash over the Lich King's forces!"]="My Onslaught will wash over the Lich King's forces!"
G["My Prince, we should leave this place, in case they come back to finish the job."]="Meu príncipe, deveríamos sair deste lugar, por se voltam a terminar o trabalho."
G["My Queen, do they know?"]="Meu rainha, o sabem?"
G["My Royal Dreadguard, you will deal with this matter as befits your station.  That, or you will wish that you had."]="My Royal Dreadguard, you will deal with this matter as befits your station.  That, or you will wish that you had."
G["My S.T.O.U.T. is more than just a target for throwing steins, it's a valuable training asset.  If you can hit S.T.O.U.T. you can probably hit anything!\n\nJust try not to hit me."]="My S.T.O.U.T. is more than just a target for throwing steins, it's a valuable training asset.  If you can hit S.T.O.U.T. you can probably hit anything!\n\nJust try not to hit me."
G["My Syra will NOT be seen with the likes of a Wanderbrew."]="My Syra will NOT be seen with the likes of a Wanderbrew."
G["My Zandalar Demoniac's Wraps have gone missing. Can you provide me with another set?"]="My Zandalar Demoniac's Wraps have gone missing. Can you provide me with another set?"
G["My Zandalar Predator's Belt has gone missing. Can you help, Falthir?"]="Meu cinto de predador Zandalariano sumiu. Pode me ajudar, Falthir?"
G["My achy bones. Achy knees. Achy face. I shoulda stayed in school I shoulda."]="Me duelen os ossos. Me duelen as joelhos. Me dói a rosto. Não deveria haver saído a escola."
G["My advice is no good to ye unless ye're ridin' a tournament mount.\n\nEquip a lance and grab a tournament mount outside yer faction's pavilion."]="My advice is no good to ye unless ye're ridin' a tournament mount.\n\nEquip a lance and grab a tournament mount outside yer faction's pavilion."
G["My advice to you is simple, $r.\n\nDo not get in the way here."]="Meu conselho é muito simples, $r.\n\nNão nos incordies."
G["My alchemy is supreme!"]="Meu alquimia é suprema!"
G["My altar will siphon the life from you!"]="Meu altar consumirá sua vida!"
G["My answer? Here's my answer, little messenger!"]="Meu decisão? Aqui está meu decisão, $gpequeno: pequena; $gmensajero: mensageira;!"
G["My apologies, $c, but the arcane secrets of the Highborne will forever remain secrets to you."]="My apologies, $c, but the arcane secrets of the Highborne will forever remain secrets to you."
G["My apologies, $n, but I do not offer instruction to novices. Instead, talk to Milla Fairancora in the Craftsmen's Terrace of Darnassus. She can help you make up for lost time."]="My apologies, $n, but I do not offer instruction to novices. Instead, talk to Milla Fairancora in the Craftsmen's Terrace of Darnassus. She can help you make up for lost time."
G["My apologies, Advisor. I did not recognize $Ghim:her;!"]="My apologies, Advisor. I did not recognize $Ghim:her;!"
G["My apologies, Cromush, but I assure you there is no problem. We are using an extremely dilute plague."]="My apologies, Cromush, but I assure you there is no problem. We are using an extremely dilute plague."
G["My apologies, I did not realize that you could understand what I was saying. What is it you are doing out here?"]="Minhas desculpas, eu não sabia que você podia entender o que eu estava dizendo. O que você está fazendo aqui?"
G["My apologies, Lady Prestor."]="Discúlpame, Lady Prestor."
G["My apologies, Nozari. I have been a bit 'on edge' as of late. These creatures are attempting to alter the timeways."]="My apologies, Nozari. I have been a bit 'on edge' as of late. These creatures are attempting to alter the timeways."
G["My apologies, Pebblebitty."]="Minhas desculpas, Pebblebitty."
G["My apologies, adventurer. The grand warlock Wilfred Fizzlebang has not arrived on the tournament grounds yet, so the next challenge of the trial is not available. We expect him next week."]="My apologies, adventurer. The grand warlock Wilfred Fizzlebang has not arrived on the tournament grounds yet, so the next challenge of the trial is not available. We expect him next week."
G["My apologies, ambassador. My orders were quite clear."]="My apologies, ambassador. My orders were quite clear."
G["My apologies, but you have already learned everything I know. The night elf Faldron could offer you further training, however. Look for him in the Craftsmen's Terrace of Darnassus."]="Peço desculpas, mas você já aprendeu tudo o que sei. O elfo noturno Faldron poderia oferecer treinamento adicional, no entanto. Procure-o no terraço dos artesãos de Darnassus."
G["My apologies, friends. Here, now. This should help to cover the expenses involved in my rescue."]="My apologies, friends. Here, now. This should help to cover the expenses involved in my rescue."
G["My apologies, sir. I wish I had more to report."]="My apologies, sir. I wish I had more to report."
G["My apologies. I did not mean to offend. I am here on behalf of my people."]="Me desculpe. Eu não quis ofender. Estou aqui em nome do meu povo."
G["My apologies. My name is Anduin Wrynn. This champion and I need your help."]="Sinto muito. Me chamo Anduin Wrynn. $gEste campeão: Esta campeona; e eu precisamos de sua ajuda."
G["My arm is getting sore."]="My arm is getting sore."
G["My arm is tired..."]="Tenho o braço cansado..."
G["My armies are endless, my power, unmatched."]="My armies are endless, my power, unmatched."
G["My arms grow restless, anxiously waiting to drive my axes into the skull of the Lich King. Thrall would have us wait and let the Scourge continue to grow in strength. I will not have this!\n\nIf we are to end the threat of the Lich King, we must sail to Northrend and give him the full might of the Horde! Our forces are ready and willing to exact revenge for the deaths wrought by the plague and invasion.\n\nThe time to strike is now!"]="My arms grow restless, anxiously waiting to drive my axes into the skull of the Lich King. Thrall would have us wait and let the Scourge continue to grow in strength. I will not have this!\n\nIf we are to end the threat of the Lich King, we must sail to Northrend and give him the full might of the Horde! Our forces are ready and willing to exact revenge for the deaths wrought by the plague and invasion.\n\nThe time to strike is now!"
G["My army has not arrived.  I knew I could not trust the people I hired.  We will recruit new people.  We will sell these apples and our new army will crush them!"]="My army has not arrived.  I knew I could not trust the people I hired.  We will recruit new people.  We will sell these apples and our new army will crush them!"
G["My army will crush you!"]="Meu exército os aplastará!"
G["My arrows alone cannot bring that monstrosity down."]="My arrows alone cannot bring that monstrosity down."
G["My assistance?! You want my assistance?! I will not be part of your petty fighting."]="My assistance?! You want my assistance?! I will not be part of your petty fighting."
G["My assistant will show you to Master Cheng.  Good Luck!"]="Meu ajudante te levará até o mestre Cheng. Boa sorte!"
G["My attention... was wasted on you..."]="My attention... was wasted on you..."
G["My awakening is complete! You shall all perish!"]="My awakening is complete! You shall all perish!"
G["My axe has seen many battles, and I like to keep it handy. Enemy forces have fought their way into our capital several times now, but have no fear: we have always driven them back."]="Meu machado já passou por muitas batalhas e eu gosto de mantê-o à mão. As forças inimigas já chegaram à nossa capital várias vezes, mas não têm medo: sempre as expulsamos."
G["My axe has split as many Alliance skulls as yours, brother. Maybe more."]="Meu machado tem partido tantas cabeças da Aliança como à sua, irmão. Talvez mais."
G["My axe is yours, hero! Together we will destroy these insects!"]="Meu machado é sua, corajoso! Juntos destruiremos a esses insectos!"
G["My axe will soon feast upon your blood, human."]="Meu machado pronto derramará seu sangue, humano."
G["My baby boy... NO!!!!! WHY!???"]="Meu ninho... NÃO!!! POR QUE!!??"
G["My back is killing me today."]="A costas me está matando hoje."
G["My back is killing me."]="A costas me está matando."
G["My banishment is ended! Let the blood flow!"]="My banishment is ended! Let the blood flow!"
G["My beautiful Kolramas! You will all pay dearly for this outrage!"]="My beautiful Kolramas! You will all pay dearly for this outrage!"
G["My beautiful mill. You! You'll die for this!"]="Meu precioso molino. Você! Morrerá por isto!"
G["My bed is looking pretty good right now."]="Meu cama tem muito boa pinta agora."
G["My best guess is that the enormous floating fortress deterred any would-be travelers as of late."]="My best guess is that the enormous floating fortress deterred any would-be travelers as of late."
G["My best scouts still haven't returned."]="Meus melhores batedores ainda não têm voltado."
G["My bird! Lightning - they shot her! Those filthy beasts shot her from the sky!"]="Meu pássaro! Raios - eles atiraram nela! Aquelas bestas imundas atiraram nela do céu!"
G["My blade is peerless!"]="Meu aço não tem igual!"
G["My blade is yours, champion."]="Meu lâmina é sua, campeão."
G["My blade never misses its mark!"]="Meu aço nunca falha!"
G["My blade thirsts for battle. Do not keep me waiting."]="My blade thirsts for battle. Do not keep me waiting."
G["My blade thirsts for blood!"]="My blade thirsts for blood!"
G["My blade will char your flesh!"]="Meu lâmina abrasará seu carne!"
G["My blades are sharp, but my skill is unhoned. I am ready to learn, $n."]="Meus lâminas são incisivas, mas meu habilidade está desafilada. Estou pronto para aprender, $n."
G["My blades hunger."]="Meus lâminas têm fome."
G["My bling is blung..."]="E perdido meu brilho..."
G["My blood feeds Hakkar! My soul... feeds... Jin'do!"]="Meu sangue alimenta a Hakkar! Minha alma... alimenta... a Jin'do!"
G["My blood hungers."]="My blood hungers."
G["My blood is like venom!"]="My blood is like venom!"
G["My blood will be the end of you!"]="Meu sangue acabará com vocês!"
G["My boat winning!"]="Meu bote vai ganhando!"
G["My body is already starting to fight the naga infection.  Please, I ask you to get to safety before I unleash my wrath!"]="My body is already starting to fight the naga infection.  Please, I ask you to get to safety before I unleash my wrath!"
G["My body returns to the earth..."]="Meu corpo volta à terra..."
G["My bones are weak, my eyes see only darkness, and my body feels only pain; but these things are good because my will is my own."]="Meus ossos são fracos, meus olhos somente venha escuridão e meu corpo somente sente o dor, mas tudo isso é bom, porque meu vontade me pertence."
G["My boom boom is too small! Can I have another?"]="Meu bum bum é pekenho! Me das outro?"
G["My boss is going to kill me if I have to stay home sick another day this month."]="Meu chefe me matará se me quedo enfermo em casa outro dia mais este mês."
G["My boy died at the Wrath Gate. I am here only to collect his body."]="Meu filho morreu na Portões da Cólera. Somente e vindo a coletar seu corpo."
G["My boy! Just in time. We have more yaks to clean."]="Bem feito! Logo a tempo. Há muitos mais yaks que limpar."
G["My boys may not be the brightest, but we can take all of you on!"]="Talvez meus pessoal não sejam os mais prontos, mas podemos com todos vocês!"
G["My braids!"]="My braids!"
G["My brethren are endless in number."]="Meus irmãos são infinitos."
G["My brethren were here not long ago.  My connection to them has grown tenuous.  A powerful presence in the courtyard guards the way forward."]="Meus irmãos estavam aqui não faz muito tempo. Minha conexão com eles se tornou tênue. Uma presença poderosa no pátio guarda o caminho a seguir."
G["My brethren, my comrades-in-arms!  I must go to seek the forces of the Horde and direct them here!  Keep your spirits strong, brave hunters!  Do not fall to the portal-spawned fiends!"]="My brethren, my comrades-in-arms!  I must go to seek the forces of the Horde and direct them here!  Keep your spirits strong, brave hunters!  Do not fall to the portal-spawned fiends!"
G["My brood will feed on your bones!"]="Meu prole se alimentará dos seus ossos!"
G["My brother Krixx thinks he has it bad working in Orgrimmar. Nothing compares to the stench of this place. At least the boss had the decency to give me hazard pay!\nWhat? Do you want to see where the zeppelin is? Good thing I've got my zeppelin tracker right here!"]="My brother Krixx thinks he has it bad working in Orgrimmar. Nothing compares to the stench of this place. At least the boss had the decency to give me hazard pay!\nWhat? Do you want to see where the zeppelin is? Good thing I've got my zeppelin tracker right here!"
G["My brother and I have dedicated ourselves to Sylvanas. She is our beacon of light when times were darkest. We sacrifice ourselves day in and day out to ensure our kind overcome the destiny that's chosen us.\n\nWe will not remain weak. We will take that which is owed to us. We will return tenfold, the pain that was done to us. And we shall do so with smiles on our faces."]="My brother and I have dedicated ourselves to Sylvanas. She is our beacon of light when times were darkest. We sacrifice ourselves day in and day out to ensure our kind overcome the destiny that's chosen us.\n\nWe will not remain weak. We will take that which is owed to us. We will return tenfold, the pain that was done to us. And we shall do so with smiles on our faces."
G["My brother has spent years working on a cure for leper gnomes. Using his notes, I think I've perfected a process for restoring gnomes who've devolved to sludge."]="My brother has spent years working on a cure for leper gnomes. Using his notes, I think I've perfected a process for restoring gnomes who've devolved to sludge."
G["My brother said we could make great money with this trade route, but he didn't tell me I would be the one living on this side. If you come back this way on the Zeppelin, could you bring me something to eat? They sell some of the finest meat in Orgrimmar, and I sure could use something that didn't die weeks before it stopped moving."]="Meu irmão disse que poderíamos ganhar muito dinheiro com essa rota comercial, mas ele não disse para mim que eu seria a pessoa que moraria neste lado. Se você voltar desse jeito no Zeppelin, poderia me trazer algo para comer? Eles vendem a melhor carne de Orgrimmar, e com certeza eu poderia usar algo que não morreu semanas antes de parar de se mover."
G["My brother simply must try these."]="My brother simply must try these."
G["My brother, Stormhoof, was a far greater warrior than I. While I trained to be the chieftain of our clan, he prepared for a larger quest."]="My brother, Stormhoof, was a far greater warrior than I. While I trained to be the chieftain of our clan, he prepared for a larger quest."
G["My brother, Synipus has lots of them. You should head up north to Blue Sky Logging Grounds and talk to him."]="Meu irmão, Synipus tem muitos deles. Você deve ir para o norte, para o Blue Sky Logging Grounds e conversar com ele."
G["My brother, no!"]="Irmão! Não!"
G["My brother... yes... I do have brothers..."]="Meu irmão... sim... tenho irmãos..."
G["My brothers and I can reach northern Gilneas by boat in a matter of days.  As soon as we finish the repairs, that is."]="Meus irmãos e eu podemos chegar ao norte de Gilneas de navio em questão de dias. Assim que terminarmos os reparos, é isso."
G["My brothers and sisters have gone insane! Do you think you could help me get out of here?"]="Meus irmãos e irmãs ficaram loucos! Você acha que poderia me ajudar a sair daqui?"
G["My brothers and sisters, words cannot describe what I felt upon seeing the Sunwell rekindled."]="My brothers and sisters, words cannot describe what I felt upon seeing the Sunwell rekindled."
G["My brothers and sisters. Listen to me. We must speak of the survival of our people. We have narrowly survived one calamity, but I fear the next shall destroy us."]="My brothers and sisters. Listen to me. We must speak of the survival of our people. We have narrowly survived one calamity, but I fear the next shall destroy us."
G["My brothers are strong, but my brothers are passive.\n\nChange does not occur without movement, contention, and violence. Our enemies live this, whether they fully realize it or not. The passive nature of my brothers makes them weak and vulnerable to these new enemies.\n\nNot I. I have no fear of change. I will tear at the ground and move the mountains. I embrace change."]="My brothers are strong, but my brothers are passive.\n\nChange does not occur without movement, contention, and violence. Our enemies live this, whether they fully realize it or not. The passive nature of my brothers makes them weak and vulnerable to these new enemies.\n\nNot I. I have no fear of change. I will tear at the ground and move the mountains. I embrace change."
G["My brothers have awoken. Your efforts are wasted..."]="My brothers have awoken. Your efforts are wasted..."
G["My brothers have grown hungry. Your souls will sate their appetites."]="My brothers have grown hungry. Your souls will sate their appetites."
G["My brothers in Stormwind told me not to join the military... I'm glad I didn't listen to them!"]="Meus irmãos em Ventobravo disseram para mim para não participar das forças armadas... Fico feliz por não ouvi-os!"
G["My brothers will come for me and then you will see what true power is!"]="My brothers will come for me and then you will see what true power is!"
G["My burden grows heavier..."]="Meu carga se volta mais pesada..."
G["My business partner slays things; I drain a portion of their essence... a pittance, really; the slightest of slivers. It won't be missed.\n\nStill, to fulfil my portion of the contract, I pay in Ethereal Credits.\n\nOne may redeem these credits for items I sell at any time. I'm bound to have something that will interest you..."]="My business partner slays things; I drain a portion of their essence... a pittance, really; the slightest of slivers. It won't be missed.\n\nStill, to fulfil my portion of the contract, I pay in Ethereal Credits.\n\nOne may redeem these credits for items I sell at any time. I'm bound to have something that will interest you..."
G["My calculations did not..."]="Meus cálculos não..."
G["My calculations, incorrect? Perhaps another 800 years..."]="Incorrectos, meus cálculos? Talvez com outros 800 anos..."
G["My captors were cruel beyond measure, $n. They would alternate between Lieutenant Kirith and I, torturing one while the other watched. During a lull in the activity of an especially brutal day, Kirith told me what had happened to my men and a plan he had been formulating to free them from their masters.\n\nThey suffered a fate far worse than death, or even the pain Kirith and I  endured."]="My captors were cruel beyond measure, $n. They would alternate between Lieutenant Kirith and I, torturing one while the other watched. During a lull in the activity of an especially brutal day, Kirith told me what had happened to my men and a plan he had been formulating to free them from their masters.\n\nThey suffered a fate far worse than death, or even the pain Kirith and I  endured."
G["My case is made. This yak is very bad. We will not leave this yak temple until you fix him or replace him."]="My case is made. This yak is very bad. We will not leave this yak temple until you fix him or replace him."
G["My challenge, if you accept it, tasks you with healing the most grievous of wounds."]="My challenge, if you accept it, tasks you with healing the most grievous of wounds."
G["My challenge, if you accept it, will test your champion's ability to defend and protect while enduring terrible hardship."]="My challenge, if you accept it, will test your champion's ability to defend and protect while enduring terrible hardship."
G["My challenge, if you accept it, will test your cunning and footwork even in the midst of life-threatening danger."]="My challenge, if you accept it, will test your cunning and footwork even in the midst of life-threatening danger."
G["My challenges have strengthened you, champion. You shall serve me well!"]="Os retos te têm fortaleceram, campeão. Me servirás bem!"
G["My champion and I seek the blessing of your strength."]="My champion and I seek the blessing of your strength."
G["My champion and I seek the blessing of your wisdom."]="Nós buscamos a bênção de sua sabedoria."
G["My champion and I seek your blessing of fortitude."]="My champion and I seek your blessing of fortitude."
G["My champion and I seek your blessing of hope."]="My champion and I seek your blessing of hope."
G["My champion, destroy this monster!"]="Campeão, destrói a esse monstro!"
G["My champions will go. They will see what can be done, and rescue who they can."]="My champions will go. They will see what can be done, and rescue who they can."
G["My charge at Agmar's Hammer extends far beyond the care of the animals at the stables."]="Meu cargo no Martelo de Agmar vai muito além do cuidado dos animais nos estábulos."
G["My charge ends as your charge begins, Irulon. Farewell and may the Light guide you."]="Meu carga acaba onde começa à sua, Irulon. Adeus e que a Luz te guíe."
G["My charge to watch the temple has failed... my corrupted soul knows no peace..."]="Não e concluído meu cometido de proteção o templo... meu corrompida alma não tem paz..."
G["My chest is one of ingenious design, and requires two keys to unlock, one gold and one silver.  The first key, the silver key, I gave to my first mate, and I kept the gold.\n\nBut we were doomed to lose them.  My key was lost during the next naga attack, and my first mate's was lost a day later when drysnap makrura assailed us and pulled him into the deep.\n\nI am sure the naga and makrura have the keys.  I am glad the two are enemies and will not share them."]="My chest is one of ingenious design, and requires two keys to unlock, one gold and one silver.  The first key, the silver key, I gave to my first mate, and I kept the gold.\n\nBut we were doomed to lose them.  My key was lost during the next naga attack, and my first mate's was lost a day later when drysnap makrura assailed us and pulled him into the deep.\n\nI am sure the naga and makrura have the keys.  I am glad the two are enemies and will not share them."
G["My chickens... ATTACK!"]="My chickens... ATTACK!"
G["My child is nearly here... everything changes today..."]="Meu filho já quase está aqui... hoje muda tudo..."
G["My children are in Stormglen alone! I have to get to them!"]="Meus filhos estão sozinhos em Valhetormenta! Tenho que ir a por eles!"
G["My children were kidnapped while they slept! I WANT ANSWERS, SOLOMON!"]="My children were kidnapped while they slept! I WANT ANSWERS, SOLOMON!"
G["My children will be made orphans!"]="My children will be made orphans!"
G["My children will not know war if I have anything say about it!"]="My children will not know war if I have anything say about it!"
G["My children... what have I done?"]="Filhos meus... que fiz?"
G["My clothing?!  Is that what this has come to now?  We debate the merits of my clothing?"]="My clothing?!  Is that what this has come to now?  We debate the merits of my clothing?"
G["My colleagues and I are gathering the deadliest substances we know and testing their effects on our enemies. Once I have everything I need, I shall brew such plagues as this world has never seen."]="Meus colegas e eu estamos reunindo as substâncias mais mortais que conhecemos e testando seus efeitos sobre nossos inimigos. Quando tiver tudo o que preciso, prepararei as pragas que este mundo nunca viu."
G["My command?"]="My command?"
G["My commander was butchered before my eyes - my brothers dead all around me - I could not fight on. I am so ashamed, $c. I did not avenge them."]="My commander was butchered before my eyes - my brothers dead all around me - I could not fight on. I am so ashamed, $c. I did not avenge them."
G["My commanding officers are all dead or missing."]="Todos meus superior estão mortos ou desaparecidos."
G["My companion is dispersed.  She will flow back to me when the time is right."]="Minha mascote foi espraiada. Ela fluirá novamente para mim quando chegar a hora."
G["My companions and I are with you, Lady Proudmoore."]="Meus companheiros e eu estamos com você, Lady Corajoso."
G["My companions are all accounted for, Muradin. Let's go!"]="Meus companheiros são todos considera, Muradin. Vamos lá!"
G["My companions are all accounted for, Saurfang. Let's go!"]="Meus companheiros são todos considera, Saurfang. Vamos lá!"
G["My compliments to the chef!"]="My compliments to the chef!"
G["My compliments, friend.  I can't remember the last time someone bested me so handily."]="Te felicito. Não lembrança a última vez que alguém me derrotou com tanta destreza."
G["My compliments."]="Te felicito."
G["My comrades and I called ourselves the Sons of Lothar - in honor of the greatest, most selfless man we ever knew.  We gave our all to defeat Ner'zhul and end his madness.\n\nAs this doomed world fell apart around us, we shattered the Dark Portal to prevent any further harm befalling our beloved Azeroth."]="My comrades and I called ourselves the Sons of Lothar - in honor of the greatest, most selfless man we ever knew.  We gave our all to defeat Ner'zhul and end his madness.\n\nAs this doomed world fell apart around us, we shattered the Dark Portal to prevent any further harm befalling our beloved Azeroth."
G["My comrades will... will... arrrrgghhh..."]="Meus camaradas vão a... vão a... arrrrgghhh..."
G["My concern for the moment is with the ruins that surround Lake Mennar, to our east. Thousands of years ago the Mennar Academy was among the first to study the arcane arts. It was a beautiful terraced structure built in a ring around a tranquil lake, a place of quiet contemplation and focused study. It was there that my ancestors first discovered the potential of the magical energies seeping from the Well of Eternity.\n\nI'm sorry - is this all too much to take in? I've immersed myself in arcane history for several decades now, I forget that others do not share my passion."]="My concern for the moment is with the ruins that surround Lake Mennar, to our east. Thousands of years ago the Mennar Academy was among the first to study the arcane arts. It was a beautiful terraced structure built in a ring around a tranquil lake, a place of quiet contemplation and focused study. It was there that my ancestors first discovered the potential of the magical energies seeping from the Well of Eternity.\n\nI'm sorry - is this all too much to take in? I've immersed myself in arcane history for several decades now, I forget that others do not share my passion."
G["My condolences. These past years have been hard on us all."]="Sinto muito. Estes últimos anos têm banido muito difíceis para todos."
G["My congratulations, champions. Through trials both planned and unexpected, you have triumphed."]="My congratulations, champions. Through trials both planned and unexpected, you have triumphed."
G["My contract is to fight for you, not to reveal the Legion's secrets, mortal."]="Meu contrato me obriga a lutar por você, não a revelar os segredos da Legião, mortal."
G["My crop is Growing... now what?"]="Meu cultivo está crescendo... e agora que?"
G["My cup runneth over."]="Meu copa se derrama."
G["My daddy can catch more fish than your daddy!"]="Meu papai pode pegar mais peixe que seu papai!"
G["My daddy says that in the ocean, there are fish so big they could swallow a whole ship."]="My daddy says that in the ocean, there are fish so big they could swallow a whole ship."
G["My daughter Lyalia would have me spend the rest of my days cleaning a temple.\n\nBah! I have never felt so alive as when I chose to step through the portal to this strange and beautiful land."]="My daughter Lyalia would have me spend the rest of my days cleaning a temple.\n\nBah! I have never felt so alive as when I chose to step through the portal to this strange and beautiful land."
G["My daughter has spirit and persistence! I worry less about her than I do my husband."]="Meu filha tem espírito e perseverância! Me preocupa mais meu marido que ela."
G["My dead grandmater, rest her soul, could beat you... even now!"]="My dead grandmater, rest her soul, could beat you... even now!"
G["My dead orc sound is da best!"]="Meu grito de orc morto é o amo!"
G["My dear Staffron, have you forgotten what it is to love? The love that we once shared?"]="My dear Staffron, have you forgotten what it is to love? The love that we once shared?"
G["My dear friends... I'm so sorry..."]="Meus queridos amigos... Sinto muito muito..."
G["My dear general, your time has come!"]="Meu querido geral, chegou seu hora!"
G["My dear prince, you and I share the same goals. We only differ in our level of commitment."]="Meu querido príncipe, você e eu temos os mesmos objetivos. Só nos diferenciamos no nível de comprometimento."
G["My dear, it appears we have visitors!  Friends of yours, Voss?"]="My dear, it appears we have visitors!  Friends of yours, Voss?"
G["My dear, you should embrace this gift that has been bestowed upon you."]="Querida, deveria aceitar o don que você banido concedido."
G["My dearest Torta, I have been gone for so long. Finally we are reunited. At long last our love can blossom again."]="My dearest Torta, I have been gone for so long. Finally we are reunited. At long last our love can blossom again."
G["My dearest old friend Nordu has bestowed to you a great gift, $r. The gift of life."]="Meu querido velho amigo Nordu você concedido um grande don. O don da vida. ($r)"
G["My dearest sibling, do you hunger? THEN FEAST UPON OUR ENEMIES!"]="Meu querida irmã! Tem fome? ENTÃO APROVEITE DE NOSSOS INIMIGOS!"
G["My death has gained you nothing!"]="Meu morte não te serve para nada!"
G["My death matters little... the Hammer will still fall!"]="My death matters little... the Hammer will still fall!"
G["My death means nothing!"]="Meu morte não indica nada!"
G["My death means nothing.... light... will... prevail!"]="Meu morte não muda nada... a luz... seguirá... imperando!"
G["My death means... little."]="Meu morte significa... pouco."
G["My death means...nothing..."]="Meu morte não sssignifica... nada..."
G["My death only serves to hasten your demise."]="My death only serves to hasten your demise."
G["My death will be avenged!"]="Meu morte será vengada!"
G["My death will not save you from what is coming..."]="Meu morte não te salvará do que se aproxima..."
G["My death will not stop da storm that is coming! Da Thunder King will rise!"]="My death will not stop da storm that is coming! Da Thunder King will rise!"
G["My death will not stop this invasion!"]="Meu morte não detendrá esta invasão!"
G["My death... heralds the end of this world."]="Meu morte... anunciao fim deste mundo."
G["My death... means... nothing. The Divine Bell is already in Darnassus. You filthy Horde... will never... have it!"]="Agh... Meu morte... não muda nada. A Sino divina já está em Darnassus. Seu maldito Horda... nunca a terá!"
G["My death... means... nothing..."]="Meu morte... não indica... nada."
G["My debt was almost repaid.  No one was going to miss those last gold coins..."]="My debt was almost repaid.  No one was going to miss those last gold coins..."
G["My debt? I owe that girl nothing.\n\nI'm pretty sure she... GAVE me those spices. I saw her wink at me. This sort of thing happens often when you're as handsome as I am.\n\nAre you still here? Scurry off, little $r."]="My debt? I owe that girl nothing.\n\nI'm pretty sure she... GAVE me those spices. I saw her wink at me. This sort of thing happens often when you're as handsome as I am.\n\nAre you still here? Scurry off, little $r."
G["My decision is final.  I will not be dissuaded.  I have devoted my life to our plan.  To jeopardize it now would betray all who have died for the cause long before me."]="My decision is final.  I will not be dissuaded.  I have devoted my life to our plan.  To jeopardize it now would betray all who have died for the cause long before me."
G["My demise accomplishes nothing! The master will have you! You will drown in your own blood! The world shall burn! Aaaghh!"]="My demise accomplishes nothing! The master will have you! You will drown in your own blood! The world shall burn! Aaaghh!"
G["My destiny is to serve the Lich King!"]="Meu destino é servir ao Rei Lich!"
G["My dog?! Where's my dog?!"]="Meu cão? Onde está meu cão?!"
G["My drakes have been eagerly awaiting your return, $c.\n\nAre you ready to take wing?"]="My drakes have been eagerly awaiting your return, $c.\n\nAre you ready to take wing?"
G["My drakes shall be watching you. Choose your words and your actions carefully, $r."]="My drakes shall be watching you. Choose your words and your actions carefully, $r."
G["My dream is to be as brilliant as Sputtervalve someday. You should see his design for a two-wheeled tricycle!"]="My dream is to be as brilliant as Sputtervalve someday. You should see his design for a two-wheeled tricycle!"
G["My dryskin can beat your dryskin. Yup, definately."]="Meu pelesseca pode vencer ao seu pelesseca. Sim, sem dúvida."
G["My duty is to protect my people. If I must be on the frontlines, then I would gladly do so."]="My duty is to protect my people. If I must be on the frontlines, then I would gladly do so."
G["My duty is to the Klaxxi Council. Whatever they ask of me, I must obey."]="My duty is to the Klaxxi Council. Whatever they ask of me, I must obey."
G["My eagles gonna bear your spirits to me. Your sacrifices not gonna be in vain...."]="My eagles gonna bear your spirits to me. Your sacrifices not gonna be in vain...."
G["My ear! You grazed my ear!"]="My ear! You grazed my ear!"
G["My early classes are always filled with bright-eyed young lads. Few make it past the first test, though.\n\nI've given up on shouting, 'when I yell vanish, you need to vanish.' They never listen. Now, the test simply kills the inept."]="My early classes are always filled with bright-eyed young lads. Few make it past the first test, though.\n\nI've given up on shouting, 'when I yell vanish, you need to vanish.' They never listen. Now, the test simply kills the inept."
G["My education is ongoing, and your knowledge surpasses mine. If you wish to learn more you must speak to Me'lynn. She will guide you."]="Minha educação está em andamento e seu conhecimento supera o meu. Se você deseja aprender mais, deve falar com Me'lynn. Ela irá guiá-o."
G["My endless agony shall be yours, as well!"]="Meu agonia eterna também será à sua!"
G["My entire team's been razed!"]="Meu time inteiro foi ceifado!"
G["My entrails are leaking out! HELP!"]="Se me estão saindo as Cidade Baixa! AJUDA!"
G["My epic schemes, my great plans! Gone!"]="Meus maquinações épicas, meus grandes planos! Perdidos!"
G["My errands are almost complete. Come, visit my collection of exotic birds. You may have the honor of feeding them."]="My errands are almost complete. Come, visit my collection of exotic birds. You may have the honor of feeding them."
G["My essence...will...persist..."]="Meu... essência... persistirá..."
G["My eternal gratitude; I had thought myself doomed."]="Meu eterna gratidão; achava que era meu fim."
G["My eternal thanks to you."]="Tem meu gratidão eterna."
G["My eternal vigil has kept the corruption of pride at bay. To face this corruption yourself you must purify yourselves in the burning light.  This process will not go easily for you.\nAre you ready?"]="My eternal vigil has kept the corruption of pride at bay. To face this corruption yourself you must purify yourselves in the burning light.  This process will not go easily for you.\nAre you ready?"
G["My expertise is needed elsewhere, heroes! When you see Garrosh, tell him he should've invested in gnomish technology!"]="My expertise is needed elsewhere, heroes! When you see Garrosh, tell him he should've invested in gnomish technology!"
G["My eyebrows! You singed my eyebrows!"]="My eyebrows! You singed my eyebrows!"
G["My eyes - auuugh!"]="Meus olhos! Aarrgh!"
G["My eyes are opened, yet they see only black."]="My eyes are opened, yet they see only black."
G["My eyes are playing tricks on me! Are those... skeletons manning that ship?"]="Acho que vejo visões... Há esqueletos tripulando esse navio?"
G["My eyes never deceive me, $r. I see great power in you - enough power, perhaps, to further our cause. Find me at the top of the tower."]="My eyes never deceive me, $r. I see great power in you - enough power, perhaps, to further our cause. Find me at the top of the tower."
G["My eyes!  It burns... it burns..."]="My eyes!  It burns... it burns..."
G["My eyes! The goggles do nothing!"]="Meus olhos! As óculos não me fazem nada!"
G["My face!  What's wrong with my face!"]="Meu rosto! Que lhe passa a meu rosto?"
G["My failings will be your downfall!"]="My failings will be your downfall!"
G["My failure?! MY FAILURE?! It was your incompetence that landed us here, you insufferable prat!"]="My failure?! MY FAILURE?! It was your incompetence that landed us here, you insufferable prat!"
G["My faith guides my actions, $r. I know that Ivus will come."]="Meu fé guia meus actos, $r. Sei que Ivus virá."
G["My family and I are bringing fresh fish from the Anglers to town. Would you like to buy some?"]="Meu família e eu levamos peixe fresco dos pescadores à cidade. Que comprar algo?"
G["My family hammer?! What could have possibly possessed you... never mind, I don't care.  You'll always be welcome in our home - we'll save a place for you at the table.  Thank you."]="O martelo de meu família?! Que te poderá haver impulsado a...? Não importa, não me importa. Sempre será $gbienvenido: boas-vindas; em nossa casa. Te guardaremos um lugar em nossa mesa. Obrigado."
G["My family has been running caravan routes in the Barrens since Orgrimmar was settled. We raise and train the kodos ourselves. My sister Nagala is the best kodo breeder outside of Mulgore."]="My family has been running caravan routes in the Barrens since Orgrimmar was settled. We raise and train the kodos ourselves. My sister Nagala is the best kodo breeder outside of Mulgore."
G["My family has crafted jade and gems for nearly ten generations. You may be surprised at what I can teach you."]="My family has crafted jade and gems for nearly ten generations. You may be surprised at what I can teach you."
G["My family has guarded this town for generations. I pray that I will be able to uphold their legacy."]="My family has guarded this town for generations. I pray that I will be able to uphold their legacy."
G["My family has stood as the greatest brewmasters of the Jade Forest for generations.\n\nUnlike those filthy travelling Wanderbrews. Peasant brews, that's what they make."]="My family has stood as the greatest brewmasters of the Jade Forest for generations.\n\nUnlike those filthy travelling Wanderbrews. Peasant brews, that's what they make."
G["My family hates me.  Frightened idiots, all of them!"]="My family hates me.  Frightened idiots, all of them!"
G["My family is planning a great banquet to celebrate the statue's completion."]="My family is planning a great banquet to celebrate the statue's completion."
G["My family left mainland Pandaria to explore the world on the back of the Wandering Isle. That was many generations ago.\n\nBut I have learned that there are other Stormstouts, here, on Pandaria! My long-lost family. What are they like? Do they still brew, as I do? Are they adventurers, like you and I?"]="My family left mainland Pandaria to explore the world on the back of the Wandering Isle. That was many generations ago.\n\nBut I have learned that there are other Stormstouts, here, on Pandaria! My long-lost family. What are they like? Do they still brew, as I do? Are they adventurers, like you and I?"
G["My family must know... I... for them... always for them..."]="Meu família deve ser informada... Eu... por eles... sempre por eles..."
G["My family used to make this... They're gone now, but I shtill love thish dish."]="My family used to make this... They're gone now, but I shtill love thish dish."
G["My family was slaughtered without mercy. Even the young."]="Minha família foi abatida sem piedade. Até os jovens."
G["My family was wiped out by the Scourge! MONSTER!"]="O Flagelo borró a meu família do mapa! MONSTRO!"
G["My family worked  the Northridge Lumber Mill in what's now Western Plaguelands. They were dedicated to the Dumah family, and now the Scarlet Crusade have taken it over along with all of Hearthglen!\n\nI will not rest until those zealots are wiped from Azeroth."]="My family worked  the Northridge Lumber Mill in what's now Western Plaguelands. They were dedicated to the Dumah family, and now the Scarlet Crusade have taken it over along with all of Hearthglen!\n\nI will not rest until those zealots are wiped from Azeroth."
G["My family's been clearing out swarms for years! Not that we're above a bit of hired help..."]="Minha família está limpando enxames há anos! Não que estejamos acima de um pouco de ajuda contratada..."
G["My family's sick!"]="Meu família está enferma!"
G["My family... did you find my family?"]="Meu família... Tem encontrado a meu família?"
G["My farm was in real trouble because of those hozen, but it's saved thanks to you."]="My farm was in real trouble because of those hozen, but it's saved thanks to you."
G["My fastest wolf is ready to take you to Taunka'le Village, champion. Let me know when you are ready."]="Meu lobo mais rápido está pronto para levá-o à vila de Taunka'le, campeão. Me avisa quando você estiver pronto."
G["My fate is written in flames!"]="Meu destino está escrito nas brasas!"
G["My father and my father's father spent their lives toiling on this statue. I am proud to be the one who will finish it."]="My father and my father's father spent their lives toiling on this statue. I am proud to be the one who will finish it."
G["My father brewed Firebough Stout. His father did before him. I can't let the legacy die out."]="My father brewed Firebough Stout. His father did before him. I can't let the legacy die out."
G["My father doesn't think so, but I can take care of myself."]="Meu pai acredita que não, mas sei cuidar de mim mesmo."
G["My father foresaw this day in the waters. He told me that I would be defeated, but I refused to believe it."]="My father foresaw this day in the waters. He told me that I would be defeated, but I refused to believe it."
G["My father has gifted me with his battle armor and axe. Soon I put it to good use."]="Meu pai me presenteou com a sua armadura e machado de batalha. Em breve, utilizo-o bem."
G["My father has trained me since I was a wee lad to respect the elements. Earth and fire, wind and sea - they possess great power, $c.\n\n<Grundy gets a gleam in his eye.>\n\nMore than you realize."]="My father has trained me since I was a wee lad to respect the elements. Earth and fire, wind and sea - they possess great power, $c.\n\n<Grundy gets a gleam in his eye.>\n\nMore than you realize."
G["My father is close, I know it! We have to bust through their defenses and rescue him!"]="Meu pai está perto, eu sei! Temos que quebrar suas defesas e resgatá-o!"
G["My father is here for the Pools of Youth. I'm here at Tyrande Whisperwind's command."]="My father is here for the Pools of Youth. I'm here at Tyrande Whisperwind's command."
G["My father is so overly protective. I never get to do anything!"]="Meu pai é muito sobreprotector. Nunca me de fazer nada!"
G["My father isn't asking you to pledge the Kirin-Tor to the Alliance-"]="Meu pai não está pedindo que você faça o Kirin-Tor jurar lealdade à Aliança..."
G["My father lives in his farmhouse in the middle of the farmlands. He's just east of the big ol' crane statue.\n\nHe owns almost all the fertile land in the valley, and he never lets anyone forget it.\n\nThat's why I left home, you know. He thinks he owns everything...and everyone."]="My father lives in his farmhouse in the middle of the farmlands. He's just east of the big ol' crane statue.\n\nHe owns almost all the fertile land in the valley, and he never lets anyone forget it.\n\nThat's why I left home, you know. He thinks he owns everything...and everyone."
G["My father once told me that life is meaningless... That it is in death that we are truly tested. I sense that the siege of Light's Hope will give meaning to his words. We strike soon, $n. Stand ready."]="Meu pai disse pai mim depois que a vida não tem sentido... Que é na morte onde mesmo se te coloca a prova. Acho que o cerco a Esperança da Luz dotará de sentido aos seus palavras. Atacaremos pronto, $n. Prepare-se."
G["My father says that's just a story."]="Meu pai diz que somente é uma história."
G["My father thinks he can tell me what to do still! I'm not a child anymore and he needs to see that."]="Meu pai acredita que ainda pode me dizer o que tenho que fazer! Terá que se fingir à ideia de que já não sou uma ninha."
G["My father thinks it's too dangerous beyond Zouchin's walls for a lady. He only lets me leave when we need supplies from One Keg."]="Meu pai acha que sair dos muros de Zouchin é demais perigoso para uma dama. Somente me de ir quando precisamos de provisiones de Barrilha."
G["My father thought they were all doomed... but behind him, a furious roar rumbled across the snow, and he turned to see the mountain dwarf growing in size, his skin taking on a stone-like texture, and his hands sizzling with lightning."]="My father thought they were all doomed... but behind him, a furious roar rumbled across the snow, and he turned to see the mountain dwarf growing in size, his skin taking on a stone-like texture, and his hands sizzling with lightning."
G["My father thought we would not encounter resistance. But then, he often spends his time obsessing over immortality instead of thinking things through."]="My father thought we would not encounter resistance. But then, he often spends his time obsessing over immortality instead of thinking things through."
G["My father told me there'd be days like this, where a stranger would talk to me and I'd have to restrain myself from killing $ghim:her;."]="My father told me there'd be days like this, where a stranger would talk to me and I'd have to restrain myself from killing $ghim:her;."
G["My father was High Elder before Cloudfall. He taught me everything that I know."]="My father was High Elder before Cloudfall. He taught me everything that I know."
G["My father was a brute. My mother was a saur-priest. I am nothing.\n\nI am a disgrace to the Skumblade. I will die in the filth, and they will not eat my meat."]="My father was a brute. My mother was a saur-priest. I am nothing.\n\nI am a disgrace to the Skumblade. I will die in the filth, and they will not eat my meat."
G["My father was slain by the filth that inhabits the cauldron. My pleas for assistance to the Stormwind magistrate fell on deaf ears. Nay, they want not to admit that this part of the world even exists, let alone send their precious military in to administer justice.\n\nI seek vengeance, $r, plain and simple. Is there a more passionate cause in this world?"]="My father was slain by the filth that inhabits the cauldron. My pleas for assistance to the Stormwind magistrate fell on deaf ears. Nay, they want not to admit that this part of the world even exists, let alone send their precious military in to administer justice.\n\nI seek vengeance, $r, plain and simple. Is there a more passionate cause in this world?"
G["My father would tell you we are here for the Pools of Youth.\n\nThe real story is that our lady Tyrande Whisperwind has had visions of a great light we would... will... find on this journey. A light that will need to be found and defended.\n\nMy father insists it is the Pools of Youth.\n\nI think he is blinded by a decade of obsession."]="My father would tell you we are here for the Pools of Youth.\n\nThe real story is that our lady Tyrande Whisperwind has had visions of a great light we would... will... find on this journey. A light that will need to be found and defended.\n\nMy father insists it is the Pools of Youth.\n\nI think he is blinded by a decade of obsession."
G["My father's off to more exotic locations in search of bigger prey.  Don't worry though, we're still on the hunt here!"]="Meu pai está indo pai locais mais exóticos à procura de presas maiores. Não se preocupe, ainda estamos caçando aqui!"
G["My father's sacrifice will not have been in vain. We need to press the attack against the mantid."]="My father's sacrifice will not have been in vain. We need to press the attack against the mantid."
G["My father, Deathwing, tried to destroy the whole of Azeroth."]="Meu pai, Asa da Morte, tentou destruir Azeroth inteira."
G["My father? What good is it to speak to him?"]="Meu pai? De que serve falar com ele?"
G["My fault? I wasn't one who bought unclean yak."]="Por meu culpar? Não fui eu o que comprou um yak sujo."
G["My favorite kind of $c: the brave, rescue-y type!"]="Meu $c $gfavorito: favorita;: $gel: a; que me resgate!"
G["My favorite part was when you splashed muddy water in my eyes."]="My favorite part was when you splashed muddy water in my eyes."
G["My feet hurt."]="Me duelen os pés."
G["My feet hurt..."]="Me duelen os pés..."
G["My finest work so far! This siege engine is ready for action!"]="Meu melhor obra! Esta máquina de cerco está pronta para a ação!"
G["My fire... has gone out.."]="Meu chama... se tem apagado..."
G["My firebolt is useless! No matter you smug little insect. I will still destroy you!"]="My firebolt is useless! No matter you smug little insect. I will still destroy you!"
G["My first command has been more difficult than I anticipated. Did I make the right decision?"]="Meu primeiro envio foi mais difícil do que achava. E tomado a decisão correta?"
G["My first field test of this technology went better than expected!  Take this with you, it should be useful against any more swarms you run into."]="Meu primeira prova de campo desta tecnologia tem ido melhor do que esperava! Leve-se isto, te virá bem se te encontrar com mais enjambres."
G["My fists are ready. Bring on the trial of wood."]="My fists are ready. Bring on the trial of wood."
G["My fists are scarlet... with your blood!"]="Meus punhos se tinhen de escarlate... com o seu sangue!"
G["My flames have died, left not a spark. I shall send you myself, to the lifeless dark."]="Meus chamas têm morto, não restante já chispa. Agora serei eu qunos rompa a crisma."
G["My flesh!"]="Meu carne!"
G["My flight is ready! Soldiers come to my aid!"]="Meu voo está pronto! Soldados, venham na minha ajuda!"
G["My floot is good luckydo! You can't have it!"]="Meu flauta é um bom grisgrís! Não te a dou."
G["My forces cannot overcome the Qiraji defenses. We will not be able to get close enough to place your precious barrier, dragon."]="My forces cannot overcome the Qiraji defenses. We will not be able to get close enough to place your precious barrier, dragon."
G["My former brethren, your time draws short!  Join us, before you are lost to the sands of eternity!"]="My former brethren, your time draws short!  Join us, before you are lost to the sands of eternity!"
G["My fortune telling powers are immeasurable - your chances are though: NO CHANCE"]="Meus poderes de vaticínio são incalculables, seus possibilidades não o são: nenhuma!"
G["My freedom means nothing if we fail to save Ursoc.  Make haste, $n."]="Meu liberdade não significará nada se não logramos superando a Ursoc. Date pressa, $n."
G["My friend come to visit Jogu again? What can I do for you today?"]="Meu $gamigo: amiga; vem a visitar a Jogu outra vez? O que posso fazer por você hoje?"
G["My friend had a pet turtle, but he gave it away as a gift."]="Meu amigo tinha uma tartaruga como ajudante, mas a regaló."
G["My friend was afraid, but not me!"]="Meu amigo tinha medo, mas eu não!"
G["My friend, $n! Let us share a drink together."]="Meu $gamigo: amiga; $n! Vamos pegar um trago juntos."
G["My friend, if you blindly trust a black dragon in the search for greater power, are you any better than Garrosh Hellscream? Please - just be careful."]="Camarada, se você confia cegamente neste dragão negro nessa busca por poder, então o que diferencia você de Garrosh Grito Infernal? Por favor, tenha cuidado."
G["My friend, one of these days we should see who is stronger in battle - you, or me."]="$gAmigo meu: Amiga minha;, um dia de estes veremos quem é mais forte em combate... você ou eu."
G["My friend, please think carefully about the legacy you will leave behind."]="Jovem, pense cuidadosamente sobre o legado que você deixará para trás."
G["My friend, please, meet me near the Big Blossom Mine in the center of the Vale. There is something I wish to show you there."]="My friend, please, meet me near the Big Blossom Mine in the center of the Vale. There is something I wish to show you there."
G["My friend, something is about to give. I wish I could experience the next chapter of the story, but alas, I am just the storyteller."]="Camarada, alguma coisa está prestes a acontecer. Eu gostaria de poder estar presente no próximo capítulo, mas sou apenas o contador de histórias."
G["My friend, today we will face one of the greatest and most diabolical of brewmasters the pandaren have ever known.\n\nThere are few who have not heard of the dangers of his brews and yet despite that he is able to dupe people and animals alike into tasting his beverages.\n\nHe must be stopped!  Are you with us?"]="My friend, today we will face one of the greatest and most diabolical of brewmasters the pandaren have ever known.\n\nThere are few who have not heard of the dangers of his brews and yet despite that he is able to dupe people and animals alike into tasting his beverages.\n\nHe must be stopped!  Are you with us?"
G["My friend, you are making enough noise to scare off a pack of mushan beasts."]="My friend, you are making enough noise to scare off a pack of mushan beasts."
G["My friends and I come with peaceful intentions."]="My friends and I come with peaceful intentions."
G["My friends say I'm a little slow, but I run faster than all of them!"]="Meus amigos dizem que sou um pouco lento, mas corro mais rápido que todos eles!"
G["My friends, my colleagues. Put yourselves at ease."]="My friends, my colleagues. Put yourselves at ease."
G["My friends, please join me in humble supplication to the Light."]="My friends, please join me in humble supplication to the Light."
G["My fur, doesn't it look good today?"]="A que hoje está precioso meu pelagem?"
G["My fury is UNLEASHED!"]="MEU FÚRIA NÃO TEM LIMITE!"
G["My fury is released!"]="Se tem libertado meu raiva!"
G["My gadget can't get an accurate reading with all the quatum nether fluctuations."]="My gadget can't get an accurate reading with all the quatum nether fluctuations."
G["My genius cannot be contained within a box!\n\nWait, this isn't Azshara?! What is this place? That's a dormant volcano!\n\nI have half a mind to go join the Trade Prince! The other half of my mind is considering the possible weaponization of the clucker eggs!"]="My genius cannot be contained within a box!\n\nWait, this isn't Azshara?! What is this place? That's a dormant volcano!\n\nI have half a mind to go join the Trade Prince! The other half of my mind is considering the possible weaponization of the clucker eggs!"
G["My goal is to work as slowly as possible, giving any murderous Scourge in the area a large window in which they can choose to kill us and then do terrible things to our corpses. Isn't that the plan?"]="My goal is to work as slowly as possible, giving any murderous Scourge in the area a large window in which they can choose to kill us and then do terrible things to our corpses. Isn't that the plan?"
G["My good friend $n! Are you here to buy or sell? Feel free to look around."]="Meu $gbuen amigo: boa amiga; $n! Tem vindo a comprar ou a vender? Não te cortes em dar um olhada por aí."
G["My good friend! How are things at the farm?"]="Meu $gbuen amigo: boa amiga;! Como vão as coisas na fazenda?"
G["My good friend! You drink with Chee Chee sometime, yes?"]="Meu $gbuen amigo: boa amiga;! Você bebe kon Chee Chee alguma vez, sim?"
G["My good friend, here's a tip. You want big vegetables?\n\nYou gotta tend them. Give them some water, some fertilizer, and some love."]="My good friend, here's a tip. You want big vegetables?\n\nYou gotta tend them. Give them some water, some fertilizer, and some love."
G["My good friend, how are you today?\n\nListen, I don't say this to just anyone, but if you ever need a yak, you let Fung know."]="My good friend, how are you today?\n\nListen, I don't say this to just anyone, but if you ever need a yak, you let Fung know."
G["My good friend, one of these days we should see who is stronger in battle - you, or me."]="$gMi bom amigo: Meu boa amiga;, um dia de estes veremos quem é mais forte em combate... você ou eu."
G["My good friend, you are making enough noise to scare off a pack of mushan beasts."]="My good friend, you are making enough noise to scare off a pack of mushan beasts."
G["My good friend, you got any news for me today?"]="$gMi bom amigo: Meu boa amiga;, tem algo que contar-me hoje?"
G["My good friend, you must know a thing or two about exterminating virmen."]="Meu $gbuen amigo: boa amiga;, deve saber um par de coisas sobre como exterminar aos virmen."
G["My goodness, Duyi. What have you been feeding that thing?"]="Mãe minha, Duyi. Que lhe dados de comer a essa coisa?"
G["My goods aren't for sale to the Horde. Don't like it? Take it up with the Warchief!"]="Minhas mercadorias não estão à venda para a Horda. Não gosta disso? Óleo o Warchief!"
G["My gosh, it's full of rocks!"]="Meu Deus, está cheio de pedras!"
G["My grandmother used to tell me it was bad for a fighter's balance to enter battle on an empty stomach!"]="My grandmother used to tell me it was bad for a fighter's balance to enter battle on an empty stomach!"
G["My granny, livin' down in Redridge, hits dummies harder than you, rookie!"]="Meu abuelita, que vive em Cristarrubra, pega mais forte que você!"
G["My great hammer, Ironfel, was handed down to the new chief architect, Fineous Darkvire: A man of despicable motive and little talent.\n\nThis is where you come in, $n. I want him stopped. He is too inept to harness the true power of Ironfel, but should one come after him with the aptitude to use Ironfel to its full potential, the destruction they could cause with their creations would be disastrous to this world."]="My great hammer, Ironfel, was handed down to the new chief architect, Fineous Darkvire: A man of despicable motive and little talent.\n\nThis is where you come in, $n. I want him stopped. He is too inept to harness the true power of Ironfel, but should one come after him with the aptitude to use Ironfel to its full potential, the destruction they could cause with their creations would be disastrous to this world."
G["My gut is telling me that it's about time we jump into action and start drinking."]="Meu instinto me diz que é hora de passar à ação e começarmos a beber."
G["My gut's telling me...."]="Meu instinto me diz..."
G["My hammer always strikes true! Let the fires rage once again!"]="Meu martelo sempre da no clavo! Que as chamas se alcen novamente!"
G["My hands... don't look at my hands!!"]="Meus mãos... Não olhe meus mãos!"
G["My hate will consume you!"]="Meu ódio os consumirá!"
G["My hated rival... so glad you came."]="Meu detestable rival... fico feliz muito de que tenha vindo."
G["My hatred burns!"]="Meu ódio arde!"
G["My hatred is strong <snort>, but the time is right to tell you a tale, $r.\n\nLong ago a battle took place between gods. Agamaggan, our great boar god, fell to the earth after being defeated in the War of the Ancients, his blood raining down and his bones torn asunder. <snort>\n\nGreat thorns reached up out of the earth where his blood touched the ground, and his skull adorns one of the caverns to the south."]="My hatred is strong <snort>, but the time is right to tell you a tale, $r.\n\nLong ago a battle took place between gods. Agamaggan, our great boar god, fell to the earth after being defeated in the War of the Ancients, his blood raining down and his bones torn asunder. <snort>\n\nGreat thorns reached up out of the earth where his blood touched the ground, and his skull adorns one of the caverns to the south."
G["My head be swimmin'. Please, I be beggin' ya!"]="My head be swimmin'. Please, I be beggin' ya!"
G["My head is clear and cloudy at the same time... Crystal Lining...Silver Clouds..."]="My head is clear and cloudy at the same time... Crystal Lining...Silver Clouds..."
G["My head swims... I am... not myself yet."]="My head swims... I am... not myself yet."
G["My heals really don't have the 'OOMPH' that they used to, $n. You know what I'm saying?"]="My heals really don't have the 'OOMPH' that they used to, $n. You know what I'm saying?"
G["My heart grows darker... Soon I will be judged... Worthy of the Val'kyr! Worthy of the Lich King!"]="My heart grows darker... Soon I will be judged... Worthy of the Val'kyr! Worthy of the Lich King!"
G["My heart hangs heavier with each passing day, Confessor."]="Cada dia que passa meu coração está mais afligido, confessor."
G["My heart has been filled with hate since our sworn enemies were allowed into our city.  I knew the one known as Voren'thal before he was called a Seer.  It was by his hand that my brother was slain."]="My heart has been filled with hate since our sworn enemies were allowed into our city.  I knew the one known as Voren'thal before he was called a Seer.  It was by his hand that my brother was slain."
G["My heart is heavy with the burden of this war. I lead my people to their deaths. But if we cannot stand against Ragnaros now, how will we withstand Neltharion?\n\nWe must fight with everything we have, or witness the destruction of our world."]="My heart is heavy with the burden of this war. I lead my people to their deaths. But if we cannot stand against Ragnaros now, how will we withstand Neltharion?\n\nWe must fight with everything we have, or witness the destruction of our world."
G["My help? Have things really grown so dire?\n\n<The distant flames flicker in Blackhorn's cruel, dark eyes.>\n\nTell me why I shouldn't let your world burn."]="My help? Have things really grown so dire?\n\n<The distant flames flicker in Blackhorn's cruel, dark eyes.>\n\nTell me why I shouldn't let your world burn."
G["My home... I wonder if it's still standing. I'll go back and find out!"]="My home... I wonder if it's still standing. I'll go back and find out!"
G["My hound!"]="My hound!"
G["My hounds shall feast on your corpse!"]="My hounds shall feast on your corpse!"
G["My house is just to the right as you enter the village. The mask should be upstairs."]="Meu casa está logo à direita conforme entra no povo. A máscara está no piso de cima."
G["My house!"]="Meu casa!"
G["My house! My things! It's all ablaze!"]="Meu casa, meus coisas! Tudo está em chamas!"
G["My humblest apologies, Champion, but you have run out of opportunities to complete the Trial of the Grand Crusader. As a reminder, you and your fellow adventurers are able to begin the Trial of the Grand Crusader once every week. May the lessons learned this week bring you one step closer to final victory here and against the Scourge!"]="Minhas desculpas mais humildes, Campeão, mas você ficou sem oportunidades para concluir a Prova do Grande Cruzado. Como lembrete, você e seus colegas aventureiros podem começar o Julgamento do Grande Cruzado uma vez por semana. Que as lições aprendidas nesta semana aproximem você da vitória fim aqui e contra o Flagelo!"
G["My hunger knows no bounds!"]="Meu fome não conhece limite!"
G["My husband and children are sick in bed because of the poison you sold me!"]="My husband and children are sick in bed because of the poison you sold me!"
G["My husband has disappeared. Please, blood guard, he is no warrior. You must help me find him."]="My husband has disappeared. Please, blood guard, he is no warrior. You must help me find him."
G["My husband just disappeared. You have to help me, captain. I'm no warrior."]="Meu mulher sumiu. Precisa me ajudar, capitão. Não sou um guerreiro."
G["My husband wanted to see what was happening down by the water. That's when...when...\n\n<Elder Yoon Su begins to sob uncontrollably.>"]="My husband wanted to see what was happening down by the water. That's when...when...\n\n<Elder Yoon Su begins to sob uncontrollably.>"
G["My husband was captured by the yaungol several days ago. I cannot not rest until I see him safely returned."]="Meu marido foi capturou pelos yaungol há vários dias. Não poderei descansar até que o fique a ver saudável e salvou."
G["My husband was taken prisoner by the yaungol several days ago.\n\nHe is in danger as we speak."]="Meu marido foi capturou pelos yaungol há vários dias.\n\nEle corre perigo neste preciso instantaneamente."
G["My husband's been missing for days.  We went on this pilgrimage together; we were supposed to finish it together.\n\nAll this worry has gotten me tapping into mana crystals more often than I really should."]="My husband's been missing for days.  We went on this pilgrimage together; we were supposed to finish it together.\n\nAll this worry has gotten me tapping into mana crystals more often than I really should."
G["My injuries are too great. I won't make it... Our citizenry held in cages... ritual..."]="My injuries are too great. I won't make it... Our citizenry held in cages... ritual..."
G["My inn has all the comforts of home, and more. Please make yourself comfortable here."]="My inn has all the comforts of home, and more. Please make yourself comfortable here."
G["My inner fire can never die."]="My inner fire can never die."
G["My insignia! Yes. I did lose it. Where did you find it, tauren?"]="Meu insígnia! Sim. É minha. Onda tem encontrado, tauren?"
G["My intelligence suggests this one is a high-value target."]="Meu inteligência me diz que este objetivo é muito valioso."
G["My jade!"]="Meu jade!"
G["My job consists of one task and one task only: ensuring that the West Sanctum runs smoothly.\n\nYou'll have to excuse my temper but, as you can see, the situation here is a bit out of hand."]="My job consists of one task and one task only: ensuring that the West Sanctum runs smoothly.\n\nYou'll have to excuse my temper but, as you can see, the situation here is a bit out of hand."
G["My job is to care for these poor souls.  I accept the help of any willing to lend a hand, be they Aldor or Scryer.\n\nWe are so understaffed, I wouldn't turn an ogre away if they knew how to apply a tourniquet.  The politics of the city are of little matter to me."]="My job is to care for these poor souls.  I accept the help of any willing to lend a hand, be they Aldor or Scryer.\n\nWe are so understaffed, I wouldn't turn an ogre away if they knew how to apply a tourniquet.  The politics of the city are of little matter to me."
G["My job title is Waste Management Specialist."]="Meu cargo é Especiapronta em Gerenciamento de Resíduos."
G["My journeyman often forgets that one must expect to fail many times in the pursuit of perfection."]="My journeyman often forgets that one must expect to fail many times in the pursuit of perfection."
G["My judgment is final."]="Meu juízo é definitivo."
G["My kin won't forget what you've done! We will rage, mortals!"]="Meu povo não olvidará o que vocês têm feito! Arderemos de raiva, mortais!"
G["My kind not welcome at broken pillar. I going back to hill - find me when you done."]="Meu gente não é boas-vindas em Pilar Partido. Vuelvo à colina, búscame quando tenha terminado."
G["My kind, da druids, we been layin' low for some time now. We been waitin' to see when an' if Vol'jin might return."]="My kind, da druids, we been layin' low for some time now. We been waitin' to see when an' if Vol'jin might return."
G["My kindness only extends so far, friend."]="Meu amabilidade tem um limite, amigo."
G["My king!  I cannot hear your voice!  Do not leave me!"]="My king!  I cannot hear your voice!  Do not leave me!"
G["My king, the world will tremble in reverence..."]="Meu rei, o mundo temblará de adoração..."
G["My kingdom? My kingdom is no more."]="Meu reino? Meu reino já não existe."
G["My knowledge is limited, though I am still learning. It is time for you to move on, traveler. Find Josef Gregorian in Undercity and tell him you are ready."]="Meu conhecimento é limitado, embora eu ainda esteja aprendendo. É hora de seguir em linha de frente, viajante. Encontre Josef Gregorian em Undercity e diga que você está pronto."
G["My knowledge of Jewelcrafting I will share with you."]="Meu conhecimento de Joalheria vou compartilhar com você."
G["My knowledge of night elf lore is limited, but it is said long ago--back when the night elves still held sacred the art of arcane spell casting--that Azshara was the greatest of their kind. A beautiful woman they named queen. Sadly, it was her addiction to the arcane that would one day be the catalyst for the most devastating events in this world's history."]="Meu conhecimento do folclore dos elfos noturnos é limitado, mas há muito tempo atrás - quando os elfos noturnos ainda mantinham sagrada a arte de lançar feitiços arcanos - que Azshara era o melhor da sua espécie. Uma mulher bonita que eles chamaram de rainha. Infelizmente, era seu vício pelo arcano que um dia seria o catalisador dos eventos mais devastadores da história do mundo."
G["My lady, I am unworthy of your prayer. Truly, you are an angel of light. Please, assist me in returning to the barrow den so that I may return to the Dream. I, like Malfurion, also have a love awaiting me... I must return to her... to protect her..."]="My lady, I am unworthy of your prayer. Truly, you are an angel of light. Please, assist me in returning to the barrow den so that I may return to the Dream. I, like Malfurion, also have a love awaiting me... I must return to her... to protect her..."
G["My lady, I think I hear Arthas coming. Whatever you're going to do, do it quickly."]="Minha senhora, acho que ouvi Arthas chegando. O que quer que você faça, faça-o rapidamente."
G["My lady, thank you for coming to our aid. I assure you that we'll do whatever we can to help."]="Meu senhora, Obrigado por vir em nossa ajuda. Te garanto que faremos tudo o possível por ajudar."
G["My lady, the surge needle is fully operational."]="My lady, the surge needle is fully operational."
G["My lady."]="Meu senhora."
G["My lady.\n\nI was unable to protect her. How can I return to Silvermoon..."]="My lady.\n\nI was unable to protect her. How can I return to Silvermoon..."
G["My lady. Weapons of the Thunder King are an abomination. They should be destroyed."]="My lady. Weapons of the Thunder King are an abomination. They should be destroyed."
G["My leg feels much better now, the remedy must be working. If you will excuse me, I must go report to my superiors about what has transpired here."]="My leg feels much better now, the remedy must be working. If you will excuse me, I must go report to my superiors about what has transpired here."
G["My legacy... will live on..."]="Meu legado... perdurará..."
G["My legend begins NOW!"]="Meu lendas começa agora!"
G["My legs feel stiff."]="Tenho as patas rígidas."
G["My liberators! Come down and have a word wit' Norkani."]="My liberators! Come down and have a word wit' Norkani."
G["My liberators! Come down and speak with Kraz."]="My liberators! Come down and speak with Kraz."
G["My liege!  Allow me to go instead."]="Meu senhor! Permítame ir no seu lugar."
G["My liege! I have done as you asked, and now beseech you for your blessing!"]="Meu senhor! Fiz o que pedisteis, e agora suplico sua bênção!"
G["My liege, a skirmish along the Neferset border just occurred.  A patrol led by your brother was involved..."]="Meu senhor, acaba de ter lugar uma escaramuça ao largo da fronteira de Neferset. Se tem visto implicada uma patrulha... ao linha de frente da qual ia seu irmão."
G["My liege, the infiltration and control of the Alliance power structure by our cultists is well underway."]="Meu senhor, nossos cultistas estão levando com êxito a infiltração e controle das instalações energéticas da Aliança."
G["My life and spirit has been filled with memories of the insufferable Horde. Times of sorrow, desperation, and sacrifice have come to pass. The rage of battle could never leave my heart!"]="Minha vida e espírito estão cheios de lembranças da horda insuportável. Tempos de tristeza, desespero e sacrifício aconteceram. A raiva da batalha nunca poderia deixar meu coração!"
G["My life before the faire was hard.  I never missed it, or my family."]="A vida antes da feira era dura. Nunca a eché de menos, nem a meu família."
G["My life for Ymiron!"]="Minha vida por Ymiron!"
G["My life for my masters.  Rejoice!"]="My life for my masters.  Rejoice!"
G["My life for the Dread King!"]="Minha vida pelo Rei do Terror!"
G["My life for the Horde!"]="Minha vida pela Horda!"
G["My life for the Horde."]="Minha vida pela Horda."
G["My life for the flame!"]="Minha vida pela chama!"
G["My life for the... death god!"]="Minha vida pelo... deus da morte!"
G["My life for you!"]="Minha vida por você!"
G["My life for you, master!"]="Minha vida por você, amo!"
G["My life is forfeit. If in my final hour I can be of some service, you needn't bother asking. Do with me what you will...."]="Minha vida está acabada. Se na minha hora fim posso oferecer algum serviço, não te molestes em perguntar. Faça comigo o que queira..."
G["My life is yours, oh great one..."]="Minha vida te pertence, oh magno..."
G["My life means nothing!  Our sacred task is all!"]="Minha vida não importa nada! Nossa sagrado missão o é tudo!"
G["My life's fortune... gone.\n\nThere's no hope left for me."]="A fortuna de minha vida... Desaparecida.\n\nJá não me restante esperança."
G["My life... to the master."]="Minha vida... pelo mestre."
G["My little angel. Are you hungry? Will you eat for auntie Twinbreeze? Just a little?"]="Angelito. Tem fome? Comerás pela tia Brisas Gêmeas? Um poquitín?"
G["My little sister could best the lot of ya. This ain't no arena. This is a nursery!"]="My little sister could best the lot of ya. This ain't no arena. This is a nursery!"
G["My loathing of interruptions is overshadowed only by my hatred of Gruul the Dragonkiller and his seven sons!"]="Minha aversão a interrupções é ofuscada apenas pelo meu ódio por Gruul, o Matador de Dragões e seus sete filhos!"
G["My long hunt is finally over. Today, Justice will be done!"]="Finalmente concluye meu larga caça. Hoje se fará justiça!"
G["My lord will be outraged to learn of this ambush.  Let us hope your death will appease him."]="My lord will be outraged to learn of this ambush.  Let us hope your death will appease him."
G["My lord will be... the end of you all!"]="Meu senhor será... o fim de todos vocês!"
G["My lord!"]="Meu senhor!"
G["My lord, I am ready to go."]="Meu senhor, estou pronto."
G["My lord, I need to get to the top of the temple."]="Meu senhor, eu preciso chegar ao topo do templo."
G["My lord, Instructor Hroegar conveys that your warriors are ready. They spar on the ledge outside awaiting your orders"]="My lord, Instructor Hroegar conveys that your warriors are ready. They spar on the ledge outside awaiting your orders"
G["My lord, Lord Servin Darengar, has been staying at Stormwind Keep for some time now. Seek him out in the House of Nobles. He is surrounded by vipers."]="Meu senhor, Lorde Servin Darengar, leva já um tempo alojado no Castelo de Ventobravo. Búscalo na Casa dos Nobres. Está cercado de víboras."
G["My lord, surely you do not expect me to leave you unattended. Lord Illidan would have my head if anything were to happen to you."]="My lord, surely you do not expect me to leave you unattended. Lord Illidan would have my head if anything were to happen to you."
G["My lord, this draenei was caught along with an entire contingent of death knights from The Shadow Vault. They are Knights of the Ebon Blade!"]="Meu senhor, temos preso a este draeneis ao lado a um contingente completo de cavaleiros da Morte da Câmera das Sombras. São Cavaleiros da Lâmina de Ébano!"
G["My lord."]="Meu senhor."
G["My lords and ladies, I present $n, bearer of Quel'Delar."]="Senhoras e senhores, os presento a $n, $gportador: portadora; de Quel'Delar."
G["My lords!  I come to thee!"]="Meu Senhor! Acudo você!"
G["My love... whatever happens... you must protect our... our child...."]="Meu amor... passe o que passe... precisa proteção a nosso... nosso bebé..."
G["My luster... wanes."]="Meu fulgor... se desaparece."
G["My lute is all tuned up. Are we ready to compose something?"]="Meu alaúde está afinado. Estamos prontos para compor alguma coisa?"
G["My machines are the future! They'll destroy you all!"]="My machines are the future! They'll destroy you all!"
G["My magic is fading. I'm going through!"]="My magic is fading. I'm going through!"
G["My magical power can turn back time to before Thrall's death, but be careful. My power to manipulate time is limited."]="Meu poder mágico pode voltar o tempo por trás, até antes da morte de Thrall, mas tenha cuidado. Meu poder para manipular o tempo é limitado."
G["My mantid stuffs! Go away!"]="Meus coisas mantídeos! Vá embora!"
G["My marines are already on shore, holding the harbor entrance.\n\nYou have your orders. Do your jobs, and return safely.\n\nThe eyes of Hellscream are upon you!"]="My marines are already on shore, holding the harbor entrance.\n\nYou have your orders. Do your jobs, and return safely.\n\nThe eyes of Hellscream are upon you!"
G["My master has a message for you..."]="Meu senhor tem uma mensagem para você..."
G["My master has shown me the future, and you have no place in it. Azeroth will be reborn in darkness. Yogg-Saron shall be released! The Pantheon shall fall!"]="My master has shown me the future, and you have no place in it. Azeroth will be reborn in darkness. Yogg-Saron shall be released! The Pantheon shall fall!"
G["My master, Plugger Spazzring, is a good boss.  And he makes a lot of money.  His pockets are bursting!"]="Meu mestre, Plugger Spazzring, é um bom chefe. E ele ganha muito dinheiro. Seus bolsos estão estourando!"
G["My master, we are honored by your presence.  How may I serve thee?"]="My master, we are honored by your presence.  How may I serve thee?"
G["My masterpiece is finished!"]="Meu obra mestra está terminada!"
G["My mate was slain while I was made to watch. Only vengeance remains in my heart."]="My mate was slain while I was made to watch. Only vengeance remains in my heart."
G["My meager healing powers are at your disposal, Zalduun."]="My meager healing powers are at your disposal, Zalduun."
G["My memories of Thalorien went cold and so did his blade."]="My memories of Thalorien went cold and so did his blade."
G["My memory isn't what it used to be."]="Meu memória já não é o que era..."
G["My men - they're all taken... Go! Save youselves!"]="My men - they're all taken... Go! Save youselves!"
G["My men and I will hole up inside the Light's Dawn Cathedral.  I've already given the order and the cannons are on their way.  Lead our people well, Genn."]="Meus homens e eu nos ocultaremos na Catedral do Alba. Já e dados as ordens e os canhões estão de caminho. Sei um bom líder para nosso povo, Genn."
G["My men are eager for some blood, commander."]="Meus homens estão ansiosos por ver algo de sangue, comandante."
G["My men are prepped and ready - just give us the word!"]="Meus homens estão preparados e disposto... somente da a ordem!"
G["My men are ready. Let's draw some Vrykul blood!"]="Meus homens estão prontos. Vamos tirar um pouco de sangue Vrykul!"
G["My men recovered the corpses of two of Godfrey's lieutenants: Baron Ashbury and Lord Walden."]="Meus homens têm recuperei os cadáveres de dois dos tenentes de Godfrey: o barão Ashbury e Lorde Walden."
G["My men speak highly of this Nurong, it will be good to finally meet him."]="My men speak highly of this Nurong, it will be good to finally meet him."
G["My men. All dead? No..."]="Meus homens... Têm morto todos? Não..."
G["My menagerie will eat the flesh from your bones."]="Meu viveiro vai devorar a carne que cobre seus ossos."
G["My message of unity is meant for the Ogre clans, not for you, $R!"]="My message of unity is meant for the Ogre clans, not for you, $R!"
G["My methods never fail!"]="My methods never fail!"
G["My mind is clear. Thank you, $r."]="Noto meu mente lúcida. Obrigado, $r."
G["My mind... my flesh... I'm... rotting...!"]="My mind... my flesh... I'm... rotting...!"
G["My minions..."]="Meus lacaios..."
G["My mission is compete. I may have some spare supplies if you need any."]="Minha missão é competir. Eu posso ter algum suprimentos, se você precisar."
G["My mom said that if I don't get enough exercise, I could end up looking like a sporeling."]="My mom said that if I don't get enough exercise, I could end up looking like a sporeling."
G["My momma always told me these flowers were lucky."]="My momma always told me these flowers were lucky."
G["My money is on one of those kids that came up from the Valley of the Four Winds.\n\nI heard they trained at the monastery in the Jade Forest."]="My money is on one of those kids that came up from the Valley of the Four Winds.\n\nI heard they trained at the monastery in the Jade Forest."
G["My money's on Lam. Did you see him take down Chu during training last week?"]="My money's on Lam. Did you see him take down Chu during training last week?"
G["My money's on the fleshfiend. That creature is terrifying!"]="My money's on the fleshfiend. That creature is terrifying!"
G["My money's on the goblins!  And if you have any sense then yours is too!"]="Meu dinheiro está nos duendes! E se você tem algum sentido, o seu também é!"
G["My monks were shrunken by a troll witch doctor, and thus meet the size requirements for battle.  Do you wish to face them in combat?"]="My monks were shrunken by a troll witch doctor, and thus meet the size requirements for battle.  Do you wish to face them in combat?"
G["My mother could hunt faster than you, $n."]="Meu mãe poderá caçar mais rápido que você, $n."
G["My mouth tastes wet!"]="My mouth tastes wet!"
G["My mouth waters just to think on it.  Pyall Silentstride is the finest cook in Bloodhoof Village.  You will find him in the great tent at the northwest corner of the village."]="Minha boca fica só de água para pensar nisso. Pyall Silentstride é o melhor cozinheiro da Vila Casco Sangrento. Você o encontrará na grande tenda no canto noroeste da vila."
G["My my - this is all that remains of the terrible being that haunted Pandaria all these years."]="Ah... Isto é o que resta do terrível ser que asoló Pandaria durante tantos anos."
G["My my, the child of the Worldbreaker, proof that none are beyond redemption. I am honored by your visit."]="Vá, vá… o filho do Rompemundos, a prova de que a redenção é sempre possível. Me honras com o seu visite."
G["My name ISN'T FRONKLE!"]="Não me chamo Fronkle!"
G["My name is Nimrida, boy."]="Meu nome é Nimrida, rapaz."
G["My name is..."]="Me chamo..."
G["My name's J.D., and I really can't tell you much about how I got here, but what I can tell you is that this camp is my home now!\n\nI spend my time studying the strange crystals that can be found all over the crater.  You must have seen some on your way over here.  Say, did you happen to pick any up?"]="Me chamo J. D. e em realidade não posso dizer como cheguei até aqui, mas o que si te posso dizer é que este acampamento é agora meu lar!\n\nMe passo a vida estudando os estranhos cristais que se podem encontrar por tudo o cratera. Tem tido que ver algumas amostras no seu caminho até aqui. Diga, por casualidade pegou alguma?"
G["My neck! I'm gonna sue!"]="My neck! I'm gonna sue!"
G["My new life was just beginning..."]="My new life was just beginning..."
G["My next great adventure is about to begin.\n\nIs that a Light I see?"]="Meu seguinte grande aventura está a ponto de começar. \n\nIsso que vejo é uma luz?"
G["My niece Li Li is so impatient to explore Pandaria. But one never learns a new land by rushing headlong from place to place. It is important to talk to everyone you meet, to experience a place until it becomes a part of your soul.\n\nIt is the Wanderer's Way!"]="My niece Li Li is so impatient to explore Pandaria. But one never learns a new land by rushing headlong from place to place. It is important to talk to everyone you meet, to experience a place until it becomes a part of your soul.\n\nIt is the Wanderer's Way!"
G["My nightmare, is it finally over?"]="Meu pesadelos... tem terminado finalmente?"
G["My noble Varo'then, do return and dispose of this murderous band."]="My noble Varo'then, do return and dispose of this murderous band."
G["My nose is cold. That is a very bad sign."]="My nose is cold. That is a very bad sign."
G["My official diagnosis is that you are both idiots! IDIOTS I SAY!"]="Meu diagnóstico oficial é que os dois são idiotas! IDIOTAS OS DIGO!"
G["My older sister, Hilda, told me to expect ye."]="My older sister, Hilda, told me to expect ye."
G["My olfactory sensors detect a burning odor."]="Meus sensores olfativos detectam um odor pungente."
G["My only wish is to serve you, great one, until I die by your foot!"]="My only wish is to serve you, great one, until I die by your foot!"
G["My orchids!"]="Meus orquídeas!"
G["My order has long wandered these lands, lending aid where we can. Ever since the days of Lei Shen there have been five of our order, passing the secrets of our order from generation to generation."]="My order has long wandered these lands, lending aid where we can. Ever since the days of Lei Shen there have been five of our order, passing the secrets of our order from generation to generation."
G["My orders are that you must wait here."]="Tenho ordens de que esperes aqui."
G["My orders are to create a distraction at the Dead Scar so our forces can take the Sun's Reach Armory.  It might not be as glamorous as killing demons face to face, but if it wins us this battle then I'm all for it.\n\nWe are $3233w percent done with our goal."]="Meus ordens são criar uma distração na Cicatriz Morta para que nossas forças possam pegar o Arsenal de Tramo do Sol. Talvez não seja tão glamuroso como matar demônios rosto a rosto, mas se nos ajuda a ganhar esta batalha eu me apunto.\n\nTemos concluído nossa meta em um $3233w %."
G["My orders from Baine were to secure new holdings in this land and investigate the light our sunwalkers felt. The Alliance is of little concern."]="My orders from Baine were to secure new holdings in this land and investigate the light our sunwalkers felt. The Alliance is of little concern."
G["My own death came at the hands of Arthas when he and his armies sacked my homeland, Quel'Thalas, and murdered my people."]="My own death came at the hands of Arthas when he and his armies sacked my homeland, Quel'Thalas, and murdered my people."
G["My pain... is endless..."]="Meu dor... é interminável..."
G["My pal Buliwyf here can show you how to use fist weapons... or, if you prefer, Ilyenia Moonfire - she's the night elf weapon master on the Warrior's Terrace in Darnassus - can show you, too!"]="Meu amigo Buliwyf aqui pode mostrar como usar armas de punho... ou, se você preferir, Ilyenia Moonfire - ela é a mestre em elfos noturnos no Terraço do Guerreiro em Darnassus - também pode mostrar!"
G["My papa always did say to help out a neighbor in need! I've just gotta take care of some stuff here at the market, first. I'll be there soon as I can!"]="My papa always did say to help out a neighbor in need! I've just gotta take care of some stuff here at the market, first. I'll be there soon as I can!"
G["My papa always did say to help out a neighbor in need! I've just gotta take care of some stuff, then I'll be there in a jiffy!"]="My papa always did say to help out a neighbor in need! I've just gotta take care of some stuff, then I'll be there in a jiffy!"
G["My papa always told me that fish swim 'n birds fly. Now if I can swim AND fly, what does that make me?"]="My papa always told me that fish swim 'n birds fly. Now if I can swim AND fly, what does that make me?"
G["My papa always told me that friends are worth more than sweet turnips. That's why yer my friend, $n!"]="My papa always told me that friends are worth more than sweet turnips. That's why yer my friend, $n!"
G["My papa always told me that good friends are worth more than a chipper carrot. That's why yer my good friend, $n!"]="My papa always told me that good friends are worth more than a chipper carrot. That's why yer my good friend, $n!"
G["My papa always told me that neighbors are worth more than earth. Now that's sayin' something!\n\nThat's why yer my neighbor, $n!"]="My papa always told me that neighbors are worth more than earth. Now that's sayin' something!\n\nThat's why yer my neighbor, $n!"
G["My papa always told me to make friends 'stead o' enemies. That's why ye're my buddy!"]="My papa always told me to make friends 'stead o' enemies. That's why ye're my buddy!"
G["My pappy helped build this harbor, you know. Ain't she a beauty?"]="My pappy helped build this harbor, you know. Ain't she a beauty?"
G["My pappy must've told me the story a hunnert times!\n\nBack during the great drought, times sure were hard. Farmers were spitting on their crops to water 'em, it was so dry. The entire town was starvin' o' thirst!\n\nSo what does Farmer Yoon's grandpappy do but pack up his wagon in the middle o' the night.\n\nThen he drives his mushan beast all the way to the lake at the base o' Kun-Lai Summit. He loads up that wagon with a hunnert barrels o' fresh water, then drives right on back.\n\nHe didn't stop fer nuthin'! How could he? Our whole town was dyin'! He drove that busted wagon up to his farm and his mushan died on the spot!\n\nBut we had enough water for the entire town and the spring harvest, too.\n\nSaved Halfhill, Yoon's grandpappy did!"]="My pappy must've told me the story a hunnert times!\n\nBack during the great drought, times sure were hard. Farmers were spitting on their crops to water 'em, it was so dry. The entire town was starvin' o' thirst!\n\nSo what does Farmer Yoon's grandpappy do but pack up his wagon in the middle o' the night.\n\nThen he drives his mushan beast all the way to the lake at the base o' Kun-Lai Summit. He loads up that wagon with a hunnert barrels o' fresh water, then drives right on back.\n\nHe didn't stop fer nuthin'! How could he? Our whole town was dyin'! He drove that busted wagon up to his farm and his mushan died on the spot!\n\nBut we had enough water for the entire town and the spring harvest, too.\n\nSaved Halfhill, Yoon's grandpappy did!"
G["My parents once spoke of a strange, furry folk that lived far to the south of our homeland before the Sundering. I always assumed they spoke of smarter furbolgs.\n\nI know now just how wrong I was. Would that they still walked this world and could see this."]="My parents once spoke of a strange, furry folk that lived far to the south of our homeland before the Sundering. I always assumed they spoke of smarter furbolgs.\n\nI know now just how wrong I was. Would that they still walked this world and could see this."
G["My parts, gnoll!"]="Meus peças, gnolh!"
G["My path is a dark and cursed one, $c. You do not wish to walk with me."]="Meu caminho é sombrio e maldito, $c. Não te conviene caminhar comigo."
G["My patience has reached its limit!"]="Meu paciência chegou ao seu limite!"
G["My patience has reached its limit. I will be rid of you!"]="My patience has reached its limit. I will be rid of you!"
G["My patience has run out! Die! Die!"]="My patience has run out! Die! Die!"
G["My patron requests your presence."]="Meu patrão pede sua presença."
G["My people and I are studying the nearby rivers and ponds. Never before have we seen such revitalizing water."]="My people and I are studying the nearby rivers and ponds. Never before have we seen such revitalizing water."
G["My people and their new allies will burn this village to the ground."]="My people and their new allies will burn this village to the ground."
G["My people are here to ensure they honor the rules of engagement. It will do your subjects well to see you in the stands."]="My people are here to ensure they honor the rules of engagement. It will do your subjects well to see you in the stands."
G["My people are wary of strangers. However, it seems I have no choice but to trust you."]="My people are wary of strangers. However, it seems I have no choice but to trust you."
G["My people ask that you pull back your Boulderfist ogres and cease all attacks on our territories. In return, we will also pull back our forces."]="Meu povo pede que você retire seus ogros Punho de Pedra e pare com todos os ataque em nossos territórios. Em troca, também recuaremos nossas forças."
G["My people do not like strangers, but I owe you this much. May the elders not punish me for this deed."]="A meu gente não lhe gostam os forasteiros, mas isto te o devo. Que os ancestrais não me castiguen por este gesto."
G["My people fight to defend our last village. If we lose now, it will be the end of a lineage of once great emperors and philosophers."]="My people fight to defend our last village. If we lose now, it will be the end of a lineage of once great emperors and philosophers."
G["My people gunna rescue me any minute, mon! ....I think."]="My people gunna rescue me any minute, mon! ....I think."
G["My people have come a long way in those regards, my lady.  I'm sorry if I gave you any cause to doubt."]="My people have come a long way in those regards, my lady.  I'm sorry if I gave you any cause to doubt."
G["My people have enjoyed a good relationship with the Wildhammer for quite some time now.\n\nA few of us have settled here... those who have found this land to be a home worth defending."]="My people have enjoyed a good relationship with the Wildhammer for quite some time now.\n\nA few of us have settled here... those who have found this land to be a home worth defending."
G["My people have faced many trials...but never have we encountered anything like this."]="My people have faced many trials...but never have we encountered anything like this."
G["My people have stood tall without you for thousands of years."]="Meu gente tem vivido com orgulho sem vocês desde há milhares de anos."
G["My people have survived in Outland..."]="Meu gente tem sobrevivido em TerrAlém..."
G["My people should have taken this world long ago, during the First War. But they fell to corruption.  In their weakness, they allowed the pitiful races of Azeroth to join the horde.  I will succeed where they have failed, and no power in this world can stop me!"]="My people should have taken this world long ago, during the First War. But they fell to corruption.  In their weakness, they allowed the pitiful races of Azeroth to join the horde.  I will succeed where they have failed, and no power in this world can stop me!"
G["My people will stand idle no longer. The halls of Ulduar shall be cleansed!"]="Meu povo não ficará mais ocioso. Os salões de Ulduar serão limpos!"
G["My people, corrupted...\nShai Hu, a local warrior, was the first to drink of the tainted waters.\nHe was strengthed, emboldened, and urged the others to do the same.\nI warned them against it. I sensed danger, corruption..."]="My people, corrupted...\nShai Hu, a local warrior, was the first to drink of the tainted waters.\nHe was strengthed, emboldened, and urged the others to do the same.\nI warned them against it. I sensed danger, corruption..."
G["My people, here $ghe:she; is! The one who gave the Inkgill new life. $n!"]="Meu gente, aqui $glo: a; têm! $gEl: A; que dio nova vida a Branquias de Tinta. $n!"
G["My people, they are as shattered as the relic you seek to repair."]="Meu povo, eles estão tão destruídos quanto a relíquia que você procura reparar."
G["My people, who have suffered through so many challenges and betrayals, look to me to secure their future."]="Meu povo, que sofreu tantas traições e enfrentou tantos desafios, confia em mim para garantir seu futuro."
G["My pet! Oh no!  Uh... I am shure that pet is around here somewhere..."]="Meu mascote! Oh, não! Eh... Eshtoy certo de que esha mascote anda por aí em alguma parte..."
G["My pets are all hand-grown! You don't stand a chance!"]="Minhas mascotes foram cultivadas organicamente! Você não tem a menor chance!"
G["My pets claim yet another victim."]="Minhas mascotes fazem mais uma vítima."
G["My pets speak to me. They tell me stories late at night."]="Meus ajudantes me falam. Me cuentan histórias pela noite."
G["My pheromones should be useful when dealing with multiple enemies."]="My pheromones should be useful when dealing with multiple enemies."
G["My plan hinges on you bringing us as many arrows as you can from the battlefield, $c."]="Meu plano depende de que nos traigas todas as flechas que possa do campo de batalha, $c."
G["My plan was to connect these underground waters directly to the Emerald Dream itself. With my faithful disciples, I journeyed deep within the Wailing Caverns, settled into meditation, and entered the Dream. Through my own body, this world was connected to it.\n\nIt was there that everything went wrong."]="My plan was to connect these underground waters directly to the Emerald Dream itself. With my faithful disciples, I journeyed deep within the Wailing Caverns, settled into meditation, and entered the Dream. Through my own body, this world was connected to it.\n\nIt was there that everything went wrong."
G["My pleasure, milady!"]="é claro, meu senhora!"
G["My pleasure, sugar drop.  I'll be back soon..."]="É um prazer, preciosa. Pronto voltarei..."
G["My plucky companion Bixi Wobblebonk here can train ye in crossbows. If ye're looking for other trainers, though, ye might want to try Ilyenia Moonfire on the Warrior's Terrace in Darnassus, or maybe the draenei weapon master, Handiir, in the Trader's Tier within the Exodar."]="Meu corajoso companheiro Bixi Wobblebonk aqui pode treinar você em bestas. Se você estiver procurando por outros treinadores, tente Ilyenia Moonfire no Terraço do Guerreiro em Darnassus, ou talvez o mestre de armas draenei, Handiir, no Nível do Negociador dentro do Exodar."
G["My poor Gobbles..."]="Meu pobrrre Gluber..."
G["My poor Lo. He tried so hard to earn the respect of the pandriarchs. It was the only honorable solution we could think of to bypass our family feuds."]="My poor Lo. He tried so hard to earn the respect of the pandriarchs. It was the only honorable solution we could think of to bypass our family feuds."
G["My poor family. Everything has been destroyed."]="Meu pobre família. O têm destruído tudo."
G["My poor flying machine. She didn't survive the crash and without spare parts, I'll never get 'er up and running again!"]="Minha pobre máquina voadora. Ela não sobreviveu ao acidente e sem peças de reposição, nunca mais voltarei a funcionar!"
G["My poor old bones were starting to get stiff out here."]="My poor old bones were starting to get stiff out here."
G["My portal creation spells do not appear to work here. The damned naaru constructed this place well."]="Meus feitiços de criação de portais não parecem funcionar aqui. Os malditos naarus construyeron bem este lugar."
G["My power cannot be contained!"]="Meu poder não é possível conter!"
G["My power grows feeble, brothers. I shamefully must rely on you for a time."]="Meu poder se debilita, irmãos. Me avergüenzo de ter que depender de vocês durante uns instantes."
G["My power has returned!"]="Meu poder tem retornado!"
G["My power is discombobulatingly devastating! It is ludicrous that these mortals even attempt to enter my realm!"]="My power is discombobulatingly devastating! It is ludicrous that these mortals even attempt to enter my realm!"
G["My power is unimaginable!"]="Meu poder é inimaginável!"
G["My power is waning - support me, brothers!"]="Meu poder se debilita... Ajudem-me, irmãos!"
G["My power is waning... you fool! I will come for you next!"]="Meu poder se desaparece... Insensssato! Você serásss o seguinte!"
G["My power wanes!"]="Meu poder se desaparece!"
G["My power... is gone!"]="Meu poder... se tem ido!"
G["My powers are drained!"]="My powers are drained!"
G["My powers are fading, Highlord!"]="My powers are fading, Highlord!"
G["My powers have returned and you have squandered your chance, foolish mortals. Till we meet again."]="My powers have returned and you have squandered your chance, foolish mortals. Till we meet again."
G["My powers must be concentrated on the portal! I do not have time to hold the shield!"]="My powers must be concentrated on the portal! I do not have time to hold the shield!"
G["My powers of sight... I beheld the future... I have seen what is to come..."]="Meus poderes de visão... Contemplé o futuro... vi o que está por vir..."
G["My precious $n! You'll pay for that!"]="Meu $gquerido: querida; $n! Pagará por isso!"
G["My precious magmawyrms... perhaps not all is lost... perhaps there is something left to raise."]="My precious magmawyrms... perhaps not all is lost... perhaps there is something left to raise."
G["My pride cloaked this land in mists! I thought we were better than the rest of the world."]="Meu orgulho envolveu esta terra em névoas! Eu pensava que éramos melhores que o resto do mundo."
G["My programming will not allow me to lower the cost of any items."]="Minha programação não me permitirá reduzir o custo de nenhum item."
G["My purpose is to regulate access to the Uldum complex for the Creators.  I allow entry into the compound only when the solicitor exhibits for access the proper sequencing discs.\n\nYour disc set currently does not contain the Plates of Uldum, the primary prerequisite for entry.  Access is not granted unless the Plates of Uldum are present."]="My purpose is to regulate access to the Uldum complex for the Creators.  I allow entry into the compound only when the solicitor exhibits for access the proper sequencing discs.\n\nYour disc set currently does not contain the Plates of Uldum, the primary prerequisite for entry.  Access is not granted unless the Plates of Uldum are present."
G["My quad-corder has detected some anomolous readings from the nether anomolies."]="My quad-corder has detected some anomolous readings from the nether anomolies."
G["My queen, they... come."]="My queen, they... come."
G["My question to you is this, $c:\nWhich of the Aspects created by the titans became the nefarious creature known as Deathwing?"]="Esta é meu pergunta, $c:\nQual dos Aspectos criados pelos titãs se transformou na malvada criatura conhecida como Alamuerte?"
G["My rage is not silenced... but it is quieter. For now."]="Meu raiva não se tem apagado... mas si se tem calmado. Por agora."
G["My rangers have sent back disturbing reports from Za'Tual. I believe it is time to take this fight to their doorstep."]="My rangers have sent back disturbing reports from Za'Tual. I believe it is time to take this fight to their doorstep."
G["My raptor can take on ANYTHING and ANYONE!"]="Meu raptor pode enfrentar qualquer coisa e qualquer um!"
G["My realm has at last been cleansed of the vile filth."]="Finalmente meu reino foi purificou dessa vil polução."
G["My redemption? You are bold, little one. My redemption comes by the will of my god."]="My redemption? You are bold, little one. My redemption comes by the will of my god."
G["My rescue plan is brilliant. Infallible. Only a goblin could possibly stop me from succeeding. A goblin with fins. Scary thought."]="Meu plano de resgate é brilhante. Infalível. Apenas um duende poderia me impedir de ter sucesso. Um duende com barbatanas. Pensamento assustador."
G["My research must continue."]="Meu investigação deve seguir."
G["My ribs are broken."]="Tenho as costelas rompidas."
G["My ring... Who holds my family ring... Tilloa, is that you?"]="Meu anel... Quem tno anel de meu família... Tilhoa, é você?"
G["My rotting flesh was just getting in the way!"]="My rotting flesh was just getting in the way!"
G["My scepter will once again become whole!"]="Meu cetro voltará a estar completo!"
G["My scepter... After so many years... You have recovered it! You shall truly be the savior of this place...\n\nPlease listen to me carefully, $n. The head and the rod of the scepter may only be reunited into one at the Stone of Maraudon."]="Meu cetro... Depois de tantos anos... O tem recuperei! Mesmo é $gel salvador: a salvadora; deste lugar!\n\nOuça com atenção, $n. Somente é possível unir a cabeça e a vara na Pedra de Maraudon."
G["My scouts have informed me that the grove holds a powerful weapon. A weapon that the Alliance will use against us if they are not stopped."]="My scouts have informed me that the grove holds a powerful weapon. A weapon that the Alliance will use against us if they are not stopped."
G["My scouts have reported nothing but quiet outside Zul'Aman."]="My scouts have reported nothing but quiet outside Zul'Aman."
G["My scouts report that the Syndicate has taken up residence in a hidden cave on the eastern plateau. Be cautious when adventuring in that area."]="Meus batedores me têm informou de que a Guilda tem uma nova covil em uma caverna oculta da meseta oriental. Tenha cuidado quando te adentres em essa zona."
G["My scouts report that the shield is maintained by several generators around the island."]="My scouts report that the shield is maintained by several generators around the island."
G["My scouts tell me that you brought the shield down. I'm confused as to why you're back here instead of up there killing their leader."]="Meus batedores dizem que tem retirado o escudo. Não entendo por que está aqui em vez de estar ali matando ao seu líder."
G["My seeds grow the best veggies in the valley. Guaranteed!"]="My seeds grow the best veggies in the valley. Guaranteed!"
G["My sensibilities are offended by this mess!"]="Este desastre ofende meu sensibilidade!"
G["My sentinels have faced far worse than this jungle has to offer."]="My sentinels have faced far worse than this jungle has to offer."
G["My sentinels have faced many dangers since we came to this new land. We are ready for whatever the future has to offer."]="My sentinels have faced many dangers since we came to this new land. We are ready for whatever the future has to offer."
G["My services were rendered. The protection of the city is not my jurisdiction. I believe that's why they call you \"peacekeepers?\""]="My services were rendered. The protection of the city is not my jurisdiction. I believe that's why they call you \"peacekeepers?\""
G["My sheep! Someone, do something!"]="My sheep! Someone, do something!"
G["My shift's almost over.  Can't wait to catch some shut-eye, know what I mean?"]="Meu turno está quase no fim. Mal posso esperar para fechar a visão, entende o que quero dizer?"
G["My shiny..."]="Brilha..."
G["My ship took a beating to make landing on these shores. I will see to it that they pay for every single nick on her hull."]="My ship took a beating to make landing on these shores. I will see to it that they pay for every single nick on her hull."
G["My shop is filled with many wonderous and hard to come by things. It would be wise to look, but not to touch."]="My shop is filled with many wonderous and hard to come by things. It would be wise to look, but not to touch."
G["My shop's doors will always be open to you, friend."]="My shop's doors will always be open to you, friend."
G["My sight is filled with visions of events taking place throughout the world and ones that may yet happen. Many of them are grim, but we needn't believe they are incapable of changing."]="Minha visão está cheia de visões de eventos que ocorrem em tudo o mundo e outros que ainda podem acontecer. Muitos deles são sombrios, mas não precisamos de acreditar que são incapazes de mudar."
G["My sight may be gone, but I am fortunate to live in a land which rewards all of the senses."]="Talvez tenha perdido a visão, mas tenho sorte de viver em uma terra que deleita todos os sentidos."
G["My sincerest apologies for the disturbance, my liege. But I believe I have something you may be very interested in!"]="My sincerest apologies for the disturbance, my liege. But I believe I have something you may be very interested in!"
G["My sister Silanna is naive to the growing danger in these woods. But like it or not, as soon as I get this wagon loaded we're moving within the city walls. \n\nIt appears that I've got more bags here than I need. Perhaps you could make use of them."]="My sister Silanna is naive to the growing danger in these woods. But like it or not, as soon as I get this wagon loaded we're moving within the city walls. \n\nIt appears that I've got more bags here than I need. Perhaps you could make use of them."
G["My sister and I haven't seen this much activity in Honeydew since, well ever!"]="My sister and I haven't seen this much activity in Honeydew since, well ever!"
G["My sister lives with my father in his farmhouse in the middle of the farmlands, just east of the big ol' crane statue.\n\nI like to see my sister now and then, but she's usually too busy making herself look pretty for the next farmboy to pass through these parts."]="My sister lives with my father in his farmhouse in the middle of the farmlands, just east of the big ol' crane statue.\n\nI like to see my sister now and then, but she's usually too busy making herself look pretty for the next farmboy to pass through these parts."
G["My sisters and I have come down from the Stonetalon Mountains to put to rest a tragedy from ages past. Unfortunately, we are not powerful enough to accomplish our goals on our own and now seek mortals such as yourself to aid us.\n\nIf you are powerful enough, then we have much to discuss, $c. If you are not, then, for your safety, I will leave the details of my mission out of our conversation."]="My sisters and I have come down from the Stonetalon Mountains to put to rest a tragedy from ages past. Unfortunately, we are not powerful enough to accomplish our goals on our own and now seek mortals such as yourself to aid us.\n\nIf you are powerful enough, then we have much to discuss, $c. If you are not, then, for your safety, I will leave the details of my mission out of our conversation."
G["My sisters and I welcome you, $r."]="Meus irmãs e eu te damos a boas-vindas, $r."
G["My skill at creating potions is inferior to yours. You are ready to speak with Ainethil, just over there. She will understand that you are ready for further instruction."]="Minha habilidade em criar poções é inferior à sua. Você está pronto para falar com Ainethil, logo ali. Ela entenderá que você está pronto para mais instruções."
G["My skills are better for offense, not defense."]="Meus habilidades são ofensivas, não defensivas."
G["My skills are no match for yours. I admit defeat."]="My skills are no match for yours. I admit defeat."
G["My skull feels like it was hit by a hammer, but otherwise I'm all right. That's more than I can say for most of the crew."]="My skull feels like it was hit by a hammer, but otherwise I'm all right. That's more than I can say for most of the crew."
G["My slack-jawed compatriot, the time to act is now! Pull yourself together and lend me a hand!"]="Meu bobo compatriota, este é o momentos de actuar! Recomponte e dê-me uma mão!"
G["My snakes are pretty right? ...RIGHT?"]="Minhas cobras são bonitas, não são? NÃO SÃO?"
G["My snakes, mon. They took my snakes!"]="Meus seh'pientes, colega. Se levaram meus seh'pientes!"
G["My son Dion is out in fields all day. He works so hard. Makes Mama so proud."]="Meu filho Dion estará no campo tudo o dia. Trabalha muito duro. Mamãe está muito orgulhosa."
G["My son Dion say Mama make the best dumplings in all of Valley!\n\nOoohoohoohooo. That's my boy."]="My son Dion say Mama make the best dumplings in all of Valley!\n\nOoohoohoohooo. That's my boy."
G["My son could design a faster car than that clunky goblin junk heap!"]="My son could design a faster car than that clunky goblin junk heap!"
G["My son does not eat enough. Look at him! So scrawny and skinny! I must feed him more."]="My son does not eat enough. Look at him! So scrawny and skinny! I must feed him more."
G["My son loved these feathers because they are blue as the sky. He always said he was going to fly someday."]="My son loved these feathers because they are blue as the sky. He always said he was going to fly someday."
G["My son used to love finding these feathers."]="A meu filho lhe costumava entusiasmar encontrar estas plumas."
G["My son! My dear, beautiful boy!"]="Meu filho! Meu querido e precioso filho!"
G["My son's soul will find no comfort in this hollow victory, dragon. I will have him back. Though it takes a millennia, I WILL have my son back!"]="My son's soul will find no comfort in this hollow victory, dragon. I will have him back. Though it takes a millennia, I WILL have my son back!"
G["My son, Taelan, was only a child when I was found guilty of treason and banished from the Alliance to live a life in exile. I chose to remain here so that I could watch over him; to somehow insure that he would grow up an honorable man.\n\nAs I had hoped, he took my place as lord of Mardenholde; but in a cruel twist of fate, joined the ranks of the Scarlet Crusade. He is now their Highlord, $r."]="My son, Taelan, was only a child when I was found guilty of treason and banished from the Alliance to live a life in exile. I chose to remain here so that I could watch over him; to somehow insure that he would grow up an honorable man.\n\nAs I had hoped, he took my place as lord of Mardenholde; but in a cruel twist of fate, joined the ranks of the Scarlet Crusade. He is now their Highlord, $r."
G["My son, there will come a day when you will command the Ashbringer and, with it, mete out justice across this land. I have no doubt that when that day finally comes, you will bring pride to our people and that Lordaeron will be a better place because of you. But, my son, that day is not today."]="My son, there will come a day when you will command the Ashbringer and, with it, mete out justice across this land. I have no doubt that when that day finally comes, you will bring pride to our people and that Lordaeron will be a better place because of you. But, my son, that day is not today."
G["My son... he's here? Alive!?"]="Meu filho... está aqui? Vivo?!"
G["My son... though I have recovered my goods, what will come of him?"]="Meu filho... embora e recuperei meus coisas, que será de ele?"
G["My soul burns for revenge, but the elements tell me to think clearly. The Lich King is a ruthless opponent... one who must be handled carefully."]="Minha alma arde com vingança, mas os elementos me dizem que piense com claridade. O Rei Lich é um inimigo impiedoso... um ao que é preciso manusear com cuidado."
G["My soul for you, master."]="Minha alma por você, mestre."
G["My soul has been wracked with unbearable anxiety, dark thoughts... distancing me from the Light."]="Minha alma se tem visto sacudida por uma ansiedade insuportável, pensamentos obscuros... que me distânciaban da Luz."
G["My soul is not a trinket!  Mortal, you must release me from these chains!"]="My soul is not a trinket!  Mortal, you must release me from these chains!"
G["My sources say \"no\". Before the torture, that is."]="My sources say \"no\". Before the torture, that is."
G["My sparkly!"]="Meu brilhante!"
G["My spear will finish you!"]="My spear will finish you!"
G["My spirit be watchin' over ya, $n."]="Meu eh'píritu cuidará de ti, $n."
G["My spirit dreams no longer..."]="My spirit dreams no longer..."
G["My spirit gonna be watchin' over ya, $n."]="Meu eh'píritu cuidará de ti, $n."
G["My spirit is lifted with the sight of you, $c. We fight on two fronts.\n\nWe're trying to push back the yaungol horde at the gate. And up on the mountain to the north, we've lost the Shado-Pan Monastery to unknown forces."]="My spirit is lifted with the sight of you, $c. We fight on two fronts.\n\nWe're trying to push back the yaungol horde at the gate. And up on the mountain to the north, we've lost the Shado-Pan Monastery to unknown forces."
G["My spirit leaves this cursed place at last..."]="Meu espírito abandona este lugar maldito ao fim..."
G["My spirit will fight on."]="Meu espírito seguirá lutando."
G["My spirit... goes on."]="Meu espírito... permanece."
G["My spouse has gone missing! Please help!"]="Meu esposa sumiu! Ajuda!"
G["My squad stands ready, $r.\n\nWe have a traditional defense that should prove effective against your Horde enemies."]="My squad stands ready, $r.\n\nWe have a traditional defense that should prove effective against your Horde enemies."
G["My squad's morale has improved since we entered the Vale."]="A moral de meu esquadrão aumentou desde que entramos no vale."
G["My squire will retrieve your purse for you."]="Meu escudeiro recuperará seu bolso."
G["My ssssserpents, dey already ssssslither beneath every rock an' shrub of Ssssstranglethorn."]="My ssssserpents, dey already ssssslither beneath every rock an' shrub of Ssssstranglethorn."
G["My state of the art teleporter will take you straight to the Northern Barrens. Whaddaya say?"]="My state of the art teleporter will take you straight to the Northern Barrens. Whaddaya say?"
G["My statue will crush the life from him, leaving nothing but a shattered corpse."]="My statue will crush the life from him, leaving nothing but a shattered corpse."
G["My story? It is kind of you to ask. Very well.\n\nLong ago on the planet Draenor - the remains of which are now known as the Outland - all of the draenei lived in peace. But then the Burning Legion came, and they corrupted the orcs with their fel magics.\n\nWith no other option we fought to survive, but exposure to these fel energies had horrible effects upon some of us, over time transforming us into the Broken like me, or worse, the seemingly mindless Lost Ones.\n\nShall I go on?"]="My story? It is kind of you to ask. Very well.\n\nLong ago on the planet Draenor - the remains of which are now known as the Outland - all of the draenei lived in peace. But then the Burning Legion came, and they corrupted the orcs with their fel magics.\n\nWith no other option we fought to survive, but exposure to these fel energies had horrible effects upon some of us, over time transforming us into the Broken like me, or worse, the seemingly mindless Lost Ones.\n\nShall I go on?"
G["My strength ... is beginning ... to falter. Kalytha, please tell me the Archmages have a backup plan..."]="Minha força... está começando a vacilar. Kalytha, por favor me diga que os Archmages têm um plano de backup..."
G["My strength grows!"]="My strength grows!"
G["My strength is returning, slowly....\n\nI hope to be able to show you the glory of my true form soon."]="My strength is returning, slowly....\n\nI hope to be able to show you the glory of my true form soon."
G["My strength is returning. Press on, heroes!"]="My strength is returning. Press on, heroes!"
G["My strength returns."]="Recupero a força."
G["My strength returns. Speak to me, Wakener, before I report to the Klaxxi."]="Meu energia retorna. Fala comigo, arauto, antes de que relatório aos Klaxxi."
G["My strength wanes, mortal. I have done as promised, the way is clear. I now return to whence I came."]="My strength wanes, mortal. I have done as promised, the way is clear. I now return to whence I came."
G["My strength.... is... returning!"]="Estou... recuperando... as forças!"
G["My strider requires training."]="Meu pernalta precisa treinamento."
G["My studies... had only just begun..."]="My studies... had only just begun..."
G["My suffering is at an end, $r. But yours has just begun!"]="Meu sofrimento termina, $r. Mas o seu acaba de começar!"
G["My suffering is eternal!"]="Meu sofrimento é eterno!"
G["My sweet, adorable progeny!"]="My sweet, adorable progeny!"
G["My sword Archeus served me well in life, but as at last my spirit may pass from the unhappy existence, I need it no longer."]="My sword Archeus served me well in life, but as at last my spirit may pass from the unhappy existence, I need it no longer."
G["My sword is quick and my feet steady. Enemies must deal with me first before attacking my allies."]="My sword is quick and my feet steady. Enemies must deal with me first before attacking my allies."
G["My tactics are unbeatable."]="Meu táctica é insuperable."
G["My talents are wasted on this filth."]="Malgasto meus talentos com esta porquería."
G["My talons will shred your puny body, $R."]="My talons will shred your puny body, $R."
G["My talons will slice you to shreds, invader."]="My talons will slice you to shreds, invader."
G["My task is done!"]="E concluído meu cometido!"
G["My teachings are only of use to mages. I cannot help you, $c."]="My teachings are only of use to mages. I cannot help you, $c."
G["My teachings would be too advanced for you at this stage. If you wish to learn more of potions, speak with Tel'Athir here instead."]="Meus ensinamentos seriam avançados demais para você nesta fase. Se você deseja aprender mais sobre poções, fale com Tel'Athir aqui."
G["My team will crush you."]="Meu equipamento te aplastará."
G["My teammate is to blame for everything..."]="Tudo foi culpar de meu companheiro..."
G["My thane, I bear untimely news. Your champion, Bethod, has fallen in the ring at Valhalas. As a vargul, he has been exiled to The Underhalls."]="Senhor feudal, traigo mais notícia. Seu campeão, Bethod, tem caído no anel de Valhalas. Como vargul, foi exilado às Câmaras Subterrâneos."
G["My thanks for your assistance, champions. I will tend to the slain and wounded here before returning to Ironforge."]="My thanks for your assistance, champions. I will tend to the slain and wounded here before returning to Ironforge."
G["My thanks to you, hero!"]="Te o agradeço, corajoso!"
G["My thanks! None of us expected to survive... I will aid you as best as I can!"]="Obrigado! Nenhum de nós esperava sobreviver... Os ajudarei o melhor que possa!"
G["My thanks! Shall we make our way off this miserable little island?"]="My thanks! Shall we make our way off this miserable little island?"
G["My thanks, $p, for saving me from that vile jade witch.\n\nEven now my legs still feel stiff. I can command soldiers, if we can call these creatures that. But I think I will be of little use in any battle."]="My thanks, $p, for saving me from that vile jade witch.\n\nEven now my legs still feel stiff. I can command soldiers, if we can call these creatures that. But I think I will be of little use in any battle."
G["My thanks, $r. I won't be forgettin' dis."]="Te o agradeço, $r. Não o esquecerei."
G["My thanks, brave one."]="Te o agradeço, corajoso."
G["My thanks, stranger."]="My thanks, stranger."
G["My theory is there isn't anything that can't be fixed with fire!"]="My theory is there isn't anything that can't be fixed with fire!"
G["My thoughts exactly."]="Logo o que achava."
G["My time is done."]="Meu tempo terminou."
G["My time is done... I offered myself to Alexstrasza in life, but I have nothing left to offer in death.  She will need a new keeper for her shrine."]="My time is done... I offered myself to Alexstrasza in life, but I have nothing left to offer in death.  She will need a new keeper for her shrine."
G["My time with the Red Crane was short, but I learned a great deal under his tutelage.\n\nThis foe--this \"sha\" energy--is unlike anything we've ever faced. It is the physical manifestation of emotional turmoil, bottled in the land for centuries\n\nThis emotional energy has now burst forth to find living, feeling hosts in which to reside.\n\nThe sha threatens to wash over the whole continent, possibly the world, if we do not aid the pandaren in facing it down!"]="My time with the Red Crane was short, but I learned a great deal under his tutelage.\n\nThis foe--this \"sha\" energy--is unlike anything we've ever faced. It is the physical manifestation of emotional turmoil, bottled in the land for centuries\n\nThis emotional energy has now burst forth to find living, feeling hosts in which to reside.\n\nThe sha threatens to wash over the whole continent, possibly the world, if we do not aid the pandaren in facing it down!"
G["My time with the Shado-Pan has taught me many secrets. Perhaps you have earned the right to learn some as well."]="O tempo que pasé com o Shadopan me ensenhó muitos segredos. ao melhor você também te ganhou o direito a aprender uns quantos."
G["My time... has run out..."]="Meu tempo…se tem esgotado…"
G["My torment continues."]="Meu tormento continua."
G["My torture is ended and now I can join the Goddess. Thank you so very much!"]="My torture is ended and now I can join the Goddess. Thank you so very much!"
G["My totems!!!"]="Meus totens!!!"
G["My training has led to this point. I must not fail my brothers and sisters!"]="Meu treinamento me trazido aqui. Não posso decepcionar a meus irmãos e irmãs!"
G["My training was for nothing, because of you!"]="Tudo meu adiestramento não tem servido para nada! Pelo seu culpar!"
G["My treasure! You no steal from Tartek, dumb big-tongue traitor thing."]="My treasure! You no steal from Tartek, dumb big-tongue traitor thing."
G["My trees.... they have withered up and died just like me."]="My trees.... they have withered up and died just like me."
G["My troll bruddas be in for some real fun today, mon!"]="Meus trolls bruddas se divirtam hoje, mon!"
G["My troops are yours to command, my King."]="Estamos ao seu serviço, majestade."
G["My tummy doesn't feel so good..."]="Me dói a tripita..."
G["My turn, meathead! I get to throw now."]="Meu turno, estúpido! Agora me toca lançar a mim."
G["My vicious teromoths will avenge me!"]="Meus teromotos cruéis vão me vingar!"
G["My victory draws near."]="Minha vitória se aproxima."
G["My victory is close at hand."]="Minha vitória está próxima."
G["My victory will be sweet."]="Meu vitória será muito doce."
G["My vigil never ends, but I cherish this short reprieve in my duty."]="A vigia não termina nunca, mas aprecio este breve descanso no exercícios do dever."
G["My village is under attack! I hope my family is alright."]="Estão atacando meu aldeia! Espero que meu família estiver bem."
G["My village will not enter your conflict. Though, I fear your arrival has changed our peaceful existence forever."]="Meu aldeia não formará parte do seu conflito, embora temo que sua chegada tenha mudado nossa existência pacífica para sempre."
G["My vision in the Eye of Eternity haunts me, Kalecgos. What do you make of it?"]="My vision in the Eye of Eternity haunts me, Kalecgos. What do you make of it?"
G["My vision is clouded, why have you done this to us?"]="Tenho a visão nublada. Por que nos faz isto?"
G["My voice, gone?  How will my subjects hear me?  Will they still love their empress?  Will they turn on me as the Klaxxi have?"]="My voice, gone?  How will my subjects hear me?  Will they still love their empress?  Will they turn on me as the Klaxxi have?"
G["My wares are reserved for those who have proven themselves on the field of battle. Come see me after you've swept the fields clean of Alliance filth."]="My wares are reserved for those who have proven themselves on the field of battle. Come see me after you've swept the fields clean of Alliance filth."
G["My wares are reserved for those who have proven themselves on the field of battle. You'll need to prove your dominance over the Horde scum before I'll entrust them to you."]="My wares are reserved for those who have proven themselves on the field of battle. You'll need to prove your dominance over the Horde scum before I'll entrust them to you."
G["My warmages are inbound and will arrive presently.\n\nSpeak to me again when they have returned,"]="Meus magos de guerra estão voando de volta. Chegarão de um momento a outro.\n\nFala comigo novamente quando tenham voltado."
G["My warriors! You have already proven your valor. This is why the Warchief has selected you."]="Meus guerreiros! Já vocês têm testado seu coragem. Por isso os tem escolhido o Chefe de Guerra."
G["My watch continues."]="Meu vigilance contínua."
G["My watch is eternal, mortal."]="Meu relógio é eterno, mortal."
G["My waters are cleansed! Drink in their power!"]="My waters are cleansed! Drink in their power!"
G["My weapon be thirsty!"]="My weapon be thirsty!"
G["My weapon! Champion, with me. I want you to see this."]="Meu arma! Você, venha comigo. Quero que veas isto."
G["My weapons are nearby - we can regroup with Irontree."]="My weapons are nearby - we can regroup with Irontree."
G["My whole family's been killed! Where was the army when we needed them most?"]="My whole family's been killed! Where was the army when we needed them most?"
G["My wife and I were happy for 23 years..."]="Meu esposa e eu temos banido felizes durante 23 anos..."
G["My wife and children are sick in bed because of the poison you sold me!"]="My wife and children are sick in bed because of the poison you sold me!"
G["My wife used to make a mean dish of braised turtle. The taste of that dish sure would bring back memories."]="My wife used to make a mean dish of braised turtle. The taste of that dish sure would bring back memories."
G["My wife, Leza, is in labor and fighting a fever.\n\nThis cursed jungle is sapping all of our strength. It could be something in the water."]="My wife, Leza, is in labor and fighting a fever.\n\nThis cursed jungle is sapping all of our strength. It could be something in the water."
G["My wind riders are trained to fly quickly through the hot Barrens air."]="Meus pilotos de vento são treinados para voar rapidamente pelo ar quente de Barrens."
G["My wisdom is yours, as is my knowledge. What can I do for you, $n?"]="Meu sabedoria é sua, assim como meu conhecimento. O que posso fazer por você, $n?"
G["My wolf will feast on your blood!"]="Meu lobo se dará um banquete com o seu sangue."
G["My work here is complete!"]="Meu trabalho aqui terminou!"
G["My work here is done."]="Meu trabalho aqui terminou."
G["My work here is done. I'll be sure to let Mar'alith and the others at Cenarion Hold know that you helped me out a little. Be careful in here, you don't have me holdin' your hand past this point."]="Meu trabalho aqui terminou. Me garantirei de decirle a Mar'alith e a todos os do Forte Cenariano que me ajudado um pouco. Tenha cuidado pois de aqui em adiante não estarei para ajudar você."
G["My work is done."]="E concluído com meu dever."
G["My work is not quite finished. This cloak will grant you the power of the celestials."]="Meu trabalho está quase concluído. Esta capa concederá a você o poder dos celestiais."
G["My work must not be interrupted!"]="Não se tem de interromper meu trabalho!"
G["My work will continue... elsewhere."]="Meu obra seguirá adiante... em outra parte."
G["My workers are highly skilled, but they are ineffective when it comes to combat. Do not wander too far off."]="My workers are highly skilled, but they are ineffective when it comes to combat. Do not wander too far off."
G["My wounds are grave.  Forgive my slow pace but my injuries won't allow me to walk any faster."]="My wounds are grave.  Forgive my slow pace but my injuries won't allow me to walk any faster."
G["My wounds are not healing, $r.  I fear I may die inside this creature's gut if we do not act soon."]="My wounds are not healing, $r.  I fear I may die inside this creature's gut if we do not act soon."
G["My wrath flows freely!"]="Meu cólera fluye livremente!"
G["My wrath knows no bounds!"]="Meu cólera não tem limite!"
G["My wrench of vengance awaits!"]="Os espera meu chave inglesa da vingança!"
G["My younger brother here is quite the rising star in the Consortium. Of course, he's too modest to acknowledge it."]="Meu irmão mais novo aqui é bastante a estrela em promoção no Consórcio. Claro, ele é muito modesto para reconhecer isso."
G["My zeppelin has docked. Despite my being held captive, and the sorry state that she's in, she'll be departing the dock again in two minutes."]="My zeppelin has docked. Despite my being held captive, and the sorry state that she's in, she'll be departing the dock again in two minutes."
G["My, it sure is hot down here. I didn't even need to bring my own forge."]="Meu, com certeza está quente aqui em baixo. Eu nem precisava trazer minha própria forja."
G["My, my, I never thought I would have the chance to see Ulduar myself. Why, when Brann asked me to help fund this expedition, how could I refuse?!"]="Meu Deus, nunca pensei que teria a chance de ver Ulduar. Por que, quando Brann me pediu para ajudar a financiar esta expedição, como eu poderia recusar?!"
G["My, my. Hello, stranger! Sampled my dream brew, have we? Its visions are hard to interpret - half truth, half illusion. Who's to say which is which?"]="Olá, viajante! Pelo jeito você provou a minha Cerveja dos Sonhos. As visões são meio verdade, meio ilusão. Quem poderia dizer qual é qual?"
G["My, that Black Claw stout packs quite a punch!"]="Caramba! Essa birra Zarpanegra si que pega forte!"
G["My, that's quite a load you have there."]="My, that's quite a load you have there."
G["My, you are strong! When I was young, I might have doubted that we could do this. But now, I have no doubts at all."]="Nossa, você é forte! Quando eu era jovem, eu duvidaria que pudéssemos fazer isso. Mas agora, não tenho dúvida alguma."
G["My---raaak--favorite! Awk awk awk! Raa-kaa!"]="Meu... raaak... preferido! Awk awk awk! Raa-kaa!"
G["My... My powers have diminished... You shall pay for this insolence!"]="My... My powers have diminished... You shall pay for this insolence!"
G["My... aunt died?  I can't believe I never even met her.  Take this money and give him a good funeral."]="Meu... tia morreu? Não me posso acreditar que nunca a conociera. Tome este dinheiro e dale um bom funeral."
G["My... blood burns."]="Me... hierve o sangue."
G["My... brother died?  I can't believe I never even met him.  Take this money and give him a good funeral."]="My... brother died?  I can't believe I never even met him.  Take this money and give him a good funeral."
G["My... grand creation! How DARE you?"]="My... grand creation! How DARE you?"
G["My... sister died?  I can't believe I never even met her.  Take this money and give him a good funeral."]="Meu... irmã morreu? Não me posso acreditar que nunca a conociera. Tome este dinheiro e dale um bom funeral."
G["My... uncle died?  I can't believe I never even met him.  Take this money and give him a good funeral."]="My... uncle died?  I can't believe I never even met him.  Take this money and give him a good funeral."
G["Myolor, I was once a weaponsmith and wish to instead learn the way of the armorsmith. Will you teach me?"]="Myolor, no seu dia fui ferreiro de armas e no seu lugar desejo aprender o oficio de ferreiro de armaduras. Me ensenfará?"
G["Myolor, I was once a weaponsmith and wish to retake the hammer once more! Teach me the way of the weaponsmith!"]="Myolor, há tempo fui ferreiro de armas, e gostaria voltar a pegar o martelo. Ensénhame a forjar armas."
G["Myolor, I was once an armorsmith and wish to instead learn the way of the weaponsmith. Will you teach me?"]="Myolor, no seu dia fui ferreiro de armaduras e no seu lugar desejo aprender o oficio de ferreiro de armas. Me ensenfará?"
G["Myolor, I was once an armorsmith and wish to retake the hammer once more! Teach me the way of the armorsmith."]="Myolor, há tempo fui ferreiro de armaduras, e gostaria voltar a pegar o martelo. Ensénhame a forjar armaduras."
G["Myranda, do you have enough eyeballs to make another amulet? I have lost the old one."]="Myranda, tem suficientes globos oculares para fazer outro amuleto? E perdido o que tinha."
G["Mysteries and wonders surround us every day, not just at the faire.  We've compiled a list of some of the wonders you may encounter in your every day business.  The Darkmoon Adventurer's Guide will help you navigate the wonders of the world.\n\nWith the guide in your possession, you may come across items you never knew existed.  Items you may have taken for granted in the past are now treasures that others long for.\n\nKeep the guide with you, and keep your eyes open for mystery.\n\nIf you happen to lose your guide, seek us out and we will replace it for free."]="Mysteries and wonders surround us every day, not just at the faire.  We've compiled a list of some of the wonders you may encounter in your every day business.  The Darkmoon Adventurer's Guide will help you navigate the wonders of the world.\n\nWith the guide in your possession, you may come across items you never knew existed.  Items you may have taken for granted in the past are now treasures that others long for.\n\nKeep the guide with you, and keep your eyes open for mystery.\n\nIf you happen to lose your guide, seek us out and we will replace it for free."
G["Mysterious hoofprints, scorched shields, stray badges... how do we make sense of all this?"]="Mysterious hoofprints, scorched shields, stray badges... how do we make sense of all this?"
G["Mysterious prizes await the adventurous.  Step right up, step right up!"]="Mysterious prizes await the adventurous.  Step right up, step right up!"
G["Mysterious runes adorn this artifact, though they appear to be unpowered at this time."]="Runas misteriosas adornam esse artefato, embora pareçam estar sem energia neste momentos."
G["Mysterious..."]="Misterioso..."
G["N-n-nice doggies..."]="P-perritos bons..."
G["N-no!"]="N-não!"
G["NAP'S OVER!! WE ARE HEADING OUT!"]="NAP'S OVER!! WE ARE HEADING OUT!"
G["NEFARIAN IS SLAIN! People of Orgrimmar, bow down before the might of $n and $g his:her; allies for they have laid a blow against the Black Dragonflight that is sure to stir the Aspects from their malaise! This defeat shall surely be felt by the father of the Black Flight: Deathwing reels in pain and anguish this day!"]="NEFARIAN IS SLAIN! People of Orgrimmar, bow down before the might of $n and $g his:her; allies for they have laid a blow against the Black Dragonflight that is sure to stir the Aspects from their malaise! This defeat shall surely be felt by the father of the Black Flight: Deathwing reels in pain and anguish this day!"
