G["Naga attacking from the port and starboard! Faceless ones attacking head on...! We're heavily  outnumbered, but the ship is holding, sir!"]="Naga attacking from the port and starboard! Faceless ones attacking head on...! We're heavily  outnumbered, but the ship is holding, sir!"
