G["Nah, not really. I just wanted to see the look on your face."]="Nah, not really. I just wanted to see the look on your face."
G["Nah. I said \"Hallo.\" But that's close enough.\n\nBye now."]="Não, e dito \"Às muito boas\", mas se lhe parece muito.\n\nAté depois."
G["Naive as always, I see. Your pet orc cannot save you now, Malfurion."]="Naive as always, I see. Your pet orc cannot save you now, Malfurion."
G["Naive fool. The Burning Blade IS the Shadow Council! There are many cults and organizations under the Council's rule, but all of them are just extensions of their will. I may lead the Burning Blade, but I am still just as much a pawn to the Council as you are to me!\n\nLook at the Searing Blade--most of them think they are becoming the next rising group of powerful warlocks that they will replace the Shadow Council."]="Naive fool. The Burning Blade IS the Shadow Council! There are many cults and organizations under the Council's rule, but all of them are just extensions of their will. I may lead the Burning Blade, but I am still just as much a pawn to the Council as you are to me!\n\nLook at the Searing Blade--most of them think they are becoming the next rising group of powerful warlocks that they will replace the Shadow Council."
