G["Narain Soothfancy, at your service! Retired engineer and master soothsayer! I can tell your future before it even happens!\n\nIf you're here to try and relearn a tradeskill, use the book over there...\n\n<Narain points to \"Soothsaying for Dummies.\">"]="Narain Soothfancy, at your service! Retired engineer and master soothsayer! I can tell your future before it even happens!\n\nIf you're here to try and relearn a tradeskill, use the book over there...\n\n<Narain points to \"Soothsaying for Dummies.\">"
