G["Narain, if you have enough materials, I could use another arcanite buoy."]="Narain, if you have enough materials, I could use another arcanite buoy."
G["Naralex sleeps again!\n\nLong ago, Naralex journeyed to this cavern with the honorable goal of entering the Emerald Dream and regrowing the Barrens into a lush forest. His focus waned and his thoughts became tainted by serpentine visions.\n\nNow, reptilian beasts seep from his dreams to the land. He must be awoken from the nightmare or he will be forever lost, and a great evil unleashed.\n\nOnly after his corrupted servants, the Fanglords, have been slain can I perform the awakening ritual."]="Naralex sleeps again!\n\nLong ago, Naralex journeyed to this cavern with the honorable goal of entering the Emerald Dream and regrowing the Barrens into a lush forest. His focus waned and his thoughts became tainted by serpentine visions.\n\nNow, reptilian beasts seep from his dreams to the land. He must be awoken from the nightmare or he will be forever lost, and a great evil unleashed.\n\nOnly after his corrupted servants, the Fanglords, have been slain can I perform the awakening ritual."
G["Narali deserved worse!"]="Narali deserved worse!"
G["Narkrall! If you want to challenge me, you do so here. Do NOT squander our forces on a fool crusade."]="Narkrall! If you want to challenge me, you do so here. Do NOT squander our forces on a fool crusade."
