G["Need to do some shopping?"]="Precisa fazer compras?"
G["Need to relax?  Visit T'chali's Voodoo Brewery at Brewfest for drinks that go down smooth!"]="Need to relax?  Visit T'chali's Voodoo Brewery at Brewfest for drinks that go down smooth!"
G["Need to requisition some supplies?"]="Precisa requisitar algum suprimentos?"
G["Need water... not much time..."]="Preciso água... pouco tempo..."
G["Need your blade sharpened, or perhaps a new weapon? Better safe than sorry..."]="Precisa da sua lâmina afiada, ou talvez de uma nova arma? Melhor prevenir do que remediar..."
G["Need... better... healer...."]="Preciso... melhor... curandeiro..."
G["Needleback gonna beatcha!"]="Costagulha vai te pancar!"
G["Needless to say, a lot of us won't be going home. But if you remember your training and keep your wits about you, you'll greatly increase your chances."]="Needless to say, a lot of us won't be going home. But if you remember your training and keep your wits about you, you'll greatly increase your chances."
G["Needless to say, it is an honor to work on behalf of such an upstanding servant of the Light and the Alliance."]="Needless to say, it is an honor to work on behalf of such an upstanding servant of the Light and the Alliance."
G["Needless to say, when I walked into the pavilion there was something of an altercation."]="Needless to say, when I walked into the pavilion there was something of an altercation."
G["Needlework requires a steady hand. And patience... above all, patience."]="O bordado exige uma mão firme. E paciência... acima de tudo, paciência."
G["Needs more glitter..."]="Há falta mais brilho..."
G["Nefarian had ordered that unsuitable subjects be destroyed immediately, but these retched beasts would not do so without first inflicting an 'ample' amount of torture.\n\nWhen we were thoroughly 'broken,' they would round up what remained and throw us to these thugs. Our bodies used as instruments in their sick game: thrown into the lava or worse; to the open and waiting arms of the bloodthirsty legion below."]="Nefarian had ordered that unsuitable subjects be destroyed immediately, but these retched beasts would not do so without first inflicting an 'ample' amount of torture.\n\nWhen we were thoroughly 'broken,' they would round up what remained and throw us to these thugs. Our bodies used as instruments in their sick game: thrown into the lava or worse; to the open and waiting arms of the bloodthirsty legion below."
G["Nefarian, Onyxia, Sinestra... they were nothing. Now you face my ultimate creation."]="Nefarian, Onyxia, Sinestra... they were nothing. Now you face my ultimate creation."
G["Nefarius' hate has made me stronger than ever before! You should have fled while you could, mortals! The fury of Blackrock courses through my veins!"]="Nefarius' hate has made me stronger than ever before! You should have fled while you could, mortals! The fury of Blackrock courses through my veins!"
G["Neferset City will fall!"]="Neferset City vai cair!"
G["Neferset City will fall!  ATTACK!!!"]="A Cidade dos Neferset sucumbirá! ATACAR!!!"
G["Negative emotions, like anger or doubt, they take on a strange power here on Pandaria. But this you will discover in time."]="Negative emotions, like anger or doubt, they take on a strange power here on Pandaria. But this you will discover in time."
G["Negative, Admiral. No sign of Captain Taylor OR his flagship."]="Negativo, Almirante. Não há sinal do Capitão Taylor OU da nau-capitânia."
G["Negotiations aren't going well, $n. The Dragonmaw are not yet free orcs.\n\nSomehow, we MUST get them to join the Horde!\n\nLet me know if you need transport back to the fleet."]="Negotiations aren't going well, $n. The Dragonmaw are not yet free orcs.\n\nSomehow, we MUST get them to join the Horde!\n\nLet me know if you need transport back to the fleet."
G["Negotiations?  NEGOTIATIONS!\n\nAllow me to make our stance perfectly clear.  We are a free people, able to do whatever we want and come and go as we please.  The Cenarion Expedition does not own this mountain range.\n\nThere will be no negotiations!  Now, go back to the druids and tell them that we will continue to do as we please."]="Negotiations?  NEGOTIATIONS!\n\nAllow me to make our stance perfectly clear.  We are a free people, able to do whatever we want and come and go as we please.  The Cenarion Expedition does not own this mountain range.\n\nThere will be no negotiations!  Now, go back to the druids and tell them that we will continue to do as we please."
G["Neighbor, I would gladly fight alongside you any day."]="Neighbor, I would gladly fight alongside you any day."
G["Neighbor, because of you, my problems is less somewhat."]="Neighbor, because of you, my problems is less somewhat."
G["Neighbor, you move quietly today."]="Neighbor, you move quietly today."
G["Neither Ealdir nor of the kingdom. Free!"]="Nem sequer Ealdir nem do reino. Livre!"
G["Neither generals is spawned."]="Nenhum dos gerais voltou a aparecem."
G["Neither you nor I could possibly imagine the pain an individual suffers when their soul is ripped from their body. They are not dead and by no means are they alive. Instead, they walk the land, servants of those that bind them to this world.\n\nLord Razelikh, demonic overlord of these lands, enslaved them all. Nine he took for his own, placing stones of binding near the Dark Portal. The remaining nine were divided up between his subordinates."]="Neither you nor I could possibly imagine the pain an individual suffers when their soul is ripped from their body. They are not dead and by no means are they alive. Instead, they walk the land, servants of those that bind them to this world.\n\nLord Razelikh, demonic overlord of these lands, enslaved them all. Nine he took for his own, placing stones of binding near the Dark Portal. The remaining nine were divided up between his subordinates."
G["Neltharion is  my answer."]="Neltharion é a minha resposta."
G["Neltharion! Look at yourself. Misshapen. Twisted. You're coming apart."]="Neltharion! Look at yourself. Misshapen. Twisted. You're coming apart."
G["Neltharion! What have you done? You have doomed us all to the madness of the Old Gods!"]="Neltharion! Que fez? Nos tem condenado a todos à loucura dos deuses antigos!"
G["Neltharion, hmm? As good an answer as any, yes?"]="Neltharion, eh? Uma resposta tão boa como outra qualquer, não?"
G["Neptulon will rise and wash your kind from Azeroth."]="Neptulon will rise and wash your kind from Azeroth."
G["Neptulon's minions are growing desperate! We must hurry!"]="Neptulon's minions are growing desperate! We must hurry!"
G["Neptulon's revenants must not consider us enemies!"]="Neptulon's revenants must not consider us enemies!"
G["Ner'zhul is my answer."]="Ner'zhul é a minha resposta."
G["Nergeld is only the first of a new army of vargul-powered flesh giants. You've not known fear until now!"]="Nergeld somente é o primeiro membro de um novo exército de gigantes de carne vargul. Até agora não tem sabido o que é o medo!"
G["Nerzhul will never give up. Where are our heroes?"]="Nerzhul will never give up. Where are our heroes?"
G["Nesingwary is a brilliant hunter, but I wish there was a druid here to teach us some proper animal hunting tactics."]="Nesingwary é um caçador impressionante, mas gostaria que tivesse um druida aqui para nos ensinar algumas estratégias de caça de animais."
G["Nesingwary is going to go broke if he keeps this up! Lane probably has no idea what he's doing!"]="Nesingwary is going to go broke if he keeps this up! Lane probably has no idea what he's doing!"
G["Nespirah is waking up! Use the Nespirah Fluid to kill Idra'kess."]="Nespirah se acorde! Usao fluido de Nespirah para matar Idra'kess."
G["Nessspirah!  Why do you turn againssst me?"]="Nessspirah! Por que te vuelvesss contra mim?"
G["Net not stop me! No... net stop me."]="A rede não me parará! Nenhuma... rede me parará!"
G["Nether Ray"]="Nether Ray"
G["Nethergarde, for years, has stood watch over the Dark Portal.  Ever vigilant, it was we who first sensed fel energies leaking through the long closed gateway.\n\nWe raised a global alarm, and the world answered...\n\nNow, the Argent Dawn holds this line as the kingdoms and clans of the Horde and Alliance marshal their forces and rush to aid us!"]="Nethergarde, for years, has stood watch over the Dark Portal.  Ever vigilant, it was we who first sensed fel energies leaking through the long closed gateway.\n\nWe raised a global alarm, and the world answered...\n\nNow, the Argent Dawn holds this line as the kingdoms and clans of the Horde and Alliance marshal their forces and rush to aid us!"
G["Netherock?!  That thing'll squish you flat with one step of its massive foot!  No thanks!"]="Rocha asa?! Essa coisa te aplastará com uma sozinha pisada do seu enorme pé! Não, Obrigado!"
G["Neutralizing agent FAILED!"]="O agente neutralizador tem FALHADO!"
G["Neutralizing agent failing!\nAdd fluid NOW!!"]="Neutralizing agent failing!\nAdd fluid NOW!!"
G["Neutralizing agent failing!\nAdd fluid soon!"]="Neutralizing agent failing!\nAdd fluid soon!"
G["Never a glancing blow laid upon you, but countless foes cut down by your halberd."]="Never a glancing blow laid upon you, but countless foes cut down by your halberd."
G["Never again shall we allow our differences to divide us.\n\nLong live the children of Cenarion!"]="Never again shall we allow our differences to divide us.\n\nLong live the children of Cenarion!"
G["Never again will you fly alone."]="Never again will you fly alone."
G["Never again."]="Never Again!"
G["Never again..."]="Never Again!"
G["Never ask Hawkmaster Norung about his eye patch. You will never hear the end of it."]="Não lhe pergunte nunca a Mestre de halcones Norung sobre seu parche do olho. Te contará uma história interminável."
G["Never before has a father felt such pride for their child, Shomi."]="Não existe pai que se sienta mais orgulhoso do seu filha, Shomi."
G["Never cross a Dark Iron, $C."]="Não contraríes nunca a um Ferro Negro, $c."
G["Never cross a Dwarf!"]="Nunca contraríes a um anão!"
G["Never did I dream that our \"king\" would betray us as he did. To think that he had been a worgen in secret while he ruled over us. Sickening..."]="Never did I dream that our \"king\" would betray us as he did. To think that he had been a worgen in secret while he ruled over us. Sickening..."
G["Never doubt it. Here, allow me to give you my wedding gift."]="Never doubt it. Here, allow me to give you my wedding gift."
G["Never drink before 5 o'clock, momma used to say. Well, momma, it's bound to be 5 o'clock somewhere!"]="Never drink before 5 o'clock, momma used to say. Well, momma, it's bound to be 5 o'clock somewhere!"
G["Never fear, Bodley is on the job! Let's see here, ah yes... there it is. Let me just summon it... and, presto!\n\nTry not to lose it again, $n."]="Never fear, Bodley is on the job! Let's see here, ah yes... there it is. Let me just summon it... and, presto!\n\nTry not to lose it again, $n."
G["Never fear, Trade Prince Gallywix is here. We'll be on our way to our new home in Azshara before you know it! Despite the bumbling interference of $n."]="Never fear, Trade Prince Gallywix is here. We'll be on our way to our new home in Azshara before you know it! Despite the bumbling interference of $n."
G["Never felt hurt like this!"]="Nunca havia sentido um dor assim!"
G["Never forget those that came before you. Never forget where you came from."]="Never forget those that came before you. Never forget where you came from."
G["Never forget those that you love. Never forget what you're fighting for."]="Nunca esqueça aos seus seres queridos. Nunca esqueça por que luchas."
G["Never forget whom you serve.  Illidan will rule this land and beyond."]="Never forget whom you serve.  Illidan will rule this land and beyond."
G["Never forget your greatest friend, they stick with you until the end."]="Nunca te esqueça do seu melhor amigo, permanecerá ao seu lado até o fim."
G["Never give up, friends!"]="Never give up, friends!"
G["Never had an unsatisfied customer! Try Chatterswitch Travels today!"]="Mais e tido um cliente insatisfecho! Prova Viagens Cotórrez hoje mesmo!"
G["Never had much use for a bow, but these rifles the goblins make are very handy when hunting. Still can't get used to the smell though."]="Never had much use for a bow, but these rifles the goblins make are very handy when hunting. Still can't get used to the smell though."
G["Never have I had cause to regret sparing your life, mortal. Always, you find ways to amuse me."]="Never have I had cause to regret sparing your life, mortal. Always, you find ways to amuse me."
G["Never have I seen an enemy such as this."]="Nunca havia visto um inimigo assim."
G["Never have I seen such a barren wasteland."]="Nunca vi um deserto tão árido."
G["Never have such humble words come from mighty Thorim. I shall deliver your words to Dun Niffelem."]="Thorim mais havia pronunciado umas palavras tão humildes. Levarei seu mensagna Dun Niffelem."
G["Never heard of it. Looks like pure evil."]="Mais ouvi falar de ela. Parece maldade em estado puro."
G["Never in my ranging have I seen a place like this."]="Nunca na minha vida havia visto um lugar como este."
G["Never interrupt an artist!"]="Nunca interrumpas a um artista."
G["Never leave home without ample supplies of flash powder, especially when working with others. I guarantee someone will run out every time.\n\nWhen the choice comes down to handing out materials or letting the poor sap die, I help... most of the time."]="Never leave home without ample supplies of flash powder, especially when working with others. I guarantee someone will run out every time.\n\nWhen the choice comes down to handing out materials or letting the poor sap die, I help... most of the time."
G["Never look the Commander directly in the eyes."]="Nunca olhe o comandante diretamente nos olhos."
G["Never look these Broken directly in the eyes. I think they can suck the soul right out of you if they're so inclined!"]="Nunca olhe estes quebrados diretamente nos olhos. Eu acho que eles podem sugar a alma de você, se estiverem tão inclinados!"
G["Never met Great Ones. Nope, just met their shrines."]="Never met Great Ones. Nope, just met their shrines."
G["Never met them before in my life. Pandaren don't really come in any bad flavors though."]="Não os havia visto na minha vida. Mas se são pandaren, não serão mal gente."
G["Never powerless Garrosh. And never alone."]="Nem estou indefeso, Garrosh, nem estou somente."
G["Never put yourself ahead of others. Never forget that this land is shared by many."]="Nunca te comece por acima de outras pessoas. Nunca esqueça que esta terra nos pertence a todos."
G["Never return to this place, elemental. This is a place of nature!"]="Nunca regreses a este lugar, elemental. Este é um lugar de natureza!"
G["Never say never, my grandpa always said. I'm going to give it my best shot."]="Never say never, my grandpa always said. I'm going to give it my best shot."
G["Never seen a dooker like you before!"]="Never seen a dooker like you before!"
G["Never seen anyone move so fast in my whole life."]="Never seen anyone move so fast in my whole life."
G["Never set a yeti on fire. They just get mad."]="Nunca lhe prendas fogo a um yeti. Se voltam loucos."
G["Never shall you find the twin blades of Sul."]="Never shall you find the twin blades of Sul."
G["Never stop fighting."]="Nunca deixe de lutar."
G["Never stop fighting. Never stop practicing. You are never perfect."]="Never stop fighting. Never stop practicing. You are never perfect."
G["Never stop training, $n. I want every gnome ready for the day when we take down the traitor Thermaplugg for good."]="Never stop training, $n. I want every gnome ready for the day when we take down the traitor Thermaplugg for good."
G["Never thought I was any good with animals 'til these little fellas started showin' up.  So what do ye say, wanna fight?"]="Never thought I was any good with animals 'til these little fellas started showin' up.  So what do ye say, wanna fight?"
G["Never thought I'd need a $c to save me from nibblers. Thank you!"]="Never thought I'd need a $c to save me from nibblers. Thank you!"
G["Never thought I'd see one of your kind walk through here."]="Mais pensei que vería a alguém do seu espécie por aqui."
G["Never to question, nor to contemplate; we simply act."]="Never to question, nor to contemplate; we simply act."
G["Never trust the Sunreavers. They are hard at work undermining us in the eyes of our Argent Crusade allies."]="Nunca confie nos Sunreavers. Eles trabalham duro nos minando aos olhos de nossos aliados da Cruzada Argentina."
G["Never underestimate the importance of healing."]="Nunca subestimes a importância da cura."
G["Never underestimate the other ethereal's greed!"]="Never underestimate the other ethereal's greed!"
G["Never underestimate the power of proper supply management. The warriors may win the battles, but it's the supplies that win the war."]="Never underestimate the power of proper supply management. The warriors may win the battles, but it's the supplies that win the war."
G["Never underestimate the worth of a good mushan beast."]="Never underestimate the worth of a good mushan beast."
G["Never weak. Always strong."]="Nunca fraco. Sempre forte."
G["Never you mind, $r. The details of my past were burned away when I joined the Druids of the Flame. They are of no concern to you.\n\nBesides, I am here to discuss the future of this realm. And I do not plan to discuss it with you.\n\nNow answer me... where is Malfurion!?"]="Never you mind, $r. The details of my past were burned away when I joined the Druids of the Flame. They are of no concern to you.\n\nBesides, I am here to discuss the future of this realm. And I do not plan to discuss it with you.\n\nNow answer me... where is Malfurion!?"
G["Never!"]="Nunca"
G["Never!  I love working for the Dark Iron!"]="Mais! Me encantar trabalhar para os Ferro Negro!"
G["Never! I'll never abide by their will! I'd sooner be dead."]="Never! I'll never abide by their will! I'd sooner be dead."
G["Never! Riko protect you to death!"]="Mais! Riko te proteger até a morte!"
G["Never, you two-timing dog!"]="Nunca, cão taimado!"
G["Never... could reach... the top shelf..."]="Nunca... cheguei... ao estante de cima..."
G["Never... submit!"]="Never... submit!"
G["Nevermind me, $r. \n\nKraz as good as dead. Leave now, $r, before bad trolls get you too."]="Não te preocupe por mim, $r.\n\nKraz está quase morto. Vá embora agora $r, antes de que os trolls maus te atrapen."
G["Nevermind me, $r. \n\nNorkani as good as dead. Leave now, $r, before da Amani get you too."]="Nevermind me, $r. \n\nNorkani as good as dead. Leave now, $r, before da Amani get you too."
G["Nevermind my injuries, $g brother : sister;. It's a miracle that any of us are alive!"]="Nevermind my injuries, $g brother : sister;. It's a miracle that any of us are alive!"
G["Nevermind."]="Déjalo."
G["Nevermore!"]="Nunca mais!"
G["Nevertheless, you are now freed from the mountains' grip and safe from harm.  Marshal's Stand lies to the east, I believe."]="Seja como seja, agora estão livre da prisão da montanha e a salvou de tudo dano. Alto de Marshal ocorrida ao este, acho."
G["New Avalon shall be purged! All Scourge will be eradicated!"]="Purgaremos Novo Avalon! Erradicaremos a toda o Flagelo!"
G["New Pet"]="Nova ajudante"
G["New directive: assist in the defeat of the iron dwarves."]="Nova directiva: ajudar a derrotar aos anões férreos."
G["New directive: leave mine and return to Inventor's Library."]="Nova directiva: abandonar a mina e voltar à Biblioteca do Inventor."
G["New directives acquired.  Obey $g magister:magistrix; $n."]="New directives acquired.  Obey $g magister:magistrix; $n."
G["New here? It is like we tell the children, do not go into the water without a handful of distracting bait and an exit strategy."]="New here? It is like we tell the children, do not go into the water without a handful of distracting bait and an exit strategy."
G["New king, new rules. Sorry, but wikkets gonna get ravaged!"]="New king, new rules. Sorry, but wikkets gonna get ravaged!"
G["New life from clay. Dead earth... reborn."]="New life from clay. Dead earth... reborn."
G["New life from the ashes of old... this is Aessina's gift.\n\nWithout you, this miracle never would've happened."]="New life from the ashes of old... this is Aessina's gift.\n\nWithout you, this miracle never would've happened."
G["New orders! Unlock the entry to the Celestial Planetarium."]="Novas ordens! Desbloquear a entrada do Planetário Celestial."
G["New posting going up! Adventurers and heroes, gather round the bulletin board!"]="Há novos anúncios! Aventureiros e heróis, reuníos ao redor da tábua de anúncios!"
G["New recruit? Have you reported to the commander yet?"]="Novo recruta? Você já se reportou ao comandante?"
G["New struggles await us with each dawn, and uncertainty weighs upon us all."]="New struggles await us with each dawn, and uncertainty weighs upon us all."
G["New tasty creature!"]="Uma nova e sabrosa criatura!"
G["New this year: the PX-238 Winter Wondervolt.  Step on up and don't be shy!\n\nAnd sign these forms before you try it, we're still working a few bugs out of this thing..."]="New this year: the PX-238 Winter Wondervolt.  Step on up and don't be shy!\n\nAnd sign these forms before you try it, we're still working a few bugs out of this thing..."
G["New to town? You should try Chin's noodles. They are the stuff of local legend."]="Acabas de chegar? Deveria testar os macarrão de Grelha Rugiente. São uma lendas local."
G["New toys!"]="Brinquedos novos!"
G["New toys? For me? I promise I won't break them this time!"]="New toys? For me? I promise I won't break them this time!"
G["New troll here!"]="Aqui tem outro troll!"
G["News of your success has preceeded you.  Our ranks have swelled!  We're in better shape now than I'd dared to hope for thanks to you, $n."]="News of your success has preceeded you.  Our ranks have swelled!  We're in better shape now than I'd dared to hope for thanks to you, $n."
G["News spread quickly of Shattrath City's victories.  Refugees from all previous wars and from the one that had begun anew begun to pour into the city.\n\nThe entire lower third of the city is inhabited by them now.  No one who seeks respite from Illidan is turned away, so you might run into an unsavory character or two there.  But for the most part, they're just ordinary people who had lost all hope and have now been given a new lease on life."]="News spread quickly of Shattrath City's victories.  Refugees from all previous wars and from the one that had begun anew begun to pour into the city.\n\nThe entire lower third of the city is inhabited by them now.  No one who seeks respite from Illidan is turned away, so you might run into an unsavory character or two there.  But for the most part, they're just ordinary people who had lost all hope and have now been given a new lease on life."
G["News to no one, Regent Lord. King Wrynn's fleet is converging on Orgrimmar as we speak."]="Isso não é novo, Senhor regente. A frota do rei Wrynn se reúne em Orgrimmar em estes momentos."
G["Newt, get that door open."]="Salamandra, abra essa porta."
G["Newt, we need this door open now."]="Salamandra, precisamos de essa porta aberta já."
G["Newt, you're up! Break out the gatestone!"]="Salamandra, te toca! Tira a pedras de porta!"
G["Next please!"]="Seguinte!"
G["Next round's on me!"]="Invito à seguinte rodada!"
G["Next squad, push forward!"]="Seguinte esquadrão, adiante!"
G["Next squad, to the front!"]="Seguinte esquadrão, ao linha de frente!"
G["Next stop, Thunder Bluff!"]="Seguinte aparo: Penhasco do Trovão!"
G["Next time I face the sha, I will be prepared."]="A próxima vez que me enfrente ao sha não me faltará preparação."
G["Next time I hit harder!"]="Next time I hit harder!"
G["Next time I see a jade monster I'm gonna punch it in the naughty bits."]="A próxima vez que veja um monstro de jade lhe vou dar um soco já sabe onde."
G["Next time I see one of you not working, I'll have Buzzer cut your head off!"]="Next time I see one of you not working, I'll have Buzzer cut your head off!"
G["Next time Ken-Ken gonna win! With or without Ashyo."]="A próxima vez ganha Ken-Ken! Kon ou sem Ashyo."
G["Next time ya go hunting, cover that glowing eye of yours. It gives ya away."]="A próxima vez que vá a caçar, cúbrete esse olho brilhante seu. Te descubra."
G["Next time you may find I'm harder to defeat! I've made sure my healer remembers his place."]="Next time you may find I'm harder to defeat! I've made sure my healer remembers his place."
G["Next time, I will leave nothing to chance."]="A próxima vez não deixarei nada ao azar."
G["Next time, I won't miss!"]="Next time, I won't miss!"
G["Next time, Poppy... Next time..."]="A próxima vez, Poppi... A próxima vez..."
G["Next time, bring friends."]="A próxima vez, traz amigos."
G["Next time, bring more friends!"]="A próxima vez traz a mais amigos!"
G["Next time, maybe Goregek let you try."]="Igual próxima vez, Goregek parar que pruebes."
G["Next time, show me the respect of at least being prepared!"]="A próxima vez, ao menos, tenha o decoro de estar pronto!"
G["Next to signs of a scuffle is a sharp, pointy spearhead and some colorful feathers."]="Next to signs of a scuffle is a sharp, pointy spearhead and some colorful feathers."
G["Next to the beer and sausage, the most popular part of Brewfest is the souvenirs! From traditional holiday garb to mini-kegs of tasty brew, all sorts of Brewfest-themed items are available from Belbi Quikswitch. Just be sure to have plenty of Brewfest Prize Tokens on hand, as it's the only way to buy them! You can earn prize tokens by helping out around the Brewfest Grounds."]="Next to the beer and sausage, the most popular part of Brewfest is the souvenirs! From traditional holiday garb to mini-kegs of tasty brew, all sorts of Brewfest-themed items are available from Belbi Quikswitch. Just be sure to have plenty of Brewfest Prize Tokens on hand, as it's the only way to buy them! You can earn prize tokens by helping out around the Brewfest Grounds."
G["Next to this track, you see some bits of chewed up carrot."]="Next to this track, you see some bits of chewed up carrot."
G["Next warrior, now!"]="Seguinte guerreiro! JÁ!"
G["Next warrior, step up!"]="Seguinte guerreiro! Adiante!"
G["Next year, I'm dressing up as either a corsair or an assassin."]="Next year, I'm dressing up as either a corsair or an assassin."
G["Next!"]="Seguinte!"
G["Next, I shall speak of the accursed spider wing of Naxxramas. It is there the Scourge breed even more poisonous and dangerous versions of their kin."]="Next, I shall speak of the accursed spider wing of Naxxramas. It is there the Scourge breed even more poisonous and dangerous versions of their kin."
G["Next, I shall speak of the blighted abomination wing of Naxxramas. There, the Scourge develop the strongest and most hideous aberrations of their armies."]="Next, I shall speak of the blighted abomination wing of Naxxramas. There, the Scourge develop the strongest and most hideous aberrations of their armies."
