G["No matter what, you can't die, because that would mean that I would cease to exist, right? But, I was here before when I was you. I'm so confused!"]="No matter what, you can't die, because that would mean that I would cease to exist, right? But, I was here before when I was you. I'm so confused!"
G["No matter what, your efforts will always be exalted here, $n!"]="Passe o que passe seus esforços sempre serão exaltados aqui, $n!"
