G["Normal dogs won't come anywhere near me nowadays.  I was devastated when I found out... I used to love the beasts.\n\nPlaguehounds make for a fine substitute, however.  They're not quite as... easy on the eyes.  But then again, neither am I!"]="Normal dogs won't come anywhere near me nowadays.  I was devastated when I found out... I used to love the beasts.\n\nPlaguehounds make for a fine substitute, however.  They're not quite as... easy on the eyes.  But then again, neither am I!"
