G["Normally it would not be my place to speak with you directly; rather, you would seek an audience with milady. However, I did give you a task directly, so what is it that we need to discuss?"]="Normalmente não seria meu lugar falar diretamente com você; em vez disso, você procuraria uma audiência com milady. No entanto, eu lhe dei uma tarefa diretamente. Então, o que precisamos de discutir?"
G["Normally we'd be more than capable of fulfilling Cho's request. Jade veins run through this land like...\n\n<Mann scratches her head for a moment in thought.>\n\nWell, like something that runs through something else in veins. \n\nLook, I ain't a poet.\n\nPoint is: we got problems."]="Normally we'd be more than capable of fulfilling Cho's request. Jade veins run through this land like...\n\n<Mann scratches her head for a moment in thought.>\n\nWell, like something that runs through something else in veins. \n\nLook, I ain't a poet.\n\nPoint is: we got problems."
G["Normally we'd have plenty on hand, but most of our supplies have been left out to ruin in the rain.\n\nHowever, I'm certain the creatures in the dried up ponds are a mixture of rainwater and salt from the earth. You may be able to get what you need from them."]="Normalmente temos muita a mão, mas a maioria de nossas provisiones se têm estropeado com a chuva.\n\nNo entanto, uma coisa é certa: as criaturas dos estanques secos são uma mistura de água de chuva e sal da terra. É possível que consigas o que precisa dessas criaturas."
G["Normally, I'd just shrug off an explosion like that, but I think someone got the nitro and kaja'mite mixture wrong."]="Normally, I'd just shrug off an explosion like that, but I think someone got the nitro and kaja'mite mixture wrong."
G["Normally, new trainees have a little more time to prepare."]="Normally, new trainees have a little more time to prepare."
G["North through Alther's Mill, but we'd have to cut through an army of bloodthirsty worgs or south through Render's Valley."]="North through Alther's Mill, but we'd have to cut through an army of bloodthirsty worgs or south through Render's Valley."
G["North wind! You will do as I command!"]="Vento do norte! Fará o que eu ordene!"
G["Northern Bank"]="Northern Bank"
G["Northern Rocketway Exchange, please."]="Ao Intercambiador da Cohetepista do Norte, por favor."
G["Northern Rocketway Terminus, please."]="À Terminal da Cohetepista do Norte, por favor."
G["Northrend awaits, $r. The majestic Cloudkisser will take you straight across the sea to Vengeance Landing in Howling Fjord."]="Nortúndria espera, $r. O magenstuoso Besanubes te levará a através do mar até Campo Vingança no Fiorde Uivante."
G["Northrend requires your attention Overlord Hellscream. We will deal with the Lich King and his minions without your aid."]="Northrend requer sua atenção Overlord Hellscream. Lidaremos com o Rei Lich e seus subordinados sem à sua ajuda."
G["Northrend's depths belong to the nerubians, $r.\n\nI have devoted myself to restoring that great truth."]="Northrend's depths belong to the nerubians, $r.\n\nI have devoted myself to restoring that great truth."
G["Nose-stenders. For smelling things in different rooms."]="Nose-stenders. For smelling things in different rooms."
G["Not Haloke!"]="Haloke não!"
G["Not a bad place here, if you aren't into the whole \"sunshine\" thing."]="Não é um lugar ruim aqui, se você não gosta de toda essa coisa de \"sol\"."
G["Not a bad shot. For a fleshling..."]="Não foi um mal disparo. Para um ser de carne..."
G["Not a bit. For the life of me, I can't figure out how this thing works."]="Not a bit. For the life of me, I can't figure out how this thing works."
G["Not a challenge at all it seems. Let us see how you handle your second test. Lysta, bring forth the minions of the Lich King."]="Não parece ser um desafio. Vamos ver como o faz na segunda prova. Lysta, traz aos lacaios do Rei Lich."
G["Not a chance, boy.  Gilneas is going to need its king's undivided attention.  Can't have your father wondering whether his child is alive or not."]="Not a chance, boy.  Gilneas is going to need its king's undivided attention.  Can't have your father wondering whether his child is alive or not."
G["Not a chance, you can keep that Mr. Derpa."]="Not a chance, you can keep that Mr. Derpa."
G["Not a chance."]="Sem chance."
G["Not a creature in the forest can elude Corand, such is his skill at tracking.  You would do well to listen to his teachings if you wish to be even half as successful.  \nI will relieve you of the burden of tracking him and mark his location on your map, there in the Cenarion Enclave."]="Not a creature in the forest can elude Corand, such is his skill at tracking.  You would do well to listen to his teachings if you wish to be even half as successful.  \nI will relieve you of the burden of tracking him and mark his location on your map, there in the Cenarion Enclave."
G["Not a penny was wasted on comfort or personal safety!"]="Not a penny was wasted on comfort or personal safety!"
G["Not a sentry!"]="Um sentinela não!"
G["Not a year ago, poor old Fitzsimmons passed on, his body ruined by drink."]="Not a year ago, poor old Fitzsimmons passed on, his body ruined by drink."
G["Not again!"]="Outra vez não!"
G["Not again! Not again..."]="Não... outra vez, não!"
G["Not again, Grok.  You've been told before to stay away!"]="Not again, Grok.  You've been told before to stay away!"
G["Not again..."]="Outra vez não..."
G["Not all Forsaken are driven by Sylvanas' will, $n. Some of us are driven by true power--power we earn for ourselves."]="Não todos os Renegados seguem a vontade de Sylvanas, $n. Alguns de nós seguimos o verdadeiro poder... o poder que vencermos para nós mesmos."
G["Not all Tauren despise your kind, $r. Alas, I am forbidden to offer you my services."]="Not all Tauren despise your kind, $r. Alas, I am forbidden to offer you my services."
G["Not all da places held together so well.  We try to help as much as we can.  But da source, it be Zul'Gurub."]="Not all da places held together so well.  We try to help as much as we can.  But da source, it be Zul'Gurub."
G["Not all dinner guests are gracious.  Mind your manners!"]="Not all dinner guests are gracious.  Mind your manners!"
G["Not all of the paragons were choosen for the physical skills, Wakener."]="Not all of the paragons were choosen for the physical skills, Wakener."
G["Not all of you will ascend to glory. Look to your left. Look to your right. THEY will perish in the end times. But YOU will become immortal."]="Not all of you will ascend to glory. Look to your left. Look to your right. THEY will perish in the end times. But YOU will become immortal."
G["Not all pandaren have chosen the same path as you three."]="Não todos os pandaren têm escolhido o mesmo caminho que vocês."
G["Not all problems can be solved with your fists.  Sometimes you must center yourself and channel your energy towards a distant target."]="Not all problems can be solved with your fists.  Sometimes you must center yourself and channel your energy towards a distant target."
G["Not an apple cart to be seen..."]="Nem um somente carrinho de manzanas à visão..."
G["Not anotha!"]="Outro não!"
G["Not another one..."]="Outra vez não..."
G["Not anymore!  Here's your sword.  Report to the barracks for duty!"]="Not anymore!  Here's your sword.  Report to the barracks for duty!"
G["Not as quiet as I would prefer, but it works."]="Não foi muito silencioso, mas funciona."
G["Not at all! If my gut could take three years of the Razor Hill barrack's Stinky Cactus Grub Soup, a bowl of roaches isn't going to kill me."]="Not at all! If my gut could take three years of the Razor Hill barrack's Stinky Cactus Grub Soup, a bowl of roaches isn't going to kill me."
G["Not at all, priestess. We are very grateful for all that you've offered us here."]="Not at all, priestess. We are very grateful for all that you've offered us here."
G["Not backing out, are you?"]="Não te irás a dar por trás, não?"
G["Not bad for a dryskin."]="Não estar mal para um pelesseca."
G["Not bad for a goblin."]="Não está mal para um goblin."
G["Not bad for a landlubber."]="Nada mau pra um marujo de terra firme."
G["Not bad for a newbie."]="Não está mal para $gun novato: uma novata;."
G["Not bad, $c. Our work here is finished for today, but stay sharp. I wouldn't be surprised if your next orders came from Lion's Landing in a few days' time."]="Not bad, $c. Our work here is finished for today, but stay sharp. I wouldn't be surprised if your next orders came from Lion's Landing in a few days' time."
G["Not bad, $n. Not bad."]="Não eh'tá mal, $n. Não eh'tá mal."
G["Not bad, I guess."]="Não tem estado mal, suponho."
G["Not bad, champion! What they say about you is true. However, we part ways here. I must go deal with this prisoner...personally."]="Not bad, champion! What they say about you is true. However, we part ways here. I must go deal with this prisoner...personally."
G["Not bad, for a beginner! I guess it couldn't hurt for me to show you a few things..."]="Nada mal para um iniciante! Eu acho que não faria mal para eu mostrar algumas coisas..."
G["Not bad, not bad! If I do say so myself, your farm is running smoothly. Maybe one day you'll be as successful as Haohan Mudclaw!"]="Not bad, not bad! If I do say so myself, your farm is running smoothly. Maybe one day you'll be as successful as Haohan Mudclaw!"
G["Not bad, not bad... But it's missing spice!  How about adding scorpid venom?  Yes!  That'll fix it right up!"]="Nada mal, nada mal... Mas falta tempero! Que tal adicionar veneno de escorpídeo? Sim! Isso vai consertar tudo!"
G["Not bad, not bad... but we are not done yet!"]="Não está mal, não está mal... mas ainda não temos terminou!"
G["Not bad, though some additional schooling wouldn't hurt! Here, watch my hips... like so!"]="Not bad, though some additional schooling wouldn't hurt! Here, watch my hips... like so!"
G["Not bad."]="Não tem estado mal."
G["Not bad.  Try that trick I told you about when you temper the steel."]="Não está mal. Prova esse truco que te ensinei quando resiliências o aço."
G["Not bad. Go talk with Snarl, he just moved to Orgrimmar to study under Saru. Look for him in the Warrior district near Saru's smithy. Oh and he'll test you, so you better be as ready as you think you are."]="Não é ruim. Vá conversar com Snarl, ele acabou de se mudar para Orgrimmar para estudar com Saru. Procure por ele no distrito de Warrior, perto da ferraria de Saru. Ah, e ele vai testá-o, então é melhor você estar tão pronto quanto pensa."
G["Not bad... I suppose training you is not out of the question. Very well! Let's begin..."]="Nada mal... Suponho que você não esteja treinando. Muito bem! Vamos começar..."
G["Not bad... for an amateur! Still, you know about as much as I do. If you wanna' learn more you're gonna' have to talk to Josef Gregorian in Undercity."]="Nada mal... para um amador! Ainda assim, você sabe tanto quanto eu. Se você quer 'aprender mais', terá que conversar com Josef Gregorian na Cidade Baixa."
G["Not bad... not bad."]="Não está mal, não está mal..."
G["Not bad... you might be able to hit the broad side of a sickly kodo."]="Not bad... you might be able to hit the broad side of a sickly kodo."
G["Not doing so good. I come back and find you later."]="Not doing so good. I come back and find you later."
G["Not eating."]="Não kome."
G["Not entirely unexpected."]="Não foi inesperado."
G["Not even a thousand deaths could put my soul to rest..."]="Not even a thousand deaths could put my soul to rest..."
G["Not even close."]="Nem chegou perto."
G["Not even my father could have planned such tragedy... such chaos. You will never make it! Time is running out!"]="Not even my father could have planned such tragedy... such chaos. You will never make it! Time is running out!"
G["Not even the Lich King's most powerful minions can stand against the Alliance. All hail our victors!"]="Not even the Lich King's most powerful minions can stand against the Alliance. All hail our victors!"
G["Not everyone gonna come out of this alive."]="Not everyone gonna come out of this alive."
G["Not everyone is cut out for the work I do.\n\n<Tormentor Sipe sharpens his blade.>\n\nCut out, get it? Oh, I slay me."]="Not everyone is cut out for the work I do.\n\n<Tormentor Sipe sharpens his blade.>\n\nCut out, get it? Oh, I slay me."
G["Not exactly.  In fact, many of the creatures here in the crater existed long before my master arrived... but some did not.\n\nNevertheless, we observe them all, without prejudice."]="Not exactly.  In fact, many of the creatures here in the crater existed long before my master arrived... but some did not.\n\nNevertheless, we observe them all, without prejudice."
G["Not fair! I wanna watch the fights!"]="Não é logo! Quero ver os combate!"
G["Not far now...."]="Não estamos longe..."
G["Not feel so good... maybe come back find us later?"]="Not feel so good... maybe come back find us later?"
G["Not for long. Time ta finish dis ting."]="Não po' muito. Já eh'tá bem."
G["Not getting out of your debts that easy."]="Not getting out of your debts that easy."
G["Not gonna jorb my jangos!"]="Not gonna jorb my jangos!"
G["Not gonna talk."]="Não falar."
G["Not good enough...."]="Não é suficiente..."
G["Not if I have something to say about it, sparky!"]="Not if I have something to say about it, sparky!"
G["Not if they renounced the Horde."]="Não, sempre e quando renuncien à Horda."
G["Not if we're caught up in it! Why weren't you running? What have you been doing with your hand in the Well?"]="Not if we're caught up in it! Why weren't you running? What have you been doing with your hand in the Well?"
G["Not if you were the last troll on Azeroth!"]="Nem embora fosse o último troll de Azeroth!"
G["Not important. I will stop at nothing to win!"]="Não importa. Eu não vou parar até vencer!"
G["Not in here!"]="Aqui não!"
G["Not in the face!"]="na rosto não!"
G["Not it!"]="Isso não!"
G["Not just any fish, mortal. This fish was a minnow. A very special minnow."]="Não é qualquer peixe mortal. Este peixe era um peixinho. Um peixinho muito especial."
G["Not just any scars, either. These were created by pandaren weapons."]="E não são qualquer tipo de cicatrizes. São de armas pandaren."
G["Not just anyone can be the boss ya know! It takes skill, brains, and of course looks!"]="Not just anyone can be the boss ya know! It takes skill, brains, and of course looks!"
G["Not like this..."]="Não desse jeito..."
G["Not long ago, but I've already seen terrible suffering in this place!"]="Not long ago, but I've already seen terrible suffering in this place!"
G["Not long ago, this place was the site of a terrible battle.  We of Nethergarde and the Argent Dawn held at bay a wave of demons, surging relentlessly from the Dark Portal.\n\nThose were dark days, full of bloodshed and despair...\n\nBut the Kingdoms of Azeroth soon joined us and pushed the monsters back!  The fighting continues on the far side of the Portal...\n\nThis camp is now calm, but I fear the quiet here belies the madness found through that hellish gate."]="Not long ago, this place was the site of a terrible battle.  We of Nethergarde and the Argent Dawn held at bay a wave of demons, surging relentlessly from the Dark Portal.\n\nThose were dark days, full of bloodshed and despair...\n\nBut the Kingdoms of Azeroth soon joined us and pushed the monsters back!  The fighting continues on the far side of the Portal...\n\nThis camp is now calm, but I fear the quiet here belies the madness found through that hellish gate."
G["Not long ago, we knew nothing but the simple life of brewing fine cider. So much has changed in so little time."]="Not long ago, we knew nothing but the simple life of brewing fine cider. So much has changed in so little time."
G["Not long later, out of nowhere, the snow burst before them and a jormungar the size of Veranus herself came down upon their party... one of them was swallowed whole before they even had time to react."]="Not long later, out of nowhere, the snow burst before them and a jormungar the size of Veranus herself came down upon their party... one of them was swallowed whole before they even had time to react."
G["Not looking too good today. Sun is high and bright early and no activity on the water."]="A coisa não pinta demais bem hoje. O sol já brilha a estas horas e não há atividade na água."
G["Not me battle? I dunnae who ye think ye are, mister, but I got a score to settle with Arthas and yer not gettin' in me way! FIRE ALL GUNS! FIRE! FIRE!"]="Not me battle? I dunnae who ye think ye are, mister, but I got a score to settle with Arthas and yer not gettin' in me way! FIRE ALL GUNS! FIRE! FIRE!"
G["Not me, Great Spirit. Me TRIBE."]="Não eu, grande eh'píritu. Meu TRIBO."
G["Not mentioned much, but Kartak ate dozen Frenzyheart before became \"friend.\""]="Not mentioned much, but Kartak ate dozen Frenzyheart before became \"friend.\""
G["Not much fishing to be had around here, but what little there is to be had is Paxton's ye can be sure.  Ye can find him fishing out on Iceflow Lake."]="Não há muita pesca por aqui, mas o pouco que resta é o de Paxton, você pode ter certeza. Você pode encontrá-o pescando no lago Iceflow."
G["Not much of a day. Just right for not much of a life."]="Um dia sem pena nem glória. Em sintonia com uma vida sem pena nem glória."
G["Not much so far, but the day is young."]="Não muito, de momentos, mas o dia é jovem."
G["Not much, I'm afraid. I'm no druid, I'm here to lead troops. Seems odd to me that Malfurion tried to plant a tree in the middle of a warzone, but... like I said, I'm no druid.\n\nHowever, I can tell you this. NOTHING makes those fire elementals angrier than the idea of a big, leafy tree growing right in the middle of their homeland. If nothing else, when this tree grows to its full size, it will be a beacon of hope for our forces... and a thorn in the side of our enemy."]="Not much, I'm afraid. I'm no druid, I'm here to lead troops. Seems odd to me that Malfurion tried to plant a tree in the middle of a warzone, but... like I said, I'm no druid.\n\nHowever, I can tell you this. NOTHING makes those fire elementals angrier than the idea of a big, leafy tree growing right in the middle of their homeland. If nothing else, when this tree grows to its full size, it will be a beacon of hope for our forces... and a thorn in the side of our enemy."
G["Not much, Magni. I've had nightmares of a human... tall... light hair... death black armor. His name rests on the tip of me tongue, but..."]="Not much, Magni. I've had nightmares of a human... tall... light hair... death black armor. His name rests on the tip of me tongue, but..."
G["Not much."]="Não muito."
G["Not my gears - not my beautiful gears!"]="Meus engranagens não! Meus preciosos engranagens não!"
G["Not my problem! If yer so antsy to get yerself a house built, do it 'ere in the fort and quit yer whinin'!"]="Not my problem! If yer so antsy to get yerself a house built, do it 'ere in the fort and quit yer whinin'!"
G["Not my problem, Messner. Make it happen."]="Not my problem, Messner. Make it happen."
G["Not necessarily. I believe...yes...it just might work."]="Not necessarily. I believe...yes...it just might work."
G["Not now!"]="Agora não!"
G["Not now, $c. I cannot train you today.\n\n<Your trainer's voice lowers to a whisper.>\n\nThe Kor'kron watches our every move. Garrosh has the Valley of Spirits under his thumb.\n\nYou want to help? Find Vol'jin. He will know what to do."]="Not now, $c. I cannot train you today.\n\n<Your trainer's voice lowers to a whisper.>\n\nThe Kor'kron watches our every move. Garrosh has the Valley of Spirits under his thumb.\n\nYou want to help? Find Vol'jin. He will know what to do."
G["Not now, $gpal:lady;.\n\nI gotta re-tune the boss' shredder.\n\nShe don't like movin' around the city on foot like any old chump, ESPECIALLY if she's gotta go deal with the warchief."]="Not now, $gpal:lady;.\n\nI gotta re-tune the boss' shredder.\n\nShe don't like movin' around the city on foot like any old chump, ESPECIALLY if she's gotta go deal with the warchief."
G["Not now, $n. The bank's been taken over for the time being.\n\nThe Kor'kron leader said that they won't be makin' any \"unauthorized withdrawals\", but... you might wanna check an' make sure."]="Not now, $n. The bank's been taken over for the time being.\n\nThe Kor'kron leader said that they won't be makin' any \"unauthorized withdrawals\", but... you might wanna check an' make sure."
G["Not now, Mack. I be in no mood for your drunken pawing. Off with ya!"]="Not now, Mack. I be in no mood for your drunken pawing. Off with ya!"
G["Not now, mortal.\n\nI am here on urgent business."]="Agora não, mortal.\n\nTenho um assunto urgente entre mãos."
G["Not now.  Have you any tasks for me?"]="Not now.  Have you any tasks for me?"
G["Not now. Leza needs all of my attention. She is three weeks early and something is very wrong."]="Not now. Leza needs all of my attention. She is three weeks early and something is very wrong."
G["Not on your life!"]="na vida!"
G["Not one of you will live to see the final cataclysm! Finish them!"]="Not one of you will live to see the final cataclysm! Finish them!"
G["Not one step closer, ogre!"]="Não des um passo mais, ogro!"
G["Not one word...."]="Nem uma palavra..."
G["Not only am I havin' all the mithril bars I be needin', but all the Horde collections are done now mon. It's lookin' like we just waitin' on the Alliance and then we be goin' to war!"]="Não somente ter todas as barras de mithril que precisar, mas sim a Horda já reunir tudo o necessário. Parece que ter que esperar pela Aliança e depois à guerra!"
G["Not only haf you led me right to zhe coffer, but you haf removed its protektions!"]="Você não só me guiar dirretamente ao baú, como também remover a prroteção que tinha nele!"
G["Not quick enough!"]="Não o bastante rápido!"
G["Not quite so sure of yourself without the Purifier, hm?"]="Não está tão certo de ti mesmo sno Purificador, eh?"
G["Not quite, old friend. Times have changed. The line between friend and foe is not so clear."]="Nem tanto, velho amigo. Os tempos mudaram. Já não é tão fácil saber quem é amigo ou inimigo."
G["Not quite.  We shall need a great many offerings of sacrifice before the Herald of the Old Gods roams the land again."]="Not quite.  We shall need a great many offerings of sacrifice before the Herald of the Old Gods roams the land again."
G["Not really much of a \"group\" anymore, is it?"]="Já não fica muito do \"grupo\", eh?"
G["Not really."]="Em realidade, não."
G["Not right now, $gpal:sugar;... I got things to do. See ya around."]="Agora não, $gtío: céu;... Tenho coisas que fazer. Nos vemos."
G["Not running this time, Jung Duk?"]="Not running this time, Jung Duk?"
G["Not safe here, slave thing. This big-tongue home."]="Not safe here, slave thing. This big-tongue home."
G["Not see these very much. That fine though, it not very pretty."]="Não ver muitos de estes. Mas ser bom, não ser muito bonitos."
G["Not so brash now, are you?"]="Já não é tão corajoso, a que não?"
G["Not so fast!"]="Alto lá!"
G["Not so fast! Save some for me, mon!"]="Não tão rápi'o! Guarda algum pa' mim, colega!"
G["Not so fast, $g guy : lady;... I'll not be handing out the reigns of a mighty ram steed to someone that's not a proven ally of the dwarves of Ironforge.  Once you've been recognized as exalted to Ironforge, I'll gladly show you what varieties of rams I have for sale."]="Not so fast, $g guy : lady;... I'll not be handing out the reigns of a mighty ram steed to someone that's not a proven ally of the dwarves of Ironforge.  Once you've been recognized as exalted to Ironforge, I'll gladly show you what varieties of rams I have for sale."
G["Not so fast, $g guy : lady;... I'll not be handing out the reigns of a mighty ram steed to someone that's not a proven ally of the dwarves of Ironforge.  Once you've been recognized as friendly to Ironforge, I'll gladly show you what varieties of rams I have for sale."]="Not so fast, $g guy : lady;... I'll not be handing out the reigns of a mighty ram steed to someone that's not a proven ally of the dwarves of Ironforge.  Once you've been recognized as friendly to Ironforge, I'll gladly show you what varieties of rams I have for sale."
G["Not so fast, $r!\n\nOnly champions of Ironforge can purchase what I got ta offer."]="Não tão depressa, $r!\n\nSomente os Campeões de Altaforja podem comprar o que tenho em venda."
G["Not so fast, Schnottz!"]="Não tão rápido, Schnottz!"
G["Not so fast, Son of Durotan! You and your allies have certainly set us back, but the Hour of Twilight CANNOT be averted!"]="Not so fast, Son of Durotan! You and your allies have certainly set us back, but the Hour of Twilight CANNOT be averted!"
G["Not so fast, bearface. First I need a foot-rub."]="Not so fast, bearface. First I need a foot-rub."
G["Not so fast, little troll!"]="Não tão depressa, troll insssignificante!"
G["Not so fast, matey. Yer on my turf!"]="Alto lá, marujo! Cê tá na minha área!"
G["Not so fast, wet guy!"]="Não tão rápido, branquias!"
G["Not so fast."]="Não tão rápido."
G["Not so fast. You're not dying on us just yet."]="Não tão rápido. Não te está morrendo, ainda não."
G["Not so fast..."]="Não tão rápido..."
G["Not so tough now!!"]="Não tão duro agora!"
G["Not so tough now, are you? That's right. You look so dumb there laying on the ground. Don't make me make $p throw more barrels at you."]="$p, Agora não é tão duro, eh? Isso. Pareces um bobo aí jogou no chão. Não nos obligues a lançar mais barris."
G["Not sure how I got here. But... good fortune often finds the open minded."]="Not sure how I got here. But... good fortune often finds the open minded."
G["Not sure how ol' Nass always finds his way back here. Must be by smell...."]="Não sei como encontre o velho Nass o caminho de volta a aqui. Deve ser pelo cheiro..."
G["Not sure how reading helps. Kekek can't read anyway, but if Hemet Nesingwary say, Kekek try."]="Not sure how reading helps. Kekek can't read anyway, but if Hemet Nesingwary say, Kekek try."
G["Not sure how thing got here. Not matter if dead though."]="Não saber como chegar aqui coisa. Mas dar igual se estar morta."
G["Not sure if this is going to be good enough.  These aren't troggs we're trying to fool."]="Não sei se isto bastará. Não estamos tentando enganar a troggs."
G["Not sure if you notice, but there rumbling sometimes from the water in the big hole. I think there something down there."]="Not sure if you notice, but there rumbling sometimes from the water in the big hole. I think there something down there."
G["Not sure who told you I had some ale left, but keep it quiet will ya? There ain't no way I have enough for the whole camp."]="Não sei quem você dito que me restante algo de cerveja, mas não se o cuentes a ninguém, vale? Não tenho suficiente para tudo o acampamento."
G["Not that I doubt your abilites, but I would like you to perform a task for me. Call it a demonstration of good faith..."]="Not that I doubt your abilites, but I would like you to perform a task for me. Call it a demonstration of good faith..."
G["Not that I'm quite sure that you could ever possibly in a gazillion years have enough stranglekelp, what with all the ice cream one needs, but we seem to have enough. Or that's what I'm told anyway. It looks like some of the others here might need help with whatever it is that they're collecting. Understandable really when you consider that theirs just couldn't possibly be as fun as collecting stranglekelp."]="Não que eu tenha certeza de que, em um zilhão de anos, você possa ter ajuda suficiente para estrangular, o que com tudo o sorvete que se você precisa, mas parece que temos o suficiente. Ou é o que disseram para mim de qualquer maneira. Parece que algum dos outros aqui podem precisar de ajuda com o que eles estão coletando. É mesmo compreensível quando você considera que o deles não poderia ser tão divertido quanto coletar ajuda de estrangulamento."
