G["Now leave me be. I see the Light...."]="Agora deixe-me. Vejo a Luz..."
G["Now let cheering dispel the twilight"]="Now let cheering dispel the twilight"
G["Now let me tell you somethin' about knotty pine, it's got knots, $gson:missy;.\n\nAnd knots is just big holes in trees, which makes for a stupid rowboat and I blamed Whistler but he had his own ideas about my choice of tar (I chose to forget it) so we decided to settle it by drinking.\n\nWhen the grog ran out, that's when we had the knife fight. For sport.\n\nAnyways, we never made it to Menethil, and I'm pretty sure one or both of us drowned."]="Now let me tell you somethin' about knotty pine, it's got knots, $gson:missy;.\n\nAnd knots is just big holes in trees, which makes for a stupid rowboat and I blamed Whistler but he had his own ideas about my choice of tar (I chose to forget it) so we decided to settle it by drinking.\n\nWhen the grog ran out, that's when we had the knife fight. For sport.\n\nAnyways, we never made it to Menethil, and I'm pretty sure one or both of us drowned."
G["Now let us place this rare earth in my planter..."]="Vamos colocar esta estranha terra na minha maceta..."
G["Now let's give shootin' another try..."]="Venha, vamos tentar outra vez..."
G["Now let's heat up these flakes..."]="Now let's heat up these flakes..."
G["Now let's look for the herb."]="E agora busquemos a erva."
G["Now let's see what Bwemba's conjured up..."]="Vamos ver que se tem sacado Bwemba da manga..."
G["Now let's try it..."]="Agora probémoslo..."
G["Now listen here! That was simply uncalled for!"]="Agora ouça! Isso tem estado fosse de lugar!"
G["Now look at me. Sweeping up after this dumb beast."]="Now look at me. Sweeping up after this dumb beast."
G["Now look at this... a jinyu and... what is that? Some sort of Beard-Sprite?"]="Vamos ver... um jinyu e... que é isto? Uma espécie de duende barbado?"
G["Now look who's here. Heya, $n, bring us a pint and get o'er here!"]="Olhe quem está aqui. Onda, $n, aproxime-se e tráenos uma pinta!"
G["Now make ready, for soon we'll be ashore."]="Preparem-se. Chegaremos a terra pronto."
G["Now me crush you myself!"]="Now me crush you myself!"
