G["Now move out! You must not keep the Banshee Queen waiting."]="Now move out! You must not keep the Banshee Queen waiting."
G["Now our Multi-Bombers can obliterate the Thermaplugg's shielded Tankbuster Cannons."]="Now our Multi-Bombers can obliterate the Thermaplugg's shielded Tankbuster Cannons."
G["Now prove your worth!"]="Now prove your worth!"
G["Now sit down and stand up lots of times in a row!"]="Agora sente-se e levántate muitas vezes seguidas!"
G["Now stand up!"]="Agora levántate!"
G["Now stay dead."]="Agora fique aí morto."
G["Now swim back with the knowledge I have granted you. Do what you can for them, $r."]="Nada de volta com o conhecimento que te e proporcionado. Faça o que possa por eles, $r."
G["Now that $n is here, we won't need to worry about the Burning Legion any longer."]="Now that $n is here, we won't need to worry about the Burning Legion any longer."
G["Now that I am at my full power I can perform Dream Funnel.  You can use it to heal other drakes, but it drains my health, so make sure you're using Leeching Poison too!"]="Now that I am at my full power I can perform Dream Funnel.  You can use it to heal other drakes, but it drains my health, so make sure you're using Leeching Poison too!"
G["Now that I am at my full power I can perform Martyr.  You can use it to protect other drakes, but I will take lots of damage, so make sure you're using Evasive Maneuvers too!"]="Now that I am at my full power I can perform Martyr.  You can use it to protect other drakes, but I will take lots of damage, so make sure you're using Evasive Maneuvers too!"
G["Now that I am at my full power I can perform Temporal Rift.  You can use it to make enemies take extra damage and to get Shock Charges.  Save up Shock Charges and then Shock Lance for huge damage!"]="Agora que tenho tudo meu poder, posso usar Falha temporário. Pode usá para fazer que os inimigos sufran dano adicional e conseguir Cargas de choque. Guárdalas e depois usa a Lança de choque para fazer um dano enorme!"
G["Now that I have been reassembled, we can return to a time of perfection... the time of the Titans!"]="Agora que me têm voltado a montar podemos voltar a uma era de perfecção... à era dos titãs!"
G["Now that I'm free of training those miserable wretches, I'll entertain myself with you!"]="Now that I'm free of training those miserable wretches, I'll entertain myself with you!"
G["Now that I've been beaten to within an inch of my life what do you want?"]="Agora que fui derrotado por uma polegada da minha vida, o que você quer?"
G["Now that I've had my peek into the Vale, I gotta say, some o' this place feels a bit... familiar.\n\nI know it don't look like it, but I can't shake that feeling. What do you think that means!?"]="Agora que e pedido dar um olhada ao vale, posso dizer que há algo neste lugar que me resulta um pouco... familiar.\n\nJá sei que não o parece, mas não me posso tirar essa sensação. O que acha que indica?!"
G["Now that Ji-Lu has his trinkets back maybe I'll get some peace in the inn!"]="Agora que Ji-Lu tem recuperei seus berloques talvez fique a paz à estalagem!"
G["Now that Lady Sacrolash and Grand Warlock Alythess have been defeated, can you teleport me to the Witch's Sanctum."]="Now that Lady Sacrolash and Grand Warlock Alythess have been defeated, can you teleport me to the Witch's Sanctum."
G["Now that is a sight for sore eyes!"]="Que bom ver você os olhos!"
G["Now that is hot."]="Sou eu ou há calor?"
G["Now that is what Zunta be talkin' about!"]="É disso que o Zunta gosta!"
G["Now that that's out of the way, welcome to the Isle of Quel'Danas. The Sunwell's on the plateau to the south, and Prince Kael'thas is holed up in the Magisters' Terrace to the east."]="Agora que nos temos retirado isso de em meio, bem-vindos à Ilha de Quel'Danas. A Nascente do Sol se encontre na meseta ao Sul e o príncipe Kael’thas está no Bancal do Magíster ao Este."
G["Now that the Frostwolf general is defeated, we can spare some troops to guard the entrance to Winterax Hold.\n\nBut stay vigilant!  We must always be on the lookout for Horde interlopers.."]="Now that the Frostwolf general is defeated, we can spare some troops to guard the entrance to Winterax Hold.\n\nBut stay vigilant!  We must always be on the lookout for Horde interlopers.."
G["Now that the Stormpike general is defeated, we can spare a few troops to guard Winterax Hold.  But we must be ever vigilant, $c, for the Alliance will return.\n\nWhen you find them skulking about, teach them another lesson!"]="Now that the Stormpike general is defeated, we can spare a few troops to guard Winterax Hold.  But we must be ever vigilant, $c, for the Alliance will return.\n\nWhen you find them skulking about, teach them another lesson!"
G["Now that the coast is clear..."]="Agora que a costa está despejada..."
G["Now that the demons have been dealt with, we can proceed with the establishment of a new base here."]="Agora que nos temos ocupado dos demônios, podemos seguir com o estavelcimento de uma nova base aqui."
G["Now that the deserters have taken over Lost Point, North Point Tower is the most distant of Theramore's outposts."]="Agora que os desertores assumiram o controle de Lost Point, a North Point Tower é o posto mais distante de Theramore."
G["Now that the flasks are ready, we can show the Skyguard our moves!"]="Now that the flasks are ready, we can show the Skyguard our moves!"
G["Now that the rude interruption is over, as I was saying, Quagmirran is nearby!\n\nAs promised, I can fortify you with a magical boon that should aid you in your fight with him."]="Now that the rude interruption is over, as I was saying, Quagmirran is nearby!\n\nAs promised, I can fortify you with a magical boon that should aid you in your fight with him."
G["Now that the show's done, can someone run me through Scarlet Monestary?"]="Agora que o espectáculo terminou, pode alguém me ajudar a recorrer o Monastério Escarlate?"
G["Now that the soup is made, pick it up by clicking on it. Soups will go bad if left out too long so only make what you need for your customers."]="Now that the soup is made, pick it up by clicking on it. Soups will go bad if left out too long so only make what you need for your customers."
G["Now that the unpleasantness is finished with, let's talk about you dealing with Grand Admiral Westwind."]="Agora que temos terminou com o desagradable, vamos falar sobre você e seus tratos com o grande almirante Vento Oeste."
G["Now that the war is in full swing, we've had no shortage of able-bodied combatants from the Horde and Alliance.\n\nIf only we could keep them off of each other's throats..."]="Now that the war is in full swing, we've had no shortage of able-bodied combatants from the Horde and Alliance.\n\nIf only we could keep them off of each other's throats..."
G["Now that was really unnecessary."]="Isso era totalmente desnecessário."
G["Now that we are besties, I must tell you that your outfit is... just to die for!"]="Now that we are besties, I must tell you that your outfit is... just to die for!"
G["Now that we are friends, I must tell you that your outfit is... hideous."]="Agora que somos $gamigos: amigas;, devo dizer que seu conjunto é... espantoso."
