G["Now that we have Freewind Post, all that's left is that stupid barge. Gnome and goblins. How sad your people are."]="Now that we have Freewind Post, all that's left is that stupid barge. Gnome and goblins. How sad your people are."
G["Now that we have captured this wretched isle, we need to do some work to get it into shape.  Can you help us out $n?"]="Now that we have captured this wretched isle, we need to do some work to get it into shape.  Can you help us out $n?"
G["Now that we have taken the island back, it's time to get to work.  Talk to me again when you are ready to help."]="Agora que temos recuperei a ilha, é o momentos de ficar mãos à obra. Fala comigo novamente quando estiver $gpronto: pronta; para ajudar."
G["Now that we're acquaintances, $n, let me give you a tip. Folks 'round here can help spruce up your farm, but you gotta become friends with them first. Make friends by helping them out with daily tasks, or by giving them gifts like the one you just gave me."]="Now that we're acquaintances, $n, let me give you a tip. Folks 'round here can help spruce up your farm, but you gotta become friends with them first. Make friends by helping them out with daily tasks, or by giving them gifts like the one you just gave me."
G["Now that we're acquaintances, $n, let me give you a tip. Folks 'round here can help spruce up your farm, but you gotta become friends. Unfortunately, you're too green to help them out or give gifts yet, so get stronger first!"]="Now that we're acquaintances, $n, let me give you a tip. Folks 'round here can help spruce up your farm, but you gotta become friends. Unfortunately, you're too green to help them out or give gifts yet, so get stronger first!"
G["Now that we're best friends, I have a confession to make. I... I think I quite fancy Farmer Fung. But then again, Farmer Yoon has nice eyes, don't you think?\n\nOh, I just can't decide!"]="Now that we're best friends, I have a confession to make. I... I think I quite fancy Farmer Fung. But then again, Farmer Yoon has nice eyes, don't you think?\n\nOh, I just can't decide!"
G["Now that we're friends, I have a confession to make. I... I think I quite fancy Farmer Fung."]="Now that we're friends, I have a confession to make. I... I think I quite fancy Farmer Fung."
G["Now that we're friends, you can call me Fish.\n\nHa ha! I'm so funny!\n\nI'm jus' kidding... everyone calls me Fish! That's cuz everyone's my friend!"]="Agora que somos $gamigos: amigas; pode chamar-me Peixe.\n\nJa, ja! Que graciosa sou!\n\nÉ broma... tudo o mundo me chama Peixe! É que tudo o mundo é amigo meu!"
G["Now that we're good friends, I have a confession to make. I... I think I quite fancy Farmer Fung. But then again, Farmer Yoon has nice eyes, don't you think?"]="Now that we're good friends, I have a confession to make. I... I think I quite fancy Farmer Fung. But then again, Farmer Yoon has nice eyes, don't you think?"
G["Now that we're neighbors, I've decided to give you the best gift a neighbor can just about give to anybody! I'm going to give you one of my prized yaks! I'll swing on by later and leave 'er in your pen."]="Now that we're neighbors, I've decided to give you the best gift a neighbor can just about give to anybody! I'm going to give you one of my prized yaks! I'll swing on by later and leave 'er in your pen."
G["Now that we're neighbors, you have to tell me your farming secrets. Do you use fertilizer? Growth spray? Weedkiller? Tell me, already!"]="Now that we're neighbors, you have to tell me your farming secrets. Do you use fertilizer? Growth spray? Weedkiller? Tell me, already!"
G["Now that you have bested me, test your skills against each other!  Take control of either king to begin play."]="Agora que você me superou, teste suas habilidades um contra o outro! Assuma o controle de qualquer rei para começar a jogar."
G["Now that you have completed the Trial of the Crusader, you should consider returning to take part in the Trial of the Grand Crusader. Only the strongest adventurers can hope to complete the Trial, but you will be rewarded well for your efforts."]="Agora que você concluiu a Prova do Cruzado, considere retornar para participar da Prova do Grande Cruzado. Somente os aventureiros mais fortes podem esperar concluir a Prova, mas você será recompensado pelos seus esforços."
G["Now that you have had a chance to study the imp, let us move on to the next minion you will be able to summon, the voidwalker."]="Now that you have had a chance to study the imp, let us move on to the next minion you will be able to summon, the voidwalker."
G["Now that you have your Black Temple key (Medallion of Karabor), I can teleport you directly to the Black Temple. Just tell me when you are ready."]="Agora que você tem sua chave do Templo Negro (Medalhão de Karabor), posso teleportá-o diretamente para o Templo Negro. Apenas me diga quando estiver pronto."
G["Now that you know the truth, I can't let you leave!"]="Agora que conhece a verdade não posso permitir que te marches."
G["Now that you mention it, I've been craving Charbroiled Tiger Steak for a while! We don't get many tigers down in the valley, so the dish is hard to find."]="Agora que o diz, levo muito tempo com ganha de comer filé de tigres à brasa! Não temos muitos tigres pelo vale, assim que é um prato difícil de encontrar."
G["Now that you mention it... my mother used to make the best Shrimp Dumplings.\n\nSigh... I miss her..."]="Now that you mention it... my mother used to make the best Shrimp Dumplings.\n\nSigh... I miss her..."
G["Now that you're attuned to Mount Hyjal, I can teleport you to the Caverns of Time. Just let me know when you are ready."]="Agora que você está em sintonia com o Monte Hyjal, posso teleportá-o para as Cavernas do Tempo. Apenas me avise quando estiver pronto."
G["Now that you've helped me to establish my ice cream empire, make sure to enjoy one of my many tasty concoctions!"]="Agora que você me ajudou a estabelecer meu império de sorvetes, aproveite uma de minhas muitas misturas saborosas!"
G["Now that's a War Stomp!  Good job!"]="Now that's a War Stomp!  Good job!"
G["Now that's a piece of steel worth wearing. Form and function lad/lass, I am impressed. Only ever seen it's match once, a Master in the Great Forge named Grumnus Steelshaper. I bet he has learned a few things since then, could probably teach some to ye."]="Agora é um pedaço de aço que vale a pena usar. Forma e função rapaz / moça, estou impressionado. Só já viu sua partida uma vez, um Mestre da Grande Forja chamado Grumnus Steelshaper. Aposto que ele aprendeu algumas coisas desde então, provavelmente poderia ensinar algumas para você."
G["Now that's earnin' your supper!"]="Os estão ganhando o pan!"
