G["Now that's what I call a match!"]="Isso si que foi uma boa partida!"
G["Now that's what I call craftsmanship.  You'll have to show me how you did this.  Promise?"]="Now that's what I call craftsmanship.  You'll have to show me how you did this.  Promise?"
