G["Now turn your lovely runeblades on our guests, and fetch me their bones!"]="Now turn your lovely runeblades on our guests, and fetch me their bones!"
G["Now wait a darn minute. Is that an orc? Is... is the HORDE here too!?"]="Aguarda um momento. Isso é um orc? A HORDA também está aqui?"
