G["Obviously. How else could she infiltrate their ranks and pass as a draenei? She had been living among them for a very long time."]="Obviously. How else could she infiltrate their ranks and pass as a draenei? She had been living among them for a very long time."
G["Occassionally, some runes will fizzle with black smoke, preventing them from firing during the following burst."]="Occassionally, some runes will fizzle with black smoke, preventing them from firing during the following burst."
G["Och I love a good brawl, but sometimes yer foe has a skull thicker than a Thorium heat shield. Times like that ye need a wee bit o assistance."]="Aj, me encantar uma boa luta, mas a vezes seu inimigo tno crânio mais duro que um escudo de tório. Nessas ocasiões sempre vem bem algo de ajuda."
G["Och!\n\n'Bout time ye showed up.\n\nI been expectin' ye fer days now.\n\nLeavin' an ol' dwarf ta swelter... I trained junior better than that."]="Och!\n\n'Bout time ye showed up.\n\nI been expectin' ye fer days now.\n\nLeavin' an ol' dwarf ta swelter... I trained junior better than that."
G["Och!\n\nWhy can't it just be easy fer once?!"]="Agh!\n\nPor que não pode ser fácil por uma vez?"
G["Och!\nWe've got ghosts AND the Reliquary to contend with here?! I dunno what's worse!"]="Och!\nWe've got ghosts AND the Reliquary to contend with here?! I dunno what's worse!"
G["Och!  Now that's a skill worth knowing.  Tognus beats the anvil with a fury ye don't see often.  Why don't ye go talk him up and see what he can teach ye?"]="Och! Agora essa é uma habilidade que vale a pena conhecer. Tognus bate na bigorna com uma fúria que você não vê com frequência. Por que você não vai falar com ele e ver o que ele pode ensinar?"
G["Och!  Now ye're talkin'!  I bet Granis Swiftaxe could show ye a thing or two about swinging steel.  He's over in the Thunderbrew Distillery in Kharanos at the moment."]="Och! Agora você está falando! Aposto que Granis Swiftaxe poderia lhe mostrar uma coisa ou duas sobre balançar aço. Ele está na Destilaria Thunderbrew em Kharanos no momentos."
G["Och!  That Daryl Riknussun is a brilliant cook!  He makes a chilli so hot ye could temper steel with it!  I don't think he'll teach ye the recipe, but he'll certainly help ye to become a good cook.  Ye'll find him at the Bronze Kettle o'er on the northeastern side of The Great Forge."]="Och! Que Daryl Riknussun é um cozinheiro brilhante! Ele faz um pimentão tão quente que você pode temperar o aço com ele! Acho que ele não vai lhe ensinar a receita, mas certamente o ajudará a se tornar um bom cozinheiro. Você o encontrará na chaleira de bronze, no lado nordeste da Grande Forja."
G["Och!  Ye should be careful what ye get enchanted $glad : lass;.  I had me mug enchanted so it wouldn't spill a drop, but now I can't drink from it!  Such a tragedy.  \nYou be sure to heed me advice when ye see Gimble.  He'll be in his shop right by the Gryphon Master at The Great Forge."]="Och!  Ye should be careful what ye get enchanted $glad : lass;.  I had me mug enchanted so it wouldn't spill a drop, but now I can't drink from it!  Such a tragedy.  \nYou be sure to heed me advice when ye see Gimble.  He'll be in his shop right by the Gryphon Master at The Great Forge."
G["Och! Come on now, ye buggar..."]="Barbaridade! Venha aqui, seu verme..."
G["Och! I can't decide!"]="Ay! Não me decido!"
G["Och! Ye seek training in the way of the warrior, do ye?  Kelstrum Stonebreaker will put ye through yer paces!  Just march yerself over to the Hall of Arms east of the gates of Ironforge."]="Och! Ye seek training in the way of the warrior, do ye?  Kelstrum Stonebreaker will put ye through yer paces!  Just march yerself over to the Hall of Arms east of the gates of Ironforge."
G["Och, 'twas a sad day when I realized my obsession. I woke up and found myself tannin' before I had my first tankard of ale. Hardly even a respectable hangover! I knew then--aye, I knew!--how it was goin' to be."]="Och, 'twas a sad day when I realized my obsession. I woke up and found myself tannin' before I had my first tankard of ale. Hardly even a respectable hangover! I knew then--aye, I knew!--how it was goin' to be."
G["Och, there's nothing I can teach ye, $n. Have a word with Tally Berryfizz over there. She can hardly reach the tables, but when she starts brewing a potion, watch out!"]="Oj, não posso ensinar nada, $n. Fala com Talhy Burbubaya. Quase não chega à mesa, mas se começa a preparar uma poção presta atenção!"
G["Och... a paladin?  Well $glad : lass;, ye're in luck!  Azar Stronghammer is back from training and is currently staying at the Thunderbrew Distillery in Kharanos."]="Oh... um paladino? Bem $gmuchacho: moça;, está de sorte! Azar Martilhopujante voltou do seu treinamento e se encontre na Destilaria Cebatruenos de Kharanos."
G["Odd city, ain't it?"]="Uma visão maravilhosa, verdade?"
G["Odd, I would have thought you'd have found something useful on those Scourge that might help us deal with the scourging crystals.\n\nIf I may strongly suggest, and I do, $c, go back down to the beach and continue to slaughter them until you do find something of use to me."]="Odd, I would have thought you'd have found something useful on those Scourge that might help us deal with the scourging crystals.\n\nIf I may strongly suggest, and I do, $c, go back down to the beach and continue to slaughter them until you do find something of use to me."
