G["Of all the wild serpents, the onyx serpent is the rarest. These elusive black cloud serpents are known to lay their eggs on Windward Isle to the northeast.\n\nIf you come across any Onyx Eggs, please bring them to me. I shall reward you handsomely."]="Of all the wild serpents, the onyx serpent is the rarest. These elusive black cloud serpents are known to lay their eggs on Windward Isle to the northeast.\n\nIf you come across any Onyx Eggs, please bring them to me. I shall reward you handsomely."
G["Of all the wondrous places within Darnassus, which would you have me direct you to?"]="De todos os lugares maravilhosos dentro de Darnassus, a que você gostaria que eu o indicasse?"
G["Of course I can help you with training. I'm just a journeyman myself, but I'm sure there's something I can show you."]="Claro que posso ajudá-o com o treinamento. Sou apenas um viajante, mas tenho certeza de que há algo que posso lhe mostrar."
G["Of course I do not have the shard. That would be asinine. I walk amongst savages in this cursed land! I cannot take five steps without some crazed orc or human trying to thrust a sharp stick into my hide. At any given time you could very well be speaking to my ghostly spirit.\n\nAnyhow... I hid it.\n\nGo on... ask me where."]="Of course I do not have the shard. That would be asinine. I walk amongst savages in this cursed land! I cannot take five steps without some crazed orc or human trying to thrust a sharp stick into my hide. At any given time you could very well be speaking to my ghostly spirit.\n\nAnyhow... I hid it.\n\nGo on... ask me where."
G["Of course I offer lessons to other Enchanters, provided you are ready."]="é claro que ofereço lições a outros encantadores, sempre e quando estiver $gpreparado: preparada;."
G["Of course I was the one chosen to summon a demon for the competitors. I am Wilfred Fizzlebang, master summoner! Demons quail before the mere thought of being under my will!"]="Of course I was the one chosen to summon a demon for the competitors. I am Wilfred Fizzlebang, master summoner! Demons quail before the mere thought of being under my will!"
G["Of course I will help!"]="Claro que vou ajudar!"
G["Of course I'm not just going to drop you off, Master Highbeacon.  We'll be happy to wait for you."]="Of course I'm not just going to drop you off, Master Highbeacon.  We'll be happy to wait for you."
G["Of course I've got a job for you! We're always looking for $cs. Hopefully you'll fare better than the draenei we had to send back to the Exodar -- for burial.\n\n<Acteon laughs.>\n\nI'm joking! You should have seen the look on your face. They got sent back to the Exodar for treatment of minor wounds. Nothin' that they won't recover from..."]="Of course I've got a job for you! We're always looking for $cs. Hopefully you'll fare better than the draenei we had to send back to the Exodar -- for burial.\n\n<Acteon laughs.>\n\nI'm joking! You should have seen the look on your face. They got sent back to the Exodar for treatment of minor wounds. Nothin' that they won't recover from..."
G["Of course he was hot! Don't be dumb, Deng."]="Of course he was hot! Don't be dumb, Deng."
G["Of course it's my drink! I invented this ya know!"]="claro que é meu copa! A inventé eu, sabe?"
G["Of course my worst fears are going to come true."]="Meus maiores temores se vão a fazer realidade."
G["Of course none of my goods are stolen.  But if someone asks, you didn't get them from me!"]="Of course none of my goods are stolen.  But if someone asks, you didn't get them from me!"
G["Of course not! We brewed beer together. That practically makes us brothers."]="é claro! Temos pronto cerveja juntos. Isso quase nos transforma em irmãos."
G["Of course not, dear $g boy:girl;. You 'adventurer' types are often victims of circumstance; subject to the political drama which tends to unfold between citizenry and royalty.\n\nMy advice to you, then, is to seek out something else, more specifically: A new career.\n\nThis world has enough heroes."]="Of course not, dear $g boy:girl;. You 'adventurer' types are often victims of circumstance; subject to the political drama which tends to unfold between citizenry and royalty.\n\nMy advice to you, then, is to seek out something else, more specifically: A new career.\n\nThis world has enough heroes."
G["Of course the Explorer's League stumbled into a foolish situation and are in over their heads.\nAnd of COURSE we are going to take advantage of it."]="Of course the Explorer's League stumbled into a foolish situation and are in over their heads.\nAnd of COURSE we are going to take advantage of it."
G["Of course there's no danger in everything catching flames and exploding like a huge helium bomb. This baby will get you to Undercity faster and safer than any boat, and the view is truly breathtaking. Speaking of breath, smoking is not allowed while on board the zeppelin"]="Of course there's no danger in everything catching flames and exploding like a huge helium bomb. This baby will get you to Undercity faster and safer than any boat, and the view is truly breathtaking. Speaking of breath, smoking is not allowed while on board the zeppelin"
G["Of course there's no danger in everything catching flames and exploding like a huge helium bomb. This baby will get you to Undercity faster and safer than any boat, and the view is truly breathtaking. Speaking of breath, smoking is not allowed while on board the zeppelin, and fire spells are banned from being cast during the trip."]="É claro que não há perigo em tudo pegar chamas e explodir como uma enorme bomba de hélio. Este bebê levará você à Undercity com mais rapidez e segurança do que qualquer outro navio, e a visão é mesmo impressionante. Por falar em fôlego, não é permitido fumar a bordo do zeppelin, e os feitiços de fogo são proibidos de serem lançados durante a viagem."
G["Of course they are. One problem at a time, Vereesa."]="Como não... Uma coisa por trás de outra, Vereesa."
G["Of course they will."]="é claro que si."
G["Of course we need a sound strategy. But why cut off an arm when you can strike at the heart?"]="Of course we need a sound strategy. But why cut off an arm when you can strike at the heart?"
G["Of course you are! Thanks for coming by. Here's my payment."]="é claro que si!\n\nObrigado por vir. Aqui tem o pagamento."
G["Of course you are. Here to save big blue from himself, spending all his time in the spirit world, obsessing over magical artifacts. Kalec doesn't understand though, I've turned a new leaf.\n\nI've met someone."]="Of course you are. Here to save big blue from himself, spending all his time in the spirit world, obsessing over magical artifacts. Kalec doesn't understand though, I've turned a new leaf.\n\nI've met someone."
G["Of course you did. We will put your understanding to the test."]="é claro. Talvez possamos colocar a prova seu entendimento."
