G["Of course!"]="Claro!"
G["Of course!\n\nWhat seems to be the problem?"]="claro!\n\nQual é o problema?"
G["Of course! After helping me with those weeds, sharing some hops is the least I can do. I'll have the hops delivered to Master Stormstout, in Halfhill."]="Of course! After helping me with those weeds, sharing some hops is the least I can do. I'll have the hops delivered to Master Stormstout, in Halfhill."
G["Of course! Anything for you, darling!"]="é claro! Qualquer coisa por você, carinho!"
G["Of course! Go with Elune's blessing."]="Claro! Vá com a bênção de Elune."
