G["Of course! It would be an honor."]="claro! Será uma honra."
G["Of course! This codex is written in the ancient Nathrezim tongue. Nathrezim, or the Dreadlords, as you call them, were once an enlightened and powerful race. Their skill in summoning and gateway magics was unsurpassed by any in the Great Dark Beyond. \n\nThis particular tome contains instructions to open a gateway to another world. Sadly, I fear that world no longer exists. It was destroyed as a show of power during the enslavement of Xoroth.\n\nThe tome is useless, I'm afraid. No $r $c could open such a gateway alone."]="Of course! This codex is written in the ancient Nathrezim tongue. Nathrezim, or the Dreadlords, as you call them, were once an enlightened and powerful race. Their skill in summoning and gateway magics was unsurpassed by any in the Great Dark Beyond. \n\nThis particular tome contains instructions to open a gateway to another world. Sadly, I fear that world no longer exists. It was destroyed as a show of power during the enslavement of Xoroth.\n\nThe tome is useless, I'm afraid. No $r $c could open such a gateway alone."
G["Of course, $c. What is the young warrior's name?\n\nI wish more of our people shared your concern for the orphans of Orgrimmar."]="Of course, $c. What is the young warrior's name?\n\nI wish more of our people shared your concern for the orphans of Orgrimmar."
G["Of course, $n! We're really good friends.\n\nDon't you remember the time that you saved me from that mountain hozen? And then afterward we got drunk and lost our pants?"]="é claro, $n! Somos muito $gbuenos amigos: boas amigas;.\n\nNão te lembra de aquela vez que me salvaste de aquele hozen da montanha? E que depois nos emborrachamos e perdimos os calças?"
G["Of course, $n."]="Of course, $n."
G["Of course, $n. You rescued these turtles from the Twilight's Hammer - they will follow you anywhere."]="Of course, $n. You rescued these turtles from the Twilight's Hammer - they will follow you anywhere."
