G["Oh yeah, there are plenty of false rumors going around about me.  That I grew up as an attraction in the Darkmoon Faire, that I killed six demons on my fifth birthday using only a spoon, or even -- and this is my favorite -- that I'm actually a natural blonde.  Folks will believe anything."]="Oh yeah, there are plenty of false rumors going around about me.  That I grew up as an attraction in the Darkmoon Faire, that I killed six demons on my fifth birthday using only a spoon, or even -- and this is my favorite -- that I'm actually a natural blonde.  Folks will believe anything."
