G["Oh, pay no attention to me. I'm just a messenger. The leader of the Deathstalkers certainly wouldn't be stupid enough to stand here on the dais waiting to be gutted. No need for history to repeat itself."]="Oh, não preste atenção em mim. Eu sou apenas um mensageiro. O líder dos Caçadores de Morte certamente não seria estúpido o suficiente para ficar aqui no estrado esperando para ser destruído. Não há necessidade da história se repetir."
G["Oh, pay no mind to Buddy.  He won't hurt you, he just likes to scratch now and then.\n\nHe's just a big, loveable kitty.\n\nAren't you Buddy?  Yes, you are, you cute, little thing.  You're mommy's little baby, that's what you are!"]="Oh, pay no mind to Buddy.  He won't hurt you, he just likes to scratch now and then.\n\nHe's just a big, loveable kitty.\n\nAren't you Buddy?  Yes, you are, you cute, little thing.  You're mommy's little baby, that's what you are!"
G["Oh, please!  This is sickening; I'm going to have to kill you all myself."]="Oh, please!  This is sickening; I'm going to have to kill you all myself."
G["Oh, please.\n\n\nI cannot teach a $r to ride a hawkstrider."]="Oh, please.\n\n\nI cannot teach a $r to ride a hawkstrider."
