G["Oh, the tram, the tram...  everyone wants to ride the tram.  What happened to the good ol' days of flying on the back of a gryphon, gripping the saddle for dear life as you flew up high in the sky above?  \nBah!  You go take the tram then... it's over in Tinker Town with the rest of the gnomish contraptions."]="Oh, the tram, the tram...  everyone wants to ride the tram.  What happened to the good ol' days of flying on the back of a gryphon, gripping the saddle for dear life as you flew up high in the sky above?  \nBah!  You go take the tram then... it's over in Tinker Town with the rest of the gnomish contraptions."
G["Oh, there you are!"]="Ah, aqui está."
G["Oh, these apples are utterly delicious!"]="Oh, estas manzanas são mesmo deliciosas!"
G["Oh, these are sticky! I wonder how they shoot the webbing?"]="Oh, these are sticky! I wonder how they shoot the webbing?"
G["Oh, they will be. But knowledge is power, and I will never turn down an opportunity to study something new. Thank you, Taoshi."]="Oh, they will be. But knowledge is power, and I will never turn down an opportunity to study something new. Thank you, Taoshi."
G["Oh, this gonna HURT!"]="Oh, this gonna HURT!"
G["Oh, this looks delicious. Thank you, $c."]="Oh, tem uma pinta deliciosa. Obrigado, $c."
G["Oh, this? <Anduin indicates his crutch.>\n\nGarrosh Hellscream tried to use an ancient mogu artifact to summon and control sha energy. I found a way to stop him, but probably shouldn't have confronted him on my own. He thought I was dead when he left me buried under the wreckage of his failed plan. I swear he shattered every bone in my body.\n\nThe pandaren mistweavers got me back on my feet again, but it may be some time before I can walk without assistance."]="Oh, this? <Anduin indicates his crutch.>\n\nGarrosh Hellscream tried to use an ancient mogu artifact to summon and control sha energy. I found a way to stop him, but probably shouldn't have confronted him on my own. He thought I was dead when he left me buried under the wreckage of his failed plan. I swear he shattered every bone in my body.\n\nThe pandaren mistweavers got me back on my feet again, but it may be some time before I can walk without assistance."
G["Oh, was that one of your favorites?  My bad."]="Ih, aquele era um dos seus favoritos? Ops."
G["Oh, we are going to get along just fine, $n."]="Oh, acho que vamos arreglárnoslas, $n."
G["Oh, we know just the thing...."]="Ah, temos a solução perfeita..."
G["Oh, we're from Blackrock Mountain,\nWe've come ta drink yer brew!\nDark Iron dwarves, they do not lie,\nAnd so yeh know it's true!"]="Oh, we're from Blackrock Mountain,\nWe've come ta drink yer brew!\nDark Iron dwarves, they do not lie,\nAnd so yeh know it's true!"
G["Oh, welcome back, $n. You here to break a few more faces, or what?"]="Onda novamente, $n. Tem vindo a partir mais caras?"
G["Oh, well, that all depends on which partners you mean. Many have come and gone over the years - always someone eager to ride the coat-tails of the legend that is Budd Nedreck!\n\nYou can rest assured that most of them have become wealthy and retired. That's simply not the path I've chosen. You see, I've always felt that I've been called to reveal the world's great mysteries. Alas, if I don't do it, who could?"]="Oh, well, that all depends on which partners you mean. Many have come and gone over the years - always someone eager to ride the coat-tails of the legend that is Budd Nedreck!\n\nYou can rest assured that most of them have become wealthy and retired. That's simply not the path I've chosen. You see, I've always felt that I've been called to reveal the world's great mysteries. Alas, if I don't do it, who could?"
G["Oh, what a beautiful flower over there..."]="Oh, what a beautiful flower over there..."
G["Oh, what a breathtaking flower. You know these are supposed to be lucky?"]="Oh, vá flor mais excepcional. Sabe que dizem que da sorte?"
G["Oh, what a nice outfit you have there. I hadn't noticed before."]="Oh, que conjunto tão bonito. Não me havia dados conta antes."
G["Oh, what a sacred place is here overthrown!"]="Oh, que lugar sagrado é aqui derrubado!"
G["Oh, what has become of the Vale?"]="Oh, que lhe acontecido ao Vale?"
G["Oh, what horrors await...."]="Oh, what horrors await...."
G["Oh, when is my son going to meet a nice young lady? All he does is hang around yaks all day!\n\nWhat girl is going to want a stinky yakherd, huh? Ai-ya, Mama worry so much..."]="Oh, when is my son going to meet a nice young lady? All he does is hang around yaks all day!\n\nWhat girl is going to want a stinky yakherd, huh? Ai-ya, Mama worry so much..."
G["Oh, where does Dooka begin!?\n\nFirst, farmer sows seeds and harvests crops. Vegetables can be used in cooking, sold at market, traded to other buyers, and lots of other stuff. I've even heard of rare seeds that can be planted for special items... like a little pet!\n\nThen there's everyone in Halfhill to meet! The people who live there are real interesting, even to a monkey like me. You give them gifts, make nice friends, and they might give you some nice gifts, too!\n\nAlways plenty to do around the fields!"]="Oh, where does Dooka begin!?\n\nFirst, farmer sows seeds and harvests crops. Vegetables can be used in cooking, sold at market, traded to other buyers, and lots of other stuff. I've even heard of rare seeds that can be planted for special items... like a little pet!\n\nThen there's everyone in Halfhill to meet! The people who live there are real interesting, even to a monkey like me. You give them gifts, make nice friends, and they might give you some nice gifts, too!\n\nAlways plenty to do around the fields!"
G["Oh, where should I begin!?\n\nFirst, the life of a farmer involves sowing seeds and harvesting crops. The crops that you sell can be used in cooking, sold on the auction house, traded to other buyers, or traded for meat and fish. I've even heard of rare seeds that can be planted for unique items... perhaps even a little pet!\n\nThen there's all of Halfhill to explore! The best way to make friends with the locals is to give them gifts, and if you become friends, they might just give you some nice gifts in return.\n\nThere's always plenty to do around the fields, and an extra pair of hands would sure be appreciated."]="Oh, where should I begin!?\n\nFirst, the life of a farmer involves sowing seeds and harvesting crops. The crops that you sell can be used in cooking, sold on the auction house, traded to other buyers, or traded for meat and fish. I've even heard of rare seeds that can be planted for unique items... perhaps even a little pet!\n\nThen there's all of Halfhill to explore! The best way to make friends with the locals is to give them gifts, and if you become friends, they might just give you some nice gifts in return.\n\nThere's always plenty to do around the fields, and an extra pair of hands would sure be appreciated."
G["Oh, who am I kidding? You are a wily one, thief."]="Bah, a quem quero enganar? É um ladrão astuto."
G["Oh, why can't this dang kite go faster?"]="Ah, não poderá ir mais rápido esta cometa?"
G["Oh, why... thank you... you shouldn't have...!"]="Oh, why... thank you... you shouldn't have...!"
G["Oh, why? You interrupted the most pleasant dream..."]="Por que? Tem interrompido um sonho estupendo!"
G["Oh, would you please stop checking your nails and spanking yourself, for one moment?  Really, no one cares!"]="Oh, would you please stop checking your nails and spanking yourself, for one moment?  Really, no one cares!"
G["Oh, wow, is that a naaru they're channeling from?  I feel funny...."]="Oh, vá, é isso um naarus? Me sinto rara..."
G["Oh, ye like me eyepatch now do ya?  Well, just make sure that ya don't have ta be wearing one yerself now $g boyo : girly;."]="Oh, te gosta meu parche, verdade? Bom, certifique-se de não ter que levar um $g rapaz: garota;."
G["Oh, ye want to learn to pick some daisies do ye?  Ha!  I'm just teasing ye $gladdie : lass;.  \nA fine profession it is, and Reyna Stonebranch can show ye how it's done.  She works at the Ironforge Physician on the southern side of The Great Forge."]="Oh, ye want to learn to pick some daisies do ye?  Ha!  I'm just teasing ye $gladdie : lass;.  \nA fine profession it is, and Reyna Stonebranch can show ye how it's done.  She works at the Ironforge Physician on the southern side of The Great Forge."
G["Oh, yeah. I remember you. Let's see what you've learned."]="Ah, sim. Me acordo de ti. Vamos ver o que tem aprendido."
G["Oh, yes I am new to Orgrimmar.  Is it that obvious?"]="Sim, sou nova em Orgrimmar. Tanto se nota?"
G["Oh, yes I am new to Stormwind.  Is it that obvious?"]="Sim, sou nova em Ventobravo. Tanto se nota?"
G["Oh, yes. Hrm. I'm... sorry it wasn't to your liking..."]="Ah, sim. Mm. Sinto... que não te tenha gostado..."
