G["Ohh, of course! The Sunsong place, just over yonder. Was wondering who might be movin' in on that.\n\n<Greenfield squints over your shoulder and waves at Yoon.>\n\nWhen you come back to market with the biggest, juiciest vegetables anyone's ever seen, you tell 'em where you got the seeds!"]="Ohh, of course! The Sunsong place, just over yonder. Was wondering who might be movin' in on that.\n\n<Greenfield squints over your shoulder and waves at Yoon.>\n\nWhen you come back to market with the biggest, juiciest vegetables anyone's ever seen, you tell 'em where you got the seeds!"
G["Ohh, thank you soo much for getting me out of that cage because I was in there for soo long and it smelled like minced mutton that had been sitting out in the sun for a week and I don't like mutton to begin with because when I was little, well littler, I was actually turned into a sheep for a minute and so I know what it feels like to be a sheep and I don't want someone eating me, especially an overgrown troll dressed up like a kitty....\n\n<Ashli takes a deep breath.>\n\nHow's my hair?"]="Ohh, thank you soo much for getting me out of that cage because I was in there for soo long and it smelled like minced mutton that had been sitting out in the sun for a week and I don't like mutton to begin with because when I was little, well littler, I was actually turned into a sheep for a minute and so I know what it feels like to be a sheep and I don't want someone eating me, especially an overgrown troll dressed up like a kitty....\n\n<Ashli takes a deep breath.>\n\nHow's my hair?"
G["Ohh, that. See, there's been nuthin' but orc grog around camp lately.\n\nOrc grog doesn't seem to agree with me, if ya know what I mean...."]="Ohh, that. See, there's been nuthin' but orc grog around camp lately.\n\nOrc grog doesn't seem to agree with me, if ya know what I mean...."
