G["Ok, if your party is ready then I'm ready to fall back and let you continue the defense here. I'll overload the defenses to clear the prison long enough to let us leave and shut the door. After that, it's up to you to protect this door at all costs!"]="Ok, if your party is ready then I'm ready to fall back and let you continue the defense here. I'll overload the defenses to clear the prison long enough to let us leave and shut the door. After that, it's up to you to protect this door at all costs!"
G["Ok, kick the boss on the third cast of the second phase. Always kick the first cast of the first phase but never the second on the first. Unless, you see lightning. If you see lightning - kick anyway. What's so hard about that?"]="Ok, kick the boss on the third cast of the second phase. Always kick the first cast of the first phase but never the second on the first. Unless, you see lightning. If you see lightning - kick anyway. What's so hard about that?"
G["Ok, let me get this straight. You put the scepter shard entrusted to your Flight by Anachronos on a minnow of your own making and now you expect me to build an... an arcanite buoy or something... to force your minnow out of hiding? AND potentially incur the wrath of an Elemental Lord? Did I miss anything? Perhaps I am to do this without any clothes on, during a solar eclipse, on a leap year?"]="Ok, let me get this straight. You put the scepter shard entrusted to your Flight by Anachronos on a minnow of your own making and now you expect me to build an... an arcanite buoy or something... to force your minnow out of hiding? AND potentially incur the wrath of an Elemental Lord? Did I miss anything? Perhaps I am to do this without any clothes on, during a solar eclipse, on a leap year?"
