G["Omega Rune deployed.  Activation successful."]="Omega Rune deployed.  Activation successful."
G["Omega Stance activated. Annihilation of foreign unit is now imminent."]="Omega Stance activated. Annihilation of foreign unit is now imminent."
G["Omen sleeps in the depths of Lake Elune'ara, but may be summoned at the southeast banks near the Stormrage Barrow Dens.  There, you will find special cluster launchers...\n\nUse your rockets in the launchers and Omen's minions will come.  Fire more rockets, nearly three dozen, or fire Elune's candles at his minions, and soon he will awaken."]="Omen sleeps in the depths of Lake Elune'ara, but may be summoned at the southeast banks near the Stormrage Barrow Dens.  There, you will find special cluster launchers...\n\nUse your rockets in the launchers and Omen's minions will come.  Fire more rockets, nearly three dozen, or fire Elune's candles at his minions, and soon he will awaken."
G["On Argus, Mac'Aree was the most sacred of our cities.\n\nWould you believe me if I told you that the walkways were lined with precious minerals? That the rivers glittered even in complete darkness?\n\nI long for those days... How long has it been? A thousand years? Ten-thousand?"]="On Argus, Mac'Aree was the most sacred of our cities.\n\nWould you believe me if I told you that the walkways were lined with precious minerals? That the rivers glittered even in complete darkness?\n\nI long for those days... How long has it been? A thousand years? Ten-thousand?"
G["On Draenor, he was a miserable wretch. The actions of his father hung heavy on his heart."]="Em Draenor, não passava de um infeliz miserável. Os atos do pai pesavam em seu coração."
G["On behalf of all of Ogri'la, we give you thanks for your efforts, $n.\n\n<Chu'a'lor's left head nods while his right head smiles at you.>\n\nAnd do not forget that by helping us here you are also helping to protect our brethren down below whom you have become like a $g king : queen; to."]="On behalf of all of Ogri'la, we give you thanks for your efforts, $n.\n\n<Chu'a'lor's left head nods while his right head smiles at you.>\n\nAnd do not forget that by helping us here you are also helping to protect our brethren down below whom you have become like a $g king : queen; to."
G["On behalf of the Argent Crusade, I welcome you to the Argent Tournament."]="Em nome da Cruzada Argent, eu o recebo no Torneio Argent."
G["On behalf of the Bilgewater Cartel, I lay claim to this mine!"]="On behalf of the Bilgewater Cartel, I lay claim to this mine!"
G["On behalf of the Bilgewater Cartel, allow me to offer a very generous reward to the first person that gets me free of this cage! Of course, standard contractual stipulations apply, but don't worry about the fine print. Just get me out of here!"]="On behalf of the Bilgewater Cartel, allow me to offer a very generous reward to the first person that gets me free of this cage! Of course, standard contractual stipulations apply, but don't worry about the fine print. Just get me out of here!"
G["On behalf of the Royal Apothecary Society, I am pleased to offer you the finest steeds available for the Forsaken.  These beasts have endured trials and tribulations as we all have, and now they too have emerged stronger and more resilient than mere mortal flesh would have had them destined to be!  Please, inspect them for yourself and see."]="Em nome da Sociedade Real de Boticário, tenho o prazer de oferecer a você os melhores corcéis disponíveis para os Renegados. Esses animais sofreram provações e tribulações como todos nós, e agora eles também emergiram mais fortes e resistentes do que a mera carne mortal os teria destinado a ser! Por favor, inspecione-os e veja."
G["On behalf of the Sunreavers, I welcome you to the tournament. The Argent Crusade has asked us to register and train those interested in competing."]="Em nome dos Sunreavers, dou as boas-vindas ao torneio. A Cruzada Argent nos pediu para registrar e treinar os interessados ​​em competir."
G["On behalf of the crew of the Moonspray, I welcome you $c.  I hope you take advantage of our provisions before parting with us."]="Em nome da tripulação do Espuma da Lua, dou a você a boas-vindas $c. Espero que faça uso de nossas provisiones antes de partir."
G["On behalf of the illustrious and always-neutral Steamwheedle Cartel, welcome to Bogpaddle! We're proud to be the only beachfront resort and military-grade weapons yard in the Eastern Kingdoms.\n\nYou guys may have that little war ragin' just south of here, but inside these walls, it's all fun and games. So take a load off, have some R&R and a drink or two, and keep out of trouble... or my bruisers will remind your skull what \"neutral territory\" means."]="On behalf of the illustrious and always-neutral Steamwheedle Cartel, welcome to Bogpaddle! We're proud to be the only beachfront resort and military-grade weapons yard in the Eastern Kingdoms.\n\nYou guys may have that little war ragin' just south of here, but inside these walls, it's all fun and games. So take a load off, have some R&R and a drink or two, and keep out of trouble... or my bruisers will remind your skull what \"neutral territory\" means."
G["On behalf of the illustrious and still neutral Steamwheedle Cartel, I hope you enjoy your stay.\n\nRemember, everyone is welcome in Gadgetzan! Everyone except pirates."]="On behalf of the illustrious and still neutral Steamwheedle Cartel, I hope you enjoy your stay.\n\nRemember, everyone is welcome in Gadgetzan! Everyone except pirates."
G["On darkest wing they fly. Prepare to meet your end!"]="Seu voo é o mais sombrio. Prepare-se para o seu fim!"
G["On duty. GO. AWAY."]="Em serviço. VAI. LONGE."
G["On guard!"]="Em guarda!"
G["On guard, friend. The lady dragon will not give in without a fight."]="On guard, friend. The lady dragon will not give in without a fight."
G["On it!"]="Vai!"
G["On it."]="Agora mesmo."
G["On my flight south from Darnassus to seek out Malfurion Stormrage, I came across these injured refugees from the Ruins of Auberdine.\n\nTheir cause is just and I am helping to heal them, but their injuries are numerous, and it will take time.\n\nI trust that you will be willing to lend them your aid as well."]="On my flight south from Darnassus to seek out Malfurion Stormrage, I came across these injured refugees from the Ruins of Auberdine.\n\nTheir cause is just and I am helping to heal them, but their injuries are numerous, and it will take time.\n\nI trust that you will be willing to lend them your aid as well."
G["On my way down here from Dun Algaz I saw a gnoll hunting Threshadons in the middle of a lake.  If you've never seen a dog try to use a spear, you're in for a treat!"]="On my way down here from Dun Algaz I saw a gnoll hunting Threshadons in the middle of a lake.  If you've never seen a dog try to use a spear, you're in for a treat!"
G["On my way!"]="Estou de caminho!"
G["On my way."]="Me pongo em marcha."
G["On my way. Thank you."]="Vou de caminho. Obrigado."
G["On one knee his love he professed:"]="On one knee his love he professed:"
G["On second thought, Drahga may need help after all! Fall in!"]="Bom, vale, Dragha talvez necesite ajuda depois de tudo! A por eles!"
G["On second thought, I don't care.  Burn in hell wretch!"]="On second thought, I don't care.  Burn in hell wretch!"
G["On second thought, keep the whole bag. I have to, uh, get going."]="Pensándolo bem, fique toda a bolsa. Tenho que, uh, ir embora."
G["On second thought, what fun is an \"adequate\" challenge?"]="Pensándolo melhor, que tem de divertido um desafio \"adequado\"?"
G["On second thought... I think I'll pass."]="Pensándolo melhor... Acho que vou passar."
G["On t' the next one!"]="A pelo seguinte!"
G["On the contrary, my friend."]="Ao contrario, amigo."
G["On the cooked goods front it would appear that we've managed to collect and store away $2092w rainbow fin albacore, out of $2093w requested. Additionally, right now we have in $2098w of $2099w roast raptor and $2101w out of $2103w spotted yellowtail in cold storage."]="Na linha de frente de produtos cozidos, parece que conseguimos coletar e armazenar albacora arco-íris de $2092w, dos $2093w solicitados. Além disso, agora temos $2098w de $2099w de aves de rapina assada e $2101w de $2103w com manchas amarelas em armazenamento a frio."
G["On the corpse of my only child, you miserable son of a pig."]="On the corpse of my only child, you miserable son of a pig."
G["On the east side of Razor Hill, behind the barracks is where you will find Dhugru Gorelust."]="No lado leste de Razor Hill, atrás do quartel é onde você encontrará Dhugru Gorelust."
G["On the matter of war against the rebel tribe of Neferset... has each member of the High Council reached a decision?"]="no assunto da guerra contra a tribo rebelde de Neferset... O Alto Conselho tomou uma decisão?"
G["On the move back up to the eastern pass!"]="On the move back up to the eastern pass!"
G["On the move to the southern pass!"]="On the move to the southern pass!"
G["On the move, men!"]="Em marcha, homens!"
G["On the night of the Brewmoon, water spirits can be found on Inkgill Mere performing a ritual. Over the years we have made offerings to them in return for a vial of pure water used in crafting the Kun-Lai Kicker. I sent Assistant Tart out to the lake but she hasn't come back yet. Can you head to the north and find out what's keeping her, $n?"]="On the night of the Brewmoon, water spirits can be found on Inkgill Mere performing a ritual. Over the years we have made offerings to them in return for a vial of pure water used in crafting the Kun-Lai Kicker. I sent Assistant Tart out to the lake but she hasn't come back yet. Can you head to the north and find out what's keeping her, $n?"
G["On the northern dock, you can board a ship that will carry you to Rut'theran Village and Darnassus.  From the southern dock, you can find passage across the Great Sea to Stormwind Harbor.  The dock to the west, at the end of the pier, leads to Azuremyst Isle, near the Exodar. Safe journeys to you!"]="Na doca norte, você pode embarcar em um navio que o levará a Rut'theran Village e Darnassus. Do cais sul, você pode encontrar uma passagem pelo Grande Mar para o Stormwind Harbour. A doca a oeste, no fim do píer, leva à Ilha Azuremyst, perto do Exodar. Viagens seguras para você!"
G["On the outer ring of the Magic Quarter you'll find a large, stepped building. That's where the mages hide."]="No anel externo do Magic Quarter, você encontrará um grande edifício em degraus. É onde os magos se escondem."
G["On the prowl."]="On the prowl."
G["On the south end of the island is a cave -- a hidden hollow. The grand admiral has holed himself up in there, preparing for the final battle against the Lich King."]="no lado sul da ilha há uma caverna, uma caverna oculta. O Grande almirante se tem escondido aí, preparação para a batalha fim contra o Rei Lich."
G["On the wings of death, I ride."]="On the wings of death, I ride."
G["On this day all Vrykul will shed their old beliefs! We denounce our old gods! All Vrykul will pledge their allegiance to Ymiron! Ymiron will protect our noble race!"]="On this day all Vrykul will shed their old beliefs! We denounce our old gods! All Vrykul will pledge their allegiance to Ymiron! Ymiron will protect our noble race!"
G["On this day, a great burden has been lifted from my chest. My heart swells with pride. And for the first time, I can proudly proclaim who I am. I can finally unleash the fury in my heart."]="Neste dia, meu peito se sente liberado de um grande peso. Meu coração se cheia de orgulho. E, pela primeira vez, posso proclamar aos quatro ventos quem sou. Já posso liberar a fúria de meu coração."
G["On this island I must ask you to face great dangers. Your loyalty and trust are appreciated, $n."]="On this island I must ask you to face great dangers. Your loyalty and trust are appreciated, $n."
G["On ya knees!"]="De joelhos!"
G["On you knees!"]="De joelhos!"
G["On your feet!"]="Em pé!"
G["On your feet! Naga attack!"]="Em pé! Os nagas atacando!"
G["On your feet! Nazgrim is organizing a counter-attack. We're regrouping in the village."]="On your feet! Nazgrim is organizing a counter-attack. We're regrouping in the village."
G["On your feet, boys!"]="Em pé, pessoal!"
G["On your feet, boys! Move, move move!"]="Em pé, pessoal! Vamos, vamos, vamos!"
G["On your feet, men! Move, move move!"]="Em pé, homens! Vamos, vamos, vamos!"
G["On your feet, soldier. The ancients are with us, and the mountain is healed!"]="Em pé, soldado. Os ancestrais estão conosco e a montanha tem sanado!"
G["On your first try! Now, take the flame to the top of the temple and burn the scroll that you find there."]="On your first try! Now, take the flame to the top of the temple and burn the scroll that you find there."
G["On your guard marines!"]="On your guard marines!"
G["On your guard!"]="Em guarda!"
G["On your guard, $n!"]="Em guarda, $n!"
G["On your guard, invaders. I, Ta'yak, Lord of Blades, will be your opponent."]="On your guard, invaders. I, Ta'yak, Lord of Blades, will be your opponent."
G["On your knees!"]="De joelhos!"
G["On your word, commander."]="Quando ordens, comandante."
G["Once Hamuul and Malfurion arrive, we shall begin..."]="Once Hamuul and Malfurion arrive, we shall begin..."
G["Once I welcomed darkness, for it was the sister of night. Now it is dark all the time, even during the day, and the forests cry out for sustenance. Unless we act soon, this spreading blight will cover the world."]="Certa vez, acolhi a escuridão, pois era a irmã da noite. Agora está escuro o tempo tudo, mesmo durante o dia, e as florestas clamam por sustento. A menos que ajamos em breve, essa praga se espalhará cobrirá o mundo."
G["Once I've hacked off your limbs, I may hang your body from our battlements."]="Once I've hacked off your limbs, I may hang your body from our battlements."
G["Once I've perfected the infusing process, the power of Y'Shaarj will make us unstoppable!"]="Once I've perfected the infusing process, the power of Y'Shaarj will make us unstoppable!"
G["Once a customer is done eating, the seat they were using will need to be cleaned. Just click on them and I'll go clean up."]="Once a customer is done eating, the seat they were using will need to be cleaned. Just click on them and I'll go clean up."
G["Once a great city of the night elves, the Highborne once ruled there, practicing great and powerful arcane magics. They are cursed now, haunting the lands, and their ruined city has been victimized by the Spitelash naga. I understand that the naga search the ruins for powerful Highborne artifacts."]="Outrora uma grande cidade dos elfos noturnos, os Altaneiros uma vez governaram lá, praticando grandes e poderosas magias arcanas. Eles são amaldiçoados agora, assombrando as terras, e sua cidade em ruínas foi vitimada pelos nagas Spitelash. Entendo que os nagas pesquisam nas ruínas por poderosos artefatos dos Altaneiros."
G["Once a match starts there's two ways out: WIN OR DIE! Fleeing is not an option!"]="Once a match starts there's two ways out: WIN OR DIE! Fleeing is not an option!"
G["Once a thief, I am now a servant of the Stars."]="Once a thief, I am now a servant of the Stars."
G["Once again you have impressed me, $n. Without your aid, we would have not made it this far. Walk with me..."]="Once again you have impressed me, $n. Without your aid, we would have not made it this far. Walk with me..."
G["Once again, all soldiers of Lordaeron are ordered to immediately report to the entrance of Stratholme, and await further instructions from Prince Arthas."]="Once again, all soldiers of Lordaeron are ordered to immediately report to the entrance of Stratholme, and await further instructions from Prince Arthas."
G["Once again, we will show this Burning Legion that our world is not for the taking!"]="Once again, we will show this Burning Legion that our world is not for the taking!"
G["Once again, you must defend me. Rotun, give us a challenge this time."]="Mais uma vez, é necessário me defender. Rotun, manda brasa agora!"
G["Once all this strife is behind us, I think I'll retire to Durotar.\n\nA nice little shack on a hill. Maybe a little garden.\n\nYeah, that sounds nice."]="Once all this strife is behind us, I think I'll retire to Durotar.\n\nA nice little shack on a hill. Maybe a little garden.\n\nYeah, that sounds nice."
G["Once da high priest is dead and da coast is clear, let me know and I be returnin' to the blood guard wit' my report."]="Quando o sumo sacerdote estiver morto e o litoral estiver limpo, avise-me e voltarei ao guarda de sangue com meu relatório."
G["Once he has done so, tell him to leave this land in peace. He does not belong here."]="Quando tenha feito isso, diga que deje esta terra em paz. Não pinta nada aqui."
G["Once in a while we'll come up against a lone orc that stands between us and victory. Chloroform is often best used in those situations. Just remember to apply chloroform we have to be behind the enemy."]="Once in a while we'll come up against a lone orc that stands between us and victory. Chloroform is often best used in those situations. Just remember to apply chloroform we have to be behind the enemy."
G["Once inside, we sabotage the Zandalari ship. In the chaos, we will slip into the courtyard and open the gates from within."]="Once inside, we sabotage the Zandalari ship. In the chaos, we will slip into the courtyard and open the gates from within."
G["Once more I apologize, but you chose this fate."]="Pido perdão novamente, mas você escolheu este destino."
G["Once more shall the twisted flesh-banners of N'Zoth chitter and howl above the fly-blown corpse of this world. After millennia, we have returned."]="Once more shall the twisted flesh-banners of N'Zoth chitter and howl above the fly-blown corpse of this world. After millennia, we have returned."
G["Once more we fight for our master."]="Lutamos uma vez mais por nosso mestre."
G["Once more we hear your call, Khufu. We have wisdom for you and $n. You face great peril and must act swiftly or you all and Har'koa will die."]="Once more we hear your call, Khufu. We have wisdom for you and $n. You face great peril and must act swiftly or you all and Har'koa will die."
G["Once more, thank you for your assistance with the cursed Lost Ones.  Without your help I would never have been able to continue my research."]="Mais uma vez, Obrigado pela sua assistência com os amaldiçoados perdidos. Sem à sua ajuda, eu nunca seria capaz de seguir minha pesquisa."
G["Once more... the dawn..."]="Once more... the dawn..."
G["Once our warchief heard that the Dark Portal had been reopened, he immediately gathered his advisors to plan this daring expedition. Though a few of his councilors have their doubts, Thrall holds out the hope that we might discover new insights into the history of our people. He believes that somewhere amidst the wreckage of this world, the true tale of the orcish people lies hidden.\n\nI must admit that in my darkest moments... I fear that that tale should remain untold."]="Once our warchief heard that the Dark Portal had been reopened, he immediately gathered his advisors to plan this daring expedition. Though a few of his councilors have their doubts, Thrall holds out the hope that we might discover new insights into the history of our people. He believes that somewhere amidst the wreckage of this world, the true tale of the orcish people lies hidden.\n\nI must admit that in my darkest moments... I fear that that tale should remain untold."
G["Once seated, a customer will wait a short while for you to deliver their noodle soup. As with waiting in line, be sure to get the customer their food before they decide to leave."]="Once seated, a customer will wait a short while for you to deliver their noodle soup. As with waiting in line, be sure to get the customer their food before they decide to leave."
G["Once the White Pawn is recovered, the full might of our navy can engage the Horde. On OUR terms."]="Once the White Pawn is recovered, the full might of our navy can engage the Horde. On OUR terms."
G["Once the capital city of the Dark Iron dwarves, this volcanic labyrinth now serves as the seat of power for Ragnaros the Firelord. Ragnaros has uncovered the secret to creating life from stone and plans to build an army of unstoppable golems to aid him in conquering the whole of Blackrock Mountain. Obsessed with defeating Nefarian and his draconic minions, Ragnaros will go to any extreme to achieve final victory."]="Once the capital city of the Dark Iron dwarves, this volcanic labyrinth now serves as the seat of power for Ragnaros the Firelord. Ragnaros has uncovered the secret to creating life from stone and plans to build an army of unstoppable golems to aid him in conquering the whole of Blackrock Mountain. Obsessed with defeating Nefarian and his draconic minions, Ragnaros will go to any extreme to achieve final victory."
G["Once the detonator goes off in... err... NOW!"]="Depois que o detonador estalhe em... isto... JÁ!"
G["Once the greatest gold production center in the human lands, the Dead Mines are now inhabited by the Defias Brotherhood, who have turned the dark tunnels into their private sanctum. It is rumored that the thieves have conscripted the clever goblins to help them build something terrible at the bottom of the mines - but what that may be is still uncertain. Rumor has it that the way into the Deadmines lies through the quiet, unassuming village of Moonbrook."]="Once the greatest gold production center in the human lands, the Dead Mines are now inhabited by the Defias Brotherhood, who have turned the dark tunnels into their private sanctum. It is rumored that the thieves have conscripted the clever goblins to help them build something terrible at the bottom of the mines - but what that may be is still uncertain. Rumor has it that the way into the Deadmines lies through the quiet, unassuming village of Moonbrook."
G["Once the hatred in my heart became focused, everything became clear to me.  Shattrath must be destroyed and the naaru with it."]="Quando o ódio de meu coração se centró, o tive tudo claro. Havia que destruir Shattrath e, com ela, aos naarus."
G["Once the incision is made, the blood flows quickly."]="Uma vez realizada a incisão, o sangue fluye rapidamente."
G["Once the jewel of northern Lordaeron, the city of Stratholme is where Prince Arthas turned against his mentor, Uther Lightbringer, and slaughtered hundreds of his own subjects who were believed to have contracted the plague of undeath. Arthas' surrender to the Lich King soon followed. The broken city is now inhabited by the undead Scourge - led by the powerful lich, Kel'Thuzad, and a contingent of Scarlet Crusaders, led by Grand Crusader Dathrohan. The two sides are locked in constant, violent combat."]="Once the jewel of northern Lordaeron, the city of Stratholme is where Prince Arthas turned against his mentor, Uther Lightbringer, and slaughtered hundreds of his own subjects who were believed to have contracted the plague of undeath. Arthas' surrender to the Lich King soon followed. The broken city is now inhabited by the undead Scourge - led by the powerful lich, Kel'Thuzad, and a contingent of Scarlet Crusaders, led by Grand Crusader Dathrohan. The two sides are locked in constant, violent combat."
G["Once the system activates, you will be required to manually\n maintain your demolisher."]="Uma vez ativado o sistema, deverá realizar\n um mantenimento manual do demoledor."
G["Once the system activates, you will be required to manually\n respond to emergencies that occur within the engine."]="Uma vez ativado o sistema, deverá responder\n manualmente às emergências que afecten ao motor."
G["Once the totem of Kar'dash is ours, we will raze your cities and rebuild them as our own."]="Quando o totem de Kar'dash seja nosso, arrasaremos suas cidades e as reconstruiremos como as nossas."
G["Once the trap is sprung no one gets in or out until the people trapped are completely drained of life. Mogu are evil."]="Quando a armadilha se ativa, ninguém pode entrar nem sair até que as pessoas atrapadas restam vazias de vida. Os mogu são malignos."
G["Once the world was small enough, I started to hunt for Deathwing in the clouds.\n\n|TInterface\\Icons\\spell_frost_arcticwinds.blp:32|t"]="Quando o mundo foi o bastante pequeno, empecé a dar caça a Alamuerte pelas nuvens.\n\n|TInterface\\Icons\\spell_frost_arcticwinds.blp:32|t"
G["Once they're dealt with we can dedicate more resources to the war effort."]="Assim que nos tenhamos ocupado de eles, poderemos seguir trabalhando pela campanha."
G["Once this ritual ceases, we will not be able to resume it, and the corruption will remain at full strength. Your courage is admirable, but if you fail, we are all doomed. Do you understand what you ask? Do you understand the consequences?"]="Once this ritual ceases, we will not be able to resume it, and the corruption will remain at full strength. Your courage is admirable, but if you fail, we are all doomed. Do you understand what you ask? Do you understand the consequences?"
G["Once upon a time - moments ago, in fact - a great king sought the help from a trio of powerful dwarves: The Council of Three Hammers."]="Era uma vez — momentos atrás, na verdade — um grande rei que buscou a ajuda de um trio de poderosos anões: o Conselho dos Três Martelos."
G["Once we are all free, we shall fly with you through Grim Batol!"]="Once we are all free, we shall fly with you through Grim Batol!"
G["Once we capture the underground railway and loading dock, we'll use them to make a rapid attack on the heart of the city."]="Once we capture the underground railway and loading dock, we'll use them to make a rapid attack on the heart of the city."
G["Once we defeat the Alliance and their allies, claiming this land will be a fitting testimony to the tenacity of the Horde."]="Once we defeat the Alliance and their allies, claiming this land will be a fitting testimony to the tenacity of the Horde."
G["Once we get rid of these spirits, we can move on."]="Quando nos libremos de estes espíritos poderemos seguir adiante."
G["Once we open this portal, we will be able to travel much more quickly between here and the garrison."]="Once we open this portal, we will be able to travel much more quickly between here and the garrison."
G["Once ye've seen one trogg, ye've seen 'em all."]="Visto um trogg, vistos todos!"
G["Once you are of revered standing with the Golden Lotus, you will be able to help the August Celestials.\n\nTo the east, Yu'lon's temple is under attack by the Sha of Doubt.\n\nTo the south, Chi-Ji's trainees are rebuilding and retraining after the attack on their temple.\n\nTo the north, Xuen tests the might of worthy combatants who enter his rings.\n\nAnd to the west, Niuzao stands vigilantly against some of the most dangerous enemies in Pandaria."]="Once you are of revered standing with the Golden Lotus, you will be able to help the August Celestials.\n\nTo the east, Yu'lon's temple is under attack by the Sha of Doubt.\n\nTo the south, Chi-Ji's trainees are rebuilding and retraining after the attack on their temple.\n\nTo the north, Xuen tests the might of worthy combatants who enter his rings.\n\nAnd to the west, Niuzao stands vigilantly against some of the most dangerous enemies in Pandaria."
G["Once you die from the torture, we will go out and kidnap another of your kind. One of you is bound to crack under the pain and give us the information we need."]="Once you die from the torture, we will go out and kidnap another of your kind. One of you is bound to crack under the pain and give us the information we need."
G["Once you enter the Order of the Cloud Serpent, you will begin the journey of a serpent rider.\n\nYou will raise a baby serpent from the egg, train with it every day, and watch it grow to adulthood."]="Once you enter the Order of the Cloud Serpent, you will begin the journey of a serpent rider.\n\nYou will raise a baby serpent from the egg, train with it every day, and watch it grow to adulthood."
G["Once you go shaman, you don't go back.\n\nI completely underestimated the usefulness of fire elementals. Easy to discipline too: just add water."]="Once you go shaman, you don't go back.\n\nI completely underestimated the usefulness of fire elementals. Easy to discipline too: just add water."
G["Once you have built the device, you simply activate the device to be transported to Toshley's Station!    A few people have reported being transformed into chickens, but I am sure they were exaggerating!\nIf possible I would try and not use the device on a day when someone else has, but it will probably work out alright even if you do!"]="Once you have built the device, you simply activate the device to be transported to Toshley's Station!    A few people have reported being transformed into chickens, but I am sure they were exaggerating!\nIf possible I would try and not use the device on a day when someone else has, but it will probably work out alright even if you do!"
G["Once you have built the device, you simply activate the device to be whisked away to lovely Gadgetzan!    Nearly everyone who has used the device has arrived on the pad here looking just the way they did when they began!\nThere have been some reported problems with transportees being replaced by their evil selves from an alternate universe, but I'm sure we will have that worked out soon..."]="Once you have built the device, you simply activate the device to be whisked away to lovely Gadgetzan!    Nearly everyone who has used the device has arrived on the pad here looking just the way they did when they began!\nThere have been some reported problems with transportees being replaced by their evil selves from an alternate universe, but I'm sure we will have that worked out soon..."
G["Once you have defeated them, help your allies collect Jungle Brew for Bo!"]="Quando tenha terminado com eles, ajuda aos seus aliados a reunir mistura de selva para Bo!"
G["Once you have delivered supplies, your work is not done. Do your best to keep our resources topped off."]="Não basta com entregar suprimentos. Esfuérzate em manter uma reserva de recurso."
G["Once you have earned the respect of his majesty, the Black Prince, then you will have earned mine. Complete more of his tasks.\n\nUntil then, begone. I have nothing to sell to you."]="Once you have earned the respect of his majesty, the Black Prince, then you will have earned mine. Complete more of his tasks.\n\nUntil then, begone. I have nothing to sell to you."
G["Once you have learned to control your own actions, you must learn to control your opponent to gain the upper hand.  A slowed opponent allows you more time to attack, which can mean the difference between victory and defeat."]="Quando tenha aprendido a controlar seus próprios actos, terá que aprender a controlar os do seu oponente para ter vantagem. Um oponente desacelerado te da mais tempo para atacar, o que pode supor a diferença entre a vitória e a derrota."
G["Once you have met the various factions in Pandaria, work orders will pour in."]="Once you have met the various factions in Pandaria, work orders will pour in."
G["Once you start loosening the reins on the ram, you'll see his speed change. He starts off walking. Ease up on the reins a bit more and he'll start to trot. Give him more slack on the reins while he's trotting and he'll go into a canter. Give him even more slack while he's in a canter and you will send him into a gallop."]="Once you start loosening the reins on the ram, you'll see his speed change. He starts off walking. Ease up on the reins a bit more and he'll start to trot. Give him more slack on the reins while he's trotting and he'll go into a canter. Give him even more slack while he's in a canter and you will send him into a gallop."
G["Once your wounded are gathered, you can thank me by leaving."]="Once your wounded are gathered, you can thank me by leaving."
G["Once, I brained an opponent who was stunned to see that my pants had fallen down during battle. He wasn't looking where he should have been."]="Once, I brained an opponent who was stunned to see that my pants had fallen down during battle. He wasn't looking where he should have been."
G["Once, I had a home in the lush woods of Quel'Thalas. Once, I had a family, a husband... children. Once, I was alive and one with the world. The Lich King took all of that away from me in the blink of an eye.\n\nThough I have not the power to strike at him directly, I will pay him back threefold!"]="Once, I had a home in the lush woods of Quel'Thalas. Once, I had a family, a husband... children. Once, I was alive and one with the world. The Lich King took all of that away from me in the blink of an eye.\n\nThough I have not the power to strike at him directly, I will pay him back threefold!"
G["Once, it is true, I was human. What might otherwise be a shortcoming works to our advantage, $n, for I know human weaknesses intimately."]="Once, it is true, I was human. What might otherwise be a shortcoming works to our advantage, $n, for I know human weaknesses intimately."
G["Once, jinyu ruled all of Pandaria from this place, from this seat of power.\n\nWe must learn all that we can from the histories, so that we may once again regain our ancient wisdom."]="Once, jinyu ruled all of Pandaria from this place, from this seat of power.\n\nWe must learn all that we can from the histories, so that we may once again regain our ancient wisdom."
G["Once, the Titans used these life-giving waters to create and shape all life in Pandaria."]="Once, the Titans used these life-giving waters to create and shape all life in Pandaria."
G["Once, the mogu enslaved all of the races of Pandaria, and bent them to their nefarious will."]="Once, the mogu enslaved all of the races of Pandaria, and bent them to their nefarious will."
G["Once, these crypts were sacred to my people. They held our loved ones' spirits. A great many people traveled long distances here on pilgrimages.\n\nThose times are long gone. Something has taken a hold of the Auchenai that used to care so deeply for the deceased. Please, you must help before the spirits tear the crypt apart."]="Once, these crypts were sacred to my people. They held our loved ones' spirits. A great many people traveled long distances here on pilgrimages.\n\nThose times are long gone. Something has taken a hold of the Auchenai that used to care so deeply for the deceased. Please, you must help before the spirits tear the crypt apart."
G["Once, when I was young, I dreamt of ending this war against the hozen. Now, I fear I will not see such a day before my death."]="Once, when I was young, I dreamt of ending this war against the hozen. Now, I fear I will not see such a day before my death."
G["One Centrifuge Construct remains.  We must find and destroy it to disable Varos Cloudstrider's protective shield.  The construct should be about halfway up The Oculus, on the Band of Acceleration."]="One Centrifuge Construct remains.  We must find and destroy it to disable Varos Cloudstrider's protective shield.  The construct should be about halfway up The Oculus, on the Band of Acceleration."
G["One Samophlange to rule them all!"]="One Samophlange to rule them all!"
G["One a dem lizard-beasts. Fight on me bruddahs!"]="One a dem lizard-beasts. Fight on me bruddahs!"
G["One a dem lizard-beasts. Fight on, me bruddahs!"]="One a dem lizard-beasts. Fight on, me bruddahs!"
G["One among us will ascend on this day."]="Um dos nós ascenderá hoje."
G["One approaches Morulu..."]="Alguém se aproxima a Morulu..."
G["One bright light appears accross the room, then disppears. Then you notice another beam... and then another.\n\nThey seem to be showing you a pattern."]="Uma luz brilhante aparecem na habitação e depois volta a desaparecer. Depois adviertes outro raio... e depois outro.\n\nAo parecer, te querem mostrar algo utilizando um patrono."
G["One by one the secrets of an ancient empire were laid bare."]="Um por um, os segredos de um império ancestral foram desvendados."
G["One by one, I overcame them - and buried them deep within the earth."]="Um por um, eu os superei — e os enterrei bem fundo na terra."
G["One by one, nearly everyone involved in this matter has fallen prey to these spectres.  I'll understand if you decide to walk away from this, $n."]="One by one, nearly everyone involved in this matter has fallen prey to these spectres.  I'll understand if you decide to walk away from this, $n."
G["One by one... our enemies will perish!  One by one... they will be destroyed!"]="One by one... our enemies will perish!  One by one... they will be destroyed!"
G["One can learn to fish near the enchanted fountain in the Eventide, a square in southern Dalaran."]="Pode-se aprender a pescar perto da fonte encantada no Eventide, uma praça no sul de Dalaran."
G["One can learn volumes about a culture by studying its refuse."]="One can learn volumes about a culture by studying its refuse."
G["One can only grow from their defeats."]="Um somente pode crescer com os seus derrotas."
G["One cannot break Pandaria.\n\nOne can only break one's self upon Pandaria."]="One cannot break Pandaria.\n\nOne can only break one's self upon Pandaria."
G["One cannot simply FLY into Gilneas City!"]="Não se entrar voando assim como assim em Guilnéas!"
G["One day I'll be a real boy."]="Um dia serei um ninho de verdade."
G["One day I'm going to explore the whole world, and my pets are coming with me!"]="One day I'm going to explore the whole world, and my pets are coming with me!"
G["One day maybe you can be Soo-dryskin. Like?"]="Talvez um dia possa ser Soo-pelesseca. Te gosta?"
G["One day soon, my friend, you will carry an Ogri'la crystal, as I do.  Then you will come to a greater understanding of the world around you."]="One day soon, my friend, you will carry an Ogri'la crystal, as I do.  Then you will come to a greater understanding of the world around you."
G["One day you will have to teach me your secrets."]="One day you will have to teach me your secrets."
G["One day, I, too, will ascend."]="Um dia eu também subirei."
G["One day, Rejek be mighty warrior."]="Um dia, Rejek seja um poderoso guerreiro."
G["One day, The Wolf was very hungry, so he ran east to look for some food."]="One day, The Wolf was very hungry, so he ran east to look for some food."
G["One day, a father grew tired of his young cub's misbehavior.  \"You act just like a hozen!\" the father scolded. Still, his son misbehaved."]="Um dia, um pai se fartou do comportamento do filhote. \"Você age como um hozen!\", o pai ralhou. Mas seu filho ainda se comportava mal."
G["One day, a hero will rise and lift the orcs up to their former glory."]="One day, a hero will rise and lift the orcs up to their former glory."
G["One day, the beloved monk issued a challenge to his fellow slaves. \"Hit me!\" he called out."]="Um dia, nosso amado monge emitiu um desafio aos seus companheiros escravos. \"Me batam!\", ele pediu aos seus irmãos."
G["One day, we will rule this dark temple."]="Alguns dia dominaremos este Templo Sombrio."
G["One day...I will have my revenge..."]="One day...I will have my revenge..."
G["One down!"]="Cai um!"
G["One down, one to go!"]="Tem caído um, ocorrida outro!"
G["One empty cage.  One troll lost to the pit.  Do any of you other trolls need more convincing?"]="One empty cage.  One troll lost to the pit.  Do any of you other trolls need more convincing?"
G["One fewer of these pests behind the blockade."]="One fewer of these pests behind the blockade."
G["One final cell remains. Yes, O great one, right away!"]="Fica uma cela. Sim, oh, magno, agora mesmo!"
G["One final... embrace."]="Um último... abraço."
G["One fire burns for lives at their end; their work may be done, but their contribution eternal."]="Uma chama arde pelas vidas que chegam ao seu fim; seu trabalho talvez estiver feito, mas seu contribuição será eterna."
G["One fire burns for lives born anew; the passion of youth and the energy they bear."]="One fire burns for lives born anew; the passion of youth and the energy they bear."
G["One fire burns for lives in their prime; struggling to make and reshape the world."]="Uma chama arde pelas vidas em tudo seu esplendor; que luchan por criar e remodelar o mundo."
G["One fire burns for lives long lost; their essence now shared with all living things."]="One fire burns for lives long lost; their essence now shared with all living things."
G["One fire burns for lives to come; nascent souls awakening in the womb."]="One fire burns for lives to come; nascent souls awakening in the womb."
G["One fog beast remains."]="Fica uma fera de névoa."
G["One gains little wisdom from speaking. One gains much wisdom from listening."]="One gains little wisdom from speaking. One gains much wisdom from listening."
G["One has opened up on the Tradesman's Terrace.  If you take the path leading Southeast from the bank, it should be easy to find."]="Um deles abriu no Terraço do Comerciante. Se você pegar o caminho que leva ao sudeste do banco, deve ser fácil encontrá-o."
G["One healthy kypari remains, far to the southwest, but the Empress's slaves are destroying it as we speak."]="One healthy kypari remains, far to the southwest, but the Empress's slaves are destroying it as we speak."
G["One is such a lonely number."]="O um é um número tão solitário."
G["One keg?! I was carrying one keg with ease when I was a young cub, barely higher than your knee!"]="Um barril?! Já levava um barril sem problemas quando era um filhote que apenas te lhegaría à joelho."
G["One last drink before we head to the front?"]="Um último trago antes de ir ao linha de frente?"
G["One last favor from old Zuni."]="Um último favo' do velho Zuni."
G["One last impersonation.  It's tough, but let's see if you can guess who it is..."]="One last impersonation.  It's tough, but let's see if you can guess who it is..."
G["One less cultist for us to worry about."]="One less cultist for us to worry about."
G["One less cultist to worry about."]="One less cultist to worry about."
G["One less demon to contend with!"]="One less demon to contend with!"
G["One less enemy of the master!"]="Um inimigo do mestre menos!"
G["One less obstacle in our way!"]="One less obstacle in our way!"
G["One less obstacle to deal with."]="One less obstacle to deal with."
G["One less threat to the timeways!"]="Uma ameaça menos para os portais do tempo!"
G["One minute until the Arena battle begins!"]="Um minuto até que dé início a batalha em arena!"
G["One minute!? Come on, Brann! Think!"]="Um minuto?! Vamos, Brann! Acha!"
G["One moment while I stitch this together..."]="um momento, enquanto coso isto..."
G["One moment, $n..."]="um momento, $n…"
G["One more beast saved from certain death!"]="Outra fera salvada de uma morte certa."
G["One more bottle?  I don't see any reason why not!"]="Outro garrafa mais? Não vejo por que não!"
G["One more down!"]="Outro que tem caído!"
G["One more elemental to go! The door is almost open!"]="Um elemental mais e pronto! A porta está quase aberta!"
G["One more for dinner this evening."]="Outro para a cena de hoje."
G["One more lock of scourge hair gained, one more shred of dignity lost...."]="One more lock of scourge hair gained, one more shred of dignity lost...."
G["One more minute!  Hold on now, the ritual is about to take hold!"]="Um minuto mais! Aguanta um pouco, o ritual está cobrando força!"
G["One more sip of the ol' fire water and I'll be ready to talk. Hiccup! Cheers!"]="Um traguito mais do velho aguardente e estarei pronto para falar. Hip! Vida!"
G["One more slave for the Lich King."]="Outro escravo mais para o Rei Lich."
G["One more thing.  We've arranged for one of our own to accompany you."]="Uma coisa mais. Temos decidido que um dos nós te acompanhará."
G["One more word out of you and so help me..."]="Como digas uma palavra mais sobre me ajudar..."
G["One more, Kat."]="Outra vez, Kat."
G["One note stands out from the other various pieces of parchment that are tacked onto this wanted poster.  It's a call to slay the bonelashers of the Bone Wastes."]="Uma nota se destaca das outras várias peças de pergaminho que estão pregadas neste pôster de procurado. É um chamado para matar os destruidores de ossos dos Desperdícios de Ossos."
G["One of Clay's catapult teams is broken down on the front. $n, I need you to get some parts from him and get that catapult back in the fight!"]="One of Clay's catapult teams is broken down on the front. $n, I need you to get some parts from him and get that catapult back in the fight!"
G["One of Darnassus' Highborne, an Arcane Reforger, is working with the Exodar's enchanters.  You'll find them all in the Crystal Hall, opposite the jewel crafters."]="One of Darnassus' Highborne, an Arcane Reforger, is working with the Exodar's enchanters.  You'll find them all in the Crystal Hall, opposite the jewel crafters."
G["One of my ancestors took part in the uprising at Tu Shen, and now lies among the graves.  I would pay my respects if only I could, but the spirits there know no peace."]="One of my ancestors took part in the uprising at Tu Shen, and now lies among the graves.  I would pay my respects if only I could, but the spirits there know no peace."
G["One of our best sentinels was on his trail - we assume it's a \"he\" - but it appears that she was discovered."]="One of our best sentinels was on his trail - we assume it's a \"he\" - but it appears that she was discovered."
G["One of our merchants has gone missing!"]="One of our merchants has gone missing!"
G["One of our scouts is reporting that a shadowy group has moved into the ruins of Grangol'var Village.  Oops, this report is over a week old."]="One of our scouts is reporting that a shadowy group has moved into the ruins of Grangol'var Village.  Oops, this report is over a week old."
G["One of our warriors broke free and smashed many of the prisons... we were free - at least for a moment.\n\nSome swam up towards the surface... some saw this cave and swam for it.\n\nI'm the only one that lived...."]="One of our warriors broke free and smashed many of the prisons... we were free - at least for a moment.\n\nSome swam up towards the surface... some saw this cave and swam for it.\n\nI'm the only one that lived...."
G["One of the Ash'ari Crystals has been destroyed!  Slay the intruders!"]="One of the Ash'ari Crystals has been destroyed!  Slay the intruders!"
G["One of the Gilneans, Vitus  Darkwalker, can help you. Find him at the Howling Oak."]="One of the Gilneans, Vitus  Darkwalker, can help you. Find him at the Howling Oak."
G["One of the children swears up and down they saw a cross between a shark and an octopus the other day.\n\nI know there are a lot of strange things in the ocean but that seems extra silly to me."]="One of the children swears up and down they saw a cross between a shark and an octopus the other day.\n\nI know there are a lot of strange things in the ocean but that seems extra silly to me."
G["One of the cultists seems to have stumbled onto my blade and died... can I have a new disguise? I promise that I will be more careful this time."]="Um dos cultistas parece ter tropeçado na minha lâmina e morreu... posso ter um novo disfarce? Eu prometo que vou ter mais cuidado desta vez."
G["One of the druids? Our people don't walk that path... but you are in luck. A tauren woman - at least, I believe it's a woman - has set up a modest residence on the north end of the Walk of Elders. Harene Plainwalker is her name."]="One of the druids? Our people don't walk that path... but you are in luck. A tauren woman - at least, I believe it's a woman - has set up a modest residence on the north end of the Walk of Elders. Harene Plainwalker is her name."
G["One of the fiercest $cs on the field of battle, we present $n."]="One of the fiercest $cs on the field of battle, we present $n."
G["One of the humans has the key to this infernal contraption. Eston I think they said his name was."]="Um dos humanos tem a chave dessa geringonça infernal. Eston, acho que eles disseram que o nome dele era."
G["One of the initiates pulled a prank on me the other day. He said I was supposed to sniff his \"healing mists\". There was nothing healing about that mist."]="One of the initiates pulled a prank on me the other day. He said I was supposed to sniff his \"healing mists\". There was nothing healing about that mist."
G["One of the mountaineers has seen something. Keep your eyes open!"]="One of the mountaineers has seen something. Keep your eyes open!"
G["One of them flies higher than the others... He loops far out over the water - alone. He is over-extending. That is our in."]="Um dos eles voe mais alto e se aleja somente, sobre a água. Está o bastante longe dos mais. É nossa oportunidade."
G["One of them has the key. Find it and get me out of here!"]="One of them has the key. Find it and get me out of here!"
G["One of them has the key. Find it and get me out of this cage!"]="One of them has the key. Find it and get me out of this cage!"
G["One of these days I'm going to bust out the crystalline doomhammer and go positively orc on this town. Then they'll be sorry..."]="One of these days I'm going to bust out the crystalline doomhammer and go positively orc on this town. Then they'll be sorry..."
G["One of these days I'm gonna drown him in that blue robe. And all his brooms too."]="One of these days I'm gonna drown him in that blue robe. And all his brooms too."
G["One of these days we're going to have to talk about you joining my group, $n."]="One of these days we're going to have to talk about you joining my group, $n."
G["One of these is BOUND to get through!"]="Uma das estas precisa passar!"
G["One of these smoke bombs will blind a sentry totem."]="One of these smoke bombs will blind a sentry totem."
G["One of those blasted Jaedenar demons saw me! Gave me a good slash in the side. The wound isn't pretty, but I'll live.\n\nThere are more urgent matters at hand, like stopping the Shadow Council from launching a full-scale attack on our friends at Wildheart Point. I'm in no shape to fight, so you'll have to go in my place."]="One of those blasted Jaedenar demons saw me! Gave me a good slash in the side. The wound isn't pretty, but I'll live.\n\nThere are more urgent matters at hand, like stopping the Shadow Council from launching a full-scale attack on our friends at Wildheart Point. I'm in no shape to fight, so you'll have to go in my place."
G["One of you man da guns, the rest on foot."]="One of you man da guns, the rest on foot."
G["One of you, stay with me to keep the cauldron safe. The others, go find some Unga Jungle Brew and bring it back!"]="One of you, stay with me to keep the cauldron safe. The others, go find some Unga Jungle Brew and bring it back!"
G["One order at a time please."]="Um pedido cada vez, por favor."
G["One pitiful wretch down. Go on, take another one!"]="Um desgraciado menos. Adiante, a por outro!"
G["One problem at a time, people. Focus on the Zandalari!"]="Vamos passo a passo. Primeiro os Zandalari!"
G["One red sash that ye can put on yer head or your britches. Pride o' the fleet, that sash is..."]="Uma faixa vermelha que pode colocar na cabeça ou nos calzones. Essa faixa é o orgulho da frota..."
G["One set of trolls dealt with, one yet to go. You have no idea how much I appreciate what you're doing, $n! Before you came along I didn't think we'd ever get the Shadowpine problem under control."]="One set of trolls dealt with, one yet to go. You have no idea how much I appreciate what you're doing, $n! Before you came along I didn't think we'd ever get the Shadowpine problem under control."
G["One shoeshine coming up!"]="Marchando outra limpeza de sapatos!"
G["One shot, one kill!"]="Um disparo, uma morte!"
G["One sip of my brews and you will see how unworthy you really are."]="One sip of my brews and you will see how unworthy you really are."
G["One statue in particular stood out. I had never seen a creature like this."]="Uma em concreto me chamou a atenção. Nunca havia visto uma criatura tamanha."
G["One step closer to victory!"]="Estamos um passo mais perto da vitória!"
G["One step closer."]="Um passo mais perto."
G["One step closer..."]="Um passo mais perto..."
G["One technique alone is not enough."]="Uma sozinha técnica não basta."
G["One thing I have learned from the sha. They know how to prey on our weaknesses."]="One thing I have learned from the sha. They know how to prey on our weaknesses."
G["One thing is clear. Our future will be affected by you and your people."]="Uma coisa está clara. Nosso futuro se verá afetado por você e pelo seu povo."
G["One thousand blades!"]="One thousand blades!"
G["One time, Keeshan told me that he could take on five of me at once. Why am I so weak?"]="One time, Keeshan told me that he could take on five of me at once. Why am I so weak?"
G["One who shares your pain. One who offers you the power to assuage it."]="One who shares your pain. One who offers you the power to assuage it."
G["One word: Incense!"]="Uma palavra: incenso!"
G["One would be hard pressed to find a more steadfast champion than this $c.  Today we present, $n."]="Seria difícil encontrar um campeão mais inquebrável que $geste: esta; $c. Hoje presentamos a $n."
G["One! Two! Five!... THREE!"]="Um! Dois! Cinco!... TRÊS!"
G["One, two, three, four, I declare a thumb war!"]="Um, dois, três, quatro, declaro uma guerra de polegares!"
G["One-sided paper!"]="Papel de uma rosto!"
G["One..."]="Uno..."
G["Online."]="Conectado"
G["Only $3658E shopping minutes before Christmas!  But wait, is it Christmas?  Well then, there are only $3659E minutes left to party!  TEST TEST DO NOT LOCALIZE"]="Only $3658E shopping minutes before Christmas! But wait, is it Christmas? Welh then, there are only $3659E minutes left to party! TEST TEST DO NOT LOCALIZE"
G["Only 10 minutes remain before the Kalu'ak Fishing Derby ends!"]="Somente restam 10 minutos para que termine a competição de pesca Kalu'ak!"
G["Only 10 more minutes until Vol'jin taps the Brewfest keg!"]="Only 10 more minutes until Vol'jin taps the Brewfest keg!"
G["Only a few more towers and that whole thing is coming down!"]="Umas torres mais e tudo o sistema se colapsará!"
G["Only a few spots to get any fishing done around here.  Paxton knows them all and probably a few he won't tell ya about.  Why don't ye go over to Iceflow Lake and see what he will tell ya."]="Apenas algum pontos para pescar por aqui. Paxton conhece todos eles e provavelmente algum dos quais não vai contar nada. Por que não vai ao lago Iceflow e vê o que ele lhe dirá?"
G["Only a flesh wound!"]="Uma ferida superficial!"
G["Only a fool walks into a den of thieves unaware. That fool rarely walks out..."]="Only a fool walks into a den of thieves unaware. That fool rarely walks out..."
G["Only a fool would dare disturb me in my lair."]="Apenas um tolo ousaria me perturbar no meu covil."
G["Only a fool would mock the appearance of my battle-garb.\n\nThis raiment of well-worn steel is from an ancient place of learning!"]="Only a fool would mock the appearance of my battle-garb.\n\nThis raiment of well-worn steel is from an ancient place of learning!"
G["Only a fool would remain in this battle. Farewell, coward."]="Only a fool would remain in this battle. Farewell, coward."
G["Only a mage can learn portal magic, $c."]="Somente um mago pode aprender a magia dos portais, $c."
G["Only a matter of time, now."]="Agora é apenas questão de tempo."
G["Only a mind at peace can fully ready a body for battle."]="Somente uma mente em paz pode ter um corpo pronto para a batalha."
G["Only a non-believer would ask such a question!  Are you a non-believer?"]="Only a non-believer would ask such a question!  Are you a non-believer?"
G["Only an elemental lord could bind so many elementals so quickly. It seems we're at war with da Stonemother herself..."]="Only an elemental lord could bind so many elementals so quickly. It seems we're at war with da Stonemother herself..."
