G["Open up! I've got a message for you!"]="Abra! Traigo uma mensagem para você!"
G["Open wide, Jir'see."]="Abra completamente, Jir've."
G["Open wide, Mr. Tauren! Here comes the hippogryph into the roost!"]="Faça lugar, senhor tauren! Aqui vem o hipogrifo direto ao seu percha!"
G["Open your eyes, brothers and sisters! GAZE UPON APOCALYPSE!"]="Open your eyes, brothers and sisters! GAZE UPON APOCALYPSE!"
G["Open your mind, wanderer, and we shall begin."]="Abra sua mente, andarilho, e começaremos."
G["Open your senses, little one. Can you not feel it - the pain, the suffering this tree endured when it was ripped from the nourishing earth? We will heal it and give it peace, though the tree will never grow again."]="Open your senses, little one. Can you not feel it - the pain, the suffering this tree endured when it was ripped from the nourishing earth? We will heal it and give it peace, though the tree will never grow again."
G["Opening"]="Abrindo"
G["Operation: Gnomeregan begins NOW!"]="Começa a operação Gnomeregan JÁ!"
G["Operation: Gnomeregan is divided into a number of phases:\n\nFirst, we must retake the air tower.  This will allow our planes give us air support as we move towards Gnomeregan's main entrance.\n\nIn addition, a cache of mechanized Battle Suits was discovered in one of the nearby buildings.  Once we have those suits, our assault on the entrance should be unstoppable.\n\nThen, we go straight for Thermaplugg in the heart of Gnomeregan!"]="Operation: Gnomeregan is divided into a number of phases:\n\nFirst, we must retake the air tower.  This will allow our planes give us air support as we move towards Gnomeregan's main entrance.\n\nIn addition, a cache of mechanized Battle Suits was discovered in one of the nearby buildings.  Once we have those suits, our assault on the entrance should be unstoppable.\n\nThen, we go straight for Thermaplugg in the heart of Gnomeregan!"
G["Operation: Gnomeregan was a success. Sure, that dastardly Thermaplugg had an unforeseen trick up his sleeve, but we have him on the run! It's only a matter of time before Gnomeregan is cleaned up and in our hands again!"]="Operação: Gnomeregan foi um sucesso. Claro, aquele desgraçado Thermaplugg tinha um truque imprevisto na manga, mas nós o temos em fuga! É apenas uma questão de tempo até que Gnomeregan seja limpo e em nossas mãos novamente!"
G["Operational status: nominal."]="Estado operacional: óptimo."
G["Optical sensor malfunction detected! Shutting down..."]="Detectado falho em sensor óptico! Apagando..."
G["Opus wants some Cuergo's Gold... with worm."]="Opus quer um pouco de Ouro Cuergo... com me ver."
G["Or THIS is what you get."]="Or THIS is what you get."
G["Or else great darkness looms in the days ahead..."]="Or else great darkness looms in the days ahead..."
G["Or if you want to wander the woods a while, Aysa and I can hang out here.  You know... just the two of us."]="Or if you want to wander the woods a while, Aysa and I can hang out here.  You know... just the two of us."
G["Or in this case, better undead than worgen."]="Or in this case, better undead than worgen."
G["Or is it an alliance of convenience, a confederacy of unlikely partners free to pursue their own agendas?"]="Ou um pacto de conveniência, uma parceria estapafúrdia em que cada um persegue os próprios objetivos?"
G["Or one murder."]="OU um assassinato."
G["Or perhaps a testament to your abilities?"]="OU talvez uma demonstração das suas habilidades?"
G["Or stay if you want. We always be needin' more to sacrifice."]="Or stay if you want. We always be needin' more to sacrifice."
G["Or that time when you told us that you'd discovered the cure for the plague of the 20th century. What is that even? 20th century?"]="Or that time when you told us that you'd discovered the cure for the plague of the 20th century. What is that even? 20th century?"
G["Or, they killed most of us. I was the village's healer - after they ran me through, I was able to apply enough of my medical skills to keep me alive... but barely."]="Or, they killed most of us. I was the village's healer - after they ran me through, I was able to apply enough of my medical skills to keep me alive... but barely."
G["Orachi shall have my head if you do not work faster, smith! And I shall have yours."]="Orachi shall have my head if you do not work faster, smith! And I shall have yours."
G["Orbaz Bloodbane, self proclaimed hand of the Lich King."]="Orbaz Bloodbane, self proclaimed hand of the Lich King."
G["Orbital countermeasures enabled."]="Orbital countermeasures enabled."
G["Orc & Troll"]="Orc & troll"
G["Orc KILL $r!"]="Orc MATAR $r!"
G["Orc general Nazgrim say we need to help them vacuum... vacuate... err... evocate... err... get the ook out!"]="Orc general Nazgrim say we need to help them vacuum... vacuate... err... evocate... err... get the ook out!"
G["Orc ships have begun a blockade of the Kalimdor coastline. No passengers can reach the continent and our merchants cannot move their goods!"]="Os barcos orcs têm começado um bloqueio da costa de Kalimdor. Nenhum passageiro pode chegar ao continente, e não há mercador capaz de transportar seus mercadorias."
G["Orcs always point and laugh at Kekek, but he get revenge one day."]="Orcs sempre apontam e riem de Kekek, mas ele se vinga um dia."
G["Orcs and trolls! Everywhere!"]="Orcs e trolls! Por todas partes!"
G["Orcs are dangerous but mounted orcs are more so. Release the hounds!"]="Orcs são perigosos, mas orcs em montarias são muito mais. Soltem os cães!"
G["Orcs are smarter than those couriers! Where the blazes are they?"]="Os orcs são mais prontos que esses mensagemros! Onde demônios estão?"
G["Orcs everywhere!"]="Há orcs por todas partes!"
G["Orcs of the Horde! This portal is the gateway to your new destiny! Azeroth lies before you, ripe for the taking!"]="Orcs da Horda! Este portal é a entrada ao seu novo destino! Azeroth está ante vocês, esperándoos!"
G["Orcs rule!"]="Orcs rule!"
G["Orcs!  It's the orcs!  No, wait, it's just Krolan's stomach again."]="Orcs! Vêm os orcs! Não, espera, volta a ser somente o estômago de Krolan."
G["Orcs. It seems I've been fighting them all my life.\n\nTwenty years ago we shattered the Horde and tore down the walls of their Hellfire Citadel. We drove the vile greenskins to the very brink! After that, other than a few skirmishes the broken orcs never again posed a threat to us.\n\nUntil now."]="Orcs. It seems I've been fighting them all my life.\n\nTwenty years ago we shattered the Horde and tore down the walls of their Hellfire Citadel. We drove the vile greenskins to the very brink! After that, other than a few skirmishes the broken orcs never again posed a threat to us.\n\nUntil now."
G["Orcs? Badlands? I'm invulnerable!"]="Orcs? Ermo? Eu sou invulnerável!"
G["Order of the Cloud Serpent"]="Ordem do Dragão Nimbo"
G["Order the fleet into close formation. Keep it tight, everyone!"]="Order the fleet into close formation. Keep it tight, everyone!"
G["Orders are orders. If the Prince says jump..."]="As ordens são as ordens. Se o Príncipe diz salta..."
G["Orders, $g sir:ma'am;?"]="Ordens, $gsenhor: senhora;?"
G["Orders, sir?"]="Ordens, senhor?"
G["Orders, your majesty?"]="Que ordenas, Majestade?"
G["Ordo Ragemesa is right on our border, $n. I need you to bring that shield down now or we're lost."]="A Meseta Infame de Ordo está logo em nossa fronteira, $n. Preciso que derribes esse escudo agora ou estamos perdidos."
G["Ordos guide my way!"]="Que Ordos me guíe!"
G["Orestes! Aenea! You are to accompany $p on his mission."]="Orestes! Aenea! You are to accompany $p on his mission."
G["Orgrim's Hammer infantry, hold position!"]="Orgrim's Hammer infantry, hold position!"
G["Orgrim's Hammer is ready to strike in Icecrown.  You will find no finer vessel."]="O Martelo de Orgrim está pronto para atacar na Coroa de Gelo. Você não encontrará embarcações mais refinadas."
G["Orgrimmar Champion's Pennant"]="Galhardete do Campeão Orgrimmar"
G["Orgrimmar Rocketway Exchange, please."]="Ao Intercambiador da Cohetepista de Orgrimmar, por favor."
G["Orgrimmar has truly become the heart of Winter Veil."]="Orgrimmar é o coração do Festival de Inverno."
G["Orgrimmar is stronger than ever!"]="Orgrimmar está mais forte do que nunca!"
G["Orgrimmar is under lock down. All shops are closed. Please visit Thunder Bluff or Silvermoon City if you require a merchant, auctioneer or trainer.\n\nStay clear of the Undercity!"]="Orgrimmar is under lock down. All shops are closed. Please visit Thunder Bluff or Silvermoon City if you require a merchant, auctioneer or trainer.\n\nStay clear of the Undercity!"
G["Orgrimmar portal open, Brawl fans!  Tell 'em Bubbles sent ya."]="Orgrimmar portal open, Brawl fans!  Tell 'em Bubbles sent ya."
G["Orgrimmar will fall to our forces!"]="Orgrimmar cairá ante nós!"
G["Orgrimmar's walls need to be taller! Thicker!"]="Orgrimmar's walls need to be taller! Thicker!"
G["Orgus think something wrong with $r lemonade..."]="Orgus acreditar que algo ruim com limonada de $r..."
G["Orhan focuses her might!"]="Orhan concentra seu poder!"
G["Orik, I need another murkweed elixir."]="Orik, I need another murkweed elixir."
G["Ormak told me to expect you, $n."]="Ormak disse para mim que vendrías, $n."
G["Ormus, what happened to your eyes?"]="Ormus, o que aconteceu com os seus olhos?"
G["Ornak orders a boat to push off for the fleet."]="Ornak ordena que se suelte um esquife para voltar à frota."
G["Orseus, Kathrena sent me to borrow one of your Hippogryphs."]="Orseus, Kathrena sent me to borrow one of your Hippogryphs."
G["Osadi!"]="Osadi!"
G["Other"]="Outro"
G["Other customers are impatient, they won't wait as long; but are really happy when they are served quickly."]="Other customers are impatient, they won't wait as long; but are really happy when they are served quickly."
G["Other shaman used to say, \"Only yer offhand should be flaming.\" What were they going on about?"]="Outro xamã costumava dizer: \"Somente seu arma deveria arder.\" De que estavam falando?"
G["Other sshaman used to say, \"Only yer offhand should be flaming.\" What were they going on about?"]="Outro xamã costumava dizer: \"Somente seu arma deveria arder\". De que estavam falando?"
G["Others are like me. You gotta find 'em."]="Há outros como eu. Devem encontrah'os."
G["Others cite rumors of his escalating conflicts with Tyrande Whisperwind, the shining light of our people, our leader in Darnassus."]="Outros falam de rumores sobre seus crescentes conflitos com Tyrande Susurravientos, a luz que brilha sobre nosso povo, nossa líder em Darnassus."
G["Others will come... the age of mortals... has passed."]="Others will come... the age of mortals... has passed."
G["Others will take my place!"]="Others will take my place!"
G["Otherwise, get off my back! One of these days you won't have old Hermesius to push around anymore. That much I can promise..."]="De outra forma, bájate de meu costas! Um dia de estes não terá ao velho Hermesius para dar ordens. Isso te o prometo..."
G["Oto! I cannot attack them while they are attacking me!"]="Oto! I cannot attack them while they are attacking me!"
G["Otoh Greyhide spends much of time in the Hall of Elders on the Elder Rise.  Seek him out there, and he will help you."]="Otoh Greyhide passa muito tempo no Salão dos Anciãos na Ascensão dos Anciões. Procure-o lá fosse, e ele irá ajudá-o."
G["Ouch!"]="Ay!"
G["Ouch!  I guess that one was a little bigger than I thought..."]="Vá... Acho que esse era um pouco mais grande do que esperava."
G["Ouch!  That's not right."]="Ay! Isso não está bem."
G["Ouch!  That... that really hurt!"]="Ouch!  That... that really hurt!"
G["Ouch!  What did I do?"]="Ay! Que fiz?"
G["Ouch! Dat hurt!"]="Auch! Isso tem doli'o!"
G["Ouch! Enjoying this, are you?"]="Ouch! Enjoying this, are you?"
G["Ouch! Hey!"]="Ay! Ouve!"
G["Ouch! I can't take much more o' this!"]="Ouch! I can't take much more o' this!"
G["Ouch! I just got burned!"]="Ai! Eu me queimei!"
G["Ouch! Ouch! Ouch!"]="Ay! Ay! Ay!"
G["Ouch! PH"]="Au! PH"
G["Ouch! That burns!!"]="Ay! Isso queima!"
G["Ouch! That one looked painful!"]="Ouch! That one looked painful!"
G["Ouch! That's it, I quit the target business!"]="Ouch! That's it, I quit the target business!"
G["Ouch! Those blades are sharp!"]="Ay! Essas lâminas estão afiadas!"
G["Ouch! Watch where you're tugging!"]="Ay! Tenha cuidado de onde tiras!"
G["Ouch! What's with the stick?!"]="Ay! Mas que passa com esse palo?!"
G["Ouch, mon!  I be trippin'!"]="Ay, colega! Estou alucinando!"
G["Ouch, my head...what day is it?"]="Auch, minha cabeça... Que dia é hoje?"
G["Ouch... sorry, $n. Get back in line and try again."]="Ay... Sinto muito, $n. Entre à cauda e volta a tentar."
G["Our \"king\" sits atop his throne made of gold and shrugs at our plight!"]="Our \"king\" sits atop his throne made of gold and shrugs at our plight!"
G["Our Aether-tech and his escort are heading to Bash'ir Landing.  Meet them there and help with their mission!"]="Nosso Aether-tech e sua escolta estão indo para Bash'ir Landing. Encontre-os lá e ajude com a sua missão!"
G["Our Alchemist's name is Carolai Anise.  You'll find her in a house at the northwest end of Brill."]="O nome do nosso alquimista é Carolai Anise. Você a encontrará em uma casa no extremo noroeste de Brill."
G["Our Alliance allies are assisting the Leage of Arathor in their defense of Arathi Basin.  They could use your aid against the undead Defilers, $c."]="Nossos aliados da Aliança estão ajudando à Liga de Arathor na defesa da Bacia Arathi. Sua ajuda não lhes viria mal para lutar contra os Rapinhadores não-mortos, $c."
G["Our Bilgewater Cartel representatives are waiting to help find the payment plan that's right for you as soon as you land!"]="Our Bilgewater Cartel representatives are waiting to help find the payment plan that's right for you as soon as you land!"
G["Our Bloodmyst scouts have located our contact. The fool, Velen, will soon leave himself open and defenseless -- long enough for us to strike! Now get out of my sight before I vaporize you..."]="Our Bloodmyst scouts have located our contact. The fool, Velen, will soon leave himself open and defenseless -- long enough for us to strike! Now get out of my sight before I vaporize you..."
G["Our Caregiver Center is located above the central Vault of Light, near the Exodar's main entrance."]="Our Caregiver Center is located above the central Vault of Light, near the Exodar's main entrance."
G["Our Commander has fallen! The time for vengeance is now! Ram riders charge!!!!!!"]="Our Commander has fallen! The time for vengeance is now! Ram riders charge!!!!!!"
G["Our Expedition made it safely through the Portal and set up a new base called Thrallmar. Yet as you can see, the Burning Legion moved in and cut us off from our brothers. Clearly, the demons hope to retake the Dark Portal and prevent us from gathering reinforcements from Azeroth."]="Nossa Expedição atravessou o Portal com segurança e montou uma nova base chamada Thrallmar. No entanto, como você pode ver, a Legião Ardente se mudou e nos separou de nossos irmãos. Claramente, os demônios esperam retomar o Portal Negro e nos impedir de reunir reforços de Azeroth."
G["Our Gods were many, and powerful. We mantid worshipped the seven heads of Y'shaarj."]="Our Gods were many, and powerful. We mantid worshipped the seven heads of Y'shaarj."
G["Our Lord commands us to make ready for war!"]="Nosso Senhor nos ordena que nos preparemos para a guerra!"
G["Our Master, protector of all life, will soon blind all of the heretics and grants us immeasurable power!"]="Our Master, protector of all life, will soon blind all of the heretics and grants us immeasurable power!"
G["Our Multi-Bombers have destroyed Tankbuster Cannons' shields. Take them down and secure the Surface Command Post!"]="Our Multi-Bombers have destroyed Tankbuster Cannons' shields. Take them down and secure the Surface Command Post!"
G["Our Sanctums syphon arcane power from ley-line currents that traverse our lands invisible to the naked eye.\n\nWith the Sunwell gone, they provide us with a steady and reliable source of energy."]="Our Sanctums syphon arcane power from ley-line currents that traverse our lands invisible to the naked eye.\n\nWith the Sunwell gone, they provide us with a steady and reliable source of energy."
G["Our Skyguard Aether-tech and her escort is studying the Bash'ir crystal forge.  She needs help!  Go to Bash'ir Landing, find the aether-tech and keep her safe!"]="Our Skyguard Aether-tech and her escort is studying the Bash'ir crystal forge.  She needs help!  Go to Bash'ir Landing, find the aether-tech and keep her safe!"
G["Our Storm Crows struggle to fly in this high density air, but the fire hawks on that ridge seem to soar with ease.\n\nThey are as wild as any of the creatures in the Plane of Fire, yet there is beauty in their form."]="Our Storm Crows struggle to fly in this high density air, but the fire hawks on that ridge seem to soar with ease.\n\nThey are as wild as any of the creatures in the Plane of Fire, yet there is beauty in their form."
G["Our Warchief's campaign across Kalimdor and Pandaria is pulling the Horde apart at the seams."]="A campanha de nosso Chefe de Guerra em Kalimdor e Pandaria está desgastando à Horda."
G["Our agents have been outed and killed, master."]="Têm descoberto e eliminado a nossos agentes, mestre."
G["Our allies are ready. Bring down the shield and make way!"]="Our allies are ready. Bring down the shield and make way!"
G["Our allies have arrived! Push them back over the edge, my brethren."]="Our allies have arrived! Push them back over the edge, my brethren."
G["Our allies within the Argent Crusade and the Knights of the Ebon Blade have broken through the front gate of Icecrown and are attempting to establish a foothold within the citadel."]="Our allies within the Argent Crusade and the Knights of the Ebon Blade have broken through the front gate of Icecrown and are attempting to establish a foothold within the citadel."
G["Our ally has arrived!  Clear the way to the materialization chamber!"]="Our ally has arrived!  Clear the way to the materialization chamber!"
G["Our ancestors looked far into the future to witness his rebirth, but instead, we saw our race troubled by many dangers. Dangers that, left unchecked, could destroy us."]="Our ancestors looked far into the future to witness his rebirth, but instead, we saw our race troubled by many dangers. Dangers that, left unchecked, could destroy us."
G["Our ancestors teach us that while the individual must be strong, there is safety in numbers.  Do you wish to defend the honor of Thunder Bluff by organizing a guild?"]="Nossos ancestrais nos ensinam que, embora o indivíduo deva ser forte, há segurança nos números. Deseja defender a honra de Thunder Bluff organizando uma guilda?"
G["Our ancient writings indicate that the mantid have always been here. They predate even the mogu. Where did they come from?"]="Nossos antigos textos indicam que os mantídeos sempre existiram. Eles são mais velhos que os mogus. De onde eles vieram?"
G["Our armies shall shake the pillars of the world!"]="Our armies shall shake the pillars of the world!"
G["Our arrogance was unpardonable. We damned one of the most noble beings of all. We may never atone for this sin."]="Our arrogance was unpardonable. We damned one of the most noble beings of all. We may never atone for this sin."
G["Our assault on the Firelands cannot wait. We strike, at Ragnaros and at Fandral, as soon as we can."]="Nosso ataque às Terras do Fogo não pode esperar. Atacamos, em Ragnaros e no Fandral, o mais rápido possível."
G["Our battle is most difficult, Tai-Feng. The sha of doubt is subtle and insidious. Once the dark seed of doubt is planted, only one of strong mind and heart can remove it."]="Our battle is most difficult, Tai-Feng. The sha of doubt is subtle and insidious. Once the dark seed of doubt is planted, only one of strong mind and heart can remove it."
G["Our blades and spells are at the ready!"]="Nossas espadas e nossos feitiços estão prontos!"
G["Our blessed great sea turtle, Green Island, travels from here to Moa'ki Harbor in Dragonblight."]="Nossa abençoada grande tartaruga marinha, a Ilha Verde, viaja daqui para o Moa'ki Harbour em Dragonblight."
G["Our brilliant brew is back! You've all our gratitude."]="Nossa excelente cerveja está de volta! Os o agradecemos todos."
G["Our brother has lost his way. He scorches the ground, he vaporizes the water, and devours too much air.\n\nHelp us to bring him back into balance and harmony."]="Our brother has lost his way. He scorches the ground, he vaporizes the water, and devours too much air.\n\nHelp us to bring him back into balance and harmony."
G["Our brother over there drowns his sorrows in apathy and wine, instead of work and toil."]="Our brother over there drowns his sorrows in apathy and wine, instead of work and toil."
G["Our brothers are falling to the northwest. Get out there and help them!"]="Our brothers are falling to the northwest. Get out there and help them!"
G["Our brothers at Baradin Hold on Tol Barad are very busy and not always available when you need them.  I have been stationed here around the clock to help you with tasks they might have given you."]="Nossos irmãos no Baradin Hold on Tol Barad estão muito ocupados e nem sempre estão disponíveis quando você precisa deles. Estive aqui o tempo tudo para ajudá-o nas tarefas que eles podem ter lhe dado."
G["Our business has stood for twelve generations and supplied many hundreds of fresh, clean, and smelly yaks to the grummles.\n\nWe've faced floods, famine, and mogu. I'll be a hozen's uncle if I let these yaungol run us off."]="Our business has stood for twelve generations and supplied many hundreds of fresh, clean, and smelly yaks to the grummles.\n\nWe've faced floods, famine, and mogu. I'll be a hozen's uncle if I let these yaungol run us off."
G["Our cache of equipment grows!"]="Nosso estoque de equipamento aumenta."
G["Our captain has fallen!"]="Nosso capitão tem caído!"
G["Our captain will save us!"]="Nosso capitão nos salvará!"
G["Our captors have allied with Deathwing, $r."]="Nossos captores se têm aliado com Alamuerte, $r."
G["Our caravans go out 'bout twice a day, but I'll be damned if the Scourge haven't gone out of their way to stop Didier and his mules from getting shipments to the front lines. Craziest thing I've ever seen. If only we had the heroic adventurin' types to help protect the shipments..."]="Nossas caravanas saem duas vezes por dia, mas eu serei amaldiçoado se o Flagelo não tiver se esforçado para impedir Didier e suas mulas de levar remessas para as linhas de linha de frente. A coisa mais louca que eu já vi. Se tivéssemos o tipo de aventura heróica para ajudar a proteger as remessas..."
G["Our casualties are too heavy!"]="Our casualties are too heavy!"
G["Our cause falls on deaf ears beyond the thick, stone walls of Stormwind."]="Our cause falls on deaf ears beyond the thick, stone walls of Stormwind."
G["Our champion units are equipped!  Beware, alliance!"]="Nossas unidades campeonas estão equipadas! Cuidado, Aliança!"
G["Our champion units are leaving the field.  We need more supplies!"]="Nossas unidades campeonas estão saindo do campo. Precisamos mais suprimentos!"
G["Our champions have lost much blood in the struggle to activate this Scourge transporter. We must be prepared to return the favor. Follow me, men!"]="Our champions have lost much blood in the struggle to activate this Scourge transporter. We must be prepared to return the favor. Follow me, men!"
G["Our charge is an ancient one, dating back to the time of Shaohao, our founder and the last emperor of Pandaria."]="Nosso cometido é muito antigo; data da época de Shaohao, nosso fundador e o último imperador de Pandaria."
G["Our child has been born. It's a girl! A beautiful baby girl."]="Nossa filha tem nascido. É uma ninha! Uma ninha linda."
G["Our clan holds true to the ways set forth by the ancients. We deserve the king's favor above all others!"]="Nosso clã continua as tradições dos ancestrais. Merecemos o favor do Rei mais que todos os outros!"
G["Our clan is the greatest in all the land, he must choose us!"]="Our clan is the greatest in all the land, he must choose us!"
G["Our clan is the true clan! No interloper can change that!"]="Nosso clã é o único clã! Nenhum intruso vai mudar isso!"
G["Our continued incursions into the graveyard and town below are already paying off. Neither the mogu nor the Zandalari should be able to mount a counter-attack."]="Our continued incursions into the graveyard and town below are already paying off. Neither the mogu nor the Zandalari should be able to mount a counter-attack."
G["Our crafters build the finest wooden planks.  They would weather the most brutal of storms.  But they are as water before the storm of my crushing skull."]="Our crafters build the finest wooden planks.  They would weather the most brutal of storms.  But they are as water before the storm of my crushing skull."
G["Our dark master has noticed your trifling, and sends me to bring a message... of doom!"]="Nosso mestre sombrio tem advertido seu insignificância e me envia para entregar uma mensagem... de morte!"
G["Our defenses are failing!  By the light we must prevail!"]="Nossas defesas estão falhando! pela Luz, devemos vencer!"
G["Our defenses are impenetrable! WE are the true sons of Gnomeregan!"]="Our defenses are impenetrable! WE are the true sons of Gnomeregan!"
G["Our defenses stand ready!"]="Nossas defesas estão preparadas!"
G["Our descent into the depths of depravity begins! Be on guard! Jaina, lend us your strength!"]="Our descent into the depths of depravity begins! Be on guard! Jaina, lend us your strength!"
G["Our destination is the Twilight Highlands. We strike at the beating heart of our enemy."]="Nosso destino são as Terras Altas Crepúsculo. Golpearemos no coração de nosso inimigo."
G["Our dreams have been haunted by mantid. We hoped the Crane Temple would give us some insight to these visions."]="Our dreams have been haunted by mantid. We hoped the Crane Temple would give us some insight to these visions."
G["Our drinks should quench even the mightiest of thirsts."]="Nossas bebidas devem saciar até a mais poderosa das sedes."
G["Our duties await."]="O dever nos chama."
G["Our efforts have paid off.  We've captured the Sun's Reach Sanctum, $n.  Go there and see if there's anyone you can assist."]="Nossos esforços têm dados seu fruto. Temos capturou o Sacrário de Tramo do Sol, $n. Vê a ver se há alguém a quem possa ajudar."
G["Our efforts in Lordaeron have been all for naught. Despite numerous setbacks, the Scourge remain unfazed. We must cut them off at the source.\n\nThe time draws near to sail for Northrend. I don't know what awaits us; only that our enemies are numerous and are eager for our slaughter.\n\nBut we cannot pursue any other path in good conscience. Azeroth depends on our vigilance."]="Our efforts in Lordaeron have been all for naught. Despite numerous setbacks, the Scourge remain unfazed. We must cut them off at the source.\n\nThe time draws near to sail for Northrend. I don't know what awaits us; only that our enemies are numerous and are eager for our slaughter.\n\nBut we cannot pursue any other path in good conscience. Azeroth depends on our vigilance."
G["Our empire will be glorious! And you won't be there to see it!"]="Nosso império será glorioso. E você não o verá!"
G["Our empires will take what is ours!"]="Our empires will take what is ours!"
G["Our enchanters are located in the Crystal Hall opposite the jewel crafters.  Light be with you."]="Nossos encantadores estão localizados no Crystal Hall, em linha de frente aos fabricantes de jóias. A luz esteja com você."
G["Our enchanters spend their days in the Exodar, working away at any number of projects. Nahogg will start your training."]="Nossos encantadores passam seus dias no Exodar, trabalhando em vários projetos. Nahogg começará seu treinamento."
G["Our enemies believe us vanquished from the frozen wastes.\n\nWe will show them the consequence of their ignorance."]="Our enemies believe us vanquished from the frozen wastes.\n\nWe will show them the consequence of their ignorance."
G["Our enemies can bury entire cities under the sand.  Our traditions have not prepared us for such a war."]="Nossos inimigos podem enterrar cidades inteiras debaixo da areia. Nossas tradições não nos prepararam para essa guerra."
G["Our enemies have finally arrived!  Demolishers, fire at will!"]="Nossos inimigos têm chegado! Demolidores, fogo a discreção!"
G["Our enemies once turned our strongest weapon against us. What makes you think the prismatic blades will be any different?"]="Uma vez, nossos inimigos usaram nossa melhor arma em nossa contra. Que te há pensar que será distinto com as espadas prismáticas?"
G["Our enemies shall fall before us."]="Our enemies shall fall before us."
G["Our enemies surround us.  I would have a better life for the Mok'Nathal, but the forces we are at battle with have chosen otherwise for us.\n\nIf you would prove yourself worthy to the Mok'Nathal, aid us in their elimination."]="Our enemies surround us.  I would have a better life for the Mok'Nathal, but the forces we are at battle with have chosen otherwise for us.\n\nIf you would prove yourself worthy to the Mok'Nathal, aid us in their elimination."
G["Our enemies think we are weak. Are we weak, soldiers? If not, then prove it to them!"]="Our enemies think we are weak. Are we weak, soldiers? If not, then prove it to them!"
G["Our enemies underestimate the power of the light."]="Our enemies underestimate the power of the light."
G["Our enemies will be annihilated!"]="Nossos inimigos serão aniquilados!"
G["Our enemies will fall beneath our blades!"]="Our enemies will fall beneath our blades!"
G["Our enemies will fall!"]="Our enemies will fall!"
G["Our enemies will perish!"]="Our enemies will perish!"
G["Our enemies wouldn't dare attack us this close to the Crossroads. It's further out that we'll have to watch our backs."]="Our enemies wouldn't dare attack us this close to the Crossroads. It's further out that we'll have to watch our backs."
G["Our enemy, cloaked in shadow, seeks to unmake our world. We will not lose another home."]="Our enemy, cloaked in shadow, seeks to unmake our world. We will not lose another home."
G["Our engines are damaged!  We're sitting ducks up here!"]="Our engines are damaged!  We're sitting ducks up here!"
G["Our envoy was making for the Crane Temple when the mogu ambushed us."]="Our envoy was making for the Crane Temple when the mogu ambushed us."
G["Our equipment is really taking a beating out here!"]="Nosso equipamento está mesmo dando uma surra aqui!"
G["Our ethereal technomancy has the ability to modify an item's arcane essence in ways previously unimaginable. We can also house items in a pocket dimension... for a small fee. See my associates for details.\n\nUnless you have something for me to examine?"]="Our ethereal technomancy has the ability to modify an item's arcane essence in ways previously unimaginable. We can also house items in a pocket dimension... for a small fee. See my associates for details.\n\nUnless you have something for me to examine?"
G["Our eye say you look lost."]="O olho diz que pareces perdido."
G["Our fate is the doom of all who face the Great Fire."]="Nosso destino é o destino de todos os que enfrentam o Grande Fogo."
G["Our fates lie ahead..."]="Our fates lie ahead..."
G["Our fight against the sha can continue tomorrow. For now, rest."]="Nossa luta contra os sha pode seguir manhã. Agora descansar."
G["Our fighters need nutritious food to keep our enemies at bay!\n\nHurry up and tell me what I can get for you."]="Our fighters need nutritious food to keep our enemies at bay!\n\nHurry up and tell me what I can get for you."
G["Our foes will fall!"]="Our foes will fall!"
G["Our food and drink are in short supply.  I'm afraid I do not have anything to offer you."]="Nossa comida e bebida são escassas. Receio não ter nada para lhe oferecer."
G["Our food should satisfy even the mightiest of hungers."]="Nossa comida deve satisfazer até a mais poderosa das fomes."
G["Our forces are poised for battle, and eager to spill the blood of the Alliance.  Soon our captain will enter Iceblood Garrison and the war will begin anew!"]="Our forces are poised for battle, and eager to spill the blood of the Alliance.  Soon our captain will enter Iceblood Garrison and the war will begin anew!"
G["Our forces are ready and eager.  Soon, Balinda Stonehearth will enter her outpost and the battle will begin anew!"]="Nossas forças estão prontas e cheias de entusiasmo. Pronto Balinda Piedrahogar entrará no seu Avançado e a batalha começará novamente!"
G["Our forces in Alterac Valley need wisdom to achieve victory $c.  You look like the one to lead them."]="Our forces in Alterac Valley need wisdom to achieve victory $c.  You look like the one to lead them."
G["Our forces report major victories off the coasts of Tanaris and Tol Barad..."]="Our forces report major victories off the coasts of Tanaris and Tol Barad..."
G["Our forces will fall."]="Our forces will fall."
G["Our fortifications are ready."]="As fortificações estão prontas."
G["Our freedom would have meant nothing if C'Thun had survived. You are truly a champion of prophecy."]="Nossa liberdade não teria significado nada se C'Thun tivesse sobrevivido. Você é verdadeiramente um campeão de profecia."
G["Our friends fought well, Brann, but we're not done yet."]="Our friends fought well, Brann, but we're not done yet."
G["Our friends in the Alliance gather to fight alongside the Silverwing Sentinels in Warsong Gulch. Will you travel there to help them?"]="Nossos amigos da Aliança se reúnem para lutar ao lado dos Silverwing Sentinels em Warsong Gulch. Você vai viajar para lá para ajudá-os?"
G["Our friendship is OVER!"]="Nossa amizade se tem TERMINADO!"
G["Our future promises even greater threats."]="Nosso futuro promete ameaças ainda maiores."
G["Our general, Vanndar Stormpike, has fallen in battle!  The battle is lost!\n\nSpeak with our quartermaster and help rebuild our forces."]="Our general, Vanndar Stormpike, has fallen in battle!  The battle is lost!\n\nSpeak with our quartermaster and help rebuild our forces."
G["Our goal is in sight - press forward..."]="Temos o objetivo à visão... Continue..."
G["Our goal... Our sole purpose was to destroy the Lich King. We threw our lot in with the Horde and began our journey towards redemption."]="Our goal... Our sole purpose was to destroy the Lich King. We threw our lot in with the Horde and began our journey towards redemption."
G["Our great queen beckons us forward. Let us turn the waters red with the blood of our enemies!"]="Our great queen beckons us forward. Let us turn the waters red with the blood of our enemies!"
G["Our greatest enemies are ourselves."]="Não há pior inimigo que nós mesmos."
G["Our gryphons are still learning the lay of the land, $c, so I can only offer you short flights to other places in the fjord. Where do you want to go?"]="Our gryphons are still learning the lay of the land, $c, so I can only offer you short flights to other places in the fjord. Where do you want to go?"
G["Our gunnery instructor is Ansekhwa, the tauren weapon master on the lower central rise of Thunder Bluff."]="Nosso instrutor de artilharia é Ansekhwa, o mestre de armas tauren na parte central mais baixa do Thunder Bluff."
G["Our gunnery instructor, he Ansekhwa, da tauren weapon master on da lower central rise of Thunder Bluff."]="Nosso instrutor de artilharia, ele Ansekhwa, mestre em armas tauren, na subida mais baixa do Thunder Bluff."
G["Our hearts are heavy with grief at the passing of master Zhen. Will you face Humongous to regain his honor, $n?"]="Our hearts are heavy with grief at the passing of master Zhen. Will you face Humongous to regain his honor, $n?"
G["Our hero!"]="Obrigado, corajoso!"
G["Our highest priority is to evacuate The White Pawn, Prince Anduin Wrynn."]="Nossa máxima prioridade é evacuar ao peão alvo, o príncipe Anduin Wrynn."
G["Our history has been wrought with great challenges..."]="Nossa história se tem forjado com grandes retos..."
G["Our home is lost, but as long as we are still alive, there is still a home to be made... somewhere."]="Temos perdido nosso lar, mas enquanto sigamos vivos, sempre poderemos criar um novo lar... em algum lado."
G["Our home was destroyed during the Cataclysm!\n\nAll of the rest of the survivors moved north to build Lor'danel, but those of us that stayed behind are here for a reason. We WILL retake the Ruins of Auberdine from those Twilight's Hammer scum just as soon as we heal up.\n\nI hope that you can help us to deal with them in the meantime."]="Our home was destroyed during the Cataclysm!\n\nAll of the rest of the survivors moved north to build Lor'danel, but those of us that stayed behind are here for a reason. We WILL retake the Ruins of Auberdine from those Twilight's Hammer scum just as soon as we heal up.\n\nI hope that you can help us to deal with them in the meantime."
G["Our home was stolen! So we will take yours!"]="Our home was stolen! So we will take yours!"
G["Our homes... destroyed... We did what we had to...."]="Our homes... destroyed... We did what we had to...."
G["Our honor has been besmirched! They make wild claims and false accusations against us. I demand justice! Allow my champions to fight in place of your knights, Tirion. We challenge the Horde!"]="Our honor has been besmirched! They make wild claims and false accusations against us. I demand justice! Allow my champions to fight in place of your knights, Tirion. We challenge the Horde!"
G["Our house is this way, through the thicket."]="Nossa casa está por aqui, a através do mata."
G["Our humble inn is located in the north of Azure Watch; Chellan will take good care of you."]="Nossa humilde pousada está localizada no norte do Azure Watch; Chellan vai cuidar bem de você."
G["Our immortality-the very essence of our beings!-was lost."]="Perdimos nossa imortalidade, a mesma essência de nosso ser."
G["Our imprisonment was intolerable. The sooner we can leave this accursed place, the better."]="Nosso encarcelamento era intolerable. Quanto antes nos marchemos deste maldito lugar, melhor."
G["Our iron masters have a mission for us!"]="Nossos mestres de ferro têm uma missão para nós!"
G["Our job is to clear out as much of his fodder as we can, while supporting the specialists that the powers-that-be are having brought in."]="Our job is to clear out as much of his fodder as we can, while supporting the specialists that the powers-that-be are having brought in."
G["Our land be a land of ice an' snow."]="Que nueh'tra terra seja uma terra de gelo e neve."
G["Our leader, Doom'rel, has ears for the challenge."]="Nosso líder, Doom'rel, tem atenção para o desafio."
G["Our leader, Vol'jin, son of Sen'jin, issued de call to all Darkspears: reclaim de Echo Isles for our tribe."]="Our leader, Vol'jin, son of Sen'jin, issued de call to all Darkspears: reclaim de Echo Isles for our tribe."
G["Our lines are holding, but Vol'jin's rebels are taking a beating."]="Our lines are holding, but Vol'jin's rebels are taking a beating."
G["Our little friend is here. I weep for the dwarves if the goblin has their weed whacker!"]="Chegou nosso amiguito. Me apiado dos anões se o goblin tem seu segador de mais ervas!"
G["Our lives are but a blink of reality's eye."]="Our lives are but a blink of reality's eye."
G["Our lives are yours, Blood Knight."]="Our lives are yours, Blood Knight."
G["Our lives were worth far more than your blood feud..."]="Our lives were worth far more than your blood feud..."
G["Our lord Hydraxis speaks highly of you.  My water is your water, friend."]="Nosso senhor Hydraxis fala muito bem de você. Minha água é sua água, amigo."
G["Our lord, Arthas, saw in me the frailty of man."]="Our lord, Arthas, saw in me the frailty of man."
G["Our loss in Tol Barad will be avenged!  I will try to bring death to this grand city.  Cower as I try to remember a battle cry!"]="Our loss in Tol Barad will be avenged!  I will try to bring death to this grand city.  Cower as I try to remember a battle cry!"
G["Our magic... useless against this sickness!"]="Nossa magia... é inútil contra esta doença!"
G["Our march upon Icecrown Citadel begins now!"]="Marchemos até a Cidadela de Coroa de Gelo agora!"
G["Our master Malfurion has returned from the Dreaming, $c.  His is the light of a beacon that shows the way for us, and we must do everything in our power to preserve that light."]="Nosso mestre Malfurion tem retornado do Sonho, $c. Ele é a luz de um farol que ilumina nosso caminho, e devemos fazer tudo o que seja possível para conservar essa luz."
G["Our master commands us."]="Nosso mestre ordena!"
G["Our master wants you!"]="Nosso mestre te quer!"
G["Our master will break the world asunder and all that you know will come to an end. This is only a taste of what's to come!"]="Nosso mestre partirá o mundo em dois e tudo o que conhecem chegará ao seu fim. Isto somente é uma mostra do que os espera!"
G["Our matron craves the taste of your blood!"]="Nossa matriarca ansía testar seu sangue!"
G["Our matron will be... the end of you."]="Nossa matrona será... seu fim."
G["Our men are almost finished unearthing great Soggoth.  Is the ritual ready?"]="Nossos homens quase têm terminou de desenterrar ao grande Soggoth. O ritual está pronto?"
G["Our men are regrouping.  They will be ready for battle in mere minutes."]="Nossos homens estão se reagrupando. Eles estarão prontos para a batalha em poucos minutos."
G["Our men have secured the walkway. Focus on helping those in the main room."]="Our men have secured the walkway. Focus on helping those in the main room."
G["Our messenger to the slave pens never returned, sir."]="Nosso mensageiro ao Área dos Escravos nunca regresó, senhor."
G["Our might will be focused. We will not allow the desecration to continue."]="Our might will be focused. We will not allow the desecration to continue."
G["Our minds were finally free, yes... Free to relive all of the unthinkable acts that we had performed under the Legions' influence."]="Our minds were finally free, yes... Free to relive all of the unthinkable acts that we had performed under the Legions' influence."
G["Our mission is now clear: The Lich King will answer for his crimes and we will save Highlord Bolvar Fordragon!"]="Nossa missão está clara: o Rei Lich responderá pelos seus crímenes e salvaremos ao alto senhor Bolvar Fordragon."
G["Our mission priority has changed.\n\nWe need to defend this camp. Now!"]="A prioridade de nossa missão tem mudado.\n\nTemos que defenda este acampamento. Já!"
G["Our need for assistance in Arathi Basin is greater than one might imagine, $n.  So too is the honor and reputation one might acquire there in this time of need, however.  I implore you to seek out the Arathi Basin battlemaster in this city."]="Our need for assistance in Arathi Basin is greater than one might imagine, $n.  So too is the honor and reputation one might acquire there in this time of need, however.  I implore you to seek out the Arathi Basin battlemaster in this city."
G["Our neighbors are positively laughable. Have you seen the way they turn up their noses at us?"]="Our neighbors are positively laughable. Have you seen the way they turn up their noses at us?"
G["Our new allies will avenge us!"]="Our new allies will avenge us!"
G["Our new allies will bring us back to our former glory. These bonds will be true, and we will not be betrayed again!"]="Our new allies will bring us back to our former glory. These bonds will be true, and we will not be betrayed again!"
G["Our new allies, the Stillpine furbolgs, have expressed interest in taking what hides we find. They live to the north; I would seek knowledge from them."]="Nossos novos aliados, os furpolgs Stillpine, manifestaram interesse em pegar o que escondemos. Eles vivem ao norte; Eu procuraria conhecimento deles."
G["Our new challenger returns! Welcome, $n."]="Retorna $gel novo: a nova; aspirante! Dou a você a boas-vindas, $n."
G["Our newest attraction, and at no cost to you I might add, these miniature tanks, or Tonks as we've cleverly named them, can be controlled from any of the Tonk Control Consoles spread throughout the faire.\n\nAll that you have to do is activate an available control console. Each tonk will come equipped with a stock set of devices, and a random special power to unleash upon your enemy!\n\nHold epic battles with your friends, cruise around, or just cause wild mayhem... the choice is yours!"]="Our newest attraction, and at no cost to you I might add, these miniature tanks, or Tonks as we've cleverly named them, can be controlled from any of the Tonk Control Consoles spread throughout the faire.\n\nAll that you have to do is activate an available control console. Each tonk will come equipped with a stock set of devices, and a random special power to unleash upon your enemy!\n\nHold epic battles with your friends, cruise around, or just cause wild mayhem... the choice is yours!"
G["Our next fighter was found in the deepest tombs of Zul'Farrak! Gorged on cursed blood, raised from death countless times, he now knows only fury and violence! Dare you face the mindless wrath of...ZUMONGA!"]="Our next fighter was found in the deepest tombs of Zul'Farrak! Gorged on cursed blood, raised from death countless times, he now knows only fury and violence! Dare you face the mindless wrath of...ZUMONGA!"
G["Our numbers are endless, our power beyond reckoning! All who oppose the Destroyer will DIE A THOUSAND DEATHS!"]="Our numbers are endless, our power beyond reckoning! All who oppose the Destroyer will DIE A THOUSAND DEATHS!"
G["Our numbers... endless! You... cannot win..."]="Nosso exército... é... infinito! Não podem ganhar!"
G["Our oldest clutch of dragons are still far from maturity, but with patience and study, we are confident the dragonflight will soon be ready."]="Our oldest clutch of dragons are still far from maturity, but with patience and study, we are confident the dragonflight will soon be ready."
G["Our only hope of getting out of here alive is to take the town."]="É preciso pegar a cidade se queremos sair com vida."
G["Our only viable port for resupply is held by the Forsaken on the other side of this blasted continent!"]="Our only viable port for resupply is held by the Forsaken on the other side of this blasted continent!"
G["Our original duty binds us to defend this land, but if Fandral has indeed escaped to the Firelands, then we must bring him to justice."]="Our original duty binds us to defend this land, but if Fandral has indeed escaped to the Firelands, then we must bring him to justice."
G["Our orphan matron says druids can turn into birds, cats, and bears, but you look like a combination of all of them!"]="Our orphan matron says druids can turn into birds, cats, and bears, but you look like a combination of all of them!"
G["Our paths through life intersect only briefly and now is the time for ours to part ways. I consider myself blessed to have spent this time teaching you and now send you along to join paths with your next mentor. Seek out Saru Steelfury of Orgrimmar, he will teach what you need to learn."]="Nossos caminhos pela vida se cruzam apenas brevemente e agora é a hora de nos separarmos. Considero-me abençoado por ter passado esse tempo ensinando você e agora o envio para se juntar a caminhos com o seu próximo mentor. Procure Saru Steelfury de Orgrimmar, ele ensinará o que você precisa aprender."
G["Our patience is growing thin..."]="Se nos está acabando a paciência..."
G["Our people are strong. We bring you a mastery over arcane magics that you have previously lacked - ah, no offense intended, of course."]="Our people are strong. We bring you a mastery over arcane magics that you have previously lacked - ah, no offense intended, of course."
G["Our people gunna kill every last one o' you Scourge!"]="Nosso pessoal não matará todos os seus açoites!"
G["Our people had walked a dark path and mine was among the darkest of them all."]="Our people had walked a dark path and mine was among the darkest of them all."
G["Our people have their differences, $c, but we are all guests in this place.\n\nThe pandaren have shown me great hospitality and respect, as I'm sure you've also received, and now they need our help.\n\nThe Horde is not without honor. If you know honor, you will know to save our quarrel for another time."]="Our people have their differences, $c, but we are all guests in this place.\n\nThe pandaren have shown me great hospitality and respect, as I'm sure you've also received, and now they need our help.\n\nThe Horde is not without honor. If you know honor, you will know to save our quarrel for another time."
G["Our people were held as prisoners, as slaves, in this very camp by the humans. I was locked in these cages; I saw my brothers held in these stocks, hung in these gallows.\n\nI saw Orgrim Doomhammer, leader of us all, stabbed in the back. His blood stained black the earth we stand on.\n\nAnd look at us now. This is our legacy: Hammerfall, where we lost everything, and then took it back with our own hands."]="Our people were held as prisoners, as slaves, in this very camp by the humans. I was locked in these cages; I saw my brothers held in these stocks, hung in these gallows.\n\nI saw Orgrim Doomhammer, leader of us all, stabbed in the back. His blood stained black the earth we stand on.\n\nAnd look at us now. This is our legacy: Hammerfall, where we lost everything, and then took it back with our own hands."
G["Our pillas! Someone has stolen our pillas!"]="Our pillas! Someone has stolen our pillas!"
G["Our plans are in danger already.  It appears Maiev's decided to do things her own way."]="Our plans are in danger already.  It appears Maiev's decided to do things her own way."
G["Our prayers have been answered!"]="Our prayers have been answered!"
G["Our prayers to Aessina go unanswered. The burning minions of Ragnaros have driven us to the brink. If they are not stopped here, the World Tree will be little more than a stump amidst the conflagration!"]="Nossas orações a Aessina ficam sem resposta. Os servos ardentes de Ragnaros nos levaram à beira do abismo. Se eles não forem parados aqui, a Árvore do Mundo será pouco mais que um toco em meio à conflagração!"
G["Our priest trainers can be found within the Order of Light's chamber, at the entrance to the Seat of the Naaru. Light be with you."]="Nossos treinadores de sacerdotes podem ser encontrados dentro da câmara da Ordem da Luz, na entrada da sede dos Naaru. A luz esteja com você."
G["Our prince has forsaken us! All is lost!"]="Nosso Príncipe nos tem traído! Tudo está perdido!"
G["Our prisoner is strange. He carries no weapon, and his garb is... untraditional.\n\nPerhaps he's a lord of some kind. With any luck, we might have captured someone valuable!"]="Our prisoner is strange. He carries no weapon, and his garb is... untraditional.\n\nPerhaps he's a lord of some kind. With any luck, we might have captured someone valuable!"
G["Our punishment is also our blessing."]="Nosso castigo também é nossa bênção."
G["Our resident alchemist Lorokeem brought his equipment with him, in fact. It may be slightly different from what you're used to - he is an arakkoa, after all - but it should serve your needs. He roosts in the northwest portion of the lower city."]="De fato, nosso alquimista residente Lorokeem trouxe seu equipamento. Pode ser um pouco diferente do que você está acostumado - ele é um arakkoa, afinal - mas deve atender às suas necessidades. Ele fica na parte noroeste da cidade baixa."
G["Our resident jewelcrafter, Aleinia, can be found within Delaniel's establishment in Falconwing Square. She might be looking for an apprentice."]="Nosso joalheiro residente, Aleinia, pode ser encontrado no estabelecimento de Delaniel na Praça Falconwing. Ela pode estar procurando um aprendiz."
G["Our resources are well stocked, thanks to you. Please strive to keep them so."]="Temos suprimentos de sobra Obrigado você. Procura que não falten."
G["Our scouts have reported that the Lich King has a private chamber, outside of the Frozen Throne, deep within a place called the Halls of Reflection. That is our target, champions."]="Os batedores nos têm informou de que o Rei Lich tem uma instância no exterior do Trono Gelado, em um lugar chamado as Câmaras de Reflexão. Esse é nosso objetivo, campeões."
G["Our search has taken us across vast oceans and deep jungles, and yet we encounter one another here, of all places. It truly seems that our conflict is inevitable, wherever we go."]="Our search has taken us across vast oceans and deep jungles, and yet we encounter one another here, of all places. It truly seems that our conflict is inevitable, wherever we go."
G["Our seasoned units are leaving the field.  We need more supplies!"]="Our seasoned units are leaving the field.  We need more supplies!"
G["Our serpents are working hard to save the temple.\n\nThey will gladly lend their strength if you require it."]="Our serpents are working hard to save the temple.\n\nThey will gladly lend their strength if you require it."
G["Our ship from Northrend was attacked by Twilight's Hammer! I don't know how they got aboard, but they killed everyone."]="Our ship from Northrend was attacked by Twilight's Hammer! I don't know how they got aboard, but they killed everyone."
G["Our ship... NO! Did everyone escape? Gather here!"]="Nosso navio... NÃO! Tem escapado tudo o mundo? Reuníos aqui!"
G["Our ships! What in the name o' me beard happened?!"]="Nossos barcos! Por meus barbas, que tem passado aqui?"
G["Our sisters have been captured! Fall back!"]="Têm capturou a nossas irmãs! Retirada!"
G["Our soldiers speak of nothing but their new training."]="Nossos soldados somente falam do seu novo treinamento."
G["Our soldiers... they're all captives now."]="Nossos soldados... eles são todos cativos agora."
G["Our souls will never be freed."]="Nossas almas nunca serão livres!"
G["Our steady progress in our fight against the Qiraji can be attributed to the diverse help we received from nearly every corner of Kalimdor.\n\nYou need more than just soldiers to fight a war, $n.  Many of the war's unsung heroes are the traders and craftsmen that keep our forces supplied with the resources they need."]="Our steady progress in our fight against the Qiraji can be attributed to the diverse help we received from nearly every corner of Kalimdor.\n\nYou need more than just soldiers to fight a war, $n.  Many of the war's unsung heroes are the traders and craftsmen that keep our forces supplied with the resources they need."
G["Our storehouses have been depleted.  I have nothing to sell until we can get more supplies."]="Nossos depósitos foram esgotados. Não tenho nada para vender até conseguirmos mais suprimentos."
G["Our story begins long ago in the days of the monstrous Emperor Tian."]="Nossa história começa há muito tempo, nos dias do monstruoso Imperador Tian."
G["Our strategy is sound. We must not falter now, when we have so much still to gain."]="Our strategy is sound. We must not falter now, when we have so much still to gain."
G["Our studies are complete!  Well fought!  Headquarters will pour over our gained measurements and, with luck, uncover the Bash'ir's intentions.  Now, to the skies!"]="Our studies are complete!  Well fought!  Headquarters will pour over our gained measurements and, with luck, uncover the Bash'ir's intentions.  Now, to the skies!"
G["Our suffering is at an end. When this war is won, our people will see prosperity at last."]="Our suffering is at an end. When this war is won, our people will see prosperity at last."
G["Our summoning is complete! The Ash'ari crystal has been restored!"]="A evocação terminou! Os Cristais de Ash'ari têm banido restaurados!"
G["Our systems are jammed, Commander! I can't control this plane!"]="Our systems are jammed, Commander! I can't control this plane!"
G["Our tactics, our science, our bravery and determination shall prevail."]="Our tactics, our science, our bravery and determination shall prevail."
G["Our task is not yet done!"]="Ainda não temos terminou!"
G["Our time draws near."]="Nossa hora se aproxima."
G["Our time has come!"]="Chegou nossa hora!"
G["Our time is at an end, $n. I would wish you luck, if such a thing existed."]="Chegou o momentos, $n. Te desearía sorte, mas sei que a sorte não existe."
G["Our time is finally at hand. The naaru and their allies will learn the true meaning of suffering."]="Our time is finally at hand. The naaru and their allies will learn the true meaning of suffering."
G["Our time is up. We need to get aboard that ship."]="Se nos acabao tempo. É preciso subir a esse navio."
G["Our top minds have been looking into the seismic activities... Well, we've mostly been looking at how to secure a building's frame while at the same time simulating tectonic shifts..."]="Our top minds have been looking into the seismic activities... Well, we've mostly been looking at how to secure a building's frame while at the same time simulating tectonic shifts..."
G["Our torment is eternal."]="Nosso tormento é eterno!"
G["Our town's under the blasted ocean, our keep's full of Dark Iron traitors, and I'm laid up with such a wound I can't do a single thing about any of it.\n\nSo welcome to Menethil Harbor!"]="Our town's under the blasted ocean, our keep's full of Dark Iron traitors, and I'm laid up with such a wound I can't do a single thing about any of it.\n\nSo welcome to Menethil Harbor!"
G["Our troops, general, consist mostly of villagers and peasants.  Good men, but not quite rid of the prejudices and superstitions of their upbringing.  They're not ready to fight alongside our more exotic allies."]="Our troops, general, consist mostly of villagers and peasants.  Good men, but not quite rid of the prejudices and superstitions of their upbringing.  They're not ready to fight alongside our more exotic allies."
G["Our underground movement against the gronn must not falter!  Return and gather more information."]="Nosso movimento clandestino contra o gronn não deve vacilar! Volta e reúne mais informações."
G["Our units are not upgraded, and I don't have enough supplies to upgrade them."]="Nossas unidades não são atualizadas e não tenho suprimentos suficientes para atualizá-as."
G["Our units are upgraded to Champions, but I can still collect more supplies."]="Nossas unidades são atualizadas para Campeões, mas ainda posso coletar mais suprimentos."
G["Our units are upgraded to Seasoned, but I don't have enough supplies to upgrade them to Veteran."]="Nossas unidades são atualizadas para Seasoned, mas eu não tenho suprimentos suficientes para atualizá-as para Veteran."
G["Our units are upgraded to Veteran, but I don't have enough supplies to upgrade them to Champion."]="Nossas unidades são atualizadas para Veteran, mas eu não tenho suprimentos suficientes para atualizá-as para Champion."
G["Our veteran units are leaving the field.  We need more supplies!"]="Nossas unidades veteranas estão saindo do campo. Precisamos mais suprimentos!"
G["Our veterans are entering the field!"]="Nossas unidades veteranas estão entrando no campo!"
G["Our veterans are leaving the field.  We need more supplies!"]="Nossas unidades veteranas estão saindo do campo. Precisamos mais suprimentos!"
G["Our victory here was much thanks to you, $n."]="Nossa vitória se você deve em grande parte você, $n."
G["Our victory in Sun's Reach is absolute!  The naaru bless us with their presence!"]="Nossa vitória em Tramo do Sol é definitiva! Os naarus nos bendicen com o seu presença!"
G["Our victory is all but assured. With the power of the bell on our side, we will be unstoppable."]="Our victory is all but assured. With the power of the bell on our side, we will be unstoppable."
G["Our vigilance is eternal..."]="Nossa vigilance é eterna..."
G["Our village is small, but my family has been producing Pandaria's finest cider atop these hills for generations.\n\nI want nothing more than for peace to return so that we may collect our harvest and reunite with our children."]="Our village is small, but my family has been producing Pandaria's finest cider atop these hills for generations.\n\nI want nothing more than for peace to return so that we may collect our harvest and reunite with our children."
G["Our vision will be realized!"]="Nossa visão levará a cabo!"
G["Our voice gives form to Her will."]="Nossa voz da forma ao seu vontade."
G["Our war against the mogu is not yet over. But today we can rest, and proclaim our victory."]="Nossa guerra contra os mogu não terminou, mas hoje podemos descansar e cantar vitória."
G["Our warriors are dying. Do you have medical supplies I can take back with me?"]="Nossos guerreiros estão morrendo. Tem suprimentos médicos que me possa levar?"
G["Our warriors are losing!"]="Nossos guerreiros estão perdendo!"
G["Our warriors... they're all captives now."]="Nossos guerreiros... agora são todos cativos."
G["Our way is sacred.  We will choose death before we abandon Thorim and join the likes of the Lich King."]="Nosso caminho é sagrado. Escolheremos a morte antes de abandonarmos Thorim e nos unirmos a gente como Rei Lich."
G["Our wolves will feast on your bones!"]="Our wolves will feast on your bones!"
G["Our work here has been steady and tedious, but the statue is almost complete."]="Nosso trabalho foi constante e tedioso, mas a estátua já quase está acabada."
G["Our work here is finished for now. Let us deliver news of our victory to the Klaxxi Council. They await our return."]="Our work here is finished for now. Let us deliver news of our victory to the Klaxxi Council. They await our return."
G["Our work in the Living Grove must not be endangered.  Our very lives hinge upon its continued health and growth."]="Nosso trabalho no Living Grove não deve ser ameaçado. Nossas próprias vidas dependem da sua saúde e crescimento contínuos."
G["Our work is almost complete."]="Nosso trabalho quase terminou."
G["Our work is done. Now we wait on the Alliance to finish theirs before shipping everything over to Silithus."]="Our work is done. Now we wait on the Alliance to finish theirs before shipping everything over to Silithus."
G["Our work is far from done. Fandral will pay for his deceit."]="Our work is far from done. Fandral will pay for his deceit."
G["Our work is not yet complete! Stop them!"]="Our work is not yet complete! Stop them!"
G["Our work is not yet complete."]="Não temos terminou nosso trabalho."
G["Our work must not be interrupted! Ick, take care of them!"]="Não se você deve interromper nosso trabalho! Agh, ocúpate de eles!"
G["Our world needs more heroes like you."]="Nosso mundo precisa mais corajosos como você."
G["Our world will be torn apart. Join us, so that you may live!"]="Our world will be torn apart. Join us, so that you may live!"
G["Our world will end soon, but together we will ascend and inherit the power of the elements."]="Nosso mundo terminará em breve, mas juntos ascenderemos e herdaremos o poder dos elementos."
G["Our world."]="Nosso mundo."
G["Our wrath will paint the highlands red  - or whatever color our enemies bleed!"]="Our wrath will paint the highlands red  - or whatever color our enemies bleed!"
G["Ours is a path for those with an iron will and unfaltering resolve. You seem to possess none of these traits, $c."]="Ours is a path for those with an iron will and unfaltering resolve. You seem to possess none of these traits, $c."
G["Ours is an ancient and long lived culture.\n\nThanks to our craft, some of the memory of that culture can be preserved for future generations."]="Ours is an ancient and long lived culture.\n\nThanks to our craft, some of the memory of that culture can be preserved for future generations."
G["Ours is but to serve in Her divine name."]="Nosso destino é servir em nome da Divina."
G["Ours is but to serve; yours is but to die."]="Nosso destino é servir; o seu, morrer."
G["Ours is the TRUE Horde! The only Horde!"]="Somos a Horda verdadeira! A única!"
G["Ours is the path of glory, $r! The puny Alliance is still trying to scrape together their war supplies, while we have gathered all of ours and stand ready to send them to Silithus."]="Ours is the path of glory, $r! The puny Alliance is still trying to scrape together their war supplies, while we have gathered all of ours and stand ready to send them to Silithus."
G["Ours is the path of purity and righteousness in the Light."]="O nosso é o caminho da pureza e justiça na Luz."
G["Ours is the true Horde!"]="A nossa é a Horda autêntico!"
G["Ours is the way of highest service. I have no time for petty conversation or challenges from a low lander."]="Ours is the way of highest service. I have no time for petty conversation or challenges from a low lander."
G["Ours is to rule. Yours is to serve!"]="Ours is to rule. Yours is to serve!"
G["Out da way!"]="Out da way!"
