G["Out with it, Farstrider! What news do you bring?"]="Desembucha, Errante. Que notícia traz?"
G["Outa my way, mon. I'm off ta join da pirates!"]="Outa my way, mon. I'm off ta join da pirates!"
G["Outgoing, $c."]="Saindo, $c."
G["Outland just oozes with magical energy, it's in the very air.  Can you feel it, $n?  I can't think of a place better suited to our race.  Soon the sin'dorei shall have a new land to call our own!"]="Outland just oozes with magical energy, it's in the very air.  Can you feel it, $n?  I can't think of a place better suited to our race.  Soon the sin'dorei shall have a new land to call our own!"
