G["Outsider! Ally of the Shado-Pan.\n\n<The old yaungol spits out the strange words bitterly.>\n\nCome closer if you wish me to break your neck!"]="Outsider! Ally of the Shado-Pan.\n\n<The old yaungol spits out the strange words bitterly.>\n\nCome closer if you wish me to break your neck!"
G["Outsider, what brings you to our village?"]="Outsider, what brings you to our village?"
G["Outsiders are forbidden!"]="Não se permitem intrusos aqui!"
G["Outsiders are rare here. Rarer still are outsiders who arrive on a floating ship of death."]="Outsiders are rare here. Rarer still are outsiders who arrive on a floating ship of death."
G["Outsiders! Kill em all!"]="Intrusos! Matem-nos a todos!"
