G["Outstandin' fightin'! Ya made an old man proud. Keep it up and ale will be on me ta'night."]="Excelente luta! Fez que este velho se enorgulhezca de vocês. Sigam assim e a cerveja correrá de meu conta esta noite."
G["Outstanding party, $n. Thanks for the disco ball!"]="Uma festa absurdo, $n. Obrigado pela bola de discoteca!"
G["Outstanding! Kaz'rogal's death cry should strike fear into the core of the Burning Legion. They now know the power your forces possess, so expect the worst the Legion can offer."]="Excepcional! O grito de morte de Kaz'rogal deve causar medo no núcleo da Legião Ardente. Agora eles sabem o poder que suas forças possuem, então espere o pior que a Legião possa oferecer."
G["Outstanding! Killing a Pit Lord such as Azgalor is no small feat, my friend. If we had more time, I would love to hear the story of you and your companions. Archimonde will not give us that pause, however. My scouts have already reported that the Legion is amassing an immense force outside our camp, and Archimonde is very close to the World Tree. We are evacuating with the help of Lady Proudmoore. You should head to the World Tree at once. The fate of our world is still undecided."]="Excepcional! Matar um Pit Lord como Azgalor não é pouca coisa, meu amigo. Se tivéssemos mais tempo, adoraria ouvir a história de você e seus companheiros. Archimonde não nos dará essa pausa, no entanto. Meus batedores já informaram que a Legião está acumulando uma força imensa fosse do nosso acampamento, e Archimonde está muito perto da Árvore do Mundo. Estamos evacuando com a ajuda de Lady Proudmoore. Você deve ir para a Árvore do Mundo de uma só vez. O destino do nosso mundo ainda está indeciso."
G["Outta my way!"]="Aparta de meu caminho!"
G["Outta my way, mon!"]="Aparta de meu caminho, colega!"
G["Over 12,000 years ago, the Mogu empire was founded by Lei Shen, \"The Thunder King.\""]="Há 12.000 anos, o império mogu foi fundada por Lei Shen, \"o Rei do Trovão\"."
G["Over a thousand years ago a group of troll priests known as the Atal'ai attempted to bring back an ancient blood god named Hakkar the Soulflayer. After the resulting civil war the priests were defeated and exiled to the Swamp of Sorrows. There they erected a temple to Hakkar to prepare for his arrival into the physical world. The dragon Aspect Ysera soon learned of the Atal'ai's plans and smashed the temple beneath the marshes. To this day, the temple's ruins are guarded by the mighty green dragons."]="Over a thousand years ago a group of troll priests known as the Atal'ai attempted to bring back an ancient blood god named Hakkar the Soulflayer. After the resulting civil war the priests were defeated and exiled to the Swamp of Sorrows. There they erected a temple to Hakkar to prepare for his arrival into the physical world. The dragon Aspect Ysera soon learned of the Atal'ai's plans and smashed the temple beneath the marshes. To this day, the temple's ruins are guarded by the mighty green dragons."
G["Over by Crystal Lake there lives a lady named Adele Fielder.  She makes patches for the local guards with the extra leather she gets from the local skinner, Helene.  She would probably be the one to see if you're interested in learning the profession."]="Em Crystal Lake, mora uma senhora chamada Adele Fielder. Ela faz remendos para os guardas locais com o couro extra que ela recebe do skinner local, Helene. Provavelmente seria ela quem veria se você está interessado em aprender a profissão."
