G["Pa keeps telling me I need to be more like my grandpa. But he died before I was born in a yak stampede."]="Pa keeps telling me I need to be more like my grandpa. But he died before I was born in a yak stampede."
G["Pa says we've faced worse. But when he says \"we\" he means people like his great great grandfather.\n\nThe worst thing I've ever had to face was a grummle angry that his yak wasn't smelly enough."]="Pa says we've faced worse. But when he says \"we\" he means people like his great great grandfather.\n\nThe worst thing I've ever had to face was a grummle angry that his yak wasn't smelly enough."
G["Pack yer bags, $n! We're off to the Twilight Highlands. You ready?"]="Faça as maletas, $n! Nos vamos as Terras Altas Crepúsculo. Está $gpronto: pronta;?"
G["Packed up with lumber? Good. Send it up to Orgrimmar."]="Até cima de madeira? Perfeito. Envíala a Orgrimmar."
G["Pah! Does not prove anything!"]="Buá! Não demonstra nada!"
G["Pah! I know I seen you around, but that don't make us friends. Go away!"]="Pah! I know I seen you around, but that don't make us friends. Go away!"
G["Pah! I remember when Un'sok was still a drone, afraid to mix his first toxin. I dare him to face me alone. Then we shall see whose alchemy is supreme."]="Pah! I remember when Un'sok was still a drone, afraid to mix his first toxin. I dare him to face me alone. Then we shall see whose alchemy is supreme."
G["Pah! That was a show of strength, worthy of a leader. I only regret I did not kill that human before the mage interfered."]="Bah! Isso foi uma demonstração de força digna de um líder. Somente lamento não haver matou a esse humano antes de que o mago interfiriera."
G["Pah! Those who failed deserved to die; you have merely culled the weak!"]="Pah! Those who failed deserved to die; you have merely culled the weak!"
G["Pain and suffering are all that await you!"]="Pain and suffering are all that await you!"
