G["Pandaria does not have a standing army. We, the Shado-Pan, are its first - and only - line of defense."]="Pandaria não conta com um exército. Nós, o Shadopan, somos a primeira e única linha de defesa."
G["Pandaria has not seen a full-scale war since the mists closed in. The Shado-Pan usually handle any trouble that crops up on the continent."]="Pandaria has not seen a full-scale war since the mists closed in. The Shado-Pan usually handle any trouble that crops up on the continent."
G["Pandaria is indeed a jewel. Such beauty. It makes you want to protect her, yes?"]="Pandaria is indeed a jewel. Such beauty. It makes you want to protect her, yes?"
