G["Paragons of Power are powerful mojo.  They are Gurubashi Empire mojo.  We Zandalar must get mojo.  The tribe will take mojo for our own.  The Blood God will not destroy us.\n\nThere are three kinds of Paragons in Zul'Gurub.  Seek coins.  Seek bijous.  Seek primal items.  These are the Paragons.\n\nGo to Zul'Gurub now.  Kill.  Take the Paragons of Power.  Bring them to the tribe.  Earn our respect.  Earn our battle gear.  Earn real power."]="Paragons of Power are powerful mojo.  They are Gurubashi Empire mojo.  We Zandalar must get mojo.  The tribe will take mojo for our own.  The Blood God will not destroy us.\n\nThere are three kinds of Paragons in Zul'Gurub.  Seek coins.  Seek bijous.  Seek primal items.  These are the Paragons.\n\nGo to Zul'Gurub now.  Kill.  Take the Paragons of Power.  Bring them to the tribe.  Earn our respect.  Earn our battle gear.  Earn real power."
G["Paratroopers?!"]="Paratroopers?!"
G["Parched crops just need water!\n\nThey should be easy to take care of now that we've got that sprinkler! It should be on the ground just at the edge of the field."]="Parched crops just need water!\n\nThey should be easy to take care of now that we've got that sprinkler! It should be on the ground just at the edge of the field."
G["Parched crops just need water!\n\nYou can use the old rusty watering can my grandpa left here. I keep it right over there by that tree stump, just next to the field."]="Parched crops just need water!\n\nYou can use the old rusty watering can my grandpa left here. I keep it right over there by that tree stump, just next to the field."
G["Pardon me traveller, but did you happen to bring any bamboo up from the forest below?  I spend all day staring at it, drooling, hungry to no avail.  Yet all I have to eat up here is what I can conjour from my limited magics."]="Pardon me traveller, but did you happen to bring any bamboo up from the forest below?  I spend all day staring at it, drooling, hungry to no avail.  Yet all I have to eat up here is what I can conjour from my limited magics."
G["Pardon me, $r, but I am on official business and cannot be disturbed.\n\nPlease excuse me."]="Pardon me, $r, but I am on official business and cannot be disturbed.\n\nPlease excuse me."
G["Pardon me, friend, but I'm busier than it might appear.\n\nI've been commissioned to document the discoveries of the commander in this region, you see.\n\nThey're certain to be most profound!"]="Discúlpame, $gamigo: amiga;, mas estou mais ocupado do que parece.\n\nMe têm encarregou documentar os descubrimentos do Comandante na região, sabe?\n\nSeguro que são do mais profundos!"
G["Pardon the intrusion, Lady Prestor, but Highlord Bolvar suggested that I seek your advice."]="Pardon the intrusion, Lady Prestor, but Highlord Bolvar suggested that I seek your advice."
G["Parents cannot always be assured of the legacy they will leave behind."]="Os pais nem sempre podem garantir o legado que será deixado para trás."
