G["Patience, $g dearest: dear; $n. The time is not quite right. Fire the flare again soon and we shall begin...."]="Patience, $g dearest: dear; $n. The time is not quite right. Fire the flare again soon and we shall begin...."
G["Patience, $n. I didn't become the renowned Budd Nedreck by being hasty.\n\nFinal preparations are being made and soon the treasures and secrets of Zul'Aman shall be mine! \n\n<Budd pauses and looks at you for a moment, then chuckles.>\n\n...ours I mean, of course."]="Patience, $n. I didn't become the renowned Budd Nedreck by being hasty.\n\nFinal preparations are being made and soon the treasures and secrets of Zul'Aman shall be mine! \n\n<Budd pauses and looks at you for a moment, then chuckles.>\n\n...ours I mean, of course."
G["Patience, Suna! If we march into Townlong alone, we compound our problems. We must focus on the Monastery and get reinforcements."]="Patience, Suna! If we march into Townlong alone, we compound our problems. We must focus on the Monastery and get reinforcements."
G["Patience, Suna. I share your desire to stop the yaungol. But I must consider every soldier, not just your husband."]="Paciência, Suna. Também desejo parar aos yaungol, mas devo ter em conta a todos os soldados, não somente ao seu marido."
G["Patience, Tyrande."]="Paciência, Tyrande."
