G["Patience, general. The Light embraces all who enter Shattrath in good faith."]="Patience, general. The Light embraces all who enter Shattrath in good faith."
G["Patience, guests. The waters are nearly cleansed."]="Paciência, convidados. As águas estão quase purificadas."
G["Patience, now. It will be done soon."]="Paciência. Já ocorrida pouco."
