G["Pay attention, soldier! You need to take this beacon to the Snowfall graveyard and plant it! Protect it long enough so that my gryphon can lock on.\n\nIf my gryphon gets a solid strike location, Mulv and his crew will be humiliated!"]="Pay attention, soldier! You need to take this beacon to the Snowfall graveyard and plant it! Protect it long enough so that my gryphon can lock on.\n\nIf my gryphon gets a solid strike location, Mulv and his crew will be humiliated!"
