G["Pay no attention to their kind, $n. The sacrifices made by your order are lost on them. They will never understand the price you pay for the power you wield in their defense."]="Pay no attention to their kind, $n. The sacrifices made by your order are lost on them. They will never understand the price you pay for the power you wield in their defense."
