G["Production professions allow you to turn raw materials into items that you can use yourself, give to companions, or sell at an auction house.\nThey are often paired with a gathering profession so that you can gather your own raw materials, but it is possible to simply buy materials on the auction house."]="Production professions allow you to turn raw materials into items that you can use yourself, give to companions, or sell at an auction house.\nThey are often paired with a gathering profession so that you can gather your own raw materials, but it is possible to simply buy materials on the auction house."
