G["Progress is going swimmingly, friend. You should focus on maintaining what you've done."]="Progress is going swimmingly, friend. You should focus on maintaining what you've done."
G["Promise me you will keep out of trouble while I am away?"]="Promise me you will keep out of trouble while I am away?"
G["Promise me you'll find him, $n."]="Prométeme que o encontrar, $n."
G["Promised One, do you remember us? Do you recall the prophecy of Kurz? This moment was pre-ordained. You have done what you were put on this world to do.\n\n<High Chief Stillpine bows before you.>\n\nDraenei will always be welcome among my people."]="Promised One, do you remember us? Do you recall the prophecy of Kurz? This moment was pre-ordained. You have done what you were put on this world to do.\n\n<High Chief Stillpine bows before you.>\n\nDraenei will always be welcome among my people."
G["Promised One, we thank you for the warning. The Stillpine tribe will be prepared."]="Prometido, agradecemos o aviso. A tribo Stillpine será preparada."
G["Promises, promises! There is nothing you can do to save us. The Zandalari are ruthless!"]="Promises, promises! There is nothing you can do to save us. The Zandalari are ruthless!"
G["Proper sustenance will keep a soldier alive long after the wounds of the battlefield should have finished $g him : her; off, $c. If we're to persevere in the Ahn'Qiraj War to come, we'll need all of the provisions that we can carry. I'm gathering up spotted yellowtail fish at this location before it is to be shipped out.\n\nAs of now we have $2101w, but we need to collect a total of $2103w if we're going to be able to feed everyone."]="Proper sustenance will keep a soldier alive long after the wounds of the battlefield should have finished $g him : her; off, $c. If we're to persevere in the Ahn'Qiraj War to come, we'll need all of the provisions that we can carry. I'm gathering up spotted yellowtail fish at this location before it is to be shipped out.\n\nAs of now we have $2101w, but we need to collect a total of $2103w if we're going to be able to feed everyone."
G["Properly responding to these events builds power\nwithin the Demolisher  5000's overflow tank.\n\n|TInterface\\Icons\\INV_Misc_EngGizmos_04.blp:32|t |TInterface\\Icons\\INV_Misc_EngGizmos_12.blp:32|t |TInterface\\Icons\\INV_Misc_EngGizmos_13.blp:32|t"]="Properly responding to these events builds power\nwithin the Demolisher  5000's overflow tank.\n\n|TInterface\\Icons\\INV_Misc_EngGizmos_04.blp:32|t |TInterface\\Icons\\INV_Misc_EngGizmos_12.blp:32|t |TInterface\\Icons\\INV_Misc_EngGizmos_13.blp:32|t"
G["Prophet Velen!"]="Profeta Velen!"
G["Propose? I propose that we prepare. That we prepare our loved ones, family and friends for the possibility of an undead holocaust."]="Propose? I propose that we prepare. That we prepare our loved ones, family and friends for the possibility of an undead holocaust."
G["Propose? I will show you what I propose!"]="Propose? I will show you what I propose!"
G["Prospecting is the primary method of finding gems!   You simply use the prospecting ability (which is found in the professions tab of your spellbook) on a stack of five ore to extract the gems from it.   Any type of non-precious ore will do!    \nBetter quality ores will provide more valuable gems so you will find higher quality gems in iron ore than in copper ore."]="Prospecting is the primary method of finding gems!   You simply use the prospecting ability (which is found in the professions tab of your spellbook) on a stack of five ore to extract the gems from it.   Any type of non-precious ore will do!    \nBetter quality ores will provide more valuable gems so you will find higher quality gems in iron ore than in copper ore."
