G["Ruby drakes excel at mitigating damage and protecting their allies.\nUsing searing wrath, they can breathe streams of liquid fire that jump from target to target, dealing increasing damage with each jump.\nWhenever a ruby drake is damaged by an enemy attack, it gains an evasive charge.  These charges can be used to perform a series of evasive maneuvers, allowing the drake to dodge incoming attacks and spells for a time."]="Ruby drakes excel at mitigating damage and protecting their allies.\nUsing searing wrath, they can breathe streams of liquid fire that jump from target to target, dealing increasing damage with each jump.\nWhenever a ruby drake is damaged by an enemy attack, it gains an evasive charge.  These charges can be used to perform a series of evasive maneuvers, allowing the drake to dodge incoming attacks and spells for a time."
