G["Rumors say that giant men live in Northrend.  They have beards made of daggers and can put out fires with their dead, cold gaze."]="Rumors say that giant men live in Northrend.  They have beards made of daggers and can put out fires with their dead, cold gaze."
G["Rumors, child. Rumors have a way of attaching themselves to people of power. In fact, I recently heard a particularly nasty one about the late lord Bolvar.\n\nI will ask you to spread your lies elsewhere. Return when you are ready to confess your wrongs before the Light."]="Rumors, child. Rumors have a way of attaching themselves to people of power. In fact, I recently heard a particularly nasty one about the late lord Bolvar.\n\nI will ask you to spread your lies elsewhere. Return when you are ready to confess your wrongs before the Light."
