G["See, the Venture Company's new shredder is better than my latest, from the interchangeable hands to the control grips!\n\nMy boss has given me a pretty strict deadline, but my boys and I couldn't come up with anything. Nothing was working, so we decided to \"borrow\" one of their prototypes. I sent Wizzlecrank to the Sludge Fen to steal one, but he hasn't gotten back yet!"]="See, the Venture Company's new shredder is better than my latest, from the interchangeable hands to the control grips!\n\nMy boss has given me a pretty strict deadline, but my boys and I couldn't come up with anything. Nothing was working, so we decided to \"borrow\" one of their prototypes. I sent Wizzlecrank to the Sludge Fen to steal one, but he hasn't gotten back yet!"
