G["Setting foot in the Dread Wastes taught me the value of knowing the terrain and understanding the enemies' movements.  Whether the goal is victory or simply survival, the best route is always to be two steps ahead of your opponent."]="Setting foot in the Dread Wastes taught me the value of knowing the terrain and understanding the enemies' movements.  Whether the goal is victory or simply survival, the best route is always to be two steps ahead of your opponent."
