G["Settle down, will ya! No need to be gettin' all riled up over nothin'! Remember what happened last time? Now sit down!"]="Settle down, will ya! No need to be gettin' all riled up over nothin'! Remember what happened last time? Now sit down!"
G["Settle down, you two. We have much to do, and getting Lin out alive is one of our top priorities."]="Já é suficiente. Nos fica muito por fazer, e trazer a Lin com vida é uma das nossas máxima prioridades."
G["Settle yourselves in and come by the market any day if you are looking for work."]="Settle yourselves in and come by the market any day if you are looking for work."
G["Settle yourselves in first. You'll be able to farm your fields, but I'm afraid you're too inexperienced to continue further. Once you've seen more of Pandaria, be sure to stop by."]="Asentaos antes. Poderá cultivar os campos, mas me temo que ainda te falta experiência para fazer mais coisas. Venha a vernos quando conozcas melhor as terras de Pandaria."
