G["Several leaves and branches cling to this object, indicating that it may have been used as part of a nest for some creature.  There is otherwise nothing of note."]="Várias folhas e galhos se apegam a esse item, indicando que ele pode ter sido usado como parte de um ninho para alguma criatura. Ouvidos contrário, não há nada digno de nota."
G["Several piles of supplies rest on the table.  You decide to start with the worg hides."]="Várias pilhas de suprimentos estão sobre a mesa. Você decide começar com os couros worg."
G["Several sets of the Plates of Uldum have been synthesized by the Creators for their expressed use.  The Creators control the distribution of said discs for all complexes on this world.  As such, Azeroth has been rescheduled for visitation, and therefore future discs may enter circulation at that time.\n\nExisting discs have been fully distributed to those parties with appropriate security clearance."]="Several sets of the Plates of Uldum have been synthesized by the Creators for their expressed use.  The Creators control the distribution of said discs for all complexes on this world.  As such, Azeroth has been rescheduled for visitation, and therefore future discs may enter circulation at that time.\n\nExisting discs have been fully distributed to those parties with appropriate security clearance."
G["Several small samples of oil sit in front of you, along with an empty beaker.  The beaker looks like it can probably fit about five samples inside of it.\n\nWhat kind of oil will you take first?"]="Several small samples of oil sit in front of you, along with an empty beaker.  The beaker looks like it can probably fit about five samples inside of it.\n\nWhat kind of oil will you take first?"
G["Several spots of dried blood can be seen on this object, likely a result of the struggle to obtain the artifact by the trolls.  The object is quite plain, however, and may not have been worth the struggle."]="Vários pontos de sangue seco podem ser vistos nesse item, provavelmente resultado da luta para obter o artefato pelos trolls. O item é bastante claro, no entanto, e pode não ter valido a pena a luta."
G["Several strange carvings adorn this object, perhaps made by the trolls in an attempt to decipher its origins.  They did not seem to meet with much success, as the object remains inert."]="Várias esculturas estranhas adornam esse item, talvez feitas pelos trolls na tentativa de decifrar suas origens. Eles não parecem ter muito sucesso, pois o item permanece inerte."
