G["Shaman Vekjik, I have spoken with the big-tongues and they desire peace. I have brought this offering on their behalf."]="Xamã Vekjik, falei com as grandes línguas e elas desejam paz. Eu trouxe esta oferta em nome deles."
G["Shaman and druid ways are very different. When was the last time you saw one of us turn into a wild beast?  ... nevermind."]="Os caminhos de um xamã e de um druida são muito diferentes. Quando foi a última vez que viste a um dos nós se transformar em uma fera selvagem...? Não importa."
G["Shaman! The Dragon Soul is not yours. Give it up, and you may yet walk away with your life."]="Xamã! O Alma de dragão não te pertence. Devuélvela e talvez salgas com vida."
G["Shaman."]="Xamã."
G["Shaman...? A troll mystic of some sort has come to the city recently to visit Harene upon the Walk of Elders. She might be able to help you."]="Xamã...? Uma espécie de místico troll chegou à cidade recentemente para visitar a Harene no Caminho dos Ancestrais. Talvez ela te possa ajudar."
G["Shamanism has brought you here... Its scent permeates the air. *The Lich King laughs* I was once a shaman."]="Shamanism has brought you here... Its scent permeates the air. *The Lich King laughs* I was once a shaman."
G["Shamanistic healing is a complex art. You can't just chain heal all day."]="Shamanistic healing is a complex art. You can't just chain heal all day."
G["Shamans, show me what your totems can do!"]="Shamans, show me what your totems can do!"
G["Shame to sit on something so pretty."]="Shame to sit on something so pretty."
G["Shan Bu shall fall! Are you ready to proceed?"]="Shan Bu cairá! Está $gpronto: pronta; para seguir?"
G["Shan Bu! Again you try to create a God. When will you learn?"]="Shan Bu! Outra vez intentas criar um deus? Quando aprenderá?"
G["Shan Bu's monstrosity remains at the foot of the palace. It must be stopped before it wreaks havoc across Pandaria."]="Shan Bu's monstrosity remains at the foot of the palace. It must be stopped before it wreaks havoc across Pandaria."
G["Shan Bu, secure the inner courtyard. None should look upon my works and live."]="Shan Bu, defenda o pátio interno. Ninguém deverá olhar meus engenhos e viver."
G["Shan Kien's eyes glow with Sha Magic!"]="Shan Kien's eyes glow with Sha Magic!"
