G["Shan-ze! Hei Feng! Kill him!"]="Shan-ze! Hei Feng! Matem-no!"
G["Shandris raises her bow to the stars!"]="Shandris ergue seu arco cima as estrelas!"
G["Shane Dabiri, Lee, Alex T., Rob F., J. A. B.,  A. Mayberry!"]="Shane Dabiri, Lê, Alex T., Rob F., J. A. B., A. Mayberry!"
