G["Shaol'mara Beastcaller summons raptors to his aid!"]="Shaol'mara Beastcaller summons raptors to his aid!"
G["Shapeshift!  Get ready for de moonfire!"]="Caminho de fo'ma! Prepá'ate para o Fogo lunar!"
G["Shapeshift!  Get ready to taste my claws!"]="Caminho de fo'ma! Prepá'ate para testar meus garras!"
G["Shapeshift!  Here come de moonfire!"]="Caminho de fo'ma! Aqui vem o Fogo lunar!"
