G["Shaping the flow of time is a very difficult and quite delicate task, but you have performed admirably today."]="Modelar o fluxo do tempo é uma tarefa muito difícil e bastante delicada, mas você realizou admiravelmente hoje."
G["Share in my pain!"]="Compah'te meu dor!"
G["Shark!!!"]="Shark!!!"
G["Sharp claw."]="Garra afilada."
G["Sharp teeth, muscles like cables, and a mind like a steel trap. This fella is one of the finest pets I have ever seen. Now if ye are interested, I could show ye a few things to make even the weakest of Raptors into a force to be reckoned with."]="Sharp teeth, muscles like cables, and a mind like a steel trap. This fella is one of the finest pets I have ever seen. Now if ye are interested, I could show ye a few things to make even the weakest of Raptors into a force to be reckoned with."
G["Sharp teeth, sharp claws."]="Colmilhos afilados, garras afiadas."
G["Sharp tooth."]="Dente afilado."
G["Sharp!"]="Afilado!"
G["Sharpbeak's the finest gryphon in Aerie Peak. He'll get you right to the top of Jintha'Alor, and we'll take the top terraces in no time."]="O Sharpbeak é o melhor grifo do Aerie Peak. Ele o levará direto ao topo de Jintha'Alor, e nós tomaremos os melhores terraços em pouco tempo."
G["Sharpbeak."]="Bicoafiado."
G["Shatter Point is a great place for a Wildhammer dwarf.  I've never had so much time in the air!"]="Shatter Point é um ótimo lugar para um anão Wildhammer. Eu nunca tive tanto tempo no ar!"
G["Shatter the bones!"]="Shatter the bones!"
G["Shattered Sun scum!  Fire at will!"]="Shattered Sun scum!  Fire at will!"
G["Shattered!"]="Estilhaçando!"
G["Shattrath did not fall, as you can see.  To the contrary, the naaru known as Xi'ri, led a successful incursion into Shadowmoon Valley - Illidan's doorstep.\n\nThere he continues to wage war on Illidan's armies with the assitance of the Aldor and the Scryers.\n\nThe two factions have not given up on their old feuds, however. Such is their animosity that they vie for the honor of being the ones sent to assist the naaru there.  Each day, that decision is made by A'dal right here in Shattrath."]="Shattrath did not fall, as you can see.  To the contrary, the naaru known as Xi'ri, led a successful incursion into Shadowmoon Valley - Illidan's doorstep.\n\nThere he continues to wage war on Illidan's armies with the assitance of the Aldor and the Scryers.\n\nThe two factions have not given up on their old feuds, however. Such is their animosity that they vie for the honor of being the ones sent to assist the naaru there.  Each day, that decision is made by A'dal right here in Shattrath."
G["Shattrath is more than a staging ground for war against the Burning Legion and Illidan.  It serves as a sanctuary to those seeking to escape the violence surrounding us.\n\nWe would be hypocrites if we turned the refugees away.\n\nIf your question refers to the Scryers, then I will respond that while I may not like them or their leader's wild claims of visions of redemption, it is not for us to question the wisdom of the naaru.\n\nThese are difficult times, $n.  We need allies where we can find them."]="Shattrath is more than a staging ground for war against the Burning Legion and Illidan.  It serves as a sanctuary to those seeking to escape the violence surrounding us.\n\nWe would be hypocrites if we turned the refugees away.\n\nIf your question refers to the Scryers, then I will respond that while I may not like them or their leader's wild claims of visions of redemption, it is not for us to question the wisdom of the naaru.\n\nThese are difficult times, $n.  We need allies where we can find them."
G["Shattrath was once the draenei capital of this world. Its name means \"dwelling of light.\""]="Shattrath was once the draenei capital of this world. Its name means \"dwelling of light.\""
G["Shattrath's battlemasters often congregate on the stairwells between the upper and lower city. The Alliance battlemasters gather in one place, the Horde in another, with the arena battlemasters between and across from them."]="Os mestres de batalha de Shattrath geralmente se reúnem nas escadas entre a cidade alta e a baixa. Os mestres de batalha da Aliança se reúnem em um lugar, a Horda em outro, com os mestres de batalha da arena entre e à linha de frente deles."
G["Shattrath's flight master is Nutral. You will find him east of the city's center."]="O mestre de vôo de Shattrath é Nutral. Você o encontrará a leste do centro da cidade."
G["Shattrath's inns are full of wounded refugees. Still, there is room among the draenei Aldor and blood elf Scryers on Aldor Rise and Scryer's Tier."]="As pousadas de Shattrath estão cheias de refugiados feridos. Ainda assim, há espaço entre os draenei Aldor e os elfos sanguíneos Scryers no Aldor Rise e no nível de Scryer."
G["Shay, what'sh your deal anwaysh? Are you shome kind of elf or shomethin? You looksh shorta familiar."]="Shay, what'sh your deal anwaysh? Are you shome kind of elf or shomethin? You looksh shorta familiar."
G["Shaza-kiel!"]="Shaza-kiel!"
G["Shcourged trooolls roashting...."]="Shcourged trooolls roashting...."
G["She allowed herself to be defeated. The others will not be so weak."]="Está claro que se tem saído derrotar. Os mais não serão tão fracos."
G["She asked for eggs. Eggs for her fiery hatchery in another realm.\n\nAnd one egg... a special egg... she sought more than any other."]="She asked for eggs. Eggs for her fiery hatchery in another realm.\n\nAnd one egg... a special egg... she sought more than any other."
G["She blames me, you know."]="Me culpar a mim, sabe?"
G["She came from Thundermar, they say"]="Era de Bramal, ou isso dizia a gente"
G["She demanded that we immediately head back to Hive'Regal! Brann would have none of that sass. He told her that there's no way we would go back into those hives without an army backing us up. It had gotten far too dangerous. The number of those stinking insects seemed to have tripled from when we first ventured into 'em.\n\nThat's when Natalia lost it!"]="She demanded that we immediately head back to Hive'Regal! Brann would have none of that sass. He told her that there's no way we would go back into those hives without an army backing us up. It had gotten far too dangerous. The number of those stinking insects seemed to have tripled from when we first ventured into 'em.\n\nThat's when Natalia lost it!"
G["She did? He is?\n\nI suppose I'll have to head over there then. Maybe... after a few more bites of food..."]="She did? He is?\n\nI suppose I'll have to head over there then. Maybe... after a few more bites of food..."
G["She has a name, you know. Anara. You'd do well to treat her with the respect she deserves.\n\nHow many times have she and her sisters brought you back from the grip of death itself? You're just all kinds of inconsiderate, aren't you?"]="She has a name, you know. Anara. You'd do well to treat her with the respect she deserves.\n\nHow many times have she and her sisters brought you back from the grip of death itself? You're just all kinds of inconsiderate, aren't you?"
G["She has returned. Tha revenge of the Darkspear finally comes to pass dis day.\n\nLet me know when ya ready, $n. We'll not let her slip away again."]="She has returned. Tha revenge of the Darkspear finally comes to pass dis day.\n\nLet me know when ya ready, $n. We'll not let her slip away again."
G["She hits 'em between the eyes, every time."]="She hits 'em between the eyes, every time."
G["She is here at my invitation, courier. Most of my Farstriders are away and cannot be recalled easily. Vereesa's rangers know the land and they are experienced combatants."]="She is here at my invitation, courier. Most of my Farstriders are away and cannot be recalled easily. Vereesa's rangers know the land and they are experienced combatants."
G["She is trying to throw you off, hold on tight!\n\n|TInterface\\Icons\\inv_misc_desecrated_leatherglove.blp:32|t Hold On"]="Tenta lançar, agárrate forte!\n\n|TInterface\\Icons\\inv_misc_desecrated_leatherglove.blp:32|t Aguanta."
G["She looked like Li Li."]="She looked like Li Li."
G["She made the back cover too!"]="Também fez a coberta posterior!"
G["She must answer for her crimes."]="Deve pagar pelos seus crímenes."
G["She must be torn by grief over her husband's death."]="Deve estar desolada pela morte do seu marido."
G["She now resides at the side of Emperor Thaurissan. He has her under some sort of powerful thought altering spell... and here I sit, completely helpless."]="Ela vive agora ao lado ao imperador Thaurissan. Ele a tem sometida a uma sorte de encantamento que altera a mente... e aqui estou eu, totalmente indefeso."
G["She of the skies, but also of darkness. Brood of the Earth-Warder. Invincible!"]="Ela dos céus, mas também das trevas. Ninhada do Guardião da Terra. Invencível!"
G["She retains knowledge and speech, and even the self sufficiency to perform tasks for you. Precisely what did you do?"]="She retains knowledge and speech, and even the self sufficiency to perform tasks for you. Precisely what did you do?"
G["She said to meet her right here... maybe I'm in the wrong place?"]="Disse que a encontraría logo aqui… estarei no lugar enganado?"
G["She scare me, she mean and say we smell bad. She in War Quarter, inner ring."]="She scare me, she mean and say we smell bad. She in War Quarter, inner ring."
G["She seems to be assaulting her own towers!"]="Parece que está atacando seus próprias torres!"
G["She should be a pile of bones and slime! Strong of stomach, indeed..."]="Deveria ser um monte de ossos e babas! É de estômago forte, desde depois..."
G["She stole your man, girlfriend! You know what you gotta do!"]="She stole your man, girlfriend! You know what you gotta do!"
G["She submits.  Well done, fleshling."]="Se somete. Bem feito, ser de carne."
G["She tests us. We will not disappoint Her."]="Nos coloca a prova. Não a defraudaremos."
G["She took a pretty nasty spill. the damage is horrific! I haven't been able to wake her."]="She took a pretty nasty spill. the damage is horrific! I haven't been able to wake her."
G["She trusts no one. Paranoia gnaws at her mind. She is driven by fear unrelenting."]="Não confia em ninguém. A paranoia se tem apoderado do seu mente. Está controlada por um medo implacável."
G["She wanted me to tell you lugs that she appreciates the job that we did for her on the Furlbrows. Gave me a pile o' gold to split with you all."]="She wanted me to tell you lugs that she appreciates the job that we did for her on the Furlbrows. Gave me a pile o' gold to split with you all."
G["She was a female dwarf.  A paladin.  She used the last of her mana curing comrades before falling to her own infection."]="She was a female dwarf.  A paladin.  She used the last of her mana curing comrades before falling to her own infection."
G["She was found by our patrols this morning.  Murdered within our own city."]="As patrulhas a encontraram esta manhã. Asesinada dentro de nossa cidade."
G["She was ready ta forge a new future for the Kirin Tor, one where the Horde-allied Sunreavers and the Alliance-sided Silver Covenant could work together in peace."]="She was ready ta forge a new future for the Kirin Tor, one where the Horde-allied Sunreavers and the Alliance-sided Silver Covenant could work together in peace."
G["She was ready ta forgive the Horde fer the destruction o' Theramore."]="She was ready ta forgive the Horde fer the destruction o' Theramore."
G["She will feast on yer soul!"]="Se dará um feh'tín com a sua alma!"
G["She will never return the dwarf to you!"]="Ela nunca te devolverá ao anão!"
G["She will protect me!"]="Ela me protegerá!"
G["She won't let me go down to the excavation, so I've become somethin' o' a personal assistant and chauffeur."]="She won't let me go down to the excavation, so I've become somethin' o' a personal assistant and chauffeur."
G["She'll have our heads if we're caught!"]="She'll have our heads if we're caught!"
G["She's a beaut', isn't she? Sky'ree... the faithful gryphon of our commander. Kurdran himself, he holds his audiences in th' stronghold. I care fer our Sky'ree here when he's busy. Gorgeous creature, she is; as strong and fierce as they come. She'd die fer Kurdran, she would. A more loyal soul ye've ne'er seen.\n'Tis an honor to care fer her, it is."]="She's a beaut', isn't she? Sky'ree... the faithful gryphon of our commander. Kurdran himself, he holds his audiences in th' stronghold. I care fer our Sky'ree here when he's busy. Gorgeous creature, she is; as strong and fierce as they come. She'd die fer Kurdran, she would. A more loyal soul ye've ne'er seen.\n'Tis an honor to care fer her, it is."
G["She's a real powder-keg that one. She'd make a fine Firebeard! Y'think the Thundermars would go for it?"]="She's a real powder-keg that one. She'd make a fine Firebeard! Y'think the Thundermars would go for it?"
G["She's all fixed up and ready to go. Treat her nice!"]="Está pronta e em perfeito estado. Trátala com carinho!"
G["She's attacking the keep! Bring her down!"]="She's attacking the keep! Bring her down!"
G["She's attacking the towers again."]="Volta a atacar as torres."
G["She's beautiful..."]="Que preciosidade..."
G["She's breaking up, sir!"]="Se liberar, senhor!"
G["She's called in more siege weapons!"]="She's called in more siege weapons!"
G["She's coming! Quiet down, you fools! The Dark Lady approaches..."]="Já vem! Silenciar, estúpidos! A Dama Sombria se aproxima..."
G["She's drawing power from the fires! Stamp out the braziers, quickly!"]="She's drawing power from the fires! Stamp out the braziers, quickly!"
G["She's going to blow! Get a parachute and jump!"]="She's going to blow! Get a parachute and jump!"
G["She's gone too far. I'm certain the Alliance can move their war mages through the city at will. That human ... witch!"]="Ela foi longe demais. Tenho certeza de que magos de batalha da Aliança caminham livremente pela cidade. Aquela... bruxa humana!"
G["She's here to make new friends... and then set them on fire! It's Pandaria's prettiest little playful pyromaniac, Liuyang!"]="She's here to make new friends... and then set them on fire! It's Pandaria's prettiest little playful pyromaniac, Liuyang!"
G["She's here! Get in that cannon, damnit! Get ready to fire!"]="Já está aqui! Métete em esse canhão, maldito seja! Prepare-se para disparar!"
G["She's hung up in the debris and I've lost steam pressure. This terrain is murder!\n\nCan you get us out of this?"]="Se tem atascado no lodo e e perdido presão de vapor. Este terreno é uma tortura!\n\nPode nos tirar de aqui?"
G["She's just as beautiful as ever! Please, $n, tell her for me!"]="She's just as beautiful as ever! Please, $n, tell her for me!"
G["She's not here."]="Não está aqui."
G["She's not lying.  Nordrassil is in danger.  I must make haste and prepare for Hyjal's defense."]="She's not lying.  Nordrassil is in danger.  I must make haste and prepare for Hyjal's defense."
G["She's sent you to do her dirty work, has she? I'll deal with the countess after I've killed you, fleshling!"]="She's sent you to do her dirty work, has she? I'll deal with the countess after I've killed you, fleshling!"
G["She's so smart and funny! I'm head over heels for her."]="É muito inteligente e divertida! Estou coladito por ela."
G["She's sooo strong!"]="É taaan forte!"
G["She's still breathin', sir! Get over here! Talk to 'er!"]="Ainda respira, senhor! Venha! Fala com ela!"
G["She's surrounded herself with a small army of deranged dragon cultists. They may not by right in the head, but they're well-armed. And dangerous."]="She's surrounded herself with a small army of deranged dragon cultists. They may not by right in the head, but they're well-armed. And dangerous."
G["She's tall!"]="É alta!"
G["She's turning her siege weapons on her own towers!"]="Volta seus armas de cerco contra seus próprias torres!"
G["Sheena Sunweaver is known for her sales of reagents and can be found in the chamber of masters, to the left as you enter the building.\n\nI will mark the location on your map."]="A Sheena Tejesol se a conhece por vender componentes na Câmera dos Mestres, nada mais entrar no edifício, à esquerda.\n\nTe marcarei seu localização no mapa."
G["Sheesh, Hao. Haven't you ever paid attention?"]="Jo, Hao. É que nunca prestas atenção?"
G["Sheesh, guys! Hurry it up already!"]="Sheesh, guys! Hurry it up already!"
G["Sheesh, you don't have to beg! Anyways, I'm almost done with the story.\n\nSo, the whole company is in the middle of that massive chamber fighting over this amulet, and you know how it echoes in there! In the end it was broken into three pieces, and we rolled the dice, with it going to various people or groups.\n\nThe rest is a bit of a blur, though, because it was at about that time that old Valthalak's spirit decided to make an entrance and start summoning forth all of these spectral assassins."]="Sheesh, you don't have to beg! Anyways, I'm almost done with the story.\n\nSo, the whole company is in the middle of that massive chamber fighting over this amulet, and you know how it echoes in there! In the end it was broken into three pieces, and we rolled the dice, with it going to various people or groups.\n\nThe rest is a bit of a blur, though, because it was at about that time that old Valthalak's spirit decided to make an entrance and start summoning forth all of these spectral assassins."
G["Shelby Stoneflint houses a good deal of pets for the local hunters.  She can be found over by the Thunderbrew Distillery if ye need her to look after a pet."]="Shelby Stoneflint abriga uma grande quantidade de animais de estimação para os caçadores locais. Ela pode ser encontrada na Destilaria Thunderbrew se você precisar que ela cuide de um animal de estimação."
G["Shen-zin Su has never returned to Pandaria."]="Shen-zin Seu não voltou mais a Pandaria."
G["Shen-zin Su hasn't made landfall for a long time. But that hasn't stopped some pandaren from exploring, anyway."]="Shen-zin Su hasn't made landfall for a long time. But that hasn't stopped some pandaren from exploring, anyway."
G["Shen-zin Su!"]="Shen-zin Seu!"
G["Shen-zin Su, the very land on which we stand, is in deep pain. Though I don't know the source, I can feel his ache within my own body."]="Shen-zin Su, the very land on which we stand, is in deep pain. Though I don't know the source, I can feel his ache within my own body."
G["Shen-zin Su, we are the descendants of Liu Lang.  We've sensed your pain, and we want to help."]="Shen-zin Su, we are the descendants of Liu Lang.  We've sensed your pain, and we want to help."
G["Shenthul, I have lost my whistle and I have no more flares. Please help!"]="Shenthul, e perdido meu apito e não me restam bengalas. Por favor, preciso ajuda."
G["Shethnoth, ol'goth, grell. Such is the mantra of those who come."]="Shethnoth, ol'goth, grelh. Este é o mantra de aqueles que vêm."
G["Shh! Be very quiet; I'm observing murlocs.\n\nLiving in an oversized turtle shell is a sacrifice I'm willing to make for science. After all, if the murlocs see me here, they'll react to my presence and contaminate my data!\n\nAs the first gnomish member of the Explorers' League, I'm boldly going places no dwarf has gone before!"]="Shh! Be very quiet; I'm observing murlocs.\n\nLiving in an oversized turtle shell is a sacrifice I'm willing to make for science. After all, if the murlocs see me here, they'll react to my presence and contaminate my data!\n\nAs the first gnomish member of the Explorers' League, I'm boldly going places no dwarf has gone before!"
G["Shh! I'm working undercover here."]="Shh! I'm working undercover here."
G["Shh! Keep your voice down. The babes are sleeping."]="Shh! Fale baixo. Os bebês estão dormindo."
G["Shh! Someone's here."]="Shh! Someone's here."
G["Shh! They can hear you, dummy!"]="Shh! Te vão a ouvir, tonto!"
G["Shh, jinyu. It's hard enough to fish here as it is!"]="Shh, jinyu. Já é bastante difícil pescar!"
G["Shh, mon!  We be hidin' here."]="Shh, mon! Estamos nos escondendo aqui."
G["Shh... quiet, death knight.  When I'm finished with you, your fear will be gone."]="Shh... Silenciar, cavaleiro da Morte. Quando tenha terminou com você, já não sentirá medo."
G["Shh... quiet, it da new $g king : queen;."]="Shh... silêncio, é $g o: a; $g novo: nova; $g rei: rainha;."
G["Shhh!"]="Shhh!"
G["Shhh!  SHHH!!!!!  Maybe if you shtay quiet your pet might come back to you!"]="Shhh!  SHHH!!!!!  Maybe if you shtay quiet your pet might come back to you!"
G["Shhh! The spirits are sleeping!"]="Sssh! Os espíritos duermen."
G["Shhh! You're scaring the fish away."]="Shhh! You're scaring the fish away."
G["Shhh, $n. I will need total concentration to attend these wounds."]="$n, shhh. Preciso concentração total para curar estas feridas."
G["Shhh, an outlander."]="Shhh, an outlander."
G["Shhh, this patient needs to rest."]="Shhh, este paciente deve descansar."
G["Shhh... I have a little secret I've been keeping."]="Shhh... Tenho um secretito que tenho estado guardando."
G["Shhh... do you smell something?"]="Shhh... você cheira alguma coisa?"
G["Shhh... it will all be over soon."]="Shhh... pronto acabará tudo."
G["Shhhad ak kereeesshh chak-k-k!"]="Shhhad ak kereeesshh chak-k-k!"
G["Shhhh - Please don't give away my position when I'm out in the field. Mathas needs to know what's happening out here."]="Shhhh - Por favor, não desista da minha posição quando estiver fosse de campo. Mathas precisa saber o que está acontecendo aqui."
G["Shhhh! Come quietly. She's practicing."]="Shhhh! Aproxime-se em silêncio. Se você está treinando."
G["Shhhh! Keep it down! You'll blow our cover."]="Shhhh! Controle-se! Você vai estragar a nossa cobertura."
G["Shhhh! They don't know that I'm hiding here."]="Shhhh! Não sabem que me e escondido aqui."
G["Shhhhh! You'll blow my cover!"]="Shhhh! Vai fazer que me descubran!"
G["Shhhhhh, my sweet darling, sleep now and be at peace."]="Shh, meu amor, agora duerme e descansar em paz."
G["Shield defense arming. Executing in 10 seconds."]="Armando defesa com escudo. Executando em 10 segundos."
G["Shield defense arming. Executing in 20 seconds."]="Armando defesa com escudo. Executando em 20 segundos."
G["Shield defense arming. Executing in 30 seconds"]="Armando defesa com escudo. Executando em 30 segundos."
G["Shield generators all over the island are protecting the Heart of Zan'vess, preventing us from reaching the weapons cache."]="Shield generators all over the island are protecting the Heart of Zan'vess, preventing us from reaching the weapons cache."
G["Shield our vessel Shadow-Warders!"]="Shield our vessel Shadow-Warders!"
G["Shield-Mages, get some shields up!"]="Shield-Mages, get some shields up!"
G["Shields"]="Escudos"
G["Shifting, %s moans from the pain of his thorn scratch."]="Shifting, %s moans from the pain of his thorn scratch."
G["Shimmer Ridge. I know it well. The Frostmane trolls breed and plot atop that snow-blown mesa."]="Shimmer Ridge. I know it well. The Frostmane trolls breed and plot atop that snow-blown mesa."
G["Shimmering amber-brew! Come and try!"]="Shimmering amber-brew! Come and try!"
G["Shin tried to back out of the hozen dare but then we double hozen dared him and he couldn't back out of that."]="Shin tried to back out of the hozen dare but then we double hozen dared him and he couldn't back out of that."
G["Shine and rise."]="Brilha e levántate."
G["Shine yer armor for a copper."]="Lustro sua armadura por uma monedita de cobre."
G["Shiney jab-jab, wikket."]="Jab jab brilha, makaku."
G["Shinies!"]="Tesouros!"
G["Shiny things! Shiny things! Not as shiny as my crystal, but still shiny!"]="Coisas brilhantes! Coisas brilhantes! Não tão brilhantes como meu cristal, mas também brilhantes!"
G["Shiny tools mine! Tasty carrots mine! All for Kunzen. All for Chief Yip-Yip!"]="Shiny tools mine! Tasty carrots mine! All for Kunzen. All for Chief Yip-Yip!"
G["Shiny!"]="Brilhante!"
G["Ship it!"]="Ship it!"
G["Shipping lanes... supplies... You bore me to death! We need nothing more than the warrior spirit of the Horde, Saurfang! Now that we are firmly entrenched in this frozen wasteland, nothing shall stop us!"]="Shipping lanes... supplies... You bore me to death! We need nothing more than the warrior spirit of the Horde, Saurfang! Now that we are firmly entrenched in this frozen wasteland, nothing shall stop us!"
G["Shipwrecked on an island infested with bomb-throwing monkeys? What's next... is there a volcano that's going to blow?!"]="Naufragou em uma ilha infestada de macacos que atiravam bombas? O que vem a seguir... tem um vulcão que vai explodir?!"
G["Shipwright, sir."]="Shipwright, sir."
G["Shipwright."]="Shipwright."
G["Shirts with leg-holes. Reversable shirtshorts!"]="Shirts with leg-holes. Reversable shirtshorts!"
G["Shirvallah, fill me with your RAGE!"]="Shirvalhah, lhéname de RAIVA!"
G["Shiver me timbers!"]="Que me parta um raio!"
G["Shkul an'zig qvsakf KSSH'GA, ag'THYZAK agthu!"]="Shkul an'zig qvsakf KSSH'GA, ag'THYZAK agthu!"
G["Shock it until it can't move anymore!  It's causing a riot in here!"]="Shock it until it can't move anymore!  It's causing a riot in here!"
G["Shock then silence overtakes the crowd."]="Shock then silence overtakes the crowd."
G["Shocking!"]="Electrizante!"
G["Shocking, I know."]="Shocking, I know."
G["Shocking."]="Fulminante."
G["Shocking. I know."]="Chocante. O sei."
G["Shoes are for the weak."]="Os sapatos são para os fracos."
G["Shoes with wheels on them. And gloves with wheels - for when you fall down."]="Sapatos com rodas incorporadas. E luvas com rodas incorporadas... para quando te caigas."
G["Shoja'my is over in front of the inn.  Now move along, I'm busy."]="Shoja'my está em linha de frente à pousada. Agora continue em linha de frente, estou ocupado."
G["Shokia an' Kiryn went off to do some girl stuff."]="Shokia an' Kiryn went off to do some girl stuff."
G["Shokia watched the prisoner while Kiryn went ahead."]="Shokia watched the prisoner while Kiryn went ahead."
G["Shokia, they've spotted me! Give me cover!"]="Shokia, me têm descoberto! Cúbreme!"
G["Sholazar Basin"]="Bacia de Sholazar"
G["Shomi is such a child!"]="Shomi é uma ninha!"
G["Shomi should not want to fight. That is a man's job!"]="Shomi não deveria que lutar. É um trabalho de homens!"
G["Shoo!"]="Saída"
G["Shoo, shoo!"]="Fora, fosse!"
G["Shoot all the guards, so I can move ahead!"]="Abate a todos os guardas para que possa avançar!"
G["Shoot for loot! Who wants to shoot for some loot?"]="Dispara e ganha! Quem quer disparar e conseguir saque?"
G["Shoot it between the eyes! Those beasts are vulnerable there!"]="Shoot it between the eyes! Those beasts are vulnerable there!"
G["Shoot it down!"]="Dispárale!"
G["Shoot it in the face! And the sides! And the pooper! You know, the soft bits."]="Shoot it in the face! And the sides! And the pooper! You know, the soft bits."
G["Shoot it! Destroy it!"]="Dispara! Destrua-o!"
G["Shoot straight to the northwest section of the Valley of Honor.  There you will find the Hunter's Hall."]="Atire diretamente para a seção noroeste do Valley of Honra. Lá você encontrará o Salão dos Caçadores."
G["Shoot!"]="Botão de tiro"
G["Shooting Gallery?"]="Galería de tiro?"
G["Shooting you a glance, %s frowns and spits."]="Shooting you a glance, %s frowns and spits."
G["Shore up those flanks!"]="Shore up those flanks!"
G["Shorry about your shoes."]="Shorry about your shoes."
G["Short work, an' none too pretty!"]="Um trabalho simples, e não demais bonito!"
G["Shortly after you disappeared into the jungle, rescued soldiers began returning to us at Paw'don. It wasn't difficult to track you here."]="Shortly after you disappeared into the jungle, rescued soldiers began returning to us at Paw'don. It wasn't difficult to track you here."
G["Shortly afterward, another raccoon befriended me."]="Shortly afterward, another raccoon befriended me."
G["Shot down by a group of alliance cowards?! PATHETIC!"]="Abatidos por um grupo de covardes da aliança?! PATÉTICO!"
