G["Shotgun!"]="Copiloto!"
G["Should I ever escape this prison..."]="Se alguma vez escapo desta prisão..."
G["Should I know? You look like an orc to me."]="Eu deveria saber? Você parece um orco para mim."
G["Should I live through this, I shall make it my life's sole ambition to destroy Arthas..."]="Se consigo sobreviver, a única ambição de minha vida será destruir a Arthas..."
G["Should I run?"]="Deveria correr?"
G["Should Kil'jaeden rise up through the Sunwell our world will be thrown into a war the likes of which has not been seen for 10,000 years!"]="Should Kil'jaeden rise up through the Sunwell our world will be thrown into a war the likes of which has not been seen for 10,000 years!"
G["Should have had more fiber in your diet then."]="Isso é que ao seu dieta lhe falta fibra."
G["Should the Empress ever fall to corruption or endanger our civilization, the Klaxxi are sworn to unseat her."]="Os Klaxxi têm jurado derrocar à Imperatriz se sucumbe à corrupção ou se coloca em perigo a nosso povo."
G["Should try the special."]="Deveria testar o especial."
