G["Silverbrook is due northwest of here.  A small community of hunters and trappers.  They know the lay of the land -- it would be good to have them on our side."]="Silverbrook is due northwest of here.  A small community of hunters and trappers.  They know the lay of the land -- it would be good to have them on our side."
