G["Simmer say Gordo got guts, but got no brains.  Why he mean?"]="Simmer diz que Gordo tem coragem, mas não tem cérebro. Por que ele quis dizer?"
G["Simple fools! Time is the fire in which you'll burn!"]="Simple fools! Time is the fire in which you'll burn!"
G["Simple game, for simple folk. Think you can manage it?"]="Um jogo simples para gente simples. Acha que pode com ele?"
G["Simple kindnesses, charitable deeds, service to those in need. These are all fruits of the Light."]="Simple kindnesses, charitable deeds, service to those in need. These are all fruits of the Light."
G["Simple stimulus-response tests.  Normally my kind does not interfere with the matters of Azeroth, but here in Un'Goro, we are free to take a more direct approach.  As Un'Goro is the experimental ground of the Titans, it is our right to do so.\n\nFor example, say Khaz'goroth wants to know what happens when one of his creations is exposed to a sulfurous hot spring.  He could wait for millenia, observing, and waiting for the creature to accidentally stumble and fall in.  Or, he could place the creature in the water himself.\n\nIn Un'Goro, we may do so."]="Simple stimulus-response tests.  Normally my kind does not interfere with the matters of Azeroth, but here in Un'Goro, we are free to take a more direct approach.  As Un'Goro is the experimental ground of the Titans, it is our right to do so.\n\nFor example, say Khaz'goroth wants to know what happens when one of his creations is exposed to a sulfurous hot spring.  He could wait for millenia, observing, and waiting for the creature to accidentally stumble and fall in.  Or, he could place the creature in the water himself.\n\nIn Un'Goro, we may do so."
G["Simpletons! You cannot comprehend the forces you have set in motion. The ley line conduit will not be disrupted! Your defeat shall be absolute!"]="Simpletons! You cannot comprehend the forces you have set in motion. The ley line conduit will not be disrupted! Your defeat shall be absolute!"
G["Simply aim and pull the trigger. Or don't aim. I wash my hands of the whole thing."]="Simply aim and pull the trigger. Or don't aim. I wash my hands of the whole thing."
G["Simply amazing!\n\nYou're reading this which means that DAN IS THE MAN!"]="Simplesmente incrível!\n\nEstá lendo isto, o que indica que DÂNI É O MAIS!"
G["Simply amazing!  You can fight by my side any day."]="Impressionante! Pode lutar a meu lado quando queira."
G["Simply grab a nearby parachute to be vaulted clear of the burning zeppelin. Hopefully onto dry land."]="Simply grab a nearby parachute to be vaulted clear of the burning zeppelin. Hopefully onto dry land."
G["Simply put, you must tell the tuskarr that they cannot run. If they do so, their spirits will be destroyed by the evil rising within Northrend."]="Simply put, you must tell the tuskarr that they cannot run. If they do so, their spirits will be destroyed by the evil rising within Northrend."
G["Simply stated, this is correct.\n\nThe Earthen's physical features are that of a smaller stature humanoid, though their composition is that of Azeroth's various stone core compounds.  Their design maximizes strength and stamina without sacrificing cognitive processing power.  Their skin and musculature are nearly impervious to physical damage, and with very minor modifications the Earthen display a remarkable resiliency to unwanted magical forces."]="Simply stated, this is correct.\n\nThe Earthen's physical features are that of a smaller stature humanoid, though their composition is that of Azeroth's various stone core compounds.  Their design maximizes strength and stamina without sacrificing cognitive processing power.  Their skin and musculature are nearly impervious to physical damage, and with very minor modifications the Earthen display a remarkable resiliency to unwanted magical forces."
G["Sin'dorei and Forsaken share a common goal in the Ghostlands, $n.  Together we shall defeat the Scourge and who knows... perhaps the Forsaken will be valuable allies in our quest to reach Outland."]="Sin'dorei and Forsaken share a common goal in the Ghostlands, $n.  Together we shall defeat the Scourge and who knows... perhaps the Forsaken will be valuable allies in our quest to reach Outland."
G["Sin'dorei have lost far too much in the past years.  Our land, our homes, even our identities...\n\nIt's about time we started taking it all back."]="Sin'dorei have lost far too much in the past years.  Our land, our homes, even our identities...\n\nIt's about time we started taking it all back."
G["Sinan, may I please have the Wings of Hope again?"]="Sinan, pode me voltar a dar as asas de esperança?"
G["Since I'm not farming right now, this is a great way to pass the time!"]="Esta é uma boa forma de passar o tempo quando não estou na fazenda."
G["Since landing here I have seen horrors that had previously only haunted my darkest nightmares, but nothing could have prepared me for what lies beyond the mist.\n\n<Mootoo nods.>\n\nThrough that fog, not more than a few yards from us, stand the bloodthirsty creatures known as Kvaldir. None have returned from the fog and few that were originally at the landing when the mist rolled in have escaped. The area has since been condemned by Hellscream. Enter at your own risk..."]="Since landing here I have seen horrors that had previously only haunted my darkest nightmares, but nothing could have prepared me for what lies beyond the mist.\n\n<Mootoo nods.>\n\nThrough that fog, not more than a few yards from us, stand the bloodthirsty creatures known as Kvaldir. None have returned from the fog and few that were originally at the landing when the mist rolled in have escaped. The area has since been condemned by Hellscream. Enter at your own risk..."
G["Since meeting you I have fought legends and seen countless wonders."]="Desde a última vez que te vi, e lutado contra lendas e vi inúmeras maravilhas."
G["Since my husband left for the front, Helene here has been my strength. Her kind heart and sharp sword have helped me through a lot of tough times. I don't know what I would've done without her."]="Desde que meu marido partiu para a linha de frente, Helene aqui tem sido minha força. Seu coração amável e sua lâmina afiada me ajudaram em muitos momentos difíceis. Não sei o que teria feito sem ela."
G["Since the dark days of the old kingdom, we pandaren have turned to the mystical art of brewing to keep our spirits and strength high.\n\nEven as we speak, brewmasters wander the world, seeking rare and powerful ingredients to craft the finest of brews.\n\nThose who seek out these elusive brewmasters and lend them aid may earn flavorful items. At the very least, you will drink plenty of brew!"]="Since the dark days of the old kingdom, we pandaren have turned to the mystical art of brewing to keep our spirits and strength high.\n\nEven as we speak, brewmasters wander the world, seeking rare and powerful ingredients to craft the finest of brews.\n\nThose who seek out these elusive brewmasters and lend them aid may earn flavorful items. At the very least, you will drink plenty of brew!"
G["Since the fall of Dalaran and the destruction of Quel'Thalas, wares of this sort have been hard to come by. But Lucan Cordell and some of our other Tradesman have been doing a fine job of filling our orders with quality merchandise."]="Desde a cai de Dalaran e a destruição de Quel'Thalas, mercadorias desse tipo têm sido difíceis de encontrar. Mas Lucan Cordell e algum de nossos outros comerciantes têm feito um bom trabalho ao preencher nossos pedidos com mercadorias de qualidade."
G["Since the fall of Grim Batol, we Wildhammers have never truly been united. Out here in the Highlands, forgotten by the rest of the world, the different clans have all gone their separate ways.\n\nTo join them all back together isn't going to be easy."]="Since the fall of Grim Batol, we Wildhammers have never truly been united. Out here in the Highlands, forgotten by the rest of the world, the different clans have all gone their separate ways.\n\nTo join them all back together isn't going to be easy."
G["Since the founding of Orgrimmar, many trials have tested the Horde, but we have risen up and beaten back any who'd seek to destroy us!\n\nBut this... this is something that even my power cannot defeat. It pains me deeply to watch my people suffer from this plague. I must rely on the Forsaken for their assistance.\n\nThe Lich King will hear the approaching war drums of the Horde, but not yet. First, we must help our people before exacting our revenge on the Scourge."]="Since the founding of Orgrimmar, many trials have tested the Horde, but we have risen up and beaten back any who'd seek to destroy us!\n\nBut this... this is something that even my power cannot defeat. It pains me deeply to watch my people suffer from this plague. I must rely on the Forsaken for their assistance.\n\nThe Lich King will hear the approaching war drums of the Horde, but not yet. First, we must help our people before exacting our revenge on the Scourge."
G["Since the sparrowhawks have proven such a success in hunting down the raven stones, Watcher Elaira has trained another one to relay my voice at a great distance. He can help us communicate as you investigate the bird spirits revealed in the tablet!"]="Since the sparrowhawks have proven such a success in hunting down the raven stones, Watcher Elaira has trained another one to relay my voice at a great distance. He can help us communicate as you investigate the bird spirits revealed in the tablet!"
G["Since we've begun our stay in the crater, Dadanga's taken a liking to the large bloodpetal sprouts that grow all over the place here.\n\nI'm sure she'd enjoy a snack, if you feel like bringing her some..."]="Since we've begun our stay in the crater, Dadanga's taken a liking to the large bloodpetal sprouts that grow all over the place here.\n\nI'm sure she'd enjoy a snack, if you feel like bringing her some..."
G["Since you are a tailor of some skill, I can tell you that I know some special recipes.   I know recipes for both the Wispcloak and the Deathchill Cloak."]="Como você é um alfaiate de alguma habilidade, posso lhe dizer que conheço algumas receitas especiais. Conheço receitas para o Wispcloak e o Deathchill Cloak."
G["Since you saw Shan Kien's memory, they been sendin' scouting parties out."]="Desde ke você viu rekuerdo de Shan Kien, têm estado enviando batedores."
G["Sing... yes! Sing in agony!"]="Sing... yes! Sing in agony!"
G["Sink your teeth into a fresh, ripe apple."]="Sink your teeth into a fresh, ripe apple."
G["Sintharia, your master owes me a great debt -- one that I intend to extract from his consort's hide!"]="Sintharia, your master owes me a great debt -- one that I intend to extract from his consort's hide!"
G["Sinu a'manore, champion."]="Sinu a'manore, corajoso."
G["Sinu a'manore. If you seek to learn how to conjure a portal to Theramore, I can show you."]="Sinu a'manore. Se você procurar aprender a invocar um portal para Theramore, eu posso lhe mostrar."
G["Sir Zeliek, a paladin in life, so strong in his faith, that even in undeath, the power of the light still heeds his call, smiting his foes in battle."]="Sir Zeliek, um paladino em vida com uma fé tão forte, que inclusive na não-morte o poder da Luz ainda responda seu chamada, golpeando aos seus inimigos na batalha."
G["Sir!"]="Senhor!"
G["Sir!  If I don't get out there and fight for Azeroth, then why am I in this army? I enlisted to do a job, and I intend to see it through."]="Sir!  If I don't get out there and fight for Azeroth, then why am I in this army? I enlisted to do a job, and I intend to see it through."
G["Sir! The fleet is straight ahead."]="Senhor! A frota está logo linha de frente."
G["Sir! Until my body ceases to function!"]="Senhor! Até meu corpo parar de funcionar!"
G["Sir! We have reports of a Man'ari abomination being summoned to the west. I am deploying the Defenders to intercept along the path to Blood Watch."]="Sir! We have reports of a Man'ari abomination being summoned to the west. I am deploying the Defenders to intercept along the path to Blood Watch."
G["Sir, Farstrider Solanna informs me that attacks on Zeb'Tela and Zeb'Nowa are underway. She was able to recruit a promising, young candidate to help with the situation. Also, the apothecary upstairs has made mention of a solution he believes he has to also help with the trolls."]="Sir, Farstrider Solanna informs me that attacks on Zeb'Tela and Zeb'Nowa are underway. She was able to recruit a promising, young candidate to help with the situation. Also, the apothecary upstairs has made mention of a solution he believes he has to also help with the trolls."
G["Sir, I am here to deliver my report from the Scryer's Tier."]="Senhor, e vindo a entregar meu relatório da Grada do Arúspice."
G["Sir, I demand to be released to my father's custody!"]="Geral, solicito que se me libere e se me entregue a meu pai."
G["Sir, I need another flying machine..."]="Senhor, preciso de outra máquina voadora..."
G["Sir, I think the explosions and gunfire gave us away. You don't have to use hand signals."]="Sir, I think the explosions and gunfire gave us away. You don't have to use hand signals."
G["Sir, I think we were close with the Lethargy Root in that last poison recipe."]="Sir, I think we were close with the Lethargy Root in that last poison recipe."
G["Sir, I... my orcs were working well, so I just... thought I'd..."]="Senhor, eu... Meus orcs estavam trabalhando tão bem que eu... bom... pensei..."
G["Sir, if you could at least get my gender correct..."]="Sir, if you could at least get my gender correct..."
G["Sir, it appears that another of our special units have arrived."]="Senhor, parece ser que chegou outra de nossas unidades especiais."
G["Sir, it's impossible to read anything into their actions."]="Senhor, é possível tirar conclusiones dos seus ações."
G["Sir, my name is... Oh, never mind..."]="Senhor, me chamo... Oh, não importa..."
G["Sir, no, sir! Another dispatch has arrived from Tranquillien. It's High Executor Mavren again, captain. This time the language in the letter was very 'colorful'. He reiterates his request that we marshal the Farstriders in support of the efforts against Deatholme, and suggests that you should send a runner north to Farstrider Retreat in Eversong Woods and muster their forces as well."]="Senhor, não, senhor! Chegou outro relatório de Tranquillien. Se trata novamente do sumo executor Mavren, capitão. Esta vez o linguagem da carta era muito \"colorido\". Reitera seu petição de que formemos aos Errantes em apoio dos esforços contra a Cidade da Morte e sugiere que você deveria enviar um mensageiro ao norte, ao Retiro do Errante, na Floresta do Canto Eterno, e entrar também aos seus forças."
G["Sir, our customers are complaining that there's not enough Maiden's Anguish in our Deadly Poisons."]="Sir, our customers are complaining that there's not enough Maiden's Anguish in our Deadly Poisons."
G["Sir, our customers are complaining that there's too much Deathweed in our Anesthetics."]="Senhor, nossos clientes se estão quejando de que há demais Muerteflor em nossos anestésicos."
G["Sir, student requests that you beat him for his lack of understanding!"]="Sir, student requests that you beat him for his lack of understanding!"
G["Sir, these Kor'kron don't seem very friendly!"]="Estes Kor'kron não parecem muito amistosos!"
G["Sir, these are Garrosh's men."]="Estes são os homens de Garrosh."
G["Sir, we can have the entirety of the seventh fleet on the scene within the month--"]="Sir, we can have the entirety of the seventh fleet on the scene within the month--"
G["Sir, we're doing everything we can to address the leak!"]="Senhor, estamos fazendo tudo o possível para solucionar o escape!"
G["Sir, we've just flown in from the south. What are your orders?"]="Senhor, acabamos de voar desdo Sul. Quais são seus ordens?"
G["Sir, yes Sir!"]="Senhor, sim, senhor!"
G["Sir, yes sir!"]="Senhor, sim, senhor!"
G["Sir, yes sir! Private will do their best to not die, sir!"]="Senhor, sim, senhor! Os soldados quanto possam para não morrer, senhor!"
G["Sir, yes, sir!"]="Sim, senhor!"
G["Sir.  The reinforcements were cut off by Neferset troops.  We are on our own."]="Senhor. As tropas de Neferset nos têm incomunicado dos reforços. Estamos sozinhos."
G["Sir?"]="Senhor?"
G["Sire, any news from the king?"]="Senhor, alguma notícia do rei?"
G["Sire, let me join the fray! I shall tear their spines out with my bare hands!"]="Sire, let me join the fray! I shall tear their spines out with my bare hands!"
G["Sironas claims that certain eredar possess the ability to transform others of their race into man'ari. Draenei were supposedly once eredar and Sironas is a powerful eredar.\n\n<The agent laughs.>\n\nCan you believe it? These pathetic creatures were once all-powerful demons. What kind of fool rejects such power?"]="Sironas claims that certain eredar possess the ability to transform others of their race into man'ari. Draenei were supposedly once eredar and Sironas is a powerful eredar.\n\n<The agent laughs.>\n\nCan you believe it? These pathetic creatures were once all-powerful demons. What kind of fool rejects such power?"
G["Sironas claims that certain eredar possess the ability to transform others of their race into man'ari: Savage demonic beings. Draenei were supposedly once eredar and Sironas is a powerful eredar.\n\n<The agent laughs.>\n\nCan you believe it? These pathetic creatures were once all-powerful demons. What kind of fool rejects such power?"]="Sironas claims that certain eredar possess the ability to transform others of their race into man'ari: Savage demonic beings. Draenei were supposedly once eredar and Sironas is a powerful eredar.\n\n<The agent laughs.>\n\nCan you believe it? These pathetic creatures were once all-powerful demons. What kind of fool rejects such power?"
G["Sironas is an eredar... I mean, yes, obviously."]="Sironas é um eredar... Quero dizer, sim, obviamente."
G["Sironas stirs, master? Does she toil?"]="Se move Sironas, mestre? Luta?"
G["Sironas will have our skulls if these are allowed to grow!"]="Sironas nos matará se permitimos que crezcan."
G["Sister!  The mean men were going to take me to Badmoon Isle.  They wanted to turn me into one of them."]="Sister!  The mean men were going to take me to Badmoon Isle.  They wanted to turn me into one of them."
G["Sister! I... too... have f-failed..."]="Irmã! Eu... também... e... f-fracassado."
G["Sister, look! The artifact is surrounded by an aura of darkness!"]="Irmã, olhe! Um aura de escuridão envuelve o artefato!"
G["Sister, we must act! If we do nothing, we will lose our entire harvest to a war we have no part in!"]="Irmã, devemos actuar! Se não fazemos nada, perderemos toda nossa colheita em uma guerra que não nos incumbe."
G["Sisters, show yourselves. The time for subtlety is past. We will face our enemies in the Plane of Fire."]="Irmãs, mostraos. O tempo para sutilezas tem passado. Nos enfrentaremos a nossos inimigos no plano do Fogo."
G["Sisters, the village need our help. Head to the front lines and heal the wounded!"]="Sisters, the village need our help. Head to the front lines and heal the wounded!"
G["Sit and listen to my story, $r."]="Siéntate e ouça meu história, $r."
G["Sit down!"]="Siéntate!"
G["Sit with me a while. We can roast crabs over the fire and sing songs."]="Sente-se comigo um pouco. Podemos assar caranguejos no fogo e cantar músicas."
G["Sittin' in the middle of enemy forces with not much more than this cloaking chicken protectin' us. This has become my new normal!"]="Sittin' in the middle of enemy forces with not much more than this cloaking chicken protectin' us. This has become my new normal!"
G["Sitting easier than killing."]="Sentar mais fácil que matar."
G["Sitting here injured and watching my brothers fight is almost too much to bear, but even I understand that I'm more valuable alive than dead."]="Sitting here injured and watching my brothers fight is almost too much to bear, but even I understand that I'm more valuable alive than dead."
G["Situated along the Zoram Strand of Ashenvale, Blackfathom Deeps was once a glorious temple dedicated to the night elves' moon-goddess Elune. However, the great Sundering shattered the temple - sinking it beneath the waves of the Veiled Sea. There it remained untouched - until, drawn by its ancient power - the naga and satyr emerged to plumb its secrets. Legends hold that the ancient beast, Aku'mai, has taken up residence within the temple's ruins."]="Situated along the Zoram Strand of Ashenvale, Blackfathom Deeps was once a glorious temple dedicated to the night elves' moon-goddess Elune. However, the great Sundering shattered the temple - sinking it beneath the waves of the Veiled Sea. There it remained untouched - until, drawn by its ancient power - the naga and satyr emerged to plumb its secrets. Legends hold that the ancient beast, Aku'mai, has taken up residence within the temple's ruins."
G["Six Lieutenants control the front line's defenses. They must be destroyed first and fast! We cannot risk one of their priests returning the fallen Lieutenants to life.\n\nShould all of the Lieutenants be killed in quick succession, the morale of the front lines will falter! It will be shattered! Their troops will run in fear, leaving the remaining soldiers without backup."]="Six Lieutenants control the front line's defenses. They must be destroyed first and fast! We cannot risk one of their priests returning the fallen Lieutenants to life.\n\nShould all of the Lieutenants be killed in quick succession, the morale of the front lines will falter! It will be shattered! Their troops will run in fear, leaving the remaining soldiers without backup."
G["Six weeks? I spent six years in Durnholde! You cannot possibly expect me to just throw aside something that has been a part of my life for so long!"]="Seis semanas? Pasé seis anos em Durnholde! Você não pode esperar que me deshaga tão pronto de algo que foi parte de minha vida durante tanto tempo!"
G["Sk'yahf qi'plahf PH'MAGG!"]="Sk'yahf qi'plahf PH'MAGG!"
G["Skadi the Ruthless is within range of the harpoon launchers!"]="Skadi o Impiedoso está dentro do alcance dos Lanzaarpones!"
G["Skaldrenox!  I hold your scepter, and charge you to enter this world!"]="Skaldrenox! Eu certo o seu cetro, e lhe convido a entrar neste mundo!"
G["Skar'this has informed us well. We have worked our way into the slave pens and await your cryomancerss."]="Skar'this nos informou bem. Nos temos aberto passo até o Área dos Escravos e estamos esperando aos seus criománticos."
G["Skarvald, you incompetent slug! Return and make yourself useful!"]="Skarvald, babosa incompetente! Volta e faça algo útil!"
G["Skeer the Bloodseeker has returned! Unnngghhh..."]="Skeer o Cruento tem retornado! Aaaagghhh..."
G["Skeezy says he already paid for my flight to Hardwrench Hideaway.  I'm ready to depart."]="Skeezy diz que já tem pagado meu voo ao Esconderijo Malalhave. Estou pronto para partir."
G["Skeletal mages. A perfect opportunity to display the utility of some of our powers."]="Magos esqueletos. Uma oportunidade perfeita para testar a utilidade de algum de nossos poderes."
G["Skeletons have advanced past the Hall of Lights!  Destroy them!"]="Skeletons have advanced past the Hall of Lights!  Destroy them!"
G["Skeletons. Simple play things, but there are lessons to be learned even here."]="Esqueletos. Simples brinquedos, mas, inclusive aí, há lições que aprender."
G["Skettis prevails!"]="Skettis prevalece!"
G["Skill is important, but sometimes it comes down to luck."]="A habilidade é importantes, mas a vezes a sorte é o que importa."
G["Skill with a weapon is but a physical manifestation of one's martial strength. Let me show you what spiritual power is!"]="Skill with a weapon is but a physical manifestation of one's martial strength. Let me show you what spiritual power is!"
G["Skillfully done."]="Que grande aptidão."
G["Skimmer, old friend, it is your turn to battle."]="Triscapé, velho amigo, é sua vez de lutar."
G["Skin on fire!"]="Pele em chamas!"
G["Skin ye right up and our customers will never know the difference!"]="Skin ye right up and our customers will never know the difference!"
G["Skin, glorious skin. It holds your insides... in. You might've noticed my skin's not doing so well. To think I used to worry about my pores. Hardly any skin left to worry about these days. In a way, it's very freeing."]="Pele, pele gloriosa. Ele mantém seu interior... dentro. Você deve ter notado que minha pele não está indo tão bem. Pensar que costumava me preocupar com meus poros. Dificilmente resta qualquer pele para se preocupar com esses dias. De certa forma, é muito libertador."
G["Skin... burns... the... pain..."]="Pele... queima... o... dor..."
G["Skinners and leatherworkers of all sorts may be found at Legendary Leathers in the Magus Commerce Exchange, northwest Dalaran."]="Esfoladores e marceneiros de todos os tipos podem ser encontrados em Couros Lendários na Magus Commerce Exchange, noroeste de Dalaran."
G["Skinning"]="Esfolamento (Skinning)"
G["Skinning allows you to remove and prepare the hides from slain creatures. These can be sold at the auction house or used to support the Leatherworking profession.\nSkilled Skinners also become masters of anatomy, increasing their chances to critically hit a target.\nYou'll need a Skinning Knife in order to skin creatures; this can be purchased from trade or Leatherworking vendors."]="Skinning allows you to remove and prepare the hides from slain creatures. These can be sold at the auction house or used to support the Leatherworking profession.\nSkilled Skinners also become masters of anatomy, increasing their chances to critically hit a target.\nYou'll need a Skinning Knife in order to skin creatures; this can be purchased from trade or Leatherworking vendors."
G["Skinning?  The only thing ye look like ye could skin is yer own knee!  Ha!  Now why don't you go see Balthus Stoneflayer so he can teach you how to properly skin some animals.  You'll find him in Finespindle's Leather Goods on the northern side of The Great Forge."]="Esfolando? A única coisa que parece que você poderia esfolar é seu próprio joelho! Ha! Agora, por que você não vê Balthus Stoneflayer para que ele possa ensiná-o a esfolar corretamente algum animais. Você o encontrará nos Artigos de Couro de Finespindle, no lado norte da Grande Forja."
G["Skip the warmup, sister... or are you too scared to face someone your own size?"]="Ignore o aquecimento, irmã... ou você está com muito medo de enfrentar alguém do seu tamanho?"
G["Skullcrusher the Mountain goes into a frenzy!"]="Trituracráneos a Montanha entrar em frenesi!"
G["Skulls you will give and skulls I will take."]="Me darás crânios e me levarei crânios."
G["Skullsplitter... is... forever... mon..."]="Rachacrânio... é... pa' sempre... colega..."
G["Skwak!"]="Skwak!"
G["Skwol!  I hold your scepter!  I command you to enter this world!"]="Skwol! Eu certo seu cetro! Eu ordeno que você entre neste mundo!"
G["Sky Commander Keller, I don't like my Deathwing Brood Cloak."]="Comandante do Céu Kelher, não me gosta meu capa do linagem de Alamuerte."
G["Sky'ree."]="Céu'ree."
G["Skybreaker infantry, hold position!"]="Skybreaker infantry, hold position!"
G["Skydancer Shun can teach you how to fly in Pandaria. He rides his cloud serpent on the main terrace. I will mark his location on your map."]="Skydancer Shun can teach you how to fly in Pandaria. He rides his cloud serpent on the main terrace. I will mark his location on your map."
G["Skyguard Rangers, MOUNT UP!!"]="Skyguard Rangers, MOUNT UP!!"
G["Skymaster Skyles stands just before the gate to Eversong Woods."]="Skymaster Skyles stands just before the gate to Eversong Woods."
G["Skymistress Gloaming and her dragonhawks are just outside and to the west of the Shepherd's Gate."]="A skymistress Gloaming e seus dragões estão do lado de fosse e a oeste do Shepherd's Gate."
G["Skymistress Gloaming stands just outside the Magister's Gate near Silvermoon proper, tending to the dragonhawks."]="A skymistress Gloaming fica do lado de fosse do Magister's Gate, perto de Silvermoon, tendendo para os dragões."
G["Skywing, I will free you from your curse over my dead body!"]="Skywing, I will free you from your curse over my dead body!"
G["Slain Hatchlings will drop feathers, use the feather to fly for short periods of time."]="Slain Hatchlings will drop feathers, use the feather to fly for short periods of time."
G["Slap Ringo before he passes out!"]="Slap Ringo before he passes out!"
G["Slate, did the Axe of Earthly Sundering return to you?"]="Slate, did the Axe of Earthly Sundering return to you?"
G["Slaughter them all! Show no mercy, brothers!"]="Slaughter them all! Show no mercy, brothers!"
G["Slaughter them all."]="Matem-nos a todos."
G["Slaughter them, $c! Destroy as many naga as you can to honor those that fell."]="Extermínalos, $c! Destrói tantos nagas como possa para honrar aos caídos."
G["Slaughter yourselves for my amusement!"]="Slaughter yourselves for my amusement!"
G["Slave thing! Go get chicken for Goregek!"]="Slave thing! Go get chicken for Goregek!"
G["Slave thing, you so full of fail."]="Slave thing, you so full of fail."
G["Slavery and death are all that away you."]="Slavery and death are all that away you."
G["Slaves - everywhere slaves. You can see what we fight against."]="Escravos... Escravos por todas partes. Isto é contra o que lutamos."
G["Slaves to our own prince, we're treated worse alive than dead."]="Escravos de nosso próprio Príncipe, nos trata pior vivos que mortos."
G["Slaves... Zombies... It don't matter to Zanzil. Dey all serve Gurubashi, one way or de other..."]="Escravos... zumbis... A Zanzil lhe da igual. Todos sirven aos Gurubashi, de uma forma u outra..."
G["Slay Ancient Spirits to empower the Staff of Pei-Zhi!"]="Matar espíritos antigos para potênciar o cajado de Pei-Zhi!"
G["Slay Warden Stillwater before you're overwhelmed!"]="Slay Warden Stillwater before you're overwhelmed!"
G["Slay all Redfang!"]="Madadaos Colmilhorrojo!"
G["Slay all who see us!  Word must not get back to Illidan."]="Slay all who see us!  Word must not get back to Illidan."
G["Slay all who see us... word must not get back to Illidan."]="Slay all who see us... word must not get back to Illidan."
G["Slay her now, before Aviana's magic wears off!"]="Acaba com ela antes de que a magia de Aviana deje de surtir efeito!"
G["Slay stone troggs."]="Matar troggs de pedras."
G["Slay the Idra'kess Mistresses to destroy the shield!"]="Matar às maestras Idra'kess para destruir o escudo!"
G["Slay the courier!"]="Slay the courier!"
G["Slay the last prisoner.  Maybe our intruders will reconsider their foolish actions now!"]="Slay the last prisoner.  Maybe our intruders will reconsider their foolish actions now!"
G["Slay them all! No excuses! No mercy! No rest!"]="Matem-nos a todos! Sem excusas… nem piedade… nem descanso!"
G["Slay them all, $n!"]="Mátalos a todos, $n!"
G["Slay them all. Leave their husks for the master to consume..."]="Slay them all. Leave their husks for the master to consume..."
G["Slay them in the master's name!"]="Matem-nos no nome do mestre!"
G["Slay them!"]="Matem-nos!"
G["Slay them!  Don't let the Scourge scum defile our city!"]="Matem-nos! Não deixem que a escória do Flagelo profane nossa cidade!"
G["Slay them, my brethren! For the Scourge!"]="Slay them, my brethren! For the Scourge!"
G["Slay these dogs, Kaylaan!  Earn your place in the Burning Legion!"]="Matar a esses cães, Kaylaan! Gánate seu posto na Legião Ardente!"
G["Slay these intruders, filthy Dreghood!  I promise you neverending pain if you disobey me!"]="Slay these intruders, filthy Dreghood!  I promise you neverending pain if you disobey me!"
G["Sleep no longer, my love. With the might of the Lich King behind you, the world will tremble."]="Sleep no longer, my love. With the might of the Lich King behind you, the world will tremble."
G["Sleep now in the cold dark...."]="Agora duerme na fria escuridão..."
G["Sleep now, little one. We'll find your parents soon."]="Agora duerme, pequeno. Pronto encontraremos aos seus padres."
