G["Sloppy, but adequate.  You seem capable in a fight and in need of direction.\n\nThere are hundreds of demons ahead, it would be suicide to go it alone:"]="Sloppy, but adequate.  You seem capable in a fight and in need of direction.\n\nThere are hundreds of demons ahead, it would be suicide to go it alone:"
G["Slow down Mei, I'm getting tired!"]="Para já, Mei, me estou cansando!"
G["Slow down you big fool!"]="Slow down you big fool!"
G["Slow down! I was getting to that!\n\nSo there he was, standing tall with all the blood and guts dripping off him when who shows up?\n\nThe Dark Irons! Didn't you hear a word I said??\n\nWell, the Dark Irons are a little craftier than those Blackrock orcs. They came prepared. By prepared I mean there were about 300 of em... *hic* 'scuse me."]="Slow down! I was getting to that!\n\nSo there he was, standing tall with all the blood and guts dripping off him when who shows up?\n\nThe Dark Irons! Didn't you hear a word I said??\n\nWell, the Dark Irons are a little craftier than those Blackrock orcs. They came prepared. By prepared I mean there were about 300 of em... *hic* 'scuse me."
G["Slow down, $r. The one you need to kill is already dead. Killing him again will serve no purpose. There are very few ways in which a lich can actually be destroyed and none of those means are available to you or I. That is why I have a plan. A plan that will have a very noticeable and real impact upon the Cult."]="Slow down, $r. The one you need to kill is already dead. Killing him again will serve no purpose. There are very few ways in which a lich can actually be destroyed and none of those means are available to you or I. That is why I have a plan. A plan that will have a very noticeable and real impact upon the Cult."
G["Slow down, friend. You say the General is coming?\n\nNow THERE'S a trophy for my wall! I'll distract the bodyguards, but it will be up to you to kill General Hawthorne himself. Are you ready to strike?"]="Slow down, friend. You say the General is coming?\n\nNow THERE'S a trophy for my wall! I'll distract the bodyguards, but it will be up to you to kill General Hawthorne himself. Are you ready to strike?"
G["Slow kobold look tasty!"]="Kobolds lento ter pinta sabrosa!"
G["Slowly then."]="Slowly then."
G["Slumber... another dream awaits you..."]="Slumber... another dream awaits you..."
G["Slurp. YUM!"]="Siup. MMM!"
G["Small, one-time portals to a major Horde or Alliance city.\n\nThe shards all washed down the drain together, so there's no way for me to know which shard will end up going where. The best I can do is figure out whether they came from Sunreaver portals or Silver Covenant portals. Both sides like to put a little signature in their portal magic - typical elvish flair.\n\nI'll sell you shards appropriate for your faction, and you'll find out where they go once they're stabilized."]="Small, one-time portals to a major Horde or Alliance city.\n\nThe shards all washed down the drain together, so there's no way for me to know which shard will end up going where. The best I can do is figure out whether they came from Sunreaver portals or Silver Covenant portals. Both sides like to put a little signature in their portal magic - typical elvish flair.\n\nI'll sell you shards appropriate for your faction, and you'll find out where they go once they're stabilized."
G["Smart money's on the gnomes to take the next race! Get your money in while you still can!"]="Smart money's on the gnomes to take the next race! Get your money in while you still can!"
