G["So I uh, lost my Fireliminator X-21. Can I get a new one?"]="So I uh, lost my Fireliminator X-21. Can I get a new one?"
G["So I was right about the energies. Let's see what the other tome has to say on the subject."]="Então tinha razão aproxima das energias. Vamos ver que diz o outro livro sobre o tema."
G["So I'm on some mountain with some big ol' tree. Bunch of elves runnin' around all over..."]="So I'm on some mountain with some big ol' tree. Bunch of elves runnin' around all over..."
G["So I've been sharing some of my brews around town, and everyone is raving! I can hardly believe it!"]="So I've been sharing some of my brews around town, and everyone is raving! I can hardly believe it!"
G["So Kel'Thuzad holds all of the pieces?"]="Isso indica que Kel'Thuzad conseguiu todos os fragmentos do cajado?"
G["So Old Man Thistle's stuck down the cave, so what does he do but whistle fer his trusty mushan, Bobo!\n\nAnd right fore long, he hears a boomin' noise, and Bobo busts a hole right in that cave!\n\nThat mushan done hear his master and come fer him!\n\nAnd then, what happens but the whole cave starts a shakin' and the ceiling starts crashing down.\n\nSo Old Man Thistle jumps on Bobo's back and you know what happened' then?"]="So Old Man Thistle's stuck down the cave, so what does he do but whistle fer his trusty mushan, Bobo!\n\nAnd right fore long, he hears a boomin' noise, and Bobo busts a hole right in that cave!\n\nThat mushan done hear his master and come fer him!\n\nAnd then, what happens but the whole cave starts a shakin' and the ceiling starts crashing down.\n\nSo Old Man Thistle jumps on Bobo's back and you know what happened' then?"
G["So Tortolla has risen to fight at our side. You are wise, $n; it is difficult to earn that ancient's trust. He will be a stalwart companion."]="So Tortolla has risen to fight at our side. You are wise, $n; it is difficult to earn that ancient's trust. He will be a stalwart companion."
G["So angry, Sarok? You shouldn't drink so much... Just tell us what you know about Mosarn."]="So angry, Sarok? You shouldn't drink so much... Just tell us what you know about Mosarn."
G["So angry.  We should calm you down with a nice lager... of pain!"]="So angry.  We should calm you down with a nice lager... of pain!"
G["So are the loa still holding to their side of the deal?"]="E os loa seguem acatando o trato?"
G["So are you going to bring this up to the elder?"]="Então, se o vai comentário ao ancestral?"
G["So be it then. I have to return to my people, brothers. Come back to me in one piece."]="So be it then. I have to return to my people, brothers. Come back to me in one piece."
G["So be it! They will curse Thrall for a fool once they have tasted our strength! To the towers!"]="So be it! They will curse Thrall for a fool once they have tasted our strength! To the towers!"
G["So be it."]="Que assim seja."
G["So be it. Al'galar thol, thol al'thaug: The end is the beginning."]="Que assim seja. Al'galar thol, thol ao'thaug: O fim é o início."
