G["So be it. The test is over."]="Que assim seja. A prova terminou."
G["So be it... brother."]="Que assim seja... irmão."
G["So be it... you have been warned."]="Que assim seja. Os o advertí."
G["So close to blessed Lakeshire.  By the Light, let my legs carry me a bit further!"]="Tão perto da bendita Vila do Lago. pela Luz, que meus pernas me levem um pouco mais longe!"
G["So cold!  There is no heat left in this world."]="Que frio! Não restante calor neste mundo."
G["So cold, so dark..."]="Tão frio, tão sombrio..."
G["So cold..."]="Tenho frio..."
G["So cold... and hungry.\n\nMy poor friend, I hope you've found peace. I can't stand to think about what they could have done to you.\n\nYou! You there! Please, you have to help me escape. One of them has a key, can you find it? I know they have it. If you get it, you can help me get out of here. Trey is probably already dead, but there's still time! Please, can you help me?"]="So cold... and hungry.\n\nMy poor friend, I hope you've found peace. I can't stand to think about what they could have done to you.\n\nYou! You there! Please, you have to help me escape. One of them has a key, can you find it? I know they have it. If you get it, you can help me get out of here. Trey is probably already dead, but there's still time! Please, can you help me?"
G["So dark..."]="Tan escuro..."
G["So delicious!"]="Que delicia!"
G["So does anyone know anything about Thel'zan? Who is he? How did he come to leading the Scourge armies on the ground?"]="Então, alguém sabe algo aproxima de Thel'zan? Quem é? Como chegou a dirigir aos exércitos de terra do Flagelo?"
G["So eager to be rescued, but no one came now did they?"]="Tanto esperar a que te rescaten... mas não tem vindo ninguém, verdade?"
G["So eager to die are we?"]="Estamos tão ansiosos por morrer?"
G["So eager you are, for my blood to spill. Yet to vanquish me, 'tis my head you must kill!"]="So eager you are, for my blood to spill. Yet to vanquish me, 'tis my head you must kill!"
G["So easily fooled by Tyrion's boasts upon holy ground, you rush to him thinking he would be victorious. You always were a coward, Darion. Just like your father."]="So easily fooled by Tyrion's boasts upon holy ground, you rush to him thinking he would be victorious. You always were a coward, Darion. Just like your father."
G["So easily solved, you are not so complicated after all!"]="Resolvido: não são tão complicados depois de tudo!"
