G["So lift a mug to Coren,\nAnd Hurley Blackbreath too!\nThis drink is weak, without much kick,\nBut oi!  At least it's brew!"]="So lift a mug to Coren,\nAnd Hurley Blackbreath too!\nThis drink is weak, without much kick,\nBut oi!  At least it's brew!"
G["So long as violence lurks in your hearts... I... will... return..."]="Sempre que a violência anide nos seus corações... voltarei..."
G["So long as we're sendin' troops up the beach, we should double-up the artillery-fire. You know, to help."]="So long as we're sendin' troops up the beach, we should double-up the artillery-fire. You know, to help."
