G["So many bookshelves, so little time..."]="So many bookshelves, so little time..."
G["So many choices, so little time..."]="Tantas opções e tão pouco tempo..."
G["So many dead serpents... If only I had kept up with my skinning..."]="So many dead serpents... If only I had kept up with my skinning..."
G["So many demons, not enough time."]="Tantos demônios e tão pouco tempo."
