G["So much to do, so much to do!  Where does the time go?"]="Sempre correndo, sempre correndo! Aonde vamos aparar?"
G["So much unstable energy... but worth the risk to destroy you!"]="So much unstable energy... but worth the risk to destroy you!"
G["So much whining! You would think I was trying to kill you!"]="So much whining! You would think I was trying to kill you!"
G["So much... lost.\n\nAnd I fear, $n, that this is only the beginning."]="Temos perdido tanto...\n\nE me temo, $n, que isto é somente o início."
G["So my blood was not a sufficient payment, eh? Fine, let us recover your arcane essence. After this, I owe Balthas nothing."]="Assim que meu sangue não foi pagamento suficiente, eh? Bem, de que recuperemos seu essência arcana. Ao fim e ao cabo não lhe devo nada a Balthas."
G["So my shouting, my rally cries... All for nothing... Everyone must think me a fool..."]="So my shouting, my rally cries... All for nothing... Everyone must think me a fool..."
G["So negative all the time Hou!"]="Que negativo é sempre, Hou!"
G["So not all of your people have allied with him?"]="Assim que não toda seu povo se tem aliado com ele?"
G["So now, let us celebrate with our fine warrior brothers!"]="Assim que festejemos ao lado a nossos valiosos irmãos guerreiros!"
G["So predictable."]="So predictable."
G["So predictable. I knew you would come. And I see you've brought the mighty Hellscream."]="So predictable. I knew you would come. And I see you've brought the mighty Hellscream."
G["So predictable..."]="So predictable..."
G["So seriously, how did your undead hunting go?  I want to hear stories."]="Venha, em sério, como tem ido a caça de não-mortos? Quero ouvir histórias."
G["So serve him I did... Were it not for me the glorious dread citadel of Naxxramas may never have returned to Northrend."]="Assim que lhe serví... Se não tivesse banido por mim, a gloriosa cidadela do terror, Naxxramas, nunca haveria retornado a Nortúndria."
G["So sexy it hurts!"]="É tão sexy que dói!"
G["So small.  So soft.  It's a wonder you've even lasted this long down here, fleshling."]="So small.  So soft.  It's a wonder you've even lasted this long down here, fleshling."
G["So soft!"]="Tan blandito!"
G["So sorry to leave a customer but we have places to go and people to swindle. We will be back sometime later today. Good-bye!"]="So sorry to leave a customer but we have places to go and people to swindle. We will be back sometime later today. Good-bye!"
G["So spout your platitudes and flail until you are spent. In the end, you will be mine, and Morbidus will be the harbinger of your death!"]="So spout your platitudes and flail until you are spent. In the end, you will be mine, and Morbidus will be the harbinger of your death!"
G["So sticky! I'll try to bring that moth down for you."]="So sticky! I'll try to bring that moth down for you."
G["So tasty! So delicious! Double Lucky special noodles!"]="Que sabor! Que delicia! Macarrão especiais de megasuerte!"
G["So tell me, goblin, why did your slave ship wander through our battle?"]="E diga, goblin, por que seu navio de escravos acabou em meio de nossa batalha?"
G["So that was the problem? Now I'm makin' progress..."]="So that was the problem? Now I'm makin' progress..."
G["So that's how Windsor died..."]="Então assim é como morreu Windsor..."
G["So that's the queen of the dragons? Hmm... we thought she'd be bigger. Yes, we did."]="So that's the queen of the dragons? Hmm... we thought she'd be bigger. Yes, we did."
G["So that's what happens what you stand too close to a bomb!"]="Isso é o que passa se você está demais perto de uma bomba!"
G["So the Alliance sent... you?"]="Assim que a Aliança você enviada... você?"
G["So the Banshee Queen has sent assassins?"]="Assim que a Rainha alma em pena tem enviada assassinos?"
G["So the Light's vaunted justice has finally arrived? Shall I lay down Frostmourne and throw myself at your mercy, Fordring?"]="So the Light's vaunted justice has finally arrived? Shall I lay down Frostmourne and throw myself at your mercy, Fordring?"
G["So the Searing Blade is expendable?"]="Então a lâmina abrasadora é dispensável?"
G["So the blood elves think they're just one step away from ruling the world..."]="Assim que os elfos de sangue acreditam que estão a ponto de domínio o mundo..."
G["So the cave's a crashing down, and Old Man Thistle and Bobo run as fast as they can! They twist and turn through the caves, til they burst outta the ground right up that hill!\n\nAnd what happened then but the cave closed up right behind 'em, like it got swallowed by the earth.\n\nOld Man Thistle's shaking, but first thing he does when he gets home is make a map to that cave full o' treasure. Cuz maybe it's still there, true?\n\nGood thing he did, cuz the next day, he couldn't remember as well, and the day after that he remembered even less, till he plumb forgot 'bout that cave altogether."]="So the cave's a crashing down, and Old Man Thistle and Bobo run as fast as they can! They twist and turn through the caves, til they burst outta the ground right up that hill!\n\nAnd what happened then but the cave closed up right behind 'em, like it got swallowed by the earth.\n\nOld Man Thistle's shaking, but first thing he does when he gets home is make a map to that cave full o' treasure. Cuz maybe it's still there, true?\n\nGood thing he did, cuz the next day, he couldn't remember as well, and the day after that he remembered even less, till he plumb forgot 'bout that cave altogether."
G["So the dogs have returned to sniff around?"]="So the dogs have returned to sniff around?"
G["So the fruit vendor was never going to wage war against us?  I find it hard to believe..."]="So the fruit vendor was never going to wage war against us?  I find it hard to believe..."
G["So the giants have been dropping the azsharite? But where does it come from?"]="Assim que os gigantes vocês têm estado tirando a azsharita? Mas, de onde procede?"
G["So the grand admiral knows about my... affliction, does she? I didn't know she cared!"]="So the grand admiral knows about my... affliction, does she? I didn't know she cared!"
G["So the oracle has decided to aid you, outlander. Very well, I will offer you what I know."]="So the oracle has decided to aid you, outlander. Very well, I will offer you what I know."
G["So the other kids, not me, dared Shin to knock on the Jade Witch's front door.  He wouldn't do it though but then someone, not me, hozen dared him.\n\nShin backed out of that but then someone, not me I swear, double hozen dared him.  And not even Shin can get out of a double hozen dare.\n\nHe went and knocked on the door but we didn't see what happened.  Jade Monsters came at us and we ran away. \n\nI never should have dared Shin..."]="So the other kids, not me, dared Shin to knock on the Jade Witch's front door.  He wouldn't do it though but then someone, not me, hozen dared him.\n\nShin backed out of that but then someone, not me I swear, double hozen dared him.  And not even Shin can get out of a double hozen dare.\n\nHe went and knocked on the door but we didn't see what happened.  Jade Monsters came at us and we ran away. \n\nI never should have dared Shin..."
G["So the prodigal son has spoken!"]="O filho pródigo tem falado!"
G["So the rumors are true? Vol'jin is alive and out for Garrosh's blood?"]="So the rumors are true? Vol'jin is alive and out for Garrosh's blood?"
G["So the stories were true..."]="Assim que as histórias eram certas..."
G["So then the array of magics would cascade into a chain reaction of positively charged energies."]="So then the array of magics would cascade into a chain reaction of positively charged energies."
G["So then we too are cursed?"]="Então nós também estamos malditos?"
G["So there we were - me and the battalion, doing a routine recon down the bone road. We'd sent the scout up ahead to look around in case anything dangerous come up."]="So there we were - me and the battalion, doing a routine recon down the bone road. We'd sent the scout up ahead to look around in case anything dangerous come up."
G["So they CAN die... I have to stay focused."]="Assim que PODEM morrer... Devo manter a concentração..."
G["So this gnome tells a tauren that he's been to Molten Core."]="Um gnomo vai e lhe diz a um tauren que tem estado no Núcleo Derretido."
G["So this is how Illidan bound so many demons to his will..."]="Então foi assim que Illidan vinculou tantos demônios à sua vontade..."
G["So this is how a chieftain is honored!"]="Assim que assim é como se honra a um chefe!"
G["So this is how it ends? A pity..."]="Assim que assim é como acaba? Uma pena..."
G["So this is what you have come for? To try and claim that which is the reason for the Dawn's existence and the Crusade's downfall? You open old wounds with your words, Commander!"]="So this is what you have come for? To try and claim that which is the reason for the Dawn's existence and the Crusade's downfall? You open old wounds with your words, Commander!"
G["So this is where you're hiding, Gar'dul."]="So this is where you're hiding, Gar'dul."
G["So this... is what it feels like... to be mortal?\n<The question trails off as Mavralyn's breathing stops.>"]="Assim que... isto é o que se sente... ao ser mortal?\n\n<A pergunta se desaparece quando Mavralyn abaixa de respirar.>"
G["So this... this is how it ends, my love..."]="Assim... assim é como acaba nossa história, amor meu..."
G["So tired. I will rest for just a moment!"]="So tired. I will rest for just a moment!"
G["So tired..."]="Estou tão cansado..."
G["So tired... just want to rest..."]="Estou tão cansado... Somente quero descansar..."
G["So today as I was gathering supplies, I found a wandering sherpa who sold exotic potions and oils. One of the more strange oils he had was known as a \"love potion\" for fish.  \n \n Nevermind how he created it, just know that the stuff REALLY works! It DOUBLED the Redbelly Mandarin population in his pond! \n \n I found him at the lake north of Niuzao Temple. You'd probably do some good if you helped even out the population there."]="So today as I was gathering supplies, I found a wandering sherpa who sold exotic potions and oils. One of the more strange oils he had was known as a \"love potion\" for fish.  \n \n Nevermind how he created it, just know that the stuff REALLY works! It DOUBLED the Redbelly Mandarin population in his pond! \n \n I found him at the lake north of Niuzao Temple. You'd probably do some good if you helped even out the population there."
G["So too do the Knights of the Ebon Blade. Although our kind has no place in your world, we will fight to bring an end to the Lich King. This I vow!"]="O mesmo tomarão os Cavaleiros da Lâmina de Ébano... Embora não temos lugar no seu mundo, lucharemos para acabar com o Rei Lich. O juro!"
G["So troll, have you given thought to my suggestion?  Whatever you decide, I'm sure it'll make Ironhide happy."]="Bom, troll, tem pensado na minha sugerência? Decidas o que decidas, certo que fará feliz a Pielférrea."
G["So until they do... bye bye!"]="Assim que, até que o façam... adeus!"
G["So warm, so red!"]="Que cálida! Que vermelha!"
G["So we finally meet to do battle."]="Então finalmente nos encontramos em batalha."
G["So we just wait until we think of something? Shen-zin Su is dying! Doing nothing risks everything!"]="Esperar a que se nos ocurra algo? Shen-zin Seu se você está morrendo! É demais arriscado."
G["So we're to trust people who would insult us with this deception? Do the draenei think so little of us that they must resort to trickery to get our attention?\n\nWe're aware of their desire to 'redeem' us, but my people want none of their redemption. We are capable of standing on our own and we will pursue our destiny as a proud and separate people. Carry this message to your allies."]="So we're to trust people who would insult us with this deception? Do the draenei think so little of us that they must resort to trickery to get our attention?\n\nWe're aware of their desire to 'redeem' us, but my people want none of their redemption. We are capable of standing on our own and we will pursue our destiny as a proud and separate people. Carry this message to your allies."
G["So weak."]="Quanta fraqueza."
G["So were you!"]="E você!"
G["So what brings you to Light's Hope?"]="Então, o que o leva à esperança da luz?"
G["So what can I do to help?"]="O que posso fazer para ajudar?"
G["So what did Ragnaros do next?"]="Então, o que Ragnaros fez a seguir?"
G["So what did you do?"]="Então que hicisteis?"
G["So what do you think of my new toy?"]="Então, que você acha meu novo brinquedo?"
G["So what do you want to do today?"]="Assim que que que fazer hoje?"
G["So what else do you have in that belt?"]="Bom, e que mais veste em esse cinto?"
G["So what happened then?"]="E que aconteceu depois?"
G["So what happened?"]="Então o que aconteceu?"
G["So what has led you to Naxxramas?"]="Assim pois, que você trouxe a Naxxramas?"
G["So what if it is? Why do you even care?"]="E que se o é? Por que te importa?"
G["So what is your purpose?"]="Então, qual é o seu propósito?"
G["So what of the cipher now? And your boys?"]="Então, o que dizer da cifra agora? E seus meninos?"
G["So what's this new plague all about?"]="Bem, de que trata esta Nova Fedor?"
G["So what's up with the bridge in Lakeshire? Oslow ever finish building it?"]="So what's up with the bridge in Lakeshire? Oslow ever finish building it?"
G["So whatever happened to that hot little number in Stormwind? Lady Prestor was her name."]="Que passou com esse bomboncito de Ventobravo? Chamava-se Lady Prestor."
G["So when you're feeling that tinglin' sensation at the base of your spine and you're 'bout ready to wet your pants, embrace it. Let it enrage you. That fear is the only thing that's gonna keep you breathin'."]="So when you're feeling that tinglin' sensation at the base of your spine and you're 'bout ready to wet your pants, embrace it. Let it enrage you. That fear is the only thing that's gonna keep you breathin'."
G["So where do we go from here?"]="Então, para onde vamos partir daqui?"
G["So where was I? Oh yea, so the orcs rushed Windsor and Windsor, well, he didn't move an inch. He stood tall as they charged him, ten at a time. All I could see was the glow from Ironfoe and a lot of blood. This went on for hours, maybe days. I don't remember. Anyhow, FINALLY, it stopped."]="Então, onde eu estava? Oh si, então os orcs apressaram Windsor e Windsor, bem, ele não se mexeu nem um centímetro. Ele ficou alto enquanto eles o atacavam, dez de cada vez. Tudo que eu podia ver era o brilho de Ironfoe e muito sangue. Isso continuou por horas, talvez dias. Não me lembro. De qualquer forma, finalmente, parou."
G["So who is protecting the Burlap Trail?"]="So who is protecting the Burlap Trail?"
G["So why are you here? What are we to do if there is no hope?"]="Então por que está aqui? Que faremos se se significa que já não fica esperança?"
G["So why are you still here?"]="Então, por que você ainda está aqui?"
G["So wild and vicious he was kicked off the Peak of Serenity, it's the froth-mouthed frenzy, always-bananas monkey monk master CLOUDBENDER KOBO!"]="So wild and vicious he was kicked off the Peak of Serenity, it's the froth-mouthed frenzy, always-bananas monkey monk master CLOUDBENDER KOBO!"
G["So ya be smellin' fortune eh? What say ya come with me to Bilgewater and we make a fortune at the gamblin' tables."]="So ya be smellin' fortune eh? What say ya come with me to Bilgewater and we make a fortune at the gamblin' tables."
G["So ye want me to go join the Alliance front in this... Pandaria... eh?"]="Assim que que que vá ao linha de frente da Aliança em... como se chama? Pandaria?"
G["So ye want to be a Blacksmith eh? Grab an apron and a hammer $g lad : lass;, let's see what ye've got."]="Então você quer ser ferreiro, não é? Pegue um avental e um martelo, $grapaz:moça;, e vamos ver do que é capaz."
G["So you are Klinfran the Crazed? Sad, I was expecting an actual challenge. Do you dare face me in your true form?"]="So you are Klinfran the Crazed? Sad, I was expecting an actual challenge. Do you dare face me in your true form?"
G["So you are the creature who gave the jinyu the courage they needed to stand their ground against the hozen.\n\nSuch courage is something we have not seen in some time. I welcome you to our humble home."]="Assim que você é a criatura que proporcionó aos jinyu o coragem suficiente para resistir contra os hozen.\n\nIsso é algo que não vemos desde há muito tempo. Dou a você a boas-vindas a nossa humilde roxa."
G["So you are to be my commander today. Very well."]="Assim que hoje será meu comandante. Muito bem."
G["So you can teach me this... this..."]="So you can teach me this... this..."
G["So you caught a thief.  Enjoy your finder's fee!"]="Assim que tem preso a um ladrão. Aproveite da recompensa!"
G["So you have come here, to the heart of the pollution. We will aid you. Our song will resonate through the walls of this twisted place, weakening the resolve of those who have forsaken our race."]="So you have come here, to the heart of the pollution. We will aid you. Our song will resonate through the walls of this twisted place, weakening the resolve of those who have forsaken our race."
G["So you have come seeking our aid?"]="Assim que tem vindo à procura de nossa ajuda?"
G["So you have come to Niby to learn the secrets of calling down an infernal servant from the Nether.\n\nSilence! Niby knows all!\n\nNiby is not so quick to part with such knowledge. First, you must assist Niby with a very important task."]="Assim que tem vindo a procurar a Niby para aprender a evocar a um infernal do averno.\n\nSilenciar! Niby o sabe tudo!\n\nMas Niby não lhe contao que sabe a qualquer. Primeiro, deverá ajudar a Niby com uma tarefa muito importantes."
G["So you have defeated the Crimson Sigil. You now seek to challenge my rule? Not even Arthas could defeat me, yet you dare to even harbor such thoughts? Then I say to you, come! Come $n! The Black Temple awaits..."]="So you have defeated the Crimson Sigil. You now seek to challenge my rule? Not even Arthas could defeat me, yet you dare to even harbor such thoughts? Then I say to you, come! Come $n! The Black Temple awaits..."
G["So you have returned to help Kum'isha, $r? Do not worry, the pang that you feel in the pit of your stomach is merely your willpower collapsing.\n\nThankfully, you will not need willpower for this collection. I am certain that you will enjoy the trinkets I will have waiting for you upon your return with the item."]="So you have returned to help Kum'isha, $r? Do not worry, the pang that you feel in the pit of your stomach is merely your willpower collapsing.\n\nThankfully, you will not need willpower for this collection. I am certain that you will enjoy the trinkets I will have waiting for you upon your return with the item."
G["So you know why I'm here then.  All right Midriff, pay up."]="So you know why I'm here then.  All right Midriff, pay up."
G["So you refuse? Is the son of Durotan a coward?"]="So you refuse? Is the son of Durotan a coward?"
G["So you say now, but at least you've got a warm dinner waiting for ya..."]="So you say now, but at least you've got a warm dinner waiting for ya..."
G["So you see - power is easily taken, but should not be lightly given."]="Portanto, perceba: o poder é facilmente tomado, mas não deve ser dado levianamente."
G["So you see fit to toy with the Lich King's creations? Ramstein, be sure to give the intruders a proper greeting."]="So you see fit to toy with the Lich King's creations? Ramstein, be sure to give the intruders a proper greeting."
G["So you suspect that someone on the inside was involved? They were tipped off?"]="So you suspect that someone on the inside was involved? They were tipped off?"
G["So you think you are good enough to learn from me? The great Snarl? You are no more than a lowly worm beneath my boot. However, taking on an underling might make me seem more appealing to Sumi and Tumi. Let's see what meager skills you possess."]="Então você acha que é bom o suficiente para aprender comigo? O grande rosnado? Você não passa de um me ver humilde debaixo da minha bota. No entanto, assumir um subordinado pode me fazer parecer mais atraente para Sumi e Tumi. Vamos ver quais habilidades escassas você possui."
G["So you thought to make a fool of Mor'ghor, eh? Before you are delivered to Lord Illidan, you will feel pain that you could not know to exist. I will take pleasure in exacting my own vengeance."]="So you thought to make a fool of Mor'ghor, eh? Before you are delivered to Lord Illidan, you will feel pain that you could not know to exist. I will take pleasure in exacting my own vengeance."
G["So you thought you could break into this palace of the Light and run away with our secrets! Vishas, interrogate this criminal at once!"]="So you thought you could break into this palace of the Light and run away with our secrets! Vishas, interrogate this criminal at once!"
G["So you want to know what I'm looking for?  I like that... I'm looking for someone strong and courageous.  Brains are one thing, but you've gotta be able to back it up with some muscle.\n\nWhenever those pesky Dark Iron dwarves attack, you can attack them by throwing a mug at them.  Just down it and throw.  Simple.\n\nFor every dwarf you down, you'll be marked.  Talk to me and I'll give you a prize ticket for every mark you have."]="So you want to know what I'm looking for?  I like that... I'm looking for someone strong and courageous.  Brains are one thing, but you've gotta be able to back it up with some muscle.\n\nWhenever those pesky Dark Iron dwarves attack, you can attack them by throwing a mug at them.  Just down it and throw.  Simple.\n\nFor every dwarf you down, you'll be marked.  Talk to me and I'll give you a prize ticket for every mark you have."
G["So you want to play?!"]="Assim que que jogar!"
G["So you will help?"]="Então nos ajudará?"
G["So you wish to commune with the dead? You shall have your wish."]="Assim que que se comunicar com os mortos? Terá o que deseja."
G["So you would like to learn a few things? I would be happy to get you started!"]="Então você gostaria de aprender algumas coisas? Ficaria feliz em começar!"
G["So you're a hunter? My father has taught me to be pretty handy with a bow, myself."]="So you're a hunter? My father has taught me to be pretty handy with a bow, myself."
G["So you're here for the Warsong axes. Well, it's about time, $n. That crate has been sitting out there for days, now.\n\nFeel free to haul it away whenever you are ready."]="So you're here for the Warsong axes. Well, it's about time, $n. That crate has been sitting out there for days, now.\n\nFeel free to haul it away whenever you are ready."
G["So you're looking to relearn what you forgot, eh? Or maybe learn what you were never taught? I know just the thing, $n. Over by Steamwheedle port, to the east, you'll find a magical book in Narain's hut called \"Soothsaying for Dummies.\" Give it a read.\n\n<Nixx winks.>\n\nYou'll find all that you need to know and then some..."]="So you're looking to relearn what you forgot, eh? Or maybe learn what you were never taught? I know just the thing, $n. Over by Steamwheedle port, to the east, you'll find a magical book in Narain's hut called \"Soothsaying for Dummies.\" Give it a read.\n\n<Nixx winks.>\n\nYou'll find all that you need to know and then some..."
G["So you're part of the Argent Crusade, eh?"]="Assim que formas parte da Cruzada Argêntea, eh?"
G["So you're the Alliance's so-called champion. With your death this place will easily fall."]="So you're the Alliance's so-called champion. With your death this place will easily fall."
G["So you're the new hot shot in town, eh?\n\n<Zorek spits on the ground.>\n\nYea..."]="So you're the new hot shot in town, eh?\n\n<Zorek spits on the ground.>\n\nYea..."
G["So you're the one who ventured into Shadowfang Keep to retreive the rare and powerful materials hidden there?"]="Assim que foi você quem se aventuró pelo Castelo de Colmilho Sombrio para encontrar os materiais raros e poderosos que se encontram no seu interior?"
G["So you're the ones causing all that ruckus!"]="So you're the ones causing all that ruckus!"
G["So you've conquered a small spot of land. A minor setback! I will reign here!"]="So you've conquered a small spot of land. A minor setback! I will reign here!"
G["So you've recently arrived from Azeroth, eh? You'd best steel yourself, $c - there are perils in this land unlike anything the Horde has faced before. I am Nazgrel - right hand to our mighty warchief, Thrall. He honored me with the task of safeguarding this brave expedition and - by all the spirits - I shall!"]="So you've recently arrived from Azeroth, eh? You'd best steel yourself, $c - there are perils in this land unlike anything the Horde has faced before. I am Nazgrel - right hand to our mighty warchief, Thrall. He honored me with the task of safeguarding this brave expedition and - by all the spirits - I shall!"
G["So your bat and your snake need Zanzil's help?  Very well.  I'll see you inside Zul'Gurub... old friend."]="So your bat and your snake need Zanzil's help?  Very well.  I'll see you inside Zul'Gurub... old friend."
G["So! Even as the Alliance binds itself ever closer together, the Horde is ripping itself apart."]="Então! Enquanto a Aliança começa a se unir mais do que nunca, a Horda está se despedaçando."
G["So! You DO have a spine!"]="Vá! Assim que SIM que tem coragem!"
G["So, $n, I'm ready to tell you what happened in the Swamp of Sorrows. Hiccup!"]="So, $n, I'm ready to tell you what happened in the Swamp of Sorrows. Hiccup!"
G["So, $n, which item are you interested in?"]="Então, $n, que item te interesse?"
G["So, $n, you have a near perfect track record. Tell me, how do you feel about the Navy?"]="Bom, $n, tem um história quase perfeito. Diga, que opinas da marinha?"
G["So, Alliance finally decided to drop in some reinforcements, eh? Get to the front, $c!"]="Assim que a Aliança se tem decido finalmente a enviar algum reforços, eh? Ao linha de frente, $c!"
G["So, General Twinbraid is dead? He was a pivotal figure in the Alliance push through Southern Barrens. Impressive work."]="Então o General Duas-tranças está morto? Ele era uma figura central para as forças da Aliança nos Sertões Meridionais. Ótimo trabalho."
G["So, Gorrok, do you think I have a chance with Kiryn?"]="Então, Gorrok, krees que eu tem possibilidades com Kiryn?"
G["So, I found this shackle key..."]="Bom, encontrei uma chave de grilhetes..."
G["So, I really appreciate you taking with me into this scary jungle and all..."]="Bom, te agradeço muito que me tenha trazido a esta selva tenebrosa e tudo isso..."
G["So, Twilight's Hammer is trying to finish me off? Honorless filth!\n\nI will definitely help you, $c. You say you need a map?"]="So, Twilight's Hammer is trying to finish me off? Honorless filth!\n\nI will definitely help you, $c. You say you need a map?"
G["So, are you ready to start? Let's see what you've got."]="Tudo pronto para começar? Vamos ver que pode oferecer."
G["So, did you hear about Helper 432-A? I heard that... what the-? HEY! We Helpers have WORK to do, you know!"]="So, did you hear about Helper 432-A? I heard that... what the-? HEY! We Helpers have WORK to do, you know!"
G["So, dis be Budd?"]="Assim que eh'te é Budd?"
G["So, do you just want to... I don't know... Roll it away or something?"]="So, do you just want to... I don't know... Roll it away or something?"
G["So, doctor, how goes your research?"]="E bem, doutor, que tal vai seu investigação?"
G["So, friends... how are we going to find the hidden master?"]="Bom, amigos... como vamos encontrar ao mestre oculto?"
G["So, how does a dwarf like you end up in a place like this?"]="Então, como um anão como você acaba em um lugar como esse?"
G["So, how does it all turn out in Icecrown?"]="Como tem terminado tudo em Coroa de Gelo?"
G["So, it has begun...."]="Já tem começado..."
G["So, it has come to this. Together, we have learned and grown over the years, and now we find ourselves face to face on the battlefield. Do not think I will go easy on you, nor do I expect any quarter. What we do now, we do for the horde, both of us."]="So, it has come to this. Together, we have learned and grown over the years, and now we find ourselves face to face on the battlefield. Do not think I will go easy on you, nor do I expect any quarter. What we do now, we do for the horde, both of us."
G["So, it is done."]="Assim que, está feito."
G["So, now that I'm the king... what have you got for me?!"]="Então, agora que eu sou o rei... o que você tem para mim?!"
G["So, off to see Myolor, eh? He's right o'er there... behind ye! Er, maybe in front of ye! Near the Great Anvil!"]="Então, vamos ver Myolor, não é? Ele está lá... atrás de você! Er, talvez na sua linha de frente! Perto da grande bigorna!"
G["So, stranger, are you the wild and crazy type like the hozen?\n\nOr the quiet and thoughtful type like the jinyu?"]="So, stranger, are you the wild and crazy type like the hozen?\n\nOr the quiet and thoughtful type like the jinyu?"
G["So, the frail members of the living have some teeth after all. Take this place, then, for the time being. I will return, twice as strong, and your paltry forces will fall!"]="So, the frail members of the living have some teeth after all. Take this place, then, for the time being. I will return, twice as strong, and your paltry forces will fall!"
G["So, we live to fight another day."]="So, we live to fight another day."
G["So, what are the fish like where you come from?"]="Então, Como são os peixe no lugar do que veio?"
G["So, when does this excavation of Zul'Aman begin?"]="Quando começa essa escavação de Zul’aman?"
G["So, when's the next party?"]="Então, quando é a próxima festa?"
G["So, where should we search first?"]="Bom, onde buscamos primeiro?"
G["So, you are willing to help repair the mighty Exodar?  I heard it will take years before the Exodar is fully functional once more.  You have two hours.  Just kidding.  Our engineers are located on the lower levels of the Trader's Tier.  Go with the Light."]="Então, você está disposto a ajudar a reparar o poderoso Exodar? Ouvi dizer que levará anos até que o Exodar esteja totalmente funcional mais uma vez. Você tem duas horas. Só brincando. Nossos engenheiros estão localizados nos níveis mais baixos do nível do trader. Vá com a luz."
G["So, you have found me. I suppose that you have come to learn of suppression and control.\n\nI will teach you much more than that... you will also learn of sacrifice.\n\n<Daio grins.>"]="So, you have found me. I suppose that you have come to learn of suppression and control.\n\nI will teach you much more than that... you will also learn of sacrifice.\n\n<Daio grins.>"
G["So, you wanna find de fabled swords of de Sandfury, eh?\n\nYa be ready ta kill for Sul'thraze? Spill de blood across de sands? In search of treasure, of power?\n\nIf ya are...welcome to de desert, mon."]="So, you wanna find de fabled swords of de Sandfury, eh?\n\nYa be ready ta kill for Sul'thraze? Spill de blood across de sands? In search of treasure, of power?\n\nIf ya are...welcome to de desert, mon."
G["So, you wish to face off against a real Orc Warchief.  So be it."]="So, you wish to face off against a real Orc Warchief.  So be it."
G["So, you wish to learn more about our elven weaponry? Let your first lesson begin."]="So, you wish to learn more about our elven weaponry? Let your first lesson begin."
G["So, you're a homebrewer?"]="Assim O que está fazendo cerveja em casa?"
G["So, you've been around a lot, but we seem to keep missing each other for getting together after work.\n\nIs it me?\n\n<Khatie purposely cheers up.>\n\nAnyway, I just wanted to say that I... we really appreciate everything that you've been doing for the Skyguard!"]="So, you've been around a lot, but we seem to keep missing each other for getting together after work.\n\nIs it me?\n\n<Khatie purposely cheers up.>\n\nAnyway, I just wanted to say that I... we really appreciate everything that you've been doing for the Skyguard!"
G["So, you've come to die?!"]="Assim que tem vindo a morrer!"
G["So, you've managed to train an army...\n\nAn impressive achievement, but is war really the right course of action?"]="So, you've managed to train an army...\n\nAn impressive achievement, but is war really the right course of action?"
G["So, you've taken over the ranch for good, eh?"]="Então vai encargar do rancho de forma permanente, não?"
G["So, zhis is zhe $r $c I haf heard so much about, hmm?"]="Assim que $geste é o: esta é a; $r $c da que tanto ouvi hablarrr, hmmm?"
G["So, zhis is zhe $r $c I've heard so much about, hmm?\n\nAs you know, zhere is vone obelisk zhat has yet to be activated....\n\nVhen zhe time comes to restore zhis ancient mechanism, vhill you be zhere? Vill history remember you?\n\nZhat depends on your villingness to cooperate!"]="So, zhis is zhe $r $c I've heard so much about, hmm?\n\nAs you know, zhere is vone obelisk zhat has yet to be activated....\n\nVhen zhe time comes to restore zhis ancient mechanism, vhill you be zhere? Vill history remember you?\n\nZhat depends on your villingness to cooperate!"
G["So-ngh-thirsty."]="Tão-ngh-sedento."
G["So... EPIC!!!"]="É... tão... ÉPICO!!"
G["So... Hungry..."]="Muito... faminto."
G["So... SPICY!!!"]="Que... ESPECIADO!"
G["So... SWEET!"]="Que... DOCE!"
G["So... You thought you could fool me, did you? The greatest criminal mastermind Azeroth has ever known???"]="So... You thought you could fool me, did you? The greatest criminal mastermind Azeroth has ever known???"
G["So... appetizing."]="Tan... apetitoso."
G["So... as much as I hate to complain after being saved from a horrible death I just thought you should know that I'm still over here stuck in one of these messy cages and it would really be great if you could come on over and let me out so I could help you celebrate your amazing victory over that big crazy scary troll-cat... thing."]="So... as much as I hate to complain after being saved from a horrible death I just thought you should know that I'm still over here stuck in one of these messy cages and it would really be great if you could come on over and let me out so I could help you celebrate your amazing victory over that big crazy scary troll-cat... thing."
G["So... business or pleasure?"]="E bem... negócios ou prazer?"
G["So... cold..."]="Tanto... frio..."
G["So... confused. Do not... belong here."]="Estou... confuso... Não... não tinha..."
G["So... difficult!"]="Que... difícil!"
G["So... do any of you know where the hidden master lives?"]="Isto... Alguém sabe onde vive o mestre oculto?"
G["So... foolish."]="Tan... imprudente."
G["So... full of life."]="Tanta... vida."
G["So... lonely."]="Estou tão sozinha..."
G["So... many... carrots..."]="So... many... carrots..."
G["So... much... power."]="Tanto... poder."
G["So... so very thirsty..."]="Muito... muito sedento..."
G["So... sore..."]="So... sore..."
G["So... the Earthen were made out of stone?"]="Então... os terrenos foram feitos de pedras?"
G["So... thirsty..."]="Tão sedento..."
G["So... uh... can Riko get a kiss?"]="Então... eh... Riko leva um beijo?"
G["So... umm... $p? I'm still here, you know."]="$p, Eh... Sabe que ainda estou aqui?"
G["So... want to talk about it?"]="Então... Que falar de elho?"
G["So... what's inside Uldum?"]="Então... o que há dentro de Uldum?"
G["So... where can I find Azuregos, Ergll?"]="Bom... Onde posso encontrar a Azuregos, Erglh?"
G["So... why isn't that troll dead yet?  He is the one reanimating all of those mogu, yes?"]="So... why isn't that troll dead yet?  He is the one reanimating all of those mogu, yes?"
G["So... you took out the King eh?  I knew that these bozos would make you the new king, I just knew it!  That's all these bozos understand - power.\n\nIt would seem that the more henchmen you keep alive, the higher your tribute will be.  Not to shabby - makes for an interesting challenge I'd say.  If you leave, I wouldn't expect to remain king.  One of these yokels will no doubt step up and take your place.\n\nOne more thing... you didn't happen to find my key, did you?"]="So... you took out the King eh?  I knew that these bozos would make you the new king, I just knew it!  That's all these bozos understand - power.\n\nIt would seem that the more henchmen you keep alive, the higher your tribute will be.  Not to shabby - makes for an interesting challenge I'd say.  If you leave, I wouldn't expect to remain king.  One of these yokels will no doubt step up and take your place.\n\nOne more thing... you didn't happen to find my key, did you?"
G["So... you want to be a tailor? Very well, we'll see if you have what it takes."]="Então... você quer ser alfaiate? Muito bem, veremos se você tem o que é preciso."
G["So... you wouldn't happen to have a chest around here that has, let's say, a gauntlet that the Gordok ogres consider to be a priceless artifact?"]="So... you wouldn't happen to have a chest around here that has, let's say, a gauntlet that the Gordok ogres consider to be a priceless artifact?"
G["So... you're the stranger Cho was talking about.\n\nWelcome to Dawn's Blossom! I am Peiji Goldendraft and my family makes only the finest brews in Pandaria.\n\nUnlike those Wanderbrews who keep slinking around ruining the good name of Brewmasters everywhere. I think I even spied the young one eyeing my daughter. Can't have that! Goldendrafts and Wanderbrews do not mix."]="So... you're the stranger Cho was talking about.\n\nWelcome to Dawn's Blossom! I am Peiji Goldendraft and my family makes only the finest brews in Pandaria.\n\nUnlike those Wanderbrews who keep slinking around ruining the good name of Brewmasters everywhere. I think I even spied the young one eyeing my daughter. Can't have that! Goldendrafts and Wanderbrews do not mix."
G["So.... How's about one 'a ya stroll on up 'ere an' help me out, eh?"]="So.... How's about one 'a ya stroll on up 'ere an' help me out, eh?"
G["So...how about we forget about our little wager and carry on with our busy lives?"]="Então... que tal se esquecermos nossa pequena aposta e continuarmos com nossas vidas?"
G["So...tired..."]="Estou... cansando..."
G["Soap on a rope! Attached to a chain. Mounted via a steel cable. To some soap."]="Soap on a rope! Attached to a chain. Mounted via a steel cable. To some soap."
G["Socks followed along, faithfully."]="Socks followed along, faithfully."
G["Socrethar is clouding your mind, Kaylaan!  You do not mean these words!  I remember training you when you were but a youngling.  Your will was strong even then!"]="Socrethar is clouding your mind, Kaylaan!  You do not mean these words!  I remember training you when you were but a youngling.  Your will was strong even then!"
G["Soft emerald green eyes framed a countenance, wise"]="Soft emerald green eyes framed a countenance, wise"
G["Soft, vulnerable shells. Brief fragile lives. You cannot escape the curse of flesh!"]="Soft, vulnerable shells. Brief fragile lives. You cannot escape the curse of flesh!"
G["Soldier! Front and center!"]="Soldado! À cabeça!"
G["Soldier, call Captain Blackanvil at once!"]="Soldado, chama ao capitão Yunquenegro de imediatamente!"
G["Soldier, run to me! I'll clear a path with the chain gun!"]="Soldier, run to me! I'll clear a path with the chain gun!"
G["Soldier, you have new orders. You're to pull back and report to the sergeant!"]="Soldado, você tem novos pedidos. Você deve recuar e informar o sargento!"
G["Soldier..."]="Recruta"
G["Soldiers arise, stand and fight! Bring victory at last to this fallen knight!"]="Soldiers arise, stand and fight! Bring victory at last to this fallen knight!"
G["Soldiers of Azeroth, you now fight against the vile Burning Crusade.  And the hopes and prayers of all Light-loving people march with you.  In the company of our brave allies and brothers-in-arms you will hold your ground and break this demonic charge.  You will stem the destructive tyranny that rages across so many worlds."]="Soldiers of Azeroth, you now fight against the vile Burning Crusade.  And the hopes and prayers of all Light-loving people march with you.  In the company of our brave allies and brothers-in-arms you will hold your ground and break this demonic charge.  You will stem the destructive tyranny that rages across so many worlds."
G["Soldiers of Frostwolf, come to my aid! The time has come to unleash the fury of the elements upon them!"]="Soldados Lobo Gelo, venham na minha ajuda! Chegou a hora de liberar a fúria dos elementos sobre eles!"
G["Soldiers of Kalimdor! Heroes of Silithus! One among you has dealt a vicious blow to our mortal enemies! $n and $g his:her; allies have relieved the Ruins of Ahn'Qiraj of its merciless leader! Ossirian the Unscarred, scourge of Silithus, has finally been destroyed and his armies wholly dismantled!"]="Soldiers of Kalimdor! Heroes of Silithus! One among you has dealt a vicious blow to our mortal enemies! $n and $g his:her; allies have relieved the Ruins of Ahn'Qiraj of its merciless leader! Ossirian the Unscarred, scourge of Silithus, has finally been destroyed and his armies wholly dismantled!"
G["Soldiers of Kalimdor, defend the base!"]="Soldiers of Kalimdor, defend the base!"
G["Soldiers of Lordaeron, rise to meet your master's call!"]="Soldados de Lordaeron, levantem-se ante a chamada do seu mestre!"
G["Soldiers of Stormpike, come to my aid! The beacon must be planted."]="Soldiers of Stormpike, come to my aid! The beacon must be planted."
G["Soldiers of Stormpike, your General is under attack! I require aid! Come! Come! Slay these mangy Frostwolf dogs."]="Soldados de Pico Tempestade, estão atacando ao seu geral! Preciso ajuda! Vamos! Venham! Madada esses asquerosos cães Lobo Gelo."
G["Soldiers of the Horde, attack!"]="Soldados da Horda, ao ataque!"
G["Soldiers of the Scourge, death knights of Acherus, minions of the darkness: hear the call of the Highlord!"]="Soldados do Flagelo, cavaleiros da Morte de Acherus, lacaios da escuridão: escutem a chamada do Alto Senhor!"
G["Soldiers of the Scourge, stand ready! Prepare to unleash your fury upon the Argent Dawn!"]="Soldados do Flagelo, em pé! Preparem-se para liberar sua fúria sobre O Alba Argêntea!"
G["Soldiers of the frozen wastes, rise and hear the call of your master! Do not let $n escape with the tome!"]="Soldiers of the frozen wastes, rise and hear the call of your master! Do not let $n escape with the tome!"
G["Soldiers! Crush their flank!"]="Soldiers! Crush their flank!"
G["Soldiers, fall in! Guard the halls!"]="Soldiers, fall in! Guard the halls!"
G["Soldiers, fall in! Looks like the Horde are comin' to take another shot!"]="Soldados, em formação! Parece que a Horda vem novamente."
G["Solve the other riddles, I am demanding! And then meet me down south at Lion's Landing."]="Solve the other riddles, I am demanding! And then meet me down south at Lion's Landing."
G["Some action. Glad to hear it."]="Algo de ação. Finalmente."
G["Some adventurers think enchanting doesn't work. I find that when I challenge them to battle they change their tune!"]="Alguns aventureiros pensam que encantar não funciona. Acho que quando os desafio a lutar, eles mudam de tom!"
G["Some are easy for even simple men to discern, while others require wisdom to see."]="Some are easy for even simple men to discern, while others require wisdom to see."
G["Some argue Brother Rabbitsfoot has more good fortune than I, the Lucky Eightcoins.\n\nAt this I laugh.\n\nIt is simple: he is called \"brother\", I am called \"Lucky\". Obviously I am of more luck."]="Some argue Brother Rabbitsfoot has more good fortune than I, the Lucky Eightcoins.\n\nAt this I laugh.\n\nIt is simple: he is called \"brother\", I am called \"Lucky\". Obviously I am of more luck."
G["Some call me... Impsy?"]="Alguns me chamam de... Impsy?"
G["Some called my father mad. But even in his darkest hours, his vision was clear."]="Some called my father mad. But even in his darkest hours, his vision was clear."
G["Some champion."]="Some champion."
G["Some consider these yaks to be lowly beasts, suitable only for grazing and menial labor. Few recognize the innate beauty that these creatures - the scions of the Black Ox - truly possess."]="Some consider these yaks to be lowly beasts, suitable only for grazing and menial labor. Few recognize the innate beauty that these creatures - the scions of the Black Ox - truly possess."
G["Some customers are hungry, they'll want a second bowl after they finish their first."]="Alguns clientes têm tanta fome que querem um segundo prato depois do primeiro."
G["Some dance with great passion and enthusiasm, like Fei Li.\n\nOthers do not dance unless they are provoked, such as Yalia."]="Some dance with great passion and enthusiasm, like Fei Li.\n\nOthers do not dance unless they are provoked, such as Yalia."
G["Some day I'll be able to put my skills at the service of Ramkahen."]="Um dia poderei colocar minhas habilidades a serviço de Ramkahen."
G["Some day we're havin', eh?\nMe poor gryphons..."]="Vá dia levamos, eh?\n\nPobres grifos..."
G["Some decisions have dire consequences."]="Some decisions have dire consequences."
G["Some enemies gain most of their power from the weapon that they wield.  Take that away, and their power over you goes with it."]="Some enemies gain most of their power from the weapon that they wield.  Take that away, and their power over you goes with it."
G["Some folks might ask why I like flowers so much. That's just me appreciatin' the beauty of this land."]="Some folks might ask why I like flowers so much. That's just me appreciatin' the beauty of this land."
G["Some furless things been making friends with big-tongues... seem pretty dumb to Dajik."]="Some furless things been making friends with big-tongues... seem pretty dumb to Dajik."
G["Some have sided with the Horde."]="Alguns se têm aliado com a Horda."
G["Some have spent decades meditating upon this mystery, Avuun. I do not wish the same fate upon you."]="Some have spent decades meditating upon this mystery, Avuun. I do not wish the same fate upon you."
G["Some healers lack the knowledge to counter the diseases that we master."]="Some healers lack the knowledge to counter the diseases that we master."
G["Some help! Anyone!"]="Que alguém me ajude!"
G["Some help, my little friend?"]="Alguma ajuda, meu amiguinho?"
G["Some injuries never heal, noble dwarf. A broken soul cannot be fixed."]="Some injuries never heal, noble dwarf. A broken soul cannot be fixed."
G["Some kind of attack plan?  Auberdine was ravaged during the first throes of the cataclysm.  What value could it have to anyone?"]="Some kind of attack plan?  Auberdine was ravaged during the first throes of the cataclysm.  What value could it have to anyone?"
G["Some laugh at my concern for beasts. I scoff at their lack of compassion."]="Some laugh at my concern for beasts. I scoff at their lack of compassion."
G["Some may question my methods, but there's no denying my results."]="Some may question my methods, but there's no denying my results."
G["Some more weeds, over here!"]="Por aqui tem mais ervas!"
G["Some nice contagion of rot for you, my pretty?"]="Algo de precioso Contagio de putrefacção para você, querida?"
G["Some o' us be loa priests, witch doctors before. Like Zalazane...\n\n<Zen'tabra's face grows hard as her gaze drifts south.>\n\nWe thought de spirits be angry wit us; we did not suspect it be Zalazane slowly cuttin' us off from dem. We knew he be strong, but not dat strong... and by de time his voodoo had reached de other isles, we was powerless ta stop 'im."]="Some o' us be loa priests, witch doctors before. Like Zalazane...\n\n<Zen'tabra's face grows hard as her gaze drifts south.>\n\nWe thought de spirits be angry wit us; we did not suspect it be Zalazane slowly cuttin' us off from dem. We knew he be strong, but not dat strong... and by de time his voodoo had reached de other isles, we was powerless ta stop 'im."
G["Some of me best friends be orcs. Dis' be a bad time."]="Muitos de meus melhores amigos são orcs. É uma época dura."
G["Some of our huntresses have already made their way to Ban'ethil Barrow Den. They will find you when you get inside. Go ahead and speak to Citarre to secure a ride there."]="Some of our huntresses have already made their way to Ban'ethil Barrow Den. They will find you when you get inside. Go ahead and speak to Citarre to secure a ride there."
G["Some of our kegs went missing recently. They were last seen just east of here..."]="Há pouco perdimos uns quantos barris. Os vimos por última vez ao este de aqui..."
G["Some of the things here are so glamourous."]="Algumas das coisas são tão lindas."
G["Some of this ointment should help."]="Alguma de estas pomadas precisa servir."
G["Some of those cake designs are outrageous!"]="Some of those cake designs are outrageous!"
G["Some of us get to avoid military duty.  A good fisherman's always handy... even generals need to eat."]="Alguns de nós evitam o serviço militar. Um bom pescador é sempre útil... até os generais precisam comer."
G["Some of you have not fought in battles. Peace has been with us for many years. Many years we sat idle but many years we battled."]="Some of you have not fought in battles. Peace has been with us for many years. Many years we sat idle but many years we battled."
G["Some of you should stay behind to hold the landing zone."]="Some of you should stay behind to hold the landing zone."
G["Some of you veterans might remember this fella'. Sure, he's broken, but he means to break you! It's Akama!"]="É possível que algum dos veteranos se acuerden deste tipo. Sim, é um tábido, mas ao fim do combate também o será você! É Akama!"
G["Some of you veterans might remember this guy. He may be Broken, but today, he means to break you! It's Akama!"]="É possível que algum dos veteranos se acuerden deste tipo. Sim, é um tábido, mas ao fim do combate também o será você! É Akama!"
G["Some of you will need to stay behind to hold the beachhead."]="Some of you will need to stay behind to hold the beachhead."
G["Some of your kind chose to join the Alliance."]="Sei que algum dos seus se têm unido à Aliança."
G["Some people only want to watch the world burn. Others want to be the ones responsible for burning it..."]="Some people only want to watch the world burn. Others want to be the ones responsible for burning it..."
G["Some people say I'm corny, but I think I'm rather sage."]="Algumas pessoas dizem que sou brega, mas acho que sou bastante sábia."
G["Some pose that he blames us, his people, for the loss of his son, long ago during the War of the Shifting Sands."]="Alguns dizem que nos culpar a nós, seu povo, pela perda do seu filho há muito tempo na guerra do Mar de Dunas."
G["Some rangers seem to be unable to look after their beastly charges themselves. If you simply must stow such a thing somewhere in town, Anathos will take it off your hands. She waits and works in Falconwing Square, outside the inn."]="Alguns guardas florestais parecem incapazes de cuidar das suas próprias bestas. Se você simplesmente precisa guardar algo assim em algum lugar da cidade, o Anathos o tira das suas mãos. Ela espera e trabalha na Praça Falconwing, nos arredores da pousada."
G["Some saur-priests call me traitor. \"Kroshik does not hunt in the sea,\" they say.\n\nI follow the path of Kros, but I do not agree with these priests. Kroshik hunts WHEREVER HE CAN, and so do I.\n\nThese priests and their stubborn, closed-mind idea of Kroshik have no place in today's Skumblades."]="Some saur-priests call me traitor. \"Kroshik does not hunt in the sea,\" they say.\n\nI follow the path of Kros, but I do not agree with these priests. Kroshik hunts WHEREVER HE CAN, and so do I.\n\nThese priests and their stubborn, closed-mind idea of Kroshik have no place in today's Skumblades."
G["Some say that strength and bravery are most needed for an army's success.  And it's true!  But an army also needs supplies to keep itself in good shape, and it's my job to make sure they have what they need."]="Alguns dizem que força e bravura são mais necessárias para o sucesso de um exército. E é verdade! Mas um exército também precisa de suprimentos para se manter em boa forma, e é meu trabalho garantir que eles tenham o que precisam."
G["Some seek to take the land from us. The finned hunters squat upon the plains and devour the antlered ones themselves."]="Some seek to take the land from us. The finned hunters squat upon the plains and devour the antlered ones themselves."
G["Some seek to take the sea from us. The giant raiders have invaded our sacred place on the shore."]="Some seek to take the sea from us. The giant raiders have invaded our sacred place on the shore."
G["Some sort of rituals were performed at this altar. It looks like a kind of pagan initiation ritual that Velen once told me about. Bloody. Disgusting."]="Some sort of rituals were performed at this altar. It looks like a kind of pagan initiation ritual that Velen once told me about. Bloody. Disgusting."
G["Some supplies for the road?  Perhaps a refreshment to enjoy while you watch the fights?"]="Alguns suprimentos para a estrada? Talvez um refresco para desfrutar enquanto assiste às lutas?"
G["Some take their knives and lop away anything that displeases them, but this would kill the entire tree. That is not the Pandaren way."]="Some take their knives and lop away anything that displeases them, but this would kill the entire tree. That is not the Pandaren way."
G["Some terrible things have happened in the Vale of Eternal Blossoms, but the real tragedy is that it's no longer a good place for fishing. All that Jewel Danio! Gone!  \n \nFortunately for you, I've heard of an island off the eastern coast where you can still fish Jewel Danio. If the rumors are correct, you should be able to find a lake full of them there."]="Some terrible things have happened in the Vale of Eternal Blossoms, but the real tragedy is that it's no longer a good place for fishing. All that Jewel Danio! Gone!  \n \nFortunately for you, I've heard of an island off the eastern coast where you can still fish Jewel Danio. If the rumors are correct, you should be able to find a lake full of them there."
G["Some things Gorth has to do himself!"]="Some things Gorth has to do himself!"
G["Some things are better left alone!"]="É melhor deixar certas coisas tal como estão!"
G["Some tips: You can always tell what a customer wants by their outfit."]="Some tips: You can always tell what a customer wants by their outfit."
G["Some topics I can help you with are: | drivers | commands | lag | bots... zzzttt!"]="Alguns temas nos que te posso ajudar são: | controladores | ordens| tempo de desfase | robots... zzzzzzttt!"
G["Some were spared the anguish that memories provide."]="Alguns foram poupados da angústia que as memórias provocam."
G["Somebody call for an exterminator?"]="Alguém pediu um exterminador?"
G["Somebody help!"]="Que alguém me ajude!"
G["Somebody help!  Our young are in peril!"]="Ajuda! Os jovens estão em perigo!"
G["Somebody kill it!"]="Que alguém o mate!"
G["Somebody knock that thing off of $n's head!"]="Que alguém lhe quite isso da cabeça a $n!"
G["Somebody please! Get me out of here before they sacrifice me!"]="Socorro! Que alguém me saque de aqui antes de que me sacrifiquen!"
G["Somebody please... Help..."]="Alguém por favor... Ajuda..."
G["Somebody save me!"]="Que alguém me salve!"
G["Somebody save us!"]="Que alguém nos salve!"
G["Somebody set us up The Bomb!"]="Que alguém estiver a bomba!"
G["Somebody shut this little girl up!"]="Que alguém faça calhar a esta ninha!"
G["Somebody, DO SOMETHING! That's an order!"]="Que alguém FAÇA ALGO! É uma ordem!"
G["Somebody... anybody..."]="Alguém... Ninguém..."
G["Somebody... please... get... rock... off... me..."]="Somebody... please... get... rock... off... me..."
G["Someday I hope to improve on our ancient knowledge. Much of it has been lost through the ages."]="Someday I hope to improve on our ancient knowledge. Much of it has been lost through the ages."
G["Someday I'm going to fly on one of those."]="Someday I'm going to fly on one of those."
G["Someday the Klaxxi will elevate my rank. I will be allowed to consume amber."]="Someday the Klaxxi will elevate my rank. I will be allowed to consume amber."
G["Someday when you have seen more of the world, you should come back and speak to me. I can tell you all about the Serpent Riders."]="Alguns dia, quando tenha visto mais mundo, deveria voltar e falar comigo. Te posso contar tudo sobre os cavaleiros de dragões."
G["Someday, I want to be an explorer!"]="Alguns dia serei uma exploradora!"
G["Someday, I will tell my children about you, $n."]="Someday, I will tell my children about you, $n."
G["Someday, Ren is going to show me his family's village."]="Someday, Ren is going to show me his family's village."
G["Someday, perhaps you can tell me more about this strange land from where you came."]="Alguns dia talvez possa contar-me mais coisas sobre a estranha terra da que procedes."
G["Someday, perhaps you too can aspire to become a serpent rider."]="Someday, perhaps you too can aspire to become a serpent rider."
G["Someday, perhaps you will show me your home. It must be very different than ours."]="Talvez algum dia me ensenhes seu lar. Deve ser um lugar muito diferente ao nosso."
G["Someday, you may also be called upon to defend all that is dear to you."]="É possível que algum dia você também tenha que defenda tudo o que amas."
G["Somehow I doubt that you want training from me, $n. I'm not sure those fingers can handle a firebolt."]="Somehow I doubt that you want training from me, $n. I'm not sure those fingers can handle a firebolt."
G["Somehow the night elves found out we were going to launch the fleet and they struck! Most of the new ships were burned at anchor in the harbor!"]="Somehow the night elves found out we were going to launch the fleet and they struck! Most of the new ships were burned at anchor in the harbor!"
G["Somehow, you and Farmer Fung have become acquaintances."]="Somehow, you and Farmer Fung have become acquaintances."
G["Somehow, you and Farmer Fung have become best friends. He would probably love to help on Sunsong Ranch."]="Por alguma razão, o fazendeiro Fung é seu melhor amigo. Talvez possa pedirle que ajude no Rancho Cantosol."
G["Somehow, you and Farmer Fung have become buddies."]="Por alguma razão, o fazendeiro Fung é seu colega."
G["Somehow, you and Farmer Fung have become friends."]="Por alguma razão, o fazendeiro Fung é seu amigo."
G["Somehow, you and Farmer Fung have become good friends."]="Por alguma razão, o fazendeiro Fung é um bom amigo."
G["Somehow, you managed to elude all of my guards. You slipped in here like a ghost. That makes you... valuable to me. Let's talk."]="Somehow, you managed to elude all of my guards. You slipped in here like a ghost. That makes you... valuable to me. Let's talk."
G["Someone LIVES back here?"]="Em sério alguém vive aqui?"
G["Someone been burnin' my tiki!"]="Alguém lhe pega'o fogo a meu Tiki!"
G["Someone called for me...?"]="Alguém me chamou...?"
G["Someone called?"]="Me chamado alguém?"
G["Someone come read this wanted poster to Grek.  Grek can't read!"]="Que alguém lea este cartaz de Se procurando para Grek! Grek não sabe ler."
G["Someone else from beyond the portal! I hope you're ready for a fight, $c."]="Alguém mais do outro lado do portal! Espero que estiver $gpreparado: preparada; para lutar, $c."
G["Someone get me out of this cage!"]="Que alguém me saque desta jaula!"
G["Someone get me out of this cage!!!"]="Que alguém me saque desta jaula!!"
G["Someone get me outta here!"]="Que alguém me saque de aqui!"
G["Someone get me somebody stupid enough to move this thing into Stonetalon!"]="Que alguém me consiga a alguém suficiente estúpido como para levar esta coisa a Cordilheira das Torres de Pedra!"
G["Someone has come to save us? Perhaps all is not lost..."]="Someone has come to save us? Perhaps all is not lost..."
G["Someone has crashed into our island.  Removing this thorn may be more complicated than we thought."]="Someone has crashed into our island.  Removing this thorn may be more complicated than we thought."
G["Someone has to report this!"]="Alguém precisa informar de isto!"
G["Someone has to save the beer!"]="Alguém precisa superando a cerveja!"
G["Someone help me!"]="Que alguém me ajude!"
G["Someone is using these beakers and alchemy tools to perform experiments with various types of submarine fuel."]="Alguém está usando essas taças e ferramentas de alquimia para realizar experimentos com vários tipos de combustível submarino."
G["Someone lost their derk?"]="Alguém perdeu a dunga?"
G["Someone must stay behind and keep the Forsaken from gaining a foothold.  Farewell, Genn."]="Someone must stay behind and keep the Forsaken from gaining a foothold.  Farewell, Genn."
G["Someone needs ta lose some weight, mon."]="Sei de alguém O que precisa perder peso, colega."
G["Someone needs to do something about that giant turtle in the cave!"]="Alguém precisa fazer algo com essa tartaruga gigantesco na caverna!"
G["Someone save me!"]="Que alguém me salve!"
G["Someone shoot that bat down!"]="Que alguém derribe a esse morcego!"
G["Someone should finish these yaungol off. I've got better things to do than stand around here all day!"]="Alguém deveria acabar com esses yaungol. Eu tenho melhores coisas que fazer que estar aqui tudo o dia!"
G["Someone should make a candy with a chewy gnome center."]="Someone should make a candy with a chewy gnome center."
G["Someone should tell the king. A chat with Lo'gosh would set these cultists straight!"]="Alguém deveria informar ao rei. Uma charla com Lo'gosh enmendaría a esses cultistas!"
G["Someone tell those fools to stay back.  They're getting slaughtered when they go over there alone!"]="Someone tell those fools to stay back.  They're getting slaughtered when they go over there alone!"
G["Someone told me these crystals are blue in their natural state. I am so glad someone took the time to apply some proper aesthetics."]="Someone told me these crystals are blue in their natural state. I am so glad someone took the time to apply some proper aesthetics."
G["Someone took refuge here after the attack, but no sign of Beak."]="Someone took refuge here after the attack, but no sign of Beak."
G["Someone was saying I was \"overhealing\" the other day. I am so confused."]="Someone was saying I was \"overhealing\" the other day. I am so confused."
G["Someone! Help!"]="Alguém! Ajuda!"
G["Someone! Please help!"]="Socorro! Por favor!"
G["Someone's already made a challenge. The ring will be free when the fight is over."]="Someone's already made a challenge. The ring will be free when the fight is over."
G["Someone's been killing all the game out from under me. Hard-won number 48, here."]="Alguém tem estado matando a todas as presas por debaixo de mim. Me lado chegar ao número 48."
G["Someone's got to stop the Crown Chemical Co. I'd bet my gold-plated Nether-Rocket they're cooking up the next big plague on the chocolate-crazed citizenry's coin...\nIf only I could find someone to serve their apothecaries with court papers! Then we could put an end to it... and maybe seize all their assets, while we're at it!"]="Someone's got to stop the Crown Chemical Co. I'd bet my gold-plated Nether-Rocket they're cooking up the next big plague on the chocolate-crazed citizenry's coin...\nIf only I could find someone to serve their apothecaries with court papers! Then we could put an end to it... and maybe seize all their assets, while we're at it!"
G["Someone's here!"]="Há alguém aqui!"
G["Someone, or something, seems to have done in the Ambassador!"]="Alguém, ou algo assim, parece ter feito no embaixador!"
G["Somethin unnatural about 'dese creatures."]="Eh'tas criaturas têm algo antinatural."
G["Somethin' hit it, sir. Wasn't cut down, didn't fall on its own."]="Somethin' hit it, sir. Wasn't cut down, didn't fall on its own."
G["Somethin' pinched me! Get it, $p!"]="Somethin' pinched me! Get it, $p!"
G["Somethin' smell funny."]="Algo cheira mal."
G["Somethin's a little funny about this here water..."]="Há algo estranho nesta água de aqui..."
G["Something I can do for you, Boss?"]="Algo que posso fazer por você, chefe?"
G["Something I can help you with? Looking for a pet pig, perhaps?"]="Posso ajudar você em algo? Talvez atenção um porco ajudante?"
G["Something about sound of battle make this place more relaxing than main hill."]="Something about sound of battle make this place more relaxing than main hill."
G["Something about this land seems to be affecting our squad's morale."]="Algo nesta terra parece estar afectando à moral de nosso esquadrão."
G["Something about this village makes my fur stand on end."]="Something about this village makes my fur stand on end."
G["Something about watching people fight to the death really warms my heart!"]="Something about watching people fight to the death really warms my heart!"
G["Something about you seems... familiar."]="Algo em ti me resulta... familiar."
G["Something bad in that juju..."]="Algo ruim em esse juju..."
G["Something big make pillars and crystals and everything. Frenzyheart not care much cause it not here anymore."]="Algo grande fazer pilares e cristais e tudo. A coração Frenético não importar muito porque já não estar aqui."
G["Something big's brewing at the Withering to the east.\n\nWhatever it is, I hope that it'll be over soon and we get restationed somewhere nicer."]="Something big's brewing at the Withering to the east.\n\nWhatever it is, I hope that it'll be over soon and we get restationed somewhere nicer."
G["Something big's coming out from the hive, ma'am.  Headed straight for us."]="Algo grande se aproxima desde a colmeia, senhora. Se dirige direto a nós."
G["Something different!!!"]="Algo diferente!!!"
G["Something drives them. They are frightened."]="Something drives them. They are frightened."
G["Something emerges from the cauldron!"]="Algo emerge da caldeirão!"
G["Something feels... different up here. I don't know what, but I expect we shall find out soon enough."]="Something feels... different up here. I don't know what, but I expect we shall find out soon enough."
G["Something fishy here..."]="Aqui há gato encerrado..."
G["Something funny about carrot..."]="Something funny about carrot..."
G["Something happening?"]="Passa algo?"
G["Something has disturbed the waters. They are normally so well-behaved."]="Something has disturbed the waters. They are normally so well-behaved."
G["Something is happening with the mantid... and I suspect it has to do with that temple across the bridge."]="Algo passa com os mantídeos... e sostorso que precisa ver com o templo ao outro lado do rio."
G["Something is wrong with the Highlord. Do something!"]="Algo vai mal com o Alto Senhor. Faça algo!"
G["Something isn't right..."]="Algo não está bem..."
G["Something must be done about these Wretched..."]="Something must be done about these Wretched..."
G["Something needs to be done about the Blackwood tribe."]="É preciso fazer algo com a tribo Floresta Negro."
G["Something plagues this tower. I've fallen ill and the other Venture Co. employees that work near or in the tower have also become sick.\n\nJust last week, two of our patrollers died, only to instantly come back to life as mindless drones!\n\nThe lifeforce is draining from my body. I can feel myself losing control. Urges taking over... Bad urges... *Fizzule slaps himself in the face* Not yet... Listen... Mine is a position of power. This position privies me to some sensitive information."]="Something plagues this tower. I've fallen ill and the other Venture Co. employees that work near or in the tower have also become sick.\n\nJust last week, two of our patrollers died, only to instantly come back to life as mindless drones!\n\nThe lifeforce is draining from my body. I can feel myself losing control. Urges taking over... Bad urges... *Fizzule slaps himself in the face* Not yet... Listen... Mine is a position of power. This position privies me to some sensitive information."
G["Something plagues this tower. I've fallen ill and the other Venture Co. employees that work near or in the tower have also become sick. Just last week, two of our patrollers died, only to come back to life immediately as mindless drones! The lifeforce is draining from my body. I can feel myself losing control. Urges taking over... Bad urges... Not yet... Listen... Mine is a position of power. This position privies me to some sensitive information."]="Something plagues this tower. I've fallen ill and the other Venture Co. employees that work near or in the tower have also become sick. Just last week, two of our patrollers died, only to come back to life immediately as mindless drones! The lifeforce is draining from my body. I can feel myself losing control. Urges taking over... Bad urges... Not yet... Listen... Mine is a position of power. This position privies me to some sensitive information."
G["Something riled that horse. Let's go!"]="Something riled that horse. Let's go!"
G["Something smells funny."]="Algo cheira raro."
G["Something stinks, and for once it's not my socks."]="Algo cheira mal e, pela primeira vez, não são minhas meias."
G["Something stirs in the pool of mojo..."]="Something stirs in the pool of mojo..."
G["Something stirs near Southwind Village! It... it's one of those sandworm creatures! Look out!"]="Algo passa perto de Aldeia do Vento do Sul. Parece ser um dos esses vermes de arena. Olhe!"
G["Something straight up stinks in here! It's definitely not me. Gnomes smell like butter and sunshine. Not like those dwarves that smell like they were born from a trogg's armpit! None of you are dwarves, are you?"]="Something straight up stinks in here! It's definitely not me. Gnomes smell like butter and sunshine. Not like those dwarves that smell like they were born from a trogg's armpit! None of you are dwarves, are you?"
G["Something tells Ken-Ken that's not the last of the sads, though..."]="Algo diz a Ken-Ken ke essa não é o último tristón..."
G["Something tells me our friend has returned triumphant."]="Algo me diz que alguém voltou triunfante."
G["Something tells me this $n wants the mysterious fossil too. Help!"]="Something tells me this $n wants the mysterious fossil too. Help!"
G["Something that should have been done a long time ago, you filthy animal."]="Algo que deveria haver feito há muito tempo, animal repugnante."
G["Something unnatural is going on, Bwemba.  Can you help?"]="Está acontecendo algo que não é natural, Bwemba. Pode ajudar?"
G["Something very, very disturbing. We're starting to see more of them across the timeways."]="Algo muito, muito inquietante. Estamos começando a ver mais de estes pelos portais do tempo."
G["Something wrong?"]="Algo errado?"
G["Something you need, sir?"]="Algo que você precisa, senhor?"
G["Something's got those Dark Iron Dwarves riled up.  They show up almost every half-hour, break all the kegs, and leave!\n\nSo you're probably asking, \"Why should I care?\"\n\nI'll tell you...  Because the kegs they break stop us from giving out free brew!  You heard me right, free brew!\n\nSo if you are around when those dwarves show up, take a minute and help protect the kegs."]="Something's got those Dark Iron Dwarves riled up.  They show up almost every half-hour, break all the kegs, and leave!\n\nSo you're probably asking, \"Why should I care?\"\n\nI'll tell you...  Because the kegs they break stop us from giving out free brew!  You heard me right, free brew!\n\nSo if you are around when those dwarves show up, take a minute and help protect the kegs."
G["Something's wrong. The baby's turned the wrong way."]="Algo vai mal. O bebé vem em mal postura."
G["Something's wrong... I sense a dark presence."]="Algo vai mal... Sinto uma presença sombria."
G["Somethun' even BETTER. History! Artifacts from an ancient an' powerful race!"]="Algo muito MELHOR: história! Artefatos de uma raça antiga e poderosa!"
G["Sometimes I dream of this amazing city being complete.  Alas, all this work has turned my dreams into nightmares!"]="Sometimes I dream of this amazing city being complete.  Alas, all this work has turned my dreams into nightmares!"
G["Sometimes I get so tense, but I can't speed up the time..."]="Resil"
G["Sometimes I impress even myself. And down goes the dragon!"]="Sometimes I impress even myself. And down goes the dragon!"
G["Sometimes I stand here, looking into the forest beyond the lake, and I see the land as it once was... green and full of life."]="Às vezes eu fico aqui, olhando para a floresta além do lago, e vejo a terra como era antes... verde e cheia de vida."
G["Sometimes I surprise even myself!"]="Às vezes me surpreendo!"
G["Sometimes I think it was the very precariousness of our world that drove my father to madness."]="Às vezes penso que foi a própria precariedade do nosso mundo que enlouqueceu meu pai."
G["Sometimes Tonsa lets me ride on his back... but he's kinda stinky."]="Sometimes Tonsa lets me ride on his back... but he's kinda stinky."
G["Sometimes a distraction can backfire and cause the orcs to become suspicious. In those instances the orcs will actively search for us. It's best to keep a good distance from any orc detecting stealth."]="Sometimes a distraction can backfire and cause the orcs to become suspicious. In those instances the orcs will actively search for us. It's best to keep a good distance from any orc detecting stealth."
G["Sometimes a well timed precision strike is all you need to take down even the toughest of foes."]="A vezes um acerto preciso desferido no momentos adequado é o único que precisa para derrubar até ao inimigo mais resistente."
G["Sometimes big-tongues try to come get crystals. Not now because they not like it when we kill them."]="A vezes, línguas-grandes vir a pegar cristais. Agora não porque não gostar que lhes matemos."
G["Sometimes dey start eatin' before you dead."]="Sometimes dey start eatin' before you dead."
G["Sometimes even I wish that I didn't know. But then I realize it's for the best."]="Em ocasiões eu desearía não saber. Mas sei que é o melhor."
G["Sometimes even the finest make mistakes."]="Às vezes até os melhores erram."
G["Sometimes it feels like I'll never go back to being a simple functionary in service to Dame Auriferous. I'm not cut out for war.\n\nThankfully there are those like you who burn to see Quel'Thalas restored to its former beauty. Crush the Scourge, $c! Crush them wherever you can!"]="Sometimes it feels like I'll never go back to being a simple functionary in service to Dame Auriferous. I'm not cut out for war.\n\nThankfully there are those like you who burn to see Quel'Thalas restored to its former beauty. Crush the Scourge, $c! Crush them wherever you can!"
G["Sometimes it is good to take a step back and reflect upon our larger goals."]="A vezes conviene dar um passo por trás e reflexionar sobre os alvos mais importantes."
G["Sometimes it's nice to get away from the sanctum and get some fresh air."]="A vezes está bem sair do sacrário e pegar um pouco de ar fresco."
G["Sometimes the best defense is to prevent your opponent from acting against you."]="A vezes a melhor defesa é impedir que seu inimigo te ataque."
G["Sometimes the mist cannot find its way if we are too far. Let's venture further and try again."]="A vezes, a névoa não pode encontrar seu caminho se estamos demais longe. Aventurémonos um pouco mais e intentémoslo novamente."
