G["Soup's on, men! Eat up. We've got a long day ahead."]="Soup's on, men! Eat up. We've got a long day ahead."
G["South! Now!"]="Ao sul! Agora!"
G["Southern Bank"]="Southern Bank"
G["Southern Rocketway Terminus, please."]="À Terminal da Cohetepista do Sul, por favor."
G["Southsea Freebooters? This place is really going downhill."]="Southsea Freebooters? This place is really going downhill."
G["Southshore is such a peaceful town.... I'd like to live here someday."]="Costa é uma cidade muito pacífica... Gostaria viver em ela algum dia."
G["Southshore shall pay in blood!"]="Southshore shall pay in blood!"
G["Southshore stout, how do I love thee? Let me count the ways..."]="Southshore stout, how do I love thee? Let me count the ways..."
G["Spare a copper, $G sir:madam;?"]="Tem uma moeda de cobre, $gsenhor: senhora;?"
G["Spare a copper? You won't need it soon. The end of days nears..."]="Spare a copper? You won't need it soon. The end of days nears..."
G["Spare a silver, friend?"]="Tem um pouco de prata para mim, $gamigo: amiga;?"
G["Spare me, Muradin. You weren't there to see what Mal'Ganis did to my homeland."]="Spare me, Muradin. You weren't there to see what Mal'Ganis did to my homeland."
G["Spare my life!  I will tell you about Arelion's secret."]="Spare my life!  I will tell you about Arelion's secret."
G["Spare my life! I will leave this place forever! Please!"]="Spare my life! I will leave this place forever! Please!"
G["Spare my life, $n! Please!"]="Perdóname a vida, $n! Por favor!"
G["Spare no one!"]="Spare no one!"
G["Spare some change for a poor blind man? ...What do you mean I'm not blind? ...I'M NOT BLIND! I CAN SEE!! It's a miracle!"]="Spare some change for a poor blind man? ...What do you mean I'm not blind? ...I'M NOT BLIND! I CAN SEE!! It's a miracle!"
G["Spare some change for a starving artist?"]="Spare some change for a starving artist?"
G["Spare some change?"]="Algo suelto?"
G["Spare some copper?"]="Umas moneditas?"
G["Spare the cleaver, spoil the patient."]="A letra com cuchilha entrar."
G["Sparklight's vehicle emporium is open for business!"]="Sparklight's vehicle emporium is open for business!"
G["Sparkmaster Vu stares at you mutely. With a powerful swing of his halberd, he attacks!"]="O truenomante Vu te observa em silêncio. Então ataca com um poderoso acerto do seu alabarda!"
G["Sparktouched best fighters for sure! Zap zap. Get things good!"]="Sparktouched best fighters for sure! Zap zap. Get things good!"
G["Spawn Nefarian please!"]="Aparecem Nefarian, por favor!"
G["Spawn of the Old Gods materialize nearby!"]="A aparição dos deuses antigos se materializa perto!"
G["Speak for yourself, Thrall."]="Fale por você, Thrall."
G["Speak freely, friend."]="Speak freely, friend."
G["Speak not your vulgar language to me!  Only Hydraxis can stand it."]="Não fale sua língua vulgar para mim! Somente Hydraxis pode suportar isso."
G["Speak now, Eye of Twilight."]="Fala, Olho do Crepúsculo."
G["Speak quickly, $n. We haven't much time!"]="Fala rápido, $n. Não temos muito tempo!"
G["Speak quickly, mortal, before you are discovered by one less discriminating than I."]="Fala rápido, moral, antes de que te descubra alguém mais intransigente que eu."
G["Speak quickly; I don't have time to waste on idle chatter. The Forsaken have become a force to be reckoned with, but there is still much to do in a given day. This city doesn't run itself.\n\nWhat do you want?"]="Fala rápido. Não tenho tempo que perder em charlas. Os Renegados são já uma força considerável, mas ainda há demais coisas por fazer. Esta cidade não se gestiona sozinha.\n\nQue que?"
G["Speak quietly and with great care, the wrong word in these parts could get your throat cut. Now, what is it you need from me?"]="Fale em voz baixa e com muito cuidado, a palavra errada nessas partes pode cortar sua garganta. Agora, o que você precisa de mim?"
G["Speak slowly, child, I am new to your strange tongue."]="Fala devagar, criança, sou novo na sua língua estranha."
G["Speak to Elder Anli if you are interested in joining our ranks."]="Fala com a ancestral Anli se te interesse se juntar a nós."
G["Speak to Grezz Ragefist in the Hall of the Brave, which is in the Valley of Honor.  Put in a good word for me!"]="Fale com Grezz Ragefist no Salão dos Bravos, que fica no Vale da Honra. Coloque uma boa palavra para mim!"
G["Speak to Paymaster Lendry on the second floor of the barracks.\nHe can arrange to store your goods with Theramore's treasury."]="Speak to Paymaster Lendry on the second floor of the barracks.\nHe can arrange to store your goods with Theramore's treasury."
G["Speak to Pephredo at the Darkbriar Lodge in the Valley of Spirits, up above and to the west of the Valley of Strength."]="Fale com Pephredo na Loja Darkbriar no Vale dos Espíritos, acima e a oeste do Vale da Força."
G["Speak to me again when you are prepared to face your inner demons."]="Speak to me again when you are prepared to face your inner demons."
