G["Speak to me when you are ready to begin."]="Fala comigo quando queira começar."
G["Speak to me when you are ready to go, $n."]="Fala comigo quando queira partir, $n."
G["Speak to me when you are ready to launch the assault!"]="Fala comigo quando queira começar o ataque."
G["Speak to me when you are ready to race, $n."]="Fala comigo quando estiver $gpronto: pronta; para competir, $n."
G["Speak to me when you are ready to try again."]="Fala comigo quando queira voltar a tentar."
G["Speak to the commander at your post, $g lad:lass;, and persuade him to abandon Vor'takh's foolish plan."]="$GMuchacho: Moça;, fala com o comandante do seu posto, e convéncelo para que abandone o estúpido plano de Vor'takh."
G["Speak to the gnome foreman, Rosey Axlerod, who will use the Soggy Journal to permanently grant a significant increase to the gnome rate of progress! \n\n|TInterface\\Icons\\INV_MISC_BOOK_11.blp:64|t"]="Fala com a supervisora gnômica, Rosey Barraeje, quem utilizará o diário encharcado para aumentar de forma considerável e permanente o firme de progresso gnômico. \n\n|TInterface\\Icons\\INV_MISC_BOOK_11.blp:64|t"
G["Speak to the jinyu foreman, Elder Adler, who will use the Adorned Sceptre to permanently grant a significant increase to the jinyu rate of progress! \n\n|TInterface\\Icons\\INV_STAFF_2H_PANDARIATRADESKILL_C_05.blp:64|t"]="Fala com o supervisor jinyu, o ancestral Adler, quem utilizará o cetro adornado para aumentar de forma considerável e permanente o firme de progresso jinyu. \n\n|TInterface\\Icons\\INV_STAFF_2H_PANDARIATRADESKILL_C_05.blp:64|t"
G["Speak with Alchemist Finklestein, $c. He can set you on the path.\n\nDemonstrate your loyalty and their methods shall be made known to you."]="Fala com o Alquimista Finklestein, $c. Pode guiar pelo bom caminho.\n\nDemonstra seu lealdade e te revelará seus métodos."
G["Speak with Hydraxis."]="Fale com Hydraxis."
