G["Speak with Wing Commander Brack, $n.  He'll outfit you with one of our armored wyvern destroyers.  And, good luck!"]="Speak with Wing Commander Brack, $n.  He'll outfit you with one of our armored wyvern destroyers.  And, good luck!"
