G["Spirits of Water, I give you praise, and I beg of you a favor. You have heard $n's pleas, and I trust $ghis:her; intent is noble. Please, will you aid us?"]="Spirits of Water, I give you praise, and I beg of you a favor. You have heard $n's pleas, and I trust $ghis:her; intent is noble. Please, will you aid us?"
G["Spirits of air!  Come to my aid!"]="Espíritos do ar! Venham na minha ajuda!"
G["Spirits of da wind be your doom!"]="Spirits of da wind be your doom!"
