G["Stay away from the sea. Too clean.\n\nThe saur-priests can tell you: Filthiness is next to godliness."]="Stay away from the sea. Too clean.\n\nThe saur-priests can tell you: Filthiness is next to godliness."
G["Stay away from the temple doors, you're playing into their hands."]="Stay away from the temple doors, you're playing into their hands."
