G["Stay strong, friend. You know as well as I do - there'll be no help for us within the Firelands."]="Stay strong, friend. You know as well as I do - there'll be no help for us within the Firelands."
G["Stay true to yourself always, and your resolve will be that of a mighty glacier."]="Stay true to yourself always, and your resolve will be that of a mighty glacier."
G["Stay vigilant, hero. The return of the Thunder King is both a threat... and an opportunity!"]="Fique de olhos abertos. O retorno do Rei Trovão é ao mesmo tempo uma ameaça... e uma oportunidade!"
G["Stay vigilant, hero. This place has been sealed for centuries. Who knows what we will encounter within."]="Stay vigilant, hero. This place has been sealed for centuries. Who knows what we will encounter within."
G["Stay with me, $n."]="Stay with me, $n."
G["Stay with me, friend. I must know what happened here."]="Fique comigo, amigo. Eu devo saber o que aconteceu aqui."
G["Stay with me. You're going to make it out of here."]="Fique comigo. Ganhará sair de aqui."
G["Stay with us mortal... live eternal."]="Junte-se a nós... para sempre."
G["Stay within the runes without getting hit by fire until you have 10 stacks of Fire Dancing to complete the trial."]="Stay within the runes without getting hit by fire until you have 10 stacks of Fire Dancing to complete the trial."
G["Stay your arms! I yield!"]="Stay your arms! I yield!"
G["Stay your blade, Chieftain. He may yet have value to us."]="Stay your blade, Chieftain. He may yet have value to us."
G["Stay your blades, heroes. This dragon's scales glow red with flame."]="Stay your blades, heroes. This dragon's scales glow red with flame."
G["Stay your hand and step aside. Very well."]="Não insistas, ríndete. Muito bem."
G["Stay your hand! Not here - not now!"]="Stay your hand! Not here - not now!"
G["Stay your sword and loosen your cap.  Before we do battle with our blades, I first have prepared an assault to unleash upon your ears.\n\nAre you prepared?"]="Stay your sword and loosen your cap.  Before we do battle with our blades, I first have prepared an assault to unleash upon your ears.\n\nAre you prepared?"
G["Stay, pup."]="Quieto, filhote."
G["Stay."]="Stay."
