G["Steel your minds and guard your thoughts. The dark wings will cloud and consume the minds of the weak, a flock of thralls whose feet may never leave the ground."]="Steel your minds and guard your thoughts. The dark wings will cloud and consume the minds of the weak, a flock of thralls whose feet may never leave the ground."
G["Steel yourselves! More of them approach!"]="Preparem-se! Vêm mais!"
G["Steel yourselves! Summoning a being this powerful is seldom done with positive results."]="Steel yourselves! Summoning a being this powerful is seldom done with positive results."
G["Steel yourselves, heroes, for the twin terrors, Acidmaw and Dreadscale, enter the arena!"]="Steel yourselves, heroes, for the twin terrors, Acidmaw and Dreadscale, enter the arena!"
G["Steel yourselves, men! We're bein' boarded!"]="Preparem-se, pessoal! Vêm ao abordagem!"
