G["Still you fight. Still you cling to misguided principles. If you survive, you'll find me in the center ring."]="Still you fight. Still you cling to misguided principles. If you survive, you'll find me in the center ring."
G["Still, I be hopin' Thrall will return to us one day. Tha future right now be lookin' very grim... and very bloody."]="Still, I be hopin' Thrall will return to us one day. Tha future right now be lookin' very grim... and very bloody."
G["Still, I can hear the cry of a distant heart, echoing through the labyrinths between worlds. It's the cry of a lover's heart, I hear... and Great Therazane has not forgotten what it was to love..."]="Still, I can hear the cry of a distant heart, echoing through the labyrinths between worlds. It's the cry of a lover's heart, I hear... and Great Therazane has not forgotten what it was to love..."
G["Still, I can't help but get an uneasy feelin' that the Horde ain't goin' to take that quietly."]="Still, I can't help but get an uneasy feelin' that the Horde ain't goin' to take that quietly."
G["Still, I fear I was lettin' my temper drive me ta bein' rash. Thrall devoted himself to makin' the Horde what it is, so I've no eagerness to be leavin' it on a whim.  Dis will be needin' much more thought."]="Still, I fear I was lettin' my temper drive me ta bein' rash. Thrall devoted himself to makin' the Horde what it is, so I've no eagerness to be leavin' it on a whim.  Dis will be needin' much more thought."
G["Still, King Rastakhan did nothing."]="Ainda assim, o Rei Rastakhan não se moveu."
G["Still, in time, I will... fall to madness. And you, heroes... will vanquish me. The cycle will repeat. So it goes."]="Still, in time, I will... fall to madness. And you, heroes... will vanquish me. The cycle will repeat. So it goes."
G["Still, looks are deceiving for the likes of you. Don't worry, I'll make something that favors your style of fighting."]="Mas as aparência podem enganar com os do seu classe. Não te preocupe, farei algo que se adapte ao seu estilo de luta."
G["Still, the Blood Knights will endure through this loss. We have no other choice... we must find another source."]="Still, the Blood Knights will endure through this loss. We have no other choice... we must find another source."
G["Still, the elements clearly speak to you, and when I'm done, you'll have a fine weapon to help you harness their power."]="Mas salta à visão que os elementos te falam, e quando termine terá uma boa arma que te ajudará a controlar seu poder."
G["Still... there is balance in all things, even death. I simply hate the concept that such destruction and darkness might be necessary."]="Mas ainda... há equilíbrio em todas as coisas, inclusive na morte. É somente que ódio o concepto de que tanta destruição e escuridão sejam necessárias."
