G["Stolen supplies?  Well, let me think about it...\n\nI know a certain priest named Daria who took all the extra wine after last week's service, but didn't throw it out as I asked.  I believe she'll be apologizing soon, though.\n\n<Alphus winks at you.>\n\nI've also heard an abnormal number of confessions this week from one of the mages... what was his name?  Crisp?  Lisp?  Something along those lines.\n\nNow, be on your way."]="Stolen supplies?  Well, let me think about it...\n\nI know a certain priest named Daria who took all the extra wine after last week's service, but didn't throw it out as I asked.  I believe she'll be apologizing soon, though.\n\n<Alphus winks at you.>\n\nI've also heard an abnormal number of confessions this week from one of the mages... what was his name?  Crisp?  Lisp?  Something along those lines.\n\nNow, be on your way."
