G["Stop!  Foolish $c, we cannot let you summon the creature Myzrael!"]="Stop!  Foolish $c, we cannot let you summon the creature Myzrael!"
G["Stop!  Infidels!"]="Basta! Infieles!"
G["Stop!  Please..."]="Para! Por favor..."
G["Stop!  Put that knife away.  You don't have to do... whatever they sent you to do.  You're not like them yet!"]="Detente! Guarda esse cuchilho. Não precisa fazer... o que te tenham mandado a fazer. Ainda não é como eles!"
G["Stop!  Stop attacking!"]="Alto! Deixem de atacar!"
G["Stop!  You will NOT turn my friends into stupid statues!"]="Stop!  You will NOT turn my friends into stupid statues!"
G["Stop! Back to your corners! Well fought, both of you."]="Stop! Back to your corners! Well fought, both of you."
G["Stop! Do not go any further, mortal. You are ill-prepared to face the forces of the Infinite Dragonflight. Come, let me help you."]="Pare! Não vá mais longe, mortal. Você está mal pronto para enfrentar as forças da Infinita Dragonflight. Venha, deixe-me ajudá-o."
G["Stop! I beg you, please stop. Please...."]="Stop! I beg you, please stop. Please...."
G["Stop! I could be convinced to join you!"]="Stop! I could be convinced to join you!"
G["Stop! Omosh time!"]="Alto! É a hora de Omosh!"
G["Stop! Stop partying! This not the real Monkey King! Monkey King die long long long long long long long time ago!"]="Stop! Stop partying! This not the real Monkey King! Monkey King die long long long long long long long time ago!"
G["Stop! Turn back and speak to Sinan at the bottom of the stairs. You should not face the Warlord's wrath alone!"]="Stop! Turn back and speak to Sinan at the bottom of the stairs. You should not face the Warlord's wrath alone!"
G["Stop! You have bested my wind serpent."]="Basta! Tem superado a meu serpente alada."
G["Stop! You maggots call that fighting? That is pathetic! Now put your hearts in it, you don't need them anymore anyway!"]="Stop! You maggots call that fighting? That is pathetic! Now put your hearts in it, you don't need them anymore anyway!"
G["Stop! You must stop!"]="Para! Detente de uma vez!"
G["Stop! You'll pull her head off!"]="Basta! Lhe vai arrancar a cabeça!"
G["Stop!! Stop!!! Scrap metal moves itself now?"]="Para!! Para!! A sucata agora se move sozinha?"
G["Stop, Garrosh! You do not know what that bell is capable of!"]="Detente, Garrosh! Não sabe que pode fazer a Sino!"
G["Stop, my brothers! Do you not see the beast of burden before you?"]="Deteneos, irmãos! Acaso não veis ante vocês à fera de carga?"
G["Stop, thief!"]="Ao ladrão!"
G["Stop.  Let me finish him."]="Aguarda. Deixe-me acabar com ele."
G["Stop. Let them pass."]="Para. De que pasen."
G["Stop... need to catch.... my breath."]="Alto... tenho que recuperar... a respiração."
G["Store an item."]="Armazenar um item."
G["Storm Peaks"]="Picos de tempestade"
G["Storm crow, go!"]="Corvo de tempestade, vê!"
G["Storm the shores! Steal their brew!"]="Storm the shores! Steal their brew!"
G["Storm!"]="A tempestade!"
G["Stormbeak."]="Picotormenta."
G["Stormcaller."]="Clamatormentas."
G["Stormforged dwarves pour out of the broken corpse!"]="Stormforged dwarves pour out of the broken corpse!"
G["Stormhoof ambushed the North Wind in the heart of its domain, and nearly succeeded in his plot. But the North Wind survived Stormhoof's treachery and executed the taunka as punishment for his invasion."]="Stormhoof ambushed the North Wind in the heart of its domain, and nearly succeeded in his plot. But the North Wind survived Stormhoof's treachery and executed the taunka as punishment for his invasion."
G["Stormhoof and his kin will be erased from history and these lands will be restored to their rightful owner!"]="Stormhoof and his kin will be erased from history and these lands will be restored to their rightful owner!"
G["Stormlash, vanquish these foes."]="Açoite Trovejante, derrote esses inimigos!"
G["Stormpike filth! In my keep?! Slay them all!"]="Stormpike filth! In my keep?! Slay them all!"
G["Stormpike soldiers, aid and protect us! The Forest Lord has granted us his protection. The gateway must now be opened!"]="Stormpike soldiers, aid and protect us! The Forest Lord has granted us his protection. The gateway must now be opened!"
G["Stormpike weaklings, face me in my fortress - if you dare!"]="Stormpike weaklings, face me in my fortress - if you dare!"
G["Storms may rise, but we stand tall..."]="Storms may rise, but we stand tall..."
G["Storms of the sky, obey the call of the Twilight's Hammer!"]="Storms of the sky, obey the call of the Twilight's Hammer!"
G["Storms! I summon you to my side!"]="Tempestades! Os convoco a meu lado!"
G["Stormstout!"]="pelos Cerveja de Trovão!"
G["Stormstout. Pandaren for \"beer.\""]="Cerveja de Trovão. É como se diz \"cerveja\" em pandaren."
G["Stormstout. Probably the best brew in Azeroth."]="Cerveja de Trovão: os brebagens mais refinados de tudo Azeroth."
G["Stormstout: Delicious and light!"]="Cerveja de Trovão: um mistura delicioso e leve!"
G["Stormstout: It's all about the brew."]="Cerveja de Trovão: os melhores brebagens."
G["Stormstout: The emperor of brews!"]="Stormstout: The emperor of brews!"
