G["Stormwind Champion's Pennant"]="Galhardete do Campeão de Ventobravo"
G["Stormwind Counting House is located by the front gates in the Trade District of Stormwind. And when you get tired of counting your money, be sure to stop by the Gilded Rose for a drink."]="A Stormwind Counting House está localizada nos portões da linha de frente do distrito comercial de Stormwind. E quando você se cansar de contar seu dinheiro, não deixe de dar uma passada no Gilded Rose para pegar uma bebida."
G["Stormwind Counting House is located by the front gates in the trade district of Stormwind. And when you get tired of counting your money, be sure to stop by the Gilded Rose for a drink."]="Stormwind Counting House is located by the front gates in the trade district of Stormwind. And when you get tired of counting your money, be sure to stop by the Gilded Rose for a drink."
G["Stormwind Harbor"]="Porto de Ventobravo"
G["Stormwind Harbor is the fastest way to get to Auberdine or Valiance Keep.  You can find it between the Cathedral District and the Park."]="Stormwind Harbour é a maneira mais rápida de chegar a Auberdine ou Valiance Keep. Você pode encontrá-o entre o distrito da catedral e o parque."
G["Stormwind Keep"]="Castelo de Ventobravo"
G["Stormwind Stockade"]="Cárcere de Ventobravo"
G["Stormwind and the Alliance cannot allow them to succeed, but our options are limited. Most of the fleet is being refitted."]="Stormwind and the Alliance cannot allow them to succeed, but our options are limited. Most of the fleet is being refitted."
G["Stormwind has many points of interest, from the Deeprun Tram to Stormwind Keep.\n\nWhat were you looking for?"]="Stormwind has many points of interest, from the Deeprun Tram to Stormwind Keep.\n\nWhat were you looking for?"
G["Stormwind is still beset -- a necropolis looms at its walls and random Scourge outbreaks have been reported."]="Ventobravo continua sob cerco: uma necrópole sobrevuela seus muros e há informes de ataque aleatórios do Flagelo."
G["Stormwind is the pillar of the human race, maintained through strength of will and the edge of a sturdy blade."]="Ventobravo é o pilar da raça humana, mantido através da força de vontade e da ponta de uma lâmina robusta."
G["Stormwind shall never fall!"]="Ventobravo nunca cairá!"
G["Stormwind still stands, and we won't be losing anything to the Horde!"]="Ventobravo ainda continua em pé e não vamos permitir que a Horda nos arrebate nada!"
G["Stormwind's Royal Bank is in the northernmost corner of the Dwarven District, just inside the Northern Landing."]="O Royal Bank de Stormwind fica no canto mais ao norte do distrito de Dwarven, logo no interior de Northern Landing."
G["Stormwind's desertion shall not be forgiven by the people of Westfall."]="O abandono de Ventobravo não será esquecido pelos habitantes dos Cerro Oeste."
G["Stormwind's resident engineer trainer is an ingenious gnome by the name of Lilliam Sparkspindle. He can be found in the back of the Dwarven District."]="O treinador de engenheiro residente de Stormwind é um gnomo engenhoso chamado Lilliam Sparkspindle. Ele pode ser encontrado na parte de por trás do distrito de Dwarven."
G["Stormwind's two most popular inns are located in the Trade and Dwarven Districts: The Gilded Rose and The Golden Keg."]="As duas pousadas mais populares de Stormwind estão localizadas nos distritos de Comércio e Anões: The Gilded Rose e The Golden Keg."
G["Stormy seas out there.  The sea spirits must be restless....hic!"]="A mar está tempestuosa. Os espíritos da mar devem de estar inquietos..., hip!"
G["Straight and true, that's the way."]="Recto e firme. Assim se há."
G["Straight from the lush forests of Elwynn, get your fresh fruit right here."]="Diretamente desdos florestas frondosos de Elwynn, à rica fruta..."
G["Straight out of Thor Modan and made of 100 percent authentic... metal... here is Rustblood, the lightning-powered iron golem!"]="Straight out of Thor Modan and made of 100 percent authentic... metal... here is Rustblood, the lightning-powered iron golem!"
G["Straight to the heart!"]="Logo ao coração!"
G["Straighten up!  I will not have soldiers in my unit looking so undisciplined before Val'zareq."]="Straighten up!  I will not have soldiers in my unit looking so undisciplined before Val'zareq."
G["Straining my eyes, I could just barely read her lips, as she said:"]="Straining my eyes, I could just barely read her lips, as she said:"
G["Straining my eyes, I could just barely read his lips, as he said:"]="Straining my eyes, I could just barely read his lips, as he said:"
G["Stranded on this island you will find the most dangerous creatures in all of Pandaria. Explore if you must, Prince Anduin. But be cautious."]="Stranded on this island you will find the most dangerous creatures in all of Pandaria. Explore if you must, Prince Anduin. But be cautious."
G["Strange activity has been reported at Frostmourne Cave. Scout it out!"]="Temos recebido informes de atividade inusual na Caverna Agonia de Gelo. Vê a investigação!"
G["Strange getup, even for a $r $c if you ask me."]="Fique forma de vestir... até para $gun: uma; $r $c."
G["Strange ghosts walk the land. Be careful!"]="Strange ghosts walk the land. Be careful!"
G["Strange that the naga would go out of their way to keep us alive.\n\nThey create prisons from mystical pearls - cells that allowed us to breathe, but little else..\n\nThey ship the prisoners off... somewhere.\n\nNever see them again...."]="Strange that the naga would go out of their way to keep us alive.\n\nThey create prisons from mystical pearls - cells that allowed us to breathe, but little else..\n\nThey ship the prisoners off... somewhere.\n\nNever see them again...."
G["Strange wizard?"]="Assistente estranho?"
G["Strange, I did not think there were any of those left in the shadow realm. Beware disciples, this one is a bit dangerous."]="Strange, I did not think there were any of those left in the shadow realm. Beware disciples, this one is a bit dangerous."
G["Strange, I don't remember any mention of those orbital emplacements last time. I wonder what dolt activated them."]="Strange, I don't remember any mention of those orbital emplacements last time. I wonder what dolt activated them."
G["Strange, the records on this one are incomplete.  It just says \"I killed it!\" in a rough scrawl, written in blood."]="Estranho, as anotações neste estão incompletas. Somente diz \"O maté!\" com uns rabiscos escritos com sangue."
G["Strange.  Very strange..."]="É estranho. Muito estranho..."
G["Strange... Just yesterday, I was dispatched to Ashenvale."]="Strange... Just yesterday, I was dispatched to Ashenvale."
G["Strange... never thought the naga would go out of their way to keep us alive.\n\nThey create these pearly bubbles... one per man... made it so we could breathe.\n\nEvery day they send a bunch of the prisoners off... somewhere.\n\nNever see them again...."]="Strange... never thought the naga would go out of their way to keep us alive.\n\nThey create these pearly bubbles... one per man... made it so we could breathe.\n\nEvery day they send a bunch of the prisoners off... somewhere.\n\nNever see them again...."
G["Strange... these mosaics don't resemble any known troll traditions."]="Strange... these mosaics don't resemble any known troll traditions."
G["Strange... this one carries a few pieces of polished stone."]="Strange... this one carries a few pieces of polished stone."
G["Stranger - your own doubts have been made manifest. Pandaria is not like whatever land you come from; it lives and breathes. You should be careful what kind of energy you bring here."]="Forasteiro, suas próprias dúvidas se manifestaram fisicamente. Pandária não é como a terra de onde você veio; ela vive e respira. Tenha cuidado com o tipo de energia que você traz para cá."
G["Stranger! A moment of your time if you please?"]="Stranger! A moment of your time if you please?"
G["Stranger, find the fallen Prince Menethil and end his reign of terror."]="Stranger, find the fallen Prince Menethil and end his reign of terror."
G["Stranger, have you ever seen a stone fall into a calm lake? Every action creates a ripple, even accepting a pledge of friendship. I shall think upon your request."]="Stranger, have you ever seen a stone fall into a calm lake? Every action creates a ripple, even accepting a pledge of friendship. I shall think upon your request."
G["Stranger, make haste and contact Lady Jaina Proudmoore. Her small Alliance force is bravely attempting to blunt the Burning Legion's initial assault and delay the approach of Archimonde."]="Stranger, make haste and contact Lady Jaina Proudmoore. Her small Alliance force is bravely attempting to blunt the Burning Legion's initial assault and delay the approach of Archimonde."
G["Stranglethorn belongs to da Gurubashi. You best be leavin' before we bury you here."]="Stranglethorn belongs to da Gurubashi. You best be leavin' before we bury you here."
G["Stranglethorn, $g man: babe;.  That's where it's AT!"]="Em Espinhaço, $gtío: nena;. Ali é onde está!"
G["Strategy, Dark Lady. We should repurpose the shore defenses."]="Estrategia, Dama Sombria. Capturaremos as defesas da costa."
G["Stratholme is no more! The city lies in ruins. The Prince consumed by hatred... madness..."]="Stratholme sumiu! A cidade está em ruínas. O Príncipe, consumido pelo ódio... a loucura..."
G["Stratholme may take quite some time to be rebuilt and fully cleansed, but it is an effort I will take great pleasure in watching unfold. Perhaps one day we will see the next great defender of the Light armed in the Bastion of the Silver Hand, or ordained in Alonsus Chapel. No matter the outcome, our work here will bear great fruit one day."]="Stratholme may take quite some time to be rebuilt and fully cleansed, but it is an effort I will take great pleasure in watching unfold. Perhaps one day we will see the next great defender of the Light armed in the Bastion of the Silver Hand, or ordained in Alonsus Chapel. No matter the outcome, our work here will bear great fruit one day."
G["Strawberries! Oh wait, they're not in season."]="Fresas! Oh, espera, não estamos em temporada."
G["Stray arcane forces can do strange things to the land, the elements and even the spirits of the dead."]="Forças misteriosas perdidas podem fazer coisas estranhas à terra, aos elementos e até aos espíritos dos mortos."
G["Strength always to the Skumblade!"]="Força sempre para os Hojaescoria!"
G["Strength always to the Skumblade. Death and dismemberment to our enemies."]="A força sempre para os Hojaescoria. Morte e desmembramento para nossos inimigos."
G["Strength and Honor, General. We come to speak with Garrosh. There may yet be hope for peace."]="Força e honra, General. Viemos falar com Garrosh. Ainda pode haver esperança para a paz."
G["Strength and endurance; patience and wisdom--remember these things always, $n."]="Força e resistência, paciência e sabedoria: recuérdalo sempre, $n."
G["Strength and honor, $c. We need eager soldiers like you in Alterac Valley; the territory of the Frostwolves must be defended! Will you return to Azeroth and lend your aid?"]="Força e honra, $c. Precisamos soldados com ganha de aprender como você no Vale Alterac; o território dos Lobo Gelo deve ser defendido! Volverás a Azeroth para oferecer sua ajuda?"
G["Strength comes in many forms. For some it is a weapon. For others a burden. For myself, I see it as a way of being."]="Strength comes in many forms. For some it is a weapon. For others a burden. For myself, I see it as a way of being."
G["Strength of the Earth, hear my call! Shield them in this dark hour, the last defenders of Azeroth!"]="Força da terra, atiende meu chamada! Proteger aos últimos defensores de Azeroth nesta hora sombria!"
G["Strength of the body is the power and swiftness of action.  You must keep yourself fit at all times, both physically and mentally.  The bear's girth highlights its strength, as it is a ferocious foe in combat.  The bear's girth, however, belies its lithe agility and sharp mind.  These are surprises you will use to your advantage.\n\nYou must rely on the strength of the bear's body in order to master the way of the Claw."]="Strength of the body is the power and swiftness of action.  You must keep yourself fit at all times, both physically and mentally.  The bear's girth highlights its strength, as it is a ferocious foe in combat.  The bear's girth, however, belies its lithe agility and sharp mind.  These are surprises you will use to your advantage.\n\nYou must rely on the strength of the bear's body in order to master the way of the Claw."
G["Strength of the heart is what gives you the resolve to take action... action that is rooted in intents that are pure and forthright.  To keep the balance is not to be complacent or banal.\n\nYou must show resolve for that which you believe in, and you must be willing to fight for it.  The mother bear shows endless conviction in protecting her young, as does an elder bear protecting his den.  It is this resolve, this strength of heart, which you must come to know if you are to master the way of the Claw."]="Strength of the heart is what gives you the resolve to take action... action that is rooted in intents that are pure and forthright.  To keep the balance is not to be complacent or banal.\n\nYou must show resolve for that which you believe in, and you must be willing to fight for it.  The mother bear shows endless conviction in protecting her young, as does an elder bear protecting his den.  It is this resolve, this strength of heart, which you must come to know if you are to master the way of the Claw."
G["Strength to the Clans, $c!  What brings you here?"]="Strength to the Clans, $c!  What brings you here?"
G["Strength to the Skumblade!"]="Força para os Hojaescoria!"
G["Strength used in the service of others is twice as powerful as strength spent on our foes."]="A força que se usa ao serviço dos mais é o doble de poderosa que a que se usa contra os inimigos."
G["Strength!"]="Força:"
G["Strength!  My new brothers and sisters!  Beat back these devils for the sake of your world.  Hold here, and your friends and allies will come and weigh their swords with you!"]="Strength!  My new brothers and sisters!  Beat back these devils for the sake of your world.  Hold here, and your friends and allies will come and weigh their swords with you!"
G["Strength!  That is the lifeblood of the Bramblestaff family.  My lineage lives today as a testament of physical greatness willing to take on any challenger."]="Strength!  That is the lifeblood of the Bramblestaff family.  My lineage lives today as a testament of physical greatness willing to take on any challenger."
G["Strength."]="Força:"
G["Strength. It is far more than simple physical prowess. When you are truly tested, will you be able to tell the difference between strength and power?"]="Strength. It is far more than simple physical prowess. When you are truly tested, will you be able to tell the difference between strength and power?"
G["Strike at the enemy - I shall be your shield."]="Ataca ao inimigo; eu serei seu escudo."
G["Strike at these barbarians with the full force of my rage!"]="Ataca com toda a força de meu cólera!"
G["Strike it down!"]="Derríbalo!"
G["Strike me down. I shall be reborn... Even more powerful..."]="Strike me down. I shall be reborn... Even more powerful..."
G["Strike now heroes, while he is weakened! Vanquish the Deceiver!"]="Strike now heroes, while he is weakened! Vanquish the Deceiver!"
G["Strike now!"]="Ataquem agora!"
G["Strike now!  Strike Ahune's frozen core while he is weakened!"]="Ataquem agora! Ataquem o núcleo congelado de Ahune enquanto está enfraquecido!"
G["Strike now! Obliterate them!"]="Strike now! Obliterate them!"
G["Strike quickly, Manchu. Show them no mercy!"]="Golpeia rápido, Manchu. Não tenha piedade!"
G["Strike swiftly an' fade away. You'll know ya beginin' ta master ya skills when people know ya deeds, but never heard of you."]="Ataque rapidamente e desapareça. Você saberá que está começando a dominar suas habilidades quando as pessoas os conhecem, mas nunca ouviram falar de você."
G["Strike the crystals when you are ready and we shall face the Broodmother together."]="Ataca aos cristais quando possa e nos enfrentaremos à Mãe de Linagem juntos."
G["Strike the stack of bamboo when the meter is full!"]="Strike the stack of bamboo when the meter is full!"
G["Strike the stack of stone when the meter is full!"]="Golpeiao monte de pedras quando o medidor estiver cheio!"
G["Strike the stack of wood when the meter is full!"]="Golpeiao monte de madeira quando o medidor estiver cheio!"
G["Strike them down in the name of the Scourge!"]="Derríbalos no nome do Flagelo!"
G["Strike them down, and I become more powerful than you can ever imagine."]="Derrote-os e me voltarei mais poderoso do que possa imaginar."
G["Strike true, brothers and sisters!  Today our quarry is demons!"]="Sorte, irmãos e irmãs! Hoje, nossa presa são os demônios!"
G["Strike true, friends!"]="Ataquem com força, amigos!"
G["Strike!"]="Ataquem!"
G["Striker Ga'dok prepares to make a strafing run!"]="Atirador Ga'dok se prepara para um bombardeio!"
G["String-less kites!"]="Cometas sem fio!"
G["Strip the flesh, harvest the organs!"]="Strip the flesh, harvest the organs!"
G["Striped melons are quite juishy this time of year! Put some sheeds in the ground, and you will reap the harvest on the morrow."]="Striped melons are quite juishy this time of year! Put some sheeds in the ground, and you will reap the harvest on the morrow."
G["Stripping energy from our foes, both fighting and fallen, allows us to persevere where lesser beings fall exhausted."]="Stripping energy from our foes, both fighting and fallen, allows us to persevere where lesser beings fall exhausted."
G["Strive to keep the balance in all things, $c.  This is where true harmony lies."]="Strive to keep the balance in all things, $c.  This is where true harmony lies."
G["Strong enough for THE BOARPOCALYPSE?"]="O bastante forte para o JABATOCALIPSIS?"
G["Strong of body and spirit.  There can be no stronger combination!  Find your destiny with Sark Ragetotem in the Hunter's Hall."]="Forte de corpo e espírito. Não pode haver combinação mais forte! Encontre o seu destino com Sark Ragetotem no Hunter's Hall."
G["Struggle as much as you like..."]="Struggle as much as you like..."
G["Struggling only makes it worse."]="Se te resiste será pior."
G["Stubborn and old. What chance do you have? I am stronger, and more powerful than you ever were."]="Velho e testarudo. Que possibilidades tem? Sou mais forte e mais poderoso do que você nunca será."
G["Stubborn weeds! They're a constant nuisance, creeping up in the soil and threatening to take over your land.\n\nBefore you can till that plot, you need to rip the weed out. There's no trick to it, really - just grab it and pull!\n\nIn the words of my grandpa, \"you just gotta be more ornery than the weed!\""]="Stubborn weeds! They're a constant nuisance, creeping up in the soil and threatening to take over your land.\n\nBefore you can till that plot, you need to rip the weed out. There's no trick to it, really - just grab it and pull!\n\nIn the words of my grandpa, \"you just gotta be more ornery than the weed!\""
G["Student is worthless, master! Student apologizes for his deficiency!"]="Student is worthless, master! Student apologizes for his deficiency!"
G["Student will work harder, master!"]="Student will work harder, master!"
G["Students are a bit like sheep.  They're useful and even likeable when you guide and pay close attention to them.\n\nYou leave them alone for a minute and they end up falling down a cliff or drowning in a shallow river."]="Students are a bit like sheep.  They're useful and even likeable when you guide and pay close attention to them.\n\nYou leave them alone for a minute and they end up falling down a cliff or drowning in a shallow river."
G["Students of our Order test their speed in an aerial competition known as the Sky Race."]="Students of our Order test their speed in an aerial competition known as the Sky Race."
G["Students! Students! Pay attention now."]="Students! Students! Pay attention now."
G["Study dis place well, mon. Ya gonna be helpin' me conquer it!"]="Study dis place well, mon. Ya gonna be helpin' me conquer it!"
G["Study hard and you might one day be able to summon one on your own, but for now it's time to move on to the felhunter."]="Study hard and you might one day be able to summon one on your own, but for now it's time to move on to the felhunter."
G["Study it, $n: The Catalogue of the Wayward."]="Estúdialo, $n: O Catálogo do Díscolo."
G["Study well, $n. We may need you fighting by our side before the next moon fills."]="Study well, $n. We may need you fighting by our side before the next moon fills."
G["Studying and understanding the Colossus will give us a needed advantage over the Qiraji."]="Estudar e entender o Colossus nos dará uma vantagem necessário sobre os Qiraji."
G["Stuff me like a haggis! Kurdran Wildhammer - in the flesh. He lives!"]="Que me ahorquen do árvore mais próximo! Kurdran Martelo Feroz em carne e osso. Está vivo!"
G["Stupid $R!  The Blackrock Clan shall dance on your grave!"]="Idiota $r! O Clã Rocha Negra bailará sobre seu tumba!"
G["Stupid $r think $ghe's:she's; the boss of me."]="$r idiota acredita que é meu chefe."
G["Stupid Dwarves and your fascination with runes! Why would you create something that would help your enemy?"]="Estúpidos anões e seu fascinação pelas runas! Por que construir algo que ajudará ao seu inimigo?"
G["Stupid Gronn, you'll obey us or... or... well you better!"]="Gronn estúpido, nos obedecerás ou... ou... Mais te vale que o faça!"
G["Stupid animals!  I'll put you down after I kill these weaklings."]="Stupid animals!  I'll put you down after I kill these weaklings."
G["Stupid animals! I'll put you down after I kill these weaklings!"]="Stupid animals! I'll put you down after I kill these weaklings!"
G["Stupid beasts!"]="Estúpidas beast!"
G["Stupid box! Stupid, stupid box! OPEN! GRURK SAY YOU OPEN!"]="Caixa estúpida! Caixa estúpida! ABRIR! GRURK DIZER ABRIR!"
G["Stupid drake!  When will you learn to follow directions?"]="Draco estúpido! Quando aprenderá a seguir indicações?"
G["Stupid grenade picked a fine time to backfire! So much for high quality goblin engineering!"]="Stupid grenade picked a fine time to backfire! So much for high quality goblin engineering!"
G["Stupid grummlepack!"]="Estúpido pacote grúmel!"
G["Stupid lizards."]="Lagartos estúpidos."
G["Stupid mages... always using the last of a reagent and never replacing it."]="Stupid mages... always using the last of a reagent and never replacing it."
G["Stupid ogre.  You all need to be taught a lesson."]="Stupid ogre.  You all need to be taught a lesson."
G["Stupid pig. This ground is already dead. Move on!"]="Porco estúpido. Essa terra já está morta. Continua adiante!"
G["Stupid puny thing.  Me smash!"]="Coisa estúpida e fraca. Eu quebrar!"
G["Stupid snake. I said shoot fire!"]="Estúpida serpente. Eu dizer disparar fogo!"
G["Stupid snow... Hey, you're, $n, aren't you? I've just received a message asking for you."]="Stupid snow... Hey, you're, $n, aren't you? I've just received a message asking for you."
G["Stupid ting!"]="Bicho eh'túpido!"
G["Stupid tiny thing kill my tiny thing. RAAAAAAAAR!"]="Coisinha burra mata minha coisinha pequenininha. RAAAAAAAR!"
G["Stupid, squishy $r. That weapon mine now! Give!"]="$gEstúpido, esponjoso: Estúpida, esponjosa; $r. Essa arma minha agora! Dar!"
G["Stupid, stupid, stupid ookin' dookers!"]="Dingues mikos! Tonto, tonto, tonto!"
G["Stupidity! I'm surrounded by stupidity!"]="Pura gracinha! Estou cercado de estúpidos!"
G["Subjugate THIS!"]="Somete ISTO!"
G["Submit or die, you fool!"]="Ríndete ou morre!"
G["Submit!"]="Someteos!"
