G["Succeed here, and our work is nearly done. Good luck, hero!"]="Succeed here, and our work is nearly done. Good luck, hero!"
G["Succeed, and even greater power shall be yours!"]="Se tem êxito, obterá um poder ainda maior!"
G["Succeed, and you may ascend after all.  Fail, and burn."]="Succeed, and you may ascend after all.  Fail, and burn."
G["Success is ours! The Ash'ari Crystal has been restored!"]="Temos tido êxito! Os Cristais de Ash'ari têm banido restaurados!"
G["Success!"]="Sucesso!"
G["Success!  Huzzah!  The power source restored the necklace!"]="Já está! Genial! A fonte de alimentação reparó o colar!"
G["Success!  I have attuned myself to Hellfire Citadel and the magic within.  Ah, such power!\n\nThere are countless fel orcs in that place... but that is not all!  I sense demonic power within those walls as well...\n\nIf you open yourself, then I shall grasp your mind -- briefly, mind you -- and take quill to parchment and record my findings for you..."]="Success!  I have attuned myself to Hellfire Citadel and the magic within.  Ah, such power!\n\nThere are countless fel orcs in that place... but that is not all!  I sense demonic power within those walls as well...\n\nIf you open yourself, then I shall grasp your mind -- briefly, mind you -- and take quill to parchment and record my findings for you..."
G["Success! Another corrupt dragon obliterated! Soon, none will stand but Deathwing himself..."]="Bem! Outro dragão corrupto tem caído! Pronto somente quedará Alamuerte..."
G["Success! Hah, well done. See me for your next trial."]="Vitória! Bem. Venha a me ver para o seu seguinte prova."
G["Success! The Siege Tank is able to retreat."]="Success! The Siege Tank is able to retreat."
G["Success! The female yak bleats at you peacefully."]="Êxito! A yak muge tranquilamente."
G["Success! The hill is yours!"]="ganhou! A colina é sua!"
G["Success! They are alive!"]="Êxito! Estão vivos!"
G["Success! You have your Personal Riches!\n\n|TInterface\\Icons\\INV_Misc_coin_02.blp:64|t"]="Success! You have your Personal Riches!\n\n|TInterface\\Icons\\INV_Misc_coin_02.blp:64|t"
G["Success, the rift is open!! My brethren, rise and return home! The Outland awaits!"]="Success, the rift is open!! My brethren, rise and return home! The Outland awaits!"
G["Succubus"]="Súcubo"
G["Succumb ta her venom!"]="Succumb ta her venom!"
G["Succumb to living flame!"]="Succumb to living flame!"
G["Succumb to living flame."]="Succumb to living flame."
G["Succumb to the chill of the grave."]="Succumb to the chill of the grave."
G["Succumb to the darkness inside your soul."]="Succumb to the darkness inside your soul."
G["Succumb to the endless dream, little ones. Let it consume you!"]="Succumb to the endless dream, little ones. Let it consume you!"
G["Succumb to the gaze, mortals!"]="Succumb to the gaze, mortals!"
G["Succumb to the icy chill... of death."]="Succumb to the icy chill... of death."
G["Succumb to your pride!"]="Succumb to your pride!"
G["Such a beautiful creature, wouldn't you agree? Do not let his small size deceive you. Even at a young age the Kunchong are lethal.\n\nBefore my discovery, the Kunchong were used as weapons with little regard for their intelligence. We struggled to control them until it occurred to me that we didn't fully understand them.\n\nBy forming a bond with the creatures we no longer needed to exert control forcefully. Instead, a partnership occurred.\n\nKovok was the next step in my experiment."]="Such a beautiful creature, wouldn't you agree? Do not let his small size deceive you. Even at a young age the Kunchong are lethal.\n\nBefore my discovery, the Kunchong were used as weapons with little regard for their intelligence. We struggled to control them until it occurred to me that we didn't fully understand them.\n\nBy forming a bond with the creatures we no longer needed to exert control forcefully. Instead, a partnership occurred.\n\nKovok was the next step in my experiment."
G["Such a dangerous and unpredictable profession cannot reliably be practiced among our pristine woods without calamitous consequences. You might try Silvermoon City itself, however; the walls are strong enough to weather the blasts."]="Uma profissão tão perigosa e imprevisível não pode ser praticada de maneira confiável entre nossas madeiras imaculadas, sem consequências calamitosas. Você pode tentar a própria Silvermoon City, no entanto; as paredes são fortes o suficiente para resistir às explosões."
G["Such a delight to see you again, $c. No, really. You're the reason that I'm making money here, hand over fist.\n\nNow, what can I sell to you today?"]="É um grande prazer voltar a ver você, $c. Não, em sério. É a razão pela que estou fazendo dinheiro aqui rapidamente.\n\nBom, que te posso vender hoje?"
G["Such a foolish creature, trying to challenge us.  His rancid corpse will serve as a reminder to the Legion of the power of Illidan Stormrage.\n\nThe shadowcloak's magic is fading, concealing us no longer.  It was fun while it lasted, but I prefer a more direct approach to bringing death to my enemy.\n\nYou fought well, but where I'm heading I need to go alone."]="Such a foolish creature, trying to challenge us.  His rancid corpse will serve as a reminder to the Legion of the power of Illidan Stormrage.\n\nThe shadowcloak's magic is fading, concealing us no longer.  It was fun while it lasted, but I prefer a more direct approach to bringing death to my enemy.\n\nYou fought well, but where I'm heading I need to go alone."
G["Such a foul, foul thing - destroy it, before it seeps deep into the soil and corrupts all of Pandaria!"]="Such a foul, foul thing - destroy it, before it seeps deep into the soil and corrupts all of Pandaria!"
G["Such a futile gesture."]="Um gesto infructuoso."
G["Such a glorious defeat!"]="Uma derrota gloriosa!"
G["Such a meaningless death!"]="Uma morte sem sentido!"
G["Such a patient one! When I was young, I would have hated this task. Nowadays, I am filled with love."]="Tão paciente! Na minha juventude, eu teria odiado esta tarefa. Hoje em dia, estou repleto de amor."
G["Such a pity, and here I'll wager that you sharpened your knife special in anticipation of slicing a few skins for me. Alas, we've already gathered all of the rugged leather necessary, $c. Do make yourself useful though, and check with the others here to see if they have any other collection tasks to send you on."]="Que pena! Apuesto a que tem afiado seu cuchilho para cortar algumas peles para mim mas, por desgraça, já temos reuniu todas as peles de couro basto necessárias, $c. No entanto, faça algo útil e vê a perguntar aos mais se necessário ajuda nos seus trabalhos de pegue de materiais."
G["Such a pity."]="Que pena."
G["Such a pity..."]="Mas que pena."
G["Such a powerful weapon!"]="Um arma tão poderosa!"
G["Such a sacred text will not be wasted on me. Thank you!"]="Such a sacred text will not be wasted on me. Thank you!"
G["Such a shame for this food to go to waste. Oh, well."]="É uma lástima que toda esta comida se desperdicie. Em fim..."
G["Such a shameful display. You are better off dead."]="Que vergonha. Está melhor morto!"
G["Such a stark contrast, this holiday, to typical human behavior. Who'd have thought such a relentlessly voracious people would make a celebration of giving and sharing?\n\nIt's pleasant to see. Darnassus should do its utmost to support and encourage it."]="Such a stark contrast, this holiday, to typical human behavior. Who'd have thought such a relentlessly voracious people would make a celebration of giving and sharing?\n\nIt's pleasant to see. Darnassus should do its utmost to support and encourage it."
G["Such a tragedy..."]="Que grande tragedia..."
G["Such a tragic waste of life."]="Que trágica perda de vida."
G["Such a unique specimen! So many possibilities! I must devote myself harder to the study of the local flora and fauna."]="Uma amostra tão única! Tantas possibilidades! Devo me dedicar mais ao estudo da flora e fauna locais."
G["Such a waste.  That arrow's poison was not meant to be wasted on your whelp.  We'll meet again, Genn!"]="Such a waste.  That arrow's poison was not meant to be wasted on your whelp.  We'll meet again, Genn!"
G["Such a waste..."]="Such a waste..."
G["Such a waste...."]="Que perda…"
G["Such a weak creature."]="Que criatura mais fraco."
G["Such an exotic land. I am sure there is quite a menagerie of animals and beasts to be found here. And all with that delightful electrical discharge popping off their bodies."]="Such an exotic land. I am sure there is quite a menagerie of animals and beasts to be found here. And all with that delightful electrical discharge popping off their bodies."
G["Such an old wagon, no wonder it broke down on you, Samuel."]="É um carro tão velho que não me estranha que se te tenha voltado a estropear, Samuel."
G["Such arrogance!"]="Quanta arrogância!"
G["Such attention!  You flatter me, love."]="Such attention!  You flatter me, love."
G["Such death..."]="Tanta morte..."
G["Such devastation... what a horrible mess..."]="Que devastação... que desastre espantoso..."
G["Such easy prey.  Sylvanas will be most pleased!"]="Such easy prey.  Sylvanas will be most pleased!"
G["Such easy prey..."]="Uma presa tão fácil..."
G["Such energy. Excellent!"]="Quanta energia. Excelente!"
G["Such flammable little insects...."]="Such flammable little insects...."
G["Such fragile creatures. Worthless!"]="Such fragile creatures. Worthless!"
G["Such glorious, beautiful power!"]="Tamanha poder, lindo e glorioso!"
G["Such harmony of flavor, such heady aroma! It is...the perfect brew!"]="Such harmony of flavor, such heady aroma! It is...the perfect brew!"
G["Such hatred is only bringing us destruction. I can see it in you as you fight the quilboar...your anger does nothing but wear you away."]="Such hatred is only bringing us destruction. I can see it in you as you fight the quilboar...your anger does nothing but wear you away."
G["Such horror... Such emptiness..."]="Quanto horror... Quanto vazio."
G["Such hunger..."]="Quanta fome..."
G["Such insolence!"]="Que insolência!"
G["Such insolence. My temper grows short."]="Que insolência. A paciência se me fica exausto."
G["Such insolence... such arrogance... must be PUNISHED!"]="Tanta insolência... tanta arrogância... devem ser CASTIGADAS!"
G["Such insolence....such arrogance..."]="Que insolência... Que arrogância..."
G["Such is the fate of all who oppose the Lich King!"]="Such is the fate of all who oppose the Lich King!"
G["Such is the fate of those who question authority."]="É o que acontece a todos que questionam a autoridade."
G["Such is the price of curiosity."]="Esse é o preço da curiosidade."
G["Such is the price of failure."]="Such is the price of failure."
G["Such is the price... of failure...."]="Such is the price... of failure...."
G["Such is their animosity that they vie for the honor of being sent to assist the naaru there. Each day, that decision is made here by A'dal.  The armies gather here to receive A'dal's blessing before heading to Shadowmoon."]="Such is their animosity that they vie for the honor of being sent to assist the naaru there. Each day, that decision is made here by A'dal.  The armies gather here to receive A'dal's blessing before heading to Shadowmoon."
G["Such is your fate."]="Esse é seu destino."
G["Such little things you are. May this challenge fortify your strength!"]="São criaturas muito pequenas. Espero que este desafio aumente sua força!"
G["Such marvelous sights. I regret being unable to see it when I was younger."]="Such marvelous sights. I regret being unable to see it when I was younger."
G["Such mediocre resistance..."]="Que resistência tão mediocre..."
G["Such needless strife, but if the elves of Silverwing Hold will not speak to us in peace, then what alternative do they leave us? Seek out the aid of Kergul Bloodaxe on the Hunter Rise to get to Warsong Gulch."]="Tal conflito desnecessário, mas se os elfos do Forte Asa de Prata não falarem conosco em paz, então que alternativa eles nos deixam? Procure a ajuda de Kergul Bloodaxe em Hunter Rise para chegar ao Warsong Gulch."
G["Such noble boasts, but in the end, we've brought you down to reality."]="Uma fanfarronada muito noble, mas ao fim te temos devolvido à realidade."
G["Such power! Can you not feel it, mortals? Cease this foolishness and join me!"]="Such power! Can you not feel it, mortals? Cease this foolishness and join me!"
G["Such power! I AM INVINCIBLE!"]="Belo poder! SOU INVENCÍVEL!"
G["Such rage I have never seen..."]="Nunca vi... tanta... raiva..."
G["Such skill for a new trainee."]="Que habilidade para $gun novo: uma nova; aprendiz."
G["Such sssorrow... The passst cannot be undone..."]="Tal amanhã... O passst não pode ser desfeito..."
G["Such strange creatures. Why do they remain so long after the Legion has left?"]="Que criaturas estranhas. Por que elas permaneceram aqui por tanto tempo depois que a Legião se foi?"
G["Such strength... it must be mine!"]="Tamanha força... tem de ser minha!"
G["Such will be the fate of all enemies of the Horde, Warchief.  Now we must deal with the wretch, Putress."]="Such will be the fate of all enemies of the Horde, Warchief.  Now we must deal with the wretch, Putress."
G["Such wind! Such cold! Once, it would have filled these old bones with despair. But on this day, I am filled with hope."]="Tanto vento! Tão frio! Outrora talvez eu me desesperasse até os ossos. Mas hoje meu coração se enche de esperança."
G["Such wisdom is steeped in a mystery that can only be found in great Thunder Bluff.  Follow the path north out of Bloodhoof Village until you come to an elevator at the base of the bluffs.  Ride it to the top and ask one of the Bluffwatchers for further assistance."]="Tal sabedoria está mergulhada em um mistério que só pode ser encontrado no grande Penhasco do Trovão. Continue o caminho para o norte, saindo da Vila Casco Sangrento até chegar a um elevador na base dos penhascos. Monte-o até o topo e peça ajuda a um dos Bluffwatchers."
G["Such wondrous power! The Darkfallen Orb has made me INVINCIBLE!"]="Um poder tão maravilhoso! O orbe Caído Sombrio me voltou INVENCÍVEL."
G["Such... dark... energy!  How can this be possible?"]="Uma energia... tão... sombria! Como é possível?"
G["Such... madness..."]="Que... loucura..."
G["Suck it down, freaks!!"]="Suck it down, freaks!!"
G["Suck it down, orc!"]="Chúpate essa, orc!"
G["Suffer for your arrogance!"]="Suffer for your arrogance!"
G["Suffer in flames!"]="Suffer in flames!"
G["Suffer the storm!"]="Suffer the storm!"
G["Suffer the storm's wrath!"]="Suffer the storm's wrath!"
G["Suffer well, death knight!"]="Suffer well, death knight!"
G["Suffer well, death knight..."]="Suffer well, death knight..."
G["Suffer!"]="Suffer!"
G["Suffer, insect!"]="Suffer, insect!"
G["Suffer, insects!"]="Suffer, insects!"
G["Suffer, mortals, as your pathetic magic betrays you!"]="Suffer, mortals, as your pathetic magic betrays you!"
G["Suffer, you despicable insect!"]="Suffer, you despicable insect!"
G["Suffering from amnesia, he fought for his life in Horde arenas."]="Ele sofria de amnésia, e lutou pela sobrevivência nas arenas da Horda."
G["Suffering loosens the tongue. Take my word for it, $r."]="O sofrimento solta a grislíngua. Créeme, $r."
G["Suffering to the conquered!"]="Suffering to the conquered!"
G["Suffering to the weak!"]="Sofrimento para os fracos!"
G["Suffice it to say that the academy was cautious in its application of these newfound powers - what few writings remain indicate that the mages there worried about arcane addiction, a problem my race suffers from to this day.\n\nThis restraint put the mages of Mennar in opposition to Queen Azshara and her highborne lackeys, who sought ever greater power with wild abandon, throwing caution to the wind and delving into ever more dangerous applications of the arts."]="Suffice it to say that the academy was cautious in its application of these newfound powers - what few writings remain indicate that the mages there worried about arcane addiction, a problem my race suffers from to this day.\n\nThis restraint put the mages of Mennar in opposition to Queen Azshara and her highborne lackeys, who sought ever greater power with wild abandon, throwing caution to the wind and delving into ever more dangerous applications of the arts."
G["Sufficient use of force would trigger a reset in watcher functions, removing the external influence."]="O uso de força suficiente será ativado o reinicia das funções de vigia e excluirá a influência externa."
G["Suffocate upon your own hate!"]="Asfíxiate com o seu próprio ódio!"
G["Suicidal bugs, aren't they?"]="Que insetos tão suicidas, verdade?"
G["Suit yerself, mate. Me an' the treasure can both be buried."]="Suit yerself, mate. Me an' the treasure can both be buried."
G["Suit yourself. At least three of you must assist me if we're to get inside. Follow me...."]="Suit yourself. At least three of you must assist me if we're to get inside. Follow me...."
G["Suited up and ready to go, sir!"]="Suited up and ready to go, sir!"
G["Sul'thraze... the first time I heard the word uttered I was around your age. It meant nothing to me then, as it means nothing to you now. It was not until a warband of trolls coming from Zul'Farrak laid waste to the land that I understood... and feared.\n\nMany will tell you that the Splitblade of Suffering does not exist. That it's a myth; a rumor started to scare children. But believe me, $r, it exists.\n\n<Trenton loses focus as he runs his hand across the jagged scar on his face.>"]="Sul'thraze... the first time I heard the word uttered I was around your age. It meant nothing to me then, as it means nothing to you now. It was not until a warband of trolls coming from Zul'Farrak laid waste to the land that I understood... and feared.\n\nMany will tell you that the Splitblade of Suffering does not exist. That it's a myth; a rumor started to scare children. But believe me, $r, it exists.\n\n<Trenton loses focus as he runs his hand across the jagged scar on his face.>"
G["Sulfuras will be your end."]="Sulfuras será seu fim."
G["Sully planted some explosive barrels for me to shoot."]="Sully colocó vários barris explosivos como armadilha."
G["Sully! How could you just let him go?"]="Sully! How could you just let him go?"
G["Sully! Little Lu! Anyone!"]="Sully! Pequeno Lu! Alguém!"
G["Sully, Little Lu, our plans have changed. We need to transport Amber back to the main camp."]="Sully, pequeno Lu, os planos têm mudado. É preciso levar a Amber ao acampamento principal."
G["Sully. Investigate those shrines to the west. Look for signs of the White Pawn."]="Sully. Investigate those shrines to the west. Look for signs of the White Pawn."
G["Sully... those aren't statues on her lawn! She wants to turn you into jade!"]="Sully... those aren't statues on her lawn! She wants to turn you into jade!"
G["Summon Ahune, the Frost Lord."]="Evocar a Ahune, o Senhor da Gelo."
G["Summon elevator to current floor."]="Chama ao elevador ao piso no que está."
G["Summon forth your cowardly master, fool! Let him face me!"]="Evocar ao seu covarde mestre, idiota! Que se enfrente a mim!"
G["Summon... ha, imagine what we could become if fused with power of this magnitude..."]="Evocar... ha, imagine o que poderíamos nos tornar se nos fundíssemos com um poder dessa magnitude..."
G["Summoned by a fumbling $r? Unbelievable. Desperate or stupid, this will be your final mistake."]="Invocado por um torpe $r? Incrível. Bem estiver desesperado ou seja idiota este será seu último erro."
G["Summoning"]="Invocando"
G["Sumthin Happenin Here. The exact nature of it lacks clarity."]="Sumthin Happenin Here. The exact nature of it lacks clarity."
G["Sumthin' I can do fer ya, $c?"]="Posso fazer algo por você, $c?"
G["Sun's Reach is ours.  Kael's dogs are on the run... it is time to put them out of their misery!"]="O alcance do sol é nosso. Os cães de Kael estão fugindo... é hora de tirá-os da sua miséria!"
G["Sun... He... aid me."]="Sun... Zheng... ajudem-me."
G["Suna and I do not always agree, but I always respect her opinion."]="Suna and I do not always agree, but I always respect her opinion."
G["Suna's thoughts are colored by worry for her husband."]="Suna's thoughts are colored by worry for her husband."
G["Sunken Temple"]="Templo Submerso"
G["Sunreavers."]="Os Atracasol."
G["Sunsong Ranch needs my help? I'll meet you there after I'm done here at the market today."]="Que o Rancho Cantosol precisa minha ajuda? Nos vemos ali assim que termine no submercado."
G["Sunsong Ranch needs my help? Let me gather my equipment, and I'll meet you there."]="Que o Rancho Cantosol precisa minha ajuda? Vou coletar meu equipamento e nos vemos ali."
G["Sunstrider shall be victorious!"]="Sunstrider shall be victorious!"
G["Sunwalker, I respect your people. You have aided us in our campaign against the Sha and the Thunder King. Otherwise, I would've already ordered the Shado-Pan to purge this entire shrine. But my patience is at an end. The Horde must leave."]="Andarilho do Sol, eu respeito seu povo. Vocês nos ajudaram na campanha contra o Sha e o Rei Trovão. Se fosse diferente, eu já teria ordenado aos Shado-pans que derrubassem o Santuário ao chão. Mas minha paciência está no fim. A Horda deve partir."
G["Superb!"]="Magnífico!"
G["Superb! Because of your help, my people stand a chance of re-taking our beloved city. Three cheers to you!"]="Excelente! Obrigado à sua ajuda, meu gente tem uma oportunidade de recuperar seu amada cidade. Três vivas para você!"
G["Superb! Gather your strength, whats-your-face. We've got a long way to travel."]="Magnífico! Recuperada as forças, seja quem seja. Temos um largo viagem por linha de frente."
G["Superstitious or not, you won't find me exploring some place a grummle is afraid to travel."]="Superstitious or not, you won't find me exploring some place a grummle is afraid to travel."
G["Supplies are limited, but I accept only the best from the traders."]="Supplies are limited, but I accept only the best from the traders."
G["Supplies from our enemies!  Well done, $n!"]="Suprimentos de nossos inimigos! Bem feito, $n!"
G["Supply drop at the Wrathgate! Ride with caution!"]="Supply drop at the Wrathgate! Ride with caution!"
G["Support and heal me! Take up this warhammer and be a shaman."]="Cúbreme e sáname! Tome este martelo de guerra e sei um xamã."
G["Supremus acquires a new target!"]="Supremus adquiere um novo objetivo!"
