G["Sure are a lot of litter bugs around here."]="Claro que existem muitos insetos por aqui."
G["Sure can! I left grandpa's shovel out with the rest of the tools.\n\nYou can use it to dig up a Growing crop, clearing the land to make room for something else."]="Sure can! I left grandpa's shovel out with the rest of the tools.\n\nYou can use it to dig up a Growing crop, clearing the land to make room for something else."
G["Sure could go for a drink of water right now."]="Me bebería uma garrafa de água agora mesmo."
G["Sure does seem like it's been a long time since anyone has relieved me from my post."]="Sure does seem like it's been a long time since anyone has relieved me from my post."
G["Sure enough, scout came runnin' back, talkin' bout some orcs down the path. They hadn't seen us yet so we figured we'd go get acquainted."]="Sure enough, scout came runnin' back, talkin' bout some orcs down the path. They hadn't seen us yet so we figured we'd go get acquainted."
G["Sure is a nice day today."]="Há um dia precioso."
