G["Sure thing, $n."]="claro, $n."
G["Sure thing, $n. Here's another for you."]="claro, $n. Aqui há outro para você."
G["Sure thing, $n. You look like you can be trusted... Trustworthy! I can spot that a mile away...\n\nAnyway, back to what I was sayin'. Takes one Evoroot plant to make the Videre Elixir. The rest 'a the ingredients are trivial really, but the Evoroot, well, that can be a bit tricky to get."]="Sure thing, $n. You look like you can be trusted... Trustworthy! I can spot that a mile away...\n\nAnyway, back to what I was sayin'. Takes one Evoroot plant to make the Videre Elixir. The rest 'a the ingredients are trivial really, but the Evoroot, well, that can be a bit tricky to get."
G["Sure thing, boss."]="claro, chefe."
G["Sure thing, friend. I'll mark where you can find Mantis Shrimp map. Take a look at the Northwest corner of Dread Wastes, it's a place called Gokk'lok Shallows."]="Sure thing, friend. I'll mark where you can find Mantis Shrimp map. Take a look at the Northwest corner of Dread Wastes, it's a place called Gokk'lok Shallows."
G["Sure thing, kid!"]="claro, $gchico: garota;!"
G["Sure thing, love.  Put it on Harry's tab, will ya?  He owes me a drink!"]="Sure thing, love.  Put it on Harry's tab, will ya?  He owes me a drink!"
G["Sure ye don't want to be a Blacksmith?  Well, if yer heart is set on Leatherworking, then you best talk to Fimble Finespindle over at his shop on the northwest side of The Great Forge."]="Claro que você não quer ser um ferreiro? Bem, se seu coração está voltado para o Couraria, é melhor conversar com Fimble Finespindle na sua loja no lado noroeste da Grande Forja."
G["Sure you don't need a break, old woman?"]="Certo que não precisa um descanso, velha?"
G["Sure!"]="claro!"
G["Sure! Choosing which group to be in!"]="Sure! Choosing which group to be in!"
G["Sure! I'll give it a whirl."]="Sure! I'll give it a whirl."
G["Sure! Let's go for a ride."]="Certo! Vamos dar uma volta."
G["Sure! That last group did about thirty times!"]="Sure! That last group did about thirty times!"
G["Sure, $n, I'll train you, $n. Just keep an eye out for those monkeys!"]="Sure, $n, I'll train you, $n. Just keep an eye out for those monkeys!"
G["Sure, I suppose I could help out for a bit! I can't leave the market today, but I'll be there as soon as I can."]="é claro, suponho que poderá ajudar um pouco! Não posso deixar o submercado hoje mas estarei ali o antes possível."
G["Sure, I suppose I could help out for a bit! I'll meet you there in a bit."]="é claro, suponho que poderá ajudar um pouco! Nos vemos ali em um tempo."
G["Sure, I'd love to hear a secret."]="claro que quero ouvir um segredo."
G["Sure, I'll get into the ring.  Let me finish these two kegs first."]="Sure, I'll get into the ring.  Let me finish these two kegs first."
G["Sure, I'll go with you. Gotta study up on your moves!"]="claro que irei com você. Tenho que estudar seus movimentos!"
G["Sure, I'll tell you the phrase.  As long as I don't have to go anywhere near Tirth!"]="Claro, eu vou lhe dizer a frase. Contanto que eu não precise ir a lugar nenhum perto de Tirth!"
G["Sure, Paige. Just be gentle."]="claro, Paige. Mas faça com cuidado."
G["Sure, but you're not going to like it."]="claro, mas não vai gostar."
G["Sure, go ahead and take one, there's plenty for all!"]="claro, adiante, tome uma, há de sobra para todos!"
G["Sure, he's a little small, even by gnome standards, but he's all there! The real question is, what will he remember?"]="Sure, he's a little small, even by gnome standards, but he's all there! The real question is, what will he remember?"
G["Sure, it's got bugs to work out. But the microtank is a marvel of engineering.\n\nit uses one quarter the materials of a full-sized siege engine, and it can be mass-produced by anyone! ...with really tiny hands!"]="Sure, it's got bugs to work out. But the microtank is a marvel of engineering.\n\nit uses one quarter the materials of a full-sized siege engine, and it can be mass-produced by anyone! ...with really tiny hands!"
G["Sure, it's not like things could get any worse..."]="claro. Total, a coisa não pode ir a pior..."
G["Sure, let's go have a drink."]="claro, vamos dar um trago."
G["Sure, she's wearing a dress, and her knees bend the wrong way, but that doesn't mean she can't walk all over you. It's Dominika!"]="Sure, she's wearing a dress, and her knees bend the wrong way, but that doesn't mean she can't walk all over you. It's Dominika!"
G["Sure, sure.  We have a Mining Trainer right here in town.  Look for Krunn over in the northwest corner alongside the inn."]="Claro, claro. Temos um instrutor de mineração aqui mesmo na cidade. Procure por Krunn no canto noroeste, ao lado da pousada."
G["Sure, the others might have gone off on exciting adventures, but I don't mind. I'm perfectly happy right here."]="Sure, the others might have gone off on exciting adventures, but I don't mind. I'm perfectly happy right here."
G["Sure, we found an Alliance prisoner of war... but at what price?"]="Sim, nos hicimos com um prisioneiro de guerra da Aliança, mas a que preço?"
G["Sure, why not?"]="claro, por que não?"
G["Sure, you can ride on a mount while you water the plants. Why should I care?"]="Sure, you can ride on a mount while you water the plants. Why should I care?"
G["Sure. I was getting tired of this sewer anyway."]="Sure. I was getting tired of this sewer anyway."
G["Surely Mot didn't send you to me? He knows better. You are not yet capable of understanding what I would teach you. See my son Mot, just outside there, and finish training with him."]="Não você enviada Mot, verdade? O sabe bem. Ainda você não pode entender o que eu te ensenfaria. Vê a ver a meu filho Mot, está aí fosse, e termina com ele seu treinamento."
G["Surely a hot bite and a fresh pint will help those battle wounds heal a bit faster, eh?"]="Certo que um prato quente e uma pinta fresca ajudam a curar essas feridas de guerra, eh?"
G["Surely they... are worth fighting for."]="Vale a pena... lutar por eles."
G["Surely ye didn't think ye would find a town without a resident miner about, did ye?  Yarr can usually be found over at Steelgrill's Depot just outside of Kharanos."]="Certamente você não pensou que encontraria uma cidade sem um mineiro residente, não é? Yarr geralmente pode ser encontrado no depósito da Steelgrill, nos arredores de Kharanos."
G["Surely you agree that decisive action wins wars, Lord Zhu."]="Surely you agree that decisive action wins wars, Lord Zhu."
G["Surely you can do do better than this.  This fight has wasted my time.  You are not yet ready to be a champion."]="Surely you can do do better than this.  This fight has wasted my time.  You are not yet ready to be a champion."
G["Surely you can help. He just went out to the market and never came back."]="Estou certo de que pode me ajudar. Ela foi ao submercado e não tem retornado."
G["Surely you can see the futility of it all!"]="Certo que agora veis a futilidade de tudo elho!"
G["Surely you did not think you could win."]="Não terá pensado que conseguia vencer"
G["Surely you do not think that you will get away with this incursion. They will come for me and you shall pay for your insolence."]="Surely you do not think that you will get away with this incursion. They will come for me and you shall pay for your insolence."
G["Surely you see the advantage in our relationship. The powers we command are immense. With our aid, your enemies could well be decimated."]="Surely you see the advantage in our relationship. The powers we command are immense. With our aid, your enemies could well be decimated."
G["Surely you wouldn't deny an old man a replenishing drink? No, no, I thought not."]="Surely you wouldn't deny an old man a replenishing drink? No, no, I thought not."
G["Surely you've been a student once in your life, $c. You learned from an instructor, and you gained respect for them in some way, yes? Maybe not as a person, but at the least, as one who knew more than you and was willing to teach you. If not, use your imagination...\n\nWhat would you do if you came to realize your instructor may not know as much as you thought, and that you may have found a better path?"]="Surely you've been a student once in your life, $c. You learned from an instructor, and you gained respect for them in some way, yes? Maybe not as a person, but at the least, as one who knew more than you and was willing to teach you. If not, use your imagination...\n\nWhat would you do if you came to realize your instructor may not know as much as you thought, and that you may have found a better path?"
G["Surely you've felt anger. Anger so foul and vicious that it makes you want to tear someone to shreds..."]="Certo que tem sentido raiva. Uma raiva tão intensa e cruel que você feito sentir ganha de fazer pedaços a alguém..."
G["Surely you've got something to spare, Zalle. You know I'm good for it. Something, anything!"]="Sem dúvida tem algo do que pode prescindir, Zalhe. Sabe que sou bom para elho. Algo, qualquer coisa!"
G["Surely, the king thought, if he helped them with their troll problem, they would give him more troops for his campaign against the Horde."]="Certamente o rei pensou que se os ajudasse com o problema dos trolls, eles enviariam mais tropas para sua campanha contra a Horda."
G["Surprise us both and do something smart, like running away."]="Sorpréndenos aos dois e faça algo inteligente, como sair correndo."
G["Surprise!"]="Surpresa!"
G["Surprise, dragon!  Aw, shucks."]="Surpresa, dragão! Oh, vá."
G["Surprise, surprise! Another ghoul!"]="Surpresa, surpresa! Outro necrófago!"
G["Surprise, you scum!  You're going to tell me where my sister is or I'll put a bucketful of truesilver bullets through your wife's heart."]="Surprise, you scum!  You're going to tell me where my sister is or I'll put a bucketful of truesilver bullets through your wife's heart."
G["Surprise."]="/surpreso"
G["Surprised to see an orc here? Don't be.\n\nThe forsaken need watching. If we'd been paying closer attention from the start, maybe the Wrath Gate wouldn't have happened."]="Surprised to see an orc here? Don't be.\n\nThe forsaken need watching. If we'd been paying closer attention from the start, maybe the Wrath Gate wouldn't have happened."
G["Surprised, the beleaguered Pandaren slaves tried to strike Kang. One by one they failed, for he intercepted their blows like a dancer and sidestepped their attacks like a reed in the wind."]="Surpresos, os acossados escravos pandarens tentaram atingir Kang. Um por um eles falharam, pois ele bloqueava seus golpes como um dançarino, e se esquivava dos ataques como um caniço ao vento."
G["Surprised? You thought what? That draenei do not beat their prisoners?"]="Surprised? You thought what? That draenei do not beat their prisoners?"
G["Surrender an' we'll let ye live, heathens! Jus' put down yer arms an' march!"]="Surrender an' we'll let ye live, heathens! Jus' put down yer arms an' march!"
G["Surrender immediately!"]="Entrégate imediatamente!"
G["Surrender your soul, mortal."]="Entrega sua alma, mortal."
G["Surrender your spirit to a stone body!"]="Entrega seu espírito a um corpo de pedras!"
G["Surrender!"]="Ríndete!"
G["Surrender, Maestra, and I will see to it that your deaths are quick!"]="Surrender, Maestra, and I will see to it that your deaths are quick!"
G["Surrender, creature!"]="Ríndete, criatura!"
G["Surrender, warm blood!"]="Ríndete, sangue quente!"
G["Surrender? I'll scrawl out the terms of our surrender in their blood."]="Surrender? I'll scrawl out the terms of our surrender in their blood."
G["Surround them! Let none escape!"]="Surround them! Let none escape!"
