G["Swarmers, attack!  Tear the flesh from their bones!"]="Swarmers, attack!  Tear the flesh from their bones!"
G["Swear da blood oath wit me."]="Façam um juramento de sangue comigo."
G["Swear the blood oath with Vol'jin"]="Swear the blood oath with Vol'jin"
G["Swear your allegiance to me (The master wants! He sees and wants and hungers!) and you will be remade in my image. (Wait! INFIDEL! A heathen among us!) An intruder! YOU! Show yourself..."]="Swear your allegiance to me (The master wants! He sees and wants and hungers!) and you will be remade in my image. (Wait! INFIDEL! A heathen among us!) An intruder! YOU! Show yourself..."
