G["Sweet baby titans! That's got to be the biggest trogg I've ever seen! Keep firing...take it down!"]="Sweet baby titans! That's got to be the biggest trogg I've ever seen! Keep firing...take it down!"
G["Sweet dreams."]="Sweet dreams."
