G["Swords, claws, daggers, of course -- I've trained rogues in the use of them all. Now maces, I won't touch maces and I won't instruct any rogue who gets it in his head to wield one.\n\nThere's nothing stealthy about a mace. You're in for a noisy kill and a long cleanup if you go that route."]="Swords, claws, daggers, of course -- I've trained rogues in the use of them all. Now maces, I won't touch maces and I won't instruct any rogue who gets it in his head to wield one.\n\nThere's nothing stealthy about a mace. You're in for a noisy kill and a long cleanup if you go that route."
G["Sylann, one of the finest cooks in the city, can be found upstairs in the Wayfarer's Rest tavern. You can purchase cooking supplies from her assistant there, too."]="Sylann, um dos melhores cozinheiros da cidade, pode ser encontrado no andar superior, na taberna Wayfarer's Rest. Você também pode comprar materiais de cozinha da assistente dela."
G["Sylvanas! You will leave our corpses alone or I will deal with you here and now."]="Sylvanas! De em paz a nossos cadáveres ou te as verá comigo aqui e agora."
G["Symbols of Divinity? Check. Candles? Check. Arcane powder, uh... arcane powder? Oh, no! This is the last time I offer to pick up reagents for anyone. Is there a vendor around here?"]="Símbolos de divindade? Correto. Velas? Correto. Partículas Arcanas... eh... partículas Arcanas? Oh não! Esta é a última vez que me ofereço a coletar reagentes. Há algum vendedor por aqui?"
G["Synge, I can't believe you got us into this mess, you stupid goblin!"]="Synge, I can't believe you got us into this mess, you stupid goblin!"
G["Synge, I'm going to slap you around some, and then some more! Just watch. I'm going to get out of this cage and then gloat and laugh at you!"]="Synge, I'm going to slap you around some, and then some more! Just watch. I'm going to get out of this cage and then gloat and laugh at you!"
