G["Take a look around, $n!\n\nWe've turned these monkeys into a bonifide army while you were away!"]="Olhe ao seu ao redor, $n!\n\nEnquanto estava fosse, temos convertido a esses macacos em um autêntico exército!"
G["Take a look around, $n. Perhaps you will find something that I have missed."]="Take a look around, $n. Perhaps you will find something that I have missed."
