G["Taurajo had a significant civilian population. I wanted to ensure that they could escape the fighting, and many did, finding refuge in the north.\n\nThere are some, even in Alliance High Command, who argued that I let an opportunity slip away. That I should've taken hostages. But I don't see the value in those sort of terror-tactics.\n\nHear me out, $n: I want this war to end someday. It won't ever stop if we butcher or imprison civilians.\n\nI just pray that there are those on the other side who see things as I do."]="Taurajo had a significant civilian population. I wanted to ensure that they could escape the fighting, and many did, finding refuge in the north.\n\nThere are some, even in Alliance High Command, who argued that I let an opportunity slip away. That I should've taken hostages. But I don't see the value in those sort of terror-tactics.\n\nHear me out, $n: I want this war to end someday. It won't ever stop if we butcher or imprison civilians.\n\nI just pray that there are those on the other side who see things as I do."
G["Tauren Gossip NPC - Periodic Talk (Expansion Prologue) 01"]="Tauren Gossip NPC - Periodic Talk (Expansion Prologue) 01"
G["Tauren Paladins!"]="Paladinos tauren!"
G["Tauren arch druid? Do you mean Hamuul?"]="Arquidruida tauren? Te refieres a Hamuul?"
G["Tauren have a passion for hunting; it is something that runs deep with our kind."]="Os Tauren têm uma paixão pela caça; é algo que é profundo com nossa espécie."
G["Tauren! What have your people done? You have dredged open a scar within our sacred Vale!"]="Tauren! O que seu povo fez? Vocês abriram uma cicatriz em nosso Vale sagrado!"
G["Tay'kn gobins!"]="Co'e gobins!"
G["Taylor fought against the hozen like a wild beast. He is a great credit to your people!\n\nBut in the end, he was overcome."]="Taylor fought against the hozen like a wild beast. He is a great credit to your people!\n\nBut in the end, he was overcome."
G["Taylor must be close by."]="Taylor dever de estar perto."
G["Tazaga-choo!"]="Tazaga-choo!"
G["Tch!  So soon?"]="Oh! Tan pronto?"
G["Tch. Amateurs."]="Pff. Aficionados."
G["Tch. One might think you're ashamed to be seen with me, master."]="Tch. One might think you're ashamed to be seen with me, master."
G["Tcha! Why did Taran leave you in charge? You would have us cower in our bedsheets until the yaungol break down our very doors!"]="Tcha! Why did Taran leave you in charge? You would have us cower in our bedsheets until the yaungol break down our very doors!"
G["Teach me how to cook, Cookie."]="Ensina-me a cozinhar, Cookie."
G["Teach me how to create and apply a Heavy Mageweave Bandage, Doctor."]="Teach me how to create and apply a Heavy Mageweave Bandage, Doctor."
