G["Teach me the ways of the spirits."]="Ensina-me os caminhos dos espíritos."
G["Teach me, $n! I will bend the forces of water to destroy our foes!"]="Teach me, $n! I will bend the forces of water to destroy our foes!"
G["Teach them the meaning of blood and thunder!"]="Ensénhales o significado de sangue e trovões!"
G["Teach these cowards the true meaning of war!"]="Teach these cowards the true meaning of war!"
G["Teach those cultists a lesson, $n. No one messes with Crusader Kul and gets away with it!"]="Ensina uma lecção a esses cultistas, $n. Ninguém se mete com o cruzado Kul e sai impune!"
G["Teach you gnomish engineering? I don't have time for this nonsense. You only get one chance with Oglethorpe and you blew that, didn't you?\n\nYou'll have to head to Tanaris and find Narain Soothfancy's hut. In that hut is a magical book that might be able to jostle whatever is left of your brain and reconnect you with what you've lost.\n\nNow get lost!"]="Teach you gnomish engineering? I don't have time for this nonsense. You only get one chance with Oglethorpe and you blew that, didn't you?\n\nYou'll have to head to Tanaris and find Narain Soothfancy's hut. In that hut is a magical book that might be able to jostle whatever is left of your brain and reconnect you with what you've lost.\n\nNow get lost!"
G["Teach you the ways of gnomish engineering? Not going to happen! Not this gnome, anyway. You have a stink on you, $n. Maybe this is the pity talking but I will offer some advice.\n\nIn the Tanaris desert you'll find a hut that belongs to Narain Soothfancy. In that hut is a magical book that has been known to do wonderous things. Find that book and you may yet learn the gnomish way."]="Teach you the ways of gnomish engineering? Not going to happen! Not this gnome, anyway. You have a stink on you, $n. Maybe this is the pity talking but I will offer some advice.\n\nIn the Tanaris desert you'll find a hut that belongs to Narain Soothfancy. In that hut is a magical book that has been known to do wonderous things. Find that book and you may yet learn the gnomish way."
G["Teach you to steal our treasures! Our treasures are... ours, okay?!"]="Teach you to steal our treasures! Our treasures are... ours, okay?!"
G["Teacher are there night elves in Stormwind? I've never seen a night elf before."]="Mestre, há elfos da noite em Ventobravo? Nunca vi elfos da noite."
G["Teacher, I have to pee!"]="Mestre, tenho que ir ao banho!"
G["Teacher, he keeps poking me!"]="Teacher, he keeps poking me!"
G["Teacher, when are we gonna see the sparkly Mage Tower?"]="Teacher, when are we gonna see the sparkly Mage Tower?"
G["Teacher..."]="Teacher..."
G["Teacher... look!"]="Teacher... look!"
G["Teaching is not a one-sided trade, $n. As I teach you, I learn more myself, and my understanding grows."]="Teaching is not a one-sided trade, $n. As I teach you, I learn more myself, and my understanding grows."
