G["Tell me where the totem of Kar'dash is hidden and the beatings will stop."]="Diga onde está o totem de Kar'dash e não haverá mais golpes."
G["Tell me your name, orc."]="Diga seu nome, orc."
G["Tell me your story again, Fizzcrank."]="Conte-me sua história novamente, Fizzcrank."
G["Tell me, $r, have you ever had a hankering to fish?\n\nIf so, you might want to visit the Anglers down in the Krasarang Wilds."]="Tell me, $r, have you ever had a hankering to fish?\n\nIf so, you might want to visit the Anglers down in the Krasarang Wilds."
G["Tell me, Black Prince: What is the nature of fortitude?"]="Diga, Príncipe Negro: Qual é a essência da fortitude?"
G["Tell me, Godfrey.  Those that stayed in Gilneas City so that we could live.  Were they following protocol?"]="Diga, Godfrey. Aqueles que se ficaram na Cidade de Guilnéas para que nós sobreviviéramos, continuavam o protocolo?"
G["Tell me, do your feel prepared to face the challenge I have laid out for you? The spirits tell me that you will pass, but do you have faith in them or in yourself?"]="Diga-me, você se sente pronto para enfrentar o desafio que lhe propus? Os espíritos me dizem que você passará, mas você tem fé neles ou em si mesmo?"
G["Tell me, dragon child: What is the nature of wisdom?"]="Diga, ninho dragão: qual é a natureza da sabedoria?"
G["Tell me, how goes the battle up above? What of Nazgrim? Speak to me!"]="Tell me, how goes the battle up above? What of Nazgrim? Speak to me!"
G["Tell me, son of the Earth-Warder: What is the nature of hope?"]="Diga, filho do Guardião da Terra: que é a esperança?"
G["Tell me, what has happened here?"]="Diga, que tem passado?"
G["Tell me, what is this charm you're using?"]="Conte-me, que embelesamento está utilizando?"
G["Tell me, young prince: What is the nature of strength?"]="Diga, jovem Príncipe: qual é a natureza da força?"
G["Tell me... tell me everything!"]="Tell me... tell me everything!"
G["Tell my family...\n\nMy last thoughts were of them..."]="Di a meu família... \n\nQue nos últimos instantes pensei em eles..."
G["Tell my husband I love him very much!"]="Diga a meu marido que lhe quero muito!"
G["Tell my story."]="Conta meu história."
G["Tell my story..."]="Conte minha história..."
G["Tell my wife I love her very much!"]="Diga a meu mulher que a quero muito!"
G["Tell that to the farmer that told me. Poor guy lost all his crops to the invaders."]="Tell that to the farmer that told me. Poor guy lost all his crops to the invaders."
G["Tell the Warden this prison is ours now!"]="Tell the Warden this prison is ours now!"
G["Tell the mystic that his people are to stand and fight alongside the Horde and Alliance against the forces of Malygos and the Lich King."]="Diga ao místico que seu povo tem de entrar à Horda ou a Aliança na luta contra os exércitos de Malygos e o Rei Lich."
G["Tell the warchief it isn't my fault! My guys fought back with mallets or whatever they had at hand, I swear!"]="Tell the warchief it isn't my fault! My guys fought back with mallets or whatever they had at hand, I swear!"
G["Tell them that I am free of my father's madness, and I will be free of them as well. I am to be left alone: this will be my first and only warning."]="Tell them that I am free of my father's madness, and I will be free of them as well. I am to be left alone: this will be my first and only warning."
G["Tell us about your captors, Gurrok."]="Háblanos dos seus captores, Gurrok."
G["Tell us again how you slew the yaungol war leader, $n."]="Cuéntanos outra vez como acabaste com o líder de guerra yaungol, $n."
G["Tell us again why this island is so unique?"]="Cuéntanos, que tem de especial esta ilha?"
G["Tell us more, Martik. What is it? What does it feel like?"]="Cuéntanos mais, Martik. O que é? Que se sente?"
G["Tell us!  Where does your leader hide?"]="Tell us!  Where does your leader hide?"
G["Tell us, Ambassador Kelemar... how do the blood elves plan to aid us, exactly?"]="Díganos, embaixador Kelemar... como piensan nos ajudar os elfos de sangue exatamente?"
G["Tell ya what Sully, tell me all about him over a mug of ale when we get back."]="Sully, diga tudo o que saiba de ele com uma jarra de cerveja quando regresemos."
G["Tell ya what, me crewmen are drinkin' wherever ale can be found in this city. If ya can convince 'em to give up their ales and take up their guns, count me in!"]="Tell ya what, me crewmen are drinkin' wherever ale can be found in this city. If ya can convince 'em to give up their ales and take up their guns, count me in!"
G["Tell ya what, mon. You take a little taste so I know ya ain't tryin' ta poison me. Then I'll drink."]="Tell ya what, mon. You take a little taste so I know ya ain't tryin' ta poison me. Then I'll drink."
G["Tell you nothing, preacher."]="Tell you nothing, preacher."
G["Tell you what, hon.  If you help me get all of this unpacked, we can both take a breather.  Deal?"]="Vamos carinho. Se me ajuda a tirar estas coisas, descansamos juntos depois, de acordo?"
G["Tell your admiral that if this works, my ship and crew will be at her command."]="Diga ao seu almirante que se isto funciona, meu navio e meu tripulação estarão aos seus ordens."
G["Tell your rune-smiths to continue converting what stone giants you can. Those that will not submit must be destroyed."]="Tell your rune-smiths to continue converting what stone giants you can. Those that will not submit must be destroyed."
G["Tell yourself again that these are not truly your friends."]="Volta a dizer você mesmo que não são seus amigos de verdade."
G["Telredor has seen more change in the last 20 years than it did in prior centuries. I cannot complain, $n, for the world has changed far more in that time.\n\nThe Light has brought me friends and companions I could not have met as a cloistered priest. Learn what you can of the past in your time here. It will help you to understand where your journey is leading you."]="Telredor has seen more change in the last 20 years than it did in prior centuries. I cannot complain, $n, for the world has changed far more in that time.\n\nThe Light has brought me friends and companions I could not have met as a cloistered priest. Learn what you can of the past in your time here. It will help you to understand where your journey is leading you."
G["Telredor was once a secluded retreat for draenei priests and pilgrims. The resident priests seldom received visitors.\n\nWhen the orcs started to attack draenei settlements, refugees began to arrive in larger numbers. Anchorite Ahuurn and the others transformed Telredor from a shrine into a safe haven. Many draenei, myself included, owe our survival to his efforts."]="Telredor was once a secluded retreat for draenei priests and pilgrims. The resident priests seldom received visitors.\n\nWhen the orcs started to attack draenei settlements, refugees began to arrive in larger numbers. Anchorite Ahuurn and the others transformed Telredor from a shrine into a safe haven. Many draenei, myself included, owe our survival to his efforts."
G["Temple guardians are no longer present. Plant forms associated with temple are deceased."]="Temple guardians are no longer present. Plant forms associated with temple are deceased."
G["Temple guardians verified to be deceased. Sulfurous odor suggests that death resulted from a fire-based entity."]="Temple guardians verified to be deceased. Sulfurous odor suggests that death resulted from a fire-based entity."
G["Temple of Invention analysis commencing."]="Temple of Invention analysis commencing."
G["Temple of Invention verified to be intact."]="Se tem verificado que o Templo da Invenção está intacto."
G["Temple of Life analysis commencing."]="Temple of Life analysis commencing."
G["Temple of Life verified to be damaged beyond repair."]="Se tem verificado que o Templo da Vida tem sofrido danos irreparables."
G["Temple of Order analysis commencing."]="Temple of Order analysis commencing."
G["Temple of Order verified to be in tact."]="Se tem verificado que o Templo do Ordem está in-tacto."
G["Temple of Winter analysis commencing."]="Temple of Winter analysis commencing."
G["Temple of Winter verified to be in tact."]="Se tem verificado que o Templo do Inverno está intacto."
G["Temple of the Jade Serpent, a level 85-87 dungeon in the Jade Forest, is now available for testing. Please be in your full group before teleporting to the dungeon. Meeting Stones are not available for this dungeon yet.\nTo leave Temple of the Jade Serpent, simply exit through the normal exit inside the dungeon and you will be teleported out. If you die and release, you should teleport back from this NPC."]="Temple of the Jade Serpent, a level 85-87 dungeon in the Jade Forest, is now available for testing. Please be in your full group before teleporting to the dungeon. Meeting Stones are not available for this dungeon yet.\nTo leave Temple of the Jade Serpent, simply exit through the normal exit inside the dungeon and you will be teleported out. If you die and release, you should teleport back from this NPC."
G["Ten minutes? Plenty of time to disarm the device."]="Dez minutos? De sobra para desativar o dispositivo."
G["Ten silver says I can hit Honor Hold with this boulder!"]="Ten silver says I can hit Honor Hold with this boulder!"
G["Ten thousand and one."]="Dez mil e um."
G["Ten thousand strikes, every day."]="Dez mil golpes ao dia."
G["Ten thousand years ago demons first breached this world, just as they had the orc homeworld of Draenor. They flooded across the terrain in legion. The great ancients of Azeroth helped the mortal races to mount a desperate defense.\n\nThe tenacity of Lo'Gosh in these dark days became the stuff of legend. He feared no demon. He would wade into their ranks, fangs bared and spattered with their vile ichor, his great claws thrashing them by the dozen...\n\nHis stand against the demons inspires us all. We can all learn from his example."]="Ten thousand years ago demons first breached this world, just as they had the orc homeworld of Draenor. They flooded across the terrain in legion. The great ancients of Azeroth helped the mortal races to mount a desperate defense.\n\nThe tenacity of Lo'Gosh in these dark days became the stuff of legend. He feared no demon. He would wade into their ranks, fangs bared and spattered with their vile ichor, his great claws thrashing them by the dozen...\n\nHis stand against the demons inspires us all. We can all learn from his example."
G["Ten thousand years ago, the last Pandaren Emperor came seeking my advice. He, too, was filled with conflict. Let us see if you are correct, Taran. Let us see how this stranger deals with turmoil of the soul."]="Há dez mil anos, o último imperador pandaren me procurou em busca de conselho. Ele também estava em conflito. Vamos ver se você está certo, Taran. Vamos ver como alguém de fora lida com os conflitos da alma."
G["Ten thousand years ago, when the demons of the Burning Legion invaded Azeroth, the ancients fought side-by-side with the mortal races. Many of the ancients met their end by the Legion's hand. Cenarius would've been killed as well, were it not for the actions of his father, Malorne.\n\nThe mighty stag leapt into battle, his hooves crashing down on demon skulls and his antlers piercing their fiery flesh.\n\nThen Archimonde the Defiler took to the field of battle. After a fierce fight, he seized Malorne by his antlers and... and snapped the ancient's neck.\n\nBut as long as there's life in the world, can a force of nature like Malorne ever truly die?"]="Ten thousand years ago, when the demons of the Burning Legion invaded Azeroth, the ancients fought side-by-side with the mortal races. Many of the ancients met their end by the Legion's hand. Cenarius would've been killed as well, were it not for the actions of his father, Malorne.\n\nThe mighty stag leapt into battle, his hooves crashing down on demon skulls and his antlers piercing their fiery flesh.\n\nThen Archimonde the Defiler took to the field of battle. After a fierce fight, he seized Malorne by his antlers and... and snapped the ancient's neck.\n\nBut as long as there's life in the world, can a force of nature like Malorne ever truly die?"
G["Ten thousand!? Outrageous! I'll kill you while you sleep!"]="Ten thousand!? Outrageous! I'll kill you while you sleep!"
G["Ten years. I have faithfully brushed yak for ten years."]="Ten years. I have faithfully brushed yak for ten years."
G["Tenacious Pet"]="Ajudante de Tenacidade"
