G["Tend to the injuries of the wounded, sisters!"]="Ocupaos dos danos afligidos aos feridos, irmãs!"
G["Tend to the wounded! This isn't over yet."]="Tend to the wounded! This isn't over yet."
G["Tender your souls, mortals! These are the halls of the dead!"]="Tender your souls, mortals! These are the halls of the dead!"
