G["Terrible business!\n\nThere was a horrific growling noise that seemed to echo throught the region.\n\nPoor fellow...\n\nYou'll excuse me - I do believe I need a drink."]="Terrible business!\n\nThere was a horrific growling noise that seemed to echo throught the region.\n\nPoor fellow...\n\nYou'll excuse me - I do believe I need a drink."
G["Terrible destruction awaits you when this seed erupts."]="Uma destruição terrível espera você quando esta semente germinar."
G["Terrible news, everyone. Rotface is dead, but great news everyone! He left behind plenty of ooze for me to use! What? I'm a poet and I didn't know it... Astounding!"]="Terrible news, everyone. Rotface is dead, but great news everyone! He left behind plenty of ooze for me to use! What? I'm a poet and I didn't know it... Astounding!"
G["Terrible thing, what happened to them mules... Metz is gonna have my hide for this failure."]="Coisa terrível, o que aconteceu com as mulas... Metz vai me esconder por esse fracasso."
G["Terrible!"]="Terrible!"
G["Terrible, but don't tell him I said so. Vermins is running everywhere. Crops ain't growing. And something keeps eating the harvest."]="Terrible, but don't tell him I said so. Vermins is running everywhere. Crops ain't growing. And something keeps eating the harvest."
G["Terrific! That went down nice and clean."]="Estupendo! Tudo tem saindo a pedir de boca."
G["Terror, darkness, power? The Forsaken crave not these things; the Forsaken ARE these things."]="Terror, darkness, power? The Forsaken crave not these things; the Forsaken ARE these things."
G["Tesoran! I need someone--Falgran Hastil, preferably--to take care of $n's lead on the prints near the Shady Rest Inn."]="Tesoran! I need someone--Falgran Hastil, preferably--to take care of $n's lead on the prints near the Shady Rest Inn."
G["Test"]="Test"
G["Test not my patience, mortal."]="Não teste minha paciência, mortal."
G["Test your aim! Test your aim!"]="Prova seu puntería! Prova seu puntería!"
G["Test your might!"]="Coloque a prova sua força!"
G["Test your skill, win a prize!"]="Prova suas habilidades, ganha um prêmio!"
G["Test."]="Test."
