G["Testing, testing, 1, 2, 7. Can you hear me $p? I have deployed Scout-o-meters in the field to gather data for the Siege-o-Matic here. This should help with a proper and mostly non-lethal test of my Siege-o-Matic."]="Testing, testing, 1, 2, 7. Can you hear me $p? I have deployed Scout-o-meters in the field to gather data for the Siege-o-Matic here. This should help with a proper and mostly non-lethal test of my Siege-o-Matic."
G["Testing..."]="Dando..."
G["Tests?  What kind of tests?"]="Provas? Que classe de provas?"
G["Tether-footbomb!"]="Bombalón prisioneiro!"
G["Th-there's no way, sir! The current... it's too strong!"]="Th-there's no way, sir! The current... it's too strong!"
G["Th... thank you."]="G... Obrigado."
G["Th... thank you.  I thought I was going to die."]="Gr... Obrigado. Pensei que ia a morrer."
G["Tha Darkspear are 'ere because I led dem here.  Orgrimmar be no home as long as it be under Hellscream's hand."]="Tha Darkspear are 'ere because I led dem here.  Orgrimmar be no home as long as it be under Hellscream's hand."
G["Tha Darkspear shall never give in to ya kind, Zar'jira. We're stronga' than you'll eva' be."]="Tha Darkspear shall never give in to ya kind, Zar'jira. We're stronga' than you'll eva' be."
G["Tha Sea Witch is dead, our home is reclaimed, but our future still be uncertain."]="Tha Sea Witch is dead, our home is reclaimed, but our future still be uncertain."
G["Tha elements be crying out in rage. It ain't no coincidence dat da naga are here. Dey be wantin' someting."]="Os elementos estão chorando de raiva. Não é por acaso que os da naga estão aqui. Eles querem algo."
G["Tha naga and de Twilight Cult be workin' together, and dis be the focus of dey're efforts."]="Tha naga and de Twilight Cult be workin' together, and dis be the focus of dey're efforts."
G["Tha's the way we Wildhammer ... get hitched, it was. *hic* That were BEAUTIFUL!"]="Assim é como nos casamos... os Martelo Feroz, si. *hic* Foi PRECIOSO!"
G["Thaddius, built from the flesh of women and children, it is said that their souls are fused together - eternally bound within that foul prison of flesh."]="Thaddius, construído com a carne de mulheres e crianças, se diz que seus almas se têm fusionado, unidas eternamente no interior dessa nauseabunda prisão de carne."
G["Thalorien fell before the gates of the Sunwell, buying time for others to escape."]="Thalorien caiu às portões da Nascente do Sol, ganhando tempo para que os mais escaparan."
G["Thane Banahogg appears upon the overlook to the southeast!"]="Thane Banahogg appears upon the overlook to the southeast!"
G["Thane Banahogg returns to Valhalas for the first time in ages to prove that the vrykul are the only beings worthy to fight within its sacred ring.  Will $n prove him wrong?"]="O senhor feudal Banahogg retorna a Valhalas pela primeira vez desde há anos para demostrar que somente os vrykuls são dignos de lutar neste sagrado anel. Lhe demostrará $n que se equivoca?"
G["Thane Banahogg the Deathblow has fallen to $n and $g his : her; fighting companions.  $G He : She; has but one challenge ahead of $g him : her;.  Who will it be?"]="O senhor feudal Banahogg, a \"Arremetida mortal\", tem caído ante $n e seus companheiros de luta. Já somente lhe cai um desafio por linha de frente. Quem será?"
G["Thane Illskar, you were challenged to honorable combat and failed."]="Thane Illskar, you were challenged to honorable combat and failed."
G["Thane Torvald Eriksson's temperamental proto-drake is chained up here."]="O proto-drake temperamental de Thane Torvald Eriksson está acorrentado aqui."
G["Thane Ufrang the Mighty, I bear ill news. The Shadow Vault over the mountain to the east has fallen."]="Senhor feudal Ufrang o Poderoso, traigo mais notícia. A Câmera das Sombras da montanha do este tem caído."
G["Thank Shen-zin Su that you're here.  I could use your help!"]="Obrigado a Shen-zin Seu que está aqui. preciso da sua ajuda!"
G["Thank again, $n.  Now I'll just wait here until it's safe to leave."]="Thank again, $n.  Now I'll just wait here until it's safe to leave."
G["Thank da elements..."]="Obrigado aos elemento'...!"
G["Thank goodness for you!"]="Menos mal que te temos você!"
G["Thank goodness for you!  Claw and I were investigating this place when we were jumped by Swamplord Musel'ek.\n\nUnfortunately, Claw was caught in bear form at the time, and is now the swamplord's pet.\n\nI'm afraid you'll have to fight Claw in order to save him."]="Thank goodness for you!  Claw and I were investigating this place when we were jumped by Swamplord Musel'ek.\n\nUnfortunately, Claw was caught in bear form at the time, and is now the swamplord's pet.\n\nI'm afraid you'll have to fight Claw in order to save him."
G["Thank goodness you arrived when you did, heroes. Orgrim's Hammer has already left. Quickly now, to the Skybreaker! If you leave soon, you may be able to catch them."]="Thank goodness you arrived when you did, heroes. Orgrim's Hammer has already left. Quickly now, to the Skybreaker! If you leave soon, you may be able to catch them."
G["Thank goodness you came along when you did. Please, take one of these troll boxes to remember me by."]="Thank goodness you came along when you did. Please, take one of these troll boxes to remember me by."
G["Thank goodness you got here, it was almost dinner time!"]="Thank goodness you got here, it was almost dinner time!"
G["Thank goodness you recovered the brew, $n! Since our work is done for the day, I'd say it's time to start drinking!"]="Menos mal que tem recuperei a cerveja, $n! Já que temos terminou nosso trabalho de hoje, eu digo que empecemos a beber!"
G["Thank goodness you're here!  Toss that fishing pole and help us out!"]="Menos mal que está aqui! Tira essa canha de pescar e ayúdanos!"
G["Thank goodness!"]="Menos mal!"
G["Thank goodness! I was worried they were going to press me into service in their war against the stone giants!"]="Thank goodness! I was worried they were going to press me into service in their war against the stone giants!"
G["Thank goodness, you look like a capable $c with some brains."]="Menos mal, pareces $gun: uma; $c bastante capaz e com algo de cérebro."
G["Thank heavens!  It's so good to see...  Why are your pants on backwards?"]="Graças ao céu! fico feliz tanto de ver... Por que veste os calças ao revés?"
G["Thank the Earth Mother!"]="Obrigado mãe terra!"
G["Thank the Light for granting me another chance. And thank you, $n."]="Thank the Light for granting me another chance. And thank you, $n."
G["Thank the Light for seeing you here safely! We have much work to do if we are to defeat the Lich King and put an end to the Scourge."]="Obrigado à Luz que estão a salvou! Temos muito trabalho que fazer se queremos derrotar ao Rei Lich e colocar fim a o Flagelo."
G["Thank the Light for that."]="Obrigado à Luz."
G["Thank the Light for you!"]="Agradeça a luz por você!"
G["Thank the Light the Defias don't know the first thing about diving!"]="Graças à luz, os Défias não sabem a primeira coisa sobre mergulho!"
G["Thank the Light you're here! Get your sword out, there's centaur on my tail!"]="Obrigado à Luz que está aqui! Tira seu lâmina, há um centauro na minha cauda!"
G["Thank the Light you're here, $n.  Something has gone horribly wrong and our leader is killing everyone!"]="Obrigado à Luz que tem vindo, $n. Tem passado algo terrível. Nosso líder está matando a tudo o mundo!"
G["Thank the Light!"]="Thank the Light!"
G["Thank the Light! I'll never do anything this foolish again!"]="Obrigado à Luz! Mais voltarei a fazer algo tão insensato!"
G["Thank the Light! I'm parched!"]="Obrigado à Luz! Estou morto de sede!"
G["Thank the Light! I'm saved!"]="Obrigado à Luz! Estou salvou!"
G["Thank the Light! I've made it."]="Obrigado à Luz! O temos conseguido."
G["Thank the Light, $n, my leg is completely healed!"]="Obrigado à Luz, $n, meu perna se tem curado por completo."
G["Thank the heavens... I thought the secrets of Firebough Stout would die with me. Help me out of here, friend!"]="Thank the heavens... I thought the secrets of Firebough Stout would die with me. Help me out of here, friend!"
G["Thank the laws of physics you're here!"]="Thank the laws of physics you're here!"
G["Thank the light that Bertha's not here..."]="Obrigado à Luz que Bertha não está aqui..."
G["Thank the light you are here! I'd accept help from a two-headed ogre at this point.\nThe city has been overrun by troggs! The attempts to wipe them out resulted in mass contamination. But there is still hope.\nOur scientists who evacuated to Ironforge are working on a cure for the fallout sickness. Meanwhile, if you can help me stop the trogg invasion, perhaps the city can be retaken."]="Thank the light you are here! I'd accept help from a two-headed ogre at this point.\nThe city has been overrun by troggs! The attempts to wipe them out resulted in mass contamination. But there is still hope.\nOur scientists who evacuated to Ironforge are working on a cure for the fallout sickness. Meanwhile, if you can help me stop the trogg invasion, perhaps the city can be retaken."
G["Thank the sea, stranger! I can get back to Sri-La village on my own."]="Thank the sea, stranger! I can get back to Sri-La village on my own."
G["Thank the spirits for you, brothers and sisters. The Skybreaker has already left. Quickly now, to Orgrim's Hammer! If you leave soon, you may be able to catch them."]="Thank the spirits for you, brothers and sisters. The Skybreaker has already left. Quickly now, to Orgrim's Hammer! If you leave soon, you may be able to catch them."
G["Thank the spirits!  The blizzard will slow down the kvadir ships!"]="Thank the spirits!  The blizzard will slow down the kvadir ships!"
G["Thank the stars!  Now turn around so I can put them on."]="Thank the stars!  Now turn around so I can put them on."
G["Thank the waves, you're back! The others have already retreated, we need to get out of here!"]="Thank the waves, you're back! The others have already retreated, we need to get out of here!"
G["Thank ya for aidin' us in our battle."]="Thank ya for aidin' us in our battle."
G["Thank ya for your guidance, spirits."]="Thank ya for your guidance, spirits."
G["Thank ya, scout. Keep up da patrols. But for now, a rest is in order. Dismissed."]="Obrigado, explorador. Seguirás patrulhando, mas agora deve descansar. Retírate."
G["Thank ya, scout. Tell de builders dey be needed on de isles. De Darkspears be home again!"]="Thank ya, scout. Tell de builders dey be needed on de isles. De Darkspears be home again!"
G["Thank ye for saving me, $p! I owe ya a big one."]="Thank ye for saving me, $p! I owe ya a big one."
G["Thank ye!"]="Obrigado"
G["Thank ye, $G lad:lass;. Thank ye, greatly."]="Thank ye, $G lad:lass;. Thank ye, greatly."
G["Thank you $g mister : miss; for finding my necklace!  You're the best!"]="Obrigado, $gsenhor: senhorita; por encontrar meu colar! É o melhor!"
G["Thank you - both of you. The Red Crane has always symbolized hope to our people, but in his absence I fear that even my thoughts began to darken."]="Thank you - both of you. The Red Crane has always symbolized hope to our people, but in his absence I fear that even my thoughts began to darken."
G["Thank you - this was turning into a massacre..."]="Obrigado. Isto se estava transformando em uma massacre..."
G["Thank you Elders. We will not dissapoint you."]="Obrigado, ancestrais. Não os decepcionaremos."
G["Thank you Nablya."]="Obrigado, Nablya."
G["Thank you again for helping Nida, $g mister : miss;!  When I grow up, I wanna be a hero just like you!"]="Obrigado novamente por ajudar a Nida, $gsenhor: senhorita;! Quando crezca quero ser um herói igual que você!"
G["Thank you again for replenishing our healing crystals.  I hear that you're helping out all over the place.  Keep up the good work!"]="Obrigado novamente por reabastecer nossos cristais de cura. Ouvi dizer que você está ajudando em tudo o lugar. Mantenha o bom trabalho!"
G["Thank you again for your aid, $n. Our children have returned safe, and your enemies have turned tail.\n\nAs far as I'm concerned, you and your Horde are always welcome here in Pandaria."]="Thank you again for your aid, $n. Our children have returned safe, and your enemies have turned tail.\n\nAs far as I'm concerned, you and your Horde are always welcome here in Pandaria."
G["Thank you again for your aid. May the wind always be at your back during your travels."]="Obrigado novamente pela sua ajuda. Que o vento sempre sople aos seus costas durante seus viagens."
G["Thank you again for your help, stranger. I have already begun to think of ideas on the ring I shall craft for Syra's hand."]="Thank you again for your help, stranger. I have already begun to think of ideas on the ring I shall craft for Syra's hand."
G["Thank you again for your help. I will remain here briefly, to help tend the wounded.\n\nThen I will be making my way north..."]="Thank you again for your help. I will remain here briefly, to help tend the wounded.\n\nThen I will be making my way north..."
G["Thank you again, $n, for helping me to uncover what happened here at the thicket."]="Obrigado novamente, $n, por me ajudar a descobrir o que passou no mata."
G["Thank you again, $n, for this delectable incense."]="Obrigado novamente, $n, por este delicioso incenso."
G["Thank you again, $n.  This rare earth will be very helpful in my experiments."]="Obrigado novamente, $n. Esta estranha terra me resultará muito útil para meus experimentos."
G["Thank you again, $n. I'll make my way to the road now. When you can, find Terenthis and let him know we escaped."]="Thank you again, $n. I'll make my way to the road now. When you can, find Terenthis and let him know we escaped."
G["Thank you again, Terenthis. I shall return again if more help is needed. Until then, please send more adventurers to Ashenvale"]="Obrigado novamente, Terenthis. Voltarei se preciso de mais ajuda. Até então e, por favor, envia mais aventureiros a Valhefresno."
G["Thank you again, friend. We will remember your name in our people's history."]="Obrigado novamente, $gamigo: amiga;. Recordaremos seu nome na história de nosso povo."
G["Thank you again.  I will return to Razor Hill now."]="Obrigado novamente. Agora voltarei a Cerrotajo."
G["Thank you all for attending this sermon. It's wonderful to see so many familiar faces!"]="Thank you all for attending this sermon. It's wonderful to see so many familiar faces!"
G["Thank you all for coming tonight.  Now put your hands together to welcome Shattrath's best, Perry Gatner!"]="Obrigado a todos por vir. E agora, um grande aplauso de boas-vindas para o melhor de Shattrath, Perry Gatner!"
G["Thank you and farewell, friend. I must return to the Argent Vanguard."]="Obrigado e adeus, $gamigo: amiga;. E de voltar à Vanguarda Argêntea."
G["Thank you everyone!  And keep clapping, there is a fly in here and one of you are bound to get it!  Good night!"]="Thank you everyone!  And keep clapping, there is a fly in here and one of you are bound to get it!  Good night!"
G["Thank you for agreeing to help. Now, let's get out of here, $n!"]="Obrigado por emprestar sua ajuda. E agora, vamos de aqui, $n!"
G["Thank you for all that you have done for us.  May you rest in peace."]="Obrigado por tudo o que fez por nós. Que descanses em paz."
G["Thank you for allowing me to speak, A'dal. I know many of your allies despise me and my knights for our treatment of M'uru."]="Thank you for allowing me to speak, A'dal. I know many of your allies despise me and my knights for our treatment of M'uru."
G["Thank you for allowing me to visit, $n.  You have a very colorful soul, but it's a little brighter than I prefer... or I might have stayed longer!"]="Thank you for allowing me to visit, $n.  You have a very colorful soul, but it's a little brighter than I prefer... or I might have stayed longer!"
G["Thank you for becoming my next victim!"]="Thank you for becoming my next victim!"
G["Thank you for breaking me out of here!"]="Thank you for breaking me out of here!"
G["Thank you for bringing back Yi-Mo.\n\nIt's clear to me now that we can no longer ignore our duties in the province."]="Thank you for bringing back Yi-Mo.\n\nIt's clear to me now that we can no longer ignore our duties in the province."
G["Thank you for bringing me here to see my friend, Hch'uu!"]="Thank you for bringing me here to see my friend, Hch'uu!"
G["Thank you for bringing my driver back, friend."]="Thank you for bringing my driver back, friend."
G["Thank you for checking in with me, $c. We now have all of the thorium bars that we'll need, but you may want to ask some of the others here that are in charge of different collection efforts."]="Thank you for checking in with me, $c. We now have all of the thorium bars that we'll need, but you may want to ask some of the others here that are in charge of different collection efforts."
G["Thank you for choosing the Bank of Silvermoon. What may I do for you today?"]="Obrigado por escolher o Bank of Silvermoon. O que posso fazer por você hoje?"
G["Thank you for clearing out those foolish senators.  Now prepare to meet your doom at the hands of Ragnaros' most powerful servant."]="Thank you for clearing out those foolish senators.  Now prepare to meet your doom at the hands of Ragnaros' most powerful servant."
G["Thank you for coming here in remembrance of me.  Your efforts in recovering that symbol, while unnecessary, are certainly touching to an old man's heart."]="Thank you for coming here in remembrance of me.  Your efforts in recovering that symbol, while unnecessary, are certainly touching to an old man's heart."
G["Thank you for coming so quickly, $n."]="Obrigado por vir tão rápido, $n."
G["Thank you for coming, everyone!"]="Obrigado a todos por vir!"
G["Thank you for delivering that list!  My leg is almost recovered enough that I'll be able to walk back to the crash site."]="Obrigado por entregar essa pronta! Minha perna está quase recuperada o suficiente para poder voltar ao local do acidente."
G["Thank you for doing this, $r. I... I think I know how to get back to my father. Please don't let the bad things hurt me."]="Obrigado por fazer isto, $r. Acho... acho que sei chegar de volta até meu pai. Por favor, não deixe que as coisas mais me façam dano."
G["Thank you for freeing Thrall, $n. He's been missed.\n\n<Aggra looks over at the Warchief.>"]="Thank you for freeing Thrall, $n. He's been missed.\n\n<Aggra looks over at the Warchief.>"
G["Thank you for freeing me of that horrible burden."]="Thank you for freeing me of that horrible burden."
G["Thank you for freeing me!"]="Thank you for freeing me!"
G["Thank you for freeing me! May the tides always favor you."]="Thank you for freeing me! May the tides always favor you."
G["Thank you for freeing me, $Gbrother:sister;. I cannot let you fight alone."]="Thank you for freeing me, $Gbrother:sister;. I cannot let you fight alone."
G["Thank you for freeing me, $Gbrother:sister;. I could not have survived another day of the yaungol's cruelty."]="Thank you for freeing me, $Gbrother:sister;. I could not have survived another day of the yaungol's cruelty."
G["Thank you for freeing me, $n! I'm going to make my way to Shattrath!"]="Thank you for freeing me, $n! I'm going to make my way to Shattrath!"
G["Thank you for freeing me, $n. Now let's get out of here!"]="Thank you for freeing me, $n. Now let's get out of here!"
G["Thank you for freeing me, my brother, and all of you! We can finally rest in peace now."]="Thank you for freeing me, my brother, and all of you! We can finally rest in peace now."
G["Thank you for freeing me, my sister, and all of you! We can finally rest in peace now."]="Thank you for freeing me, my sister, and all of you! We can finally rest in peace now."
G["Thank you for freeing me.  Speak with my sister in Splintertree.  I... I must find a place to rest..."]="Thank you for freeing me.  Speak with my sister in Splintertree.  I... I must find a place to rest..."
G["Thank you for freeing me. I thought I was done for."]="Thank you for freeing me. I thought I was done for."
G["Thank you for freeing us, mortals.  Beware, the blue flight is alerted to your presence.  Even now, Malygos sends Varos Cloudstrider and his ring guardians to defend the Oculus.  You will need our help to stand a chance."]="Thank you for freeing us, mortals.  Beware, the blue flight is alerted to your presence.  Even now, Malygos sends Varos Cloudstrider and his ring guardians to defend the Oculus.  You will need our help to stand a chance."
G["Thank you for getting me out of there!"]="Thank you for getting me out of there!"
G["Thank you for helping Thrall escape, friends. Now I only hope you can help me as well. I awoke this morning to find myself trapped in this magical prison. A strange wizard told me that I would have to stay here for a while."]="Obrigado por ajudar Thrall a escapar, amigos. Agora só espero que você possa me ajudar. Acordei esta manhã e me vi preso nessa prisão mágica. Um mago estranho disse para mim que eu teria que ficar aqui por um tempo."
G["Thank you for helping me end the great mistake I made long ago, that led our people into this dark place. I could not do it alone. Let me regain my honor, and end Garrosh's reign of terror once and for all."]="Thank you for helping me end the great mistake I made long ago, that led our people into this dark place. I could not do it alone. Let me regain my honor, and end Garrosh's reign of terror once and for all."
G["Thank you for helping me to get back to the camp. Go tell Walter that I'm safe now!"]="Obrigado por me ajudar a voltar ao acampamento. Vê e diga a Walter que já estou a salvou!"
G["Thank you for helping me. I know my way back from here."]="Obrigado por me ajudar. Posso seguir sozinha a partir de aqui."
G["Thank you for helping us and for helping Jim. If you see him, tell him little Jimmy and I love him and that we're waiting for him."]="Obrigado por nos ajudar e por ajudar a Jim. Se lhe vê, diga que o pequeno Jimmy e eu lhe queremos e que lhe estamos esperando."
G["Thank you for helping us with the flasks."]="Obrigado por nos ajudar com os frascos."
G["Thank you for helping us, $n."]="Obrigado por nos ajudar, $n."
G["Thank you for making the journey here. I hope you will find Silvermoon to your liking."]="Obrigado por haver vindo até aqui. Espero que te guste Luaprata."
G["Thank you for opening my eyes to who my daughter really is."]="Thank you for opening my eyes to who my daughter really is."
G["Thank you for opening the gates for us, $p. You honor us with your presence."]="Thank you for opening the gates for us, $p. You honor us with your presence."
G["Thank you for purifying the armaments yourself, $n. I have much to do and very little time to do it in."]="Obrigado por purificar o armamentos seu mesmo, $n. Tenho muito que fazer e muito pouco tempo."
G["Thank you for reminding me that I must train more diligently."]="Thank you for reminding me that I must train more diligently."
G["Thank you for rescue! Meet me at Burlap Waystation."]="Thank you for rescue! Meet me at Burlap Waystation."
G["Thank you for rescuing me stranger! I will see you at the Yakwash."]="Thank you for rescuing me stranger! I will see you at the Yakwash."
G["Thank you for rescuing me! Word of your deed will not go unnoticed."]="Thank you for rescuing me! Word of your deed will not go unnoticed."
G["Thank you for rescuing me, $n. I will never forget your courage and determination."]="Thank you for rescuing me, $n. I will never forget your courage and determination."
G["Thank you for rescuing me, $r. Please tell the king that I am back."]="Thank you for rescuing me, $r. Please tell the king that I am back."
G["Thank you for rescuing me, but the others are still held on the tiers above!"]="Thank you for rescuing me, but the others are still held on the tiers above!"
G["Thank you for rescuing me, now please aid the rest of my brood!"]="Thank you for rescuing me, now please aid the rest of my brood!"
G["Thank you for rescuing me. For the Alliance!"]="Thank you for rescuing me. For the Alliance!"
G["Thank you for rescuing me. I simply hate being a yucky frog!"]="Thank you for rescuing me. I simply hate being a yucky frog!"
G["Thank you for rescuing the king... and the prince, $n."]="Obrigado por resgate ao Rei... E ao príncipe, $n."
G["Thank you for rescuing us, $c. Hopefully now our mission will not be lost."]="Thank you for rescuing us, $c. Hopefully now our mission will not be lost."
G["Thank you for returning Wolf."]="Obrigado por retornar Wolf."
G["Thank you for saving me from that nightmare. I wanted to rip everything apart!"]="Thank you for saving me from that nightmare. I wanted to rip everything apart!"
