G["Thank you for saving me!"]="Thank you for saving me!"
G["Thank you for saving me!\n\nI'm a cook and an alchemist from Stormwind.  I was here looking for local herbs and recipes for my uncle Angus when these quilboar captured me.  If you hadn't come around, I'm sure I'd have ended up in their stew pot!"]="Thank you for saving me!\n\nI'm a cook and an alchemist from Stormwind.  I was here looking for local herbs and recipes for my uncle Angus when these quilboar captured me.  If you hadn't come around, I'm sure I'd have ended up in their stew pot!"
G["Thank you for saving me! But don't tell Ferli, ok? I said I busted out on my own!"]="Obrigado por me salvar! Mas não conte a Ferli, ok? Eu disse que saí sozinho!"
G["Thank you for saving me, $g Mr. : Ms.; $n."]="Thank you for saving me, $g Mr. : Ms.; $n."
G["Thank you for saving me, $n! My father will be delighted!"]="Thank you for saving me, $n! My father will be delighted!"
G["Thank you for saving me, $n. This is the least that I could do to return the favor. Hold on tight. Here we go."]="Thank you for saving me, $n. This is the least that I could do to return the favor. Hold on tight. Here we go."
G["Thank you for saving me, soldier. You too, young prince."]="Thank you for saving me, soldier. You too, young prince."
G["Thank you for saving me, stranger."]="Thank you for saving me, stranger."
G["Thank you for saving me. I'll make my way back to Orgrimmar once I recover a bit."]="Thank you for saving me. I'll make my way back to Orgrimmar once I recover a bit."
G["Thank you for saving my life and bringing me back to safety, $n!"]="Thank you for saving my life and bringing me back to safety, $n!"
G["Thank you for saving my life!"]="Thank you for saving my life!"
G["Thank you for saving my life."]="Thank you for saving my life."
G["Thank you for saving my life. I owe you a debt of gratitude."]="Thank you for saving my life. I owe you a debt of gratitude."
G["Thank you for saving us. We accidentally uncovered the pieces of Gearmaster Mechazod and reassembled him."]="Thank you for saving us. We accidentally uncovered the pieces of Gearmaster Mechazod and reassembled him."
G["Thank you for speaking to the men, Almonen. They'll be better for it."]="Obrigado por falar com os homens, Almonen. Serão melhores Graças ao que lhes tem dito."
G["Thank you for taking care of the lake, the lashers and the owlkin, $c."]="Thank you for taking care of the lake, the lashers and the owlkin, $c."
G["Thank you for taking the time to help us test the Cataclysm content for World of Warcraft. \nWhere would you like to go?"]="Thank you for taking the time to help us test the Cataclysm content for World of Warcraft. \nWhere would you like to go?"
G["Thank you for that. Now let's take down that wall!"]="Obrigado. Agora a derrubar essa muralha!"
G["Thank you for that... It was humbling to be served in such a manner."]="Obrigado por isso... Foi humilhante ser servido dessa forma."
G["Thank you for the armor scraps, $n!"]="Obrigado pelos restos de armadura, $n!"
G["Thank you for the blessing, $n."]="Obrigado pela bênção, $n."
G["Thank you for the gifts. Let us see if you are worthy, $c!"]="Thank you for the gifts. Let us see if you are worthy, $c!"
G["Thank you for the help. I'll go help with the wound."]="Obrigado pela sua ajuda. Irei a dar uma mão com a ferida."
G["Thank you for the inquiry, $c, but as you can see, I already have all of the linen bandages that the Alliance feels is necessary in preparation for the war at Ahn'Qiraj. Don't let that stop you from helping out with the other collections going on here though."]="Thank you for the inquiry, $c, but as you can see, I already have all of the linen bandages that the Alliance feels is necessary in preparation for the war at Ahn'Qiraj. Don't let that stop you from helping out with the other collections going on here though."
G["Thank you for the invitation, Lord Fordring. We look forward to observing these games."]="Obrigado pela invitação, Lorde Vadín. Temos ganha de ver esses jogos."
G["Thank you for the masks, $n. Be at peace and take this blessing as a token of our thanks."]="Obrigado pelas máscaras, $n. Vê em paz e leve-se esta bênção como mostra de nosso agradecimento."
G["Thank you for the offer, $c.  Unfortunately you are not yet experienced enough to weather the hazards of Arathi Basin."]="Thank you for the offer, $c.  Unfortunately you are not yet experienced enough to weather the hazards of Arathi Basin."
G["Thank you for the opportunity of getting beaten up by you."]="Thank you for the opportunity of getting beaten up by you."
G["Thank you for the opportunity to demonstrate my skills."]="Agradeço pela oportunidade de demonstrar minhas habilidades."
G["Thank you for the opportunity. I shall report to Vol'jin with your regards."]="Thank you for the opportunity. I shall report to Vol'jin with your regards."
G["Thank you for the spores, $n.  They are now prepared for transport."]="Obrigado pelas esporos, $n. Já estão prontas para o transporte."
G["Thank you for the summon, little one. My group left for the dungeon without me!"]="Obrigado pela evocação, pequeno. Meu grupo se tem ido à Masmorra sem mim!"
G["Thank you for the supplies, $n."]="Obrigado pelos suprimentos, $n."
G["Thank you for the timely rescue, hero."]="Thank you for the timely rescue, hero."
G["Thank you for the warning, $n. We will prepare our defenses."]="Obrigado pelo aviso, $n. Prepararemos nossas defesas."
G["Thank you for the warning. Be safe."]="Obrigado pelo aviso. Cuídate."
G["Thank you for these badges, $n.  I will send news to the families of the deceased."]="Thank you for these badges, $n.  I will send news to the families of the deceased."
G["Thank you for thinking of a lonely old man, $n."]="Obrigado por pensar em um velho solitário, $n."
G["Thank you for this report, $n.  It is now clear that we must tighten our patrols near Theramore."]="Obrigado pelo relatório, $n. Está claro que temos que aumentar nossas patrulhas perto de Theramore."
G["Thank you for trying, my friends. We'll unlock its secrets. Hopefully before it's too late."]="Obrigado por tentar, amigos meus. Desvelaremos seus segredos. Espero que antes de que seja tarde demais."
G["Thank you for watching, everyone! If you'd be so kind as to bring your non-irradiated currency to tomorrow's performance, I'd appreciate it."]="Thank you for watching, everyone! If you'd be so kind as to bring your non-irradiated currency to tomorrow's performance, I'd appreciate it."
G["Thank you for what you have done, $n.\n\nKeep the scepter safe; may it aid you in your toil against the evils that have invaded this place..."]="Obrigado pelo que fez, $n.\n\nProteger o cetro. Que te ajude no seu luta contra o mal que tem invadido este lugar..."
G["Thank you for your aid in this desperate time, $n.  May the Light grant you speed and strength in the face of darkness."]="Obrigado pela sua ajuda em estes tempos desesperados, $n. Que a Luz te conceda força e velocidade ante a escuridão."
G["Thank you for your assistance, $n. As the leader of the blood elves, it is my duty to protect my people. It is not a responsibility to be taken lightly."]="Obrigado pela sua ajuda, $n. Como líder dos elfos de sangue, é meu dever proteção a meu povo. Tamanha responsabilidade não se tome à leve."
G["Thank you for your assistance, $n. You have helped me enough for today. I shall seek you at Domination Point if I have further need of you."]="Thank you for your assistance, $n. You have helped me enough for today. I shall seek you at Domination Point if I have further need of you."
G["Thank you for your counsel. I will meditate on it deeply."]="Thank you for your counsel. I will meditate on it deeply."
G["Thank you for your hard work and dedication. Unpaid overtime is approved for all!"]="Obrigado pelo seu trabalho e sua dedicação. horas extra não remuneradas para todos!"
G["Thank you for your help - these notes are important to my studies. Your people value knowledge too, yes? I assume so, only because you arrived on a great airship."]="Thank you for your help - these notes are important to my studies. Your people value knowledge too, yes? I assume so, only because you arrived on a great airship."
G["Thank you for your help in making the salve, $n. Once it's had a chance to dull the pain, I'm going to see how far I can get on this leg."]="Thank you for your help in making the salve, $n. Once it's had a chance to dull the pain, I'm going to see how far I can get on this leg."
G["Thank you for your help, $n! These woods may never be safe from the evils that once dwelled here, but I feel better knowing that heroes like you are helping me keep watch."]="Thank you for your help, $n! These woods may never be safe from the evils that once dwelled here, but I feel better knowing that heroes like you are helping me keep watch."
G["Thank you for your help, $n.  These frostberries are literally the fruits of your labor."]="Obrigado pela sua ajuda, $n. Estes gelifructus são, literalmente, o fruto do seu trabalho."
G["Thank you for your help, $n. I wish you well in your adventures."]="Obrigado pela sua ajuda, $n. Que tenha sorte nos seus aventuras."
G["Thank you for your help, $n. My daggers will cut through many enemies."]="Thank you for your help, $n. My daggers will cut through many enemies."
G["Thank you for your help, $p. We may not have made the best brew, but we had quite an adventure."]="Obrigado pela sua ajuda, $p. Talvez não tenhamos feito a melhor cerveja, mas ao menos temos vivido uma grande aventura."
G["Thank you for your help, adventurer.  We will assist you as best we can in fending off the mogu."]="Obrigado pela ajuda. Vamos ajudar você a rechaçar os mogus o máximo que pudermos."
G["Thank you for your help, friend. I'll take it from here."]="Obrigado pela sua ajuda, $gamigo meu: amiga minha;. Eu me encargo do resto."
G["Thank you for your help."]="Obrigado pela sua ajuda."
G["Thank you for your help. I'll make sure this Honeybrew gets back to the village. Try not to blow anything else up!"]="Obrigado pela sua ajuda. Me garantirei de que a birramiel volta à aldeia. Tenta não voar nada mais!"
G["Thank you for your help. Try not to blow anything else up!"]="Obrigado pela sua ajuda. Tenta não voar nada mais!"
G["Thank you for your help. You can find me at the Argent Vanguard if you require anything further."]="Thank you for your help. You can find me at the Argent Vanguard if you require anything further."
G["Thank you for your hospitality, Mayor. I assure you: you're doing the right thing."]="Muitas Obrigado pelo seu hospitalidade. Te garanto que estão fazendo o correto."
G["Thank you for your hospitality."]="Obrigado pelo seu hospitalidade."
G["Thank you for your inquiry, $c, but we have all of the spotted yellowtail necessary. There are others here though that may still be gathering materiel for the upcoming war. Seek them out, and may the goddess shine upon you."]="Thank you for your inquiry, $c, but we have all of the spotted yellowtail necessary. There are others here though that may still be gathering materiel for the upcoming war. Seek them out, and may the goddess shine upon you."
G["Thank you for your time, Lady Prestor."]="Obrigado pelo seu tempo, Lady Prestor."
G["Thank you for your time. I hope you will reconsider training me in the future."]="Thank you for your time. I hope you will reconsider training me in the future."
G["Thank you for your training, $n. I hope to one day be as good a fighter as you!"]="Thank you for your training, $n. I hope to one day be as good a fighter as you!"
G["Thank you friends, I owe my freedom to you. Where is Taretha? I hoped to see her one last time and thank her before leaving into the mountains."]="Obrigado amigos, devo minha liberdade a você. Onde fica Taretha? Eu esperava vê-a uma última vez e agradecer antes de sair para as montanhas."
G["Thank you kindly!"]="Thank you kindly!"
G["Thank you my friend for making this possible.  This is a day that I shall never forget!  I think I will stay a while.  Please return to High Priestess MacDonnell at the camp.  I know that she'll be keenly interested to know of what has transpired here."]="Thank you my friend for making this possible.  This is a day that I shall never forget!  I think I will stay a while.  Please return to High Priestess MacDonnell at the camp.  I know that she'll be keenly interested to know of what has transpired here."
G["Thank you sergeant.  You may return to your post."]="Obrigado, sargento. Pode voltar ao seu posto."
G["Thank you sir, though I cannot accept your praise without acknowledging the assistance of our guest, Emissary Mordin."]="Obrigado, senhor, mas não posso aceitar seus louvores sem antes admitir a ajuda de nosso convidou, o Emissário Mordin."
G["Thank you so much $p!"]="Muitas Obrigado, $p!"
G["Thank you so much $p! If you find me in Dawn's Blossom later I'll give you one of the things we stashed from our adventures."]="Thank you so much $p! If you find me in Dawn's Blossom later I'll give you one of the things we stashed from our adventures."
G["Thank you so much for the lovely gift, $n. Cats are my favorite!"]="Muitas Obrigado por este maravilhoso presente, $n. Os gatos são meus favoritos!"
G["Thank you so much!"]="Thank you so much!"
