G["Thank you, $c! Back to the fight!"]="Obrigado, $c! De volta à batalha!"
G["Thank you, $c, for seeing to it that I received the letter from my brother.\n\nRest assured, his death will not have been in vain. The blue dragonflight will pay for this.\n\nI'll see to it personally!"]="Thank you, $c, for seeing to it that I received the letter from my brother.\n\nRest assured, his death will not have been in vain. The blue dragonflight will pay for this.\n\nI'll see to it personally!"
