G["Thank you, $p. You fight well for one not of our order. I can handle the rest from here."]="Thank you, $p. You fight well for one not of our order. I can handle the rest from here."
G["Thank you, $p. You have saved us all."]="$p, Muitas Obrigado. Nos salvou a todos."
G["Thank you, $r!"]="Obrigado, $r!"
G["Thank you, $r! I feel the tide of battle turning in our favor. You have gained us a moment's respite, $n."]="Thank you, $r! I feel the tide of battle turning in our favor. You have gained us a moment's respite, $n."
G["Thank you, $r! Your service to the Mag'har will not be forgotten."]="Thank you, $r! Your service to the Mag'har will not be forgotten."
G["Thank you, $r."]="Obrigado, $r."
G["Thank you, $r.\n\nYou saved me from certain death."]="Obrigado, $r.\n\nMe salvou de uma morte certa."
G["Thank you, $r. I can find my way back on my own."]="Obrigado, $r. Basta que ninguém me ajuda voltar."
G["Thank you, $r. I shall not forget your kindness."]="Obrigado, $r. Não esquecerei seu amabilidade."
G["Thank you, $r. I will join your struggle against the stormforged."]="Thank you, $r. I will join your struggle against the stormforged."
G["Thank you, $r. I will take this miserable cur from you now."]="Thank you, $r. I will take this miserable cur from you now."
G["Thank you, $r. It would be my honor to fight at your side."]="Obrigado, $r. Seria tudo uma honra lutar ao seu lado."
G["Thank you, $r. Without your help I would have become one of them!"]="Obrigado, $r. Sem sua ajuda me haveria convertido em um dos eles!"
