G["That Duke Studlington's a jerk.  He talks a big game, but can barely lift his own sword.  Oh, and yeah that's not his real name, as I'm sure you guessed."]="That Duke Studlington's a jerk.  He talks a big game, but can barely lift his own sword.  Oh, and yeah that's not his real name, as I'm sure you guessed."
