G["That Jormund Stonebrow has a knack for the needle, he does.  Should you be needing some training, then you'll find him at Stonebrow's Clothier on the northern side of The Great Forge."]="Que Jormund Stonebrow tem um talento especial para a agulha, ele tem. Se precisar de algum treinamento, você o encontrará no Clothon de Stonebrow, no lado norte da Grande Forja."
G["That Kel'Thuzad is nothing but a troublemaker. If he keeps it up he'll get himself in hot water again."]="That Kel'Thuzad is nothing but a troublemaker. If he keeps it up he'll get himself in hot water again."
G["That Lumak... always fishing instead of fighting.  You'll find him out on his dock on the lake in the Valley of Honor.  While you're there say hi to Shankys for me."]="Aquele Lumak... sempre pescando em vez de lutar. Você o encontrará na sua doca no lago no Vale da Honra. Enquanto estiver lá, diga oi para Shankys por mim."
G["That Malfurion... fitting of him to send his $r underling to speak with me.\n\nHe has proven himself a coward, as always."]="Esse Malfurion... É tão próprio de ele mandar ao seu lacaio $r para falar comigo.\n\nTem mostrou ser um covarde, como sempre."
G["That Saurok's making off with our loot, get him!"]="That Saurok's making off with our loot, get him!"
