G["That is what these structures that litter the landscape are called. The Legion have employed the mo'arg and gan'arg to build weapons of mass destruction at these mobile forge camps. Let us not find out what it is that they intend to build here in Nagrand!\n\nYou will be my eyes. Your weapons will be my fury."]="That is what these structures that litter the landscape are called. The Legion have employed the mo'arg and gan'arg to build weapons of mass destruction at these mobile forge camps. Let us not find out what it is that they intend to build here in Nagrand!\n\nYou will be my eyes. Your weapons will be my fury."
G["That is where the skull of Gul'dan is being kept! These paltry demons will not prevent me from claiming it!"]="That is where the skull of Gul'dan is being kept! These paltry demons will not prevent me from claiming it!"
G["That is where you are wrong, Garrosh."]="É aí que você se engana, Garrosh."
G["That is where you come in, heroes. The war for Stratholme is not yet over. Leave this area and travel east to the Eastwall Gate. It is the service entrance to the city, and the last remaining opening into Lord Aurius Rivendare's scourge-infested domain. If we defeat him, Stratholme will be ours once more."]="That is where you come in, heroes. The war for Stratholme is not yet over. Leave this area and travel east to the Eastwall Gate. It is the service entrance to the city, and the last remaining opening into Lord Aurius Rivendare's scourge-infested domain. If we defeat him, Stratholme will be ours once more."
G["That is wonderous, Rimblat! Even this foul, sundered earth is not beyond healing."]="That is wonderous, Rimblat! Even this foul, sundered earth is not beyond healing."
