G["That's why you're here, $n. The egg was hidden here at the Vermillion Redoubt. Days ago, it disappeared.\n\nWhoever did it was able to elude our sharpest guards. One of the thieves was killed during the abduction, although now I believe he may have been a diversion - the egg is simply GONE.\n\nOn his corpse we found this note. It remains our only clue, but it is written in a dense code and it MUST be deciphered."]="That's why you're here, $n. The egg was hidden here at the Vermillion Redoubt. Days ago, it disappeared.\n\nWhoever did it was able to elude our sharpest guards. One of the thieves was killed during the abduction, although now I believe he may have been a diversion - the egg is simply GONE.\n\nOn his corpse we found this note. It remains our only clue, but it is written in a dense code and it MUST be deciphered."
