G["The Alliance has gone through some dramatic changes since I last walked among its citizens in the time of the Third War. Some good and some...\n\n<Broll glances forlornly at Valeera.>\n\n...that could have been regrettably avoided.\n\nWith all the focus on the Burning Legion and their attacks on Azeroth, the Scourge has grown into a formidable force. The Legion's corruption and Scourge's defilement of the land are one and the same: an aberration of the natural order that must end."]="The Alliance has gone through some dramatic changes since I last walked among its citizens in the time of the Third War. Some good and some...\n\n<Broll glances forlornly at Valeera.>\n\n...that could have been regrettably avoided.\n\nWith all the focus on the Burning Legion and their attacks on Azeroth, the Scourge has grown into a formidable force. The Legion's corruption and Scourge's defilement of the land are one and the same: an aberration of the natural order that must end."
