G["The Alliance requires your strength $R! Core Materials and Demon Materials can be claimed by Heroes willing to venture into High-Risk to obtain them.\n\nWhile in High-Risk, you can obtain these materials and choose the risk you are willing to take with Tiered Zones.\n\nTier 1 Zones: Un'goro Crater, Burning Steppes and Azshara. You will only drop items from your bags.\n\nTier 2 Zones: Western and Eastern Plaguelands. You will drop items from your bag, equipped items or Felcom gold if your items are insured.\n\nTier 3 Zones: Silithus and Winterspring. You will drop items from your bag and equipped items. Felcom costs 3 times more."]="The Alliance requires your strength $R! Core Materials and Demon Materials can be claimed by Heroes willing to venture into High-Risk to obtain them.\n\nWhile in High-Risk, you can obtain these materials and choose the risk you are willing to take with Tiered Zones.\n\nTier 1 Zones: Un'goro Crater, Burning Steppes and Azshara. You will only drop items from your bags.\n\nTier 2 Zones: Western and Eastern Plaguelands. You will drop items from your bag, equipped items or Felcom gold if your items are insured.\n\nTier 3 Zones: Silithus and Winterspring. You will drop items from your bag and equipped items. Felcom costs 3 times more."
G["The Alliance sends gnomes and dwarves against us? Is this some kind of joke?!"]="A Aliança envia gnomos e anões contra nós? É uma broma?"
G["The Alliance spectators cheer for $n."]="The Alliance spectators cheer for $n."
G["The Alliance steams in close formation without escort."]="A Aliança entrar em formação cerrada e sem escolta."
G["The Alliance team is running out of reinforcements!"]="O equipamento da Aliança se você está quedando sem reforços!"
G["The Alliance tower was destroyed!"]="A torre da Aliança foi destruído!"
G["The Alliance towers have fallen! We have forced their hand. Finish off the remaining forces!"]="The Alliance towers have fallen! We have forced their hand. Finish off the remaining forces!"
G["The Alliance will never recover from the blow that we are about to deal them!"]="The Alliance will never recover from the blow that we are about to deal them!"
G["The Alliance will not be allowed to scar this land!"]="Não permitiremos que a Aliança profane esta terra!"
G["The Alliance wins!"]="A Aliança ganha!"
G["The Alliance? If the crashed ship is theirs, we need to contact them. Jojo, would you come with me?"]="The Alliance? If the crashed ship is theirs, we need to contact them. Jojo, would you come with me?"
G["The Altar of Kros is sacred ground, $gbrother:sister;. Watch where you tread when you're on my beach."]="O altar de Kros é um lugar sagrado, $ghermano: irmã;. Cuidado com o que está fazendo na minha praia."
G["The Amber Monstrosity readies an |cFFFF0000|Hspell:122398|h[Amber Explosion]|h|r!"]="The Amber Monstrosity readies an |cFFFF0000|Hspell:122398|h[Amber Explosion]|h|r!"
G["The Amberwing is flying in, watch out!"]="O alacárabe se aproxima! Cuidado!"
G["The Ancient Gate of the Keepers unlocks!"]="A Porta Antiga dos Guardiões se abra!"
G["The Ancient Guardians are coming back.  Cenarius, Aviana, Goldrinn... I can feel their presence.  We must make sure we usher them into this world.  Their timely aid will be indispensable."]="The Ancient Guardians are coming back.  Cenarius, Aviana, Goldrinn... I can feel their presence.  We must make sure we usher them into this world.  Their timely aid will be indispensable."
G["The Ancient Mogu Machine breaks down! |cFFFF0000|Hspell:116779|h[Titan Gas]|h|r floods the room!"]="A Antiga Máquina Mogu se quebra! |cFFFF0000|Hspell:116779|h[Gas Titã]|h|r invada salão!"
G["The Ancient Mogu Machine goes into overdrive! |cFFFF0000|Hspell:116779|h[Titan Gas]|h|r floods the room!"]="A Antiga Máquina Mogu se sobrecarga! |cFFFF0000|Hspell:116779|h[Gas Titã]|h|r invada salão!"
G["The Anglers Wharf in southeastern Krasarang Wilds is home to the most avid of all fisherman this side of Pandaria.\n\nIf you love the reward of a day spent with the great sea, I urge you to honor us with your presence."]="The Anglers Wharf in southeastern Krasarang Wilds is home to the most avid of all fisherman this side of Pandaria.\n\nIf you love the reward of a day spent with the great sea, I urge you to honor us with your presence."
G["The Anglers over at Sri-La village are reporting an unusually high number of Reef Octopi at their village. I'd wager that it's spawning season, but who knows? \n \n The problem is, that the increased octopus influx is damaging the shellfish population... and everyone knows the real money is in shellfish. \n \n Dangle your bobber there for a minute or two, I bet you'd walk away with swarms of those octopi."]="The Anglers over at Sri-La village are reporting an unusually high number of Reef Octopi at their village. I'd wager that it's spawning season, but who knows? \n \n The problem is, that the increased octopus influx is damaging the shellfish population... and everyone knows the real money is in shellfish. \n \n Dangle your bobber there for a minute or two, I bet you'd walk away with swarms of those octopi."
G["The Annihilan are incredibly destructive creatures. Their sheer strength and power is absolutely unrivaled."]="Os Aniquilan são criaturas incrivelmente destrutivas. Sua força e poder sem tamanho são inigualáveis."
G["The Anti-Air Rockets should be perfect for taking down those air transports to get at the extra pyrite."]="The Anti-Air Rockets should be perfect for taking down those air transports to get at the extra pyrite."
G["The Anub'ar have destroyed the %s!"]="Os Anub'ar têm destruído o %s!"
G["The Apexis Monument looms above you."]="O Monumento Apexis aparece acima de você."
G["The Apexis Relic shimmers, betraying a hidden intelligence within."]="A Apexis Relic brilha, traindo uma inteligência oculta por dentro."
G["The Apothecary Society researches to find a cure against the plague of the Lich King.."]="The Apothecary Society researches to find a cure against the plague of the Lich King.."
G["The Arcane Storage Unit begins to overload. Step back!"]="The Arcane Storage Unit begins to overload. Step back!"
G["The Arch Druid approached the dragons for their blessings, as the dragons had placed on Nordrassil in ancient times."]="The Arch Druid approached the dragons for their blessings, as the dragons had placed on Nordrassil in ancient times."
G["The Arch Druid believes that Ivus the Forest Lord will come once he is made aware of the destructive forces within this valley."]="O Arch Druid acredita que Ivus, o Lorde da Floresta, virá assim que pegar conhecimento das forças destrutivas dentro deste vale."
G["The Arch Druid... how in the world...?"]="O arquidruida... como demônios...?"
G["The Archonisus Gate is no more! The way to the Sunwell is clear!"]="A porta Archonisus já não existe! O caminho até a Nascente do Sol está abriu!"
G["The Arena battle ends in 60 seconds."]="A batalha de arena acaba em 60 segundos."
G["The Arena battle ends in sixty seconds."]="The Arena battle ends in sixty seconds."
G["The Arena battle has begun!"]="A batalha de arena tem começado!"
G["The Arena battlemasters are in the southeast lower city, along the wall."]="Os mestres de batalha da Arena estão na cidade baixa do sudeste, ao longo do muralha."
G["The Argent Crusade and the Knights of the Ebon Blade have assaulted the gates of the Icecrown Citadel and are preparing for a massive attack upon the Scourge. Our mission is a bit more subtle, but equally as important."]="The Argent Crusade and the Knights of the Ebon Blade have assaulted the gates of the Icecrown Citadel and are preparing for a massive attack upon the Scourge. Our mission is a bit more subtle, but equally as important."
G["The Argent Crusade can wait for us a little while longer.  Besides... our guest may want to get off the caravan soon."]="The Argent Crusade can wait for us a little while longer.  Besides... our guest may want to get off the caravan soon."
G["The Argent Crusade comes for you, Arthas!"]="A Cruzada Argêntea vai por você, Arthas!"
G["The Argent Crusade invites you to test your skills in honorable combat against other heroes of Azeroth at the Argent Tournament."]="A Cruzada Argêntea te convida a que comece a prova suas habilidades em honrado combate contra outros heróis de Azeroth no Torneio Argêntea."
G["The Argent Crusade is here in force, friend. We weren't going to let you have all the glory!"]="A Cruzada Argent está aqui em vigor, amigo. Nós não vamos deixar você ter toda a glória!"
G["The Argent Crusade never surrenders!"]="A Cruzada Argêntea nunca se rinde!"
G["The Argent Crusade riders believe in balance and precision, deftly mixing attack and defense.\n\nHowever, they will often open themselves to Charges by trying to gain range on you.\n\nClose that range with a Charge before they can do the same, and then Shield-Break them as you wheel around for more Thrusts."]="The Argent Crusade riders believe in balance and precision, deftly mixing attack and defense.\n\nHowever, they will often open themselves to Charges by trying to gain range on you.\n\nClose that range with a Charge before they can do the same, and then Shield-Break them as you wheel around for more Thrusts."
G["The Argent Crusade salutes you, $c!  The name's Lightspark, and I'm an authorized equipment and materiel quartermaster for the Crusade.\n\nAs you fight evil under our commission - all the while earning our respect and trust - you'll earn valor tokens from Officer Pureheart.  Tokens serve two purposes: use them to gain increased standing within our ranks, or use them as tender in acquiring special items.\n\nAs you improve your standing with the Crusade, you'll discover that more items will be made available to you."]="The Argent Crusade salutes you, $c!  The name's Lightspark, and I'm an authorized equipment and materiel quartermaster for the Crusade.\n\nAs you fight evil under our commission - all the while earning our respect and trust - you'll earn valor tokens from Officer Pureheart.  Tokens serve two purposes: use them to gain increased standing within our ranks, or use them as tender in acquiring special items.\n\nAs you improve your standing with the Crusade, you'll discover that more items will be made available to you."
G["The Argent Crusade stands behind you."]="The Argent Crusade stands behind you."
G["The Argent Dawn and the Order of the Silver Hand will come together as one! We will succeed where so many before us have failed!"]="The Argent Dawn and the Order of the Silver Hand will come together as one! We will succeed where so many before us have failed!"
G["The Argent Dawn coordinates the Scourge's opposition at Light's Hope Chapel in the Eastern Plaguelands.  Go there for instructions."]="O Amanhecer Argent coordena a oposição do Flagelo na Capela da Esperança da Luz, nas Terras Pestilentas Orientais. Vá lá para obter instruções."
G["The Argent Dawn dogs will be consumed by the shadow of the Scourge!"]="The Argent Dawn dogs will be consumed by the shadow of the Scourge!"
G["The Argent Dawn is finished!"]="O Alba Argêntea está acabada!"
G["The Argent Dawn might be impotent idealists but their delusional leader knows that they are outmatched. I have been sent here as an emissary of the Scarlet Crusade. An ambassador, if you will... It is doubtful that we could even dent the armies of Kel'Thuzad - united or not - but we might be able to contain them long enough for some sort of miracle to happen.\n\nAs for me? I'll die in battle...\n\n<Marjhan shrugs.>"]="The Argent Dawn might be impotent idealists but their delusional leader knows that they are outmatched. I have been sent here as an emissary of the Scarlet Crusade. An ambassador, if you will... It is doubtful that we could even dent the armies of Kel'Thuzad - united or not - but we might be able to contain them long enough for some sort of miracle to happen.\n\nAs for me? I'll die in battle...\n\n<Marjhan shrugs.>"
G["The Argent Dawn salutes you, $c.  I am Hasana - one of but a few authorized equipment and materiel quartermasters for the Dawn.\n\nAs you fight evil under our commission - all the while earning our respect and trust - you'll earn valor tokens from Officer Garush.  Tokens serve two purposes: use them to gain increased standing within our ranks, or use them as tender in acquiring special items.\n\nAs you improve your standing with the Dawn, you'll discover that more items will be made available to you."]="The Argent Dawn salutes you, $c.  I am Hasana - one of but a few authorized equipment and materiel quartermasters for the Dawn.\n\nAs you fight evil under our commission - all the while earning our respect and trust - you'll earn valor tokens from Officer Garush.  Tokens serve two purposes: use them to gain increased standing within our ranks, or use them as tender in acquiring special items.\n\nAs you improve your standing with the Dawn, you'll discover that more items will be made available to you."
G["The Argent Dawn will fight until the end!"]="O Alba Argêntea luchará até o fim!"
G["The Argent Dawn's agents scored a decisive victory in the deserts of Tanaris."]="Os agentes do Alba Argêntea têm conseguido uma vitória decisiva no Deserto de Tanaris."
G["The Argent Tournament has begun in the northern reaches of Icecrown, $c. If you've yet to find your way there, I can pay your way.\n\nThe more we have participating in the melee, the stronger we'll be when we strike against the Lich King."]="The Argent Tournament has begun in the northern reaches of Icecrown, $c. If you've yet to find your way there, I can pay your way.\n\nThe more we have participating in the melee, the stronger we'll be when we strike against the Lich King."
G["The Arsenal Absolute in southeast Dalaran carries all manner of melee weapons."]="O Arsenal Absolute, no sudeste de Dalaran, carrega todos os tipos de armas brancas."
G["The Ash'ari Crystals have been destroyed! The Slaughterhouse is vulnerable!"]="The Ash'ari Crystals have been destroyed! The Slaughterhouse is vulnerable!"
G["The Ashbringer is dead and there will never be another like him. The lesser Mograine is a far cry from the man his father was. You know this, Commander! It was, after all, your own leadership that was responsible for the death of the Scarlet Highlord Mograine."]="The Ashbringer is dead and there will never be another like him. The lesser Mograine is a far cry from the man his father was. You know this, Commander! It was, after all, your own leadership that was responsible for the death of the Scarlet Highlord Mograine."
G["The Ashbringer..."]="The Ashbringer..."
G["The Ashen Verdict is a select group of the most talented craftsmen in the Ebon Blade and Argent Crusade. Its creation symbolizes the unity of our forces as we mount this final assault on the Lich King and his minions.\n\nIt is through the Ashen Verdict's efforts that we have discovered how to bend primordial saronite to our will."]="The Ashen Verdict is a select group of the most talented craftsmen in the Ebon Blade and Argent Crusade. Its creation symbolizes the unity of our forces as we mount this final assault on the Lich King and his minions.\n\nIt is through the Ashen Verdict's efforts that we have discovered how to bend primordial saronite to our will."
G["The Aspects believe it will. And they should know..."]="Os Aspectos acreditam que si. E eles devem saber..."
G["The Aspects have already gathered and await your arrival. Go now!"]="The Aspects have already gathered and await your arrival. Go now!"
G["The Aspects misplaced their trust."]="The Aspects misplaced their trust."
G["The Assistant Resort Director doesn't like to see us taking breaks. We don't like to see him, either."]="The Assistant Resort Director doesn't like to see us taking breaks. We don't like to see him, either."
G["The Assurance has somehow become inundated with bugs and we are unable to set sail to Northrend."]="De alguma forma, a Garantia ficou inundada de insetos e não podemos zarpar para Northrend."
G["The August Celestials quartermaster can be found here in the Vale. Sage Lotusbloom stands with the other faction representatives, in the lower section of The Golden Terrace.\n\nI will mark her location on your map."]="The August Celestials quartermaster can be found here in the Vale. Sage Lotusbloom stands with the other faction representatives, in the lower section of The Golden Terrace.\n\nI will mark her location on your map."
G["The August Celestials quartermaster can be found here in the Vale. Sage Lotusbloom stands with the other faction representatives, in the lower section of The Golden Terrace.\n\nI will mark his location on your map."]="The August Celestials quartermaster can be found here in the Vale. Sage Lotusbloom stands with the other faction representatives, in the lower section of The Golden Terrace.\n\nI will mark his location on your map."
G["The August Celestials quartermaster can be found here in the Vale. Sage Lotusbloom stands with the other faction representatives, in the lower section of The Summer Terrace.\n\nI will mark her location on your map."]="The August Celestials quartermaster can be found here in the Vale. Sage Lotusbloom stands with the other faction representatives, in the lower section of The Summer Terrace.\n\nI will mark her location on your map."
