G["The Bank of Silvermoon can be found within the Bazaar. Seek it out in the southeast corner."]="O Bank of Silvermoon pode ser encontrado dentro do Bazar. Procure no canto sudeste."
G["The Banshee Queen has plans for you!"]="A Rainha alma em pena tem planos para você!"
G["The Banshee Queen has plans for you, human."]="A Rainha alma em pena tem planos para você, humano."
G["The Banshee Queen sees all."]="The Banshee Queen sees all."
G["The Barleybrews have always been leaders in brewery innovation.  Check out our newest creation, Barleybrew Clear!"]="The Barleybrews have always been leaders in brewery innovation.  Check out our newest creation, Barleybrew Clear!"
G["The Barov house sure does keep me busy. Always some sort of refuse coming out of there."]="A casa dos Barov certamente me mantém ocupado. Sempre algum tipo de recusa saindo de lá."
G["The Barrens ... will ... devour you, $r."]="The Barrens ... will ... devour you, $r."
G["The Barrens may be dry, but these plains once teemed with life. We roamed, we hunted, and we lived off the land.\n\nThen the Alliance came... slashing, burning, killing. We call these the Fields of Blood now, $c.\n\nThe refugees have all fled. Those who remain behind remain to fight."]="The Barrens may be dry, but these plains once teemed with life. We roamed, we hunted, and we lived off the land.\n\nThen the Alliance came... slashing, burning, killing. We call these the Fields of Blood now, $c.\n\nThe refugees have all fled. Those who remain behind remain to fight."
G["The Barrens, with its hot sun and hostile denizens, is the perfect place to test your strength and fortitude."]="O Barrens, com o seu sol quente e habitantes hostis, é o lugar perfeito para testar sua força e fortaleza."
G["The Bash'ir crystalforge can be used to transform your apexis shards into unstable flasks of the sorcerer.  These flasks make the imbiber more intelligent, heartier, and increase the effectiveness of their damaging and healing magics.\n\nIt appears, however, that you do not have the requisite ten shards to purchase even a single flask."]="A forja de cristal Bash'ir pode ser usada para transformar seus fragmentos de ápices em frascos instáveis do feiticeiro. Estes frascos voltam ao que os bebe mais ágil e feliz e aumentam a efectividade dos seus feitiços de ataque e cura.\n\nNo entanto, parece que não tem os 10 fragmentos necessários para comprar um frasco."
G["The Bash'ir crystalforge can be used to transform your apexis shards into unstable flasks of the sorcerer.  These flasks make the imbiber more intelligent, heartier, and increase the effectiveness of their damaging and healing magics.\n\nMake your choice, below."]="A forja de cristal Bash'ir pode ser usada para transformar seus fragmentos de ápices em frascos instáveis do feiticeiro. Estes frascos voltam ao que os bebe mais ágil e feliz e aumentam a efectividade dos seus feitiços de ataque e cura.\n\nElige debaixo."
G["The Battle Helm of the Thunder King..."]="O elmo de combate do Rei do Trovão..."
G["The Battle for Gilneas"]="A Batalha por Guilnéas"
G["The Battle for Gilneas City is underway!  You can head to the frontlines or wait until our men regroup for the next attack."]="A batalha pela cidade de Gilneas está em andamento! Você pode ir para a linha de linha de frente ou esperar até que nossos homens se reagrupem para o próximo ataque."
G["The Battle for Gilneas is about to begin."]="A Batalha por Guilnéas está a ponto de começar."
G["The Battle for Lake Wintergrasp is about to begin!"]="A batalha pelo lago Invérnia vai começar!"
G["The Battle of Mount Hyjal is one of the most well-guarded events of this timeline.  Should an intruder alter its outcome, the impact would extend to all subsequent moments in history.\n\nAs the Aspect's prime mate I'm far more in tune with the flow of time than other bronze dragons.  I recently sensed a minute ripple in time emanating from the events surrounding the Battle of Mount Hyjal.  Someone or something is attempting to change this timeline and they must be stopped."]="The Battle of Mount Hyjal is one of the most well-guarded events of this timeline.  Should an intruder alter its outcome, the impact would extend to all subsequent moments in history.\n\nAs the Aspect's prime mate I'm far more in tune with the flow of time than other bronze dragons.  I recently sensed a minute ripple in time emanating from the events surrounding the Battle of Mount Hyjal.  Someone or something is attempting to change this timeline and they must be stopped."
G["The Battlegrounds are full of eager competitors today."]="Os campos de batalha estão cheios de competidores ansiosos hoje."
G["The Battlescar is a dangerous place. All the armor in the world can't save a steam tank that's swallowed up by the earth."]="O carro de guerra é um lugar perigoso. Toda a armadura do mundo não pode salvar um tanque de vapor que é engolido pela terra."
G["The Beard-Sprite will make an excellent addition to my family!"]="O duende barbado será uma adquisição excelente para meu família!"
G["The Bell... speaks with the voice of the gods..."]="A sino... fala com a voz dos deuses..."
G["The Bellmaster is right over there. I heard he turns kids into bells!"]="The Bellmaster is right over there. I heard he turns kids into bells!"
G["The Betrayer hasn't been the most predictable of foes, Exarch.  I have no fear however, with the Light on our side we shall defeat his forces today, tomorrow, or whenever he chooses to attack."]="The Betrayer hasn't been the most predictable of foes, Exarch.  I have no fear however, with the Light on our side we shall defeat his forces today, tomorrow, or whenever he chooses to attack."
G["The Betrayer no longer holds sway over us.  His dark magic over the Ashtongue soul has been destroyed!"]="The Betrayer no longer holds sway over us.  His dark magic over the Ashtongue soul has been destroyed!"
G["The Betrayer was freed from his prison, and Shand'do Stormrage disappeared into the emerald dream."]="The Betrayer was freed from his prison, and Shand'do Stormrage disappeared into the emerald dream."
G["The Bile-O-Tron signals in the affirmative and shuts down permanently."]="O Bilistrón há sinais afirmativas e se apaga de forma permanente."
G["The Bile-O-Tron springs to life and begins to emit a foul smelling substance."]="O Bilistrón se ativa e começa a emitir uma sustância de cheiro asqueroso."
G["The Bilgewater Cartel has grown too large. Time to downsize!"]="The Bilgewater Cartel has grown too large. Time to downsize!"
G["The Bilgewater Cartel thanks you for your frequent future purchases!"]="The Bilgewater Cartel thanks you for your frequent future purchases!"
G["The Bilgewater Cartel will be in business here by the end of the day, mark my words."]="O Cartel de Bilgewater estará em operação até o fim do dia, marque minhas palavras."
G["The Binan fishermen could catch a greased hozen in their nets while blindfolded, $n. Surely they could snare a few yaungol for us. Talk to them about helping us defend the village!"]="The Binan fishermen could catch a greased hozen in their nets while blindfolded, $n. Surely they could snare a few yaungol for us. Talk to them about helping us defend the village!"
G["The Bishop moves diagonally!"]="O alfil se move em diagonal!"
G["The Black Bishop's shields dissipate as the wretched traitor breathes his last."]="The Black Bishop's shields dissipate as the wretched traitor breathes his last."
G["The Black Feather Quill is located down the ramp in the lower section of the southern chamber."]="O canhão de pluma negra se encontre ao descer a rampa na seção inferior da câmera sul."
G["The Black Knight has been defeated!"]="The Black Knight has been defeated!"
G["The Black dragonkin materialized from thin air, and set upon us before we could react."]="The Black dragonkin materialized from thin air, and set upon us before we could react."
G["The Blackhand legion shall wear your skin as fashion accessories!"]="A legião Punho Negro utilizará seu pele para se fingir uns bonitos complementos!"
G["The Blackrock forces are panicking!  Strike at them now!"]="The Blackrock forces are panicking!  Strike at them now!"
G["The Blackrock infestation is thick in these parts.  I will do my best to keep the pace.  Let's go!"]="The Blackrock infestation is thick in these parts.  I will do my best to keep the pace.  Let's go!"
G["The Blackrock orcs are my kin.  My father was a Blackrock, as was his father before him.  My mother was a Blackrock.  And I am a Blackrock.\n\nBut before anything else, I am an orc.  And that means honor above all else.\n\nMy Highlord has granted me leave to complete my task here in the Burning Steppes.  And I will not leave until the Blackrock orcs here learn the error of their ways."]="The Blackrock orcs are my kin.  My father was a Blackrock, as was his father before him.  My mother was a Blackrock.  And I am a Blackrock.\n\nBut before anything else, I am an orc.  And that means honor above all else.\n\nMy Highlord has granted me leave to complete my task here in the Burning Steppes.  And I will not leave until the Blackrock orcs here learn the error of their ways."
G["The Blackrock orcs blew up the bridge leading to Stonewatch Keep. Frontal assault is out of the question."]="The Blackrock orcs blew up the bridge leading to Stonewatch Keep. Frontal assault is out of the question."
G["The Blackwood tribe is disrupting our sacred lands."]="A tribo Floresta Negro perturba nossa terra sagrado."
G["The Blackwood tribe must not be permitted to interfere with the progress of nature."]="Não devemos permitir que a tribo Floresta Negro interfiera com o progresso da natureza."
G["The Blade's Edge Mountains are a place of great opportunity.  How unfortunate that some deem themselves above all others on matters that pertain to taking advantage of such opportunities.\n\nWho do the Cenarion Expedition think they are to tell us what we can and cannot do here?"]="The Blade's Edge Mountains are a place of great opportunity.  How unfortunate that some deem themselves above all others on matters that pertain to taking advantage of such opportunities.\n\nWho do the Cenarion Expedition think they are to tell us what we can and cannot do here?"
G["The Blastenheimer 5000 Ultra Cannon is a state-of-the-art single person projectile device.\n\nDelivering its payload at near the speed of a dragon, the cannon is the pride and joy of the Blastenheimer family, world renowned for their aeronautical and combustible feats!\n\nIf you'd like to be launched through the skies to fly free as a bird, seek out Maxima Blastenheimer."]="The Blastenheimer 5000 Ultra Cannon is a state-of-the-art single person projectile device.\n\nDelivering its payload at near the speed of a dragon, the cannon is the pride and joy of the Blastenheimer family, world renowned for their aeronautical and combustible feats!\n\nIf you'd like to be launched through the skies to fly free as a bird, seek out Maxima Blastenheimer."
G["The Blastenheimer 5000 Ultra Cannon is a state-of-the-art single person projectile device. Delivering its payload at near the speed of a dragon, the cannon is the pride and joy of the Blastenheimer family, world renown for their aeronautical and combustible feats!\n\nIf you'd like to be launched through the skies to fly free as a bird, seek out Maxima Blastenheimer in the Terrace of Light in Shattrath City. She'll aim you at a target in a small pond outside the city walls!"]="The Blastenheimer 5000 Ultra Cannon is a state-of-the-art single person projectile device. Delivering its payload at near the speed of a dragon, the cannon is the pride and joy of the Blastenheimer family, world renown for their aeronautical and combustible feats!\n\nIf you'd like to be launched through the skies to fly free as a bird, seek out Maxima Blastenheimer in the Terrace of Light in Shattrath City. She'll aim you at a target in a small pond outside the city walls!"
G["The Blastenheimer 5000 Ultra Cannon is a state-of-the-art single person projectile device. Delivering its payload at near the speed of a dragon, the cannon is the pride and joy of the Blastenheimer family, world renown for their aeronautical and combustible feats!\n\nIf you'd like to be launched through the skies to fly free as a bird, seek out Maxima Blastenheimer on the east end of the faire. I hear that she's placed a target ring way over on Crystal Lake for you to aim for as you sail through the air!"]="The Blastenheimer 5000 Ultra Cannon is a state-of-the-art single person projectile device. Delivering its payload at near the speed of a dragon, the cannon is the pride and joy of the Blastenheimer family, world renown for their aeronautical and combustible feats!\n\nIf you'd like to be launched through the skies to fly free as a bird, seek out Maxima Blastenheimer on the east end of the faire. I hear that she's placed a target ring way over on Crystal Lake for you to aim for as you sail through the air!"
G["The Blastenheimer 5000 Ultra Cannon is a state-of-the-art single person projectile device. Delivering its payload at near the speed of a dragon, the cannon is the pride and joy of the Blastenheimer family, world renown for their aeronautical and combustible feats!\n\nIf you'd like to be launched through the skies to fly free as a bird, seek out Maxima Blastenheimer on the south edge of Thunder Bluff's central rise. She'll aim you at the target far to south on Stonebull Lake!"]="The Blastenheimer 5000 Ultra Cannon is a state-of-the-art single person projectile device. Delivering its payload at near the speed of a dragon, the cannon is the pride and joy of the Blastenheimer family, world renown for their aeronautical and combustible feats!\n\nIf you'd like to be launched through the skies to fly free as a bird, seek out Maxima Blastenheimer on the south edge of Thunder Bluff's central rise. She'll aim you at the target far to south on Stonebull Lake!"
G["The Blessed Banner of the Crusade has been planted.\nDefend the banner from all attackers!"]="O estandarde da Cruzada abençoado foi clavado.\nDefiendo estandarte dos atacantes!"
G["The Blessed Banner of the Crusade is destroyed!\nThe Scourge are victorious!"]="O estandarde da Cruzada abençoado está destruído!\nA Praga derrotou!"
G["The Blight Slimes are beginning to react negatively towards your prodding."]="The Blight Slimes are beginning to react negatively towards your prodding."
G["The Blight Slimes are getting ANGRY!"]="The Blight Slimes are getting ANGRY!"
G["The Blight Slimes want your blood!"]="As babosas de anhublo querem seu sangue!"
G["The Blood Furnace is a testament to the dark past of my people."]="A Fornalha de Sangue é uma prova do passado sombrio do meu povo."
G["The Blood God, the Soulflayer, has been defeated!  We are imperiled no longer!"]="O Deus da Sangue, o Caçador de Almas, foi derrotou! Já não corremos perigo!"
G["The Blood Knights in Farstriders' Square graciously allow space within their halls for Ileda, the weapon master of Silvermoon. While her training is not cheap, you'll appreciate her expertise."]="Os Cavaleiros de Sangue na Praça dos Farstriders permitem graciosamente espaço dentro dos seus salões para Ileda, o mestre em armas de Lua Prateada. Embora o treinamento dela não seja barato, você apreciará a experiência dela."
G["The Blood Prince should be very pleased with these..."]="The Blood Prince should be very pleased with these..."
G["The Bloodfang Berserkers begin to salivate heavily."]="The Bloodfang Berserkers begin to salivate heavily."
G["The Bloodfang come for you, worgen hunters!"]="Os Colmilho de Sangue vêm a por vocês, caçadores huargen!"
G["The Bloodfang will prevail."]="Os Presas de Sangue prevalecerão."
G["The Blue Rays reveal an Azure Fog!"]="The Blue Rays reveal an Azure Fog!"
G["The Bone Wastes!  I don't care what's being offered as a reward, I'm not going into the Bone Wastes!"]="O Ermo das Ossadas! Não quero saber o que me derem de recompensa. Eu não vou ao Ermo das Ossadas!"
G["The Branch of Nordrassil reacts violently to $n's touch!"]="The Branch of Nordrassil reacts violently to $n's touch!"
G["The Bravery's crew will do its best to make your journey as swift and pleasant as possible."]="A equipe do Bravery fará o possível para tornar sua jornada o mais rápida e agradável possível."
G["The Bravo Company, all present and accounted for..."]="The Bravo Company, all present and accounted for..."
G["The Brawler $ghimself:herself;: $n!\n\nYou here to beat up my monsters some more?"]="The Brawler $ghimself:herself;: $n!\n\nYou here to beat up my monsters some more?"
G["The Bright  Light reveals an Amber Fog!"]="A Luz brilhante revela uma névoa âmbar!"
G["The Broken Temple siege workshop has been attacked by the Alliance!"]="A Aliança atacou a Oficina de Cerco do Templo Quebrado!"
G["The Broken Temple siege workshop has been attacked by the Horde!"]="A Horda atacou a Oficina de Cerco do Templo Quebrado!"
G["The Broken Temple siege workshop has been captured by the Alliance!"]="A Oficina de Cerco do Templo Quebrado foi tomado pela Aliança!"
G["The Broken Temple siege workshop has been captured by the Horde!"]="A Oficina de Cerco do Templo Quebrado foi tomado pela Horda!"
G["The Brotherhood of the Light transcends the ability of any other group to eradicate affronts to the Light. We will take any actions necessary to rid the world of foul beasts like these undead. Nothing will stand in our way.\n\nAre you with us, or against us?"]="The Brotherhood of the Light transcends the ability of any other group to eradicate affronts to the Light. We will take any actions necessary to rid the world of foul beasts like these undead. Nothing will stand in our way.\n\nAre you with us, or against us?"
G["The Brotherhood shall prevail!"]="A Guilda se impondrá!"
G["The Brotherhood will not be hampered by insects."]="A guilda não tolerará insectos."
G["The Brotherhood will not tolerate your actions."]="A guilda não tolerará seus actos."
G["The Burning Blade sends its greetings."]="O Filo Ardente te manda seus saudações."
G["The Burning Blade? What are they doing here? Shoot to kill!"]="O Filo Ardente? Que fazem aqui? Dispara a matar!"
G["The Burning Inn."]="O Burning Inn."
G["The Burning Legion"]="A Legião Ardente"
G["The Burning Legion has returned! What can we do to stop them?"]="The Burning Legion has returned! What can we do to stop them?"
G["The Burning Legion presses us hard, but our defenses hold. Every moment we keep Archimonde away from the World Tree brings us closer to victory."]="A Legião Ardente nos pressiona com força, mas nossas defesas se mantêm. Cada momentos em que mantemos Archimonde longe da Árvore do Mundo, nos aproxima da vitória."
G["The Burning Legion. Demons. I see them as clearly as you can see your own hand in front of your face. That is, I used to be able to see them clearly.\n\nWith the Legion's return come new machinations. Under normal circumstances, I am able to sense the presence of a demon from a thousand paces.\n\n<Altruis grimaces.>"]="The Burning Legion. Demons. I see them as clearly as you can see your own hand in front of your face. That is, I used to be able to see them clearly.\n\nWith the Legion's return come new machinations. Under normal circumstances, I am able to sense the presence of a demon from a thousand paces.\n\n<Altruis grimaces.>"
G["The Burning Steppes is a dangerous place, but scholars like me will do almost anything to advance our knowledge."]="The Burning Steppes é um lugar perigoso, mas estudiosos como eu farão quase tudo para promover nosso conhecimento."
G["The Butcher of Taurajo will pay."]="O açougueiro de Taurajo pagará."
G["The Butcher would speak of 'the blood of innocents,' and his dark master, 'Kirtonos.' Of how he must appease his master.\n\nFinally, the beast was done with his experiments. We had been drained of all life. Our spirits shattered. The sweet embrace of death was upon us and we welcomed it with open arms. But in his infinite cruelty, the Butcher revived us from death's door.\n\nWe were to be kept alive and thrown to his ravenous ghouls. He laughed as he watched the fiends devour our flesh."]="The Butcher would speak of 'the blood of innocents,' and his dark master, 'Kirtonos.' Of how he must appease his master.\n\nFinally, the beast was done with his experiments. We had been drained of all life. Our spirits shattered. The sweet embrace of death was upon us and we welcomed it with open arms. But in his infinite cruelty, the Butcher revived us from death's door.\n\nWe were to be kept alive and thrown to his ravenous ghouls. He laughed as he watched the fiends devour our flesh."
G["The Cabal have threatened the innocent for far too long! The time for retribution has come!"]="The Cabal have threatened the innocent for far too long! The time for retribution has come!"
G["The Cabal will pay for their recklessness!"]="The Cabal will pay for their recklessness!"
G["The Captain is busy at the moment.  He's studying maps we recently acquired of the underground silithid hives.  Stay with us if you'd like to help, he'll come out any moment now."]="The Captain is busy at the moment.  He's studying maps we recently acquired of the underground silithid hives.  Stay with us if you'd like to help, he'll come out any moment now."
G["The Captain of the Guard upstairs, Hedric Evencane, should posses a key. Please, make haste. We do not have all night, you know!"]="The Captain of the Guard upstairs, Hedric Evencane, should posses a key. Please, make haste. We do not have all night, you know!"
G["The Captain's Log lies nearby."]="O Diário do Capitão jaz perto."
G["The Cataclysm crumbled the eastern mountains. The South Seas poured in and submerged all of Thousand Needles! Can you aid us in our time of need?"]="The Cataclysm crumbled the eastern mountains. The South Seas poured in and submerged all of Thousand Needles! Can you aid us in our time of need?"
G["The Cataclysm has destroyed Thousand Needles, $c. Will you help us in our greatest time of need?"]="O Cataclismo tem destruído As Mil Agulhas, $c. Nos ajudará em nosso momentos de maior necessidade?"
G["The Cataclysm has destroyed Thousand Needles. We need your help so that we can save as many lives as possible!"]="O Cataclismo tem destruído As Mil Agulhas. Precisa nos ajudar a superando tantas vidas como seja possível!"
G["The Cataclysm has destroyed the western mountains of Thousand Needles. The South Sea has rushed in and the canyons are flooded.\n\nPlease, $c, you must come to our aid at New Thalanaar!"]="The Cataclysm has destroyed the western mountains of Thousand Needles. The South Sea has rushed in and the canyons are flooded.\n\nPlease, $c, you must come to our aid at New Thalanaar!"
G["The Cataclysm has struck hardest in Thousand Needles. Please, can you lend us your aid?"]="The Cataclysm has struck hardest in Thousand Needles. Please, can you lend us your aid?"
G["The Cataclysm is only the beginning. Let the two-legs drown in a sea of their own blood!"]="The Cataclysm is only the beginning. Let the two-legs drown in a sea of their own blood!"
G["The Catacylsm has created chaos in Dun Morogh. The troggs have come to the surface in numbers we haven't seen before, driving our traditional enemies, the Frostmane trolls, ever closer to our settlements.\n\nIronforge has dispatched my mountaineer company to help deal with the problems."]="The Catacylsm has created chaos in Dun Morogh. The troggs have come to the surface in numbers we haven't seen before, driving our traditional enemies, the Frostmane trolls, ever closer to our settlements.\n\nIronforge has dispatched my mountaineer company to help deal with the problems."
G["The Cathedral District is under Stormwind Control again. The Light always prevails!"]="O Distrito da Catedral volta a estar sob o controle de Ventobravo. A Luz sempre prevalece!"
G["The Cathedral of Light in Cathedral Square is home to the priests of Stormwind. There you will find High Priestess Laurena."]="A Catedral da Luz, na Praça da Catedral, abriga os padres de Ventobravo. Lá você encontrará a Alta Sacerdotisa Laurena."
G["The Cathedral of Light is the center of all the healing practices of Stormwind. There you can find Angela Leifeld to help you learn this craft."]="A Catedral da Luz é o centro de todas as práticas de cura de Ventobravo. Lá você encontra Angela Leifeld para ajudá-o a aprender este ofício."
G["The Celestial Blacksmith is near death!"]="O Ferreiro Celestial está quase morrendo!"
G["The Celestial Defender is critically injured and is no longer able to fight!"]="O defensor celestial está gravemente ferido e já não pode lutar!"
G["The Celestial Defender is near death!"]="O Defensor Celestial está quase morrendo!"
G["The Celestial Defender manifests an area of |cFFFF2222|Hspell:140068|h[healing energy]|h|r!"]="O Defensor Celestial manifesta uma área de |cFFFF2222|Hspell:140068|h[energia curativa]|h|r!"
G["The Celestial Tournament is nearly as old as Pandaria itself.  Many have come to test their mettle.  Shall we test yours?"]="The Celestial Tournament is nearly as old as Pandaria itself.  Many have come to test their mettle.  Shall we test yours?"
G["The Celestial Tournament tests your leadership skills through pet battles with other contestants, and if you are successful enough, the children of the celestials."]="The Celestial Tournament tests your leadership skills through pet battles with other contestants, and if you are successful enough, the children of the celestials."
G["The Cenarion Circle been around a long time, mon. We trolls are newcomers to this party."]="O Círculo Cenariano existe há muito tempo, seg. Nós trolls somos recém-chegados a esta festa."
G["The Cenarion Circle is wise, and has delved into many of earth's secrets.  Craftsmen would do well to heed the words of these druids."]="O Círculo Cenariano é sábio e investigou muitos dos segredos da Terra. Os artesãos fariam bem em oferecer atenção às palavras desses druidas."
G["The Cenarion Expedition rescued me from certain death inside the mines. I owe them my life! I offer up my services of repair and reagent sales to those that are allies of the Cenarion Expedition."]="A Expedição Cenarion me resgatou de certa morte dentro das minas. Devo-lhes a minha vida! Ofereço meus serviços de reparo e vendas de reagentes para aqueles que são aliados da Expedição Cenarion."
G["The Center Rise has been reclaimed!  The Earthmother be praised!"]="The Center Rise has been reclaimed!  The Earthmother be praised!"
G["The Challenge begins!"]="Começao desafio!"
G["The Challenge has been completed!"]="Tem concluído o desafio!"
G["The Champions' Hall is located in the southeastern end of Old Town.\n\nThe Honor and Conquest quartermasters can be found there."]="The Champions' Hall is located in the southeastern end of Old Town.\n\nThe Honor and Conquest quartermasters can be found there."
G["The Cipher of Damnation belongs to us now!"]="Agora a Importante de Condenação nos pertence!"
G["The Cipher of Damnation was kept in Gul'dan's private quarters inside Karabor for twenty years. Ah, that's right, you have no idea what Karabor is, do you?\n\nThe Black Temple...\n\nAye, now home to Illidan Stormrage.\n\nWhen Illidan took control of the Black Temple, he discovered the cipher. He recognized that the damage to this world had already been done but thought it wise to keep the cipher secure for later use."]="The Cipher of Damnation was kept in Gul'dan's private quarters inside Karabor for twenty years. Ah, that's right, you have no idea what Karabor is, do you?\n\nThe Black Temple...\n\nAye, now home to Illidan Stormrage.\n\nWhen Illidan took control of the Black Temple, he discovered the cipher. He recognized that the damage to this world had already been done but thought it wise to keep the cipher secure for later use."
G["The Citadel, correct? Facing the Lich King's most powerful minions."]="The Citadel, correct? Facing the Lich King's most powerful minions."
G["The Coffer!? You wouldn't..."]="O baú!? Você não..."
G["The Coldtooth Mine is owned by the Alliance."]="A Mina Dentefrio pertence à Aliança."
G["The Coldtooth Mine is owned by the Horde."]="A Mina Dentefrio pertence à Horda."
G["The Coldtooth Mine is owned by the Kobolds."]="A Mina Dentefrio pertence aos kobolds."
G["The Coldtooth Mine lies in Horde territory, in the mountains north of the Frostwolf Graveyard.\n\nIt is controlled by the Alliance."]="A Mina Dentefrio se encontre em território da Horda, nas montanhas que estão ao norte do Cemitério Lobo Gelo.\n\nEstá controlada pela Aliança."
G["The Coldtooth Mine lies in Horde territory, in the mountains north of the Frostwolf Graveyard.\n\nIt is controlled by the Horde."]="A Mina Dentefrio está em território da Horda, nas montanhas ao norte do Cemitério Lobo Gelo.\n\nPertence à Horda."
G["The Coldtooth Mine lies in Horde territory, in the mountains north of the Frostwolf Graveyard.\n\nIt is controlled by the Kobolds."]="A Mina Dentefrio está em território da Horda, nas montanhas ao norte do Cemitério Lobo Gelo.\n\nPertence aos kobolds."
G["The Colossus burrows underground!"]="O colosso se mete baixo terra!"
G["The Commander has been slain! Charge their lines! Die with honor!"]="The Commander has been slain! Charge their lines! Die with honor!"
G["The Commander has not been himself as of late. His mistress disappeared while on an archaeological dig in the southern desert - vanished without a trace! Very strange, indeed.\n\nI suppose you're looking for work? Do I need to bash you in the head with a clue?"]="The Commander has not been himself as of late. His mistress disappeared while on an archaeological dig in the southern desert - vanished without a trace! Very strange, indeed.\n\nI suppose you're looking for work? Do I need to bash you in the head with a clue?"
G["The Commander will have the Alliance king's head on a spike!"]="O comandante levará a cabeça do rei da Aliança cravada em uma estaca!"
G["The Commons are secured!  Now, secure the rest of the city!"]="A Câmera do Povo está a salvou! Agora, devemos fazer o mesmo com o resto da cidade!"
G["The Conclave of Wind has dissipated. Your honorable conduct and determination have earned you the right to face me in battle, mortals. I await your assault on my platform! Come!"]="The Conclave of Wind has dissipated. Your honorable conduct and determination have earned you the right to face me in battle, mortals. I await your assault on my platform! Come!"
G["The Conclave of Wind is nearing full strength!"]="O Conclave do Vento está a ponto de alcançar sua força máxima!"
G["The Conduit is at full energy and Lei Shen disconnects!"]="The Conduit is at full energy and Lei Shen disconnects!"
G["The Conquest will sail into Ratchet harbor first. Noise is her aim: Double-shot the guns, sew havoc."]="The Conquest will sail into Ratchet harbor first. Noise is her aim: Double-shot the guns, sew havoc."
G["The Conservatory must be protected!"]="The Conservatory must be protected!"
G["The Consortium has been planning this operation for months!  We were to dig Oshu'gun, the largest known diamond in the universe.\n\nMinutes before we were to begin, Nexus-Prince Haramaad sends word that we're to hold off until a political matter is resolved in Netherstorm.  I've transformed our operation into a clearing house for smuggled gems in the meantime, but this is slowly eating into our profits."]="The Consortium has been planning this operation for months!  We were to dig Oshu'gun, the largest known diamond in the universe.\n\nMinutes before we were to begin, Nexus-Prince Haramaad sends word that we're to hold off until a political matter is resolved in Netherstorm.  I've transformed our operation into a clearing house for smuggled gems in the meantime, but this is slowly eating into our profits."
G["The Consortium will exact its revenge upon the Zaxxis betrayers!"]="O Consórcio vai se vingar dos traidores Zaxxis!"
G["The Corporal's a good man, but he's got tunnel-vision when it comes to his orders.\n\nSomething unnatural is happening to the land here, $n. This jungle shouldn't be here!"]="O cabo é um bom homem, mas tem uma visão limitada quando se trata de ordens.\n\nAlgo antinatural lhe acontece a esta terra, $n. Esta selva não deveria estar aqui!"
G["The Council of Duskwood must take action.  Evil lingers in the air."]="O Conselho da Floresta do Crepúsculo deve pegar medidas. O mal frota no ar."
G["The Crane Temple usually comes to our defense and keeps the raiders at bay. But lately they have been quiet."]="The Crane Temple usually comes to our defense and keeps the raiders at bay. But lately they have been quiet."
G["The Crazy Sapper activates the bomb strapped to its chest!"]="The Crazy Sapper activates the bomb strapped to its chest!"
G["The Creators are cognizant of the magnitude of the information housed in this repository.  Subsequently, a portable copy of the data stored here will be made available to you once you are attuned with the Discs of Norgannon.\n\nPlease consider your cursory requirements for the assimilation of this knowledge to be complete.  At your leisure, access the Discs of Norgannon to begin synthesis of your discs."]="The Creators are cognizant of the magnitude of the information housed in this repository.  Subsequently, a portable copy of the data stored here will be made available to you once you are attuned with the Discs of Norgannon.\n\nPlease consider your cursory requirements for the assimilation of this knowledge to be complete.  At your leisure, access the Discs of Norgannon to begin synthesis of your discs."
G["The Creators are... the Creators.\n\nThey are the beings that seeded and shaped this world by their own design.  They are the reason for this world's existence, as well as many other worlds.  They are the wellspring from which Azeroth flows."]="The Creators are... the Creators.\n\nThey are the beings that seeded and shaped this world by their own design.  They are the reason for this world's existence, as well as many other worlds.  They are the wellspring from which Azeroth flows."
G["The Creators use visitation as a means to reestablish control over seeded worlds when forces, both external and internal, upset the matrix dynamics associated with it.  Such tactics are not to be taken lightly when executed by the Creators.\n\nFor additional information on this world's scheduled visitation, please consult the appropriate data repository that fields all Creator-related scheduling considerations."]="The Creators use visitation as a means to reestablish control over seeded worlds when forces, both external and internal, upset the matrix dynamics associated with it.  Such tactics are not to be taken lightly when executed by the Creators.\n\nFor additional information on this world's scheduled visitation, please consult the appropriate data repository that fields all Creator-related scheduling considerations."
G["The Crusade appreciates the work you're doing out here, $n."]="A Cruzada agradece o trabalho que está fazendo, $n."
G["The Crusade has been marked for death!"]="A Cruzada foi desmarcada para morte!"
G["The Crusade will be victorious!"]="The Crusade will be victorious!"
G["The Crusade will purge your kind from this world!"]="A Cruzada purgará aos do seu calanha deste mundo!"
G["The Crystal Pylons of Un'Goro are a mystery to all. To the few inhabitants here, they are a source of legend, with much speculation as to their purpose."]="Os Postes de Cristal de Um'Goro são um mistério para todos. Para os poucos habitantes daqui, eles são uma fonte de lenda, com muita especulação quanto ao seu propósito."
G["The Cult of the Damned has grown large in scope. Nearly every city, from the capitals to the small hamlets and hovels of both the Horde and Alliance, have Cult members hidden amongst their citizenry.\n\nDo not look so surprised. The Cult only wears a uniform for ritual and ceremony. It is quite possible that you have interacted with one during your adventures and not even known."]="The Cult of the Damned has grown large in scope. Nearly every city, from the capitals to the small hamlets and hovels of both the Horde and Alliance, have Cult members hidden amongst their citizenry.\n\nDo not look so surprised. The Cult only wears a uniform for ritual and ceremony. It is quite possible that you have interacted with one during your adventures and not even known."
G["The DARKNESS devours ALL!"]="A escuridão o devora tudo!"
G["The DEC operator can also choose to load themselves into the loading arm,\n allowing the Demolisher driver to launch them into the distance.\n|TInterface\\Icons\\INV_Misc_EngGizmos_27.blp:32|t"]="The DEC operator can also choose to load themselves into the loading arm,\n allowing the Demolisher driver to launch them into the distance.\n|TInterface\\Icons\\INV_Misc_EngGizmos_27.blp:32|t"
G["The Dalaran Merchants' Bank is in the southern part of the city, off the Eventide."]="O Dalaran Merchants 'Bank fica na parte sul da cidade, perto do Eventide."
G["The Dark Animus goes berserk!"]="O Animus sombrio se volta furioso!"
G["The Dark Iron Dwarves shall reclaim their rightful lands!"]="The Dark Iron Dwarves shall reclaim their rightful lands!"
G["The Dark Iron dwarves of the Slag Pit in Searing Gorge have a great number of locked boxes."]="Os anões Dark Iron do Slag Pit em Searing Gorge têm um grande número de caixas trancadas."
G["The Dark Irons in Blackrock have got nothin' on me.  Neither do those boys up at Thorium Point.\n\nI'm independent as can be, and that's the way I like it.  Of course, for the right price, I'd listen to either side..."]="The Dark Irons in Blackrock have got nothin' on me.  Neither do those boys up at Thorium Point.\n\nI'm independent as can be, and that's the way I like it.  Of course, for the right price, I'd listen to either side..."
G["The Dark Irons thought these tablets to be encoded. This is not any form of coding, it is the tongue of ancient dragon."]="The Dark Irons thought these tablets to be encoded. This is not any form of coding, it is the tongue of ancient dragon."
G["The Dark Lady fought off as many as she could, but in the end... I hope she survived. Please help!"]="The Dark Lady fought off as many as she could, but in the end... I hope she survived. Please help!"
G["The Dark Lady has said that knowledge will be our greatest weapon in this war."]="A Dama Negra disse que o conhecimento será a nossa maior arma nesta guerra."
G["The Dark Lady lets these mongrels live? Useless..."]="The Dark Lady lets these mongrels live? Useless..."
G["The Dark Lady watch over you..."]="A Dama Negra cuida de você..."
G["The Dark Lady watches over you. Make haste!"]="The Dark Lady watches over you. Make haste!"
G["The Dark Lady's followers are blind to think they can stand against our might."]="The Dark Lady's followers are blind to think they can stand against our might."
G["The Dark Lord is displeased with your interference."]="The Dark Lord is displeased with your interference."
G["The Dark Pharaoh has fallen!  His immortal colossi tumble like toys!"]="O Faraó das Trevas caiu! Seus colossos imortais desmoronaram feito brinquedos!"
G["The Dark Portal coming alive? This can't be good."]="O Portal Sombrio volta à vida? Isto não tem boa pinta..."
G["The Dark Portal opens once again! What does it portend?"]="The Dark Portal opens once again! What does it portend?"
G["The Dark Shaman go into a berserker rage!"]="The Dark Shaman go into a berserker rage!"
G["The Dark Summoner is vulnerable for a short time, now's your chance!"]="O conjurador sombrio é vulnerável durante um tempo! É seu oportunidade!"
G["The Dark Summoner's protective magics are active once again."]="A magia protetora do conjurador sombrio volta a estar ativa."
G["The Darkhatched Lizard-Lord begins to spin violently."]="O senhor lagarto Incubasombras começa a girar violentamente."
G["The Darkhatched Lizard-Lord calls for help!"]="O senhor lagarto Incubasombras pede ajuda!"
G["The Darkhatched Lizard-Lord prepares to unleash a group of Water Jets!"]="O senhor lagarto Incubasombras se prepara para disparar um grupo de chorros de água!"
G["The Darkmoon Deathmatch is over!  $n is the victor!"]="O combate a morte da Feira da Lua Negra tem finalizado! $n ganhou!"
G["The Darkmoon Faire has already arrived, you say?  Where is it located?"]="O Darkmoon Faire já chegou, você diz? Onde ele está localizado?"
G["The Darkmoon Faire has come to town!  Be sure to experience the most thrilling show you'll ever see!"]="O Darkmoon Faire chegou à cidade! Não deixe de experimentar o show mais emocionante que você já viu!"
G["The Darkmoon Faire is coming to town!  Don't miss it!"]="O Darkmoon Faire está chegando à cidade! Não perca!"
G["The Darkmoon Faire is coming!  There is fun for children of ALL ages!  Come one, come all!"]="O Darkmoon Faire está chegando! Há diversão para crianças de todas as idades! Venha um, venha todos!"
G["The Darkmoon Faire is filled with all sorts of amazing attractions.  We have a fortune teller, a concert, a fishing contest and a lot of games.\n\nWe are constantly expanding the faire with all manner of new attractions!\n\nAre there any attractions you'd like more information on?"]="The Darkmoon Faire is filled with all sorts of amazing attractions.  We have a fortune teller, a concert, a fishing contest and a lot of games.\n\nWe are constantly expanding the faire with all manner of new attractions!\n\nAre there any attractions you'd like more information on?"
G["The Darkmoon Faire is now open!\n\nFor a small fee, I can teleport you to the fairground staging area.\n\nWould you like to go?"]="A Feira da Lua Negra já está aberta!\n\nPor um módico preço te posso teletransportar à zona de escala da feira.\n\nQue ir?"
G["The Darkmoon Faire is right now located in Elwynn Forest, just south of Goldshire.  Don't miss it!"]="O Darkmoon Faire está agora localizado em Elwynn Forest, ao sul de Goldshire. Não perca!"
G["The Darkmoon Faire is right now located in Terokkar Forest in Outland, just south of Shattrath City.  Don't miss it!"]="A Feira da Lua Negra se celebra agora no Mata Terokkar, em TerrAlém, logo ao sul de Shattrath. Não te o perda!"
G["The Darkmoon Faire is right now located in the golden plains of Mulgore, just southwest of Thunder Bluff.  Don't miss it!"]="O Darkmoon Faire está agora localizado nas planícies douradas de Mulgore, a sudoeste de Thunder Bluff. Não perca!"
G["The Darkmoon Faire is the greatest event in all of Outland!"]="A Feira da Lua Negra é o maior evento de tudo TerrAlém!"
G["The Darkmoon Faire is the greatest event on all of Azeroth!"]="O Darkmoon Faire é o maior evento de todos os Azeroth!"
G["The Darkmoon Faire will only be live for a short time before the curtains are drawn closed.  Be sure to visit it today!"]="O Darkmoon Faire só estará ativo por um curto período de tempo antes que as cortinas sejam fechadas. Não deixe de visitá-o hoje!"
G["The Darkspear and her allies will attack Orgrimmar by land, so that you can attack her by sea. It be the only way."]="Os Lança Negra e seus aliados atacarão Orgrimmar por terra pa' que possam atacar por mar. É a única maneira."
G["The Darkspear never deserved to be part of the Horde!"]="The Darkspear never deserved to be part of the Horde!"
G["The Darkspear will know the true price of defiance!"]="Os Lança Negra vão a pagar caro seu desafio!"
G["The Darkspears stand ready to face the competition and the enemy."]="As Darkspears estão prontas para enfrentar a concorrência e o inimigo."
G["The Darnassus riders count on their nimbleness and skill at range.\n\nThey are quick and cunning enough to avoid your Charges, so try using a mixture of close-range Thrusts and the occasional Shield-Breaker to defeat them."]="The Darnassus riders count on their nimbleness and skill at range.\n\nThey are quick and cunning enough to avoid your Charges, so try using a mixture of close-range Thrusts and the occasional Shield-Breaker to defeat them."
G["The Dawnblade forces have been driven from the Sun's Reach Harbor!  The day is ours!"]="As forças Hojalba têm banido eliminadas do Porto de Tramo do Sol! Hoje é nosso dia!"
G["The Dawnblade will defend this land for all of the Sin'dorei. There is no turning back!"]="The Dawnblade will defend this land for all of the Sin'dorei. There is no turning back!"
G["The Deadmines can be found beneath Moonbrook in the south of Westfall."]="As Minas Mortas podem ser encontradas abaixo de Moonbrook, no sul de Westfall."
G["The Deathforge is run by the Shadow Council, under the watchful eye of the Legion."]="A Forja da Morte é administrada pelo Conselho das Sombras, sob o olhar atento da Legião."
G["The Defenders are here to protect Blood Watch from the Sunhawk threat."]="Os defensores estão aqui para proteção a Avançado de Sangue da ameaça de Falcão do Sol."
G["The Defenders of Blood Watch protect this outpost from any threat."]="The Defenders of Blood Watch protect this outpost from any threat."
G["The Defiant is mine! Stand down or die!"]="O Desafiante é meu! Afaste-se ou morre!"
G["The Defias are a joke compared to us."]="Os Défias são um chiste comparados conosco."
G["The Defias are little more than a band of thugs. We should be busy combatting Stormwind's real enemies instead of chasing baseless speculation!"]="Os Défias são pouco mais que uma Raide de matones. Deveríamos estar ocupados combatendo aos verdadeiros inimigos de Ventobravo em vez de perseguir especulações sem fundamento."
G["The Defias shall succeed! No meek adventurer will stop us!"]="The Defias shall succeed! No meek adventurer will stop us!"
G["The Defiler... must warn Thrall..."]="O Profanador... é preciso avisar a Thrall..."
G["The Demon Chain. It projects our will like a physical force."]="The Demon Chain. It projects our will like a physical force."
G["The Denmother will have your head!"]="A mãe do covil te arrancará a cabeça!"
G["The Destroyer is gathering all his might for a blow that will split the world. Attack him, now! We must stop the final Cataclysm!"]="O Destruidor está reunindo tudo seu poder para destruir o mundo de um acerto. Ataquem, agora! Devemos parar o Cataclismo fim!"
G["The Destructive Ward gains in power."]="The Destructive Ward gains in power."
G["The Destructive Ward has been destroyed."]="The Destructive Ward has been destroyed."
G["The Destructive Ward is fully charged!"]="The Destructive Ward is fully charged!"
G["The Devourer awaits..."]="O Devorador espera..."
G["The Displacement Pad appears to be active and stable."]="A almofada de deslocamento parece estar ativa e estável."
G["The Divine Bell is a weapon of unquestionable power. It belongs in horde hands. It belongs to me!"]="A Sino divina é um arma de poder incuestionable. Deve estar em mãos da Horda. Deve estar nos meus mãos!"
G["The Divine Bell means a great deal to the Horde.\n\nThe Warchief is counting on us."]="A Sino divina é muito importantes para a Horda.\n\nO Chefe de Guerra conta conosco."
G["The Divine Bell! I knew I could count on you, $n."]="A Sino divina! Sabia que podia contar com você, $n."
G["The Divine challenges us to face these intruders."]="A Divina nos ordena que nos enfrentemos aos intrusos."
G["The Divine chose us to give mortal voice to Her divine will. We are but the vessel that enacts Her will."]="The Divine chose us to give mortal voice to Her divine will. We are but the vessel that enacts Her will."
G["The Divine will not suffer your taint here, outsider."]="A Divina não tolerará que profanes este lugar."
G["The Dojani Dynasty is remembered for their cruelty. Use caution."]="The Dojani Dynasty is remembered for their cruelty. Use caution."
G["The Doomguard are utterly devoted to their Pit Lord masters and revel in the destruction of worlds."]="The Doomguard are utterly devoted to their Pit Lord masters and revel in the destruction of worlds."
G["The Door is under attack!"]="Estão atacando a porta!"
G["The Drag race will start in 1 minute!"]="The Drag race will start in 1 minute!"
G["The Dragon Soul is safe once again. Quickly, into the time portal, before this world sunders!"]="O Alma de dragão volta a estar a salvou. Rápido, ao portal do tempo, antes de que o mundo se desabe!"
G["The Dragon Soul's link to the portal has been broken!  The Soul plummets downwards towards the Well!"]="O vínculo do Alma de dragão com o portal se tem front! O Alma se precipita para o Poço!"
G["The Dragonmaw Warchief is in the largest building up on the hilltop here. I'm sure he'll be reasonable."]="The Dragonmaw Warchief is in the largest building up on the hilltop here. I'm sure he'll be reasonable."
G["The Dragonmaw are attempting to push out of the Angerfang Encampment and are already raiding the caravan to the east.  They've called in two powerful warriors who are leading the charge.  If you're up for a challenge, you might find them at the Encampment, planning and strategizing and doing other evil, Orcish things."]="The Dragonmaw are attempting to push out of the Angerfang Encampment and are already raiding the caravan to the east.  They've called in two powerful warriors who are leading the charge.  If you're up for a challenge, you might find them at the Encampment, planning and strategizing and doing other evil, Orcish things."
G["The Dragonmaw are corrupt. They are strip-mining this island of all natural resources and using those resources to supply Illidan's armies out of the Black Temple. They take much for themselves, however, and sell whatever they have hidden away to the highest bidder."]="Os Presa do Dragão estão corrompidos. Eles estão explorando esta ilha com todos os recursos naturais e usando esses recursos para suprir os exércitos de Illidan do Templo Negro. Eles levam muito para si mesmos, no entanto, e vendem tudo o que esconderam para o maior lance."
G["The Dragonmaw are supporting the Warchief."]="Os Faucedraco apoiam ao Chefe de Guerra."
G["The Dragonmaw can be great again. Help our conquest of the Twilight Highlands - can you give me a map?"]="The Dragonmaw can be great again. Help our conquest of the Twilight Highlands - can you give me a map?"
G["The Dragonmaw drums fall from Zaela's unconscious body!"]="O tambor dos Faucedraco cai do corpo inconsciente de Zaela!"
G["The Dragonmaw must be stopped..."]="The Dragonmaw must be stopped..."
G["The Dragonmaw stand proudly with the Horde. The Twilight Citadel will fall, $n!"]="The Dragonmaw stand proudly with the Horde. The Twilight Citadel will fall, $n!"
G["The Drakkari Chieftains have been captured! What more would you have me do?"]="Os Chefes Drakkari foram capturados! O que mais você gostaria que eu fizesse?"
G["The Drakkari are keeping my body close to death up in the altar building. They cannot see my spirit though.\n\nWe must work together to prevent them from getting my power."]="The Drakkari are keeping my body close to death up in the altar building. They cannot see my spirit though.\n\nWe must work together to prevent them from getting my power."
G["The Drakkari must not be allowed to break through the defenses."]="The Drakkari must not be allowed to break through the defenses."
G["The Dread Captain DeMeza has pulled into Booty Bay and declared it Pirates' Day!\n\nShe's making anyone who's brave enough to share a drink with her an honorary crewmember."]="The Dread Captain DeMeza has pulled into Booty Bay and declared it Pirates' Day!\n\nShe's making anyone who's brave enough to share a drink with her an honorary crewmember."
G["The Dread King sends his regards! Pray that today is the day that we die in battle! Pray that the judgement is favorable!"]="The Dread King sends his regards! Pray that today is the day that we die in battle! Pray that the judgement is favorable!"
G["The Dream Brew is an ancient recipe passed down through the ages."]="The Dream Brew is an ancient recipe passed down through the ages."
G["The Dream Brew will put you into a deep state of meditation. Your mind's eye will find the answers to your greatest questions."]="The Dream Brew will put you into a deep state of meditation. Your mind's eye will find the answers to your greatest questions."
G["The Dude, over yonder, is pretty upset about his rug."]="O Rosto, além, está muito chateado com o seu tapete."
G["The Dun Baldar North Bunker is under attack!  If left unchecked, the Alliance will destroy it!"]="The Dun Baldar North Bunker is under attack!  If left unchecked, the Alliance will destroy it!"
G["The Dun Baldar North Bunker is under attack!  If left unchecked, the Horde will destroy it!"]="The Dun Baldar North Bunker is under attack!  If left unchecked, the Horde will destroy it!"
G["The Dun Baldar North Bunker protects the eastern entrance to Dun Baldar.\n\nIt is controlled by neither side."]="The Dun Baldar North Bunker protects the eastern entrance to Dun Baldar.\n\nIt is controlled by neither side."
G["The Dun Baldar North Bunker protects the eastern entrance to Dun Baldar.\n\nIt is controlled by the Alliance."]="The Dun Baldar North Bunker protects the eastern entrance to Dun Baldar.\n\nIt is controlled by the Alliance."
G["The Dun Baldar North Bunker protects the eastern entrance to Dun Baldar.\n\nIt is controlled by the Horde."]="The Dun Baldar North Bunker protects the eastern entrance to Dun Baldar.\n\nIt is controlled by the Horde."
G["The Dun Baldar North Bunker was destroyed by the Horde!"]="The Dun Baldar North Bunker was destroyed by the Horde!"
G["The Dun Baldar North Bunker was taken by the Alliance!"]="The Dun Baldar North Bunker was taken by the Alliance!"
G["The Dun Baldar South Bunker is under attack!  If left unchecked, the Alliance will destroy it!"]="The Dun Baldar South Bunker is under attack!  If left unchecked, the Alliance will destroy it!"
G["The Dun Baldar South Bunker is under attack!  If left unchecked, the Horde will destroy it!"]="The Dun Baldar South Bunker is under attack!  If left unchecked, the Horde will destroy it!"
G["The Dun Baldar South Bunker protects the south and east flanks of Dun Baldar.\n\nIt is controlled by neither side."]="The Dun Baldar South Bunker protects the south and east flanks of Dun Baldar.\n\nIt is controlled by neither side."
G["The Dun Baldar South Bunker protects the south and east flanks of Dun Baldar.\n\nIt is controlled by the Alliance."]="The Dun Baldar South Bunker protects the south and east flanks of Dun Baldar.\n\nIt is controlled by the Alliance."
G["The Dun Baldar South Bunker protects the south and east flanks of Dun Baldar.\n\nIt is controlled by the Horde."]="The Dun Baldar South Bunker protects the south and east flanks of Dun Baldar.\n\nIt is controlled by the Horde."
G["The Dun Baldar South Bunker was destroyed by the Horde!"]="The Dun Baldar South Bunker was destroyed by the Horde!"
G["The Dun Baldar South Bunker was taken by the Alliance!"]="The Dun Baldar South Bunker was taken by the Alliance!"
G["The Dunwald family is built tough, but they let it go to their heads. I worry that me brothers put their repuation to the test a wee bit too often."]="A família Dunwald é construída com firmeza, mas eles a deixam ir à cabeça. Eu me preocupo que meus irmãos testem à sua repetição com muita frequência."
G["The EMP disrupts Iron Thane Furyhammer's shield!"]="O PEM perturbao escudo do senhor feudal ferro Martelo Furioso!"
G["The Earth Mother calls and you answer.  You will find the Hall of Spirits on the Spirit Rise."]="A Mãe Terra chama e você responde. Você encontrará o Salão dos Espíritos na Ascensão Espiritual."
G["The Earth Mother holds many secrets and Brek Stonehoof can help you to discover some of them.  You will find him on the lower rise at Stonehoof Geology."]="A Mãe Terra guarda muitos segredos e Brek Stonehoof pode ajudá-o a descobrir algum deles. Você o encontrará na subida mais baixa da Stonehoof Geology."
G["The Earth Mother provides, but at times, a $c needs a little extra help to survive. Thus, I am collecting all of the runecloth bandages that we can in preparation for the looming war at Ahn'Qiraj. As of now we have gathered $2089w on our way to collecting a total of $2090w."]="A Mãe Terra nos oferecem todos seus recurso mas, em ocasiões, $gun: uma; $c precisa um pouco de ajuda extra para poder sobreviver. Por elho, estou recolhendo todas as seda de pano rúnico que posso em visão da guerra que se aproxima em Ahn'Qiraj. Até o momentos, temos reuniu $2089w de um total de $2090w."
G["The Earth Mother watch over us; under cover of the night as in the day. Let this fire illuminate both our bodies and spirits and remind us of our honored ancestors, who are ever present and guiding our way."]="The Earth Mother watch over us; under cover of the night as in the day. Let this fire illuminate both our bodies and spirits and remind us of our honored ancestors, who are ever present and guiding our way."
G["The Earth Warder... he is dead."]="O Guardião da Terra... está morto."
G["The Earthen Ring cannot withstand my fury!"]="The Earthen Ring cannot withstand my fury!"
G["The Earthen Ring have set up portals to various regions of the world on a small lake islet northwest of Stormwind Keep.\nThere are representatives from the Baradin Wardens there as well, offering transport to Tol Barad."]="The Earthen Ring have set up portals to various regions of the world on a small lake islet northwest of Stormwind Keep.\nThere are representatives from the Baradin Wardens there as well, offering transport to Tol Barad."
G["The Earthen Ring have set up portals to various regions of the world on the cliffs north of the zeppelin towers.\nThere are representatives from Hellscream's Reach there as well, offering transport to Tol Barad."]="The Earthen Ring have set up portals to various regions of the world on the cliffs north of the zeppelin towers.\nThere are representatives from Hellscream's Reach there as well, offering transport to Tol Barad."
G["The Earthen Ring seeks to preserve the strength and majesty of the elements."]="O Anel Terrestre procurando preservar a força e a majestade dos elementos."
G["The Earthen Ring shall fall!"]="O Anel da Terra cairá!"
G["The Earthen Ring stands behind you."]="The Earthen Ring stands behind you."
G["The Earthen Ring's Assault Begins."]="Começao ataque ao Anel da Terra."
G["The Earthen are a synthesized race engineered by the Creators, functioning as one of the seed races in the initial population of the world designated as Azeroth.  The Earthen were created to aid the Creators' efforts in shaping the deep regions of this world.\n\nThey are a modification of the standard subterranean being matrix used on other worlds that the Creators have seeded.  The construction of this prototype race created various anomalies that were observed after initial synthesis."]="The Earthen are a synthesized race engineered by the Creators, functioning as one of the seed races in the initial population of the world designated as Azeroth.  The Earthen were created to aid the Creators' efforts in shaping the deep regions of this world.\n\nThey are a modification of the standard subterranean being matrix used on other worlds that the Creators have seeded.  The construction of this prototype race created various anomalies that were observed after initial synthesis."
G["The Earthen's only anomaly in synthesis is the tendency for matrix destabilization while being utilized in high-stress environments.\n\nAddendum: deep earth sculpting was naturally suited to the new matrix design and thus never met the qualifications of duplicating a high-stress environment.\n\nDestabilization was not discovered until well into the Earthen's primary service cycle for the Creators.  The Creators began work on post-synthesis modification, rather than recall and re-synthesis."]="The Earthen's only anomaly in synthesis is the tendency for matrix destabilization while being utilized in high-stress environments.\n\nAddendum: deep earth sculpting was naturally suited to the new matrix design and thus never met the qualifications of duplicating a high-stress environment.\n\nDestabilization was not discovered until well into the Earthen's primary service cycle for the Creators.  The Creators began work on post-synthesis modification, rather than recall and re-synthesis."
G["The Earthwatchers won't allow faction squabbling to jeopardize the Earthen Ring's work here.\nThose who break the peace will be dealt with... harshly."]="The Earthwatchers won't allow faction squabbling to jeopardize the Earthen Ring's work here.\nThose who break the peace will be dealt with... harshly."
G["The East Frostwolf Tower is under attack!  If left unchecked, the Alliance will destroy it!"]="Estão atacando a Torre Este Lobo Gelo! Se não fazemos algo, a Aliança a destruirá!"
G["The East Frostwolf Tower is under attack!  If left unchecked, the Horde will destroy it!"]="Estão atacando a Torre Este Lobo Gelo! Se não fazemos algo, a Horda a destruirá!"
G["The East Frostwolf Tower was destroyed by the Alliance!"]="A Aliança tem destruído a Torre Este Lobo Gelo!"
G["The East Frostwolf Tower was taken by the Horde!"]="A Horda capturou a Torre Este Lobo Gelo!"
G["The East Spire has been destroyed!"]="The East Spire has been destroyed!"
G["The East Spire has been heavily damaged!"]="The East Spire has been heavily damaged!"
G["The Eastern Crossroads changed tracks!"]="The Eastern Crossroads changed tracks!"
G["The Eastern Graveyard has been captured by the Alliance!"]="A Aliança tomou o Cemitério do Este!"
G["The Eastern Graveyard has been captured by the Horde!"]="A Horda tomou o Cemitério do Este!"
G["The Eastern Pylon accepts blue, yellow, and green crystals.\n\nIt focuses on the energy that can be created using blue crystals as the main source of power. There are two possible effects: one provides bonus to spirit, and one that creates a damaging shield.\n\nCrystal Force requires blue and green crystals. This will provide you with an increase in spirit.\n\nCrystal Spire requires blue and yellow crystals. This will create a shield that does damage to attackers."]="The Eastern Pylon accepts blue, yellow, and green crystals.\n\nIt focuses on the energy that can be created using blue crystals as the main source of power. There are two possible effects: one provides bonus to spirit, and one that creates a damaging shield.\n\nCrystal Force requires blue and green crystals. This will provide you with an increase in spirit.\n\nCrystal Spire requires blue and yellow crystals. This will create a shield that does damage to attackers."
G["The Eastspark siege workshop has been attacked by the Alliance!"]="A Oficina de Cerco Chispa Oriental foi atacado pela Aliança!"
G["The Eastspark siege workshop has been attacked by the Horde!"]="A Oficina de Cerco Chispa Oriental foi atacado pela Horda!"
G["The Eastspark siege workshop has been captured by the Alliance!"]="A Oficina de Cerco Chispa Oriental foi capturou pela Aliança!"
G["The Eastspark siege workshop has been captured by the Horde!"]="A Oficina de Cerco Chispa Oriental foi capturou pela Horda!"
G["The Ebon Blade is indebted to you for your help in taking The Shadow Vault. We are lucky to have you.\n\nWhile the Alliance and the Horde fight each other, doing the Lich King's job for him, we will stay focused on the task at hand.\n\nWhere the Argent Crusade might falter and think twice about how best to crush the enemy, we will have no such moral difficulties.\n\nYou shall be our instrument of vengeance, $n."]="The Ebon Blade is indebted to you for your help in taking The Shadow Vault. We are lucky to have you.\n\nWhile the Alliance and the Horde fight each other, doing the Lich King's job for him, we will stay focused on the task at hand.\n\nWhere the Argent Crusade might falter and think twice about how best to crush the enemy, we will have no such moral difficulties.\n\nYou shall be our instrument of vengeance, $n."
G["The Elder Crone rubs her wrists as she flashes a toothy grin your way."]="A bruxa ânciana se frota as munhecas enquanto te sorri brevemente."
G["The Elder has much to consider, but I think it's clear. You are meant to lead us to victory against the hozen."]="The Elder has much to consider, but I think it's clear. You are meant to lead us to victory against the hozen."
G["The Emerald Circle strives to heal the wounded land of Felwood. Although the land is named for the very thing that has corrupted it, we hope that one day we will be able to eradicate the corruption from this land."]="O Círculo Esmeralda se esforça para curar a terra ferida de Felwood. Embora o nome da terra seja exatamente o que a corrompeu, esperamos que um dia possamos erradicar a corrupção dessa terra."
G["The Emerald Circle welcomes you, $n.\n\nHopefully together we can help rejuvenate and protect this once-mighty forest. Many forces seek to destroy it from without... and within.\n\nDo not be persuaded by the power here--it will only corrupt you, like it has this entire land."]="The Emerald Circle welcomes you, $n.\n\nHopefully together we can help rejuvenate and protect this once-mighty forest. Many forces seek to destroy it from without... and within.\n\nDo not be persuaded by the power here--it will only corrupt you, like it has this entire land."
G["The Emerald Dream doesn't sound like a place for me. What if it turns me into a turtle? I've always wanted wings, though..."]="Não me parece que o Sonho Esmeralda seja um lugar para mim. E se me transforma em uma tartaruga? Embora sempre e querido ter asas..."
G["The Emerald Dream has become a dangerous place. I grow increasingly concerned for those who have sacrificed their waking life in Azeroth in hopes of saving it."]="O Emerald Dream se tornou um lugar perigoso. Fico cada vez mais preocupado com aqueles que sacrificaram sua vida em Azeroth na esperança de salvá-a."
G["The Emerald Dream will never be yours!"]="O Sonho Esmeralda mais será seu!"
G["The Emperor was in need of trusted messengers and deliverymen."]="O Imperador estava precisando de mensageiros e entregadores de confiança."
G["The Emperor's Breath abates."]="O fôlego do Imperador remite."
G["The Emperor's Breath is regained."]="The Emperor's Breath is regained."
G["The Emperor's Courage appears in the alcoves!"]="O coragem do Imperador aparecem na habitação!"
G["The Emperor's Courage burns everlasting."]="O coragem do Imperador arde eternamente."
G["The Emperor's Rage echoes through the hills."]="A raiva do Imperador ressoa pelas colinas."
G["The Emperor's Strength appears in the alcoves!"]="A força do Imperador aparecem na habitação!"
G["The Emperor's Strength grips this land with fists of iron."]="The Emperor's Strength grips this land with fists of iron."
G["The Emperor's Will dominates all it beholds."]="A vontade do Imperador domina tudo o que vê."
G["The Empire rises again!"]="O Império se ergue novamente!"
G["The Empress commands it!"]="A Imperatriz o ordena!"
G["The Empress fears her own undoing, yet fear itself is her undoing. She is gone beyond the edge of madness."]="A Imperatriz teme seu perdição, mas seu perdição é o medo mesmo. Tem caído no abismo da loucura."
G["The Empress must be brought to justice."]="A Imperatriz deve responder ante a justiça."
G["The Empress would force this swarm and raze our own lands in the process.\n\nThe cost is too high."]="A Imperatriz pretende forçar este enxame, arrasando assim nossas próprias terras.\n\nO preço é demais alto."
G["The End of the Scourge draws near."]="O fim do Flagelo se aproxima."
G["The Endless Army will crush the Emperor's foes."]="O Exército Infinito aplastará aos inimigos do Imperador."
G["The Energy Vortex begins to shut down."]="Vórtice de energia reduzindo."
G["The Energy Vortex is active!"]="O vórtice de energia está ativado!"
G["The Energy Vortex is inactive!"]="O vórtice de energia está desativado!"
G["The Energy Vortex is powering down! Get off the platform!"]="O vórtice de energia se você está apagando! Saia da plataforma!"
G["The Energy Vortex is powering up!"]="The Energy Vortex is powering up!"
G["The Engine of Nalak'sha begins to self destruct!"]="O Motor de Nalak'sha começa a auto-destruirse!"
G["The Ethereum have grown dark... twisted. Vengeance has become their only recourse and any that would stand in their way or not join their cause are considered enemies. Many saw that the Ethereum were plummeting into madness and left. Several of the Nexus-Princes of the Ethereum council abandoned the Ethereum to form other groups and factions with different goals. The Consortium are one such example of an off-shoot group. The Protectorate another..."]="The Ethereum have grown dark... twisted. Vengeance has become their only recourse and any that would stand in their way or not join their cause are considered enemies. Many saw that the Ethereum were plummeting into madness and left. Several of the Nexus-Princes of the Ethereum council abandoned the Ethereum to form other groups and factions with different goals. The Consortium are one such example of an off-shoot group. The Protectorate another..."
G["The Ethereum were the ruling class of ethereal on my homeworld of K'aresh. Tragically, we were forced to evacuate K'aresh shortly before the void lord, Dimensius, unleashed his void armies upon the world and utterly decimated all that stood in his way. For this act, the Ethereum vowed vengeance. They have been tracking Dimensius ever since...\n\nThe Protectorate, however, were not a reaction to Dimensius. We were a reaction to Ethereum."]="The Ethereum were the ruling class of ethereal on my homeworld of K'aresh. Tragically, we were forced to evacuate K'aresh shortly before the void lord, Dimensius, unleashed his void armies upon the world and utterly decimated all that stood in his way. For this act, the Ethereum vowed vengeance. They have been tracking Dimensius ever since...\n\nThe Protectorate, however, were not a reaction to Dimensius. We were a reaction to Ethereum."
G["The Eventide"]="The Eventide"
G["The Eventide is a square in southern Dalaran. The enchanted fountain there is popular for fishing."]="O Eventide é uma praça no sul de Dalaran. A fonte encantada é popular para a pesca."
G["The Exodar"]="O Exodar"
G["The Exodar has not answered my pleas, $n. I am afraid you are the only one who can help poor Magtoor."]="O Exodar não tem respondido a meus súplicas, $n. Me temo que somente você pode ajudar ao pobre Magtoor."
G["The Exodar riders are massive and powerful combatants, terrifying at close range.\n\nTry to stay out of their defense-crushing Thrust range, breaking down their defenses with Shield-Breakers before risking a Charge."]="The Exodar riders are massive and powerful combatants, terrifying at close range.\n\nTry to stay out of their defense-crushing Thrust range, breaking down their defenses with Shield-Breakers before risking a Charge."
G["The Exodar's once-vast supply of textiles has dwindled dangerously low. Your reputation with the draenei here would increase were you to assist us by donating cloth."]="O suprimento outrora vasto de têxteis do Exodar diminuiu perigosamente. Sua reputação com os draeneis aqui aumentaria se você nos ajudasse doando roupas."
G["The Exodar's paladin trainers are found in the luminous Chapel of Light in the Seat of the Naaru."]="Os treinadores de paladino do Exodar são encontrados na luminosa Capela da Luz, na Sede dos Naaru."
G["The Exodar's vaults are vast and well-protected. Your goods will come to no harm here."]="Os cofres do Exodar são vastos e bem protegidos. Seus produtos não terão danos aqui."
G["The Explorers' League exists to uncover the hidden secrets within this world.  While the cataclysm was devastating for most, for us, it provided access to untold troves of information and wealth."]="A Liga dos Batedores existe para descobrir os segredos ocultos deste mundo. Embora o Cataclismo tenha sido devastador para a maioria, para nós, ele forneceu acesso a inúmeros tesouros de informações e riqueza."
G["The Eye Sentry pulls nearby enemies into its field of misery, defeat it to get free!"]="The Eye Sentry pulls nearby enemies into its field of misery, defeat it to get free!"
G["The Eye have no lips, but the Eye whispers to Gar'gol. The Eye knows everything!"]="O Olho não ter lábios, mas o Olho sussurra a Gar'gol. O Olho saber tudo!"
G["The Eye led me here, Eris."]="O Olho me trazido aqui, Eris."
G["The Eye of Acherus is in your control."]="O olho de Acherus está sob seu poder."
G["The Eye of Acherus launches towards its destination."]="O Olho de Acherus se lança cima seu destino."
G["The Eye of Paleth was retrieved and cleansed a long time ago, $c. We thought the curse lifted."]="The Eye of Paleth was retrieved and cleansed a long time ago, $c. We thought the curse lifted."
G["The Eye of the Storm... countless battles have been fought just to find that artifact. I know not why Xi'ri entrusted it to your care, $c... but be warned... no one has wielded its power without paying a greater price."]="The Eye of the Storm... countless battles have been fought just to find that artifact. I know not why Xi'ri entrusted it to your care, $c... but be warned... no one has wielded its power without paying a greater price."
G["The Eye sees all within its sphere of influence, $c. What is it that you wish to see?"]="O Olho vê tudo aquilo que entrar no seu esfera de influência, $c. O que deseja ver?"
G["The Eye talks in shadow-talk. I do what Eye says! You do what Gar'gol says!"]="O Olho falar em linguagem das Sombras. Eu fazer o que o Olho dizer! Você fazer o que Gar'gol dizer!"
G["The Eyes of Peroth'arn are looking for you."]="The Eyes of Peroth'arn are looking for you."
G["The Faith of Ramkahen... abstains."]="A Fé de Ramkahen... se abstiene."
G["The Fanglords are dead! All hope is not lost!\n\nThe awakening ritual is quite complex, however. It cannot be done alone.\n\nI will handle all of the necessary preparations but I will need you to protect me. The nightmares summoned from Naralex's journey through the Emerald Dream prove to be quite formidable. Without your help, this mission is doomed.\n\nWhen you are ready to defend me, say the word, and I shall lead the way to Naralex's chamber."]="The Fanglords are dead! All hope is not lost!\n\nThe awakening ritual is quite complex, however. It cannot be done alone.\n\nI will handle all of the necessary preparations but I will need you to protect me. The nightmares summoned from Naralex's journey through the Emerald Dream prove to be quite formidable. Without your help, this mission is doomed.\n\nWhen you are ready to defend me, say the word, and I shall lead the way to Naralex's chamber."
G["The Fel Horde is on the move!"]="A Horda vil está em marcha!"
G["The Felsworn Gas Mask was destroyed, do you have another one?"]="A Máscara de Gás Felsworn foi destruída, você tem outra?"
G["The Festival Loremaster asked me to speak with you."]="O mestre cultural do Festival me pediu que hable com você."
G["The Festival Talespinner asked me to speak with you."]="The Festival Talespinner asked me to speak with you."
G["The Fire Hawk Matriarch screams in rage at your theft."]="The Fire Hawk Matriarch screams in rage at your theft."
G["The Fire Lasher wriggles with glee. You found him!"]="The Fire Lasher wriggles with glee. You found him!"
G["The Firelord and all who dare stand in my way shall reel from my wrath."]="O Senhor do Fogo e todos os que ousarem ficar no meu caminho se afastarão da minha ira."
G["The Firelord and his brethren once held sway over this entire world, mortal. As a servant of the Old Gods, he fought against the Titans for domination of this planet. The victorious Titans banished my master and his brethren to the Elemental Plane - there to remain imprisoned until the end of time."]="O Senhor do Fogo e seus irmãos já dominaram este mundo inteiro, mortal. Como servo dos Deuses Antigos, ele lutou contra os Titãs pelo domínio deste planeta. Os Titãs vitoriosos baniram meu mestre e seus irmãos para o Plano Elementar - lá para permanecerem presos até o fim dos tempos."
G["The Firelord has risen!  We must send word to the others.  Let us hurry!"]="The Firelord has risen!  We must send word to the others.  Let us hurry!"
G["The Firelord will be most pleased."]="The Firelord will be most pleased."
G["The Firelord will bring about the end of Azeroth at long last! You will burn in his fury, fools!"]="The Firelord will bring about the end of Azeroth at long last! You will burn in his fury, fools!"
G["The Firelord's advances were wholly unknown to Thunderaan. Before my Lord could react, Sulfuras, legendary hammer of Ragnaros, would strike an unmerciful blow. Thunderaan fell, utterly defeated.\n\nThe Firelord feasted upon the essence of my Lord, but was unable to consume him entirely."]="The Firelord's advances were wholly unknown to Thunderaan. Before my Lord could react, Sulfuras, legendary hammer of Ragnaros, would strike an unmerciful blow. Thunderaan fell, utterly defeated.\n\nThe Firelord feasted upon the essence of my Lord, but was unable to consume him entirely."
G["The Firewing blood elves... for some reason they want to stop us.\n\n<Warden Treelos visibly struggles to keep his wits about him for a few more seconds.>\n\nThey... they sent one of the Broken as ... as an emissary....  But he had a bomb!\n\nThey died, they all died!  They tried to run away!  The lucky ones didn't even know.\n\nI must have been at the edge of the blast.  It was horr...IT'S WATCHING US AGAIN!\n\n<Treelos becomes despondent and looks straight through you as if you're not there.>"]="The Firewing blood elves... for some reason they want to stop us.\n\n<Warden Treelos visibly struggles to keep his wits about him for a few more seconds.>\n\nThey... they sent one of the Broken as ... as an emissary....  But he had a bomb!\n\nThey died, they all died!  They tried to run away!  The lucky ones didn't even know.\n\nI must have been at the edge of the blast.  It was horr...IT'S WATCHING US AGAIN!\n\n<Treelos becomes despondent and looks straight through you as if you're not there.>"
G["The First World Pillar Fragment drops from Abyssion's lifeless corpse!"]="O primeiro fragmento do Pilar do Mundo cai do corpo sem vida de Abismion!"
G["The Flame Leviathan begins to overload!"]="The Flame Leviathan begins to overload!"
G["The Fleshwerks is the heart of the Scourge's ghoul, abomination, and flesh giant production. If we can take it out, the Lich King will be greatly weakened."]="Os Fleshwerks são o coração do ghoul, abominação e produção gigantesco de carne do Flagelo. Se conseguirmos retirá-o, o Rei Lich ficará muito enfraquecido."
G["The Fleshwerks will never again produce soldiers for the Lich King's armies."]="Os Fleshwerks nunca mais produzirão soldados para os exércitos de Rei Lich."
G["The Flower of Life calls upon me. I WILL NOT fail you, my Queen."]="The Flower of Life calls upon me. I WILL NOT fail you, my Queen."
G["The Focusing Iris thrums, holding back an inconceivable amount of restrained power!"]="The Focusing Iris thrums, holding back an inconceivable amount of restrained power!"
G["The Focusing Iris within the Eye of Eternity may allow us to converge the magical matrix contained within the Dragon Soul."]="Talvez o Íris de enfoque do Olho da Eternidade nos permita unir a matriz mágico que contém o Alma de dragão."
G["The Forest Lord is aware of the destruction in this valley, $n. Soon we must make our way to the Circle of Calling. Prepare yourself!"]="The Forest Lord is aware of the destruction in this valley, $n. Soon we must make our way to the Circle of Calling. Prepare yourself!"
G["The Forsaken are right to celebrate their freedom."]="Os Renegados fazem bem em celebrar seu liberdade."
G["The Forsaken are right to celebrate their freedom. What else is more important?"]="Os Renegados estão certos em celebrar sua liberdade. O que mais é mais importante?"
G["The Forsaken brew such intriguing and strong concoctions, don't you think? It comes from an inability to poison oneself with failures, I believe. Luckily for you, Doctor Herbert Halsey in the Undercity has already done the necessary research; all that remains is for you to visit him."]="The Forsaken brew such intriguing and strong concoctions, don't you think? It comes from an inability to poison oneself with failures, I believe. Luckily for you, Doctor Herbert Halsey in the Undercity has already done the necessary research; all that remains is for you to visit him."
G["The Forsaken have broken through your defenses, magistrate."]="The Forsaken have broken through your defenses, magistrate."
G["The Forsaken think we're weak.  A broken people.  They think we'll roll over like a scared dog."]="The Forsaken think we're weak.  A broken people.  They think we'll roll over like a scared dog."
G["The Forsaken weapon master Archibald knows his way around the polearm. He trains others in the War Quarter of the Undercity. Ileda, the blood elf weapon master within Farstrider Square in Silvermoon, can show you the proper techniques also."]="O mestre de armas Renegado Archibald conhece o seu caminho com a arma. Ele treina outros no Bairro de Guerra da Cidade Baixa. Ileda, o mestre da arma dos elfos sanguíneos na Farstrider Square em Silvermoon, também pode mostrar as técnicas adequadas."
G["The Forsaken will pay for what they've done!"]="The Forsaken will pay for what they've done!"
G["The Fossil-Finder 3000 indicates that there is a large fossil to the east of here."]="The Fossil-Finder 3000 indicates that there is a large fossil to the east of here."
G["The Fossil-Finder 3000 indicates that there is a large fossil to the north of here."]="The Fossil-Finder 3000 indicates that there is a large fossil to the north of here."
G["The Fossil-Finder 3000 indicates that there is a large fossil to the northeast of here."]="The Fossil-Finder 3000 indicates that there is a large fossil to the northeast of here."
G["The Fossil-Finder 3000 indicates that there is a large fossil to the northwest of here."]="The Fossil-Finder 3000 indicates that there is a large fossil to the northwest of here."
G["The Fossil-Finder 3000 indicates that there is a large fossil to the south of here."]="The Fossil-Finder 3000 indicates that there is a large fossil to the south of here."
G["The Fossil-Finder 3000 indicates that there is a large fossil to the southeast of here."]="The Fossil-Finder 3000 indicates that there is a large fossil to the southeast of here."
G["The Fossil-Finder 3000 indicates that there is a large fossil to the southwest of here."]="The Fossil-Finder 3000 indicates that there is a large fossil to the southwest of here."
G["The Fossil-Finder 3000 indicates that there is a large fossil to the west of here."]="The Fossil-Finder 3000 indicates that there is a large fossil to the west of here."
G["The Fostwolf Graveyard is owned by the Alliance."]="O Cemitério Lobo Gelo pertence à Aliança."
G["The Fostwolf Graveyard is owned by the Horde."]="O Cemitério Lobo Gelo pertence à Horda."
G["The Frost Lord has won."]="O Senhor da Gelo derrotou!"
G["The Frost Lord, Ahune, must be stopped.\nEven now he is taking form, summoned from his elemental prison by the mad cultists of the Twilight's Hammer.\nIf he's allowed to enter our world completely, he'll bury us beneath an eternal winter."]="É preciso parar ao Senhor da Gelo Ahune.\n\nEm estes mesmos instantes está tomando forma ao ser invocado do seu prisão elemental pelos cultistas loucos do Martelo Crepúsculo.\n\nSe consegue entrar em nosso mundo por completo, nos enterrará sob o manto de um inverno perpetuo."
G["The Frost Queen is gone. We must keep moving - our objective is near."]="A Rainha de Gelo se tem ido. Devemos seguir adiante. Nosso objetivo está perto."
G["The Frostlord... will... destroy you..."]="O Senhor da Gelo... te... destruirá."
G["The Frostmane trolls have been raiding the ranch continuously."]="Os trolls Peloescarcha têm estado atacando a fazenda continuamente."
G["The Frostwolf General is dead!"]="O geral Lobo Gelo morreu!"
G["The Frostwolf Graveyard is along the side of the road, not far north of Frostwolf Village.\n\nNeither side controls it."]="O Cemitério Lobo Gelo está logo ao lado do caminho, perto da Aldeia Lobo Gelo.\n\nAgora mesmo não pertence a ninguém."
G["The Frostwolf Graveyard is along the side of the road, not far north of Frostwolf Village.\n\nThe Alliance currently controls it."]="O Cemitério Lobo Gelo está logo ao lado do caminho, perto da Aldeia Lobo Gelo.\n\nAtualmente pertence à Aliança."
G["The Frostwolf Graveyard is along the side of the road, not far north of Frostwolf Village.\n\nThe Horde currently controls it."]="O Cemitério Lobo Gelo está logo ao lado do caminho, perto da Aldeia Lobo Gelo.\n\nAtualmente pertence à Horda."
G["The Frostwolf Graveyard is under attack!  If left unchecked, the Alliance will capture it!"]="Estão atacando o Cemitério Lobo Gelo! Se não fazemos algo, a Aliança se apoderará de ele!"
G["The Frostwolf Graveyard is under attack!  If left unchecked, the Horde will capture it!"]="Estão atacando o Cemitério Lobo Gelo! Se não fazemos algo, a Horda se apoderará de ele!"
G["The Frostwolf Graveyard was taken by the Alliance!"]="A Aliança capturou o Cemitério Lobo Gelo!"
G["The Frostwolf Graveyard was taken by the Horde!"]="A Horda capturou o Cemitério Lobo Gelo!"
G["The Frostwolf Quartermaster is southwest of this bunker.  Enter the bunker and then exit on the right, you'll see the quartermaster a short way down the path."]="The Frostwolf Quartermaster is southwest of this bunker.  Enter the bunker and then exit on the right, you'll see the quartermaster a short way down the path."
G["The Frostwolf Relief Hut is under attack!  If left unchecked, the Alliance will capture it!"]="Estão atacando o Posto de auxilio Lobo Gelo! Se não fazemos algo, a Aliança se apoderará de ela!"
G["The Frostwolf Relief Hut is under attack!  If left unchecked, the Horde will capture it!"]="Estão atacando o Posto de auxilio Lobo Gelo! Se não fazemos algo, a Horda se apoderará de ela!"
G["The Frostwolf Relief Hut lies in Frostwolf Keep, south of the Frostwolf Towers.\n\nNeither side currently controls it."]="O Posto de auxilio Lobo Gelo está no Bastião Lobo Gelo, ao sul das Torres Lobo Gelo.\n\nAgora mesmo não pertence a ninguém."
G["The Frostwolf Relief Hut lies in Frostwolf Keep, south of the Frostwolf Towers.\n\nThe Alliance currently controls it."]="O Posto de auxilio Lobo Gelo está no Bastião Lobo Gelo, ao sul das Torres Lobo Gelo.\n\nAtualmente pertence à Aliança."
G["The Frostwolf Relief Hut lies in Frostwolf Keep, south of the Frostwolf Towers.\n\nThe Horde controls it."]="O Posto de auxilio Lobo Gelo está no Bastião Lobo Gelo, ao sul das Torres Lobo Gelo.\n\nAtualmente pertence à Horda."
G["The Frostwolf Relief Hut was taken by the Alliance!"]="A Aliança capturou o Posto de auxilio Lobo Gelo!"
G["The Frostwolf Relief Hut was taken by the Horde!"]="A Horda capturou o Posto de auxilio Lobo Gelo!"
G["The Frostwolf forces gain the General's Warcry."]="As tropas Lobo Gelo obtêm o Brado Guerreiro do Geral."
