G["The General is determined to set up camp here.\n\nI hope he knows what he's doing..."]="O geral se empenha em estabelecer o acampamento aqui.\n\nEspero que sepao que há..."
G["The Ghostlands will not be won back by military force alone, $n.  That's where we magisters come in.\n\nOur guile and knowledge of the arcane are unmatched."]="The Ghostlands will not be won back by military force alone, $n.  That's where we magisters come in.\n\nOur guile and knowledge of the arcane are unmatched."
G["The Ginormus has fallen! $n looks like $Ghe's:she's; ready for more!"]="O Enormus tem caído! Parece que $n está $gpronto: pronta; para mais!"
G["The Glacial Falls be to the east, mon. Bring back da best armor ya be findin'. Those Alliance won't know what hit 'em."]="The Glacial Falls be to the east, mon. Bring back da best armor ya be findin'. Those Alliance won't know what hit 'em."
G["The Glacial Falls is a dangerous place, $n. The Horde will be just as happy to claim your armor for their vile hoodoo magics."]="The Glacial Falls is a dangerous place, $n. The Horde will be just as happy to claim your armor for their vile hoodoo magics."
G["The Glintrok Scout shouts a warning!"]="O explorador Glintrok advierte aos mais a gritos!"
G["The Glopgut ogres stormed Thundermar while Colin was here at the summit. They kidnapped Fanny and ran for the hills!"]="The Glopgut ogres stormed Thundermar while Colin was here at the summit. They kidnapped Fanny and ran for the hills!"
G["The Gnomeregan riders believe in balance and precision, deftly mixing attack and defense.\n\nHowever, they will often open themselves to Charges by trying to gain range on you.\n\nClose that range with a Charge before they can do the same, and then Shield-Break them as you wheel around for more Thrusts."]="The Gnomeregan riders believe in balance and precision, deftly mixing attack and defense.\n\nHowever, they will often open themselves to Charges by trying to gain range on you.\n\nClose that range with a Charge before they can do the same, and then Shield-Break them as you wheel around for more Thrusts."
G["The Goblin All-In-1der Belt's battery is depleted."]="A bateria do Cinto Goblin de Mil-e-Uma Utilidades acabou."
G["The Goddess has granted me wisdom, stranger. If it is her will, I shall pass it on to you."]="A Deusa me concedeu sabedoria, estranho. Se for a vontade dela, eu a transmitirei."
G["The Golden Keg is in the northen part of the Dwarven District, right by the fountain."]="O Golden Keg fica na parte norte do distrito de Dwarven, ao lado da fonte."
G["The Golden Lotus has overseen the Vale for thousands of years.\n\nThe heavens have sent us their sign, and we stand united in our belief that it is time to open the gates once more.\n\nAre you ready?"]="The Golden Lotus has overseen the Vale for thousands of years.\n\nThe heavens have sent us their sign, and we stand united in our belief that it is time to open the gates once more.\n\nAre you ready?"
G["The Golden Lotus is charged with defending the Vale of Eternal Blossoms.\n\nIf you wish to help us, defeat enemies of the Golden Lotus who currently occupy the Vale.\n\nYou may also speak to Anji Autumnlight at the Setting Sun Garrison training camp for further tasks."]="The Golden Lotus is charged with defending the Vale of Eternal Blossoms.\n\nIf you wish to help us, defeat enemies of the Golden Lotus who currently occupy the Vale.\n\nYou may also speak to Anji Autumnlight at the Setting Sun Garrison training camp for further tasks."
G["The Golden Lotus will never yield."]="The Golden Lotus will never yield."
G["The Golden Lotus... they pledged their lives to defend this place."]="The Golden Lotus... they pledged their lives to defend this place."
G["The Gordunni Ogres have blighted this land long enough. We are here to take this land and its resources for the Horde."]="Os Ogros Gordunni arruinaram esta terra por tempo suficiente. Estamos aqui para pegar esta terra e seus recursos para a Horda."
G["The Gordunni are a large ogre tribe that has control over considerable portions of forests in Feralas. Their dark magic seeps into the elements around them, damaging both the environment and the creatures that inhabit it.\n\nIf you do decide to travel to Feralas, please be mindful of these ogres -- they are quite nasty and many are able to wield powerful dark magic."]="The Gordunni are a large ogre tribe that has control over considerable portions of forests in Feralas. Their dark magic seeps into the elements around them, damaging both the environment and the creatures that inhabit it.\n\nIf you do decide to travel to Feralas, please be mindful of these ogres -- they are quite nasty and many are able to wield powerful dark magic."
G["The Grand Admiral himself has come to see to our dedication.  If I see you slacking on your post again, I will gut you myself."]="The Grand Admiral himself has come to see to our dedication.  If I see you slacking on your post again, I will gut you myself."
G["The Grand Crusader has charged me with destroying you and your newfound friends, Taelan, but know this: I do this for pleasure, not of obligation or duty."]="The Grand Crusader has charged me with destroying you and your newfound friends, Taelan, but know this: I do this for pleasure, not of obligation or duty."
G["The Grand Widow Faerlina, a botanist in life, breeder and caretaker of arachnids in death, she overseers the spider wing, developing the most potent of poisons for the Lich King."]="The Grand Widow Faerlina, a botanist in life, breeder and caretaker of arachnids in death, she overseers the spider wing, developing the most potent of poisons for the Lich King."
G["The Great One will smash you!"]="The Great One will smash you!"
G["The Greatmother raised all of us. Any Mag'hari that you see has had their life touched in some special way by the Greatmother. We will miss her greatly when she passes."]="A bisavó criou todos nós. Qualquer Mag'hari que você vê teve sua vida tocada de alguma maneira especial pela avó. Sentiremos muita falta dela quando ela passar."
G["The Grimleer tribe owns this forest. We'll kill anyone who creeps on our turf."]="Este boske pertence à tribo Visão Vil. Mataremos a tudo o ke pise nosso território."
G["The Grimtotem attacked us by surprise. We're barely hanging on here."]="O Grimtotem nos atacou de surpresa. Mal estamos aguentando aqui."
G["The Grimtotem have struck us for the last time. Since they cannot be taught the error of their ways, we will destroy them like beasts.\n\nEarth Mother forgive us."]="The Grimtotem have struck us for the last time. Since they cannot be taught the error of their ways, we will destroy them like beasts.\n\nEarth Mother forgive us."
G["The Grimtotem will never surrender!"]="The Grimtotem will never surrender!"
G["The Guild Master & Vendor."]="O mestre de guilda e vendedor."
G["The Gumps are letting me help them run their shop! I just love flowers.\n\n<Little Adeline suddenly squints at you, looking very serious.>\n\nDo you like flowers?"]="The Gumps are letting me help them run their shop! I just love flowers.\n\n<Little Adeline suddenly squints at you, looking very serious.>\n\nDo you like flowers?"
G["The Gurubashi are dead, and Hakkar with them.  Most of my fellow Zandalar have returned to their homeland.\n\nIt falls on me, Chabal, and the Darkspears of Bambala to watch over Zul'Gurub now."]="Os Gurubashi estão mortos, e Hakkar com eles. A maioria de meus companheiros Zandalariano têm voltado ao seu lar.\n\nAgora somos nós, Chabal, os Lança Negra de Bambala e eu, os que devemos vigilar Zul'gurub."
G["The Gurubashi are dead, and Hakkar with them.  Most of my fellow Zandalar have returned to their homeland.\n\nIt falls on me, Maywiki, and the Darkspears of Bambala to watch over Zul'Gurub now."]="The Gurubashi are dead, and Hakkar with them.  Most of my fellow Zandalar have returned to their homeland.\n\nIt falls on me, Maywiki, and the Darkspears of Bambala to watch over Zul'Gurub now."
G["The Gurubashi attackers just keep streaming in! We've been pinned down here and haven't received word from the outlying outposts in days."]="Os atacantes Gurubashi continuam entrando! Estamos presos aqui e não recebemos notícia dos postos avançados há dias."
G["The Gurubashi have fallen on hard times.  I live, and Mandokir has returned... but the rest of us are gone."]="The Gurubashi have fallen on hard times.  I live, and Mandokir has returned... but the rest of us are gone."
G["The Hall of Spirits is where our shamans call home.  You can find it on the Spirit Rise.  May your ancestors watch over you."]="O Salão dos Espíritos é onde nossos xamãs chamam de lar. Você pode encontrá-o na Ascensão do Espírito. Que seus antepassados ​​cuidem de você."
G["The Halls of Lightning, a level 80 dungeon within Storm Peaks, is now available for testing. Please be in your full group before teleporting to the dungeon. Meeting Stones are not available for this dungeon yet.\nTo leave the Halls of Lightning, simply exit through the normal exit inside the dungeon and you will be returned here. If you die and release, you should teleport back from this NPC."]="The Halls of Lightning, a level 80 dungeon within Storm Peaks, is now available for testing. Please be in your full group before teleporting to the dungeon. Meeting Stones are not available for this dungeon yet.\nTo leave the Halls of Lightning, simply exit through the normal exit inside the dungeon and you will be returned here. If you die and release, you should teleport back from this NPC."
G["The Halls of Origination lie due east of here, near the desert sands of Tanaris. It be a bit of a walk, so we'd best get movin'."]="The Halls of Origination lie due east of here, near the desert sands of Tanaris. It be a bit of a walk, so we'd best get movin'."
G["The Halls of Stone, a level 77-79 dungeon within Storm Peaks, is now available for testing. Please be in your full group before teleporting to the dungeon. Meeting Stones are not available for this dungeon yet.\nTo leave the Halls of Stone, simply exit through the normal exit inside the dungeon and you will be returned here. If you die and release, you should teleport back from this NPC."]="The Halls of Stone, a level 77-79 dungeon within Storm Peaks, is now available for testing. Please be in your full group before teleporting to the dungeon. Meeting Stones are not available for this dungeon yet.\nTo leave the Halls of Stone, simply exit through the normal exit inside the dungeon and you will be returned here. If you die and release, you should teleport back from this NPC."
G["The Hammer of Twilight. (The Hammer of Twilight!) Commissioned by the Aspect of Death. It is the breaker of worlds. It is not yours to wield. (Kill the intruders!) Kill them all!"]="The Hammer of Twilight. (The Hammer of Twilight!) Commissioned by the Aspect of Death. It is the breaker of worlds. It is not yours to wield. (Kill the intruders!) Kill them all!"
G["The Harsh Light reveals a Pale Fog!"]="A Luz abrasadora revela uma névoa pálida!"
G["The Headless Horseman attacks the village!  Someone must save the children and stop him!"]="O Cavaleiro Sem Cabeça ataca a vila! Alguém deve salvar as crianças e detê-o!"
G["The Headless Horseman attacks!  The fires threaten to consume the whole village!  What will we do?"]="O Cavaleiro Sem Cabeça ataca! Os incêndios ameaçam consumir toda a vila! O que faremos?"
G["The Headless Horseman had been driven away, for now.  We may breath easy for a time, but must remain ever vigilant."]="O Cavaleiro Sem Cabeça havia sido expulso, por enquanto. Podemos respirar tranqüilamente por um tempo, mas devemos permanecer sempre vigilantes."
G["The Headless Horseman has set fire to the village!  We must protect the children!"]="O Cavaleiro Sem Cabeça incendiou a vila! Nós devemos proteger as crianças!"
G["The Headless Horseman is attacking!  Quickly, aid your Horde brethren in the village's defense!"]="O Cavaleiro Sem Cabeça está atacando! Rapidamente, ajude seus irmãos da Horda na defesa da vila!"
G["The Headless Horseman lives in the Scarlet Monastery with all the other creepy ghosts and humans."]="O Cavaleiro Sem Cabeça vive no Mosteiro Escarlate com todos os outros fantasmas e humanos assustadores."
G["The Headless Horseman lives in the Scarlet Monastery.  Sometimes he comes out and scares the grown ups, but not me!"]="O Cavaleiro Sem Cabeça vive no Mosteiro Escarlate. Às vezes ele sai e assusta os adultos, mas não eu!"
G["The Headless Horseman was scared away!"]="O Cavaleiro Sem Cabeça estava assustado!"
G["The Headless Horseman was scary, but I wasn't scared!  Not me!"]="O Cavaleiro Sem Cabeça era assustador, mas eu não estava assustado! Eu não!"
G["The Headless Horseman's mind is plagued with dementia!  During Hallow's End, he might attack this village at any moment."]="A mente do Cavaleiro Sem Cabeça é atormentada por demência! Durante o Hallow's End, ele pode atacar esta vila a qualquer momentos."
G["The Headless Horseman's undead mind is obsessed!  During Hallow's End, his attacks on this village are frequent, and terrible."]="A mente morta-viva do Cavaleiro Sem Cabeça é obcecada! Durante o Hallow's End, seus ataque a esta vila são frequentes e terríveis."
G["The Headless Horseman, once a knight of the Silver Hand and a hero among his fellow paladins, is cursed.  Driven insane within the Scarlet Monastery, he believes that he is alive and we are dead.\n\nNow, his fervor no longer serves the Light.  With the coming of Hallow's End, he spreads gloom and fire across the villages of Azeroth."]="The Headless Horseman, once a knight of the Silver Hand and a hero among his fellow paladins, is cursed.  Driven insane within the Scarlet Monastery, he believes that he is alive and we are dead.\n\nNow, his fervor no longer serves the Light.  With the coming of Hallow's End, he spreads gloom and fire across the villages of Azeroth."
G["The Heart of Fury... I witnessed its power long ago, when Velen wielded it.  I feel the same power coursing through it right now!"]="The Heart of Fury... I witnessed its power long ago, when Velen wielded it.  I feel the same power coursing through it right now!"
G["The Heart will be your end!"]="O coração será seu fim!"
G["The Helm of Hodir!"]="O Elmo de Hodir!"
G["The Helmsman comes for you!"]="The Helmsman comes for you!"
G["The High Commander said to speak with you to get a ride to Thorson's Post."]="O Alto comandante quer falar com você quando vá ao Posto de Thorson."
G["The High Executor is a very busy man, $c.  Maybe I can help you with whatever you need?"]="O Sumo Executor é um homem muito ocupado, $c. Talvez eu possa ajudar você com o que necesites."
G["The High Inquisitor comes! Be ready, death knight! Do not let him draw you out of the protective bounds of my anti-magic field! Kill him and take his head!"]="Vem o Alto Inquisidor! Prepare-se, cavaleiro da Morte! Não deixe que te saque dos limite protetores de meu campo antimagia! Mátalo e pegue sua cabeça!"
G["The High King has no intention of letting Garrosh continue his mad campaign. It is costing too many innocent lives.\n\nWe are here to look for vulnerabilities in Orgrimmar's defenses. The sort of vulnerabilities that an Alliance army could take advantage of.\n\nUnfortunately, it looks like Garrosh has not been idle. He has stepped up recruitment of Kor'kron and turned them into a full-fledged war machine."]="The High King has no intention of letting Garrosh continue his mad campaign. It is costing too many innocent lives.\n\nWe are here to look for vulnerabilities in Orgrimmar's defenses. The sort of vulnerabilities that an Alliance army could take advantage of.\n\nUnfortunately, it looks like Garrosh has not been idle. He has stepped up recruitment of Kor'kron and turned them into a full-fledged war machine."
G["The High King, his champions, and the Dark Iron dwarves worked together to save Ironforge."]="O Alto Rei, seus campeões e os anões Ferro Negro trabalharam juntos para salvar Altaforja."
G["The High King. Varian Wrynn - Leader of the Alliance."]="O Alto-rei. Varian Wrynn – o líder da Aliança."
G["The High Priest sends his regrets.  He had hoped that one day you would be a powerful weapon against our enemies."]="The High Priest sends his regrets.  He had hoped that one day you would be a powerful weapon against our enemies."
G["The High Priestess could not leave Darnassus. Fandral is in a very foul mood."]="A Alta Sacerdotisa não podia deixar Darnassus. Fandral está de mau humor."
G["The High Priestess will feast on your bones!"]="A suma sacerdotisa se dará um banquete com os seus ossos!"
G["The High Shaman is here - I can see the storm clouds. Crush him, that we may take his skull as a trophy!"]="The High Shaman is here - I can see the storm clouds. Crush him, that we may take his skull as a trophy!"
G["The Highborne Archmage, Aranhir Starsinger, is a master of arcane reforging... you might convince him to aid you.\nHe can often be found discussing his craft with those of Simply Enchanting, just outside the Magus Commerce Exchange in northwest Dalaran."]="The Highborne Archmage, Aranhir Starsinger, is a master of arcane reforging... you might convince him to aid you.\nHe can often be found discussing his craft with those of Simply Enchanting, just outside the Magus Commerce Exchange in northwest Dalaran."
G["The Highborne ghosts that you see wandering through the courtyard and halls of Eldre'Thalas were slain, not by invading Gordok ogres or satyrs, but by the Prince himself!"]="Os fantasmas dos Altaneiros que você vê vagando pelo pátio e corredores de Eldre'Thalas foram mortos, não invadindo ogros ou sátiros de Gordok, mas pelo próprio príncipe!"
G["The Highborne have returned, and with them spellcraft lost to the world for centuries.\n\nDo you have something for me to examine?"]="The Highborne have returned, and with them spellcraft lost to the world for centuries.\n\nDo you have something for me to examine?"
G["The Highborne, Irriende, inside of the inn, can train you in the ways of the arcane."]="The Highborne, Irriende, inside of the inn, can train you in the ways of the arcane."
G["The Highlord has requested more abominations!"]="O Alto Senhor pediu mais abominações!"
G["The Highlord was the lynchpin of the Crusade. Aye, Mograine was called the Ashbringer because of his exploits versus the armies of the Lich King. With only blade and faith, Mograine would walk into whole battalions of undead and emerge unscathed - the ashes of his foes being the only indication that he had been there at all. Do you not understand? The very face of death feared him! It trembled in his presence!"]="The Highlord was the lynchpin of the Crusade. Aye, Mograine was called the Ashbringer because of his exploits versus the armies of the Lich King. With only blade and faith, Mograine would walk into whole battalions of undead and emerge unscathed - the ashes of his foes being the only indication that he had been there at all. Do you not understand? The very face of death feared him! It trembled in his presence!"
G["The Hippogryph is a noble beast, proud and swift.  They are an honor to train, and can quickly take their rider a great distance."]="O hipogrifo é um animal nobre, orgulhoso e rápido. Eles são uma honra para treinar e podem rapidamente levar o cicpronta a uma grande distância."
G["The Hole is a foul place $n.  I would not venture down there unless you are well armed and ready for battle."]="The Hole is a foul place $n.  I would not venture down there unless you are well armed and ready for battle."
G["The Honor Quartermaster can be found on the Serpent's Spine, the great wall to the west.\n\nI will mark their location on your map for you."]="O intendente de honra se encontre no Espinhaço do Dragão, a grande muralha que há ao oeste.\n\nTe marcarei seu localização no mapa."
G["The Hooded Crusader gazes down upon the high inquisitor's blade-skewered corpse."]="A cruzada encapuchada dê um olhada ao cadáver desgarrado do alto inquisidor."
G["The Horde Captain Galvangar is slain.  Defeat Drek'Thar and victory will be ours!"]="Têm matou ao capitão da Horda Galvangar. Derrodada Drek'Thar e a vitória será nossa."
G["The Horde Embassy is in the Valley of Strength on the west side."]="A Embaixada da Horda fica no Vale da Força, no lado oeste."
G["The Horde Flag has returned to its base!"]="A bandeira da Horda foi devolvida à base!"
G["The Horde Flag is now placed at its base."]="Agora a bandeira da Horda está situada na base."
G["The Horde Flag was dropped by $n!"]="$n tem saído cair a bandeira da Horda!"
G["The Horde Flag was picked up by $n!"]="The Horde Flag was picked up by $n!"
G["The Horde Flag was returned to its base by $n!"]="$n tem devolvido a bandeira da Horda ao seu base!"
