G["The Horde battlemasters can usually be found on a stairwell southeast of the city's center."]="Os mestres de batalha da Horda geralmente podem ser encontrados em uma escada a sudeste do centro da cidade."
G["The Horde bridge is under attack!"]="Estão atacando o ponte da Horda!"
G["The Horde brought back a hozen?! Dinna' they had enough of those back in Pandaria?"]="The Horde brought back a hozen?! Dinna' they had enough of those back in Pandaria?"
G["The Horde cannot be allowed to recover the Focusing Iris.  Eliminate what remains of their forces, and I will secure the artifact."]="The Horde cannot be allowed to recover the Focusing Iris.  Eliminate what remains of their forces, and I will secure the artifact."
G["The Horde cannot win!"]="A Horda não pode ganhar!"
G["The Horde captured the last flag!"]="A Horda capturou a última bandeira!"
G["The Horde captured the titan portal!"]="A Horda capturou o portal dos titãs!"
G["The Horde cries for a hero of old. An orc of true blood that will bow to no human and bear no betrayal. A warrior that will make our people proud again. Garrosh can be that hero."]="The Horde cries for a hero of old. An orc of true blood that will bow to no human and bear no betrayal. A warrior that will make our people proud again. Garrosh can be that hero."
G["The Horde demands justice! We challenge the Alliance! Allow us to battle in place of your knights, paladin. We will show these dogs what it means to insult the Horde."]="The Horde demands justice! We challenge the Alliance! Allow us to battle in place of your knights, paladin. We will show these dogs what it means to insult the Horde."
G["The Horde did attack the ship, preventing it from reaching Teldrassil. But that's only the beginning of it..."]="The Horde did attack the ship, preventing it from reaching Teldrassil. But that's only the beginning of it..."
G["The Horde did much to aid my people in freeing the Black Temple of Illidan's grasp. \n\nI will help you as a show of mutual trust."]="A Horda ajudou a meu gente a liberar o Templo Sombrio das garras de Illidan.\n\nTe ajudarei como gesto de confiança mutua."
G["The Horde doesn't pay me enough for this... this crap!"]="The Horde doesn't pay me enough for this... this crap!"
G["The Horde embraced my people when we stood alone and we Forsaken never forget a debt..."]="A Horda dio a boas-vindas a meu gente quando estávamos sozinhos e os Renegados nunca olvidamos uma dívida..."
G["The Horde fires will never be extinguished!"]="The Horde fires will never be extinguished!"
G["The Horde gold cart is now full and can be stolen from their base!"]="O carro de ouro da Horda já está cheio e se você pode roubar do seu base."
G["The Horde gold cart was returned to its base by $n!"]="$n tem levado o carro de ouro da Horda novamente ao seu base!"
G["The Horde gold cart was returned to its base!"]="Têm voltado a levar ao seu base o carro de ouro da Horda!"
G["The Horde has captured Wintergrasp Fortress!"]="A Horda tomou a Fortaleza de Invérnia!"
G["The Horde has captured a Mine Cart!"]="A Horda capturou uma vagoneta!"
