G["The Horde will find no purchase on these shores. And when the Thunder King lies beaten, the Pandaren will see that it was Alliance heroes who stood by them in their hour of need."]="The Horde will find no purchase on these shores. And when the Thunder King lies beaten, the Pandaren will see that it was Alliance heroes who stood by them in their hour of need."
