G["The Illidari demons keep me here because of my knowledge of ancient draenei crystals and relics.\n\nThey've enslaved many of my people and use us to look for a powerful crystal... one that in all likelihood is not even here."]="The Illidari demons keep me here because of my knowledge of ancient draenei crystals and relics.\n\nThey've enslaved many of my people and use us to look for a powerful crystal... one that in all likelihood is not even here."
G["The Illusionary Amber-Weaver conjures globs of amber that float toward you and explode on any contact. Lead the amber globs into other illusions."]="The Illusionary Amber-Weaver conjures globs of amber that float toward you and explode on any contact. Lead the amber globs into other illusions."
G["The Illusionary Mystic will heal any ally that is significantly wounded. Interrupt its healing spells."]="The Illusionary Mystic will heal any ally that is significantly wounded. Interrupt its healing spells."
G["The Infinite Dragonflight has destroyed the %s!"]="O Voo Infinito tem destruído o %s!"
G["The Infinite Dragonflight is attempting to alter the destiny of Prince Arthas Menethil.\n\nYou know him now as the Lich King, but here and now he was still a Prince of Lordaeron trying to do what was best for his kingdom.\n\nArthas makes a very fateful choice today, leading to something we Keepers of Time call an inflection point in the timeline."]="The Infinite Dragonflight is attempting to alter the destiny of Prince Arthas Menethil.\n\nYou know him now as the Lich King, but here and now he was still a Prince of Lordaeron trying to do what was best for his kingdom.\n\nArthas makes a very fateful choice today, leading to something we Keepers of Time call an inflection point in the timeline."
G["The Infinites are attempting something unusually subtle for them. They are trying to hide the evidence that will lead to Arthas deciding to cull Stratholme.\n\nTheir agents have used illusionary magic on the plagued grain shipments in the nearby countryside to make them appear normal.\n\nI need you to find the hidden grain, and use this Arcane Disruptor on the shipments. Arthas' men are looking for plagued grain, and should find it quickly with the illusion gone."]="The Infinites are attempting something unusually subtle for them. They are trying to hide the evidence that will lead to Arthas deciding to cull Stratholme.\n\nTheir agents have used illusionary magic on the plagued grain shipments in the nearby countryside to make them appear normal.\n\nI need you to find the hidden grain, and use this Arcane Disruptor on the shipments. Arthas' men are looking for plagued grain, and should find it quickly with the illusion gone."
G["The Infrared Light reveals a Crimson Fog!"]="The Infrared Light reveals a Crimson Fog!"
G["The Injured Rainspeaker Oracle rises clumsily to its feet."]="O Oráculo Hablalhuvia ferido se coloca de pé com torpeza."
G["The Inn"]="A pousada"
G["The Inn?  Ah, ye looking to toss back some of the best ales Ironforge has to offer?  The Stonefire Tavern is where ye'll want to go. \n\nYe'll find it just to the left of the entrance to Ironforge if ye be coming, or to the right if ye be going."]="The Inn?  Ah, ye looking to toss back some of the best ales Ironforge has to offer?  The Stonefire Tavern is where ye'll want to go. \n\nYe'll find it just to the left of the entrance to Ironforge if ye be coming, or to the right if ye be going."
G["The Inn?  Ah, ye looking to toss back some of the best ales Ironforge has to offer?  The Stonefire Tavern is where ye'll want to go.  \n\nYe'll find it just to the left of the entrance to Ironforge if ye be coming, or to the right if ye be going."]="The Inn?  Ah, ye looking to toss back some of the best ales Ironforge has to offer?  The Stonefire Tavern is where ye'll want to go.  \n\nYe'll find it just to the left of the entrance to Ironforge if ye be coming, or to the right if ye be going."
