G["The Ironforge riders are a tenacious lot, relying heavily on their defenses and steadfastly trading blows with their opponents, strike for strike.\n\nTrying wearing them down with Charges while maintaining your own Defense... meet them with a defensive advantage so that they will suffer the most with each exchange."]="The Ironforge riders are a tenacious lot, relying heavily on their defenses and steadfastly trading blows with their opponents, strike for strike.\n\nTrying wearing them down with Charges while maintaining your own Defense... meet them with a defensive advantage so that they will suffer the most with each exchange."
G["The Isle of Conquest is laden with valuable resources we cannot allow to fall into Alliance hands. Will you join the fight?"]="A Ilha da Conquista está carregada de recursos valiosos que não podemos deixar de cair nas mãos da Aliança. Você vai se juntar à luta?"
