G["The Isle of Quel'Danas has been overrun by the forces of Prince Kael'thas Sunstrider. Intel had him pegged as deceased. Intel was wrong."]="The Isle of Quel'Danas has been overrun by the forces of Prince Kael'thas Sunstrider. Intel had him pegged as deceased. Intel was wrong."
G["The Jade Serpent is nearly complete. You know what that means? Several months of cheering, celebrating, sleeping, and brewing! I can't wait!"]="O dragão de jade quase está pronto. Sabe o que indica isso? Meses celebrando, durmiendo e destilando! Não vejo o momentos!"
G["The Jade Serpent is the incarnation of wisdom in Pandaria. Let's see what she has to say."]="A Serpente de Jade é a encarnação da sabedoria em Pandária. Vejamos o que ela tem a dizer."
