G["The King's royal banner. Someone of royal blood certainly slept in this chamber."]="The King's royal banner. Someone of royal blood certainly slept in this chamber."
G["The Kingways is treacherous. Proceed with caution."]="The Kingways é perigoso. Procede com cautela."
G["The Kirin Tor can keep Dalaran for all I care. This is where I feel most at home, behind enemy lines, right in the thick of things!"]="The Kirin Tor can keep Dalaran for all I care. This is where I feel most at home, behind enemy lines, right in the thick of things!"
G["The Kirin Tor can't possibly spare any additional resources to take on anything that size. We may not have to though."]="The Kirin Tor can't possibly spare any additional resources to take on anything that size. We may not have to though."
G["The Kirin Tor must be stopped!"]="É preciso parar ao Kirin Tor!"
G["The Kirin Tor was betrayed from within. I've handled the situation."]="O Kirin Tor foi traído por um de seus membros. Mas já resolvi tudo."
G["The Kirin Tor will not tolerate insurrection."]="O Kirin Tor não tolerará a insurrecção."
G["The Kirin-Tor has a legacy of abuse. Kel'thuzad turned his knowledge of the arcane arts toward Necromancy."]="O Kirin Tor tem um histórico de abusos. Kel'thuzad, usando seu conhecimento das artes arcanas, voltou-se para a Necromancia."
G["The Klaxxi Paragons go berserk!"]="The Klaxxi Paragons go berserk!"
G["The Klaxxi are to be disbanded, by the will of the Empress."]="The Klaxxi are to be disbanded, by the will of the Empress."
G["The Klaxxi beckon..."]="Os Klaxxi me chamam..."
G["The Klaxxi do not give their trust easily, outsider. It has taken me many years to even be seen by them."]="Os Klaxxi não concedem seu confiança à leve, arauto. Me lado muitos anos que se percaten de meu existência."
G["The Klaxxi have betrayed her majesty. Your corpses will be strung from the palace walls for this."]="The Klaxxi have betrayed her majesty. Your corpses will be strung from the palace walls for this."
G["The Klaxxi have spoken. The Empress must fall."]="Os Klaxxi têm falado. A Imperatriz deve cair."
G["The Klaxxi said they needed someone to continue punishing fools in a future generation.\n\nI told them, \"I'm your mantid.\""]="The Klaxxi said they needed someone to continue punishing fools in a future generation.\n\nI told them, \"I'm your mantid.\""
G["The Klaxxi sent you to oppose the Swarm? Ah, how the mighty have fallen. Come, little fly. Take the paragon, if you can!"]="The Klaxxi sent you to oppose the Swarm? Ah, how the mighty have fallen. Come, little fly. Take the paragon, if you can!"
G["The Klaxxi'va you sent has fallen to an adjunct of Her majesty."]="O Klaxxi'vai que enviaste tem caído ante um súbdito do seu majestade."
G["The Kolkar are the strongest!"]="Os Kolkar são os mais fortes!"
G["The Kolkar invaders are retreating!"]="The Kolkar invaders are retreating!"
G["The Kolkar will rule!"]="The Kolkar will rule!"
G["The Kor'kron are making a push for this compound. They're not giving up!"]="The Kor'kron are making a push for this compound. They're not giving up!"
G["The Kor'kron are ready. Let them come and taste steel!"]="Os Kor'kron estão prontos. Que venham e prueben nosso aço!"
G["The Kor'kron could not fight better! For the Horde!"]="Os Kor'kron não poderiam lutar melhor! pela Horda!"
G["The Kor'thik have no equal in combat!"]="Os Kor'thik não conhecem rival no combate!"
G["The Krasarang Wild Brew is extremely volatile, $n! We could set the barrels near where the yaungol will approach and then blow them up. Grab one and I'll put a marker where we should place them."]="The Krasarang Wild Brew is extremely volatile, $n! We could set the barrels near where the yaungol will approach and then blow them up. Grab one and I'll put a marker where we should place them."
G["The Kun-Lai Kicker is finished, $n! Are you ready for the best brew in all of Pandaria? I'll warn you now, after drinking this brew you may want to kick things. Which is good because we have a lot of yaungol that need a good kicking!"]="The Kun-Lai Kicker is finished, $n! Are you ready for the best brew in all of Pandaria? I'll warn you now, after drinking this brew you may want to kick things. Which is good because we have a lot of yaungol that need a good kicking!"
G["The Kun-Lai Kicker is finished, $p! Now we can use it to kick some yaungol butt!"]="The Kun-Lai Kicker is finished, $p! Now we can use it to kick some yaungol butt!"
G["The Kur Drakkar is engulfed in tuskarr fire!"]="The Kur Drakkar is engulfed in tuskarr fire!"
G["The Kvaldir are without mercy, $n.  But I cannot abandon sacred Kaskala.  If we don't abandon the spirits, the spirits will not abandon us either."]="The Kvaldir are without mercy, $n.  But I cannot abandon sacred Kaskala.  If we don't abandon the spirits, the spirits will not abandon us either."
G["The Kvaldir have been purged from the city. Now we can begin our preparations."]="Os Kvaldir têm banido eliminados da cidade. Agora, iniciaremos os preparativos."
G["The Kvaldir have returned to take the city back from us, Battlemaiden. They will need you outside."]="The Kvaldir have returned to take the city back from us, Battlemaiden. They will need you outside."
G["The Lady Mehley"]="The Lady Mehley"
G["The Lady Mehley is in Theramore enough that we've been assigned to guard her passengers."]="Lady Mehley está em Theramore o suficiente para termos sido designados para guardar seus passageiros."
G["The Lady Mehley is the best ship EVER!"]="O Lady Mehley é o melhor navio NUNCA!"
G["The Lady has requested you back at the temple, Honor Guard."]="A Dama deseja que regreses ao templo, guarda de honra."
G["The Lady has sent word for your return to the temple. Do not delay."]="A Dama deseja que regreses ao templo. Não te retrases."
G["The League of Arathor has sworn to retake Arathi for humans of Stromgarde and the Alliance.  It is a battle hard fought, but a battle worth fighting."]="A Liga de Arathor jurou retomar Arathi para humanos de Stromgarde e da Aliança. É uma batalha dura, mas vale a pena lutar."
G["The League of Arathor is trying to reclaim their ancestral holdings in Arathi Basin from the Forsaken.  If you would aid them $n speak to Donal Osgood in the Hall of Arms."]="A Liga de Arathor está tentando recuperar seus antigas posesiones na Bacia Arathi dos Renegados. $n, se que ajudá-los, vê a falar com Donal Osbien na Salão de Armas."
G["The Left Arm has regrown!"]="O braço esquerdo voltou a crescer!"
G["The Legion reigns!"]="A Legião vencerá!"
G["The Legion requires you work faster!  Faster, worms!"]="The Legion requires you work faster!  Faster, worms!"
G["The Legion will conquer all!"]="A Legião o conquistará tudo!"
G["The Legion will consume you all!"]="A Legião os consumirá a todos!"
G["The Legion will prevail!"]="A Legião prevalecerá!"
G["The Legion's creations truly grow more foul by the day."]="As criações da Legião são cada dia mais grotescas."
G["The Legion's final conquest has begun! Once again the subjugation of this world is within our grasp. Let none survive!"]="The Legion's final conquest has begun! Once again the subjugation of this world is within our grasp. Let none survive!"
G["The Legion's machinations are truly intimidating!"]="The Legion's machinations are truly intimidating!"
G["The Legion... will never... fall."]="A Legião... mais... cairá."
G["The Lich King brought only small forces to bear against each of Azeroth's capital cities, while their main forces periodically attack the following lands:\n\nAzshara, the Blasted Lands, the Burning Steppes, the Tanaris Desert, the Eastern Plaguelands and Winterspring."]="The Lich King brought only small forces to bear against each of Azeroth's capital cities, while their main forces periodically attack the following lands:\n\nAzshara, the Blasted Lands, the Burning Steppes, the Tanaris Desert, the Eastern Plaguelands and Winterspring."
G["The Lich King cannot be stopped. Accept it."]="Não é possível parar ao Rei Lich. Acéptalo."
G["The Lich King demands more frost wyrms be sent to Angrathar! Meet his demands or face my wrath!"]="The Lich King demands more frost wyrms be sent to Angrathar! Meet his demands or face my wrath!"
G["The Lich King demands more saronite. Work harder fools or we'll feed you to the creature!"]="The Lich King demands more saronite. Work harder fools or we'll feed you to the creature!"
G["The Lich King has given me power beyond your wildest nightmares. Behold!"]="The Lich King has given me power beyond your wildest nightmares. Behold!"
G["The Lich King has spoken to each of you! Let his words resonate among you once more!"]="O Rei Lich tem falado com cada um dos vocês! Deixem que seus palavras resuenen no seu interior uma vez mais!"
G["The Lich King is attempting to make his presence known in our world. This must not be allowed to occur."]="O Rei Lich tenta fazer sentir seu presença em nosso mundo. Não devemos permitir que isto ocurra."
G["The Lich King is badly hurt.  We ought to stay behind and finish him."]="O Rei Lich está mal ferido."
G["The Lich King is here.  May the Light guide our blades."]="O Rei Lich está aqui. Que a Luz guíe nossas espadas."
G["The Lich King is here? Then my destiny shall be fulfilled on this day!"]="The Lich King is here? Then my destiny shall be fulfilled on this day!"
G["The Lich King is near, $n. His voice taunts me...\n\nLet us silence him at last!"]="O Rei Lich está perto, $n. Seu voz me provoca...\n\nAcalhémoslo de uma vez!"
G["The Lich King is stretching his hand far now... fearlessly treading on the most sacred lands of all of the flights.  He intends to force us to action."]="The Lich King is stretching his hand far now... fearlessly treading on the most sacred lands of all of the flights.  He intends to force us to action."
G["The Lich King is unlike any foe that you have ever faced, Highlord. Though you bested him upon the holy ground of Light's Hope Chapel, you tread now upon his domain."]="The Lich King is unlike any foe that you have ever faced, Highlord. Though you bested him upon the holy ground of Light's Hope Chapel, you tread now upon his domain."
G["The Lich King is unstoppable..."]="The Lich King is unstoppable..."
G["The Lich King knows your boundaries, Highlord. He knows that you will not fire on your own men. Do you not understand? He has no boundaries. No rules to abide."]="The Lich King knows your boundaries, Highlord. He knows that you will not fire on your own men. Do you not understand? He has no boundaries. No rules to abide."
G["The Lich King must answer for what he has done, and must not be allowed to cause further destruction in our world."]="The Lich King must answer for what he has done, and must not be allowed to cause further destruction in our world."
G["The Lich King must fall!!"]="O Rei Lich DEVE CAIR!!"
G["The Lich King reacted swiftly to the breach. Faster than I anticipated."]="O Rei Lich reagiu com rapidez ante a ruptura. Mais depressa do que eu achava."
G["The Lich King say to tell you... DIE!"]="The Lich King say to tell you... DIE!"
G["The Lich King shall consume all..."]="O Rei Lich o consumirá tudo..."
G["The Lich King shall extinquish... every... last... one... of you."]="O Rei Lich extinguirá... até... ao último... de vocês."
G["The Lich King tormented me without end, Darion."]="O Rei Lich me atormentó sem descanso, Darion."
G["The Lich King will be pleased with this initiate."]="The Lich King will be pleased with this initiate."
G["The Lich King will see his true champion on this day!"]="O Rei Lich verá ao seu campeão hoje!"
G["The Lich King's cruel reign has inflicted great suffering on all of Northrend's inhabitants, particularly the children. If you are a friend to the Oracles or Frenzyheart Tribe of Sholazar, perhaps you might consider caring for an orphan for a week."]="O reinado cruel de Rei Lich infligiu grande sofrimento a todos os habitantes de Northrend, principalmente às crianças. Se você é amigo da tribo Oracles ou Frenzyheart de Sholazar, talvez considere cuidar de um órfão por uma semana."
G["The Lich King's forces are building.  It is imperative that our timetable supports his plans."]="As forças do Rei Lich se estão intensificando. É fundamental que nosso trabalho sustente seus planos."
G["The Light be praised!  I would have died out here if it weren't for you, $c!  I must get to the ship."]="The Light be praised!  I would have died out here if it weren't for you, $c!  I must get to the ship."
G["The Light be with ya, $c. How can I help ya?"]="Que a Luz estiver com você, $c. Posso ajudar você?"
G["The Light be with ya, $n."]="Que a Luz te acompanhe, $n."
G["The Light burns bright in you, Davil.  I will enjoy snuffing it out!"]="The Light burns bright in you, Davil.  I will enjoy snuffing it out!"
G["The Light condemns all who harbor evil.  Now you will die!"]="A luz condena a tudo aquele que albergao mal. Agora morrerá!"
G["The Light gives us the strength and magic to triumph."]="A Luz nos dá força e magia para triunfar."
G["The Light has abandoned us!"]="A Luz nos abandonou!"
G["The Light has abandoned you!"]="A Luz os abandonou!"
G["The Light has no choice. It does as it is commanded. Just as the naaru you hold at the core of your vessel will do when we capture and enslave it... Do my words surprise you, blue blood? Yes, we know... We know everything."]="The Light has no choice. It does as it is commanded. Just as the naaru you hold at the core of your vessel will do when we capture and enslave it... Do my words surprise you, blue blood? Yes, we know... We know everything."
G["The Light has not chosen you for the Templar path, $C. Seek training elsewhere."]="The Light has not chosen you for the Templar path, $C. Seek training elsewhere."
G["The Light has spoken!"]="A Luz tem falado!"
G["The Light is my guide... it is my sustenance!"]="A Luz é meu guia... é meu sustento!"
G["The Light is my shield."]="A Luz é meu escudo."
G["The Light is no match for the Lich King's might!"]="A Luz não é rival para o poder do Rei Lich!"
G["The Light is with us this day!"]="A Luz nos acompanha hoje!"
G["The Light is with you, $c.  No harm will come to you today."]="A Luz está com você, $c. Hoje não sofrerá dano algum."
G["The Light must prevail!"]="A Luz deve prevalecer!"
G["The Light of Elune shine upon thee, $n!  You will find Aethalas, our battlemaster, on the Warrior's Terrace.  She will aid you on your way to Warsong Gulch."]="Que a Luz de Eluna brilhe sobre você, $n! Encontrar a Aethalas, nossa mestra de batalha, no Bancal do Guerreiro. Ela te ajudará no seu caminho até a Ravina Brado Guerreiro."
G["The Light protect you, $c."]="Que a Luz te proteja, $c."
G["The Light that guides us. This movement was set in motion before you came... We... We do as we are told. It is what must be done."]="The Light that guides us. This movement was set in motion before you came... We... We do as we are told. It is what must be done."
G["The Light wants its lost son back, Socrethar."]="A Luz quer recuperar ao seu filho perdido, Socrethar."
G["The Light will abandon you, hero, just as it did me."]="A Luz te abandonará, herói, como fez comigo."
G["The Light will bless these dismal halls once again... I swear it."]="The Light will bless these dismal halls once again... I swear it."
G["The Light will bless these dismal halls once again.... I swear it."]="The Light will bless these dismal halls once again.... I swear it."
G["The Light will consume you!"]="A Luz os consumirá!"
G["The Light wishes suffering on none, my child. But it does not reign unopposed in our realm."]="A Luz não lhe deseja sofrimento a ninguém, filho meu. Mas não é a única força de nosso reino."
G["The Light's blessing be upon you for aiding me in my time of need, $n."]="The Light's blessing be upon you for aiding me in my time of need, $n."
G["The Light?"]="A Luz?"
G["The Lightbringer..."]="O Iluminado..."
G["The Lightwarden's job is twofold.  Protect the priesthood at all costs first and foremost.  Destroy the enemies of the Light wherever they may hide second."]="O trabalho do Lightwarden é duplo. Proteja o sacerdócio a tudo custo em primeiro lugar. Destrua os inimigos da Luz onde quer que eles se escondam em segundo."
G["The Lion's Pride Inn in Goldshire is as good as any inn you will find around these parts.  Drop in and let Innkeeper Farley make you feel at home."]="O Lion's Pride Inn em Goldshire é tão bom quanto qualquer outra pousada que você encontrará nessas partes. Entre e deixe Innkeeper Farley fazer você se sentir em casa."
G["The Lithe Stalker is weakened by the assault."]="The Lithe Stalker is weakened by the assault."
G["The Loa gonna' eat you up."]="Os loa se te vão a zampar."
G["The Loch belongs to the Stonesplinter Tribe now, $n!  Now die!"]="O lago pertence agora à tribo dos Rompecantos, $n! E agora morre!"
G["The Long Tube Gadget Analyzer should tell me what I need to know."]="The Long Tube Gadget Analyzer should tell me what I need to know."
G["The Lord of Blackrock hangs from the arches!"]="O Senhor da Rocha Negra está pendurado nos arcos!"
G["The Lorehammer is reacting. This must be from Stormhoof's time."]="The Lorehammer is reacting. This must be from Stormhoof's time."
G["The Lorehammer is silent. This isn't from Stormhoof's time."]="O martelo de conhecimento está calhado. Isto não é da época de Pezunha Tempestuosa."
G["The Lorehammer..."]="O martelo de conhecimento..."
G["The Lorekeeper is an ancient. He has served under our glorious Queen!"]="O Lorekeeper é um antigo. Ele serviu sob nossa gloriosa rainha!"
G["The Lorewalker's art lacks both subtlety and technical expertise. Perhaps you can do better?"]="O arte do eremita carece de sutileza e destreza técnica. Talvez você possa fazer isso melhor."
G["The Lorewalkers travel the world, discovering new tales and retelling old ones.\n\nWe explore the rich history of the places and people in Pandaria.\n\nIf you would like to hear some of these stories for yourself, speak to Lorewalker Cho at the Seat of Knowledge, above the entrance to Mogu'shan Palace here in the Vale of Eternal Blossoms."]="The Lorewalkers travel the world, discovering new tales and retelling old ones.\n\nWe explore the rich history of the places and people in Pandaria.\n\nIf you would like to hear some of these stories for yourself, speak to Lorewalker Cho at the Seat of Knowledge, above the entrance to Mogu'shan Palace here in the Vale of Eternal Blossoms."
end)(AscensionPTBR.GossipEN2ES)
;(function(G)
G["The Lorewalkers will send you to explore significant areas of Pandaria to recover cultural artifacts.\n\nOnce you find all the artifacts that belong to a collection, you will be able to hear the entire story from start to finish.\n\nFind all the artifacts and collect all the books to become a Lorewalker!\n\nIf you would like to become a researcher, then you should speak to Lorewalker Cho at the Seat of Knowledge."]="The Lorewalkers will send you to explore significant areas of Pandaria to recover cultural artifacts.\n\nOnce you find all the artifacts that belong to a collection, you will be able to hear the entire story from start to finish.\n\nFind all the artifacts and collect all the books to become a Lorewalker!\n\nIf you would like to become a researcher, then you should speak to Lorewalker Cho at the Seat of Knowledge."
G["The Lost Shandaral Spirit kneels silently before the violet waters, gazing into the tranquil surface of the pool."]="The Lost Shandaral Spirit kneels silently before the violet waters, gazing into the tranquil surface of the pool."
G["The Lovely Merchant is waiting for that. Hurry it up!"]="A mercador preciosa está esperando isto. Date pressa!"
G["The Lunar Festival celebration being held by the druids is taking place in Moonglade. If that's too far for you to travel, they are offering transportation just outside Stormwind."]="A celebração do Festival Lunar realizada pelos druidas está ocorrendo em Moonglade. Se é muito longe para você viajar, eles estão oferecendo transporte nos arredores de Stormwind."
G["The Lunar Festival holds special meaning for the night elves. We seek out the wisdom of our elders across the world."]="O Festival Lunar tem um significado especial para os elfos da noite. Buscamos a sabedoria de nossos ancestrais por tudo o mundo."
G["The Lunar Festival holds special meaning for the tauren. We seek out the wisdom of our elders across the world."]="O Festival Lunar tem um significado especial para os tauren. Buscamos a sabedoria de nossos ancestrais por tudo o mundo."
G["The Lunar Festival is a special time for us. We seek out our ancient elders, the Earthen, and pay homage to them."]="O Festival Lunar é uma época especial para nós. Buscamos a nossos ancestrais, os terranos, e os honramos."
G["The Lunar Festival is in full swing in Moonglade. A delegation of druids can be found in the throne room of Undercity, transporting people there."]="O Festival Lunar está em plena marcha em Clareira da Lua. Se você pode encontrar uma delegação de druidas na salão do trono de Cidade Baixa, que transporta a gente ali."
G["The Lunar Festival is in full swing on Azeroth! Return there and honor your elders in this wonderful celebration! The main festivities can be found in Moonglade, but we've provided easy transportation from Stormwind, Ironforge, Darnassus, Thunder Bluff, Orgrimmar, and the Undercity. We hope to see you there!"]="O Festival Lunar está a tudo vapor em Azeroth! Volte para lá e honre seus anciãos nesta maravilhosa celebração! As principais festividades podem ser encontradas em Moonglade, mas fornecemos transporte fácil de Stormwind, Ironforge, Darnassus, Thunder Bluff, Orgrimmar e Undercity. Esperamos ver você lá!"
G["The Magical Menagerie is located in northeast Dalaran. Pet supplies, exotic mounts, and stables are all available there."]="O Menagerie Mágico está localizado no nordeste de Dalaran. Suprimentos para animais de estimação, montarias exóticas e estábulos estão disponíveis lá."
G["The Magistrate has fallen! Make your escape, my brothers."]="The Magistrate has fallen! Make your escape, my brothers."
G["The Magistrate is too well protected. Retreat!"]="O magistrado está mais que protegido. Replegaos!"
G["The Magus Commerce Exchange is in northwest Dalaran, and holds most of the city's profession trainers."]="A Magus Commerce Exchange fica no noroeste de Dalaran e detém a maioria dos treinadores profissionais da cidade."
G["The Maiden's Fancy"]="A fantasia da donzela"
G["The Maneweavers practice their professions out of their home on the road to Darnassus.  Nadyia is an excellent teacher when it comes to Leatherworking.  You should see what she can teach you."]="Os Maneweavers praticam suas profissões fosse de casa, no caminho para Darnassus. Nadyia é uma excelente professora quando se trata de Couraria. Você deve ver o que ela pode lhe ensinar."
G["The Manifestation of Terror has appeared on the battlefield!"]="A manifestação do terror tem aparecido no campo de batalha!"
G["The Manor has been abuzz with talk of your arrival, $G Master:Mistress; $n. We are all honored and graced by your presence."]="A Mansão bulhe de excitação com as notícia do seu chegada, $gMaestro: Mestra; $n. Todos nos sentimos honrados pelo seu presença."
G["The Mantid will cover this land, and devour all who oppose use!"]="Os mantídeos tomaremos esta terra e devoraremos a todos os que se opongan."
G["The Master has gone to great lengths to secure information about the whereabouts of the Exodar. You could have blown the entire operation, including the cover of our spy on the inside."]="The Master has gone to great lengths to secure information about the whereabouts of the Exodar. You could have blown the entire operation, including the cover of our spy on the inside."
G["The Master holds great interest in the lair of Nefarian. If only someone would defeat the dragon and his minions and retell the tale to the Prince. I bet that would loosen the Prince's lips. The Ashbringer could be found!"]="O Mestre tem grande interesse no covil de Nefarian. Se ao menos alguém derrotasse o dragão e seus lacaios e recontasse a história ao príncipe. Aposto que isso afrouxaria os lábios do príncipe. O Ashbringer pode ser encontrado!"
G["The Master is deep in study."]="The Master is deep in study."
G["The Master is resting after his labors."]="O Mestre está descansando depois dos seus tarefas."
G["The Master shall rain hellfire upon Azeroth, and then we will at last cleanse the Light from this wretched world!"]="O Mestre provocará uma chuva de fogo infernal em Azeroth. Finalmente purgaremos a Luz deste mundo infecto!"
G["The Master will be pleased."]="O Mestre ficará satisfeito."
G["The Master will return from Stormwind soon...."]="The Master will return from Stormwind soon...."
G["The Master's will remains inviolate..."]="A vontade do mestre permanece intacta..."
G["The Matrix Punchograph Technologic Huerist-o-meter has detected your aptitude in engineering.  You may now choose from the following option(s):\n01000111 01101111 00100000 01100111 01101111 00100000 01100111 01101111 00100001 00100001"]="The Matrix Punchograph Technologic Huerist-o-meter has detected your aptitude in engineering.  You may now choose from the following option(s):\n01000111 01101111 00100000 01100111 01101111 00100000 01100111 01101111 00100001 00100001"
G["The Melee Target trains Aspirants in both mounted attack and defense.\n\nApproach the Melee Target and strike it with a Thrust attack. The force of the blow often spins the target hard enough to injure you or your mount. This is where defense comes into play.\n\nBe certain to have at least one layer of Defend before attacking the target, and continue to stack and refresh Defend throughout the training exercise. Otherwise, you may well find yourself dismounted.\n\nThe same holds true in actual mounted combat: Balance attack and defense, Thrusting at every opportunity and maintaining your layers of Defend as best you can."]="The Melee Target trains Aspirants in both mounted attack and defense.\n\nApproach the Melee Target and strike it with a Thrust attack. The force of the blow often spins the target hard enough to injure you or your mount. This is where defense comes into play.\n\nBe certain to have at least one layer of Defend before attacking the target, and continue to stack and refresh Defend throughout the training exercise. Otherwise, you may well find yourself dismounted.\n\nThe same holds true in actual mounted combat: Balance attack and defense, Thrusting at every opportunity and maintaining your layers of Defend as best you can."
G["The Menagerie is for guests only."]="A coleção é somente para os convidados."
G["The Mercurial Guardian comes to life!"]="O guardião mercúrico cobra vida!"
G["The Mercurial Guardian's skin becomes as hard as silver!"]="A pele do guardião mercúrico se volta tão dura como a prata!"
G["The Midsummer Fire Festival has something for everyone to enjoy!"]="O Festival do Fogo do Solstício de Verão tem algo para todos os gostos!"
G["The Might of Kalimdor is victorious! The last of the Qiraji forces are defeated, retreating back to the ancient city-fortress of Ahn'Qiraj. The Qiraji Resonating Crystals littering Kalimdor vanish as quickly as they appeared, leaving behind nothing but sundered earth."]="The Might of Kalimdor is victorious! The last of the Qiraji forces are defeated, retreating back to the ancient city-fortress of Ahn'Qiraj. The Qiraji Resonating Crystals littering Kalimdor vanish as quickly as they appeared, leaving behind nothing but sundered earth."
G["The Might of Kalimdor will halt their advances!"]="O poder de Kalimdor detendrá seu avanço!"
G["The Militant Mystic in southern Dalaran should have what you desire."]="O Militant Mystic no sul de Dalaran deve ter o que você deseja."
G["The Military Ward is clear of rifts and we have completed the evacuation of the citizens in this district!"]="A Salão Militar está despejada de falhas e temos levado a cabo a complete evacuação dos cidadãos deste distrito!"
G["The Mist-Hopper Jr. is on the dock just southeast of here. Let's go!"]="The Mist-Hopper Jr. is on the dock just southeast of here. Let's go!"
G["The Mistress of the Tides will need your defense back at the temple. Make your way there immediately."]="A Senhora das Marés te precisa para defendao templo. Deve voltar imediatamente."
G["The Moat Monster submerges."]="The Moat Monster submerges."
G["The Mogu cannot reclaim our rightful glory without our clan's strength!"]="Os mogu não recuperaremos a glória sna força de nosso clã!"
G["The Molten Eggs begin to crack and splinter!"]="The Molten Eggs begin to crack and splinter!"
G["The Molten Eggs begin to hatch!"]="The Molten Eggs begin to hatch!"
G["The Monastery... it worries me that we have heard nothing from them..."]="O Monastério... me preocupa que não tenhamos tido notícia de eles..."
G["The Monkey King broke the mallet and sent the pieces afar."]="O Rei Macaco quebrou a marreta e mandou pra longe da visão."
G["The Monkey King was there, the last time this mallet struck true. Tears came to eyes, and harmony was felt through and through. But no more ointment was ever made, for the mogu came with their raid. Use what you have, be grateful it is there. For the bell is a dangerous weapon, so handle with care."]="O Rei Macaco presenciou a última vez que a marreta o sino tocou. Ele chorou de alegria, sentindo tanta harmonia. Mas cessou a produção de unguento, pois os mogus atacaram com vil intento. Use o unguento e use bem, aproveite enquanto tem. O Sino é uma arma de grande poder, tome cuidado, ou a coisa vai feder."
G["The Narsong crocolisk is no more... simply because the pandaren didn't see the whole story."]="The Narsong crocolisk is no more... simply because the pandaren didn't see the whole story."
G["The Nathrezim are merciless villains who feed upon the energies of mortal creatures."]="The Nathrezim are merciless villains who feed upon the energies of mortal creatures."
G["The Nerub'ar have been punished for their transgression!"]="Os Nerub'ar têm banido castigados pelo seu transgresão!"
G["The Nerubians built an empire beneath the frozen wastes of Northrend. An empire that you so foolishly built your structures upon. MY EMPIRE."]="The Nerubians built an empire beneath the frozen wastes of Northrend. An empire that you so foolishly built your structures upon. MY EMPIRE."
G["The Netherwing. They speak to us. They offered us peace and protection. Something the broken have never truly felt. We accepted their offer and assisted Toranaku in rousing the creatures of this mine - at great personal cost to us. Many of my brothers gave their lives for this offensive. We were attempting to make the mine uninhabitable, forcing the Dragonmaw to relocate and ultimately move off of this island."]="O Netherwing. Eles falam conosco. Eles nos ofereceram paz e proteção. Algo que os quebrados nunca sentiram verdadeiramente. Aceitamos a oferta e ajudamos Toranaku a despertar as criaturas desta mina - a um custo pessoal considerável para nós. Muitos de meus irmãos deram a vida por essa ofensiva. Estávamos tentando tornar a mina inabitável, forçando o Dragonmaw a se mudar e, finalmente, sair desta ilha."
G["The Nexus War will not be stopped!"]="A guerra do Nexus não se detendrá!"
G["The Night Watch alone cannot protect us forever.  We need the backing of the Stormwind Army."]="The Night Watch alone cannot protect us forever.  We need the backing of the Stormwind Army."
G["The Nightmare Elixir takes hold!"]="O Elixir de pesadelos se arraiga!"
G["The Nightmare Elixir wears off!"]="O Elixir de pesadelos de de surtir efeito!"
G["The Nightmare cannot be stopped!"]="Ninguém poderá parar à Pesadelos!"
G["The Nightmare is finally over!  Darrowshire, forgive me!"]="O pesadelo finalmente acabou! Darrowshire, me perdoe!"
G["The North Wind is the ancient enemy of the taunka, a ruler among the elements, and the very force which bleeds the life from these ancient people."]="O Vento do Norte é o ancestral inimigo dos taunkas, um soberano entre os elementos e a força que arrebata a vida a este antigo povo."
G["The North Wind? It still troubles my people?"]="O Vento do Norte? Ainda molesta a meu gente?"
G["The Northern Crossroads changed tracks!"]="The Northern Crossroads changed tracks!"
G["The Northern Pylon accepts yellow, red, and green crystals.\n\nThe focus is the energy that can be created using yellow crystals as the main source of power. There are two possible effects: one that will produce damage, and one that will negate damage. \n\nCrystal Charge requires red and yellow crystals. This will produce a large explosion, stunning your enemies.\n\nCrystal Restore requires yellow and green crystals. This will provide you with a healing aura."]="The Northern Pylon accepts yellow, red, and green crystals.\n\nThe focus is the energy that can be created using yellow crystals as the main source of power. There are two possible effects: one that will produce damage, and one that will negate damage. \n\nCrystal Charge requires red and yellow crystals. This will produce a large explosion, stunning your enemies.\n\nCrystal Restore requires yellow and green crystals. This will provide you with a healing aura."
G["The Northpass tower needs our aid!  Once again, let us charge and do proud our liege!"]="The Northpass tower needs our aid!  Once again, let us charge and do proud our liege!"
G["The Oculus is ours!"]="O Oculus é nosso!"
G["The Ogre clans will not be subjugated.  Not by the gronn, and not by a puny $r like you!"]="The Ogre clans will not be subjugated.  Not by the gronn, and not by a puny $r like you!"
G["The Old God would create avatars from the silithid in its own image. These avatars were to be known as Qiraji. Sentient and with purpose, the Qiraji would name their creator: C'Thun was born... For many thousands of years the Qiraji worked feverishly to build a force capable of laying waste to the world that would betray their god. The great fortress city of Ahn'Qiraj was created to house their growing armies and prepare for the coming of C'Thun."]="The Old God would create avatars from the silithid in its own image. These avatars were to be known as Qiraji. Sentient and with purpose, the Qiraji would name their creator: C'Thun was born... For many thousands of years the Qiraji worked feverishly to build a force capable of laying waste to the world that would betray their god. The great fortress city of Ahn'Qiraj was created to house their growing armies and prepare for the coming of C'Thun."
G["The Old Gods have shown themselves - a tide of darkness sweeps from their gaping maws towards the temple. We MUST buy the aspects more time."]="Os deuses antigos se têm mostrado; uma onda de escuridão se extiende desde seus enormes fauces para o templo. Devemos ganhar tempo para os Aspectos."
G["The Old Gods protect the Soul!"]="The Old Gods protect the Soul!"
G["The Old Gods will be restored.  You will not be allowed to interfere!"]="Os deuses antigos serão restituidos. Não poderá interferir!"
G["The Old One calls to you!"]="O Antigo os chama!"
G["The Old One grants us strength."]="O Antigo nos da poder."
G["The Order of the Cloud Serpent is sworn to defend the Jade Forest. We train at the Arboretum, just to the north of the Temple of the Jade Serpent in the Jade Forest."]="The Order of the Cloud Serpent is sworn to defend the Jade Forest. We train at the Arboretum, just to the north of the Temple of the Jade Serpent in the Jade Forest."
G["The Order of the Shattered Hand existed before Thrall and shall exist after Thrall."]="The Order of the Shattered Hand existed before Thrall and shall exist after Thrall."
G["The Orgrimmar Auction House is in the Valley of Strength.  Look for it on the east side next to Boomstick Imports."]="A Casa de Leilões Orgrimmar fica no Vale da Força. Procure-o no lado leste, próximo a Boomstick Imports."
G["The Orgrimmar riders pride themselves on fearless and devastating charges. Such is their skill and ferocity that even when charged themselves they simply charge right back.\n\nTry staying close and Thrusting, and when they attempt to gain range, throw them off-balance with a Shield-Breaker before you Charge. Otherwise, they'll meet you head-on every time."]="The Orgrimmar riders pride themselves on fearless and devastating charges. Such is their skill and ferocity that even when charged themselves they simply charge right back.\n\nTry staying close and Thrusting, and when they attempt to gain range, throw them off-balance with a Shield-Breaker before you Charge. Otherwise, they'll meet you head-on every time."
G["The Pandaren are deeply concerned about the return of this \"Thunder King.\" But I'm more concerned about the Horde. We can talk during the flight."]="The Pandaren are deeply concerned about the return of this \"Thunder King.\" But I'm more concerned about the Horde. We can talk during the flight."
G["The Pandaren are terrified that the former Emperor will try to reclaim his empire, and enslave them once again."]="The Pandaren are terrified that the former Emperor will try to reclaim his empire, and enslave them once again."
G["The Paragons of Power are remnants from the ancient Gurubashi Empire.  We Zandalar seek them - not only are they of tremendous collectible value to us, but we believe that they also hold latent signatures of magic used by the old Empire.\n\nYou'll more than likely discover three kinds of Paragons in Zul'Gurub: coins, bijous, and primal items.  Bring them to us in the quantities that we seek, and you'll be rewarded with some of the finest items we Zandalar have ever crafted."]="The Paragons of Power are remnants from the ancient Gurubashi Empire.  We Zandalar seek them - not only are they of tremendous collectible value to us, but we believe that they also hold latent signatures of magic used by the old Empire.\n\nYou'll more than likely discover three kinds of Paragons in Zul'Gurub: coins, bijous, and primal items.  Bring them to us in the quantities that we seek, and you'll be rewarded with some of the finest items we Zandalar have ever crafted."
G["The Paragons of Power are remnants from the ancient Gurubashi Empire.  We Zandalar seek them - not only are they of tremendous collectible value to us, but we believe that they also hold the strongest of mojo used by the old Empire.\n\nYa can expect to be findin' three kinds of Paragons in Zul'Gurub: coins, bijous, and primal items.  Bring them to us in the quantities that we seek, and you'll be rewarded with the some of the finest items we Zandalar have ever crafted.\n\nCount on it, mon!"]="The Paragons of Power are remnants from the ancient Gurubashi Empire.  We Zandalar seek them - not only are they of tremendous collectible value to us, but we believe that they also hold the strongest of mojo used by the old Empire.\n\nYa can expect to be findin' three kinds of Paragons in Zul'Gurub: coins, bijous, and primal items.  Bring them to us in the quantities that we seek, and you'll be rewarded with the some of the finest items we Zandalar have ever crafted.\n\nCount on it, mon!"
G["The Park"]="O Parque"
G["The Park is where you want to go if you are looking for druid trainers. Theridan and Maldryn can usually be found by the moonwell in the center of the district."]="O parque é para onde você quer ir se você estiver procurando por treinadores de druidas. Theridan e Maldryn geralmente podem ser encontrados pelo poço da lua no centro do distrito."
G["The Park's been ruined... we'll have to go another way, today. Miserable dragon!"]="The Park's been ruined... we'll have to go another way, today. Miserable dragon!"
G["The Park...?\n\nIt's in ruins. Haven't you heard? The great dragon Deathwing soared over Stormwind and destroyed it in passing.\n\nNot sure why he didn't level everything, honestly, but we all thank the Light he didn't."]="The Park...?\n\nIt's in ruins. Haven't you heard? The great dragon Deathwing soared over Stormwind and destroyed it in passing.\n\nNot sure why he didn't level everything, honestly, but we all thank the Light he didn't."
G["The Pearlfin do not trust us. We must show them that we mean no harm."]="The Pearlfin do not trust us. We must show them that we mean no harm."
G["The People of Westfall salute $n, a brave and valiant defender of freedom."]="O Povo dos Cerro Oeste vidaa a $n, $gsoberbio: soberbia; e corajoso $gdefensor: defensora; da liberdade."
G["The Pincer X2 has docked. All aboard!"]="O Tenazario X2 chegou ao cais. Subam a bordo!"
G["The Pincer X2 will be arriving shortly! Get your gear and form up, boys!"]="O Tenazario X2 chegará em breve! Peguem suas coisas e a formar, pessoal!"
G["The Plaguelands are an excellent place to strike against the Scourge!"]="As Terras Pestilentas são um excelente lugar para atacar o Flagelo!"
G["The Plaguewood is too big!  Your friend is gone!  You will never find him!"]="The Plaguewood is too big!  Your friend is gone!  You will never find him!"
G["The Plates of Uldum are discs synthesized by the Creators that allow access into the Uldum compound.  These discs house and store specific data related to the Creators' activities here.\n\nPhysically, they are nearly identical in circumference to the disc set you currently possess.  Their markings, however, are directly related to information on Uldum as opposed to the Uldaman complex."]="The Plates of Uldum are discs synthesized by the Creators that allow access into the Uldum compound.  These discs house and store specific data related to the Creators' activities here.\n\nPhysically, they are nearly identical in circumference to the disc set you currently possess.  Their markings, however, are directly related to information on Uldum as opposed to the Uldaman complex."
G["The Pool of Tears in the Swamp of Sorrows holds ancient locked boxes that were lost in another age."]="A Piscina de Lágrimas no Pântano das Dores contém antigas caixas trancadas que foram perdidas em outra era."
G["The Pools of Youth were an ancient fable my grandsires told me long ago. Now this old man intends to find them!"]="The Pools of Youth were an ancient fable my grandsires told me long ago. Now this old man intends to find them!"
G["The Primal Gods serve Hakkar. Turn back now, you stand no chance."]="The Primal Gods serve Hakkar. Turn back now, you stand no chance."
G["The Primal Gods? Impossible!"]="Os deuses primordiais? Possível!"
G["The Prince of Stormwind is unguarded! Why don't we capture him for the Horde?"]="O Príncipe de Ventobravo está desprotegido! Por que não o capturamos para a Horda?"
G["The Prince plotted to imprison a demon of immense power behind a grand force field. The pylons would channel latent energies into the field, keeping it operational.\n\nWhile imprisoned, Immol'thar would serve as a battery to the populace of Eldre'Thalas."]="The Prince plotted to imprison a demon of immense power behind a grand force field. The pylons would channel latent energies into the field, keeping it operational.\n\nWhile imprisoned, Immol'thar would serve as a battery to the populace of Eldre'Thalas."
G["The Qiraji forces were commanded to fall back and hide the bulk of their numbers beneath the sands of the desert. A small attack was ordered upon Southwind Village while the front lines of Staghelm's army were kept occupied."]="The Qiraji forces were commanded to fall back and hide the bulk of their numbers beneath the sands of the desert. A small attack was ordered upon Southwind Village while the front lines of Staghelm's army were kept occupied."
G["The Quicksilver falls off his blades! Kill the blobs to absorb their power!"]="The Quicksilver falls off his blades! Kill the blobs to absorb their power!"
G["The Quilboar here are too dangerous to get riled up over outside conflicts, $r. My totem will not ward them off forever.\n\nWe must put a stop to their transgressions against nature."]="The Quilboar here are too dangerous to get riled up over outside conflicts, $r. My totem will not ward them off forever.\n\nWe must put a stop to their transgressions against nature."
G["The Rabid Mastiff slobbers all over the floor..."]="The Rabid Mastiff slobbers all over the floor..."
G["The Ragemesa leader is in the caves!"]="O líder da Meseta Infame está nas cavernas!"
G["The Ranger-General of Silvermoon will be a loyal ally!"]="The Ranger-General of Silvermoon will be a loyal ally!"
G["The Rapier has fallen to the ground.  Pick it up to engage Admiral Hagman!"]="The Rapier has fallen to the ground.  Pick it up to engage Admiral Hagman!"
G["The Raven Claw Talisman is located on the ledge in the upper section of the northern chamber."]="The Raven Claw Talisman is located on the ledge in the upper section of the northern chamber."
G["The Razza just made more fertilizer for Mushgog!"]="O Razza acaba de fazer mais fertilizante para Mushgog."
G["The Rear Admiral will hear of this."]="The Rear Admiral will hear of this."
G["The Recombobulator is shaping up quite nicely. Just a few adjustments to go!"]="The Recombobulator is shaping up quite nicely. Just a few adjustments to go!"
G["The Red Crane of Hope has inspired the citizens of Pandaria from the very dawn of history. I very much want to speak with him."]="A Grulha Vermelha da esperança tem inspirado às gentes de Pandaria desdo albor dos tempos. Estou desejando hablarle."
G["The Red Crane saw hope in me, and instructed me to look inward. Despite my visage of despair, I found this hope, and the despair was vanquished."]="A Garça Vermelha viu esperança em mim e me instruiu para olhar para dentro. Apesar de desesperado, eu encontrei a esperança, e o desespero desvaneceu."
G["The Regent Lord will want a full report. Let's get you back to camp - you have earned a rest."]="O Senhor regente querrá um relatório completo. Regresemos, te ganhou um descanso."
G["The Reliquary is hot on the trail o' that bell at Mogujia."]="O Relicário está procurando a sino em Mogujia."
G["The Remnant of Dahlia Suntouch fades away..."]="O resto de Dália Toque Solar se desaparece..."
G["The Right Arm has regrown!"]="O braço direito voltou a crescer!"
G["The Ring of Trials was once of place of great glory and honor. But then, the Steamwheedle Cartel came, with their wagons of gold and quill pens sharper than any orc axe..."]="O Anel das Provações já foi um lugar de grande glória e honra. Mas então, o Cartel Steamwheedle chegou, com as suas carroças de ouro e canetas de pena mais afiadas do que qualquer machado orc..."
G["The Rogue Trainer's name is Marion Call.  You can find her upstairs in the reading room at the Gallows' End Tavern at the town's southeast edge."]="O nome do Rogue Trainer é Marion Call. Você pode encontrá-a no andar de cima, na sala de leitura da Gallows 'End Tavern, na extremidade sudeste da cidade."
G["The Rohendor Gate has been shattered! Move forward, champions!"]="A porta Rohendor foi destrozada! Adiante, campeões!"
G["The Royal Apothecary Society has little patience for fools, as do I.  Perhaps the next time you and I speak of my steeds, you will be considered a friend of the Undercity.  Until then..."]="The Royal Apothecary Society has little patience for fools, as do I.  Perhaps the next time you and I speak of my steeds, you will be considered a friend of the Undercity.  Until then..."
G["The Royal Apothecary Society has little patience for fools, as do I.  Perhaps the next time you and I speak of my steeds, you will be considered exalted by the Undercity.  Until then..."]="A Sociedade Real de Boticário tem pouca paciência para os tolos, assim como eu. Talvez da próxima vez que você e eu falarmos de meus corcéis, você será considerado exaltado pela Cidade Baixa. Até então..."
G["The Royal Apothecary Society of the Undercity is eager to aid our orc allies here, in Outland.  It is an opportunity to strengthen our bonds, and to find new specimens and compounds for study.\n\nCompounds...such as poisons."]="The Royal Apothecary Society of the Undercity is eager to aid our orc allies here, in Outland.  It is an opportunity to strengthen our bonds, and to find new specimens and compounds for study.\n\nCompounds...such as poisons."
G["The Royal Apothecary Society welcomes you to Northrend, $c.  Now, what is it that you will do to aid us in Sylvanas' service?"]="The Royal Apothecary Society welcomes you to Northrend, $c.  Now, what is it that you will do to aid us in Sylvanas' service?"
G["The Royal Exchange auction house can be found in the eastern part of the city, just south of the training area for the blood knights and rangers."]="A casa de leilões Royal Exchange pode ser encontrada na parte leste da cidade, ao sul da área de treinamento para cavaleiros e guardas florestais."
G["The Royal Quarter is just up ahead, Warchief."]="O Bairro Real está logo linha de frente, Chefe de Guerra."
G["The Ruins of Eldarath."]="As ruínas de Eldarath."
G["The Rune of Nesting is located across the bridge in the upper section of the southern chamber."]="The Rune of Nesting is located across the bridge in the upper section of the southern chamber."
G["The Runebreaker fails to free the Runed Giant, weakening it and causing it to attack!"]="The Runebreaker fails to free the Runed Giant, weakening it and causing it to attack!"
G["The SD-5 Automated Shredder defense unit. A labor of love."]="The SD-5 Automated Shredder defense unit. A labor of love."
G["The Sacred Pools have been corrupted by dark energy, thanks to Garrosh Hellscream. Remnants of the sha still linger."]="As Poços Sagradas têm banido corrompidas por energias sombrios por culpar de Garrosh Grito Infernal. Ainda há restos de sha."
G["The Sandfury reign supreme!"]="O reino de Furiarena é invencível!"
G["The Sapphire of Sky is located at the separate room in the lower section of the northern chamber."]="O safira de céu se encontre em uma habitação individual na seção inferior da câmera norte."
G["The Sarkhoff's... sometimes the Sarkhoff's visit. They are good people."]="Os Sarkhoff... a vezes a visite de Sarkhoff. São boa gente."
G["The Scarlet Crusade is not over! Undeath is merely a setback!"]="The Scarlet Crusade is not over! Undeath is merely a setback!"
G["The Scarlet Crusade is powerless to stop us!"]="The Scarlet Crusade is powerless to stop us!"
G["The Scarlet Crusade of Tyr's Hand in the Eastern Plaguelands have many lockboxes that will challenge your skill."]="A Cruzada Escarlate da Mão de Tyr nas Terras Pestilentas Orientais tem muitos cofres que desafiam sua habilidade."
G["The Scarlet Crusade shall not fail in its mission!"]="The Scarlet Crusade shall not fail in its mission!"
G["The Scarlet Crusade shall smite the wicked and drive evil from these lands!"]="A Cruzada Escarlate azotará ao perverso e expulsará ao demônio de estas terras!"
G["The Scarlet Crusade will return to its noble roots!"]="A Cruzada Escarlate retornará às suas raízes nobres!"
G["The Scarlet Crusade will scour these lands!"]="A Cruzada Escarlate dará uma batida em estas terras!"
G["The Scarlet Crusade will serve a new master - in death..."]="A Cruzada Escarlate servirá a um novo mestre - na morte..."
G["The Scarlet Monastery belongs to the Forsaken now!"]="Agorao Monastério Escarlate pertence aos Renegados!"
G["The Scarlet fleet lies in ruin upon the sundered coast!"]="A frota Escarlate jaz em ruínas sobre a costa destruído!"
G["The Scepter of Domination glows brightly! Use it now!"]="O Cetro de Dominação brilha com força! Alvo agora!"
G["The Scepter of the Shifting Sands is whole once more, $n.\n\nIt is you who must lead your armies into the cursed fortress city of Ahn'Qiraj and mete justice to its inhabitants.\n\nVenture to Silithus and present the Scepter of the Shifting Sands to Jonathan the Revelator."]="The Scepter of the Shifting Sands is whole once more, $n.\n\nIt is you who must lead your armies into the cursed fortress city of Ahn'Qiraj and mete justice to its inhabitants.\n\nVenture to Silithus and present the Scepter of the Shifting Sands to Jonathan the Revelator."
G["The Scepter of the Shifting Sands is whole once more, $n.\n\nIt must be you who uses the scepter. It must be you who heralds in the next age of your people.\n\nWhen you are prepared to ring the Scarab Gong and once more open the gates of Ahn'Qiraj, I will grant you the Scepter. You have only to ask."]="The Scepter of the Shifting Sands is whole once more, $n.\n\nIt must be you who uses the scepter. It must be you who heralds in the next age of your people.\n\nWhen you are prepared to ring the Scarab Gong and once more open the gates of Ahn'Qiraj, I will grant you the Scepter. You have only to ask."
G["The Scepter of the Shifting Sands is whole once more, $n.\n\nIt must be you who uses the scepter. It must be you who heralds in the next age of your people. \n\nYou must wait for the armies of the Horde and the Alliance to arrive in Silithus before you may ring the Scarab Gong. The time for war is close at hand."]="O cetro do Mar de Dunas está completo uma vez mais, $n.\n\nDeve ser você quem use o cetro. Deve ser você quno anuncie ao seu povo na próxima era. \n\nDeve esperar a que os exércitos da Horda e da Aliança cheguem a Silithus para fazer soar o gongo do Besouro. O tempo da guerra está próximo."
G["The Scholomance is housed in crypts beneath the Caer Darrow keep. Once owned by the noble Barov family, the keep fell to ruin after the Second War. As the wizard Kel'Thuzad enlisted followers for his Cult of the Damned, he often promised immortality for those who served his Lich King. The Barovs fell to his influence and donated their keep, but the cultists killed the family and turned the crypts into a school of necromancy. Though Kel'Thuzad no longer resides there, cultists and instructors still remain."]="The Scholomance is housed in crypts beneath the Caer Darrow keep. Once owned by the noble Barov family, the keep fell to ruin after the Second War. As the wizard Kel'Thuzad enlisted followers for his Cult of the Damned, he often promised immortality for those who served his Lich King. The Barovs fell to his influence and donated their keep, but the cultists killed the family and turned the crypts into a school of necromancy. Though Kel'Thuzad no longer resides there, cultists and instructors still remain."
G["The School for Necromancy known as Scholomance is on the ruined island of Caer Darrow in the Western Plaguelands."]="A Escola de Necromancia, conhecida como Scholomance, fica na ilha arruinada de Cair Darrow, nas Terras Pestilentas Ocidentais."
G["The Scoured Reach lies to the west."]="The Scoured Reach lies to the west."
G["The Scourge are a blemish upon these pristine lands.  By the might of my creators, I will crush every last one of their decrepit bones under my heel."]="O Flagelo é uma mancha nessas terras imaculadas. Pelo poder de meus criadores, esmagarei cada um dos seus ossos decrépitos sob meus calcanhares."
G["The Scourge are a fearless machine set to bring about the end of all life on this world."]="O Flagelo é uma máquina destemida para trazer o fim de toda a vida neste mundo."
G["The Scourge are at the castle entrance!  For Stormwind!  For King Anduin!"]="O Flagelo está à entrada do Castelo! Por Ventobravo! pelo rei Anduin!"
G["The Scourge are at the entrance to the Royal Quarter!  Kill them!!"]="O Flagelo está às portões do Bairro Real! Matem-nos!"
G["The Scourge are breaching the northern wall!"]="O Flagelo está entrando pelo muralha norte!"
G["The Scourge are breaching the southern wall!"]="O Flagelo está entrando pelo muralha sul!"
G["The Scourge are breaching the western wall!"]="O Flagelo está entrando pelo muralha oeste!"
G["The Scourge are defeated!  Darrowshire is saved!"]="The Scourge are defeated!  Darrowshire is saved!"
G["The Scourge are establishing small staging points in the places under attack, receiving communications and other assistance from the necropolises that fly overhead. From what we can tell, the only way to root them out is by killing the ground forces that surround the points."]="O Flagelo está estabelecendo pequenos pontos de aparo nos locais sob ataque, recebendo comunicações e outras ajudas das necrópoles que sobrevoam. Pelo que sabemos, a única maneira de eliminá-os é matando as forças terrestres que cercam os pontos."
G["The Scourge are everywhere!  This is... a nightmare!"]="O Flagelo está em toda parte! Isso é... um pesadelo!"
G["The Scourge are no match for me, Torp!"]="O Flagelo não é rival para mim, Torp!"
G["The Scourge are running freely through the streets!"]="O Flagelo corre livremente pelas ruas!"
G["The Scourge are upon us! Run! Run for your lives!"]="The Scourge are upon us! Run! Run for your lives!"
G["The Scourge attack against my court has been eliminated.  You may go about your business."]="The Scourge attack against my court has been eliminated.  You may go about your business."
G["The Scourge beckons you, foolish $r."]="O Flagelo te chama, $gestúpido: estúpida; $r."
G["The Scourge cannot be stopped..."]="Não é possível parar a o Flagelo..."
G["The Scourge descends like locust from the north."]="The Scourge descends like locust from the north."
G["The Scourge don't stand a chance!"]="O Flagelo não tem nenhuma oportunidade!"
G["The Scourge has broken through!"]="O Flagelo entrou!"
G["The Scourge has broken through! RUN AWAY! RUN AWAY!"]="The Scourge has broken through! RUN AWAY! RUN AWAY!"
G["The Scourge has us surrounded. We can hold the village for awhile, but if we can't defeat them, they will overrun us."]="The Scourge has us surrounded. We can hold the village for awhile, but if we can't defeat them, they will overrun us."
G["The Scourge have broken into the Bastion!  Redouble your efforts!  We must not fail!"]="The Scourge have broken into the Bastion!  Redouble your efforts!  We must not fail!"
G["The Scourge have broken through in all wings!  May the light defeat these foul creatures!  We shall fight to the last!"]="The Scourge have broken through in all wings!  May the light defeat these foul creatures!  We shall fight to the last!"
G["The Scourge infestation grows in Azshara. Every able bodied warrior is needed to stem the tide of their invasion.\n\nNumber of Necropolises remaining: $2279W"]="A presença do Flagelo vai em aumento em Azshara. É necessário que todos aqueles guerreiros que estejam aptos ajuden a frenar seu invasão.\n\nNúmero de necrópole restantes: $2279W"
G["The Scourge infestation grows in the Blasted Lands. Every able bodied warrior is needed to stem the tide of their invasion.\n\nNumber of Necropolises remaining: $2280W"]="The Scourge infestation grows in the Blasted Lands. Every able bodied warrior is needed to stem the tide of their invasion.\n\nNumber of Necropolises remaining: $2280W"
G["The Scourge infestation grows in the Eastern Plaguelands. Every able bodied warrior is needed to stem the tide of their invasion.\n\nNumber of Necropolises remaining: $2282W"]="A presença do Flagelo vai em aumento nas Terras da Fedor do Este. É necessário que todos aqueles guerreiros que estejam aptos ajuden a frenar seu invasão.\n\nNúmero de necrópole restantes: $2282W"
G["The Scourge must be stopped at any cost. We cannot permit them to field the army they're constructing here."]="O Flagelo deve ser interrompido a qualquer custo. Não podemos permitir que eles coloquem o exército que estão construindo aqui."
G["The Scourge shall reign supreme!"]="O Flagelo dominará tudo!"
G["The Scourge spread so rapidly, I often find myself wondering why they haven't already won this war."]="O Flagelo se espalhou tão rapidamente que muitas vezes me pergunto por que eles ainda não venceram esta guerra."
G["The Scourge will consume you!"]="O Flagelo te consumirá!"
G["The Scourge will destroy this place!"]="O Flagelo destruirá este lugar!"
G["The Scourge will destroy you all!  Death will sweep the lands!"]="The Scourge will destroy you all!  Death will sweep the lands!"
G["The Scourge will not prevail!"]="O Flagelo não se impondrá!"
G["The Scourge will rise again, under a dark new master... Ix'lar!"]="The Scourge will rise again, under a dark new master... Ix'lar!"
G["The Scourge will wash over this world as a swarm of death and destruction!"]="O Flagelo arrasará este mundo como um enxame de morte e destruição!"
G["The Scourge's plague is almost to the turning point; a handful more cauldron subversions will push us over the top!  Be sure to do your part to help out!"]="O Flagelo do flagelo está quase no ponto de virada; um punhado de mais subversões de caldeirão nos empurrará para o topo! Certifique-se de fazer sua parte para ajudar!"
G["The Scourge's plague still dominates the zone, and we have a long way to go before the plague will be altered enough to affect them.  Collect the necessary resources and help out the war effort!"]="O Flagelo do Flagelo ainda domina a zona, e ainda temos um longo caminho a percorrer antes que o Flagelo seja alterada o suficiente para afetá-os. Colete os recursos necessários e ajude o esforço de guerra!"
G["The Scryer's Tier has a library devoted to training professions.\n\nYou will find the knowledge you seek in the Seer's Library."]="na Grada do Arúspice há uma biblioteca especializada em profissões.\n\nEncontrar o conhecimento que atenção na Biblioteca do Profeta."
G["The Scryers bank is located southeast of the city's center."]="O banco Scryers está localizado a sudeste do centro da cidade."
G["The Scryers inn is located above Shattrath city, on Scryer's Tier. The lift to there is southwest of the city center."]="A pousada Scryers está localizada acima da Shattrath, no nível de Scryer. O elevador para lá fica a sudoeste do centro da cidade."
G["The Scythe of Antiok drops to the ground!"]="The Scythe of Antiok drops to the ground!"
G["The Sea Witch is 'ere, I can sense it. Stay and she's sure to come out of her hole soon enough."]="The Sea Witch is 'ere, I can sense it. Stay and she's sure to come out of her hole soon enough."
G["The Seers of Elder Rise will help you.  Seek them out in the Hall of Elders there."]="Os videntes do Alto dos Ancestrais te ajudarão. Búscalos na Salão dos Ancestrais."
G["The Sen'jin riders count on their nimbleness and skill at range.\n\nThey are quick and cunning enough to avoid your Charges, so try using a mixture of close-range Thrusts and the occasional Shield-Breaker to defeat them."]="The Sen'jin riders count on their nimbleness and skill at range.\n\nThey are quick and cunning enough to avoid your Charges, so try using a mixture of close-range Thrusts and the occasional Shield-Breaker to defeat them."
G["The Sentinels and I exchanged stories of our time in the Krasarang Wilds. I told them all about my adventures at the Temple of Chi-Ji."]="The Sentinels and I exchanged stories of our time in the Krasarang Wilds. I told them all about my adventures at the Temple of Chi-Ji."
G["The Sentinels and I exchanged stories of our time in the Krasarang Wilds. I told them all about our adventures together at the Temple of Chi-Ji."]="The Sentinels and I exchanged stories of our time in the Krasarang Wilds. I told them all about our adventures together at the Temple of Chi-Ji."
G["The Serpent's Maw is engulfed in tuskarr fire!"]="The Serpent's Maw is engulfed in tuskarr fire!"
G["The Sethekk believe themselves to be the true and most loyal followers of the master of all arakkoa. Do not ask about the master, $r, for his mysteries are for the feathered people alone.\n\nThe Sethekk interpreted the destruction of Auchindoun to be the arrival of our master on this planet. They set out for the ruins, taking with them the relics of our greatest hero, Terokk.\n\nThey still seek the master in the temple's ruins, but I came to see through their lies. I am no longer one of them."]="The Sethekk believe themselves to be the true and most loyal followers of the master of all arakkoa. Do not ask about the master, $r, for his mysteries are for the feathered people alone.\n\nThe Sethekk interpreted the destruction of Auchindoun to be the arrival of our master on this planet. They set out for the ruins, taking with them the relics of our greatest hero, Terokk.\n\nThey still seek the master in the temple's ruins, but I came to see through their lies. I am no longer one of them."
G["The Sha Abomination breathes pure death!  Move away from him!"]="A abominação sha exhala morte pura! Afaste-se de ele!"
G["The Sha Amalgamation banishes the Celestial Defender.  Defend yourself!"]="The Sha Amalgamation banishes the Celestial Defender.  Defend yourself!"
G["The Sha Amalgamation begins casting |cFFFF2222|Hspell:139382|h[Insanity]|h|r!  Discharge one of the anvils to stop it!"]="The Sha Amalgamation begins casting |cFFFF2222|Hspell:139382|h[Insanity]|h|r!  Discharge one of the anvils to stop it!"
G["The Sha Amalgamation casts |cFFFF2222|Hspell:139443|h[Meteor Storm]|h|r!"]="A amalgama de sha lança |cFFFF2222|Hspell:139443|h[Tempestade de meteoritos]|h|r!"
G["The Sha Amalgamation is casting |cFFFF2222|Hspell:139375|h[Shadow Burst]|h|r! Run Away!"]="A amalgama de sha começa a lançar |cFFFF2222|Hspell:139375|h[Rajada das Sombras]|h|r! Corre!"
G["The Sha Amalgamation is vulnerable!  Throw the |cFFFF2222[Lightning Lance]|r at it!"]="A amalgama de sha é vulnerável! Arrójale a |cFFFF2222[Lança do relâmpago]|r!"
G["The Sha are too many, we must flee while we still have the chance!"]="São demais Sha, devemos fugir enquanto possamos!"
G["The Sha have broken out of the temple. We must beat them back...or die trying."]="The Sha have broken out of the temple. We must beat them back...or die trying."
G["The Sha of Fear |cFFFF0404|Hspell:126121|h[Corrupts]|h|r a dissonance field!"]="O sha do medo |cFFFF0404|Hspell:126121|h[Corrompe]|h|r um campo de disonância!"
G["The Sha of Hatred has fled my body... and the monastery, as well. I must thank you, strangers. The Shado-Pan are in your debt. Now, there is much work to be done..."]="O Sha do ódio abandonou meu corpo... e o monastério. Os o agradeço, forasteiros. O Shadopan está em dívida com vocês. Agora fica muito trabalho por fazer..."
G["The Sha of Hatred is inside that mantid structure... I suspect it was drawn to a powerful host there."]="O Sha do Ódio está dentro daquela construção mantídea... Acho que ele foi atraído para um poderoso hospedeiro."
G["The Sha's hold over our people has been broken thanks to you. You have our thanks."]="The Sha's hold over our people has been broken thanks to you. You have our thanks."
G["The Sha'tar, or \"born from light\" are the naaru that came to Outland to fight the demons of the Burning Legion."]="The Sha'tar, or \"born from light\" are the naaru that came to Outland to fight the demons of the Burning Legion."
G["The Sha... must be... stopped..."]="Há... que parar... aos sha..."
G["The Shade of the Kaldorei closes its eyes and fades away."]="A Sombra dos Kaldorei cierraos olhos e desaparece."
G["The Shado-Pan Archers disappear!"]="The Shado-Pan Archers disappear!"
G["The Shado-Pan always friend of the grummles. Why are they not letting us in to trade?"]="O Shadopan sempre foi amigo dos grúmel. Por que não nos deixam entrar para negociar?"
G["The Shado-Pan are few in number, but we make up for it in strength."]="Os Shadopan somos poucos em número, mas o compensamos com nossa força."
G["The Shado-Pan are here! They may be of use to us. We should help."]="The Shado-Pan are here! They may be of use to us. We should help."
G["The Shado-Pan are legendary. Their force is unmatched in Pandaria."]="O Shadopan é lendário. Sua força não tem rival em Pandaria."
G["The Shado-Pan are not here because the wall needs them. Grummles owe much fortune to the Shado-Pan. If the Shado-Pan cannot defend grummles that means they are in danger, and need grummlepacks now more than ever."]="The Shado-Pan are not here because the wall needs them. Grummles owe much fortune to the Shado-Pan. If the Shado-Pan cannot defend grummles that means they are in danger, and need grummlepacks now more than ever."
G["The Shado-Pan has many secrets. High among those is how to craft weapons and armor of surpassing quality."]="The Shado-Pan has many secrets. High among those is how to craft weapons and armor of surpassing quality."
G["The Shado-Pan have held this wall for centuries, but I won't turn down help from outsiders for the sake of pride."]="The Shado-Pan have held this wall for centuries, but I won't turn down help from outsiders for the sake of pride."
G["The Shado-Pan hold the eternal vigil, keeping watch over the dark sha energies that were sealed away into the earth long ago.\n\nUnfortunately, the sha have escaped their prisons, and now we must defeat them once again."]="The Shado-Pan hold the eternal vigil, keeping watch over the dark sha energies that were sealed away into the earth long ago.\n\nUnfortunately, the sha have escaped their prisons, and now we must defeat them once again."
G["The Shado-Pan is an ancient order that accepts and trains only the most elite and worthy.\n\nShould you manage to make yourself useful, you may find many powerful items available to you."]="The Shado-Pan is an ancient order that accepts and trains only the most elite and worthy.\n\nShould you manage to make yourself useful, you may find many powerful items available to you."
G["The Shado-Pan need no outside aid! Remove these interlopers!"]="The Shado-Pan need no outside aid! Remove these interlopers!"
G["The Shado-Pan quartermaster can be found at the Shado-Pan Garrison in the Townlong Steppes.\n\nI will mark their location on your map."]="The Shado-Pan quartermaster can be found at the Shado-Pan Garrison in the Townlong Steppes.\n\nI will mark their location on your map."
G["The Shado-Pan sends a lackey to do their work? Perhaps Shan'bu was wrong about them..."]="The Shado-Pan sends a lackey to do their work? Perhaps Shan'bu was wrong about them..."
G["The Shado-Pan strike from the shadows, so that our enemies fear the dark."]="O Shadopan ataca desdas sombras para que nossos inimigos teman à escuridão."
G["The Shado-Pan told us this would be a safe haven for all the refugees from Kun-Lai. Perhaps here, we shall finally find peace."]="O Shadopan nos disse que este lugar acogería a todos os refugiados de Kun-Lai. ao melhor aqui encontraremos ao fim a paz."
G["The Shado-Pan will be here if you need us."]="O Shadopan estará aqui se o precisa."
G["The Shado-Pan will never rest."]="O Shadopan não descansar nunca."
G["The Shado-pan Defender has placed a |cFFFF2222|Hspell:132744|h[Healing Orb]|h|r!"]="O defensor do Shadopan tem colocado um |cFFFF2222|Hspell:132744|h[orbe de cura]|h|r!"
G["The Shadow Grave is this way.  Follow me, $n."]="O Sepulcro Sombrio está por aqui. Siga-me, $n."
G["The Shaman Commander is not to be trifled with, $r."]="O Comandante xamã não é alguém com quem se possa jogar, $r."
G["The Shaman is mine, focus on his companions!"]="O xamã é meu, centraos nos seus companheiros!"
G["The Shan'ze Stormclaw comes to its senses!"]="A garratormenta de Shan'ze se você está acordando!"
G["The Shan... will take you..."]="The Shan... will take you..."
G["The Shao-Tien have taken a great interest in these ruins.  They intend to recover power from its depths.  I intend to leave their corpses littering them."]="The Shao-Tien have taken a great interest in these ruins.  They intend to recover power from its depths.  I intend to leave their corpses littering them."
G["The Shao-Tien march to their deaths!"]="The Shao-Tien march to their deaths!"
G["The Shattered Hand has been able to place spies throughout the upper citadel of Blackrock. Though the information gathering process has been slow, we have made discoveries that cannot be ignored."]="A Mão Despedaçada conseguiu colocar espiões por toda a cidadela superior da Rocha Negra. Embora o processo de pegue de informações tenha sido lento, fizemos descobertas que não podem ser ignoradas."
G["The Shattered Hand will see the Horde to their former glory."]="A Mão Despedaçada verá a Horda para a sua antiga glória."
G["The Shattered Hand's influence dominates these lands. We are the veil which covers Kalimdor: The protectorates, the police, the judges, the jury, and ultimately, the executioners. We see all, we know all.\n\nYou have grown much in the time which you have spent in service of the Hand, $n. The time has come to send you into the field.\n\nAre you prepared to undertake your next mission?"]="The Shattered Hand's influence dominates these lands. We are the veil which covers Kalimdor: The protectorates, the police, the judges, the jury, and ultimately, the executioners. We see all, we know all.\n\nYou have grown much in the time which you have spent in service of the Hand, $n. The time has come to send you into the field.\n\nAre you prepared to undertake your next mission?"
G["The Shattered Sun Offensive has made great progress in the outer areas of the Isle of Quel'Danas. Kil'jaeden's forces are being pushed back, and in the chaos I was able to lead a small scouting force here inside the Sunwell Plateau. My troops proceeded through Parhelion Plaza, spotted a group of Sunblade blood elves, and we then engaged the enemy. That fight quickly turned into a disaster."]="A Ofensiva do Sol Despedaçado fez grandes progressos nas áreas externas da Ilha de Quel'Danas. As forças de Kil'jaeden estão sendo recuadas e, no caos, pude liderar uma pequena força de observação aqui dentro do Sunwell Plateau. Minhas tropas prosseguiram pelo Parhelion Plaza, avistaram um grupo de elfos sanguíneos da Lâmina Solar, e então atacamos o inimigo. Essa luta rapidamente se transformou em um desastre."
G["The Shattered Sun Offensive is lucky to have $n on our side."]="The Shattered Sun Offensive is lucky to have $n on our side."
G["The Shattered Sun Offensive will surely benefit from the addition of your knights, Lady Liadrin."]="The Shattered Sun Offensive will surely benefit from the addition of your knights, Lady Liadrin."
G["The Shen'dralar were Queen Azshara's most revered arcanists. It was within these very walls that the Queen's most important demands were processed - often in secret.\n\nAfter the destruction of the Well and the subsequent lethargy that overcame the Highborne and lesser night elf sects, the Prince of Eldre'Thalas, Tortheldrin, began construction of the pylons that you see littering the halls of the west wing."]="The Shen'dralar were Queen Azshara's most revered arcanists. It was within these very walls that the Queen's most important demands were processed - often in secret.\n\nAfter the destruction of the Well and the subsequent lethargy that overcame the Highborne and lesser night elf sects, the Prince of Eldre'Thalas, Tortheldrin, began construction of the pylons that you see littering the halls of the west wing."
G["The Shrine of Remulos is a sacred place for us in the Cenarion Circle here in Moonglade... so please conduct yourself in a manner befitting a visitor.\n\nA visitor who doesn't want my scimitar buried in them, that is."]="O Santuário de Remulos é um lugar sagrado para nós os do Círculo Cenariano no Clareira da Lua... assim que, por favor, compórtate de forma adequada para um visitante.\n\nUm visitante que não quer ver cravada em ele meu cimitarra."
G["The Siege Tank explodes!"]="O tanque de cerco explode!"
G["The Signet of Chaos belongs to Ravenholdt, beast! You will never hold its power! (PLACEHOLDER - TO BE MOVED/CHANGED)"]="O selo do caos pertence a Ravenholdt, fera! Nunca terá seu poder! (PLACEHOLDER - TO BE MOVED/CHANGED)"
G["The Silver Covenant is pleased to present their contenders for this event, Highlord."]="The Silver Covenant is pleased to present their contenders for this event, Highlord."
G["The Silver Covenant welcomes you to the tournament. The Argent Crusade has asked us to register and train those interested in competing."]="A Aliança de Prata recebe você no torneio. A Cruzada Argent nos pediu para registrar e treinar os interessados ​​em competir."
G["The Silvermoon City Inn, located in the Royal Exchange, is run by a talented woman named Velandra. I'm told that the renowned vinemaster can sometimes be found there, as well."]="O Silvermoon City Inn, localizado no Royal Exchange, é administrado por uma mulher talentosa chamada Velandra. Disseram-me que o renomado mestre da vinha também pode ser encontrado lá."
G["The Silvermoon City Inn."]="A pensão da cidade de Silvermoon."
G["The Silvermoon riders believe in balance and precision, deftly mixing attack and defense.\n\nHowever, they will often open themselves to Charges by trying to gain range on you.\n\nClose that range with a Charge before they can do the same, and then Shield-Break them as you wheel around for more Thrusts."]="The Silvermoon riders believe in balance and precision, deftly mixing attack and defense.\n\nHowever, they will often open themselves to Charges by trying to gain range on you.\n\nClose that range with a Charge before they can do the same, and then Shield-Break them as you wheel around for more Thrusts."
G["The Silverwing Sentinels are hardly what I would call honorable opponents. But if you are intent upon their slaughter $c, then seek out Brakgul Deathbringer in the Hall of the Brave."]="The Silverwing Sentinels are hardly what I would call honorable opponents. But if you are intent upon their slaughter $c, then seek out Brakgul Deathbringer in the Hall of the Brave."
G["The Silverwing Sentinels can use all the help they can get in their fight against the Warsong Outriders. $n, go to Stormwind Keep and speak with Elfarran if you wish to assist them."]="Os sentinelas Asa de Prata necessário toda a ajuda que possam conseguir para lutar contra os batedores Brado Guerreiro. $n, vá embora ao Castelo de Ventobravo e fala com Elfarran se que ajudá-los."
G["The Silverwing Sentinels shall be in your debt, $c.  You will find Elfarran, our battlemaster, inside Stormwind Keep, attending the boy-king's audience.  Goddess watch over you!"]="Os sentinelas Asa de Prata estarão em dívida com você, $c. Encontrar a Elfarran, nosso mestre de batalha, no Castelo de Ventobravo, presênciando a audiência do Rei. Que a deusa vele por você!"
G["The Silverwing Sentinels still fight the Horde in Warsong Gulch, $c. What remains to be seen is if you will return there to help them."]="The Silverwing Sentinels still fight the Horde in Warsong Gulch, $c. What remains to be seen is if you will return there to help them."
G["The Skettis Windwalker throws a bundle of fragrant herbs into the fire. [PH]"]="O surcavientos de Skettis lança um pacote de ervas aromáticas ao fogo."
G["The Skybreaker patrols Icecrown.  You will find no finer ship in all of the realms."]="O Skybreaker patrulha Coroa de Gelo. Você não encontrará navio mais refinado em todos os reinos."
G["The Skyfire can't take much more of this!"]="O Abrasacielos não aguantará muito mais."
G["The Skyfire has had a complete overhaul since our encounter with Deathwing! We now carry a full complement of both fixed-wing and gyro aircraft as well as a battery of 18-inch smoothbore shore bombardment cannons.\n\nThe Horde won't be able to hide from her reach. Not on land, not at sea, not in the air."]="The Skyfire has had a complete overhaul since our encounter with Deathwing! We now carry a full complement of both fixed-wing and gyro aircraft as well as a battery of 18-inch smoothbore shore bombardment cannons.\n\nThe Horde won't be able to hide from her reach. Not on land, not at sea, not in the air."
G["The Skyguard are here! The Skyguard are here!"]="A Guarda do céu está aqui! A Guarda do céu está aqui!"
G["The Skyguard need our help! We need to get more magical flasks."]="A Guarda de Céu precisa nossa ajuda! Temos que obter mais frascos mágicas."
G["The Skyguard shall pay for your temerity, $n!"]="The Skyguard shall pay for your temerity, $n!"
G["The Snowfall Graveyard is owned by the Alliance."]="O Cemitério Avalancha pertence à Aliança."
G["The Snowfall Graveyard is owned by the Horde."]="O Cemitério Avalancha pertence à Horda."
G["The Snowfall Graveyard is under attack!  If left unchecked, the Alliance will capture it!"]="Estão atacando o Cemitério Avalancha! Se não fazemos algo, a Aliança se apoderará de ele!"
G["The Snowfall Graveyard is under attack!  If left unchecked, the Horde will capture it!"]="Estão atacando o Cemitério Avalancha! Se não fazemos algo, a Horda se apoderará de ele!"
G["The Snowfall Graveyard lies high atop a hill in the Field of Strife, east of Winterax Hold.\n\nNeither side controls it."]="O Cemitério Avalancha se encontre na cume de uma colina na Terra de Disputa, ao este do Forte Machado Invernal.\n\nAgora mesmo não pertence a ninguém."
G["The Snowfall Graveyard lies high atop a hill in the Field of Strife, east of Winterax Hold.\n\nThe Alliance currently controls it."]="O Cemitério Avalancha se encontre na cume de uma colina na Terra de Disputa, ao este do Forte Machado Invernal.\n\nAtualmente pertence à Aliança."
G["The Snowfall Graveyard lies high atop a hill in the Field of Strife, east of Winterax Hold.\n\nThe Horde currently controls it."]="O Cemitério Avalancha se encontre na cume de uma colina na Terra de Disputa, ao este do Forte Machado Invernal.\n\nAtualmente pertence à Horda."
G["The Snowfall Graveyard was taken by the Alliance!"]="A Aliança capturou o Cemitério Avalancha!"
G["The Snowfall Graveyard was taken by the Horde!"]="A Horda capturou o Cemitério Avalancha!"
G["The Song of the Vale hangs on the wall. Take it. I hear the celestials calling. Thank you..."]="The Song of the Vale hangs on the wall. Take it. I hear the celestials calling. Thank you..."
G["The Sons of Arugal will rise against all who challenge the power of the Moonrage!"]="The Sons of Arugal will rise against all who challenge the power of the Moonrage!"
G["The Sons of Gruul must be defeated if we are to shake off our shackles and live as free ogres once more!\n\nWe must work quietly, yet quickly, if our underground resistance is to have a chance of success."]="The Sons of Gruul must be defeated if we are to shake off our shackles and live as free ogres once more!\n\nWe must work quietly, yet quickly, if our underground resistance is to have a chance of success."
G["The Sons of Lightning will have their vengeance!"]="Os Filhos do Relâmpago terão seu vingança!"
G["The Sons of Lothar have been fighting a war without end.  I'm amazed we've kept our equipment in as good a shape as it is!"]="Os Filhos de Lothar estão travando uma guerra sem fim. Estou surpreso por termos mantido nosso equipamento tão bem quanto ele!"
G["The Sons of Thaurissan shall watch you perish in the Ring of the Law!"]="The Sons of Thaurissan shall watch you perish in the Ring of the Law!"
G["The Soulflayer comes!"]="Aí vem o Caçador de Almas!"
G["The Soulflayer is defeated!  Our leader, Molthor, now calls more of his servants..."]="O Caçador de Almas foi derrotou! Nosso líder, Molthor, chama a mais dos seus servos..."
G["The South Seas are mine to pillage for all eternity!"]="The South Seas are mine to pillage for all eternity!"
G["The South Spire has been destroyed!"]="The South Spire has been destroyed!"
G["The South Spire has been heavily damaged!"]="The South Spire has been heavily damaged!"
G["The Southern Graveyard has been captured by the Alliance!"]="A Aliança tomou o cemitério do sul!"
G["The Southern Graveyard has been captured by the Horde!"]="A Horda tomou o Cemitério do sul!"
G["The Southsea Freebooters own this shore!"]="Os Filibuhteros dos Mares do Sul controlam a orilha!"
G["The Southsea Pearl and the Conquest will be joining us within the week to help with the invasion."]="The Southsea Pearl and the Conquest will be joining us within the week to help with the invasion."
G["The Southshore Crier grabs the back of his neck and his eyes go wide."]="The Southshore Crier grabs the back of his neck and his eyes go wide."
G["The Spear of Durotar is filled to the bursting point with combustible, super-heated gas."]="The Spear of Durotar is filled to the bursting point with combustible, super-heated gas."
G["The Spear of the Kolkar Khan has been broken..."]="A lança do Khan Kolkar se tem front..."
G["The Spineclaw scuttles away in fear!"]="The Spineclaw scuttles away in fear!"
G["The Spinefish are right here on your map. Off the shores of Bin'an Village in Kun-Lai Summit. Anywhere the sky is dark and heavy."]="The Spinefish are right here on your map. Off the shores of Bin'an Village in Kun-Lai Summit. Anywhere the sky is dark and heavy."
G["The Spirit of the Loch sent you here. You seek information."]="O espírito do lago você enviada aqui. Ouvidos informações."
G["The Spirit-Kissed Water from the local sprites will nourish our saplings well. And once the bucket is filled, you will not need to replenish it."]="The Spirit-Kissed Water from the local sprites will nourish our saplings well. And once the bucket is filled, you will not need to replenish it."
G["The Spirits of Competition have grown strong again."]="Os espíritos de competição se têm feito fortes novamente."
G["The Splithoof Heights centaur have destroyed the oil drilling rig!"]="The Splithoof Heights centaur have destroyed the oil drilling rig!"
G["The Sra'thik command the elements of this land, leaving their foes imprisoned for all time!"]="The Sra'thik command the elements of this land, leaving their foes imprisoned for all time!"
G["The Sssea Witch will kill you all."]="A Bruxa do Mar os matará a todossss."
G["The Staff of Storm's Fury pilfered. A curse upon this land! The storms will never cease!"]="The Staff of Storm's Fury pilfered. A curse upon this land! The storms will never cease!"
G["The Steamwheedle Cartel hosts an entire arena circuit in the central sewers of Dalaran.\n\nYou'll find dueling rings there, too, at the Circle of Wills."]="The Steamwheedle Cartel hosts an entire arena circuit in the central sewers of Dalaran.\n\nYou'll find dueling rings there, too, at the Circle of Wills."
G["The Steamwheedle Fighting Circuit has begun. You can find Arena Organizers selling arena team charters in Gadgetzan and outside the arenas in Nagrand and the Blade's Edge Mountains."]="The Steamwheedle Fighting Circuit has begun. You can find Arena Organizers selling arena team charters in Gadgetzan and outside the arenas in Nagrand and the Blade's Edge Mountains."
G["The Steamwheedle Fighting Circuit is beginning soon. They're holding practice matches in their arenas now, but ranking fights begin in $4262d."]="The Steamwheedle Fighting Circuit is beginning soon. They're holding practice matches in their arenas now, but ranking fights begin in $4262d."
G["The Steamwheedle Fighting Circuit isn't selling the arena team charters you'll need to participate in ranking matches yet.\nStill, you can find an Arena Battlemaster and get in some practice rounds. It's never too soon to start training."]="The Steamwheedle Fighting Circuit isn't selling the arena team charters you'll need to participate in ranking matches yet.\nStill, you can find an Arena Battlemaster and get in some practice rounds. It's never too soon to start training."
G["The Stockade"]="As Masmorras"
G["The Stockades are a high-security prison complex, hidden beneath the canal district of Stormwind city. Presided over by Warden Thelwater, the Stockades are home to petty crooks, political insurgents, murderers and a score of the most dangerous criminals in the land. Recently, a prisoner-led revolt has resulted in a state of pandemonium within the Stockades - where the guards have been driven out and the convicts roam free."]="The Stockades are a high-security prison complex, hidden beneath the canal district of Stormwind city. Presided over by Warden Thelwater, the Stockades are home to petty crooks, political insurgents, murderers and a score of the most dangerous criminals in the land. Recently, a prisoner-led revolt has resulted in a state of pandemonium within the Stockades - where the guards have been driven out and the convicts roam free."
G["The Stone Crow's closed today, sorry. There are too many health concerns, and I'm not about to have Ed under fire for supposedly making people sick."]="O Corvo de Pedra está fechado hoje, Sinto muito. Há demais problemas de vida e não pretendo deixar que sospechen que Ed está fazendo que a gente enferme."
G["The Stone Dragon Broodmother approaches."]="The Stone Dragon Broodmother approaches."
G["The Stone Dragon Broodmother bows her head in surrender."]="The Stone Dragon Broodmother bows her head in surrender."
G["The Stone Dragons are here, fleshling.  Take wing!"]="The Stone Dragons are here, fleshling.  Take wing!"
G["The Stonehearth Bunker is under attack!  If left unchecked, the Alliance will destroy it!"]="The Stonehearth Bunker is under attack!  If left unchecked, the Alliance will destroy it!"
G["The Stonehearth Bunker is under attack!  If left unchecked, the Horde will destroy it!"]="The Stonehearth Bunker is under attack!  If left unchecked, the Horde will destroy it!"
G["The Stonehearth Bunker protects the eastern flank of the Field of Strife.\n\nIt is controlled by neither side."]="The Stonehearth Bunker protects the eastern flank of the Field of Strife.\n\nIt is controlled by neither side."
G["The Stonehearth Bunker protects the eastern flank of the Field of Strife.\n\nIt is controlled by the Alliance."]="The Stonehearth Bunker protects the eastern flank of the Field of Strife.\n\nIt is controlled by the Alliance."
