G["The Stonehearth Bunker was destroyed by the Horde!"]="The Stonehearth Bunker was destroyed by the Horde!"
G["The Stonehearth Bunker was taken by the Alliance!"]="The Stonehearth Bunker was taken by the Alliance!"
G["The Stonehearth Graveyard is under attack!  If left unchecked, the Alliance will capture it!"]="O Cemitério Piedrahogar está sendo atacado! Se não fazemos algo, a Aliança se apoderará de ele!"
G["The Stonehearth Graveyard is under attack!  If left unchecked, the Horde will capture it!"]="O Cemitério Piedrahogar está sendo atacado! Se não fazemos algo, a Horda se apoderará de ele!"
G["The Stonehearth Graveyard lies east of the Stonehearth Outpost in the Field of Strife.\n\nNeither side currently controls it."]="O Cemitério Piedrahogar se encontre ao este da Avançado Piedrahogar, na Terra de Disputa.\n\nAgora mesmo não pertence a ninguém."
G["The Stonehearth Graveyard lies east of the Stonehearth Outpost in the Field of Strife.\n\nThe Alliance currently controls it."]="O Cemitério Piedrahogar se encontre ao este da Avançado Piedrahogar, na Terra de Disputa.\n\nAtualmente pertence à Aliança."
G["The Stonehearth Graveyard lies east of the Stonehearth Outpost in the Field of Strife.\n\nThe Horde currently controls it."]="O Cemitério Piedrahogar se encontre ao este da Avançado Piedrahogar, na Terra de Disputa.\n\nAtualmente pertence à Horda."
G["The Stonehearth Graveyard was taken by the Alliance!"]="A Aliança capturou o Cemitério Piedrahogar!"
G["The Stonehearth Graveyard was taken by the Horde!"]="A Horda capturou o Cemitério Piedrahogar!"
G["The Stonemaul clan serves the Horde!\n\nDuring the founding of Orgrimmar, when Kalimdor was being tamed as our people's homeland, the hero Rexxar defeated the chief of the Stonemaul ogre clan.\n\nThey have served the Horde ever since, and I've called them in here to do the heavy lifting against the Gordunni clan."]="O clã Quebrantarrocas serve à Horda!\n\nDurante a fundação de Orgrimmar, quando Kalimdor estava sendo domesticado para servir de lar para nossa gente, o herói Rexxar derrotou ao chefe do clã ogro dos Quebrantarrocas.\n\nTêm servido à Horda desde então, e os e mandado chamar para que se ocupen do trabalho sujo contra o clã Gordunni."
G["The Stonescale Matriarch is snared!  Avoid her attacks by staying on the move!"]="The Stonescale Matriarch is snared!  Avoid her attacks by staying on the move!"
G["The Stonesplinter Tribe shall see to your doom!"]="The Stonesplinter Tribe shall see to your doom!"
G["The Stonewrought Dam has been saved!  Three cheers for $n!"]="A Presa das Três Cabeças se salvou! Três vivas para $n!"
G["The Stonewrought Dam will be destroyed!  Long live Ragnaros!"]="A Presa das Três Cabeças será destruído! Larga vida a Ragnaros!"
G["The Stormpike Aid Station is in Dun Baldar, right outside the Dun Baldar barracks.\n\nNeither side currently controls it."]="The Stormpike Aid Station is in Dun Baldar, right outside the Dun Baldar barracks.\n\nNeither side currently controls it."
G["The Stormpike Aid Station is in Dun Baldar, right outside the Dun Baldar barracks.\n\nThe Alliance currently controls it."]="The Stormpike Aid Station is in Dun Baldar, right outside the Dun Baldar barracks.\n\nThe Alliance currently controls it."
