G["The Stormpike Guard is in need of your assistance in the fight against the Frostwolf Clan, $n. Speak to Brogun Stoneshield on the Warrior's Terrace and he will help you find your way to Alterac Valley. Elune be praised!"]="The Stormpike Guard is in need of your assistance in the fight against the Frostwolf Clan, $n. Speak to Brogun Stoneshield on the Warrior's Terrace and he will help you find your way to Alterac Valley. Elune be praised!"
G["The Stormpike Guard must be destroyed!  Ready for Alterac Valley $c?"]="É preciso destruir à Guarda Pico Tempestade! Está $gpronto: pronta; para o Vale Alterac, $c?"
G["The Stormpike Quatermaster keeps his supplies under an awning, just west of here."]="O intendente Pico Tempestade guarda seus suprimentos baixo um toldo, logo ao oeste de aqui."
G["The Stormpike clan bows to no one, especially the horde!"]="O clã Pico Tempestade não se somete a ninguém, especialmente à Horda!"
G["The Stormpike forces gain the General's Warcry."]="As tropas Pico Tempestade obtêm o Brado Guerreiro do Geral."
G["The Stormpike general has fallen!  The battle is won!\n\nNow laugh as the Alliance scurries to recover its lost holdings."]="O geral Pico Tempestade tem caído! Temos ganhou a batalha!\n\nReíd agora enquanto a Aliança corre de aqui para além tentando recuperar o pouco que lhe cai!"
G["The Stormpikes uncovered ancient artifacts within Alterac Valley, but the Frostwolf orcs don't take kindly to explorers.  If the dwarves have to fight for knowledge of their ancestors, then so be it!\n\nTo win this battle, defeat the orc, Drek'Thar, in Frostwolf Keep.  Fortune be with you, $c!"]="The Stormpikes uncovered ancient artifacts within Alterac Valley, but the Frostwolf orcs don't take kindly to explorers.  If the dwarves have to fight for knowledge of their ancestors, then so be it!\n\nTo win this battle, defeat the orc, Drek'Thar, in Frostwolf Keep.  Fortune be with you, $c!"
G["The Stormwind Harbor is really bustling.  I wonder where the new boats will sail..."]="The Stormwind Harbor is really bustling.  I wonder where the new boats will sail..."
G["The Stormwind Stockades are found near the mage quarter in Stormwind."]="As Stockades do Ventobravo são encontradas perto do bairro dos magos em Ventobravo."
G["The Stormwind riders pride themselves on fearless and devastating charges. Such is their skill and ferocity that even when charged themselves they simply charge right back.\n\nTry staying close and Thrusting, and when they attempt to gain range, throw them off-balance with a Shield-Breaker before you Charge. Otherwise, they'll meet you head-on every time."]="The Stormwind riders pride themselves on fearless and devastating charges. Such is their skill and ferocity that even when charged themselves they simply charge right back.\n\nTry staying close and Thrusting, and when they attempt to gain range, throw them off-balance with a Shield-Breaker before you Charge. Otherwise, they'll meet you head-on every time."
G["The Sun's Reach Armory is ours!  We've pushed the demons back to Dawning Square!"]="The Sun's Reach Armory is ours!  We've pushed the demons back to Dawning Square!"
G["The Sunken Ring siege workshop has been attacked by the Alliance!"]="A Aliança atacou a Oficina de Cerco do Anel Submerso!"
G["The Sunken Ring siege workshop has been attacked by the Horde!"]="A Horda atacou a Oficina de Cerco do Anel Submerso!"
G["The Sunken Ring siege workshop has been captured by the Alliance!"]="A Oficina de Cerco do Anel Submerso foi tomado pela Aliança!"
G["The Sunken Ring siege workshop has been captured by the Horde!"]="A Oficina de Cerco do Anel Submerso foi tomado pela Horda!"
G["The Sunken Temple can be found in the center of a great lake in eastern Swamp of Sorrows."]="O Templo Afundado pode ser encontrado no centro de um grande lago no leste do Pântano das Dores."
G["The Sunreavers are proud to present their representatives in this trial by combat."]="Os Atracasol estão orgulhosos de apresentar aos seus representantes em estas provas de combate."
G["The Sunreavers are scum!"]="Os Atracasol são escória!"
G["The Sunreavers have devised a way to ward our flying mounts against the lightning. But fly in loose formation, just in case."]="Os Atracasol têm averiguado como proteção a nossas montarias dos raios, mas mantenha as distâncias por se acaso."
G["The Sunreavers knew NOTHING of Garrosh's raid on Darnassus!"]="The Sunreavers knew NOTHING of Garrosh's raid on Darnassus!"
G["The Sunreavers still operate within this city. Alliance and Horde work together."]="Os Fendessol ainda operam nesta cidade. A Aliança e a Horda trabalham juntas."
G["The Sunreavers will not be pleased. Mark my words, we're not an organization to be taken lightly."]="The Sunreavers will not be pleased. Mark my words, we're not an organization to be taken lightly."
G["The Sunspire held a beautiful vantage of the Sunwell... once.  Our lives have been turned upside down, $n, but we nonetheless carry on.  It is our way; we are survivors.\n\nIf you are to survive this upheaval... to carry on in your own right, then you MUST learn how to survive.  All blood elves must do this.  You must master your insatiable hungering for magic before it masters you."]="The Sunspire held a beautiful vantage of the Sunwell... once.  Our lives have been turned upside down, $n, but we nonetheless carry on.  It is our way; we are survivors.\n\nIf you are to survive this upheaval... to carry on in your own right, then you MUST learn how to survive.  All blood elves must do this.  You must master your insatiable hungering for magic before it masters you."
G["The Syndicate have been reported to be nosing around in a cave on the eastern plateau. Find out what they're up to, soldier! Beware of Frostwolf activity!"]="Foi relatado que o Sindicato estava bisbilhotando em uma caverna no planalto oriental. Descubra o que eles estão fazendo, soldado! Cuidado com a atividade Lobo do Gelo!"
G["The Syndicate is made up of a bunch of hacks - disorganized, unskilled, and lazy..."]="The Syndicate is made up of a bunch of hacks - disorganized, unskilled, and lazy..."
G["The Syndicate keeps many locked boxes of supplies in Durnholde Keep in Hillsbrad."]="A Guilda tem muitas caixas fortes de suprimentos no Castelo de Durnholde, em Trabalomas."
G["The T.A.D. units have the priority targets!"]="The T.A.D. units have the priority targets!"
G["The Talking Skull cackles gleefully as the instructor's soul is destroyed."]="The Talking Skull cackles gleefully as the instructor's soul is destroyed."
G["The Talking Skull proceeds into the next chamber without saying a word."]="The Talking Skull proceeds into the next chamber without saying a word."
G["The Talking Skull seems hesitant to enter the hall, but proceeds with you nonetheless."]="The Talking Skull seems hesitant to enter the hall, but proceeds with you nonetheless."
G["The Talrendis Ancient howls out in pain!"]="O Ancião de Talrendis aúlha de dor!"
G["The Tanaris desert is littered with gigantic bones just like this one to my right.  I'd hate to have ever ran across that thing."]="The Tanaris desert is littered with gigantic bones just like this one to my right.  I'd hate to have ever ran across that thing."
G["The Tapping of the Keg"]="O toque do barril"
G["The Tauren Chieftains are staying in Silvermoon while I arrange their next tour. They often lounge on the balcony above me when they're not practicing. Feel free to wave... they love the attention.\nWe're not currently hiring for the show or the crew, but you can always check back later. Who knows what will arise?"]="The Tauren Chieftains are staying in Silvermoon while I arrange their next tour. They often lounge on the balcony above me when they're not practicing. Feel free to wave... they love the attention.\nWe're not currently hiring for the show or the crew, but you can always check back later. Who knows what will arise?"
G["The Tauren Chieftains concert will begin in fifteen minutes!"]="The Tauren Chieftains concert will begin in fifteen minutes!"
G["The Tauren Chieftains concert will begin in fifteen minutes!  Come celebrate the opening of the Darkmoon Faire in Terokkar, just south of Shattrath City!"]="The Tauren Chieftains concert will begin in fifteen minutes!  Come celebrate the opening of the Darkmoon Faire in Terokkar, just south of Shattrath City!"
G["The Tauren Chieftains concert will begin in five minutes!"]="The Tauren Chieftains concert will begin in five minutes!"
G["The Tauren Chieftains concert will begin in five minutes!  Come celebrate the opening of the Darkmoon Faire in Terokkar, just south of Shattrath City!"]="The Tauren Chieftains concert will begin in five minutes!  Come celebrate the opening of the Darkmoon Faire in Terokkar, just south of Shattrath City!"
G["The Tauren Chieftains concert will begin in thirty minutes!"]="The Tauren Chieftains concert will begin in thirty minutes!"
G["The Tauren Chieftains concert will begin in thirty minutes!  Come celebrate the opening of the Darkmoon Faire in Terokkar, just south of Shattrath City!"]="The Tauren Chieftains concert will begin in thirty minutes!  Come celebrate the opening of the Darkmoon Faire in Terokkar, just south of Shattrath City!"
G["The Tauren Chieftains must be the best-known minstrels in all of Azeroth!"]="Os Chefes Tauren devem ser os menestréis mais conhecidos de todos os Azeroth!"
G["The Tauren Chieftains play on this stage at the top of every hour. Show some energy: Cheer the minstrels on to capture some of the event's intensity!"]="Os Chefes Tauren jogam neste palco no topo de cada hora. Mostre um pouco de energia: animar os menestréis para capturar parte da intensidade do evento!"
G["The Tavern serves to those who do not ask too many questions."]="A taberna serve a aqueles que não fazem demais perguntas."
G["The Temple Priests are too frightened to face the truth..."]="The Temple Priests are too frightened to face the truth..."
G["The Temple of the Moon is home to the priests of Elune.  There you will find Jandria and Lariia, who will provide you with further guidance in the path of priesthood."]="O Templo da Lua é o lar dos sacerdotes de Elune. Lá você encontrará Jandria e Lariia, que fornecerão mais orientações no caminho do sacerdócio."
G["The Terrace is just up the hill here. Stay on your guard; few visitors have returned."]="The Terrace is just up the hill here. Stay on your guard; few visitors have returned."
G["The Thandol Span fell to Ragnaros.  So shall the Stonewrought Dam!"]="O Ponte Thandol caiu em mãos de Ragnaros. Que a Presa das Três Cabeças caia também!"
G["The Thorium Brotherhood Fall Catalogue:\n\nInside you will find the hottest deals on all of your adventuring needs! We'll even show you where to pick up those difficult to find components and supplies."]="The Thorium Brotherhood Fall Catalogue:\n\nInside you will find the hottest deals on all of your adventuring needs! We'll even show you where to pick up those difficult to find components and supplies."
G["The Thorium Brotherhood does not waste time on ants. Be gone!"]="A Irmandade do Tório não perde tempo com formigas. Vá embora!"
G["The Thorium Brotherhood possesses the knowledge required to make the sacred arms and armaments of the Fire Lord, but we lack the manpower to obtain the materials required for the crafting.\n\nI, Lokhtos Darkbargainer, have been empowered by the Brotherhood to exchange the exalted recipes for materials gathered from the Molten Core.\n\nPresent your offer, $r."]="The Thorium Brotherhood possesses the knowledge required to make the sacred arms and armaments of the Fire Lord, but we lack the manpower to obtain the materials required for the crafting.\n\nI, Lokhtos Darkbargainer, have been empowered by the Brotherhood to exchange the exalted recipes for materials gathered from the Molten Core.\n\nPresent your offer, $r."
G["The Threads of Fate in western Dalaran is the city's most popular supplier of clothing and cloth armor."]="A Threads of Fate, no oeste de Dalaran, é o fornecedor mais popular da cidade de roupas e armaduras."
G["The Thunder Bluff Bank can be found on the lower rise."]="O Thunder Bluff Bank pode ser encontrado na subida mais baixa."
G["The Thunder Bluff riders are massive and powerful combatants, terrifying at close range.\n\nTry to stay out of their defense-crushing Thrust range, breaking down their defenses with Shield-Breakers before risking a Charge."]="The Thunder Bluff riders are massive and powerful combatants, terrifying at close range.\n\nTry to stay out of their defense-crushing Thrust range, breaking down their defenses with Shield-Breakers before risking a Charge."
G["The Thunder Forge has begun to charge an area nearby.  Run into it to |cFFFF2222|Hspell:139397|h[Overcharge]|h|r yourself!"]="The Thunder Forge has begun to charge an area nearby.  Run into it to |cFFFF2222|Hspell:139397|h[Overcharge]|h|r yourself!"
G["The Thunder Forge is ours!  We will defend it with our lives!"]="A Forja do Trovão é nossa! Vamos defendê-la com nossas vidas!"
G["The Thunder King built a palatial fortress on the borders of his empire. We should see it soon..."]="The Thunder King built a palatial fortress on the borders of his empire. We should see it soon..."
G["The Thunder King took within himself the powers of a Titan keeper. We must take them back!"]="O Rei Trovão tomou para si os poderes do guardião titã. Precisamos tomá-los de volta!"
G["The Thunder King will rise again!"]="The Thunder King will rise again!"
G["The Thunder King wills it; it shall be done."]="É a vontade do Rei do Trovão; assim se fará."
G["The Thunder King! What a magnificent individual."]="O Rei Trovão! Que indivíduo magnífico!"
G["The Thunder King's palace lies ahead. We must secure a foothold on the island before we can assault his fortress."]="The Thunder King's palace lies ahead. We must secure a foothold on the island before we can assault his fortress."
G["The Thunderbrews run a fine Inn in Kharanos which bears their name.  Stop in for a pint and a bit of rest."]="Os Thunderbrews administram uma bela pousada em Kharanos, que leva seu nome. Pare para pegar uma cerveja e descansar um pouco."
G["The Tian Monastery taught me how to focus my energies so tightly that I could tap a keg using only my pinky finger."]="The Tian Monastery taught me how to focus my energies so tightly that I could tap a keg using only my pinky finger."
G["The Tidehunter will fall."]="O Cazamareas cairá."
G["The Tiger Gourami will be found near the pagoda of Shado-pan Monastery... here, in Kun-Lai Summit. \n\n<Ben marks a spot on your map.>"]="The Tiger Gourami will be found near the pagoda of Shado-pan Monastery... here, in Kun-Lai Summit. \n\n<Ben marks a spot on your map.>"
G["The Timberlings have made it too difficult for the fishermen to catch anything around Dolanaar.  You best look for someone to train you in Darnassus."]="Os Timberlings tornaram muito difícil para os pescadores pegar qualquer coisa em torno de Dolanaar. É melhor procurar alguém para treiná-o em Darnassus."
G["The Timbermaw furbolgs."]="Os Timbermaw furbolgs."
G["The Titans had long since vacated this world. Only the night elves that once inhabited this area were here to defend. Oh my! The next passage is fascinating!"]="The Titans had long since vacated this world. Only the night elves that once inhabited this area were here to defend. Oh my! The next passage is fascinating!"
G["The Titans! It would seem the mogu salvaged and repurposed ancient Titan technology to advance their empire!"]="The Titans! It would seem the mogu salvaged and repurposed ancient Titan technology to advance their empire!"
G["The Tomb of Conquerors is directly below you. Follow the dirt path to the entrance. You must hurry!"]="A Tumba dos Conquistadores se encontre logo debaixo de ti. Continua o caminho até a entrada. Precisa dar a você pressa!"
G["The Torn-heart men give their weapons to Earthmender Torlok."]="The Torn-heart men give their weapons to Earthmender Torlok."
G["The Trade District is secured!  Now, secure the rest of the city!"]="O Distrito de Mercadores está a salvou! Agora, devemos fazer o mesmo com o resto da cidade!"
G["The Trade Prince will hear about this, $n!"]="The Trade Prince will hear about this, $n!"
G["The Trade Prince's yacht is about to set sail. Everyone, get to the dock! Hand over the keys, boss. I'm driving. Just let me know when you're ready to go."]="The Trade Prince's yacht is about to set sail. Everyone, get to the dock! Hand over the keys, boss. I'm driving. Just let me know when you're ready to go."
G["The Trial of the Grand Crusader is a more difficult version of the Trial of the Crusader. Each encounter is more difficult, and you will not be able to freely attempt the encounters until you win. After 50 unsuccessful attempts, the Trial of the Grand Crusader will end for the week. After successfully completing the Trial of the Grand Crusader, you will receive an additional tribute chest of rewards as compensation. Are you prepared for this trial?"]="O Julgamento do Grande Cruzado é uma versão mais difícil do Julgamento do Cruzado. Cada encontro é mais difícil e você não poderá tentar livremente os encontros até vencer. Após 50 tentativas frustradas, o Julgamento do Grande Cruzado terminará por uma semana. Depois de concluir com êxito o Julgamento do Grande Cruzado, você receberá um baú adicional de recompensas como compensação. Você está pronto para este julgamento?"
G["The True Horde WILL come to pass.  I have SEEN it.  IT HAS SHOWN ME. I HAVE SEEN MOUNTAINS OF SKULLS AND RIVERS OF BLOOD.  AND I WILL...HAVE...MY...WORLD!"]="The True Horde WILL come to pass.  I have SEEN it.  IT HAS SHOWN ME. I HAVE SEEN MOUNTAINS OF SKULLS AND RIVERS OF BLOOD.  AND I WILL...HAVE...MY...WORLD!"
G["The True Horde takes what it wants!"]="A Horda autêntico tome o que quer!"
G["The Twilight Cult seeks to undo everything we fight to preserve. It is our sworn duty to prevent this calamity from coming to pass, $r."]="The Twilight Cult seeks to undo everything we fight to preserve. It is our sworn duty to prevent this calamity from coming to pass, $r."
G["The Twilight Curse is shifting Go'el between elemental states! Before he vanished, he took on the aspect of water. We must hurry to him..."]="The Twilight Curse is shifting Go'el between elemental states! Before he vanished, he took on the aspect of water. We must hurry to him..."
G["The Twilight Documents go flying through the air!"]="Os documentos Crepúsculo saem voando!"
G["The Twilight Dragonkin must be stopped! Rescue the other Red Dragonflight and we shall assist you!"]="É preciso parar aos dragonantes Crepúsculo! Resgate ao resto do Voo Vermelho e te ajudaremos!"
G["The Twilight Prophet knows that YOU - and you alone - are our final obstacle. He's sent ME to remove you from the game."]="The Twilight Prophet knows that YOU - and you alone - are our final obstacle. He's sent ME to remove you from the game."
G["The Twilight's Hammer has agents everywhere! Kill me and a dozen take my place!"]="The Twilight's Hammer has agents everywhere! Kill me and a dozen take my place!"
G["The Twilight's Hammer has most certainly uncovered something of interest up at the Masters' Gate.\n\nPerhaps a $g skilled : lovely; $c such as yourself would help me with that?"]="Não há dúvida de que o Martelo Crepúsculo tem descoberto algo interessante na Porta dos Mestres.\n\nTalvez $gun hábil: uma encantadora; $c como você me possa ajudar com elho?"
G["The Twilight's Hammer has unearthed a titan Waygate and it appears that they're attempting to activate it."]="The Twilight's Hammer has unearthed a titan Waygate and it appears that they're attempting to activate it."
G["The Twilight's Hammer invaded these once-pristine waters, and the surrounding lands, a short time ago.\n\nThey have polluted my loch and I would have them gone so that I may purify it once more."]="The Twilight's Hammer invaded these once-pristine waters, and the surrounding lands, a short time ago.\n\nThey have polluted my loch and I would have them gone so that I may purify it once more."
G["The Twilight's Hammer is a major power to be reckoned with.  Thanks to us, Deathwing is free.  Thanks to us, Old Gods have risen from the bowels of the earth.  Thanks to us... Hyjal burns.\n\nWhat do you think you have to offer us?"]="The Twilight's Hammer is a major power to be reckoned with.  Thanks to us, Deathwing is free.  Thanks to us, Old Gods have risen from the bowels of the earth.  Thanks to us... Hyjal burns.\n\nWhat do you think you have to offer us?"
G["The Twilight's Hammer is more than an organization to me.  It's a family.\n\nAs such, I take great care in making sure no unworthy candidates make it past the training phase."]="Para mim, o Martelo Crepúsculo é mais que uma organização.\n\nPor isso eu me encargo de que os candidatos que não sejam dignos não pasen a fase de treinamento."
G["The Twilight's Hammer is retreating! The temple is ours; fortify your positions within!"]="The Twilight's Hammer is retreating! The temple is ours; fortify your positions within!"
G["The Twilight's Hammer is the instrument of this grand destruction, the method of glorious annihilation! (Tear aside the veil! Open your mind to emptiness!) Through us will you find true power."]="The Twilight's Hammer is the instrument of this grand destruction, the method of glorious annihilation! (Tear aside the veil! Open your mind to emptiness!) Through us will you find true power."
G["The Twilight's Hammer returns."]="O Martelo Crepúsculo retorna."
G["The Twilight's Hammer will pay for what they've done."]="O Martelo Crepúsculo pagará pelo que têm feito."
G["The Twilight's Hammer will rise again! The very earth beneath your feet will be swallowed by the fury of our resurgence!"]="The Twilight's Hammer will rise again! The very earth beneath your feet will be swallowed by the fury of our resurgence!"
G["The Twilight's Hammer!"]="O Martelo Crepúsculo!"
G["The Twilight's Hammer...fascinating. They are within your \"Dire Maul\"?"]="Os do Martelo Crepúsculo... fascinante. Estão dentro dessa \"A Massacre\"?"
G["The Twilight's Hammer: happy to serve local nefarious schemes anytime, anywhere. And today is no exception! Our final combatant hails from the not so distant Bastion of Twilight! Or is it the Twilight Bastion... bah, who cares!"]="The Twilight's Hammer: happy to serve local nefarious schemes anytime, anywhere. And today is no exception! Our final combatant hails from the not so distant Bastion of Twilight! Or is it the Twilight Bastion... bah, who cares!"
G["The Twilight's Hammer?! Where are they?"]="O Martelo Crepúsculo?! Onde estão?"
G["The Twisting Nether's coldest reaches shall not hide you from my vengeance."]="The Twisting Nether's coldest reaches shall not hide you from my vengeance."
G["The U.D.E.D. dispenser rumbles at you expectantly."]="A U. D. E. D. distribuidor ronca para você com expectativa."
G["The Undercity belongs to the Horde once more! LOK'TAR!"]="Cidade Baixa pertence à Horda uma vez mais! LOK'TAR!"
G["The Undercity riders are a tenacious lot, relying heavily on their defenses and steadfastly trading blows with their opponents, strike for strike.\n\nTrying wearing them down with Charges while maintaining your own Defense... meet them with a defensive advantage so that they will suffer the most with each exchange."]="The Undercity riders are a tenacious lot, relying heavily on their defenses and steadfastly trading blows with their opponents, strike for strike.\n\nTrying wearing them down with Charges while maintaining your own Defense... meet them with a defensive advantage so that they will suffer the most with each exchange."
G["The Underhold has been breached! Get to the Shredders, and tear these interlopers to pieces!"]="The Underhold has been breached! Get to the Shredders, and tear these interlopers to pieces!"
G["The Unstable Mur'ghoul is about to explode!"]="O Mur'crófago instável está a ponto de explodir!"
G["The Usurpers abandoned you."]="Os usurpadores te têm abandonou."
G["The Val'kyr are attacking! Take cover!"]="As Val'kyr estão atacando! A coberto!"
G["The Val'kyrs'  teamwork is rather astounding. I now see why we had such problems capturing the two of them."]="O trabalho em equipe dos Val'kyrs é bastante surpreendente. Agora vejo por que tivemos esses problemas ao capturar os dois."
G["The Vale empowers me."]="O Vale me dá forças."
G["The Vale is my home. It is my duty and my desire to protect it from harm."]="The Vale is my home. It is my duty and my desire to protect it from harm."
G["The Vale is peaceful. Too peaceful."]="O vale está tranquilo. Demais tranquilo."
G["The Vale of Eternal Blossoms is in great danger, $r.\n\nGarrosh Hellscream has tainted the waters of our sacred Vale with the Heart of Y'Shaarj, a dark relic from an ancient evil. The effects of his act... well... you can see them for yourself here in the Vale.\n\nNow, remnants of the sha threaten our very existence. We have no choice but to fight."]="The Vale of Eternal Blossoms is in great danger, $r.\n\nGarrosh Hellscream has tainted the waters of our sacred Vale with the Heart of Y'Shaarj, a dark relic from an ancient evil. The effects of his act... well... you can see them for yourself here in the Vale.\n\nNow, remnants of the sha threaten our very existence. We have no choice but to fight."
G["The Vale of Eternal Blossoms.\n\nWho could have imagined the warchief was capable of destroying such a beautiful place.\n\nThe Golden Lotus feared that one day the mogu would retake this land, but it would seem they underestimated the depths of Garrosh's pride."]="The Vale of Eternal Blossoms.\n\nWho could have imagined the warchief was capable of destroying such a beautiful place.\n\nThe Golden Lotus feared that one day the mogu would retake this land, but it would seem they underestimated the depths of Garrosh's pride."
G["The Vale was once the seat of power of the great mogu empire. The time of the mogu reign was terrible, cruel, and bloody."]="O vale foi em outros tempos a sede do poder do grande império mogu. A época do reinado mogu foi terrível, cruel e sangrenta."
G["The Vale will never fall into mogu hands!"]="O Vale nunca cairá em mãos dos mogu!"
G["The Valley of Honor"]="O Vale do Honra"
G["The Valley of Honor has been secured!"]="O Vale da Força está a salvou!"
G["The Valley of Honor's bank is just before the gate to The Drag."]="O banco do Valley of Honra fica logo antes do portões do The Drag."
G["The Valley of Strength"]="Vale da Força"
G["The Valley of Strength is Horde again! This pathetic attack on Orgrimmar will be crushed.  For the Horde!"]="O Vale da Força pertence à Horda novamente! O patético ataque a Orgrimmar será esmagado. pela Horda!"
G["The Valley of Strength's bank is south of the entrance to Grommash Hold, northwest of the main gate."]="O banco do Vale da Força está ao sul da entrada do Forte Grommash, ao noroeste da Entrada Principal."
G["The Valley of Trials will temper even the weakest into a warrior worthy to join the Horde. Those who cannot rise to its tests will be left to bake in the scorching desert sun."]="O Vale das Provações transformará até o mais fraco em um guerreiro digno de se juntar à Horda. Aqueles que não puderem enfrentar seus testes serão deixados para assar no sol escaldante do deserto."
G["The Vault in Ironforge is the closest bank ye'll find in these parts."]="O Vault em Ironforge é o banco mais próximo que você encontrará nessas partes."
G["The Vector Coil is massive. I hope we have more than one abomination guarding the numerous weak points."]="A bobina de vetor é enorme. Espero que tenhamos mais de uma abominação guardando os inúmeros pontos fracos."
G["The Vegetron 4000 is recharging, try again later."]="O Vegetrón 4000 se você está recarregando. Inténtalo novamente."
G["The Veiled Stair is under Madam Goya's protection."]="A Escadaria Velada está sob a proteção da Senhora Goya."
G["The Veiled Stair will soon be ours again!"]="A Escadaria Velada será nossa novamente muito pronto!"
G["The Venture Company based around Windshear Crag in Stonetalon keeps their supplies in locked boxes."]="A Venture Company, sediada em Windshear Crag, em Stonetalon, mantém seus suprimentos em caixas trancadas."
G["The Vermillion Redoubt is our base of operations here in the Twilight Highlands.\n\nFrom this perch we can supervise the assault on Grim Batol and the cleansing of the river valley below."]="The Vermillion Redoubt is our base of operations here in the Twilight Highlands.\n\nFrom this perch we can supervise the assault on Grim Batol and the cleansing of the river valley below."
G["The Verne has docked. All aboard!"]="O Verne tem atracado. Todos a bordo!"
G["The Verne will be arriving shortly! Get your gear and form up, boys!"]="O Verne está a ponto de chegar! Preparad as armas e a formar!"
G["The Violet Citadel"]="Cidadela Violeta"
G["The Violet Hold"]="Castelo Violeta"
G["The Violet Hold, prison for the enemies of the Kirin Tor, is in southeast Dalaran."]="A Fortaleza Violeta, prisão para os inimigos do Kirin Tor, fica no sudeste de Dalaran."
G["The Vision of Deathwing fixates on Wrathion, heal him!"]="A Visão de Alamuerte se seleciona em Wrathion. Sánalo!"
G["The Voice of Ramkahen casts its vote in favor of war as well."]="A Voz de Ramkahen também vota a favor da guerra."
G["The Void Binder can be found in the Ethereal Corridor, just upstairs and to the right as you enter the building."]="The Void Binder can be found in the Ethereal Corridor, just upstairs and to the right as you enter the building."
G["The Void Binder can be found in the Hall of Secrets, just upstairs and to the right as you enter the building."]="The Void Binder can be found in the Hall of Secrets, just upstairs and to the right as you enter the building."
G["The Void... beckons."]="O vazio... se aproxima."
G["The Vortex Pinnacle, a level 82-84 dungeon in Uldum, is now available for initial testing. The dungeon is a work in progress. Please be in your full group before teleporting to the dungeon.\nTo leave the Vortex Pinnacle, you must teleport out with a Hearthstone or similar method. If you die and release, you should teleport back from this NPC."]="The Vortex Pinnacle, a level 82-84 dungeon in Uldum, is now available for initial testing. The dungeon is a work in progress. Please be in your full group before teleporting to the dungeon.\nTo leave the Vortex Pinnacle, you must teleport out with a Hearthstone or similar method. If you die and release, you should teleport back from this NPC."
G["The Vrykul storage facility is up in flames! Dragonflayer defenders have been alerted!"]="The Vrykul storage facility is up in flames! Dragonflayer defenders have been alerted!"
G["The Wailing Caverns has its entrance at the Lushwater Oasis southwest of Crossroads in the Barrens."]="The Wailing Caverns has its entrance at the Lushwater Oasis southwest of Crossroads in the Barrens."
G["The Wakener may prove useful. One way or another."]="É possível que o arauto nos seja útil. De uma forma u outra."
G["The Wanderer's Festival is tonight. Are you coming?"]="Esta noite é o Festival do Errante. Vai vir?"
G["The War Serpent will not travel beyond the Jade Temple Grounds! Return before you are tossed off!"]="O dragão de guerra não viajará fosse das Terras do Templo de Jade! Volta antes de que te desmonte!"
G["The Warchief brings change that will bring the Horde victory!  Look for Swart inside the barracks on the east side of town."]="O Chefe Guerreiro traz mudanças que trarão a vitória da Horda! Procure Swart dentro do quartel no lado leste da cidade."
G["The Warchief demands results on your research."]="O Chefe de Guerra exige resultados no seu investigação."
G["The Warchief demands that this shore is secured! When the Alliance makes its move, the tides will run red with their blood!"]="The Warchief demands that this shore is secured! When the Alliance makes its move, the tides will run red with their blood!"
G["The Warchief has instructed me to study all kinds of weapons and armor. He has sent me here to the hub of both the tauren and orc cultures in the Barrens to meet as many travelers as possible, and to learn about the cultures of the Barrens.\n\nHe feels there's something to be learned from even the most pathetic of cultures... like the quilboar or centaur."]="The Warchief has instructed me to study all kinds of weapons and armor. He has sent me here to the hub of both the tauren and orc cultures in the Barrens to meet as many travelers as possible, and to learn about the cultures of the Barrens.\n\nHe feels there's something to be learned from even the most pathetic of cultures... like the quilboar or centaur."
G["The Warchief has learned there's a connection between the Mogu and these creatures."]="O Chefe de Guerra tem descoberto que existe uma conexão entre os mogu e estas criaturas."
G["The Warchief has ordered an invasion of the Hellfire Citadel, and we're starting with these exposed ramparts."]="O Warchief ordenou uma invasão da Cidadela Fogo do Inferno, e estamos começando com essas muralhas expostas."
G["The Warchief has promised to help us rescue our people and deal with Gallywix if we help them with the Alliance.\n\nIt sounds like a fair deal to me. The enemy of my friend is my enemy, right?"]="O Chefe de Guerra nos tem prometido ajuda para resgate aos nossos e acabar com Galhywix se lhe ajudamos com a Aliança.\n\nA mim me parece um bom trato. O inimigo de meu amigo é meu inimigo, não?"
G["The Warchief ignored my council. I discovered he was building a compound beneath the caverns of Ragefire."]="The Warchief ignored my council. I discovered he was building a compound beneath the caverns of Ragefire."
G["The Warchief is caging all the dissidents. Even us orcs!"]="The Warchief is caging all the dissidents. Even us orcs!"
G["The Warchief of the Horde, Thrall, and Overlord Garrosh Hellscream have arrived upon the tournament grounds! Clear the way to the entrance!"]="The Warchief of the Horde, Thrall, and Overlord Garrosh Hellscream have arrived upon the tournament grounds! Clear the way to the entrance!"
G["The Warchief rewards the loyal."]="O Chefe de Guerra recompensa a lealdade."
G["The Warchief shall make quick work of you, mortals. Prepare yourselves!"]="O Chefe de Guerra será rápido com vocês, mortais. Preparem-se!"
G["The Warchief should've never crossed the Darkspear. He tore the Horde apart."]="O Chefe de Guerra não deveria haver bravo aos Lança Negra. Tem dividido à Horda."
G["The Warchief will annihilate his enemies!"]="O Chefe de Guerra aniquilará aos seus inimigos!"
G["The Warchief will have your blood!"]="O Chefe de Guerra terá seu sangue!"
G["The Warchief will hear of this betrayal!"]="O Chefe de Guerra saberão desta traição!"
G["The Warchief won't be pleased. He is wasting valuable troops fending off their pathetic rebellion."]="The Warchief won't be pleased. He is wasting valuable troops fending off their pathetic rebellion."
G["The Warchief's zeppelin is in flames! It's going down!"]="O zepelim do Chefe de Guerra está em chamas! Cai em picado!"
G["The Watchers are the Timewalkers' scholars and scouts, researchers and spies.\nWe watch the timeways and record, investigate, and report temporal tampering and unusual phenomena.\nIt was a Watcher, of course, that brought the Timewalkers' attention to this bizarre, timeless isle."]="The Watchers are the Timewalkers' scholars and scouts, researchers and spies.\nWe watch the timeways and record, investigate, and report temporal tampering and unusual phenomena.\nIt was a Watcher, of course, that brought the Timewalkers' attention to this bizarre, timeless isle."
G["The Water of the Seers is ready for your consumption, $n."]="A água dos videntes está pronta para o seu consumo, $n."
G["The Waterlord Hydraxis hides off in Azshara, on an island in the Bay of Storms.  What kind of threat can the fool muster from there?"]="O Waterlord Hydraxis se esconde em Azshara, em uma ilha na Baía das Tempestades. Que tipo de ameaça o tolo pode reunir a partir daí?"
G["The Wayfarer's Rest Tavern is located between the Walk of Elders and the Bazaar. You can reach it from either location."]="A Taberna de Descanso do Wayfarer's está localizada entre a Calçada dos Anciãos e o Bazar. Você pode alcançá-o em qualquer local."
G["The Wayfarer's Rest tavern."]="A taberna Rest Wayfarer."
G["The Weavers are arcanists who specialize in chronomancy; the art of weaving time.\nAmongst the Timewalkers, we alone can repair damage to the timeways, open temporal portals, and other such tasks.\nThese things once came easily to the bronze dragonflight, but alas, no longer."]="The Weavers are arcanists who specialize in chronomancy; the art of weaving time.\nAmongst the Timewalkers, we alone can repair damage to the timeways, open temporal portals, and other such tasks.\nThese things once came easily to the bronze dragonflight, but alas, no longer."
G["The Weeping Souls may be frightening, but they are somewhat predictable. Lure them into the rune traps spread across the ground."]="The Weeping Souls may be frightening, but they are somewhat predictable. Lure them into the rune traps spread across the ground."
G["The West Frostwolf Tower is under attack!  If left unchecked, the Alliance will destroy it!"]="Estão atacando a Torre Oeste Lobo Gelo! Se não fazemos algo, a Aliança a destruirá!"
G["The West Frostwolf Tower is under attack!  If left unchecked, the Horde will destroy it!"]="Estão atacando a Torre Oeste Lobo Gelo! Se não fazemos algo, a Horda a destruirá!"
G["The West Frostwolf Tower protects the gate between Frostwolf Village and Frostwolf Keep.\n\nIt is controlled by neither side."]="A Torre Oeste Lobo Gelo proteger a porta entre a Aldeia Lobo Gelo e o Bastião Lobo Gelo.\n\nAgora mesmo não pertence a ninguém."
G["The West Frostwolf Tower protects the gate between Frostwolf Village and Frostwolf Keep.\n\nIt is controlled by the Alliance."]="A Torre Oeste Lobo Gelo proteger a porta entre a Aldeia Lobo Gelo e o Bastião Lobo Gelo.\n\nAtualmente pertence à Aliança."
G["The West Frostwolf Tower protects the gate between Frostwolf Village and Frostwolf Keep.\n\nIt is controlled by the Horde."]="A Torre Oeste Lobo Gelo proteger a porta entre a Aldeia Lobo Gelo e o Bastião Lobo Gelo.\n\nAtualmente pertence à Horda."
G["The West Frostwolf Tower was destroyed by the Alliance!"]="A Aliança tem destruído a Torre Oeste Lobo Gelo!"
G["The West Frostwolf Tower was taken by the Horde!"]="A Horda capturou a Torre Oeste Lobo Gelo!"
G["The West Spire has been destroyed!"]="The West Spire has been destroyed!"
G["The West Spire has been heavily damaged!"]="The West Spire has been heavily damaged!"
G["The Western Graveyard has been captured by the Alliance!"]="The Western Graveyard has been captured by the Alliance!"
G["The Western Graveyard has been captured by the Horde!"]="The Western Graveyard has been captured by the Horde!"
G["The Western Pylon accepts red, green, and blue crystals.\n\nThe Pylon focuses on the energy that can be created using red crystals as the main source of power. There are two possible effects: one that increases your protection from damage, and one that weakens an enemy's defenses.\n\nCrystal Ward requires red and green crystals. This will provide you with an increase to armor.\n\nCrystal Yield requires blue and red crystals. This can lower the armor of a specific target."]="The Western Pylon accepts red, green, and blue crystals.\n\nThe Pylon focuses on the energy that can be created using red crystals as the main source of power. There are two possible effects: one that increases your protection from damage, and one that weakens an enemy's defenses.\n\nCrystal Ward requires red and green crystals. This will provide you with an increase to armor.\n\nCrystal Yield requires blue and red crystals. This can lower the armor of a specific target."
G["The Westspark siege workshop has been attacked by the Alliance!"]="The Westspark siege workshop has been attacked by the Alliance!"
G["The Westspark siege workshop has been attacked by the Horde!"]="The Westspark siege workshop has been attacked by the Horde!"
G["The Westspark siege workshop has been captured by the Alliance!"]="The Westspark siege workshop has been captured by the Alliance!"
G["The Westspark siege workshop has been captured by the Horde!"]="The Westspark siege workshop has been captured by the Horde!"
G["The Wickerman Festival now begins!  Power to the Forsaken!"]="The Wickerman Festival now begins!  Power to the Forsaken!"
G["The Wickerman festivities will begin in ten minutes!  Join us in the Ruins of Lordaeron courtyard to celebrate Hallow's End and our liberation from the Scourge!"]="The Wickerman festivities will begin in ten minutes!  Join us in the Ruins of Lordaeron courtyard to celebrate Hallow's End and our liberation from the Scourge!"
G["The Wickerman festivities will begin in ten minutes! Please join us just outside the gates of Stormwind City and celebrate Hallow's End!"]="The Wickerman festivities will begin in ten minutes! Please join us just outside the gates of Stormwind City and celebrate Hallow's End!"
G["The Widow Greenpaw is NOT a witch. She just makes very lifelike jade statues."]="A viúva Zarpa Verde não é uma bruxa. Simplesmente talha estátuas de jade muito reaprontas."
G["The Wild Cloudrider senses its freedom!"]="O surcacielos selvagem sente seu liberdade!"
G["The Wildhammer High Shaman is finished. Count up our dead. Bloodgulch will want to hear of our triumph!"]="The Wildhammer High Shaman is finished. Count up our dead. Bloodgulch will want to hear of our triumph!"
G["The Wildhammer Shaman places a Resistance Totem to aid you!"]="O xamã Martelo Feroz coloca um totem de resistência para ajudar vocês!"
G["The Wildhammer dwarves are our mortal enemy. It's them or us."]="Os anões Wildhammer são nosso inimigo mortal. Somos eles ou nós."
G["The Wildhammer dwarves might have fast steeds, but can those Aerie Peak gryphons stand the heat of The Great Forge?  I think not!"]="Os anões Wildhammer podem ter corcéis rápidos, mas esses gryphons do Aerie Peak aguentam o calor da Grande Forja? Eu acho que não!"
G["The Wildhammer horn falls from Kurdran's unconscious body!"]="O chifre dos Martelo Feroz cai do corpo inconsciente de Kurdran!"
G["The Wildhammers have always embraced shamanism, aye, but to find ourselves beneath the sea as part of the Earthen Ring?\nIt would've taken more than a few tankards for me to believe that one, a year ago."]="The Wildhammers have always embraced shamanism, aye, but to find ourselves beneath the sea as part of the Earthen Ring?\nIt would've taken more than a few tankards for me to believe that one, a year ago."
G["The Wind Rider Roost is atop the totem stairway in the center of town."]="O Wind Rider Roost está no topo da escada do totem no centro da cidade."
G["The Wind-Reaver will not accompany you on this task, Wakener. His talents are needed elsewhere."]="O Atracavientos não te acompanhará nesta missão, arauto. Seus talentos fazem falta em outra parte."
G["The Windblades rush to aid their trapped ally!"]="The Windblades rush to aid their trapped ally!"
G["The Winterfall furbolg that reside here in Winterspring were once our allies... But one day, that all changed.\n\nDriven by the strange demands of their high chief, they began to attack all others that they came in contact with, including our tribe. They keep to themselves now..."]="The Winterfall furbolg that reside here in Winterspring were once our allies... But one day, that all changed.\n\nDriven by the strange demands of their high chief, they began to attack all others that they came in contact with, including our tribe. They keep to themselves now..."
G["The Winterskorn tribe will prevail!"]="A tribo Inbjerskorn prevalecerá!"
G["The Wolf did not care for raptor meat."]="The Wolf did not care for raptor meat."
G["The Wolf found scorpid meat to be too bitter."]="The Wolf found scorpid meat to be too bitter."
G["The Wolf had grown tired of eating boar meat."]="O lobo se havia cansado de comer carne de javali."
G["The Wolf ran and ran, looking for an easy meal."]="The Wolf ran and ran, looking for an easy meal."
G["The Wolf was lazy, and didn't want to work for his meal."]="The Wolf was lazy, and didn't want to work for his meal."
G["The World's End Tavern has nothing to offer those of my kind.  However, I find that it attracts the type of clientele that are interested in what I have for sale.\n\nI specialize in exotic engineering goods acquired from far and wide.  From time to time I might even have a rare thing or two for purchase.\n\nWhat might I interest you in?"]="The World's End Tavern has nothing to offer those of my kind.  However, I find that it attracts the type of clientele that are interested in what I have for sale.\n\nI specialize in exotic engineering goods acquired from far and wide.  From time to time I might even have a rare thing or two for purchase.\n\nWhat might I interest you in?"
G["The World's End Tavern may be found in the easternmost portion of the lower city."]="A Taverna do Fim do Mundo pode ser encontrada na parte mais oriental da cidade baixa."
G["The Wrestler is going to destroy the competition today."]="The Wrestler is going to destroy the competition today."
G["The Wrestler took out my old apprentice. Now you shall be my apprentice. You smell of luck... and sweat. Most good fortune indeed!\n\nThe Wrestler is slow but strong. Do not let him grab you.\n\nAlso, his mind is weak. Use the chairs in the arena to stun him.\n\nIf you get weak, use the bucket next to me for refreshings.\n\nGood fortune to you, apprentice of grummle!"]="The Wrestler took out my old apprentice. Now you shall be my apprentice. You smell of luck... and sweat. Most good fortune indeed!\n\nThe Wrestler is slow but strong. Do not let him grab you.\n\nAlso, his mind is weak. Use the chairs in the arena to stun him.\n\nIf you get weak, use the bucket next to me for refreshings.\n\nGood fortune to you, apprentice of grummle!"
G["The Wretched are a constant thorn in my side, $n.  When they're not being a danger to themselves by tapping unstable arcane sources to satisfy their cravings, they're cooking up half-brained schemes against our respectable society."]="The Wretched are a constant thorn in my side, $n.  When they're not being a danger to themselves by tapping unstable arcane sources to satisfy their cravings, they're cooking up half-brained schemes against our respectable society."
G["The Wyrmcult must be using another path. We are still finding them in Ruuan Weald."]="The Wyrmcult must be using another path. We are still finding them in Ruuan Weald."
G["The Xuen shield bearers come down from the Temple of the White Tiger each year, $n. They could block the yaungol advance and prevent them from getting into the village. Talk to them and see if they can aid us."]="The Xuen shield bearers come down from the Temple of the White Tiger each year, $n. They could block the yaungol advance and prevent them from getting into the village. Talk to them and see if they can aid us."
G["The Yaungol warlord shows his face! Come, let's finish this!"]="O chefe yaungol mostrou a cara! Venha, vamos acabar com isso!"
G["The Ymirjar battle lord, Algar the Chosen, rouses his Vargul armies at the Reliquary of Pain, northeast of this cage.\n\nPrince Navarius is across the Dead Fields, east of here, near the great steps leading up to the second level of Zul'Drak.\n\nThrym's location is currently unknown, which is curious considering his size.\n\nAll must be dealt with!"]="The Ymirjar battle lord, Algar the Chosen, rouses his Vargul armies at the Reliquary of Pain, northeast of this cage.\n\nPrince Navarius is across the Dead Fields, east of here, near the great steps leading up to the second level of Zul'Drak.\n\nThrym's location is currently unknown, which is curious considering his size.\n\nAll must be dealt with!"
G["The Zandalari Dinomancer drops an Orb of Control!"]="O dinomántico Zandalari solta um orbe de controle!"
G["The Zandalari Prophecy."]="The Zandalari Prophecy."
G["The Zandalari are a proud race. Their pride will ultimately be their undoing.\n\nEven the most powerful of foes have a weakness; we need only to find it."]="The Zandalari are a proud race. Their pride will ultimately be their undoing.\n\nEven the most powerful of foes have a weakness; we need only to find it."
G["The Zandalari are more cautious than I thought. Look down there - swarming with patrols."]="Os Zandalari são mais precavidos do que esperava. Olhe aí baixo. Há patrulhas por todas partes."
G["The Zandalari are nothing but lap-dogs. Do you hear me? You are pets for the mogu!"]="The Zandalari are nothing but lap-dogs. Do you hear me? You are pets for the mogu!"
G["The Zandalari here practice a dark magic I am unfamiliar with. They mix arcane powers with shadow; a frightening and dangerous combination."]="The Zandalari here practice a dark magic I am unfamiliar with. They mix arcane powers with shadow; a frightening and dangerous combination."
G["The Zandalari people turned to their King for help, but there was only one Zandalari equipped to help them: The prophet Zul. The prophet, and the mighty warfleet he had assembled while his King sat idle."]="Os Zandalari se voltaram para seu rei para pedir ajuda, mas somente um Zandalari estava preparado para ajudá-los: O profeta Zul e a poderosa frota que ele havia reunido enquanto o rei não fazia nada."
G["The Zandalari should never have underestimated us!"]="The Zandalari should never have underestimated us!"
G["The Zandalari, ancient allies of the mogu! They must seek the legendary weapon within the depths of the Vaults!"]="Os Zandalari, antigos aliados dos mogu! Devem de procurar o arma lendária nas profundezas das câmaras."
G["The Zandalarian trolls have traveled far and suffered much to reach this place, but to do nothing... is to invite our doom..."]="Os trolls zandalarianos viajaram para longe e sofreram muito para chegar a esse lugar, mas não fazer nada... é convidar nossa desgraça..."
G["The abomination has come! Forward!"]="A abominação chegou! Adiante!"
G["The abomination has overrun the Night Watch camp! Quickly, we must intercept it before it reaches town!"]="The abomination has overrun the Night Watch camp! Quickly, we must intercept it before it reaches town!"
G["The actions of these deserters shames us all. A shame so powerful that it must be witnessed to be understood. It is why Ug'thor is here... The boy must learn."]="As ações desses desertores vergonha a todos nós. Uma vergonha tão poderosa que deve ser testemunhada para ser entendida. É por isso que Ug'thor está aqui... O garoto deve aprender."
G["The admiral and his forces pushed forward to take one of the bases you scouted for him earlier. You should go and meet them."]="O almirante e suas forças avançaram para pegar uma das bases que você procurou antes. Você deveria ir encontrá-os."
G["The age of the night elves is coming to a close."]="O tempo dos elfos da noite chega ao seu fim."
G["The ages have been cruel to you and I, my love, but be assured, it is, and at long last we are reunited."]="Ele foi cruel conosco, amor meu, mas tenha por certo que agora si permaneceremos unidos."
G["The agony..."]="Que agonia..."
G["The air around you crackles as Khanok the Impassable appears!"]="O ar que te perto crepita quando aparecem Khanok o Infranqueable!"
G["The air battle rages close, $n.  Both we and the Horde send bombers into the Bombardment and the Valley of Lost Hope.  Will you enter the fray?"]="The air battle rages close, $n.  Both we and the Horde send bombers into the Bombardment and the Valley of Lost Hope.  Will you enter the fray?"
G["The air crackles as a |cFFF00000|Hspell:118077|h[Lightning Storm]|h|r forms!"]="The air crackles as a |cFFF00000|Hspell:118077|h[Lightning Storm]|h|r forms!"
G["The air crackles with anger!"]="O ar crepita pela raiva!"
G["The air crackles with electricity!"]="O ar crepita carregado de electricidade!"
G["The air is abuzz with energy, Arch Druid. What is the status of the Forest Lord?"]="O ar bulhe de energia, arquidruida. Qual é o estado do Senhor da Floresta?"
G["The air is so clean here."]="Aqui o ar é muito limpo."
G["The air itself freezes with the introduction of our next combatant, Icehowl! Kill or be killed, champions!"]="The air itself freezes with the introduction of our next combatant, Icehowl! Kill or be killed, champions!"
G["The air teems with latent energy... quite the harvest!"]="The air teems with latent energy... quite the harvest!"
G["The airfield is ours, and with it, the skies over Gnomeregan."]="Temos a base aérea e, com ela, o céu de Gnomeregan."
G["The airstrip at last! Thank you, I can make my way from here. Be sure to tell Fizzcrank I'm back and safe!"]="A pista de aterrizagem ao fim! Obrigado, posso seguir somente desde aqui. Certifique-se de decirle a Palanqueta que e voltado saudável e salvou."
G["The alchemists are located in the Court of the Sun; you'll find Camberon eager to teach you anything you might want to know about the art of brewing potions."]="Os alquimistas estão localizados na Corte do Sol; você encontrará Camberon ansioso para ensinar qualquer coisa que você queira saber sobre a arte de preparar poções."
G["The alchemy lab is not quite yet ready, $n. Mar'nah says that she is $3223w percent done with its assembly, however.\n\nIf you would like to help her with that, you will find her inside the inn at the Sun's Reach Harbor."]="O laboratório de alquimia ainda não está pronto, $n. Mas Mar'nah diz que o tem montado ao $3223w %.\n\nSe que ajudá-lo, a encontrar dentro da estalagem no Porto de Tramo do Sol."
G["The ale?! Why would they destroy the ale?! Monsters!"]="The ale?! Why would they destroy the ale?! Monsters!"
G["The altar is glowing! We have done it!"]="The altar is glowing! We have done it!"
G["The altar is still warm from a recent ritual..."]="O altar ainda está quente por algum ritual recente..."
G["The altar seems to beckon to you as if it were alive."]="O altar parece acenar para você como se estivesse vivo."
G["The ambassador lies dead in a pool of his own gore.\n\nThrough his rent clothing, you can make out a row of enormous, deep teethmarks.\n\nEven stranger, the wounds appear to be cauterized, even charred in places."]="The ambassador lies dead in a pool of his own gore.\n\nThrough his rent clothing, you can make out a row of enormous, deep teethmarks.\n\nEven stranger, the wounds appear to be cauterized, even charred in places."
G["The amber congeals to form an |cFFFF0404|Hspell:125803|h[Amber Trap]|h|r !"]="The amber congeals to form an |cFFFF0404|Hspell:125803|h[Amber Trap]|h|r !"
G["The amber offers a paragon's respite, Wakener. Should you fall near death, it will activate on its own."]="The amber offers a paragon's respite, Wakener. Should you fall near death, it will activate on its own."
G["The amber protects us."]="O âmbar nos proteger."
G["The amber sustained me as I slept, but I felt its powers drain over time.\n\nIf you had not awakened me when you did, I fear I would have soon slipped into eternal sleep."]="The amber sustained me as I slept, but I felt its powers drain over time.\n\nIf you had not awakened me when you did, I fear I would have soon slipped into eternal sleep."
G["The amount of time Aysa spends practicing seems excessive... but you can't deny the results.  Her form is beautiful."]="The amount of time Aysa spends practicing seems excessive... but you can't deny the results.  Her form is beautiful."
G["The ancestors knew a way to confound an enemy's senses. We could use this knowledge to discover the Scourge's weakness or strike at their commanders. Without their leaders, the Scourge would fall before our warriors."]="The ancestors knew a way to confound an enemy's senses. We could use this knowledge to discover the Scourge's weakness or strike at their commanders. Without their leaders, the Scourge would fall before our warriors."
G["The ancient Altar of Hakkar stands silently near the entrance to the room.\n\nLooking to the balconies above it, you notice a large serpent-like statue rests on each. The statues look very much like the ones on the altar before you. They must be related in some way..."]="The ancient Altar of Hakkar stands silently near the entrance to the room.\n\nLooking to the balconies above it, you notice a large serpent-like statue rests on each. The statues look very much like the ones on the altar before you. They must be related in some way..."
G["The ancient chest is covered in dust..."]="O cofre antigo está coberto de poeira."
G["The ancient cipher falls to the ground."]="A importante antiga cai no chão."
G["The ancient machine goes haywire! All constructs become |cffFF0000|Hspell:118041|h[Overcharged]|h|r!"]="The ancient machine goes haywire! All constructs become |cffFF0000|Hspell:118041|h[Overcharged]|h|r!"
G["The ancient tomes are always found near inscription trainers."]="Os tomos antigos são sempre encontrados perto de treinadores de inscrição."
G["The ancient vaults of the mogu, untouched by time for thousands of years, who knows what secrets await?"]="The ancient vaults of the mogu, untouched by time for thousands of years, who knows what secrets await?"
G["The anguish of ten-thousand years awaits any foolish enough to don the Ancient Armor of the Kvaldir. Beware the mist and fog, mortals; for with them comes your end."]="The anguish of ten-thousand years awaits any foolish enough to don the Ancient Armor of the Kvaldir. Beware the mist and fog, mortals; for with them comes your end."
G["The anguish will creep up on you."]="A angústia se apoderará de você."
G["The animal looks confused."]="Os animais parecem confusos."
G["The answer I seek eludes me...\n\nSometimes $c, one must step back from the trees in order to see the forest."]="The answer I seek eludes me...\n\nSometimes $c, one must step back from the trees in order to see the forest."
G["The answer is still no, Grok.  You can't go up."]="A resposta continua sendo não, Grok. Você não pode subir."
G["The answer is yes in here, I don't see why it would be any different out there."]="A resposta aqui é sim. Não vejo por que deveria ser distinta aí fosse."
G["The answer will be a yes if you let me out of here."]="A resposta será sim, se me sacas de aqui."
G["The apothecaries toil day and night on a cure for the Lich King's plague.  Without them, both the Horde and the Alliance would be lost."]="The apothecaries toil day and night on a cure for the Lich King's plague.  Without them, both the Horde and the Alliance would be lost."
G["The arakkoa are hidden... everywhere!"]="Os arakkoas estão escondidos... em todas partes!"
G["The arakkoa can send all the assassins they have... they will meet the same fate as these!"]="The arakkoa can send all the assassins they have... they will meet the same fate as these!"
G["The arcane only corrupts those who are weak. Even if you do not follow the path of the warlock, you would do well to remember that."]="O arcano só corrompe aqueles que são fracos. Mesmo se você não seguir pelo caminho do feiticeiro, seria bom lembrar disso."
G["The arcane only corrupts those who are weak. Keep up on your training, or you may find a similar fate."]="O arcano só corrompe aqueles que são fracos. Mantenha seu treinamento, ou você pode encontrar um destino semelhante."
G["The architecture in here is strange, differing in many ways from traditional mogu design. This room seems to be a device of some sort, but I see nothing of its purpose in my notes.  \n\nThe only way for us to figure out what this is for is to activate it and observe.\n\nWhat's the worst that could happen?"]="The architecture in here is strange, differing in many ways from traditional mogu design. This room seems to be a device of some sort, but I see nothing of its purpose in my notes.  \n\nThe only way for us to figure out what this is for is to activate it and observe.\n\nWhat's the worst that could happen?"
G["The archmage Allistarj of the Shadowsworn was granted three. Lady Sevine, warlock of the Shadowsworn was also granted three. The remaining three were given to Grol the Destroyer, lord of the Dreadmaul ogres of these blasted lands.\n\nYou see, $n, without a soul, the body cannot be killed. The remnants of my men are now indestructible fighting units. Thankfully, they are bound in how far they can travel by the stones of binding."]="The archmage Allistarj of the Shadowsworn was granted three. Lady Sevine, warlock of the Shadowsworn was also granted three. The remaining three were given to Grol the Destroyer, lord of the Dreadmaul ogres of these blasted lands.\n\nYou see, $n, without a soul, the body cannot be killed. The remnants of my men are now indestructible fighting units. Thankfully, they are bound in how far they can travel by the stones of binding."
G["The arcing bolts intensify as Onyxia's electrical charge reaches dangerous levels!"]="The arcing bolts intensify as Onyxia's electrical charge reaches dangerous levels!"
G["The arena is a bit loud for my tastes, but it is worth it to witness such a spectacle."]="A arena é um pouco ruidosa para meu gusto, mas o espectáculo merece a pena."
G["The armies of iron will conquer all!"]="The armies of iron will conquer all!"
G["The armies of the Alliance will march upon your bones!"]="The armies of the Alliance will march upon your bones!"
G["The armies of the Burning Legion are attacking all across Azeroth. We need heroes to throw them back!"]="The armies of the Burning Legion are attacking all across Azeroth. We need heroes to throw them back!"
G["The armor and weapons crafters Kradu Grimblade and Zula Slagfury may be found working at a great forge in the lower city."]="Os artesãos de armaduras e armas Kradu Grimblade e Zula Slagfury podem ser encontrados trabalhando em uma grande forja na cidade baixa."
G["The armor of Redemption was worn by our most pious knights - armor worthy of the Lightbringer himself!\n\nThousands fell in the last war; their vestments stripped from their corpses and taken to the dread citadel of Naxxramas.\n\nIt is said that the death knights of Naxxramas corrupt the Redemption plate mail for their own use.\n\nSuch tragedy..."]="The armor of Redemption was worn by our most pious knights - armor worthy of the Lightbringer himself!\n\nThousands fell in the last war; their vestments stripped from their corpses and taken to the dread citadel of Naxxramas.\n\nIt is said that the death knights of Naxxramas corrupt the Redemption plate mail for their own use.\n\nSuch tragedy..."
G["The art of the Windfur Punch has been handed down from generation to generation in my family since the dark days.\n\nIt is said this punch was first attempted during the dark days of the mogu empire, and aided in earning pandaren their freedom."]="The art of the Windfur Punch has been handed down from generation to generation in my family since the dark days.\n\nIt is said this punch was first attempted during the dark days of the mogu empire, and aided in earning pandaren their freedom."
