G["The assistant shakes her head."]="The assistant shakes her head."
G["The assortment of images, shapes, and markings come together before your eyes. The book seems to know your skill with leatherworking and offers you a choice - but be warned - you may only select one and once you have done so, may not change your mind!:"]="The assortment of images, shapes, and markings come together before your eyes. The book seems to know your skill with leatherworking and offers you a choice - but be warned - you may only select one and once you have done so, may not change your mind!:"
G["The ata'mal crystal is mine!"]="O cristal de Ata'mal é meu!"
G["The attackers have fled!  Strength and honor to the Horde!"]="Os agressores têm huido! Força e honra à Horda!"
