G["The barrier preventing access to the Crimson Halls has been smashed. The blood princes and their queen await our... arrival. Let's not keep them waiting.\n\nThe last barrier, preventing our access to Frostwing Halls, will be dismantled in $4939W days."]="The barrier preventing access to the Crimson Halls has been smashed. The blood princes and their queen await our... arrival. Let's not keep them waiting.\n\nThe last barrier, preventing our access to Frostwing Halls, will be dismantled in $4939W days."
G["The barrier protecting the Pulsing Twilight Eggs dissipates as Sinestra harnesses their power!"]="A barrera que proteger os ovos Crepúsculo com pulso desaparece quando Sinestra usa seu poder!"
G["The barrier to the Crimson Hall be open, $g lad:lass;! I got me best gnomes workin' on gettin' the barrier to the Frostwing Halls open. Looks like it's gonna be another $4939W days! Fer now, it's probably best that you go face the blood princes and their queen!"]="A barrera até a Salão Carmesim está aberta, $gchico: garota;. Meus melhores gnomos estão trabalhando para abrir a barrera cima As Câmaras de Alaescarcha. Parece que vão a tardar outros $4939W dias! De momentos será melhor que te enfrentes aos príncipes de sangue e ao seu rainha."
G["The bartender hums a tune while working."]="The bartender hums a tune while working."
G["The bastion is falling! Burn the evidence!"]="O Bastião se vem baixo! Queima as provas!"
