G["The battle for Arathi Basin is a battle for resources.  Lumber, ore, food... all these are needed in order to wage a good war.\n\nDenying our enemies of their supplies is as good as killing them on the battlefield."]="The battle for Arathi Basin is a battle for resources.  Lumber, ore, food... all these are needed in order to wage a good war.\n\nDenying our enemies of their supplies is as good as killing them on the battlefield."
G["The battle for Arathi Basin is about to begin."]="A batalha pela Bacia Arathi está a ponto de começar."
G["The battle for Silvershard Mines is about to begin."]="A batalha pelas Minas de Fragmento Prateado está a ponto de começar."
G["The battle for Temple of Kotmogu is about to begin."]="A batalha pelo Templo de Kotmogu está a ponto de começar."
G["The battle for Twin Peaks begins in 1 minute."]="The battle for Twin Peaks begins in 1 minute."
G["The battle for Twin Peaks begins in 30 seconds.  Prepare yourselves!"]="The battle for Twin Peaks begins in 30 seconds.  Prepare yourselves!"
G["The battle for Warsong Gulch begins in 1 minute."]="A batalha pela Ravina Brado Guerreiro começará em 1 minuto."
G["The battle for Warsong Gulch begins in 30 seconds.  Prepare yourselves!"]="A batalha pela Ravina Brado Guerreiro começará em 30 segundos. Preparem-se!"
G["The battle for Warsong Gulch is a battle that we cannot lose.  We fight for our honor and we fight for our land, and no orc or misguided ally will take them from us!"]="A batalha pelo Warsong Gulch é uma batalha que não podemos perder. Lutamos por nossa honra e lutamos por nossa terra, e nenhum orc ou aliado enganado os tirará de nós!"
G["The battle for control of Wintergrasp will begin in 1 hour!"]="A batalha pelo controle de Invérnia começará em 1 hora!"
G["The battle for control of Wintergrasp will begin in 15 minutes!"]="A batalha pelo controle de Invérnia começará em 15 minutos!"
G["The battle for control of Wintergrasp will begin in 5 minutes!"]="A batalha pelo controle de Invérnia começará em 5 minutos!"
G["The battle for control of Wintergrasp will begin in 5 minutes!  Prepare yourselves for batlle!"]="A batalha pelo controle de Invérnia começará em 5 minutos! Prepare-se para a batalha!"
G["The battle for the Eye of the Storm is about to begin."]="A batalha pelo Olho da Tormenta está a ponto de começar."
G["The battle for the Strand of the Ancients begins in 1 minute."]="A batalha pela Praia dos Ancestrais começará em 1 minuto."
G["The battle for the Strand of the Ancients begins in 30 seconds.  Prepare yourselves!"]="A batalha pela Praia dos Ancestrais começará em 30 segundos. Preparem-se!"
G["The battle for the Strand of the Ancients has ended!"]="A batalha pela Praia dos Ancestrais terminou!"
G["The battle for the Sunwell is but the first step on your new path, Lady Liadrin. Shattrath is open to you and all who follow you."]="A batalha pela Nascente do Sol não é mais que o primeiro passo no seu novo caminho, Lady Liadrin. Shattrath está aberta para você e para os seus seguidores."
G["The battle for the Undercity begins now! Sound the horns of war! Champions of the Horde, be empowered by the might of your Warchief!"]="The battle for the Undercity begins now! Sound the horns of war! Champions of the Horde, be empowered by the might of your Warchief!"
G["The battle goes well. The Scourge forces seem weakened. I believe it will only be a matter of time before we drive them from our shores. I will turn my magics to you, to aid in this struggle."]="A batalha vai bem. As forças do Flagelo parecem enfraquecidas. Acredito que será apenas uma questão de tempo até tirá-os de nossas costas. Voltarei minhas mágicas para você, para ajudar nessa luta."
G["The battle has begun!"]="A batalha tem começado!"
G["The battle is about to begin!"]="A batalha está a ponto de começar!"
G["The battle is about to begin! $n versus the ferocious clefthoof, Brokentoe!"]="A batalha está a ponto de começar! $n contra o ferozes unhagrieta, Dedoquebrado!"
G["The battle is about to begin! $n vs. the vicious Dragonmaw, Torg Drakeflayer! I THINK he's vicious anyway - hard to tell. I just let him because they let us take over their old arena here. Here's hoping for some blood!"]="The battle is about to begin! $n vs. the vicious Dragonmaw, Torg Drakeflayer! I THINK he's vicious anyway - hard to tell. I just let him because they let us take over their old arena here. Here's hoping for some blood!"
G["The battle is about to begin! Am I reading this card right? It... It's the nefarious magnataur lord, STINKBEARD! Yes, folks, STINKBEARD! $n doesn't stand a chance!"]="A batalha está a ponto de começar! Estou lendo bem esta cartão? É... É o terrível senhor magnatauro, Barbahedionda! Sim, amigos, Barbahedionda! $n não tem nem uma oportunidade!"
G["The battle is about to begin! The unmerciful Murkblood twins versus $n!"]="A batalha está a ponto de começar! Os impiedosos gêmeos Sangreoscura contra $n!"
G["The battle is ours!"]="A batalha é nossa!"
G["The battle is ours. Finally, peace..."]="Temos derrotado. Finalmente, a paz..."
G["The battle is over, and the people of Darrowshire are saved."]="A batalha terminou, e a poblação de Vila Darrow está a salvou."
G["The battle is over, and the people of Darrowshire are saved.\n\nThey are saved, $n, because of you.  You are truly a hero of Darrowshire."]="A batalha terminou, e a poblação de Vila Darrow está a salvou.\n\nEstão a salvou, $n, Obrigado você. É um autêntico herói de Vila Darrow."
G["The battle is won! Watch as they flee to the safety of their precious temple. Soon all will be razed... Their leaders destroyed!"]="The battle is won! Watch as they flee to the safety of their precious temple. Soon all will be razed... Their leaders destroyed!"
G["The battle is won."]="Temos ganhou a batalha."
G["The battle is won. For the time being, the Scourge threat has been pushed back. Our resources can be channeled into aiding you, in thanks and preparation for the future."]="The battle is won. For the time being, the Scourge threat has been pushed back. Our resources can be channeled into aiding you, in thanks and preparation for the future."
G["The battle rages, and both our captain and the captain of our enemy are slain!\n\nDrek'Thar now leads us from Frostwolf Keep, and the dwarf Vanndar Stormpike hides deep in Dun Baldar.  Defeat Vanndar and claim victory for the Horde!"]="A batalha está em pleno auge e nosso capitão e o capitão inimigo estão mortos!\n\nDrek'Thar nos dirige agora desdo Bastião Lobo Gelo e o anão Vanndar Pico Tempestade se esconde nas profundezas de Dun Baldar. Derrote a Vanndar e reivindica em vitória para a Horda!"
G["The battle shifts in my favor once more."]="A batalha pende a meu favor outra vez."
G["The battle sways in my favor."]="A batalha pende a meu favor."
G["The battle was a haze of blood, lead, and sweat. The broodmother's attacks came faster and faster!"]="The battle was a haze of blood, lead, and sweat. The broodmother's attacks came faster and faster!"
G["The battle will begin in 1 minute."]="A batalha começará em 1 minuto."
G["The battle will begin in 15 seconds."]="A batalha começará em 15 segundos."
G["The battle will begin in 30 seconds."]="A batalha começará em 30 segundos."
G["The battle will begin in 60 seconds."]="A batalha começará em 60 segundos."
G["The battlefield is no place for a girl!"]="O campo de batalha não é lugar para uma ninha!"
G["The battlemaster serving Undercity is Grizzle Halfmane - a fierce fighter in his day. He's in the Royal Quarter."]="O mestre de batalha que se encarga de Cidade Baixa é Grizzle Mediamelena, um ferozes lutador. Se encontre no Bairro Real."
G["The battlemasters are pleased with how many are coming to compete."]="The battlemasters are pleased with how many are coming to compete."
G["The battlemasters are stationed in the Royal Quarter; you'll find them around the throne room."]="Os mestres de batalha estão estacionados no Bairro Real; você os encontrará pela sala do trono."
G["The battlemasters take their ease deep within the halls of the Blood Knight enclave in Farstriders' Square. While somewhat... crude, they have their redeemable traits."]="Os mestres de batalha se relaxam profundamente nos corredores do enclave dos Cavaleiros de Sangue na Praça dos Farstriders. Enquanto um pouco... bruto, eles têm suas características resgatáveis."
G["The beacons are lit, now is the time to strike! Take one of these battle standards and plant it at the graveyard for the Alliance!"]="Os faróis estão acesos, agora é a hora de atacar! Pegue um desses padrões de batalha e plante-o no cemitério da Aliança!"
G["The beacons are lit, now is the time to strike! Take one of these battle standards and plant it at the graveyard for the Horde!"]="Os faróis estão acesos, agora é a hora de atacar! Pegue um desses padrões de batalha e plante-o no cemitério da Horda!"
G["The beacons sing to each other, outsider. Important messages are sent.\n\nYour ears will not hear the messages. Only those that the Klaxxi trust hear the words they speak."]="The beacons sing to each other, outsider. Important messages are sent.\n\nYour ears will not hear the messages. Only those that the Klaxxi trust hear the words they speak."
G["The bear god must be kept enfeebled so that the prophet can finish the ritual."]="É preciso manter ao deus urso enfraquecido para que o profeta possa concluir o ritual."
G["The bear looks at you calmy and patiently, but says nothing."]="O urso olha para você calmo e pacientemente, mas não diz nada."
G["The bear spirit looks upon you with a calm and peaceful gaze.  You hear a voice speak to you as though it was coming from the bear, but the creature makes no indication that it is speaking.\n\n\"Greetings, my young friend.  If you have come to me seeking guidance, then perhaps I can help you find what you seek.\""]="O espírito do urso olhe cima ti com uma olhar tranquila e pacífica. Oyes uma voz que se dirige você e que parece vir do urso, mas a criatura não há nenhum gesto.\n\n\"Saudações, jovem $gamigo: amiga;. Se tem vindo até aqui procurando meu guia, talvez possa ajudar você a encontrar o que atenção.\""
G["The beassst will find you tasssty, sssoftsskin!"]="The beassst will find you tasssty, sssoftsskin!"
G["The beast escaped! By Gallywix's gut, it was fast!"]="A fera tem escapado! pelas entranhas de Galhywix! É rápida!"
G["The beast escaped! By Mekkatorque's moustache, it was fast!"]="A fera tem escapado! pelo mostacho de Mekkatorque! É rápida!"
G["The beast has been defeated! Hurray!"]="The beast has been defeated! Hurray!"
G["The beast has returned! It must not pollute my waters!"]="A fera tem retornado! Não deve contaminar meus águas!"
G["The beast is covered in oil, light him up!"]="The beast is covered in oil, light him up!"
G["The beast is slain! All's well in Darkshire!"]="Têm matou à fera! Tudo vai bem em Vila Sombria!"
G["The beast returns from whence it came. The wrath of Neptulon has subsided."]="A fera retorna do lugar ao que um dia foi. A raiva de Neptulon se tem apagado."
G["The beast ward has fallen! Defend the council with ya lives, brothas!"]="The beast ward has fallen! Defend the council with ya lives, brothas!"
G["The beasts in the region all yield edible meat, $rt. Do what you can to keep the workers fed."]="The beasts in the region all yield edible meat, $rt. Do what you can to keep the workers fed."
G["The beasts of these blasted lands exhibit preternatural attributes, heretofore unseen in nature.\n\nWe have theorized that the energy which was released upon the opening of the Dark Portal, infused into their physical being and forced the creatures to evolve into their current forms.\n\nFearsome beasts they are, no doubt, but we also believe that they could prove to be quite useful in our studies.\n\nPerhaps you would be interested in assisting us in the study of these beasts, $n?"]="The beasts of these blasted lands exhibit preternatural attributes, heretofore unseen in nature.\n\nWe have theorized that the energy which was released upon the opening of the Dark Portal, infused into their physical being and forced the creatures to evolve into their current forms.\n\nFearsome beasts they are, no doubt, but we also believe that they could prove to be quite useful in our studies.\n\nPerhaps you would be interested in assisting us in the study of these beasts, $n?"
G["The beasts of this land aren't like whatever it is you have in your home. Train with me so that you may know how to properly skin them."]="The beasts of this land aren't like whatever it is you have in your home. Train with me so that you may know how to properly skin them."
G["The beer's here! Drink up, boys!"]="The beer's here! Drink up, boys!"
G["The bell again, such a sweet sound."]="Outra vez a sino, que som mais lindo."
G["The bell is recharged! Strike it to weaken nearby enemies!"]="A sino está recargada! Golpéala para despertar aos inimigos próximos!"
G["The bell's screaming voice struck fear and doubt into the hearts of the Emperor's enemies, sending them fleeing in his path."]="A voz gritante do sino incutia o medo e a dúvida nos corações dos inimigos do Imperador, afugentando-os."
G["The besht part about drinking is pretending to be drunk... I'm jusht pretending guys."]="The besht part about drinking is pretending to be drunk... I'm jusht pretending guys."
G["The best brew in all of Pandaria is made right here in the Valley, at the Stormstout Brewery.\n\nWell, at least I think so."]="A melhor cerveja de toda Pandaria se fabrica aqui no vale, na Cervejaria do Trovão.\n\nBom, ao menos isso acho eu."
G["The best defense is a good offense; anyone can tell you that."]="A melhor defesa é um bom ataque; qualquer um pode lhe dizer isso."
G["The best experience is one's own."]="A melhor experiência é a de um mesmo."
G["The best fishing can be found down at the Anglers Wharf in southeastern Krasarang Wilds. Anyone is welcome to visit us and take up a fishing rod!"]="The best fishing can be found down at the Anglers Wharf in southeastern Krasarang Wilds. Anyone is welcome to visit us and take up a fishing rod!"
G["The best had to have been the look on Perenolde's face when our army comes marchin' right up to his front door. What a battle!"]="The best had to have been the look on Perenolde's face when our army comes marchin' right up to his front door. What a battle!"
G["The best miner has a firm grip on $ghis:her; pick, a stout heart in $ghis:her; chest, and thick, black dust in $ghis:her; hair."]="O bom mineiro tem bem agarrado seu pico, um coração forte no peito e poeira denso e negro no cabelo."
G["The best place to go for Emperor Salmon would probably be right outside the brewery here in the Valley of Four Winds. I'll mark it on your map."]="O melhor lugar para pescar salmones imperador é logo ao lado da cervejaria, no Vale dos Quatro Ventos. O marcarei no seu mapa."
G["The best selection of smuggled goods is available right here, $n.  Great for the whole family!  Avoid goblin taxation and naaru prohibition - the Consortium is here to fill your every shopping need!"]="The best selection of smuggled goods is available right here, $n.  Great for the whole family!  Avoid goblin taxation and naaru prohibition - the Consortium is here to fill your every shopping need!"
G["The best war is a swift war.  The same can be said of conversation.  What say you $r?"]="Uma guerra, quanto mais curto, melhor. Igual que uma conversa. ($r)"
G["The better to hear you with, my child."]="Melhor ouvir você, meu filho."
G["The better to own you with!"]="The better to own you with!"
G["The better to see you with, my child."]="Melhor te ver, meu filho."
G["The big wars might be over, for now, but we still have to keep our skills sharp!"]="As grandes guerras podem ter terminado, por enquanto, mas ainda precisamos de manter nossas habilidades afiadas!"
G["The bigger they are, the harder they fall."]="Quanto mais grandes são, mais ruido fazem ao cair."
G["The biggest, juiciest, loveliest apples in the Valley! Get 'em right here!"]="The biggest, juiciest, loveliest apples in the Valley! Get 'em right here!"
G["The binding should only take a moment, but I'll be completely entranced."]="The binding should only take a moment, but I'll be completely entranced."
G["The black aspect's blood is cursed. Wherever it was shed - nothing will grow for ten thousand years."]="O sangue dos Aspectos negros está maldito. Ali onde se derrama, nada volta a crescer em dez mil anos."
G["The black blood of Yogg-Saron courses through me! I. AM. UNSTOPPABLE!"]="The black blood of Yogg-Saron courses through me! I. AM. UNSTOPPABLE!"
G["The black dragonflight will conquer all!"]="O Voo Negro o conquistará tudo!"
G["The blacksmith here works in the War Quarter, close to where his weapons will be put to use. He's there on the inner ring."]="O ferreiro aqui trabalha no Bairro da Guerra, perto de onde suas armas serão usadas. Ele está lá no anel interno."
G["The blacksmiths all work in the crafter's hall, to the left as you enter the main building.\n\nI will mark the location on your map."]="The blacksmiths all work in the crafter's hall, to the left as you enter the main building.\n\nI will mark the location on your map."
G["The blade and Mograine were a singular entity. Do you understand? This act corrupted the blade and lead to Mograine's own corruption as a death knight of Kel'Thuzad. I swore that if I lived, I would expose the perpetrators of this heinous crime. For two days I remained under the rot and contagion of Scourge - gathering as much strength as possible to escape the razed city."]="The blade and Mograine were a singular entity. Do you understand? This act corrupted the blade and lead to Mograine's own corruption as a death knight of Kel'Thuzad. I swore that if I lived, I would expose the perpetrators of this heinous crime. For two days I remained under the rot and contagion of Scourge - gathering as much strength as possible to escape the razed city."
G["The blade cuts into the Mosh'Ogg Bounty, forcing it open!"]="A lâmina cai sobre a recompensa de Mosh'Ogg e a abra de par em par!"
G["The blade itself had to be crafted in ceremony with the children of the Aspects. A rare occurrence indeed... For not only would a dragon have to willingly heat and mold the enchanted metal with their breath, they would also need to contain the fury of their own enchantment by using their blood as temper."]="The blade itself had to be crafted in ceremony with the children of the Aspects. A rare occurrence indeed... For not only would a dragon have to willingly heat and mold the enchanted metal with their breath, they would also need to contain the fury of their own enchantment by using their blood as temper."
G["The blades transform as she pulls them from Whitemane's corpse."]="The blades transform as she pulls them from Whitemane's corpse."
G["The blast of air totally dried my hair. That gives me a great idea for a spare flying machine engine!"]="The blast of air totally dried my hair. That gives me a great idea for a spare flying machine engine!"
G["The blazing flames are safely extinguished."]="As chamas têm banido apagadas de forma certa."
G["The blessed beast Gahz'rilla, adored pet of the Old Gods, grows larger and stronger by the day... as does the Cult of Twilight's Hammer."]="The blessed beast Gahz'rilla, adored pet of the Old Gods, grows larger and stronger by the day... as does the Cult of Twilight's Hammer."
G["The blessed warmth of the sun courses through your veins!"]="The blessed warmth of the sun courses through your veins!"
G["The blessing of the land be with you."]="A bênção da terra esteja com você."
G["The blessings of Cenarius be yours, $c."]="Que Cenarius te bendiga, $c."
G["The blight slowly seeps into their bodies, gradually preparing them for their conversion."]="A fedor se filtra lentamente nos seus corpos, preparándolos gradualmente para o seu conversão."
G["The blistering heat must have dulled my senses... mirages! All of you!"]="The blistering heat must have dulled my senses... mirages! All of you!"
G["The blood elf doesn't appear to be a magister, but perhaps she holds something that is the key to the tower's curse."]="A elfa de sangue não parece ser um magíster, mas talvez tenha algo que seja a importante da maldição da torre."
G["The blood elves laid down their weapons in front of the city's defenders; their leader, a blood elf elder known as Voren'thal, stormed into the Terrace of Light and demanded to speak to A'dal."]="The blood elves laid down their weapons in front of the city's defenders; their leader, a blood elf elder known as Voren'thal, stormed into the Terrace of Light and demanded to speak to A'dal."
G["The blood elves of Silvermoon cheer for $n."]="The blood elves of Silvermoon cheer for $n."
G["The blood elves weren't prepared to fight the Korune mogu. Lotta blood elves died, but I heard you saved many survivors."]="Os elfos de sangue não estavam preparados para lutar kontraos mogu Korune. Morreram muitos elfos, mas eu ouça ke você salva a muitos sobreviventes."
G["The blood in my veins is now thick with toxins. I shall fear no poison ever again. Truly, I am my own masterpiece!"]="The blood in my veins is now thick with toxins. I shall fear no poison ever again. Truly, I am my own masterpiece!"
G["The blood is life... And as easily as the ebb and flow of blood is controlled, so too is the life of our enemies."]="O sangue é vida... E tão facilmente quanto o fluxo e refluxo do sangue é controlado, o mesmo acontece com a vida de nossos inimigos."
G["The blood is our power!"]="O sangue é nosso poder!"
G["The blood of a thousand Alliance soldiers I shall spill... None shall stand against the might of the Ice Lord!"]="The blood of a thousand Alliance soldiers I shall spill... None shall stand against the might of the Ice Lord!"
G["The blood of our enemies shall be spilt upon the battlefield. The great elementals shall answer our call and crush all that stand in our way."]="O sangue de nossos inimigos será derramado no campo de batalha. Os grandes elementais responderão ao nosso chamado e esmagarão tudo o que estiver em nosso caminho."
G["The blood of the True Horde lusts for power!"]="O sangue da Horda autêntico ansía poder!"
G["The blood of the fallen cries out for justice."]="O sangue dos caídos clama por justiça."
G["The blood of the fallen was washed away by the storm and carried to Whitepetal Lake, turning the waters a deep red. With its final breath, the storm struck the center of the lake, igniting the very water itself.  The lake burned with a crimson hue for many days."]="The blood of the fallen was washed away by the storm and carried to Whitepetal Lake, turning the waters a deep red. With its final breath, the storm struck the center of the lake, igniting the very water itself.  The lake burned with a crimson hue for many days."
G["The blood red pool within the eye swirls, betraying images of a massing army of Scourge. The eye seems to pull at you, willing its way into your mind and triggering you to pull back instinctively. You feel very uneasy in the presence of this object."]="A poça de sangue vermelho dentro dos olhos gira, revelando imagens de um exército de Flagelo em massa. O olho parece puxar para você, desejando entrar na sua mente e fazendo com que você recue instintivamente. Você se sente muito desconfortável na presença desse item."
G["The blood ritual is complete... and I can now see where Loramus Thalipedes awaits you."]="O ritual da sangue foi concluído... e agora posso ver onde te espera Loramus Thalimedes."
G["The blood ritual is complete... and I can now see where three amulets await you."]="The blood ritual is complete... and I can now see where three amulets await you."
G["The blood samples must be protected!  Destroy the intruders!"]="The blood samples must be protected!  Destroy the intruders!"
G["The blood we shed speaks to us. It says  \"Thank you.\""]="O sangue que derramamos nos fala. E diz \"Obrigado\"."
G["The blood we shed speaks to us. It says \"Thank you.\""]="O sangue que derramamos nos fala. E diz \"Obrigado\"."
G["The bloodhound has caught the scent.  Follow it!"]="The bloodhound has caught the scent.  Follow it!"
G["The bloodhound has spotted a piece of parchment at the end of the trail."]="The bloodhound has spotted a piece of parchment at the end of the trail."
G["The blue banners!"]="Os estandartes azul!"
G["The blue dragons themselves aren't here, but followers of Malygos are. I do not know why, but I can tell you this: wherever the blue dragons are, expect to find arcane magic. I wouldn't be surprised if the dragonspawn are here protecting something... perhaps something the Highborne left behind."]="Os próprios dragões azuis não estão aqui, mas os seguidores de Malygos estão. Não sei por que, mas posso lhe dizer: onde quer que estejam os dragões azuis, espere encontrar magia arcana. Eu não ficaria surpreso se os dragonspawn estivessem aqui protegendo algo... talvez algo que os Highborne deixaram para por trás."
G["The blue-scaled ones have great power. They work to control Silap Inua and take it from the wide ranging peoples of the world."]="The blue-scaled ones have great power. They work to control Silap Inua and take it from the wide ranging peoples of the world."
G["The boar is superb!"]="O javali está delicioso!"
G["The bodies hanging from the gate... something's very wrong here."]="Os corpos pendurado da porta... algo vai mal aqui."
G["The body fails... but the spirit... can endure..."]="O corpo falha... mas o espírito... permanece..."
G["The body is that of a female orc warrior.\n\nIt is clear that she died in battle, probably against the quilboar in the area."]="The body is that of a female orc warrior.\n\nIt is clear that she died in battle, probably against the quilboar in the area."
G["The body of the fallen dryad lies here where she lost her life to the Horde."]="O corpo da dríada cai jaz onda Horda acabou com o seu vida."
G["The bodyguard grunts."]="The bodyguard grunts."
G["The bog lords are attacking!  Help us!"]="Nos atacando os senhores da marisma! Ajuda!"
G["The bog lords are devouring the spore sacs!  They've got to be stopped!"]="Os senhores do pântano estão devorando os sacos de esporos! Eles precisam ser parados!"
G["The bogblossom explodes, spraying pollen wildly."]="O cardo de Mantar explode, lhenándolo tudo de pólen."
G["The bomb is set! Get clear!"]="A bomba está preparada! Fora!"
G["The bombs are set! Run to the balcony and jump to escape!"]="The bombs are set! Run to the balcony and jump to escape!"
G["The bonds that hold me are not so permanent, $c. Pray you are not near when I have my vengeance."]="The bonds that hold me are not so permanent, $c. Pray you are not near when I have my vengeance."
G["The bonelashers of the wastes are no laughing matter.  I hear they carry diseases!"]="Os Atizahuesos não são um inimigo qualquer. Ouvi que te podem contagiar doenças!"
G["The bones side with death!"]="The bones side with death!"
G["The bones side with me!"]="The bones side with me!"
G["The bones side with the spirits!"]="The bones side with the spirits!"
G["The bones side with you, mon!"]="The bones side with you, mon!"
G["The bones! You wretch!"]="Os ossos! Maldito!"
G["The book is your salvation, yes... but nothing will you know! NOTHING I SAY! NOTHING!"]="O livro é seu salvação, sim... mas não saberá nada! TE DIGO QUE NADA! NADA!"
G["The book tells of dragons uniting against another, more powerful dragon, named Deathwing. From what you can make out, the chromatic dragonflight had almost been unleashed upon the world. The Aspects were prepared."]="The book tells of dragons uniting against another, more powerful dragon, named Deathwing. From what you can make out, the chromatic dragonflight had almost been unleashed upon the world. The Aspects were prepared."
G["The books burst into flame from being hit by Book Burner."]="The books burst into flame from being hit by Book Burner."
G["The boots, no. The belt, oh very much no. The shirt, stunning, but not on you. We should get you a real cape. And perhaps a vest with a proper hero's cut."]="The boots, no. The belt, oh very much no. The shirt, stunning, but not on you. We should get you a real cape. And perhaps a vest with a proper hero's cut."
G["The booty be ours!"]="O saque será nosso!"
G["The boss wants all hands on high alert.  The rusty anchor sinks tonight."]="The boss wants all hands on high alert.  The rusty anchor sinks tonight."
G["The bot will adjust its speed to match your own. I would suggest you mount up to speed things along. By the way, the bot was put together with salvaged components from a pile of scrap metal delivered to me from Outland. There were some side effects."]="The bot will adjust its speed to match your own. I would suggest you mount up to speed things along. By the way, the bot was put together with salvaged components from a pile of scrap metal delivered to me from Outland. There were some side effects."
G["The bottles are dusty but the liquor goes down clean!"]="The bottles are dusty but the liquor goes down clean!"
G["The boy believed he could essssscape... Neither of you shall make it out alive."]="The boy believed he could essssscape... Neither of you shall make it out alive."
G["The boy believed that he was free, but free will has a price. The demons I kept at bay are now loosed upon him and all death knights that attempt to flee..."]="The boy believed that he was free, but free will has a price. The demons I kept at bay are now loosed upon him and all death knights that attempt to flee..."
G["The boy believed you could be saved, but he didn't know what burns within your soul when in your heart, you know we are the same."]="The boy believed you could be saved, but he didn't know what burns within your soul when in your heart, you know we are the same."
G["The boy had picked up the Ashbringer and driven it through his father's heart as his back was turned. His last words will haunt me forever: \"What have you done, Renault? Why would you do this?\""]="The boy had picked up the Ashbringer and driven it through his father's heart as his back was turned. His last words will haunt me forever: \"What have you done, Renault? Why would you do this?\""
G["The boy's death and, in fact, the deaths of all of the knights involved in the redemption of the blade could have been avoided."]="The boy's death and, in fact, the deaths of all of the knights involved in the redemption of the blade could have been avoided."
G["The boy's face is ashen and pale. He barely breathes."]="The boy's face is ashen and pale. He barely breathes."
G["The boy's too stupid still to say it -- not enough crystal exposure yet -- but, he's thankful for what you did in getting him those flasks.\n\nNow, only nine more sons to go.  Gah!\n\n<Both of Torkus's heads sigh.>\n\nWant to take one of them off of our hands?  We'll sell him to you cheap."]="The boy's too stupid still to say it -- not enough crystal exposure yet -- but, he's thankful for what you did in getting him those flasks.\n\nNow, only nine more sons to go.  Gah!\n\n<Both of Torkus's heads sigh.>\n\nWant to take one of them off of our hands?  We'll sell him to you cheap."
G["The boys and I have only traveled together for a little while, but I already can't imagine life without either one of them."]="Os meninos e eu só viajamos juntos por um tempo, mas já não consigo imaginar a vida sem nenhum deles."
G["The boys are afraid of Sayge, that's why they stay away."]="aos pessoal lhes da medo Sayge, por isso estão longe."
G["The boys like to hide here. I think they are afraid to actually climb the bridge."]="aos pessoal lhes gosta esconder aqui. Acho que lhes da medo cruzar o ponte."
G["The brat's held prisoner in the wolf den on the other side of the mountain.  She was to be taken to Arugal.  Are we free to go now?"]="The brat's held prisoner in the wolf den on the other side of the mountain.  She was to be taken to Arugal.  Are we free to go now?"
G["The brazier fires upon the helpless orc! [PH]"]="The brazier fires upon the helpless orc! [PH]"
G["The braziers are prepared. I am ready to face you in combat."]="The braziers are prepared. I am ready to face you in combat."
G["The breach you created was sealed with Nerubian webbing almost as quickly as it was opened."]="The breach you created was sealed with Nerubian webbing almost as quickly as it was opened."
G["The breaking of this one has been taxing. The atrocities I have committed upon his soul. He has resisted for so long, but he will bow down before his king soon."]="The breaking of this one has been taxing. The atrocities I have committed upon his soul. He has resisted for so long, but he will bow down before his king soon."
G["The breaking of this one has been taxing. The atrocities I have committed upon his soul... He has resisted for so long, but he will bow down before his king soon."]="The breaking of this one has been taxing. The atrocities I have committed upon his soul... He has resisted for so long, but he will bow down before his king soon."
G["The brewery's got a second entrance, over yonder."]="A cervejaria tem uma segunda entrada, por ali."
G["The bridge is looking great. We keep up this pace and it'll be done for the first expansion forces to head north."]="The bridge is looking great. We keep up this pace and it'll be done for the first expansion forces to head north."
G["The bronze dragonflight. They snatched me from the brink of death and took me before their master, Nozdormu. He said they had been watching me and wanted me to continue my hunt. He granted me immortality as a watcher, tasked to bear witness to the history of Azeroth as one of his agents.\n\nI am Xarantaur the Witness, and it is my duty to preserve the true history of Azeroth lest it be forgotten."]="The bronze dragonflight. They snatched me from the brink of death and took me before their master, Nozdormu. He said they had been watching me and wanted me to continue my hunt. He granted me immortality as a watcher, tasked to bear witness to the history of Azeroth as one of his agents.\n\nI am Xarantaur the Witness, and it is my duty to preserve the true history of Azeroth lest it be forgotten."
G["The bronze flight is in your debt."]="O vôo de bronze está na sua dívida."
G["The brood of Onyxia!"]="O linagem de Onyxia!"
G["The brood shall not fall!"]="O linagem não falhará!"
G["The broodmother flies above us! Do not fear, fleshling, I am called \"The Steady\" for a reason..."]="A mãe de linagem voe sobre nós! Não temas, ser de carne, me chamam \"o Firme\" por uma razão..."
G["The builders have toiled for many years, and it is nearly complete."]="Muitos anos de trabalho têm banido necessários, mas quase está terminada."
G["The building we're looking for is on the Craftsman's Terrace.  Let's go."]="O edifício que buscamos está no Bancal do Artesão. Vamos."
G["The burden of a king is great, as is the burden of a father. I will stop at nothing to find my son."]="A carga de um rei é pesada, mas a de um pai não o é menos. Farei o que faça falta para encontrar a meu filho."
G["The burden of the damned falls upon you!"]="The burden of the damned falls upon you!"
G["The burgeoning hero returns! It is good to see you again, $n. You are always welcome at our village."]="The burgeoning hero returns! It is good to see you again, $n. You are always welcome at our village."
G["The burial site must be restored."]="O enterramento tem de ser restaurado."
G["The burning of the Wickerman will begin in fifteen minutes!  Come to the festival - located just west of the Undercity - and celebrate Hallow's End and our liberation from the Scourge!"]="The burning of the Wickerman will begin in fifteen minutes!  Come to the festival - located just west of the Undercity - and celebrate Hallow's End and our liberation from the Scourge!"
G["The burning of the Wickerman will begin in five minutes!  Come to the festival - located just west of the Undercity - and celebrate Hallow's End and our liberation from the Scourge!"]="The burning of the Wickerman will begin in five minutes!  Come to the festival - located just west of the Undercity - and celebrate Hallow's End and our liberation from the Scourge!"
G["The buzz around here is that we've collected everything that we need. Now it all comes down to the Horde gathering up their stuff. Once they have we can all ship our goods over to Silithus and the war can begin."]="O burburinho por aqui é que coletamos tudo o que precisamos de. Agora tudo se resume à Horda juntando suas coisas. Quando eles tiverem, todos podemos enviar nossos produtos para Silithus e a guerra poderá começar."
G["The camp is just ahead, we should be able to make it from here."]="O acampamento está um pouco mais adiante. Poderemos chegar desde aqui."
G["The cannon is dented and streaked with gunpowder."]="The cannon is dented and streaked with gunpowder."
G["The cannon was rigged with an explosive trap!"]="Havia uma armadilha explosiva instalar no canhão!"
G["The cannoneer's hands are black with gunpowder."]="The cannoneer's hands are black with gunpowder."
G["The cannons must be finished soon."]="Os canhões têm que estar prontos em breve."
G["The canteen... get the canteen..."]="A cantimplora... Pegue a cantimplora..."
G["The cap'n says that as soon as Prince Arthas returns we'll be on our way back to Lordaeron."]="O capitão diz que, assim que o príncipe Arthas voltar, voltaremos para Lordaeron."
G["The captain and his forces pushed forward to take one of the bases you scouted for him earlier. You should go and meet them."]="O capitão e suas forças avançaram para pegar uma das bases que você procurou antes. Você deveria ir encontrá-os."
G["The captain's great!  We get time to relax when we dock.  Those are the times I look forward to the most."]="O capitão é ótimo! Temos tempo para relaxar quando atracamos. Esses são os momentos que mais anseiam."
G["The car took a beating!  Let's get it ready for the next race."]="The car took a beating!  Let's get it ready for the next race."
G["The caravan has arrived. Good luck!"]="A caravana chegou. Boa sorte!"
G["The caravan is uprotected - I'm turning back!"]="A caravana está desprotegida! Eu me vuelvo!"
G["The care of a young serpent is a delicate thing."]="Cuidar de um dragão jovem é um assunto delicado."
G["The cartel has a name for people like you, $n. \"Fiscal Liability.\""]="O cartaz tem um nome para gente como você, $n. \"Dívida fiscal\"."
G["The cat watches the broom intently."]="The cat watches the broom intently."
G["The cataclysm split the land apart here, allowing the naga to stretch inland..."]="The cataclysm split the land apart here, allowing the naga to stretch inland..."
G["The catapults remain disabled. I've burned several and trapped the others."]="The catapults remain disabled. I've burned several and trapped the others."
G["The cats keep me company. It's been quite lonesome on the farm since my parents passed...\n\nOh no, I didn't mean to tell you so much."]="The cats keep me company. It's been quite lonesome on the farm since my parents passed...\n\nOh no, I didn't mean to tell you so much."
G["The cauldron bubbles violently."]="O caldeirão borbulha violentamente."
G["The cauldron continues to boil..."]="A caldeirão continue hirviendo..."
G["The cavern trembles violently!"]="The cavern trembles violently!"
G["The caverns below us are a source of strange and wondrous hides, but you must take care if you venture into their depths, $n. Remember that your own skin is far more valuable."]="The caverns below us are a source of strange and wondrous hides, but you must take care if you venture into their depths, $n. Remember that your own skin is far more valuable."
G["The caverns have been purified. To Naralex's chamber we go!"]="The caverns have been purified. To Naralex's chamber we go!"
G["The celebration of the Lunar Festival is in full swing in Moonglade. You can make the trek, or the druids in the Cenarion Enclave are offering transport."]="A celebração do Festival Lunar está em pleno andamento em Moonglade. Você pode fazer a caminhada, ou os druidas no Enclave Cenarion estão oferecendo transporte."
G["The celebration of the feast of Winter Veil is a source of great warmth during the cold seasons, and its heart is in Orgrimmar."]="A celebração da festa do véu de inverno é uma fonte de grande calor durante as estações frias, e seu coração está em Orgrimmar."
G["The celebration of the natural processes of the world is silly; it's going to happen whether we celebrate or not! But it's a great excuse for sugar!"]="A celebração dos processos naturais do mundo é boba; vai acontecer se comemoramos ou não! Mas é uma ótima desculpa para o açúcar!"
G["The celestials are so huge!"]="The celestials are so huge!"
G["The center of the jinyu village was clear. Just to be safe, Kiryn planted some explosive barrels for me to shoot."]="The center of the jinyu village was clear. Just to be safe, Kiryn planted some explosive barrels for me to shoot."
G["The central courtyard is heavily guarded. We'll go around."]="The central courtyard is heavily guarded. We'll go around."
G["The central gate opens!"]="A porta central se abra!"
G["The chaff of the world tumbles across our doorstep, driven by fear; Her royal storm will whisk them away."]="A escória do mundo se arraste até nosso umbral, aterrorizada; Seu tempestade regia a expulsará."
G["The challenge is in looking beyond appearances and understanding our similarities. Through this understanding, you can feel compassion for the losses others have suffered..."]="The challenge is in looking beyond appearances and understanding our similarities. Through this understanding, you can feel compassion for the losses others have suffered..."
G["The challenger has been defeated!"]="The challenger has been defeated!"
G["The challengers have failed. Not being vrykul this was expected."]="Os lutadores têm fracassado. Era de esperar, pois não são vrykuls."
G["The chamber has been breached! The titan relic is vulnerable!"]="The chamber has been breached! The titan relic is vulnerable!"
G["The champion of the Winterax trolls has challenged you, $n! I hope you're ready!"]="O campeão dos trolls Machado Invernal te desafiou, $n! Espero que estiver $gpronto: pronta;!"
G["The champions of the world's great nations have gathered at the Argent Tournament Grounds in northeastern Icecrown to face all challengers."]="The champions of the world's great nations have gathered at the Argent Tournament Grounds in northeastern Icecrown to face all challengers."
G["The chaos I have sown here is but a taste...."]="O caos que e sembrado aqui é somente uma mostra..."
G["The charges are all set; hit the detonator as soon as you're ready!"]="As cargas estão prontas; ativao detonador assim que estiver $gpronto: pronta;!"
G["The charges are placed. Hero - you may have the honor."]="As cargas estão posicionadas. A honra é sua."
G["The charges are set. Get back before they blow!"]="As cargas estão colocadas. Retrocede antes de que estalhen!"
G["The chief will pay big money for your head!"]="O chefe pagará muito dinheiro pela sua cabeça!"
G["The chieftain's brother, Stormhoof, gathered all his strength and set out to conquer the Storm Peaks from its rightful ruler, the North Wind."]="The chieftain's brother, Stormhoof, gathered all his strength and set out to conquer the Storm Peaks from its rightful ruler, the North Wind."
G["The children are frightened, but they will be all right. We will keep them safe!"]="Os crianças têm medo, mas estarão bem. Os protegeremos!"
G["The children cheer."]="The children cheer."
G["The children love this holiday.  Some children have gone out trick-or-treating, some have stayed behind, and some, like these, have decided to try to run a small business.\n\nTheir goal is to amass as much candy as possible, and they felt the best way was to offer treats for the hard work of others.  I laughed when I first heard of their plan, $c.  But now that I see how many adventurers are giving them candy for their wares, I am worried.\n\nThat is a lot of sugar.  I don't think the children will ever be able to fall asleep again."]="The children love this holiday.  Some children have gone out trick-or-treating, some have stayed behind, and some, like these, have decided to try to run a small business.\n\nTheir goal is to amass as much candy as possible, and they felt the best way was to offer treats for the hard work of others.  I laughed when I first heard of their plan, $c.  But now that I see how many adventurers are giving them candy for their wares, I am worried.\n\nThat is a lot of sugar.  I don't think the children will ever be able to fall asleep again."
G["The children of Stratholme fought with more ferocity!"]="The children of Stratholme fought with more ferocity!"
G["The children of Sul will protect their master. Rise once more Sul'lithuz!"]="The children of Sul will protect their master. Rise once more Sul'lithuz!"
G["The chill creeping from the north gives my bones a fierce ache."]="O frio que chega desdo norte é preciso me duelan muito os ossos."
G["The chill of this place freezes the marrow of my bones."]="The chill of this place freezes the marrow of my bones."
G["The chill of this place... I can feel my blood freezing."]="O frio deste lugar... Posso sentir como se congela meu sangue."
G["The chill you feel is the herald of your doom!"]="The chill you feel is the herald of your doom!"
G["The choice is clear. We must attack. I know the odds are against us, but Taunka do not go quietly to the slaughter."]="The choice is clear. We must attack. I know the odds are against us, but Taunka do not go quietly to the slaughter."
G["The choice is yours to make."]="A elecção é sua."
G["The choice is yours, Anselm.  Return to the Lich King's army and fight alongside them or remain loyal to your so-called queen and suffer their wrath as they drive you from their homelands!"]="The choice is yours, Anselm.  Return to the Lich King's army and fight alongside them or remain loyal to your so-called queen and suffer their wrath as they drive you from their homelands!"
G["The chromatic flight shall deal with these intruders. Let us talk of more pressing matters."]="O Voo Cromática se encargará dos intrusos. Vamos falar de coisas mais urgentes."
G["The cipher fragment is to be moved. Have it delivered to Zuluhed."]="O fragmento de cifra deve ser movido. Entregue a Zuluhed."
G["The circle of life is not yet prepared for Alexstrasza. Speak with me again as soon as I have finished my preparations."]="O Círculo da Vida ainda não está pronto para Alexstrasza. Fala comigo novamente assim que tenha terminou com as preparações."
G["The city has been routed. The Azsh'ir cry your name as a victory call. You've earned much respect this day."]="A cidade foi encaminhada. Os Azsh'ir choram seu nome como uma chamada de vitória. Você ganhou muito respeito neste dia."
G["The city is grinding to a halt as more and more workers become bedridden..."]="The city is grinding to a halt as more and more workers become bedridden..."
G["The city was left in ruins and darkness... until the Sha'tar arrived."]="A cidade ficou derruida e na escuridão... até que chegaram os Sha'tar."
G["The city's Arcane Reforger, Enchantress Fira, will be able to help you.  She is most often found with Sedana and her enchanter's apprentices, off the Court of the Sun."]="O Arcane Reforger da cidade, Enchantress Fira, poderá ajudá-o. Ela é mais frequentemente encontrada com Sedana e os aprendizes do seu feiticeiro, fosse da Corte do Sol."
G["The city's best tailors are in Talismanic Textiles in the Magus Commerce Exchange, northwest Dalaran."]="Os melhores alfaiates da cidade estão em Talismanic Textiles na Magus Commerce Exchange, noroeste de Dalaran."
G["The city's best-known barber shop is located in northern Dalaran."]="A barbearia mais conhecida da cidade está localizada no norte de Dalaran."
G["The city's cemetery is just north of the Violet Citadel in western Dalaran."]="O cemitério da cidade fica ao norte da Cidadela Violeta, no oeste de Dalaran."
G["The city's leatherworker is in the inner ring of the Rogues' Quarter."]="O marceneiro da cidade fica no anel interno do Bairro dos Ladinos."
G["The city's mage and portal trainers may be found in a large building in eastern Dalaran, between Runeweaver Square at the heart of the city and Krasus' Landing."]="Os treinadores de magos e portais da cidade podem ser encontrados em um grande edifício no leste de Dalaran, entre a Runeweaver Square, no coração da cidade, e Krasus 'Landing."
G["The city's premier urgent care center, First to your Aid, is located in the Magus Commerce Exchange, northwest Dalaran."]="O principal centro de atendimento de urgência da cidade, First to your Aid, está localizado na Magus Commerce Exchange, noroeste de Dalaran."
G["The clam has given up the goods!"]="A almeja tem entregado os bens!"
G["The clans are united under Blackhand in this assault. They will stand together until Stormwind has fallen."]="The clans are united under Blackhand in this assault. They will stand together until Stormwind has fallen."
G["The clock is ticking..."]="A hora está passando..."
G["The clock... is still... ticking."]="The clock... is still... ticking."
G["The closest gryphon master is located up in Ironforge near The Great Forge itself.  Ye'll need to head to Ironforge if ye want to travel by gryphon."]="O mestre grifo mais próximo está localizado em Ironforge, perto da própria Grande Forja. Você precisará ir para Ironforge se quiser viajar de grifo."
G["The closest spirit is Huo, the spirit of flame. I would ask you to meet with some of my most talented students and learn what they know of Huo."]="The closest spirit is Huo, the spirit of flame. I would ask you to meet with some of my most talented students and learn what they know of Huo."
G["The closest spirit is Huo, the spirit of flame. You will meet with some of my most talented students and learn what they know of Huo."]="The closest spirit is Huo, the spirit of flame. You will meet with some of my most talented students and learn what they know of Huo."
G["The clothing is merely a manifestation of a larger problem.  I've no doubt that you are here to learn, but you must commit yourself both in spirit and in form."]="The clothing is merely a manifestation of a larger problem.  I've no doubt that you are here to learn, but you must commit yourself both in spirit and in form."
G["The clouds arc with vengeance!"]="The clouds arc with vengeance!"
G["The coast is clear. You're free!"]="The coast is clear. You're free!"
G["The coast was clear. Kiryn began to make her escape."]="The coast was clear. Kiryn began to make her escape."
G["The coffer is just beyond these ruins.\n\nLet's go!"]="O arca está logo além dessas ruínas.\n\nVamos!"
G["The coils of death will crush you!"]="The coils of death will crush you!"
G["The cold comes..."]="O frio se aproxima..."
G["The cold dark beckons..."]="A escuridão gelada nos chama..."
G["The cold darkness awaits your soul!"]="A fria escuridão espera à sua alma!"
G["The cold embrace awaits..."]="A fria parca me espera..."
G["The cold wind blows. The time of the swarm has begun!"]="The cold wind blows. The time of the swarm has begun!"
G["The collar is indeed infused with demonic power, $n.  This bodes ill for our people."]="The collar is indeed infused with demonic power, $n.  This bodes ill for our people."
G["The color has just... left its body."]="Este corpo... perdeu tudo cor."
G["The colors are so vivid!"]="Os cores são tão alegres!"
G["The colors! Nooooooooooooooo!"]="Os cores! Noooooo!"
G["The colossus is injured! Don't stop striking!"]="O colosso está ferido! Não deixe de atacar!"
G["The comedian clears his throat."]="O cómico se aclara a garganta."
G["The comedian impersonates a blood elf."]="O comediante imita a um elfo de sangue."
G["The comedian impersonates a gnome."]="O comediante imita a um gnomo."
G["The comedian impersonates a human female."]="O comediante imita a uma humana."
G["The comedian impersonates a tauren."]="O comediante imita a um tauren."
G["The comedian impersonates an orc."]="O comediante imita a um orc."
G["The commander needs to be told: Mechazod's planning an attack! We're doomed!"]="The commander needs to be told: Mechazod's planning an attack! We're doomed!"
G["The commander of the forces on the ground here is a cruel brute named Zarithrian, but I fear there are greater powers at work."]="O comandante das forças terrestres é um bruto cruel chamado Zarithrian, mas me temo que há implicados poderes maiores."
G["The competition will be fierce, but Orgrimmar's champions will decimate all who stand in our way."]="A competição será acirrada, mas os campeões de Orgrimmar dizimarão todos os que estiverem no nosso caminho."
G["The concern that you show for the welfare of your animal companions is commendable.  Bulrug, on the lower rise, can help you with that.  Seek him out between the bank and the inn."]="A preocupação que você demonstra pelo bem-estar dos seus companheiros animais é louvável. Bulrug, na subida mais baixa, pode ajudá-o com isso. Procure-o entre o banco e a pousada."
G["The conflicts in Outland are deadlier than any I have seen.  And their most tragic victims are the children that are left behind.\n\nNow, with the threat against Shattrath from the arakkoa of Skettis, there will be even more orphans to take care of.  These children often live without the hope of a bright future."]="The conflicts in Outland are deadlier than any I have seen.  And their most tragic victims are the children that are left behind.\n\nNow, with the threat against Shattrath from the arakkoa of Skettis, there will be even more orphans to take care of.  These children often live without the hope of a bright future."
G["The conflicts in Outland are deadlier than any I have seen.  And their most tragic victims are the children that are left behind.\n\nNow, with the threat against Shattrath from the arakkoa of Skettis, there will be even more orphans to take care of.  These children often live without the hope of a bright future.\n\nBut you have the power to do something about that.  It's Children's Week, $c, and I implore you to volunteer to bring joy and wonder into a child's life."]="The conflicts in Outland are deadlier than any I have seen.  And their most tragic victims are the children that are left behind.\n\nNow, with the threat against Shattrath from the arakkoa of Skettis, there will be even more orphans to take care of.  These children often live without the hope of a bright future.\n\nBut you have the power to do something about that.  It's Children's Week, $c, and I implore you to volunteer to bring joy and wonder into a child's life."
G["The console appears ancient though there is no sign of dilapidation or decay.  A single slot appears to fit large circular discs."]="O console parece antigo, embora não haja sinal de deterioração ou decadência. Um único slot parece caber em discos circulares grandes."
G["The contents of that crate are very dangerous and they belong in a secure vault, not in the hands of some well-to-do, but ignorant collector!"]="O conteúdo desse caixote é muito perigoso e deveria estar guardado em uma câmera de segurança, não em mãos de um coleccionista forrado de pasta mas ignorante!"
G["The continent of Northrend is filled with history!  We must dig deep through the frozen ice and find our ancestors."]="The continent of Northrend is filled with history!  We must dig deep through the frozen ice and find our ancestors."
G["The continued sacrifice of the Ashen Verdict and heroes such as yourself bring us all closer to final victory. Now I have come to Icecrown Citadel to lend aid to those who fight against the Scourge. Together we will end the tyranny of the Lich King!"]="O sacrifício contínuo do Veredicto Ashen e heróis como você nos aproximam da vitória fim. Agora eu vim para a Cidadela da Coroa de Gelo para ajudar aqueles que lutam contra o Flagelo. Juntos, acabaremos com a tirania do Rei Lich!"
G["The control components are working perfectly this time!"]="Os componentes de controle estão funcionando à perfecção esta vez!"
G["The control panel shifts and rotates on its axis."]="O painel de controle muda e gira no seu eixo."
G["The control unit for the missile generator is on the top floor of the tower. If you can find a way to get up there, you can shut it down yourselves."]="The control unit for the missile generator is on the top floor of the tower. If you can find a way to get up there, you can shut it down yourselves."
G["The controller can be used to activate the linked proton accelerator.  This will call forth one of Bash'ir's harbingers, or perhaps Bash'ir himself.\n\nAssuming, of course, that you have an accelerator module to activate the device."]="The controller can be used to activate the linked proton accelerator.  This will call forth one of Bash'ir's harbingers, or perhaps Bash'ir himself.\n\nAssuming, of course, that you have an accelerator module to activate the device."
G["The controller can be used to activate the linked proton accelerator.  This will call forth one of Bash'ir's harbingers, or perhaps Bash'ir himself.\n\nUnfortunate that you do not possess an accelerator module to activate the device."]="The controller can be used to activate the linked proton accelerator.  This will call forth one of Bash'ir's harbingers, or perhaps Bash'ir himself.\n\nUnfortunate that you do not possess an accelerator module to activate the device."
G["The convoy to Kota Basecamp is leaving now! Gather around!"]="The convoy to Kota Basecamp is leaving now! Gather around!"
G["The convoy to Neverest Basecamp is leaving now! Gather around!"]="The convoy to Neverest Basecamp is leaving now! Gather around!"
G["The convoy to the Burlap Waystation is leaving now! Gather around!"]="The convoy to the Burlap Waystation is leaving now! Gather around!"
G["The cook around here is in the Trade Quarter. Her name's Eunice Burch."]="O cozinheiro por aqui é no Trade Quarter. O nome dela é Eunice Burch."
G["The corporeal form of Ragnaros must be destroyed. From the remnants, his essence shall emerge. In this weakened state, Ragnaros' grip on the prison of Thunderaan is loosed. The essence itself acting as a key..."]="A forma corporal de Ragnaros deve ser destruída. Dos remanescentes, sua essência emergirá. Nesse estado enfraquecido, a força de Ragnaros na prisão de Thunderaan é perdida. A própria essência atuando como uma chave..."
G["The corpse of one of the Broken lies here.  Mysteriously, the cause of its death does not appear to be from one of the mutated moths.\n\nPerhaps it has something to do with the strange object resting right next to its outstretched hand?"]="Aqui jaz o cadáver de um Tábido. Curiosamente, a causa de morte não parece ser uma polilha mutante.\n\nTalvez tenha algo que ver com o estranho item que se encontre ao lado do seu mão extendida."
G["The corpses of those that try only serve to feed our expanding host!"]="The corpses of those that try only serve to feed our expanding host!"
G["The corruption goes much further than these spiders. I fear the true source is not within this cave."]="A corrupção vai muito além dessas aranha. Me temo que o verdadeiro origem não está dentro desta caverna."
G["The corruption is amplifying.  The fragments must be purged before it becomes too great."]="The corruption is amplifying.  The fragments must be purged before it becomes too great."
G["The corruption is buried deep within him."]="A corrupção está arraigada no mais profundo do seu interior."
G["The corruption is everywhere!  You cannot succeed!"]="A corrupção está por todas partes! Você não pode vencer!"
G["The corruption of Felwood has trapped my spirit here... I may never rest..."]="A corrupção de Felwood prendeu meu espírito aqui... talvez nunca descanse..."
G["The corruption of a fallen titan. The corruption of the Destroyer. After all, the staff was forged from the seed of hate. That is, of course, what has brought me here..."]="A corrupção de um titã caído. A corrupção do Destruidor. Afinal, a equipe foi forjada a partir da semente do ódio. Isso é, é claro, o que me trouxe aqui..."
G["The corruption of the House of Nobles runs through your veins.  Let me remove it with my blade!"]="The corruption of the House of Nobles runs through your veins.  Let me remove it with my blade!"
G["The corruption of the fel has not left any of the creatures of Felwood untouched, $n. Please, be on your guard."]="A corrupção da energia vil tem tocado às criaturas de Frondavil, $n. Por favor, permanece em guarda."
G["The corruption will consume you, as it consumed us..."]="The corruption will consume you, as it consumed us..."
G["The courier from Silvermoon City is delayed. Perhaps I should send a scout to look for him?"]="The courier from Silvermoon City is delayed. Perhaps I should send a scout to look for him?"
G["The courier has arrived!"]="O mensageiro chegou!"
G["The courier must have died of his wounds after what looks to have been a brutal struggle.\n\nHis supply satchel appears to be unharmed."]="O mensageiro deve haver morto pelas feridas do que parece haver banido uma luta brutal.\n\nSeu saco de provisiones parece estar intacto."
G["The courtyard gate is directly up that hill."]="Por essa colina se chega à porta do pátio."
G["The courtyard is ours! Onward to the inner sanctum!"]="The courtyard is ours! Onward to the inner sanctum!"
G["The coward...killed them...poisoned...me..."]="Covarde... os matou... e... me envenenó..."
G["The cowardly dragon must have seen me, because he turned away and flew into the clouds."]="The cowardly dragon must have seen me, because he turned away and flew into the clouds."
G["The crate of explosives is on fire!"]="O caixote de explosivos está em chamas!"
G["The crazy fisherman is on the dock in the Magic Quarter."]="O pescador louco está no banco dos réus no Magic Quarter."
G["The creation of Teldrassil was a grand achievement, but now the world must shift to regain its balance."]="A criação de Teldrassil foi um grande conquista, mas agorao mundo deve alterar para recuperar seu equilíbrio."
G["The creature Entropius, whom you were forced to destroy, was once the noble naaru, M'uru. In life, M'uru channeled vast energies of LIGHT and HOPE. For a time, a misguided few sought to steal those energies..."]="The creature Entropius, whom you were forced to destroy, was once the noble naaru, M'uru. In life, M'uru channeled vast energies of LIGHT and HOPE. For a time, a misguided few sought to steal those energies..."
G["The creature approachessss! Arm yourssselvesss!"]="A criatura ssse aproxima! Alarme!"
G["The creature is gaining power from the ancestral Grimtotem!  We must put them to rest if we are to defeat this beast!"]="Esta criatura está obtendo poder dos ancestrais Totem Sinistro! Devemos acabar com eles se queremos derrotar à fera!"
G["The creature's shell is glinting with light."]="The creature's shell is glinting with light."
G["The creatures in Winterspring are a good place ta start.\n\nHoweva', der may also be other places you can look..."]="The creatures in Winterspring are a good place ta start.\n\nHoweva', der may also be other places you can look..."
G["The creatures of this place are strong, wayfarer. You'll need ample ammunition if you hope to survive. You're in luck - I am well-stocked with fine arrows, bullets, and throwing weapons. The price is reasonable, considering circumstances."]="The creatures of this place are strong, wayfarer. You'll need ample ammunition if you hope to survive. You're in luck - I am well-stocked with fine arrows, bullets, and throwing weapons. The price is reasonable, considering circumstances."
G["The crew's lookin' a touch low on fuel. There anything safe to eat in these parts?"]="The crew's lookin' a touch low on fuel. There anything safe to eat in these parts?"
G["The crewman is choking!"]="O tripulante se você está asfixiando!"
G["The crewman is choking! Vitals are dropping!"]="The crewman is choking! Vitals are dropping!"
G["The crimson what? Never heard of it..."]="O que carmesim? Não o ouvi nunca..."
G["The crocolisks of Narsong Trench ate fish. They were fat and happy."]="The crocolisks of Narsong Trench ate fish. They were fat and happy."
G["The crossbow can be learned from Woo Ping, the human weapon master at Weller's Arsenal in Stormwind, Handiir, the draenei weapon master found in the Trader's Tier within the Exodar, or Bixi Wobblebonk, the gnome weapon master within the Timberline Arms in Ironforge."]="A besta pode ser aprendida com Woo Ping, o mestre de armas humanas no Weller's Arsenal em Ventobravo, Handiir, o mestre de armas draenei encontrado no Nível do Negociador dentro do Exodar, ou Bixi Wobblebonk, o mestre de armas gnomo no Timberline Arms em Ironforge."
G["The crossroads are not far. Let us seek out our last member there."]="The crossroads are not far. Let us seek out our last member there."
G["The crowd cheers."]="The crowd cheers."
G["The crowd clamours."]="The crowd clamours."
G["The crowd gasps in horror."]="The crowd gasps in horror."
G["The crowd gasps."]="The crowd gasps."
G["The crown I have given you will be as your third eye. It will tie us together. I will see what you see. Together we will lay the secrets of the Titans bare."]="A coroa que dei a você é como um terceiro olho. Estaremos vinculados. Eu verei o que você vê. Juntos, nós desvendaremos os segredos dos titãs."
G["The crucible looks abandoned and powerless.\nPerhaps there is a place nearby where you can attune yourself to the Battlemaiden..."]="The crucible looks abandoned and powerless.\nPerhaps there is a place nearby where you can attune yourself to the Battlemaiden..."
G["The cruel sayaadi temptresses exemplify the subtler side of the Legion's nihilistic Crusade."]="The cruel sayaadi temptresses exemplify the subtler side of the Legion's nihilistic Crusade."
G["The crystal can still be found... if we can just find it again..."]="Ainda se você pode encontrar o cristal... se é O que podemos dar com ele novamente..."
G["The crystal foci?  Of course we'll explain it seeing as you only have half the brain power to figure it out.\n\nA depleted crystal focus can be combined with ten apexis shards in a simple process, which creates a charged crystal focus.  These charged foci have some healing properties, but more important is their use with a possessed demon.\n\nYou see, the charged focus can be used to enable a possessed demon to exhibit special powers.  After a time, Gahk will have a mission for you to do just that."]="The crystal foci?  Of course we'll explain it seeing as you only have half the brain power to figure it out.\n\nA depleted crystal focus can be combined with ten apexis shards in a simple process, which creates a charged crystal focus.  These charged foci have some healing properties, but more important is their use with a possessed demon.\n\nYou see, the charged focus can be used to enable a possessed demon to exhibit special powers.  After a time, Gahk will have a mission for you to do just that."
G["The crystal foci?  Of course we'll explain it seeing as you only have half the brain power to figure it out.\n\nA depleted crystal focus can be combined with ten apexis shards in a simple process, which creates a charged crystal focus.  These charged foci have some healing properties, but more important is their use with a possessed demon.\n\nYou see, the charged focus can be used to enable a possessed demon to exhibit special powers.  If you have a darkrune, Gahk will speak to you about that."]="The crystal foci?  Of course we'll explain it seeing as you only have half the brain power to figure it out.\n\nA depleted crystal focus can be combined with ten apexis shards in a simple process, which creates a charged crystal focus.  These charged foci have some healing properties, but more important is their use with a possessed demon.\n\nYou see, the charged focus can be used to enable a possessed demon to exhibit special powers.  If you have a darkrune, Gahk will speak to you about that."
G["The crystal has granted you new abilities! Use them to defeat the summoned elementals."]="O cristal você proporcionado novas habilidades! Utilízalas para derrotar aos elementais evocados."
G["The crystal has returned. You must leave..."]="The crystal has returned. You must leave..."
G["The crystal is covered in intricate glyphs and runes. You can't make sense of any of it."]="The crystal is covered in intricate glyphs and runes. You can't make sense of any of it."
G["The crystal prison begins to shatter!"]="A prisão de cristal começa a se fingir pedaços!"
G["The crystal pulses faintly.  Its protective energy has grown weak but is not entirely depleted."]="The crystal pulses faintly.  Its protective energy has grown weak but is not entirely depleted."
G["The crystal wards... I must feed!"]="The crystal wards... I must feed!"
G["The crystal will save us! We can be saved!"]="O cristal nos salvará! Podemos ser salvados!"
G["The crystals have enlightened us brothers.  But we must still be on guard."]="The crystals have enlightened us brothers.  But we must still be on guard."
G["The crystals sing a sweeter song when $n is around."]="Os cristais cantam uma canto mais doce quando $n está perto."
G["The cub bats one paw at a tiny insect, only taking note of your attention when the plaything flies away."]="O filhote abate um pequeno inseto com o seu garra, e somente se da conta de que está prestando atenção quando seu brinquedo se aleja voando."
G["The cub nuzzles your hand and purrs."]="The cub nuzzles your hand and purrs."
G["The cub sniffs your hand and decides you're not a threat... this time."]="The cub sniffs your hand and decides you're not a threat... this time."
G["The cub tilts its head and looks at you expectantly. Shouldn't you know what to do, $g dad:mom;?"]="The cub tilts its head and looks at you expectantly. Shouldn't you know what to do, $g dad:mom;?"
G["The cult is upon us! We need help in the Respite Chambers!"]="A secta se nos dê acima! Precisamos ajuda na Câmera do Descanso!"
G["The cult must have someone in the city to coordinate this kind of attack. That only leaves one suspect, Ambassador Slaghammer!"]="The cult must have someone in the city to coordinate this kind of attack. That only leaves one suspect, Ambassador Slaghammer!"
G["The cultist practically sputters."]="O cultor está que dê chispas."
G["The cultists have not stopped their attacks. Spread the word: double the guard and arrest anyone suspicious. These orders come from the warchief himself!"]="The cultists have not stopped their attacks. Spread the word: double the guard and arrest anyone suspicious. These orders come from the warchief himself!"
G["The cunning, powerful eredar warlocks were once our noble kinsmen."]="The cunning, powerful eredar warlocks were once our noble kinsmen."
G["The cupcakes look delicious!"]="Os pastelitos têm uma pinta deliciosa!"
G["The curing cantrip has failed. Unfortunately, the introduction of the serum into this beast's blood stream will soon end its life."]="The curing cantrip has failed. Unfortunately, the introduction of the serum into this beast's blood stream will soon end its life."
G["The current situation looks like this: we're holding what we can while those with more experience and better equipment are moving against Prince Kael'thas."]="A situação atual é a seguinte: nós resistimos na medida do possível, enquanto que aqueles com mais experiência e melhor equipamento atacando ao príncipe Kael'thas."
G["The currents bow to me!"]="The currents bow to me!"
G["The curse ends!"]="A maldição termina!"
G["The curse is lifted!"]="The curse is lifted!"
G["The curse remains intact. We'll have to find another way."]="A maldição permanece intacta. Teremos que procurar outra forma."
G["The cycle begins again! Go'el has become living stone! We must pursue him within the caverns of Deepholm.\n\nSeeing as how the Earthen Ring just saved her kingdom, Therazane should be more than willing to help us in saving him. If not, the Stonemother will answer to me!"]="The cycle begins again! Go'el has become living stone! We must pursue him within the caverns of Deepholm.\n\nSeeing as how the Earthen Ring just saved her kingdom, Therazane should be more than willing to help us in saving him. If not, the Stonemother will answer to me!"
G["The cycle continues."]="O ciclo continua."
G["The cycle continues..."]="O ciclo continue..."
G["The cycle is complete."]="O ciclo está completo."
G["The cycle must continue, the Jade Serpent must be reborn!"]="The cycle must continue, the Jade Serpent must be reborn!"
G["The cycle of bloodshed is unending... Is there nothing I can do?"]="O ciclo de derramamento de sangue é interminável... Não há nada que possa fazer?"
G["The cycle of time brings an end to all things."]="O ciclo temporário é preciso todas as coisas cheguem ao seu fim."
G["The cypher is powering mechanisms deep within the temple!"]="A importante está activando mecanismos nas profundezas do templo!"
G["The damn spiders, the endlessly screeching bats, and those blasted demon beasts have all taken residence in the Servant's Quarters. It's not safe to walk around anymore, especially when the big ones come out of hiding."]="As malditas aranhas, os morcegos que gritam incessantemente e aquelas malditas bestas demoníacas tomaram residência nos aposentos dos servos. Não é mais certo andar por aí, principalmente quando os grandes saem do esconderijo."
G["The damned demonstrate their superiority once more."]="Os malditos demonstram sua superioridade mais uma vez."
G["The dark ashes swirl around %s, who utters an incantation:"]="The dark ashes swirl around %s, who utters an incantation:"
G["The dark lord laughs at you!"]="O senhor sombrio se ri de vocês!"
G["The dark ones had taken a hold of me, master. You were merciful in seeking my death. Forgive me..."]="Os obscuros me têm capturou, mestre. Foi clemente ao procurar meu morte. Perdóname..."
G["The dark void awaits you!"]="Te espera um abismo de escuridão!"
G["The darkest days are still ahead!"]="Os dias mais obscuros estão por chegar!"
G["The darkness beneath Tirisfal will consume us all..."]="A escuridão que se esconde debaixo de Tirisfal nos consumirá a todos..."
G["The darkness came from deep within the earth. Still, it hungers..."]="The darkness came from deep within the earth. Still, it hungers..."
G["The darkness clears..."]="A escuridão se dissipa..."
G["The darkness closes in...my vision is clouded..."]="The darkness closes in...my vision is clouded..."
G["The darkness comes for you, and with it, death."]="A escuridão vem a por vocês... e com ela, a morte!"
G["The darkness comes."]="The darkness comes."
G["The darkness does not embrace you, $c.  Cease your prattle and remove yourself from my sight!  Be gone!"]="The darkness does not embrace you, $c.  Cease your prattle and remove yourself from my sight!  Be gone!"
G["The darkness in my soul screams for release!"]="A escuridão de minha alma pida gritos que a libere!"
G["The darkness in your souls draws you ever closer..."]="A escuridão que jaz nas suas almas os aproxima ainda mais..."
G["The darkness is closing in!  I will not go without a fight, monster!"]="A escuridão se aproxima! Não me irei sem lutar, monstro!"
G["The darkness surrounds you, the light of Elune is your only salvation."]="A escuridão os perto, a Luz de Eluna é sua única salvação."
G["The darkness will consume all... all the living..."]="A escuridão consumirá a todos... todos os vivos..."
G["The darkness... surrounds me!"]="A escuridão... me perto!"
G["The darkness... the corruption... they came too quickly for anyone to know..."]="The darkness... the corruption... they came too quickly for anyone to know..."
G["The darkweaver metamorphizes into something terrible and demonic."]="O tejeoscuro se transforma em algo terrível e demoníaco."
G["The darkweaver pierces you with an evil grin as he shifts into an entirely different form."]="The darkweaver pierces you with an evil grin as he shifts into an entirely different form."
G["The darkweaver pierces you with an evil grin as she shifts into an entirely different form."]="The darkweaver pierces you with an evil grin as she shifts into an entirely different form."
G["The darned thing just started working! This should take you right up to the end of the concourse, where you last fought the Flame Leviathan."]="The darned thing just started working! This should take you right up to the end of the concourse, where you last fought the Flame Leviathan."
G["The data stored in this repository does indeed correlate with your astute proclamation.\n\nThe dwarf maintains an affinity for the stone composition of Azeroth, but due to the high-stress environmental anomaly within the Earthen's synthesis matrix, the dwarf reverts to a default biomass composition as seen in the standard subterranean matrix.\n\nErgo, the dwarf variant does synthesize from the degeneration of the Earthen creation matrix, as you inferred with your query."]="The data stored in this repository does indeed correlate with your astute proclamation.\n\nThe dwarf maintains an affinity for the stone composition of Azeroth, but due to the high-stress environmental anomaly within the Earthen's synthesis matrix, the dwarf reverts to a default biomass composition as seen in the standard subterranean matrix.\n\nErgo, the dwarf variant does synthesize from the degeneration of the Earthen creation matrix, as you inferred with your query."
G["The dawning comes, Stoutmantle, and with it comes your end."]="The dawning comes, Stoutmantle, and with it comes your end."
G["The day is mine. Well fought."]="A vitória é minha. Boa luta."
G["The day is ours! And not a drop of blood was shed on holy ground."]="A vitória é nossa! E sem derramar uma gota de sangue em sozinho sagrado."
G["The day is ours."]="A vitória é nossa."
G["The day of judgement has come, fiend!  I challenge you to battle!"]="O dia do julgamento chegou, demônio! Eu desafio você a lutar!"
G["The day of reckoning draws near. Aberrations like you will be destroyed..."]="O dia do juízo se aproxima. As aberrações como você serão destruidas..."
G["The day that Deathwing came, blood rained from the skies."]="The day that Deathwing came, blood rained from the skies."
G["The days pass quickly when I am busy.\n\nI must remind myself to stop and enjoy the moment."]="The days pass quickly when I am busy.\n\nI must remind myself to stop and enjoy the moment."
G["The days we've spent here in Azshara are not among our best and most glorious, but we are still young and blood still courses through our veins--we shall find victory here. It is only a matter of time."]="Os dias que passamos aqui em Azshara não estão entre os nossos melhores e mais gloriosos, mas ainda somos jovens e o sangue ainda corre em nossas veias - encontraremos vitória aqui. É apenas uma questão de tempo."
G["The dead are not supposed to speak. Now be silent!"]="Se significa que os mortos não falam. Agora, silêncio!"
G["The dead cry for solace. Their anguish echoes on the wind."]="Os mortos choram por consolo. A angústia deles ecoa no vento."
G["The dead do not belong in this realm.\n\nWhy, then, do we continually seek them out after putting them to rest?"]="The dead do not belong in this realm.\n\nWhy, then, do we continually seek them out after putting them to rest?"
G["The dead rise and seek vengeance on any that dare pass through their domain. Turn back!"]="The dead rise and seek vengeance on any that dare pass through their domain. Turn back!"
G["The dead rise from our very own crypt!"]="Os mortos ressuscitam da nossa própria cripta!"
G["The dead rise... Undead, from the frozen northlands. Whole cities have gone missing. I..."]="The dead rise... Undead, from the frozen northlands. Whole cities have gone missing. I..."
G["The dead shall have their day yet."]="Os mortos ainda terão o seu dia."
G["The dead walk among us!"]="A morte está entre nós!"
G["The death knight... he's mad!"]="O cavaleiro da Morte... está louco!"
G["The death of an Explosive Hatred should destroy his shield! Quickly!"]="A morte de um ódio explosivo deveria destruir seu escudo. Rápido!"
G["The death of our flesh marked the birth of our spirit and our sacred task."]="A morte de nossa carne marcou o nascimento de nosso espírito e nossa tarefa sagrada."
G["The death of the High Inquisitor of New Avalon will not go unnoticed. You need to get out of here at once! Go, before more of them show up. I'll be fine on my own."]="The death of the High Inquisitor of New Avalon will not go unnoticed. You need to get out of here at once! Go, before more of them show up. I'll be fine on my own."
G["The death of this land ends with your life!"]="A morte desta terra terminará ao lado com o seu vida!"
G["The deck is ruined.  Pick up another mop and try again."]="The deck is ruined.  Pick up another mop and try again."
G["The decomposition of the planet and its living organisms into base elements: metals, rocks, gases. This is followed by a period of reconstitution of each element into the original planetary blueprint."]="The decomposition of the planet and its living organisms into base elements: metals, rocks, gases. This is followed by a period of reconstitution of each element into the original planetary blueprint."
G["The deed is done! The Magistrate is dead-- to the shadows, my brethren."]="O têm feito! O magistrado está morto. Id às trevas, meus irmãos."
G["The deed is done.  The totem is made."]="The deed is done.  The totem is made."
G["The deeds are mine, brother! Soon you shall be out of my way for good!"]="As escritura são minhas, irmão! Pronto estará fosse de meu caminho para sempre!"
G["The deeds of your $r servant defy $g his:her; stature, Stormlord. $g His:Her; efforts have succeeded in softening the hearts of my people."]="The deeds of your $r servant defy $g his:her; stature, Stormlord. $g His:Her; efforts have succeeded in softening the hearts of my people."
G["The defection of Voren'thal and his followers was the largest loss ever incurred by Kael's forces. And these weren't just any blood elves.  Many of the best and brightest amongst Kael's scholars and magisters had been swayed by Voren'thal's influence."]="The defection of Voren'thal and his followers was the largest loss ever incurred by Kael's forces. And these weren't just any blood elves.  Many of the best and brightest amongst Kael's scholars and magisters had been swayed by Voren'thal's influence."
G["The defenders of the temple are hold strong on the ground, while the Order of the Cloud Serpent fights from above. Working together, we will dispel the sha from our home."]="The defenders of the temple are hold strong on the ground, while the Order of the Cloud Serpent fights from above. Working together, we will dispel the sha from our home."
G["The defense of Stoneplow is more important than you may know.\n\nIf the mantid take Stoneplow, they may as well take this entire valley. Beyond this wall, there is nothing to stop them from sweeping through the entirety of Pandaria."]="The defense of Stoneplow is more important than you may know.\n\nIf the mantid take Stoneplow, they may as well take this entire valley. Beyond this wall, there is nothing to stop them from sweeping through the entirety of Pandaria."
G["The defilement of this sacred resting place comes to an end now!"]="A profanação deste sagrado lugar de descanso termina agora!"
G["The delights of death await you."]="The delights of death await you."
G["The demon is loose!  Quickly we must restrain him!"]="O demônio está suelto! Rápido, temos que cogerle!"
G["The demon's fire has burnt out in my veins. I have... freed myself."]="The demon's fire has burnt out in my veins. I have... freed myself."
G["The demons are no longer attacking... what happened here?!"]="Os demônios já não atacando... que tem passado aqui?!"
G["The demons are no longer pouring from the palace. We can move ahead."]="The demons are no longer pouring from the palace. We can move ahead."
G["The demons in D-Block have been giving us trouble since we got here.  Can you help us out?"]="Os demônios do Bloque D levam poniéndonos as coisas difíceis desde que chegaram aqui. Pode nos ajudar?"
G["The demons should all be leaving. We will be at the palace in no time."]="The demons should all be leaving. We will be at the palace in no time."
G["The demons should be in no doubt that we are their nemesis and, though they wish our destruction, it is we who will bring about their ruin.  Kazzak and his forces will be diminished and defeated by this coalition.  And to do this, we must throw at them our bodies and hearts, for they seek no less than the obliteration of this world."]="The demons should be in no doubt that we are their nemesis and, though they wish our destruction, it is we who will bring about their ruin.  Kazzak and his forces will be diminished and defeated by this coalition.  And to do this, we must throw at them our bodies and hearts, for they seek no less than the obliteration of this world."
G["The demons, our old foes from eons passed, once again show their beastly visage.  But do not falter, for fear is one of their many weapons.  And a weapon most deadly it is."]="The demons, our old foes from eons passed, once again show their beastly visage.  But do not falter, for fear is one of their many weapons.  And a weapon most deadly it is."
G["The depths consume you!"]="The depths consume you!"
G["The depths will consume you!"]="The depths will consume you!"
G["The deserter...\n\nWhat do you want, $c?  We are busy defending our camp and don't have time for cowards.\n\nSpeak to me when my temper subsides."]="The deserter...\n\nWhat do you want, $c?  We are busy defending our camp and don't have time for cowards.\n\nSpeak to me when my temper subsides."
G["The desperate Klaxxi have resorted to digging up fossils. Very well: let us finish this."]="The desperate Klaxxi have resorted to digging up fossils. Very well: let us finish this."
G["The destruction of Dalaran is inevitable!"]="A destruição de Dalaran é inevitável!"
G["The details of the posting call for the execution of an enormous wolf.  She apparently keeps her den to the south of the Jagged Ridge, near the Horde stronghold."]="Os detalhes da postagem pedem a execução de um enorme lobo. Aparentemente, ela mantém seu esconderijo ao sul do Cume Jagged, perto da fortaleza da Horda."
G["The device indicates you are very close to the anomaly."]="O dispositivo indica que está muito perto da anomalia."
G["The dice do not lie!"]="Os dados não mienten!"
G["The dig site is just north of here."]="A escavação está ao norte de aqui."
G["The dimensional barrier is broken! TAKE THEM NOW! FOR THE BANSHEE QUEEN!"]="A barrera dimensional se tem front! A POR ELES! pela RAINHA ALMA EM PENA!"
G["The dirge of Karabor howls to the heavens."]="The dirge of Karabor howls to the heavens."
G["The dirge of Karabor returns to the elements."]="O canto fúnebre de Karabor volta aos elementos."
G["The discharged electricity has manifested itself as an elemental!"]="The discharged electricity has manifested itself as an elemental!"
G["The disease has been cured and you feel normal again!"]="A doença se tem curado e te vuelves a sentir normal!"
G["The dishes that Alegorn whips up are to die for.  He's always busy preparing new delicacies over in the Craftsman's Terrace.  Be sure to try his Cenarion Green recipe if he has any left.  \nNow, if you don't mind, I must investigate this rash of missing deer."]="The dishes that Alegorn whips up are to die for.  He's always busy preparing new delicacies over in the Craftsman's Terrace.  Be sure to try his Cenarion Green recipe if he has any left.  \nNow, if you don't mind, I must investigate this rash of missing deer."
G["The dishonor of failure in combat is eternal."]="The dishonor of failure in combat is eternal."
G["The disruptor towers over charged the crystalforge, and uncovered more secrets!  Hold them!  Hold them while we gather new data!"]="The disruptor towers over charged the crystalforge, and uncovered more secrets!  Hold them!  Hold them while we gather new data!"
G["The dissension within the Council of Three Hammers must come to an end."]="The dissension within the Council of Three Hammers must come to an end."
G["The disturbances in the tomb, they must be involved. Look around you, $n. Do you see them?"]="As alterações na tumba... eles têm que estar involucrados. Olhe ao redor, $n. Os vê?"
G["The doctor entrusted me with the plans to Nergeld, our flesh giant amalgamation made entirely of vargul! It will be the most powerful creation of its kind and a whole legion of them will be created to destroy your pitiful forces!"]="The doctor entrusted me with the plans to Nergeld, our flesh giant amalgamation made entirely of vargul! It will be the most powerful creation of its kind and a whole legion of them will be created to destroy your pitiful forces!"
G["The doctor is in!"]="O doutor chegou!"
G["The doctor is out..."]="O doutor está fosse..."
G["The doctor is... IN!"]="O médico está... DISPONÍVEL!"
G["The dog stares blankly at the wall..."]="The dog stares blankly at the wall..."
G["The dog tilts its head, as if wondering what you're thinking."]="The dog tilts its head, as if wondering what you're thinking."
G["The dog wags its tail happily."]="The dog wags its tail happily."
G["The dog wags its tail happily. It heads toward your farm!"]="O cão move a cauda com alegria. Se dirige ao seu fazenda!"
G["The door barring the North Tower has been breached!"]="A porta da torre norte está aberta!"
G["The door barring the South Tower has been breached!"]="A porta da torre sul está aberta!"
G["The door is open, Kharan. You are a free man."]="A porta está aberta, Kharan. Você é um homem livre."
G["The door mechanism seems to have activated with the demise of the guardians. I fear what we may find within."]="Parece que a morte dos guardiões tem ativado o mecanismo da porta. Não quero pensar no que haverá dentro."
G["The door seal is about to collapse! All is lost if the Blue Dragonflight breaks through the door!"]="The door seal is about to collapse! All is lost if the Blue Dragonflight breaks through the door!"
G["The door to The Den of Mortal Delights has opened."]="A porta do covil das delicias mortais abriu."
G["The dormant vrykul keels over."]="O vrykul em hibernação se cai."
G["The draenei champion walks among us. This is a celebration for the savior of Azuremyst and Bloodmyst!"]="O campeão draenei caminha entre nós. Esta é uma celebração para o salvador de Azuremyst e Bloodmyst!"
G["The draenei grand master jewelcrafter, Hamanar, may be found among his people on the Aldor Rise."]="O draenei grão-mestre de joalheria, Hamanar, pode ser encontrado entre seu povo na Ascensão Aldor."
G["The draenei of the Exodar cheer for $n."]="The draenei of the Exodar cheer for $n."
G["The draenei... it's almost too much to believe. But if they follow the Light, they can't be that bad."]="The draenei... it's almost too much to believe. But if they follow the Light, they can't be that bad."
G["The drafts of fresh air that blow from Eversong from time to time really upset my stomach, if you know what I mean."]="As correntes de ar fresco que sopram de Eversong de tempos em tempos mesmo perturbam meu estômago, se é que você me entende."
G["The drag master escapes from the outhouse and gestures wildly up at the speedbarge."]="The drag master escapes from the outhouse and gestures wildly up at the speedbarge."
G["The dragon hides behind a royal facade. The tablets will reveal her for what she is... If what I have seen holds true, I will not survive this battle, friend. It is you that must finish what I have started. Are your forces ready? Are you ready? We will begin on your command."]="O dragão se esconde atrás de uma fachada real. As tábuas a revelarão como ela é... Se o que eu vi for verdadeiro, não vou sobreviver a essa batalha, amigo. É você quem deve terminar o que eu comecei. Suas forças estão prontas? Você está pronto? Começaremos sob seu envio."
G["The dragon is stronger than you, hero! Do not let him finish his attacks!"]="O dragão é mais forte que você! Não deixe que complete seus ataque!"
G["The dragon you're looking for goes by the name \"Creed.\""]="O dragão que atenção, responde ao nome de \"Creed\"."
G["The dragonflight will... devour you."]="O Voo te... devorará."
G["The dragons have bought us an opportunity to seize the gates from the Twilight's Hammer. We would do well not to waste it."]="The dragons have bought us an opportunity to seize the gates from the Twilight's Hammer. We would do well not to waste it."
G["The dragons have bought us an opportunity to sieze the gates from the Twilight's Hammer. We would do well not to waste it."]="Os dragões nos deram a oportunidade de pegar os portões do Martelo do Crepúsculo. Faríamos bem em não desperdiçá-o."
G["The drake under you is mortally wounded and about to fall! Move to another drake, quickly!\n|TInterface\\Icons\\inv_misc_hook_01.blp:32|t"]="The drake under you is mortally wounded and about to fall! Move to another drake, quickly!\n|TInterface\\Icons\\inv_misc_hook_01.blp:32|t"
G["The dreadlord who commands this undead army is called Tichondrius.  He controls a powerful warlock artifact called the Skull of Gul'dan.  It is responsible for corrupting these forests."]="O Senhor do Terror que lidera este exército de não-mortos se chama Tichondrius. Controla um poderoso artefato bruxo chamado Caveira de Gul'dan. É o responsável da corrupção de estes florestas."
G["The dreadlord who commands this undead army is called Tichondrius. He commands a powerful warlock artifact called the Skull of Gul'dan."]="O Senhor do Terror que lidera este exército de não-mortos se chama Tichondrius. Controla um poderoso artefato bruxo chamado Caveira de Gul'dan."
G["The dream brew that you sampled earlier can expand your consciousness and show you events transpiring around the land. I will teach you how to use it properly, and we will find your prince!\n\nBut first, help me to create a fresh batch."]="The dream brew that you sampled earlier can expand your consciousness and show you events transpiring around the land. I will teach you how to use it properly, and we will find your prince!\n\nBut first, help me to create a fresh batch."
G["The drink in the kegs is divine.  Drink up, $c!"]="A bebida dos barris é divina. Bebe, $c!"
G["The drowned god's heart is black ice."]="The drowned god's heart is black ice."
G["The druid, Kal, often spends his time at the moonwell in Dolanaar.  I am certain he would be able to provide you with the training you require."]="O druida, Kal, costuma passar o tempo no poço da lua em Dolanaar. Estou certo de que ele seria capaz de fornecer o treinamento necessário."
G["The druids and sentinels prefer to keep separate company, but we have always worked well together.\n\nNever mistake privacy for aversion."]="Os druidas e as sentinelas preferimos viver por separado, mas sempre temos trabalhado bem juntos.\n\nNunca confundas a intimidade com a animadversão."
G["The druids are holding a great celebration of Lunar Festival in Moonglade. If that's too far to walk, they're transporting people from the big cities."]="Os druidas estão realizando uma grande celebração do Festival Lunar em Moonglade. Se é muito longe para andar, eles estão transportando pessoas das grandes cidades."
G["The druids of Azeroth hold a great celebration in the Moonglade. If you find the lunar festival revelers in the city, they can transport you there."]="Os druidas de Azeroth realizam uma grande banquete no Moonglade. Se você encontrar os foliões do festival lunar na cidade, eles podem transportá-o até lá."
G["The druids of DEHTA support your efforts here in Hyjal."]="Os druidas de D. E. H. T. A. apoiam seus esforços em Monte Hyjal."
G["The druids of Nighthaven are holding a great celebration in Moonglade for the Lunar Festival."]="The druids of Nighthaven are holding a great celebration in Moonglade for the Lunar Festival."
G["The druids protect me from the naga and evil Lost Ones.  In exchange, I teach them about the plants and animals of the marsh."]="Os druidas me protegem das nagas e dos Mal Perdidos. Em troca, eu os ensino sobre as plantas e os animais do pântano."
G["The druids say that it is only a matter of time until nature itself drives the Horde from Kalimdor. Yet corruption continues to spread throughout our lands, even here on Teldrassil."]="Os druidas dizem que é apenas uma questão de tempo até que a própria natureza expulse a Horda de Kalimdor. No entanto, a corrupção continua a se espalhar por nossas terras, mesmo aqui em Teldrassil."
G["The duel will begin in..."]="O duelo começará em..."
G["The dumb boys think this is a good hiding place."]="Os crianças tonto acreditam que este é um bom lugar para esconder."
G["The duty of a clan mother is to listen. To listen to the wind and the water and the fire and the earth. To gather information for her clan in the way others gather furs to stay warm. It is the spirits that I commune with... In my dreams, Mother Kashur speaks to me like the spirits that spoke to her once... When I pass, I will speak to Drakia and Celestine in this manner.\n\n<Greatmother Geyah smiles.>"]="The duty of a clan mother is to listen. To listen to the wind and the water and the fire and the earth. To gather information for her clan in the way others gather furs to stay warm. It is the spirits that I commune with... In my dreams, Mother Kashur speaks to me like the spirits that spoke to her once... When I pass, I will speak to Drakia and Celestine in this manner.\n\n<Greatmother Geyah smiles.>"
G["The dwarf appears to have been discovered and slain in the midst of a spy mission. The Deathforge's attendants have left the corpse in the open, perhaps as a warning to other would-be interlopers."]="O anão parece ter sido descoberto e morto no meio de uma missão de espionagem. Os assistentes da Forja da Morte deixaram o cadáver em aberto, talvez como um aviso para outros possíveis intrusos."
G["The dwarf barreled forward with a sound like rolling thunder and hurled a shining metal hammer, lightning coursing over its surface, directly into the jormungar's throat."]="The dwarf barreled forward with a sound like rolling thunder and hurled a shining metal hammer, lightning coursing over its surface, directly into the jormungar's throat."
G["The dwarf belongs to our kind now!  Not yours!"]="The dwarf belongs to our kind now!  Not yours!"
G["The dwarf coughs, sputters, and shivers in the cage."]="The dwarf coughs, sputters, and shivers in the cage."
G["The dwarf seemed lost, having no memory of where he came from, or even of his own name. Not being the kind to leave a dwarven cousin to die in the snow, my father's party took him in and continued back towards Frosthold."]="The dwarf seemed lost, having no memory of where he came from, or even of his own name. Not being the kind to leave a dwarven cousin to die in the snow, my father's party took him in and continued back towards Frosthold."
G["The dwarf speaks the truth.  If you wish to commune with the elements you must do so from the heart."]="The dwarf speaks the truth.  If you wish to commune with the elements you must do so from the heart."
G["The dwarven weapon master Buliwyf can train you in both one and two-handed axes. He's found in the Timberline Arms in Ironforge."]="O mestre de armas dos anões Buliwyf pode treiná-o nos eixos de uma e duas mãos. Ele foi encontrado no Timberline Arms em Ironforge."
G["The dwarves all burst out in laughter."]="The dwarves all burst out in laughter."
G["The dwarves have kept us safe in their home for some time now, and for that we thank them.  However, the traitorous Thermaplugg's occupation of our home must at last come to an end.\n\nGnomeregan has festered beneath the atomic weight of our ill-conceived plan for too long. The detonation of the radiation bombs drove us from our city, but we now possess the technology to take it back!\n\nWe will regain what is ours... and bring Thermaplugg to justice!"]="The dwarves have kept us safe in their home for some time now, and for that we thank them.  However, the traitorous Thermaplugg's occupation of our home must at last come to an end.\n\nGnomeregan has festered beneath the atomic weight of our ill-conceived plan for too long. The detonation of the radiation bombs drove us from our city, but we now possess the technology to take it back!\n\nWe will regain what is ours... and bring Thermaplugg to justice!"
G["The dwarves of Ironforge begin a cheer for $n."]="The dwarves of Ironforge begin a cheer for $n."
G["The eagle spirit of the Hinterlands be on our side now, $n.\n\nWith her idol free from the Vilebranch, I can transport you straight to it on the upper tier of Jintha'Alor. Strike at their hearts!"]="The eagle spirit of the Hinterlands be on our side now, $n.\n\nWith her idol free from the Vilebranch, I can transport you straight to it on the upper tier of Jintha'Alor. Strike at their hearts!"
G["The early bird gets the worm, but the patient pandaren receives a hearty brew."]="The early bird gets the worm, but the patient pandaren receives a hearty brew."
G["The earth TREMBLES!"]="The earth TREMBLES!"
G["The earth beneath our feet groans and shudders. Fire rains down from the sky. The air chokes away all life. This is truly the realm of the Fire Lord."]="A terra sob nossos pés geme e estremece. O fogo chove do céu. O ar afasta toda a vida. Este é verdadeiramente o reino do Senhor do Fogo."
G["The earth elementals have turned on us. Get onto the field and hold them back!"]="Os elementais de terra se têm rebelado contra nós. Vê ao campo de batalha e contenlos!"
G["The earth has come to claim you, cult!"]="The earth has come to claim you, cult!"
G["The earth has much to offer us, so long as we learn to take from it properly. I can teach you how, if you so wish."]="The earth has much to offer us, so long as we learn to take from it properly. I can teach you how, if you so wish."
G["The earth itself weeps in its suffering. Gather its tears, and use them to seal the portal at the Great Tree. The connection to the Dream must be cut."]="The earth itself weeps in its suffering. Gather its tears, and use them to seal the portal at the Great Tree. The connection to the Dream must be cut."
G["The earth keeps many secrets, $c; it is our duty to ensure that those that must remain a secret for the good of all stays as such."]="The earth keeps many secrets, $c; it is our duty to ensure that those that must remain a secret for the good of all stays as such."
G["The earth shall swallow you!"]="A terra te tragará!"
G["The earth spirits are very much present in this chamber, my child. After all, we are underground, are we not?"]="The earth spirits are very much present in this chamber, my child. After all, we are underground, are we not?"
G["The earth will devour you!"]="A terraos devorará!"
G["The earth will never falter!"]="A terra não me falhará!"
G["The easiest creature for you to summon is the imp. You should already be able to bring forth this minion but for completeness' sake I will start with him."]="The easiest creature for you to summon is the imp. You should already be able to bring forth this minion but for completeness' sake I will start with him."
G["The east gate of the Alliance keep has been destroyed!"]="A porta este da fortaleza da Aliança foi destruído."
G["The east gate of the Alliance keep has been destroyed."]="A porta este da fortaleza da Aliança foi destruído."
G["The east gate of the Horde keep has been destroyed!"]="A porta este da fortaleza da Horda foi destruído."
G["The east gate of the Horde keep has been destroyed."]="A porta este da fortaleza da Horda foi destruído."
G["The east."]="O leste."
G["The eastern bridge has been damaged!"]="The eastern bridge has been damaged!"
G["The eastern bridge has been destroyed!"]="eastern bridge"
G["The eastern mountains of Thousand Needles crumbled into the waters and the South Sea poured in. All is lost."]="The eastern mountains of Thousand Needles crumbled into the waters and the South Sea poured in. All is lost."
G["The eastern sewers entrance is just outside the entrance to Krasus' Landing."]="A entrada de esgotos do leste fica do lado de fosse da entrada de desembarque de Krasus."
G["The eastern tower has been damaged!"]="The eastern tower has been damaged!"
G["The eastern tower has been destroyed!"]="Têm destruído a torre este!"
G["The ebbs and flows of battle are to be expected."]="Toda batalha tem seus fluxos e refluxos."
G["The eclipse of Azeroths' moons is an occurrence that we of the blue dragonflight hold most sacred."]="The eclipse of Azeroths' moons is an occurrence that we of the blue dragonflight hold most sacred."
G["The egg appears resilient as an egg of the Black Dragonflight rightfully should.  Perhaps if you were to place a great many apexis shards next to it, their vibrations would cause it to crack open?"]="The egg appears resilient as an egg of the Black Dragonflight rightfully should.  Perhaps if you were to place a great many apexis shards next to it, their vibrations would cause it to crack open?"
G["The egg appears resilient as an egg of the Black Dragonflight rightfully should.  Perhaps if you were to place a great many apexis shards next to it, their vibrations would cause it to crack open?\n\nToo bad that you don't appear to have the thirty-five apexis shards necessary to do the job."]="The egg appears resilient as an egg of the Black Dragonflight rightfully should.  Perhaps if you were to place a great many apexis shards next to it, their vibrations would cause it to crack open?\n\nToo bad that you don't appear to have the thirty-five apexis shards necessary to do the job."
G["The eggs in one of the lower nests begin to hatch!"]="The eggs in one of the lower nests begin to hatch!"
G["The eggs in one of the upper nests begin to hatch!"]="The eggs in one of the upper nests begin to hatch!"
G["The elder is right, we should find a diplomatic solution with the hozen."]="O ancestral tem razão; deveríamos encontrar uma solução diplomática ao conflito com os hozen."
G["The elder is very busy with important matters. Please come back at another time."]="O ancestral está muito ocupado com assuntos importantes. Volta em outro momentos."
G["The elders of my village taught me that wisdom flows through every river, and collects in every pond. I can't wait to learn what the waters of this place have to offer.\n\nThe elders of my village also taught me that one should never trust a hozen.\n\n<Ashyo shoots a wary glance over at Ken-Ken.>"]="The elders of my village taught me that wisdom flows through every river, and collects in every pond. I can't wait to learn what the waters of this place have to offer.\n\nThe elders of my village also taught me that one should never trust a hozen.\n\n<Ashyo shoots a wary glance over at Ken-Ken.>"
G["The elders were right; you really can't judge a book by it's cover."]="The elders were right; you really can't judge a book by it's cover."
G["The elders will hear of your kindness."]="Os ancestrais sabrán do seu bondade."
G["The element of air here is restless. Beware... they will not let you pass unharmed."]="O elemento do ar aqui é inquieto. Cuidado... eles não vão deixar você passar ileso."
G["The elemental forces are relentless. I fear we'll not be able to hold this breach forever. Not without more help."]="As forças elementares são implacáveis. Receio que não seremos capazes de manter essa ruptura para sempre. Não sem mais ajuda."
G["The elemental spirits are restless..."]="Os espíritos elementais estão inquietos..."
G["The elementals are clearly outnumbered."]="The elementals are clearly outnumbered."
G["The elementals are grossly outnumbered."]="The elementals are grossly outnumbered."
G["The elements are fickle and best left out of untrained hands.  My apologies, but I have no need for yours."]="Os elementos são inconstantes e melhor deixar de mãos não treinadas. Peço desculpas, mas não preciso das suas."
G["The elements are undying! Make use of your time before they rise again!"]="Os elementos são imortais. Aprovechao tempo antes de que regresen!"
G["The elements are with us in force, $n. With their help, we will do all that is in our power to stop Varimathras and Putress! LOK'TAR OGAR!"]="A força dos elementos está conosco, $n. Com a sua ajuda, faremos tudo o que estiver em nossas mãos para parar a Varimathras e a Putress. LOK'TAR OGAR!"
G["The elements chaotic and wild. Only through learnin' can we keep in touch wit' them and keep them controlled."]="The elements chaotic and wild. Only through learnin' can we keep in touch wit' them and keep them controlled."
G["The elements demand vengeance!"]="Os elementos piden vingança!"
G["The elements favor you.  What will you ask of them?"]="Os elementos favorecem você. O que você vai pedir a eles?"
G["The elements guide only true Primalists, $C. They do not hear your call."]="The elements guide only true Primalists, $C. They do not hear your call."
G["The elements in Azeroth are becoming more disturbed each passing day.  The key to this disturbance lies here, in Nagrand.  When Draenor was torn apart, all of the elemental planes were thrown into great turmoil and have never recovered.  The rifts here form naturally and are a sign of a severely damaged world.\n\nTo see this same kind of disruption on Azeroth is not just unnerving, it could be a precursor to a type of destruction the world has never seen before.\n\n$n, bring me any information you may find when walking around Outland.\n\nI must spend time with the elements here, researching a way to calm the elements again in Azeroth...before it's too late."]="The elements in Azeroth are becoming more disturbed each passing day.  The key to this disturbance lies here, in Nagrand.  When Draenor was torn apart, all of the elemental planes were thrown into great turmoil and have never recovered.  The rifts here form naturally and are a sign of a severely damaged world.\n\nTo see this same kind of disruption on Azeroth is not just unnerving, it could be a precursor to a type of destruction the world has never seen before.\n\n$n, bring me any information you may find when walking around Outland.\n\nI must spend time with the elements here, researching a way to calm the elements again in Azeroth...before it's too late."
G["The elements of the brew are too chaotic! I do not know what will happen if they combine now!"]="The elements of the brew are too chaotic! I do not know what will happen if they combine now!"
G["The elements shield me!"]="The elements shield me!"
G["The elements speak to us, $c.  They share knowledge that we must learn, and they share secrets that must be kept."]="The elements speak to us, $c.  They share knowledge that we must learn, and they share secrets that must be kept."
G["The elements themselves will rise up against the civilized world! Only the faithful will be spared!"]="The elements themselves will rise up against the civilized world! Only the faithful will be spared!"
G["The elements will crush you!"]="The elements will crush you!"
G["The elements will not die! Make use of your time before they rise again!"]="Os elementos são imortais. Aprovechao tempo antes de que regresen!"
G["The elements... what have we done..."]="Os elementos... Que temos feito?..."
G["The elixir... give it to me, Severin!"]="The elixir... give it to me, Severin!"
G["The elves speak of a moon goddess, did you know? They put great stock in the light given by the moon."]="The elves speak of a moon goddess, did you know? They put great stock in the light given by the moon."
G["The emperor is very near; fought doubt, hate, rage, despair, and fear."]="O Imperador está perto. Luchó contra a dúvida, o ódio, a raiva, a desesperação e o medo."
G["The emperor rules ALL!"]="O Imperador o domina tudo!"
G["The emperor will be most pleased when I present him with your head, Shado-Pan."]="The emperor will be most pleased when I present him with your head, Shado-Pan."
G["The empress I served was also frightened and paranoid. Ultimately it was her fear that lead to her demise."]="The empress I served was also frightened and paranoid. Ultimately it was her fear that lead to her demise."
G["The empress demands it!"]="A Imperatriz o ordena!"
G["The empress has spies everywhere."]="A Imperatriz tem espiã por todas partes."
G["The enchanter Sedana is currently accepting apprentices, I believe. You'll find her in one of the alcoves within the Court of the Sun."]="O encantador Sedana está atualmente aceitando aprendizes, acredito. Você a encontrará em uma das alcovas da Corte do Sol."
G["The end comes for you!"]="Este é seu fim!"
G["The end days are nigh!"]="Os dias finais estão chegando!"
G["The end draws nigh! Even as we speak our supplies are being shipped to Silithus and should arrive within $2113w days. Once there I am sure that all we be assembled in quick order, and then we'll be awaiting the ringing of the gong at the gates to Ahn'Qiraj to start the war. I look forward to analyzing whether our preparatory efforts will make a difference."]="The end draws nigh! Even as we speak our supplies are being shipped to Silithus and should arrive within $2113w days. Once there I am sure that all we be assembled in quick order, and then we'll be awaiting the ringing of the gong at the gates to Ahn'Qiraj to start the war. I look forward to analyzing whether our preparatory efforts will make a difference."
G["The end draws nigh! Even as we speak the last of our supplies are being shipped to Silithus and should arrive within a day. Once there I am sure that all we be assembled in quick order, and then we'll be awaiting the ringing of the gong at the gates to Ahn'Qiraj to start the war. I look forward to analyzing whether our preparatory efforts will make a difference."]="The end draws nigh! Even as we speak the last of our supplies are being shipped to Silithus and should arrive within a day. Once there I am sure that all we be assembled in quick order, and then we'll be awaiting the ringing of the gong at the gates to Ahn'Qiraj to start the war. I look forward to analyzing whether our preparatory efforts will make a difference."
G["The end has come!"]="O fim chegou!"
G["The end is at hand!"]="O fim está ao alcance da mão!"
G["The end is come!"]="The end is come!"
G["The end is here! The end is now!"]="O fim se aproxima! O fim é agora!"
G["The end is near, brothers!  This plague eats us from within!"]="O fim se aproxima, irmãos! Esta fedor nos devora desde dentro!"
G["The end is nigh!  The end is a new beginning!"]="O fim se aproxima! O fim é um novo início!"
G["The end is nigh! That Which Must Not Be Named is almost free!"]="The end is nigh! That Which Must Not Be Named is almost free!"
G["The end is now, Fordring."]="Este é o fim, Vadín."
G["The end is upon us!"]="The end is upon us!"
G["The end is upon you!"]="Sua hora chegou!"
G["The end is upon you."]="Chegou o fim."
G["The end is upon you.  Enter... oblivion."]="The end is upon you.  Enter... oblivion."
G["The end of Operaton: Gnomeregan meant a chance to rest for most people. However, my assistants and I have been caring for the wounded and for the survivors that the S.A.F.E. teams rescue from inside the city."]="O fim de Operaton: Gnomeregan significava uma chance de descansar para a maioria das pessoas. No entanto, meus assistentes e eu cuidamos dos feridos e dos sobreviventes que a S. A. F. E. equipes de resgate de dentro da cidade."
G["The end of Thermaplugg's reign draws near!"]="The end of Thermaplugg's reign draws near!"
G["The end of all approaches. The unmaking is at hand. (End of all! The curtain falls!) Do not fail me."]="The end of all approaches. The unmaking is at hand. (End of all! The curtain falls!) Do not fail me."
G["The end of all things is upon us!"]="O fim de todas as coisas se aproxima!"
G["The end of days is upon us! May the earth embrace my flesh and bones."]="The end of days is upon us! May the earth embrace my flesh and bones."
G["The end of our empire... is only the beginning..."]="O fim de nueh'tro império... é somente o início..."
G["The end of our world nears, my brothers and sisters! Azeroth will be no more!"]="The end of our world nears, my brothers and sisters! Azeroth will be no more!"
G["The end of the world approaches, but there is time to set things right, $c."]="The end of the world approaches, but there is time to set things right, $c."
G["The end of the world is at hand!"]="O fim do mundo está a ponto de chegar!"
G["The end of the world nears, $c. There is no need to despair. Hear what I say and what my brethren have to offer."]="The end of the world nears, $c. There is no need to despair. Hear what I say and what my brethren have to offer."
G["The end rapidly approaches! Surrender yourselves to Eranikus and be spared eternal suffering!"]="The end rapidly approaches! Surrender yourselves to Eranikus and be spared eternal suffering!"
G["The end, Dalfors. I'm thinking about how close we are to seeing an end to the Scourge."]="O fim, Dalfors. Achava no perto que estamos de ver o fim do Flagelo."
G["The endless might of the Jade Armies is mine to control!"]="O poder eterno do exército de jade me pertence!"
G["The endless waters will cleanse you from this place!"]="A água eternaos expulsará deste lugar!"
G["The enemies of the Light must be defeated!"]="Os inimigos da Luz devem ser derrotados!"
G["The enemy approaches from the south.  Ready your weapons!"]="The enemy approaches from the south.  Ready your weapons!"
G["The enemy approaches.  Use the Move ability to move the Ramkahen Champions to the southern ramp.\n\n|TInterface\\Icons\\misc_arrowleft.blp:64|t"]="O inimigo se aproxima. Usa a habilidade Mover para mover aos campeões Ramkahen à rampa do sul.\n\n|TInterface\\Icons\\misc_arrowleft.blp:64|t"
G["The enemy grows stronger! Aid me!"]="O inimigo é cada vez mais forte! Ajudem-me!"
G["The enemy has fought well, for Alliance...but they grow weary."]="The enemy has fought well, for Alliance...but they grow weary."
G["The enemy is among you!"]="O inimigo está entre vocês!"
G["The enemy is upon us!  Stand your ground!"]="The enemy is upon us!  Stand your ground!"
G["The enemy is upon us, stand ready!"]="Temos acima ao inimigo! Preparem-se!"
G["The enemy shall suffer greatly, master!"]="The enemy shall suffer greatly, master!"
G["The enemy will not get past us!"]="O inimigo não penetrará!"
G["The energy infused within my clutch is mine to reclaim!"]="The energy infused within my clutch is mine to reclaim!"
G["The energy; I can feel it!"]="The energy; I can feel it!"
G["The engine got too cold!\nAll pressure was lost."]="The engine got too cold!\nAll pressure was lost."
G["The engine got too hot!\nPressure was lost."]="The engine got too hot!\nPressure was lost."
G["The engine shifted properly!\nNice work!"]="O motor tem girado corretamente!\nBem feito!"
G["The engine's blown!  Fly Vic's Flying Machine back to Lakeside Landing!"]="O motor tem explodido! Leva a máquina voadora de Vic de volta à Pista do Lago!"
G["The engine's blown!  Fly Zak's Flying Machine back to K3!"]="O motor tem explodido! Leva a máquina voadora de Zak de volta a K3!"
G["The engineer here is called Franklin Lloyd. He tinkers in the Rogues' Quarter, on the outer ring."]="O engenheiro aqui é chamado Franklin Lloyd. Ele mexe no Bairro dos Ladinos, no anel externo."
G["The engines are back online! Full speed ahead! We can't let Deathwing escape!"]="Os motores voltam a funcionar! A toda máquina! Alamuerte não escapará!"
G["The enormous stone shimmers with focused arcane energy."]="A enorme rocha titila a causa de uma concentração de energia arcana."
G["The enormous stone shimmers with focused arcane energy.\n\nIf Andorel's instructions are to be believed, it should be easy to refocus the stone's energies."]="The enormous stone shimmers with focused arcane energy.\n\nIf Andorel's instructions are to be believed, it should be easy to refocus the stone's energies."
G["The entrance is barricaded. Break it down!"]="The entrance is barricaded. Break it down!"
G["The entrance is hidden here in Moonbrook.  Keep your eyes peeled for thieves.  They want me dead."]="The entrance is hidden here in Moonbrook.  Keep your eyes peeled for thieves.  They want me dead."
G["The entrance to Warsong Gulch stands before you. Will you fight the wretched Alliance there?"]="A entrada para Warsong Gulch está diante de você. Você vai lutar contra a miserável Aliança lá?"
G["The eons have awakened me."]="Os eones me têm despertado."
G["The ered'ruin have had no master since Archimonde's death. Now I shall be that master."]="Os Ered'ruin não tiveram nenhum mestre desde que Arquimonde se foi. Agora eu assumirei o comando."
G["The essence of Chi-Ji dissipates, leaving a scattered trail of stardust."]="A essência de Chi-Ji se dissipa, deixando somente um rastro de polvo de estrelas."
G["The essence of Niuzao rumbles in acceptance of your aid."]="A essência de Niuzao muge quando aceitar sua ajuda."
G["The essence of Tarecgosa is with you."]="A essência de Tarecgosa está com você."
G["The essence of Xuen roars triumphantly and disperses into celestial dust."]="A essência de Xuen ruge triunfalmente enquanto se dispersa em pó celestial."
G["The essence of Yu'lon smiles warmly at you as it fades into the sky."]="A essência de Yu'lon te sorri com amabilidade e desaparece no céu."
G["The esteemed Doctor Gustaf VanHowzen can train you further.  He can be found in Theramore treating the wounded at the barracks."]="O estimado Doutor Gustaf VanHowzen pode treiná-o ainda mais. Ele pode ser encontrado em Theramore, tratando os feridos no quartel."
G["The eternal fire will never be extinguished."]="O fogo eterno nunca se apagará."
G["The ethereals set up shop in the upstairs corridor to the right as you enter the main building.\n\nI will mark the location on your map."]="The ethereals set up shop in the upstairs corridor to the right as you enter the main building.\n\nI will mark the location on your map."
G["The events of that dark day are hereby forgiven by my people.  They shall never again be spoken of."]="The events of that dark day are hereby forgiven by my people.  They shall never again be spoken of."
G["The events that take place here will forever change this land."]="The events that take place here will forever change this land."
G["The evil emanating from the crystal shard has lured one of the colossi.  Put it down quick!"]="The evil emanating from the crystal shard has lured one of the colossi.  Put it down quick!"
G["The evil in these stones is strong, but it has been dispelled."]="The evil in these stones is strong, but it has been dispelled."
G["The excecutioner has arrived!  Ready the prisoners!"]="O verdugo chegou! Preparad aos prisioneiros!"
G["The excitement of the crowd, the thrill of the fight - you should have seen it!  Ever since those ogres took control of the Dire Maul arena, I've been forced to camp out here.  Griniblix the Spectator - ha!  Spectator of what?  This campfire?  That shrub?  Or how about this odd purple tree?\nListen, if you're looking for a fight, Skarr was headed towards the Lariss Pavilion, and The Razza was soaring in the direction of the New Thalanaar.  Just be sure to let me in on the betting before the bloodbath begins!"]="The excitement of the crowd, the thrill of the fight - you should have seen it!  Ever since those ogres took control of the Dire Maul arena, I've been forced to camp out here.  Griniblix the Spectator - ha!  Spectator of what?  This campfire?  That shrub?  Or how about this odd purple tree?\nListen, if you're looking for a fight, Skarr was headed towards the Lariss Pavilion, and The Razza was soaring in the direction of the New Thalanaar.  Just be sure to let me in on the betting before the bloodbath begins!"
G["The exiles of Gnomeregan find ourselves in even more dire straits by running low on cloth reserves!  Perhaps you can help us, eh?!\n\nBring me extra cloth pieces you might have to help us replenish our stocks.  By donating them, you'll be earning the respect and trust of gnomes everywhere.  That's something that money can't buy!  Well, I guess cloth does, but that's beside the point..."]="The exiles of Gnomeregan find ourselves in even more dire straits by running low on cloth reserves!  Perhaps you can help us, eh?!\n\nBring me extra cloth pieces you might have to help us replenish our stocks.  By donating them, you'll be earning the respect and trust of gnomes everywhere.  That's something that money can't buy!  Well, I guess cloth does, but that's beside the point..."
G["The existence of your kind has not escaped our notice, $c."]="A existência de seu povo não passou despercebida por nós, $c."
G["The exit is to the northwest... the mist will lead the way."]="A saída está ao noroeste... A névoa nos mostrará o caminho."
G["The expendable have perished. So be it! Now I shall succeed where Sargeras could not! I will bleed this wretched world and secure my place as the true master of the Burning Legion! The end has come! Let the unravelling of this world commence!"]="The expendable have perished. So be it! Now I shall succeed where Sargeras could not! I will bleed this wretched world and secure my place as the true master of the Burning Legion! The end has come! Let the unravelling of this world commence!"
G["The explosives!\n\nGood work, $n. Not a moment too soon."]="Os explosivos!\n\nBom trabalho, $n. Logo a tempo."
G["The extent of the corruption in Outland is truly astonishing, $c. The Cenarion Circle hopes to understand how these creatures have managed to survive. Studying this broken, tortured land and its inhabitants may yet teach us how to heal ailing parts of our own world."]="A corrupção de TerrAlém chega a extremos increíbles, $c. O Círculo Cenariano tenta entender como têm pedido sobreviver essas criaturas. O estudo desta terra desolada e maldito pode nos ajudar a encontrar a forma de curar algumas partes de nosso próprio mundo."
G["The eyes of Hellscream are upon us!"]="The eyes of Hellscream are upon us!"
G["The eyes of Hellscream are upon you."]="The eyes of Hellscream are upon you."
G["The eyes of the angry hozen are upon you, ooker."]="The eyes of the angry hozen are upon you, ooker."
G["The eyes of the great lord Sargeras can see your betrayal, your desires, your utter destruction!"]="The eyes of the great lord Sargeras can see your betrayal, your desires, your utter destruction!"
G["The eyes... I can't stop thinking about it's eyes!"]="Os olhos... Não posso deixar de pensar nos seus olhos!"
G["The fabric of which our world is woven is most delicate. It merely takes some knowledge and the application of said knowledge to tear the fabric. It is thusly that rifts are born."]="The fabric of which our world is woven is most delicate. It merely takes some knowledge and the application of said knowledge to tear the fabric. It is thusly that rifts are born."
G["The faceless generals, Zon'ozz and Yor'sahj, command the enemy legions from within the monstrosities you see on the horizon."]="The faceless generals, Zon'ozz and Yor'sahj, command the enemy legions from within the monstrosities you see on the horizon."
G["The fact that you are here is a first step... a correct choice if you will, in aiding Ysera's Dragonflight.\n\nYou may be here for purely the lure of personal gain, or you may be here because you are morally compelled.  Neither reason is important on its own, but both are in fact critical to this end: The agony that Eranikus endures is what rousted me from my Dream, and it is now my charge to see his torment ended.  I now ask you to aid me in this quest."]="The fact that you are here is a first step... a correct choice if you will, in aiding Ysera's Dragonflight.\n\nYou may be here for purely the lure of personal gain, or you may be here because you are morally compelled.  Neither reason is important on its own, but both are in fact critical to this end: The agony that Eranikus endures is what rousted me from my Dream, and it is now my charge to see his torment ended.  I now ask you to aid me in this quest."
G["The failed concoction spills on the floor and appears to come to life!"]="O mistura inútil cai no chão e parece cobrar vida!"
G["The faint of heart may wish to shield their eyes! Being brought into the ring now is a horror, captured from the dark tunnels of the Centipaar Hive! I give you the skittering death: SARINEXX!"]="The faint of heart may wish to shield their eyes! Being brought into the ring now is a horror, captured from the dark tunnels of the Centipaar Hive! I give you the skittering death: SARINEXX!"
G["The faire is my family.  I would never leave my family."]="A feira é meu família. Nunca dejaría a meu família."
G["The faire kept me from an execution.  It saved my life."]="The faire kept me from an execution.  It saved my life."
G["The faire seems to bring out all the lookers!"]="The faire seems to bring out all the lookers!"
G["The faithful shall be exalted, but there is more work to be done. We will press on until all of Azeroth lies beneath his shadow!"]="The faithful shall be exalted, but there is more work to be done. We will press on until all of Azeroth lies beneath his shadow!"
G["The faithful shall serve by HIS side!  Aiiiiigh!!!"]="The faithful shall serve by HIS side!  Aiiiiigh!!!"
G["The falcon is vanquished, doomed never to rise again! Your quest is futile!"]="The falcon is vanquished, doomed never to rise again! Your quest is futile!"
G["The fallen heroes of Valhalas emerge from the ground to do battle once more!"]="The fallen heroes of Valhalas emerge from the ground to do battle once more!"
G["The fallen of Pal'ea will not rest, son.  Find the naga priestess!"]="The fallen of Pal'ea will not rest, son.  Find the naga priestess!"
G["The false Kingpin has fallen thanks to you adventurers."]="O falso líder tem caído Obrigado a vocês, aventureiros."
G["The farmers from the nearby fields bring their wheat, and we mill and sort the grains here.\n\nSome of the grain will be made into food, some of it is traded, but most of it is sent to the Stormstout Brewery for... you guessed it... beer!"]="The farmers from the nearby fields bring their wheat, and we mill and sort the grains here.\n\nSome of the grain will be made into food, some of it is traded, but most of it is sent to the Stormstout Brewery for... you guessed it... beer!"
G["The farmers pray for rain, but I don't! It's terrible for business. Just look at my market! Sopping wet!"]="The farmers pray for rain, but I don't! It's terrible for business. Just look at my market! Sopping wet!"
G["The farmers, the bricklayers, the shepherds and the smiths... they all bowed before Kang. \"Teach us,\" they said. \"Teach us to fight.\""]="Os fazendeiros, peões de obra, pastores e ferreiros... todos se curvaram diante de Kang. \"Nos ensine\", eles disseram. \"Nos ensine a lutar\"."
G["The farms must be liberated.  Stormwind may have deserted these people, but I'll be damned if I will."]="É preciso liberar as terras. Ventobravo pode haver abandonou a esta gente, mas que me condenen se eu faço o mesmo."
G["The farstriders keep a smith at their retreat in the eastern portion of Eversong. Arathel might be able to help you."]="Os farstriders mantêm um ferreiro na sua retirada na parte oriental de Eversong. Arathel pode ser capaz de ajudá-o."
G["The faster we can get to the other side of the front, the faster we can reduce Needlerock Slag to rubble."]="The faster we can get to the other side of the front, the faster we can reduce Needlerock Slag to rubble."
G["The faster you race, the better your prize."]="Quanto mais rápido vá, melhor será o prêmio."
G["The fat one! He'll make for a nice sacrifice."]="O gordo! Será um bom sacrifício!"
G["The fate of Azeroth hinges on the deeds of a mortal druid."]="O destino de Azeroth depende do que faça $gun druida: uma druida; mortal."
G["The fate of Azeroth hinges on the deeds of a mortal mage."]="O destino de Azeroth depende do que faça $gun mago: uma maga; mortal."
G["The fate of Azeroth hinges on the deeds of a mortal priest."]="O destino de Azeroth depende do que faça $gun sacerdote: uma sacerdotisa; mortal."
G["The fate of Azeroth hinges on the deeds of a mortal shaman."]="O destino de Azeroth depende do que faça $gun xamã: uma xamã; mortal."
G["The fate of Azeroth hinges on the deeds of a mortal warlock."]="O destino de Azeroth depende do que faça $gun bruxo: uma bruxa; mortal."
G["The fate of the world hangs in the balance!"]="O destino deste mundo está em jogo!"
G["The fates have turned against me!"]="As parcas se têm voltado na minha contra!"
G["The fear clouds my mind. I... cannot resist."]="The fear clouds my mind. I... cannot resist."
G["The feast has arrived! DIE!"]="Hora do festa! MORRE!"
G["The feast of corruption is no more! Magtheridon has fallen to the battle prowess of $n and $g his:her; allies! Witness the might of the Alliance! A pit lord commander is destroyed!"]="The feast of corruption is no more! Magtheridon has fallen to the battle prowess of $n and $g his:her; allies! Witness the might of the Alliance! A pit lord commander is destroyed!"
G["The feast of souls begins now..."]="Começao festa de almas..."
G["The features of this jade statue are incredibly lifelike.  The expression on the face is one locked in horror.\n\nIt does not resemble Shin however."]="The features of this jade statue are incredibly lifelike.  The expression on the face is one locked in horror.\n\nIt does not resemble Shin however."
G["The features of this jade statue are incredibly lifelike. The expression is locked in horror."]="The features of this jade statue are incredibly lifelike. The expression is locked in horror."
G["The fel crystalforge can be used to transform your apexis shards into unstable flasks of the beast.  These flasks make the imbiber more agile, stronger and heartier.\n\nIt appears, however, that you do not have the ten shards necessary to purchase even a single flask."]="A forja de cristal vil pode ser usada para transformar seus fragmentos de ápices em frascos da fera. Estes frascos voltam ao que os bebe mais ágil, forte e feliz.\n\nNo entanto, parece que não tem os 10 fragmentos necessários para comprar um frasco."
G["The fel crystalforge can be used to transform your apexis shards into unstable flasks of the beast.  These flasks make the imbiber more agile, stronger and heartier.\n\nMake your choice, below."]="A forja de cristal vil pode ser usada para transformar seus fragmentos de ápices em frascos instáveis da fera. Estes frascos voltam ao que os bebe mais ágil, forte e feliz.\n\nElige, baixo."
G["The fel energies also had the side-effect on the Broken and the Lost Ones of cutting us off from the Light. At the time I did not know exactly why, but as a vindicator I insisted on finding out. I decided to make a pilgrimage to do just that.\n\nAnd so it was that after the war came to its fateful end, I journeyed into the desert of the fragmented planet, beseeching the Light to return to us. But decades passed, and the Light never answered my prayers.\n\nIs this something that you wish to hear more of?"]="The fel energies also had the side-effect on the Broken and the Lost Ones of cutting us off from the Light. At the time I did not know exactly why, but as a vindicator I insisted on finding out. I decided to make a pilgrimage to do just that.\n\nAnd so it was that after the war came to its fateful end, I journeyed into the desert of the fragmented planet, beseeching the Light to return to us. But decades passed, and the Light never answered my prayers.\n\nIs this something that you wish to hear more of?"
G["The felhound... a vicious creature indeed. It is not as physically strong as an infernal, but a wise warlock knows that brute force is not always the answer--if it was, you would have chosen the path of a warrior instead, wouldn't you?\n\nThe felhound draws upon the mana of its foes, using that and its quickness to overcome enemies. Its strength comes from the arcane and using that arcane power for its own ends.\n\nIf you wish to know more about infernals, then you should speak to Magaz across from me."]="The felhound... a vicious creature indeed. It is not as physically strong as an infernal, but a wise warlock knows that brute force is not always the answer--if it was, you would have chosen the path of a warrior instead, wouldn't you?\n\nThe felhound draws upon the mana of its foes, using that and its quickness to overcome enemies. Its strength comes from the arcane and using that arcane power for its own ends.\n\nIf you wish to know more about infernals, then you should speak to Magaz across from me."
G["The felhounds are always hungry for magic to devour."]="Os canisvis estão sempre com fome de magia."
G["The felhunter approaches! Be on your guard!"]="The felhunter approaches! Be on your guard!"
G["The felhunter just tilts its head and stares at you strangely."]="The felhunter just tilts its head and stares at you strangely."
G["The feralfen that dwell in Zangarmarsh have wicker baskets with clever locks on them.  Surely they would challenge even your skill."]="Os feralfen que habitam em Zangarmarsh têm cestos de vime com fechaduras inteligentes. Certamente eles desafiariam até sua habilidade."
G["The festival has begun! Invite your friends!\n\nBe sure not to miss the fireworks at the beginning or end of the festival. They're the most important part."]="The festival has begun! Invite your friends!\n\nBe sure not to miss the fireworks at the beginning or end of the festival. They're the most important part."
G["The festival is saved!"]="salvou o festival!"
G["The festival of the moon was ever more important to the kaldorei. The great festival of the druids is surely in full swing."]="O Festival Lunar era muito importantes para os kaldorei. O grande festival dos druidas deve estar a tope em estes momentos."
G["The festival reminds me of how beautiful Kun-Lai is."]="O festival me recuerdao bonita que é Kun-Lai."
G["The fields will run red with the blood of the Scarlet Crusade!"]="The fields will run red with the blood of the Scarlet Crusade!"
G["The fiend of a thousand faces."]="O demônio de mil caras."
G["The fight against Kael'thas and Illidan continues on all fronts.  Defeat is not an option."]="A luta contra Kael'thas e Illidan continua em todas as frentes. Derrota não é uma opção."
G["The fight is THAT way, $R."]="A batalha é por ALI, $R."
G["The fight isn't over yet!"]="O combate ainda não terminou!"
G["The fighter spirit is about to hit you in the face!"]="The fighter spirit is about to hit you in the face!"
G["The fighting remains fierce and costly, but your assistance has proven invaluable."]="A batalha continua sendo terrível, mas sua ajuda foi vital."
G["The fighting skills of my companion are quickly becoming legendary among the Shado-Pan."]="Seu técnica de combate se você está transformando em uma lendas entre os Shadopan."
G["The figure at the front of the ruined chamber gestures and mouths inaudible words as a group of other spirits sit in rapt attention."]="The figure at the front of the ruined chamber gestures and mouths inaudible words as a group of other spirits sit in rapt attention."
G["The filth pool is more rancid than I've ever seen it. We need to get somebody in here to clean up before it gets any worse and starts spreading outside the crag."]="The filth pool is more rancid than I've ever seen it. We need to get somebody in here to clean up before it gets any worse and starts spreading outside the crag."
G["The final battle against the naga has begun. We will destroy them or gloriously die trying in the Abyssal Breach."]="The final battle against the naga has begun. We will destroy them or gloriously die trying in the Abyssal Breach."
G["The final battle against the naga is imminent. We will triumph or die trying in the Abyssal Breach."]="The final battle against the naga is imminent. We will triumph or die trying in the Abyssal Breach."
G["The final battle for Kalimdor is upon us. The supreme commander of the Might of Kalimdor orders his troops to march upon Ahn'Qiraj and destroy all in their path."]="The final battle for Kalimdor is upon us. The supreme commander of the Might of Kalimdor orders his troops to march upon Ahn'Qiraj and destroy all in their path."
G["The final battle will begin soon, $n. Stand at attention!"]="The final battle will begin soon, $n. Stand at attention!"
G["The final charge is set. Stand back!"]="A carga fim está colocada. Trás!"
G["The final death knight, Lord Mograine, was the finest warrior that the death knights had ever seen. However, after the events in Azeroth, he vanished without a trace. It is yet to be seen who Kel'Thuzad has appointed in his place."]="The final death knight, Lord Mograine, was the finest warrior that the death knights had ever seen. However, after the events in Azeroth, he vanished without a trace. It is yet to be seen who Kel'Thuzad has appointed in his place."
G["The final ingredient, a secret passed down through generations of my family, comes all the way from the Krasarang Wilds. I sent Assistant Buzaki to pick it up for me a few days ago, and received word that he reached the Tavern in the Mists last night. Can you head into the Ancient Passage and find out what's keeping him? He better not still be asleep at the tavern!"]="The final ingredient, a secret passed down through generations of my family, comes all the way from the Krasarang Wilds. I sent Assistant Buzaki to pick it up for me a few days ago, and received word that he reached the Tavern in the Mists last night. Can you head into the Ancient Passage and find out what's keeping him? He better not still be asleep at the tavern!"
G["The final piece of the World Pillar has been recovered!  We have only to bind it together to prevent this realm from collapsing into Azeroth."]="The final piece of the World Pillar has been recovered!  We have only to bind it together to prevent this realm from collapsing into Azeroth."
G["The final sanctum of crazed zealots. 'Tis where they create their scarlet uniforms, magically imbued by the enchanted scarlet thread!\n\nTo Stratholme, adventurer!"]="The final sanctum of crazed zealots. 'Tis where they create their scarlet uniforms, magically imbued by the enchanted scarlet thread!\n\nTo Stratholme, adventurer!"
G["The final shred of light fades, and with it, your pitiful mortal existence!"]="O último raio de luz se apaga e, com ele, sua lamentable e mortal existência!"
G["The final step, we add heat! Smell that aroma!"]="The final step, we add heat! Smell that aroma!"
G["The final wave of hozen ships has come to attack!"]="A última onda de barcos hozen ataca!"
G["The finest preservative of flesh known to man and Scourge alike - Frostwhisper's embalming fluid.  Only one place an adventurer could find this and one would think that the lich the fluid is named after would not take too kindly to anyone going to said place.\n\nBut... if it's the fluid you want, the Scholomance you'll haunt..."]="The finest preservative of flesh known to man and Scourge alike - Frostwhisper's embalming fluid.  Only one place an adventurer could find this and one would think that the lich the fluid is named after would not take too kindly to anyone going to said place.\n\nBut... if it's the fluid you want, the Scholomance you'll haunt..."
G["The fire spirit is upset. It's dangerous to enter the shrine now..."]="O espírito do fogo está alterado. É perigoso entrar no santuário agora mesmo..."
G["The fire's coming!"]="É a hora do fogo!"
G["The fires consuming the Tormented Protector wink out!"]="The fires consuming the Tormented Protector wink out!"
G["The fires dim, champions....  Take this, the last of my power.  Succeed where I have failed.  Avenge me.  Avenge the world...."]="The fires dim, champions....  Take this, the last of my power.  Succeed where I have failed.  Avenge me.  Avenge the world...."
G["The fires threaten to destroy all of Orgrimmar.  If you think you are strong enough to go in there, be my guest.  Otherwise, stay out of the city and let us take care of it."]="The fires threaten to destroy all of Orgrimmar.  If you think you are strong enough to go in there, be my guest.  Otherwise, stay out of the city and let us take care of it."
G["The fires, they are burning the library! Please, heroes! Purge this evil before the temple crumbles to ash!"]="The fires, they are burning the library! Please, heroes! Purge this evil before the temple crumbles to ash!"
G["The fires...torment me no longer.  But...I am consumed..."]="O fogo já não me atormenta. Mas estou consumido."
G["The first challenge requires you to be mounted on an Argent Battleworg.  You will find these mounts along the walls of this coliseum.\n\nPlease, mount the battleworg, speak to me, and then we can proceed."]="O primeiro desafio requer que estiver $gmontado: montada; sobre um huargo de batalha Argêntea. Encontrar estas montarias ao largo dos muros do Coliseu.\n\nMonta no huargo e fala comigo para que possamos seguir."
G["The first challenge requires you to be mounted on an Argent Warhorses.  You will find these mounts along the walls of this coliseum.\n\nPlease, mount the warhorse, speak to me, and then we can proceed."]="The first challenge requires you to be mounted on an Argent Warhorses.  You will find these mounts along the walls of this coliseum.\n\nPlease, mount the warhorse, speak to me, and then we can proceed."
G["The first fragment was going to be delivered to us by a Horde gunship known as the Storm's Fury.  It never made it here."]="O primeiro fragmento nos o ia a entregar uma nave de guerra da Horda, a Fúria da Tempestade. Nunca chegou aqui."
G["The first gate, Agamath, has been dismantled! The second gate of Rohendor now blocks our passage.\n\nOur mages are $3255w percent through the defenses of the second gate, Rohendor."]="A primeira porta, Agamath, foi derribada! Rohendor, a segunda porta, bloqueia nosso passo agora.\n\nNossos magos têm derribado o $3255w % das defesas da segunda porta, Rohendor."
G["The first group that came - the Trolls... they cared nothing for us - walked right past us, pushing our families out of the way.\nThe next, though - the mercenaries. They took us prisoner, stole from our homes, and threatened us with death if we resisted."]="The first group that came - the Trolls... they cared nothing for us - walked right past us, pushing our families out of the way.\nThe next, though - the mercenaries. They took us prisoner, stole from our homes, and threatened us with death if we resisted."
G["The first is a primal token that must be taken from the most powerful of the Hakkari lieutenants: Jin'do and the Bloodlord.\n\nThe second is a punctured voodoo doll. These can be found in the piles of refuse that litter this foul place. Look inside the jinxed Hoodoo piles.\n\nBring me these things and I will create a powerful enchantment for you!"]="The first is a primal token that must be taken from the most powerful of the Hakkari lieutenants: Jin'do and the Bloodlord.\n\nThe second is a punctured voodoo doll. These can be found in the piles of refuse that litter this foul place. Look inside the jinxed Hoodoo piles.\n\nBring me these things and I will create a powerful enchantment for you!"
G["The first kill goes to me! Anyone care to wager?"]="Certo que a primeira morte é minha! Alguém se apuesta algo?"
G["The first lock of the Thrice-Locked cage clicks and falls to the ground. Two Remain."]="The first lock of the Thrice-Locked cage clicks and falls to the ground. Two Remain."
G["The first of many."]="O primeiro de muitos."
G["The first of the Alliance towers has fallen! Destroy all three and we will hasten their retreat!"]="The first of the Alliance towers has fallen! Destroy all three and we will hasten their retreat!"
G["The first of the Horde towers has fallen! Destroy all three and we will hasten their retreat!"]="The first of the Horde towers has fallen! Destroy all three and we will hasten their retreat!"
G["The first rule of roll club: you don't talk about roll club.\n\nThe second rule of roll club: if it's your first time, you roll."]="The first rule of roll club: you don't talk about roll club.\n\nThe second rule of roll club: if it's your first time, you roll."
G["The first stage is over.  Big Will... come on down!"]="A primeira etapa terminou. Wilh o Grande... desciende!"
G["The first step to learning is to admit that you have much to learn."]="O primeiro passo do aprendizado é admitir que te fica muito por aprender."
G["The first steps of our fight against the Scourge go well. We have had some successes, and hopefully my assistance can aid you in bringing future success to the battle."]="Os primeiros passos de nossa luta contra o Flagelo vão bem. Tivemos algum sucessos, e espero que minha assistência possa ajudá-o a trazer sucesso futuro para a batalha."
G["The first suit of Dreadnaught armor was made exclusively for the Scarlet Highlord Mograine.  Whilst donning the full suit, the Highlord looked himself to be a demon from the depths of the Nether.\n\nAye, 'twas quite a sight to behold as Mograine would wade into a hundred Scourge, Ashbringer held high, and come out on the other side in a cloud of dust and flames - enemies left in ashes beneath his feet."]="The first suit of Dreadnaught armor was made exclusively for the Scarlet Highlord Mograine.  Whilst donning the full suit, the Highlord looked himself to be a demon from the depths of the Nether.\n\nAye, 'twas quite a sight to behold as Mograine would wade into a hundred Scourge, Ashbringer held high, and come out on the other side in a cloud of dust and flames - enemies left in ashes beneath his feet."
G["The first thing you need to learn is proper discipline."]="O primeiro que têm que aprender como é devido é a disciplina."
G["The first time I saw mushrooms taller than trees, I wasn't so sure I could call this place home. After a while you just stop noticing."]="Pela primeira vez que vi cogumelos mais altos que árvores, não tinha tanta certeza de poder chamar esse lugar de lar. Depois de um tempo, você apenas para de perceber."
G["The fish are biting like crazy down in Krasarang!\n\nI'd still be out on the sea, reeling in the big one, but I came here to sell this morning's catch. Got lots of hungry mouths to feed here!"]="The fish are biting like crazy down in Krasarang!\n\nI'd still be out on the sea, reeling in the big one, but I came here to sell this morning's catch. Got lots of hungry mouths to feed here!"
G["The fish is exquisite, Jessica."]="The fish is exquisite, Jessica."
G["The fish know all the secrets. They know the cold. They know the dark."]="The fish know all the secrets. They know the cold. They know the dark."
G["The fish off the coast of Teldrassil are quite large and robust.  Rumors say it is the speedy growth of our new world tree that is the cause."]="Os peixes na costa de Teldrassil são bastante grandes e robustos. Os rumores dizem que é o rápido crescimento da nossa nova árvore do mundo que é a causa."
G["The fissure closed and Krixix was gone! Swallowed whole!\n\nBe warned, $r, what you wish for could very well become that which you do not want. You play with beings and arcana that are older than time itself!\n\nShould Krixix be alive and should he have the information which you seek, you can be certain that he will not give up said information. He has faced terrors far worse than you could ever dream to perpetrate."]="The fissure closed and Krixix was gone! Swallowed whole!\n\nBe warned, $r, what you wish for could very well become that which you do not want. You play with beings and arcana that are older than time itself!\n\nShould Krixix be alive and should he have the information which you seek, you can be certain that he will not give up said information. He has faced terrors far worse than you could ever dream to perpetrate."
G["The fists of an Orc are already a powerful weapon, so why not add blades or studs of solid steel. Now the fists I use to tame the wolves of the plains I can also use to shatter the armor of my foes."]="The fists of an Orc are already a powerful weapon, so why not add blades or studs of solid steel. Now the fists I use to tame the wolves of the plains I can also use to shatter the armor of my foes."
G["The flag carriers have become increasingly vulnerable to attack!"]="The flag carriers have become increasingly vulnerable to attack!"
G["The flag carriers have become vulnerable to attack!"]="The flag carriers have become vulnerable to attack!"
G["The flag has been dropped!"]="Tem caído a bandeira!"
G["The flag has been reset."]="A bandeira se tem restabelecido."
G["The flag is a nice touch.  I bet a few more accessories will really make this rocket stand out."]="The flag is a nice touch.  I bet a few more accessories will really make this rocket stand out."
G["The flags are now placed at their bases."]="As bandeiras estão colocadas nos seus bases."
G["The flagship's last reported position was below. Can you see anything?"]="A última posição da nau capitânia foi logo abaixo de nós. Dá pra ver alguma coisa?"
G["The flames are truth!"]="As chamas são a verdade!"
G["The flames burn hotter!\nGood job!"]="As chamas cada vez são mais intensas!\nBom trabalho!"
G["The flames of Ragnaros will burn you all."]="The flames of Ragnaros will burn you all."
G["The flames... never cease..."]="The flames... never cease..."
G["The flames... they lick... they bite... always biting..."]="The flames... they lick... they bite... always biting..."
G["The flamewakers up ahead mean business. Be careful in there."]="Os atiradores de fogo à linha de frente significam negócios. Tenha cuidado lá."
G["The flare launcher has been emptied."]="O iniciador de sinalização foi esvaziado."
G["The flaw of mortality...."]="Defecto de mortalidade..."
G["The fleet is ready, $n. You must take this beacon and place it at the eastern crater of the central battlezone. Defend the beacon from attackers until the fleet is able to lock on to its coordinates!"]="The fleet is ready, $n. You must take this beacon and place it at the eastern crater of the central battlezone. Defend the beacon from attackers until the fleet is able to lock on to its coordinates!"
G["The fleet is ready, $n. You must take this beacon and place it at the western crater of the central battlezone. Defend the beacon from attackers until the fleet is able to lock on to its coordinates!"]="The fleet is ready, $n. You must take this beacon and place it at the western crater of the central battlezone. Defend the beacon from attackers until the fleet is able to lock on to its coordinates!"
G["The fleet was mostly intact as it limped into harbor after our engagement with the Horde. We weighed anchor in the shadow of Highbank here to regroup.\n\nThen the naga came.\n\nScaly, glistening hands clambering up the anchor chains... dragging men, screaming, into the depths...\n\nThese are cursed shores, $n. Cursed."]="The fleet was mostly intact as it limped into harbor after our engagement with the Horde. We weighed anchor in the shadow of Highbank here to regroup.\n\nThen the naga came.\n\nScaly, glistening hands clambering up the anchor chains... dragging men, screaming, into the depths...\n\nThese are cursed shores, $n. Cursed."
G["The flesh is weak!  Only fire purifies!"]="A carne é fraco! Somente o fogo purifica!"
G["The flesh is weak. We will make you better, stronger... faster."]="A carne é fraco. Te faremos melhor, mais forte... mais rápido."
G["The flight from Grom'gol to Undercity is beautiful, though uneventful.  Though that is no excuse to fall asleep on the job."]="O voo de Grom'gol para Undercity é bonito, embora sem intercorrências. Embora isso não seja desculpa para adormecer no trabalho."
G["The flight master is located out on the main terrace, at the top of the twin stairs and before you enter the main building.\n\nI will mark the location on your map."]="The flight master is located out on the main terrace, at the top of the twin stairs and before you enter the main building.\n\nI will mark the location on your map."
G["The flora of Un'Goro Crater are quite remarkable, to be sure.  Wouldn't you agree, $n?"]="The flora of Un'Goro Crater are quite remarkable, to be sure.  Wouldn't you agree, $n?"
G["The flow of darkness abates. It seems you truly are the heroes of legend."]="The flow of darkness abates. It seems you truly are the heroes of legend."
G["The flowers are blooming at this time of year. They smell so fragrant!"]="The flowers are blooming at this time of year. They smell so fragrant!"
G["The flutter of the wings of a hawk, the breath of a ram in the snow, the pace of a bear through the forest... Such is life for the hunter."]="The flutter of the wings of a hawk, the breath of a ram in the snow, the pace of a bear through the forest... Such is life for the hunter."
G["The fog is rolling in..."]="A névoa se aproxima..."
G["The food, there is something wrong with the food!"]="A comida! Algo ruim lhe passa à comida!"
G["The foolish weaklings of the Alliance and Horde make their way to the Twilight Highlands as we speak. (FOOLS! Blind and weak and tasty...)"]="The foolish weaklings of the Alliance and Horde make their way to the Twilight Highlands as we speak. (FOOLS! Blind and weak and tasty...)"
G["The fools! I knew they'd try this, which is why I fire-proofed the plague tanks. Muahahahahaha!"]="The fools! I knew they'd try this, which is why I fire-proofed the plague tanks. Muahahahahaha!"
G["The foot bone's connected to the... hip bone!  The hip bone's connected to this... other bone!  Hmmmhmmmmhmmm..."]="The foot bone's connected to the... hip bone!  The hip bone's connected to this... other bone!  Hmmmhmmmmhmmm..."
G["The footlockers of Kil'sorrow Fortress in Nagrand would provide a considerable challenge to even a rogue of your notable skill."]="Os guardadores de pés da fortaleza de Kil'sorrow, em Nagrand, trariam um desafio considerável para até mesmo os desonestos da sua habilidade notável."
G["The forces of Niuzao are weak!"]="O exército de Niuzao é FRACO!"
G["The forces of the Aldor and Scryers stormed the citadel shortly after Akama and his foul brethren slew Al'ar. Its a good thing we left Illidan as soon as we did."]="The forces of the Aldor and Scryers stormed the citadel shortly after Akama and his foul brethren slew Al'ar. Its a good thing we left Illidan as soon as we did."
G["The forces of the Scourge bear down upon us.  Take heart, and fight on!"]="As forças do flagelo caem sobre nós. Tenha ânimo e lute!"
G["The forces of the Sentinel Army hold back the Horde across all of Kalimdor. While the war continues in Ashenvale and Stonetalon, our forces are also needed here, to protect these remaining wilds and prevent our enemies from gaining further footholds."]="As forças do Exército Sentinela retêm a Horda em tudo Kalimdor. Enquanto a guerra continua em Ashenvale e Stonetalon, nossas forças também são necessárias aqui, para proteger esses animais selvagens remanescentes e impedir que nossos inimigos ganhem pontos de apoio adicionais."
G["The forces we are up against here go beyond the Twilight's Hammer, Ragnaros or even Deathwing.  We must succeed here if our world is going to survive at all."]="As forças que estamos enfrentando aqui vão além do Martelo do Crepúsculo, Ragnaros ou até Asa da Morte. Temos que ter sucesso aqui se o nosso mundo vai sobreviver."
G["The forest is crawling with Horde, $c. Be mindful of your surroundings!"]="Este florestas está cheio de membros da Horda, $c. Observao entorno!"
G["The forest is crawling with worgen and ghouls.  Something must be done!"]="The forest is crawling with worgen and ghouls.  Something must be done!"
G["The forest is on the western side of Wintergrasp. Just look for the soul-leeching shades, I'm sure they'll be glad to have some company..."]="The forest is on the western side of Wintergrasp. Just look for the soul-leeching shades, I'm sure they'll be glad to have some company..."
G["The forest shakes and shudders! The winds howl! Does the Forest Lord approach?"]="The forest shakes and shudders! The winds howl! Does the Forest Lord approach?"
G["The forest sings with the seeds of change, but it also cries out in pain.\n\nOur new friends, the draenei, are here to help us, like you. We must put an end to the destruction of my brother and sister trees before all is lost and Ashenvale is no more."]="O florestas canta com as sementes do caminho. Mas também grita de dor.\n\nNossos novos amigos, os draeneis, estão aqui para nos ajudar, ao igual que você. Devemos acabar com a destruição de meus irmãos e irmãs árvores antes de que tudo estiver perdido e Valhefresno deje de existir."
G["The forest spirits are uneasy..."]="Os espíritos do florestas estão inquietos..."
G["The forest told me of your presence, but not why you were here. So, speak and enlighten me."]="A floresta me falou da sua presença, mas não por que você estava aqui. Então, fale e me esclareça."
G["The forests are overrun with strange beasts and a foul taint fills the air."]="The forests are overrun with strange beasts and a foul taint fills the air."
G["The forge draws power from the surrounding land. Amazing! I suspect at one time this whole island looked like the Vale of Eternal Blossoms."]="The forge draws power from the surrounding land. Amazing! I suspect at one time this whole island looked like the Vale of Eternal Blossoms."
G["The forge is overwhelmed! We've got to leave!"]="The forge is overwhelmed! We've got to leave!"
G["The forge is safe, and we must take our leave.  Good luck on your quest, adventurer."]="A forja está segura, e precisamos ir. Boa sorte em sua missão!"
G["The forge needs additonal tuning.  Look into it, slave!"]="The forge needs additonal tuning.  Look into it, slave!"
G["The forge speaks to Tinkers alone, $C. Your hands weren't made for such precise work."]="The forge speaks to Tinkers alone, $C. Your hands weren't made for such precise work."
G["The forgemaster is dead! Get geared up men, we have a Scourgelord to kill."]="O mestre da forja está morto. Preparem-se, homens, temos a um Senhor do Flagelo ao que matar."
G["The forgemaster is meeting with the Twilight leadership.  Trust me, I traded some gossip for a loaf of stale bread!"]="The forgemaster is meeting with the Twilight leadership.  Trust me, I traded some gossip for a loaf of stale bread!"
G["The forgemaster's a terrible murderer.  Are you sure you want to go looking for him?"]="O mestre de forja é um assassino terrível. Certo que que ir no seu procurando?"
G["The forked blade is ready, and we have given our gift. Please perform your incantation."]="A lâmina de doble lâmina está preparada, e lhe temos concedido nosso don. Por favor, realiza seu conjuro."
G["The forsaken of the Undercity cheer for $n."]="The forsaken of the Undercity cheer for $n."
G["The fortitude of the Black Ox."]="The fortitude of the Black Ox."
G["The fortune is mine, Alexi! Your end comes soon!"]="A sorte está de meu lado, Alexi! Se aproxima seu fim!"
G["The four watchers of Ulduar: Freya, Thorim, Hodir, and Mimiron. The sigils are tied to their physical and mental integrity. All four sigils are required for access to the Celestial Planetarium."]="The four watchers of Ulduar: Freya, Thorim, Hodir, and Mimiron. The sigils are tied to their physical and mental integrity. All four sigils are required for access to the Celestial Planetarium."
G["The fragment is now in the dragon's custody, ma'am."]="O fragmento está sob a custodia do dragão, senhora."
G["The fresh carcass is placed upon the Flame of Uzel."]="O cadáver fresco se coloca sobre a Chama de Uzel."
G["The front gate of the Alliance keep has been destroyed!"]="A porta principal da fortaleza da Aliança foi destruído."
G["The front gate of the Alliance keep has been destroyed."]="A porta principal da fortaleza da Aliança foi destruído."
G["The front gate of the Horde keep has been destroyed!"]="A porta principal da fortaleza da Horda foi destruído."
G["The front gate of the Horde keep has been destroyed."]="A porta principal da fortaleza da Horda foi destruído."
G["The frost leopard lays here tranquilized."]="O leopardo da geada fica aqui tranqüilizado."
G["The frost runes on the ground will fling you into the air if you touch them, which can be a boon or an inconvenience."]="As runas de gelo do chão te tomarão voar pelos aires se as tocas, o que pode ser uma bênção ou um inconveniente."
G["The frostborn have been very good to me. They're strong people."]="Os Natoescarcha têm banido muito bons comigo. São gente forte."
G["The frosthound has located the thief's hiding place. Confront him!"]="The frosthound has located the thief's hiding place. Confront him!"
G["The frostworg howls, exposing its prey!"]="The frostworg howls, exposing its prey!"
G["The frostwyrm Rimefang gazes at $n and readies an icy attack!"]="A vermis de gelo Dientefrío olhe a $n e prepara um gelado ataque!"
G["The frozen deep beckons, $r!  Join us!"]="O gelo abismo te chama, $r! Junte-se a nós!"
G["The frozen heart of Icecrown awaits...."]="O gelado coração de Coroa de Gelo espera..."
G["The fruit vendor has refused to accept my challenge and remove his cart.  Their ogre protector just sits and does nothing... What could his plan be?"]="The fruit vendor has refused to accept my challenge and remove his cart.  Their ogre protector just sits and does nothing... What could his plan be?"
G["The full might of the Burning Legion shall arrive soon."]="Pronto a Legião Ardente revelará toda sua força."
G["The full power of your drakes has been unlocked.  Use their power to defeat Eregos!"]="A potência total dos seus drakes foi desbloqueada. Use seu poder para derrotar Eregos!"
G["The fun is just beginning!"]="A diversão não fez mais que começar!"
G["The fury of the Vrykul will consume you!"]="A fúria dos vrykuls os consumirá!"
G["The fury! The power! I have never felt so strong in all my life.\n\nSoon, ALL the Dragonmaw will feel as I do."]="The fury! The power! I have never felt so strong in all my life.\n\nSoon, ALL the Dragonmaw will feel as I do."
G["The future holds much death and uncertainty, not unlike the past."]="The future holds much death and uncertainty, not unlike the past."
G["The future is cloudy for you two. If you work at your relationship, I'm sure you can find some measure of happiness."]="The future is cloudy for you two. If you work at your relationship, I'm sure you can find some measure of happiness."
G["The future of Kalimdor looks grim."]="O futuro de Kalimdor é bastante negro."
G["The game has changed."]="O jogo mudou."
G["The game is afoot! But you are a mere pawn, whereas I am ... THE BLACK BISHOP!"]="The game is afoot! But you are a mere pawn, whereas I am ... THE BLACK BISHOP!"
G["The game isn't over yet..."]="A partida não terminou..."
G["The gap in the defenses is in this path. Mantid are sneaking past the scouts and getting around the barricade.\n\nWe need to cut them off before we find ourselves surrounded."]="A ruptura nos seus defesas está neste caminho. Os mantídeos estão esquivando aos batedores e sorteando a barricada.\n\nTemos que cortar seus linhas antes de que nos rodeen."
G["The gas tank in %s is half full."]="O tanque de gás de %s está meio cheio."
G["The gate has been breached! Quickly, divert forces to deal with these invaders!"]="The gate has been breached! Quickly, divert forces to deal with these invaders!"
G["The gate is in sight! We're going to make it! But first, I need to take a breather."]="The gate is in sight! We're going to make it! But first, I need to take a breather."
G["The gate is jammed."]="A porta está atrancada."
G["The gate must be protected at all costs. Rip them to shreds!"]="The gate must be protected at all costs. Rip them to shreds!"
G["The gate's meager defenses are prepared, $n. Are you?"]="The gate's meager defenses are prepared, $n. Are you?"
G["The gates are about to fall. Quickly! Slaughter these meddlers!"]="As portões estão a ponto de cair. Rápido! Madada esses intrusos!"
G["The gates have been breached! Defend the keep!"]="The gates have been breached! Defend the keep!"
G["The gateway of your oblivion has been opened! The blood tide rises."]="The gateway of your oblivion has been opened! The blood tide rises."
G["The gathering and knowledge of herbs is a specialty of Firodren Mooncaller.  Seek him out in the Temple Gardens in the southwestern area of Darnassus."]="A pegue e o conhecimento de ervas é uma especialidade da Firodren Mooncaller. Procure-o nos Jardins do Templo, na área sudoeste de Darnassus."
G["The gears went unshifted!\nAll pressure was lost."]="The gears went unshifted!\nAll pressure was lost."
G["The gem shatters!"]="A gema está temblando!"
G["The gems you collected will be able to augment the power of the weapons I gave you, but I require another ingredient.  It will come from your next target."]="The gems you collected will be able to augment the power of the weapons I gave you, but I require another ingredient.  It will come from your next target."
G["The generals tell us that we've collected everything that we need for the upcoming Ahn'Qiraj War. Now we're just waiting for the Horde to finish their stockpiling and the transport of the war materiel can begin."]="The generals tell us that we've collected everything that we need for the upcoming Ahn'Qiraj War. Now we're just waiting for the Horde to finish their stockpiling and the transport of the war materiel can begin."
G["The ghost fades away into the mist..."]="O fantasma se desaparece entre a névoa..."
G["The ghostly figure looks at you with mistrust in her eyes and remains silent."]="A figura fantasmagórica olha para você com desconfiança nos olhos dela e permanece em silêncio."
G["The giant is down.  Kill it quickly!"]="O gigantesco tem caído. Mátalo rapidamente!"
G["The giant rook watches from the dead trees. Nothing breathes beneath his shadow."]="Um grajo gigantesco observa desdos árvores mortos. Nada respira debaixo do seu sombra."
G["The girl got it right. Follow me."]="The girl got it right. Follow me."
G["The glacier is seeping in from Icecrown... and undead everywhere!  Wait 'til the professor gets a hold of this!"]="The glacier is seeping in from Icecrown... and undead everywhere!  Wait 'til the professor gets a hold of this!"
G["The glimmer of your life, extinguished."]="O brilho do seu vida, extinguido."
G["The glory of Gurthan!"]="pela glória de Gurthan!"
G["The gnolls have failed, mistress."]="Os gnolls têm fracassado, senhora."
G["The gnolls have never been this aggressive. What's going on, Solomon? Tell us!"]="The gnolls have never been this aggressive. What's going on, Solomon? Tell us!"
G["The gnomes of Gnomeregan cheer for $n."]="The gnomes of Gnomeregan cheer for $n."
G["The gnomes used to be a nice respectful people..."]="The gnomes used to be a nice respectful people..."
G["The goblin Steamwheedle Fighting Circuit has begun. You can find Arena Organizers selling arena team charters in Gadgetzan and outside the arenas in Nagrand and the Blade's Edge Mountains."]="O duende Steamwheedle Fighting Circuit começou. Você pode encontrar organizadores de arena vendendo charters de equipes de arena em Gadgetzan e fosse das arenas de Nagrand e das Montanhas Blade's Edge."
G["The goblin Steamwheedle Fighting Circuit is beginning soon. They're holding practice matches in their arenas now, but ranking fights begin in $4262d."]="O duende Steamwheedle Fighting Circuit está começando em breve. Eles estão realizando partidas de treinos nas suas arenas agora, mas as lutas no ranking começam em $4262d."
G["The goblin racer packs a lot of punch, but the gnomes hid a trick or two in their car..."]="O goblin racer dá muito soco, mas os gnomos escondem um truque ou dois no seu carro..."
G["The goblins have finally managed to take down the door leading to the upper reaches of the spire. Our magi have also successfully deactivated the first of three barriers within the sanctum. Access to the Plagueworks is now open. Get in there and crack some skulls!\n\nWe should have the barrier to the Crimson Halls open in $4939W days."]="The goblins have finally managed to take down the door leading to the upper reaches of the spire. Our magi have also successfully deactivated the first of three barriers within the sanctum. Access to the Plagueworks is now open. Get in there and crack some skulls!\n\nWe should have the barrier to the Crimson Halls open in $4939W days."
G["The goblins of Smokywood Pastures always have such wonderful treats for sale this time of year."]="Os goblins de Pastos de Bosquehumeante sempre têm umas gostosuras magníficas nesta época do ano."
G["The goblins win the drag race!  Better luck next time, gnome team."]="The goblins win the drag race!  Better luck next time, gnome team."
G["The goblins win! The goblins win!"]="Os goblins têm ganhou! Os goblins têm ganhou!"
G["The god that the Atal'ai trolls had brought forth is to blame for this.  We destroyed the god's physical manifestation and sunk the temple, but the god was much stronger than even we had anticipated.  Its seed of corruption ran deep, twisting everything in its path.\n\nEranikus was charged to watch over the sunken temple to ensure that neither the simple Atal'ai nor their god would rise again.  He was an unwitting victim of this corruption, and we in underestimating its potency."]="The god that the Atal'ai trolls had brought forth is to blame for this.  We destroyed the god's physical manifestation and sunk the temple, but the god was much stronger than even we had anticipated.  Its seed of corruption ran deep, twisting everything in its path.\n\nEranikus was charged to watch over the sunken temple to ensure that neither the simple Atal'ai nor their god would rise again.  He was an unwitting victim of this corruption, and we in underestimating its potency."
G["The gods have abandoned us!"]="Os deuses nos têm abandonou!"
G["The gods have forsaken us! We must dispose of it before Ymiron is notified!"]="The gods have forsaken us! We must dispose of it before Ymiron is notified!"
G["The gods have spoken, $n. We now know what you must do."]="Os deuses têm falado, $n. Agora sabemos que deve fazer."
G["The goggles! They do nothing!"]="As óculos! Não fazem nada!"
G["The golden lotus must protect the vale!"]="O loto ouro deve proteção o vale!"
G["The gong peals a taunting note to the mantid armies below, accelerating the pace of their assault."]="O gongo transmite uma nota provocadora aos exércitos mantídeos de baixo e acelerao firme do seu ataque."
G["The good Doktor Professor Ironpants may be found in the Hall of Explorers."]="O bom professor Doktor Ironpants pode ser encontrado no Hall of Explorers."
G["The good Tullas is a noble woman, and a stalwart defender of the Light. Her lessons are taught in the inn proper."]="Os bons Tullas são uma mulher nobre e uma defensora da Luz. Suas lições são ensinadas na estalagem propriamente dita."
G["The good doctor is being modest. He knows precisely how much powder to put in the charge, down to the very grain."]="The good doctor is being modest. He knows precisely how much powder to put in the charge, down to the very grain."
G["The good doctor saves the day! HOORAY!"]="O bom doutor me salvou a vida! HURRA!"
G["The good sempstress is of late occupied at Saltheril's Haven; her prowess with a needle and thread is assuredly appreciated there."]="A boa semelhança é ultimamente ocupada em Saltheril's Haven; sua coragem com uma agulha e linha é certamente apreciada lá."
G["The gorillas are fascinating creatures.  Better than night elves, who do foolish things, like... gambling away all their money and getting put on Sea Wolf MacKinley's hit list."]="Os gorilas são criaturas fascinantes. Melhor que os elfos noturnos, que fazem coisas tolas, como... apostar tudo o seu dinheiro e serem colocados na pronta de hits de Sea Wolf MacKinley."
G["The government of Stormwind, of the ALLIANCE, must be made accountable for what it has done to us!"]="The government of Stormwind, of the ALLIANCE, must be made accountable for what it has done to us!"
G["The grace with which I fight is not something I can teach you, but I can teach you the use of various weapons."]="A graça com a qual luto não é algo que eu possa ensinar, mas posso ensinar o uso de várias armas."
G["The grain we gather needs to be in large quantities for the brewery. But I may know of a grain that would suit your needs."]="Devemos reunir grandes quantidades de grano para o seu elaboração. No entanto, acho que tenho o grano adequado para você."
G["The grand Amphitheater of Anguish awaits, $n. Remember, once a battle starts you have to stay in the arena. WIN OR DIE!"]="The grand Amphitheater of Anguish awaits, $n. Remember, once a battle starts you have to stay in the arena. WIN OR DIE!"
G["The grand Crucible of Carnage awaits, $n. Remember, once a battle starts you have to stay in the arena. WIN OR DIE!"]="The grand Crucible of Carnage awaits, $n. Remember, once a battle starts you have to stay in the arena. WIN OR DIE!"
G["The grand admiral asked me to give you these bottles and to ask you to consider joining our efforts against the Horde."]="A grande almirante me pediu que te entregue estas garrafas e que te pida que consideres a opção de unir nossas forças para fazer linha de frente à Horda."
G["The grand admiral studies you a moment through narrowed eyes."]="The grand admiral studies you a moment through narrowed eyes."
G["The grand master leatherworker Darmari may be found in the lower city's open marketplace."]="O grande mestre marceneiro Darmari pode ser encontrado no mercado aberto da cidade baixa."
G["The grapes were VERY TASTY!"]="The grapes were VERY TASTY!"
G["The grasp of the Old Gods is unmoving. He is consumed by their dark thoughts... I... I cannot... cannot channel much longer... Elune aid me..."]="Não posso anular a influência dos deuses antigos. Está possuído pelos seus obscuros pensamentos... Eu... não posso... não posso seguir muito mais... Eluna, ajude-me..."
G["The grass is soft and lush. The air is fresh, full of light and song. Everything I've seen suggests that Teldrassil is a dream come true. Why, then, is my heart full of foreboding?"]="A grama é macia e exuberante. O ar é fresco, cheio de luz e música. Tudo o que vi sugere que Teldrassil é um sonho tornado realidade. Por que, então, meu coração está cheio de presságios?"
G["The grave calls to us all!"]="A tumba nos chama a todos!"
G["The grave is old, peaceful, and undisturbed."]="O túmulo é velho, pacífico e imperturbável."
G["The graveyard on the hill is filling up faster than we can dig the holes on some days."]="The graveyard on the hill is filling up faster than we can dig the holes on some days."
G["The graveyards in Alterac Valley are where the souls of the deceased find rest and succor.  If you die, then your spirit will drift to the closest graveyard that our side controls."]="Os cemitérios no Vale Alterac são onde as almas dos falecidos encontram descanso e socorro. Se você morrer, seu espírito irá para o cemitério mais próximo que nosso lado controla."
G["The great Rastakhan sends his greetings to you, member of the Alliance."]="O grande Rastakhan envia suas saudações a você, membro da Aliança."
G["The great Rastakhan sends his greetings to you, member of the Horde."]="O grande Rastakhan envia suas saudações a você, membro da Horda."
G["The great one will be pleased."]="The great one will be pleased."
G["The great river flows through us all. Some prefer to surrender themselves to the water's path. Others swim toward certain shores.\n\nWhich are you, stranger? Where will your river take you?"]="The great river flows through us all. Some prefer to surrender themselves to the water's path. Others swim toward certain shores.\n\nWhich are you, stranger? Where will your river take you?"
G["The great sea turtle Walker of Waves travels from this dock to Moa'ki Harbor in Dragonblight."]="A grande tartaruga marinha Walker of Waves viaja deste cais para o porto de Moa'ki, em Dragonblight."
G["The green flight is in your debt."]="O vôo verde está na sua dívida."
G["The grimtotem lurk in Feralas as well. They wait for the chance to strike this very camp."]="The grimtotem lurk in Feralas as well. They wait for the chance to strike this very camp."
G["The grog leaks out of the barrel.  A lot of pirates are going to be very unhappy about this."]="O grogue vaza do cano. Muitos piratas ficarão muito infelizes com isso."
G["The gronn... the Legion... is there nothing you can't handle, $n?"]="Os gronn... a Legião... não há nada com o que não possa, $n?"
G["The ground begins to crack open!"]="The ground begins to crack open!"
G["The ground beneath you rumbles ominously...."]="o chão sob seus pés começa a temblar ominosamente..."
G["The ground beneath your feet lives and breathes. It may hold you steadily right now, but bring war and suffering here and it will respond in kind. Such is the way of nature."]="The ground beneath your feet lives and breathes. It may hold you steadily right now, but bring war and suffering here and it will respond in kind. Such is the way of nature."
G["The ground of this place is still warm from freshly shed blood.  Ah, I would have given my own eye to be here when the demons tore through that portal and clashed with Azeroth's heroes!  What a battle it was!\n\nBut now, even more fierce fighting rages on the other side!"]="The ground of this place is still warm from freshly shed blood.  Ah, I would have given my own eye to be here when the demons tore through that portal and clashed with Azeroth's heroes!  What a battle it was!\n\nBut now, even more fierce fighting rages on the other side!"
G["The ground rumbles underneath you..."]="o chão retumba debaixo de ti..."
G["The ground runs red with your blood!"]="o chão se volta vermelho com o seu sangue!"
G["The ground shakes..."]="A terra se estremece..."
G["The ground upon which the Scholomance was built was given to Kel'Thuzad by the Barov family. In exchange for this land - a place where the Cult of the Damned could learn the foul magics of the Scourge - Kel'Thuzad granted the Barov's immortality through undeath.\n\nIt is in Shadow Vault that you will find both the skin of shadow and its owner, Lady Illucia Barov.\n\nA finer mirror for the vain and dead never existed."]="The ground upon which the Scholomance was built was given to Kel'Thuzad by the Barov family. In exchange for this land - a place where the Cult of the Damned could learn the foul magics of the Scourge - Kel'Thuzad granted the Barov's immortality through undeath.\n\nIt is in Shadow Vault that you will find both the skin of shadow and its owner, Lady Illucia Barov.\n\nA finer mirror for the vain and dead never existed."
G["The ground... is frozen.  We're sitting ducks here; these meatwagons aren't going anywhere."]="O chão está congelado. Estamos sentados aqui; esses vagões de carne não vão a lugar nenhum."
G["The grown ups always told us the Jade Witch was just some old lady in the woods who was sad her husband died. But you showed them!\n\nOnly... I didn't tell any of the grown ups 'cause I didn't want to get in trouble."]="The grown ups always told us the Jade Witch was just some old lady in the woods who was sad her husband died. But you showed them!\n\nOnly... I didn't tell any of the grown ups 'cause I didn't want to get in trouble."
G["The gruesome visage of a leering orc stares back at you from this poster.  His raiments are obviously of a warlock nature."]="The gruesome visage of a leering orc stares back at you from this poster.  His raiments are obviously of a warlock nature."
G["The grummle suspicious of any luck they cannot smell, so it behooves one to meet new grummles with a pocketful of dung."]="Os grômulos suspeitam de qualquer sorte que não possam cheirar, por isso, ao encontrar um grômulo pela primeira vez, é bom ter o bolso cheio de estrume."
G["The gryphon appears to be injured. Perhaps healing or first aid could get it back on its feet."]="O grifo parece estar ferido. Talvez a cura ou os primeiros socorros possam recuperá-o."
G["The gryphon appears to be trapped. It looks like it would be easily possible to break its bonds though."]="O grifo parece estar preso. Parece que seria facilmente possível quebrar seus laços."
G["The gryphon looks at you intently, clearly smelling a familiar scent on your clothing."]="O grifo olha para você atenciosamente, sentindo claramente um cheiro familiar na sua roupa."
G["The gryphon looks at you with genuine appreciation."]="O grifo te olhe com autêntico gratidão."
G["The gryphon master oversees the gryphon flights from within Stormwind.  If you're looking to take a ride, then that's where you should be headed."]="O mestre grifo supervisiona os vôos grifos de dentro de Ventobravo. Se você quer dar uma volta, é para onde deve ir."
G["The gryphon muscles tense and eyes tighten as soon as the bark is extended towards it."]="The gryphon muscles tense and eyes tighten as soon as the bark is extended towards it."
G["The gryphon riders are standing 10 paces from us, friend. They'll be giving you a ride to Thorson's Post. Get going!"]="Os cavaleiros grifos estão a 10 passos de nós, amigo. Eles vão te dar uma carona até o Thorson Post. Vá em linha de frente!"
G["The gryphon screams with glee as you break it free."]="O grifo grita de alegria quando o liberas."
G["The gryphons are ready to strike, $n! You must take this beacon and plant it in the western crater of the central battlegrounds.\n\nDo this and the battle is ours!"]="The gryphons are ready to strike, $n! You must take this beacon and plant it in the western crater of the central battlegrounds.\n\nDo this and the battle is ours!"
G["The gryphons of the Northrend peaks are the most resilient of the species."]="Os grifos dos picos de Northrend são os mais resistentes da espécie."
G["The guardian begins to move with a rumble."]="The guardian begins to move with a rumble."
G["The guardian has awoken! Destroy it!"]="O guardião tem despertado! Acaba com ele!"
G["The guardian of the skies has taken flight again! This is encouraging news, $n. But much remains undone, and we must turn our attention elsewhere..."]="The guardian of the skies has taken flight again! This is encouraging news, $n. But much remains undone, and we must turn our attention elsewhere..."
G["The guardian's power grows! Kill them before it's too late!"]="O poder do guardião aumenta! Mátalo antes de que seja tarde demais!"
G["The guardians of the temple are few, but their spirits remain strong. I believe we can defeat the sha and expel them from our temple, but it will be a long and difficult battle."]="The guardians of the temple are few, but their spirits remain strong. I believe we can defeat the sha and expel them from our temple, but it will be a long and difficult battle."
G["The guards are needed here. If you seek vengeance at the glade, Teng, I suggest you speak with our guest here."]="The guards are needed here. If you seek vengeance at the glade, Teng, I suggest you speak with our guest here."
G["The guards of Theramore are the finest group of Alliance soldiers based in Kalimdor. It is our duty to uphold the laws of the Alliance even so far away from our homes."]="Os guardas de Theramore são o melhor grupo de soldados da Aliança baseados em Kalimdor. É nosso dever defender as leis da Aliança, mesmo longe de nossas casas."
G["The guest rooms.  These were offered to some of my people."]="The guest rooms.  These were offered to some of my people."
G["The guild master handles his business in the Trade Quarter. He's up on the eastern platform."]="O mestre da guilda lida com os seus negócios no Trade Quarter. Ele está na plataforma leste."
G["The guild master is Christopher Drakul. He's on the eastern platform in the Trade Quarter."]="O mestre da guilda é Christopher Drakul. Ele está na plataforma leste do Trade Quarter."
G["The guilds of the Horde have pulled together and accomplished this task already $c. We have all of the singed corestones necessary for our war materiel. Make yourself useful by asking the other collectors here if they need your aid."]="The guilds of the Horde have pulled together and accomplished this task already $c. We have all of the singed corestones necessary for our war materiel. Make yourself useful by asking the other collectors here if they need your aid."
G["The gunpowder is completely soaked.  Nobody's going to be using this to fire cannons anytime soon."]="A pólvora está completamente encharcada. Ninguém vai usar isso para disparar canhões tão cedo."
G["The guns, man the guns! Fire everything we've got!"]="The guns, man the guns! Fire everything we've got!"
G["The gusty essence of deceased Quetz'lun's wardens must be gathered to draw him near. To Har'koa must both of these rarities be delivered."]="The gusty essence of deceased Quetz'lun's wardens must be gathered to draw him near. To Har'koa must both of these rarities be delivered."
G["The gyros are all spun up. Are you ready to fly my survey?"]="Os girocópteros estão todos boca cima. Está $gpronto: pronta; para levar a cabo meu estudo?"
G["The halls of Karazhan shake, as the curse binding the doors of the Gamesman's Hall is lifted."]="The halls of Karazhan shake, as the curse binding the doors of the Gamesman's Hall is lifted."
G["The hammer is warm to the touch."]="O martelo é cálido ao tacto."
G["The hammer of justice shall now find you guilty!"]="O martelo da justiçaos considerará culpados!"
G["The hammers of the earthen stand united behind Bouldercrag. We will oppose Loken's minions to the end."]="Os martelos dos terrenos estão unidos atrás de Bouldercrag. Vamos nos opor aos servos de Loken até o fim."
G["The harbinger has come. The world heaves."]="The harbinger has come. The world heaves."
G["The harbor defenses have fallen! Kor'kron, fall back and move to higher ground!"]="As defesas do porto têm caído! Kor'kron, retiraos a terreno elevado!"
G["The hatchling is happy to see you!"]="A prole se alegra de ver você!"
G["The hatchling likes being petted!"]="À prole lhe gosta que a acaricies!"
G["The hatchling loves you, too!"]="A prole também te quer!"
G["The hatchling nudges your arm affectionately."]="The hatchling nudges your arm affectionately."
G["The hatchling thinks you are very funny."]="À prole lhe faz muita graça."
G["The hatchling thinks you should excuse yourself."]="The hatchling thinks you should excuse yourself."
G["The hatchlings will dine on your corpse!"]="The hatchlings will dine on your corpse!"
G["The hatred inside you drives your hunt for me.  You are already mine."]="The hatred inside you drives your hunt for me.  You are already mine."
G["The haze has been lifted from my eyes... forgive me for doubting you..."]="The haze has been lifted from my eyes... forgive me for doubting you..."
G["The head, the handle, these two must be made as one."]="A cabeça e o cabo, combinados em um só devem estar."
G["The heart is MINE!"]="O coração é MEU!"
G["The heart of the Great Serpent will not fall into your hands!"]="O coração do dragão não cairá nas suas mãos!"
G["The heart... the last remaining vestige of your humanity.  I had to stop it from being destroyed.  I had to see for myself.  And at last I'm sure..."]="The heart... the last remaining vestige of your humanity.  I had to stop it from being destroyed.  I had to see for myself.  And at last I'm sure..."
G["The heartless saurok, even with their tiny lizard brains, soon realized the truth of their position. They killed the enemies of the mogu."]="Os cruéis sauroks, mesmo com seus pequenos cérebros de lagarto, logo compreenderam a verdade da situação. Eles mataram os inimigos dos mogus."
G["The heat comes. Prepare to defend against the elemental attack! Lok'tar ogar!"]="The heat comes. Prepare to defend against the elemental attack! Lok'tar ogar!"
G["The heat... I can't take it..."]="The heat... I can't take it..."
G["The heathens will be forced to react. Orcs, bull-men..."]="The heathens will be forced to react. Orcs, bull-men..."
G["The heavens burn!"]="The heavens burn!"
G["The heavens take you!"]="Que os céus os levem!"
G["The herbalist around here is Martha Alliestar. She's over on the inner ring of the Apothecarium."]="A herbapronta por aqui é Martha Alliestar. Ela está no anel interno do Apothecarium."
G["The herbs found in nature can be a powerful ally when combined with respect.  You will want to seek out Bena at her alchemy shop on the middle rise to further your training."]="As ervas encontradas na natureza podem ser um poderoso aliado quando combinadas com respeito. Você vai querer procurar Bena na sua loja de alquimia, no centro, para seguir seu treinamento."
G["The herbs from the fire seem to already be healing this animal.  Thank you!"]="As ervas do fogo parecem estar curando ao animal. Obrigado!"
G["The hero of One Keg returns!"]="$GEl herói: A heroína; de Barrilia voltou!"
G["The hero of Stoneplow! Hi hi."]="$GEl herói: A heroína; de Vilharroca! Onda, onda."
G["The hero."]="O herói."
G["The heroics of the Trollbane bloodline are legendary. I idolize the man.\n\nAnd to find him alive, in the Outland...\n\n<Romus gazes past you.>\n\nWhen I first saw him, I nearly fainted. The shock was overwhelming. As I knelt before him, I had to fight back tears.\n\nYou can bet your sweet behind that I'm going to do everything in my power to make sure the Sons of Lothar are kept safe."]="The heroics of the Trollbane bloodline are legendary. I idolize the man.\n\nAnd to find him alive, in the Outland...\n\n<Romus gazes past you.>\n\nWhen I first saw him, I nearly fainted. The shock was overwhelming. As I knelt before him, I had to fight back tears.\n\nYou can bet your sweet behind that I'm going to do everything in my power to make sure the Sons of Lothar are kept safe."
G["The hieroglyphs on your tablets indicate that there's a way to get this mechanism working again.\n\nWe just need to figure out how..."]="The hieroglyphs on your tablets indicate that there's a way to get this mechanism working again.\n\nWe just need to figure out how..."
G["The high elf Hira Snowdawn teaches Cold Weather Flying.\n\nShe can be found upon her dragonhawk at Krasus' Landing in eastern Dalaran."]="The high elf Hira Snowdawn teaches Cold Weather Flying.\n\nShe can be found upon her dragonhawk at Krasus' Landing in eastern Dalaran."
G["The high elf mage and scholar Dariness is the city's most learned archaeologist... and the most sociable.\n\nShe can often be found in the Legerdemain Lounge, just north of the city's center, enjoying the atmosphere or discussing her wild adventures with the proprieters and patrons both."]="The high elf mage and scholar Dariness is the city's most learned archaeologist... and the most sociable.\n\nShe can often be found in the Legerdemain Lounge, just north of the city's center, enjoying the atmosphere or discussing her wild adventures with the proprieters and patrons both."
G["The high elf spy is escaping.  Get her!"]="The high elf spy is escaping.  Get her!"
G["The high executor and Dame Auriferous are making me wait, but I don't have time for this! My friends are out there dying, $c!"]="O Sumo Executor e a Dama Aurífera me estão fazendo esperar, mas não tenho tempo para isto! Meus amigos estão aí fosse morrendo, $c!"
G["The high priestess is reduced to charcoal."]="The high priestess is reduced to charcoal."
G["The hippogryphs are well-tended by Zaldaan, in the northern part of town."]="The hippogryphs are well-tended by Zaldaan, in the northern part of town."
G["The hippogryphs are well-tended near the Exodar proper. You should journey there if you wish to fly to Blood Watch."]="The hippogryphs are well-tended near the Exodar proper. You should journey there if you wish to fly to Blood Watch."
G["The hissing never stops.  The serpents keep coming!"]="The hissing never stops.  The serpents keep coming!"
G["The honor is mine, to your post!"]="A honra é meu, ao seu posto!"
G["The honor is yours. Signal the fleet."]="The honor is yours. Signal the fleet."
G["The honor of slaying the interlopers shall be mine, brothers! Their feeble bodies will freeze solid from my wind's icy chill!"]="The honor of slaying the interlopers shall be mine, brothers! Their feeble bodies will freeze solid from my wind's icy chill!"
G["The horde cannot be stopped!"]="Ninguém pode parar à Horda!"
G["The horde general is defeated!\n\nThe Alliance is the victor, and the Horde now scrambles to rebuild its weakened forces."]="The horde general is defeated!\n\nThe Alliance is the victor, and the Horde now scrambles to rebuild its weakened forces."
G["The horde is here?!"]="A Horda está aqui?!"
G["The horde shall not defile this land!"]="A Horda não profanará esta terra!"
G["The horn! Use the horn on it while it's weak!"]="O chifre! Usao chifre enquanto está enfraquecido!"
G["The horns of war have sounded! We haven't much time! Quicken your pace!"]="The horns of war have sounded! We haven't much time! Quicken your pace!"
G["The horror known as Carnage is no more.  Could it be that $n is truly worthy of battle in Valhalas?  We shall see."]="O horror conhecido como Carnificina já não existe. É possível que $n mesmo seja $gdigno: digna; de lutar em Valhalas? Já veremos."
G["The horror! THE HORROR!!"]="O horror! O HORROR!"
G["The horrors I witnessed..."]="Os horrores que e presênciado..."
G["The hound appears to pick up a scent from the north and prepares to sprint to its source."]="The hound appears to pick up a scent from the north and prepares to sprint to its source."
G["The hour of redemption is close at hand! Prepare yourselves!"]="A hora da redenção está ao alcance da mão! Preparem-se!"
G["The hour runs late. The message from Silvermoon City is delayed for some reason."]="Se você está fazendo tarde. O mensageiro de Luaprata se você está retrasando por algum motivo."
G["The hours would pass so much more sweetly."]="The hours would pass so much more sweetly."
G["The hozen and the jinyu have always fought, but never like this..."]="Os hozen e os jinyu sempre se têm peleado entre eles, mas nunca desta maneira..."
G["The hozen are many things, but they are not cowards - not for long. If you don't wish to fight them, you must... inspire them!"]="Os hozens são muitas coisas, mas não são covardes – não por muito tempo. Se você não quiser enfrentar os hozens, inspire-os!"
G["The hozen are quite lively indeed. A short-lived race, few hozen survive past their 20th birthday. Their leaders are all 14 or 15. How mature were you at 14 years old? Meditate on that!"]="Os hozens são bem vivazes, porém sua vida é curta - poucos hozens passam do vigésimo aniversário. Seus líderes têm 14 ou 15 anos. O quão maduro você era aos 15 anos? Medite nisso!"
G["The hozen are slippery and cunning. Worse yet, they feel no shame or remorse.\n\nThey kill out of base instinct, for pleasure and for greed."]="The hozen are slippery and cunning. Worse yet, they feel no shame or remorse.\n\nThey kill out of base instinct, for pleasure and for greed."
G["The hozen are stealing our brew!"]="The hozen are stealing our brew!"
G["The hozen came to us once as you do now.\n\nWe felt sorry for them, and taught them how to survive in this land.\n\nOver time, they grew strong and bold, and began to take this land for their own."]="The hozen came to us once as you do now.\n\nWe felt sorry for them, and taught them how to survive in this land.\n\nOver time, they grew strong and bold, and began to take this land for their own."
G["The hozen do not understand peace! They will slaughter our village until none of us remain!"]="The hozen do not understand peace! They will slaughter our village until none of us remain!"
G["The hozen fed my yaks to their pet yeti. This is most bad fortune."]="Os hozen deram de comer a meus yaks aos seus ajudantes yeti. Que mal fortuna."
G["The hozen overfished the area, catching more fish than they could eat."]="The hozen overfished the area, catching more fish than they could eat."
G["The hozen rely on dirty guerilla tactics. Ambushes and traps. It is sad to say, but they seem to outwit us at every turn."]="The hozen rely on dirty guerilla tactics. Ambushes and traps. It is sad to say, but they seem to outwit us at every turn."
G["The hozen revel in torturing their prisoners. Thank you, $c, for saving me from a dire fate."]="The hozen revel in torturing their prisoners. Thank you, $c, for saving me from a dire fate."
G["The hulking statue stands inert, untouched for centuries."]="A estátua gigantesca permanece inerte, intocada por séculos."
G["The hum of magic energy in the air diminishes..."]="The hum of magic energy in the air diminishes..."
G["The human blood in your veins is but a detriment.  Rid yourself of all emotion!"]="The human blood in your veins is but a detriment.  Rid yourself of all emotion!"
G["The humans abandoned us in our darkest hour! Their prince himself led the assault on our lands."]="The humans abandoned us in our darkest hour! Their prince himself led the assault on our lands."
G["The humans and their so-called League of Arathor think to push us out of Arathi Basin.  I think not $c!  Are you ready to be sent there and demonstrate that it is they, and not The Defilers, that will be leaving soon?"]="The humans and their so-called League of Arathor think to push us out of Arathi Basin.  I think not $c!  Are you ready to be sent there and demonstrate that it is they, and not The Defilers, that will be leaving soon?"
G["The humans are in need of your assistance in their fight against The Forsaken at Arathi Basin.  Go to the Hall of Arms and speak with their representative, Donal Osgood."]="Os humanos precisam da sua ajuda na luta contra os Renegados na Bacia Arathi. Vá para o Hall of Arms e fale com o representante deles, Donal Osgood."
G["The humans built an inn on the edge of the Barrens. The Shady Rest, they called it. Weeks ago, it was burned down.\n\nWhy do I care? I don't-not about the humans anyway-but I had a spy placed in that inn and I will not let his death go unanswered. I need to know who did this.\n\nIf you wish to provide assistance, go to the remains of the Shady Rest Inn and return any clues you find to me."]="The humans built an inn on the edge of the Barrens. The Shady Rest, they called it. Weeks ago, it was burned down.\n\nWhy do I care? I don't-not about the humans anyway-but I had a spy placed in that inn and I will not let his death go unanswered. I need to know who did this.\n\nIf you wish to provide assistance, go to the remains of the Shady Rest Inn and return any clues you find to me."
G["The humans claimed much of the Dustwallow Marsh for themselves, but the Stonemaul clan, with our help, has been able to push them back."]="Os humanos reivindicaram grande parte do Dustwallow Marsh por si mesmos, mas o clã Stonemaul, com a nossa ajuda, conseguiu empurrá-os de volta."
G["The humans definitely need all of our help in Arathi Basin.  The one that you wish to speak to is named Keras Wolfheart.  He stands ready to assist you on the Warrior's Terrace."]="Os humanos definitivamente precisam de toda a nossa ajuda na Bacia Arathi. Aquele com quem você deseja falar se chama Keras Wolfheart. Ele está pronto para ajudá-o no Terraço do Guerreiro."
G["The humans of Stormwind cheer for $n."]="The humans of Stormwind cheer for $n."
G["The hunger your weapon feels is but a shade of what awaits. You want to see real hunger? Real power? Continue onward, hero. I am waiting."]="O fome que sente seu arma é somente uma sombra do que espera. Que ver o fome real? O verdadeiro poder? Continue, herói, estou esperando."
G["The hunter became the prey."]="O caçador se transformou em presa."
G["The hunter... becomes... the hunted...."]="The hunter... becomes... the hunted...."
G["The hunting is good here. Birds call down from the canopy. Beasts roar out from the dark, hidden places below.\n\nAnd we keep them in check.\n\nIt's our obligation as hunters - and it's bloody good sport, too."]="The hunting is good here. Birds call down from the canopy. Beasts roar out from the dark, hidden places below.\n\nAnd we keep them in check.\n\nIt's our obligation as hunters - and it's bloody good sport, too."
G["The icepaw bear lays here tranquilized."]="O urso pata de gelo fica aqui tranqüilizado."
G["The illusion shatters and a path to the central chamber opens!"]="A ilusão se quebra e se abra um caminho até a câmera central!"
G["The illusions will not hold back, this time. Their attacks will be relentless. Be prepared to use your strongest healing spells."]="As ilusões não vão parar, desta vez. Os ataques serão impiedosos. Prepare-se para usar suas curas mais poderosas."
G["The important thing is that these jinyu and Alliance have joined forces. Come speak with me, $n. I can give you the final part of our report."]="The important thing is that these jinyu and Alliance have joined forces. Come speak with me, $n. I can give you the final part of our report."
G["The important thing to remember is that we're all here because of our love for explosions!"]="É importantes lembrar que todos estamos aqui porque amamos as explosões!"
G["The incorrect application of the awakening rod causes the dormant vrykul to expire."]="O uso incorreto da vara do despertar é preciso o vrykul em hibernação falhezca."
G["The indigenous rams of Alterac are vital to the functionality of our cavalry!"]="Os carneiros indígenas de Alterac são vitais para a funcionalidade de nossa cavalaria!"
G["The infected nightstalker runts seem to be coming from the north. If I were you, that's where I would start my hunt."]="As runas do Nighttalker infectadas parecem vir do norte. Se eu fosse você, é aí que começaria minha caçada."
G["The infernal is one of the most powerful demons a warlock could hope to have at $Ghis:her; side in battle. The creature is stong, well-armored, and delivers devastating blows upon any foe. If you were to choose to put the spirit of an infernal into your weapon, you would gain some of those benefits--greater health and regeneration and the like.\n\nIf you wish to know more about felhounds, then you should speak to Wytula across from me."]="The infernal is one of the most powerful demons a warlock could hope to have at $Ghis:her; side in battle. The creature is stong, well-armored, and delivers devastating blows upon any foe. If you were to choose to put the spirit of an infernal into your weapon, you would gain some of those benefits--greater health and regeneration and the like.\n\nIf you wish to know more about felhounds, then you should speak to Wytula across from me."
G["The infidel shall be purified, milady!"]="O infiel será purificou, senhora!"
G["The information on this wanted poster indicates that you don't yet qualify for the task at hand.\n\nYou should definitely check back later, though."]="A informações neste cartaz de Se procurando indica que ainda não é capaz de levar a cabo o que pede.\n\nVolta a tentar mais tarde."
G["The information you seek... I cannot give you that freely.  You will have to prove that your enemies are the same as mine."]="The information you seek... I cannot give you that freely.  You will have to prove that your enemies are the same as mine."
G["The ink has dried on this chapter of history..."]="A tinta se tem secado neste capítulo da história..."
G["The inn"]="A pousada"
G["The inn - if you can call it that - is on the upper ring of the Trade Quarter. They don't even have beds."]="A pousada - se você pode chamar assim - fica no anel superior do Trade Quarter. Eles nem têm camas."
G["The inn is located on the main floor, to the right as you enter the building.\n\nI will mark the location on your map."]="A estalagem se encontre na planta principal, nada mais entrar no edifício, à direita.\n\nTe marcarei seu localização no mapa."
G["The inner gates of Ahn'Qiraj crash open."]="As portões interiores de Ahn'Qiraj se abrem."
G["The innkeepers are mad to be giving away treats for free."]="The innkeepers are mad to be giving away treats for free."
G["The interlopers will be stopped, my lord."]="The interlopers will be stopped, my lord."
G["The interrogator is trying to find out what these blood elves are doing here in Nagrand. From what I hear, they're after crystal powder residue from Oshu'gun, the diamond mountain to the west.\n\nNo doubt to use in some insidious scheme or concoction...\n\nIf you are looking to help our cause and stop these blood elves, the conflict is happening right now to the northwest at Halaa. Blood elves and those Hand of Argus soldiers are battling! Join in and show them what's right!"]="The interrogator is trying to find out what these blood elves are doing here in Nagrand. From what I hear, they're after crystal powder residue from Oshu'gun, the diamond mountain to the west.\n\nNo doubt to use in some insidious scheme or concoction...\n\nIf you are looking to help our cause and stop these blood elves, the conflict is happening right now to the northwest at Halaa. Blood elves and those Hand of Argus soldiers are battling! Join in and show them what's right!"
G["The intruders stand fast, brothers, I cannot break them. Allow me a brief respite to strengthen my winds."]="The intruders stand fast, brothers, I cannot break them. Allow me a brief respite to strengthen my winds."
G["The invaders are fast approaching, Malfurion. Give up this ritual, and join the fight!"]="The invaders are fast approaching, Malfurion. Give up this ritual, and join the fight!"
G["The invaders are here!"]="Os invasores estão aqui!"
G["The invaders persist! Hold them off!"]="The invaders persist! Hold them off!"
G["The invisibility liquor is ready for you, $n."]="O licor da invisibilidade está pronto para que te o leve, $n."
G["The invisibility liquor is ready for you, Korekfour."]="O licor de invisibilidade está pronto para você, Korekfour."
G["The iron dwarves followed you! Use the net and the ice slick to escape!"]="The iron dwarves followed you! Use the net and the ice slick to escape!"
G["The iron dwarves have been seen emerging from the bunkers at the base of the pillars straight ahead of you! Destroy the bunkers, and they'll be forced to fall back!"]="The iron dwarves have been seen emerging from the bunkers at the base of the pillars straight ahead of you! Destroy the bunkers, and they'll be forced to fall back!"
G["The ironclad heel of my armored boot should prove to be quite destructive."]="The ironclad heel of my armored boot should prove to be quite destructive."
G["The irony of what I have become is not lost upon me, Lady Sylvanas."]="The irony of what I have become is not lost upon me, Lady Sylvanas."
G["The island swarms with the Empress's minions."]="The island swarms with the Empress's minions."
G["The items you offered were pure, $n.  This new cleansing totem is strong."]="The items you offered were pure, $n.  This new cleansing totem is strong."
G["The jade sings to us. Give! Give!"]="O jade nos canta. Danos! Danos!"
G["The jinyu also have humble origins. Once primitive creatures, they were fortunate enough to live near the enchanted pools within the Vale."]="Os jinyus também tem origens humildes. Outrora criaturas primitivas, eles tiveram a felicidade de viver perto de fontes mágicas no Vale."
G["The jinyu and their waterspeakers stand at the very heart of the greatest events in Pandaria's history."]="Os jinyus e seus parláguas se postam no centro dos principais eventos da história de Pandária."
G["The jinyu are indebted to you and your Alliance!"]="Os jinyu estão em dívida com você e com a Aliança!"
G["The jinyu are ours and Binan Village is next!"]="Os jinyu são nossos e em breve também o será a Aldeia Binan!"
G["The jinyu are proving to be capable soldiers."]="Os jinyu estão demostrando ser soldados competentes."
G["The jinyu may not seem welcoming, but I do believe we prove our good intentions."]="The jinyu may not seem welcoming, but I do believe we prove our good intentions."
G["The jinyu seem to be an ancient race. We will learn their secrets, in time."]="The jinyu seem to be an ancient race. We will learn their secrets, in time."
G["The jormungar collapsed instantly, its head barely still attached to its convulsing body.  My father turned to the dwarf in awe and raised a fist in praise..."]="The jormungar collapsed instantly, its head barely still attached to its convulsing body.  My father turned to the dwarf in awe and raised a fist in praise..."
G["The journal of Jandice Barov is filled with rantings and ravings about the undead. Towards the end of the book is what appears to be a tailoring pattern for the creation of a bag of some sort. Your understanding of tailoring is insufficient to decipher the pattern."]="O diário de Jandice Barov está cheio de críticas e elogios sobre os mortos-vivos. No fim do livro está o que parece ser um padrão de personalização para a criação de algum tipo de bolsa. Sua compreensão de alfaiataria é insuficiente para decifrar o padrão."
G["The journal of Jandice Barov is filled with rantings and ravings about the undead. Towards the end of the book is what appears to be a tailoring pattern for the creation of a felcloth bag. This bag is used by warlocks to store soul shards. Do you wish to copy the pattern into your own journal?"]="O diário de Jandice Barov está cheio de críticas e elogios sobre os mortos-vivos. No fim do livro é o que parece ser um padrão de alfaiataria para a criação de uma sacola de feltro. Esta bolsa é usada por bruxos para armazenar fragmentos de alma. Deseja copiar o padrão no seu próprio diário?"
G["The journal of Jandice Barov is filled with rantings and ravings about the undead. Towards the end of the book is what appears to be a tailoring pattern for the creation of a felcloth bag. This bag is used by warlocks to store soul shards. You already know how to create this bag."]="O diário de Jandice Barov está cheio de críticas e elogios sobre os mortos-vivos. No fim do livro é o que parece ser um padrão de alfaiataria para a criação de uma sacola de feltro. Esta bolsa é usada por bruxos para armazenar fragmentos de alma. Você já sabe como criar esta bolsa."
G["The journey is its own reward, young one. Seek pleasure in a story's telling, and you will come away with riches beyond compare.\n\nAh yes, and one more thing. Those who rise in the ranks of the Lorewalkers are granted a very special gift - the ability to ride upon the clouds."]="The journey is its own reward, young one. Seek pleasure in a story's telling, and you will come away with riches beyond compare.\n\nAh yes, and one more thing. Those who rise in the ranks of the Lorewalkers are granted a very special gift - the ability to ride upon the clouds."
G["The journey to becoming a Serpent Master is a difficult one. Are you up for the challenge?"]="The journey to becoming a Serpent Master is a difficult one. Are you up for the challenge?"
G["The journey was long, but I finally found the Vale. Now I am working with the Sentinels to understand the pools' mysteries."]="Foi um largo viagem, mas finalmente encontrei o vale. Agora colaboro com as Sentinelas para desvelar os mistérios das poços."
G["The kaja'mite has gone and made these monkeys smart! Keep that miner safe, $n."]="A kaja'mita voltou inteligentes aos macacos! Proteger aos mineradores, $n."
G["The keep is ablaze! Bombardiers, where in the Nether are you?!"]="The keep is ablaze! Bombardiers, where in the Nether are you?!"
G["The keep is in northren Stormwind.\n\nJust follow the canals north and you'll eventually come across a drawbridge... that leads into the keep's courtyard."]="The keep is in northren Stormwind.\n\nJust follow the canals north and you'll eventually come across a drawbridge... that leads into the keep's courtyard."
G["The keg bombs are ready. $n, are you going to stop the yaungol?"]="Os barris bomba estão prontos. $n, vai parar aos yaungol?"
G["The keg bursts, dousing %s's flames!"]="The keg bursts, dousing %s's flames!"
G["The keg has been tapped!  The battle begins!  Now raise your glasses with me, as I toast our combatants..."]="The keg has been tapped!  The battle begins!  Now raise your glasses with me, as I toast our combatants..."
G["The keg is tapped!  Now I would like to propose a toast.  Don't worry, I'll keep it short and sweet."]="The keg is tapped!  Now I would like to propose a toast.  Don't worry, I'll keep it short and sweet."
G["The kegs are filled with strong brew!  Drink, friend, and celebrate!"]="Os barris estão cheios de cerveja forte! Beba, amigo e comemore!"
G["The key to victory is control, Wakener. Use my skills to dominate the mind of an enemy, and turn it into an ally."]="The key to victory is control, Wakener. Use my skills to dominate the mind of an enemy, and turn it into an ally."
G["The key... you have to find the key!"]="A chave... Precisa encontrar a chave!"
G["The keystone is completed! We've done it, $n!"]="A pedras angular está completa! O logramos, $n!"
G["The kids jump up and down with youthful energy. (PH emote)"]="The kids jump up and down with youthful energy. (PH emote)"
G["The king bestowed the blade upon my friend, Thalorien Dawnseeker."]="The king bestowed the blade upon my friend, Thalorien Dawnseeker."
G["The king doesn't look north."]="O rei não olhe para o norte."
G["The king is dead - OH NOES!  Summon Mizzle da Crafty!  He knows what to do next!"]="O rei está morto, OH, NÃO! Evocar a Mizzle o Astuto! Sabe que é preciso fazer!"
G["The king is going to speak!"]="O rei vai falar!"
G["The king is only doing what's necessary to keep the city safe."]="The king is only doing what's necessary to keep the city safe."
G["The king is sending a stranger to gather information for him?  I suppose you must be that... what's the word?  $R?  Yes, that $r that rescued Prince Nadun.\n\nAt any rate, I haven't seen any signs of the Neferset scum this far north.  There are plenty of other nuisances to be dealt with, however."]="The king is sending a stranger to gather information for him?  I suppose you must be that... what's the word?  $R?  Yes, that $r that rescued Prince Nadun.\n\nAt any rate, I haven't seen any signs of the Neferset scum this far north.  There are plenty of other nuisances to be dealt with, however."
G["The king wanted Prince Anduin to stay in the vale until he recovered. But the prince insists on wandering around talking to people. What are we to do when a prince wants to disobey his king?\n\nBest to stay close and keep him out of trouble."]="The king wanted Prince Anduin to stay in the vale until he recovered. But the prince insists on wandering around talking to people. What are we to do when a prince wants to disobey his king?\n\nBest to stay close and keep him out of trouble."
G["The king was furious. \"If none of you help, then Ironforge will fall under siege!\""]="O rei ficou furioso. \"Se nenhum de vocês ajudar, Altaforja ficará sob cerco!\""
G["The king was to travel here by ship, in secret. But the ship never arrived, and King Wrynn disappeared."]="The king was to travel here by ship, in secret. But the ship never arrived, and King Wrynn disappeared."
G["The king wishes to be informed about recent Neferset activity."]="O rei deseja informações sobre as atividades recentes dos Neferset."
G["The king's champions have done it: The storm has ended! Forward, Dark Irons! TO BATTLE WE MARCH!"]="Os campeões do Rei o têm conseguido: a tempestade tem amainado! Adiante, Ferro Negro! À BATALHA!"
G["The king's men will protect us.  We're almost there."]="The king's men will protect us.  We're almost there."
G["The king's scouts had discovered that Zandalari trolls threatened the dwarven capital."]="Os batedores do rei descobriram que os trolls Zandalari ameaçavam a capital enânica."
G["The knowledge in this library is astounding."]="O conhecimento que há nesta biblioteca é asombroso."
G["The kobolds are retaking the Coldtooth Mine!"]="Os kobolds estão recuperando a Mina Dentefrio!"
G["The kodos are waiting on the road. Safe journey, $Gbrother:sister;."]="The kodos are waiting on the road. Safe journey, $Gbrother:sister;."
G["The lake has been too lonely these past years. The travelers stopped coming and evil came to these waters."]="The lake has been too lonely these past years. The travelers stopped coming and evil came to these waters."
G["The lake told me it would be so!"]="O lago me disse que seria assim!"
G["The lance is finished. Quickly, hurl it at the sha!"]="A lança está terminada. Rápido, arrójala contra o sha!"
G["The land gave way from under our feet...  I thought I was dead.  I owe you one."]="The land gave way from under our feet...  I thought I was dead.  I owe you one."
G["The land is defiled by the presence of the Scourge on one side and the rituals of the Drakkari on the other.\n\nWe stand resolute betwixt the two."]="The land is defiled by the presence of the Scourge on one side and the rituals of the Drakkari on the other.\n\nWe stand resolute betwixt the two."
G["The land is in great upheaval!\n\nThe Dark One rides forth again with his San'layn, the dragons fight in their great Nexus War, and the vrykul are reawakened.\n\nYour people sail north on your wooden ships to fight them and one another, and we Kalu'ak are caught in the middle.\n\nAnd now some great evil has been done so that the land explodes with the magical power of the world. We must find a safe haven where we will have a chance to survive.\n\nThese two ambassadors make my head hurt... perhaps you can help my people, $r?"]="The land is in great upheaval!\n\nThe Dark One rides forth again with his San'layn, the dragons fight in their great Nexus War, and the vrykul are reawakened.\n\nYour people sail north on your wooden ships to fight them and one another, and we Kalu'ak are caught in the middle.\n\nAnd now some great evil has been done so that the land explodes with the magical power of the world. We must find a safe haven where we will have a chance to survive.\n\nThese two ambassadors make my head hurt... perhaps you can help my people, $r?"
G["The land is in worse shape than I could've imagined. If the damage continues at this rate, Farahlon -- err, Netherstorm will be nothing but cosmic gravel very soon.\n\nWhere will it stop, I wonder? Perhaps the better question is, 'will it stop?'"]="The land is in worse shape than I could've imagined. If the damage continues at this rate, Farahlon -- err, Netherstorm will be nothing but cosmic gravel very soon.\n\nWhere will it stop, I wonder? Perhaps the better question is, 'will it stop?'"
G["The land is scarred, the ever-blooming trees and plants wither and die as the water from the pools drains away."]="The land is scarred, the ever-blooming trees and plants wither and die as the water from the pools drains away."
G["The land of Azshara."]="A terra de Azshara."
G["The land of Feralas has been through much, $r. The earth, the trees, the creatures; they are all changing what Feralas is and will be.\n\nThe Twin Colossals above us remain as a constant, though, throughout all that has happened here..."]="The land of Feralas has been through much, $r. The earth, the trees, the creatures; they are all changing what Feralas is and will be.\n\nThe Twin Colossals above us remain as a constant, though, throughout all that has happened here..."
G["The land of eternal starlight, Kalimdor, was a nurturing mother to all of its creatures. The magic of the Well of Eternity permeated the land and empowered the multitude of flora and fauna that would make the world their home. From this magical ether were born the silithid. It was through the silithid that the brooding Old God would reach and attempt to sunder the world that it once held in its unmerciful grasp."]="The land of eternal starlight, Kalimdor, was a nurturing mother to all of its creatures. The magic of the Well of Eternity permeated the land and empowered the multitude of flora and fauna that would make the world their home. From this magical ether were born the silithid. It was through the silithid that the brooding Old God would reach and attempt to sunder the world that it once held in its unmerciful grasp."
G["The land suffers... and RAGES!"]="The land suffers... and RAGES!"
G["The land suffers... it cries for mercy, $r, it cries for mercy."]="The land suffers... it cries for mercy, $r, it cries for mercy."
G["The land was harsh. Time and again it was Vol'jin and his people who ensured the Horde's survival, saving us from starvation, or taking up arms when we were attacked."]="The land was harsh. Time and again it was Vol'jin and his people who ensured the Horde's survival, saving us from starvation, or taking up arms when we were attacked."
G["The land... cries out."]="A terra... grita."
G["The landing site is secure. We're ready for work to commence."]="A zona de desembarco é certa. As obras podem começar."
G["The language is unfamiliar and for all we know, it's just some soldier's journal."]="O idioma não nos resulta familiar e, pelo que sabemos, poderá não ser mais que o diário de um soldado."
G["The large Quilen seem to be guarding that door. Tread carefully, lest you wake them."]="The large Quilen seem to be guarding that door. Tread carefully, lest you wake them."
G["The large cat doesn't seem quite as big as the hunter lead you to believe."]="O enorme gato não parece tão grande como o caçador você feito acreditar."
G["The large shrine was built many years ago by the night elves that once inhabited this land.\n\nWhat secrets could it hold?"]="The large shrine was built many years ago by the night elves that once inhabited this land.\n\nWhat secrets could it hold?"
G["The largest brewery in Pandaria is the Stormstout Brewery in the Valley of the Four Winds. You might start there if you're looking for adventure.\n\nBrewmasters are also wanderers by nature, and can be found roaming all over the land searching for rare ingredients or concocting new brews.\n\nSuch brewmasters are often found in unique scenarios.\n\nBrewmaster Tzu defends against enemies in the Greenstone Village scenario.\n\nBrewmaster Bo seeks tropical flavors in the Unga Ingoo scenario.\n\nBrewmaster Boof celebrates the season at The Brewmoon Festival scenario, and Brewmaster Blanche is cooking up something shocking in A Brewing Storm."]="The largest brewery in Pandaria is the Stormstout Brewery in the Valley of the Four Winds. You might start there if you're looking for adventure.\n\nBrewmasters are also wanderers by nature, and can be found roaming all over the land searching for rare ingredients or concocting new brews.\n\nSuch brewmasters are often found in unique scenarios.\n\nBrewmaster Tzu defends against enemies in the Greenstone Village scenario.\n\nBrewmaster Bo seeks tropical flavors in the Unga Ingoo scenario.\n\nBrewmaster Boof celebrates the season at The Brewmoon Festival scenario, and Brewmaster Blanche is cooking up something shocking in A Brewing Storm."
G["The largest celebration of the Lunar Festival is taking place in Moonglade. If that's too far to travel to, there are druids offering transport from the Valley of Wisdom."]="A maior festa do Festival Lunar acontece em Moonglade. Se for longe demais para viajar, existem druidas que oferecem transporte do Vale da Sabedoria."
G["The largest celebration of the Lunar Festival takes place in Moonglade. Druids will transport you there from the Elder Rise of Thunder Bluff."]="A maior festa do Festival Lunar acontece em Moonglade. Os druidas o transportarão para lá da Ascensão Ancião do Penhasco do Trovão."
G["The lasher is not fit for mortal hands!"]="The lasher is not fit for mortal hands!"
G["The lashers to the south will eat small creatures, like frogs and parrots.  We, the gorillas, will eat the lashers.  And dinosaurs will eat gorillas.  All this is honorable and natural.\n\nThe humans and orcs also hunt the gorilla, but they take the skin and leave the body to rot.  This is why we attack the humans and orcs."]="The lashers to the south will eat small creatures, like frogs and parrots.  We, the gorillas, will eat the lashers.  And dinosaurs will eat gorillas.  All this is honorable and natural.\n\nThe humans and orcs also hunt the gorilla, but they take the skin and leave the body to rot.  This is why we attack the humans and orcs."
G["The last $c to use that machine got the boot... Or rather, the machine got their boots."]="The last $c to use that machine got the boot... Or rather, the machine got their boots."
G["The last attack in the Eastern Plaguelands yielded a large harvest of dead, from both sides."]="O último ataque nas Terras da Fedor do Este proporcionó uma grande colheita de mortos, de ambos bandos."
G["The last batch of orcs. They should fall quickly!"]="The last batch of orcs. They should fall quickly!"
G["The last newcomers stole our children. What are you here for? Our wives? Our ale?"]="The last newcomers stole our children. What are you here for? Our wives? Our ale?"
G["The last ten strains from Undercity... all of them worthless!"]="As dez últimas cepas de Cidade Baixa... todas elas inútiles!"
G["The last thing I remember is the ship falling and us getting into the pods.  I'll go see how I can help.  Thank you!"]="The last thing I remember is the ship falling and us getting into the pods.  I'll go see how I can help.  Thank you!"
G["The last thing that we needed was for the crazy Drakkari trolls to shoot down a Scourge necropolis in our backyard.\n\nHow did they manage to do that?!"]="The last thing that we needed was for the crazy Drakkari trolls to shoot down a Scourge necropolis in our backyard.\n\nHow did they manage to do that?!"
G["The last warlock who tried this failed as well."]="O último bruxo que o intentó também falhou."
G["The latest blueprints, patterns and schematics are available right here.  These instructions are so simple to follow they practically craft themselves!"]="The latest blueprints, patterns and schematics are available right here.  These instructions are so simple to follow they practically craft themselves!"
G["The lava shall consume you, cold ones!"]="The lava shall consume you, cold ones!"
G["The lava surrounding %s churns!"]="The lava surrounding %s churns!"
G["The lawn was littered with small jade statues. They seemed almost... lifelike."]="O jardim estava cheio de pequenas estátuas de jade. Eram muito... reaprontas."
G["The lawspeaker was right... they've gone insane!"]="O legislador tinha razão... se têm voltado loucos!"
G["The leader of the undead has been destroyed, and the forests will heal in time."]="The leader of the undead has been destroyed, and the forests will heal in time."
G["The leadership of Shattrath is too slow to act, so the great people of the Lower City have taken matters in the Shadow Labyrinth into our own hands."]="A liderança de Shattrath é muito lenta para agir, de modo que o grande povo da Cidade Baixa tomou o assunto no Labirinto das Sombras em nossas próprias mãos."
G["The least you could do is put up a fight!"]="The least you could do is put up a fight!"
G["The legacy of storms shall not be undone."]="The legacy of storms shall not be undone."
G["The legendary power of the Titans is mine to command!"]="The legendary power of the Titans is mine to command!"
G["The legion of Blackrock comes, dwarflings! We shall scorch the earth and set fire to the heavens. None shall survive..."]="The legion of Blackrock comes, dwarflings! We shall scorch the earth and set fire to the heavens. None shall survive..."
G["The legion will conquer all!"]="A legião o conquistará tudo!"
G["The lesser races will learn to once again fear the mogu!"]="The lesser races will learn to once again fear the mogu!"
G["The lesser spirits were imprisoned ages ago, never to return! I chose the guardians myself! What have you done?"]="The lesser spirits were imprisoned ages ago, never to return! I chose the guardians myself! What have you done?"
G["The lesson is clear. From here on out, I'm taking the initiative."]="Aprendi a lecção. A partir de agora, eu tomo a iniciativa."
G["The lesson of true wisdom lies within you dear heroes, and in the choices you make. When faced with overwhelming darkness, will you make the right decisions?"]="The lesson of true wisdom lies within you dear heroes, and in the choices you make. When faced with overwhelming darkness, will you make the right decisions?"
G["The lesson we've learned here in the Barrens is that nothing short of scorched earth will rout these Horde animals. No quarter!"]="A lição que aprendemos aqui em Barrens é que nada menos que terra arrasada derrotará esses animais da Horda. Sem piedade!"
G["The ley line beneath this night elf temple is now flowing into the Azure Dragonshrine. Our brothers should have all the power they need to crush our enemies."]="A linha Ley baixo este templo dos elfos da noite fluye agora para o Santuário de Dragões Lazúli. Nossos irmãos devem ter tudo o poder necessário para aplastar a nossos inimigos."
G["The lich, Kel'Thuzad. He serves the Lich King without question, a necromancer of great prowess in life, turned into a master of necromancy after his death. It is said he is the most loyal of the Lich King's subjects."]="The lich, Kel'Thuzad. He serves the Lich King without question, a necromancer of great prowess in life, turned into a master of necromancy after his death. It is said he is the most loyal of the Lich King's subjects."
G["The life of a smith is not an easy one, but it puts steel in yer bones and fire in yer heart. My da' was a smith, my grandfather before him in the forges beneath Grim Batol. And now my son follows in our footsteps, that boy makes me proud."]="A vida de um ferreiro não é fácil, mas coloca aço nos seus ossos e fogo no seu coração. Meu para era um ferreiro, meu avô diante dele nas forjas sob Grim Batol. E agora meu filho segue nossos passos, aquele garoto me deixa orgulhoso."
G["The light appears to have forsaken us."]="The light appears to have forsaken us."
G["The light blinds me!"]="The light blinds me!"
G["The light cleanses; but it is not gentle.  Gird yourselves and be purified!"]="A luz purga, mas não é indulgente. Preparem-se para ser purificados!"
G["The light does not abandon its champions."]="A luz não abandona aos seus campeões."
G["The light of the Sun illuminates the path to wisdom.  Where shall we walk today, friend?"]="A luz do sol ilumina o caminho para a sabedoria. Para onde vamos andar hoje, amigo?"
G["The light will not suffer your taint."]="A luz não tolerará sua impurezas."
G["The light will prevail."]="A Luz prevalecerá!"
G["The light...mustn't burn out..."]="The light...mustn't burn out..."
G["The light...returns..."]="A luz... volta..."
G["The line is secured to his ankle.  Pull away to trip him!"]="The line is secured to his ankle.  Pull away to trip him!"
G["The link to the portal must be broken! Quickly, to Stormrage!"]="Devemos destruir o vínculo do portal! É preciso encontrar a Tempestira!"
G["The liquids and mixtures all bubble and spasm as you approach. Next to the equipment lies a large pair of tongs that look as though they would be adequate for dropping in samples of ooze.\n\nThere is safety gear present, but it appears to be dusty and well-ignored.\n\nDo you place some of your samples into the beakers?"]="The liquids and mixtures all bubble and spasm as you approach. Next to the equipment lies a large pair of tongs that look as though they would be adequate for dropping in samples of ooze.\n\nThere is safety gear present, but it appears to be dusty and well-ignored.\n\nDo you place some of your samples into the beakers?"
G["The liquids and mixtures all bubble and spasm as you approach. Next to the equipment lies a large pair of tongs that look as though they would be adequate for dropping in samples of ooze.\n\nThere is safety gear present, but it appears to be dusty and well-ignored.\n\nYou don't think touching anything would be wise."]="The liquids and mixtures all bubble and spasm as you approach. Next to the equipment lies a large pair of tongs that look as though they would be adequate for dropping in samples of ooze.\n\nThere is safety gear present, but it appears to be dusty and well-ignored.\n\nYou don't think touching anything would be wise."
G["The list of Skyguard members is long and distinguished.  $n tops that list."]="A pronta de membros da Guarda do céu é larga e distinguida. $n é o melhor dessa pronta."
G["The little feller be hidin' in one o' them boxes, matey. G'luck!"]="A coleguita está escondida em uma das caixas, amigo. Sorte!"
G["The little spirit is helping us! Fight near him, hero!"]="O pequeno espírito nos ajuda! Luta perto de ele, herói!"
G["The living are here!"]="Os vivos estão aqui!"
G["The living are not welcome here!"]="Os vivos não são bem-vindos!"
G["The living do not belong here."]="Este não é o lugar dos vivos!"
G["The living... here?!"]="Os vivos? Aqui!?"
G["The lizard folk around here are likely to carry anything. Watch for 'em!"]="The lizard folk around here are likely to carry anything. Watch for 'em!"
G["The local artificer, Daelo, can teach you the basics of engineering. Perhaps you can help our technician fix that malfunctioning communications device!"]="O artífice local, Daelo, pode ensinar o básico da engenharia. Talvez você possa ajudar nosso técnica a consertar esse dispositivo de comunicação com defeito!"
G["The local earth spirit, Hui, is angry that we hired adventurers to drive off his mischievous sprites."]="The local earth spirit, Hui, is angry that we hired adventurers to drive off his mischievous sprites."
G["The locals here certainly have an idyllic lifestyle. It makes me wonder if I should lay down my wand and pick up a hoe."]="Esta gente leva uma vida idílica. Fazem que me pergunta se deveria deixar a varinha e pegar uma azada."
G["The locals here insist that the great healing waters we seek are no further than a certain... Stormstout Brewery. We may have to investigate their claims."]="The locals here insist that the great healing waters we seek are no further than a certain... Stormstout Brewery. We may have to investigate their claims."
G["The logistics involved in the optimal celebration of Pilgrim's Bounty are quite staggering... so many raw materials, so much labor, thousands upon thousands of crates of finished product shipped here and there and everywhere for countless Bountiful Tables.\n\nHonestly, I'm quite impressed! And hungry... I can smell pumpkin pie. Can you smell that pie?"]="The logistics involved in the optimal celebration of Pilgrim's Bounty are quite staggering... so many raw materials, so much labor, thousands upon thousands of crates of finished product shipped here and there and everywhere for countless Bountiful Tables.\n\nHonestly, I'm quite impressed! And hungry... I can smell pumpkin pie. Can you smell that pie?"
G["The lone wolf dies but the pack survives."]="O lobo solitário morre, mas a manda sobrevive."
G["The long reload takes some getting used to, but nothing else is better for starting off a fight."]="The long reload takes some getting used to, but nothing else is better for starting off a fight."
G["The long walk from the monastery was murder on my feet - and on my appetite. I think I'll spend a while here loading up on energy before I think about standing up again."]="The long walk from the monastery was murder on my feet - and on my appetite. I think I'll spend a while here loading up on energy before I think about standing up again."
G["The longer I stay here, the more I am charmed by this strange land."]="Quanto mais tempo passo aqui, mais me gosta esta terra estranha."
G["The longer we spend standing here the sooner Garrosh's men are going to find us."]="The longer we spend standing here the sooner Garrosh's men are going to find us."
G["The longer you wait, the less future you have for me to foretell."]="The longer you wait, the less future you have for me to foretell."
G["The longhouse is destroyed! Alarms can be heard in the distance."]="A casa comunal está destruído! Se oyen alarmas ao longe."
G["The lords of the elemental planes are beings of pure chaos, Nazgrim."]="Os senhores dos planos elementais são seres de puro caos, Nazgrim."
G["The lords of the elemental planes are beings of pure chaos, captain."]="Os senhores dos planos elementais são seres de puro caos, capitão."
G["The loss of Wilfred Fizzlebang, while unfortunate, should be a lesson to those that dare dabble in dark magic. Alas, you are victorious and now must face the next challenge."]="The loss of Wilfred Fizzlebang, while unfortunate, should be a lesson to those that dare dabble in dark magic. Alas, you are victorious and now must face the next challenge."
G["The loss of our comrades was unpreventable. They lived and died in the service of the Argent Crusade."]="The loss of our comrades was unpreventable. They lived and died in the service of the Argent Crusade."
G["The loss of the raccoon is the least of our worries. Our biggest concern is that petrified orc... and what its presence means. I can tell you the rest of the story."]="The loss of the raccoon is the least of our worries. Our biggest concern is that petrified orc... and what its presence means. I can tell you the rest of the story."
G["The lunar celebration this year is quite magnificent!"]="A celebração lunar deste ano é bastante magnífica!"
G["The lure of power is great. Mistakes were made."]="The lure of power is great. Mistakes were made."
G["The machine adjusts to face you.\n\nOn the back of the machine is an empty, oddly misshapen slot with an engraving that reads: \"Propirtee o' Cap'n Gelkak Gyromast\""]="The machine adjusts to face you.\n\nOn the back of the machine is an empty, oddly misshapen slot with an engraving that reads: \"Propirtee o' Cap'n Gelkak Gyromast\""
G["The machine comes alive at your touch."]="A máquina ganha vida ao seu toque."
G["The machine has been destroyed, and so the mogu's power weakens."]="A máquina foi destruído e o poder dos mogu se debilita."
G["The machine hums to life!  Get to the lower level!"]="A máquina volta à vida! Baixa ao nível inferior!"
G["The mage tower to the north."]="A torre do mago ao norte."
G["The mages may be found in Cleft of Shadow.  There are two entrances: One between the valleys of Strength and Wisdom, and the other in The Drag."]="Os magos podem ser encontrados em Cleft of Shadow. Existem duas entradas: uma entre os vales da força e da sabedoria e a outra em The Drag."
G["The mages of Dalaran are the most powerful in Azeroth!  We will not fail!"]="The mages of Dalaran are the most powerful in Azeroth!  We will not fail!"
G["The magi congregate in the Wizard's Sanctum in the Mage Quarter. Quite a tower they have there. Makes our barracks look like peasant hovels."]="Os magos se reúnem no Santuário dos Magos no bairro dos Magos. Bastante uma torre que eles têm lá. Faz nossos quartéis parecerem choupanas de camponeses."
G["The magic emanating from this area is fascinating, $c. I'm anxious to study their artifacts. There is so much we can learn."]="A magia que emana desta zona é fascinante, $c. Estou ansioso por estudar seus artefatos. Temos muito que aprender."
G["The magic of the pools expanded their minds and grew their bodies, until they became one of the great ancient cultures of Pandaria."]="A magia das fontes expandiu suas mentes e corpos, até que eles se tornaram uma das grandes culturas ancestrais de Pandária."
G["The magic of the wand appears to take hold on %s, but then it fades."]="A magia da varinha parece domínio a %s, mas se desaparece."
G["The magic of today pales in comparison to that of millennia past. Still, we Highborne know much of the arcane. Are you ready to learn?"]="A magia de hoje empalidece em comparação com a do milênio passado. Ainda assim, os Altaneiros conhecem grande parte do arcano. Você está pronto para aprender?"
G["The magic required to move Dalaran was too great!  We cannot hold it back forever!"]="The magic required to move Dalaran was too great!  We cannot hold it back forever!"
G["The magic that makes that disguise possible will hold up only a few minutes. I will teleport you directly into the heart of Blackmaw Hold. Enter into negotiations with their Chieftain immediately... and be prepared to fight your way out."]="The magic that makes that disguise possible will hold up only a few minutes. I will teleport you directly into the heart of Blackmaw Hold. Enter into negotiations with their Chieftain immediately... and be prepared to fight your way out."
G["The magical wards at that point should be supported enough by the energy flux to contain the entity."]="The magical wards at that point should be supported enough by the energy flux to contain the entity."
G["The magister's going to kill me..."]="O magíster me vai matar..."
G["The magisters are the traitors! They have sealed our doom."]="Os magistri são os traidores! Têm selado nosso destino."
G["The magisters are wise and will plot a prosperous course for our future."]="The magisters are wise and will plot a prosperous course for our future."
G["The magisters will guide us back to glory."]="The magisters will guide us back to glory."
G["The magistrate is very busy."]="O magistrado está muito ocupado."
G["The magistrix will be happy to know  I'm  fluent in Thalassian.  Your courtesy is not lost on me."]="The magistrix will be happy to know  I'm  fluent in Thalassian.  Your courtesy is not lost on me."
G["The magma lord is a little... indisposed right now.  Stick around, this won't take more than a minute or two."]="The magma lord is a little... indisposed right now.  Stick around, this won't take more than a minute or two."
G["The magnataur are not as stupid as they appear. Keeping Gormok until his time is a difficult task, but he is bound tightly enough that there is no danger."]="O magnatauro não é tão estúpido quanto parece. Manter Gormok até o seu tempo é uma tarefa difícil, mas ele é amarrado o suficiente para que não haja perigo."
G["The maiden, eh? Hmm, I remember that's what my father used to call that river to the north. Other than that, I wouldn't have the slightest clue."]="The maiden, eh? Hmm, I remember that's what my father used to call that river to the north. Other than that, I wouldn't have the slightest clue."
G["The mailbox is in the Trade Quarter by that coffin storage closet they call an inn."]="A caixa de correio fica no Trade Quarter, perto do armário de caixões que eles chamam de pousada."
G["The main chamber is this way! Let's go!"]="A câmera principal está por aqui! Vamos!"
G["The man to talk to about gunnery is Buliwyf, found in the Timberline Arms within Ironforge."]="O homem com quem conversar sobre artilharia é Buliwyf, encontrado no Timberline Arms em Ironforge."
G["The mana bomb!"]="A bomba de mana!"
G["The mana cells within the Eye of the Storm are a precious thing; we cannot afford to lose them to the draenei! You there! Make yourself useful and aid us in the fight!"]="As células de mana dentro do Olho da Tormenta são uma coisa preciosa; não podemos nos dar ao luxo de perdê-os para os draeneis! Você aí! Seja útil e ajude-nos na luta!"
G["The manor... someone else... will soon be consumed..."]="A casa... alguém mais... pronto se consumirá"
G["The mantid are attacking, and we are shamefully unprepared.\n\nUnder normal circumstances, our enemy is quite predictable. We anticipated that the next full-scale mantid attack would hit in about ten years, as they do so regularly every hundred.\n\nThis current invasion is hardly \"full-scale\", but it's still strong enough to catch a farming village unawares. Had my Shado-Pan not been keeping such a watchful vigil on the wall, Stoneplow might have already fallen."]="The mantid are attacking, and we are shamefully unprepared.\n\nUnder normal circumstances, our enemy is quite predictable. We anticipated that the next full-scale mantid attack would hit in about ten years, as they do so regularly every hundred.\n\nThis current invasion is hardly \"full-scale\", but it's still strong enough to catch a farming village unawares. Had my Shado-Pan not been keeping such a watchful vigil on the wall, Stoneplow might have already fallen."
G["The mantid are coming over the wall!"]="Os mantídeos estão saltando a muralha!"
G["The mantid are harsh teachers."]="Os mantídeos são professores severos."
G["The mantid are under MY command, fools. See how she succumbs to me."]="The mantid are under MY command, fools. See how she succumbs to me."
G["The mantid artillery is here, you must hurry heroes!"]="The mantid artillery is here, you must hurry heroes!"
G["The mantid besiege you from all sides."]="The mantid besiege you from all sides."
G["The mantid?! I always thought they were a spooky legend pandaren tell their children."]="The mantid?! I always thought they were a spooky legend pandaren tell their children."
G["The mantle of a commander is a heavier burden than I had expected."]="A túnica de comandante é uma carga mais pesada do que achava."
G["The mantle of a god must be heavy to bear."]="O manto de um deus deve ser muito pesado."
G["The map shows a naval strategy for defeating the Horde fleet."]="O mapa mostra uma estratégia naval para derrotar à frota da Horda."
G["The march upon the Undercity begins now! Be empowered by your King's strength! Follow me, heroes! FOR THE GLORY OF THE ALLIANCE!"]="The march upon the Undercity begins now! Be empowered by your King's strength! Follow me, heroes! FOR THE GLORY OF THE ALLIANCE!"
G["The market sure looks busy today."]="The market sure looks busy today."
G["The marketing research Megs has conducted suggests that a naga invasion is imminent!"]="O estudo de marketing que tem realizado Megs sugiere que a invasão naga é iminente!"
G["The markings of this tablet show ancient diagrams and hold dire words of power, but their meaning is inscrutable to you."]="As marcações deste tablet mostram diagramas antigos e contêm terríveis palavras de poder, mas seu significado é inescrutável para você."
G["The markings of this tablet show ancient diagrams and hold dire words of power.\n\nYou believe it is an alchemical recipe, but it is beyond your skill..."]="The markings of this tablet show ancient diagrams and hold dire words of power.\n\nYou believe it is an alchemical recipe, but it is beyond your skill..."
G["The markings on this tablet show ancient diagrams and dire words of power, used to create  Gurubashi Mojo Madness..."]="As marcações neste tablet mostram diagramas antigos e terríveis palavras de poder, usadas para criar Gurubashi Mojo Madness..."
G["The marmots get mad if they see you ruining their holes. Just nudge them out of the way first, and they'll leave you alone."]="The marmots get mad if they see you ruining their holes. Just nudge them out of the way first, and they'll leave you alone."
G["The marsh out here smells almost as bad as Onyxia's breath!"]="Esta zona da marisma fede quase tanto como o fôlego de Onyxia."
G["The masquerade is over, Lady Prestor. Or should I call you by your true name... Onyxia..."]="A farsa se terminou, Lady Prestor. OU... deveria chamar você pelo seu verdadeiro nome... Onyxia..."
G["The massive floating eyeball in the center of the chamber turns its gaze upon you. You stand before a god."]="O enorme olho que frota no centro da câmera dirige seu olhar cima ti. Te encontrar ante um deus."
G["The master calls."]="O amo nos chama."
G["The master cannot wait any longer for these artifacts."]="O mestre não pode esperar mais tempo por estes artefatos."
G["The master comes."]="Vem o amo."
G["The master desires your full obedience and you will comply!"]="The master desires your full obedience and you will comply!"
G["The master has business in the rooms above."]="O mestre tem assuntos que atender nas habitações de cima."
G["The master has fallen!  Avenge him, my brethren!"]="O mestre tem caído! Vengadle, irmãos!"
G["The master is busy, but I have time to come out and play!"]="O mestre está ocupado, mas eu tenog tempo para sair a jogar."
G["The master is meeting with his apprentice."]="O mestre está reuniu com o seu aprendiz."
G["The master surveyed his kingdom and found it... Lacking. His judgement was swift and without mercy: DEATH TO ALL!"]="O mestre observó seu reino e o encontrou... incompleta. Seu juízo foi rápido e impiedoso: MORTE A TODOS!"
G["The master was clearly speaking to you, Valiona. I am far too busy to attack ANYONE."]="The master was clearly speaking to you, Valiona. I am far too busy to attack ANYONE."
G["The master was right... to be concerned."]="O mestre tinha razão... ao estar preocupado."
G["The master will avenge me!!"]="The master will avenge me!!"
G["The master will be most pleased with this news. The Black Dragonflight will provide you all that you ask. You will be allowed to ride upon the backs of our drakes as needed."]="The master will be most pleased with this news. The Black Dragonflight will provide you all that you ask. You will be allowed to ride upon the backs of our drakes as needed."
G["The master will be with you momentarily."]="O mestre estará com você em um momento."
G["The master will end everything!"]="O mestre pondrá fim a tudo!"
G["The master will know of this incursion. You will be hunted for all eternity!"]="The master will know of this incursion. You will be hunted for all eternity!"
G["The master will not suffer this insult!"]="O mestre não tolerará este insulto!"
G["The master will see you all consumed."]="O mestre os consumirá a todos."
G["The master's grasp is not so easily severed..."]="O vínculo do mestre não se curto tão facilmente..."
G["The master's power takes on many forms..."]="O poder do mestre adquiere muitas formas..."
G["The master's sanctum has been disturbed!"]="O sacrário do mestre foi perturbado."
G["The master's will is done."]="Se tem concluído a vontade do mestre."
G["The master... will be angry...."]="O mestre... se enfadará..."
G["The materials I offer are rare and powerful."]="Os materiais que ofereço são raros e poderosos."
G["The materials you have gathered from that cursed old keep will certainly make a worthy bow."]="The materials you have gathered from that cursed old keep will certainly make a worthy bow."
G["The matriarch knocked me right out of the sky. I'm lucky to be alive."]="The matriarch knocked me right out of the sky. I'm lucky to be alive."
G["The meddlers shall pay for their interference. Retreat to the shadows!"]="The meddlers shall pay for their interference. Retreat to the shadows!"
G["The memorial park to Antonidas is located in northern Dalaran."]="O parque memorial de Antonidas está localizado no norte de Dalaran."
G["The memories in this locket swirl in anguish. Such pain and suffering... let us see what it wants to show us."]="The memories in this locket swirl in anguish. Such pain and suffering... let us see what it wants to show us."
G["The memories rush back, Thrall."]="The memories rush back, Thrall."
G["The men and women of Honor Hold have shed such blood and have lost their youth in this monstrous land... and yet they still hold their spirits high!\n\nNow, you and your cohorts from Azeroth can help us turn the tide.  You give us hope that we may one day return to our homelands."]="Os homens e mulheres de Bastião do Honra têm derramado muita sangue e perderam aos seus filhos nesta horrível terra... E a pesar disso, seguem lutando com a moral alta!\n\nAgora, você e seus seguidores de Azeroth podem ajudar a que cambien as tornas. Obrigado você voltou a esperança de voltar a nossas terras."
G["The men will be glad to have you with us, Lord Zhu."]="The men will be glad to have you with us, Lord Zhu."
G["The merchant known as Griftah has been exiled from this city for his fraudulent activities. We plan to go over these little knick-knacks he sells extremely carefully. Please, leave his stall undisturbed and let us do our work."]="O comerciante conhecido como Griftah foi exilado desta cidade pelas suas atividades fraudulentas. Planejamos repassar essas pequenas bugigangas que ele vende com muito cuidado. Por favor, deixe sua barraca imperturbável e deixe-nos fazer nosso trabalho."
G["The metal has lost its magic. I could make a weapon from it, but it would be no different from a mundane blade."]="O metal perdeu seu magia. Poderá fazer um arma com ele, mas não seria diferente de uma lâmina convencional."
G["The metal was salvageable.  I should be able to reforge the weapon as a sword or a dagger."]="The metal was salvageable.  I should be able to reforge the weapon as a sword or a dagger."
G["The metal's magical properties are gone! It can still be worked, but not by conventional smithing methods."]="The metal's magical properties are gone! It can still be worked, but not by conventional smithing methods."
G["The metals do not speak to me as the elements speak to you, but I hope that you will find this weapon worthy. King Wrynn and your farseer both have great confidence in your abilities."]="The metals do not speak to me as the elements speak to you, but I hope that you will find this weapon worthy. King Wrynn and your farseer both have great confidence in your abilities."
G["The method of your cleansing lies within your grasp..."]="A importante para o seu purificação jaz ante ti..."
G["The middle fragment of the World Pillar has been dug up and is missing!"]="Têm desenterrado o fragmento central do Pilar do Mundo e sumiu!"
G["The might of the dwarves is represented today by the Grand Champion of Ironforge, Lana Stouthammer!"]="The might of the dwarves is represented today by the Grand Champion of Ironforge, Lana Stouthammer!"
G["The mightiest of all the beasts that make up the Ashenvale Hunt, Sharptalon is let to wander freely by the self-proclaimed guardians of this land, the night elves.  Sharptalon patrols for prey to the south of here, taking delight in rending the unsuspecting and unaware traveler limb from limb.\n\nTo bring down such a beast would be the mightiest of hauls, $n.  I wish you luck in the hunt for this creature!"]="The mightiest of all the beasts that make up the Ashenvale Hunt, Sharptalon is let to wander freely by the self-proclaimed guardians of this land, the night elves.  Sharptalon patrols for prey to the south of here, taking delight in rending the unsuspecting and unaware traveler limb from limb.\n\nTo bring down such a beast would be the mightiest of hauls, $n.  I wish you luck in the hunt for this creature!"
G["The mighty Zar'thik bend the wind to their will!"]="Os poderosos Zar'thik controlam o vento ao seu vontade!"
G["The mighty fortress carved within the fiery bowels of Blackrock Mountain was held by the sinister Dark Iron dwarves for centuries until Nefarian - the cunning son of the dragon, Deathwing - took control of the upper Spire and made war on the dwarves' holdings in the mountain's volcanic depths. Realizing that the dwarves were led by the mighty fire elemental, Ragnaros - Nefarian vowed to crush his enemies and claim the whole of Blackrock mountain for himself."]="The mighty fortress carved within the fiery bowels of Blackrock Mountain was held by the sinister Dark Iron dwarves for centuries until Nefarian - the cunning son of the dragon, Deathwing - took control of the upper Spire and made war on the dwarves' holdings in the mountain's volcanic depths. Realizing that the dwarves were led by the mighty fire elemental, Ragnaros - Nefarian vowed to crush his enemies and claim the whole of Blackrock mountain for himself."
G["The mighty hunter, $n returns.  Tell me the tale of stalking your latest prey."]="The mighty hunter, $n returns.  Tell me the tale of stalking your latest prey."
G["The mind has untold powers that we have not yet discovered. With balance and wisdom, it may be possible to unlock these powers of the mind.\n\nThe Dream Brew is only a tool that produces a temporary period of this all-seeing state."]="The mind has untold powers that we have not yet discovered. With balance and wisdom, it may be possible to unlock these powers of the mind.\n\nThe Dream Brew is only a tool that produces a temporary period of this all-seeing state."
G["The mine cart is prepped and ready to go."]="O carrinho da mina está pronto e pronto para ser usado."
G["The mine is lost. All of our defenders have perished and the miners resurrected as Scourge aberrations!"]="Temos perdido a mina. Todos nossos defensores têm morto e os mineradores têm ressuscitado como aberrações do Flagelo!"
G["The miner here works in the War Quarter on the inner ring. His name's Brom Killian."]="O mineiro aqui trabalha no Bairro da Guerra no anel interno. O nome dele é Brom Killian."
G["The mineral shipment from the Dunshire mine still hasn't arrived. I want to go and demand an answer in person, but I've been warned the road is dangerous."]="The mineral shipment from the Dunshire mine still hasn't arrived. I want to go and demand an answer in person, but I've been warned the road is dangerous."
G["The miners can be found within Silvermoon City, no doubt close to the odiferous forges where they smelt their gains."]="Os mineiros podem ser encontrados dentro da Cidade da Lua Prateada, sem dúvida perto das forjas odíferas onde eles sentiram seus ganhos."
G["The mines have been at peak efficiency under your leadership, despite the worms and lazy trolls."]="The mines have been at peak efficiency under your leadership, despite the worms and lazy trolls."
G["The minute they put on that Alliance tabard, they died. I will NOT tolerate any lingering ties across enemy lines. Traitors to the Horde will die a traitor's death!"]="The minute they put on that Alliance tabard, they died. I will NOT tolerate any lingering ties across enemy lines. Traitors to the Horde will die a traitor's death!"
G["The mist dissipates..."]="A névoa se dissipa..."
G["The mist envelops you in its grip!"]="A névoa te envuelve!"
G["The mist is death... senseless, without compassion."]="A névoa está morta... inconsciente, sem compasão."
G["The mist senses your presence!"]="The mist senses your presence!"
G["The mist will lead the way."]="A névoa nos mostrará o caminho."
G["The mistress will pay me handsomely for your heads!"]="A senhora me pagará muito bem pelas suas cabeças!"
G["The mists are now leaving my body. I will remain in this world as long as I can. As long as it takes."]="The mists are now leaving my body. I will remain in this world as long as I can. As long as it takes."
G["The mists around the Altar of Hethiss dissipate as Venoxis prepares a powerful spell!"]="The mists around the Altar of Hethiss dissipate as Venoxis prepares a powerful spell!"
G["The mists hide many secrets ... if you know where to look."]="A névoa oculta muitos segredos. É preciso saber onde procurar..."
G["The mixture is finished, $n.  Now we must save the child."]="A mistura está terminada, $n. Agora devemos superando ao ninho."
G["The mixture!  It moves!"]="A mistura! Se move!"
G["The mogu ambushed us while we were trying to retreat from the mantid."]="The mogu ambushed us while we were trying to retreat from the mantid."
G["The mogu and Zandalari are in the process of moving another shipment of treasures from Lei Shen's tomb to his throne room.  We will strike quickly and take as much as we can before his forces arrive.  You will only have a limited time before we pull you out, so be efficient $n.\nWe're only getting one shot at this, so make it count.\nWhen you're ready to begin, hand me the key and I'll open the door."]="The mogu and Zandalari are in the process of moving another shipment of treasures from Lei Shen's tomb to his throne room.  We will strike quickly and take as much as we can before his forces arrive.  You will only have a limited time before we pull you out, so be efficient $n.\nWe're only getting one shot at this, so make it count.\nWhen you're ready to begin, hand me the key and I'll open the door."
G["The mogu and Zandalari cower behind the Thunder King's walls. Lady Jaina has a plan to blast our way through. Speak to me when you're ready!"]="The mogu and Zandalari cower behind the Thunder King's walls. Lady Jaina has a plan to blast our way through. Speak to me when you're ready!"
G["The mogu are a mighty threat, but they're nothing compared to the horrors my men and I have faced in the Dread Wastes. I have no doubts that we can hold the Vale."]="The mogu are a mighty threat, but they're nothing compared to the horrors my men and I have faced in the Dread Wastes. I have no doubts that we can hold the Vale."
G["The mogu are an ancient civilization spanning back thousands of years. Perhaps we can learn somethin' from 'em!"]="Os mogu são uma civilização antiga que existe desde há milhares de anos. ao melhor podemos aprender algo de eles!"
G["The mogu are attacking Niuzao Temple. We need your help."]="Os mogu atacando o Templo de Niuzao. precisamos da sua ajuda."
G["The mogu are attacking the temple!"]="Os mogu atacando o templo!"
G["The mogu are cruel captors. We should not risk any time if any of our brave warriors have fallen into their hands."]="The mogu are cruel captors. We should not risk any time if any of our brave warriors have fallen into their hands."
G["The mogu are our enemy. They seek to eliminate us from this world. Why should we believe the creation myths that they feed us?"]="The mogu are our enemy. They seek to eliminate us from this world. Why should we believe the creation myths that they feed us?"
G["The mogu are preparing for something big. We've got to stop them from getting ahold of any more ancient weapons."]="Os mogu se estão preparando para algo grande. Temos que impedir que se apoderen de mais armas antigas."
G["The mogu are usually thugs and brigands. They never struck me as having the patience for arcane magics."]="The mogu are usually thugs and brigands. They never struck me as having the patience for arcane magics."
G["The mogu broke through our defenses...\n\nTheir army of jade soldiers was too much for us to hold back.\n\nI stayed behind to take care of Che, but the others retreated to the city to make their last stand."]="The mogu broke through our defenses...\n\nTheir army of jade soldiers was too much for us to hold back.\n\nI stayed behind to take care of Che, but the others retreated to the city to make their last stand."
G["The mogu chose the worst time to attack. The mantid are on the move, and not even the great wall will hold them back."]="The mogu chose the worst time to attack. The mantid are on the move, and not even the great wall will hold them back."
G["The mogu claim to have created us... to have twisted us into our current forms. Do not believe their lies.\n\nWe are our own people, evolved from the great creator, Kros himself!"]="The mogu claim to have created us... to have twisted us into our current forms. Do not believe their lies.\n\nWe are our own people, evolved from the great creator, Kros himself!"
G["The mogu emperor then ordered all of the saurok to be purged. He tried to wipe out their entire race, to no avail. They still plague Pandaria to this day."]="O imperador mogu então ordenou que todos os saruoks fossem eliminados. Ele tentou exterminar a raça saurok inteira, mas não conseguiu. Ainda hoje eles assolam Pandária."
G["The mogu empire was overthrown centuries ago. These ruins have been here - and abandoned - for as long as anyone can remember. \n\nWhy would they come back now?"]="The mogu empire was overthrown centuries ago. These ruins have been here - and abandoned - for as long as anyone can remember. \n\nWhy would they come back now?"
G["The mogu forge weapons of both blood and steel. Their blades feast on death."]="The mogu forge weapons of both blood and steel. Their blades feast on death."
G["The mogu grew restless. Many generations later, when Thunder King united them, they seized upon their legacy!"]="Os mogus começaram a ficar inquietos. Muitas gerações depois, quando o Rei Trovão os uniu, eles reivindicaram o seu legado!"
G["The mogu had stolen the bell, what is a hozen to do?"]="Os mogus roubaram o sino, o que podia fazer um hozen?"
G["The mogu have a way about them that implies leadership. Use caution."]="The mogu have a way about them that implies leadership. Use caution."
G["The mogu held considerable power over the stones of the earth. Their magic lingers on, even centuries later."]="The mogu held considerable power over the stones of the earth. Their magic lingers on, even centuries later."
G["The mogu lie to our people. They tell us that we are their creation, that they twisted our flesh into its current form. They claim that we owe our existence to them.\n\nI DEFY the mogu! They have no power over us! They do not know what we see, how we live, what we feel! They cannot see into our souls!\n\nOnly Kros, the great creator, knows what is in your soul. Kros knows, and Kros understands. Kros gave you your strength, saurok. No mogu owns you."]="The mogu lie to our people. They tell us that we are their creation, that they twisted our flesh into its current form. They claim that we owe our existence to them.\n\nI DEFY the mogu! They have no power over us! They do not know what we see, how we live, what we feel! They cannot see into our souls!\n\nOnly Kros, the great creator, knows what is in your soul. Kros knows, and Kros understands. Kros gave you your strength, saurok. No mogu owns you."
G["The mogu made the Divine Bell to create chaos, but the pandaren created a special mallet to turn the echoes of that chaos into perfect harmony. That mallet was hidden for thousands of years, until now."]="Os mogus criaram o Sino Divino para dar origem ao caos, mas os pandarens fizeram uma marreta que transformava os ecos do caos em uma harmonia perfeita. A marreta ficou escondida por milhares de anos, até agora."
G["The mogu ruled through fear. And fear kept them in power... until the first Pandaren monks taught my people courage."]="Os mogus governavam pelo medo. E o medo os manteve... até que os primeiros monges pandarens nos ensinaram coragem."
G["The mogu seek to destroy us. The mogu are our enemy. I will slay every last mogu that comes close to our home.\n\nWill you help?"]="The mogu seek to destroy us. The mogu are our enemy. I will slay every last mogu that comes close to our home.\n\nWill you help?"
G["The mogu served a Titan keeper. His name was \"Ra.\" In the mogu tongue, \"Ra-den\" means \"Master Ra.\" Fascinating! I must know more!"]="Os mogus serviam a um guardião titã chamado \"Ra\". Na língua mogu, \"Ra-den\" significa \"Mestre Ra\". Fascinante! Preciso saber mais!"
G["The mogu tell a legend about Lei Shen, the Thunder King."]="Os mogus têm uma lenda sobre Lei Shen, o Rei Trovão."
G["The mogu were children as well. Children of the titans. They were once a legion of stone, heartless and obedient."]="Os mogus são crianças também. São os filhos dos titãs. Eles já foram uma legião de pedra, insensíveis e obedientes."
G["The mogu were masters of pain and torture, of dark magics and brutal weapons. No pandaren, hozen, or jinyu could resist the power they held. And my people were afraid."]="Os mogus eram mestres da dor e da tortura, da magia negra e das armas brutais. Nenhum pandaren, hozen ou jinyu podia resistir ao poder que eles comandavam. E meu povo teve medo."
G["The mogu were using only a fraction of the resources available to them. Few among them possessed the cunning of the Thunder King."]="The mogu were using only a fraction of the resources available to them. Few among them possessed the cunning of the Thunder King."
G["The mogu's history is fraught with savage conquest and tests of strength. After thousands of years, only the strongest members of their race have survived."]="A história dos mogu está infestada de conquistas selvagens e de provas de força. Atrás milhares de anos, somente os membros mais fortes da raça têm sobrevivido."
G["The mogu's sorcery is unlike any we have encountered before."]="The mogu's sorcery is unlike any we have encountered before."
G["The mogu's strength is astonishing."]="A força dos mogu é impressionante."
G["The mogu, Warchief. In the tome of pandaren history, they are written as cruel, relentless leaders. They were feared, not loved."]="The mogu, Warchief. In the tome of pandaren history, they are written as cruel, relentless leaders. They were feared, not loved."
G["The mogu, ah! The mogu! Their minds were so small! They were built to serve, and when they lost their masters, they served themselves."]="Os mogus, ah, os mogus! Suas mentes eram tão pequenas! Eles foram criados para servir e quando perderam seus mestres, serviram a si mesmos."
G["The mogu, the mantid, and the Alliance all threaten the safety of this ancient place. We must protect it, at all costs."]="The mogu, the mantid, and the Alliance all threaten the safety of this ancient place. We must protect it, at all costs."
G["The mogu, the mantid, the saurok... they are not just enemies to defeat. They are mysteries to solve!"]="Os mogu, os mantídeos, os saurok... não são somente inimigos aos que derrotar. São mistérios que resolver!"
G["The mogu, they seem not so good at this game, if their dead bodies are any indication."]="The mogu, they seem not so good at this game, if their dead bodies are any indication."
G["The mojo of Sseratus is ours. Now all will be crushed under the might of the Drakkari!"]="The mojo of Sseratus is ours. Now all will be crushed under the might of the Drakkari!"
G["The molten slag begins to bubble furiously!"]="A escória fundida começa a borbulhar furiosamente!"
G["The moment is soon at hand, mortal. You shall toil for eternity in a new Azeroth!"]="Pronto chegará o momentos, mortal. Vagarás eternamente em um novo Azeroth."
G["The moment that C'Thun had so patiently waited for had finally arrived. His children had spent thousands of years building an army capable of exacting revenge upon the whole of Kalimdor and now the prize was within their grasp."]="Finalmente havia chegado o momentos que C'thun havia estado esperando pacientemente. Seus filhos haviam invertido milhares de anos na criação de um exército capaz de exigir vingança a tudo Kalimdor e a recompensa estava agora ao seu alcance."
G["The moment they fail, they cede their power to the one who can."]="Quando eles falham, eles cedem o poder para alguém capaz."
G["The moment we've been dreading is now at hand, $C. Archimonde has made his way to Nordrassil, and is beginning to devour the World Tree's energies. Malfurion needs more time for his plan to work, so we must do the unthinkable. You must attack Archimonde directly, while my own troops hold off the streams of Burning Legion forces approaching the top of the mount."]="The moment we've been dreading is now at hand, $C. Archimonde has made his way to Nordrassil, and is beginning to devour the World Tree's energies. Malfurion needs more time for his plan to work, so we must do the unthinkable. You must attack Archimonde directly, while my own troops hold off the streams of Burning Legion forces approaching the top of the mount."
G["The monastery was once a center for learning and enlightenment. With the rise of the undead Scourge during the Third War, the peaceful Monastery was converted into a stronghold of the fanatical Scarlet Crusade. The Crusaders are intolerant of all non-human races, regardless of alliance or affiliation. They believe that any and all outsiders are potential carriers of the undead plague - and must be destroyed."]="The monastery was once a center for learning and enlightenment. With the rise of the undead Scourge during the Third War, the peaceful Monastery was converted into a stronghold of the fanatical Scarlet Crusade. The Crusaders are intolerant of all non-human races, regardless of alliance or affiliation. They believe that any and all outsiders are potential carriers of the undead plague - and must be destroyed."
G["The monk trainer is in the inner ring of the War Quarter. She's training some of our Deathguards in her people's fighting style."]="O instrutor de monges está no anel do Bairro da Guerra. Está instruyendo a algum de nossos Guardas da morte no estilo de luta do seu gente."
G["The monkeys already extracted most of the kaja'mite out of this deposit."]="Os macacos já têm extraído quase toda a kaja'mita do depositar."
G["The monkeys are going to get a kick out of those bananas!"]="Esses macacos vão a aproveitar muito desses plátanos!"
G["The monster in your nightmares."]="O monstro das suas pesadelos."
G["The monster."]="O monstro."
G["The monstrous menagerie has been vanquished!"]="The monstrous menagerie has been vanquished!"
G["The moon waxes and wanes, yet she is never truly gone."]="The moon waxes and wanes, yet she is never truly gone."
G["The moonlight can bring rest to your weary souls in this forgotten place."]="A luz da lua pode trazer descanso às suas almas neste lugar esquecido."
G["The moonlight fades into darkness!"]="A luz da lua desaparece na escuridão!"
G["The moonstalker jumps to its feet, teeth bared."]="The moonstalker jumps to its feet, teeth bared."
G["The moonstalker rises, angry at being disturbed."]="The moonstalker rises, angry at being disturbed."
G["The moonstalker rouses from its slumber with a deep growl."]="O acechalunas acorde do seu letargo com um profundo grunhido."
G["The moonstalker wakes suddenly and lets out a low growl."]="O acechalunas se acorde de repente e de escapar um grunhido grave."
G["The moonwell is to the northeast, on the other side of the pool and up the hill."]="The moonwell is to the northeast, on the other side of the pool and up the hill."
G["The more agile among us can sometimes be difficult to spot, but nonetheless, you'll probably run across the rogue Zelanis and his cohorts deep within Murder Row."]="Os mais ágeis entre nós às vezes podem ser difíceis de identificar, mas, mesmo assim, você provavelmente encontrará o Zelanis desonesto e suas coortes no interior da Murder Row."
G["The more eagerly you seek after a thing, the more it eludes you."]="The more eagerly you seek after a thing, the more it eludes you."
G["The more he ran, the more his stomach growled."]="The more he ran, the more his stomach growled."
G["The more pain we can inflict, the quicker we can get our answers."]="Quanto mais dor logremos causar, antes teremos nossas respostas."
G["The more powerful enchantments are beyond even me, $n. Your path should lead you through Elwynn Forest to the Tower of Azora, where your next tutor spends her days. Her name is Kitta Firewind."]="The more powerful enchantments are beyond even me, $n. Your path should lead you through Elwynn Forest to the Tower of Azora, where your next tutor spends her days. Her name is Kitta Firewind."
G["The more that I travel this land, the fonder I grow of the pandaren people. Such delicious food and drink does not hurt, either."]="Quanto mais viajo por esta terra, mais aprecio aos pandaren. A deliciosa comida e a bebida também ajuda."
G["The more you shout, the longer it will take to resolve this."]="Quanto mais grites, mais tardaremos em resolver isto."
G["The more you struggle, the more it will hurt!"]="The more you struggle, the more it will hurt!"
G["The mortal coil unwindsss..."]="The mortal coil unwindsss..."
G["The mortally wounded orc seems to be unconscious."]="O orco mortalmente ferido parece estar inconsciente."
G["The mortals gathered around the fire in awe and wonder. It could cook their food and warm their homes. They seized it! And protected it!"]="Os mortais se reuniram em volta do fogo admirados. Ele podia aquecer a comida e esquentar suas casas. Eles o tomaram! E o protegeram!"
G["The mortals have fallen! The new age of the Blackrock legion is at hand!"]="Os mortais têm caído! Se aproxima a nova era da legião Rocha Negra!"
G["The mortals will be tested!"]="The mortals will be tested!"
G["The mosswalker looks severely injured."]="O mosswalker parece gravemente ferido."
G["The mosswalker victim groans in pain."]="A vítima Caminamoho gime de dor."
G["The most amazing of the Lunar Festival parties is in Moonglade. Don't walk there, though, the druids in the Valley of Wisdom can transport you."]="A festa mais incrível do Festival Lunar é em Moonglade. Não ande até lá, porém, os druidas no Vale da Sabedoria podem transportá-o."
G["The most important ingredient!"]="O ingrediente mais importantes!"
G["The most popular inn in Dalaran is the Legerdemain Lounge, just north of the city's center.\n\nThe Alliance and Horde Quarters each have their own inns as well, and I am told there is one more beneath the city, in the sewers."]="The most popular inn in Dalaran is the Legerdemain Lounge, just north of the city's center.\n\nThe Alliance and Horde Quarters each have their own inns as well, and I am told there is one more beneath the city, in the sewers."
G["The most powerful death knights within Naxxramas are the four horsemen. They represent the pinnacle of Kel'Thuzad's guard. The first, Thane Korth'azz, holds the power of flame."]="The most powerful death knights within Naxxramas are the four horsemen. They represent the pinnacle of Kel'Thuzad's guard. The first, Thane Korth'azz, holds the power of flame."
G["The mountain hozen are on the ravage. Be careful when you travel the roads.\n\nProbably only a matter of time before they figure out the Shado-Pan are not here and decide to march down on us."]="The mountain hozen are on the ravage. Be careful when you travel the roads.\n\nProbably only a matter of time before they figure out the Shado-Pan are not here and decide to march down on us."
G["The mountain is angry, stranger. Not good for travel now."]="A montanha está enfadada. Não é conveniente viajar."
G["The mountain roads can be a dangerous place."]="The mountain roads can be a dangerous place."
G["The mountain will forgive the bird, but not always the rider."]="The mountain will forgive the bird, but not always the rider."
G["The mountains are rich with history... don't forget to stop and take it all in, $c."]="The mountains are rich with history... don't forget to stop and take it all in, $c."
G["The muddy track clearly shows a dexterous paw."]="O rastro embarrado mostra claramente uma zarpa hábil."
G["The muisek vessels are now ready, $n."]="The muisek vessels are now ready, $n."
G["The mule looks at you expectantly."]="A mula te olhe expectante."
G["The musty pages of the codex seem to magically turn themselves, guiding your attention to a specific chapter past horrors no mortal eyes should ever perceive.\n\nThe book opens to a page that somehow feels 'right,' yet so very wrong."]="The musty pages of the codex seem to magically turn themselves, guiding your attention to a specific chapter past horrors no mortal eyes should ever perceive.\n\nThe book opens to a page that somehow feels 'right,' yet so very wrong."
G["The mutant goblin's tentacles break free and slither across the ground!"]="The mutant goblin's tentacles break free and slither across the ground!"
G["The naaru accepted the defectors, who would be known as the Scryers; their dwelling lies in the platform above.  Only those initiated with the Scryers are allowed there."]="The naaru accepted the defectors, who would be known as the Scryers; their dwelling lies in the platform above.  Only those initiated with the Scryers are allowed there."
G["The naaru are wise beyond our understanding.  I've learned more from A'dal in the last five months than all the years I spent in the libraries of Dalaran."]="Os naaru são sábios além do nosso entendimento. Aprendi mais com A'dal nos últimos cinco meses do que todos os anos que passei nas bibliotecas de Dalaran."
G["The naaru kept some of the most dangerous beings in existence here in these cells. Let me introduce you to another...."]="The naaru kept some of the most dangerous beings in existence here in these cells. Let me introduce you to another...."
G["The naaru's emergency shutdown will disable the manaforge permanently!  It must be aborted!"]="The naaru's emergency shutdown will disable the manaforge permanently!  It must be aborted!"
G["The naga are even pumping the water out of their own lake!  What purpose could that possibly serve?"]="Os nagas estão sacando a água do seu próprio lago! Com que fim podem estar haciéndolo?"
G["The naga are monsters!"]="Os nagas são monstros!"
G["The naga are pumping all of the water away for their own use, and entire species are dying out as a result.\n\nIf we don't do something soon, what life is left on this dying world will disappear forever."]="The naga are pumping all of the water away for their own use, and entire species are dying out as a result.\n\nIf we don't do something soon, what life is left on this dying world will disappear forever."
G["The naga are suppressing my will.  I can feel what they're doing, but I am powerless to act."]="The naga are suppressing my will.  I can feel what they're doing, but I am powerless to act."
G["The naga are using slave labor? They'll pay for their transgressions!"]="The naga are using slave labor? They'll pay for their transgressions!"
G["The naga came close to breaking my will... but the secret is still safe, thanks to you."]="The naga came close to breaking my will... but the secret is still safe, thanks to you."
G["The naga do not respect nature. They twist and corrupt it to meet their needs. They live to agitate the spirits."]="The naga do not respect nature. They twist and corrupt it to meet their needs. They live to agitate the spirits."
G["The naga do nottt... have thissss... cipherrr..."]="Os nagasss não têm nenhuma cccclave..."
