G["The naga have enlisted the aid of the Old God's minions."]="Os nagas têm a ajuda dos lacaios do deus antigo."
G["The naga must pay for what they've done here!"]="Os nagas devem pagar pelo que têm feito!"
G["The naga of Coilskar are exceptionally cruel to their prisoners. It is a miracle that I survived inside that watery prison for as long as I did. Earthmother be praised."]="The naga of Coilskar are exceptionally cruel to their prisoners. It is a miracle that I survived inside that watery prison for as long as I did. Earthmother be praised."
G["The naga priestesses look to be summoning a near endless stream of reinforcements!"]="A sacerdotisa naga parece estar invocando uma onda quase interminável de reforços!"
G["The naga torture the spirits of water. They invoke chaos and destruction!"]="The naga torture the spirits of water. They invoke chaos and destruction!"
G["The naga! They've followed $n back to the ship!"]="Os nagas! Têm seguido a $n até o navio!"
G["The naga's water boiler activates and the sound of dying frenzies can be heard below."]="The naga's water boiler activates and the sound of dying frenzies can be heard below."
G["The name of Earthshatter has been one held by my family for hundreds of years. And like my father and his father before him, I too have inherited the right to create the vestments of my namesake."]="The name of Earthshatter has been one held by my family for hundreds of years. And like my father and his father before him, I too have inherited the right to create the vestments of my namesake."
G["The name of Stormstout will be sung once again throughout the hills!"]="The name of Stormstout will be sung once again throughout the hills!"
G["The natives here are quite friendly. Well, except for those monkeys."]="Os nativos são muito amistosos. Bom, a excepção dos macacos."
G["The natural beauty of these hills belies a great darkness below.  Tread carefully, friend."]="A beleza natural dessas colinas esconde uma grande escuridão abaixo. Pise com cuidado, amigo."
G["The nearby activity of living flesh drives some Bore Worms to action!"]="The nearby activity of living flesh drives some Bore Worms to action!"
G["The nearby forces of the Scarlet Crusade stand ready to assist their Commander if he is attacked."]="The nearby forces of the Scarlet Crusade stand ready to assist their Commander if he is attacked."
