G["The next location of the Darkmoon Faire has not been finalized yet, but when it is you and I will be the first to know!"]="Ainda não temos terminou de preparar a próxima localização da Feira da Lua Negra, mas quando tudo estiver pronto, você e eu seremos os primeiros em saber!"
G["The next one of you peons that messes up will spend a night patrolling the cursed perimeter!"]="The next one of you peons that messes up will spend a night patrolling the cursed perimeter!"
G["The next person who asks me for a potion is getting a knuckle sandwich. I quit alchemy!"]="The next person who asks me for a potion is getting a knuckle sandwich. I quit alchemy!"
G["The next spirit that awaits you is Shu, the spirit of water. When you are ready, meet Aysa at the Singing Pools to the east."]="O próximo espírito que te espera é Shu, o espírito da água. Quando estiver $gpronto: pronta;, encontre-se com Aysa nas Poços Cantarinas, situadas ao este."
G["The next stage of my experiment begins!"]="Começa a seguinte fase de meu experimento!"
G["The next ten orcs I kill are gonna be for you, friend."]="A próxima vez que mate orcs será no seu honra, colega."
G["The next time the Headless Horseman comes, we'll beat him again!"]="The next time the Headless Horseman comes, we'll beat him again!"
G["The next, Lady Blaumeux, calls forth the power of shadows, drawing the souls of the living into the voracious embrace."]="A seguinte, Lady Blaumeux, pode evocar o poder das Sombras, arrancando as almas dos vivos com o seu voraz abraço."
G["The nice thing about trees is they always grow back. This is what you would call sustained income!"]="The nice thing about trees is they always grow back. This is what you would call sustained income!"
G["The night Kael'thas leveled the village, I could do nothing to help. His magic had already sealed me in the tower, exacerbating my torment by forcing me to witness the deaths of my fellows.\n\nAnd still their voices are calling from far away, waking me up in the middle of the night."]="The night Kael'thas leveled the village, I could do nothing to help. His magic had already sealed me in the tower, exacerbating my torment by forcing me to witness the deaths of my fellows.\n\nAnd still their voices are calling from far away, waking me up in the middle of the night."
G["The night elf army was pushed back through Un'Goro, to the borders of the Tanaris desert. Something in Un'Goro prevented the Qiraji from being able to take the land. I do not quite understand this word but I believe it to mean 'God Lands.' It is stated that they could not 'take the God Lands.'"]="The night elf army was pushed back through Un'Goro, to the borders of the Tanaris desert. Something in Un'Goro prevented the Qiraji from being able to take the land. I do not quite understand this word but I believe it to mean 'God Lands.' It is stated that they could not 'take the God Lands.'"
G["The night elves didn't properly secure their portals in Dalaran. It was a simple matter to exploit the ley lines..."]="The night elves didn't properly secure their portals in Dalaran. It was a simple matter to exploit the ley lines..."
G["The night elves of Darnassus cheer for $n."]="The night elves of Darnassus cheer for $n."
G["The night is dark and savage."]="A noite é sombria e selvagem."
G["The night surrounds you..."]="A noite te envuelve."
G["The nightmare is over!"]="Se acabou a pesadelos!"
