G["The north-western keep tower has been damaged!"]="The north-western keep tower has been damaged!"
G["The north-western keep tower has been destroyed!"]="Têm destruído a torre do Bastião noroeste!"
G["The number of naga here continue to rise steadily...."]="O número de nagas não para de aumentar a firme constante..."
G["The numbers of my companions dwindles, goddess, and my own power shall soon be insufficient to hold back the demons of Felwood."]="O número de meus companheiros merma, deusa, e meu próprio poder pronto será insuficiente para conter aos demônios de Frondavil."
G["The objective is simple: kill me and take my deathcharger."]="The objective is simple: kill me and take my deathcharger."
