G["The odds appear to be against us, but we cannot falter, $n.  We are all that stands between the enemy's hordes and Nordrassil."]="The odds appear to be against us, but we cannot falter, $n.  We are all that stands between the enemy's hordes and Nordrassil."
G["The odds are 32.33 (repeating of course) percent chance of success."]="The odds are 32.33 (repeating of course) percent chance of success."
G["The ogres - ya kilt 'em!"]="Os ogros! Os matou!"
G["The ogres have the keys! Kill the ogres and get me out of here!"]="Os ogros têm as chaves! Matar aos ogros e sácame de aqui!"
G["The ogres, they bury me here up to my neck and then forget to come back.\n\nYah, mon, funny.  Laugh it up.  Disembodied ghost head here.\n\nOf course, if you want to help me out, I might be able to make it worth your while.\n\nBut no, keep laughing."]="The ogres, they bury me here up to my neck and then forget to come back.\n\nYah, mon, funny.  Laugh it up.  Disembodied ghost head here.\n\nOf course, if you want to help me out, I might be able to make it worth your while.\n\nBut no, keep laughing."
G["The old blood will flow once again with the coming of the raven, the return of the darkness in the skies. Scarlet night, and the rise of the old."]="A antiga sangue fluirá uma vez mais com a chegada do Corvo, a volta da escuridão aos céus. Noite escarlate e o surgimento do antigo."
G["The old memories stir. They rush back to me as if propelled by the noble spirits of the air..."]="The old memories stir. They rush back to me as if propelled by the noble spirits of the air..."
G["The old wounds still linger, $g lad:lass;. I can feel 'em in me bones, even now. Aye, I got a score to settle with Arthas and ye can believe I'm gonna give that boy the beatin' I shoulda given 'im when he was a wee lad. Always knew there was something wrong with 'im.\n\nTell me when yer crew is ready and we'll lift off for the top o' the citadel.\n\nArthas won't be expectin' this!"]="The old wounds still linger, $g lad:lass;. I can feel 'em in me bones, even now. Aye, I got a score to settle with Arthas and ye can believe I'm gonna give that boy the beatin' I shoulda given 'im when he was a wee lad. Always knew there was something wrong with 'im.\n\nTell me when yer crew is ready and we'll lift off for the top o' the citadel.\n\nArthas won't be expectin' this!"
G["The one memory, I clung to, Darion... The one thought that kept me from giving in..."]="The one memory, I clung to, Darion... The one thought that kept me from giving in..."
G["The one remaining is still enough to finish you."]="O que restante bastará para acabar com vocês."
G["The one that they call Hellscream might be our only hope."]="O que eles chamam de Hellscream pode ser nossa única esperança."
G["The only escape is death!"]="A única saída é a morte!"
G["The only good $R is a dead $R!"]="$gEl único: A única; $r $gbueno: boa; é $gun: uma; $r $gmuerto: morta;!"
G["The only good vermen is a dead vermen!"]="Vermen bom, vermen morto!"
G["The only justice is death!"]="A única justiça é a morte!"
G["The only madness here is your own, Kor'ik! Did you really think you would go unnoticed forever?"]="The only madness here is your own, Kor'ik! Did you really think you would go unnoticed forever?"
G["The only one I'm worried about is Qua-Ro. He always has some trick up his sleeve."]="O único que me preocupa é Qua-Ro. Sempre se guarda algum as na manga."
G["The only peace you shall find is in death, Kvaldir!"]="A única paz que encontraréisss será a da morte, Kvaldir!"
G["The only place in Stormwind where magic and spirits mix, come to the Blue Recluse!"]="The only place in Stormwind where magic and spirits mix, come to the Blue Recluse!"
G["The only reason that you still live is because of my curiosity."]="A única razão pela qual você ainda vive é por causa da minha curiosidade."
G["The only redemption for the traitors responsible for this will be an agonizing death. My vengeance will be swift and without mercy."]="The only redemption for the traitors responsible for this will be an agonizing death. My vengeance will be swift and without mercy."
G["The only remaining spirit is Dafeng, who hides somewhere across the Dawning Span to the west."]="The only remaining spirit is Dafeng, who hides somewhere across the Dawning Span to the west."
G["The only surviving egg of my late gryphon, Sky'ree.  Honor it and care for it; her child is yours."]="The only surviving egg of my late gryphon, Sky'ree.  Honor it and care for it; her child is yours."
G["The only thing I'll tell you is to get the hell out of here!"]="O único que vou dizer é que te largues de aqui!"
