G["The only thing hurt is your pride, lad. Buck up!"]="O único ferido aqui é seu orgulho, rapaz. Date pressa!"
G["The only thing that matters is that we rescue my father."]="O único que importa é que rescatemos a meu pai."
G["The only thing you will find at Thal'darah Grove are terrified young druids. They have no weapon of mass destruction."]="The only thing you will find at Thal'darah Grove are terrified young druids. They have no weapon of mass destruction."
G["The only true crime is inaction."]="The only true crime is inaction."
G["The only way I know is that of the warrior."]="O único caminho que conheço é o do guerreiro."
G["The only way a hero can die, $r: Through tragedy. The Grand Crusader struck a deal with Kel'Thuzad himself! An ambush would be staged that would result in the death of Mograine. The type of betrayal that could only be a result of the actions of one's most trusted and loved companions."]="The only way a hero can die, $r: Through tragedy. The Grand Crusader struck a deal with Kel'Thuzad himself! An ambush would be staged that would result in the death of Mograine. The type of betrayal that could only be a result of the actions of one's most trusted and loved companions."
G["The only weapon I know of that has no use other than killing someone. Not something, but someone. These blades were invented to end the lives of men. Beautiful aren't they?"]="A única arma que conheço assim não tem mais fim que matar a alguém. Não a algo, a alguém. Estas espadas foram ideadas para colocar fim às vidas dos homens. Não são lindas?"
G["The opening of the Dark Portal brought news of my people's fate. In a way, my exile shielded me from sharing in their downfall, but to see the Farstriders throw their lot in with Kael'thas...\n\nI never imagined my one-time brethren capable of such a thing.\n\nThe homecoming I once dreamt of will never happen. This forest is the only home I have left."]="The opening of the Dark Portal brought news of my people's fate. In a way, my exile shielded me from sharing in their downfall, but to see the Farstriders throw their lot in with Kael'thas...\n\nI never imagined my one-time brethren capable of such a thing.\n\nThe homecoming I once dreamt of will never happen. This forest is the only home I have left."
G["The opposition includes some of Gnomeregan's finest... although they've all seen better days. It's the leper gnome quintet!"]="The opposition includes some of Gnomeregan's finest... although they've all seen better days. It's the leper gnome quintet!"
G["The orb behind me was once capable of glimpsing into the happenings on Azeroth.\n\nKael'thas's curse changed all that, of course, but during our years of isolation many of the mages found solace in its images.\n\nSome scried to remember; some scried to forget."]="The orb behind me was once capable of glimpsing into the happenings on Azeroth.\n\nKael'thas's curse changed all that, of course, but during our years of isolation many of the mages found solace in its images.\n\nSome scried to remember; some scried to forget."
G["The orb explodes!"]="O orbe explode!"
G["The orb has been dropped!"]="Tem caído a orbe!"
G["The orb has been returned!"]="A orbe foi devolvida!"
G["The orb swirls malevolently..."]="O orbe gira malévolamente..."
G["The orb's markings match the brand on your hand."]="As marcações da esfera correspondem à marca na sua mão."
G["The orbiting spheres pulse with dark energy!"]="The orbiting spheres pulse with dark energy!"
G["The orbs have appeared!"]="Têm aparecido as orbes!"
G["The orc leaders agree with your assessment."]="The orc leaders agree with your assessment."
G["The orc's corpse has been casually tossed aside so as not to litter the walkway."]="O cadáver do orc foi jogado para o lado para não desarrumar a passarela."
G["The orcs and tauren are fortunate to have found one another, for each people's strengths compliment the other's.  We are glad to join them in this celebration.\n\nEven the Forsaken partake, though to what end I am not certain..."]="The orcs and tauren are fortunate to have found one another, for each people's strengths compliment the other's.  We are glad to join them in this celebration.\n\nEven the Forsaken partake, though to what end I am not certain..."
G["The orcs hate us, Obadei!  They've killed many of us before!  They deserve death and worse."]="The orcs hate us, Obadei!  They've killed many of us before!  They deserve death and worse."
G["The orcs in my citadel will drink your blood and devour you!"]="The orcs in my citadel will drink your blood and devour you!"
G["The orcs of Orgrimmar cheer for $n."]="The orcs of Orgrimmar cheer for $n."
G["The orcs of Stonetalon will suffer your rampage no more, foul beast."]="Os orcs de Cordilheira das Torres de Pedra não voltarão a sofrer seus ataque, fera infame."
G["The orders are given!  Move out, and show them what we're made of!"]="The orders are given!  Move out, and show them what we're made of!"
G["The orders have been given! Death to Stormpike! Charge the enemy!"]="The orders have been given! Death to Stormpike! Charge the enemy!"
G["The ore cart squeaks against the rails as it is released."]="The ore cart squeaks against the rails as it is released."
G["The ore used in this sample originated deep within the crust of Azeroth and was recently unearthed."]="The ore used in this sample originated deep within the crust of Azeroth and was recently unearthed."
G["The orphans we have taken in come from war torn Sholazar Basin. You can choose to care for either an orphaned Oracle hatchling or a Frenzyheart pup. Either will be happy to make a new friend, but you will only be able to care for one of them."]="Os órfãos que recebemos vêm da Bacia do Sholazar, devastada pela guerra. Você pode optar por cuidar de um filhote órfão do Oracle ou de um filhote de Frenzyheart. Qualquer um ficará feliz em fazer um novo amigo, mas você só poderá cuidar de um deles."
G["The other Stone Lords have already heard my words."]="Os Senhores de pedras têm ouvi meus palavras."
G["The other captives are up in the volcano... they're being sacrificed, or worse, zombiefied!"]="Os mais cativos estão cima no vulcão. Os estão sacrificando, ou pior, zombificando!"
G["The other day I saw one walking down the street shouting, \"Once you go gnome, you never go home!\""]="O outro dia ouvi a alguém pela calhe dizer:'Quisiera se gnomo, mas não sei como!'"
G["The other dwarven leaders were ashamed of their behavior, and vowed never again to allow fear or distrust to cloud their judgment."]="Os outros líderes anões ficaram envergonhados por sua atitude e juraram nunca mais deixar o medo ou a desconfiança nublarem seu julgamento."
G["The other rangers are waiting for us just ahead. Our first priority is - Look out!"]="The other rangers are waiting for us just ahead. Our first priority is - Look out!"
G["The other rangers simply turned on one another.\n\nWe would have turned as well, but thanks to Yalia's quick thinking, we are safe."]="The other rangers simply turned on one another.\n\nWe would have turned as well, but thanks to Yalia's quick thinking, we are safe."
G["The other tamers were right about you."]="Os outros domadores estavam certos sobre você."
G["The other trainees have their skills and talents. I am honored to ride with them."]="The other trainees have their skills and talents. I am honored to ride with them."
G["The other victims... they made such awful sounds. Thank you for coming to my rescue!"]="The other victims... they made such awful sounds. Thank you for coming to my rescue!"
G["The others look at this landscape and see only death, corruption, and adversity. None of those things are in short supply, true, but that view ignores the opportunities presented by our environment.\n\nI will not stand by and watch these opportunities go ignored, $c. With your help, we can demonstrate to the others here at Blood Watch just how to make use of the environment and its creatures."]="The others look at this landscape and see only death, corruption, and adversity. None of those things are in short supply, true, but that view ignores the opportunities presented by our environment.\n\nI will not stand by and watch these opportunities go ignored, $c. With your help, we can demonstrate to the others here at Blood Watch just how to make use of the environment and its creatures."
G["The outhouse appears to be occupied at the moment."]="O banheiro externo parece estar ocupado no momentos."
G["The outlook is positive, but I'm still negative."]="O pronóstico é positivo, mas eu sigo sendo negativo."
