G["The pandaren embrace life. With so much fighting all around us, it is refreshing to know what we're fighting for."]="Os pandaren aproveitam da vida. Com tanto combate a nosso ao redor, não para de ser agradável saber por que lutamos."
G["The pandaren fished in the trench's waters, but the crocolisks survived."]="The pandaren fished in the trench's waters, but the crocolisks survived."
G["The pandaren have many legends about trolls like you, Griftah. Many legends indeed."]="Os pandaren têm muitas lendas sobre os trolls como você, Griftah. Muitas."
G["The pandaren may be strangers now, but in time, I believe they will prove to be valuable allies."]="The pandaren may be strangers now, but in time, I believe they will prove to be valuable allies."
G["The pandaren were prepared. This attack was folly."]="Os pandaren estavam preparados. Este ataque foi uma loucura."
G["The pandaren will sing your praises for ages to come."]="The pandaren will sing your praises for ages to come."
G["The pandaren, in fear and defense, killed all the crocolisks of Narsong Trench."]="The pandaren, in fear and defense, killed all the crocolisks of Narsong Trench."
G["The pandriarchs blessed my future son-in-law thanks to you. I guess this means the Wanderbrew and Goldendraft feud will have to go on hold.\n\nDon't tell anyone this, but I'm sort of grateful to you for that. So many years of hate is just exhausting.\n\nWe were too set in our ways though, and it took something, or someone, new to help us see passed our differences."]="The pandriarchs blessed my future son-in-law thanks to you. I guess this means the Wanderbrew and Goldendraft feud will have to go on hold.\n\nDon't tell anyone this, but I'm sort of grateful to you for that. So many years of hate is just exhausting.\n\nWe were too set in our ways though, and it took something, or someone, new to help us see passed our differences."
G["The panther is hunting us, it can't be a good idea to stay in one spot.  We've got to leave!"]="The panther is hunting us, it can't be a good idea to stay in one spot.  We've got to leave!"
G["The paperwork's ready for you to sign, Marin. My people are just waiting on your decision."]="The paperwork's ready for you to sign, Marin. My people are just waiting on your decision."
G["The paragon does not speak truth, Wakener. His mind did not survive encasement."]="The paragon does not speak truth, Wakener. His mind did not survive encasement."
G["The party you sent to Zul'Aman is being slaughtered! You must do something!"]="Estão matando ao grupo que enviaste a Zul'aman! Precisa fazer algo!"
G["The past lives in these wastes, $c.  We must be careful to not awaken it."]="The past lives in these wastes, $c.  We must be careful to not awaken it."
G["The path ahead may bend, but it does not vanish. Walk it with faith, and trust that Elune already walks beside you."]="The path ahead may bend, but it does not vanish. Walk it with faith, and trust that Elune already walks beside you."
G["The path before us has been revealed. Let us return."]="O caminho que se extiende ante nós nos foi revelado. Regresemos."
G["The path of freedom has always been beset with tragedy, sire. We could not risk losing you. The Crusade could not have survived such a blow."]="The path of freedom has always been beset with tragedy, sire. We could not risk losing you. The Crusade could not have survived such a blow."
G["The path of the Red Crane is a path of failure. I have seen the truth!\n\nAll paths lead to despair! You have no hope! NONE OF YOU!!"]="The path of the Red Crane is a path of failure. I have seen the truth!\n\nAll paths lead to despair! You have no hope! NONE OF YOU!!"
G["The path of the cloud serpent rider is long and arduous, but you will travel it together with your cloud serpent companion.\n\nIf you reach the end of the road together, you will have a loyal friend who will carry you to the end of your days."]="The path of the cloud serpent rider is long and arduous, but you will travel it together with your cloud serpent companion.\n\nIf you reach the end of the road together, you will have a loyal friend who will carry you to the end of your days."
G["The path of those who undertake a profession is long and rewarding.  Which path do you choose to walk?"]="O caminho daqueles que assumem uma profissão é longo e gratificante. Qual caminho você escolhe percorrer?"
G["The pathway to damnation awaits..."]="The pathway to damnation awaits..."
G["The peace of Ogri'la shall be restored!"]="A paz voltará a Ogri'a!"
G["The peasant contemplates what life means without work."]="O campesino ponderao significado de uma vida sem trabalho."
G["The peasant wishes there was more work to do."]="The peasant wishes there was more work to do."
G["The penalty for treason is death!"]="A traição se castiga com a morte!"
G["The peninsula is not a place to be trifled with $r.  Those foul Alliance can be found all over the island."]="The peninsula is not a place to be trifled with $r.  Those foul Alliance can be found all over the island."
G["The pennants mark the race course, but you will not be penalized for finding other routes."]="The pennants mark the race course, but you will not be penalized for finding other routes."
G["The people cried \"Fanny,\" her name."]="The people cried \"Fanny,\" her name."
G["The people in Nighthaven sure know how to party!"]="As pessoas em Nighthaven com certeza sabem como festejar!"
G["The people of Darkshire expect more from the Council.  We cannot let them suffer from this unholy wrath which plagues us."]="The people of Darkshire expect more from the Council.  We cannot let them suffer from this unholy wrath which plagues us."
G["The people of Gilneas understand the gravity of change all too well."]="The people of Gilneas understand the gravity of change all too well."
G["The people of Kaskala are in your debt, $c."]="A gente de Kashala está em dívida com você, $c."
G["The people of Pandaria came here millennia ago to watch aspiring emperors face the challenges of the August Celestials.\nSo! Are you here to watch would-be heroes brave the Celestials' tests?\nOr to brave them yourself?"]="The people of Pandaria came here millennia ago to watch aspiring emperors face the challenges of the August Celestials.\nSo! Are you here to watch would-be heroes brave the Celestials' tests?\nOr to brave them yourself?"
G["The people were destroyed in order to preserve the Prince's immortal life and near limitless powers. The power once divided among thousands now funnels into the Prince and the Shen'dralar zealots. Those few remaining survivors are directly feeding power into the pylons in order to keep Immol'thar imprisoned.\n\nShould the demon break free of its bonds, it would surely destroy what little is left of this once great bastion of arcana."]="The people were destroyed in order to preserve the Prince's immortal life and near limitless powers. The power once divided among thousands now funnels into the Prince and the Shen'dralar zealots. Those few remaining survivors are directly feeding power into the pylons in order to keep Immol'thar imprisoned.\n\nShould the demon break free of its bonds, it would surely destroy what little is left of this once great bastion of arcana."
G["The people who called this land their home in life, do so in death as well."]="The people who called this land their home in life, do so in death as well."
G["The perfect mix of northern and southern styles!"]="A mistura perfeita do estilo do norte e o estilo do sul!"
G["The perimeter is secure, commander."]="O perímetro está controlado, Comandante."
G["The person you described was just here and he tried to persuade me to list a crateful of arcane objects."]="The person you described was just here and he tried to persuade me to list a crateful of arcane objects."
G["The phylactery is not yours to take, $n!  You will pay for your transgression."]="Você não pode levar você a filactério, $n! Pagará pelo seu transgresão."
G["The pile of skulls reeks of foulness.  You fear the arakkoa have made an addition to the pile fairly recently."]="A pilha de crânios cheira a sujeira. Você teme que os arakkoa tenham feito uma adição à pilha recentemente."
G["The pile of skulls reeks of foulness.  You fear the arakkoa have made an addition to the pile fairly recently.\nYou will need 10 Time-Lost Scrolls to call forth the descendants of Terokk's adversaries."]="The pile of skulls reeks of foulness.  You fear the arakkoa have made an addition to the pile fairly recently.\nYou will need 10 Time-Lost Scrolls to call forth the descendants of Terokk's adversaries."
G["The pink cranes are beautiful!\n\nI mean... if you wanted to know..."]="As grulhas rosa são preciosas!\n\nDigo... Por se te interesse..."
G["The pink hearts are pretty!"]="Os corações rosa são bonitos!"
G["The pirates have keys!"]="Os piratas têm chaves!"
G["The pit calls, minion. Go to it. NOW!"]="O fosso te chama, lacaio. Entrar em ele. AGORA!"
G["The pit lord's loose!  We're doomed!  Retreat!"]="O senhor do fosso está suelto! Estamos perdidos! Retirada!"
G["The pitfighter will be victorious! Just look at him!"]="O lutador do fosso vencerá! Somente é preciso verle!"
G["The pitiful human escaped!"]="The pitiful human escaped!"
G["The place is a bit drafty... but what do I care? I'm dead."]="O lugar é um pouco complicado... mas com o que eu me importo? Eu estou morto."
G["The plague cauldron begins to boil vigorously!"]="A caldeirão de fedor começa a ferver vigorosamente!"
G["The plague samples they've sent us would not even hurt a rat!"]="As amostras de fedor que nos têm enviada não farian dano nem a uma rata!"
G["The plague was not quite... fatal.  However, reports of harmful effects include nausea, loss of equilibrium and severe stomach pain."]="The plague was not quite... fatal.  However, reports of harmful effects include nausea, loss of equilibrium and severe stomach pain."
G["The plague... is it over?"]="A Fedor..? Se terminou?"
G["The plaguebringer sighs at the interruption."]="O pestífero suspira ante a interrupção."
G["The plan is to keep moving south.  We can't go back to the Merchant Square.  It's not safe."]="The plan is to keep moving south.  We can't go back to the Merchant Square.  It's not safe."
G["The planets are aligned!  The second moon is in the house of ... now what was that house called again?"]="Os planetas estão alineados! A segunda lua está na casa de... Que casa era esta?"
G["The plans are in there!"]="Os planos estão aí dentro!"
G["The plans for my twenty-foot tall turkey baster are nearly complete! Now all I need is a twenty-foot tall turkey..."]="Os planos para o meu peru de seis metros de altura estão quase completos! Agora tudo o que preciso é de um peru de seis metros de altura..."
G["The plants are hungry..."]="As plantas têm fome..."
G["The plates! He's coming apart! Tear up the plates and we've got a shot at bringing him down!"]="The plates! He's coming apart! Tear up the plates and we've got a shot at bringing him down!"
G["The play is a Kilo Tango Charlie Blitz on three. One... two... three! Um... guys?!"]="The play is a Kilo Tango Charlie Blitz on three. One... two... three! Um... guys?!"
G["The pleasure is mine, madam. Might I ask what it is that you are doing here?"]="O prazer é meu, senhora. Posso perguntar o que você está fazendo aqui?"
G["The polarity has shifted!"]="A polaridade tem mudado!"
G["The pool stirs..."]="The pool stirs..."
G["The poor hozen and jinyu! We knew they didn't like each other but to go this far..."]="The poor hozen and jinyu! We knew they didn't like each other but to go this far..."
G["The portal has been opened! Thanks to your efforts, we can now quickly travel from Stormwind to Twilight Highlands."]="O portal foi aberto! Graças aos seus esforços, agora podemos viajar rapidamente de Ventobravo para Twilight Highlands."
G["The portal has stabilized! Attack!"]="O portal se tem estabilizado! Ataquem."
G["The portal is closing! Hurry!"]="O portal se fecha, rápido!"
G["The portal shows old, ancient desert ruins.  The wind picks up, there must be a sandstorm brewing inside.  This portal must lead somewhere important, but where?"]="The portal shows old, ancient desert ruins.  The wind picks up, there must be a sandstorm brewing inside.  This portal must lead somewhere important, but where?"
G["The portal to Stormwind is good to go!  Get in!"]="The portal to Stormwind is good to go!  Get in!"
G["The portal will shift slightly, at this point if you cast a binding cantrip you will solidify it in place."]="The portal will shift slightly, at this point if you cast a binding cantrip you will solidify it in place."
G["The portals are shut down. I hear the orcs still have a portal to the Blasted Lands open, down in the Cleft o' Shadow."]="The portals are shut down. I hear the orcs still have a portal to the Blasted Lands open, down in the Cleft o' Shadow."
G["The portals will open and your precious city will be swept away!"]="The portals will open and your precious city will be swept away!"
G["The possibilities are infinite."]="As possibilidades são infinitas."
G["The potion is finished. I can only hope Clintar forgives us for interrupting his sojourn in the Emerald Dream."]="A poção está pronta. Agora somente fica esperar que Clintar nos perdone por interromper seu instância no Sonho Esmeralda."
G["The power flows through me!"]="O poder fluye em mim!"
G["The power of Elune compels you!  The power of Elune compels you!  \nGo now!  Seek out Jandria in the central hall of the Temple of the Moon in the southern section of Darnassus!"]="The power of Elune compels you!  The power of Elune compels you!  \nGo now!  Seek out Jandria in the central hall of the Temple of the Moon in the southern section of Darnassus!"
G["The power of Light compels you!  Back to your pit!"]="The power of Light compels you!  Back to your pit!"
G["The power of our winds, UNLEASHED!"]="O poder de nossos ventos, LIBERTADO!"
G["The power of the Dark Shaman will overwhelm you!"]="O poder do Xamã sombrio te aplastará!"
G["The power of the Eye is unquestionable, Ryson, but what else can it do?"]="O poder do Olho é innegable, Ryson, mas que mais pode fazer?"
G["The power of the Lich King pales in comparison to the glory of the Light!"]="The power of the Lich King pales in comparison to the glory of the Light!"
G["The power of the Light knows no bounds, Saurfang. His soul is under great strain, but he lives - for now."]="O poder da Luz não tem limite, Colmilhosauro. Sua alma está baixo uma grande tensão, mas vive, por agora."
G["The power of the Soul is tearing him apart!"]="The power of the Soul is tearing him apart!"
G["The power of the Sunwell will be harnessed once more!"]="O poder da Nascente do Sol voltará a ser aproveitado novamente!"
G["The power of the Tear of the Moons is mine! Mine I say!"]="O poder da Lágrima das Luas é meu! E dito meu!"
G["The power of the elements is strong here. Little wonder this is where they chose to summon a servant of the old gods."]="The power of the elements is strong here. Little wonder this is where they chose to summon a servant of the old gods."
G["The power of the light is truly great and merciful."]="O poder da Luz é grandioso e misericordioso."
G["The power of the storm lives on."]="The power of the storm lives on."
G["The power of the warchief will overwhelm you!"]="The power of the warchief will overwhelm you!"
G["The power to crush one's foes. That is strength."]="O poder de aplastar aos seus inimigos. Isso é a força."
G["The power to crush your world, and everything on it!"]="O poder para destruir seu mundo e tudo o que contém!"
G["The power tools compel you! The power tools compel you!"]="The power tools compel you! The power tools compel you!"
G["The power washes through me! I see... EVERYTHING!"]="O poder me invade! O vejo… TUDO!"
G["The power you absorb from spells with your shell can be used to counter with your other attacks."]="A energia que absorbes dos feitiços com o seu carapaça pode ser usada para responder com outros dos seus ataque."
G["The power you've bestowed upon me has granted me great mental influence over human minds.  I bear these offerings as proof of my progress."]="The power you've bestowed upon me has granted me great mental influence over human minds.  I bear these offerings as proof of my progress."
G["The power! More, more, more!"]="O poder! Mais, mais, mais!"
G["The power... It cannot be wielded this way! You tempt forces you do not understand!"]="The power... It cannot be wielded this way! You tempt forces you do not understand!"
G["The power... it will be mine!"]="O poder... será meu!"
G["The power...is too much...I cannot hold...any longer..."]="O poder... é demais... Não posso... aguantar mais..."
G["The powers at work here exceed anything you could possibly imagine!"]="The powers at work here exceed anything you could possibly imagine!"
G["The powers of the Hourglass do nothing to me!"]="O poder do relógio de arena não me afeta!"
G["The powers of this place are NOT for your kind, warlock!"]="The powers of this place are NOT for your kind, warlock!"
G["The powers of this room are not unlike the original Well of Eternity in Azeroth."]="Os poderes desta sala não são diferentes da Nascente da Eternidade original em Azeroth."
G["The praise is well deserved. Tirion will want to praise you himself, shortly. Hey, have you noticed it getting a bit cold all of a sudden?"]="Os elogios são bem merecidos. Tirion vai querer elogiá-o, em breve. Ei, você notou que de repente ficou um pouco frio?"
G["The presence of blue dragons."]="A presença de dragões azuis."
G["The presence of titan architecture in this region is quite... interesting."]="A presença de arquitectura dos titãs nesta região é bastante... interessante."
G["The preternatural ability of the crypt fiend to hunt and kill its foe is one studied and vaunted by men in my profession. I, myself, have slain thousands of the beasts in my crusade to rid this world of Scourge.\n\nWhile I loathe the crypt fiend for its merciless nature, its abilities must be admired. It has a job and it does it - very well."]="The preternatural ability of the crypt fiend to hunt and kill its foe is one studied and vaunted by men in my profession. I, myself, have slain thousands of the beasts in my crusade to rid this world of Scourge.\n\nWhile I loathe the crypt fiend for its merciless nature, its abilities must be admired. It has a job and it does it - very well."
G["The priest kneels in silent prayer."]="O sacerdote se arrodilha e reza em silêncio."
G["The priestesses will require your aid soon. The Lady requests your return."]="The priestesses will require your aid soon. The Lady requests your return."
G["The priesthood, known as the Aldor, quickly regained its strength as word spread that the naaru had returned and reconstruction soon began.  The ruined temple is now used as an infirmary for injured refugees."]="The priesthood, known as the Aldor, quickly regained its strength as word spread that the naaru had returned and reconstruction soon began.  The ruined temple is now used as an infirmary for injured refugees."
G["The priests are located on the outer ring of the War Quarter."]="Os padres estão localizados no anel externo do Bairro da Guerra."
G["The priests imbue the guardian with their Loas! They must be stopped!"]="The priests imbue the guardian with their Loas! They must be stopped!"
G["The priests of our fair city can be found within the Sunfury Spire.  Seek out the lady Belestra."]="Os padres de nossa cidade justa podem ser encontrados dentro da Torre da Fúria do Sol. Procure a senhora Belestra."
G["The prince has run off. This is bad!"]="O príncipe fugiu. Isto é mau!"
G["The principle is absolute, follow it and you will be accepted."]="O início é absoluto, síguelo e será aceitou."
G["The prison? Why would you want to go there? It's in the center of the city, just northeast of the Mage Quarter.\n\nIf you're truly going there, be careful. I've heard news of riots."]="The prison? Why would you want to go there? It's in the center of the city, just northeast of the Mage Quarter.\n\nIf you're truly going there, be careful. I've heard news of riots."
G["The prisoner sobs desperately, waiting for the end to come."]="The prisoner sobs desperately, waiting for the end to come."
G["The prisoners are escaping!"]="The prisoners are escaping!"
G["The prisoners shall not go free! The word of Malygos is law!"]="The prisoners shall not go free! The word of Malygos is law!"
G["The process is arduous. We must first summon forth acolytes of the elements. You must then destroy these acolytes so that my minions can make preparations."]="The process is arduous. We must first summon forth acolytes of the elements. You must then destroy these acolytes so that my minions can make preparations."
G["The process is finally complete! My work here is done."]="O processo se tem concluído ao fim! Meu trabalho aqui está feito."
G["The processing will continue as scheduled!"]="O processo continuará conforme o previsto!"
G["The profession of Enchanting displays the cycle of destruction and creation that is at the heart of nature.  Teg at the Dawnstrider Enchanters on the middle rise will show you how."]="A profissão de Encantamento exibe o ciclo de destruição e criação que está no coração da natureza. Teg no Dawnstrider Enchanters no meio da elevação mostrará como."
G["The project will... continue."]="O projeto... continuará."
G["The prophet begins to cast a ritual of annihilation."]="O profeta começa a lançar um ritual de aniquilação."
G["The prophet inclines his head slightly as if he has noticed something amiss."]="O profeta inclina ligeiramente sua cabeça, como se se tivesse dados conta de que algo vai mal."
G["The prophet meditates on how best to handle stealing the power from his goddess."]="O profeta medita procurando a melhor maneira de roubar o poder do seu deusa."
G["The protective tendrils of arcane energy have been lifted. The sun gate is vulnerable!"]="The protective tendrils of arcane energy have been lifted. The sun gate is vulnerable!"
G["The proto-drake smells freedom and flies homeward!"]="O protodraco cheira a liberdade e voe para o lar!"
G["The pumpkin has been smashed, and offers no more treasure."]="A abóbora foi esmagada e não oferece mais tesouros."
G["The pumpkin head smolders forebodingly..."]="A cabeça de abóbora arde sem pressa..."
G["The pumps are working magnificently."]="As bombas funcionam muito bem."
G["The punishment for you all is DEATH!"]="O castigo para todos vocês é a MORTE!"
G["The puny zandalari are gonna be crushed!"]="The puny zandalari are gonna be crushed!"
G["The pure of heart will be allowed to remain in New Avalon. Those that the inquisitors find bereft of the holy Light will be turned away."]="The pure of heart will be allowed to remain in New Avalon. Those that the inquisitors find bereft of the holy Light will be turned away."
G["The pylon seems to be transmitting data somewhere.\n\nA closer inspection of the pylon leads you to find a small table containing red, blue, and green crystals arranged in what seems like a specific formation.\n\nA large red circle of crystals is flanked on either side by a smaller circle of blue crystals and another of green crystals.\n\nYou carefully take note of what you see, knowing that someone may be very interested in hearing about what you have found."]="The pylon seems to be transmitting data somewhere.\n\nA closer inspection of the pylon leads you to find a small table containing red, blue, and green crystals arranged in what seems like a specific formation.\n\nA large red circle of crystals is flanked on either side by a smaller circle of blue crystals and another of green crystals.\n\nYou carefully take note of what you see, knowing that someone may be very interested in hearing about what you have found."
G["The pylon seems to be transmitting data somewhere.\n\nA closer inspection of the pylon leads you to find a small table containing yellow, red, and green crystals arranged in what seems like a specific formation.\n\nA large blue circle of crystals is flanked on either side by a smaller circle of yellow crystals and another of green crystals.\n\nYou carefully take note of what you see, knowing that someone may be very interested in hearing about what you have found."]="The pylon seems to be transmitting data somewhere.\n\nA closer inspection of the pylon leads you to find a small table containing yellow, red, and green crystals arranged in what seems like a specific formation.\n\nA large blue circle of crystals is flanked on either side by a smaller circle of yellow crystals and another of green crystals.\n\nYou carefully take note of what you see, knowing that someone may be very interested in hearing about what you have found."
G["The pylon seems to be transmitting data somewhere.\n\nA closer inspection of the pylon leads you to find a small table containing yellow, red, and green crystals arranged in what seems like a specific formation.\n\nA large yellow circle of crystals is flanked on either side by a smaller circle of red crystals and another of green crystals.\n\nYou carefully take note of what you see, knowing that someone may be very interested in hearing about what you have found."]="The pylon seems to be transmitting data somewhere.\n\nA closer inspection of the pylon leads you to find a small table containing yellow, red, and green crystals arranged in what seems like a specific formation.\n\nA large yellow circle of crystals is flanked on either side by a smaller circle of red crystals and another of green crystals.\n\nYou carefully take note of what you see, knowing that someone may be very interested in hearing about what you have found."
G["The quality of this workmanship is pathetic. Not even fit for a Ghoul to wield."]="A qualidade deste trabalho é patética. Não serve nem para que o use um necrófago."
G["The quantity and quality of rewards inside the tribute chest is based upon how many unsuccessful attempts you had during the Trial of the Grand Crusader. The fewer unsuccessful attempts, the better the rewards."]="A quantidade e a qualidade das recompensas dentro do baú do tributo são baseadas em quantas tentativas malsucedidas você teve durante o Julgamento do Grande Cruzado. Quanto menos tentativas frustradas, melhores as recompensas."
G["The quarry will be fine thanks to you.\n\nThink I'll let some o' the boys take a little vacation...\n\nHAH! Who am I kiddin'? I almost said that with a straight face, too.\n\nWe got WORK to do!"]="The quarry will be fine thanks to you.\n\nThink I'll let some o' the boys take a little vacation...\n\nHAH! Who am I kiddin'? I almost said that with a straight face, too.\n\nWe got WORK to do!"
