G["The question is, what are WE doin' here? Yeh bring 'dis war to anudder corner of Azeroth, and I wanna know why."]="The question is, what are WE doin' here? Yeh bring 'dis war to anudder corner of Azeroth, and I wanna know why."
G["The quickest path to Mal'Ganis lies behind that bookshelf ahead."]="The quickest path to Mal'Ganis lies behind that bookshelf ahead."
G["The quilboar have always scavenged the fringes of our camps for food and supplies, but direct assaults on our farms and homesteads? Something has sent them on a rampage recently."]="Os quilboar sempre vasculharam as margens de nossos acampamentos à procura de comida e suprimentos, mas ataque diretos a nossas fazendas e propriedades? Algo os enviou a um tumulto recentemente."
G["The quilboar will pay!"]="O jabaespín pagará!"
G["The race is about to begin!"]="The race is about to begin!"
