G["The race will start in 1 minute!"]="The race will start in 1 minute!"
G["The races are coming, $g lad : lass;! We're working hard on getting the track setup and I've been busy signing some worthy competitors.\n\nTell your friends!"]="The races are coming, $g lad : lass;! We're working hard on getting the track setup and I've been busy signing some worthy competitors.\n\nTell your friends!"
G["The races of the world will perish. It is only a matter of time."]="The races of the world will perish. It is only a matter of time."
G["The rage burning within you will soon find fuel in our enemies."]="A fúria que os queima pronto encontrará combustível em nossos inimigos."
G["The rage of Ishamuhale runs through you, $n."]="A fúria de Ishamuhale te invade, $n."
G["The rally is about to begin!"]="A reunião está a ponto de começar!"
G["The ramp up to Aldrassil is just in sight over there. Circle around and find Tenaron up top."]="The ramp up to Aldrassil is just in sight over there. Circle around and find Tenaron up top."
G["The ranged Shield-Breaker attack is simple to learn, but difficult to master. Alone it may seem weak, but in conjunction with Thrusts and Charges the Shield-Breaker makes a successful jouster.\n\nFind a Ranged Target. Take a moment to understand the Shield-Breaker's range... how much space you need, and how far you can hurl the lance.\n\nAfter that? Well. Start throwing, and do not stop until you've broken every last layer of Defend and pierced the vulnerable target.\n\nThis tactic will serve you well in actual mounted combat: Break down your opponents' defenses... and then crush them!"]="The ranged Shield-Breaker attack is simple to learn, but difficult to master. Alone it may seem weak, but in conjunction with Thrusts and Charges the Shield-Breaker makes a successful jouster.\n\nFind a Ranged Target. Take a moment to understand the Shield-Breaker's range... how much space you need, and how far you can hurl the lance.\n\nAfter that? Well. Start throwing, and do not stop until you've broken every last layer of Defend and pierced the vulnerable target.\n\nThis tactic will serve you well in actual mounted combat: Break down your opponents' defenses... and then crush them!"
G["The rangers certainly have a high opinion of themselves."]="The rangers certainly have a high opinion of themselves."
G["The rangers take their lessons from Hannovia, a farstrider who stays in the northeast building of Falconwing Square."]="Os guardas florestais aprendem com o Hannovia, um cavaleiro que fica no prédio nordeste da Praça Falconwing."
G["The rank of valiant is not easily won.  Prepare yourself!"]="O grau de $gValeroso: Valerosa; não se obtém facilmente. Prepare-se!"
G["The ravasaur here in Un'Goro seem to be related to the raptors of the barrens - highly intelligent, volatile, and with a sense or code of conduct. The greatest of these that I have encountered is  Lar'korwi. He is one of the most dangerous beasts I've ever seen. In taurahe, Lar'korwi means \"sharp claw,\" but that does not do him justice.\n\nDo not underestimate Lar'korwi if you ever plan on hunting him, but I will help you in any way I can if you do."]="The ravasaur here in Un'Goro seem to be related to the raptors of the barrens - highly intelligent, volatile, and with a sense or code of conduct. The greatest of these that I have encountered is  Lar'korwi. He is one of the most dangerous beasts I've ever seen. In taurahe, Lar'korwi means \"sharp claw,\" but that does not do him justice.\n\nDo not underestimate Lar'korwi if you ever plan on hunting him, but I will help you in any way I can if you do."
G["The raven was struck down once for flying too high, unready. The eons have prepared the Dark Watcher for its ascent, to draw the dark cloak across the horizon."]="O Corvo foi abatido uma vez por voar demais alto, desprevenido. Os eones têm pronto ao Vigia Sombrio para o seu promoção, para que trace a capa sombria no horizonte."
G["The raven will return to us as foretold in the prophecy and you are powerless to stop it!"]="The raven will return to us as foretold in the prophecy and you are powerless to stop it!"
G["The razing of Orgrimmar was not just an attack against orcs, it was an affront to the Horde. An assault against our very existence!\n\nThe Lich King sought to sow the seeds of fear.\n\nThis...\n\n<Garrosh points to the fortified walls that surround him.>\n\nThis is the result of Arthas's campaign.\n\nThe Horde fears nothing..."]="The razing of Orgrimmar was not just an attack against orcs, it was an affront to the Horde. An assault against our very existence!\n\nThe Lich King sought to sow the seeds of fear.\n\nThis...\n\n<Garrosh points to the fortified walls that surround him.>\n\nThis is the result of Arthas's campaign.\n\nThe Horde fears nothing..."
G["The realm of fire will consume you!"]="O reino de fogo os consumirá!"
G["The realm of shadows awaits..."]="O reino das sombras espera..."
G["The realm you see all around you was mine to command."]="O reino que você vê ao seu redor era meu para comandar."
G["The rebels of Lordaeron are small and weak, and know not the joy of serving our Lich King."]="Os rebeldes de Lordaeron são pequenos e fracos e desconhecem a alegria de servir a nosso Rei Lich."
G["The rebirth of the Empire of Azjol-Nerub is upon us! Hear my call, brothers, and rise to reclaim what is rightfully ours!"]="The rebirth of the Empire of Azjol-Nerub is upon us! Hear my call, brothers, and rise to reclaim what is rightfully ours!"
G["The recent decrease in our magical powers is being reviewed as we speak. Even Lord Xavius has said that the ebb and flow of magic is normal."]="The recent decrease in our magical powers is being reviewed as we speak. Even Lord Xavius has said that the ebb and flow of magic is normal."
G["The reckoning is upon you, weakling!"]="The reckoning is upon you, weakling!"
G["The red dragonflight will take on the burden of mending the devastation wrought on Azeroth. Return home to your people and rest. Tomorrow will bring you new challenges, and you must be ready to face them. Life... goes on."]="The red dragonflight will take on the burden of mending the devastation wrought on Azeroth. Return home to your people and rest. Tomorrow will bring you new challenges, and you must be ready to face them. Life... goes on."
G["The red thing's connected to the... squiggly thing... the squiggly thing's connected to my... wristband..."]="A coisa vermelha está conectada a essa coisa retorcida... A coisa retorcida está conectada a meu... bracelete..."
G["The reeds of the Singing Pools are the hardest in all of the land, but they are as air before my mighty brow."]="Os juncos das Poços Cantarinas são os mais difíceis de todas estas terras, mas são como ar ante meu linha de frente."
G["The reef cow and her new bull find true love."]="The reef cow and her new bull find true love."
G["The reflexes built in the survival ring are what keep these trainees alive beyond the wall.  There, the threats are much less forgiving."]="The reflexes built in the survival ring are what keep these trainees alive beyond the wall.  There, the threats are much less forgiving."
G["The regent lord is a very busy man. I'm sure you understand."]="O Senhor regente é uma pessoa muito ocupada. Estou certo de que o entende."
G["The regent speaks truly, $n. Thalorien's sacrifice could not prevent the fall of this very Sunwell."]="The regent speaks truly, $n. Thalorien's sacrifice could not prevent the fall of this very Sunwell."
G["The relic chamber is under attack!"]="Estão atacando a Câmera das Relíquias!"
G["The relics are truly a great mystery.  Perhaps by studying them regularly, you will gain a finer appreciation of their capabilities."]="As relíquias são mesmo um grande mistério. Talvez estudando-os regularmente, você obtenha uma apreciação mais precisa das suas capacidades."
G["The remaining Kodo, angry at The Wolf's impetuousness,\nswiftly killed The Wolf before he had a chance to eat."]="The remaining Kodo, angry at The Wolf's impetuousness,\nswiftly killed The Wolf before he had a chance to eat."
G["The remains are covered in flies and maggots."]="Os restos estão cobertos de moscas e larvas."
G["The rendezvous is just up ahead. We've gathered an elite strike force - What?"]="Nos acercamos ao ponto de encontro. Temos reuniu a um grupo de... Que?"
G["The reports were accurate! The beast is here..."]="Os informes eram precisos! A fera está aqui..."
G["The reservoir fills nicely."]="The reservoir fills nicely."
G["The rest are fine without us."]="O resto está bem sem nós."
G["The rest of Nesingwary's Safari is up in the western side of the Valley of Four Winds. If you find yourself heading west, you should join us. Good hunting!"]="The rest of Nesingwary's Safari is up in the western side of the Valley of Four Winds. If you find yourself heading west, you should join us. Good hunting!"
G["The rest of the drakes should be here shortly. I'll fly on ahead; catch up when you can."]="The rest of the drakes should be here shortly. I'll fly on ahead; catch up when you can."
G["The rest of the fleet has already been sent to the region."]="Já têm enviada ao resto da frota à zona."
G["The rest of you, follow me downstairs!"]="The rest of you, follow me downstairs!"
G["The rest of you, secure the courtyard."]="The rest of you, secure the courtyard."
G["The resultant energies could collapse though, and that could cause an energy flux that would give you a migraine for weeks."]="The resultant energies could collapse though, and that could cause an energy flux that would give you a migraine for weeks."
G["The resurrection ritual has failed!"]="O ritual de ressurreição tem fracassado!"
G["The return of the Emperor will doom your entire race!"]="O retorno do Imperador acabará com toda seu raça!"
G["The revitalized kodo rises to its feet, shaking off the dust."]="The revitalized kodo rises to its feet, shaking off the dust."
G["The rift can be reached through this hall. Follow me."]="Se você pode chegar à falha por esta câmera. Siga-me."
G["The rift must be protected!"]="É preciso proteção a falha!"
G["The rift will be opened there, above Lake Elun'ara. Prepare yourself, $n. Eranikus's entry into our world will be wrought with chaos and strife."]="The rift will be opened there, above Lake Elun'ara. Prepare yourself, $n. Eranikus's entry into our world will be wrought with chaos and strife."
G["The rift's power is ours!"]="O poder da falha é nosso!"
G["The rifts are down and Ironforge is safe!  These portals must be the second half of their attack.\n\nQuickly! Into the portal! We must press the attack while we have the advantage!"]="As falhas têm caído e Altaforja está a salvou! Os portais devem de ser a segunda metade do seu ataque.\n\nRápido! Ao portal! Devemos atacar agora que levamos vantagem!"
G["The rifts are down and Orgrimmar is safe!  These portals must be the second half of their attack.\n\nQuickly! Into the portal! We must press the attack while we have the advantage!"]="As falhas têm caído e Orgrimmar está a salvou! Os portais devem de ser a segunda metade do seu ataque.\n\nRápido! Ao portal! Devemos atacar agora que levamos vantagem!"
G["The rifts are down and Stormwind is safe!  These portals must be the second half of their attack.\n\nQuickly! Into the portal! We must press the attack while we have the advantage!"]="As falhas têm caído e Ventobravo está a salvou! Os portais devem de ser a segunda metade do seu ataque.\n\nRápido! Ao portal! Devemos atacar agora que levamos vantagem!"
G["The rifts are down and Thunder Bluff is safe!  These portals must be the second half of their attack.\n\nQuickly! Into the portal! We must press the attack while we have the advantage!"]="As falhas têm caído e Penhasco do Trovão está a salvou! Os portais devem de ser a segunda metade do seu ataque.\n\nRápido! Ao portal! Devemos atacar agora que levamos vantagem!"
G["The ring will overflow with the blood of the interlopers! Oluf has come!"]="The ring will overflow with the blood of the interlopers! Oluf has come!"
G["The rising threats of the mogu's return and the mantid swarms in the west have brought far more trainees to bare than usual. This is good. They will be needed."]="The rising threats of the mogu's return and the mantid swarms in the west have brought far more trainees to bare than usual. This is good. They will be needed."
G["The ritual in Coilfang will bring Ahune through once he is fully prepared, and the resulting clash between Firelord and Frostlord will rend the foundations of this world. Our ultimate goals are in reach at last...."]="The ritual in Coilfang will bring Ahune through once he is fully prepared, and the resulting clash between Firelord and Frostlord will rend the foundations of this world. Our ultimate goals are in reach at last...."
G["The ritual is already underway!"]="O ritual tem começado."
G["The ritual of soothing has begun.  Defend the totem at all costs!"]="The ritual of soothing has begun.  Defend the totem at all costs!"
G["The ritual of soothing has completed."]="The ritual of soothing has completed."
G["The ritual proceeds too slowly. More sacrifices are needed!"]="The ritual proceeds too slowly. More sacrifices are needed!"
G["The ritual will take much from us, as it requires a very piece of our being. We will be weakened greatly."]="The ritual will take much from us, as it requires a very piece of our being. We will be weakened greatly."
G["The river does not stop from a single stone."]="Uma única pedra não basta para impedir o rio."
G["The rivers foretold of this defeat."]="Os rios anunciaram essa derrota."
G["The rivers foretold of this triumph."]="Os rios profetizaram esse triunfo."
G["The roads here are rough, Gidwin.  I don't want to risk losing a horse."]="The roads here are rough, Gidwin.  I don't want to risk losing a horse."
G["The roads of Kun-Lai are cold, dangerous, and unforgiving. But there is little satisfaction - or profit! - for deals easily concluded."]="The roads of Kun-Lai are cold, dangerous, and unforgiving. But there is little satisfaction - or profit! - for deals easily concluded."
G["The rockling clatters its crystals together in thanks."]="The rockling clatters its crystals together in thanks."
G["The rockling looks confused for a moment before running off."]="The rockling looks confused for a moment before running off."
G["The rockling looks up at you questioningly."]="The rockling looks up at you questioningly."
G["The rockling offers a great gravelly sigh of appreciation."]="The rockling offers a great gravelly sigh of appreciation."
G["The rockling rumbles in appreciation."]="The rockling rumbles in appreciation."
G["The rockling scampers into the distance, excited by its newfound freedom."]="The rockling scampers into the distance, excited by its newfound freedom."
G["The rockling thuds happily upon the ground."]="The rockling thuds happily upon the ground."
G["The rocks are here when we first enter this world, and they will remain long after we pass."]="The rocks are here when we first enter this world, and they will remain long after we pass."
G["The rocks tremble..."]="As pedras tiemblan..."
G["The rod's design is simple. Dartol didn't use his arcane knowledge in its creation... it is more druidic in nature."]="The rod's design is simple. Dartol didn't use his arcane knowledge in its creation... it is more druidic in nature."
G["The rogues are in the Rogues' Quarter. Simple as that. Look for them on the outer ring."]="Os bandidos estão no bairro dos bandidos. Simples assim. Procure-os no anel externo."
G["The romantic plays are really tough, but you'll do better this time. You have TALENT. Ready?"]="The romantic plays are really tough, but you'll do better this time. You have TALENT. Ready?"
G["The roof over the mess hall collapsed. So many - dead!"]="Se tem desabou o teto do comedor. Quantos... mortos!"
G["The route across the beach is circled.  Let's get there and see if there's anything to find."]="A rota que cruza a praia está desmarcada. Vamos ali e vamos ver O que podemos encontrar."
G["The route across this western beach is circled.  Do you know your way there?"]="The route across this western beach is circled.  Do you know your way there?"
G["The ruined city of Stratholme lies in the Eastern Plaguelands to the north of the Plaguewood."]="A cidade em ruínas de Stratholme fica nas Terras Pestilentas Orientais, ao norte de Plaguewood."
G["The ruins of Dire Maul stand in central Ferelas."]="As ruínas de Dire Maul ficam no centro de Ferelas."
G["The ruins of Korja were where something important happened sometime, I guess. I may have snoozed through that history lesson."]="As ruínas de Korja devem de haver banido testigo de algo importantes, suponho. Me quedaría dormindo durante essa classe de história."
G["The ruins of Zul'Farrak are located in the northwestern corner of the Tanaris Desert."]="As ruínas de Zul'Farrak estão localizadas no canto noroeste do deserto de Tanaris."
G["The ruins scattered throughout this area are remnants of the night elven civilization at its former peak. They are a treasure trove of information for those who study the arcane.\n\nAnd it would seem they have attracted the attention of a most unusual group of night elven mages. Yes, you heard me $r - night elves are trying to reclaim their magical heritage! I would find it amusing but for the terrible potential should they discover anything of value here."]="The ruins scattered throughout this area are remnants of the night elven civilization at its former peak. They are a treasure trove of information for those who study the arcane.\n\nAnd it would seem they have attracted the attention of a most unusual group of night elven mages. Yes, you heard me $r - night elves are trying to reclaim their magical heritage! I would find it amusing but for the terrible potential should they discover anything of value here."
G["The ruins you see here are identical to ones I dug up a few months ago, but they're flooded! Curious, eh?"]="The ruins you see here are identical to ones I dug up a few months ago, but they're flooded! Curious, eh?"
G["The rules are simple. Pass through all 10 checkpoints and cross the finish line."]="The rules are simple. Pass through all 10 checkpoints and cross the finish line."
G["The rules of the trial are simple. These target dummies are equipped with powder bombs. If a single one of them explodes, your trial is over."]="The rules of the trial are simple. These target dummies are equipped with powder bombs. If a single one of them explodes, your trial is over."
G["The ruling council has ordered you banished. I plan to see those orders out."]="The ruling council has ordered you banished. I plan to see those orders out."
G["The rumors were true!  The prince has gone mad!"]="The rumors were true!  The prince has gone mad!"
G["The runes foretold victory for me today!"]="As runas predijeron meu vitória hoje!"
G["The runes of warding have been destroyed! Hunt down the infidels, my brethren!"]="The runes of warding have been destroyed! Hunt down the infidels, my brethren!"
G["The sacking of the Scarlet Enclave will be a lesson for history!"]="The sacking of the Scarlet Enclave will be a lesson for history!"
G["The sacrifices now bring themselves to us? Have you no sense!?"]="The sacrifices now bring themselves to us? Have you no sense!?"
G["The sacrifices of my Argent Dawn brothers must never be forgotten. They believed in the Dawn, though none lived to see the return of the Light to these lands."]="Os sacrifícios dos meus irmãos Argent Dawn nunca devem ser esquecidos. Eles acreditavam no Amanhecer, embora ninguém vivesse para ver o retorno da Luz a essas terras."
G["The sadness in the earth is quelling the gifts granted me by the light.\n\nMy wife, she is suffering, and none of my abilities are able to help her."]="The sadness in the earth is quelling the gifts granted me by the light.\n\nMy wife, she is suffering, and none of my abilities are able to help her."
G["The safety of the tribe is my foremost concern. Do you blame me for being cautious?"]="A segurança da tribo é meu maior preocupação. Me culpas por ser tão cauteloso?"
G["The sails of the windmill grow taut against the sudden wind."]="The sails of the windmill grow taut against the sudden wind."
G["The same fate awaits all who would steal from the master."]="O mesmo destino espera a tudo aquele que robe ao mestre."
G["The sand has run out."]="Se terminou a arena."
G["The sandbox is crowded..."]="O caixote de arena está a tope..."
G["The sands of time count out the days to your annihilation!"]="As arenas do tempo cuentan os dias que restam para a sua aniquilação!"
G["The sands of time shall be scattered to the winds!"]="The sands of time shall be scattered to the winds!"
G["The sands of time shift away from you, $C. This calling is not meant for you."]="The sands of time shift away from you, $C. This calling is not meant for you."
G["The sands of time will halt, but only for a moment! I will now conjure the barrier."]="As terras do tempo se detendrán, mas somente por um instantaneamente! Farei aparecem a barrera."
G["The sapling they grew bore a fruit.  At first it seemed to work.  Ursoc did come back and I was filled with joy for a brief moment.\n\nAs he recovered, it was clear that he wasn't the same.  Neither were the furbolg.\n\nWhatever evil caused the ancient druids to tear down Vordrassil manifested itself in the new tree and turned them all into monsters filled with bloodlust.\n\nThe thing that now walks the Grizzly Hills is not my father and it must be put to rest."]="The sapling they grew bore a fruit.  At first it seemed to work.  Ursoc did come back and I was filled with joy for a brief moment.\n\nAs he recovered, it was clear that he wasn't the same.  Neither were the furbolg.\n\nWhatever evil caused the ancient druids to tear down Vordrassil manifested itself in the new tree and turned them all into monsters filled with bloodlust.\n\nThe thing that now walks the Grizzly Hills is not my father and it must be put to rest."
G["The saronite barrier protecting General Vezax shimmers and fades away!"]="The saronite barrier protecting General Vezax shimmers and fades away!"
G["The saronite in this sample is nearly pure. Ores like this do not occur naturally on the surface of Azeroth."]="The saronite in this sample is nearly pure. Ores like this do not occur naturally on the surface of Azeroth."
G["The saronite vapors mass and swirl violently, merging into a monstrous form!"]="The saronite vapors mass and swirl violently, merging into a monstrous form!"
G["The saronite... there's something in it!"]="O saronita... tem algo nele!"
G["The saur-priests have seen my weakness. The brutes beat me, and call me shortfang. If I did not have my basilisk to protect me, I would be all alone.\n\nLikely dead."]="The saur-priests have seen my weakness. The brutes beat me, and call me shortfang. If I did not have my basilisk to protect me, I would be all alone.\n\nLikely dead."
G["The saur-priests will tell you that our strength comes from Kroshik. Don't listen to their religious talk.\n\nOur strength comes from our claws, from our teeth, from our weapons. It comes from the filth that the filth-mongers gather and cultivate.\n\nIt comes from us.\n\nI don't care whether we descended from some devilsaur in the sky or we were created by the mogu. All I care about is protecting this land from our enemies."]="The saur-priests will tell you that our strength comes from Kroshik. Don't listen to their religious talk.\n\nOur strength comes from our claws, from our teeth, from our weapons. It comes from the filth that the filth-mongers gather and cultivate.\n\nIt comes from us.\n\nI don't care whether we descended from some devilsaur in the sky or we were created by the mogu. All I care about is protecting this land from our enemies."
G["The saurok are despicable, but they may end up useful.\n\nIf we can incite them against the mogu, they can draw attention away from our men."]="The saurok are despicable, but they may end up useful.\n\nIf we can incite them against the mogu, they can draw attention away from our men."
G["The saurok are restless. They're planning something. Aethas will want to know."]="The saurok are restless. They're planning something. Aethas will want to know."
G["The saurok have been quiet lately, and are becoming restless. The time is ripe to turn them against the mogu."]="The saurok have been quiet lately, and are becoming restless. The time is ripe to turn them against the mogu."
G["The saurok have plagued this land since the time of the mogu. They are impossible to negotiate with. But we never stop trying! We fight them only as a last resort."]="The saurok have plagued this land since the time of the mogu. They are impossible to negotiate with. But we never stop trying! We fight them only as a last resort."
G["The saurok here are scavengers. There's no telling what they might be carrying."]="Os saurok são saqueadores. A saber que poderiam levar acima..."
G["The saurok intrigue me.\n\nHow is it that they've survived so long in the shadow of their clearly superior enemy?"]="The saurok intrigue me.\n\nHow is it that they've survived so long in the shadow of their clearly superior enemy?"
G["The saurok intrigue me.\n\nSo much so, in fact, that some have started calling me \"Skumblade Steve\"."]="The saurok intrigue me.\n\nSo much so, in fact, that some have started calling me \"Skumblade Steve\"."
G["The saurok leadership has called off their attacks on the mogu. They plan on attacking the Horde and Alliance instead.\n\nIt may be time to intervene."]="The saurok leadership has called off their attacks on the mogu. They plan on attacking the Horde and Alliance instead.\n\nIt may be time to intervene."
G["The saurok make it difficult for anyone to visit here other than by flying.\n\nOf course, that makes slipping off to the Tavern in the Mists very difficult."]="The saurok make it difficult for anyone to visit here other than by flying.\n\nOf course, that makes slipping off to the Tavern in the Mists very difficult."
G["The savior of the forest! Were it not for your actions, Astranaar and then the rest of Ashenvale surely would have fallen to the Burning Legion.\n\nI hope that this day finds you well, $n!"]="The savior of the forest! Were it not for your actions, Astranaar and then the rest of Ashenvale surely would have fallen to the Burning Legion.\n\nI hope that this day finds you well, $n!"
G["The scales...have...tipped..."]="As mechas se têm... apagado..."
G["The scar is sealed! Thank Cenarius..."]="A cicatriz está selada! Obrigado Cenarius..."
G["The scent of blood...so delicious!"]="O aroma da sangue... é delicioso."
G["The scepter shard is no more! Your beloved Kalimdor shall soon be a desolate wasteland. I will, of course, turn the Eastern Kingdoms into an ashen, lifeless void..."]="The scepter shard is no more! Your beloved Kalimdor shall soon be a desolate wasteland. I will, of course, turn the Eastern Kingdoms into an ashen, lifeless void..."
G["The score is fourty-six to fifty-two!"]="A pontuação é 46 a 52!"
G["The scribe of the city is in the Apothecarium, someone named Margaux Parchley."]="O escriba da cidade está no Apothecarium, alguém chamado Margaux Parchley."
G["The scrolls! I must save the scrolls!"]="Os pergaminhos! Devo superando os pergaminhos!"
G["The sea and the land has given us life."]="O mar e a terra nos têm dados vida."
G["The sea riders!"]="Os cavaleiros do mar!"
G["The sea will swallow your smoldering remains."]="The sea will swallow your smoldering remains."
G["The seahorse floats patiently."]="O cavalo marinho flutua pacientemente."
G["The search for my people.  Our struggle against the Alliance.  The war with the ogres and their gronn masters.\n\nAll of these things weigh heavy upon my shoulders, $c.\n\nEven I can use some help from time to time."]="A procurando de meu povo. Nossa luta contra a Aliança. A guerra contra os ogros e seus mestres gronn.\n\nTodas estas coisas são um grande peso sobre meus ombros, $c.\n\nAté a mim me vem bem algo de ajuda de vez em quando."
G["The seas are a dangerous place, $c.  We must be alert."]="Os mares são um lugar perigoso, $c. Devemos estar alerta."
G["The seasons turn for all in due time, but you are still in the springtime of your life.  Please return to us later, $c, when you have experienced more."]="A vida tem etapas e cada uma das elas chega ao seu devido tempo. Você ainda te encontrar na primeira etapa do seu vida. Por favor, $c, retorna a nós quando tenha vivido mais."
G["The second lock of the Thrice-Locked cage clicks and falls to the ground. One Remains."]="The second lock of the Thrice-Locked cage clicks and falls to the ground. One Remains."
G["The second tower has fallen! Destroy the final tower and we will hasten their retreat!"]="The second tower has fallen! Destroy the final tower and we will hasten their retreat!"
G["The secret dies with you."]="O segredo morre com você."
G["The secret to goblin engineering has nothing to do with keeping things from exploding. It has everything to do with directing the explosions exactly where you want them."]="O segredo da engenharia goblin não tem nada a ver com impedir que as coisas explodam. Tem tudo a ver com direcionar as explosões exatamente para onde você as deseja."
G["The secret to good noodle soup begins with strong, thick noodles!"]="The secret to good noodle soup begins with strong, thick noodles!"
G["The secret to the knife is to keep it hidden until the moment you strike."]="The secret to the knife is to keep it hidden until the moment you strike."
G["The secret to the shadow dance is control.\n\nPrecision.\n\nAgility.\n\nGrace.\n\nNever a movement too many, and never too few."]="The secret to the shadow dance is control.\n\nPrecision.\n\nAgility.\n\nGrace.\n\nNever a movement too many, and never too few."
G["The secrets behind the power of the Colossus could lead to all sorts of innovations in science!"]="Os segredos por por trás do poder do Colossus podem levar a tudo tipo de inovação na ciência!"
G["The secrets hidden within the Pylons of Un'Goro Crater are now yours. Visit the Pylons at any time to access their power and gain useful resources."]="Os segredos escondidos dentro dos Pilões da Cratera Um'Goro agora são seus. Visite os Pilões a qualquer momentos para acessar seu poder e obter recursos úteis."
G["The secrets of Suntara will not leave these lands."]="Os segredos de Suntara não deixarão estas terras."
G["The secrets of Uldum will be ours only!"]="Os segredos de Uldum serão somente para nós!"
G["The secrets of the deep shall remain hidden."]="The secrets of the deep shall remain hidden."
G["The secrets of the library are ours and ours alone!"]="Os segredos da biblioteca são nossos e somente nossos!"
G["The secrets of the waters are now known to me. I will use these gifts to help the village."]="The secrets of the waters are now known to me. I will use these gifts to help the village."
G["The secrets of this place are not intended for the likes of you!"]="Os segredos deste lugar não estão destinados a gente como você!"
G["The sensation is... beyond my imagining. I am yours to command, my king."]="Esta sensação... vai além de meu imaginação. Estou à sua disposição, meu rei."
G["The sentence... was to be... yours.."]="A sentência... deveria ser... para vocês..."
G["The sentinel I told you about was Lilly's sister.  She can be trusted."]="A sentinela da que te e falado era a irmã de Lilhy. Pode confiar em ela."
G["The sentinel's body rests here, the apparent victim of the elemental onslaught that has overtaken the town."]="O corpo da sentinela repousa aqui, a aparente vítima do ataque elementar que tomou conta da cidade."
G["The serpent is here!"]="O dragão está aqui!"
G["The serpent rider's path is drenched in blood and tears. Your journey has just begun!"]="A senda do cavaleiro de dragões está repleta de sangue e lágrimas. Seu viagem acaba de começar."
G["The serpents overwhelmed us."]="The serpents overwhelmed us."
G["The serpents, they are everywhere!"]="The serpents, they are everywhere!"
G["The serum will only take a few minutes to prepare, $n."]="The serum will only take a few minutes to prepare, $n."
G["The servants of sul will feast on your remains."]="The servants of sul will feast on your remains."
G["The service here is really slow."]="The service here is really slow."
G["The sha are right about one thing.\n\nOur greatest enemies are often ourselves.\n\nI just wish I weren't such a formidable opponent."]="The sha are right about one thing.\n\nOur greatest enemies are often ourselves.\n\nI just wish I weren't such a formidable opponent."
G["The sha can be a powerful tool. The mogu may have once harnessed its power into the Divine Bell, and look at the glorious empire they built in its wake."]="The sha can be a powerful tool. The mogu may have once harnessed its power into the Divine Bell, and look at the glorious empire they built in its wake."
G["The sha had me in its grasp? I had not even realized it until now..."]="The sha had me in its grasp? I had not even realized it until now..."
G["The sha has made the pandaren weak! Now is the time to push them from the Veiled Stair forever!"]="The sha has made the pandaren weak! Now is the time to push them from the Veiled Stair forever!"
G["The sha took us by surprise. Luckily, we had no casualties."]="The sha took us by surprise. Luckily, we had no casualties."
G["The sha will take you all."]="O shaos levará a todos."
G["The shadow of the Master covers this world... (Darkness, all darkness.) Our enemies fight one another, across the Highland. Fools. (Blood, blood.) WAIT! There is another!"]="A sombra do mestre cubre este mundo... (Escuridão, tudo é escuridão.) Nossos inimigos luchan uns contra outros nas Terras Altas. Estúpidos. (Sangue, sangue.) AGUARDA! Há outro!"
G["The shadow of the Scourge yet remains on this land, fools! You will never prevail!"]="The shadow of the Scourge yet remains on this land, fools! You will never prevail!"
G["The shadow sees. Bal'qwari Og Shadar. The end comes!"]="A sombra vê. Bal'qwari Og Shadar. O fim se aproxima!"
G["The shadow sees. Bo'al lal arwi C'toth. The end comes, cloaked in silent fire."]="A sombra vê. Bo'ao lal arwi C'toth. O fim chega, envolto em fogo silencioso."
G["The shadow... will engulf you."]="The shadow... will engulf you."
G["The shadows are gone...the corruption is lifted."]="The shadows are gone...the corruption is lifted."
G["The shadows consume you."]="As sombras te consomem."
G["The shadows serve ME, now..."]="As sombras me sirven, agora..."
G["The shadows will be our allies."]="As sombras serão nossas aliadas."
G["The shadows will consume you. You are not prepared to face the void."]="The shadows will consume you. You are not prepared to face the void."
G["The shadows will hide us well.\n\nI am concealed by this shadowcloak, and can imbue its magics onto you.\n\nIt will not make us invisible, but as long as we keep our distance from our foes we will remain hidden."]="The shadows will hide us well.\n\nI am concealed by this shadowcloak, and can imbue its magics onto you.\n\nIt will not make us invisible, but as long as we keep our distance from our foes we will remain hidden."
G["The shadows will not save you."]="The shadows will not save you."
G["The shaft is trapped, Warchief. A fall would mean certain death."]="O elevador está preso, Chefe de Guerra. Uma cai significaría a morte."
G["The shape wasn't mine, of course.  And had you not been so reckless, you would've seen past my illusion.  But you came through for me, and for that... I must thank you!"]="The shape wasn't mine, of course.  And had you not been so reckless, you would've seen past my illusion.  But you came through for me, and for that... I must thank you!"
G["The sharks competed for the fish, but the crocolisks survived."]="The sharks competed for the fish, but the crocolisks survived."
G["The sheer audacity of the plan is exactly what intrigues me. If we breech the shipyard, we will deprive the mogu of further Zandalari reinforcements."]="The sheer audacity of the plan is exactly what intrigues me. If we breech the shipyard, we will deprive the mogu of further Zandalari reinforcements."
G["The shell's markings read: \"STORMWIND ROYAL INDUSTRIES\""]="The shell's markings read: \"STORMWIND ROYAL INDUSTRIES\""
G["The sherpen has clearly been frozen here for some time, but you see a glint of light from something in his pack."]="Salta à visão que este sherpen leva bastante tempo congelado aqui, mas vê um clarão de luz procedente do seu mochila."
G["The shield - it is down! We did it!"]="O escudo tem caído! O logramos!"
G["The shield be down! Rise up Atal'ai! Rise up!"]="O escudo tem caído! Levantaos, Atal'ai! Levantaos!"
G["The shield is down! Nice work, $p! I'll take us to the beachhead."]="O escudo se tem desativado! Bom trabalho, $p. Voltarei à cabeça de praia."
G["The shield is down! Quickly get to the beachhead!"]="O escudo está desativado! Vê à cabeça de praia, rápido!"
G["The shield is down; Varos is vulnerable!  Defeating him should disperse the Azure Ring Guardians and allow us access to the upper bands.  Varos is on a floating platform about halfway up The Oculus, on the Band of Acceleration."]="The shield is down; Varos is vulnerable!  Defeating him should disperse the Azure Ring Guardians and allow us access to the upper bands.  Varos is on a floating platform about halfway up The Oculus, on the Band of Acceleration."
G["The shield is engraved: Sentinel Ku-Yao. It belongs to the boy's father."]="O escudo tem gravado \"Sentinela Ku-Yao\". Pertence ao pai do ninho."
G["The shield is nearly gone! All that I have worked for is in danger!"]="The shield is nearly gone! All that I have worked for is in danger!"
G["The shield surrounding the Aspects is destroyed by Ultraxion's attack!"]="The shield surrounding the Aspects is destroyed by Ultraxion's attack!"
G["The shields surrounding the Aspects shatter! The Aspects are vulnerable!"]="The shields surrounding the Aspects shatter! The Aspects are vulnerable!"
G["The shins. The face. The crotch. Kick them all, indiscriminately."]="The shins. The face. The crotch. Kick them all, indiscriminately."
G["The shiny isss mine!"]="O brilhante esss meu!"
G["The ship is about to explode.  Run to the top deck and swing away!"]="The ship is about to explode.  Run to the top deck and swing away!"
G["The ship's aflame!"]="O navio arde!"
G["The ship's not ready yet.  We still need to calibrate the fuse length to make sure that it doesn't burn out and leave you up there alone."]="The ship's not ready yet.  We still need to calibrate the fuse length to make sure that it doesn't burn out and leave you up there alone."
G["The ships are aflame! Troops, to the harbor!"]="The ships are aflame! Troops, to the harbor!"
G["The show is for guests only!"]="O espectáculo é somente para convidados!"
G["The show must go on!"]="Que sigao espectáculo!"
G["The shredder... It's done! Where'd that driver go..."]="The shredder... It's done! Where'd that driver go..."
G["The shrine was corrupted by Ordos!"]="Ordos tem corrompido o santuário!"
G["The sickness is born of the Nightmare within the Emerald Dream, and the dragon Taerar spreads it. He is but a crazed shade of his former self, but will see this land devoured."]="A doença tem nascido da Pesadelos, dentro do Sonho Esmeralda, e o dragão Taerar a extiende. Não fica de ele mais que uma sombra do que foi e está louco, mas não parará até devorar esta terra."
G["The siege engine is ready to roll!"]="A máquina de cerco está pronta para a ação!"
G["The siege is broken... for now. Follow me to Splintertree."]="O cerco se tem front... pelo momentos. Siga-me a Posto do Machadozo."
G["The siege is underway but our heavy explosives never made it to the wall!"]="O cerco tem começado, mas nossos explosivos não têm chegado à muralha."
G["The siege must be broken. Wyrmrest Accord, defend the line!"]="The siege must be broken. Wyrmrest Accord, defend the line!"
G["The sights, the sounds, the smells..."]="As vistas, os sons, os olores..."
G["The sign here says: \"ABSOLUTELY NO BUMS!\" Now get lost!"]="O cartaz diz: \"NADA DE VAGABUNDOS!\". Agora piérdete!"
G["The sign out front was not very... welcoming."]="The sign out front was not very... welcoming."
G["The signal has been sent. He should be arriving shortly."]="The signal has been sent. He should be arriving shortly."
G["The silent, sleeping, staring houses in the backwoods always dream. It would be merciful to tear them down."]="The silent, sleeping, staring houses in the backwoods always dream. It would be merciful to tear them down."
G["The silithid are no match for the sons and daughters of Orgrimmar.  Soon all that will be left of them are their crushed limbs and wings under our feet, $n."]="The silithid are no match for the sons and daughters of Orgrimmar.  Soon all that will be left of them are their crushed limbs and wings under our feet, $n."
G["The silithid? Those things are disgusting and completely inedible...oh, whatever."]="The silithid? Those things are disgusting and completely inedible...oh, whatever."
G["The similarities between this place and Un'goro are uncanny.  Maybe the two are connected in some way."]="As similitudes entre este lugar e Um'goro são intrigantes. Talvez exista algum tipo de conexão entre ambos..."
G["The sin'dorei reign supreme!"]="pelo reinado supremo sem'dorei!"
G["The siphoned energies would sustain the Highborne's magic, allowing those within the walls of Eldre'Thalas to feed their endless and growing magical pangs.\n\nThousands of years passed and the power required to keep Immol'thar imprisoned while sustaining life within Eldre'Thalas, began to shift. The cost to keep Immol'thar bound grew to overshadow the rate at which energy could be siphoned and distributed. The once net gain turned to loss."]="The siphoned energies would sustain the Highborne's magic, allowing those within the walls of Eldre'Thalas to feed their endless and growing magical pangs.\n\nThousands of years passed and the power required to keep Immol'thar imprisoned while sustaining life within Eldre'Thalas, began to shift. The cost to keep Immol'thar bound grew to overshadow the rate at which energy could be siphoned and distributed. The once net gain turned to loss."
G["The sisters go into a Berserker Rage!"]="As irmãs muestran raiva rabiosa!"
G["The site has been compromised. The aspects must be alerted."]="A zona não é certa. Se você deve alertar aos Aspectos."
G["The situation is dire, $p.\nThe Horde are after a cache of mantid weapons near the Heart of Zan'vess. I don't know what they intend to do with them but I'm not about to wait around and find out.\nI need you to get through the shield that enshrouds the island and secure those weapons before the horde does. Take a gyrocopter and head out to the island. I'll send further orders while you are en route."]="The situation is dire, $p.\nThe Horde are after a cache of mantid weapons near the Heart of Zan'vess. I don't know what they intend to do with them but I'm not about to wait around and find out.\nI need you to get through the shield that enshrouds the island and secure those weapons before the horde does. Take a gyrocopter and head out to the island. I'll send further orders while you are en route."
G["The situation is more grim than many have been led to believe. The Forsaken are here as allies in the fight against our common enemy, the Scourge.\n\nTrust me when I say this, without them the Ghostlands would be lost and the Scourge would already have overrun all of Eversong Woods!\n\nBut more than anything else, we need your help in reclaiming our once proud lands!"]="The situation is more grim than many have been led to believe. The Forsaken are here as allies in the fight against our common enemy, the Scourge.\n\nTrust me when I say this, without them the Ghostlands would be lost and the Scourge would already have overrun all of Eversong Woods!\n\nBut more than anything else, we need your help in reclaiming our once proud lands!"
G["The situation is rather complicated, Thrall. It would be best for you to head into the mountains now, before more of Blackmoore's men show up. We'll make sure Taretha is safe."]="A situação é bastante complicada, Thrall. Seria melhor você ir para as montanhas agora, antes que mais homens de Blackmoore aparecessem. Vamos garantir que Taretha esteja a salvou."
G["The situation out here is worse than I thought! The zeppelin is little better than a heap of twisted metal and burning fuel!"]="A situação aqui é pior do que eu pensava! O zepelim é um pouco melhor do que um monte de metal retorcido e combustível em chamas!"
G["The skeletal horse appears to look towards the nearby ziggurat."]="O cavalo esquelético parece olhar para o zigurat próximo."
G["The skies belong to the Empress!"]="The skies belong to the Empress!"
G["The skies turn red with the blood of the fallen! The Lich King watches over us, minions! Leave only ashes and misery in your destructive wake!"]="The skies turn red with the blood of the fallen! The Lich King watches over us, minions! Leave only ashes and misery in your destructive wake!"
G["The skies will darken and all will go quiet. Only then will you know the sweet serenity of death..."]="The skies will darken and all will go quiet. Only then will you know the sweet serenity of death..."
G["The skill of the bow is a great asset to anyone, not just the hunter. You can strike swiftly, silently, and before your prey can blink... they are dead."]="The skill of the bow is a great asset to anyone, not just the hunter. You can strike swiftly, silently, and before your prey can blink... they are dead."
G["The skill with which Telonis crafts armor is beyond compare.  You should be grateful that he does not charge more for the knowledge he passes to others.  Go now and seek him out in the Craftsmen's Terrace in the northeast section of Darnassus."]="A habilidade com a qual Telonis fabrica armaduras é incomparável. Você deve ser grato por ele não cobrar mais pelo conhecimento que transmite a outras pessoas. Vá agora e procure-o no Terraço dos Artesãos, na seção nordeste de Darnassus."
G["The skin stretched taut between the bones is a call to arms against the main defender of the Alliance's Sylvanaar and the Living Grove to the west."]="A pele esticada entre os ossos é um chamado às armas contra o principal defensor dos Sylvanaar da Aliança e o Living Grove, a oeste."
G["The skinner here is named Killian Hagey. He works in the Rogues' Quarter on the inner ring."]="O skinner aqui é chamado Killian Hagey. Ele trabalha no Bairro dos Ladinos no anel interno."
G["The skinners usually take all their hides into Ironforge to dry out.  Why don't you head there and see if you can find one to train ye?"]="Os skinners geralmente levam tudo o seu couro para Ironforge para secar. Por que você não vai até lá e vê se consegue encontrar alguém para treiná-o?"
G["The sky darkens and the elements are restless! Seek shelter!"]="The sky darkens and the elements are restless! Seek shelter!"
G["The sky darkens with your impending demise!"]="The sky darkens with your impending demise!"
G["The sky is dark.  The fire burns.  You strive in vain as Fate's wheel turns."]="O céu está sombrio. O fogo arde. O destino está selado e já é tarde."
G["The sky is falling!"]="Sálvese quem possa!"
G["The sky is not safe, friend. Be alert!"]="O céu não está certo, amigo. Esteja em alerta!"
G["The sky itself feeds upon the suffering of the conquered!"]="The sky itself feeds upon the suffering of the conquered!"
G["The sky shall fall with the Legions glory!"]="O céu cairá sob a glória da Legião!"
G["The sky weeps at the glorious devastation of these lands! Soon, Azeroth's futile tears will rain down upon us!"]="The sky weeps at the glorious devastation of these lands! Soon, Azeroth's futile tears will rain down upon us!"
G["The sky weeps for your demise!"]="O céu chora sua morte!"
G["The sky... Beckons..."]="O céu... chama..."
G["The slain spirit of Lunaclaw stares at you intently, as though wanting something from you."]="O espírito morto de Lunaclaw olha fixamente para você, como se quisesse algo de você."
G["The slightest spark shall be your undoing."]="A chispa mais fraco será seu fim."
G["The slow blade penetrates the shield."]="O lento limiar penetra no escudo."
G["The smell of death covers every inch of this place."]="O cheiro da morte cubre cada centímetro deste lugar."
G["The smell of good fortune is upon this lake...  or is that just Fishbreath?"]="Este lago cheira a boa fortuna... Embora ao melhor somente cheira a peixe."
G["The smell of these land walkers disgusts me."]="The smell of these land walkers disgusts me."
G["The smell of these mutant orcs disgusts me."]="O cheiro de estes orcs mutantes me repugna."
G["The smell of victory!"]="Cheira a... vitória!"
G["The smoke in the distance... It is Wartook. He is trying to tell us something..."]="The smoke in the distance... It is Wartook. He is trying to tell us something..."
G["The soil welcomes your bones!"]="A terra receberá seus ossos!"
G["The soldiers are doing important work. The safety of the people is more important, Mal, if you're interested in your customers living to spend another day."]="The soldiers are doing important work. The safety of the people is more important, Mal, if you're interested in your customers living to spend another day."
G["The soldiers are spreading panic with the rumors of bad food. Neighbors are accusing one another of poison. The city will fall into bedlam!"]="The soldiers are spreading panic with the rumors of bad food. Neighbors are accusing one another of poison. The city will fall into bedlam!"
G["The solution is ready in my cauldron.  It's just the matter of treating both the unfinished key and the scarab."]="A solução está pronta na minha caldeirão. Somente é preciso tratar a chave incomplete e o besouro."
G["The song is written in the old tongue, the language of emperors and scholars. Hardly anyone speaks it anymore."]="The song is written in the old tongue, the language of emperors and scholars. Hardly anyone speaks it anymore."
G["The song of your life will be sung by the mighty, $n. Until we meet again."]="The song of your life will be sung by the mighty, $n. Until we meet again."
G["The sooner I'm left alone, the faster the work will be finished."]="The sooner I'm left alone, the faster the work will be finished."
G["The sooner we can get away from the Stonemother, the better. I do not trust her."]="Quanto antes nos afastarmos da Mãe da Pedra, melhor. Eu não confio nela."
G["The sooner you come to accept your condition as a defect, the sooner you will find yourselves in a position to transcend it."]="The sooner you come to accept your condition as a defect, the sooner you will find yourselves in a position to transcend it."
G["The souls of the Third Fleet are cursed to roam this shore, for eternity, $r. The Eye of Paleth lay claim to our lives, and trapped us in the mire forevermore."]="The souls of the Third Fleet are cursed to roam this shore, for eternity, $r. The Eye of Paleth lay claim to our lives, and trapped us in the mire forevermore."
G["The souls of the undead are cursed and tortured.  If I am infected, promise you'll burn me before I turn."]="The souls of the undead are cursed and tortured.  If I am infected, promise you'll burn me before I turn."
G["The souls of the undead are cursed and tortured.  If I am infected, promise you'll burn me before I turn.."]="The souls of the undead are cursed and tortured.  If I am infected, promise you'll burn me before I turn.."
G["The souls of your fallen champions will be mine, Fordring."]="As almas dos seus campeões caídos serão minhas, Vadín."
G["The sound of death... so sweet to my ears..."]="O som da morte... tão agradável a meus ouvidos..."
G["The sound of footsteps shuffling echo throughout the cave."]="O som de pés arrastrando ressoa por toda a caverna."
G["The sound of grinding metal reverberates through the halls as the lock on the Nexus doors releases."]="The sound of grinding metal reverberates through the halls as the lock on the Nexus doors releases."
G["The sound of those explosions was like music to my ears. Come here, $n. Give me a hug!"]="O som dessas explosões era música para meus ouvidos. Venha aqui, $n. Dê-me um abraço!"
G["The sound of thunder dissipates."]="O som do trovão se dissipa."
G["The sound of thunder roars throughout the cavern."]="O som do trovão retumba na caverna."
G["The soup must be piping hot to warm the soul!"]="A sopa precisa estar tão quente que a sientas no alma!"
G["The south-eastern keep tower has been damaged!"]="The south-eastern keep tower has been damaged!"
G["The south-eastern keep tower has been destroyed!"]="Têm destruído a torre do Bastião sudeste!"
G["The south-western keep tower has been damaged!"]="The south-western keep tower has been damaged!"
G["The south-western keep tower has been destroyed!"]="Têm destruído a torre do Bastião sudoeste!"
G["The southern bridge has been damaged!"]="The southern bridge has been damaged!"
G["The southern bridge has been destroyed!"]="Têm destruído o ponte do sul!"
G["The southern tower has been damaged!"]="The southern tower has been damaged!"
G["The southern tower has been destroyed!"]="Têm destruído a torre sul!"
G["The spark of life fades."]="A chispa da vida se desaparece."
G["The spark plugs are clear!\nWell done!"]="The spark plugs are clear!\nWell done!"
G["The spark plugs misfired!\nPressure was lost."]="The spark plugs misfired!\nPressure was lost."
G["The spark plugs were clogged!\nAll pressure was lost."]="The spark plugs were clogged!\nAll pressure was lost."
G["The sparktouched are some of the best fighters among us... they're carried most of the battle against the wolvar."]="The sparktouched are some of the best fighters among us... they're carried most of the battle against the wolvar."
G["The sparky ones are more squishy! Get them first!"]="The sparky ones are more squishy! Get them first!"
G["The spear is broken! Retreat!"]="A lança está rota! Retirada!"
G["The spears are just for show. As long as we don't get out of the boat or make eye contact or get hit by a spear then we should be fine."]="The spears are just for show. As long as we don't get out of the boat or make eye contact or get hit by a spear then we should be fine."
G["The specimen is a female gnome.  Even while infected, her insufferable cuteness let her get close to and infect a dozen others before being stopped."]="The specimen is a female gnome.  Even while infected, her insufferable cuteness let her get close to and infect a dozen others before being stopped."
G["The specimen was a male human.  A farmer.  He'd killed his family and then wandered into Stormwind."]="O espécimen era um humano. Um fazendeiro. Matou ao seu família e depois vagó até Ventobravo."
G["The specimens... must be preserved."]="The specimens... must be preserved."
G["The speed of Owatanka is with you, $n."]="A rapidez de Owatanka está com você, $n."
G["The speed of sound in dry air is approximately 343 m/s!"]="A velocidade do som no ar seco é de aproximadamente 343 m/s!"
G["The spiders here are as big as... me! Do you know how to get rid of a spider infestation?\n\nYeah, that's right. Dynamite. Lots and lots of dynamite."]="Aqui as aranha são tão grandes como... eu! Sabe como exterminar uma praga de aranha?\n\nExacto. Dinamite. Um monte de dinamite."
G["The spirit has spoken. We should take up arms and attack the hozen!"]="O espírito tem falado. Deveríamos pegar as armas e atacar aos hozen!"
G["The spirit is displeased and attacks!"]="The spirit is displeased and attacks!"
G["The spirit looks intently into your eyes and grasps your hand.  You feel a warmth shoot through your body, almost knocking you to your knees.\n\nAs the warmth passes, you feel the slight presence of an ursine spirit within your being... bolstering your resolve."]="The spirit looks intently into your eyes and grasps your hand.  You feel a warmth shoot through your body, almost knocking you to your knees.\n\nAs the warmth passes, you feel the slight presence of an ursine spirit within your being... bolstering your resolve."
G["The spirit looks upon you with a sense of completeness and cognizance that had not been present before.\n\n\"I feel as though a great burden has been lifted from my soul.  Soon I will rest forever in peace.  I now know this, and I await this time patiently.\n\nThank you, stranger.\""]="The spirit looks upon you with a sense of completeness and cognizance that had not been present before.\n\n\"I feel as though a great burden has been lifted from my soul.  Soon I will rest forever in peace.  I now know this, and I await this time patiently.\n\nThank you, stranger.\""
G["The spirit of Echeyakee flows through you, $n."]="Te inundao espírito de Echeyaki, $n."
G["The spirit of the Dreadsteed pulses with rage."]="O espírito dos Dreadsteed pulsa de raiva."
G["The spirit of water has left us.  Our tribe is doomed."]="O espírito da água nos deixou. Nossa tribo está condenada."
G["The spirit showed us the path to our future. And somehow, it has something to do with you."]="O espírito nos mostró o caminho a nosso futuro. E, de alguma forma, tem algo que ver."
G["The spirit's voice echoed through me like thunder. Did you hear it?"]="A voz do espírito ressoa a através de mim como um trovão. A oyes?"
G["The spirits are gone. The nightmare is over."]="Os espíritos se têm ido. A pesadelos terminou."
G["The spirits are greatly agitated. We must find the cause of this disturbance."]="Os espíritos estão muito agitados. Precisamos encontrar a causa desse distúrbio."
G["The spirits are restless, $r. Be mindful of your surroundings while in Nagrand lest you be consumed by their fury."]="The spirits are restless, $r. Be mindful of your surroundings while in Nagrand lest you be consumed by their fury."
G["The spirits call... I am consumed."]="Os espíritos me chamam... Estou consumido."
G["The spirits can finally rest, thanks to you. Soon I, too, will return to the other side.\n\nI leave you with this piece of advice: Pandaria is a land of history. If ever you are unsure about the future, you need only to seek answers from the past.\n\nRemember this, and you will thrive here."]="The spirits can finally rest, thanks to you. Soon I, too, will return to the other side.\n\nI leave you with this piece of advice: Pandaria is a land of history. If ever you are unsure about the future, you need only to seek answers from the past.\n\nRemember this, and you will thrive here."
G["The spirits condemn you!"]="Que os espíritos te condenen!"
G["The spirits give us strength!"]="Os eh'píritus os derem força!"
G["The spirits guide our steps as we follow our paths though life, how may I guide yours?"]="The spirits guide our steps as we follow our paths though life, how may I guide yours?"
G["The spirits have abandoned you."]="Os espíritos te têm abandonou."
G["The spirits have brought you to me, and so I feel blessed by them."]="Os espíritos te têm trazido até mim, e posso sentir seu bênção."
G["The spirits have guided you to me. How may I be of service?"]="Os espíritos o guiaram para mim. Como posso ser útil?"
G["The spirits have listened!  Can you feel it, $n?"]="The spirits have listened!  Can you feel it, $n?"
G["The spirits have spoken. I have much to ponder."]="Os espíritos têm falado. Tenho muito que reflexionar."
G["The spirits here have been tormented for a long time. We only want to rest."]="Os espíritos daqui foram atormentados por um longo tempo. Nós só queremos descansar."
G["The spirits o' this land won't tolerate this dark magic and vicious sacrifice any longer.\n\nThe Vilebranch have got to go!"]="The spirits o' this land won't tolerate this dark magic and vicious sacrifice any longer.\n\nThe Vilebranch have got to go!"
G["The spirits of Silithus call out to us, $n.  The land weeps, for it has a woeful story to tell..."]="Os espíritos de Silithus nos chamam, $n. A terra chora pois tem uma triste história que contar..."
G["The spirits of Stonetalon still rage, $n."]="The spirits of Stonetalon still rage, $n."
G["The spirits of air have heard my call. Cyclones will lower us to safety. Now we jump!"]="The spirits of air have heard my call. Cyclones will lower us to safety. Now we jump!"
G["The spirits of the air can be found even here, underground. They dislike being surrounded, constricted by the earth... their precious freedom is limited here."]="The spirits of the air can be found even here, underground. They dislike being surrounded, constricted by the earth... their precious freedom is limited here."
G["The spirits of the elements are wise. They've been here long before us and will persist long after we're gone. When they speak to us, we must listen."]="Os espíritos dos elementos são sábios. Eles estão aqui muito antes de nós e vão persistir muito depois que partimos. Quando eles falam conosco, devemos ouvir."
G["The spirits of the elements surround us. We must always listen. I have seen firsthand the consequences when we ignore their warnings..."]="Os espíritos dos elementos nos cercam. Devemos sempre ouvir. Vi em primeira mão as conseqüências quando ignoramos seus avisos..."
G["The spirits of the taunka will not rest until Steeljaw is dealt with."]="The spirits of the taunka will not rest until Steeljaw is dealt with."
G["The spirits of this place are focused against your kind, $r. Perhaps if you win this tower in the flesh, I will be able to aid you."]="Os espíritos deste lugar estão em contra dos do seu classe, $r. Talvez se logras conquistar a torre com a lâmina eu possa ajudar você."
G["The spirits shall consume you!"]="The spirits shall consume you!"
G["The spirits sing to us!  They sing the song of battle!"]="O espíritos cantam para nós! Cantam a canto da batalha!"
G["The spirits smile upon my victory!"]="Os espíritos sorriem para minha vitória!"
G["The spirits speak all around us. Are you listening, $r?"]="The spirits speak all around us. Are you listening, $r?"
G["The spirits told me you would come, that you would seek me for some reason, but that even you may not know that reason. So, do you know why you are here?"]="Os espíritos disseram para mim que você viria, que me procuraria por algum motivo, mas que nem você sabe disso. Então, você sabe por que você está aqui?"
G["The spirits whisper in my ear.  They are restless and full of angst."]="Os espíritos me o dizem ao ouvido. Estão inquietos e cheios de angústia."
G["The spirits will feast on your blood!"]="The spirits will feast on your blood!"
G["The spirits will guide us in the coming battle."]="The spirits will guide us in the coming battle."
G["The spotted one must be sought. Their fates are entwined."]="The spotted one must be sought. Their fates are entwined."
G["The sprites look angry! Kill them while you can!"]="Os duendes se têm bravo! Mátalos enquanto possa!"
G["The stable is empty! We must provide our cavalry with suitable mounts. Stormpike Stables requests your assistance!"]="O estábulo está vazio! Devemos proporcionar montarias certos a nossa cavalaria. Os estábulos Pico Tempestade requerem sua ajuda!"
G["The stable master"]="O mestre dos estábulos"
G["The stables and mill are left abandoned! What will happen to our horses?"]="The stables and mill are left abandoned! What will happen to our horses?"
G["The stables are full again! Our cavalry is soon to ride!"]="Os estábulos estão cheios novamente! Nossa cavalaria está pronta."
G["The stains are appearing more quickly now!"]="Agora as manchas aparecem com mais rapidez!"
G["The stake is covered with the remnants of those foolish enough to anger the Warchief."]="A estaca está coberta com os restos dos que foram tão estúpidos como para enfadar ao Chefe de Guerra."
G["The stakes will be high."]="Haverá muito em jogo."
G["The stars come to my aid!"]="As estrelas vêm na minha ajuda!"
G["The stars of this time are bent on new paths, beacons of hope and strength for the coming ages."]="As estrelas deste tempo estão inclinadas para novos caminhos, faróis de esperança e força para as eras vindouras."
G["The stars speak to me.  They whisper of the horrors waiting in the night."]="The stars speak to me.  They whisper of the horrors waiting in the night."
G["The stars sweep chill currents that make men shiver in the dark."]="The stars sweep chill currents that make men shiver in the dark."
G["The stars will be in perfect form tonight!"]="The stars will be in perfect form tonight!"
G["The station's mechanics had put him back together, bringing him back to \"life\".\n\nAnd now, by way of thanks, he was going to return the favor by curing all of us of what he called the \"Curse of the Flesh\".\n\nAccording to Mechazod, it's a condition that eventually befalls all of the creations of the Titans! In other words, we all supposedly start out as robots of some kind, and, over thousands of years, slowly turn into fleshy beings!\n\nPreposterous, I know."]="The station's mechanics had put him back together, bringing him back to \"life\".\n\nAnd now, by way of thanks, he was going to return the favor by curing all of us of what he called the \"Curse of the Flesh\".\n\nAccording to Mechazod, it's a condition that eventually befalls all of the creations of the Titans! In other words, we all supposedly start out as robots of some kind, and, over thousands of years, slowly turn into fleshy beings!\n\nPreposterous, I know."
G["The statue appears to be holding something..."]="Parece que a estátua tem algo..."
G["The statue appears to be of an ancient Mogu emperor."]="A estátua parece ser a representação de um antigo imperador mogu."
G["The statue is alive?!"]="A estátua está viva?!"
G["The statue lies dormant."]="A estátua está inerte."
G["The statue softly hums as you approach."]="A estátua emite um som leve quando te acercas."
G["The statue's shoulder looks quite imposing in relation to the rest of its features. The subject was clearly a mighty creature!\n\nPerhaps it's a good natured sort. Or if not, then maybe it's extinct!\n\nOne can hope..."]="The statue's shoulder looks quite imposing in relation to the rest of its features. The subject was clearly a mighty creature!\n\nPerhaps it's a good natured sort. Or if not, then maybe it's extinct!\n\nOne can hope..."
G["The statues all move back into their original positions.\n\nThe sequence must be started again now, from the beginning."]="The statues all move back into their original positions.\n\nThe sequence must be started again now, from the beginning."
G["The statues are all in place, and you may begin the puzzle."]="Todas as estátuas estão no seu lugar, pode começar o rompecabeças."
G["The steam-powered Alliance icebreaker Northspear sails from here to Menethil Harbor in the Wetlands, across the sea in the Eastern Kingdoms."]="O quebra-gelo da Alliance, movido a vapor, Northspear parte daqui para Menethil Harbor, nos pântanos, do outro lado do mar nos reinos do leste."
G["The stench of Alliance scum is in the air."]="O ar fede a escória da Aliança."
G["The stench of sulfur and brimstone... These portals are as foul as the demons themselves."]="The stench of sulfur and brimstone... These portals are as foul as the demons themselves."
G["The stench of that holy trinket you carry disgusts me..."]="The stench of that holy trinket you carry disgusts me..."
G["The stench that surrounds your kind is overwhelming.  You will pay with all the others who commune with demonkind."]="A fedor do seu espécie é insuportável. Te castigaremos igual que a todos os amigos dos demônios."
G["The still needs heat! Light the brazier!"]="The still needs heat! Light the brazier!"
G["The sting of your defeat will fade with time."]="The sting of your defeat will fade with time."
G["The stone begins to fall away from the guardian. The ritual is almost complete!"]="The stone begins to fall away from the guardian. The ritual is almost complete!"
G["The stone calls..."]="A pedras chama..."
G["The stone knife!  Use it NOW!  I can't maintain control of him for much longer..."]="The stone knife!  Use it NOW!  I can't maintain control of him for much longer..."
G["The stone radiates a bitter cold, chilling the air around it and the platform on which it sits. Deep within its facets, a blue light pulses, waiting."]="A pedras irradia um frio intenso, resfriando o ar ao redor e a plataforma em que está assentada. No fundo das suas facetas, uma luz azul pulsa, esperando."
G["The stone thinks itself unmovable until the ground is washed away beneath it."]="A rocha se considera imóvel até que o chão que a sustenta é levado pelas águas."
G["The storm feeds my power!"]="A tempestade alimenta meu poder!"
G["The storm is starting! Get ready."]="Já começa a tempestade! Preparem-se."
G["The storm long spent there rests..."]="Exausta tempestade dorme lá..."
G["The storm will consume you!"]="The storm will consume you!"
G["The storm's knowledge is vast, but it speaks only to Stormbringers, $C. You cannot control such power."]="The storm's knowledge is vast, but it speaks only to Stormbringers, $C. You cannot control such power."
G["The storms speak only to Stormbringers, $C. Your spirit lacks the tempest needed for such power."]="As tempestades falam somente com os PortaTormentas, $C. Seu espírito carece da tempestade necessário para tal poder."
G["The story is still being written..."]="A história ainda está sendo escrita..."
G["The story of your journey will be told for years to come!"]="A história da sua jornada será contada nos próximos anos!"
G["The strain of living... just let go..."]="The strain of living... just let go..."
G["The stranded Alliance sailors know they're going to die, yet they fight us tooth and nail.\n\nImpressive and pathetic at the same time."]="The stranded Alliance sailors know they're going to die, yet they fight us tooth and nail.\n\nImpressive and pathetic at the same time."
G["The strands of LIFE have been severed! The Dreamers must be avenged!"]="Os hilos da VIDA se têm front! Temos que vingar aos Sonhadores!"
G["The strands of life have been severed.\n\nThe dreamers must be avenged."]="Os hilos da vida se têm cortado.\n\nOs sonhadores devem ser vengados."
G["The strands of life..."]="The strands of life..."
G["The stranger having no name of his own, my father deemed \"Yorg,\" a name reserved for champions of legend. Years later, he now stands before us as Yorg Stormheart, King of the Frostborn."]="The stranger having no name of his own, my father deemed \"Yorg,\" a name reserved for champions of legend. Years later, he now stands before us as Yorg Stormheart, King of the Frostborn."
G["The stranger is here!"]="The stranger is here!"
G["The strength of fire lies in change. Its strength is considerable, but ever-shifting... unpredictable."]="A força do fogo está no caminho. A força é importantes, mas sempre muda... É impredecible."
G["The strength of my clan will be with you. I swear it."]="A força de meu clã os acompanhará. O juro."
G["The strength of the White Tiger."]="A força do Tigre Branco."
G["The strength of your resolve shines, $n. You continue to prove that you are an asset to our people. Someday the world will realize the extent of your great deeds."]="The strength of your resolve shines, $n. You continue to prove that you are an asset to our people. Someday the world will realize the extent of your great deeds."
G["The strength to overcome any hardship! This is fortitude."]="A força para superar qualquer dificuldade! Isso é a fortitude."
G["The strength, the wisdom, the unending endurance of the peoples of Azeroth inspires those beyond your reckoning.  On this day, this day of blood and terror, I see that yours is a world of heroes!"]="A força, a sabedoria e a resistência dos povos de Azeroth inspira a mais dos que te imaginas. Neste dia, de sangue e terror, vejo que o seu é um mundo de heróis!"
G["The strong odor coming from the bowl smells like a mixture of various herbs with burning hair."]="O forte odor que sai da tigela cheira a uma mistura de várias ervas com cabelos em chamas."
G["The stronger our defenders, the greater our chance of survival. But that should be obvious, even to someone like you."]="Quanto mais fortes sejam nossos defensores, maior será nossa probabilidade de sobreviver. Mas isso deveria ser obvio, inclusive para alguém como você."
G["The stronger the ingredients, the stronger the magic of the brew."]="Quanto mais fortes sejam os ingredientes, mais potente será a magia da bebida."
G["The strongest hides come from those kodo that have laid themselves to rest in this wasteland."]="As peles mais fortes vêm daqueles kodo que se deitaram para descansar neste terreno baldio."
G["The structure above begins to hum with energy."]="The structure above begins to hum with energy."
G["The students nod slowly, eyes rapt on their teacher."]="The students nod slowly, eyes rapt on their teacher."
G["The sturdy crate sits in the middle of the lumber mill surrounded by debris and very zealous followers of the Scarlet Crusade."]="O robusto engradado fica no meio da serraria, cercado por escombros e seguidores muito zelosos da Cruzada Escarlate."
G["The style of this blade and its markings hinted that it might be a dragonforged sword. At last, we will have our answer."]="The style of this blade and its markings hinted that it might be a dragonforged sword. At last, we will have our answer."
G["The subject is still breathing. Time for another dosage..."]="The subject is still breathing. Time for another dosage..."
G["The subjugation of these people has only just begun... so much time for fun and games."]="The subjugation of these people has only just begun... so much time for fun and games."
G["The submarine's gonna blow! Move out!"]="O submarino vai explodir! Fora!"
G["The summer fields will remain safe as long as I live!"]="The summer fields will remain safe as long as I live!"
G["The summoning incantations have been prepared, but we were depending on the Crucible of Nazsharin to draw power for our spell. The artifact must be recovered."]="Os encantamentos de convocação foram preparados, mas estávamos dependendo do Crisol de Nazsharin para atrair poder para o nosso feitiço. O artefato deve ser recuperei."
G["The summoning of demons is a dangerous practice, but the resulting power can be immense. Our resident expert is Alamma, who watches over the warlocks within Murder Row."]="A convocação de demônios é uma prática perigosa, mas o poder resultante pode ser imenso. Nosso especiapronta residente é Alamma, que vigia os feiticeiros em Murder Row."
G["The summoning runes were already drawn when we arrived. You'll need to destroy all of them."]="The summoning runes were already drawn when we arrived. You'll need to destroy all of them."
G["The sun burned me bad, but I got my hands around his slimy neck."]="The sun burned me bad, but I got my hands around his slimy neck."
G["The sun eclipses. Darkness crawls through earth and ash. The seas are as blood..."]="O sol se eclipsa. A escuridão se arraste pela terra e a cinza. Os mares são como sangue..."
G["The sun gate must be stabilized. Focus your energies!"]="The sun gate must be stabilized. Focus your energies!"
G["The sun has set on this mortal world, fools. Make peace with your end, for the hour of Twilight falls."]="O sol se tem posto neste mundo mortal, insensatos. Aceito seu fim, porque o ocaso se aproxima."
G["The sun has set on this mortal world, fools. Make peace with your end, for the hour of twilight falls!"]="O sol se tem posto neste mundo mortal, insensatos. Aceito seu fim, porque o ocaso se aproxima!"
G["The sun of life will set forever, as light gives way to eternal night! (Oblivion looms! It calls!)"]="O sol da vida se pondrá para sempre, e a luz dará passo à noite eterna. (O esquecimento se aproxima! Chama!)"
G["The sun still shines upon you, $C, but you are no Sun Cleric."]="O sol continua brilhando sobre você, $C, mas já não é um Sacerdote Solar."
G["The sun... shines through..."]="O sol... se abra passo..."
G["The surface of the %s begins to bubble."]="The surface of the %s begins to bubble."
G["The surface quakes..."]="A superfície se sacode..."
G["The surrounding air crackles with energy...."]="The surrounding air crackles with energy...."
G["The survey team has done well. This is an ideal deep-water port."]="The survey team has done well. This is an ideal deep-water port."
G["The swamp conceals many things."]="O pântano esconde muitas coisas."
G["The swamp was horrible! I was so... so... scared!"]="O pântano era horrível! Tinha t.. tanto m... medo!"
G["The swarm is eager to feed."]="The swarm is eager to feed."
G["The swarm is the blade that will cut through our enemies!"]="O enxame é a lâmina que segará a nossos inimigos!"
G["The swarm of the elements shall overtake you!"]="O azote dos elementos poderá com vocês!"
G["The swarm shall darken the skies with our numbers! We shall cast eternal night upon this land!"]="The swarm shall darken the skies with our numbers! We shall cast eternal night upon this land!"
G["The swarm shall overtake you!"]="O enxame os vencerá!"
G["The swarm will consume you!"]="O enxame os consumirá!"
G["The sweet irony -- Stormwind forces cut down in defense of their city, only to rise and fight alongside the Brotherhood as instruments of destruction."]="The sweet irony -- Stormwind forces cut down in defense of their city, only to rise and fight alongside the Brotherhood as instruments of destruction."
G["The swell of souls will not be abated! You only delay the inevitable."]="The swell of souls will not be abated! You only delay the inevitable."
G["The swoop egg is destroyed..."]="The swoop egg is destroyed..."
G["The sword has pierced his infernal armor! Strike him down!"]="The sword has pierced his infernal armor! Strike him down!"
G["The sword isn't a tool, it's an extension of you. I expect better!"]="The sword isn't a tool, it's an extension of you. I expect better!"
G["The symbols on the tablet are carefully transcribed..."]="Os símbolos no tablet são cuidadosamente transcritos..."
G["The tabard was pink when I got it back, Buckets. Pink! Think about that..."]="The tabard was pink when I got it back, Buckets. Pink! Think about that..."
G["The tablet has the confirmation we need, just as I thought. Now, we have to use this information to draw out and defeat this Anzu before he can do any more damage to the Emerald Dream!"]="Como eu achava, a tabuleta contém a confirmação que precisamos de. Agora temos que usar esta informações para vencer a Anzu antes de que possa fazer mais dano ao Sonho Esmeralda!"
G["The tag on this present reads: \"For ages 10 and up.\""]="A tag deste presente diz: \"Para maiores de 10 anos.\""
G["The tag on this present reads: \"For ages 20 and up.\""]="A tag deste presente diz: \"Para maiores de 20 anos.\""
G["The tag on this present reads: \"For ages 40 and up.\""]="A tag deste presente diz: \"Para maiores de 40 anos.\""
G["The tailor Keelen is always seeking more curious students to teach his delicate craft. His shop is somewhat difficult to uncover at first, but it's just north of the auction house in the Bazaar. You'll find him on the lower level of the building."]="O alfaiate Keelen está sempre procurando estudantes mais curiosos para ensinar seu ofício delicado. Sua loja é um pouco difícil de descobrir no começo, mas fica ao norte da casa de leilões no Bazar. Você o encontrará no nível mais baixo do edifício."
G["The tailor here's Josef Gregorian. He's in the Magic Quarter on the inner ring."]="O alfaiate aqui é Josef Gregorian. Ele está no bairro mágico no anel interno."
G["The taking of Crusaders' Pinnacle is only the first step in a long and dangerous journey. There is much left to do before we are able to assault Icecrown Citadel.\n\nIt can only be possible with help from you and others like you, hero."]="The taking of Crusaders' Pinnacle is only the first step in a long and dangerous journey. There is much left to do before we are able to assault Icecrown Citadel.\n\nIt can only be possible with help from you and others like you, hero."
G["The tale of ol' Duncan is a sad one, I'm afraid.  I used to be captain of me own ship, ye know?\n\nOne more demotion and I'll be a swabbie again.  I don't think I could take the humiliation."]="The tale of ol' Duncan is a sad one, I'm afraid.  I used to be captain of me own ship, ye know?\n\nOne more demotion and I'll be a swabbie again.  I don't think I could take the humiliation."
G["The taskmaster's dead!  Quick, Dreghoods!  Run!"]="The taskmaster's dead!  Quick, Dreghoods!  Run!"
G["The taste of defeat... so strange and unfamiliar. Thank you for keeping me humble."]="The taste of defeat... so strange and unfamiliar. Thank you for keeping me humble."
G["The tauren are the most majestic of hunters."]="Os tauren são os caçadores mais magenstuosos."
G["The tauren have made themselves useful. Look - this one is a shaman."]="Os tauren têm encontrado formas de ajudar. Olhe: este é um xamã."
G["The tauren of Thunder Bluff cheer for $n."]="The tauren of Thunder Bluff cheer for $n."
G["The tauren says, \"That's a load of bull.\""]="E o tauren diz, \"Não te o acha nem você.\""
G["The techniques he has suggested have been most effective in preparing the troops."]="As técnicas que tem sugerido têm resultados ser eficaces para treinar aos soldados."
G["The teleporter is ready! Let's get out of here!"]="O teletransportador está pronto! Vamos de aqui!"
G["The temperature is 12 degrees Kraklenheit. How exciting."]="A temperatura é de 12 graus Kraklenheit! Que excitante!"
G["The temperature is 122 degrees Kraklenheit."]="A temperatura é de 122 graus Kraklenheit!"
G["The temperature is 564 degrees Kraklenheit."]="A temperatura é de 564 graus Kraklenheit."
G["The temperature is 9280 degrees Kraklenheit! That's HOT!"]="A temperatura é de 9280 graus Kraklenheit! É muito alta!"
G["The temperature is... not hot enough!"]="A temperatura não é... o suficiente alta!"
G["The temple has been infiltrated! Alarm! ALARM!"]="Alguém se tem infiltrado no templo! Alerta! ALERTA!"
G["The temple is breached, masters! ALARM!"]="Alerta de segurança, mestres! ALERTA!"
G["The temple is under siege. We need you outside, now!"]="O templo está sob cerco. Precisamos de você fosse, agora!"
G["The temple must not fall!"]="O templo não deve cair!"
G["The temple walls have been breached!"]="The temple walls have been breached!"
G["The temple will be ours!"]="O templo será nosso!"
G["The temple will fall! You cannot stop my forces!"]="O templo cairá! Não podem parar a meus tropas!"
G["The temple will not fall!"]="O templo não cairá!"
G["The tenacity of the wolf ancient is the stuff of legend.\n\nLearn from his example, $c, and victory is all but certain."]="A tenacidade do ancestral lobo é lendária.\n\nContinua seu exemplo, $c e a vitória será nossa com toda segurança."
G["The terrace was not meant for your kind!"]="The terrace was not meant for your kind!"
G["The terrace... must not... fall..."]="The terrace... must not... fall..."
G["The terrified bear cub refuses to leave the tree!"]="The terrified bear cub refuses to leave the tree!"
G["The thane spits as the first of his champions falls."]="O senhor feudal escupe quando cai o primeiro dos seus campeões."
G["The theory behind it is that we completely destroy you with a massive explosion wherever you are and send those particles through a dimensional rip and then re-implode you at the machine here.   Instant Transport!    It might not work ALL the time, but what kind of goblin engineer are you!   If survival was your first priority you could never be a real Goblin Engineer!\nHere is the recipe you will need to make the Dimensional Ripper and try it out!"]="The theory behind it is that we completely destroy you with a massive explosion wherever you are and send those particles through a dimensional rip and then re-implode you at the machine here.   Instant Transport!    It might not work ALL the time, but what kind of goblin engineer are you!   If survival was your first priority you could never be a real Goblin Engineer!\nHere is the recipe you will need to make the Dimensional Ripper and try it out!"
G["The things I do for the Alliance..."]="As coisas que faço pela Aliança..."
G["The things I have done... such horrible things...\n\n<Tarsis begins to sob.>"]="The things I have done... such horrible things...\n\n<Tarsis begins to sob.>"
G["The things I show you now must never be spoken of outside Voltarus. The world shall come to know our secret soon enough!"]="The things I show you now must never be spoken of outside Voltarus. The world shall come to know our secret soon enough!"
G["The things I would teach you would turn your brain to jelly! Come back when you've learned sufficiently!"]="As coisas que eu ensinaria a você transformavam seu cérebro em geléia! Volte quando tiver aprendido o suficiente!"
G["The things I've seen... so beautiful...  if only I were a poet..."]="As coisas que vi... Que lindas... Se fosse poeta..."
G["The things we love destroy us every time, $c, remember that."]="Aquilo que amamos nos destrói sempre, $c, lembre-se disso."
G["The third lock of the Thrice-Locked cage clicks and falls to the ground. The cage opens!"]="The third lock of the Thrice-Locked cage clicks and falls to the ground. The cage opens!"
G["The thousandth challenger cheated."]="O número mil fez trampas."
G["The threads that holds together the abominations of Stratholme are highly sought after by artisan craftsmen: Extremely resilient - nearly unbreakable."]="The threads that holds together the abominations of Stratholme are highly sought after by artisan craftsmen: Extremely resilient - nearly unbreakable."
G["The threat be over! $n be savin' us all!"]="A ameaça terminada! $n salva a todos!"
G["The threat to Silap Inua is known as those who would cage it. They will be called the blue-scaled ones."]="The threat to Silap Inua is known as those who would cage it. They will be called the blue-scaled ones."
G["The three fissures opened by the mortals of this region must be silenced. The earth hears and sees what we do and will continue to interfere with our efforts if the way is not closed."]="The three fissures opened by the mortals of this region must be silenced. The earth hears and sees what we do and will continue to interfere with our efforts if the way is not closed."
G["The thrill of the hunt, right lads?!"]="A emoção da caça, eh, pessoal?"
G["The thundering depths call to you..."]="As profundezas atronadoras te chamam..."
G["The tide cannot be stopped!"]="The tide cannot be stopped!"
G["The tide has brought me a story. Listen, and be enlightened."]="The tide has brought me a story. Listen, and be enlightened."
G["The tide has turned? I've got to get back to the fight!"]="Têm mudado as tornas? Devo voltar à batalha!"
G["The tides do as Elune commands."]="As marés fazem o que Eluna ordena."
G["The tides of war have come again. From the cold north, the Lich King's necropolises have laid siege to our lands.  He sends flying necropolises to invade across the world."]="As marés da guerra voltaram. Do norte frio, as necrópoles de Rei Lich sitiaram nossas terras. Ele envia necrópoles voadoras para invadir o mundo."
G["The tides shall wash away the entire Darkspear Tribe."]="Lasss marés ssse levarão a toda a tribo Lança Negra."
G["The tiger matriarch appears! Prove yourself in combat!"]="Aparecna Matriarca tigresa! Demonstra seu coragem em combate!"
G["The time I spent binding that, WASTED!"]="O tempo que pasé vinculándolo, PERDIDO!"
G["The time for celebration is done."]="O tempo de festa terminou."
G["The time for conquest approaches quickly."]="A hora da conquista se aproxima."
G["The time for practice is over! Show me what you have learned!"]="The time for practice is over! Show me what you have learned!"
G["The time for the Crusade is now!"]="É a hora da Cruzada!"
G["The time for us to rise and strike at the fel orcs that remain is now! Do this for your Warchief! Do this for the Horde!"]="The time for us to rise and strike at the fel orcs that remain is now! Do this for your Warchief! Do this for the Horde!"
G["The time for vengeance draws near."]="Se aproxima a hora da vingança."
G["The time for war is almost upon us, $c! Both the Horde and the Alliance have finished with their preparations. All of our war materiel is being shipped to Silithus as we speak. I'd expect it all to arrive within $2113w days. When all is assembled there, the one who has completed the arduous task of reassembling the Scepter of the Shifting Sands will bang it against the Scarab Gong and open the gates to Ahn'Qiraj. Then battle shall be joined as has not been seen in ages!\n\nLok'tar Ogar!"]="The time for war is almost upon us, $c! Both the Horde and the Alliance have finished with their preparations. All of our war materiel is being shipped to Silithus as we speak. I'd expect it all to arrive within $2113w days. When all is assembled there, the one who has completed the arduous task of reassembling the Scepter of the Shifting Sands will bang it against the Scarab Gong and open the gates to Ahn'Qiraj. Then battle shall be joined as has not been seen in ages!\n\nLok'tar Ogar!"
G["The time for war is almost upon us, $c! Both the Horde and the Alliance have finished with their preparations. All of our war materiel is being shipped to Silithus as we speak. I'd expect the last of it to arrive within a day. When all is assembled there, the one who has completed the arduous task of reassembling the Scepter of the Shifting Sands will bang it against the Scarab Gong and open the gates to Ahn'Qiraj. Then battle shall be joined as has not been seen in ages!\n\nLok'tar Ogar!"]="The time for war is almost upon us, $c! Both the Horde and the Alliance have finished with their preparations. All of our war materiel is being shipped to Silithus as we speak. I'd expect the last of it to arrive within a day. When all is assembled there, the one who has completed the arduous task of reassembling the Scepter of the Shifting Sands will bang it against the Scarab Gong and open the gates to Ahn'Qiraj. Then battle shall be joined as has not been seen in ages!\n\nLok'tar Ogar!"
G["The time for your destruction has finally come, Dimensius!"]="Chegou a hora do seu destruição, Dimensius!"
G["The time has come for Horde and Alliance to look towards Northrend and the invasion of the Lich King. In recent days, territories across Kalimdor and the Eastern Kingdoms have come under attack. Will you take up arms to save your land from destruction at their hands?"]="Chegou a hora da Horda e da Aliança olharem para Northrend e a invasão do Rei Lich. Nos últimos dias, territórios entre Kalimdor e os reinos do leste foram atacados. Você pegará em armas para salvar sua terra da destruição nas mãos deles?"
G["The time has come for Noblegarden once again! Time to thank the Light for the rebirth of the world."]="Chegou a hora de Noblegarden mais uma vez! Hora de agradecer à Luz pelo renascimento do mundo."
G["The time has come for me to once again make my wares available to all who travel near Sentinel Hill! Come one, come all!"]="The time has come for me to once again make my wares available to all who travel near Sentinel Hill! Come one, come all!"
G["The time has come for my husband, our king, to rejoin us. Together we will scour this world of its unworthy infestation!"]="Chegou o momentos de que meu marido, nosso rei, se reúna conosco. Juntos liberaremos ao mundo desta indigna praga!"
G["The time has come to act. We must decide how to deal with the Scourge before it consumes us."]="Chegou a hora de entrar em ação. Devemos decidir que fazer com o Flagelo antes de que nos consumo."
G["The time has come to destroy the Vector Coil!"]="Chegou a hora de destruir a bobina de vetor!"
G["The time has come to face Illidan, $n.  Are you ready?"]="The time has come to face Illidan, $n.  Are you ready?"
G["The time has come to make things right. To disband your treacherous kingdom of murderers and thieves. Putress was the first strike. Many more will come."]="The time has come to make things right. To disband your treacherous kingdom of murderers and thieves. Putress was the first strike. Many more will come."
G["The time has come to prove your worth as a wing man, $n. Take this beacon and plant it dead center of the Snowfall graveyard. Defend it until my fleet arrives.\n\n<Mulverick salutes.>"]="The time has come to prove your worth as a wing man, $n. Take this beacon and plant it dead center of the Snowfall graveyard. Defend it until my fleet arrives.\n\n<Mulverick salutes.>"
G["The time has come to shatter this clockwork universe forever! Let us no longer be slaves of the hourglass! I warn you: those who do not embrace this greater path shall become victims of its passing!"]="The time has come to shatter this clockwork universe forever! Let us no longer be slaves of the hourglass! I warn you: those who do not embrace this greater path shall become victims of its passing!"
G["The time has come!  March onward, and bring doom to the frightened denizens of this blasted land!"]="The time has come!  March onward, and bring doom to the frightened denizens of this blasted land!"
G["The time has come! Gul'dan, order your warlocks to double their efforts! Moments from now the gateway will open and your Horde will be released upon this ripe, unsuspecting world!"]="The time has come! Gul'dan, order your warlocks to double their efforts! Moments from now the gateway will open and your Horde will be released upon this ripe, unsuspecting world!"
G["The time has come! The moment is at hand!"]="Chegou a hora: é nosso momentos!"
G["The time has come, Guse. You fly again!"]="The time has come, Guse. You fly again!"
G["The time has come, brothers and sisters, to stop this injustice!"]="The time has come, brothers and sisters, to stop this injustice!"
G["The time has come, brothers. We must not let the enemy advance through Frost Dagger Pass. Some of us will surely perish, but would any of you shy away from this duty? This honor? Onward! For the Horde!"]="The time has come, brothers. We must not let the enemy advance through Frost Dagger Pass. Some of us will surely perish, but would any of you shy away from this duty? This honor? Onward! For the Horde!"
G["The time has come, my $c friend, to talk of other things. Of crabs and seas and turtles with trees..."]="The time has come, my $c friend, to talk of other things. Of crabs and seas and turtles with trees..."
G["The time has come, my $g brother : sister; in arms, to take back the night from the Scourge!"]="Chegou a hora, $ghermano: irmã;, às armas, é preciso recuperar a noite do Flagelo!"
G["The time has come, my $r friend, to talk of other things. Of hozen and grummles and how my tummy rumbles..."]="The time has come, my $r friend, to talk of other things. Of hozen and grummles and how my tummy rumbles..."
G["The time has come, my little captive... word has come back from your father."]="The time has come, my little captive... word has come back from your father."
G["The time has come, my little friend, to talk of other things. Of mogu and trolls and jinyu river tolls..."]="Meu $gpequeno amigo: pequena amiga;, chegou o momentos de falar de outras coisas. De mogu, de trolls, de jinyu e de gnolls..."
G["The time has come, my silly friend, to talk of other things. Of yetis and yaks and random shark attacks..."]="Meu $gcurioso amigo: curiosa amiga;, chegou o momentos de falar de outras coisas. De yeti, de yaks, e de muitas coisas mais..."
G["The time has come, soldiers! Godfrey lies just ahead! Have no mercy! We fight-"]="The time has come, soldiers! Godfrey lies just ahead! Have no mercy! We fight-"
G["The time has come.  Strike down every creature that stands in the way of the clans!"]="The time has come.  Strike down every creature that stands in the way of the clans!"
G["The time has now come for you to face our enemies on the field of battle. As I speak our brothers and sisters fight to fend off the forces of Kil'jaeden on the isle of Quel'Danas."]="The time has now come for you to face our enemies on the field of battle. As I speak our brothers and sisters fight to fend off the forces of Kil'jaeden on the isle of Quel'Danas."
G["The time is nearly here! We shall sweep across this land, sacrificing all who defy us!"]="Já quase é a hora! Barreremos esta terra, sacrificando a todos os que nos desafíen!"
G["The time is now! Leave none standing!"]="Chegou o momentos! Que não que nem um em pé!"
G["The time may soon come when the kaldorei require the knowledge and skill we have to offer."]="The time may soon come when the kaldorei require the knowledge and skill we have to offer."
G["The time of awakening must be near, but they have not yet come for me. Why do the Klaxxi wait?"]="The time of awakening must be near, but they have not yet come for me. Why do the Klaxxi wait?"
G["The time of judgement is nigh. In your heart, you know justice is the only true path."]="O tempo do julgamento está próximo. No seu coração, você sabe que a justiça é o único caminho verdadeiro."
G["The time of our retribution is at hand! Let darkness reign in the hearts of our enemies!"]="A hora das recompensas está próxima! Que a escuridão gobierne o coração de nossos inimigos!"
G["The time of the Argent Crusade is now!"]="Este é o momentos da Cruzada Argêntea."
G["The time of the Raven is nigh, but yours will end here!"]="The time of the Raven is nigh, but yours will end here!"
G["The time of the dragons is over..."]="O tempo dos dragões terminou..."
G["The time of your reckoning is upon us."]="A hora do acerto de contas está próxima."
G["The time to feed is now, minion. Wake!"]="The time to feed is now, minion. Wake!"
G["The time to strike at the head of the beast will soon be upon us! Focus your anger and hatred on his minions!"]="The time to strike at the head of the beast will soon be upon us! Focus your anger and hatred on his minions!"
G["The time to strike at the remaining blood elves of Tempest Keep is now. Take arms and let A'dal's song of battle empower you!"]="The time to strike at the remaining blood elves of Tempest Keep is now. Take arms and let A'dal's song of battle empower you!"
G["The time to strike is at hand. Terminate Icarius."]="The time to strike is at hand. Terminate Icarius."
G["The time to take back Gilneas City is at hand."]="O momentos de recuperar Gilneas City está próximo."
G["The times we live in are as fickle as the shifting winds, $c. The ground itself quakes and cries out in anguish. We must remain resolute or we ourselves will be engulfed by the turmoil."]="The times we live in are as fickle as the shifting winds, $c. The ground itself quakes and cries out in anguish. We must remain resolute or we ourselves will be engulfed by the turmoil."
G["The timeway collapsed with five of our agents inside."]="O portal do tempo se veio baixo com cinco de nossos agentes no seu interior."
G["The timeways are currently ranked in order from least catastrophic to most catastrophic. Note that they are all classified as catastrophic, meaning that any single one of these timeways collapsing would mean that your world would end. We only classify them in such a way so that the heroes and adventurers that are sent here know which timeway best suits their abilities."]="The timeways are currently ranked in order from least catastrophic to most catastrophic. Note that they are all classified as catastrophic, meaning that any single one of these timeways collapsing would mean that your world would end. We only classify them in such a way so that the heroes and adventurers that are sent here know which timeway best suits their abilities."
G["The tinkerer's craft for you is it?  No doubt ye'll want to go see Springspindle Fizzlegear in Tinker Town.  \nJust head east from the gates of Ironforge, or follow the sound of the explosions."]="The tinkerer's craft for you is it?  No doubt ye'll want to go see Springspindle Fizzlegear in Tinker Town.  \nJust head east from the gates of Ironforge, or follow the sound of the explosions."
G["The tireless efforts of the Shado-Pan are the only thing keeping this land from being ravaged by the mantid swarm. We do not ask thanks for this, but now we are faced with a time when we can no longer accomplish this task alone."]="The tireless efforts of the Shado-Pan are the only thing keeping this land from being ravaged by the mantid swarm. We do not ask thanks for this, but now we are faced with a time when we can no longer accomplish this task alone."
G["The titan Waygate is almost opened. We will assist the Tol'vir to reconfigure Uldum and bring about the end of all life on Azeroth!"]="A porta dos titãs quase está aberta. Ajudaremos aos Tol'vir a reconfigurar Uldum e propiciaremos o fim de toda vida em Azeroth!"
G["The titans did not create life overnight.  The process was gradual and required a great deal of experimentation and iteration.\n\nIt is for that reason that highly protected places such as Sholazar Basin exist.\n\nTo ensure the safety of their experimentation sites, the titans created a defense mechanism.  Its destructive force is unparalleled however, and I will reveal no more unless you swear your fealty to my cause."]="The titans did not create life overnight.  The process was gradual and required a great deal of experimentation and iteration.\n\nIt is for that reason that highly protected places such as Sholazar Basin exist.\n\nTo ensure the safety of their experimentation sites, the titans created a defense mechanism.  Its destructive force is unparalleled however, and I will reveal no more unless you swear your fealty to my cause."
G["The title is misleading. I'm really a very nice person once you get to know me."]="O título é enganoso. Eu sou mesmo uma pessoa muito legal quando você me conhece."
G["The title of this book reads with a handwritten flourish: Maureen Dalson's Diary."]="O título deste livro é lido com um floreio manuscrito: Diário de Maureen Dalson."
G["The toils of the living never cease to amaze. Your numbers are limited, and with every battle they dwindle further. You will not live to see the end!"]="The toils of the living never cease to amaze. Your numbers are limited, and with every battle they dwindle further. You will not live to see the end!"
G["The tools are weak!"]="Essas ferramentas são mais!"
G["The tools are weak? You're weak! I've been in this business fifty years."]="Que as ferramentas são mais? Você si que é ruim. Levo neste negócios cinquenta anos."
G["The torture of a thousand screaming deaths awaits..."]="The torture of a thousand screaming deaths awaits..."
G["The tortured spirits of your ancestors cling to you, screaming in silence. Apparently they are quite numerous."]="The tortured spirits of your ancestors cling to you, screaming in silence. Apparently they are quite numerous."
G["The totem has finished taking its sample!"]="O totem terminou de pegar seu mostra!"
G["The totem is halfway finished with taking its sample."]="O totem está a meio caminho de terminar de pegar seu mostra."
G["The totem is made, $n."]="O totem está feito, $n."
G["The totem is made.  The well may now be cleansed."]="O totem está feito. Agora se poderá limpar o poço."
G["The touch of creation... and destruction."]="O toque da criação... e a destruição."
G["The tour guide will be along soon..."]="O guia virá pronto..."
G["The tournament's seneschal has asked us to shoulder some of the burden of running the competition now that the coliseum is finished. Those who have earned the right to stand as champions and who have proven themselves in our eyes are asked to assist with these duties."]="O senescal do torneio nos pediu para arcar com parte do fardo de dirigir a competição agora que o coliseu terminou. Aqueles que conquistaram o direito de permanecer como campeões e que se provaram aos nossos olhos são convidados a ajudar com esses deveres."
G["The tower is just there. I will cover you from the sky. Be quick."]="The tower is just there. I will cover you from the sky. Be quick."
G["The tower is no place for the uninitiated!"]="A torre não é lugar para os não iniciados!"
G["The tower reinforcements will not abandon their post!"]="The tower reinforcements will not abandon their post!"
G["The tower's defenses are at their weakest right now. The patrollers, sentries, lookouts, and even Gallywix himself are all infected and highly vulnerable to your special abilities and attacks.\n\nI want to see you enter that tower and when you exit, I want to see you covered in the blood of your enemies, the head of Grand Foreman Puzik Gallywix in your hands, and the last of that poison in your pack. Take what you recover to Shenthul. He'll know what to do... I hope."]="The tower's defenses are at their weakest right now. The patrollers, sentries, lookouts, and even Gallywix himself are all infected and highly vulnerable to your special abilities and attacks.\n\nI want to see you enter that tower and when you exit, I want to see you covered in the blood of your enemies, the head of Grand Foreman Puzik Gallywix in your hands, and the last of that poison in your pack. Take what you recover to Shenthul. He'll know what to do... I hope."
G["The towers and bunkers in Alterac Valley are vital strategic locales.  If we control a tower, then our troops can fire great distances from it."]="As torres e bunkers no Vale Alterac são locais estratégicos vitais. Se controlarmos uma torre, nossas tropas poderão disparar grandes distâncias."
G["The town still burns, a cleansing fire!  Time is short, I'll soon retire!"]="A cidade ainda arde, com fogo a purifico! Já fica pouco, pronto me jubilo!"
G["The town... demolished! We couldn't stop them."]="The town... demolished! We couldn't stop them."
G["The toxin is ready, $n."]="A toxina já está pronta, $n."
G["The tracks are smeared, almost as if the creature drags its feet."]="The tracks are smeared, almost as if the creature drags its feet."
G["The trail leads to the northeast.  Follow me if you would."]="The trail leads to the northeast.  Follow me if you would."
G["The trainees will be quite disappointed if I don't get all of these kegs back together for them. What a mess..."]="Os aprendices estarão bastante decepcionados se não recupero todos os barris. Que desastre..."
G["The training you gave us is paying off, sire!"]="O treinamento que nos deu funciona, senhor!"
G["The traitor helped planned this!  He helped to massacre them."]="The traitor helped planned this!  He helped to massacre them."
G["The translocator hums, awaiting your command."]="O trasladador da zumbidos esperando sua ordem."
G["The transporter glimmers with a crystalline light."]="O transportador brilha com uma luz cristalina."
G["The trap emits a raptor-like screech!"]="A armadilha emite um grito como o de um raptores!"
G["The trees are dying. Kypari Vor is already dead... a victim of the sha. It will never again produce amber. It barely even looks like a tree anymore.\n\nThe few amber-producing trees that remain are either being overharvested by the mantid, or in danger of succumbing to sha. Either way, no more sap means no more sapmasters. At which point, I'd have to return to my old job."]="The trees are dying. Kypari Vor is already dead... a victim of the sha. It will never again produce amber. It barely even looks like a tree anymore.\n\nThe few amber-producing trees that remain are either being overharvested by the mantid, or in danger of succumbing to sha. Either way, no more sap means no more sapmasters. At which point, I'd have to return to my old job."
G["The trees here are more beautiful than any I have seen in my travels."]="Os árvores de aqui são mais bonitos que qualquer que tenha visto nos meus viagens."
G["The trees here are more beautiful than even the ones in the southern jungle."]="Os árvores de aqui são ainda mais bonitos que os da selva do sul."
G["The trees here in the Highlands are made of stout wood. And some of them... stone. I don't pretend to understand.\n\nWe've got diamond-bladed shredders to harvest the stuff, but the Alliance keeps whacking them."]="The trees here in the Highlands are made of stout wood. And some of them... stone. I don't pretend to understand.\n\nWe've got diamond-bladed shredders to harvest the stuff, but the Alliance keeps whacking them."
G["The trial begins!"]="Começa a prova!"
G["The tribe thanks you for your deeds, $n."]="A tribo agradece sua ajuda, $n."
G["The tribe will prevail!"]="A tribo prevalecerá!"
G["The tribes have assembled - ye face not one force, but the combined might of all of the troll empire! The hand of Zul will span all the continents of Azeroth once again! An ye lesser races will know pain!"]="The tribes have assembled - ye face not one force, but the combined might of all of the troll empire! The hand of Zul will span all the continents of Azeroth once again! An ye lesser races will know pain!"
G["The trick to dealing with pirate hozen is to have the element of surprise."]="O truco para lidar com hozen piratas é o factor surpresa."
G["The trick to using evasion is realizing that the best fifteen seconds of your life are often the last."]="O truque para usar a evasão é perceber que os melhores quinze segundos da sua vida costumam ser os últimos."
G["The trick, Wakener, is to be like water. Do not resist your enemy's force - simply flow with it. Let his blows drift past you. Then IMPALE HIM."]="The trick, Wakener, is to be like water. Do not resist your enemy's force - simply flow with it. Let his blows drift past you. Then IMPALE HIM."
G["The trickster Mage-Lord Urom protects the third ring.  He will appear alone and defenseless, but do not be fooled by appearances!  Urom is a powerful conjurer who commands a menagerie of Phantasmal creatures.  Seek him out above."]="The trickster Mage-Lord Urom protects the third ring.  He will appear alone and defenseless, but do not be fooled by appearances!  Urom is a powerful conjurer who commands a menagerie of Phantasmal creatures.  Seek him out above."
G["The trickster Mage-Lord Urom protects the third ring.  He will appear alone and defenseless, but do not be fooled by appearances!  Urom is a powerful conjurer who commands a menagerie of Phantasmal creatures.  Seek him out above.\nI can grant you the power to call upon a drake from the red flight.  Speak to Eternos or Verdisa if you prefer to draw on the power of the bronze or the green."]="The trickster Mage-Lord Urom protects the third ring.  He will appear alone and defenseless, but do not be fooled by appearances!  Urom is a powerful conjurer who commands a menagerie of Phantasmal creatures.  Seek him out above.\nI can grant you the power to call upon a drake from the red flight.  Speak to Eternos or Verdisa if you prefer to draw on the power of the bronze or the green."
G["The tricky part is, he was frozen in jade while dueling a mogu that history names \"The Jade Warlord.\""]="O problema era que foi preso em jade, em pleno combate contra um mogu que conhecemos como \"o senhor da guerra de jade\"."
G["The trillium you brought me must be refined for our purposes."]="The trillium you brought me must be refined for our purposes."
G["The triumphant $g hero : heroine; returns!\n\nYou haven't seen Magmatooth around, have you?\n\n<The initiate looks worried.>"]="The triumphant $g hero : heroine; returns!\n\nYou haven't seen Magmatooth around, have you?\n\n<The initiate looks worried.>"
G["The troggs are retaking the Irondeep Mine!"]="Os troggs estão recuperando a Mina Ferrofundo!"
G["The troggs...they never stop coming.  Die trogg!  Die!"]="Os troggs... não deixam de vir. Morre, trogg! Morre!"
G["The trolls are acting strangely, $n.  I don't like it.  I don't like it one bit."]="Os trolls actúan de forma estranha, $n. Não me gosta. Não me gosta nem um cabelo."
G["The trolls here are quite accepting of my kind. After all, they spoke to the dead for centuries before the Forsaken even existed.\n\nIt's good for business."]="The trolls here are quite accepting of my kind. After all, they spoke to the dead for centuries before the Forsaken even existed.\n\nIt's good for business."
G["The trolls of Stranglethorn don't take too kindly to us Darkspear.  I'm not afraid of no Bloodscalp or Skullsplitter, but still... Grom'gol's high walls make me feel safe."]="Os trolls de Espinhaço espinhoso não nos agradam muito com a Lança Sombria. Eu não tenho medo de Bloodscalp ou Skullsplitter, mas ainda assim... Muros altos de Grom'gol me fazem sentir certa."
G["The trolls of the Sen'jin Village begin a chant to celebrate $n."]="The trolls of the Sen'jin Village begin a chant to celebrate $n."
G["The true Horde cannot be STOPPED!"]="Ninguém pode parar à... Horda... autêntico!"
G["The true Horde will triumph."]="A Horda autêntico prevalecerá."
G["The true Horde, the pure Horde, cannot be stopped!"]="Ninguém pode parar à Horda autêntico, a Horda pura!"
G["The true Horde... will prevail."]="A Horda verdadeira prevalecerá!"
G["The true believers have lived in shame since the day our treacherous cousins in Skettis stole the book from us, shattered its tablet, and buried the fragments in their wretched city!\n\nPray that the raven will choose you to restore it, my son. Be faithful and remember always the prophecy, \"From the dreams of his enemies shall the raven spring forth into the world.\""]="The true believers have lived in shame since the day our treacherous cousins in Skettis stole the book from us, shattered its tablet, and buried the fragments in their wretched city!\n\nPray that the raven will choose you to restore it, my son. Be faithful and remember always the prophecy, \"From the dreams of his enemies shall the raven spring forth into the world.\""
G["The true crusader is more than just a hero in the battle against evil... he is an exemplar, a rallier to the cause, a champion in the eyes of all his people.\n\nAs High Crusader, it is my duty to task such men and women with worthy quests."]="The true crusader is more than just a hero in the battle against evil... he is an exemplar, a rallier to the cause, a champion in the eyes of all his people.\n\nAs High Crusader, it is my duty to task such men and women with worthy quests."
G["The true horde will rule all of Azeroth."]="The true horde will rule all of Azeroth."
G["The true master has emerged victorious."]="O mestre verdadeiro surge vitorioso."
G["The truth shall set you free. Like us, you will be with IT forever!"]="A verdade te fará livre. Ao igual que nós, estará com ELHO para sempre!"
G["The tub needs more water!"]="A tina precisa mais água!"
G["The tumultuous nature of the great waterways of Azeroth and Draenor are a direct result of tormented water spirits."]="The tumultuous nature of the great waterways of Azeroth and Draenor are a direct result of tormented water spirits."
G["The turmoil in Kun-Lai Summit has uprooted many innocents. They will find shelter within our gates."]="The turmoil in Kun-Lai Summit has uprooted many innocents. They will find shelter within our gates."
G["The tusked people call it Silap Inua."]="Os dos presas o chamam Silap Inua."
G["The twists and turns of Orgrimmar are designed to thwart invaders. Can you imagine how quickly one of those puny gnomes would get lost in here? Ha! If it was lucky, I'd track it down and keep it as a pet."]="As reviravoltas de Orgrimmar são projetadas para impedir invasores. Você pode imaginar a rapidez com que um desses gnomos insignificantes se perderia aqui? Ha! Se tivesse sorte, eu o rastrearia e o manteria como animal de estimação."
G["The two of us against the vast undead sea."]="The two of us against the vast undead sea."
G["The two paths of sha corruption in Dread Wastes both seem to be in very straight lines.  I wonder where they are heading?  Curious."]="The two paths of sha corruption in Dread Wastes both seem to be in very straight lines.  I wonder where they are heading?  Curious."
G["The two students close their eyes and bow their heads."]="The two students close their eyes and bow their heads."
G["The tyranny of iron is at an end!"]="The tyranny of iron is at an end!"
G["The unblemished heart of the guardian must be secured to show defiance and strength. Jealous Zim'Rhuk keeps those who harbor it."]="The unblemished heart of the guardian must be secured to show defiance and strength. Jealous Zim'Rhuk keeps those who harbor it."
G["The undead are a taint upon Azeroth!  Every one of you creatures deserves to be destroyed!"]="Os mortos-vivos são uma mancha em Azeroth! Cada uma de vocês criaturas merece ser destruída!"
G["The undead are approaching.  Attack!"]="The undead are approaching.  Attack!"
G["The undead are upon us!"]="Os não-mortos estão sobre nós!"
G["The undead shall feast on your soul, $n."]="The undead shall feast on your soul, $n."
G["The underside of this table is REALLY dirty!"]="A parte de debaixo desta mesa está MUITO suja!"
G["The undying flames are all that remain of this sacred place. I sense much anger here...a seething rage, barely held in check. Be on your guard."]="The undying flames are all that remain of this sacred place. I sense much anger here...a seething rage, barely held in check. Be on your guard."
G["The unique magnetic fields of the polar regions pose millions of research possibilities!"]="The unique magnetic fields of the polar regions pose millions of research possibilities!"
G["The universe will be remade."]="Se rehará o universo."
G["The untamed plains of Nagrand offer some of the best hunting I've ever experienced."]="The untamed plains of Nagrand offer some of the best hunting I've ever experienced."
G["The unthinkable has happened... $n has slain Prince Sandoval!"]="Tem sucedido o impensable... $n matou ao príncipe Sandoval!"
G["The unthinkable has happened: Our siege on Theramore has failed."]="Tem acontecido o possível: o cerco de Theramore tem fracassado."
G["The unworthy have not yet learned of my power."]="Hahaha! Os infiéis ainda não conhecem meu poder."
G["The val'kyr surround us, brothers and sisters! Glory comes to those who sacrifice all for the Lich King!"]="The val'kyr surround us, brothers and sisters! Glory comes to those who sacrifice all for the Lich King!"
G["The vale belongs to the Shao-Tien!"]="O vale pertence aos Shao-Tien!"
G["The vale is safer now."]="Agorao vale é mais certo."
G["The valley should mask our movements. Stay low. Stay close."]="The valley should mask our movements. Stay low. Stay close."
G["The valor quartermaster, Commander Oxheart, can be found at Niuzao Temple in the Townlong Steppes.\n\nI will mark her location on your map."]="The valor quartermaster, Commander Oxheart, can be found at Niuzao Temple in the Townlong Steppes.\n\nI will mark her location on your map."
G["The various merchants of Curiosities & Moore in southern Dalaran sell trinkets, relics, heirlooms, and off-hand items of all sorts."]="Os vários comerciantes de Curiosities & Moore, no sul de Dalaran, vendem bugigangas, relíquias, relíquias e itens de todos os tipos."
G["The vault will be cracked once the |cFFFF2222Vault Breaking progress bar reaches 100 percent!|r\n|TInterface\\Icons\\INV_Misc_coin_02.blp:64|t\nDoing the wrong thing at the wrong time will reduce the progress of the bar."]="The vault will be cracked once the |cFFFF2222Vault Breaking progress bar reaches 100 percent!|r\n|TInterface\\Icons\\INV_Misc_coin_02.blp:64|t\nDoing the wrong thing at the wrong time will reduce the progress of the bar."
G["The vaults of the Titans grow weak as chaos flourishes. This prison can no longer contain you."]="The vaults of the Titans grow weak as chaos flourishes. This prison can no longer contain you."
G["The veil of shadows has lifted!"]="The veil of shadows has lifted!"
G["The veil of winter will protect you, champions!"]="O velo do inverno os protegerá, campeões!"
G["The very spirits of Pandaria are supporting us in our grand crusade! Behold:"]="Os espíritos de Pandaria nos apoiam em nossa grande cruzada! Observa."
G["The very trees repel your presence!"]="The very trees repel your presence!"
G["The vessel of rebirth must be fortified with elementium. I know of only one source of the mineral: the elemental planes, at the core of our world.\n\nThere is one, an Earthshaper, who may know more than I about the acquisition of such things. You must find this Earthshaper!"]="The vessel of rebirth must be fortified with elementium. I know of only one source of the mineral: the elemental planes, at the core of our world.\n\nThere is one, an Earthshaper, who may know more than I about the acquisition of such things. You must find this Earthshaper!"
G["The vicious teromoths and I are just fine in here on our own, thank you."]="As teropolilhas sanhosas e eu estamos muito bem aqui tranquilos, Obrigado."
G["The victorious heroes have returned! Control of Chill Breeze Valley is ours once again!"]="The victorious heroes have returned! Control of Chill Breeze Valley is ours once again!"
G["The victors will take their rightful place in the assault upon the Citadel. We will stand together in the face of evil, and Arthas WILL fall!"]="Os vencedores poderão ocupar o lugar que lhes pertence por direito próprio no ataque à cidadela. Nos mantendremos unidos ante a faz do mal e Arthas CAIRÁ!"
G["The view from the top of Telredor is magnificent, isn't it?"]="A visão do topo da Telredor é magnífica, não é?"
G["The view really is much better from up here.  Not to mention the distinct lack of blood-spatter."]="A visão desde aqui é muito melhor. E isso sem mencionar a ausência de manchas de sangue."
G["The view up here is amazing!"]="A visão desde aqui é incrível!"
G["The vigil is never finished, but I can always take a break for a hot meal!"]="The vigil is never finished, but I can always take a break for a hot meal!"
G["The village of Astranaar in Ashenvale is Elder Riversong's current home."]="A vila de Astranaar, em Ashenvale, é o lar atual do Élder Riversong."
G["The village of Dolanaar atop Teldrassil is home to Elder Bladeleaf."]="A vila de Dolanaar, no alto de Teldrassil, abriga o Élder Bladeleaf."
G["The villagers were thankful to have Emberstone back.  They brought us a little something to help against the Forsaken!"]="The villagers were thankful to have Emberstone back.  They brought us a little something to help against the Forsaken!"
G["The violent earthquake has alerted nearby Murlocs!"]="The violent earthquake has alerted nearby Murlocs!"
G["The virmen are eating all of the grain!"]="Os virmen se estão comeu tudo o grano!"
G["The visions are clouded... like these waters."]="As visões estão nubladas... como essas águas."
G["The visions we had failed to mention this event."]="The visions we had failed to mention this event."
G["The visiting Horde keep primarily to the Sunreaver's Sanctuary in northeastern Dalaran.\n\nThere is an inn there, as well as portals to the various battlegrounds and Orgrimmar."]="The visiting Horde keep primarily to the Sunreaver's Sanctuary in northeastern Dalaran.\n\nThere is an inn there, as well as portals to the various battlegrounds and Orgrimmar."
G["The voice... such splendor... Arthas... My king...."]="A voz... que esplendor... Arthas... Meu rei..."
G["The voices are talking to me."]="As vozes estão falando comigo."
G["The void rejects your light, $C. You are too pure for our dark wisdom."]="The void rejects your light, $C. You are too pure for our dark wisdom."
G["The void sucks at your soul. It is content to feast slowly."]="The void sucks at your soul. It is content to feast slowly."
G["The vortex of the harvested calls to you!"]="O vórtice da destruição te chama!"
G["The vrykul are evil and must be destroyed!"]="The vrykul are evil and must be destroyed!"
G["The vrykul clutches at his throat as he begins to gag and thrash about."]="O vrykul se agarra a garganta e começa a ter arcadas e a se contorcer."
G["The vrykul dies from being awakened improperly."]="O vrykul morre ao ser despertado de forma pouco apropiada."
G["The vrykul rests peacefully in his magical slumbering."]="O vrykul repousa pacificamente no seu sono mágico."
G["The wall is wired up and ready to go - the honor is all yours!"]="A muralha está pronta para ser explodida. A honra é toda sua!"
G["The walls have been breached!"]="The walls have been breached!"
G["The walls of Frostmourne Cavern shudder and shake."]="The walls of Frostmourne Cavern shudder and shake."
G["The walls of the chamber tremble. Something is happening..."]="The walls of the chamber tremble. Something is happening..."
G["The war against the Horde has reached full tilt, $n.  This is a time of great need for the Alliance and it's necessary that all of us do our part to help."]="A guerra contra a Horda está no seu auge, $n. É um momento de grande necessidade para a Aliança e é necessário que cada um dos nós cumplamos com nosso cometido."
G["The war against the orcs, there seems to be no respite."]="na guerra contra os orcs parece que não há descanso."
G["The war between the Earthen and the stone troggs has raged for time beyond measure. But now in the chaos, the Stonefather, prisoner. They are threatening to kill him if we do not surrender."]="The war between the Earthen and the stone troggs has raged for time beyond measure. But now in the chaos, the Stonefather, prisoner. They are threatening to kill him if we do not surrender."
G["The war continued but the will of the great leader was sapped. The whole of Silithus was soon engulfed by the silithid and their Qiraji hosts."]="The war continued but the will of the great leader was sapped. The whole of Silithus was soon engulfed by the silithid and their Qiraji hosts."
G["The war in Northrend took its toll on us as a people, $n. While we were victorious in the frozen wastes, our own land fell into disarray."]="The war in Northrend took its toll on us as a people, $n. While we were victorious in the frozen wastes, our own land fell into disarray."
G["The war is not over, but we have dealt them a bitter blow."]="A guerra não terminou, mas lhes temos desferido um bom acerto."
G["The war... goes on."]="A guerra... continue."
G["The warchief calls."]="O Chefe de Guerra nos chama."
G["The warchief demands it!"]="The warchief demands it!"
G["The warchief doesn't take kindly to non-orcs loitering in this part of Orgrimmar."]="Ao Chefe de Guerra não lhe há muita graça que os não orcs merodeen por esta parte de Orgrimmar."
G["The warchief graciously permits the families of the dead to live in his city.  To die in the service of the Horde should be a great honor, but you see it as another opportunity to line your filthy pockets!"]="The warchief graciously permits the families of the dead to live in his city.  To die in the service of the Horde should be a great honor, but you see it as another opportunity to line your filthy pockets!"
G["The warchief wants to know why his ships are delayed."]="O Chefe de Guerra quer saber por que se têm retrasado seus barcos."
G["The warchief will have all of our hides if production doesn't double!"]="The warchief will have all of our hides if production doesn't double!"
G["The warchief will hear of our success!"]="O Chefe de Guerra saberão de nosso êxito!"
G["The warchief will hear of your failure!"]="The warchief will hear of your failure!"
G["The warchief's put a price on Arazzius's head! As of right now, that no-good piece of demon refuse is enemy number one."]="The warchief's put a price on Arazzius's head! As of right now, that no-good piece of demon refuse is enemy number one."
G["The warchief? Big guy, giant spikey shoulderpads, short temper, and a morbid attachment to axes? THAT warchief?"]="The warchief? Big guy, giant spikey shoulderpads, short temper, and a morbid attachment to axes? THAT warchief?"
G["The warm embrace of Tarecgosa's presence encircles you."]="O cálido abraço da presença de Tarecgosa te envuelve."
G["The warmth of the sun... awaits."]="O calor do sol... espera."
G["The warmth of this place sickens me."]="O calor deste lugar me coloca enferma."
G["The warrior's role is one of protection.  Just as we protect our compatriots in battle, we must also protect the interests of the Forsaken."]="O papel do guerreiro é de proteção. Assim como protegemos nossos compatriotas na batalha, também devemos proteger os interesses dos Abandonados."
G["The warriors are in the War Quarter, practicing on the outer ring."]="Os guerreiros estão no Quartel da Guerra, praticando no ringue externo."
G["The warriors are reporting that you saved their lives. Thank you, $n."]="Os guerreiros dizem que lhes salvou a vida. Obrigado, $n."
G["The washed ones!"]="Os náufragos!"
G["The water elementals are at war with the fire elementals, which sort of means they're at war with us.  One of their leaders, Hydraxis, is mustering agents for his cause..."]="Os elementais da água estão em guerra com os elementais do fogo, o que significa que eles estão em guerra conosco. Um dos seus líderes, Hydraxis, está reunindo agentes para a sua causa..."
G["The water here is disturbed... what is happening here?"]="The water here is disturbed... what is happening here?"
G["The water here is peaceful, is it not? Listening to the trickle from the ceiling can aid you in finding its true voice..."]="The water here is peaceful, is it not? Listening to the trickle from the ceiling can aid you in finding its true voice..."
G["The water in this pond is... quite awful."]="A água deste estanque é... bastante horrível."
G["The water itself rises to fight against them here, but why? Many questions and few answers..."]="Neste lugar até a água mesma se ergue para lutar contra eles, mas por que? Muitas perguntas e muito poucas respostas..."
G["The water may not create life, but at least it will let me transfer it."]="The water may not create life, but at least it will let me transfer it."
G["The water never lies."]="A água nunca morre."
G["The water reacts violently to your touch!"]="The water reacts violently to your touch!"
G["The water spirits are perhaps the most outspoken. They are generous and understanding. Indeed, if you are having trouble hearing the voices, it is with water that you should begin."]="The water spirits are perhaps the most outspoken. They are generous and understanding. Indeed, if you are having trouble hearing the voices, it is with water that you should begin."
G["The water spirits have answered my prayers. Thank you."]="The water spirits have answered my prayers. Thank you."
G["The watering can is empty. Return to Gardener Fran."]="The watering can is empty. Return to Gardener Fran."
G["The waters are forbidden to all!"]="The waters are forbidden to all!"
G["The waters are restless..."]="A água está inquieta..."
G["The waters are wild and chaotic. Something agitates them."]="A água está selvagem e caótica. Algo a sacode."
G["The waters calm as Watoosun materializes."]="The waters calm as Watoosun materializes."
G["The waters have not been cleansed!"]="A água não se purificou!"
G["The waters of Quel'thalas are teeming with fish; I take it they caught your eye? Drathen is quite experienced with the tricks of the fishing trade, and can be found on the Walk of Elders near the Royal Exchange."]="As águas de Quel'thalas estão repletas de peixes; Presumo que eles chamaram sua atenção? Drathen é bastante experiente com os truques do comércio de pesca e pode ser encontrado na Calçada dos Anciãos, perto do Royal Exchange."
G["The waters of Westfall are where you must search, due west-northwest of where the Gold Coast Quarry meets with the shore.  An anchor shows where a boat has sunk beyond it, deep within the water.  The underwater pressure is fierce here; swimming too far will crush even the mightiest swimmer from fatigue.  \n\nLook for a natural formation to aid you, $n - a bubbly fissure is near here, offering deep-water swimmers a chance for renewed breath."]="The waters of Westfall are where you must search, due west-northwest of where the Gold Coast Quarry meets with the shore.  An anchor shows where a boat has sunk beyond it, deep within the water.  The underwater pressure is fierce here; swimming too far will crush even the mightiest swimmer from fatigue.  \n\nLook for a natural formation to aid you, $n - a bubbly fissure is near here, offering deep-water swimmers a chance for renewed breath."
G["The waters of northern Sar'theris Strand in Desolace or the Angor Fortress in Badlands have locked boxes that can be picked open."]="As águas do norte de Sar'theris Strand em Desolace ou da Angor Fortress em Badlands têm caixas trancadas que podem ser abertas."
G["The waters of the Vale are now yours to protect..."]="Agora te toca você proteção as águas do vale..."
G["The waters rushed in and drowned everything!"]="The waters rushed in and drowned everything!"
G["The waters speak of your demise..."]="A água fala do seu perdição..."
G["The waters whisper to me... enemies approach."]="The waters whisper to me... enemies approach."
G["The waters will consume you!"]="The waters will consume you!"
G["The waters. They only transfer life. My translations are starting to make sense now.\n\nI surmise the mogu used to extend their lives with the water by sacrificing prisoners, rebels, and slaves.\n\nIt is also my guess that all of the ancient scrolls I was researching were written by mogu originally, and they neglected to mention that fact."]="The waters. They only transfer life. My translations are starting to make sense now.\n\nI surmise the mogu used to extend their lives with the water by sacrificing prisoners, rebels, and slaves.\n\nIt is also my guess that all of the ancient scrolls I was researching were written by mogu originally, and they neglected to mention that fact."
G["The watersh tell of good fortune today, $n."]="Lash aguash falam de boa fortuna, hoje, $n."
G["The waterspeaking ceremony has tired me. Please, give me time to rest, and think."]="The waterspeaking ceremony has tired me. Please, give me time to rest, and think."
G["The waves shall rise and consume your tribe, Vol'jin! You should never have returned!"]="The waves shall rise and consume your tribe, Vol'jin! You should never have returned!"
G["The waves tremble at your approach..."]="The waves tremble at your approach..."
G["The way I see it is, I'm not very good at being a lady, so maybe I'd make a better adventurer like you."]="The way I see it is, I'm not very good at being a lady, so maybe I'd make a better adventurer like you."
G["The way into Dalaran has been opened!"]="A entrada a Dalaran abriu!"
G["The way is cleared! Open the prison!"]="O caminho está abriu! Abra a prisão!"
G["The way of the Druid is sibling to the Shaman.  Gennia Runetotem is steeped in such knowledge.  Seek her out in the large tent on the east side of Bloodhoof Village."]="O caminho do druida é irmão do xamã. Gennia Runetotem está mergulhado em tal conhecimento. Procure-a na grande tenda no lado leste da Vila Casco Sangrento."
G["The way of the Tushui is one of gaining proper perspective. Through meditation and consideration, we find our way to the most effective solution to any problem. Through practice and discipline, we hone our bodies to be the perfect implements of our will.\n\nTo live the way of the Tushui is to be respected both for tempered mind and impeccable form."]="The way of the Tushui is one of gaining proper perspective. Through meditation and consideration, we find our way to the most effective solution to any problem. Through practice and discipline, we hone our bodies to be the perfect implements of our will.\n\nTo live the way of the Tushui is to be respected both for tempered mind and impeccable form."
G["The way to the rendevous point is mostly clear. You should get moving."]="O caminho para o ponto de encontro está abriu no seu maior parte. Deveria poderá em marcha."
G["The ways of Jaedenar are dark and treacherous.  Watch your moves in this place, $C, or you will find your soul entralled by your rivals..."]="The ways of Jaedenar are dark and treacherous.  Watch your moves in this place, $C, or you will find your soul entralled by your rivals..."
G["The weak have no place in this world!"]="Não há lugar neste mundo para os fracos!"
G["The weapon masters in the Valley of Honor within Orgrimmar, Sayoc and Hanashi, can teach you how to shoot a bow. Ileda, the weapon master of Silvermoon found in Farstrider Square, is also an expert."]="The weapon masters in the Valley of Honor within Orgrimmar, Sayoc and Hanashi, can teach you how to shoot a bow. Ileda, the weapon master of Silvermoon found in Farstrider Square, is also an expert."
G["The weapon which you seek is called the Hammer of Twilight."]="O arma que atenção se chamao Martelo do Crepúsculo."
G["The weapon will soon be completed. The Wildhammer and the Dragonmaw are about to be no more."]="The weapon will soon be completed. The Wildhammer and the Dragonmaw are about to be no more."
G["The wedding's a go! I'm going to need a gift for the happy couple, of course. Something important.\n\nThe future of the Wildhammer really hinges on this one last chance to bring us all together!"]="The wedding's a go! I'm going to need a gift for the happy couple, of course. Something important.\n\nThe future of the Wildhammer really hinges on this one last chance to bring us all together!"
G["The well is very important. It's good that they asked me to watch it."]="O poço é muito importantes. Menos mal que me têm pedido que o vigile."
G["The west gate of the Alliance keep has been destroyed!"]="A porta oeste da fortaleza da Aliança foi destruído."
G["The west gate of the Alliance keep has been destroyed."]="A porta oeste da fortaleza da Aliança foi destruído."
G["The west gate of the Horde keep has been destroyed!"]="A porta oeste da fortaleza da Horda foi destruído."
G["The west gate of the Horde keep has been destroyed."]="A porta oeste da fortaleza da Horda foi destruído."
G["The west."]="O Oeste."
G["The western auction house can be found in the middle of the Bazaar, just west of the Walk of Elders."]="A casa de leilões ocidental pode ser encontrada no meio do Bazar, a oeste da Calçada dos Anciãos."
G["The western bridge has been damaged!"]="The western bridge has been damaged!"
G["The western bridge has been destroyed!"]="The western bridge has been destroyed!"
G["The western sewers entrance is beneath the stairway to the Violet Citadel."]="A entrada de esgotos do oeste fica embaixo da escada da Cidadela Violeta."
G["The western tower has been damaged!"]="The western tower has been damaged!"
G["The western tower has been destroyed!"]="Têm destruído a torre oeste!"
G["The wha-??\n\nWell, I refer to them as undefined floating obstructions. And where I'm from, most deny their existence entirely.\n\nBut I know better! I've even seen 'em up close! My recent years have been spent building this vessel to locate, track, document, and if needs be, eradicate them!"]="The wha-??\n\nWell, I refer to them as undefined floating obstructions. And where I'm from, most deny their existence entirely.\n\nBut I know better! I've even seen 'em up close! My recent years have been spent building this vessel to locate, track, document, and if needs be, eradicate them!"
G["The what-bringer? Oh, ASHbringer? Never heard of it... What? Stop bothering me!"]="The what-bringer? Oh, ASHbringer? Never heard of it... What? Stop bothering me!"
G["The wheel... spins... again."]="A roleta... gira... novamente."
G["The whispering winds have made it known to me that a $r $c would come; that $ghe:she; would assist me where many others have failed.\n\nCould you be the one?"]="The whispering winds have made it known to me that a $r $c would come; that $ghe:she; would assist me where many others have failed.\n\nCould you be the one?"
G["The whole city's ill!"]="Toda a cidade está enferma!"
G["The whole island is protected by a sonic shield, $p."]="Um escudo sónico proteger toda a ilha, $p."
G["The whole squad laughed at me for a week! Don't let it happen again!"]="The whole squad laughed at me for a week! Don't let it happen again!"
G["The whole town is gone!"]="The whole town is gone!"
G["The wild cloud serpents breed very rarely, and as such, each egg is extremely precious.\n\nIf we do not work to help and protect the wild cloud serpents, they may one day disappear."]="The wild cloud serpents breed very rarely, and as such, each egg is extremely precious.\n\nIf we do not work to help and protect the wild cloud serpents, they may one day disappear."
G["The will o' the Firelord be done, Grand Ambassador."]="Que se cumpla a vontade do Senhor do Fogo, grande embaixador."
G["The will of N'Zoth corrupts you."]="A vontade de N'Zoth os corrompe."
G["The will of the Empress is our own. Her greatness is our greatness. Her victory is a victory for the swarm!"]="A vontade de nossa Imperatriz é nossa vontade. Seu grandeza é a nossa. Seu vitória é a do enxame!"
G["The wilting lotus is the first sign of winter, a winter that has not come to Shen-zin Su in thousands of years."]="The wilting lotus is the first sign of winter, a winter that has not come to Shen-zin Su in thousands of years."
G["The wind abruptly shifts direction at %s' command!"]="The wind abruptly shifts direction at %s' command!"
G["The wind and air elementals threaten to destroy Thunder Bluff.  If you think you are strong enough to go in there, be my guest.  Otherwise, stay out of the city and let us take care of it."]="The wind and air elementals threaten to destroy Thunder Bluff.  If you think you are strong enough to go in there, be my guest.  Otherwise, stay out of the city and let us take care of it."
G["The wind and trees whisper of unseen troubles.  The land appears healthy, but there's more going on here than meets the eye."]="O vento e as árvores sussurram problemas invisíveis. A terra parece saudável, mas há mais coisas acontecendo aqui do que aparenta."
G["The wind blows in my favor."]="O vento sopra a meu favor."
G["The wind calls to me."]="O vento me chama."
G["The wind fiercely cuts across this bluff, and most life has long since fled this corner of Icecrown. However, all it takes is a bit of coaxing for it to return, and that is why I walk these grounds. One day these trees will tower over us all."]="O vento atravessa ferozmente esse penhasco, e a maior parte da vida já fugiu deste canto da Coroa de Gelo. No entanto, basta um pouco de persuasão para que ele retorne, e é por isso que eu ando por esses motivos. Um dia essas árvores se elevarão sobre todos nós."
G["The wind grows stronger! Take the lifts to safer ground!"]="The wind grows stronger! Take the lifts to safer ground!"
G["The wind immediately surrounding the mill picks up rapidly, causing the timbers to groan."]="The wind immediately surrounding the mill picks up rapidly, causing the timbers to groan."
G["The wind rider master"]="O mestre do cavaleiro do vento"
G["The wind speaks of our enemies' movements, Ashyen.  The naga will attack again."]="Os ventos falam dos movimentos de nossos inimigos, Ashyen. Os nagas atacarão novamente."
G["The wind used its minions to distort the history of this place, changing the stories your people told, destroying the spirits of the honored dead."]="The wind used its minions to distort the history of this place, changing the stories your people told, destroying the spirits of the honored dead."
G["The winds are good today."]="The winds are good today."
G["The winds are strange today. Strange indeed."]="Os ventos estão estranhos hoje. Estranho mesmo."
G["The winds do not speak to our tribe anymore, $n.  My people are lost without elders to bring the spirits to them."]="Os ventos já não falam com nossa tribo, $n. Meu povo está perdido sem anciãos que lhes traigan os espíritos."
G["The winds may be strong, and the sleet may sting."]="The winds may be strong, and the sleet may sting."
G["The winds of Outland speak of calm and peace."]="Os ventos de TerrAlém falam de paz e tranquilidade."
G["The winds of change can bring anything, from a terrible storm to a bountiful harvest. It seems this time they have brought you.\n\nNow, I wonder, are you a storm or a harvest?"]="Os ventos do caminho podem trazer qualquer coisa, desde uma terrível tempestade até uma colheita generosa. Parece que esta vez te têm trazido você.\n\nE eu me pergunto: é uma tempestade ou uma colheita?"
G["The winds take me!"]="Os ventos me levam!"
G["The wings of the empress cannot fail!"]="AS ALAS da IMPERATRIZ NÃO PODEM FALHAR!"
G["The winner of the drag race is...the gnome team!  Great job guys!"]="The winner of the drag race is...the gnome team!  Great job guys!"
G["The winter after the curse was lifted, hundreds of veteran orcs like me were lost to despair."]="The winter after the curse was lifted, hundreds of veteran orcs like me were lost to despair."
G["The wisdom of the Jade Serpent."]="A sabedoria do Dragão de Jade."
G["The wisest among you will do the same."]="The wisest among you will do the same."
G["The wisest of the jinyu are very wise indeed - they can speak to the rivers the way you and I would consult our elders."]="Os mais sábios entre os jinyus podem falar com os rios, assim como você ou eu consultaríamos nossos anciãos."
G["The wisps and I watch the seas for any lost souls."]="Os tufos e eu observamos os mares à procura de almas perdidas."
G["The witches of Scadeald are the glue that keeps the Ealdir together when they aren't tearing at each other's throats for the title of chieftain. Before their clans, the witches owe themselves first to the coven, always. Mother Morgwena leads them. They say she's lived long enough to remember Scadeald before Stormwind laid its first stone... but I don't put much stock in old wives' tales."]="The witches of Scadeald are the glue that keeps the Ealdir together when they aren't tearing at each other's throats for the title of chieftain. Before their clans, the witches owe themselves first to the coven, always. Mother Morgwena leads them. They say she's lived long enough to remember Scadeald before Stormwind laid its first stone... but I don't put much stock in old wives' tales."
G["The wizard will fall!"]="The wizard will fall!"
G["The wolf's going down."]="O lobo está bajando."
G["The word is given. The Lich King will die by our hands!"]="A palavra é dada. O Rei Lich vai morrer pelas nossas mãos!"
G["The words painted on the stretched skin here call for something that you don't think you're quite ready for.\n\nYou should check back later."]="The words painted on the stretched skin here call for something that you don't think you're quite ready for.\n\nYou should check back later."
G["The worg growls as it closes in on its prey."]="O huargo grunhe enquanto se aproxima ao seu presa."
G["The worg hesitates for a moment, then changes direction."]="O huargo dúvida um momento e depois muda de direção."
G["The worg sprints off in search of enemies."]="O huargo corre à procura de inimigos."
G["The worgen killed my parents, $n.  Watch yourself."]="Os huargen mataram a meus padres, $n. Tenha cuidado."
G["The worgen stares and hesitates!"]="O huargen olhe e dúvida!"
G["The worgen will pass.  We shall pass.\n\nOnly the earth and her secrets will remain.  Are you willing to learn, $n?"]="The worgen will pass.  We shall pass.\n\nOnly the earth and her secrets will remain.  Are you willing to learn, $n?"
G["The work is hard, but necessary. This statue represents all that we believe."]="The work is hard, but necessary. This statue represents all that we believe."
G["The work must continue!"]="O trabalho deve seguir!"
G["The work of your brothers in the Storm Peaks has reached a frenzied pace. Soon, Father will be freed."]="O trabalho dos seus irmãos nas Picos Tempestuosos alcançou um firme frenético. Pronto, pai será liberado."
G["The work that you did for me at the Ruins of Farahlon has got me back on schedule.  I'm assembling my team to head out there now.\n\nThank you, $n."]="Graças ao que fez por mim nas Ruínas de Farahlon já não vou retrasado na minha plano de trabalho. Estou reunindo a meu equipamento para sair.\n\nObrigado, $n."
G["The world is indebted to you and your allies, $n."]="O mundo está em dívida com você e com os seus aliados, $n."
G["The world of the living may have turned its back on me, but I'm no damned Scourge.  Just go."]="Talvez o mundo dos vivos me tenha dados a costas, mas eu não pertenezco à maldito Praga. Lárgate."
G["The world suffers yet another insignificant loss."]="The world suffers yet another insignificant loss."
G["The world will be reborn in flames!"]="The world will be reborn in flames!"
G["The world will suffer immeasurable cruelties under my reign."]="The world will suffer immeasurable cruelties under my reign."
G["The world's gone to hell, $n."]="O mundo se tem ido ao inferno, $n."
G["The world-shaman - shattered by the hand of Fandral Staghelm?\n\nGreater powers are at work here. Ragnaros has pushed his strength farther into this realm than I would have imagined.\n\nThe Firelord must be stopped!"]="The world-shaman - shattered by the hand of Fandral Staghelm?\n\nGreater powers are at work here. Ragnaros has pushed his strength farther into this realm than I would have imagined.\n\nThe Firelord must be stopped!"
G["The worm is about to bite!  Place the bomb down now!"]="O me ver está a ponto de morder! Coloca a bomba agora!"
G["The worst is behind us. Soon we will put an end to the Lich King's reign."]="Já temos passado o pior. Pronto acabaremos com o reinado do Rei Lich."
G["The worst is yet to come!"]="The worst is yet to come!"
G["The wounds will heal, child."]="The wounds will heal, child."
G["The wyrmcult blackwhelp lies here netted and helpless."]="A filhote negra Culto Vermis jaz aqui, presa e indefensa."
G["The wyrms will eat well tonight!"]="The wyrms will eat well tonight!"
G["The wyvern drops a black drake corpse on the ground."]="O dracoleón de cair um cadáver de draco negro no chão."
G["The yaungol are attacking!"]="Os yaungol nos atacando!"
G["The yaungol are coming from every direction, $n! Quickly, defend the village before they burn it down!"]="The yaungol are coming from every direction, $n! Quickly, defend the village before they burn it down!"
G["The yaungol are so powerful... maybe we need to look to your people for protection."]="The yaungol are so powerful... maybe we need to look to your people for protection."
G["The yaungol attacked the beasts with great determination and ferocity. Yet, the more he attacked, the more fearsome the beasts grew!"]="The yaungol attacked the beasts with great determination and ferocity. Yet, the more he attacked, the more fearsome the beasts grew!"
G["The yaungol have shamed my people.\n\nThey will soon know the true meaning of shame."]="The yaungol have shamed my people.\n\nThey will soon know the true meaning of shame."
G["The yaungol must be attacking because of the stranger!"]="The yaungol must be attacking because of the stranger!"
G["The yaungol ruin everything!"]="The yaungol ruin everything!"
G["The yeti is a fierce, cunning creature, and this one is one of the strongest of his kind. We keep him asleep through herbs in his food.\n\nDo not think he will be lethargic in the ring, however."]="The yeti is a fierce, cunning creature, and this one is one of the strongest of his kind. We keep him asleep through herbs in his food.\n\nDo not think he will be lethargic in the ring, however."
G["The young Prince Anduin's been askin' after ya."]="O jovem príncipe Anduin tem perguntado por você."
G["The young must not go hungry...."]="Os jovens não devem passar fome."
G["The young races? The infants? Humans? Orcs? Dwarves? You expect to defeat the Hakkari? To destroy a GOD?"]="As raças jovens? Os infantes? Humanos? Orcs? Anões? Esperas derrotar aos Hakkari? Destruir a um DEUS?"
G["The young raptor looks up at you. You can't be certain, but you think you see a flicker of recognition in her eye."]="O jovem raptores te olhe. Você não pode saber com segurança, mas acha ver uma chispa de reconhecimento nos seus olhos."
G["The younger races make a big fuss over Winter Veil. Ironforge's bank is the center of the festivities."]="As raças mais jovens fazem muito barulho por Winter Veil. O banco de Ironforge é o centro das festividades."
