G["The... Empire... will rise again."]="The... Empire... will rise again."
G["The... The fire lord? An elemental lord was unearthed? Of course... Gul'dan you were a damned fool!"]="O... O Senhor do Fogo? Despertó a um senhor elemental? claro... Maldito Gul'dan!"
G["The... The master? He lives?"]="O... o mestre? Vive?"
G["The... They promised that we'd be safe..."]="The... They promised that we'd be safe..."
G["The... bridge..."]="O... ponte..."
G["The... dookers... took my brew..."]="The... dookers... took my brew..."
G["The... the monkeys... they attacked...\n\nI fought them off, but... they'll be back... with more..."]="The... the monkeys... they attacked...\n\nI fought them off, but... they'll be back... with more..."
G["The... the yaungol!\nThey attacked my farm, and the nearby village, Eastwind Rest... killed some of us, and the ones they didn't kill they chased off!\nI managed to gather some of us here. Any word on help coming from Binan?"]="Os... os yaungol!\n\nTêm atacado meu fazenda e a aldeia próxima, Repouso Vento do Este... Têm matou a algum de nós, e aos mais os têm expulso.\n\nE conseguido que algum nos reunamos aqui. Se sabe se vem ajuda de Binan?"
G["The... the yaungol!\nThey attacked my farm, and the nearby village, Westwind Rest... killed some of us, and the ones they didn't kill they chased off!\nI managed to gather some of us here. Any word on help coming from Binan?"]="Os... os yaungol!\n\nTêm atacado meu fazenda e a aldeia próxima, Repouso Vento do Oeste... Têm matou a algum de nós, e aos mais os têm expulso.\n\nE conseguido que algum nos reunamos aqui. Se sabe se vem ajuda de Binan?"
G["The... village... dead..."]="A... aldeia... mortos..."
G["The...they're agents of the Twilight's Hammer! Is that...the Assistant Resort Director with them?"]="São... são agentes do Martelo Crepúsculo! O... o director adjunto do complexo está com eles?"
G["Their attacks are getting more frequent. You better keep moving."]="Os ataque cada vez são mais frequentes. Não te pare."
G["Their attacks are relentless. Thank you for your help."]="Seus ataque são implacables. Obrigado pela sua ajuda."
G["Their black iron constructs have sown death across a thousand worlds."]="Seus construtos de ferro bruno têm sembrado a morte a através de mil mundos."
G["Their camp is in shambles. What happened?"]="O acampamento está em ruínas. Que tem passado?"
G["Their ceremonial chamber, where I was to be sacrificed..."]="Their ceremonial chamber, where I was to be sacrificed..."
G["Their coming will herald the end of the world!"]="Seu chegada anunciará o fim do mundo!"
G["Their cowardly leader hides behind this barricade. Where are my sappers?"]="Their cowardly leader hides behind this barricade. Where are my sappers?"
G["Their cruelty seems to know no end."]="Seu crueldade não parece ter limite."
G["Their day will come, $n.\n\nAnd when it does, I will be there."]="Chegará seu dia, $n.\n\nE, quando chegue, estarei ali."
G["Their deaths only serve to empower my summoners further! Behold!"]="Their deaths only serve to empower my summoners further! Behold!"
G["Their defenses are down!  Attack!"]="Seus defesas estão bajas! Ataquem!"
G["Their defenses are down! The time is now, minions! ATTACK!"]="Têm bajado seus defesas! Este é o momentos, lacaios! ATAQUEM!"
G["Their dragonshrine may have empowered them, but the blues will not wrest the temple from us this day!"]="Their dragonshrine may have empowered them, but the blues will not wrest the temple from us this day!"
G["Their energy is strong!"]="Seu energia é forte!"
G["Their fate is sealed."]="Seu destino está escrito!"
G["Their fury pales before mine, Illidan. We have some unsettled business between us."]="A fúria deles diminui diante da minha. Illidan, temos assuntos pendentes entre nós."
G["Their leader is here! Strike him down!"]="Their leader is here! Strike him down!"
G["Their leader is hold up behind this barracade. The coward. Let me know when you are ready to move in."]="Their leader is hold up behind this barracade. The coward. Let me know when you are ready to move in."
G["Their leader is still in hiding. Find him!"]="Seu líder ainda se esconde. Olhe a ver se o encontrar."
G["Their loss is most definitely my gain..."]="Seu perda é, sem dúvida, meu ganância..."
G["Their magics are meaningless to you, $n!"]="Seu magia não te afeta, $n!"
G["Their main army has breached the north gate!"]="Seu batalhão principal tem derribado a porta do norte!"
G["Their manifest forms weak from eons of battle, imprisoned beneath the world - the world that they themselves created - the corruption of the Titan Shapers would permeate through the surface and befoul the Old Gods.\n\nIt was then and there that the brothers did turn. For five millennia a battle was fought at the core of this world."]="Their manifest forms weak from eons of battle, imprisoned beneath the world - the world that they themselves created - the corruption of the Titan Shapers would permeate through the surface and befoul the Old Gods.\n\nIt was then and there that the brothers did turn. For five millennia a battle was fought at the core of this world."
G["Their minds are now tainted, $r. Yes, even more so than before. They live only to serve and protect Razelikh. The amulet fragments they each hold are the key to summoning the demon lord. What you do not understand is that none of them can be harmed through any conventional means"]="Their minds are now tainted, $r. Yes, even more so than before. They live only to serve and protect Razelikh. The amulet fragments they each hold are the key to summoning the demon lord. What you do not understand is that none of them can be harmed through any conventional means"
G["Their minds are now tainted, $r. Yes, even more so than before. They live only to serve and protect Razelikh. The amulet fragments they each hold are the key to summoning the demon lord. What you do not understand is that none of them can be harmed through any conventional means."]="Their minds are now tainted, $r. Yes, even more so than before. They live only to serve and protect Razelikh. The amulet fragments they each hold are the key to summoning the demon lord. What you do not understand is that none of them can be harmed through any conventional means."
G["Their movements are totally chaotic, as if they themselves know not what they are about."]="Seus movimentos são completamente aleatórios; é como se eles mesmos não supieran o que estão fazendo."
G["Their numbers are endless, $c! Help us hold them back!"]="Their numbers are endless, $c! Help us hold them back!"
G["Their numbers are too many to count. Their defenses look impenetrable.\n\nI saw no weaknesses to exploit, $r."]="Their numbers are too many to count. Their defenses look impenetrable.\n\nI saw no weaknesses to exploit, $r."
G["Their numbers are unbelievable... I'm glad to hear King Stormheart came to your aid. I only hear good things of him - I think it's high time we meet."]="Their numbers are unbelievable... I'm glad to hear King Stormheart came to your aid. I only hear good things of him - I think it's high time we meet."
G["Their numbers are... endless..."]="Seu número é... incontable."
G["Their partnership was never meant to be. It actually makes me sick a little bit. Here comes GG Engineering!"]="Esta colaboração é antinatural. De feito, me coloca enferma. Aqui vem Engenharia GG!"
G["Their passing weighs heavily upon my soul."]="Seus mortes são uma pesada carga para minha alma."
G["Their power and wisdom seized for a greater glory!"]="Seu poder e sabedoria foram sobrepujados por uma grande glória!"
G["Their sacrifice will not be in vain."]="O sacrifício deles não será em vão."
G["Their shadow will choke the land for eternity."]="Their shadow will choke the land for eternity."
G["Their skill in battle should never be underestimated."]="Seu habilidade na batalha nunca se você deve subestimar."
G["Their spirits are restored! The gryphons are ready to strike! Come, soldiers! Come to my side!"]="Seus espíritos têm banido restaurados! Os grifos estão prontos para atacar! Adiante, Soldados! Venham ao lado a mim!"
G["Their strength is an inspiration... and sorely needed. We must trust that their hearts are pure."]="Ah... A força deles é uma inspiração... e muito necessária. Temos que acreditar que seus corações sejam puros."
G["Their success hinges upon what we discover within these cursed halls. Although our mission is fraught with peril, we must persevere!"]="Their success hinges upon what we discover within these cursed halls. Although our mission is fraught with peril, we must persevere!"
G["Their visions built empires, freed slaves, and warned our Last Emperor of the Sundering that shattered Azeroth ten thousand years ago."]="Sua visão construiu impérios, libertou escravos e avisou ao nosso Último Imperador da Cisão que estraçalhou Azeroth há dez mil anos."
G["Thel'zan cannot stop me! For the Alliance! For Lord Fordragon!"]="Thel'zan cannot stop me! For the Alliance! For Lord Fordragon!"
G["Thel'zan needs to die, if only to stop the incessant yammering!"]="Thel'zan precisa morrer, mesmo que seja para parar o incessante grito!"
G["Thel'zan will have you..."]="Thel'zan acabará com vocês..."
G["Thel'zan's enchantment is broken! I am safe!"]="O encantamento de Thel'zan se tem front! Estou a salvou!"
G["Thel'zan's phylactery drops to the ground beneath Icestorm."]="A filactério de Thel'zan cai no chão baixo Tempestade de Gelo."
G["Theldurin the Lost!"]="Theldurin, o Perdido"
G["Thelonius has told me much about your skill in battle. I look forward to seeing it firsthand."]="Thelonius has told me much about your skill in battle. I look forward to seeing it firsthand."
G["Them crocs drop some tasty meat, $p, but tiger haunch is my personal favorite!"]="Them crocs drop some tasty meat, $p, but tiger haunch is my personal favorite!"
G["Them lizard-folk could be carryin' anything. Keep an eye out for 'em!"]="Esses homens lagarto poderiam levar qualquer coisa acima. Não os perda de visão!"
G["Them thar druids be sendin' children to thar deaths now? The Clam Master obliges, matey!"]="Esses druidas estão enviando crianças a morrer? O mestre de almejas precisa fazer algo, colega!"
G["Them's DEFINITELY fightin' words!"]="Essas são TOTALMENTE palavras de luta!"
G["Then Firebeard decreed his plea"]="Então Barbafuego se lhe declaró."
G["Then HIT THAT GONG, and show these monks what you're made of! ...one way or another, heh."]="Then HIT THAT GONG, and show these monks what you're made of! ...one way or another, heh."
G["Then I am glad you came. Now that you know of our fires, and of honoring them... and of the fires of our enemies, and of extinguishing them... you may return to him and be rewarded."]="Then I am glad you came. Now that you know of our fires, and of honoring them... and of the fires of our enemies, and of extinguishing them... you may return to him and be rewarded."
G["Then I ask you again: WHAT HAVE YOU DONE!"]="Então te pergunto novamente: QUE FEZ!?"
G["Then I have no other choice than to kill you."]="Then I have no other choice than to kill you."
G["Then I must consider this an act of treason."]="Então devo considerar isto um acto de traição."
G["Then I remind you...WE are the strongest in this forest. We are the kings of the trees! We are death to our enemies!"]="Then I remind you...WE are the strongest in this forest. We are the kings of the trees! We are death to our enemies!"
G["Then I will force you down! Wind grant me flight!"]="Then I will force you down! Wind grant me flight!"
G["Then I will open the way into the Eye of Eternity. You must not fail, heroes. The future of Azeroth hinges on your actions."]="Then I will open the way into the Eye of Eternity. You must not fail, heroes. The future of Azeroth hinges on your actions."
G["Then I'll commit myself to ignoring you."]="Then I'll commit myself to ignoring you."
G["Then I'm sure you won't mind if I accompany you on your mission."]="Então não te importará que te acompanhe nesta missão."
G["Then Orgrimmar is where you need to go.  The north road out of Razor Hill leads directly there.  Just talk to one of the grunts there and they can give you further directions."]="Então Orgrimmar é onde você precisa ir. A estrada norte de Razor Hill leva diretamente para lá. Basta conversar com um dos grunhidos lá e eles podem lhe dar mais instruções."
G["Then Orkus WILL DO IT! YES!"]="Então Orkus VAI FAZER! SIM!"
G["Then again, why kill myself... when I can kill YOU instead!"]="Then again, why kill myself... when I can kill YOU instead!"
G["Then all is in order. The master has given us a mission of the utmost importance and he will not suffer failure."]="Então tudo está em ordem. O mestre nos tem dados uma missão de incrível importância e não admitirá nenhum falho."
G["Then come, hermit!"]="Then come, hermit!"
G["Then fortunate it is, that I have reclaimed the noble naaru's spark from where it fell! Where faith dwells, hope is never lost, young blood elf."]="A boa notícia é que e recuperei a chispa do noble naarus do lugar em que caiu! Onde há fé nunca se perda esperança, jovem elfo de sangue."
G["Then he's out there alone! We've got to find him!"]="Then he's out there alone! We've got to find him!"
G["Then head over to Bena's Alchemy on the middle rise and talk to Bena herself.  She will be able to help you master the art of potion brewing."]="Depois, vá até a Alquimia de Bena, no centro, e converse com ela mesma. Ela será capaz de ajudá-o a dominar a arte de preparar poções."
G["Then it happened... all at once! A whole mess of fighters came outta nowhere, sir..."]="Then it happened... all at once! A whole mess of fighters came outta nowhere, sir..."
G["Then it is Thelman Slatefist that you wish to speak to. You can find him in the presence of the King at Stormwind Keep."]="Então é com Thelman Slatefist que você deseja falar. Você pode encontrá-o na presença do rei na Fortaleza de Ventobravo."
G["Then it is done."]="Então não há mais que falar."
G["Then it is option two."]="Então que seja a opção dois."
G["Then it is to Taim Ragetotem that you must speak. Seek him out on the Hunter Rise."]="Então é para Taim Ragetotem que você deve falar. Procure-o no Hunter Rise."
G["Then it is with great pride that I tell you that Brakgul Deathbringer stands ready in the Hall of Arms to aid you on your way to Warsong Gulch. Seek him out in the Valley of Honor."]="É com muito orgulho que digo que o Brakgul Deathbringer está pronto no Hall of Arms para ajudá-o no seu caminho para Warsong Gulch. Procure-o no Vale da Honra."
G["Then let Archimonde do his worst."]="Então deixe Archimonde fazer o seu pior."
G["Then let it be done."]="Que assim se faça, então."
G["Then let the Legion do their worst!"]="Então deixe a Legião fazer o seu pior!"
G["Then let those towers be their tombs! Lay waste to them!"]="Então, que essas torres sejam seus tumbas! A por eles!"
G["Then let us begin."]="Comencemos."
G["Then let us pretend that you undergo the long and arduous task of creating the bane necessary to break through the demonic wards placed upon the triad. What would be your next course of action? To face the Defiler in his lair?\n\n<Loramus laughs.>"]="Then let us pretend that you undergo the long and arduous task of creating the bane necessary to break through the demonic wards placed upon the triad. What would be your next course of action? To face the Defiler in his lair?\n\n<Loramus laughs.>"
G["Then listen well, $c.\n\nCan you feel the power radiating from me? Does your morale not swell? Aye, it is the same for the other side. To disrupt their defenses and thin out their troops will be no easy task, but it must be done! Victory will be ours!"]="Pois ouça atenciosamente, $c.\n\nPode sentir o poder que emana de mim? Acaso não aumenta seu moral? Sim, pois é o mesmo para o inimigo. Destruir seus defesas e reduzir seus tropas não será uma tarefa fácil, mas é preciso fazer isso de qualquer forma! A vitória será nossa!"
G["Then listen well, $r.\n\nSeveral months ago, the Magistrate of Lakeshire sent envoys to Ironforge, pleading with the King for assistance with the Blackrock incursions coming from Redridge and the Burning Steppes.\n\nPrincess Moira volunteered to help, against my pleadings. I was assigned twenty elite guardsmen to protect the Princess through the perilous journey from the Loch to Lakeshire."]="Then listen well, $r.\n\nSeveral months ago, the Magistrate of Lakeshire sent envoys to Ironforge, pleading with the King for assistance with the Blackrock incursions coming from Redridge and the Burning Steppes.\n\nPrincess Moira volunteered to help, against my pleadings. I was assigned twenty elite guardsmen to protect the Princess through the perilous journey from the Loch to Lakeshire."
G["Then may the Light save you and raise you up."]="Então, que a Luz te guíe e te eleve."
G["Then maybe there is still hope..."]="Então, ainda há esperança..."
G["Then meet me at the entrance to the abbey. I'll be along in short order."]="Então me encontre na entrada da abadia. Eu estarei ao lado em pouco tempo."
G["Then put twice as much in next time!"]="A próxima vez echao doble!"
G["Then repeat after me: \"Lok'tar ogar! Victory or death - it is these words that bind me to the Horde. For they are the most sacred and fundamental of truths to any warrior of the Horde.\nI give my flesh and blood freely to the Warchief. I am the instrument of my Warchief's desire. I am a weapon of my Warchief's command.\nFrom this moment until the end of days I live and die - For the Horde!\""]="Then repeat after me: \"Lok'tar ogar! Victory or death - it is these words that bind me to the Horde. For they are the most sacred and fundamental of truths to any warrior of the Horde.\nI give my flesh and blood freely to the Warchief. I am the instrument of my Warchief's desire. I am a weapon of my Warchief's command.\nFrom this moment until the end of days I live and die - For the Horde!\""
G["Then teach me, Kel'Thuzad. Teach me everything you know..."]="Então ensénhame, Kel'Thuzad. Ensénhame tudo o que saiba..."
G["Then the Sunreavers betray her trust and open portals straight ta the Bell from her own city!"]="Then the Sunreavers betray her trust and open portals straight ta the Bell from her own city!"
G["Then the darkness came. It seeped from the ground. Slowly, it infected us...suffocated us!"]="Then the darkness came. It seeped from the ground. Slowly, it infected us...suffocated us!"
G["Then the mogu were overthrown."]="Então, os mogus foram derrubados."
G["Then the sharks came."]="Depois chegaram os tiburones."
G["Then they killed the subjects of the mogu."]="Depois eles mataram os súditos dos mogus."
G["Then they will die an honorable death in combat!"]="Then they will die an honorable death in combat!"
G["Then this starts happening..."]="E passa isto..."
G["Then truly, we are lost."]="Então, estamos perdidos."
G["Then we cut our way through the Nerubians."]="Então nos abrimos passo entre os nerubianos."
G["Then we have a deal. I'll see you in battle, $n."]="Em esse atenção temos um trato. Te verei na batalha, $n."
G["Then we leave!"]="Então nos vamos!"
G["Then we must not waste anymore time. Are the chromatic dragonflight ready?"]="Então não podemos perder mais tempo. Está pronto o Voo Cromática?"
G["Then we must put an end to Athrikus Narassin. Tell me, spirit, where might we find the other soulgems, to undo his magic?"]="Então teremos que acabar com Athrikus Narassin. Diga, espírito, onde poderíamos encontrar as outras gemas de almas para deshacer esta magia?"
G["Then we must save him! If we rescue Bolvar Fordragon, we may quell the unrest between the Alliance and the Horde."]="Then we must save him! If we rescue Bolvar Fordragon, we may quell the unrest between the Alliance and the Horde."
G["Then we will stand astride this world as its masters -"]="Depois, seremos os amos deste mundo,"
G["Then we'll protect it with our lives. Son, I need you with me on this. We in this together?"]="Então a protegeremos com nossas vidas. Filho! Preciso seu apoio. Estamos juntos em isto."
G["Then what are we to do, wife? The others cannot find out. Should they learn of this aberration, we will all be executed."]="Then what are we to do, wife? The others cannot find out. Should they learn of this aberration, we will all be executed."
G["Then what are you doing here?"]="Então que está fazendo aqui?"
G["Then what happened?"]="Que aconteceu depois?"
G["Then what?"]="Então o que?"
G["Then who are these people?"]="Quem são estes?"
G["Then why don't you go and do that? My friends and I have better things to do!"]="Então, por que não vai e faz isso? Meus amigos e eu temos coisas melhores que fazer!"
G["Then witness my new gifts, bestowed by this world's true masters."]="Then witness my new gifts, bestowed by this world's true masters."
G["Then you are a fool."]="Então é um insensato."
G["Then you are a fool. Do you not know what I am?"]="Então você é um tolo. Você não sabe o que eu sou?"
G["Then you become enemies of my lord, Illidan. Enemies of Illidan are destroyed. Are your giants able to withstand an attack from the forces of Eclipse Point?"]="Then you become enemies of my lord, Illidan. Enemies of Illidan are destroyed. Are your giants able to withstand an attack from the forces of Eclipse Point?"
G["Then you have forced my hand.  I will correct the mistake I made long ago.  Spirits of the wind, the earth, the water, hear my call!  Come to my aid!"]="Then you have forced my hand.  I will correct the mistake I made long ago.  Spirits of the wind, the earth, the water, hear my call!  Come to my aid!"
G["Then you have lost, Highlord."]="Então perdeu, Alto Senhor."
G["Then you leave me no choice. I won't say that I won't enjoy this."]="Then you leave me no choice. I won't say that I won't enjoy this."
G["Then you must send a messenger to the Lich King. Ready my forces to attack upon his word."]="Then you must send a messenger to the Lich King. Ready my forces to attack upon his word."
G["Then you take responsibility for its actions, Stone Lord.  You will be the one answering to me when it shows its true intent."]="Then you take responsibility for its actions, Stone Lord.  You will be the one answering to me when it shows its true intent."
G["Then you will die."]="Então morrerá."
G["Then, Liu Lang went up to the Wood of Staves, carrying with him a bamboo umbrella that he always took on his adventures."]="Then, Liu Lang went up to the Wood of Staves, carrying with him a bamboo umbrella that he always took on his adventures."
G["Then, by the powers vested in me... the powers vested in me..."]="Then, by the powers vested in me... the powers vested in me..."
G["Then, we maybe take a rest? Sit down for a while?"]="Então descansamos? Nos sentamos um tempo?"
G["Then...you do not need to bear it alone. Just sit next to me and forget your troubles, if only for a while."]="Then...you do not need to bear it alone. Just sit next to me and forget your troubles, if only for a while."
G["Theralion, Halion, and Abyssion."]="Theralion, Halion e Abyssion."
G["Theralion, I will engulf the hallway. Cover their escape!"]="Theralion, vou incendiar o corredor. Que não escapen!"
G["Theralion, Shadron, and Abyssion."]="Theralion, Shadron e Abyssion."
G["Therazane be happy to get middle fragment."]="Therazane contenta de recuperar fragmento central."
G["Therazane's doom is assured!"]="A condenação de Therezane é certa!"
G["Therazane's finally gathered the nerve to challenge us, has she?"]="Therazane's finally gathered the nerve to challenge us, has she?"
G["There $g he : she; is!"]="Aí está!"
G["There $g he : she; is! Oh, yer my favorite $g lad : lass;, yes you are, $n!"]="Aí está! Oh, é meu $gfavorito: favorita;, $n!"
G["There $g he : she; is. You're welcome here anytime, $n."]="Aqui está. Sempre é $gbienvenido: boas-vindas;, $n."
G["There - do you feel it? A perfect stillness of the soul! Feel the dream brew take effect."]="There - do you feel it? A perfect stillness of the soul! Feel the dream brew take effect."
G["There - the slave master! Hold his attention while I undo the lock."]="There - the slave master! Hold his attention while I undo the lock."
G["There - they've fallen!"]="Olhe! Têm caído!"
G["There I was tumbling in a patch of prickly undergrowth with a talbuk stag, hand-to-hand, only my sharp knife...<cough>... and keen hunter's intellect to save me.\n\nAll of a sudden I'm jumped by a pair of fierce windroc hunters that came at me from the skies!  Their cowardly attack...<cough>... didn't help them any though.\n\nAnd while I have their beaks as trophies, I received an infected scratch out of the ordeal.  Kind of nasty, and I'm in a lot of pain, but I'm sure it'll heal up in a day or two."]="There I was tumbling in a patch of prickly undergrowth with a talbuk stag, hand-to-hand, only my sharp knife...<cough>... and keen hunter's intellect to save me.\n\nAll of a sudden I'm jumped by a pair of fierce windroc hunters that came at me from the skies!  Their cowardly attack...<cough>... didn't help them any though.\n\nAnd while I have their beaks as trophies, I received an infected scratch out of the ordeal.  Kind of nasty, and I'm in a lot of pain, but I'm sure it'll heal up in a day or two."
G["There I was, minding my own business, enjoying a nice game of cards when these Silver Covenant... slugs came around telling us to hand over our belongings. What gives?"]="Estava dando uma partida de cartas, sem molestar a ninguém, quando de repente chegaram uns... cafres do Pacto de Prata e nos disseram que lhes entregáramos nossas pertences. Mas que passa?"
G["There MUST be a way to make more money off of this holiday."]="Precisa haver um modo de ganhar dinheiro com esta festa."
G["There Scourge outside Trade Quarter!"]="O Flagelo está nas arredores do Bairro do Comercio!"
G["There Will Be Blood!"]="Correrá o sangue!"
G["There are $3094W activated dwarves!"]="Há $3094W anões ativos!"
G["There are Alliance survivors!  Send... reinforcements..."]="There are Alliance survivors!  Send... reinforcements..."
G["There are FOUR lights!"]="Existem quatro luzes!"
G["There are Tian disciples in town celebrating the Brewmoon, $n! Surely they could use their training to help us. Talk to them and see if they can stop these yaungol!"]="Há discípulas de Tian no povo celebrando a Cerveja Lunar, $n! Certo que poderiam usar seu adiestramento para nos ajudar. Fala com elas para ver se podem parar a estes yaungol!"
G["There are Tian mistweavers here from the Tian monastery, $n. Their skills with mistweaving would allow us to fight even longer! Ask them to aid us in this fight."]="There are Tian mistweavers here from the Tian monastery, $n. Their skills with mistweaving would allow us to fight even longer! Ask them to aid us in this fight."
G["There are Twilight's Hammer to be slain."]="Ainda restam membros do Martelo Crepúsculo por matar."
G["There are a few ways to earn our esteem.\n\nWe are busy dealing with sha eruptions at Firebough Nook in Kun-Lai Summit. Help us there, and you will gain a foothold into our brotherhood.\n\nThe Shado-Pan Monastery is also in trouble. You may be able to assist our brothers and sisters there.\n\nThe Sha of Anger roams the fields of Kun-Lai to the north. Defeat it, and you will gain great respect from our order.\n\nA Shado-Pan contigent chases the Sha of Hatred in the Townlong Steppes. They may need help.\n\nIf you wish to earn our highest esteem, you must first prove yourself by earning revered standing with the Golden Lotus. Only then, speak to my brothers and sisters at Shado-Pan Garrison in the Townlong Steppes."]="There are a few ways to earn our esteem.\n\nWe are busy dealing with sha eruptions at Firebough Nook in Kun-Lai Summit. Help us there, and you will gain a foothold into our brotherhood.\n\nThe Shado-Pan Monastery is also in trouble. You may be able to assist our brothers and sisters there.\n\nThe Sha of Anger roams the fields of Kun-Lai to the north. Defeat it, and you will gain great respect from our order.\n\nA Shado-Pan contigent chases the Sha of Hatred in the Townlong Steppes. They may need help.\n\nIf you wish to earn our highest esteem, you must first prove yourself by earning revered standing with the Golden Lotus. Only then, speak to my brothers and sisters at Shado-Pan Garrison in the Townlong Steppes."
G["There are a lot of corpses out there.  Nicely done, $p."]="Há muitos cadáveres aqui. Bem feito, $p."
G["There are a number of skilled tradesmen scattered around Azuremyst. Which one are you looking for?"]="Há um número de comerciantes qualificados espalhados por Azuremyst. Qual você está procurando?"
G["There are a thousand reasons, but you must decide what is worth fighting for."]="Há milhares de razones, mas você deve decidir por que que lutar."
G["There are at least three ways beneath Dalaran: Sewer entrances in the east and west, and a well in the north."]="Existem pelo menos três maneiras sob Dalaran: entradas de esgoto no leste e oeste e um poço no norte."
G["There are basics that must be learned. Trianna is standing nearby, speak with her and return to me later."]="Existem noções básicas que devem ser aprendidas. Trianna está por perto, fale com ela e volte para mim mais tarde."
G["There are clams to be collected and orcas to be killed. Help or stay out of the way!"]="Existem amêijoas a serem coletadas e orcas a serem mortas. Ajude ou fique fosse do caminho!"
G["There are costs with war, $c... ones often overlooked.  Those costs are the orphans - children who have lost their parents to the far-too-numerous conflicts that rage across Azeroth.  Those children who have no one else to turn to often come here to live until they are old enough to fend for themselves.\n\nOne week out of the year during the Spring, the Alliance takes time to give something back to these innocents.  This time is called Children's Week."]="There are costs with war, $c... ones often overlooked.  Those costs are the orphans - children who have lost their parents to the far-too-numerous conflicts that rage across Azeroth.  Those children who have no one else to turn to often come here to live until they are old enough to fend for themselves.\n\nOne week out of the year during the Spring, the Alliance takes time to give something back to these innocents.  This time is called Children's Week."
G["There are costs with war, $c... ones often overlooked.  Those costs are the orphans - children who have lost their parents to the far-too-numerous conflicts that rage across Azeroth.  Those children who have no one else to turn to often come here to live until they are old enough to fend for themselves.\n\nOne week out of the year during the Spring, the Horde takes time to give something back to these innocents.  This time is called Children's Week."]="There are costs with war, $c... ones often overlooked.  Those costs are the orphans - children who have lost their parents to the far-too-numerous conflicts that rage across Azeroth.  Those children who have no one else to turn to often come here to live until they are old enough to fend for themselves.\n\nOne week out of the year during the Spring, the Horde takes time to give something back to these innocents.  This time is called Children's Week."
G["There are demons to kill, $c.  Do you have the backbone to do what needs to be done?"]="Há demônios que matar, $c. Tem coragem para fazer o que é preciso fazer?"
G["There are dozens of the pesky little brats. Can't grab the orbs with them tormenting us. Can't catch them to kill them.\n\nAt least I haven't lost my weapon, unlike some people..."]="There are dozens of the pesky little brats. Can't grab the orbs with them tormenting us. Can't catch them to kill them.\n\nAt least I haven't lost my weapon, unlike some people..."
G["There are eight types of Darkmoon Cards; Beasts, Blessings, Elementals, Furies, Lunacy, Portals, Storms and Warlords, with eight cards, Ace to Eight in each suit. If you collect all eight of one suit then you can turn them into a deck that you can give to our Professor Thaddeus Paleo in exchange for a powerful trinket."]="Existem oito tipos de cartões de Negraluna; Bestas, Bênçãos, Elementais, Fúrias, Loucura, Portais, Tempestades e Senhores da Guerra, com oito cartas, Ás a Oito em cada naipe. Se você coletar todos os oito de um naipe, poderá transformá-os em um baralho que você pode dar ao nosso Professor Thaddeus Paleo em troca de uma bugiganga poderosa."
G["There are enough parts to rebuild it. Stronger, faster, better!"]="There are enough parts to rebuild it. Stronger, faster, better!"
G["There are few left in the world who can prepare the Ward of Waking, $n. We are fortunate that I am among them."]="Restam muito poucos no mundo que possam preparar o Resguardo de despertar, $n. Temos a fortuna de eu seja um dos eles."
G["There are few things you can trust in life. Steel, you can trust."]="Existem poucas coisas em que você pode confiar na vida. Aço, você pode confiar."
G["There are few thundering cloud serpents left in our world."]="There are few thundering cloud serpents left in our world."
G["There are four August Celestials who rule over this land.\n\nYu'lon the Jade Serpent, lifegiver of the east.\n\nChi-Ji the Red Crane, hope of the south.\n\nXuen the White Tiger, whose strength upholds the north.\n\nAnd Niuzao the Black Ox, who stands tall in the west.\n\nRecently, with the advent of the sha, turmoil has engulfed each of their temples. They need our help, $r."]="There are four August Celestials who rule over this land.\n\nYu'lon the Jade Serpent, lifegiver of the east.\n\nChi-Ji the Red Crane, hope of the south.\n\nXuen the White Tiger, whose strength upholds the north.\n\nAnd Niuzao the Black Ox, who stands tall in the west.\n\nRecently, with the advent of the sha, turmoil has engulfed each of their temples. They need our help, $r."
G["There are four generators powering the defense structures. If you sabotage the generators, the missile attacks will stop!"]="There are four generators powering the defense structures. If you sabotage the generators, the missile attacks will stop!"
G["There are four other votes you'll need to get, but that'll come in time."]="There are four other votes you'll need to get, but that'll come in time."
G["There are fundamental things you must learn before I can aid you. Speak to my apprentice, Vhan. He is kind and patient and will teach you what you need to know."]="Há coisas fundamentais que você deve aprender antes que eu possa ajudá-o. Fale com meu aprendiz, Vhan. Ele é gentil e paciente e ensinará o que você precisa saber."
G["There are healers under some of the wreckage!  Get them free."]="There are healers under some of the wreckage!  Get them free."
G["There are hundreds of them! Maybe thousands! They will attack at any moment! I'm sure of it!"]="Há centenas de eles! Talvez milhares! Atacarão em qualquer momentos! Estou certo!"
G["There are hunters training in Old Town's Command Center as well as in the Dwarven District."]="Há caçadores treinando no Centro de Comando da Cidade Velha e no Distrito dos Anões."
G["There are intruders about. Slay them before they ruin everything!"]="Há intrusos por aqui. Matem-nos antes de que o arruinen tudo!"
G["There are intruders within the temple!"]="Há intrusos no templo!"
G["There are many dangers facing us, but we cannot find ourselves neglecting nature, lest it neglect us in our time of need. We've learned this lesson before."]="Existem muitos perigos que enfrentamos, mas não podemos nos encontrar negligenciando a natureza, para que ela não nos negligencie em nosso tempo de necessidade. Nós aprendemos essa lição antes."
G["There are many establishments where you can get a drink in Stormwind, but only one will let you spend the night. Head over to the Gilded Rose in the Trade District. I've heard the cost of a room is reasonable and the sheets are clean."]="There are many establishments where you can get a drink in Stormwind, but only one will let you spend the night. Head over to the Gilded Rose in the Trade District. I've heard the cost of a room is reasonable and the sheets are clean."
G["There are many gathered here from many walks of life. Today, we are all equal as audience to these epic battles."]="There are many gathered here from many walks of life. Today, we are all equal as audience to these epic battles."
G["There are many hidden things on this island. You should seek them out."]="There are many hidden things on this island. You should seek them out."
G["There are many lessons left to learn, let us move onto our next subject..."]="There are many lessons left to learn, let us move onto our next subject..."
G["There are many mailboxes in Dalaran: On many corners, outside nearly every inn and bank, even upon Krasus' Landing."]="Há muitas caixas de correio em Dalaran: em muitas esquinas, do lado de fosse de quase todas as pousadas e bancos, mesmo no desembarque de Krasus."
G["There are many o' us in the Explorer's League who stay in the library, cataloguing and analyzing all of our findings.\n\nI spent the last five years doin' just that while Brann went out into the world, caperin' from one inneresting site to another.\n\nWell Hilda's finally back in the field, and it's about time I find somethin' BIG!"]="There are many o' us in the Explorer's League who stay in the library, cataloguing and analyzing all of our findings.\n\nI spent the last five years doin' just that while Brann went out into the world, caperin' from one inneresting site to another.\n\nWell Hilda's finally back in the field, and it's about time I find somethin' BIG!"
G["There are many obstacles one must overcome on the path to excellence. Your path is no exception..."]="no caminho da excelência, há muitos obstáculos que vencer. Seu caminho não é uma excepção..."
G["There are many places of interest in Dalaran. Which do you seek?"]="Existem muitos locais de interesse em Dalaran. Qual você procura?"
G["There are many places that you might visit in Teldrassil.  Tell me what you seek."]="Há muitos lugares que você pode visitar em Teldrassil. Diga-me o que você procura."
G["There are many secrets that may be unlocked with patience and determination. Now, let us begin..."]="Existem muitos segredos que podem ser descobertos com paciência e determinação. Agora, vamos começar..."
G["There are many wonderful poisons, Wakener. Some can boil you alive. Some will eat your flesh. Some burst you open from the inside.\n\nSo many wonderful varieties."]="There are many wonderful poisons, Wakener. Some can boil you alive. Some will eat your flesh. Some burst you open from the inside.\n\nSo many wonderful varieties."
G["There are master miners located at the Greenstone Quarry in the Jade Forest. They can probably help you improve your skill. I will mark the location on your map."]="There are master miners located at the Greenstone Quarry in the Jade Forest. They can probably help you improve your skill. I will mark the location on your map."
G["There are more at the east pass!"]="Há mais no passo do este!"
G["There are more attackers coming from Garm. Get some mines on that field!"]="De Garm chegam mais atacantes. Coloque algumas minas em esse campo!"
G["There are more coming. Defend yourself! Don't fall out of the anti-magic field! They'll tear you apart without its protection!"]="There are more coming. Defend yourself! Don't fall out of the anti-magic field! They'll tear you apart without its protection!"
G["There are more of them!"]="Há mais!"
G["There are more survivors to tend to. I'll see you on the shore."]="Tenho que atender a mais sobreviventes. Te verei na orilha."
G["There are more than enough to go around. Should you need other goods, don't hesitate to ask!"]="There are more than enough to go around. Should you need other goods, don't hesitate to ask!"
G["There are more that might still be alive! We need to keep moving."]="Restam mais que podem estar vivos! Temos que seguir moviéndonos."
G["There are more to the south!"]="Há mais ao sul!"
G["There are more up ahead - keep at it!"]="Há mais ali linha de frente... Continua assim!"
G["There are mysteries in this place that we, the orcs, are desperate to uncover.  Mysteries of our past, mysteries of our future, and mysteries that offer glimpses inside us.\n\nIt is my hope to pierce these mysteries... will you walk that path with me?"]="There are mysteries in this place that we, the orcs, are desperate to uncover.  Mysteries of our past, mysteries of our future, and mysteries that offer glimpses inside us.\n\nIt is my hope to pierce these mysteries... will you walk that path with me?"
G["There are new, stronger elementals attacking, but the fires are out of control!  Eliminate the elementals and get a handle on those fires."]="Há novos elementais mais fortes atacando, mas os fogos perderam o controle. Acaba com os elementais e controla esses fogos."
G["There are no battlemasters here in the Vale.\n\nYou must return to your home city to queue for battlegrounds or arenas of war."]="Não há mestres de batalha no vale.\n\nSe que poderá à cauda dos campos de batalha ou as arenas de guerra, terá que voltar ao seu capital."
G["There are no emotions. There are no morals. There are no zealots.\n\nThere is only the Brotherhood.\n\nHere, in the very chapel where Uther the Lightbringer joined the Order of the Silver Hand, I, Korfax, Champion of the Light, will inspire fear into the fearless.\n\nNothing will curb my fury - not the Scarlet Crusade, not the Argent Dawn, not my brothers, not even you."]="There are no emotions. There are no morals. There are no zealots.\n\nThere is only the Brotherhood.\n\nHere, in the very chapel where Uther the Lightbringer joined the Order of the Silver Hand, I, Korfax, Champion of the Light, will inspire fear into the fearless.\n\nNothing will curb my fury - not the Scarlet Crusade, not the Argent Dawn, not my brothers, not even you."
G["There are no freebies here, move on."]="Aqui não há nada grátis, circula."
G["There are no more available rides! There should be one available very soon... <PH>"]="There are no more available rides! There should be one available very soon... <PH>"
G["There are no whispers in your mind. You're imagining it. Back to work!"]="Não há sussurros no sua cabeça. Te os está imaginando. Volta ao trabalho!"
G["There are only 3 kinds of people in this world: competitors, customers, and employees. Competitors are to be crushed ruthlessly, customers indulged, and employees strictly supervised.\n\nIndependent contractors are a myth.They want to be paid better than employees, but treated like customers. Never trust one who calls himself by that title."]="There are only 3 kinds of people in this world: competitors, customers, and employees. Competitors are to be crushed ruthlessly, customers indulged, and employees strictly supervised.\n\nIndependent contractors are a myth.They want to be paid better than employees, but treated like customers. Never trust one who calls himself by that title."
G["There are only two truths to be found here: First, that time is chaotic, always in flux, and completely malleable and second, perception does not dictate reality."]="There are only two truths to be found here: First, that time is chaotic, always in flux, and completely malleable and second, perception does not dictate reality."
G["There are other fights to be had within Jotunheim if you are not skilled enough for Valhalas."]="Pode participar em outras luchas dentro de Jotunheim se não tem é suficiente habilidoso para Valhalas."
G["There are others like me. Paragons of each era, frozen in time and buried safely beyond the whispers of the Empress."]="There are others like me. Paragons of each era, frozen in time and buried safely beyond the whispers of the Empress."
G["There are plants in Felwood that may be saved from corruption when Cenarion plant salve is applied to them.  I know how to make the salve from several different kinds of items; based on your skill set, you may find that you have multiple options to assist me.\n\nYou will also need a Cenarion beacon for your work here; it is a device that allows you to see the taint and corruption of nature that the naked eye will miss."]="There are plants in Felwood that may be saved from corruption when Cenarion plant salve is applied to them.  I know how to make the salve from several different kinds of items; based on your skill set, you may find that you have multiple options to assist me.\n\nYou will also need a Cenarion beacon for your work here; it is a device that allows you to see the taint and corruption of nature that the naked eye will miss."
G["There are plenty more where that came from!"]="Tem muito mais de onde veio isso!"
G["There are plenty of targets out there for both of us..."]="Há alvos de sobra para todos..."
G["There are plenty of thermal vents up ahead, $n. Feel free to use them if you get into a jam."]="There are plenty of thermal vents up ahead, $n. Feel free to use them if you get into a jam."
G["There are quite a few trainers available in Elwynn.  Which one are you looking for?"]="Existem algum treinadores disponíveis em Elwynn. Qual você está procurando?"
G["There are routes traced from this Auberdine to several locations.  It almost looks like an evacuation plan."]="There are routes traced from this Auberdine to several locations.  It almost looks like an evacuation plan."
G["There are rumors o' heroes fightin' back the elementals, but we'll conjure more."]="There are rumors o' heroes fightin' back the elementals, but we'll conjure more."
G["There are secrets contained within these halls that are beyond our wildest dreams."]="Existem segredos contidos nesses salões que estão além dos nossos sonhos mais loucos."
G["There are several battlegrounds from which to choose.  To which battlemaster shall I send you?"]="Existem vários campos de batalha para você escolher. Para qual mestre de batalha devo lhe enviar?"
G["There are several prominent bills tacked up on the board here.\n\nHowever, the fine-print indicates that you're not quite ready for either of the tasks at hand.  You should definitely check back later!"]="Há várias notas destacadas na tábua.\n\nNo entanto, a letra pequena indica que não está $gpreparado: preparada; para nenhuma das tarefas. Definitivamente deveria voltar mais tarde!"
G["There are so MANY of them..."]="São demais..."
G["There are so many choices, I can't decide!"]="Há tantas coisas... Não sei que comer!"
G["There are so many cute, little rats!"]="There are so many cute, little rats!"
G["There are so many great stories to uncover. So much history. Isn't it fascinating?"]="Há muitas histórias que descobrir. Muita história. Nos é fascinante?"
G["There are so many strange and interesting things in this land. It is different, but I am impressed."]="There are so many strange and interesting things in this land. It is different, but I am impressed."
G["There are so many things to buy."]="Há tantas coisas que comprar."
G["There are so many wounded..."]="Há tantos feridos..."
G["There are some Vale marksmen in town that stopped to rest for the night, $n. They have defended the Gate of the Setting Sun against the mantid for many years with their mortars. See if you can wake them up!"]="There are some Vale marksmen in town that stopped to rest for the night, $n. They have defended the Gate of the Setting Sun against the mantid for many years with their mortars. See if you can wake them up!"
G["There are some damaged cannons inside the storehouses and behind the inn, $n. If you could repair them, the villagers could use them to blast the yaungol!"]="There are some damaged cannons inside the storehouses and behind the inn, $n. If you could repair them, the villagers could use them to blast the yaungol!"
G["There are some jovial villagers in town that claim they created a helmet that makes them better at everything. While I'm skeptical, having a helmet on couldn't hurt, right? Talk to them and see if they'll lend you one."]="There are some jovial villagers in town that claim they created a helmet that makes them better at everything. While I'm skeptical, having a helmet on couldn't hurt, right? Talk to them and see if they'll lend you one."
G["There are some rather cryptic instructions in this note. Brann must've had some kind of backup plan, but he can't keep evading capture forever..."]="Nesta nota há umas instruções bastante crípticas. Brann deve ter algum outro plano, mas não pode seguir evitando a captura eternamente..."
G["There are some rewards fit only for those who have attained the title of Crusader, exalted in the eyes of the Argent Crusade as well as all their allied peoples.\n\nTirion himself has charged me with the finding of such heroes and bestowing upon them the proper decorations."]="There are some rewards fit only for those who have attained the title of Crusader, exalted in the eyes of the Argent Crusade as well as all their allied peoples.\n\nTirion himself has charged me with the finding of such heroes and bestowing upon them the proper decorations."
G["There are some that would call us barbarians... the \"mongrel races\" of Azeroth."]="Há quem nos chama bárbaros... as \"raças selvagens\" de Azeroth."
G["There are some who call me 'Tim,' but to my friends, I am 'the specialist.'"]="Há quem me chame de 'Tim', mas, para meus amigos, sou o 'especiapronta'."
G["There are some who desire to stop gaining experience from their actions; to forever remain at the level of strength they are now, and never grow stronger.\n\nI can make this possible... for a fee, of course.\n\nBut understand this: Once you pay me, you will NO LONGER GAIN EXPERIENCE. None. Not one whit.\n\nShould you change your mind afterwards and want to start gaining experience again, I can undo the process for the same fee."]="There are some who desire to stop gaining experience from their actions; to forever remain at the level of strength they are now, and never grow stronger.\n\nI can make this possible... for a fee, of course.\n\nBut understand this: Once you pay me, you will NO LONGER GAIN EXPERIENCE. None. Not one whit.\n\nShould you change your mind afterwards and want to start gaining experience again, I can undo the process for the same fee."
G["There are some who do not believe in the legendary Night Elf Mohawks.\n\nI pity the fools."]="Há quem não acreditam nos lendários elfos da noite mohicanos.\n\nEstão como uma maraca."
G["There are stable masters in both Old Town and the Dwarven District."]="Existem mestres estáveis ​​na Cidade Velha e no Distrito dos Anões."
G["There are stable masters just outside both the draenei and blood elf inns on Aldor Rise and Scryer's Tier."]="Existem mestres estáveis ​​do lado de fosse das pousadas draenei e elfa de sangue em Aldor Rise e Scryer."
G["There are stables just beyond Old Town's southeast gates. You can find a riding trainer and a horse breeder there."]="Há estábulos logo após os portões sudeste da Cidade Velha. Você pode encontrar um treinador de equitação e um criador de cavalos lá."
G["There are still lessons you must learn from others before my knowledge may be shared with you. Be diligent, and do not give up hope."]="Ainda há lições que você deve aprender com outras pessoas antes que meu conhecimento possa ser compartilhado com você. Seja diligente e não desista da esperança."
G["There are still others - search the barracks!"]="There are still others - search the barracks!"
G["There are those that attempt to follow the path of the Rogue, but only the night elves are truly embraced by the night.  If you seek to walk the shaded path then find Syurna in the Cenarion Enclave."]="Existem aqueles que tentam seguir pelo caminho do Ladino, mas apenas os elfos noturnos são mesmo abraçados pela noite. Se você tentar percorrer o caminho sombreado, encontre Syurna no Enclave Cenarion."
G["There are those that would teach you of Herbalism in the great home of Thunder Bluff away to the north.  Follow the road out of the village to get there and at the base of the bluff ride the elevator to the top of the rise.  There are many Bluffwatchers there who can direct you further."]="Há quem o ensine Herbalismo na grande casa de Thunder Bluff, ao norte. Continue a estrada para fosse da vila para chegar lá e, na base do penhasco, pegue o elevador até o topo da subida. Existem muitos Bluffwatchers lá que podem direcioná-o ainda mais."
G["There are those who seek to lie and twist the truth.  Seers, on the other hand, bring the truth to light.\n\nThe purpose of this library, $n, is to make a seer out of everyone."]="There are those who seek to lie and twist the truth.  Seers, on the other hand, bring the truth to light.\n\nThe purpose of this library, $n, is to make a seer out of everyone."
G["There are those who would say that the Argent Crusade is a thing of the past.  I am one of them, but not because the Scourge have fallen.\n\nNo... it is because of their stubborn ways.  They've become too much like the church that they seceded from: too rigid, too governed by honor and order.  This is what I'm trying to tell Barthalomew, anyhow.\n\nSure, it may sound a bit jingoistic, but it makes for a good debate."]="There are those who would say that the Argent Crusade is a thing of the past.  I am one of them, but not because the Scourge have fallen.\n\nNo... it is because of their stubborn ways.  They've become too much like the church that they seceded from: too rigid, too governed by honor and order.  This is what I'm trying to tell Barthalomew, anyhow.\n\nSure, it may sound a bit jingoistic, but it makes for a good debate."
G["There are three banks in the city: The Bank of Dalaran in the north, the Dalaran Merchants' Bank in the south, and one more beneath the city, in the sewers."]="Existem três bancos na cidade: o banco de Dalaran, no norte, o banco de comerciantes de Dalaran, no sul, e mais um abaixo da cidade, nos esgotos."
G["There are three of us, which is two more than I need to eat your head."]="There are three of us, which is two more than I need to eat your head."
G["There are three ways out of the Underbelly: Ramps leading up to the east and west, and the tunnel that drops out of the bottom of Dalaran.\n\nBe certain you can fly before you take that tunnel, of course."]="There are three ways out of the Underbelly: Ramps leading up to the east and west, and the tunnel that drops out of the bottom of Dalaran.\n\nBe certain you can fly before you take that tunnel, of course."
G["There are too few who care for the wounded from battle. If I had the skill, I would certainly join them."]="Há poucos que possam atender aos feridos em combate. Se contara com a habilidade necessário, lhes ajudaria."
G["There are too many of them!"]="Eles são muitos!"
G["There are too many! Shaman, do something!"]="São demais! Xamã, faça algo!"
G["There are two banks in Shattrath, both along the rim of the central city hub. One is run by the draenei Aldor, the other by the blood elf Scryers."]="Existem dois bancos em Shattrath, ambos ao longo da orla do centro da cidade. Um é dirigido pelo draenei Aldor, o outro pelo sangue elfo Scryers."
G["There are two banks in the city: The Stormwind Counting House in the Trade District, and the Royal Bank of Stormwind in the Dwarven District."]="Existem dois bancos na cidade: a Casa de Contagem de Ventobravo no Distrito Comercial e o Banco Real de Ventobravo no Distrito Dwarven."
G["There are two gem merchants in residence: one works closely with the Scryers, and the other is loyal to the Aldor. Whom do you seek?"]="Há dois comerciantes de pedras preciosas em residência: um trabalha em estreita colaboração com os Scryers e o outro é leal ao Aldor. A quem você procura?"
G["There are two mailboxes in the Seat of the Naaru: one by the bank, and another outside the auction house."]="Há duas caixas de correio na sede dos Naaru: uma do banco e outra do lado de fosse da casa de leilões."
G["There are two masters of the sword: Handiir and Woo Ping. The former can be found in the Trader's Tier of the Exodar, and the latter in Weller's Arsenal within Stormwind."]="Existem dois mestres da lâmina: Handiir e Woo Ping. O primeiro pode ser encontrado no Nível do Exodar do Comerciante e o segundo no Arsenal de Weller, no Ventobravo."
G["There are two mines in Alterac: the Irondeep in Alliance territory and the Coldtooth mine in Horde territory.  Both mines are a rich source of minerals, and in the past were used to store excess supplies.\n\nNow, these mines are constantly fought over by the Horde, the Alliance and local denizens."]="There are two mines in Alterac: the Irondeep in Alliance territory and the Coldtooth mine in Horde territory.  Both mines are a rich source of minerals, and in the past were used to store excess supplies.\n\nNow, these mines are constantly fought over by the Horde, the Alliance and local denizens."
G["There are two potential results when the Earthen's synthesis matrix destabilizes.  Initiating visual aid representation number one.\n\nThe first variant matrix is a degenerative product of synthesis, hereby designated with the common nomenclature of \"Trogg\".  This variant maintains strength and stamina comparable to the Earthen, but its cognitive processing power has been almost completely compromised.  Force of will and a strong sense of cunning are the only driving factors in the psyche of the trogg."]="There are two potential results when the Earthen's synthesis matrix destabilizes.  Initiating visual aid representation number one.\n\nThe first variant matrix is a degenerative product of synthesis, hereby designated with the common nomenclature of \"Trogg\".  This variant maintains strength and stamina comparable to the Earthen, but its cognitive processing power has been almost completely compromised.  Force of will and a strong sense of cunning are the only driving factors in the psyche of the trogg."
G["There are two prominent bills tacked up on the board here; one from Papa Wheeler and one from Rocket-Chief Fuselage.\n\nPapa's looks like it's a wanted ad for a machine part.  The rocket-chief's has something to do with a bounty on the head of an immense mountain giant!\n\nThe details for both are provided in very small goblin handwriting, which is, of course, barely legible."]="There are two prominent bills tacked up on the board here; one from Papa Wheeler and one from Rocket-Chief Fuselage.\n\nPapa's looks like it's a wanted ad for a machine part.  The rocket-chief's has something to do with a bounty on the head of an immense mountain giant!\n\nThe details for both are provided in very small goblin handwriting, which is, of course, barely legible."
G["There are two sides to the blade of demonology..."]="Há dois lados na lâmina da demonologia..."
G["There are two zeppelin towers outside Orgrimmar. The eastern tower serves Tirisfal Glades and Stranglethorn Vale, while the western tower serves Northrend and Thunder Bluff."]="Existem duas torres de zepelim fosse de Orgrimmar. A torre leste serve Tirisfal Glades e Stranglethorn Vale, enquanto a torre oeste serve Northrend e Thunder Bluff."
G["There are two: The Trader's Hall in the Trade District, and the Stormwind Auction House in the Dwarven District."]="Existem dois: o Trader's Hall, no Trade District, e o Stormwind Auction House, no Dwarven District."
G["There are villains amongst us - remain vigilant. The Ebon Blade seeks to prevent us from destroying their true master, the Lich King."]="There are villains amongst us - remain vigilant. The Ebon Blade seeks to prevent us from destroying their true master, the Lich King."
G["There are ways for a shortfang to become stronger. If I wanted, I could escape the scorn of my tribe.\n\nThere are ways... but I am afraid. I am too scared, too weak.\n\nThey do not understand me. I will be a shortfang all my life."]="There are ways for a shortfang to become stronger. If I wanted, I could escape the scorn of my tribe.\n\nThere are ways... but I am afraid. I am too scared, too weak.\n\nThey do not understand me. I will be a shortfang all my life."
G["There are ways to strengthen steel beyond the hammer and forge, young wanderer."]="Existem maneiras de fortalecer o aço além do martelo e forjar, jovem andarilho."
G["There aren't any enchanters out here in Dun Morogh that I know of.  Ye're going to have to visit Ironforge if ye want to learn the enchanter's profession."]="Não tenho nenhum feiticeiro aqui em Dun Morogh que eu saiba. Você terá que visitar Ironforge se quiser aprender a profissão do feiticeiro."
G["There aren't any more challengers who want to fight you, $n. You're just too damned good.\nYou still want a fight? Go pick up a challenge card and talk to me again."]="There aren't any more challengers who want to fight you, $n. You're just too damned good.\nYou still want a fight? Go pick up a challenge card and talk to me again."
G["There aren't many of us left, $n.  The return of our old enemy is a cause for great concern."]="There aren't many of us left, $n.  The return of our old enemy is a cause for great concern."
G["There aren't many willing to brave the mountain pass anymore, friend. Nowadays, some would say you'd have to be crazy to try."]="There aren't many willing to brave the mountain pass anymore, friend. Nowadays, some would say you'd have to be crazy to try."
G["There be no fishin' today. Kor'kron orders."]="Hoje não se pesca. Ordens Kor'kron."
G["There be nuthin' here to drink, Mack. Away with ya!"]="Aqui não há nada para beber, Mack. Márchate!"
G["There be one mon!"]="Aí há um, colega!"
G["There can be no disruptions! Mustn't keep the master waiting! Mustn't fail again!"]="Não, não pode haver interrupções! Não devo fazer esperar ao mestre! Não devo falhar outra vez!"
G["There can be no doubt as to your tenacity... but there are other virtues to consider."]="Ninguém pode colocar em dúvida sua tenacidade... Mas há outras virtudes que considerar."
G["There can be only one outcome to such a battle: death for one side or the other. Let $n prove $g himself : herself; upon the bones of those outsiders who have fallen before!"]="There can be only one outcome to such a battle: death for one side or the other. Let $n prove $g himself : herself; upon the bones of those outsiders who have fallen before!"
G["There can be only one survivor!"]="Somente pode haver um sobrevivente!"
G["There can't be too many more of these collectors. Just keep me safe as I do my job."]="There can't be too many more of these collectors. Just keep me safe as I do my job."
G["There comes a time when the life we know falls short.  We are trapped and look for answers, and we find hope burning in dark places.\n\nOnly then, $n, do we take our first steps to freedom."]="There comes a time when the life we know falls short.  We are trapped and look for answers, and we find hope burning in dark places.\n\nOnly then, $n, do we take our first steps to freedom."
G["There could be danger around every corner here."]="Aqui acechao perigo em cada esquina."
G["There exist in Outland demonic presences much more powerful than anything we'd ever seen in the old world.\n\nGreat power shall come to those who do not shy away from it, but learn to harness and master its strength."]="There exist in Outland demonic presences much more powerful than anything we'd ever seen in the old world.\n\nGreat power shall come to those who do not shy away from it, but learn to harness and master its strength."
G["There exist two great disciplines among our people. The Tushui are patient, pensive, and deliberate. The Huojin are fierce, forward, and active. Both disciplines serve us in their own way, and neither could exist effectively without the other."]="There exist two great disciplines among our people. The Tushui are patient, pensive, and deliberate. The Huojin are fierce, forward, and active. Both disciplines serve us in their own way, and neither could exist effectively without the other."
G["There goes another one..."]="Além vai outro..."
G["There goes the BOOM!"]="Além vao BUM!"
G["There goes the finest $c I have the honor of knowing."]="Aí vai $gel melhor: a melhor: c;$c que e tido a honra de conhecer."
G["There goes the hero of the Vanguard!"]="Além vai estrela da Vanguarda!"
G["There goes the zeppelin to Orgrimmar. I hope there's no explosions this time."]="Aí vao zepelim a Orgrimmar. Espero que esta vez não tenha explosões."
G["There has been too much violence. Too much pain. But I have an honorable compromise. Just walk away."]="There has been too much violence. Too much pain. But I have an honorable compromise. Just walk away."
G["There has to be a way to stop this corruption before it consumes us all."]="Precisa haver uma maneira de parar essa corrupção antes que ela consuma todos nós."
G["There has to be someone who can help me!"]="Precisa haver alguém que possa me ajudar!"
G["There has to be something you can do, blood guard."]="Deve haver algo que possa fazer, guarda de sangue."
G["There have been no Shado-Pan down this way recently. That cannot be good.\n\nWe were supposed to still have a few years before the next mantid swarm."]="There have been no Shado-Pan down this way recently. That cannot be good.\n\nWe were supposed to still have a few years before the next mantid swarm."
G["There have been reports of intruders. You are to notify me at once if you see anything unusual!"]="There have been reports of intruders. You are to notify me at once if you see anything unusual!"
G["There have been some complaints filed about this... individual. I'm told he's something of a shady character. I am here to determine whether or not this business of his is legitimate... and take action if it proves otherwise."]="Houve algumas queixas apresentadas sobre este... indivíduo. Disseram para mim que ele é um personagem sombrio. Estou aqui para determinar se esse negócio dele é legítimo ou não... e pegar medidas se isso for de outro modo."
G["There he continues to wage war on Illidan with the assistance of the Aldor and the Scryers.  The two factions have not given up on their old feuds, though."]="There he continues to wage war on Illidan with the assistance of the Aldor and the Scryers.  The two factions have not given up on their old feuds, though."
G["There he is!"]="Aí está!"
G["There he is! Kill him now, $p!"]="Aí está! Matem-no, $p!"
G["There he is, stop him!"]="There he is, stop him!"
G["There is NOTHING random about what I say!  Nothing!"]="Eu SEMPRE sei o que digo! SEMPRE!"
G["There is a Blacksmithing Trainer in our great home Thunder Bluff to the north.  If you seek such knowledge then head there and ask one of the Bluffwatchers for directions."]="Há um instrutor de ferraria em nossa grande casa, Thunder Bluff, ao norte. Se você procura esse conhecimento, vá até lá e peça instruções a um dos Bluffwatchers."
G["There is a Highborne archmage visiting the city's Enchanting trainer. You can have your items reforged there."]="Há um arquimago Highborne visitando o treinador Encantador da cidade. Você pode ter seus itens reformados lá."
G["There is a Wind Rider Master in the great city of Thunder Bluff to the north.  Ride the elevator from the base of Thunder Bluff to the top and ask one of the Bluffwatchers there for further instructions."]="Há um Wind Rider Master na grande cidade de Thunder Bluff, ao norte. Pegue o elevador da base do Thunder Bluff até o topo e peça mais instruções a um dos Bluffwatchers de lá."
G["There is a battle brewing at the Abyssal Breach. I hope that the reinforcements that arrived with the Pincer X2 will be enough."]="Há uma batalha se formando na Abissal Violação. Espero que os reforços que chegaram com o Pincer X2 sejam suficientes."
G["There is a battle trainer by the name of Gentle San who trains her pets out on the main terrace.\n\nI will mark the location on your map."]="There is a battle trainer by the name of Gentle San who trains her pets out on the main terrace.\n\nI will mark the location on your map."
G["There is a battle trainer by the name of Sara Finkleswitch who trains her pets out on the main terrace.\n\nI will mark the location on your map."]="There is a battle trainer by the name of Sara Finkleswitch who trains her pets out on the main terrace.\n\nI will mark the location on your map."
G["There is a black market of sorts in the northeastern portion of the sewers."]="Existe uma espécie de mercado negro na porção nordeste dos esgotos."
G["There is a blood elf in the Valley of Strength's central fortress, part of a delegation from Silvermoon: Belloc. He is who you want."]="Há um elfo sangrento na fortaleza central do Valley of Strength, parte de uma delegação de Silvermoon: Belloc. Ele é quem você quer."
G["There is a bluff south of here that would make a fine farm. It overlooks a gorge. You may be right, stranger."]="There is a bluff south of here that would make a fine farm. It overlooks a gorge. You may be right, stranger."
G["There is a creature half-buried in the silt, a hideous collection of limbs and tentacles with no discernable face. You can't bring yourself to touch the eerily translucent flesh.\n\nAlthough the beast is dead, the water around the shapeless body appears clean, and the corpse itself curiously shows no sign of decay."]="There is a creature half-buried in the silt, a hideous collection of limbs and tentacles with no discernable face. You can't bring yourself to touch the eerily translucent flesh.\n\nAlthough the beast is dead, the water around the shapeless body appears clean, and the corpse itself curiously shows no sign of decay."
G["There is a difference between testing one's strength and blindly walking into harm's way. Garrosh sent us to do the latter, and this I cannot accept."]="There is a difference between testing one's strength and blindly walking into harm's way. Garrosh sent us to do the latter, and this I cannot accept."
G["There is a faint light emanating from deep within the orb and a blue mist swirls across its surface."]="There is a faint light emanating from deep within the orb and a blue mist swirls across its surface."
G["There is a fisherman within our grand city... if spending time with pungent, wet, flopping abominations is your idea of a pleasant day."]="Há um pescador em nossa grande cidade... se passar um tempo com abominações pungentes, molhadas e caídas, é à sua idéia de um dia agradável."
G["There is a glint of light coming from something on the creature's back."]="Há algo na costas da criatura que reflete a luz."
G["There is a goblin-run bank down here, just north of the Cantrips and Crows Tavern in the western sewers."]="Há um banco administrado por goblins aqui, ao norte da Cantrips e Crows Tavern, nos esgotos ocidentais."
G["There is a great concentration of naga just outside of this cavern.\n\nWe were fortunate to reach this place unnoticed."]="Há uma grande concentração de nagas no exterior dessa caverna.\n\nTemos tido muita sorte de haver pedido chegar até aqui sem chamar seu atenção."
G["There is a great deal at stake within the blue dragonflight, $c.\n\nSoon, a new aspect must be chosen to take the place of Malygos.\n\nArygos aspires to follow in the footsteps of his father, renewing the misguided aggression against all who wield magic. This path, I feel, would lead to the end of our kind.\n\nThe remnants of our flight are divided on this fateful issue, and I fear that Arygos will stop at nothing to meet his ends..."]="There is a great deal at stake within the blue dragonflight, $c.\n\nSoon, a new aspect must be chosen to take the place of Malygos.\n\nArygos aspires to follow in the footsteps of his father, renewing the misguided aggression against all who wield magic. This path, I feel, would lead to the end of our kind.\n\nThe remnants of our flight are divided on this fateful issue, and I fear that Arygos will stop at nothing to meet his ends..."
G["There is a greenhouse attached to the Agronomical Apothecary in the Magus Commerce Exchange, northwest Dalaran. You'll find the city's best herbalists there."]="Há uma estufa anexada ao Boticário Agronômico na Magus Commerce Exchange, noroeste de Dalaran. Você encontrará os melhores herbaprontas da cidade por lá."
G["There is a hozen on your face! Jump to shake it off!"]="There is a hozen on your face! Jump to shake it off!"
G["There is a large smithy and forge in the Magus Commerce Exchange, northwest Dalaran.\n\nLook for the massive enchanted anvil and stained glass windows in the shapes of axes and shields."]="There is a large smithy and forge in the Magus Commerce Exchange, northwest Dalaran.\n\nLook for the massive enchanted anvil and stained glass windows in the shapes of axes and shields."
G["There is a large tent on the east side of Bloodhoof Village.  You will find Narm Skychaser awaiting you there."]="Há uma grande tenda no lado leste da Vila Casco Sangrento. Você encontrará Narm Skychaser esperando por você lá."
G["There is a lesson to be learned in every challenge we face."]="Cada desafio ao que nos enfrentamos é uma lecção por aprender."
G["There is a little lamb lost in dark woods."]="Há um pequeno ovelha perdido nos florestas obscuros."
G["There is a mailbox located conveniently right between the Stormwind Bank and The Gilded Rose Inn in the Trade District."]="Há uma caixa de correio localizada convenientemente entre o Stormwind Bank e o The Gilded Rose Inn, no distrito comercial."
G["There is a mailbox outside of the Bank which you'll find in the center of Darnassus."]="Há uma caixa de correio fosse do banco, que você encontrará no centro de Darnassus."
G["There is a master of archaeology in the Seat of Knowledge, above Mogu'shan Palace here in the Vale of Eternal Blossoms.\n\nI will mark their location on your map for you."]="There is a master of archaeology in the Seat of Knowledge, above Mogu'shan Palace here in the Vale of Eternal Blossoms.\n\nI will mark their location on your map for you."
G["There is a much larger problem we face now, my students. Shen-zin Su is in pain. If we do not act, the very land on which we stand could die, and all of us with it."]="Agora nos enfrentamos a um problema muito maior: Shen-zin Seu está sofrendo. Se não fazemos algo, a terra que pisamos perecerá e, com ela, todos nós."
G["There is a noise from behind you!"]="Há um ruido por trás de ti!"
G["There is a pained howl from deep within the woods."]="Se ouça um uivo de dor no mais profundo do florestas."
G["There is a pair of tauren visiting the city. I'm told they've come from Mulgore to learn more about the Forsaken \"condition,\" or something to that effect.\n\nSeek them out near the herbalist by the Apothecarium."]="There is a pair of tauren visiting the city. I'm told they've come from Mulgore to learn more about the Forsaken \"condition,\" or something to that effect.\n\nSeek them out near the herbalist by the Apothecarium."
G["There is a pile of wrapped gifts here."]="Há uma pilha de presentes embrulhados aqui."
G["There is a power flowing through all things that live. It carries many names."]="Há uma energia que fluye por todas as coisas que estão vivas. Tem muitos nomes."
G["There is a powerful infernal named Kroshius northeast of this camp. It is why Niby is here. Kroshius is a greater infernal - an infernal that has lasted longer than expected. You see, nub, an infernal crashes down into the earth with great intensity to serve its master but this intensity fades fast. Once the blazing flames have died down, the infernal crumbles."]="Existe um poderoso infernal chamado Kroshius, a nordeste deste acampamento. É por isso que Niby está aqui. Kroshius é um infernal maior - um infernal que durou mais do que o esperado. Veja bem, um acidente infernal cai na terra com grande intensidade para servir seu mestre, mas essa intensidade desaparece rapidamente. Depois que as chamas ardentes se apagam, as infernais se desfazem."
G["There is a reason I am king!"]="Há uma razão pela que sou rei!"
G["There is a scholar, Hammond the Jaded, who can assist you.  You will find him in the Temple of the Moon, often conversing with one of the returned Highborne."]="Há um estudioso, Hammond, o Jaded, que pode ajudá-o. Você o encontrará no Templo da Lua, conversando frequentemente com um dos Altaneiros retornados."
G["There is a serenity to this place. It is untainted by the wars that ravage the mainland."]="There is a serenity to this place. It is untainted by the wars that ravage the mainland."
G["There is a situation to the south that requires my immediate attention."]="There is a situation to the south that requires my immediate attention."
G["There is a skinning trainer at Nesingwary's Safari in the Valley of the Four Winds.\n\nI will mark their location on your map."]="Há um instrutor de desuelho no Safári Nesingwary, no Vale dos Quatro Ventos.\n\nTe marcarei seu localização no mapa."
G["There is a symmetry in the idea of the hide of your enemy providing you with protection.  To further your leatherworking skills look for Una inside the Thunder Bluff Armorers on the middle rise."]="Há uma simetria na idéia da pele do seu inimigo, fornecendo proteção. Para aprimorar suas habilidades em couro, procure por Uma nas Armourers do Penhasco do Trovão no meio do caminho."
G["There is a task I would like you to perform before we go any further..."]="Há algo que gostaria que hicieras antes de seguir avançando..."
G["There is a thorn in my side.  I cannot remove it."]="Tenho uma espinha no lado. Não me a posso tirar."
G["There is a time and a place for all things, including relaxation.  On the west side of Bloodhoof Village Innkeeper Kauth maintains a long house for those who seek to rest.  You will find him there."]="Há um tempo e um lugar para todas as coisas, incluindo relaxamento. No lado oeste do estalajadeiro da aldeia Bloodhoof, Kauth mantém uma casa comprida para quem procura descansar. Você o encontrará lá."
G["There is a way..."]="Há um modo..."
G["There is a well in northern Dalaran that some of the city's more... adventurous... visitors use to enter the sewers."]="Há um poço no norte de Dalaran que algum dos visitantes mais... aventureiros da cidade usam para entrar nos esgotos."
G["There is a wise one in the village who goes by the name Narm Skychaser.  He can continue your learning along the path of the Shaman."]="Há um sábio na vila que se chama Narm Skychaser. Ele pode seguir seu aprendizado pelo caminho do xamã."
G["There is always value  in spending time with old friends."]="There is always value  in spending time with old friends."
G["There is always... Ashbringer."]="There is always... Ashbringer."
G["There is an Engineering Trainer in Razor Hill.  He is called Mukdrak and can usually be found standing over near the forge."]="Há um instrutor de engenharia em Razor Hill. Ele é chamado Mukdrak e geralmente pode ser encontrado em pé perto da forja."
G["There is an alchemist that lives up in the hills between Northshire and Stormwind that might be of some help.  Why don't you go pay him a visit?"]="Há um alquimista que mora nas colinas entre Northshire e Stormwind que pode ser de alguma ajuda. Por que você não vai visitá-o?"
G["There is an intruder amongst us. Destroy them! Nothing must interfere with Lord Deathwing's plan!"]="There is an intruder amongst us. Destroy them! Nothing must interfere with Lord Deathwing's plan!"
G["There is an unnatural darkness to this place, a perpetual midnight. Take caution, heroes, and do not stray from the light."]="There is an unnatural darkness to this place, a perpetual midnight. Take caution, heroes, and do not stray from the light."
G["There is another visitor from beyond the mists here. \"Chen Stormstout\" he is called. He is Pandaren, but from a different homeland."]="Há outro visitante de além da névoa. Se chama \"Chen Cerveja de Trovão\". É um pandaren, mas de outra terra."
G["There is bound to be a gnome in Stormwind that can teach you the profession.  I'm sure one of the Stormwind Guards could point you in the right direction."]="É certo que existe um gnomo em Ventobravo que pode lhe ensinar a profissão. Tenho certeza de que um dos guardas de Ventobravo poderia apontá-o na direção certa."
G["There is but one duty that remains..."]="Tão somente resta uma obligação que cumprir..."
G["There is change on the wind, and we cannot ignore it. I have traveled from the dust and ruin of the past to come to an accord."]="There is change on the wind, and we cannot ignore it. I have traveled from the dust and ruin of the past to come to an accord."
G["There is fear in you, mortal.\n\nI can smell it."]="There is fear in you, mortal.\n\nI can smell it."
G["There is fight left in me yet, scum."]="Ainda posso dar guerra, escória."
G["There is fire in my eyes!  My mind!"]="Há fogo nos meus olhos! Meu mente!"
G["There is great arcane power on this island. I cannot yet tell if it lies in the hands of the Thunder King, or in the hands of our old Sunreaver allies.\n\nWe will find out in time."]="Nesta ilha existe um grande poder Arcano. Ainda não sei se se encontre em mãos do Rei do Trovão ou de nossos antigos aliados Atracasol.\n\nJá o averiguaremos."
G["There is great potential in the hammer Arthas cast aside when he took up Frostmourne.\n\nIt has helped to bring about events that have shaped this world's destiny. It possesses a great capacity for power that few comprehend.\n\nWith ample saronite I can reforge the hammer into an artifact to rival Frostmourne itself.\n\nIt is then that your most dangerous trial begins...."]="There is great potential in the hammer Arthas cast aside when he took up Frostmourne.\n\nIt has helped to bring about events that have shaped this world's destiny. It possesses a great capacity for power that few comprehend.\n\nWith ample saronite I can reforge the hammer into an artifact to rival Frostmourne itself.\n\nIt is then that your most dangerous trial begins...."
G["There is hope, Solomon."]="Há esperança, Solomon."
G["There is little else I can teach you, $c. Please, speak with my colleague Kalinda if you wish to know more of the craft."]="There is little else I can teach you, $c. Please, speak with my colleague Kalinda if you wish to know more of the craft."
G["There is little time for idle chatter. Our people are in crisis and every sin'dorei has a role to play in our restoration."]="Não há tempo para charlar. Nossa gente está em crisis e todos os sem'dorei têm um papel em nossa restauração."
G["There is more to magic than just arcane gesticulations... but I am speaking to someone who already knows this, yes?\n\nYou've come to me to learn, and learn you will... just so long as you pay attention and do as I say.  The secrets of the demons do not cater to fools, and neither do I."]="There is more to magic than just arcane gesticulations... but I am speaking to someone who already knows this, yes?\n\nYou've come to me to learn, and learn you will... just so long as you pay attention and do as I say.  The secrets of the demons do not cater to fools, and neither do I."
G["There is more."]="Há mais."
G["There is much I do not know about this artifact. The weak-willed cannot control this sha energy, but I WILL master it."]="There is much I do not know about this artifact. The weak-willed cannot control this sha energy, but I WILL master it."
G["There is much adventure to be had on this isle!"]="There is much adventure to be had on this isle!"
G["There is much and more that can be found at the Tavern in the Mists."]="Se você pode encontrar muito mais na Taberna na Névoa."
G["There is much damage to repair."]="Há muitos danos por reparar."
G["There is much punishment to deliver for the empire's crimes. We have no time to waste, Wakener. Meet me outside."]="Há muitos crímenes do império pendentes de castigo. Não temos tempo que perder, arauto. Reúnete comigo fosse."
G["There is much that you do not understand, $r. The Master sees all."]="Há muitas coisas que você não pode entender, $r. O mestre o vê tudo."
G["There is much to be done."]="Fica muito por fazer."
G["There is much to do. But first, Wakener... help me recover my strength."]="Há... muito que fazer. Mas antes, arauto... ajude-me a recobrar... minha força."
G["There is much we can learn from these Zandalari, largely by doing what they do not."]="Podemos aprender muito de estes Zandalari: devemos fazer sempre o contrario que eles fazem."
G["There is much work ahead of us if we are to heal the land and mend our wounds. But thanks to your deeds we no longer must work in the shadow of the seven breaths of Y'Shaarj.\n\nIn time, the sha will cease to be, and your name will be remembered with the reverence of the last emperor."]="There is much work ahead of us if we are to heal the land and mend our wounds. But thanks to your deeds we no longer must work in the shadow of the seven breaths of Y'Shaarj.\n\nIn time, the sha will cease to be, and your name will be remembered with the reverence of the last emperor."
G["There is much work left to be done, $n! Continue to strike down our enemies!"]="Ainda restante muito trabalho por fazer, $n. Sigam atacando a nossos inimigos!"
G["There is news, Warchief."]="Temos notícia, Chefe de Guerra."
G["There is no COW level... really! I repeat: there is no COW level. Well, maybe there is..."]="Não há um nível SEGREDO... Em sério! Repito: Não há um nível SEGREDO. Bom, talvez si..."
G["There is no Light. Only darkness!"]="Não há Luz. Somente escuridão!"
G["There is no army here. Only a handful of heroes stand between you and the King of Stormwind. Are you afraid?"]="Aqui não há nenhum exército. Somente um punhado de heróis os separa do Rei de Ventobravo. Têm medo?"
G["There is no better day than one filled with the blood of dwarves!"]="O melhor dia é o que está cheio de sangue de anões!"
G["There is no blood easier spilt than that of a puny night elf!"]="Não há sangue mais fácil de derramar que a de um fraca elfo da noite!"
G["There is no corner of this vale that the Shao-Tien can hide from us in. They underestimate the tenacity of the Shado-Pan."]="There is no corner of this vale that the Shao-Tien can hide from us in. They underestimate the tenacity of the Shado-Pan."
G["There is no dish I have not mastered! Come and eat!"]="Não existe prato que eu não tenha dominado! Venha a comer!"
G["There is no doubt - you are the heir of Durotan... my grandson. Draka told me she was with child before she and your father left our world, but I never dared dream that they would survive..."]="There is no doubt - you are the heir of Durotan... my grandson. Draka told me she was with child before she and your father left our world, but I never dared dream that they would survive..."
G["There is no doubt in my mind you'd lose. Speed and wit triumphs over brute strength and bullheadedness any day of the week."]="There is no doubt in my mind you'd lose. Speed and wit triumphs over brute strength and bullheadedness any day of the week."
G["There is no end in sight to these illusions, but we shall hold out as long as we can."]="Não há fim para estas ilusões, mas ficaremos firmes enquanto pudermos."
G["There is no end to these trolls, $c."]="There is no end to these trolls, $c."
G["There is no escape for you.  The Crusade shall destroy all who carry the Scourge's taint."]="There is no escape for you.  The Crusade shall destroy all who carry the Scourge's taint."
G["There is no escape from my rise!"]="Você não pode escapar de mim!"
G["There is no escape from our might!"]="Ninguém pode fugir de nossa força!"
G["There is no escape from the fury of the twilight flight!"]="Não é possível escapar da fúria do Voo Crepúsculo!"
G["There is no escape now. The only way out is through me!"]="There is no escape now. The only way out is through me!"
G["There is no escape!"]="Não há saída!"
G["There is no escape! There is only the fiery embrace of my lava!"]="There is no escape! There is only the fiery embrace of my lava!"
G["There is no escape."]="Sem escape e sem abrigo"
G["There is no escape. Not in this life. Not in the next."]="There is no escape. Not in this life. Not in the next."
G["There is no escape. There is only my wrath!"]="There is no escape. There is only my wrath!"
G["There is no escape..."]="Sem escape e sem abrigo"
G["There is no escaping the Lich King's will. Prepare for an explosive encounter!"]="There is no escaping the Lich King's will. Prepare for an explosive encounter!"
G["There is no experience quite like riding on the back of a war serpent."]="There is no experience quite like riding on the back of a war serpent."
G["There is no finer cook in Thunder Bluff than Aska Mistrunner.  Mmmmm, I can smell what she is cooking from here.  Head over to her kitchen located on the high rise.\nDrat... now I am hungry."]="There is no finer cook in Thunder Bluff than Aska Mistrunner.  Mmmmm, I can smell what she is cooking from here.  Head over to her kitchen located on the high rise.\nDrat... now I am hungry."
G["There is no future for you."]="Para você não há futuro."
G["There is no good. No evil. No Light. There is only POWER!"]="Não existe o bem. Nem o mal. Nem a Luz. Somente existe o PODER!"
G["There is no greater honor than rising through the ranks of the Order of the Cloud Serpent.\n\nOnce you have proven yourself, you will be free to wander the land with your serpent as your flying mount.\n\nYou will also earn the Cloud Serpent Riding skill, which will allow you to ride any cloud serpent mount from Pandaria."]="There is no greater honor than rising through the ranks of the Order of the Cloud Serpent.\n\nOnce you have proven yourself, you will be free to wander the land with your serpent as your flying mount.\n\nYou will also earn the Cloud Serpent Riding skill, which will allow you to ride any cloud serpent mount from Pandaria."
G["There is no greater joy than walking the world, writing your story.\n\nIt is the wanderer's way."]="There is no greater joy than walking the world, writing your story.\n\nIt is the wanderer's way."
G["There is no greater way to clear the mind than to weave."]="Não há melhor maneira de limpar a mente do que tecer."
G["There is no honor fighting us when the end has already been written.  Azeroth... will... die."]="There is no honor fighting us when the end has already been written.  Azeroth... will... die."
G["There is no hope for enemies of the Twilight!"]="Não há esperança para os inimigos do Crepúsculo!"
G["There is no hope for our future..."]="Nosso futuro carece de esperança..."
G["There is no hope for you. Your Darkshore lies in ruins. Astranaar will fall before the end of the day as will this place. Retreat to Darnassus while you still can."]="Não há esperança para vocês. Sua Costa Sombria jaz em ruínas. Astranaar cairá antes do fim de dia, ao igual que este lugar. retiraos a Darnassus enquanto possam."
G["There is no hope!"]="Não há nenhuma esperança!"
G["There is no hope, no future. All life is doomed."]="Não há esperança nem futuro. A vida está condenada."
G["There is no hope.  You will fail."]="There is no hope.  You will fail."
G["There is no knowledge that is not power."]="Não há conhecimento que não otorgue poder."
G["There is no longer a place for you."]="Não há lugar para você, Kalecgos."
G["There is no need to speak to me that way."]="Basta que me fale em esse tono."
G["There is no other way, blasphemer. Prepare to meet your fate."]="Esta é a única solução, blasfemo. Prepare-se para o seu fim."
G["There is no question that these crusaders are the source of great discomfort, $g brother:sister;. But what is sacrifice without pain? You were with me at Light's Hope Chapel. You saw many great sacrifices made. We are here now to settle a debt to the Highlord. Payment in full for his sacrifice.\n\nOnce the Argent Crusade has established their foothold inside the walls of Icecrown, we will depart. A different destiny awaits us."]="There is no question that these crusaders are the source of great discomfort, $g brother:sister;. But what is sacrifice without pain? You were with me at Light's Hope Chapel. You saw many great sacrifices made. We are here now to settle a debt to the Highlord. Payment in full for his sacrifice.\n\nOnce the Argent Crusade has established their foothold inside the walls of Icecrown, we will depart. A different destiny awaits us."
G["There is no room for war here."]="Aqui a guerra não tem cabida."
G["There is no safe place to hide!"]="Não há nenhum lugar certo no que esconder!"
G["There is no sharp distinction between the real and the unreal."]="Não existe nenhuma distinção clara entre o real e o irreal."
G["There is no shelter from my fury!"]="There is no shelter from my fury!"
G["There is no shelter from my fury."]="There is no shelter from my fury."
G["There is no spoon."]="There is no spoon."
G["There is no stopping $n! Sarinexx has been massacred!"]="There is no stopping $n! Sarinexx has been massacred!"
G["There is no time for celebration - many followers of the Way still battle outside."]="Não há tempo para celebrações. Muitos seguidores da senda seguem lutando."
G["There is no time for cookies! Well, one cookie. Just one."]="Não há tempo para galhetas! Bom, uma. Somente uma. Mmmm..."
G["There is no time to waste!"]="Não há tempo que perder!"
G["There is no time to waste, friend.\n\nMy flight is in disarray and is in desperate need of leadership."]="Não há tempo que perder, $gamigo: amiga;.\n\nO caos rainha na minha Voo. Precisamos um líder desesperadamente."
G["There is no time to waste. The Alliance move on the Isle of Thunder as we speak!"]="Não há tempo que perder. A Aliança está avançando até a Ilha do Trovão agora mesmo."
G["There is no time to waste. The Horde move on the Isle of Thunder as we speak!"]="Não há tempo que perder. A Horda está avançando até a Ilha do Trovão agora mesmo."
G["There is no time. The Shado-Pan trackers are too close. They cannot learn the location of the Bell."]="Não temos tempo. Os rastreadores Shado-pans estão perto demais. Eles não podem descobrir a localização do Sino."
G["There is no turning back now!"]="Já não há volta por trás!"
G["There is no victory for you here! What little ground you've gained will be swallowed by my army in due course!"]="There is no victory for you here! What little ground you've gained will be swallowed by my army in due course!"
G["There is no way out."]="Não há saída."
G["There is not a better tracker in these lands than Drayl.  He can be found on the Hunter Rise."]="Não há melhor rastreador em estas terras que Drayl. Está na Custa dos Caçadores."
G["There is not much more to tell. Dalaran was nearly wholly destroyed by Archimonde, the staff lost, presumably shattered by the barrier's fail-safe mechanisms.\n\nThere are those that believe the staff to be the cause of Archimonde's reprisal."]="There is not much more to tell. Dalaran was nearly wholly destroyed by Archimonde, the staff lost, presumably shattered by the barrier's fail-safe mechanisms.\n\nThere are those that believe the staff to be the cause of Archimonde's reprisal."
G["There is not nearly enough dancing in this club!"]="There is not nearly enough dancing in this club!"
G["There is nothing I call my own that would be of use to you.\n\nPerhaps D'lom will have something of interest to you in his collection."]="There is nothing I call my own that would be of use to you.\n\nPerhaps D'lom will have something of interest to you in his collection."
G["There is nothing I cannot take!"]="Não há nada que não os possa arrebatar!"
G["There is nothing but the Crusade! Anyone that is not with us, will fall!"]="Somente importa a Cruzada! Tudo o que não estiver conosco, cairá!"
G["There is nothing here for you.  Now go."]="Não há nada aqui para você. Agora vá."
G["There is nothing in all Pandaria that can stay the rampage of the Grand Expedition Yak. Pray you never see it."]="There is nothing in all Pandaria that can stay the rampage of the Grand Expedition Yak. Pray you never see it."
G["There is nothing left for me. I seek a warrior's death. Is that wrong?"]="Já não me restante nada. Busco uma morte de guerreiro. Acaso está mal?"
G["There is nothing left for us but to wait... and hope."]="Não podemos fazer outra coisa salvou esperar... e manter a esperança."
G["There is nothing left for us here."]="Não há mais nada para nós aqui."
G["There is nothing left for you here, nothing but death and sorrow."]="There is nothing left for you here, nothing but death and sorrow."
G["There is nothing left to be done for the Vale at this time, $n. The mogu disappeared shortly after you killed their leader. We are safe, thanks to you."]="There is nothing left to be done for the Vale at this time, $n. The mogu disappeared shortly after you killed their leader. We are safe, thanks to you."
G["There is nothing more that I can do for you, $n. Take what I have taught you, and use it elsewhere."]="There is nothing more that I can do for you, $n. Take what I have taught you, and use it elsewhere."
G["There is nothing more that I can teach - now get out! And don't even think of approaching Saru, for one as unworthy as you he will use your blood to temper his steel."]="Não há mais nada que eu possa ensinar - agora saia! E nem pense em se aproximar de Saru, para alguém tão indigno quanto você, ele usará seu sangue para temperar o aço dele."
G["There is nothing of interest on the table."]="Não há nada de interessante em cima da mesa."
G["There is nothing that cannot be mastered through repetition."]="Não há nada que não se possa domínio mediante a repetição."
G["There is nothing the proper mixture can't handle."]="Não há nada que a mistura adequada não possa consertar."
G["There is nothing to see here. Move along."]="Não há nada para ver aqui. Continue em linha de frente."
G["There is nothing to see here. Proceed with your mandated duties."]="There is nothing to see here. Proceed with your mandated duties."
G["There is nowhere to hide!"]="Não os podem esconder!"
G["There is nowhere to run..."]="Não há nenhum lugar ao que fugir..."
G["There is one even greater than I in this art. You are ready to receive her knowledge. She is Annora, and you may find her... in Uldaman."]="Há um ainda maior que eu nesta arte. Você está pronto para receber o conhecimento dela. Ela é Annora, e você pode encontrá-a... em Uldaman."
G["There is one further step on the path of Light: compassion."]="Há um passo mais no caminho até a Luz: a compasão."
G["There is one last thing.  I need to know where Arugal is."]="Ainda falta uma coisa. Preciso saber onde está Arugal."
G["There is one that I know of here in Thunder Bluff that can aid you in your journey to Alterac Valley. On the Hunter Rise look for Taim Ragetotem. May you find what you are looking for $n."]="Há alguém que conheço aqui, em Penhasco do Trovão, que pode ajudar você no seu viagem ao Vale Alterac. Busca a Taim Totem de Raiva no Alto dos Caçadores. Que encontre o que atenção, $n."
G["There is one true path. The path of flame!"]="Somente há um caminho verdadeiro. O caminho da chama!"
G["There is one whose knowledge exceeds my own. You are ready to seek her out. Go to Sun Rock Retreat in Stonetalon Mountains. Find Hgarth, and continue your training."]="Há alguém cujo conhecimento excede o meu. Você está pronto para procurá-a. Vá para o Sun Rock Retreat nas montanhas Stonetalon. Encontre Hgarth e continue seu treinamento."
G["There is only Ghur'sha."]="Somente existe Ghur'sha."
G["There is only one Warchief, Eitrigg!"]="Existe apenas um Warchief, Eitrigg!"
G["There is only one thing to do.  I must smash it!  Once and for all, all shall know the power of my mighty brow."]="There is only one thing to do.  I must smash it!  Once and for all, all shall know the power of my mighty brow."
G["There is only one true path of enlightenment! DEATH!"]="Somente há um caminho até a iluminação! A MORTE!"
G["There is only one way to cleanse this sword. Make haste for the Sunwell and immerse the blade in its waters."]="There is only one way to cleanse this sword. Make haste for the Sunwell and immerse the blade in its waters."
G["There is only one way to find out."]="Só há um jeito de saber..."
G["There is perhaps a way..."]="Talvez exista uma forma..."
G["There is so much life here. And so much space.\n\nBack on the Wandering Isle there was never enough space for predators to grow large enough to hunt."]="There is so much life here. And so much space.\n\nBack on the Wandering Isle there was never enough space for predators to grow large enough to hunt."
G["There is so much we can learn from this land, and yet you are content to watch it burn around you."]="There is so much we can learn from this land, and yet you are content to watch it burn around you."
G["There is so much work to do!"]="Há muito que fazer!"
G["There is some kind of barrier that shields this Vale, preventing my use of portal magic."]="Há uma espécie de barrera que proteger este vale. Me impede usar meu magia de portal."
G["There is something greater than magic at work in the night sky.  One day they'll listen to me. . . ."]="There is something greater than magic at work in the night sky.  One day they'll listen to me. . . ."
G["There is something odd about this particular object..."]="Há algo estranho neste item particular..."
G["There is something that I must attend to."]="Há algo do que devo cuidar."
G["There is something that you wish to buy?  There is something that you wish to sell?\n\nThis is why we are here, my friend.\n\nPlease, tell me your pleasure."]="Há algo que quiser comprar? Há algo que quiser vender?\n\nPor isso estamos aqui, $gamigo: amiga;.\n\nPor favor, diga O que deseja."
G["There is something you can do, troll, to demonstrate your value to the Horde. A mission in the heart of this continent."]="There is something you can do, troll, to demonstrate your value to the Horde. A mission in the heart of this continent."
G["There is still time to stop this madness. You don't have to do this Shokia..."]="Ainda há tempo de colocar fim a esta loucura. Não precisa fazer isso, Shokia..."
G["There is trouble at Lor'danel, a village of ours across the waters from Rut'theran."]="Há problemas em Lor'danel, uma aldeia nossa que fica logo ao outro lado das águas, enfrente de Rut'theran."
G["There is usable wood, even in these swamps. Look for brittle roots protruding from the soil."]="There is usable wood, even in these swamps. Look for brittle roots protruding from the soil."
G["There is wisdom in your words, brother. I'll take that food of yours..."]="There is wisdom in your words, brother. I'll take that food of yours..."
G["There is word from Jotunheim. The sleep-watchers there believe that they have found someone of significance."]="Há notícia de Jotunheim. Os vigías do sonho dessa zona acreditam que têm encontrado algo importantes."
G["There is work to be done here, but do you see anyone jumping to help me? No! Wretches, all of them!"]="Aqui há trabalho pendente, mas vê a alguém saltando para me ajudar? Não! Escória, todos eles!"
G["There is yet much which stands between you and your question's answer."]="There is yet much which stands between you and your question's answer."
G["There is... something else that you should know about the Lich King. Control over the Scourge must never be lost. Even if you were to strike down the Lich King, another would have to take his place. For without the control of its master, the Scourge would run rampant across the world - destroying all living things."]="There is... something else that you should know about the Lich King. Control over the Scourge must never be lost. Even if you were to strike down the Lich King, another would have to take his place. For without the control of its master, the Scourge would run rampant across the world - destroying all living things."
G["There isn't room in this town for both of us!"]="Nesta cidade não há lugar para ambos!"
G["There it goes.  It should only be a moment now...."]="Já está. Deveria ser questão de segundos..."
G["There it is -- Gadgetzan!  We're in the home stretch now!"]="Aí está... Gadgetzan! Já estamos no último tramo!"
G["There it is again! I know I heard something!"]="Aí está novamente! Sabia que havia ouvido algo!"
G["There it is! Do you see where the large red crystal is jutting out from the Vector Coil? That's where I need to plant the first set of explosives."]="There it is! Do you see where the large red crystal is jutting out from the Vector Coil? That's where I need to plant the first set of explosives."
G["There it is! Get ready!"]="Aí está! Prepare-se!"
G["There it is! I could've sworn it wasn't here last time I checked..."]="There it is! I could've sworn it wasn't here last time I checked..."
G["There it is! Old Man Thistle's treasure!"]="Aí está! O tesouro de Cardo o Velho!"
G["There it is! The Isle of the Thunder King. Already, the Horde is circling it like hungry birds of prey."]="There it is! The Isle of the Thunder King. Already, the Horde is circling it like hungry birds of prey."
G["There it is! Wide open. Good luck to you conquering what lies beyond. I must report back to the Kirin Tor at once!"]="Já está! Aberta de par em par. Boa sorte na conquista do além. Tenho que informar ao Kirin Tor de imediatamente!"
G["There it is, hero! The Divine Bell!"]="Aí está! A Sino divina!"
G["There may still be a solution. Come here, $n. I will explain what I need."]="There may still be a solution. Come here, $n. I will explain what I need."
G["There must be a way."]="Precisa haver uma forma."
G["There must be a way..."]="Precisa haver um modo..."
G["There must be one around here somewhere..."]="Precisa haver uma por aqui em alguma parte..."
G["There must be someplace on Azeroth that we can find oozes uncorrupted by the Scourge or anything else. But where?!"]="Deve haver algum lugar em Azeroth que possamos encontrar lodo não corrompido pelo Flagelo ou qualquer outra coisa. Mas onde?!"
G["There must be something wrong with those Hozen we saw earlier!"]="A esses hozen que temos visto antes lhes passava algo raro."
G["There now. It be a gift to you, to celebrate Tanzar's great escape!"]="There now. It be a gift to you, to celebrate Tanzar's great escape!"
G["There now. It be a gift to you, to help wit' defeatin' da Amani!"]="Tome. Um obsequio pa' ti, pa' que te ajuda derrotar aos Amani."
G["There once was a jibby nib mallet all shiny and divine."]="Era uma vez uma marreta porreta, toda brilhante e divina."
G["There reason Frenzyheart not chase back chickens. Look kind of dumb to lose to chicken."]="Haver razão para que Coração Frenético não perseguir frangos. Parecer um pouco tonto perder com os frangos."
G["There shall be no prison for you this time!"]="Esta vez não haverá prisão para você!"
G["There she is, mon! Let's finish this business."]="There she is, mon! Let's finish this business."
G["There she is. Mount up!"]="Aí está. Monta!"
G["There should be plenty of anti-venom, thanks to $p."]="There should be plenty of anti-venom, thanks to $p."
G["There should be plenty of food stored around this temple."]="Deveria haver suficiente comida neste templo."
G["There some reason why we're still here? I'd love to hear it."]="There some reason why we're still here? I'd love to hear it."
G["There there, little hunter. I'm here for you."]="Hala, hala, hala, pequeno caçador. Estou aqui."
G["There there... close your eyes..."]="Ea, ea... cierraos olhos..."
G["There they are!"]="Aqui estão!"
G["There they are! Okay, you three make sure that you help $g him : her; out today. $G He's : She's; got a lot of stuff to take care of before the party!"]="There they are! Okay, you three make sure that you help $g him : her; out today. $G He's : She's; got a lot of stuff to take care of before the party!"
G["There they are. Taima, are we close enough to see everything for the report?"]="Ali estão. Taima, estamos o suficiente perto como para ver tudo e elaborar o relatório?"
G["There they were, marching through the depths of the Silkwood on an errand of peace."]="There they were, marching through the depths of the Silkwood on an errand of peace."
G["There walks a hero!"]="Por ali camina um herói!"
G["There walks a hero."]="Lá vai $Uum herói:uma heroína;."
G["There walks a true soldier of the Horde!"]="Aí vai um verdadeiro soldado da Horda!"
G["There was a demon amongs us after all... Just not where we had expected."]="Depois de tudo, havia um demônio entre nós. Somente que não onde esperávamos."
G["There was a time when I could ask whatever I wished from those who sought out my master.  But now, he takes pretty much anyone in as an apprentice and they can pass through his portals all they please.\n\nIt is upsetting to me, but I do not question his orders.  I can only take enjoyment in making fun of the ridiculous clothes you wear or the pathetic look on your face.  Even that bores me...\n\nEven this rambling bores me!  Go. Be gone. Share your depressing sense of style with someone else."]="There was a time when I could ask whatever I wished from those who sought out my master.  But now, he takes pretty much anyone in as an apprentice and they can pass through his portals all they please.\n\nIt is upsetting to me, but I do not question his orders.  I can only take enjoyment in making fun of the ridiculous clothes you wear or the pathetic look on your face.  Even that bores me...\n\nEven this rambling bores me!  Go. Be gone. Share your depressing sense of style with someone else."
G["There was a time when my father would spend days in the jungle hunting for the perfect cave barley.\n\nIt was very dangerous, and something I can't bring myself to do.\n\nNot worth it. Stormstout only pays for quantity, not quality."]="There was a time when my father would spend days in the jungle hunting for the perfect cave barley.\n\nIt was very dangerous, and something I can't bring myself to do.\n\nNot worth it. Stormstout only pays for quantity, not quality."
G["There was a time where I would have done the same. But I've learned a lot over the years. I've fallen for too many of Garrosh's tricks."]="There was a time where I would have done the same. But I've learned a lot over the years. I've fallen for too many of Garrosh's tricks."
G["There was another guy just hitting on me. Oh, the nerve!\n\nWill you beat him up for me, sweetie? Thanks. Love ya!"]="There was another guy just hitting on me. Oh, the nerve!\n\nWill you beat him up for me, sweetie? Thanks. Love ya!"
G["There was hundreds of times these hardknuckles before Goregek."]="Antes de Goregek havia centenas de estes calhonudilhos."
G["There was little time before the watchers of Nethergarde sensed a disturbance in the portal... and the demons screamed into our world!\n\nAlthough reinforcements from the kingdoms of Azeroth are on the march, we of the Argent Dawn were first to rally behind Nethergarde's call.\n\nOur mission: hold these monsters at bay until help from the Alliance and Horde arrives..."]="There was little time before the watchers of Nethergarde sensed a disturbance in the portal... and the demons screamed into our world!\n\nAlthough reinforcements from the kingdoms of Azeroth are on the march, we of the Argent Dawn were first to rally behind Nethergarde's call.\n\nOur mission: hold these monsters at bay until help from the Alliance and Horde arrives..."
G["There was no sport in that kill."]="Essa morte não tem suposto nenhum desafio."
G["There was once a Titan-made stone inside.  It was known as the World Pillar.  The name was literal.  It bore the weight of all the elemental and magnetic forces in Deepholm."]="There was once a Titan-made stone inside.  It was known as the World Pillar.  The name was literal.  It bore the weight of all the elemental and magnetic forces in Deepholm."
G["There was something else I wanted to ask you, Altruis."]="Havia outra coisa que queria lhe perguntar, Altruis."
G["There was something else I wanted to ask you."]="Havia algo mais que eu queria perguntar a você."
G["There was something interesting about those red pandas.  I think I might have an idea on how to fix Brewmaster Shadowpour's drinks so they are non-lethally tasty."]="There was something interesting about those red pandas.  I think I might have an idea on how to fix Brewmaster Shadowpour's drinks so they are non-lethally tasty."
G["There was something strange about that wind; it didn't stop. For weeks it blew across the land, waxing and waning, but never ceasing. And all the time the voice continued, though I could not understand it, nor did I know where it was coming from.\n\nMy time in solitude had taught me how to calm myself and look inward. This I did in order to keep my sanity. And that is when I began to understand the voice. It was coming from the wind itself and it had much to say!"]="There was something strange about that wind; it didn't stop. For weeks it blew across the land, waxing and waning, but never ceasing. And all the time the voice continued, though I could not understand it, nor did I know where it was coming from.\n\nMy time in solitude had taught me how to calm myself and look inward. This I did in order to keep my sanity. And that is when I began to understand the voice. It was coming from the wind itself and it had much to say!"
G["There we are, $n.  The Scroll is fixed!  Hooray!"]="Já está, $n. O pergaminho está arreglado! Hurra!"
G["There we are, $n.  The toxin is ready."]="Já está, $n. A toxina está pronta."
G["There we are.  A new batch of flash bombs!"]="There we are.  A new batch of flash bombs!"
G["There we go!"]="Lá vamos nós!"
G["There we go! Good as new... I guess..."]="Já está! Como nova. Bom... é um dizer."
G["There we go! Ripe for the pickin's!"]="There we go! Ripe for the pickin's!"
G["There we go, $n! This fat'll do the trick fer sure! And now for some real swabbin'!"]="There we go, $n! This fat'll do the trick fer sure! And now for some real swabbin'!"
G["There we go, all finished.  The journal has been translated for you."]="Já está. Se acabou. A diário está traducida para você."
G["There we go, the Rune of Command... hopefully. Not nearly as vicious as its Iron Dwarf cousin, but functional."]="There we go, the Rune of Command... hopefully. Not nearly as vicious as its Iron Dwarf cousin, but functional."
G["There we go.  The substance that you have brought me is approximately... 150,000 years old?  What!?  I'm going to need to run another test."]="Aí tem. A sustância que me trazido tem aproximadamente... 150000 anos? Que?! Vou ter que realizar outra prova."
G["There we go. All done!"]="Além vamos. Pronto!"
G["There we go. Should you pass through Silvermoon City, come and say hello, hmmm? Al diel shala..."]="There we go. Should you pass through Silvermoon City, come and say hello, hmmm? Al diel shala..."
G["There we go. That should do it!"]="Pronto! Deveria funcionar!"
G["There we have it! Back to the labs!"]="Pois já está! De volta ao laboratório!"
G["There we were, riding into battle at full speed on the back of Stampy..."]="There we were, riding into battle at full speed on the back of Stampy..."
G["There were hundreds imprisoned by his spell. Now only a few remain in their prisons. He would speak to us sometimes."]="There were hundreds imprisoned by his spell. Now only a few remain in their prisons. He would speak to us sometimes."
G["There were too many... our assault seems to have barely even scratched at their ranks. We lost so many men! Something must come of this..."]="Havia muitos... nosso ataque parece ter apenas arranhado suas fileiras. Perdemos tantos homens! Algo deve vir disso..."
G["There were two others that were already recovered. Godfrey is the final piece."]="Havia outros dois que já se têm recuperei. Godfrey é o último."
G["There were worgen everywhere.... it should've been me...."]="Havia huargen por todas partes... Debí haver banido eu."
G["There were... too many!"]="Havia... demais!"
G["There will be a time for battle, Durm. But first, we must find a way to even the odds. What would you have me do, Aeire?"]="There will be a time for battle, Durm. But first, we must find a way to even the odds. What would you have me do, Aeire?"
G["There will be a very unpleasant surprise waiting for the next troll who disturbs these. Let's keep moving."]="O seguinte troll que se que levará uma surpresa muito desagradable. Sigamos."
G["There will be more time to talk once we get back to the surface safely."]="Haverá mais tempo para conversar quando voltarmos à superfície com segurança."
G["There will be no cages this time, I will tear your limbs from your bodies!"]="There will be no cages this time, I will tear your limbs from your bodies!"
G["There will be no easy escape for you.  You answer to the temple."]="Não saldrás desta facilmente. Deve responder ante o templo."
G["There will be no escape!"]="There will be no escape!"
G["There will be no escape..."]="Não haverá forma de fugir..."
G["There will be no escaping me."]="Não há forma de fugir de mim."
G["There will be no everlasting life for you!"]="Não haverá vida eterna para você!"
G["There will be no mercy!"]="Não haverá piedade!"
G["There will be no peace in death for you, that I promise."]="Não halfará paz na morte, te o prometo."
G["There will be no reprieve! My work here is nearly finished!"]="Não haverá indulto! Já quase e terminou meu labor aqui!"
G["There will be no second chances, $r."]="Não haverá segundas oportunidades. ($r)"
G["There will be no sitting. No talking. And none of your horrible beer!"]="Não nos sentaremos, não beberemos, e não quero seu horrível cerveja!"
G["There will be no surrender!  There will be no escape!  There will be no quarter!"]="There will be no surrender!  There will be no escape!  There will be no quarter!"
G["There will be no survivors, my lord."]="Não haverá sobreviventes, meu senhor."
G["There will be pain..."]="Haverá sofrimento..."
G["There will be plenty of time for this later Brann, we need to get moving!"]="Haverá tempo de sobra para isso mais tarde, Brann, precisamos de nos mexer!"
G["There will be time enough to speak of preparations for battle against Twilight's Hammer. Today, we celebrate $n's victory!"]="Teremos tempo suficiente para falar dos preparativos para a batalha contra o Martelo Crepúsculo. Hoje celebraremos a vitória de $n!"
G["There will be time for a proper thanks later, but there is still a battle to be fought!"]="Já haverá tempo para dar as Obrigado como é devido depois, mas ainda temos uma batalha que lutar!"
G["There will be time to celebrate later, commander.  Twilight dragons approach!"]="There will be time to celebrate later, commander.  Twilight dragons approach!"
G["There will never be another like me..."]="Nunca haverá outro como eu..."
G["There ya go!"]="/rasp"
G["There ya go, all aboard. That's right..."]="Além vamos! Todos a bordo! Isso é..."
G["There ya go, mon. Try ta be more careful with this one, won't ya?\n\nNow head down ta Drak'Zin Ruins and drink it near the pedestal!"]="There ya go, mon. Try ta be more careful with this one, won't ya?\n\nNow head down ta Drak'Zin Ruins and drink it near the pedestal!"
G["There ya go, mon. Try ta be more careful with this one, won't ya?\n\nNow head to the passage of Drak'Atal to the northwest and drink the elixir at the pedestal there. \n\nI'll instruct you further when I see you again."]="Aí tem. Tenta ter mais cuidado esta vez, que?\n\nAgora vá ao Passagem de Drak'Atal ao noroeste e bebe o elixir no pedestal que ali encontrar. \n\nDepois te darei mais informações."
G["There ya go, mon. Try ta be more careful with this one, won't ya?\n\nNow head up north to Zeb'Halak and drink it near the pedestal!\n\nI'll instruct you further from there."]="Aí tem. Tenta ter mais cuidado esta vez, que?\n\nAgora vá ao norte, a Zeb'Halak e bébelo perto do pedestal.\n\nDepois te darei mais informações."
G["There ya go, mon. Try ta be more careful with this one, won't ya?\n\nNow head up north to Zeb'Halak and drink it near the pedestal!\n\nOh, and be sure ya get the Eye of the Prophets from the head on the ziggurat first..."]="There ya go, mon. Try ta be more careful with this one, won't ya?\n\nNow head up north to Zeb'Halak and drink it near the pedestal!\n\nOh, and be sure ya get the Eye of the Prophets from the head on the ziggurat first..."
G["There ye are! I was startin' to think ye'd made off with the beer!"]="Aí está! Estava começando a pensar que te havia largado com a cerveja!"
G["There ye are. Here's the lay of it: The king's spies are dead to a man. Only a handful o' dwarven scouts are left."]="Aí estão. Esta é a situação: os espiã do rei estão quase todos mortos. Somente restam uns quantos batedores anões."
G["There you are Darion! I was wondering when you'd crawl forth."]="There you are Darion! I was wondering when you'd crawl forth."
G["There you are!"]="Aí está você!"
G["There you are! I think I've just about got this door figured out. Let me know when you're ready and I'll open'er up!"]="Aí está você! Acho que quase consegui descobrir essa porta. Deixe-me saber quando estiver pronto e eu vou me abrir!"
G["There you are! I thought the furbolgs might have caught you before you could even get here."]="There you are! I thought the furbolgs might have caught you before you could even get here."
G["There you are! I was beginning to think that the Sunreavers had intercepted you. Are you ready to deliver the tome to our representatives in Icecrown?"]="Aí está você! Eu estava começando a pensar que os Sunreavers haviam interceptado você. Você está pronto para entregar o tomo aos nossos representantes em Icecrown?"
G["There you are, $n! I thought you'd forgotten about me."]="Aqui está, $n! Achava que te havia esquecido de mim."
G["There you are, you little miscreant."]="Aí está, traviesilho."
G["There you are."]="Aí está."
G["There you are.  Are you ready then?  Once we start, there is no turning back."]="Aí está você. Você está pronto então? Quando começamos, não há como voltar atrás."
G["There you are. What news from Westfall?"]="Aqui está. Traz notícia dos Cerro Oeste?"
G["There you go, $n. Good thing my powers of divination and summoning still work in this ghostly state, huh?"]="Aí o tem, $n. Menos mal que meus poderes de vaticínio e evocação ainda funcionam neste estado fantasmagórico, eh?"
G["There you go, $r."]="Aí tem, $r."
G["There you go, Mister Noggenfogger! You won't have to worry about those giants anymore!"]="There you go, Mister Noggenfogger! You won't have to worry about those giants anymore!"
G["There you go, mon. Your very own bone gryphon Now let's talk about you takin' it out to fight the Onslaught!"]="There you go, mon. Your very own bone gryphon Now let's talk about you takin' it out to fight the Onslaught!"
G["There you go. I need to get back to work before Rokar clouts me again for being lazy."]="Já está $gpronto: pronta;. Tenho que voltar ao trabalho antes de que Rokar me dé outra torta por estar vagueando."
G["There you go. Tastes like seaweed and hot garbage, doesn't it?"]="Isso é. Sabe a alga e sucata quente, verdade?"
G["There you go..."]="Isso é..."
G["There you have it! The King should be quite pleased, if I do say so myself."]="There you have it! The King should be quite pleased, if I do say so myself."
G["There you have it, $n. A mighty bow for a mighty hunter. Use it well in service of the Alliance."]="Aqui o tem, $n. Um grande arco para $gun grande caçador: uma grande caçadora;. Alvo bem em serviço da Aliança."
G["There you have it, $n. All the safe approaches to the Twilight Highlands. Unleash havoc on our foes!"]="There you have it, $n. All the safe approaches to the Twilight Highlands. Unleash havoc on our foes!"
G["There you have it. Our lesson on summoning has come to an end. A new class will begin shortly, so if you wish to brush up, feel free to stay around."]="There you have it. Our lesson on summoning has come to an end. A new class will begin shortly, so if you wish to brush up, feel free to stay around."
G["There!  Those pipes all appear to be connected to that structure.  It can't possibly fit all the water they've been stealing.  Where are they keeping it?"]="There!  Those pipes all appear to be connected to that structure.  It can't possibly fit all the water they've been stealing.  Where are they keeping it?"
G["There!  Who is that he's meeting with?"]="Aí! Quem é esse com o está reuniu?"
G["There! Destroy him! The Cipher must be recovered!"]="Aí! Destruidle! É preciso recuperar a importante!"
G["There! Go! GO!!!"]="Aqui! Vamos, vamos!"
G["There! I see him, wreathed in flame! I can feel waves of fury radiating from his core. Such rage... his anger alone could burn us to cinders!"]="There! I see him, wreathed in flame! I can feel waves of fury radiating from his core. Such rage... his anger alone could burn us to cinders!"
G["There! It is ready."]="Já está pronto!"
G["There! Job's done."]="Já está! Terminou."
G["There! Just ahead: The Isle of the Thunder King."]="Aí está! A Ilha do Trovão."
G["There! Look at him - frozen in stone, unmoving. Unfeeling. That look on his face... the resolve, the stubbornness. He gets it when he digs his heels in."]="There! Look at him - frozen in stone, unmoving. Unfeeling. That look on his face... the resolve, the stubbornness. He gets it when he digs his heels in."
G["There! Our work is complete - we have forged a masterpiece!"]="Já está! Se acabou. Temos forjado uma obra mestra."
G["There! Over there!"]="Ali! Por ali!"
G["There! She reveals herself. Attack!"]="Ali! Se tem descoberto. Ao ataque!"
G["There! That wasn't too bad. What did you say you and Raene were going to do with this thing? It's powerful!"]="There! That wasn't too bad. What did you say you and Raene were going to do with this thing? It's powerful!"
G["There! The Klaxxi! Hold that crystal together... don't let it escape!"]="There! The Klaxxi! Hold that crystal together... don't let it escape!"
G["There! There!"]="Aí! Aí!"
G["There! We got it! Let's get 'er outta here."]="Bem! Já está! Vamos de aqui."
G["There'd be no more elementals in the Mystic Ward now. We've also cleared out all of those trapped folks too!"]="Já não haverá mais elementais na Salão Místico. Também temos evacuado a todos os que estavam ali presos!"
G["There'll be a new trade risin' up round your carcass, $n. We'll call it 'flesh-craftin.'"]="There'll be a new trade risin' up round your carcass, $n. We'll call it 'flesh-craftin.'"
G["There's Farstrider Enclave now, $c. Not far to go... look out!  Troll ambush!!"]="Agora vem o Enclave do Errante, $c. Não está muito longe... Cuidado! Emboscada trolh!"
G["There's Horde to kill, lads! I can smell 'em!"]="There's Horde to kill, lads! I can smell 'em!"
G["There's a $c incoming! Don't let $Ghim:her; through!"]="Se aproxima $gun: uma; $c! Não deixem que passe!"
G["There's a Bat Handler inside the Undercity.  Head south down the road out of Brill, then west at the T-intersection.  The Ruins of Lordaeron will be on your left.  Go into them and then down into the Undercity.  You can ask an Undercity Guardian there for further assistance."]="Há um manipulador de morcegos dentro da cidade. Continue para o sul pela estrada saindo de Brill e depois para o oeste no cruzamento em T. As ruínas de Lordaeron estarão à sua esquerda. Entre neles e depois na Cidade Baixa. Você pode pedir a um Guardião da Cidade Baixa lá para obter mais assistência."
G["There's a Skinning Trainer in Orgrimmar.  To get there head north up the road out of Razor Hill.  Ask an Orgrimmar Grunt for directions when you arrive."]="Há um treinador de esfolamento em Orgrimmar. Para chegar lá, continue para o norte pela estrada saindo de Razor Hill. Peça instruções a um Orgrimmar Grunt quando chegar."
G["There's a big meanie attacking Mr. Floppy! Help!"]="Há um ruim enorme atacando a Floppy! Socorro!"
G["There's a broken world that could use your help, my student. Have you decided who you would like to accompany in your journey?"]="There's a broken world that could use your help, my student. Have you decided who you would like to accompany in your journey?"
G["There's a building in the northeast of Falconwing Square... within, you'll most likely find Tannaria, a woman well skilled in remaining out of sight."]="Há um prédio no nordeste da Praça Falconwing... lá dentro, você provavelmente encontrará Tannaria, uma mulher muito hábil em permanecer fosse de visão."
G["There's a cave, north o' here, across a bridge. If ye can slay the elemental within, the storm ought ta stop."]="There's a cave, north o' here, across a bridge. If ye can slay the elemental within, the storm ought ta stop."
G["There's a chemical inside the rocket. What is it?"]="Há um produto químico dentro do foguete. O que é isso?"
G["There's a druid stealthing around in his cat-form.  I thought that we had hunters in here.  Deal with it!"]="There's a druid stealthing around in his cat-form.  I thought that we had hunters in here.  Deal with it!"
G["There's a great cook who works at the Pig and Whistle Tavern in Old Town.  I've watched him use a knife when he cooks and just between you and me, I don't think he's always been a cook.  Don't get me wrong... if you still want to learn, he's the best we have."]="Há um ótimo cozinheiro que trabalha na Pig and Whistle Tavern, na Cidade Velha. Eu o vi usar uma faca quando ele cozinha e, apenas entre você e eu, não acho que ele sempre tenha sido cozinheiro. Não me interpretem mal... se você ainda quer aprender, ele é o melhor que temos."
G["There's a great deal that you do not understand, my dear Greely. That is why you are the assistant and I... I am Hobart Grapplehammer!"]="Há muitas coisas que não entende, meu querida Greely. Por isso você é a ajudante e eu... Eu sou Roberto Martilhazos!"
G["There's a little blood on your armor there. Are you okay?"]="Há um pouco de sangue na sua armadura lá. Você está bem?"
G["There's a lot of gear here we can still use. Fan out. And step lively! The Dragonmaw are near."]="There's a lot of gear here we can still use. Fan out. And step lively! The Dragonmaw are near."
G["There's a lot of money out there in that jungle, $r.  Can you see it?\n\nNo, it doesn't look like gold or copper.  It looks like raptor hides, and mineral veins, and ancient troll artifacts.\n\nOK, maybe the mineral veins might look like gold or copper.\n\nBut still, you get my point, right?"]="There's a lot of money out there in that jungle, $r.  Can you see it?\n\nNo, it doesn't look like gold or copper.  It looks like raptor hides, and mineral veins, and ancient troll artifacts.\n\nOK, maybe the mineral veins might look like gold or copper.\n\nBut still, you get my point, right?"
G["There's a mage at the Thunderbrew Distillery who might be able to teach you some new spells.  I believe his name is Magis Sparkmantle."]="Há um mago na Destilaria Thunderbrew que pode ser capaz de ensinar novos feitiços. Eu acredito que o nome dele é Magis Sparkmantle."
G["There's a path right there... only a few mines at the end in between us and the tools."]="Aí mesmo há um caminho... entre nós e as ferramentas somente há algumas minas ao fim."
G["There's a phrase... \"It's always darkest before the dawn.\" The dawn will come, though, Tahu. The sun will rise. The balance will shift back to where it should be."]="There's a phrase... \"It's always darkest before the dawn.\" The dawn will come, though, Tahu. The sun will rise. The balance will shift back to where it should be."
G["There's a set of fresh tracks following the forest's edge back towards town.  It's hard to tell if they're his though."]="There's a set of fresh tracks following the forest's edge back towards town.  It's hard to tell if they're his though."
G["There's a thief over here!"]="Ao ladrão, aqui!"
G["There's a tower coming up on our left.  What do you say we stop and rest a bit?"]="Nos acercamos a uma torre pela esquerda. Que você acha se nos paramos e descansamos um tempo?"
G["There's a type of iron unique to these parts. Bring back any ya find, $p. Ain't no iron in Azeroth us dwarves can't forge."]="Há um tipo de ferro que somente se encontre nesta zona. Tráenos tudo o que encontre, $p. Não existe ferro em Azeroth que os anões não possamos forjar!"
G["There's a village up here... and a big fish statue, too."]="Aqui há uma aldeia... e também uma enorme estátua de um peixe."
G["There's a whole bunch of them still in the caves.  They're getting ready to attack your people!"]="Ainda restam muitos nas cavernas. Se estão preparando para atacar ao seu gente!"
G["There's a whole vast forest out there, $c. Let the shaman play with the spirits and the warriors toy with their swords. Terokkar is where I'll make my fortune."]="There's a whole vast forest out there, $c. Let the shaman play with the spirits and the warriors toy with their swords. Terokkar is where I'll make my fortune."
G["There's a worgen druid by the name of Dareth just outside the city gates; he might be able to help you.\n\nBig beast of a fellow, covered in white leather and furs. You can't miss him."]="There's a worgen druid by the name of Dareth just outside the city gates; he might be able to help you.\n\nBig beast of a fellow, covered in white leather and furs. You can't miss him."
G["There's absolutely nothing out of the ordinary about it."]="There's absolutely nothing out of the ordinary about it."
G["There's always a need for more kegs at Brewfest!\n\nI'll lend you the reins to one of my personal rams.\n\nEvery time you bring me a keg, I'll give you some tokens.  I'll even let you use the ram for a bit longer for every keg you bring me!  \nTake heed! Once you start this, you won't be able to do it again until tomorrow.\nAre you sure you're ready to do this?"]="There's always a need for more kegs at Brewfest!\n\nI'll lend you the reins to one of my personal rams.\n\nEvery time you bring me a keg, I'll give you some tokens.  I'll even let you use the ram for a bit longer for every keg you bring me!  \nTake heed! Once you start this, you won't be able to do it again until tomorrow.\nAre you sure you're ready to do this?"
G["There's always just enough time for a last minute sale to the $g hero : heroine; of the Bilgewater Cartel, $n."]="There's always just enough time for a last minute sale to the $g hero : heroine; of the Bilgewater Cartel, $n."
G["There's always room for one more."]="Sempre há lugar para um mais."
G["There's always something new to investigate."]="Sempre há algo novo para investigar."
G["There's an altar nearby where I can conduct the ritual. Let's go!"]="Perto há um altar no que posso realizar o ritual. Vamos!"
G["There's an artifact, a weapon, being forged with the power of an Old God. We don't know exactly what it is, but we need to get to it before it's completed by Cho'gall.\n\nEverything else is secondary. Everyone is expendable, including you and I."]="There's an artifact, a weapon, being forged with the power of an Old God. We don't know exactly what it is, but we need to get to it before it's completed by Cho'gall.\n\nEverything else is secondary. Everyone is expendable, including you and I."
G["There's an ethereal beauty about this place... but for all the trees and plant life, it's still so... unnatural."]="There's an ethereal beauty about this place... but for all the trees and plant life, it's still so... unnatural."
G["There's an excellent skinner that lives up in the house by Crystal Lake.  She's bound to be able to show you how to get started in the skinner's profession."]="Há um excelente skinner que mora na casa perto de Crystal Lake. Ela certamente será capaz de mostrar como começar na profissão de skinner."
G["There's an herbalist that lives in the hills east of Stormwind with our alchemist. Quite the handy pairing don't you think?"]="Há um herbapronta que mora nas colinas a leste de Stormwind com nosso alquimista. Bastante par útil, você não acha?"
G["There's an old saying, \"Give a man a fish; you have fed him for a day.  Teach a man to fish; and you have fed him for a lifetime.\"  Of course, you might want to cook that fish and that is where I come in."]="Há um velho ditado: \"Dê a um homem um peixe; você o alimentou por um dia. Ensine um homem a pescar; e você o alimentou por toda a vida\". É claro que você pode cozinhar esse peixe e é onde eu entro."
G["There's an opening up ahead. GO NOW!"]="Há uma saída aí linha de frente. VAMOS!"
G["There's another destroyed. Maintain the assault!"]="Temos destruído outro. Sigam com o ataque!"
G["There's another mistlurker here... I can smell his stink."]="There's another mistlurker here... I can smell his stink."
G["There's another one! Kill the $r!"]="There's another one! Kill the $r!"
G["There's at least fifteen people waiting in line ahead of you. Hard to tell - it's a little busy in here right now."]="There's at least fifteen people waiting in line ahead of you. Hard to tell - it's a little busy in here right now."
G["There's at least fifty people in line in front of you. It's packed in here. I'd wait for things to calm down a bit if you want to fight anytime in the next hour or two."]="There's at least fifty people in line in front of you. It's packed in here. I'd wait for things to calm down a bit if you want to fight anytime in the next hour or two."
G["There's been too much death. Too much destruction. Put an end to them!"]="There's been too much death. Too much destruction. Put an end to them!"
G["There's been trouble contacting Mennu, sir!"]="There's been trouble contacting Mennu, sir!"
G["There's blueleaf tuber in this trench! It's like gold waiting to be mined I tell you!"]="There's blueleaf tuber in this trench! It's like gold waiting to be mined I tell you!"
G["There's enough work here for an army of orcs, and most of it, only I can do. Still, there is a job I could use a hand with."]="Aqui há suficiente trabalho para um exército de orcs e eu sou o único que pode fazer a maior parte desse trabalho. De qualquer forma, há algo para o que me viria bem uma mão."
G["There's got to be a way in somewhere."]="Precisa haver um caminho em alguma parte."
G["There's got to be more. Doublecheck the bodies!"]="There's got to be more. Doublecheck the bodies!"
G["There's gotta be some riches around this place... c'mon boss, you know you want to..."]="There's gotta be some riches around this place... c'mon boss, you know you want to..."
G["There's hope for Greenstone! Thank you!"]="There's hope for Greenstone! Thank you!"
G["There's just never enough Mojo to go around..."]="Nunca há suficiente mojo..."
G["There's just not enough time to pack all of this stuff up! Grab only the important stuff! Where'd I put my Blastproof Underwater G-Ray Goggles?!"]="There's just not enough time to pack all of this stuff up! Grab only the important stuff! Where'd I put my Blastproof Underwater G-Ray Goggles?!"
G["There's lamp oil in the back - make use of it.  The fiends hate fire!"]="There's lamp oil in the back - make use of it.  The fiends hate fire!"
G["There's money to be made!  Just like pops always said - no better time for raking in the cash than a time of war."]="Temos dinheiro que conseguir! Já o dizia papi: os melhores tempos para fazer fortuna são os tempos de guerra."
G["There's more to this than we know, $n.  I can guarantee you that much."]="There's more to this than we know, $n.  I can guarantee you that much."
G["There's more where that came from, Marion!"]="Ainda ocorrida mais, Marion!"
G["There's more where that came from. I am a well of rage."]="Há mais de onde tem saindo isso. Sou um poço sem fundo de raiva."
G["There's my $g boy : girl;!"]="Assim se há!"
G["There's my bag! At last I've found it and now it's my gift to you and I truly hope you like it because I want you to all remember this wonderful moment for as long as you live and I hope that when you think of it you'll smile inside because I know I'll never forget it in a million years and I can't wait to tell momma all about it when I get back home.... Do you like my earrings?"]="There's my bag! At last I've found it and now it's my gift to you and I truly hope you like it because I want you to all remember this wonderful moment for as long as you live and I hope that when you think of it you'll smile inside because I know I'll never forget it in a million years and I can't wait to tell momma all about it when I get back home.... Do you like my earrings?"
G["There's my best friend! Come on, $n, dance with us!"]="Aí está meu melhor colega! Venha $n, baila conosco!"
G["There's my favorite warlock! What dark secret can I whisper in your ear today?"]="Aqui está o meu bruxo favorito! Que segredo obscuro posso sussurrar no seu ouvido hoje?"
G["There's my survey team. Bring us in."]="Aí está o equipamento de investigação. Vamos."
G["There's no denying it - they really put that dog down! So much for our former champion!"]="Não é possível negar... que têm terminado com esse cão! Vá ex campeão!"
G["There's no doubt about it. These creatures have been affected by sha."]="Não há nenhuma dúvida. Estas criaturas têm sofrido o efeito dos sha."
G["There's no doubt that something has distorted the true history of Stormhoof and the warriors of Camp Tunka'lo. But, what?"]="There's no doubt that something has distorted the true history of Stormhoof and the warriors of Camp Tunka'lo. But, what?"
G["There's no escape for you, insects.  You face the Shado-Pan this day."]="There's no escape for you, insects.  You face the Shado-Pan this day."
G["There's no finer expert I know on axes than Buliwyf here! One hand, two hands... he's a master of it all!"]="Não há nenhum especiapronta mais refinado que conheço em eixos do que Buliwyf aqui! Uma mão, duas mãos... ele é o mestre de tudo!"
G["There's no gettin' away this time, orc! You've sung your last lok'tar!"]="There's no gettin' away this time, orc! You've sung your last lok'tar!"
G["There's no hope... our people have lost their minds!"]="Não há esperança... nossa gente perdeu a cabeça!"
G["There's no king that matters here!"]="Não há nenhum rei que importe aqui!"
G["There's no loitering, pan handling, cursing, fighting, or anything else you're thinking about doing, allowed in Caer Darrow."]="Não há demora, manipulação de panela, xingamentos, brigas ou qualquer outra coisa que você esteja pensando em fazer, permitida em Cair Darrow."
G["There's no need for you to understand, Arthas. All you need to do is die."]="Não é necessário que o entiendas, Arthas. Tão somente precisa morrer."
G["There's no need to contact that conniving ethereal. Come, we have much to discuss."]="Não há razão para entrar em contato com esse conspirador etéreo. Venha, temos muito de que falar."
G["There's no need to worry, Fahrad. This next mission is ... quite likely ... suicide."]="Não te preocupe, Fahrad. A próxima missão é... um tanto... suicida."
G["There's no point in denying it, Dran! That thief knew exactly where to bring his stolen goods."]="There's no point in denying it, Dran! That thief knew exactly where to bring his stolen goods."
G["There's no room on your skin for runic tattoos, $C, because you lack the Runemaster's spirit to hold them."]="There's no room on your skin for runic tattoos, $C, because you lack the Runemaster's spirit to hold them."
G["There's no running away from a challenge."]="Não é possível fugir de um desafio."
G["There's no substitute for live observers, but I need those mountaineers here. We'll have to rely on those little gnomish observer bots for now..."]="There's no substitute for live observers, but I need those mountaineers here. We'll have to rely on those little gnomish observer bots for now..."
G["There's no telling how we might use the power these mechanisms create."]="There's no telling how we might use the power these mechanisms create."
G["There's no thrill like the thrill of a dragon hunt."]="Não há emoção como a emoção de uma caça ao dragão."
G["There's no time left! All remaining forces, attack the invaders!"]="Não restante tempo! Que todas as forças restantes ataque aos invasores!"
G["There's no time to waste, $n. My intel tells me that the yaungol are about to launch an all-out last ditch assault. We're all counting on you to kill Chief Ragemesa."]="Não há tempo que perder, $n. Meu serviço de inteligência diz que os yaungol estão a ponto de lançar um último ataque total à desesperada. Temos todos com você para que mate ao Chefe da Meseta Infame."
G["There's no time to waste, trooper. I must get back to base immediately! Cover me!"]="Não há tempo que perder, Soldado. E de voltar à base imediatamente! Cúbreme!"
G["There's no turning back now, $n. Stay close and watch my back."]="Agora não nos podemos voltar, $n. Fique perto e vigila meu retaguarda."
G["There's no warranty on those shades yous bought!"]="There's no warranty on those shades yous bought!"
G["There's no way I'm dying for you."]="Não pretendo morrer por você."
G["There's no way I'm going into the Rivenwood; the place is haunted!"]="Não vou ir ao Floresta Fendido de nenhuma maneira! Esse lugar está maldito!"
G["There's no way some Protectorate prisoner is going to defeat our gladiator!"]="De nenhum modo um prisioneiro do Protectorado vai derrotar a nosso gladiador!"
G["There's no way they could have escaped by land.  Did they..."]="Não têm pedido escapar por terra. Talvez têm..."
G["There's no way you'll sleep through THIS."]="Mas é possível que não te despiertes com ISTO."
G["There's no way you're gettin' out of here alive!"]="Não há maneira de sair vivos de aqui!"
G["There's no way you're getting past us."]="There's no way you're getting past us."
G["There's no... greater... glory."]="Não há... maior... glória."
G["There's not nearly enough hide here to make a proper disguise."]="Aqui não há pelego suficiente para um bom disfarce nem de longe."
G["There's nothing I can teach you, other than maybe a better eye for color and detail. Talk to Simon Tanner over there; he knows a lot of advanced techniques for working with leather."]="Não há nada que eu possa ensinar, a não ser talvez um olho melhor para cores e detalhes. Fale com Simon Tanner ali; ele conhece muitas técnicas avançadas para trabalhar com couro."
G["There's nothing I hate more than mercenaries. They are without honor!"]="Não há nada que odie mais que aos mercenários. Não têm honra!"
G["There's nothing better than a fine brew!"]="Não há nada melhor que um bom mistura!"
G["There's nothing better than working up a sweat with a good fight!"]="Não há nada melhor para fazer exercícios que uma boa luta!"
G["There's nothing here. Let's keep looking."]="Não há nada. É preciso seguir procurando."
G["There's nothing like a common enemy to bring people together. The dwarven clans have never been so united. If the peace holds, our three kingdoms will be stronger than ever before..."]="There's nothing like a common enemy to bring people together. The dwarven clans have never been so united. If the peace holds, our three kingdoms will be stronger than ever before..."
G["There's nothing like a good cup of kafa! When the seeds are roasted just right, ground fresh, and brewed in pure water.\n\nPerfect for the weary traveler or studious monk."]="There's nothing like a good cup of kafa! When the seeds are roasted just right, ground fresh, and brewed in pure water.\n\nPerfect for the weary traveler or studious monk."
G["There's nothing like a little Lunar celebration to warm your bones!"]="Não há nada como uma pequena celebração lunar para aquecer seus ossos!"
G["There's nothing like running your own enterprise.  But do I have to do everything myself?  Tell them to speed it up!"]="There's nothing like running your own enterprise.  But do I have to do everything myself?  Tell them to speed it up!"
G["There's nothing like some scalding mornbrew on a chilly Dun Morogh day to get things started right!"]="There's nothing like some scalding mornbrew on a chilly Dun Morogh day to get things started right!"
G["There's nothing more I can teach you. I've heard of a night elf who might be able to, though. Her name is Ainethil, and she lives in the Craftsmen's Terrace of Darnassus."]="Não há mais nada que eu possa ensinar. Já ouvi falar de um elfo noturno que pode ser capaz. O nome dela é Ainethil e ela mora no Terraço de Artesãos de Darnassus."
G["There's nothing more exciting than to soar through the air.\n\nWell, maybe to fight while soaring through the air, and a good tankard of ale afterward!"]="There's nothing more exciting than to soar through the air.\n\nWell, maybe to fight while soaring through the air, and a good tankard of ale afterward!"
G["There's nothing more inspiring than a flower in bloom!"]="Não há nada mais inspirador do que uma flor em flor!"
G["There's nothing quite like communing with nature... or at least that's what the night elves tell me.  I'm not much for talking to flowers and trees, but I'm sure Tannysa could help you out.  She's over in the Mage Quarter outside of Alchemy Needs."]="Não há nada como se se comunicar com a natureza... ou pelo menos é o que os elfos da noite me dizem. Não gosto muito de conversar com flores e árvores, mas tenho certeza de que Tannysa pode ajudá-o. Ela está no Mage Quarter, perto de Alchemy Needs."
G["There's nothing quite like the smell of Durotar on a warm, comfortable boat ride."]="Não há nada como o cheiro de Durotar durante um viagem em navio cálido e agradável."
G["There's nothing there, Ha'lei. Please, I just need a few more minutes of silence."]="Aí não há nada, Ha'lei. Somente preciso uns poucos minutos mais de silêncio."
G["There's nowhere for you to run. The disease is inside you."]="Você não pode fugir a nenhum lado. A doença está dentro de ti."
G["There's nowhere left to hide, VanCleef! The Defias are THROUGH!"]="Não restante nenhum lugar onde te possa esconder VanCleef! Os Défias estão ACABADOS!"
G["There's nowhere to run, monster!"]="There's nowhere to run, monster!"
G["There's oil here alright, and we're gonna need it!"]="Aqui há combustível, e o vamos precisar!"
G["There's one - get it!"]="There's one - get it!"
G["There's one after me!"]="Me persigue um!"
G["There's one in Orgrimmar.  A grunt up there will know what directions to give you.  Just head north up the road here, you can't miss it."]="Há um em Orgrimmar. Um grunhido lá em cima saberá que instruções dar a você. Apenas continue para o norte pela estrada aqui, você não pode perder."
G["There's one in Orgrimmar.  Go north and talk to one of their grunts."]="Há um em Orgrimmar. Vá para o norte e fale com um dos seus grunhidos."
G["There's one of the Scourge, right over there!"]="Há um membro do Flagelo logo ali!"
G["There's one of those inside the barracks on the east side of Razor Hill.  Look for Rawrk."]="Há um daqueles dentro do quartel no lado leste de Razor Hill. Procure Rawrk."
G["There's one! For the Horde!"]="Aí há uma! pela Horda!"
G["There's only a few of us left; the ones they don't eat, they butcher at some big altar."]="There's only a few of us left; the ones they don't eat, they butcher at some big altar."
G["There's only one hunter around here I would have ye talk to, and that would be Grif Wildheart.  Ye'll find him standing just outside the smithy in Kharanos."]="Há apenas um caçador por aqui com quem você gostaria de conversar, e esse seria Grif Wildheart. Você o encontrará parado do lado de fosse da ferraria em Kharanos."
G["There's only one person I know of who is more learned in the art of tailoring than myself. Last I heard he could be found in Theramore Isle. He is the person you should seek."]="Conheço apenas uma pessoa que é mais instruída na arte de costurar do que eu. A última vez que ouvi dizer que ele poderia ser encontrado em Theramore Isle. Ele é a pessoa que você deve procurar."
G["There's only one solution. I have to join the council. As for the farm..."]="There's only one solution. I have to join the council. As for the farm..."
G["There's only one way to find out..."]="There's only one way to find out..."
G["There's orcs out there, $p. I can smell 'em. And they're bound to have supplies we can make use of."]="Aí fosse há orcs, $p. Os sinto o cheiro. Certo que levam suprimentos O que podemos aproveitar."
G["There's our $g hero : heroine; right there! How are you doing, $n?"]="Aí está nosso $ghéroe: heroína;! Que tal vai, $n?"
G["There's plenty else going on out here, too.  We've opened up the path to the airport, there's rumors of Dark Irons in the east... oh, and I think something weird is going on with that dwarf king, Magni.  Might want to check it out."]="There's plenty else going on out here, too.  We've opened up the path to the airport, there's rumors of Dark Irons in the east... oh, and I think something weird is going on with that dwarf king, Magni.  Might want to check it out."
G["There's plenty more where that came from!"]="Tem muito mais de onde veio isso!"
G["There's plenty of me to go around."]="Tenho para dar e pegar."
G["There's plenty others of your kind here, but I wouldn't worry about competition.  You're from the bloodline of Ohgan, my oldest friend.  You see... our souls are intertwined, yours and mine."]="There's plenty others of your kind here, but I wouldn't worry about competition.  You're from the bloodline of Ohgan, my oldest friend.  You see... our souls are intertwined, yours and mine."
G["There's really nothing I enjoy more than the sound of screaming victims. Especially if they're MY victims."]="There's really nothing I enjoy more than the sound of screaming victims. Especially if they're MY victims."
G["There's really nothing quite like a warm brew. Warms your bones and hits the spot. You can keep that cold stuff to yourself."]="There's really nothing quite like a warm brew. Warms your bones and hits the spot. You can keep that cold stuff to yourself."
G["There's so much I still wanted to do..."]="Me restam tantas coisas que quero fazer..."
G["There's so much going on! Isn't it exciting?"]="Quanta atividade! A que é emocionante?"
G["There's so much knowledge of the ancient world stored here that we're only just now discovering!"]="There's so much knowledge of the ancient world stored here that we're only just now discovering!"
G["There's some adventuring in store for us today, then?"]="There's some adventuring in store for us today, then?"
G["There's some good huntin' to be found here in the Barrens, if you've the stomach for it."]="Há uma boa caçada aqui em Barrens, se você tiver estômago para isso."
G["There's something about this land - you don't understand..."]="There's something about this land - you don't understand..."
G["There's something else here, too. After a description of a bloody battle and the downfall of the raven, there's a prophecy. Anzu will haunt the dreams of his enemies, twisting them to effect a return to this world..."]="There's something else here, too. After a description of a bloody battle and the downfall of the raven, there's a prophecy. Anzu will haunt the dreams of his enemies, twisting them to effect a return to this world..."
G["There's something fishy about new King Mrgl-Mrgl, but I can't quite put my finger on it."]="Há algo suspeito no novo rei Mrgl-Mrgl, mas não consigo entender."
G["There's something going on in Orgrimmar, and I don't like the look of it. These women complain that people have disappered. Others say the world will end. What does it mean?"]="Há algo acontecendo em Orgrimmar, e eu não gosto da aparência. Essas mulheres reclamam que as pessoas desapontaram. Outros dizem que o mundo vai acabar. O que isso significa?"
G["There's something here.  It's in the rocks and the earth!"]="Há algo aqui. Está nas rochas e na terra!"
G["There's something out there. Let loose a warning round!"]="Há algo aí fosse. Faça um disparo de advertência!"
G["There's something... strange about them... something out of place..."]="Há algo... estranho neles... algo que não está certo..."
G["There's still hope - Gorai is still alive, to the south. Go!"]="Ainda há esperança... Gorai continua vivo, no sul. Vamos!"
G["There's still more virmen in the silos! Can you scare them off for me, $p?"]="There's still more virmen in the silos! Can you scare them off for me, $p?"
G["There's the dog's banner and there's his corpse. What's that? He's upon us!"]="Aí está o estandarte do cão e aí seu cadáver. Que é isso? Está sobre nós!"
G["There's the flare. Left cannon, ready!"]="There's the flare. Left cannon, ready!"
G["There's the mystical tome I was looking for."]="Este é o livro místico que estava procurando."
G["There's the refugee camp!"]="Aí está o acampamento de refugiados!"
G["There's the stolen shredder! Stop it or Lugwizzle will have our hides!"]="There's the stolen shredder! Stop it or Lugwizzle will have our hides!"
G["There's the survey marker!"]="Aí está o marcador de peritagem!"
G["There's too many of them! I don't know how long we can hold out! Go'el, now would be a good time to wake up!"]="São demais! Não sei quanto poderemos aguantar! Go'o, agora seria um bom momentos para despertar!"
G["There's too many of them. Kalithresh has an entire army down here."]="São demais. Kalithresh tem tudo um exército aqui baixo."
G["There's too much smoke in the air to see very far.\nI can't make out much of anything on the beach, and sniping's useless."]="Com tanto humo no ar não é possível ver muito longe.\n\nApenas vejo a praia. Disparar não serve de nada."
G["There's trouble in the woods.  We must uncover its source before it is too late!"]="Há problemas na floresta. Precisamos descobrir sua fonte antes que seja tarde demais!"
G["There, $n, I think I've figured it out!"]="Olhe, $n, acho que o e entendido!"
G["There, $n, now you will be able to speak with, and understand, the Winterfin murlocs."]="There, $n, now you will be able to speak with, and understand, the Winterfin murlocs."
G["There, $n.  You may now speak to the Bloodscalp chief and his witchdoctor."]="Aí, $n. Agora pode falar com o chefe Sangrapelhejo e seu médico bruxo."
G["There, $n. It is done."]="Tome, $n. Está feito."
G["There, I crafted this breastplate with my own hands, toiling for hours upon the forge."]="Ali elaboré este peitoral com meus próprias mãos, trabalhando duro durante horas na forja."
G["There, I've got it!"]="Já o tenho!"
G["There, by the fountain! Set them down gently now."]="Ali, ao lado da fonte! Déjalos com suavidade."
G["There, deep within the pockets of a Troll was the beautiful gem, which I sold for a handsome price!"]="There, deep within the pockets of a Troll was the beautiful gem, which I sold for a handsome price!"
G["There, he earned the name \"Lo'Gosh,\" or \"Ghost Wolf.\""]="Lá, ele ganhou o apelido de \"Lo'Gosh\", ou \"Lobo Fantasma\"."
G["There, isn't that much better?"]="Já está. Muito melhor, não?"
G["There, it is completed."]="Tome, está terminou."
G["There, it is done.  The book has been enhanced..."]="Ali, já está pronto. O livro tem aprimorado..."
G["There, see? Ol' Trollplow'll be better in no time! Before you know it, you'll be bragging about out-gunning me again..."]="There, see? Ol' Trollplow'll be better in no time! Before you know it, you'll be bragging about out-gunning me again..."
G["There, that should do it..."]="There, that should do it..."
G["There, the Forest Heart is now purified. Its power will replenish Ashenvale once more. We are forever in your debt, young one."]="Tome, o coração do florestas já está purificou. Seu poder voltará a inundar Valhefresno. Sempre estaremos em dívida com você, jovem."
G["There, there, $n, worry not! Which piece of the amulet have you misplaced?\n\nDid you check all of your bags and the bank?"]="Vamos, $n. Não te preocupe! Que fragmento do amuleto não encontrar?\n\nTem mirado em todas seus bolsas e no banco?"
G["There, there, Priest. You're in no condition to help anyone right now. Both of your arms are broken! I'll get you some medicine."]="There, there, Priest. You're in no condition to help anyone right now. Both of your arms are broken! I'll get you some medicine."
G["There, there, sweetheart. Everything is going to be ok."]="Cálmate, céu. Tudo vai sair bem."
G["There, there."]="Ea, ea."
G["There.  I am finished with your robe, $n."]="Já está. E terminou seu túnica, $n."
G["There.  I don't want to have to do this again.  That's your job, swineherd."]="There.  I don't want to have to do this again.  That's your job, swineherd."
G["There.  I found you..."]="Aí. Te encontrei..."
G["There.  It is done."]="Já está. Pronto."
G["There. My work is done. You can now greatly augment the power of any sha-touched weapon."]="Já está. Meu trabalho terminou. Agora pode aumentar o poder de qualquer arma de influência sha."
G["There. Now drink up!"]="There. Now drink up!"
G["There. One Micro Mechachicken. I'll never understand how you come up with these names."]="There. One Micro Mechachicken. I'll never understand how you come up with these names."
