G["There... Now we now have a shipping lane."]="Isso é… Agora temos uma rota marítima."
G["There... That should be enough rocks to make a necklace. I should probably get home now anyway."]="Já está... Com isto deveria ter suficientes pedras para fazer um colar. De qualquer forma, já deveria voltar a casa..."
G["There... There's no more time for me. I'm done for. Finish me off, $n. Do it or they'll kill us both. $n... For KHAAAAAAAAZZZ MODAAAAAANNNNNN!!!"]="There... There's no more time for me. I'm done for. Finish me off, $n. Do it or they'll kill us both. $n... For KHAAAAAAAAZZZ MODAAAAAANNNNNN!!!"
