G["There... There's no more time for me. I'm done for. Finish me off, $n. Do it or they'll kill us both. $n... Remember Teldrassil, our beloved home. This world is worth saving."]="There... There's no more time for me. I'm done for. Finish me off, $n. Do it or they'll kill us both. $n... Remember Teldrassil, our beloved home. This world is worth saving."
