G["There... that should help. Now, tell me what's happened, Grimclaw."]="There... that should help. Now, tell me what's happened, Grimclaw."
G["There... will be more! Zandalar... will never fall..."]="Vendrán... mais! Zandalariano... nunca cairá..."
G["Theresa, take this to Father Lankester."]="Theresa, leva isto ao para Lankester."
G["Therum Deepforge is the dwarf you want to talk to. One of the finest blacksmiths around if you ask me. You can find him in the heart of the Dwarven District."]="Therum Deepforge é o anão com quem você deseja conversar. Um dos melhores ferreiros do mundo, se você me perguntar. Você pode encontrá-o no coração do distrito de Dwarven."
G["These \"elf\" creatures. Can they be trusted?"]="Estes \"elfos\"... são de fiar?"
G["These Alliance pigs are swinging aboard.  Fend them off!"]="These Alliance pigs are swinging aboard.  Fend them off!"
G["These Alliance pondsuckers sure are gutsy!  Boarding fully-manned Forsaken destroyers... now that's suicidal behavior if I ever heard of it."]="These Alliance pondsuckers sure are gutsy!  Boarding fully-manned Forsaken destroyers... now that's suicidal behavior if I ever heard of it."
G["These Death Knights truly know no honor. First, they take my greatest arms and armor, crafted with care, forged with the Lich King's blessing. Then they wander off to who knows where and come back dressed like Goblins, mumbling something about pawning off their armor for a few coppers! Pathetic!"]="Estes cavaleiros da Morte não conhecem a honra. Primeiro se levam meus melhores armas e armaduras, creadas com carinho e forjadas com a bênção do Rei Lich. Depois se vão vá embora a saber você onde e voltam vestidos como goblins, murmurando algo sobre empenhar sua armadura por umas moedas de cobre! Patético!"
G["These Drakkari are just bad news. We need to leave and head to Justice Keep!"]="These Drakkari are just bad news. We need to leave and head to Justice Keep!"
G["These Forsaken are quick students. I guess you can teach an old... and, well, formerly living dog new tricks."]="These Forsaken are quick students. I guess you can teach an old... and, well, formerly living dog new tricks."
G["These Grimtotem beasts will soon be sent to their maker!"]="Esses animais Grimtotem serão enviados em breve ao seu criador!"
G["These Horde dogs are swinging aboard.  Fend them off!"]="Esses cães da Horda nos estão abordando. Acabemos com eles!"
G["These Illusionary Aqualytes will affect us with dark magic. Dispel it quickly."]="These Illusionary Aqualytes will affect us with dark magic. Dispel it quickly."
G["These Infernals are almost ready for the next assualt on The Betrayers Black Citadel!"]="Estes infernais estão quase prontos para o próximo ataque à Cidadela Sombria do Traidor."
G["These Jinyu have been locked in an eternity of servitude."]="These Jinyu have been locked in an eternity of servitude."
G["These Kun-Lai pandaren are comin' along just fine. Now if they'd only show a little more of that scrappiness that you seem to be full of."]="A estes pandaren Kun-Lai não se lhes está dando nada mal. A ver se agora muestran algo mais desse empenho combativo que você te sobra."
G["These Pandaren are sittin' on a treasure trove. They even got books in here about vrykul. I mean the vrykul! Come on! How could they possibly have encountered them?"]="These Pandaren are sittin' on a treasure trove. They even got books in here about vrykul. I mean the vrykul! Come on! How could they possibly have encountered them?"
G["These Runestones protect the lands in Eversong from becoming tainted by the Scourge.  The Western Runestone failed long ago, forcing us to burn the ground around it.\n\nAs long as I live I won't allow the remaining Runestones to fail us.  That is my oath."]="These Runestones protect the lands in Eversong from becoming tainted by the Scourge.  The Western Runestone failed long ago, forcing us to burn the ground around it.\n\nAs long as I live I won't allow the remaining Runestones to fail us.  That is my oath."
G["These Shrimp Dumplings are for you."]="These Shrimp Dumplings are for you."
G["These Tears of the Goddess have been blessed by Elune, and their power will help you combat Archimonde's vile magics. Use their power well."]="Essas Lágrimas da Deusa foram abençoadas por Elune, e seu poder o ajudará a combater as mágicas vis de Archimonde. Use bem o poder deles."
G["These Thunderfoots are good people, but they do not have enough ale between them to fill a cask."]="These Thunderfoots are good people, but they do not have enough ale between them to fill a cask."
G["These Twilight idiots have no idea of the pain that's coming their way."]="Esses idiotas Crepúsculo não têm nem ideia da que se lhes se aproxima."
G["These Twilight scum can't hold out much longer. The Dragonmaw Clan has waited a long time for this, $n."]="Essa escória Crepúsculo não poderá resistir mais tempo. O clã Faucedraco tem esperado muito para isto, $n."
G["These Twilight's Hammer fools would tear the very earth apart to get these tablets."]="These Twilight's Hammer fools would tear the very earth apart to get these tablets."
G["These Zandalari are not to be underestimated. They are quite unlike any troll I have yet encountered."]="Não devemos subestimar aos Zandalari. Não se parecem a nenhum outro troll que tenha conhecido."
G["These Zandalari are proving to be a greater threat than I expected."]="Parece que estes Zandalari são uma ameaça maior do que havia previsto."
G["These abominations are responsible for the deaths of dozens of squirrels! They deserve no mercy!"]="These abominations are responsible for the deaths of dozens of squirrels! They deserve no mercy!"
G["These appear to be the remains of Thalorien Dawnseeker, the last wielder of Quel'Delar."]="Estes parecem ser os restos mortais de Thalorien Dawnseeker, o último portador de Quel'Delar."
G["These arcane sanctums of yours are quite... interesting Mr. Caidanis.  I appreciate the information you have given me today."]="These arcane sanctums of yours are quite... interesting Mr. Caidanis.  I appreciate the information you have given me today."
G["These are all excellent. It's going to be hard to choose just one."]="These are all excellent. It's going to be hard to choose just one."
G["These are dangerous times, $r.  An ancient evil is rising, and it cares not if you're Horde or Alliance."]="These are dangerous times, $r.  An ancient evil is rising, and it cares not if you're Horde or Alliance."
G["These are dangerous times, adventurer. Walk lightly."]="Estes são tempos perigosos, aventureiro. Ande levemente."
G["These are dark and difficult times for us all. The armies of the Scourge amass to the south. Companions fall on the battlefield and rise to serve our enemy moments later."]="These are dark and difficult times for us all. The armies of the Scourge amass to the south. Companions fall on the battlefield and rise to serve our enemy moments later."
G["These are definitely the ones that raided our boats, but I don't see any of our missing people. Where did they take them?"]="Definitivamente, esses são os que invadiram nossos barcos, mas não vejo nenhuma de nossas pessoas desaparecidas. Para onde eles os levaram?"
G["These are delicious!"]="Está delicioso!"
G["These are fine pieces, $n.  Let me get started on your robe."]="These are fine pieces, $n.  Let me get started on your robe."
G["These are from the dig site in the Vale of Eternal Blossoms. What is Garrosh trying to find there?"]="São da escavação no Vale da Flor Eterna. Que trata de encontrar Garrosh ali?"
G["These are good blades you make, $n. Cut a stone and still sharp enough to slit a throat. I have seen better though, an orc named Kelgrum Bloodaxe makes them, go and learn all he can teach you."]="These are good blades you make, $n. Cut a stone and still sharp enough to slit a throat. I have seen better though, an orc named Kelgrum Bloodaxe makes them, go and learn all he can teach you."
G["These are grave times for Azeroth, $n."]="Estes são tempos difíceis para Azeroth, $n."
G["These are grave times for Azeroth, $n.  The elementals have imprisoned both citizens around the city and those they battle with.  We can give you a totem that will break the elemental prison."]="Estes são tempos difíceis para Azeroth, $n. Os elementais têm feito prisioneiros aos cidadãos que estavam tanto ao redor da cidade como na batalha. Podemos dar a você um totem que romperá a prisão elemental."
G["These are harsher skies than any of us could have known."]="Estes céus são mais difíceis que os que qualquer que nós tenhamos pedido conhecer."
G["These are holy grounds!  You are not welcome here."]="Esta é terra sagrado! Não é $gbienvenido: boas-vindas;."
G["These are my enemies. YOU would be my enemy in battle! Your king has declared war on my kind!"]="These are my enemies. YOU would be my enemy in battle! Your king has declared war on my kind!"
G["These are my kind of people. Sure, maybe Garrosh is a bit intense, but you can really feel like they're going somewhere!\nAnyways, what can I show you about being a monk, friend?"]="Esta é meu gente. Bom, talvez Garrosh seja um pouco intenso, mas ao menos se nota que têm um objetivo!\n\nEm fim, O que posso ensinar sobre ser monge, $gamigo: amiga;?"
G["These are not the elekk we're looking for."]="Estes não são os elekk que estamos procurando."
G["These are not the first dark times we have endured. There is always a light at the edge of the shadows."]="These are not the first dark times we have endured. There is always a light at the edge of the shadows."
G["These are our Allies! You watch over them like they're a threat. Why? You WILL answer to me!"]="São nossos aliados! Por que os vigilas como se fossem uma ameaça? Responderás ante mim!"
G["These are our fields now."]="These are our fields now."
G["These are our scouts! They have already gone through the Dark Portal. They return to you with news of the new world."]="These are our scouts! They have already gone through the Dark Portal. They return to you with news of the new world."
G["These are sacred halls! Your intrusion will be met with death!"]="These are sacred halls! Your intrusion will be met with death!"
G["These are some mighty fine animals..."]="These are some mighty fine animals..."
G["These are the densest stones across all of Shen-zin Su, yet they are as nothing before my mighty head."]="Estas são as pedras mais consistentes de tudo Shen-zin Seu, mas nada podem ante meu poderosa cabeça."
G["These are the greatest treasures in life."]="Estes são os maiores tesouros da vida."
G["These are the most delicious hors d'oeurves I have ever tasted. You must share your recipe, $n!"]="These are the most delicious hors d'oeurves I have ever tasted. You must share your recipe, $n!"
G["These are the new tools. These are the Gadgetzan Power tools. And to you, they're gold. And you don't get 'em. Because to give them to you is just like throwin' them into a scrap heap. They're for crafters. Crafters only!"]="These are the new tools. These are the Gadgetzan Power tools. And to you, they're gold. And you don't get 'em. Because to give them to you is just like throwin' them into a scrap heap. They're for crafters. Crafters only!"
G["These are the reasons that you must leave."]="Por isso deve partir."
G["These are the times to find yourselves in unison with the Light."]="These are the times to find yourselves in unison with the Light."
G["These are yaungol lands!"]="Estas são terras yaungol!"
G["These aren't Shango's tracks."]="Este não é o rastro de Shango."
G["These aren't as light as they look. Could we make haste?"]="These aren't as light as they look. Could we make haste?"
G["These babies can hurl fire like none other. We've even attached a secondary cannon, a grappling hook and added a manual fuel injection system.  If you can obtain liquid pyrite from the mechanognomes, you can use it to hurl high-density explosives, or turbo-boost your movement speed. \nLet's see those Explorers' League twirps beat that!"]="These babies can hurl fire like none other. We've even attached a secondary cannon, a grappling hook and added a manual fuel injection system.  If you can obtain liquid pyrite from the mechanognomes, you can use it to hurl high-density explosives, or turbo-boost your movement speed. \nLet's see those Explorers' League twirps beat that!"
G["These babies may look like scrap, but they can rush ahead, knocking enemies aside. The front ram has been overloaded with a electroscopic hyper capacitor, letting it discharge electrical blasts. \n\nEven the turret has been upgraded with anti-air rockets, providing it with a definitive edge over those blasted demolishers."]="These babies may look like scrap, but they can rush ahead, knocking enemies aside. The front ram has been overloaded with a electroscopic hyper capacitor, letting it discharge electrical blasts. \n\nEven the turret has been upgraded with anti-air rockets, providing it with a definitive edge over those blasted demolishers."
