G["These statuettes must hold a hidden compartment...."]="These statuettes must hold a hidden compartment...."
G["These stones should be the last of them. Our coordination with Neptulon's forces will be impeccable."]="These stones should be the last of them. Our coordination with Neptulon's forces will be impeccable."
G["These stunted mo'arg are very clever, and are often employed as helpers for their larger brethren."]="These stunted mo'arg are very clever, and are often employed as helpers for their larger brethren."
G["These supply crates came from Orgrimmar. What is Garrosh planning to do with so many war supplies?"]="Os carros de suprimentos chegaram de Orgrimmar. Que pretende fazer Garrosh com tantos suprimentos bélicos?"
G["These swine, they are weak.  They're not good for breeding, not good for eating, and certainly no good for combat."]="These swine, they are weak.  They're not good for breeding, not good for eating, and certainly no good for combat."
G["These thermals have made flying here nearly suicidal. Thank you for coming for us."]="These thermals have made flying here nearly suicidal. Thank you for coming for us."
G["These things should bring down those towers in no time!"]="Estas coisas debieran derrubar essas torres em um instantaneamente!"
G["These things that you do for Netherwing do not go unnoticed."]="These things that you do for Netherwing do not go unnoticed."
G["These three again?"]="Outra vez estes três?"
G["These tools are junk!"]="Estas ferramentas são sucata!"
G["These tracks are fresh, and they lead down into the water..."]="These tracks are fresh, and they lead down into the water..."
G["These tracks must belong to Shango."]="These tracks must belong to Shango."
G["These trainees are weak.  They are not ready to walk the wall, much less face the mantid or the mogu head-on.  It will be some time before we can depend on them in any real sense."]="These trainees are weak.  They are not ready to walk the wall, much less face the mantid or the mogu head-on.  It will be some time before we can depend on them in any real sense."
G["These travellers are ripe for the robbing! Take their things! Take all of their things!!!"]="These travellers are ripe for the robbing! Take their things! Take all of their things!!!"
G["These trees are AMAZING!"]="These trees are AMAZING!"
G["These trees are quite glorious, aren't they?"]="Estes árvores são fantásticos, verdade?"
G["These trolls are among those you exposed on the battlefield. Masterfully done, indeed...."]="Estes trolls são algum dos que fez sair no campo de batalha. Uma obra mestra, sem dúvida..."
G["These trolls cannot continue to defy the Warchief! They must be dealt with."]="These trolls cannot continue to defy the Warchief! They must be dealt with."
G["These trolls have just shown up demanding our help."]="Esses trolls acabaram de aparecem exigindo nossa ajuda."
G["These trolls have made a grave mistake, $c."]="Esses trolls têm cometido um grave erro, $c."
G["These trolls need to learn their place."]="Os trolls têm que aprender qual é seu lugar."
G["These tunnels that you see are called timeways. They are infinite in number. The ones that currently exist in your reality are what the master has deemed as 'trouble spots.'  These trouble spots may differ completely in theme but they always share a cause. That is, their existence is a result of the same temporal disturbance. Remember that should you venture inside one..."]="These tunnels that you see are called timeways. They are infinite in number. The ones that currently exist in your reality are what the master has deemed as 'trouble spots.'  These trouble spots may differ completely in theme but they always share a cause. That is, their existence is a result of the same temporal disturbance. Remember that should you venture inside one..."
G["These tuskarr have seen nothing!  Show them what we're capable of!"]="These tuskarr have seen nothing!  Show them what we're capable of!"
G["These two brave, ignorant fools despise each other, yet somehow they both spoke of you as a hero. Perhaps you just lack the will to choose a side... let me extend you that opportunity."]="These two brave, ignorant fools despise each other, yet somehow they both spoke of you as a hero. Perhaps you just lack the will to choose a side... let me extend you that opportunity."
G["These undead atrocities will be destroyed!"]="These undead atrocities will be destroyed!"
G["These undead rabble, and their dead-elf queen, will fall!"]="These undead rabble, and their dead-elf queen, will fall!"
G["These walls will be your tomb!"]="Estas paredes serão seu tumba!"
G["These warlocks will suffer for their demonic pacts."]="These warlocks will suffer for their demonic pacts."
G["These wastes are scarred by terrible magic.  We must do what we can to heal this great wound."]="Esses resíduos são marcados por uma terrível magia. Devemos fazer o que pudermos para curar esta grande ferida."
G["These waters were ours even before the Sundering!"]="Estas águas eram nossas antes inclusive do Cataclismo!"
G["These waters will be your grave."]="Essas águas serão seu tumba."
G["These wendigos are an annoyance, sure, but the real fight is with those Frostmane refugees."]="Esses wendigos são um aborrecimento, claro, mas a verdadeira luta é com aqueles refugiados da Frostmane."
G["These woods are dangerous.  A lesson I learned the hard way."]="These woods are dangerous.  A lesson I learned the hard way."
G["These woods make my tusks itch..."]="Estes florestas fazem que me piquen os presas..."
G["These worgen are our prisoners. Their fate is in the hands of High Command."]="Esses worgen são nossos prisioneiros. O destino deles está nas mãos do Alto Comando."
G["These working conditions are horrible! We haven't had a beer break in HOURS!"]="Estas condições de trabalho são uma vergonha! Há horas que não temos um descanso para beber cerveja!"
G["These wounds won't prevent me from facing the Kor'kron."]="These wounds won't prevent me from facing the Kor'kron."
G["These yaungol never even bothered to say hello. They simply attacked! Serves them right being infested by those sha things!"]="These yaungol never even bothered to say hello. They simply attacked! Serves them right being infested by those sha things!"
G["These yaungol thought the sha were scary until they met me!"]="These yaungol thought the sha were scary until they met me!"
G["These... mogu... are tougher than I gave them credit for. And clever. You shouldn't have come, this is a trap."]="Estes... mogu... são mais difíceis do que eu achava. E mais inteligentes. Não deveria haver vindo, isto é uma armadilha."
G["Theses tombs hold many secrets, $n."]="Theses tombs hold many secrets, $n."
G["They ARE the Faire's finest, after all."]="Eles SÃO os feras da Feira, afinal de contas."
G["They agreed?!"]="They agreed?!"
G["They all go to the Spire but none ever come back... just like Bijou."]="Todos vão à Cume, mas nenhum retorna... ao igual que Biju."
G["They all must die."]="Que morram... todos."
G["They all wanted it for themselves, but I slew them as easily as I will slay you when I pay you a visit later."]="They all wanted it for themselves, but I slew them as easily as I will slay you when I pay you a visit later."
G["They all... begged... for their... lives!"]="They all... begged... for their... lives!"
G["They almost sent my brother, Loksey, to this gathering. He cannot even take care of his hounds, let alone represent the Scarlet Crusade in a competent manner."]="Eles quase enviaram meu irmão, Loksey, para esta reunião. Ele não pode nem cuidar dos seus cães, e muito menos representar a Cruzada Escarlate de maneira competente."
G["They approach from both sides in great numbers now!"]="They approach from both sides in great numbers now!"
G["They approach from the right now!  Use your Fierce Roar ability if your lions become overwhelmed!\n\n|TInterface\\Icons\\ability_druid_skinteeth.blp:64|t"]="They approach from the right now!  Use your Fierce Roar ability if your lions become overwhelmed!\n\n|TInterface\\Icons\\ability_druid_skinteeth.blp:64|t"
G["They approach? Good. Now, if only my students were here to see and learn from the coming display of martial prowess..."]="They approach? Good. Now, if only my students were here to see and learn from the coming display of martial prowess..."
G["They are a council of our wisest cultural leaders. They serve to check the power of the Empress."]="They are a council of our wisest cultural leaders. They serve to check the power of the Empress."
G["They are a very superstitious people, who often take on the names of their favorite charms, or \"Luckydos.\""]="Eles são um povo bem supersticioso, que gosta de usar os nomes de seus amuletos preferidos, os \"sorte-sims\"."
G["They are amazing!"]="São increíbles!"
G["They are as cruel as they are powerful - and revel in the destruction of all that exists."]="They are as cruel as they are powerful - and revel in the destruction of all that exists."
G["They are assaulting Thrallmar!"]="They are assaulting Thrallmar!"
G["They are but the waves crashing upon the mountain of Her divine will. They may rise again and again; but will accomplish nothing."]="They are but the waves crashing upon the mountain of Her divine will. They may rise again and again; but will accomplish nothing."
G["They are coming for you."]="Vêm a por você."
G["They are coming in from the ocean! Use the cannon!"]="They are coming in from the ocean! Use the cannon!"
G["They are depressed because they have no work to do?"]="Estão deprimidos porque não têm trabalho?"
G["They are doing well, sir. They should all make full recoveries."]="They are doing well, sir. They should all make full recoveries."
G["They are exactly what you need to destroy in order to free the regiment! As I had told you earlier, Kirith had a plan.\n\nEach of the servants does have a weakness. Punish their physical form in proximity of their stones until they are near the state of disintegration. It is at that point, and that point alone, that the stones of binding are vulnerable to attack. You must hurry to destroy the stones, however, as once the enslaved regain their composure, they will be invulnerable to harm once more."]="They are exactly what you need to destroy in order to free the regiment! As I had told you earlier, Kirith had a plan.\n\nEach of the servants does have a weakness. Punish their physical form in proximity of their stones until they are near the state of disintegration. It is at that point, and that point alone, that the stones of binding are vulnerable to attack. You must hurry to destroy the stones, however, as once the enslaved regain their composure, they will be invulnerable to harm once more."
G["They are falling back!"]="They are falling back!"
G["They are falling back! We need to press the assault before they can regroup. Follow me!"]="They are falling back! We need to press the assault before they can regroup. Follow me!"
G["They are falling! Don't stop now!"]="They are falling! Don't stop now!"
G["They are fearless and unwaveringly loyal to their master's godlike will."]="They are fearless and unwaveringly loyal to their master's godlike will."
G["They are flighty, these spirits, and easily distracted... but they will share their secrets with those who know how to listen."]="They are flighty, these spirits, and easily distracted... but they will share their secrets with those who know how to listen."
G["They are going to eat me!"]="They are going to eat me!"
G["They are hardier than I would expect for their size."]="São mais difíceis do que tivesse esperado de alguém do seu tamanho."
G["They are here because they do not wish to defend their homes... their families..."]="They are here because they do not wish to defend their homes... their families..."
G["They are holding us off, bring in the air support!"]="They are holding us off, bring in the air support!"
G["They are ignorant, and blind to reality. Look around you, pandaren."]="São ignorantes; não venha a realidade. Olhe ao seu ao redor, pandaren."
G["They are lost, $r. Librams written by the elven masters. Scattered across the world when the Scourge was unleashed upon Quel'Thalas.\n\nNow we search for these librams. Search to find the secrets they hold - to restore power once had.\n\nI search for the ten written by Master Kariel Winthalus. Should you find a libram, allow me to absorb its magical properties and for you I shall craft an amalgamation of power... of course, all things come at some cost. You will find my cost to be high; but pay you shall."]="They are lost, $r. Librams written by the elven masters. Scattered across the world when the Scourge was unleashed upon Quel'Thalas.\n\nNow we search for these librams. Search to find the secrets they hold - to restore power once had.\n\nI search for the ten written by Master Kariel Winthalus. Should you find a libram, allow me to absorb its magical properties and for you I shall craft an amalgamation of power... of course, all things come at some cost. You will find my cost to be high; but pay you shall."
G["They are massing at Purgation Isle, just west of us here, off the coast. We are to meet them there, general."]="They are massing at Purgation Isle, just west of us here, off the coast. We are to meet them there, general."
G["They are not the Twilight.  I see no reason to oppose their goals."]="They are not the Twilight.  I see no reason to oppose their goals."
G["They are not where they appear to be!  Strike in an area, it is the only way to uncover the real one!"]="Não estão onde parecem estar! Golpeia em toda a zona, é a única forma de descobrir ao autêntico!"
G["They are now your enemies."]="Agora são seus inimigos."
G["They are outside the cycle..."]="Estão fosse do ciclo..."
G["They are protecting that mask. It must be the source of the barrier. Destroy it!"]="They are protecting that mask. It must be the source of the barrier. Destroy it!"
G["They are pulling back, but we cannot let up now."]="They are pulling back, but we cannot let up now."
G["They are redeemed! Then we have won?"]="Se têm redimido! Então, temos ganhou?"
G["They are scouring the entire region. We must discover what it is that they seek!"]="They are scouring the entire region. We must discover what it is that they seek!"
G["They are so tiny."]="They are so tiny."
G["They are soft, weak!"]="They are soft, weak!"
G["They are stoic, the spirits of the earth. Through them, the shaman learns to endure the hardships of life."]="They are stoic, the spirits of the earth. Through them, the shaman learns to endure the hardships of life."
G["They are surely unredeemable, but it still hurts to see them die."]="They are surely unredeemable, but it still hurts to see them die."
G["They are the driving heart of the Burning Crusade."]="São o coração da Cruzada Ardente."
G["They are the literal incarnation of corruption.  Their very skin screams it."]="São a reencarnação literal da corrupção. Seu pele o clama a gritos."
G["They are the whisper on the shivering wind."]="They are the whisper on the shivering wind."
G["They are tokens of respect, purchased only with blood on the battlefield. Earning enough of these marks will be critical if we plan on winning this war."]="São sinais de respeito, comprados apenas com sangue no campo de batalha. Ganhar o suficiente dessas marcas será fundamental se planejarmos vencer esta guerra."
G["They are too strong!"]="São demais fortes!"
G["They are... subsiding.  Renew your efforts, brothers!  We must complete the ritual before they can return!"]="They are... subsiding.  Renew your efforts, brothers!  We must complete the ritual before they can return!"
G["They are... too strong! Underestimated their... fortitude."]="São demais... fortes! Temos subestimado seu... fortaleza."
G["They aren't so tough after all."]="Ao fim não são tão difíceis."
G["They attacked Taurajo while our strongest were on the hunt. By some miracle, there was a gap in the Alliance lines through which myself and some others were able to carry the little ones...\n\n<Tawane trails off, trying not to cry in front of the children.>"]="They attacked Taurajo while our strongest were on the hunt. By some miracle, there was a gap in the Alliance lines through which myself and some others were able to carry the little ones...\n\n<Tawane trails off, trying not to cry in front of the children.>"
G["They attacked our ships from below, and will advance on the keep at any moment!\nWe don't have the numbers to stop them..."]="They attacked our ships from below, and will advance on the keep at any moment!\nWe don't have the numbers to stop them..."
G["They attacked us when the waters rushed in! It was almost as if they knew what was going to happen.\n\nThey should all suffer for what they've done."]="They attacked us when the waters rushed in! It was almost as if they knew what was going to happen.\n\nThey should all suffer for what they've done."
G["They attacked while you were gone... the Admiral didn't make it. The rest retreated to the cave, you should do the same."]="They attacked while you were gone... the Admiral didn't make it. The rest retreated to the cave, you should do the same."
G["They attacked while you were gone... the Captain fell fighting them off. The rest retreated to the cave, you should do the same."]="They attacked while you were gone... the Captain fell fighting them off. The rest retreated to the cave, you should do the same."
G["They be on either side of us!  Send 'em down to Neptulon's Locker!"]="Estão a ambos laos! Mándalos direstos ao fundo do mal!"
G["They brand me unworthy? I will show them unworthy!"]="They brand me unworthy? I will show them unworthy!"
G["They break it and I fix it! It's a very symbiotic relationship."]="They break it and I fix it! It's a very symbiotic relationship."
G["They broke us all."]="They broke us all."
G["They built an empire, when they could have built a new world."]="Eles construíram um império, quando poderiam ter construído um novo mundo."
G["They call to me, the discs...I must..."]="Os discos me chamam... Devo..."
G["They call you a monster. But they're the monsters, not you. Farewell, Thrall."]="Te chamam monstro. Mas eles são os monstros, não você. Adeus, Thrall."
G["They call you the Fel Horde's elite? Yet, you still tremble in my presence!"]="They call you the Fel Horde's elite? Yet, you still tremble in my presence!"
G["They called me down from K'aresh to deal with this band of misfits?  Unbelievable!  Prepare to be collected!"]="They called me down from K'aresh to deal with this band of misfits?  Unbelievable!  Prepare to be collected!"
G["They called me stupid, but I'll show them. I'm going to watch every pot I have and prove that they can all boil stuff anyway. Yeah, I'm on a roll! Who's stupid now, huh? Huh!?"]="Eles me chamaram de idiota, mas eu mostro a eles. Vou assistir todos os potes que tenho e provar que todos eles podem ferver coisas de qualquer maneira. Sim, eu estou em um rolo! Quem é estúpido agora, hein? Hã!?"
G["They called us the Bravo Company. When things needed killin', we did the spillin'... of blood."]="They called us the Bravo Company. When things needed killin', we did the spillin'... of blood."
G["They came from nowhere! There was nothing we could do..."]="They came from nowhere! There was nothing we could do..."
G["They came out of nowhere!"]="Saíram da nada!"
G["They came without warning.  There's nothing the guards could have done."]="They came without warning.  There's nothing the guards could have done."
G["They can drain the Loch until it's little more than a drip of mud, and we'll still fight to keep it ours."]="Eles podem drenar o Loch até que seja pouco mais que um pingo de lama, e ainda vamos lutar para mantê-o nosso."
G["They can take away our land, but they can't take away our freedom!  Attack! [PH]"]="They can take away our land, but they can't take away our freedom!  Attack! [PH]"
G["They can't keep this up! Their wings will eventually give..."]="Eles não podem seguir assim! Suas asas acabarão dando..."
G["They cannot fear..."]="Não sienten medo..."
G["They captured and enslaved us. Put us to work on a weapon."]="They captured and enslaved us. Put us to work on a weapon."
G["They chose their own path."]="Eles escolheram o próprio caminho."
G["They come endlessly from the palace."]="They come endlessly from the palace."
G["They come for you, fool!"]="Vêm a por você, idiota!"
G["They come here for war! Did you not see how they massacred the other outsiders?"]="They come here for war! Did you not see how they massacred the other outsiders?"
G["They come now. Try not to get yourself killed, young blood."]="Aí vêm. Tenta que não te matem, $gchico: garota;."
G["They come!"]="Estão chegando!"
G["They come! Everyone, get ready..."]="Vêm! Tudo o mundo pronto..."
G["They come! To arms me brothers - hurl them back to the sea!"]="They come! To arms me brothers - hurl them back to the sea!"
G["They come... <Snort> Pretty $r, yes? So pretty..."]="Já vêm... <Resopla> Bonito, verdade, $r? Muito bonito..."
G["They couldn't possibly have gotten through... this was an inside job. Somebody inside the city has the Bell, unless... no..."]="They couldn't possibly have gotten through... this was an inside job. Somebody inside the city has the Bell, unless... no..."
G["They crossed a trail of blood-soaked snow and followed it to find a dwarf wandering and speaking in a dialect they couldn't make out... and not a dwarf of our kind mind you, but a mountain dwarf - something our kind had never seen before."]="They crossed a trail of blood-soaked snow and followed it to find a dwarf wandering and speaking in a dialect they couldn't make out... and not a dwarf of our kind mind you, but a mountain dwarf - something our kind had never seen before."
G["They crumble so easily."]="They crumble so easily."
G["They crushed us as if we were ants. What monstrous power these mogu have!"]="They crushed us as if we were ants. What monstrous power these mogu have!"
G["They dare attack us? The fools! Do they not know we are now all-powerful?!"]="They dare attack us? The fools! Do they not know we are now all-powerful?!"
G["They defied us - they defied Hellscream's Horde - I should've executed the whole town!"]="They defied us - they defied Hellscream's Horde - I should've executed the whole town!"
G["They did it!  Enemy down!  Return to base!"]="They did it!  Enemy down!  Return to base!"
G["They did not have to die...\n\nThe village to the south... my home, my family! They killed them all!\n\nIf only I had been stronger. I could have saved them!"]="They did not have to die...\n\nThe village to the south... my home, my family! They killed them all!\n\nIf only I had been stronger. I could have saved them!"
G["They didn't always call me Ol' Durty Pete.\n\nOnce, when I were young an' durty, I thought I'd impress a sweet buxom lass named Bellie with me chiselin' styles.\n\nOl' Bellie! She were somthin' else. Firm, that one. All big but for the middle, like they was meant to be.\n\nSo I found me a chunk of limestone white like her skin and I set about to chiselin' and carvin' and creatin' what you'd call a masterpiece, but I got me scale all wrong, see? I ended up with an enormous, what would you call it? Butt."]="They didn't always call me Ol' Durty Pete.\n\nOnce, when I were young an' durty, I thought I'd impress a sweet buxom lass named Bellie with me chiselin' styles.\n\nOl' Bellie! She were somthin' else. Firm, that one. All big but for the middle, like they was meant to be.\n\nSo I found me a chunk of limestone white like her skin and I set about to chiselin' and carvin' and creatin' what you'd call a masterpiece, but I got me scale all wrong, see? I ended up with an enormous, what would you call it? Butt."
G["They didn't leave me with a leg to stand on!"]="A mover o esqueleto!"
G["They died honorably, Greatmother."]="They died honorably, Greatmother."
G["They died of natural causes..."]="Morreram por causas naturais..."
G["They died so easily. No matter."]="Morreram tão facilmente. Não importa."
G["They died. All of them...\n\nAs the Murkbloods cut through us, something took hold of me that I cannot understand. Tell me, have you ever felt a rage so great that the whole of your being burns? A heat that wilts the living? A heat that incinerates the blood in your veins? That is what I felt.\n\n<Saurfang's eyes glow red for a brief moment.>\n\nI was the last one left alive. 30 of them surrounded me... Murkbloods... I remember nothing beyond that vision. I blacked out and awoke some time later."]="They died. All of them...\n\nAs the Murkbloods cut through us, something took hold of me that I cannot understand. Tell me, have you ever felt a rage so great that the whole of your being burns? A heat that wilts the living? A heat that incinerates the blood in your veins? That is what I felt.\n\n<Saurfang's eyes glow red for a brief moment.>\n\nI was the last one left alive. 30 of them surrounded me... Murkbloods... I remember nothing beyond that vision. I blacked out and awoke some time later."
G["They do not die."]="They do not die."
G["They do not die; they do not live. They are outside the cycle."]="They do not die; they do not live. They are outside the cycle."
G["They do not know the doors they are opening..."]="Desconhecem as portões que estão abrindo..."
G["They do that all day.  I get exhausted just looking at them."]="They do that all day.  I get exhausted just looking at them."
G["They don't know where to store the leftovers!"]="Não sabem onde armazenar as sobras!"
G["They don't look very helpful, we should let them sleep."]="Não parece que possam nos ajudar, deveríamos deixar que duerman."
G["They don't pay me enough to put up with this kind of unprofitable behavior!"]="They don't pay me enough to put up with this kind of unprofitable behavior!"
G["They don't pay us enough for this.  But this ruined village sure beats skulking around inside of Auchindoun."]="Eles não nos pagam o suficiente por isso. Mas esta vila em ruínas é melhor do que se esconder dentro de Auchindoun."
G["They don't realize that they're dead, $r. They are cursed to relive the last memory they had before the town was eaten alive from the inside out. Most of them, anyway. Some were less fortunate.\n\nYou thought the Scourge did this? The Scourge did not yet exist and if they had, we would have at least put up a damned fight.\n\nNo, this was the result of a plague that came out of Scholomance and ravaged the town. It was horrifying and devastating. None survived.\n\nNow leave me to my sorrows."]="They don't realize that they're dead, $r. They are cursed to relive the last memory they had before the town was eaten alive from the inside out. Most of them, anyway. Some were less fortunate.\n\nYou thought the Scourge did this? The Scourge did not yet exist and if they had, we would have at least put up a damned fight.\n\nNo, this was the result of a plague that came out of Scholomance and ravaged the town. It was horrifying and devastating. None survived.\n\nNow leave me to my sorrows."
G["They don't stand a chance..."]="Não têm possibilidades..."
G["They drink your fear: it is the blood of life."]="They drink your fear: it is the blood of life."
G["They eagerly rush to their deaths. What fools!"]="They eagerly rush to their deaths. What fools!"
G["They elude me. I cannot see past their defenses. They have put in place wards to prevent detection.\n\n<Altruis points westward.>\n\nThey fear us because they know that we fear nothing. The cost for such power is great, the sacrifices many."]="They elude me. I cannot see past their defenses. They have put in place wards to prevent detection.\n\n<Altruis points westward.>\n\nThey fear us because they know that we fear nothing. The cost for such power is great, the sacrifices many."
G["They failed their test. Will you?"]="Eles não deram a talha. O fará você?"
G["They fall asleep after. Me, I fall asleep during...."]="They fall asleep after. Me, I fall asleep during...."
G["They fear my words. They make an example out of me. A mockery of the one true god, Neptulon.\n\n<Skar'this spits.>\n\nRetribution comesss, mortal. The glorious hand of the Tidehunter will one day sweep through the non-believers like a scythe against a new harvest."]="They fear my words. They make an example out of me. A mockery of the one true god, Neptulon.\n\n<Skar'this spits.>\n\nRetribution comesss, mortal. The glorious hand of the Tidehunter will one day sweep through the non-believers like a scythe against a new harvest."
G["They fed the fire every hour of every day. Hot coals were carried from one primitive camp to the next. Do you see? In a single flash of light, civilization was born."]="O fogo era alimentado a cada hora, todos os dias. Carvão quente era levado de um acampamento primitivo até o outro. Vocês percebem? Em um lampejo de luz, a civilização nasceu."
G["They fight in vain..."]="They fight in vain..."
G["They fought over their food supplies. It looks like rather than sharing their food, someone destroyed it all. Why would they do that?"]="They fought over their food supplies. It looks like rather than sharing their food, someone destroyed it all. Why would they do that?"
G["They got recalled to Serpent's Spine."]="They got recalled to Serpent's Spine."
G["They had no right to demote me to these menial tasks!"]="They had no right to demote me to these menial tasks!"
G["They had their chance to come with me, and instead they mocked my beliefs. They are nothing to me."]="Eles tiveram a chance de vir comigo e, em vez disso, zombaram de minhas crenças. Eles não são nada para mim."
G["They had what on them?  Tell the tailor my ceremonial robes had better be perfect with everything she's charging me."]="They had what on them?  Tell the tailor my ceremonial robes had better be perfect with everything she's charging me."
G["They hand the corpses to me, I toss them in the pit."]="Eles entregam os cadáveres para mim, eu os jogo no poço."
G["They have abandoned us! Do not forget!"]="Nos têm abandonou! Não esqueça!"
G["They have all abandoned you. Left you to die."]="They have all abandoned you. Left you to die."
G["They have broken into the Hall of Lights!  We must stop the intruders!"]="They have broken into the Hall of Lights!  We must stop the intruders!"
G["They have broken our defenses... the very earth turns against us in Deathwing's name."]="They have broken our defenses... the very earth turns against us in Deathwing's name."
G["They have failed us sister."]="Nos têm falhado, irmã."
G["They have forced me to this...."]="They have forced me to this...."
G["They have freed the human, Windsor, sire. It will not be long until Onyxia is uncovered."]="They have freed the human, Windsor, sire. It will not be long until Onyxia is uncovered."
G["They have given up and surrendered - willingly - to us."]="Têm cedido e se têm rendido, voluntariamente, ante nós."
G["They have grown up here. We kept them safe from harm. We did the best that we could in nursing them back to health. Many perished but many, many more grew strong. Like Garrosh...\n\n<Greatmother Geyah sighs.>\n\nHe has lost his heart, you know. He tells me that I am his balance. That without me, the blood lust that consumed his father and ultimately cursed our people would take him over."]="They have grown up here. We kept them safe from harm. We did the best that we could in nursing them back to health. Many perished but many, many more grew strong. Like Garrosh...\n\n<Greatmother Geyah sighs.>\n\nHe has lost his heart, you know. He tells me that I am his balance. That without me, the blood lust that consumed his father and ultimately cursed our people would take him over."
G["They have limited supplies in this camp.  It would be a real shame if something were to happen to them."]="Neste acampamento têm os suprimentos limitados. Seria uma autêntico pena que lhes sucediera algo."
G["They have no respect for the dead, $r. The ogres must be taught a lesson."]="Não têm respeito pelos mortos, $r. É preciso dar uma lecção aos ogros."
G["They have not even begun to see the fury of the Horde!"]="Não sabno que é a fúria da Horda!"
G["They have practically beaten him unconscious! I have to do something!"]="O têm saído quase inconsciente! Tenho que fazer algo!"
G["They have turned against you. Now... take your revenge."]="Se têm voltado no seu contra. Agora... aproveite do seu vingança."
G["They have two moons to pay their debts. Make it known!"]="They have two moons to pay their debts. Make it known!"
G["They have undermined EVERY attempt at peace!"]="Têm saboteado todos os tentativas de dialogar!"
G["They have you good on that one, lad!"]="Te têm pilhado esta vez!"
G["They haven't noticed us yet. Hurry, maybe we can still stop them!"]="They haven't noticed us yet. Hurry, maybe we can still stop them!"
G["They hide this way!  Quick!"]="Eles esconder por aqui! Rápido!"
G["They hunger...."]="They hunger...."
G["They imbued it with the power of an Old God."]="A imbuyeron com o poder de um deus antigo."
G["They intend to execute Lorewalker Fu! Please, you must help me stop them..."]="They intend to execute Lorewalker Fu! Please, you must help me stop them..."
G["They just keep attacking.  There's nothing else that I can do but put them down."]="They just keep attacking.  There's nothing else that I can do but put them down."
G["They just take the rams and go. The herd can't take any more."]="They just take the rams and go. The herd can't take any more."
G["They keep coming!  Push them back!  We must make sure we save as many Gilneans as possible!"]="Eles continuam vindo! Empurre-os de volta! Devemos garantir que salvemos o verdadeiro desafio de gilneanos possível!"
G["They keep coming!  Stand your ground!"]="They keep coming!  Stand your ground!"
G["They keep their tools in boxes that look like this. Look for them near the pavilions."]="They keep their tools in boxes that look like this. Look for them near the pavilions."
G["They killed him! General Hawthorne - he was ambushed on the road by Horde assassins."]="They killed him! General Hawthorne - he was ambushed on the road by Horde assassins."
G["They killed hundreds! We barely escaped with our lives! Help!"]="They killed hundreds! We barely escaped with our lives! Help!"
G["They killed my husband!"]="They killed my husband!"
G["They know how to throw a party here in Moonglade.  Who would have thought so?"]="Eles sabem como fazer uma festa aqui em Moonglade. Quem pensaria assim?"
G["They lack control... Oshu'gun calls to them..."]="Não têm controle... Oshu'gun lhes chama..."
G["They leave!"]="Que se vão!"
G["They left us here impaled as a warning to the others... Several still alive... prisoners of..."]="Nos deixaram aqui empalados como advertência para os mais... Alguns ainda vivos... prisioneiros de..."
G["They look so delicious..."]="E parecem tão deliciosos..."
G["They lurk nearby ready to strike."]="They lurk nearby ready to strike."
G["They made it this far? I told you the others needed some micro-sonic genetic alterations."]="They made it this far? I told you the others needed some micro-sonic genetic alterations."
G["They mask their intentions with meaningless movements to confuse us."]="They mask their intentions with meaningless movements to confuse us."
G["They may take our lives, but they'll never take..."]="They may take our lives, but they'll never take..."
G["They might have run all the other farmers off, but the Saldean's will never leave Westfall."]="They might have run all the other farmers off, but the Saldean's will never leave Westfall."
G["They mine my pearls, they carve my body, and they distort my mind.  I can feel my will breaking, strangers... they mean to use me for war!"]="They mine my pearls, they carve my body, and they distort my mind.  I can feel my will breaking, strangers... they mean to use me for war!"
G["They mock us from within the temple."]="They mock us from within the temple."
G["They most often turn deadly, and we're understaffed as it is."]="They most often turn deadly, and we're understaffed as it is."
G["They must be after the Kun-Lai Kicker! $p, investigate these sightings and setup the village defenses! They won't get my brew without a fight!"]="They must be after the Kun-Lai Kicker! $p, investigate these sightings and setup the village defenses! They won't get my brew without a fight!"
G["They must have had someone helping them."]="Alguém teve que ajudá-los."
G["They must not discover the fate of the young paladin. Not yet."]="Não devem descobrir o destino do jovem paladino. Ainda não."
G["They must really like this city. Maybe it's the view?"]="Lhes deve gostar muito esta cidade. Talvez sejam as vistas?"
G["They must've drugged you. It's safe now."]="They must've drugged you. It's safe now."
G["They mustn't escape!"]="Não devem escapar com os planos da bomba de mana!"
G["They need you on the northwestern field! Go!"]="Te necessário no campo do noroeste! Vê!"
G["They never stood a chance."]="They never stood a chance."
G["They opened the doors so we can escape!"]="Que têm aberto as portões e agora podemos fugir!"
G["They outnumber us! This is madness!"]="They outnumber us! This is madness!"
G["They poisoned our supplies... we had cultists onboard all along..."]="They poisoned our supplies... we had cultists onboard all along..."
G["They provided the distraction I required. We continue as planned."]="Têm proporcionado a distração que queríamos. Continuamos com o planeado."
G["They put these lanterns out to commemorate the closing of the Lunar Festival."]="They put these lanterns out to commemorate the closing of the Lunar Festival."
G["They ravage the land and destroy everything that they touch. How many lives have been lost to their vile poisons?"]="They ravage the land and destroy everything that they touch. How many lives have been lost to their vile poisons?"
G["They refused to train you?"]="They refused to train you?"
G["They revel in causing anguish and pain - and their murderous interrogations are the stuff of nightmares."]="They revel in causing anguish and pain - and their murderous interrogations are the stuff of nightmares."
G["They said Lady Proudmoore wanted us out. I... I don't understand."]="They said Lady Proudmoore wanted us out. I... I don't understand."
G["They said they were looking for slaves and weapons."]="They said they were looking for slaves and weapons."
G["They say Duriel is a fierce night elf.  It'll be a good fight!"]="They say Duriel is a fierce night elf.  It'll be a good fight!"
G["They say I have a bad reputation as a pirate, but you don't see me sailing around indiscrimanately killing people just to make a profit. Oh, wait...."]="They say I have a bad reputation as a pirate, but you don't see me sailing around indiscrimanately killing people just to make a profit. Oh, wait...."
G["They say a stitch in time saves... what, eleven? Ah, I can't remember. Stupid saying anyway."]="Dizem que um ponto no tempo economiza... o que, onze? Ah, não me lembro. Dizer estúpido de qualquer maneira."
G["They say an army travels on its stomach, and that's the truth.  For any offensive to succeed, your troops have to be well-fed and well supplied."]="Dizem que um exército viaja de bruços, e essa é a verdade. Para que qualquer ofensiva seja bem-sucedida, suas tropas precisam ser bem alimentadas e bem supridas."
G["They say he can turn into a raven sometimes."]="They say he can turn into a raven sometimes."
G["They say strangers from beyond the mists have started showing up across the Jade Forest. Strange times."]="They say strangers from beyond the mists have started showing up across the Jade Forest. Strange times."
G["They say that $n has never been shot down."]="Dizem que nunca têm derribado a $n."
G["They say that Alani can only see the flash of the greatest lightning, and may only hear the echo of the greatest thunder. Should you wish to get her attention, you will need to harness the very essence of the sky that spawned her."]="They say that Alani can only see the flash of the greatest lightning, and may only hear the echo of the greatest thunder. Should you wish to get her attention, you will need to harness the very essence of the sky that spawned her."
G["They say that I am blessed: A herald to harken in a new age."]="Dizem que sou abençoado: um arauto para escutar em uma nova era."
G["They say that the Alliance has found new allies. They will be hard pressed to recover from losing us."]="They say that the Alliance has found new allies. They will be hard pressed to recover from losing us."
G["They say that the raptor matriarch lives deep within Raptor Ridge, protecting her clutch of eggs."]="They say that the raptor matriarch lives deep within Raptor Ridge, protecting her clutch of eggs."
G["They say that the way to the Tiller's Union is through the leader's stomach. Eh?"]="They say that the way to the Tiller's Union is through the leader's stomach. Eh?"
G["They say that there are over five thousand brews in Pandaria. I ain't leavin' until I try them all!"]="They say that there are over five thousand brews in Pandaria. I ain't leavin' until I try them all!"
G["They say that there's gonna be another attack... None are to be left alive..."]="Dizem que vai haver outro ataque... Ninguém vai sobreviver..."
G["They say the barrel and buckets are for fighting fires.  Are you a fire fighter?"]="Eles dizem que o barril e os baldes são para combater incêndios. Você é um bombeiro?"
G["They say the elves have stirred themselves from their forest for the first time in years. But to join the Horde? It can't be true, can it?"]="Dizem que os elfos têm saindo dos seus florestas pela primeira vez em muitos anos. Mas de aí a entrar à Horda... Não pode ser certo, não?"
G["They say the eyes are the window to the soul. If that's the case, I'm guessing this guest and their soul have something to hide."]="They say the eyes are the window to the soul. If that's the case, I'm guessing this guest and their soul have something to hide."
G["They say there's no rest for the wicked. That means you!"]="They say there's no rest for the wicked. That means you!"
G["They say these fireworks use the power of the moon!"]="Dizem que esses fogos de artifício usam o poder da lua!"
G["They say time does not affect this island. There must be many amazing things to find here!"]="They say time does not affect this island. There must be many amazing things to find here!"
G["They say you were a sweet girl."]="Dizem que eras uma garota encantadora."
G["They say your name was Evie."]="They say your name was Evie."
G["They seek only power, as the Twilight do.  Yet you are confident that they will not turn on us.  Did I raise you to be fools?"]="They seek only power, as the Twilight do.  Yet you are confident that they will not turn on us.  Did I raise you to be fools?"
G["They seek to defeat the Thunder King, not to protect Pandaria, but to claim his power for themselves."]="Querem derrotar ao Rei do Trovão; não para proteção Pandaria, destino para se fingir com o seu poder."
G["They seem to be biting pretty good today."]="Parece que hoje estão picando muito."
G["They sent someone after me?!\n\nThank the winds."]="They sent someone after me?!\n\nThank the winds."
G["They sent you to kill me, eh? So predictable... Creatures ruled by terror are all the same.\n\nBut you... You are not one of them..."]="They sent you to kill me, eh? So predictable... Creatures ruled by terror are all the same.\n\nBut you... You are not one of them..."
G["They set it off!"]="A têm accionado!"
G["They shivered in the cold and the rain until - in one instant - lightning tore the sky!"]="Eles tremiam no frio e na chuva, até que - em um instante - um raio rasgou os céus!"
G["They should aim the cannon straight up."]="They should aim the cannon straight up."
G["They should have burned my damned corpse."]="They should have burned my damned corpse."
G["They should have listened to me.  Then I'd receive all of the accolades that are my due!"]="They should have listened to me.  Then I'd receive all of the accolades that are my due!"
G["They should have studied harder."]="They should have studied harder."
G["They should show you a degree of trust."]="They should show you a degree of trust."
G["They simply fear what they cannot begin to understand."]="They simply fear what they cannot begin to understand."
G["They slaughtered stone troggs, Gorik?  This is supposed to sway me?  It is not much of a feat."]="They slaughtered stone troggs, Gorik?  This is supposed to sway me?  It is not much of a feat."
G["They slaughtered us with cold efficiency, but the true focus of their interest seemed to be the eggs kept here in the Sanctum."]="Foi uma massacre calculada e eficaz, mas seu verdadeiro objetivo eram os ovos que guardamos no Sacrário."
G["They so ookin' stupid!"]="São mikos estúpidos!"
G["They spoil the coast with their cowardly mines. Disgusting!"]="They spoil the coast with their cowardly mines. Disgusting!"
G["They sssend you to your death, youngling."]="Te enviam ao seu morte, jovem."
G["They stabbed and bit and chomped but nothing they could do would defeat our hero, $p!"]="They stabbed and bit and chomped but nothing they could do would defeat our hero, $p!"
G["They stand no chance against Xuen."]="Não têm nenhuma possibilidade contra Xuen."
G["They stand unaware that their deaths are moments away."]="They stand unaware that their deaths are moments away."
G["They struck from the shadows. We didn't stand a chance."]="They struck from the shadows. We didn't stand a chance."
G["They sunk the Collingwood off the coast, but we managed to drag her carronades to the shore.\n\nThose animals won't set one filthy green foot on this beach! Not while I've got powder!"]="They sunk the Collingwood off the coast, but we managed to drag her carronades to the shore.\n\nThose animals won't set one filthy green foot on this beach! Not while I've got powder!"
G["They swarm us, shaman! Make yourself useful!"]="They swarm us, shaman! Make yourself useful!"
G["They teach me to sneak good.  You find them in Rogues' Quarter on outer ring of Undercity."]="Eles me ensinam a esgueirar-se bem. Você os encontra no Bairro dos Ladinos, no anel externo da Cidade Baixa."
G["They tell me that I can shed my shame. I only need to do one thing, and then I will not be a shortfang.\n\nBut I cannot do that. I cannot take Farros' strength for myself. Not after what he has done for me..."]="They tell me that I can shed my shame. I only need to do one thing, and then I will not be a shortfang.\n\nBut I cannot do that. I cannot take Farros' strength for myself. Not after what he has done for me..."
G["They thought I was weak.  Haha!!"]="They thought I was weak.  Haha!!"
G["They threaten not only the ways of the tusked people, but the existence of all who live."]="They threaten not only the ways of the tusked people, but the existence of all who live."
G["They told me that this would be a training mission. I feel like it is turning into something more."]="Me disseram que isto seria uma missão de treinamento. Me da a impresão de que se você está transformando em algo mais."
G["They told us Gilneas City was safe..."]="Nos disseram que a Cidade de Guilnéas estaria a salvou..."
G["They took my son... They took my goods, I have lost everything. What could possibly have changed these Jinyu?"]="Se levaram a meu filho... Se levaram meus mercadorias, o e perdido tudo. Que pediu passar para que cambien tanto estes jinyu?"
G["They took off for Gadgetzan a while ago to bring us back some supplies.  Frankly, I would have given at least four of my fingers to have had the chance to crawl inside one of Dadanga's packs in order to leave this forsaken place."]="They took off for Gadgetzan a while ago to bring us back some supplies.  Frankly, I would have given at least four of my fingers to have had the chance to crawl inside one of Dadanga's packs in order to leave this forsaken place."
G["They took the others up into the volcano. Some to turn into zombies, some to sacrifice to their turtle god, Volcanoth!"]="They took the others up into the volcano. Some to turn into zombies, some to sacrifice to their turtle god, Volcanoth!"
G["They took us one by one. I'm sure there are other survivors."]="They took us one by one. I'm sure there are other survivors."
G["They took us unaware... attacked all of the highlands all at once, burstin' forth from the ground, swoopin' from the air. Most of the gryphon wings were scattered, and far too many good dwarves lost their lives.\n\nThere'd be little hope at all if Keegan hadn't rallied us together. I owe that man my life. At least now we have a chance."]="They took us unaware... attacked all of the highlands all at once, burstin' forth from the ground, swoopin' from the air. Most of the gryphon wings were scattered, and far too many good dwarves lost their lives.\n\nThere'd be little hope at all if Keegan hadn't rallied us together. I owe that man my life. At least now we have a chance."
G["They tricked us into ambushing the Horde gunship... but why?"]="They tricked us into ambushing the Horde gunship... but why?"
G["They used the powers of the Vale, and their own flesh-warping magics, to twist and shape a race of ferocious lizards into a living weapon. They created an army. An army of Saurok. Bloodthirsty savages created to enforce the will of the emperor."]="Usaram os poderes do Vale e suas próprias magias de moldar a carne para transformar uma raça de lagartos ferozes em uma arma viva. Eles criaram um exército. Um exército de Sauroks. Selvagens sedentos de sangue criados para impor a vontade do imperador."
G["They used to be an elite band of orcs created to serve the Warchief as protectors and enforcers of his command.\n\nNow they are an army of incredibly well trained destroyers. Garrosh's personal legion."]="They used to be an elite band of orcs created to serve the Warchief as protectors and enforcers of his command.\n\nNow they are an army of incredibly well trained destroyers. Garrosh's personal legion."
G["They used to call me Tony THREE-Tusk."]="They used to call me Tony THREE-Tusk."
G["They utilize terror and subterfuge - often turning brother against brother as whole worlds fall before their dark influence."]="They utilize terror and subterfuge - often turning brother against brother as whole worlds fall before their dark influence."
G["They want you to stop asking questions! Shut up and fight!"]="Querem que deixe de fazer perguntas! Cálhate e luta!"
G["They warned me of the wakening sickness, but I did not believe it would be this bad."]="They warned me of the wakening sickness, but I did not believe it would be this bad."
G["They was real crunchy, and Haohan thought they were his best crop yet! Haha!"]="They was real crunchy, and Haohan thought they were his best crop yet! Haha!"
G["They weaken us! Our strength is dilluted by their very existence! Destroy them all!"]="They weaken us! Our strength is dilluted by their very existence! Destroy them all!"
G["They went down like a sack of orc skulls!"]="Têm caído como um saco de crânios orcs!"
G["They were best friends, you know. Durotan and Orgrim once ventured into the Terokkar forest, where they were almost killed by an ogre. If it were not for the draenei that saved them... It makes me sad to look back upon those days. Such terrible things we did to the draenei..."]="They were best friends, you know. Durotan and Orgrim once ventured into the Terokkar forest, where they were almost killed by an ogre. If it were not for the draenei that saved them... It makes me sad to look back upon those days. Such terrible things we did to the draenei..."
G["They were clearly unworthy of Her divine embrace."]="Claramente não eram dignos do seu abraço divino."
G["They were drawn to the ruins of Shattrath City where a small remnant of the draenei priesthood conducted its rites inside a ruined temple on this very spot."]="They were drawn to the ruins of Shattrath City where a small remnant of the draenei priesthood conducted its rites inside a ruined temple on this very spot."
G["They were going to sacrifice me to summon more of their elementals!"]="They were going to sacrifice me to summon more of their elementals!"
G["They were just getting in the way anyways."]="They were just getting in the way anyways."
G["They were once people... Now? Undead monsters with an appetite for flesh!"]="Antes eram gente... Agora? Monstros não-mortos com fome de carne!"
G["They were ready for us all along. Our forces are scattered, and we are on our own."]="Nos estavam esperando. Nossas tropas se têm dispersado... Não haverá ajuda."
G["They were seconds from strapping me to one of those altars and sucking my soul out. Let's get out of here!"]="They were seconds from strapping me to one of those altars and sucking my soul out. Let's get out of here!"
G["They were taken towards a waterfall to the southeast. I'll lead you there."]="They were taken towards a waterfall to the southeast. I'll lead you there."
G["They were trivial by comparison! These things are never in the same place."]="Perto disso, eles eram fáceis! Essas coisas nunca ficam paradas no mesmo lugar!"
G["They were trying to change me into a zombie!!!"]="They were trying to change me into a zombie!!!"
G["They who dine on lost souls know only hunger."]="They who dine on lost souls know only hunger."
G["They will abandon you when you need them most. They will leave you to burn."]="They will abandon you when you need them most. They will leave you to burn."
G["They will all see through to your weakness soon enough, \"Shan'do.\""]="They will all see through to your weakness soon enough, \"Shan'do.\""
G["They will be forgotten..."]="They will be forgotten..."
G["They will bring more destruction to our village!"]="Trarão mais destruição a nossa aldeia!"
G["They will find me and they will free me... Your pathetic cages cannot hold me for long!"]="They will find me and they will free me... Your pathetic cages cannot hold me for long!"
G["They will get their chance to fight."]="Terão uma oportunidade de lutar."
G["They will get what they deserve, in due time."]="They will get what they deserve, in due time."
G["They will help you Garrosh.  And I will help you.  I will find the answers that we need to assuage the fears of the people and soothe the elements."]="Te ajudarão, Garrosh, ao igual que eu. Encontrarei as respostas que precisamos de para aliviar o medo da gente e calmar aos elementos."
G["They will learn that no place is safe from the Shado-Pan."]="They will learn that no place is safe from the Shado-Pan."
G["They will live, if only to see the fruits of their labor: the destruction and chaos that will surely ensue as the legion of Blackrock invade the gorge."]="They will live, if only to see the fruits of their labor: the destruction and chaos that will surely ensue as the legion of Blackrock invade the gorge."
G["They will not."]="Não o tomarão."
G["They will pay for forsaking us.  For leaving us here amongst the beastly undead to rot..."]="They will pay for forsaking us.  For leaving us here amongst the beastly undead to rot..."
G["They will return soon. Let's get back to Bloodgulch."]="Voltarão pronto. Voltemos a Garganta de Sangue."
G["They won't take our land without a fight!"]="They won't take our land without a fight!"
G["They worked from the shadows, and get this... somehow, they managed to master the sha."]="They worked from the shadows, and get this... somehow, they managed to master the sha."
G["They would rather die than bow before the North Wind. Something is amiss here."]="They would rather die than bow before the North Wind. Something is amiss here."
G["They'll have to get past me, first."]="They'll have to get past me, first."
G["They'll learn to fear the Stormriders this day!"]="They'll learn to fear the Stormriders this day!"
G["They'll never find us here, will they? We won't let them get us like they got Limpy Joe and Flannel McGee!"]="They'll never find us here, will they? We won't let them get us like they got Limpy Joe and Flannel McGee!"
G["They'll never know we're missing."]="Nunca sabrán que hemos sumiu."
G["They'll never see me coming."]="Não me verão chegar."
G["They'll pay for this."]="They'll pay for this."
G["They'll see the light, I hope."]="Verão a luz. OU isso espero."
G["They'll take this camp over my dead body!"]="They'll take this camp over my dead body!"
G["They'll thank me for being hard on them when the battle starts."]="They'll thank me for being hard on them when the battle starts."
G["They're EVERYWHERE! WATCH OUT!"]="Estão POR TODAS PARTES! CUIDADO!"
G["They're after the Warchief -"]="Vão a pelo Chefe de Guerra..."
G["They're after the beer!"]="Vão a pela cerveja!"
G["They're alive..."]="Estão vivos..."
G["They're almost in sight - finish placing mines on that field!"]="Já quase se lhes vê! Termina de colocar as minas em esse campo!"
G["They're already assembled. I'm trusting you to secure the route to Grim Batol. Don't let me down."]="Já estão reunidos. Confío em ti para que asegures a rota a Grim Batol. Não me decepções."
G["They're backing off here... get to the east pass! Quickly!"]="They're backing off here... get to the east pass! Quickly!"
