G["Things are looking up for us, $n. Now that the attacks are over, we can finally work on repairing our ships to find a way home."]="Things are looking up for us, $n. Now that the attacks are over, we can finally work on repairing our ships to find a way home."
G["Things are proceeding as planned."]="As coisas estão saindo conforme o planeado."
G["Things are proceeding well!  Soon we grind The Betrayers bones beneath our feet!"]="Things are proceeding well!  Soon we grind The Betrayers bones beneath our feet!"
G["Things are quite calm here usually. We only have problems with the occassional saurok hunting party. And the saurok tend to only come out during a heavy storm."]="Things are quite calm here usually. We only have problems with the occassional saurok hunting party. And the saurok tend to only come out during a heavy storm."
G["Things are rarely what they seem, Tyrande. And my son tells me this is a sacred place."]="As coisas raramente são o que parecem, Tyrande. E meu filho me disse que este lugar é sagrado."
