G["Think, $n. Think back. Try and remember the majestic halls of Silvermoon City, where you were born. Remember the splendor of life, $g brother:sister;. You were a champion of the sin'dorei once! This isn't you."]="Think, $n. Think back. Try and remember the majestic halls of Silvermoon City, where you were born. Remember the splendor of life, $g brother:sister;. You were a champion of the sin'dorei once! This isn't you."
