G["Think, $n. Think back. Try and remember the rolling plains of Mulgore, where you were born. Remember the splendor of life, $g brother:sister;. You were a champion of the tauren once! This isn't you."]="Think, $n. Think back. Try and remember the rolling plains of Mulgore, where you were born. Remember the splendor of life, $g brother:sister;. You were a champion of the tauren once! This isn't you."
G["Think, $n. Think back. Try and remember the snow capped mountains o' Dun Morogh! Ye were born there, $g lad:lass;. Remember the splendor o' life, $n! Ye were a champion o' the dwarves once! This isn't ye!"]="Think, $n. Think back. Try and remember the snow capped mountains o' Dun Morogh! Ye were born there, $g lad:lass;. Remember the splendor o' life, $n! Ye were a champion o' the dwarves once! This isn't ye!"
