G["This Godfrey must be quite an extraordinary individual. The mistress has sacrificed much for his return."]="This Godfrey must be quite an extraordinary individual. The mistress has sacrificed much for his return."
G["This Honeybrew is the lifeblood of this village. Now THAT is something worth fighting for!"]="A birramiel é o sangue vital desta aldeia. Por isso si que merece a pena lutar!"
