G["This afterlife thing isn't all that bad. I can see lots of business opportunities here. Plenty of spirits that are waiting for the right deal to come along."]="This afterlife thing isn't all that bad. I can see lots of business opportunities here. Plenty of spirits that are waiting for the right deal to come along."
G["This ain't a ride, clem.  Beat it."]="Isso não é um passeio, Clem. Cai fosse."
