G["This ain't much of a big challenge, mon, but we gotta know ya can handle the pit before we can take ya in."]="This ain't much of a big challenge, mon, but we gotta know ya can handle the pit before we can take ya in."
G["This ain't the first time I been stuck up to me teef in a jungle that up an' done ambushed me. I been all over the world, $gson:missy;, an' I'll be hog-smacked if this one's gonna be the end of me."]="This ain't the first time I been stuck up to me teef in a jungle that up an' done ambushed me. I been all over the world, $gson:missy;, an' I'll be hog-smacked if this one's gonna be the end of me."
G["This ain't your vacation getaway, $r. If you want to rest, take a bedroll and shut yer yap.\n\nAnd don't tell me that you wanna make Hellfire yer home. You ain't gonna last two minutes out in the wilds. We'll be shipping you back home in five small boxes."]="This ain't your vacation getaway, $r. If you want to rest, take a bedroll and shut yer yap.\n\nAnd don't tell me that you wanna make Hellfire yer home. You ain't gonna last two minutes out in the wilds. We'll be shipping you back home in five small boxes."
G["This all feels like a long shot.  We've got a lot riding on this plan.  Redridge's freedom, for one."]="Tudo isso parece um tiro no escuro. Temos muita coisa nesse plano. A liberdade de Redridge, por exemplo."
