G["This barrel of ale is guarded by Jarven Thunderbrew.  As long as he's in the basement, no barrels may be disturbed."]="Este barril de cerveja é guardado por Jarven Thunderbrew. Enquanto ele estiver no porão, nenhum barril poderá ser perturbado."
G["This battle has extracted a heavy toll. My own rebirth will have to wait for several years."]="This battle has extracted a heavy toll. My own rebirth will have to wait for several years."
G["This battle must be seen to be believed! Once a mild-mannered tuskarr fisherman, our next fighter turned to the life of a soulless mercenary when his entire family was wiped out by a vicious pack of lion seals and ill-tempered penguins! Now he's just in it for the gold! Ladies and gentlemen, ORINOKO TUSKBREAKER!!"]="This battle must be seen to be believed! Once a mild-mannered tuskarr fisherman, our next fighter turned to the life of a soulless mercenary when his entire family was wiped out by a vicious pack of lion seals and ill-tempered penguins! Now he's just in it for the gold! Ladies and gentlemen, ORINOKO TUSKBREAKER!!"
G["This beach used to be such a peaceful place. Now it's polluted with these barbarians!"]="This beach used to be such a peaceful place. Now it's polluted with these barbarians!"
G["This beam of greater moonlight will send you to Darnassus."]="Este raio de luz da lua maior o enviará a Darnassus."
G["This beam of moonlight leads to Stormwind.  Use your invitation when you're ready."]="Este raio de luar leva a Ventobravo. Use seu convite quando estiver pronto."
G["This beam of moonlight leads to the Undercity.  Retire when ready."]="Esse raio de luar leva à Cidade Baixa. Se aposente quando estiver pronto."
G["This bear wanders a path close to where the Talondeep Path lies, due west of Mystral Lake and the Alliance outpost of Silverwind Refuge.  While he is the easiest of the three creatures you will face on the Ashenvale Hunt, he should not be trifled with.  His presence is a constant threat to travelers who sojourn between Ashenvale and the Stonetalon Mountains."]="Este urso vagueia por um caminho próximo ao local onde fica o Caminho Talondeep, a oeste do Lago Mystral e o posto avançado da Aliança do Refúgio de Vento de Prata. Embora ele seja a mais fácil das três criaturas que você enfrentará na Caça Ashenvale, ele não deve ser brincalhão. Sua presença é uma ameaça constante para os viajantes que peregrinam entre Ashenvale e as montanhas Stonetalon."
G["This bear's flank is frozen solid.... try again."]="O costilhar de urso está completamente congelado... volta a tentar."
G["This beast leads the Riverpaw gnoll gang and may be the key to ending gnoll aggression in Elwynn."]="Esta fera encabeça a Raide dos gnolls Zarparrío e poderá ser a importante para acabar com as agresiones dos gnolls em Elwynn."
G["This beats patrolling the Opera Hall. Theater people scare me."]="This beats patrolling the Opera Hall. Theater people scare me."
