G["This book contains information on the plant species of Outland.  Most of the plants detailed are native to Zangarmarsh.\n\nThe charts and diagrams are a bit beyond your understanding.  Perhaps the author could give you some pointers."]="This book contains information on the plant species of Outland.  Most of the plants detailed are native to Zangarmarsh.\n\nThe charts and diagrams are a bit beyond your understanding.  Perhaps the author could give you some pointers."
