G["This book holds a seemingly endless amount of knowledge..."]="Este livro abriga uma quantidade aparentemente interminável de conhecimentos..."
G["This book would give me unlimited power over my enemies... I would become... unstoppable!"]="This book would give me unlimited power over my enemies... I would become... unstoppable!"
G["This bridge isn't ever going to be finished, is it?"]="Este ponte nunca se vai terminar, verdade?"
G["This bridge should have been destroyed by now.  How long does it take for those lazy sods to get here from the Highlands!"]="This bridge should have been destroyed by now.  How long does it take for those lazy sods to get here from the Highlands!"
G["This calls for an old-fashioned bulldozer exorcism! Give me a hand if she gets uppity, will ya?"]="This calls for an old-fashioned bulldozer exorcism! Give me a hand if she gets uppity, will ya?"
G["This can't be right. An Old God could never be allowed to enter this world. The results would be... Oh dear!"]="This can't be right. An Old God could never be allowed to enter this world. The results would be... Oh dear!"
G["This can't be. He can't just give up like this. Why has he asked that you take his place as warchief?"]="Não pode ser. Não pode render sem mais. Por que te pediu que ocuparas seu posto de Chefe de Guerra?"
G["This cannon appears to be pointed directly at the shore, with a fresh charge of powder and fuse already set.\n\nHow convenient!"]="This cannon appears to be pointed directly at the shore, with a fresh charge of powder and fuse already set.\n\nHow convenient!"
G["This cannot be happening!"]="Isto não pode estar passando!"
G["This cannot be!"]="Não pode ser!"
G["This cannot be!  I am the master here!  You mortals are nothing to my kind!  Do you hear me? Nothing!"]="Não pode ser certo!! Eu sou aqui o mestre! Vocês mortais não são nada para meu raça! Vocês têm entendido? Nada!"
G["This cannot be! The Vazuvius could never fall to the likes of you!"]="Não é possível! Vazuvius nunca caería ante alguém como você!"
