G["This champion also faced the Stone Dragons and their Broodmother with no glimpse of fear or hesitation.  I've seen the most hardy of giants falter where the fleshling did not."]="Este campeão também se enfrentó aos dragões de pedras e à Mãe de Linagem sem rastro de dúvida ou medo. vi aos gigantes mais difíceis temblar ondo ser de carne não o fez."
G["This champion has proved intent and capable."]="Este campeão mostrou ser decidido e capaz."
G["This changes nothing. (Nothing nothing changes. Crush them, crush.)"]="This changes nothing. (Nothing nothing changes. Crush them, crush.)"
G["This charade has gone on long enough!"]="Esta farsa já tem durado bastante!"
G["This cherry pie tastes so good, it could make a grown gnome cry."]="Esta torta de cereja tem um gosto tão bom que pode fazer um gnomo crescer."
G["This chest must have been resting here for millenia."]="Este baú deve estar descansando aqui há milênios."
G["This childish effort ends now!"]="Este esforço infantil termina agora!"
G["This chunk of amber may be exactly what the Klaxxi are looking for."]="This chunk of amber may be exactly what the Klaxxi are looking for."
G["This chunk's been picked clean."]="This chunk's been picked clean."
G["This city can be strange. Is there something I can do for you?"]="Esta cidade pode resultar estranha. Posso fazer algo por você?"
G["This city is so big, to me, a tiny, pathetic gnome."]="Para mim, que sou um pequeno e patético gnomo, esta cidade é tão grande..."
G["This city is so unlike anything from home...\nAh, friend, how may I help you?"]="Esta cidade é tão distinta a meu lar...\n\nAh, $gamigo: amiga; em O que posso ajudar você?"
G["This city is very... expansive, but it seems to be lacking something. I can't put my finger on what..."]="A cidade é muito... extensa, mas parece que lhe falta algo. Não sei exatamente que..."
G["This city will fall!"]="Esta cidade cairá!"
G["This conflict is little more than a race-war. Their hatreds would engulf this land - we will have no part in this!"]="Seu conflito não é mais que uma guerra de raças. Seu ódio consumirá esta terra. Não tomaremos parte em isso."
G["This confrontation no longer serves any purpose. I shall end it."]="Este enfrentamento já não tem nenhum objetivo. Lhe pondré fim."
G["This console stands before steaming rubble.  The sounds of an engine can be heard below."]="Este console está diante de vapor de entulho. Os sons de um motor podem ser atenção abaixo."
G["This constant, annoying resistance is futile, you maggots! There will be nothing in the end but death!"]="This constant, annoying resistance is futile, you maggots! There will be nothing in the end but death!"
G["This continent does not give up its secrets easily."]="Este continente não desvela seus segredos com facilidade."
G["This courier must have died of his wounds after what looks to have been a brutal struggle."]="O mensageiro deve haver morto pelas feridas do que parece haver banido uma luta brutal."
G["This crate looks like it was used to store weapons and armor."]="Parece que essa caixa foi usada para armazenar armas e armaduras."
G["This creature suffers from the effects of the fel... We must end its misery."]="Esta criatura padece os efeitos da energia vil... Temos que acabar com o seu sofrimento."
G["This creature you've recovered is immune to the lightning strikes that protect the island."]="This creature you've recovered is immune to the lightning strikes that protect the island."
G["This creature... she is quite old, and very wise.  We stand to learn a great deal about Vashj'ir and the naga, if we can only speak with Nespirah."]="Essa criatura... ela é bastante velha e muito sábia. Nós estamos dispostos a aprender muito sobre Vashj'ir e os naga, se pudermos falar com Nespirah."
G["This crime cannot be allowed to go unsolved. The location of the inn and the violence of its destruction make this a very delicate matter. Inspect the site with the utmost respect, friend."]="Este crime não pode ser resolvido. A localização da pousada e a violência da sua destruição fazem deste um assunto muito delicado. Inspecione o site com o maior respeito, amigo."
G["This crypt will be your grave!"]="This crypt will be your grave!"
G["This crystal-based construct hums with energy.  Strange glyphs are projected in front of you and scroll in rapid succession."]="This crystal-based construct hums with energy.  Strange glyphs are projected in front of you and scroll in rapid succession."
G["This cultist is in a deep trance..."]="Este cultor está em estado de trance..."
G["This dark taint is downright bad for business."]="Esta sombria praga não nos traz nada bom."
G["This darkness in my heart, it is your doing!"]="A escuridão de meu coração é culpar sua!"
G["This data will be quite useful for Project Blue Book. Er, I mean, this will be great for my new look.  See if you can gather any more data."]="This data will be quite useful for Project Blue Book. Er, I mean, this will be great for my new look.  See if you can gather any more data."
G["This day brings victory, but more difficult trials lie ahead..."]="This day brings victory, but more difficult trials lie ahead..."
G["This day is long overdue! Out of my way!"]="Este dia se tem retrasado demais! Fora de meu caminho!"
G["This day seems to be one full of hard decisions.  Having the courage to make them is gravely important, for the sake of us all.  I did what I had to do, and we may have all been doomed if I had not... but sadly, not all see it that way.\n\nIt is time for me to leave Shen-zin Su, that those here might be free from the burden of my difficult choice, and that I might fight on for the sake of a much larger world.\n\nI've only known Korga a short time, but he and I could be brothers if he were born in different skin - he possesses bravery and honor that I would gladly stand beside.  You too could be my $gbrother:sister;, after all we've been through together.  I'm hoping you might join us, but I understand that there is much to consider."]="This day seems to be one full of hard decisions.  Having the courage to make them is gravely important, for the sake of us all.  I did what I had to do, and we may have all been doomed if I had not... but sadly, not all see it that way.\n\nIt is time for me to leave Shen-zin Su, that those here might be free from the burden of my difficult choice, and that I might fight on for the sake of a much larger world.\n\nI've only known Korga a short time, but he and I could be brothers if he were born in different skin - he possesses bravery and honor that I would gladly stand beside.  You too could be my $gbrother:sister;, after all we've been through together.  I'm hoping you might join us, but I understand that there is much to consider."
G["This day we fight!! By all that you hold dear in these good lands, I bid you stand, heroes of Azeroth!"]="This day we fight!! By all that you hold dear in these good lands, I bid you stand, heroes of Azeroth!"
G["This day will stand as a testament not only to your valor, but to the fact that no foe, not even the Lich King himself, can stand when Alliance and Horde set aside their differences and---"]="This day will stand as a testament not only to your valor, but to the fact that no foe, not even the Lich King himself, can stand when Alliance and Horde set aside their differences and---"
G["This death is only a temporary respite from my curse."]="A morte é tão somente um alívio momentâneo de meu maldição."
G["This demands a tireless search for ancient clues, and the wisdom to interpret them."]="Tal dever exige uma procurando incansável de rastros antigos e a astúcia para descifrarlos."
G["This demonic entity is known as the Voidwalker. Its strength and endurance are significant, making it ideal for defense. Send it to attack your enemy, then use it as a shield while you use your spells and abilities to drain away your opponent's life."]="Este ente demoníaco se conhece como abisario. Se força e resistência são importantes, resultando ideal para a defesa. Envíalo ao linha de frente para atacar ao seu inimigo e depois objetivo como escudo enquanto utilizas seus encantamentos e habilidades para extinguir a vida do seu oponente."
G["This desert be mine!"]="O deserto é meu!"
G["This devastation could have been avoided, $c. There was a time when Theramore was a symbol of peace..."]="This devastation could have been avoided, $c. There was a time when Theramore was a symbol of peace..."
G["This dig here is compromised - the Explorers' League wants us to grab whatever's left of value and clear out. Easily said, not so easily done."]="Essa escavação aqui está comprometida - a Liga dos Batedores quer que pegemos o que resta de coragem e resolvamos. Dito facilmente, não é tão fácil de fazer."
G["This discovery will surely rock the foundation of modern archaeology."]="Este descoberta sem dúvida sacudirá os cimentos da arqueologia moderna."
G["This dock here?  Well you can catch the ship that goes to that Night Elf place.  What's it's name?  Uhh Auberdine I think.  I don't really know for sure, I just load and unload stuff."]="Esta doca aqui? Bem, você pode pegar o navio que vai para o lugar dos Night Elf. Qual o nome disso? Uhh Auberdine, eu acho. Eu mesmo não tenho certeza, apenas carrego e descarrego coisas."
G["This does not concern you. Be on your way."]="Isso não diz respeito a você. Esteja a caminho."
G["This does not look familar to me at all.  Let's head back to the courtyard and see if there is another way.  I don't really like long stairwells anyways."]="This does not look familar to me at all.  Let's head back to the courtyard and see if there is another way.  I don't really like long stairwells anyways."
G["This does not look good for the future of the cartel. Not one bit.\n\nYou have to pull our fat out of the fire, $n, or we might as well all just walk into that volcano up there."]="Isto não pinta bem para o futuro do cartaz. Nada bem.\n\nTem que nos tirar as castanhas do fogo, $n, ou mais nos vale que saltemos a esse vulcão."
G["This doesn't bode well.  Send scouts to gather more intelligence, and stay on alert."]="This doesn't bode well.  Send scouts to gather more intelligence, and stay on alert."
G["This doesn't look good!"]="Isto não tem boa pinta!"
G["This doesn't look good. Whatever you do, don't fall off. There's a ton of nasty things in there!"]="This doesn't look good. Whatever you do, don't fall off. There's a ton of nasty things in there!"
G["This doesn't look pretty, lad."]="Isto não tem boa pinta, rapaz."
G["This doesn't look right..."]="Isto não tem bom aspecto..."
G["This doesn't look... right.  Look at how alien the desert is!  Going through here might be a terrible mistake."]="This doesn't look... right.  Look at how alien the desert is!  Going through here might be a terrible mistake."
G["This door is all that stands between us and the Betrayer.  Stand aside, friends."]="This door is all that stands between us and the Betrayer.  Stand aside, friends."
G["This dwarf's body is severely battered. The Twilight's Hammer must take pleasure in their killing."]="O corpo deste anão está severamente agredido. O Martelo do Crepúsculo deve ter prazer na sua matança."
G["This emitter is driving me nuts!  I'm missing all sorts of parts that I need to fix it."]="Este emissor está me deixando louco! Estou sentindo falta de todos os tipos de peças necessárias para corrigi-o."
G["This end have I reached before.  What new adventure lies in store?"]="Este fim a mim me soa. Vamos ver que nova me espera."
G["This ends NOW!"]="Isto acaba AGORA!"
