G["This entire holiday is nonsensical. Colored eggs and \"life affirmation,\" bah."]="Tudo esse feriado é sem sentido. Ovos coloridos e \"afirmação da vida\", bah."
G["This equipment looks cool and all, but couldn't we have done a little better?  Are you even raiding?"]="This equipment looks cool and all, but couldn't we have done a little better?  Are you even raiding?"
G["This ethereal teleport pad is covered in brightly colored buttons and switches, but seems to have fallen into disuse."]="Este bloco de teleporte etéreo é coberto por botões e interruptores de cores vivas, mas parece ter caído em desuso."
G["This evil I have unleashed... In whose hand does the power my goddess granted to me now lie... By whose hand is it directed?"]="This evil I have unleashed... In whose hand does the power my goddess granted to me now lie... By whose hand is it directed?"
G["This evil cannot be allowed to enter this world!  Come my children!"]="Não podemos permitir que o mal entre neste mundo! Venham, filhos meus!"
G["This exercise bores me."]="This exercise bores me."
G["This expedition is a terrible drain on military supplies."]="This expedition is a terrible drain on military supplies."
G["This faire is a sweet surprise!"]="Esta feira é uma bonita surpresa!"
G["This faire is great!"]="Esta feira é genial!"
G["This farce ends here!"]="Esta farsa acaba aqui!"
G["This farm has been in my family for generations. How can I give it up? Yet, a greater responsibility has fallen upon me."]="Esta fazenda leva generações na família. Como posso renunciar a ela? Mas me chama uma responsabilidade maior..."
G["This feather... brings back so many memories. Thank you, $n."]="This feather... brings back so many memories. Thank you, $n."
G["This fel reaver appears to not be quite operation just yet."]="Parece que este assaltante vil não está operacional ainda."
G["This field will look as good as new in no time!"]="Este campo estará como novo em menos que canta um galo!"
G["This fight has gotten a bit stale; allow me to spice things up!"]="This fight has gotten a bit stale; allow me to spice things up!"
G["This fight is favorable to us."]="A batalha nos é favorable."
G["This fight is the true test of courage. Steel your hearts and drench your blades in the enemies' blood!"]="This fight is the true test of courage. Steel your hearts and drench your blades in the enemies' blood!"
G["This fight will take everything we have. I hope you are ready."]="This fight will take everything we have. I hope you are ready."
G["This fight's all yours!"]="Esta luta é toda sua!"
G["This fighting is endless. I'm not certain how much more of it I can stand."]="Esta luta é interminável. Não estou certo de quanto nunca poderei aguantar."
G["This first part is the toughest. Once we get to the thermal vents, the path will be much clearer."]="This first part is the toughest. Once we get to the thermal vents, the path will be much clearer."
G["This flight takes you to the far point of the Singing Ridge.  Very dangerous!\n\nFor this one, I'm going to need a signed waiver..."]="Este voo te leva ao ponto remoto de Cresta Canto. Muito perigoso!\n\nPor isto, vou ter que precisar uma renuncia firmada..."
G["This food is delicious. I never want to leave."]="Está comida está deliciosa. Não quero ir embora nunca."
G["This fool does not understand. He carries negative emotion with reckless abandon. We will all suffer the consequences if such action continues."]="This fool does not understand. He carries negative emotion with reckless abandon. We will all suffer the consequences if such action continues."
G["This footprint is too muddy to be useful."]="This footprint is too muddy to be useful."
G["This forest be a spooky place.  It's full of more bad juju than just the Alliance, so you watch out for yourself."]="Essa floresta é um lugar assustador. Está cheio de mais juju ruim do que apenas a Aliança, então tome cuidado."
G["This forest can be confusing! Be careful out there."]="Essa floresta pode ser confusa! Tenha cuidado lá fosse."
G["This forge can make unstable concoctions... to study them, I need Apexis Shards!"]="This forge can make unstable concoctions... to study them, I need Apexis Shards!"
G["This forge will usher in the new age! Demos commands it!"]="Nesta forja se dará forma a uma nova era! Demos o ordena!"
G["This form means nothing. We are without end."]="Esta forma não indica nada. Não temos fim."
G["This fortress will be harder to take than Garrosh'ar was. But sooner or later, they will break. The Horde always breaks."]="Esta fortaleza será mais difícil de pegar que Garrosh'ar, mas tarde ou cedo cairá. A Horda sempre cai."
G["This foul little beast is the imp. It is small and weak, making it almost useless as a meatshield, and its damage output is mediocre at best. This creature is best used for support of a larger group."]="This foul little beast is the imp. It is small and weak, making it almost useless as a meatshield, and its damage output is mediocre at best. This creature is best used for support of a larger group."
G["This foundry should be sufficient.  Help me manipulate the molds."]="Esta fundição servirá. Ajude-me a preparar os moldes."
G["This foundry should be sufficient.  We will empower the metal with an electrical charge."]="This foundry should be sufficient.  We will empower the metal with an electrical charge."
G["This frozen land shall suffice for a start.  Come to me, mortals - and I shall give you a quick and painful death."]="Esta terra congelada será suficiente para começar. Venham a mim, mortais. E os darei uma morte rápida e dolorosa."
G["This gash just doesn't seem to be healing."]="Esse corte simplesmente não parece estar se curando."
G["This gem once allowed direct communication with Elune, herself."]="This gem once allowed direct communication with Elune, herself."
G["This generator powers Mimiron's Gaze. In moments, it can turn earth to ash, stone to magma--we cannot let it reach full power!"]="This generator powers Mimiron's Gaze. In moments, it can turn earth to ash, stone to magma--we cannot let it reach full power!"
G["This girl has done nothing, and will not be held accountable for what she might do, or fail to do, in the future."]="Esta ninha não fez nada, e não será responsável do que possa fazer ou deixar de fazer no futuro."
G["This grain has too much zing."]="Este grano tem demais chispa."
G["This grain shipment has been nothing but trouble!"]="Este carregamento de grano não nos tem dados mais que problemas!"
G["This grain tastes too earthy and natural."]="Este grano sabe demais a terra e natureza."
G["This grain tastes too light and bouncy."]="Este grano tem um sabor demais leve e vivo."
G["This grain tastes too old, bitter, and angry."]="Este grano sabe a velho, amargo e bravo."
G["This greyin' seadog may be the oldest of the crew, but he's also the toughest of the lot! Eh? Eh? Arms like an ogre!"]="Este cão cinzento pode ser o mais velho da tripulação, mas ele também é o mais difícil de todos! Eh? Eh? Braços como um ogro!"
G["This group is awful!"]="Este grupo é terrível!"
G["This guest wears a memento of a love lost. I guess it's true what they say; every love story has its thorns, just like every night has its dawn."]="This guest wears a memento of a love lost. I guess it's true what they say; every love story has its thorns, just like every night has its dawn."
G["This guy's a little bigger than I thought he'd be.\n\nYou think it's from drinking beer? I know too much beer makes you fat, like Uncle Chen, but I didn't think it'd make you any taller.\n\nEither way, I don't think I can take this guy on alone."]="This guy's a little bigger than I thought he'd be.\n\nYou think it's from drinking beer? I know too much beer makes you fat, like Uncle Chen, but I didn't think it'd make you any taller.\n\nEither way, I don't think I can take this guy on alone."
G["This hardly seems fair!!"]="Isto não parece logo!"
G["This has been the worst year of my life: Theramore, destroyed. And a betrayal from within the Kirin-Tor."]="Foi o pior ano de minha vida: a destruição de Theramore... A traição no seno do Kirin Tor..."
G["This has gone too far.  How dare the Scourge attack Stormwind!  Destroy it before more come!"]="This has gone too far.  How dare the Scourge attack Stormwind!  Destroy it before more come!"
G["This has gone too far.  How dare the Scourge attack Undercity!  Destroy it before more come!"]="This has gone too far.  How dare the Scourge attack Undercity!  Destroy it before more come!"
G["This has got to be some type of health violation!"]="This has got to be some type of health violation!"
G["This has to be said... the Twilight's Hammer sucks!"]="This has to be said... the Twilight's Hammer sucks!"
G["This has to be the biggest diamond ever!"]="Este deve ser o diamante mais grande que tem existido nunca!"
G["This hatred has burned in me for years, Mahka. Your words cannot lift it from me so easily."]="This hatred has burned in me for years, Mahka. Your words cannot lift it from me so easily."
G["This he has spoken to me...go, and KILL!"]="Tem falado comigo e me dito: \"Vê... e MATAR!\""
G["This healing stuff sure does beat having to pay for medical insurance!"]="Já o acho que essas coisas de cura são muito melhor que ter que pagar um certo médico!"
G["This heat. This stifling heat.\n\nIt makes me want to hurt things."]="Este calor. Este calor insuportável.\n\nMe da ganha de esmagar coisas."
G["This helmet is like magic, you want to give it a try? We have extras!"]="This helmet is like magic, you want to give it a try? We have extras!"
G["This here is the finest, most state of the art mode of transportation money can build. What? Deeprun Tram? Gnomes? Listen pal, If you believe that garbage then I've got a statue down in Stranglethorn to sell ya. Now, are you walking to Grom'Gol or are you gonna ride in style in this fine flying machine? Your choice."]="Esse aqui é o melhor e mais avançado modo de transporte que o dinheiro pode construir. O que? Deeprun Tram? Gnomos? Ouça amigo, se você acredita nesse lixo, então eu tenho uma estátua em Stranglethorn para vender você. Agora, você está caminhando para Grom'Gol ou vai pilotar com estilo nesta bela máquina voadora? Sua escolha."
G["This here terrain is terrible! Spongy ground, all lumpy-like with stumps and stones. Like angry oatmeal. The mud'll practically swallow a steam tank whole.\n\nOur gear's all mired in the muck, getting thumped by the Horde!"]="This here terrain is terrible! Spongy ground, all lumpy-like with stumps and stones. Like angry oatmeal. The mud'll practically swallow a steam tank whole.\n\nOur gear's all mired in the muck, getting thumped by the Horde!"
G["This here's a might embarrassing with them yaungol still infestin' the farm. You gotta understand though... I ain't no fancy $c like you. These things take time for ordinary folk like us. Well, I could just let Uyen go beat 'em 'bout their heads. But I wouldn't want to get her started if you know what I mean."]="This here's a might embarrassing with them yaungol still infestin' the farm. You gotta understand though... I ain't no fancy $c like you. These things take time for ordinary folk like us. Well, I could just let Uyen go beat 'em 'bout their heads. But I wouldn't want to get her started if you know what I mean."
G["This hero represents the Earthen Ring. They need the middle fragment."]="This hero represents the Earthen Ring. They need the middle fragment."
G["This hide isn't ready to work with yet. I wish it didn't take so long to make leather. There has to be some way to cut down on all this waiting. It can't be good for my health, you know?"]="Esta pele ainda não está pronta para ser usada. Eu gostaria que não demorasse muito tempo para fazer couro. Precisa haver alguma maneira de reduzir toda essa espera. Não pode ser bom para minha saúde, sabe?"
G["This hozen land! No wikkets!"]="Esta é terra hozen! Estranhos fu-uh-era!"
G["This inn was built before the savages from the north awoke. Thank the Light for that, at least!\n\nWill you be staying long?"]="This inn was built before the savages from the north awoke. Thank the Light for that, at least!\n\nWill you be staying long?"
G["This insignia is from Sergeant Rantack, once my superior.  You'd never find a tougher soldier than old Rantack..."]="Esta insígnia é do sargento Rantack, que antanho foi meu superior. Nunca encontrarías um soldado mais duro que o velho Rantack..."
