G["This is Camp Tunka'lo, the village ruled by my brother, but I... I don't remember you."]="This is Camp Tunka'lo, the village ruled by my brother, but I... I don't remember you."
G["This is Dajik's hunt. Let's go, slave thing."]="This is Dajik's hunt. Let's go, slave thing."
G["This is Dalin Forgewright. He fled from Lordaeron when the plague struck, taking his love with him."]="This is Dalin Forgewright. He fled from Lordaeron when the plague struck, taking his love with him."
G["This is Desolation Hold, $c. Here we bide our time until we are ready to strike back against the Alliance."]="This is Desolation Hold, $c. Here we bide our time until we are ready to strike back against the Alliance."
G["This is Gregory."]="Este é Gregory."
G["This is Ha-Cha, Sentinel Ku-Yao's yak."]="Este é Tem-Cha, o yak do sentinela Ku-Yao."
G["This is Kor'kron business! Nothing to see here."]="Isto é um assunto Kor'kron. Circula."
