G["This is Master Cheng.  She has mastered the art of fighting on the move."]="Esta é a mestra Cheng. Tem dominado o arte de lutar em movimento."
G["This is Master Hsu.  He specializes in using all kinds of weaponry and is masterfully proficient with nearly any weapon under the sun."]="This is Master Hsu.  He specializes in using all kinds of weaponry and is masterfully proficient with nearly any weapon under the sun."
G["This is Master Kistane, she is a master in the art of channeling the mists to assist her and her allies."]="This is Master Kistane, she is a master in the art of channeling the mists to assist her and her allies."
G["This is Master Tsang.  He is a master of meditation and the ability to sense what is happening around him."]="Este é o mestre Tsang. É um perito na meditação e a percepção de tudo o que lhe perto."
