G["This is Master Yoon.  He is practiced in using powerful, focused healing to maintain himself in battle."]="This is Master Yoon.  He is practiced in using powerful, focused healing to maintain himself in battle."
G["This is OUR Horde!"]="Esta é NOSSA Horda!"
G["This is OUR city too, Proudmoore."]="Esta também é nossa cidade, Corajoso."
G["This is Rigger Gizelton asking for assistance escorting my caravan past Mannoroc Coven. I'm on the road east of Shadowprey village."]="This is Rigger Gizelton asking for assistance escorting my caravan past Mannoroc Coven. I'm on the road east of Shadowprey village."
G["This is The Bomb to end all bombs!"]="Esta é a bomba que acabará com todas as bombas!"
G["This is a beer recipe!"]="Isto é uma receita de cerveja!"
G["This is a child of Beth'tilac, the Red Widow. Her spawn will seek vengeance for their slain brethren."]="Este é um filho de Beth'tilac, a Viúva Vermelha. Sua cria buscará vingança pelos seus irmãos mortos."
G["This is a dangerous game you play... take your gold for now, but know that I'm watching you."]="Está jogando com fogo... Por agora fique com o seu ouro, mas lembre-se que te estou observando."
G["This is a dangerous line of business!\n\nMiran just left with a delivery. He should be back in a few minutes."]="Este negócios si que é perigoso!\n\nMiran se acaba de ir com uma entrega. Estará de volta em uns minutos."
G["This is a dangerous place, $n. Be careful around here."]="É um lugar perigoso, $n. Tenha cuidado por aqui."
G["This is a family farm, in case you haven't noticed yet. We Thunderfoots don't fight, don't explore... we don't even drink that much.\n\nWe do enjoy our food, however."]="Isto é uma fazenda familiar, por se não você dados conta. Os Pé Atronador não peleamos nem exploramos... nem sequer bebemos tanto.\n\nIsso si, nos gosta muito nossa comida."
G["This is a fate far worse than death - please, heroes!  Set their souls free!"]="This is a fate far worse than death - please, heroes!  Set their souls free!"
G["This is a fine mess we've gotten ourselves into. We're overdue to join up with our forces in Icecrown and now we're entangled in this debacle, stuck between the Scourge and the Drakkari.\n\nI told the highlord it was a mistake to come here.\n\nSee what you can do to help out there."]="This is a fine mess we've gotten ourselves into. We're overdue to join up with our forces in Icecrown and now we're entangled in this debacle, stuck between the Scourge and the Drakkari.\n\nI told the highlord it was a mistake to come here.\n\nSee what you can do to help out there."
G["This is a fine mess."]="Esta é uma ótima bagunça."
G["This is a flavor whisper."]="Isto é um rumor do momentos."
G["This is a flawlessly etched jade statue of An Windfur's friend Shin, eyes wide with terror."]="This is a flawlessly etched jade statue of An Windfur's friend Shin, eyes wide with terror."
G["This is a glorious day for the draenei! Thank you for all that you have done, $n."]="Este é um dia glorioso para os draeneis! Obrigado por tudo o que fez, $n."
G["This is a good hiding spot."]="This is a good hiding spot."
G["This is a great day for all who oppose the Lich King! Brave $n has taken up the ancient blade, Quel'Delar, in the name of the Silver Covenant!"]="This is a great day for all who oppose the Lich King! Brave $n has taken up the ancient blade, Quel'Delar, in the name of the Silver Covenant!"
G["This is a great day, $c!"]="Hoje é um grande dia, $c!"
G["This is a historic moment, $n. What do you think lies beyond the gates?"]="É um momento histórico, $n. O que acha que há por trás das portões?"
G["This is a hostile land, and we have no reinforcements. We're going to have to improvise, champion."]="Esta é uma terra hostil e não temos reforços. Vamos ter que improvisar."
G["This is a little something I like to call..."]="Isto é algo que me gosta chamar..."
G["This is a lot more work than I thought it would be..."]="Isto custa muito mais do que eu achava..."
G["This is a lot to think about."]="Isso é muito para se pensar."
G["This is a map of Darkshore.  There are paths drawn from Auberdine towards Lor'danel... and towards several other safe-havens as well."]="This is a map of Darkshore.  There are paths drawn from Auberdine towards Lor'danel... and towards several other safe-havens as well."
G["This is a mercy killing."]="This is a mercy killing."
G["This is a most...unfortunate turn of events."]="Um resultado deveras... Lamentável."
G["This is a one way trip, kid, and you definitely don't want to be comin' back on the other wagon."]="Este é um viagem somente de ida, $gchico: garota;, e te garanto que não que voltar no outro carro."
G["This is a place of peace. We watch, we meditate, we work on our crafts, and we are content."]="This is a place of peace. We watch, we meditate, we work on our crafts, and we are content."
G["This is a portal to the Alterac Valley battleground."]="Este é um portal para o campo de batalha do Vale Alterac."
G["This is a portal to the Arathi Basin battleground."]="Este é um portal para o campo de batalha da Bacia Arathi."
G["This is a portal to the Eye of the Storm battleground."]="Este é um portal para o campo de batalha Eye of the Storm."
G["This is a portal to the Warsong Gulch battleground."]="Este é um portal para o campo de batalha do Warsong Gulch."
G["This is a rare opportunity, pandaren. Prove your might to the Warchief of the Horde!"]="This is a rare opportunity, pandaren. Prove your might to the Warchief of the Horde!"
G["This is a sacred place. Strangers are unwelcome."]="Este é um lugar sagrado. Os forasteiros não são bem-vindos."
G["This is a shiney rock, I'll put it in my bucket. Ok, I just need a few more..."]="Uma pedras brilhante, a pondré na minha cesta. Vale, somente preciso algumas mais..."
G["This is a slap in the face! We demand answers!"]="This is a slap in the face! We demand answers!"
G["This is a strange land. So beautiful. And yet so deadly."]="É uma terra estranha. É preciosa, mas por vez é mortal."
G["This is a very pretty cat, $n. Thanks fer givin' it to me."]="This is a very pretty cat, $n. Thanks fer givin' it to me."
G["This is a very unusual place.\n\nThe magic I'm channeling to try to repair the ley lines should be tearing my body apart, but I feel incredible!"]="This is a very unusual place.\n\nThe magic I'm channeling to try to repair the ley lines should be tearing my body apart, but I feel incredible!"
G["This is a war, right? We're supposed to be able to kill our enemies with our weapons, right?"]="É uma guerra, não? Se significa que temos que poder matar ao inimigo com nossas armas, não?"
G["This is a waste of my time. Where's the action?"]="Isto é uma perda de meu tempo. Onde está a ação?"
G["This is a waste of time, mine and yours! Go see Graham Van Talen if you want to begin your instruction! He's standing to my left over there."]="Isso é uma perda de tempo, minha e sua! Vá ver Graham Vão Talen se você quiser começar suas instruções! Ele está parado à minha esquerda ali."
G["This is a wee bit trickier than before... Oh, bloody--incomin'!"]="This is a wee bit trickier than before... Oh, bloody--incomin'!"
G["This is absolutely barbaric!"]="Isto é uma barbaridade!"
G["This is all YOUR fault, Sten!"]="Tudo isto é culpar SUA, Sten!"
G["This is all for you, $n. You did this. You saved all of these people and thousands more.\n\nYou have risen above the strife and tragedy of this world and in doing so, elevated all of us with you.\n\nYou have done so much - more than many could do in ten lifetimes - yet your life has just begun. If only we had a thousand heroes like you.\n\nBut listen well, $n. Your destiny lies in the Outland. I have seen it in visions, a prophecy yet untold.\n\nFind our people, $n. Find them and bring them home..."]="This is all for you, $n. You did this. You saved all of these people and thousands more.\n\nYou have risen above the strife and tragedy of this world and in doing so, elevated all of us with you.\n\nYou have done so much - more than many could do in ten lifetimes - yet your life has just begun. If only we had a thousand heroes like you.\n\nBut listen well, $n. Your destiny lies in the Outland. I have seen it in visions, a prophecy yet untold.\n\nFind our people, $n. Find them and bring them home..."
G["This is all happening sooner than I would have liked."]="Tudo isto está passando antes do que gostaria."
G["This is all my fault.  I've got to go find him, to set things right."]="This is all my fault.  I've got to go find him, to set things right."
G["This is all pretty cool, and scary, and all that stuff, but shouldn't we be getting back to Mudmug's place now?"]="This is all pretty cool, and scary, and all that stuff, but shouldn't we be getting back to Mudmug's place now?"
G["This is all that is left of the Blue Dragonshrine. A great battle shattered the timeways leading out of this forsaken place. You must reconstruct the fragments strewn across the ground and defeat the trapped spirit to proceed."]="Isto é o que restante do Santuário de Dragões Azul. Uma grande batalha devastó os portais do tempo deste lugar maldito. Para seguir adiante devem reconstruir os fragmentos do chão e derrotar ao espírito preso."
G["This is all too much to bear.\n\nI wish I had the nerve to... <sob>."]="This is all too much to bear.\n\nI wish I had the nerve to... <sob>."
G["This is all very interesting but what is it that you want?"]="Tudo isso é muito interessante, mas o que você quer?"
G["This is all wrong. There's nothing in here about the Twilight's Hammer. What is Samuelson playing at?"]="Não entendo nada. Aqui não se diz nada sobre o Martelo Crepúsculo. A que está jogando Samuelson?"
G["This is all your fault!"]="Isto é culpar sua!"
G["This is all your fault, you know..."]="Isto é culpar sua, já sabe..."
G["This is an Emergency Evacuation Portal."]="Este é um portal de evacuação de emergência."
G["This is an atrocity."]="Isso é uma atrocidade."
G["This is an exotic sample of flora, unseen in other parts of Teldrassil."]="Esta é uma amostra exótica de flora, invisível em outras partes de Teldrassil."
G["This is an insult! An affront! They deny us participation in time-honored dwarven traditions!"]="This is an insult! An affront! They deny us participation in time-honored dwarven traditions!"
G["This is an intriguing find, $n, but I don't know what to make of it."]="É um descoberta intrigante, $n, mas não sei que fazer com ele."
G["This is an outrage!"]="Isto é uma atrocidade!"
G["This is an outrage! Aethas will hear about this!"]="Isto é um ultragem! Aethas o saberão!"
G["This is an outrage! Your disobedience shall not go unpunished!"]="Isto é uma atrocidade! Seu desobediência não quedará livre de castigo!"
G["This is an... unrecoverable... loss."]="Esta é uma... perda... irrecuperable."
G["This is as close as we can get. See what you can find out!"]="This is as close as we can get. See what you can find out!"
G["This is as far north as I go! Those spiders are huge!"]="Até aqui é o mais ao norte que pretendo ir! Essas aranha são enormes!"
G["This is as fast as I've ever seen this team work! Keep it up, $p!"]="Nunca havia visto a este equipamento trabalhar tão rápido! Continua assim, $p!"
G["This is as strong as I can make you. Fight well, my earthen friend."]="Isto é o verdadeiro desafio que te posso fortalecer. Luta bem, amigo terrestre."
G["This is awful! I shouldn't be sitting here, useless, when there's so much to be done! If only my arm hadn't gotten injured up in Northrend... No use dwelling on it, though! Tahu will have me patched up and cured eventually, and we'll still help around here in the meantime.\nJust because we're not at the front doesn't mean we can't help out somehow."]="This is awful! I shouldn't be sitting here, useless, when there's so much to be done! If only my arm hadn't gotten injured up in Northrend... No use dwelling on it, though! Tahu will have me patched up and cured eventually, and we'll still help around here in the meantime.\nJust because we're not at the front doesn't mean we can't help out somehow."
G["This is bad."]="Isto não me gosta..."
G["This is becoming tiresome."]="This is becoming tiresome."
G["This is becoming unbearable."]="Começa a ser fatigoso."
G["This is but a brief repose..."]="Não é mais que um pequeno descanso."
G["This is but a taste of my power."]="Isto é somente uma mostra de meu poder."
G["This is but a test of our strength. We will pass this trial, just as we have passed others!"]="Isto não é mais que uma prova de força. A superaremos, como temos superado outras!"
G["This is coward's work. We should be crushing the Alliance now!"]="Este é um trabalho para covardes. Agora deveríamos estar aplastando à Aliança!"
G["This is crazy you idiots!"]="Isto é uma loucura, idiotas!"
G["This is cultist literature. The only way you're entering Orgrimmar is in chains."]="Isto é um texto de cultor. A única forma de que entres em Orgrimmar é carregado de correntes."
G["This is cultist literature. The only way you're entering Stormwind is in chains."]="Isto é um texto de cultor. Somente entrarás em Ventobravo com esposas."
G["This is cultist propaganda. You're under arrest!"]="Isto é propaganda dos cultistas. Está baixo arresto!"
G["This is cultist propaganda. You're under arrest."]="Isto é propaganda dos cultistas. Está baixo arresto."
G["This is definitely more exciting than my usual intelligence gathering operations. Now hurry and take care of Garrosh, I don't want this to be my last mission for SI:7."]="This is definitely more exciting than my usual intelligence gathering operations. Now hurry and take care of Garrosh, I don't want this to be my last mission for SI:7."
G["This is delicate work out here, you know?  It can't just be rushed, or something's likely to get broken.\n\nLike Fuselage's head!\n\nYou might be wondering about my bots?  I'm always working on the Mk. I, and the Mk. II gained sentience for a split-second before his brain capacitor blew out and he went insane!\n\nI decided to skip III and IV, and went straight to the Mk. V - my pride and joy!"]="This is delicate work out here, you know?  It can't just be rushed, or something's likely to get broken.\n\nLike Fuselage's head!\n\nYou might be wondering about my bots?  I'm always working on the Mk. I, and the Mk. II gained sentience for a split-second before his brain capacitor blew out and he went insane!\n\nI decided to skip III and IV, and went straight to the Mk. V - my pride and joy!"
G["This is delicious! Are there more hors d'oeuvres?"]="Isto é delicioso! Há mais entremeses?"
G["This is dire news indeed!"]="Isso, sem dúvida, são notícia preocupantes!"
G["This is disheartening. Is there anything I can do to stop this?"]="This is disheartening. Is there anything I can do to stop this?"
G["This is disturbing. Please continue."]="Isso é perturbador. Por favor continue."
G["This is easy! I'm ready for the next clue."]="Que fácil! Dê-me a seguinte pista."
G["This is excellent work. Are you ready to undertake a mission on my behalf? I know of no one more qualified."]="This is excellent work. Are you ready to undertake a mission on my behalf? I know of no one more qualified."
G["This is exhausting!"]="This is exhausting!"
G["This is extended to the spirits themselves. They are often quick to anger; it is important that you learn to listen without falling prey to their tempers."]="This is extended to the spirits themselves. They are often quick to anger; it is important that you learn to listen without falling prey to their tempers."
G["This is far enough! Meet me back at base!"]="Até aqui! Nos vemos na base!"
G["This is far enough. I can make it on my own from here."]="Já estamos bastante longe. Posso ir somente desde aqui."
G["This is fascinating... but what could it mean?!\n\nThe jade you gathered from those sprites will help us fill in the next panel, but we'll need more to finish the whole fresco.\n\nPlease help the foreman get her quarry back in operation."]="This is fascinating... but what could it mean?!\n\nThe jade you gathered from those sprites will help us fill in the next panel, but we'll need more to finish the whole fresco.\n\nPlease help the foreman get her quarry back in operation."
G["This is for Theramore!"]="Essa vai por Theramore!"
G["This is for the best."]="Se tornou o necessário."
G["This is fruitless, draenei!  You and your little helper cannot wrest control of this pathetic human.  He is mine!"]="This is fruitless, draenei!  You and your little helper cannot wrest control of this pathetic human.  He is mine!"
G["This is fun!"]="Que divertido!"
G["This is fun, $p. Way more fun than hanging out with a boring uncle."]="$p, Isto é divertido. Mais divertido que seguir a um tio entediado."
G["This is getting good!  It really warms the stomach!  And $n, I have to say, you're a sharp dressing $gfellow:lass;!"]="Está cada vez melhor! Calientao estômago! E $n, devo dizer que tem muito estilo vistiendo!"
G["This is going south quick!"]="Tá tudo indo pro brejo!"
G["This is going to be a humbling defeat."]="This is going to be a humbling defeat."
G["This is going to be easier than a drinking contest with a grummle."]="This is going to be easier than a drinking contest with a grummle."
G["This is going to be fascinating!"]="Isto vai ser fascinante!"
G["This is going to be so epic!"]="Isto vai ser a monda!"
G["This is going to be such fun!  Don't you think, my dear?"]="Isso vai ser tão divertido! Você não acha, minha querida?"
G["This is going to be the best Brewmoon yet with $n here!"]="Com $n aqui, este vai ser o melhor festival da história!"
G["This is going to hurt a bit!"]="This is going to hurt a bit!"
G["This is going to hurt in the morning."]="This is going to hurt in the morning."
G["This is going to hurt, isn't it?"]="This is going to hurt, isn't it?"
G["This is gonna be a bloodbath. A bloodbath... of flames!"]="Isto será um banho de sangue. Um banho de sangue... de chamas!"
