G["This is gonna leave a mark!"]="This is gonna leave a mark!"
G["This is gonna leave a mark..."]="This is gonna leave a mark..."
G["This is good news. Return to them, priest. But heed this: do not eat ANYONE."]="Boas notícia. Volta com eles, sacerdote. Mas ouça bem: NÃO te comas a ninguém."
G["This is good news; our covert operation against the gronn proceeds as planned.  And, there is someone on the outside helping us now, too."]="This is good news; our covert operation against the gronn proceeds as planned.  And, there is someone on the outside helping us now, too."
G["This is good stuff!  But I think it's a little flat.  Let's round it out with a few squishy basilisk eyeballs..."]="Isso é bom! Mas acho que é um pouco chato. Vamos terminar com algum globos oculares de basilisco mole..."
G["This is good stuff!  But it's a little weak.  I think I'll add a little more garlic breath to it..."]="Isso é bom! Mas está um pouco fraco. Acho que vou acrescentar um pouco mais de hálito de alho..."
G["This is great news!  Your efforts have indeed saved us, $n!"]="Magníficas notícia! Seus esforços nos têm salvou, $n."
G["This is great!"]="Isto é genial!"
G["This is great, I never get to talk to Stormwind's rogues. They're always so quiet and secretive..."]="Que bem, nunca tenho ocasão de falar com os ladinos de Ventobravo. Sempre são tão silenciosos e reservados..."
G["This is grim news, and I fear it is linked to the dealings $n had with the Embalmer."]="São mais notícia, e me temo que estão relacionados com os tratos que teve $n com o Embalsamador."
G["This is hard work.  I feel like I need a vacation.  You there, put your back into it!"]="Isto é trabalho duro. Acho que preciso umas vacações. Eh, você, vamos, quero ver como te rompes a costas!"
G["This is harder than it looks."]="Isto é mais difícil do que parece."
G["This is history in the making..."]="Assim se escreve a história…"
G["This is holy ground, heathen."]="Está em sozinho sagrado, infiel."
G["This is horrible!"]="Isto é horrível!"
G["This is horse poop!"]="Este acabalho está esgotado!"
G["This is how we live on, for all eternity."]="This is how we live on, for all eternity."
G["This is humiliating."]="Isto é humilhante."
G["This is impossible!"]="Isto é possível!"
G["This is incredible! You're covered in potent, virulent, fantastic blight! Please, allow me to harvest these pristine samples. I will remove any lingering infection from your allies as well, and reward you all for your bravery and self-sacrifice in the name of medicine! Let me know if you are ready to proceed.\n[Before proceeding, make sure that ALL raid members are nearby in order for them to receive credit for your accomplishment.]"]="This is incredible! You're covered in potent, virulent, fantastic blight! Please, allow me to harvest these pristine samples. I will remove any lingering infection from your allies as well, and reward you all for your bravery and self-sacrifice in the name of medicine! Let me know if you are ready to proceed.\n[Before proceeding, make sure that ALL raid members are nearby in order for them to receive credit for your accomplishment.]"
G["This is insufferable! I represent a nexus-prince, I am not to be made to wait! Goramosh should be waiting on me!"]="This is insufferable! I represent a nexus-prince, I am not to be made to wait! Goramosh should be waiting on me!"
G["This is it!  Brace yourself!"]="Além vamos! Prepare-se!"
G["This is it!  The perfect bio-fuel!  Good work, $n!"]="Este é! O biocombustible perfeito! Bom trabalho, $n!"
G["This is it! Stay close and let me do the talking. I'm an expert."]="Já estamos! Fique perto e de que hable eu. Sou o perito."
G["This is it! The entrance to Neptulon's realm..."]="Aqui está! A entrada ao reino de Neptulon..."
G["This is it! Their final assault! FOR LION'S LANDING!"]="Além vamos! O ataque fim! pelo DESEMBARCO DO LEÃO!"
G["This is it! They're making their final assault. There's no place to run. We hold Thundermar or die with hammer in hand.\n\nFor the Wildhammer!!"]="This is it! They're making their final assault. There's no place to run. We hold Thundermar or die with hammer in hand.\n\nFor the Wildhammer!!"
G["This is it! This is really it -- the Book of the Raven!"]="Este é! Este é mesmo – o Livro do Corvo!"
G["This is it! You've found Aviana's Egg! Keep it safe while I go get help."]="O conseguiu! Tem encontrado o ovo de Aviana! Protégelo enquanto busco ajuda."
G["This is it, $c! The revolution has come."]="Isso é, $c! A revolução chegou!"
G["This is it, $n!  This is where we make our stand!"]="Este é o momentos, $n! Aqui é onde plantaremos rosto!"
G["This is it, $n. My stuff should be in that room. Cover me, I'm going in!"]="Aqui é, $n. Meus coisas têm que estar em essa habitação. Cúbreme, vou entrar!"
G["This is it, $n. The start of the end of the world. And you're here to see it off..."]="This is it, $n. The start of the end of the world. And you're here to see it off..."
G["This is it, $n. We charge on your orders! Just say the word and my men and I will engage!"]="Já está, $n. Atacamos quando você digas! Da a ordem e meus homens e eu cargaremos!"
G["This is it, I just know it..."]="É este, o sei..."
G["This is it, Impsy. I can feel it! This is the big one!"]="This is it, Impsy. I can feel it! This is the big one!"
G["This is it. I can sense that this was once the site of great tragedy; mortal suffering still echoes through it. No doubt this is what the horrors beyond have seized onto.\n\nTo fully seal this intrusion into our world, I must first fully open it. I will need your strength to hold back whatever may attempt to come through.\n\nAre you prepared?"]="This is it. I can sense that this was once the site of great tragedy; mortal suffering still echoes through it. No doubt this is what the horrors beyond have seized onto.\n\nTo fully seal this intrusion into our world, I must first fully open it. I will need your strength to hold back whatever may attempt to come through.\n\nAre you prepared?"
G["This is just a warning, wench.  You strike one of us again and we'll kill you in your sleep."]="This is just a warning, wench.  You strike one of us again and we'll kill you in your sleep."
G["This is just horrible.\n\nI care not for our own discomforts here, but we must do something to ease the pain of the dead in the Bone Wastes!"]="This is just horrible.\n\nI care not for our own discomforts here, but we must do something to ease the pain of the dead in the Bone Wastes!"
G["This is just lovely, thank you!"]="É maravilhoso, Obrigado!"
G["This is just too easy..."]="Isto é demais fácil..."
G["This is just what I needed."]="This is just what I needed."
G["This is kind of cool. A day in the life of a... a silk-getting guy."]="Isto está chulo. Um dia na vida de um... tio que pegue seda."
G["This is known; and there are temples to mark these most sacred of places."]="Isto é sabido. E há templos marcando cada um destes locais sagrados."
G["This is laughable. You know what it's like trying to do business with gnomes."]="Isto é de riso. Já sabe o que é tentar fazer negócios com gnomos."
G["This is looking bleak for me."]="A coisa tá ficando feia pra mim."
G["This is madness!"]="Isto é uma loucura!"
G["This is madness! Cease this foolish battle!"]="This is madness! Cease this foolish battle!"
G["This is madness! I've had enough! ENOUGH!"]="Isto é uma loucura! Já basta! BASTA!"
G["This is magnificent!  I've never seen craftsmanship so fine."]="This is magnificent!  I've never seen craftsmanship so fine."
G["This is marbles and conkers!"]="Isto é de pirados!"
G["This is merely part of what Silvermoon once was. Much of the city was lost after Arthas swept through our lands."]="Isto é simplesmente parte do que Luaprata foi antanho. Grande parte da cidade se perdeu depois de que Arthas destruyera nossas terras."
G["This is more than I expected, $c. The Sunreaver Onslaught thanks you."]="Isto é mais do que esperava, $c. O Embate dos Atracasol te o agradece."
G["This is most strange. Shado-Pan are our best customers. We sell them supplies, and they keep us safe.\n\nWhy are they turning us away? This I do not understand."]="This is most strange. Shado-Pan are our best customers. We sell them supplies, and they keep us safe.\n\nWhy are they turning us away? This I do not understand."
G["This is most unfortunate."]="Isto é deveras lamentável."
G["This is much more relaxing than being on the speedbarge."]="This is much more relaxing than being on the speedbarge."
G["This is my favorite game, because of the turtle."]="Este jogo é meu favorito, pela tartaruga."
G["This is my gift to you: a gift, and a trial."]="Este é meu presente... Um presente e uma prova."
G["This is my home too!"]="Este também é meu lar!"
G["This is my question to you: What is the SOUL of the Horde?"]="É o que eu pergunto a você: o que é a ALMA da Horda?"
G["This is my stop!"]="Esta é meu aparo!"
G["This is my test gossip."]="This is my test gossip."
G["This is no business of yours, $p! I will allow you to leave."]="Isto não é do seu incumbência, $p! Te deixarei marchar."
G["This is no coincidence! Azeroth herself has cast her lot with the Horde!"]="Não é nenhuma coincidência! Azeroth se tem posto do lado da Horda!"
G["This is no good - too dangerous. We'll try again later!"]="Isto não pinta bem. Demais perigoso! Volveremos mais tarde."
G["This is no good, Scruffy. Stay here and guard the house, I need to go find a soldier."]="Isto não tem boa pinta, Desalinhado. Fique aqui e cuida da casa, tenho que encontrar a um soldado."
G["This is no place for a bright, young $g man : lady; such as yourself.\n\nPerhaps you would like for me to escort you to safety, hmm?"]="Este não é lugar para $gun rapaz: uma moça; brilhante como você.\n\nao melhor que que te escolte até um lugar certo, eh?"
G["This is no place for outsiders, stranger. Go back to Stormwind."]="Os estranhos não são bem-vindos aqui. Retorna a Ventobravo."
G["This is no small island, $n. It's a landmass that would likely rival Northrend!\n\nHow it has gone undiscovered is still a mystery."]="Isto não é uma simples ilha, $n. É um continente, provavelmente mais grande que Nortúndria.\n\nÉ um mistério que leve tanto tempo sem descobrir."
G["This is no time for talk! If those boats are destroyed, then the Alliance will keep fighting the Scourge in their home instead of the Lich King's! So make yourself useful and kill some undead!"]="This is no time for talk! If those boats are destroyed, then the Alliance will keep fighting the Scourge in their home instead of the Lich King's! So make yourself useful and kill some undead!"
G["This is no vacation - our hearts, our souls, the final escape from the addictions that bind us lie here on Quel'Danas."]="This is no vacation - our hearts, our souls, the final escape from the addictions that bind us lie here on Quel'Danas."
G["This is not a beast you will wish to fight alone, $n. Gather allies. I will open the beast's cage when you believe that you are ready."]="This is not a beast you will wish to fight alone, $n. Gather allies. I will open the beast's cage when you believe that you are ready."
G["This is not a construct break. Get back to work."]="Não é a hora de descanso para os construtos. Volta ao trabalho."
G["This is not a good start to relations between my people and your Horde."]="Este não é um bom início para as relações entre meu gente e seu Horda."
G["This is not going well..."]="Isso não está indo bem..."
G["This is not good, $n.  We have to find a way to hold on to Nahom."]="Isto não é bom, $n. Devemos encontrar a forma de permanecer em Nahom."
G["This is not how I was supposed to die!"]="Assim não é como deveria morrer!"
G["This is not how orcs fight! My duty to the Warchief wars with my personal honor. I hold no faith in your Light, but as you seem an advisor, I would hear your words."]="This is not how orcs fight! My duty to the Warchief wars with my personal honor. I hold no faith in your Light, but as you seem an advisor, I would hear your words."
G["This is not in my contract! Die, $r!"]="Isto não estava na minha contrato! Morre, $r!"
G["This is not my doing, Rommath. There is no treachery here."]="Isto não é culpar minha, Rommath. Não é uma traição."
G["This is not my fight, $p."]="Esta não é meu luta, $p."
G["This is not nearly over..."]="Isto não se tem terminado ainda!"
G["This is not our final rest."]="Este não é nosso descanso fim."
G["This is not over!"]="Ainda não se tem terminado!"
G["This is not over..."]="Isto não terminou..."
G["This is not right - this is not how it was supposed to end!"]="This is not right - this is not how it was supposed to end!"
G["This is not the end... death only... strengthens..."]="Este não é o fim... a morte somente... fortalece..."
G["This is not the last we have seen of Feng..."]="Não será a última vez que vamos ver a Feng..."
G["This is not the place to discuss such matters. Join me in the chambers beneath the Farstrider Square.\n\nOh, and come armed. I believe we will have need of your skills."]="This is not the place to discuss such matters. Join me in the chambers beneath the Farstrider Square.\n\nOh, and come armed. I believe we will have need of your skills."
G["This is not the place to explain. In short, your own doubts have been made manifest, as a consequence of your actions."]="Agora não dá para explicar. Em poucas palavras, suas dúvidas estão se manifestando fisicamente, como consequência das suas ações."
G["This is not what he was expecting at all."]="Isso não se o esperava."
G["This is not what was promised!"]="This is not what was promised!"
G["This is not your battle, dwarf. Back down or we will be forced to destroy your ship."]="Esta não é seu batalha, anão. Trás ou teremos que destruir seu navio."
G["This is not your fight, stranger. Protect yourself from the attacks of the Crimson Elite. I shall battle the Grand Inquisitor."]="This is not your fight, stranger. Protect yourself from the attacks of the Crimson Elite. I shall battle the Grand Inquisitor."
G["This is not your mule."]="Esta mula não é sua."
G["This is nothing at all like the Shimmering Flats."]="Não há nada como O Deserto de Saia."
G["This is okay; but not really what I wanted, shouldn't the chef know what I want?"]="Isto me gosta, mas não é o prato que pedí. Tão difícil é lembrar o pedido?"
G["This is one of our less productive colossal disasters."]="This is one of our less productive colossal disasters."
G["This is only what you once asked me to do if it came to this, Kanrethad. You brought this on yourself."]="Isso foi o que você me pediu que fizesse se chegasse a isso, Kanrethad. É tudo culpa sua."
G["This is our chance boys!  Push!"]="This is our chance boys!  Push!"
G["This is our chance!  Run for it!"]="Esta é nossa oportunidade! A correr!"
G["This is our final stand. What happens here will echo through the ages. Regardless of outcome, they will know that we fought with honor. That we fought for the freedom and safety of our people!"]="This is our final stand. What happens here will echo through the ages. Regardless of outcome, they will know that we fought with honor. That we fought for the freedom and safety of our people!"
G["This is our final stand. What happens here will echo through the ages. Regardless of outcome, they will know that we fought with honor. That we fought for the freedom and safety of our people.\n\nRemember, hero, fear is your greatest enemy in these befouled halls. Steel your heart and your soul will shine brighter than a thousand suns. The enemy will falter at the sight of you. They will fall as the light of righteousness envelops them!"]="This is our final stand. What happens here will echo through the ages. Regardless of outcome, they will know that we fought with honor. That we fought for the freedom and safety of our people.\n\nRemember, hero, fear is your greatest enemy in these befouled halls. Steel your heart and your soul will shine brighter than a thousand suns. The enemy will falter at the sight of you. They will fall as the light of righteousness envelops them!"
G["This is our home too! You can't do this!"]="Este também é nosso lar! Não podem fazer isto!"
G["This is our home!"]="Este é nosso lar!"
G["This is our land -- they're not going to take it away without a fight!"]="Esta é nossa terra. Não vamos deixar que se a que ninguém sem lutar!"
