G["This is really hard!"]="Isto é muito difícil!"
G["This is reckless, even for Ji. I need to stop him. Are you coming?"]="This is reckless, even for Ji. I need to stop him. Are you coming?"
G["This is ridiculous!  I don't have to put up with this!"]="This is ridiculous!  I don't have to put up with this!"
