G["This is sacred ground!"]="Isto é sozinho sagrado!"
G["This is so delicious!"]="This is so delicious!"
G["This is so easy it would be boring -- if it weren't so much fun."]="Isso é tão fácil que seria chato – se não fosse tão divertido."
G["This is some specialized equipment! Don't be handling it carelessly, and of course don't try and operate the thing if you've had too much of that volatile rum I hear you like so much...\n\nSpeaking of which... you don't happen to have any of that nasty stuff, do you?"]="This is some specialized equipment! Don't be handling it carelessly, and of course don't try and operate the thing if you've had too much of that volatile rum I hear you like so much...\n\nSpeaking of which... you don't happen to have any of that nasty stuff, do you?"
G["This is terrible! How will we ever defeat the Zandalari?"]="Isto é terrível! Como poderemos derrotar aos Zandalari?"
G["This is terrible, Durak! Hellscream is conviced there's a demon behind our work here! What can we do?!"]="Isto é terrível, Durak! Grito Infernal está convencido de que há um demônio atrás nossas ações! O que podemos fazer?"
G["This is terrible..... my arms grow tired from beating on you lazy peons!"]="This is terrible..... my arms grow tired from beating on you lazy peons!"
G["This is the Alterac Valley battlefield.  Both sides are still fighting."]="Este é o campo de batalha do Vale Alterac. Os dois bandos seguem combatendo."
G["This is the Alterac Valley battlefield.  Currently both sides are at odds."]="Este é o campo de batalha do Vale Alterac. Os dois bandos estão em liza."
G["This is the Song of Liu Lang, the first pandaren explorer."]="Esta é a canto de Liu Lang, o primeiro explorador pandaren."
G["This is the Temple of Earth.  It's the most important structure in Deepholm."]="This is the Temple of Earth.  It's the most important structure in Deepholm."
G["This is the Thunder King Raid!"]="Esta é a Raide do Rei do Trovão!"
G["This is the Trade Prince's party, sweetie. Invite only!"]="Esta é a festa do Príncipe do Comércio, querida. Convide apenas!"
G["This is the Training Ground, where most of your training will take place.  Come, I will introduce you to the masters who will be teaching you."]="This is the Training Ground, where most of your training will take place.  Come, I will introduce you to the masters who will be teaching you."
G["This is the Wanderer's Festival, $n! Where pandaren with the spirit of adventure gather to celebrate the first explorer to venture beyond the mists.\n\nIt's a time of contemplation and song. Thank you for joining us!"]="This is the Wanderer's Festival, $n! Where pandaren with the spirit of adventure gather to celebrate the first explorer to venture beyond the mists.\n\nIt's a time of contemplation and song. Thank you for joining us!"
G["This is the answer to the first question of the first chain."]="Esta é a resposta à primeira pergunta da primeira cadeia."
G["This is the beginning AND the end, mortals. None may enter the master's sanctum!"]="Este é o início E o fim, mortais. Ninguém pode entrar no sacrário do mestre!"
G["This is the best I've felt in years!"]="Fazia anos que não me sentia tão bem!"
G["This is the best!"]="Esta é a melhor!"
G["This is the biggest sword ever!"]="Esta é a lâmina mais grande que tem existido nunca!"
G["This is the brazier, $n. Put it out. Vorsha is a beast, worthy of praise from no one!"]="This is the brazier, $n. Put it out. Vorsha is a beast, worthy of praise from no one!"
G["This is the chamber we're looking for."]="Esta é a câmera que buscamos."
G["This is the closest any outsider has come to the Engine of Nalak'sha."]="This is the closest any outsider has come to the Engine of Nalak'sha."
G["This is the difference between me and you, Vol'jin. I won't let MY people starve to death in the desert. I will stop at nothing - NOTHING - to ensure a proud and glorious future for the orcs and anyone with the courage to stand with us. Wait here."]="This is the difference between me and you, Vol'jin. I won't let MY people starve to death in the desert. I will stop at nothing - NOTHING - to ensure a proud and glorious future for the orcs and anyone with the courage to stand with us. Wait here."
G["This is the end of the line, no friend of mine!"]="Este é o fim da linha, nenhum amigo meu!"
G["This is the end of the line, pal!"]="Aqui se acabao caminho, colegas!"
G["This is the end!"]="Este é o fim!"
G["This is the end."]="É o fim."
G["This is the end... for you, and for the world."]="Isto é o fim... para você e para o mundo."
G["This is the finish line. After you have flown through all 10 checkpoints, fly under the finish line to lock in your place."]="This is the finish line. After you have flown through all 10 checkpoints, fly under the finish line to lock in your place."
G["This is the first time I've ever seen anything like it."]="É pela primeira vez que vejo algo assim."
G["This is the gateway that Kael's armies used to retreat to the Sunwell.  Some of his lapdogs remain here; the Legion has rewarded them in a most... unusual way."]="Este é o portal que os exércitos de Kael costumavam se retirar para a Sunwell. Alguns dos seus cachorros permanecem aqui; a Legião os recompensou da maneira mais... incomum."
G["This is the hallowed birthplace of Chi-Ji, the Red Crane, the Southern Celestial. Followers and acolytes of Chi-Ji gather in this place to train their bodies, to hone their minds, to duel one another, and to better themselves in the eyes of the Red Crane.\n\nYou are welcome to join us in our training, $c. Bring with you a stout heart and a stout staff."]="This is the hallowed birthplace of Chi-Ji, the Red Crane, the Southern Celestial. Followers and acolytes of Chi-Ji gather in this place to train their bodies, to hone their minds, to duel one another, and to better themselves in the eyes of the Red Crane.\n\nYou are welcome to join us in our training, $c. Bring with you a stout heart and a stout staff."
G["This is the hour of our greatest triumph!"]="Esta é a hora de nosso maior triunfo!"
G["This is the kind of spirit I expected to see when we joined the Horde!"]="Esse é o espírito que esperava ver quando nos unimos à Horda!"
G["This is the last of them.  Don't get sloppy!"]="This is the last of them.  Don't get sloppy!"
G["This is the last one that I need for the set of Nesingwary steak knives!"]="This is the last one that I need for the set of Nesingwary steak knives!"
G["This is the last time I get caught! I promise! Bye!"]="This is the last time I get caught! I promise! Bye!"
G["This is the last time that I buy second-hand equipment from an ethereal!"]="É a última vez que compro materiais de segunda mão de um etéreo!"
G["This is the longest day of my life."]="Este é o dia mais longo da minha vida."
G["This is the might of Harthak!"]="Este é o poder dos Harthak!"
G["This is the moment of destiny! On the other side, a new beginning awaits. A new enemy to slaughter. You can feel it, can you not? The bloodlust rising? Follow Blackhand! Listen to his orders and you will rule this new world as is your right! It is your world on the other side of the portal. Take it!"]="This is the moment of destiny! On the other side, a new beginning awaits. A new enemy to slaughter. You can feel it, can you not? The bloodlust rising? Follow Blackhand! Listen to his orders and you will rule this new world as is your right! It is your world on the other side of the portal. Take it!"
G["This is the moment we've all been waiting for! The Warmaul champion is about to make his first showing at the Ring of Blood in weeks! Will $n go down in defeat as easily as the champion's other opponents? We shall see..."]="This is the moment we've all been waiting for! The Warmaul champion is about to make his first showing at the Ring of Blood in weeks! Will $n go down in defeat as easily as the champion's other opponents? We shall see..."
G["This is the most bountiful land in all of Pandaria! A smart man could grow rich here!"]="This is the most bountiful land in all of Pandaria! A smart man could grow rich here!"
G["This is the most moronic... half-assed... ridiculous plan you've ever come up with, Budd!"]="Esse seu plano... É cilada, Bino!"
G["This is the most pathetic bunch of peons I've ever seen! Where's my booterang?"]="Este é o grupo de peões mais patético que vi na minha vida! Onde está meu botarangue?"
G["This is the new beginning. Rejoice in your coming doom."]="Este é o novo início. Regocijaos no seu fim."
G["This is the old Imperial Road. They say the mogu empire used to bring their prisoners here for torture."]="This is the old Imperial Road. They say the mogu empire used to bring their prisoners here for torture."
G["This is the one. The ancient will be ours."]="Este é. O ancestral será nosso."
G["This is the only button I haven't pushed yet. Let's give it a try!"]="Este é o único botão que não e pulsado ainda. Probémoslo!"
G["This is the only way Harry will even talk to me! I have to keep this stupid mask on all the time..."]="Esta é a única maneira de Harry falar comigo! Eu tenho que manter essa máscara estúpida o tempo tudo..."
G["This is the part I enjoy most..."]="This is the part I enjoy most..."
G["This is the place, $r: The Cauldron! Mark it on a map or do something so that you don't forget. If anything ever happened to me, my team would be stuck in that mine forever."]="This is the place, $r: The Cauldron! Mark it on a map or do something so that you don't forget. If anything ever happened to me, my team would be stuck in that mine forever."
G["This is the place. Let's light it."]="This is the place. Let's light it."
G["This is the place. Samuelson's files should be on the third floor, all the way up the spiral staircase."]="This is the place. Samuelson's files should be on the third floor, all the way up the spiral staircase."
G["This is the price you pay!"]="This is the price you pay!"
G["This is the quality of assassin sent to kill me? Laughable."]="Esta é a qualidade dos assassinos que têm enviada a me matar? Me parto de riso."
G["This is the ring where the champions practice fighting each other. It's my job to summon the knights to their practice battles."]="Este é o anel em que os campeões praticam a luta entre si. É meu trabalho convocar os cavaleiros para as suas batalhas de prática."
G["This is the ship that took down Deathwing. You think some raggedy little Horde outpost stands a chance against the pride of the Alliance fleet? NO!"]="This is the ship that took down Deathwing. You think some raggedy little Horde outpost stands a chance against the pride of the Alliance fleet? NO!"
G["This is the tale of A Little Patience!\n\nIt was here that the king of men, Varian Wrynn, counseled patience to Tyrande Whisperwind, high priestess of the night elf's moon goddess and leader of their people.\n\nKing Varian's plan -- and the work of three bold adventurers! -- saw to an Alliance victory at the temple of the Red Crane, despite being vastly outnumbered by Commander Scargash's Horde forces."]="This is the tale of A Little Patience!\n\nIt was here that the king of men, Varian Wrynn, counseled patience to Tyrande Whisperwind, high priestess of the night elf's moon goddess and leader of their people.\n\nKing Varian's plan -- and the work of three bold adventurers! -- saw to an Alliance victory at the temple of the Red Crane, despite being vastly outnumbered by Commander Scargash's Horde forces."
G["This is the tale of the Dagger in the Dark!\n\nIt was here that three bold adventurers saved Vol'jin, leader of the Horde's Darkspear trolls, from certain assassination."]="This is the tale of the Dagger in the Dark!\n\nIt was here that three bold adventurers saved Vol'jin, leader of the Horde's Darkspear trolls, from certain assassination."
G["This is the tale of the Hungry Crocolisk."]="This is the tale of the Hungry Crocolisk."
G["This is the technique of a Blade Lord."]="Esta é a técnica de um Senhor das Espadas."
G["This is the test put before you this day. Return to us only once The Iron Watcher is dead, and be revered as a warrior of the frostborn."]="This is the test put before you this day. Return to us only once The Iron Watcher is dead, and be revered as a warrior of the frostborn."
G["This is the tower of Karazhan and residence of my master, Medivh. As a humble doorman, there is little else I can explain to you."]="Esta é a torre de Karazhan e a residência do meu mestre, Medivh. Como um porteiro humilde, há pouco mais que eu possa lhe explicar."
G["This is the truth of it! Fighting leads to killing, and killing leads to warring. And that was nearly the end of all our customers!\n\nNow, when men get to fighting, it happens here. And it finishes here! For maximum viewing potential!"]="This is the truth of it! Fighting leads to killing, and killing leads to warring. And that was nearly the end of all our customers!\n\nNow, when men get to fighting, it happens here. And it finishes here! For maximum viewing potential!"
G["This is the very first thing I say to the player.  Huzzah!"]="Isto é o primeiro que lhe digo ao jogador. Genial!"
G["This is the worst contraption anyone ever devised!"]="This is the worst contraption anyone ever devised!"
G["This is the wrong way. Arconus is at the other end of the mine. You're not chickening out, are you, fleshling? I won't follow a coward."]="This is the wrong way. Arconus is at the other end of the mine. You're not chickening out, are you, fleshling? I won't follow a coward."
G["This is their destiny...."]="Este é seu destino..."
G["This is their natural breeding ground. We must tread carefully."]="Este é seu território de filhote natural. Devemos andar com cuidado."
G["This is too big, though.  If the naga aren't stopped, our expedition won't even matter.  Word must be sent back to the Arch Druids of the Circle."]="This is too big, though.  If the naga aren't stopped, our expedition won't even matter.  Word must be sent back to the Arch Druids of the Circle."
G["This is too easy!"]="Isto é demais fácil!"
G["This is too easy."]="Isto é demais fácil."
G["This is truly grave. We must find the true cause of this illness, for the sake of the land."]="Isto é como uma tumba. Devemos encontrar o origem desta doença, pelo bem desta terra."
G["This is undoubtedly Godfrey's fault."]="Isto é culpar de Godfrey. Certo."
G["This is unforseen.  The being who enchanted this is known to me..."]="Isto é inesperado. O ser que encantó isto me resulta conhecido..."
G["This is unfortunate."]="Isso é uma infelicidade."
G["This is usually a calm stop. Now look at it. Where did all of these yaungol come from?"]="This is usually a calm stop. Now look at it. Where did all of these yaungol come from?"
G["This is war, Dame Auriferous, and in any war lives will be lost! The only areas that we need to secure are the two ziggurats. We will turtle in and take the Tower of the Damned and its master by brute force. Then you will have your Quel'Thalas."]="Isto é a guerra, Dama Aurífera, e na guerra se perderão muitas vidas! As únicos áreas que temos que garantir são os dois zigurates. Nos colaremos dentro e ocuparemos a Torre dos Condenados e derrocaremos ao seu senhor pela força. Então terá seu Quel'thalas."
G["This is welcome news indeed. I shall pass along your gratitude to our commanders back on Azeroth."]="This is welcome news indeed. I shall pass along your gratitude to our commanders back on Azeroth."
G["This is what I have gathered from the information that you collected from the survey.\n\nThere are two primary forge camps: Forge Camp: Hate, directly west of where we stand and Forge Camp: Fear, directly southwest. Each camp has a Legion transporter, one forge, and several spell warding towers. Additionally, the camps are guarded by wrathguards manning fel cannons. Lastly, each camp has a pit lord overseer.\n\nRight then, this should be no problem at all...\n\n<Altruis laughs.>"]="This is what I have gathered from the information that you collected from the survey.\n\nThere are two primary forge camps: Forge Camp: Hate, directly west of where we stand and Forge Camp: Fear, directly southwest. Each camp has a Legion transporter, one forge, and several spell warding towers. Additionally, the camps are guarded by wrathguards manning fel cannons. Lastly, each camp has a pit lord overseer.\n\nRight then, this should be no problem at all...\n\n<Altruis laughs.>"
G["This is what happen when you get lazy."]="Isto é o que passa quando faz o vago."
G["This is what happens when southerners come to our lands."]="This is what happens when southerners come to our lands."
G["This is what the mantid have taught us."]="Foi isso que os mantídeos nos ensinaram."
G["This is where I get off, suckers!"]="This is where I get off, suckers!"
G["This is where it matters, hero. You may signal to me when you are ready to press the attack. Oh, and, do try to keep Lady Sylvanas in line, would you?"]="This is where it matters, hero. You may signal to me when you are ready to press the attack. Oh, and, do try to keep Lady Sylvanas in line, would you?"
G["This is where my agents tracked the Zandalari."]="This is where my agents tracked the Zandalari."
G["This is where she stood, heroes, and this is where she fell. The time-lost echo of Sylvanas Windrunner will reverberate through the rotting limbs of the Dragonshrine for all eternity."]="This is where she stood, heroes, and this is where she fell. The time-lost echo of Sylvanas Windrunner will reverberate through the rotting limbs of the Dragonshrine for all eternity."
G["This is where the cultists' orders are coming from.  Their leader is bound to show up soon.\n\nLet's not miss this opportunity."]="De aqui é de onde vêm as ordens dos cultistas. Seu líder aparecerá pronto.\n\nNão dejemos passar esta oportunidade."
G["This is where things get interesting.  My plan is to follow the mountail wall, keeping it to our left.  That way, we won't get lost in the jungle and we'll cut down on the hostiles.  You ready?"]="This is where things get interesting.  My plan is to follow the mountail wall, keeping it to our left.  That way, we won't get lost in the jungle and we'll cut down on the hostiles.  You ready?"
G["This is where we gather the surivors to prepare them for decontamination. From there, it's just a short trip to the surface!"]="É aqui que reunimos os sobreviventes para prepará-os para a descontaminação. A partir daí, é apenas uma curta viagem à superfície!"
G["This is where we make our stand!"]="This is where we make our stand!"
G["This is where we play a movie of you turning into a worgen!  We also flash-forward to the present!"]="This is where we play a movie of you turning into a worgen!  We also flash-forward to the present!"
G["This is where you'd expect something to go wrong on a beautiful trip like this."]="Aqui é onde um se espera que algo vá mal em um viagem tão estupendo como este."
G["This is why we call you lesser beings!"]="Por isto os chamamos seres inferior!"
G["This is wonderful!"]="Isto é maravilhoso!"
G["This is worse than I suspected."]="Isto é pior do que achava."
G["This is wrong. It is not yet time to swarm."]="Isto está mal. Não é época de enxame."
G["This is your fault!"]="Isto é culpar sua!"
G["This is your first trip up Neverest? It's mine too!"]="É pela primeira vez que veio a Nieverest? Eu também!"
G["This is your idea of doing the right thing???"]="Este é seu concepto de fazer o correto?"
G["This is your moment, Shado-Pan!  This is everything that you've trained for!"]="This is your moment, Shado-Pan!  This is everything that you've trained for!"
G["This is your standard fireball."]="This is your standard fireball."
G["This is your stop, pal. Safe landing!"]="Esta é seu aparo, colega. Que tenha um aterrizagem certo!"
G["This is..."]="Isto é..."
G["This is... Silvermoon? My head... Next time Bloodvalor needs a volunteer, I'll point him in a different direction. Paragon of Blood Knight virtue, indeed!"]="This is... Silvermoon? My head... Next time Bloodvalor needs a volunteer, I'll point him in a different direction. Paragon of Blood Knight virtue, indeed!"
G["This is... remarkable, $n! These notes provide invaluable knowledge to our farmers. We are truly in Old Man Thistle's debt for keeping such records, and in your debt for recovering them. Thank you!"]="This is... remarkable, $n! These notes provide invaluable knowledge to our farmers. We are truly in Old Man Thistle's debt for keeping such records, and in your debt for recovering them. Thank you!"
G["This is... where I belong."]="Este é... meu lugar."
G["This is... worse... than death..."]="Isto é... pior... que a morte..."
G["This island holds many secrets that have yet to be uncovered."]="Esta ilha abriga muitos segredos que ainda estão por descobrir."
G["This island is equal parts fascinating and terrifying."]="Esta ilha é fascinante e aterradora a partes iguales."
G["This island is home to a very powerful magic. If we can harness it, no one will be able to stand in our way."]="This island is home to a very powerful magic. If we can harness it, no one will be able to stand in our way."
G["This island will make a perfect coastal stronghold. Rokla! When the peons arrive, clear these trees and begin construction of the docks."]="This island will make a perfect coastal stronghold. Rokla! When the peons arrive, clear these trees and begin construction of the docks."
G["This isle can be strange, can it not? Is there something I can do for you?"]="Esta ilha pode ser estranha, não pode? Existe algo que eu possa fazer por você?"
G["This isn't Silvermoon City! Where are we? Oh, I was confused there for a moment."]="Isto não é Luaprata! Onde estamos? Oh, me confundí um instantaneamente."
G["This isn't a field trip, maggot!  You're in the Outland now!  Shape up or take a stroll back through the portal."]="Esta não é uma viagem de campo, larva! Você está no Outland agora! Modele-se ou dê um passeio de volta pelo portal."
G["This isn't a game you toy with youngling! Go, speak with Snarl outside. He may be a serpent in my lair but he does know his way around an anvil."]="Este não é um jogo com o qual você brinca! Vá, fale com Snarl lá fosse. Ele pode ser uma serpente no meu covil, mas ele conhece o caminho de uma bigorna."
G["This isn't a weapon! It's just a book!"]="Mas se isso não é um arma! Não é mais que um livro!"
G["This isn't easy."]="Isto não é fácil."
G["This isn't fair!  My dearest Sully!  Come back to me!  No, $n!  Why did you bring me such news!"]="This isn't fair!  My dearest Sully!  Come back to me!  No, $n!  Why did you bring me such news!"
G["This isn't footbomb, kids. This is the real deal!"]="Isto não é futebomba, pessoal. Isto é de verdade."
G["This isn't getting any easier. Stratholme is burning. We must brave the Scourge and the flames to reach Mal'Ganis. Prepare yourselves."]="Isso não está ficando mais fácil. Stratholme está queimando. Devemos enfrentar o flagelo e as chamas para alcançar Mal'Ganis. Preparem-se."
G["This isn't going to end well."]="Isto não vai acabar bem..."
G["This isn't happening. Oh no... my friends!"]="Isto não pode estar passando. Oh, não... Meus amigos!"
G["This isn't helping!"]="Isto não serve!"
G["This isn't honorable combat. I long to face my opponents in battle with my axe in hand!"]="This isn't honorable combat. I long to face my opponents in battle with my axe in hand!"
G["This isn't how it ends. Not for me. I'm a survivor."]="Assim não é como acaba. Não para mim. Sou uma sobrevivente."
G["This isn't lookin' good, lads!"]="Isto não tem boa pinta, pessoal."
G["This isn't looking good, boss."]="Isso não parece bom, chefe."
G["This isn't over!"]="Isso ainda não acabou!"
G["This isn't over, $n.  Not by a long shot."]="Isto não terminou, $n. Nem de longe."
G["This isn't over, Baine..."]="Isto não terminou, Baine..."
G["This isn't quite what I signed up for, but hey... at least it's warm here."]="Não foi exatamente para isso que me inscrevi, mas ei... pelo menos está quente aqui."
G["This isn't right at all, $n. In the tale Wind Tamer Barah told me, Stormhoof was a hero, not a villain."]="This isn't right at all, $n. In the tale Wind Tamer Barah told me, Stormhoof was a hero, not a villain."
G["This isn't right."]="E'to não e'tá bem."
G["This isn't supposed to happen!"]="Isto não tinha que passar!"
G["This isn't the biggest job I've done, not even close. This cataclysm may just be the best thing that ever happened to us!"]="Este não é o maior trabalho que já fiz, nem mesmo perto. Esse Cataclismo pode ser a melhor coisa que já aconteceu conosco!"
G["This isn't the end; it can't be!"]="Este não é o fim; não pode ser!"
G["This isn't the kind of place to raise your kids. It's cold, and there'd be no one to raise them."]="This isn't the kind of place to raise your kids. It's cold, and there'd be no one to raise them."
G["This isn't the last of them! $C, help us drive them back!"]="This isn't the last of them! $C, help us drive them back!"
G["This isn't the same, father. The sha cannot simply be defeated. It feeds on our inner-most weaknesses. It twists our thoughts. Don't underestimate it!"]="This isn't the same, father. The sha cannot simply be defeated. It feeds on our inner-most weaknesses. It twists our thoughts. Don't underestimate it!"
G["This jade shortage is the worst thing to happen since the golden autumn crisis. Production is already months behind. The Serpent ain't getting any younger!"]="This jade shortage is the worst thing to happen since the golden autumn crisis. Production is already months behind. The Serpent ain't getting any younger!"
G["This job is definitely not worth sixteen-five a year."]="Esse trabalho definitivamente não vale dezesseis e cinco por ano."
G["This job is well-suited for you, Duarn.  I must attend to matters outside."]="Este trabalho te vem ao cabelo, Duarn. Eu devo cuidar de outros assuntos no exterior."
G["This journal is written in dwarven. I can't read this scrawl, but I can make out one thing."]="Este diário está escrito em enánico. Não posso ler estes rabiscos, mas há uma coisa que si entendo."
G["This jungle is filled with an unnatural sense of dispair."]="Esta selva está cheia de uma sensação sobrenatural de desesperação."
G["This jungle is going to be the end of us all."]="Esta selva será o fim de todos nós."
G["This jungle is making me depressed."]="This jungle is making me depressed."
G["This jungle is nice and humid compared to the arid deserts of Uldum."]="This jungle is nice and humid compared to the arid deserts of Uldum."
G["This jungle will soon be cleansed of Alliance filth!"]="This jungle will soon be cleansed of Alliance filth!"
G["This just happens to be your lucky day; I just completed Super-Seller 680's maintenance. There are tons of items for sell at great low-low prices. Go ahead and see for yourself... my brother Cork thinks his Vendor-Tron 1000 will out sell my bot."]="Este é apenas o seu dia de sorte; Acabei de concluir a manutenção do Super-vendedor 680. Existem toneladas de itens para vender a preços baixos-baixos. Vá em linha de frente e veja por si mesmo... meu irmão Cork acha que seu Vendor-Tron 1000 vai vender meu bot."
G["This kind of work isn't for the faint of heart. I have an uncle who lost a hand! Poor old Stumpy... anyway, if you're still interested I might be able to show you a few things."]="Esse tipo de trabalho não é para os fracos de coração. Eu tenho um tio que perdeu a mão! Pobre e velho Stumpy... de qualquer forma, se você ainda estiver interessado, talvez eu possa lhe mostrar algumas coisas."
G["This kingdom belongs to the Scourge. Only the dead may enter!"]="Este reino pertence a o Flagelo. Somente os mortos podem passar!"
G["This knowledge is useless... what are you trying to achieve, Kanrethad?"]="Este conhecimento é inútil... o que você está tentando fazer, Kanrethad?"
G["This kodo sure looks nothing like the beast I originally lured!  I wonder if the kombobulator can be used on me."]="Esse kodo com certeza não se parece em nada com a fera que eu originalmente atraí! Gostaria de saber se o kombobulator pode ser usado em mim."
G["This lack of knowledge is just one more weakness among many. There is little hope against the power of death itself."]="Esta falta de conhecimento somente é uma fraqueza mais entre outras muitas. Há pouca esperança contra o poder da própria morte."
G["This land belongs to the Alliance, Horde wretch! Away with you!"]="This land belongs to the Alliance, Horde wretch! Away with you!"
G["This land belongs to the Dark Iron Dwarves.  Prepare to see the afterlife, $C!"]="Esta terra pertence aos anões Ferro Negro. Prepare-se para uma visite ao além, $c!"
G["This land belongs to the Defias Brotherhood now!"]="Agora esta terra pertence à Guilda Défias!"
G["This land belongs to the Horde!  Attack!"]="Esta terra pertence à Horda! Ataquem!"
G["This land has been ravaged by the crash. While you may not follow our philosophies, $c, I urge you to do whatever you can to aid in the healing process."]="This land has been ravaged by the crash. While you may not follow our philosophies, $c, I urge you to do whatever you can to aid in the healing process."
G["This land has endured much, and yet it thrives in the wake of the worldbreaker. You will find that my pets possess similar fortitude."]="Esta terra tem sofrido muito, mas continua adiante atrás a irrupção do Rompemundos. Verá que meus ajudantes são igual de resistentes."
G["This land is - different than ours. It's a treasure."]="Esta terra é... diferente à nossa. É um tesouro."
G["This land is freezing, but I am warm, blanketed in the glow of the Holy Light. Do not be disheartened."]="A terra se você está congelando, mas eu sinto calor, pois estou coberto com o manto da Luz Sagrado. Não te rindas."
G["This land is ours now!"]="Agora esta terra é nossa!"
G["This land is rich in resources, $n. I am preparing a detailed report for our return."]="Esta terra é rica em recurso, $n. Estou preparando um relatório detalhado para quando voltemos."
G["This land is soft like you."]="Esta terra é fraco como vocês."
G["This land is tainted. Ivus must be called!"]="Esta terra estar contaminada. Ivus deve ser chamado!"
G["This land is where orcs and humans first spilled each other's blood. Not a mile south lurks Stonard, where the orcs first grouped to invade our lands.\n\nIt was here they amassed their armies before we even knew they existed. It was here that they started the first of three wars with their attack on a small Alliance town to the west.\n\nMy town. The town where my parents died to save me.\n\nBut I'm not here to settle a grudge... I'm here to win a war."]="This land is where orcs and humans first spilled each other's blood. Not a mile south lurks Stonard, where the orcs first grouped to invade our lands.\n\nIt was here they amassed their armies before we even knew they existed. It was here that they started the first of three wars with their attack on a small Alliance town to the west.\n\nMy town. The town where my parents died to save me.\n\nBut I'm not here to settle a grudge... I'm here to win a war."
G["This land must be made ready for the fleet.\n\nNo excuses!"]="Esta terra precisa estar pronta para a frota.\n\nNão há excusas!"
G["This land once belonged to the great jinyu empire. As our kingdom has fallen into disrepair, we have lost more and more land to the relentless hozen tribes."]="This land once belonged to the great jinyu empire. As our kingdom has fallen into disrepair, we have lost more and more land to the relentless hozen tribes."
G["This land shall be purged in the Twilight's Flame!"]="A Chama do Crepúsculo purgará esta terra!"
G["This land still bears the scars of the past. I wonder if they will ever heal."]="Esta terra ainda carrega as cicatrizes do passado. Eu me pergunto se eles vão se curar."
G["This land truly needs to be cleansed by the Light!  Let us continue on to the tomb.  It isn't far now."]="Mesmo esta terra precisa ser limpiada pela Luz! Sigamos até a tumba. Já não está muito longe."
G["This land was mine long before your wretched kind set foot here."]="This land was mine long before your wretched kind set foot here."
G["This land will be your grave."]="Esta terra será seu tumba."
G["This land will quiver and shake in the wake of our destruction!"]="Esta terra temblará e se sacudirá baixo nossa destruição!"
G["This land, it belongs to us..."]="Ela pertence a nós..."
G["This large jack-o'-lantern rests in the middle of the village."]="Este grande jack-o'-lantern fica no meio da vila."
G["This latest affront by the Lich King must be dealt with. Stormwind is doing what we can, but it will require the effort of everyone to overcome. Only after the threat at home has passed can we begin to deal with the Scourge threat abroad.\n\nThe traitor prince Arthas tests us from his seat of power in Northrend. Rest assured that the Alliance will not sit on its haunches. Preparations are already underway... for war.\n\nDefeating the Lich King and his armies will be a long and challenging ordeal. Death itself must be conquered. Many lives will be lost, but the future of Azeroth depends on our victory.\n\nI only hope that you'll be able to join the battle in Northrend and contribute your skill and strength to the cause."]="This latest affront by the Lich King must be dealt with. Stormwind is doing what we can, but it will require the effort of everyone to overcome. Only after the threat at home has passed can we begin to deal with the Scourge threat abroad.\n\nThe traitor prince Arthas tests us from his seat of power in Northrend. Rest assured that the Alliance will not sit on its haunches. Preparations are already underway... for war.\n\nDefeating the Lich King and his armies will be a long and challenging ordeal. Death itself must be conquered. Many lives will be lost, but the future of Azeroth depends on our victory.\n\nI only hope that you'll be able to join the battle in Northrend and contribute your skill and strength to the cause."
G["This latest sample is unique.  What is its history?"]="Esta última mostra é única. Qual é seu história?"
G["This lava hot."]="Esta lava quente."
G["This library holds thousands of years of history and lore. The greatest knowledge in all of Pandaria is kept here.\n\nThat is why we must keep this great treasure safe."]="This library holds thousands of years of history and lore. The greatest knowledge in all of Pandaria is kept here.\n\nThat is why we must keep this great treasure safe."
G["This library should prove to be useful to my own research."]="Esta biblioteca será útil para meu própria investigação."
G["This lifeboat appears to be abandoned.  Maybe it belongs to some of the nearby pirates?"]="This lifeboat appears to be abandoned.  Maybe it belongs to some of the nearby pirates?"
G["This likeness of the Horn of Hodir stands in memorial of King Arngrim and all others lost in the battle of Thunderfall."]="Essa semelhança do Corno de Hodir fica em memória do rei Arngrim e de todos os outros perdidos na batalha de Thunderfall."
G["This line is mostly filler..."]="This line is mostly filler..."
G["This little one shall vex me no longer."]="$gEste pequeno: Esta pequena; não me irritará mais!"
G["This lock should be easy enough to pick."]="Esta cerradura não deveria ser difícil de forçar."
G["This lock... it is more complicated than I thought..."]="A cerradura é mais complicada do que achava..."
G["This looks good, but I think it'll look even better if we beat it up a little bit.  You know, to sell the illusion of a fight.  What do you think?"]="Parece bom, mas acho que ficará ainda melhor se batermos um pouco. Você sabe, para vender a ilusão de uma luta. O que você acha?"
G["This looks like a good perch. Mark the target and signal me when you've sighted the broodmother and are ready to attack."]="This looks like a good perch. Mark the target and signal me when you've sighted the broodmother and are ready to attack."
G["This looks like the perfect place for a nap..."]="This looks like the perfect place for a nap..."
G["This looks pretty good... but it burns too long!  I need to be able to stop the fire instantly.  Cut back on hammerhead oil next time."]="This looks pretty good... but it burns too long!  I need to be able to stop the fire instantly.  Cut back on hammerhead oil next time."
G["This looks suspicious. I can't let you in."]="This looks suspicious. I can't let you in."
G["This looks to be the record of Qiang the Merciless, a great conqueror who ruled his vassals with an iron fist!"]="This looks to be the record of Qiang the Merciless, a great conqueror who ruled his vassals with an iron fist!"
G["This lots of gold! Me look other way."]="Isto ser muito ouro! Eu olhar para outro lado."
G["This machine will be your undoing. PH"]="This machine will be your undoing. PH"
G["This man-child, Arthas, took for himself a cursed blade known as Frostmourne."]="Este jovem, Arthas, se aduenhó de uma lâmina maldito chamada Agonia de Gelo."
G["This mastiff will help you find the hidden worgen."]="This mastiff will help you find the hidden worgen."
G["This match is sure to be SHORT! Okay, okay, I'm done. Let the bloodbath begin!"]="This match is sure to be SHORT! Okay, okay, I'm done. Let the bloodbath begin!"
G["This may be a bit unsettling..."]="Isto pode resultar algo inquietante..."
G["This may be a strange request, but... do you have any ink or paint?"]="Talvez seja uma petição estranha, mas... tem tinta ou pintura?"
G["This may be my greatest work yet!"]="É possível que se trate de meu melhor trabalho até o momentos!"
G["This may be the end for you, Dalliah.  What a shame that would be."]="Este pode ser seu fim, Dalhiah. Que vergonha."
G["This may come as a shock to you, but business hasn't been all that good as of late..."]="Isso pode ser um choque para você, mas os negócios não têm sido tão bons ultimamente..."
G["This may disorient you momentarily, Wakener. It is always difficult the first time your eyes truly see."]="This may disorient you momentarily, Wakener. It is always difficult the first time your eyes truly see."
G["This may hurt a little...."]="This may hurt a little...."
G["This may look like a losing battle, but the Scarlet Crusade will prevail. I believe wholly in our capability to eradicate the scourge in Stratholme. And though I do not look favorably upon the Argent Dawn, the Brotherhood of the Light is much closer to how I like to work.\n\nEnough idle chatter, $c. Let's get started."]="Talvez parezca uma batalha perdida, mas a Cruzada Escarlate prevalecerá. Acho absolutamente em nossa capacidade para erradicar o Flagelo de Stratholme. Embora não vejo com bons olhos ao Alba Argêntea, a Guilda da Luz se aproxima muito mais a meu forma de trabalhar.\n\nBasta de cháchara, $c. Empecemos."
G["This may seem meager at first, but give it a moment. Soon, the pain will be unbearable."]="Pode parecer fraca no início, mas dê um momento. Logo, a dor será insuportável."
G["This mean war!"]="Isto é a guerra!"
G["This meaningless exertion bores me. I'll incinerate you all from above!"]="This meaningless exertion bores me. I'll incinerate you all from above!"
G["This means he's completely unhinged."]="Isto indica que está totalmente fosse de si."
G["This means war, Lump! War I say!"]="Isso significa guerra, caroço! Guerra eu digo!"
G["This meeting of the Assembly of Iron is adjourned!"]="This meeting of the Assembly of Iron is adjourned!"
G["This might be a one-way mission, $n. If you're not comfortable with that, you can walk away at any time, though I'd rather that you didn't."]="This might be a one-way mission, $n. If you're not comfortable with that, you can walk away at any time, though I'd rather that you didn't."
G["This might be the only cool place left on the island... right next to the volcano!"]="Este pode ser o único lugar legal que resta na ilha... bem ao lado do vulcão!"
G["This might just change your mind.  Brann is shipping the tablets to me as we speak. Preliminary reports from the Explorers' League state that they may be able to help us understand what is going on with the earthquakes."]="This might just change your mind.  Brann is shipping the tablets to me as we speak. Preliminary reports from the Explorers' League state that they may be able to help us understand what is going on with the earthquakes."
G["This mine and everything in it are now property of Queen Sylvanas.  That includes all you worms -- so get back to work!"]="This mine and everything in it are now property of Queen Sylvanas.  That includes all you worms -- so get back to work!"
G["This miserable can is nothing compared to the might of <Kraken Name here>!"]="Esse miserável can não é nada comparado com o poder de <Aqui nome do kraken>!"
G["This miserable existence finally ends."]="Esta existência miserável chega ao seu fim."
G["This mission is far too vital to leave your repairs in the hands of someone other than myself."]="Esta missão é demais importantes como para deixar que te repare o equipamento outra pessoa."
G["This mole machine is a little rusty, but it still looks operational."]="Esta máquina toupeira está um pouco enferrujada, mas ainda parece operacional."
G["This monkey's about to get slapped!"]="This monkey's about to get slapped!"
G["This monument hums and crackles with perpetual ancient energies."]="Este monumento zumbe e crepita com energias antigas e perpétuas."
G["This monument is dedicated to all those who have fallen in the protection of Stormwind. Our people have weathered unbelievable hardships to retain their freedoms and to control their own destinies. It is here we remember every sacrifice our citizens have made during the first war that riddled our people."]="Este monumento é dedicado a todos aqueles que caíram na proteção de Ventobravo. Nosso povo enfrentou dificuldades inacreditáveis ​​para manter suas liberdades e controlar seus próprios destinos. É aqui que nos lembramos de todos os sacrifícios que nossos cidadãos fizeram durante a primeira guerra que envolveu nosso povo."
G["This moon beam will send you to Orgrimmar.  Use your invitation when you want to go."]="Este raio da lua o enviará a Orgrimmar. Use seu convite quando quiser ir."
G["This moonlight will send you to Ironforge.  But who'd want to leave this party?"]="Este luar enviará você para Ironforge. Mas quem iria querer sair dessa festa?"
G["This moonlight will take you to Thunder Bluff.  Use it when you want to leave the festival."]="Este luar o levará ao Thunder Bluff. Use quando quiser sair do festival."
G["This mouthwatering brew has an almost hypnotic aroma coming from it."]="Este mistura tão apetecible desprende um aroma quase hipnótico."
G["This mouthwatering brew has an almost hypnotic aroma coming from it.\n\n(Scenarios require item level 425 or greater.)"]="Este mistura tão apetecible desprende um aroma quase hipnótico.\n\n(As gestas requerem nível de item 425 ou superior)."
G["This music never gets old, does it?"]="Esta música nunca passa de moda, verdade?"
G["This must be somewhat different from the environment to which you're accustomed. It is a visible demonstration of the power we hold, nothing more. We're mindful of our resources."]="This must be somewhat different from the environment to which you're accustomed. It is a visible demonstration of the power we hold, nothing more. We're mindful of our resources."
G["This must be the lifeboat that Captain Hecklebury Smotts spoke about."]="Este deve ser o navio salva-vidas de que o capitão Hecklebury Smotts falou."
G["This my real home place! You believe we were a hatchling long time ago? We were!"]="This my real home place! You believe we were a hatchling long time ago? We were!"
G["This new world fascinates us. A world that has fought the Legion to a standstill... amazing."]="Este novo mundo nos fascina. Um mundo que tem lutado contra a Legião e a tem neutralizado... impressionante."
G["This nightsaber is rumored to be docile in the presence of night elves and their allies, which makes her an even more worthy opponent.  Shadumbra's hunting path takes her from the Raynewood Retreat to our west, ultimately to lands due west of there.  Her fur is the color of pitch, and her speed is not to be underestimated."]="Há rumores de que este sabre de noite seja dócil na presença de elfos noturnos e seus aliados, o que a torna uma oponente ainda mais digna. O caminho de caça de Shadumbra a leva do Retiro de Raynewood para o oeste, e finalmente para terras a oeste dali. Seu pêlo é da cor do tom e sua velocidade não deve ser subestimada."
G["This no go here."]="Isto não ir aí."
G["This not Frenzyheart Hill, where we again?"]="Isto não ser Colina Coração Frenético, onde estar nós novamente?"
G["This not be good..."]="Isto não ser bom..."
G["This not easy for A-Me to say... A-Me going home.  It finally time for A-Me to leave."]="This not easy for A-Me to say... A-Me going home.  It finally time for A-Me to leave."
G["This not first queen slain by Frenzyheart. Seem like there always more."]="Esta não ser primeira rainha asesinada por Coração Frenético. Parecer que sempre haver mais."
G["This not fun..."]="Isto não divertido..."
G["This not good tickle!"]="This not good tickle!"
G["This not... end well for you!"]="Isto não acabar... bem para você!"
G["This object is of low quality and is likely one of many fake artifacts that have been flooding the black market."]="Esse item é de baixa qualidade e provavelmente é um dos muitos artefatos falsos que vêm inundando o mercado negro."
G["This object is useless to me."]="Este item não me serve de nada."
G["This object of your chagrin may still prove... valuable... to me."]="Embora você te disguste, talvez a mim me resulte... útil."
G["This oil no good for Grek! What Grek look like to you, some weakling in robes?"]="Este óleo não vale para Grek! O que acha que é Grek? Um debilucho com túnica?"
G["This ol' cloaking chicken better not fail. She's been actin' up lately."]="This ol' cloaking chicken better not fail. She's been actin' up lately."
G["This old bear... I can't stay mad at him.\n\nThank you, stranger."]="This old bear... I can't stay mad at him.\n\nThank you, stranger."
G["This old draenei board has been refurbished by the Kurenai and is now used to post announcements and bounties."]="Este antigo quadro draenei foi reformado pelos Kurenai e agora é usado para postar anúncios e recompensas."
G["This old inn isn't much to look at anymore, but it makes for a great stronghold."]="Esta antiga pousada não é muito para se olhar, mas é uma grande fortaleza."
G["This old pandaren is a fool. How are we supposed to fight without emotion? It's impossible!"]="Esse velho pandaren não tem nem ideia. Como vamos lutar sem emoção? É possível!"
G["This one die easy!"]="Este morre fácil!"
G["This one has awoken too soon. It retains emotion and memory..."]="This one has awoken too soon. It retains emotion and memory..."
G["This one has indeed proven mastery over anger. Between the young cub's words and the actions of this hero, I think I understand. Those from beyond the mists are hardened by battle. They are scarred, yes, but they have learned much. I trust them."]="Eis alguém que de fato mostrou domínio sobre a raiva. Entre as palavras do filhote e tais atos de heroísmo, acho que compreendo. Os que vêm de além das névoas estão calejados pela guerra. Eles têm cicatrizes, mas aprenderam muito. Confio neles."
G["This one is especially ugly. Perfect for a ghoul..."]="Este é especialmente feio. Perfeito para ser um necrófago..."
G["This one is in pretty bad shape."]="Este tem mal aspecto."
G["This one is slightly better than the last. However, it still suffers from the same flimsy bone structure as the others. When you summon one of these, you are on the right path."]="This one is slightly better than the last. However, it still suffers from the same flimsy bone structure as the others. When you summon one of these, you are on the right path."
G["This one looks a little fragile... well, no matter..."]="Este parece um pouco frágil… bom, não importa…"
G["This one seems a little weak still."]="Este ainda parece um podo fraco."
G["This one should make a fine mount someday."]="Este deveria ser uma montaria excelente algum dia."
G["This one smells particularly bad."]="Este cheira especialmente mal."
G["This one that assisted me should be adequate. Have them report to our force commander, Crag Rockcrusher at Stonehearth."]="$gEste: Esta; que me ajudou servirá. Faça que informen a nosso comandante, Crag Aplastarrocas no Lar Pétreo."
G["This one was from Corporal Stonewell... he died protecting a field hospital..."]="This one was from Corporal Stonewell... he died protecting a field hospital..."
G["This one will grow to be a great warrior. Won't you, darling?"]="This one will grow to be a great warrior. Won't you, darling?"
