G["This paragon is for the Empress! You shall not have it!"]="This paragon is for the Empress! You shall not have it!"
G["This party is just the best!  Don't you agree?"]="Esta festa é apenas a melhor! Você não concorda?"
G["This party is pointless. Those foolish nobles will never get to see Medivh. Can't they see this? I should have just stayed in Darkshire with my family instead of wasting my time here."]="Essa festa é inútil. Esses nobres tolos nunca conseguirão ver Medivh. Eles não podem ver isso? Eu deveria ter ficado em Darkshire com minha família em vez de perder meu tempo aqui."
G["This path leads to Kun-Lai Summit. Good fortune to those who travel it to shop at grummle shops."]="This path leads to Kun-Lai Summit. Good fortune to those who travel it to shop at grummle shops."
G["This path only leads deeper into the city. Keep going south toward the Loading Room."]="This path only leads deeper into the city. Keep going south toward the Loading Room."
G["This pathetic revolution ends here!"]="Esta patética revolução termina aqui!"
G["This pathetic siege ends NOW!"]="Este patético cerco acaba AQUI!"
G["This person sure has lots o' statues..."]="Alguém tem um monte de estátuas..."
G["This pie is so good, would you like some?"]="Essa torta é tão boa, você gostaria?"
G["This pit stinks and I'm surrounded by snakes, but I'm here to do a job.\n\nEver since Putress pulled his stunt at the Wrath Gate, the Warchief doesn't trust these people as far as he can throw them. That's why we're here. The apothecaries can't do a thing without me."]="This pit stinks and I'm surrounded by snakes, but I'm here to do a job.\n\nEver since Putress pulled his stunt at the Wrath Gate, the Warchief doesn't trust these people as far as he can throw them. That's why we're here. The apothecaries can't do a thing without me."
G["This place be reekin' of death and sacrifice.\n\nBest you leave before you become da next prisoner."]="This place be reekin' of death and sacrifice.\n\nBest you leave before you become da next prisoner."
G["This place doesn't look good."]="Este lugar não tem boa pinta."
G["This place doesn't look pretty. Come on, $n. Let's go inside."]="Este lugar não tem boa pinta. Vamos, $n. Vamos dentro."
G["This place is GREAT! Have you seen how much FOOD they have here?"]="Este lugar é genial! Tem visto quanta comida têm aqui?"
G["This place is all shiny. Not sure I like it. Seems like it is missing that \"lived in\" smell."]="This place is all shiny. Not sure I like it. Seems like it is missing that \"lived in\" smell."
G["This place is an archaeologist's dream!\n\nI wish there were time to conduct a proper excavation."]="Este lugar é o sonho de tudo arqueólogo!\n\ntomara tivesse tempo para levar a cabo uma escavação como é devido."
G["This place is crazy! I could spend years here investigating all this technology!"]="Este lugar é louco! Eu poderia passar anos aqui investigando toda essa tecnologia!"
G["This place is great.  Anywhere else I'd be called a violent sociopath.  Well, they call me that here too, but at least they say it to my face with a smile."]="This place is great.  Anywhere else I'd be called a violent sociopath.  Well, they call me that here too, but at least they say it to my face with a smile."
G["This place is huge!"]="Este lugar é enorme!"
G["This place is infested... we'll need to make our way out of here with the relics as quickly as possible."]="Este lugar está infestado... vamos precisar sair daqui com as relíquias o mais rápido possível."
G["This place is like... ALL puddles."]="Este lugar está... cheio de poças."
G["This place is packed to the rafters with Alliance all-stars!  Let's go tear apart Orgrimmar!"]="Este lugar transborda de estrelas da Aliança! Vamos arrasar Orgrimmar!"
G["This place is packed! We should all team up and go kick Varian in his pretty little face!"]="This place is packed! We should all team up and go kick Varian in his pretty little face!"
G["This place is quite strange. There is powerful magic everywhere around us."]="É um lugar muito estranho. Uma magia poderosa nos perto por todas partes."
G["This place is really heating up!"]="Aqui começa a fazer calor!"
G["This place is remarkable, don't you think?"]="É um lugar fascinante, não você acha?"
G["This place is safe for the Defias to take over! Get the others."]="Este lugar está a salvou da invasão dos Défias! Id a pelos mais."
G["This place is still mostly free from the naga. But...it is deeply tormented. I don't know how long we have."]="This place is still mostly free from the naga. But...it is deeply tormented. I don't know how long we have."
G["This place is to warm and sticky and smells of bad fortune."]="This place is to warm and sticky and smells of bad fortune."
G["This place is under my protection. The mysteries of the arcane shall remain inviolate."]="This place is under my protection. The mysteries of the arcane shall remain inviolate."
G["This place is up crap creek an' I ain't got no shovel."]="Este lugar é um rio de porquería e eu não tenho pala."
G["This place isn't quite as cool as the ruins, and the air in here is a bit humid if I do say so myself, but it does have a comfy, home feel to it.\n\nDon't you think?"]="This place isn't quite as cool as the ruins, and the air in here is a bit humid if I do say so myself, but it does have a comfy, home feel to it.\n\nDon't you think?"
G["This place isn't safe.  Let's leave!"]="Huargen! Huargen por todas partes!"
G["This place looks rough and tumble, but everyone around here is a softie on the inside."]="Este lugar parece muito duro, mas por dentro tudo o mundo é um pedaço de pan."
G["This place makes me uneasy, but we Shado-Pan do not run from danger."]="This place makes me uneasy, but we Shado-Pan do not run from danger."
G["This place reeks of death, stranger.\n\nYou must leave before you fill a cage like Kraz."]="This place reeks of death, stranger.\n\nYou must leave before you fill a cage like Kraz."
G["This place reeks of evil. It must be purged!"]="Este lugar fede a maldade. Deve ser purgado!"
G["This place seems nice enough, I suppose. Needs a little elbow grease.\n\nYou looking for a job, $n?"]="Suponho que este lugar não está mal. Embora haverá que trabalhar duro.\n\nCaso trabalho $n?"
G["This place was only the beginning. We will crush your refugee camp and then lead our elementals north to destroy Lor'danel with Aetherion as our vanguard!"]="Isto somente é o início. Aplastaremos seu acampamento de refugiados, e depois levaremos nossos elementais ao norte para destruir Lor'danel com Aetherion na vanguarda!"
G["This place was supposed to be safe! Instead we're in the middle of hungry worgs and the High Tinker only knows what!"]="This place was supposed to be safe! Instead we're in the middle of hungry worgs and the High Tinker only knows what!"
G["This place will serve as your graveyard."]="Este lugar será seu cemitério."
G["This place will serve as your tomb!"]="This place will serve as your tomb!"
G["This place won't stay in business long if they keep this up."]="Este lugar acabará por quebrar se seguem assim."
G["This place... it's cursed.\n\nI barely managed to escape, and I cannot bear to go down through the tunnels again.\n\nMy brother, and sisters though... They were not as fortunate. Trapped inside, they are feverish with the corrupted haze that flows from the evil garden growing there.\n\nPlease, you must help."]="This place... it's cursed.\n\nI barely managed to escape, and I cannot bear to go down through the tunnels again.\n\nMy brother, and sisters though... They were not as fortunate. Trapped inside, they are feverish with the corrupted haze that flows from the evil garden growing there.\n\nPlease, you must help."
G["This places chills me to my core, $c."]="This places chills me to my core, $c."
G["This plant stands out among the normal flora of Teldrassil, and emits a strange, purplish glow."]="Esta planta se destaca entre a flora normal de Teldrassil e emite um brilho estranho e arroxeado."
G["This platform is about to crumble! Jump to another!"]="This platform is about to crumble! Jump to another!"
G["This pond sure is nice, neighbor."]="This pond sure is nice, neighbor."
G["This poor sherpen has been frozen here for a while."]="Este pobre sherpen leva bastante tempo congelado"
G["This portal is not like the others that lead back to Azeroth. To maintain it, we must acquire more mana cells.\n\nIt is either that or risk losing our access to the Isle of Quel'Danas and the Sunwell."]="This portal is not like the others that lead back to Azeroth. To maintain it, we must acquire more mana cells.\n\nIt is either that or risk losing our access to the Isle of Quel'Danas and the Sunwell."
G["This portal leads to Lake Wintergrasp."]="Este portal leva ao Lago Invérnia."
G["This portal leads to the Caverns of Time, deep beneath the earth in far-off Tanaris.\n\nI possess the power to send you there, should you so desire."]="This portal leads to the Caverns of Time, deep beneath the earth in far-off Tanaris.\n\nI possess the power to send you there, should you so desire."
G["This portal leads to the Caverns of Time, deep beneath the earth in far-off Tanaris.\n\nUntil you have grown stronger, though, I must ask you not to travel there."]="Este portal leva às Caverna do Tempo, nas profundezas da terra sob o distante Tanaris.\n\nMas tenho que pedir que não viagens ali até que seja mais forte."
G["This portal leads to the Stair of Destiny in Hellfire Peninsula... that's right, Outland.\n\nAre you prepared...?"]="This portal leads to the Stair of Destiny in Hellfire Peninsula... that's right, Outland.\n\nAre you prepared...?"
G["This portion of the statue tells you little, other than the subject actually had arms..."]="This portion of the statue tells you little, other than the subject actually had arms..."
G["This post is secure, $r.\n\nThe enemy has been cleared from the area for some time now."]="This post is secure, $r.\n\nThe enemy has been cleared from the area for some time now."
G["This potion seems to heal less damage every time I brew it, though I use the same ingredients. There can be only one conclusion: the plants are changing. I cannot say why or into what."]="Essa poção parece curar menos danos toda vez que eu a preparo, embora eu use os mesmos ingredientes. Só pode haver uma conclusão: as plantas estão mudando. Não sei dizer por que ou para quê."
G["This power is harnessed by all thinking peoples to heal or harm. It is the power of life. It is the power of souls living and dead."]="This power is harnessed by all thinking peoples to heal or harm. It is the power of life. It is the power of souls living and dead."
G["This power is too dangerous. I will have none of it!"]="É um poder demais perigoso. Não o quero!"
