G["This probably isn't a smooth ride, but I bet I'd look smooth in this ride."]="This probably isn't a smooth ride, but I bet I'd look smooth in this ride."
G["This pumpkin sure looks succulent! Nobody will notice if I take a small bite... [PH]"]="This pumpkin sure looks succulent! Nobody will notice if I take a small bite... [PH]"
G["This puny green pup was of no use at the mines.  No matter, he'll make for suitable warmup for battle."]="Esse filhote verde insignificante não tinha utilidade nas minas. Não importa, ele fará um aquecimento adequado para a batalha."
G["This raft is all yours, neighbor. You ever want to go rafting, just come back here. It'll be waiting for you."]="Esta balsa é toda sua. Se alguma vez te apetece navegar, somente precisa voltar aqui. Te estará esperando."
G["This realm is more terrible than I'd imagined. Even now, I can feel the rage of this place pressing down on me."]="This realm is more terrible than I'd imagined. Even now, I can feel the rage of this place pressing down on me."
