G["This red statue looks a lot like the Sentinel's pawn that you hold.\n\nThe statue has a small indentation that matches the size of your pawn."]="This red statue looks a lot like the Sentinel's pawn that you hold.\n\nThe statue has a small indentation that matches the size of your pawn."
G["This reflection of me is exceptionally weak. Don't let these brutes lay a finger on my precious image."]="Este reflexo de mim é excepcionalmente fraco. Não deixe que esses brutos pongan um dedo na minha preciosa imagem."
G["This region is one of the epicenters of the cataclysm that threatens to rend our world.\n\nIf we manage to survive, we must try to discover its cause."]="This region is one of the epicenters of the cataclysm that threatens to rend our world.\n\nIf we manage to survive, we must try to discover its cause."
G["This region was an epicenter of the cataclysm.\n\nThe naga activity here is certainly no coincidence. Their intentions must be unveiled!"]="Esta região foi um epicentro do Cataclismo.\n\nA atividade naga local não é nenhuma casualidade. Devemos descobrir seus intenções!"
G["This reminds me of that one time where you made us search Silithus for evidence of sand gnomes."]="Isso me recuerdpor vez que nos fez registrar a Silithus para encontrar provas de gnomos de arena."
G["This resolution pains me deeply, but the destruction, the monumental loss of life had to end. Regardless of Malygos' recent transgressions, I will mourn his loss. He was once a guardian, a protector. This day, one of the world's mightiest has fallen."]="This resolution pains me deeply, but the destruction, the monumental loss of life had to end. Regardless of Malygos' recent transgressions, I will mourn his loss. He was once a guardian, a protector. This day, one of the world's mightiest has fallen."
