G["This stuff is so volatile, it probably shouldn't be moved. Much less... flown."]="This stuff is so volatile, it probably shouldn't be moved. Much less... flown."
G["This sun-blasted city is home to the Sandfury trolls, known for their particular ruthlessness and dark mysticism. Troll legends tell of a powerful sword called Sul'thraze the Lasher, a weapon capable of instilling fear and weakness in even the most formidable of foes. Long ago, the weapon was split in half. However, rumors have circulated that the two halves may be found somewhere within Zul'Farrak's walls."]="This sun-blasted city is home to the Sandfury trolls, known for their particular ruthlessness and dark mysticism. Troll legends tell of a powerful sword called Sul'thraze the Lasher, a weapon capable of instilling fear and weakness in even the most formidable of foes. Long ago, the weapon was split in half. However, rumors have circulated that the two halves may be found somewhere within Zul'Farrak's walls."
G["This sure is exciting, isn't it?"]="É emocionante, a que si?"
G["This symbol, I think I've seen this before..."]="Acho que vi este símbolo antes..."
