G["This tear in the fabric of time and space looks ominous.  Different scenes flash by at terrifying speed.  A very brave person might try to jump through at the right time..."]="Esse rasgo no tecido do tempo e do espaço parece ameaçador. Cenas diferentes passam a uma velocidade assustadora. Uma pessoa muito corajosa pode tentar pular na hora certa..."
G["This teleportation device appears to have been used recently to teleport various goods deeper into the mine."]="Este dispositivo de teletransporte parece ter sido usado recentemente para teletransportar vários bens mais fundo na mina."
G["This teleporter will transport you to Grom'gol in Northern Stranglethorn.\n\nUsually.\n\nI mean, sometimes it'll just disintegrate you, or reduce all your soft tissues into a greenish, foul-smelling mist, but mostly it's safe!\n\n...mostly."]="This teleporter will transport you to Grom'gol in Northern Stranglethorn.\n\nUsually.\n\nI mean, sometimes it'll just disintegrate you, or reduce all your soft tissues into a greenish, foul-smelling mist, but mostly it's safe!\n\n...mostly."
G["This teleporter will transport you to the irradiated ruins of Gnomeregan, deep beneath Dun Morogh.\n\nDon't worry, there's another one there that'll send you back here... well, if it doesn't turn you inside-out or transmogrify your organs into unstable organic explosives, that is!\n\nWell? What are you waiting for? Hop on in!"]="This teleporter will transport you to the irradiated ruins of Gnomeregan, deep beneath Dun Morogh.\n\nDon't worry, there's another one there that'll send you back here... well, if it doesn't turn you inside-out or transmogrify your organs into unstable organic explosives, that is!\n\nWell? What are you waiting for? Hop on in!"
