G["This tournament is the biggest event in ages! Buy something to bring home to your family and show your kids."]="Este torneio é o maior acontecimento desde há anos! Compra algo que levar ao seu família e mostrar aos seus filhos."
G["This tower is complete and utter madness. This isn't a library, it's a huge haystack of books and I don't think the needle even exists! Now, what was I doing?"]="Esta torre é loucura complete e absoluta. Isso não é uma biblioteca, é um enorme palheiro de livros e acho que nem a agulha existe! Agora, o que eu estava fazendo?"
G["This tower powers the Hammer of Hodir. It is said to have the power to turn entire armies to ice!"]="This tower powers the Hammer of Hodir. It is said to have the power to turn entire armies to ice!"
G["This tracking pheromone will reveal to you targets of great value."]="Esta feromona de rastreando te revelará alvos de grande coragem."
G["This trail is bloody. You follow it to a nearby bush, where you find the remains of the creature's last meal."]="This trail is bloody. You follow it to a nearby bush, where you find the remains of the creature's last meal."
G["This training is really helping."]="Este treinamento me está ajudando muito."
G["This transgression against the Blue Dragonflight has been noted. I will take extra pleasure in separating the life energy from your body!"]="This transgression against the Blue Dragonflight has been noted. I will take extra pleasure in separating the life energy from your body!"
G["This transmatter's the key to our survival. If we don't get it fully operational, we're goners for sure!"]="Esta transmateria é a importante para sobreviver. Se não logramos que funcione corretamente, não o contaremos!"
G["This tree stands as a symbol of hope. Hope that the land might in time be healed and made stronger by your deeds."]="Este árvore é um símbolo de esperança. Espero que, com o tempo, a terra se sane e se fortalezca Obrigado aos seus façanhas."
G["This trial will test how far your skill can take you. It will never end; it only gets more challenging."]="Este desafio medirá o alcance das suas habilidades. Nunca termina, somente se volta mais difícil."
G["This troll complains about the food, but he eats more than any of us."]="This troll complains about the food, but he eats more than any of us."
G["This troll was positively filthy."]="Esse troll era bastante asqueroso."
G["This twisted world is beyond redemption, beyond the reach of deluded heroes. The only answer to corruption is destruction. And that begins... now."]="This twisted world is beyond redemption, beyond the reach of deluded heroes. The only answer to corruption is destruction. And that begins... now."
G["This unfortunate Zandalari has been gored and trampled. The expression on his face is not one of fear, but one of steely determination, even in death.\n\nHis open eyes appear to burn with intense passion, even as they stare unblinking into the sky. A fly crawls along their still-moist surface."]="This unfortunate Zandalari has been gored and trampled. The expression on his face is not one of fear, but one of steely determination, even in death.\n\nHis open eyes appear to burn with intense passion, even as they stare unblinking into the sky. A fly crawls along their still-moist surface."
G["This unit has been activated outside normal operating protocols. Downloading new operational parameters. Download complete. Full unit self defense routines are now active. Destruction of foreign units in the system shall now commence."]="This unit has been activated outside normal operating protocols. Downloading new operational parameters. Download complete. Full unit self defense routines are now active. Destruction of foreign units in the system shall now commence."
G["This unit is busy. Please inquire later."]="Esta unidade está ocupada. Por favor, relatório mais tarde."
G["This unit is currently at ninety five percent operational efficiency."]="Esta unidade se encontre atualmente ao noventa e cinco por cento do seu eficiência operacional."
G["This unit is currently performing within normal parameters."]="This unit is currently performing within normal parameters."
G["This unit is ready to serve."]="Esta unidade está preparada para ser utilizada."
G["This used to be a peaceful brewing village. Now, the horrors of war have already robbed our children of their innocence.\n\nTake your war elsewhere, $r."]="This used to be a peaceful brewing village. Now, the horrors of war have already robbed our children of their innocence.\n\nTake your war elsewhere, $r."
G["This valley is proof that our nightmares can become reality."]="Este vale é a prova de que nossas pesadelos podem se fingir realidade."
