G["This vessel is empty."]="This vessel is empty."
G["This view is terrible!"]="Esta visão é horrível!"
G["This village has been peaceful for longer than I can remember. Our weapons are surely as rusty as our fighters."]="This village has been peaceful for longer than I can remember. Our weapons are surely as rusty as our fighters."
G["This village has you to thank for their victory."]="Esta aldeia te deve seu vitória."
G["This village is normally so peaceful."]="Normalmente esta aldeia é muito tranquila."
G["This village is ours! Death to the trolls!"]="Este povo é nosso! Morte aos trolls!"
G["This village was built with Hui's approval, but that was many generations ago."]="This village was built with Hui's approval, but that was many generations ago."
G["This virmen land now, you go!"]="Isto agora terra de virmen! Fora!"
G["This virmen land!"]="Esta é terra de virmen!"
G["This wall cannot stop the might of the mantid!"]="Esta muralha não pode conter a força dos mantídeos!"
G["This wall is your grave!"]="Esta muralha será seu tumba!"
G["This wall of shadow will hold back the demons long enough for us to cross.\n\nWhen you and the other elves have crossed I will follow."]="This wall of shadow will hold back the demons long enough for us to cross.\n\nWhen you and the other elves have crossed I will follow."
G["This wanted poster has a bounty on bonelashers.  You think I should do that?"]="Este cartaz de Se Busca oferecem uma recompensa pelos Atizahuesos. Não acha que eu poderá fazer isso?"
G["This wanted poster is adorned with an assortment of notices and rewards for all manner of dangerous activities.  However, you see nothing in particular that you feel you're cut out for yet.\n\nPerhaps you should check again at a later time?"]="This wanted poster is adorned with an assortment of notices and rewards for all manner of dangerous activities.  However, you see nothing in particular that you feel you're cut out for yet.\n\nPerhaps you should check again at a later time?"
G["This wanted poster says that they're offering gold to these so-called adventurers to go kill things.  Isn't that what we do?  I don't think I'm being paid enough!"]="This wanted poster says that they're offering gold to these so-called adventurers to go kill things.  Isn't that what we do?  I don't think I'm being paid enough!"
G["This war - and don't mistake this for anything but a war - is not going to win itself. If we do not fight, scratch, claw, and kick for every speck of land on this shattered world, all will be lost."]="This war - and don't mistake this for anything but a war - is not going to win itself. If we do not fight, scratch, claw, and kick for every speck of land on this shattered world, all will be lost."
G["This war has been an enormous drain upon our people and resources. Even here on Teldrassil, we cannot escape its repercussions. Forgive me for asking it of you, but would you perform a task for me?"]="This war has been an enormous drain upon our people and resources. Even here on Teldrassil, we cannot escape its repercussions. Forgive me for asking it of you, but would you perform a task for me?"
G["This war has to end. Soon. Before it consumes our strength!"]="Esta guerra tem que acabar. E logo. Antes que consuma nossa força!"
G["This war's not over, it's only just begun!  We have brave men and women fighting our enemy inside Ahn'Qiraj day and night, $n.  It won't be long before the Qiraji city falls."]="Esta guerra não tem terminado mas sim não fez mais que começar! Temos com corajosos homens e mulheres que luchan dia e noite contra o inimigo no interior de Ahn'Qiraj, $n. A cidade qiraji não tardará muito em cair."
G["This was NOT in my contract!"]="This was NOT in my contract!"
G["This was a good man, $r. We'd served together through many battles...\n\nThese beasts have a debt to pay!"]="Era um bom homem, $r. Lutamos juntos em muitas batalhas...\n\nEssas beast devem pagar!"
G["This was a massacre.  A planned ambush?  Who do these elementals bend to?"]="Isto é uma massacre. Uma emboscada? A quem sirven esses elementais?"
G["This was a simple town to oversee for my father. We spent some days growing crops, others brewing. Once a year we would travel to other villages to trade. It was a life that we all enjoyed.\n\nNow, the echoes of war bounce all around us, and we must navigate these troublesome times with care. I only hope we may find a resolution quickly."]="This was a simple town to oversee for my father. We spent some days growing crops, others brewing. Once a year we would travel to other villages to trade. It was a life that we all enjoyed.\n\nNow, the echoes of war bounce all around us, and we must navigate these troublesome times with care. I only hope we may find a resolution quickly."
G["This was an execution. Whoever did this was sending a message..."]="Isto foi uma ejecução. Quem seja que tenha banido queria enviar uma mensagem..."
G["This was before the Cataclysm?"]="This was before the Cataclysm?"
G["This was child's play."]="Isto é pan comido."
G["This was going to be a walk in the park until that airhead over there came out of nowhere with an army of gnomes.\n\nGallywix will have my head if we let these creepy runts one-up us here."]="This was going to be a walk in the park until that airhead over there came out of nowhere with an army of gnomes.\n\nGallywix will have my head if we let these creepy runts one-up us here."
G["This was my fault, my lord. I should've done more research on those tablets..."]="Foi culpar minha, meu senhor. Deveria haver investigado mais essas tabuletas..."
G["This was not supposed to be a combat mission."]="Se deveria que esta não era uma missão de combate."
G["This was not worth my time."]="Não tem merecido a pena perder meu tempo em isto."
G["This was one of the royal cities of the elves in the days when Azshara was queen. In this city lie the keys to lore long lost and artifacts of unimaginable historical value."]="This was one of the royal cities of the elves in the days when Azshara was queen. In this city lie the keys to lore long lost and artifacts of unimaginable historical value."
G["This was the Ashbringer, fool! As the Scourge began to materialize around us, Mograine's blade began to glow... to hum... the younger Mograine would take that as a sign to make his escape. They descended upon us with a hunger the likes of which I had never seen. Yet..."]="This was the Ashbringer, fool! As the Scourge began to materialize around us, Mograine's blade began to glow... to hum... the younger Mograine would take that as a sign to make his escape. They descended upon us with a hunger the likes of which I had never seen. Yet..."
