G["Those filthy beasts are all over the place.\n\nIf you prefer hunting outdoors, you'll find most of them around Plaguewood and Terrordale, with a good concentration of them in the Terrorweb tunnel. They are also likely to appear at almost any Scourge encampment in the Eastern Plaguelands.\n\nIf you're a hearty dungeon crawler, you'll find a good lot of them in Stratholme and a few of the necrofiend variety in Scholomance."]="Those filthy beasts are all over the place.\n\nIf you prefer hunting outdoors, you'll find most of them around Plaguewood and Terrordale, with a good concentration of them in the Terrorweb tunnel. They are also likely to appear at almost any Scourge encampment in the Eastern Plaguelands.\n\nIf you're a hearty dungeon crawler, you'll find a good lot of them in Stratholme and a few of the necrofiend variety in Scholomance."
G["Those filthy mutts forced me out of Fenris Keep, I won't be forced out of my camp as well!"]="Those filthy mutts forced me out of Fenris Keep, I won't be forced out of my camp as well!"
G["Those fools! What have they done! What horrors do they hold? And for what purpose? I will need your help again, hero. Help us. Help your people."]="Those fools! What have they done! What horrors do they hold? And for what purpose? I will need your help again, hero. Help us. Help your people."
G["Those goblins should be ashamed of themselves.  Bah!"]="Those goblins should be ashamed of themselves.  Bah!"
G["Those gorillas look angry, friend, but challenging them may well be worth the risk!"]="Those gorillas look angry, friend, but challenging them may well be worth the risk!"
G["Those green dirtbags down there plagued your homes in Southshore, laid siege to your children in Redridge, and massacred every man, woman and child in Theramore."]="Those green dirtbags down there plagued your homes in Southshore, laid siege to your children in Redridge, and massacred every man, woman and child in Theramore."
G["Those had better not be evacuation papers I see."]="Those had better not be evacuation papers I see."
G["Those imps you had delivered... they woke up and started shooting fireballs at everybody!  It was chaos!"]="Those imps you had delivered... they woke up and started shooting fireballs at everybody!  It was chaos!"
G["Those innocent pterodactyl hatchlings now have a chance at a real life."]="Essas inocentes proles de pterodáctilos terão agora alguma possibilidade de conhecer o que é a vida real."
G["Those mogu belong to a tribe called the Korune."]="Those mogu belong to a tribe called the Korune."
G["Those noble hunters found a way to survive on their own. Fire was the key. They drew up oil from the ground. They used it to heat their homes, cook their food, and burn their enemies. They grew STRONG."]="Aqueles nobres caçadores encontraram uma maneira de sobreviver sozinhos. O fogo foi a chave. Eles extraíram petróleo do chão e o usaram para aquecer suas casas, cozinhar a comida e queimar os inimigos. Eles ficaram FORTES."
G["Those of the Explorers' League and The Reliquary are very much alike: Archaeology is our religion, yet we have both fallen from the pure faith.\nOur methods have not differed as much as they pretend. We are but a shadowy reflection of them.\nIt would take only a nudge to make them like us. To push them out of the light..."]="Those of the Explorers' League and The Reliquary are very much alike: Archaeology is our religion, yet we have both fallen from the pure faith.\nOur methods have not differed as much as they pretend. We are but a shadowy reflection of them.\nIt would take only a nudge to make them like us. To push them out of the light..."
G["Those orcs took my wife and tossed her into the water when she tried to protect the goods we were bringing to Stormwind! You can't let them get away with this!"]="Those orcs took my wife and tossed her into the water when she tried to protect the goods we were bringing to Stormwind! You can't let them get away with this!"
G["Those other women are just friends, baby."]="Essas outras mulheres são apenas amigas, querida."
G["Those piles of blue-ish crystals we find on the ground."]="Esses montes de cristais azulados que há no chão."
G["Those relics are going to fetch a lot of gold just as soon as I can find the time to get back to town and find a buyer."]="Estas relíquias me vão a proporcionar muito ouro assim que tenha tempo de voltar ao povo e encontrar um comprador."
G["Those ruins creep me out. They're so old..."]="Those ruins creep me out. They're so old..."
G["Those scorpid are moving the towers! Take them out!"]="Those scorpid are moving the towers! Take them out!"
G["Those shoes match your eyes real nice."]="Those shoes match your eyes real nice."
G["Those smelly boys love scaring the poor, cute, little rats."]="Those smelly boys love scaring the poor, cute, little rats."
G["Those sneaky monkeys ambushed me out of nowhere."]="Those sneaky monkeys ambushed me out of nowhere."
G["Those spearthrowers are still firing. Don't you like destroying stuff, $c?"]="Esses tiralanzas seguem disparando. Não te encantar destruir coisas, $c?"
G["Those statues wield the power of the first emperor. Destroy them!"]="Those statues wield the power of the first emperor. Destroy them!"
G["Those that came on the Skyfire are the Alliance's finest. Still, there're some things that only the SI:7 can pull off."]="Those that came on the Skyfire are the Alliance's finest. Still, there're some things that only the SI:7 can pull off."
G["Those that dare play with fire will be incinerated!"]="Aqueles que osen jogar com fogo serão incinerados!"
G["Those that speak to me from on high in Ogri'la will be most pleased with the information that you bring."]="Those that speak to me from on high in Ogri'la will be most pleased with the information that you bring."
G["Those that surrendered are being taken to the Violet Hold. I make no guarantees about those who chose to fight."]="Os que se renderam estão sendo levados para o Castelo Violeta. Eu não me responsabilizo pelos que decidiram lutar."
G["Those thieving elementals are up the path, this way.  Good luck, $n."]="Those thieving elementals are up the path, this way.  Good luck, $n."
G["Those things eat fish! Watch out!"]="Essas coisas come peixe! Cuidado!"
G["Those tonks are dangerous!"]="Those tonks are dangerous!"
G["Those weapons ain't gonna build themselves! Faster!"]="Essas armas não se vão a construir solas! Mais depressa!"
G["Those were some amazing fights!"]="Those were some amazing fights!"
G["Those were some impressive feats of strength you displayed today. Well done!"]="Those were some impressive feats of strength you displayed today. Well done!"
G["Those who are not of the earth must be destroyed!"]="Those who are not of the earth must be destroyed!"
G["Those who behold the starlight must forever protect it!"]="Those who behold the starlight must forever protect it!"
G["Those who meddle with the timeways for their own selfish ends are often dangerous.\nIt is for this reason I joined Wardens, staunch defenders of the Timewalkers.\nWe guard the Watchers and Weavers as they go about their tasks."]="Those who meddle with the timeways for their own selfish ends are often dangerous.\nIt is for this reason I joined Wardens, staunch defenders of the Timewalkers.\nWe guard the Watchers and Weavers as they go about their tasks."
G["Those who oppose him will be destroyed utterly, and those who serve -- who serve wholly, unquestioningly, with utter devotion of mind and soul -- elevated to heights beyond your ken."]="Those who oppose him will be destroyed utterly, and those who serve -- who serve wholly, unquestioningly, with utter devotion of mind and soul -- elevated to heights beyond your ken."
G["Those who participate in the Brewmaster scenarios will earn valor. And if you find any rare items as you adventure with a Brewmaster, they are yours to keep!"]="Those who participate in the Brewmaster scenarios will earn valor. And if you find any rare items as you adventure with a Brewmaster, they are yours to keep!"
G["Those who seek power through force will often find themselves alone in it."]="Those who seek power through force will often find themselves alone in it."
G["Those who stand against us will receive no mercy!"]="Nossos inimigos não conhecerão a piedade!"
G["Those who steal from the mogu will be punished."]="Those who steal from the mogu will be punished."
G["Those who would speak out against magic are enemies of progress."]="Those who would speak out against magic are enemies of progress."
G["Those who you once considered friends, or even those you might have loved, are now your sworn adversaries."]="Those who you once considered friends, or even those you might have loved, are now your sworn adversaries."
G["Those who've defiled this temple have all been defeated.  All but one!"]="Those who've defiled this temple have all been defeated.  All but one!"
G["Those yaungol have straight swords. Straight. Swords."]="Those yaungol have straight swords. Straight. Swords."
G["Those zombies are slow. You don't have to run right through them. Don't let them eat your brains, $n!"]="Esses zumbis são muito lentos. Basta que corras entre eles. Não deixe que se te coman o cérebro, $n!"
G["Those zombies are so slow. It's a turkey shoot out there!"]="Esses zumbis são tão lentos. É um tiro de peru por aí!"
G["Those zombies are so slow. It's a turkey shoot out there!\n\nNeed any training before you head out?"]="Os zumbis são tão lentos. Isso de aí fosse é um tiro ao prato!\n\nPrecisa treinamento antes de que salgas aí fosse?"
G["Those'll net me a nice profit when I return from the South Seas."]="Those'll net me a nice profit when I return from the South Seas."
G["Those..."]="Esses..."
G["Thoth can teach you Inscription in The Crystal Hall."]="Você pode aprender a Inscrição no Salão de Cristal."
G["Thoth'al amun Ree'thael vormos! Vormos! Vormos!"]="Thoth'ao amun Ree'thael vormos! Vormos! Vormos!"
G["Thou detestable maw, thou womb of death; I enforce thy rotten jaws to open!"]="Thou detestable maw, thou womb of death; I enforce thy rotten jaws to open!"
G["Thou smilest... upon the stroke that... murders me."]="Sonreís... ao ver o acerto que... me abate."
end)(AscensionPTBR.GossipEN2ES)
;(function(G)
G["Though Dunshire is known throughout the province for its famous pies, this is still, first and foremost, a mining town. And if the mine falls, the whole town's economy will suffer before long."]="Though Dunshire is known throughout the province for its famous pies, this is still, first and foremost, a mining town. And if the mine falls, the whole town's economy will suffer before long."
G["Though I cannot offer you training, young $c, I can give you my blessing.  Walk boldly in the Light!\n\nIs there anything else?"]="Embora não posso oferecer a você treinamento, jovem $c, posso dar a você meu bênção. Camina com bravura até a Luz!\n\nHá algo mais?"
G["Though I cannot offer you training, young $c, I can give you my blessing. Walk boldly in the Light!"]="Though I cannot offer you training, young $c, I can give you my blessing. Walk boldly in the Light!"
G["Though I find the cool grass which covers Teldrassil as good a bed as any, the beds which Saelienne keeps at the Inn in Craftsman's Terrace are quite suitable for those with a taste for luxury."]="Embora eu encontre a grama fresca que cobre Teldrassil como uma cama tão boa quanto qualquer outra, as camas que Saelienne mantém na pousada no terraço do artesão são bastante adequadas para quem gosta de luxo."
G["Though I hate to admit it, the bear did get the better of me. My oh my, that's one big ol' bear!\n\nNonetheless, if you can take that bear down, it'd be a feat to be proud of! It gave more than a few of our best hunters some trouble.\n\n<He claps you on the back.>\n\nBest the bear and we'll accept you as a regular member of the Farstrider Lodge."]="Though I hate to admit it, the bear did get the better of me. My oh my, that's one big ol' bear!\n\nNonetheless, if you can take that bear down, it'd be a feat to be proud of! It gave more than a few of our best hunters some trouble.\n\n<He claps you on the back.>\n\nBest the bear and we'll accept you as a regular member of the Farstrider Lodge."
G["Though I move on in peace, you all have my undying gratitude. Thank you for freeing me from the curse of my folly and greed."]="Though I move on in peace, you all have my undying gratitude. Thank you for freeing me from the curse of my folly and greed."
G["Though a small corruption lingers, desperately longing to be cleansed, the boughs of Teldrassil itself seem changed.  Growth has begun anew."]="Embora ainda ocorrida uma mínimo corrupção que ansía desesperadamente ser purificação, as ramas de Teldrassil parecem haver mudado. Voltam a crescer novamente."
G["Though as I have always said, better dead than worgen."]="Embora, como sempre digo, melhor morto que huargen."
G["Though exiled as a heretic, my beliefs still ring true--that alone drives me onward. But for my destiny to be complete, I need the aid of an outsider... one not of any centaur tribe.\n\nThe task requires someone to enter the holy halls of Maraudon--a temple my people protect, and only the most devout are ever allowed to enter.\n\nIf you agree to aid me, then you need only nod. I will pass you a parchment with my instructions on it. Read it over and consider my words."]="Though exiled as a heretic, my beliefs still ring true--that alone drives me onward. But for my destiny to be complete, I need the aid of an outsider... one not of any centaur tribe.\n\nThe task requires someone to enter the holy halls of Maraudon--a temple my people protect, and only the most devout are ever allowed to enter.\n\nIf you agree to aid me, then you need only nod. I will pass you a parchment with my instructions on it. Read it over and consider my words."
G["Though many flames are fought over, extinguished and re-lit, all are welcome to show honor to the flame, $c.\n\nHere among the Earthen Ring, we simply honor the flame, rather than engage in other frivolities.\n\nHere, we will honor the flame as tradition dictates.  Will you join with us in honoring the flame, $n?"]="Though many flames are fought over, extinguished and re-lit, all are welcome to show honor to the flame, $c.\n\nHere among the Earthen Ring, we simply honor the flame, rather than engage in other frivolities.\n\nHere, we will honor the flame as tradition dictates.  Will you join with us in honoring the flame, $n?"
G["Though mighty, we only knew of violence..."]="Though mighty, we only knew of violence..."
G["Though my compatriots would have you take an active role in what is transpiring in Zul'Drak, we Zandalari are primarily here to witness what is occurring and to chronicle the end of an empire."]="Embora meus compatriotas façam com que você assuma um papel ativo no que está acontecendo em Zul'Drak, nós, Zandalari, estamos aqui principalmente para testemunhar o que está acontecendo e para narrar o fim de um império."
G["Though the Crossroads seems to be the center of activity in The Barrens, I prefer the quietude of Camp Taurajo.  Where shall I send you?"]="Embora a encruzilhada pareça ser o centro de atividades em The Barrens, prefiro a quietude do acampamento Taurajo. Para onde devo lhe enviar?"
G["Though the acquisition of wealth is no longer a driving force in our lives, we understand that money makes the world go 'round. You will find our auction house in the Seat of the Naaru."]="Embora a aquisição de riqueza não seja mais uma força motriz em nossas vidas, entendemos que o dinheiro faz o mundo girar. Você encontrará nossa casa de leilões na sede dos Naaru."
G["Though the peak is safe, the areas around it are not.  Be more careful!"]="Emborao pico é certo, as zonas circundantes não o são. Tenha mais cuidado!"
G["Though the sounds of battle are still near, we also hear the song of these crystals."]="A pesar de que o som da batalha ainda é próximo, também oímos a canto de estes cristais."
G["Though these Pandarens - my friends - have died, we know that through their sacrifice, and your noble works, Pandaria lives on."]="Though these Pandarens - my friends - have died, we know that through their sacrifice, and your noble works, Pandaria lives on."
G["Though this artifact seems to be in pristine condition, you sense nothing particularly special about it."]="Embora esse artefato pareça estar em bom estado, você não sente nada de especial sobre ele."
G["Though we do not truly understand the traditions of Winter Veil, we have taken to them."]="Though we do not truly understand the traditions of Winter Veil, we have taken to them."
G["Though we face great conflict, our might combined shall obliterate those who would oppose us! The grave injustices committed against the Horde will be met by an unstoppable force of reckoning!"]="Though we face great conflict, our might combined shall obliterate those who would oppose us! The grave injustices committed against the Horde will be met by an unstoppable force of reckoning!"
G["Though we have our new home, our immortal lives have not been restored."]="Embora temos um novo lar, não temos recuperei nossas vidas imortais."
G["Though we may die, from our passing blossoms new life. This is the truth that we live, work, and die for."]="Though we may die, from our passing blossoms new life. This is the truth that we live, work, and die for."
G["Though we've arrived at the promised land, $n, much work remains to be done.  Our people won't reach Kael'thas if we lunge desperately across Outland.\n\nSafe routes must be found, resources must be secured and our enemies must be avoided or destroyed."]="Though we've arrived at the promised land, $n, much work remains to be done.  Our people won't reach Kael'thas if we lunge desperately across Outland.\n\nSafe routes must be found, resources must be secured and our enemies must be avoided or destroyed."
G["Though you are compelled, the choice, and the last step before you leap, are yours. You have twenty more seconds to decide."]="Though you are compelled, the choice, and the last step before you leap, are yours. You have twenty more seconds to decide."
G["Though you will be surrounded by foes greater than you can imagine, your fortitude shall allow you to endure. Remember this in the times ahead."]="Though you will be surrounded by foes greater than you can imagine, your fortitude shall allow you to endure. Remember this in the times ahead."
G["Though your sinews tire and your blood flows from cuts and wounds to this sodden ground, you fight for the spirits of your world.  No evil force can stand against us!"]="Though your sinews tire and your blood flows from cuts and wounds to this sodden ground, you fight for the spirits of your world.  No evil force can stand against us!"
G["Thought I couldn't handle them? Don't let my size be follin' ya. Anyway, thanks for the hand."]="Pensei que não poderia lidar com eles? Não deixe meu tamanho estar seguindo você. De qualquer forma, Obrigado pela mão."
G["Thousand Needles has been swallowed by the South Sea. Thalanaar is submerged!"]="Thousand Needles has been swallowed by the South Sea. Thalanaar is submerged!"
G["Thousand Needles lies in ruins under hundreds of feet of water. Can you spare any braves to assist us?"]="Thousand Needles lies in ruins under hundreds of feet of water. Can you spare any braves to assist us?"
G["Thousand Needles lies in ruins under hundreds of feet of water. Can you spare any goblins to assist us?"]="Thousand Needles lies in ruins under hundreds of feet of water. Can you spare any goblins to assist us?"
G["Thousands of years ... without new playthings ... I will enjoy this."]="Milhares de anos sem brinquedos novos... Me vou divertir."
G["Thrall Hall!"]="Larga vida a Thrall!"
G["Thrall Hall, $n! Here to help kill some misguided dwarves and gnomes?"]="Larga vida a Thrall, $n! Tem vindo para matar uns quantos anões e gnomos descarriados?"
G["Thrall and Saurfang have already gone down below."]="Thrall e Colmilhosauro já têm bajado."
G["Thrall be me brother, I hope he be safe."]="Thrall é meu irmão. Eh'mas que eh'chá bem."
G["Thrall grunts and thinks a moment on what to do with the Trade Prince."]="Thrall grunhe e acha durante uns segundos que fazer com o Príncipe mercante."
G["Thrall has escaped!  Don't let him get away!"]="Thrall tem huido! Não lhe deixem escapar!"
G["Thrall is not here to save you this time, Darkspear. Slink away to the shadows, for I shall hunt every last one of you down."]="Thrall is not here to save you this time, Darkspear. Slink away to the shadows, for I shall hunt every last one of you down."
G["Thrall is using all of his power to stabilize the rift from Azeroth's side.  We are doing what we can to stabilize it here as well."]="Thrall is using all of his power to stabilize the rift from Azeroth's side.  We are doing what we can to stabilize it here as well."
G["Thrall must be told of this day's events."]="Thrall precisa saber o que aconteceu hoje."
G["Thrall startles the horse with a fierce yell!"]="Thrall startles the horse with a fierce yell!"
G["Thrall tries to calm the horse down."]="Thrall tenta calmar ao cavalo."
G["Thrall was killed! Attack Corrupted Slimes to prevent damage to him."]="Thrall morreu! Ataca às babosas corruptas para esta que receba dano."
G["Thrall will never be free!"]="Thrall nunca será livre!"
G["Thrall will remain a slave. Taretha will die. You have failed."]="Thrall will remain a slave. Taretha will die. You have failed."
G["Thrall!  I am glad ya be well.  Dere were rumors otherwise."]="Thrall!  I am glad ya be well.  Dere were rumors otherwise."
G["Thrall!  My lord... are you all right?"]="Thrall! Meu senhor... está bem?"
G["Thrall! Come outside and face your fate!"]="Thrall! Saia e Enfrente ao seu destino!"
G["Thrall! You didn't really think you would escape, did you?  You and your allies shall answer to Blackmoore... after I've had my fun."]="Thrall! You didn't really think you would escape, did you?  You and your allies shall answer to Blackmoore... after I've had my fun."
G["Thrall's Grasp they called us: Twenty of Thrall's most accomplished and honored soldiers.\n\nI had ordered the regiment to build an encampment here, on the border of the Blasted Lands, while we waited for our orders to arrive from Orgrimmar. Weeks passed without word from the warchief; the men grew restless.\n\nIt was a judgment call, $n. I was young and ambitious, afraid of nothing. The battalion would set forth into the Blasted Lands under my command.\n\nA decision I would later regret."]="Thrall's Grasp they called us: Twenty of Thrall's most accomplished and honored soldiers.\n\nI had ordered the regiment to build an encampment here, on the border of the Blasted Lands, while we waited for our orders to arrive from Orgrimmar. Weeks passed without word from the warchief; the men grew restless.\n\nIt was a judgment call, $n. I was young and ambitious, afraid of nothing. The battalion would set forth into the Blasted Lands under my command.\n\nA decision I would later regret."
G["Thrall's balls! They're everywhere..."]="Thrall's balls! They're everywhere..."
G["Thrall's false Horde dares to intrude this far into my fortress?  Bring out the Thrallmar prisoners and call for the executioner!  They'll pay with their lives for this trespass!"]="Thrall's false Horde dares to intrude this far into my fortress?  Bring out the Thrallmar prisoners and call for the executioner!  They'll pay with their lives for this trespass!"
G["Thrall's fighting the Trade Prince up top on the other side of the docks. Hurry, $n!"]="Thrall está lutando contra o Príncipe mercante ao outro extremo dos Docas. Date pressa, $n!"
G["Thrall's traitors have abandoned the path to true power! They should die for their insolence and stupidity!"]="Os traidores de Thrall têm abandonou o caminho para o verdadeiro poder! Devem morrer pelo seu insolência e seu gracinha!"
G["Thrall's trapped himself in the chapel. He can't escape now."]="Thrall's trapped himself in the chapel. He can't escape now."
G["Thrall's words be true. Dey always be. The Horde is much more den a few old, stubborn leaders and a handful of heroes from Northrend. The people be cryin' Garrosh's name... at least for now."]="Thrall's words be true. Dey always be. The Horde is much more den a few old, stubborn leaders and a handful of heroes from Northrend. The people be cryin' Garrosh's name... at least for now."
G["Thrall, I've never met these people before in my life."]="Thrall, não lhes havia visto mais."
G["Thrall, come outside and face your fate. [PH]"]="Saia fosse e Enfrente ao seu destino! [PH]"
G["Thrall, we no longer answer to you. We have a new Warchief now. And he has reminded us that we are STRONG!"]="Thrall, já não respondemos ante ti. Agora temos um novo Chefe de Guerra, um que nos tem recordado que somos FORTES!"
G["Thrall, what has happened? The King is preparing for war..."]="Thrall, que tem acontecido? O Rei se prepara para a guerra..."
G["Thrall, you escaped!"]="Thrall, has escapado!"
G["Thrall, you must fully devote yourself to the cause."]="Thrall, you must fully devote yourself to the cause."
G["Thrall, you should go alone. Perhaps this old shaman can teach those farseers a thing or two."]="Thrall, you should go alone. Perhaps this old shaman can teach those farseers a thing or two."
G["Thrall... The blood haze has lifted."]="Thrall... A brumas de sangue sumiu."
G["Thrall... Warchief... your armies await your command. Let me lead them to Northrend to remove this undead menace!"]="Thrall... Warchief... your armies await your command. Let me lead them to Northrend to remove this undead menace!"
G["Thrall... must not... go free."]="Thrall... não deve ser... livre."
G["Thrall? Varok? What business do you have here?"]="Thrall? Varok? O que traz vocês aqui?"
G["Thrall? You've been a slave only to the past, grandson! But no more! When last I saw him, Durotan told me the name he would give his unborn son... He was... so proud..."]="Thrall? You've been a slave only to the past, grandson! But no more! When last I saw him, Durotan told me the name he would give his unborn son... He was... so proud..."
G["Thrallmar needs you, $c. The warchief needs you. Stand ready to do your duty."]="Thrallmar te precisa, $c. O Chefe de Guerra te precisa. Você precisa estar a ponto para cumprir com o seu dever."
G["Thralls balls! I'm sick of fighting naga!"]="Thralls balls! I'm sick of fighting naga!"
G["Threat analyzed!  Activating combat plan beta!  CLUCK!"]="Ameaça analizada! Ativando plano beta de combate! CLUC!"
G["Threat assessment routine modified. Current target threat level: 0. Acquiring new target."]="Threat assessment routine modified. Current target threat level: 0. Acquiring new target."
G["Threat imminent! Beginning evasive action!"]="Ameaça iminente! Iniciando ação evasiva!"
G["Threat index threshold exceeded.  Celestial archive aborted. Security level heightened."]="Limite de índice de ameaça superado. Arquivo celestial cancelado. Nível de segurança aumentou."
G["Threat level zero."]="Nível de ameaça zero."
G["Threat neutralized."]="Ameaça neutralizada."
G["Threat re-evaluated. Target assessment complete. Changing course."]="Ameaça re-evaluada. Evaluação de objetivo concluída. Cambiando de rumbo."
G["Three cheers for $n -- Admiral o' the Bloodsail Bucaneer Navy!"]="Three cheers for $n -- Admiral o' the Bloodsail Bucaneer Navy!"
G["Three cheers for $n!"]="Três vivas por $n!"
G["Three cheers for $n!  $G He's : She's; saved the town from the Burning Legion!"]="Três vivas por $n! salvou a cidade da Legião Ardente!"
G["Three cheers for $n!  This land shall be ours once again!"]="Três vivas para $n! Esta terra voltará a ser nossa!"
G["Three cheers for $n! Three cheers, and three beers!"]="Três vivas por $n! Três vivas e três birras!"
G["Three cheers for $n!!!\n\nI really cannot wait to setup my own little bed and breakfast in Azshara. What do you think it's like there?"]="Três vivas por $n!!!\n\nNão posso esperar a abrir meu próprio hotelito rural em Azshara. Como acha que é aquele lugar?"
G["Three cheers for all of you! Keep on riding that rocketway and buying from those vendors. You're contributing to the most noble cause in all of Azeroth: my pockets!"]="Três vivas por todos vocês! Sigam utilizando a Cohetepista e comprando desses vendedores. Estão contribuyendo à causa mais noble de tudo Azeroth: meus bolsos!"
G["Three decent elites!!"]="Três elites decentes!"
G["Three fragments were lost after the World Pillar shattered.  We must recover them or else the fate of our world is doomed."]="Three fragments were lost after the World Pillar shattered.  We must recover them or else the fate of our world is doomed."
G["Three minutes left -- I can feel the energy starting to build!  Keep up the solid defense!"]="Three minutes left -- I can feel the energy starting to build!  Keep up the solid defense!"
G["Three players are needed to cleanse the Pool of Life!"]="Fazem falta três jogadores para purificar a Poço de vida!"
G["Three words - \"ab - so - lutely\"!"]="Em três palavras \"se, gu, ro\"."
G["Three."]="Três."
G["Three..."]="Três..."
G["Throm'ka $c!  Are you ready to fight for the Horde at Warsong Gulch?"]="Throm'ka, $c! Está $gpreparado: preparada; para lutar pela Horda na Ravina Brado Guerreiro?"
G["Throm'ka, $c. All of the war materiel is in final preparation and being sent to Silithus. It should arrive over the course of the next $2113w days. With the equipment readied, and our forces arrayed, all we will be waiting for is someone to ring the gong on the Scarab Dais, which should open the gates of Ahn'Qiraj and start the war.\n\nLok'tar Ogar!"]="Throm'ka, $c. All of the war materiel is in final preparation and being sent to Silithus. It should arrive over the course of the next $2113w days. With the equipment readied, and our forces arrayed, all we will be waiting for is someone to ring the gong on the Scarab Dais, which should open the gates of Ahn'Qiraj and start the war.\n\nLok'tar Ogar!"
G["Throm'ka, $c. All of the war materiel is in final preparation and being sent to Silithus. The last of it should arrive in less than a day. With the equipment readied, and our forces arrayed, all we will be waiting for is someone to ring the gong on the Scarab Dais, which should open the gates of Ahn'Qiraj and start the war.\n\nLok'tar Ogar!"]="Throm'ka, $c. All of the war materiel is in final preparation and being sent to Silithus. The last of it should arrive in less than a day. With the equipment readied, and our forces arrayed, all we will be waiting for is someone to ring the gong on the Scarab Dais, which should open the gates of Ahn'Qiraj and start the war.\n\nLok'tar Ogar!"
G["Throm'ka, $c. Did you know our fight with the Silverwing Sentinels in Warsong Gulch continues still? Your presence would be welcome there..."]="Throm'ka, $c. Did you know our fight with the Silverwing Sentinels in Warsong Gulch continues still? Your presence would be welcome there..."
G["Throm'ka, $c. Is this shattered land what you expected to see? It's nothing like the stories I've been told. It's hard to believe my people ever thrived in this desolate place."]="Throm'ka, $c. Is this shattered land what you expected to see? It's nothing like the stories I've been told. It's hard to believe my people ever thrived in this desolate place."
G["Throm'ka, $c. You are here to help me with tin bars? They tell me that I will need $2006w so that they can make weapons and armor for the upcoming Ahn'Qiraj War, but I only have $2005w right now. You are going to bring me more!"]="Throm'ka, $c. You are here to help me with tin bars? They tell me that I will need $2006w so that they can make weapons and armor for the upcoming Ahn'Qiraj War, but I only have $2005w right now. You are going to bring me more!"
G["Throm'ka, $c. You must be new. You look fresh and unspoiled by the horrors of this land.\n\n<Sergeant Shatterskull spits into the dust.>\n\nThat'll change."]="Throm'ka, $c. Deve ser $gnuevo: nova;. Pareces jovem e não tem aspecto de haver vivido os horrores de estas terras.\n\n<O sargento Trizacráneo escupe no chão>\n\nIsso vai alterar."
G["Throm'ka, $gbrother:sister;! Welcome to Outland. The Horde needs all the strength it can muster in this broken world. I promise you, if it's glorious battle you've come seeking, you'll have your fill of it here."]="Throm'ka, $gbrother:sister;! Welcome to Outland. The Horde needs all the strength it can muster in this broken world. I promise you, if it's glorious battle you've come seeking, you'll have your fill of it here."
G["Throm'ka, $n.  Warsong Gulch is in need of heroes such as you."]="Throm'ka, $n. na Ravina Brado Guerreiro fazem falta heróis como você."
G["Throm'ka, Horde $C, stand proud! I am Warlord Gorchuk, commander of the Horde's war effort. There are trying times ahead of us, but we shall prevail, as always.\n\nIf you have questions, you should ask them."]="Throm'ka, Horde $C, stand proud! I am Warlord Gorchuk, commander of the Horde's war effort. There are trying times ahead of us, but we shall prevail, as always.\n\nIf you have questions, you should ask them."
G["Throm'ka, friend!\n\nThe Warchief has ordered me to assemble his greatest veterans for an assault on the Twilight Highlands.\n\nYou look like one tough $c, but we need soldiers who are a bit more... battle-hardened. Perhaps someday you and I will fight side-by-side. Until then, continue your training!"]="Throm'ka, amigo!\n\nO Chefe de Guerra me organizado que reúna aos melhores veteranos para o ataque às Terras Altas Crepúsculo.\n\nVocê pareces ser $gun: uma; $c resistente, mas precisamos de soldados mais... curtidos na batalha. Talvez algum dia você e eu luchemos ombros com ombros. Enquanto tanto, continue treinando!"
G["Throm'ka, friend! It is good to see a fellow veteran of the Northrend campaign.\n\nThe Warchief has ordered me to assemble his greatest warriors for an assault on the Twilight Highlands.\n\n<Warlord Krogg looks you up and down.>\n\nWe may need your help. Check in with the Warchief in Orgrimmar and see if he has a use for you yet."]="Throm'ka, amigo! fico feliz em ver a um amigo veterano da campanha de Nortúndria.\n\nO Chefe de Guerra me organizado que reúna aos melhores veteranos para o ataque às Terras Altas Crepúsculo.\n\n<O senhor da guerra Krogg te olhe de cima baixo.>\n\nTalvez necesitemos sua ajuda. Vê a falar com o Chefe de Guerra em Orgrimmar para ver se tem alguma tarefa para você."
G["Throm'ka, old friend."]="Throm'ka, velho amigo."
G["Throm-Ka, $c. My mood is poor this day, so please, unless you can help me, I would prefer to be alone."]="Throm-Ka, $c. Hoje não estou de bom humor assim que, por favor, se você não pode me ajudar preferiría estar sozinha."
G["Throm-Ka, $n. It is good to see you again."]="Throm-Ka, $n. fico feliz em voltar a ver você."
G["Throm-Ka, $n. We snuck a few more in while you were preparing the Gates for attack.\n\nI'll show you where we're to meet with Garona.\n\n<The squad leader produces a map of the Twilight Citadel and points to the spot.>\n\nLet me know when you're ready, and we'll go together."]="Throm-Ka, $n. We snuck a few more in while you were preparing the Gates for attack.\n\nI'll show you where we're to meet with Garona.\n\n<The squad leader produces a map of the Twilight Citadel and points to the spot.>\n\nLet me know when you're ready, and we'll go together."
G["Throm-Ka, goblin!"]="Throm-Ka, goblin!"
G["Throm-Ka, hero!"]="Throm-Ka, herói!"
G["Throm-ka! What you looking for, stranger?"]="Throm-ka! O que você está procurando, estranho?"
G["Throm-ka, Legionnaire!"]="Throm-ka, legionário!"
G["Throm-ka, pandaren. Welcome to the Horde."]="Throm-ka, pandaren. Bem-vindos à Horda."
G["Throne of Tides"]="Trono das Marés"
G["Throne of the Tides, a level 79-81 dungeon in Vashj'ir, is now available for initial testing. The dungeon is very much a work in progress, and the final boss is not available. Please be in your full group before teleporting to the dungeon. Meeting Stones are not available for this dungeon yet.\nTo leave the Throne of the Tides, simply exit through the normal exit inside the dungeon and you will be teleported to Dalaran. If you die and release, you should teleport back from this NPC."]="Throne of the Tides, a level 79-81 dungeon in Vashj'ir, is now available for initial testing. The dungeon is very much a work in progress, and the final boss is not available. Please be in your full group before teleporting to the dungeon. Meeting Stones are not available for this dungeon yet.\nTo leave the Throne of the Tides, simply exit through the normal exit inside the dungeon and you will be teleported to Dalaran. If you die and release, you should teleport back from this NPC."
G["Throngus SLICE you up!"]="Throngus SLICE you up!"
G["Throngus use your corpse on body. Somewhere..."]="Throngus usar seu cadáver sobre corpo. Em alguma parte..."
G["Through Frostmourne, Arthas killed his own father and razed this land along with every living creature in it!"]="Through Frostmourne, Arthas killed his own father and razed this land along with every living creature in it!"
G["Through fire we purge this land of its impurities."]="Mediante o fogo purgamos as impurezas desta terra."
G["Through me the Banshee Queen sees all..."]="Through me the Banshee Queen sees all..."
G["Through my studies, I see that defeating the god Hakkar's avatar has weakened him.  But the bulk of his strength remains, lurking at the far end of the Nether.\n\nYou have defeated his avatar once, $n.  Perhaps if you defeat it again you can further weaken the god so that, one day, we might face his true self.\n\nI have prepared a spell that you may use to again summon an avatar of Hakkar within the Sanctum of the Fallen God.  Do you want to confront it once again?"]="Through my studies, I see that defeating the god Hakkar's avatar has weakened him.  But the bulk of his strength remains, lurking at the far end of the Nether.\n\nYou have defeated his avatar once, $n.  Perhaps if you defeat it again you can further weaken the god so that, one day, we might face his true self.\n\nI have prepared a spell that you may use to again summon an avatar of Hakkar within the Sanctum of the Fallen God.  Do you want to confront it once again?"
G["Through our Master, all things are possible. His power is without limit, and his will unbending."]="Com nosso mestre, tudo é possível. Seu poder não tem limite e seu vontade é inflexible."
G["Through rigorous retraining I have had to break many students of all they had previously learned so that I might teach them anew.  The service I offer becomes increasingly difficult to perform each time it is done.  It is for that reason that it becomes increasingly expensive with each retraining.  Do you desire that I break you of the talents you have learned?"]="Através de uma reciclagem rigorosa, tive que quebrar muitos estudantes de tudo o que haviam aprendido anteriormente, para que eu pudesse ensiná-os novamente. O serviço que ofereço se torna cada vez mais difícil de executar cada vez que é feito. É por esse motivo que se torna cada vez mais caro a cada reciclagem. Deseja que eu quebre os talentos que aprendeu?"
G["Through sea and sky, we fly together."]="Juntos surcamos mares e céus."
G["Through sunsets beyond counting, the tusked people have dwelled here in the land of ice."]="Through sunsets beyond counting, the tusked people have dwelled here in the land of ice."
G["Through the Dark Portal"]="Através do Portal Negro"
G["Through the air we breathe, She strengthens our voice."]="A através do ar que respiramos, Ela reforça nossa voz."
G["Through the breech! Focus on their priests - they're empowering the others!"]="Entrar pela ruptura! Céntrate nos sacerdotes; reforçan aos mais!"
G["Through the breech! Target the wounded!"]="Atraviesa a ruptura! Ataca aos feridos!"
G["Through the gem, Elune channeled her infinite wisdom..."]="Through the gem, Elune channeled her infinite wisdom..."
G["Through the milennia, Ilyenia Moonfire has mastered numerous weapons and now offers to train others in their use.  You can find her at the Warrior's Terrace if you desire training."]="Através dos milênios, Ilyenia Moonfire dominou inúmeras armas e agora se oferece para treinar outras pessoas no seu uso. Você pode encontrá-a no Terraço do Guerreiro, se desejar treinamento."
G["Through the pain and fire my hatred burns!"]="Com o dor e o fogo, meu ódio arde!"
G["Through the purity of the fire's spirit are we cleansed.  Through the passion of its being are we driven."]="A pureza do espírito do fogo nos depura. A pasão do seu ser nos guia."
G["Through the second turn it's the $n!"]="$n tem concluído a segunda volta!"
G["Through the valleys and peaks of Mount Hyjal, across the shifting sands of Silithus, against the Legion's dread armies - we have fought. We are the nameless, faceless, sons and daughters of the Alliance. By the Light and by the might of the Alliance, the first strike belongs to us and the last strike is all that our enemies see.\n\nWe are 7th Legion."]="Through the valleys and peaks of Mount Hyjal, across the shifting sands of Silithus, against the Legion's dread armies - we have fought. We are the nameless, faceless, sons and daughters of the Alliance. By the Light and by the might of the Alliance, the first strike belongs to us and the last strike is all that our enemies see.\n\nWe are 7th Legion."
G["Through this portal, Tol Barad awaits."]="Através deste portal, Tol Barad espera."
G["Through thunder and storm, we fly together."]="Juntos superamos trovões e tempestades."
G["Through wind and tide, we fly together."]="Through wind and tide, we fly together."
G["Through you, is it? I think we can manage that."]="Through you, is it? I think we can manage that."
G["Through your efforts, you have brought both the Shadow Wardens and the Druids of the Talon to our side.\n\nExcellent work, $c.\n\nWe are gaining ground, but much work still remains.\n\nAs the enemy assails us, we must continue to build up our defenses. We require three things, $n.\n\nElderlimb and the Ancient Protectors watch over Hyjal, but their strength would be invaluable here.\n\nAs stalwart as our courage, our armory needs additional military supplies.\n\nFinally, the strength of Elune's calming waters will heal and rejuvenate our tired soldiers.\n\nWe need these things before our work here is complete.\n\nGo, $n. Your efforts are crucial to our victory."]="Through your efforts, you have brought both the Shadow Wardens and the Druids of the Talon to our side.\n\nExcellent work, $c.\n\nWe are gaining ground, but much work still remains.\n\nAs the enemy assails us, we must continue to build up our defenses. We require three things, $n.\n\nElderlimb and the Ancient Protectors watch over Hyjal, but their strength would be invaluable here.\n\nAs stalwart as our courage, our armory needs additional military supplies.\n\nFinally, the strength of Elune's calming waters will heal and rejuvenate our tired soldiers.\n\nWe need these things before our work here is complete.\n\nGo, $n. Your efforts are crucial to our victory."
G["Throw a Spiced Punch on hozen who jump on the cart!"]="Throw a Spiced Punch on hozen who jump on the cart!"
G["Throw a Spiced Punch to knock hozen off the cart!"]="Throw a Spiced Punch to knock hozen off the cart!"
G["Throw de big skull in de pot!"]="Mete a caveira g'ande na olha!"
G["Throw de mojos on de skull!"]="Vie'te os mojos sobre a caveira!"
G["Throw down your weapon and pick up your gloves. It's time for a good old-fashioned boxing match. Prepare to be floored by Ty'thar!"]="Throw down your weapon and pick up your gloves. It's time for a good old-fashioned boxing match. Prepare to be floored by Ty'thar!"
G["Throw in all 12 flasks."]="Lançar os 12 frascos."
G["Throw in an entire flask."]="Throw in an entire flask."
G["Throw it really hard at my face!"]="Throw it really hard at my face!"
G["Throw me back up!"]="Throw me back up!"
G["Throw me out of the priory, will they?"]="Throw me out of the priory, will they?"
G["Throw me up there!"]="Arrójame ali!"
G["Throw me!"]="Arrójame!"
G["Throw the Bouncy Ball to your serpent and see how long you can keep it in the air! When you are done playing, speak to me and I will take your serpent. Good luck!"]="Lánzale a pelota de goma ao seu dragão e prova quanto tempo pode jogar sem que caia ao sozinho. Quando tenha terminou, fala comigo e me levarei ao dragão. Boa sorte!"
G["Throw them into chaos while we regroup. The eyes of Hellscream are upon you!"]="Throw them into chaos while we regroup. The eyes of Hellscream are upon you!"
G["Throw these prisoners in the cages.  Let the men have their way with them."]="Throw these prisoners in the cages.  Let the men have their way with them."
G["Throw your Footbombs at those Steamwheedle Sharks!"]="Throw your Footbombs at those Steamwheedle Sharks!"
G["Throwing Starfish"]="Estrela marinha de arremesso"
G["Throwing grenade!"]="Throwing grenade!"
G["Thrown"]="Arremesso"
