G["Thunder and lightning dance at my call!"]="Thunder and lightning dance at my call!"
G["Thunder begins with a shock wave in the air due to the sudden thermal expansion of the plasma in the lightning channel!"]="Thunder begins with a shock wave in the air due to the sudden thermal expansion of the plasma in the lightning channel!"
G["Thunderbrew, finest brewery in all the realms."]="Cebatruenos, a melhor destilaria de todos os reinos!"
G["Thunderbrew, finest brewery in all the realms.  Check them out at Brewfest!"]="Cebatruenos, a melhor destilaria de todos os reinos! Não te os perda na Festa da Cerveja!"
G["Thundermar is the last holdout of the Wildhammer. My brother's trying to keep up the fight while our little town fills up with refugees."]="Thundermar é o último destaque do Wildhammer. Meu irmão está tentando seguir a luta enquanto nossa pequena cidade se enche de refugiados."
G["Thundermar, if we weren't on holy ground I'd pop you one so hard yer shoes would be the only thing left standin'!"]="Thundermar, if we weren't on holy ground I'd pop you one so hard yer shoes would be the only thing left standin'!"
G["Thundris Windweaver's corpse lays sprawled out here, the apparent victim of the Twilight's Hammer's machinations."]="Os cadáveres de Thundris Windweaver espalhados por aqui, a aparente vítima das maquinações do Martelo do Crepúsculo."
G["Thundris Windweaver's spirit is coaxed forth."]="Thundris Windweaver's spirit is coaxed forth."
G["Thurman my brother, who's laughing now?  Hah!"]="Thurman, irmão, quem ri agora? Ha!"
G["Thus, I was the first Paragon. This is why, I am the Prime."]="Thus, I was the first Paragon. This is why, I am the Prime."
G["Thuwd will show you how to skin your kills.  Look for him at Kodohide Leatherworkers in The Drag."]="Thuwd irá mostrar-lhe como esfolar suas mortes. Procure por ele em Kodohide Leatherworkers em The Drag."
