G["Tickets! Redeem your Darkmoon Prize Tickets here!  Wondrous and exotic prizes are waiting for you!"]="Tickets! Redeem your Darkmoon Prize Tickets here!  Wondrous and exotic prizes are waiting for you!"
G["Tides take you!"]="Tides take you!"
