G["Tillers"]="Tillers"
G["Tilloa is that you?  Why no!  It's just some dirty $r!"]="Tilhoa, é você? Oh, não! Somente é $gun sujo: uma suja; $r!"
G["Timan fell from the Pillar of Ash.  Othana was eaten by wolves.  Gorlop fell in lava.  And most of my sergeants were killed in a freak cudgelling accident."]="Timan fell from the Pillar of Ash.  Othana was eaten by wolves.  Gorlop fell in lava.  And most of my sergeants were killed in a freak cudgelling accident."
