G["Time for a five-minute break. Haha, just kidding! What do you think this is, the Alliance?!"]="Time for a five-minute break. Haha, just kidding! What do you think this is, the Alliance?!"
G["Time for a little open-heart surgery!"]="Hora de operar a coração aberto!"
