G["Time for listening. You listen to son of Zart, best scrapper Frenzyheart ever see!"]="Time for listening. You listen to son of Zart, best scrapper Frenzyheart ever see!"
G["Time for more smart Dajik tip! Crystals work little too good for back scratch. No try."]="Hora de receber outro conselho inteligente de Dajik! Cristais rascar costas demais bem. Não tentar."
G["Time for more smart Dajik tip! If Goregek let chickens out again, make Goregek get chickens back again."]="Hora de receber outro conselho inteligente de Dajik! Se Goregek soltar frangos novamente, fazer que Goregek coletar frangos."
G["Time for more smart Dajik tip! Lot of dead things mean lot of chance of being dead thing. Dajik leaving now."]="Time for more smart Dajik tip! Lot of dead things mean lot of chance of being dead thing. Dajik leaving now."
