G["Time for more smart Dajik tip! Messing up big-tongue shrine is fun, but make sure lot of big-tongues not watching first."]="Time for more smart Dajik tip! Messing up big-tongue shrine is fun, but make sure lot of big-tongues not watching first."
G["Time for more smart Dajik tip! No let things beat your teacher up so badly. Going home now."]="Time for more smart Dajik tip! No let things beat your teacher up so badly. Going home now."
