G["Time for the Gizleton Caravan to head on out! We'll be back soon but if you cannot wait, head north to Kormek's Hut. We open shop in about an hour."]="Time for the Gizleton Caravan to head on out! We'll be back soon but if you cannot wait, head north to Kormek's Hut. We open shop in about an hour."
G["Time for the feedings."]="Time for the feedings."
G["Time for the pain!"]="Hora de sofrer!"
G["Time for vengeance, mortals!"]="É a hora da vingança, mortais!"
G["Time for you to go."]="É hora de que te vá."
G["Time for you to take a long nap in the sand...."]="Time for you to take a long nap in the sand...."
G["Time has run out. The Arena battle is over!"]="Se acabou o tempo. A batalha de arena terminou!"
G["Time is a luxury you no longer possess!"]="Time is a luxury you no longer possess!"
G["Time is frozen in this place. The island teems with life, yet somehow never changes."]="Time is frozen in this place. The island teems with life, yet somehow never changes."
G["Time is money, friend!"]="O tempo é ouro, colega!"
G["Time is money, friend. Go go go!"]="O tempo é ouro, colega. Vamos, vamos!"
G["Time is not for all mortals to command, $C. Only those chosen as Chronomancers may learn to navigate the temporal streams."]="Time is not for all mortals to command, $C. Only those chosen as Chronomancers may learn to navigate the temporal streams."
G["Time is not on our side. Go as soon as you are able."]="O tempo não nos acompanha. Vá ali assim que possa."
G["Time is of the essence here, $n. Are you prepared to be tested?"]="O tempo é esêncial aqui, $n. Empezamos com a prova?"
G["Time is of the essence, $n. Proveditor Grantley may be able to help you get back to Stormwind. Of course, everything has a price."]="O tempo apremia, $n. É possível que o proveditor Grantley possa ajudar você a voltar a Ventobravo, mas claro, tudo tem um preço."
G["Time is precious, never waste it."]="Time is precious, never waste it."
G["Time is precious, sister. Let us see to our ritual..."]="O tempo é ouro, irmã. Ocupémonos de nosso ritual..."
G["Time is running out for me... for us all..."]="O tempo está acabando para mim... para todos nós..."
G["Time is running out troll.  Whenever you feel like talking about Drak'Tharon, let me know."]="Time is running out troll.  Whenever you feel like talking about Drak'Tharon, let me know."
G["Time is running out! Tell me!"]="Se nos acabao tempo! Dilo!"
G["Time is up! You have failed.... Any remaining prisoners are now SMOKED."]="Time is up! You have failed.... Any remaining prisoners are now SMOKED."
G["Time is wasting. I want this place picked clean before they counter-attack."]="Time is wasting. I want this place picked clean before they counter-attack."
