G["Time to relax, the Alliance be way behind us mon. We all done with our collectin' here, and the final polishes be goin' on things as we speak. When they get done over in their Ironforge, then we be thinkin' 'bout movin' all this stuff to Silithus. 'Til then, sit tight and maybe do some fishin'."]="Time to relax, the Alliance be way behind us mon. We all done with our collectin' here, and the final polishes be goin' on things as we speak. When they get done over in their Ironforge, then we be thinkin' 'bout movin' all this stuff to Silithus. 'Til then, sit tight and maybe do some fishin'."
