G["Times are changing, $n.  War has arrived.\n\nWill our people rise to the occasion and aid our allies... or will we linger in the sidelines?"]="Times are changing, $n.  War has arrived.\n\nWill our people rise to the occasion and aid our allies... or will we linger in the sidelines?"
