G["To arms!"]="Às armas!"
G["To arms!  Scourge spotted in the Cathedral of Light!"]="To arms!  Scourge spotted in the Cathedral of Light!"
G["To arms!  The colossi attack!"]="Peguem as armas! Os colossos atacando!"
