G["To be honest, I did not believe the truth of Vaeldrin's visions at first. But this place radiates an unusual magic - could these be the fabled \"Pools of Youth?\""]="To be honest, I did not believe the truth of Vaeldrin's visions at first. But this place radiates an unusual magic - could these be the fabled \"Pools of Youth?\""
G["To become a Shado-Pan, one must dedicate $Ghimself:herself; in body, mind, and soul."]="To become a Shado-Pan, one must dedicate $Ghimself:herself; in body, mind, and soul."
G["To burn my kingdom, you can't use fire! Come my servants, I am not ready to retire!"]="To burn my kingdom, you can't use fire! Come my servants, I am not ready to retire!"
G["To care for these fearless beasts, who stand between my clanmates and death, is an honor."]="Cuidar dessas bestas destemidas, que ficam entre meus companheiros de clã e a morte, é uma honra."
G["To catch Gahz'ranka, you'll need a special Mudskunk lure.  I make 'em myself!\n\nBut you need more than just the lure; you need some mudskunks too... you need to place them in the lure to give it a rank old smell!\n\nWhen you have the mudskunks, throw the lure off Pagle's Point in Zul'Gurub... and then grab a drink and wait... but not too long, because Gahz'ranka is sure to come a'stomping!"]="To catch Gahz'ranka, you'll need a special Mudskunk lure.  I make 'em myself!\n\nBut you need more than just the lure; you need some mudskunks too... you need to place them in the lure to give it a rank old smell!\n\nWhen you have the mudskunks, throw the lure off Pagle's Point in Zul'Gurub... and then grab a drink and wait... but not too long, because Gahz'ranka is sure to come a'stomping!"
G["To celebrate the birth of yet another deadly enemy is an odd thing, to say the least. Still, we will join our allies in their festivities."]="Celebrar o nascimento de mais um inimigo mortal é uma coisa estranha, para dizer o mínimo. Ainda assim, nos juntaremos aos nossos aliados nas suas festividades."
G["To come this far has not been easy, I know. But how boring life would be without challenges, don't you think? Good, because I have a challenge for you..."]="Chegar até aqui não foi fácil, o sei. Mas a vida seria muito entediante sem retos, não acha? Estupendo, porque tenho um desafio para você."
G["To complete our great work, we will need a sacred place."]="Para concluir nossa obra precisamos de um lugar sagrado."
G["To darkness I condemn you."]="À escuridão os condeno."
G["To defeat an opponent in battle is to validate your strategy."]="Derrotar um oponente em batalha éa validação da sua estratégia."
G["To defeat me, you will need to use all that you have learned from the other masters.  If you can do that, your training will be complete."]="To defeat me, you will need to use all that you have learned from the other masters.  If you can do that, your training will be complete."
G["To defend the vale with my life is an honor!"]="Defendao vale com minha vida é uma honra!"
G["To die for the empress is an honor!"]="Morrer pela Imperatriz é uma honra!"
G["To die in battle is glorious! But, with what I teach you, maybe you not die so quickly, hm?"]="To die in battle is glorious! But, with what I teach you, maybe you not die so quickly, hm?"
G["To die today, on this field of battle, is to die an orcish death. To die today is to die for our little ones. Our old ones. Our ... loved ones."]="Morrer hoje, neste campo de batalha, é morrer como um autêntico orc. Morrer hoje é morrer por nossos pequenos e nossos maiores, em definitiva, por todos aos que amamos."
G["To die would be a wonderfully grand adventure."]="Morrer seria uma aventura maravilhosamente intensa."
G["To die... for the warchief... is... an... honor..."]="Morrer pelo Chefe de Guerra... é... um... honra..."
G["To do what is right, no matter the cost. That is wisdom."]="Fazer o que é certo, não importa o custo. Isso é sabedoria."
G["To do your heavy lifting, most likely."]="To do your heavy lifting, most likely."
G["To eat!!"]="To eat!!"
G["To ensure a rapid crew response in the event of a fire, fuel storage has been moved away from the crew quarters and placed beneath the passenger compartment."]="To ensure a rapid crew response in the event of a fire, fuel storage has been moved away from the crew quarters and placed beneath the passenger compartment."
G["To fight, yes. To die? Likely. But we will give them no ground, $c.\n\nWe are outnumbered. Our armor is patchwork, our weapons scavenged.\n\nBut this is our land! Our tauren allies know every hidden trail, crevice, and pass through these hills. We descend from the high ground where they least expect us, then disappear into the terrain like phantoms. Fear is our weapon, and we will strike at them unceasingly."]="To fight, yes. To die? Likely. But we will give them no ground, $c.\n\nWe are outnumbered. Our armor is patchwork, our weapons scavenged.\n\nBut this is our land! Our tauren allies know every hidden trail, crevice, and pass through these hills. We descend from the high ground where they least expect us, then disappear into the terrain like phantoms. Fear is our weapon, and we will strike at them unceasingly."
G["To find clarity and purpose, immerse yourself in inner reflection."]="Para encontrar a claridade e a determinação, sumérgete na reflexão interno."
G["To find your White Pawn, we must call upon the ancient magic of my people. To do so, we must first create a Dream Brew."]="Para encontrar seu peão alvo devemos evocar a magia ancestral de meu povo. Para elho, temos que elaborar primeiro um mistura de ensuenho."
G["To get down safely, I provide wings to those in need."]="To get down safely, I provide wings to those in need."
G["To get in, we will need specially tuned crystals from some of the mantid leaders in the area."]="Para entrar, vamos precisar dos cristais sintonizados de alguns chefes dos mantídeos da área."
G["To have seen the things I've seen, to have done the things I've done, and to still breathe... I am a lucky gnome."]="Ter visto as coisas que vi, ter feito as coisas que fiz e ainda respirar... Sou um gnomo de sorte."
G["To have waited so long... for this..."]="Haver esperado tanto... para isto."
G["To have witnessed the opening of the gates... it is a tale I will pass down to my children's children."]="To have witnessed the opening of the gates... it is a tale I will pass down to my children's children."
G["To hell with the undead! We'll cut our way through the woods, men!"]="Ao inferno com os não-mortos! Nos abriremos passo pelas florestas, companheiros!"
G["To hell with this, I'm running for it!"]="Já é suficiente! Vou tentar escapar!"
G["To hell with you, Thassarian."]="Vá embora ao inferno, Thassarian."
G["To her altar this mortal must travel. What they must do will not be easy. In the end it may prove impossible."]="Este mortal deve viajar até seu altar. O que devem fazer não será fácil. Ao fim talvez resulte possível."
G["To hold you in my arms would be the fulfillment of my dreams. Come down from there, let us travel far away from here!"]="To hold you in my arms would be the fulfillment of my dreams. Come down from there, let us travel far away from here!"
G["To honor your elders is to honor your culture and your people, $c.  For this, the coins of ancestry serve as a tangible means to recognize those who choose to follow a venerable path of respect.\n\nDuring this Lunar Festival, you may have the opportunity to honor many elders.  As you do so, you will acquire the coins of ancestry.  Bring me these coins, and I will reward your diligence with a selection of unique items."]="To honor your elders is to honor your culture and your people, $c.  For this, the coins of ancestry serve as a tangible means to recognize those who choose to follow a venerable path of respect.\n\nDuring this Lunar Festival, you may have the opportunity to honor many elders.  As you do so, you will acquire the coins of ancestry.  Bring me these coins, and I will reward your diligence with a selection of unique items."
G["To interfere with construct's function results in termination. Move along."]="Interferir nas funções de ensamblagem tem como resultados a aniquilação. Muévete."
G["To learn THAT is to learn true wisdom."]="Aprender isso é conhecer a verdadeira sabedoria."
G["To learn to be one with Nature in the eyes of the Earth Mother, this is a matter of pride.  If your will is to learn the ways of the Hunter you must seek out Yaw Sharpmane at the north end of Bloodhoof Village."]="Para aprender a ser um com a Natureza aos olhos da Mãe Terra, isso é uma questão de orgulho. Se sua vontade é aprender os caminhos do Caçador, você deve procurar Yaw Sharpmane no extremo norte da Vila Casco Sangrento."
G["To learn to cure leather and work with hides go to Orgrimmar to the north.  One of the Orgrimmar Grunts will be able to tell you the way to the Leatherworking Trainer."]="Para aprender a curar couro e trabalhar com couros, vá para Orgrimmar, ao norte. Um dos Grunhidos de Orgrimmar poderá lhe dizer o caminho para o Treinador de Couraria."
G["To live without anger is not to live at all. It is ours to overcome. In defeating our anger, we draw great strength."]="To live without anger is not to live at all. It is ours to overcome. In defeating our anger, we draw great strength."
G["To maintain our link to the mainland, we have hippogryphs constantly flying between Rut'theran Village and Darkshore."]="To maintain our link to the mainland, we have hippogryphs constantly flying between Rut'theran Village and Darkshore."
G["To many of my people I am known as a traitor... as Illidan's lapdog.  It is best that they continue to think that for now."]="Para muitas pessoas, sou conhecido como traidor... como o cãozinho de Illidan. É melhor que eles continuem pensando isso por enquanto."
G["To many of the Forsaken, the moon now holds the place in our hearts where sun once resided. However, if you choose to join the celebration, go to Moonglade in Kalimdor. You'll find druids in the throne room above Undercity that will transport you there."]="Para muitos dos Renegados, a lua agora ocupa o lugar em nossos corações onde o sol antes residia. No entanto, se você optar por participar da celebração, vá para Moonglade em Kalimdor. Você encontrará druidas na sala do trono acima da Cidade Baixa que o transportarão até lá."
G["To me, my minions! Strike now!"]="Venham a mim, meusss ssservosss! Ataquem agora!"
G["To me, my servants!"]="To me, my servants!"
G["To merely provide an answer teaches nothing.\n\nPandaria is a land of teaching and learning."]="To merely provide an answer teaches nothing.\n\nPandaria is a land of teaching and learning."
G["To my side, brothers! For the Makers!"]="A meu lado, irmãos! pelos Criadores!"
G["To my surprise, his people have found something! Right here, in the sacred vale! What will happen now?"]="Para minha surpresa, seu povo realmente encontrou algo! Bem aqui, no Vale sagrado! O que acontecerá agora?"
G["To our great fortune, you've proven quite honorable and dedicated."]="To our great fortune, you've proven quite honorable and dedicated."
G["To pass beyond my Hall, you must defeat me in a game of skill!  Control your king when you are ready to begin..."]="Para passar além do meu salão, você deve me derrotar em um jogo de habilidade! Controle seu rei quando estiver pronto para começar..."
G["To prepare for a world of perfection, the imperfect must be swept away."]="To prepare for a world of perfection, the imperfect must be swept away."
G["To reach The Crossroads, $n, follow the road east then north."]="To reach The Crossroads, $n, follow the road east then north."
G["To reach the Rut'theran Ferry, you will need to travel to Darnassus and take the portal to Rut'theran Village at the base of Teldrassil."]="Para chegar ao ferry de Rut'theran, você precisará viajar para Darnassus e pegar o portal para a vila de Rut'theran, na base de Teldrassil."
G["To repeat the same action and expect different results is madness."]="Fazer o mesmo uma e outra vez e esperar diferentes resultados é uma loucura."
G["To restore life is to restore the natural order of the elements."]="Restaurar a vida é restaurar o ordem natural dos elementos."
G["To retrieve Mimiron's sigil, initiate self-destruct sequence and defeat Mimiron before its completion."]="To retrieve Mimiron's sigil, initiate self-destruct sequence and defeat Mimiron before its completion."
G["To run on water, one must run very fast."]="Para correr sobre a água é preciso correr muito rápido."
G["To see only the defeat of losing the remains would be foolish. This village is the first of many that will rise against the Thunder King. This is a great victory!"]="To see only the defeat of losing the remains would be foolish. This village is the first of many that will rise against the Thunder King. This is a great victory!"
G["To serve is madness, but defiance ... impossible!"]="To serve is madness, but defiance ... impossible!"
G["To serve upon his table."]="... um prato de delicioso sabor."
G["To signify our reforged friendship, I have something which belongs to you..."]="Para honrar nossa renovada amizade, tenho algo que te pertence..."
G["To stand a chance in this battle against Ragnaros, we must gather allies who will gladly brave the scorched plains of the Firelands. And before we can recruit such allies to our cause - be they druid, soldier, or simple provisioner - we will need to give them reason to join us.\n\nCarrying even a handful of these marks signifies you as a hero of our cause. Gather them in the hundreds... and you will lead armies.\n\nAre you beginning to see the plan yet?"]="To stand a chance in this battle against Ragnaros, we must gather allies who will gladly brave the scorched plains of the Firelands. And before we can recruit such allies to our cause - be they druid, soldier, or simple provisioner - we will need to give them reason to join us.\n\nCarrying even a handful of these marks signifies you as a hero of our cause. Gather them in the hundreds... and you will lead armies.\n\nAre you beginning to see the plan yet?"
G["To strike me is to strike his Majesty! He will not suffer this insult!"]="To strike me is to strike his Majesty! He will not suffer this insult!"
G["To success, then!"]="Então, pelo êxito!"
G["To summon a Dreadsteed, you must first create a Circle of Greater Summoning.  A portal to Xoroth may only be created from within such a circle.\n\nThe Circle of Greater Summoning requires three powerful implements: a Bell of Dethmoora, a Wheel of the Black March and a Doomsday Candle."]="Para evocar a um corcel nefasto, primeiro deve criar um Círculo de evocação superior. Somente é possível criar um portal a Xoroth a partir desse círculo.\n\nPara formar o Círculo de evocação superior precisa três poderosos itens: uma Sino de Dethmoora, uma Roda da Marcha Negra e uma Vela do dia do Juízo Fim."
G["To teach him a lesson, the father dragged the cub out to the forest, to watch how the hozen live. \"Do you see what the hozen are like?\" he asked. \"Do you want to live like that?\""]="Para ensinar uma lição a ele, o pai arrastou o filhote para a floresta, para que ele visse como viviam os hozens. \"Você viu como são os hozens?\", ele perguntou. \"Você quer viver daquele jeito?\""
G["To the Greymane Wall! We will force their hand."]="To the Greymane Wall! We will force their hand."
G["To the Void... once more."]="Ao Vazio... outra vez."
G["To the crushing depths with you!"]="To the crushing depths with you!"
G["To the death!"]="À morte!"
