G["To the front lines! The Kor'kron Vanguard needs air support!"]="Às linhas de linha de frente! A Vanguarda Kor'kron precisa apoio aéreo!"
G["To the front, men!"]="To the front, men!"
G["To the grave with you!"]="Vê à tumba!"
G["To the heavens above our hero claimed love"]="Nosso herói aos céus clamó seu amor"
G["To the house! Stay close to me, no matter what! I have my gun and ammo there!"]="To the house! Stay close to me, no matter what! I have my gun and ammo there!"
G["To the plaguelands went old Duggan, ta' send them Scourge back inta' th' groun'."]="Às terras da fedor o velho Duggan foi, para devolver o Flagelo à terra,"
G["To the safe hall, your majesty."]="To the safe hall, your majesty."
G["To the skies!"]="Até o céu!"
G["To the south lies our goal. We will march to the Citadel and cut out the heart of the Scourge where it dwells."]="To the south lies our goal. We will march to the Citadel and cut out the heart of the Scourge where it dwells."
G["To the south! Move!"]="Ao sul! Vamos!"
G["To the throne room!"]="À Salão do Trono!"
G["To the town hall, everyone!  We've brought you weapons!  Arm yourselves and beat the Scourge back!"]="To the town hall, everyone!  We've brought you weapons!  Arm yourselves and beat the Scourge back!"
G["To the well! HURRY!"]="Ao poço! RÁPIDO!"
G["To the west."]="Para o oeste."
G["To think you've come so far, only to perish here. I'll honor you with clean deaths."]="To think you've come so far, only to perish here. I'll honor you with clean deaths."
G["To think: This place has been outside our time stream - and existence itself! - for millennia.\nOur most experienced Weavers assure us the island's temporal position is presently stable, but still, I wonder...\nWhat would happen if it vanished again while we were upon it?"]="To think: This place has been outside our time stream - and existence itself! - for millennia.\nOur most experienced Weavers assure us the island's temporal position is presently stable, but still, I wonder...\nWhat would happen if it vanished again while we were upon it?"
G["To this day, I ponder why I, myself, was chosen for this particular station. I can only imagine my superior felt I was uniquely suited to the task and would quickly become accustomed to the quaint culture of the Horde found herein, but I heard a truly mean-spirited rumor that it may be because I talk too much."]="To this day, I ponder why I, myself, was chosen for this particular station. I can only imagine my superior felt I was uniquely suited to the task and would quickly become accustomed to the quaint culture of the Horde found herein, but I heard a truly mean-spirited rumor that it may be because I talk too much."
G["To those who would question our place in this world..."]="aos que cuestionen nosso lugar neste mundo..."
G["To trust an orc? Even if it is the progeny of Durotan himself! This is madness!"]="To trust an orc? Even if it is the progeny of Durotan himself! This is madness!"
G["To use the convienent Grimtotem Auctioneering services, you must have the permission of the great Magatha Grimtotem!"]="To use the convienent Grimtotem Auctioneering services, you must have the permission of the great Magatha Grimtotem!"
G["To what end? What are you two working towards?"]="Com que fim? Qual é o objetivo de vocês dois?"
G["To win this war, we can't sit idle and let the tides sweep us over.  We must strike, hard and fast, or Arathi will never again be ours."]="Para vencer esta guerra, não podemos ficar ociosos e deixar a maré nos varrer. Devemos atacar com força e rapidez, ou Arathi nunca mais será nosso."
G["To your health, windbag."]="To your health, windbag."
