G["Today is a good day, friend. Long has it been since I have left Wyrmrest Temple, free to fly across the great Dragonblight."]="Today is a good day, friend. Long has it been since I have left Wyrmrest Temple, free to fly across the great Dragonblight."
G["Today is a good day."]="Hoje é um bom dia."
G["Today is the day I defeat my rival!"]="Today is the day I defeat my rival!"
