G["Today it's cave-ins and nibblers, tomorrow it'll be floods and jinyu. Just another day at the quarry."]="Today it's cave-ins and nibblers, tomorrow it'll be floods and jinyu. Just another day at the quarry."
G["Today marks the first of many defeats for the Scourge! Death knights, once in service of the Lich King, have broken free of his grasp and formed a new alliance against his tyranny!"]="Today marks the first of many defeats for the Scourge! Death knights, once in service of the Lich King, have broken free of his grasp and formed a new alliance against his tyranny!"
G["Today our world's destruction has been averted in defiance of our very makers!"]="Today our world's destruction has been averted in defiance of our very makers!"
G["Today they still act as traders, messengers, guides, and pack bearers for expeditions high up in Kun-Lai summit."]="Hoje em dia eles ainda são comerciantes, mensageiros, guias e carregadores para expedições que sobem o monte Kun-Lai."
G["Today you have lost -- but what have you learned?"]="Hoje você perdeu, mas o que aprendeu?"
G["Today you have unmade what took me years to create! For this you shall all die by my hand!"]="Today you have unmade what took me years to create! For this you shall all die by my hand!"
G["Today, $n, we celebrate your graduation. You have learned all that there is to know within the walls of Tian."]="$n, hoje celebramos seu graduação. Tem aprendido tudo o que podemos ensinar atrás os muros de Tian."
G["Today, I fight by your side."]="Today, I fight by your side."
G["Today, I fulfill that promise."]="Hoje cumplo meu promessa."
G["Today, WE will remake the world. OUR world. FOR THE HORDE!"]="Hoje, NÓS reharemos o mundo. NOSSO mundo. pela HORDA!"
G["Today, our friendship is cemented with the Alliance! Today, we go forth as brothers and sisters. To our new future!"]="Today, our friendship is cemented with the Alliance! Today, we go forth as brothers and sisters. To our new future!"
G["Today, the Borean Tundra. Tomorrow, the world!"]="Hoje, a Tundra Boreana. Manhã, o mundo!"
G["Today, we are reborn! Today, we take a stand as men and women, not nameless, faceless numbers!"]="Today, we are reborn! Today, we take a stand as men and women, not nameless, faceless numbers!"
G["Today, we honor the ones that bring us good food and good drink."]="Today, we honor the ones that bring us good food and good drink."
G["Today, we welcome you into the Shado-Pan."]="Hoje te damos a boas-vindas ao Shadopan."
G["Today, you forge an eternal bond with your cloud serpent."]="Hoje, se forja um vínculo eterno entre seu dragão nimbo e você."
G["Today, you will face many trainers, who have honed their skills and proven themselves.  Will your pets tell the same story about you?  We shall see!  Good luck!"]="Today, you will face many trainers, who have honed their skills and proven themselves.  Will your pets tell the same story about you?  We shall see!  Good luck!"
G["Today, you will meet your ancestors!"]="Today, you will meet your ancestors!"
G["Today, you'll wish you never stirred from your bed!"]="Today, you'll wish you never stirred from your bed!"
G["Today, your journey toward the Order of the Cloud Serpent ends. Today, a new rider joins our ranks."]="Hoje, seu viagem para se juntar à Ordem do Dragão Nimbo termina. Hoje, $gun novo: uma nova; cavaleiro se une a nossas fileiras."
G["Toe up..."]="Patas cima..."
G["Together we are unstoppable!"]="Together we are unstoppable!"
