G["Too little, too late. The dam has broken. We are a bump in the road at best."]="Já é tarde demais. Estamos desbordados. Somos, como muito, um pequeno obstáculo no caminho."
G["Too long have I been gone, fighting my way across Azeroth to rediscover my past and reclaim my throne. With all the challenges that have tested the Alliance in my absence, it warms my heart to see heroes such as yourself defending our coalition."]="Há muito tempo estou fosse, lutando contra Azeroth para redescobrir meu passado e recuperar meu trono. Com todos os desafios que testaram a Aliança na minha ausência, aquece meu coração ver heróis como você defendendo nossa coalizão."
G["Too long have I sat idle, gripped in this haze... this malaise, lamenting what could have been... what should have been."]="Too long have I sat idle, gripped in this haze... this malaise, lamenting what could have been... what should have been."
G["Too long in that cage.  I'll show these mogu what I think of their captivity..."]="Too long in that cage.  I'll show these mogu what I think of their captivity..."
G["Too long... Tireless, endless planning... It will not end like this..."]="Tanto tempo... de planificação incansável... Não terminará assim..."
