G["Tracking is it?  Then Denmul Farmountain is the one you should pay a visit to.  He'll teach ye the tricks of the trade like no other.  \nJust head south from the gates of Ironforge to The Military District to find him."]="Tracking is it?  Then Denmul Farmountain is the one you should pay a visit to.  He'll teach ye the tricks of the trade like no other.  \nJust head south from the gates of Ironforge to The Military District to find him."
