G["Treelos, I know that the truth is somewhere inside you.  Tell me what it is."]="Treelos, eu sei que a verdade está em algum lugar dentro de você. Diga-me o que é."
G["Tremble before Taldaram, mortals, for the power of the orb flows through me!"]="Tremble before Taldaram, mortals, for the power of the orb flows through me!"
G["Tremble before me!"]="Tremble before me!"
