G["Troll mojo da strongest mojo!"]="Mojo de troll, o mojo mais forte!"
G["Troll powah, mon!"]="Troll powah, mon!"
G["Troll weaklings, there is no hope. Your death has been foretold by the tides."]="Debiluchos trolls, não há esperança. As marés têm presagiado sua morte."
G["Troll! What are you still doing in my town?"]="Troll! O que está fazendo ainda na minha cidade?"
G["Troll! You know all about this... voodoo.  What can you find?"]="Troll! Você o sabe tudo sobre esse... rolho vodu. Que pode fazer?"
G["Troll, if you can't keep a civil tongue in your head, I'll be happy to remove it for you."]="Troll, if you can't keep a civil tongue in your head, I'll be happy to remove it for you."
G["Trollbane alone cannot fight back the combined might of the orcish Horde. We are done for..."]="Trollbane alone cannot fight back the combined might of the orcish Horde. We are done for..."
G["Trollbane!"]="Matatroll"
G["Trolls - make yourselves useful. I am almost finished here."]="Trolls - make yourselves useful. I am almost finished here."
G["Trolls and orcs have fought together. Died together. We are family. And family looks after its own."]="Trolls and orcs have fought together. Died together. We are family. And family looks after its own."
G["Trolls been saying stuff, boss."]="Os trolls estar dizendo coisas."
G["Trolls is shameful. Trolls is killers!"]="Trolls is shameful. Trolls is killers!"
G["Trolls of the world will unite against you!"]="Trolls of the world will unite against you!"
G["Trolls. Those were actual trolls! We have heard of them in stories. But to see them in person. And every bit as ferocious as the tales tell."]="Trolls. Those were actual trolls! We have heard of them in stories. But to see them in person. And every bit as ferocious as the tales tell."
G["Trolls... I thought they were but legend!"]="Trolls... Achava que eram uma lendas!"
G["Troops! Fall in!"]="Tropas! A formar!"
G["Troops! Fall out!"]="Troops! Fall out!"
G["Trope will show you how to fly like a Dragonmaw... You will show Trope how to die like a scrub."]="Trope will show you how to fly like a Dragonmaw... You will show Trope how to die like a scrub."
G["Troteman, you old dog, I knew I'd find you stirring up trouble."]="Troteman, you old dog, I knew I'd find you stirring up trouble."
G["Troteman?"]="Troteman?"
G["Troublesome whelps. I'll teach you to interfere!"]="Troublesome whelps. I'll teach you to interfere!"
G["Troubling times indeed. Fear of the unknown makes people do foolish things."]="Em verdade são tempos difíceis. O medo ao desconhecido impulsa às pessoas a cometer estupideces."
G["True masters learn to make blood serve more than just their strength in battle."]="True masters learn to make blood serve more than just their strength in battle."
G["True mastery must be earned! It is up to you to earn it now..."]="True mastery must be earned! It is up to you to earn it now..."
G["True wisdom comes from the understanding that you have much to master."]="A verdadeira sabedoria radica em entender que te ocorrida muito por domínio."
G["True, Northrend is a hard land, but our people are strong, hardy, and equal to the task!"]="Certo, Nortúndria é uma terra dura, mas nossa gente é forte, robusta e muito apta para a tarefa!"
G["True, but how far should we push?  At what point are we no better than our enemies?"]="True, but how far should we push?  At what point are we no better than our enemies?"
G["True, our enemies would show us no mercy."]="True, our enemies would show us no mercy."
G["True. True. Light help him if that monster ever gets free!"]="Certo, certo. Que a Luz o ajude se alguma vez se liberar esse monstro!"
G["Truer words were never spoken!"]="Truer words were never spoken!"
G["Truffles!"]="Truffles!"
G["Truly $n has been enlightened by the crystals."]="$n foi mesmo iluminado pelos cristais."
G["Truly a splendor! Have you ever seen such a view, Prince Anduin?"]="Um esplendor! Você já contemplou uma vista assim antes, Príncipe Anduin?"
G["Truly amazing, Gerard. How did you do it?"]="Truly amazing, Gerard. How did you do it?"
G["Truly an advantageous alliance."]="Truly an advantageous alliance."
G["Truly an amazing sword, don't you think? That's no weapon of dwarven make, no, it's far more ancient than that.\n\nThese Sunreaver and Silver Covenant representatives seem intent on getting to the bottom of the mystery. I'm already working on a report for Brann."]="É uma lâmina incrível, não acha? Não é uma lâmina forjada pelos anões, não, é muito mais antiga.\n\nEsses representantes dos Atracasol e O Pacto de Prata parecem decididos a descobrir o mistério. Já estou preparando um relatório para Brann."
G["Truly pathetic. The sin'dorei were not meant to mix with mongrels such as the draenei."]="Truly pathetic. The sin'dorei were not meant to mix with mongrels such as the draenei."
G["Truly, I envy you: To battle in the name of the Horde, at the forefront of conflict. Mine is a job of command.\n\nCertainly, in my youth, I lived out the dreams that make my old age bearable. I now revel in the glory of victory, the bitter taste of defeat - all through the soldiers I command."]="Truly, I envy you: To battle in the name of the Horde, at the forefront of conflict. Mine is a job of command.\n\nCertainly, in my youth, I lived out the dreams that make my old age bearable. I now revel in the glory of victory, the bitter taste of defeat - all through the soldiers I command."
G["Truly, lightning is a gift of the Gods."]="Verdadeiramente, o raio é um presente dos Deuses."
G["Truly, the Sin'dorei are the greatest of races."]="Certo, os sem'dorei são a melhor raça de todas."
G["Truly, the horrors here surpass those we've endured in the Plaguelands.\n\nThe Scourge are more powerful now than ever before."]="Truly, the horrors here surpass those we've endured in the Plaguelands.\n\nThe Scourge are more powerful now than ever before."
G["Truly? \"Guaranteed?\" We'll have to sit down and talk at length about this \"guarantee\" of yours, merchant."]="Truly? \"Guaranteed?\" We'll have to sit down and talk at length about this \"guarantee\" of yours, merchant."
G["Trust in the might of your Empress. She shall lead us to glory!"]="Trust in the might of your Empress. She shall lead us to glory!"
G["Trust in ya bow. It'll be there for ya when ya need it most."]="Confie no seu arco. Estará lá para você quando você mais precisar."
G["Trust is earned, stranger."]="Trust is earned, stranger."
G["Trust is your weakness."]="A confiança é seu fraqueza."
