G["Unpleasant place, this \"Undercity\". Not at all like the Lordaeron of old. How I miss it...\n\nIf you're looking to go to Stratholme, I'm afraid I'm unable to assist at the moment. The towers nearby the burning city are still in contention, and as such my powers are far too weak to aid you. Return to me once you're victorious there."]="Unpleasant place, this \"Undercity\". Not at all like the Lordaeron of old. How I miss it...\n\nIf you're looking to go to Stratholme, I'm afraid I'm unable to assist at the moment. The towers nearby the burning city are still in contention, and as such my powers are far too weak to aid you. Return to me once you're victorious there."
G["Unsatisfied with the appearance of an item?\n\nBehold the Transmogrifier, one of our most potent technomantic engines. With it, a skilled Warpweaver may shift the appearance of one object to that of another.\n\nWhat might this humble one transmogrify for you, goodly customer?"]="Unsatisfied with the appearance of an item?\n\nBehold the Transmogrifier, one of our most potent technomantic engines. With it, a skilled Warpweaver may shift the appearance of one object to that of another.\n\nWhat might this humble one transmogrify for you, goodly customer?"
