G["Used by the Barov family of the Scholomance as a mirror into the souls that they no longer possess. A valuable keepsake."]="Usado pela família Barov da Scholomance como um espelho para as almas que eles não possuem mais. Uma lembrança valiosa."
G["Used to be hauling gear and food from Orgrimmar to Crossroads was peon-work. Nowadays my neck's always on the line."]="Costumávamos transportar equipamentos e comida de Orgrimmar para Crossroads, era trabalho de peões. Hoje em dia meu pescoço está sempre em risco."
G["Used to be you couldn't trust a goblin..."]="Antes não te conseguia fiar de um goblin..."
G["Useless mongrel! I'll kill 'em myself!"]="Useless mongrel! I'll kill 'em myself!"
G["Useless orc! Just you wait, one day I'll drop somethin in yer grog that you'll NEVER wake up from...."]="Useless orc! Just you wait, one day I'll drop somethin in yer grog that you'll NEVER wake up from...."
G["Useless pile of bones..."]="Inútil monte de ossos..."
G["Useless wind rider! I don't need you anyway!"]="Cavaleiro do vento inútil! De qualquer forma não me faz falta!"
G["Useless!"]="Inútil!"
G["Useless, all of you! Even the guards you give me in tribute can't keep these lesser beings from my palace."]="Useless, all of you! Even the guards you give me in tribute can't keep these lesser beings from my palace."
G["Useless..."]="Inútil..."
G["User-objective protocol complete.  Stasis protocol re-enabled."]="Protocolo de objetivo de usuário concluído. Protocolo de estase reactivado."
G["Using"]="Utilizando"
G["Using a crystal Brann sent with the tablets, I managed to protect myself and escape, but one of the attackers followed me!"]="Using a crystal Brann sent with the tablets, I managed to protect myself and escape, but one of the attackers followed me!"
G["Using a mogu weapon forge whose powers you barely understand?"]="Usando uma forja de armas mogu cujos poderes você mal entende?"
G["Using the energy pads on the ground, ascend the Arcane Pinnacle, touching all the pedestals along the way."]="Using the energy pads on the ground, ascend the Arcane Pinnacle, touching all the pedestals along the way."
G["Using the fruits of the Earth Mother to create potions to aid us in our eternal struggle is an honorable endeavor.  To learn of this you must travel north to our great home of Thunder Bluff.  When you arrive at the top seek out the assistance of one of the Bluffwatchers for more specific directions."]="Usar os frutos da Mãe Terra para criar poções para nos ajudar em nossa eterna luta é um esforço honroso. Para aprender isso, você deve viajar para o norte, para nossa grande casa, Thunder Bluff. Quando você chegar ao topo, procure a assistência de um dos Bluffwatchers para obter instruções mais específicas."
G["Using the hammer was fun, but I think I'm ready to go home now."]="Foi divertido usar o martelo, mas agora quero ir embora a casa."
G["Using this orb will create a portal leading to Naxxanar."]="Usar esse orbe criará um portal que leva a Naxxanar."
G["Usually it just run away in sand. Not do so good at run away this time."]="Normalmente fugir na arena. Não fugir muito bem esta vez."
G["Usually these shores are covered in mists. It looks like they cleared out for some reason."]="Usually these shores are covered in mists. It looks like they cleared out for some reason."
G["Usurper?"]="Usurpador?"
G["Usurpers! Gnomeregan is mine!"]="Usurpadores! Gnomeregan é minha!"
G["Utgarde Keep is where you'll find Elder Jarten."]="Utgarde Keep é onde você encontrará o Élder Jarten."
G["Uther Lightbringer brought only darkness to Quel'Thalas.  Let us see if we can bring some darkness to his tomb!"]="Uther o Iluminado somente levou escuridão a Quel'thalas. Vamos ver se podemos levar algo de escuridão ao seu tumba!"
G["Uther had my troops recalled? Damn it! If my warriors abandon me, I'll never defeat Mal'Ganis. The ships must be burned before the men reach the shore!"]="Uther had my troops recalled? Damn it! If my warriors abandon me, I'll never defeat Mal'Ganis. The ships must be burned before the men reach the shore!"
G["Uther shakes his head."]="Uther shakes his head."
G["Uther the Lightbringer."]="Uther o Iluminado."
G["Uther! Dear Uther! I... I'm so sorry."]="Uther! Querido Uther! O... Sinto muito."
G["Uther... Uther the Lightbringer. How..."]="Uther... Uther o Iluminado. Como...?"
G["Uthrok make gud shot"]="Uthrok disparar bom tiro"
G["Uunak-hissss tik-k-k-k-k!"]="Uunak-hissss tik-k-k-k-k!"
G["Uurrghh now you... you infuriate me!"]="Uurrghh, agora... me vocês têm feito enfadar!"
G["Uuuuuuggggghhhhh...."]="Uuuuuuggggghhhhh..."
G["Uyen, $n's back. We got any chow for $g him : her;. Heh, get it? Chow?"]="Uyen, $n's back. We got any chow for $g him : her;. Heh, get it? Chow?"
G["VARIAN, NO! STOP!"]="VARIAN, NÃO! BASTA!"
G["VHAAAT?! Vhat is zhe meanink of zhis?"]="QUÉEEE! Que indica isto?"
G["VHAT!?"]="Que!?"
G["VICTORY!"]="/vitoria"
G["VOL'JIN LIVES!"]="VOL'JIN VIVE!"
G["Vaelastrasz, no!!!"]="Vaelastrasz, não!!!"
G["Vaelastrasz, when this world belongs to the black flight, your flight shall know its end."]="Vaelastrasz, quando este mundo pertenezca ao Voo Negro, seu Voo chegará ao seu fim."
G["Vait a shekkont! Vhat's zhis!?"]="Esperrra um segundo! Que é isto?!"
G["Val'anyr was shattered during the first war between the earthen and the iron dwarves. The weapon's remnants were believed lost in the conflict."]="Se acabou com Val'anyr durante a primeira guerra entre a terra e os anões férreos. Dizem que os restos se perderam no conflito."
G["Val'kyr! Take cover!"]="Val'kyr! A coberto!"
G["Val'kyr, your master calls!"]="Val'kyr, seu mestre os chama."
G["Val'kyr? We're ready for them."]="Val'kyr? Estamos prontos para eles."
G["Valdred Moray, reporting for duty, sir!"]="Valdred Moray, reporting for duty, sir!"
G["Valea Twinblades."]="Valea Twinblades."
G["Valhalas is no place for games and fools."]="Valhalas não é lugar para jogos, nem para insensatos."
G["Valhalas is yours to win or die in, $n. But whatever you do, stay within the bounds of the arena. To flee is to lose and be dishonored."]="Valhalas é o lugar onde ganhará ou morrerá, $n. Mas faça o que faça, fique dentro dos limite da arena. Fugir é como perder e ficar desonrado."
G["Valiant effort."]="Um esforço admirable."
G["Valiona, Theralion, put them in their place."]="Valiona, Theralion, put them in their place."
G["Valiona, finish them! Avenge me!"]="Valiona, acaba com eles! Véngame!"
G["Valley of the Four Winds"]="Vale dos Quatro Ventos"
G["Valn can aid you.\nSeek him out on the south side of Azure Watch."]="Valn can aid you.\nSeek him out on the south side of Azure Watch."
G["Valor Quartermaster"]="Intendente de coragem"
G["Valstann Staghelm served as the right hand of Fandral. A proud and noble warrior, his dedication and adoration for his father unyielding... and the Twin Emperors sensed this as weakness. A weakness that could be exploited."]="Valstann Staghelm served as the right hand of Fandral. A proud and noble warrior, his dedication and adoration for his father unyielding... and the Twin Emperors sensed this as weakness. A weakness that could be exploited."
G["Valstann, eager to please his father, convinced Fandral to allow him to take a small battalion to the defense of Southwind. Surely with the tide of battle turning their way, no harm could come to his beloved child. The trap was missed. Valstann was captured by the hiding Qiraji and Southwind Village obliterated. Rajaxx himself would take the captive Valstann to the front lines of the battle where - in front of Staghelm and the night elf forces - he would brutally execute the young night elf."]="Valstann, eager to please his father, convinced Fandral to allow him to take a small battalion to the defense of Southwind. Surely with the tide of battle turning their way, no harm could come to his beloved child. The trap was missed. Valstann was captured by the hiding Qiraji and Southwind Village obliterated. Rajaxx himself would take the captive Valstann to the front lines of the battle where - in front of Staghelm and the night elf forces - he would brutally execute the young night elf."
G["Valstann, my dear husband, you left us too soon."]="Valstann, my dear husband, you left us too soon."
G["VanCleef pay big for you heads!"]="VanCleef paga muito pelas suas cabeças!"
G["VanCleef sends word that the plans are underway. But he's heard rumors about someone snooping about."]="VanCleef sends word that the plans are underway. But he's heard rumors about someone snooping about."
G["Vanessa VanCleef is still out there somewhere, plotting against us. Thankfully, without this base she is largely powerless against the might of the Alliance."]="Vanessa VanCleef is still out there somewhere, plotting against us. Thankfully, without this base she is largely powerless against the might of the Alliance."
G["Vanessa begins throwing poison vials!  Climb up quickly!"]="Vanessa begins throwing poison vials!  Climb up quickly!"
G["Vanessa has detonated charges on the ship!  Get to the ropes at the side of the boat!"]="Vanessa detonou as cargas no navio! Corre às sogas que cuelgan no lado do navio!"
G["Vanessa injects you with the Nightmare Elixir!"]="Vanessa injects you with the Nightmare Elixir!"
G["Vanessa is detonating more charges!  Get to the ropes at the side of the boat!"]="Vanessa está detonando mais cargas! Corre às sogas que cuelgan no lado do navio!"
G["Vanessa pulls out a final barrel of mining powder and ignites it!  RUN!"]="Vanessa tire um último barril de pólvora para mineração e o prende! CORRE!"
G["Vanira told me to speak to you about borrowing a bat."]="Vanira disse para mim para falar com você sobre pedir emprestado um morcego."
G["Vanndar Stormpike is the general of the Alliance military in Alterac, and directs his forces from Dun Baldar.\n\nIf he is defeated then the Alliance will surely lose the battle for Alterac."]="Vanndar Pico Tempestade é o geral da milícia da Aliança em Alterac, e dirige aos seus tropas desde Dun Baldar.\n\nSe cai, certamente a Aliança perderá a batalha de Alterac."
G["Vanndar Stormpike is the general of the Alliance military in Alterac, and directs his forces from Dun Baldar.\n\nIf he is defeated then the Alliance will surely lose the battle for Alterac.\n\nVanndar is not currently in Alterac Valley."]="Vanndar Pico Tempestade é o geral da milícia da Aliança em Alterac, e dirige aos seus tropas desde Dun Baldar.\n\nSe cai, certamente a Aliança perderá a batalha de Alterac.\n\nVanndar não está no Vale Alterac agora mesmo."
G["Vanndar is here.  Come on, hordelings!  Show me what you got!"]="Vanndar is here.  Come on, hordelings!  Show me what you got!"
G["Var-jorgg gramalch!"]="Var-jorgg gramalch!"
G["Vardmadra. I'd wondered where you disappeared to. How is Iskalder?"]="Vardmadra. I'd wondered where you disappeared to. How is Iskalder?"
G["Vardmadra?! Did the Lich King send you personally?"]="Vardmadra? Te enviao Rei Lich em pessoa?"
G["Varedis was his name.  To Illidan's surprise, not only did he succeed in the excruciating rites of passage that are part of the training; Varedis was already displaying better command over his powers than many veteran demon hunters.\n\nIllidan sensed the potential in Varedis and assigned three master demon hunters to train him further in their ways."]="Varedis was his name.  To Illidan's surprise, not only did he succeed in the excruciating rites of passage that are part of the training; Varedis was already displaying better command over his powers than many veteran demon hunters.\n\nIllidan sensed the potential in Varedis and assigned three master demon hunters to train him further in their ways."
G["Vargul maybe eat you!"]="Talvez vargul os devore!"
G["Varian Wrynn didn't use the disaster to gain a military advantage."]="Varian Wrynn não usou o desastre para ganhar vantagem militar."
G["Varian Wrynn... I saw him fight once at Dire Maul. He killed five feral scar yetis with his bare hands. Pretty good for a human, no?"]="Varian Wrynn... Lhe vi lutar uma vez na Massacre. Matou a cinco yeti Cicatriz Feral com as mãos desnudas. Não está mal para um humano, eh?"
G["Varian and I spoke at length about the price of peace before his decision here today. I am willing to allow the Horde the use of Azshara's lumber if they abandon Ashenvale for good. Knowing the way that goblins chew through resources, we will see how long that will sustain them.\n\nI support this peace, but I do not share the High King's confidence. If the Horde breaks treaty to engage us again... my people will be ready."]="Varian and I spoke at length about the price of peace before his decision here today. I am willing to allow the Horde the use of Azshara's lumber if they abandon Ashenvale for good. Knowing the way that goblins chew through resources, we will see how long that will sustain them.\n\nI support this peace, but I do not share the High King's confidence. If the Horde breaks treaty to engage us again... my people will be ready."
G["Varian sent me to keep an eye on the temple while you finish building the defense.\nHave a little patience and don't approach the temple until Varian gives the word."]="Varian me enviada para vigilar o templo enquanto você te encargas de terminar a construção das defesas.\n\nTenha paciência e não te acerques ao templo até que Varian dé a ordem."
G["Varian sent you as well? I'm outnumbered in my own city!\n\n<Jaina's eyes flash mischievously.>\n\nLet's go about this a different way. Put yourself in my shoes. Imagine that YOU are the leader of the Kirin Tor. $p! The most influential archmage in all of Azeroth!\n\nWhat would YOU do?"]="Varian sent you as well? I'm outnumbered in my own city!\n\n<Jaina's eyes flash mischievously.>\n\nLet's go about this a different way. Put yourself in my shoes. Imagine that YOU are the leader of the Kirin Tor. $p! The most influential archmage in all of Azeroth!\n\nWhat would YOU do?"
G["Varian will honor me for this victory!"]="Varian me honrará por esta vitória!"
G["Varian!  No!  Varian!!"]="Varian! Não! Varian!"
G["Varian, stop! I won't help you do this!"]="Varian, basta! Não te ajudarei com isto!"
G["Varian... I have... failed... you"]="Varian... Te... e... falhado..."
G["Varimathras has released the Blight aberration!"]="Aberração de anhublo"
G["Varimathras? No, he hasn't reported in for some time. No doubt he's off on an errand of importance for his queen."]="Varimathras? Não, ele não aparece há algum tempo. Sem dúvida, ele está em uma missão importante para a sua rainha."
G["Varo'then's magical sword falls to the ground!"]="A lâmina mágico de Varo'then cai no chão!"
G["Varo'then, see that I am not disrupted by this rabble!"]="Varo'then, see that I am not disrupted by this rabble!"
G["Varos Cloudstrider and his ring guardians protect the second ring.  Your drakes are more than a match for the ring guardians, but Varos stands behind an impenetrable shield created from the energy of the Oculus itself.  Ten centrifuge constructs power the shield from the ring and platforms above.  Destroy them and Varos will be vulnerable."]="Varos Cloudstrider e seus guardiões do anel protegem o segundo toque. Seus drakes são mais do que iguais aos guardiões do anel, mas Varos está atrás de um escudo impenetrável criado a partir da energia do próprio Oculus. Dez construções de centrífuga alimentam o escudo do anel e das plataformas acima. Destrua-os e Varos ficará vulnerável."
G["Varos Cloudstrider and his ring guardians protect the second ring.  Your drakes are more than a match for the ring guardians, but Varos stands behind an impenetrable shield created from the energy of the Oculus itself.  Ten centrifuge constructs power the shield from the ring and platforms above.  Destroy them and Varos will be vulnerable.\nI can grant you the power to call upon a drake from the red flight.  Speak to Eternos or Verdisa if you prefer to draw on the power of the bronze or the green."]="Varos Cloudstrider and his ring guardians protect the second ring.  Your drakes are more than a match for the ring guardians, but Varos stands behind an impenetrable shield created from the energy of the Oculus itself.  Ten centrifuge constructs power the shield from the ring and platforms above.  Destroy them and Varos will be vulnerable.\nI can grant you the power to call upon a drake from the red flight.  Speak to Eternos or Verdisa if you prefer to draw on the power of the bronze or the green."
G["Vary your blows. Show your opponent no pattern. Prove his instincts wrong."]="Vary your blows. Show your opponent no pattern. Prove his instincts wrong."
G["Ve meet again, Doctor Jones! Zhanks to your vork in zhis region, my mission has become much easier."]="Ve meet again, Doctor Jones! Zhanks to your vork in zhis region, my mission has become much easier."
G["Ve're vatchink you, $r..."]="Te obserrrfamos, $r..."
G["Veer left!"]="Gira à esquerda!"
G["Vek'lor, I feel your pain!"]="Vek'lor, sinto seu dor!"
G["Vek'nilash and Vek'lor, known as the Twin Emperors of Ahn'Qiraj, watched the war from the sanctuary of their temple. The clever brothers devised a plan to demoralize and divide Staghelm's forces."]="Vek'nilash and Vek'lor, known as the Twin Emperors of Ahn'Qiraj, watched the war from the sanctuary of their temple. The clever brothers devised a plan to demoralize and divide Staghelm's forces."
G["Vekjik likes finding big-tongues that wander too far to throw in the basin. He help me trap some of the dumb ones. You should watch him sometime... it pretty funny actually."]="Vekjik likes finding big-tongues that wander too far to throw in the basin. He help me trap some of the dumb ones. You should watch him sometime... it pretty funny actually."
G["Vekjik no want to be bothered."]="Vekjik não quer ser incomodado."
G["Velen urged me to take a leadership role amongst the Broken. But more importantly, he asked me to teach shamanism to all; Broken and draenei alike. I accepted.\n\nWe knew then that given the prejudices of some that this would be a difficult proposition at best. There are those that despise the Broken because we are a frightening reminder of the past. And there are others who believe the way of the shaman to be a blasphemy against the Light.\n\nIn any case, that is my tale."]="Velen urged me to take a leadership role amongst the Broken. But more importantly, he asked me to teach shamanism to all; Broken and draenei alike. I accepted.\n\nWe knew then that given the prejudices of some that this would be a difficult proposition at best. There are those that despise the Broken because we are a frightening reminder of the past. And there are others who believe the way of the shaman to be a blasphemy against the Light.\n\nIn any case, that is my tale."
G["Vell done, Doctah Jones!"]="Muita bem, doutorr Jones!"
G["Vell in zhat case, ve must ensure zhat you and your friend are out of zhe picture."]="Vell in zhat case, ve must ensure zhat you and your friend are out of zhe picture."
G["Velora was several years my elder."]="Valoriza era vários anos maior que eu."
G["Vendor"]="Comerciante"
G["Vendors"]="Vendedores"
G["Vendors from all over the land have found their way into the city. What are you looking for?"]="À cidade têm chegado vendedores de todas partes. Que andas procurando?"
G["Vengeance burns!"]="A vingança arde!"
G["Vengeance is mine!"]="A vingança é minha!"
G["Vengeance is ours!"]="A vingança é nossa!"
G["Vengeance is ours!  Attack my brothers!"]="A vingança é nossa! Ataquem irmãos!"
G["Vengeance shall be mine! For Quel'thalas! For the sin'dorei!"]="A vingança será minha! Por Quel'thalas! pelos sem'dorei!"
G["Vengeance shall be mine."]="A vingança será minha."
G["Vengeance will be ours!"]="A vingança será nossa!"
G["Vengeance will not be yours, $n!"]="A vingança não será sua, $n!"
G["Vengeance!"]="Selva da serpente"
G["Vengeance..."]="Selva da serpente"
G["Vengeful Hui has appeared in the Mason's Quarter, north of Greenstone Village. Challenge him!"]="Vengeful Hui has appeared in the Mason's Quarter, north of Greenstone Village. Challenge him!"
G["Venoxis be a master of poisons, he be a deadly foe."]="Venoxis be a master of poisons, he be a deadly foe."
G["Venoxis, he be controllin' da serpents.  He be a wily one."]="Venoxis, he be controllin' da serpents.  He be a wily one."
G["Venturing into forgotten vaults..."]="Se aventurando em salões esquecidos..."
G["Verdantleaf!  This is quite fortunate."]="Hojaverde! Isto resulta sortudo."
G["Vereesa is waiting for you, champion."]="Vereesa te está esperando."
G["Vereesa, are you hurt?"]="Vereesa, está ferida?"
G["Vereesa, establish a perimeter. Modera, place the sentry wards. Narasi, begin porting in tents and supplies."]="Vereesa, establish a perimeter. Modera, place the sentry wards. Narasi, begin porting in tents and supplies."
G["Vereesa, gather up everything we can find before the mogu return. Leave nothing for the Horde to claim."]="Vereesa, reúne tudo o que encontre antes de que vuelvan os mogu. Que não que nada para a Horda."
G["Vereesa, please!"]="Vereesa, por favor!"
G["Verifying encryption key ..."]="Verificando importante de encriptação..."
G["Verifying status of Norgannon's shell."]="Verificando o estado do carapaça de Norgannon."
G["Vermin! Leeches! Take my blood and choke on it!"]="Vermin! Leeches! Take my blood and choke on it!"
G["Vermin, your dinner awaits!"]="Vermin, your dinner awaits!"
G["Vernon looks around nervously, making sure to not look at the pig on the spit."]="Vernon looks around nervously, making sure to not look at the pig on the spit."
G["Verog the Dervish howls with rage!"]="Verog the Dervish howls with rage!"
G["Vertical stabilizers offline. Powering down."]="Vertical stabilizers offline. Powering down."
G["Very busy... very busy!  What?"]="Muito ocupado... muito ocupado! O que?"
G["Very clever how you got in here like that, $n.\n\nWhat? Surprised that I know your name? I'm a demon, that's what we do. I also know your true name, so you'd better buy something expensive."]="Tem mostrou grande habilidade no seu modo de entrar aqui, $n.\n\nQue? Te surpreende que sepa seu nome? Sou um demônio, é nosso trabalho. Também conheço seu verdadeiro nome assim que é melhor que me compres algo caro."
G["Very creative fighting, there."]="Very creative fighting, there."
G["Very few seek me out... What may I do for you?"]="Muito poucos me procuram... O que posso fazer por você?"
G["Very fine equipment you make, very fine indeed. Go to the Orc's home of Orgrimmar and seek out a smith named Saru Steelfury. One thing you must give the Orcs, they make beautiful instruments of death."]="Equipamento muito bom que você faz, muito bom mesmo. Vá para a casa de Orgrimmar dos Orc e procure um ferreiro chamado Saru Steelfury. Uma coisa que você deve dar aos Orcs, eles são belos instrumentos de morte."
G["Very good - lay down your weapons!"]="Very good - lay down your weapons!"
G["Very good - that is enough!"]="Muito bem. É suficiente!"
G["Very good work! Our defenses held with minimal casualties. Please accept this reward for your outstanding effort."]="Excelente trabalho! Apenas temos sofrido bajas. Aceito esta recompensa pelo seu admirable esforço."
G["Very good!  Once you take to the skies, the Zandalari will try to stop you."]="Very good!  Once you take to the skies, the Zandalari will try to stop you."
G["Very good! You have done it!"]="Muito bem! O conseguiu!"
G["Very good, $n.  You will find Grizzle Halfmane in the Royal Quarter of the Undercity.  May you find great honor in Alterac Valley."]="Muito bem, $n. Encontrar a Osco Mediamelena no Bairro Real de Cidade Baixa. Que encontre grande honra no Vale Alterac."
G["Very good, $r! Remember, your ring will not reach its full charge for many hours."]="Muito bem, $r! Lembre-se, seu anel não se cargará do tudo até dentro de muitas horas."
G["Very good.  Our supply cache grows..."]="Muito bem. Nosso estoque de equipamento aumenta..."
G["Very good.  Secondly, you must know that a knight embraces no tenet more tightly than that of chivalry.  He clings to his generosity as tightly as he clings to his lance.  His valor shines as brightly as his armor.  And while his smallsword may be sharp, his manner among allies is soft and courteous.\n\nNow tell me $n, do you give your oath to hold to the teachings of chivalry and gallantry?"]="Very good.  Secondly, you must know that a knight embraces no tenet more tightly than that of chivalry.  He clings to his generosity as tightly as he clings to his lance.  His valor shines as brightly as his armor.  And while his smallsword may be sharp, his manner among allies is soft and courteous.\n\nNow tell me $n, do you give your oath to hold to the teachings of chivalry and gallantry?"
G["Very good.  You are relieved, private.  Rest, but don't get too comfortable.  Kurzen won't leave us alone forever."]="Very good.  You are relieved, private.  Rest, but don't get too comfortable.  Kurzen won't leave us alone forever."
G["Very good. Fall into formation with the rest of your squadron. There is work to be done."]="Muito bem. Colócate em formação com o resto do seu esquadrão. Há trabalho que fazer."
G["Very good. Is that blood? On your teeth? Excellent! Bring on two more!"]="Muito bem. Isso que tem no dente é sangue? Estupendo! Que venham dois mais!"
G["Very good. Let's talk."]="Excelente, vamos conversar."
G["Very good. Whatever it is you boys do... Do a lot of it."]="Very good. Whatever it is you boys do... Do a lot of it."
G["Very impressive!"]="Impressionante!"
G["Very impressive, tamer."]="Bastante impressionante, $gdomador:domadora;."
G["Very interesting!"]="Muito interessante!"
G["Very interesting. But if that's the case then my theory is wrong. I must reread the other sections to see what I missed."]="Muito interessante."
G["Very interesting..."]="Muito interessante..."
G["Very lucky day to travel friend! East wind brings much good fortune."]="Very lucky day to travel friend! East wind brings much good fortune."
G["Very much, sir."]="Já o acho, senhor."
G["Very nice, Gerard. Next you will be breeding them."]="Very nice, Gerard. Next you will be breeding them."
G["Very nice, yes yes... a good gift for Chee Chee. Thank you!"]="Muito bem, sim, sim... um bom presente para Chee Chee. Obrigado!"
G["Very recently, all four spirits left the temple and scattered to the corners of Shen-zin Su. The land suffers."]="Very recently, all four spirits left the temple and scattered to the corners of Shen-zin Su. The land suffers."
G["Very sad to think what has befallen those poor undead souls.  You can find Archmage Shymm reflecting near the Pools of Vision under the Spirit Rise."]="Muito triste pensar no que aconteceu àquelas pobres almas não-mortas. Você pode encontrar o Arquimago Shymm refletindo perto das Piscinas da Visão sob a Ascensão Espiritual."
G["Very soon we will be able to augment your cloak with my own formidable draconic powers."]="Muito em breve seremos capazes de melhorar a capa com meus próprios poderes dracônicos."
G["Very sweet of you - now DIE!"]="Muito gracioso. Agora MORRE!"
G["Very vell, zhen. Let me just check my notes vone lasht time..."]="Very vell, zhen. Let me just check my notes vone lasht time..."
G["Very well fought."]="Has lutado bem."
G["Very well my beloved. Come friend, let us ride to the home of the Darkspear."]="Muito bem, meu amor. Vamos, $gamigo: amiga;, dirijámonos até o lar dos Lança Negra."
G["Very well then, have it your way. When we turn others away, you will be responsible for their suffering. Think about that."]="Muito bem, faça ao seu maneira. Quando rechacemos a outros, você será responsável do seu sofrimento. Acha em elho."
G["Very well then, outsiders. Let us see your true strength."]="Muito bem, forasteiros. Comprobemos sua verdadeira força."
G["Very well then. I see that the Spear of Durotar has almost arrived."]="Muito bem. Vejo que a Lança de Durotar quase chegou."
G["Very well then. Let's get the courtyard door open so we can continue our mission!"]="Muito bem. Abramos a porta do pátio para que possamos seguir com nossa missão!"
G["Very well then. Let's go!"]="Muito bem pois. Vamos!"
G["Very well then...\n\nYou have been tasked by your liege to guard his fields of corn from poachers and thieves.  One night on patrol, you stumble across a haggard man in thread-bare clothing stealing corn from the field.  You quickly confront him, and he immediately begs for his life.  He claims he is stealing the corn to feed his family since the lord of the land - your liege - demands too much in taxes.  Your liege is indeed known for his harsh taxes throughout the land.\n\nMake your choice."]="Very well then...\n\nYou have been tasked by your liege to guard his fields of corn from poachers and thieves.  One night on patrol, you stumble across a haggard man in thread-bare clothing stealing corn from the field.  You quickly confront him, and he immediately begs for his life.  He claims he is stealing the corn to feed his family since the lord of the land - your liege - demands too much in taxes.  Your liege is indeed known for his harsh taxes throughout the land.\n\nMake your choice."
G["Very well!"]="Muito bem!"
G["Very well, $c. But be careful, Brutusk can be very... spirited."]="Muito bem, $c. Mas tenha cuidado, Brutusk pode ser muito... enérgico."
G["Very well, $n, you have failed to act. The prophecy is not yours to learn. Do not call upon me again until you have found your backbone!"]="Very well, $n, you have failed to act. The prophecy is not yours to learn. Do not call upon me again until you have found your backbone!"
G["Very well, $n."]="Muito bem, $n."
G["Very well, $n. I will need your help making this beer."]="$n, Muito bem. Vou precisar sua ajuda para elaborar esta cerveja."
G["Very well, $n. I will use the Nightmare object to conjure forth Eranikus."]="Very well, $n. I will use the Nightmare object to conjure forth Eranikus."
G["Very well, $n. I'll meet you there."]="Very well, $n. I'll meet you there."
G["Very well, $n. Return to me when your thirst and hunger are sated."]="Muito bem, $n. Volta quando tenha saciado o fome e a sede."
G["Very well, $p. Prove yourself to me and I will aid you in your fight."]="Muito bem, $p. Demuéstrame seu coragem e te ajudarei no seu luta."
G["Very well, Chromie."]="Muito bem, Chromie."
G["Very well, I will create a field to keep your corruption quarantined."]="Very well, I will create a field to keep your corruption quarantined."
G["Very well, I will put my belly into it..."]="Muito bem, a ver se faço algo de contrapeso com a barriga..."
G["Very well, I'm sure that I can find a Skyguard out there that can make use o' the cloak.\n\nThere's yer apexis crystal.  I hope it makes ya happier than that cloak did."]="Bem, certo que encontrarei a algum Guarda do céu que possa usar a capa.\n\nAqui tem seu cristal de ápices. Espero que te faça mais feliz que a capa."
G["Very well, Proudtusk, you may begin your march. Carry on!"]="Muito bem, Colmilho Orgulhoso, pode começar a caminhar. Continue!"
G["Very well, Taoshi. If our champion here agrees, the mission may proceed."]="Muito bem, Taoshi. Se há acordo, adiante com a missão."
G["Very well, Warchief. I have solved the plight of the Forsaken!"]="Muito bem, Chefe de Guerra. E resolvido o problema dos Renegados!"
G["Very well, Warchief. The Royal Quarter is this way. Stay on guard. There is no telling what Varimathras and Putress have in store for us."]="Very well, Warchief. The Royal Quarter is this way. Stay on guard. There is no telling what Varimathras and Putress have in store for us."
G["Very well, Zaela. I trust you to do the right thing. $C, I can help your fallen warriors..."]="Muito bem, Zaela. Confío em que faça o correto. $C, posso ajudar aos seus guerreiros caídos..."
G["Very well, but if I were you, I would pay attention and not just blindly nod my head at what I heard.\n\nIt begins, as all good stories do, with betrayal. Oh, it's not that we were betrayed... not at all. The Lich King raised us death knights above all others.\n\nRather, it was we who betrayed him with the help of Highlord Darion Mograine.\n\nIn the final fight at Light's Hope Chapel in the Plaguelands, with the simpletons moments away from annihilation, Tirion Fordring helped Mograine break the Lich King's hold upon him and all of the rest of us that were present."]="Very well, but if I were you, I would pay attention and not just blindly nod my head at what I heard.\n\nIt begins, as all good stories do, with betrayal. Oh, it's not that we were betrayed... not at all. The Lich King raised us death knights above all others.\n\nRather, it was we who betrayed him with the help of Highlord Darion Mograine.\n\nIn the final fight at Light's Hope Chapel in the Plaguelands, with the simpletons moments away from annihilation, Tirion Fordring helped Mograine break the Lich King's hold upon him and all of the rest of us that were present."
G["Very well, but make certain she knows that the blackwhelps are to be captured first."]="Muito bem, mas certifique-se de que ela sabe que primeiro é preciso capturar às filhotes sombrios."
G["Very well, but try not to lose this one, okay?"]="Muito bem, mas procura não perder este, vale?"
G["Very well, dwarf. Have it your way. I shall kill you and take the tablets."]="Very well, dwarf. Have it your way. I shall kill you and take the tablets."
G["Very well, dwarf. I shall slay you and carry the tablets to Cho'Gall."]="Very well, dwarf. I shall slay you and carry the tablets to Cho'Gall."
G["Very well, general.  Should you change your mind, my people will be more than willing to provide military assistance."]="Very well, general.  Should you change your mind, my people will be more than willing to provide military assistance."
G["Very well, here is another. Please be more careful with this one."]="Bem, aqui tem outro. Tenha mais cuidado esta vez."
G["Very well, here is your replacement."]="Muito bem, aqui tem seu recambio."
G["Very well, if you won't talk, you won't need your head anymore."]="Very well, if you won't talk, you won't need your head anymore."
G["Very well, intruder. You have earned my undivided attention..."]="Muito bem, intruso. Tem toda meu atenção..."
G["Very well, kitten. I see no need to delay your inevitable demise. I look forward to dealing with you just as soon as I finish off this fool!"]="Very well, kitten. I see no need to delay your inevitable demise. I look forward to dealing with you just as soon as I finish off this fool!"
G["Very well, let me see what you've got."]="Muito bem, deixe-me ver o que você tem."
G["Very well, let us continue."]="Muito bem, sigamos."
G["Very well, let your journey of tailoring begin."]="Muito bem, comece sua jornada de alfaiataria."
G["Very well, let's go!"]="Muito bem, vamos lá!"
G["Very well, little $c.\n\nWhile there is much left for you to do to mend our relations with Thorim, I am compelled to share with you this one secret.\n\nSpeak to me again when you are ready to be shown that which you seek."]="Very well, little $c.\n\nWhile there is much left for you to do to mend our relations with Thorim, I am compelled to share with you this one secret.\n\nSpeak to me again when you are ready to be shown that which you seek."
G["Very well, shaman. I shall slay you and carry the tablets to Cho'Gall."]="Very well, shaman. I shall slay you and carry the tablets to Cho'Gall."
G["Very well, then. May the ghosts of our brothers guard this place for all eternity."]="Muito bem. Que os espíritos de nossos irmãos protejam este lugar por toda a eternidade."
G["Very well, we shall break it for you."]="Muito bem, a quebraremos por você."
G["Very well."]="Muito bem."
G["Very well.  Before we head down there, take a moment to prepare yourself."]="Very well.  Before we head down there, take a moment to prepare yourself."
G["Very well.  Carry on Mr. Ely."]="Muito bem. Continúe Sr. Ely."
G["Very well.  Follow me."]="De acordo. Siga-me."
G["Very well.  I look forward to it."]="Very well.  I look forward to it."
G["Very well.  I'll take part in this competition."]="Muito bem. Eu vou participar desta competição."
G["Very well.  Let's see what you have to show me, $n."]="Very well.  Let's see what you have to show me, $n."
G["Very well.  Onward to fame and glory!"]="Muito bem. A pela fama e a glória!"
G["Very well.  Stand back... this may get messy."]="Very well.  Stand back... this may get messy."
G["Very well.  When that decision is made, I will be ready.  Let us hope it won't be too late."]="Muito bem. Quando se tenha tomado essa decisão, estarei pronto. Esperemos que não seja tarde demais."
G["Very well. As the oldest and fattest among us, I will wait here for each of you to return."]="Very well. As the oldest and fattest among us, I will wait here for each of you to return."
G["Very well. Beware the crane's song... or you may find yourself too distracted to fight."]="Very well. Beware the crane's song... or you may find yourself too distracted to fight."
G["Very well. Cut another lump of flesh from one of these specimens. Let us test what you've learned so far, and we can progress from there."]="Muito bem. Corte outro pedaço de carne de um desses espécimes. Vamos testar o que você aprendeu até agora e podemos progredir a partir daí."
G["Very well. Finish these lesser beings and let us be about our business."]="Muito bem. Acaba com estes seres inferior e centrémonos em nossos assuntos."
G["Very well. How about you, Olon?"]="Muito bem. E você que me diz, Olon?"
G["Very well. I am sorry, champion - But I will not be the one learning a lesson today."]="De acordo. Sinto muito, mas não serei eu quem aprenda uma lecção hoje."
G["Very well. I saw nothing. But in the future, you are NOT to exploit our relationship with the Kirin Tor."]="Very well. I saw nothing. But in the future, you are NOT to exploit our relationship with the Kirin Tor."
G["Very well. I will allow it. Fight with honor!"]="Very well. I will allow it. Fight with honor!"
G["Very well. I will dispatch these creatures. It is only an inconvenience. Prepare to die!"]="Very well. I will dispatch these creatures. It is only an inconvenience. Prepare to die!"
G["Very well. I will face you myself. This is for the Alliance!"]="Very well. I will face you myself. This is for the Alliance!"
G["Very well. I will return then."]="Very well. I will return then."
G["Very well. I will return to the Black Temple and notify Lord Illidan of your unwillingness to carry out his wishes. I suggest you make arrangements with your subordinates and let them know that you will be leaving this world soon."]="Very well. I will return to the Black Temple and notify Lord Illidan of your unwillingness to carry out his wishes. I suggest you make arrangements with your subordinates and let them know that you will be leaving this world soon."
G["Very well. I wish to talk about something else."]="Muito bem. Gostaria falar de outra coisa."
G["Very well. If you help us fend off the Zandalari, we will help you find the Prophet."]="Very well. If you help us fend off the Zandalari, we will help you find the Prophet."
G["Very well. It is done."]="Muito bem. Está feito."
G["Very well. It saddens me that it has come to this. I look upon all of you as if you were my children. I will slay you if I must!"]="Very well. It saddens me that it has come to this. I look upon all of you as if you were my children. I will slay you if I must!"
G["Very well. Later, however, I wish to see proof of your claims."]="Muito bem. De todos modos, depois quero ver provas dos seus afirmações."
G["Very well. Let us fight."]="Muito bem. Vamos lutar."
G["Very well. Let us proceed."]="Muito bem. Vamos além."
G["Very well. Malfurion shall press into the Firelands, and we will deal with him there. His judgment can wait for a few more brief days.\n\n<Leyara's eyes light up.>\n\nThe tauren arch druid, however, will not be so lucky."]="Very well. Malfurion shall press into the Firelands, and we will deal with him there. His judgment can wait for a few more brief days.\n\n<Leyara's eyes light up.>\n\nThe tauren arch druid, however, will not be so lucky."
G["Very well. Tarren Mill lies just west of here. Since time is of the essence..."]="Muito bem. O Millhouse Tarren se encontre ao oeste. O tempo é fundamental..."
G["Very well. Tell me!"]="Very well. Tell me!"
G["Very well. The test is over."]="Está bem. A prova terminou."
G["Very well. The words you seek have a name, $n. They are known as the Cipher of Damnation: The words uttered by Gul'dan himself to shatter this land. The very spell that severed the last remaining tie the orcs had with the elements of Draenor.\n\n<Oronok nods.>\n\nAye, it is the cipher that you must reconstruct and ultimately the words of the cipher that you must call."]="Very well. The words you seek have a name, $n. They are known as the Cipher of Damnation: The words uttered by Gul'dan himself to shatter this land. The very spell that severed the last remaining tie the orcs had with the elements of Draenor.\n\n<Oronok nods.>\n\nAye, it is the cipher that you must reconstruct and ultimately the words of the cipher that you must call."
G["Very well. Today... is your day..."]="Muito bem. Hoje... é seu dia..."
G["Very well. Warriors of the frozen wastes, rise up! I command you to fight, kill and die for your master! Let none survive!"]="Muito bem. Guerreiros do deserto gelado! Levantaos, os ordeno lutar, matar e morrer pelo seu mestre! Que não sobreviva nenhum!"
G["Very well. We are nearly finished, $p."]="$p, Muito bem. Quase temos terminou."
G["Very well. We will stand down."]="Muito bem. Bajaremos as armas."
G["Very well. We'll return later after the crystal is fully charged."]="Muito bem. Voltaremos mais tarde, quando o cristal estiver carregado."
G["Very well. With your permission, Princess."]="Muito bem. Com o seu permissão, princesa."
G["Very well. Witness the raw power of my new Lord!"]="Very well. Witness the raw power of my new Lord!"
G["Very well. Ya earned me trust. I will put me faith in tha Alliance to do tha right ting."]="Muito bem. Te ganhou meu confiança. Terei fé em que a Aliança fará o correto."
G["Very well. You are invested once more with her keen eyesight."]="Muito bem. Te concede seu aguda visão novamente."
G["Very well. You have until season's end. No longer."]="Muito bem. Você tem até o final da estação. Não mais."
