G["Was that potent enough?"]="Foi suficiente potente?"
G["Was that really necessary...?"]="Era mesmo necessário...?"
G["Was that the best you can do?"]="Isso é o melhor que sabe fazer?"
G["Was that the third or fourth time you nearly got me gutted trying one of your crazy stunts?"]="Was that the third or fourth time you nearly got me gutted trying one of your crazy stunts?"
G["Was that... Yoga?"]="Isso era... yoga?"
G["Was that... the sha? I wanted to rip everyone to shreds!"]="Isso era... o sha? Queria fazer pedaços a tudo o mundo!"
G["Was there truly no way to save him?\n\nI fear I shall always wonder."]="Was there truly no way to save him?\n\nI fear I shall always wonder."
