G["Was this really the home of the ancient emperors of Pandaria? It is beautiful."]="Was this really the home of the ancient emperors of Pandaria? It is beautiful."
G["Was... Was it all a dream? Azuremyst, Bloodmyst, Zangarmarsh, Shadowmoon... even Zul'Aman... Jane! Jane where are you!"]="Foi... foi tudo um sonho? Brumas Lazúli, Brumas de Sangue, a Pântano Zíngaro, Sombraluna... até Zul'aman... Jane! Jane, onde está?"
G["Wasn't that the night we had to pick up my thumb and carry it in your smoke pouch?"]="Wasn't that the night we had to pick up my thumb and carry it in your smoke pouch?"
