G["Watch as the blood seeps into the snow, children. The elemental will be bound to us!"]="Filhos meus, ved como o sangue se filtra na neve. O elemental quedará vinculado a nós!"
G["Watch as the world around you collapses!"]="Watch as the world around you collapses!"
