G["Watch out fer fallin' rocks! Clear the streets!"]="Watch out fer fallin' rocks! Clear the streets!"
G["Watch out for Big Shirl!"]="Watch out for Big Shirl!"
G["Watch out for Xuen's cubs. What they lack in size they make up for in pure strength."]="Watch out for Xuen's cubs. What they lack in size they make up for in pure strength."
G["Watch out for lightning strikes!"]="Cuidado com os raios!"
G["Watch out for pups. Frenzyheart vicious when little."]="Cuidado com os cachorros. Os Coração Frenético são impiedosos de pequenos."
G["Watch out for the $n!"]="Tenha cuidado com $n!"
G["Watch out for the acid spray, Overseer Tidewrath!"]="Cuidado com a espuma de ácido, sobrestante Iramarea!"
G["Watch out for those mists! That stuff looks poisonous."]="Cuidado com essa névoa! Parece uma sustância venenosa."
G["Watch out!"]="Cuidado!"
G["Watch out! Our air scouts report that the generators for the missile silos are coming online!"]="Watch out! Our air scouts report that the generators for the missile silos are coming online!"
G["Watch out! That's how our other 12 assassins got killed."]="Cuidado! Assim morreram os outros 12 assassinos."
G["Watch out! The Lich King is near!"]="Cuidado! O Rei Lich está perto!"
G["Watch out, Skyguard. Here comes Torkus Jr.!"]="Atenta, Guarda do céu. Aqui chega Torkus Jr.!"
G["Watch out."]="Com precaução."
G["Watch over her as she has watched over us; let her look down on us with joy, through the eternal gaze of An'she and Mu'sha, until we too join her in death."]="Cuida de ela como ela tem cuidado de nós. Que nos olhe com alegria, a através da olhar eterna de An'she e Mu'sha, até que nos unamos a ela na morte."
G["Watch over us, $p. We are not accustomed to fighting. We will require your protection if we are attacked."]="Protégenos, $p. Não estamos ajustados a lutar. Se nos atacando, nos fará falta seu proteção."
G["Watch that last step."]="Cuidado com o último passo."
G["Watch the might of the Horde in action as we turn this slab of land into DOMINATION POINT."]="Watch the might of the Horde in action as we turn this slab of land into DOMINATION POINT."
G["Watch the roads. They may be foolish enough to try another assault."]="Watch the roads. They may be foolish enough to try another assault."
G["Watch the skies for Alliance eyes. I will see you back at Thunder Cleft. Hellscream's eyes are upon you."]="Watch the skies for Alliance eyes. I will see you back at Thunder Cleft. Hellscream's eyes are upon you."
G["Watch these mercenaries closely, brothers!"]="Watch these mercenaries closely, brothers!"
G["Watch those tentacles! Their reach is frightening."]="Cuidado com esses tentáculos! Seu alcance é incrível."
G["Watch where you're going!"]="Olhe por onde vai!"
G["Watch where you're going! They're everywhere in that city..."]="Olhe por onde vai! Estão para cada esquina da cidade..."
G["Watch where you're going, meat vendor."]="Vigila aonde vai, carniceiro."
G["Watch where you're stepping, $c, because I have a polymorph spell with your name on it..."]="Olhe por onde pisas, $c, porque tenho um encantamento transformado com o seu nome inscrito em ele..."
G["Watch yer step!"]="Watch yer step!"
G["Watch yerself down here, $c. These wendigos are savage fighters."]="Tenho muito cuidado aqui, $c. Esses wendigos são guerreiros selvagens."
G["Watch your back, $n.  If you weren't Krennan's pet you would've died a long time ago."]="Watch your back, $n.  If you weren't Krennan's pet you would've died a long time ago."
G["Watch your back, $r!"]="Vigila seu costas, $r!"
G["Watch your back, courier. I needn't remind you of the value of the book, nor the fact that the Silver Covenant will stop at nothing to take it from us."]="Watch your back, courier. I needn't remind you of the value of the book, nor the fact that the Silver Covenant will stop at nothing to take it from us."
G["Watch your back, mon!"]="Ándate com cuidado, colega!"
G["Watch your back, stranger."]="Cuidado, estranho."
G["Watch your back. These Drakkari are a nasty lot."]="Vigila seu costas. Estes Drakkari são uns asquerosos."
G["Watch your back..."]="Não bagens a guarda."
G["Watch your backs: they have us surrounded in this hall."]="Watch your backs: they have us surrounded in this hall."
G["Watch your clever mouth, bitch."]="Cuidado com o que diz, bruxa."
G["Watch your footing ... muhahaha!"]="Watch your footing ... muhahaha!"
G["Watch your footing! The stones are still slick from rain."]="Watch your footing! The stones are still slick from rain."
G["Watch your step aboard Elune's Blessing, $r.  Though Elune's blessed us with the discovery of our new friends, we've also had our share of hardships at sea.\n\nHowever, recovering souls lost at sea or lost in a new world is truly a blessing from Elune."]="Tenha cuidado a bordo do Bênção de Eluna, $r. Embora Eluna nos tem abençoado com o descoberta de nossos novos amigos, também temos sofrido a dureza do mar.\n\nNo entanto, recuperar almas perdidas no mar ou em um novo mundo é uma autêntico bênção de Eluna."
G["Watch your step around here, meat vendor."]="Tenha muito cuidado conosco, carniceiro."
G["Watch your step around here, stranger."]="Observe seu passo por aqui, estranho."
G["Watch your step in here, $gboy:girl;.  The master sees all..."]="Watch your step in here, $gboy:girl;.  The master sees all..."
G["Watch your step out there.  Many an adventure seeker has not returned from the marsh.  hic!"]="Watch your step out there.  Many an adventure seeker has not returned from the marsh.  hic!"
G["Watch your step!"]="Olhe onde pisas!"
G["Watch your step! Don't want you becoming a smudge down there. Welcome to Thunder Bluff!"]="Olhe por onde pisas! Não queremos que te conviertas em uma mancha ali baixo. Dou a você a boas-vindas a Penhasco do Trovão!"
G["Watch your step, it's a mine field out here!"]="Olhe onde pisas! Isto é um campo de minas!"
G["Watch your step, pie vendor.  You are flirting with disaster."]="Watch your step, pie vendor.  You are flirting with disaster."
G["Watch your step, soldier. The Stormpike have littered the ground around their bases with landmines. Speak with our explosives expert in the watch tower to the east if you want information on how to diffuse their mine fields."]="Watch your step, soldier. The Stormpike have littered the ground around their bases with landmines. Speak with our explosives expert in the watch tower to the east if you want information on how to diffuse their mine fields."
G["Watch your step, stranger. We do not allow miscreants in our town."]="Cuidado com o seu passo, estranho. Não permitimos que os mal-entendidos em nossa cidade."
G["Watch your step..."]="Watch your step..."
G["Watch your tone with me, boy. You may be the prince, but I'm still your superior as a paladin!"]="Controla seu tono quando te dirijas a mim, rapaz. Será o Príncipe, mas eu ainda sou seu superior como paladino."
G["Watch your tongue, worm.  You will not refer to Soggoth the Slitherer as \"that thing\" or you'll find yourself eating your own heart for dinner."]="Watch your tongue, worm.  You will not refer to Soggoth the Slitherer as \"that thing\" or you'll find yourself eating your own heart for dinner."
G["Watch your tongues, servant of Deathwing. Do you think me a fool?!"]="Watch your tongues, servant of Deathwing. Do you think me a fool?!"
G["Watch yourself, Highborne."]="Compórtate, Altonato."
G["Watch yourself, young one. You don't-"]="Cuidado, jovem. Não..."
G["Watch yourselves. The seals are breaking."]="Watch yourselves. The seals are breaking."
G["Watch! See the ground shatter before us! Watch as the energy flows! It will feed our armies..."]="Watch! See the ground shatter before us! Watch as the energy flows! It will feed our armies..."
G["Watch, druid. The earth still breathes. It yearns to be cleansed."]="Olhe, druida. A terra ainda respira. Ansía ser purificação."
G["Watch, heathens, as death surrounds you!"]="Olhem, intrusos! A morte os perto!"
G["Watched you investigating the ship and dealing with those creatures down there. Good work. You find anything?"]="Watched you investigating the ship and dealing with those creatures down there. Good work. You find anything?"
G["Watcher Analysis: Freya"]="Análise do Observador: Freya"
G["Watcher Analysis: Hodir"]="Análise do Observador: Hodir"
G["Watcher Analysis: Mimiron"]="Análise do Observador: Mimiron"
G["Watcher Analysis: Thorim"]="Análise do Observador: Thorim"
G["Watcher Freya verified to no longer be present. Analysis complete."]="Se tem verificado que a vigia Freya já não está presente. Análise concluído."
G["Watcher Hodir verified to no longer be present. Analysis complete."]="Se tem verificado que o vigia Hodir já não está presente. Análise concluído."
G["Watcher Hodir's temperament and behavior highly unstable. Destruction of cache highly probable during prolonged combat."]="O temperamento e o comportamento do vigia Hodir são altamente instáveis. A destruição do estoque é muito provável durante um combate prolongado."
G["Watcher Leesa'oh, why are you out here?"]="Observador Leesa'oh, por que você está aqui?"
G["Watcher Mimir verified to no longer be present. Analysis complete."]="Se tem verificado que o vigia Mimir já não está presente. Análise concluído."
G["Watcher Mimiron's sigil is linked to a self-destruct mechanism connected to the entirety of the Corridors of Ingenuity."]="Watcher Mimiron's sigil is linked to a self-destruct mechanism connected to the entirety of the Corridors of Ingenuity."
G["Watcher Tyr verified to no longer be present. Analysis complete."]="Se tem verificado que o vigia Tyr já não está presente. Análise concluído."
G["Watcher powers augmented by presence of elder servants."]="Watcher powers augmented by presence of elder servants."
G["Watcher, inform Althea that a dire threat is marshalling against our town.  We must prepare!"]="Watcher, inform Althea that a dire threat is marshalling against our town.  We must prepare!"
G["Watcher, we have docked.  On your feet!"]="Vigia, temos atracado. Em pé!"
G["Water Strider"]="Water Strider"
G["Water can hold any form, take any shape... overcome any obstacle."]="Water can hold any form, take any shape... overcome any obstacle."
G["Water grant me serenity..."]="Água otórgame serenidade..."
G["Water is life. When the waters feel torment, then so shall we."]="A água é vida. Quando a água padece tormento, nós também."
G["Water my Bright Green Spinach!"]="Water my Bright Green Spinach!"
G["Water my Cabbages!"]="Water my Cabbages!"
G["Water my Elephant Garlic!"]="Water my Elephant Garlic!"
G["Water my Giant Carrots!"]="Water my Giant Carrots!"
G["Water my Huge Melons!"]="Water my Huge Melons!"
G["Water my Red-Leaf Lettuce!"]="Water my Red-Leaf Lettuce!"
G["Water my Sugar Beets!"]="Water my Sugar Beets!"
G["Water spider! Smush him, $p!"]="$p, Uma aranha de água! Aplástala!"
G["Water! Here!?"]="Água! Aqui?!"
G["Water-proof soap!  For underwater use!"]="Water-proof soap!  For underwater use!"
G["Water..."]="Aquático"
G["Water... is life. It has become a rare commodity here in Outland; a commodity that we alone shall control. We are the Highborne, and the time has come at last for us to retake our rightful place in the world!"]="Water... is life. It has become a rare commodity here in Outland; a commodity that we alone shall control. We are the Highborne, and the time has come at last for us to retake our rightful place in the world!"
G["Water?"]="A água?"
G["Water?! Are you daft?! I need some ALE!"]="Água?! É que é idiota?! Preciso CERVEJA!"
G["Watered down garbage. Doesn't even slow 'em down."]="Watered down garbage. Doesn't even slow 'em down."
G["Watermelon boats float really easy."]="Watermelon boats float really easy."
G["Waters... claim me..."]="Água... Leve-me com você..."
G["Wating for dungeon particle effects to implement completion event for Buying Time quest."]="Esperando que os efeitos das partículas da Masmorra implementen o evento de finalização para a missão Comprando Tempo."
G["Wave One:"]="Primeira onda:"
G["Wave Two:"]="Segunda oleada:"
G["Waves of flame consume you!"]="Waves of flame consume you!"
G["Way back in the old times the mogu would put little traps like this around the world to stop people from portalling this way and that. It's powered by the people who get stuck in it and won't turn off until they are dead.\n\nIt's like mama Bramblestaff always used to say: \"Don't put your hand in a stranger's portal.\""]="Way back in the old times the mogu would put little traps like this around the world to stop people from portalling this way and that. It's powered by the people who get stuck in it and won't turn off until they are dead.\n\nIt's like mama Bramblestaff always used to say: \"Don't put your hand in a stranger's portal.\""
G["Wazat, I have done something foolish and have lost my key as a result of this action. Could I trouble you for a spare?"]="Wazat, I have done something foolish and have lost my key as a result of this action. Could I trouble you for a spare?"
G["We ... crushes it! Must ... make crush. Hurry friends!"]="Aplastaremos... nós! Aplastar... devemos! Depressa, amigos!"
G["We Alliance have rallied to defeat many enemies, my son. The sha will fall to us, just like any other."]="We Alliance have rallied to defeat many enemies, my son. The sha will fall to us, just like any other."
G["We Cenarion druids are the protectors of the balance of nature.  The main point being the balance.  When called for, we shouldn't wait too long before taking decisive action.  Don't let anyone tell you otherwise, especially those of us who only want to observe!"]="Nós, druidas Cenarion, somos os protetores do equilíbrio da natureza. O ponto principal é o equilíbrio. Quando solicitado, não devemos esperar muito antes de pegar uma ação decisiva. Não deixe ninguém lhe dizer o contrário, especialmente aqueles que apenas querem observar!"
G["We Darkspear gonna' be ready."]="We Darkspear gonna' be ready."
G["We Dragonmaw have seen so much suffering... our defeat at Grim Batol... the loss of so many great warriors in Outland... and now incursions from Twilight's Hammer.\n\nI sometimes wonder if we will ever be great again. But younglings like Zaela, they give this old heap of bones some hope."]="We Dragonmaw have seen so much suffering... our defeat at Grim Batol... the loss of so many great warriors in Outland... and now incursions from Twilight's Hammer.\n\nI sometimes wonder if we will ever be great again. But younglings like Zaela, they give this old heap of bones some hope."
G["We Druids of the Talon aren't cut out for front-line duty. We're aerial spies, infiltrators...\n\nBut occasionally I like to get my talons dirty."]="We Druids of the Talon aren't cut out for front-line duty. We're aerial spies, infiltrators...\n\nBut occasionally I like to get my talons dirty."
G["We Forsaken are doomed! Take pity!"]="Os Renegados estamos perdidos! Tenha piedade!"
G["We Mantid serve a power far greater than they or their gods."]="Os mantídeos servimos a um poder superior a eles e aos seus deuses."
G["We NEED dis land! Da cataclysm destroyed our home!"]="We NEED dis land! Da cataclysm destroyed our home!"
G["We Pandaren do not worship our ancestors, but we revere their memory and the wisdom that they have passed on to us."]="Os pandaren não adoramos a nossos ancestrais, mas veneramos seu memória e a sabedoria que nos têm transmitido."
G["We Razormane ... must ... survive ..."]="Os Crines de Aço... devemos... sobreviver."
G["We Sin'dorei were driven to the Horde by the bigotry and distrust of the Alliance."]="Nós, Sin’dorei, fomos levados à Horda por causa do preconceito e da desconfiança da Aliança."
G["We Sin'dorei will take our future into our own hands."]="Nós, Sin'dorei, tomaremos as rédeas do nosso próprio destino."
G["We Thunderbrews take pride knowing that we are the best brewhouse in all the realms."]="Nós, Thunderbrews, temos orgulho em saber que somos a melhor cervejaria de todos os reinos."
G["We Timbermaw can grant you safe passage through the hold, however, you must prove yourself worthy of our aid."]="Nós, Timbermaw, podemos conceder a você uma passagem certa pelo porão, no entanto, você deve provar que é digno de nossa ajuda."
G["We Wildhammer are a proud bunch. I trust that you have as much pride in the Alliance, $n?"]="Os Martelo Feroz somos gente orgulhosa. Confío em que tenhao mesmo orgulho pela Aliança, $n?"
G["We a lot cleaner than da ogres in Tanaris.  All over da desert as far as da eye can see - ogre poo.  Not here, no $g sir : ma'am;!"]="We a lot cleaner than da ogres in Tanaris.  All over da desert as far as da eye can see - ogre poo.  Not here, no $g sir : ma'am;!"
G["We ain't got no time ta lose."]="Não há tempo que perder."
G["We all have a job to do, $c. Just, some do it better than others!"]="Todos temos um trabalho que fazer, $c. É somente que algum trabalhamos melhor que outros."
G["We all have our demons...."]="Todos temos nossos demônios..."
G["We all have talents, outsider. Some are just not as easy to see as others."]="Todos temos nossos talentos, arauto. É somente que algum são menos evidentes que outros."
G["We all owe our lives to Keeshan. He's saved our hides a hundred times."]="Todos lhe devemos nossas vidas a Keeshan. Nos salvou o traseiro centenas de vezes."
G["We all served under Leven in excursions past the wall.  We honed our blades against countless mantid and yaungol.  These mogu think us weak, but that mistake in judgment will cost them dearly."]="We all served under Leven in excursions past the wall.  We honed our blades against countless mantid and yaungol.  These mogu think us weak, but that mistake in judgment will cost them dearly."
G["We already have all our winners for today's contest, but Jang is willing to purchase any Tastyfish that you have fished up!\nThere's always next Sunday for you to show your angling skill!"]="We already have all our winners for today's contest, but Jang is willing to purchase any Tastyfish that you have fished up!\nThere's always next Sunday for you to show your angling skill!"
G["We already have control of Twin Spire Ruins! Get out there and defend it!"]="Já temos o controle de Twin Spire Ruins! Vá lá e defenda-o!"
G["We already have them on the defensive. Even as we speak, their numbers weaken."]="We already have them on the defensive. Even as we speak, their numbers weaken."
G["We already know the mogu mastered imprisoning living energy in devices. This is not a magic we need know more about."]="We already know the mogu mastered imprisoning living energy in devices. This is not a magic we need know more about."
G["We also welcome Smash Hoofstomp, the terrible tauren from Thunder Bluff!"]="Também damos a boas-vindas a Esmagamento Holhapezunha, o terrível tauren de Penhasco do Trovão!"
G["We also welcome Smash Hoofstomp, the terrible tauren from Thunder Bluff! Look at those GREAT shoulderpads!"]="Também damos a boas-vindas a Esmagamento Holhapezunha, o tauren mais terrível de Penhasco do Trovão! Olhem que ombreiras!"
G["We also welcome everybody's favorite frosty feathered friend: Dippy!"]="We also welcome everybody's favorite frosty feathered friend: Dippy!"
G["We also welcome our pain-packing crowd favorite: Dungeon Master Vishas!"]="We also welcome our pain-packing crowd favorite: Dungeon Master Vishas!"
G["We always have need of allies. I'd be a fool to turn you away, especially at a time of war."]="We always have need of allies. I'd be a fool to turn you away, especially at a time of war."
G["We am free! Thank you little, puny ones."]="Somos livres! Obrigado, pequenhajos."
G["We answer only to the council. And we rest only when their will is done."]="Somente respondemos ante o conselho. Somente descansamos quando se tornou seu vontade."
G["We appear to be dealing with something far bigger than any in the Earthen Ring had suspected."]="Parece que estamos lidando com algo muito maior do que qualquer um no Anel Terrestre suspeitava."
G["We appear to be on target."]="We appear to be on target."
G["We are Hellscream's Vanguard!"]="Somos a Vanguarda de Grito Infernal!"
G["We are Mechagnome... resistance is futile."]="We are Mechagnome... resistance is futile."
G["We are NOT monsters! We are NOT the mindless wretches of a ghoul army!"]="We are NOT monsters! We are NOT the mindless wretches of a ghoul army!"
G["We are Skyguard!  This is what we are trained to do.  We do not retreat, we do not surrender.  We will see our mission through even if it means death! We will secure that information or we will die on the field of battle."]="We are Skyguard!  This is what we are trained to do.  We do not retreat, we do not surrender.  We will see our mission through even if it means death! We will secure that information or we will die on the field of battle."
G["We are a peaceful people, but awaken the warriors within us, and we will fight."]="We are a peaceful people, but awaken the warriors within us, and we will fight."
G["We are a people without a home to call our own now."]="Somos um povo sem casa para chamar de nosso agora."
G["We are a point of light in a universe of shadow. A candle in a tempest."]="Somos um ponto de luz num universo de trevas. Uma vela na tempestade."
G["We are a town of brewers and farmers. We hunt on occasion when we need to.\n\nThat's where I come in. It's awfully hard to hunt without a quality bow!"]="We are a town of brewers and farmers. We hunt on occasion when we need to.\n\nThat's where I come in. It's awfully hard to hunt without a quality bow!"
G["We are accustomed to wisps carrying out our labors. Please bring food to keep us sustained."]="We are accustomed to wisps carrying out our labors. Please bring food to keep us sustained."
G["We are all a part of him..."]="Todos somos parte de ele..."
G["We are all counting on you."]="Todos temos com você."
G["We are all drawn here for different reasons, $c.\n\n<Rayne smiles.>\n\nI am here to meet with Rimblat of the Earthen Ring. He has some interesting theories on cleansing these lands."]="We are all drawn here for different reasons, $c.\n\n<Rayne smiles.>\n\nI am here to meet with Rimblat of the Earthen Ring. He has some interesting theories on cleansing these lands."
G["We are all here. This is a historic moment, $n. My dying wife envisioned a city of light beyond these gates... What do you think we will find?"]="Já estamos todos. é um momento histórico, $n. Meu mulher viu uma cidade de luz por trás de estas portões antes de morrer. O que acha que encontraremos?"
G["We are all in this together, $c."]="Todos estamos juntos em isto, $c."
G["We are all pieces of a much larger puzzle, $n. Just as you guide the piece of a puzzle to its destination, so too are we guided by another.\n\nAnd perhaps they who guide us are themselves guided by an even greater force."]="We are all pieces of a much larger puzzle, $n. Just as you guide the piece of a puzzle to its destination, so too are we guided by another.\n\nAnd perhaps they who guide us are themselves guided by an even greater force."
G["We are all responsible for maintaining our home. Even the High Elder must occasionally lend a hand."]="We are all responsible for maintaining our home. Even the High Elder must occasionally lend a hand."
G["We are all sons and daughters of the storm!"]="Todos somos filhos da tempestade!"
G["We are approaching the cavern, Captain."]="Nos acercamos à caverna, capitão."
G["We are as new to this vale as you. We came when the gates opened, having lost our homes in Kun-Lai. There is much to build, much to mend."]="We are as new to this vale as you. We came when the gates opened, having lost our homes in Kun-Lai. There is much to build, much to mend."
G["We are as unwavering as the amber that shapes our halls. With Her might we will vanquish all who dare intrude upon Her divine home."]="Somos tão inflexibles como o âmbar que da forma a estas salões. Com a sua força venceremos a tudo aquele que profane Seu roxa divina."
G["We are being consumed by the Light!"]="We are being consumed by the Light!"
G["We are beset upon again!  Defend yourself!"]="We are beset upon again!  Defend yourself!"
G["We are besieged by elementals and giants! Your help is needed in the northwest, Earthguard!"]="We are besieged by elementals and giants! Your help is needed in the northwest, Earthguard!"
G["We are besieged!"]="Estamos sitiados!"
G["We are besieged! Strike out and bring back their corpses!"]="We are besieged! Strike out and bring back their corpses!"
G["We are betrayed!"]="Nos têm traído!"
G["We are betrayed! You may have won here, but the ritual will succeed!"]="Nos têm traído! Talvez tenha ganhou esta vez, mas o ritual terá êxito!"
G["We are born from the flesh of Kros. We were fashioned from his meat, his bones. He is our creator.\n\nKroshik is the blood of Kros. He watches over us. He is our connection to Kros. He has the strength of Kros, yet he walks on our world.\n\nWhen the time comes, Kroshik will die, and we will take his strength. Then, the cycle will start again."]="We are born from the flesh of Kros. We were fashioned from his meat, his bones. He is our creator.\n\nKroshik is the blood of Kros. He watches over us. He is our connection to Kros. He has the strength of Kros, yet he walks on our world.\n\nWhen the time comes, Kroshik will die, and we will take his strength. Then, the cycle will start again."
G["We are born into a perilous age, where the forces of darkness are determined to bring about our destruction."]="We are born into a perilous age, where the forces of darkness are determined to bring about our destruction."
G["We are bound by will to serve the Banshee Queen."]="A vontade nos obriga a servir à Rainha alma em pena."
G["We are bound here... eternally. It is the will of Gorefiend."]="Estamos destinados aqui... eternamente. É a vontade de Sanguinávido."
G["We are bound to her, sisters..."]="Estamos vinculadas a ela, irmãs..."
G["We are brothers.  And we will stand united against those who oppose our peace."]="We are brothers.  And we will stand united against those who oppose our peace."
G["We are building a permanent outpost here in the Firelands, $n. Even if Ragnaros is defeated, another may someday take his place. We cannot allow what happened in the Burning Steppes and Mount Hyjal to threaten our world again.\n\nTo that end, we will grow the \"Sentinel Tree.\" A tree with roots in Azeroth, but a protective canopy growing here in this terrible realm. Under its shelter, we will permanently station a group of druids to maintain an eternal vigil over this desolate world."]="We are building a permanent outpost here in the Firelands, $n. Even if Ragnaros is defeated, another may someday take his place. We cannot allow what happened in the Burning Steppes and Mount Hyjal to threaten our world again.\n\nTo that end, we will grow the \"Sentinel Tree.\" A tree with roots in Azeroth, but a protective canopy growing here in this terrible realm. Under its shelter, we will permanently station a group of druids to maintain an eternal vigil over this desolate world."
G["We are but darkness and shadows. Eternal. Invisible."]="Nós somos apenas trevas e sombras. Eterno. Invisível."
G["We are but dirt beneath your feet, sir."]="Somente somos sujeira sob seus pés, senhor."
G["We are but extensions of Doom Lord Kazzak's will!  Be strong!  Be vigilant!  Let nothing stand in the way of the Burning Legion!"]="We are but extensions of Doom Lord Kazzak's will!  Be strong!  Be vigilant!  Let nothing stand in the way of the Burning Legion!"
G["We are but one tiny village... What could we possibly do to defeat the Thunder King's forces?"]="Somente somos uma pequena aldeia... O que podemos fazer contra o exército do Rei do Trovão?"
G["We are damned.  If I were you, I'd leave before it was too late.  You'll be lucky if you make it back alive."]="We are damned.  If I were you, I'd leave before it was too late.  You'll be lucky if you make it back alive."
G["We are discussing where we shall go next. Perhaps join the Pearlfin in Jade Forest?\nSpeaking of which - how does the $ngill Tribe sound to you?"]="We are discussing where we shall go next. Perhaps join the Pearlfin in Jade Forest?\nSpeaking of which - how does the $ngill Tribe sound to you?"
G["We are doing everything we can."]="Fazemos o que podemos."
G["We are dominating the Scourge - the effects of the altered plague will affect them for at least another full day!  We need to stay on top of it though, so be sure to sabotage a cauldron when you can."]="Estamos dominando o flagelo - os efeitos do Flagelo alterada os afetarão por pelo menos mais um dia inteiro! No entanto, precisamos de ficar por dentro, então sabote um caldeirão quando puder."
G["We are done here, but the weapon is not yet tempered."]="Temos terminou aqui, mas ainda é preciso templar o arma."
G["We are done talking."]="Esta conversa terminou."
G["We are doomed!"]="Estamos perdidos!"
G["We are everywhere underneath you."]="Estamos em todas partes baixo vocês."
G["We are far from finished."]="Nós ainda não terminamos."
G["We are fast digger! Really fast! See... all done! That was fast, huh?"]="Cavamos rápido! Muito rápido! Olhe... já está! Foi rápido, não?"
G["We are focus testing new encounters! I can open doors, build bridges, and slay lions to facilitate the testing."]="We are focus testing new encounters! I can open doors, build bridges, and slay lions to facilitate the testing."
G["We are free of the Headless Horseman's terror, for now.  We may breathe easy again, but until he can be defeated while joined with his head, he may return."]="Por enquanto, estamos livres do terror do Cavaleiro Sem Cabeça. Podemos respirar tranqüilamente novamente, mas até que ele possa ser derrotado enquanto se junta à cabeça, ele pode retornar."
G["We are friends now, $n. You are welcome to our village any time you wish to return."]="We are friends now, $n. You are welcome to our village any time you wish to return."
G["We are friends of the world that you call Azeroth. I am happy to provide any assistance that I can."]="Nós ser amigos do mundo que você chamar Azeroth. Eu estar contente de poder ajudar no que eu poder."
G["We are from the Alliance, and mean you no harm. Tell me, what was that shadow you drew out of me?"]="Nós somos da Aliança e não queremos lhe fazer mal. Diga-me, o que era a sombra que você extraiu de mim?"
G["We are going to crush you next time! Our tank should be able to remember to generate enough threat on you!"]="A próxima vez te aplastaremos! Nosso tanque se acordará de gerar a ameaça suficiente!"
G["We are going to pass through a fierce battle. You must engage the hozen while I run through. If all goes well, I will meet you at my village."]="We are going to pass through a fierce battle. You must engage the hozen while I run through. If all goes well, I will meet you at my village."
G["We are going to the Temple of Earth, yes?"]="Vamos ao Templo da Terra, verdade?"
G["We are graced to hear from our revered Grand Anchorite Almonen. Take a knee men."]="Nos honra receber notícia de nosso reverenciado grande anacoreta Almonen. Arrodilhaos."
G["We are guests here, Garrosh, and you will conduct yourself honorably."]="Aqui somos convidados, Garrosh, e te comportarás de modo honrado."
G["We are halfway there!"]="Já falta pouco!"
G["We are happy to provide you with supplies."]="Estamos felizes em fornecer suprimentos."
G["We are hard at work, training with your soldiers."]="Estamos trabalhando muito duro treinando com os seus soldados."
G["We are having difficulty determining the status of the plague within the area; check back shortly and we may have a better idea."]="We are having difficulty determining the status of the plague within the area; check back shortly and we may have a better idea."
G["We are here on a peaceful rescue mission - will you help us?"]="We are here on a peaceful rescue mission - will you help us?"
G["We are here on a rescue mission."]="Temos vindo em uma missão de resgate."
G["We are here to celebrate your victory and to welcome our newfound allies!"]="We are here to celebrate your victory and to welcome our newfound allies!"
G["We are here to fight the Thunder King. Justice demands it, and Hellscream is too preoccupied at Domination Point to pay attention here."]="We are here to fight the Thunder King. Justice demands it, and Hellscream is too preoccupied at Domination Point to pay attention here."
G["We are here to help."]="Estamos aqui para ajudar."
G["We are here to pay respect to the great forest, and take part in the wonder of the Earth Mother's gifts."]="Estamos aqui para respeitar a grande floresta e participar da maravilha dos presentes da Mãe Terra."
G["We are here to preserve these lands for our people."]="Estamos aqui para preservar essas terras para o nosso povo."
G["We are here to support our hero!"]="Estamos aqui para apoiar a nosso herói!"
G["We are honored by your presence, friend.  How can we serve you today?"]="Estamos honrados pela sua presença, amigo. Como podemos atendê-o hoje?"
G["We are honored by your presence, little $g brother : sister; $n."]="We are honored by your presence, little $g brother : sister; $n."
G["We are honored by your presence, son of Durotan. The Greatmother awaits you at the hospice."]="We are honored by your presence, son of Durotan. The Greatmother awaits you at the hospice."
G["We are honored by your sacrifice."]="Seu sacrifício nos honra."
G["We are honored that you have chosen to be tainted."]="Nos honra que te deixe contaminar."
G["We are humbled by your selflessness, $n.  If in the past we've seemed a bit conceited, realize that it is by your example that we were able to change our attitudes.\n\nWe thank you, and hope that you'll continue to assist us in our struggle against the forge camps."]="We are humbled by your selflessness, $n.  If in the past we've seemed a bit conceited, realize that it is by your example that we were able to change our attitudes.\n\nWe thank you, and hope that you'll continue to assist us in our struggle against the forge camps."
G["We are hunters, too. We are fighters. We can fight for the sea and the land."]="We are hunters, too. We are fighters. We can fight for the sea and the land."
G["We are in Ogri'la."]="Estamos em Ogri'a."
G["We are in heaven."]="Estamos no céu."
G["We are in the heart of the mogu war machine."]="Estamos no coração da maquinaria de guerra mogu."
G["We are infinite... eternal."]="Somos infinitos... eternos."
G["We are investigating the cultists activities as we speak."]="Estamos investigando as atividades dos cultistas agora mesmo."
G["We are investigating the sewer system - perhaps there is another way in to the citadel."]="Estamos investigando o sistema de cloacas: talvez tenha outro modo de entrar à cidadela."
G["We are joining an assault on Lorthuna's Gate. You are needed."]="Nos vamos unir ao ataque sobre a Porta de Lorthuna. Precisamos de você."
G["We are just barely holding our ground. We need every able-bodied soldier to report for duty."]="Nós mal estamos nos segurando. Precisamos de tudo soldado capaz de se apresentar para o serviço."
G["We are just beginning our pandaren campaign, $n."]="Não temos feito mais que começar nossa campanha pandaren, $n."
G["We are just getting started, friend! Our greatest challenges lie ahead."]="We are just getting started, friend! Our greatest challenges lie ahead."
G["We are keepers of the secrets of Uldum.  Beneath the sand... under the pyramids... there exists great power.\n\nThe power to make and break an entire world.\n\nHe cannot access this power without us, however."]="We are keepers of the secrets of Uldum.  Beneath the sand... under the pyramids... there exists great power.\n\nThe power to make and break an entire world.\n\nHe cannot access this power without us, however."
G["We are known for trade, not war. Would you like to see what I have for sale?"]="We are known for trade, not war. Would you like to see what I have for sale?"
G["We are launching an assault on Bash'ir Landing, to study their Crystalforge.  Help us if you can!  Our Skyguard Aether-tech will leave in about $4581d."]="Estamos lançando um ataque a Bash'ir Landing, para estudar a Crystalforge deles. Ajude-nos se puder! Nossa Skyguard Aether-tech sairá em perto de $4581d."
G["We are legion. We are everywhere. See you back at Jinyu Mere, $p."]="Somos legião. Estamos em todas partes. Te verei novamente em Jinyu Mere, $p."
G["We are looking for a brewer named Mudmug. Do you know of him?"]="We are looking for a brewer named Mudmug. Do you know of him?"
G["We are looking into the missing person reports you filed."]="Estamos investigando o relatório de pessoa desaparecida que presentaste."
G["We are looking into these cultists groups."]="Estamos investigando estes grupos de cultistas."
G["We are lost! Fall back!"]="Estamos perdidos! Replegaos!"
G["We are lucky to have survived this ordeal. If it wasn't for you, everyone on this island could have been killed!"]="Temos sorte de ter sobrevivido a esta provação. Se não fosse por você, todos na ilha poderiam ter sido mortos!"
G["We are masters of the Stair now!"]="Agora somos os mestres da escadaria!"
G["We are masters of the water, which is why we have been able to defend this village for so long. But on land, especially with thick tree cover, the hozen are vastly superior."]="We are masters of the water, which is why we have been able to defend this village for so long. But on land, especially with thick tree cover, the hozen are vastly superior."
G["We are more than capable of handling this without assistance. Withdraw. When you return, you will find the Empress slain and your problems solved."]="We are more than capable of handling this without assistance. Withdraw. When you return, you will find the Empress slain and your problems solved."
G["We are most pleased with your actions against the night elves. When you uncovered their plot to use the ley-line nexi and their so-called moon crystals to spy upon us, you strengthened our position here by an order of magnitude.\n\nYou have our gratitude, $n."]="We are most pleased with your actions against the night elves. When you uncovered their plot to use the ley-line nexi and their so-called moon crystals to spy upon us, you strengthened our position here by an order of magnitude.\n\nYou have our gratitude, $n."
G["We are nearly prepared to start this battle, brothers.  Thorg'izog, what is the matter?  Why are you covering your butt like that?"]="Já quase estamos prontos para começar a batalha, irmãos. Thorg'izog, que acontece? Por que te tapas o traseiro dessa forma?"
G["We are not afraid to fight. Our warriors, while few in number, are extremely skilled."]="We are not afraid to fight. Our warriors, while few in number, are extremely skilled."
G["We are not finished!"]="Não temos terminou!"
G["We are not in the habit of welcoming outsiders into our village."]="Não solemos receber a desconocidos em nossa aldeia."
G["We are not interested in your war, outsider. This is a peaceful village."]="Não nos interesse sua guerra. Esta é uma aldeia pacífica."
G["We are not out of the woods yet."]="Isto ainda não terminou."
G["We are not some mind controlled savages you are dealing with. To defy Hellscream is to defy the greatest orcs of the Horde!"]="Não somos uns selvagens manipulados. Desafiar a Grito Infernal é desafiar aos orcs mais grandiosos da Horda."
G["We are not unfriendly, stranger. Just wary."]="Não somos hostis, destino precavidos."
G["We are not warriors. I produce only tools and light weaponry for hunting."]="We are not warriors. I produce only tools and light weaponry for hunting."
G["We are nothing. Tulall par'okoth. Far'al, ka'kar. The void devours."]="Não somos nada. Tulall par'okoth. Far'ao, ka'kar. O vazio devora."
G["We are on a quest to find the Pools of Youth!\n\nThe fabled waters were a boon of a mysterious lost civilization that predated Queen Azshara.\n\nWith these waters, we will be able to restore the glory of immortality to the kal'dorei."]="We are on a quest to find the Pools of Youth!\n\nThe fabled waters were a boon of a mysterious lost civilization that predated Queen Azshara.\n\nWith these waters, we will be able to restore the glory of immortality to the kal'dorei."
G["We are on a strict timetable. You will not interfere!"]="We are on a strict timetable. You will not interfere!"
G["We are on our way to the Wanderer's Festival. You should join us!"]="Nos dirigimos ao Festival do Errante. Deveria vir conosco!"
G["We are on the brink of all out war with the Alliance!"]="Estamos ao borda de uma encarnizada Guerra contra a Aliança!"
G["We are one in the Light, $g brother : sister;, but I cannot train you."]="We are one in the Light, $g brother : sister;, but I cannot train you."
G["We are one step closer. The unknowable, transcendent power of the Emerald Dream I now give unto the Dragon Soul."]="We are one step closer. The unknowable, transcendent power of the Emerald Dream I now give unto the Dragon Soul."
G["We are only doing what's necessary to keep the city safe."]="We are only doing what's necessary to keep the city safe."
G["We are outnumbered here, our ties to Crossroads and Durotar severed. But one orc is worth 10 Alliance cowards.\n\nWe will bottle them up in this pass and gut them like swine."]="We are outnumbered here, our ties to Crossroads and Durotar severed. But one orc is worth 10 Alliance cowards.\n\nWe will bottle them up in this pass and gut them like swine."
G["We are patient."]="Somos pacientes."
G["We are poorly equipped to do battle here.\n\nPreparations must be made..."]="We are poorly equipped to do battle here.\n\nPreparations must be made..."
G["We are prepared, Highlord. Let us battle for the fate of Azeroth! For the light of dawn!"]="Estamos preparados, Grão-lorde. Vamos lutar pelo destino de Azeroth! Pela luz do amanhecer!"
G["We are preparing. I just need time to ensure the safety of my people. But Vol'jin..."]="Nos estamos preparando. Somente preciso tempo para colocar a meu gente a salvou. Mas, Vol'jin..."
G["We are proud to call ourselves the last tribe of Forest Trolls to serve the Horde.\n\nIn time, we will overcome the other tribes, and the dwarves, and the Hinterlands will be ours."]="We are proud to call ourselves the last tribe of Forest Trolls to serve the Horde.\n\nIn time, we will overcome the other tribes, and the dwarves, and the Hinterlands will be ours."
G["We are quickly learning the price of death in this frigid wasteland, $n. The Lich King's power extends across every inch of Northrend, permeating into the earth itself! He turns our own fallen people against us.\n\nFrom the sky, risen gryphon riders rain down their vengeful stormhammers as the walking dead assail us on the ground."]="We are quickly learning the price of death in this frigid wasteland, $n. The Lich King's power extends across every inch of Northrend, permeating into the earth itself! He turns our own fallen people against us.\n\nFrom the sky, risen gryphon riders rain down their vengeful stormhammers as the walking dead assail us on the ground."
G["We are quite safe from your pitiful band!"]="Sua lamentable Raide não significa uma ameaça para nós!"
G["We are ready for whatever Archimonde might send our way, Lady Proudmoore."]="Estamos prontos para qualquer coisa que Archimonde nos mande, lady Corajoso."
G["We are ready to get you out of here, Thrall. Let's go!"]="Estamos prontos para tirá-o daqui, Thrall. Vamos lá!"
G["We are ready to go, High Overlord. The Lich King must fall!"]="Estamos prontos para partir, Sumo Lorde. O Rei Lich deve cair!"
G["We are ready to help!"]="Nós estamos prontos para ajudar!"
G["We are ready to launch the raid at a moment's notice. All we need is the key. Have you found one?"]="Estamos a ponto de começar o ataque. Somente nos há falta a chave. A tem encontrado?"
G["We are ready to proceed.  Magni, you have called this meeting.  What concerns you?"]="Estamos prontos para seguir. Magni, você tem convocado esta reunião. Que te preocupa?"
G["We are ready!"]="Estamos prontos!"
G["We are ready, Cenarius."]="Estamos prontos, Cenarius."
G["We are ready, Keeper."]="O estamos, vigia."
G["We are safe... for now. His strength has increased tenfold since our last battle. It will take a mighty army to destroy the Lich King. An army greater than even the Horde can rouse."]="Estamos seguros... por enquanto. Sua força aumentou dez vezes desde a nossa última batalha. Será necessário um exército poderoso para destruir o Rei Lich. Um exército maior que até a Horda pode despertar."
G["We are saved! The peasants have escaped the Scourge!"]="Estamos salvados! Os campesinos se têm salvou do Flagelo!"
G["We are sending crusaders to reclaim what is rightfully ours! Any Scourge that stand in our way will be turned to ashes."]="We are sending crusaders to reclaim what is rightfully ours! Any Scourge that stand in our way will be turned to ashes."
G["We are sieging Niuzao Temple.\n\nYou are known to us, $n. Your help is necessary once more."]="We are sieging Niuzao Temple.\n\nYou are known to us, $n. Your help is necessary once more."
G["We are still beset by threats here. I cannot leave the camp unguarded."]="Aqui ainda estamos em perigo. Não deixarei o acampamento sem proteção."
G["We are stronger now! You will die!"]="Agora somos mais fortes! Morrerá!"
G["We are strongest when we listen to the wisdom of our elders, to when we share our burdens with one another, and when we remember that Elune’s light is reflected in each other."]="We are strongest when we listen to the wisdom of our elders, to when we share our burdens with one another, and when we remember that Elune’s light is reflected in each other."
G["We are supposed to play here, but I bet we could wander around and not get in too much trouble."]="We are supposed to play here, but I bet we could wander around and not get in too much trouble."
G["We are surrounded!"]="Estamos rodeados!"
G["We are surrounded... Our enemies press in from all sides, young Hellscream."]="We are surrounded... Our enemies press in from all sides, young Hellscream."
G["We are the Alliance. We are always ready."]="Somos a Aliança. Sempre estamos preparados."
G["We are the HORDE. We are slaves to nothing and no one!"]="Somos a HORDA. Não somos escravos de nada nem de ninguém!"
G["We are the Horde. We are always ready."]="Somos a Horda. Sempre estamos preparados."
G["We are the Horde. We do NOT back down."]="We are the Horde. We do NOT back down."
G["We are the Orcish Horde, the True Horde.  We die, bloody and thrashing on the field of battle, like true orcs SHOULD."]="We are the Orcish Horde, the True Horde.  We die, bloody and thrashing on the field of battle, like true orcs SHOULD."
G["We are the Royal Apothecary Society!  Inducing belly aches is not part of our job description!"]="We are the Royal Apothecary Society!  Inducing belly aches is not part of our job description!"
G["We are the Sin'dorai! We should not have to bow to anyone. Not the Kirin Tor, not the Alliance, and certainly not the Horde."]="We are the Sin'dorai! We should not have to bow to anyone. Not the Kirin Tor, not the Alliance, and certainly not the Horde."
G["We are the arm of His will.  And we will crush His foes into grave dust!"]="We are the arm of His will.  And we will crush His foes into grave dust!"
G["We are the backbone of the Ashenvale offensive. Failure is NOT an option!"]="We are the backbone of the Ashenvale offensive. Failure is NOT an option!"
G["We are the chill in a coward's spine..."]="We are the chill in a coward's spine..."
G["We are the chosen ones, $n. Death knights of the Scourge, sent to sow the seeds of the master's destruction."]="Somos os escolhidos, $n. Cavaleiros da Morte do Flagelo, enviados para sembrar as sementes da destruição do mestre."
G["We are the extension of our Empress's will."]="Somos a extensão da vontade de nossa Imperatriz."
G["We are the greatest!"]="Somos os melhores!"
G["We are the grummles. We know all of the paths through the mountains.\n\nMost of all we bring supplies to the great wall in the east. The bastion of the Shado-Pan.\n\nThese are dark times though, and grummles face great dangers on our road."]="We are the grummles. We know all of the paths through the mountains.\n\nMost of all we bring supplies to the great wall in the east. The bastion of the Shado-Pan.\n\nThese are dark times though, and grummles face great dangers on our road."
G["We are the instruments of an unyielding ire..."]="Somos os instrumentos de uma raiva implacável..."
G["We are the last of the furbolg race... The Timbermaw tribe remains uncorrupted, yet we face the same hostility from outsiders; most believe that it is not possible... that there could actually be furbolg that escaped the corruption...\n\nAngry at those that strive to make enemies too quickly, my brethren now attack any that draw near; they trust no one.\n\nBut perhaps, if you strive to make your presence peaceful with them, they might look upon you as an ally."]="We are the last of the furbolg race... The Timbermaw tribe remains uncorrupted, yet we face the same hostility from outsiders; most believe that it is not possible... that there could actually be furbolg that escaped the corruption...\n\nAngry at those that strive to make enemies too quickly, my brethren now attack any that draw near; they trust no one.\n\nBut perhaps, if you strive to make your presence peaceful with them, they might look upon you as an ally."
G["We are the lost. We know not who we are, or where we belong. We wander in darkness."]="Somos os perdidos. Não sabemos quem somos, nem aonde devemos ir. Vagamos na escuridão."
G["We are the new Horde, and under Warchief Hellscream, we are masters of our own destinies."]="We are the new Horde, and under Warchief Hellscream, we are masters of our own destinies."
G["We are the only supplier of healthy flowers in all of Stormwind. We provide beautiful blooms for any occasion."]="Nós somos o único fornecedor de flores saudáveis ​​em tudo o Stormwind. Nós fornecemos belas flores para qualquer ocasião."
G["We are the outsiders here, Li Li. We probably look even weirder to him."]="Aqui somos nós os forasteiros, Li Li. A ele lhe pareceremos ainda mais estranhos."
G["We are the perfect one, yes, yes, not a failure, no no, not a failure..."]="We are the perfect one, yes, yes, not a failure, no no, not a failure..."
G["We are the protectors - immovable and unflappable.\n\nWhen we are moving, nothing can stop us from moving. When we are standing still, nothing can budge us."]="We are the protectors - immovable and unflappable.\n\nWhen we are moving, nothing can stop us from moving. When we are standing still, nothing can budge us."
G["We are the true Horde!"]="Somos a verdadeira Horda!"
G["We are the watchers of the wall, the keepers of darkness, the masters of shadows. We know what evil lurks in the heart of Pandaria. We... are the Shado-Pan."]="We are the watchers of the wall, the keepers of darkness, the masters of shadows. We know what evil lurks in the heart of Pandaria. We... are the Shado-Pan."
G["We are to surround the temple with defenses. Can your druids help?"]="Temos que colocar defesas ao redor do templo. Podem nos ajudar seus druidas?"
G["We are to wait here. They sent others ahead to check the tunnel interior."]="We are to wait here. They sent others ahead to check the tunnel interior."
G["We are too late! Shan Bu is nearly done resurrecting Nalak, the Storm Lord. That is only incidental, however. Our true objective is to defeat Shan Bu!"]="Chegamos tarde demais! Shan Bu quase terminou de ressuscitar a Nalak, o Senhor da Tempestade. Mas não importa. Nosso verdadeiro objetivo é derrotar a Shan Bu."
G["We are too late! They killed her, as Fandral predicted."]="Chegamos tarde demais! A têm matou, tal como Fandral predijo."
G["We are trying to bring Agamath, the First Gate down. Please, $c, go to the Isle of Quel'Danas and help in any way that you can!"]="Ainda estamos tentando derrubar Agamath, a primeira porta. Por favor, $c, vê à Ilha de Quel'Danas e ajuda no que seja possível!"
G["We are under attack! To arms!"]="Nos atacando! Às armas!"
G["We are under direct orders from Cairne, $r. Do not interfere with the Commander's task."]="We are under direct orders from Cairne, $r. Do not interfere with the Commander's task."
G["We are under siege!  To arms!  Kill this $n!"]="We are under siege!  To arms!  Kill this $n!"
G["We are unfazed. We will stand firm."]="We are unfazed. We will stand firm."
G["We are unified like never before. We've bought our people security in Kalimdor, an end to the blockade, and an end to the total war that's spilt so much blood on either side of the great sea.\n\nNow, to the work of winning the peace. I would like to station a garrison near Theramore. We need to investigate cleansing the plague from Gilnean lands so they can rebuild. We must contain Sylvanas.\n\nFrom here on forward, the Alliance will be proactive. Never again can there be another the likes of Hellscream."]="We are unified like never before. We've bought our people security in Kalimdor, an end to the blockade, and an end to the total war that's spilt so much blood on either side of the great sea.\n\nNow, to the work of winning the peace. I would like to station a garrison near Theramore. We need to investigate cleansing the plague from Gilnean lands so they can rebuild. We must contain Sylvanas.\n\nFrom here on forward, the Alliance will be proactive. Never again can there be another the likes of Hellscream."
G["We are united in cause, $r. An ancient evil threatens to extinguish all life on Kalimdor and consume the world with its depravity... Its hatred of all things born of the great Shapers: The eternal Titans.\n\nWe are the first and the last lines of defense against the armies of C'Thun. If we do not rise up and strike at our enemy, our enemy will surely destroy us.\n\nThe war effort needs you!"]="We are united in cause, $r. An ancient evil threatens to extinguish all life on Kalimdor and consume the world with its depravity... Its hatred of all things born of the great Shapers: The eternal Titans.\n\nWe are the first and the last lines of defense against the armies of C'Thun. If we do not rise up and strike at our enemy, our enemy will surely destroy us.\n\nThe war effort needs you!"
G["We are vastly outnumbered here, but with a well-executed strategy, I believe we can succeed."]="We are vastly outnumbered here, but with a well-executed strategy, I believe we can succeed."
G["We are very fortunate to be alive, you and I!"]="Temos muita sorte de estar vivo, você e eu!"
G["We are victorious on the Wintergrasp battlefield!  The fortress is ours!"]="Temos derrotado no campo de batalha de Invérnia! A fortaleza é nossa!"
G["We are victorious!"]="Hemos triunfado!"
G["We are victorious! Dimensius is no more! Report back to the Professor, hero."]="We are victorious! Dimensius is no more! Report back to the Professor, hero."
G["We are victorious.  In Azshara's name!"]="Temos derrotado. Em nome de Azshara!"
G["We are wasting time. We should move in for the kill!"]="We are wasting time. We should move in for the kill!"
G["We are what the cold wind carries. The icy chill of despair... The cold embrace of death..."]="Nós somos o que o vento frio carrega. O frio gelado do desespero... O frio abraço da morte..."
G["We are winning this battle, $n.  As long as those farmers keep chipping away at the Forsaken's flanks, we will overtake them."]="We are winning this battle, $n.  As long as those farmers keep chipping away at the Forsaken's flanks, we will overtake them."
G["We are working to open a portal from here to Shado-Pan Garrison."]="We are working to open a portal from here to Shado-Pan Garrison."
G["We are... beaten. Escape if you can..."]="Nos têm... derrotado. Huye se você pode..."
G["We aren't giving those savages an inch of ground. Not while I'm still alive."]="We aren't giving those savages an inch of ground. Not while I'm still alive."
G["We aren't your enemy, Xorenth!"]="Não somos o inimigo, Xorenth!"
G["We arrived just in time! Go'el's spirit has become so unstable, it could collapse upon itself if we don't act fast."]="We arrived just in time! Go'el's spirit has become so unstable, it could collapse upon itself if we don't act fast."
G["We assemble an enormous fleet: land, sea, and air. We are legion!"]="Temos reuniu uma grande frota: por terra, por mar e por ar. Somos legiones!"
G["We assembled a mighty force and defeated Thermaplugg's servants, fighting our way into the city. But, the usurper Thermaplugg had one last trick up his sleeve..."]="We assembled a mighty force and defeated Thermaplugg's servants, fighting our way into the city. But, the usurper Thermaplugg had one last trick up his sleeve..."
G["We attack Neferset city at first light."]="Atacaremos a Cidade de Neferset ao alba."
G["We attacked under cover of a blizzard....\n\nThe Scourge were caught off guard... our victory was certain....\n\nThen... from behind us... the Horde came from nowhere.\n\nThey cost us... everything...."]="We attacked under cover of a blizzard....\n\nThe Scourge were caught off guard... our victory was certain....\n\nThen... from behind us... the Horde came from nowhere.\n\nThey cost us... everything...."
G["We await a batch of black dragon eggs from the Burning Steppes.  We believe that, through their study, we will advance our knowledge dramatically."]="We await a batch of black dragon eggs from the Burning Steppes.  We believe that, through their study, we will advance our knowledge dramatically."
G["We barely have any excess supplies.  It'll take a lot more work before we're ready to send another ground assault into the Field of Strife."]="Mal temos excesso de suprimentos. Vai levar muito mais trabalho antes de estarmos prontos para enviar outro ataque terrestre ao Campo de Conflito."
G["We barely have any supplies to build Frostwolf Keep.  We'll need many, many more before we can repair our base and reenter the battle."]="We barely have any supplies to build Frostwolf Keep.  We'll need many, many more before we can repair our base and reenter the battle."
G["We barely made it out alive. You'd better run and tell Lasha what you've seen. We've got a serious problem to deal with!"]="We barely made it out alive. You'd better run and tell Lasha what you've seen. We've got a serious problem to deal with!"
G["We barely pulled you out of there.  You're lucky to be alive."]="We barely pulled you out of there.  You're lucky to be alive."
G["We battle for the glory of Ymiron! We die in the name of the Lich King!"]="We battle for the glory of Ymiron! We die in the name of the Lich King!"
G["We be facin' da Kor'kron. Deh be da meanest, baddest orcs deh' Horde have ever seen. Ya betta' not be sleepin' through 'dis trainin'."]="We be facin' da Kor'kron. Deh be da meanest, baddest orcs deh' Horde have ever seen. Ya betta' not be sleepin' through 'dis trainin'."
G["We be gatherin' here, on de shores of Sen'jin Village, to be takin' BACK what is ours!"]="Não' reunimo' na orilha do Poblao Sen'jin pa RECUPERÁ o que e' nueh'tro!"
G["We be gettin' ready to march to de Isles, an' FREE dem of Zalazane's wicked rule! Join me!"]="We be gettin' ready to march to de Isles, an' FREE dem of Zalazane's wicked rule! Join me!"
G["We be headin' up t' where the goblins say they found black gold.  That gold belongs t' the Bloodsail!"]="We be headin' up t' where the goblins say they found black gold.  That gold belongs t' the Bloodsail!"
G["We be here courtesy o' the trade prince."]="We be here courtesy o' the trade prince."
G["We be killin' you now."]="A gente vamo estar te matando."
G["We be meetin' again so soon..."]="Nós nos encontraremos novamente tão cedo..."
G["We be ready to strike back soon!"]="Nós estar prontos para devolver ataque pronto!"
G["We be ready to take da fight to Garrosh."]="Eh'tamos preparados para ir a por Garrosh."
G["We be takin' out de trash!"]="We be takin' out de trash!"
G["We been duped!"]="Como temos caído!"
G["We been idle too long!"]="We been idle too long!"
G["We been workin' wit de spirits for many moons now, mon, but many o' us already knew de forms o' de loa we served before. It not be easy, but de Emerald Dream be a powerful teacher by itself-havin' de spirits demselves also teachin' ya... it hurries tings along.\n\nDat don't mean 'twas easy keepin' safe from Zalazane. Even wit our new tricks combined wit de loa givin' what help dey could, we lost a few bruddas and sistas over de years ta his voodoo and mindless servants. But we kept de life o' de isles alive, and when Vol'jin and de Darkspears returned, we knew just how ta take Zalazane down."]="We been workin' wit de spirits for many moons now, mon, but many o' us already knew de forms o' de loa we served before. It not be easy, but de Emerald Dream be a powerful teacher by itself-havin' de spirits demselves also teachin' ya... it hurries tings along.\n\nDat don't mean 'twas easy keepin' safe from Zalazane. Even wit our new tricks combined wit de loa givin' what help dey could, we lost a few bruddas and sistas over de years ta his voodoo and mindless servants. But we kept de life o' de isles alive, and when Vol'jin and de Darkspears returned, we knew just how ta take Zalazane down."
G["We believed the Sanctum was well-fortified, but we were not prepared for the nature of this assault."]="We believed the Sanctum was well-fortified, but we were not prepared for the nature of this assault."
G["We bent the crap outta them!"]="As temos front bem rompidas!"
G["We better destroy them all. But first, I need to get the shrapnel out of my backside."]="We better destroy them all. But first, I need to get the shrapnel out of my backside."
G["We blood elves have weathered many a storm. Whatever the Thunder King unleashes against us, we shall strike him an even greater blow!"]="We blood elves have weathered many a storm. Whatever the Thunder King unleashes against us, we shall strike him an even greater blow!"
G["We break from this haze to find that Fandral Staghelm and many of his closest followers have disappeared without a word."]="We break from this haze to find that Fandral Staghelm and many of his closest followers have disappeared without a word."
G["We bring only our honor and the desire to crush our enemies. Have your kind been aiding the Alliance?"]="Trazemos só nossa honra e o desejo de esmagar os inimigos. Seu povo andou ajudando a Aliança?"
G["We bring victory..."]="We bring victory..."
G["We broke up afterward, that's what happened. Too much bad blood, I guess...it had been building for a while. And the thing with the amulet was the straw that broke the kodo's back.\n\nEver since then Valthalak's servants have been picking us off one by one. Most of the amulet piece holders are dead, their souls corrupted by the portion of Valthalak's spirit contained within it.\n\nThat's why I'm glad that you're here, $n. With your help we'll be able to recombine the amulet and return it to Lord Valthalak!"]="We broke up afterward, that's what happened. Too much bad blood, I guess...it had been building for a while. And the thing with the amulet was the straw that broke the kodo's back.\n\nEver since then Valthalak's servants have been picking us off one by one. Most of the amulet piece holders are dead, their souls corrupted by the portion of Valthalak's spirit contained within it.\n\nThat's why I'm glad that you're here, $n. With your help we'll be able to recombine the amulet and return it to Lord Valthalak!"
G["We brought you a gift, Great One. Maybe you see it when you wake up. Maybe you remember we came to see you, oki?"]="We brought you a gift, Great One. Maybe you see it when you wake up. Maybe you remember we came to see you, oki?"
G["We built this place with our bare hands! Blood and tears, my friend.\n\nBelieve me when I tell you this: We have no plans on ever giving up our hold on Valgarde."]="We built this place with our bare hands! Blood and tears, my friend.\n\nBelieve me when I tell you this: We have no plans on ever giving up our hold on Valgarde."
G["We burns it, we burns! Bring fire, yes!"]="We burns it, we burns! Bring fire, yes!"
G["We call him Smiling Jim..."]="We call him Smiling Jim..."
G["We call it \"Doom Juice.\""]="O chamamos \"o jugo da morte\"."
G["We call them \"Emergency Rampless Debarkation Devices.\""]="Os chamamos \"Dispositivos de evacuação de emergência livres de rampas\"."
G["We call upon you, Firelord!"]="Te invocamos, Senhor do Fogo!"
G["We came for something, yes? Can't remember."]="Nós vir por algo, sim? Não lembrar."
G["We came here for war.\n\nThey gave it to us."]="Vinimos aqui para lutar.\n\nE eles nos têm proporcionado guerra."
G["We came here to Un'Goro with one objective in mind: profit.  My associates and I are always looking for business partners, if you're interested."]="Viemos aqui para Um'Goro com um objetivo em mente: lucro. Meus associados e eu estamos sempre procurando parceiros de negócios, se você estiver interessado."
G["We came here to investigate and were caught like a gnome with his hand on King Mekkatorque's throne."]="We came here to investigate and were caught like a gnome with his hand on King Mekkatorque's throne."
G["We came here to seal da rift Deathwing tore into Azeroth. We need the World Pillar to repair da hole on dis side."]="We came here to seal da rift Deathwing tore into Azeroth. We need the World Pillar to repair da hole on dis side."
G["We came to bring the master's prophecy into being. The rituals have already begun and we are too numerous for you to stop us all."]="We came to bring the master's prophecy into being. The rituals have already begun and we are too numerous for you to stop us all."
G["We can afford no delay. Fort Triumph must be completed and reinforced, or any hope we have for permanent settlement on this continent will be erased."]="Não podemos permitir nenhum atraso. O Forte Triunfo deve ser completado e reforçado, ou qualquer esperança que tenhamos de um assentamento permanente neste continente será apagada."
G["We can agree it is noble to fight for a righteous cause: to defend home or family. But what of vengeance? What of anger? I sense these emotions run deep in this one."]="Concordamos que é nobre lutar por uma causa justa: defender o lar ou a família. Mas e vingança? E raiva? Sinto que essas emoções são profundas nesta alma."
G["We can both agree on that, doctor."]="Os dois estamos de acordo em isso, doutor."
G["We can continue now, I think.  Let us press on."]="Acho que podemos seguir. Sigamos."
G["We can dance too!"]="Nós também sabemos dançar!"
G["We can decurse you, we have the technology."]="We can decurse you, we have the technology."
G["We can discuss the cut after you come back with the hides. I'm thinking ninety-ten."]="We can discuss the cut after you come back with the hides. I'm thinking ninety-ten."
G["We can do this in one of two ways, Godfrey. First, I will simply ask you to tell me what the unholy markings etched upon the pages of this tome mean. What say you?"]="We can do this in one of two ways, Godfrey. First, I will simply ask you to tell me what the unholy markings etched upon the pages of this tome mean. What say you?"
G["We can do this!"]="We can do this!"
G["We can handle it from here.  Roughriders you are dismissed."]="We can handle it from here.  Roughriders you are dismissed."
G["We can has aged yolk?"]="Podemos ter gema envelhecida?"
G["We can learn much by watching others do battle."]="We can learn much by watching others do battle."
G["We can learn much from these experiments..."]="Podemos aprender muito com estes experimentos."
G["We can make it better, stronger, faster. We have the technology. We have the magic."]="We can make it better, stronger, faster. We have the technology. We have the magic."
G["We can make it if we run!"]="O conseguiremos se corremos!"
G["We can never rest until we get to the top! Heh? Get it?"]="Veremos a neve esta na cima! Eh? O pilhas?"
G["We can now rebuild!  For the Horde!"]="Agora podemos reconstruir! pela Horda!"
G["We can only stay a few moments before returning to the tower. If you wish to speak to us more you may find us there."]="We can only stay a few moments before returning to the tower. If you wish to speak to us more you may find us there."
G["We can overcome these foul creatures!"]="Podemos vencer a estas hediondas criaturas!"
G["We can run no longer. It is time to stand and fight."]="Não podemos mais correr. É hora de ficar de pé e lutar."
G["We can save this one, but we must be quick."]="We can save this one, but we must be quick."
G["We can slip through here quietly, or fight our way through. It is your decision."]="We can slip through here quietly, or fight our way through. It is your decision."
G["We can sneak past them. As long as we can take down that construct in front of the gate, we should be able to get inside."]="We can sneak past them. As long as we can take down that construct in front of the gate, we should be able to get inside."
G["We can take this boat inside.  Just let me make a few modifications..."]="Podemos usar este navio. Vou hacerle um par de apanhos..."
G["We can take this boat inside. Just let me make a few modifications..."]="Podemos usar este navio. Vou hacerle um par de apanhos..."
G["We can use the balloon. Follow me!"]="Podemos usar o globo. Siga-me!"
G["We can use the orchids you gathered to purify the lake in the Valley of the Mad Brewer.  We'll need help though.\n\nMy friend Jian is a water sprite that has helped with some of my own brews and is very useful for getting just the right density of water.  He would know how best to distribute these herbs."]="We can use the orchids you gathered to purify the lake in the Valley of the Mad Brewer.  We'll need help though.\n\nMy friend Jian is a water sprite that has helped with some of my own brews and is very useful for getting just the right density of water.  He would know how best to distribute these herbs."
G["We can win if we work together."]="Podemos ganhar se trabalhamos juntos."
G["We can win this war!"]="Podemos ganhar esta guerra!"
G["We can't afford to let our enemy, Thermaplugg, continue to tighten his grip on the rest of Gnomeregan."]="Não podemos permitir que nosso inimigo, Termochufe, continúe cerrando seu punho sobre o resto de Gnomeregan."
G["We can't be certain that he was killed.  Maybe he just ran off somewhere."]="Não podemos estar seguros de que o tenham matou. ao melhor se tem escapado a algum lugar."
G["We can't be lettin' him get away!"]="Não podemo' de' que eh'cape!"
G["We can't even leave our houses anymore! The attacks are never ending!"]="Já nem sequer podemos sair de nossas casas! Os ataque são interminables!"
G["We can't help ya 'ere, mon."]="Não podemos ajuda'te, colega."
G["We can't hold them for long!  Get inside disrupt their necromancers!"]="We can't hold them for long!  Get inside disrupt their necromancers!"
G["We can't just let you return to your companions and we can't take you with us..."]="We can't just let you return to your companions and we can't take you with us..."
G["We can't just sit here!"]="We can't just sit here!"
G["We can't keep up the operation much longer. Delber and his team must launch their attack from Steelgrill's Depot as soon as possible!"]="We can't keep up the operation much longer. Delber and his team must launch their attack from Steelgrill's Depot as soon as possible!"
G["We can't leave these refugees like this, Kelaan. Buin here has sold his weapons and armor to buy food for them. He cannot do it alone."]="Não podemos deixar assim a estes refugiados, Kelaan. Buin tem vendido seus armas e sua armadura para comprar comida para eles. Não pode fazer isso somente."
G["We can't let a failing servo slow down the construction of the X-52 Nether-Rocket!"]="Não podemos permitir que um servo defeituoso retrase a construção do foguete asa X-52!"
G["We can't let this stand. The undead must pay!"]="Não podemos passar isto por alto. Os não-mortos devem pagar!"
G["We can't seem to stop the pumps."]="Parece que não conseguimos parar as bombas."
G["We can't wait to join the Skyguard. We just need to take a few more magical flasks, right?"]="We can't wait to join the Skyguard. We just need to take a few more magical flasks, right?"
G["We cannot afford to give an inch in this war. Day and night, I create new armor, and I patch whatever can be salvaged from the old. I have no time for other tasks. Would you take care of something for me?"]="Não podemos nos dar ao luxo de dar uma polegada nesta guerra. Dia e noite, crio nova armadura e remendo o que puder ser recuperei da antiga. Não tenho tempo para outras tarefas. Você cuidaria de algo para mim?"
G["We cannot afford to let our guard down, $c. This world is crawling with agents and allies of the Burning Legion. If you come across anything strange, don't hestitate to show me."]="We cannot afford to let our guard down, $c. This world is crawling with agents and allies of the Burning Legion. If you come across anything strange, don't hestitate to show me."
G["We cannot afford to take mythology at face value."]="We cannot afford to take mythology at face value."
G["We cannot allow the Alliance to turn the hidden secrets of the Strand of the Ancients against us. Will you join our brave warriors there?"]="Não podemos permitir que a Aliança volte contra nós os segredos ocultos do Fio dos Antigos. Você vai se juntar aos nossos bravos guerreiros lá?"
G["We cannot allow the Horde to turn the hidden secrets of the Strand of the Ancients against us. Will you join our brave soldiers there?"]="Não podemos permitir que a Horda revele contra nós os segredos ocultos do Fio dos Antigos. Você vai se juntar aos nossos bravos soldados lá?"
G["We cannot allow the arcane power to build up further!"]="Não podemos permitir que o poder Arcano se acumule ainda mais!"
G["We cannot allow this to fall into the wrong hands."]="Não podemos permitir que caia em mais mãos."
G["We cannot circle up here for long. Do what you can while I plan our next move."]="We cannot circle up here for long. Do what you can while I plan our next move."
G["We cannot dwell on the mistakes of the past, $r.\n\nThe only path is forward."]="We cannot dwell on the mistakes of the past, $r.\n\nThe only path is forward."
G["We cannot escape!"]="Não podemos escapar!"
G["We cannot fail, $n.  The future of multiple worlds is at stake here."]="Não podemos falhar, $n. Está em jogo o futuro de vários mundos."
G["We cannot fight like this forever."]="Não podemos lutar assim eternamente."
G["We cannot hold off the naga this way."]="We cannot hold off the naga this way."
G["We cannot hold out against power of this magnitude!  You must use the horn!"]="We cannot hold out against power of this magnitude!  You must use the horn!"
G["We cannot let Deathwing win. Should he triumph in this war, then all life will perish."]="We cannot let Deathwing win. Should he triumph in this war, then all life will perish."
G["We cannot let the deaths of our comrades go wasted! Do not let down your guard!"]="We cannot let the deaths of our comrades go wasted! Do not let down your guard!"
G["We cannot let them destroy this tree."]="Não podemos permitir que destruyan este árvore."
G["We cannot let them destroy this tree. It is the last of its kind."]="Não podemos permitir que destruyan este árvore. É o último do seu espécie."
G["We cannot rest yet, my child. Hyjal still stands, but if we falter on the Fire Lord's doorstep, all may still be lost. Let the strength of the ancients be with us."]="Ainda não podemos descansar, meu filho. Hyjal ainda está de pé, mas se vacilarmos na porta do Senhor do Fogo, tudo ainda poderá estar perdido. Que a força dos antigos esteja conosco."
G["We cannot save them all, $n. Let us move on to someone who may yet respond to our treatment."]="Não podemos salvá-los a todos, $n. Ajudemos a alguém que ainda possa responder ao tratamento."
G["We cannot thank you enough for everything you've done to protect our family, $n.\n\nAnd, you do realize that we were joking before when we offered to sell you one of our sons?  No, really... although we do feel a couple more headaches coming on.\n\nJunior, be still, will you?!"]="We cannot thank you enough for everything you've done to protect our family, $n.\n\nAnd, you do realize that we were joking before when we offered to sell you one of our sons?  No, really... although we do feel a couple more headaches coming on.\n\nJunior, be still, will you?!"
G["We caught this beast slaughtering sheep in the countryside. He is unrepentant and easily agitated. Keep your distance, lieutenant."]="We caught this beast slaughtering sheep in the countryside. He is unrepentant and easily agitated. Keep your distance, lieutenant."
G["We celebrate his bravery with statue and song, but if you were actually there on the beach that very day - well, I'm sure he looked quite silly, indeed."]="Nós celebramos sua coragem com estátua e canções, mas se você estivesse na praia no dia em que ele partiu... bem, tenho certeza de que ele parecia bem ridículo, de fato."
G["We choose vengeance!"]="We choose vengeance!"
G["We chose to leave the protection and comfort of the Depths to exploit... er, I mean... hrm, yes that's right, EXPLORE the world."]="Optamos por deixar a proteção e o conforto das Profundezas para explorar... er, quero dizer... hum, sim, isso mesmo, EXPLORE o mundo."
G["We claim your lands for our own!"]="We claim your lands for our own!"
G["We come destroy puny ones!"]="We come destroy puny ones!"
G["We come for you! Prepare yourself!"]="Vamos por você! Prepare-se!"
G["We come from below! You can never stop us!"]="We come from below! You can never stop us!"
G["We command the arcane! It shall not be used against us!"]="Mandamos sobre o Arcano! Não é possível usar contra nós!"
G["We command the power of the elements. Storm, Earth and Fire!  I'd never dress like an oversized chicken and shoot moon beams from the sky."]="We command the power of the elements. Storm, Earth and Fire!  I'd never dress like an oversized chicken and shoot moon beams from the sky."
G["We compete not only for glory, but to bring honor to our ancestors and to our people."]="Competimos não apenas pela glória, mas para trazer honra aos nossos antepassados ​​e ao nosso povo."
G["We control World Pillar!"]="Controlamos o Pilar do Mundo!"
G["We control access to the Exodar's storage facilities. Are there goods you wish to store or remove?"]="Controlamos o acesso às instalações de armazenamento da Exodar. Existem produtos que você deseja armazenar ou remover?"
G["We control the ebb and flow of time!  The Infinite Dragonflight cannot be defeated!"]="Controlamos o ir e vir do tempo! É possível derrotar ao Voo Infinito!"
G["We control the sand, the seas, the winds..."]="Controlamos as arenas, os mares, os ventos..."
G["We control the timeways now!"]="Nós controlamos os portais do tempo agora!"
G["We could certainly use another cook around Dolanaar, not that Zarrin's cooking is lacking mind you.  Why don't you go see what he can teach you?"]="Certamente poderíamos usar outro cozinheiro em torno de Dolanaar, não que a comida de Zarrin esteja faltando na sua mente. Por que você não vai ver o que ele pode lhe ensinar?"
G["We could go on fighting like this forever.  What is it you truly want?"]="Poderíamos seguir lutando eternamente. Que é o que que de verdade?"
G["We could go on fighting like this forever. What is it you truly want?"]="Poderíamos seguir lutando eternamente. Que é o que que de verdade?"
G["We could have been civil about this, but no!"]="We could have been civil about this, but no!"
G["We could have had so much fun!"]="We could have had so much fun!"
G["We could have, had we been given any warning. You threw my people to the wolves."]="We could have, had we been given any warning. You threw my people to the wolves."
G["We could probably use these parts."]="We could probably use these parts."
G["We could use a $c. Glad to see my husband sent you along.\nI'm a scout, not much for face-to-face combat. And Lao-chen here... well, normally he's a fighter, but he's still exhausted from the last battle.\nAnd, he's too busy cooking up some scheme."]="We could use a $c. Glad to see my husband sent you along.\nI'm a scout, not much for face-to-face combat. And Lao-chen here... well, normally he's a fighter, but he's still exhausted from the last battle.\nAnd, he's too busy cooking up some scheme."
G["We could use a healer."]="Nós poderíamos usar um curandeiro."
G["We could use some more of those beautiful striped melons!"]="We could use some more of those beautiful striped melons!"
G["We couldn't have done it without you, $g sir:ma'am;."]="We couldn't have done it without you, $g sir:ma'am;."
G["We couldn't have done this without you, $p.  Thank you."]="We couldn't have done this without you, $p.  Thank you."
G["We cried out in agony as our families were cut down before our eyes."]="We cried out in agony as our families were cut down before our eyes."
G["We crush you!"]="Nós esmaga você!"
G["We crushed your Alliance in Southern Barrens. We will crush you here. And Pandaria will tremble!"]="Aplastamos ao seu Aliança nos Sertões do Sul e a aplastaremos aqui. Pandaria temblará!"
G["We defeated the Destroyer!"]="Temos derrotou ao Destruidor!"
G["We defeated the sea monster!"]="Temos derrotado ao monstro marinho!"
G["We defend. We stand. We show that as one. United. We destroy. Their god will fall."]="We defend. We stand. We show that as one. United. We destroy. Their god will fall."
G["We demand answers!"]="Queremos respostas!"
G["We did it boys!  Now back to the Grim Guzzler and we'll drink to the $3096W that were injuredl!"]="O logramos pessoal! Agora voltemos a Tragapenas e bebamos pelos $3096W que foram feridos!"
G["We did it boys!  Now back to the Grim Guzzler and we'll drink to the $3151W that were injuredl!"]="O logramos pessoal! Agora voltemos a Tragapenas e bebamos pelos $3151W que foram feridos!"
G["We did it men, we saved The Barnacle! Finally, a moment of rest since we entered this forsaken mist. Turn the sails, men. We're goin' home!"]="We did it men, we saved The Barnacle! Finally, a moment of rest since we entered this forsaken mist. Turn the sails, men. We're goin' home!"
G["We did it!"]="O conseguimos!"
G["We did it!  We survived another trip with our ship intact!  But that's no reason to slack off!  Push her hard until we dock!"]="We did it!  We survived another trip with our ship intact!  But that's no reason to slack off!  Push her hard until we dock!"
G["We did it! Can you believe what we're hearing? This is incredible!"]="Conseguimos! Você pode acreditar no que estamos ouvindo? Isto é incrível!"
G["We did it! Cover the roads and keep this place locked down."]="We did it! Cover the roads and keep this place locked down."
G["We did it! Let's fire this masterpiece up..."]="O logramos! Vamos arrancar esta obra mestra..."
G["We did it! That'll learn those Dragonmaw to try an' ambush a Wildhammer."]="We did it! That'll learn those Dragonmaw to try an' ambush a Wildhammer."
G["We did it! The Maiden's Dagger is mine, all mine!"]="We did it! The Maiden's Dagger is mine, all mine!"
G["We did it! The trail should be clear from here on."]="O conseguimos! A partir de agorao caminho deveria estar abriu."
G["We did it! We've defeated Tethyr!"]="O temos conseguido! Temos derrotado a Tethyr!"
G["We did it, $p! That was some good butt-punchin' back there!"]="We did it, $p! That was some good butt-punchin' back there!"
G["We did it, father..."]="O logramos, pai..."
G["We did it, lads! We got here before Algalon's arrival. Maybe we can rig the systems to interfere with his analysis--"]="O temos conseguido, pessoal! Chegamos antes da chegada de Algalon. Igual podemos entrar no sistema e interferir seus análise…"
G["We did it, lads! We got here before Algalon's arrival... maybe we can rig the systems to interfere with his analysis..."]="O temos conseguido, pessoal! Chegamos antes da chegada de Algalon. Igual podemos entrar no sistema e interferir seus análise…"
G["We did not stand a chance. As my brethren perished around me, I managed to retreat here and bar the entrance."]="We did not stand a chance. As my brethren perished around me, I managed to retreat here and bar the entrance."
G["We did this for about six months and watched as the house went through horrifying changes. Foul monsters roamed through the manor at will. Dark cultists populated every inch with various paraphernalia relating to rituals and sacrifices. We knew that we could not hide much longer.\n\nAs expected, we were found and captured. They stripped us of all our clothes and laid us out inside a circle of blood. We sat there for days, naked and terrified."]="We did this for about six months and watched as the house went through horrifying changes. Foul monsters roamed through the manor at will. Dark cultists populated every inch with various paraphernalia relating to rituals and sacrifices. We knew that we could not hide much longer.\n\nAs expected, we were found and captured. They stripped us of all our clothes and laid us out inside a circle of blood. We sat there for days, naked and terrified."
G["We did well here."]="Temos feito bem aqui."
G["We didn't bring the war to the Horde, the Horde brought the war to us."]="Nós não trouxemos a guerra para a Horda, a Horda trouxe a guerra para nós."
G["We didn't hide this stuff just you could steal it!"]="We didn't hide this stuff just you could steal it!"
G["We didn't know th-"]="Não sabíam..."
G["We didn't see it coming..."]="We didn't see it coming..."
G["We didn't want to do this!"]="Não queríamos fazer isto!"
G["We discovered these proto-drakes at the Bronze Dragonshrine in the Dragonblight. We knew at once that they were kin - our blood from ages past.\n\nMy apologies, $c. You are probably confused. I am Penumbrius of the bronze dragonflight. I have taken this form out of convenience. It is much easier to communicate and live amongst mortals while in the mortal guise.\n\nHow can I help you?"]="We discovered these proto-drakes at the Bronze Dragonshrine in the Dragonblight. We knew at once that they were kin - our blood from ages past.\n\nMy apologies, $c. You are probably confused. I am Penumbrius of the bronze dragonflight. I have taken this form out of convenience. It is much easier to communicate and live amongst mortals while in the mortal guise.\n\nHow can I help you?"
G["We discovered this crystal and tablets in a Titan archive. I used the crystal to buy some time, but they're still following me!"]="We discovered this crystal and tablets in a Titan archive. I used the crystal to buy some time, but they're still following me!"
G["We discussed the merits of your High King. I have been observing him closely."]="Falamos sobre os méritos do seu Alto-rei. Eu o tenho observado com atenção."
G["We dispatched a force of knights to capture a pair of Arthas' Scourge lieutenants to serve as the next challenge of the trial. The knights have not returned with their prey yet, so the next phase of the trial is on hold. Check back next week."]="Temos enviada uma tropa de cavaleiros a capturar aos tenentes do Flagelo de Arthas para que sejam o seguinte desafio da Prova. Os cavaleiros ainda não têm retornado com o seu presa, assim que a seguinte fase da Prova está congelada. Volta a semana que vem."
G["We do not act alone in this. Whatever happens to us this day, the night elves will still fall!"]="We do not act alone in this. Whatever happens to us this day, the night elves will still fall!"
G["We do not ask the elements for aid..."]="Não pedimos ajuda aos elementos."
G["We do not choose to go to war, $n.  War comes to us.\n\nWe must do what we must to be ready."]="We do not choose to go to war, $n.  War comes to us.\n\nWe must do what we must to be ready."
G["We do not fear you!"]="Não os temos medo!"
G["We do not fear you, child of iron!"]="Não os tememos, filhos do ferro!"
G["We do not have much time, hero. What do you need?"]="Não temos muito tempo, herói. O que você precisa?"
G["We do not know if the Caverns of Time have always been accessible to mortals. Truly, it is impossible to tell as the Timeless One is in perpetual motion, changing our timeways as he sees fit. What you see now may very well not exist tomorrow. You may wake up yesterday and have no memory of this place."]="We do not know if the Caverns of Time have always been accessible to mortals. Truly, it is impossible to tell as the Timeless One is in perpetual motion, changing our timeways as he sees fit. What you see now may very well not exist tomorrow. You may wake up yesterday and have no memory of this place."
G["We do not know! That is precisely why I am here."]="Não o sabemos! Precisamente por isso estou aqui."
G["We do not know.\n\nThe Dark Irons that did survive made their way into the mountain and began rebuilding their city.\n\nFrom the ashes of Thaurissan then rose Blackrock Spire and the new Dark Iron nation. Additional fortifications were made within the Searing Gorge, in the area known as the Cauldron.\n\nStories of an ancient evil that controlled the kingdom of Dark Irons began to circulate."]="We do not know.\n\nThe Dark Irons that did survive made their way into the mountain and began rebuilding their city.\n\nFrom the ashes of Thaurissan then rose Blackrock Spire and the new Dark Iron nation. Additional fortifications were made within the Searing Gorge, in the area known as the Cauldron.\n\nStories of an ancient evil that controlled the kingdom of Dark Irons began to circulate."
G["We do not know. We believe that the Black Dragonflight is involved as are some independent third parties. That is why you are here, $r. You will unravel this mystery from the inside and bring redemption to Netherwing.\n\nAnd now... I can only assume she asked you to bring back my hand."]="We do not know. We believe that the Black Dragonflight is involved as are some independent third parties. That is why you are here, $r. You will unravel this mystery from the inside and bring redemption to Netherwing.\n\nAnd now... I can only assume she asked you to bring back my hand."
G["We do not need help from the lesser races! Dispose of it!"]="We do not need help from the lesser races! Dispose of it!"
G["We do not need your kind here."]="Não precisamos de a gente do seu calanha aqui."
G["We do not often have troubles with predators up here. Sometimes when it rains the saurok come out. But that is only when there is a lightning storm."]="Não solemos ter problemas com os predadores por aqui. Algumas vezes, quando lhueve, os saurok saem. Mas isso somente é quando há uma tempestade com relâmpagos."
G["We do not wish to be disturbed!"]="Não queremos que se nos moleste!"
G["We do not wish to enter your conflict. But I fear that when war is on the horizon, peace is not a choice."]="Não queremos formar parte do seu conflito, mas me temo que quando a guerra está no horizonte, a paz não é uma opção."
G["We do not yet have the strength to push forward into the Firelands. First, we must rebuild our forces and supplies. Will you lend yourself to our efforts?"]="Ainda não temos forças para avançar para as Terras do Fogo. Primeiro, devemos reconstruir nossas forças e suprimentos. Você se presta a nossos esforços?"
G["We do our best here to heal the broken earth. It was difficult enough before we started getting raided at night."]="Nós fazemos o nosso melhor aqui para curar a terra quebrada. Já era bastante difícil antes de começarmos a invadir a noite."
G["We do wish for you to stand down, your Highness."]="Desejamos que você se afaste, Alteza."
G["We doins Hozen activities!"]="Aí está! Aí está!"
G["We don't deal with those kinds of people here! This auction house only lists honestly-acquired merchandise."]="We don't deal with those kinds of people here! This auction house only lists honestly-acquired merchandise."
G["We don't die that easily, sea-witch!"]="We don't die that easily, sea-witch!"
G["We don't get many visitors out here. May I interest you in something?"]="Não temos muitos visitantes por aqui. Posso lhe interessar em alguma coisa?"
G["We don't have a bank here in Brill, you'll have to go to the Undercity for that.  At the back of the Ruins of Lordaeron to the south are elevators that will take you down into the Undercity.  Once there, ask one of the Undercity Guardians for more precise directions."]="Nós não temos um banco aqui em Brill, você terá que ir à Cidade Baixa para isso. Na parte de por trás das ruínas de Lordaeron, ao sul, há elevadores que o levarão à cidade subterrânea. Uma vez lá, peça a um dos Guardiões da Cidade Baixa instruções mais precisas."
G["We don't have a choice! We need to alert the other villages of what's going on here!"]="We don't have a choice! We need to alert the other villages of what's going on here!"
G["We don't have all night. Hurry it up already!"]="We don't have all night. Hurry it up already!"
G["We don't have any easy path before us. If you've got a strong arm on you, stick around until one of my squads is ready to ascend to Ymirheim. They could use all the help they can get."]="Não temos nenhum caminho fácil diante de nós. Se você tem um braço forte, fique por perto até que um dos meus esquadrões esteja pronto para subir a Ymirheim. Eles poderiam usar toda a ajuda que conseguirem."
G["We don't have many supplies for rebuilding.  It will take a lot more before Dun Baldar will be repaired."]="We don't have many supplies for rebuilding.  It will take a lot more before Dun Baldar will be repaired."
G["We don't have time to talk!  We have to think about those trolls!"]="Não temos tempo para conversar! Temos que pensar sobre esses trolls!"
G["We don't know much about the burning of the Shady Rest Inn, except that James Hyal's wife and child were unable to escape.\n\nWe managed to drag James out, but he hasn't been the same since.\n\nWe have many leads but not much evidence. It is our hope that through the efforts of the guard and the vigilant help of the people of Theramore, we will unravel this terrible crime.\n\nIf you would like to lend assistance to the investigation, what remains of the inn can be found at the border to the Barrens."]="We don't know much about the burning of the Shady Rest Inn, except that James Hyal's wife and child were unable to escape.\n\nWe managed to drag James out, but he hasn't been the same since.\n\nWe have many leads but not much evidence. It is our hope that through the efforts of the guard and the vigilant help of the people of Theramore, we will unravel this terrible crime.\n\nIf you would like to lend assistance to the investigation, what remains of the inn can be found at the border to the Barrens."
G["We don't let just any riffraff off the street in here!"]="We don't let just any riffraff off the street in here!"
G["We don't live our lives as quickly as you do, my mushy friend. A healthy giant eats three square meals a decade, although I am known to indulge in a snack every couple of years. We'll go to the bathroom every 15 to 25 years... barring any tummy trouble."]="Nós não vivemos nossas vidas tão rapidamente quanto você, meu amigo piegas. Um gigantesco saudável come três refeições quadradas por década, embora eu seja conhecido por fazer um lanche a cada dois anos. Iremos ao banheiro a cada 15 a 25 anos... exceto qualquer problema de barriga."
G["We don't need to tell Omnuron about this."]="Não há por que contarle isto a Omnuron."
G["We don't need your healing skills."]="We don't need your healing skills."
G["We don't see very many new faces here anymore."]="We don't see very many new faces here anymore."
G["We don't shoe no mules here. 'Sides, it's strictly expedition business right now."]="We don't shoe no mules here. 'Sides, it's strictly expedition business right now."
G["We don't stand a chance if we face the hozen alone. We will need the help of the Alliance if our tribe is to survive."]="We don't stand a chance if we face the hozen alone. We will need the help of the Alliance if our tribe is to survive."
G["We don't stand a chance..."]="Nós não temos a mínima chance..."
G["We don't take kindly to miscreants, $r."]="We don't take kindly to miscreants, $r."
G["We don't want any trouble. Just keep our path clear and everything will be fine. Nobody needs to get hurt. Especially me!"]="We don't want any trouble. Just keep our path clear and everything will be fine. Nobody needs to get hurt. Especially me!"
G["We drink for the Horde!  Do you drink for the Horde?  Come show us at Drohn's Distillery!"]="Bebemos pela Horda! Você bebes pela Horda? Venha a demostrárnoslo ao posto da Destilaria de Drohn!"
G["We drove back the sha, your kind will fall before us as well."]="We drove back the sha, your kind will fall before us as well."
G["We dwarves have a connection to the earth.  We can feel her pain.  And right now the earth is crying out.  These earthquakes... they are both natural and not.  I wanted to gather you all together and discuss them."]="We dwarves have a connection to the earth.  We can feel her pain.  And right now the earth is crying out.  These earthquakes... they are both natural and not.  I wanted to gather you all together and discuss them."
G["We embark soon for distant shores, to hurl ourselves at the enemy homeland."]="We embark soon for distant shores, to hurl ourselves at the enemy homeland."
G["We end this now!"]="Acabamos com isto agora!"
G["We face an enemy we cannot kill through traditional means. The Lich King's plague is a force that no healer within our ranks has been able to deter. The Forsaken and their alchemists are the only hope we have, much to my disgust.\n\nIf we live through this, I promise you that the Horde will go to Northrend and bring the Lich King and his armies to their knees!"]="We face an enemy we cannot kill through traditional means. The Lich King's plague is a force that no healer within our ranks has been able to deter. The Forsaken and their alchemists are the only hope we have, much to my disgust.\n\nIf we live through this, I promise you that the Horde will go to Northrend and bring the Lich King and his armies to their knees!"
G["We fear not the brilliance of the tan-chao - we know it is a path home. The bridge between earth and sky."]="Não tememos o brilho do Tão-Chao. Sabemos que é o caminho a casa. É o ponte entre a terra e o céu."
G["We fear not the darkness of this world - we know it is but shadow, cast by the glorious world beyond."]="We fear not the darkness of this world - we know it is but shadow, cast by the glorious world beyond."
G["We feel it best to position them here, where they might come to terms with their impending fate."]="We feel it best to position them here, where they might come to terms with their impending fate."
G["We feel nothing. Our souls remain here, in limbo. We are unable to leave until our remains are found and spirits laid to rest."]="Não sentimos nada. Nossas almas permanecem aqui, no limbo. Não podemos sair até que nossos restos sejam encontrados e os espíritos descansem."
G["We feel that the Ethereum are as great a threat to our existence as Dimensius. Both must be stopped..."]="Sentimos que o Ethereum é uma ameaça tão grande à nossa existência quanto Dimensius. Ambos devem ser parados..."
G["We few, we happy few, we band of brothers and sisters.  For those today that shed their blood with me, Shall be my kin; be they never so vile, This day shall gentle their conditions."]="Por nós, esses poucos afortunados, irmãs e irmãos. pelos que hoje têm derramado seu sangue comigo, pelos meus. Que este dia nos faça melhores."
G["We fight because we believe in what we fight for."]="We fight because we believe in what we fight for."
G["We fight for the glory of Brunnhildar!"]="Lutamos pela glória de Brunnhildar!"
G["We fight so that our children can live better lives than ours!"]="Lutamos para que nossos filhos levem uma vida melhor que a nossa!"
G["We fight so that sacrifices of our ancestors were not in vain!"]="We fight so that sacrifices of our ancestors were not in vain!"
G["We fight the mantid, yaungol, and mogu. Enemies face us from all sides.\nI'm here to make sure there are no surprises."]="We fight the mantid, yaungol, and mogu. Enemies face us from all sides.\nI'm here to make sure there are no surprises."
G["We fight to the death!"]="Lucharemos até a morte!"
G["We fight to the death, Phaoris!  Our race was created to guard this land.  We must not betray that legacy."]="Lucharemos até a morte, Phaoris! Nossa raça foi criada para guardados esta terra. Não devemos traicionar esse legado."
G["We fight together brethren!"]="Luchemos juntos, irmãos!"
G["We fight!"]="A gente luta!"
G["We fight! We push them back, just as we have always done!"]="Lutamos! Lhes fazemos recuar, como temos feito sempre!"
G["We fight, that others may live in peace."]="Lutamos para que outros possam viver em paz."
G["We fight, toil, and serve so that Her vision for us is made reality."]="Lutamos, trabalhamos e servimos para que Sua visão de nós se faça realidade."
G["We finally understood what the screams were from. The Butcher exposed us to pain that we did not know existed. He used us in countless experiments, attempting to devise a plague.\n\nThe days turned to weeks. We would have died on the first day had it not been for that cruel monster keeping us alive through magical means."]="We finally understood what the screams were from. The Butcher exposed us to pain that we did not know existed. He used us in countless experiments, attempting to devise a plague.\n\nThe days turned to weeks. We would have died on the first day had it not been for that cruel monster keeping us alive through magical means."
G["We find evil ones now!  Follow!"]="Nós encontrar aos maus! Seguir!"
G["We find you unworthy of ascension, Halfdan. Let your soul know oblivion!"]="We find you unworthy of ascension, Halfdan. Let your soul know oblivion!"
G["We finds evil one!  Quick!"]="Encontraremos ao ruim! Depressa!"
G["We finish this now, champions of Kirin Tor!"]="Acabemos isto agora, campeões do Kirin Tor!"
G["We fish, we sleep, and we explode things.  What could be better than that?"]="Nós pescamos, dormimos e explodimos as coisas. O que poderia ser melhor que isso?"
G["We followed Leza's visions of the light to this place like moths to a flame."]="We followed Leza's visions of the light to this place like moths to a flame."
G["We followed the sound of the water, and came upon this resplendent Vale.\n\nThe water of these pools is like none other that we have ever seen."]="Seguimos o som da água e chegamos a este reluzente vale.\n\nNunca havia visto um água como a de estas poços."
G["We fought back da Scourge. What chance joo thinkin' JOO got?"]="Nós lutamos contra o Flagelo. Que possibilidades acreditam que TÊM?"
G["We fought long and hard.  We had proven again and again that we ogres were a force to be reckoned with."]="Lutamos largo e tendido. Demostramos uma e outra vez que os ogros eramos uma força a ter em conta."
G["We fought well, but we should not push our luck."]="We fought well, but we should not push our luck."
G["We found a saddle and harness from one of the carcasses of the various beasts being shot out of the sky.\n\nA little polish and a little magic and presto... good as new!"]="We found a saddle and harness from one of the carcasses of the various beasts being shot out of the sky.\n\nA little polish and a little magic and presto... good as new!"
G["We found somethin' down there, somethin' HUGE, and all of a sudden the rocks started fightin' back and everyone went crazy. Bad business!"]="We found somethin' down there, somethin' HUGE, and all of a sudden the rocks started fightin' back and everyone went crazy. Bad business!"
G["We found this one cawing up a storm in Auchindoun. Give it up for Yikkan Izu!"]="We found this one cawing up a storm in Auchindoun. Give it up for Yikkan Izu!"
G["We found this one scuttling in circles in Silithus. From the looks of him, somebody mostly killed him already. It's Ixx!"]="A este o encontramos vagando em círculos por Silithus. Tem pinta de que alguém o tenha matou já. É Ixx!"
G["We found this one scuttling in circles in Silithus. Looks like somebody mostly killed him already. It's Ixx!"]="A este o encontramos vagando em círculos por Silithus. Tem pinta de que alguém o tenha matou já. É Ixx!"
G["We gather to determine the fate of our great flight."]="Nos reunimos para decidir o destino de nosso atribulado Voo."
G["We gave shinies to shrine... we not greedy... why this happen?"]="Nós entregar cositas brilhantes a santuário... nós não egoístas... por que passar isto?"
G["We gave up much to attain this foothold, and we must continue fighting to keep it. Although our defenses are weak, continued efforts to push forward will help us recruit stronger allies in the future.\n\nThe time for courage is now, champion."]="We gave up much to attain this foothold, and we must continue fighting to keep it. Although our defenses are weak, continued efforts to push forward will help us recruit stronger allies in the future.\n\nThe time for courage is now, champion."
G["We get tabard?"]="Nós conseguir tabardo?"
G["We glad, little $g brother : sister; $n here."]="Nós contentos de que $gpequeno irmão: pequena irmã; $n estar aqui."
G["We gnomes have a high metabolism, $p. Make sure we don't run outta food!"]="Os gnomos temos o metabolismo rápido, $p. Não deixe que nos quedemos sem comida!"
G["We go to scout out the sinkholes to the west, Chieftain."]="We go to scout out the sinkholes to the west, Chieftain."
G["We go!"]="Vamos!"
G["We going to break your spears! Don't cry about your spears puppy-men... don't cry about them being broken!"]="We going to break your spears! Don't cry about your spears puppy-men... don't cry about them being broken!"
G["We gonna Ook all night!"]="Nós fazem kraku toda a noite!"
G["We gonna be dancin' on ya grave tonight, mon!"]="Eh'ta noite bailare sobre seu tumba, tron!"
G["We gonna burry ya here."]="Te enterraremos aqui."
G["We gonna kill 'em all!"]="We gonna kill 'em all!"
G["We gonna put you in the Dooker Dome!"]="We gonna put you in the Dooker Dome!"
G["We gonna show you why treasure be a pirate's best friend!"]="We gonna show you why treasure be a pirate's best friend!"
G["We gonna' feed ya to the big one!"]="Será comida pa' o mandamás!"
G["We gork big dooker!"]="We gork big dooker!"
G["We got a yeti, ookers! You hear me! We got a yeti!"]="We got a yeti, ookers! You hear me! We got a yeti!"
G["We got another $c inbound!"]="We got another $c inbound!"
G["We got the door down and the barrier preventin' entry to the Plagueworks busted open! My gnomes are werkin' on gettin' the barrier to the Crimson Hall down. It'll be another $4939W days before that thing comes down.\n\nGet in there and take out some Scourge!"]="We got the door down and the barrier preventin' entry to the Plagueworks busted open! My gnomes are werkin' on gettin' the barrier to the Crimson Hall down. It'll be another $4939W days before that thing comes down.\n\nGet in there and take out some Scourge!"
G["We got the final barrier blockin' entry to Frostwing Halls down, $g lad:lass;. Only Sindragosa stands between the Lich King and divine retribution! What are ye waitin' for?!"]="We got the final barrier blockin' entry to Frostwing Halls down, $g lad:lass;. Only Sindragosa stands between the Lich King and divine retribution! What are ye waitin' for?!"
G["We got this."]="Tudo baixo controle."
G["We got work to do, $c. This forest isn't going to chop itself down!"]="Temos trabalho pendente, $c. Este florestas não se vai talar somente!"
G["We gots Hozen tendencies!"]="O makaku, o makaku!"
G["We gots da Hozen enemies!"]="Não pare, continua continua!"
G["We gots da Hozen friends!"]="Se a levou, se a levou!"
G["We gotta find the matriarch of this operation and end her!"]="Devemos encontrar à matriarca desta operação e acabar com ela!"
G["We gotta finish up here and get you to the dock before the Trade Prince leaves us all behind!"]="Temos que terminar aqui e levá-o ao cais antes que o Príncipe do Comércio nos deixe para por trás!"
G["We gotta warn the others!"]="Temos que avisar aos mais!"
G["We grooked!"]="We grooked!"
G["We grow better!  You bad!"]="Nós nos volvemos melhores! Você, pior!"
G["We grow strong, while our foes are surrounded by foes, and weakened by constant attacks."]="We grow strong, while our foes are surrounded by foes, and weakened by constant attacks."
G["We grunts were ordered to charge once more - into a wall of pikes - I could not do it, $c. My weapon slid from my hands and my legs did not move.\n\nI am dishonored."]="We grunts were ordered to charge once more - into a wall of pikes - I could not do it, $c. My weapon slid from my hands and my legs did not move.\n\nI am dishonored."
G["We guarded the waters. Too dangerous, too powerful, to fall into the wrong hands."]="We guarded the waters. Too dangerous, too powerful, to fall into the wrong hands."
G["We gunna drive all da scourge outta Zul'Drak, mon - startin' with you!"]="Vamos dar a toda o Flagelo de Zul'Drak, tron, começando por você!"
G["We had a name we called ourselves... what was it?"]="We had a name we called ourselves... what was it?"
G["We had no cooks to spare, but it is a bit odd... there are some delectable scents on the south wind. Follow your nose, eh?"]="Não tínhamos cozinheiros de sobra, mas é um pouco estranho... existem algum aromas deliciosos no vento sul. Continue seu nariz, hein?"
G["We had them in our sights... the Horde ships... then out of nowhere, tentacles reached up and seized our ship... broke it right in two!\n\nThe survivors... we were captured by naga as soon as we hit the water.\n\nThat was nearly a week ago."]="We had them in our sights... the Horde ships... then out of nowhere, tentacles reached up and seized our ship... broke it right in two!\n\nThe survivors... we were captured by naga as soon as we hit the water.\n\nThat was nearly a week ago."
G["We had them!\n\nWretched Alliance ships... we could've cut a path to Stormwind and put an end to them!\n\n...But out of nowhere, gigantic tentacles reached up and seized our ship... broke it right in two!\n\nThe survivors... we were captured by naga as soon as we hit the water."]="We had them!\n\nWretched Alliance ships... we could've cut a path to Stormwind and put an end to them!\n\n...But out of nowhere, gigantic tentacles reached up and seized our ship... broke it right in two!\n\nThe survivors... we were captured by naga as soon as we hit the water."
G["We had traveled north through the forest for several hours."]="We had traveled north through the forest for several hours."
G["We happily drink in your blue blood, draenei. Nothing gives us more pleasure than to wound you just to see the blood flow."]="We happily drink in your blue blood, draenei. Nothing gives us more pleasure than to wound you just to see the blood flow."
G["We have a battle to win!"]="Temos uma batalha que ganhar!"
G["We have a dozen more dishes to finish today!  Get a move on!"]="We have a dozen more dishes to finish today!  Get a move on!"
G["We have a large store of supplies to rebuild Frostwolf Keep.  Just a little bit more and we'll have enough to repair and reenter the battle!"]="Temos uma grande quantidade de suprimentos para reconstruir o Bastião Lobo Gelo. Com algum mais, teremos suficientes para reparar e voltar a entrar na batalha."
G["We have a lot of excess supplies, but we still need more before we can send an assualt into the Field of Strife."]="Temos muito suprimento em excesso, mas ainda precisamos de de mais antes de podermos enviar um assalariado para o campo de conflito."
G["We have a lot of supplies, but we still need a lot more in order to send a ground assault into the Field of Strife."]="Temos muitos suprimentos, mas ainda precisamos de de muito mais para enviar um ataque terrestre ao Campo de Conflito."
G["We have a lot of visitors from all over Pandaria, surely they can help us with these raiders."]="We have a lot of visitors from all over Pandaria, surely they can help us with these raiders."
G["We have a medium store of supplies for rebuilding, but we still need a lot more before Frostwolf Keep can be fully repaired."]="Temos uma quantidade de suprimentos média para reconstruir, mas precisamos de muitos mais antes de poder reparar o Bastião Lobo Gelo completamente."
G["We have a right to this land, same as you!"]="Temos o mesmo direito a esta terra que vocês!"
G["We have a situation on our hands. Help defend our allies!"]="Temos um problema. Ayúdanos a defenda a nossos aliados!"
G["We have a special guest today: the always-endearing, ever-resilient, Millhouse Manastorm! Good luck, MillMan!"]="Hoje temos um convidou especial: o adorável, o resistente... Millhouse Tempestade de Mana! Boa sorte!"
G["We have a traitor within our walls.  Someone who is well connected."]="Há um traidor entre nossos muros. Alguém que está bem conectado."
G["We have a very small store of supplies to rebuild Frostwolf Keep.  It's going to take a lot more before we can repair and reenter the battle."]="Temos uma quantidade de suprimentos muito pequena para reconstruir o Bastião Lobo Gelo. Vamos precisar muitos mais para poder reparar e voltar a entrar na batalha."
G["We have a winner!  $n has won FIRST PLACE in the tournament!"]="We have a winner!  $n has won FIRST PLACE in the tournament!"
G["We have a winner!  $n has won SECOND PLACE in the tournament!"]="We have a winner!  $n has won SECOND PLACE in the tournament!"
G["We have a winner!  $n has won THIRD PLACE in the tournament!"]="We have a winner!  $n has won THIRD PLACE in the tournament!"
G["We have all been witness to a terrible tragedy. The blood of good men has been shed upon this soil! Honorable knights, slain defending their lives -- our lives!"]="We have all been witness to a terrible tragedy. The blood of good men has been shed upon this soil! Honorable knights, slain defending their lives -- our lives!"
G["We have all been witness to terrible tragedies, but we must not let them drag us to despair.\n\nInstead, hold those memories close so that one day, we might find a reckoning."]="We have all been witness to terrible tragedies, but we must not let them drag us to despair.\n\nInstead, hold those memories close so that one day, we might find a reckoning."
G["We have all the copper bars that we need. Thank you for your assistance, $c. You might wanna help out with the other materials being collected here."]="Temos todas as barras de cobre que precisamos de. Obrigado pela sua ajuda, $c. Talvez queira dar uma mão na pegue do resto de materiais."
G["We have all the time in the world...."]="Temos tudo o tempo do mundo..."
G["We have all three of the relics, but my energy is rapidly fading. We must make our way back to Dreamwarden Lurosa! He will let you know what to do next."]="We have all three of the relics, but my energy is rapidly fading. We must make our way back to Dreamwarden Lurosa! He will let you know what to do next."
G["We have almost all the silithyst we need!  Don't stop now!"]="Quase temos toda a silitista que precisamos de. Não devemos aparar!"
G["We have almost all the silithyst we need!  For the Horde!"]="Temos quase toda a silitista que precisamos de. pela Horda!"
G["We have an abundance of mailboxes in our fair city. The one by the Royal Exchange Bank should certainly fit your needs."]="Temos uma abundância de caixas de correio em nossa cidade justa. O do Royal Exchange Bank certamente deve atender às suas necessidades."
G["We have arrived, $n. Does he still live?"]="Temos chegado, $n. Ainda vive?"
G["We have auction house in central ring."]="Temos casa de leilões no anel central."
G["We have barely any supplies.  If we want to send a ground assault into the Field of Strife, then we'll need a lot more!"]="Quase não temos suprimentos. Se quisermos enviar um ataque terrestre ao campo de luta, precisaremos de muito mais!"
G["We have barrels of fireworks all over the town for the festival celebrations, $n. Place a few of them in the right locations and give them a good wack and they would cause all kinds of destruction. Grab a barrel and I'll mark the locations we should place them."]="We have barrels of fireworks all over the town for the festival celebrations, $n. Place a few of them in the right locations and give them a good wack and they would cause all kinds of destruction. Grab a barrel and I'll mark the locations we should place them."
G["We have been betrayed!"]="Nos têm traído!"
G["We have been sent here from Darnassus to aid the Stormpike in their time of need."]="Fomos enviados para cá de Darnassus para ajudar os Stormpike nos seus momentos de necessidade."
G["We have been taught not to trust strangers, $c."]="We have been taught not to trust strangers, $c."
G["We have been tending these worms for some time. I hope they will be fit in time for the ring event of this organization. You must face not one, but two jormungar, after all."]="Estamos cuidando desses vermes há algum tempo. Espero que eles estejam aptos a tempo para o evento do anel desta organização. Você deve enfrentar não um, mas dois jormungar, afinal."
G["We have been through worse and survived, Leoric. Do not forget Hyjal..."]="We have been through worse and survived, Leoric. Do not forget Hyjal..."
G["We have begun to turn the Scourge's plague against them, but our hold is tenuous at best!  Be sure to aid the cause by subverting their cauldrons!"]="Começamos a lançar o Flagelo do Flagelo contra eles, mas nosso domínio é tênue, na melhor das hipóteses! Certifique-se de ajudar a causa subvertendo seus caldeirões!"
G["We have breached the inner sanctum, heroes! We press on!"]="We have breached the inner sanctum, heroes! We press on!"
G["We have but to evacuate the workers and the rest of our warriors."]="Precisamos evacuar os trabalhadores e o resto dos guerreiros."
G["We have carriages at the ready, we're just waiting for King Greymane's word."]="Os carros estão prontos, estamos esperando a ordem do rei Greymane."
G["We have come to compete for honor, renown, and the right to fight the Scourge alongside the brothers of the Argent Crusade."]="Viemos competir por honra, renome e pelo direito de combater o Flagelo ao lado dos irmãos da Cruzada Argentina."
G["We have come to help battle the dirge of Karabor!"]="Temos vindo a ajudar na luta contra o dirge de Karabor!"
G["We have confirmed the Horde presence at Dragonmaw Port, master. They are now in league."]="We have confirmed the Horde presence at Dragonmaw Port, master. They are now in league."
G["We have disturbed what should not have been disturbed. He cannot be free to escape this prison! You must destroy him!"]="We have disturbed what should not have been disturbed. He cannot be free to escape this prison! You must destroy him!"
G["We have done it!"]="O temos conseguido!"
G["We have done it!  Un'Goro is cleansed."]="O temos conseguido! Temos purificou Um'goro."
G["We have done it! Thrall would be proud."]="O temos conseguido! Thrall estaria orgulhoso."
G["We have done it, hero! We have the blessings of the celestials, and we have completed their challenge."]="We have done it, hero! We have the blessings of the celestials, and we have completed their challenge."
G["We have endured loss, trechery, and long nights without answers… yet still the moon rises. So too must we."]="We have endured loss, trechery, and long nights without answers… yet still the moon rises. So too must we."
G["We have endured the Usurpers, their children, the loss of the Old One, and soon... you."]="We have endured the Usurpers, their children, the loss of the Old One, and soon... you."
G["We have enough supplies to launch a ground assault.  If you want to deliver those orders, and you think you qualify, then speak with Corporal Noreg Stormpike."]="Temos suficientes suprimentos para lançar um ataque terrestre. Se que dar a ordem e acha que pode fazer isso, fala com o cabo Noreg Pico Tempestade."
G["We have enough supplies to launch a ground assault.  If you want to send the order, and you think you qualify, then speak Sergeant Yazra Bloodsnarl."]="Temos suficientes suprimentos para lançar um ataque terrestre. Se que dar a ordem e acha que pode fazer isso, fala com o sargento Yazra Grunhido Sangrenta."
G["We have enough supplies!  Our captain has retaken position in the Field of Strife!"]="Já temos suficientes suprimentos! Nosso capitão tem retomado seu posição na Terra de Disputa."
G["We have entered a dangerous place my luckydo. In this the saurok have grown very angry and attack all boats that pass through. We must be on our guard."]="We have entered a dangerous place my luckydo. In this the saurok have grown very angry and attack all boats that pass through. We must be on our guard."
G["We have excess supplies, but not many.  We'll need a lot more before we can send a ground assault into the Field of Strife."]="Temos excesso de suprimentos, mas não muitos. Precisamos de muito mais antes de podermos enviar um ataque terrestre ao Campo de Conflito."
G["We have failed."]="Temos fracassado."
G["We have gained control of the armory, but our work on the island is not yet finished."]="Nós ganhamos o controle do arsenal, mas nosso trabalho na ilha ainda não terminou."
G["We have gathered a lot of supplies for rebuilding, but we still need a lot more in order to repair Dun Baldar.  Keep bringing me supplies!"]="We have gathered a lot of supplies for rebuilding, but we still need a lot more in order to repair Dun Baldar.  Keep bringing me supplies!"
G["We have gathered enough hides from the wolves. Soon, the cavalry will be ready to ride! Speak to me again when we have stabled enough rams."]="We have gathered enough hides from the wolves. Soon, the cavalry will be ready to ride! Speak to me again when we have stabled enough rams."
G["We have got to disable more of their defenses or we will never be able to get in! Loop around again."]="We have got to disable more of their defenses or we will never be able to get in! Loop around again."
G["We have half of our needed silithyst.  We can do it!"]="We have half of our needed silithyst.  We can do it!"
G["We have half our needed silithyst.  Don't stop now!"]="We have half our needed silithyst.  Don't stop now!"
G["We have heard reports of mogu infiltrating this valley. They will not get beyond us."]="We have heard reports of mogu infiltrating this valley. They will not get beyond us."
G["We have heard your requests, and we agree... it is noble in intent. We will purify your waters. Go with our blessing, shaman."]="Temos ouvido seus petições e estamos de acordo... é um noble propósito. Purificaremos seus águas. Márchate com nossa bênção, xamã."
G["We have known nothing but peace for so long, I don't know how anyone is going to handle the arrival of war on our shores."]="We have known nothing but peace for so long, I don't know how anyone is going to handle the arrival of war on our shores."
G["We have labored long and hard for our lord Deathwing. Let us give our all in his name that we will bask in his flames at the end of days!"]="We have labored long and hard for our lord Deathwing. Let us give our all in his name that we will bask in his flames at the end of days!"
G["We have little to discuss, $c. Perhaps you should seek other, more like-minded individuals."]="We have little to discuss, $c. Perhaps you should seek other, more like-minded individuals."
G["We have lived on the bounty of the sea. We have grown fat on the meat of the antlered ones."]="Temos vivido das recompensas do mar. Temos engordado com a carne dos que têm cornamenta."
G["We have lived on this lake for thousands of years. The waters here flow down from the ancient pools of Pandaria."]="We have lived on this lake for thousands of years. The waters here flow down from the ancient pools of Pandaria."
G["We have lost Thalanaar, but not by much. We were the fortunate ones to be only at the very edge of the flooding. I cannot begin to imagine how many lives were lost. Please send as much help as you can to New Thalanaar."]="Temos perdido Thalanaar, mas não por muito. Temos tido a sorte de estar no borda da inundação. Não posso nem imaginar quantas vidas se perderam. Por favor, envia toda a ajuda que possa a Nova Thalanaar."
G["We have lost our engineers, this will not end well!"]="Temos perdido a nossos engenheiros, isto não acabará bem!"
G["We have lost so many brothers in battle, I no longer wish to keep count."]="Temos perdido a tantos irmãos na batalha que já não quero levar a conta."
G["We have lost so much, Warchief. Our families, dead. Our friends, lost. Our homeland, gone. How much more must our people suffer?"]="We have lost so much, Warchief. Our families, dead. Our friends, lost. Our homeland, gone. How much more must our people suffer?"
G["We have lots of supplies for rebuilding.  Just a little bit more and we'll have enough to repair Dun Baldar and reenter the battle!"]="Temos muitos suprimentos para reconstruir. Com algum mais, teremos suficientes para reparar Dun Baldar e voltar a entrar na batalha."
G["We have managed to defend this point, and much of it is thanks to you.\n\nYou have managed to recruit a valuable ally to our ranks, however, the enemy continues to assail us without relent.\n\nWe must hold our ground or lose what we have fought so hard to gain."]="We have managed to defend this point, and much of it is thanks to you.\n\nYou have managed to recruit a valuable ally to our ranks, however, the enemy continues to assail us without relent.\n\nWe must hold our ground or lose what we have fought so hard to gain."
G["We have men in that wreckage! Get more men out there recovering the wounded."]="We have men in that wreckage! Get more men out there recovering the wounded."
G["We have more than one enemy in Silithus, $n.\n\nWhile everyone's attention is focused on the silithid, my big brother and I have been keeping a close eye on the Twilight's Hammer crazies."]="We have more than one enemy in Silithus, $n.\n\nWhile everyone's attention is focused on the silithid, my big brother and I have been keeping a close eye on the Twilight's Hammer crazies."
G["We have much in common, night elf. I can't help but feel that perhaps it was fate that brought us together. Let me help you, Cowlen. Let my people help. We will right the wrongs. This I vow."]="Temos muito em comum, elfo noturno. Não posso deixar de sentir que talvez tenha sido o mas sim nos uniu. Deixe-me ajudá-o, Cowlen. Deixe meu povo ajudar. Vamos corrigir os erros. Eu juro."
G["We have much to do and very little time to do it if we're to assist the Freewind Post tauren and push the Grimtotem back.\n\nTor ilisar'thera'nal! Let our enemies beware!"]="Se queremos ajudar aos tauren da Aldeia Vento Livre e recusar aos Totem Sinistro, temos muito por fazer e muito pouco tempo para fazer isso.\n\nTor ilisar'thera'nal! Que tiemblen nossos inimigos!"
G["We have need of your explosives. I'll take pleasure in killing you for them."]="We have need of your explosives. I'll take pleasure in killing you for them."
G["We have no choice.  If we fail to honor the presence of the Horde, then surely they will crush us from nearby Stonard!  I'm afraid that not even you and your friends would be able to stop them."]="We have no choice.  If we fail to honor the presence of the Horde, then surely they will crush us from nearby Stonard!  I'm afraid that not even you and your friends would be able to stop them."
G["We have no choice.  We must have faith in our allies."]="Não temos alternativa. Devemos confiar em nossos aliados."
G["We have no other choice. Put down your weapon, warrior, and we will put down ours."]="Não temos elecção. Baixa seu arma, guerreiro, e nós bajaremos as nossas."
G["We have no quarrel with your people. Would you like to sample our wares?"]="Não lhe desejam nenhum mal ao seu gente. Deseja testar nossa mercadoria?"
G["We have no smithy set up in Azure Watch. However, I've seen a few young blacksmiths coming from that odd encampment on the south coast. Perhaps you should investigate."]="Não temos nenhuma ferraria configurada no Azure Watch. No entanto, eu vi algum jovens ferreiros vindo daquele acampamento estranho na costa sul. Talvez você deva investigar."
G["We have no such place in the village.  The soaring heights of Thunder Bluff does though.  Head north up the road out of Bloodhoof Village until you come to the base of the bluffs.  There ride the elevator to the top and speak with a Bluffwatcher.  May your ancestors watch over you."]="Não temos esse lugar na vila. As alturas crescentes de Thunder Bluff fazem embora. Continue para o norte pela estrada fosse da Vila Casco Sangrento até chegar à base dos penhascos. Lá, pegue o elevador até o topo e fale com um Bluffwatcher. Que seus antepassados ​​cuidem de você."
G["We have no tailors here in Azure Watch. You might try the encampment on the beach, however - they seem to have a number of tradesmen from across the sea."]="Não temos alfaiates aqui no Azure Watch. Você pode tentar o acampamento na praia, no entanto - eles parecem ter vários comerciantes do outro lado do mar."
G["We have no time to rest, $r."]="Não temos tempo para descansar, $r."
G["We have no time to waste, $c. Why do you delay here?"]="Não temos tempo que perder, $c. O que está fazendo ainda aqui?"
G["We have not been properly introduced."]="We have not been properly introduced."
G["We have not fulfilled our oath!"]="Não temos concluído nosso juramento!"
G["We have not known war here for a very long time. I hope for the good of us all that we may find peace soon."]="We have not known war here for a very long time. I hope for the good of us all that we may find peace soon."
G["We have not lost hope..."]="Não temos perdido a esperança..."
G["We have not struggled so hard to survive, only to bring about the true destruction."]="Não temos lutado tanto por sobreviver somente para trazer a destruição verdadeira."
G["We have nothing to fear."]="Não temos nada que temer."
G["We have one eye and see better than you!  Bank in center of Undercity!"]="Temos um olho e vemos melhor que você! Banco no centro da cidade!"
G["We have one quarter of our needed silithyst! Keep it up!"]="We have one quarter of our needed silithyst! Keep it up!"
G["We have one quarter of the needed silithyst! Keep it up!"]="We have one quarter of the needed silithyst! Keep it up!"
G["We have only a small foothold on this continent for now, but the humans can't fight us off forever. Then they'll pay for enslaving us. We'll cut their lying tongues out for their treachery."]="Por enquanto, temos apenas um pequeno ponto de apoio neste continente, mas os humanos não podem lutar contra nós para sempre. Então eles vão pagar por nos escravizar. Cortaremos a língua mentirosa pela traição."
G["We have only sustained a few minor casualties. Otherwise, I would say that things are going quite well."]="We have only sustained a few minor casualties. Otherwise, I would say that things are going quite well."
G["We have our best people looking into these issues."]="Temos a nossos melhores agentes investigando estes casos."
G["We have our duties, $c.  Duties to the Horde."]="Temos nossas obligações, $c. Obligações para com a Horda."
G["We have played our part, and done well at that. It is up to the others now."]="Temos concluído com nossa parte. Agora depende dos outros."
G["We have pledged to open an elemental gateway from Stormwind to the Highlands, but interference from the Bastion of Twilight hampers our efforts.\n\nWhat madness are they engaged in over there?"]="We have pledged to open an elemental gateway from Stormwind to the Highlands, but interference from the Bastion of Twilight hampers our efforts.\n\nWhat madness are they engaged in over there?"
G["We have quite the feast for you friend."]="Temos um banquete para você, amigo."
G["We have reinforcements! For the Stonefather!"]="Temos reforços! pelo Para Pétreo!"
G["We have reports from a scout in the field that one of the Cenarion druids has been taken captive up at Firewing Point."]="We have reports from a scout in the field that one of the Cenarion druids has been taken captive up at Firewing Point."
G["We have secured the Hunter's Rise! All invaders have been repelled and the evacuation has been completed!"]="Temos o controle do Alto dos Caçadores! Temos feito recuar aos invasores e a evacuação se tem concluído com êxito!"
G["We have secured the Mage District! All invaders have been repelled and the evacuation has been completed!"]="O Bairro dos Magos está a salvou! Temos repelido a todos os invasores e a evacuação foi concluída!"
G["We have seeded darkmoon cards around the world to see if any worthy individuals could complete a set of any of the eight suits.  If you manage to collect all eight cards of one of the suits we will reward you with one of the greater darkmoon cards that functions as a powerful trinket as well as a link to the Darkmoon Faire."]="Semeamos cartões de lua escura em tudo o mundo para ver se alguém digno poderia completar um dos oito naipes. Se você conseguir coletar todas as oito cartas de um dos naipes, nós o recompensaremos com uma das maiores cartas de lua escura que funciona como uma bugiganga poderosa, bem como um link para o Darkmoon Faire."
G["We have slain the sea-witches and our god shall slay their queen!"]="Temos matou às bruxas marinas e nosso deus matará ao seu rainha!"
G["We have some supplies, but not many.  We'll need a lot more in order to send a ground assault into the Field of Strife."]="Temos algum suprimentos, mas não muitos. Precisamos de muito mais para enviar um ataque terrestre ao campo de conflito."
G["We have some uninvited guests.... [PH]"]="Temos uns convidados surpresa... [PH]"
G["We have spent generations perfecting just the right leaves for silkworm food."]="We have spent generations perfecting just the right leaves for silkworm food."
G["We have suffered a major setback, but we must see our mission through nevertheless."]="We have suffered a major setback, but we must see our mission through nevertheless."
G["We have suffered a tragic defeat."]="Sofremos uma derrota trágica."
G["We have swept the wreckage for days, Your Majesty. There is no sign of Admiral Taylor or his ships."]="We have swept the wreckage for days, Your Majesty. There is no sign of Admiral Taylor or his ships."
G["We have sworn to serve, intruder. And so shall you."]="Temos jurado servir. E você também o fará."
G["We have taken too long. Terokk reigns victorious."]="We have taken too long. Terokk reigns victorious."
G["We have the purified ashes of Vordrassil's sapling.  If we can subdue Ursoc, we might be able to heal his soul."]="Temos as cinzas purificadas do rebento de Vordrassil. Se pudermos subjugar Ursoc, poderemos curar sua alma."
G["We have the situation under control."]="O temos tudo baixo controle."
G["We have them cornered inside the temple. We should strike now!"]="Eles estão encurralados no templo. Vamos atacar agora!"
G["We have to be in position to strike against Crushcog when the mountaineers arrive."]="Quando os montaraces cheguem devemos estar em situação de atacar a Prensadiente."
G["We have to break through those mindless leper gnomes if we want to get out of here alive!"]="We have to break through those mindless leper gnomes if we want to get out of here alive!"
G["We have to deal with these stone troggs first. Then hand me the reagents."]="We have to deal with these stone troggs first. Then hand me the reagents."
G["We have to get off the island! Quick, Greely, grab the schematics! And my toothbrush!"]="Temos que sair desta ilha! Rápido, Greely, pegue os esquemas! E meu cepilho de dentes!"
G["We have to get out of here! The howling gets louder every night."]="We have to get out of here! The howling gets louder every night."
G["We have to get out of here."]="Temos que sair de aqui."
G["We have to keep moving; are you ready?"]="Temos que seguir em linha de frente; você está pronto?"
G["We have to keep those fungal terrors off of the front. They're too powerful!"]="Temos que manter esses terrores de fungos fosse da linha de frente. Eles são muito poderosos!"
G["We have to kill more trolls!  Kill enough and I'll blow the door to the troll chief!"]="Temos que matar mais trolls! Mate o suficiente e eu vou explodir a porta do chefe dos trolls!"
G["We have to make our way to the coffer without tipping off Schnottz and his boys."]="We have to make our way to the coffer without tipping off Schnottz and his boys."
G["We have to push forward if we're to put an end to him. Follow me, I'll open the courtyard so that you can spearhead our assault."]="We have to push forward if we're to put an end to him. Follow me, I'll open the courtyard so that you can spearhead our assault."
G["We have to reach the Aspects, are you ready?"]="Temos que alcançar os Aspectos, você está pronto?"
G["We have to rescue everyone and get out of here before the volcano explodes for real!"]="Temos que resgatar todos e sair daqui antes que o vulcão exploda de verdade!"
G["We have to stop the naga and save Zangarmarsh while we still can!"]="Devemos parar aos naga e superando Pântano Zíngaro enquanto possamos!"
G["We have traveled far to celebrate the hero of the draenei people."]="Temos viajado até aqui para celebrar ao herói do povo draeneis."
G["We have travelled a long way from the Jade Forest to be here today. It is my hope I will grow my skills in this tournament."]="Temos recorrido um largo caminho desdo Floresta de Jade até chegar aqui. Espero melhorar meus habilidades neste torneio."
G["We have two auction houses within Silvermoon. Which would you prefer?"]="Temos duas casas de leilão em Silvermoon. Qual você prefere?"
G["We have used bows since before even my father's time. They are solid and sure and take down our foes swiftly. I see no reason to use the guns that the goblins and tauren seem so fond of."]="We have used bows since before even my father's time. They are solid and sure and take down our foes swiftly. I see no reason to use the guns that the goblins and tauren seem so fond of."
G["We have very little information on this timeway. Sa'at has been dispatched and is currently inside. The data we have gathered from his correspondence is that the Infinite Dragonflight are once again attempting to alter time. Could it be that the opening of the Dark Portal is being targeted for sabotage? Let us hope not..."]="We have very little information on this timeway. Sa'at has been dispatched and is currently inside. The data we have gathered from his correspondence is that the Infinite Dragonflight are once again attempting to alter time. Could it be that the opening of the Dark Portal is being targeted for sabotage? Let us hope not..."
G["We have waited forever for this day to come!"]="We have waited forever for this day to come!"
G["We have what we need from the meddlesome Loremaster."]="We have what we need from the meddlesome Loremaster."
G["We have withdrawn from life in the city to await our fates here, where the truth has been revealed to us."]="Temos abandonou nossa vida na cidade para esperar a nosso destino aqui, onda verdade nos foi revelada."
G["We have witnessed your \"help\" in the Jade Forest. This \"Horde,\" this \"Alliance\" of yours - you have no control over your own nature. You leave misery in your wake."]="We have witnessed your \"help\" in the Jade Forest. This \"Horde,\" this \"Alliance\" of yours - you have no control over your own nature. You leave misery in your wake."
G["We have won $2219W battles against the Scourge.  Gird yourself, $n, for this war is far from over."]="Temos ganhou $2219W batalhas contra o Flagelo. Prepare-se, $n, pois esta guerra não fez mais que começar."
G["We have won $2219W battles against the Scourge.  Stand firm, $n!  We must persevere!"]="Temos ganhou $2219W batalhas contra o Flagelo. Aguanta, $n! Devemos perseverar!"
G["We have won $2219W battles against the Scourge.  Take heart, $n.  While many battles lie ahead, heroes, heroes from every realm have risen to fight them."]="We have won $2219W battles against the Scourge.  Take heart, $n.  While many battles lie ahead, heroes, heroes from every realm have risen to fight them."
G["We have won valuable time. Now we must pull back."]="We have won valuable time. Now we must pull back."
G["We have yet to meet our quota for the wood demand.  Now back to work with you."]="We have yet to meet our quota for the wood demand.  Now back to work with you."
G["We have... more important matters to attend to than you. Go away, scum."]="Temos assuntos mais importantes que atender. Vá embora, escória."
G["We haven't got much time. Crowley will be arriving shortly. Let's go!"]="Não temos muito tempo. Crowley virá em qualquer momentos. Vamos!"
G["We haven't much time, friends! You're going to help me test out my latest and greatest creation. Now, before you change your minds, remember that you kind of owe it to me after the mess you made with the XT-002."]="We haven't much time, friends! You're going to help me test out my latest and greatest creation. Now, before you change your minds, remember that you kind of owe it to me after the mess you made with the XT-002."
G["We hear so many conflicting stories about what's happening just out of sight. Tell me, $n, is it as bad as it sounds?"]="We hear so many conflicting stories about what's happening just out of sight. Tell me, $n, is it as bad as it sounds?"
G["We hear that the dragons tremble in fear at the mere mention of $n."]="Cuentan que os dragões tiemblan de medo com somente mencionar a $n."
G["We heard that $n figured out how to use the apexis relics and monuments!"]="Temos ouvido que $n tem averiguado como usar as relíquias e monumentos de ápices!"
G["We heard that $n single-handedly took out a forge camp!"]="Temos ouvido que $n eliminó um acampamento Forja somente."
G["We held our place here as long as we could, but it still wasn't enough."]="We held our place here as long as we could, but it still wasn't enough."
G["We help you find them."]="We help you find them."
G["We here! Only, if this is world tree, how come it broke when they tried to put whole world in?"]="We here! Only, if this is world tree, how come it broke when they tried to put whole world in?"
G["We hold dis place wid our lives mon!"]="Defendemos este lugar com nossas vidas!"
G["We hold the surface, and when the radiation clears we'll assault and recapture Gnomeregan with a force twice this size."]="Defendamos a superfície e quando a radiação desaparezca, atacaremos e recuperaremos Gnomeregan com um exército o doble de grande."
G["We honor them by putting them to war against one another."]="Os honramos enviándolos a lutar uns contra outros."
G["We hope guide gets here soon."]="Esperamos que o guia chegue aqui em breve."
G["We hope you'll be able to ease our headaches.  You try having ten sons, all of them wanting to do something they weren't meant for!\n\nStill, as a father, we do what we must."]="We hope you'll be able to ease our headaches.  You try having ten sons, all of them wanting to do something they weren't meant for!\n\nStill, as a father, we do what we must."
G["We hope you're staying for a while, $n.  Stop by later and we'll catch up on old times."]="We hope you're staying for a while, $n.  Stop by later and we'll catch up on old times."
G["We humbly entrust our fallen brothers and sisters into the Light.  In this life you embraced them with your tender love; deliver them now from every evil and bid them enter eternal rest."]="We humbly entrust our fallen brothers and sisters into the Light.  In this life you embraced them with your tender love; deliver them now from every evil and bid them enter eternal rest."
G["We hunger for vengeance."]="Temos sede de vingança."
G["We is good."]="Estar bem."
G["We jinyu do not cower in fear of defeat. Neither do we fight simply for victory."]="We jinyu do not cower in fear of defeat. Neither do we fight simply for victory."
G["We join guild?  No?  Ok, you find Guild Master on east platform in Trade Quarter."]="Entramos na guilda? Não? Ok, você encontra o Guild Master na plataforma leste no Trade Quarter."
G["We just couldn't do it the quiet way!"]="Não podíamos fazer isso em silêncio!"
G["We just lost a plane!"]="We just lost a plane!"
G["We just might win this!"]="Acho que vamos acabar vencendo!"
G["We just mix these two together..."]="We just mix these two together..."
G["We just need to knock the centrifugal rotary ball clutch back into alignment. Easy!"]="We just need to knock the centrifugal rotary ball clutch back into alignment. Easy!"
G["We just need to stand together. You have to trust me. Know that I will do the right thing. If we act as one, we cannot fail."]="We just need to stand together. You have to trust me. Know that I will do the right thing. If we act as one, we cannot fail."
G["We just need to stay focused on our mission so we can get out of here in one piece."]="We just need to stay focused on our mission so we can get out of here in one piece."
G["We just rested a few minutes ago!  Let's just go to Light's Hope Chapel!"]="We just rested a few minutes ago!  Let's just go to Light's Hope Chapel!"
G["We just wait for guide."]="Nós apenas esperamos pelo guia."
G["We keep waiting then..."]="Seguimos esperando então..."
G["We keep waiting."]="Seguimos esperando."
G["We kept goin' south, until Shokia started whinin' about somethin'."]="We kept goin' south, until Shokia started whinin' about somethin'."
G["We kidnap and ravage and rage by moonlight, drink up me 'earties, aaaa-ooo!"]="We kidnap and ravage and rage by moonlight, drink up me 'earties, aaaa-ooo!"
G["We kill 'em good, mon."]="Os matamos bem, homem."
G["We kill his friend!"]="Matamos ao seu amigo!"
G["We kill someone else!"]="Matamos a outro!"
G["We kill them and we take their stuffs..."]="Os matamos e nos levamos seus coisas..."
G["We kin make it back to camp on our own. Come talk to meh later if ya fancy borrowin' a gryphon."]="Podemos voltar ao acampamento por nossa conta. Venha a me ver mais tarde se te apetece pegar prestado um grifo."
G["We knew you could do it!"]="Sabíamos que o conseguirías!"
G["We knocked something loose with that last one."]="We knocked something loose with that last one."
G["We know all about you, and the perfume, and the rose petals.  Watch it!"]="We know all about you, and the perfume, and the rose petals.  Watch it!"
G["We know hunger never to be quenched..."]="We know hunger never to be quenched..."
G["We know now that the mogu share their roots with the Titans. But many mysteries remain. Why were they here? Why Pandaria?"]="Nós sabemos agora que os mogus têm a mesma origem dos titãs. Mas muitos mistérios permanecem. Por que eles estavam aqui? Por que Pandária?"
G["We know only despair now. A fitting punishment for our failure...."]="We know only despair now. A fitting punishment for our failure...."
G["We know power never to be overcome..."]="We know power never to be overcome..."
G["We know some of the truth. Now we must uncover the rest!"]="We know some of the truth. Now we must uncover the rest!"
G["We know that he purged his doubts in the Jade Forest. That he cleansed himself of despair in the Krasarang Wilds. That he overcame his fear in Townlong Steppes. And that he defeated anger, hatred, and violence high in the mountains of Kun-Lai."]="Nós sabemos que ele purgou as próprias dúvidas na Floresta de Jade. Que ele se purificou do desespero na Selva de Krasarang. Que ele superou o medo nas Estepes de Taolong. E que ele derrotou a ira, o ódio e a violência no alto das montanhas Kun-Lai."
G["We know that the wyrmcultists are massing on the other side of the tunnel.  We'll make our stand here."]="Sabemos que os lobistas estão se reunindo do outro lado do túnel. Vamos nos posicionar aqui."
G["We know you have dragon thing! We not scared! We going to get you and dragon thing!"]="Nós saber que vocês ter coisa dragão! Não ter medo! Nós ir a por vocês e a por coisa dragão!"
G["We know you were getting ready to attack us. You brought this on yourselves."]="We know you were getting ready to attack us. You brought this on yourselves."
G["We know you, Cairne Bloodhoof, and your people have told us of your deeds. You are welcome at the hearth of the ancestors."]="Nós te conhecemos, Caerne Pezunha de Sangue; e seu povo nos tem falado muitas vezes dos seus façanhas. É bem-vindo no lar dos ancestrais."
G["We know, cap'n.  We know."]="O sabemos, capitão. O sabemos."
G["We know... that you don't... know why we're immune... to your so-called blight. Grand Admiral Westwind somehow gave the high abbot that prayer. I beg you... no more... please?!"]="We know... that you don't... know why we're immune... to your so-called blight. Grand Admiral Westwind somehow gave the high abbot that prayer. I beg you... no more... please?!"
G["We leave, then, Torlok. I have only one request..."]="Então nos marchamos, Torlok. Somente tenho uma petição..."
G["We let you stay here too long."]="Os vocês têm ficado demais."
G["We like to make sure that faire goers of all ages can enjoy the games.\n\nRing Toss is a simple game where you try to land a ring on the back of a moving turtle.\n\nIt's one of my favorite games to play."]="We like to make sure that faire goers of all ages can enjoy the games.\n\nRing Toss is a simple game where you try to land a ring on the back of a moving turtle.\n\nIt's one of my favorite games to play."
G["We live and die, and the land remains, eternal, unmoved by our passage. Thus, land cannot belong to us, $n. Instead, we belong to it. Therefore we protect the land, for without it we cannot hope to survive."]="We live and die, and the land remains, eternal, unmoved by our passage. Thus, land cannot belong to us, $n. Instead, we belong to it. Therefore we protect the land, for without it we cannot hope to survive."
G["We live in a world of endless tragedy."]="Vivemos em um mundo de tragédia sem fim."
G["We live on the back of a big turtle?!"]="We live on the back of a big turtle?!"
G["We live only to serve the ancient one. DIE INTERLOPER!"]="We live only to serve the ancient one. DIE INTERLOPER!"
G["We live or die in THEIR service!"]="We live or die in THEIR service!"
G["We live to fight another day, $r."]="We live to fight another day, $r."
G["We live together, or we die together. All of Pandaria is connected."]="We live together, or we die together. All of Pandaria is connected."
G["We live, we fight, we die. The tricky part is finding a reason to do each of those."]="We live, we fight, we die. The tricky part is finding a reason to do each of those."
G["We lived under the same waves, breathed the same water, and worshipped the same god.  Why, then, would the naga turn against us?"]="Vivíamos sob as mesmas ondas, respirávamos a mesma água e adorávamos o mesmo deus. Por que, então, as nagas se voltariam contra nós?"
G["We look for the evil ones now, yes?"]="Nós agora procurar aos maus, sim?"
G["We lose that island to the Horde and Stormwind's as good as gone... and they know it."]="We lose that island to the Horde and Stormwind's as good as gone... and they know it."
G["We lost a lot a good people today, laddy. The Lich King is gonna pay for all the lives he's ruined!"]="Temos perdido a muita gente Boa hoje, tio. O Rei Lich pagará por todas as vidas que tem arruinado!"
G["We lost everything, brother.  We thank Kamagua for giving us shelter."]="We lost everything, brother.  We thank Kamagua for giving us shelter."
G["We lost many of our kin in the war... so yes, the city is not perhaps as lively as it once was. We will endure, however."]="Perdimos a muitos dos nossos na guerra... Sim, a cidade não está tão animada como antes. Mas resistiremos."
G["We lost many to the faceless ones, my lord.  But we succeeded in retrieving the heart from Naz'anak."]="Temos perdido a muitos de mão dos ignotos, meu senhor. Mas temos conseguido recuperar o coração de Naz'anak."
G["We lost our home to the yaungol. But this place... this place offers us a new beginning."]="Perdimos nosso lar ante os yaungol. Mas este lugar... este lugar nos oferecem um novo início."
G["We lost this time but don't let it get you down. Concentrate on your special attacks. Keep your shield high and close. Do this and next time victory will be ours!"]="We lost this time but don't let it get you down. Concentrate on your special attacks. Keep your shield high and close. Do this and next time victory will be ours!"
G["We made a new friend!"]="Temos feito uma amizade nova!"
G["We made camp in the mountains. Little Lu watched over Rell."]="Acampamos nas montanhas. Pequeno Lu cuidó de Relh."
G["We made it out alive! Boy oh boy, wait until my friends hear all about this. They'll never believe it! See you later, $n!"]="Temos conseguido sobreviver! Oh, espera a que meus amigos escuchen isto. Não se o vão a acreditar mais! Nos vemos depois, $n!"
G["We made it past enemy lines - looked like it was gunna be smooth sailin' all the way."]="We made it past enemy lines - looked like it was gunna be smooth sailin' all the way."
G["We made it through the pass!  Now we have the swamp..."]="We made it through the pass!  Now we have the swamp..."
G["We made it to Nethergarde!"]="Temos conseguido chegar até Etergarde!"
G["We made it to the top!"]="O temos conseguido!"
G["We made it!"]="O temos conseguido!"
G["We made it!  Thanks again!  I'm going to run ahead!"]="O logramos! Obrigado novamente! Eu irei linha de frente!"
G["We made it!  Thanks, $n.  I couldn't have gotten here without you."]="O temos conseguido! Obrigado, $n. Não haveria chegado até aqui sem sua ajuda."
G["We made it! I'll find my way back on my own. Do me a favor and go tell Royce Duskwhisper where he can stick his stupid Eye of Twilight."]="We made it! I'll find my way back on my own. Do me a favor and go tell Royce Duskwhisper where he can stick his stupid Eye of Twilight."
G["We made it! Quae, we made it!"]="O temos conseguido! Quae, o temos conseguido!"
G["We made it! Take care, $n, and thanks again!"]="O temos conseguido! Cuídate, $n, e Obrigado novamente!"
G["We made it! Thank you for getting me out of that hell hole. Tell Hemet to expect me!"]="We made it! Thank you for getting me out of that hell hole. Tell Hemet to expect me!"
G["We made it! We actually made it!"]="O logramos! O logramos de verdade!"
G["We made it!!"]="O temos conseguido!"
G["We made it, my friend. Remember to find Terenthis and let him know we're safe. Thank you again."]="O logramos, $gamigo meu: amiga minha;. Não esqueça procurar a Terenthis e hacerle saber que estamos a salvou. Obrigado novamente."
G["We made our home in this desert, and named it after my father Durotan, Chieftain of the Frostwolf Clan."]="We made our home in this desert, and named it after my father Durotan, Chieftain of the Frostwolf Clan."
G["We make a great team!"]="Fazemos um bom equipamento!"
G["We make our stand here!"]="Aqui resistiremos."
G["We managed to earn the Celestials' trust and open the Vale, but we must continue to show them that we are on a mission of peace."]="We managed to earn the Celestials' trust and open the Vale, but we must continue to show them that we are on a mission of peace."
G["We managed to get up a few new makeshift buildings for the refugees. It's not pretty, but it'll hold. And it'll be a hell of a lot better than the bandit-infested fields they came from."]="We managed to get up a few new makeshift buildings for the refugees. It's not pretty, but it'll hold. And it'll be a hell of a lot better than the bandit-infested fields they came from."
G["We mantid are an elder race. The pandaren you associate with - they are but children. They have their role to play."]="Os mantídeos somos uma raça antiga. Os pandaren com os que tratas não são mais que crianças. Têm seu própria missão."
G["We may be few, Socrethar, but our faith is strong.  Something you will never understand.  Now that custom has been served, prepare to meet your end."]="We may be few, Socrethar, but our faith is strong.  Something you will never understand.  Now that custom has been served, prepare to meet your end."
G["We may be surrounded by all sorts of nasties here, but at least we're out over the open water.\n\nThat won't protect us from whatever it was that I saw fly over last night, though. It was big... I mean, really big!"]="We may be surrounded by all sorts of nasties here, but at least we're out over the open water.\n\nThat won't protect us from whatever it was that I saw fly over last night, though. It was big... I mean, really big!"
G["We may be working together, but that only increases the need for discretion. Once again, be mindful of your words and actions.\n\nI can guarantee we're far from the only ones out here."]="We may be working together, but that only increases the need for discretion. Once again, be mindful of your words and actions.\n\nI can guarantee we're far from the only ones out here."
G["We may have been suffering a drought but there's no shortage of meat! Care to browse my goods?"]="Podemos estar sofrendo uma seca, mas basta de carne! Gostaria de procurar meus produtos?"
G["We may have to improvise. Make friends with the locals - whatever it takes to secure a beach-head."]="We may have to improvise. Make friends with the locals - whatever it takes to secure a beach-head."
G["We may have to retreat into the Valley of the Four Winds. I don't want to give up my home here."]="We may have to retreat into the Valley of the Four Winds. I don't want to give up my home here."
G["We may learn much from this specimen..."]="Poderíamos aprender muito deste espécimen..."
G["We may not be warriors by trade, but we will do anything to save our home and our land."]="We may not be warriors by trade, but we will do anything to save our home and our land."
G["We may not trust the Alliance, but we need their help if we are to take back the Horde."]="Talvez a Aliança não seja de fiar, mas precisamos de sua ajuda se queremos recuperar o controle da Horda."
G["We may operate in the shadows of polite society, but out here on the battlefront our powers are properly respected at last."]="Podemos operar nas sombras da sociedade educada, mas aqui na linha de frente de batalha nossos poderes são respeitados, finalmente."
G["We meet again, stranger from beyond the mists."]="Nos volvemos a encontrar, jovem de além da névoa."
G["We meet again, time traveller!"]="Volvemos a nos encontrar, viagemro do tempo!"
G["We meet again. You havin' a good day now?"]="Onda novamente. Você está passando bem?"
G["We might be able to win this."]="ao melhor conseguimos ganhar."
G["We mortal races know so little of Aessina, the spirit of the wilderness who lurks in dense untamed woods. She is the soul of the forest, its beating heart, the source of life energy that breaks down stone, devours ancient ruins, and fills dense thickets with mystery and fear. Aessina is the center of the web of life.\n\nThe night elves have built shrines to her throughout Kalimdor. She is revered, yes... But not understood.\n\nWhat would it be like, do you think, to get even a glimpse of this reclusive, powerful ancient?"]="We mortal races know so little of Aessina, the spirit of the wilderness who lurks in dense untamed woods. She is the soul of the forest, its beating heart, the source of life energy that breaks down stone, devours ancient ruins, and fills dense thickets with mystery and fear. Aessina is the center of the web of life.\n\nThe night elves have built shrines to her throughout Kalimdor. She is revered, yes... But not understood.\n\nWhat would it be like, do you think, to get even a glimpse of this reclusive, powerful ancient?"
G["We most definitely do not need anymore attention drawn to us, stranger. Return to those that sent you in search of the lost master and tell them that nothing could be found. When this is done - and I will know when it is so - return and I shall reveal the secrets of the deceased."]="We most definitely do not need anymore attention drawn to us, stranger. Return to those that sent you in search of the lost master and tell them that nothing could be found. When this is done - and I will know when it is so - return and I shall reveal the secrets of the deceased."
G["We murder every turnip!"]="We murder every turnip!"
G["We must act quickly or all shall be lost!"]="Devemos actuar com rapidez ou estaremos perdidos!"
G["We must avenge our mother!\nDistract the monster who slew her, free us from this cage, and we will fight by your side.\nOur ability to reduce the damage an enemy inflicts will help you survive the Proto-Behemoth's Scorching Breath."]="We must avenge our mother!\nDistract the monster who slew her, free us from this cage, and we will fight by your side.\nOur ability to reduce the damage an enemy inflicts will help you survive the Proto-Behemoth's Scorching Breath."
G["We must avoid another war with the Horde at all costs!"]="Devemos evitar outra guerra com a Horda a tudo custo!"
G["We must be close, Commander. I can feel the elements stirring."]="We must be close, Commander. I can feel the elements stirring."
G["We must be prepared for the next assualt!  The Betrayer will be destroyed!"]="Preparémonos para o seguinte ataque! O Traidor será destruído!"
G["We must be very quiet. The Slitherscale will not hesitate to eat us for dinner."]="We must be very quiet. The Slitherscale will not hesitate to eat us for dinner."
G["We must be vigilant to eradicate this plague!"]="Temos que estar alerta para erradicar esta Fedor!"
G["We must bide our time.  They won't know what hit them."]="We must bide our time.  They won't know what hit them."
G["We must break the siege!"]="Devemos acabar com o cerco!"
G["We must break through - where are my explosives?"]="Devemos seguir! Onde estão os explosivos?"
G["We must carry on with or without Maiev.  Inside!  Quickly!"]="Devemos seguir com ou sem Maiev. Dentro! Rápido!"
G["We must confer with the leaders of the Horde and the Alliance.  Ragnaros must be defeated in his home realm.  Only then will he forever be vanquished."]="Devemos falar com os líderes da Horda e da Aliança. Ragnaros deve ser derrotou no seu reino. Somente assim lhe venceremos para sempre."
G["We must consume his flesh, for he is weak! The cycle must continue!"]="Devemos consumir seu carne, pois é fraco! O ciclo dever seguir!"
G["We must contain the arcane power we have unleashed!"]="Devemos conter o poder Arcano que temos liberado!"
G["We must contain the disease the naga have unleashed here before it is too late!"]="Devemos conter a doença que as nagas desencadearam aqui antes que seja tarde demais!"
G["We must continue on now."]="Devemos seguir."
G["We must continue to hold on for as long as we can! Fight on!"]="Devemos seguir nos segurando o quanto pudermos! Lute!"
G["We must defeat these satyr, $n. We will not suffer the Legion's presence in these lands."]="We must defeat these satyr, $n. We will not suffer the Legion's presence in these lands."
G["We must defend the Sunwell from the enemy at all costs."]="Devemos defenda A Nascente do Sol passe o que passe."
G["We must defend the pools from their corruption!"]="Devemos impedir que contaminen os poças!"
G["We must defend the villagers! I will take the front gates, the rest of you spread out and don't let any yaungol get past you!"]="É preciso defenda aos camponeses! Eu me encargo da porta principal. Vocês separaos e não deixem que passe nenhum yaungol."
G["We must destroys it."]="We must destroys it."
G["We must discover what's behind the mystery of the giant crystal that fell from the heavens on Fallen Sky Ridge."]="Devemos descobrir o que está por por trás do mistério do cristal gigantesco que caiu dos céus em Fallen Sky Ridge."
G["We must dispatch another watcher. Balance must be maintained..."]="Devemos enviar a outro vigia. Se você deve manter o equilíbrio..."
G["We must dissipate this power before it is noticed by elf or demon."]="Devemos dissipar este poder antes de que o perciban os elfos ou os demônios."
G["We must do everything in our power to stop the same from happening here. We'll have to step up our investigations of the oases and stop this phenomenon at the source. We'll talk again at Crossroads!"]="We must do everything in our power to stop the same from happening here. We'll have to step up our investigations of the oases and stop this phenomenon at the source. We'll talk again at Crossroads!"
G["We must do everything we can to protect the shrines and temples of my people."]="We must do everything we can to protect the shrines and temples of my people."
G["We must do more than hold the tree, $r. The Horde will never give up.\n\nWe must destroy them!"]="We must do more than hold the tree, $r. The Horde will never give up.\n\nWe must destroy them!"
G["We must do whatever it takes to recombine the fragments of the World Pillar.\n\nBut first, we must regain all of them."]="We must do whatever it takes to recombine the fragments of the World Pillar.\n\nBut first, we must regain all of them."
G["We must drive the yaungol back to the Townlong Steppes."]="We must drive the yaungol back to the Townlong Steppes."
G["We must eliminate the elves and their cowardly Alliance from Warsong Gulch. Go to the Hall of the Brave in the Valley of Honor and speak with Brakgul Deathbringer if you have what it takes to aid the Horde."]="Devemos eliminar os elfos e sua Aliança covarde do Warsong Gulch. Vá para o Salão dos Bravos no Vale da Honra e fale com o Brakgul Deathbringer, se você tem o que é preciso para ajudar a Horda."
G["We must endure these trying times faithfully, and one day we will find ourselves victorious."]="We must endure these trying times faithfully, and one day we will find ourselves victorious."
G["We must endure."]="Devemos resistir!"
G["We must enjoy this time together before yet more conflict arrives on our doorsteps."]="Devemos aproveitar do tempo que temos antes de que se produzcan mais conflitos."
G["We must ensure that you are up to the task... and then equip you accordingly."]="Vamos garantir que você seja forte o bastante... E então conseguir o equipamento adequado."
G["We must ensure the survival of this camp at all costs, $c!  Our enemies must not be given any quarter, for they would surely give us none were we to need it."]="We must ensure the survival of this camp at all costs, $c!  Our enemies must not be given any quarter, for they would surely give us none were we to need it."
G["We must fight those who would threaten our flesh, who would kill our children; we must look to our own."]="We must fight those who would threaten our flesh, who would kill our children; we must look to our own."
G["We must find a way to strip our enemies of their power. Without their strength, we can easily overcome them with our will."]="We must find a way to strip our enemies of their power. Without their strength, we can easily overcome them with our will."
G["We must find out. Without the Shado-Pan, Pandaria will surely be engulfed in darkness..."]="We must find out. Without the Shado-Pan, Pandaria will surely be engulfed in darkness..."
G["We must find your allies and discover the naga motives in this region.\n\nBut first, we must find a more secure location."]="Devemos encontrar aos seus aliados e descobrir os planos dos nagas para esta região.\n\nMas antes devemos encontrar um lugar mais certo."
G["We must first craft a prison to confine the beast, if you wish to progress further."]="Primeiro devemos criar uma prisão para confinar a besta, se você quiser progredir ainda mais."
G["We must focus if we are to spawn our dragonflight!"]="Devemos nos concentrar se quisermos gerar nosso vôo do dragão!"
G["We must focus on creating a base of operations. Once we have secured our position, then we can spare resources to find a way back home."]="We must focus on creating a base of operations. Once we have secured our position, then we can spare resources to find a way back home."
G["We must focus our thoughts upon the Circle of Calling if the Forest Lord is to come! We must hurry! Concentrate your energies!"]="We must focus our thoughts upon the Circle of Calling if the Forest Lord is to come! We must hurry! Concentrate your energies!"
G["We must gain a foothold here.. away from these Horde dogs."]="Temos que estabelecer uma posição... longe desses cães da Horda."
G["We must get all of this fel reaver tech out of here before the Stormspire comes down on us!"]="É preciso conseguir essa tecnologia de assaltante vil antes de que se nos eche acima Flecha da Tempestade!"
G["We must get the parts Driz wants. THE REST IS OURS!"]="Devemos conseguir as peças O que quer Driz. O MAIS É NOSSO!"
G["We must get you back to the monastery."]="Devemos levar você de volta ao monastério."
G["We must go and gather with the other Disciples. There is much work to be done before I can make another attempt to restore the Barrens. Farewell, brave souls!"]="We must go and gather with the other Disciples. There is much work to be done before I can make another attempt to restore the Barrens. Farewell, brave souls!"
G["We must go, we are not done yet."]="We must go, we are not done yet."
G["We must halt their advance! Take your positions!"]="We must halt their advance! Take your positions!"
G["We must hold fast. If Northwatch falls, there is nothing to our backs but the sea!"]="Nós devemos nos segurar firme. Se Northwatch cair, não há nada nas nossas costas senão o mar!"
G["We must hold off the enemy for just a while longer.  In mere moments, Cenarius will walk among us."]="We must hold off the enemy for just a while longer.  In mere moments, Cenarius will walk among us."
G["We must hold out a little longer, just until reinforcements arrive."]="Temos que resistir um pouco mais, somente até que cheguem os reforços."
G["We must hold strong!"]="Temos que aguantar!"
G["We must hold the gate. Attack! Tear them limb from limb!"]="We must hold the gate. Attack! Tear them limb from limb!"
G["We must hurry and speak with your Earthen Ring friend."]="We must hurry and speak with your Earthen Ring friend."
G["We must hurry!"]="We must hurry!"
G["We must hurry! Do something, shaman!"]="We must hurry! Do something, shaman!"
G["We must hurry, $n. Malygos' ruinous plans will soon be irreversible."]="Deve dar a você pressa, $n. Os ruinosos planos de Malygos pronto serão irreversibles."
G["We must hurry, now. I sense that my time is short."]="We must hurry, now. I sense that my time is short."
G["We must hurry."]="We must hurry."
G["We must keep Therazane's forces from attacking Stonehearth.\n\nIf they do, they will steal the middle fragment of the World Pillar."]="We must keep Therazane's forces from attacking Stonehearth.\n\nIf they do, they will steal the middle fragment of the World Pillar."
G["We must keep the guards here to protect the refugees."]="Devemos manter aqui aos guardas para que protejan aos refugiados."
G["We must leave before more are alerted."]="We must leave before more are alerted."
G["We must let no Horde escape this place. Any ideas?"]="Não podemos permitir que nenhum soldado da Horda saia deste lugar. Alguma ideia?"
G["We must maintain a state of vigilance, $c! Between Dar'Khan the Betrayer and his Scourge, and the Shadowpine trolls backed by the might of Zul'Aman, we're barely keeping our heads above water here. We really shouldn't have to be dividing our attentions!\n\nI hope you're here to help."]="We must maintain a state of vigilance, $c! Between Dar'Khan the Betrayer and his Scourge, and the Shadowpine trolls backed by the might of Zul'Aman, we're barely keeping our heads above water here. We really shouldn't have to be dividing our attentions!\n\nI hope you're here to help."
G["We must maintain the balance!"]="Devemos proteção o equilíbrio!"
G["We must make haste! The elementals cannot endure this siege."]="We must make haste! The elementals cannot endure this siege."
G["We must make our way to the crater!"]="We must make our way to the crater!"
G["We must make sure not to lose any more souls to the seas."]="Devemos ter certeza de não perder mais almas para os mares."
G["We must move quickly. Auberdine isn't too far away, but many enemies lurk in the forest."]="We must move quickly. Auberdine isn't too far away, but many enemies lurk in the forest."
G["We must never give in to despair."]="We must never give in to despair."
G["We must not allow an inch to our enemy.  If they strike in Darkshore we will fight them back just as if they had attacked Darnassus itself."]="Não devemos permitir uma polegada ao nosso inimigo. Se eles atacarem em Darkshore, lutaremos contra eles como se tivessem atacado o próprio Darnassus."
G["We must not allow the Alliance to expand their power base in Arathi!  Even their miniscule Refuge Pointe may one day grow to threaten us."]="Não devemos permitir que a Aliança expanda sua base de poder em Arathi! Até seu minúsculo refúgio Pointe pode um dia crescer para nos ameaçar."
G["We must not fail The Betrayer."]="Não devemos defraudar ao Traidor."
G["We must not fail our leader!  Kael'thas will redeem us!"]="Não podemos falhar a nosso líder! Kael'thas nos redimirá!"
G["We must not fail the Firelord!"]="Não devemos falharle ao Senhor do Fogo!"
G["We must not fail the master."]="Não devemos falharle ao mestre."
G["We must not give into the evil which has darkened our land.  The Night Watch must prevail!"]="We must not give into the evil which has darkened our land.  The Night Watch must prevail!"
G["We must not give up!"]="We must not give up!"
G["We must not let down our guard.  It's only a matter of time before he regains his strength and returns to turn Nordrassil into ash."]="Não devemos descer a guarda. É somente questão de tempo que recupere seus forças e regrese para reduzir Nordrassil a cinzas."
G["We must not let our grief weaken us. Our people will stand strong against the invaders."]="Não devemos deixar que nossa tristeza nos enfraqueça. Nosso povo permanecerá forte contra os invasores."
G["We must not only see the negative when there is much to be positive about."]="Não devemos ver somente o negativo quando há muitas coisas positivas."
G["We must not sit idly by in our mountain-top fortress as Pandaria falls apart. And that is why you and I must demand an audience with Taran Zhu."]="We must not sit idly by in our mountain-top fortress as Pandaria falls apart. And that is why you and I must demand an audience with Taran Zhu."
G["We must not waste time, traveler."]="Não devemos perder tempo, viajante."
G["We must perservere, $n. That is something I learned from our beloved wolf ancient.\n\nNever, never, never give up."]="We must perservere, $n. That is something I learned from our beloved wolf ancient.\n\nNever, never, never give up."
G["We must prevent it from occurring in the first place."]="Devemos esta que ocurra desdo início."
G["We must prevent the Horde from taking Pandaria... but we must also work to minimize suffering as we do."]="We must prevent the Horde from taking Pandaria... but we must also work to minimize suffering as we do."
G["We must protect the brew!"]="Devemos proteção a cerveja!"
G["We must push little cart!"]="We must push little cart!"
G["We must put an end to the corruption permeating Ashenvale."]="Temos de pôr um fim à corrupção que permeia Ashenvale."
G["We must re-establish our stranglehold on these mines!"]="Devemos restabelecer nosso domínio sobre essas minas!"
G["We must redeem the Vale."]="Devemos redimir o vale."
G["We must regroup before the Sha attack again!"]="We must regroup before the Sha attack again!"
G["We must remain focused on our work.  Once the sanctum starts producing at full capacity, Silvermoon will be forced to send help.  Functioning arcane sanctums are in short supply."]="We must remain focused on our work.  Once the sanctum starts producing at full capacity, Silvermoon will be forced to send help.  Functioning arcane sanctums are in short supply."
G["We must resist!  Gird your soul!  Burn the foul plague wherever you find it!"]="Nós devemos resistir! Cinge sua alma! Queime o Flagelo suja onde quer que a encontre!"
G["We must search for survivors. If anyone is still alive, we must at least try and get them back..."]="Nós devemos procurar por sobreviventes. Se alguém ainda está vivo, devemos pelo menos tentar recuperá-o..."
G["We must seek out the elemental spirits and reunite them in the temple. Through this we will heal the land and find understanding of what truly ails it."]="We must seek out the elemental spirits and reunite them in the temple. Through this we will heal the land and find understanding of what truly ails it."
G["We must speak with the shaman of the Earthen Ring. Come..."]="Devemos falar com o xamã do Anel da Terra. Venha..."
G["We must stand at the ready. I have faced undead before. They are ruthless killing machines, devoid of any emotion or compassion."]="We must stand at the ready. I have faced undead before. They are ruthless killing machines, devoid of any emotion or compassion."
G["We must stay together, Tholo!"]="Devemos permanecer juntos, Tholo!"
G["We must stick together to survive.  Move around in groups."]="Devemos permanecer juntos para sobreviver. Moveos em grupos."
G["We must stop Cho'gall from creating his ultimate weapon at all costs, even if that means sacrificing ourselves."]="Devemos impedir que Cho'gall crie sua arma suprema a tudo custo, mesmo que isso signifique sacrificar a nós mesmos."
G["We must stop the Dark Shaman now."]="Devemos parar ao Xamã sombrio agora."
G["We must stop these villains!"]="We must stop these villains!"
G["We must strike at Jotunheim continuously. Never give them a chance to catch their breath, never a chance to sleep, and never accept surrender!\n\nTirion Fordring with all the might of Ashbringer and the Argent Crusade behind him cannot hope to accomplish what you are doing!\n\nNow, be quick about your business, $n. There is too much occurring for idle chit-chat."]="We must strike at Jotunheim continuously. Never give them a chance to catch their breath, never a chance to sleep, and never accept surrender!\n\nTirion Fordring with all the might of Ashbringer and the Argent Crusade behind him cannot hope to accomplish what you are doing!\n\nNow, be quick about your business, $n. There is too much occurring for idle chit-chat."
G["We must strive to understand the balance maintained by this world's elemental spirits."]="Devemos nos esforçar para entender o equilíbrio mantido pelos espíritos elementares deste mundo."
G["We must succceed! Azeroth's fate lies in the balance...."]="Nós devemos ter sucesso! O destino de Azeroth está na balança...."
G["We must take back Auberdine!"]="Devemos recuperar Auberdine!"
G["We must take care. The temple grounds are patrolled by mogu and their saurok slaves, and their beasts lurk in the grass off the roads."]="We must take care. The temple grounds are patrolled by mogu and their saurok slaves, and their beasts lurk in the grass off the roads."
G["We must take caution in reacting against the recent events on our shores. Paw'don is a small brewing town, not a fortress of war.\n\nYou would do well to urge your leaders to take similar caution in their judgment of my people. We do not seek combat, but we will provide it if necessary.\n\nI must meditate on this affair."]="We must take caution in reacting against the recent events on our shores. Paw'don is a small brewing town, not a fortress of war.\n\nYou would do well to urge your leaders to take similar caution in their judgment of my people. We do not seek combat, but we will provide it if necessary.\n\nI must meditate on this affair."
G["We must take it somewhere safe. Sentinels! Let's get to work."]="We must take it somewhere safe. Sentinels! Let's get to work."
G["We must take what is ours. Our survival depends on it."]="Nós devemos pegar o que é nosso. Nossa sobrevivência depende disso."
G["We must train harder."]="We must train harder."
G["We must tread carefully. The Shan'ze tribe practices dark magic that we still do not fully understand."]="We must tread carefully. The Shan'ze tribe practices dark magic that we still do not fully understand."
G["We must uncover the truth about these rumors and stop this Twilight's Hammer campaign to spread fear among us!"]="We must uncover the truth about these rumors and stop this Twilight's Hammer campaign to spread fear among us!"
G["We must unite and focus our attention upon the true threat: THE LICH KING!"]="We must unite and focus our attention upon the true threat: THE LICH KING!"
G["We must use this time wisely!"]="Devemos usar este tempo sabiamente!"
G["We must wait for the right time to strike!"]="Devemos esperar o momentos oportuno para atacar!"
G["We must work faster."]="Devemos trabalhar mais rápido."
G["We must work quickly to get the beacon operational."]="Devemos trabalhar rapidamente para que a baliza fique a estar operativa."
G["We must work together to preserve what nativel life remains in Nagrand."]="Devemos colaborar para preservar a fauna nativa de Nagrand."
G["We mustn't allow them through!"]="Não devemos permitir que pasen!"
G["We mustn't anger the Master. His is a wrath that is cruel beyond measure."]="Não devemos irritar o mestre. A ira dele é cruel além da medida."
G["We mustn't fail the Banshee Queen."]="Não devemos falharle à Rainha alma em pena."
G["We mustn't lose our focus. The dangers inherent in getting lost in the moment could put us in peril. Alas, the soldiers need a respite from this madness.\n\nBask in the victory, $n. If not for you we might have lost the Vanguard."]="We mustn't lose our focus. The dangers inherent in getting lost in the moment could put us in peril. Alas, the soldiers need a respite from this madness.\n\nBask in the victory, $n. If not for you we might have lost the Vanguard."
G["We mustn't tarry here... stay close - I'll take us somewhere safe."]="We mustn't tarry here... stay close - I'll take us somewhere safe."
G["We named him Dranosh - It means \"Heart of Draenor\" in orcish. I would not let the warlocks take him. My boy would be safe, hidden away by the elders of Garadar."]="We named him Dranosh - It means \"Heart of Draenor\" in orcish. I would not let the warlocks take him. My boy would be safe, hidden away by the elders of Garadar."
G["We need a cold pint over here! Stat!"]="Aqui precisamos de uma pinta fria! Agora mesmo!"
G["We need a great number of copper bars, $c. The upcoming war at Ahn'Qiraj is going to use up a lot of metal for weapons, armor and whatnot. I'm told that the Horde alone needs to collect $1998w copper bars. As of now we have $2018w."]="We need a great number of copper bars, $c. The upcoming war at Ahn'Qiraj is going to use up a lot of metal for weapons, armor and whatnot. I'm told that the Horde alone needs to collect $1998w copper bars. As of now we have $2018w."
G["We need adventurers to assist us, $n. Will you help?"]="We need adventurers to assist us, $n. Will you help?"
G["We need all of our bombs and tools to survive on this deserted island, $n."]="We need all of our bombs and tools to survive on this deserted island, $n."
G["We need better representation from Stormwind.  Our homes are falling to the undead."]="We need better representation from Stormwind.  Our homes are falling to the undead."
G["We need dis land! Da cataclysm destroyed our home!"]="We need dis land! Da cataclysm destroyed our home!"
G["We need help from you and your goblins. Thousand Needles is destroyed! Thalanaar is underwater!"]="We need help from you and your goblins. Thousand Needles is destroyed! Thalanaar is underwater!"
G["We need leadership!"]="Precisamos um líder!"
G["We need more brew. A good place to look might be the pirate ship to the southwest."]="We need more brew. A good place to look might be the pirate ship to the southwest."
G["We need more brew. I think I saw brew guzzling hozen on the mountain peak to the southeast."]="We need more brew. I think I saw brew guzzling hozen on the mountain peak to the southeast."
G["We need more brew. The cave west of here along the beach might have some stashed there."]="Precisamos mais mistura. na caverna ao oeste de aqui, ao lado à praia, poderá haver um pouco."
G["We need more brew. You should search the island to the northwest. I think I saw a beach party over there."]="We need more brew. You should search the island to the northwest. I think I saw a beach party over there."
G["We need more flesh!"]="Precisamos mais carne!"
G["We need more healers at the tents. Recall the priests from the west."]="We need more healers at the tents. Recall the priests from the west."
G["We need more oil! How many times do I have to tell you peons!"]="Precisamos mais óleo! Quantas vezes os o tenho que dizer, peões?"
G["We need more wolves! Come to the stables and help!"]="Precisamos mais lobos! Venha aos estábulos e dê uma mão!"
G["We need oil and lots of it if we're going to get your footbomb uniform running, kid!"]="We need oil and lots of it if we're going to get your footbomb uniform running, kid!"
G["We need some new friends if we're going to survive all of this. Hopefully, the orcs won't just kill you on sight."]="We need some new friends if we're going to survive all of this. Hopefully, the orcs won't just kill you on sight."
G["We need some..."]="Precisamos um pouco de..."
G["We need those pandaren rescued.  If that doesn't happen soon, we're going to have a slew of defectors here going after their loved ones and getting themselves killed!"]="Temos que resgate a esses pandaren. Como não o hagamos pronto, vamos ter a um monte de desertores caminho de uma morte certa à procura dos seus seres queridos!"
G["We need to confirm this data, we don't want to rip apart any more of our facility."]="We need to confirm this data, we don't want to rip apart any more of our facility."
G["We need to dislodge that ship, Korga.  If we help your crewmates, can you help us?"]="Korga, temos que desencalhar esse navio. Se ajudamos ao seu tripulação, nos ajudará?"
G["We need to do right by these people if we want a chance at understanding this land."]="Se queremos entender esta terra, devemos tratar bem a esta gente."
G["We need to do this more often! This so funny... lightning hitting big-tongues everywhere!"]="Temos que fazer isto mais a belo! É tão divertido..."
G["We need to figure out everything there is to know about Cho'gall's mystery weapon before it's too late."]="Temos que saber tudo sobre essa arma misteriosa de Cho'galh antes de que seja tarde demais."
G["We need to figure out everything there is to know about the weapon Cho'gall's working on and we need to do it fast!"]="Temos que saber tudo sobre essa arma na que está trabalhando Cho'galh, e rápido!"
G["We need to figure out what this shadowy group is doing here at Grangol'var Village!"]="Precisamos descobrir o que esse grupo sombrio está fazendo aqui na vila de Grangol'var!"
G["We need to get back to Lantinga and tell him about this place. Hurry it up!"]="Temos que voltar com Lantinga e hablarle deste lugar. Date pressa!"
G["We need to get into the fight. Are you ready?"]="Precisamos entrar na luta. Você está pronto?"
G["We need to get this outpost ready for the push into Sholazar Basin.\n\nDon't just stand there, $c. Go out and represent the Horde with honor and spilled blood!"]="Temos que preparar esta avançado para o ataque à Bacia de Sholazar.\n\nNão te fique aí $gparado: aparo: c; $c. Vê e representar à Horda derramando sangue e com honra!"
G["We need to get this wagon filled by the end of the day.  So back to work with you.  Chop, chop!"]="We need to get this wagon filled by the end of the day.  So back to work with you.  Chop, chop!"
G["We need to get those arrows and get out of here."]="We need to get those arrows and get out of here."
G["We need to give this another try."]="Temos que dar outra oportunidade."
G["We need to keep moving!"]="Temos que seguir!"
G["We need to keep the worgen's attention in the city, Genn.  It's the only shot we have for the survivors to make it to Duskhaven."]="We need to keep the worgen's attention in the city, Genn.  It's the only shot we have for the survivors to make it to Duskhaven."
G["We need to kill all of these cultists and their leaders out here before we can take out the Bastion of Twilight."]="We need to kill all of these cultists and their leaders out here before we can take out the Bastion of Twilight."
G["We need to lighten the load here."]="We need to lighten the load here."
G["We need to make a move now, while we still can!"]="Devemos actuar agora O que podemos!"
G["We need to make for the oasis, $n.\n\nYou about ready to go?"]="Temos que chegar ao oásis, $n.\n\nEstá $gpronto: pronta; para partir?"
G["We need to move quickly! Tyrygosa and her guard have fallen, leaving the temple defenseless. Deathwing's forces must never reach the Dragon Soul or all is lost. The Wyrmrest Accord will aid you in the assault; the siege must be broken!"]="Precisamos nos mover rapidamente! Tyrygosa e sua guarda caíram, deixando o templo indefeso. As forças da Asa da Morte nunca devem alcançar a Alma do Dragão ou tudo estará perdido. O Acordo Wyrmrest o ajudará no assalto; o cerco deve ser quebrado!"
G["We need to regroup, Sergeant! Go to the nearby village."]="We need to regroup, Sergeant! Go to the nearby village."
G["We need to speak to Shen-zin Su and discover how to heal it. And to do that, we need the four elemental spirits returned. Huo was the first."]="We need to speak to Shen-zin Su and discover how to heal it. And to do that, we need the four elemental spirits returned. Huo was the first."
G["We need to stop the Dark Shaman before they become a real threat to Orgrimmar."]="Devemos parar ao Xamã sombrio antes de que se conviertan em uma verdadeira ameaça para Orgrimmar."
G["We need to support one another. They'll target any weakness."]="We need to support one another. They'll target any weakness."
G["We need to take care of everything out here before we can launch the final assault on the Bastion of Twilight."]="We need to take care of everything out here before we can launch the final assault on the Bastion of Twilight."
G["We need to wait for the winds to settle, then make a break for the cover of the far hallway."]="Temos que esperar a que os ventos amainen e tentar chegar à instância do fundo."
G["We need ya, mon."]="A gente precisa de tu, irmão."
G["We need you to send reinforcements to Manaforge Duro, Ardonis.  This is not a request, it's an order."]="We need you to send reinforcements to Manaforge Duro, Ardonis.  This is not a request, it's an order."
G["We need you, $n!  There are worgen everywhere!"]="Precisamos de você, $n! Há huargen por todas partes!"
G["We need your help hunting this traitor down.  Are you willing?"]="Precisamos de você para atrapar ao traidor. Nos ajudará?"
G["We need your help, $c.  We've fought tooth and nail to get here, but the naga keep coming."]="We need your help, $c.  We've fought tooth and nail to get here, but the naga keep coming."
G["We never did see eye to eye... Good riddance I say!"]="Nunca nos enfrentamos rosto a rosto... Já era hora!"
G["We never have enough of these rays for the Skyguard.  You're keeping us afloat... literally!"]="We never have enough of these rays for the Skyguard.  You're keeping us afloat... literally!"
G["We not do anything... to them... I no understand."]="We not do anything... to them... I no understand."
G["We not want to die. We want to help though! Come back for us, okay?"]="We not want to die. We want to help though! Come back for us, okay?"
G["We now hide in shadows, hidden from our enemies."]="Agora nos escondemos de nossos inimigos nas sombras."
G["We now hold the wisdom of the Winterax, $n. This power can be yours for a short time should you so desire."]="Agora temos a sabedoria do Machado Invernal, $n. Este poder pode ser seu durante um curto período de tempo se assim o deseja."
G["We now know what must be done. I will deliver this news to King Varian and Highlord Fordring."]="Agora sabemos que devemos fazer. Lhes darei estas notícia ao rei Varian e ao alto senhor Vadín."
G["We now prepare to lay siege to the city and bring the perpetrators of this unforgivable crime to justice."]="We now prepare to lay siege to the city and bring the perpetrators of this unforgivable crime to justice."
G["We number in the millions! Your efforts are wasted..."]="We number in the millions! Your efforts are wasted..."
G["We obey, blood guard. For the Horde!"]="Obedecemos, guarda de sangue. pela Horda!"
G["We of Darnassus look forward to competing in the tournament."]="Nós, de Darnassus, esperamos competir no torneio."
G["We of Gilneas show little patience for outsiders."]="Os gilneanos temos pouca paciência com os de fosse."
G["We of the Brotherhood of the Light are not as lenient as our brethren when it comes to meting justice to those that would do this world wrong."]="Nós da Irmandade da Luz não somos tão indulgentes quanto nossos irmãos quando se trata de encontrar justiça para aqueles que fariam mal este mundo."
G["We of the Horde have done all that we can to prepare for the upcoming war at Ahn'Qiraj. Now we wait, $c, for the Alliance to do the same. Once they are done we will all transport our war materiel to Cenarion Hold in Silithus."]="We of the Horde have done all that we can to prepare for the upcoming war at Ahn'Qiraj. Now we wait, $c, for the Alliance to do the same. Once they are done we will all transport our war materiel to Cenarion Hold in Silithus."
G["We offer a mighty champion, a capable $c, an honorable $r.  We present, $n."]="Oferecemos um poderoso campeão, $gun: uma; $c capaz, $gun: uma; $r honrado. Presentamos a $n."
G["We ogres are not all bad."]="Nós os ogros não ser tão maus."
G["We ogres were once lost..."]="We ogres were once lost..."
G["We only have to work crunch time for a few more weeks.  At least thats what they tell us..."]="Somente temos que trabalhar com esta intensidade umas quantas semanas mais. Ao menos isso é o que nos dizem..."
G["We only want to be left alone. Why is that so difficult to understand?"]="Somente queremos que nos deixem em paz. Por que é tão difícil de entender?"
G["We only wish to know why the wildkin guard this area..."]="We only wish to know why the wildkin guard this area..."
G["We openly deal with the ethereal, ignorant of their true intentions. Could we be aiding in the preparation of our own demise?"]="We openly deal with the ethereal, ignorant of their true intentions. Could we be aiding in the preparation of our own demise?"
G["We orcs are usually a private people, but lately, no one's been hiding their feelings."]="Nós, orcs, geralmente somos um povo privado, mas ultimamente, ninguém esconde seus sentimentos."
G["We ought to leave Crowley in prison with those beasts!"]="Deveríamos encerrar a Crowley com essas beast!"
G["We overheard their orders... no survivors..."]="Temos ouvi seus ordens... Nenhum sobrevivente..."
G["We owe you a debt of gratitude $n."]="Te devemos nossa gratidão $n!"
G["We owe you a debt that will be hard to repay, $n."]="Te devemos um favor que resultará difícil de devolver, $n."
G["We owe you a great deal for the part you have played in the destiny of our flight."]="Te devemos muito pelo papel que tem jogado no destino de nosso Voo."
G["We owe you a great debt, $r."]="Estamos em grande dívida com você, $r."
G["We owe you a great debt."]="Estamos em dívida com você."
G["We paint our faces with the ash to send a message to new enemies - a declaration to those who fear and revile us as monsters."]="We paint our faces with the ash to send a message to new enemies - a declaration to those who fear and revile us as monsters."
G["We pandaren are no strangers to dealing with tyrants. The coming battle will try your souls. May the celestials guide your actions."]="Nós pandarens sabemos como é lidar com tiranos. A batalha que seguirá testará suas almas. Que os celestiais guiem suas ações."
G["We pandaren are such a peaceful race, but we do appreciate a good brawl every now and again!"]="Os pandaren somos uma raça pacífica, mas de vez em quando nos gosta uma boa luta."
G["We pandaren do not know."]="Nós pandarens não sabemos."
G["We pandaren work best on a full stomach, $p. Be sure to keep our table full!"]="Os pandaren trabalhamos melhor com o estômago cheio, $p. Certifique-se de que a mesa está repleta!"
G["We passed the savings on to us."]="We passed the savings on to us."
G["We pay the mercs to get us out there, or our troops get no reinforcements."]="We pay the mercs to get us out there, or our troops get no reinforcements."
G["We people of the Lower City had a rather extensive spy network set up in the Shadow Labyrinth until recently.\n\nNow they're all dead except me and To'gun."]="We people of the Lower City had a rather extensive spy network set up in the Shadow Labyrinth until recently.\n\nNow they're all dead except me and To'gun."
G["We performed da ancient rites..."]="Nós realizamos os ritos antigos..."
G["We pillage, we plunder, we steal sheep and fight, wolf out, me 'earties, aaa-ooo!"]="We pillage, we plunder, we steal sheep and fight, wolf out, me 'earties, aaa-ooo!"
G["We plaguebringers tend to be slightly more practical than the average apothecary.  After all, we deal with the logistics of deploying the plague.\n\nThat doesn't mean our theoretical background isn't rock solid.  We just prefer... hands on tasks."]="We plaguebringers tend to be slightly more practical than the average apothecary.  After all, we deal with the logistics of deploying the plague.\n\nThat doesn't mean our theoretical background isn't rock solid.  We just prefer... hands on tasks."
G["We plant the vegetables.  Our vegetables are eaten by the rabbit.  The rabbit is devoured by the wolf.  The wolf is slain by us.  We take the meat and hide from the wolf's corpse.  It's that Magic Circle of life, or whatever you call it.  \nNow go see Telonis in the Cenarion Enclave to get started and let me return to my duties."]="We plant the vegetables.  Our vegetables are eaten by the rabbit.  The rabbit is devoured by the wolf.  The wolf is slain by us.  We take the meat and hide from the wolf's corpse.  It's that Magic Circle of life, or whatever you call it.  \nNow go see Telonis in the Cenarion Enclave to get started and let me return to my duties."
G["We practitioners of the arcane and elemental ways follow a never ending path of discovery. Is that why you seek my counsel? You wish further training?"]="Nós, praticantes dos caminhos arcano e elementar, seguimos um caminho interminável de descoberta. É por isso que você procura meu conselho? Deseja mais treinamento?"
G["We present to you, $n.  One of the finest $cs we have seen in action."]="Os presentamos a $n. $gUno: Uma; $c $gdigno: digna; de ser $gvisto: visão; em ação."
G["We protect the waters. From greed, from darkness."]="We protect the waters. From greed, from darkness."
G["We protect this airship on its way from Orgrimmar to Grom'gol base camp in Stranglethorn Vale."]="Protegemos esta aeronave no caminho de Orgrimmar para o acampamento base de Grom'gol, em Stranglethorn Vale."
G["We protected Gilneas from the Scourge.  We protected Gilneas during the Northgate rebellion.  We will protect Gilneas from whatever this new threat may be."]="We protected Gilneas from the Scourge.  We protected Gilneas during the Northgate rebellion.  We will protect Gilneas from whatever this new threat may be."
G["We put a whole town... in a tiny little box!"]="Colocar toda uma cidade... em uma caixa minúscula!"
G["We put together some sweet custom horns for these things. Enjoy!"]="We put together some sweet custom horns for these things. Enjoy!"
G["We read you. Comin' in hot."]="Positivo. Vamos cair em cima."
G["We really must perfect a way to deal with those smelly Shadowpine trolls!"]="Nós mesmo precisamos de aperfeiçoar uma maneira de lidar com aqueles trolls fedorentos de Shadowpine!"
G["We really must perfect a way to deal with those smelly Shadowpine trolls.\n\nOh, no offense, $c.\n\n<The apothecary grins innocently and shrugs.>"]="We really must perfect a way to deal with those smelly Shadowpine trolls.\n\nOh, no offense, $c.\n\n<The apothecary grins innocently and shrugs.>"
G["We really not like it here. Maybe come find us when you done."]="We really not like it here. Maybe come find us when you done."
G["We really should fix this fence soon."]="Deveríamos reparar esta perto quanto antes."
G["We received Brann's message, and we have begun preparations."]="We received Brann's message, and we have begun preparations."
G["We reclaiming our land, Gurubashi land.  An' we gonna kill anyone dat get in our way."]="We reclaiming our land, Gurubashi land.  An' we gonna kill anyone dat get in our way."
G["We remain unscathed."]="We remain unscathed."
G["We remember this visit, yes we do. Never forget what you learn from your new friend, little Roo. You got great future ahead."]="Recordaremos esta visite, sim. Nunca esqueça o que tem aprendido do seu $gnuevo amigo: nova amiga;, pequeno Lito. Te espera um grande futuro."
G["We require da help of allies on da islands.\n\nZen'tabra has been watching over da animals of de Islands for some time now.  We'd need her help and da help of da animal creatures.\n\nBwonsamdi is a powerful loa dat controls de spirits of de dead on da islands.  His blessing is crucial for our attack.\n\nOnce our allies have joined us, Zalazane and his army of mind-controlled trolls will have no chance!  Then, da Echo Isles will be de Darkspears!"]="We require da help of allies on da islands.\n\nZen'tabra has been watching over da animals of de Islands for some time now.  We'd need her help and da help of da animal creatures.\n\nBwonsamdi is a powerful loa dat controls de spirits of de dead on da islands.  His blessing is crucial for our attack.\n\nOnce our allies have joined us, Zalazane and his army of mind-controlled trolls will have no chance!  Then, da Echo Isles will be de Darkspears!"
G["We require your aid."]="precisamos da sua ajuda."
G["We return to when we lost our way. You... are very kind."]="We return to when we lost our way. You... are very kind."
G["We return!"]="We return!"
G["We ride on your command!"]="We ride on your command!"
G["We ride!"]="We ride!"
G["We ride! For the Fel Horde! For Victory!"]="We ride! For the Fel Horde! For Victory!"
G["We risked everything, but we did it. Shen-zin Su will be okay."]="Arriscamos tudo, mas conseguimos. Shen-zi Su ficará bem."
G["We rode off down the canyon, careful to avoid falling rocks."]="We rode off down the canyon, careful to avoid falling rocks."
G["We rowdy!"]="Peleamos!"
G["We run circles around you! We so good!"]="Nós correr em círculos ao redor de ti! Nós muito bons!"
G["We sacked the town?"]="Temos saqueado o povo?"
G["We sail to a virgin island, a gift from Azeroth to the Horde!"]="We sail to a virgin island, a gift from Azeroth to the Horde!"
G["We sally forth in search of the dragons' despicable broodmother.  Follow me, squire!"]="Partimos à procura da vil mãe de linagem dos dragões. Siga-me, escudeiro!"
G["We saved. You nice, dryskin."]="Nós salvados. Você simpático, pelesseca."
G["We see a flicker of flame. It seems far, but we know it to be close."]="We see a flicker of flame. It seems far, but we know it to be close."
G["We see strange ships. These are not mogu ships.\n\nWho are the invaders? What do they want? What do they taste like?"]="We see strange ships. These are not mogu ships.\n\nWho are the invaders? What do they want? What do they taste like?"
G["We seek the wisdom of the Crane to explain the visions we have been having.\n\nMantid! Mantid assaulting our homes, flying over the wall and attacking in force.\n\nSuch dreams are expected, living so close to the wall.\n\nBut lately, they have been most insistent."]="We seek the wisdom of the Crane to explain the visions we have been having.\n\nMantid! Mantid assaulting our homes, flying over the wall and attacking in force.\n\nSuch dreams are expected, living so close to the wall.\n\nBut lately, they have been most insistent."
G["We seem to have awakened a spirit of some kind."]="Parece que temos despertado a um espírito."
G["We serve Stormwind faithfully, my lady!"]="Servimos fielmente a Ventobravo, meu senhora!"
G["We serve Thorim, sister."]="Servimos Thorim, irmã."
G["We serve Thrall with great pride.  We'll travel as far as is needed to vanquish the enemy."]="Servimos Thrall com muito orgulho. Viajaremos o quanto for necessário para derrotar o inimigo."
G["We serve the light unquestioningly. Perhaps you might be a bit more curious about our purpose?"]="Servimos a luz inquestionavelmente. Talvez você esteja um pouco mais curioso sobre o nosso propósito?"
G["We serve the world's TRUE masters! When their rule begins, we will share in their glory!"]="Nós servimos aos verdadeiros amos do mundo! Quando comience seu reinado, compartiremos seu glória!"
G["We serve until death, and sometimes after that."]="Servimos até a morte, e a vezes inclusive depois."
G["We set up a small camp in the hills above the jinyu village."]="Establecimos um pequeno acampamento nas colinas, sobre a aldeia jinyu."
G["We set up camp for the night. Rell split up responsibilities."]="We set up camp for the night. Rell split up responsibilities."
G["We set up this area to practice fire fighting.  You never know when the town will be imperiled!"]="Montamos essa área para praticar o combate a incêndios. Você nunca sabe quando a cidade estará em perigo!"
G["We shall be in your debt, $c.  Look for Donal Osgood in the Hall of Arms.  He will be more than happy to aid you in your journey to Arathi Basin."]="Estaremos em dívida com você, $c. Busca a Donal Osbien na Salão de Armas. Estará encantado de ajudar você no seu viagna a Bacia Arathi."
G["We shall be needing more blood for the master soon..."]="Talvez pronto necesitemos mais sangue para o mestre…"
G["We shall be reunited once more, my love..."]="We shall be reunited once more, my love..."
G["We shall claim victory for Warchief Garrosh!"]="Reclamaremos a vitória em nome do Chefe de Guerra Garrosh!"
G["We shall crush Shai Hu, together!"]="Juntos aplastaremos a Shai Hu!"
G["We shall crush these feeble beings!"]="Aplastaremos a estes fracos seres!"
G["We shall crush what remains of them and lay claim to this land."]="Aplastaremos o que que de eles e reclamaremos a ilha."
G["We shall dispel you from this land!"]="Os expulsaremos desta terra!"
G["We shall earn our deaths at the very least!"]="We shall earn our deaths at the very least!"
G["We shall face the Firelord and drive every ember of his being out of our realm!"]="Nos enfrentaremos ao Senhor do Fogo e expulsaremos de nosso reino cada brasa do seu ser!"
G["We shall hunt our foes."]="Daremos caça a nossos inimigos."
G["We shall not fail you Sir!"]="Não lhe falharemos, senhor!"
G["We shall persevere."]="Nós vamos perseverar."
G["We shall reign over Pandaria once more!"]="Reinaremos sobre Pandaria uma vez mais!"
G["We shall rise again!"]="We shall rise again!"
G["We shall rout all traitors to the Horde!"]="Identificaremos a todos os traidores da Horda!"
G["We shall sail for distant Azshara. There, I will forge a new trade empire. One that will crush the Steamwheedle Cartel! And I shall carve my likeness upon that distant land's mountains. All will pay tribute to me!"]="We shall sail for distant Azshara. There, I will forge a new trade empire. One that will crush the Steamwheedle Cartel! And I shall carve my likeness upon that distant land's mountains. All will pay tribute to me!"
G["We shall see how much punishment these invaders can stand."]="We shall see how much punishment these invaders can stand."
G["We shall see how you fare against the Vor'thik without the wind at your back..."]="We shall see how you fare against the Vor'thik without the wind at your back..."
G["We shall see if you are a worthy opponent!"]="Veremos se é um oponente digno!"
G["We shall see if you are so defiant after we start breaking your bones."]="We shall see if you are so defiant after we start breaking your bones."
G["We shall see, $C."]="Veremos, $C."
G["We shall see."]="Já o veremos."
G["We shall see. Let us weaken him, my friends!"]="Já veremos. Debilitémoslo, amigos!"
G["We shall take up this grim task in high spirits, and be sure that our cause will not be suffered to fail.  Welcome the aid of your brethren, and of your once heated foes - let us all go forward together with our united strength, and know victory this day!"]="We shall take up this grim task in high spirits, and be sure that our cause will not be suffered to fail.  Welcome the aid of your brethren, and of your once heated foes - let us all go forward together with our united strength, and know victory this day!"
G["We shall triumph!"]="Triunfaremos!"
G["We shall, Sylvanas..."]="O faremos, Sylvanas…"
G["We shame our ancestors. We shame those lost to us... forgive me, Reginald."]="We shame our ancestors. We shame those lost to us... forgive me, Reginald."
G["We share a common enemy, Lady Proudmoore. Nothing more."]="Temos um inimigo comum, Lady Jaina. Nada mais."
G["We share a common enemy, Regent Lord, nothing more."]="Temos um inimigo comum, Senhor regente. Nada mais."
G["We shou-- oh most unluckiest of days! What is THAT!?"]="Deberíam... Por toda a mal sorte! Que é isso?!"
G["We should attack them now, Ban, while their eyes are set upon the gates of Kun-Lai."]="Deveríamos atacar agora, Ban, enquanto estão concetrados nas portões de Kun-Lai."
G["We should attend the next burning of the Wickerman."]="We should attend the next burning of the Wickerman."
G["We should be taking the fight to the hozen, not stalling out of fear."]="We should be taking the fight to the hozen, not stalling out of fear."
G["We should be uniting the Ogre clans, not fighting each other."]="We should be uniting the Ogre clans, not fighting each other."
G["We should drink some tiger blood. Then we'd surely be winning!"]="Deveríamos beber sangue de tigres. Assim nos aseguraríamos a vitória!"
G["We should fire another signal flare.  Perhaps we will get more help from Ebon Watch."]="Deveríamos disparar outra bengala de aviso. Talvez nos chegue mais ajuda desdo Posto de Vigilância de Ébano."
G["We should get moving. That Honeybrew isn't going to find itself!"]="We should get moving. That Honeybrew isn't going to find itself!"
G["We should get out of here. I need to renew!"]="Deveríamos sair de aqui. Preciso Renovar."
G["We should go explore the rest of the faire!"]="Deveríamos explorar o resto da feira."
G["We should go to Moonglade to see the druids' great festival of the moon."]="Deveríamos ir ao Clareira da Lua para ver o grande festival da lua dos druidas."
G["We should go trick or treating later."]="Deveríamos jogar a truco ou trato mais tarde."
G["We should have been here... we should have stopped this from happening."]="Deveríamos haver estado aqui… deveríamos haver prevenido isto."
G["We should have seen this coming. The corruption has been spreading for quite some time."]="Deveríamos ter previsto isso. A corrupção está se espalhando há algum tempo."
G["We should join this fleet, captain. The admiral's allies are worthy."]="We should join this fleet, captain. The admiral's allies are worthy."
G["We should just leave.  Is this what we came to Outland for?"]="We should just leave.  Is this what we came to Outland for?"
G["We should let Elder Shaopai know and then plan our next move."]="Deveríamos informar ao ancestral Shaopai e decidir que faremos depois."
G["We should move now.  See you at the Wild Overlook."]="We should move now.  See you at the Wild Overlook."
G["We should move out, $n. Up the ramp and then straight to Master Shaw."]="We should move out, $n. Up the ramp and then straight to Master Shaw."
G["We should never have come along."]="Não deveríamos haver vindo nunca."
G["We should never have traveled through the Rivenwood. Everyone knows this!"]="Nunca debimos haver viajado pelo Floresta Fendido. Tudo o mundo o sabe!"
G["We should not fight here. Not like this!"]="Não deveríamos lutar aqui. Não assim!"
G["We should not let those who bear the Curse walk among us.  It's just not right."]="We should not let those who bear the Curse walk among us.  It's just not right."
G["We should not peer into the spirit realm..."]="Não deveríamos fisgar no mundo dos espíritos..."
G["We should return... I am sure my skills will be needed at my cousin's village. And... we must prepare a funeral for those we have lost."]="Deveríamos voltar. Estou certo de que tomarão falta meus habilidades na aldeia de meu primo. E... devemos celebrar um funeral por nossos mortos."
G["We should run around and stomp on all the houses!"]="Deveríamos ir correndo e dar baixo todas as casas!"
G["We should sabotage the siege weapons toward the bow. Then we will go below decks and find the captain."]="We should sabotage the siege weapons toward the bow. Then we will go below decks and find the captain."
G["We should sell these apples, but we will not allow peole to eat them.  Oh no!  We will sell apples to our friends, and they shall bring the fight to the fruit vendor for me!"]="We should sell these apples, but we will not allow peole to eat them.  Oh no!  We will sell apples to our friends, and they shall bring the fight to the fruit vendor for me!"
G["We should stay here for only as long as it is necessary, $c."]="We should stay here for only as long as it is necessary, $c."
G["We should strike now. I'll tear them apart!"]="Deveríamos atacar agora. Os farei pedaços!"
G["We should take action! While our leaders waggle their tongues, I could have slain ten yaungol."]="Deveríamos fazer algo! Enquanto nossos líderes não deixam de falar, eu poderá haver terminado já com dez yaungol."
G["We should talk, pandaren."]="Temos que falar, pandaren."
G["We should tell the Admiral."]="Deveríamos informar ao almirante."
G["We should totally have a pants-off dance-off!"]="Oh, si, definitivamente deveríamos jogar a dançar enquanto nos quitamos a roupa!"
G["We shouldn't have left so many behind at Valgarde. Admiral Keller, that insufferable egomaniac!\n\nHow am I to fulfill my orders with so few? I need enough men to stay here at the keep and still properly garrison Fort Wildervar when it's ready!\n\nAt least we have a hope of dealing with our problems now that you're here."]="We shouldn't have left so many behind at Valgarde. Admiral Keller, that insufferable egomaniac!\n\nHow am I to fulfill my orders with so few? I need enough men to stay here at the keep and still properly garrison Fort Wildervar when it's ready!\n\nAt least we have a hope of dealing with our problems now that you're here."
G["We showed that one!"]="Assim aprenderá!"
G["We sniff 'em an' mark 'em and rip 'em to chow, sing out, me 'earties: aaaa-ooo!"]="We sniff 'em an' mark 'em and rip 'em to chow, sing out, me 'earties: aaaa-ooo!"
G["We so lucky."]="Somos muito afortunados."
G["We sorry... going home so not die now. We so sorry!"]="We sorry... going home so not die now. We so sorry!"
G["We span the universe, as countless as the stars!"]="Abarcamos o universo, somos tantos como as estrelas!"
G["We spent days trying to find this one in Sholazar Basin. Welcome to the jungle! It's Mazhareen!"]="We spent days trying to find this one in Sholazar Basin. Welcome to the jungle! It's Mazhareen!"
G["We spoke of your Warchief. His inner conflicts and his outer conquests."]="Falamos do Chefe Guerreiro. Dos seus conflitos interiores e das suas conquistas externas."
G["We stand at the brink of victory, my friends. Initiate Phase III: Into the tunnels!"]="A vitória está perto, amigos. Iniciar fase 3: aos túneis!"
G["We stand behind Dezco and his choices. We will stand against the mogu, the saurok, the sha, even the warchief of the Horde. We will protect this Vale to the last, if necessary."]="We stand behind Dezco and his choices. We will stand against the mogu, the saurok, the sha, even the warchief of the Horde. We will protect this Vale to the last, if necessary."
G["We stand by your side, friend.  This battle is not yours alone."]="Estamos com você, pandaren. Esta lucha nos incumbe a todos."
G["We stand in an undiscovered paradise as ancient as the titans themselves and you want to go to war?"]="We stand in an undiscovered paradise as ancient as the titans themselves and you want to go to war?"
G["We stand in the heart of Beth'tilac's breeding ground. Beyond those pillars to the north, her brood awaits. They will defend her young relentlessly."]="We stand in the heart of Beth'tilac's breeding ground. Beyond those pillars to the north, her brood awaits. They will defend her young relentlessly."
G["We stand on the brink of destruction. We must reconsider this rash course of action."]="Estamos ao borda da destruição. Devemos meditar bem sobre a direção que temos tomado."
G["We stand ready to defend the Eye!"]="Estamos prontos para defenda ao Olho!"
G["We stand together with the Alliance, $r. An evil, so old that the world has forgotten it, seeks to engulf us all; first on Kalimdor and then the rest of Azeroth. It is driven by a hatred of all things born of the great Shapers: The eternal Titans.\n\nWe are all that stand in the way of C'Thun's armies. We will strike first and bring down the forces of Ahn'Qiraj. Let all of Azeroth quake at the combined might of the Horde and Alliance.\n\nThe war effort needs you!"]="We stand together with the Alliance, $r. An evil, so old that the world has forgotten it, seeks to engulf us all; first on Kalimdor and then the rest of Azeroth. It is driven by a hatred of all things born of the great Shapers: The eternal Titans.\n\nWe are all that stand in the way of C'Thun's armies. We will strike first and bring down the forces of Ahn'Qiraj. Let all of Azeroth quake at the combined might of the Horde and Alliance.\n\nThe war effort needs you!"
G["We stand together.  We will never fall!"]="We stand together.  We will never fall!"
G["We stand united as sons of Cenarion, thanks to you.\n\nYour deeds here shall live on as long as our clans draw breath, $n!"]="We stand united as sons of Cenarion, thanks to you.\n\nYour deeds here shall live on as long as our clans draw breath, $n!"
G["We still go through the motions, but the feast of Winter Veil feels empty now. In Orgrimmar they have the true celebration."]="Ainda seguimos os movimentos, mas a festa do Véu de Inverno parece vazia agora. Em Orgrimmar, eles têm a verdadeira celebração."
G["We still have forces in that tower!"]="Ainda temos gente em essa torre!"
G["We still have so much to learn."]="Ainda temos tanto que aprender."
G["We still here cuz $n help Ogri'la!"]="Seguimos aqui porque $n ajuda a Ogri'a!"
G["We still stand here only because of $n's help."]="Seguiremos aqui Obrigado à ajuda de $n."
G["We stirred up a great deal of trouble, $n. But it was worth it."]="We stirred up a great deal of trouble, $n. But it was worth it."
G["We stop here. Everyone out!"]="Nos paramos aqui. Tudo o mundo fosse!"
G["We stopped when we found a strange fallen tree."]="Nos detuvimos ao encontrar um estranho árvore caído."
G["We struck liquid gold with this place, $c! All we had to do was tear down some useless trees and clear out some pesky animals!"]="Temos encontrado ouro líquido neste lugar, $c! E somente temos tido que talar uns quantos árvores inútiles e dar a uns animais molestos!"
G["We stuck with the cargo 'til the end, which came, well, right after the start..."]="Nos quedamos com a mercadoria até o fim, que foi, bom, logo depois do início..."
G["We succeeded in taking the Sanctum.  We can continue to convert sentries and use them as guards at other tactical locations."]="Conseguimos pegar o Santuário. Podemos seguir a converter sentinelas e usá-as como guardas em outros locais táticos."
G["We suffered a lot of casualties when capturing your next challenge!"]="Sofremos muitas baixas ao capturar seu próximo desafio!"
G["We support mystical tradesmen by carrying a limited selection of arcane trade supplies. Are you looking for something in particular?"]="We support mystical tradesmen by carrying a limited selection of arcane trade supplies. Are you looking for something in particular?"
G["We survived!"]="Hemos sobrevivido!"
G["We suspect that in order to preserve their fortune and hold of the land - well past their lifespan - the Barovs made a deal with a powerful human mage named Kel'Thuzad.\n\n<Eva shudders.>\n\nFrom this deal sprang the school of necromancy: A place which bore the Cult of the Damned and would become their capital.\n\nAs each week passed, the house Barov became more and more decrepit...\n\nDark beings began to take residence in the various wings of the house. Upkeep became impossible... and disgusting."]="We suspect that in order to preserve their fortune and hold of the land - well past their lifespan - the Barovs made a deal with a powerful human mage named Kel'Thuzad.\n\n<Eva shudders.>\n\nFrom this deal sprang the school of necromancy: A place which bore the Cult of the Damned and would become their capital.\n\nAs each week passed, the house Barov became more and more decrepit...\n\nDark beings began to take residence in the various wings of the house. Upkeep became impossible... and disgusting."
G["We take these missing person reports very seriously, ma'am."]="Nos tomamos estes informes de pessoas desaparecidas muito em sério, senhora."
G["We take what we wish!"]="We take what we wish!"
G["We teeter on the brink of annihilation. Is there no one left to help us?"]="Estamos ao borda da aniquilação. É que não há ninguém que possa nos ajudar?"
G["We tell his story, so that he will always be remembered."]="Nós temos seu história para que seja recordado sempre."
G["We tell orphan matron on you!"]="We tell orphan matron on you!"
G["We thank you mortal.  The ocean's will is to be free."]="We thank you mortal.  The ocean's will is to be free."
G["We thank you, Aroom.  And we thank $n.  We return to Elune... finally."]="We thank you, Aroom.  And we thank $n.  We return to Elune... finally."
G["We thank you, friend of the blue dragonflight."]="Te damos as Obrigado, amigo do Voo Azul."
G["We think that the unique qualities of the water in the Valley is the main reason for the abundance in the region."]="We think that the unique qualities of the water in the Valley is the main reason for the abundance in the region."
G["We toil day in and day out, and for what?\n\nThere's no point to any of it..."]="Trabalhamos muito duro dia si e dia também, e para que?\n\nNão tem nenhum sentido..."
G["We took back our city... we took back..."]="Recuperamos nossa cidade... Recuperamos..."
G["We took her to the Commander with hopes that the druids of the Circle could fix her up. Sure enough, they were able to wake her up. We figured our business with the Circle was done and we could get back to work.\n\nA few weeks passed and everything was going fine. Brann was still around back then so we had a bit of order in our work structure. Then one day, out of the blue, she appeared back at our camp."]="We took her to the Commander with hopes that the druids of the Circle could fix her up. Sure enough, they were able to wake her up. We figured our business with the Circle was done and we could get back to work.\n\nA few weeks passed and everything was going fine. Brann was still around back then so we had a bit of order in our work structure. Then one day, out of the blue, she appeared back at our camp."
G["We took your land and now we take your food."]="Os arrebatamos a terra e agora a comida."
G["We travel long long way. Now Shado-Pan say they do not want our goods. This is most strange."]="Temos vindo desde muito longe. Agorao Shadopan diz que não quer nossos bens. É estranho."
G["We travel where the winds take us, good $r. Would you like to listen for a while?"]="Viajamos onde nos levou vento, $r. Querrías escutar um tempo?"
G["We traveled south until night fell. Shokia spoke:"]="Viajamos para o sul até a noite. Shokia disse:"
G["We travelled through angry hozen, rampaging yeti, and unclean yaks to get here. Now the Shado-Pan act like we are strangers.\n\nThis very bad fortune indeed."]="We travelled through angry hozen, rampaging yeti, and unclean yaks to get here. Now the Shado-Pan act like we are strangers.\n\nThis very bad fortune indeed."
G["We turn eyes now ta de final prize - Orgrimmar."]="Agora volvemos a vih'ta ao prêmio fim: Orgrimmar."
G["We typically shy away from eating the flesh of beasts, but our predicament requires that we make exception."]="We typically shy away from eating the flesh of beasts, but our predicament requires that we make exception."
G["We upgraded these with some advanced armor plating - they should be able to take quite a beating now!"]="We upgraded these with some advanced armor plating - they should be able to take quite a beating now!"
G["We use frost to chill their bones and bring their movement to a halt."]="Usamos gelo para congelar seus ossos e parar seu movimento."
G["We use many animal pelts and skins in our creations."]="Em nossas criações utilizamos muitas peles e pelambres de animais."
G["We used to burn the worgen when we killed them - to be sure that they were dead."]="We used to burn the worgen when we killed them - to be sure that they were dead."
G["We used to roam the seas... 'til that damned King Greymane shut down the harbors in Gilneas!  If it weren't for him, we wouldn't be..."]="We used to roam the seas... 'til that damned King Greymane shut down the harbors in Gilneas!  If it weren't for him, we wouldn't be..."
G["We usually handle this all through the mail..."]="Normalmente solemos fazer isso por correio..."
G["We wait for the next adventurer to come through and we tell him that's the way to go... then after they set off the mines, we just walk in and grab the tools!"]="We wait for the next adventurer to come through and we tell him that's the way to go... then after they set off the mines, we just walk in and grab the tools!"
G["We wait until you ready."]="Esperaremos até que estiver $gpronto: pronta;."
G["We waiting for tour guide."]="Estamos esperando pelo guia turístico."
G["We walk the edge of a precipice. Some of us must be pushed over for the rest of us to continue."]="We walk the edge of a precipice. Some of us must be pushed over for the rest of us to continue."
G["We want another shot at those beasts!"]="Queremos outra chance dessas bestas!"
G["We want answers, Lieutenant! We're entitled to know the truth!"]="Queremos respostas, tenente! Temos direito a saber a verdade!"
G["We want everyone to have fun at Brewfest.  It would also help if we had some people remember it as well.\n\nThese goggles allow anyone to experience what it's like to be drunk, but without the drinking part.  Put the goggles on, and it's like you're drunk!  Take them off, and you're sober!\n\nAre you interested in a pair?"]="We want everyone to have fun at Brewfest.  It would also help if we had some people remember it as well.\n\nThese goggles allow anyone to experience what it's like to be drunk, but without the drinking part.  Put the goggles on, and it's like you're drunk!  Take them off, and you're sober!\n\nAre you interested in a pair?"
G["We want to speak to the magistrate!"]="Queremos falar com o Magistrado!"
G["We war so that our little ones may live to see a better tomorrow! And for them, we destroy the Burning Legion!"]="Lutamos para que nossos pequenos possam ter um futuro melhor. E por eles, destruiremos à Legião Ardente!"
G["We was travelin' east, looking for those horkin' human guys."]="We was travelin' east, looking for those horkin' human guys."
G["We waste our time here just floating about..."]="We waste our time here just floating about..."
G["We watch dem trolls real good!"]="Nós vigilar bem a trolls!"
G["We watched as our homes were razed to the ground."]="We watched as our homes were razed to the ground."
G["We welcome all who wish to join our ranks, but you need some more experience before you can begin. Please come speak to me later."]="Damos a boas-vindas a todos aqueles que querem entrar a nossas fileiras, mas te há falta um pouco mais de experiência para começar. Fala comigo mais adiante."
G["We welcome the opportunity to fight by your side, mighty Thorim."]="Damos a boas-vindas à oportunidade de voltar a lutar ao seu lado, poderoso Thorim."
G["We were afraid you'd been caught, but I wouldn't think of leaving you out of the portal ritual."]="We were afraid you'd been caught, but I wouldn't think of leaving you out of the portal ritual."
G["We were all set to sail into Northrend, but we've noticed a severe number of pests aboard our ship."]="Estávamos todos prontos para navegar em Northrend, mas notamos um número grave de pragas a bordo de nosso navio."
G["We were all trained to strengthen our minds against the sha's influence, but it is stronger than we imagined."]="We were all trained to strengthen our minds against the sha's influence, but it is stronger than we imagined."
G["We were attacked on the road across Transborea by necromancers. What was I to do?"]="We were attacked on the road across Transborea by necromancers. What was I to do?"
G["We were called.\n\nWe sailed deep into uncharted waters, at first on orders from High Chieftan Baine Bloodhoof.\n\nIt was my wife Leza whose visions gave us a course to sail by.\n\nBut when we saw the wall of mists, we all began to feel the call like a voice on the wind. North. The voice calls for us to travel north.\n\nWe came ashore, dismantled our ship, and sailed up river by canoe until we hit the cliff you see before us."]="We were called.\n\nWe sailed deep into uncharted waters, at first on orders from High Chieftan Baine Bloodhoof.\n\nIt was my wife Leza whose visions gave us a course to sail by.\n\nBut when we saw the wall of mists, we all began to feel the call like a voice on the wind. North. The voice calls for us to travel north.\n\nWe came ashore, dismantled our ship, and sailed up river by canoe until we hit the cliff you see before us."
G["We were created by the mogu. There is no reason not to believe it. Anybody who denies it is ignorant, or living in fantasy.\n\nI refuse to pretend I am a devilsaur. I know what I am. I know where my strength comes from."]="We were created by the mogu. There is no reason not to believe it. Anybody who denies it is ignorant, or living in fantasy.\n\nI refuse to pretend I am a devilsaur. I know what I am. I know where my strength comes from."
G["We were drawn here by visions of this place. But even the visions pale in comparison to the Vale's beauty."]="We were drawn here by visions of this place. But even the visions pale in comparison to the Vale's beauty."
G["We were driven away, Great Spirit. Hexmaster Zalazane took de Isles from us...  drove us mad, made us fight one another. De only trolls left in de Echo Isles are his mindless voodoo slaves."]="We were driven away, Great Spirit. Hexmaster Zalazane took de Isles from us...  drove us mad, made us fight one another. De only trolls left in de Echo Isles are his mindless voodoo slaves."
G["We were duped.  This is definitely not the promised land!"]="We were duped.  This is definitely not the promised land!"
G["We were findin' carp behind the furniture for weeks!"]="We were findin' carp behind the furniture for weeks!"
G["We were fine until we ate from this tainted grain of yours!"]="We were fine until we ate from this tainted grain of yours!"
G["We were fools to entrust an imbecile like Cho'gall with such a sacred duty! I will deal with you intruders myself!"]="We were fools to entrust an imbecile like Cho'gall with such a sacred duty! I will deal with you intruders myself!"
G["We were fools to take up arms against each other, Darius.  The worgen would've never stood a chance."]="We were fools to take up arms against each other, Darius.  The worgen would've never stood a chance."
G["We were forced to retreat. Thermaplugg continues to hide behind the radiation, sending his crony, Crushcog, to harass us here on the surface."]="We were forced to retreat. Thermaplugg continues to hide behind the radiation, sending his crony, Crushcog, to harass us here on the surface."
G["We were fortunate enough to find the Vale after it opened its gates. We sought refuge, and have found safe haven.\n\nAre you lost? May I help you find something?"]="Tuvimos a sorte de encontrar o vale pouco depois de que abriera seus portões. Buscamos refúgio e encontramos um lugar certo.\n\nTe perdeu? Precisa que te ajuda encontrar algo?"
G["We were heading west when we received word of the mantid attack and redirected here."]="We were heading west when we received word of the mantid attack and redirected here."
G["We were here to scout for an invasion, but they already knew we were coming."]="We were here to scout for an invasion, but they already knew we were coming."
G["We were hoping you wouldn't surrender peacefully!"]="Esperávamos que não te rindieras sem lutar!"
G["We were in luck to find enough parts to get these babies working again!\nHow can I help you?"]="We were in luck to find enough parts to get these babies working again!\nHow can I help you?"
G["We were investigating the crypt for sha corruption... and everything went horribly wrong.  Our leader, Jin Ironfist, was possessed and began killing everyone.  Even now he is in there looking for more victims."]="We were investigating the crypt for sha corruption... and everything went horribly wrong.  Our leader, Jin Ironfist, was possessed and began killing everyone.  Even now he is in there looking for more victims."
G["We were investigating the temple when a mogu warlord and his retinue arrived.\n\nThose of us not slain immediately were taken prisoner.\n\nI was left for dead and have been hiding here since.\n\nI don't know what the mogu are here for, though it can't be anything good!"]="We were investigating the temple when a mogu warlord and his retinue arrived.\n\nThose of us not slain immediately were taken prisoner.\n\nI was left for dead and have been hiding here since.\n\nI don't know what the mogu are here for, though it can't be anything good!"
G["We were just trying to eat and suddenly zombies started to appear!"]="We were just trying to eat and suddenly zombies started to appear!"
G["We were lucky to meet up with these other Horde survivors. I did not realize that our brethren had washed up elsewhere on this new land."]="Tuvimos sorte de encontrar mais sobreviventes da Horda. Não sabia que nossos irmãos haviam desembarcado em outros pontos desta nova terra."
G["We were making progress with our plague in Undercity.  All of a sudden our strains keep failing!"]="We were making progress with our plague in Undercity.  All of a sudden our strains keep failing!"
G["We were most fortunate to escape, $n. Follow me."]="Temos banido muito afortunados de poder escapar, $n. Siga-me."
G["We were not safe at all. They were waiting for us. Our forces are scattered throughout the swamp, and we are alone behind enemy lines!"]="We were not safe at all. They were waiting for us. Our forces are scattered throughout the swamp, and we are alone behind enemy lines!"
G["We were on our way to Dawn's Blossom for a festival before you arrived! When I imagined fireworks tonight, I didn't expect it to be like this!"]="We were on our way to Dawn's Blossom for a festival before you arrived! When I imagined fireworks tonight, I didn't expect it to be like this!"
G["We were on our way to the Tiger Temple when you caught us. Lucky for you our healer was napping... apparently."]="We were on our way to the Tiger Temple when you caught us. Lucky for you our healer was napping... apparently."
G["We were promised safety! Security!"]="We were promised safety! Security!"
G["We were still goin' north when we stopped near this big ol' clearing."]="Seguíamos rumbo norte quando nos detuvimos em um grande clareira."
G["We were successful, Kalecgos."]="O temos conseguido, Kalecgos."
G["We were to be rewarded for the best work we'd ever done, and we were... with this."]="We were to be rewarded for the best work we'd ever done, and we were... with this."
G["We were working on this wall here and... well, I don't even remember.  Who are you, anyhow?  Where's Gearslip?"]="We were working on this wall here and... well, I don't even remember.  Who are you, anyhow?  Where's Gearslip?"
G["We were.  My new friend here performed stunningly!"]="We were.  My new friend here performed stunningly!"
G["We will act when we know what we need, old friend.  The druids have proven wise and capable of making their own decisions."]="We will act when we know what we need, old friend.  The druids have proven wise and capable of making their own decisions."
G["We will all be tested this day, but we shall prevail."]="We will all be tested this day, but we shall prevail."
G["We will always remember Kargath Bladefist for what he once was to the Horde. He was one of the finest warriors to ever live, even the Alliance recognizes this.\n\nThe Kargath Expeditionary force was named in his honor, and I plan to ensure we live up to his name. We will drive out the Dark Iron Dwarves and claim Blackrock Mountain, and all of the surrounding areas, for the Horde as they so rightfully belong.\n\nYou will be the Warchief's blade against Thaurissan. Wear that honor proudly."]="We will always remember Kargath Bladefist for what he once was to the Horde. He was one of the finest warriors to ever live, even the Alliance recognizes this.\n\nThe Kargath Expeditionary force was named in his honor, and I plan to ensure we live up to his name. We will drive out the Dark Iron Dwarves and claim Blackrock Mountain, and all of the surrounding areas, for the Horde as they so rightfully belong.\n\nYou will be the Warchief's blade against Thaurissan. Wear that honor proudly."
G["We will attack as one!"]="Atacaremos todos juntos!"
G["We will attack from the opposite side, $c. The alliance won't expect a ground assault this quickly. Find me when the slaughter is over."]="We will attack from the opposite side, $c. The alliance won't expect a ground assault this quickly. Find me when the slaughter is over."
G["We will battle along side you until the bitter end, $g sir:ma'am;!"]="Lucharemos ao seu lado até o amargo fim, amigo!"
G["We will battle these fiends, together! Nighthaven's Defenders are also among us. They will fight to the death if asked. Now, quickly, we must drive these aberrations back to the Nightmare. Destroy them all!"]="We will battle these fiends, together! Nighthaven's Defenders are also among us. They will fight to the death if asked. Now, quickly, we must drive these aberrations back to the Nightmare. Destroy them all!"
G["We will battle together to rid this quarry of the Scourge!"]="Lucharemos juntos para librar a esta Pedreira do Flagelo!"
G["We will be at capacity soon enough."]="We will be at capacity soon enough."
G["We will be victorious! Do not relent!"]="We will be victorious! Do not relent!"
G["We will be watching you."]="Os estaremos observando."
G["We will become legend."]="Seremos uma lendas."
G["We will blanket the Vale in your bloody bodies!"]="We will blanket the Vale in your bloody bodies!"
G["We will bring the might of all races to the Lich King, and he will be defeated."]="Faremos cair o poder de todas as raças sobre o Rei Lich, e será derrotou."
G["We will burn your lands!"]="Prenderemos fogo aos seus terras!"
G["We will bury you in your mountain!"]="Os... enterraremos em vueh'tra montanha!"
G["We will carve a path through this wretched place and find a way to enter the Halls of Reflection. I sense powerful magic hidden away within those halls. Magic that could be the key to destroying the Scourge!"]="Nos abriremos passo a através deste espantoso lugar e encontraremos a forma de entrar nas Câmaras de Reflexão. Sinto uma magia poderosa oculta nessas câmaras. Uma magia que poderá ser a importante para destruir a o Flagelo!"
G["We will cause you no trouble. We seek only to continue our research in peace."]="Não te causaremos problemas. Somente queremos seguir com nossa investigação em paz."
G["We will claim this land in the name of the Horde, or die trying!"]="We will claim this land in the name of the Horde, or die trying!"
G["We will cleanse this world in steel and fire!"]="Purificaremos este mundo com fogo e aço!"
G["We will conquer all, for we are the Burning Legion!  Our enemies shall be consumed in flame and crushed beneath our might!"]="We will conquer all, for we are the Burning Legion!  Our enemies shall be consumed in flame and crushed beneath our might!"
G["We will continue to monitor the mogu's activity, $n. However, I am afraid that what lies ahead will require greater strength than you currently possess. Return to us when you have gained more experience."]="Seguiremos controlando a atividade dos mogu, $n, mas me temo que o que nos espera exige uma força da que ainda careces. Volta a vernos quando tenha mais experiência."
G["We will crush Arthas! The Scourge cannot stand up to the might of the Horde!"]="Vamos esmagar Arthas! O Flagelo não suporta a força da Horda!"
G["We will crush the Bladespire clan.  Then we will have Gruul the Dragonkiller's favor!"]="We will crush the Bladespire clan.  Then we will have Gruul the Dragonkiller's favor!"
G["We will cut a swath of destruction through this cursed place and find a way to enter the Halls of Reflection. If there is anything of value to be found here, it will be found in the halls."]="Abriremos uma senda de destruição até esse maldito lugar e encontraremos uma forma de entrar nas Câmaras de Reflexão. Se há algo de coragem aqui, o encontraremos nas câmaras."
G["We will defeat Garrosh and restore the Horde!"]="Derrotaremos a Garrosh e restauraremos a Horda!"
G["We will defeat the Twilight's Hammer wherever they may hide.  Not even the elemental planes will be a safe haven for their kind."]="Derrotaremos o Martelo do Crepúsculo onde quer que eles se escondam. Nem mesmo os planos elementares serão um refúgio certo para a sua espécie."
G["We will defend our lands!"]="Defenderemos nossas terras!"
G["We will demonstrate the limits of power without vision to guide it."]="Veremos quais são os limite do poder sem uma visão que o guíe."
G["We will destroy all who oppose us!"]="Destruiremos a tudo aquele que se oponga a nós!"
G["We will destroy them. Their blood-red blood-will flow freely upon our swords. As we have destroyed the Draenei, so now we will destroy the humans!"]="Os destruiremos. Seu sangue – sangue vermelha fluirá com liberdade sobre nossas espadas. Como temos destruído aos Draeneis, destruiremos aos humanos agora!"
G["We will destroy you, puny creature!"]="Te destruiremos, lamentable criatura!"
G["We will destroy you."]="Os destruiremos."
G["We will die trying!"]="We will die trying!"
G["We will do better, champion. Behold! The Crown of Heaven! My gift to you."]="NÓS faremos melhor. Veja! A Coroa do Céu! Meu presente para você."
G["We will do our best to protect the refugees, but with the mogu pushing into the Vale, it may not remain safe for long."]="We will do our best to protect the refugees, but with the mogu pushing into the Vale, it may not remain safe for long."
G["We will do this with honor, Darion. We will not sink to the levels of the Scourge to be victorious. To do so would make us no better than the monster that we fight to destroy!"]="We will do this with honor, Darion. We will not sink to the levels of the Scourge to be victorious. To do so would make us no better than the monster that we fight to destroy!"
G["We will do what we can, dear sister. We are not warriors, we cannot simply drive the outsiders away."]="We will do what we can, dear sister. We are not warriors, we cannot simply drive the outsiders away."
G["We will double our efforts!"]="We will double our efforts!"
G["We will drive our foes from Silverpine, then bring the tides of war to their very capital!"]="We will drive our foes from Silverpine, then bring the tides of war to their very capital!"
G["We will drive you from our lands!"]="We will drive you from our lands!"
G["We will drive you from the beach. The Pandaren will tremble before our might!"]="We will drive you from the beach. The Pandaren will tremble before our might!"
G["We will enslave the quilboar!"]="We will enslave the quilboar!"
G["We will fail to defend Pandaria."]="Não lograremos defenda Pandaria."
G["We will fight beside you, A'dal."]="Lucharemos ao lado você, A'dal."
G["We will fight them in the alleys, until our knuckles are skinned and bloody and our rapiers lay on the ground shattered."]="We will fight them in the alleys, until our knuckles are skinned and bloody and our rapiers lay on the ground shattered."
G["We will fight them on the streets until the last shot is fired.  And when there's no more ammunition, we'll crush their skulls with the stones that pave our city."]="We will fight them on the streets until the last shot is fired.  And when there's no more ammunition, we'll crush their skulls with the stones that pave our city."
G["We will fight to the last!"]="Nós lutaremos até a última mascote!"
G["We will fight when you are ready, $n."]="Lucharemos quando estiver $gpreparado: preparada;, $n."
G["We will fight when you are ready."]="Lucharemos quando estiver $gpreparado: preparada;."
G["We will fight you until the end, then, Lantresor. We will not stand idly by as you pillage our towns and kill our people."]="Vamos lutar com você até o fim, então, Lantresor. Não ficaremos à toa enquanto você saqueia nossas cidades e mata nosso povo."
G["We will fight you with every fiber of our being - until we are nothing more than dust and debris. We will fight until the end."]="We will fight you with every fiber of our being - until we are nothing more than dust and debris. We will fight until the end."
G["We will find it, and we will remove it.  You have our word!"]="A encontraremos e te a quitaremos. Tem nossa palavra."
G["We will find out."]="Comprobémoslo."
G["We will find the answers here in Pandaria."]="Encontraremos as respostas aqui em Pandária."
G["We will find these words. We will summon your master and we will destroy him."]="Encontraremos essas palavras. Invocaremos ao seu mestre e o destruiremos."
G["We will find what the Master is looking for!  Failure is not an option!"]="We will find what the Master is looking for!  Failure is not an option!"
G["We will find you, monster!"]="Te encontraremos, monstro!"
G["We will finish this another time... son of Grom."]="Terminaremos isto em outro momentos... filho de Grom."
G["We will follow your lead, heroes. The Scourgelord will die this eve."]="Vamos seguir sua liderança, heróis. O Scourgelord vai morrer nesta véspera."
G["We will free the admiral during the dawning."]="We will free the admiral during the dawning."
G["We will give our lives for the Empress without hesitation. She is the light, and without Her our lives will be lost to darkness."]="We will give our lives for the Empress without hesitation. She is the light, and without Her our lives will be lost to darkness."
G["We will give you a swift death!"]="Te daremos uma morte rápida!"
G["We will give you who have fallen another chance. You are not vrykul, so you cannot be held to such a high standard."]="We will give you who have fallen another chance. You are not vrykul, so you cannot be held to such a high standard."
G["We will go about our business now. Good day."]="Agora nos ocuparemos de nossos assuntos. Bons dias."
G["We will grind you under our heels!"]="Te aplastaremos baixo nossas rodas!"
G["We will guard this place, $n, and hope for your safe return."]="Protegeremos este lugar, $n e esperamos que regreses a salvou."
G["We will handle them!"]="Nos ocuparemos de eles!"
G["We will have much good news to report to Lord Taran.\n\nNews of our victory here at Osul Peak will ring gladly in his ears."]="Teremos muitas boas novas que transmitir a lorde Taran.\n\nAs notícia sobre nossa vitória em Cima Osul serão música para os seus ouvidos."
G["We will have revenge... some day."]="Alguns dia obtendremos vingança... algum dia."
G["We will have to regroup quickly if we hope to destroy the alliance."]="We will have to regroup quickly if we hope to destroy the alliance."
G["We will have to work quickly Wakener. This area is not safe."]="Temos que trabalhar depressa, arauto. Esta área não é certa."
G["We will have to work quickly if we want to find the remains."]="We will have to work quickly if we want to find the remains."
G["We will have vengeance!"]="We will have vengeance!"
G["We will hold until the reinforcements come. As long as men with stout hearts are manning the walls and the throne, Stormwind will hold."]="Resistiremos até que cheguem os reforços. Enquanto os homens de coração forte custodien as muralhas e o trono, Ventobravo aguantará."
G["We will hunt this traitor down.  That I promise."]="Atraparemos a esse traidor. O prometo."
G["We will investigate this hut. Perhaps they have seen Alliance survivors."]="Nós investigaremos essa cabanha. Talvez tenham visto sobreviventes da Aliança."
G["We will learn who the greatest brewmaster is.  We know the breweries are up for the challenge.  We would not have invited them otherwise."]="We will learn who the greatest brewmaster is.  We know the breweries are up for the challenge.  We would not have invited them otherwise."
G["We will leave you to your training, Ilthalaine. This is your area of expertise."]="We will leave you to your training, Ilthalaine. This is your area of expertise."
G["We will locate the origin of the Nightmare through the fragments you collected, $n. From there we will pull Eranikus through a rift in the Dream. Steel yourself, $c. We are inviting the embodiment of the Nightmare into our world."]="We will locate the origin of the Nightmare through the fragments you collected, $n. From there we will pull Eranikus through a rift in the Dream. Steel yourself, $c. We are inviting the embodiment of the Nightmare into our world."
G["We will make sure to honor Lin's courage."]="We will make sure to honor Lin's courage."
G["We will make this province safe again. Zhu's legacy will not end with this."]="We will make this province safe again. Zhu's legacy will not end with this."
G["We will make this right, Jaina. Tell your king all that you have learned here."]="Arreglaremos isto, Jaina. Cuéntale ao seu rei o que tem descoberto aqui."
G["We will meet again soon."]="Nos volveremos a ver pronto."
G["We will meet again... Someday."]="Volveremos a nos encontrar... Alguns dia."
G["We will miss you, Antonidas."]="We will miss you, Antonidas."
G["We will move ahead, Kilag."]="Nós vamos avançar, Kilag."
G["We will need Anduin's help to move on the temple. When he's ready, we'll begin."]="We will need Anduin's help to move on the temple. When he's ready, we'll begin."
G["We will need more veteran Shado-Pan among us before we can confront it.  We'll stop at the encampments along the way."]="We will need more veteran Shado-Pan among us before we can confront it.  We'll stop at the encampments along the way."
G["We will need the help of ALL the elements to save Thrall from this place. The lieutenants of Ragnaros will not be nearly as compromising as Cyclonas, Hydrius, or even Therazane."]="Precisamos da ajuda de TODOS os elementos para salvar Thrall deste local. Os tenentes de Ragnaros não serão tão comprometedores quanto Cyclonas, Hydrius ou mesmo Therazane."
G["We will need the strongest the Shado-Pan has to offer for the confrontation with the Sha of Hatred. And it's likely that even then, not all of us will make it out alive."]="We will need the strongest the Shado-Pan has to offer for the confrontation with the Sha of Hatred. And it's likely that even then, not all of us will make it out alive."
G["We will neutralize him and take his route. Let's go!"]="O neutralizaremos e tomaremos seu rota. Vamos!"
G["We will never allow it... We have banished him from our world before and we will banish him again."]="We will never allow it... We have banished him from our world before and we will banish him again."
G["We will never be without power! I have secured our future! Bask in my glory!"]="We will never be without power! I have secured our future! Bask in my glory!"
G["We will never dissipate, mortal... Our fate is tied to Gorefiend..."]="We will never dissipate, mortal... Our fate is tied to Gorefiend..."
G["We will never fail ya!"]="Nunca te falharemos!"
G["We will never fall to these cowards! The Horde stands united against all enemies! Lok'tar Ogar!"]="Nunca sucumbiremos ante esses covardes! A Horda resistirá unida contra todos seus inimigos! Lok'tar Ogar!"
G["We will never forget your bravery, $n. You are always welcome in Wintergarde.\n\nWould you like to make this inn your home?"]="Nunca olvidaremos seu coragem, $n. Sempre será bem-vindo em Invergarde.\n\nTe gostaria estabelecer seu lar nesta estalagem?"
G["We will never stop fighting for Lordaeron. Never..."]="We will never stop fighting for Lordaeron. Never..."
G["We will never surrender our right to rule the destiny of our people!"]="Nunca renunciaremos ao direito a controlar o destino de nosso povo!"
G["We will never yield our defense of the Vale!"]="Nunca renunciaremos a defendao Vale!"
G["We will not allow this to come to pass."]="Não permitiremos que suceda."
G["We will not be caught in the middle of your war for any longer than we can help it. You may stay here and tend to your wounded, but that is the end of our involvment."]="We will not be caught in the middle of your war for any longer than we can help it. You may stay here and tend to your wounded, but that is the end of our involvment."
G["We will not be forgotten, no, no, no..."]="We will not be forgotten, no, no, no..."
G["We will not be stopped!"]="Não nos detendrán!"
G["We will not be swayed from our mission!"]="Ninguém nos apartará de nossa missão!"
G["We will not be the only village to rise against the Thunder King!"]="Não seremos a única aldeia que se ergue contra o Rei do Trovão!"
G["We will not die as slaves... we're Gilneans!"]="We will not die as slaves... we're Gilneans!"
G["We will not fail!"]="Não falharemos!"
G["We will not fail."]="Não falharemos."
G["We will not falter."]="We will not falter."
G["We will not give in to the despair of the dark void. If Her will for us is to perish, then it shall be so."]="Não sucumbiremos ante a desesperação do vazio sombrio. Se Ela deseja que perezcamos, assim o faremos."
G["We will not go quietly into the night! We will not vanish without a fight!"]="Não desapareceremos em silêncio na escuridão! Não nos desvaneceremos sem lutar!"
G["We will not rest until our duties here are done."]="Não descansaremos até cumprir com nosso dever."
G["We will not tolerate those who unleashed the sha upon our land."]="Não toleraremos a aqueles que têm liberado ao sha em nossa terra."
G["We will overcome this.  Do not give into panic."]="We will overcome this.  Do not give into panic."
G["We will overwhelm you before you can react."]="Nós venceremos antes que você consiga reagir."
G["We will pay back the Alliance for their betrayal a thousandfold. We will never forgive and never forget."]="We will pay back the Alliance for their betrayal a thousandfold. We will never forgive and never forget."
G["We will prove our loyalty - to the Council, Ironforge, and the Alliance - here, today, and with our own blood."]="Demostraremos nossa lealdade ao Conselho, a Altaforja e à Aliança; aqui, hoje, e com nossa sangue."
G["We will purge this land!"]="Purgaremos esta terra!"
G["We will push them back, Anachronos. This I vow. Uphold your end of this task. Let not your hands falter as you seal our fates behind the barrier."]="Faremos que retrocedan, Anacronos. O prometo. Complete seu cometido. Não vaciles à hora de encerrar nossos destinos atrás a barrera."
G["We will ravage the living... I mean the Scourge, of course."]="Acabaremos com os vivos... quero dizer com o Flagelo, é claro."
G["We will rebuild our empire on the corpses of our enemies!"]="Reconstruiremos nosso império sobre os cadáveres de nossos inimigos!"
G["We will reclaim this world."]="Conquistaremos o mundo uma vez mais."
G["We will reclaim thisss land. Gurubashi land.  An' we kill anyone dat getssss in our way!"]="We will reclaim thisss land. Gurubashi land.  An' we kill anyone dat getssss in our way!"
G["We will reclaim what is rightfully ours!"]="Recuperaremos o que nos pertence por direito!"
G["We will repay the betrayal of the Alliance! We shall never forget, and never forgive!"]="We will repay the betrayal of the Alliance! We shall never forget, and never forgive!"
G["We will rest here in the Vale until we have gathered our research. Then, we must find a way home."]="Descansaremos aqui no vale até que finalicemos nossa investigação. Depois, teremos que encontrar um caminho a casa."
G["We will retake Icemist. The Anub'ar will be expelled from our city."]="Retomaremos Brumas de Gelo. Os Anub'ar serão expulsados de nossa cidade."
G["We will retake these wards!"]="Recuperaremos esses resguardos!"
G["We will return swiftly with our report."]="We will return swiftly with our report."
G["We will return to Lion's Landing. Meet us there when you have everything."]="Volveremos ao Ancoradouro do Leão. Reúnete conosco ali quando o tenha tudo."
G["We will return, dear friend.  We will come back, to take what belongs to us.  This I swear!"]="We will return, dear friend.  We will come back, to take what belongs to us.  This I swear!"
G["We will rise again, and your kind will be made to serve!"]="We will rise again, and your kind will be made to serve!"
G["We will root out all corruption within Orgrimmar."]="Purgaremos toda a corrupção de Orgrimmar."
G["We will rout out dissention among these mongrels!"]="Extirparemos a disensão de estes animais!"
G["We will save him, $n. We MUST."]="$n, O salvaremos! Devemos fazer isso!"
G["We will save him, Suna. I promise."]="Lhe salvaremos, Suna. O prometo."
G["We will scout ahead to the Wild Overlook and see you there, Kilag."]="We will scout ahead to the Wild Overlook and see you there, Kilag."
G["We will see if he has managed to keep up his end of the bargain."]="Veremos se pediu cumprir com a sua parte do trato."
G["We will send scouts to assess the situation. I will also convene with the Lady Proudmoore and see what plans the Alliance has."]="We will send scouts to assess the situation. I will also convene with the Lady Proudmoore and see what plans the Alliance has."
G["We will send you to your grave!"]="Te mandaremos ao seu tumba!"
G["We will set the elements free of your grasp by force!"]="Liberaremos aos elementos do seu alcance pela força!"
G["We will show da warchief da valor and skill of da Darkspears!"]="We will show da warchief da valor and skill of da Darkspears!"
G["We will show our enemies no quarter!"]="We will show our enemies no quarter!"
G["We will show you..."]="We will show you..."
G["We will slay you all as easily as we slew the Pandaren of old."]="Os mataremos com a mesma facilidade que aos pandaren de antanho."
G["We will soon find out. He is cornered like a rat down one of these corridors."]="We will soon find out. He is cornered like a rat down one of these corridors."
G["We will speak again, but away from here."]="Volveremos a falar, mas longe de aqui."
G["We will spread across this barren land!"]="We will spread across this barren land!"
G["We will stand idle no longer! The time to act is now!"]="Já está bem de permanecer mão sobre mão! Chegou o momentos de actuar!"
G["We will stop the Shadow Council and put an end to their atrocities!"]="We will stop the Shadow Council and put an end to their atrocities!"
G["We will suffer no demon's servant in our lands!"]="We will suffer no demon's servant in our lands!"
G["We will suffer no interruptions!"]="Não permitimos que nos interrumpan!"
G["We will take everything from them, death knight."]="Tiraremos tudo deles, cavaleiro da morte."
G["We will take from the land if it refuses to give!"]="We will take from the land if it refuses to give!"
G["We will take our leave. Again, welcome to all of you."]="Nos marchamos. Bem-vindos a todos, novamente."
G["We will take the fight to Arthas, and we will tear down the walls of Icecrown!"]="Levaremos a luta até Arthas e derribaremos os muros de Coroa de Gelo!"
G["We will tear out your eyes!"]="Te arrancaremos os olhos!"
G["We will throw these Alliance curs back into the sea!"]="We will throw these Alliance curs back into the sea!"
G["We will track this traitor down, my lady.  You've no reason to worry."]="Encontraremos ao traidor, meu senhora. Não te preocupe."
G["We will triumph. It is only a matter... of time."]="Triunfaremos. É somente uma questão de... tempo."
G["We will walk together, $n."]="We will walk together, $n."
G["We will win in the end."]="Acabaremos ganhando."
G["We will win this land with the sword, and break it with the plow! You are the men and women who will be remembered for taming the wild continent!"]="We will win this land with the sword, and break it with the plow! You are the men and women who will be remembered for taming the wild continent!"
G["We will... never... give up!"]="We will... never... give up!"
G["We wiped and I didn't get my gear."]="Temos perdido e não e conseguido meu equipamento."
G["We wish that we could create more than one darkrune in a day, but that would be a waste of time.  It's simply not physically possible.  Besides, we can't even reliably create them at that rate.\n\nAnd trust us, if there were anyone else here smart enough to help, they'd be conscripted and we'd have as many darkrunes as needed."]="We wish that we could create more than one darkrune in a day, but that would be a waste of time.  It's simply not physically possible.  Besides, we can't even reliably create them at that rate.\n\nAnd trust us, if there were anyone else here smart enough to help, they'd be conscripted and we'd have as many darkrunes as needed."
G["We wish to face the Defiler."]="We wish to face the Defiler."
G["We wish to help you, spirit. We seek your wisdom."]="Queremos ajudar você, espírito. Buscamos seu sabedoria."
G["We won't allow you to leave this valley!"]="Não te permitiremos sair deste vale!"
G["We won't have much time before they're onto us. Let's begin."]="We won't have much time before they're onto us. Let's begin."
G["We won't lose a horse.  Look at them!  They look exactly like they did when we started."]="Não vamos perder nenhum cavalo. Míralos! Estão igual que quando temos empezado."
G["We won't survive another attack, Dan. You gotta get us out of here!"]="We won't survive another attack, Dan. You gotta get us out of here!"
G["We work to preserve the balance as Cenarius teaches, $c.  His is the light of a beacon that shows the way for us, and we must do everything in our power to preserve that light."]="We work to preserve the balance as Cenarius teaches, $c.  His is the light of a beacon that shows the way for us, and we must do everything in our power to preserve that light."
G["We work well together, $n.  I couldn't have taken that warp-gate down without you!"]="Trabalhamos bem juntos, $n. Não poderá haver derribado esse portal de distorção se ti."
G["We would like to fight the Ancient Bloodcrown Crane."]="Nos gostaria lutar contra a grulha Tiarasangre ânciana."
G["We would like to fight the Colossal Viseclaw."]="Nos gostaria lutar contra o pinzatuerca colossal."
G["We would like to fight the Krasari Elder."]="Nos gostaria lutar contra o ancestral Krasari."
G["We would not lose."]="Não perderíamos."
G["We would rather die than be turned into worgen, but seeing as how even death provides no relief from the atrocities of this war..."]="We would rather die than be turned into worgen, but seeing as how even death provides no relief from the atrocities of this war..."
G["We wouldn't be in this mess if Tankiss would learn to keep the heat off his healer."]="We wouldn't be in this mess if Tankiss would learn to keep the heat off his healer."
G["We wouldn't be in this mess if it weren't for the gnomes!\n\nIt's a well-known fact that they were the ones that caused the Cataclysm with all of their world-enlarging devices, and other such nonsense!"]="We wouldn't be in this mess if it weren't for the gnomes!\n\nIt's a well-known fact that they were the ones that caused the Cataclysm with all of their world-enlarging devices, and other such nonsense!"
G["We wouldn't have crashed if Hemet could learn how to avoid shooting through the ailerons when he's trying to bag game on the ground!\n\nNo worries though, I'll have her fixed up quick enough."]="We wouldn't have crashed if Hemet could learn how to avoid shooting through the ailerons when he's trying to bag game on the ground!\n\nNo worries though, I'll have her fixed up quick enough."
G["We wrecked out here after Soggy took us way off course from our original charter. Thought he could pull a fast one on us. Hah!\n\nTruthfully, we're all glad he tried. Not one of us is an \"easy day's work\" kinda person."]="We wrecked out here after Soggy took us way off course from our original charter. Thought he could pull a fast one on us. Hah!\n\nTruthfully, we're all glad he tried. Not one of us is an \"easy day's work\" kinda person."
G["We'd be best friends.  I bet me and Anduin would also be best friends, too.  Friends are important."]="Seríamos melhores amigos. Apuesto a que Anduin e eu também seríamos melhores amigos. Os amigos são importantes."
G["We'd be gettin' ready to take back da Echo Isles. Zalazane has been workin' his voodoo magic for some time, convincing folks dat he be dead and performing ancient dark rituals.\n\nHe knows we'd be coming, so we have ta make sure we be prepared."]="We'd be gettin' ready to take back da Echo Isles. Zalazane has been workin' his voodoo magic for some time, convincing folks dat he be dead and performing ancient dark rituals.\n\nHe knows we'd be coming, so we have ta make sure we be prepared."
G["We'd been having a rough spot these past months.  Everyone has I guess."]="Estes últimos meses têm banido difíceis. Para todos, suponho."
G["We'd best head back, $n.  These simpletons don't know what a grave mistake they're making."]="We'd best head back, $n.  These simpletons don't know what a grave mistake they're making."
G["We'd better help them out and worry about the others later. Let's go!"]="Lhes ajudaremos e nos preocuparemos depois dos mais. Vamos!"
G["We'd better keep moving before this whole island finds out we're here."]="We'd better keep moving before this whole island finds out we're here."
G["We'd do well not to be reckless.  There's still much to learn about this land and about the enemy."]="Haverá que ter cuidado. Ainda há muito que aprender sobre esta terra e sobre nossos inimigos."
G["We'd gone an hour without an injury report. That's a new record!"]="Tem passado uma hora e não temos nenhuma ferida da que informar! É um novo recorde!"
G["We'd need to bring this information back to Pearlfin Village... but not before shooting a few orcs in the head."]="We'd need to bring this information back to Pearlfin Village... but not before shooting a few orcs in the head."
G["We'll all end up serving the Lich King, kid.  Better this way than becoming a rotten corpse."]="Todos acabaremos sirviendo ao Rei Lich, garota. Melhor deste modo que acabar sendo um cadáver podrido."
G["We'll be doin' exactly that then. Ya have our tanks, Stonemother."]="We'll be doin' exactly that then. Ya have our tanks, Stonemother."
G["We'll be handing him over to Hellscream once he's had some time to cool off. Can't have him destroying our prize, can we?"]="We'll be handing him over to Hellscream once he's had some time to cool off. Can't have him destroying our prize, can we?"
G["We'll be marching all day if I see any more of that!"]="We'll be marching all day if I see any more of that!"
G["We'll be notching our axes after this."]="We'll be notching our axes after this."
G["We'll be out of here just as soon as I get this wagon fixed. . . ."]="We'll be out of here just as soon as I get this wagon fixed. . . ."
G["We'll be ready for 'em... You did a good job in warning us."]="We'll be ready for 'em... You did a good job in warning us."
G["We'll burn it to the ground before giving it to you!"]="We'll burn it to the ground before giving it to you!"
G["We'll cleanse this place! Arthas beware!"]="We'll cleanse this place! Arthas beware!"
G["We'll clear the ruins of Horde while you work."]="We'll clear the ruins of Horde while you work."
G["We'll cover this front. You keep my priests safe."]="We'll cover this front. You keep my priests safe."
G["We'll cover ye from the brush: Point out a target, and we'll open fire."]="We'll cover ye from the brush: Point out a target, and we'll open fire."
G["We'll cut your throats and bleed you dry!"]="We'll cut your throats and bleed you dry!"
G["We'll dance on your bones!"]="We'll dance on your bones!"
G["We'll deal with you soon enough."]="Nos encargaremos de ti muito pronto."
G["We'll defend the ship and crew for as long as we're able.\n\nDon't worry about us!"]="Defenderemos o navio e ao seu tripulação tudo o que possamos.\n\nNão te preocupe por nós!"
G["We'll drag you out here if we have to!"]="We'll drag you out here if we have to!"
G["We'll drink their blood and feast on their bones!"]="We'll drink their blood and feast on their bones!"
G["We'll drink yer stout and lager,\nDrain all the pints and kegs!\nWe'll drink and brawl and brawl and drink,\n'til we can't feel our legs!"]="We'll drink yer stout and lager,\nDrain all the pints and kegs!\nWe'll drink and brawl and brawl and drink,\n'til we can't feel our legs!"
G["We'll fight this to the very end!"]="Lucharemos até o fim!"
G["We'll get right on this, $gsir:ma'am;!"]="We'll get right on this, $gsir:ma'am;!"
G["We'll get through this, $n.  We'll be wearing these beasts' pelts when we're done."]="We'll get through this, $n.  We'll be wearing these beasts' pelts when we're done."
G["We'll get to the bottom of this massacre if it's the last thing we do!"]="Vamos chegar ao fundo deste massacre, se é a última coisa que fazemos!"
G["We'll get to the bottom of this. Someone with your skills is exactly what we need."]="Chegaremos ao fundo do assunto. Alguém com o seu capacidade é logo o que precisamos de."
G["We'll get you out of there, Foreman, just HANG ON!"]="Te sacaremos de aqui, supervisor, somente AGUANTA!"
G["We'll get you out, Taretha. Don't worry. I doubt the wizard would wander too far away."]="Nós vamos tirar você, Taretha. Não se preocupe. Duvido que o bruxo se afaste demais."
G["We'll go ice skating as soon as the lake freezes over, honey."]="Iremos a patinar sobre gelo assim que se congele o lago, céu."
G["We'll grant you a swift death, Arthas. More than can be said for the thousands you've tortured and slain."]="We'll grant you a swift death, Arthas. More than can be said for the thousands you've tortured and slain."
G["We'll have this whole island cleared out soon."]="We'll have this whole island cleared out soon."
G["We'll have to go around."]="We'll have to go around."
G["We'll have to make an emergency water landing!"]="É preciso realizar um amerizagem de emergência!"
G["We'll have to tread carefully with all this teleporting in and out. We CANNOT risk Jaina finding out about this.\n\nAre you ready to go in?"]="We'll have to tread carefully with all this teleporting in and out. We CANNOT risk Jaina finding out about this.\n\nAre you ready to go in?"
G["We'll have your heads!"]="Os decapitaremos!"
G["We'll hold Domination Point or die trying!"]="We'll hold Domination Point or die trying!"
G["We'll hold Lion's Landing or die trying!"]="We'll hold Lion's Landing or die trying!"
G["We'll hold the docks for the remaining landing parties. Follow the path to the gates of Orgrimmar, and make contact with Vol'jin and his revolutionaries."]="We'll hold the docks for the remaining landing parties. Follow the path to the gates of Orgrimmar, and make contact with Vol'jin and his revolutionaries."
G["We'll hold the line, $n. You just worry about putting an end to Garrosh's madness."]="We'll hold the line, $n. You just worry about putting an end to Garrosh's madness."
