G["We'll let you into the city, this time."]="We'll let you into the city, this time."
G["We'll made the Horde pay, we will!"]="A Horda nos as pagará!"
G["We'll make use of these supplies to get everyone ready for a fight.\n\nContinue on. We'll meet you ahead."]="We'll make use of these supplies to get everyone ready for a fight.\n\nContinue on. We'll meet you ahead."
G["We'll meet you at Kota Basecamp!"]="Nos vemos no Acampamento Base Kota!"
G["We'll meet you back in camp."]="Nos reuniremos no acampamento."
