G["We'll need to collect more data to substantiate these readings.  Get back in there and collect that data."]="We'll need to collect more data to substantiate these readings.  Get back in there and collect that data."
G["We'll need to make a few modifications, but it will get the job done."]="Teremos que fazer uma série de modificações, mas servirá."
G["We'll need twenty thousand more cog wheels, and another... hey! You can't just summon me away like that!"]="We'll need twenty thousand more cog wheels, and another... hey! You can't just summon me away like that!"
G["We'll never finish in time! Can't we make them go faster?"]="We'll never finish in time! Can't we make them go faster?"
G["We'll never get these ships ready in time. The winter comes and with it our doom. I fear that the young prince has damned us all."]="Nunca prepararemos esses navios a tempo. O inverno chega e com ele nossa destruição. Temo que o jovem príncipe tenha nos amaldiçoado."
G["We'll never yield to the mogu!"]="Mais obedeceremos aos mogu!"
G["We'll not let this act of madness go unpunished!"]="Não permitiremos que este acto de loucura que impune!"
G["We'll post up here with some troops. Scout on ahead and see if you can flush Garrosh out of hiding."]="We'll post up here with some troops. Scout on ahead and see if you can flush Garrosh out of hiding."
G["We'll return, Liam.  I swear this to you."]="Nós voltaremos, Liam. Eu juro."
G["We'll run every last one of you fools from this land!"]="We'll run every last one of you fools from this land!"
G["We'll see about that, Perelli. We'll see about that."]="Já veremos, Perelhi. Já veremos."
G["We'll see about that, young prince."]="Já veremos, jovem Príncipe."
G["We'll see about that."]="Já veremos."
G["We'll see how the Drakkari holds up against the might of the Scourge!"]="We'll see how the Drakkari holds up against the might of the Scourge!"
G["We'll see if you revel so much in death once I've ripped out your throat!"]="We'll see if you revel so much in death once I've ripped out your throat!"
G["We'll set flight once everyone is ready."]="Despegaremos quando tudo o mundo estiver pronto."
G["We'll set up camp soon. First, we'll take advantage of this darkness to do some reconnaissance."]="We'll set up camp soon. First, we'll take advantage of this darkness to do some reconnaissance."
G["We'll squish you like bugs!"]="Os aplastaremos como a insectos!"
G["We'll start at that first energy pylon, straight ahead.  Remember, try to keep them off of me."]="We'll start at that first energy pylon, straight ahead.  Remember, try to keep them off of me."
G["We'll start in just a moment.\n\nI just want to be very clear -- we're not here to soften them up. We're not here to make a dent. We're here to put an end to the disease that calls itself the Scarlet Onslaught.\n\nIf you don't want any part of that, if you don't have the stomach, fly away now. I want someone with us who is going to be here every day until the job's done.\n\nAre you that $g man : woman;, $n?"]="We'll start in just a moment.\n\nI just want to be very clear -- we're not here to soften them up. We're not here to make a dent. We're here to put an end to the disease that calls itself the Scarlet Onslaught.\n\nIf you don't want any part of that, if you don't have the stomach, fly away now. I want someone with us who is going to be here every day until the job's done.\n\nAre you that $g man : woman;, $n?"
G["We'll string his body from the trees and leave him swinging in the wind for the Alliance to discover. Go back and tell Warlord Bloodhilt the news!"]="We'll string his body from the trees and leave him swinging in the wind for the Alliance to discover. Go back and tell Warlord Bloodhilt the news!"
G["We'll take Booty Bay or Firallon'll spay us, howl out, me 'earties, aaaa-ooo!"]="We'll take Booty Bay or Firallon'll spay us, howl out, me 'earties, aaaa-ooo!"
G["We'll take over from here, you've earned quite a respite after that battle."]="Vamos assumir a partir daqui, você ganhou uma trégua depois dessa batalha."
G["We'll track this traitor down, priestess.  You've no reason to worry."]="Encontraremos ao traidor, sacerdotisa. Não te preocupe."
G["We'll worry about him later. I need to get you to safety."]="Já nos preocuparemos por ele mais tarde. Tenho que poderá a salvou."
G["We're Orgrimmar and Azshara bound. Let's get this baby out to sea!"]="Somos Orgrimmar e Azshara ligados. Vamos levar esse bebê para o mar!"
G["We're Orgrimmar bound, $g bud : girlie;, and then on to our new home in Azshara. See you there!"]="Nos dirigimos a Orgrimmar, $gamigo: moça;, e desde ali seguiremos a nosso novo lar, Azshara. Nos veremos ali!"
G["We're all going to DIE in here!!!\n\nI'm a slave foreman... I wonder if it's too late to side with the Trade Prince?"]="We're all going to DIE in here!!!\n\nI'm a slave foreman... I wonder if it's too late to side with the Trade Prince?"
G["We're all going to die!"]="Vamos morrer todos!"
G["We're all gonna die!"]="Vamos morrer todos!"
G["We're all gonna die!!!"]="Vamos morrer todos!"
G["We're all ready."]="Estamos prontos."
G["We're all very proud of Bael Modan. It was the first dwarven settlement in Kalimdor."]="Todos estamos muito orgulhosos de Bael Modan. Foi o primeiro asentamento anão em Kalimdor."
G["We're almost done!"]="Está quase terminado!"
G["We're almost done. Just the homestretch now!"]="Quase temos terminou. Somente ocorrida a recta fim!"
G["We're almost out... just a little bit farther."]="We're almost out... just a little bit farther."
G["We're almost ready to depart. Just give us a little bit longer to finish our preparations."]="Estamos quase prontos para partir. Apenas nos dê um pouco mais de tempo para terminar nossos preparativos."
G["We're almost ready. Keep on working!"]="We're almost ready. Keep on working!"
G["We're almost there!"]="Falta pouco para chegar!"
G["We're almost there. Just a bit more to go."]="Já quase. Somente um pouco mais."
G["We're almost there... Don't give up!"]="We're almost there... Don't give up!"
G["We're almost through. Stay close!"]="Quase temos passado. Manteneos juntos!"
G["We're almost to Ravenholdt Manor."]="Quase temos chegado à Mansão Ravenholdt."
G["We're almost to safety. From here, we run. Try not to get too far behind! GO!"]="We're almost to safety. From here, we run. Try not to get too far behind! GO!"
G["We're almost to the fresco. Keep it up back there!"]="Já quase temos chegado ao fresco. Aguanta um pouco mais!"
G["We're almost to the refuge!  Let's go."]="Quase temos chegado ao refúgio! Vamos."
G["We're alphas, we're playas, we're straight from Gilneas, wolf out, me 'earties, aaaa-ooo!"]="We're alphas, we're playas, we're straight from Gilneas, wolf out, me 'earties, aaaa-ooo!"
G["We're always eager for more flight data!  Where do you want to go?"]="Estamos sempre ansiosos por mais dados de voo! Onde você quer ir?"
G["We're amassin' an army to head Garrosh off, but that will take time, and the Prince may already be in danger."]="We're amassin' an army to head Garrosh off, but that will take time, and the Prince may already be in danger."
G["We're at the center of the Maelstrom, the rift between Deepholm and Azeroth.  Watch as it threatens to tear your world apart!"]="Estamos no coração da Voragem, a falha entre Infralar e Azeroth. Observa como ameaça com desgarrar nosso mundo!"
G["We're back and better than ever!  It's the Darkmoon Faire friend, and it's your lucky day!  Sparing no expense, we've gathered wonders and treats from around the world for your delight.  Whether you're young or old, rich or poor, the Darkmoon Faire has it all!  Be sure to turn in your Darkmoon Faire Prize Tickets to Gelvas Grimegate, and choose from several exotic and wondrous prizes!"]="We're back and better than ever!  It's the Darkmoon Faire friend, and it's your lucky day!  Sparing no expense, we've gathered wonders and treats from around the world for your delight.  Whether you're young or old, rich or poor, the Darkmoon Faire has it all!  Be sure to turn in your Darkmoon Faire Prize Tickets to Gelvas Grimegate, and choose from several exotic and wondrous prizes!"
G["We're beginning to put the pieces together, champion. The mogu were created and sent here to guard the Vale for their Titan masters. Guard it from what? Were the Old Gods still a threat?"]="Estamos começando a colocar as peças no lugar. Os mogus foram criados e enviados para cá para proteger o Vale para seus mestres titãs. Proteger do quê? Os Deuses Antigos ainda eram uma ameaça?"
G["We're behind enemy lines, $n. We've got to do as much damage as we can!"]="Estamos atrás as linhas inimigas, $n. Temos que fazer tudo o dano que possamos!"
G["We're behind schedule! Turn this tub east! EAST!"]="Vamos com atraso! Move esta coisa para o este! ESTE!"
G["We're being besieged by the naga attempting to breech our airlocks! Defend the ship topside!"]="We're being besieged by the naga attempting to breech our airlocks! Defend the ship topside!"
G["We're being overrun!"]="Nos estão superando!"
G["We're building another road down into Stormwind Harbor as soon as this wall has been removed... but this mad dwarf brought enough powder to level the entire quarter!\n\nI don't know what Master Alexston was thinking when he hired her... she's foul-mouthed, mean, and stubborn as an ox!"]="We're building another road down into Stormwind Harbor as soon as this wall has been removed... but this mad dwarf brought enough powder to level the entire quarter!\n\nI don't know what Master Alexston was thinking when he hired her... she's foul-mouthed, mean, and stubborn as an ox!"
G["We're catching up to the dragon! I think I can make him out through the cloud cover!"]="Estamos alcançando o dragão! Eu acho que posso vê-o através da nebulosidade!"
G["We're celebrating spring during Noblegarden. Affirmation of life and all that."]="Estamos comemorando a primavera durante o Noblegarden. Afirmação da vida e tudo isso."
G["We're celebrating the who breaking free of the what? Bah, who cares?! More candy!"]="Estamos comemorando quem se libertando do quê? Bah, quem se importa?! Mais doce!"
G["We're clear. Let's keep moving."]="Já está. Sigamos avançando."
G["We're close to the exit. I'll let you rest for about thirty seconds, but then we're out of here."]="We're close to the exit. I'll let you rest for about thirty seconds, but then we're out of here."
G["We're close! These documents all mention the bell and Kun-Lai Summit. It must be here."]="We're close! These documents all mention the bell and Kun-Lai Summit. It must be here."
G["We're close. I can feel the unnatural hatred broiling inside of me."]="Nos acercamos. Já posso sentir como o ódio antinatural começa a arder na minha interior."
G["We're coming for you!"]="Vamos por você!"
G["We're coming for you, Chillheart! Time for payback!"]="Vamos por você, Coração Álgido! Hora da vingança!"
G["We're coming up on Frosthold. I would be very appreciative if you would introduce me to King Stormheart before you go. I believe we are both very much in his debt."]="We're coming up on Frosthold. I would be very appreciative if you would introduce me to King Stormheart before you go. I believe we are both very much in his debt."
G["We're coming up on the Town-In-A-Box now..."]="Estamos chegando à Cidade de Bolso..."
G["We're coming, $n! Keep her occupied while we loop around for an attack."]="Já chegamos, $n! Mantenla ocupada enquanto a rodeamos para atacar."
G["We're currently focus testing The Black Temple. You must have at least HONORED reputation with the Violet Eye to participate.\n\nThat's the reputation you gain while doing Karazhan."]="Nos estamos centrando em testar O Templo Sombrio. Para participar deve ter, como mínimo, reputação HONRADO com O Olho Violeta.\n\nEssa é a reputação que ganha a fazer Karazhan."
G["We're currently focus testing Zul'Aman, a 10 player raid dungeon in the Ghostlands. You must be at least level 68 to enter."]="We're currently focus testing Zul'Aman, a 10 player raid dungeon in the Ghostlands. You must be at least level 68 to enter."
G["We're currently focus testing the Battle of Mount Hyjal. You must have at least HONORED reputation with the Violet Eye to participate.\n\nThat's the reputation you gain while doing Karazhan."]="Estamos dando a Batalha do Monte Hyjal. Para participar deve ter, como mínimo, reputação HONRADO com O Olho Violeta.\n\nEssa é a reputação que ganha a fazer Karazhan."
G["We're doing everything we can to stop the water."]="Estamos fazendo tudo o que podemos para parar a água."
G["We're done for!"]="Estamos acabados!"
G["We're done for! Save us, Quimby!"]="Estamos acabados! Sálvanos, Quimby!"
G["We're done here. I'm out."]="Temos terminado aqui. Me vou."
G["We're done here. Mulgore will no longer suffer the hatred of the Grimtotem."]="We're done here. Mulgore will no longer suffer the hatred of the Grimtotem."
G["We're done practicing so soon?  Very well, I'll see you later."]="We're done practicing so soon?  Very well, I'll see you later."
G["We're doomed!"]="Estamos perdidos!"
G["We're doomed..."]="Estamos perdidos..."
