G["We're expecting the Shatterspear Leader to show here at any moment. Be patient if you wish to join the attack."]="Esperamos que o Líder Lança Estilhaçador apareça aqui a qualquer momentos. Seja paciente se você quiser se juntar ao ataque."
G["We're filled to capacity on purple lotus, $c. Go ask one of the others if they need your help, and leave me to my studies. There is no time to waste!"]="We're filled to capacity on purple lotus, $c. Go ask one of the others if they need your help, and leave me to my studies. There is no time to waste!"
G["We're finally here, thanks to you $n!  Without your help, we would have been some over-grown lizard's lunch!"]="We're finally here, thanks to you $n!  Without your help, we would have been some over-grown lizard's lunch!"
G["We're fine. We're all fine here now, thank you. How are you?"]="Estamos bem. Estamos muito bem, Obrigado. Como está você?"
G["We're finished! I might as well call for an evacuation now and clear out Lakeshire before the orcs march."]="Estamos acabados! Será melhor que ordene a evacuação agora e assim Vila do Lago estará vazio quando os orcs marchen por ela."
G["We're flying a little too close. It's been a good fight, but I'm ending it, now."]="Estamos voando demais perto. Foi uma boa luta, mas vou acabar com isto agora."
G["We're flying high!"]="Estamos voando alto!"
G["We're free!"]="Somos livres!"
G["We're free! RUN FOR YOUR LIVES!"]="We're free! RUN FOR YOUR LIVES!"
G["We're free! We're free!"]="Somos livres! Somos livres!"
G["We're getting bogged down in the fight against the Frostmane trolls."]="Nos estamos atascando na luta contra os trolls Peloescarcha."
G["We're getting close... but it's still a little too smoky.  Don't put in any terrapin oil next time.  <cough>  Too much smoke.  Give it another shot!"]="We're getting close... but it's still a little too smoky.  Don't put in any terrapin oil next time.  <cough>  Too much smoke.  Give it another shot!"
G["We're glad to have your help."]="Estamos felizes em ter sua ajuda."
G["We're glad to see you here again, $n. With so many of our brethren seized by the Warchief's forces, we thought we'd never see you again."]="We're glad to see you here again, $n. With so many of our brethren seized by the Warchief's forces, we thought we'd never see you again."
G["We're going down. Abandon the ship!"]="We're going down. Abandon the ship!"
G["We're going in! Take out those towers!"]="Vamos além! Destrói as torres!"
G["We're going to bring down the Hellfire Citadel, and it all starts with these ramparts."]="Vamos derrubar a Cidadela Fogo do Inferno, e tudo começa com essas muralhas."
G["We're going to die in here like all the others, aren't we?"]="Vamos morrer todos como os mais, verdade?"
G["We're going to die!"]="Vamos morrer!"
G["We're going to do little Andi's braids soon. Would you like your's done too, sweetie?"]="We're going to do little Andi's braids soon. Would you like your's done too, sweetie?"
G["We're going to finish this right now, Mal'Ganis. Just you... and me."]="Vamos colocar fim a isto agora, Mal'Ganis. Solos você e eu."
G["We're going to get you some help."]="We're going to get you some help."
G["We're going to have a hard time handling this one alone. I sent a message to the dwarven capital of Ironforge asking for their support."]="We're going to have a hard time handling this one alone. I sent a message to the dwarven capital of Ironforge asking for their support."
G["We're going to have to deal with Cho'gall and Skullcrusher sooner rather than later. Are you up to it, $n?"]="We're going to have to deal with Cho'gall and Skullcrusher sooner rather than later. Are you up to it, $n?"
G["We're going to have to scratch the Maraudines off our list.  Too hard to work with..."]="Vamos ter que borrar aos Maraudines de nossa pronta. É difícil trabalhar com eles..."
G["We're going to live on! We're going to survive! Today we celebrate..."]="We're going to live on! We're going to survive! Today we celebrate..."
G["We're going to need a mop over here!"]="Vamos precisar uma fregona!"
G["We're going to need more mud to properly color your disguise."]="Vamos precisar mais lama para dar um bom cor ao seu disfarce."
G["We're going to need some serious firepower."]="We're going to need some serious firepower."
G["We're gonna burn this place to the ground!"]="We're gonna burn this place to the ground!"
G["We're gonna do a quick fly by Conquest Hold to see what those filthy, no good, Horde are up to. Keep your eyes peeled for their wind riders. Not that they'd ever catch me!"]="Vamos fazer uma passada rápida pelo Bastião da Conquista para ver que fazem esses ronhosos da Horda. Abra bem os olhos por se aparecem seus Cavaleiros do Vento. Di que não me pilfarian na vida!"
G["We're gonna lose this war to \"regulations.\" What's next? Only wooden swords may be used???"]="Vamos perder esta guerra com tanta \"regulação\". Que será o seguinte? Somente poderemos lutar com espadas de madeira?"
G["We're gonna make you the ultimate footbomb uniform, kid. But first, we need parts. Lots of them."]="We're gonna make you the ultimate footbomb uniform, kid. But first, we need parts. Lots of them."
G["We're gonna march in there and do one thing and one thing only:"]="Vamos ir ali e faremos uma coisa e somente uma coisa:"
G["We're gonna melt this hunk of junk down and make weapons with the ingots! Let's see how the Legion likes a taste of fel reaver served up Alliance style!"]="We're gonna melt this hunk of junk down and make weapons with the ingots! Let's see how the Legion likes a taste of fel reaver served up Alliance style!"
G["We're gonna turn this place into a sinkhole, heh."]="Vamos transformar este lugar num redemoinho, heh."
G["We're gunna take it."]="We're gunna take it."
G["We're hard at work, searching for Prince Anduin. We're just stoppin' fer a bite and a drink."]="We're hard at work, searching for Prince Anduin. We're just stoppin' fer a bite and a drink."
G["We're here as support for the so-called 'adventurers' that the brass has called in. We'll help them hold the key points on the island, and keep the heat off so that they can do their jobs."]="We're here as support for the so-called 'adventurers' that the brass has called in. We'll help them hold the key points on the island, and keep the heat off so that they can do their jobs."
G["We're here for civilian work, sir."]="Estamos aqui para fazer trabalho civil, senhor."
G["We're here for you, lost brother.  It is custom to offer you a chance to repent before you are destroyed.  We offer you this chance, as the naaru's law commands."]="We're here for you, lost brother.  It is custom to offer you a chance to repent before you are destroyed.  We offer you this chance, as the naaru's law commands."
G["We're here on a research and excavation mission. No gettin' into trouble, I promise!"]="We're here on a research and excavation mission. No gettin' into trouble, I promise!"
G["We're here to finish this! Face us, coward!"]="Temos vindo para terminar com isto! Enfrente a nós, covarde!"
G["We're here to help."]="Temos vindo a ajudar."
G["We're here to join the Alliance. We seek audience with your Emperor."]="We're here to join the Alliance. We seek audience with your Emperor."
G["We're here to lend our aid. We can help protect the Vale."]="We're here to lend our aid. We can help protect the Vale."
G["We're here to lend our aid. We can help you rebuild the Vale."]="Estamos aqui para contribuir. Podemos ajudar vocês a reconstruir o vale."
G["We're here to protect Gadgetzan interests in Un'Goro and that's none of your business."]="Estamos aqui para proteger os interesses da Gadgetzan na Um'Goro e isso não é da sua conta."
G["We're here to rescue you, Taretha."]="We're here to rescue you, Taretha."
G["We're here with you Brann, you can trust in your brothers of earth."]="Estamos ao seu lado, Brann, pode confiar nos seus irmãos da terra."
G["We're here! Start diggin'!"]="Estamos aqui! Começa a cavar!"
G["We're here, everybody out!"]="Estamos aqui, todos fosse!"
G["We're here. Just wait a moment while we load up---HEY! What's happening!?"]="Já estamos. Aguarda um segundo enquanto cargo... Eh! Que passa?"
G["We're here. With this weapon we will lay waste to the Empresses' army!"]="Já temos chegado. Com esta arma aniquilaremos o exército da Imperatriz!"
G["We're hit!"]="Nos têm dados!"
G["We're holding Lord Jaraxxus back for now, but we can't keep him bound for much longer."]="Estamos segurando Lorde Jaraxxus por enquanto, mas não podemos mantê-o preso por muito mais tempo."
G["We're holding them in the northwest - reinforce the line!"]="We're holding them in the northwest - reinforce the line!"
G["We're hungry and cold! Help us!"]="Temos fome e frio! Ayúdanos!"
G["We're hunters, you and I. No wolfmen here, no ma'am."]="Somos caçadores, você e eu. Não há homens lobo aqui, não senhora."
G["We're hunting an old god, Brann."]="Estamos dando caça a um deus antigo, Brann."
G["We're in a fine mess here."]="Estamos em uma ótima bagunça aqui."
G["We're in a pretty tight pickle here, $n."]="We're in a pretty tight pickle here, $n."
G["We're in desperate need of those turnips!"]="We're in desperate need of those turnips!"
G["We're in over our heads, $r! Watch your back!"]="We're in over our heads, $r! Watch your back!"
G["We're in the home stretch now."]="Estamos a ponto de acabar."
G["We're in your debt, friend.  Speak to Lysander at Vengeance Landing; he will arrange a suitable reward for you."]="Te devemos uma, colega. Fala com Lysander em Campo Vingança; ele te proporcionará uma recompensa adequada."
G["We're just trying to get a decent meal and maybe a comfortable night's sleep."]="Somente intentamos conseguir uma comida decente e talvez dormir bem uma noite."
G["We're leaving. Stay close."]="We're leaving. Stay close."
G["We're like their puppets - we dance and cry and fight and say silly things for their amusement."]="We're like their puppets - we dance and cry and fight and say silly things for their amusement."
G["We're making progress!  Bring more supplies to repair Dun Baldar!"]="We're making progress!  Bring more supplies to repair Dun Baldar!"
G["We're making progress, $r, but far too slowly."]="We're making progress, $r, but far too slowly."
G["We're mangy, we're matted, we're worgen and how, wolf out, me 'earties, aaaa-ooo!"]="We're mangy, we're matted, we're worgen and how, wolf out, me 'earties, aaaa-ooo!"
G["We're miners, farmers and craftsmen - not soldiers.  But we'll defend our land with our bare fists if we must."]="Somos mineiros, agricultores e artesãos - não soldados. Mas defenderemos nossa terra com nossos punhos, se for necessário."
G["We're nearing Render's Valley. These orcs are tough! Make sure you are camo'd!|TInterface\\Icons\\SPELL_NATURE_PROTECTIONFORMNATURE.BLP:16|t"]="Nos acercamos ao Vale de Render. Esses orcs são difíceis! Certifique-se de ir camuflado!|TInterface\\Icons\\SPELL_NATURE_PROTECTIONFORMNATURE.BLP:16|t"
