G["We're not the younglings we once were, Man'ari! By the light, we shall end your suffering!"]="We're not the younglings we once were, Man'ari! By the light, we shall end your suffering!"
G["We're not too far from the Protectorate Watch Post, $n. This way!"]="Não estamos demais longe da Avançado do Protectorado, $n. Por aqui!"
