G["We're on the trail of the Sha of Hatred. I want you with us for the hunt."]="Estamos seguindo ao Sha do ódio. Quero que te umas à caça."
G["We're one step closer my friends.  Have a rest and let me know when you are ready to continue."]="We're one step closer my friends.  Have a rest and let me know when you are ready to continue."
