G["We're out of here. Good luck!"]="Nos vamos. Boa sorte!"
G["We're planning on having a special naga appreciation sale after your surrender is all wrapped up.  Thirty percent off most goods we have in stock. Red light savings on Kaldorei artifacts today only!"]="We're planning on having a special naga appreciation sale after your surrender is all wrapped up.  Thirty percent off most goods we have in stock. Red light savings on Kaldorei artifacts today only!"
G["We're preparing for war, $c. We've taken all that we're going to from the Silithid and their masters in Ahn'Qiraj. To get ready for it we're collecting all sorts of material. I'm in charge of gathering Arthas' Tears. Not sure what we need them for though. If you ask me I don't want anything to do with that madman, even if it is just a flower named after him.\n\nStill, I'm my father's daughter, and a soldier, so I do what I'm told. Currently we have $2057w and need to collect a grand total of $2058w."]="We're preparing for war, $c. We've taken all that we're going to from the Silithid and their masters in Ahn'Qiraj. To get ready for it we're collecting all sorts of material. I'm in charge of gathering Arthas' Tears. Not sure what we need them for though. If you ask me I don't want anything to do with that madman, even if it is just a flower named after him.\n\nStill, I'm my father's daughter, and a soldier, so I do what I'm told. Currently we have $2057w and need to collect a grand total of $2058w."
G["We're prepped, sir."]="Estamos preparados, senhor."
G["We're pretty far from anything I'd call civilization here, at least until the Horde can send us more reinforcements. You must really like working with leather."]="We're pretty far from anything I'd call civilization here, at least until the Horde can send us more reinforcements. You must really like working with leather."
G["We're proud. We're strong. We are descended from the blood of the Tiller himself... and we don't run from trouble."]="We're proud. We're strong. We are descended from the blood of the Tiller himself... and we don't run from trouble."
G["We're pulling up near your stop. Head due west along the road to reach Nozzlepot's Outpost."]="Nos acercamos ao seu aparo. Continua o caminho para o oeste para chegar à Avançado de Olhaboquilha."
G["We're putting the final preparations together even as we speak.  The rest will depend upon how quickly you can organize your forces at Ruuan Weald.\n\nDo you think that you can handle that and get it done quickly?"]="We're putting the final preparations together even as we speak.  The rest will depend upon how quickly you can organize your forces at Ruuan Weald.\n\nDo you think that you can handle that and get it done quickly?"
G["We're rather selective of who we befriend, $n.  You think you have what it takes?"]="We're rather selective of who we befriend, $n.  You think you have what it takes?"
G["We're ready for anything!"]="Estamos prontos para qualquer coisa!"
G["We're ready for glory, sir."]="Estamos prontos para a glória, senhor."
G["We're ready for the next challenge."]="Estamos preparados para o seguinte desafio."
G["We're ready for the push."]="Estamos preparados para o ataque."
G["We're ready to bring the pain, sir."]="Estamos preparados para causar dor, senhor."
G["We're ready to defend!"]="Estamos preparados para a defesa!"
G["We're ready to face Illidan."]="Estamos prontos para enfrentar Illidan."
G["We're ready to fight the sorceror again."]="Estamos prontos para lutar contra o feiticeiro novamente."
G["We're ready to go whenever you are, $n."]="$n, Estamos prontos para partir."
G["We're ready to open the gates."]="Estamos prontos para abrir as portões."
G["We're ready! Go, Brann!"]="Estamos prontos! Vamos, Brann!"
G["We're ready! Let's go!"]="Estamos prontos! Vamos lá!"
G["We're ready, Muradin."]="Estamos prontos, Muradin."
G["We're ready, Thrall."]="Estamos prontos, Thrall."
G["We're ready, commander."]="Estamos preparados, comandante!"
G["We're ready. Begin the assault!"]="Estamos prontos. Comece o assalto!"
G["We're ready. This time things will be different."]="Estamos prontos. Desta vez, as coisas serão diferentes."
G["We're really plowing through your team now!"]="Estamos passando a foice na sua equipe!"
G["We're relieved to see you whole, $n."]="Que alívio ver você de uma peça, $n!"
G["We're routing out the traitors. Looks like we've found another..."]="Estamos identificando aos traidores. Parece que temos encontrado a outro..."
G["We're runnin' at full steam, $p. Just focus on keepin' us topped off."]="We're runnin' at full steam, $p. Just focus on keepin' us topped off."
G["We're running low on iron, lads!  I don't want to see a single bar go to waste, ye hear me now?"]="We're running low on iron, lads!  I don't want to see a single bar go to waste, ye hear me now?"
G["We're safe here, my brothers and sisters, while the rest of the world will perish."]="Aqui estamos a salvou, meus irmãos e irmãs, enquanto que o resto do mundo perecerá."
G["We're safe!  But we weren't going fast enough!  All I want to feel is the wind in my eyes!"]="We're safe!  But we weren't going fast enough!  All I want to feel is the wind in my eyes!"
G["We're safe.  Let's rest a bit before we go back."]="Estamos a salvou. Descansemos um pouco antes de voltar."
G["We're safe; IT will never reach us here!"]="We're safe; IT will never reach us here!"
G["We're saved!"]="Estamos salvados!"
G["We're saved? We're really saved?! YAHOO!"]="Estamos salvados? Estamos salvados de verdade?! YUJU!"
G["We're sendin' out our best, and that means you."]="We're sendin' out our best, and that means you."
G["We're snowballing out of control! You don't stand a chance now!"]="Estamos saindo de controle! Agora vocês não tem chance!"
G["We're spotted! Hang on. We have to get out of here!"]="Nos têm visto! Aguanta. Temos que escapar de aqui!"
G["We're staging a relief effort at New Thalanaar for all of the survivors of Thousand Needles. We need your help now!"]="Estamos organizando uma operação de resgate em Nova Thalanaar para todos os sobreviventes das Mil Agulhas. precisamos da sua ajuda!"
G["We're still alive, Doctor Grapplehammer, despite your best efforts."]="Seguimos vivos, doutor Martilhazos, a pesar de todos seus esforços."
G["We're still cut off from Forward Command, but thanks to your 'negotiations' with the quilboar, we should be able to re-open the roads with a little elbow grease."]="Ainda estamos isolados do Comando Avançado, mas, graças às suas 'negociações' com o quilboar, poderemos reabrir as estradas com um pouco de graxa no cotovelo."
G["We're still in this fight? I've got to report to Irontree!"]="Ainda seguimos lutando? Tenho que ir a informar a Troncoferro!"
G["We're still making preparations. We won't be ready to go for a while."]="Ainda estamos fazendo os preparativos. Não estaremos prontos para ir por um tempo."
G["We're sure. Let's go!"]="Temos certeza. Vamos lá!"
G["We're surrounded - dispatch the ascendant while I keep the ambushers at bay."]="We're surrounded - dispatch the ascendant while I keep the ambushers at bay."
G["We're surrounded! Its defenses are too great. $n! Wake up!"]="Estamos rodeados! Seus defesas são demais fortes. $n! Acorde!"
G["We're taking a shortcut.  Be on the lookout for worgs."]="We're taking a shortcut.  Be on the lookout for worgs."
G["We're taking him into custody in the name of King Varian Wrynn."]="We're taking him into custody in the name of King Varian Wrynn."
G["We're taking hull damage, get a battle-mage out here to shut down those cannons!"]="We're taking hull damage, get a battle-mage out here to shut down those cannons!"
G["We're taking hull damage, get a sorcerer out here to shut down those cannons!"]="We're taking hull damage, get a sorcerer out here to shut down those cannons!"
G["We're taking it back!"]="We're taking it back!"
G["We're through, $n! I'm with Candy now."]="Temos terminou, $n! Agora estou com Rosto."
G["We're through, $n! I'm with Chip now."]="Temos terminou, $n! Agora estou com Locko."
G["We're to just pick up and leave?"]="We're to just pick up and leave?"
G["We're too late, $n. Looks like those monkeys butchered the Foreman and his crew."]="We're too late, $n. Looks like those monkeys butchered the Foreman and his crew."
G["We're too late. The grove is destroyed and with it our hopes and dreams."]="We're too late. The grove is destroyed and with it our hopes and dreams."
G["We're too merciful with the Wretched.  We ought to drive a sword through each of them.\n\nTheir boldness in Sunsail Anchorage is unpardonable."]="We're too merciful with the Wretched.  We ought to drive a sword through each of them.\n\nTheir boldness in Sunsail Anchorage is unpardonable."
G["We're tryin' ta blow this wall so Wick's men can work on the new Harbor gatehouse and road beyond, but the clueless sod is cryin' about me using too much powder!\n\nTch. I've been sappin' since he was in diapers. This goes on much longer, I'll kick him into the canal and finish the whole blasted job meself!"]="We're tryin' ta blow this wall so Wick's men can work on the new Harbor gatehouse and road beyond, but the clueless sod is cryin' about me using too much powder!\n\nTch. I've been sappin' since he was in diapers. This goes on much longer, I'll kick him into the canal and finish the whole blasted job meself!"
G["We're trying to find a solution to the growin' elemental disturbances in Azeroth. Here in Nagrand, we see the same rifts formin', but as a direct consequence of Draenor bein' torn to shreds. They're a sign of a weakened planet and of an elemental plane in upheaval.\n\nYet, on Azeroth, there's no solid explanation for it.\n\nIf ya find any information about these rifts when adventurin' in the Outland, please let us know. We'll continue to speak with the elements here and find a way to calm the elements in Azeroth...before it's too late."]="We're trying to find a solution to the growin' elemental disturbances in Azeroth. Here in Nagrand, we see the same rifts formin', but as a direct consequence of Draenor bein' torn to shreds. They're a sign of a weakened planet and of an elemental plane in upheaval.\n\nYet, on Azeroth, there's no solid explanation for it.\n\nIf ya find any information about these rifts when adventurin' in the Outland, please let us know. We'll continue to speak with the elements here and find a way to calm the elements in Azeroth...before it's too late."
G["We're trying to find out what's so important up at the Masters' Gate.\n\nI just know that those Hammer jerks are up to no good. No fair! We came all this way following a clue and now we can't even get close."]="We're trying to find out what's so important up at the Masters' Gate.\n\nI just know that those Hammer jerks are up to no good. No fair! We came all this way following a clue and now we can't even get close."
G["We're unda attack!"]="Estamos em um ataque!"
G["We're under attack!"]="Nos atacando!"
G["We're under attack! Avast, ye swabs! Repel the invaders!"]="We're under attack! Avast, ye swabs! Repel the invaders!"
G["We're under attack! Defend yourself! I'm taking the high road. Call me back when the coast is clear!"]="We're under attack! Defend yourself! I'm taking the high road. Call me back when the coast is clear!"
G["We're under attack! Step up and do your part, $c!"]="Nos atacando! Adelántate e faça o que te corresponde, $c!"
G["We're under attack! Take your positions!"]="We're under attack! Take your positions!"
G["We're up against pterrodax, sharks, teraptors, and bomb-throwing monkeys. It's going to take a miracle to win!"]="We're up against pterrodax, sharks, teraptors, and bomb-throwing monkeys. It's going to take a miracle to win!"
G["We're warriors, $n. <Snort> Many and proud."]="Somos guerreiros, $n.<Resopla> Muitos e orgulhosos."
G["We're wastin' time here, professor! The orcs are slaughtering us!"]="We're wastin' time here, professor! The orcs are slaughtering us!"
G["We're watching you, meat vendor."]="Te vigilamos, carniceiro."
G["We're watching you, pie vendor."]="We're watching you, pie vendor."
G["We're way out of these guys league."]="Não estamos à altura desses tipos."
G["We're wearing him down.  Keep it up!"]="We're wearing him down.  Keep it up!"
G["We're with you Brann! Open it!"]="Estamos com você Brann! Abra!"
G["We're without our escort. I want to see interlocking fields of fire. Now, now!"]="Vamos sem escolta. Quero ver um campo de fogo cruzado. Agora, agora!"
G["We're... er, I mean the Light, is going to need a lot of gold, now more than ever.\n\nSpeaking of which, do you need any training?"]="Nós... eh, quero dizer a Luz, vai precisar um monte de ouro, agora mais do que nunca.\n\nE falando do tema, precisa treinamento?"
G["We're... we're alive!"]="Estamos... estamos vivos!"
G["We've Finally captured this tauren."]="Finalmente temos capturou ao tauren."
G["We've a duty out here, $g boy : girl;, to see to it that we don't let anyone surprise us.\n\nThat means proactive action!"]="We've a duty out here, $g boy : girl;, to see to it that we don't let anyone surprise us.\n\nThat means proactive action!"
G["We've almost consolidated our control over Sun's Reach.  If we manage to keep the harbor from getting any reinforcements we will certainly succeed.\n\nWe are $3238w percent done with our goal."]="We've almost consolidated our control over Sun's Reach.  If we manage to keep the harbor from getting any reinforcements we will certainly succeed.\n\nWe are $3238w percent done with our goal."
G["We've already lost the town... why have no reinforcements arrived from the Monastery?"]="Já temos perdido o povo... Por que não têm chegado reforços do Monastério?"
G["We've also secured air support for the operation and will be ready to deploy soon. If any of your men want to join the assault team, just send them to Delber."]="We've also secured air support for the operation and will be ready to deploy soon. If any of your men want to join the assault team, just send them to Delber."
G["We've beaten back the elementals, $n.  But they have left behind odd portals.\n\nThe King has gone through the portal, contrary to reason, to see where they lead. The portals have been reported in the Trade district, Cathedral district and Mage district\n\nI must remain here to see to the clean up of the city and the return of the citizens.  Go and help the King!"]="We've beaten back the elementals, $n.  But they have left behind odd portals.\n\nThe King has gone through the portal, contrary to reason, to see where they lead. The portals have been reported in the Trade district, Cathedral district and Mage district\n\nI must remain here to see to the clean up of the city and the return of the citizens.  Go and help the King!"
G["We've been at this post for days with no sleep. You've no idea how badly I want to just lie down."]="We've been at this post for days with no sleep. You've no idea how badly I want to just lie down."
G["We've been discovered. I know you're tired, but we cannot keep the Aspects waiting!"]="Nos têm descoberto. Sei que estão cansados, mas não podemos fazer esperar aos Aspectos!"
G["We've been discovered... Hurry $n, there's little time!"]="We've been discovered... Hurry $n, there's little time!"
G["We've been expecting you, $n. Now we have the upper hand."]="Te estávamos esperando, $n. Agora temos vantagem."
G["We've been fighting nonstop since the cataclysm. It'll be nice to get a rest, if a brief one."]="Não temos aparado de lutar desdo Cataclismo. Nos viria bem um descanso, embora seja breve."
G["We've been flying in this mist for hours, General. The crew grows... uneasy."]="Estamos voando na névoa há horas, General. A tripulação está... ficando inquieta."
G["We've been getting a lot of complaints about your yelling.  Keep it down."]="We've been getting a lot of complaints about your yelling.  Keep it down."
G["We've been getting reports about your noise.  Quiet down!"]="Temos recebido informes sobre o ruido que está fazendo. Baixa a voz!"
G["We've been getting some complaints about your pies.  Clean up your act!"]="We've been getting some complaints about your pies.  Clean up your act!"
G["We've been hearing reports of elemental disturbances around Azeroth for some time now.  Our sources indicate that the phenomenon is not entirely natural, but we haven't quite been able to determine the source.  We have some theories though, but nothing concrete.\n\nKeep your eye out for any suspicious elemental activity as you walk around.  If you find anything worthwhile, please let an Earthen Ring Emissary know.  You can find us in any capital city.\n\nKeep your eye open.  Trouble is brewing."]="We've been hearing reports of elemental disturbances around Azeroth for some time now.  Our sources indicate that the phenomenon is not entirely natural, but we haven't quite been able to determine the source.  We have some theories though, but nothing concrete.\n\nKeep your eye out for any suspicious elemental activity as you walk around.  If you find anything worthwhile, please let an Earthen Ring Emissary know.  You can find us in any capital city.\n\nKeep your eye open.  Trouble is brewing."
G["We've been lookin' all over Kun-Lai Summit fer a place that matches what ye saw in that mogu's memory, and we finally found the Korune's hidin' place."]="We've been lookin' all over Kun-Lai Summit fer a place that matches what ye saw in that mogu's memory, and we finally found the Korune's hidin' place."
G["We've been over this before. Only a focused assault upon Deatholme will meet with success. These other targets are distractions that we can ill afford. I suggest that you inform your Captain Helios that he is to leave off his campaign against the Shadowpine trolls and focus solely on the Scourge."]="We've been over this before. Only a focused assault upon Deatholme will meet with success. These other targets are distractions that we can ill afford. I suggest that you inform your Captain Helios that he is to leave off his campaign against the Shadowpine trolls and focus solely on the Scourge."
G["We've been searching for days. All we have found are dusty scrolls and broken statues."]="We've been searching for days. All we have found are dusty scrolls and broken statues."
G["We've been shot out of the sky!"]="Céus! Fomos abatidos!"
G["We've been so wrapped up in this war, some of us forgot to make time for love."]="Estamos tão envolvidos nessa guerra que algum de nós esquecemos de dar tempo ao amor."
G["We've been spotted! Make ready!"]="Nos têm visto! Preparem-se!"
G["We've been stranded here for days. We are stretched to the breaking point, but trying our best to keep spirits high."]="We've been stranded here for days. We are stretched to the breaking point, but trying our best to keep spirits high."
G["We've broken through the prison gate! The way into Dalaran is clear! Now we finally put an end to the Nexus War!"]="We've broken through the prison gate! The way into Dalaran is clear! Now we finally put an end to the Nexus War!"
G["We've captured the armory, $n.  Let's not rest on our laurels, however.  The Legion sure will not."]="We've captured the armory, $n.  Let's not rest on our laurels, however.  The Legion sure will not."
G["We've cleared the way to Kil'jaeden! Can you transport me close to the Sunwell?"]="Temos abriu o caminho até Kil'jaeden! Pode teletransportarme perto da Nascente do Sol?"
G["We've come to end your reign, Illidan. My people, and all of Outland, shall be free!"]="Viemos acabar com seu reinado, Illidan. Meu povo e toda Terralém serão livres!"
G["We've come to the Ruuan Weald to see if we can reestablish the balance of nature to these mountains.\n\nThe interference of the arakkoa and the wyrmcult is making this a difficult task, however.\n\nLuckily, there are those like you and Samia that are willing to lend us a hand."]="We've come to the Ruuan Weald to see if we can reestablish the balance of nature to these mountains.\n\nThe interference of the arakkoa and the wyrmcult is making this a difficult task, however.\n\nLuckily, there are those like you and Samia that are willing to lend us a hand."
G["We've come to try to help, but it seems that their favor for you does not yet extend to us."]="Viemos tentar ajudar, mas parece que o favor deles por você ainda não se estende a nós."
G["We've committed no wrongs against the city or its king..."]="Não temos cometido nenhuma falta contra a cidade ou seu rei..."
G["We've committed no wrongs against the city or the Horde..."]="Não temos cometido nenhuma falta contra a cidade ou a Horda..."
G["We've defeated Valduran and we'll fell his colossus."]="Temos derrotou a Valduran e acabaremos com o seu colosso."
G["We've delayed long enough. Let us take the battle to this servant of Ragnaros immediately."]="Já demoramos o suficiente. Vamos começar a batalha com este servo de Ragnaros imediatamente."
G["We've destroyed hundreds of elementals, $n, and now they seem to be gaining strength!  Our guards are holding firm, but I'm sure they could use your support.  King Varian Wrynn is leading the defense in the Trade district, Lady Jaina Proudmoore is helping defend the Mage district and Archbishop Benedictus is holding firm at the Cathedral of the Light.\n\nNo matter where you go in Stormwind, $n, you will be more than helpful."]="We've destroyed hundreds of elementals, $n, and now they seem to be gaining strength!  Our guards are holding firm, but I'm sure they could use your support.  King Varian Wrynn is leading the defense in the Trade district, Lady Jaina Proudmoore is helping defend the Mage district and Archbishop Benedictus is holding firm at the Cathedral of the Light.\n\nNo matter where you go in Stormwind, $n, you will be more than helpful."
G["We've done all we can here. Farewell Gao-Ran. I will send more men as soon as I am able."]="We've done all we can here. Farewell Gao-Ran. I will send more men as soon as I am able."
G["We've done all we can here. Let's get back to Thundermar!"]="Temos feito o que temos pedido. Voltemos a Bramal!"
G["We've done it!"]="O temos conseguido!"
G["We've done it!  Victory to the Alliance!"]="O temos conseguido! Vitória para a Aliança!"
G["We've done it! Come get the cask."]="O logramos! Venha a pelo tonel."
G["We've done it! Good work, lads!"]="O temos conseguido! Bom trabalho, camaradas!"
G["We've done it! Meet me back by Jer'kai above the Grim Totem camp."]="O temos conseguido! Nos vemos ao lado a Jer'kai, perto do acampamento do Totem Sinistro."
G["We've done it! The control room is breached!"]="Conseguido! Temos aberto a salão de controle!"
G["We've done it! WE'VE DONE IT!"]="O conseguimos! O CONSEGUIMOS!"
G["We've done it! We won!"]="O temos conseguido! Temos ganhou!"
G["We've done it! We're victorious!"]="O temos conseguido! Temos ganhou!"
G["We've done it! We've done it! We've driven them off!"]="We've done it! We've done it! We've driven them off!"
G["We've done it, $g lad : lass;! The Alliance and the Horde have completed gathering everything that we think we'll need for the Ahn'Qiraj War. Right now the final goods are being taken over to Cenarion Hold in Silithus and all of it will arrive within $2113w days. After that, some brave $g hero : heroine; is going to need to ring the Scarab Gong with the Scepter of the Shifting Sands to open the gates to Ahn'Qiraj. When those gates open, the war begins!"]="O temos conseguido,$gmuchacho: moça;! Tanto a Aliança como a Horda temos reuniu tudo o materiais que consideramos necessário para a guerra de Ahn'Qiraj. Toda a mercadoria está de caminho ao Forte Cenariano em Silithus e o último carregamento chegará em menos de $2113w dias. Depois, $galgún: alguma; corajoso terá que fazer soar o gongo do Besouro com o cetro do Mar de Dunas para abrir as portões de Ahn'Qiraj. Quando as portões se abran, dará início a guerra!"
G["We've done it, $g lad : lass;! The Alliance and the Horde have completed gathering everything that we think we'll need for the Ahn'Qiraj War. Right now the final goods are being taken over to Cenarion Hold in Silithus and the last of it will arrive within a day. After that, some brave $g hero : heroine; is going to need to ring the Scarab Gong with the Scepter of the Shifting Sands to open the gates to Ahn'Qiraj. When those gates open, the war begins!"]="O temos conseguido,$gmuchacho: moça;! Tanto a Aliança como a Horda temos reuniu tudo o materiais que consideramos necessário para a guerra de Ahn'Qiraj. Toda a mercadoria está de caminho ao Forte Cenariano em Silithus e o último carregamento chegará em menos de um dia. Depois, $galgún: alguma; corajoso terá que fazer soar o gongo do Besouro com o cetro do Mar de Dunas para abrir as portões de Ahn'Qiraj. Quando as portões se abran, dará início a guerra!"
G["We've done it, $n.  Mar'nah has learned how to transmute very special gems.  And I've learned how to work them."]="We've done it, $n.  Mar'nah has learned how to transmute very special gems.  And I've learned how to work them."
G["We've done it, $n.  With Sun's Reach under our control we are but mere moments away from absolute victory."]="O temos conseguido, $n. Com Tramo do Sol sob nosso controle estamos a um passo da vitória absoluta."
G["We've done it, lads! We've taken the pinnacle from the Scourge! Report to Father Gustav at once and tell him the good news! We're gonna get to buildin' and settin' up! Go!"]="We've done it, lads! We've taken the pinnacle from the Scourge! Report to Father Gustav at once and tell him the good news! We're gonna get to buildin' and settin' up! Go!"
G["We've failed, $n!!"]="Temos fracassado, $n!"
G["We've finally captured this tauren."]="Finalmente temos capturou ao tauren."
G["We've finally got what we came here for. I just wish we'd hired $n right away and saved you the embarassment, Jaxon."]="We've finally got what we came here for. I just wish we'd hired $n right away and saved you the embarassment, Jaxon."
G["We've found him! But this tempest he's become... I'll try to calm it - to reach him somehow."]="We've found him! But this tempest he's become... I'll try to calm it - to reach him somehow."
G["We've found it!"]="O temos encontrado!"
G["We've found the hiding place of the Sha of Hatred."]="We've found the hiding place of the Sha of Hatred."
G["We've gathered up some items from this time period. I hope this helps!"]="E conseguido algum itens deste tempo. Espero que sirva de ajuda!"
G["We've got Aranas!  Fire at will!"]="Temos a Aranas! Fogo a discreção!"
G["We've got a $c inbound!"]="Se aproxima $gun: uma; $c!"
G["We've got a live one."]="Temos um vivo."
G["We've got a survivor inbound!"]="Está chegando um sobrevivente!"
G["We've got a whole list of people who want to fight, you know."]="Temos uma pronta cheia de gente O que quer lutar, sabe?"
G["We've got an eye on you, pie vendor."]="We've got an eye on you, pie vendor."
G["We've got another $r flying in!"]="We've got another $r flying in!"
G["We've got hammers, we've got gnolls.\n\nIf you've got a token, you can use the hammer to whack some gnolls."]="Temos martelos e temos gnolls.\n\nSe tem uma ficha, você pode usar o martelo e aporrear algum gnolls."
G["We've got him now!"]="O temos!"
G["We've got no time to waste. This is a really long run! Cover me!"]="Não temos tempo que perder. Um recorrido muito largo! Cúbreme!"
G["We've got orders from the harbinger to pick up some elekk for the base."]="Temos ordens do Arauto de capturar algum elekk para a base."
G["We've got our work cut out for us, $p."]="Nosso objetivo está claro, $p."
G["We've got the explosives  in the furnace room.  Just hold them off now!"]="We've got the explosives  in the furnace room.  Just hold them off now!"
G["We've got to do something about this!"]="Temos que fazer algo com isto!"
G["We've got to get our people out of here, $n! The key is to get them to drink plenty of Kaja'Cola Zero-One!"]="We've got to get our people out of here, $n! The key is to get them to drink plenty of Kaja'Cola Zero-One!"
G["We've got to get out of here!"]="Temos que sair daqui!"
G["We've got to get the brew to safety. My brews are the lifeblood of this entire town!"]="Devemos levar a cerveja a um lugar certo. Meu cerveja é a essência de toda esta aldeia!"
G["We've got to get those supply crates back!"]="Temos que recuperar essas caixas de suprimentos!"
G["We've got to light that signal fire. Without reinforcements, they'll destroy the gate!"]="We've got to light that signal fire. Without reinforcements, they'll destroy the gate!"
G["We've got to secure this beach stronghold. We let the Horde have a foothold here, all of Pandaria is going to look like Theramore."]="We've got to secure this beach stronghold. We let the Horde have a foothold here, all of Pandaria is going to look like Theramore."
G["We've got to stop them!"]="We've got to stop them!"
G["We've got what we need. Clear out. We'll hit them again elsewhere."]="Temos o que precisamos de. Vamos. Lhes atacaremos novamente em algum outro lugar."
G["We've got you covered, now fallback!"]="We've got you covered, now fallback!"
G["We've got you now, $n!"]="Agora te temos, $n!"
G["We've got your back, $n!"]="We've got your back, $n!"
G["We've got your back."]="We've got your back."
G["We've got your back... and a hefty supply of vehicles to fix up too apparently."]="Te temos você coberto... e, pelo visto, a um bom monte de veículos esperando reparações."
G["We've got your hatchlings. You better not attack us if you know what's good for you!"]="We've got your hatchlings. You better not attack us if you know what's good for you!"
G["We've got your sap -- come and get it!"]="We've got your sap -- come and get it!"
G["We've gotta find out what the Qiraji are feeding those monsters! Look at the size of 'em!"]="Temos que descobrir o que os Qiraji estão alimentando aqueles monstros! Veja o tamanho deles!"
G["We've gotta stop giving the recruits those red shirts. They're just moving targets in them."]="Vamos deixar de dar camisetas vermelhas aos novos. Parecem uma diana andante."
G["We've gotten complaints that your fruit is not as fresh as you claim."]="We've gotten complaints that your fruit is not as fresh as you claim."
G["We've had no luck tracking down the missing black dragon egg.\n\nHave you discovered anything, $n?"]="We've had no luck tracking down the missing black dragon egg.\n\nHave you discovered anything, $n?"
G["We've had too many setbacks along the way: Hellfire Citadel, Fallen Sky Ridge, Firewing Point...  Prince Kael'thas will tolerate no further delays.  I will tolerate nothing other than complete success!"]="We've had too many setbacks along the way: Hellfire Citadel, Fallen Sky Ridge, Firewing Point...  Prince Kael'thas will tolerate no further delays.  I will tolerate nothing other than complete success!"
G["We've heard reports of people getting sick off of bad meat.  We're watching you, meat vendor!"]="Temos recebido informes de que há gente que se tem posto enferma pelo seu carne podrida. Te vigilamos, carniceiro!"
G["We've heard that you are selling some bad apples."]="Temos ouvido que vender manzanas podridas."
G["We've held them off for now.  Hop in the port-side cannon and help out our other ships!"]="We've held them off for now.  Hop in the port-side cannon and help out our other ships!"
G["We've hit the jackpot in this place!"]="Nos tem tocado o Gordo com este lugar!"
G["We've important work to do, $n.  Let us attack our enemies while their guard is down.  Let us show them that sin'dorei vengeance never forgets nor forgives."]="We've important work to do, $n.  Let us attack our enemies while their guard is down.  Let us show them that sin'dorei vengeance never forgets nor forgives."
G["We've just arrived here and already we've buried too many of our friends and comrades."]="Acabamos de chegar aqui e já enterramos muitos de nossos amigos e camaradas."
G["We've just graduated from the Tian Monastery, in the Jade Forest. Have you been there before?\n\nWe're not students anymore. We're on our first quest - the quest to find the Hidden Master."]="We've just graduated from the Tian Monastery, in the Jade Forest. Have you been there before?\n\nWe're not students anymore. We're on our first quest - the quest to find the Hidden Master."
G["We've just located her here, in the caverns beneath Karazhan. Fearful for her life, she is researching arcane secrets buried beneath the foundation."]="A temos localizado aqui, nas caverna situadas baixo Karazhan. Temerosa pelo seu vida, investigue os segredos arcanos enterrados baixo os cimentos."
G["We've just sent another inexperienced squad into Nagrand. Might you offer a prayer for them?"]="Acabamos de enviar um esquadrão de novatos a Nagrand. Poderia orar por eles?"
G["We've killed dozens of naga to get this far, but they still keep coming.  What will it take to escape this wretched cavern?"]="Matamos dezenas de nagas para chegar até aqui, mas elas continuam chegando. O que é preciso para escapar desta caverna miserável?"
G["We've killed your captors. You're free to go."]="We've killed your captors. You're free to go."
G["We've located the mark, commander. Ya-six and I have been separated. Requesting backup."]="Localizamos a marca, comandante. Já-seis e eu fomos separados. Solicitando backup."
G["We've long held out hope of redeeming the Earthwarden and his children. At some point, we must have the wisdom to realize that no amount of redemption can atone for the destruction these dragons are unleashing upon the world.\n\nAt some point, we are forced to intervene."]="We've long held out hope of redeeming the Earthwarden and his children. At some point, we must have the wisdom to realize that no amount of redemption can atone for the destruction these dragons are unleashing upon the world.\n\nAt some point, we are forced to intervene."
G["We've lost Undercity. Nothing but demons and Putress' apothecaries left there..."]="We've lost Undercity. Nothing but demons and Putress' apothecaries left there..."
G["We've lost a few good people up here already. I'm beginning to doubt that this place is worth our attention."]="Já perdemos algumas pessoas boas aqui em cima. Estou começando a duvidar que este lugar mereça nossa atenção."
G["We've lost a good many of our wind riders on scouting missions to the west. The Scourge is ruthless in their assault against any would-be spies.\n\nFortunately, I've come up with a solution that only risks the life of the rider. It's seen a 30% survival rate to those being ferried across the Plains of Nasam. That's a 30% improvement over when we were using wind riders!"]="We've lost a good many of our wind riders on scouting missions to the west. The Scourge is ruthless in their assault against any would-be spies.\n\nFortunately, I've come up with a solution that only risks the life of the rider. It's seen a 30% survival rate to those being ferried across the Plains of Nasam. That's a 30% improvement over when we were using wind riders!"
G["We've lost many mountaineers to this freakish storm, or the trolls slithering about in it."]="We've lost many mountaineers to this freakish storm, or the trolls slithering about in it."
G["We've made it this far into the Slag Pit, $n.  Now it's time to finish the job."]="Temos chegado até aqui, na Fosso da Escória, $n. Agora toca terminar o trabalho."
G["We've made so many sacrifices, and our fight lingers on. These battles have a way of wearing away at my spirit..."]="We've made so many sacrifices, and our fight lingers on. These battles have a way of wearing away at my spirit..."
G["We've managed to squeeze through Thunder Bluff twice now!"]="We've managed to squeeze through Thunder Bluff twice now!"
G["We've mitigated the explosive instability of the gas by putting it under IMMENSE pressure."]="We've mitigated the explosive instability of the gas by putting it under IMMENSE pressure."
G["We've moved from bloodstained roads to roads illuminated by crystals."]="Temos passado de caminhos manchados de sangue a caminhos iluminados por cristais."
G["We've moved the replacement vehicles up already so that you can take the thing down this time. Good luck!"]="We've moved the replacement vehicles up already so that you can take the thing down this time. Good luck!"
G["We've only got a limited amount of pyrite stocked, use it sparingly."]="We've only got a limited amount of pyrite stocked, use it sparingly."
G["We've performed Niuzao's errand. Now it's time to get back to some real investigation."]="Já temos feito o recado de Niuzao. Agora é o momentos de realizar uma investigação de verdade."
G["We've pushed them back to their ship.  Swing over and steal their explosives to blow it to smithereens!"]="Os temos feito recuar ao seu navio. É o momentos idóneo para roubar seus explosivos e fazê-os saltar pelos aires!"
G["We've pushed them back to their ship.  Swing over and use some of their explosives to blow it to smithereens!"]="We've pushed them back to their ship.  Swing over and use some of their explosives to blow it to smithereens!"
G["We've recently heard word of a creature of immense power being summoned near the Vector Coil. Fear not, should anything threaten the town, we will give our lives to protect it."]="Recentemente, ouvimos falar de uma criatura de imenso poder sendo convocada perto da Bobina de Vetor. Não tema, se alguma coisa ameaçar a cidade, daremos nossas vidas para protegê-a."
G["We've retaken the Idol of Akil'darah thanks to you, $n! Come over here and I'll take you deep into Jintha'Alor on the winds of her blessin'!"]="We've retaken the Idol of Akil'darah thanks to you, $n! Come over here and I'll take you deep into Jintha'Alor on the winds of her blessin'!"
G["We've rigged the powder barrels in every ship."]="Temos pronto barris de pólvora em todos os barcos."
G["We've secured the surface! Operation: Gnomeregan is proceeding with 93% efficiency...well done, everyone!"]="A superfície é nossa! A operação Gnomeregan avanza com um... 93% de efectividade... Bem feito!"
G["We've seen the results of your 'research' before. I'll deliver this package to Orgrimmar for study."]="We've seen the results of your 'research' before. I'll deliver this package to Orgrimmar for study."
G["We've softened them up. They run and hide like rats from the might of the Horde. NO QUARTER!"]="We've softened them up. They run and hide like rats from the might of the Horde. NO QUARTER!"
G["We've spared no expense for the crowd, folks! We're determined to kill $n at any cost, for you, the viewer! Taken all the way from the hidden jungle of Un'goro Crater, cower in fear at...KING KRAW!"]="We've spared no expense for the crowd, folks! We're determined to kill $n at any cost, for you, the viewer! Taken all the way from the hidden jungle of Un'goro Crater, cower in fear at...KING KRAW!"
G["We've stirred up a hornet's nest, $n!\n\nI hope you have a plan for finishing this. Krogg's warriors are tearing up the dragonmaw, but we're taking heavy losses for every inch of ground..."]="We've stirred up a hornet's nest, $n!\n\nI hope you have a plan for finishing this. Krogg's warriors are tearing up the dragonmaw, but we're taking heavy losses for every inch of ground..."
G["We've sworn to do our very best to protect the passengers of The Bravery. The sea lane between Rut'theran Village and Stormwind Harbor must remain safe."]="Juramos fazer o nosso melhor para proteger os passageiros do The Bravery. A faixa marítima entre a vila de Rut'theran e o porto de Ventobravo deve permanecer certa."
G["We've taken control of the temple and we're containing as much of the damage as we can.  Go inside and speak to Maruut; he's in charge."]="We've taken control of the temple and we're containing as much of the damage as we can.  Go inside and speak to Maruut; he's in charge."
G["We've taken some strange readings from nether ribbons."]="We've taken some strange readings from nether ribbons."
G["We've taken the Sanctum at Sun's Reach!  Send word back to Shattrath, we make our move now!"]="We've taken the Sanctum at Sun's Reach!  Send word back to Shattrath, we make our move now!"
G["We've taken the harbor!  The enemy has been driven away.  Sun's Reach is ours!"]="Temos tomado o porto! O inimigo foi expulso. Tramo do Sol é nosso!"
G["We've taken the harbor, and this ship is a nice bonus. Too bad she's not yet sea-worthy.\n\nIn the meantime, I've been instructed to oversee the disruption of the naga on the Greengill Coast.\n\nThink you can help me out?"]="Temos tomado o porto e este navio é um bonito extra. Uma pena que ainda não se possa levar ao mar.\n\nEnquanto, se me organizado que supervise o desbaratamento dos nagas na Costa Branquia Verde.\n\nAcha que pode me ajudar?"
G["We've told you all there is to know!  Do you forget that many of us used to be trusted followers of Kael'thas?"]="We've told you all there is to know!  Do you forget that many of us used to be trusted followers of Kael'thas?"
G["We've tracked the recent disappearances in Durotar to this abandoned section of Ragefire."]="Temos seguido o rastro das recentes desaparições em Durotar até esta zona abandonadas de Sima Ígneas."
G["We've wrested control of The Oculus from the forces of Malygos.  You're not getting any lighter, little one.  My wings itch for the open sky."]="We've wrested control of The Oculus from the forces of Malygos.  You're not getting any lighter, little one.  My wings itch for the open sky."
G["We, his sworn servants, do his bidding and enforce his iron-rule. Cut off from the energies of his fiery realm, Ragnaros is but a shadow of his true self. However, he has more than enough strength to be your end."]="We, his sworn servants, do his bidding and enforce his iron-rule. Cut off from the energies of his fiery realm, Ragnaros is but a shadow of his true self. However, he has more than enough strength to be your end."
G["We, the Alliance, will prevail!"]="Somos a Aliança e venceremos!"
G["We, the Sons of Lothar, have remained here ever since - fighting... dying... praying that a day like today would come - a day when the Portal would open and our brothers would come to deliver us home.\n\nOverjoyed as we are, duty still calls. There is much to be done before we can depart this world and take our rest."]="We, the Sons of Lothar, have remained here ever since - fighting... dying... praying that a day like today would come - a day when the Portal would open and our brothers would come to deliver us home.\n\nOverjoyed as we are, duty still calls. There is much to be done before we can depart this world and take our rest."
G["We, the Zandalarian trolls, traveled here from distant islands, for we cannot ignore the threat that now faces our world."]="We, the Zandalarian trolls, traveled here from distant islands, for we cannot ignore the threat that now faces our world."
G["We, the Zandalarian trolls, traveled here from distant islands, for we cannot ignore the threat that now faces our world.\n\nThe leader of our expedition, Molthor, brought us to the Yojamba Isle, along the northern coasts of Stranglethorn, and even now recruits brave heroes to venture into the ancient troll city... Zul'Gurub."]="We, the Zandalarian trolls, traveled here from distant islands, for we cannot ignore the threat that now faces our world.\n\nThe leader of our expedition, Molthor, brought us to the Yojamba Isle, along the northern coasts of Stranglethorn, and even now recruits brave heroes to venture into the ancient troll city... Zul'Gurub."
G["We... We have only been told that the \"Crimson Dawn\" is an awakening. You... You see, the Light speaks to the High General. It is the Light..."]="Somente... Somente nos têm dito que o \"Alba Carmesim\" é um despertar. Verá... a Luz lhe fala à Alta Geral. É a Luz..."
G["We... are superior! How could this... be?"]="Somos... superior! Como pediu... passar?"
G["We... are... endless..."]="Somos... infinitos..."
G["We... are... lost."]="Estamos... perdidos."
G["We... did it..."]="O... O conseguimos..."
G["We...are...investigating."]="Estamos... investigando."
G["We? More like what are YOU going to tell Forba!"]="Nós? Melhor que lhe vai dizer VOCÊ a Forba!"
G["Weak $C! You are no match for the Stonesplinter Tribe!"]="$C, mequetrefe! Não está à altura da tribo dos Rompecantos!"
G["Weak slickies are good for nuthin'!"]="Mandukos fracos são inútiles!"
G["Weak!"]=" (Fraco)"
G["Weak, little bugs!  Your souls aren't worth eating..."]="Weak, little bugs!  Your souls aren't worth eating..."
G["Weak, pitiful creatures. Hardly worthy of being called a legion."]="Weak, pitiful creatures. Hardly worthy of being called a legion."
G["Weak-minded fool!"]="Louco descerebrado!"
G["Weak."]=" (Fraco)"
G["Weak. How predictable."]="Weak. How predictable."
G["Weakling!"]="Debilucho!"
G["Weakling."]="Debilucho."
G["Weaklings!"]="Fracos!"
G["Weaklings! Fools! You cannot stand before the Bloodseeker!"]="Weaklings! Fools! You cannot stand before the Bloodseeker!"
G["Weaklings... let me make room for our guests."]="Vermes... deixem lugar a nossos convidados."
G["Weakness will not be tolerated. Only strength prevails!"]="Não toleraremos a fraqueza! Somente a força prevalece."
G["Weakness. These dwarves are nothing!"]="Que fraqueza. Estes anões não são nada!"
G["Weakness... Fit for only the lowliest of undeath. To the pit!"]="Weakness... Fit for only the lowliest of undeath. To the pit!"
G["Weapon Master"]="Mestre das Armas"
G["Weaponized sharks?  Why didn't I think of that!?"]="Tiburones com armas? Como não se me havia acontecido?!"
G["Weapons"]="Armas"
G["Weapons Trainer"]="Treinador de Armas"
G["Weapons are merely a convenience for a warrior of my skill!"]="As armas são somente uma nimiedade para um guerreiro de meu altura!"
G["Weapons out!"]="Weapons out!"
G["Weapons ready!"]="Armas preparadas!"
G["Weapons systems offline."]="Sistemas de armamentos desconectados."
G["Weapons systems primed."]="Sistemas de armamentos preparados."
G["Weapons up, you magnificent monsters! They're about to charge."]="Weapons up, you magnificent monsters! They're about to charge."
G["Weapons...armor...these are the keys to victory. Any warrior, no matter how strong, is essentially defenseless without them.\n\nI have crafted many a legend in my day, $r. You will find nothing like them in all of Azeroth. They are the key to my brethren's success."]="Armas... Armadura... São as chaves da vitória. Todos os guerreiros, inclusive os mais fortes, estão indefensos sem elas.\n\nEm meus tempos creé muitas lendas, $r. Não verá nada igual em tudo Azeroth. São a importante do êxito de meus irmãos."
G["Weary of one of your demonic charges? Hoping for one with a more pleasing name?\nFor a price, I can assist you in the obliteration of a current minion so that you may summon an entirely new one..."]="Está $gcansado: cansada; de carregar com os seus lacaios demoníacos? Desearías ter um com um nome mais agradável?\n\nPor um módico preço, posso ajudar você a eliminar ao seu lacaio atual para que possa evocar a um totalmente novo..."
G["Weed whacking is hard work."]="Weed whacking is hard work."
G["Weee!"]="Ueeee!"
G["Weee! I'm a girl again!"]="Chachi! Vuelvo a ser uma garota!"
G["Weee! Shinies all over this place!\n\nTake a look at what I found diggin' right here...\n\nIt's a breathin' hat!"]="Weee! Shinies all over this place!\n\nTake a look at what I found diggin' right here...\n\nIt's a breathin' hat!"
G["Weeee! I'm alive, I'm alive, I'm alive! Oh, I hope it's not too forward of me to tell you that I think I love you all and I hope I can find my bag because you certainly deserve a little something extra, you know, for the effort and all that you must have went through to save me..."]="Weeee! I'm alive, I'm alive, I'm alive! Oh, I hope it's not too forward of me to tell you that I think I love you all and I hope I can find my bag because you certainly deserve a little something extra, you know, for the effort and all that you must have went through to save me..."
G["Weeeeee!"]="Ueee!"
G["Weeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeee!"]="Ueeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeee!"
G["Weep SNOT!?"]="Weep SNOT!?"
G["Weep for Gilneas!"]="Weep for Gilneas!"
G["Weezil Slipshadow - master of disguise!"]="Weezil Slipshadow - mestre do disfarce!"
G["Wei, are these friends of yours?"]="Wei, are these friends of yours?"
G["Welcome $c, to my humble retreat.  I find this place very relaxing and I have always loved being at home in Dalaran.  Sometimes though, it can be a lonely place...  such a lonely place."]="Welcome $c, to my humble retreat.  I find this place very relaxing and I have always loved being at home in Dalaran.  Sometimes though, it can be a lonely place...  such a lonely place."
G["Welcome $n, dragonfriend."]="$gBienvenido: Bem-vinda; $n, $gamigo: amiga; de dragão."
G["Welcome $n. Come, have a seat."]="Onda, $n. Siéntate sem medo."
G["Welcome $p, as a member of the Shado-Pan!"]="$p, Te damos a boas-vindas, membro do Shadopan."
G["Welcome Back, $n!"]="Onda outra vez, $n!"
G["Welcome Friend.  Keep your head down and hold on tight!"]="Dou a você a boas-vindas, colega. Mantenha a cabeça agachada e agárrate bem!"
G["Welcome Traveler! Help yourself to some ale."]="Welcome Traveler! Help yourself to some ale."
G["Welcome aboard $c.  Take a load off and enjoy the trip.  Aboard \"The Purple Princess\" we want you to relax.  We have vending machines down below if there's anything you might need while aboard."]="Dou a você a boas-vindas a bordo, $c. Relájate e aproveite do viagem. A bordo do \"Princesa púrpura\" queremos que te relagens. Temos máquinas de refrescos e comida baixo por se você precisa algo enquanto estas a bordo."
G["Welcome aboard the Feathermoon Ferry.  We travel between Feathermoon Stronghold and the Forgotten Coast looking for those lost at sea.  The sea can be a dangerous place if you are not prepared.\n\nIf you need to get prepared, please speak to our provisioners.  They are more than happy to help you."]="Welcome aboard the Feathermoon Ferry.  We travel between Feathermoon Stronghold and the Forgotten Coast looking for those lost at sea.  The sea can be a dangerous place if you are not prepared.\n\nIf you need to get prepared, please speak to our provisioners.  They are more than happy to help you."
G["Welcome aboard the Maiden's Fancy. It should be smooth sailing all the way to port."]="Bem-vindo a bordo do Maiden's Fancy. Deve ser fácil navegar até o porto."
G["Welcome aboard the Skyfire.  You ready to chase down the end of the world?"]="Bem-vindos a bordo do Abrasacielos. Prontos para chegar até o fim do mundo?"
G["Welcome aboard the Skyfire. You ready to chase down the end of the world?"]="Bem-vindo a bordo do Skyfire. Você está pronto para perseguir o fim do mundo?"
G["Welcome aboard the Thundercaller!\n\nDon't pay attention to the people that complain about explosions or the like.  I mean really, everyone makes mistakes.  We should cut people some slack.\n\nLook, I'd understand if a captain managed to crash his ship 22 or 23 times... But anything less than that isn't worth mentioning."]="Welcome aboard the Thundercaller!\n\nDon't pay attention to the people that complain about explosions or the like.  I mean really, everyone makes mistakes.  We should cut people some slack.\n\nLook, I'd understand if a captain managed to crash his ship 22 or 23 times... But anything less than that isn't worth mentioning."
G["Welcome aboard the Zephyr, the smoothest ride you're likely to get across the Barrens. Sit back and enjoy the flight, eh, kid? Ain't nothing like that sweet, dry air mixed with the scent of oil."]="Bem-vindo a bordo do Zephyr, o passeio mais tranquilo que você provavelmente atravessará os Sertões. Sente-se e aproveite o vôo, hein, garoto? Não é nada parecido com aquele ar doce e seco misturado com o cheiro de óleo."
G["Welcome aboard... Tillers!"]="Welcome aboard... Tillers!"
G["Welcome back to Thundermar, $n. Fighting continues all across the shire, but with Alliance help I think we can gain the upper hand."]="Welcome back to Thundermar, $n. Fighting continues all across the shire, but with Alliance help I think we can gain the upper hand."
G["Welcome back to the Cradle of Chi-Ji, friend! I am glad to see that you've returned."]="Dou a você a boas-vindas novamente à Cuna de Chi-Ji! fico feliz em que tenha voltado."
G["Welcome back to the Great Forge, $n. Ye come to visit an old Dwarf or do ye think yer ready for the next step in yer training?"]="Dou a você a boas-vindas novamente à Grande Fundição, $n. Veio a visitar a um velho anão ou acha que já pode seguir com o seguinte nível do seu treinamento?"
G["Welcome back to the greatest show in Outland, my friend!  It is truly a delight to see you once again.\n\nPlease, step right up and once more take in all we have to offer.  Be sure to check around, as we are always adding new and exciting things to the Darkmoon Faire!  Amaze at wonders old and new that we have uncovered!  We continue to spare no expense in bringing you excitement that children of all ages will delight in!"]="Welcome back to the greatest show in Outland, my friend!  It is truly a delight to see you once again.\n\nPlease, step right up and once more take in all we have to offer.  Be sure to check around, as we are always adding new and exciting things to the Darkmoon Faire!  Amaze at wonders old and new that we have uncovered!  We continue to spare no expense in bringing you excitement that children of all ages will delight in!"
G["Welcome back to the greatest show on Azeroth, my friend!  It is truly a delight to see you once again.\n\nPlease, step right up and once more take in all we have to offer.  Be sure to check around, as we are always adding new and exciting things to the Darkmoon Faire!  Amaze at wonders old and new that we have uncovered!  We continue to spare no expense in bringing you excitement that children of all ages will delight in!"]="Welcome back to the greatest show on Azeroth, my friend!  It is truly a delight to see you once again.\n\nPlease, step right up and once more take in all we have to offer.  Be sure to check around, as we are always adding new and exciting things to the Darkmoon Faire!  Amaze at wonders old and new that we have uncovered!  We continue to spare no expense in bringing you excitement that children of all ages will delight in!"
G["Welcome back to the waking world, child."]="$gBienvenido: Bem-vinda; novamente ao mundo consciente, $ghijo: filha;."
G["Welcome back! What news, $n?"]="$GBienvenido: Bem-vinda; outra vez! Que notícia traz, $n?"
G["Welcome back, $n!"]="$gBienvenido: Bem-vinda; novamente, $n!"
G["Welcome back, $n! How goes your training?\n\nOur trainees have missed you dearly... though I must say that they appreciate not having to spar with you anymore."]="Welcome back, $n! How goes your training?\n\nOur trainees have missed you dearly... though I must say that they appreciate not having to spar with you anymore."
G["Welcome back, $n! I see you found our missing guides!"]="Welcome back, $n! I see you found our missing guides!"
G["Welcome back, $n."]="$gBienvenido: Bem-vinda; novamente, $n."
G["Welcome back, $n.  You were fortunate.  Krennan's treatment doesn't always work this well on people who've had the Curse as long as you."]="Welcome back, $n.  You were fortunate.  Krennan's treatment doesn't always work this well on people who've had the Curse as long as you."
G["Welcome back, $n.  You've proven a worthy ally against Ragnaros and your presence is always welcome among us."]="Welcome back, $n.  You've proven a worthy ally against Ragnaros and your presence is always welcome among us."
G["Welcome back, $n. Have I mentioned how good it is to have someone to talk to?\n\nAlright then, let's get down to business. What's next that we have to do?"]="$GBienvenido: Bem-vinda; novamente, $n. Já te disse o muito que fico feliz em ter a alguém com quem falar?\n\nBom, pois agora vamos colocar mãos à obra. Que é o seguinte que temos que fazer?"
G["Welcome back, $n. I've been eagerly anticipating your return."]="Welcome back, $n. I've been eagerly anticipating your return."
G["Welcome back, $n. That took longer than expected. Learn anything useful?"]="fico feliz em ver você novamente, $n. Você levado mais tempo do esperado. Tem aprendido algo útil?"
G["Welcome back, bruiser. You up for a go?"]="Welcome back, bruiser. You up for a go?"
G["Welcome back, champion of the Horde! How fares the battle along the coast?"]="É sempre bom ver heróis da Horda! Como vai a batalha na costa?"
G["Welcome back, champion!"]="Dou a você a boas-vindas!"
G["Welcome back, champion."]="Welcome back, champion."
G["Welcome back, friend! It feels like it's been years since you helped me whip up my first Noggenfogger Elixer.\n\nNow I'm running the whole city! Those things still sell like crazy."]="Welcome back, friend! It feels like it's been years since you helped me whip up my first Noggenfogger Elixer.\n\nNow I'm running the whole city! Those things still sell like crazy."
G["Welcome back, hero of the Alliance! How fares the battle along the coast?"]="É sempre bom ver heróis da Aliança! Como vai a batalha na costa?"
G["Welcome child to my humble valley.  It is my goal in life to build a beverage so delicious it will humble any other experience your taste buds have encountered.\n\nMy research is on the verge of something phenominal, that no pandaren can claim to be even close to achieving."]="Welcome child to my humble valley.  It is my goal in life to build a beverage so delicious it will humble any other experience your taste buds have encountered.\n\nMy research is on the verge of something phenominal, that no pandaren can claim to be even close to achieving."
G["Welcome friend!"]="Onda, $gamigo: amiga;!"
G["Welcome friend! What would you like to see?"]="Bem vindo amigo! O que você gostaria de ver?"
G["Welcome ladies and gentlemen, to this evening's presentation!"]="Bem-vindos, senhoras e senhores, à sessão desta tarde!"
G["Welcome my brothers! Bask in the glory of my power!"]="Welcome my brothers! Bask in the glory of my power!"
G["Welcome one and all to the Darkmoon Faire, the greatest event in all the world!  We have it all... delicious food, strong drink, exotic artifacts, fortunes read, amazing prizes and excitement without end!  Don't forget to turn in your Darkmoon Faire Prize Tickets to Gelvas Grimegate!  All it takes is five or more and you're on your way to the most wondrous prizes on all of Azeroth.  Everybody is a winner!"]="Welcome one and all to the Darkmoon Faire, the greatest event in all the world!  We have it all... delicious food, strong drink, exotic artifacts, fortunes read, amazing prizes and excitement without end!  Don't forget to turn in your Darkmoon Faire Prize Tickets to Gelvas Grimegate!  All it takes is five or more and you're on your way to the most wondrous prizes on all of Azeroth.  Everybody is a winner!"
G["Welcome one and all to the Darkmoon Faire, the greatest event in all the worlds!  We have it all... delicious food, strong drink, exotic artifacts, fortunes read, amazing prizes and excitement without end!  Don't forget to turn in your Darkmoon Faire Prize Tickets to Gelvas Grimegate!  All it takes is five or more and you're on your way to the most wondrous prizes in all of Outland.  Everybody is a winner!"]="Welcome one and all to the Darkmoon Faire, the greatest event in all the worlds!  We have it all... delicious food, strong drink, exotic artifacts, fortunes read, amazing prizes and excitement without end!  Don't forget to turn in your Darkmoon Faire Prize Tickets to Gelvas Grimegate!  All it takes is five or more and you're on your way to the most wondrous prizes in all of Outland.  Everybody is a winner!"
G["Welcome one and all to the greatest show on all of Azeroth... the Darkmoon Faire!  Adventure and excitement await, don't be shy!  Mysteries and prizes for both the young and the old are here for the taking.  And be sure to speak with the professor about any Darkmoon Cards that you have come across during your travels!"]="Welcome one and all to the greatest show on all of Azeroth... the Darkmoon Faire!  Adventure and excitement await, don't be shy!  Mysteries and prizes for both the young and the old are here for the taking.  And be sure to speak with the professor about any Darkmoon Cards that you have come across during your travels!"
G["Welcome stranger. It has been a long time since I've seen someone new travel through here."]="Welcome stranger. It has been a long time since I've seen someone new travel through here."
G["Welcome ta Moonglade, $c. All be welcome 'ere, as long as ya be keepin' the sacred peace."]="$gBienvenido: Bem-vinda; ao Clareira da Lua, $c. Todos são bem-vindos aqui, sempre que respeten a paz sagrado."
G["Welcome to Aerie Peak, home of the Wildhammer Clan.\n\nWith High Thane Falstad off in Ironforge, you'll be dealin' with me."]="Welcome to Aerie Peak, home of the Wildhammer Clan.\n\nWith High Thane Falstad off in Ironforge, you'll be dealin' with me."
G["Welcome to Aldor Rise. You seek guidance?"]="Bem-vindo ao Aldor Rise. Você procura orientação?"
G["Welcome to Amberpine Lodge, $c."]="$gBienvenido: Bem-vinda; ao Refúgio Pinho Âmbar, $c."
G["Welcome to Anglers Wharf $r.  Feel free to take a look around, there is much an angler can learn here."]="Bem-vindo ao Cais dos Pescadores, $r. Se dá um olhada ao redor poderá aprender muito sobre pesca."
G["Welcome to Argent Stand, $c.\n\nMake yourself at home, but don't get too comfortable. We're not out of the woods yet - far from it.\n\nIf we're going to make it out of here in one piece, everyone's going to have to do their share... including you."]="Welcome to Argent Stand, $c.\n\nMake yourself at home, but don't get too comfortable. We're not out of the woods yet - far from it.\n\nIf we're going to make it out of here in one piece, everyone's going to have to do their share... including you."
G["Welcome to Binan Village, $c. I beg you... please help us."]="$GBienvenido: Bem-vinda; à Aldeia Binan, $c. Te o imploro... ayúdanos, por favor."
G["Welcome to Blood Watch, $c. In my travels, I have amassed a wide variety of tools, artifacts, and knowledge from the various peoples we've encountered.\n\nShould you find yourself in need of this knowledge, you have only to ask."]="Welcome to Blood Watch, $c. In my travels, I have amassed a wide variety of tools, artifacts, and knowledge from the various peoples we've encountered.\n\nShould you find yourself in need of this knowledge, you have only to ask."
G["Welcome to Blue Moon Odds and Ends, $c.  If you have any questions, please let me know."]="Welcome to Blue Moon Odds and Ends, $c.  If you have any questions, please let me know."
G["Welcome to Booty Bay, $r."]="Dou a você a boas-vindas a Baía do Saque, $r."
G["Welcome to Booty Bay, partner.  Don't mind DeMeza and her crew... we let the hellion run riot one day a year, Pirates' Day, and then she leaves us in peace to go plunder the South Seas again.\n\nNow then... what can this humble servant of the Steamwheedle Cartel do for you?  Better still - what can you do for me, eh?"]="Welcome to Booty Bay, partner.  Don't mind DeMeza and her crew... we let the hellion run riot one day a year, Pirates' Day, and then she leaves us in peace to go plunder the South Seas again.\n\nNow then... what can this humble servant of the Steamwheedle Cartel do for you?  Better still - what can you do for me, eh?"
G["Welcome to Booty Bay, partner.  I hope your stay in my town is enjoyable and uneventful - emphasis on the latter.  We've got plenty of drink if you're thirsty, and plenty of bouncers if you're antsy.\n\nNow then... what can this humble servant of the Steamwheedle Cartel do for you?  Better still - what can you do for me, eh?"]="Welcome to Booty Bay, partner.  I hope your stay in my town is enjoyable and uneventful - emphasis on the latter.  We've got plenty of drink if you're thirsty, and plenty of bouncers if you're antsy.\n\nNow then... what can this humble servant of the Steamwheedle Cartel do for you?  Better still - what can you do for me, eh?"
G["Welcome to Caer Darrow, stranger."]="Bem-vindo a Cair Darrow, estranho."
G["Welcome to Camp Oneqwah."]="Bem-vindo ao acampamento Oneqwah."
G["Welcome to Camp Oneqwah.  Rest for a while and we will tend to your kodo."]="Dou a você a boas-vindas ao Acampamento Oneqwah. Descansar um momento enquanto nos ocupamos do seu kodo."
G["Welcome to Dalaran's Guild Registry offices. How may I help you?"]="Bem-vindo aos escritórios do Registro da Guilda de Dalaran. Como posso ajudá-o?"
G["Welcome to Dalaran, $c."]="$gBienvenido: Bem-vinda: c;, $c."
G["Welcome to Dalaran, traveler.\n\nIs there something I might help you find?"]="$gBievenido: Bem-vinda; a Dalaran, $gviajero: viajante;.\n\nposso ajudar você a encontrar algo?"
G["Welcome to Darkmoon Island! Feel free to ride one of these lovely beasts down to the Faire."]="Welcome to Darkmoon Island! Feel free to ride one of these lovely beasts down to the Faire."
G["Welcome to Deepholm, cultist."]="Bem-vindo a Infralar, cultor."
G["Welcome to Dolanaar, $c. Let me know if you need any recipes or basic cooking ingredients."]="$gBienvenido: Bem-vinda; a Dolanaar, $c. Avise-me se você precisa receitas ou ingredientes básicos de cozinha."
G["Welcome to Dunshire, traveler.\n\nTread these lands carefully. Scadeald boils with tension: conflicts with the Ealdir are growing, and even in the noble houses of Graysky voices are rising. These are not peaceful times..."]="Welcome to Dunshire, traveler.\n\nTread these lands carefully. Scadeald boils with tension: conflicts with the Ealdir are growing, and even in the noble houses of Graysky voices are rising. These are not peaceful times..."
G["Welcome to Eco-Dome Midrealm, traveler. I would warn you to be wary of dealing with that goblin, Shauly. I don't believe I've ever heard anyone use the word \"buddy\" as punctuation before."]="Bem-vindo ao Eco-Dome Midrealm, viajante. Eu o alertaria para ter cuidado ao lidar com aquele duende, Shauly. Acho que nunca ouvi alguém usar a palavra \"amigo\" como pontuação antes."
G["Welcome to Fairbreeze Village.  Silvermoon's all but given up on us, but we refuse to leave.  This is our home."]="Bem-vindo ao Fairbreeze Village. Silvermoon quase desistiu de nós, mas nos recusamos a sair. Esta é a nossa casa."
G["Welcome to Falcon Watch, $c. I see to the needs of the pilgrims and help them in continuing their long journey. If you haven't yet undertaken the pilgrimage, I can provide you with the information you will need."]="Welcome to Falcon Watch, $c. I see to the needs of the pilgrims and help them in continuing their long journey. If you haven't yet undertaken the pilgrimage, I can provide you with the information you will need."
G["Welcome to First Bank of Kezan, a wholly-owned subsidiary of the Bilgewater Traders & Merchants Bank Of The South Seas.\n\nWhat can I do for you today?"]="Welcome to First Bank of Kezan, a wholly-owned subsidiary of the Bilgewater Traders & Merchants Bank Of The South Seas.\n\nWhat can I do for you today?"
G["Welcome to Fizzle & Pozzik's Speedbarge. You'll find just about anything you're looking for here."]="Welcome to Fizzle & Pozzik's Speedbarge. You'll find just about anything you're looking for here."
G["Welcome to Forest Song, $c. If there is anything I can do for you, please let me know."]="$gBienvenido: Bem-vinda; a Canto da Floresta, $c. Podemos ajudar você?"
G["Welcome to Fort Wildervar, brave homesteaders! There's a whole continent out there just waiting to be claimed!"]="Welcome to Fort Wildervar, brave homesteaders! There's a whole continent out there just waiting to be claimed!"
G["Welcome to Fuselight-by-the-Sea, a picturesque seaside town founded by explosives enthusiasts for explosives enthusiasts."]="Bem-vindo à Fuselight-by-the-Sea, uma cidade pitoresca à beira-mar fundada por entusiastas de explosivos para entusiastas de explosivos."
G["Welcome to Garadar, stranger. Are you looking for a place to rest?"]="Bem-vindo a Garadar, estranho. Você está procurando um lugar para descansar?"
G["Welcome to Granite Springs, friend.\n\nIf you manage to catch any of these ice trolls alive, be sure to let me know. We're paying well for 'em."]="Dou a você a boas-vindas ao Manantial de Granito, colega.\n\nSe conseguir atrapar a algum desses trolls de gelo vivo, Avise-me. Pagamos bem por eles."
G["Welcome to Grom'gol, $c.  Before we get off on the wrong foot, I'll have you know that I won't have slackers in my Base Camp.  I expect a healthy $r like you to pull your own weight around here."]="Welcome to Grom'gol, $c.  Before we get off on the wrong foot, I'll have you know that I won't have slackers in my Base Camp.  I expect a healthy $r like you to pull your own weight around here."
G["Welcome to Halfhill Market!"]="Welcome to Halfhill Market!"
G["Welcome to Halfhill Market, $r."]="Welcome to Halfhill Market, $r."
G["Welcome to Halfhill Market, where the prices are always fair!"]="Welcome to Halfhill Market, where the prices are always fair!"
G["Welcome to Halfhill, neighbor."]="Welcome to Halfhill, neighbor."
G["Welcome to Hardwrench Hideaway!\n\nLooking to get away from the hustle and bustle of city life?  You've come to the right place!\n\nWant to witness the marvels of Azeroth's famous jungle firsthand?  Look no further!\n\nShopping for some freshly pumped bio-fuel or weapons-grade mineral ores?  Then you've come to the right place, $c!"]="Welcome to Hardwrench Hideaway!\n\nLooking to get away from the hustle and bustle of city life?  You've come to the right place!\n\nWant to witness the marvels of Azeroth's famous jungle firsthand?  Look no further!\n\nShopping for some freshly pumped bio-fuel or weapons-grade mineral ores?  Then you've come to the right place, $c!"
G["Welcome to Honor Hold, $n.  It's good to have you."]="Welcome to Honor Hold, $n.  It's good to have you."
G["Welcome to Honor's Stand, $c! We ripped this valley from the claws of the Horde, but keeping this chokepoint open has proven to be another matter entirely."]="Welcome to Honor's Stand, $c! We ripped this valley from the claws of the Horde, but keeping this chokepoint open has proven to be another matter entirely."
G["Welcome to Keelen's Trustworthy Tailoring. I think you'll find my shop will suit your needs. If you wish to train with me, you need only ask; I'll be more than happy to teach you."]="Bem-vindo à alfaiataria confiável da Keelen. Acho que você encontrará que minha loja atenderá às suas necessidades. Se você deseja treinar comigo, basta perguntar; Ficarei feliz em ensinar."
G["Welcome to Kota Peak. Home of super famous Kota Kafa. A luckydo would be wise to sniff and savor exotic brews."]="Welcome to Kota Peak. Home of super famous Kota Kafa. A luckydo would be wise to sniff and savor exotic brews."
G["Welcome to Light's Hope Chapel, stranger."]="Bem-vindo à Capela da Esperança da Luz, estranho."
G["Welcome to Nethergarde, $c.  Call me \"Mama,\" I'm here to take care of you."]="Bem-vindo a Etergarde, $c. Lhámame \"Mamãe\", estou aqui para cuidar de ti."
G["Welcome to Ogri'la, $c.\n\nThe ogres here have managed to gain a great mental acuity through the magical emanations of the surrounding crystals.  Though we do not fully understand how they work, we have come to appreciate our new home and only want to live in peace.\n\nUnfortunate then that the demons and ethereals, and especially the Black Dragonflight, will not leave us to that peace."]="$gBienvenido: Bem-vinda; a Ogri'a, $c.\n\nOs ogros aqui temos conseguido grande agudeza mental Obrigado às emanações mágicas dos cristais que nos cercam. Embora não acabamos de entender seu funcionamento, temos conseguido apreciar nosso novo lar e somente queremos viver em paz.\n\nPor desgraça, os demônios e etéreos e, em especial, o Voo Negro, não nos deixam alcançar essa paz."
G["Welcome to Orgrimmar!"]="Dou a você a boas-vindas a Orgrimmar."
G["Welcome to Paw'don Village, outsider. I do not know why you have come, but you certainly look like you could use a rest.\n\nWhy not sit back with a fine cup of cider and let your worries fall away?"]="Welcome to Paw'don Village, outsider. I do not know why you have come, but you certainly look like you could use a rest.\n\nWhy not sit back with a fine cup of cider and let your worries fall away?"
G["Welcome to Redridge, $c!"]="Dou a você a boas-vindas a Cristarrubra, $c!"
G["Welcome to Revantusk Village, stranger. I am Primal Torntusk, leader of the Revantusk trolls."]="Bem-vindo à Vila Revantusk, estranho. Sou Primal Torntusk, líder dos trolls Revantusk."
G["Welcome to SI:7 headquarters, $n."]="Dou a você a boas-vindas ao posto de envio do IV:7, $n."
G["Welcome to Sentry Point, $c."]="$gBienvenido: Bem-vinda; ao Alto do Sentinela, $c."
G["Welcome to Shatter Point, $n!  I hope you survive the experience!"]="$gBienvenido: Bem-vinda; ao Posto Devastação, $n! Espero que sobrevivas a esta experiência!"
G["Welcome to Shattrath City, seat of the Sha'tar in Outland. You seek guidance?"]="Bem-vindo à Shattrath, sede dos Sha'tar em Outland. Você procura orientação?"
G["Welcome to Starfall Village, traveler. Have you come to assist us?"]="Bem-vindo ao Starfall Village, viajante. Você veio nos ajudar?"
G["Welcome to Steelgrill's Depot!"]="Bem-vindo ao depósito da Steelgrill!"
G["Welcome to Stonemaul Hold, brave $c.  How may I assist you this day?"]="Dou a você a boas-vindas ao Bastião Quebrantarrocas, corajoso $c. De que maneira posso ajudar você hoje?"
G["Welcome to Stoneplow. What can we do for you?"]="Te damos a boas-vindas a Vilharroca. O que podemos fazer por você?"
G["Welcome to Stonetalon Mountains, friend! Saurboz is expectin' ya."]="Dou a você a boas-vindas a Cordilheira das Torres de Pedra, amigo! Saurboz te espera."
G["Welcome to Stormwind!"]="$GBienvenido: Bem-vinda; a Ventobravo!"
G["Welcome to Stormwind!  I am one of the city's officers, aiding the citizenry of the city through our census bureau.  If you are in need of locating someone specific, then I might be able to assist you.  Through arcane methods and sharpened mental discipline, I am able to access these records.\n\nIf you have business with me, then please proceed!"]="Welcome to Stormwind!  I am one of the city's officers, aiding the citizenry of the city through our census bureau.  If you are in need of locating someone specific, then I might be able to assist you.  Through arcane methods and sharpened mental discipline, I am able to access these records.\n\nIf you have business with me, then please proceed!"
G["Welcome to Stormwind, $c."]="$gBienvenido: Bem-vinda; a Ventobravo, $c."
G["Welcome to Stormwind. Took a long time to rebuild her but it was well worth it. So are you visiting, or are you here on business?"]="Bem-vindo ao Ventobravo. Demorou muito tempo para reconstruí-a, mas valeu a pena. Então você está visitando ou está aqui a negócios?"
G["Welcome to Tanaris, $n. How can I be of service to you today? You don't look like a blacksmith to me, but I know how looks can be deceiving."]="Welcome to Tanaris, $n. How can I be of service to you today? You don't look like a blacksmith to me, but I know how looks can be deceiving."
G["Welcome to Telredor, $c. If you need anything, don't hesitate to ask."]="$gBienvenido: Bem-vinda; a Telredor, $c. Se você precisa algo, não dudes em perguntar."
G["Welcome to The Arboretum, traveler.\n\nThis is the home of the Order of the Cloud Serpent. Together with our cloud serpents, we are sworn to defend The Jade Forest.\n\nYou, too, can join our ranks. However, you need more experience before you can begin the journey.\n\nGo and travel the land, then return to me when you are stronger."]="$gBienvenido: Bem-vinda; ao Arboretum, $gviajero: viajante;.\n\nEsta é a sede da Ordem do Dragão Nimbo. Temos jurado defendao Floresta de Jade ao lado a nossos dragões nimbo.\n\nVocê também pode se juntar a nós, mas te há falta experiência para começar o viagem.\n\nVê, recorre esta terra, e volta a me ver quando seja mais forte."
G["Welcome to The Bravery, $gsir:madame;. Now if you'll excuse me..."]="Welcome to The Bravery, $gsir:madame;. Now if you'll excuse me..."
G["Welcome to The Heartland!"]="Welcome to The Heartland!"
G["Welcome to Thelsamar, your home away from home in Loch Modan!\n\nThelsamar is a nice place, but it's not all beer and salted meat for those who answer the call to duty!  If you're willing to face danger in the name of the Alliance, then read the poster outside the Thelsamar branch of the Explorers' League."]="Welcome to Thelsamar, your home away from home in Loch Modan!\n\nThelsamar is a nice place, but it's not all beer and salted meat for those who answer the call to duty!  If you're willing to face danger in the name of the Alliance, then read the poster outside the Thelsamar branch of the Explorers' League."
G["Welcome to Theramore Isle. Something I can help you find?"]="Dou a você a boas-vindas à Ilha Theramore. Posso ajudar você em algo?"
G["Welcome to Theramore, $c."]="Dou a você a boas-vindas a Theramore, $c."
G["Welcome to Theramore, $c. Looking for something?"]="$gBienvenido: Bem-vinda; a Theramore, $c. Ouvidos algo?"
G["Welcome to Theramore."]="Bem-vindo ao Theramore."
G["Welcome to Thorium Point.  As Overseer, I'm responsible for all the activities of the Thorium Brotherhood.  While that mainly involves mining, smithing, and some minor guard duty, we've lately become more of a martial organization... out of necessity."]="Bem-vindo ao Thorium Point. Como superintendente, sou responsável por todas as atividades da Irmandade do Tório. Embora isso envolva principalmente mineração, ferraria e algum serviço de guarda menor, ultimamente nos tornamos mais uma organização marcial... por necessidade."
G["Welcome to Thrallmar, $n!  As you continue to aid us in our cause, I will grant you access to more of our supplies."]="Welcome to Thrallmar, $n!  As you continue to aid us in our cause, I will grant you access to more of our supplies."
G["Welcome to Tian Monastery."]="Dou a você a boas-vindas ao Monastério Tian."
G["Welcome to Tinker Town!"]="Bem-vindo à cidade Tinker!"
G["Welcome to Tol Barad, $c.  Time's a wastin' so let's get to work."]="$gBienvenido: Bem-vinda; a Tol Barad, $c. Nos falta tempo, assim que a trabalhar."
G["Welcome to Tranquillien, $c. I apologize for the state that you find it in. As you can see, we've been having some trouble, but the Forsaken, and their Lady Sylvanas Windrunner, have been gracious enough to lend us a great deal of assistance in our time of need.\n\nIf you can lend a hand please do not hesitate to do so. We can use all of the help that we can get in our struggle against the myriad forces arrayed against us."]="Welcome to Tranquillien, $c. I apologize for the state that you find it in. As you can see, we've been having some trouble, but the Forsaken, and their Lady Sylvanas Windrunner, have been gracious enough to lend us a great deal of assistance in our time of need.\n\nIf you can lend a hand please do not hesitate to do so. We can use all of the help that we can get in our struggle against the myriad forces arrayed against us."
G["Welcome to Woo's, where the sun is always shining and the food is always hot!"]="Com os Woo, o sol sempre brilha e a comida sempre está quente!"
G["Welcome to Wyrmrest Temple, traveler.\n\nHere the dragonflights confer in peace with one another amidst the bones of their honored ancestors.\n\nAt least, we were peaceful until the Blue Dragonflight launched a surprise attack upon the temple itself.\n\nEnter with our blessing, but know that we will brook no aggression within our walls."]="Welcome to Wyrmrest Temple, traveler.\n\nHere the dragonflights confer in peace with one another amidst the bones of their honored ancestors.\n\nAt least, we were peaceful until the Blue Dragonflight launched a surprise attack upon the temple itself.\n\nEnter with our blessing, but know that we will brook no aggression within our walls."
G["Welcome to Zabra'jin, $c. I am Shadow Hunter Denjai, overseer of this outpost and commander of the Darkspear forces in Zangarmarsh."]="$gBienvenido: Bem-vinda; a Zabra'jin, $c. Sou o caçador das Sombras Denjai, supervisor desta Avançado e comandante das forças de Lança Negra destacadas na Pântano Zíngaro."
G["Welcome to Zul'Gurub, little one.  It might not look like much now, but give it time..."]="Dou a você a boas-vindas a Zul'gurub, pequena. Agora não te parecerá grande coisa, mas dê-me tempo..."
G["Welcome to a cold death."]="$gBienvenido: Bem-vinda; à morte gelada."
G["Welcome to a very special trial!  The wisdom of a leader is reflected in the greatness of his followers. Let us see if your training has truly inspired those you lead..."]="Welcome to a very special trial!  The wisdom of a leader is reflected in the greatness of his followers. Let us see if your training has truly inspired those you lead..."
G["Welcome to baradin base camp.  I know it does not look like much now, but with a little hard work we can whip this place into shape."]="Bem-vindo ao acampamento base de baradin. Sei que agora não parece muito, mas com um pouco de trabalho, podemos moldar esse lugar."
G["Welcome to cokeplay.com, drink CocaCola and raise a cute polar bear!"]="$gBienvenido: Bem-vinda; a cokeplay. com, bebe CocaCola e filhote a um urso polar muito mono!"
G["Welcome to da' revolution."]="Te damos a boas-vindas a nueh'tra revolução."
G["Welcome to de great show, friends. Just wait 'til ya see what I got in store for ya."]="Welcome to de great show, friends. Just wait 'til ya see what I got in store for ya."
G["Welcome to flavor country!"]="$gBienvenido: Bem-vinda; ao país dos sabores!"
G["Welcome to hell!"]="Bem-vindo ao inferno!"
G["Welcome to me camp, $r.\n\nShe don't look like much, but she's home fer now."]="Dou a você a boas-vindas a meu acampamento, $r.\n\nNão parece grande coisa, mas por agora é um lar."
G["Welcome to me shop. What can I do for ye'?"]="Bem-vindo à minha loja. O que posso fazer por você?"
G["Welcome to my Inn, weary traveler. What can I do for you?"]="Boas-vindas à minha estalagem, viajante cansado. Em que posso ajudar?"
G["Welcome to my forge, Blacksmith. Let me share with you a little secret. No one, no one in the world can you trust. Not men, not women, not beasts ... this you can trust, Steel."]="Bem-vindo à minha forja, ferreiro. Deixe-me compartilhar com você um pequeno segredo. Ninguém, ninguém no mundo você pode confiar. Nem homens, nem mulheres, nem bestas... isso em que você pode confiar, Steel."
G["Welcome to my humble shop, $c."]="Welcome to my humble shop, $c."
G["Welcome to my inn, traveler. We have hot meals and soft beds."]="Dou a você a boas-vindas a meu estalagem, $gviajero: viajante;. Temos comida quente e cómodas cama."
G["Welcome to my kingdom of darkness!"]="Bem-vindos a meu reino de escuridão!"
G["Welcome to my kitchen!\nAre you here looking for food, or to do some cooking yourself?"]="Dou a você a boas-vindas a meu cozinha!\n\nTem vindo à procura de boa comida ou que cozinhar você?"
G["Welcome to my kitchen! We prepare some of the finest food in Dalaran here."]="Bem-vindo à minha cozinha! Aqui preparamos algum dos melhores pratos de Dalaran."
G["Welcome to my noodle shack. We've got every type of noodle that should be eaten. If we don't have it, you shouldn't be eating it."]="Welcome to my noodle shack. We've got every type of noodle that should be eaten. If we don't have it, you shouldn't be eating it."
G["Welcome to my personal sanctum, heroes! I hope you find the accommodations to your liking. Herein you will find many of my failed experiments and ultimately my greatest triumph!"]="Welcome to my personal sanctum, heroes! I hope you find the accommodations to your liking. Herein you will find many of my failed experiments and ultimately my greatest triumph!"
G["Welcome to my shop!"]="Bem vindo a minha loja!"
G["Welcome to my shop, $c. What is it the Goodstitch brothers can do for you?"]="Welcome to my shop, $c. What is it the Goodstitch brothers can do for you?"
G["Welcome to my shop, it's good to see another Enchanter here in Stormwind. Are you here for a lesson perhaps?"]="Welcome to my shop, it's good to see another Enchanter here in Stormwind. Are you here for a lesson perhaps?"
G["Welcome to my shop, it's good to see another Tailor here in Stormwind. Are you here for a lesson perhaps?"]="Welcome to my shop, it's good to see another Tailor here in Stormwind. Are you here for a lesson perhaps?"
G["Welcome to my shop, traveler!"]="Welcome to my shop, traveler!"
G["Welcome to my wall, $c.\n\nNow, let's kick some mantid butt!"]="$gBienvenido: Bem-vinda; a meu muralha, $c.\n\nAgora, vamos esmagar a esses mantídeos!"
G["Welcome to our camp, $c. You're free to rest here if you'd like."]="Te damos a boas-vindas a nosso acampamento, $c. Pode descansar aqui se o deseja."
G["Welcome to our first officially-sanctioned combat event, the Arena of Annihilation!"]="Bem-vindos a nosso primeiro evento de combate com permissão oficial, a Arena da Aniquilação!"
G["Welcome to our home away from home, $c. I wish we had a bit more hospitality to offer."]="Dou a você a boas-vindas ao lar longe do lar, $c. Desearía poder oferecer a você mais que simples hospitalidade."
G["Welcome to our home in the hills, $r."]="Dou a você a boas-vindas a nosso lar nas colinas, $r."
G["Welcome to our home, $n. Radnaal and I have little to offer, but you are welcome to what hospitality we can provide."]="Welcome to our home, $n. Radnaal and I have little to offer, but you are welcome to what hospitality we can provide."
G["Welcome to our humble abode! It's always nice to see a friendly face. And what strong arms you have. My husband and I are always looking for help around the farm. Now that most the good folk have left, it's hard to find an able body to help out."]="Welcome to our humble abode! It's always nice to see a friendly face. And what strong arms you have. My husband and I are always looking for help around the farm. Now that most the good folk have left, it's hard to find an able body to help out."
G["Welcome to our little chapel of the Light. Please, take a seat. Enjoy a respite from the world's ills."]="Bem-vindo à nossa pequena capela da luz. Por favor, sente-se. Desfrute de uma pausa dos males do mundo."
G["Welcome to our most humble camp."]="Dou a você a boas-vindas a nosso humilde acampamento."
G["Welcome to our shop.  We have everything you need... if you need alchemy supplies."]="Bem vindo a nossa loja. Temos tudo o que você precisa... se precisar de suprimentos de alquimia."
G["Welcome to our tent. May I assist you?"]="Bem-vindo à nossa tenda. Posso te ajudar?"
G["Welcome to the Allerian Stronghold, $c."]="$gBienvenido: Bem-vinda; ao Bastião Alleriano, $c."
G["Welcome to the Allerian Stronghold, $n."]="$GBienvenido: boas-vindas; ao Bastião Alleriano, $n."
G["Welcome to the Arboretum. May you find inspiration amongst the trees."]="$gBienvenido: Bem-vinda; ao Arboretum. Que encontre a inspiração entre os árvores."
G["Welcome to the Bank of Darnassus. We offer financial accounts and safety deposit boxes for valuable items. Do you already have an account with us $g sir : ma'am;?"]="Welcome to the Bank of Darnassus. We offer financial accounts and safety deposit boxes for valuable items. Do you already have an account with us $g sir : ma'am;?"
G["Welcome to the Bank of Silvermoon, $g sir : ma'am;. Would you care to access the depository?"]="Welcome to the Bank of Silvermoon, $g sir : ma'am;. Would you care to access the depository?"
G["Welcome to the Bank of Stormwind. We offer financial accounts and safety deposit boxes for valuable items. Do you already have an account with us $g sir : ma'am;?"]="Boas-vindas ao Banco de Ventobravo. Oferecemos contas e cofres para guardar itens valiosos. Já possui uma conta conosco, $gsenhor:senhora;?"
G["Welcome to the Blue Recluse, where the magically inclined gather to blow off steam. Though not literally of course. What can I get for you $g sir : ma'am;?"]="Welcome to the Blue Recluse, where the magically inclined gather to blow off steam. Though not literally of course. What can I get for you $g sir : ma'am;?"
G["Welcome to the Booty Bay fishing contest where each week we reward the finest fishermen in all of Azeroth.\nWhen the fishing tournament begins, you will be able to catch tastyfish from any fishing node in Stranglethorn."]="Welcome to the Booty Bay fishing contest where each week we reward the finest fishermen in all of Azeroth.\nWhen the fishing tournament begins, you will be able to catch tastyfish from any fishing node in Stranglethorn."
G["Welcome to the Cantrips and Crows Tavern, $r.\n\nWatch your back while you're here, hmmm? Narisa doesn't like scrubbing blood off the floor."]="Welcome to the Cantrips and Crows Tavern, $r.\n\nWatch your back while you're here, hmmm? Narisa doesn't like scrubbing blood off the floor."
G["Welcome to the Cenarion Circle, $c."]="Dou a você a boas-vindas ao Círculo Cenariano, $c."
G["Welcome to the Cenarion Circle, $c.  How may I assist you?"]="Dou a você a boas-vindas ao Círculo Cenariano, $c. Como posso ajudar você?"
G["Welcome to the Cenarion Refuge, $n. I've been instructed to offer you basic supplies for purchase, should you need them."]="$gBienvenido: Bem-vinda; ao Refúgio Cenariano, $n. Tenho ordens de oferecer a você materiais básico se o precisa."
G["Welcome to the Cold of Cold, friend! Our unique ice cream is chilled to order by one of Stormwind's finest apprentice mages!"]="Bem-vindo ao frio do frio, amigo! Nosso sorvete exclusivo é resfriado por encomenda por um dos melhores magos aprendizes de Stormwind!"
G["Welcome to the Cradle of Chi-Ji, friend."]="Dou a você a boas-vindas à Cuna de Chi-Ji."
G["Welcome to the Crossroads, $c. My name is Thork--I lead the defenses here in the name of the Warchief.\n\nPlease, feel free to make yourself at home. As long as you mind your business, no one should have any problem with you taking up some space.\n\nThere are many threats to our safety here. If you've already become familiar with the lay of the land, speak to the others here--perhaps they have tasks for you to do."]="Welcome to the Crossroads, $c. My name is Thork--I lead the defenses here in the name of the Warchief.\n\nPlease, feel free to make yourself at home. As long as you mind your business, no one should have any problem with you taking up some space.\n\nThere are many threats to our safety here. If you've already become familiar with the lay of the land, speak to the others here--perhaps they have tasks for you to do."
G["Welcome to the Darkmoon Faire!"]="$gBienvenido: Bem-vinda; à Feira da Lua Negra!"
G["Welcome to the Darkmoon Faire, $c!"]="$gBienvenido: Bem-vinda; à Feira da Lua Negra, $c!"
G["Welcome to the Darkmoon Faire, $c!\n\nMy name is Kerri Hicks and I'd shake your hand but I'm afraid I'd break it, because I'm the strongest woman alive!"]="Welcome to the Darkmoon Faire, $c!\n\nMy name is Kerri Hicks and I'd shake your hand but I'm afraid I'd break it, because I'm the strongest woman alive!"
G["Welcome to the Demolisher Engineering Console v0.1 alpha."]="$gBienvenido: Bem-vinda; à console de engenheiro do demoledor v0.1 alfa."
G["Welcome to the Demolisher Mechanic Console v0.1 alpha."]="$gBienvenido: Bem-vinda; à console de mecânico do demoledor v0.1 alfa."
G["Welcome to the Evergrove, $c. Timeon and I have been studying the arakkoa of Blade's Edge for some time now, and we've found some alarming differences between them and their cousins in Terokkar."]="Bem-vindo a Soto Eterno, $c. Timeon e eu levamos algum tempo estudando aos arakkoas das Montanhas da Lâmina Afiada e temos encontrado algumas diferências alarmantes entre eles e seus primos de Terokkar."
G["Welcome to the Explorers' League.  If you need information, and it is in book form, then I might be able to help you out."]="Bem-vindo à Liga dos Batedores. Se você precisar de informações e elas estiverem em formato de livro, talvez eu possa ajudá-o."
G["Welcome to the Falconwing Square Inn. May I prepare a meal for you, or ready a room?"]="Bem-vindo ao Falconwing Square Inn. Posso preparar uma refeição para você ou preparar um quarto?"
G["Welcome to the Farstrider Lodge, $n!"]="$GBienvenido: Bem-vinda; à Cabanha do Errante, $n!"
G["Welcome to the Farstrider Retreat.  We are rangers sworn to defend our people from enemies both near and far."]="Bem-vindo ao retiro Farstrider. Somos guardas florestais jurados a defender nosso povo de inimigos próximos e distantes."
G["Welcome to the First-Class Experimental Teleporter! \n\nFor a modest fee, this marvel of goblin engineering will hurl you across Azeroth in the blink of an eye. \n\nSimply select your destination and hold on tight. Management is not responsible for unexpected detours, rough landings, or spontaneous combustion."]="Welcome to the First-Class Experimental Teleporter! \n\nFor a modest fee, this marvel of goblin engineering will hurl you across Azeroth in the blink of an eye. \n\nSimply select your destination and hold on tight. Management is not responsible for unexpected detours, rough landings, or spontaneous combustion."
G["Welcome to the Gallywix Rocketway Exchange! Debts to pay or get the heck away."]="Welcome to the Gallywix Rocketway Exchange! Debts to pay or get the heck away."
G["Welcome to the Golden Lantern, the finest inn in the Vale. If anyone wants to argue with me, I will show them my fists."]="Welcome to the Golden Lantern, the finest inn in the Vale. If anyone wants to argue with me, I will show them my fists."
G["Welcome to the Great Banquet. High Elder Cloudfall awaits you at the back table."]="Welcome to the Great Banquet. High Elder Cloudfall awaits you at the back table."
G["Welcome to the Great Forge $g lad : lass;. It may be cold outside but we keep it nice and hot down 'ere. Grab a hammer, strike that anvil and show me ye've got what it takes to be a Blacksmith of the Great Forge!"]="Welcome to the Great Forge $g lad : lass;. It may be cold outside but we keep it nice and hot down 'ere. Grab a hammer, strike that anvil and show me ye've got what it takes to be a Blacksmith of the Great Forge!"
G["Welcome to the Grim Guzzler!"]="Bem-vindo ao Grim Guzzler!"
G["Welcome to the Horde, High Chief. Lok'tar ogar!"]="Bem-vindo à Horda, Grande Chefe. Lok'tar ogar!"
G["Welcome to the Imperial Granary.\n\nThough not so \"imperious\" today with this sprite infestation. Oh, um, you didn't hear that. Or see, for that matter.\n\nIn fact, can you not tell anyone you ever came here and especially not say anything about this sprite fiasco?"]="Welcome to the Imperial Granary.\n\nThough not so \"imperious\" today with this sprite infestation. Oh, um, you didn't hear that. Or see, for that matter.\n\nIn fact, can you not tell anyone you ever came here and especially not say anything about this sprite fiasco?"
G["Welcome to the Legerdemain Lounge, $c. I do hope you'll enjoy your stay."]="Welcome to the Legerdemain Lounge, $c. I do hope you'll enjoy your stay."
G["Welcome to the Lion's Pride Inn.  Make yourself at home!"]="Welcome to the Lion's Pride Inn.  Make yourself at home!"
G["Welcome to the Menders' Stead, $c."]="Welcome to the Menders' Stead, $c."
G["Welcome to the Molten Flow, $n."]="Welcome to the Molten Flow, $n."
G["Welcome to the Nightingale Lounge, $c. What can we play for you today?"]="Welcome to the Nightingale Lounge, $c. What can we play for you today?"
G["Welcome to the North Wind Tavern."]="Dou a você a boas-vindas à taberna Vientonorte."
G["Welcome to the Northern Rocketway Exchange! We at Rocketway Relations are glad you survived that last turn!"]="Welcome to the Northern Rocketway Exchange! We at Rocketway Relations are glad you survived that last turn!"
G["Welcome to the Northern Rocketway Terminus! You probably took a wrong turn, but we're happy to have you anyway!"]="Welcome to the Northern Rocketway Terminus! You probably took a wrong turn, but we're happy to have you anyway!"
G["Welcome to the Order of the Cloud Serpent. Only those exalted with our Order may acquire our cloud serpents."]="Dou a você a boas-vindas à Ordem do Dragão Nimbo. Somente os exaltados com nossa Ordem podem adquirir dragões nimbo."
G["Welcome to the Orebor Harborage, friend. You have nothing to fear here. We are Broken, but we are not your enemies.\n\nI am Ikuti of the Kurenai, a group of Broken who desire to reestablish ties with our draenei brothers and their newfound allies."]="$gBienvenido: Bem-vinda; ao Porto Orebor, $gamigo: amiga;. Aqui não tem nada que temer. Somos Tábidos, mas não somos inimigos.\n\nEu sou Ikuti dos Kurenai, um grupo de Tábidos que querem recuperar as relações com os irmãos draeneis e seus novos aliados."
G["Welcome to the Orgrimmar Rocketway Exchange! You still look to be in one piece."]="$gBienvenido: Bem-vinda; ao Intercambiador da Cohetepista de Orgrimmar! Parece que sigues de uma peça."
G["Welcome to the Peak of Serenity $n.  How can I help you?"]="$n, Dou a você a boas-vindas ao Pico da Serenidade. Em O que posso ajudar você?"
G["Welcome to the Peak of Serenity.  Good luck in your training."]="Dou a você a boas-vindas ao Pico da Serenidade. Boa sorte com o seu treinamento."
G["Welcome to the Pig and Whistle! Grab a drink my friend and pull up a seat, the more the merrier!"]="Bem-vindo ao porco e apito! Pegue uma bebida meu amigo e puxe um assento, quanto mais, melhor!"
G["Welcome to the Proving Grounds. Your first trial will now begin. Defeat each wave of illusions before time runs out."]="Estes são os Terrenos de Provas. A primeira começará agora. Derrote a cada onda de ilusões antes de que se acabe o tempo."
G["Welcome to the Registrar of Guilds.  How can I be of service to you?"]="Bem-vindo ao Registrador de Guildas. Como posso ajudá-o?"
G["Welcome to the Ring of Valor, pandaren. Make yourself comfortable while I finish preparing."]="Dou a você a boas-vindas ao Círculo do Coragem, pandaren. Descansar enquanto o preparo tudo."
G["Welcome to the Royal Exchange Bank, $g sir : ma'am;. How may I help you?"]="$gBienvenido: Bem-vinda; a ao Banco Real de Caminho. O que deseja?"
G["Welcome to the Scarlet Raven.  It's best to stay indoors these days."]="Dou a você a boas-vindas ao Corvo Escarlate. Hoje em diao melhor é estar baixo teto."
G["Welcome to the Seat of Knowledge. And never was there a greater repository of information and wisdom to be found about the ancient days of Pandaria."]="Te damos a boas-vindas ao Trono do Saber. Nunca tem existido um repositório de informações e sabedoria mais extenso aproxima do passado de Pandaria."
G["Welcome to the Serpent's Overlook. Did you happen to bring a kite with you?"]="Welcome to the Serpent's Overlook. Did you happen to bring a kite with you?"
G["Welcome to the Shady Lady, home of fine wines and exotic merchandise you won't find anywhere else!"]="Bem-vindo à Shady Lady, lar de bons vinhos e mercadorias exóticas que você não encontrará em nenhum outro lugar!"
G["Welcome to the Shrine of Aviana, $c. Here we sit atop the world and touch the sky."]="Dou a você a boas-vindas ao Santuário de Aviana, $c. Aqui estamos no mais alto do mundo e tocamos o céu."
G["Welcome to the Southern Rocketway Terminus! Home of the world famous Secret Lab!"]="$gBienvenido: Bem-vinda; à Terminal da Cohetepista do Sul! O lar do laboratório segredo mais famoso do mundo."
G["Welcome to the Stockade!"]="$gBienvenido: Bem-vinda; às masmorras!"
G["Welcome to the Storm Peaks, $r."]="Dou a você a boas-vindas a Picos Tempestuosos, $r."
G["Welcome to the Stormspire, $c.\n\nPlease do not be put off by my being present through this imaging device.  I have many enemies that would like to see me dead, so it is only a precaution.\n\nI assure you that you are perfectly safe here."]="Welcome to the Stormspire, $c.\n\nPlease do not be put off by my being present through this imaging device.  I have many enemies that would like to see me dead, so it is only a precaution.\n\nI assure you that you are perfectly safe here."
G["Welcome to the Stormwind Guild Registry offices. What can I help you with today?"]="Bem-vindo aos escritórios do Registro da Guilda Stormwind. Com o que posso ajudá-o hoje?"
G["Welcome to the Sunwell. Despite the mild temperatures and scenic vistas, you're not on vacation, ladies and gentlemen!"]="Welcome to the Sunwell. Despite the mild temperatures and scenic vistas, you're not on vacation, ladies and gentlemen!"
G["Welcome to the Taverns of Time!"]="Bem-vindo às Tabernas do Tempo!"
G["Welcome to the Temple of the Jade Serpent, stranger. Our doors are open to all who seek knowledge."]="Welcome to the Temple of the Jade Serpent, stranger. Our doors are open to all who seek knowledge."
G["Welcome to the Temple of the Jade Serpent, traveler.\n\nWe welcome all within our doors, and offer knowledge freely to any who seek it."]="$gBienvenido: Bem-vinda; ao Templo do Dragão de Jade, $gviajero: viajante;.\n\nDamos a boas-vindas a tudo o mundo e oferecemos nossa sabedoria a tudo aquele que a procurando."
G["Welcome to the Temple of the Jade Serpent. How may I help you?"]="Dou a você a boas-vindas ao Templo do Dragão de Jade. Em O que posso ajudar você?"
G["Welcome to the Thunderpaw Refuge. Do not let the armor deceive you. We train in healing practices here."]="Welcome to the Thunderpaw Refuge. Do not let the armor deceive you. We train in healing practices here."
G["Welcome to the Thunderpaw Refuge. Here we practice our craft of focusing our chi into healing."]="Welcome to the Thunderpaw Refuge. Here we practice our craft of focusing our chi into healing."
G["Welcome to the Toshley's Station inn.  What can I do for you?"]="Bem-vindo à pousada Toshley's Station. O que posso fazer para você?"
G["Welcome to the Trials of the Crusader! Only the most powerful combatants of Azeroth are allowed to undergo these trials. You are among the worthy few."]="Welcome to the Trials of the Crusader! Only the most powerful combatants of Azeroth are allowed to undergo these trials. You are among the worthy few."
G["Welcome to the Underbelly. Something I can help you find?"]="Bem-vindo ao Underbelly. Algo que eu posso ajudá-o a encontrar?"
G["Welcome to the Undercity Guild Registry. What do you want?"]="Bem-vindo ao Undercity Guild Registry. O que você quer?"
G["Welcome to the Vale, friend. Stay and be at peace."]="Dou a você a boas-vindas ao vale. Fique e vive em paz."
G["Welcome to the Void..."]="$gBienvenido: Bem-vinda; ao Vazio..."
G["Welcome to the Wickerman Festival, $c!\n\nOn the observance of Hallow's End, the Forsaken burn a wickerman in honor of this, the most revered of occasions.  It was on this day that the Banshee Queen herself delivered us from the clutches of the Lich King and the Scourge.  We have remained free ever since.  Those who would have seen us fall are repaid in full... with vengeance!\n\nThe burning of the Wickerman begins at 8:00 PM!"]="Welcome to the Wickerman Festival, $c!\n\nOn the observance of Hallow's End, the Forsaken burn a wickerman in honor of this, the most revered of occasions.  It was on this day that the Banshee Queen herself delivered us from the clutches of the Lich King and the Scourge.  We have remained free ever since.  Those who would have seen us fall are repaid in full... with vengeance!\n\nThe burning of the Wickerman begins at 8:00 PM!"
G["Welcome to the Wickerman Festival, $c!\n\nOn the observance of Hallow's End, we burn a Wickerman to represent a cleansing of the self. As the woods sigh and shed their leaves, we too must undergo a catharsis. Fears, sorrows, regrets: by throwing a branch into the blaze, you can relieve yourself of any burden you would not bear into winter.\n\nPlease, grab a branch from the bonfire and join the celebration!"]="Welcome to the Wickerman Festival, $c!\n\nOn the observance of Hallow's End, we burn a Wickerman to represent a cleansing of the self. As the woods sigh and shed their leaves, we too must undergo a catharsis. Fears, sorrows, regrets: by throwing a branch into the blaze, you can relieve yourself of any burden you would not bear into winter.\n\nPlease, grab a branch from the bonfire and join the celebration!"
G["Welcome to the Wonderworks!\n\nPlease take your time and browse the shop. We have wonderful toys for people young and old!"]="Welcome to the Wonderworks!\n\nPlease take your time and browse the shop. We have wonderful toys for people young and old!"
G["Welcome to the camp, $c."]="Dou a você a boas-vindas ao acampamento, $c."
G["Welcome to the coast of Pandaria! Where everything that can wash ashore has, or will, wash ashore."]="Welcome to the coast of Pandaria! Where everything that can wash ashore has, or will, wash ashore."
G["Welcome to the endless winter."]="Bem-vindo ao inverno interminável."
G["Welcome to the faire young one!   We have collected wonders from all over the world for your perusal.   Oh and please let me know if you manage to collect a set of the lesser darkmoon cards, as the master... I mean I would be keenly interested in them."]="Bem-vindo ao jovem faire! Reunimos maravilhas de tudo o mundo para a sua leitura. Ah, e por favor me avise se você conseguir coletar um conjunto de cards de lua negra menor, como mestre... quero dizer, que eu estaria profundamente interessado neles."
G["Welcome to the field, $c! You can't get a feel for the tactical situation if you're hiding in a fortress all day. I always like to get my boots dirty."]="Welcome to the field, $c! You can't get a feel for the tactical situation if you're hiding in a fortress all day. I always like to get my boots dirty."
G["Welcome to the front lines, $c.  The Kingdom of Stormwind, with the aid of its allies, has sent me here to counter the growing threat of the Scourge.  Here at Chillwind Camp, we fight for our continued survival on a daily basis.\n\nIf you've come here looking for a chance to prove yourself as a hero, then you'll find plenty of opportunities to do so... especially as we push towards Andorhal and whatever malign force that controls the Scourge there."]="Welcome to the front lines, $c.  The Kingdom of Stormwind, with the aid of its allies, has sent me here to counter the growing threat of the Scourge.  Here at Chillwind Camp, we fight for our continued survival on a daily basis.\n\nIf you've come here looking for a chance to prove yourself as a hero, then you'll find plenty of opportunities to do so... especially as we push towards Andorhal and whatever malign force that controls the Scourge there."
G["Welcome to the front lines, $c.  While politicians may connive and scheme amongst themselves, they'll find no such luxury afforded to them here.  This is the Bulwark, and we fight for our continued survival on a daily basis here.\n\nIf you've come here looking for a chance to prove yourself as a hero, then you'll find plenty of opportunities to do so."]="Welcome to the front lines, $c.  While politicians may connive and scheme amongst themselves, they'll find no such luxury afforded to them here.  This is the Bulwark, and we fight for our continued survival on a daily basis here.\n\nIf you've come here looking for a chance to prove yourself as a hero, then you'll find plenty of opportunities to do so."
G["Welcome to the great show, friends.  Step right up to die!"]="Welcome to the great show, friends.  Step right up to die!"
G["Welcome to the headquarters of the Blood Knights, the defenders of Quel'Thalas, the faithful servants of Silvermoon, and the true masters of the Light."]="Bem-vindo ao quartel general dos Cavaleiros Sangrentos, os defensores de Quel'Thalas, os servos fiéis de Lua de Prata e os verdadeiros mestres da Luz."
G["Welcome to the home of the Kirin Tor."]="Bem-vindo à casa do Kirin Tor."
G["Welcome to the iCoke-WOW summer promotion.\n\nDear $n, the halo of fortune goddess is shining on you.  Obey to the order of god; you'll get a special and mystery present.  Now, the gate of Azeroth is open for you.  A great adventure will begin soon.  Are you ready?\n\nMay the honor be with you!"]="Dou a você a boas-vindas à promoção de verão de iCoke-WOW!\n\n$gQuerido: querida; $n, o halo da deusa fortuna está brilhando sobre você. Obedece a ordem de um deus. Obterá um presente especial e misterioso. Agora, a porta de Azeroth abriu para você. Pronto começará uma grande aventura. $gPreparado: preparada;?\n\nQue a honra estiver com você!"
G["Welcome to the jungle, $n."]="$gBienvenido: Bem-vinda; à selva, $n."
G["Welcome to the jungle, $r! Nesingwary dispatched me to gather info on the wildlife down here.\n\nFeel like lending a hand?"]="Welcome to the jungle, $r! Nesingwary dispatched me to gather info on the wildlife down here.\n\nFeel like lending a hand?"
G["Welcome to the jungle, $rt. You're gunna die!"]="$gBienvenido: Bem-vinda; à selva, $rt. Morrerá aqui!"
G["Welcome to the majestic Lady Mehley. I am Captain Torgoley.\n\nIf you've questions about the ship, feel free to ask; otherwise, please, enjoy the journey, as I always do... After all, to quote a favorite scribe of mine: My experience of ships is that on them one makes an interesting discovery about the world. One finds one can do without it completely."]="Welcome to the majestic Lady Mehley. I am Captain Torgoley.\n\nIf you've questions about the ship, feel free to ask; otherwise, please, enjoy the journey, as I always do... After all, to quote a favorite scribe of mine: My experience of ships is that on them one makes an interesting discovery about the world. One finds one can do without it completely."
G["Welcome to the military, recruit."]="Welcome to the military, recruit."
G["Welcome to the party, $g pal:lady;!"]="Dou a você a boas-vindas à festa, $gamigo: nena;!"
G["Welcome to the party, $n!"]="$gBienvenido: Bem-vinda; à festa, $n!"
G["Welcome to the party, $n.  Would you like to receive a lesson in how to fight with minions?"]="$gBienvenido: Bem-vinda; à festa, $n. Que que te dé uma lecção sobre o combate com lacaios?"
G["Welcome to the races!  Enjoy your stay, and don't bet all your money in one place!"]="Bem-vindo às corridas! Aproveite à sua estadia e não aposte tudo o seu dinheiro em um só lugar!"
G["Welcome to the refuge, $n. Some come here with a purpose, others found their way here by accident... But everyone here seems to have a unique story to tell."]="Welcome to the refuge, $n. Some come here with a purpose, others found their way here by accident... But everyone here seems to have a unique story to tell."
G["Welcome to the tournament, $n."]="Welcome to the tournament, $n."
G["Welcome to the war, kid."]="$gBienvenido: Bem-vinda; à guerra, $gchaval: garota;."
G["Welcome to the world of the unliving."]="Dou a você a boas-vindas ao mundo da não-vida."
G["Welcome to your future -- what little there is left of it..."]="Bem-vindos ao seu futuro... ou ao que restante de ele."
G["Welcome weary traveler.  You've come a long way.  We hope you can find rest here at Camp Oneqwah."]="Saudações, andarilho. Tem recorrido um largo caminho. Esperamos que possa descansar aqui, no Acampamento Oneqwah."
G["Welcome!"]="$gBienvenido: Bem-vinda;!"
G["Welcome!  If you need a place to rest, I can solve that problem."]="Bem-vinda! Se você precisar de um lugar para descansar, eu posso resolver esse problema."
G["Welcome!  Welcome to Yebb Neblegear's Darkmoon Zoo Bizarre - a Trove of Living Legends and Mythical Oddities!  Enjoy your visit, friend!\n\nBut be mindful of what you touch!  These exhibits hold artifacts and beasts both dire and divine!  They might burn the wayward hand of an over-curious onlooker..."]="Welcome!  Welcome to Yebb Neblegear's Darkmoon Zoo Bizarre - a Trove of Living Legends and Mythical Oddities!  Enjoy your visit, friend!\n\nBut be mindful of what you touch!  These exhibits hold artifacts and beasts both dire and divine!  They might burn the wayward hand of an over-curious onlooker..."
G["Welcome! Don't be shy... move away from those pillars so that I can see you fully."]="Welcome! Don't be shy... move away from those pillars so that I can see you fully."
G["Welcome! Have you come to join us for a Pilgrim's Bounty feast? Please, have a seat at a Bountiful Table.\n\nTry everything! I'm certain you'll find something to your liking."]="$gBienvenido: Bem-vinda;! Tem vindo para se juntar a um banquete da Generosidade do Peregrino? Siéntate em uma mesa generosa.\n\nPruébalo tudo! Estou certa de que encontrar algo que te guste."
G["Welcome! Have you yet honored this land's flame?"]="Bem-vinda! Você já honrou a chama desta terra?"
G["Welcome! Step right up, don't be shy.\n\nThis here is my pride and joy... the Blastenheimer 5000 Ultra Cannon! Ain't she pretty?"]="$gBienvenido: Bem-vinda;! Adiante, não tenha vergonha.\n\nIsto de aqui é meu maior tesouro... o Ultracanhón Pimpampum 5000! Não é precioso?"
G["Welcome! You won't find a better selection east of the camp!"]="$GBienvenido: Bem-vinda;! Não encontrar uma seleção melhor ao este do acampamento!"
G["Welcome, $C.\n\nMy name is Aliscar Lend; mage, sorcerer, and public advisor for Goldshire."]="Bem-vindo, $C.\n\nMe chamo Aliscar Lend; mago, feiticeiro e conselheiro público de Vilhadorada."
G["Welcome, $c!"]="Dou a você a boas-vindas, $c!"
G["Welcome, $c!  I hope you aren't afraid of heights!\n\nI've got a practice parachute for you.  These chutes are for quick landings.  If you want to gently soar to the ground, use a mount.  If you want action and an adrenaline rush, you fall.  At the last possible moment you use your chute.  That's how these were made.  Quick action!  Are you ready for some quick action?\n\nThe chute only lasts a few seconds.  So you'll need to time it just right.  I'm not sure you can handle it, $c.  I'd like to see you prove me wrong."]="Welcome, $c!  I hope you aren't afraid of heights!\n\nI've got a practice parachute for you.  These chutes are for quick landings.  If you want to gently soar to the ground, use a mount.  If you want action and an adrenaline rush, you fall.  At the last possible moment you use your chute.  That's how these were made.  Quick action!  Are you ready for some quick action?\n\nThe chute only lasts a few seconds.  So you'll need to time it just right.  I'm not sure you can handle it, $c.  I'd like to see you prove me wrong."
G["Welcome, $c! Be sure to take a moment and enjoy the view!"]="Onda, $c! Tire um descanso e aproveite das vistas!"
G["Welcome, $c! My contacts throughout Pandaria tell me that you have been quite busy here. I admire mortals with your... 'initiative.'\n\nHistory finds us at a turning point. If you are prepared to meet destiny with me head on, I will ensure that you are richly rewarded for your efforts."]="Welcome, $c! My contacts throughout Pandaria tell me that you have been quite busy here. I admire mortals with your... 'initiative.'\n\nHistory finds us at a turning point. If you are prepared to meet destiny with me head on, I will ensure that you are richly rewarded for your efforts."
G["Welcome, $c! Welcome to the Shrine of Aviana, a haven for all creatures of the sky.\n\nAviana may no longer be with us, but her heart and her ferocity live on in all winged creatures.\n\nSpeak with Choluna down below if you are curious about Aviana's story."]="Welcome, $c! Welcome to the Shrine of Aviana, a haven for all creatures of the sky.\n\nAviana may no longer be with us, but her heart and her ferocity live on in all winged creatures.\n\nSpeak with Choluna down below if you are curious about Aviana's story."
G["Welcome, $c.\n\nHyjal burns and the world I've spent my life protecting is on the brink of oblivion.\n\nTell me: Have you ever heard of Tyrus Blackhorn?"]="Welcome, $c.\n\nHyjal burns and the world I've spent my life protecting is on the brink of oblivion.\n\nTell me: Have you ever heard of Tyrus Blackhorn?"
G["Welcome, $c. Have you come to honor this flame?\n\nRemember: Our festival fires burn in every land with a Horde settlement. Make time to honor each of them, if you can.\n\nThe Alliance, too, burns fires of their own. You would do well to desecrate such unworthy efforts when you see them."]="Welcome, $c. Have you come to honor this flame?\n\nRemember: Our festival fires burn in every land with a Horde settlement. Make time to honor each of them, if you can.\n\nThe Alliance, too, burns fires of their own. You would do well to desecrate such unworthy efforts when you see them."
G["Welcome, $c. Have you come to honor this flame?\n\nRemember: Our festival fires burn in every land with an Alliance settlement. Make time to honor each of them, if you can.\n\nThe Horde, too, burns fires of their own. You would do well to desecrate such unworthy efforts when you see them."]="Welcome, $c. Have you come to honor this flame?\n\nRemember: Our festival fires burn in every land with an Alliance settlement. Make time to honor each of them, if you can.\n\nThe Horde, too, burns fires of their own. You would do well to desecrate such unworthy efforts when you see them."
G["Welcome, $g brother: sister;."]="Dou a você a boas-vindas, $ghermano: irmã;."
G["Welcome, $g sir : my lady;. This is a much better camp than the one that I used to have.\n\nIt's good to have company. They've been nice enough to teach me some of their fighting techniques so that I can hold my own against the Horde."]="Welcome, $g sir : my lady;. This is a much better camp than the one that I used to have.\n\nIt's good to have company. They've been nice enough to teach me some of their fighting techniques so that I can hold my own against the Horde."
G["Welcome, $n!\n\nThis is the \"Wanderer's Festival,\" where we celebrate the deeds of the first pandaren explorer and gather on the beach to gaze out across the sea.\n\nThere was a time when the mists that cloaked Pandaria were so thick, sometimes you couldn't even see that large rock just off the shore there. Now look at it - what a glorious night! I'm glad you are here for this."]="Welcome, $n!\n\nThis is the \"Wanderer's Festival,\" where we celebrate the deeds of the first pandaren explorer and gather on the beach to gaze out across the sea.\n\nThere was a time when the mists that cloaked Pandaria were so thick, sometimes you couldn't even see that large rock just off the shore there. Now look at it - what a glorious night! I'm glad you are here for this."
G["Welcome, $n! Are you interested in training in tailoring?"]="Welcome, $n! Are you interested in training in tailoring?"
G["Welcome, $n."]="Bem-vindo, $n."
G["Welcome, $n.  We are the Aldor, priests of the Light and servants of the Sha'tar.\n\nYou are welcome to stay with us for as long as you need."]="Welcome, $n.  We are the Aldor, priests of the Light and servants of the Sha'tar.\n\nYou are welcome to stay with us for as long as you need."
G["Welcome, $n. Bring me the marks that Illidan bestows upon his most powerful minions and I shall grant you access to my alchemical goods."]="Welcome, $n. Bring me the marks that Illidan bestows upon his most powerful minions and I shall grant you access to my alchemical goods."
G["Welcome, $n. Have you come to join the invasion of the Firelands?"]="Dou a você a boas-vindas, $n. Tem vindo a se juntar à invasão das Terras de Fogo?"
G["Welcome, $n. I am Landro Longshot - manager of the Black Flame. Perhaps you've not heard of the Black Flame until now. That doesn't surprise me; we work to keep things that way. We prefer to avoid... factional entanglements.\n\nThe Black Flame specializes in providing the finest services and entertainment money can buy, whether they happen to be hard to find items, gladiatorial combat, or lucrative games of chance.\n\nAre you here seeking something specific?"]="Welcome, $n. I am Landro Longshot - manager of the Black Flame. Perhaps you've not heard of the Black Flame until now. That doesn't surprise me; we work to keep things that way. We prefer to avoid... factional entanglements.\n\nThe Black Flame specializes in providing the finest services and entertainment money can buy, whether they happen to be hard to find items, gladiatorial combat, or lucrative games of chance.\n\nAre you here seeking something specific?"
G["Welcome, $n. I've had the market area cleared to make room for Halfhill's first noodle stand, run by you!"]="Welcome, $n. I've had the market area cleared to make room for Halfhill's first noodle stand, run by you!"
G["Welcome, $n. My expertise is in the art of working with primal mooncloth. Tailors interested in becoming mooncloth specialists often ask me to teach them our ways."]="Welcome, $n. My expertise is in the art of working with primal mooncloth. Tailors interested in becoming mooncloth specialists often ask me to teach them our ways."
G["Welcome, $n. We are honored to have you as our guest. Today, we celebrate not only your arrival, but the initiation of a new class of trainees within our monastery.\n\nPlease, enjoy the food and drink that we have prepared. When you are ready, I would like to introduce you to some of the monastery's instructors."]="Welcome, $n. We are honored to have you as our guest. Today, we celebrate not only your arrival, but the initiation of a new class of trainees within our monastery.\n\nPlease, enjoy the food and drink that we have prepared. When you are ready, I would like to introduce you to some of the monastery's instructors."
G["Welcome, $p! I'll never forget the help ya gave me savin' my boy. Now that was a proper hunt!"]="Welcome, $p! I'll never forget the help ya gave me savin' my boy. Now that was a proper hunt!"
G["Welcome, $p, to my Tournament of Strength!"]="$p, Bem-vindos, participantes, a meu Torneio de Força!"
G["Welcome, $p. We have been watching you for some time.\n\nYou are the gust of wind that heralds the storm of change."]="Dou a você a boas-vindas, $p. Te temos estado observando durante um tempo.\n\nÉ a rajada de vento que anuncia a tempestade do caminho."
G["Welcome, $p. We have been watching your accomplishments since your arrival in our land."]="Dou a você a boas-vindas, $p. Temos estado seguindo seus conquistas desde seu chegada a nossa terra."
G["Welcome, $r! Stay and listen for a while."]="Dou a você a boas-vindas, $r! Fique um tempo e ouça."
G["Welcome, $r."]="$GBienvenido: Bem-vinda;, $r."
G["Welcome, $r. Have a look around."]="Welcome, $r. Have a look around."
G["Welcome, $r. Here you will find representatives from all the factions of Pandaria. Speak to them to find out if you are the brave adventurer that they seek."]="Welcome, $r. Here you will find representatives from all the factions of Pandaria. Speak to them to find out if you are the brave adventurer that they seek."
G["Welcome, $r. Here you will find representatives from all the factions of Pandaria. When you have had a little more experience under your belt, come back and speak to us. Great adventures and great rewards await."]="Welcome, $r. Here you will find representatives from all the factions of Pandaria. When you have had a little more experience under your belt, come back and speak to us. Great adventures and great rewards await."
G["Welcome, Brann Bronzebeard. I am all that remains of this temple's guardian."]="Bem-vindo, Brann Barba de Bronze. Sou o que resta do guardião deste templo."
G["Welcome, Challengers, to my Tournament of Strength!"]="Bem-vindos, participantes, a meu Torneio de Força!"
G["Welcome, Huo. The people have missed your warmth."]="Welcome, Huo. The people have missed your warmth."
G["Welcome, Nurong. Good to have you with us."]="Bem-vindo, Nurong. É bom que estiver conosco."
G["Welcome, O great one. I am your humble servant."]="Welcome, O great one. I am your humble servant."
G["Welcome, Son of Durotan. And to you, Aggralan of the Frostwolves."]="Bem-vindo, filho de Durotan. E você também, Aggralan dos Lobo Gelo."
G["Welcome, Warchief Thrall. Overlord Hellscream."]="Bem-vindos, Chefe de Guerra Thrall, Senhor Supremo Grito Infernal."
G["Welcome, adventurer. You've come just in the nick of time."]="Bem-vindo, aventureiro. Você chegou bem na hora certa."
G["Welcome, ally. We have much to discuss.\n\nThe beasts you call the \"Horde\" ravage these woods. Their terrible stone ribbon slices through our land, frightens the animals we hunt, and fills the air with noise and ash.\n\nTell me, friend. How can we Blackmaw join this \"Alliance\" of yours?"]="Welcome, ally. We have much to discuss.\n\nThe beasts you call the \"Horde\" ravage these woods. Their terrible stone ribbon slices through our land, frightens the animals we hunt, and fills the air with noise and ash.\n\nTell me, friend. How can we Blackmaw join this \"Alliance\" of yours?"
G["Welcome, and feel free to examine my goods.  Other than the moldy smell, they are in perfect condition."]="Welcome, and feel free to examine my goods.  Other than the moldy smell, they are in perfect condition."
G["Welcome, champion! Have you gathered your forces in preparation for the challenges of the Trial of the Grand Crusader? Only the most powerful and accomplished of combatants are able to participate in these trials. To participate in these trials, you must have completed the normal Trial of the Crusader."]="Bem-vindo, campeão! Você reuniu suas forças em preparação para os desafios do Julgamento do Grande Cruzado? Somente os combatentes mais poderosos e realizados são capazes de participar desses testes. Para participar dessas tentativas, você deve ter completado a Prova normal do Cruzado."
G["Welcome, champion! Have you gathered your forces in preparation for the challenges of the Trials of the Crusader?"]="Bem-vindo, campeão! Você reuniu suas forças em preparação para os desafios das Provações do Cruzado?"
G["Welcome, champions! All of our attempts at bringing her down have failed. We could use a hand in bringing her down with these harpoon guns."]="Bem-vindos, campeões! Todas as nossas tentativas de derrubá-a falharam. Poderíamos ajudar a derrubá-a com essas armas de arpão."
G["Welcome, champions! You have heard the call of the Argent Crusade and you have boldly answered! It is here, in the Crusaders' Coliseum, that you will face your greatest challenges. Those of you who survive the rigors of the coliseum will join the Argent Crusade on its march to Icecrown Citadel."]="Welcome, champions! You have heard the call of the Argent Crusade and you have boldly answered! It is here, in the Crusaders' Coliseum, that you will face your greatest challenges. Those of you who survive the rigors of the coliseum will join the Argent Crusade on its march to Icecrown Citadel."
G["Welcome, champions. Today, before the eyes of your leaders and peers, you will prove yourselves worthy combatants."]="Welcome, champions. Today, before the eyes of your leaders and peers, you will prove yourselves worthy combatants."
G["Welcome, child."]="Bem vindo, criança."
G["Welcome, friend of the Wildhammer!\n\nKirthaven is the spiritual center of our people, the one place where the varied clans can come together in peace.\n\nIt's here we honor our dead heroes, before burying them with their gryphons atop Mount Thunderstrike. There they spend eternity at one with the sky."]="Welcome, friend of the Wildhammer!\n\nKirthaven is the spiritual center of our people, the one place where the varied clans can come together in peace.\n\nIt's here we honor our dead heroes, before burying them with their gryphons atop Mount Thunderstrike. There they spend eternity at one with the sky."
G["Welcome, friend of the free people of the Lower City, but do not tarry long.\n\nThere are sounds of battle coming from within.  My compatriots could use your assistance!"]="$gBienvenido: Bem-vinda;, $gamigo: amiga; do Bairro Inferior, mas não te demores.\n\nDo interior chegam sons de batalha. Meus compatriotas estarão encantados de receber sua ajuda!"
G["Welcome, friend, to the Brewfest Grounds! There's much to enjoy here while we celebrate the spirit of friendly competition between rival breweries. If you have any questions, let me know!"]="Bem-vindo, amigo, ao Brewfest Grounds! Aqui há muito para desfrutar enquanto celebramos o espírito de competição amigável entre cervejarias rivais. Se você tiver alguma dúvida me avise!"
G["Welcome, friend, to the Grummle Bazaar!"]="$GBienvenido: Bem-vinda; ao Bazar Grúmel!"
G["Welcome, friend, to the Oasis of Vir'sar!\n\nA paradise on Azeroth!"]="Dou a você a boas-vindas, $gamigo: amiga;, ao Oásis de Vir'sar!\n\nUm paraíso em Azeroth!"
G["Welcome, friend, to the barbershop! Come for a cut? A coloring? Something else, perhaps?\n\nWe can groom facial hair, perform piercings, ink night elf tattoos, and even reshape draenei horns and tendrils!\n\nHave a seat and we'll get right to work. You're only a few coins away from a new, more attractive you..."]="Welcome, friend, to the barbershop! Come for a cut? A coloring? Something else, perhaps?\n\nWe can groom facial hair, perform piercings, ink night elf tattoos, and even reshape draenei horns and tendrils!\n\nHave a seat and we'll get right to work. You're only a few coins away from a new, more attractive you..."
G["Welcome, friend, to the barbershop! Come for a cut? A coloring? Something else, perhaps?\n\nWe can groom facial hair, perform piercings, reshape tusks and horns, and even modify undead features!\n\nHave a seat and we'll get right to work. You're only a few coins away from a new, more attractive you..."]="Welcome, friend, to the barbershop! Come for a cut? A coloring? Something else, perhaps?\n\nWe can groom facial hair, perform piercings, reshape tusks and horns, and even modify undead features!\n\nHave a seat and we'll get right to work. You're only a few coins away from a new, more attractive you..."
G["Welcome, friend, welcome! There's always room for one more!"]="Bem-vindo, amigo, bem-vindo! Sempre há lugar para um mais!"
G["Welcome, friend.\nWe have little to offer by way of supplies, but I will assist you however I can."]="Dou a você a boas-vindas, amigo.\n\nNão temos muito que oferecer a você em tema de suprimentos, mas te ajudarei em tudo o que possa."
G["Welcome, friend.  Let's ride through Grim Batol and strike a blow against Deathwing that he won't soon forget!"]="Dou a você a boas-vindas, amigo. Atravesemos Grim Batol e lancemos um ataque contra Alamuerte que não olvide facilmente!"
G["Welcome, friend. We've been expecting you."]="Te damos a boas-vindas. Te esperávamos."
G["Welcome, kind spirit.  What has brought you to us?"]="Bem-vindo, gentil espírito. Que você trouxe até nós?"
G["Welcome, mortals. (Frail little children). Few have laid eyes on this inner sanctum. (They reach out to touch the fire!)"]="Welcome, mortals. (Frail little children). Few have laid eyes on this inner sanctum. (They reach out to touch the fire!)"
G["Welcome, my $g brother : sister;.  If you are here to train, then I would be delighted to teach you.\n\nIt never hurts to reaffirm one's place within what I like to call the Great Balance.  As preservers of this balance, we must strive to continually keep our minds clear and our hearts strong.  Training helps us in this regard."]="Welcome, my $g brother : sister;.  If you are here to train, then I would be delighted to teach you.\n\nIt never hurts to reaffirm one's place within what I like to call the Great Balance.  As preservers of this balance, we must strive to continually keep our minds clear and our hearts strong.  Training helps us in this regard."
G["Welcome, my $g brother : sister;.  If you are here to train, then I would be delighted to train you!"]="Welcome, my $g brother : sister;.  If you are here to train, then I would be delighted to train you!"
G["Welcome, my $g brother : sister;.  If you are here to train, then I would be delighted to train you."]="Dou a você a boas-vindas, $ghermano: irmã;. Se tem vindo à procura de treinamento, estarei encantado de ajudar você."
G["Welcome, my $g brother : sister;.  If you are here to train, then I would be delighted to train you.\n\nThere will be a time soon where the call of the Emerald Dream will take hold in you.  You will hibernate for many years and walk amongst the purest of forms.  It is there and then that your ultimate training will take place."]="Welcome, my $g brother : sister;.  If you are here to train, then I would be delighted to train you.\n\nThere will be a time soon where the call of the Emerald Dream will take hold in you.  You will hibernate for many years and walk amongst the purest of forms.  It is there and then that your ultimate training will take place."
G["Welcome, my $g brother : sister;.  If you are here to train, then I would be delighted to train you.\n\nWe are the preservers of the balance, now and forever, as Cenarius has taught us.  Never forget this."]="Welcome, my $g brother : sister;.  If you are here to train, then I would be delighted to train you.\n\nWe are the preservers of the balance, now and forever, as Cenarius has taught us.  Never forget this."
G["Welcome, my $g brother : sister;.  If you are here to train, then I would be delighted to train you.\n\nWe are the preservers of the balance, now and forever, as Malfurion lies in the Dreaming.  Never forget this."]="Welcome, my $g brother : sister;.  If you are here to train, then I would be delighted to train you.\n\nWe are the preservers of the balance, now and forever, as Malfurion lies in the Dreaming.  Never forget this."
G["Welcome, my $g brother : sister;.  If you are here to train, then I would be delighted to train you.\n\nWe are the preservers of the balance, now and forever, with Malfurion watching over us.  Never forget this."]="Welcome, my $g brother : sister;.  If you are here to train, then I would be delighted to train you.\n\nWe are the preservers of the balance, now and forever, with Malfurion watching over us.  Never forget this."
G["Welcome, my brethren!  You've been freed from demons.  Embrace the teachings of Velen!  Embrace the light!"]="Welcome, my brethren!  You've been freed from demons.  Embrace the teachings of Velen!  Embrace the light!"
G["Welcome, my new Alliance friend! How can I be of service?"]="Dou a você a boas-vindas, membro da Aliança! Em O que posso ajudar você?"
G["Welcome, my young friend."]="Dou a você a boas-vindas, jovem."
G["Welcome, outsider, to our home."]="Bem-vindo, estranho, à nossa casa."
G["Welcome, outsiders. Master Snowdrift is waiting for you inside the school. Please remember to show proper respect to the Master."]="Welcome, outsiders. Master Snowdrift is waiting for you inside the school. Please remember to show proper respect to the Master."
G["Welcome, serpent rider! I have beautiful cloud serpents for you to browse at your leisure."]="Welcome, serpent rider! I have beautiful cloud serpents for you to browse at your leisure."
G["Welcome, traveler! I have treasure from all across the world.\n\nYou want to test your luck? Only a few timeless coins for a key."]="Welcome, traveler! I have treasure from all across the world.\n\nYou want to test your luck? Only a few timeless coins for a key."
G["Welcome, traveler. Make your home here if you wish. Upstairs you will find the bank vaults and the city portals. Vendors of all trades have set up shop around the building. Please explore at your own leisure."]="Welcome, traveler. Make your home here if you wish. Upstairs you will find the bank vaults and the city portals. Vendors of all trades have set up shop around the building. Please explore at your own leisure."
G["Welcome, traveler. Please stay a while and rest."]="Welcome, traveler. Please stay a while and rest."
G["Welcome, traveller. It is good to see variety included in this tournament."]="Onda. Que bem que tenha tanta variedade neste torneio."
G["Welcome, weaklings, to the rebirth of the Zandalari Empire!"]="Bem-vindos ao renascimento do império Zandalari, vermes!"
G["Welcome, welcome, to the recently appropriated and callously renamed Steamwheedle Stadium!"]="Welcome, welcome, to the recently appropriated and callously renamed Steamwheedle Stadium!"
G["Welcome."]="Boas-vindas."
G["Welcome.  Speak with me when you are ready to begin."]="Onda. Fala comigo quando queira começar."
G["Welcome. I can replace any any rewards you may have gotten from the Black Prince... for a price."]="Welcome. I can replace any any rewards you may have gotten from the Black Prince... for a price."
G["Welcome. May I help you find something?"]="$gBienvenido: Bem-vinda;. Posso ajudar você a encontrar algo?"
G["Welcome. May I offer you rest or sustenance?"]="Bem-vinda. Posso oferecer-lhe descanso ou sustento?"
G["Welcome. We'll hold just a few seconds to see if anyone else is coming along."]="$GBienvenido: Bem-vinda;. Esperemos um momento a ver se alguém mais se indica."
G["Welcome. Will you take your rest here, or perhaps a meal?"]="Bem-vinda. Você vai descansar aqui, ou talvez uma refeição?"
