G["Well I wish they'd go away!"]="Pois desejo que desaparezcan!"
G["Well I won't lie to you, $n. I'm one of the most powerful men in the Valley. Most people send me gifts of great value."]="Well I won't lie to you, $n. I'm one of the most powerful men in the Valley. Most people send me gifts of great value."
