G["Well done, $n! You must be tired after participating in the race. Go and get some rest. There will be plenty of tasks waiting for you here tomorrow."]="Well done, $n! You must be tired after participating in the race. Go and get some rest. There will be plenty of tasks waiting for you here tomorrow."
