G["Well done, heroes."]="Bem feito, heróis."
G["Well done, heroes. Balnazzar had been a threat for far too long. He had a hand in the Scourge and the Scarlet Crusade, two of our most difficult foes. The Risen may have tipped the balance against us, had they time to fester."]="Well done, heroes. Balnazzar had been a threat for far too long. He had a hand in the Scourge and the Scarlet Crusade, two of our most difficult foes. The Risen may have tipped the balance against us, had they time to fester."
G["Well done, heroes. Let us return through that portal we left behind... much work awaits me in Ironforge."]="Well done, heroes. Let us return through that portal we left behind... much work awaits me in Ironforge."
G["Well done, heroes. Let us return through the very portal meant to send this beast through! Much work awaits me in Thunder Bluff."]="Bem feito, heróis. Regresemos pelo mesmo portal pelo que queriam enviar a esta fera! Me espera muito trabalho em Penhasco do Trovão."
G["Well done, heroes. Let us return through the very portal that witch meant to send this beast through! Much work awaits me in Stormwind."]="Bem feito, heróis. Regresemos pelo mesmo portal pelo que essa bruxa queria enviar a esta fera! Me espera muito trabalho em Ventobravo."
G["Well done, my lady. I will have the intruder disposed of at once."]="Well done, my lady. I will have the intruder disposed of at once."
G["Well done, my minions. The mortals' courage begins to wane! Now, let's see how they contend with the true Lord of Blackrock Spire!!!"]="Well done, my minions. The mortals' courage begins to wane! Now, let's see how they contend with the true Lord of Blackrock Spire!!!"
G["Well done, pawn. You are free to go as I no longer have a use for your body."]="Well done, pawn. You are free to go as I no longer have a use for your body."
G["Well done, servant. For so long I have been held captive within the prison of the Firelord. I am once more free to feast upon the out world! The land shall once more be ravaged by the force of the Wind Seeker!"]="Well done, servant. For so long I have been held captive within the prison of the Firelord. I am once more free to feast upon the out world! The land shall once more be ravaged by the force of the Wind Seeker!"
G["Well done, soldier. A few more and our stables will be overflowing with mounts for the cavalry to ride into combat!"]="Muito bem, soldado. Um pouco mais e nossos estábulos estarão transbordando de montarias para a cavalaria entrar em combate!"
G["Well done, soldiers! At ease!"]="Well done, soldiers! At ease!"
G["Well done, soldiers! We weren't about to let the filthy animals of the Horde show us up!"]="Well done, soldiers! We weren't about to let the filthy animals of the Horde show us up!"
