G["Well done, you have proven worthy to test your skills against my master engineer, Telonicus."]="Well done, you have proven worthy to test your skills against my master engineer, Telonicus."
G["Well done, young rogue. Well done, indeed...."]="Well done, young rogue. Well done, indeed...."
G["Well done."]="Bom trabalho."
