G["Well fought. Until next time..."]="Bem lutado. Até a próxima..."
G["Well fought..."]="Bem lutado..."
G["Well get to it then. You're the one veering off onto all these unnecessary topics."]="Well get to it then. You're the one veering off onto all these unnecessary topics."
G["Well gosh, I'm so flattered! I'd love to! You hang on just a giggle, now..."]="Well gosh, I'm so flattered! I'd love to! You hang on just a giggle, now..."
G["Well hand it over and let's see what you've got!"]="Well hand it over and let's see what you've got!"
G["Well hello again, $n!  I don't know how much longer I'm going to keep on trying to set up a shop out in the middle of nowhere.  Still, since you've helped me out in the past, I'll show you some stuff you may find interesting!"]="Well hello again, $n!  I don't know how much longer I'm going to keep on trying to set up a shop out in the middle of nowhere.  Still, since you've helped me out in the past, I'll show you some stuff you may find interesting!"
G["Well hello there ladies. Heard about the new plague?"]="Muito bem, bons dias, senhoritas. Vocês têm ouvido falar da Nova Fedor?"
