G["Well look what we have here. Our first keg of recovered brew! I'll take this one, folks."]="Vá, vá. Que temos aqui? Nosso primeiro barril de mistura recuperei! Já me o quedo eu."
G["Well look who it is!"]="Olhe quem está aqui!"
G["Well look who it is!  The cudgel-bearer $g himself: herself;!"]="Olhe quem está aqui! $gEl: A; do garrote em pessoa!"
G["Well lookee here, it's my good friend $n. You know what I want? Uh-huh, that's right. Got any gossip?"]="Well lookee here, it's my good friend $n. You know what I want? Uh-huh, that's right. Got any gossip?"
G["Well lookie dere! Dat be my bad eye, but it be a good start!"]="Vá sueh'te! Esse é meu olho ruim, mas é um bom início!"
G["Well met master of Rod and Reel!   If you be willing to test your skills against the best fisher-folk in the lands then listen up!   On this very Sunday there be a contest in Stranglethorn where the master angler will be chosen!"]="Well met master of Rod and Reel!   If you be willing to test your skills against the best fisher-folk in the lands then listen up!   On this very Sunday there be a contest in Stranglethorn where the master angler will be chosen!"
G["Well met traveler.  I hope the journey from Camp Winterhoof to our humble outpost was not too taxing."]="Well met traveler.  I hope the journey from Camp Winterhoof to our humble outpost was not too taxing."
G["Well met, $N. It is good to see that $cs like yourself are taking an active part in protecting the groves."]="Well met, $N. It is good to see that $cs like yourself are taking an active part in protecting the groves."
G["Well met, $c.\n\nI train Aspirants in the art of mounted close combat."]="Well met, $c.\n\nI train Aspirants in the art of mounted close combat."
G["Well met, $c.  My advice to you is this: As you travel the world, be wary of magic for it will burn the untrained."]="Onda, $c. Meu conselho para você é este: quando viagens pelo mundo, tenha cuidado com a magia porque pode acabar com o profano."
G["Well met, $c.  You want some advice?  Befriend a mage!  We have a trick or two up our sleeves, we do..."]="Well met, $c.  You want some advice?  Befriend a mage!  We have a trick or two up our sleeves, we do..."
G["Well met, $c. Even now, the Horde attacks Warsong Gulch. Will you fight alongside the Alliance there?"]="Saudações, $c. Inclusive agora, a Horda ataca a Ravina Brado Guerreiro. Lucfará ao lado à Aliança ali?"
G["Well met, $c. I am Rokaro."]="Bem feito, $c. Sou Rokaro."
G["Well met, $c. I hope you are here to inquire on the Ahn'Qiraj war effort. We are going to need a great deal of assistance.\n\nThe war effort is a united effort between the Alliance and Horde to prepare for the upcoming war against the Silithid and their masters in Ahn'Qiraj. In the Military Ward of Ironforge, we are collecting all manner of goods to create our war materiel from, and these gathering tasks are what we need your help with.\n\nCan I convince you to speak with our commander about pitching in?"]="Well met, $c. I hope you are here to inquire on the Ahn'Qiraj war effort. We are going to need a great deal of assistance.\n\nThe war effort is a united effort between the Alliance and Horde to prepare for the upcoming war against the Silithid and their masters in Ahn'Qiraj. In the Military Ward of Ironforge, we are collecting all manner of goods to create our war materiel from, and these gathering tasks are what we need your help with.\n\nCan I convince you to speak with our commander about pitching in?"
G["Well met, $c. I mean you no harm.\n\nI'm here posing as one of the Scarlet Crusade because they have become irredeemably corrupt and evil.\n\nI need your help to put an end to them once and for all."]="Onda, $c. Não te desejo mal algum.\n\nMe faço passar por um membro da Cruzada Escarlate porque se têm voltado malvados e corruptos além de toda redenção.\n\npreciso da sua ajuda para acabar com eles de uma vez por todas."
G["Well met, $c. I'm learning the art of gryphon handling from Baldruc over there. One day, I hope to run my own stable of gryphons."]="$gBienvenido: Bem-vinda;, $c. Estou aprendendo o arte de manusear grifos com Baldruc. Espero ter meu próprio estábulo de grifos algum dia."
G["Well met, $c. You may speak to me unless you have direct business with my mistress Magatha.\n\nI deal with most of her tasks for her so she can concentrate on more important matters. Perhaps there are some things we could discuss before you seek audience with her?"]="Well met, $c. You may speak to me unless you have direct business with my mistress Magatha.\n\nI deal with most of her tasks for her so she can concentrate on more important matters. Perhaps there are some things we could discuss before you seek audience with her?"
G["Well met, $c. Your arrival in Thrallmar could not have occurred at a better time. The warchief is depending on us, since he cannot be here himself."]="Onda, $c. Seu chegada a Thrallmar não poderá haver acontecido em melhor momentos. O Chefe de Guerra conta conosco, já que não pode estar aqui ele mesmo."
G["Well met, $n."]="Onda, $n."
G["Well met, $n. We must be brief because there is much to do."]="Muito bem, $n. Devemos ser breves, há muito que fazer."
G["Well met, $r. I am here as a resource of advice for the High Executor to make use of as he will. I am confident that together we can forge the Horde into something that is even stronger than before and turn back the Scourge menace once and for all!"]="Well met, $r. I am here as a resource of advice for the High Executor to make use of as he will. I am confident that together we can forge the Horde into something that is even stronger than before and turn back the Scourge menace once and for all!"
G["Well met, Battle-Sister. I can assist you in recovering lost companions."]="Bem conhecido, Irmã da Batalha. Eu posso ajudá-o a recuperar companheiros perdidos."
G["Well met, Battle-Sister. I can help stable your pets or assist you in recovering lost companions."]="Bem conhecido, Irmã da Batalha. Posso ajudar a estabilizar seus animais de estimação ou ajudá-o a recuperar companheiros perdidos."
G["Well met, Farmer Yoon. I had to come by and see your farm for myself."]="Onda, fazendeiro Yoon. Queria ver seu fazenda com meus próprios olhos."
G["Well met, I'm Azimi! I often make the walk out here to sell the men fresh fruit and water. Are you hungry, or perhaps thirsty?"]="Bem conhecido, eu sou Azimi! Costumo sair daqui para vender aos homens frutas e água frescas. Você está com fome, ou talvez com sede?"
G["Well met, Lord Zhu. He's with the rest of my men, holding the line at Farwatch Overlook."]="Well met, Lord Zhu. He's with the rest of my men, holding the line at Farwatch Overlook."
G["Well met, fellow Mohawk $GBrother:Sister;."]="Bem conhecido, companheiro Mohawk $gIrmão: Sister;."
G["Well met, friend!"]="Bem conhecido, amigo!"
G["Well met, friend.  I am Officer Garush, and I am a proud member of a world-wide organization known as the Argent Crusade.  Our cause is to fight swiftly and mercilessly against any element of evil that surfaces in Azeroth.  We are not a political body, nor do we ever wish to become one.  Our cause is singular, and to that end we call both the Horde and Alliance as friends - friends in the cause of stamping out evil!\n\nFor the Crusade, my $g brother : sister;!"]="Well met, friend.  I am Officer Garush, and I am a proud member of a world-wide organization known as the Argent Crusade.  Our cause is to fight swiftly and mercilessly against any element of evil that surfaces in Azeroth.  We are not a political body, nor do we ever wish to become one.  Our cause is singular, and to that end we call both the Horde and Alliance as friends - friends in the cause of stamping out evil!\n\nFor the Crusade, my $g brother : sister;!"
G["Well met, friend.  I am Officer Pureheart, and I am a proud member of a world-wide organization known as the Argent Crusade.  Our cause is simple - fight swiftly and mercilessly against any element of evil that surfaces in Azeroth.  We are not a political body, nor do we ever wish to become one.  To that end we call both the Alliance and the Horde both as friends - friends in the cause of stamping out evil!\n\nFor the Light, my $g brother : sister;!"]="Well met, friend.  I am Officer Pureheart, and I am a proud member of a world-wide organization known as the Argent Crusade.  Our cause is simple - fight swiftly and mercilessly against any element of evil that surfaces in Azeroth.  We are not a political body, nor do we ever wish to become one.  To that end we call both the Alliance and the Horde both as friends - friends in the cause of stamping out evil!\n\nFor the Light, my $g brother : sister;!"
G["Well met, friend. Enjoying Noblegarden, I hope? Why not join in the fun?"]="Bem conhecido, amigo. Apreciando o Noblegarden, espero? Por que não participar da diversão?"
G["Well met, travelers of Duskwood! My incredible wares are on sale for a short time in Darkshire. Make haste!"]="Well met, travelers of Duskwood! My incredible wares are on sale for a short time in Darkshire. Make haste!"
G["Well my friend, ye have more skill than I do. Why don't ye go find me old friend Rotgath Stonebeard. He stayed in Ironforge when I left to join Jaina's army. I'm sure he'll be able ta teach ye somethin, or at least know someone who can. If he's still around, I'm sure he'll be at The Great Forge."]="Bem, meu amigo, você tem mais habilidade do que eu. Por que não vai me encontrar, velho amigo Rotgath Barba de Pedra? Ele ficou em Ironforge quando saí para me juntar ao exército de Jaina. Tenho certeza de que ele será capaz de ensinar alguma coisa ou, pelo menos, conhecer alguém que possa. Se ele ainda estiver por perto, tenho certeza de que ele estará na Grande Forja."
G["Well my friend, you've reached heights some people only dream of. Congrats! And now, without further ceremony, it is time for your final lesson!"]="Well my friend, you've reached heights some people only dream of. Congrats! And now, without further ceremony, it is time for your final lesson!"
G["Well now $n, let's get to work on those cauldrons!  If you're going to collect the components we need, then get a vitreous focuser from me.  You'll need to have it on you to identify the necessary resources found on the Scourge that will turn those cauldrons.\n\nYou'll also need a dose of arcane quickener for the cauldrons.  It's not cheap, nor is it stable.  Once you have it, you'll only have thirty minutes to use it before it expires on you; be smart about buying it."]="Well now $n, let's get to work on those cauldrons!  If you're going to collect the components we need, then get a vitreous focuser from me.  You'll need to have it on you to identify the necessary resources found on the Scourge that will turn those cauldrons.\n\nYou'll also need a dose of arcane quickener for the cauldrons.  It's not cheap, nor is it stable.  Once you have it, you'll only have thirty minutes to use it before it expires on you; be smart about buying it."
G["Well now that you and me are neighbors, I can tell you the truth. It's just downright wrong not ta have a proper pig or two on your farm! I'll bring some by when yer not lookin' and then blammo! You'll have pigs."]="Well now that you and me are neighbors, I can tell you the truth. It's just downright wrong not ta have a proper pig or two on your farm! I'll bring some by when yer not lookin' and then blammo! You'll have pigs."
G["Well now! Who knew such a beautiful thing was hiding here? I can see that this \"Alliance\" of yours cuts with precision in order to change the world around you. Interesting."]="Well now! Who knew such a beautiful thing was hiding here? I can see that this \"Alliance\" of yours cuts with precision in order to change the world around you. Interesting."
G["Well now, $g lad : lass;, it looks like the Alliance has already gathered up all that we need for our part of the war. I know that the blacksmiths, engineers and everyone else is busy with the final preparations, and as soon as the Horde assembles all of their goods, it will all be sent to Silithus for the war."]="Well now, $g lad : lass;, it looks like the Alliance has already gathered up all that we need for our part of the war. I know that the blacksmiths, engineers and everyone else is busy with the final preparations, and as soon as the Horde assembles all of their goods, it will all be sent to Silithus for the war."
G["Well now, I haven't seen blades this fine since I left Lordaron with Proudmore and her people. I can't teach ye much more it seems, but if ye were to find Borgus Steelhand I bet he could show ye some things. Finest weaponsmith I ever met."]="Well now, I haven't seen blades this fine since I left Lordaron with Proudmore and her people. I can't teach ye much more it seems, but if ye were to find Borgus Steelhand I bet he could show ye some things. Finest weaponsmith I ever met."
G["Well now, I'm surprised to see other adventurers in a place such as this!\n\nNow that you're here, ye can help me get to the Tribunal. If my research theories about these halls is correct, information pertainin' to the creation o' the entire dwarven race lies within."]="Well now, I'm surprised to see other adventurers in a place such as this!\n\nNow that you're here, ye can help me get to the Tribunal. If my research theories about these halls is correct, information pertainin' to the creation o' the entire dwarven race lies within."
G["Well now, it would appear that we have some time on our hands. The Horde has completed its gathering tasks, and all is being prepared for final shipment to Silithus. We're only waiting on the Alliance to finish with theirs. You should go ask that silly, little ambassador of theirs how far along they are."]="Bom, parece que temos com algo mais de tempo. A Horda tem finalizado seus tarefas de recolecção de materiais, que se você está preparando para ser enviada a Silithus. Agora somente nos fica esperar a que a Aliança hagao mesmo. Deveria perguntar a ela a esse que têm por embaixador quanto tempo vão a tardar."
G["Well now, look Ma. $n's back. Why ain't you got any of my yaks?"]="Vá, olhe mamãe. Voltou $n. Por que vuelves sem meus yaks?"
G["Well now, what vision of loveliness is this?"]="E bem, que visão da beleza é esta?"
G["Well now, ye'll need papers to form a guild, and Jondor Steelbrow can help you get started with the process.  He can be found over at the Ironforge Visitor's Center when yer ready to get started."]="Bem, agora você precisará de documentos para formar uma guilda, e Jondor Steelbrow pode ajudá-o a começar o processo. Ele pode ser encontrado no Centro de Visitantes de Ironforge quando estiver pronto para começar."
G["Well now, you can find Farseer Javad in the area of The Great Forge, just a bit to the North on the East side."]="Bem, agora você pode encontrar o Farseer Javad na área de The Great Forge, um pouco ao norte, no lado leste."
G["Well now. You sure know how to arrive in style."]="Vá, vá. Isso si que é chegar com estilo."
G["Well of Eternity."]="O Poço da Eternidade."
G["Well of course he did. He'd be a fool not to.\n\nThank you, $r. I'll prepare to depart at once."]="Well of course he did. He'd be a fool not to.\n\nThank you, $r. I'll prepare to depart at once."
G["Well of course we are, my dear Greely. And look there. The Micro Mechachicken's stabilization appears to be a complete success!"]="Bom, claro que o estamos, meu querida Greely. E olhe isto. A estabilização do micromecapolho tem resultados ser um completo êxito!"
G["Well one thing's for sure, $n's not a nugget any more!"]="Uma coisa é certa, $n já não é uma pepita!"
G["Well partner, I got some bad news for you. You can come back every day to plant and harvest your vegetables, but you'll need more experience before helping me join the Tillers Union. But don't forget - you're welcome here on the farm any time!"]="Well partner, I got some bad news for you. You can come back every day to plant and harvest your vegetables, but you'll need more experience before helping me join the Tillers Union. But don't forget - you're welcome here on the farm any time!"
G["Well partner, looks like you're ready to work this farm on your own. Come back every day to plant and harvest vegetables if you like. If we work hard, we might even be able to upgrade this place!"]="Well partner, looks like you're ready to work this farm on your own. Come back every day to plant and harvest vegetables if you like. If we work hard, we might even be able to upgrade this place!"
G["Well played, $n. Well played, indeed..."]="Bem jogado, $n. Sem dúvida, bem jogado..."
G["Well played, sir."]="Bem jogado, senhor."
G["Well played."]="Bem jogado."
G["Well said, my lady. We sin'dorei will be free and we shall be great again!"]="Bem dito, meu senhora! Os sem'dorei seremos livres e volveremos a ser grandes."
G["Well said, my son."]="Well said, my son."
G["Well shoot, of course! They're the biggest brewin' family in the whole valley!"]="Well shoot, of course! They're the biggest brewin' family in the whole valley!"
G["Well spoken, Zhi. The strangers from beyond the mists have no shortage of passions, but let us see if they indeed control them. Beyond anger lies hatred, the wellspring of all misery. What is this? Your hatred has a face!"]="Muito bem, Zhi. Não falta paixão aos estrangeiros de além das névoas, mas vamos ver se eles conseguem mesmo controlá-las. Além da raiva está o ódio, a fonte de toda desgraça. O que é isso? Seu ódio tem face!"
G["Well thankee, friend!"]="Muitas Obrigado, colega!"
G["Well that didn't work."]="Bom, isso não tem funcionado."
G["Well that was unexpected!"]="Isso não me o esperava!"
G["Well that's a start at least. Do ya remember who you are?"]="Well that's a start at least. Do ya remember who you are?"
G["Well that's all semantics, really."]="Bom, mas tudo isto não são mais que palavras, em realidade."
G["Well that's embarrassing. To battle!"]="Que vergonha! A lutar!"
G["Well that's one way to voice your opinion."]="Well that's one way to voice your opinion."
G["Well that's quite enough of that."]="Bom, já basta disso."
G["Well that's unusual...Take care of it, then tug another line when you can."]="Vá, que raro... Encárgate disso e tira outro sedal quando possa."
G["Well then perhaps his deeds will be so great that history will remember it as a bull's name."]="Bom, ao melhor seus façanhas serão tão grandes que a históriao recordará como o nome de um toro."
G["Well then there is only one thing left to be done..."]="Bom, em esse atenção somente restante uma coisa por fazer..."
G["Well then what happen is ranger elf's people got jerbed in the nerb! Ouch!"]="Well then what happen is ranger elf's people got jerbed in the nerb! Ouch!"
G["Well then! A mounted Charge is about more than just kickin' yer mount ta full speed an' hollerin' yer lungs out... though that IS the fun part, heh! But the Charge Target will teach ye the finer points.\n\nA good Charge is all about distance and timing. Ye can't be TOO close, or ye won't get enough speed. But ye can't be too far away either or yer mount will tire! As for timin'...\n\nYe'll want ta make sure the Charge Target doesn't have a layer o' Defend up before ye rush in. If it does, use yer Shield Breaker ta make it vulnerable, and THEN Charge in!\n\nSame goes for the real thing: Try ta drop yer opponent defenses before ye Charge!"]="Well then! A mounted Charge is about more than just kickin' yer mount ta full speed an' hollerin' yer lungs out... though that IS the fun part, heh! But the Charge Target will teach ye the finer points.\n\nA good Charge is all about distance and timing. Ye can't be TOO close, or ye won't get enough speed. But ye can't be too far away either or yer mount will tire! As for timin'...\n\nYe'll want ta make sure the Charge Target doesn't have a layer o' Defend up before ye rush in. If it does, use yer Shield Breaker ta make it vulnerable, and THEN Charge in!\n\nSame goes for the real thing: Try ta drop yer opponent defenses before ye Charge!"
G["Well then! It seems all those muscles are not just for show!"]="Vá! Parece que esses músculos não estão somente de adorno!"
G["Well then, I spose I be owin' ya my thanks, $r.\n\nTruth is, I thought I'd swallowed me last tankard 'til ye showed up."]="Bom, suponho que devo dar a você as Obrigado, $r.\n\nA verdade é que, até que chegou, achava que me havia tragado meu última jarra de cerveja."
G["Well then, I'll give the signal to Tirion when you are ready to go."]="Bem, então, darei o sinal para Tirion quando você estiver pronto para partir."
G["Well then, it seems we're both looking for Hogral Bakkan.  He's a dwarf to be sure, so sooner or later he'll be heading for the Thunderbrew Distillery for an ale -- he might even be there now."]="Bem, parece que nós dois estamos procurando por Hogral Bakkan. Ele é um anão, com certeza, mais cedo ou mais tarde estará indo para a Destilaria Thunderbrew para uma cerveja - ele pode até estar lá agora."
G["Well then, let's get this started. The longer we're here, the more damage the undead could be doing back in Hillsbrad."]="Well then, let's get this started. The longer we're here, the more damage the undead could be doing back in Hillsbrad."
G["Well then."]="De acordo."
G["Well then.\n\nIt is good that I no longer sleep."]="Bom.\n\nÉ uma sorte que já não necesite dormir."
G["Well then. Ready to fly?"]="Bem então. Pronto para voar?"
G["Well then... show me the tribute!"]="Bem, então... mostre-me a homenagem!"
G["Well there's a gryphon master up in Stormwind if you need to fly somewhere.  You should be able to see the gryphons landing on your right as you walk through the Valley of Heroes."]="Bem, há um mestre grifo em Ventobravo, se você precisar voar para algum lugar. Você poderá ver os grifos pousando à sua direita enquanto caminha pelo Vale dos Heróis."
G["Well this all is all manner of spooky, is it not?  And these traps, quite unwelcoming.  These mogu could desperately use some decoration advice."]="Well this all is all manner of spooky, is it not?  And these traps, quite unwelcoming.  These mogu could desperately use some decoration advice."
G["Well this is certainly a nice change of scenery."]="Well this is certainly a nice change of scenery."
G["Well this is troublesome! How am I supposed to collect the ore samples for the magisters if the mines have been overrun with gnoll vermin?"]="Bem, isso é problemático! Como devo coletar as amostras de minério para os magisters se as minas foram invadidas por vermes gnoll?"
G["Well this son o' Ironforge would like..."]="Bom, a este filho de Altaforja lhe gostaria..."
G["Well this wagon ain't gonna fix itself."]="Bom, este carro não se vai consertar somente."
G["Well time's money, and time's wasting!  Let's have that drink..."]="O tempo é ouro! E estamos perdendo tempo! Bebamos..."
G["Well well well! $n wins! Looks like I owe someone some money."]="Vá, vá! ganhou $n! Acho que lhe devo dinheiro a alguém."
G["Well well well... look who came waddling back. It's the bruised-beaked bouncing bird, Dippy! And this time, he's not alone!"]="Well well well... look who came waddling back. It's the bruised-beaked bouncing bird, Dippy! And this time, he's not alone!"
G["Well well!  You've come to the right place to learn Mining, $gboyo : girlie;!  Geofram Bouldertoe himself resides at Deepmountain Mining and Jewelcrafting.  Ye couldn't ask for a better instructor than him."]="Well well!  You've come to the right place to learn Mining, $gboyo : girlie;!  Geofram Bouldertoe himself resides at Deepmountain Mining and Jewelcrafting.  Ye couldn't ask for a better instructor than him."
G["Well well, a young visitor.\n\nHave you come to pay your respects at the shrine of my husband?  He was a hero you know.  A master of Jade crafting and fighting. He was to be remembered forever they said.\n\nDo you like my statues?  I craft them with special care saving only the best to  provide my husband company and protection."]="Well well, a young visitor.\n\nHave you come to pay your respects at the shrine of my husband?  He was a hero you know.  A master of Jade crafting and fighting. He was to be remembered forever they said.\n\nDo you like my statues?  I craft them with special care saving only the best to  provide my husband company and protection."
G["Well well, not too bad. Maybe I CAN show you a few things..."]="Bem, bem, não é tão ruim. Talvez eu possa te mostrar algumas coisas..."
G["Well whaddya know? It worked!"]="Quno ia a dizer? Tem funcionado!"
G["Well what about the bombs that landed in our farms from your warship!"]="Well what about the bombs that landed in our farms from your warship!"
G["Well what are you waiting for?! Let's see!"]="Well what are you waiting for?! Let's see!"
G["Well what do you know, this is Children's Week!  What can I do to help?"]="Bom, esta é a Semana dos Ninhos! O que posso fazer para ajudar?"
G["Well whatever happens, we must make a decision as a group."]="Passe o que passe, temos de pegar a decisão em grupo."
G["Well ye'd be sure to find some training in the magical arts over in the Hall of Mysteries, north of the gates of Ironforge.  Juli Stormkettle can always be found there with her nose in a book."]="Bem, você certamente encontrará algum treinamento nas artes mágicas no Hall of Mysteries, ao norte dos portões de Ironforge. Juli Stormkettle sempre pode ser encontrada lá com o nariz em um livro."
G["Well yes, I do know a rare alchemical recipe.  Let me teach you!"]="Bem, sim, eu conheço uma receita alquímica rara. Deixe-me ensinar!"
G["Well you came in last.\n\nNowhere to go but up, right?"]="Bom, e que se terminou $gel último: a última;?\n\nJá somente pode ir a melhor!"
G["Well you can't just stay in here! You leave me no choice!\n<Use the Fire Lotus Incense.>"]="Well you can't just stay in here! You leave me no choice!\n<Use the Fire Lotus Incense.>"
G["Well you know me... I like cats!"]="Bom, já me conhece... me gostam os gatos!"
G["Well you know the only thing that I admire as much as my own looks is a rare white flower that grows around these parts.\n\nIt's terribly hard to find, though."]="Well you know the only thing that I admire as much as my own looks is a rare white flower that grows around these parts.\n\nIt's terribly hard to find, though."
G["Well you're a picky little $r, aren't you? Fine. Just go get me that sample."]="Well you're a picky little $r, aren't you? Fine. Just go get me that sample."
G["Well you're an ugly one! Don't mean you don't know how to fight though.\n\nOne of my squads should be geared and ready to march soon - get your sorry butt in line and make the climb with them!"]="Vá, você si que é feio! Embora isso não quer dizer que não saiba lutar.\n\nUm dois meus escuadrones estará equipado e pronto para marchar dentro de pouco... Mete seu sujo traseiro na fila e escala com eles!"
G["Well! This looks like as good a place to brew as any."]="Bom! Este lugar parece tão bom como qualquer outro para elaborar brebagens."
G["Well! You see, was gift from Grandmother Oluba. She hand-weave from finest silk on Draenor! Am quite proud of, yes."]="Well! You see, was gift from Grandmother Oluba. She hand-weave from finest silk on Draenor! Am quite proud of, yes."
G["Well, $c, that was... subtle."]="Bom, $c, isso foi... sutil."
G["Well, $n - are you ready to roll? It won't be easy!"]="E bem, $n? Está $gpreparado: preparada;? Não vai ser fácil!"
G["Well, $n looks a little weird. Sorry, $n."]="Bom, $n tem uma pinta um pouco estranha. Sinto muito, $n."
G["Well, $n? How are those chickens doing?\n\nMake sure to look around for their eggs. Those darned things hide them in the weirdest places!"]="Well, $n? How are those chickens doing?\n\nMake sure to look around for their eggs. Those darned things hide them in the weirdest places!"
G["Well, Bessy will enjoy this little snack."]="Well, Bessy will enjoy this little snack."
G["Well, I am headed in that direction.  I've only been dallying here at Crown's Guard because of all the wildlife activity on the roads.\n\nI'll make you a deal: help me clear the roads, and yes, I'll join your group."]="Well, I am headed in that direction.  I've only been dallying here at Crown's Guard because of all the wildlife activity on the roads.\n\nI'll make you a deal: help me clear the roads, and yes, I'll join your group."
G["Well, I declare! It's a new student! I'll gladly teach you everything I know once you have a little more skill. Go talk to Gretta Finespindle over there, would you? She'll have you up to speed in no time."]="Bem, eu declaro! É um novo aluno! Com prazer, ensinarei tudo o que sei quando você tiver um pouco mais de habilidade. Vá falar com Gretta Finespindle por lá, si? Ela fará você acelerar rapidamente."
G["Well, I don't know. I was here tending the fire and discussing the drawbacks of cogs with Zootfizzle. That's pretty epic, too, in its own way."]="Well, I don't know. I was here tending the fire and discussing the drawbacks of cogs with Zootfizzle. That's pretty epic, too, in its own way."
G["Well, I hope once they're done he'll send them right back through that portal..."]="Bom, espero que quando tenham terminado os devuelvan ao outro lado do portal..."
G["Well, I suppose I do owe you a little something - here, take one of these. I've got lots."]="Bem, suponho que te devo algo... Tome, fique um dos estes. Tenho muitos."
G["Well, I suppose I should go in there after him.\n\nCan't be any worse than facing Hellscream after this..."]="Well, I suppose I should go in there after him.\n\nCan't be any worse than facing Hellscream after this..."
G["Well, I survived my first encounter with the sha. It was more frightening than I had anticipated."]="Bom, e sobrevivido a meu primeiro encontro com o sha. Foi mais terrível do que esperava."
G["Well, I was just giving our leader here a progress report on how everything is proceeding according to plan.  It should only be a few more weeks and we'll have this place back in shape.\n\nWe may want the Shadow Council to only staff the village with orcs, however.  That way we can make an ancestral claim and work undercover.\n\nWait a minute.  Do I know you?  What's your name?"]="Well, I was just giving our leader here a progress report on how everything is proceeding according to plan.  It should only be a few more weeks and we'll have this place back in shape.\n\nWe may want the Shadow Council to only staff the village with orcs, however.  That way we can make an ancestral claim and work undercover.\n\nWait a minute.  Do I know you?  What's your name?"
G["Well, I won't hold you up.  It's been a pleasure, $n.  I hope our paths cross again soon."]="Well, I won't hold you up.  It's been a pleasure, $n.  I hope our paths cross again soon."
G["Well, I'm going outside to check. Something is amiss."]="Vá, saldré a ver que passa. Algo acontece."
G["Well, I'm going to follow the clue and see where it leads me!"]="Well, I'm going to follow the clue and see where it leads me!"
G["Well, I'm not sure how far I'll make it in this state... I'm feeling kind of faint..."]="Well, I'm not sure how far I'll make it in this state... I'm feeling kind of faint..."
G["Well, I'm off then.  Take care, Harlan."]="Bom, então me marcho. Cuídate, Harlan."
G["Well, I'm off to Ratchet now! Best of luck to you!"]="Bom, parto cima Trinquete! Que tenha muita sorte!"
G["Well, I'm off to the Gelkis.  They're not as dumb as the Maraudines, but they're more reasonable."]="Well, I'm off to the Gelkis.  They're not as dumb as the Maraudines, but they're more reasonable."
G["Well, I'm sorry to hear that. I'll be by again later if you want a hand."]="Well, I'm sorry to hear that. I'll be by again later if you want a hand."
G["Well, I've said my goodbyes.  Time to move on."]="Bom, já me e despedido. Hora de partir."
G["Well, I've seen better. But, you have potential, I won't deny it. Pay attention and you just might learn something!"]="Bem, eu já vi melhor. Mas, você tem potencial, não vou negar. Preste atenção e você pode aprender alguma coisa!"
G["Well, I've spent weeks trying to understand how to summon one of these things. If you know something I don't, I'd appreciate it if you'd share it with us \"lesser\" mortals."]="Bem, eu passei semanas tentando entender como evocar uma dessas coisas. Se você sabe de algo que eu não sei, eu ficaria contente se compartilhasse essa informação com nós, mortais 'inferiores'."
G["Well, Marge, I've actually been looking for a way to tell you this...."]="Bem, Marge, tenho estado procurando a maneira de dizer isto..."
G["Well, NOW I am!"]="Pois agora si!"
G["Well, Warchief? What say you now? Will you send me to Northrend?"]="E bem, Chefe de Guerra? Que diz agora? Me enviarás a Nortúndria?"
G["Well, Zanzil, I'd like to make it your concern.  I've recovered the bodies of High Priestess Jeklik and High Priest Venoxis."]="Well, Zanzil, I'd like to make it your concern.  I've recovered the bodies of High Priestess Jeklik and High Priest Venoxis."
G["Well, actually, that's pretty bad news, but considering the alternatives..."]="Bom, é uma notícia bastante mal, mas tendo em conta as alternativas..."
G["Well, alright then $n. I can tell that you've seen the error of your ways and rejoined the engineering fold.\n\nHave fun with your yeti!!!"]="Vale, de acordo $n. Te posso dizer que você dados conta do erro dos seus actos e voltou ao redil de engenharia.\n\nDiviértete com o seu yeti!!"
G["Well, alright then, there you go, First Officer $n.  Just try to be more careful with your helmet in the future.\n\nThose things don't grow on trees, you know!"]="Well, alright then, there you go, First Officer $n.  Just try to be more careful with your helmet in the future.\n\nThose things don't grow on trees, you know!"
G["Well, alright, but you know these things don't grow on trees.\n\n<The spiritcaller thinks about that a moment.>\n\nOh, wait a minute...."]="Well, alright, but you know these things don't grow on trees.\n\n<The spiritcaller thinks about that a moment.>\n\nOh, wait a minute...."
G["Well, are we going to attack, or are we just going to mill about all day?"]="Bom, vamos atacar ou vamos estar pululando por aqui tudo o dia?"
G["Well, aren't you going to pick the weeds?"]="Ouça, não pensa coletar as ervas?"
G["Well, aren't you the smarty-pants? Ye know more than I do, I can tell ye that! Don't go getting' a big head, but if ye want to keep learnin', have a chat with Georgio Bolero in Stormwind. They say he knows his tailorin'!"]="Bem, você não é o espertinho? Você sabe mais do que eu, posso lhe dizer isso! Não fique com uma cabeça grande, mas se você quiser seguir aprendendo, converse com Georgio Bolero em Stormwind. Dizem que ele conhece seus alfaiates!"
G["Well, at least the ale was safe."]="Bom, pelo menos a cerveja está a salvou."
G["Well, at least there will always be more honeybrew!"]="Bom, sempre nos quedará a birramiel!"
G["Well, back to business for me.  But it sure was nice taking that short break, and it's always nice drinking Thunder Ale!"]="Bom, devo voltar a meu trabalho. Me vindo de pérolas este pequeno descanso... e que bem sienta beber um pouco de Cerveja do Trovão!"
G["Well, before all the hostilities broke out here we were fixing them up to harvest the local trees.\n\nLately, though, they've been forced into service against the Horde. Turns out they make for a pretty fine fighting machine. If you've got a key, you'd be silly not to use it!"]="Well, before all the hostilities broke out here we were fixing them up to harvest the local trees.\n\nLately, though, they've been forced into service against the Horde. Turns out they make for a pretty fine fighting machine. If you've got a key, you'd be silly not to use it!"
G["Well, from what I hear, the new plague has ALL of the old plague flavor but none of the old plague calories or carbohydrates!"]="Well, from what I hear, the new plague has ALL of the old plague flavor but none of the old plague calories or carbohydrates!"
G["Well, from what I've gathered while waiting to be eaten by these yokels... it might not be necessary to kill every ogre you find here.\n\nThe ogres were going on and on the other day about how King Gordok came to power; specifically, he killed the previous king and took his place.  Well, the king's henchmen - those that Gordok spared - immediately swore fealty to the new king.\n\nWho knows - the ogre you save could very well be your own... figuratively speaking, of course!"]="Well, from what I've gathered while waiting to be eaten by these yokels... it might not be necessary to kill every ogre you find here.\n\nThe ogres were going on and on the other day about how King Gordok came to power; specifically, he killed the previous king and took his place.  Well, the king's henchmen - those that Gordok spared - immediately swore fealty to the new king.\n\nWho knows - the ogre you save could very well be your own... figuratively speaking, of course!"
G["Well, guess I should load everything back into the cart."]="Bom, suponho que deveria voltar a carregar tudo na vagoneta."
G["Well, guess we're walking."]="Pois, parece que teremos que caminhar."
G["Well, he comes back to the king all pretendin' to be nice, draws his sword, and runs the king through, elbow to ... well you know... kills him on the spot."]="Well, he comes back to the king all pretendin' to be nice, draws his sword, and runs the king through, elbow to ... well you know... kills him on the spot."
G["Well, he'd better keep the moonshine flowing if he wants my men to stop their research to serve the military's purposes!"]="Bom, mais vale que ele faça fluir o licor se você quer que meus homens abandonen seu investigação para levar a cabo seus propósitos militares!"
G["Well, he's gone too... so why are they still around?"]="Bom, ele também se foi... então por que eles ainda estão por aqui?"
G["Well, helllooo there, pretty thing..."]="Well, helllooo there, pretty thing..."
G["Well, hop to it then!"]="Bom, então cima!"
G["Well, how did it go? Well, I hope?"]="Que? Que tal tem ido? Espero que bem."
G["Well, hurry up! Lord Illidan has no patience for mistakes!"]="Bom, date pressa! Lorde Illidan não tem paciência para os erros!"
G["Well, if it isn't $n!  It's good to see you again; I cannot express my gratitude enough at the help that you've given me and my invention work to date.\n\nWhat can I do for you today?"]="Mas se é $n! fico feliz em ver você outra vez. Apenas posso expressar meu gratidão pela ajuda que nos tem brindado até hoje a mim e a meu trabalho de inventor.\n\nO que posso fazer por você hoje?"
G["Well, if it isn't a young, bristling $c, no doubt drawn here by talk of my exploits in fields of battle!\n\nNo time for stories now, for there are great, important deeds that need doing!  So if you're looking for glory, then luck shines on you today..."]="Well, if it isn't a young, bristling $c, no doubt drawn here by talk of my exploits in fields of battle!\n\nNo time for stories now, for there are great, important deeds that need doing!  So if you're looking for glory, then luck shines on you today..."
G["Well, if it isn't our resident $g flyboy : flygirl;, $n.  How's it going, ace?"]="Vá, se é $gnuestro: nossa; piloto residente, $n. Que tal vai?"
G["Well, if you say so."]="Se acha que é o melhor..."
G["Well, if you've come to kill me, too, can you at least wait until I've fed Griselda? Poor girl hasn't eaten in days."]="Bom, se tem vindo a me matar, pode, ao menos, esperar a que alimente a Griselda? A pobre garota não tem comido desde há dias."
G["Well, isn't this the nicest gift I've gotten today!"]="Vá, é o melhor presente que me têm dados hoje!"
G["Well, it is good that things have turned out... better for you and your people, High Tinker.  But not all of us have the luxury of up and moving our kingdom."]="Well, it is good that things have turned out... better for you and your people, High Tinker.  But not all of us have the luxury of up and moving our kingdom."
G["Well, it isn't exactly a new thought, sister."]="Bom, isto não exatamente um novo pensamento, irmã."
G["Well, it was nice knowing you."]="Well, it was nice knowing you."
G["Well, it's like I said; it's going to be a while before we get this ship ready for flight.  We'll keep you informed."]="Well, it's like I said; it's going to be a while before we get this ship ready for flight.  We'll keep you informed."
G["Well, it's not good. The battle has taken its toll on both your steam tanks. My salvage teams will secure what's left of them as soon as it's safe."]="Well, it's not good. The battle has taken its toll on both your steam tanks. My salvage teams will secure what's left of them as soon as it's safe."
G["Well, it's time to take these comedic muscles elsewhere. Have a good night all!"]="Well, it's time to take these comedic muscles elsewhere. Have a good night all!"
G["Well, it's true. If you ever go to the Wood of Staves, you can see it."]="Well, it's true. If you ever go to the Wood of Staves, you can see it."
G["Well, just for that, you can come to my market any time."]="Bem, pois somente por isso, poderá vir a meu submercado sempre que queira."
G["Well, lad, you can start by readin' The Green Hills of Stranglethorn. Then, maybe you can join me on one of my safaris. What do you say?"]="Bom, colega, pode começar lendo As verdes colinas de Espinhaço. Depois talvez possa vir comigo a um dos meus safaris. Que diz?"
G["Well, let's get to it then."]="Bom, pois vamos elho."
G["Well, let's see.  I heard that Magus Bisp has been spending his time cooped up on top of his tower, working on some new spell, or something.\n\nI heard that Del Gahrron was planning on retiring and heading back to his farm.  He may have already left, in fact.\n\nOh, and I heard that there's some $r $c running around town, asking people all sorts of annoying questions!\n\nJust playing with you, love.  Hope that information helped."]="Well, let's see.  I heard that Magus Bisp has been spending his time cooped up on top of his tower, working on some new spell, or something.\n\nI heard that Del Gahrron was planning on retiring and heading back to his farm.  He may have already left, in fact.\n\nOh, and I heard that there's some $r $c running around town, asking people all sorts of annoying questions!\n\nJust playing with you, love.  Hope that information helped."
G["Well, let's see... I saw some drudges running away from that mine over there.  Said something about a spider.  New customers?  Well, there's Jeralee, the lovely young gnome, who bought an axe twice her size last week.  Oh, and Magus Bisp came by asking for armor.  Not sure why he'd need plate armor..."]="Bem, vamos ver... eu vi algum trabalhos fugindo daquela mina ali. Disse algo sobre uma aranha. Novos clientes? Bem, há Jeralee, a adorável jovem gnomo, que comprou um machado duas vezes o tamanho dela na semana passada. Ah, e Magus Bisp veio pedindo armadura. Não sei por que ele precisaria de armadura de placa..."
G["Well, look what the virmen dragged in. $P, how have you been? Are you hear to compete?"]="Olhe quem tem vindo. Como está, $P? Tem vindo a competir?"
G["Well, look who's here!"]="Bom, olhe quem está aqui!"
G["Well, looks like we have all of the cooked albacore that we can properly salt and store for the upcoming war at Ahn'Qiraj. Thanks for asking though, $c. If you have a mind to, check around with the other collectors. I'd bet there's someone else here that could use your help with gathering up whatever it is that they need."]="Well, looks like we have all of the cooked albacore that we can properly salt and store for the upcoming war at Ahn'Qiraj. Thanks for asking though, $c. If you have a mind to, check around with the other collectors. I'd bet there's someone else here that could use your help with gathering up whatever it is that they need."
G["Well, looks like we've gathered up everything that the Alliance is going to need; now we're just waiting on the Horde. I think soon I'm going to see if there's any Tigule & Foror's ice cream nearby."]="Bom, parece que já temos reuniu tudo o que a Aliança vai precisar; agora somente nos fica esperar pela Horda. Acho que não vou tardar muito em ir a procurar um gelado Tigule e Foror por aí."
G["Well, maybe 'pay' isn't the best word to use. See, when I was stuck in the belly of that thing, I got to thinking:\n\nThis creature lives in hot, flaming magma and yet it doesn't take a lick of damage from the fire!\n\nIf only I could find a pristine hide from one of these beasts. I could take it back to my dear friend, Malyfous Darkhammer, in Everlook. If anyone could do anything with the hide of a beast like this, it would be him."]="Well, maybe 'pay' isn't the best word to use. See, when I was stuck in the belly of that thing, I got to thinking:\n\nThis creature lives in hot, flaming magma and yet it doesn't take a lick of damage from the fire!\n\nIf only I could find a pristine hide from one of these beasts. I could take it back to my dear friend, Malyfous Darkhammer, in Everlook. If anyone could do anything with the hide of a beast like this, it would be him."
G["Well, maybe it was more like a hundred..."]="Well, maybe it was more like a hundred..."
G["Well, milord, your father had our troops recalled at Lord Uther's request."]="Bom, meu senhor, seu pai tem retirado nossas tropas a petição de Lorde Uther."
G["Well, my birds have taken a liking to you. I will follow their lead."]="Well, my birds have taken a liking to you. I will follow their lead."
G["Well, my master Morthis is really the expert, but I can share with you what I know.\n\nThey are not birds. Certainly, they fly, their wings have the appearance of feathers, and we even call them hawks, but that is where the comparisons to birds stop. In fact, it would appear that they have more in common with dragons: an affinity for fire, a solitary nature, and - based on what we've seen - some indications of intelligence."]="Well, my master Morthis is really the expert, but I can share with you what I know.\n\nThey are not birds. Certainly, they fly, their wings have the appearance of feathers, and we even call them hawks, but that is where the comparisons to birds stop. In fact, it would appear that they have more in common with dragons: an affinity for fire, a solitary nature, and - based on what we've seen - some indications of intelligence."
G["Well, my research said you were the last one to-"]="Conforme meu investigação, você foi o último em..."
G["Well, nevermind. I'm sure no one would be foolish enough to lay a hand on Kel'thuzard precious pet."]="Well, nevermind. I'm sure no one would be foolish enough to lay a hand on Kel'thuzard precious pet."
G["Well, no one asked you, Tatai."]="Ninguém te havia perguntado, Tatai."
G["Well, now or never I suppose. Remember, once we get to the road safely, return to Terenthis to let him know we escaped."]="Bom, suponho que é agora ou nunca. Lembre-se, depois que cheguemos até o caminho aptos e salvos, vê a ver a Terenthis para contarle que temos escapado."
G["Well, now that I've got a nice lead, I think I'll enjoy a little nap."]="Well, now that I've got a nice lead, I think I'll enjoy a little nap."
G["Well, now that we've fought, it's settled. We're friends!"]="Bom, agora que temos lutado, somos camaradas!"
G["Well, now that you mention it, yeah, I did see something I thought was a little strange yesterday afternoon!\n\nI was running past some old troll ruins southeast of here; well, I wasn't really running, more like hopping... The sand's so hot!\n\nAnyway, so I was hopping past the ruins, when I noticed a camp set up there. Seems like a funny place to set up camp, if you ask me... I would have poked around a little more but one of those crazy big vultures chased me off."]="Well, now that you mention it, yeah, I did see something I thought was a little strange yesterday afternoon!\n\nI was running past some old troll ruins southeast of here; well, I wasn't really running, more like hopping... The sand's so hot!\n\nAnyway, so I was hopping past the ruins, when I noticed a camp set up there. Seems like a funny place to set up camp, if you ask me... I would have poked around a little more but one of those crazy big vultures chased me off."
G["Well, now we've got a competition on our hands."]="Well, now we've got a competition on our hands."
G["Well, now. What a pleasant turn of events."]="Bem. Que caminho de planos mais agradável"
G["Well, now... that's a lot to digest. I'm gonna need some time to take all this in. Thank ye."]="Well, now... that's a lot to digest. I'm gonna need some time to take all this in. Thank ye."
G["Well, of course, here are some extras. I'm just made of fireworks...."]="Well, of course, here are some extras. I'm just made of fireworks...."
G["Well, out with it, neophyte..."]="Well, out with it, neophyte..."
G["Well, practice makes perfect I suppose."]="Bom, acho que a prática leva à perfeição."
G["Well, recently I've had quite the craving for Fire Spirit Salmon."]="Well, recently I've had quite the craving for Fire Spirit Salmon."
G["Well, see you here tomorrow!"]="Bom, nos vemos manhã!"
G["Well, shaman, what now?"]="E então, xamã, e agora?"
G["Well, so far, it tastes like something my wife would drink..."]="Bom, por agora, sabe como algo que bebería meu mulher..."
G["Well, sometimes veggies get to sprouting SO beautifully, they practically beg to be pilfered.\n\nGrandpa said a keen plainshawk could spot a prize pumpkin better than anyone at the market, and it'd make for it quicker than a... err....\n\n\"Quicker than a hozen in heat.\"\n\nI guess you could say stuff like that back then?\n\nThe point is, you'll just have to defend alluring crops from critters!"]="Well, sometimes veggies get to sprouting SO beautifully, they practically beg to be pilfered.\n\nGrandpa said a keen plainshawk could spot a prize pumpkin better than anyone at the market, and it'd make for it quicker than a... err....\n\n\"Quicker than a hozen in heat.\"\n\nI guess you could say stuff like that back then?\n\nThe point is, you'll just have to defend alluring crops from critters!"
G["Well, spit it out!  What's the bad news?"]="Venha, escúpelo! Qual é a mal notícia?"
G["Well, stuff it. This thing is busted beyond hope. I'm outta here!"]="Well, stuff it. This thing is busted beyond hope. I'm outta here!"
G["Well, that enough of that! Going now."]="Bom, já basta! Vamos."
G["Well, that is just not right. The creature is far too small. Let us see what Keever's third batch will do."]="Bom, isto não está bem. A criatura é demais pequena. Vamos ver o que fará o terceiro lote de Keever."
G["Well, that must be why my neighbor shaved his head and donned those robes. Maybe he'll let me have his stuff."]="Well, that must be why my neighbor shaved his head and donned those robes. Maybe he'll let me have his stuff."
G["Well, that should do it.  Come now, back to the shop to finish our business!"]="Well, that should do it.  Come now, back to the shop to finish our business!"
G["Well, that should put a damper on their plans. Good work, $n. I trust you can get back on your own."]="Bom, isso deveria parar seus planos. Bom trabalho, $n. Suponho que pode voltar pelo seu próprio pé."
G["Well, that was a relaxing nap. How's the game hunting going over there?"]="Well, that was a relaxing nap. How's the game hunting going over there?"
G["Well, that was fun, wasn't it?"]="Bom, tem estado genial, eh?"
G["Well, that went smoothly for a change."]="Bom, isso tem ido muito bem para variar."
G["Well, that's good news. Once we join the Alliance, we certainly won't run out of things to do."]="Well, that's good news. Once we join the Alliance, we certainly won't run out of things to do."
G["Well, that's good news. Once we join the Horde, we certainly won't run out of things to do."]="Bom, são boas notícia. Quando nos unamos à Horda, sempre teremos algo que fazer."
G["Well, that's what I get for oversleeping!"]="Vá, isso é o que acontece quando duermes de mais!"
G["Well, the Tillers won't be crowning you in jewels or building you for war.\n\nFarming is a little different.\n\nIt's a slower life, but a good one. You ask Dooka, Dooka knows!\n\nYou can build up your own farm, plant your own crops, and enjoy eating all the food you grow! That's Dooka's favorite part!\n\nSo if that sounds interesting, then you should go to Halfhill and see for yourself!"]="Well, the Tillers won't be crowning you in jewels or building you for war.\n\nFarming is a little different.\n\nIt's a slower life, but a good one. You ask Dooka, Dooka knows!\n\nYou can build up your own farm, plant your own crops, and enjoy eating all the food you grow! That's Dooka's favorite part!\n\nSo if that sounds interesting, then you should go to Halfhill and see for yourself!"
G["Well, the Tillers won't be crowning you in jewels or building you up for war.\n\nNah, the life of a farmer is about somethin' a little different.\n\nIf you stick with it, you might meet some real interesting folks. You'll be able to build up your own farm, plant your own crops, and enjoy the fruits of your own labor.\n\nSo if all that sounds interesting, then you should go to Halfhill and see for yourself!"]="Well, the Tillers won't be crowning you in jewels or building you up for war.\n\nNah, the life of a farmer is about somethin' a little different.\n\nIf you stick with it, you might meet some real interesting folks. You'll be able to build up your own farm, plant your own crops, and enjoy the fruits of your own labor.\n\nSo if all that sounds interesting, then you should go to Halfhill and see for yourself!"
G["Well, the way I see it, $n, we have two options to consider for leaving this cave.\n\nWe can make our way stealthfully--I use the cloak you've given me, and you'd be left to your own devices, or, and this may be a harder option considering my wounds, we fight our way out back to back.\n\nI'll let you decide since you know your strengths better than I."]="Well, the way I see it, $n, we have two options to consider for leaving this cave.\n\nWe can make our way stealthfully--I use the cloak you've given me, and you'd be left to your own devices, or, and this may be a harder option considering my wounds, we fight our way out back to back.\n\nI'll let you decide since you know your strengths better than I."
G["Well, then. Let us begin."]="Bem, então. Comencemos."
G["Well, there is at least a wee bit of good news... no offense, Gelbin.  The shaking seems to have stirred up The Earthen Ring.  Even the Wildhammer shaman have offered their help."]="Well, there is at least a wee bit of good news... no offense, Gelbin.  The shaking seems to have stirred up The Earthen Ring.  Even the Wildhammer shaman have offered their help."
G["Well, there's your problem! You have what we call a ghost in the machine."]="Bom, aí está seu problema! Tem o que solemos chamar um fantasma na máquina."
G["Well, these will have to do. The Klaxxi'va send their thanks, though I don't know why."]="Well, these will have to do. The Klaxxi'va send their thanks, though I don't know why."
G["Well, this is a little embarrassing...."]="Bom, isto é um pouco embaraçoso."
G["Well, time for a stretch."]="Well, time for a stretch."
G["Well, times were getting tough up north.  While the scourge problem has been dealt with, we are constantly on the move and looking for food.  I decided it was time to head out and find some new fishing grounds!\n\nAfter almost a month at sea, I ended up here.  Good thing I packed a few crates of pickled herring for the trip!"]="Well, times were getting tough up north.  While the scourge problem has been dealt with, we are constantly on the move and looking for food.  I decided it was time to head out and find some new fishing grounds!\n\nAfter almost a month at sea, I ended up here.  Good thing I packed a few crates of pickled herring for the trip!"
G["Well, uh, the truth is, there were ships. There WERE!"]="Bom, eh, a verdade é que havia barcos. Os HAVIA!"
G["Well, we are having some problems at the Sludge Fields, located northeast of here. Warden Stillwater could use your help."]="Well, we are having some problems at the Sludge Fields, located northeast of here. Warden Stillwater could use your help."
G["Well, we may still be crawling with sprites, but I certainly appreciate the help you gave us. You really are quite the travelling hero."]="Well, we may still be crawling with sprites, but I certainly appreciate the help you gave us. You really are quite the travelling hero."
G["Well, we meet again."]="Nos volvemos a encontrar."
G["Well, we're not getting any closer just standing here.  Come on Dadanga!  Yah!"]="Não estamos avançando nada, simplesmente estamos aqui parados. Vamos, Dadanga! Venha!"
G["Well, we've got a master person-finder here, eh $p?  We're on it."]="Well, we've got a master person-finder here, eh $p?  We're on it."
G["Well, well well... look who's back for more!"]="Vá, vá... olhe quem voltou a por mais!"
G["Well, well, moving up in the world are we? You're looking for the Champions' Hall, and you'll find it on the southeast end of Old Town. Good luck!"]="Bem, bem, subindo no mundo, não é? Você está procurando o Salão dos Campeões e o encontrará no extremo sudeste da Cidade Velha. Boa sorte!"
G["Well, well, well, it looks like you people have a spine after all."]="Vá, vá, vá. Parece que têm coragem depois de tudo."
G["Well, well, well, look who's back!  Slumming, $n?"]="Vá, vá, vá, olhe quem voltou! Te vão mal as coisas, $n?"
G["Well, well, well, what have we here?  A $T civilian : civilian;?  Isn't that precious?  You'll get no special treatment from me!"]="Ora, ora, ora, o que temos aqui? $TUm civil: Uma civil;? Que gracinha. Não espere tratamento especial da minha parte!"
G["Well, well, well. $p. I figured I best not be here in person. Don't want to give your ambition any ideas."]="Vá, vá, vá. $p. Sabia que era boa ideia não vir em pessoa. Não queria dar ideas ao seu ambição."
G["Well, well, well…\n\nWhen the vultures spoke of you, I dismissed them as gossips. Meddlers. But here you are! In the flesh… more bone than flesh, truth be told…"]="Well, well, well…\n\nWhen the vultures spoke of you, I dismissed them as gossips. Meddlers. But here you are! In the flesh… more bone than flesh, truth be told…"
G["Well, well, what do we have here...? You must know many secrets...."]="Bom, bom, que temos aqui...? Deve conhecer muitos segredos..."
G["Well, well, what do you know, sparky, we did it. Everything's collected and ready to go. We're just waiting on those Horde yahoos now, and once they get their act together it's off to the races at Ahn'Qiraj!"]="Well, well, what do you know, sparky, we did it. Everything's collected and ready to go. We're just waiting on those Horde yahoos now, and once they get their act together it's off to the races at Ahn'Qiraj!"
G["Well, well. I admire your tenacity. Baleroc stood guard over this keep for a thousand mortal lifetimes."]="Vá, vá. Admiro sua tenacidade. Baleroc montó guarda ante esta fortaleza durante milhares de vidas humanas."
G["Well, well. Looks like we got ourselves some competition. Get 'em boys!"]="Well, well. Looks like we got ourselves some competition. Get 'em boys!"
G["Well, well... look what the cat brung in... and how can I help you, $c?"]="Vá, vá... olhe quem tem vindo... Em O que posso ajudar você, $c?"
G["Well, well... look who's here!"]="Bem, bem... olha quem está aqui!"
G["Well, what do we have here? Do you truly believe you can steal the title of Chieftain of Ealdmaine from me? Ha!"]="Well, what do we have here? Do you truly believe you can steal the title of Chieftain of Ealdmaine from me? Ha!"
G["Well, what's it gonna be, buddy? I've got a market to run."]="Bom, que vai ser? Tenho um submercado que atender."
G["Well, what's it gonna be, friend? I've got a market to run."]="Bom, que vai ser, $gamigo: amiga;? Tenho um submercado que atender."
G["Well, what's it gonna be, my good friend? I've got a market to run."]="Bom, que vai ser, meu $gbuen amigo: boa amiga;? Tenho um submercado que atender."
G["Well, what's it gonna be, neighbor? I've got a market to run."]="Well, what's it gonna be, neighbor? I've got a market to run."
G["Well, what's it gonna be, stranger? I've got a market to run."]="Well, what's it gonna be, stranger? I've got a market to run."
G["Well, what's it gonna be? I've got a market to run."]="Bom, que vai ser? Tenho um submercado que atender."
G["Well, what's this Algalon going to be looking for with his diagnostics? What are our chances?"]="Bom, que procurando esse Algalon com os seus diagnósticos? Quais são nossas possibilidades?"
G["Well, whatever it is, it works quite well!"]="Bem, sejao que seja, funciona bastante bem!"
G["Well, why didn't you say so? Give those Twilight cultists a good one from me, will ya?"]="Bem, por que você não disse isso? Dê a esses cultistas de Crepúsculo uma boa parte de mim, si?"
G["Well, wrap me in leather and tug my leash: it's Dungeon Master Vishas!"]="Well, wrap me in leather and tug my leash: it's Dungeon Master Vishas!"
G["Well, ya got where you were goin'. Too bad you're not gonna live long enough to see it!"]="Well, ya got where you were goin'. Too bad you're not gonna live long enough to see it!"
G["Well, ye won't have much luck with finding a tailor out here.  Ironforge is home to a quite a few talented tailors though.  Why don't ye go ask a guard there."]="Bem, você não terá muita sorte em encontrar um alfaiate aqui. Ironforge é o lar de algum alfaiates talentosos. Por que você não vai pedir um guarda lá?"
G["Well, yeah, sure... who hasn't heard of Chen Stormstout? Though, I hear his keg's empty, if you know what I mean."]="Bom, sim, claro... Tudo o mundo sabe quem é Chen Cerveja de Trovão; embora ouvi que seu barril está vazio, já me entende."
G["Well, you WILL at least write about it, won't you?"]="Well, you WILL at least write about it, won't you?"
G["Well, you aren't going to like what I have to tell you, young missy. This tablet is a naga communication. Their leader, Warlord Sriss'tiz, has ordered his naga to take the rest of the island by force."]="Bom, não vai gostar o que tenho que dizer, jovem senhorita. Esta tabuleta é um comunicado naga. Seu líder, o senhor da guerra Sriss'tiz, tem organizado aos seus nagas que tomen o resto da ilha pela força."
G["Well, you can always go back to the camp and help Weslex with all his cogs..."]="Bom, sempre pode voltar ao acampamento e ajudar a Weslex com todos seus engranagens..."
G["Well, you can find Theridan or Maldryn by the moonwell in the Park.  Just head to the western area of Stormwind, north of the Mage District, but west of the Cathedral Square."]="Bem, você pode encontrar Theridan ou Maldryn pelo poço da lua no parque. Basta ir para a área oeste de Stormwind, ao norte do distrito de Mage, mas a oeste da Cathedral Square."
G["Well, you didn't come all this way out here to jaw over a cup of tea. Let's see how you might be able to help get us out of this situation."]="Bem, você não veio até aqui para comer uma xícara de chá. Vamos ver como você pode nos ajudar a sair dessa situação."
G["Well, you have done what you could through diplomacy. Now, we can only prove ourselves to the Pearlfin through our deeds."]="Well, you have done what you could through diplomacy. Now, we can only prove ourselves to the Pearlfin through our deeds."
G["Well, you really sent them flying. I could hear their... bleating from here. \nBleating? Is that what you call the sound of a yaungol flying off a wall?"]="Vá, si que lhes fez voar. Podia ouvir seu... balido desde aqui.\n\nBalido? Assim é como chamas ao som que há um yaungol cayendo de uma muralha?"
G["Well, you won today, but that doesn't mean I can't win tomorrow. Papa Bramblestaff always said if at first you don't succeed, wipe the blood off and get back in there until you do."]="Well, you won today, but that doesn't mean I can't win tomorrow. Papa Bramblestaff always said if at first you don't succeed, wipe the blood off and get back in there until you do."
G["Well, you won... I guess."]="Bom... acho que... você ganha"
G["Well, you're certainly more talkative..."]="Well, you're certainly more talkative..."
G["Well, you're just zooming right along! I can't teach you anything you don't already know, but Springspindle Fizzlegear sure can! You can find Springspindle in Ironforge. Good luck!"]="Bem, você está apenas dando zoom! Não posso ensinar nada que você ainda não saiba, mas o Springspindle Fizzlegear certamente pode! Você pode encontrar Springspindle em Ironforge. Boa sorte!"
G["Well, you're not going to sign recruitment papers or anything, but you are going to fight alongside him.\n\nYou need to make sure Arthas culls Stratholme and defeats Mal'Ganis. Without Uther and Jaina around, he'll need all the help he can get.\n\nIf you talk to Arthas, he'll put you to work destroying the forces of Mal'Ganis. Follow along until I can figure out what's going on with the Infinites."]="Well, you're not going to sign recruitment papers or anything, but you are going to fight alongside him.\n\nYou need to make sure Arthas culls Stratholme and defeats Mal'Ganis. Without Uther and Jaina around, he'll need all the help he can get.\n\nIf you talk to Arthas, he'll put you to work destroying the forces of Mal'Ganis. Follow along until I can figure out what's going on with the Infinites."
G["Well, you're still here. I'd say that is something worth drinking to."]="Bem, aqui sigues. Parece que há algo bom de beber."
G["Well, you've done just that. Come; let us return to Ironforge, and announce your victory to the Council."]="E é o que fez. Venha, voltemos a Altaforja e anunciemos seu vitória ao Conselho."
G["Well-done, heroes.  You have passed my test of combat."]="Bem feito, heróis. Vocês têm superado meu prova de combate."
G["Well-picked. I'm sure Aska will be satisfied."]="Well-picked. I'm sure Aska will be satisfied."
G["Well. Another $c, come to learn the ways of the Shield-Breaker...?"]="Bem. Otr$go: a; $c. Veio a aprender Romper escudo?"
G["Well. Look what the netherwinds swept in. Come in, sit down, and rest yourself a spell. The fee is modest; you can surely afford it."]="Bem. Veja o que os ventos do interior entraram. Entre, sente-se e descanse um feitiço. A taxa é modesta; você certamente pode pagar."
G["Well..."]="Bem..."
G["Well... I guess I'll just keep an eye on the turrets... or something."]="Well... I guess I'll just keep an eye on the turrets... or something."
G["Well... I guess that no one here is going to want to hear about the Keg Tapper prototypes 74205 and 75633...  Maybe if I spoke about prototype 1701-D, you would get excited..."]="Well... I guess that no one here is going to want to hear about the Keg Tapper prototypes 74205 and 75633...  Maybe if I spoke about prototype 1701-D, you would get excited..."
G["Well... I hate to admit it, but my sister's the one you'll have to talk to if you want to continue training. I don't know as much as she does... yet! She's standing over by the rocket car."]="Bem... Eu odeio admitir, mas minha irmã é com quem você terá que conversar se quiser seguir treinando. Eu não sei tanto quanto ela... ainda! Ela está de pé ao lado do carro-foguete."
G["Well... I was just thinking... you're a bit smaller, so you're less likely to set off any of those mines."]="Bom... estava pensando... você é um pouco mais pequeno, assim que é mais difícil que actives alguma das minas."
G["Well... That got ugly. You're lucky I'm here."]="Well... That got ugly. You're lucky I'm here."
G["Well... ah... don't tell her I sent you, but look for a red-robed woman above the ground level of the central tower.\nRedia Vaunt is her name. But do not mention me!"]="Bom... eh... Não lhe digas que te e enviada eu, mas procurando a uma mulher vestida de vermelho acima da planta baixa da torre central.\n\nSe chama Redia Vaunt. Mas não menções meu nome!"
G["Well... done, heh. But I wonder if you're good enough... to best him."]="Well... done, heh. But I wonder if you're good enough... to best him."
G["Well... done..."]="Bem... feito."
G["Well... done... champions."]="Bem... feito... campeões."
G["Well... fine, fine. We need to test the equipment anyhow.\n\nGimme a few seconds. I'll have 'em come out to \"rehearse.\"\n\nYou ready?"]="Well... fine, fine. We need to test the equipment anyhow.\n\nGimme a few seconds. I'll have 'em come out to \"rehearse.\"\n\nYou ready?"
G["Well... that was interesting. Let's go meet with Lor'themar back outside."]="Well... that was interesting. Let's go meet with Lor'themar back outside."
G["Well... that's interesting. Most of your ancestors died in a fire. Oh my. Your people put themselves at great personal risk in the name of progress! I wish more Pandaren had your initiative."]="Well... that's interesting. Most of your ancestors died in a fire. Oh my. Your people put themselves at great personal risk in the name of progress! I wish more Pandaren had your initiative."
G["Well... the good news is we forced the reinforcements to turn back."]="Well... the good news is we forced the reinforcements to turn back."
G["Well... uh...  I guess the Keg Tapper 74205 will have to wait... but that's okay, I've got some designs for the Keg Tapper 75633..."]="Well... uh...  I guess the Keg Tapper 74205 will have to wait... but that's okay, I've got some designs for the Keg Tapper 75633..."
G["Well... um... I..."]="Em fim... hmm... Eu..."
G["Well... we're undertakers, sir."]="Well... we're undertakers, sir."
G["Well... what do you think the answer is?"]="Bom... Qual acha que é a resposta?"
G["Well... yes."]="Bem, sim."
G["Well... yes. There are problems with the hozen."]="Bom... sim. Há problemas com os hozen."
G["Well... you almost impressed me. I suppose I could spare the time for a few lessons..."]="Well... you almost impressed me. I suppose I could spare the time for a few lessons..."
G["Well? Are we going in, or what?"]="E bem? Vamos entrar ou que?"
G["Well? Are you going to help me down?"]="Bem? Você vai me ajudar?"
G["Well? Don't ye have heads ta roll an' treasure ta dig up?"]="Bem? Vocês não têm cabeças para rolar e um tesouro para desenterrar?"
G["Well? Let's go! I'm eager to see what you've got."]="E bem? Vamos! Tenho ganha de ver que guardas."
G["Well? What is it?"]="E bem? De que se trata?"
G["Well? Who's on the listening side of the signal? What's going to happen?"]="Well? Who's on the listening side of the signal? What's going to happen?"
G["Welp the fish ain't bitin' no more so I might as start gutting and cleaning what I did catch today."]="Welp the fish ain't bitin' no more so I might as start gutting and cleaning what I did catch today."
G["Welp, back to the grind."]="Volta ao corte."
G["Went to Halfhill Market. Please show yourselves out.\n- Old Hillpaw"]="Went to Halfhill Market. Please show yourselves out.\n- Old Hillpaw"
G["Were he still alive to avenge himself, General Hawthorne would have no doubt ordered a retaliatory massacre of biblical proportions."]="Were he still alive to avenge himself, General Hawthorne would have no doubt ordered a retaliatory massacre of biblical proportions."
G["Were my pets too much for you to handle, tamer?"]="Minhas mascotes foram demais pra você, $gdomador:domadora;?"
G["Were they able to hold out?"]="Were they able to hold out?"
G["Were this tower to boast TWICE as many tomes, it would still not be enough for me. My collecting and copying shall never be done.\nSo. You have need of my assistance?"]="Were this tower to boast TWICE as many tomes, it would still not be enough for me. My collecting and copying shall never be done.\nSo. You have need of my assistance?"
G["Were you bitten?"]="Te têm mordido?"
G["Were you counting on this whelp to stop us? Hah!"]="Were you counting on this whelp to stop us? Hah!"
