G["Were you ever a threat?"]="Eras uma ameaça?"
G["Were you going to pay for that? Oh, it's for Aska! Take care, then."]="Were you going to pay for that? Oh, it's for Aska! Take care, then."
G["Were you looking to Reforge an item? I no longer provide such services.\nThe ethereals of \"Three Winds\" in Stormwind's Cathedral District will help you, though.\nAny of the city's guards can provide directions."]="Were you looking to Reforge an item? I no longer provide such services.\nThe ethereals of \"Three Winds\" in Stormwind's Cathedral District will help you, though.\nAny of the city's guards can provide directions."
G["Were you looking to Reforge an item? I no longer provide such services.\nThe ethereals of Orgrimmar's Drag will help you, though.\nAny of the city's guards can provide directions."]="Were you looking to Reforge an item? I no longer provide such services.\nThe ethereals of Orgrimmar's Drag will help you, though.\nAny of the city's guards can provide directions."
G["Were you planning on using Toxitron's chemicals to damage the other constructs? Clever plan, let me ruin that for you."]="Were you planning on using Toxitron's chemicals to damage the other constructs? Clever plan, let me ruin that for you."
G["Were you sent by Baron Sliver to get me out of this cage? Finally. Hurry up!"]="Were you sent by Baron Sliver to get me out of this cage? Finally. Hurry up!"
G["Weren't we supposed to do something?"]="Weren't we supposed to do something?"
G["Western Sewer Entrance"]="Entrada de esgoto ocidental"
