G["Wet fur not fun to sleep on."]="Wet fur not fun to sleep on."
G["Wh- where am I...?  What a nightmare I have had....  But this is no time to reflect, I have much information to report!"]="Dón… onde estou…? Que classe de pesadelos…? Não é hora de reflexionar, tenho que fazer chegar muita informações!"
G["Wh-what are you doing here?! G-go away!"]="Wh-what are you doing here?! G-go away!"
G["Wh-what came over me?"]="Wh-what came over me?"
G["Wh-what happening!?!"]="Que... que está passando?"
G["Wh-what is that thing!!"]="Que... que é essa coisa?"
G["Wh-what?! Well, I...\n\nIn this midst of such an exciting excavation, I'm not certain it would be appropriate to focus on such a thing.\n\nIt would make for a most troubling story, you know."]="Wh-what?! Well, I...\n\nIn this midst of such an exciting excavation, I'm not certain it would be appropriate to focus on such a thing.\n\nIt would make for a most troubling story, you know."
G["Wh... what is happening? Why is the ritual affecting her?"]="Que... O que está acontecendo? Por que lhe está afectando a elao ritual?"
G["Wh... what is that?!"]="Que... que é isso?!"
G["Wh... what is this?"]="Que... que é isto?"
G["Wha - Where  am I? Are you one of them?"]="O que - onde estou? És um deles?"
G["Wha - what? Where am I? I've got to get out of here!"]="Do-onde? Onde estou? Tenho que sair de aqui!"
G["Wha- Help! Help, Shokia! Riko!"]="Que? Socorro! Ajuda, Shokia! Riko!"
G["Wha-?"]="Que?"
G["Wha.. ungh..."]="Que... ungh..."
G["Wha..."]="Mas... que...?"
G["Wha... What has happened?"]="Que... que tem passado?"
G["Wha... What is going on?  The last thing I remember was sitting down to eat..."]="Wha... What is going on?  The last thing I remember was sitting down to eat..."
G["Wha... my roses?! Did Cailin tell you?  I really can't thank you enough. I thought I'd never smell home again..."]="Wha... my roses?! Did Cailin tell you?  I really can't thank you enough. I thought I'd never smell home again..."
G["Wha... what's happening?"]="Q... que está passando?"
G["Wha... where am I?"]="Que... onde estou?"
G["Wha... where am I?  So... weak.."]="D... onde estou? Tão... fraco..."
G["Wha... who... GET OUT OF MY DIGSITE!"]="Que... quem... FORA DE MEU ESCAVAÇÃO!"
