G["Whaa.... What's happening?!?"]="Que... que está passando?"
G["Whaaa? I can't believe he did that ta me!"]="Como? Não posso acreditar que me tenha feito isso!"
G["Whaaaa!!!!!"]="Aaaah!"
G["Whaaaa?"]="Mas que...?!"
G["Whack some gnolls! Step right up and whack some gnolls!"]="Golpeia aos gnolls! Vê aí e golpeia aos gnolls!"
G["Whack-a-Gnoll is a fun-filled game of whacking... gnolls.\n\nIt's a new attraction, and quite popular among us... Well, Sayge isn't too fond of it."]="Atacar ao gnolh é um divertido jogo que consiste em atacar... gnolls.\n\nÉ uma atracção nova e bastante popular entre nós... Bom, a Sayge não lhe há tanta graça."
G["Whack-a-Gnoll?"]="Atacar ao gnolh?"
G["Whaddaya mean Fish is a weird name, too? It ain't weird at all, buddy! I was named after dem fishes in the lake!\n\nNow just now what's a \"$n,\" eh? I ask ya that!"]="Whaddaya mean Fish is a weird name, too? It ain't weird at all, buddy! I was named after dem fishes in the lake!\n\nNow just now what's a \"$n,\" eh? I ask ya that!"
G["Whaddaya mean, what's in it for you? What kind of question is that?\n\nIsn't the joy of fishing The Big One out of the sea enough? What about feeling the sun on your neck and the saltwater spray of the ocean on your face? What about opening a cold brew while sitting back with your friends?\n\nThat ain't enough?!?\n\nLet me tell you, the life of a $Gfisherman:fisherwoman; is rewarding beyond compare!\n\nYou can improve your fishing skill for starters. There are Craftsmen Tokens to be earned for helping out the locals. Gain enough skill, and you can purchase powerful fishing rods.\n\nWell-respected fishermen can get access to a special fish pet and a water strider mount. There's even a fishing raft, for crying out loud!"]="Whaddaya mean, what's in it for you? What kind of question is that?\n\nIsn't the joy of fishing The Big One out of the sea enough? What about feeling the sun on your neck and the saltwater spray of the ocean on your face? What about opening a cold brew while sitting back with your friends?\n\nThat ain't enough?!?\n\nLet me tell you, the life of a $Gfisherman:fisherwoman; is rewarding beyond compare!\n\nYou can improve your fishing skill for starters. There are Craftsmen Tokens to be earned for helping out the locals. Gain enough skill, and you can purchase powerful fishing rods.\n\nWell-respected fishermen can get access to a special fish pet and a water strider mount. There's even a fishing raft, for crying out loud!"
G["Whaddaya mean, what's in it for you? What kind of question is that?\n\nIsn't the joy of fishing The Big One out of the sea enough? What about feeling the sun on your neck and the saltwater spray of the ocean on your face? What about opening a cold brew while sitting back with your friends?\n\nThat ain't enough?!?\n\nLet me tell you, your future life as a $Gfisherman:fisherwoman; will be rewarding beyond compare!\n\nYou can improve your fishing skill for starters. Gain enough skill, and you can purchase powerful fishing rods.\n\nWell-respected fishermen can get access to a special fish pet, a water strider mount, and even your own personal fishing raft!"]="Whaddaya mean, what's in it for you? What kind of question is that?\n\nIsn't the joy of fishing The Big One out of the sea enough? What about feeling the sun on your neck and the saltwater spray of the ocean on your face? What about opening a cold brew while sitting back with your friends?\n\nThat ain't enough?!?\n\nLet me tell you, your future life as a $Gfisherman:fisherwoman; will be rewarding beyond compare!\n\nYou can improve your fishing skill for starters. Gain enough skill, and you can purchase powerful fishing rods.\n\nWell-respected fishermen can get access to a special fish pet, a water strider mount, and even your own personal fishing raft!"
G["Whaddya need? Information? I got that too!"]="O que precisa? Informações? disso também tenho!"
G["Whaddya want now?"]="O que você quer agora?"
G["Whaddya want?"]="O que você quer?"
G["What $r dare harm those of my flock?"]="Que $r osa fazer dano a meu rebanho?"
G["What - WHAT!? What does he think he's DOING? The carriers are unprotected."]="What - WHAT!? What does he think he's DOING? The carriers are unprotected."
G["What - wait - father!?"]="Que? Aguarda... Para!?"
