G["What I did find, however, was the final resting place of the infamous \"Monkey King.\""]="O que si encontramos foi o lugar de repouso do conhecido \"Rei Mono\"."
G["What I do for the Argent Crusade now should only be viewed as fulfillment of an obligation. A payment, if you will. The Highlord freed me from the grasp of the Lich King and laid before us all the path to salvation. With that said, it must be understood that our methods differ - greatly. I and the Knights of the Ebon Blade will help the Argent Crusade lay their foundations within Icecrown and then we will part ways. The payment made in full.\n\nA different destiny awaits us."]="What I do for the Argent Crusade now should only be viewed as fulfillment of an obligation. A payment, if you will. The Highlord freed me from the grasp of the Lich King and laid before us all the path to salvation. With that said, it must be understood that our methods differ - greatly. I and the Knights of the Ebon Blade will help the Argent Crusade lay their foundations within Icecrown and then we will part ways. The payment made in full.\n\nA different destiny awaits us."
G["What I doin' wrong? Don't I get a lunch and two breaks a day, mon?"]="What I doin' wrong? Don't I get a lunch and two breaks a day, mon?"
G["What I not have in height I make up for in magics. I take care of Great Mist Stone good... most of time anyway.\n\nDumb puppy-men."]="What I not have in height I make up for in magics. I take care of Great Mist Stone good... most of time anyway.\n\nDumb puppy-men."
G["What I offer to you now is one such blade, unfired, unheated, untreated - the most raw and basic form.\n\nNow you merely need to find a dragon that will willingly enchant the blade.\n\nIf you had an eternity to live, this might be a possibility; but since you are mortal and could very likely cease to exist at any moment, might I recommend trying to persuade one of the lesser dragons to do your bidding."]="What I offer to you now is one such blade, unfired, unheated, untreated - the most raw and basic form.\n\nNow you merely need to find a dragon that will willingly enchant the blade.\n\nIf you had an eternity to live, this might be a possibility; but since you are mortal and could very likely cease to exist at any moment, might I recommend trying to persuade one of the lesser dragons to do your bidding."
G["What I smell?"]="Que esse cheiro?"
