G["What are you looking at?"]="O que você está olhando?"
G["What are you looking down at?\n\nI'll have you know that the Pestlepots are a storied family with a long tradition of pestling.\n\nYes, that's a word!\n\nThere are no finer alchemists in all of Azeroth, or anywhere else for that matter, I can assure you!\n\nI may carry the title of apprentice at the moment, but my skill is second to none! One must endure such humilities though to get places in life.\n\nOf course, maybe you're just here to help me?\n\n<The diminuitive gnome grins arrogantly.>"]="What are you looking down at?\n\nI'll have you know that the Pestlepots are a storied family with a long tradition of pestling.\n\nYes, that's a word!\n\nThere are no finer alchemists in all of Azeroth, or anywhere else for that matter, I can assure you!\n\nI may carry the title of apprentice at the moment, but my skill is second to none! One must endure such humilities though to get places in life.\n\nOf course, maybe you're just here to help me?\n\n<The diminuitive gnome grins arrogantly.>"
