G["What can I say, $c? You're a true $g hero : heroine;! Not only have you personally saved many of my rangers, but you've dealt a decisive blow against the Shadowpine trolls. Are you sure that you don't want to stay here and be one of my Farstriders?\n\nFare well, $n."]="What can I say, $c? You're a true $g hero : heroine;! Not only have you personally saved many of my rangers, but you've dealt a decisive blow against the Shadowpine trolls. Are you sure that you don't want to stay here and be one of my Farstriders?\n\nFare well, $n."
