G["What is it you seek, $r?  Knowledge?  Money?  Honor?\n\nFor me, it has always been further enlightenment in the arcane arts.  My quest for knowledge has taken me around Azeroth countless times, and each time I learn something new about the magic this world has to offer.\n\nJust kidding!  I'm in it for the money."]="What is it you seek, $r?  Knowledge?  Money?  Honor?\n\nFor me, it has always been further enlightenment in the arcane arts.  My quest for knowledge has taken me around Azeroth countless times, and each time I learn something new about the magic this world has to offer.\n\nJust kidding!  I'm in it for the money."
