G["What is this, an interrogation?  You're not one of Fordring's internal affairs guys, are you?\n\nWell, I've got nothing to hide.  Let me look over my records.  Last week I sold a ball gown to Lieutenant Myner, which struck me as odd.  What else... Magus Bisp bought several dozen leather jerkins, which he couldn't give a reason for.  Oh, and Friar Burlingham came by to stock up on swimwear for his trip to Hardwrench Hideaway.  That's about it.\n\nNow if you don't mind, I have customers!"]="What is this, an interrogation?  You're not one of Fordring's internal affairs guys, are you?\n\nWell, I've got nothing to hide.  Let me look over my records.  Last week I sold a ball gown to Lieutenant Myner, which struck me as odd.  What else... Magus Bisp bought several dozen leather jerkins, which he couldn't give a reason for.  Oh, and Friar Burlingham came by to stock up on swimwear for his trip to Hardwrench Hideaway.  That's about it.\n\nNow if you don't mind, I have customers!"
