G["What... in... Mazu's... name... HRRGHHH!!"]="Em... o... nome... de... Mazu... RRRGGG!!"
G["What... is happening... to me?  Get this cat away from me!"]="What... is happening... to me?  Get this cat away from me!"
G["What... is that thing?!"]="Que é essa coisa?!"
