G["What? $n, you're not a warlock.\n\nThere's nothing that I can teach a $c like you, $g sir : ma'am;."]="Que? $n, não é $gun bruxo: uma bruxa;.\n\nNão há nada que eu possa ensenharle a $gun: uma; $c como você."
G["What? A Horde ship? HERE?"]="Como? Uma nave da Horda? AQUI?"
G["What? Am I here alone. We both have a stake in this, you know!"]="What? Am I here alone. We both have a stake in this, you know!"
G["What? Are you looking for something?\n\nThere's nothing left here. Dead crops. Dead people. So many... dead.\n\nThe blight has taken everything. Even the earth feels it, its shadow seeps into the soil like poison. It's unnatural... If I weren't so stubborn, if I hadn't insisted on staying in our home, maybe they'd still be here.\n\nIt's just Minnie and I now. We're all that's left... and I still refuse to leave.\n\nLight save us both."]="What? Are you looking for something?\n\nThere's nothing left here. Dead crops. Dead people. So many... dead.\n\nThe blight has taken everything. Even the earth feels it, its shadow seeps into the soil like poison. It's unnatural... If I weren't so stubborn, if I hadn't insisted on staying in our home, maybe they'd still be here.\n\nIt's just Minnie and I now. We're all that's left... and I still refuse to leave.\n\nLight save us both."
G["What? Are you too good to help us out here?"]="Que passa? Não merecemos que nos ajude?"
