G["What? Can't you see that I'm busy here?\n\nYou think this transmatter is going to fix itself?!"]="What? Can't you see that I'm busy here?\n\nYou think this transmatter is going to fix itself?!"
G["What? Cheated!?"]="Como que trampas?"
G["What? Did someone say ale? Don't start pouring the pints without ol' Torren!"]="What? Did someone say ale? Don't start pouring the pints without ol' Torren!"
