G["What? Fine, fine... I'll pay my protection moolah to your goons!"]="What? Fine, fine... I'll pay my protection moolah to your goons!"
G["What? HAR'KOA?!"]="Que? HAR'KOA?!"
G["What? Here? Now? We're in a battle!\n\nAs much as I love your enthusiasm to learn the wonders of Gnomish Engineering this really is a conversation best saved for when we are back under the protection of Tinkertown's walls in Ironforge."]="What? Here? Now? We're in a battle!\n\nAs much as I love your enthusiasm to learn the wonders of Gnomish Engineering this really is a conversation best saved for when we are back under the protection of Tinkertown's walls in Ironforge."
G["What? How is this possible?"]="Que? Como é possível?"
G["What? I don't know of any warlock trainers in Stormwind. \nAlthough... There have been some sightings of demonic activity over by The Slaughtered Lamb in the Mage Quarter. I suppose you could check there."]="What? I don't know of any warlock trainers in Stormwind. \nAlthough... There have been some sightings of demonic activity over by The Slaughtered Lamb in the Mage Quarter. I suppose you could check there."
G["What? I'm busy here."]="O que? Estou ocupada aqui."
G["What? I'm just sayin' that's how we do things in Grizzly Hills."]="Que? Somente digo que assim é como fazemos as coisas nas Serra Gris."
G["What? I... I lost? Auuugh! I'll have to work harder to beat you!"]="What? I... I lost? Auuugh! I'll have to work harder to beat you!"
