G["What? Ya found it! Wahoo! I'll get right to work!"]="Que? O tem encontrado! Yuju! Me pondré mãos à obra!"
G["What? Yes, I was backing the Alliance."]="What? Yes, I was backing the Alliance."
G["What? You changed your mind after all? I told you to pick carefully!\n\nAh well, I will forgive you this time. Tell me, which egg do you really want?"]="What? You changed your mind after all? I told you to pick carefully!\n\nAh well, I will forgive you this time. Tell me, which egg do you really want?"
G["What? You just want me to look at some dirty old tome? Ugh, how disappointing. \n\nThis is the script of the Nathrezim, what you call Dreadlords. They rarely use it outside of their home."]="What? You just want me to look at some dirty old tome? Ugh, how disappointing. \n\nThis is the script of the Nathrezim, what you call Dreadlords. They rarely use it outside of their home."
G["What? You mean you can't kill this one by yourself?"]="What? You mean you can't kill this one by yourself?"
