G["What?! How did you sneak past my jail...er, minion out there? Well, I suppose it's for the best. Sales have been a little slow lately.\n\nHow may I fulfill your infernal needs, $c?"]="What?! How did you sneak past my jail...er, minion out there? Well, I suppose it's for the best. Sales have been a little slow lately.\n\nHow may I fulfill your infernal needs, $c?"
G["What?! I will finish you myself!"]="What?! I will finish you myself!"
G["What?! Impossible!"]="Como? Possível!"
G["What?! Impossible! RUNNN!"]="What?! Impossible! RUNNN!"
G["What?! MY SHIP! Who did this?!"]="Que?! MEU NAVIO! Quem fez isto?!"
G["What?! No! This lawn... was... mine..."]="What?! No! This lawn... was... mine..."
G["What?! This is preposterous."]="Como? Isto é ridículo."
G["What?! What was that?"]="Que?! Que foi isso?"
G["What?! What was that?! Impossible! His body is right here! Unless..."]="Que?! Que foi isso?! Possível! Seu corpo está aqui mesmo! A não ser..."
G["What?! You think I'm made out of miners?\n\nHow bad can it be in there?"]="What?! You think I'm made out of miners?\n\nHow bad can it be in there?"
G["What?! You're immune to my air magic?"]="Como?! É imune a meu magia de ar?"
G["What??  The Burning Blade is spreading!  We must investigate!"]="Que?? O Filo Ardente se extiende! Temos que investigação!"
G["What?? You have no proof of such a claim."]="O quê?? Você não tem provas de tal afirmação."
G["Whatcha doin', mon? Don'tcha know the end o' the world be nigh? Here, I show you!"]="Whatcha doin', mon? Don'tcha know the end o' the world be nigh? Here, I show you!"
G["Whatcha lookin' at kid?  There's work to be done!"]="Que está olhando? Há trabalho que fazer."
G["Whatcha lookin' at, ye bilge rat?  Har, har.... just kiddin' with ye, mate!"]="Whatcha lookin' at, ye bilge rat?  Har, har.... just kiddin' with ye, mate!"
G["Whatcha need?"]="O que precisa?"
G["Whatchoo been doin', pacin' yourselves?"]="Whatchoo been doin', pacin' yourselves?"
G["Whatever advice I can give to aid in your fight against the ogres, you shall have it!"]="Qualquer conselho que eu possa dar para ajudar na sua luta contra os ogros, você o terá!"
G["Whatever darkness it once exuded is silent at last."]="Whatever darkness it once exuded is silent at last."
G["Whatever the courier delivers, I hope that it's good news."]="Traigao que traigao mensageiro, espero que sejam boas notícia."
G["Whatever ye do today, hero, ye're doin' fer all the Alliance."]="Faça o que faça, o fará pela Aliança."
G["Whatever yeh do... Don't. Black. Out!"]="Faça o que faça... Não te desmayes!"
G["Whatever you do, don't let it hit you!"]="Passe o que passe, que não te golpeie!"
G["Whatever you do, don't let me forget my Ingenious Cap of Mook Foolery!"]="Whatever you do, don't let me forget my Ingenious Cap of Mook Foolery!"
G["Whatever you do, don't look down."]="Faça o que faça, não olhe baixo."
G["Whatever you do, don't look like a carrot!"]="Whatever you do, don't look like a carrot!"
G["Whatever you do, stranger, do not ask my husband about his egg noodle recipe. It will be the longest conversation you have ever heard."]="Whatever you do, stranger, do not ask my husband about his egg noodle recipe. It will be the longest conversation you have ever heard."
G["Whatever you need, Brazie Getz! Get it?\n\nAnd I'm not just talkin' about the \"legal\" stuff, either. WHATEVER YOU NEED, PAL! Anything..."]="Whatever you need, Brazie Getz! Get it?\n\nAnd I'm not just talkin' about the \"legal\" stuff, either. WHATEVER YOU NEED, PAL! Anything..."
G["Whatever you need, I can get..."]="Whatever you need, I can get..."
G["Whatever you say, princess. But yer simply postponing the inevitable...."]="O que você digas princesa, mas somente está retrasando o inevitável."
G["Whatever you're going to ask for, do it quickly."]="Tudo o que você pedir, faça-o rapidamente."
G["Whatever, Duncan.  Grab a mop and get to work."]="Não me importa, Duncan. Pegue uma mopa e entre a trabalhar."
G["Whatever, I've felt worse."]="Da igual, tenho estado pior."
G["Whatever, let the fight begin!"]="Whatever, let the fight begin!"
G["Whatever."]="Pues fique."
G["Whatever. The revolting, unkempt Horde filth..."]="Whatever. The revolting, unkempt Horde filth..."
G["Whatzit...are they...what are they doin' to our alementals?"]="Mas que...? Que estão fazendo com nossos elementais de cerveja?"
G["Whe... Where am I? What... What is this place?"]="Dó... Onde estou? Que... Que é este lugar?"
G["Wheee!"]="Ueee!"
G["Wheeee! I'm a bird-boy!"]="Ueeeee! Sou um ninho-pássaro!"
G["Wheeee! Thanks Mom!"]="Bieeeen! Obrigado, mamãe!"
G["Wheeeeeee!"]="Ueeeeee!"
G["When Ahune surfaces, will we be ready?"]="Quando Ahune aparecem, estaremos prontos?"
G["When Blackrock freezes over!"]="Quando Rocha Negra se congele!"
G["When Deathwing destroyed the World Pillar, he broke open a rift between your world and ours. These spores and fungi are one consequence.\n\nLet's see if we can deal with them together."]="When Deathwing destroyed the World Pillar, he broke open a rift between your world and ours. These spores and fungi are one consequence.\n\nLet's see if we can deal with them together."
G["When Deathwing rose from the Maelstrom, dark, angry waves crashed into the Zandalari capital. The spine of the land broke in two, and soon, the city and all its riches began to slide into the hungry sea."]="Quando Asa da Morte surgiu na Voragem, furiosas ondas negras atingiram a capital dos Zandalari. A coluna do mundo se partiu em duas, e logo a cidade e suas riquezas deslizaram para o mar faminto."
G["When Hallow's End is over we'll smash all these pumpkins. That'll be the greatest day I've ever known!"]="Quando Hallow's End acabar, esmagaremos todas essas abóboras. Será o melhor dia que eu já conheci!"
G["When I am done here, I am going to mount your heads upon the walls of Azjol-Nerub!"]="Quando acabe aqui, vou colgar suas cabeças nas paredes de Azjol-Nerub!"
G["When I am finished with you, I shall not rest until this world is cleansed. Now perish!"]="When I am finished with you, I shall not rest until this world is cleansed. Now perish!"
G["When I am finished with your tribe, I shall hunt down that orcish cur that saved you from my wrath once before. None will survive."]="When I am finished with your tribe, I shall hunt down that orcish cur that saved you from my wrath once before. None will survive."
G["When I awoke, the Klaxxi told me of you. It seems you are not without your uses."]="When I awoke, the Klaxxi told me of you. It seems you are not without your uses."
G["When I break out of these stocks I'm going to rip out your heart and devour it whole!"]="When I break out of these stocks I'm going to rip out your heart and devour it whole!"
G["When I catch you, I'm going to disenchant your components, so help me..."]="Quando te pilhe, vou desencantar seus peças, te o garanto..."
G["When I clawed my way out of the grave, I thought my family would welcome me with open arms. Instead, they drove me from the village, screaming in a language I could no longer understand."]="Quando saí do túmulo, pensei que minha família me receberia de braços abertos. Em vez disso, eles me expulsaram da aldeia, gritando em um idioma que eu não conseguia mais entender."
G["When I done fightin', went up to Kiryn to ask for my... reward."]="When I done fightin', went up to Kiryn to ask for my... reward."
G["When I find that dragon, I'm gonna throw him to Kalimdor."]="Quando encuentre a esse dragão, o vou lançar até Kalimdor."
G["When I finish this, your pathetic mortal world will burn with my vengeance!"]="Quando isto termine, seu patético mundo mortal arderá com meu vingança!"
G["When I first arrived, I'd hoped to meet the town's namesake.\n\n<Ros'eleth glances around.>\n\nMost young high elves outgrow the 'I wanna be a Farstrider' phase by the time they come of age for their first apprenticeship. Then, it's onto the 'I'm going to be a magister' stage.\n\nNo one dreams of growing up to be a seamstress, but we can't have the Farstriders going around naked, as my mother used to say."]="When I first arrived, I'd hoped to meet the town's namesake.\n\n<Ros'eleth glances around.>\n\nMost young high elves outgrow the 'I wanna be a Farstrider' phase by the time they come of age for their first apprenticeship. Then, it's onto the 'I'm going to be a magister' stage.\n\nNo one dreams of growing up to be a seamstress, but we can't have the Farstriders going around naked, as my mother used to say."
G["When I first arrived, I'd hoped to meet the town's namesake.\n\n<Ros'eleth glances around.>\n\nMost young high elves outgrow the 'I wanna be a Farstrider' phase by the time they're taken as apprentices. Then, it's onto the 'I'm going to be a magister' stage.\n\nI don't think I ever quite outgrew the Farstrider phase, to be honest. No one dreams of growing up to be a seamstress, but we can't have the Farstriders running around naked, as my mother used to say."]="When I first arrived, I'd hoped to meet the town's namesake.\n\n<Ros'eleth glances around.>\n\nMost young high elves outgrow the 'I wanna be a Farstrider' phase by the time they're taken as apprentices. Then, it's onto the 'I'm going to be a magister' stage.\n\nI don't think I ever quite outgrew the Farstrider phase, to be honest. No one dreams of growing up to be a seamstress, but we can't have the Farstriders running around naked, as my mother used to say."
G["When I first saw the undead, I wept, for I could not imagine their horror and loneliness. The Earth Mother spoke to me then; she sang in my blood. And she told me, \"Save them.\""]="Quando vi os mortos-vivos pela primeira vez, chorei, pois não conseguia imaginar o horror e a solidão deles. A Mãe Terra falou comigo então; ela cantou no meu sangue. E ela disse para mim: \"Salve-os\"."
G["When I first set up my rogue academy in Shattrath, it wasn't nearly this crowded. Then, the refugees started flooding in and the naaru needed every available building to house them.\n\nI've closed the doors to my academy for now, but it's not permanent. I'll find a new place to set up.\n\nThen, a new generation of rogues will learn such staples as the gouge'n grin, combat looting, and blaming someone else for breaking polymorph. And who can forget the central rule of roguery --- real rogues don't feint."]="When I first set up my rogue academy in Shattrath, it wasn't nearly this crowded. Then, the refugees started flooding in and the naaru needed every available building to house them.\n\nI've closed the doors to my academy for now, but it's not permanent. I'll find a new place to set up.\n\nThen, a new generation of rogues will learn such staples as the gouge'n grin, combat looting, and blaming someone else for breaking polymorph. And who can forget the central rule of roguery --- real rogues don't feint."
G["When I get all shaken up, hear me shout..."]="Quando me altero... se me ouça gritar."
G["When I get back into my body, I'm going to kill you, mon! Er... no, what I meant to say is that I'm going to hug you. Yeah, that's right, I'm going to hug you and give you a big reward. Nevermind what I said about the killing."]="When I get back into my body, I'm going to kill you, mon! Er... no, what I meant to say is that I'm going to hug you. Yeah, that's right, I'm going to hug you and give you a big reward. Nevermind what I said about the killing."
G["When I get home, I'm going to have a hot bath to scour away the grime. Perhaps two. Or five."]="When I get home, I'm going to have a hot bath to scour away the grime. Perhaps two. Or five."
G["When I get out of here, I'm going to kill every last one of you Twilight's Hammer scum!"]="When I get out of here, I'm going to kill every last one of you Twilight's Hammer scum!"
G["When I get out of here, I'm going to rip every last one of you Twilight's Hammer curs to shreds!"]="When I get out of here, I'm going to rip every last one of you Twilight's Hammer curs to shreds!"
G["When I get sad about losing, I eat..."]="Quando me pongo triste por perder, me pongo a comer..."
G["When I get this hunk of junk up and running, I'll be able to walk the roads without fear of being jumped by bandits!"]="When I get this hunk of junk up and running, I'll be able to walk the roads without fear of being jumped by bandits!"
G["When I give the signal, let loose your greatest roar!"]="When I give the signal, let loose your greatest roar!"
G["When I grow up I wanna be a tanner!"]="Quando crescer, quero ser curtidor!"
G["When I grow up I want to be a fire juggler!"]="Quando seja maior, quero ser malabarista de fogo!"
G["When I grow up I want to be a stable man!"]="Quando eu crescer, quero ser um homem estável!"
G["When I grow up, I wanna be the king of Stormwind!"]="Quando eu crescer, quero ser o rei de Ventobravo!"
G["When I grow up, I want to be the best chef in Pandaria."]="When I grow up, I want to be the best chef in Pandaria."
G["When I grow up, I want to be the bestest Shaman in the world!"]="Quando seja maior, quero ser o melhor xamã do mundo!"
G["When I grow up, I want to put strange things together too!"]="Quando crezca, eu também quero unir coisas raras!"
G["When I learned about my relatives here in the north, I came to learn more.  What I found was warring tribes acting against our very nature.\n\nI have no hope left, $r.  Even great Ursoc has been tainted by this cursed place.\n\nI've lost all hope."]="When I learned about my relatives here in the north, I came to learn more.  What I found was warring tribes acting against our very nature.\n\nI have no hope left, $r.  Even great Ursoc has been tainted by this cursed place.\n\nI've lost all hope."
G["When I need someone to prance around like an overstuffed peacock, I'll call on you."]="Quando necesite a alguém que faça cabriolas como um peru rechoncho, te chamo."
G["When I reached the end of the canyon, I remembered that my motorcycle could fly."]="Quando chegamos ao fim do canhão, recordé que meu moto pode voar."
G["When I return victorious, we will see who the Dragonmaw call \"Warchief\"."]="When I return victorious, we will see who the Dragonmaw call \"Warchief\"."
G["When I said we should strike at the heart of the beast, going through it's stomach wasn't what I had in mind..."]="When I said we should strike at the heart of the beast, going through it's stomach wasn't what I had in mind..."
G["When I say: \"Who's the Master?\" You say: \"Shonuf!\""]="Quando eu digo \"Quem é o mestre?\", você respondes \"Shonuf!\"."
G["When I scowled at you before you became da new king... um... I was just joking.\n\nYeah!"]="When I scowled at you before you became da new king... um... I was just joking.\n\nYeah!"
G["When I see her smile, it makes me smile. When she casts a spell, it puts a spell on me. When I see her horns, it makes me feel... intrigued. It's Dominika!"]="When I see her smile, it makes me smile. When she casts a spell, it puts a spell on me. When I see her horns, it makes me feel... intrigued. It's Dominika!"
G["When I spoke to the waters, they showed me a vision of you, $n. Perhaps you are more than a passing traveler. Perhaps you were sent to us for a reason."]="When I spoke to the waters, they showed me a vision of you, $n. Perhaps you are more than a passing traveler. Perhaps you were sent to us for a reason."
G["When I stumbled upon the Suntara stones at the Grimesilt Digsite, the power of Ragnaros surged through my being. It was Ragnaros that gave me a purpose."]="When I stumbled upon the Suntara stones at the Grimesilt Digsite, the power of Ragnaros surged through my being. It was Ragnaros that gave me a purpose."
G["When I trained as a guard in Orgrimmar, Thrall urged us to be patient and cautious when dealing with enemies.\n\nBut Naga threaten to overrun this peninsula, and Thrall is no longer my Warchief. The time has come to shed some blood, $c."]="When I trained as a guard in Orgrimmar, Thrall urged us to be patient and cautious when dealing with enemies.\n\nBut Naga threaten to overrun this peninsula, and Thrall is no longer my Warchief. The time has come to shed some blood, $c."
G["When I was but a cub I could scarcely throw a punch, but after years of training I can do so much more!"]="When I was but a cub I could scarcely throw a punch, but after years of training I can do so much more!"
G["When I was last in the halls, Talon King Ikiss carried Terokk's Quill with him, as a sign of his authority.\n\nMy brother, Darkweaver Syth, wore Terokk's Mask during our rituals.\n\nAs for the Saga of Terokk, there's no way of knowing exactly where it is, but they usually kept it at the center of one of their rune circles in the great vaulted halls."]="When I was last in the halls, Talon King Ikiss carried Terokk's Quill with him, as a sign of his authority.\n\nMy brother, Darkweaver Syth, wore Terokk's Mask during our rituals.\n\nAs for the Saga of Terokk, there's no way of knowing exactly where it is, but they usually kept it at the center of one of their rune circles in the great vaulted halls."
G["When I was wandering the crater after I crashed here, I remembered something that I once was told... \"Go up, up the mountain ahead,\" said the voice in my head.\n\nListening to it is how I ended up here, $n!"]="When I was wandering the crater after I crashed here, I remembered something that I once was told... \"Go up, up the mountain ahead,\" said the voice in my head.\n\nListening to it is how I ended up here, $n!"
G["When I was young I trained hard to become an anchorite in the priesthood.  Female exarchs were practically unheard of.\n\nNowadays gender matters little - it is courage and conviction that make all the difference."]="When I was young I trained hard to become an anchorite in the priesthood.  Female exarchs were practically unheard of.\n\nNowadays gender matters little - it is courage and conviction that make all the difference."
G["When I was young I wanted to be a brewmaster. Mixing various chemicals to get the perfect drink and flavor.\n\nDuring my training though they kept telling me my drinks were too hearty.\n\nSo I went into smelting. Seemed like a logical transition at the time."]="When I was young I wanted to be a brewmaster. Mixing various chemicals to get the perfect drink and flavor.\n\nDuring my training though they kept telling me my drinks were too hearty.\n\nSo I went into smelting. Seemed like a logical transition at the time."
G["When I was your age I could have had all of those shredders fixed before breakfast and still had time for all of my other chores.  In the Winterspring snow, no less.  And it's uphill both ways there!"]="When I was your age I could have had all of those shredders fixed before breakfast and still had time for all of my other chores.  In the Winterspring snow, no less.  And it's uphill both ways there!"
G["When I woke up, I couldn't find my way back to the campsite..."]="Quando me desperté, não pude encontrar o caminho de volta ao acampamento..."
G["When I yell out the names of ingredients, you throw them in the pot..."]="Quando grite os nomes dos ingredientes, você os arrojas à olha..."
G["When I'm done with this plague wagon it'll look like a goblin built it! Keep me safe!"]="When I'm done with this plague wagon it'll look like a goblin built it! Keep me safe!"
G["When I'm done with ye, ye won't have a toe to stand on!"]="Quanto termine com você não te quedará nem um dedo do pé sobre o que permanecer erguido!"
G["When I'm through with ya, yer head's gonna be firmly placed between yer ass cheeks!"]="Quando termine com você, sua cabeça estará situada firmemente entre seus nalgas!"
G["When King Magni approached me about these festivities I was excited.  I began explaining how with a little help from the gnomes, we could really make this a blast to remember.  Sadly, King Magni wanted to keep it simple.  He wanted to honor the past."]="When King Magni approached me about these festivities I was excited.  I began explaining how with a little help from the gnomes, we could really make this a blast to remember.  Sadly, King Magni wanted to keep it simple.  He wanted to honor the past."
G["When Lolo doesn't wanna spill any o' his precious ale or get his lil' dress dirty, I'm called in. Yep. Ol' Hansel is the dwarf they use to mete out a lil' bit o' justice an' a whole lotta pain."]="Quando Lolo não quer derramar nada da sua preciosa cerveja ou sujar o vestido, sou chamado. Sim. O velho Hansel é o anão que eles usam para dar um pouquinho de justiça e muita dor."
G["When Rocket-Chief Fuselage was asking for volunteers to help out with building the X-52 Nether-Rocket, I submitted my resume for the security division.\n\nUnfortunately, the only position that was left was chief engineer.  Lucky for me, I have Xyrol here to look over my shoulder."]="When Rocket-Chief Fuselage was asking for volunteers to help out with building the X-52 Nether-Rocket, I submitted my resume for the security division.\n\nUnfortunately, the only position that was left was chief engineer.  Lucky for me, I have Xyrol here to look over my shoulder."
G["When Stormwind is secure, we will take this fight to the Highlands."]="Quando Ventobravo estiver certo, levaremos essa luta para as Terras Altas."
G["When Vol'jin come back ta us, I saw he was changed. Da light a' revolution be burnin' in his eyes!"]="When Vol'jin come back ta us, I saw he was changed. Da light a' revolution be burnin' in his eyes!"
G["When a customer has been selected, click on an open seat and the customer will go sit there."]="Quando tenha selecionado a um cliente, faça clique em um assento disponível e o cliente se sentará em ele."
G["When all this is over, I'm going to recommend you for an Alliance Mark of Honor."]="When all this is over, I'm going to recommend you for an Alliance Mark of Honor."
G["When all you have is your fists, everything looks like a face."]="Quando o único que tem são seus punhos, tudo te parecem caras."
G["When am I not respectful?  You hurt me, Aysa."]="Quando não o sou? Seus palavras me hieren, Aysa."
G["When are we going to get some more magical flasks?"]="Quando vamos obter mais frascos mágicas?"
G["When can we eat again?"]="Quando podemos voltar a comer?"
G["When can we go home?"]="When can we go home?"
G["When can we reopen our shops? I'm losing gold here!"]="When can we reopen our shops? I'm losing gold here!"
G["When counting past 3, continue to 5. Never stop at 4. Most bad fortune for those who stop on four."]="When counting past 3, continue to 5. Never stop at 4. Most bad fortune for those who stop on four."
G["When d'ye think we can leave?  I need ta get back to work."]="Quando você acha O que podemos sair? Eu preciso voltar ao trabalho."
G["When dawn rises, the hammer shall fall."]="When dawn rises, the hammer shall fall."
G["When did the mogu learn to wield magic portals?"]="Quando têm aprendido os mogu a manusear portais mágicas?"
G["When did you arrive on this island?"]="When did you arrive on this island?"
G["When disruptions are detected by our watchers, we are charged with their repair."]="When disruptions are detected by our watchers, we are charged with their repair."
G["When do your people counter-attack? Tell me and I'll end your suffering."]="When do your people counter-attack? Tell me and I'll end your suffering."
G["When does de trainin' start?"]="When does de trainin' start?"
G["When dwarves fly! They do? Then yes!"]="When dwarves fly! They do? Then yes!"
G["When everyone else is busy with their own problems, you've only got two options. You can be another problem begging for help, or you can carry your own weight. The People's Militia is here to carry Westfall's weight."]="Quando todos estão ocupados com os seus próprios problemas, somente tem dois opções: ser outro problema que pede ajuda ou carregar seu próprio peso. A Milícia Popular está aqui para carregar o peso dos Cerro Oeste."
G["When faced with challenges the like you have never seen, what do you hope for? What is the future you seek?"]="When faced with challenges the like you have never seen, what do you hope for? What is the future you seek?"
G["When facing a spellcaster of any kind, this feral beast will be your best friend. Now, let us take a look at something a bit different. This next creature will aid your travels and make your future journeys much easier. Let's take a look at a felsteed."]="When facing a spellcaster of any kind, this feral beast will be your best friend. Now, let us take a look at something a bit different. This next creature will aid your travels and make your future journeys much easier. Let's take a look at a felsteed."
G["When have the dwarves ever been our friends?"]="Desde quando são os anões nossos amigos?"
G["When he came upon the refugees at the Greymane Wall, he felt it his duty to succor them, sending his woman on to Hillsbrad."]="When he came upon the refugees at the Greymane Wall, he felt it his duty to succor them, sending his woman on to Hillsbrad."
G["When he says, 'younger brother,' he fails to mention that we're twins. He's really only older by a couple of minutes.\n\nDon't let that 'rising star' bit of his fool you. I'll never be a trader of the same magnitude that he is."]="When he says, 'younger brother,' he fails to mention that we're twins. He's really only older by a couple of minutes.\n\nDon't let that 'rising star' bit of his fool you. I'll never be a trader of the same magnitude that he is."
G["When he was given to us by 'Prince' Kael'thas, we believed his power would help us lead our people into a new age."]="When he was given to us by 'Prince' Kael'thas, we believed his power would help us lead our people into a new age."
G["When is daddy coming back, mom?"]="Quando volta papai, mamãe?"
G["When is it ever wise not to act for the greater good?"]="Quando é sábio não agir pelo bem maior?"
G["When is pappa coming back from the fights in Warsong? It has been so long..."]="Quando volta papai das luchas em Brado Guerreiro? Há muito tempo já..."
G["When it becomes difficult to tell friend from foe..."]="Quando resulta difícil distinguir a amigo de inimigo..."
G["When it comes to treasure, never be lookin' sideways at lootin' someone else's junk. Stolen goods be much sweeter, ya? But free is free, no matta how it got that way!"]="Quando se trata de tesouro, nunca olhe de lado para saquear o lixo de outra pessoa. Bens roubados são muito mais doces, não é? Mas grátis é grátis, não importa como foi assim!"
G["When lightning strikes the ocean why don't all the fish die?"]="Quando um raio atinge o oceano, por que todos os peixes não morrem?"
G["When man asks favor of a fish..."]="Quando um pida um peixe um favor..."
G["When me and my Wildhammer Mercenaries were hired on to secure Fort Triumph, I imagined we'd be fighting the Horde.\n\nBut we're set on from all sides! 'Sploding goblins, burrowing bugs, electro-fied lizards..."]="When me and my Wildhammer Mercenaries were hired on to secure Fort Triumph, I imagined we'd be fighting the Horde.\n\nBut we're set on from all sides! 'Sploding goblins, burrowing bugs, electro-fied lizards..."
G["When mounted on the back of a wind rider, one sees that its reputation for strength and speed is well earned."]="When mounted on the back of a wind rider, one sees that its reputation for strength and speed is well earned."
G["When my druids and I were ambushed by renegade orcs, you challenged Warchief Garrosh to trial by combat to answer for their deaths, chieftain."]="Quando meus druidas e eu caímos na emboscada dos orcs renegados, desafiaste ao Chefe de Guerra Garrosh a uma prova de combate para que respondiera pelos seus mortes, chefe."
G["When my journey began, I was reckless in my strength. The White Tiger taught me control. My hatred, anger, and violence were vanquished."]="Quando minha jornada começou, eu era forte e imprudente. O Tigre Branco me ensinou controle, e meu ódio, raiva e violência desvaneceram."
G["When my son found a blue feather, he used to say that it was a kiss from his mother, up in the sky.\n\n<Old Hillpaw pauses, too choked up to continue.>"]="When my son found a blue feather, he used to say that it was a kiss from his mother, up in the sky.\n\n<Old Hillpaw pauses, too choked up to continue.>"
G["When next we meet I shall require much more to justify your life."]="A próxima vez que nos vamos ver, precisarei muito mais para justificar sua vida."
G["When next we meet, it won't be on holy ground, paladin."]="Paladino, a próxima vez que nos vamos ver, não será sobre sozinho sagrado."
G["When one Shado-Pan falls, another steps forward to take his place."]="Quando um Shado-Pan cai, outro logo toma seu lugar."
G["When one studies and digs, one reveals the truth."]="When one studies and digs, one reveals the truth."
G["When one virtue is lost, cling to those that remain."]="Quando uma virtude se perde, você deve se ater às que restam."
G["When our duty here is behind us, I shall find a way to repay you for my rescue."]="Quando nosso dever aqui estiver para por trás, encontrarei uma maneira de recompensá-o por meu resgate."
G["When our fury is unleashed, our enemies will cower!"]="When our fury is unleashed, our enemies will cower!"
G["When our supplies are high, Field Marshal Teravaine is stationed in the Field of Strife, at our southernmost ballista emplacement."]="When our supplies are high, Field Marshal Teravaine is stationed in the Field of Strife, at our southernmost ballista emplacement."
G["When our supplies are high, Warmaster Garrick is stationed in the Field of Strife at a catapult, north of Iceblood Garrison."]="Quando nosso nível de suprimentos é alto, o mestre de guerra Garrick está estacionado na Terra de Disputa. Em uma catapulta, ao norte do Baluarte Sangrehielo."
G["When preparing the dragon's meal, be sure to torture the prisoner in view of the dragon.  It responds well to pre-meal entertainment."]="Ao preparar a comida do dragão, certifique-se de torturar o prisioneiro linha de frente de ele. Sempre responde bem a este entretenimento antes da comida."
G["When pushed to the edge, results may become unpredictable..."]="Quando se lhes leva ao limite, os resultados se voltam impredecibles..."
G["When she tried to forbid the swarm, it was to prevent, as she put it, \"a senseless loss of life.\""]="When she tried to forbid the swarm, it was to prevent, as she put it, \"a senseless loss of life.\""
G["When should I open my eyes?"]="Quando deveria abrir os olhos?"
G["When standing on the precipice, do not forget to breathe."]="When standing on the precipice, do not forget to breathe."
G["When that day comes, seek all the light and wonder of this world, and fight."]="Quando chegue esse dia, procurando toda a luz e a felicidade deste mundo e luta."
G["When the Burning Legion turned the orcs against the draenei, the fiercest battle was fought here. The draenei fought tooth and nail, but in the end the city fell."]="When the Burning Legion turned the orcs against the draenei, the fiercest battle was fought here. The draenei fought tooth and nail, but in the end the city fell."
G["When the Cataclysm happened, the links bounding elementals across Azeroth weakened significantly.  One such elemental, Aquementas, is no longer imprisoned.  I hear he's causing some major problems for the Southsea gang!"]="Quando o Cataclismo aconteceu, os elos que ligavam os elementais através de Azeroth enfraqueceram significativamente. Um desses elementos, Aquementas, não está mais preso. Ouvi dizer que ele está causando algum problemas importantes para a gangue do Mar do Sul!"
G["When the Cataclysm struck, I decided the time had come to part the mists ... and help heal our broken world."]="Quando o Cataclismo veio, eu decidi que era hora de dissipar a névoa... e ajudar a curar nosso mundo partido."
G["When the Darkmoon Faire arrives, where will it be located?"]="Quando o Darkmoon Faire chegar, onde será localizado?"
G["When the Darkmoon Faire is open, it will be located in Elwynn Forest.  We'll be pitching our tents just south of Goldshire!"]="Quando o Darkmoon Faire estiver aberto, ele estará localizado na Floresta de Elwynn. Vamos montar nossas barracas ao sul de Goldshire!"
G["When the Darkmoon Faire is open, it will be located in Terokkar Forest in Outland.  We'll be pitching our tents just south of Shattrath City!"]="When the Darkmoon Faire is open, it will be located in Terokkar Forest in Outland.  We'll be pitching our tents just south of Shattrath City!"
G["When the Darkmoon Faire opens, it will be located in Mulgore.  We'll be pitching our tents just southwest of Thunder Bluff!"]="Quando o Darkmoon Faire for aberto, ele estará localizado em Mulgore. Vamos montar nossas barracas a sudoeste de Thunder Bluff!"
G["When the Earthwarder began to recover, he became ill content with the quiet. With the peace. It was not long before he turned the stone dragons upon us.\n\nWith Deathwing gone, they are without purpose again. We can remind them of our strength. Bring them back to the Earthmother."]="When the Earthwarder began to recover, he became ill content with the quiet. With the peace. It was not long before he turned the stone dragons upon us.\n\nWith Deathwing gone, they are without purpose again. We can remind them of our strength. Bring them back to the Earthmother."
G["When the Horde finally show their ugly faces, we'll be ready."]="Quando a Horda muestre ao fim seu suja rosto, estaremos preparados."
G["When the Horde was shattered, men returned here and began to rebuild the once great city as a testament to our own survival."]="When the Horde was shattered, men returned here and began to rebuild the once great city as a testament to our own survival."
G["When the SI:7 found me, they wanted to take me home. I ran away.\n\nIt wasn't long before the Horde found me.\n\nDuring the battle at Serpent's Heart, I managed to slip away in the chaos. A merchant allowed me to ride with his family as they fled west, to Zhu's Watch.\n\nIt was there that I met Mei Barrelbottom.\n\nShe told me of the Crane Wing order, and on her advice I accompanied a courier to the temple to seek an audience with Chi-Ji, the Red Crane.\n\nI was studying with the disciples there when the sha arrived."]="When the SI:7 found me, they wanted to take me home. I ran away.\n\nIt wasn't long before the Horde found me.\n\nDuring the battle at Serpent's Heart, I managed to slip away in the chaos. A merchant allowed me to ride with his family as they fled west, to Zhu's Watch.\n\nIt was there that I met Mei Barrelbottom.\n\nShe told me of the Crane Wing order, and on her advice I accompanied a courier to the temple to seek an audience with Chi-Ji, the Red Crane.\n\nI was studying with the disciples there when the sha arrived."
G["When the Sundering ripped apart the continents of Azeroth, we pandaren thought that the rest of the world had been utterly destroyed."]="Quando a Cisão rasgou os continentes de Azeroth, nós pandarens pensamos que o resto do mundo havia sido completamente destruído."
G["When the blaze subsided, a cloud serpent hatching could be seen flying around the center of the lake. Its scales sparked with storm and fire, and where it flew, great clouds formed in the sky. My people named it Alani, the Stormborn."]="When the blaze subsided, a cloud serpent hatching could be seen flying around the center of the lake. Its scales sparked with storm and fire, and where it flew, great clouds formed in the sky. My people named it Alani, the Stormborn."
G["When the cataclysm struck Azeroth, it disrupted the cloaking mechanism that kept this terrace hidden.  At that point, it was only a matter of time until the intelligent races discovered me here.\n\nThis was a scenario that, quite honestly, we did not foresee.  It required us to perform some new tests.  And you, $n, are my test subject."]="When the cataclysm struck Azeroth, it disrupted the cloaking mechanism that kept this terrace hidden.  At that point, it was only a matter of time until the intelligent races discovered me here.\n\nThis was a scenario that, quite honestly, we did not foresee.  It required us to perform some new tests.  And you, $n, are my test subject."
G["When the doctor returns, your pitiful Shadow Vault will be laid to waste."]="Quando o doutor fique, seu lamentable Câmera das Sombras quedará arrasada."
G["When the guards pay you a visit, I'm sure you'll have no problem explaining how you got your hands on those Uldum artifacts or that lovely painting."]="When the guards pay you a visit, I'm sure you'll have no problem explaining how you got your hands on those Uldum artifacts or that lovely painting."
G["When the land ails, the spirits are first to feel the ill tiding. When the spirits leave the temple and fall to their baser instincts, the wise Pandaren takes heed."]="When the land ails, the spirits are first to feel the ill tiding. When the spirits leave the temple and fall to their baser instincts, the wise Pandaren takes heed."
G["When the last emperor hid our land from the rest of the world, he also preserved the homeland of our ancient enemy, the mantid. Why did he do this?"]="When the last emperor hid our land from the rest of the world, he also preserved the homeland of our ancient enemy, the mantid. Why did he do this?"
G["When the little ones come, I won't hold back like I am with you."]="Quando venham os pequenos, não me contendré como o estou fazendo com você."
G["When the mind grows hungry for inspiration, feed it with beautiful things."]="When the mind grows hungry for inspiration, feed it with beautiful things."
G["When the positively aligned energies collide with the negatively charged energies, they don't negate one another."]="When the positively aligned energies collide with the negatively charged energies, they don't negate one another."
G["When the rep is talking to you, he will start each line with your name.  If you don't see your name, he's not yet speaking to you."]="Quando o representante estiver falando com você, começará cada linha com o seu nome. Se não vê seu nome, indica que não está falando com você."
G["When the river turns left or right, flow along it instead of fight."]="Se o rio gira a esquerda ou direita, fluye com ele, não te resistas."
G["When the sha attack began, every one of my students ran to battle without hesitation.\n\nI have taught them much, but yet they continue to surpass my expectations."]="When the sha attack began, every one of my students ran to battle without hesitation.\n\nI have taught them much, but yet they continue to surpass my expectations."
G["When the shaking stopped, his true motives were revealed. We were trapped, and he was slowly draining our powers."]="When the shaking stopped, his true motives were revealed. We were trapped, and he was slowly draining our powers."
G["When the silkworm makes its cocoon, we use this device to extract the silk."]="Quando o me ver de seda cria seu capulho, utilizamos este aparato para extrair a seda."
G["When the time is right, I'll use this staff to bring the walls of Orgrimmar crashing down around Garrosh Hellscream's head."]="When the time is right, I'll use this staff to bring the walls of Orgrimmar crashing down around Garrosh Hellscream's head."
G["When the time is right, my lady. All will be clear when the time is right. The master stirs even now. Look to the skies for the Brood of Nozdormu have returned."]="Ao seu devido tempo, meu senhora. Tudo se aclarará ao seu devido tempo. O mestre bulhe inclusive agora. Olhe aos céus pois o Linagem de Nozdormu voltou."
G["When the tournament starts, all will see the Forsaken emerge triumphant."]="Quando o torneio começar, todos verão os Renegados emergirem triunfantes."
G["When the trial begins, shadows from under you will periodically break free, traveling to a nearby portal to summon a Weeping Soul."]="When the trial begins, shadows from under you will periodically break free, traveling to a nearby portal to summon a Weeping Soul."
G["When the usurpers came - the ones you call \"Titans\" - Y'shaarj was destroyed."]="Quando chegaram os usurpadores, aqueles aos que chamas \"titãs\", destruyeron a E'shaarj."
G["When the weaker Kodo died, The Wolf approached and tried to eat it."]="When the weaker Kodo died, The Wolf approached and tried to eat it."
G["When the work of a blacksmith reaches your level of expert craftsmanship, I present them with a choice.\n\nWhile you are not required to make a choice, it is recommended that you do - after all, do you want to be a neophyte forever? It is the artisan armorsmiths and weaponsmiths that supply our armies, win our wars and garner acclaim!\n\nBe warned, $n. Once a choice is made and the tasks required completed - there is no going back. One can only walk down one path."]="When the work of a blacksmith reaches your level of expert craftsmanship, I present them with a choice.\n\nWhile you are not required to make a choice, it is recommended that you do - after all, do you want to be a neophyte forever? It is the artisan armorsmiths and weaponsmiths that supply our armies, win our wars and garner acclaim!\n\nBe warned, $n. Once a choice is made and the tasks required completed - there is no going back. One can only walk down one path."
G["When the wounded arrive, we will be putting them up in the Inn while we tend to their recovery. Please find us there when you return."]="Quando cheguem os feridos, os alojaremos na estalagem enquanto velamos pelo seu recuperação. Vê a vernos ali quando vuelvas, por favor."
G["When these creatures die, they explode... I know, kill them near Shai Hu!"]="When these creatures die, they explode... I know, kill them near Shai Hu!"
G["When these monsters came, the Shado-Pan got so serious... they kept saying, \"Sha\". What's that?"]="When these monsters came, the Shado-Pan got so serious... they kept saying, \"Sha\". What's that?"
G["When they are completed, you will hide these devices all over Orgrimmar."]="When they are completed, you will hide these devices all over Orgrimmar."
G["When they are completed, you will hide these devices all over Stormwind."]="When they are completed, you will hide these devices all over Stormwind."
G["When this is all over I'm gonna buy you a drink, $n."]="When this is all over I'm gonna buy you a drink, $n."
G["When this is all over, I'm taking a vacation."]="Quando tudo isto termine, me irei de vacações."
G["When this is over, you may want to brush up on your secrecy skills...."]="Quando isto acabe, talvez queira refrescar suas habilidades para fazer as coisas em segredo..."
G["When time permits, we must speak at length.  For we have much to discuss."]="Se o tempo o permite temos que falar com calma. Há muito que discutir."
G["When times are dark, it is best to turn on a light."]="Quando a escuridão prevalece, o melhor é encender uma luz."
G["When two great empires reunite, the world will crumble around them..."]="When two great empires reunite, the world will crumble around them..."
G["When using the mallet on the Divine Bell, the pandaren monks were able to create pure harmony."]="When using the mallet on the Divine Bell, the pandaren monks were able to create pure harmony."
G["When war came to Pandaria's shores, our hero was ready."]="Quando a guerra chegou à costa de Pandária, nosso herói estava pronto."
G["When was your last check up?"]="When was your last check up?"
G["When we face the Thunder King we will be prepared."]="Quando nos enfrentemos ao Rei do Trovão, estaremos preparados."
G["When we get back, I'm gonna kill Petrov!"]="Quando voltemos, vou matar a Petrov!"
G["When we have control of the expedition again, everything will be fine..."]="Quando retomemos o controle da expedição, tudo irá bem..."
G["When we heard call of the ravage, we darkened the very skies with our numbers."]="When we heard call of the ravage, we darkened the very skies with our numbers."
G["When we make it back to the Retreat, we can tap these and toast to life!"]="Quando voltemos ao Refúgio, podemos abrir estes e brindar pela vida."
G["When we move, we'll move fast. Be prepared to put to rest anything that gets in our way."]="Quando nos movamos, nos moveremos rápido. Preparem-se para acabar com qualquer coisa que se interponga em nosso caminho."
G["When we returned from Deepholm, we found that the Twilight's Hammer had established a base here and taken control of the elemental portals.\n\nPlease, $n, you must stop them before Cho'gall can complete whatever it is that he's up to inside the Bastion of Twilight!"]="When we returned from Deepholm, we found that the Twilight's Hammer had established a base here and taken control of the elemental portals.\n\nPlease, $n, you must stop them before Cho'gall can complete whatever it is that he's up to inside the Bastion of Twilight!"
G["When we saw that the ships had been burned by those savage beasts our hearts sank. Never have I felt so helpless..."]="Quando vimos que os navios haviam sido queimados por aqueles animais selvagens, nossos corações afundaram. Nunca me senti tão desamparado..."
G["When we spoke previously, you offered to repay the favor. I may have to act on that sooner than I would have liked."]="When we spoke previously, you offered to repay the favor. I may have to act on that sooner than I would have liked."
G["When we start tour?"]="Quando começar recorrido?"
G["When we use the hides of the animals we must fell for food or protection we give honor to the Earth Mother and respect to the animal.  Chaw Stronghide can teach you of such things.  You will find him in the great tent at the northwest corner of Bloodhoof Village."]="Quando usamos os couros dos animais, devemos nos apegar a comida ou proteção, honramos a Mãe Terra e respeitamos o animal. Chaw Stronghide pode ensiná-o a essas coisas. Você o encontrará na grande tenda no canto noroeste da Vila Casco Sangrento."
G["When we were ambushed by Rom'ogg he threw chains around Raz and then hit him with the |cff71d5ff|Hspell:75543|h[The Skullcracker]|h|r! Luckily I moved away before he landed that final blow!"]="When we were ambushed by Rom'ogg he threw chains around Raz and then hit him with the |cff71d5ff|Hspell:75543|h[The Skullcracker]|h|r! Luckily I moved away before he landed that final blow!"
G["When we were packed into the Town-In-A-Box, they told us we'd be deployed somewhere in Azshara. Is this Azshara?\n\nI ask you: who prepares a Town-In-A-Box and doesn't supply it with enough food to live on?! One measly Poultryizer?!\n\nWe all know how the \"Micro\" Mechachicken worked out."]="When we were packed into the Town-In-A-Box, they told us we'd be deployed somewhere in Azshara. Is this Azshara?\n\nI ask you: who prepares a Town-In-A-Box and doesn't supply it with enough food to live on?! One measly Poultryizer?!\n\nWe all know how the \"Micro\" Mechachicken worked out."
G["When we're done here, those Frostmanes will fear us more than the troggs. They'll have no choice but to leave."]="Quando terminarmos aqui, esses Frostmanes terão mais medo de nós do que os troggs. Eles não terão escolha a não ser partir."
G["When will someone do something about the undead?"]="When will someone do something about the undead?"
G["When will the tour start?"]="Quando empiezao recorrido?"
G["When will they learn?"]="When will they learn?"
G["When will they learn? When will they see that the Horde exists BECAUSE of the Alliance? Because of their prejudice and their bigotry!? They force us ever closer to Hellscream's Horde."]="Quando eles vão aprender? Quando vão ver que a Horda só existe por causa da Aliança? Por causa do preconceito e da intolerância dela!? Eles nos empurram cada vez mais para a Horda de Grito Infernal."
G["When will this city be done?  Everytime I think im done they tell me I need to work for one more day..."]="Quando se acabará esta cidade? Sempre que acho que e terminou, me dizem que há um dia mais de trabalho..."
G["When will this end?"]="Quando acabará?"
G["When will this tour start?"]="Quando começa este recorrido?"
G["When will we start this tour?"]="Quando empezamos com o recorrido?"
G["When you absolutely, positively must kill NOW, the heavy bomb is the way to go. Heavy bombs have a much larger radius and cause much more damage. The downside is that you can carry far fewer heavy bombs than you can light bombs and you must wait longer between uses."]="When you absolutely, positively must kill NOW, the heavy bomb is the way to go. Heavy bombs have a much larger radius and cause much more damage. The downside is that you can carry far fewer heavy bombs than you can light bombs and you must wait longer between uses."
G["When you and Haohan have a friendship like yours, there's no doubt the head of the Tillers Union himself would drop by to lend a hand."]="When you and Haohan have a friendship like yours, there's no doubt the head of the Tillers Union himself would drop by to lend a hand."
G["When you are a genius, you have to put up with a lot of strange actions."]="Quando é genio, precisa aguantar um monte de coisas estranhas."
G["When you are at the Brewfest grounds, have a drink for me, $c!"]="Quando vá à Festa da Cerveja, bébete uma a minha vida, $c!"
G["When you are dying, beast, remember that I gave you a choice."]="Quando agonices, fera, lembre-se que te di a escolher."
G["When you are finished with your duties, report to Ban Bearheart. I am leaving him in command for the duration of the mission here."]="When you are finished with your duties, report to Ban Bearheart. I am leaving him in command for the duration of the mission here."
G["When you are on your own, your enemies will not be as kind as I."]="Quando estiver $gsolo: sozinha;, os inimigos não serão tão considera como eu."
G["When you are ready I will place you atop my head and we will march into the heart of the Scourge in Zul'Drak. You must direct me to smash and destroy our enemies!"]="Quando estiver pronto, colocarei você no topo da minha cabeça e marcharemos para o coração do Flagelo em Zul'Drak. Você deve me instruir a esmagar e destruir nossos inimigos!"
G["When you are ready to fly to Durnholde, let me know and I shall take you."]="When you are ready to fly to Durnholde, let me know and I shall take you."
G["When you are ready to seek a new specialization, seek Narain Soothfancy.   He can be found in Steamwheedle Port in Tanaris."]="When you are ready to seek a new specialization, seek Narain Soothfancy.   He can be found in Steamwheedle Port in Tanaris."
G["When you are ready to test for the rank of valiant, I will call forth a member of the Argent Crusade."]="Quando você estiver pronto para testar a posição de valente, chamarei um membro da Cruzada Argêntea."
G["When you are ready, touch the altar to begin."]="When you are ready, touch the altar to begin."
G["When you chose this path, you bound your life to that of your serpent. Do not fail them now!"]="When you chose this path, you bound your life to that of your serpent. Do not fail them now!"
G["When you found the sword, it was broken and abandoned, much like Silvermoon after Kael'thas's betrayal."]="Quando encontraste a lâmina, estava rota e abandonadas, como Luaprata atrás a traição de Kael'thas."
G["When you get a chance do you think you could let me out of here?"]="When you get a chance do you think you could let me out of here?"
G["When you get a ram, you also get the reins. These aren't your grandma's reins though, you've gotta use them!\n\nJust loosen up on the reins a few times to build up some speed.  Keep on loosening up and GIDDYUP!  You'll be flying!\n\nBut the faster he goes the quicker he'll get tired. So you have to be careful."]="When you get a ram, you also get the reins. These aren't your grandma's reins though, you've gotta use them!\n\nJust loosen up on the reins a few times to build up some speed.  Keep on loosening up and GIDDYUP!  You'll be flying!\n\nBut the faster he goes the quicker he'll get tired. So you have to be careful."
G["When you get hurt bad, remember rest and get strong again. Dajik show you how right now..."]="When you get hurt bad, remember rest and get strong again. Dajik show you how right now..."
G["When you get me out of this cage, we're going to make them wish they were never awakened!"]="Quando me saques desta jaula, vamos fazer que deseen não haver despertado nunca!"
G["When you give love tokens to townsfolk, you'll receive different gifts in return.  Some of those you'll want to keep and use, but others can be bundled together and given to your favorite hero!  Visit Kwee Q. Peddlefeet to turn them in.\n\nKwee can be found near Bolvar, Magni, or Tyrande."]="When you give love tokens to townsfolk, you'll receive different gifts in return.  Some of those you'll want to keep and use, but others can be bundled together and given to your favorite hero!  Visit Kwee Q. Peddlefeet to turn them in.\n\nKwee can be found near Bolvar, Magni, or Tyrande."
G["When you give love tokens to townsfolk, you'll receive different gifts in return.  Some of those you'll want to keep and use, but others can be bundled together and given to your favorite hero!  Visit Kwee Q. Peddlefeet to turn them in.\n\nKwee can be found near Cairne, Sylvanas and Thrall."]="When you give love tokens to townsfolk, you'll receive different gifts in return.  Some of those you'll want to keep and use, but others can be bundled together and given to your favorite hero!  Visit Kwee Q. Peddlefeet to turn them in.\n\nKwee can be found near Cairne, Sylvanas and Thrall."
G["When you go into combat, it is important that you know how to intimidate the enemy with a deafening battle roar!"]="When you go into combat, it is important that you know how to intimidate the enemy with a deafening battle roar!"
G["When you have lived as long as I, it becomes easy to forget about love for years. It is always good to be reminded."]="Quando você vive tanto quanto eu, fica fácil esquecer o amor por anos. É sempre bom ser lembrado."
G["When you have not a healer to tend to your wounds, the knowledge of First Aid can be a lifesaver.  I would consult Dannelor over at the Craftsmen's Terrace for instruction on this skill."]="Quando você não tem um curador para cuidar das suas feridas, o conhecimento de Primeiros Socorros pode ser um salva-vidas. Eu consultava Dannelor no terraço dos artesãos para obter instruções sobre essa habilidade."
G["When you kill the Pit Master, spit on his corpse for me, will you?"]="Quando mate ao mestre do fosso, escupe sobre seu cadáver, vale?"
G["When you next go to the Molten Core, kill a Firelord for me, will you?"]="Quando você for ao Molten Core, mate um Senhor do Fogo por mim, si?"
G["When you run with Razak's Roughriders, you learn a thing or two about following orders.\n\nThe first thing is that you fight until you die.  The second thing is, see the first thing."]="Quando corras com os Cavaleiros Férreos de Razak, aprenderá um par de coisas sobre seguir ordens.\n\nO primeiro é que luchas até a morte. O segundo é ver o primeiro."
G["When you say Stormstout, you've said it all."]="Se te digo \"Cerveja de Trovão\", basta saber mais."
G["When you stand at the Altar of Damnation and see the spirits of the damned, kneeling in prayer, what you do not see is me, standing next to Gul'dan.\n\n<Oronok nods.>\n\nI told you that I was a lot of things, did I not? One of those 'things' was a lieutenant of Gul'dan.\n\nI have done many terrible things in my life. I have slaughtered man, woman, and child alike. Danced in the blood of innocent draenei... yet...\n\n<Oronok chokes on his words.>"]="When you stand at the Altar of Damnation and see the spirits of the damned, kneeling in prayer, what you do not see is me, standing next to Gul'dan.\n\n<Oronok nods.>\n\nI told you that I was a lot of things, did I not? One of those 'things' was a lieutenant of Gul'dan.\n\nI have done many terrible things in my life. I have slaughtered man, woman, and child alike. Danced in the blood of innocent draenei... yet...\n\n<Oronok chokes on his words.>"
G["When you stay at an inn, you rest very comfortably.  Because of this, you will become \"well rested\" much more quickly than you would in the wilderness.  When you are well rested, you learn more from experience.\n\nYou may also speak with any innkeeper to get a hearthstone, and can later use the hearthstone in order to quickly return to that inn."]="When you stay at an inn, you rest very comfortably.  Because of this, you will become \"well rested\" much more quickly than you would in the wilderness.  When you are well rested, you learn more from experience.\n\nYou may also speak with any innkeeper to get a hearthstone, and can later use the hearthstone in order to quickly return to that inn."
G["When you take one of these tasks, we'll lend you a ram. It's a loan, so it won't last forever. The ram may seem slow, but just ease up on the reins a bit and he'll pick up the pace.\n\nOur rams love apples. We've put a few bushels of apples out along the way, so make sure to stop by. Eating apples will make your ram forget about how tired he's been getting."]="When you take one of these tasks, we'll lend you a ram. It's a loan, so it won't last forever. The ram may seem slow, but just ease up on the reins a bit and he'll pick up the pace.\n\nOur rams love apples. We've put a few bushels of apples out along the way, so make sure to stop by. Eating apples will make your ram forget about how tired he's been getting."
G["When you're doggone tired, it's mighty easy to slip up on the job, pardner! Be sure to get at least two hours' rest between shifts!"]="When you're doggone tired, it's mighty easy to slip up on the job, pardner! Be sure to get at least two hours' rest between shifts!"
G["When you're done visiting this exotic city, perhaps you would be interested in celebrating with us. The Lunar Festival is underway in Moonglade; the other cities have transport to the festivities. Come and join the other revelers!"]="Quando você terminar de visitar esta cidade exótica, talvez esteja interessado em comemorar conosco. O Festival Lunar está em andamento em Moonglade; as outras cidades têm transporte para as festividades. Venha se juntar aos outros foliões!"
G["When you're off duty, let's go to the inn. I'll buy a round and we can reminisce about the good old days."]="When you're off duty, let's go to the inn. I'll buy a round and we can reminisce about the good old days."
G["When's the last time you cleaned that weapon, Holmberg?"]="When's the last time you cleaned that weapon, Holmberg?"
G["Whenever you get the GUTS to come back here, you better be ready.  'Cause Jin'do's got a surprise for you..."]="Quando consigas reunir o CORAGEM pa' voltar aqui, será melhor que te prepares. Porque Jin'do tem uma sorpresita pa' ti..."
G["Whenever you need me, I'll be here."]="Estarei além onde me necesites."
