G["Where corruption creeps, we will answer with vigilance, patience, and Elune’s light. The roots remember us, and they will heal."]="Where corruption creeps, we will answer with vigilance, patience, and Elune’s light. The roots remember us, and they will heal."
G["Where could she possibly be? I sent my apprentice, Shatharia, to the Underlight Mines to the west quite some time ago. We need those ore samples back, and fast or our experiment is going to fail!"]="Onde ela poderia estar? Enviei meu aprendiz, Shatharia, para as Minas Underlight, a oeste, há algum tempo. Precisamos dessas amostras de minério de volta, e rápido, ou nosso experimento falhará!"
G["Where dere be zombies, dere be Zanzil.  Da Zandalar trolls be makin' da Gurubashi work all of dere mojo to take back Stranglethorn."]="Where dere be zombies, dere be Zanzil.  Da Zandalar trolls be makin' da Gurubashi work all of dere mojo to take back Stranglethorn."
