G["Whew! That was some hard work, $r. I haven't seen the Scourge this aggressive since...\n\n<Guard Didier swallows hard.>\n\nSince the last war..."]="Whew! That was some hard work, $r. I haven't seen the Scourge this aggressive since...\n\n<Guard Didier swallows hard.>\n\nSince the last war..."
G["Whew! What's that smell?"]="Uau! Que cheiro é esse?"
G["Whew, thanks! I'm going to check and see if these results are repeatable."]="Whew, thanks! I'm going to check and see if these results are repeatable."
G["Whew, that was a bit of a tight squeeze, but the rest of the trip should be a breeze."]="Bom, isso tem estado perto, mas o resto do viagem deveria ser coser e cantar."
G["Whew, time to take a break!"]="Whew, time to take a break!"
G["Whew, what a mess! Someone inform the monastery kitchens: We're having turtle soup, tonight!"]="Whew, what a mess! Someone inform the monastery kitchens: We're having turtle soup, tonight!"
G["Whew... I need a smoke and the touch of a fine gnomish woman - not particularly in that order!\n\nI've been stuck inside the belly of that thing for months! What day is it anyway? Ah, nevermind. All that matters is that I'm finally out.\n\nWOOO HOOO!"]="Whew... I need a smoke and the touch of a fine gnomish woman - not particularly in that order!\n\nI've been stuck inside the belly of that thing for months! What day is it anyway? Ah, nevermind. All that matters is that I'm finally out.\n\nWOOO HOOO!"
