G["While Cyndra is not bubbly like her potions, her kind manner is suitable for teaching her trade.  You can find her just east of the Inn in Dolanaar."]="Enquanto Cyndra não é borbulhante como suas poções, sua maneira gentil é adequada para ensinar seu ofício. Você pode encontrá-à leste da pousada em Dolanaar."
G["While Greta focuses her energy on the recovery of Jaedenar and those who she thinks is mostly responsible for the corruption here in Felwood. I spend my time looking into the effects the corruption has had on the land.\n\nHow has it affected the creatures of the land? What must be done to end the pain of their suffering?\n\nUnfortunately, the corruption runs so deep that eternal sleep is too often the answer."]="While Greta focuses her energy on the recovery of Jaedenar and those who she thinks is mostly responsible for the corruption here in Felwood. I spend my time looking into the effects the corruption has had on the land.\n\nHow has it affected the creatures of the land? What must be done to end the pain of their suffering?\n\nUnfortunately, the corruption runs so deep that eternal sleep is too often the answer."
G["While I already feel better, I am not yet ready for combat. I will need you to escort me."]="While I already feel better, I am not yet ready for combat. I will need you to escort me."
G["While I am buried in research, it will be up to you to teach the Lasher the ways of the world."]="Enquanto estou enterrado em pesquisas, você deve ensinar ao Lasher os caminhos do mundo."
G["While I have them distracted you get the plans from the guard's corpse. I will call Kasha to pick you up as soon as I see you get the plans."]="While I have them distracted you get the plans from the guard's corpse. I will call Kasha to pick you up as soon as I see you get the plans."
G["While I live to serve the Earth Mother and the Horde, I cannot help but feel a little nervous now that we've collected everything that we need. At least we have a little time until the Alliance finishes their gathering efforts. After that it will all be shipped to Cenarion Hold in Silithus, and the war will likely follow not long after."]="Vivo para servir à Mãe Terra e à Horda mas não posso esta me sentir inquieta agora que já temos reuniu tudo o que precisamos de. Ao menos temos com algo de tempo até que a Aliança acabe com a sua parte. Atrás isso enviaremos tudo ao Forte Cenariano em Silithus e a guerra não tardará muito em começar."
G["While I miss Gilneas greatly, there's ancient ruins to explore!"]="Enquanto sinto muita falta de Gilneas, há ruínas antigas para explorar!"
G["While I was trapped in that web, I had such feelings of doubt and despair. You have freed me from my own fears."]="While I was trapped in that web, I had such feelings of doubt and despair. You have freed me from my own fears."
G["While I would love to purify all of my corrupted bretheren, I cannot allow those of us who have not fallen to corruption to go leaderless.\nWe must stop the spread of this vile influence, and then I will lead those of us who remain pure to freedom."]="While I would love to purify all of my corrupted bretheren, I cannot allow those of us who have not fallen to corruption to go leaderless.\nWe must stop the spread of this vile influence, and then I will lead those of us who remain pure to freedom."
G["While Nesingwary's advances upon the wildlife of Northrend has been halted, it is only a matter of time before he attempts another incursion. You must remain vigilant, $n!\n\nAbove all else, do not give in to whatever temptations may be set before you... The demon will attempt to charm you. When it happens, you must resist!"]="While Nesingwary's advances upon the wildlife of Northrend has been halted, it is only a matter of time before he attempts another incursion. You must remain vigilant, $n!\n\nAbove all else, do not give in to whatever temptations may be set before you... The demon will attempt to charm you. When it happens, you must resist!"
G["While Theramore is reknown for it's exceptional training of warriors, I am afraid that I can not help you."]="Embora Theramore seja conhecido pelo seu treinamento excepcional de guerreiros, tenho medo de não poder ajudá-o."
G["While Varimathras is, uh... away, I've been assigned to assist Captain Bragor in his duties."]="Enquanto Varimathras está, uh... ausente, fui designado para ajudar o Capitão Bragor nas suas tarefas."
G["While camouflaged, we are harder to detect when we are BEHIND creatures."]="While camouflaged, we are harder to detect when we are BEHIND creatures."
G["While exploration in these new lands is no doubt important, you mustn't forsake Azeroth! We need you now more than ever in the fight against the Defilers. Those resources must be secured!"]="Embora a exploração nessas novas terras seja sem dúvida importante, você não deve abandonar Azeroth! Precisamos de você agora mais do que nunca na luta contra os Profanadores. Esses recursos devem ser protegidos!"
G["While it is clearly quite old, this statue does not appear to have crumbled at all over the centuries."]="Embora seja claramente bastante antiga, esta estátua não parece ter desmoronado ao longo dos séculos."
G["While it is true that the Alliance has completed all of their war effort tasks, don't let that discourage you, $r. Time is of the essence, but we would much rather that you help in the Horde's collections carefully and thoroughly. That seems better to me than making a mistake that could cost someone their life once this war truly begins. Wouldn't you agree, $c?"]="While it is true that the Alliance has completed all of their war effort tasks, don't let that discourage you, $r. Time is of the essence, but we would much rather that you help in the Horde's collections carefully and thoroughly. That seems better to me than making a mistake that could cost someone their life once this war truly begins. Wouldn't you agree, $c?"
G["While my brother, Drazial, focuses his analysis on the more physical nature of the beasts of the blasted lands, I tend to focus on the more cerebral and spiritual aspects of the wildlife.\n\nIt is true that the beasts exhibit extremely unusual strength, agility, and stamina, but some of them also possess great intelligence and regenerative abilities, untied to their physical being.\n\nPerhaps you would be interested in helping advance my research, $r?"]="While my brother, Drazial, focuses his analysis on the more physical nature of the beasts of the blasted lands, I tend to focus on the more cerebral and spiritual aspects of the wildlife.\n\nIt is true that the beasts exhibit extremely unusual strength, agility, and stamina, but some of them also possess great intelligence and regenerative abilities, untied to their physical being.\n\nPerhaps you would be interested in helping advance my research, $r?"
G["While my comrades held the line against the encroaching darkness, I used my magic to reach out into the Great Dark Beyond.  There, I sensed beings of immense Light - of unfathomable purity.\n\nIt was A'dal and his naaru I had found. It was nothing short of a... miracle."]="While my comrades held the line against the encroaching darkness, I used my magic to reach out into the Great Dark Beyond.  There, I sensed beings of immense Light - of unfathomable purity.\n\nIt was A'dal and his naaru I had found. It was nothing short of a... miracle."
G["While not the most powerful combatants, a pack of felhounds still has many uses."]="Embora não sejam os combatentes mais poderosos, uma matilha de canisvis ainda pode ser útil."
G["While nothing can change the past, time can heal all wounds. Thank you for showing me that it is possible, $n. I wish you well."]="While nothing can change the past, time can heal all wounds. Thank you for showing me that it is possible, $n. I wish you well."
G["While one player is zapping a saurok, another can instantly destroy it."]="While one player is zapping a saurok, another can instantly destroy it."
G["While our end is inevitable, let us try to take as many of them down with us as we can. Be ready."]="Bom, nossa derrota é inevitável, então vamos tentar levar o máximo deles conosco. Prepare-se!"
G["While our goals call for the eradication of the mogu, we can't ignore our flanks.\n\nWhile both the Alliance and the saurok attack the mogu alongside us, either could turn on us at any moment."]="Nosso objetivo é erradicar aos mogu, mas não podemos ignorar nossos flancos.\n\nEmbora tanto a Aliança como os saurok atacando aos mogu a nosso lado, se poderiam voltar contra nós em qualquer momentos."
G["While our goals call for the eradication of the mogu, we can't ignore our flanks.\n\nWhile both the Horde and the saurok attack the mogu alongside us, either could turn on us at any moment."]="While our goals call for the eradication of the mogu, we can't ignore our flanks.\n\nWhile both the Horde and the saurok attack the mogu alongside us, either could turn on us at any moment."
G["While studying the land, I discovered a cave that stretched deep beneath the earth. These waterways carried underground rivers for miles beneath the parched savannah above. I named them the Wailing Caverns, for the howls made by the wind and steam as they coursed through its depths.\n\nThis would be the instrument of revival, I thought. The water had already bubbled to the surface as small, lush oases throughout the Barrens...if it were imbued, enhanced, this growth could spread across the entire land."]="While studying the land, I discovered a cave that stretched deep beneath the earth. These waterways carried underground rivers for miles beneath the parched savannah above. I named them the Wailing Caverns, for the howls made by the wind and steam as they coursed through its depths.\n\nThis would be the instrument of revival, I thought. The water had already bubbled to the surface as small, lush oases throughout the Barrens...if it were imbued, enhanced, this growth could spread across the entire land."
G["While the Forsaken deal with curing the plague from both sides of the Horde and Alliance, we have pledged ourselves to deal with the Scourge necropoli that lay siege to our cities.\n\nBy using concentrated Light energy, we can strike back at the Lich King's structures and, with luck, destroy them."]="While the Forsaken deal with curing the plague from both sides of the Horde and Alliance, we have pledged ourselves to deal with the Scourge necropoli that lay siege to our cities.\n\nBy using concentrated Light energy, we can strike back at the Lich King's structures and, with luck, destroy them."
G["While the details remain shrouded from our view, one thing we have gleaned..."]="While the details remain shrouded from our view, one thing we have gleaned..."
G["While the elements are doing their best to tear Darkshore asunder, I've been struggling to protect the remaining wildlife.\n\nCan I count on your help, $c?"]="While the elements are doing their best to tear Darkshore asunder, I've been struggling to protect the remaining wildlife.\n\nCan I count on your help, $c?"
G["While the enemies are focused on me, my allies can sneak up from behind!"]="While the enemies are focused on me, my allies can sneak up from behind!"
