G["While the house of my mad father collapses around him, the few remaining Black Dragons have gone into hiding."]="While the house of my mad father collapses around him, the few remaining Black Dragons have gone into hiding."
G["While the hozen pillage our supplies and kill our warriors, what does he do? Nothing!"]="While the hozen pillage our supplies and kill our warriors, what does he do? Nothing!"
G["While the loss of this vehicle is a setback, we must persist. We must succeed!"]="While the loss of this vehicle is a setback, we must persist. We must succeed!"
G["While the soldiers of our army put their steel to our enemies, the actual efficacy of such attacks is questionable - a diversion at best. It is through the arcane that our enemies will crumble and fall before us."]="While the soldiers of our army put their steel to our enemies, the actual efficacy of such attacks is questionable - a diversion at best. It is through the arcane that our enemies will crumble and fall before us."
G["While there's no Engineering Trainer in Brill, there is one down in the Undercity.  To get there head to the back of the Ruins of Lordaeron to the south of town and take the elevator down.  Once you get there ask an Undercity Guardian for more specific directions."]="Embora não haja um instrutor de engenharia em Brill, há um na parte inferior da cidade. Para chegar lá, continue para a parte de por trás das ruínas de Lordaeron, ao sul da cidade e desça o elevador. Quando chegar lá, peça a um Guardião da Cidade para instruções mais específicas."
G["While there, a wise old war hero told me something that I would carry with me forever..."]="Enquanto estava ali, um sábio e velho herói de guerra disse para mim algo que nunca esquecerei..."
G["While this is certainly a grave marker, it is unclear who is buried here."]="Embora este seja certamente um marcador grave, não está claro quem está enterrado aqui."
G["While visitors complain about the exceptionally humid air, I find it helps my complexion! Dry skin is unflattering."]="While visitors complain about the exceptionally humid air, I find it helps my complexion! Dry skin is unflattering."
G["While we have much to teach the other races of the Alliance, we have as much to learn from them.  Keep your eyes, ears and mind open, $c."]="While we have much to teach the other races of the Alliance, we have as much to learn from them.  Keep your eyes, ears and mind open, $c."
G["While we have no Alchemy Trainer here in Bloodhoof Village, there is one in Thunder Bluff to the north.  Follow the road there and ask one of the Bluffwatchers for directions when you get to the top."]="Embora não tenhamos Treinador de Alquimia aqui na Vila Casco Sangrento, há um em Thunder Bluff ao norte. Continue a estrada até lá e peça instruções a um dos Bluffwatchers quando chegar ao topo."
G["While we mourn the fallen, many more would be lost if not for your efforts. Please accept this gift of gratitude from the Alliance."]="While we mourn the fallen, many more would be lost if not for your efforts. Please accept this gift of gratitude from the Alliance."
