G["Why, thank you. I do pride myself on knowing when a little bit of grease beats spending hours of sorcerous study for the same effect."]="Why, thank you. I do pride myself on knowing when a little bit of grease beats spending hours of sorcerous study for the same effect."
G["Why, the refurbished shredder key, silly!\n\nIf you haven't already gotten one today you can talk to my brother, Synipus."]="Why, the refurbished shredder key, silly!\n\nIf you haven't already gotten one today you can talk to my brother, Synipus."
G["Why, up the river of course!\n\nHaha! Up the river... Okay, okay, you can find him working on shredders up at Blue Sky Logging Ground.\n\nOh, and you can tell him that if he sends me any more half-finished shredders he WILL be up a river!"]="Why, up the river of course!\n\nHaha! Up the river... Okay, okay, you can find him working on shredders up at Blue Sky Logging Ground.\n\nOh, and you can tell him that if he sends me any more half-finished shredders he WILL be up a river!"
