G["With the Earth Mother's blessing, we shall begin."]="Com a benção da Mãe Terra, começaremos."
G["With the Emperors slain, the magical protection blocking teleportation within the temple has been greatly weakened. If you desire, I am able to translocate you to the Emperors' lair."]="Com os Imperadores mortos, a proteção mágica bloqueando o teletransporte dentro do templo foi bastante enfraquecida. Se desejar, posso translocá-o para o covil dos imperadores."
G["With the Lich King fleeing in fear of Fordring armed with the Ashbringer, we were able to easily wrest Ebon Hold from the remaining Scourge forces.\n\nThat didn't settle things between us and the Scarlet Crusade, however.\n\nAs the Forsaken have learned the hard way, the Scarlets cannot seem to differentiate between us and the Scourge.\n\nWe think on our own, we have our own motivations, we have almost all of the qualities of the living, and yet to them, we are no different than the mindless slaves of the Lich King.\n\nMistakenly they think we will roll over and play dead."]="With the Lich King fleeing in fear of Fordring armed with the Ashbringer, we were able to easily wrest Ebon Hold from the remaining Scourge forces.\n\nThat didn't settle things between us and the Scarlet Crusade, however.\n\nAs the Forsaken have learned the hard way, the Scarlets cannot seem to differentiate between us and the Scourge.\n\nWe think on our own, we have our own motivations, we have almost all of the qualities of the living, and yet to them, we are no different than the mindless slaves of the Lich King.\n\nMistakenly they think we will roll over and play dead."
G["With the Lich King on the offensive, the Horde must respond in kind!  To Northrend!"]="Com o Rei Lich à ofensiva, a Horda deve responder da mesma forma! A Nortúndria!"
G["With the Light's blessing and your help, $n, the Defias are no longer a threat.\n\nBut we're a long way from Westfall up here, and if we don't win this battle, there may not be a home to return to."]="Com a bênção da Luz e sua ajuda, $n, os Défias deixaram de ser uma ameaça.\n\nMas agora estamos muito longe dos Cerro Oeste e se não vencermos esta batalha, talvez não tengamos um lar ao que voltar."
G["With the Riders behind me, and my serpent beside me."]="Com o apoio dos cavaleiros e ao lado a meu dragão."
G["With the Sha of Doubt defeated you are ready to read the scroll."]="Atrás haver derrotou ao Sha da dúvida, está $gpronto: pronta; para ler o pergaminho."
G["With the Warsong Offensive here in Icecrown Citadel, victory is within our grasp! The death of the Lich King will bring glory to the Horde!"]="Com a Ofensiva do Brado de Guerra aqui na Cidadela da Coroa de Gelo, a vitória está ao nosso alcance! A morte do Rei Lich trará glória à Horda!"
G["With the aid of the val'kyr, we are now able to take the corpses of the fallen and create new Forsaken."]="Com a ajuda das Val'kyr, agora podemos pegar os cadáveres dos caídos e criar novos Renegados."
G["With the approaching darkness comes the end of the Scarlet Crusade. You will battle once more! For the Scourge! For the Lich King!"]="With the approaching darkness comes the end of the Scarlet Crusade. You will battle once more! For the Scourge! For the Lich King!"
G["With the attention of the Lich King drawn towards the front gate, we will be working our way through the side in search of information that will enable us to defeat the Scourge once and for all."]="With the attention of the Lich King drawn towards the front gate, we will be working our way through the side in search of information that will enable us to defeat the Scourge once and for all."
G["With the attention of the Lich King turned towards the front gate, we'll be working our way through the side in search of information that will enable us to defeat him - once and for all."]="With the attention of the Lich King turned towards the front gate, we'll be working our way through the side in search of information that will enable us to defeat him - once and for all."
G["With the benefit of my improved cognitive capacity, I am able to turn fresh eyes upon the rest of my race. A majority of our energies were spent in the hunt of fresh prey. Why, I wonder, did we not invest that time developing a store of domesticated creatures from which to draw our food supply?\n\nI am naturally inclined to think that humans would make excellent foodstock. They breed quickly, fatten up nicely, and can be trained to do menial chores for the herd until harvest time. Hmmm."]="With the benefit of my improved cognitive capacity, I am able to turn fresh eyes upon the rest of my race. A majority of our energies were spent in the hunt of fresh prey. Why, I wonder, did we not invest that time developing a store of domesticated creatures from which to draw our food supply?\n\nI am naturally inclined to think that humans would make excellent foodstock. They breed quickly, fatten up nicely, and can be trained to do menial chores for the herd until harvest time. Hmmm."
G["With the bulk of Undercity's forces deployed to Vengeance Landing in Northrend, the Warchief has sent us to reinforce the city's defenses."]="Com a maior parte das forças da Cidade Baixa implantadas em Vengeance Landing em Northrend, o Warchief nos enviou para reforçar as defesas da cidade."
G["With the bulk of our forces focused on Illidan, the task of cleansing these lands falls to you."]="Com o grosso de nossas tropas concentradas em Illidan, a tarefa de limpar estas terras cai sobre vocês."
G["With the cauldrons breeched, we are now able to introduce the counter agent into the environment.  This should give the scourge a taste of their own medicine, as it were!\n\nCheck with Alchemist Arbington on information regarding the reagents needed to use in the cauldrons.  I will be handling all information reports on how we are doing overall in turning the plague against the Scourge!"]="With the cauldrons breeched, we are now able to introduce the counter agent into the environment.  This should give the scourge a taste of their own medicine, as it were!\n\nCheck with Alchemist Arbington on information regarding the reagents needed to use in the cauldrons.  I will be handling all information reports on how we are doing overall in turning the plague against the Scourge!"
G["With the cauldrons breeched, we are now able to introduce the counter agent into the environment.  This should give the scourge a taste of their own medicine, as it were!\n\nCheck with Apothecary Dithers on information regarding the reagents needed to use in the cauldrons.  I will be handling all information reports on how we are doing overall in turning the plague against the Scourge!"]="With the cauldrons breeched, we are now able to introduce the counter agent into the environment.  This should give the scourge a taste of their own medicine, as it were!\n\nCheck with Apothecary Dithers on information regarding the reagents needed to use in the cauldrons.  I will be handling all information reports on how we are doing overall in turning the plague against the Scourge!"
G["With the death of the Lich King, all I have left is my duty.  There is no family, there are no friends... there is only this.\n\nWar."]="With the death of the Lich King, all I have left is my duty.  There is no family, there are no friends... there is only this.\n\nWar."
G["With the death of the Lich King, many of the more intelligent Scourge became... unemployed. Those 'fiends,' as you so delicately put it, are called val'kyr. They are under my command now..."]="Atrás a morte do Rei Lich, muitos dos membros mais inteligentes do Flagelo se ficaram... sem trabalho. Estes \"monstros\", como os tem chamado com tanta delicadeza, são as Val'kyr. Agora estão baixo meu controle..."
G["With the destruction of Stormwind's park - and most of the night elves within, the poor, unlucky souls - your best bet would be to seek out old Celestine just outside the Dwarven District.\n\nThere are stairs leading down from the Northern Landing... you can see her cottage from there."]="With the destruction of Stormwind's park - and most of the night elves within, the poor, unlucky souls - your best bet would be to seek out old Celestine just outside the Dwarven District.\n\nThere are stairs leading down from the Northern Landing... you can see her cottage from there."
G["With the garments that Me'Lynn tailors, one might think that her needle was blessed by Elune herself.  Unless your needle is so blessed, you best pay her a visit and listen to her teachings.  You can find her in The Craftsmen's Terrace in northeastern Darnassus."]="Com as roupas que Me'Lynn costura, pode-se pensar que sua agulha foi abençoada por Elune. A menos que sua agulha seja tão abençoada, é melhor fazer uma visita e ouvir seus ensinamentos. Você pode encontrá-a no The Craftsmen's Terrace, no nordeste de Darnassus."
G["With the help of Engineer Lapforge from Gadgetzan i have built a powerful gnomish transporter here at Toshley's Station!  I would be happy to help any gnomish engineer with enough skill to build their own personal transport beacon."]="Com a ajuda do Engineer Lapforge da Gadgetzan, construí um poderoso transportador gnômico aqui na Toshley's Station! Ficaria feliz em ajudar qualquer engenheiro gnômico com habilidade suficiente para construir seu próprio farol de transporte pessoal."
G["With the help of its allies the %s regenerates back to life."]="Com a ajuda dos seus aliados, o %s se regenera e revive."
G["With the help of my brother Zap in Everlook I have constructed a Dimensional Imploder right here in Area 52.   Who needs a rocket when you have instant transportation via Goblin Engineering!   Are you a skilled enough Goblin Engineer to learn how to build your own Imploder beacon?"]="With the help of my brother Zap in Everlook I have constructed a Dimensional Imploder right here in Area 52.   Who needs a rocket when you have instant transportation via Goblin Engineering!   Are you a skilled enough Goblin Engineer to learn how to build your own Imploder beacon?"
G["With the help of our new taunka allies, the Northrend will belong to the Horde."]="Com a ajuda de nossos novos aliados taunka, a Northrend pertencerá à Horda."
G["With the help of the Burning Blade, demons shall rule all of Azeroth!"]="With the help of the Burning Blade, demons shall rule all of Azeroth!"
G["With the help of the Shado-Pan and this beast you recovered, I believe we can infiltrate and disable the Thunder King's armory."]="With the help of the Shado-Pan and this beast you recovered, I believe we can infiltrate and disable the Thunder King's armory."
G["With the intelligence you've provided on the enemy and their tactics we've gained a significant edge in the field."]="Com a informações que nos tem proporcionado sobre o inimigo e seus táticas, teremos uma grande vantagem no campo."
G["With the loss of my power, the Dragon Soul has returned to its original place in time."]="Com a perda do meu poder, a Alma do Dragão retornou ao seu lugar original no tempo."
G["With the orb returned, the search for answers begins!"]="Agora que temos recuperei o orbe, começa a procurando de respostas!"
G["With the pillar restored, dis realm is safe.  We must now attend to the wound on the surface."]="With the pillar restored, dis realm is safe.  We must now attend to the wound on the surface."
G["With the pool pony, I can make it back."]="With the pool pony, I can make it back."
G["With the power of the horn, I bind you to its wielder's will!"]="With the power of the horn, I bind you to its wielder's will!"
G["With the power of the wild gods burning in our veins, none, not even the Lich King, can stand in our way!"]="With the power of the wild gods burning in our veins, none, not even the Lich King, can stand in our way!"
G["With the power within the amulets of Razelikh..."]="Com o poder de estes amuletos de Razelikh..."
G["With the precise angle and velocity..."]="Com a velocidade e o ângulo preciso..."
G["With the price they're getting on this operation, I'm hoping for a nice hefty profit sharing check. They better not shortchange us again."]="Com o que vão a tirar com esta operação espero receber um bom cheque quando toque o reparto de benefícios. Espero que nos timen novamente."
G["With the proper technology, you can fix anything, $n. Of course there are always malfunctions, short circuits, and uncooperative patients to keep things interesting."]="With the proper technology, you can fix anything, $n. Of course there are always malfunctions, short circuits, and uncooperative patients to keep things interesting."
G["With the right training, the jinyu will make a strong addition to our land force."]="With the right training, the jinyu will make a strong addition to our land force."
G["With the sanction of Lady Sylvanas, the Deathstalkers' numbers grow. More blades to strike at our enemies when they least expect it."]="Com a sanção de Lady Sylvanas, o número dos Caçadores de Morte aumenta. Mais lâminas para atacar nossos inimigos quando menos esperam."
G["With the sudden arrival of strangers on Pandaria, I believe we'll need the lessons our history can teach us."]="With the sudden arrival of strangers on Pandaria, I believe we'll need the lessons our history can teach us."
G["With the summoning complete and the armies of Azshara gathering for war, Neptulon the Tidehunter will soon fall."]="A evocação terminou e os exércitos de Azshara se reúnen para a guerra. Pronto cairá o Cazamareas."
G["With the villagers help we will surely track down the Zandalari."]="Com a ajuda dos camponeses certo que encontraremos aos Zandalari."
G["With their newfound patronage and apparent role in the king's disappearance, I see no choice but to plan a renewed offensive against the Defias."]="With their newfound patronage and apparent role in the king's disappearance, I see no choice but to plan a renewed offensive against the Defias."
G["With this crystal's powers, my Deathsworn and I... we'd be unstoppable!  We could destroy Illidan!  We could... replace him as lords of Outland!"]="With this crystal's powers, my Deathsworn and I... we'd be unstoppable!  We could destroy Illidan!  We could... replace him as lords of Outland!"
G["With this much void waste and run-off, a toxic void horror can't be too far behind."]="Com tantos resíduos e desechos de vazio, não pode estar longe um horror de vazio tóxico."
G["With this seed, we set root. With time and attention, we should be able to grow shelter from this charred, hostile realm."]="With this seed, we set root. With time and attention, we should be able to grow shelter from this charred, hostile realm."
G["With this shield and sword, I will protect my friends and family."]="With this shield and sword, I will protect my friends and family."
G["With this staff, the circle is entrusting an item of great power to you, $n. Use it to uphold the tenets of our order."]="With this staff, the circle is entrusting an item of great power to you, $n. Use it to uphold the tenets of our order."
G["With this totem, the spirits will bless your participation in the blockade."]="With this totem, the spirits will bless your participation in the blockade."
G["With time, we may be able to restore this land."]="Com o tempo, poderemos restaurar esta terra."
G["With turmoil as tinder, let it blaze; may it temper us against what tomorrow may bring."]="With turmoil as tinder, let it blaze; may it temper us against what tomorrow may bring."
G["With weapons of power and a magnificent regalia our hero unleashed their fury on the beasts. It was glorious!"]="With weapons of power and a magnificent regalia our hero unleashed their fury on the beasts. It was glorious!"
G["With you and I working together, this battle will be over in no time."]="With you and I working together, this battle will be over in no time."
G["With you and your people as allies, we have decided to stay on this island and rebuild. Elune bless you, hero.\n\nWhile the sadness still comes and goes, I think we will survive."]="With you and your people as allies, we have decided to stay on this island and rebuild. Elune bless you, hero.\n\nWhile the sadness still comes and goes, I think we will survive."
G["With you here, we're saved, $n."]="Com você aqui, estamos salvados $n."
G["With your help, I can evaluate these tunnels."]="With your help, I can evaluate these tunnels."
G["With your help, we can repel them!"]="Com a sua ajuda, poderemos fazê-os recuar!"
G["With your help, we might be able to win this thing!"]="Com à sua ajuda, podemos ganhar essa coisa!"
G["With your steadfast determination, we cannot fail!"]="With your steadfast determination, we cannot fail!"
G["With your strength and determination, we cannot fail!"]="With your strength and determination, we cannot fail!"
G["With your strength, murlocs, our plan will succeed. Our kobold friends will mine us plenty of ore..."]="With your strength, murlocs, our plan will succeed. Our kobold friends will mine us plenty of ore..."
G["With your wing of drake riders and the support of the Horde, we can make an assault on the Bastion of Twilight."]="With your wing of drake riders and the support of the Horde, we can make an assault on the Bastion of Twilight."
G["Withdraw your troops, brother, and I promise you a swift second death!"]="Retira seus tropas, irmão, e te prometo uma morte rápida."
G["Wither away!"]="Marchítate!"
G["Wither in Elune's grace!"]="Marchítate na graça de Eluna!"
G["Withered Batwing!"]="Withered Batwing!"
G["Withers absorbs the water, growing back to full size."]="Marchituelo absorve a água e recuperada tudo seu tamanho."
G["Within a year of training under Illidan's best three demon hunters, Varedis had surpassed them.\n\nNo longer content with the training they had to offer, Varedis infiltrated the Shadow Council where he learned of a powerful relic known as the Book of Fel Names.  He secretly read from this book, committing each passage to memory."]="Within a year of training under Illidan's best three demon hunters, Varedis had surpassed them.\n\nNo longer content with the training they had to offer, Varedis infiltrated the Shadow Council where he learned of a powerful relic known as the Book of Fel Names.  He secretly read from this book, committing each passage to memory."
G["Within every brush stroke are a thousand meanings."]="Within every brush stroke are a thousand meanings."
G["Within lies the Shrine of Lost Souls. The souls of thousands of my fallen brethren remain within this area."]="Within lies the Shrine of Lost Souls. The souls of thousands of my fallen brethren remain within this area."
G["Within these ruins rest many ancient mogu secrets.  This entire vale was theirs once, and some corners of it have yet to be tread by pandaren feet."]="Within these ruins rest many ancient mogu secrets.  This entire vale was theirs once, and some corners of it have yet to be tread by pandaren feet."
G["Within these walls, you will be tested. Your skill in combat will be matched against the fiercest dangers Northrend has to offer under the watchful eyes of your leaders."]="Within these walls, you will be tested. Your skill in combat will be matched against the fiercest dangers Northrend has to offer under the watchful eyes of your leaders."
G["Within this circle of fire I must cast the spell to banish the spirits of the slain Fanglords."]="Within this circle of fire I must cast the spell to banish the spirits of the slain Fanglords."
G["Without Taunka'le, life is no longer worth living."]="Sem Taunka'le não vale a pena viver."
G["Without a purpose, they wander... But many find their way back to the sacred areas that they once were sworn to protect."]="Without a purpose, they wander... But many find their way back to the sacred areas that they once were sworn to protect."
G["Without a state... without a cause... what drives them, do you wonder?"]="Without a state... without a cause... what drives them, do you wonder?"
G["Without aid, they will fail."]="Without aid, they will fail."
G["Without delay!"]="Without delay!"
G["Without delivery of the Underlight ore in such a timely fashion, our research would have failed.\n\nJust wait until Shatharia shows her head here again. I've got some interesting tasks for her, you can be sure of it!"]="Without delivery of the Underlight ore in such a timely fashion, our research would have failed.\n\nJust wait until Shatharia shows her head here again. I've got some interesting tasks for her, you can be sure of it!"
G["Without hesitation, the ethereal worg sets off into the valley."]="Without hesitation, the ethereal worg sets off into the valley."
G["Without hope, there is no brightness in the future!"]="Sem esperança, o futuro somente abriga escuridão!"
G["Without knowledge of the incantations required to unite the two parts, Lord Vyletongue was unable to use the scepter. However, now that I am free of the curse of Vyletongue's corruption, I will be able to assist you, if you'd like to bring me the two parts -- both the head and the rod of the scepter."]="Sem o conhecimento dos encantamentos necessários para unir as duas partes, Lorde Vyletongue foi incapaz de usar o cetro. No entanto, agora que estou livre da maldição da corrupção de Vyletongue, poderei ajudá-o, se você quiser me trazer as duas partes - a cabeça e a vara do cetro."
G["Without pressure in both realms, %s begins to regenerate."]="Without pressure in both realms, %s begins to regenerate."
G["Without proper upkeep, buildings within the plaguelands tend to... waste away."]="Without proper upkeep, buildings within the plaguelands tend to... waste away."
G["Without reinforcements, our positions there will be overrun in days."]="Without reinforcements, our positions there will be overrun in days."
G["Without the protection of the Celestials you are forcibly ejected from Ordos' temple!"]="Without the protection of the Celestials you are forcibly ejected from Ordos' temple!"
G["Without these throwing axes, their axe throwers will certainly be less effective."]="Sem estas machados de arremesso, seus lanzamachados serão, sem dúvida, menos eficientes."
G["Without warning, Prince Sandoval magically appears within Valhalas!"]="Without warning, Prince Sandoval magically appears within Valhalas!"
G["Without you we'd be lost. Thanks for the ride!"]="Sem ti estaríamos perdidos. Obrigado pelo viagem!"
G["Without your help, I surely would have died...."]="Sem sua ajuda, haveria morto certo..."
G["Without your help, I would've been doomed to a life of undeath among the Lich King's gruesome creations."]="Sem sua ajuda, estaria condenado a uma vida de não-morte entre as horripilantes criações do Rei Lich."
G["Witness da Drakkari's might."]="Contemplao poder dos Drakkari."
G["Witness de power of de spiritbinder!"]="Eh'te é o poder do vinculador de espíritos!"
G["Witness de power of me voodoo... you ain't leavin' dis island ALIVE!"]="Witness de power of me voodoo... you ain't leavin' dis island ALIVE!"
G["Witness my POWER!"]="Contempla meu poder!"
G["Witness the fury of the cosmos!"]="Witness the fury of the cosmos!"
G["Witness the majesty of flame!"]="Witness the majesty of flame!"
G["Witness the might of the true Horde!"]="Witness the might of the true Horde!"
G["Witness the power bestowed upon me by Deathwing! Feel the fury of earth!"]="Witness the power bestowed upon me by Deathwing! Feel the fury of earth!"
G["Witness the power of the True Horde's arsenal!"]="Witness the power of the True Horde's arsenal!"
G["Witness the sheen of immeasurable power!"]="Contempla a força do poder inconmensurable!"
G["Witness the true meaning of pain!"]="Este é o verdadeiro significado do dor!"
G["Wizzle, you idiot! Everything would have been fine if you'd just kept your mouth shut!"]="Wizzle, you idiot! Everything would have been fine if you'd just kept your mouth shut!"
G["Woah!"]="Uau!"
G["Woah! Woah! Take it easy! You win!"]="Uoah! Uou! Pega leve! Você venceu!"
G["Woah, look at that! It's huge!"]="Uau! Olhe isso! É enorme!"
G["Woah, point that somewhere else!"]="Ouça, indica com isso cima outro lado!"
G["Woah... My hooves are huuuuge..."]="Uooo... Meus pezunhas são enooormes..."
G["Woah... get away from me, crazy... spider-thing!"]="Ah! Afaste-se de mim... aranha... coisa!"
G["Woe to da pandaren usurpers! The mogu will rule dis land again, and we Zandalari will have a new homeland..."]="Ai dos usurpadores pandarens! Os mogus vão mandar nessa terra de novo e nós Zandalari vamos ter uma casa nova..."
G["Woe to each and every one of you, my pretties!"]="Ay de todos e cada um dos vocês, queridos meus!"
G["Woe unto those that dare oppose the Scourge!"]="Woe unto those that dare oppose the Scourge!"
G["Wolf"]="Lobo"
G["Wolf riders, to Frost Dagger Pass!"]="Cavaleiros Lobo, ao Passagem da Adaga Gelo!"
G["Wolf spirit of the forest, hear me!"]="Espírito lobo do florestas, escúchame!"
G["Wolves are pack animals."]="Lobos vivem em matilhas."
G["Wolves head this way, as if fleeing from...something."]="Os lobos vão em essa direção, como se huyeran de... algo."
