G["Women!"]="Mulheres!"
G["Women..."]="Mulheres..."
G["Won a few fights, I see! Keep it up."]="Vejo que ganhou uns combate! Continua assim."
G["Won't be long now until the Brewfest starts!  Come back later and check to see if we're done."]="Não ocorrida muito para que comience a Festa da Cerveja! Volta dentro de um tempo a ver se você está tudo pronto."
G["Won't be long now until the Darkmoon Faire opens.  Come back later and check to see if we're done."]="Não demorará muito até que a Darkmoon Faire seja aberta. Volte mais tarde e verifique se terminamos."
G["Won't somebody help us?"]="Não vai nos ajudar ninguém?"
G["Won't you try a taste of poison, Wakener? Not even just a drop?"]="Não que testar o veneno, arauto? Nem sequer uma gota?"
G["Wonderful!"]="Estupendo!"
G["Wonderful!  Once you take to the skies, the Zandalari may come after you."]="Wonderful!  Once you take to the skies, the Zandalari may come after you."
G["Wonderful! Just look at it. A hundred years to produce this incredible monument for the Jade Serpent. And now, you too have contributed to this masterpiece."]="Wonderful! Just look at it. A hundred years to produce this incredible monument for the Jade Serpent. And now, you too have contributed to this masterpiece."
G["Wonderful! You made it!"]="Maravilhoso! O conseguiu!"
G["Woo Ping is the master of polearms. He trains his students at Weller's Arsenal in Stormwind."]="Woo Ping é o mestre de armas de fogo. Ele treina seus alunos no Weller's Arsenal, em Stormwind."
G["Woo Ping's stamina is simply astounding.  Watching him practice his weapon techniques for hours on end, I felt sorry for the practice dummy afterward.  I can't think of anyone better suited to train you in armed combat."]="A resistência de Woo Ping é simplesmente espantosa. Observando-o praticar suas técnicas de armas por horas a fio, senti pena do manequim depois. Não consigo pensar em alguém mais adequado para treiná-o em combate armado."
G["Woo hoo!"]="Yujuuuuu!"
G["Woo hoo!  Martek picked me!"]="Sim! Martek me escolhido a mim!"
G["Woo hoo!  More rays for training!"]="Yu ju! Mais arraias para treinar!"
G["Woo hoo! Finally getting out of here. It's going to be rough though. Keep your eyes peeled for trouble."]="Woo hoo! Finally getting out of here. It's going to be rough though. Keep your eyes peeled for trouble."
G["Woo hoo! Go Skyguard!"]="Yu ju! Bem Guarda do céu!"
G["Woo hoo, fireworks! More, more!"]="Haaalaaaaa, fogos artifício! Mais, mais!"
G["Woo hoo, here we go! Everyone's collected everything, and it's all being airlifted via zeppelin to Silithus as we speak. The last of it should be there in less than $2113w days. Once it's all over there, and the scepter has been assembled, the war against those dirty insects can begin. As they say, 'Ship It!'"]="Woo hoo, here we go! Everyone's collected everything, and it's all being airlifted via zeppelin to Silithus as we speak. The last of it should be there in less than $2113w days. Once it's all over there, and the scepter has been assembled, the war against those dirty insects can begin. As they say, 'Ship It!'"
G["Woo hoo, here we go! Everyone's collected everything, and it's all being airlifted via zeppelin to Silithus as we speak. The last of it should be there in less than a day. Once it's all over there, and the scepter has been assembled, the war against those dirty insects can begin. As they say, 'Ship It!'"]="Woo hoo, here we go! Everyone's collected everything, and it's all being airlifted via zeppelin to Silithus as we speak. The last of it should be there in less than a day. Once it's all over there, and the scepter has been assembled, the war against those dirty insects can begin. As they say, 'Ship It!'"
G["Woo hoo."]="Yuju."
