G["Word from Netherstorm, sir.  Stop all bloodgem imports; client has reneged payments.\n\nThe nexus-prince will buy out our stock at full price as compensation."]="Word from Netherstorm, sir.  Stop all bloodgem imports; client has reneged payments.\n\nThe nexus-prince will buy out our stock at full price as compensation."
G["Word from the front lines is that your recruits outperform all others in battle."]="Word from the front lines is that your recruits outperform all others in battle."
