G["Working all day in the fields works up a big appetite.\n\nYou didn't hear it from me, but most o' the folk here can eat a woman out of a market stall.\n\nMost everyone has a favorite dish. If you've got any cooking skill, they'll be hankering to try your dishes."]="Working all day in the fields works up a big appetite.\n\nYou didn't hear it from me, but most o' the folk here can eat a woman out of a market stall.\n\nMost everyone has a favorite dish. If you've got any cooking skill, they'll be hankering to try your dishes."
G["Working conditions are horrible under Trade Prince Gallywix. I hope you become the new Trade $g Prince : Princess;!"]="Working conditions are horrible under Trade Prince Gallywix. I hope you become the new Trade $g Prince : Princess;!"
G["Working for Jerrod isn't all that bad.  He might lose his temper now and again, but he pays well, and he even gives me a boost when I can't reach something in the cart."]="Trabalhar para Jerrod não é tão ruim assim. Ele pode perder a paciência de vez em quando, mas paga bem, e até me dá um impulso quando não consigo alcançar algo no carrinho."
