G["YOUR RAGE! I FEED ON YOUR RAGE!"]="SEU RAIVA! ME ALIMENTO DO SEU RAIVA!"
G["YOUR SAD ATTEMPT AT CREATING A FEL REAVER TO STOP ME HAS FAILED!  NOW, ON TO AREA 52!"]="YOUR SAD ATTEMPT AT CREATING A FEL REAVER TO STOP ME HAS FAILED!  NOW, ON TO AREA 52!"
G["YOUR SOUL IS MINE!"]="SUA ALMA É MINHA!"
G["Ya about to be darkspeared."]="Será atravesa'o po’ uma lança negra."
G["Ya all gonna fail!"]="Ya all gonna fail!"
G["Ya barely be fit tah' feed to de big one."]="Somente servirás pa' alimentar ao mandamás... e se quedará com fome."
G["Ya be callin' dat a grip on your weapon? Any Kor'kron worth 'is hide will have dat ting disarmed in a pinch."]="Ya be callin' dat a grip on your weapon? Any Kor'kron worth 'is hide will have dat ting disarmed in a pinch."
G["Ya be crampin' my style, man. Seriously."]="Colega, me está cortando as asas. Em sério."
G["Ya be facin' tha' Zandalari now. Not some Darkspear traitor."]="Agora te enfrentas aos Zandalari, não a um traidor Lança Negra."
G["Ya be havin' me gratitude, $c.\n\nIf there be anythin' I can be doin' fer yeh, just say so."]="Tem meu gratidão, $c.\n\nSe há algo que possa fazer por você, tão somente dilo."
G["Ya be havin' me gratitude, $c.\n\nIf there be anythin' I can be doin' for ya, just say so."]="Ya be havin' me gratitude, $c.\n\nIf there be anythin' I can be doin' for ya, just say so."
G["Ya be lettin' us outta here now!"]="Déjanos sair agora mih'mo!"
G["Ya be lookin' good... in a stew."]="Ya be lookin' good... in a stew."
G["Ya be messin' with Tzu-Tzu? It no matter... Aetherion's here, mon. We gonna roll on ya refugee camp an' then bring the hurt to ya Lor'denal. But first, ya die!"]="Ya be messin' with Tzu-Tzu? It no matter... Aetherion's here, mon. We gonna roll on ya refugee camp an' then bring the hurt to ya Lor'denal. But first, ya die!"
G["Ya be no Warchief of mine.  Ya not earned my respect and I'll not be seein' tha Horde destroyed by ya foolish thirst for war."]="Ya be no Warchief of mine.  Ya not earned my respect and I'll not be seein' tha Horde destroyed by ya foolish thirst for war."
G["Ya be nothin' but fuel to me."]="Não será mais que combuh'tible pa' mim."
G["Ya be on da path, mortal....\n\nEndure, and ya be gettin' great power!"]="Está em caminho, mortal... \n\nAguanta e ganhará grande poder!"
G["Ya be strong and proud, youngblood.  Tha Darkspear will be honored ta have you fight beside d'em."]="Ya be strong and proud, youngblood.  Tha Darkspear will be honored ta have you fight beside d'em."
G["Ya be trespassin' on our land now, mon."]="É um intruso em nueh'tras terras, tron."
G["Ya been invaluable to the revolution, mon. We be armin' up now."]="Ya been invaluable to the revolution, mon. We be armin' up now."
G["Ya bring down da big badda dragon an' destroy da island!"]="Ya bring down da big badda dragon an' destroy da island!"
G["Ya came to the right place... to be eaten!"]="Tem vindo ao lugar adequado... pa' que te coman!"
G["Ya can't be riding yaks into the mountains without a bonified \"Lucktug\"! That be madness! Lemme sell ya some for cheap."]="Ya can't be riding yaks into the mountains without a bonified \"Lucktug\"! That be madness! Lemme sell ya some for cheap."
G["Ya can't beat both de Zandalar an' de mogu!"]="Você não pode vencer aos Zandalari e aos mogu!"
G["Ya can't let anyone through, mon. Or it's ya' head."]="Você não pode deixar passar a ninguém, colega. OU perderá a cabeça."
G["Ya come to the right place to die."]="Tem vindo ao lugar adequado pa' morrer."
G["Ya don' have to look to da sky to see da dragonhawk!"]="Basta olhar ao céu pa' ver ao dracohalcón!"
G["Ya don' kill me yet... ya don' get anudda chance!"]="Ya don' kill me yet... ya don' get anudda chance!"
G["Ya done turned your back on destiny, mon. Now you gunna die!"]="Ya done turned your back on destiny, mon. Now you gunna die!"
G["Ya done well, mon."]="Bem feito."
G["Ya done well, mon...."]="Bem feito, colega."
G["Ya gave up your home an' ya gave up de loas of your ancestors when ya left de Echo Isles. Dey will not be pleased dat you been ignorin' dem."]="Ya gave up your home an' ya gave up de loas of your ancestors when ya left de Echo Isles. Dey will not be pleased dat you been ignorin' dem."
G["Ya gonna bleed, mon."]="Vai sangrar, colega."
G["Ya gonna fail, strangers. Many try before you, but dey only make us stronger!"]="Ya gonna fail, strangers. Many try before you, but dey only make us stronger!"
G["Ya gonna go on to great ting's. Don't forget me, mon."]="Você vai' a fazer grandes coisas. Não me olvi'é, colega."
G["Ya gonna' be helpin' us, $c?"]="Nos vai ajudar, $c?"
G["Ya gonna' be my next trophy."]="Ya gonna' be my next trophy."
G["Ya got nothin'!"]="Não tem nada!"
G["Ya got some nerve, mon!"]="Mas que morro que tem', colega!"
G["Ya got some powerful mojo, $n!"]="Seu mojo é mu' poderoso, $n!"
G["Ya grummles be good sports. I be likin' the cut of your jib.\n\nFor dat reason, I be willing to part with this \"Luckydo Kazoo\" which be makin' only deh most luckiest of music."]="Ya grummles be good sports. I be likin' the cut of your jib.\n\nFor dat reason, I be willing to part with this \"Luckydo Kazoo\" which be makin' only deh most luckiest of music."
G["Ya handle yaself on da ground.  How about in da skies?"]="Te as apanha' muito bem em terra fih'me. Que tal se prova' nos céus?"
G["Ya have met your match, fools!"]="Ya have met your match, fools!"
G["Ya have my gratitude for gettin' me outta dat cage. My wits are finally returnin' an' I'll be able to tell Vol'jin what I learned."]="Ya have my gratitude for gettin' me outta dat cage. My wits are finally returnin' an' I'll be able to tell Vol'jin what I learned."
G["Ya have my tanks, $c. I thought I'd be endin' up just another sacrifice..."]="Tem meu agradecimento, $c. Pensei que acabaría sendo um sacrifício mais."
G["Ya have no idea what it's like to be stuck here in Vashj'ir like this!  Do ya know how many fish have confused me for a piece of seaweed, nibbling on my toes and hiding between pieces of my armor?\n\nThe tickling alone is enough to drive a dwarf mad!"]="Ya have no idea what it's like to be stuck here in Vashj'ir like this!  Do ya know how many fish have confused me for a piece of seaweed, nibbling on my toes and hiding between pieces of my armor?\n\nThe tickling alone is enough to drive a dwarf mad!"
G["Ya have the thanks of my men, $n. This totem be a powerful omen for war."]="Meus homens estão muito agradecidos, $n. Este totem é um grande presagio pa' a guerra."
G["Ya head's gonna make a nice bag!"]="Sua cabeça será uma boa bolsa!"
G["Ya here to join da revolution, mon?"]="Tem vindo a se juntar à revolução, colega?"
G["Ya know, without so many of them burly trolls wanderin' about this place can be downright pleasant."]="Ya know, without so many of them burly trolls wanderin' about this place can be downright pleasant."
G["Ya know... my heart really ain't in it."]="Acho que não tenho estômago para isto."
G["Ya look lovesick. Special someone be gettin' ya down, eh? No worries, no worries. Ya get this medallion from me, ya wear it when ya see 'em, and they be all over ya, $G man:sweetheart;!"]="Ya look lovesick. Special someone be gettin' ya down, eh? No worries, no worries. Ya get this medallion from me, ya wear it when ya see 'em, and they be all over ya, $G man:sweetheart;!"
G["Ya look tired, $c. I be havin' somethin' for ya. These amulets, they can help ya leap obstacles and swim through the rivers like ya be born to it. They energize the food ya be eatin', makin' yer wounds close before yer eyes!"]="Ya look tired, $c. I be havin' somethin' for ya. These amulets, they can help ya leap obstacles and swim through the rivers like ya be born to it. They energize the food ya be eatin', makin' yer wounds close before yer eyes!"
G["Ya make a good try... but now you gonna join da ones who already fall."]="Bom intento... mas agoraos vais a unir às almas dos que já têm caído."
G["Ya man, you be wantin Jandi's Arboretum.  Did I just say that?  Glok'tar I must be tired!  Follow the wooden steps behind Asoran's Market in the Valley of Wisdom up into The Drag and you'll find Jandi's there on the upper level."]="Sim, rosto, você quer o Arboreto de Jandi. Eu acabei de dizer isso? Glok'tar, devo estar cansado! Continue os degraus de madeira atrás do Mercado de Asoran, no Vale da Sabedoria, até The Drag e você encontrará Jandi's lá no nível superior."
G["Ya may know a thing or two about handlin' animals, but have ya ever taken ta the skies? We Wildhammers know how ta ride the wind with the best of 'em. Fer a small fee, if ya've got the mettle, I'll train ya good and proper."]="Você pode saber uma coisa ou duas sobre animais manipulados, mas você já tomou o céu? Nós, Wildhammers, sabemos como montar o vento com os melhores. Por uma pequena taxa, se você tiver coragem, eu treinarei você de maneira adequada."
G["Ya may not follow the ways of the Light like a Knight of the Silver Hand, but ya can always ask us for aid."]="Você pode não seguir os caminhos da Luz como um Cavaleiro da Mão de Prata, mas sempre pode pedir ajuda."
G["Ya messed with de wrong trolls."]="Te metes com os trolls equivocados."
G["Ya mest with da wrong trolls, fishhead."]="Ya mest with da wrong trolls, fishhead."
G["Ya momma was bait fish."]="Seu mãe era cebo pa’ peixe."
G["Ya mon! A hero done freed our raptors!"]="Ya mon! A hero done freed our raptors!"
G["Ya must make amends wit' Bwonsamdi, de guardian of de dead, if ya hope to defeat Zalazane. It be de only way. Tell de son of Sen'jin dese things."]="Ya must make amends wit' Bwonsamdi, de guardian of de dead, if ya hope to defeat Zalazane. It be de only way. Tell de son of Sen'jin dese things."
G["Ya need ta be more swift den that!"]="Precisa se' muito mais veloz!"
G["Ya need trainin'?  You picked a real inconvenient time to come pokin' through the Valley of Spirits.\n\n<Your trainer's voice lowers to a whisper.>\n\nThe Kor'kron watches our every move. Garrosh has the Valley of Spirits under his thumb. I could be killed if they saw me talkin' to you.\n\nLucky for you, they don't ever see me. Lean in close, $n. We gotta keep this on the down low."]="Ya need trainin'?  You picked a real inconvenient time to come pokin' through the Valley of Spirits.\n\n<Your trainer's voice lowers to a whisper.>\n\nThe Kor'kron watches our every move. Garrosh has the Valley of Spirits under his thumb. I could be killed if they saw me talkin' to you.\n\nLucky for you, they don't ever see me. Lean in close, $n. We gotta keep this on the down low."
G["Ya needed ta prove yer worthiness...."]="Ya needed ta prove yer worthiness...."
G["Ya not be gettin' me dat easy! Atal'ai gonna rise up..."]="Ya not be gettin' me dat easy! Atal'ai gonna rise up..."
G["Ya not be gettin' the drop on us again ya half wit Kor'kron!"]="Ya not be gettin' the drop on us again ya half wit Kor'kron!"
G["Ya not be needin' dis weapon again now are ya?"]="Já não te há falta eh'ta arma, verdade?"
G["Ya not be so tough from the dead now are ya?"]="Ya not be so tough from the dead now are ya?"
G["Ya not be stoppin' de Zandalari, mon."]="Você não pode parar aos Zandalari, colega."
G["Ya not be stoppin' us, mon."]="Não nos detendrás, colega."
G["Ya not be welcome here!"]="Não são bem-vindos!"
G["Ya not do too bad.... Your efforts delay da inevitable for a small time. Come to me now. Ya prove yourselves worthy offerings."]="Ya not do too bad.... Your efforts delay da inevitable for a small time. Come to me now. Ya prove yourselves worthy offerings."
G["Ya not gonna be foolin' ol' Zen'tabra with dat cat disguise. I be rememberin' dis, $r."]="Ya not gonna be foolin' ol' Zen'tabra with dat cat disguise. I be rememberin' dis, $r."
G["Ya not the only ones who bleed for dah Horde ya orcs!"]="Ya not the only ones who bleed for dah Horde ya orcs!"
G["Ya saved me, mon! I thought they be drownin' me for sure."]="Ya saved me, mon! I thought they be drownin' me for sure."
G["Ya saved my life!"]="Me salvou a vida!"
G["Ya see that pass ahead dere, $glad:lass;?"]="Ya see that pass ahead dere, $glad:lass;?"
G["Ya see... to summon Hakkar, I need Mandokir.  And Mandokir, he needs you."]="Verá... Para evocar a Hakkar preciso de Mandokir. E Mandokir te precisa você."
G["Ya should be able to send in de builders anytime now. Dere be a lot of work ahead of dem."]="Dentro de pouco poderá enviar conh'tructores. Há muito trabalho por fazer."
G["Ya shouldn'a taken the boat north, mon!"]="Ya shouldn'a taken the boat north, mon!"
G["Ya shouldn't be messin' wit da Zandalari!"]="Ya shouldn't be messin' wit da Zandalari!"
G["Ya skull gonna make a fine ornament for my tusks."]="Seu caveira será um bonito adorno pa' meus presas."
G["Ya soul be weak."]="Sua alma é fraco."
G["Ya spirit is mine!"]="Seu eh'píritu é meu!"
G["Ya still call him \"Warchief,\" $c? Is he still YOUR Warchief? What of de spoils of his war? I don't see you fat an' happy like his Kor'kron.\n\nLook, ya be an orc, maybe ya don't see it. Da ghettos in Orgrimmar. De way he talk 'bout de other races. De way he use 'em like cannon fodder. Are ya one of de chosen few, $n? Or are ya disposable, like de rest of us? De trash he throw away once he get his monstrous way. He promise glory but bathes our Horde in blood.\n\nMe an' Thrall, we see a diff'rent Horde."]="Ya still call him \"Warchief,\" $c? Is he still YOUR Warchief? What of de spoils of his war? I don't see you fat an' happy like his Kor'kron.\n\nLook, ya be an orc, maybe ya don't see it. Da ghettos in Orgrimmar. De way he talk 'bout de other races. De way he use 'em like cannon fodder. Are ya one of de chosen few, $n? Or are ya disposable, like de rest of us? De trash he throw away once he get his monstrous way. He promise glory but bathes our Horde in blood.\n\nMe an' Thrall, we see a diff'rent Horde."
G["Ya still call him \"Warchief,\" $c? Is he still YOUR Warchief? What of de spoils of his war? I don't see you fat an' happy like his Kor'kron. His Horde be an orc Horde. Do ya still feel welcome here, $r? Are ya a part of his plan? Or are ya trash he gonna do away wit' once he has his way? He promise glory, but bathes our Horde in blood, an' steps on anyone who see it diff'rent.\n\nYa wanna know how I see de Horde? De Horde dat me an' Thrall built?"]="Ya still call him \"Warchief,\" $c? Is he still YOUR Warchief? What of de spoils of his war? I don't see you fat an' happy like his Kor'kron. His Horde be an orc Horde. Do ya still feel welcome here, $r? Are ya a part of his plan? Or are ya trash he gonna do away wit' once he has his way? He promise glory, but bathes our Horde in blood, an' steps on anyone who see it diff'rent.\n\nYa wanna know how I see de Horde? De Horde dat me an' Thrall built?"
G["Ya surpassed my greatest hopes."]="Tem superado todas meus expectativas."
G["Ya think? Hobart, the Micro Mechachicken is destablizing. It's expanding!"]="Isso acha? Roberto, o micromecapolho se você está desestabilizando. Está crescendo!"
G["Ya tink these herbs and fancy incense be givin' ya luck in dah mountains? Ha ha! Ya not be tradin' with dah right mon, mon. Come be gettin' you a genuine Lucky Lock!"]="Ya tink these herbs and fancy incense be givin' ya luck in dah mountains? Ha ha! Ya not be tradin' with dah right mon, mon. Come be gettin' you a genuine Lucky Lock!"
G["Ya tink ya got what it takes ta face ME? Give up, shadow hunter!"]="Ya tink ya got what it takes ta face ME? Give up, shadow hunter!"
G["Ya trainer should be somewhere in the grounds 'ere. I'll catch you lata, mon."]="Seu inh'tructor deveria andar po' aqui. Não' vemos depois, colega."
G["Ya wanna find out?!"]="Ya wanna find out?!"
G["Ya want a present?! WELL, MY LEGS DON'T EVEN WORK!!!"]="Que um presente?! POIS A MIM NÃO ME FUNCIONAM AS PERNAS!!!"
G["Ya want to join the attack on the naga?"]="Você quer se juntar ao ataque aos nagas?"
G["Ya were foolish to come 'ere, Sea Witch. Ya escaped our vengeance once, but the Darkspear Tribe will not abide ya trespassin' again."]="Ya were foolish to come 'ere, Sea Witch. Ya escaped our vengeance once, but the Darkspear Tribe will not abide ya trespassin' again."
G["Ya will spend ya reign glancin' over ya shoulda and fearin' tha shadows, for when tha time comes and ya blood be slowly drainin' out, ya will know exactly who fired tha arrow dat pierced ya black heart."]="Ya will spend ya reign glancin' over ya shoulda and fearin' tha shadows, for when tha time comes and ya blood be slowly drainin' out, ya will know exactly who fired tha arrow dat pierced ya black heart."
G["Ya won't take de Horde from us!"]="Ya won't take de Horde from us!"
G["Ya' better stay away, chumps. No one hassles the Hoff!"]="Ya' better stay away, chumps. No one hassles the Hoff!"
G["Ya' ever wonder how magnets work?"]="Ya' ever wonder how magnets work?"
G["Ya'll get a few minutes to wake up, but let's get started soon."]="Têm uns quantos minutos para despertar, mas Vamos em marcha quanto antes."
G["Ya'll need to find a different trainer, $c. I cannot help ya."]="Ya'll need to find a different trainer, $c. I cannot help ya."
G["Ya, mon! I'm da best there ever was!"]="Sim, colega! Sou o melhor dos melhores."
G["Ya, mon, for now. Dey not be too keen on teachin' many more o' our kind, but dey be helpin' us 'long as we be keepin' de life o' de isles flourishin'. When Gonk left after de fall o' Zalazane, he be tellin' us how ta contact him if de other loa don't keep dey end o' de bargain.\n\nI be hopin' it never come ta dat... but just in case, we be openin' up channels wit dat Cenarion Circle group. \n\n<Zen'tabra cackles madly.>\n\nOh, ya shoulda seen de look on dat night elf's face...."]="Ya, mon, for now. Dey not be too keen on teachin' many more o' our kind, but dey be helpin' us 'long as we be keepin' de life o' de isles flourishin'. When Gonk left after de fall o' Zalazane, he be tellin' us how ta contact him if de other loa don't keep dey end o' de bargain.\n\nI be hopin' it never come ta dat... but just in case, we be openin' up channels wit dat Cenarion Circle group. \n\n<Zen'tabra cackles madly.>\n\nOh, ya shoulda seen de look on dat night elf's face...."
G["Ya, mon. Let's crack some tiki target skulls!"]="Ya, mon. Let's crack some tiki target skulls!"
G["YaY! WE WON!"]="YUPI! TEMOS GANHOU!"
G["Yaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaay!"]="Sííííííííííííííííííííííííííííííí!"
G["Yaaaaawwwwwnnnn..."]="Uaaaaaaaaa..."
G["Yaaarr!"]="Yaaarr!"
G["Yachi! Yao! Rip these fools to shreds!"]="Yachi! Yao! Rip these fools to shreds!"
G["Yah, I know, it be lookin' like we already have all of the mithril bars we be needin' for the war. But ya know, there still be plenty of folk 'round here that can probably be usin' your help right about now.  Thanks mon."]="Sim, o sei, parece que já temos todas as barras de mithril que precisamos de para a guerra. Mas sabe? Ainda há muitos por aí que poderiam precisar sua ajuda agora mesmo. Obrigado, colega."
G["Yah, me bredren!  Galang now and pass us a grog, just dead men yahso."]="Yah, me bredren!  Galang now and pass us a grog, just dead men yahso."
G["Yah, mom... woooo!"]="Sim, mamãe! Yuju!"
G["Yah, mon, this be the time to be glad of life and spring. Ya collect lots of eggs yet?"]="Sim, seg, esta é a hora de se alegrar com a vida e a primavera. Você já colecionou muitos ovos?"
G["Yah. Hellscream, he be a fierce one, but too eager to prove himself, I be thinkin'. It be good Saurfang be here, for sure."]="Yah. Hellscream, he be a fierce one, but too eager to prove himself, I be thinkin'. It be good Saurfang be here, for sure."
G["Yah. It be dem sinkholes. You see dem? Dere be talk of blowin' dem up, cavin' dem in."]="Yah. It be dem sinkholes. You see dem? Dere be talk of blowin' dem up, cavin' dem in."
G["Yak hair."]="Cabelo de yak."
G["Yak, yak! Let's get to the drinking!"]="Sim, si! Vamos beber!"
G["Yak. Yak never changes."]="Yak. O yak nunca muda."
G["Yalia - we need more healing! Taoshi - cover the rear!"]="Yalia, mais cura! Taoshi, cubre a retaguarda!"
G["Yalia, take Lord Zhu to safety."]="Yalia, coloque a salvou a Lorde Zhu."
G["Yana Bloodspear."]="Yana Lança de Sangue."
G["Yanyra Moonfell peddles reagents and can be found in the crafter's hall, to the left as you enter the building.\n\nI will mark the location on your map."]="Yanyra Lunabaja trafica com componentes e se encontre na salão do artesão, nada mais entrar no edifício, à esquerda.\n\nTe marcarei seu localização no mapa."
G["Yap, I can teach ye to fish."]="Sim, eu posso ensinar a pescar."
G["Yar!"]="Yar!"
G["Yar, he's dead all right.  That makes you da new king... well, all of you!  Gordok is yours now, boss!  You should talk to me so you can learn everything there is about being da king!  I was... is his assistant!  Yeah, that's why I'm called da crafty one!"]="Yar, he's dead all right.  That makes you da new king... well, all of you!  Gordok is yours now, boss!  You should talk to me so you can learn everything there is about being da king!  I was... is his assistant!  Yeah, that's why I'm called da crafty one!"
G["Yarg!"]="Yarg!"
G["Yarp? Yar wannar fly? Narp... No-no-no-norp gonnarp ha-hap-hap-happen!"]="Yarp? Você quer voar? Narp... Não-não-não-norp gonnarp ha-hap-hap-acontecer!"
G["Yarr!"]="Yarr!"
G["Yarr!  I pilfered those limes fair 'n' square!"]="Yarr!  I pilfered those limes fair 'n' square!"
G["Yarr! Someone be needin' ta show these bloaks what fer!\n\n<hic>"]="Yarr! Someone be needin' ta show these bloaks what fer!\n\n<hic>"
G["Yarr, Admiral. Let me think about it... Arrr... It be comin' into focus."]="Yarr, Admiral. Let me think about it... Arrr... It be comin' into focus."
G["Yarr, and what be ye?  A bilge-lickin' $r with some fancy $c pants and a mug like a $g sea giant: harpy;.  I'd rather take a bite o' Keelhaul's boot than take a weakling like yerself into the Bloodsails.\n\nCome back when ye got a little more wind in yer sails."]="Yarr, and what be ye?  A bilge-lickin' $r with some fancy $c pants and a mug like a $g sea giant: harpy;.  I'd rather take a bite o' Keelhaul's boot than take a weakling like yerself into the Bloodsails.\n\nCome back when ye got a little more wind in yer sails."
G["Yarr, hold on tight, me hearty, fer thar be nary an oarsman so capable as I!"]="Yarr, hold on tight, me hearty, fer thar be nary an oarsman so capable as I!"
G["Yarr, thar be a traitor!  An ugly one at that!  Get out o' me office, before I blow ye down to Pirate-town!"]="Yarr, thar be a traitor!  An ugly one at that!  Get out o' me office, before I blow ye down to Pirate-town!"
G["Yarr, thar be nary a soul s'thirsty as me, says I."]="Jarrr, aqui não há ninguém mais sedento, que eu, senhol."
G["Yarr, the Adm'rl sent me here to sell ya some of the booty we plundered from the Jade Forest.  He thought it might 'elp you on yer journey.\n\nIf ye want I can also take ye back to the mainland."]="Yarr, the Adm'rl sent me here to sell ya some of the booty we plundered from the Jade Forest.  He thought it might 'elp you on yer journey.\n\nIf ye want I can also take ye back to the mainland."
G["Yarr."]="Yarr."
G["Yarr?"]="Yarr?"
G["Yarrr!"]="Yarrr!"
G["Yarrr! Keep it down, Ed! Thar be scallywags about! Their scallywag ears be listenin' for gasps like the one that just escaped yer lips!"]="Yarrr! Keep it down, Ed! Thar be scallywags about! Their scallywag ears be listenin' for gasps like the one that just escaped yer lips!"
G["Yarrrr!"]="Arrrr!"
G["Yarrrr!  If it's me treasure yer lookin' for... yer gonna have to fight for it!"]="Arrrr! Se atenção você meu tesouro... terá que lutar!"
G["Yarrrr, mon!"]="Arrrrr! Que bolá, asere?"
G["Yarrrr, yeh don't want none of what I be dealin', $gSonny:missy;.\n\nBegone wit' yeh!"]="Aaarrrr, não que ter nada que ver com o que me traigo entre mãos, $ghijo: senhorita;.\n\nLargo de aqui!"
G["Yarrrrr... dead again!"]="Arrrrr... outra vê morto!"
G["Yarrrrrrr!  Ye'll never get me spyglass, bilgesucker!"]="Yarrrrrrr!  Ye'll never get me spyglass, bilgesucker!"
G["Yaungol!? Now!?"]="Yaungol?! Agora?!"
G["Yaw Sharpmane awaits you on the north edge of the village.  He can teach you the ways of the Hunter."]="Yaw Sharpmane espera por você no extremo norte da vila. Ele pode ensinar-lhe os caminhos do caçador."
G["Yawww!"]="Aaaaau!"
G["Yay!"]="Sim!"
G["Yay!  We love you!  You saved us!"]="Bem! Te queremos! Nos has salvou!"
G["Yay!  We're free!"]="Bem! Somos livres!"
G["Yay! Dinner come to ME!"]="Sim! Cena vir a MIM!"
G["Yay! I'm the best!"]="É! Eu sou sinistro!"
G["Yay! Shin! You're alive!"]="Sim! Shin! Está vivo!"
G["Yay! That was amazing!"]="Sim! Foi absurdo!"
G["Yay!!"]="Bem!"
G["Yay, fireworks!"]="Bem, fogos artifício!"
G["Yay... more dirt."]="Sim... mais sujeira."
G["Yayyyy!"]="Yupiiiii!"
G["Ye ain't cookin' ME, ye long-eared snow-huffer!"]="Ye ain't cookin' ME, ye long-eared snow-huffer!"
G["Ye be needing directions $glad : lass;?"]="Precisa que te guíen, $gmuchacho: moça;?"
G["Ye bothered me for that? Ye'd be better off strapping a dead rabbit to yer back and running through a Troll's den than wearing that piece of garbage."]="Você me incomodou por isso? Seria melhor amarrar um coelho morto nas costas e correr pela cova dos Trolls do que usar aquele pedaço de lixo."
G["Ye can defuse it, right Magruder?!"]="Pode desactivarlo, verdade, Magruder?!"
G["Ye can probably hear Tognus beating away on the anvil when yer in Kharanos.  Although, if ye haven't cleared the wax out of yer ears recently, then why don't ye just have a look in the smithy."]="Você provavelmente pode ouvir Tognus batendo na bigorna quando você está em Kharanos. Embora, se você não limpou a cera dos seus atenção recentemente, então por que você simplesmente não olha a ferraria?"
G["Ye don' want ta' be goin up dis' way, mon.  Da spirits be restless.\nMebbe if ye' know a ting or two about ancient artifacts, ye can fin' a way to put dem to rest."]="Ye don' want ta' be goin up dis' way, mon.  Da spirits be restless.\nMebbe if ye' know a ting or two about ancient artifacts, ye can fin' a way to put dem to rest."
G["Ye don't remember me, do ye? Blasted Scourge... They've tried to drain ye o' everything that made ye a righteous force o' reckoning. Every last ounce o' good... Everything that made ye a $g son:daughter; o' Ironforge!"]="Ye don't remember me, do ye? Blasted Scourge... They've tried to drain ye o' everything that made ye a righteous force o' reckoning. Every last ounce o' good... Everything that made ye a $g son:daughter; o' Ironforge!"
G["Ye don't?  But ya worked so hard ta get it!  Well, $g lad : lass;, if ya want, I'll take it off o' yer hands fer a fair price.\n\nHow does an exchange of yer cloak fer an apexis crystal sound ta ye?"]="Ye don't?  But ya worked so hard ta get it!  Well, $g lad : lass;, if ya want, I'll take it off o' yer hands fer a fair price.\n\nHow does an exchange of yer cloak fer an apexis crystal sound ta ye?"
G["Ye have my approval $n, ye can forge blades better than any I've trained in years. If ye want to make a real weapon though, ye need to talk with Myolor Sunderfury. That Dwarf will set ya on the right path."]="Ye have my approval $n, ye can forge blades better than any I've trained in years. If ye want to make a real weapon though, ye need to talk with Myolor Sunderfury. That Dwarf will set ya on the right path."
G["Ye have some skill about ye with hammer and anvil, but not enough. Go speak to Dane Lindgren, he'll get ye ready to learn what I have to teach ye."]="Você tem alguma habilidade sobre você com martelo e bigorna, mas não o suficiente. Vá falar com Dane Lindgren, ele vai se preparar para aprender o que eu tenho para lhe ensinar."
G["Ye have some skill at weapon crafting $g lad : lass;,very impressive indeed. Now grab a hammer and let's see if ye can forge a real weapon."]="Se te da bastante bem fabricar armas, $gmuchacho: moça;, muito impressionante. Agora, pegue um martelo e vamos ver se você pode fabricar uma das verdade."
G["Ye have the look of a Blacksmith to ye. Soot under the nails, steel in yer bones. Aye, very much the blood of a Blacksmith in yer veins. Which means ye've come to me looking to learn a thing or two, well $g lad : lass; grab a hammer. Let's see what I can teach ye."]="Ye have the look of a Blacksmith to ye. Soot under the nails, steel in yer bones. Aye, very much the blood of a Blacksmith in yer veins. Which means ye've come to me looking to learn a thing or two, well $g lad : lass; grab a hammer. Let's see what I can teach ye."
G["Ye know more than I do, that's a certainty. Tell ye what though, go talk with me da'. He'll want ye ta prove yerself, but he is a fine teacher indeed. His name's Rotgath, and ye'll find him near the anvils workin steel for ol' Bengus."]="Você sabe mais do que eu, isso é uma certeza. Diga o que, porém, vá falar comigo da '. Ele quer que você se prove, mas é um ótimo professor. O nome dele é Rotgath, e você o encontrará perto das bigornas trabalhando em aço para o velho Bengus."
G["Ye know, $n, I gotta admit I look forward to your visits now and again."]="Olhe, $n, tenho que admitir que me encantar receber seus visitas de vez em quando."
G["Ye learn fast $g lad : lass;, much faster than I can keep up with. If ye want ta continue yer training, I suggest ye see my teacher. His name's Rotgath, Rotgath Stonebeard and ye'll find him in Ironforge at The Great Forge."]="Ye learn fast $g lad : lass;, much faster than I can keep up with. If ye want ta continue yer training, I suggest ye see my teacher. His name's Rotgath, Rotgath Stonebeard and ye'll find him in Ironforge at The Great Forge."
G["Ye look a bit lost there.  Can I help ye find something?"]="Pareces um pouco $gperdido: perdida;. Posso ajudar você a encontrar algo?"
G["Ye looking for Hogral?  Well did ye check the tavern?  Och!  If yer looking for a rogue, and a dwarf one at that, ye should start in the Inn!  Go have a look already."]="Você está procurando Hogral? Bem, você checou a taberna? Och! Se você está procurando um ladino, e um anão, deve começar na estalagem! Vá dar uma olhada já."
G["Ye might not know it, but in addition to being a skilled tailor, Jormund is also a slayer of giants!  Why he must have overheard a few of us sharing stories when he shouted that he'd killed seven with one blow!  \nYe should pay him a visit at his store on the north side of The Great Forge an' see if he'll tell ye the tale!"]="Ye might not know it, but in addition to being a skilled tailor, Jormund is also a slayer of giants!  Why he must have overheard a few of us sharing stories when he shouted that he'd killed seven with one blow!  \nYe should pay him a visit at his store on the north side of The Great Forge an' see if he'll tell ye the tale!"
G["Ye need some training?  Well, Azar Stronghammer is always up for showing the younger paladins a thing or two.  Why don't ye go see him in the Thunderbrew Distillery."]="Você precisa de algum treinamento? Bem, Azar Stronghammer está sempre disposto a mostrar uma coisa ou duas aos paladinos mais jovens. Por que você não o vê na Destilaria Thunderbrew?"
G["Ye should be on yer way $g lad : lass;. My pet here is hungry and he likes the smell of ye."]="Ye should be on yer way $g lad : lass;. My pet here is hungry and he likes the smell of ye."
G["Ye should check over at Steelgrill's Depot for Bronk.  When he's not tinkering with some odd device, he's usually chatting up the pilots about their steam tanks."]="Você deve dar uma olhada no Steelgrill's Depot à procura de Bronk. Quando ele não está mexendo em algum dispositivo estranho, geralmente está conversando com os pilotos sobre seus tanques de vapor."
G["Ye should take a look in Ironforge if ye have yer mind set on enchanting.  I think I saw a shop over by the gryphon master last time I was up there."]="Você deve dar uma olhada em Ironforge se você tem a mente encantada. Acho que vi uma loja do mestre grifo da última vez que estive lá em cima."
G["Ye sure ye don't want to learn to be a warrior?  Well, it's yer hide on the battlefield.  If ye really want to learn to waggle yer finger, ye best talk to Magis Sparkmantle in the Thunderbrew Distillery."]="Tem certeza de que não quer aprender a ser um guerreiro? Bem, é o seu esconderijo no campo de batalha. Se você mesmo quer aprender a mexer o dedo, é melhor conversar com Magis Sparkmantle na Destilaria Thunderbrew."
G["Ye walk on the Baron's land now, ye scurvy worgen scum!"]="Ye walk on the Baron's land now, ye scurvy worgen scum!"
G["Ye want Deepmountain Mining and Jewelcrafting, over on the northern side of The Great Forge."]="Vocês querem Mineração da Montanha Profunda e Joalheria, no lado norte da Grande Forja."
G["Ye want to be trained in the use of a weapon, do ye?  Well don't stand there slack-jawed, speak up $gladdie : lassie;!"]="Que aprender a usar um arma, eh? Bom, não te fique aí com rosto de idiota, fala, $gchico: garota;."
G["Ye won't find a gryphon master just anywhere around Dun Morogh, $glad : lass;.  Ye're going to have to go to Ironforge if ye want to take a gryphon somewhere."]="Não encontrar nenhum mestre de grifos por Dun Morogh, $gmuchacho: moça;. Terá que ir até Altaforja se que ir em grifo a alguma parte."
G["Ye won't find any skinners out in here Dun Morogh $glad : lass;, they're mostly to be found in Ironforge if ye're looking to be trained."]="Ye won't find any skinners out in here Dun Morogh $glad : lass;, they're mostly to be found in Ironforge if ye're looking to be trained."
G["Ye won't find anythin' like it elsewhere. Come and try!"]="Não encontrar nada parecido em outro lugar. Venha e pruébalo!"
G["Ye'd think that, after an earthquake of cataclysmic proportions, the LAST place ye'd want ta be is indoors, wouldn't ye?"]="Ye'd think that, after an earthquake of cataclysmic proportions, the LAST place ye'd want ta be is indoors, wouldn't ye?"
G["Ye'll be feasting on me blade this Winter Veil!  Yeargh!"]="Será um bom festa neste Festival de Inverno! Grrrroaj!"
G["Ye'll find an Arcane Reforger in Gimble's shop, Thistlefuzz Arcanery, right by the Gryphon Master at The Great Forge.\n\nHe's one o' them long-lost Highborne elves, but he'll do ye right."]="Ye'll find an Arcane Reforger in Gimble's shop, Thistlefuzz Arcanery, right by the Gryphon Master at The Great Forge.\n\nHe's one o' them long-lost Highborne elves, but he'll do ye right."
G["Ye'll find the battlemasters around the war table in the Hall of Arms."]="Você encontrará os mestres de batalha em torno da mesa de guerra no Hall of Arms."
G["Ye'll not find a finer craftsman than I in all the Dark Irons!\n\nHammerin', smithin', and diggin' be damned!  A needle and a thimble's all the metal I need!"]="Ye'll not find a finer craftsman than I in all the Dark Irons!\n\nHammerin', smithin', and diggin' be damned!  A needle and a thimble's all the metal I need!"
G["Ye'll not get around our blockade with scavengin'!"]="Ye'll not get around our blockade with scavengin'!"
G["Ye'll surely find Maxan Anvol tossin' back a few in the Thunderbrew Distillery.  Why don't ye go have yerself a pint and see if he'll teach ye something new."]="Certamente encontrará Maxan Anvol jogando algum na Destilaria Thunderbrew. Por que você não vai pegar uma cerveja e ver se ele lhe ensinará algo novo?"
G["Ye'll want ta seek out Wembil Taskwidget, just along the south road.\nHe can help ye with any profession ye're interested in!"]="Busca a Wembil Trastarea pelo caminho do sul.\n\nPode ajudar você com qualquer profissão que te interese!"
G["Ye're a fine enchanter indeed! Now it's time fer ye to move on. I want ye to talk to Gimble Thistlefuzz, upstairs. He's a bit of a character, but he'll steer ye in the right direction from here on out!"]="Você é mesmo um encantador encantador! Agora é hora de seguir em linha de frente. Quero que fale com Gimble Thistlefuzz, no andar de cima. Ele é meio que um personagem, mas ele vai te guiar na direção certa daqui pra linha de frente!"
G["Ye're beyond my skill to teach, $n. Go pester Tally Berryfizz; she's a gnome living in Tinker Town of Ironforge. Oh, and since you're headed up anyway, give Kali my love."]="Ye're beyond my skill to teach, $n. Go pester Tally Berryfizz; she's a gnome living in Tinker Town of Ironforge. Oh, and since you're headed up anyway, give Kali my love."
G["Ye've come to the right place $glad : lass;!  People come here from all o'er the world to train to be a blacksmith.  Ye'll find Bengus Deepforge hammering away at an anvil in the middle of our fine city by The Great Forge itself."]="Ye've come to the right place $glad : lass;!  People come here from all o'er the world to train to be a blacksmith.  Ye'll find Bengus Deepforge hammering away at an anvil in the middle of our fine city by The Great Forge itself."
G["Ye've either got to stop the boy or help him... one o' the two!"]="Precisa pararle os pés ao rapaz ou ajudá-lo... uma das dois!"
G["Ye've got a little skill on ye. Enough to learn ye a few things I wager. Let's see what I can teach ye, shall we?"]="Você tem um pouco de habilidade em você. O suficiente para aprender algumas coisas que aposto. Vamos ver o que eu posso ensinar, vamos?"
G["Ye've got my attention.  OK, now ye've lost it."]="Tem toda meu atenção. Vale, já a perdeu."
G["Ye've got some stones comin' up here, $glad:lass;. It's Pirates' Day, ye know... and 'til the sun rises on the morrow, Booty Bay is MINE.\n\nSo! What do ye say? Raise a drink ta me and me crew, and join the celebration?"]="Ye've got some stones comin' up here, $glad:lass;. It's Pirates' Day, ye know... and 'til the sun rises on the morrow, Booty Bay is MINE.\n\nSo! What do ye say? Raise a drink ta me and me crew, and join the celebration?"
G["Ye've got some stones, $glad:lass;, comin' in here unannounced.\nWhat do ye want?"]="Ye've got some stones, $glad:lass;, comin' in here unannounced.\nWhat do ye want?"
G["Ye've gotta be kiddin' me! Yer nearly dead! Look at ye!"]="Mas está louca? Está meio morta! Mírate!"
G["Ye've made yer way to Chiselgrip, $g lad: lass;.  Best make yerself useful."]="Chegou a Cincelada, $gmuchacho: moça;. Será melhor que faça algo útil."
G["Ye... Yes, yes... Of course. We need only the crystals and ore from this place. There is... We will need mounts."]="Ye... Yes, yes... Of course. We need only the crystals and ore from this place. There is... We will need mounts."
G["Ye... yes, high <hic> elder?"]="S... sim, grande <hip> ancestral?"
G["Yea, Nat?"]="Sim, Nat?"
G["Yea, great. Can we leave now? This desert is giving me hives."]="Yea, great. Can we leave now? This desert is giving me hives."
G["Yea, sure. There's supposed'ta be a door here. Big whoop. Wanna fight abboudit?"]="Sim, claro. Se deveria que havia uma pos'ta aqui. E que? Que lutar por isso?"
G["Yea, that hit the spot.  Muffins for sale!  Get your fresh muffins right here!"]="Yea, that hit the spot.  Muffins for sale!  Get your fresh muffins right here!"
G["Yea, we got problems. I think that's crystal clear. The question is, what are we gonna do about it?"]="Sim, temos problemas. Acho que isso está mais que claro. A pergunta é, que vamos fazer?"
G["Yea, yea, I'm the muffin man.  You know why?  Because I sell muffins, that's why!"]="Yea, yea, I'm the muffin man.  You know why?  Because I sell muffins, that's why!"
G["Yea."]="Sim."
G["Yea... I don't know about this."]="Bom... Não estou muito certo de isto."
G["Yea?"]="Sim?"
G["Yeaaaarrrghhh!"]="Aaaarrrgghhh!"
G["Yeah mon. Let's get dis show on da road."]="Yeah mon. Let's get dis show on da road."
G["Yeah yeah, I know Dadanga dislikes smoke.  From the smell of it though, seems like Dadanga also dislikes bathing."]="Sim, sim, eu sei que Dadanga não gosta de fumar. Pelo cheiro, parece que Dadanga também não gosta de pegar banho."
G["Yeah yeah, I'll come to his rescue.\n\nDon't you fall into his little center-of-the-world hero bit though! He just likes the attention. I swear, he thinks he's going to be the next Aspect. It's laughable."]="Yeah yeah, I'll come to his rescue.\n\nDon't you fall into his little center-of-the-world hero bit though! He just likes the attention. I swear, he thinks he's going to be the next Aspect. It's laughable."
G["Yeah yeah. I'm on my way. Don't get your chain panties in a bunch."]="Sim, sim. Vou de caminho. Não te comece dos nervoso, eh?"
G["Yeah!"]="Isso!"
G["Yeah! And you'll get in trouble for that too! Now ring the bell you big baby."]="Yeah! And you'll get in trouble for that too! Now ring the bell you big baby."
G["Yeah! Fightin' time!"]="Sim! Hora de dar guerra!"
G["Yeah! Get back over your wall, you jikkety-dooks!"]="Sim! Ao outro lado da muralha, dingue!"
G["Yeah! Get sprayed!"]="Sim! Tome já!"
G["Yeah! I love this song!"]="Sim! Me encantar esta canto!"
G["Yeah! They made it! The captured sprite darters made it!"]="Yeah! They made it! The captured sprite darters made it!"
G["Yeah! Yeah. Later, man. Much later."]="Sim! Sim. Mais tarde, colega. Muito mais tarde."
G["Yeah!! BEEEEEER!"]="Sim!! CERVEEEEZA!"
G["Yeah!! BEER!"]="Sim!! CERVEJA!"
G["Yeah, I am the head of the Tiller's Union. Why do you ask?"]="Yeah, I am the head of the Tiller's Union. Why do you ask?"
G["Yeah, I could never do that. The pay's too good here."]="Yeah, I could never do that. The pay's too good here."
G["Yeah, I don't want to be here if Myzrael wakes up.  They say she has a mean temper..."]="Eh, não quero estar aqui se acorde Myzrael. Dizem que tem mal carácter..."
G["Yeah, I got it. That's weird.\n\nWho loses their river boat, cap'n?"]="Sim, já o entendo. É raro.\n\nQuem perde seu navio fluvial, capitão?"
G["Yeah, I need to drop off some things myself.  Find it by heading north up the road to Orgrimmar and then ask one of the grunts there."]="Sim, eu mesmo preciso deixar algumas coisas. Encontre-o indo para o norte, subindo a estrada para Orgrimmar e depois pergunte a um dos grunhidos."
G["Yeah, I tried to hop through that thing too."]="Sim, eu também intenté cruzar isso de um salto."
G["Yeah, I'll show you a few things. We'll see how you do, maybe you'll surprise me!"]="Sim, eu vou te mostrar algumas coisas. Vamos ver como você vai, talvez você me surpreenda!"
G["Yeah, I'm sure safety is your top priority. Give me a rocket pack."]="Sim, tenho certeza de que a segurança é sua principal prioridade. Me dê um foguete."
G["Yeah, I've heard through the grapevine that I might be seeing you sooner or later. But I don't just take on anyone, I need to make sure you have what it takes first. You willing to take my little test and find out?"]="Sim, ouvi dizer que talvez esteja vendo você mais cedo ou mais tarde. Mas não assumo ninguém, preciso ter certeza de que você tem o que é preciso primeiro. Você está disposto a fazer o meu pequeno teste e descobrir?"
G["Yeah, I... I think I can see it too."]="Yeah, I... I think I can see it too."
G["Yeah, a real party that I was actually invited to. Why does something always happen and I never get to go? I could use a drink."]="Yeah, a real party that I was actually invited to. Why does something always happen and I never get to go? I could use a drink."
G["Yeah, get him!"]="Sim, a por ele!"
G["Yeah, he did."]="Assim é."
G["Yeah, let's go now."]="Sim, vamos agora."
G["Yeah, no problem, $n! Sorry... thought you were done with it already."]="Sim, claro, $n! Sinto muito... creí que já havia terminou."
G["Yeah, okay, boss. No problem."]="Sim, vale, chefe. Não há problema."
G["Yeah, sure, go ahead and tell ol' Great-father Winter what you'd like for this Winter Veil.\n\nHo ho hurry up."]="Sim, claro, adiante, diga ao velho Grande Para Inverno que você gostaria receber este Festival de Inverno.\n\nJo, jo, jo, date pressa!"
G["Yeah, sure, go ahead and tell ol' Greatfather Winter what you'd like for this Winter Veil.\n\nHo ho hurry up."]="Sim, claro, adiante, diga ao velho Grande Para Inverno que você gostaria receber este Festival de Inverno.\n\nJo, jo, jo, date pressa!"
G["Yeah, sure. The Jade Lungfish are found about here, in the Enchanted Woods of the Lost in Jade Forest on your map. It's not the biggest pool in Pandaria, but it's majestic all its own."]="claro. Os peixe alveolares de jade se encontram por aqui, na Floresta Encantado dos Perdidos da Floresta de Jade. Não é o maior banco de Pandaria, mas é magenstuoso."
G["Yeah, sure. You just keep thinking that."]="Sim, certo. Você continua pensando isso."
G["Yeah, thanks!"]="Sim, Obrigado!"
G["Yeah, that would be Austil de Mon.  He's always hanging out in the tavern at the southeast end of town.  It's called the Gallows' End Tavern, you can't miss it."]="Sim, isso seria Austil de Mon. Ele sempre fica na taverna no extremo sudeste da cidade. Chama-se Gallows 'End Tavern, você não pode perder."
G["Yeah, that would be Austil de Mon.  You will find him standing guard near one of the meatwagons, near the inn."]="Yeah, that would be Austil de Mon.  You will find him standing guard near one of the meatwagons, near the inn."
G["Yeah, that's her you're standing on. A beaut, isn't she? The Baron set me up as the captain a while back. She's not mine originally, so I didn't name her; if you want my opinion, kid, I think the sailor who named her spent a little too much time at sea and not enough time in port, if you catch my meaning."]="Sim, é nela que você está. Uma beldade, não é? O Barão me colocou como capitão há um tempo. Ela não é minha originalmente, então eu não a nomeei; se você quer minha opinião, garoto, acho que o marinheiro que a nomeou passou muito tempo no mar e pouco tempo no porto, se você entendeu."
G["Yeah, the hut! Good idea. You go first."]="Sim, a kabanha! Boa ideia. Você primeiro."
G["Yeah, there's tons of people still trapped in the escape pods, boss. Oh, wait. I guess you're not the boss anymore. Anyways, they're all probably going to drown if you don't get them out."]="Yeah, there's tons of people still trapped in the escape pods, boss. Oh, wait. I guess you're not the boss anymore. Anyways, they're all probably going to drown if you don't get them out."
G["Yeah, we'll see who's got Garrosh's back when it counts."]="Sim, já veremos quem lhe cubre as costas quando faça falta."
G["Yeah, what do you want?  Can't you see I'm busy here?  The Shadow Council isn't paying me by the hour!"]="Sim, o que você quer? Você não vê que estou ocupado aqui? O Conselho das Sombras não está me pagando a cada hora!"
G["Yeah, yeah!  Shut yer trap and let me finish this stew!"]="Sim, sim! Cálhate e deixe-me acabar este ensopado!"
G["Yeah, yeah, I'll come join you on your adventure. Just let me play one more game first."]="Sim, sim, irei de aventuras com você, mas antes deixe-me jogar outra partida."
G["Yeah, yeah, I'm feeling better, but I kind of like it down here."]="Sim, sim, estou me sentindo melhor, mas meio que gosto daqui de baixo."
G["Yeah, yeah, you won. Big deal."]="Tá, tá, você ganhou. Grandes coisas."
G["Yeah, yeah."]="Sim, sim."
G["Yeah, yeah. Just read the discs and gimme access already..."]="Sim, sim. Lê os discos e dê-me acesso de uma vez..."
G["Yeah, yeah. When aren't we behind schedule?"]="Já, já. E quando não levamos atraso?"
G["Yeah, yeah... welcome to my station.\n\nSo, what do you think?  Pretty nifty what we've done here, wouldn't you say?\n\nMakes me glad to be rid of those stuffy elves at Sylvanaar anyway.\n\nMake yourself useful around here; there're plenty of experiments and whatnot to help out with."]="Yeah, yeah... welcome to my station.\n\nSo, what do you think?  Pretty nifty what we've done here, wouldn't you say?\n\nMakes me glad to be rid of those stuffy elves at Sylvanaar anyway.\n\nMake yourself useful around here; there're plenty of experiments and whatnot to help out with."
G["Yeah, you better run!"]="Sim, melhor sal correndo!"
G["Yeah, you hold that carrot. That's right."]="Yeah, you hold that carrot. That's right."
G["Yeah, you know a few things! If you wanna' learn more you're gonna' have to talk to Georgio Bolero in Stormwind."]="Sim, você sabe algumas coisas! Se você quiser 'aprender mais, precisará conversar com Georgio Bolero em Stormwind."
G["Yeah, you should all be more like me."]="Sim, todos deveriam ser como eu."
G["Yeah, you'll always find Clyde Kellen fishing on the bank of Brightwater Lake just east of Brill.  Just watch out for psychos wearing masks while you're out there.  We had to shut down the kids' summer camp last year."]="Sim, você sempre encontrará Clyde Kellen pescando na margem do lago Brightwater, a leste de Brill. Cuidado com os psicopatas que usam máscaras enquanto estiver lá fosse. Tivemos que encerrar o acampamento de verão das crianças no ano passado."
G["Yeah, you're a real brainiac.  Just how smart do you think you are, Slip'kik?"]="Sim, você é um verdadeiro cérebro. Quão inteligente você pensa que é, Slip'kik?"
G["Yeah, you're next. Unless someone cuts in front of you, that is."]="Você é $gel: a; seguinte! A não ser que se te cuele alguém, claro está."
G["Yeah.  We could use some more of you.  Report to the civilian liaison for work assignment."]="Yeah.  We could use some more of you.  Report to the civilian liaison for work assignment."
G["Yeah. I hope to retire next month to a little tract of land I bought off the coast of Azeroth."]="Yeah. I hope to retire next month to a little tract of land I bought off the coast of Azeroth."
G["Yeah. I taught $n everything $g he : she; knows."]="Yeah. I taught $n everything $g he : she; knows."
G["Yeah. This is pretty horrible."]="Sim. Isto é horrível."
G["Yeah..."]="Sim..."
