G["Years ago, the Grimtotem raided my village. The pain, the anger, the loss - still they weigh on my heart.\n\nAnd now I find myself giving comfort and aid to others who have lost their village to a savage attack."]="Years ago, the Grimtotem raided my village. The pain, the anger, the loss - still they weigh on my heart.\n\nAnd now I find myself giving comfort and aid to others who have lost their village to a savage attack."
