G["Yes, $t citizen : citizen;, what matter of import do you have to bring to my attention?"]="Sim, $tcidadão: cidadã;, que assunto importante requer minha atenção?"
G["Yes, Admiral."]="Sim, Almirante."
G["Yes, Anachronos. I am ready to witness your vision of the future."]="Por favor, Anachronos, estou pronto para a sua visão do futuro."
G["Yes, Augustus.  I would like to do business."]="Sim, Augusto. Eu gostaria de fazer negócios."
G["Yes, Battlemaiden?"]="Sim, dama de batalha?"
G["Yes, Bishop."]="Yes, Bishop."
G["Yes, Blackhorn. I've been sent to request your aid, if you are willing."]="Yes, Blackhorn. I've been sent to request your aid, if you are willing."
G["Yes, Bonescythe. You see, it was our tenor, an ornery fellow known as Don Julio, who got me started on the whole thing. In his travels throughout Lordaeron, Don Julio picked up many interesting skills, one of them being the ability to take the bones of fallen Scourge and fashion them into a lethal set of leather armor - perfectly suited for an assassin."]="Sim, Bonescythe. Veja bem, foi nosso tenor, um sujeito rebelde conhecido como Don Julio, que me levou a começar a coisa toda. Nas suas viagens por Lordaeron, Don Julio adquiriu muitas habilidades interessantes, uma delas a capacidade de pegar os ossos do Flagelo caído e transformá-os em um conjunto letal de armadura de couro - perfeitamente adequada para um assassino."
G["Yes, Commander Mai sent me, and I carry his evacuation orders."]="Yes, Commander Mai sent me, and I carry his evacuation orders."
G["Yes, Doctor Grapplehammer."]="Sim, doutor Martilhazos."
G["Yes, Fathom-Caller. The Mistress awaits."]="Yes, Fathom-Caller. The Mistress awaits."
G["Yes, Hamuul. And she's more dangerous than you know."]="Sim, Hamuul. E é mais perigosa do que acha."
G["Yes, Hao - our home is on Shen-zin Su's back."]="Yes, Hao - our home is on Shen-zin Su's back."
G["Yes, Hargus. I wish to purchase supplies."]="Sim, Hargus. Desejo comprar suprimentos."
G["Yes, I am one of the 'Broken'.  I trust that this does not bother you?  Broken or draenei, we must endure the ridicule that some in our society may throw at us.  A better understanding and communication with the elements of this world is all that matters."]="Sim, eu sou um dos 'Quebrados'. Eu acredito que isso não te incomoda? Quebrados ou draeneis, devemos suportar o ridículo que algum em nossa sociedade podem lançar sobre nós. Uma melhor compreensão e comunicação com os elementos deste mundo é tudo o que importa."
G["Yes, I am ready to travel to Venture Bay!"]="Sim, estou pronto para viajar para Venture Bay!"
G["Yes, I am. What's it to you?"]="Sim, eu sou. O que é isso para você?"
G["Yes, I do, though it was easier when I was younger.  These days, I have to be more careful."]="Sim, em efeito, embora era mais fácil quando era jovem. Hoje em dia devo ter mais cuidado."
G["Yes, I expected that you would be back. I sent Korra out earlier and she came across Dartol's Rod, abandoned in the forest.\n\nWe worked so hard to recover it, $n. Please take care to see that you do not handle it so carelessly in the future."]="Yes, I expected that you would be back. I sent Korra out earlier and she came across Dartol's Rod, abandoned in the forest.\n\nWe worked so hard to recover it, $n. Please take care to see that you do not handle it so carelessly in the future."
G["Yes, I feel much better.\n\nMishka and Bold Karasshi have brought me up to speed. Your arrival, your search for the White Pawn, my rescue from the hozen.\n\nThe situation is not ideal, and we have much work to do. Finding Anduin is our top priority."]="Sim, me encontro muito melhor.\n\nMishka e Karasshi o Audaz me têm posto ao tanto de tudo: seu chegada, a procurando do peão alvo, meu resgate dos hozen...\n\nA situação não é ideal e temos muito trabalho que fazer. Nossa prioridade é encontrar a Anduin."
G["Yes, I have seen the shaman you seek. Last I saw her, she was to the west of here. She hides in the hills above the Razormane tribe. If you're clever, you'll be able to find a path to her hut in the hills. It is not too far north of here. That path should allow you to find her without fighting through the quilboar."]="Sim, eu vi o xamã que você procura. A última vez que a vi, ela estava a oeste daqui. Ela se esconde nas colinas acima da tribo Navalha. Se você for esperto, poderá encontrar um caminho para a cabana dela nas colinas. Não é muito longe ao norte daqui. Esse caminho deve permitir que você a encontre sem lutar pelo quilboar."
G["Yes, I have. Teach me."]="Sim, eu tenho. Ensine-me."
G["Yes, I know of an inscription trainer in the Seat of Knowledge, in the Vale of Eternal Blossoms.\n\nLet me mark their location on your map."]="Sim, conheço a um instrutor de inscrição no Trono do Saber, no Vale da Flor Eterna.\n\nTe marcarei seu localização no mapa."
G["Yes, I know you lost your egg.\n\nHow do I know this? Because I have your egg RIGHT HERE.\n\nI will entrust this egg to you once more, but please, I deplore you, take better care of it this time."]="Yes, I know you lost your egg.\n\nHow do I know this? Because I have your egg RIGHT HERE.\n\nI will entrust this egg to you once more, but please, I deplore you, take better care of it this time."
G["Yes, I know.  And don't think I'll go easy on you."]="Sim, o sei. Mas não cria que me contendré com você."
G["Yes, I leave for Nagrand to learn from the elements there.  They have suffered and seen many of these same symptoms."]="Yes, I leave for Nagrand to learn from the elements there.  They have suffered and seen many of these same symptoms."
G["Yes, I live! No Twilight Dragon can keep this orc down."]="Sim, estou vivo! Nenhum dragão Crepúsculo pode acabar com este orc."
G["Yes, I must go on."]="Sim, devo seguir."
G["Yes, I offer training. But it's not cheap."]="Sim, ofereço treinamento. Mas não é barata."
G["Yes, I overheard someone talking about Twilight's Hammer at the party last night. I didn't see them, but they were extremely rude."]="Yes, I overheard someone talking about Twilight's Hammer at the party last night. I didn't see them, but they were extremely rude."
G["Yes, I see.  We can finally turn Deathwing's own power back against him."]="Yes, I see.  We can finally turn Deathwing's own power back against him."
G["Yes, I smell them too, Riplimb. Outsiders encroach on the Firelord's private grounds. Find their trail. Find them for me, that I may dispense punishment!"]="Yes, I smell them too, Riplimb. Outsiders encroach on the Firelord's private grounds. Find their trail. Find them for me, that I may dispense punishment!"
G["Yes, I speak a language you understand $r.  We are not animals, yet most of your kind continues to treat us as such!  Our differences though pale to the tragedy that has befallen this land.  Please, put aside your differences with my kind and hear my dying plea.\n\nI came to this land to mend what I could, and now that will be for naught unless you can aid me.  I ask for such aid with my last breaths of life."]="Yes, I speak a language you understand $r.  We are not animals, yet most of your kind continues to treat us as such!  Our differences though pale to the tragedy that has befallen this land.  Please, put aside your differences with my kind and hear my dying plea.\n\nI came to this land to mend what I could, and now that will be for naught unless you can aid me.  I ask for such aid with my last breaths of life."
G["Yes, I think I remember now...."]="Sim, acho que já lembrança..."
G["Yes, I think you have potential. Maybe I can show you a thing or two."]="Sim, acho que você tem potencial. Talvez eu possa lhe mostrar uma coisa ou duas."
G["Yes, I was able to reseal the relic, $n."]="Yes, I was able to reseal the relic, $n."
G["Yes, I will deliver the orders to Warmaster Garrick!"]="Yes, I will deliver the orders to Warmaster Garrick!"
G["Yes, I'd like to purchase a ride down to the Ghostlands."]="Sim, eu gostaria de comprar uma carona até as Ghostlands."
