G["Yes, Malorne was consort to the moon goddess herself, the one the night elves call \"Elune.\" From their union was born Cenarius, the patron god of all druids and one of the most powerful creatures ever to walk upon Azeroth.\n\nBut listen to me, I ramble on.\n\nMalorne is an incredible force of nature, but he only interacts with the mortal races in times of dire trouble. Have you heard about his deeds during the War of the Ancients?"]="Yes, Malorne was consort to the moon goddess herself, the one the night elves call \"Elune.\" From their union was born Cenarius, the patron god of all druids and one of the most powerful creatures ever to walk upon Azeroth.\n\nBut listen to me, I ramble on.\n\nMalorne is an incredible force of nature, but he only interacts with the mortal races in times of dire trouble. Have you heard about his deeds during the War of the Ancients?"
