G["Yes, there is a fishing supplies vendor downstairs, on the first level of The Summer Terrace.\n\nI will mark the location on your map."]="Sim, há um vendedor de suprimentos de pesca no piso de baixo, no primeiro nível do Bancal do Verão.\n\nTe marcarei seu localização no mapa."
G["Yes, there is a fishing supplies vendor inside the hall of tranquility. Please be quiet so as to not ruin a catch!\n\nI will mark the location on your map."]="Yes, there is a fishing supplies vendor inside the hall of tranquility. Please be quiet so as to not ruin a catch!\n\nI will mark the location on your map."
G["Yes, there is a vendor of herbs in the city. Hafuna Landwalker can be found in the chamber of masters, to the left as you enter the building.\n\nI will mark the location on your map."]="Sim, há um vendedor de ervas na cidade. Pode encontrar a Hafuna Andarilho Terrestre na Câmera dos Mestres, nada mais entrar no edifício, à esquerda.\n\nTe marcarei seu localização no mapa."
G["Yes, there is a vendor of herbs in the city. Tommy Tinkerspade can be found in the crafter's hall, to the left as you enter the building.\n\nI will mark the location on your map."]="Sim, há um vendedor de ervas na cidade. Pode encontrar a Tommy Palahonda na salão do artesão, nada mais entrar no edifício, à esquerda.\n\nTe marcarei seu localização no mapa."
G["Yes, these will do quite nicely. They feel almost as if they were meant for me all along."]="Yes, these will do quite nicely. They feel almost as if they were meant for me all along."
G["Yes, they are at fault, but I am powerless to stop them. Will you warn the people of Tunka'lo, stranger, that their past and their ancestors are in danger?"]="Yes, they are at fault, but I am powerless to stop them. Will you warn the people of Tunka'lo, stranger, that their past and their ancestors are in danger?"
G["Yes, they're right here. Let's go."]="Sim, aqui estão. Vamos."
G["Yes, this is the beginning. I've been waiting for you, young prince. I am Mal'Ganis."]="Sim, este é o início. Te tenho estado esperando, jovem Príncipe. Sou Mal'Ganis."
G["Yes, this is the spot."]="Sim, este é o lugar."
G["Yes, this is unfortunate."]="Sim, é inoportuno."
G["Yes, this one should advance my studies nicely...."]="Yes, this one should advance my studies nicely...."
G["Yes, this will definitely burn too hot.  Do you want to blow up the ship?  Cut back on remora oil next time."]="Sim, definitivamente este se queima a temperaturas demais altas. É que que fazer saltar o navio pelos aires? A próxima vez reduz a quantidade de óleo de rêmora."
G["Yes, traveler?"]="Sim viajante?"
G["Yes, unless I have anything to do with it."]="Sim, a menos que tenha algo que fazer com elho."
G["Yes, warchief."]="Sim, Chefe de Guerra."
G["Yes, we can pay."]="Sim, podemos pagar."
G["Yes, we said you can stay here, but this building is our headquarters! All of our manuals and blueprints are stored here!"]="Yes, we said you can stay here, but this building is our headquarters! All of our manuals and blueprints are stored here!"
G["Yes, we shall ascend beyond the mere trappings of our mortal coil and attain the power that were promised to us by Sargeras so long ago."]="Yes, we shall ascend beyond the mere trappings of our mortal coil and attain the power that were promised to us by Sargeras so long ago."
G["Yes, we shall!"]="Sim!"
G["Yes, we will handle this our own way."]="Sim. O faremos a nossa maneira."
G["Yes, weakling... beg Lurid for life!"]="Yes, weakling... beg Lurid for life!"
G["Yes, well, listen here, $c. I'm older than I look and wise beyond my years. You'd do well not to question me so much.\nLook, you don't need to take my word for it. Read the postings on any local bulletin board for yourself. I'm everywhere!\n\nJust do yourself a favor and ignore the ones with 'WANTED' in the title. Simple misunderstandings, I assure you."]="Yes, well, listen here, $c. I'm older than I look and wise beyond my years. You'd do well not to question me so much.\nLook, you don't need to take my word for it. Read the postings on any local bulletin board for yourself. I'm everywhere!\n\nJust do yourself a favor and ignore the ones with 'WANTED' in the title. Simple misunderstandings, I assure you."
G["Yes, well... it's not like Suna to run off by herself."]="Yes, well... it's not like Suna to run off by herself."
G["Yes, well... luckily for us all, the troll will not be in a position of power within our fair city anytime soon."]="Yes, well... luckily for us all, the troll will not be in a position of power within our fair city anytime soon."
G["Yes, well...let's head on to the monument dedicated to the heroes of the two Great Wars, the Valley of Heroes. Follow me."]="Yes, well...let's head on to the monument dedicated to the heroes of the two Great Wars, the Valley of Heroes. Follow me."
G["Yes, yes my son is quite powerful... but I have powers of my own!"]="Sim, sim, meu primogénito é bastante poderoso... mas eu tenho meus próprios poderes!"
G["Yes, yes!"]="Sim, sim!"
G["Yes, yes! I want more!"]="Sim, sim! Quero mais!"
G["Yes, yes! Very interesting! Perhaps I could distill it into a new power source?"]="Yes, yes! Very interesting! Perhaps I could distill it into a new power source?"
G["Yes, yes, I am given to understand that the ley line has already been diverted. I will wait no longer... summon Goramosh this instant!"]="Yes, yes, I am given to understand that the ley line has already been diverted. I will wait no longer... summon Goramosh this instant!"
G["Yes, yes, I haven't forgotten Hyjal, or Silithus, or the march of the Legion, or every other damnable confrontation the 7th Legion has faced. It... I don't want the soldiers to hear this, Two-bit, but for the first time in my life..."]="Yes, yes, I haven't forgotten Hyjal, or Silithus, or the march of the Legion, or every other damnable confrontation the 7th Legion has faced. It... I don't want the soldiers to hear this, Two-bit, but for the first time in my life..."
G["Yes, yes, I'll train you. There's no need to raise your voice."]="Yes, yes, I'll train you. There's no need to raise your voice."
G["Yes, yes, I'm quite certain this represents a melding of entities. Fascinating."]="Yes, yes, I'm quite certain this represents a melding of entities. Fascinating."
G["Yes, yes, a thousand times, yes already!"]="Sim, sim, mil vezes que sim!"
G["Yes, yes, all of the Horde's and Alliance's war materiel is being shipped over to Silithus and should be there within $2113w days. Do you know what happens then, $c? We hurry up and wait. Hopefully someone is gathering the pieces of the Scepter of the Shifting Sands, because in order to open the gates of Ahn'Qiraj it needs to be rung against the gong on the Scarab Dais."]="Yes, yes, all of the Horde's and Alliance's war materiel is being shipped over to Silithus and should be there within $2113w days. Do you know what happens then, $c? We hurry up and wait. Hopefully someone is gathering the pieces of the Scepter of the Shifting Sands, because in order to open the gates of Ahn'Qiraj it needs to be rung against the gong on the Scarab Dais."
G["Yes, yes, all of the Horde's and Alliance's war materiel is being shipped over to Silithus and should be there within a day. Do you know what happens then, $c? We hurry up and wait. Hopefully someone is gathering the pieces of the Scepter of the Shifting Sands, because in order to open the gates of Ahn'Qiraj it needs to be rung against the gong on the Scarab Dais."]="Yes, yes, all of the Horde's and Alliance's war materiel is being shipped over to Silithus and should be there within a day. Do you know what happens then, $c? We hurry up and wait. Hopefully someone is gathering the pieces of the Scepter of the Shifting Sands, because in order to open the gates of Ahn'Qiraj it needs to be rung against the gong on the Scarab Dais."
G["Yes, yes, calm down, $c, there's nothing to worry about. As luck would have it, when you first gave the left piece to me, I attuned myself to it, so summoning it back from wherever you 'misplaced' it is really not a problem.\n\nHere, and this time try to take better care of it."]="Yes, yes, calm down, $c, there's nothing to worry about. As luck would have it, when you first gave the left piece to me, I attuned myself to it, so summoning it back from wherever you 'misplaced' it is really not a problem.\n\nHere, and this time try to take better care of it."
G["Yes, yes, everything will be fine! Wonderful, in fact. She'll be better than ever!"]="Yes, yes, everything will be fine! Wonderful, in fact. She'll be better than ever!"
G["Yes, yes, that's all very interesting, but as you can see here, we're in a fight for our lives, and these pygmies are the least of our problems compared to what's inside that cave!\n\nWhere's my worthless assistant when I need her the most? Probably off being lazy somewhere and complaining that no one asks her how her day is going...."]="Yes, yes, that's all very interesting, but as you can see here, we're in a fight for our lives, and these pygmies are the least of our problems compared to what's inside that cave!\n\nWhere's my worthless assistant when I need her the most? Probably off being lazy somewhere and complaining that no one asks her how her day is going...."
G["Yes, yes, very good..."]="Sim, sim, muito bem..."
G["Yes, yes, we should do whatever we can to help them."]="Sim, sim, deveríamos fazer tudo o que possamos para ajudá-los."
G["Yes, yes, yes...no, no, no no no! Yes! No! Peppers!"]="Sim, sim, sim... Não, não, não, não, não, não! Sim! Não! Pimentos!"
G["Yes, yes. Definitely needs more..."]="Sim, sim. É evidente O que precisa mais..."
G["Yes, yes. Hmm, it seems to cross reference another tome. Guess I have to find that one too."]="Yes, yes. Hmm, it seems to cross reference another tome. Guess I have to find that one too."
G["Yes, yes. I see you.\n\nBe on your way. You may have earned the trust of a few, but it will take more than that to prove it to me!"]="Yes, yes. I see you.\n\nBe on your way. You may have earned the trust of a few, but it will take more than that to prove it to me!"
G["Yes, yes. That happens."]="Yes, yes. That happens."
G["Yes, yes... another! Your will is mine!"]="Sim, sim... outro! Seu vontade me pertence!"
G["Yes, you heard true, $c, all of our collections are complete and the last of the war materiel should arrive in Silithus within $2113w days. I am told that once all is assembled there, and our troops readied, someone from within the ranks of you heroes is going to ring the gong outside of Ahn'Qiraj, already having assembled the Scepter of the Shifting Sands to do so with. I hope that we don't have to wait too long for that to happen."]="Yes, you heard true, $c, all of our collections are complete and the last of the war materiel should arrive in Silithus within $2113w days. I am told that once all is assembled there, and our troops readied, someone from within the ranks of you heroes is going to ring the gong outside of Ahn'Qiraj, already having assembled the Scepter of the Shifting Sands to do so with. I hope that we don't have to wait too long for that to happen."
G["Yes, you heard true, $c, all of our collections are complete and the last of the war materiel should arrive in Silithus within a day. I am told that once all is assembled there, and our troops readied, someone from within the ranks of you heroes is going to ring the gong outside of Ahn'Qiraj, already having assembled the Scepter of the Shifting Sands to do so with. I hope that we don't have to wait too long for that to happen."]="Yes, you heard true, $c, all of our collections are complete and the last of the war materiel should arrive in Silithus within a day. I am told that once all is assembled there, and our troops readied, someone from within the ranks of you heroes is going to ring the gong outside of Ahn'Qiraj, already having assembled the Scepter of the Shifting Sands to do so with. I hope that we don't have to wait too long for that to happen."
G["Yes, you move like my son. You have his broad shoulders - ahh, and your mother's fierce eyes."]="Yes, you move like my son. You have his broad shoulders - ahh, and your mother's fierce eyes."
G["Yes, you'll stay with us now..."]="Sim, te quedarás conosco..."
G["Yes, you're well seasoned in your field of work.  Report to the civilian liaison at once, we need more like you!"]="Yes, you're well seasoned in your field of work.  Report to the civilian liaison at once, we need more like you!"
G["Yes, young one, you need not convince me of such things, the Warchief and I have much history. Your dedication, however, is noted.\n\nAs I was saying, Rend had found a new home for his people, and I was among those who would wearily follow.\n\nFrom one conflict arose others... countless others. It was in those battles for Blackrock Spire between the Blackrock clan and the Dark Iron dwarves that my sons were both slain. It was then that I realized my time among the Blackrock clan had come to an end."]="Yes, young one, you need not convince me of such things, the Warchief and I have much history. Your dedication, however, is noted.\n\nAs I was saying, Rend had found a new home for his people, and I was among those who would wearily follow.\n\nFrom one conflict arose others... countless others. It was in those battles for Blackrock Spire between the Blackrock clan and the Dark Iron dwarves that my sons were both slain. It was then that I realized my time among the Blackrock clan had come to an end."
G["Yes, your eminence. Come on!"]="Sim, seu eminência. Adiante!"
G["Yes, your majesty.  The Sword of Ramkahen casts its vote in favor of war.  Your armies are standing at the ready."]="Sim, seu majestade. A Lâmina de Ramkahen vota a favor da guerra. Seus exércitos estão prontos para o combate."
G["Yes."]="Sim."
G["Yes.\n\nThat sounds like a good idea."]="Sim.\n\nParece uma boa ideia."
G["Yes.  Do you have a raptor that can take me there?"]="Sim. Tem um raptores que possa me levar ali?"
G["Yes.  Give me the spell to summon the avatar."]="Sim. Dê-me o feitiço para evocar o avatar."
G["Yes.  Just... just show mercy to the egg."]="Sim... Somente te pido que tenha piedade com o ovo."
G["Yes.  Please prepare the portal, Arman."]="Sim. Por favor, prepare o portal, Arman."
G["Yes.  Please prepare the portal, Erallier."]="Sim. Por favor, prepare o portal, Eralhier."
G["Yes.  Towards the falls.  I tried to convince him to get his wounds treated, but he just ignored me."]="Yes.  Towards the falls.  I tried to convince him to get his wounds treated, but he just ignored me."
G["Yes.  We'll need his expertise with a crossbow when the final battle comes."]="Sim. Quando chegue o momentos, nos fará falta seu aptidão com a balhesta."
G["Yes. $n. I have located the Forest Lord. We must redouble our efforts! More crystals are needed!"]="Yes. $n. I have located the Forest Lord. We must redouble our efforts! More crystals are needed!"
G["Yes. And now, with your permission, I would like to ask for your daughter's hand."]="Sim. E agora, com o seu permissão, gostaria pedir a mão do seu filha."
G["Yes. Do your best to return in one piece."]="Sim. Faça o que possa por voltar de uma peça."
G["Yes. Don't go near it!"]="Yes. Don't go near it!"
G["Yes. Fight and you may die. Run and you will live, but for how long?  The devils are upon us!  And those not here, dying in their villages weeks from now, would they be willing to trade all the days from this day to that, for one chance to come here and stop these horrors from invading our world?"]="Yes. Fight and you may die. Run and you will live, but for how long?  The devils are upon us!  And those not here, dying in their villages weeks from now, would they be willing to trade all the days from this day to that, for one chance to come here and stop these horrors from invading our world?"
G["Yes. Go on."]="claro. Adiante."
G["Yes. He has been called upon to help the aspects with their efforts at Wyrmrest. He wishes to aid them in cleansing Azeroth of Deathwing's menace.\n\nMay the Light guide his path."]="Sim. Se lhe convocado para ajudar aos aspectos com os seus esforços no Repouso do Dragão. Deseja ajudá-los a limpar Azeroth da ameaça de Alamuerte.\n\nQue a Luz guíe seu caminho!"
G["Yes. He hasn't been the same since the attack on Tempest Keep."]="Sim. Não voltou a ser o mesmo desdo ataque no Castelo da Tempestade."
G["Yes. Highness! We will prepare $n for the coming battle!"]="Sim. Alteza! Prepararemos a $n para a batalha que se aproxima!"
G["Yes. Horde is Horde."]="Sim. A Horda é a Horda."
G["Yes. I do."]="Sim. Eu faço."
G["Yes. I have."]="Sim. Eu tenho."
G["Yes. I knew that she could do it. She is shy, but she is strong.\n\nI shall finish my business here. Then I shall join her."]="Yes. I knew that she could do it. She is shy, but she is strong.\n\nI shall finish my business here. Then I shall join her."
G["Yes. I'd love a refill. Fetch one and be quick about it."]="Sim. Eu adoraria um refil. Pegue um e seja rápido."
G["Yes. My scouts learned all about this one.\"Warlord Zaela.\" Bring her proto-drake down and the rest of the Dragonmaw will crumble."]="Yes. My scouts learned all about this one.\"Warlord Zaela.\" Bring her proto-drake down and the rest of the Dragonmaw will crumble."
G["Yes. Please take me to Vashj'ir."]="Sim. Leve-me a Vashj'ir, por favor."
G["Yes. Suna's tracks stop here. We won't leave until we find her."]="Yes. Suna's tracks stop here. We won't leave until we find her."
G["Yes. That did the trick."]="Sim. Isso bastó."
G["Yes. The Sha of Hatred has been through here."]="Sim. O Sha do ódio tem passado por aqui."
G["Yes. The defense of Stoneplow currently rests on me, Guard-Captain Oakenshield, and three others of our order. As we speak, those three Shado-Pan are standing at the foot of the wall, waiting to defend against the next wave of attackers. This is our charge - to protect Pandaria from the enemies that the common people have all but forgotten about.\n\nWhile our numbers here in Stoneplow are few, we do not expect reinforcements from Kun Lai... unless this situation gets worse. Say, for example, if that weak spot in the wall crumbled."]="Yes. The defense of Stoneplow currently rests on me, Guard-Captain Oakenshield, and three others of our order. As we speak, those three Shado-Pan are standing at the foot of the wall, waiting to defend against the next wave of attackers. This is our charge - to protect Pandaria from the enemies that the common people have all but forgotten about.\n\nWhile our numbers here in Stoneplow are few, we do not expect reinforcements from Kun Lai... unless this situation gets worse. Say, for example, if that weak spot in the wall crumbled."
G["Yes. The payment for the demons' service was to drink from the energy of this place."]="Sim. O pagamento pelos serviços do demônio era beber da energia deste lugar."
G["Yes. They are even more beautiful without your reflection in them."]="Sim. E são ainda mais bonitos sem seu reflexo."
G["Yes. This is just the opportunity the Alliance needs. We'll use the trolls as a diversion while the main Alliance fleet assembles. You get what I'm saying, Sully?"]="Yes. This is just the opportunity the Alliance needs. We'll use the trolls as a diversion while the main Alliance fleet assembles. You get what I'm saying, Sully?"
G["Yes. This weather is not natural."]="Certo. Este clima não é natural."
G["Yes. Those are pandaren, Moni."]="Sim, são pandaren, Moni."
G["Yes. We are prepared for the challenges ahead of us."]="Sim. Estamos preparados para os desafios que temos pela linha de frente."
G["Yes. We regrouped east of the pass and prepared a counter-attack, but the next day, the skies reddened and the land was cleaved in two, as easily as a child might split open a cactus apple. See how the devastation stretches from horizon to horizon?\n\nOur Alliance foes in their makeshift bunkers were as surprised and disorganized as we were by the disaster. It would've been the perfect time to strike! But Warlord Gar'dul insisted we pull back to the south to refortify.\n\n<Kilrok spits on the ground.>\n\nNot all of us followed. I stood toe-to-toe with demons in the last war, $n. I'm not about to turn tail and let the Alliance plant roots on my soil."]="Yes. We regrouped east of the pass and prepared a counter-attack, but the next day, the skies reddened and the land was cleaved in two, as easily as a child might split open a cactus apple. See how the devastation stretches from horizon to horizon?\n\nOur Alliance foes in their makeshift bunkers were as surprised and disorganized as we were by the disaster. It would've been the perfect time to strike! But Warlord Gar'dul insisted we pull back to the south to refortify.\n\n<Kilrok spits on the ground.>\n\nNot all of us followed. I stood toe-to-toe with demons in the last war, $n. I'm not about to turn tail and let the Alliance plant roots on my soil."
G["Yes. You rescued me while I was still within my egg, and I owe you my life."]="Yes. You rescued me while I was still within my egg, and I owe you my life."
G["Yes. Your son, Ku-Mo, has been looking for you."]="Sim. Seu filho, Ku-Mo, você estado procurando."
G["Yes.. spill more of their blood! It draws me nearer to this place!"]="Yes.. spill more of their blood! It draws me nearer to this place!"
G["Yes..."]="Sim..."
G["Yes... Gul'dan..."]="Sim... Gul'dan..."
G["Yes... I am... empowered."]="Sim... tenho... o poder."
G["Yes... I have done terrible things, but nothing could ever be as terrible as lending aid to the Forsaken."]="Yes... I have done terrible things, but nothing could ever be as terrible as lending aid to the Forsaken."
G["Yes... I sense Vordrassil's magic... free of any perceivable taint.\n\nPlease!  You must allow me to help you.  Fate brought me here, perhaps I can serve a purpose yet!"]="Yes... I sense Vordrassil's magic... free of any perceivable taint.\n\nPlease!  You must allow me to help you.  Fate brought me here, perhaps I can serve a purpose yet!"
G["Yes... Let the rage consume you!"]="Sim... De que a rabia te consumo!"
G["Yes... Report to the Plains of Nasam, my children..."]="Sim… Presentaos nas Planícies de Nasam, filhos meus..."
G["Yes... Run... Run to meet your destiny... Its bitter, cold embrace, awaits you."]="Sim... Corre... Corre cima seu destino... Seu amargo e frio abraço te espera."
G["Yes... Well enough for the elements that are here, but the cipher is known to another... The spirits of fire are in turmoil... If this force is not stopped, the world where these mortals came from will cease."]="Yes... Well enough for the elements that are here, but the cipher is known to another... The spirits of fire are in turmoil... If this force is not stopped, the world where these mortals came from will cease."
G["Yes... Yes we move now... Please no hurt us..."]="Yes... Yes we move now... Please no hurt us..."
G["Yes... Yes... the words. The words of damnation. The words spoken by the dark one. Your master."]="Sim... Sim..., as palavras. As palavras da maldição. As palavras pronunciadas pelo sombrio, seu mestre."
G["Yes... a target of great importance."]="Sim... Com um objetivo importantes."
G["Yes... and the raccoon. I will watch over our commander."]="Yes... and the raccoon. I will watch over our commander."
G["Yes... cast your precious little spells, ak-a-ak!"]="Sim... evocar seus preciosos hechicitos, ak-a-ak!"
G["Yes... he shall suit our needs perfectly.  Have him sent to Solstice Village when you're ready.  Arthas will not be pleased if we fall behind schedule."]="Yes... he shall suit our needs perfectly.  Have him sent to Solstice Village when you're ready.  Arthas will not be pleased if we fall behind schedule."
G["Yes... master."]="Sim... mestre."
G["Yes... new test subjects!"]="Yes... new test subjects!"
G["Yes... of course."]="Sim... claro."
G["Yes... perhaps that is for the best. I like what I've seen of them, and it sounds as though their world could use my help."]="Yes... perhaps that is for the best. I like what I've seen of them, and it sounds as though their world could use my help."
G["Yes... pop. Sorry I got me head all snared by that thing."]="Yes... pop. Sorry I got me head all snared by that thing."
G["Yes... the power should be mine!"]="Sim... O poder deveria ser meu!"
G["Yes... this must be it. We're headed the right way."]="Sim... Isto deve ser. Vamos na direção correta."
G["Yes... this will do nicely."]="Sim... isto servirá."
G["Yes... we are fighters. But we come from a violent land. We fought off demons, we fought off death, we even fought against the very end of the world!"]="Yes... we are fighters. But we come from a violent land. We fought off demons, we fought off death, we even fought against the very end of the world!"
G["Yes... what do you want, $r? Can't you see I am busy here?"]="Sim... que que, $r? Não vê que estou ocupado?"
G["Yes... why don't you \"escort\" me out of here."]="Sim... por que não me \"batedores\" fosse de aqui?"
G["Yes... yes $c. It's all true. I am not ashamed. The powers I submit to make mortal kings look like insects."]="Yes... yes $c. It's all true. I am not ashamed. The powers I submit to make mortal kings look like insects."
G["Yes... yes I can see now...I can see the future of this world...a world ruled by the horde...MY horde."]="Yes... yes I can see now...I can see the future of this world...a world ruled by the horde...MY horde."
G["Yes... yes!"]="Sim... sim!"
G["Yes... yes, I believe you will do. I will see you again shortly, $p."]="Sim... sim, acho que valdrás. Volveremos a vernos pronto, $p."
G["Yes... yes, it's me..."]="Sim... sim, sou eu..."
G["Yes...YES. I can feel the raw power of the Well of Eternity! It is time to end this charade!"]="Sim... Sim! Sinto o poder selvagem do Poço da Eternidade! É hora de acabar com esta farsa!"
G["Yes...join us!"]="Sim... junte-se a nós!"
G["Yes...yes! I can feel his burning eyes upon me, he is close...so close! And then your world will be unmade, your lives as nothing!"]="Yes...yes! I can feel his burning eyes upon me, he is close...so close! And then your world will be unmade, your lives as nothing!"
G["Yes?"]="Sim?"
G["Yes?  Darn it all, now I'll have to start over from scratch!"]="Sim? Droga, agora vou ter que começar do zero!"
G["Yes?  What do you want?"]="Sim? O que você quer?"
G["Yes?  What is it?"]="Sim? O que é isso?"
G["Yes? I have a breastplate to finish so this had better be good."]="Sim? Eu tenho um peitoral para terminar, então é melhor que seja bom."
G["Yes? The Arch Druid is resting.\n\nI am sure he appreciates your visit, but it is best not to disturb him."]="Sim? O Arquidruida está descansando.\n\nEstou certo de que lhe agrada seu visite, mas é melhor não molestarle agora."
G["Yes? What brings you to Theren-Dion?"]="Sim, que te traz por Theren-Dion?"
G["Yes? What is it?"]="Sim? O que é isso?"
G["Yes? What is it?\n\nTime waits for no one!"]="Sim? Que acontece?\n\nO tempo não espera a ninguém!"
G["Yesh, Brom here's the love of my life.  We're two peash in a pod, even if he's a lightweight!"]="Yesh, Brom here's the love of my life.  We're two peash in a pod, even if he's a lightweight!"
G["Yesh, it'sh true, I'm blind as a bat! An' drunk as a ... err, drunk as shomething that getsh drunk.\n\nI'll tell you what, $r. It'sh the drink that keeps me shenses sharp. It'sh common knowledge that when you lose a shense, yer other shenses become more alert. My drunk shense is incredible these days."]="Yesh, it'sh true, I'm blind as a bat! An' drunk as a ... err, drunk as shomething that getsh drunk.\n\nI'll tell you what, $r. It'sh the drink that keeps me shenses sharp. It'sh common knowledge that when you lose a shense, yer other shenses become more alert. My drunk shense is incredible these days."
G["Yess. The Tidehunter will be pleased at this development. The Firelord's hold will weaken."]="Yess. The Tidehunter will be pleased at this development. The Firelord's hold will weaken."
G["Yessir! My grandfather left me this farm. Just moved in the other day. Nice to meet you, neighbor!"]="Yessir! My grandfather left me this farm. Just moved in the other day. Nice to meet you, neighbor!"
G["Yessir, those stormsnouts pack quite a punch."]="Sim senhor, esses morrotormenta não são lodo de peru."
