G["Yesss... Guards, come to your lord's aid!"]="Sssí... Guardas, venham em ajuda do seu senhor!"
G["Yesss... Yesss... Ssset me freee..."]="Yesss... Yesss... Ssset me freee..."
G["Yesss...ssssuccumb to the venom..."]="Yesss...ssssuccumb to the venom..."
G["Yessss! Defeat him, Overseer!"]="Ssssí! Véncelo, sobrestante!"
