G["Yessssssss!  Kill them!  Kill them all!"]="Sssssssssí! Mátalos! Mátalos a todos!"
G["Yesterday's sundown celebration went a little long, you see. We may have... overmeditated."]="Yesterday's sundown celebration went a little long, you see. We may have... overmeditated."
G["Yesterday, today, tomorrow...you and your serpent act as one."]="Ontem, hoje, manhã. Seu dragão e você são um."
G["Yet I am a true servant of the warchief and he does not grant boons lightly. His wisdom guides my hammer."]="Mas sou um leal súbdito do Chefe de Guerra e não concede favores à leve. Seu bom juízo guia meu martelo."
G["Yet soon we turned on each other.  Brother fought brother to decide who was the mightiest."]="Yet soon we turned on each other.  Brother fought brother to decide who was the mightiest."
G["Yet they fell to the lure of Sargeras' evil - and now they have become our most stalwart enemies."]="Mas cayeron na atracção do mal de Sargeras – e agora se têm convertido em nossos inimigos mais acérrimos."
G["Yet what? What is it, Oronok?"]="Ainda o que? O que é isso, Oronok?"
G["Yet you persevere, as we all must. In these times, no one is a stranger to the virtue of tenacity. In the face of despair and hatred, we continue to stand true to our beliefs and fight on."]="Yet you persevere, as we all must. In these times, no one is a stranger to the virtue of tenacity. In the face of despair and hatred, we continue to stand true to our beliefs and fight on."
G["Yet you think that recovering Ashbringer will somehow turn the tide of battle? Let me let you in on a little secret, Commander: The power of the Ashbringer came from the man who would wield it... I was there, Commander. I watched him burn legions of undead in righteous fire before he would even unsheathe the blade. Alas, your grasp on history is ... lacking."]="Yet you think that recovering Ashbringer will somehow turn the tide of battle? Let me let you in on a little secret, Commander: The power of the Ashbringer came from the man who would wield it... I was there, Commander. I watched him burn legions of undead in righteous fire before he would even unsheathe the blade. Alas, your grasp on history is ... lacking."
G["Yet, I have witnessed that your actions speak of no evil."]="Yet, I have witnessed that your actions speak of no evil."
G["Yet? Yet what??"]="Yet? Yet what??"
G["Yi-Mo will be fine for right now, we gotta take care of these nasties first!"]="Yi-Mo will be fine for right now, we gotta take care of these nasties first!"
