G["Yiiipe!"]="Yiiipii!"
G["Yikes!  Someone call the fire marshal!  Medic!!!  Is there a doctor in the house?"]="Yikes!  Someone call the fire marshal!  Medic!!!  Is there a doctor in the house?"
G["Yikes! That stings!"]="Ay! Isso escuece!"
G["Yikes! Two fiery personalities. You'll have many arguments, but your love will burn just as hot!"]="Yikes! Two fiery personalities. You'll have many arguments, but your love will burn just as hot!"
G["Yikes, $p, don't manhandle the thing. Have you never picked an herb before?"]="$p, Ouça, não a manosees. É que nunca pegou ervas?"
G["Yikes."]="Ups."
