G["Yo! Big lady! You think you're big enough to handle me?"]="Yo! Big lady! You think you're big enough to handle me?"
G["Yo! Have you heard about the Steamwheedle Fighting Circuit?\nYou can find Arena Organizers selling the arena team charters in Gadgetzan and outside the arenas in Nagrand and the Blade's Edge Mountains."]="Yo! Have you heard about the Steamwheedle Fighting Circuit?\nYou can find Arena Organizers selling the arena team charters in Gadgetzan and outside the arenas in Nagrand and the Blade's Edge Mountains."
G["Yo! I'm Kall Worthaton, Bilgewater Trikes.\n\nGo ahead, look over the lot. Pick out the trike that you REALLY want!\n\nA trike that's a blast to ride... a trike that's dangerous and death-defying... a trike you can be PROUD of!\n\nYou let me know when you see it, and we'll make a deal."]="Yo! I'm Kall Worthaton, Bilgewater Trikes.\n\nGo ahead, look over the lot. Pick out the trike that you REALLY want!\n\nA trike that's a blast to ride... a trike that's dangerous and death-defying... a trike you can be PROUD of!\n\nYou let me know when you see it, and we'll make a deal."
G["Yo! I'm here representing the Crown Chemical Company.\n\nYou looking for a gift? A job? Maybe a little something for yourself? Well, you've come to the right place, friend.\n\nIf I don't have what you need, our mascot Kwee or the Lovely Merchant beside me will."]="Eh! Venho em representação de Químicos A Coroa, S. L.\n\nCaso um presente? Um trabalho? Algo para você? Bom, tem vindo ao lugar adequado, $gamigo: amiga;.\n\nSe não tenho o que atenção, nossa ajudante Kwee ou a mercador preciosa a meu lado o terão."
G["Yo! You look like a $g man : woman; of discerning tastes.\n\nWhat can I do you for?"]="Yo! You look like a $g man : woman; of discerning tastes.\n\nWhat can I do you for?"
G["Yo, I know you before. You help me, yes?"]="Colega, eu te konoce de antes. Você me ajuda, sim?"
G["Yo-ho-ho, and a bottle of gnomish spirits!"]="Jo, jo, jo e uma garrafa de walfarina gnômica!"
G["Yo."]="/oi"
