G["Yo.\n\nYou lookin' for a lost companion?"]="Hey.\n\nCaso a um companheiro perdido?"
G["Yo. I'm Vixton Pinchwhistle, official Arena Vendor for the Steamwheedle Fighting Circuit. If you've got the rep, I've got the goods that'll make your mouth water."]="Ei. Sou Vixton Pinchwhistle, fornecedor oficial da Arena para o circuito de combate Steamwheedle. Se você tem o representante, eu tenho as mercadorias que lhe darão água na boca."
G["Yo. Lookin' to get back to the Old World? Fly to Tirisfal Glades in style on the Cloudkisser."]="Ei. Procurando voltar ao Velho Mundo? Voe para Tirisfal Glades em grande estilo no Cloudkisser."
G["Yo. Looking for a ride to Vengeance Landing? The Wild Wench flies back and forth, day and night."]="Yo. Looking for a ride to Vengeance Landing? The Wild Wench flies back and forth, day and night."
G["Yo. They weren't sure this elevator would be workin' in time, so they called me and my brother in. You need a ride up?"]="Yo. They weren't sure this elevator would be workin' in time, so they called me and my brother in. You need a ride up?"
G["Yo. Up for a little target practice?"]="Ei. Quer um pouco de prática de tiro o objetivo?"
G["Yogg-Saron is here? It sounds like we really will have our hands full then."]="Yogg-Saron está aqui? Então parece que vamos estar ocupados."
