G["You ain't doin' nothin' of de sort, shadow hunter. De Echo Isles are MINE!"]="You ain't doin' nothin' of de sort, shadow hunter. De Echo Isles are MINE!"
G["You ain't foolin' nobody, ghosty! I can see right through you!"]="You ain't foolin' nobody, ghosty! I can see right through you!"
G["You ain't got dah right to keep us captive!"]="Não tem direito a encerrah'nos!"
