G["You are a lifesaver, $c. I will have your hops delivered to Halfhill right away."]="You are a lifesaver, $c. I will have your hops delivered to Halfhill right away."
G["You are a little gnat to the Foulweald!  Die!"]="É um mosquitajo para os Maderiza! Morre!"
G["You are a most effective fighter, $n!"]="You are a most effective fighter, $n!"
G["You are a most welcome sight, son of Malorne!  We  must preserve your power so you can spearhead the attack against the Firelord."]="É mais que bem-vindo, filho de Malorne! Devemos preservar seu poder para que possa dirigir o ataque contra o Senhor do Fogo."
G["You are a pawn of forces unseen."]="É um peão de forças invisíveis."
G["You are a reasonable man, blood guard. Where would you turn if your kin went missing?"]="You are a reasonable man, blood guard. Where would you turn if your kin went missing?"
G["You are a sick, sick orc, Ut."]="É um orc muito enfermo, Ut."
G["You are a subject of the Horde. Remember your obligations and oaths. By the Warchief's command we must slay these night elves."]="É um súbdito da Horda. Não esqueça seus obligações e juramentos. Por ordem do Chefe de Guerra, devemos acabar com estes elfos da noite."
G["You are a true hero of the Alliance!"]="You are a true hero of the Alliance!"
