G["You are a |cFFFF0000|Hspell:122151|h[Voodoo Doll]|h|r! Damage you take is copied to the other Voodoo Dolls in your raid!"]="You are a |cFFFF0000|Hspell:122151|h[Voodoo Doll]|h|r! Damage you take is copied to the other Voodoo Dolls in your raid!"
