G["You are about to find out!"]="You are about to find out!"
G["You are about to rip the horizon a new sky-hole aboard a sensational new era in aeronautical innovation."]="Está a ponto de rasgar o horizonte a bordo de uma nova era sensacional de innovações aeronáuticas."
G["You are acquaintances with Fish."]="You are acquaintances with Fish."
G["You are all weak. Frail."]="You are all weak. Frail."
G["You are alone in the world."]="Está somente no mundo."
G["You are always welcome at the inn, $n!"]="Sempre é $gbienvenido: boas-vindas; na estalagem, $n!"
G["You are always welcome with us here in the Raven's Wood, $n."]="Sempre é $gbienvenido: boas-vindas; conosco na Floresta do Corvo, $n."
G["You are among the Taunka of Camp Oneqwah, dwarf."]="You are among the Taunka of Camp Oneqwah, dwarf."
G["You are an Orc no longer, and speak for none but yourself. You betrayed our people to forge your fragile alliances, and I will take great pleasure in tearing them apart."]="You are an Orc no longer, and speak for none but yourself. You betrayed our people to forge your fragile alliances, and I will take great pleasure in tearing them apart."
G["You are an agent of their wicked god, fool.  I will see you destroyed!"]="You are an agent of their wicked god, fool.  I will see you destroyed!"
G["You are an exceptional enchanter. Beyond my talents as a teacher, I fear. Seek out Kitta Firewind at the Tower of Azora. Only she can qualify as your instructor now."]="Você é um encantador excepcional. Além dos meus talentos como professor, eu temo. Procure Kitta Firewind na Torre de Azora. Somente ela pode se qualificar como sua instrutora agora."
G["You are an honorable Orc, Nazgrim. I regret what I must do."]="É um orc honrado, Nazgrim. Lamento o que tenho que fazer."
G["You are an honorable opponent."]="É uma honra ser seu oponente."
G["You are an inspiration to us all, sir."]="É uma inspiração para todos nós, senhor."
G["You are ancient relics of a bygone age!"]="São umas relíquias antigas de uma época passada!"
G["You are as kind as you are intelligent. It is very lucky to help a stranger."]="É tão gentil como inteligente. Da muita sorte ajudar a um desconhecido."
G["You are as strong as they say, especially considering you defeated ME. Well fought."]="You are as strong as they say, especially considering you defeated ME. Well fought."
G["You are asking for an axe in your back. Drop the weapon, now."]="You are asking for an axe in your back. Drop the weapon, now."
G["You are astute to ask, young $c.  Scribes are capable of inscribing tarot cards of great power, although even they do not have full control of what they make.  The fates decide for them.\n\nIf you manage to obtain a completed deck, please bring it to me for a magnificent reward."]="You are astute to ask, young $c.  Scribes are capable of inscribing tarot cards of great power, although even they do not have full control of what they make.  The fates decide for them.\n\nIf you manage to obtain a completed deck, please bring it to me for a magnificent reward."
G["You are at a grave disadvantage."]="Está em desvantagem."
G["You are bad... Toys... Very... Baaaaad"]="Brinquedos maus... maus... Muito... maus."
G["You are being chased by lightning!"]="Te persigue um relâmpago!"
G["You are being misled! The Onslaught is all lies! The Scourge and the Forsaken are not our enemies! Wake up!"]="You are being misled! The Onslaught is all lies! The Scourge and the Forsaken are not our enemies! Wake up!"
G["You are being tentative, Varian. You must be decisive if you wish to lead the Alliance."]="Você não pode vacilar, Varian. Deve ser firme se que liderar à Aliança."
G["You are being...hunted."]="Os vão a... caçar."
G["You are beneath me."]="Não é digno de mim."
G["You are best friends with Fish. With her knowledge of animals, she would probably help out quite a bit on the farm."]="Peixe é seu melhor amiga. Com os seus conhecimentos sobre animais, seria de grande ajuda na fazenda."
G["You are better than your companions!"]="É melhor que seus companheiros!"
G["You are beyond my level of expertise. Georgio Bolero, the master of Duncan's Textiles around the corner could help you advance your skills."]="Você está além do meu nível de conhecimento. Georgio Bolero, o mestre dos têxteis de Duncan ao virar da esquina, pode ajudá-o a aprimorar suas habilidades."
G["You are beyond my limited abilities. Seek out the night elf Ainethil in the Craftsmen's Terrace of Darnassus. She can teach you more. I only wish that I could go with you."]="Você está além das minhas habilidades limitadas. Procure o elfo noturno Ainethil no Terraço dos Artesãos de Darnassus. Ela pode ensinar mais. Eu só queria poder ir com você."
G["You are bound for a great things, trainee."]="You are bound for a great things, trainee."
G["You are bound to me, spirit! Your task is to keep the mill running - do not falter!"]="Está vinculado a mim, espírito! Seu labor é manter o molino em movimento, não vaciles!"
G["You are brave to swim down to my realm, land-walker."]="Você é corajoso em nadar até o meu reino, andarilho."
G["You are brave to try to escape, young Ohgan'aka.\n\nBefore you continue, let me teach you how to use your teeth to bite through the trolls' nets."]="You are brave to try to escape, young Ohgan'aka.\n\nBefore you continue, let me teach you how to use your teeth to bite through the trolls' nets."
G["You are braver than you look, stranger."]="É mais corajoso do que pareces."
G["You are breaking into the vault to retrieve your Personal Riches!"]="You are breaking into the vault to retrieve your Personal Riches!"
G["You are buddies with Fish."]="Peixe é seu colega."
G["You are but a plaything. Unfit even to amuse."]="You are but a plaything. Unfit even to amuse."
G["You are but one against the Empress's divine wrath! You, too, will fall!"]="You are but one against the Empress's divine wrath! You, too, will fall!"
G["You are caring for your serpent well, $n. You have done all that you can for today. Make sure you come check on the serpent again tomorrow."]="Está cuidando bem do seu dragão, $n. Hoje já fez tudo o possível. Não te esqueça de voltar a visitar ao seu dragão manhã."
G["You are carrying too much brew. Return to the Brewing Cauldron to turn in what you have."]="Leva demais mistura. Volta ao caldeirão de fermentação para entregar o que veste."
G["You are certainly a long way from home, $r."]="Está muito longe de casa, $r."
G["You are certainly not your father, insect. Should it interest me, I would crush you with but a swipe of my claws. Turn Shan'do Stormrage over to me and your pitiful life will be spared along with the lives of your people."]="You are certainly not your father, insect. Should it interest me, I would crush you with but a swipe of my claws. Turn Shan'do Stormrage over to me and your pitiful life will be spared along with the lives of your people."
G["You are close enough to reach Magmaw's head!"]="Está a ponto de alcançar a cabeça de Faucemagma!"
G["You are coming along nicely."]="You are coming along nicely."
G["You are constantly surprising me with what a person can live through."]="You are constantly surprising me with what a person can live through."
G["You are correct. We do not beat our prisoners. Broken, on the other hand, have no issues with violence. You see, they are brutes, after all..."]="Pois tem razão. Não maltratamos a nossos prisioneiros. Os Tábidos, ao contrario, não têm problemas com a violência. Verá, depois de tudo são uns brutos..."
G["You are correct; we must concentrate on the Scourge. Ignore the trolls and the villages, and focus our attentions on Deatholme! With Dar'khan defeated you will find that the rest of the Scourge 'body' will fall quickly, lacking their 'head'."]="You are correct; we must concentrate on the Scourge. Ignore the trolls and the villages, and focus our attentions on Deatholme! With Dar'khan defeated you will find that the rest of the Scourge 'body' will fall quickly, lacking their 'head'."
