G["You are dealing with a being that holds within it the consciousness of the most cunning, intelligent, and ruthless individuals to ever live."]="You are dealing with a being that holds within it the consciousness of the most cunning, intelligent, and ruthless individuals to ever live."
G["You are deemed a threat!"]="You are deemed a threat!"
G["You are defenders of a doomed world! Flee here, and perhaps you will prolong your pathetic lives!"]="You are defenders of a doomed world! Flee here, and perhaps you will prolong your pathetic lives!"
