G["You are dutiful to inquire, $c, but all Horde collections have been completed. We now wait for the Alliance hegemony to finish theirs, and then all will be transported to Silithus in the vicinity of Cenarion Hold."]="Sei que é seu dever perguntar, $c, mas a Horda já reuniu tudo o materiais necessário. Agora devemos esperar a que a Aliança faça sua parte e assim todos poderemos levar a mercadoria a Silithus, nas inmediações do Forte Cenariano."
G["You are dying!"]="You are dying!"
G["You are eager, that is good. However, you are not yet ready to train with the likes of me."]="You are eager, that is good. However, you are not yet ready to train with the likes of me."
G["You are easily bested!"]="You are easily bested!"
G["You are either mad, foolhardy, or a hero worthy of being called legend. Which one are you?"]="Você é louco, imprudente ou um herói digno de ser chamado de lenda. Qual é você?"
G["You are expected to provide aid to Alliance members in need, whether they be human, gnome, draenei... or pandaren like yourselves."]="You are expected to provide aid to Alliance members in need, whether they be human, gnome, draenei... or pandaren like yourselves."
G["You are far to slow on the field of battle.  Perhaps you need to further hone your skills."]="You are far to slow on the field of battle.  Perhaps you need to further hone your skills."
G["You are far too late.  The Jade Armies are mine."]="You are far too late.  The Jade Armies are mine."
G["You are finished!"]="Estão acabados!"
G["You are fools to have come to this place. The icy winds of Northrend will consume your souls!"]="You are fools to have come to this place. The icy winds of Northrend will consume your souls!"
G["You are forbidden from my master's domain, mortals."]="You are forbidden from my master's domain, mortals."
G["You are forgiven..."]="You are forgiven..."
G["You are forgotten. This is what you fear, is it not?"]="Te têm esquecido. É o que temes, verdade?"
G["You are fortunate to have come to Darnassus where you can find such an accomplished Hunter as Jocaste among our trainers.  I encourage you to visit her over in the Cenarion Enclave and seek her tutelage."]="Você tem sorte de ter chegado a Darnassus, onde pode encontrar um Hunter tão talentoso como Jocaste entre nossos treinadores. Convido você a visitá-a no Enclave Cenarion e procurar sua tutela."
G["You are fortunate zhat I am too busy to make you suffer as you deserve."]="You are fortunate zhat I am too busy to make you suffer as you deserve."
G["You are free of His control. And while you will be judged by lesser beings, at least you have chances that the Scourge do not!"]="You are free of His control. And while you will be judged by lesser beings, at least you have chances that the Scourge do not!"
G["You are free to do whatever you like."]="É livre de fazer o que queira."
G["You are free to take your leave."]="São livres de partir."
G["You are friends with Fish."]="Peixe é seu amiga."
G["You are going the wrong way, $n. My elekk will not go into hostile territory."]="Esse não é o caminho correto, $n. Meu elekk não querrá passar por território hostil."
G["You are going to love this story, $r. See, here is the thing. As soon as Malygos charged me with protecting the scepter shard, I knew I was in for an eternity of headache and pain.\n\nAll I want to do is study these magic rich shorelines and take in what artifacts might remain from the Sundering. You know, there was once a thriving Highborne civilization here! You don't have to tell me that there is going to be some solid magical items around here, $r. I can smell it!"]="You are going to love this story, $r. See, here is the thing. As soon as Malygos charged me with protecting the scepter shard, I knew I was in for an eternity of headache and pain.\n\nAll I want to do is study these magic rich shorelines and take in what artifacts might remain from the Sundering. You know, there was once a thriving Highborne civilization here! You don't have to tell me that there is going to be some solid magical items around here, $r. I can smell it!"
G["You are gonna want to head over to Old Town and drop by the Protective Hide if you are lookin' to learn skinning."]="Você vai querer ir para a Cidade Velha e dar uma passadinha no Couro Protetor, se quiser aprender a esfolar."
G["You are good friends with Fish."]="Peixe é seu boa amiga."
G["You are growing ever closer to the pinnacle of your training. To become a greater enchanter, you have yet another instructor to seek out. Her name is Annora, and you may find her in Uldaman."]="Você está cada vez mais próximo do auge do seu treinamento. Para se tornar um encantador maior, você tem mais um instrutor para procurar. O nome dela é Annora, e você pode encontrá-a em Uldaman."
G["You are heartless. What about the grummles?"]="Não tem coração. Que passa com os grúmel?"
G["You are here because you displayed exceptional aptitude and ability throughout your training period."]="You are here because you displayed exceptional aptitude and ability throughout your training period."
G["You are here to assist the Aldor?"]="Você está aqui para ajudar o Aldor?"
G["You are here to stop the Archduke?"]="You are here to stop the Archduke?"
G["You are here? Does this mean we will finally get a chance to compete against each other for the tournament title?"]="You are here? Does this mean we will finally get a chance to compete against each other for the tournament title?"
G["You are hopelessly outmatched!"]="You are hopelessly outmatched!"
G["You are hopelessly outmatched, $r."]="$R, isto te supera completamente."
G["You are ignorant to the powerful secrets contained within this vale.  I will take them, and then I will destroy all of your kind."]="You are ignorant to the powerful secrets contained within this vale.  I will take them, and then I will destroy all of your kind."
G["You are impressive indeed.  It would be my honor to fight beside you."]="Foi impressionante. Será uma honra lutar ao seu lado."
G["You are impure!"]="Você é impuro!"
G["You are in my realm now, serpent!"]="Agora está na minha reino, serpente!"
G["You are in no position to complain about the help you are receiving!"]="You are in no position to complain about the help you are receiving!"
G["You are in orc territory.  What do you need, $r?"]="Está em território orc. O que precisa, $r?"
G["You are indeed a stranger to Pandaria.\n\nThe mantid are the monsters beyond the wall. The scourge of the west. The evil that haunts our lands.\n\nEvery one hundred years the mantid launch an assault on our lands to ravage them of their wealth and food.\n\nOur greatest scholars tell us we are still many years from the next ravage, but our dreams say otherwise."]="You are indeed a stranger to Pandaria.\n\nThe mantid are the monsters beyond the wall. The scourge of the west. The evil that haunts our lands.\n\nEvery one hundred years the mantid launch an assault on our lands to ravage them of their wealth and food.\n\nOur greatest scholars tell us we are still many years from the next ravage, but our dreams say otherwise."
G["You are indeed courageous for wanting to brave the horrors that lie beyond this door."]="You are indeed courageous for wanting to brave the horrors that lie beyond this door."
G["You are indeed powerful, $n. Come to me if it is more work that you seek."]="You are indeed powerful, $n. Come to me if it is more work that you seek."
G["You are insignificant."]="Você é insignificante."
G["You are kind to seek me out, but your skills are beyond my own. Have a word with Sylvanna Forestmoon, just over there. She's been looking for another student."]="Você é gentil em me procurar, mas suas habilidades estão além das minhas. Converse com Sylvanna Forestmoon, logo ali. Ela está procurando por outra aluna."
G["You are leaving the greater Jotunheim region. Return or lose the proto-drake."]="Está abandonando a grande região Jotunheim. Volta ou perderá o protodraco."
G["You are leaving the raptor dens?  I was commanded to guard this post and prevent escapes, but... I think I understand why you want to leave.\n\nFine.  You may pass, but first, I have a request.\n\nThe trolls often carry packs of raptor food, and I haven't been fed in days.  You don't stand a chance in combat, but you're small enough that you might be able to steal it from one of the sleeping trolls inside the tents..."]="You are leaving the raptor dens?  I was commanded to guard this post and prevent escapes, but... I think I understand why you want to leave.\n\nFine.  You may pass, but first, I have a request.\n\nThe trolls often carry packs of raptor food, and I haven't been fed in days.  You don't stand a chance in combat, but you're small enough that you might be able to steal it from one of the sleeping trolls inside the tents..."
G["You are leaving?"]="Vai?"
G["You are less than dust, fit only to be brushed from my back."]="You are less than dust, fit only to be brushed from my back."
G["You are like... piece of iron..."]="São como... uma barra de ferro..."
G["You are little more than insects! When I am done with you, I will burn your shrine to the ground!"]="You are little more than insects! When I am done with you, I will burn your shrine to the ground!"
G["You are looking for Uthan Stillwater.  You will find him west of the village, fishing at Stonebull Lake."]="Você está procurando Uthan Stillwater. Você o encontrará a oeste da vila, pescando no lago Stonebull."
G["You are looking for the apothecary. He makes some truly wonderful potions and tinctures. Got rid of my rash in no time!\n\nAhem... Apothecary Greenmoss sells his wares in the crafter's hall. I will mark the location on your map."]="You are looking for the apothecary. He makes some truly wonderful potions and tinctures. Got rid of my rash in no time!\n\nAhem... Apothecary Greenmoss sells his wares in the crafter's hall. I will mark the location on your map."
G["You are looking for the apothecary. He makes some truly wonderful potions and tinctures. Got rid of my rash in no time!\n\nAhem... Victor Pearce sells his wares in the chamber of masters. I will mark the location on your map."]="You are looking for the apothecary. He makes some truly wonderful potions and tinctures. Got rid of my rash in no time!\n\nAhem... Victor Pearce sells his wares in the chamber of masters. I will mark the location on your map."
G["You are looking pale, my friend! I trust you have not allowed fear to get the better of you?"]="Que palidez à sua! Não terá saído que o medo te supere, verdade?"
G["You are lucky that I don't gut you right here, whelp.  You are foolish to think that you can speak to your Warchief in such ways."]="Tem sorte de que não te destripe aqui mesmo, cão. Está louco se acha que pode hablarle assim ao seu Chefe de Guerra."
G["You are lucky you were able to find amber and flesh nearby, Wakener.\n\nIf there was none to be found, you would have been my sustenance."]="You are lucky you were able to find amber and flesh nearby, Wakener.\n\nIf there was none to be found, you would have been my sustenance."
