G["You be a LONG way from home, mon. Heh heh heh.\nWhat can I be helpin' ya find?"]="You be a LONG way from home, mon. Heh heh heh.\nWhat can I be helpin' ya find?"
G["You be crazy, mon, meddlin' with dat bad mojo. But I ain't one ta stop ya.\n\nUnjari Feltongue is in de taller building in de southeast, past de shadow priest's shrine."]="You be crazy, mon, meddlin' with dat bad mojo. But I ain't one ta stop ya.\n\nUnjari Feltongue is in de taller building in de southeast, past de shadow priest's shrine."
G["You be da victor today. Enjoy it."]="Hoje foi tu que ganhou. Aproveita aí."
G["You be dead soon enough!"]="You be dead soon enough!"
G["You be dead soon!"]="You be dead soon!"
G["You be drinkin' everyting, mon."]="Eh'tás bebendo de to'o, colega."
G["You be dyin' along with all dese scourge!"]="Morrerá ao lado a todos estes membros do Flagelo!"
G["You be feelin' dis fight for a long time."]="You be feelin' dis fight for a long time."
G["You be free from da voodoo now!"]="Agora é livre do vodu!"
