G["You be good eatin' for me pets."]="Será uma comida eh'tupenda para meus ajudantes."
G["You be here ta learn fishin', mon? Or maybe ta buy some tings for it?"]="Você está aqui para aprender a pescar, mon? Ou talvez ta comprando algumas coisas por isso?"
G["You be interferin' with de wrong empire!"]="You be interferin' with de wrong empire!"
G["You be it now, brudda!"]="Você a veste, colega!"
G["You be lookin' for Sesebi, mon.\n\nShe most often be sleepin' under de tree by old Umbehto, de fisherman, lookin' like a big ol' tiger."]="You be lookin' for Sesebi, mon.\n\nShe most often be sleepin' under de tree by old Umbehto, de fisherman, lookin' like a big ol' tiger."
G["You be not afraid of nothin', $c!\n\nBuunu be waitin' for you outside."]="You be not afraid of nothin', $c!\n\nBuunu be waitin' for you outside."
G["You be sayin' that now, but come dinner you'll think differently!"]="Isso o diz agora, mas à hora da cena pensarás de outra maneira!"
G["You be the worm my captives be cursin'? I expected more!"]="You be the worm my captives be cursin'? I expected more!"
G["You be too scared!  Me find you!"]="You be too scared!  Me find you!"
G["You be wantin' Sijambi, mon.\n\nShe be in de tall building in de middle of de valley."]="É a Sijambi a quem buh'cas, colega.\n\nA encontrará' no grande edifício no centro do vale."
G["You be wantin' our land? We gonna bury you here."]="You be wantin' our land? We gonna bury you here."
G["You be watchin' yerself, $c. Respect our ways, or a curse be on you and yours."]="You be watchin' yerself, $c. Respect our ways, or a curse be on you and yours."
G["You bear the burden of an entire people upon your shoulders. And how have they repaid you?"]="Leva o peso de tudo um povo aos seus costas. E como te o têm pagado?"
G["You beasts! What sort of madness is this?"]="Seus animais! Que loucura é essa?"
G["You been savin' hozen, wikket?\n\nWikket loves hozen?"]="Makaku salvou hozen?\n\nMakaku quer hozen?"
G["You begin to cast |cFFFF0000|Hspell:91317|h[Worshipping]|h|r!"]="Empiezas a lançar |cFFFF0000|Hspell:91317|h[Adoração]|h|r!"
G["You believe our allies will not be able to control the power of the swords?"]="Acha que nossos aliados não poderão controlar o poder das espadas?"
G["You believe you are ready to be a champion?  Defend yourself!"]="Acha que está preparad$go: a; para ser u$gn: na; Campe$gón: ona;? Defiéndete!"
G["You believe yourself ready for the rank of valiant?  We shall see."]="Acha que está $gpreparado: preparada; para o grau de $gValeroso: Valerosa;? Já veremos."
G["You bend down to speak with me? A pet-keeper? A shortfang?\n\nI know my place in this world, stronger. I am not strong enough to fight on my own, so I keep a pet. I am called weak, and pushed to the edge of the village.\n\nYou should stay away from me, before they see you."]="You bend down to speak with me? A pet-keeper? A shortfang?\n\nI know my place in this world, stronger. I am not strong enough to fight on my own, so I keep a pet. I am called weak, and pushed to the edge of the village.\n\nYou should stay away from me, before they see you."
G["You best have a seat then, this is gonna be a long one.\n\nWhen we initially arrived in Silithus, Mistress Mar'alith was the first of the night elves from Cenarion Hold to join the expedition. Our routine was nothing out of the ordinary: Form a party to venture into the various hives and search for lost artifacts."]="You best have a seat then, this is gonna be a long one.\n\nWhen we initially arrived in Silithus, Mistress Mar'alith was the first of the night elves from Cenarion Hold to join the expedition. Our routine was nothing out of the ordinary: Form a party to venture into the various hives and search for lost artifacts."
G["You best head up to Stormwind in the Dwarven District if you want to learn to mine.  Surely one of the dwarves there can teach you the profession."]="É melhor você ir até Stormwind, no distrito dos Anões, se quiser aprender a explorar o meu. Certamente um dos anões lá pode lhe ensinar a profissão."
G["You betrayed the Warchief!"]="Tem traído ao Chefe de Guerra!"
G["You better back me up on this one!"]="Será melhor que me respaldes nesta!"
G["You better be happy I threw my back out or I'd come over there and kick you off my land."]="You better be happy I threw my back out or I'd come over there and kick you off my land."
G["You better believe it! You're going to face two of Arthas' most powerful Val'kyr lieutenants!"]="É melhor você acreditar! Você vai enfrentar dois dos mais poderosos tenentes de Val'kyr de Arthas!"
G["You better bring that bat back in one piece, $n!"]="Mais te vale devolver esse morcego de uma peça, $n!"
G["You better do something quick or you'll have a riot on your hands, Solomon!"]="You better do something quick or you'll have a riot on your hands, Solomon!"
G["You better get upstairs pronto, boss. Trade Prince Gallywix is waiting for you."]="You better get upstairs pronto, boss. Trade Prince Gallywix is waiting for you."
G["You better have a good reason for letting this wolvar continue to breath."]="Mais vale que tenha uma boa razão para deixar que este wolvar continúe respirando."
G["You better head straight there, but be cautious."]="Será melhor que vá ali diretamente, tenha cuidado."
G["You better hold me back or $n is going to feel some prison house beatings."]="You better hold me back or $n is going to feel some prison house beatings."
G["You better hope they don't survive it, lad."]="Mais te vale que não sobrevivan, rapaz."
G["You better not break Jum-jump!  It's not fair!"]="Mais te vale que não rompas a Jum-jump! Não é logo!"
G["You better wake up real quick, rookie.  This isn't our cushy backyard outside of Skettis; this is the Blade's Edge Mountains!  One false move and it's crash and burn!"]="É melhor você acordar bem rápido, novato. Este não é o nosso quintal acolhedor fosse de Skettis; estas são as Montanhas da Lâmina Afiada! Um movimento falso e é bater e queimar!"
G["You big boss now!  You king!  All hail King $n, King of Gordok!\n\nNow that you da boss, all henchmen will give you tribute!  You left some alive, yeah boss?"]="You big boss now!  You king!  All hail King $n, King of Gordok!\n\nNow that you da boss, all henchmen will give you tribute!  You left some alive, yeah boss?"
G["You big duffer, these ARE the same ruins. You're wandering in circles again."]="You big duffer, these ARE the same ruins. You're wandering in circles again."
G["You big meanie! Who put you up to this?"]="Eh, tacanho! Quem te dio a ideia?"
G["You blame the peacekeepers for your failure? You were entrusted with a simple task. The troll was obviously a fraud!"]="You blame the peacekeepers for your failure? You were entrusted with a simple task. The troll was obviously a fraud!"
G["You blaspheme! The Light would never allow such an aberration!"]="Blasfemas! A Luz nunca permitiría tal aberração!"
G["You blew it!"]="You blew it!"
G["You block like a little girl! Put your shoulder into it!"]="You block like a little girl! Put your shoulder into it!"
G["You blood elves should rejoin the flock before it's too late."]="You blood elves should rejoin the flock before it's too late."
G["You both have my thanks and that of the village, though many will never know of your deeds."]="You both have my thanks and that of the village, though many will never know of your deeds."
G["You both shall suffer as his father does..."]="You both shall suffer as his father does..."
G["You boys need some help?"]="Precisam algo de ajuda, pessoal?"
G["You brash interlopers are out of your element! I will ground you!"]="You brash interlopers are out of your element! I will ground you!"
G["You break and enter?! Me break YOU!"]="You break and enter?! Me break YOU!"
G["You break easy!"]="You break easy!"
G["You break our cave, I break your skull!"]="Você quebrar nossa caverna, eu quebrar seu crânio!"
G["You bring great pride to the Horde, Champion $n."]="Faz que a Horda se sienta muito orgulhosa, campeão $n."
G["You bring violence to Ogri'la?"]="Traz violência a Ogri'a?"
G["You brought back the instruments just in time, $n. The Elder is ready to perform the waterspeaking ceremony."]="Nos tem devolvido os instrumentos logo a tempo, $n. O ancestral está pronto para levar a cabo a cerimônia da oração da água."
G["You brought strife to our lands! I will bring strife to you now!"]="You brought strife to our lands! I will bring strife to you now!"
G["You brought supplies from the enemy!  Hah! Well done $n!"]="Tem trazido suprimentos dos inimigos! Ha! Bem feito, $n!"
G["You brought the green to my land for a short time.  It is enough.  I am at peace.  I am ready for my long sleep."]="Você trouxe o verde para a minha terra por um curto período de tempo. É o suficiente. Estou em paz. Estou pronto para meu longo sono."
G["You brought the worgen to Duskwood! You led the Dark Riders to my farm, and hid while they murdered my family!"]="You brought the worgen to Duskwood! You led the Dark Riders to my farm, and hid while they murdered my family!"
G["You brought this down on us! I'd bet gold on it!"]="Apostaría ouro a que você tem provocado isto!"
G["You brought this on yourself!"]="Te o tem buscado!"
G["You brought this on yourselves!"]="O vocês têm provocado vocês!"
G["You brought this on yourselves, Sunreavers."]="Vocês o vocês têm querido, Atracasol."
G["You brutes make sure that my number one executive doesn't get anywhere near the villa."]="You brutes make sure that my number one executive doesn't get anywhere near the villa."
G["You built your dwellings upon our very rockface.  Your ignorance shall be your undoing."]="Construisteis suas moradas em nossos rostros de pedras. Sua ignorância será sua perdição."
G["You burned down my headquarters. Now I'm gonna burn down you!"]="You burned down my headquarters. Now I'm gonna burn down you!"
G["You buy one wrong grain and suddenly the world falls apart. Now we have a sprite infestation and migrating birds to boot.\n\nI was just trying to help us hit our quota to the Stormstout Brewery!"]="You buy one wrong grain and suddenly the world falls apart. Now we have a sprite infestation and migrating birds to boot.\n\nI was just trying to help us hit our quota to the Stormstout Brewery!"
G["You buy time... but not your lives... my hatchery remains..."]="You buy time... but not your lives... my hatchery remains..."
G["You buyin' the next round?"]="Vai convidar à próxima rodada?"
G["You call 'dat a battlecry? We be startin' a revolution. Roar like ya already won and deh' other side just not figured it out yet."]="You call 'dat a battlecry? We be startin' a revolution. Roar like ya already won and deh' other side just not figured it out yet."
G["You call on da beast, you gonna get more dan you bargain for!"]="You call on da beast, you gonna get more dan you bargain for!"
G["You call that a hammer strike? What kind of amateurs am I workin' with here?"]="Isso é o que você chamas um martilhazo? Com que classe de principiantes estou trabalhando?"
G["You call that a hit?  My grandma could hit harder and she's dead!"]="You call that a hit?  My grandma could hit harder and she's dead!"
G["You call that a trigger assembly? This is not a toy, people!"]="You call that a trigger assembly? This is not a toy, people!"
G["You call that an offense? I've seen more offensive tallstriders!"]="You call that an offense? I've seen more offensive tallstriders!"
G["You call that fighting?"]="A isso chamas você pelear?"
G["You call that fighting? Let me go grab your dolly. Maybe she could teach you how to swing."]="You call that fighting? Let me go grab your dolly. Maybe she could teach you how to swing."
G["You call that slaying an opponent? I expected more... fire. Or maybe some lightning."]="A isso lhe chamas matar a um inimigo? Eu esperava... mais fogo. OU raios, talvez."
G["You call that sneaking?"]="You call that sneaking?"
G["You call that... a fight...?"]="A isso... o chamam... lutar?"
G["You call this a weapon? Keep this up, knave and I'll see that you're brought back as one of them. Maybe then you will learn how to put your back into it."]="You call this a weapon? Keep this up, knave and I'll see that you're brought back as one of them. Maybe then you will learn how to put your back into it."
G["You call those strong arms? Ha! I have bruises that have more muscle in them."]="Isso é o que você entende por braços fortes? Ha! Eu tenho moretones com mais músculos."
G["You call us traitors?"]="Nos está chamando traidores?"
G["You call yourself, $n? That is a strange name for a furbolg.\n\nYou're not from Ashenvale."]="Te faz chamar $n? É um nome estranho para um fúrbolg.\n\nNão é de Valhefresno."
G["You called?"]="Tem chamado?"
G["You came along just as they were about to throw me to the fiends below - for that, I thank you. Perhaps, I - rather - we, of the blue flight, can assist you further?\n\nYou have come this far, $r, risked much. Will you go a ways further to battle Nefarian and his legion of Blackrock?"]="You came along just as they were about to throw me to the fiends below - for that, I thank you. Perhaps, I - rather - we, of the blue flight, can assist you further?\n\nYou have come this far, $r, risked much. Will you go a ways further to battle Nefarian and his legion of Blackrock?"
G["You came in first!"]="Chegou em primeiro lugar!"
G["You came in second!"]="Chegou em segundo lugar!"
G["You came in third!"]="Chegou em terceiro lugar!"
G["You came not a moment too soon, Wakener. The Adjuncts would have destroyed me as I slept."]="You came not a moment too soon, Wakener. The Adjuncts would have destroyed me as I slept."
G["You came, wise sista! De Darkspear be grateful."]="You came, wise sista! De Darkspear be grateful."
