G["You can do this alone, you say? Is this simple foolishness or misplaced confidence I see before me?\nNo, I can see it in your eyes. You have to know. You have to prove to yourself that you can do this alone. Very well. I will retreat from the battlefield if you so wish it."]="You can do this alone, you say? Is this simple foolishness or misplaced confidence I see before me?\nNo, I can see it in your eyes. You have to know. You have to prove to yourself that you can do this alone. Very well. I will retreat from the battlefield if you so wish it."
G["You can do this, $p... but you cannot do this alone. You will need help from that mushan beast. Yes, I believe her name was Miss Fanny."]="You can do this, $p... but you cannot do this alone. You will need help from that mushan beast. Yes, I believe her name was Miss Fanny."
G["You can enter the city."]="You can enter the city."
G["You can fill a bucket at the water barrel.  It's fun to splash!"]="Você pode encher um balde no barril de água. É divertido espirrar!"
G["You can find Aldwin Laughlin at the Stormwind Visitor's Center in the Trade District."]="Você pode encontrar Aldwin Laughlin no Centro de Visitantes de Ventobravo, no Trade District."
G["You can find Arthaid, our stable master, outside of the Caregiver Center. He is located on the upper level of the central hub, near the Exodar's main entrance."]="You can find Arthaid, our stable master, outside of the Caregiver Center. He is located on the upper level of the central hub, near the Exodar's main entrance."
G["You can find Erett the fishing trainer in the Crystal Hall near the Light Blessed Waters."]="Você pode encontrar Erett, o treinador de pesca, no Crystal Hall, perto das Águas Abençoadas pela Luz."
G["You can find Radnaal practicing his craft outside his home on the road to Darnassus.  You should stop by and see what he can teach you."]="Você pode encontrar Radnaal praticando seu ofício fosse da sua casa, na estrada para Darnassus. Você deve parar e ver o que ele pode lhe ensinar."
G["You can find Tannysa standing outside Alchemy Needs in the Mage Quarter."]="Você pode encontrar Tannysa do lado de fosse das Necessidades de Alquimia no Bairro dos Magos."
G["You can find Vance Undergloom upstairs in a room at the Gallows' End Tavern on the southeast side of Brill."]="Você pode encontrar Vance Undergloom no andar de cima, em uma sala na Gallows 'End Tavern, no lado sudeste de Brill."
G["You can find a leatherworking trainer at the Grummle Bazaar in Kun-Lai Summit. I will mark the location on your map."]="Há um instrutor de couro no Bazar Grúmel, na Cima Kun-Lai. Te marcarei seu localização no mapa."
G["You can find a mailbox just outside the Thunder Bluff Bank on the lower rise."]="Você pode encontrar uma caixa de correio do lado de fosse do Thunder Bluff Bank, na subida mais baixa."
G["You can find a mailbox right o'er by The Stonefire Tavern.  It's just north of the gates of Ironforge."]="Você pode encontrar uma caixa de correio ao lado do The Stonefire Tavern. É ao norte dos portões de Ironforge."
G["You can find me in my house if you need me."]="You can find me in my house if you need me."
G["You can find our mana loom in the merchant's bazaar within the Lower City."]="Você pode encontrar nosso tear de mana no bazar do comerciante na Cidade Baixa."
G["You can find passage to Theramore from this dock.  Heed my words, those lands are rarely safe to travel for people of the Alliance.  Watch your step and your back."]="Você pode encontrar passagem para Theramore a partir desta doca. Preste atenção às minhas palavras, essas terras raramente são seguras para viajar para as pessoas da Aliança. Assista seu passo e suas costas."
G["You can find the Conquest Quartermaster and the Glorious Conquest Quartermaster on the Serpent's Spine to the west.\n\nI will mark their location on your map."]="Tanto o intendente de conquista como o intendente de conquista gloriosa se encontram no Espinhaço do Dragão, ao oeste.\n\nTe marcarei seu localização no mapa."
