G["You can keep your stick-fighting and your mist-weaving to yourselves. I'm perfectly happy standing here and watching."]="You can keep your stick-fighting and your mist-weaving to yourselves. I'm perfectly happy standing here and watching."
G["You can kiss me if you like, just be quick about it."]="You can kiss me if you like, just be quick about it."
G["You can learn a great deal about this land from the Valley of the Four Winds."]="Pode aprender muitas coisas sobre esta terra no Vale dos Quatro Ventos."
