G["You can purchase mining supplies in the back of the chamber of masters, from Razzie Coalwrench.\n\nI will mark the location on your map."]="Pode comprarle suprimentos de mineração a Razzie Lhavecarbón, ao fundo da Câmera dos Mestres.\n\nTe marcarei seu localização no mapa."
G["You can purchase mining supplies in the crafter's hall, to the left as you enter the main building.\n\nI will mark the location on your map."]="Pode comprar suprimentos de mineração na salão do artesão, nada mais entrar no edifício principal, à esquerda.\n\nTe marcarei seu localização no mapa."
G["You can rest assured that my loyalties lie with your Horde."]="Pode ter certeza de que minha lealdade está com a Horda."
G["You can return to the Shado-Pan Garrison to select a new Shado-Pan Companion.\nAre you sure you want to dismiss your Shado-Pan Companion?"]="You can return to the Shado-Pan Garrison to select a new Shado-Pan Companion.\nAre you sure you want to dismiss your Shado-Pan Companion?"
G["You can see me? Do you know how much I'm ignored up here just because no one can see me? How refreshing to finally have someone to talk to!\n\nSo, you must have been sent by some living member of my former mercenary company, am I right? Of course I am!\n\nBut enough idle chit-chat, there's a great deal of work for you and I if you're going to put things right and return Lord Valthalak's spirit to him!"]="You can see me? Do you know how much I'm ignored up here just because no one can see me? How refreshing to finally have someone to talk to!\n\nSo, you must have been sent by some living member of my former mercenary company, am I right? Of course I am!\n\nBut enough idle chit-chat, there's a great deal of work for you and I if you're going to put things right and return Lord Valthalak's spirit to him!"
G["You can see me? How can you see me, boss?\n\nI'm going to have to work on that."]="You can see me? How can you see me, boss?\n\nI'm going to have to work on that."
G["You can see through the fog that hangs over this world like a shroud, and grasp where true power lies."]="You can see through the fog that hangs over this world like a shroud, and grasp where true power lies."
G["You can sleep in the barracks, if you'd like. Just don't wake my men, or I'll throw you out in the snow myself."]="Você pode dormir no quartel, se quiser. Só não acorde meus homens, ou eu mesma jogarei você na neve."
G["You can start by telling us where the World Pillar fragment is.  My gryphon's starting to look a bit tired from hauling you around."]="You can start by telling us where the World Pillar fragment is.  My gryphon's starting to look a bit tired from hauling you around."
G["You can take a man away from the Sons of Lothar, but you can't take the Sons out of him.\n\n<The smith shrugs.>\n\nIt's hard to explain, but I don't feel like I'm meant to be at Honor Hold right now, is all.\n\nPerhaps I'm meant to be part of something larger."]="You can take a man away from the Sons of Lothar, but you can't take the Sons out of him.\n\n<The smith shrugs.>\n\nIt's hard to explain, but I don't feel like I'm meant to be at Honor Hold right now, is all.\n\nPerhaps I'm meant to be part of something larger."
G["You can take our lives... but you'll... never... take... our brew..."]="You can take our lives... but you'll... never... take... our brew..."
G["You can talk to Anya Maulray up by the inn on the upper ring of the Trade Quarter. I wouldn't recommend it, but they're your pets."]="Você pode conversar com Anya Maulray na pousada no anel superior do Trade Quarter. Eu não recomendaria, mas eles são seus animais de estimação."
G["You can talk until you're blue in the face, I'm not delivering the ata'mal crystal to you."]="Pode falar tudo o que queira; não te pretendo entregar meu cristal de Ata'mal."
G["You can teach a soldier how to kill, but you can't teach him to want to kill.  That is one thing we don't have to worry about down here.  Every single one of my boys can't wait to take a piece out of those naga for what they did to us, and I can't say I feel  much different.\n\nWe need to find a way to make contact with the surface, but before that, I want to make a bit of \"contact\" with these naga.  We have some brothers to avenge."]="You can teach a soldier how to kill, but you can't teach him to want to kill.  That is one thing we don't have to worry about down here.  Every single one of my boys can't wait to take a piece out of those naga for what they did to us, and I can't say I feel  much different.\n\nWe need to find a way to make contact with the surface, but before that, I want to make a bit of \"contact\" with these naga.  We have some brothers to avenge."
G["You can tell a lot about a designer in how they weave their fabric together. Yours has the look of function over pride.\n\nTightly sealed with mana infused right into the fabric. Impressive, though it could benefit from an artistic hand."]="You can tell a lot about a designer in how they weave their fabric together. Yours has the look of function over pride.\n\nTightly sealed with mana infused right into the fabric. Impressive, though it could benefit from an artistic hand."
G["You can tell that booming voice that he's nothing but hot air!"]="Pode decirle a essa voz retumbante que cão ladrador, pouco mordedor!"
G["You can thank $n for getting me back here safely, father."]="You can thank $n for getting me back here safely, father."
G["You can thank me anytime for making your life more interesting."]="You can thank me anytime for making your life more interesting."
G["You can thank me later."]="Depois me darás as Obrigado."
G["You can trade your marks of justice with Commander Lo Ping, who can be found at Niuzao Temple in the Townlong Steppes.\n\nI will mark his location on your map."]="You can trade your marks of justice with Commander Lo Ping, who can be found at Niuzao Temple in the Townlong Steppes.\n\nI will mark his location on your map."
G["You can trust a goblin to COUNT your coins, but not to GUARD them."]="You can trust a goblin to COUNT your coins, but not to GUARD them."
G["You can trust any pets you have to be well taken care of by Alassin.  He resides in the Cenarion Enclave where the hunters gather."]="Você pode confiar em qualquer animal de estimação que você tenha que cuidar bem de Alassin. Ele reside no Enclave Cenarion, onde os caçadores se reúnem."
G["You can trust me.  I am no friend of the Lich King's."]="Você pode confiar em mim. Eu não sou amigo do Rei Lich."
G["You can trust our auctioneers."]="You can trust our auctioneers."
G["You can turn my steel against the \"Warchief,\" but only against his corrupt soldiers - leave the civilians out of your bloodshed!"]="You can turn my steel against the \"Warchief,\" but only against his corrupt soldiers - leave the civilians out of your bloodshed!"
G["You can understand me? I can understand you!"]="Você pode me entender? Eu consigo te entender!"
G["You can use her, but I don't want to hear any complaints about saw blades in your seat. I had to fix 'er with what we could find."]="You can use her, but I don't want to hear any complaints about saw blades in your seat. I had to fix 'er with what we could find."
G["You can use the bombs and cannons nearby to blast the hozen away!"]="Pode usar as bombas e os canhões próximos para liquidar aos hozen!"
G["You can use the shark in a minute, just wait your turn!"]="You can use the shark in a minute, just wait your turn!"
G["You can use these beakers and alchemy tools to perform experiments with various types of submarine fuel."]="Você pode usar essas taças e ferramentas de alquimia para realizar experimentos com vários tipos de combustível submarino."
G["You can usually find Brother Wilhelm in back of the smithy trading stories with Lyria.  He's always up for teaching fellow paladins new skills."]="Geralmente, você encontra o irmão Wilhelm nos bastidores das histórias de comércio com Lyria. Ele está sempre disposto a ensinar novas habilidades aos colegas paladinos."
G["You can't be serious!  Did you forget everything that $n did for us?"]="Não fale em sério! É que tem esquecido tudo o que $n fez por nós?"
G["You can't be serious!  Did you forget everything that $n did for us?  $gHe:She; stayed behind... for us!"]="Não fale em sério! É que tem esquecido tudo o que $n fez por nós? $gÉl: Ela; se tem ficado por trás... por nós!"
G["You can't be serious, Crowley. You miserable bastard!"]="Você não pode falar em sério, Crowley. Miserável covarde!"
G["You can't blame me for our mishaps... I can't even see where I'm going!\n\nThough maybe that means you can blame me...\n\nNo!  Wait!  I can dock this ship just fine... It's gotta be the orders the captain issues!  Maybe he likes pushing us to our limits and testing out our survival and repair skills."]="You can't blame me for our mishaps... I can't even see where I'm going!\n\nThough maybe that means you can blame me...\n\nNo!  Wait!  I can dock this ship just fine... It's gotta be the orders the captain issues!  Maybe he likes pushing us to our limits and testing out our survival and repair skills."
G["You can't buy me! DIE!"]="You can't buy me! DIE!"
G["You can't catch me Lo!"]="You can't catch me Lo!"
G["You can't catch me!"]="You can't catch me!"
G["You can't come in here all dirty like that. You need that nasty flesh scrubbed off first!"]="You can't come in here all dirty like that. You need that nasty flesh scrubbed off first!"
G["You can't come in here!"]="Você não pode entrar aqui!"
