G["You can't find someone? Well only three possible places a person can be.\n\nEither they're here at the market, or they're at their own house for the day, or they're at Sunsong Ranch.\n\nIf you don't see them at any of those places, you might need your eyes checked!"]="You can't find someone? Well only three possible places a person can be.\n\nEither they're here at the market, or they're at their own house for the day, or they're at Sunsong Ranch.\n\nIf you don't see them at any of those places, you might need your eyes checked!"
