G["You can't fly here. We'll be spotted for sure!"]="You can't fly here. We'll be spotted for sure!"
G["You can't get away from a warrior of The Horde! Take that! And that!"]="You can't get away from a warrior of The Horde! Take that! And that!"
G["You can't hide from me!"]="Você não pode esconder de mim!"
G["You can't hide from us.  Prepare to burn!"]="Não os podem esconder de nós. Preparem-se para arder!"
