G["You can't take this away from me!  Not now, not ever!"]="You can't take this away from me!  Not now, not ever!"
G["You can't teach an old dog new tricks.  At least that's what someone once told me.  Lucky for you, I've discovered it to be untrue.\n\nNow then, would you like your pet to unlearn talents?"]="You can't teach an old dog new tricks.  At least that's what someone once told me.  Lucky for you, I've discovered it to be untrue.\n\nNow then, would you like your pet to unlearn talents?"
