G["You clearly lack the capacity to grasp the intricacies of the arcane, $c. Off with you."]="You clearly lack the capacity to grasp the intricacies of the arcane, $c. Off with you."
G["You cling to a shattered world... Your time comes... soon enough..."]="You cling to a shattered world... Your time comes... soon enough..."
