G["You come to steal our filth?"]="Veio a roubar nossa sucata?"
G["You come to us with title and so we will listen, but do not try our patience, $c.  The council has no time for idle gossip from one such as you."]="You come to us with title and so we will listen, but do not try our patience, $c.  The council has no time for idle gossip from one such as you."
