G["You don't have to tell me twice!"]="Não me o digas dois vezes!"
G["You don't have to tell me twice."]="Não me o digas dois vezes."
G["You don't have to worry about that anymore. What's going on here?"]="You don't have to worry about that anymore. What's going on here?"
