G["You don't remember me, do you? Blasted Scourge... They've tried to drain you of everything that made you a righteous force of reckoning. Every last ounce of good... Everything that made you a draenei!"]="You don't remember me, do you? Blasted Scourge... They've tried to drain you of everything that made you a righteous force of reckoning. Every last ounce of good... Everything that made you a draenei!"
G["You don't remember me, do you? Blasted Scourge... They've tried to drain you of everything that made you a righteous force of reckoning. Every last ounce of good... Everything that made you a human!"]="You don't remember me, do you? Blasted Scourge... They've tried to drain you of everything that made you a righteous force of reckoning. Every last ounce of good... Everything that made you a human!"
G["You don't remember me, do you? Blasted Scourge... They've tried to drain you of everything that made you a righteous force of reckoning. Every last ounce of good... Everything that made you a tauren!"]="You don't remember me, do you? Blasted Scourge... They've tried to drain you of everything that made you a righteous force of reckoning. Every last ounce of good... Everything that made you a tauren!"
G["You don't remember me, do you? Blasted Scourge... They've tried to drain you of everything that made you a righteous force of reckoning. Every last ounce of good... Everything that made you an orc!"]="You don't remember me, do you? Blasted Scourge... They've tried to drain you of everything that made you a righteous force of reckoning. Every last ounce of good... Everything that made you an orc!"
G["You don't remember me, mon? Damn da Scourge! Dey gone ta drain you of everytin' dat made ya a mojo masta. Every last ounce a good... Everytin' dat made ya a troll hero, mon!"]="You don't remember me, mon? Damn da Scourge! Dey gone ta drain you of everytin' dat made ya a mojo masta. Every last ounce a good... Everytin' dat made ya a troll hero, mon!"
G["You don't remember me? We were both servants of Arugal back in Silverpine Forest. We put up with his merciless torture for ages. It was you who saved me on that fateful night when we escaped Shadowfang Keep. Without you I would have died. YOU! The most noble worgen I ever knew. What have they done to you, $n? How could this have happened?"]="You don't remember me? We were both servants of Arugal back in Silverpine Forest. We put up with his merciless torture for ages. It was you who saved me on that fateful night when we escaped Shadowfang Keep. Without you I would have died. YOU! The most noble worgen I ever knew. What have they done to you, $n? How could this have happened?"
G["You don't remember me? We were humans once - long, long ago - until Lordaeron fell to the Scourge. Your transformation to a Scourge zombie came shortly after my own. Not long after that, our minds were freed by the Dark Lady."]="You don't remember me? We were humans once - long, long ago - until Lordaeron fell to the Scourge. Your transformation to a Scourge zombie came shortly after my own. Not long after that, our minds were freed by the Dark Lady."
G["You don't remember me? We were humans once - long, long ago - until Lordaeron fell to the Scourge. Your transformation to an Scourge zombie came shortly after my own. Not long after that, our minds were freed by the Dark Lady."]="You don't remember me? We were humans once - long, long ago - until Lordaeron fell to the Scourge. Your transformation to an Scourge zombie came shortly after my own. Not long after that, our minds were freed by the Dark Lady."
G["You don't remember me? When you were a child your mother would leave you in my care while she served at the Temple of the Moon. I held you in my arms and fed you honey and sheep's milk to calm you until she would return. You were my little angel. Blasted Scourge... What have they done to you, $n?"]="You don't remember me? When you were a child your mother would leave you in my care while she served at the Temple of the Moon. I held you in my arms and fed you honey and sheep's milk to calm you until she would return. You were my little angel. Blasted Scourge... What have they done to you, $n?"
G["You don't see too many apprentices around these parts, do you?  I'm beginning to think it's because the magisters give us all the dangerous work they'd rather not do themselves."]="Você não vê muitos aprendizes nessas partes, vê? Estou começando a pensar que é porque os magísteres nos dão tudo o trabalho perigoso que eles preferem não fazer."
G["You don't stand a chance!"]="Não tem nenhuma possibilidade!"
G["You don't stand a chance, $n."]="Não tem nenhuma possibilidade, $n."
G["You don't steal big slickies!"]="You don't steal big slickies!"
G["You don't think they'll hesitate to strangle you with their bare hands? GUN THEM DOWN!"]="Você acha que eles vão hesitar em estrangular você com as mãos nuas? MATE TODOS ELES!"
