G["You don't understand - we're fighting a war here-"]="Você não entende. Nós estamos no meio de uma guerra –"
G["You don't understand! I had to study it. I HAD TO!"]="You don't understand! I had to study it. I HAD TO!"
G["You don't understand! If I'm not ready to go soon, all the good homesteading land will be taken!"]="You don't understand! If I'm not ready to go soon, all the good homesteading land will be taken!"
G["You don't understand.  If I wanted to I could fight my way out of this cave.\n\nIt's my father, Ursoc.  He has returned from the dead... but he's not the same.\n\nHe gave his life during the War of the Ancients thousands of years ago.  For centuries, the furbolg who worshipped him tried to devise a way to resurrect him.\n\nFinally they decided they were to attempt to regrow the failed world tree, Vordrassil, and use its magic to bring back my father."]="You don't understand.  If I wanted to I could fight my way out of this cave.\n\nIt's my father, Ursoc.  He has returned from the dead... but he's not the same.\n\nHe gave his life during the War of the Ancients thousands of years ago.  For centuries, the furbolg who worshipped him tried to devise a way to resurrect him.\n\nFinally they decided they were to attempt to regrow the failed world tree, Vordrassil, and use its magic to bring back my father."
G["You don't understand... I CAN'T be undead!  Not me, not now..."]="Não o entende... NÃO POSSO estar não-morta! Eu não, agora não..."
G["You don't want to fight this beast alone, $n. Gather allies. I'll open the beast's cage when you think you're good and ready."]="You don't want to fight this beast alone, $n. Gather allies. I'll open the beast's cage when you think you're good and ready."
G["You don't want to force the hand of the warchief."]="Não acho que queira colocar a prova a paciência do Chefe de Guerra."
