G["You dwarves are worthless!  You come to Ragnaros seeking ascendance, but you have nothing to offer!"]="You dwarves are worthless!  You come to Ragnaros seeking ascendance, but you have nothing to offer!"
G["You even know how to run a farm? Know what, I'll save you the trouble. Sell me this here piece of land and go back where you came from."]="You even know how to run a farm? Know what, I'll save you the trouble. Sell me this here piece of land and go back where you came from."
G["You ever been to the Valley of the Four Winds?\n\nWe farmhands hear about the crisis here in the Vale, and the Tillers are hard at work growing food for refugees.\n\nIf you want some time out in the country, visit us at Halfhill!"]="You ever been to the Valley of the Four Winds?\n\nWe farmhands hear about the crisis here in the Vale, and the Tillers are hard at work growing food for refugees.\n\nIf you want some time out in the country, visit us at Halfhill!"
