G["You ever just go walkin', for no reason at all? Just to see what's on the other side of the hill?\n\nMa says I got busy feet and an upside-down brain to boot. But I think maybe she's the one that's got it all backwards."]="Alguma vez tem saindo a caminhar sem nenhuma razão em concreto? Somente para ver o que há ao outro lado da colina?\n\nMamãe diz que tenho pés inquietos e que, por se fosse pouco, tenho o cérebro do revés. Mas eu acho que é ela a que o tem tudo do revés."
G["You ever notice how sarcastic the people living in Redridge are? Sometimes I feel like I just want to take a blow torch to that jackass Solomon's town hall."]="You ever notice how sarcastic the people living in Redridge are? Sometimes I feel like I just want to take a blow torch to that jackass Solomon's town hall."
G["You ever seen Keeshan kill an orc? It's a sight to behold, $g man:lady;."]="Alguma vez tem visto a Keeshan matar um orc? É algo digno de ver, $gsenhor: senhora;."
