G["You have certainly proven that you are worthy of it, but the materials do not come without cost.\n\nI'm sure I can arrange something with Madam Goya, but it won't come cheap.\n\nPlease keep in mind that only one Crystal of Fear can be equipped at any time."]="You have certainly proven that you are worthy of it, but the materials do not come without cost.\n\nI'm sure I can arrange something with Madam Goya, but it won't come cheap.\n\nPlease keep in mind that only one Crystal of Fear can be equipped at any time."
G["You have challenged death itself!"]="You have challenged death itself!"
G["You have challenged the Seven, and now you will die!"]="desafiou aos Sete e agora morrerá!"
G["You have chosen a path of darkness.  Mother moon, guide my hand; allow me to bring rest to these misbegotten souls."]="You have chosen a path of darkness.  Mother moon, guide my hand; allow me to bring rest to these misbegotten souls."
G["You have chosen death."]="You have chosen death."
G["You have chosen wisely, $n.  Seek out Kergul Bloodaxe on the Hunter Rise.  He will assist you on your journey to Warsong Gulch."]="Sabia decisão, $n. Busca a Kergul Sangracha no Alto dos Caçadores. Ele te ajudará no seu viagem até a Ravina Brado Guerreiro."
G["You have come a long way, traveler. There is one more task for you to perform..."]="Você percorreu um longo caminho, viajante. Há mais uma tarefa para você executar..."
G["You have come seeking deliverance? I have come to deliver!"]="Veio procurando a libertação? Eu e vindo aqui a liberar!"
G["You have come to bring Arthas to justice? To see the Lich King destroyed?"]="You have come to bring Arthas to justice? To see the Lich King destroyed?"
G["You have come to learn in the art of warfare, $r? You have come to the wrong place."]="Tem vindo a aprender as artes da guerra, $r? Tem vindo ao lugar enganado."
G["You have come to learn of battles won and lost on this field? There are no winners here..."]="Você veio para aprender sobre batalhas vencidas e perdidas neste campo? Não há vencedores aqui..."
G["You have come to me for instruction, and in return I have a favor to ask of you. See it done, and you will be rewarded."]="Tem vindo a mim à procura de treinamento e, a caminho, tenho um favor que pedir. Faça e receberá uma recompensa."
G["You have come to play? Then let us play!"]="Tem vindo a jogar? Juguemos, pois!"
G["You have come to your grave."]="Tem vindo ao seu tumba."
G["You have come too far to fail. Stand back, mortals."]="You have come too far to fail. Stand back, mortals."
G["You have completed Teronis' mission, and I appreciate all you have done, $n."]="Tem concluído a missão de Teronis, e aprecio muito tudo o que fez, $n."
G["You have completed the quest!"]="terminou a missão!"
G["You have confidence in your skills? Think carefully as the answer may surprise you."]="You have confidence in your skills? Think carefully as the answer may surprise you."
G["You have conquered every challenge I put before you, $n. You have found Huo and brought him safely to the temple."]="$n, Tem superado todos os desafios que se te têm planteado. Tem encontrado a Huo e o tem devolvido ao templo."
G["You have cost me too much work!"]="Me lado demais trabalho!"
G["You have crossed into the world of the dead in search of answers. You wish to save your ally and have risked life and limb to be here. Allow me to help."]="Você adentrado no mundo dos mortos à procura de respostas. Deseja superando a todos seus aliados e tem arriscado o pelego para estar aqui. Permíteme que te ajude."
G["You have damned us all... We are lost."]="Nos has condenado a todos... Estamos perdidos."
G["You have dared to defile my perch and must now be cleansed in fire!"]="You have dared to defile my perch and must now be cleansed in fire!"
G["You have delved too far into our magics. I will claim your soul myself!"]="You have delved too far into our magics. I will claim your soul myself!"
G["You have demonstrated skill in learning our craft. Do you also possess the resolve to complete a mission on my behalf?"]="Tem mostrou grande talento ao aprender nosso oficio. Possui também a capacidade de realizar uma missão para mim?"
G["You have discovered a new type of bio-fuel!  Bring it to Engineer Hexascrub for testing."]="Você descobriu um novo tipo de biocombustível! Leve-o ao Engineer Hexascrub para teste."
G["You have discovered a new type of bio-fuel!  Bring it to Fiasco Sizzlegrin for testing."]="Você descobriu um novo tipo de biocombustível! Leve-o ao Fiasco Sizzlegrin para teste."
G["You have disturbed my rest, $c.  Now face my wrath!"]="Tem perturbado meu descanso, $c. Agora Enfrente a meu raiva!"
G["You have done NOTHING. I will tear your world APART."]="You have done NOTHING. I will tear your world APART."
G["You have done a great thing, $n.  You are welcome here at any time."]="Fez algo estupendo, $n. É $gbienvenido: boas-vindas; aqui em qualquer momentos."
G["You have done all that you can for your hatchling today. I will keep it safe, but remember to return tomorrow to check on its progress."]="Hoje já fez tudo o possível para cuidar do seu prole. Eu a mantendré a salvou, mas não te esqueça de voltar manhã para ver que tal lhe vai."
G["You have done all you can for the serpents on the island today. Come back tomorrow to resume your training."]="Hoje já fez tudo o possível para ajudar aos dragões da ilha. Volta manhã para seguir com o seu treinamento."
G["You have done an exceptional job, soldier! The cavalry is ready to ride on your command."]="Fez um trabalho excepcional, Soldado. A cavalaria está pronta para marchar quando des a ordem."
G["You have done great things, friend. I can assure you this is but the beginning of our work together."]="Conseguiu grandes façanhas. Te garanto que isto é somente o início de nossa colaboração."
G["You have done it!"]="Você conseguiu!"
G["You have done many good things for our village, $n. Perhaps we can be friends after all."]="Fez muito bem em nossa aldeia, $n. Talvez acabemos sendo amigos depois de tudo."
G["You have done much and more for us today, $n. Our work will continue, but we have gained a small victory."]="Hoje fez muito por nós, $n. Nosso trabalho continue, mas temos conseguido uma pequena vitória."
G["You have done much for our cause, $n, but you may go no further until you have mastered flight. Only the most stalwart riders are able to assist the Netherwing."]="You have done much for our cause, $n, but you may go no further until you have mastered flight. Only the most stalwart riders are able to assist the Netherwing."
G["You have done much in this war against the Scourge. May the light embrace you."]="Fez muito durante esta guerra contra o Flagelo. Que a Luz te envuelva."
G["You have done much today, $n. Rest and return tomorrow."]="Hoje fez muitas coisas, $n. Descansar e volta manhã."
G["You have done the Shado-Pan a great service, $p."]="Tem servido bem ao Shadopan, $p."
G["You have done well here, $n. I will put in a good word with your superiors when we return to Stormwind."]="You have done well here, $n. I will put in a good word with your superiors when we return to Stormwind."
G["You have done well, $c. Our presence here can no longer be unnoticed by Ragnaros. We are an essential thorn in his side. As his rage grows, so must we continue to press forward.\n\nWe must stay ever vigilant here, but it is time to cast our eyes upon the final battle. It is time to face the Lord of Fire himself."]="You have done well, $c. Our presence here can no longer be unnoticed by Ragnaros. We are an essential thorn in his side. As his rage grows, so must we continue to press forward.\n\nWe must stay ever vigilant here, but it is time to cast our eyes upon the final battle. It is time to face the Lord of Fire himself."
G["You have done well, $n. Continue your search for knowledge, and remember the history you have learned."]="Tem actuado bem, $n. Continue no seu procurando do saber e lembre-se a história que tem aprendido."
G["You have done well, $rt. My workers are making efficient progress."]="You have done well, $rt. My workers are making efficient progress."
G["You have done well, Drakuru."]="O fez bem, Drakuru."
G["You have done well, Keldonus. Lord Malygos will be quite pleased with your progress."]="You have done well, Keldonus. Lord Malygos will be quite pleased with your progress."
G["You have done well, traveler. I am proud to call you my student!"]="Você fez bem, viajante. Tenho orgulho de chamá-o de meu aluno!"
G["You have done well, wallwalker."]="O fez bem, caminamuros."
G["You have done well.  The information you are providing is critical to our success."]="Bem feito. A informações que está proporcionando é muito importantes para nosso êxito."
G["You have done well. We will keep these weapons under close guard, hidden away here in this hall. The mogu shall never see these treasures again."]="O fez bem. Ocultaremos as armas nesta salão e as vigilaremos de perto. Os mogu não voltarão a ver estes tesouros."
G["You have doomed yourselves. It... is... unleashed."]="Os vocês têm condenado. É... livre."
G["You have earned my trust hero. This will be your most dangerous task yet: To steal the secrets of the Thunder King from the very heart of his lair. I wish you the best of luck."]="Te ganhou meu confiança. Esta será seu missão mais perigosa até o momentos: roubar os segredos do Rei do Trovão do seu própria covil. Te desejo muita sorte."
G["You have earned the privilege of training with a higher instructor. Go see my pal Roxxik there."]="Você ganhou o privilégio de treinar com um instrutor superior. Vá ver meu amigo Roxxik lá."
G["You have earned the right to proceed.  Huo lies beyond."]="Te ganhou o direito a avançar. Continua e halfará a Huo."
G["You have entered Glubtok's Nightmare!"]="entrou na Pesadelos de Glubtok!"
G["You have entered Helix's nightmare!"]="entrou na Pesadelos de Helix!"
G["You have entered Ripsnarl's nightmare!"]="entrou na pesadelos de Rasgagrunhido!"
G["You have entered the mechanical nightmare!"]="entrou na pesadelos mecânica!"
G["You have faced many challenges.... Pity they were all in vain! Soon your people will kneel to MY lord!"]="You have faced many challenges.... Pity they were all in vain! Soon your people will kneel to MY lord!"
G["You have failed him, mortalsss... Farewell!"]="Lhe vocês têm falhado, mortalesss... Adeus!"
G["You have failed me, Drakuru!"]="Me falhado, Drakuru!"
G["You have failed the test.  Try again."]="Tem fracassado na prova. Inténtalo de novamente."
G["You have failed to protect me from the apes!"]="You have failed to protect me from the apes!"
G["You have failed yet again, stranger."]="You have failed yet again, stranger."
G["You have failed your people!"]="You have failed your people!"
G["You have failed!"]="Tem falhado!"
G["You have failed..."]="Vocês têm fracassado..."
G["You have floppy ears!"]="Seus orelhas são largas!"
G["You have foolishly trespassed upon our waters, Alliance fools. Be whipped by the lash of my storm!"]="You have foolishly trespassed upon our waters, Alliance fools. Be whipped by the lash of my storm!"
G["You have foolishly trespassed upon our waters, Horde fools. Be whipped by the lash of my storm!"]="You have foolishly trespassed upon our waters, Horde fools. Be whipped by the lash of my storm!"
G["You have forced my hand!"]="You have forced my hand!"
G["You have forged this blade from saronite, the very blood of an old god. The power of the Lich King calls to this weapon."]="You have forged this blade from saronite, the very blood of an old god. The power of the Lich King calls to this weapon."
G["You have fought hard to invade the realm of the harvester."]="You have fought hard to invade the realm of the harvester."
G["You have fought well, spirit.  I ask you to grant me the strength of your body and the strength of your heart."]="Você lutou bem, espírito. Peço que me conceda a força do seu corpo e a força do seu coração."
G["You have found your way here, because you are among the few gifted with true vision in a world cursed with blindness."]="You have found your way here, because you are among the few gifted with true vision in a world cursed with blindness."
G["You have four samples, and only have room to test one more.  Which one will it be?"]="Você tem quatro amostras e só tem espaço para testar mais uma. Qual deles será?"
G["You have friends. Your champion did not allow you to fall. Take this lesson to heart."]="You have friends. Your champion did not allow you to fall. Take this lesson to heart."
G["You have fully depleted my patience as well."]="Também tem esgotado toda meu paciência."
G["You have gathered your supplies.  Bring them to Thelaron Direneedle to assemble."]="Você reuniu seus suprimentos. Traga-os para Thelaron Direneedle para montar."
G["You have gazed upon one of the ancient jinyu emperors of Pandaria, $n."]="You have gazed upon one of the ancient jinyu emperors of Pandaria, $n."
G["You have given much of your time, patience, and love, $n. Behold your serpent now."]="Tem dedicado muito tempo, paciência e amor, $n. Olhe no que se transformou seu dragão."
G["You have gone to great lengths, stranger, and you have my appreciation. I promised to further your training, and now I shall keep that promise."]="You have gone to great lengths, stranger, and you have my appreciation. I promised to further your training, and now I shall keep that promise."
G["You have got another wall... and it's made up of the people who call this place HOME."]="Você tem outra muralha... feita das pessoas que chamam este lugar de lar."
G["You have got to be the most incompetent officer I have ever met!"]="É o oficial mais incompetente que e conhecido na minha vida."
G["You have great honor, stranger. Please join us."]="You have great honor, stranger. Please join us."
G["You have great potential, but you must achieve understanding first, you must accept the spirits and listen to their calling. Only then will you be prepared for the path you must follow. Go speak with Thrag, I think perhaps you can learn a lot from one another."]="Você tem um grande potencial, mas deve primeiro compreender, deve aceitar os espíritos e ouvir o chamado deles. Só então você estará pronto para o caminho que deve seguir. Vá falar com Thrag, acho que talvez você possa aprender muito um com o outro."
G["You have grown much since we first met."]="You have grown much since we first met."
G["You have grown stronger than I ever expected."]="Você feito muito mais forte do que esperava."
G["You have guts asking me about warlocks. Go to the Magic Quarter's outer ring and get out of my sight."]="Você tem coragem de me perguntar sobre bruxos. Vá para o anel externo do Magic Quarter e saia da minha visão."
G["You have incurred the wrath!"]="Tem provocado a cólera!"
G["You have interfered with our plans for the last time, mortals!"]="You have interfered with our plans for the last time, mortals!"
G["You have issues."]="Tem problemas."
G["You have it all wrong, Jaina. I did nothing."]="Te equivocas, Jaina. Não fiz nada."
G["You have it. Do not lose it again!"]="Você tem isso. Não perca novamente!"
G["You have jade?"]="Tem jade?"
G["You have jostled the cluster, and have been sickened by the spores!"]="You have jostled the cluster, and have been sickened by the spores!"
G["You have learned a trick to speak with us, $r, but I am not impressed.\n\nThere are Winterfin betrayers across the water that need killing."]="You have learned a trick to speak with us, $r, but I am not impressed.\n\nThere are Winterfin betrayers across the water that need killing."
G["You have learned all that I am able to teach you at this time, Doctor $n. Return to me when your practice has expanded and I shall train you in the ways of the more advanced medicinal arts."]="You have learned all that I am able to teach you at this time, Doctor $n. Return to me when your practice has expanded and I shall train you in the ways of the more advanced medicinal arts."
G["You have learned much, but I sense that there is more left for the spirits to teach you. I can place your foot on the path but cannot guide your steps. Go and find Saru Steelfury in Orgrimmar, the next stretch of your journey begins there."]="Você aprendeu muito, mas sinto que resta mais para os espíritos ensinarem. Eu posso colocar o pé no caminho, mas não posso guiar seus passos. Vá e encontre Saru Steelfury em Orgrimmar, o próximo trecho da sua jornada começa lá."
G["You have learned much, more than I can teach. Go to James Van Brunt, he will teach you what I cannot."]="Você aprendeu muito, mais do que eu posso ensinar. Vá para James Vão Brunt, ele ensinará o que eu não posso."
G["You have learned the fundamentals of making potions, but further study requires greater commitment. Prove your dedication by carrying out a task for me."]="You have learned the fundamentals of making potions, but further study requires greater commitment. Prove your dedication by carrying out a task for me."
G["You have learned well my child. Go to the Undercity, find a smith named James Van Brunt. He will be able to teach you much that I cannot. I understand he spends his time near the Warriors training hall, forging their weapons and armor."]="Você aprendeu bem meu filho. Vá para a Cidade Baixa, encontre um ferreiro chamado James Vão Brunt. Ele será capaz de lhe ensinar muito que eu não posso. Entendo que ele passa seu tempo perto do salão de treinamento dos guerreiros, forjando suas armas e armaduras."
G["You have learned well. Continue on your path, disciple."]="Tem aprendido bem. Continue seu senda, discípulo."
G["You have left the roll course!"]="Você saindo da pista!"
G["You have lost your mind, Nefarius. You speak in riddles."]="Você enlouqueceu, Nefarius. Você fala em enigmas."
G["You have made a fatal mistake, mortal... There isss no essscape..."]="Hassss cometido um erro tremendo, mortal... não há essscapatoria..."
G["You have made a grave error, fiend!"]="Tem cometido um grande erro, demônio!"
G["You have made a grave misssstake..."]="Habéissss cometido um grave erro..."
G["You have made an... unwise... decision."]="Vocês têm tomado uma... decisão... incorreta."
G["You have made our enemies your own.  I will gladly share waters with you."]="Você tornou nossos inimigos seus. Terei prazer em compartilhar as águas com você."
G["You have made your choice."]="Has escolhido."
G["You have many lessons to learn."]="Tem muitas lições que aprender."
G["You have more learning ahead of you disciple. Return to your studies."]="You have more learning ahead of you disciple. Return to your studies."
G["You have much to learn if you wish to defend your people from the Sha initiate.  Stand aside for your fellow students!"]="Te ocorrida muito por aprender se pretendes defenda ao seu povo dos sha, iniciada. Da passo aos seus companheiros!"
G["You have my attention."]="Tem toda meu atenção."
G["You have my deepest gratitude. I thank you."]="Te o agradeço de tudo coração. Obrigado."
G["You have my eternal gratitude, hero."]="Contas com meu gratidão eterna."
G["You have my gratitude and that of my people."]="Contas com meu gratidão e a de meu gente."
G["You have my gratitude!"]="Têm meu gratidão!"
G["You have my gratitude, $c. I thought I'd never be free."]="Te o agradeço, $c. Creí que nunca seria livre."
G["You have my gratitude."]="Tem meu gratidão."
G["You have my gratitude. I should return back to training now."]="Tem meu gratidão. Agora deveria voltar ao treinamento."
G["You have my leave."]="Tem meu permissão."
G["You have my sword."]="Tem meu lâmina."
G["You have my thanks for dispatching the iron dwarves. But why would the Horde have an interest in me?"]="Te agradeço que te tenha encarregou dos anões férreos. Mas, por que tem interesse a Horda em mim?"
G["You have my thanks for saving my existence in this timeline. Now I must report back to my superiors. They must know immediately of what I just experienced."]="Te agradeço que me tenha salvou nesta linha do tempo. Agora, tenho que informar a meus superior. Têm que saber de imediatamente o que me passado."
G["You have my thanks!"]="Te o agradeço!"
G["You have my thanks, friend."]="Dou a você as Obrigado."
G["You have my thanks, hero. If you don't mind, I'd like to stay by your side and exact a little vengeance upon my captors!"]="You have my thanks, hero. If you don't mind, I'd like to stay by your side and exact a little vengeance upon my captors!"
G["You have my thanks, heroes. You have given peace to this sacred temple."]="Os o agradeço, heróis. Vocês têm trazido a paz a este templo sagrado."
G["You have my thanks, stranger."]="Te o agradeço, visitante."
G["You have my thanks."]="You have my thanks."
G["You have my thanks. I'm going back to The Shadow Vault now."]="Te estou agradecido. Agora vou voltar à Câmera das Sombras."
G["You have my thanks. Stay safe, $c."]="Te o agradeço. Cuídate, $c."
G["You have my thanks. We were outnumbered until you arrived."]="You have my thanks. We were outnumbered until you arrived."
G["You have my undying gratitude and that of my people, $n."]="Contas com meu gratidão eterna e a de meu gente, $n."
G["You have my word that I shall find a use for your body after I've killed you, $r."]="Tem meu palavra de que darei um uso ao seu cadáver depois de que te mate, $r!"
G["You have need of my skills as an alchemist, yes?"]="Requers meus habilidades como alquimista, verdade?"
G["You have new orders, maggots."]="Têm novas ordens, vermes."
G["You have no business with me, little one."]="Você não tem nenhum negócio comigo, pequena."
G["You have no chance of defeating my team. I am eternal!"]="Não tem nenhuma possibilidade de derrotar a meu equipamento. Sou eterna!"
G["You have no doubt heard about Nefarian's failures on Azeroth... While he has fallen, the experiments continue. My master... He continues the work that his progeny began."]="You have no doubt heard about Nefarian's failures on Azeroth... While he has fallen, the experiments continue. My master... He continues the work that his progeny began."
G["You have no hope!"]="Não têm esperança!"
G["You have no idea how happy I am right now. If you were one of my officers, you'd be getting a promotion!"]="Não tem nem ideia do feliz que estou agora mesmo. Se fosse um dos meus oficial te ascendería."
G["You have no idea how happy I am to see you!"]="Não te faz a ideia do feliz que me há ver você!"
G["You have no idea how long I was in there."]="Não te faz uma ideia do tempo que tenho estado aí dentro."
G["You have no idea how much your help has saved our family business.\n\nI should be able take it from here as long as the yaungol slow down their assault."]="You have no idea how much your help has saved our family business.\n\nI should be able take it from here as long as the yaungol slow down their assault."
G["You have no idea how to control the ata'mal crystal.  It will consume you!"]="Não tem nem ideia de como controlar o cristal de Ata'mal. Te consumirá!"
G["You have no idea what horrors lie ahead. You have seen nothing! The frozen heart of Naxxramas awaits you!"]="You have no idea what horrors lie ahead. You have seen nothing! The frozen heart of Naxxramas awaits you!"
G["You have no idea what they put us through..."]="Não tem nem ideia do que nos têm feito passar..."
G["You have no idea what you're meddling with!"]="You have no idea what you're meddling with!"
G["You have no idea what's waiting for you!"]="Não tem nem ideia do que te espera!"
G["You have no need to worry - the swindler who peddled his \"wares\" here has been exiled from our fair city."]="You have no need to worry - the swindler who peddled his \"wares\" here has been exiled from our fair city."
G["You have no place here! Your place... is among the departed!"]="You have no place here! Your place... is among the departed!"
G["You have no right to keep us out!"]="You have no right to keep us out!"
G["You have not earned the right to defeat me, tamer."]="Você não conquistou o privilégio de me derrotar, $gadestrador:adesradora;."
G["You have not fully reconciled with your past. Now is the time."]="Ainda não você reconciliado com o seu passado. Agora é o momentos."
G["You have not only saved our village; you have also repaired my family."]="Não somente salvou a nossa aldeia; também reuniu a meu família."
G["You have not seen the full might o' the Zandalari!"]="Bah! Ainda não vocês têm vih'to o poder dos Zandalari!"
G["You have not seen the last of me fools!  All shall be consumed in the end!"]="You have not seen the last of me fools!  All shall be consumed in the end!"
G["You have not yet earned the right to train with me. See Thund first, over by the table. Come back when he says you're ready!"]="Você ainda não ganhou o direito de treinar comigo. Veja Thund primeiro, ao lado da mesa. Volte quando ele disser que você está pronto!"
G["You have not yet learned the basics, wanderer. Have you spoken to my assistant, Lalina Summermoon? Perhaps you should."]="Você ainda não aprendeu o básico, andarilho. Você falou com minha assistente, Lalina Summermoon? Talvez você devesse."
G["You have not yet proven yourself worthy enough to issue a challenge within Valhalas, $n.\n\nReturn when you have earned a name for yourself."]="You have not yet proven yourself worthy enough to issue a challenge within Valhalas, $n.\n\nReturn when you have earned a name for yourself."
G["You have nothing. No one."]="Não tem nada. A ninguém."
G["You have now learned Dual Specialization."]="Acabas de aprender a doble especialização."
G["You have nowhere to go, weakling!"]="You have nowhere to go, weakling!"
G["You have nowhere to run, coward!"]="You have nowhere to run, coward!"
G["You have only just begun to see the Eye's power, $c. If you wish to facilitate the abilities of the Eye, then there is a task that you must complete."]="Acabas de começar a ver o poder do Olho, $c. Se que ver tudo o que pode fazer, deve concluir uma missão."
G["You have our deepest gratitude. Al diel shala, hero."]="Tem nosso mais profundo agradecimento. Ao diel shala."
G["You have our full cooperation, lieutenant. The Furlbrows were good people. Their deaths will not go unpunished."]="Tem toda nossa cooperação, tenente. Os Cejade eram boa gente. Seus assassinos serão castigados."
G["You have our respect and our thanks."]="Contas com nosso respeito e nosso agradecimento."
G["You have our thanks! I will see the Lorewalker safely to the Vale from here."]="Os o agradecemos! Me garantirei de que o eremita chega a salvou ao vale."
G["You have our thanks, $p. We'll be watchin' over ya."]="Tem nueh'tro agradecimento, $p. Cuidaremos de ti."
G["You have outgrown any teachings I could offer. Go with the blessing of the Earth Mother. Seek out the tauren Tarn in the northwestern shops of Thunder Bluff's central plateau. Be guided by his wisdom."]="Você superou todos os ensinamentos que eu poderia oferecer. Vá com a bênção da Mãe Terra. Procure o Tarn tauren nas lojas do noroeste do platô central de Thunder Bluff. Seja guiado pela sua sabedoria."
G["You have outstayed your welcome, Keeper. Be gone!"]="Você ficado mais do devido, vigilante do tempo. Desaparece!"
G["You have outworn your welcome!"]="Seu boas-vindas já está desfasada!"
G["You have parcel to pick up? You have mail to send?\n\nVery fast service, yes!"]="Tem algum pacote por coletar? Que mandar uma carta?\n\nOfrezco um serviço muito rápido!"
G["You have passed your test, well done! Your training may now continue."]="Você passou no teste, muito bem! Seu treinamento agora pode seguir."
G["You have permission to enter the city."]="Tem permissão para entrar na cidade."
G["You have persevered against some of my best advisors... but none can withstand the might of the Blood Hammer. Behold, Lord Sanguinar!"]="You have persevered against some of my best advisors... but none can withstand the might of the Blood Hammer. Behold, Lord Sanguinar!"
G["You have pets that need watching? I promise I will consider not eat them."]="You have pets that need watching? I promise I will consider not eat them."
G["You have pets, too. We fight?"]="Você também ter ajudantes. Nós lutar?"
G["You have pie? Someone gave us pie year ago. Really yummy."]="You have pie? Someone gave us pie year ago. Really yummy."
G["You have plenty of time before the next Sky Race to meditate on what you have learned. On race days, speak to me to enter the competition."]="You have plenty of time before the next Sky Race to meditate on what you have learned. On race days, speak to me to enter the competition."
G["You have proven capable. Resourceful. I think you will be the one to take the fight to the gyreworms where we cannot. You will be the one to make your way deep into the Crumbling Depths, the only place where we cannot pass."]="Você provou ser capaz. Engenhoso. Eu acho que você será o único a levar a luta para as gyreworms onde não podemos. Você será o único a se aprofundar nas profundezas em ruínas, o único lugar onde não podemos passar."
G["You have proven to be an exemplary hero. A champion for your cause."]="You have proven to be an exemplary hero. A champion for your cause."
G["You have proven too difficult to control!"]="Tem mostrou ser muito difícil de controlar!"
G["You have proven yourself as an explorer and seeker of knowledge."]="Tem mostrou ser um explorador e um usar de conhecimento."
G["You have reached Rank 1: Corporal"]="alcançou o Grau 1: Cabo"
G["You have reached Rank 1: Recruit"]="You have reached Rank 1: Recruit"
G["You have reached Rank 2: First Lieutenant"]="alcançou o Grau 2: Tenente primeiro."
G["You have reached new heights in your path to mastery. Let us see if we can take you even further..."]="Você alcançou novas alturas no seu caminho para o domínio. Vamos ver se podemos levá-o ainda mais longe..."
G["You have reached the limits of my knowledge, but there is more yet to learn. Across the sea, in the Mage Quarter of Stormwind City, a great tailor dwells. His name is Georgio Bolero, and he will train you now, I think. Go and speak with him."]="Você atingiu os limites do meu conhecimento, mas ainda há mais a aprender. Do outro lado do mar, no Bairro dos Magos da cidade de Ventobravo, mora um grande alfaiate. O nome dele é Georgio Bolero, e ele treinará você agora, eu acho. Vá e fale com ele."
G["You have returned to finish the job? <Lathoric laughs.> Obsidion rise and annihilate them!"]="You have returned to finish the job? <Lathoric laughs.> Obsidion rise and annihilate them!"
G["You have roach on your foot, $gbrother:sister;.\n\nWatch your step.  The roaches help us spread disease."]="You have roach on your foot, $gbrother:sister;.\n\nWatch your step.  The roaches help us spread disease."
G["You have robbed it of its strength. Now rob it of its life!"]="Lhe roubado sua força. Agora róbale a vida!"
G["You have run out of time, mortals! Your lives are forfeit!"]="Os vocês têm ficado sem tempo, mortais! Suas vidas estão condenadas!"
G["You have run out of time. Shall we try again?"]="Se acabou o tempo. Outro intento?"
G["You have saved Binan Village, $n. Ring the gong so all shall know!"]="You have saved Binan Village, $n. Ring the gong so all shall know!"
G["You have saved Wintergarde! With Thel'zan's filth washed away, the 7th Legion will easily clean up the remaining Scourge. When you are done here, report to Angrathar!"]="You have saved Wintergarde! With Thel'zan's filth washed away, the 7th Legion will easily clean up the remaining Scourge. When you are done here, report to Angrathar!"
G["You have saved me from those vicious monsters. Thank you."]="Me salvou das garras desses feroces monstros. Obrigado."
G["You have saved my life, champion. For that, I am in your debt."]="Me salvou a vida. Estou em dívida com você."
G["You have saved us from a fate far worse than death, $n.  You have the eternal gratitude of the Mok'Nathal ancestors."]="Nos salvou de um destino pior que a morte, $n. Tem a gratidão eterna dos ancestrais de Mok'nathal."
G["You have sealed your doom!"]="Vocês têm firmado sua sentência!"
G["You have sealed your fate, troll."]="Tem selado seu destino, troll."
G["You have seen where this Divine Bell is hidden? Very good. Garrosh will be pleased. We will try to locate the site you describe, and will contact you as soon as we find it."]="Tem visto onde se esconda Sino divina? Muito bem. Garrosh se alegrará. Intentaremos localizar o lugar que tem descrito e nos pondremos em contato com você assim que o encontremos."
G["You have selected all five of your samples."]="Você selecionou todas as cinco amostras."
G["You have served honorably.. I shall make your victory known to all the Horde."]="Tem servido com honra. Farei que toda a Horda se entere do seu vitória."
G["You have served one of three with honor, $n. Our time is at an end. Kuros will call for you when he is ready."]="You have served one of three with honor, $n. Our time is at an end. Kuros will call for you when he is ready."
G["You have served us well, $p. Please continue as we draw near completion."]="Nos tem ajudado muito, $p. Não flaquees agora que nos acercamos ao fim."
G["You have shown Pandaria the power of a true hero."]="Você mostrou a Pandária o poder de um verdadeiro herói."
G["You have shown me I must remain diligent in my training."]="Me mostrou que tenho ser diligente com meu treinamento."
G["You have shown me the face of true evil, $n."]="Me mostrado o rosto do autêntico mal, $n."
G["You have shown me truths that I would have never known. You and your allies have gifted me with something that cannot bear a price: Redemption. Thrall, redeemer of the Mag'har, you honor me as none ever have..."]="You have shown me truths that I would have never known. You and your allies have gifted me with something that cannot bear a price: Redemption. Thrall, redeemer of the Mag'har, you honor me as none ever have..."
G["You have shown me your desire, and have paid with precious stone.  I will teach you..."]="Você me mostrou seu desejo e pagou com pedras preciosa. Eu vou ensinar..."
G["You have shown that you are ready for the rank of champion."]="Tem mostrou que está em condições de ascender de grau e se juntar ao resto de Campeões."
G["You have some fight in you. I'm impressed."]="You have some fight in you. I'm impressed."
G["You have some skill, it is true, but every moment I spend teaching you is one more moment the undead will spend in torment. Prove to me that you are worth my time."]="You have some skill, it is true, but every moment I spend teaching you is one more moment the undead will spend in torment. Prove to me that you are worth my time."
G["You have some spare commissions you'd like to spend? I'll take them off your hands.\n\nWhat would you like to buy?"]="You have some spare commissions you'd like to spend? I'll take them off your hands.\n\nWhat would you like to buy?"
G["You have something to say to my face?"]="You have something to say to my face?"
G["You have something to show me?"]="You have something to show me?"
G["You have stood and listened long enough. Step forth."]="You have stood and listened long enough. Step forth."
G["You have strayed too far. Wasted too much time...."]="You have strayed too far. Wasted too much time...."
G["You have strength I didn't see at first."]="Você tem mais força do que previ."
G["You have studied your craft well, $c."]="You have studied your craft well, $c."
G["You have successfully planted the seaforium at the Blackrock tower."]="You have successfully planted the seaforium at the Blackrock tower."
G["You have successfully planted the seaforium at the munitions hut."]="You have successfully planted the seaforium at the munitions hut."
G["You have summoned me, fool!  Now DIE!"]="Me invocado, idiota! E agora MORRE!"
G["You have surpassed your title. You are a Battlemaiden no longer. Take your new crown, Nar'jira, champion of Azshara."]="You have surpassed your title. You are a Battlemaiden no longer. Take your new crown, Nar'jira, champion of Azshara."
G["You have swept the filth from my doorstep. Perhaps you are worthy of my attention."]="You have swept the filth from my doorstep. Perhaps you are worthy of my attention."
G["You have talent, $n. But mercy makes you weak."]="Tem talento, $n. Mas a piedade te volta fraco."
G["You have taught me much, $r.  It seems the master has again become the student."]="Você me ensinou muito, $r. Parece que o mestre se tornou o estudante outra vez."
G["You have the heart of a giant, $n. It has been an honor!"]="Tem o coração de um gigantesco, $n. Foi uma honra!"
G["You have the look of a $g man : woman; who seeks knowledge. Perhaps you seek the teachings of the forge, and the hammer. Perhaps I can guide you down that path. But only once you have accepted the spirits, and listened to their calling."]="You have the look of a $g man : woman; who seeks knowledge. Perhaps you seek the teachings of the forge, and the hammer. Perhaps I can guide you down that path. But only once you have accepted the spirits, and listened to their calling."
G["You have the look of a champion. But do you have the fortitude."]="Tem o porte de um campeão. Me pergunto se possui também a fortaleza."
G["You have the power to change your destiny!"]="Têm o poder para alterar seu destino!"
G["You have the stride of a champion, $r."]="Tem o andar de $gun campeão: uma campeona;, $r."
G["You have the support of Ogri'la."]="Você ter o apoio de Ogri'a."
G["You have thwarted us for now, but we shall return..."]="Por agora tem frustrado nossos planos, mas volveremos..."
G["You have time to kill hapless island folk but no time to assemble my glorious body?"]="You have time to kill hapless island folk but no time to assemble my glorious body?"
G["You have time?  Soo-nee teach you good song!"]="Você tem tempo? Soo-nee ensinar boa música!"
G["You have to be careful lighting fireworks when you can't feel your fingers..."]="Você precisa pegar cuidado ao acender fogos de artifício quando não consegue sentir seus dedos..."
G["You have to be kidding me..."]="Precisa ser uma broma..."
G["You have to believe me, I'm innocent!"]="You have to believe me, I'm innocent!"
G["You have to get out of here before it gets to you, too!"]="Você precisa sair daqui antes que chegue até você também!"
G["You have to go to Thousand Needles and help. Please!"]="You have to go to Thousand Needles and help. Please!"
G["You have to help me, $c! Twilight's Hammer attacked my zeppelin and their men tried to take the tablets and the crystal I was transporting to Orgrimmar."]="You have to help me, $c! Twilight's Hammer attacked my zeppelin and their men tried to take the tablets and the crystal I was transporting to Orgrimmar."
G["You have to help us, Nove!"]="Precisa nos ajudar, Nove!"
G["You have to help! He just went to the market and never came back!"]="Precisa me ajudar! Se partiu ao submercado e não tem retornado!"
G["You have to let me in, my customers are waiting."]="You have to let me in, my customers are waiting."
G["You have to put a stop to this madness before it's too late!"]="Precisa acabar com esta loucura antes de que seja tarde demais!"
G["You have traveled long and risked much to be here! Your devotion shall be rewarded."]="Vocês têm feito um largo viagem e arriscado muito para estar aqui! Sua devoção será recompensada."
G["You have truly become one of the finest tailors in the business! Congratulations, I am proud to have been your instructor!"]="You have truly become one of the finest tailors in the business! Congratulations, I am proud to have been your instructor!"
G["You have truly excelled in your knowledge of enchanting. There is much more to learn, if you are willing. Speak to Taladan, in the Craftsmen's Terrace in Darnassus."]="Você mesmo se destacou no seu conhecimento de encantamento. Há muito mais a aprender, se você estiver disposto. Fale com o Taladan, no Terraço dos Artesãos em Darnassus."
G["You have truly grown more cunning, $n."]="Seu astúcia aumentou em grande medida, $n."
G["You have us working very efficiently, $rt. Our task will be complete soon at this pace."]="Obrigado você nosso trabalho é do mais eficiente, $rt. A este firme completaremos nossa tarefa em muito pouco tempo."
G["You have walked the trial of fortitude, and learned of the path of the Black Ox. May it bless your passage."]="Você passou pela provação da fortitude e aprendeu sobre o caminho do Boi Negro. Que ele abençoe sua passagem."
G["You have walked the trial of hope, and learned of the path of the Red Crane. May it guide your footsteps through time."]="Você passou pela provação da esperança e aprendeu sobre o caminho da Garça Vermelha. Que ele sempre guie seus passos."
G["You have walked the trial of strength, and learned of the path of the White Tiger. May you remember this lesson, always."]="Você passou pela provação da força e aprendeu sobre o caminho do Tigre Branco. Que você lembre desta lição para sempre."
G["You have walked the trial of wisdom, and learned of the path of the Jade Serpent. May you learn from this lesson, as I did."]="Você passou pela provação da sabedoria e aprendeu sobre o caminho da Serpente de Jade. Que você aprenda com esta lição, assim como eu."
G["You have wasted your time and mine by coming to me for training, $n. I have no time to teach basic skills. We're fighting a war here, and this is one of the front lines. Don't return to me until you are more prepared."]="You have wasted your time and mine by coming to me for training, $n. I have no time to teach basic skills. We're fighting a war here, and this is one of the front lines. Don't return to me until you are more prepared."
G["You have withstood the torment of the Lich King himself, and now Shadowmourne is yours."]="You have withstood the torment of the Lich King himself, and now Shadowmourne is yours."
G["You have woken the bull, now face the horns!"]="Tem despertado ao toro! Agora Enfrente aos chifres!"
G["You have won this battle, but not... the... war."]="Vocês têm ganhou esta batalha, mas não a guerra."
G["You have won... Maiev. But the huntress... is nothing without the hunt. You... are nothing... without me."]="ganhou... Maiev. Mas a caçadora... não é NADA... sem seu presa. VOCÊ... não é... nada... sem mim."
G["You have worked your way up... time to see the boss. Go to Josef and tell him you are ready."]="Você subiu... tempo para ver o chefe. Vá até Josef e diga que você está pronto."
G["You have wrested control of the Oculus from the forces of Malygos.  The red flight is in your debt."]="Você conseguiu o controle do Oculus das forças de Malygos. O vôo vermelho está na sua dívida."
G["You have your mop, now look for stains to swab!"]="Já tem seu mopa, agora procurando manchas que tenha que limpar!"
G["You have your petty secret, Kanrethad. Now, I demand knowledge from you... why do you care?"]="Você tem seu segredinho risível, Kanrethad. Agora eu exijo esse conhecimento. Por que você se importa?"
G["You have your whole life ahead of you."]="Tem toda a vida por linha de frente."
G["You have |cFFFF0000|Hspell:116161|h[Crossed Over]|h|r to the Spirit World! You or an ally must heal your spirit to 90% health within 30 seconds or else you will perish!"]="Tem |cFFFF0000|Hspell:116161|h[Cruzado]|h|r ao mundo dos espíritos! Um aliado ou você devem curar seu espírito até o 90% de vida dentro de 30 s ou morrerá."
G["You have, in the face of terrifying adversity, shown true valor and chivalry. From one glimmering beacon of heroism to another: I salute you!"]="You have, in the face of terrifying adversity, shown true valor and chivalry. From one glimmering beacon of heroism to another: I salute you!"
G["You have...turnip...for a head..."]="You have...turnip...for a head..."
G["You haven't completed the quest!"]="Não tem concluído a missão!"
G["You haven't had a real adventure until you've skipped through Onyxia's whelp pits!"]="You haven't had a real adventure until you've skipped through Onyxia's whelp pits!"
G["You haven't heard of the \"Brew of the Month\" club?  It's a bunch of really cute guys that want to celebrate Brewfest all year long!  They tried to bring Brewfest back in the past, but it never lasted very long.\n\nOnce you join the club you get mailed a different brew every month!  If you like that brew, you can talk to the vendors in Ironforge to get more brew.\n\nI think you are cute enough to join the club.  You give me a few prize tokens and I'll give you the forms.  Then maybe we can celebrate Brewfest together, all year round!"]="You haven't heard of the \"Brew of the Month\" club?  It's a bunch of really cute guys that want to celebrate Brewfest all year long!  They tried to bring Brewfest back in the past, but it never lasted very long.\n\nOnce you join the club you get mailed a different brew every month!  If you like that brew, you can talk to the vendors in Ironforge to get more brew.\n\nI think you are cute enough to join the club.  You give me a few prize tokens and I'll give you the forms.  Then maybe we can celebrate Brewfest together, all year round!"
G["You haven't heard of the \"Brew of the Month\" club?  Those gals love to party.  If they had their way, Brewfest would never end!  Sometimes last year, it felt like it didn't.\n\nBut now they've figured, the best way to keep the Brewfest spirit going would be to allow people to join their club.\n\nFor a small fee, just a few tokens, you can join!  You get brew mailed to you every month and a chance to buy that same brew if you like it.  It's cutting edge stuff and a way to make sure that Brewfest's spirit is never really gone."]="You haven't heard of the \"Brew of the Month\" club?  Those gals love to party.  If they had their way, Brewfest would never end!  Sometimes last year, it felt like it didn't.\n\nBut now they've figured, the best way to keep the Brewfest spirit going would be to allow people to join their club.\n\nFor a small fee, just a few tokens, you can join!  You get brew mailed to you every month and a chance to buy that same brew if you like it.  It's cutting edge stuff and a way to make sure that Brewfest's spirit is never really gone."
G["You haven't lived until you've looked down on the world from the back of a wind rider."]="Você não viveu até olhar para o mundo com as costas de um cicpronta."
G["You haven't much time. The Lich King sees what the sword sees. He will be here shortly."]="Não têm muito tempo. O Rei Lich vê o que vê a lâmina. Chegará em qualquer momentos."
G["You haven't seen zhe last of me, $p!"]="Isto não acabarr aqui, $p!"
G["You haven't signed your waiver!  Come back after you've signed away all claims of liability toward me or Tally."]="You haven't signed your waiver!  Come back after you've signed away all claims of liability toward me or Tally."
G["You haven't the strength to lead anyone."]="Não possui a força para liderar a ninguém."
G["You haven't yet mastered the simplest of enchantments. Please, trouble Dolothos instead."]="Ainda não dominas nem o mais simples dos encantamentos. Por favor, molesta a Dolothos em mim lugar."
G["You having a good time here with us in Ogri'la?\n\nWe have a lot of stuff that our ogres are making, day and night.  We save the best to sell to our coolest guests like you!\n\nSo, as you're out there doing your thing, and making the mountains a safer place, stop by from time to time to see what we have.\n\nGood luck out there, $g man : chicky;."]="You having a good time here with us in Ogri'la?\n\nWe have a lot of stuff that our ogres are making, day and night.  We save the best to sell to our coolest guests like you!\n\nSo, as you're out there doing your thing, and making the mountains a safer place, stop by from time to time to see what we have.\n\nGood luck out there, $g man : chicky;."
G["You healed the most damage during this battle!"]="Tem sanado mais que ninguém nesta batalha!"
G["You hear Unkor, dummy? Dance!"]="Oyes a Unkor, tonto? Baila!"
G["You hear a faint clicking noise coming from the west..."]="You hear a faint clicking noise coming from the west..."
G["You hear a faint echo...."]="Oyes um eco fraco..."
G["You hear a faint unlocking sound..."]="Oyes um fraco som de algo abrindo..."
G["You hear a grinding noise coming from the elevator shaft!"]="You hear a grinding noise coming from the elevator shaft!"
G["You hear a loud cracking noise as the rockling tries to smile."]="You hear a loud cracking noise as the rockling tries to smile."
G["You hear a loud rumble of metal grinding on stone..."]="You hear a loud rumble of metal grinding on stone..."
G["You hear a low guttural growl from nearby."]="Oyes um grave grunhido gutural que proviene de perto."
G["You hear a mournful howl in the distance."]="You hear a mournful howl in the distance."
G["You hear a noise behind you."]="Oyes um som por trás de ti."
G["You hear a noise from above the cabin door!"]="Oyes o ruido da porta do camarote de cima!"
G["You hear a shuffling noise nearby, but see nothing."]="You hear a shuffling noise nearby, but see nothing."
G["You hear it beeping very faintly.  The fossil must be very, very far away."]="You hear it beeping very faintly.  The fossil must be very, very far away."
G["You hear rustling of heavy wings in the distance.  The matriarch approaches!"]="You hear rustling of heavy wings in the distance.  The matriarch approaches!"
G["You hear something, Jones? I almost thought I heard something, right there..."]="You hear something, Jones? I almost thought I heard something, right there..."
G["You hear that, naga? $n is on $g his : her; way to settle our \"negotiations\"!"]="Vocês têm ouvido isso, nagas? $n vem de caminho para chegar a um acordo em nossas \"negociações\"!"
G["You hear that? I think they're getting closer..."]="Tem ouvido isso? Acho que se estão acercando..."
G["You hear that? You hear that chantin', brother? They're cheerin' for the Rulkster!"]="Você ouviu isso? Você ouviu isso, irmão? Eles estão torcendo pelo Governador!"
G["You hear the faint sound of a gate unlocking in the cavern."]="Oyes o fraco som de uma porta que se abra na caverna."
G["You hear the sound of beating wings from high up in the canyon as Rexxar approaches."]="You hear the sound of beating wings from high up in the canyon as Rexxar approaches."
G["You hear the sound of giant gears churning to life below the depths..."]="You hear the sound of giant gears churning to life below the depths..."
G["You hear the sound of shuffling stones behind you."]="You hear the sound of shuffling stones behind you."
G["You hear, some of the grummles are refusing to go up Mount Neverest?"]="You hear, some of the grummles are refusing to go up Mount Neverest?"
G["You heard correctly, Thassarian.  I wanted to give you a chance to kill me again."]="You heard correctly, Thassarian.  I wanted to give you a chance to kill me again."
G["You heard him! Keep that gun stocked with ammo!"]="You heard him! Keep that gun stocked with ammo!"
G["You heard him, men. We make our stand here!"]="Já lhe vocês têm ouvido, pessoal. Nos quedaremos aqui a defenda!"
G["You heard him, traveler. Speak to me again when you're ready to speak to Belgrum."]="Já lhe ouvido, viagemro. Volta a falar comigo quando estiver $gpronto: pronta; para falar com Belgrum."
G["You heard me, $glad:lass; - a butt! Not a fitting gift for a lady. But I liked it. So I offered to donate it to me local drinkin' hole.\n\nThey called it Durty Pete's Bottom, and eventually named the pub after it, afore them orcs burned it to toast, and all that's left today is me big blackened bottom amidst a heap of rubble.\n\n<Ol' Durty Pete sheds a single tear.>"]="You heard me, $glad:lass; - a butt! Not a fitting gift for a lady. But I liked it. So I offered to donate it to me local drinkin' hole.\n\nThey called it Durty Pete's Bottom, and eventually named the pub after it, afore them orcs burned it to toast, and all that's left today is me big blackened bottom amidst a heap of rubble.\n\n<Ol' Durty Pete sheds a single tear.>"
G["You heard that from your sister and she doesn't count. She's a big meanie. I double hozen dare you to ring the bell!"]="You heard that from your sister and she doesn't count. She's a big meanie. I double hozen dare you to ring the bell!"
G["You heard the Prophet. Move, filth."]="Já tem ouvido ao Profeta. Circula, escória."
G["You heard the Warlord, maggots! MARCH!"]="You heard the Warlord, maggots! MARCH!"
G["You heard the admiral. Concentrate fire on the Horde base. Begin your attack runs."]="Você ouviu o almirante. Concentre fogo na base da Horda. Comece as surtidas."
G["You heard the fleshling! MOVE OUT!"]="Já vocês têm ouvido ao ser de carne! VAMOS!"
G["You heard the goblin, $p. Get to work!"]="Já tem ouvido ao goblin, $p. Mãos à obra!"
G["You heard the king, bolster the line! Give our heroes the time they need to reach Garrosh!"]="You heard the king, bolster the line! Give our heroes the time they need to reach Garrosh!"
G["You heard the lady, boys... Give 'em some fire!"]="You heard the lady, boys... Give 'em some fire!"
G["You heard what I said! Your parents are cowards, and so are you, Furlbrow!"]="Tem ouvido o que e dito! Seus padres são uns covardes igual que você, Cejade!"
G["You help Rainspeaker! I saw you help Rainspeaker! Traitor thing!"]="Seu ajudar a Hablalhuvia! Eu ver você ajudar a Hablalhuvia! Coisa traidora!"
G["You here to buy or sell, stranger? Feel free to look around."]="You here to buy or sell, stranger? Feel free to look around."
G["You here to buy or sell? Feel free to look around."]="Tem vindo a comprar ou a vender? Não te cortes em dar um olhada por aí."
G["You here to fight?"]="Tem vindo a lutar?"
G["You here to fish?"]="You here to fish?"
G["You here to steal my yaks?!\n\nIf so, be ready for me to slap that look off your face."]="You here to steal my yaks?!\n\nIf so, be ready for me to slap that look off your face."
G["You here to stomp on the mook-mooks?"]="You here to stomp on the mook-mooks?"
G["You heroes are a sight for sore eyes. Vol'jin's rebellion wasn't able to secure the bay. We're taking a pounding."]="You heroes are a sight for sore eyes. Vol'jin's rebellion wasn't able to secure the bay. We're taking a pounding."
G["You hide well, worms.  But how long you can delay your doom?"]="You hide well, worms.  But how long you can delay your doom?"
G["You hit like a child."]="Pegas como um ninho."
G["You hit like a girl. Honestly. Is that the best you can do?"]="Pegas como uma garota. Em sério. Você não pode fazer isso melhor?"
G["You hit rock or me hit you!"]="Seu atacar rocha ou eu atacar você!"
G["You hold evil in your hands, fool! REPENT!"]="Portas o mal nos seus mãos, idiota! ARREPIÉNTENTE!"
G["You hold my father's blade, $n. My soldiers are yours to control, my $g Lord:Lady;. Take them... Lead them... The impure must be purged. They must be cleansed of their taint."]="Portas a lâmina de meu pai, $n. Meus Soldados estão agora sob seu envio, meu $gsenhor: senhora;. Cógelos... Dirígelos... Temos de acabar com os impuros. Têm de ser liberados da fedor que os contamina."
G["You hold still, fish!"]="You hold still, fish!"
G["You hold still, spider!"]="You hold still, spider!"
G["You honor me with your presence, $r. Alas, it is too late for me. I pass from this world soon, but... I know so much. So much is in this head of mine. So much that could help this world fend off the beasts of this citadel of depravity.\n\nPerhaps if you are a master of a trade... Yes, perhaps you would take the knowledge I hold and use it to save this world."]="You honor me with your presence, $r. Alas, it is too late for me. I pass from this world soon, but... I know so much. So much is in this head of mine. So much that could help this world fend off the beasts of this citadel of depravity.\n\nPerhaps if you are a master of a trade... Yes, perhaps you would take the knowledge I hold and use it to save this world."
G["You honor me, $g brother:sister;."]="É uma honra, $ghermano: irmã;."
G["You honor our memory."]="Honras nossa memória."
G["You honor the spirits of the animals you must slay by not letting them go to waste.  Aska Mistrunner will show you how.  She has a kitchen on the high rise."]="Você honra os espíritos dos animais que deve matar, não os deixando desperdiçar. Aska Mistrunner irá mostrar-lhe como. Ela tem uma cozinha em prédio alto."
G["You honor us by delivering this information.  It seems as if we've finally found the spy in the city... a homeless man whom we will execute shortly.  Take your reward, you've done well!"]="You honor us by delivering this information.  It seems as if we've finally found the spy in the city... a homeless man whom we will execute shortly.  Take your reward, you've done well!"
G["You honor us with your actions on behalf of our dead, $n."]="Nos honras com os seus actos em nome de nossos mortos, $n."
G["You honor us with your presence, $n."]="Nos honras com o seu presença, $n."
G["You honor us with your presence, Champion."]="Nos honras com o seu presença, $gcampeón: campeona;."
G["You honor us with your presence, my $glord:lady;."]="Nos honras com o seu presença, meu $gsenhor: senhora;."
G["You honor us, friend."]="Nos honras."
G["You hurt Lunk's feelings when you kill."]="You hurt Lunk's feelings when you kill."
G["You hurted the chief's lion seal! WHY YOU HURT LION SEAL??!"]="You hurted the chief's lion seal! WHY YOU HURT LION SEAL??!"
G["You impetuous little whelp... I know exactly what you and the mortal are up to."]="Filhote insolente... Sei exatamente o que estão tramando seu mortal e você."
G["You impress me, my young student. You have great strength in you."]="You impress me, my young student. You have great strength in you."
G["You in hot water now!"]="You in hot water now!"
G["You infuriate me, mortal!"]="Me enfureces, mortal!"
G["You insult my honor with your inquiries."]="Insultas meu honra com os seus pesquisas."
G["You invade my home and then dare to challenge me?  I will tear the hearts from your chests and offer them as gifts to the death god! Rualg nja gaborr!"]="You invade my home and then dare to challenge me?  I will tear the hearts from your chests and offer them as gifts to the death god! Rualg nja gaborr!"
G["You is BAD $r!"]="Você ser CRUEL, $r!"
G["You is bad orc... baaad... or... argh!"]="Você é orc ruim... maaalo... ou... argh!"
G["You is friend. Tanks!"]="Você ser amigo. Obrigado!"
G["You join me and I shower wealth and power upon you."]="You join me and I shower wealth and power upon you."
G["You joined a battle already lost."]="Luchas por uma causa perdida."
G["You just ate, silly. How can you be hungry again?"]="Mas se acabas de comer, tonta. Como pode ter fome outra vez?"
G["You just can't get good help these days!"]="É possível conseguir ajuda de qualidade nesta época!"
G["You just don't get it! This could be a herald to the end times!"]="Não o pilhas! Poderá ser o anúncio do fim dos tempos!"
G["You just don't see $cs like $n anymore."]="$n é $gun: uma; $c de $glos: as; que já não se venha."
G["You just get yourself beat up! Hah! You so dumb, slave thing."]="You just get yourself beat up! Hah! You so dumb, slave thing."
G["You just going to kneel there all day?"]="Vai ficar de joelhos aqui tudo o dia?"
G["You just got Chromie'd!"]="You just got Chromie'd!"
G["You just got served, punk!"]="Despachado, pedaço de inútil!"
G["You just keep goin' down this same road, but..."]="Somente precisa seguir este caminho, mas..."
G["You just let Zen'Kiki know when you're ready!  I'll bring one of these birds down for ya!"]="You just let Zen'Kiki know when you're ready!  I'll bring one of these birds down for ya!"
G["You just watch slave thing, Goregek take care of these hardknuckles!"]="You just watch slave thing, Goregek take care of these hardknuckles!"
G["You just watered that spot! Don't get lazy on me!"]="Acabas de regar essa parte! Não me seja vago!"
G["You just won a kickin' rad poster! Raise your hand in the air like you just don't care!"]="Acabas de ganhar um póster que parte a pana! Levante a mão e flipa em cores!"
G["You just won a video card!!"]="Acabas de ganhar uma cartão de vídeo!!"
G["You keep a lookout, $r! The elfs are everywhere!"]="Você vigilar, $r! Os elfos estar por todas partes!"
G["You keep pointing me in the right direction and I'll keep tossing these kegs!"]="You keep pointing me in the right direction and I'll keep tossing these kegs!"
G["You keep talking, but all I hear is \"Blah blah my people bathe in our own filth.\""]="You keep talking, but all I hear is \"Blah blah my people bathe in our own filth.\""
G["You keep that garbage up and I'll ship you back to your momma in a box with a note strapped to your chest that reads: FAILURE."]="You keep that garbage up and I'll ship you back to your momma in a box with a note strapped to your chest that reads: FAILURE."
G["You keep the company of wolvar? Perhaps you didn't come with good intentions after all."]="Te juntas com os wolvar? Talvez, depois de tudo, não tuvieras boas intenções."
G["You keep this up, and I might just have to share my secret to growing so many vegetables."]="Continua assim e terei que compartilhar meu segredo para conseguir que crezcan tantas verduras."
G["You kept me in that cell for too long, monster!"]="Me tido prisioneira em essa cela demais tempo, monstro!"
G["You kiddin' me..."]="Não pue'e ser..."
G["You kidding me, Commander? I ain't here to babysit some untried newcomer."]="You kidding me, Commander? I ain't here to babysit some untried newcomer."
G["You kids have fun at Mudmug's! And thanks again, $n!"]="You kids have fun at Mudmug's! And thanks again, $n!"
G["You kill dese ettins so we be comin' back ta finish dey job, mon!"]="You kill dese ettins so we be comin' back ta finish dey job, mon!"
G["You kill gronn!  Now you fight things from sky?"]="Você mata o Gronn! Agora você luta contra as coisas do céu?"
G["You kill him - you kill my cat! Why must I suffer so?"]="Vocês têm matou... Vocês têm matou a meu gato! Por que devo sofrer tanto?"
G["You kill next one!"]="Matar ao seguinte!"
G["You kill our pups! We kill you back!"]="Você matas nossos cachorros! Nós matar ti!"
G["You kill the trollbear, mon? It be safe for Tanzar to come out now?"]="matou ao troll urso, colega? É certo que Tanzar saia agora?"
G["You kill the trollbear, mon? It be safe for me to make my way back now?"]="matou ao troll urso, colega? É certo que me ponga em marcha eu somente?"
G["You killed Ghost Howl.  You're a stud!"]="Você matou o Ghost Howl. Você é um garanhão!"
G["You killed dozens of my students.  You will pay for what you've done."]="You killed dozens of my students.  You will pay for what you've done."
G["You killed me and now I will kill you... over and over!"]="You killed me and now I will kill you... over and over!"
G["You kind of like me, don't you?"]="Te caigo bem, verdade?"
G["You know I can make no guarantee of your safety... or Garrosh's response."]="Não posso garantir a sua segurança... nem a resposta de Garrosh."
G["You know I can't resist tauren women, Donty. They're my one weakness..."]="You know I can't resist tauren women, Donty. They're my one weakness..."
G["You know I do, mortal; I am abandoning a fair number of pretenses here, and I recommend you do the same.\n\nYou have come here clearly because you know that what you possess, garnered from your actions within the Sunken Temple of the Atal'al, has brought you to me for a purpose.  This purpose is to put my associate... my brother, to rest.  He is trapped within a nightmare within the Dream itself.  He cannot break free alone."]="Sabe que si, mortal. Deixarei de mentir e te recomendo que faça o mesmo.\n\nTem vindo aqui claramente porque sabe que o que possui, fruto dos seus obras no Templo Submerso dos Atal'ai, você trouxe até mim por alguma razão. Esta razão é conseguir que meu socio... meu irmão, logre descansar. Está preso em uma pesadelos dentro do próprio Sonho. Não pode escapar somente."
G["You know I love it when you beg... but no."]="Sabe que me encantar quando suplicas... mas não."
G["You know I'd gladly blow myself up for the company with you in charge, boss!"]="You know I'd gladly blow myself up for the company with you in charge, boss!"
G["You know Riko?  He good party."]="Konoces a Riko? É genial."
G["You know Yoon, maybe I was wrong about you."]="Verá, Yoon, talvez estava enganado com você."
G["You know about the Violet Eye then?  Maybe I'll have time for you later.\n\nI have to get back to my work."]="Então, tem ouvido falar do Olho Violeta? ao melhor depois terei tempo para você.\n\nTenho que voltar ao trabalho."
G["You know anything 'bout yaks, rookie? Well I know a lot about 'em."]="Sabe algo sobre yaks, $gnovato: novata;? Pois eu sei muito sobre eles."
G["You know enough to be dangerous, but you still look like you need training to me $n."]="Sabe o suficiente como para ser $gpeligroso: perigosa;, mas a mim me parece que ainda precisa treinamento, $n."
G["You know me to be the Supreme Commander of the Might of Kalimdor."]="Me conhece por ser o Comandante em Chefe das forças de Kalimdor."
G["You know not what you do!  We must destroy you for your own good."]="You know not what you do!  We must destroy you for your own good."
G["You know not what you have done. Aman'Thul... What I... have... seen..."]="Não têm nem ideia do que vocês têm feito. Aman'Thul... O que... e... visto..."
G["You know not what you have unleashed!"]="Não são conscientes do que vocês têm liberado!"
G["You know nothing of fury, worm!"]="Não sabe nada da fúria, me ver!"
G["You know nothing of loyalty!"]="Não sabe o que é a lealdade!"
G["You know nothing of pain, monster!"]="Não sabe nada aproxima do dor, monstro!"
G["You know nothing of power!"]="Não vocês sabem nada sobre o PODER!"
G["You know nothing of power. You cling to your allies in desperation, but they cannot save you."]="You know nothing of power. You cling to your allies in desperation, but they cannot save you."
G["You know of more Stormstouts? Here, in Pandaria?"]="Conhece a mais Cerveja de Trovão? Aqui, em Pandaria?"
G["You know of our history with the black dragonflight, do you? I won't soon forget what Lady Prestor - Onyxia - did to my family. Maybe that's why I sought Wrathion out.\n\n<Anduin peers across the table at his unusual companion.>\n\nBut... he's not like the other black dragons, is he? He's completely honest and yet always hiding something. Not at all what I expected."]="You know of our history with the black dragonflight, do you? I won't soon forget what Lady Prestor - Onyxia - did to my family. Maybe that's why I sought Wrathion out.\n\n<Anduin peers across the table at his unusual companion.>\n\nBut... he's not like the other black dragons, is he? He's completely honest and yet always hiding something. Not at all what I expected."
G["You know of the Spirits of Competition, yes?\n\nEvery two years they draw close to the mortal realm. During such times, members of both the Alliance and Horde wear Competitor's Tabards into the Battlegrounds to honor the spirits, seeking to defeat one another and earn their favor.\n\nI stockpile souvenirs from such turbulent times. If you've learned the proper word, I might be convinced to part with one..."]="You know of the Spirits of Competition, yes?\n\nEvery two years they draw close to the mortal realm. During such times, members of both the Alliance and Horde wear Competitor's Tabards into the Battlegrounds to honor the spirits, seeking to defeat one another and earn their favor.\n\nI stockpile souvenirs from such turbulent times. If you've learned the proper word, I might be convinced to part with one..."
G["You know that these are troubling times for the Horde.  Our supplies dwindle.  Our lands are barren.  Our warriors are in need of rest.  These are tasks that must be addressed for the good of the Horde."]="You know that these are troubling times for the Horde.  Our supplies dwindle.  Our lands are barren.  Our warriors are in need of rest.  These are tasks that must be addressed for the good of the Horde."
G["You know the battle plan, right?"]="Conhece o plano de ataque, não?"
G["You know the plays, kid. Execute them!"]="Já sabe como se há, rapaz. Ejecútalos!"
G["You know the service down here just keeps getting worse and worse!"]="O serviço é cada dia pior."
G["You know the worst thing about fire creatures? No harvestable organs."]="You know the worst thing about fire creatures? No harvestable organs."
G["You know their kind as old gods.  Beware Yogg-Saron, the beast with a thousand maws.  His evil extends beyond Vordrassil's roots."]="Chamam aos do seu classe deuses antigos. Tenha cuidado com Yogg-Saron, a fera das mil fauces. Seu maldade se extiende além das raízes de Vordrassil."
G["You know there are crocolisks in the Canals. They were brought from the swamp as pets, but got thrown in the canals."]="You know there are crocolisks in the Canals. They were brought from the swamp as pets, but got thrown in the canals."
G["You know too much!"]="Sabe demais!"
G["You know well enough about why I'm here, Zanzil."]="Sabe muito bem por que eh'toy aqui, Zanzil."
G["You know what I been thinking, my good friend? You need a way to keep up with all your friends at home.\n\nI know a carpenter who can come by an install your own mailbox. How's that for an idea?"]="You know what I been thinking, my good friend? You need a way to keep up with all your friends at home.\n\nI know a carpenter who can come by an install your own mailbox. How's that for an idea?"
G["You know what I have a craving for? A good bowl of Swirling Mist Soup. That would sure taste good right now."]="You know what I have a craving for? A good bowl of Swirling Mist Soup. That would sure taste good right now."
G["You know what I think? <Tomma glances quickly behind him.>\n\nThe saur-priests are as filled with filth as the village itself.\n\nTheir Kroshik-worship makes them weak. They preach strength, but do they hunt? Do they kill? Do they roll in the decaying remains of their fallen brothers?\n\nNo. They hide in their caves and talk. If they were truly strong, they would be out here fighting with us."]="You know what I think? <Tomma glances quickly behind him.>\n\nThe saur-priests are as filled with filth as the village itself.\n\nTheir Kroshik-worship makes them weak. They preach strength, but do they hunt? Do they kill? Do they roll in the decaying remains of their fallen brothers?\n\nNo. They hide in their caves and talk. If they were truly strong, they would be out here fighting with us."
G["You know what dat mean..."]="Você sabe o ke isso signifika..."
G["You know what needs to be done, champion."]="Você sabe o que precisa ser feito."
G["You know what they say - help your neighbors and your neighbors will help you.\n\nSure, you can help 'em out with chores now and then, but gifts make faster friends, don'tcha think?"]="You know what they say - help your neighbors and your neighbors will help you.\n\nSure, you can help 'em out with chores now and then, but gifts make faster friends, don'tcha think?"
G["You know what they say about curiosity...."]="Já vocês sabem o que dizem da curiosidade..."
G["You know what they say... if you can't beat 'em, join 'em! And in this case, you won't have the choice! Cruicible of Carnage, I adore you so."]="You know what they say... if you can't beat 'em, join 'em! And in this case, you won't have the choice! Cruicible of Carnage, I adore you so."
G["You know what time it is? That's right, it's time to DIE!"]="Sabe que hora é? Sim, assim é, a hora de MORRER!"
G["You know what would be the cherry on top today? Nazgrim dead."]="Sabe que faria de hoje um dia redondo? A morte de Nazgrim."
G["You know what's the best thing about this group?"]="Sabe que é o melhor deste grupo?"
G["You know what, $p?"]="$p, Sabe que?"
G["You know what."]="Já sabe o que."
G["You know what? I'm going to show them that I can also become a master farmer!\n\nI'm going to turn this farm into one of the most prosperous in the Valley!\n\nIt's too much work for one pandaren, though. Whaddaya say? Want to help me?"]="Sabe que? Lhes pretendo demostrar que eu também posso ser um mestre fazendeiro!\n\nVou a fazer desta fazenda uma das mais prósperas do vale!\n\nNão obstante, é demais trabalho para um somente pandaren. Que diz? Me ajudará?"
G["You know what? You remind me of the Ambulatory Campfire prototype that I've been working on."]="You know what? You remind me of the Ambulatory Campfire prototype that I've been working on."
G["You know where I stand, Stonemother."]="You know where I stand, Stonemother."
G["You know who can really show you some things? Nogg! You go find him in Orgrimmar."]="Você sabe quem pode mesmo mostrar algumas coisas? Nogg! Você o encontra em Orgrimmar."
G["You know who's got the biggest vegetables in the Valley? You're lookin' at him!"]="Sabe quem tnas verduras mais grandes do Vale? O tem linha de frente de ti!"
G["You know who's really smart? Nogg! Smarter than me, even. You go tell Nogg Thund sent you! You can find him by the control panel over there."]="Você sabe quem é mesmo inteligente? Nogg! Mais esperto que eu, até. Você vai dizer que Nogg Thund lhe enviou! Você pode encontrá-o pelo painel de controle ali."
G["You know why orc eyes glow red? It's because they drink blood!"]="You know why orc eyes glow red? It's because they drink blood!"
G["You know why they call it stout? 'Cuz once it were rolling down the hill it couldnae be bargained wit', couldnae be reasoned wit'. It felt no pity, no remorse, no fear.\n\nIt were like a beervalanche, which is a damn fine way to die.\n\nSo that keg explodered soon as it hit the orphanage at the bottom of the hill, and I dove inta the mud puddle wit' me mouth open, an'... Come to think of it, I don't 'member how this story ends. Wanna see the tattoo?\n\n<Ol' Durty Pete drops his pants.>"]="You know why they call it stout? 'Cuz once it were rolling down the hill it couldnae be bargained wit', couldnae be reasoned wit'. It felt no pity, no remorse, no fear.\n\nIt were like a beervalanche, which is a damn fine way to die.\n\nSo that keg explodered soon as it hit the orphanage at the bottom of the hill, and I dove inta the mud puddle wit' me mouth open, an'... Come to think of it, I don't 'member how this story ends. Wanna see the tattoo?\n\n<Ol' Durty Pete drops his pants.>"
G["You know why!"]="Sabe por que!"
G["You know, $n, it's such an honor to work with you!\n\nWhen you're not busy wrangling, maybe we could $g go out some place for dinner? : get together for a girl's night?;\n\nOh, did I mention that we can now get you to our base in the Skethyl Mountains real quick?  If you want, speak with Skyguard Handler Irena about that."]="You know, $n, it's such an honor to work with you!\n\nWhen you're not busy wrangling, maybe we could $g go out some place for dinner? : get together for a girl's night?;\n\nOh, did I mention that we can now get you to our base in the Skethyl Mountains real quick?  If you want, speak with Skyguard Handler Irena about that."
G["You know, I could just leave you up there!"]="You know, I could just leave you up there!"
G["You know, I could run an orc through or slice up a troll.  I could even carve my initials in an ogre's flank, but I just can't stand to skin an animal.  Go figure, eh.  \nWell, if you have the stomach for it, then go see Maris Granger at the Protective Hide in Old Town."]="You know, I could run an orc through or slice up a troll.  I could even carve my initials in an ogre's flank, but I just can't stand to skin an animal.  Go figure, eh.  \nWell, if you have the stomach for it, then go see Maris Granger at the Protective Hide in Old Town."
G["You know, I have often thought of making a mechano-pup. We should study these wolves more closely."]="Sabe, andei pensando em fazer um mecanofilhote. Acho que devemos estudar esses lobos mais de perto."
G["You know, I just don't really feel much like working today."]="Hoje não me apetece muito trabalhar, sabe?"
G["You know, I kept hearing the Blackrock orcs talk about the return of Hellscream to the Horde. What's that all about? Isn't Hellscream dead?"]="You know, I kept hearing the Blackrock orcs talk about the return of Hellscream to the Horde. What's that all about? Isn't Hellscream dead?"
G["You know, I really envy these guys!"]="You know, I really envy these guys!"
G["You know, I saw the Wrestler's real face once. True story."]="Um dia lhe vi a rosto ao Lutador. De verdade."
G["You know, I think that yeti appreciates good kafa more than most people. And she has't eaten a single grummle since you brought her down from the peak!"]="You know, I think that yeti appreciates good kafa more than most people. And she has't eaten a single grummle since you brought her down from the peak!"
G["You know, I think we can hit Honor Hold from here."]="Sabe? Acho que podemos chegar ao Bastião do Honra desde aqui."
G["You know, I'm going to be using this orb to perform a powerful ritual in just a few minutes.  Don't tell anyone this... but I'll be summoning a pit lord.  Redridge will bow to the Blackrock!"]="You know, I'm going to be using this orb to perform a powerful ritual in just a few minutes.  Don't tell anyone this... but I'll be summoning a pit lord.  Redridge will bow to the Blackrock!"
G["You know, I've always like the color of jade. So green, just like the forest."]="Olhe, sempre me gostado o cor do jade. Tão verde... como o florestas."
G["You know, I've always wondered why they call themselves orcs."]="Sabe, sempre me e perguntado por que se chamam a si mesmos \"orcs\"."
G["You know, I've been stuck in these cages watching the mogu a lot, but I'm pretty sure I've never seen a girl mogu.  What's with that?"]="Sabe uma coisa? Levo um bom tempo em essa jaula, observando aos mogu, mas acho que não vi a nenhuma mulher mogu. E isso?"
G["You know, I've decided I like having you as a friend. Makes me think that maybe I can have other friends, too."]="You know, I've decided I like having you as a friend. Makes me think that maybe I can have other friends, too."
G["You know, Keeshan lost his wife to Blackrock orcs. He was never the same after that day. Was like the sun just set on his life. Darkness, $g man:lady;. Pure darkness."]="Keeshan perdeu ao seu mulher a mãos dos orcs Rocha Negra, sabe. Depois de aquilo, nunca foi o mesmo. Era como se o sol se tivesse posto no sua vida. Escuridão, $gsenhor: senhora;. Pura escuridão."
G["You know, big brown guy was lookin' for a trip up north earlier. Some Garrod... err... Ganosh... err... anyway, I didn't get his name."]="You know, big brown guy was lookin' for a trip up north earlier. Some Garrod... err... Ganosh... err... anyway, I didn't get his name."
G["You know, getting items must be hard for these guys!"]="You know, getting items must be hard for these guys!"
G["You know, good friends always share their farming secrets. Now tell me, how do you get your vegetables looking like that?"]="You know, good friends always share their farming secrets. Now tell me, how do you get your vegetables looking like that?"
G["You know, if I was a bit younger, I'd show you how a real man courts a young lady."]="Sabe, se fosse algo mais jovem, te ensenfaria como corteja a uma jovem dama um homem de verdade."
G["You know, if you'd just been reasonable about the whole thing, I might have simply sold the key to you. Not that it would have done you any good. Broke off in the lock. Muahahahahahahaha!"]="You know, if you'd just been reasonable about the whole thing, I might have simply sold the key to you. Not that it would have done you any good. Broke off in the lock. Muahahahahahahaha!"
G["You know, if you're looking for a place to hide out, you're free to join us in our caravan."]="Já sabe, se atenção um lugar no que esconder, pode se juntar a nossa caravana."
G["You know, that does smell pretty... Hey! Stop spraying that thing at me!"]="You know, that does smell pretty... Hey! Stop spraying that thing at me!"
G["You know, that house that Farmer Yoon lives in is a dump! He should talk to Tina. I hear she's real good at redecorating."]="Essa casa na que vive o fazendeiro Yoon é uma vergonha! Deveria falar com Tina. Dizem que se lhe da muito bem a decoração."
