G["You may stay in our village as long as you need, stranger. Just... please try to keep your weapons sheathed."]="You may stay in our village as long as you need, stranger. Just... please try to keep your weapons sheathed."
G["You may stay only until Taylor is well. But then, you must leave."]="You may stay only until Taylor is well. But then, you must leave."
G["You may stay while you are still useful, outsider."]="You may stay while you are still useful, outsider."
G["You may succeed on the field of battle briefly... but you cannot hope to win against my Scourge!"]="You may succeed on the field of battle briefly... but you cannot hope to win against my Scourge!"
G["You may take my life, but you won't take my freedom!"]="You may take my life, but you won't take my freedom!"
G["You may think you have won, worms, but against the might of the Lich King there is no victory for the living! You have not seen the last of me!"]="You may think you have won, worms, but against the might of the Lich King there is no victory for the living! You have not seen the last of me!"
G["You may unlearn all of your current Talents for a price, so that you may select new ones.\nThis will become more expensive each additonal time you do so."]="Pode esquecer seus talentos e selecionar uns novos por um módico preço.\n\nSempre que repitas esta operação, será mais caro."
G["You may unlearn your current Class Specialization for a price, so that you may select a new one.\nThis will become more expensive each additonal time you do so."]="Pode esquecer seu especialização de classe e selecionar uma nova por um módico preço.\n\nSempre que repitas esta operação, será mais caro."
G["You may walk through the streets of Orgrimmar with pride!"]="Pode caminhar pelas ruas de Orgrimmar cheio de orgulho!"
G["You may want to consider leaving this place. I think being transformed into a frog is one of the better things that can happen to one here."]="You may want to consider leaving this place. I think being transformed into a frog is one of the better things that can happen to one here."
G["You may want to rethink your actions, fool."]="You may want to rethink your actions, fool."
G["You may want to take cover."]="You may want to take cover."
G["You may wish to put some more signal powder on the brazier next time. I'm not sure they could see that from Orgrimmar...."]="Talvez a próxima vez queira colocar mais polvos de santo e senha no fogo. Não acho que tenham pedido ver isso desde Orgrimmar..."
G["You may yet regret your presence here."]="You may yet regret your presence here."
G["You mean it? Oh, I cannae WAIT to see the look on Brann's face when he finds out I got an excavation green-lit by the King himself! You'll have your quarry by next sundown!"]="You mean it? Oh, I cannae WAIT to see the look on Brann's face when he finds out I got an excavation green-lit by the King himself! You'll have your quarry by next sundown!"
G["You mean other than Lazy Dan over there? Sure!\n\nI spent some time with Evie before she went hunting up north. Such a sweet girl.\n\nAnd of course, who could forget Mama Stormstout?"]="You mean other than Lazy Dan over there? Sure!\n\nI spent some time with Evie before she went hunting up north. Such a sweet girl.\n\nAnd of course, who could forget Mama Stormstout?"
G["You mean the iceberg?"]="Você quer dizer o iceberg?"
G["You mean to say - physical strength is developed without, but fortitude comes from within?"]="Que dizer que a força se desarrolha no exterior, mas a fortitude vem do interior, não?"
G["You mean to say there is a warlock? Here, in goodly Theramore?!\nOh, my. Someone must inform Lady Proudmoore immediately!\n...heh."]="Que dizer que há um bruxo? Aqui, na bendita Theramore?!\n\nAy, mãe. Alguém deve informar a Lady Corajoso de imediatamente!... Jejeje."
G["You mean to tell me you sell frogs?"]="Você quer me dizer que vende sapos?"
G["You mean you can't smell the smoke of the Dwarven forges from here?  Well, you will be looking for Therum Deepforge if you want to learn blacksmithing.  He's over in the Dwarven District which is just north of the Cathedral Square."]="Você quer dizer que não pode sentir o cheiro da fumaça das forjas dos anões daqui? Bem, você estará procurando Therum Deepforge se quiser aprender ferraria. Ele está no distrito de Dwarven, ao norte da Praça da Catedral."
G["You mean, I can do it here, too?"]="Que dizer O que posso fazer isso aqui também?"
G["You mean, you don't know? The sword that you carry on your back - it is known as Ashbringer; named after its original owner."]="You mean, you don't know? The sword that you carry on your back - it is known as Ashbringer; named after its original owner."
G["You mean..."]="Que dizer que..."
G["You meddle in affairs beyond your comprehension."]="You meddle in affairs beyond your comprehension."
G["You mentioned two results when the Earthen destabilize.  What is the second?"]="Você mencionou dois resultados quando os terrenos desestabilizaram. Qual é o segundo?"
G["You merely destroy an image, fool. I shall hunt you until the end of days."]="You merely destroy an image, fool. I shall hunt you until the end of days."
G["You merely prolong the inevitable. Succumb. She will free your misguided soul."]="You merely prolong the inevitable. Succumb. She will free your misguided soul."
G["You mess with Silas, you mess with me.  Have a nice day."]="Você mexe com Silas, você mexe comigo. Tenha um bom dia."
G["You messed with the wrong goblin."]="Você metido com o goblin enganado."
G["You messed with the wrong soldier!"]="Você metido com o soldado enganado!"
G["You might be able to take me, but the Defias WILL take back Stormwind!"]="You might be able to take me, but the Defias WILL take back Stormwind!"
G["You might be right, sister.  My obligations to my land and King have been fulfilled.  But there is something that I still owe to myself."]="Talvez tenha razão, irmã. E concluído meu dever com meu terra e com meu rei, mas ainda há algo que devo fazer por mim."
G["You might be the best set of recruits I've ever seen!  Let's go through all of that again!"]="You might be the best set of recruits I've ever seen!  Let's go through all of that again!"
G["You might have found me, but you won't bring word back to the others!"]="Talvez me tenha encontrado, mas não lhes contarás nada aos mais!"
G["You might have gone feral, but Gilnean blood still pumps through your veins.  Defend our homelands agains the Horde!"]="You might have gone feral, but Gilnean blood still pumps through your veins.  Defend our homelands agains the Horde!"
G["You might have gotten past the weaklings. You aren't gonna get past me."]="Talvez tenha superado aos fracos. Mas não me vai superar a mim."
G["You might need this shield."]="Talvez necesites este escudo."
G["You might not have that long.  Enemy reinforcements are already underway."]="Talvez não tenha tanto tempo. Os reforços do inimigo estão de caminho."
G["You might not think that a Worgen like myself would know how to cook a fine steak.\n\nJust 'cuz I like my meat raw... Still panting from flight... Arterial spray in my face...\n\nWhat were we talking about? Oh yes! I was quite the gourmet back in Gilneas."]="You might not think that a Worgen like myself would know how to cook a fine steak.\n\nJust 'cuz I like my meat raw... Still panting from flight... Arterial spray in my face...\n\nWhat were we talking about? Oh yes! I was quite the gourmet back in Gilneas."
G["You might wanna keep your distance, $c. We on pretty strict Kor'kron lockdown around here. No knowin' what might happen."]="You might wanna keep your distance, $c. We on pretty strict Kor'kron lockdown around here. No knowin' what might happen."
G["You might wanna stand back. Fish guttin' is a dirty job."]="Você pode querer recuar. Peixe guttin 'é um trabalho sujo."
G["You minnows finish early and you can go for a nice swim. How's that sound?"]="You minnows finish early and you can go for a nice swim. How's that sound?"
G["You miserable fools never did manage to select a decent bat wing."]="You miserable fools never did manage to select a decent bat wing."
G["You missed some."]="Você saído algum."
G["You mistake this for weakness?  Fool!"]="Confundes isto com fraqueza? Insensato!"
G["You mistake your greatest strength for weakness. Do you see this?"]="Confundes sua maior força com fraqueza. Não o vê?"
G["You mooks be on the lookout for any looters. Treat them with extreme prejudice!"]="You mooks be on the lookout for any looters. Treat them with extreme prejudice!"
G["You mortals may remember Alysra, who spirited me to freedom in Mount Hyjal. She, too has been reborn. Born of flame!"]="You mortals may remember Alysra, who spirited me to freedom in Mount Hyjal. She, too has been reborn. Born of flame!"
G["You motherless knaves! Your corpses will make fine morsels for my new drake!"]="You motherless knaves! Your corpses will make fine morsels for my new drake!"
G["You move like a pregnant yak. You are not ready to be trained here."]="Te move como um yak em faixa. Ainda não pode instruir aqui."
G["You move too slowly, how does your kind catch any prey?"]="You move too slowly, how does your kind catch any prey?"
G["You move with grace, rogue. How may I help you?"]="You move with grace, rogue. How may I help you?"
G["You movements are light, free, flowing ... you would be killed in an instant. Get out of the ring!"]="You movements are light, free, flowing ... you would be killed in an instant. Get out of the ring!"
G["You mussst forgive me... I have no time to ssstay and play."]="You mussst forgive me... I have no time to ssstay and play."
G["You must answer to the elements, demon!"]="Deve responder ante os elementos, demônio!"
G["You must be $n.\n\nI've been expecting you."]="Você deve ser $n.\n\nTe estava esperando."
G["You must be exalted with the blood elves before I will teach you a riding skill, $c."]="É necessário que os elfos de sangue te consideren $gun exaltado: uma exaltada; para que possa ensinar uma habilidade de equitação, $c."
G["You must be friendly with the blood elves before I will teach you a riding skill, $c."]="É necessário que os elfos de sangue te consideren $gamistoso: amistosa; para que possa ensinar uma habilidade de equitação, $c."
G["You must be hard up to be wandering these Badlands, $c.  Hard up like me.\n\nOr maybe you're here because you're crazy.  Crazy, like me."]="You must be hard up to be wandering these Badlands, $c.  Hard up like me.\n\nOr maybe you're here because you're crazy.  Crazy, like me."
G["You must be looking for Palehoof, who keeps our elevators and windmills in good working order. Find him upon the lower rise."]="Ouvidos a Pezunha Pálida, o que se ocupa do mantenimento de nossos ascensores e moinhos. O encontrar na Pequena Pendente."
G["You must be looking for Smith Argus.  He's usually overseeing the forge in Goldshire if you need some training."]="Você deve estar procurando por Smith Argus. Ele geralmente supervisiona a forja em Goldshire, se você precisar de algum treinamento."
G["You must be my secret admirer! Well, not so secret anymore. Thanks!"]="Você deve ser meu $gadmirador secreto: admiradora secreta;! Bom, já não tão $gsecreto: secreta;... Obrigado!"
G["You must be one of the brave soldiers who have been fighting the Scourge forces of Mal'Ganis. Well done."]="Você deve ser um dos bravos soldados que lutam contra as forças do Flagelo de Mal'Ganis. Bem feito."
G["You must be one of those folk from that sky-ship that crashed. I have MANY questions for you, but this is a terrible place to chat."]="You must be one of those folk from that sky-ship that crashed. I have MANY questions for you, but this is a terrible place to chat."
G["You must be powerful, to have come this far. Yes, yes... you will make worthy test subjects."]="You must be powerful, to have come this far. Yes, yes... you will make worthy test subjects."
G["You must be purged from this land."]="Os borraremos do mapa."
G["You must be quite the cook, $n. This looks very nice."]="Deve cozinhar muito bem, $n. Isto tem muito boa pinta."
G["You must be riding a tournament mount before I can instruct you.\n\nEquip a lance and find a tournament mount outside your faction's pavilion."]="You must be riding a tournament mount before I can instruct you.\n\nEquip a lance and find a tournament mount outside your faction's pavilion."
G["You must be seeking Zen Master Lao! He is working at the Setting Sun Garrison in the Vale of Eternal Blossoms.\n\nI will mark his location on your map."]="Acho que procura o mestre zen Lao! Trabalha no Baluarte do Sol Oeste, no Vale da Flor Eterna.\n\nTe marcarei seu localização no mapa."
G["You must be the $r that freed Bold Karasshi and our other brothers! We owe you our thanks."]="Você deve ser $gel: a; $r que liberó a Karasshi o Audaz e a nossos irmãos! Te devemos nosso agradecimento."
G["You must be the hero that everyone is talking about. Thank you."]="You must be the hero that everyone is talking about. Thank you."
G["You must be the laziest messenger known to draenei."]="You must be the laziest messenger known to draenei."
G["You must be the one who helped our brothers. Thank you."]="Você deve ser $gel: a; que ajudou a nossos irmãos. Obrigado."
G["You must be the outsider that everyone speaks of."]="You must be the outsider that everyone speaks of."
G["You must be the sorriest bunch of recruits I've seen today!  Fall in formations and report to High Executor Anselm!"]="Devem ser a panda mais patética de recrutas que vi em tudo o dia! Poneos em formação e presentaos ante o sumo executor Anselm!"
G["You must be the talented hunter that Wulf mentioned, the hunter who has managed to attract King Wrynn's attention."]="Deve ser $gese caçador: essa caçadora; com tanto talento que mencionó Wulf; $gese: essa; que tem chamado a atenção do rei Wrynn."
G["You must be the trainer I've heard about. Tell me, do you fear defeat?"]="You must be the trainer I've heard about. Tell me, do you fear defeat?"
G["You must choose a more experienced teacher, for you have surpassed my abilities. I advise you to speak with Lilyssia Nightbreeze here: she has much knowledge to offer."]="Você deve escolher um professor mais experiente, pois superou minhas habilidades. Aconselho que você fale com Lilyssia Nightbreeze aqui: ela tem muito conhecimento a oferecer."
G["You must continue! Their resolve is weakening. Drink from my power and be renewed once again!"]="Deve seguir! Seu determinação se você está debilitando. Bebe de minha força e renuévate novamente!"
G["You must decide, young Lu. What is worth fighting for?"]="Deve pegar uma decisão, jovem Lu. Por que merece a pena lutar?"
G["You must defeat Prince Sandoval. It is your only hope for survival, $c."]="Deve derrotar ao príncipe Sandoval. É seu única espranza de sobreviver, $c."
G["You must defeat our rivals in any of the Battlegrounds. With every victory, there is a chance that a Gold Medallion will be mailed to you."]="Você deve derrotar nossos rivais em qualquer um dos campos de batalha. A cada vitória, há uma chance de que um medalhão de ouro seja enviado a você."
G["You must defeat your rivals in any of the Battlegrounds. With every victory, there is a chance that a Gold Medallion will be mailed to you."]="Você deve derrotar seus rivais em qualquer um dos campos de batalha. A cada vitória, há uma chance de que um medalhão de ouro seja enviado a você."
G["You must destroy it. Here, now, before any harm can come to Pandaria."]="You must destroy it. Here, now, before any harm can come to Pandaria."
G["You must destroy the source of the corruption! Quickly, before our cherished history is erased forever!"]="Devem destruir o origem da corrupção! Rápido, antes de que nossa valiosa história se pierda para sempre!"
G["You must destroy these outsiders, empress! They have come to conquer your people!"]="Deve acabar com estes forasteiros, Imperatriz! Têm vindo a conquistar ao seu povo!"
G["You must die! But wait: this does not-- No, no... you must die!"]="Tem de morrer! Aguarda: isto não-- Não, não... tem de morrer!"
G["You must do what I could not: Save the peasants that were cut down while fleeing from Stratholme.\n\nThey will walk towards the light, you must ensure their survival. Should too many fall, our cursed existence shall continue - you will have failed.\n\nEvery ability, prayer, and spell that you have learned will be tested. May the Light protect you, $n."]="You must do what I could not: Save the peasants that were cut down while fleeing from Stratholme.\n\nThey will walk towards the light, you must ensure their survival. Should too many fall, our cursed existence shall continue - you will have failed.\n\nEvery ability, prayer, and spell that you have learned will be tested. May the Light protect you, $n."
G["You must do what you think is right, Marcus. We served together under Turalyon. He made us both the men that we are today. Did he err with me? Do you truly believe my intent is to cause harm to our alliance? Would I shame our heroes?"]="You must do what you think is right, Marcus. We served together under Turalyon. He made us both the men that we are today. Did he err with me? Do you truly believe my intent is to cause harm to our alliance? Would I shame our heroes?"
G["You must drop everything that you're doing to help me free my father, our leader the Stonefather."]="Deve deixar tudo o que tem entre mãos pai me ajudar a liberar a meu pai e nosso líder, o Para Pétreo."
G["You must feel it already then... the demonic energy entering your heart, your lungs, your soul..."]="You must feel it already then... the demonic energy entering your heart, your lungs, your soul..."
G["You must fight now, $n!"]="Agora deve lutar, $n!"
G["You must find Thrall and put a stop to Hellscream's reign."]="Devem encontrar a Thrall e colocar fim ao reino de Grito Infernal."
G["You must find a way to show that you both are fighting for the same side. Although the Timbermaw may attack you now, if you are diligent, you will find a way.\n\nYou must remember that any attacks on the Timbermaw furbolg directly will greatly hinder your chances of gaining them as an ally.\n\nA good place to start would be the Deadwood furbolg found in many parts of Felwood. These furbolg are the enemy of the Timbermaw tribe, and slaying them would greatly improve your standing with the Timbermaw."]="You must find a way to show that you both are fighting for the same side. Although the Timbermaw may attack you now, if you are diligent, you will find a way.\n\nYou must remember that any attacks on the Timbermaw furbolg directly will greatly hinder your chances of gaining them as an ally.\n\nA good place to start would be the Deadwood furbolg found in many parts of Felwood. These furbolg are the enemy of the Timbermaw tribe, and slaying them would greatly improve your standing with the Timbermaw."
G["You must find one amongst the wretch in the lower portion of this citadel that has attained an Unadorned Seal of Ascension. It is a great honor for one of the lesser beings to obtain this item, as it is the first step in gaining access to the upper citadel and becoming one of Nefarian's elite guardsmen - the Blackhand legion. Find such an item and return it to me so that I may examine its properties. I will know how to proceed once my inspection of the seal is complete."]="Você deve encontrar um entre os miseráveis ​​na parte inferior desta cidadela que alcançou um Selo de Ascensão sem adornos. É uma grande honra para um dos seres inferiores obter esse item, pois é o primeiro passo para obter acesso à cidadela superior e se tornar um dos guardas de elite de Nefarian - a legião Mão Negra. Encontre esse item e devolva-o para que eu possa examinar suas propriedades. Eu saberei como proceder quando minha inspeção do selo estiver concluída."
G["You must flee at once, if you value your life."]="You must flee at once, if you value your life."
G["You must fly through all 10 checkpoints before you can finish the race."]="You must fly through all 10 checkpoints before you can finish the race."
G["You must fly up to Stonehearth, aid my people against the stone troggs, and free my father.\n\nI will meet you there shortly after speaking with the Earthcaller.\n\nDon't let him die, $n, or I will put you in the ground myself!"]="You must fly up to Stonehearth, aid my people against the stone troggs, and free my father.\n\nI will meet you there shortly after speaking with the Earthcaller.\n\nDon't let him die, $n, or I will put you in the ground myself!"
G["You must focus on your training!  Try again!"]="Concéntrate no seu treinamento! Volta a tentar!"
G["You must focus."]="Você precisa se concentrar!"
G["You must forget your weapon type specialty before i can help you.   Go to Everlook in Winterspring and seek help there!"]="Deve esquecer seu especialidade em um tipo de arma antes de que possa ajudar você. Vê a Visão Eterna, em Cuna do Inverno, e procurando ajuda ali!"
G["You must give peace to these lands if you are to face Murozond."]="You must give peace to these lands if you are to face Murozond."
G["You must have been very brave."]="Precisa haver banido muito corajoso."
G["You must have good luckydo."]="Deve ter um bom grisgrís."
G["You must have wondered how it is that I can speak so clearly for an ogre.  It's a side effect of the crystals that grow on the terrace surrounding Ogri'la.  The ogres there gifted me with this staff, and its crystal has in turn gifted me mentally.\n\nIt is through your continued actions, at Ogri'la above, that I hope to one day be able to bring this boon to all of my ogre brethren.  You have my thanks, my $g king : queen;, for all that you have done and will do."]="You must have wondered how it is that I can speak so clearly for an ogre.  It's a side effect of the crystals that grow on the terrace surrounding Ogri'la.  The ogres there gifted me with this staff, and its crystal has in turn gifted me mentally.\n\nIt is through your continued actions, at Ogri'la above, that I hope to one day be able to bring this boon to all of my ogre brethren.  You have my thanks, my $g king : queen;, for all that you have done and will do."
G["You must hear my story before we may continue, $n. It will be of great use to you in the future."]="Precisa ouvir meu história antes de que sigamos, $n. Te resultará muito útil no futuro."
G["You must help me safeguard the Tablets of Earth. Twilight's Hammer will not stop until they've taken the tablets."]="Deve me ajudar a defenda as tabuletas da terra. O Martelo Crepúsculo não se detendrá até que as tenha conseguido."
G["You must help! We're homeless!"]="Deve ajudar! Não temos lar!"
G["You must hurry!"]="You must hurry!"
G["You must hurry... Wyrmrest falls as we speak... all... is lost..."]="You must hurry... Wyrmrest falls as we speak... all... is lost..."
G["You must keep up with me, $n. Venture too far and you will fail the exercise."]="You must keep up with me, $n. Venture too far and you will fail the exercise."
G["You must keep your mind strong to withstand the ever present whispers from the empress. Weaker minds will fall to her will without even noticing."]="You must keep your mind strong to withstand the ever present whispers from the empress. Weaker minds will fall to her will without even noticing."
G["You must learn to become one with this land, stranger.\n\nOnly then will its secrets be revealed to you."]="You must learn to become one with this land, stranger.\n\nOnly then will its secrets be revealed to you."
G["You must learn to ponder, stranger. Your impetuous questions betray a lazy mind."]="You must learn to ponder, stranger. Your impetuous questions betray a lazy mind."
G["You must leave the bar!"]="Deve deixar a barra!"
G["You must let go! You must become what you were always meant to be! The time is now Anveena!"]="You must let go! You must become what you were always meant to be! The time is now Anveena!"
G["You must not approach the Frost Queen. Quickly, stop them!"]="You must not approach the Frost Queen. Quickly, stop them!"
G["You must not interfere!"]="You must not interfere!"
