G["You must not think of this as betrayal, $n, but Mr. Goodwin has offered me the find of a lifetime in exchange for his belongings."]="You must not think of this as betrayal, $n, but Mr. Goodwin has offered me the find of a lifetime in exchange for his belongings."
G["You must pay to ride, friends! Come and get your ride tickets!"]="You must pay to ride, friends! Come and get your ride tickets!"
