G["You pour grease all over the heavy metal projectiles.  Firallon's crew is certainly going to have a hard time loading these."]="Você derrama graxa em todos os projéteis de metal pesado. A equipe de Firallon certamente terá dificuldade em carregá-os."
G["You practice as if you're still asleep."]="You practice as if you're still asleep."
G["You present an interesting option, $r.  I'll take that into consideration.\n\nAlright, I've considered it.  Sure, I'll join you.  I've probably stayed in Light's Hope Chapel for too long anyhow.  Like a gnome at a urinal, I'm gonna have to stay on my toes!  Heh heh!"]="You present an interesting option, $r.  I'll take that into consideration.\n\nAlright, I've considered it.  Sure, I'll join you.  I've probably stayed in Light's Hope Chapel for too long anyhow.  Like a gnome at a urinal, I'm gonna have to stay on my toes!  Heh heh!"
G["You press on... to your deaths... fools."]="Buscáisss... sua morte... Insensatosss."
G["You pretty cool, boss. Thank you!"]="You pretty cool, boss. Thank you!"
G["You pretty good! Natural at hunt, like me."]="Você bastante bom! Caça ser o seu, como eu."
G["You pretty powerful! I bet you could kill big yeti beast thing! You could get him good!"]="Você bastante poderoso! Eu apostar que poder matar grande coisa fera yeti! Você poder com ele!"
G["You probably askin', then what happen?"]="Certo ke você pergunta: e então ké passa?"
G["You probably don't remember me, but you saved my life. I have only recently become healthy enough to walk on my own.\n\nI wanted to thank you for what you did for me and apologize for what I may have said... Thank you, $n. May Elune always watch over you."]="You probably don't remember me, but you saved my life. I have only recently become healthy enough to walk on my own.\n\nI wanted to thank you for what you did for me and apologize for what I may have said... Thank you, $n. May Elune always watch over you."
G["You probably have seen the ships crashed off our shores. Would any of those happen to be yours?\n\nThe mists often bring us a number of \"gifts\" like that."]="You probably have seen the ships crashed off our shores. Would any of those happen to be yours?\n\nThe mists often bring us a number of \"gifts\" like that."
G["You promise?"]="Me o prometes?"
G["You promised to take me out for a night on the town!  Are we just going to stand around here again tonight?"]="You promised to take me out for a night on the town!  Are we just going to stand around here again tonight?"
G["You pull the bell on the shrine. Ask it a question or make a wish!"]="You pull the bell on the shrine. Ask it a question or make a wish!"
G["You puny thief!  Koroth find you!  Koroth smash your face in!"]="You puny thief!  Koroth find you!  Koroth smash your face in!"
G["You put a floodgate on a channel from the inside and trapped yerself!"]="You put a floodgate on a channel from the inside and trapped yerself!"
G["You put it right in the... wait... where's the keyhole? What kind of racket is this?"]="You put it right in the... wait... where's the keyhole? What kind of racket is this?"
G["You put the piece on a minnow and placed the minnow somewhere in the waters of the sea between here and the Eastern Kingdoms? And this minnow has special powers?"]="Você colocou a peça em um peixinho e colocou o peixinho em algum lugar nas águas do mar entre aqui e os reinos do leste? E este peixinho tem poderes especiais?"
G["You put up a good fight, Edward. Let's see if Kahil can take'em."]="Luchas bem, Edward. Veremos se Kahil pode com eles."
G["You put up a hell of a fight, newbie. Hell of a fight..."]="Tem organizado uma grande luta, novato. Uma grande luta..."
G["You quickly place the subdued whelp into your pack."]="Te metes rapidamente a mansa filhote na bolsa."
G["You rabble get to work.  The ship must be completed soon."]="Chusma, a trabalhar. O navio precisa estar pronto em breve."
G["You raised all of the orcs here, Greatmother?"]="Você criou todos os orcs aqui, Grande-mãe?"
G["You raised me to be a killer.  How am I doing, daddy?"]="You raised me to be a killer.  How am I doing, daddy?"
G["You rang?"]="Me têm chamado?"
G["You rats call that cannoneering? You make me sick!"]="You rats call that cannoneering? You make me sick!"
G["You read wanted poster to Grek?\n\nGrek want to help!"]="You read wanted poster to Grek?\n\nGrek want to help!"
G["You ready for a brawl, $n?"]="Está $gpronto: pronta; para pelear, $n?"
G["You ready for this?"]="Tá $gpronto:pronta; pra luta?"
G["You ready to do this? I'm ready to do this. I'm fixin' to make a puddle out of that critter.\n\nIt's just... well, I ain't much of a bruiser, and I get skeered real easy. You're the $c here. You gonna... you gonna protect me, right?"]="You ready to do this? I'm ready to do this. I'm fixin' to make a puddle out of that critter.\n\nIt's just... well, I ain't much of a bruiser, and I get skeered real easy. You're the $c here. You gonna... you gonna protect me, right?"
G["You ready to go or what?"]="Você está $Gpronto:pronta; pra partir ou não?"
G["You ready to go water-huntin'?"]="Já podemos ir a por água?"
G["You ready to make their leader surrender, $g buddy : lady;? Okay, here we go."]="You ready to make their leader surrender, $g buddy : lady;? Okay, here we go."
G["You ready to ride, babe?"]="Está $gpreparado: preparada; para montar?"
G["You ready to ride?"]="Está $gpreparado: preparada; para montar?"
G["You ready?"]="Está $gpronto: pronta;?"
G["You realize not the error of your ways, but soon you will cower before Darkblaze."]="You realize not the error of your ways, but soon you will cower before Darkblaze."
G["You realize, of course, that we would likely have to joust one another should we enter the tournament."]="Suponho que te das conta de que é provável que tengamos que lutar entre nós se tomamos parte no torneio."
G["You really have a way with people, $n. They fear and respect you."]="You really have a way with people, $n. They fear and respect you."
G["You really have it in for the Horde, don't you?"]="Se a tem jurada à Horda, não?"
G["You really have to want it!"]="You really have to want it!"
G["You really kicked some yaungol butt, $p!"]="Tem barrido o sozinho com os yaungol, $p!"
G["You really should not be here, $r. Leave if you value your life."]="De verdade que não deveria estar aqui, $r. Márchate se aprecias a vida."
G["You really shouldn't be here, $r."]="De verdade que não deveria estar aqui, $r."
G["You really shouldn't play with this stuff. Someone could get hurt."]="Não deveriam jogar com isto. Alguém poderá sair ferido."
G["You really stop at no expense, $n! Amazing!"]="É verdade que não reparas em gastos, $n! Impressionante!"
G["You receive 2500 honor and 50 arena points."]="Recebe 2500 p. de honra e 50 p. de arenas."
G["You receive 7500 honor and 150 arena points."]="Recebe 7500 pontos de honra e 150 pontos de arena."
G["You recovered an ata'mal crystal?  Impressive, $n!"]="Tem encontrado um cristal de Ata'mal? Incrível, $n!"
G["You reek of death, human. You'll regret approaching me."]="Você cheira a morte, humano. Vai se arrepender de ter se aproximado de mim."
G["You reek of fortune! Many thanks for saving me, Luckydo! You can call me Brother Yakshoe."]="You reek of fortune! Many thanks for saving me, Luckydo! You can call me Brother Yakshoe."
G["You remember damn well enough what it was."]="Sabe exatamente qual era."
G["You remember the time you tried to drill that hole in your head?"]="You remember the time you tried to drill that hole in your head?"
G["You remind me of a young Master Goh, minus the girth.\n\nHe first came to me a farm boy dressed in rags but with a stylish stride to him that owned the look.\n\nTogether we made a clothing line that was all the rage in the east for at least two years."]="You remind me of a young Master Goh, minus the girth.\n\nHe first came to me a farm boy dressed in rags but with a stylish stride to him that owned the look.\n\nTogether we made a clothing line that was all the rage in the east for at least two years."
G["You require the Bishop's blessing.  Go to him soon."]="You require the Bishop's blessing.  Go to him soon."
G["You require the instruction of a true master! Go to Daryl Stack in Tarren Mill and embrace your destiny!"]="Você precisa da instrução de um verdadeiro mestre! Vá para Daryl Stack em Tarren Mill e abrace seu destino!"
G["You resist the power of the torch... why won't you die, beast?"]="You resist the power of the torch... why won't you die, beast?"
G["You resist. You cling to your life as if it actually matters. You will learn."]="Te resiste. Te aferras ao seu vida como se importara algo. Já aprenderá."
G["You rich punks are all the same!"]="Os ricos são todos iguales!"
G["You risk destroying us all, $r! You must be terminated!"]="You risk destroying us all, $r! You must be terminated!"
G["You runts want to riot?  I'll show you!"]="You runts want to riot?  I'll show you!"
G["You rush headlong into all-out war without a thought of the consequences."]="You rush headlong into all-out war without a thought of the consequences."
G["You rush headlong into the maw of madness!"]="You rush headlong into the maw of madness!"
G["You said Brogg could stay here! You promised Brogg you'd help regain Stonemaul clan mound!"]="You said Brogg could stay here! You promised Brogg you'd help regain Stonemaul clan mound!"
G["You said it!"]="Você o tem dito!"
G["You said you needed hops? Very well. I'll send some to Halfhill."]="You said you needed hops? Very well. I'll send some to Halfhill."
G["You said you would have it back. What does that mean?"]="Disse que o recuperarías. Que indica isso?"
G["You said you would ring the gong first."]="Disse que farias soar o gongo primeiro."
G["You save us! Yay for you!"]="You save us! Yay for you!"
G["You saved me from certain death. I owe you."]="Me salvou de uma morte certa. Te devo uma."
G["You saved me! What a hero!"]="Me salvou! Que heroicidade!"
G["You saved me? But, you're Horde!"]="Me salvou você? Mas... é da Horda!"
G["You saved my daughter, $n, and for that, I am forever indebted to you, $n. Thank you so much."]="Salvaste a meu filha, $n, e por isso estou em dívida eterna com você, $n. Muitas Obrigado."
G["You saved my life!"]="Me salvou a vida!"
G["You saved my life! Thanks!"]="Me salvou a vida! Obrigado!"
G["You saved my son and my ranch. I am forever in your debt, stranger. If you ever find yourself in need of a clean yak, you know where to go."]="You saved my son and my ranch. I am forever in your debt, stranger. If you ever find yourself in need of a clean yak, you know where to go."
G["You saved the lives of my sentinels, hero. You have my everlasting gratitude. Now we can continue with our mission."]="Lhes salvou a vida a meus sentinelas, $ghéroe: heroína;. Te estarei agradecida eternamente. Agora podemos seguir com nossa missão."
G["You saved us, $p!"]="Nos has salvou, $p!"
G["You say something?"]="You say something?"
G["You say you come in peace, yet you wear strong armor and wield many weapons.\n\nHow do you explain that?"]="Afirmas que veio em são de paz, mas vistes pesada armadura e veste muitas armas.\n\nComo explicas isso?"
G["You say you have come to seek knowledge and understanding, but you are dressed for battle.  That is why I question you and your willingness to do what must be done."]="Diz que tem vindo à procura de conhecimento, mas vai vestido para a guerra. Por isso pongo em dúvida seu disposição para fazer o que é preciso fazer."
G["You say you want hops? No problem. You kill virmen for me, Mung-Mung send some hops to Halfhill for you."]="You say you want hops? No problem. You kill virmen for me, Mung-Mung send some hops to Halfhill for you."
G["You scared of da creepy crawlies, $r?"]="Te derem medo os insetos, $r?"
G["You scared the fish away!  What do you want?"]="Você assustou o peixe! O que você quer?"
G["You screamed like a little girl, funniest thing I ever saw."]="You screamed like a little girl, funniest thing I ever saw."
G["You scum aren't even worth my time.  Destroy them, my pack!"]="You scum aren't even worth my time.  Destroy them, my pack!"
G["You scum will NOT destroy this land as you defiled Kalimdor!"]="Vocês vermes NÃO destruirão esta terra como fizeram a Kalimdor."
G["You scurvy dogs make yourselves useful! KEEP FIRING!"]="You scurvy dogs make yourselves useful! KEEP FIRING!"
G["You see a brief glimmer along the east wall..."]="Observas uma tenue luz na muralha do este..."
G["You see for yourself now. Da Lich King be generous to dem who obey."]="You see for yourself now. Da Lich King be generous to dem who obey."
G["You see large cavernous tunnels and corridors reflected inside the crystal. You recognize the area as the Molten Core."]="Você vê grandes túneis e corredores cavernosos refletidos dentro do cristal. Você reconhece a área como o núcleo derretido."
G["You see that final blow! Awesome!"]="Tem visto o ataque fim? Incrível!"
G["You see that?  She's... huge!"]="Vê... isso? É... enorme!"
G["You see the faint outline of a humanoid figure inside the pod; you now know that this is indeed the location you need to be at.  While you think you will eventually be able to open the pod, it remains tighly shut even to your most forceful attempts to open it."]="You see the faint outline of a humanoid figure inside the pod; you now know that this is indeed the location you need to be at.  While you think you will eventually be able to open the pod, it remains tighly shut even to your most forceful attempts to open it."
G["You see the stack of worg hides that you collected earlier.  These will be used for the bulk of your costume."]="Você vê a pilha de ocultos worg que você coletou anteriormente. Estes serão utilizados para a maior parte do seu traje."
G["You see the world through Kalytha's eyes..."]="Você vê o mundo a através dos olhos de Kalytha..."
G["You see this here gun, $gboy:missy;?\n\n<Ol' Durty Pete casually waves his weapon directly at your face.>\n\nThis here gun's seen action on every continent but for Northrend. It's saved me life more times than I can count: Seven. One time, \"Big Mackie\" MacDungal - not the wee MacDungal now, but his pappy - offered me his youngest daughter in barter for me gun.\n\nLet me tell you somethin' about Edie: she and me gun had a lot in common. Wide-mouthed. Buck-toofed. Dangerous from the biz-ness end. Likin' to go oft half-cocked.\n\nYou heard about the time wee Edie bet Chuck Brandybeard 25 silver she could kick 'im in the head so hard he would weep snot?"]="You see this here gun, $gboy:missy;?\n\n<Ol' Durty Pete casually waves his weapon directly at your face.>\n\nThis here gun's seen action on every continent but for Northrend. It's saved me life more times than I can count: Seven. One time, \"Big Mackie\" MacDungal - not the wee MacDungal now, but his pappy - offered me his youngest daughter in barter for me gun.\n\nLet me tell you somethin' about Edie: she and me gun had a lot in common. Wide-mouthed. Buck-toofed. Dangerous from the biz-ness end. Likin' to go oft half-cocked.\n\nYou heard about the time wee Edie bet Chuck Brandybeard 25 silver she could kick 'im in the head so hard he would weep snot?"
G["You see this kodo? DO YOU SEE THIS KODO? This kodo cost more than that toolbox you call a house. You see, pal, that's who I am. And you're nothin'."]="Vê este kodo? VÊ ESTE KODO? Este kodo vale mais que essa caixa de ferramentas que chamas ‘casa’. Já vê, colega, este sou eu. E você não é nada."
G["You see those bones at your feet? Those are guards who tried to desert their post."]="Vê os ossos que estão aos seus pés? São de guardas que tentaram abandonar seu posto."
G["You see, Cozwynn, I told you that we could rely upon $n."]="Vê, Cozwynn? Te disse que podíamos confiar em $n."
G["You see, Thorim is not like these harpies.  He's a worthy being of near godlike stature.\n\nHe served the titans as guardian of Ulduar and the Terrace of the Makers.\n\nThat is until his wife, Sif, was cowardly slain by his brother."]="You see, Thorim is not like these harpies.  He's a worthy being of near godlike stature.\n\nHe served the titans as guardian of Ulduar and the Terrace of the Makers.\n\nThat is until his wife, Sif, was cowardly slain by his brother."
G["You see, all you gotta do is forge the Sulfuron hammer and find yourself the Eye of Sulfuras. Combine the Eye of Sulfuras with the Sulfuron hammer and it will become Sulfuras! Now I'm not going to bog you down with any technical information as to where or how or when you can get an Eye of Sulfuras. I'm sure you'll figure that stuff out. Just sign this here contract so that our agreement is binding and our business will be done."]="You see, all you gotta do is forge the Sulfuron hammer and find yourself the Eye of Sulfuras. Combine the Eye of Sulfuras with the Sulfuron hammer and it will become Sulfuras! Now I'm not going to bog you down with any technical information as to where or how or when you can get an Eye of Sulfuras. I'm sure you'll figure that stuff out. Just sign this here contract so that our agreement is binding and our business will be done."
G["You see, brother... we're not so different..."]="Vê, irmão... Não somos tão diferentes..."
G["You see, the TRUE power of kings and emperors stems from the power to aid their people."]="Percebem? O VERDADEIRO poder de reis e imperadores consiste da capacidade de ajudar seu povo."
G["You see, there is balance in all things. Wisdom etched in our very fur: Black and white. Darkness and light."]="Há equilíbrio em todas as coisas. Nosso pelagem reflete essa sabedoria: alvo e negro. Luz e escuridão."
G["You see, those who lead through fear only stay in power while those they govern lack courage."]="Veja bem, os que governam pelo medo só permanecem no poder enquanto os governados temem."
G["You see, what you have done is a tribute to a truth we Pandaren hold most dear."]="Verá, o que acabas de fazer é um tributo a uma verdade que os pandaren valoramos profundamente."
G["You see? Bad yak. Now go on, $r. Try to feed it."]="Vê? Yak ruim. Agora tenta dar de comer, $r."
G["You see? No power of this world can trample the pure of spirit."]="Vê? Não há poder no mundo que possa com um espírito puro."
G["You see? Nothing beats the crushing power of my hammers."]="You see? Nothing beats the crushing power of my hammers."
G["You see? They're wild animals in there!"]="O vê? Ali há animais selvagens."
G["You seek Azuregos? Bane of the Bitter Reaches? Scourge of the Bay of Storms? Lord of all magic in Azshara?\n\nWell, you've found him.\n\n<Azuregos appears to be smiling.>"]="Ouvidos a Azuregos? Pesadelos da Costa Amarga? Azote da Baía da Tempestade? Senhor de toda a magia de Azshara?\n\nBem, lhe encontrado.\n\n<Parece que Azuregos sorri.>"
G["You seek Grol'dar and the Darkfire Enclave?  Find them in the underground cavern called the Cleft of Shadow.  There are two tunnels leading down into that cave, one just south of the Valley of Wisdom and the other from The Drag."]="Você procura Grol'dar e o Enclave Fogo Negro? Encontre-os na caverna subterrânea chamada Cleft of Shadow. Existem dois túneis que levam à caverna, um ao sul do Vale da Sabedoria e o outro de The Drag."
G["You seek Kardris Dreamseeker.  She and the other shaman are in the entrance room to Thrall's Fortress in the Valley of Wisdom."]="Você procura Kardris Dreamseeker. Ela e o outro xamã estão na sala de entrada da Fortaleza de Thrall, no Vale da Sabedoria."
G["You seek Mai the Jade Shaper. You can find her at Greenstone Village in The Jade Forest.\n\nI will mark her location on your map."]="You seek Mai the Jade Shaper. You can find her at Greenstone Village in The Jade Forest.\n\nI will mark her location on your map."
G["You seek Silkmaster Tsai at the Silken Fields in the Valley of the Four Winds. I will mark his location on your map for you."]="Ouvidos ao mestre de seda Tsai, nos Campos de Seda, no Vale dos Quatro Ventos. Te marcarei seu localização no mapa."
G["You seek Tan Shin Tiao. She can be found in the Seat of Knowledge, above Mogu'shan Palace here in the Vale of Eternal Blossoms.\n\nI will mark her location on your map."]="You seek Tan Shin Tiao. She can be found in the Seat of Knowledge, above Mogu'shan Palace here in the Vale of Eternal Blossoms.\n\nI will mark her location on your map."
G["You seek a Sunwalker.  Sunwalker Iopi resides with many of our other trainers."]="Ouvidos a um Caminasol. O Caminasol Iopi vive ao lado com muitos de nossos outros instrutores."
G["You seek a higher knowledge. Tepa is blessed with such knowledge. She should be standing somewhere nearby..."]="Você procura um conhecimento superior. Tepa é abençoada com esse conhecimento. Ela deveria estar em algum lugar próximo..."
G["You seek a prize, eh? How about death?"]="Que um prêmio, eh? Que tal a morte?!"
G["You seek a rogue?  I believe Jannok would fit that description.  Why don't you go talk to him over at the Inn in Dolanaar."]="Você procura um ladino? Acredito que Jannok se encaixaria nessa descrição. Por que você não vai falar com ele na pousada em Dolanaar."
G["You seek death?"]="Quiser morrer?"
G["You seek escape, not glory. It's suicide."]="You seek escape, not glory. It's suicide."
G["You seek further instruction, $n?"]="Ouvidos mais treinamento, $n?"
G["You seek me? We fight now!"]="Me procuram? Luchemos então!"
G["You seek passage somewhere, $n?  My bats will get you there in no time."]="You seek passage somewhere, $n?  My bats will get you there in no time."
G["You seek power, yes? But will you walk the cursed path I do for it?"]="Você procura poder, sim? Mas você seguirá o caminho amaldiçoado que eu faço por isso?"
G["You seek someone who cares for animals?  Then you should look for Seriadne outside the Inn in Dolanaar.  She is the one that you seek."]="Você procura alguém que cuida de animais? Então você deve procurar Seriadne fosse da pousada em Dolanaar. Ela é quem você procura."
G["You seek something in our fair land?"]="Você procura algo em nossa terra justa?"
G["You seek the aid of a Druid?  Then you should go see Kal at the Moonwell just south of the Inn in Dolanaar."]="Você procura a ajuda de um druida? Então você deve ir ver Kal no Moonwell, ao sul da pousada em Dolanaar."
G["You seek the hunters?  You will find them on the second level of the Trader's Tier, in the Hunters' Sanctum."]="Você procura os caçadores? Você os encontrará no segundo nível do Nível do comerciante, no Santuário dos Caçadores."
G["You seek the newly-arrived Highborne? So be it.\nYou'll find them in the western wing of the Temple of the Moon. There may be one of them at the Howling Oak, as well."]="You seek the newly-arrived Highborne? So be it.\nYou'll find them in the western wing of the Temple of the Moon. There may be one of them at the Howling Oak, as well."
G["You seek the scepter shard charged to the protection of the Blue Flight?\n\n<Azuregos appears to be smiling.>"]="You seek the scepter shard charged to the protection of the Blue Flight?\n\n<Azuregos appears to be smiling.>"
G["You seek the secrets of Ulduar? Then take them!"]="Procuram os segredos de Ulduar? Pois aí vão!"
G["You seek the troll, Jabul. He can help you."]="Ouvidos ao troll, Jabul. Pode ajudar você."
G["You seek their leader... little thing, you wage war against the clans of Grom'thar the Thunderbringer himself.  Don't be so eager to rush to your death."]="You seek their leader... little thing, you wage war against the clans of Grom'thar the Thunderbringer himself.  Don't be so eager to rush to your death."
G["You seek to challenge the infamous Tenwu of the Red Smoke? Come friend, let us see what you have got!"]="Pretendes desafiar a Tenwu do Humo Vermelho? Venha e demonstra que sabe fazer!"
G["You seek to deafen me? Pathetic... Wait... What's that sound?"]="You seek to deafen me? Pathetic... Wait... What's that sound?"
G["You seek to draw the General of the Frostwolf legion out from his fortress? PREPOSTEROUS!"]="Pretendes tirar ao geral da legião Lobo Gelo do seu fortaleza? QUE RIDICULEZ!"
G["You seek to halt an avalanche. I will bury you."]="You seek to halt an avalanche. I will bury you."
G["You seek to harm me, $r?"]="You seek to harm me, $r?"
G["You seek to lower our global defenses in order to appease a paranoid magistrate and an encampment of riff-raff that are most probably suffering from heat stroke."]="Você procura diminuir nossas defesas globais para apaziguar um magistrado paranóico e um acampamento de riff-raff que provavelmente estão sofrendo de insolação."
G["You seek to lure me from my clutch? You shall pay for your insolence!"]="You seek to lure me from my clutch? You shall pay for your insolence!"
G["You seek to martyr me before my order - so be it. Strike me down, another will rise in my place and the suffering of the Light - of the conquered - will continue uninterrupted."]="You seek to martyr me before my order - so be it. Strike me down, another will rise in my place and the suffering of the Light - of the conquered - will continue uninterrupted."
G["You seek to uncover mysteries I myself have yet to unlock, $c. Please, discuss these matters with Nahogg instead."]="Ouvidos desvelar mistérios que eu não e revelado ainda, $c. Fala de estes assuntos com Nahogg."
G["You seek two lovers blind to the ambitions of their family names. They were here, seeking a way to hold to their path.\n\nSadly they did not find their answers among the trees or art."]="You seek two lovers blind to the ambitions of their family names. They were here, seeking a way to hold to their path.\n\nSadly they did not find their answers among the trees or art."
G["You seek your own death, trespasser!"]="Está cavando seu própria tumba, intruso!"
G["You seek...a reward?\n\nSurely the joy of a successful catch is reward enough? The thrill of the open sea? The comraderie that only a fishing pole can grant?\n\nYou have much to learn, $r.\n\nMy opinion aside, there is much to be gained from the art of fishing.\n\nYou may improve your fishing skill.  One day, you may purchase powerful fishing rods.\n\nThe most revered fishermen may receive access to a special fish pet, a water stride mount, and a fishing raft."]="You seek...a reward?\n\nSurely the joy of a successful catch is reward enough? The thrill of the open sea? The comraderie that only a fishing pole can grant?\n\nYou have much to learn, $r.\n\nMy opinion aside, there is much to be gained from the art of fishing.\n\nYou may improve your fishing skill.  One day, you may purchase powerful fishing rods.\n\nThe most revered fishermen may receive access to a special fish pet, a water stride mount, and a fishing raft."
