G["You there!  You look able bodied... we need your aid in defending Southshore!\n\nThe blasted Forsaken are all riled up because it's Hallow's End.  Their \"celebration\" will no doubt be leading them right to our doorstep.  If you've got the time, we really could use your help!"]="You there!  You look able bodied... we need your aid in defending Southshore!\n\nThe blasted Forsaken are all riled up because it's Hallow's End.  Their \"celebration\" will no doubt be leading them right to our doorstep.  If you've got the time, we really could use your help!"
G["You there! $C! These men are dying! I need your assistance!"]="Você! $C! Estes homens estão morrendo! preciso da sua ajuda!"
G["You there! Be you friend or foe?"]="You there! Be you friend or foe?"
