G["You want my foot in your front or in your rear? Make the call."]="You want my foot in your front or in your rear? Make the call."
G["You want my help? I'm a little busy trying to restore the peace that you disrupted."]="Quiser minha ajuda? Estou algo ocupada restaurando a paz que vocês têm destruído."
