G["You were destined to fail."]="You were destined to fail."
G["You were drunk on the job!"]="You were drunk on the job!"
G["You were expecting one of my harbingers?"]="You were expecting one of my harbingers?"
G["You were foolish to come."]="Foi um insensato ao vir."
G["You were fools to leave the safety of your city. Your return to the ocean has assured your demise."]="You were fools to leave the safety of your city. Your return to the ocean has assured your demise."
G["You were hit! Weapons temporarily disabled!"]="Te têm dados! Armas desactivadas temporariamente!"
G["You were in a raid. Still, my hat's off to you, I don't even know where Kharazan is. How did you get there?"]="You were in a raid. Still, my hat's off to you, I don't even know where Kharazan is. How did you get there?"
G["You were looking for me, child? Why do you come to kill me, $n? I only wish to help."]="You were looking for me, child? Why do you come to kill me, $n? I only wish to help."
G["You were magnificent out there, $n!"]="Isso foi impressionante, $n!"
G["You were nearly lost! Do not wander off!"]="Quase te perdemos! Não te alejes!"
G["You were never alone, $n."]="You were never alone, $n."
G["You were never in any danger, sweetheart.  My friends down below would've caught you.  You're worth too much to us alive!"]="You were never in any danger, sweetheart.  My friends down below would've caught you.  You're worth too much to us alive!"
G["You were not invited!"]="You were not invited!"
G["You were not prepared!"]="You were not prepared!"
