G["You were right to come.  My wisdom will be yours."]="Fez bem ao vir. Meu sabedoria será sua."
G["You were right, Fairbanks. That is tragic."]="You were right, Fairbanks. That is tragic."
G["You were right, Fordring. I did send them in to die. Their lives are meaningless, but yours..."]="You were right, Fordring. I did send them in to die. Their lives are meaningless, but yours..."
