G["You were standing right here! What the hell did you see? Speak up!"]="You were standing right here! What the hell did you see? Speak up!"
G["You were stubborn enough to keep tilling this soil even though you didn't have much experience."]="You were stubborn enough to keep tilling this soil even though you didn't have much experience."
G["You were surrendering? Why? Because these invaders can break down a wall?"]="Você está se rendendo? Por quê? Por que esses invasores conseguem derrubar uma muralha?"
G["You were telling me about The Veiled Blade and how you took the wrong mission."]="Você estava me falando sobre The Veiled Blade e como você assumiu a missão errada."
G["You were the one that rescued Admiral Taylor? So the jinyu was telling the truth..."]="You were the one that rescued Admiral Taylor? So the jinyu was telling the truth..."
G["You were the one who challenged me for merely looking. I still await my audience with Tyrande."]="You were the one who challenged me for merely looking. I still await my audience with Tyrande."
G["You were there! Is it true then? What happened in Orgrimmar?"]="You were there! Is it true then? What happened in Orgrimmar?"
