G["You will allow me a weapon and armor, yes?"]="Me vai deixar um arma e uma armadura, verdade?"
G["You will always be my little girl and I will always fear for you, but I know now you can take care of yourself."]="You will always be my little girl and I will always fear for you, but I know now you can take care of yourself."
G["You will be alone in the end."]="Ao fim estará somente."
G["You will be cleansed!"]="Será purificou!"
