G["You will be... punished..."]="You will be... punished..."
G["You will bleed!"]="Sangrarás!"
G["You will bring him back into this world, champion."]="You will bring him back into this world, champion."
G["You will burn under the might of the Shao-Tien!"]="You will burn under the might of the Shao-Tien!"
G["You will burn with your lands!"]="Arderás ao lado com os seus terras!"
