G["You will come no further, Forsaken scum!  By the war banner of the ancient Greymane clan, I expel you from our ancestral lands!"]="You will come no further, Forsaken scum!  By the war banner of the ancient Greymane clan, I expel you from our ancestral lands!"
G["You will come out no more!"]="Já não aparecerás mais!"
G["You will die for your hubris, $c!"]="Morrerá pelo seu excesso de orgulho, $c!"
