G["You will find Fineous Darkvire beyond the Ring of Law, in the Hall of Crafting. Kill the miserable cur and recover Ironfel.\n\nTake Ironfel to the Shrine of Thaurissan and place the hammer in its rightful place: In the hands of the statue erected in my honor.\n\nWhen this is done, the compartment in which I stored the master key will open. More importantly, Ironfel will remain forever in my grasp. Should they make an attempt to remove the hammer; both the statue and hammer will shatter, lost forever."]="You will find Fineous Darkvire beyond the Ring of Law, in the Hall of Crafting. Kill the miserable cur and recover Ironfel.\n\nTake Ironfel to the Shrine of Thaurissan and place the hammer in its rightful place: In the hands of the statue erected in my honor.\n\nWhen this is done, the compartment in which I stored the master key will open. More importantly, Ironfel will remain forever in my grasp. Should they make an attempt to remove the hammer; both the statue and hammer will shatter, lost forever."
G["You will find Fono, the mining trainer, on the Aldor Rise."]="Encontrar a Fono, o instrutor de mineração, no Alto Aldor."
G["You will find Funaam, the guild master, near the Trader's Tier entrance."]="Você encontrará Funaam, o mestre da guilda, perto da entrada do comerciante."
G["You will find Lothan Silverblade where you can find weapons and armor.  A warrior is never far from his blade."]="Encontrar a Lothan Platahoja onde tenha armas e armaduras. Um guerreiro nunca se aleja demais do seu lâmina."
G["You will find Pyall Silentstride inside the great tent in the northwest corner of the village.  He can teach you what you crave."]="Você encontrará Pyall Silentstride dentro da grande tenda no canto noroeste da vila. Ele pode ensinar o que você deseja."
G["You will find Recorder Lidio on the Aldor Rise."]="You will find Recorder Lidio on the Aldor Rise."
G["You will find Sildinair at the Warrior's Terrace among the guards, her keen eyes scanning the forest for enemies that might dare to enter our fair city."]="You will find Sildinair at the Warrior's Terrace among the guards, her keen eyes scanning the forest for enemies that might dare to enter our fair city."
G["You will find Technician Mihila on the Aldor Rise."]="Encontrar à técnica Mihila no Alto Aldor."
G["You will find Tseh Rah on the Spirit Rise. She has been meeting with the Shaman Trainers there."]="Encontrar a Tseh Rah no Alto dos Espíritos. Se tem estado reunindo com os instrutores de chamanes da zona."
G["You will find Weaver Aoa in northeastern Aldor Rise."]="You will find Weaver Aoa in northeastern Aldor Rise."
G["You will find a blood elf Arcane Reforger, Herim, at Dawnstrider Enchanters on the middle rise.  She will be able to assist you."]="Encontrar uma reforjadora Arcana, a elfa de sangue Herim, em Encantadores Caminalba, no alto central. Ela poderá ajudar você."
G["You will find a caregiver center in the southern portion of Aldor Rise."]="Você encontrará um centro de atendimento na parte sul de Aldor Rise."
