G["You will find a number of shaman trainers in the Crystal Hall. Perhaps you should visit Farseer Nobundo there, and show the Broken some pity. Light be with you."]="Você encontrará vários treinadores xamãs no Crystal Hall. Talvez você deva visitar o Farseer Nobundo lá e mostrar ao Broken alguma pena. A luz esteja com você."
G["You will find a pair of draenei conversing with Elissa Dumas - the human mage who minds the magical portals - on the ground floor of The Temple of the Moon.\n\nThey will know how to help you."]="Encontrar a um par de draeneis conversando com Elissa Dumas, a humana maga que se ocupa dos portais mágicas, na planta baixa do Templo da Lua.\n\nEles sabrán como ajudar você."
G["You will find him in the Caregiver Center in the Seat of the Naaru. Light be with you."]="You will find him in the Caregiver Center in the Seat of the Naaru. Light be with you."
G["You will find it in your interest to aid the Alliance war effort.  We are in need of scouts and trackers, as well as provisions for our troops.  Payment, in gold, will be delivered immediately from the king's treasury."]="You will find it in your interest to aid the Alliance war effort.  We are in need of scouts and trackers, as well as provisions for our troops.  Payment, in gold, will be delivered immediately from the king's treasury."
G["You will find mailboxes within or just outside the Aldor and Scryers banks and inns."]="Você encontrará caixas de correio dentro ou fosse dos bancos e pousadas de Aldor e Scryers."
G["You will find no better partner in battle than an orc."]="Não encontrar melhor companheiro de batalha que um orc."
