G["You won this round but I'll have a better brew by our next encounter."]="ganhou este ataque, mas terei uma cerveja melhor em nosso próximo encontro."
G["You won't be able to open the back door yourself to escape once you've started the chaos. You'll have to either get the guards to open it by killing bar patrons, get Private Rocknot drunk so he causes property damage, or see if Spazzring has the key on him!"]="Não poderá abrir a porta de por trás para escapar uma vez tenha libertado o caos. Terá que fazer que os guardas o façam por você matando aos clientes do bar, emborrachar ao soldado Sinroca para que cause danos no local ou descobrir se Aropatoso leva a chave acima!"
G["You won't be deterrin' me. Not today. I'll keep trainin'!"]="Você não vai me deter. Não hoje. Eu vou continuar treinando!"
G["You won't deny me this, Arthas! I must know... I must find out..."]="Não me privarás de isto, Arthas! Devo saber... Devo descobrir..."
G["You won't eat me, will you?"]="Não me comerás, verdade?"
G["You won't escape alive!"]="You won't escape alive!"
G["You won't escape alive, $r!"]="Não saldrás com vida, $r!"
G["You won't escape from us so easily!"]="You won't escape from us so easily!"
G["You won't escape us, druid!"]="You won't escape us, druid!"
G["You won't find a better brew in Azeroth."]="Você não encontrará uma bebida melhor em Azeroth."
G["You won't find a finer firearm anywhere else in Orgrimmar."]="Você não encontrará uma arma mais fina em nenhum outro lugar em Orgrimmar."
G["You won't find all of us!"]="You won't find all of us!"
G["You won't find better prices anywhere!"]="Não encontrar melhores preços em nenhuma parte!"
G["You won't get away this time!"]="Esta vez não escaparás!"
G["You won't get away with this!"]="Não te saldrás com à sua!"
G["You won't get away with this, you know?  You're just a kid."]="Não te saldrás com à sua, o sabe? Não é mais que uma ninha."
G["You won't get far...."]="You won't get far...."
G["You won't get my clothes!  Die!"]="Não te levará meu roupa! Morre!"
G["You won't get near the Master. Dragonriders, attack!"]="You won't get near the Master. Dragonriders, attack!"
G["You won't get... anything else... out of me!"]="Não me... sacarás... nada mais!"
G["You won't impede our escape, fiend! Keep the undead off me while I bring this barrier down."]="You won't impede our escape, fiend! Keep the undead off me while I bring this barrier down."
G["You won't keep me from getting to Falcon Watch!"]="You won't keep me from getting to Falcon Watch!"
G["You won't kill next one so easy."]="You won't kill next one so easy."
G["You won't learn anything new from me; you know too much already. If you want more training, talk to the tauren Una in the northwestern shops of Thunder Bluff's central plateau. Send her my regards, eh?"]="Você não aprenderá nada novamente comigo; você já sabe demais. Se você quiser mais treinamento, converse com o tauren Uma nas lojas do noroeste do platô central de Thunder Bluff. Envie meus cumprimentos, hein?"
G["You won't like me when I'm mildly influenced by incense!"]="You won't like me when I'm mildly influenced by incense!"
G["You won't live to speak of this!"]="You won't live to speak of this!"
G["You won't make it far!"]="You won't make it far!"
G["You won't make slaves out of us!"]="Não seremos seus escravos!"
G["You won't need that body where you're going!"]="You won't need that body where you're going!"
G["You won't put me in chains again!"]="You won't put me in chains again!"
G["You won't ruin my lands, you scum!"]="Não vais a destruir meus terras, escória!"
G["You won't sneak up on me, $c!"]="You won't sneak up on me, $c!"
G["You won't survive this game of fetch, $c!"]="You won't survive this game of fetch, $c!"
G["You won't... get far."]="Não irão... muito longe."
G["You won? How... disappointing. I could have easily watched you all continue to stand in the fire."]="You won? How... disappointing. I could have easily watched you all continue to stand in the fire."
G["You work for me now!"]="You work for me now!"
G["You work with machines for so long, sometimes you forget about real hearts."]="Você trabalha com máquinas há tanto tempo que às vezes esquece corações reais."
G["You worship death, little man?  Death is here!"]="Adoras à morte, hombrecito? A morte está aqui!"
G["You would be wise not to waste time. If my father dies, he takes with him the knowledge of where the middle fragment of the World Pillar is hidden. I know that you people want it."]="Seria melhor não perder o tempo. Se meu pai morre, levará com ele o conhecimento de onde está escondido o segundo fragmento do Pilar do Mundo. Sei que vocês o quiser."
G["You would be wrong. With clarity and focus, nothing is impossible."]="Te equivocas. Com claridade e concentração, nada, nada é possível."
G["You would betray your kingdom out of spite?"]="You would betray your kingdom out of spite?"
G["You would certainly be looking for Me'Lynn if you have any hope of learning to be a tailor.  She resides at the Craftsmen's Terrace in northeastern Darnassus."]="Você certamente procuraria Me'Lynn se tiver alguma esperança de aprender a ser um alfaiate. Ela reside no Terraço dos Artesãos, no nordeste de Darnassus."
G["You would challenge me in my own sanctum? Witness your folly!"]="You would challenge me in my own sanctum? Witness your folly!"
G["You would champion the cause of such a lowly street rat? Very well, best me in combat and I shall consider giving you my blessing."]="You would champion the cause of such a lowly street rat? Very well, best me in combat and I shall consider giving you my blessing."
G["You would do well to not disrupt this fancy fancy ritual."]="Não é boa ideia interromper este ritual tão formal."
G["You would have had a better chance at the blockade, mantid."]="Te haveria ido melhor na linha de frente, mántide."
G["You would have us live like the savages!"]="Que que vivamos como selvagens!"
G["You would like to move away from that, wouldn't you? Too bad."]="You would like to move away from that, wouldn't you? Too bad."
G["You would make better rugs!"]="Não matarías nem o tempo!"
G["You would not have helped the legion of Blackrock had we just asked for your assistance, now would you?"]="You would not have helped the legion of Blackrock had we just asked for your assistance, now would you?"
G["You would think we would be finished mending this roof by now."]="You would think we would be finished mending this roof by now."
G["You wouldn't believe some of the rabble that we've had come through here lately. Most are more trouble than the supposed help that they provide. Nothing at all like you.\n\nYou sure you don't want to sign up with the Farstriders?"]="You wouldn't believe some of the rabble that we've had come through here lately. Most are more trouble than the supposed help that they provide. Nothing at all like you.\n\nYou sure you don't want to sign up with the Farstriders?"
G["You wouldn't happen to have another bundle of that incense would you?"]="Por casualidade não te sobrará um fardo de incenso?"
G["You wouldn't happen to have any canned turtle soup from Hillsbrad, would you?"]="You wouldn't happen to have any canned turtle soup from Hillsbrad, would you?"
G["You wouldn't like me when I'm angry..."]="Não você gostaria me ver bravo..."
G["You!  $n!  What are you doing wandering around the village like this?  There are Alliance foes in Alterac!  We must drive them out!\n\nOur supplies are too low to launch a large ground assault, so speak with our quatermaster.  He'll tell you how you can increase our supply base."]="You!  $n!  What are you doing wandering around the village like this?  There are Alliance foes in Alterac!  We must drive them out!\n\nOur supplies are too low to launch a large ground assault, so speak with our quatermaster.  He'll tell you how you can increase our supply base."
G["You!  Enter the fray!"]="Eh, você! Entrar em combate!"
G["You!  I see you!  One of you, kill them!"]="Você! Te vi! Que um dos vocês o mate!"
G["You!  Let me go now!  Wait... no!  Don't let go!"]="Você! Suéltame! Aguarda... Não! Não me sueltes!"
G["You!  You don't belong here!"]="Você! Este não é seu lugar!"
G["You!  You have allowed the Sha to reawaken after all these years!"]="Vocês vocês têm permitida que os sha despierten, depois de todos estes anos!"
G["You!  Your mutt killed my Butcher!  I will crush you!"]="You!  Your mutt killed my Butcher!  I will crush you!"
G["You! $C! Help us defend against a counterattack."]="You! $C! Help us defend against a counterattack."
G["You! $R! Come here. <snort>\n\nTime is short, and my end <snort> is near. Mangletooth shall win; you will see. <snort>\n\nMy capture can still aid <snort> my people. The Razormane tribe is more powerful than the Bristlebacks!\n\nThe Horde looks to find out who leads the raids on their people. You <snort> shall aid Mangletooth in return for the information only I know. Mangletooth can help you! <snort> But you must help Mangletooth."]="You! $R! Come here. <snort>\n\nTime is short, and my end <snort> is near. Mangletooth shall win; you will see. <snort>\n\nMy capture can still aid <snort> my people. The Razormane tribe is more powerful than the Bristlebacks!\n\nThe Horde looks to find out who leads the raids on their people. You <snort> shall aid Mangletooth in return for the information only I know. Mangletooth can help you! <snort> But you must help Mangletooth."
G["You! Are you the ones responsible for what has happened here...?"]="You! Are you the ones responsible for what has happened here...?"
G["You! Away from our crops!"]="Você! Afaste-se de nossos cultivos!"
G["You! Bear-creature. What kind of sorcery was this?"]="Você! Seu bicho urso. Que tipo de bruxaria é essa?"
G["You! COME! Drink, feast, rest for the next battle.\n\nBut do not fight! Or I will feed you to my wolves."]="You! COME! Drink, feast, rest for the next battle.\n\nBut do not fight! Or I will feed you to my wolves."
G["You! Come over here, give us just a taste..."]="Você! Venha aqui, danos algo de comer..."
G["You! Fiend, you are not my beloved! Begone!"]="Você! Demônio, você não é meu amada! Fora!"
G["You! Get over here, mopesy. Ken-Ken got just the thing for you!"]="You! Get over here, mopesy. Ken-Ken got just the thing for you!"
G["You! How did you escape detection by my sentry-bots?"]="You! How did you escape detection by my sentry-bots?"
G["You! Not a word to Grick about this! Do you hear me?"]="Você! Nem uma palavra a Grick sobre isto! Me oyes?"
G["You! The cute one! Would you like to go over to my place and look over my tool collection?"]="Você! O bonito! Que vir a meu casa a ver meu coleção de ferramentas?"
G["You! What are you doing here?"]="Você! O que está fazendo aqui?"
G["You! Yes, you!\n\nGaze upon me and treasure this moment of meeting, for soon the world will come to know and fear the name and stern visage of Wilfred Fizzlebang! Once my magnificent summoning is complete, no one will doubt my ability!"]="You! Yes, you!\n\nGaze upon me and treasure this moment of meeting, for soon the world will come to know and fear the name and stern visage of Wilfred Fizzlebang! Once my magnificent summoning is complete, no one will doubt my ability!"
G["You! Yes, you! Get back to work!"]="Você! Sim, você! Volta ao trabalho!"
G["You! You have earned my ire. I will make an example of you, such that all who look upon my might will tremble and submit."]="You! You have earned my ire. I will make an example of you, such that all who look upon my might will tremble and submit."
G["You! You killed my brothers! You spilled their blood on the sacred ground of my ancestors!\n\nIf I were not chained, I would kill you now!\n\n<The old yaungol collapses from his outburst, breathing heavily.>"]="You! You killed my brothers! You spilled their blood on the sacred ground of my ancestors!\n\nIf I were not chained, I would kill you now!\n\n<The old yaungol collapses from his outburst, breathing heavily.>"
G["You! You need more practice."]="You! You need more practice."
G["You! You will suffer for your insolence at the hands of my greatest champions.  Surely they will protect their empress!"]="You! You will suffer for your insolence at the hands of my greatest champions.  Surely they will protect their empress!"
G["You! You're not fit to punch arclight spanners from copper plates. Get out of my sight!"]="You! You're not fit to punch arclight spanners from copper plates. Get out of my sight!"
G["You'd be surprised how often that works."]="Te sorprenderíao bem que funciona."
G["You'd best hurry if you want any of the spoils."]="Será melhor que te des pressa se que dar mão dos restos."
G["You'd best scram, $n.  I do not want Jonah's death to be linked back to me.\n\nIt'll be hard enough to establish myself as leader of this lot without them knowing I had their previous skipper killed."]="You'd best scram, $n.  I do not want Jonah's death to be linked back to me.\n\nIt'll be hard enough to establish myself as leader of this lot without them knowing I had their previous skipper killed."
G["You'd better get outta here unless you want to find yourself in one of these cages...."]="É melhor você sair daqui, a menos que queira se encontrar em uma dessas gaiolas..."
G["You'd better get used to it, jerkyloins. The Alliance primarily views you as pets. Do you do tricks?"]="You'd better get used to it, jerkyloins. The Alliance primarily views you as pets. Do you do tricks?"
G["You'd better have good reason to approach me, minnow!"]="É melhor você ter um bom motivo para se aproximar de mim, peixinho!"
G["You'd better hurry up if you want in on all the fun."]="Será melhor que te des pressa se que formar parte da diversão."
G["You'd better leave if you don't want an axe through your skull!"]="Será melhor que te vá se não que que te incruste um machado no crânio!"
G["You'd better meet up with him in the field and see what Garrosh is up to."]="You'd better meet up with him in the field and see what Garrosh is up to."
G["You'd better not be causing trouble, $n!"]="Será melhor que não causes problemas, $n!"
G["You'd better not tattle on me!"]="You'd better not tattle on me!"
G["You'd do well not to toy with me, Akama.  Illidan has given me specific orders to keep a close watch on the Warden.  If I find out you're hiding anything from me, I will crush you with my own hands!"]="You'd do well not to toy with me, Akama.  Illidan has given me specific orders to keep a close watch on the Warden.  If I find out you're hiding anything from me, I will crush you with my own hands!"
G["You'd do well to watch your tone, General.  Neither you nor Garrosh have anything to worry about.  We've ceased all production of the Plague, as he ordered.  We'd never deploy it without his permission."]="You'd do well to watch your tone, General.  Neither you nor Garrosh have anything to worry about.  We've ceased all production of the Plague, as he ordered.  We'd never deploy it without his permission."
G["You'd fight better if you'd loosen up."]="You'd fight better if you'd loosen up."
G["You'd think by now they'd learn to just run away."]="A estas alturas já devem haver aprendido a fugir, não?"
G["You'd think we'd have killed all of them by now."]="Já os deveríamos haver matou a todos."
G["You'll PAY for that."]="You'll PAY for that."
G["You'll all suffer for this! Zul'Gurub is NOTHING without Zan... Zan..."]="You'll all suffer for this! Zul'Gurub is NOTHING without Zan... Zan..."
G["You'll also find a complementary bag of peanuts."]="You'll also find a complementary bag of peanuts."
G["You'll always be here, with me."]="Sempre estará aqui comigo."
G["You'll be a fine example for the others!"]="Serão um magnífico exemplo para os mais!"
G["You'll be after Benik Boltshear, then. He's located in the heart of the Dwarven District by the blacksmiths."]="Você está atrás de Benik Boltshear, então. Ele está localizado no coração do distrito de Dwarven pelos ferreiros."
G["You'll be back."]="Volverás."
G["You'll be destroyed if the Twilight's Hammer brings this mountain down!"]="Se o Martelo Crepúsculo derruba esta montanha, será destruído!"
G["You'll be even more amazed after we take them out!"]="Você ficará ainda mais surpreso depois que nós os tirarmos!"
G["You'll be free to take it off when I die."]="You'll be free to take it off when I die."
G["You'll be hanging at the gallows soon..."]="You'll be hanging at the gallows soon..."
G["You'll be hanging in the gallows shortly, Scourge fiend!"]="You'll be hanging in the gallows shortly, Scourge fiend!"
G["You'll be hearing from my lawyer!"]="You'll be hearing from my lawyer!"
G["You'll be joining the other guests now...."]="Agora vai se juntar aos outros convidados..."
G["You'll be purchasing no hawkstrider here until you've proven your worth and dedication to our people.\n\nDo not return until you are considered exalted among the blood elves. Away with you!"]="You'll be purchasing no hawkstrider here until you've proven your worth and dedication to our people.\n\nDo not return until you are considered exalted among the blood elves. Away with you!"
G["You'll be purchasing no hawkstrider here until you've proven yourself at least friendly to our people."]="Não poderá comprar nenhum falcão pernalta até que meu povo não te considere, ao menos, amistoso."
G["You'll be sorry!"]="You'll be sorry!"
G["You'll burn for that."]="Você vai queimar por isso."
G["You'll burn for your crimes!"]="Arderás pelos seus crímenes!"
G["You'll come then?"]="Então acudirás?"
G["You'll die in this cave!"]="Morrerá nesta caverna!"
G["You'll do no such thing. We simply haven't the room to keep you here. Now, kindly be on your way."]="Nem falar. Simplesmente, não temos espaço para que te fique aqui. E agora, largo, por favor."
G["You'll find Carolai Anise trying to blow up her house at the northwest end of town.  Why don't you go see if you can help her?"]="Você encontrará Carolai Anise tentando explodir sua casa no extremo noroeste da cidade. Por que você não vai ver se você pode ajudá-a?"
G["You'll find Elder Grimtotem at the Lariss Pavilion in Feralas."]="Você encontrará o Élder Grimtotem no Pavilhão Lariss em Feralas."
G["You'll find Elder Northal inside the Transitus Shield in Coldarra."]="Você encontrará o Élder Northal dentro do Transitus Shield em Coldarra."
G["You'll find Elder Starglade outside the gates to Zul'Gurub in Stranglethorn Vale."]="Você encontrará Elder Starglade do lado de fosse dos portões de Zul'Gurub, em Stranglethorn Vale."
G["You'll find Elder Whurain at Camp Oneqwah in Grizzly Hills."]="Você encontrará o Élder Whurain no acampamento Oneqwah, em Grizzly Hills."
G["You'll find Ergll to the northeast. This should help you get across the bay more quickly."]="Encontrar a Erglh ao nordeste. Isto te ajudará a cruzar mais rápido a baía."
G["You'll find Greatfather Winter in the center of the Valley of Strength. Just look for the tree."]="Você encontrará o Bisavô Winter no centro do Vale da Força. Basta olhar para a árvore."
G["You'll find Horace Alder pacing about above the ground level of Lady Proudmoore's tower."]="Você encontrará Horace Alder andando acima do nível do chão da torre de Lady Proudmoore."
G["You'll find Innkeeper Renee inside the Gallows' End Tavern at the southeast end of the street running through town."]="Você encontrará o Estalajadeiro Renee dentro da Gallows 'End Tavern, no extremo sudeste da rua que atravessa a cidade."
G["You'll find Krendle Bigpockets near the zeppelin's perch on the western edge of Spirit Rise. I'm not fond of the goblin contraption flying through here... but it will take you to Orgrimmar if you can stand it."]="Você encontrará Krendle Bigpockets perto do poleiro do zeppelin, na borda oeste de Spirit Rise. Não gosto da engenhoca dos duendes voando por aqui... mas você será levado a Orgrimmar, se você aguentar."
G["You'll find Marley Twinbraid up top, $gsir:ma'am;."]="You'll find Marley Twinbraid up top, $gsir:ma'am;."
G["You'll find a jewelcrafting trainer and supplies on the inner ring of the War Quarter."]="Encontrar um instrutor de joyería e suprimentos no cinto interior do Bairro da Guerra."
G["You'll find her in the inner ring of the War Quarter."]="Está no Bairro da Guerra, no anel interior."
G["You'll find it in the northernmost part of the Dwarven District, near the Northern Landing."]="Você o encontrará na parte mais ao norte do distrito de Dwarven, perto de Northern Landing."
G["You'll find no finer rat kabob this side of Khaz Modan!"]="Você não encontrará kabob de tempo mais fino deste lado de Khaz Modan!"
G["You'll find one of those outside the Bank of Orgrimmar in the middle of the Valley of Strength."]="Você encontrará um daqueles fosse do Banco de Orgrimmar, no meio do Vale da Força."
G["You'll find out soon enough. Are you ready for the next challenge?"]="Você descobrirá em breve. Você está pronto para o próximo desafio?"
G["You'll find plenty to do here, $n."]="Aqui encontrar muito que fazer, $n."
G["You'll find reagants and more at the Sisters Sorcerous in western Dalaran.\n\nJust mind the Mooreheads' black cat..."]="You'll find reagants and more at the Sisters Sorcerous in western Dalaran.\n\nJust mind the Mooreheads' black cat..."
G["You'll find that goblin and his toy shop in the Valley of Honor."]="Você encontrará aquele duende e sua loja de brinquedos no Vale da Honra."
G["You'll find the Krasarang Paddlefish AND that no-good goblin in the biggest pool of the Krasari River. Right in the heart of Krasarang Wilds. Right here. \n\n<Ben pokes a hole in your map with his claw.>"]="You'll find the Krasarang Paddlefish AND that no-good goblin in the biggest pool of the Krasari River. Right in the heart of Krasarang Wilds. Right here. \n\n<Ben pokes a hole in your map with his claw.>"
G["You'll find the Mage Trainer, Cain Firesong, upstairs on the landing at the Gallows' End Tavern, which is on the southeast end of Brill.  I guess he checked in too late to get a room."]="Você encontrará o Mage Trainer, Cain Firesong, no andar de cima, no patamar da Gallows 'End Tavern, que fica no extremo sudeste de Brill. Acho que ele fez check-in tarde demais para conseguir um quarto."
G["You'll find the Wind Rider Master in Orgrimmar.  Go north up the road to get there and ask an Orgrimmar Grunt for further directions."]="Você encontrará o Wind Rider Master em Orgrimmar. Vá para o norte pela estrada para chegar lá e peça a um Orgrimmar Grunt mais instruções."
G["You'll find the battlemasters in the war room of Stormwind Keep."]="Você encontrará os mestres de batalha na sala de guerra da Fortaleza de Ventobravo."
G["You'll find the city's Flight Master at Krasus' Landing in eastern Dalaran."]="Você encontrará o Flight Master da cidade em Krasus 'Landing, no leste de Dalaran."
G["You'll find the trainer inside of Aldrassil, $n."]="Encontrar ao instrutor dentro de Aldrassil, $n."
G["You'll find the warlocks in the Magic Quarter's main building, but I better not hear of any trouble that comes of this."]="Você encontrará os feiticeiros no edifício principal do Bairro Mágico, mas é melhor não ouvir nenhum problema que possa surgir disso."
G["You'll find them in the Apothecarium. Names are Doctor Herbert Halsey and Doctor Marsh. Just watch your back."]="Você os encontrará no Apothecarium. Os nomes são Doutor Herbert Halsey e Doutor Marsh. Apenas observe suas costas."
G["You'll find what you are looking for at One More Glass in northern Dalaran."]="Você encontrará o que procura no One More Glass, no norte de Dalaran."
G["You'll get no mercy from me."]="Não receberá nenhuma piedade de mim."
G["You'll get nothing from me, $r!"]="Não me sacarás nada, $r!"
G["You'll get nothing out of me!"]="Não me sacarás nada!"
G["You'll get nothing out of me, monster. I am beyond your ability to influence."]="Não me sacarás nada, monstro. Estou além do seu esfera de influência."
G["You'll get yourself killed!"]="Ganhará que te matem!"
G["You'll get'm this time. Show no mercy!"]="You'll get'm this time. Show no mercy!"
G["You'll go nowhere worms!"]="Não irão a nenhuma parte, vermes!"
G["You'll go nowhere, Skyguard scum!"]="Não irás a nenhuma parte, sucata Guarda do céu!"
G["You'll go nowhere, fool!"]="Não irás a nenhuma parte, $gestúpido: estúpida;!"
G["You'll have to ask Mung-Mung about that. He maintains our foodstores."]="You'll have to ask Mung-Mung about that. He maintains our foodstores."
G["You'll have to be patient with me, $n. I've got my Spybot inside working on a very delicate matter. I'll be with ya in a second.\n\nOh, and do me a favor, try not to let Lescovar see you... we're about to ambush him."]="You'll have to be patient with me, $n. I've got my Spybot inside working on a very delicate matter. I'll be with ya in a second.\n\nOh, and do me a favor, try not to let Lescovar see you... we're about to ambush him."
G["You'll have to be patient."]="Terá que ter paciência."
G["You'll have to give me a moment, $c, the naga are attacking us right now. I'll speak to you as soon as the attack is done!"]="You'll have to give me a moment, $c, the naga are attacking us right now. I'll speak to you as soon as the attack is done!"
G["You'll have to kill me, monster. I will tell you NOTHING!"]="You'll have to kill me, monster. I will tell you NOTHING!"
G["You'll have to prove yourself to Nana and Haohan Mudclaw. Those two Mudclaws will be tough to sway, but I think you can do it."]="You'll have to prove yourself to Nana and Haohan Mudclaw. Those two Mudclaws will be tough to sway, but I think you can do it."
G["You'll have to prove yourself to us before you're welcome here, $n."]="You'll have to prove yourself to us before you're welcome here, $n."
G["You'll have to wrench me out of here!"]="Eu de aqui não me muevo!"
G["You'll keep the bad people away, won't you?"]="You'll keep the bad people away, won't you?"
G["You'll learn of that first hand. When my work is complete, you will beg for mercy -- and I will deny you. Your anguished cries will be testament to my unbridled power..."]="You'll learn of that first hand. When my work is complete, you will beg for mercy -- and I will deny you. Your anguished cries will be testament to my unbridled power..."
