G["You're hit! We're losing your signal!"]="You're hit! We're losing your signal!"
G["You're hunting Deathclasp, $n?  Color me impressed.  I lost two of my men to her this week alone.  Let's hope your luck is better than theirs."]="You're hunting Deathclasp, $n?  Color me impressed.  I lost two of my men to her this week alone.  Let's hope your luck is better than theirs."
