G["You're such a hero, you've got so much gold - why you coming down here and wasting your time on a bunch of losers?"]="You're such a hero, you've got so much gold - why you coming down here and wasting your time on a bunch of losers?"
G["You're such a sweet lad.  Here, take this horse over to your stable."]="É um rapaz muito doce. Tome, leva este cavalo ao seu estábulo."
G["You're supposed to be doing your chores!"]="Se significa que deveria estar fazendo seus tarefas!"
G["You're supposed to hit the big guy, not me."]="Se significa que deve pegar ao grandote, não a mim."
G["You're sweet for asking, $c, but we have all of the light leather that we need. May be that one of the others in charge of collecting around here is in need of your assistance though?"]="You're sweet for asking, $c, but we have all of the light leather that we need. May be that one of the others in charge of collecting around here is in need of your assistance though?"
G["You're talking to the wrong orc. I don't train novices. Talk to young Whuut over there... and use small words."]="Você está falando com o orc errado. Eu não treino novatos. Fale com o jovem Whuut por lá... e use palavras pequenas."
G["You're telegraphing your moves."]="Anuncias seus movimentos."
G["You're telling me! It's even stranger considering between Brann, Rutgar, me and the monkey, we know 38 different languages including a touch of Titan - both Vanir and Aesir.\n\nSo anyway, whatever she was click clacking about, it definitely wasn't with anyone \"present.\" She then nodded and went on the offensive! Attacked us outright!"]="You're telling me! It's even stranger considering between Brann, Rutgar, me and the monkey, we know 38 different languages including a touch of Titan - both Vanir and Aesir.\n\nSo anyway, whatever she was click clacking about, it definitely wasn't with anyone \"present.\" She then nodded and went on the offensive! Attacked us outright!"
G["You're the best I've ever seen. I can't believe I'm saying this but you might have a chance against Skyshatter. And hey, if that doesn't go so well you can be my wing man..."]="You're the best I've ever seen. I can't believe I'm saying this but you might have a chance against Skyshatter. And hey, if that doesn't go so well you can be my wing man..."
G["You're the best thing I've seen since the troggs showed up!"]="You're the best thing I've seen since the troggs showed up!"
G["You're the best trainer here!"]="You're the best trainer here!"
G["You're the best!"]="É o mais!"
G["You're the best, $n - thanks for going trick-or-treating for me!"]="É o melhor, $n! Obrigado por fazer o truco ou trato por mim!"
G["You're the best, $p!"]="É o mais, $p!"
G["You're the bomb!"]="Você a veste!"
G["You're the bomb-diggity, $n!"]="É a bomba, $n!"
G["You're the boss."]="Você é o chefe."
G["You're the champion now, buddy! Do you think you have what it takes to defend your title?"]="Você é o campeão agora, amigo! Você acha que tem o que é preciso para defender seu título?"
G["You're the contingency plan. Your mission is to infiltrate Theramore Isle."]="You're the contingency plan. Your mission is to infiltrate Theramore Isle."
G["You're the first person to come through that door who isn't in shock, injured, or both.\n\nI'm hoping that means you can help."]="You're the first person to come through that door who isn't in shock, injured, or both.\n\nI'm hoping that means you can help."
G["You're the great champion brought to battle the Aspect of Death?"]="Você é $gel grande campeão: a grande campeona; que tem vindo a lutar contra o Aspecto da Morte?"
G["You're the greatest, $p!"]="É o mais, $p!"
G["You're the hero that is supposed to be my undoing?"]="You're the hero that is supposed to be my undoing?"
G["You're the last of your tribe with any sense left.  As a reward for giving us Prince Nadun, I grant you the gift that is your birthright and more!"]="Vocês são os últimos da sua tribo com juízo na cabeça. Como recompensa por nos dar o Príncipe Nadun, eu lhes darei um presente que é seu por direito e muito mais!"
G["You're the last one. Hop on that sea plane and we'll get going. The King has placed a lot of trust in you."]="You're the last one. Hop on that sea plane and we'll get going. The King has placed a lot of trust in you."
G["You're the lucky one."]="Você é $gel sortudo: a sortuda;."
G["You're the man from my dream!"]="É o homem de meu sonho!"
G["You're the most handsome boyfriend a girl could hope for. Knock 'em dead, honey!"]="You're the most handsome boyfriend a girl could hope for. Knock 'em dead, honey!"
G["You're the one my aunt sent? A test, no doubt. I'll kill you quickly and prove myself to her once again."]="You're the one my aunt sent? A test, no doubt. I'll kill you quickly and prove myself to her once again."
G["You're the one that's been disrupting things? This should be easy."]="You're the one that's been disrupting things? This should be easy."
G["You're the one who should be-- Wait, we have company..."]="You're the one who should be-- Wait, we have company..."
G["You're the one who tracked down the brutes who did this to us."]="You're the one who tracked down the brutes who did this to us."
G["You're the one who was supposed to be watching for orcs!"]="You're the one who was supposed to be watching for orcs!"
G["You're the one, $n. You must defeat the Trade Prince or all is lost."]="Você é o escolhido, $n. Você derrotarás ao Príncipe mercante ou tudo estará perdido."
G["You're the strongest of us - show'm how it's done, my king!"]="É o mais forte de nós, muéstrales como se há, meu rei!"
G["You're too late to stop our plan."]="Chega tarde demais para parar nosso plano."
G["You're too late! The accord has been negotiated. Only the details remain. Small details... like you!"]="You're too late! The accord has been negotiated. Only the details remain. Small details... like you!"
G["You're too late, $n. Another visitor from Dalaran came asking after information about the same prismatic dragon blades."]="Chega tarde, $n. Outro visitante de Dalaran veio pedindo informações sobre as mesmas lâminas prismáticas dos dragões."
G["You're too late, Bouldergut. The proverbial cavalry has arrived!"]="Demais tarde, Tripapétrea. Chegou a cavalaria, como quem diz."
G["You're too late, now feel the wrath of my warhounds!"]="Demais tarde, agora sente a raiva de meus cães de guerra!"
G["You're too late, puny one."]="Chega tarde demais, enclenque."
G["You're too late. I must start again from the beginning...."]="Chega tarde demais. Tenho que voltar a começar..."
G["You're too ugly and scrawny to be a female yeti! And now you're making me mad..."]="You're too ugly and scrawny to be a female yeti! And now you're making me mad..."
G["You're tough!"]="Você é $gdurão:durona;!"
G["You're tougher than you look."]="Pegas mais forte do que esperava."
G["You're toying with death."]="You're toying with death."
G["You're trespassing!"]="You're trespassing!"
G["You're truly a force to be reckoned with. The beast is done with. Let's get out of here."]="Tenho que admitir que é uma força a ter em conta. Temos terminou com a fera. Vamos de aqui."
G["You're under arrest."]="You're under arrest."
G["You're useless, Quimby!"]="É um inútil, Quimby!"
G["You're very welcome! I must be on my way... be safe, all of you."]="You're very welcome! I must be on my way... be safe, all of you."
G["You're wasting time. Go kill the minions of the Lich King, $c!"]="Está perdendo o tempo. Vê a matar aos lacaios do Rei Lich, $c!"
G["You're wasting your time.\n\nI'm not going anywhere."]="You're wasting your time.\n\nI'm not going anywhere."
G["You're way cooler than Uncle Chen."]="You're way cooler than Uncle Chen."
G["You're weak! COME ON!"]="Você é fraca! VAMOS!"
G["You're weak, old woman!"]="É fraco, ânciana!"
G["You're wearing my patience thin, grunt. I've put the new flare gun in your pack. Try not to lose this one!"]="You're wearing my patience thin, grunt. I've put the new flare gun in your pack. Try not to lose this one!"
G["You're welcome among us anytime, $n."]="Sempre será $gbienvenido: boas-vindas; entre nós, $n."
G["You're welcome to stay at the Farstrider Enclave for as long as you'd like, $c.  We welcome any who would aid us in our endeavors in the Ghostlands."]="$gBienvenido: Bem-vinda; ao Enclave do Errante, $c. Fique tudo o tempo que queira. São bem-vindos todos os que nos apoiam nas Terras Fantasmas."
G["You're welcome.... Now tell us what's going on in here!"]="De nada... Agora cuéntanos que está passando!"
G["You're what's for dinner!"]="Vais a ser meu cena!"
G["You're willing to give up an Ata'mal crystal... just to see your plan against Illidan through?  You intrigue me, Broken.  Perhaps I'll play along... for now, at least."]="You're willing to give up an Ata'mal crystal... just to see your plan against Illidan through?  You intrigue me, Broken.  Perhaps I'll play along... for now, at least."
G["You're with the Earthen Ring, I just figured you'd have a water breathing spell like the rest of them."]="Está com O Anel da Terra... E dados por sentado que tendrías um feitiço para respirar debaixo d'água, como todos os outros."
G["You're working your way up... higher than me, at this point! You should talk to Springspindle Fizzlegear in Ironforge! (He'll? She'll?) show you more than I ever could!"]="Você está subindo... mais alto que eu, neste momentos! Você deve conversar com o Springspindle Fizzlegear em Ironforge! (Ele vai? Ela vai?) Mostrar-lhe mais do que eu jamais pude!"
G["You're wrong, banshee.  We've come to take Gidwin back."]="Te equivocas, alma em pena. Temos vindo a resgate a Gidwin."
G["You're... sixth in line."]="Você é $gel sexto: a sexta;."
G["You're... working for the Shado-Pan? I can't believe it!"]="Está... trabalhando para o Shadopan? Não me o posso acreditar!"
G["You've FAILED, Mekkatorque! I've caught and defeated you before you even set FOOT in my precious city!"]="Tem FALHADO, Mekkatorque! Te e derrotou antes de que pisaras meu preciosa cidade!"
G["You've a good eye for ingredients."]="Tem bom olho para os ingredientes."
G["You've absorbed 3 Static Charges. Your next Storm Hammer will deal massive AoE damage!\n|TInterface\\Icons\\spell_nature_lightningoverload.blp:32|t"]="You've absorbed 3 Static Charges. Your next Storm Hammer will deal massive AoE damage!\n|TInterface\\Icons\\spell_nature_lightningoverload.blp:32|t"
G["You've accepted my surrender."]="aceitou meu rendição."
G["You've all accomplished a great thing in saving Shen-zin Su. You do us all proud."]="You've all accomplished a great thing in saving Shen-zin Su. You do us all proud."
G["You've almost got him! Og'nor ka Lok'tar - Now we finish this!"]="Quase o têm! Og'nor ka Lok'tar. Acabemos com isto!"
G["You've already bested one of our riders today, so I cannot accept your challenge."]="Você já venceu um de nossos pilotos hoje, então não posso aceitar seu desafio."
G["You've already done me a great service, $n. For that I thank you.\n\nThe least I can do now is tell you what brought me here: My long time friend Trey Lightforge and I came to Jaedenar to investigate the Shadow Council when they caught us unprepared. They took Trey deeper into Shadow Hold and put me in here after taking all of our equipment... I can still hear his screams from below, $n. They were... inhuman. I don't know what they've done to him, but they will pay for it."]="You've already done me a great service, $n. For that I thank you.\n\nThe least I can do now is tell you what brought me here: My long time friend Trey Lightforge and I came to Jaedenar to investigate the Shadow Council when they caught us unprepared. They took Trey deeper into Shadow Hold and put me in here after taking all of our equipment... I can still hear his screams from below, $n. They were... inhuman. I don't know what they've done to him, but they will pay for it."
G["You've already learned everything I can teach you, $n. Talk to the night elf Lilyssia Nightbreeze in the Mage Quarter of Stormwind if you want to continue your studies. I hear she's a good teacher."]="You've already learned everything I can teach you, $n. Talk to the night elf Lilyssia Nightbreeze in the Mage Quarter of Stormwind if you want to continue your studies. I hear she's a good teacher."
G["You've angered me for the last time $n!"]="É a última vez que me enfadas $n!"
G["You've bagged them all: Bach'lor, Banthar, Gutripper, and even the mighty Tusker!  You're truly the finest big game hunter that I know!"]="Você ensacou todos eles: Bach'lor, Banthar, Gutripper e até o poderoso Tusker! Você é mesmo o melhor caçador de grandes jogos que eu conheço!"
G["You've become quite the hunter, $n! Not only have you proven your skills, you also bested Daryl, which gets you extra points in my book!\n\nYou're welcome here any time."]="Você feito $gtodo um caçador: toda uma caçadora;, $n! Não somente tem testado suas habilidades mas sim derrotou a Daryl, e isso te da ainda mais pontos!\n\nSempre será $gbienvenido: boas-vindas;."
G["You've become strong indeed, child. This is good. You will need that strength soon."]="You've become strong indeed, child. This is good. You will need that strength soon."
G["You've beel afflicted with Master Hsu's Deadly Poison.  Detox yourself to remove it!"]="You've beel afflicted with Master Hsu's Deadly Poison.  Detox yourself to remove it!"
G["You've been MALOWNED!"]="Recebe um MACHAQUE de Gassol!"
G["You've been a great help thus far, $n. You would do well to help out the others at the encampment.\n\nAnd don't worry about those goblins, I'm taking care of everything."]="Foi de grande ajuda até agora, $n. Harías bem em ajudar aos mais no acampamento.\n\nE não te preocupe por esses goblins, me estou fazendo cargo de tudo."
G["You've been a really big help here at the Temple!\n\nI heard the Elder Sage say that he's glad you arrived when you did."]="Nos tem servido de grande ajuda no templo!\n\nouvi que o ancestral sábio diz que se alegra de que vinieras."
G["You've been a tremendous help, $r! Let's get out of here before more of those things show up! I'll let Dwarfowitz know you did the job asked of ya' admirably."]="You've been a tremendous help, $r! Let's get out of here before more of those things show up! I'll let Dwarfowitz know you did the job asked of ya' admirably."
G["You've been afflicted by Spirit's Wrath.  Run away!"]="Te têm afligido com Raiva dos espíritos. Corre!"
G["You've been bitten by a worgen.  It's probably nothing, but it sure stings a little.\n\n|TInterface\\Icons\\INV_Misc_monsterfang_02.blp:32|t"]="You've been bitten by a worgen.  It's probably nothing, but it sure stings a little.\n\n|TInterface\\Icons\\INV_Misc_monsterfang_02.blp:32|t"
G["You've been cut off, $n.  No more ale for you."]="Te têm fechado o grifo, $n. Não há mais cerveja para você."
G["You've been just as busy blowing yourself up as you have blowing up the opposition.  That sounds fun, but be careful or I'll stop giving you bombers..."]="You've been just as busy blowing yourself up as you have blowing up the opposition.  That sounds fun, but be careful or I'll stop giving you bombers..."
G["You've been making quite a name for yourself around here, $r.  Good for you.\n\nWe trust that you won't let that go to your single head, and that you'll still help out by banishing demons?"]="You've been making quite a name for yourself around here, $r.  Good for you.\n\nWe trust that you won't let that go to your single head, and that you'll still help out by banishing demons?"
G["You've been paid good coin for non-stop passage, miss. We have no time for delays..."]="You've been paid good coin for non-stop passage, miss. We have no time for delays..."
G["You've been seen! Use the net and ice slick to keep the dwarves away!"]="You've been seen! Use the net and ice slick to keep the dwarves away!"
G["You've been so nice, $n. I've been trapped here so long thanks to Verinias. That young elf was the first soul I've tasted in ages."]="Foi muito gentil comigo, $n. tenho estado presa aqui tanto tempo por culpar de Verinias. Esse jovem elfo foi a primeira alma que e saboreado em anos."
G["You've been spotted!  Club your target to death before you are unmasked!"]="You've been spotted!  Club your target to death before you are unmasked!"
G["You've been such an unbelievably big help! These bones are going to unlock so much new information and help me futher my research."]="You've been such an unbelievably big help! These bones are going to unlock so much new information and help me futher my research."
G["You've been summoned by Lago Blackwrench, warlock master of Ironforge. You'd do yourself well to report to him immediately. You'll find him in the Forlorn Cavern district of the city."]="Você foi convocado por Lago Blackwrench, mestre bruxo de Ironforge. Você faria bem em se reportar a ele imediatamente. Você o encontrará no distrito de Forlorn Cavern da cidade."
G["You've been swallowed by the Ik'thik Colossus!"]="O colosso Ik'thik se você tragado!"
G["You've been trained well."]="You've been trained well."
G["You've been unmasked!  Get to safety, then put your disguise back on!"]="You've been unmasked!  Get to safety, then put your disguise back on!"
G["You've been |cFFFF0000|Hspell:107268|h[Sabotaged]|h|r!"]="Te têm |cFFFF0000|Hspell:107268|h[saboteado]|h|r!"
G["You've betrayed the Kirin Tor, Sunreaver. You've allowed Garrosh to move his forces through MY city."]="Tem traído ao Kirin Tor, Atracasol. Tem permitida que as forças de Garrosh entren na minha cidade."
G["You've brought me way too much worg-hide, $n!"]="You've brought me way too much worg-hide, $n!"
G["You've caught me at a critical time in my research!  No worries, you're welcome to join me in quiet contemplation... emphasis on \"quiet\", if you don't mind though."]="Você me pegou em um momento crítico na minha pesquisa! Não se preocupe, você pode se juntar a mim em uma contemplação silenciosa... ênfase em \"quiet\", se você não se importa."
G["You've caused enough damage, Glop. The earth welcomes you no longer."]="Já tem causa'o dano suficiente, Glop. A terra já não te aceitar."
G["You've come a long way, $n. A long way indeed... But I knew you were destined for great things.  We all knew. All hail $n!\n\nAnd thanks again for taking care of our gnome problem..."]="You've come a long way, $n. A long way indeed... But I knew you were destined for great things.  We all knew. All hail $n!\n\nAnd thanks again for taking care of our gnome problem..."
G["You've come far, my young student. I see within you a great hero. I leave the fate of this land to you."]="You've come far, my young student. I see within you a great hero. I leave the fate of this land to you."
G["You've come for the doctor's plans! You'll only find death!"]="Veio a pelos planos do doutor! Somente encontrar a morte!"
G["You've come for training in order to pass it on to your pets?"]="Você veio para o treinamento para passá-o aos seus animais de estimação?"
G["You've come for training. Good!"]="Tem vindo à procura de treinamento. Bem!"
G["You've come further than many, $n. Respect the elements around you and you shall fare far greater than most."]="Chegou mais longe que ninguém, $n. Respetaos elementos que te cercam e te irá melhor que a ninguém."
G["You've come seeking your death? Happy to oblige."]="You've come seeking your death? Happy to oblige."
G["You've come to address the men, sir?"]="You've come to address the men, sir?"
G["You've come to help, $c? Let us stay together for a while."]="Tem vindo a ajudar, $c? Permanezcamos juntos durante um tempo."
G["You've come to prove yourself, fleshling?  The Crumbling Depths lie northeast.  The stone you seek is within."]="Tem vindo para demostrar o que vales, ser de carne? As Profundezas Desmoronadas estão ao nordeste. A pedras que atenção está ali."
G["You've come to test the might of the Onslaught?"]="You've come to test the might of the Onslaught?"
G["You've come to the right place! Halfhill Market's got everything you need."]="You've come to the right place! Halfhill Market's got everything you need."
G["You've come to the right place, buddy! Halfhill Market's got everything you need."]="You've come to the right place, buddy! Halfhill Market's got everything you need."
G["You've come to the right place, friend! Halfhill Market's got everything you need."]="You've come to the right place, friend! Halfhill Market's got everything you need."
G["You've come to the right place, my good friend! Halfhill Market's got everything you need."]="You've come to the right place, my good friend! Halfhill Market's got everything you need."
G["You've come to the right place, neighbor! Halfhill Market's got everything you need."]="You've come to the right place, neighbor! Halfhill Market's got everything you need."
G["You've come to the right place, stranger! Halfhill Market's got everything you need."]="You've come to the right place, stranger! Halfhill Market's got everything you need."
G["You've come where you are not welcome."]="Aqui não receberá boas-vindas alguma."
G["You've completed the quest!"]="Tem concluído a missão!"
G["You've convinced me of your intentions, $n, and you have my thanks for being willing to help out the members of my former mercenary company, The Veiled Blade.\n\nNow let's see, what's next on our list of things to do?"]="You've convinced me of your intentions, $n, and you have my thanks for being willing to help out the members of my former mercenary company, The Veiled Blade.\n\nNow let's see, what's next on our list of things to do?"
G["You've crossed into the domain of red dragons, $r."]="You've crossed into the domain of red dragons, $r."
G["You've dealt the decisive blow against the Shadowpine trolls, $n. I only hope that we can muster our forces quickly enough to finish them off before they receive reinforcements from Zul'Aman.\n\nIt would be nice if Tranquillien were to reinforce us."]="You've dealt the decisive blow against the Shadowpine trolls, $n. I only hope that we can muster our forces quickly enough to finish them off before they receive reinforcements from Zul'Aman.\n\nIt would be nice if Tranquillien were to reinforce us."
G["You've defeated the Iron Council and unlocked the Archivum!  Well done, lads!"]="Vocês têm derrotou ao Conselho de Ferro e desbloqueadao Archivum. Bem feito, pessoal!"
G["You've destroyed too much of my work!  Prepare to join them in the Nether!"]="You've destroyed too much of my work!  Prepare to join them in the Nether!"
G["You've done a lot for us.  I am here on an important assignment but if you need passage to the Caverns of Time I'd be glad to take you there."]="Fez muito por nós. Estou levando a cabo uma importantes missão, mas se você precisa ir às Caverna do Tempo estarei encantado de levar você até ali."
G["You've done all that I've asked you to do, $n. There's really nothing more here for you. If you are interested in continuing your career as an agent of the Thorium Brotherhood, speak with Lokhtos Darkbargainer at the Grim Guzzler in Blackrock Depths.\n\nFarewell!"]="You've done all that I've asked you to do, $n. There's really nothing more here for you. If you are interested in continuing your career as an agent of the Thorium Brotherhood, speak with Lokhtos Darkbargainer at the Grim Guzzler in Blackrock Depths.\n\nFarewell!"
G["You've done great work here, friend. We should have a strong base of operations here going forward - see if anyone else needs your help."]="Fez um grande trabalho, amigo. A partir de agora deveríamos ter uma sólida base de operações aqui. Vê a ver se alguém mais precisa da sua ajuda."
G["You've done great work. We should be able to maintain our base of operations here now without too much trouble."]="Fez um trabalho excelente. Não deveríamos ter maiores problemas para manter nossa base de operações aqui."
G["You've done it!  Now quickly, lets attack it while it's grounded."]="You've done it!  Now quickly, lets attack it while it's grounded."
G["You've done it! You've broken the defenses of Ulduar. In a few moments, we will be dropping in to..."]="You've done it! You've broken the defenses of Ulduar. In a few moments, we will be dropping in to..."
G["You've done it! You've saved the tablets. Hurry and bring them to Ironforge. I'll be along once I've had some time to recover."]="O conseguiu! salvou as tabuletas. Date pressa e lhévalas a Altaforja. Eu irei assim que me tenha recuperei um pouco."
G["You've done it, $n! <The strangely familiar voice seems to be coming from the phial!> Hurry back! The fallout will only remain stable for thirty minutes."]="You've done it, $n! <The strangely familiar voice seems to be coming from the phial!> Hurry back! The fallout will only remain stable for thirty minutes."
G["You've done it, heroes! Stratholme is ours! Come, we wait just outside the Slaughterhouse!"]="O vocês têm conseguido, heróis! Stratholme é nossa! Venham, os esperamos linha de frente do matadouro!"
G["You've done much work today, $n. We will resume your training tomorrow."]="You've done much work today, $n. We will resume your training tomorrow."
G["You've done so much for Old Hillpaw, that old geezer is probably missing your company right now. You should ask him to help on the farm."]="You've done so much for Old Hillpaw, that old geezer is probably missing your company right now. You should ask him to help on the farm."
G["You've done the Crusade proud, $n!"]="É o orgulho da Cruzada, $n!"
G["You've done the impossible, shaman. You have stilled the vortex within him without losing yourself, in turn. Your love for him... must be very great."]="You've done the impossible, shaman. You have stilled the vortex within him without losing yourself, in turn. Your love for him... must be very great."
G["You've done us exemplary service, $n. Between dealing with the gnolls at the Underlight Mines, and the mummified trolls in the Amani Catacombs, you've dealt a mighty blow to our enemies!\n\n$G Good job! : We should get together for drinks sometime, what do you say?;"]="You've done us exemplary service, $n. Between dealing with the gnolls at the Underlight Mines, and the mummified trolls in the Amani Catacombs, you've dealt a mighty blow to our enemies!\n\n$G Good job! : We should get together for drinks sometime, what do you say?;"
G["You've done well for yourself, I can see that.  But to enter the Celestial Tournament, you must prove yourself as a leader.  When you have taken fifteen battle pets to their maximum level, you may attempt the trials that await you there."]="You've done well for yourself, I can see that.  But to enter the Celestial Tournament, you must prove yourself as a leader.  When you have taken fifteen battle pets to their maximum level, you may attempt the trials that await you there."
G["You've done well, $c.\n\nMy men and I are now prepared to face the enemy."]="Tem estado bem, $c.\n\nAgora meus homens e eu nos prepararemos para fazer linha de frente ao inimigo."
G["You've driven them back to the Horde."]="Você os mandou de volta para a Horda."
G["You've earned my aid.  Where to?"]="Te ganhou minha ajuda. Aonde vamos?"
G["You've earned my trust hero. Simply place my staff on the Thunder King's dais and it will do the rest. You are very brave to take this mission on; good luck!"]="Tem meu confiança. Coloca meu cajado no estrado do Rei do Trovão e ele fará o resto. Demuestras um grande coragem ao aceitar esta missão. Boa sorte!"
G["You've faced the best of our trainees, and defeated them all. Now let's see what you're really made of..."]="You've faced the best of our trainees, and defeated them all. Now let's see what you're really made of..."
G["You've failed us all, $n. Deathwing has won. The world is doomed."]="Nos tem falhado a todos, $n. Alamuerte ganhou. O mundo está condenado."
G["You've failed your race. You've failed all life on Azeroth. Because of you, everyone you've ever known will die... gruesomely and painfully."]="You've failed your race. You've failed all life on Azeroth. Because of you, everyone you've ever known will die... gruesomely and painfully."
G["You've fallen right into my trap!"]="Tem caído logo na minha armadilha!"
G["You've found a cure!  We will crush our enemies!"]="Tem encontrado uma cura! Destruiremos a nossos inimigos!"
G["You've found another piece of the puzzle! This was carved by the mogu. They were frustrated - a thousand years with no orders from their master, and their bodies had turned to flesh. The mogu began to argue among themselves."]="Você achou mais uma peça! Esta foi esculpida pelos mogus. Eles estavam frustrados. Mil anos sem ordens do seu mestre, e seus corpos tinham virado carne. Os mogus começaram a discutir entre si."
G["You've found another stone! What have we learned? The \"curse of flesh\" made the mogu mortal. Ah - but later, they found a way to reverse the process. A clever race."]="Você achou outra pedra! O que já sabemos? A \"maldição da carne\" transformou os mogus em mortais. Sim, mas eles encontraram um jeito de reverter o processo. Mogus espertos."
G["You've found for us our only lead. The rogues from Ravenholdt are behind this."]="Tem encontrado nossa única pista. Os ladinos de Ravenholdt são os culpados."
G["You've found nothing?  Very well.  Over there next."]="Não tem encontrado nada? Muito bem. Continue por ali."
G["You've found something?"]="Has encontrado algo?"
G["You've freed me!  The winds speak to my people once again and grant us their strength.  I thank you, stranger."]="You've freed me!  The winds speak to my people once again and grant us their strength.  I thank you, stranger."
G["You've gained Mogu Power!  Pick up more runes and your power will grow."]="Tem obtido poder mogu! Coleta mais runas e seu poder aumenta."
G["You've gone mum and dad, you have!"]="You've gone mum and dad, you have!"
G["You've got a darkness in you, $r."]="A escuridão está no seu interior, $r."
G["You've got a lot of shinies. Lucky."]="Você ter muitas cositas brilhantes. Ter sorte."
G["You've got a lot to make up for, Jitters. I won't give you the easy way out."]="Tem muito que expiar, Alterio. Não vou deixar que te livres."
G["You've got a miscievious look in your eye. What have you been up to, babe?\n\nWell?"]="You've got a miscievious look in your eye. What have you been up to, babe?\n\nWell?"
G["You've got him, keep it up!"]="Já quase está! Continua assim!"
G["You've got it all wrong. I'm a subjugator!"]="You've got it all wrong. I'm a subjugator!"
G["You've got money and we've got food.  What are you waiting for?!"]="Você tem dinheiro e nós temos comida. O que você está esperando?!"
G["You've got more guts than brains, coming to me without the proper training. Go talk to somebody closer to your skill level, like the orc Kamari, who lives in the Drag of Orgrimmar."]="Você tem mais coragem do que cérebro, vindo até mim sem o treinamento adequado. Vá conversar com alguém mais próximo do seu nível de habilidade, como o orc Kamari, que vive no Drag of Orgrimmar."
G["You've got my attention, dragon.  You'll find I'm not as easily scared as the villagers below."]="You've got my attention, dragon.  You'll find I'm not as easily scared as the villagers below."
G["You've got my attention."]="Tem toda meu atenção."
G["You've got quite the setup here, friend. Come with me while I find out who's in charge."]="You've got quite the setup here, friend. Come with me while I find out who's in charge."
G["You've got real talent and a passion for making potions. There is one little matter I'd like you to take care of, though."]="You've got real talent and a passion for making potions. There is one little matter I'd like you to take care of, though."
G["You've got some fight in you! Blood and honor, friend!"]="Tem coragem! Sangue e honra, colega!"
G["You've got something I need, Astor. And I'll be taking it now."]="Tem algo que preciso, Astor. E me o levarei agora."
G["You've got the hang of it. I can't teach you any more, but talk to Arthur Moore, a Forsaken who works in the Rogues' Quarter of the Undercity. Tell him I sent you."]="Você tem o jeito. Não posso mais ensinar você, mas fale com Arthur Moore, um Deixado que trabalha no Bairro dos Ladinos da Cidade Baixa. Diga a ele que eu te enviei."
G["You've got the moves, $n. Now use them!\n\nOr are you looking for some new moves?"]="Dominas a técnica, $n. Utilízala!\n\nOU prefieres aprender uma nova?"
G["You've got the moves, $n. Use them!"]="Dominas a técnica, $n. Utilízala!"
G["You've got this handled."]="O tem controlado."
G["You've got to save me here, $c! He's gone mad... mad I telll you! His inability to stop the flooding of Thousand Needles has caused him to go completely bonkers!\n\nHe blames me for everything, including the Cataclysm. He probably thinks that I'm Deathwing in disguise, or something!\n\nHelp!"]="You've got to save me here, $c! He's gone mad... mad I telll you! His inability to stop the flooding of Thousand Needles has caused him to go completely bonkers!\n\nHe blames me for everything, including the Cataclysm. He probably thinks that I'm Deathwing in disguise, or something!\n\nHelp!"
G["You've got to try some of this beer."]="Você precisa experimentar um pouco dessa cerveja."
G["You've got us workin' up a sweat here, $p. We'll have our defenses in place in no time!"]="You've got us workin' up a sweat here, $p. We'll have our defenses in place in no time!"
G["You've got yourself a duel, $c."]="Te desafio a um duelo, $c."
G["You've gotten in my way one too many times, gnome."]="Você cruzado na minha caminho demais vezes, $gnomo: gnoma;."
G["You've grown a few inches around the waist, little brother! Come down here and give your sister a hug!"]="You've grown a few inches around the waist, little brother! Come down here and give your sister a hug!"
G["You've had enough time to recover from your wounds, Gal'ressa. The time has come for you to return to the road."]="You've had enough time to recover from your wounds, Gal'ressa. The time has come for you to return to the road."
G["You've heard about the Tram have you?  What a ride that thing is!  You'll find it in the Dwarven District towards the back.  Oh, and be sure to keep your arms and legs inside the tram while the tram is in motion."]="Você já ouviu falar sobre o bonde, ouviu? Que passeio é esse! Você o encontrará no distrito de Dwarven na parte de por trás. Ah, e mantenha seus braços e pernas dentro do bonde enquanto ele estiver em movimento."
G["You've helped me clear the roads of all that nasty wildlife, so I suppose I have no choice.  Let's get going!"]="You've helped me clear the roads of all that nasty wildlife, so I suppose I have no choice.  Let's get going!"
G["You've impressed everyone here today with your skills in the arena.  It is now time to be recognized before all as a champion of the tournament."]="Você impressionou todos aqui hoje com as suas habilidades na arena. Agora é hora de ser reconhecido antes de tudo como um campeão do torneio."
G["You've impressed me so far, $n. How do you feel about helping me in creating the ultimate dish?"]="You've impressed me so far, $n. How do you feel about helping me in creating the ultimate dish?"
G["You've interfered with our plans for the last time, foolish $c!"]="You've interfered with our plans for the last time, foolish $c!"
G["You've just crossed a terrible threshold, Arthas."]="You've just crossed a terrible threshold, Arthas."
G["You've learned nothing."]="Não vocês têm aprendido nada."
G["You've let too many customers get away. Perhaps you should try again?"]="You've let too many customers get away. Perhaps you should try again?"
G["You've let your pride cloud your vision, Titan puppet! You can never contain ME!"]="You've let your pride cloud your vision, Titan puppet! You can never contain ME!"
G["You've made a good start, but you still have a great deal to learn, $n."]="Tem empezado bem, mas ainda tem muito que aprender, $n."
G["You've made a wise decision to join my Horde."]="Se juntar a meu Horda foi uma decisão sabia."
G["You've made the right decision, $c.  You'll find our battlemaster, Glordrum Steelbeard, in the Hall of Arms.  Good luck, $n!"]="Tomou a decisão correta, $c. Encontrar a nosso mestre de batalha, Glordrum Barbacerada, na Salão de Armas. Boa sorte, $n!"
G["You've managed to walk right into my trap!"]="Você conseguiu entrar na minha armadilha!"
G["You've meddled in affairs that were none of your business. You are nothing but a foreign invader. Prepare to die!"]="You've meddled in affairs that were none of your business. You are nothing but a foreign invader. Prepare to die!"
G["You've more'n earned my vote."]="You've more'n earned my vote."
G["You've no doubt noticed the string of earthquakes we've had in the last weeks.  Something doesn't feel right about them."]="You've no doubt noticed the string of earthquakes we've had in the last weeks.  Something doesn't feel right about them."
G["You've not had a steed until you've taken the reigns of a finely bred Barak Tor'ol mountain ram, my friend.  Please, feel free to inspect these fine companions to any adventurer.  They'll serve you well, believe me."]="Você não teve um corcel até assumir o reinado de um carneiro Barak Tor'ol, meu amigo. Por favor, fique à vontade para inspecionar esses bons companheiros para qualquer aventureiro. Eles vão te servir bem, acredite em mim."
G["You've plundered our treasures too long.  Prepare to meet your watery grave!"]="You've plundered our treasures too long.  Prepare to meet your watery grave!"
G["You've proven more than capable of defeating any enemy.  I would be honored if you stand guard through the ritual, young hero."]="Tem mostrou que é capaz de derrotar a qualquer inimigo. Seria uma honra que montaras guarda durante o ritual, jovem corajoso."
G["You've proven true to your word, Earthmender.  For that, we will spare you our wrath."]="You've proven true to your word, Earthmender.  For that, we will spare you our wrath."
G["You've proven yourself a very capable game hunter, $n.  But there's still one beastie that haunts your dreams... Tusker!"]="You've proven yourself a very capable game hunter, $n.  But there's still one beastie that haunts your dreams... Tusker!"
G["You've proven yourself to Sho. She did say she would watch your back if you ever needed it. You can just ask her to watch your crops instead."]="You've proven yourself to Sho. She did say she would watch your back if you ever needed it. You can just ask her to watch your crops instead."
G["You've put in your time studying the basics. Now it's time to up the ante."]="You've put in your time studying the basics. Now it's time to up the ante."
G["You've reached a Horde bonfire! Desecrate this bonfire and stamp it out!"]="Você atingiu uma fogueira da Horda! Profanar esta fogueira e acabar com ela!"
G["You've reached an Alliance bonfire! Desecrate this bonfire and stamp it out!"]="Você atingiu uma fogueira da Aliança! Profanar esta fogueira e acabar com ela!"
G["You've reached an Earthen Ring bonfire!"]="Você alcançou uma fogueira do Anel Terrestre!"
G["You've reached the limits of my enchantments. Sedana can instruct you further."]="alcançou o limite de meus encantamentos. Sedana pode seguir com o seu treinamento."
G["You've reached the limits of my skill. Farii was my instructor, and I'm sure she'll instruct you as well."]="alcançou o limite de meu habilidade. Farii me instruyo a mim e estou certo de que também te instruirá você."
G["You've reached too far, serpent. You shall suffer greatly for your trespass!"]="Você chegou longe demais, serpente. Você sofrerá muito pela transgressão!"
G["You've really outdone yourself this time, Mrs. Chambers. Not a spot of mold to be found!"]="You've really outdone yourself this time, Mrs. Chambers. Not a spot of mold to be found!"
G["You've received Volatile Greenstone Brew! Use it in combat to help defeat multiple enemies."]="You've received Volatile Greenstone Brew! Use it in combat to help defeat multiple enemies."
G["You've reclaimed a few paltry territories. Pathetic. In short order they will again be mine!"]="You've reclaimed a few paltry territories. Pathetic. In short order they will again be mine!"
G["You've restored my health!  I'm in your debt, $n."]="Me devolvido a vida! Estou em dívida com você, $n."
G["You've returned with the spirits of water and earth. You make an old master proud."]="Tem retornado com os espíritos da água e a terra. Este velho mestre está orgulhoso."
G["You've ruined this batch!  Why must I work with you worthless Gan'arg."]="Tem arruinado este lote! Por que terei que trabalhar com um desprezível Gan'arg."
G["You've ruined your own lands, you'll not ruin mine."]="Tem arruinado seus próprias terras, mas não vai arruinar as minhas."
G["You've saved both myself and my son."]="Nos salvou a mim e a meu filho."
G["You've saved me, $c. Thank you!"]="Me has salvou, $c. Obrigado!"
G["You've saved me, fleshling! Ameer will hear of this noble act."]="Me salvou, ser de carne! Ameer saberão deste noble acto."
G["You've saved my life!"]="Me salvou a vida!"
G["You've saved my life, $c.  Protect me for a few more moments while I recover."]="Me salvou a vida, $c. Protégeme uns minutos mais enquanto me recupero."
G["You've saved us!  Now we need to get out of here."]="Nos salvou! Agora temos que sair de aqui."
G["You've sealed your fate, Akama.  The Master will learn of your betrayal!"]="Tem selado seu destino Akama. O mestre terá notícia do seu traição!"
G["You've served our cause with great loyalty, $n.  Allow me to present you with an unending source of our elemental quintessence."]="You've served our cause with great loyalty, $n.  Allow me to present you with an unending source of our elemental quintessence."
G["You've sniffed every inch of this city."]="You've sniffed every inch of this city."
G["You've some sting in you, human."]="Tem coragem, humano."
G["You've started down an honorable path, $n. My ancestors respect your willingness, but you will not have my approval until you have followed through with my tasks.\n\nYou know what you must do if you wish to prove yourself a hunter in spirit."]="You've started down an honorable path, $n. My ancestors respect your willingness, but you will not have my approval until you have followed through with my tasks.\n\nYou know what you must do if you wish to prove yourself a hunter in spirit."
G["You've strayed too far from the Stonemother's gaze, dragon.  It is time that you be put in your place."]="You've strayed too far from the Stonemother's gaze, dragon.  It is time that you be put in your place."
G["You've strayed too far from your comfortable soil, $r."]="You've strayed too far from your comfortable soil, $r."
G["You've stumbled right into my trap."]="Tem caído na minha armadilha."
G["You've stumbled upon the wrong camp!"]="entrou no acampamento enganado!"
G["You've succeeded in defending the bridge. The summon ritual has been completed."]="Tem tido êxito na defesa do ponte. O ritual de evocação foi concluído."
G["You've successfully freed your spirit! You can serve as my eyes. Together we'll get to the bottom of this."]="Conseguiu liberar seu espírito! Agora será meus olhos. Juntos chegaremos até o fundo da questão."
G["You've sufficiently advanced in the field to be beyond my ability to teach. I hear there's a skilled engineer named Roxxik in the stinking pit of a city they call Orgrimmar who might be able to train you."]="You've sufficiently advanced in the field to be beyond my ability to teach. I hear there's a skilled engineer named Roxxik in the stinking pit of a city they call Orgrimmar who might be able to train you."
G["You've surpassed my own knowledge, but Bemarrin over there can teach you far more."]="Tem superado meu próprio conhecimento, mas Bemarrin, ali, pode ensinar muito mais."
G["You've taken a lot of bombers out and don't have much to show for it.  Use more caution or your flight priveledges will be revoked..."]="You've taken a lot of bombers out and don't have much to show for it.  Use more caution or your flight priveledges will be revoked..."
G["You've taught me what it means to have friends, $n."]="You've taught me what it means to have friends, $n."
G["You've underestimated us!"]="Nos vocês subestimado!"
G["You've wasted enough of my time... let these games be finished!"]="You've wasted enough of my time... let these games be finished!"
G["You've wasted too much time, mortals. Now you shall fall."]="You've wasted too much time, mortals. Now you shall fall."
G["You, \"orc\", will make an excellent addition to my family!"]="Você, \"orc\", será uma adquisição excelente para meu família!"
G["You, $c! We require your aid! The brutish Warsong orcs are destroying the wonder and beauty of Ashenvale, and we need your strength to meet them on the field of battle. Return with us to Azeroth and fight for the honor of the Silverwing Sentinels! Will you join us?"]="You, $c! We require your aid! The brutish Warsong orcs are destroying the wonder and beauty of Ashenvale, and we need your strength to meet them on the field of battle. Return with us to Azeroth and fight for the honor of the Silverwing Sentinels! Will you join us?"
G["You, <Snort> you are strong <Gurgle>. But..."]="You, <Snort> you are strong <Gurgle>. But..."
G["You, Aethas, will be coming with me."]="Aethas, você virás comigo."
G["You, Chief!"]="Você, chefe?"
G["You, Felguard.  Hold this area."]="Você, guarda vil. Defiende esta zona."
G["You, Wrathion, will be blindfolded."]="Você, Wrathion, terá os olhos vendados."
G["You, and your Alliance, are welcome in Paw'don."]="Seu Aliança e você são bem-vindos em Zarpa'don."
G["You, brave hero - you are strong enough to leap into the center of events as they transpire."]="Você. Você é forte o suficiente para participar dos eventos à medida que acontecem."
G["You, hold there!"]="Você, aguanta aí!"
G["You, honored paladin.  Please come here.."]="Você, honrado paladin. Por favor, venha aqui..."
G["You, in harmony with nature, and only your skills to survive.  This is the way that the Earth Mother intended it to be.  You will want to find Bale on the Hunter Rise."]="You, in harmony with nature, and only your skills to survive.  This is the way that the Earth Mother intended it to be.  You will want to find Bale on the Hunter Rise."
G["You, initiate. Where are the troops?"]="Você, iniciada. Onde estão as tropas?"
G["You, meet up with Commander Nightwind at the harbor, immediately."]="Você, vê a ver ao Comandante Nochebrisa no porto, imediatamente."
G["You, my dark prince, will be blindfolded."]="Você, Príncipe Negro, terá os olhos vendados."
G["You, over there. Come kill my jailer!"]="You, over there. Come kill my jailer!"
G["You, pandaren! You will be back in chains where you belong."]="You, pandaren! You will be back in chains where you belong."
G["You, soldier, report back to Kargath at once!"]="Você, Soldado, apresente ante Kargath's de imediatamente!"
G["You, stranger... you are not one of my soldiers. Will you stay and stand with me to face the enemy?"]="You, stranger... you are not one of my soldiers. Will you stay and stand with me to face the enemy?"
G["You, there! Hand over that moonstone and nobody gets hurt!"]="Você! Entrega essa pedras lunar e ninguém saldrá ferido!"
G["You, too, are beautiful, Voss. Have you looked in a mirror recently?"]="You, too, are beautiful, Voss. Have you looked in a mirror recently?"
G["You, too, shall be charred to ash!"]="You, too, shall be charred to ash!"
G["You, too, shall know the silence!"]="You, too, shall know the silence!"
G["You, too, shall serve!"]="Você também será meu escravo!"
G["You, what have you done?"]="Você! Que fez?"
G["You.  Me.  We're done."]="Você. E eu. Temos terminado."
G["You... Don't think I don't see you. Leave me alone!"]="Você... Não cria que não te vejo. Deixe-me em paz!"
G["You... I've seen you in Shattrath..."]="Você... te vi em Shattrath..."
G["You... Rook knows you...."]="Você...? Rook te conhece..."
G["You... Shado-Pan. You're here to help me?"]="Você... Shadopan. Tem vindo a me ajudar?"
G["You... The frame! How? You must not... It... the Destroyer..."]="Não... O cajado! Como? Não deve... o... o Destruidor..."
G["You... WHAT?\n\nCome over here and say that!\n\n<Kristoff kicks and flails his limbs in a frothing rage, his head twisting around to glare at you.>\n\nSo help me, I will - I am going to - I will knock your brains out! I will fill the empty cavity left behind with my boot! Come here! GET BACK HERE!\n\n<Kristoff strains to grasp your neck, his fingers wriggling inches from your face.>"]="You... WHAT?\n\nCome over here and say that!\n\n<Kristoff kicks and flails his limbs in a frothing rage, his head twisting around to glare at you.>\n\nSo help me, I will - I am going to - I will knock your brains out! I will fill the empty cavity left behind with my boot! Come here! GET BACK HERE!\n\n<Kristoff strains to grasp your neck, his fingers wriggling inches from your face.>"
G["You... You saved me? I'm a damned monster! YOU'RE A DAMNED MONSTER! LOOK AT YOURSELF!"]="Me vocês têm... salvou? Sou um maldito monstro! VOCÊ É UM MALDITO MONSTRO! MÍRATE!"
G["You... You'll get nothing... And like it..."]="Você... não ganhará nada... E acéptalo..."
G["You... are marked."]="Está marcado."
G["You... are next."]="É... meu próxima vítima."
G["You... are the disease... not I..."]="Vocês são... a doença, não eu!"
G["You... betrayed me. You betrayed us all, monster! Face the might of Mograine!"]="Você... nos tem traído… a todos, monstro! Enfrente ao poder de Mograine!"
G["You... bunch... of... dookers!"]="Pandilha... de... mikos!"
G["You... cannot escape us!"]="Não… pode escapar!"
G["You... cannot win... this war..."]="Não podem... ganhar... esta guerra..."
G["You... die now!!"]="Morre, agora!"
G["You... half-idiot!  You really did it this time.  I'm going to have to make it look like your leg's broken."]="Você... Médio-bobo! Esta vez a tem liado. Vou ter que fazer que parezca que tem a perna rota."
G["You... half-idiot... what got into you?  Pulling off something like that on her?  Did you think she wouldn't notice?"]="Você... meio idiota... Em que estava pensando? Hacerle algo assim a ela! Creíste que não se daria conta?"
G["You... have... bested me..."]="Me... has... derrotado..."
G["You... must... contain... it..."]="You... must... contain... it..."
G["You... never get outta here... alive."]="You... never get outta here... alive."
G["You... will not defeat... the thunder..."]="Não... derrotarás... ao trovão..."
G["You... will pay for that, old man.  Slay them all!"]="Você… pagará por isso, velho. Matem-nos a todos!"
G["You... will... leave... this... man!"]="You... will... leave... this... man!"
G["You... will... pay."]="Você... o... pagará."
G["You... you escaped me in Vashj'ir. You won't be so lucky here."]="Conseguiu escapar em Vashj'ir. Não terá tanta sorte aqui."
G["You... you're not going to try to eat me, are you?"]="You... you're not going to try to eat me, are you?"
G["You... you're not one of the Alliance? Good."]="Não... não é da Aliança? Que bem."
G["You... you're not one of them, are you? You've got to help me!"]="Você... você não é um dos eles, verdade? Precisa me ajudar!"
G["You... you're the one from the portal... the druid of flame..."]="Você... você é a do portal... a druida da Chama."
G["You...friend of Nordrassil...take what remains of my strength...and fight back the flames..."]="Você... amigo de Nordrassil... tome o que resta de meus forças... e luta contra as chamas..."
G["You...will...burn..."]="Arderás..."
G["You?\n\n<Lorax laughs.>\n\nThat is doubtful.\n\nI stand in these ruins and dream. Dream of the day that I catch that miserable thief, Goraluk Anvilcrack.\n\nWe had a deal, him and I. A deal that he broke. Betrayed."]="You?\n\n<Lorax laughs.>\n\nThat is doubtful.\n\nI stand in these ruins and dream. Dream of the day that I catch that miserable thief, Goraluk Anvilcrack.\n\nWe had a deal, him and I. A deal that he broke. Betrayed."
G["You? A lone orc? Against me and..."]="Você? Um orc solitário? Contra mim e..."
G["You? Join the Tillers? Ha! You'd have to prove your farming skills to all five members of our Council. They would never vote for you!"]="You? Join the Tillers? Ha! You'd have to prove your farming skills to all five members of our Council. They would never vote for you!"
G["You?! I hear all 'bout you. My juju be strong. You not gonna stop the Zandalari!"]="Vocês?! O sei tudo de vocês. Meu juju é fueh'te. Vocês não vais a parar aos Zandalari!"
