G["Your lungs are filled and you are ready for action!"]="Seus pulmones estão cheios e está $gpronto: pronta; para a ação!"
G["Your magic is pathetic. Let me show you mine."]="Seu magia é patética. De que te muestre a minha."
G["Your magics shall be your undoing... ak-a-ak..."]="Seu magia será seu fim... ak-a-ak..."
G["Your makers failed you... your flawed race succumbed to the curse of flesh!  Lord Deathwing's gift makes you perfect again!"]="Seus criadores abandonaram vocês... Sua raça imperfeita sucumbiu à maldição da carne! O presente do mestre Asa da Morte os tornará perfeitos novamente!"
G["Your march to your deaths! Azshara shall see you wiped from the seas!"]="Your march to your deaths! Azshara shall see you wiped from the seas!"
G["Your martial skills are unparallelled. There is much I wish to learn from you."]="Your martial skills are unparallelled. There is much I wish to learn from you."
G["Your master knows what lies beneath the chapel. That is why he dares not show his face! He's sent you and your death knights to meet their doom, Darion."]="Your master knows what lies beneath the chapel. That is why he dares not show his face! He's sent you and your death knights to meet their doom, Darion."
G["Your masters will never conquer the stone!"]="Your masters will never conquer the stone!"
G["Your mate?"]="Seu companheiro?"
G["Your meal is ready, sir."]="Seu comida está pronta, senhor."
G["Your meddling ends here, $n!  Lord Valthalak shall have his revenge!"]="Your meddling ends here, $n!  Lord Valthalak shall have his revenge!"
G["Your meddling in demonic affairs ends NOW, mortal!  Face the great corruptor - Xandivious!"]="Seu intromisão em assuntos demoníacos acaba AQUI, mortal! Enfrente ao grande corruptor, Xandivious!"
G["Your meddling is at an end. Mechazod will relieve your curse once I am done with you."]="Seu intromisão está chegando ao seu fim. Mecazod levantará seu maldição quando eu tenha terminado com você."
G["Your message did reach us, Commander, but by no means is our involvement here sanctioned by the Grand Crusader."]="Comandante, temos recebido seu mensagem, mas nossa participação aqui não conta com a aprovação do Grande Cruzado."
G["Your mighty castles will crumble and your loved ones will join the Lich King's ranks!"]="Your mighty castles will crumble and your loved ones will join the Lich King's ranks!"
G["Your mind has grown weak since we last met."]="Seu mente se tem enfraquecido desde a última vez que nos vimos."
G["Your mind is gradually opened as you focus on the orb before you...."]="Seu mente se vai abrindo gradualmente à medida que te concentras no orbe ante ti..."
G["Your mind is plagued with |cFFFF0404|Hspell:124862|h[Visions of Demise]|h|r !"]="Your mind is plagued with |cFFFF0404|Hspell:124862|h[Visions of Demise]|h|r !"
G["Your mind is strong Wakener. Even now I struggle to communicate with you. Controlling you would be near impossible..."]="Your mind is strong Wakener. Even now I struggle to communicate with you. Controlling you would be near impossible..."
G["Your mind is unfocused.  Are you hiding something from me?"]="Sua mente está fosse de foco. Você está escondendo algo de mim?"
G["Your minds is weak."]="Seu mente é fraco."
G["Your minion has been terminated."]="Seu lacaio foi destruído."
G["Your miniscule intellect is no match for my superior claws!"]="Seu minúsculo intelecto não tem nada que fazer contra meus garras superior!"
G["Your misery is my delight!"]="Your misery is my delight!"
G["Your mixtures are weak, Maloriak! They need a bit more... kick!"]="Your mixtures are weak, Maloriak! They need a bit more... kick!"
G["Your moldering remains will serve ME as a testament to what happens when one is foolish enough to trespass in my domain!"]="Your moldering remains will serve ME as a testament to what happens when one is foolish enough to trespass in my domain!"
G["Your moment of defiance is nearly over!"]="A hora do seu desafio quase terminou!"
G["Your money or your life!"]="O dinheiro ou a vida!"
G["Your money or your life! Actually, just your life will do..."]="A bolsa ou a vida! De feito, somente com a vida bastará..."
G["Your monkeys failed to finish the job, naaru. Beaten but alive... The same mistake was not made when we took command of your vessel."]="Your monkeys failed to finish the job, naaru. Beaten but alive... The same mistake was not made when we took command of your vessel."
G["Your mortal remains have been gathered, here in this place where you spent your childhood!"]="Your mortal remains have been gathered, here in this place where you spent your childhood!"
G["Your mother calls!"]="Sua mãe os chama!"
G["Your mother was a wrench and your father smelled of seaforium!"]="Your mother was a wrench and your father smelled of seaforium!"
G["Your mother's in the basement next door.  Get to her now!"]="Seu mãe está no porão de ao lado. Vê com ela agora!"
G["Your mother's so old she saw the rise of the first kingdom!"]="Seu mãe é tão velha que viu nascer o primeiro reino!"
G["Your motives are pure. The keystone's parts shall be reunited. Go to Ulduar and learn the answers to your questions, Brann Bronzebeard."]="Your motives are pure. The keystone's parts shall be reunited. Go to Ulduar and learn the answers to your questions, Brann Bronzebeard."
G["Your move.  I'll follow you in."]="Vê você primeiro. Te sigo."
G["Your muscles are stretched out and ready for action!"]="Seus músculos estão bem estirados e prontos para a ação!"
G["Your name is as insignificant to me as the names of the thousands who have died under the might of Goc.  I will crush you and $n!"]="Seu nome é tão insignificante para mim como o nome dos milhares que têm morto sob o poder de Goc. Os machacare você e a $n!"
G["Your name is beginning to be revered around here.\n\n<Chu'a'lor's left eye pierces you with its stony gaze.>\n\nKeep up the good work, $n!"]="Your name is beginning to be revered around here.\n\n<Chu'a'lor's left eye pierces you with its stony gaze.>\n\nKeep up the good work, $n!"
G["Your name seems to be on everyone's lips around the outpost.  Don't let it get to your head; I know that you can do better!\n\nI'll be watching you, rookie."]="Seu nome parece estar nos lábios de tudo o mundo na avançado. Não deixe que se te suba à cabeça; eu sei que ainda pode fazer isso melhor!\n\nTe estarei observando, novato."
G["Your name will be remembered down through the ages, $n.  Seek out Taim Ragetotem on the Hunter Rise and he will assist you on your way to Alterac Valley."]="Seu nome será recordado pelos tempos dos tempos, $n. Busca a Taim Totem de Raiva no Alto dos Caçadores. Te ajudará a chegar ao Vale Alterac."
G["Your name will be spoken in our village for many years to come."]="Your name will be spoken in our village for many years to come."
G["Your name's Leveny?"]="Você é Leveny?"
G["Your new name is Sayena."]="Seu novo nome é Sayena."
G["Your next choice awaits.\n\nYou alone have defeated a terrible beast that has been ravaging the countryside, taking its ear as a trophy.  You later learn that your liege had offered a reward for the beast's death, and that a kind but destitute knight who you know is trying to support a family by meager means claims the beast's kill as his own.  You have no real need for money yourself, but you know that the destitute knight is lying for his own personal gain.\n\nMake your choice."]="Your next choice awaits.\n\nYou alone have defeated a terrible beast that has been ravaging the countryside, taking its ear as a trophy.  You later learn that your liege had offered a reward for the beast's death, and that a kind but destitute knight who you know is trying to support a family by meager means claims the beast's kill as his own.  You have no real need for money yourself, but you know that the destitute knight is lying for his own personal gain.\n\nMake your choice."
G["Your next choice awaits.\n\nYou are on a diplomatic mission for your liege to a cruel country that is currently at war with yours.  The war has been costly on both sides.  Your mission is to secure a peace that is honorable to both peoples.\n\nAt a diplomatic dinner, you overhear the ruler of the opposing land viciously insult your benevolent liege.  You are fairly certain the ruler meant to say it out of your earshot, but nonetheless he has besmirched your liege's honor.\n\nMake your choice."]="Your next choice awaits.\n\nYou are on a diplomatic mission for your liege to a cruel country that is currently at war with yours.  The war has been costly on both sides.  Your mission is to secure a peace that is honorable to both peoples.\n\nAt a diplomatic dinner, you overhear the ruler of the opposing land viciously insult your benevolent liege.  You are fairly certain the ruler meant to say it out of your earshot, but nonetheless he has besmirched your liege's honor.\n\nMake your choice."
G["Your next choice awaits.\n\nYou are the sworn executioner for your liege.  A man has been sent to you for execution as a traitor of the liege and your people.  You know this individual as a close, virtuous friend who mysteriously vanished one day.  You also know that the man's crimes for which he was convicted supposedly caused the deaths of many innocent civilians.  Upon seeing you he begs for his life, claiming he was framed by a higher authority.\n\nMake your choice."]="Your next choice awaits.\n\nYou are the sworn executioner for your liege.  A man has been sent to you for execution as a traitor of the liege and your people.  You know this individual as a close, virtuous friend who mysteriously vanished one day.  You also know that the man's crimes for which he was convicted supposedly caused the deaths of many innocent civilians.  Upon seeing you he begs for his life, claiming he was framed by a higher authority.\n\nMake your choice."
G["Your next choice awaits.\n\nYour brother seeks to join the ranks of the prestigious military order you are already a part of.  While you are sure of his commitment and loyalty, his talent and ability to perform the arduous tasks of the order is what you question.  While you are not certain he will be able to rise to the challenge of the order - putting you and others in danger - you are certain that your word alone would allow him in or keep him out.\n\nMake your choice."]="Your next choice awaits.\n\nYour brother seeks to join the ranks of the prestigious military order you are already a part of.  While you are sure of his commitment and loyalty, his talent and ability to perform the arduous tasks of the order is what you question.  While you are not certain he will be able to rise to the challenge of the order - putting you and others in danger - you are certain that your word alone would allow him in or keep him out.\n\nMake your choice."
G["Your offer will be carefully considered, harbinger.  In the meantime we will make use of your delegation in an advisory role."]="Your offer will be carefully considered, harbinger.  In the meantime we will make use of your delegation in an advisory role."
G["Your offering has come too late, little one. Can you feel the mist closing in upon you? The Kvaldir return..."]="Your offering has come too late, little one. Can you feel the mist closing in upon you? The Kvaldir return..."
G["Your old lives, your mortal desires mean nothing... you are acolytes of the master now, and you will serve the cause without question! The greatest glory is to die in the master's service!"]="Your old lives, your mortal desires mean nothing... you are acolytes of the master now, and you will serve the cause without question! The greatest glory is to die in the master's service!"
G["Your only concern here is your stake in this operation?"]="O único que te interesse é sua parte da operação?"
G["Your only hope is that you will all burn together. There is no victory for you."]="Your only hope is that you will all burn together. There is no victory for you."
G["Your only lesson will be death."]="Your only lesson will be death."
G["Your orders have been revoked until further notice.  Cool your jets and try to be more careful out there!"]="Your orders have been revoked until further notice.  Cool your jets and try to be more careful out there!"
G["Your overconfidence will be your undoing! Guards, lend me your strength!"]="Your overconfidence will be your undoing! Guards, lend me your strength!"
G["Your overlord promised me help. Where is this important person he intends to send?"]="Your overlord promised me help. Where is this important person he intends to send?"
G["Your own strength feeds me, $n!"]="Seu própria força me alimenta, $n!"
G["Your pain amuses me!"]="Me entretengo com o seu dor!"
G["Your pain excites me!"]="Seu dor me estimula!"
G["Your pain has only begun!"]="Seu dor não fez mais que começar!"
G["Your pain is my release."]="Seu dor é meu liberdade."
G["Your pain will be endless."]="Seu dor será interminável."
G["Your pain will end soon!"]="Seu dor acabará pronto!"
G["Your path does not match mine.  You must seek training elsewhere, $c."]="Seu caminho e o meu são diferentes. Deve procurar outro instrutor, $c."
G["Your path is steady, $n, for Washte Pawne's resolve is with you."]="Seu senda é certa, $n, posto que a determinação de Washte Pawne te acompanha."
G["Your pathetic attempt to escape will be short lived, Gorefiend. Let the $g boy:girl; go and submit! Even with your armor and weapons, you cannot defeat the ancients!"]="Your pathetic attempt to escape will be short lived, Gorefiend. Let the $g boy:girl; go and submit! Even with your armor and weapons, you cannot defeat the ancients!"
G["Your pathetic challenge has not gone unnoticed. I shall enjoy toying with you before you die."]="Your pathetic challenge has not gone unnoticed. I shall enjoy toying with you before you die."
G["Your pathetic defense ends here!"]="Sua patética defesa acaba aqui!"
G["Your pathetic efforts shall yield you nothing but pain."]="Your pathetic efforts shall yield you nothing but pain."
G["Your people are both stout and ferocious. But always remember, the lion kills only when hungry."]="Seu povo é corajoso e ferozes. Mas lembre-se sempre que o leão somente matar quando tem fome."
G["Your people are despicable cowards, orc. You are nothing more than rabid dogs, and you will be put down!"]="Your people are despicable cowards, orc. You are nothing more than rabid dogs, and you will be put down!"
G["Your people are legitimate prisoners of war. They orchestrated an attack on Darnassus from MY city-"]="Your people are legitimate prisoners of war. They orchestrated an attack on Darnassus from MY city-"
G["Your people are lost. Even as we speak, we mogu are overtaking your precious Vale."]="Seu povo está perdido. Neste momentos os mogu estamos conquistando seu vale."
G["Your people are very interesting, $r. I wish to know more about you and your kind."]="Seu povo é muito interessante, $r. Quero saber mais sobre você e sobre seu povo."
G["Your people have an interesting practice of arrival to someone's home."]="Seu povo tem uma forma muito peculiar de entrar nas casas de outras pessoas."
G["Your people will always be with you!"]="Seu povo sempre estará com você!"
G["Your perseverance strengthens us. Your courage leads us. Your honor inspires us."]="Seu perseverância nos fortalece. Seu coragem nos dirige. Seu honra nos inspira."
G["Your pet fell down!"]="Sua mascote caiu!"
