G["Your stench sickens me. I'd kill you myself if it were not for Angerboda."]="Seu fedor me coloca enfermo. Se não fosse por Inquinoda, te mataría eu mesmo."
G["Your stench will attract every dragon for miles.  Tell me what you want, and quickly."]="Seu fedor atrairá tudo dragão por quilômetros. Diga-me o que você quer, e rapidamente."
G["Your story continues on, friend.\n\nIt is a story worth reading."]="Your story continues on, friend.\n\nIt is a story worth reading."
G["Your strategy was flawed."]="Your strategy was flawed."
G["Your strength has helped free this land of its long held darkness. It is my honor to witness your deeds with my own eyes, Champion."]="Your strength has helped free this land of its long held darkness. It is my honor to witness your deeds with my own eyes, Champion."
G["Your strength is of the mountain.  Your grace is of the winds!"]="Tem a força de uma montanha. Tem a graça do vento!"
