G["Your timing is perfect as always, hero. It is time to kick down the Thunder King's front door."]="Chega no momentos oportuno, como sempre. É hora de dar sob a porta do Rei do Trovão."
G["Your tinker must've made you from tin, you lazy piles of slag!"]="Your tinker must've made you from tin, you lazy piles of slag!"
G["Your tone enrages me, outsider. If this is what we can expect from your so-called \"Alliance,\" we will have no part in it!"]="Your tone enrages me, outsider. If this is what we can expect from your so-called \"Alliance,\" we will have no part in it!"
