G["Your training has paid off, young $c. You have found Huo and brought him safely to the temple."]="Seu treinamento tem dados seus frutos, jovem $c. Tem encontrado a Huo e o tem trazido de volta ao templo saudável e salvou."
G["Your training has progressed well, sisters. It won't be long before you lead your own people, with no further need of my teaching."]="Your training has progressed well, sisters. It won't be long before you lead your own people, with no further need of my teaching."
