G["Your willingnesss to obey ssshall determine the length of your life."]="Your willingnesss to obey ssshall determine the length of your life."
G["Your winning streak ends here, $n. Today, you fall by my spear."]="Your winning streak ends here, $n. Today, you fall by my spear."
