G["Zalazane got most of his hexed trolls hidden under de canopy on de big island."]="Zalazane got most of his hexed trolls hidden under de canopy on de big island."
G["Zalazane's mindless servants were killin' all de beasts o' de isles, burnin' up de trees and plants too. Gonk needed us ta save de life on de isles. But since we not be able ta draw upon de power o' de loa wit Zalazane in power, Gonk be showin' us a new way ta connect wit ALL de spirits o' nature, ta work WIT de spirits, not just be servin' a single loa at a time. \n\nIt be difficult at first, ya, mon, but Gonk be showin' us how ta also reach inta de Emerald Dream ta speak wit de spirits and learn from dem directly!"]="Zalazane's mindless servants were killin' all de beasts o' de isles, burnin' up de trees and plants too. Gonk needed us ta save de life on de isles. But since we not be able ta draw upon de power o' de loa wit Zalazane in power, Gonk be showin' us a new way ta connect wit ALL de spirits o' nature, ta work WIT de spirits, not just be servin' a single loa at a time. \n\nIt be difficult at first, ya, mon, but Gonk be showin' us how ta also reach inta de Emerald Dream ta speak wit de spirits and learn from dem directly!"
G["Zalazane's time be runnin' out. De Echo Isles will belong to de Darkspear Tribe again!"]="O tempo de Zalazane está acabando. De Echo Isles pertencerá novamente à Tribo Lança de Darks!"
